#dung dkar tshig mdzod chen mo bzhugs so/ (slob dpon lung rigs nyi mas sgrigs pa'o//) ka nas/tha bar
ka ka ni|{gna' rabs rgya gar gyi gser dngul ljid tshad 'jal byed kyi tshad gzhi zhig ste/zha lu lo tsA ba chos skyong bzang pos mdzad pa'i (drin lan )gyi tshig rgyal dbang lnga pa chen pos ('dul ba'i las chog )du drangs pa las/ka ni ka zhes pa ni/kuny+dza zhes 'bod pa dmar ru mgo nag gi ming yin/ka ka ni bzhi la ma sha ka zhes bya ba gser se ba do yin zhes sogs drangs yod/dmar ru mgo nag ni dbyibs sran ril ltar 'jong ril yin pa la phyed ka nag po dang phyed ka dmar po yin pa zhig ste/de snga bod du maN+Dal gyi nang blugs kyi yod pa de yin cing/sman gzhung las ldum bu mda' rgyu zhes 'bod srol yod/dmar ru mgo nag gam ka ka ni bzhi la ma sha ka zhes gser se ba do yi ljid tshad yin pa dang de'i phyed de ka ka ni gnyis la gser se ba gang gi ljid tshad yin cing/gser se ba nyi shu tham pa la rgya gar gyi gser zho gang dang/bod kyi gser zho do ste gser se ba brgyad cu tham pa yod/rgya gar gyi gser zho brgya la gser srang gang/de la bod kyi gser srang gang dang zho drug rtsis pa ni brgyad zho zhes rgyal po khri ral pa can gyi dus nas rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags phag (1791)lo'i bar lo brgyad brgya bdun cu don bdun ring brgyad zho dang brgyad srang gi lugs de bed spyod byas pa/da yod bod kyi khrims yig khag gi nang gsal zhing/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lo zhe drug pa chu byi (1792)lor man ching gong ma chan lung gis bka' phab pa ltar bod sa gnas su bod dngul zho gang skar lnga dang/zho phyed do/zho gang/zho phyed bcas kyi par 'debs 'go tshugs pa nas bzung mes rgyal nang khul gyi sa gnas gzhan dag dang 'dra bar zho bcu la srang gang du brtsis pa'i bcu srang gi lam lugs lag bstar byas pa red}
ka ko la yi srin bu|{spyir ka ko la zhes pa sman la ngos 'dzin tshul dang/dug rigs shig la ngos 'dzin pa bcas mi 'dra ba yod pas skabs 'dir dug gi srin bur go dgos pa 'dra}
ka bkol ma|{(ka khol ma )bod kyi lo rgyas thog skad grags yod pa'i lo rgyus dpe cha zhig gi ming/'di la yongs grags kyi bshad srol ni/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po mya ngan las 'das khar dbon sras mang srong mang btsan dang/mong bza'/thon mi/blon po rnams dang/bod 'bangs spyi bcas la zhal chems su gsungs pa rnams lha sa gtsug lag khang gi ka ba shing lo can gyi gseb tu sbas nas bzhag pa dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i mgor jo bo rje a ti sha bod du phebs nas lha sar bzhugs pa'i skabs shig sprang mo smyon ma zhig gis lung bstan pa ltar/de'i nang nas bton pa gnang thog /rnal 'byor pa sogs slob ma bzhi la las mgos kyis nyin gcig la bshu gang thub mdzad rung mjug cung zad bshu ma thub par lus shing/slar yang sngar gyi ngar gnas su 'jog pa gnang ba de las dpe rgyun rim par 'phel bas (bka' chems ka khol ma )zhes grags pa yin zer/yang dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng ba sogs mkhas pa 'ga' zhig gis gsung rgyun la skabs de'i ma dpe mang po 'phel rgyas ma byung bi thog nyung shas yod pa de tsho brlag stor song ste deng sang mthong rgyud yod pa'i bka' chems 'di gtsug lag khang gi dkon gnyer zhig gi ngag rgyun ltar bris pa yin stabs khungs ma dag pa dang yi ge nor ba mang po yod pa'i rgyu mtshan de yin gsungs/gang ltar de'i nang gal che'i lo rgyud mang po gsal ba dper na/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po dgung lo zhe bzhi las ma bzhugs pa dang/btsun mo bgres shos mong bzang yin pa de la gung ri gung btsan 'khrungs pa/bal bza' btsun mo lnga pa dang rgya bza' btsun mo drug pa yin pa/gtsug lag gang gi ka gdung ngos su bris pa'i gab tshig gi nang don dang ri mo'i 'grel bshad gsal por bris pa sogs red/'on kyang de'i nang du dmangs khrod kyi ngag rgyun 'khyog bshad byas pa zhig yin pas 'dir bkod kyang dgos pa mi 'dug snyam nas ma bris so/}
ka lking|{rgya gar lho phyogs rgya mtsho'i 'gram gyi yul la tri ling+ga sogs pa'i ling+ka'i ming can brgyad tsam yod par bshad pa'i nang nas gcig yin}
ka ci sgong shun ma|{rgya gar nas thon pa'i ras dkar po sgo nga'i pags pa lta bu srab la 'jam pa zhig ste/bod rigs sa khul du ras gzhi de lha sku'i thang ka 'bri gzhir med du mi rung ba zhig yin/ras de sngon dus a ra Na si ste ka shi'i grong khyer nas thon pa yin pas ming gzhan ka shi ka'i ras kyang zer/ras de'i gras nas shin tu srab pa des bzos pa'i gyon chas rnams mi'i lus yi sha mdog mi sgrib par gsal por mngon thub pa zhig yod pa de la du ku la'i ras zer}
ka cog zhang gsum|{btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus su byon pa'i lo tsA ba gzhon gsum ste/'bro ka ba dpal brtsegs dang/cog ro klu'i rgyal mtshan/sna nam zhang ye shes sde bshas gsum yin/yongs grags kyi lo rgyus yig cha tshang mar ka cog zhang gsum zhes brjod bde ba'i dbang du byas nas go rim de ltar mdzad kyang/ka ba dpal brtsegs kyis phyogs bsgrigs mdzad pa'i (dkar chag ldan dkar ma )las/cog ro lo tsA ba'i mtshan smros pa'i tshe slob dpon klu'i rgyal mtshan zhes dang/zhang lo tsA ba la mkhan po ye shes sde zhes zhe sa'i che brjod yod pa dang/ka ba dpal brtsegs rang nyid kyi mtshan smros pa'i tshe/sgra bsgyur gyi ban de dpal brtsegs zhes spyir btang gi ming thog nas bkod gnang mdzad yod pas de'i go rim ltar byas te/zhang cog ka gsum zhes brjod dgos pa ltar snang zhing/gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi lo rgyun tshang pa ltar snang zhing/gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi lo rgyus tshang ma'i nang ka cog zhang gsum mkhan chen bo d+hi swa twa dang/slob dpon chen po pad+ma 'byung gnas/btsan po khri srong lde btsan bcas sku 'tsho bzhugs skabs mkhan slob gnyis ka'i lo tsA ba mdzad pa ma zad/mkhan chen sku gshegs rjes rgya nag gi slob dpon hwa shang ma hA ya na dang/slob dpon ka ma la shI la gnyis chos rtsod mdzad nas ha shang pham par mdzad pa'i rjes/chos rtsod kyi mjug bsdoms su (sgom rim rnam gsum )brtsams/de'i rigs pa'i gzhung lugs gsal bshad ched (dbu ma snang ba )bcas brtsams nas btsan po khri srong lde btsan la gnang ba de bsgyur zhing (dbu ma snang ba )ka ba dpal brtsegs kyis bod skad du bsgyur gnang mdzad pa bcas la gzhir bzung na/ka cog zhang gsum ka mkhan slob chos gsum zhal bzhugs dus kyi lo tsA ba yin par ra 'phrod gsang po byed thub pa yod/'on kyang deng skabs rgyal khab phyi nang gi lo rgyus smra ba 'ga' zhig gis ka cog zhang gsum btsan po khri srong lde btsan skabs kyi lo tsA ba min pa'i rgyu mtshan bkod pa'i dpyad gtam sna tshogs 'dug pa 'dir yig tshogs che bar bsam nas bkod med/nyang nyi ma 'od zer gyis mdzad pa'i (chos 'byung me tog snying po )shog grangs 420las/ka cog zhang gsum ni rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi sku tshe'i smad du byon pa'i lo tsA ba yin par gsungs shing/(mkhas pa'i dga' ston )shog grangs 419par/ka cog zhang gsum yang rgyal khri ral pa can gyis 'u shang rdo'i lha khang bzhengs zin pa'i skabs de shed du p+maya ngan las 'das nas mchod rten has po ri'i skor du brtsigs zhes gsal ba ltar na/rgyal po khri srong lde btsan dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gcig par mkhan po dang slob dpon bod du gdan drangs te chos gsungs pa'i skabs nas khri ral pa can gyis 'u shang rdo'i lha khang bzhengs grub pa'i bar lo brgya tham pa yod pas ka cog zhang gsum yang de tsam gyi bar bzhugs dgos par snang zhing/khri srong lde btsan sku tshe'i smad kyi lo tsA ba yin na khri srong lde btsan sku gshegs dus ka cog zhang gsum dgung lo sum cu yas mas zhig las phebs med tshod bcas bod kyi lo rgyus thog ka cog zhang gsum la khri srong lde btsan skabs kyi lo tsA ba gzhon gsum zhes gsung srol yod pa yang rgyu mtshan yang dag pa yod nges yin snyam pa 'dug lags pas dpyad par zhu'o/}
ka gcig lcam gang ma|{bod sa gnas kyi khang pa'i rgya khyon 'jal byed kyi tshad gzhi zhig ste khang pa mdo sbug gnyis yod pa'i gcig gi dkyil du ka ba gcig yod pa'i ka gcig ma dang/khang pa de'i 'khris su lcam gling gcig yod pa zhig la zer}
ka gcig ma|{bod sa gnas kyi khang pa'i rgya khyon 'jal byed kyi tshad gzhi'i ming zhig ste khang pa'i nang gi dkyil du ka ba gcig yod pa dang lcam gling mdo sbug gnyis yod pa zhig la zer}
ka chu gsos|{ka chu'i thang du yod pa'i lha khang zhig gsos byas pa'i don te/de sngon btsan po khri srong lde btsan skabs kyi blon po dpal tshab stong 'bar gyis ka chu'i lha khang bzhengs/rjes su 'bangs gyen log skabs bshig nas nyams chag byung ba bstan pa phyi dar gyi mgor klu mes tshul khrims shes rab kyis gnas gzhir bzung ste nyams gso gnang ba de yin}
ka chu'i thang|{lho kha khul bsam yang dang thag nye ba'i sa gnas zhig yin pa 'dra yang/zhib phra'i sa cha ngos ma chod cing/sngar btsan po khri srong lde btsan skabs thang der khrod pa 'dru rgyu'i gleng mol byung ba dang/sa 'og 'dom gang drus na chu thon yong ba yin tshul (rba bzhed )nang gsal}
ka chu'i spo chung tshul khrims bla ma|{smad 'dul gyi bshad brgyud 'dzin pa gzung rdo rje rgyal mtshan gyi slob ma bu bzhir grags pa byung ba'i nang gses shig yin/'khrungs yul lho kha'i g.yor po 'bum gling nas yin cing/btsan thang dang/ro skam/ka chu lha khang bcas gnas gzhir bzung p+sade 'dul ba'i bshad pa mdzad pas/slob ma myang mtshams pa rin chen bla ma sogs byung/lo rgyus zhib pa da phan bdag gis ma 'jal zhing 'dir bkod pa ni (deb ther sngon po )lcags dpar ma deb dang po'i shog grangs (deb dang po'i shog grangs )107par gsal ba ltar yin no/}
ka chen bzhi|{lho brag mar pa lo tsA ba'i brgyud 'dzin slob ma'i gtso bo bzhi la zer zhing de yang/1 rngog chos sku rdo rje ni rgyud sde'i bshad srol yi bka' babs/2 dol gyi mtshur ston dbang gi rdo rje ni 'pho ba'i man ngag gi bka' babs/3 gtsang rong gi mes ston tshon pa ni 'od gsal man ngag gi bka' babs/4 rje btsun mi la ras pa ni sgrub brgyud kyi bstan pa'i bka' babs bcas yin par mar pa dang mi la ras pa gnyis ka'i rnam thar gyi nang du gsal}
ka ju|{thang deb gsar rnying gi bod kyi lo rgyus thog gsal ba'i sa cha 'i ming zhig ste rgya yig thog {(WP:1,194)}zhes 'bod pa de yin/sa khul 'di na sngar thang rgyal rabs kyi skabs su lung yug ta'o yi srid 'dzin mnga' khongs su gtogs/thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ma ka'o tsung gi hrang yon {(WP:1,194)}khri lo gnyis par (795)bod kyi btsan po mang srong mang btsan gyis blon chen zhig mngags te 'a zha dang 'dum 'grigs byed par btang yang gong mas ma gsan par brten/lo de'i rjes mar btsan pos bod dmag mngags te/ka'o kra'o {(WP:1,194)}hran kra'o {(WP:1,194)}sogs bcom par bshad pa de yin cing/sa che de mang srong mang btsan gyi dus nas rgyal po khri ral pa can gyi sku tshe'i stod kyi bar bod kyis bdag bzung byas shing/khung gi sku tshe'i sman la thang bod dmar dmag 'khrug yang yang byung ring phan tshun thob shor thengs kha shas byung myong ba (thang deb )gsar rnying gnyis su gsal/sa cha de deng sang kan su'u zhing chen gyi lin zhA khongs su gtogs yod}
ka thang klu tshes|{mdo smad a mdo'i khul gyi sa cha zhig gi ming yin 'dra yang sa gnas gang du yod med kyi dpyad gzhi ma rnyed}
ka tho|{rgyun srol bod yig dpe cha dang/dpyad gzhi'i yig cha sogs kyi dkar chags dang/deb ther tho 'god byed skabs/sde tshan mi 'khrugs pa'i ched du ka mad sum cu tham par dbyangs med dang dbyangs bzhi bcas kyi go ring ltar sde tshan bsgrigs pa'i tho la zer}
ka thog|{de sngon dus rabs bcu gnyis pa'i dkyil bod kyi rab byung gsum pa'i sa yos (1159)lor gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi bstan 'dzin chen po ka dam pa bde gshegs kyis 'bri chu'i 'gram spo 'bor sgang dang nye ba'i sag nas su phyag btab pa'i dgon pa zhig yin/deng sang si khron su phyag btab pa'i dgon pa zhig yin/deng sang si khron zhing chen gyi dkar mdzes bod rigs rang skyong khul du yod/ka dam pa bde gshegs kyis rang nyid kyi rtsa ba'i bla ma 'dzam ston pas/khyod kam po'i gnas su song nas sgrub pa mdzad do/_/ka thog ces pa'i gnas su song na bstan pa mthar rgyas pa zhig 'ong zhes lung bstan pa ltar/nyid kyi dgung lo so brgyad pa ste rab byung gsum pa'i sa yos (1159)lor ka thil gyi phur sa dbyibs yi ge ka 'dra ba yod pa'i thog tu dgon pa phyag btab pas dgon pa'i ming la yang ka thog ces grags/dgon pa der ka dam pa'i slob ma gtsang ston rdo rje rgyal mtshan nas mkhas grub ye shes rgyal mtshan bar gdan rabs bcu gsum byon pa rnams kyi lo rgyus zhib pa stag dge gu ru bkra shis kyis mdzad pa'i (gu bkra chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 309nas 312bar gsal}
ka thog bla rabs bcu gsum|{shes rab seng ge /rje rgyal mtshan/byams pa 'bum/(karma pak+shi las bsnyen par rdzogs) spyan snga rin po che zhes dbon po bsod nams 'bum/dbu 'od pa ye shes 'bum/byang chub dbang phyug dpal ba/blo gros 'bum pa/blo gros seng ge /byang chub blo gros/byang chub rgyal mtshan dang bcu gsum mo/_}
ka thog rig 'dzin chen po|{gsang sngags lnga 'gyur gyi rig 'dzin dam pa'i skyes ma chog cig ste mtshan yongs grags su ka thog rig 'dzin chen por zhu zhing/mtshan gzhan tshe dbang nor bu zhes kyang 'bod/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa stag (1698)lor/mdo smad sa ngan bso ba zhes pa'i grong du yab rngu ba a ti mgon po'am jo bo skyabs dang/yum sgo bza' rdo rje 'tsho gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/stag bla pad+ma nor bu'i yang srid du ngos bzung/dgung lo lnga nas bcu bdun bar du grub dbang pad+ma bde chen gling pa sogs mkhas grub kyi bla ma mang por bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/dgung lo bco brgyad pa shing lug (1715)lor spo bo dang/kong po brgyud nas dbus gtsang du phebs/grub mtha' ris med kyi chos skor mang po gsan nas lo shas bzhugs/dgung lo nyer drug pa chu yos (1723)lor khams ka thog tu phyir phebs nas dgon pa'i gdan sa mdzad/lo de'i ston mjug la slar yang dbus gtsang dang/sa stod ding ri brgyud nas bal yul du phebs/dgung lo sum cu'i (1727)lor mnga' ris mang yul du phebs nas lo shas bzhugs/dgung lo so gcig par mchod rten bya rung kha shor gyi rab gnas la byon/dgung lo zhe brgyad pa shing glang (1745)lor gtsang khul nas dwags po brgyud de kong por phebs/nyang kha ljon sa lung du bzhugs skabs (bod rje lha btsan po'i gdung rabs tshig nyung don gsal )zhes pa'i gsung rtsom ring thang bral ba de brtsams gnang mdzad/dgung lo nga gcig pa sa 'brug (1748)lor su tu rin po che chos kyi 'byung gnas dang lhan du bal yul la phebs/bal po'i rgyal pos zhus pa ltar mchod rten bya rung kha shor gyi nyams gso phun sum tshogs pa gnang/de nas phyir log phebs pa'i lam bar glo bo sman thang ngam mnga' ris gung thang du 'bod pa'i nang gses gung thang za 'og phug tu lo gcig lhag tsam bzhugs ring mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal rabs yig rnying mang por zhib 'jug thog (gung thang rgyal rabs )rtsom sgrig gnang/dgung lo nga lngar phebs pa chu sprel (1752)lor la dwags stod smad gnyis nang 'khrug shor ba bod sa gnas srid gzhung la bar chings yong ba'i re 'dun zhus skabs/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtshos rig 'dzin chen po nyid la bka' yig phebs pa ltar/la dwags su phebs nas lo phyed gnyis tsam bzhugs te chings sgrigs mdzad pa phan tshul gnyis kas gus bkur zhus/dgung grangs nga bdun pa shing khyi (1754)lor slar yang bal yul du phebs/de'i phyi lo mnga' ris mang yul skyid grong du phebs nas gnas der dgongs pa rdzogs/gsung rtsom po chen po bzhi yod ces (la dwags rgyal rabs )su gsal yang dkar chag zhib gsal bdag gis ma mthong/rig 'dzin chen po 'di'i rnam thar rgyas pa sprul sku byang chub rdo rjes mdzad pa zhig yod 'dug kyang ma mjal/mdor bsdus tsam stag dge gu ru bkra shis kyis mdzad pa'i (gu bkra chos 'byung )shog grangs 576 dang/(gter na brgya rtsa'i rnam thar )shog grangs 67(la dwags kyi sngon rabs kun gsal me long )shog grangs 323bcas su gsal}
ka dam pa bde gshegs|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi bstan 'dzin mtshan snyan che ba zhig yin/mtshan gzhan bla ma shar pa spobs pa mtha' yas sam shes rab seng ge yang zhu/mdo khams su 'bor sgang gi sa char gtogs pa 'bri chu'i 'gram du rab yung gnyis pa'i chu stag (1122)lor yab gtsang pa dpal grags dang yul gtsang mo rin chen rgyan gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs shing/rje phag mo grub pa dang yum gcig pa'i sku mched gcung po yin/dgung lo bcu bdun pa sa rta (1138)lor dbus su byon nas 'phan yul du bla ma byang chub seng ge las rab tu byung/mtshan shes rab seng ger btags/'dzam ston 'gro ba'i mgon po sogs mkhas grub kyi la ma bdun tsam bsten nas gnang sngags gsar rnying gi chos skor ma lus pa gsan nas khams su phebs/dgung lo so brgyad pa sa yos (1159)lor bla ma 'dzam ston rin po ches lung bstan pa ltar/khams ka thil gyi lung pa'i phu yi ge ka 'dra ba'i sa gnas su ka thog dgon chen thog mar phyag 'debs par mdzad/mdo phyogs phar phyin dang/dbu ma/gsang sngags gsar rnying spyi dang/snga 'gyur rnying ma'i chos skor dar rgyas su mdzad pa'i bla rabs bcu gsum gyi bar du 'phel rgyas chen po byung zhing/de rjes nas kyang yul der nang pa'i bstan pa 'dzin skyong spel ba'i skyes chen mang du byon pa'i gnas gzhi chen po zhig tu gyur/a mdo dang/bar khams lho brgyud/mon bcas yi sa gnas khag la/chos brgyud 'dzin pa'i slob ma dang/dgon pa mang pos khyab nas yod/dgung lu don gcig par rab byung gsum pa'i chu byi (1192)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar rgyas pa dge slong sdings pos mdzad pa de sngon ka thog tu dpar yod/mdor bsdus tsam/stag dge mkhan chen gu ru bkra shis kyis mdzad pa'i (gu bkra chos 'byung )shog grangs 303nas 307bar gsal lo/_}
ka di da|{kha di da ste se ldeng/phun Da ri ka ni pad+ma dkar po'i ming}
ka gdung brtsegs ma bcu gsum|{bod gna' rabs kyi rgyun srol 'dzugs skrun gyi skabs khang pa'i nang gi shing brtsegs rgyan spros rgyas shos la sna kha nyi shu rtsa gcig yod pa dang/rgyas bsdus 'bring gi dbang du byas na bcu gsum/bsdus pa'i dbang du byas na dgu yod pas/rgyas shos ni/1 ka ba/2 bre/3 'ben log /4 gzhu/5 gdung stan/6 glang na/7 gdung ma/8 gdung khebs/9 rin po che/10 pad+ma/11 pad khebs/12 sprin chung/13 mchod brtsegs/14 babs khebs/15 babs brkyang ma/16 babs bskums ma/17 lcam/18 kha shing/19 gyen rtse/20 gag spang 21 lcam bkag bcas yin cing rgyas bsdus 'bring la gdung stan dang/glang nas/gdung khebs/rin po che/sprin chung/babs brkyang ma/babs khebs/gyen rtse bcas khag brgyad mi dgos pa yas pa de yin cing/bsdus pa'i dbang du byas na/gong gsal bcu gsum gyi nang nas/pad khebs dang/babs khebs/gag spang/gyen rtse bcas bzhi mi dgos par shing brtsegs dgus chog par byas pa yongs grags ltar yin/shing ba rtsegs rgyas pa'i dpar ris/po ta la'i tshoms chen nub phyogs kyi ka ring dpar ris la gsal}
ka na ya|{'di 'jigs byed kyi bskyed rim du/lag pa la bkod nas 'phangs pa'i mdung ring thag pa yod pa zhig yin par bshad pa de yin nam snyam ste/dag yig dang mngon brjod rnams su mi gsal}
ka n+ya kub dza|{('dul ba lung )las bshad pa'i rgya gar gyi gna' rabs kyi grong khyer zhig gi ming ste lung de nyid kyi rgyal po mang pos bkur pa'i gdung rabs 'a chad pa'i skabs su bskal bzang 'di'i sangs rgyas gnyis pa gser thub kyi gong nas yod pa'i grong khyer rnying pa zhig yin par bshad pa ltar na lo khri 'bum mang po song dgos tshod 'dug /grong khyer 'di rgya gar nub phyogs ma thu ra'am bod skad du bcom brlag ces 'bod pa'i gnas nas shar phyogs rgyang grags gcig tsam gyi sa na yod pa dang yul de'i bud med rnams gzugs mdzes kyang lus sgur po yin pas bo mo sgur mo'i yul zhes 'bod par mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyi (gtam rgyud gser thang )las gsal}
ka ni ka|{rgyal po ka Ni Sha ka /ka ni sha ka bcas 'bri stangs mi 'dra ba kha shas byung zhing/don du rgya gar nub phyogs kha che dza lan+d+ha ra'i yul gyi rgyal po stobs chen zhig yin par jo nang tA ra nA thas mdzad pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )le'u bcu gsum pa las bshad/(deb ther sngon po )stod cha grangs 47bstan pa'i gtad rabs rgya gar skad nas bod skad du bsgyur ba'i lung drangs par/bar skabs der bcom ldan 'das yongs su mya ngan las 'das nas lo sum brgya lon te zhes pa nas/dge 'dun la phul ba zhes pa'i bar der brtags na/rgyal po ka ni Shaka ni sangs rgyas mya ngan las 'das nas lo sum brgya 'das pa na byung bar bshad cing/(mkhas pa'i dga' ston )las kyang de dang mthun par gsungs/(lung phran tshegs )las sangs rgyas mya ngan las 'das nas lo bzhi brgya na rgyal po ka niSha ka sa srid skyong ba'i dus su bka' bsdu gsum pa byas par bshad/mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (gtam rgyud gser thang )shog grangs 314las/ku sha na'i rigs las rgyal rabs dang po ka da li shi bya bas sangs rgyas 'das rjes kyi lo drug brgya pa'i phyed snga ma'i nang du srid dbang bzung ba dang/de rjes rgyal rabs gnyis pa rgyal po sngon ma de dang ming 'dra ba zhig gis srid dbang bzung/rgyal po ka ni Sha ka ni rgyal rabs gsum yin par gsungs/bod kyi lo rgyus mang che bar sangs rgyas 'das nas lo bzhi brgya na rgyal po ka ni Sha ka 'i dus su bka' bsdu gsum pa byas par bshad pa dang bsdur na lo grangs rags pa mthun shas che bar 'dug /phyi rgyal gyi mkhas pa 'ga' zhig gis sangs rgyas 'das na lo drug brgya dang nyer gnyis pa spyi lo 79lor rgyal po ka ni Sha ka sa srid dbang bzung ba dang/de nas bzung shakya'i lo rabs zhes pa 'go tshogs pa yin zer/phyi rgyal du bzhugs pa'i bon kyi mkhas pa 'ga' zhig gis spyi lo'i dus rabs gnyis pa'i stod tsam la chos rgyal ka ni Sha ka sa ku sha na'i rgyal rgyud gtor nas ya gling dkyil ma dang/ab g+ha ni si than/rgya gar gyi nub byang dang byang phyogs li yul bcas mnga' 'og tu bsdus pa'i rgyal khab stobs chen zhig btsugs/rgyal rabs 'di nyid rgya gar gyi lo rgyus thog chos rgyal mya ngan med kyi rjes su rgyal rabs 'di las stobs che ba yung ma myong ba bcas kyi bshad tshul mi 'dra ba yod pa 'dir dpyad bzhir bkod/rgyal po 'di'i rgyal ni rgya gar nub phyogs kyi grong khyer rdo 'jog gi nub phyogs dang thag mi ring ba'i sa na yod par mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis (gtam rgyud gser thang )las gsungs/rgyal po 'di'i dus su theg pa che chung gnyis ka dar rgyas che zhing rgyal po rang nyid kyang theg pa che chung gnyis ka'i chos la dad gus yod pa dang/ka ni Sha ka 'i gtsug lag khang sogs gtsug lag khang mang po brtsigs pa'i nang nas rna rgyan nags kyi gtsug lag khang ni bod du yang grags che/rgyal po 'dis sbyin bdag yas te dgra bcom pa rtsigs tshogs sogs kyis gtso bo mdzad pa'i dgra bcom pa lnga brgyar gcig gis ma tshang bas bka' bsdu tha med byas pa dang/rgyal po rang nyid khro lo gnyis pa'i dus su bzos pa'i kha byang can gyi rdo sku zhig dang/kar+sha pA na bcas bcom brlag gi yul nas rnyed pa dngos su gzigs tshul mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis (gtam rgyud gser thang )las gsungs 'dug }
ka ni Sh+ka'i mchod rten|{mchod rten 'di de sngon dus rabs gnyis pa'i yas mas tsam du kha tshe dza lan rda ra'i yul gyi rgyal po ka ni Sha ka sa bzhengs pa'i nang pa'i ma chod rten zhig yin/rgya nag gi mkhas pa chen po ha shang h+pha hen dang/thang sen tsang gnyis rgya gar du phebs skabs mchod rten 'di da dung ma nyams par yod pa gzigs pa dang mchod rten 'di'i mtho tshad khru bzhi brgya lhag tsam (bod kyi mtho tshad 'dom brgya rtsa tsam ste/deng sang gi spyi khrer brtsis na nyis brgya lhag tsam )mtha' bskor du le dbar gcig dang phyed pa tsam/chos 'khor brtsegs nyi shu rtsa lnga yod ces so so'i rnam thar du gsal/mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis deng sang mchod rten de'i shul tsam las med ces (gtam rgyud gser thang )las gsungs}
ka pi la bstu|{gsham gyi ka pi la'i yul zhes pa der gsal}
ka pi la'i yul|{rgya gar gyi grong khyer ser skya'i ming yin cing/bcom ldan 'das sku 'khrungs pa'i gnas yin/slob dpon thang sen tsang gis mdzad pa'i (rgya gar lam yig )las ser skya'i grong khyer gyi shul la mtha' bskor du le dbar bco lnga tsam dang/grong stong bcu lhag tsam/lha khang gog pa mang po/pho brang gi lte bar lhum zhugs mchod rten gyi shul bcas dang/rgyal po zas gtsang gi sku brnyan/de dang nye bar yul sgyu 'phrul chen mo'i sku brnyan ma hA dzo gi nir grags pa dang/grong khyer gyi sgo bzhir gzhon du don grub kyi sku re dang/rga na 'chi ba'i sdug bsngal gyis mnar ba dang/dge slong gi rnam pa/grong khyer gyi nub byang du rgyal po 'phags skyes pos shAkya rnams bsad pa'i gnas dang/de dag gi rus pa bcug pa'i mchod rten brgya stong mang po/gzhon nu don grub gnon nu'i rol rtsed kyi mdzad pa bstan pa'i shul sogs yod ces gsal/btsan po paN+Di tas mdzad pa'i ('dzam gling rgyal bshad )las/bcom ldan 'das sku bltams pa'i gnas lum bi'i tshal de ni/grong khyer ser skya'i shar phyogs mal le lnga drug tsam gyi sa na yod par bshad/mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (rgya gar lam yig )las/lum bi'i tshal de la deng sang yong grags su ru man de zhes 'bod pa da nga/gnas der rgyal po mya ngan med yis btsugs pa'i rdo ring zhig gi ngos su/rgyal po khri lo nyer gcig pa la phyogs der slebs shing/phyogs 'dir sangs rgyas 'khrungs so zhes rdo ring bslang ba yin bya ba'i yi ge 'khod pa zhig deng sang yang mjal rgyu yod ces gsungs/zhib par gong gsal kyi dpyad gzhi'i yig cha khag gsum po der gsal lo/}
ka spungs|{pho brang dang lha khang lta bu'i gzhung sgo chen mo'i mdun ngos su sgo khang ste deng sang sgo 'phyor zhes 'bod pa de yin cing/ka spungs zhes pa'i go don yang sgo khang gi mdun du ka ba mang po g.yas g.yon du gral bsgrigs nas yod pa la bsams nas ming de ltar btags pa yin/po ta la'i bde yangs shar nub dang/gdan sa gsum sogs dgon pa khag phal che ba'i 'du khang gi mdun sgo'i phyi la sgo 'phyor zhes 'bod pa de yin}
ka phibs|{gzhogs g.yas g.yon gnyis sam gzhogs gcig la ka ma mang po gral bstar bsgrigs pa'i dkyil du 'gro lam dang/steng du thog bkab pa'i khyams ring po zhig ste/rgyal nang gi gling kha dang bod kyi nor bu gling kha/dgon pa khag gi shag skor bcas la ka phibs bka' yod pa lta ba yin}
ka phor|{ga phor}
ka phyag chu bo gnyis 'dres|{'di yi ge nor ba ste bka' phyag chu bo gnyis 'dres zhes bka' gdams chos lugs kyi lam rim brgyud pa'i man ngag dang mar mi dwags gsum nas brgyud pa'i phyag rgya chen po'i gdams ngag gnyis kyi brgyud pa phyogs gcig tu 'dres pa'am/yang na de gnyis kyi man ngag zung 'brel du nyams bzhes gnang ba la zer bas/karma bka' brgyud kyi man ngag dang/phyag rgya chen po'i man ngag gcig tu 'dres pa la go ba ni bon kyi nang chos lo rgyus la sbyangs pa chung ba'i rkyen gyis yig nor byung ba yin}
ka 'phan|{nang sa dang bod kyi gtsug lag khang dang/dgon pa khag gi mchod khang dang 'du khang nang du ka ba'i ngos su 'gel srol yod pa'i mchod rdzas zhig gi ming ste steng du 'phan mgo gos chen nam gser zangs las bzos pa'i tsi pa Ta'i mgo dang de'i gsham du 'phan lag dar sne gsum gyi dbus ma zheng che zhing/g.yas g.yon gnyis de las cung zad chung ba'i sde mor 'dzar phon g.yer kha can btags yod pa zhig yin}
ka ba sbrul mgo can|{lha sa gtsug lag khang gi yams ra nang ma'i mtha' bskor gyi ka thung rtags can bzhi'i gras shig ste/(bka' chems ka khol ma )dang (chos 'byung me tog snying po )(mkhas pa'i dga' ston )sogs lo rgyus mang por rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos ka ba 'di dang nye ba'i sar gtsug lag khang 'dir mi dang mi min gnod 'tshe bzlog pa'i ched du drag sngags nus mthu'i gter kha sbas zhes gsal}
ka ba bum pa can|{lha sa gtsug lag khang chen po'i khyams ra nang ma'i mtha' bskor gyi ka thung gras su ka ba rtags can bzhi yod pa'i nang gses zhig ste/ka ba 'di gang yin da phan jo bo rje a ti shas ngo mkhyen pa ma gtogs sus kyang ngos 'dzin ma thub cing/jo bo rjes gsang ba srung ba'i phyir du gtsug lag khang gi phyogs gang du yod med gsal por gsungs med/(bka' chems ka khol ma )dang/(chos 'byung me tog snying po )(mkhas pa'i dga' ston )sogs mang po zhig las/rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos ka ba 'di dang nye ba'i sar rin po che'i gter sbas par gsungs pa/ka ba'i gter rtags mtshan mar brtags na don dngos dang mthun nam snyam/snar thang mkhan chen mchims nam mkha' rags kyis phyogs bsgrigs mdzad pa'i (jo bo rje a ti sha'i rnam thar rgyas pa )las/ka ba 'di nas 'dom gsum dang phyed ka gzhal ba'i gdung gseb nas bka' chems shog dril gsum ste/1 blon po rnams kyis bsgrigs pa'i (zla ba 'dod 'jo/) 2 btsun mo rnams kyis mdzad pa'i (dar dkar gsal ba ) 3 rgyal po nyid kyis mdzad pa'i (bka' chems ka khol ma )bcas gter nas bton gnang thog /nyin mo cig la ji tsam bris zin pa de ma gtogs bshus mi chog cer gter bdag gis bkag cha byas pa ltar/jo bo rje'i slob ma rnal 'byor pa sogs bzhis khag bgos nas bshus pa gnang/mjug nas phran tsam bshus ma tshar ba dang/bka' chems gyi nang don zhib cha rnams mi ngan gyis gtor bshig mi 'byung ched bris bshus ma mdzad par sngar gyi rang gnas su 'jog par mdzad ces jo bo'i rje rnam thar dang (bka' chems ka khol ma'i )gleng gzhi gnyis ka las gsal}
ka ba shAkya dbang phyug|{jo bo rje a ti sha'i dngos slob bgres pa'i gras yin/'khrungs yul ni 'phan po/rus ni ska ba/jo bo rje a ti sha bod du ma byon gong dbus gtsang gi mkhas pa brgyad kyi nang tshan rba btsun blo gros dbang phyug gi drung nas rab yung dang bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/'brom ston pas dbus gtsang gi mi chen rnams la jo bo rje bod du spyan 'dren pa'i bskul ma'i phyag bris 'byor pa ltar mnga' ris mang yul du spyan 'dren la phebs/jo bo rje dbus kyi lha sar phebs rjes khong gi bzhugs gnas 'phan yul lan pa spyil bur gdan drangs/jo bo rje'i slob ma rnams kyis khong gi bka' bzhin sgrub pa zhig yin}
ka ba shing lo can|{lha sa gtsug lag khang gi khyams ra nang ma'i mtha' bskor gyi ka thung gras su ka ba rtags can bzhi yod pa'i nang gses zhig ste/lo rgyus 'ga' zhig tu/'od dpag med kyi lha khang gi sgo'i g.yas g.yon mdun gsum gang rigs shig tu yod par bshad/ka ba 'di dang nye ba'i sar gter gang zhig sbas pa'i skor la gsung tshul mi mthun pa yod/(rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )dang (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )sogs las ka ba 'di dang nye ba'i sar rin po che'i gter sbas par gsungs/(bka' thang sde lnga'i rgyal po bka' thang )las ka ba 'di dang nye ba'i sar chos gter sbas par gsungs pa dang/(bka' chems ka khol ma )dang/(chos 'byung me tog snying po )(mkhas pa'i lde'u'i chos 'byung )rje tsong kha pa chen po'i rnam thar )rgyas bsdus bcas mthun par snang/(bka' chems ka khol ma )yi gter byang dum bu'i nang/ka ba 'di dang nye ba'i sa gso rig sman dpyad kyi gzhung khag gcag kyang gter du sbas zhes gsal}
ka ba seng mgo can|{lha sa gtsug lag khang gi khyams ra nang ma'i mtha' bskor gyi ka ba rtags bzhi'i gras shig ste/ka ba 'di dang nye ba'i sar rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos gtsug lag khang 'dir mi dang mi min gyi gnod 'tshe phyir ba zlog byed pa'i gsang sngags kyi rigs rnams gter du sbas zhes (bka' chems ka khol ma )dang/(chos 'byung me tog snying po )(mkhas pa'i dga' ston )bcas las gsal}
ka ma ta'i yi ge|{(mdo rgya cher rol po )dang bod yig gi gna' rabs lo rgyus yig cha mang po'i nang gsal zhing/yig gzugs kyi dpe ni (rgya dkar nag rgya ser kasmir bal bod hor gyi yi ge dang dpe ris rnam grangs )zhes pa'i dpe rnying lcang lung paN+Di ta blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi gsung 'bum phyi sog gi dpar ma pod (nga)pa'i mjug tu yod pa de'i shog grangs 10nas 3bar dang/(yig rigs sna tshogs kyi phyi mo me tog phreng ba )sku 'bum che shos rin po che'i bla brang gi shing dpar shog grangs 7nas 4pa'i mjug bar gsal ba der gzigs}
ka ma ba shes rab 'od|{'di nyid dgon pa ba'i bu bzhi'i ya gyal yin zhing/rab yung nga po'i me bya (1057)lor lan pa mdar sku 'khrungs/rab tu byung ba'i mtshan la shes rab 'od zhu/phyis dgon pa ba mjal du byon pas dgon pa bas chos dang zang zing gnyis kas bskyangs/mngon par rtogs pa'i yon tan yang tshad med pa dang ldan pa yin/thugs rab kyang shin tu che/rtog ge 'bar ba nag tshos bsgyur ba las rnal 'byor spyod pa'i de kho na nyid gtan la dbab pa'i le'u la bsgyur bcos mdzad pa po mkhas btsun shes rab 'od gsal gnyis kyis bsgyur zer ba'i ya gcig khong yin pa 'dra'o/_/'di nyid kyis ka ma dgon pa btab/dge 'dun bdun brgya tsam 'tshogs/phyi rol gyi dang po ngan pa rnams bzang por bsgyur nus pa'i ting nge 'dzin brtan po yang mnga'/mthar dgung lo bdun cu don lnga pa rab byung gnyis pa'i lcags phag (1131)lor sku gshegs}
ka ma rU pa|{rgya gar gyi gnas chen zhig ste mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis parba ti phur nas g+ho ha Da bar rel li dang de nas mal le bcu bdun song ba na shar rtswa mchog grong (ma hA mu ni )yod/de ni gnas chen nyer bzhi'i ya gyal gyi ka ma rU pa yin 'dug cing/sngon mdo sngags gnyis ka'i bstan pa shin tu dar ba'i gnas yin zhes gsungs}
ka ma la gup+ta|{'di lo tsA ba rin chen bzang pos bsten myong ba'i paN+Di ta chen po zhig par deb ther (dpyid kyi rgyal mo'i glu dbyangs)nang gsungs pa las gzhan gyi lo rgyus da phan ma 'jal lags}
ka ma la rak+Shi ta|{rgya gar gyi nang pa'i gnas gzhi che shos gras bri ka ma la shI la'i mkhan thog bcu gnyis pa yin pa dang mdo sngags kyi gzhung thams dang/lhag par du phar phyin dang/gsang ba 'dus pa/gshin rje gshed bcas la mkhas pa phul du phyin pa'i paN+Di ta zhig yin zhing/jo bo rje a ti sha dang/mkhas grub khyung po rnal 'byor la sogs pa'i paN+Di ta dang grub thob mang po zhig gi rtsa ba'i bla ma yin/sku tshe'i stod du drag po mngon spyod kyi mdzad pa'i sgo nas mu stegs mang po btul/sku tshe'i smad du na len+d+ra dgon pa dang thag nye ba'i nags khrod cig tu sgrub pa gtso bor mdzad cing bzhugs/'di'i lo rgyus cung zad cig (rgya gar chos 'byung )shog grangs 313nas 314bar gsal bas der gzigs}
ka ma la shI la|{ka ma la ste pad+ma dang shI la ni ngang tshul te pad+ma'i ngang tshul lam rgyal ba'i ngang tshul zhes bya zhing/rgya gar gyi rnal 'byor spyod pa'i dbu ma rang rgyud pa'i bzhed srol 'dzin pa'i paN+Di ta chen po zhig yin pa yongs grags kyi lo rgyus phal che ba'i nang gsal yang/mnga' bdag nyang nyi ma 'od zer gyis mdzad pa'i (chos 'byung me tog snying po )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 332dang/yang de nyid kyis mdzad pa'i (bka' thang zangs gling ma )lcags dpar gyi shog grangs 52pa bcas gnyis kar rgyal nag nas slob dpon ka ma la shI la spyan drangs zhes 'khod 'dug pa de kho bo'i bsam tshul ltar nam yig bris ma gcig la gcig brgyud kyis dpe bshu byas stabs/yig phreng gong ma nas 'og mar mchongs te bris nor byung ba min nam snyam te yig phreng gong mar rgya nag nas hA shang ma hA ya na bod du phebs pa dang/rgya gar nas slob dpon ka ma la shI la gdan drangs zhes gsungs rgyu yin nges snyam pas mkhas dbang rnams kyis dpyad par zhu zhing/slob dpon 'di mkhan cheni ba 'tsho'i dngos slob yin/mkhan chen zhi ba 'tsho sku 'das rjes rgya nag nas phebs pa'i hA shang ma hA ya nas cig ngar 'jug pa'i chos zhes phyag mchod sogs lus ngag gi chos spyod mi dgos par dang po nas sems rnam par mi rtog pa sgom dgos pa'i srol gsar pa dar spel btang bar brten sngar gyi slob dpon zhi ba 'tsho'i skabs btsugs pa gnang ba'i chos srol dang mi mthun pa'i phyogs khag gsar pa zhig chags te bod kyi nang bstan chos lugs pa nang khul lta ba mi mthun pa'i phyogs khag gnyis byung/hA shang gi phyogs khag rnams kyis slob dpon zhi ba 'tsho'i yogs khag rnams dmar gsod gtong rtsis byas shing/'ga' zhig rang srog bcad pa bcas 'gal zla tshabs chen byung ba la/btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyis hA shang phyogs khag rnams la phun tshun drag 'thab ma dgos par phyogs gnyis kyi slob dpon mkhas pa rnams chos rtsod 'gran gleng thog rgyal phab thag gcod gnang rgyur go bskon slob gso gnang rjes mkhan po zhi ba 'tsho sku gshegs kha'i zhal chems ltar khong gi slob ma kA ma la shI la bal yul nas gdan drangs pa ltar bsam yas su phebs thog /hA shang ma hA ya na dang rtsod gleng gnang ste hA shang tshar bcad pa sogs (rba bzhed )dang (mda' bdag nyang ral pa can gyi chos 'byung )sogs bod yig gi chos 'byung lo rgyus tshang ma gsung tshul gcig mthun du yod/'on kyang deng skabs rgyal khab phyi nang gi mkhas pa mang pos gsungs don du bod yig gi lo rgyus thog hA shang gi phyogs rtsod pa phab par gsal ba de btsan po khri srong lde btsan dang slob dpon ka ma la shI la'i phyogs gtogs kyis bris pa zhig yin pa dang/rgya yig gi thog bris pa'i (rigs pa yang dag par nges pa )zhes pa'i nang rtsod pa bsam gtan mkhan po'i phyogs la rgyal kha thob par bshad yod pas bod yig thob bris pa'i lo rgyus de khungs dag min zhes hA shang ma hA ya na'i don du dag sel gnang mkhan byung yod pas don gnad de skor la gzu bor gnas pa'i mkhas dbang rnam pa tshos zhib dpyad gnang rogs zhu rgyu/slob dpon ka ma la shI la bsam yas chos rtsod kyi rjes su lo kha shas bod du bzhugs ring btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyis lta ba da nga/sgom pa/'bras bu gsum gyi skor la dri ba zhus pa'i lan du (sgom rim dang po/bar pa/tha ma )bcas ched rtsom mdzad de 'bras bu gsungs pa'i zhor la hA shang ma ya na'i lta yul la dgag pa mdzad/(gsung rtsom de lo tsA ba zhang ye shes sdes bod skad du bsgyur ba bstan 'gyur sde dge dpar ma'i pod (ki )par yod) slar yang sgom rim gsum gyi don 'grel du lung rigs gnyis kyi sgo nas gtan la phab pa'i (dbu ma snang ba )brtsams par mdzad pa de lo tsA ba dpal brtsegs rak+Shi tas bod skad du bsgyur ba bstan 'gyur sde dge dpar ma'i mdo phyogs pod (sa )par yod/gzhan yang gsung rtsom gzhan dag skor (sher phyin bdun brgya pa'i rgya cher bshad pa )lo tsA ba nam mkha' bstan pas bsgyur ba bstan 'gyur sde dge dpar ma'i mdo phyogs pod (ma )par yod/(sher phyin rdo rje gcod pa dbu ma'i tshul du 'grel ba (lo tsA ba zhang ye shes sdes bsgyur ba dang (dbu ma rgyan gyi dka' 'grel )lo tsA ba ye shes sde bsgyur ba bstan 'gyur sde dge dpar ma'i mdo phyogs pod (sa )par yod/gzhan yang gsung khag kha shas yod pa 'dir ma bkod/slob dpon sku gshegs rkyen ni bod yig gi lo rgyus thog gsal ba ltar na hA shang ma hA ya na'i phyogs chos rtsod pham nyes byung ba des nad ma theg par gshed ma lag dmar pa gnyis mngags nas mtshan mo sgra bsgyur khang par gzims nas bzhugs pa'i dus su mkhal ma btsir nas sku dkrongs par bshad pa dpyad gzhi che snyam}
ka med rta ra|{lha sa'i bar skor gyi shar du yod pa'i ka med rta ra zhes pa'i khang pa de ni btsan po srong btsan sgom pos lha sa'i gtsug lag khang gsar skrun mdzad skabs kyi chibs ri yin skad}
ka tshal|{mal dro brgyud 'bri gung ngos su 'gro ba'i lam bar gyi kha nub tu blta ba'i ri ldebs su yod pa'i ka tshal lha khang ste/rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos lha sa gtsug lag khang ma bzhengs gong btab pa'i mtha' 'dul gyi lha khang bzhi'i gras bod kyi sa dbyibs srin mo gan rkyal gyi gzugs ltar gnas pa'i dpung mgo g.yas pa gnon pa'i ched du bzhengs pa yin zhes bshad srol yod}
ka wa li|{nang bstan gsung rab kyi chos dpe 'jug snod kyi ming rnying pa ste/yongs grags su sho ka li zer ba de yin de'i sgrom skyor ni si dang smyug ma gang rigs kha gshags te dra rig lta bur bzos pa'i bar stong rnams shog bu lugs ma 'thug tshad sor phyed ka tsam zhig che chung phyi sgrom dang mnyam pa bzos pa'i 'dus mtshams kyi gzer sdoms rnams gla pags rgyun bu'am ko bse'i rgyun bu gang rigs kyis bsdams thog /nang sha gos chen dang ras gang rigs btang nas steng 'og sbrel mtshams kyi mtho tshad sor lnga yan bzhag par gos chen dang ras sogs chos gcig ma byas pa da nga/bsdoms thag hrug (yun dmar po yin pa zhig )si tA ho gang rigs kyis bsdams chog pa zhig ste/rgyud grwa stod smad gnyis kyi sho ka li bcas bzo dbyibs dang/rgyu chu'i spros pa rgyas bsdus mi 'dra ba yod do/}
ka gzhu|{ka ba dang gzhung zhes pa'i tshig sdud/de yang ka ba'i steng du bre gdan/de'i steng du bre/de'i steng du gzhu yod pa bod kyi 'dzugs skrun khyad chos yin pa dang/lha sa gtsug lag khang gi khyams ra nang ma'i ka ba phur pa'i gzugs kyi steng du bre gdan pad gzugs can zlum po/brtsegs nas yod/krung go'i 'dzugs skrun bzo las dpe skrun khang nas dpar skrun byas pa'i (bod kyi gna' rabs 'dzugs skrun )zhes pa'i brnyan dpar gyi shog grangs 51par gzigs na ka ba dag gzhu'i dbyibs rnams rgya gar dang bal yul gyi lha khang gi ka gzhung dang gcig mtshungs yod}
