ka shi rmir khongs kha che'i phyag khang|{lha sa'i ka shi rmir khongs kyi kha che'i phyag khang ni lha sa'i gling skor lho lam rags kha smad du yod/ching rgyal rabs kyi sngon nas ka shi rmir khongs kyi tshong pa nyung shas shig lha sar bsdad pa dang/skabs der rags kha smad du phyag khang zhig gsar du btsugs/rjes su phyag khang de rgya bskyed thegs gcig byas pa dang/de snga kha che'i chos pa sbir ya kob zer ba zhig lha sar bsdad de nyin ltar nyin dgung nyan bran gyi ri steng brag rdo zhig gi steng du phyag 'tshal rgyag par 'gro ba de p+tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas pho brang po ta la nas gzigs te der thugs mos byung bas rgya mda' sgang gi kha che'i lha khang gi sa cha gnang zhing/rgya mda' sgang ni sa de'i rgya khyon gyi tshad yin zer/de skabs ka shi rmir nas 'byor pa'i mi 44yod pa de dag lha sar gtan sdod chog pa dang de dag la dmigs bsal gzigs skyong gnang ste sa der khral yul rgyugs mi dgos pa'i thog dus chen skabs gzigs bzos kyang gnang gi yod skad/sbir ya kob kyis phyag 'tshal rgyag sa'i rag ri der ka shi rmir khongs kyi kha che tsho lo ltar gnas mjal smon lam 'debs par 'gro srol yod/rgya mda' sgang la ma gzhi phyag khang zhig yod kyang rgyun gtan lha sa'i phyag khang du phyag 'tshal byed cing/smyung gnas dang gor pan gyi dus chen skabs mgron 'bod dang/sems can srog gcod sogs byed rgyur sa cha gu yangs shing/cha rkyen bzang pas kha chen rnams rgya mda' sgang la 'gro bas phyag khang de gnyis khongs gtogs gcig gi kha che mang che ba spyi lo 1961lor ka shi rmir la log 'gro skabs spyi rdzas rnams khyer/da cha phyag khang yas mas gnyis kar nyams gso dang 'brel lha sar yod pa'i rgyal khongs phyi rgyal yin pa'i kha che rnams phya 'tshal sogs chos kyi byed sgo spel yul yin}
ka shi'i gur khang|{(ka shi ka'i gur khang )ka li'i yul nas thon pa'i ras las 'tshem bzo byas pa'i gur zhes pa'i don/bod sa gnas su gur che chung sna tshogs bzo ba'i lam lugs ni sngar btsan po'i dus rabs skabs nas dar srol che zhing/gur che ba'i nang mi brgya phrag kha shas shong ba nas chung ba la mi gsum bzhi shong ba'i bar yod/gur gyi dbyibs la lding gur rta gzugs mdang/lcog gur/dmag gur/sbra gur bcas rigs mi 'dra ba yod/lding gur rta gzugs ma ni gur gyi stod cha rgya phibs dang 'dri bar ngos gnyis gru bzhi dang/logs gnyis gru gsum yin cing/gsham cha gru bzhir yod pa'i mdo sbug gnyis dang/mdo la yol sgor/gur gyi steng du char khebs/'go snam dang ras tshos sogs kyi babs lhe rgyan spros rgyas bsdus na tshogs byas pa zhig yin/lcog gur ni gur gyi dbyibs bang so lum po'i dbyibs lta bu/nang gi dkyil du ka ba gcig las med pa dang/'ga' zhig nang du shing dra ba bsnol ma bsgrigs pa'i gur sgrom la phyi nas ras dang phying pa'i gur g.yogs rgyu yod pa de rigs la zer/dmag gur gyi ngos gnyis grub zhi dang/logs gnyis gru gsum/nang du ka ba yas mas gnyis dang/steng du gur gdung bcas stod smad sgrigs bshig byed rgyu yod pa de rigs dmag dpung dang/'grub pa phyogs thon skabs 'khyer stabs bde ba zhig yin/sbra gur ni 'brog khul du sdod pa'i 'brog pa rnams kyis rgyu rtsid pa las 'thags pa'i sbra las bzos pa'i gur zhig ste/dbyar dus char pa dang dgun dus kha rlung 'gog thub cing/tsha ba che skabs bsil ba bcas kyi khyad chos yod pa zhig yin}
ka shi'i grong|{ka shi'i yul zhes pa grong khyer wa ra Na si chags sa'i yul spyi'i ming yin cing/de nas thon pa'i ras la ka shi ka'i ras zer/zhib par gong gsal ka ci sgong shun ma zhes pa der gzigs}
ka so ri ba|{'di yang rgya gar gyi grub chen zhig yin/'di yi lo rgyus rags bsdus tsam zhig jo nang tA ra nA thas mdzad pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )shog grangs 293las/yi dam rdo rje rnal 'byor ma brten nas grub pa thob/rdzu 'phrul dang sprul bsgyur la mnga' brnyed pa zhig yin par gsungs pa tsam las zhib cha mi gsal}
kA ma tsan+d+ra|{gna' rabs rgya gar shar phyogs bam g+ha lar (deng sang gi rgya skad du mang cha la zer )tsan+d+ra'i rigs kyi rgyal po bcu dgu byung ba'i rgyal rabs bcu bzhi pa yin zhing/tA ra nA tha'i (rgya gar cho sa 'byung )skabs nyi shu rtsa gnyis par slob dpon 'phags pa thogs med mdzad 'phrin rgyas pa'i skabs rgyal por 'di rgyal srid skyong ba'i dus skabs yin par gsungs}
kA ma rU pa|{nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i gsang sngags yi gzhung nas bshad pa'i yul nyi shu rtsa bzhi'i nang tshan zhig ste/bod skad du bsgyur na 'dod pa'i gzugs zhes pa'i go don yin tshul (saM bod skad gnyis shan sbyar gyi tshig mdzod )las gsal/btsan po paN+Di tas mdzad pa'i ('dzam gling rgyas bshad )las/rang re'i bod ljongs kyi chu bo yar lung gtsang po de lho nas kong po brgyud rgya gar shar phyogs su 'bab pa'i khul der ri warta'i yul yod cing/yul de la chag gsum du phye ba'i dbus kyi cha la gau ha ri dang/kam tsha rang+ga gnyis/shar gyi cha la a sam gyi yul/nub kyi cha la kA ma rU pa'i yul zhes 'bod la kA ma rU pa'i yul zhes gsal bar gsungs/gnas chen nyi shu rtsa bzhi'i gras kyi kA ma rU pa'i yul dngos ni dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis g+ho ha Ta nas le dbar bcu bdun tsam song ba na/shar rtsa mchog grong ngam ma hA mu nir 'bod pa de yin pa dang/sa gnas der sngon dus su nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i mdo sngags kyi bstan pa dar rgyas chen po byung ba'i gnas yin zhes (rgya gar gnas chen khag gi lam yig )ces pa las gsungs}
kA ri ka lnga bcu|{bstan 'gyur nang yod pa'i 'dul ba'i gzhung zhig gi ming ste/mdzad pa po ni 'ga' zhig gis mgon po klu sgrub kyis mdzad par bzhed cing/mkhas pa mang pos gzhung 'di kha che'i slob dpon dge 'dun bzang pos mdzad par gsungs/kha byang du ('phags pa gzhi thams cad yod par smra ba'i dge tshul gyi tshig le'ur byas pa lnga bcu pa )zhes 'khod cing/nang don ni dge tshul gyi sdom pa blangs zin pa rnams kyi spang bya rtsa ba bzhi dang/blang 'das so drug gi nyes pa dang phyogs mthun gyi nyes pa so so'i ngo sprod bcas zhib par gsungs yod/bstan pa sngar dar gyi skabs rgya gar gyi mkhan po mu ni warma dang/bod kyi lo tsA ba sna nam ye shes sdes bsgyur ba zhig yin/sde dge bstan 'gyur pod (su )pa'i mgor yod}
kA la ri'i dgon bkra shis lhun grub|{rje tsong kha pa'i dngos slob bstan pa phyogs mthar spel ba'i dar chen drug gi nang tshan rong po ljags nag pa dge 'dun rgyal mtshan gyis rab byung bdun pa'i chu 'brug (14120lor btab pa'i dgon pa zhig yin/thog mar mgon po gur dang bram gzugs gnyis kyi sku brnyan bzhugs pa'i mgon khang tsam bzhengs/rjes su kirti sku phreng gnyis pa 'gro mgon bstan pa rin chen gyis byams sku bzhugs pa'i lha khang bzhengs gnang thog /rim bzhin slob ma yang slob dang/kirti sku phreng rim byon rnams kyis lha khang mang po gsar bzhengs mdzad pa yin/kirti sku phreng dang po'i skabs ri khrod der grwa pa sum cu tsam yod ces ri khrod 'di'i lo rgyus su gsal}
kA lI dA sa|{rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta nag po khol gyi ming yin/paN+Di ta 'di dus skabs gang du byung ba ni jo nang tA ra nA thas mdzad pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )skabs bco lnga pa 'phags pa klu sgrub kyis bstan pa skyong ba'i dus kyi gtam las mgon po klu sgrub kyi sku tshe'i smad du rgyas po b+ho dza de wa gsang sngags kyi grub pa thob pa dang wa ra nA sa'i rgyal po b+hi ma shu las srid dbang bzung ba bcas dus mtshungs pa dang/dus skabs der paN+Di ta 'di byung bar gsungs/mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (gtam rgyud gser thang )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 322las/rgyal po tsan+d+ra gup+ta gnyis pa'am bi kra ma di t+ya yang 'bod pa 'dis sangs rgyas 'das lo dgu brgya dang so dgu pa'i (395)lor srid bzung ba dang/rgyal po 'di'i mdun sar kA li dA sa sogs rin chen dgu zhes grags pa'i mkhas pa rnams yod par grags shing/slob dpon phyogs kyi gling po yang 'di dang dus mnyam zhes gsungs 'dug /paN+Dita nag mo khol gyi lo rgyus skor (rgya gar chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 100nas 103bar dang mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (gtam rgyud gser thang )shog grangs 322nas 325bar gsal bas der gzigs}
kak+Ni sgo bzhi|{lha sa grong khyer gyi bar skor byang ngos khrom lam gyi snang rtse shag las khungs kyi g.yon ngos su yod pa'i mchod rten chen po phyogs bzhir kar sgo btod pa de yin/mchod rten 'di thog mar byung ba'i dus tshon nam yin skor dpyad bzhi'i yig cha ma mthong yang de sngon dus rabs bcu bzhi pa'i 'gor byon pa'i kun mkhyen klong chen pa dgung lo nyi shu lhag tsam gyi dus lha sar gtsug lag khang du gnas gzigs phebs skabs kak+Ni sgo bzhi'i mchod rten gyi thad du ma gcig lab kyi sgron ma'i zhal gzigs byung tshul dang/grub thob thang stong rgyal po lha sar gnas gzigs la phebs thengs gnyis pa'i skabs lo gcig ring mchod rten 'di'i 'gram du sprang po'i tshul mdzad nas bzhugs tshul dam pa gnyis ka'i rnam thar nang gsal bar 'khod pa ltar na mchod rten 'di skabs de dus nas yod par mthong thub/dmangs khrod kyi ngag rgyun du mchod rten 'di'i gzungs kyi nang tshong dpon nor bu bzang po'i dbu thod dang rgyan cha sogs yod par brten lha sa grong khyer gyi nang 'dzam gling gi tshong zon sna 'dzoms 'dus thub pa byung ba red ces shod srol 'dug kyang rjes su rab byung bcu drug 'i shing bya (1945)lor de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung nas nyams gso byed skabs gzungs 'bul dang rab gnas la phebs myong ba'i skyes chen dam pa 'ga' zhig gi rang rnam nang gsungs don du/mchod rten 'di'i nang rtsa che'i rten mang po yod tshul dmangs khrod kyi ngag rgyun du shod srol yod rung de rigs gang yang med par brten rnam sras dang dzam b+ha la sogs nor lha khag gi bum gter gzungs su phul zhes gsal bar mchod rten 'dir nyams chag thengs 'ga' zhig byung yod nges snyam mo/}
kak+Ni sgo bzhi dang man thang ser po|{lha sa grong khyer gyi bar skor byang ngos khrom lam gyi snang rtse shag las khungs kyi g.yon ngos su yod pa'i mchod rten chen po phyogs bzhir kar sgo gtod pa de yin/mchod rten 'di thog mar byung ba'i dus tshod nam yin skor dpyad gzhi'i yig cha ma mthong yang de sngon dus rabs bcu bzhi pa'i 'gor byon pa'i kun mkhyen klong chen pa dgung lo nyi shu lhag tsam gyi dus lha sar gtsug lag khang du gnas gzigs phebs skabs/kak+Ni sgo bzhi'i mchod rten gyi thad du ma gcig lab kyi sgron me'i zhal gzigs byung tshul dang/grub thob thang stong rgyal po lha sar gnas gzigs la phebs thengs gnyis pa'i skabs lo gcig ring mchod rten 'di'i 'gram du sprang po'i tshul/dam pa gnyis ka'i rnam thar nang gsal bar 'khod pa lta na mchod rten 'di skabs de dus nas yod pa mthong thub/dmangs khrod kyi ngag rgyud du mchod rten 'di'i gzungs kyi nang tshong dpon nor bu bzang po'i dbu thod dang rgyan cha sogs yod par brten lha sa grong khyer gyi nang 'dzam gling gi tshong zon sna 'dzoms 'dus thub pa byung ba red ces shod srol 'dug kyang rjes su rab byung bcu drug 'i shing bya (1945)lor de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung nas nyams gso byed skabs gzungs 'bul dang rab gnas la phebs myong ba'i skyes chen dam pa 'ga' zhig gi rang rnam nang gsungs don du/mchod rten 'di'i nang rtsa che'i rten mang po yod tshul dmangs khrod kyi ngag rgyun du shod srol yod rung de rigs gang yang med par brten rnam sras dang dzam b+ha la sogs nor lha khag gi bum gter gzungs su phul zhes gsal bas/mchod rten 'dir nyams chag thengs 'ga' zhig byung yod nges snyam/gzhan yang 'phan po dbu ru lung shang gi khongs su brag steng zhig la kak+Ni sgo bzhi zhes pa'i mkhar shul zhig yod pa de bod sil bu'i dus skabs su brtsigs pa'i mkhar rdzong zhig yin skad dang/sgo bzhi zhes pa ni mkhar rdzong de'i lcags rir sgo bzhi yod pa'i go don yin 'dug /mchod rten de'i byang ngos su mi dbang 'khor chen zhes pa'i ma Ni lha khang ser po zhig yod pa de dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i nang mi dbang pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis bzhengs skad}
kak+Ni'i mchod rten|{mchod rten chen po'i sa 'dzin gyi 'og gang yang na khri'i phyogs bzhir 'grim 'grul gyi 'gro lam yod pa zhig /dper na lha sa grong khyer gyi bar skor khrom lam byang du rig gnas gsar brje'i gong mthong rgyu yod pa'i ma chod rten kak+Ni sgo bzhi lta bu yin}
kag nis sbrel|{lha sa grong khyer gyi nub ngos su yod pa'i dmar po ri dang lcags po ri gnyis sngon dus ri sna gnyis sbrel nas yod pa la rgya bza' cin khren kong jo la btsan po khri srong lde btsan 'khrungs rjes/yab khri lde gtsug brtan gyi btsun mo che ba sna nam bza' bzhi stengs kyis phrogs par ba rten rgya bza' cin khren kong jo ma dga' ba'i dbang gis bya thabs gzhan ma rnyed par lha sa dang yar lung khul du yod pa'i bod kyi sa dpyad bzang po mi nyung ba zhig gtor bshig btang ba'i nang nas bod la nang 'khrugs rgyun mi chad pa yong ba'i phyir du lha sa'i dmar po ri dang lcags po ri gnyis kyi ri sna sbrel ba dang/lcags po ri dang bar ma ri'i mjug ma sbrel ba bcad/rjes su sras khri srong lde btsan rang nyid la thob rjes de sngon gtor bshig btang ba'i sa dpyad khag gcig nyams gso byas de skabs dmar lcags kyi ri gnyis sna sbrel ched ri sna phan tshun gnyis kyi steng du mchod rten re dang/bar du kak+Ni'i mchod rten brtsigs pa yin zhes lo rgyus mang por gsal ba don dngos dang mthun pa e yin snyam pas dpyad par zhu'o/}
kany+tsi|{rgya gar lho phyogs kyi dbus dkyil sa khul tri ling ka zhes pa de yin par bshad}
kany+tsi pu ra|{rgya gar gyi lho phyogs Ti ling+ka zhes 'bod pa'i yul te sngon sa su gup+ta'i rgyal khab kyi khongs su yod pa'i blon po zhig gis gup+ta'i rgyal khab stobs shugs nyams rjes gup+ta'i rgyal khab kyi khongs nas logs su thon te pa la wa zhes pa'i rgyal rabs btsugs shing/na ra sing ha warba na dang po'i skabs rgyal khab de yi mnga' khongs rgya cher gyur nas rgyal sa kany+tsi pur la gnas gzhi bcas pas grong khyer de'i ming la kany+tsi pu ra zer/slob dpon thang san tsang gi lam yig bod skad du bsgyur ba las/yul der gtsug lag khang brgya dang gcig tsam la dge 'dun chig khri lhag bzhugs pa thams cad gnas brtan sde pa kho na yin pa dang/mu stegs pa'i lha khang bcu lhag la phyi rol ger bu ba mang tsam gnas shing/sngon sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das phebs bzhugs mdzad pa'i gnas gang yod sar rgyal po mya ngan med kyi mchod rten re bzhengs yod pa dang/yul de ni byang chub sems dpa' dpal ldan chos skyong (grub chen bir wa pa )gi 'khrungs yul yin zhes gsungs 'dug go }
kat+ya ya na|{nyan thos sde pa bzhi'i nang gi gnas brtan sde pa'i thog ma'i slob dpon yin zhing/'khrungs yul ni rgya gar skad du u jen te/bod skad du 'phags rgyal zhes 'bod pa de yin par ('dul ba lung )gi sman gyi gzhi'i skabs su gsungs/khong gi rigs ni kat+ya yin pa dang/rab tu ma byung gong gi mtshan ni na la dA dang/rab tu byung rjes kat+ya'i bu dang kat+ya na zhes 'bod/sangs rgyas kyi dngos slob nang nas mtha' 'khor 'dul ba'i mchog tu gyur pa zhig yin/khong gi lo rgyus zhib pa ma mthong zhing cung zad tsam 'dul ba'i gleng 'bum shog grangs 390(ba)par gsal}
kaTha maN+Ta|{'di la deng sang bod skad thog ka da man rdur zer zhing rgya skad du ca ta man tu'u zhes 'bod pa de yin/go don ni shing dkyil zer ba dang bod yig gi lo rgyus mang por ye rang zhes 'bod pa de yin par btsan po paN+Di ta'i ('dzam gling rgyas bshad )las gsal}
kan gru'u mkhar|{({(WP:1,194)}) kan su'u zhing chen gyi khongs gtogs pa'i gna' bo'i mkhar rnying pa zhig ste/(mdo smad chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 147las/lang gru nas nub byang phyogs su nyin lam drug bdun sa na yod pa dang/der gong ma'i blon chen kan gru thi tu zhig gis rgyal dbang bsod nams rgya mtsho gdan drangs/dmag dpung khri bcu gsum tsam gyis phebs bsu zhus pa dang chos gsungs pa sogs gsal zhing/mkhar 'di'i nang da thub dbang myang 'das kyi sku shin tu che ba zhig dang sa skya paN chen gyi phyag rjes dang zhabs rjes sogs mjal rgyu yod pa dang/mkhar 'di nas nyin lam tsam gyi sa na sgrol ma lha khang dang/rta mgrin lha khang/rgyal po lcags 'bar gyis klu bdud btul ba'i ral gri nang gzungs su bzhugs pa'i mchod rten/brag ldebs su lha khang nyi shu rtsa lnga/mi nyag rgyal po'i mchod sdong du grags pa'i brag mi chen po'i mdun ngos rtsig pa la zhal ba byas pa lta bu sogs yod par gsungs zhing/zhib par gong gsal chos 'byung de'i shog grangs 141nas 148bar gzigs}
kan ta'o|{rgya nag gi skad/gri kha chen po khru do lhag tsam zhig gi yu ba shing las byas pa ring tshad 'do gang tsam yod pa zhig}
kan tsi|{rgya gar lho phyogs kyi dkyil tri ling ka zhes pa de yin par bshad}
kar+Na'i yul|{'di ni rgya gar nub phyogs kyi rgyal khab chung ngu zhig yin pa dang/rgya gar shar phyogs pA la'i rgyal rabs nyams rgud du song ste rgyal po ner+ya pA las da dbang bzung skabs nub phyogs kar+Na'i rgyal pos mag+ha rdar dmag drangs te grong khyer bzung ma thub pa'i dbang gis dmag dpung nang pa'i gnas gzhi yod sar drangs te nang pa'i lha khang dgon par gnod pa chen po byas pa dang/rjes su dmag pham nas kar+Na'i yogs kyi mi mang po gsod par nye skabs jo bo rje dpal ldan a ti shas chu bo gang+ga la thengs mang po phar brgal tshur brgal mdzad nas bar 'dum gnang ba'i lo rgyus rnam thar nang gsal ba de yin}
kam kam|{sngar lha sa grong khyer nas rta pa'i nyin lam phyed dang gnyis 'das pa'i sa dbus stod 'chum mda' khul du bka' gdams pa'i dge bshes bya yul ba'i slob ma khrom gzher ba rin chen seng ge'i (rab byung gsum pa'i chu lug 1163lo nas rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags 'brug 1220shar )lo sku rten sngags pa yin pa zhig gis btab pa'i dgon rnying zhig yin cing/rje tsong kha pa rin po'i 'phrin las dbus stod khul dang khyab rjes dge dgon du gyur/mkhan po ni dbus stod brag dbar grwa tshang dang gcig lcogs yin pa dang sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i skabs grwa pa ang gnyis pa'i gras nyi shu rtsa gsum yod pa/sngags chog rnams rgyud stod pa dang phyogs 'dra/mtshan nyid kyi slob gnyer dga' ldan shar rtse dang/'bras spungs blo gsal gling/se ra byes/brag dbar dgon pa bcas su 'gro zhes (bai ser )las bshad}
kam kang pa don grub dpal|{'di ni lo rgyus yig cha gzhan dgi nang spyan snga don grub dpal ba zhes gsal ba de yin/'phan yul klu gong du rab byung drug pa'i shing sbrul (1365)lor sku 'khrungs/dgu lo dgu la klog yig bslabs pas mkhas par mkhyen/dgung lo bcu gsum pa la mkhan chen blo bzang pa dang/slob dpon gu ru ba gnyis las rab ta byung/mkhan chen pa rtsa ba'i bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gnyis pa la mkhan chen shAkya mi tra las bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/gzhan yang gsang phu ba blo gros brtan pa dang/mkhas grub rdo rje rgyal mtshan/rdo rje 'dzin pa gzhon nu rgyal mtshan/stag lung lo tsA ba shAkya bzang po/kun spangs ye shes rgyal mtshan sogs bla ma mang du bsten/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gsum pa la kam kam gyi gdan sar phebs/dgung lo sum cu so gcig pa rab yung bdun pa'i me bya (1417)lor (kam kam chos 'byung bstan pa rin po che'i gsal byed (brtsams zhes sum pa mkhan chen gyi (chos 'byung dpag bsam ljon bzang )gi bstan rtsis re'u mig tu gsal/dgung lo ji tsam bzhugs min chos 'byung khag tu mi gsal}
kam po gnas nang|{sa cha'i ming ste sngar karma pa dus gsum mkhyen pa sogs skyes chen dam pa mang pos bsnyen sgrub gnang ste rgyun ring bzhugs pa'i gnas shig dang/gnas gzhi'i lte bar pha bong chen po yi ge ka rang yon can yod pa/'khor lo bde mchog gi gnas su rags pa'i gangs ri che ba zhig dang 'khor gyi lha rnams gangs ri chung ngu mang po phreng bsgrigs yod pa'i gnas de'i mdar gnas sgo grwa tshang zhes pa'i dgon pa dge 'dun lnga bcu skor yod/dgon pa nas gnas kyi phur 'gro ba'i lam zhor lha khang zhig tu gling ge sar gyi dpal btul mang po'i go khrab dang mda' gri mdung gsum sogs mtshon cha/rgya tsha zhal dkar gyi gri ya zi skar phran sogs mjal rgyu yod tshul bdag gi drin can rtsa ba'i bla ma yongs 'dzin rdo rje 'chang gar gi dbang po'i rang rnam gnang gsal}
kam po tse gling|{bod yig gi lo rgyus yig cha mang che bar kam po dza zhes gsal zhing/de ni rgya yig gi lo rgyus yig cha rnying pa'i nang h+phu nan kren lA ({(WP:1,194)})zer zhing deng sang kam po tse zer ba'i sgra zur chag nas can phu'u kre ze bde yin/e shi yA shar lho'i dkyil rgyud du gnas/sngon dus rgyal sa u ko la spos/tA ming rgyal rabs kyi skabs rgyal khab kyi ming kam po tse zhes par ming bsgyur byas pa bcas lo rgyus yun ring yod pa'i rgyal khab zhig yin no/}
kam tshang chos 'byung|{'di la rgyas bsdus gnyis yod pa las bsdus pa ni 'bri gung spyan snga don grub dpal bas rab byung bdun pa'i me bya (1417)lor mdzad pa'i (kam kam chos 'byung bstan pa rin po che'i gsal byed )ces pa de yin zhing/rgyas pa ni (kam kam tshang gi chos 'byung rab 'byams nor bu'i zla ba chu shel gyi phreng ba )zhes pa si tu rin po che chos kyi 'byung gnas kyis mdzad pa de'i smad cha'i kha skong rnams zur mang tshe dbang kun khyab kyis rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing lug (1775)lor mdzad pa yin cing/'di'i nang grub chen te lo pa dang na ro pa nas rtogs ldan grags pa rin chen bar si tu rin po ches mdzad cing/karma pa mthong ba don ldan nas si tu rin po che chos kyi 'byung gnas bar zur mang tshe dbang kun khyab kyis kha skong mdzad pa yin pa dang/dam pa so so'i rnam thar gyi zhor du zhal slob grags pa can rnams kyi lo rgyus kyang rgyas bshus skabs su gang 'os bkod gnang mdzad yod pa si tu rin po che'i gzung 'bum pod (da)pa dang (na)pa gnyis su bzhugs}
kam log dgon bsam gtan gling|{(bka' ma log )mtsho sngon tsong chu'i lho rgyud du sngar btsan po srong btsan sgam po dang/btsan po khri lde srong btsan gyi dus su bod sa gnas kyi phyogs bzhir srung dmag bzhag /b+ha ta hor gyi sgom grwa bcom rjes dmag dpung gi nang nas dpa' bo mi dgu dmag dang bcas pa sa gnas der srung dmag la bzhag pa las kho tshor btsan po'i bka' ma byung bar du ma log par sdod cig ces bka' phab pa la sde dang gzhis chags pa'i gnas yin pas dpa' bo mi dgu'i mi rgyud la bka' ma log ces mi thogs shing/yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hu pi li'i nang blon sang g+ha ching sang yang bka' ma log gi mi rgyud yin pa dang/de'i rus rgyud las chad pa'i da tsho mang po mtsho sngon du yod par ba rten tA la'i la ma sku phreng lnga pas skyar po dkar bcu ngag dbang dpal mgon dang dar han chos rje ngag dbang dpal 'byor gnyis la bka' mngags gnang ba ltar stag lo la dgon pa 'di btab/bla ma mi nyag pas se ra rje btsun chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyi yig cha'i steng nas mtshan nyid kyi 'chad nyan btsugs/skabs der grwa grangs sum brgya skor yod pa rnams kyi grwa rgyun 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang la 'gro srol yod/gong gsal lo rgyus rnams sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i (bai ser )shing dpar gyi shog grangs 270pa dang/(mdo smad chos 'byung )shog grangs 224pa bcas nas gnad bsdus bkod pa yin}
karma kam tshang|{karma bka' brgyud kyi mtshan gzhan zhig ste karma pa dus gsum mkhyen pas mtshur phu'i gdan sa phyag ma btab gong du mdo khams sa khul kam po gnang nang du sgrub pa yun ring mdzad de slob brgyud mang po byung bar brten nas chos brgyud 'dzin mkhan rnams la karma kam tshang zhes 'bod srol chags}
karma dkon mchog gzhon nu|{bod du 'gran zla med pa'i mkhas pa chen po zhig yin cing/karma pa rang byung rdo rje'i zhabs la thug tsam dang gtso bor karma pa rol pa'i rdo rje'i dngos slob yin/thog mar gsang phur bzhugs te gzhung bka' pod lnga la sbyangs pa mdzad/karma rol pa'i rdo rje'i drung nas gsang sngags kyi dbang dang lung khrid mang du gsan/rje skyabs mchog dpal ba dang/rje btsun red mda' ba/rje tsong kha pa chen po bas gsum rab byung bdun pa'i lcags 'brug (1400)lorastod lung dga' gdong du zhal 'dzoms skabs dge bshes mkhan grags can lnga brgya tsam tshogs pa'i tshogs dpon dbu bzhugs mdzad/de skabs bla ma dam pa rnam gsum dang/karma pa dkon mchog gzhon nu/gsang phu'i dge bshes ldan ma dkon mchog seng ge bcas phan tshun gsung bgros gnang skabs kyi gnas tshul zin bris su bkod pa/kha byang du (karma dkon gzhon gyis mdzad pa'i rtsod yig )ces 'khod pa dbu med bris rnying dpe ring shog grangs 8yod pa zhig 'dug pa kho bos zhib tu bltas par de ni phan tshun gsung bgros gnang ba'i zin bris dang skabs der byung ba'i gnas tshul dngos kyi lo rgyus lta bu zhig las rtsod yig ni min 'dug/gong du bkod pa'i lo rgyus de ni (karma kam tshang gi chos 'byung )gsum 'bum pod (da)pa'i shog grangs 198nas grangs 199bar gsal ba nas drangs pa yin}
karma bka' brgyud|{mnyam med dwags po lha rje la slob ma'i gtso bo khams pa mi gsum byung ba'i nang nas karma pa dus gsum mkhyen pa nas brgyud pa'i bka' brgyud chos lugs pa karma bka' brgyud zer/ming gzhan mtshur phur bka' brgyud ces kyang 'bod srol 'dug /de ni karma pa dus gsum mkhyen pas rab byung gsum pa'i sa bya (1189)lor stod lung nang du mtshur phu'i dgon pa btab ste gnas gzhi bzung bar mdzad pa nas ming de ltar grags}
karma bka' brgyud kyi bstan pa|{bod kyi sangs rgyas chos lugs grub mtha' mi 'dra ba bzhi yod cing/bka' brgyud pa la yang nang gses che ba bzhi dang/chung ba brgyad yod pa'i nang nas karma bka' brgyud pa ni che ba bzhi'i gras yin/bod kyi rab byung gsum pa'i sa bya (sung ka'o tsung kra'o mu gi khrun zhis khri lo bcu drug pa )1189lor dwags po lha rje'i slob ma karma pa dus gsum mkhyen pas stod lung nang du mtshur phu'i dgon pa btab nas gnas gzhi bzung/de nas dar spel byung ba'i bka' brgyud chos lugs la bod kyi lo rgyus thog karma bka' brgyud dang/mtshur phu bka' brgyud kyang zer}
karma bka' brgyud pa'i sku phreng rim par byon pa bcu bzhi|{1 rje dus gsum mkhyen pa/(rab byung gnyis pa'i lcags stag 1110lo nas rab byung gsum pa'i chu glang 1193bar )'khrungs yul mdo khams kre shod/dgung lo brgyad cu gya bzhir bzhugs/2 karma pak+shi chos gyi bla ma/(rab yung gsum pa'i shing byi 1204lo nas rab yung lnga pa'i chu lug 1283lo bar) dgung lo don dgu bzhugs/3 karma pa rang byung rdo rje/(rab byung lnga pa'i shing sprel 1284lo nas rab byung drug pa'i sa yos 1339lo bar) dgung lo nga drug bzhugs/4 karma pa rol pa'i rdo rje/(rab byung drug pa'i gas 'brug 1340lo nas rab byung drug pa'i chu phag 1383lo bar) dgung lo zhi bzhi bzhugs/5 karma pa de bzhin gshegs pa/(rab byung drug pa'i shing byi 1384lo nas rab byung bdun pa'i shing lug 1415lo bar) dgung lo so gnyis bzhugs/6 karma pa mthong ba don ldan/(rab byung bdun pa'i me sprel 1416lo nas rab byung brgyad pa'i chu bya 1453lo bar) dgung lo so brgyad bzhugs/7 karma pa chos grags rgya mtsho/(rab byung brgyad pa'i shing khyi 1454lo nas rab yung brgyad pa'i me stag 1506lo bar) dgung lo nga gsum bzhugs/8 karma pa mi bskyod rdo rje/(rab byung dgu pa'i me yos 1507lo nas rab byung dgu pa'i shing stag 1554lo bar) dgung lo zhe brgyad bzhugs/9 karma pa dbang phyug rdo rje/(rab byung dgu pa'i me 'brug 1556lo nas rab byung bcu pa'i chu yos 1603lo bar) dgung lo zhe brgyad bzhugs/10 karma pa chos dbyings rdo rje/(rab byung bcu pa'i shing 'brug 1604lo nas rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing stag 1674lo bar) dgung lo don gcig bzhugs/11 karma pa ye shes rdo rje/(rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me sbrul 1677lo nas rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags sbrul 1701lo bar) dgung lo nyer lnga bzhugs/12 karma pa byang chub rdo rje/(rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu byi 1732lo bar ) dgung lo so gcig bzhugs/13 karma pa bdud 'dul rdo rje/(rab byung bcug nyis pa'i chu glang 1733lo nas gshegs lo mi gsal/14 karma pa theg mchog rdo rje/(rab byung bcug sum pa'i me sbrul spyi lo 1797lo nas{(WP:1,194)})bcas kyi sku phreng so so'i mdzad rnam mdor bsdus gsham du gzigs}
karma gan dkar|{karma zhwa nag sku phreng lnga pa de bzhin gshags pa bod kyi rab byung bdun pa'i shing bya (1405)lor ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma yung los pe cin du gdan drangs pa ltar thog ma'i phebs ston dang/de rjes bod du 'bul chen lan gsum phul ba bcas kyi skabs rin thang bral ba'i dngos po grangs las 'das pa lha sa'i bar skor 'khor ba nas 'go po tA la'i bzhugs khri'i bar slebs pa'i dngos 'bul phul ba'i nang dkar yol rkyang pa mi res lag pa g.yas g.yon gnyis la re re bzung bas bar skor hrig gis khengs pa phul ba dang/dkar yol de tshor logs su sder mo lnga yod pa'i 'brug lnga dang bdun byas pa sna tshogs/mthil du gong ma rang gi ming byang yi ge sngon po bzhi yod pa zhig yin zhes (kam tshang chos 'byung )pod dang po'i shog grangs 238nas 4bar gsal zhing/gzhan yang stag tshang rdzong pa dpal 'byor bzang pos rab byung bdun pa'i shing stag (1434)lor brtsams pa'i (rgya bod yig tshang )gi nang gses dkar yol brtag pa'i le'u nang 'khod do/karma gan dkar zhes pa karma pa de bzhin gshegs pa la tA ming gong mas phul ba'i mdzod nang ma'i dkar yol spus legs kyi rigs shig yin pa dang/de'i logs kyi ri mo la 'brug ris dang/bka' shis rtags brgyad/bod yig dbu can gyis mtha' bskor ba'i tshig la nyin mo bde legs mtshan bde legs zhes sogs kyi bar shis tshigs bcad cha tshang yod tshul gsal ba khungs dag yin pa ni/1987lor bod sa gnas su yod pa'i mes rgyal nang khul gyi rig gnas dngos rdzas gal che'i rigs la rtog zhib bgyis skabs nor bu gling khar yod pa'i rig dngos gras nas ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma zhon te'i dus su bzos pa'i dkar yol sngo khra'i chang snod lan mo'i gzugs/shing lo lag 'khyud kyi ri mo dang/smad du bod yig dbu can gyi bkra shis tshigs bcad nyin mo bde legs mtshan bde legs zhes pa'i tshigs bcad sho lo ka cha tshang/mthil du tA ming zhon te ({(WP:1,194)})zhes pa'i yig 'bru bzhi yod pa zhig nga rang gis dngos su mthong byung ba der brtags na dkar yol de rigs thog mar tA ming gong ma yung los kyis ({(WP:1,194)})skabs su bzos pa dang/rjes su gong ma de'i sras zhon te'i skabs su yang mu mthud bzos pa yin 'dra snyam zhing/de dung sa skya'i ti shi theg chen chos rgyal la yang dkar yol de gras phul tshul gsal bar sa skya'i lha khang chen mo sogs la ming rgyal rabs skabs kyi dkar yol de gras phal cher yod srid}
karma gan dril|{gong du karma gan dkar gyi skabs su bshad pa ltar karma pa sku phreng lnga pa de bzhin gshegs pa la ming rgyal rabs kya gong ma yung los rgya bzos dril bu rje bcas cha tshang spus sgam rang 'grigs yod pa de gras mang po zhig phul tshul rnam thar du gsal ba de gras la zer zhing/kun mkhyen 'jigs med gling pas mdzad pa'i (rin po che brtag pa'i gtam )zhes pa las/rgya nag tA ming skabs thon pa'i dril bu rab 'bring gsum yod pa dang/lugs kha gtsang la 'jam sha dod pa/kha sbub 'thug cing mdog nag pa/ri mo zhib tshags che ba/skad snyan pa/che cha nga bod dril rnying ma las phran tsam che ba/rtse rdor gser dang rag la tsha gser btang ba/rag tsha gser med pa bcas sna tshogs yod cing/tA ming gan dril dkyus ma ni lugs kha ha cang gtsang ma rang med thog /dbyibs cog tsam cong ba/skad gsang ba/dril bu tshang mar thod rgyar rgyal ba rigs lnga'i sa bon rnams rgya gar gyi yi ge lany+tsha byas pa zhig yod par gsungs pa ltar/de sngon rig gnas gsar brje'i gong du kong po khul gyi dgon pa rnying gras la re gnyis yod pa bdag gis dngos su mthong myong/de rung yang re gnyis mthong rgyu yod srid}
karma gu ru'i lcags sku|{slob dpon chen po pad+ma 'byung gnas drag po'i skur sprul pa mdzad pa la karma gu ru zhes zhu zhing/'dir sku rgyu lcags las bzhengs pa'i gu ru drag po'i sku la go dgos}
karma dgon gsar|{karma zhwa dmar sku phreng bzhi pa chos kyi grags pas bskul ma gnang ba ltar rab byung brgyad pa'i chu phag (1503)lor rin spungs sde pa don yod rdo rjes lha sa'i grong khyer gyi shar ngos sa nag mar se 'bras dge gsum gyi kha gnon du dgon gsar thub bstan chos 'khor zer ba btab pa der yongs grags su karma dgon gsar zhes 'bod srol yod cing/dgon pa de btab nas lo gcig lhag tsam song nas mjug skyong ma thub pa'i lo rgyus karma zhwa dmar bzhi pa'i rnam thar du zur tsam gsal}
karma sgar bris|{bod lugs thun mong ma yin pa'i ri mo'i 'bri srol chen po lnga yod pa'i nang nas skad grags che ba'i 'bri rgyun zhig ste/'di'i srol thog mar dar spel mdzad mkhan ni karma pa sku phreng brgyad pa mi bskyod rdo rje'i slob ma yar stod sprul sku nam mkha' bkra shis yin par (kam tsham chos 'byung )sde dge dpar ma pod gnyis pa'i shog grangs 33na6par gsal zhing/karma pa sku phreng bcu pa chos dbyings rdo rje phyag ris la mkhas rtsal che ba bcas la brten bka' brgyud phyogs kyi dgon rnying mang po zhig la sgar bris gyi srol dar khyab byung bar mngon/karma pa chos dbyings rdo rje'i phyag bris yin zhes mtshan byang 'khod pa'i rje btsun mi la ras pa dang/tshe ring mched lnga'i zhal thang chung ba gnyis lho brag nyi lde dgon par yod tshul skyes chen dam pa 'ga' zhig gi rnam thar nang gsal zhing/yang grub thob brgyad bcu'i zhal thang sgar bris byas pa bcas yod tshul de'i dkar chag tu rgyas par gsal ba ltar thang ka khag gcig de sngon 1988lo nga rang gis khra 'brug dgon par mjal myong lags}
karma sgrub rgyud|{karma bka' brgyud kyi chos lugs la gzhung bshad man ngag gi rgyud pa dang sgrub pa nyams len gyi brgyud pa gnyis yod pa'i nang gi gnyis pa}
karma nges legs bstan 'dzin|{bod kyi gso rig thog mdzad rjes che ba zhig yin/'khrungs gshegs kyi lo zla dang rnam thar gsal ba zhig ma rnyed cing/khong gi gsung rtsom (sman bsdus )e dang wam zhes pod gnyis yod pa'i pod dang po'i rang rnam mdor bsdus kyi nang thams cad mkhyen gzigs chen po ma hA paN+Di ta chos kyi 'byung gnas kyi bka'adrin la brten nas rig pa 'di la phyogs sgar mo nang mthong thos ci rigs kyis 'gro phyogs dkyus ma min tsam zhig yod do zhes gsungs pa ltar na gso ba rig pa'i skor si tu rin po che chos kyi 'byung gnas drung nas gsan bzhes gnang ba yin 'dug /bar skabs shig nas dus thog mnyam pa'i sman pa dang/mkhas pa 'ga' zhig gis phra dog brnyas smon gyi sgro skur zhu mkhan byung bar brten lo bco lnga tsam ring sman dpyad kyi phyag len mtshams 'jog gnang thog /de'i ring (sman bsdus )e wam pod gnyis brtsams gnang mtshan/rab byung 12pa'i chu byi (1732)lor (rtsis gzhung nyer mkho'i bum bzang )brtsams/'di skor las 'phros pa'i dpyad gleng zhig bod ljongs sman rtsis gang gi dbu 'dzin mkhas dbang byams pa phrin las kyis mdzad pa'i (gangs ljongs gso rig bstan pa'i nyin byed rim yon gyi rnam thar )shog grangs 274nas 275b.ragasal ba der gzigs}
karma snying thig|{karma pa sku phreng gnyis pa rang byung rdo rje nas brgyud pa'i snying thig gi skor ste/snga 'gyur gyi grub chen me long rdo rje'i dngos slob rig 'dzin chen po ku mA rA dza'i drung nas rdzogs pa chen po snying thig gi chos skor cha tshang bar gsan/slar yang she'i rgyal sras legs ldan pa'i drung nas kyang cha tshang bar tshar gcig gsan nas de'i man ngag gi yig cha yang mdzad cing/skal ldan gyi slob ma 'ga' zhig la spel bar mdzad pa las byung ba'i snying thig gi skor yin}
karma bstan skyong dbang po|{gtsang pa rgyal po karma phun tshogs rnam rgyal gyi bu yin/rab byung bcu pa'i me rta (1606)lor gtsang stod seng ge lung mchod rten rgyal po skyes zhes bya bar 'khrungs/rang lo bcu bzhi pa lcags sprel (1620)lo rang gi pha phun tshogs rnam rgyal 'brum nad kyis 'das pa'i lo de nas rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu rta'i (1642)lo 'go bar lo nyi shu lhag tsam ring srid bzung/'on kyang ming tsam las don dngos kyi dbang cha ni mgron gnyer bong gong ba dang/phyi blon sgang chen pa/zug po ba bcas kyis zin par tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i (rang rnam du ku la'i gos bzang )deb dang po'i shog grangs 53par gsal zhing/lo de'i rjes ma lcags bya (1621)lor dga' ldan pho brang pa'i rgyab skyor du sog po lha btsun chung ba blo bzang bstan 'dzin dang/gu ru hong tha'i ji gnyis kyis bod du btang ba'i sog po'i rta dmag nyis stong dang dbus dmag mnyam 'brel dmag dpung gis gtsang pa rgyal po'i dpung la pham nyes byung rjes lcags bya lo'i chings yig bzhag /chings yig gi nang don zhib par (tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i rang rnam du ku la'i gos bzang )deb dang po'i shog grangs 51nas 21mjug rdzogs pa'i bar gsal zhing/lcags bya lo'i dmag 'khrug pham nyes byung ba sdug khur ma thub pa'i rkyen gyis slar yang dge lugs phyogs la dgra sha len rgyu'i go skabs sgugs nas yod mur sog po cha har len nad rgyal po dang/bar khams kyi be ri rgyal po don yod rgyal gnyis dang mna' 'brel btsugs/phyogs gsum mnyam 'brel gyis dge lugs pa gtor rgyu'i kha dan byas pa ma zad/thog mar shing phag (1635)lo nas cha han len dan gyi dmag dpung gtsang par rgyab skyor byed par btang yang bod du slebs rjes rkyen mang po zhig la brten nas gtsang sog gnyis nang 'khrugs byung te sog dmag yir 'then byas shing/sog po'i dpon nang ma mthun par cha har gyi bu bsad pa sogs rgyab skyor yong ba'i re ba med par gyur/de rjes sa stag (1638)lor bkra shis lhun po'i kha gnon du dmigs te dgon pa'i 'khris su chos sde chen po gsar rgyag thog /ming la bkra shis zil gnon zer ba btags pa dang/se 'bras gnyis kyi kha gnon du dmigs te shun gdong dkar rdzong brtsigs pa sogs byas rkyen rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags 'brug (1640)lor gu shri han gyis bar khams su dmag drings te gtsang pa rgyal po'i rgyab dpung be ri rgyal po don yod rgyal pham pa nyes su btang zhing/lo 'di'i mjug nas phyi lo'i bod zla gsum pa'i 'go bar zla ba kha shas ring gtsang pa rgyal po'i dpung la phar rgol byas mthar gtsang pa rgyal po gtor ba dang/dga' ldan pho brang gi srid dbang gsar du btsugs pa sogs zhib par (tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i rang rnam du ku la'i gos bzang )deb dang po dang/(mdo smad chos 'byung )shog grangs 30nas 36bar gsal/rgyal po 'di'i dus su khrims yig zhal lce bcu drug tu grags pa gtan 'bebs byas shing/bod dbus gtsang yongs la rgya khyab tu spyod pa'i gtan tshigs mkhar ru zer ba yang rgyal po 'di'i dus su gsar gtod byas pa yin zhes shod srol 'dug /gong gsal rnams karma bstan skyong dbang po'i khrims yig rgyas bsdus dang/gtsang pa rgyal po'i gdung rabs gzhir bzung nas bris}
karma bstan skyong dbang po'i khrims yig|{gtsang pa rgyal po karma bstan skyong dbang pos bod na gsal gyi srid dbang bzung rjes bde chen gsang sngags mkhar gyi rdzong dpon du bskos pa spel ser ba zhes pa der 'bri ru bcug pa bzhin gtsang pa'i khrims yig rnying pa shel tham chen mo zhes pa dang/zhal lce'i rnam gzhag phun tshogs dge legs ma'i zin bris/tshal pa khri dpon skabs kyi khrims yig rnying pa zhig bcas khag mang por zhib bsdur byas te bsgrigs pa zhig yin khrims yig de'i 'gor brjod du gsal zhing/khrims yig 'di'i nang don gtso bo ni 'go brjod gleng gzhir gtsang pa rgyal po mi rabs dang po zhing shag pa tshe brtan rdo rje'i mi brgyud dang/sde pa phun tshogs rnam rgyal/karma bstan skyong dbang po bcas kyi lo rgyus mdor bsdus 'khod yod cing/de rjes khrims lugs spyi'i rmang gzhi'i shes bya ngo sprod byas yod pa dang/khrims yig dngos gzhi don tshan bcu drug yod pa dang/dang po dpa' bo stag gi zhal lce/gnyis pa sdar ma wa'i zhal lce/gsum pa sne mo las 'dzin gyi zhal lce/bzhi pa zhu bzhes bden rdzun gyi zhal lce/lnga pa bzung bkyigs khrims ra'i zhal lce/drug pa nag chen khrag sbyor gyi zhal lce/bdun pa dran 'dzin chad las kyi zhal lce/brgyad pa hor 'dra za rkang gi zhal lce/dgu pa bsad pa stong gi zhal lce/bcu pa rmas pa khrag gi zhal lce/bcu gcig pa bsnyon ham mna' dag gi zhal lce/bcu gnyis pa brkus pa 'jal gyi zhal lce/bcu gsum pa nyer 'brel 'bral bsdums kyi zhal lce/bcu bzhi pa byi byas byi rin gyi zhal lce/bco lnga pa nar phar tshur gyi zhal lce/bcu drug pa kla klo mtha' 'khor gyi zhal lce bcas khag so so'i 'grel bshad zhib phra byas yod/khrims yig 'di bzhin bod ljongs spyi tshogs tshan rig khang nas dpe skrun byas pa'i (gangs can rig mdzod deb bdun pa (bod kyi snga rabs khrims srol yig cha bdams sgrigs )shog grangs 82nas 145bar gsal/yang da phan dpar bskrun byed ma byang ba'i khrims yig lag bris ma kha byang du (karma bstan skyong dbang po'i khrims yig )ces yod cing/'go brjod du tshigs bcad sho lo ka gcig yod par 'di ltar/bsod nams chen po'i dpal gyis grub pa yis/_/gser kyi 'khor los bsgyur ba'i mthu chen pos/_/rtsod pa'i dus kyang rdzogs ldan du byed pa/_/dpal ldan karma bstan skyong dbang po'i gtam/_/zhes dang/mjug du zhes skyes bdag ces pa lcags mo lug gi lo smin drug gis nya ba'i dkar po'i phyogs kyi dang po'i tshes la bris pa skye 'gro thams cad la dge bar gyur cig ces 'khod pa zhig kho bos mthong ba de ni/srid dbang bzung nas lo ngo bcu gcig pa'i lcags lug (1631)lor bris 'dug pas de la brtags na deng skabs dpar skrun byas pa de khrims yig rgyas pa dang/bris ma de khrims yig bsdus pa yin 'dra zhing/rgyas bsdus gnyis po sngon rjes gang yin rjes su zhig 'jug byed dgos pa ma zad/nye rabs phyi rgyal du yod pa'i lo rgyus smra ba kha cig gis karma bstan skyong dbang po'i pha karma phun tshogs rnam rgyal rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu sprel (1632)lor 'das pa dang/de'i phyi lo karma bstan skyong dbang pos srid dbang bzung bar bshad pa de khungs med 'ol tshod kyis bris pa yin par gong gsal khrims rgyas bsdus gnyis nas ra sprod byed thub}
karma bstan srungs dbang po|{sde pa zhig shag pa tshe brtan rdo rje la bu dgu yod pa las/karma bstan srungs dbang po gsum ni skad grags che zhing/dpal rtsal blo gros ldan pa yin zhes karma bstan skyong dbang po'i khrims yig gi 'gor yod pa'i gleng gzhir gsal zhing/de min karma bstan srungs dbang po'i dmigs gsal gyi lo rgyus gsal bar 'khod pa zhig ma mthong lags}
karma mthu stobs rnam rgyal|{sde pa zhing shag pa tshe brtan rdo rje'i bu dgu yod pa'i nang nas grags che ba zhig yin zhes (karma bstan skyong dbang po'i khrims yig )gi 'khor gsal yang/zhib cha'i lo rgyus da phan ma mthong zhing/kho bo'i bsam tshod la 'di'i karma mthu stobs rnam rgyal nam/gang zag mi 'dra ba gnyis yin da dung brtag dgos so/}
karma pa|{dus rabs bcu gnyis pa'i mjug rab yung gsum pa'i shing sbrul (1185)lor mnyam med dwags po lha rje'i slob ma dus gsum mkhyen pas khams khul du karma lha steng gi dgon pa btab te gnas gzhi bzung/de nas bzung khong la karma pa zhes ming thogs shing/chos brgyud la karma bka' brgyud zer zhing dbu zhwa nag po yin pas karma zhwa nag pa zer/de'i sku phreng rim byan gyi mdzad rnam mdor bsdus gsham du gsal}
karma pa dus gsum mkhyen pa|{(karma pa sku phreng dang po )'khrungs yul mdo khams kre shod du yab sgom pa rdo rje mgon dang yum lha thog bza' sgam lcam ming 'dren pa'i sras su rab byung gnyis pa'i lcags stag (1110)lor sku 'khrungs/chung dus kyi mtshan la dge 'phel zhu/dgung lo bcu drug pa shing sbrul (1125)lor chos 'khor ka rag tu rngog lo tsA ba'i slob ma mchog gi bla mas mkhan po dang/chag seng ge grags kyis slob dpon mdzad de rab byung bzhes pa'i mtshan la chos kyi grags pa zhes gsol/khong gnyis kyi drung nas 'dul ba dang bka' gdams kyi chos skor 'ga' zhig gsan/dgung lo dgu pa sa sprel (1128)lor khams nas dbus su byon/de'i phyi lo stod lung du phebs nas rgya dmar ba dang/phya pa chos kyi seng ge /pa tshab lo tsA ba nyi ma grags pa bcas kyi drug nas phar phyin dang/dbu ma/tshad ma bcas gsan/mal 'dul ba 'dzin pas mkhan po dang/gzhal yang dge bshes sha ra ba dang/rnal 'byor pa shes rab rdo rje/rga lo tsA ba/khams pa a seng/yol chos dbang rol pa mgar dge sogs bla ma mang du bsten te bka' gdams kyi gzhung dang/man ngag /dus 'khor mgon po bya rog ma/phag mo/kyai rdor/sa skya ba'i lam 'bras/zhi byed sogs skabs der bod du yongs su grags pa'i chos bka' thams cad gsan/dgung lo sum cu pa sa lug (1139)lor rje sgam po pa khu dbon gnyis dang mjal/gsang sngags thabs lam gyi skor gsan nas lo gsum gyi bar sgom sgrub la 'bad brtson gnang bas na bza' ras kyang thub pa byung/rje sgam po bas lung bstan pa ltar zangs ri dang/phag mo gru/'ol kha/mon pa gro stag tshang sogs gnas mang por phebs te sgom sgrub kho na mdzad/mon gyi rgyal po ga thung gis sbyin bdag zhus nas lo gcig ring ri khrod du bzhugs/rje btsun ras nga pa bsten nas rje mi la ras pa'i zhal gdams cha tshang ba gsan/rje sgam po pa sku mya ngan las 'das khar lung bstan pa ltar gnas nges med du mdzad pa'i ngang nas rlung la rang dbang thob pa'i rtags gsal po byung/dgung lo lnga bcu pa sa yos (1159)lor mtshur phu'i brag rtsar zhag 'ga' shas bzhugs te dgon pa dang gtsug lag khang chags pa'i rten 'a brel dang thugs smon mdzad/de nas khams su byon nas dben gnas mang por sgrub pa mdzad/dgung lo lnga bcur nga lnga pa shing sprel (1164)lor kam po gnas nang du phebs te gnas gzhi bzung bar mdzad/dgung lo bdun cu don bdun pa shing sbrul la karma pa'i dgos pa phyag btab/de'i phyi lo khams nas dbus su phebs/'bri gung skyob pa rin po che dwags lha sgam por bzhugs pa dang mjal nas chos gsan res mdzad/dgung lo brgyad cu rtsa bzhir phebs pa chu glang (1189)lor stod lung du mtshur phu'i dgon pa dngos su phyag btab/dgung lo brgyad cu rtsa bzhir phebs pa chu glang (1193)lor mtshur phu'i gdan sa rang du sku gshegs/sku gdung zhugs 'bul zhugs pa'i gdung la ring bsrel sogs byon pa rnams gdung rten gser gdung 'bras spungs mchod rten gyi dbyibs 'dra ba zhig bzhengs pa mtshur phu'i dgon pa rang du bzhugs/lo rgyus zhib pa (lho rong chos 'byung )bris ma'i shog grangs 177nas 182bar dang/(mkhas pa'i dga' ston )shog grangs 859nas 870bar/(kam tshang chos 'byung )pod dang po'i shog grangs 2nas 23bar gsal/gzhan yang (karma pa dus gsum mkhyen pa'i rnam thar dgos 'dod kun 'byung )dri med dpal ye shes kyis mdzad pa bris ma shog grangs 28yod pa zhig 'dug yang zhib cha lta ba'i go skabs ma rnyed lags}
karma pak+Shi|{(karma pa sku phreng gnyis pa )karma pa sku phreng dang po dus gsum mkhyen pa sku 'das nas lo bcu gsum song ba na sku phreng gnyis pa karma pak+Shi'am chos kyi bla ma/rab byung gsum pa'i shing byi (1204)lor 'khrungs yul mdo khams dam pa chos phyug gi yul du yab rgya dbang tshur tsha dang/yum seng bzang a skyid kyi sras su 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga nas bcu'i bar 'bri klog sbyangs/dgu lo bcu gcig par rab tu byung ba'i mtshan chos kyi bla mar gsol/dgung lo lon nas ka thog pa byams pa 'bum gyis mkhan po dang/rin po che spong brag pas slob dpon mdzad nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/rin po che de nyid kyi drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gnas cing sku ma gshegs bar du phyag phyir 'bral med du bzhugs shing/spong brag pa sku gshegs rjes khams khul gyi gnas chen kha ba dkar po sogs dben gnang mang por p+sagom sgrub mdzad/rlung sems gnyis la rang dbang thob ste grub pa'i go 'phang mthon por phebs/de nas byang lam brgyud nas 'bri gung dang mtshur phur phebs te lo drug rim der bzhugs nas dgon pa nyams gsos mdzad/de sngon khams su bzhugs dus yon gong ma'i rgyal sras hu pe lis dmag dpon mdzad nas khams su 'byor ba dang phan tshul mjal myong ba'i stabs kyis hu pe lis zhu yig rten bcas bskur nas mchod gnas su phebs dgos pa'i gdan 'dren 'byor pa ltar rab byung bzhi pa'i shing stag (1254)lor bar khams kyi lam brgyud nas sog yul du phebs/rgyal sras hu pe li dang mjal nas chos mang du gsungs/me 'brug (1256)lor yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma mong gol han dang mjal nas gong ma ma gshegs kyi bar du lo ngo lnga'i ring mchod gnas mdzad/lcags sprel (1260)lor gong ma mong gol han 'das rjes rgyal sras a ri bo ga dang/hu pe li gnyis gong ma'i go gnas 'phrogs pa'i 'khrugs rtsod byung mthar a ri bo ga phab nas hu pe li gong ma'i khrir 'khod/hu pe li rang nyid sngar nas mong gol han khul dbon gnyis la sems ma rangs pa yod pa'i thog /karma pak+Shi mchog thog mar sog yul du mchod gnas la gdan 'dren mkhan u pe li yin kyang der ma bzhugs par gong ma mong gol han gyi mchod gnas su bzhugs shing/rgyal sras mang po dbang gnas sbas su yang hu pe li dbang gral nas phud pa bcas gnang ba'i rkyen gyis ha cang khros te btson du bcug mtshon cha mang po btab pa dang/me la bsregs pa/chu la bskyur ba/dug ster ba sogs gnod 'tshe grangs med byas kyang rlung sems la rang dbang thob pa'i stobs kyis skyon ci yang ma byung bar brten rgya mtsho chen po'i mtha' 'gram du lo ngo gsum ring rgyang phung btang/de nas yang tshur gdan drangs te lha khang gcig gi nang du btson la bcug ste gsol zas sogs gang yang med par zhag bdun ring bzhag kyang sku lus dang sku srog la skyon gang yang med par brten rgyal po hu pe li dad pa skyes te bshags pa phul nas mu mthud mchod gnas su bzhugs par zhus yang ma gnang bar bod du phyir phebs pa'i lam bar lo brgyad tsam 'gor/mtshur phur phebs te rab byung bzhi pa'i shing byi (1264)lor mtshur phu'i lha khang chen mor gser zangs kyi lha chen 'dom bcu gsum (spyi khre 26)tsam yod pa dang/de'i mtha' bskor du byams pa dang/spyan ras gzigs/rgyal ba rigs lnga bcas kyi ldem sku/gser dngul las grub pa'i bka' 'gyur sogs rten gsum grangs las 'das pa bzhengs/dgung lo don bzhi pa rab byung lnga pa'i chu lug (1283)lor sku gshegs/sku gdung zhugs la phul ba'i gdung thal sogs gdan sa gong 'og gi gdung rten nang du bzhugs/dam pa 'di'i lo rgyus rgyas pa (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )shog grangs 880nas 913bar dang/(kam tshang chos 'byung )pod dang po'i shog grangs 38par gsal/gsung rtsom pod 16yod ces (mkhas pa'i dga' ston)shog grangs 1313la gsal/gzhan yang (chos rje karma pa chen po'i rnam thar bsam yas lha yi lnga chen )dri med dpal ye shes kyis mdzad pa bris ma shog grangs 34can zhig 'dug kyang kho bos zhib par mjal ba'i go skabs ma thob}
karma pa rang byung rdo rje|{(karma pa sku phreng gsum pa )'khrungs yul la stod mang yul gung thang 'o ma lung mkhan thang gi rtsi khur yab ston pa chos dpal dang/yum jo mo g.yang 'dren gyi sras su rab byung lnga pa'i shing sprel (1284)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo gsum la phebs skabs yab yum sogs la nga karma pa yin gsung ba sogs sngon gnas dran pa'i gsung mang du byon/yab sngags pa yin pas de'i drung nas zhi byed dang gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi chos 'ga' zhig gsan/grub chen u rgyan pa dang mjal skabs sngon gnas dran pa'i gsung mang du gnang bas grub chen u rgyan pas rab yung rdo rje zhes mtshan gsol/grub chen de nyid kyi drung nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa dang/'khor lo bde mchog /kyai rdor/phur pa sogs dbang khrid kyi rigs mang po gsan/dgung lo bdun pa lcags stag (1290)lor khro bu kun ldan shes rab kyis mkhan po mdzad nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/slob dpon shes rab dpal dang/rgya sgo ye shes 'od/grub chen gnyan ras bcas kyi drung nas skabs der bod du brgyud pa bzhugs pa'i gsang sngags kyi chos mtha' dag gsan/dgung lo bco brgyad pa mnga' bshol gyi zla ba rtsis pa'i nyi shu lon pa lcags glang (1301)lor tshogs dge 'dun sgang pa'i mkhan po gnas brtan gzhon nu 'bum gyi mkhan po dang/mkhas pa dge 'dun rin chen gyis las slob mdzad de dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/mkhan po de nyid kyi drung nas 'dul ba'i skor dang/bka' gdams kyi blo sbyong skor/gsang phu'i slob dpon chen po shaka gzhon gyi drung nas dbu ma dang/tshad ma/mngon pa gong 'og /phar phyin skor bshad gsan/snye mdo ba kun dga' don grub kyi drung nas dus 'khor dang/gsang 'dus ye shes zhabs lugs/gshin rje gshed dmar nag 'jigs gsum/zhi khro'i skor sogs gsang sngags gsar rnying gi chos skor mang du gsan/dgung lo sum cu so lnga pa sa rta (1318)lor (rtsis kyi bstan bcos kun la btus pa )brtsams par mdzad/dgung lo bzhi bcur 'gor phebs dus (chos dbyings bstod pa'i 'grel pa )brtsams/dgung lo zhe drug pa lcags lug (1331)lorayon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma thug the'i mur 'ja' yA dus mi dpon mang po mngags te pe cin du gdan 'dren pa'i gser yig 'byor (gser yig ni nang don bod skad du bsgyur ba (kam tshang chos 'byung )pod dang po'i shog grangs 107nas 6bar gsal )ba ltar lo de'i rjes ma chu sprel lo (1332)lor mtshur phu nas rang rta rang khal mdzad de mgyogs par byon yang pe cin du phebs 'byor ma byung gong du gong ma 'das te rin chen dpal gong ma'i khrir 'khod pa mjal nas 'das mchod dang rgyal por dbang bskur mdzad/rin chen dpal gyi tshe la bar chad yod ces gsungs pa ltar zla ba gcig song nas 'das/de'i tshab tu yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma dgu pa tho kan the'i mur gong ma'i khrir bkod pa'i rten 'brel mdzad sgo sog yul gyi rgyal sa rnying pa hrang tu'u la tshugs pa der phebs te dbang bskur shis brjod mdzad/pho brang chen po ta'i tur lo gcig tsam bzhugs ring gong ma dang mjal phrad skabs mang por chos dang 'brel ba'i bslab bya/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi lo rgyus dang/bod kyi rgyal rabs lo rgyus/skabs de'i bod kyi nang pa'i chos lugs 'phel rgyas kyi gnas tshul bcas go skabs dang bstun nas ngo sprod yang yang mdzad cing shing khyi (1334)lo'i lo stod du pe cin nas dbus su phyir phebs mdzad/lam bar du sde mang po'i 'khrug pa su phyir phebs mdzad/mi byi (1336)lor slar yang gong ma tho kan the'i mur gyis gdan 'dren pa'i zhu yig thengs mang po 'byor ba ltar mtsho sngon brgyud nas pe cin pho brang chen por phebs/de skabs gong ma nyid pho brang gi rgyal sgo'i mdun du bsu bar phebs/rgyal po'i don du tshe sgrub sogs rim gro mdzad/pe cin gi nub phyogs su karma pa'i dgon sde gsar du bzhengs/sa yos (1339)lo'i dkyil du pe cin pho brang nas sog yul gyi rgyal sa rnying pa hrang tur phebs te zla ba gcig tsam bzhugs nas dgung lo lnga bcu nga drug sa yos (1339)lor sku gshegs/sku gdung zhugs 'bul zhus pa'i rten ngo mtshar can rnams rnam thar gyi nang sog yul rang du bzhag pa lta bu zhig gsal yang (deb dmar )nang rten de rnams mtshur phu dgon par gdan drangs te 'dra sku bzhengs zhes gsal bas phyogs yas mas gnyis kar yod pa 'dra snyam/gsung rtsom gyi gras (sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyi skyes rabs brgya rtsa )(rtsis kyi bstan bcos )(zab mo nang gi don gsal bar byed pa'i bstan bcos rtsa 'grel )sogs deng sang mjal rgyu yod pa pod gsum tsam bzhugs/lo rgyus zhib par (kam tshang chos 'byung )pod dang po'i shog grangs 92nas 115bar gsal/gzhan yang (karma pa rang byung rdo rje'i rnam thar )kun dga' 'od zer gyis mdzad pa bris ma shog grangs 17yod pa zhig kyang 'dug }
karma pa rol pa'i rdo rje|{(karma pa sku phreng bzhi pa )'khrungs yul mdo khams lho brgyud lung chen bco brgyad kyi nang tshang rngo a la rong gi a la spang dkar zhes par yab lha ldong bsod nams don grub dang/yum mdza' bza' brtson 'grus gnyis kyi sras su rab byung drug pa'i lcags 'brug (1340)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo gsum bzhes pa na nga karma pa k+Shi yin gsung ba sogs sngon gnas rjes dran gyi gsung mang po gnang bas rje gong ma'i zhal slob rnams yid ches par mdzad/dgung lo bdun nas bzung rtogs ldan mgon po rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas nA ro chos drug dang/bde mchog /kyai rdor sogs kyi dbang dang khrid kyi rim pa mang po gsan/gzhan yang rtogs ldan ye rgyal pa/rdza gshong ba shes rab dpal bzang/slob dpon blo gros seng ge sogs kyi drung nas gsang sngags gsar rnying gi chos skor dang phar phyin sogs gsan/dgung lo bcu gsum pa chu 'brug (1352)lor ko nas dwags po brgyud lha sa dang mtshur phur phebs/tshogs dge lugs sgang pa'i chos rje don grub dpal gyis mkhan po dang/rje btsun bsod nams 'bum gyis dus go ba mdzad de dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi mkhas grub chen po g.yung ston rdo rje dpal ba'i drung nas gsang sngags gsar rnying gi chos skor mang du gsan/dgu lo bcu brgyad pa mnga' bshol rtsis pa'i nyi shu bzhes pa me bya (1357)lor sngar gyi mkhan slob de rang gi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/de nas bzung sha chang zhal du gsol ba lta zhog /sku'i nye 'khor du dri bro ba tsam mi mdzad cing/sku 'khor rnams la sha chang gi ston mo 'grims mi chog pa/zhabs 'bring pa yang dge slong khrims gtsang rkyang pas zhu ba sogs mdzad spyod 'gran zla bral ba bzhugs/lo de'i nang yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma tho kan the'i mur gyis hor bod kyi gser yig pa mang po mngags te pe cin pho brang du gdan 'dren zhu par slebs (gong ma'i bka' yig bod skad du bsgyur ba cha tshang (kam tshang chos 'byung )pong dang po'i shog grangs 176par gsal)pa ltar sa khyi (1358)lor mtshur phur nas phebs thon gyis mdo khams lho brgyud nas phebs pa'i lam bar du sde tshan phun 'khrug pa che ba mang po bar 'dum mdzad pa kho nar yar 'gro mgron gser srang nyis stong skor dang/rta bdun brgya/ja sig chen lnga brgya tsam phangs med du gtong gnang mdzad pa sogs chos srid kyi mdzad pa rgya che bas lam bar yun ring 'gor ste mtsho sngon brgyud nas phebs/mtsho sngon du phebs 'byor skabs rje tsong kha pa chen po dgung lo gsum bzhes pa mjal nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa gnang ste mtshan kun dga' snying por gsol zhing/bstan pa la phan pa'i skyes bu dam pa yin par lung bstan/lcags byi (1360)lor shing kun sde chen sogs brgyud nas pe cin pho brang chen por phebs/gong ma tho kan the'i mur dang mjal/gong mar rje btsun rdo rje rnal 'byor ma'i byin rlabs dang/khrid/nA ro chos drug /phyag chen/sku gsum ngo sprod bcas gnang/gzhan yang dpon chen dang/ser skya dmangs bcas la rang rang gi 'dod mos dang mtshams pa'i mdo sngags kyi chos bka' mang du gnang ste lo ngo gsum gyi ring bzhugs/de nas gong ma rgyal blon rnams la rgyal srid dang gong ma'i tshe srog la bar chad chen po yod pas bod du phyir log phebs rgyu'i bka' gnang ste/rgyal blon tshang mas yun ring bar mchod gnas su bzhugs pa'i zhu ba nan tan yang yang zhus par ma gsan par chu stag (1362)lo'i lo 'gor pe cin nas bod phyogs su phyir phebs gnang ba'i lan kan su'u dang/mtsho sngon brgyud nas mdo khams lho brgyud/'ba' thang/kong po/tsA ri sogs gnas thams cad du phebs pas lam bar lo ngo bcu tsam thugs 'gor byung te dgung lo zhe bzhi bzhes pa rang byung drug pa'i chu phag (1383)lor kong po zho khar dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs/sku gdung zhugs 'bul zhus pa'i gdung thal rnams mtshur phu dgon par gdan drangs te dngul bre chen brgyad cu (dngul srang nyis stong lnga brgya drug cu )las grub pa'i gdung rten bzhengs pa'i nang du bzhugs/gsung rtsom kha shas kyi mtshan byang rnam thar nang gsal yang gsung 'bum phyogs bsgrigs byas pa da phan mjal ma byung/lo rgyus zhib pa dngos slob mkhas pa'i dbang po karma dkon ma chog gzhon nus mdzad pa'i kha byang du (chos rje rol pa'i rdo rje'i rnam thar mkhas pa dga' byed )bris ma shog grangs 106yod pa zhig 'dug pa de dang/(kam tshang chos 'byung )pod dang po'i shog grangs 161nas 198bar gsal ba gnyis tshig sbyor tsam las nang don khyad par mi 'dug lags}
karma pa de bzhin gshegs pa|{(karma pa sku phreng lnga pa )'khrungs yul ni nyang po long po kong po gsum gyi nyang po khong nyang 'dam (deng sang rgya mda' rdzong khongs )du rab byung drug pa'i shing byi (1384)lor yab sngags pa gu ru rin chen dang/yum lha mo skyid gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs shing/nga karma pak+Shi yin zhes zhal bzhes gnang ba sogs karma pa'i yang sprul yin pa'i rtags mtshan mang po bstan par rnam thar las bshad/dgung lo bdun la phebs skabs snyags phu ba bsod nams bzang pos mkhan po mdzad nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/mkhan slob gnyis kyi drung du 'dul ba gtso bor gyur pa'i chos mang du gsan/gzhan yang rtogs ldan ye shes dpal ba dang/dge bshes bkra shis rgyal mtshan/dka' bzhi pa rin chen dpal sogs kyi drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/mngal zla dang bshol zla rtsis pa'i nyi shu dang/ma rtsis pa'i dgung lo bcu dgu pa chu rta (1402)lor mkhan chen bsod nams bzang po dang/las slob yon tan blo gro sa/dad pa'i dge 'dun brgyad cu tshogs pa'i dbus su dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyi shur phebs pa chu lug (1403)lor ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma mi rabs gsum pa yung los ({(WP:1,194)})kyis srid dbang bzung rjes nan cin du gdan 'dren pa'i mi sna zhu yig dang bcas pa 'byor (yi ge ngo ma bod yig tu bsgyur ba'i nang don cha tshang (kam tshang chos 'byung )pod dang po'i shog grangs 227nas 228bar gsal )ba ltar zhal gyis bzhes te/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gnyis pa shing ya (1405)lor mtshur phu dgon pa nas phebs thon gnang nas bar khams brgyud lam thog lo ngo gnyis 'gor zhing/me phag (1407)lo'i zla ba dang po'i zla mjug la nan cin du phebs/gsol ja phul skabs gong ma bzhengs nas sne len gnang ba sogs gus bkur chen po zhus pa dang/pho brang nang gi mdzad sgo'i bkod sgrig /'bum pa'i rnam grangs/rgya lugs kyi lo gsar skabs nyin bco lnga'i ring gsol ston dang gzigs mo phul/gong ma rang nyid karma pa'i bzhugs gnas su phebs nas chos zhus pa dang 'bul ba thengs 'ga' zhig phul ba'i tho dang/phan tshun du phebs skabs gong ma'i sras re res bsu skyel zhus pa/lhag par zla ba gnyis pa'i tshes lnga nas pho brang nang du chos gsungs pa dang/gong ma'i yum gshegs pa'i dgongs rdzogs mchod 'bul gnang skabs ngo mtshar ba'i ltas gang dang gang byung ba'i bkod pa rnams nyi ma re re bzhin rgya yi ri mo mkhan mkhas pas ri mor bris te/nyin so so'i gnas tshul ngo sprod kyi yi ge 'bri gzhi'i g.yon ngos nas rim bzhin rgya yig /du ru ka'i yi ge (tur ki'i yi ge /yu gur gyi yi ge /bod yig /sog yig bcas yig rigs khag lnga yod pa'i nyin thang yug dril ma ring tshang la li smi 4968dang/zheng tshad la li smi 66 ri mo'i rnam grangs khag bzhi bcu zhe dgu yod pa zhig bris nas dran rten du phul/('di sngon dus mtshur phu'i bla brang gi nang rten gras su yod cing/deng nas nor bu gling kha'i rig dngos rtsa che'i khongs su nyar tshags byas yod/'di'i dur bu kha shas kyi dpar ris ni (bod ljongs sgyu rtsal zhib 'jug )1991lo'i rgya yig gi dus deb ang gsum pa'i shog ngos dang po'i kha shog la gsal ) zla ba gsum pa'i tshes gsum nyin gong mas gzengs bstod kyi 'ja' sa gser srang brgya las brdungs pa zhig mtshan byang la rgya skad du/gzhu la'i tA ba'u h+pha wang gis th+yan tA shan tsi tsa'i h+phu'o zhes pa ste/de'i rgya yig la 'di ltar ({(WP:1,194)})yod cing/de bod skad du bsgyur na de bzhin gshegs pa rin po che chos kyi rgyal po/nub phyogs kyi byams pa chen po zhi bar dbang phyug gi sangs rgyas zhes pa'i don yin par rnam thar las gsal/gzhan yang rje nyid dang mnyam du phebs pa'i mtshur phu'i bla ma 'brong bu ba/slob dpon dka' bzhi pa rin chen dpal/mkhan chen mgon blon pa bcas gsum la bkwan ting go shri'i 'ja' sa dang/gser tham/shel gyi tho shu bcas phul/mnga' 'og tu yod pa'i btson pa rnams kyi don du zhu nan mdzad de btson grol thengs gsum tsam mdzad/gong mas bod du yod pa'i chos lugs thams cad karma bka' brgyud kyi lugs ltar byed dgos pa'i bka' phab rtsis yod pa yang rje 'dis chos lugs dad mos mi 'dra ba rnams rang rang so so'i lugs bzhin byed du 'jug na legs pa'i zhu ba mdzad pa ltar don 'khyol byung ba ma zad/phag gru sde srid dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan la khran h+pha wang {(WP:1,194)}ste bod skad du sprul pa spel ba'i rgyal po/'bri gung spyan lnga don grub rgyal po la chen kya'u wang {(WP:1,194)}ste bstan pa spel ba'i rgyal po/stag tshang pa la hu kya'u wang {(WP:1,194)}ste bstan pa skyong ba'i rgyal po/sde dge gling tshang la tsan shang wang {(WP:1,194)}ste dge la rton pa'i rgyal po/go 'jo tshang la h+phu kya'u wang {(WP:1,194)}ste bstan pa srung ba'i rgyal po zhes pa'i lung dang tham ka bcas rim bzhin thob pa byung/rgya zla bzhi pa'i nang rgyal nang nas zhal gyes te bar khams dang byang lam brgyud lcags los (14100lo'i dgun stod la mtshur phu gdon par phyag phebs/lho kha dang/kong po/dwags po sogs sa gnas mang por chos gsungs pa sogs bstan pa'i don rgya cher mdzad de dgung lo so gnyis pa rab byung bdun pa'i shing lug (1415)lor dngos pa mya ngan las 'das/sku gdung zhugs 'bul zhus pa las byon pa'i rten ngo mtshar can rnams dngul gdung dang/'dra sku bzhengs pa'i nang du bzhugs/rnam thar lo rgyus zhib pa (karma kam tshang chos 'byung )pod dang po'i shog grangs 219nas 239bar dang/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dmar ma'i shog grangs 991nas 1018b.ragasal}
karma pa mthong ba don ldan|{(karma pa sku phreng drug )bar khams kyi khul ngom stod bshes skyam zhes pa'i sa gnas su rab byung bdun pa'i me sprel (1416)lor yab go 'jo bsam 'grub rdo rje dang/yum ldong bza' pad+ma mtsho gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/sku gong ma'i dngos slob rnams kyis brtag dpyad mang du mdzad de karma pa sku phreng du ngos bzung/mkhan chen mgo blon po sogs bla ma mang du bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos skor mtha' yas pa gsan/bar khams dang kong po sogs su byon nas chos gsungs pa dang/yul sde phan tshun gyi 'khrugs rtsod bsdums par mdzad pa sogs sku na gzhon nu'i dus nas nang bstan dar spel dang/'gro ba mang po'i don mdzad bzhin pa'i mu nas dgung lo so brgyad la phebs pa chu bya (1453)long kong po lha sgang du glo bur sku gshegs/sku gdung zhugs 'bul zhus par ngo mtshar ba'i rten mang du byon zhing/rten de rnams mtshur phur gdan drangs te gdung rten dang 'dra sku bzhengs pa'i nang bzhugs su gsol/lo rgyus zhib pa (lho rong chos 'byung )shong grangs 203dang/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 1027pa/(kam tshang chos 'byung )po dang po'i shog grangs 258bcas su gsal}
karma pa chos grags rgya mtsho|{(karma pa sku phreng bdun pa )'khrungs yul bar khams rngod kyi spyi mda' zhes bya bar rab byung brgyad pa'i shing khyi (1454)lor yab sngags 'chang grags pa dpal grub dang/yum jo dar bza' lha mo skyid gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/byis pa gzhan dang mi 'dra pa'i sku gsung thugs kyi khyad chos ngo mtshar can mang du mnga' bar brten sku gong ma'i dngos slob snye bo dar steng dgon pa'i mkhan po chos dpal 'byor gyis karma pa mthong ba don ldan gyi sprul sku yin min brtag dpyad mang po mdzad pas sku gong ma'i nyer spyad ngos 'dzin dang/bka' lan gnang stangs bcas 'khrul med byung bas sprul sku yin par yid ches thob cing/zla ba ngo dgu bzhes pan go shri rin po che dbus nas phebs te slar yang brtag dpyad dang bcas ngos 'dzin mdzad de karma pa sku phreng drug pa'i yang srid du thag bcad nas khri la bkod/dgung lo dgu la phebs pa chu rta (1462)lor khams kyi gdan sa karmar phebs/go shri rin po che'i drung nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo bcu gnyis pa shing bya (1465)lor kun mkhyen dpal bzang pos mkhan po dang/go shri dpal 'byor don grub kyis las kyi slob dpon mdzad de dge tshul gyi sdom bzhes/chos grags rgya mtshor gsol/mkhan po'i drung nas 'dul ba'i bslab bya dang lag len rnams dang/gzhan yang mdo sngags kyi chos bka' mang du gsan/tA ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma khreng h+pha rgyal po'i khri lo dgu pa chu sbrul (1473)lor go shri bsod nams rgya mtsho dang/nyi ma 'od zer bcas kyi gdong lung dang/'ja' sa/dbu zhwa zhwa nag /mu tig gis spras pa'i snam sbyar/gser bre chen/gos dar spug khri bcas 'bul rgyur bskur/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gsum pa la (sangs rgyas kyi skyems rabs brgya rtsa'i don bsdus )brtsams par mdzad/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa bzhi pa me bya (1477)lor bar khams brgyud nas mtshur phu'i gdan sar phebs te lo shas bzhugs shing/slar yang khams phyogs su 'gro don bskyangs pa 'debs pa/'khrugs rtsod bar 'dum mdzad pa sogs grangs las 'das/lhag par du dbus gtsang gnyis su karma bka' brgyud dang/dge lugs pa'i bar gyi 'gal la che ba dang/bya pa ri dpon bkra shis dar rgyas dang/rin spungs don yon rdo rje gnyis kyis dge lugs ming med du gtong ba'i 'khrugs pa chen po bslang skabs grub mtha'i phyogs lhung phyogs 'gal la brten pa'i dmag 'khrugs byas na mi 'os mkhan ha cang dkon pa byung 'dug /dgung lo nga gsum lor kor por phebs bzhugs skabs su sku skye ba gang da 'byon pa'i zhal chems phyag bris gnang ste glo bur du dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/sku gdung zhugs 'bul zhus pa'i sku'i sgal tshigs la rten ngo mtshar can yon pa kong po rtse lha sgang gi gser gdung nang gzungs su phul/gsung rtsom skor (phar phyin mngon rtogs rgyan gyi 'grel pa 'jig rten gsum gyi sgron me )dang/(tshan ma sde bdun gyi rgyas 'grel rigs gzhung rgya mtsho ) (dbu ma'i lta khrid ) (phyag chen rgya gzhung gi khrid yig chen mo ) (dbu tshan chos 'byung chen po )sogs khyon bsdoms pod chen brgyad tsam yod/de'i nang nas phar phyin dang tshad ma sde bdun gyi 'grel chen gnyis ni 'grel pa gzhan dag dang mi 'dra ba'i 'chad tshul thun mong ma yin pa'i khyad chos ldan pa zhig yin/zhib par (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma'i grangs 1032nas 1115bar dang (kam tshang chos 'byung )pod dang po'i shog grangs 266nas 298bar gsal zhing/nang don phan tshul kha gsab bya rgyu mang tsam 'dug pas zhib bsdur gnang dgos}
karma pa mi bskyod rdo rje|{(karma pa sku phreng brgyad pa )sku 'khrungs pa'i yul mdo stod karma'i gdan sa dang nye ba'i ngom chu rgyud g.yas yul ka ra ti phug /sa tam gyi grong du rab byung dgu pa'i me yos (1507)lo yab gser bya bral byams pa bshes gnyen dang/yum da ra gsal sgron gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/sku 'khrungs nas zhag bcu gsum lon pa las bzung sku gsung thugs kyi mdzad pa ngo mtshar can skye bo kun gyis mthun snang du mjal rgyu yod pa zhig byung bas sku gong ma'i dngos slob mang pos sku phreng bdun pa'i sprul sku yin min brtag dpyad mdzad/skabs der kong po brag gsum du sdod pa'i a mdo'i bla ma zhig la bu zhig byung bar ma'i mngal na yod dus pha ma gnyis la rmi lam bzang po byung ba dang/ltas bzang por mngon par 'ga' zhig byung stabs karma pa'i sprul skur ngos 'dzin byed mkhan yong ba'i re ba skyes te bu la bslab bya mang po byas nas karma pa'i sprul sku yin tshul phyi la bsgrags/karma sgar pa'i zhabs 'bring mang po zhig zas dang chang gis bslu brid byas te kho tsho'i phyogs su yong bar byas/skya se bla ma rin po che gdan drangs te ngos 'dzin mdzad du bcug rjes zla ba gnyis tsam song dus skya se bla ma sku gshegs/sku gong ma dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das kha'i zhal chems shog dril dang mthun par mtshur phur rgyal tshab rin po ches khams su 'khrungs pa'i chung srid rin po cher yid ches yod na yang/karma sgar pa'i zhabs 'bring mang che ba'i kha ngo la ma gzigs ka med byung nas kong po brag gsum du phebs nas brtag dpyad mdzad dgos byung skabs ngos 'dzin yag po ma byung/'on kyang gnas skabs rtse lnga sgang du gdan drangs nas sku mtshams la bzhugs su bcug pa sogs sprul sku'i yang srid gdan ku'i skor lam 'phros pa'i gtam ya mtshan can mang po rnam thar nang gsal ba 'dir bkod med/yang srid skor la 'then rtsod byung bar brten dgung lo bdun la phabs pa chu bya (1513)lor rgyal tshab bkra shis dpal 'byor gyi dgongs pa ltar khams phyogs su 'khrungs pa'i chung srid rin po che 'dir ngos 'dzin gtan khel byung ste khri la bkod/tA ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma kreng rda'i {(WP:1,194)}nas kyang khri phebs kyi legs 'bul na bza' nyer spyad sogs gnang/rgyal tshab sprul sku rin po che las dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa dang/sangs rgyas mnyan pa'i drung nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyer gcig pa me phag (1527)lor tshogs dge 'dun sgang pa'i mkhan po chos grub seng ges mkhan po dang/karma 'phrin las phyogs las rnam rgyal gyis las slob/sgam po'i mkhan po shAkya bzang pos gsang ston/bla ma bkra shis bzang po grib tshod pa bcas mdzad de bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/go shri rin po che dang sangs rgyas mnyan pa/karma lo tsA ba rin chen bkra shis sogs bla ma dge ba'i bshes gnyis mkhas pa dang grub pa'i yon tan phun sum tshogs pa mang po bsten nas gzhung bka' pod lnga dang/gsang sngags rgyud sde bzhi lung khrid/dbang bka'/rjes gnang/rig gnas che chung la sogs pa mtha' yas pa zhig lo mang po'i bar du gsan nas/gang gsan pa rnams nyams bzhes thog 'khyol bar mdzad/tA ming gong mas mi sna mngags nas thems mang por gdan 'dres zhus kyang ma phebs/'on kyang phan tshun bar 'brel ba ma chad tsam gnang ste sngon karma pa sku phreng rim byon drug gi bar du yon rgyal rab dang ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma rim pa'i bla mchod du gdan drangs pa'i stobs kyis go gnas mthong zhing/sgar pa'i bla brang gi stobs 'byor phun sum tshogs pas gzhir byes gang sar sku 'khor dang bcas pa'i spros pa ha cang rgyas po yod pa rnams dus skabs dang ma 'tshams par gzigs te khu bsdu gang thub thog /phyag tu gang 'byor mchod 'bul dang/sbyin gtor/dgos pa 'debs pa sogs kyi sgo nas chud zos ma song bar mdzad pas zhabs 'bring pa mang po zhig gi blo la ma babs kyang gzur mkhas mkhas pa rnams kyis bsngags brjod dang dad gus 'phel ba'i rgyur song/karma pa'i yon bdag khag gcig ros mthun nas kong po khul gyi dge lugs dgon pa rnams gtor rtsis byed skabs bka' nan pos 'gog par mdzad pa sogs grub mtha' phan tshul gyi phyogs ris la gtan nas mi dgyes pa zhig yin/dgung lo zhe brgyad bzhes pa rab byung dgu pa'i shing stag (1554)lor yar stod ra mor sku gshegs/sku gdung mtshur phur spyan drangs nas zhugs 'bul zhus pa'i gdung thal dang na bza' sogs dngul gdung bzhengs pa'i nang du bzhugs/gsung rtsom skor ('dul ba'i 'grel pa )sogs pod sum cu skor yod ces (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang gsal yang/deng skabs mjal rgyu yod pa bris ma pod bcu gsum tsam pe cing mi rigs pho brang du bzhugs/lo rgyus zhib pa (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 1206nas 1324bar dang/(karma tshang chos 'byung )pod gnyis pa'i shog grangs 3par gsal lo/}
karma pa dbang phyug rdo rje|{(karma pa sku phreng dgu pa )sku phreng brgyad pa dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs nas lo gcig dang zla ba ngo bcu gcig tsam song ba rab yung dgu pa'i me 'brug (1556)lo'i bod zla bdun pa'i 'gor mdo khams tre bo'i yul kha ba glang ri'i zhol stag bzang du yab a rdor dang/yum gling bza' a lod kyi sras su 'khrungs/zla ba ngo kha shas nas bzung lo drug tsam gyi ring sprul sku'i yang srid yin min gyi brtag dpyad thems mang phebs pa lcags bya (1561)lor zhwa dmar rin po ches karma pa sku phreng brgyad pa'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin gtan 'khel mdzad de gtsug phud bzhes/mtshan mi pham cho sa kyi dbang phyug tu gsol/dgung lo lnga la phebs pa shing glang (1565)lor gdan sa mtshur phu'i khri la bkod/de nas mi ring bar rje zhwa dmar bas mkhan po dang/dpa' bo sprul sku rin po ches las kyi slob dpon mdzad de dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes pa'i mtshan la mi pham chos kyi dbang phyug rdo rje gar dbang phyogs las rnam rgyal zhes gsol/de nas bzung snga rjes su rje zhwa dmar sku phreng lnga pa dang/dbang po sprul sku rin po che/mkhas dbang rnam rgyal grags pa bcas rtsa ba'i bla mar bsten pa gnang ste gzhung chen bka' pod lnga dang rgyud sde bzhi'i dbang bka' rjes gnang khrid lung thun mong rig gnas lnga sogs cha tshang bar gsan/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa bzhir phebs pa sa yos (1579)lor rje zhwa dmar bas mkhan po dang/rgyal tshab sprul skus las slob mdzad de dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/dbus gtsang/lho kha/mon/khams/kong po/spo bo sogs su sku phreng gong ma'i dus ltar thengs kha shas phebs te chos brgyud dar rgyas su mdzad pa dang sa gnas khag gi 'khrugs rtsod mang po 'dum 'grig mdzad/rgyal dbang sku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtsho dang phan tshul thugs 'dris 'a brel bzang rgyun 'khyongs mdzad pa'i zil shugs la brten nas zhal bzhugs ring karma bka' brgyud dang/dge lugs bar gyi 'gal ba'i rnam pa mi mngon par gyur pa bcas bstan pa spyi dang/bod mi rigs yongs la phan rlabs che ba'i mdzad pa bskyangs/dgung lo zhe brgyad du phebs pa rab byung bcu pa'i chu yos (1603)lor dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/gsung rtsom skor (phyag rgya chen po lhan cig skyes sbyor gyi khrid yig) dbu ma 'jug pa'i 'grel pa) (mngon pa mdzod kyi 'grel pa )sogs gsung 'bum pod bcu skor yod/zhib par (karma kang tshang gi chos 'byung (pod gnyis pa'i grangs 63nas 121bar gsal}
karma pa chos dbyings rdo rje|{(karma pa sku phreng bcu pa )smar stod ki za thang zhes par yab khye'u thar dang/yum a 'tsho zhes pa'i sras su rab byung bcu pa'i shing 'grub (1604)lor sku 'khrungs/chung dus kyi mtshan la o rgyan skyabs zhes zhu zhing/dgung lo brgyad la phebs pa lcags phag (1611)lor karma pa'i khri thog tu mnga' gsol zhus/dgung lo bcu gnyis la phebs pa shing yos (1615)lor mtshur phu'i gdan sar mnga' gsol zhing/dpa' bo rin po che gtsug lag rgya mtshos chos dbyings rdo rje zhes mtshan gsol/rje de nyid dang/zhwa dmar gar gyi dbang po sogs la ma mang po bsten nas mdo sngags rig gnas dang bcas pa'i lung khrid dbang sogs mtha' yas pa gnas/dgung lo nyir gcig tu phebs pa shing byi (1624)lor bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/dus skabs der karma pa rin po che nyid nas dge lugs chos brgyud 'dzin skyon gnang mkhan mchog dman tshang mar mthun sgril dam gtsang yong rgyu'i dgongs bzhed kyis thabs mkhas mdzad pa bskyangs gang thub gnang yang rgyal dbang lnga pa chen po'i yab tshang dang gtsang ma sde srid bar phun 'gal zla che ba'i thog /gtsang pa karma bstan skyong gis bi ri rgyal po don yod dang cha har legs ldan rgyal po bcas dang ngan 'brel byas te dge lugs pa'i bla dgon tshang mar sdang zug che ba'i skabs dang 'khel te gtsang be cha gsum gyi ngan gros yi ge'i thog karma pa rin po che'i zhabs 'bring 'ga' zhig nas lkog tu phyag tham brkus te chod yig thog phab pa sogs rkyen ngan mang po sne 'doms la brten rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu rta (1642)lor gu shri han gyi dmag dpung gis gtsang pa rgyal po'i srid dbang rtsa gtor btang ba dang stabs bstun lho brag dang rtsa ri brgyud gsang stabs kyis ljang yul du bros byos phabs te chu byi (1672)lo bar lo sum cu'i ring ljang yul sogs yul gru mang por phebs nas gdul bya'i re 'dod dang mthun pa'i chos mang du gsungs shing/skabs der ljang rgyal pos dga' ldan pho brang srid gzhung la dmag drangs te dgra sha len rtsis byas par yang chos dam tshig dang 'brel ba'i bka' nan pos sgo nas bkag 'gog mdzad pa sogs bstan 'gro spyi la phan pa'i mdzad pa bzang po bskyangs pa rnams tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa mchog gis gnas nas karma pa chos dbyings rdo rje mchog mtshur phu'i gdan sar phyir phebs dang 'brel sngon chad kyi dam sel gnas tshul skor gleng med thugs mthun dam gtsang mdzad rgyu'i phyag bris phyag bstar ma yang yang gnang ba bzhin/chu glang (1673)lor dbus su phebs te gong sa lnga pa rin po che dang mjal 'phrad bkur bzos 'gran zla med pa gnang ste/mtshur phu'i gdan sa chen por lhod bzhugs mdzad cing/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing stag (1674)lor dgung lo don gcig thog sku gshegs/'di'i rnam thar skor (karma pa sku phreng bcu pa chos dbyings rdo rje'i rnam thar bdud rtsi'i bum bzang )bris ma thog grangs 47yod pa zhig 'dug kyang kho bor blta klog gi go skabs ma thob cing/'dir bkod pa ni (na rim bcu pa chos dbyings rdo rje'i rnam thar )tshigs bcad ma zhwa dmar ye shes snying pos mdzad pa dang 'brel yod bla ma gzhan gyi mdzad rnam nas phyogs bsdus byas pa yin}
karma pa ye shes rdo rje|{(karma pa sku phreng bcu gcig pa )mgo log gi yul du rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me sbrul (1677)lor sku 'khrungs nas rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags sbrul (1701)lor sku gshegs/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa bzhi bzhugs/zhwa dmar rin po che ye shes snying po sogs bla ma mang du bsten nas gsan bsam mthar phyin par mdzad/sku tshe'i mthar zhwa dmar sprul pa'i sku rang nyid kyi rgyal tshab du bsko bzhag mdzad de dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/rnam thar so rgyus zhig pa bdag gis ma mthong ngo/}
karma pa byang chub rdo rje|{(karma pa sku phreng bcu gnyis pa )mdo khams sde dge'i mnga' khongs dbon stod dkyil le zhes pa sngon dus karma pa pak+shi'i dbon rgyud du rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu lug (1703)lor sku 'khrungs nas rab byung de ga'i chu byi (1732)lor sku 'khrungs nas rab byung de 'i chu byi (1732)lo bar dgung lo sum cu so gcig bzhugs/zhwa dmar sku phreng brgyad pa nyid rtsa ba'i bla mar bsten/lhan rgyas dang si tu rin po che bcas bal yul du phebs te gnas rten khag la mchod 'bul gnas gzigs gnang/man ching gong ma yung Ting {(WP:1,194)}gis pe cin du gdan drangs pa ltar phebs kyang lam bar du dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs/rnam thar zhib pa bdag gis ma mjal lags}
karma pa bdud 'dul rdo rje|{(karma pa sku phreng bcu gsum pa )lho gnas dge ri dang nye sar rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu glang (1733)lor sku 'khrungs nas rab byung bcu gsum kyi me sbrul (1797)lo bar dgung so drug cu re lnga bzhugs/mdo sngags rig gnas dang bcas par gsan bsam mthar phyin gnang nas mtshur phu'i gdan sa yun ring mdzad/rnam ra zhib pa da phan bdag gis ma mjal lags}
karma phun tshogs phyogs las rnam rgyal|{gtsang pa sde srid phun tshogs rnam rgyal/sde pa zhing shag pa tshe brtan rdo rje la bu dgu yod pa las ming grags che ba gsum byung (karma mthu stobs rnam rgyal/kun spangs lha dbang rdo rje/karma bstan srung dbang po )bas de gsum gang rigs shig gi bu yin /rab byung dgu pa'i lcags khyi (550)lor gzhis kha bsam 'grub rtser skyes/lo chung dus nas pha ma gnyis ka 'das/rang lo nyi shu rtsa lnga pa shing khyi (1474)lor yar rgyab pa dang ma mthun par dmag dpung yar rgyab tu drangs nas tshar bcad de yar rgyab sde pa bdun 'dul grags pa khyim tshang rnams la lto skal gzhis ka phran bu bcas bzhag /rab byung bcu pa'i sa rta (1618)lor gtsang dmag dbus su drangs te se 'bras gnyis la drag blangs te se 'bras gling log zer ba byas/de'i phyi lor lho kha khul du dmag drangs te sde pa sku rab pa tshar bcad thog 'phyongs rgyas rdzong dpon yin pa yang dbang cha phrogs te sna dkar rtser bzang btson du bcug ste lo shas ma 'gyangs par 'das/de nas lo ngo gnyis song ba'i lcags sprel (1620)lor phyi tshul du 'brum nad kyis 'das zer yang/don dngos su gza' nad phog ste 'das pa yin}
karma 'phrin las phyogs las rnam rgyal|{yongs grags su dpal sgang lo tsA ba'am mtshan gzhan karma 'phrin las gnyis pa zhu ba de yin/rab byung brgyad pa'i me byi (1456)lo nas rab byung dgu pa'i sa phag (1539)lo bar dgung lo gya bzhi bzhugs/mtshan dngos la ngag dbang chos rgyal zer/bzo rig pa dang/sgra rig snyan ngag /sdeb sbyor sogs lam khas pa'i yul du phyin pa zhig yin stabs slob ma dang slob rgyun ha cang mang zhing/si tu chos kyi go cha dang/rgyal tshab grags pa don grub gnyis kyi yongs 'dzin mdzad/dgung lo zhe gnyis pa rab byung brgyad pa'i me sbrul (1497)lor (dag yig ngag sgron )brtsams/gzhan (karma shing rta )dang (rdo rje nyi ma'i snang ba )sogs brtsams nas karma pa sku phreng brgyad pa'i dgongs dos dbu ma thal 'gyur du 'grel bar mdzad/gzhan yang (mngon brjod pad+ma dkar po'i phreng ba ) (snyan ngag gi 'grel pa dang dper brjod rab gsal bklags pa kun shes )le tshan gsum/(chab shog snyan ngag gi skor ) (dbang gi rnam bshad chen mo ) (kyai rdo rje'i rgyud 'grel )bcas yod/rnam thar zhim par mi bskyod bzang pos mdzad pa'i (grub mchog karma 'phrin las kyi rnam thar legs mdzad rgya mtsho'i sgra dbyangs dbyangs (bris ma shog grangs 20yod pa der gzigs}
karma badzra|{las kyi rdo rje}
karma zhwa dmar|{karma pa rang byung rdo rje'i dngos slob rtogs ldan grags pa seng ge sku mya ngan las 'da' khar yon gyi rgyal sa pe cin nas hrang tu'u la ma phebs gong tsam rab byung drug pa'i sa yos (1339)lor dbu zhwa dmar po rin po che'i rgyan gyis spras pa zhig gnang ste sku tshab lta bur bsko bzhag gnang ba nas sku phreng rim yon la zhwa dmar rin po che zhes mtshan thogs pa byung/karma zhwa dmar rin po che'i sku phreng bcu byung ba ste/1 rtogs ldan grags pa seng ge dang/2 mkha' spyod dbang po/3 chos dpal ye shes/4 chos grags ye shes/5 dkon mchog yan lag /6 chos kyi dbang phyug /7 dpal ldan ye shes snying po/8 chos kyi don grub/9 chos kyi nyi ma/10 chos grub rgya mtsho bar du byung/sku phreng bcu pa chos grub rgya mtsho'i skabs gor khas bod du btsan 'dzul byed pa'i go rim nang 'brel ba byung ba'i gleng gzhi la brten nas man ching gong ma chen lung gis bka' phabs te phyin chad yang srid rtsad gcad gdan zhu mi chog pa dang/yangs pa ngan gyi dgon pa chos lugs dge lugs par bsgyur rgyu sogs kyi nyes chad bcad pa (rdo ring paN+Di ta'i rnam thar )las gsal}
karma rabs brgyad|{1 karma dus gsum mkhyen pa/2 karma pak+Shi/3 karma rang byung rdo rje/4 karma rol pa'i rdo rje/5 karma de bzhin gshegs pa/6 karma mthong ba don ldan/7 karma chos grags rgya mtsho/8 karma mi bskyod rdo rje rnams so/}
karma rin chen nges don bstan 'dzin|{khams ka thog si tu chos kyi 'byung gnas kyi dbon po karma nges legs kyi mtshan/'di bod kyi skar rtsis la shin tu mkhas pa'i rtsom pa po zhig ste des rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu byi (1732)lor mdzad pa'i (rtsis kyi bstan bcos nyer mkho bum bzang )zer ba zhig sde dge dpar khang du dpar yod do/}
karma sha tam|{gzhung gi ming/slob dpon dbyig gnyen gyi slob ma 'dul ba la mkhas pa'i mchog tu gyur pa slob dpon yon tan 'od kyis mdzad pa yin/nad don ni 'dul ba'i gzhung nas bshad pa'i las rigs kyi cho ga'i lag len rnam grangs brgya dang gcig gi bya tshul zhib par gsungs yod/btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi skabs cog ro lo tsA ba klu'i rgyal mtshan gyis rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta dzi na mi tra la gtugs nas bod skad du bsgyur ba yin/sh+lau ka gsum stong bdun brgya dang bam po dgu yod pa 'di sde dge bstan 'gyur gyi mdo phyogs pod (wu)par yod/(dkar chag ldan dkar ma )las kyang gsal}
karma shag|{lha sa'i shar ngos gyi khang ming zhig ste sngon dus de gar karma pa sku phreng kha shas bzhugs pa yin stabs karma shag ces ming thogs/phyis dus 'gyur zhig gis rkyen pas de'i bdag dbang se ra bla spyir yod/de gar chos skyong bya khri spyan gcig khog zhugs byed sa'i lcog 'du khang dang bcas yod pa dang/khang pa'i ming chos skyong la thogs nas karma shag chos skyong zer/dmangs khrod bod srol du karma shag chos skyong de lha sa'i gtsug lag khang gi gnas srung dang/yul gyi sa bdag rdo bdag yin pas lha ba sa zhig yin phyin lha de gsol dgos pa'i shod srol yod/'on kyang lha de'i gsol mchod byed mkhan gtso bo rags rgyab pa dang ping gtong ba sogs yin stabs shod rgyun du karma shag sprang po'i lha zhes kyang zer/sngon dus sku rten la bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi go gnas med kyang dus rabs nyi shu pa'i lo rabs sum cu pa'i nang nas karma shag chos rjer rim pa drug pa'i las tshan gyi go gnas byung}
kar+sha pa Na|{(ka r+sha pa Na )'di la deng sang gsar du bsgrigs pa'i tshig brjod 'ga' zhig dang lo rgyus kyi dpe deb 'ga' zhig nang/kar+shapa Na zhes pa bod skad du bsgyur na 'gron bu la go dgos par gsal ba ni ma dag rgyun 'byams kyi ngag rgyud gzhir bzung ba nas bris pa zhig yin zhing/dngos don ni kar+sha pa Na zhes gser dngul zangs gsum ci rigs las bzos pa'i dngul sgor gyi rigs shing yin pa ni bstan 'gyur 'dul ba'i nang bzhugs pa rgya gar gyi slob dpon dge legs bshes gnyen (spyi lo'i dus rabs brgyad pa'i 'gor byon )gyis mdzad pa'i ('dul ba lung zhu ba'i 'grel pa )las kar+sha pa Na ni zong gi khyad par ste/dngul las byas pa gzugs dod pa btsong du rung ba'o zhes dang/yang slob dpon de nyid kyis mdzad pa'i ('dul ba lung gzhi'i 'grel pa )las kyang kar+sha pa Na ni/pa Na'i bye brag ste/mngon mtshan can yin na ni/dngul las byas pa yin no zhes gsal zhing/slob dpon chos grags kyi rjes tsam la byung ba'i rgya gar gyi slob dpon dul ba'i lhas mdzad pa'i ('dul ba lung rnam 'byed kyi 'grel pa )las/mngon mtshan can zhes bya ba ni tha snyad du bya ba'i mtshan ma can te zlum po la sogs pa'i dbyibs la mi la sogs pa'i rtags byas pa'am zhes gsungs pa dang/dus rabs bcu bzhi pa'i 'gor kun mkhyen mtsho sna bas mdzad pa'i ('dul ba'i legs bshad nyi ma'i 'od zer )las kar+sha pa Na de yang dngul zho phyed tsam las bzo byas pa ste zhes gsungs pa ltar kar+sha pa Na gcig la 'gron bu ngo grangs chig stong drug brgya'i rin thang gi tshad yin cing/de gser srang gi dbang du byas na gser srang med zho do dang dngul srang gi dbang du byas na dngul srang med zho bzhi yin/zhib par kho bos bris pa'i (bod gna' rabs kyi 'jal gshor 'debs gsum tshad gzhi )zhes pa'i rtsom yig zur yod la gzigs par zhu}
kasmi ra|{bod skad du kha che'i yul zer/rgya gar nub byang phyogs su yod/bod yig thog 'khod pa'i lo rgyus khag dang/tA ra nA thas mdzad pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )le'u gsum pa'i 'gor/kha che'i yul 'di thog mar mtsho zhig yin pa la rgyal po ma skyes dgu'i bu lag bzang ('char byed yin nam snyam )gi bu gzhu bzang (ma 'gags pa yin nam snyam )gis srid dbang bzung skabs te/phal cher spyi lo'i kun dga' bo'i slob ma dgra bcom pa nyi ma gus pas yul der byon nas klu'i rgyal po o du Sh+Ta btul nas mtsho bskams pa'i shul du skam sa chags te/rim gyis yul gzhan dag nas mi mang po der 'dzoms shing/grong khyer chen po dag dang grong gser khag mang po/rgyal po'i pho brang gcig /gtsug lag khang bcu gnyis/dge 'dun ha cang mang po 'dzoms pa zhig chags par gsungs yang mu stegs rig byed smra ba 'ga' zhig gis bshad srol la/drang srong ka sh+yab zer ba zhig yul der byon nas mtsho rdol du bcug pa yin pas/yul gyi ming yin drang srong de'i mtshan las gras te ka sha smir zhes thogs pa yin zer ba'ang snang/gang ltar mtsho p+sakam pa'i shul du yul grong chags pa'i bshad tshul mthun yon/de nas spyi lo'i dus rabs dang po'i dkyil du ku sha na'i rgyal rabs kyi rgyal po mi thog gsum pa rgyal po ka ni ska'i dus su theg pa che chung gnyis ka dar rgyas che zhing bka' bsdu gsum pa'i sbyin bdag kyang rgyal po 'dis yas te kaNi ka gtsug lag khang dang/khru bzhi brgya ('dom brgya )yod pa'i mchod rten chen po bcas bzhengs par gsal zhing/(thang san tsang gi lam yig )bod skad du bsgyur ba las/skabs der kha che'i yul du theg pa chung ngu'i dge 'dun lnga stong tsam yod pa'i dgon pa gcig dang/sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyi tshems yin zer ba tshon gang tsam yod pa gcig bcas mjal ba dang/slob dpon dge 'dun grags pa las theg pa chen po'i chos dang/rig gnas skor mang po gsan par gsungs/de nas rab byung gsum pa'i mjug la (dus rabs bcu gsum pa'i 'go )kha che paN chen shAkya shri bod nas kha che'i yul du phyir log phebs rjes lo ngo bcu bzhi'i ring nas bstan chos lugs dar spel mdzad pa'i lo rgyus kha che paN chen gyi rnam thar khro phu lo tsA bas mdzad pa'i nang gsal/de nas rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me rta (1666)yas mas su dbyi si lan gyi chos lugs la dad pa'i rgyal po o ran dzeb zer bas rgya gar gyi sa khul mang che ba bzung rjes rgya gar byang brgyud du dmag drangs te dbang du bsdus skabs kasmi ra yang 'og tu bcug pa de nas bzung kasmi ra'i yul du sdod pa'i mi tshang ma dbyi si lan gyi chos lugs la ma bsgyur dbang med byung zhing/bod sa gnas su dbyi si lan gyi chos lugs la dad pa byed mkhan gyi tshong pa mang che ba thog mar kasmi ra nas yong ba yin stabs bod du yongs grags kyi ngag rgyun la dbyi si lan gyi chos la dad pa byed mkhan gyi kasmi ra'i mi rnams la kha che zhes 'bod srol dang/kasmi ra nas thon pa'i me tog gur kum la kha che gur kum zhes 'bod srol byung ba yin}
kasmi ra rgyal rabs|{'di la mkhas dbang dge 'dun chon 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (gtam rgyud gser thang )lcags dpar ma'i deb dang po'i shog grangs (352las/kha che'i tshul gyi rgyal po 'ga' zhig gi lo rgyus gsal ba de ma gtogs zhib cha da phan ma mthong zhing/gong gsal gsung rtsom de'i shog grangs 186las (kasmi ra'i rgyal rabs ra dza tang+gi ni )bya ba go dka' ba'i snyan dngags kyi tshigs bcad du byas pa kla klo ma slebs kyi bar kha cha'i yul du gang byung ba'i gnas tshul bris pa 'di gcig pu ma gtogs ye nas ma byung ba yin zhes gsungs 'dug pa 'dir brtags na/gong gsal gyi rgyal rabs de mkhas dbang dam pas cha tshang gzigs myong yod tshod 'dug kyang/thugs dgyes pa'i dpyad gzhir 'os pa zhig ma byung ba 'dra snyam}
kasmi ra'i yi ge|{rgya gar nub phyogs kha cha'i yul gyi yi ge la zer/de la yang yig gzugs mi 'dra ba kha shas yod pa'i rigs gcig gi dper ris ni lcang lung paN+Di ta blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi gsung 'bum phyi sog dmar ma pod (nga)pa'i mjug tu (rgya dkar nag rgya ser kasmi ra bal bod hor gyi yi ge dang dpe ris rnam grangs )zhes pa'i shog grangs 7pa dang/(yig ris sna tshogs kyi phyi mo me tog phreng ba )sku 'bum che shos rin po che bla brang gi dpar ma shog grangs 11nas 12bar kasmi ra'i yig gzugs mi 'dra ba khag bsum gyi dpe ris gsal ba der gzigs}
ka'u ni|{'di ni bstan 'gyur nang du dpyad gzhi'i khongs su bzhugs pa'i ('dul ba mdo rtsa ba'i 'grel chung )zhes pa de'i nang gsal ba'i dngul zho'i tshad gzhi rtsi stangs shig ste 'di ltar ni/'gron bu brgyad cu la kar+sha pa Na bcu drug la ka'u ni gcig /ka'u ni bi la ge der gcig /ge der lnga la srang gang zhes rtsi ba red/zho tshad 'di'i rtsi gzhi dngul yin pa ma gtogs gser min zhing yongs grags su kar+sha pa Na'i rtsi stangs 'di khas mi len pa red}
ka'u li dkar po|{yongs grags su ko ri ya zhes dang/khro'o shan zhes 'bod pa'i yul de yin cing/(deb dmar )las rgya mtsho'i gling ka'u li dkar po zhes gsal ba ltar mtsho thog gi phyed gling phran zhig yin/ka'u li zhes pa ni ko ri ya zhes pa'i ri yig li yig tu 'bod pa'i rgya skad kyi zur chag gi sgra gdangs yin/mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (deb ther dkar po )las/ka'u li ni gna' rabs kyi ming cha tshang la ka'o cus li zer bar gsungs pa ltar spyi lo'i dus rabs drug pa'i 'gor byung ba'i wed byang ma'i rgyal khab gyi lo rgyus dang/khra'o shan rgyal khab kyi lo rgyus nang du yang ka'o cus li zer ba'i ming bed spyod byed myong zhing/rjes su de'i bsdus ming la ka'o li zer/spyi lo 642lor ka'o li nub rgyud kyi tsho dpon chon ka'i su'u wen gyis ka'o li rgyal po can wu dang/blon po brgya lhag tsam bsad pa sogs nang 'khrug byung zhing/thang gi gong ma thang tha'i tsung gis go skabs de dang bstun nas/spyi lo 644lor ka'o lir dpung 'jug byas kyang pham nyes byung/slar yang spyi lo 647lor dpung 'jug byas te/spyi lo 649lor thang tha'i tsung gshegs rjes gnas skabs ring dmag mtshams bzhag /spyi lo 660lor ka'u li'i chon ka'i su'u wen grongs rjes de'i bu chon nan krung dang/chon nan can/chon nan khreng bcas dbang cha'i don du ma 'chams par rtsod gzhi byung ste chon nan khreng gis rang nyid kyi bu chon shan khreng btang nas thang rgyal rabs la dmag rogs yong ba'i re ba zhus/thang ka'o tsung gis go skabs de dang bstun nas dmag rogs byas par kha g.yar nas ka'o lir dpung 'jug byas te spyi lo 668lor grong khyer phing dbrang blangs thog ka'o li sa khongs hril po thang gis mnga' 'og tu bsdus nas grong khyer phing dbrang du srid 'dzin sgrig gzhi yang btsugs myong/spyi lo 918lor wan can zer bas srid dbang bzung ste bkas bkod brgyud 'dzin gyi rgyal khab dang po btsugs shing/rgyal sa'i ming la kha'i cing (deng sang {(WP:1,194)})zer/sangs rgyas chos lugs ni dus skabs der rgyal khab kyi chos lugs su ngos 'dzin byed kyi yod pa dang/khra'o shan gyi nang pa'i slob dpon 'ga' zhig thang gi rgyal sa khrang an du phebs myong ba'i nang nas/kim ha shang zhes ko ri ya'i rgyal sras rab byung mdzad pa zhig yod pa des btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi blon po sang shi la chos gsungs nas lung bstan bka' slob mang po gnang myong ba yin/'phros rnams gsham gsal gyi kim ha shang zhes pa'i mchan 'grel la gzigs}
ka'u hi|{{(WP:1,194)} gnas brtan sde pa'i lugs kyi sangs rgyas 'das lo 1307chu yos (spyi lo 763)lor btsan po khri srong sde btsan gyis bka' phab pa ltar blon po zhang stong dang tang zhang gi dmag khri nyi shu lhag tsam khrid nas 'bum gling lcags zam brgal te thang rgyal rabs kyi sde grong mang por dmag drangs te bcom/thang gi dmag dpon ka'u hi zer bas bod la mgo btags te dmag sna lam rgyus an grong khyer bod la shor nas nyin bco lnga rim bzung ba sogs kyi lo rgyus (thang deb gsar rnying )gnyis su gsal ba de yin}
ka'u hi'i rgyal khams|{'di'i 'grel bshad gong gi ka'u li dkar po zhes pa der gzigs}
ka'o le|{(deb ther dkar po'i )nang srong btsan gyis thang gong mar phul ba'i yi ge'i nang kong li zhes pa da lta'i kun ri yA'i (khra'o shan )rgyal khab kyi ming yin zhes gsal}
kar sde|{karma pa'i chos brgyud 'dzin pa'i dgon sde la chos lugs gzhan dag gis btags pa'i mang gzhan}
kar srid pa|{sngon dus bod kyi btsan po'i dus rabs skabs kong po dkaro mang po rje'i rgyal rgyud kyis 'dzin pa'i srid dbang de btsan po'i mnga' 'og tu gtogs pa'i rgyal phran zhig yin zhing/ming rgyal rabs kyi skabs karma bka' brgyud kyi sbyin bdag gtso bo zhig yin/rin spungs pa dang/gtsang pa rgyal po'i dus su yang kong po khul du stobs shugs che ba'i gras zhig dang/dge lugs phyogs la sdang zug che ba zhig yin stabs lo rgyus thog dkar srid pa zhes brjod srol byung}
kar lugs|{'di la go don mi 'dra ba gnyis yod/1 karma bka' brgyud kyi thun mong ma yin pa'i yi dam dang/srung ma/chos brgyud man ngag bcas la go ba blang dgos pa/2 karma bka' brgyud kyi che nyams dang gus srol sgrig lam sogs bka' brgyud chos lugs gzhan dang mi 'dra ba'i khyad chos mang po yod/karma pa chos grags rgya mtsho'i rnam thar nang 'khod pa lta bur go dgos pa bcas skabs dang sbyar shes pa dgos}
