kaSh+Tha maN+Ta|{'di la deng sang bod skad thog ka Ta man rdu zer zhing rgya skad du ca ta man tu'u zhes 'bod pa de yin/go don ni shing dkyil zer ba dang/bod yig gi lo rgyus mang por ye rang zhes 'bod pa de yin par btsan po paN+Di ta'i ('dzam gling rgyas bshad )las gsal}
ki bswa ho gsum|{ki sgra bswo sgra ho sgra gsum ni gri 'phyar ba'i dpa' skad}
king cang hur|{(kun cang hur ) (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 1389thog kun cang hu zhes gsal ba sgra mi 'dra ba tsam las don gcig yin/thang rgyal rabs kyi skabs su rgyal sa khrang an yi ming gzhan cing khrang h+phu {(WP:1,194)}zhes 'bod pa de rgya yig nas yu gur gyi skad du bsgyur zhing/de nas bod skad du bsgyur skabs kyin chang dang king cang/kin cang zhes sgra mi 'dra bar 'gyur ba yin/thang rgyal rabs kyi skabs su rgyal sa khrang an gyi ming la cing khrang zhes 'bod cing/de ni h+phu rim pa'i srid gzhung gnas yul yin/(rgya yig tshig mdzod chen mo )shong grangs 350thog (cing khrang ){(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i 'grel bshad las thang rgyal rabs kyi then pa'o lo dang po {(WP:1,194)}thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ma zhon tsung gis srid dbang bzung ba'i khri lo dang po (742)phan chad rgyal sa khrang an gyi ming la cing khrang zhes 'bod tshul gsal}
king+kar|{rgya gar gyi skad de/bod skad du bsgyur na jag pa/g.yog po dang/las byed/mngag gzhug pa bcas don mang po la 'jug pa'i nang nas skabs 'dir mngag gzhug pa la go dgos}
kirti sku phreng dang po dge 'dun rgyal mtshan|{rje tsong kha pa'i dngos slob bap+satan pa phyogs mthar spel ba'i dar chen bdun gyi nang tshan yongs grags su rong po ljags nag pa zer/mdo smad bzhag shod ces pa'i sa char rab byung drug pa'i shing stag (1374)lor yab klu 'bum dang yum a sman gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs shing/byis pa'i dus kyi mtshan la chos 'bum zhes zer/dgung lo bcu drug pa la dbus su phebs/zha lur byon te rdo rje 'dzin pa khyung po lhas pa'i drung nas bod du bzhugs pa'i gsang sngags kyi dbang rgyun yongs su rdzogs pa gsan/rje tsong kha pa'i drung du rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes pa'i mtshan la dge 'dun rgyal mtshan zhes gsol ba dang/dge slong gi sdom pa yang rje bla ma nyid kyi drung nas bzhes shing/mdo sngags kyi lung khrid man ngag yongs su rdzogs pa gsan/lha sa smon lam chen mo thog mar 'dzugs skabs zhabs 'degs thugs zin nges sgrub/lho brag mkhan chen nam mkha' rgyal mtshan dang/rje tsong kha pa rnam gnyis kyi lung bstan ltar rab byung bdun pa'i lcags yos (1411)lor mdo smad phyogs su byon nas dpon slob sum cu so drug dang mnyam du dgon pa 'tshol bar phebs te/thog mar ka la ri'i ngos su sgrub gnas ri khrod phyag btab ste lo nyi shu tsam der bzhugs/de nas stag tshang lha mo dgon pa chags sa'i sa gnas der phebs nas lha mo ri khrod phyag btab nas mdo sngags kyi 'chad nyan gnang bzhin pa'i mu nas 'du khang chung ngu zhig dang mgon khang bcas bzhengs/sku tshe hril por 'chad nyan dang/sgrub pa nyams bzhes ya ma bral ba'i ngang nas mthar/dgung lo don bdun pa rab byung brgyad pa'i lcags rta (1450)lor sku gshegs/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang 'di'i gsung rtsom skor/mdo sngags smin rtsis/sum rtags dag gsum skor bcas khyon pod bcu lhag yod tshul kirti dgon pa'i dpe mdzod khang gi dkar chag shog dril nang 'khod 'dug ces gsal/lo rgyus zhib par gong gsal (mdo sngags chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 614nas 716bar dang/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 5nas 23bar gsal zhing/rnam thar rgyas pa kirti sku phreng lnga pa blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa la shog grangs 101yod lags}
kirti sku phreng gnyis pa bstan pa rin chen|{smad rgyud du yab dkon mchog skyabs dang yum skyid bde gnyis kyi sras su sku phreng gong ma sku gshegs nas lo nyer lnga pa rab byung brgyad pa'i shing rta (1474)lor 'khrungs/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang/'di'i dgung rnying chu sprel yin par bshad/dgung lo bcu drug la dbus gtsang du phebs/dge bshes chos dpal sogs bsten nas mdo sngags rigs gnang dang bcas pa gsan bsam mthar phyin pa gnang/dgung lo so gcig pa la rang yul du byon/kirti ri khrod du so bdun tsam bzhugs nas chos 'chad nyan dang/sgom sgrub zung 'brel gyis dus 'gar bar mdzad/dgung lo so lnga pa rab byung dgu pa'i sa 'brug (1580)lor tA ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma kreng rdes {(WP:1,194)}nas pho nya mngags te nang sar gdan 'dren zhus kyang ma phebs par lung bstan dang rim 'gro bkod pa sogs zhal bkod zhib par gnang slar yang gong mas rta zhing la ma dang/shig go ching gnyis kyi gdong dngul srang stong dang/gser ja sogs kyi 'bul rten dang/bla ma sang rgyas grub thob rin po che zhes pa'i lung dang/sa bo las grub pa'i tham ka nor bu'i yu ba can zhig phul te gzengs bstod zhus/rgyal rong dang rnga ba stod smad kun du mdo sngags kyi 'chad spel rgya cher mdzad nas dgung lo brgyad cu gya lnga pa rab byung dgu pa'i sa rta (1558)lor dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/gsung rtsom skor (stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang 'khod don du/(mngon rtogs rgyan )dang/(dbu ma 'jug pa'i 'grel pa/) ('dul ba'i cho ga /) (sdom gsum bslab bya/) (sum rtags 'grel pa mkhas pa dgyes pa'i mchod sprin/) (snyan ngag 'grel pa tshangs sras dgyes pa'i glu )sogs pod brgyad lhag yod tshul gsal/rnam thar lo rgyus ni/(mdo smad chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 716par dang/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )dpar ma'i shog grangs 23nas 26bar gsal lo/}
kirti sku phreng gsum pa bstan pa rab rgyas|{a rig gi yul du yab yon tan dbang phyug dang/yum skyid mo yag gnyis kyi sras su rab byung dgu pa'i shing byi (1564)lor 'khrungs/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang 'di'i dgung rnying sa khyi lo yin par bshad slob dpon rdo rje rags pa dang zhabs drung bstan pa grags pa sogs kyi drung du rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan la bstan pa rab rgyas zhes gsol/dgung lo nyer bdun pa rab byung bcu pa'i lcags stag (1590)lor dbus gtsang du phebs/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa rin po che dang mjal zhing/paN chen rin po che sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/paN chen de nyid dang/rgyal dbang sku phreng lnga pa rin po che/sa skya bdag chen rin po che sogs bla ma mang po bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang po gsan/dgung lo so dug pa la rang yul du byon/mkha' 'gro phug ring dang rgan rgya'i gnya' gong brag dkar gyi gnas sgo phye/ri bo rtse lnga dang lo'u kya tun sogs gnas chen grags pa can mang por byon nas sgom sgrub mdzad/ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma khrung kreng gis pe cin tu gdan drangs pa ltar phebs nas zla ba gcig dang zhag lnga bzhugs/gong mas bla ma 'di nyid la kyin tha'i tsin tse ge'u tang se (bla ma thugs rje chen po 'gran med seng ge )zhes pa'i lung dang tham ka phul/gu shri han gyis bod sa gnas dbang du bsdus nas dga' ldan pho brang gi srid dbang btsugs rjes dbus su phebs nas p+tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa rin po che dang mjal te rang yul du phebs nas dgung lo brgyad cu bzhes pa rang byung bcu gcig pa'i chu lugs (1643)lor sku gshegs/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang/sku gshegs pa'i lo ni 1617lo ste rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me sbrul (tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa sku 'khrungs pa'i lo de yin )lo yin par bshad pa nor skyon byung 'dug /gsung rtsom skor/gong gsal (stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )las bla ma'i rnal 'byor dang/gsol 'debs/gur zhal gyi gtor chog sogs pod dgu tsam yod tshul 'khod 'dug}
kirti sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang 'jam dbyangs|{mdo smad pA la zhes grags pa'i sa gnas su yab 'bum thar dang yum me 'gyur gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me sprel (1656)lor 'khrungs/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang 'di'i dgung rnying me sbrul yin par bshad pa nor )dgung lo bcu drug nas 'don chos spyod dang rig gnas sogs la sbyangs pa mdzad/dgung lo nyer drug pa la dbus su byon nas 'bras spungs blo gsal gling gi chos grwar zhugs te rgyal dbang lnga pa chen po dang paN chen rin po che'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos bka' mang du gsan zhing dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags rta (1690)lor gzhis dgon du bla brang thog mar brtsigs/dgung lo nga gsum pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa byi (1708)lor sku gshegs/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang dgung lo drug cu re gcig pa (1679)lor gshegs zhes gsal/lo rgyus gnad bsdus (mdo smad chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 717dang (stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 31nas 33bar gsal lo/}
kirti sku phreng lnga pa blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{mdo smad rdo stod khul du yab tshe ring 'bum dang yul skyid mo yag gi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu 'brug (1712)lor 'khrungs/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang dgung rnying lcags bya (1681)lo yin par bshad/dgung lo brgyad la phebs dus (lam rim nyung ngu mkhas pa dgyes pa'i mchod sprin )zhes pa ljags rtsom mdzad/gnyan rtse rin po che'i drung nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes shing mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/dgung lo nyer gsum pa shing stag 173lor dbus su byon/rgyal sras rin po che 'jigs med ye shes grags pa tA li'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i sku tshab tu bzhugs pa'i drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/paN chen rin po che sku phreng lnga pa blo bzang ye shes dang/rgyal mkhan chen grags pa rgyal mtshan/sa skya mkhan chen dpal ldan chos skyong/khri chen rgyal mtshan seng ge /'jam dbyangs bzhad pa 'jigs med dbang po/lcang skya rol po'i rdo rje bcas bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos bka' yongs su rdzogs pa gsan/dgung lo so bdun pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa 'brug (1748)lor tha la ri khrod du kirti dgos pa'i rmang gzhi bting ste ming la rnam rgyal bde chen gling zhes btags/snga phyir rong po khul dang/co ne/mdzod dge /rgyal rong/rnga ba/sog yul sogs su byon nas bstan 'gro'i don rgya cher mdzad/dgung lo drug cu bzhes pa rang byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags yos (1771)lor sku gshegs/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang sku gshegs pa'i lo shing phag (1755)lo yin par bshad/sku gdung dmar gdung du bzhugs so gsol ba deng sang yang ma nyams par bzhugs pa stag tshang lha mo dgon du 'jal rgyud 'dug /gsung rtsom mi nyung ba zhig yod tshod 'dug kyang pod grangs dang le tshan ji yod dpyad gzhi gsal ba zhig ma rnyed/lo rgyus rnam thar khong nyid kyi dngos slob hor sprul sku 'jam dbyangs mkhas grub pas mdzad pa dang gsang ba'i rnam thar gsang tshig mu to rgya mtsho don ldan gyis mdzad pa yod/lo rgyus gnad bsdus (mdo smad chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 717nas 719bar dang (stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 33nas shog grangs 38bar gsal lo/}
kirti sku phreng drug pa dge 'dun chos kyi dbang phyug|{mdo sme reb gong gi chu ma zhes pa'i sa char klu rgyal gyi khyim tshang du yab ngag dbang rab brtan dang yum snying mo thang gi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu 'brug (1773)lor 'khrungs/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang 'di'i dgung rnying 175lo ste rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me glang lo yin par bshad nor ba ste/me glang de nas rtsis pa'i lo nyer pa lcags glang (1781)lo yin pas de lor rje 'di dgongs pa chu stag lo nas rtsis pa'i lo bcu pa lcags phag (1791)lor 'jam bzhad bar pa 'jigs med dbang po dgongs pa rdzogs pa yin pas de'i dgongs rdzogs kyi mchod 'bul pas so/_/dgung lo lnga la phebs pa me sprel lor ngos 'dzin dang brtag dpyad bzang po byung bar brten kirti sku phreng lnga pa'i yang sprul du thag bcad de gdan sar bkod/mdzod dge ri khrod dbang so mkhas grub bstan 'dzin dang ang smon sprul sku dge rgan du bsten nas gsan bsam mdzad/'jam bzhad bar pa 'jigs med dbang po dgongs pa rdzogs pa'i mchod 'bul gyi tshogs dgu'i gras su phebs/dgung lo nyer lnga pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me 'brug (1796)lor sku mya ngan las 'das/gsung rtsom 'ga' zhig yod tshod 'dug kyang dpyad gzhi ma rnyed/rnam thar lo rgyus skor (mdo smad chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs (719dang/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )shog grangs 38nas 39bar gsal}
kirti sku phreng bdun pa kun dga' chos 'phags thub bstan nyi ma|{mdo sngags kirti dgon gyi nye 'dabs su yab mdzod dge bzod pa dang yum bkra shis skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me sbrul (1797)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun la phebs skabs g.yer gshong dge 'dun bla ba grags pa'i drung nas rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo brgyad la rang dgon gyi gdan sar bkod de gzhung chen mor sbyangs pa mdzad/'jam bzhad 'jigs med rgya mtsho'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/dgu lo bcu gnyis pa sa 'brug (1808)lor dbus gtsang du phebs nas rgyal ba yab sras dang mjal/paN chen rin po che sku phreng bdun pa bstan pa'i nyi ma'i drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/bka' 'gyur ba dkon mchog dpal 'dzin/khri chen byang chub chos 'phel/khri zung ngag dbang snyan grags/tsha rdor khri chen 'jam dpal tshul khroms kyi drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos bka' rgya cher gsan/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gnyis pa sa stag (1818)lor 'bras spungs blo gsal gling gi yig cha gtso bor bzung ba'i mtshan nyid grwa tshang gsar 'dzugs gnang/mdo sngags kyi chos 'chad nyan rgya cher gnang ba'i phyag rjes su brtsams chos po ti gcig nas bcu'i bar yod pa'i slob ma nyi shu lhag tsam thon/dgung lo nga gsum zhes pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa sprel (1848)lor sku gshegs/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang sku gshegs pa'i lo chu sprul yin zhes gsal ba ltar na 1833lo yin pa dang/yang 1855lo yin par bshad pa ltar rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing yos yin dgos pa bcas tshig lnga phyi mi mthun pa'i skyon byung 'dug /sku gdung ril por bzhugs yod pa dang/gsum rtsom gyi skor mi nyung ba zhig yod tshod 'dug kyang dpyad gzhi gsal po zhig ma rnyed/rnam thar lo rgyus (mdo smad chos 'byung )kan su'u mi rigs dpe bskrun khang gis lcags kar ma shog grangs 719dang (stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )shog grangs 39nas 43bar bcas la gsal lo/}
kirti sku phreng brgyad pa blo bzang 'phrin las bstan pa rgya mtsho|{rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags khyi (1850)lor yab jo mo thar dang yum bde chen gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/deng skabs gsar thon (stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )nang 'khrungs lo rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags 'brug yin par bshad/dgung lo bzhi la phebs skabs 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa skal bzang thub bstan dbang phyug rin po che nas bkra shis 'khyil gyi btsan khang du gser khri rnam gnyis sogs gdan sa'i bla sprul grwa dmangs tshang ma 'dzoms sar kirti sku phreng bdun pa'i yang srid yin par ngos 'dzin thag gcod dang mtshan gsol gnang ste kirti dgon pa'i gdan khrir mnga' gsol/dge ba'i bshes gnyen dkon ma chog smon lam dang thub bstan mtha' yas sogs bla ma mang du bsten nas gzhung chen po lnga dang/rig gnas skor/gsang sngags kyi dbang lung khrid gsum sogs gsan bsam slob gnyer mthar phyin pa mdzad/dgos pa rang du rgyun bzhugs gnang yul gtso bor mdzad thog /mdzo dge /rnga ba stod smad/sku 'bum/bkra shis 'khyil sogs dgon sde mang por phebs nas mdo sngags kyi 'chad nyan dang/rten gsum gsar bzhengs/sgrig khrims nyams gso sogs gang la gang 'os pa'i mdzad bzang yun ring por bskyangs pas bstan 'gro'i don chen skyong thub pa'i slob ma grangs las 'das pa byung/dgung lo nga drug pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing sbrul (1905)lor dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/(deng dus gsar rtsom (stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )nang sku gshegs lo lcags byi yin par bshad/sku'i dmar gdung de sngon kirti dgon gyi gdung rten lha khang nang gi dngul gdung nang bzhugs yod cing/gsung rtsom pod grangs bcu gnyis kyi dpar shing yang dgon par bzhugs yod tshul gsal ) rnam thar lo rgyus skor gsung 'bung nang dang mdor bsdus tsam (mdo smad chos 'byung )kan su'u mi rigs dpe skrun khang gi lcags dkar ma'i shog grangs 720par gsal}
kirti sku phreng dgu pa bskal bzang blo gros kun dga' lung rtogs rgya mtsho|{stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi nye 'debs yab sbyin pa dang yum mkha' 'gro 'tshog nyis kyi sras su rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing sbrul (1905)lor 'khrungs/(deng skabs gso rtsom (stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )zhes pa'i nang 'khrungs lo chu stag yin par bshad/) dgung lo chung dus nas stag tshang lha mo'i dngos pa rang du gzhung chen mo lnga la gsan bsam slob gnyer phul du phyin pa gnang ste grwa slob kun gyis sku phreng gong ma rnams dang 'dra bar bstan 'dzin gyi skyes chen mtshan don mthun pa zhig yong rgyu'i re ba shin tu che ba'i mur dgung po bcu drug la phebs pa lcags sprel (1920)lor glo bur du sku gshegs}
kirti dgon|{zi khrod zhing chen rnga ba rang skyong khul mdzod dge rdzong khongs kyi dgon pa che gras shig yin zhing/kan su'u zhing chen khongs kyi stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon pa'i mdun ngos kyi ri ldebs su chags yod pa dang/rgyal khab phyi nang du skad grags chen po yod pa zhig yin/dgon pa 'di ni kirti sku phreng lnga pa bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyis dgung lo so bdun pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa 'brug (1748)lor thog mar dgon pa'i rmang gzhi bting ste ming la rnam rgyal bde chen gling zhes btags/de las lo bcu pa me glang (1757)lor rgyud stod grwa tshang gi phyag bzhes ltar gyi rgyud pa grwa tshang btsugs/de nas lo re gcig song ba'i rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa stag (1818)lor kirti sku phreng bdun pa kun dga' chos 'phags rin po ches 'bras spungs blo gsal gling gi yig cha gtso bo bzung ba'i mtshan nyid grwa tshang 'dzugs gnang mdzad pa skabs der grwa grangs lnga brgya yas mang yod/kirti sku phreng brgyad pa blo bzang 'phrin las kyis rab byung bco lnga pa'i me yos (1867)lor dus 'khor grwa tshang 'dzugs gnang mdzad cing/khong gi sku dus su dgon pa 'dir grwa grangs chig stong nyis brgya lhag tsam yod/kirti sku phreng dgu pa skal bzang blo gros zhal bzhugs skabs grwa grangs chig stong bzhi brgya tsam du slebs par brten tshogs chen 'du khang ka ba ring thung bsdoms pa'i bzhi bcu tham pa'i rgya khyon can gsar du bzhengs/dgon pa 'di nas gsung rtsom yod pa'i bla sprul dge bshes drung yig sogs khyon mkhas dbang bzhi bcu zhe brgyad byon pa'i mtshan tho dang pod grangs bcas (stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )dang yig tshang nang gsal yod de 'phros rnams bris ma yin/de dag kyang rig gsar dus zing skabs rtsa med song 'dug /dgon pa 'di'i lha dgon lha khang khag gi rgya khyon dang/nang gi sku gsum thugs rten dgon lag mchod gzhir thob khungs/lo re'i chos 'chad nyan slob sbyong gi skor sogs rags bsdus 'khod pa'i lo rgyus ni/mdzod dge'i mkhas dbang nyi ma lags kyis brtsams pa'i (stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus mdo tsam brjod pa )zhes pa'i kha byang can gyi deb chung shog grangs 101yod pa der gsal}
kirti rin po che|{rje tsong kha pa chen po'i dngos slob bstan po phyogs mthar spel ba'i dar chen bdun gyi nang tshan rong po ljags nag pa dge 'dun rgyal mtshan la sku phreng rim par byung zhing/sku phreng lnga pa blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi skabs tha la ngag dbang dpal bzang gis ri khrod phul ba des rmang gzhi byas te/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa 'brug (1748)lor kirti dgon rnam rgyal bde chen gling ga btab pa nas rgyun bzhugs gnang bas sku phreng rim gyon la kirti rin po che zhes zhu srol byung/sku phreng dang po rong po ljags nag pa dge 'dun rgyal mtshan (rang byung drug pa'i shing stag 1374lo nas rab byung brgyad pa'i lcags rta 1450lo'i bar )dgung lo bdun cu don bdun bzhugs/sku phreng gnyis pa kirti bstan pa rin chen sku phreng gong ma gshegs nas lo nyer lnga pa (rab byung brgyad pa'i shing 1474lo nas rab byung dgu pa'i sa rta 1558lo bar )dgung lo brgyad cu rgya lnga bzhugs zhes zer zhing/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang 'di'i dgung rnying chu sprel yin par bshad/sku phreng gsum pa kirti bstan pa rab rgyas sku phreng gong ma gshegs nas lo ngo bdun song ba (rab byung dgu pa'i shing byi 1564lo nas rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu lugs 1643lo'i bar )dgung lo brgyad bcu bzhugs/sku phreng bzhi pa kirti blo bzang 'jam dbyangs (rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me sprel 1656lo nas rab byung bcu gnyis pa sa byi 1708lo'i bar )dgung lo nga gsum bzhugs (mdo smad chos 'byung )las gsal zhing/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang dgung rnying me sbrul yin pa dang dgung lo re gcig pa me sbrul la gshegs zhes gsal/sku phreng rnga pa kirti blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan (rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu 'brug 1712lo nas rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags yo 1717lo'i bar )dgung lo drug cu bzhugs par bshad/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang 'di'i dgung rnying lcags bya yin pa dang gshegs lo shing phag yin par bshad/sku phreng drug pa kirti dge 'dun chos kyi dbang phyug (rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu 'brug 1772lo nas me 'brug 1796lo'i bar )dgung lo nyer lnga las ma bzhugs/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang dgung rnying me gling yin par bshad/sku phreng bdun pa kirti kun dga' chos 'phags thub bstan nyi ma (rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me sbrul 1797lo nas rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa bya 1849lo'i bar )dgung lo nga gsum bzhugs par bshad/) (stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang dgung rnying chu bya yin pa dang gshegs lo chu sbrul yin par bshad/sku phreng brgyad pa kirti blo bzang 'phrin las bstan pa rgya mtsho (rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags kyu 1850lo nas rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing sbrul 1905lo'i bar )dgung lo nga drug bzhugs par bshad/) (stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang dgung rnying shing 'brug yin pa dang gshegs lo lcags byi yin par bshad/sku phreng dgu pa skal bzang blo gros kun dga' lung rtogs rgya mtsho (rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing sbrul 1905lo nas rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa lugs 1919lo'i bar (dgung lo bcu ga las ma bzhugs/(stag tshang lha mo kirti dgon gyi lo rgyus )gsar rtsom nang 'di'i dgung rnying chu stag dang gshegs lo me sbrul yin par bshad/sku phreng bcu pa ngag dbang blo bzang bstan pa tshe ring (rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa lug 1919lo nas rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa yos 1939 lo'i bar )dgung lo nyer gcig las ma bzhugs/sku phreng bcu gcig pa blo bzang bstan 'dzin 'jigs med ye shes rgya mtsho rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu rta 1942lor 'khrungs pa dang/da lta phyi rgyal du bzhugs mus yin pa bcas sku phreng dang po nas brgyad pa'i bar gyi lo rgyus gnad bsdus shig (mdo smin chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 714nas 720bar gsal zhing/sku phreng brgyad pa dang dgu pa'i rnam thar zur du yod}
