kim shing kong jo|{{(WP:1,194)}thang rgyal rabs kyi skabs bod kyi btsan po'i btsun mor blangs pa'i rgya bza' lnga rjes gnyis byung ba'i nang gi rjes ma ste cin khrin kong jo zhu ba de yin cing/mtshan de rgya skad nas bod skad du bsgyur dus skabs de'i rgya skad gyi sgra la cin la kim dang king/khren la shing dang/shin/zhin/zhing bcas 'bod srol yod pa ltar bris pa yin/yongs grags bon kyi lo rgyus mang che ba'i nang bshad srol du/rgya bza' cin khrin kong jo ni gong ma'i sras mo ngo ma yin pa dang/rgya bza' cin khrin kong jo ni gong ma'i sras mo ngo ma yin pa dang/thog mar rgyal po khri lde gtsug brtan gyi sras 'jang tsha lha dbon gyi bar mar blangs pa yin kyang kong jo bod du ma 'byor gong du sras 'jang tsha lha dbon rtas g.yugs te grongs par brten/yab khri lde gtsug brtan gyi btsun mor bzhes shing/de la sras khri srong lde btsun 'khrungs pa dang de btsun mo che ba sna nam bzas 'phrog par brten rgya bza' khros nas lha sa dang bsam yal khul gyi sa dpyad bzang po mang po gtor bshig byas/sras khri srong lde btsan zhabs 'dzugs kyi dga' ston skabs rgyal blon sum kyang ma yum su yin brtag dpyad bya ba'i ched du sras la a ma su yin ngos 'dzin byed du bcug dus sras kyis rang nyid rgya tsha yes zhes gsungs nas rgya bza'i pang du phebs pa sogs kyi gtam rgyud snyan la bden bden 'dra ba mang po zhig ngag rgyud du chags yod pa de skor deng rabs rgyal khab phyi nang gi mkhas pa mi nyung ba zhig gis tun hong nas thon pa'i yig rnying dang rgya yig gi (thang hru'u )gsar rnying bcas phan tshul zhib bsdur gyis brtag dpyad gnang ba'i dpyad gtam sna tshogs spel gnang mdzad 'dug pa'i nang don rags bsdus tsam ni 'di ltar yin te/rgya bza' cin khrin kong jo ni gong ma thang krung tsung gi yang tsha yin pa las sras mo ngo ma min pa dang/rgya bza' cin khrin kong jo bod du phebs skabs rgyal po khri lde gtsug brtan lo bdun las ma lon pa'i rgyal sras shig yin pa dang/sras 'jang tsha lha dbon dang/cin khrin kong jo gnyis ka lo gcig gi nang snga rjes su 'das par tun hong yig rnying nang gsal por 'khod yod pas/cin khrin kong jo btsun mor bzhes mkhan gyi rgyal po ni 'dus srong mang po rje yin pa las 'jang tsha lha dpon dang/khri lde gtsug brtan gnyis ka min pa dang/rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi ma yum ni sna nam bza' yin pa las rgya bza' cin kha kong jo min pa bcas ra sprod gnang yod/yin yang mkhas pa 'ga' zhig gis rgya bza' cing khrin kong jo btsun mor blangs pa'i rgyal sras ni rgyal po khri lde gtsug brtan yin pa las/'jang tsha lha dbon min zhes pa sogs bshad tshul mi 'dra ba yod pa'i skor zhib par (bod ljongs zhib 'jug )1989lo'i dus deb ang 4pa'i nang dang/(bod kyi lo rgyus rags rim g.yu yi phreng ba )shog grangs 258nas 29b.ragasal ba ltar/thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ma krung tsung {(WP:1,194)}gi cin lung khri lo bzhi pa lcags khyi (710)lor bod kyi btsan po khri lde gtsug brten gyi btsun mor sbyin/bod nas zhang to re lhas sbyin dar khri phrag mong dang/rtsed mo mkhan/rol mo ba/bzo rigs lag rtsa mi sna/sman dpyad sogs kyi dpe deb mang po bcas bsgyur/tso wes dmag dpon chen mo {(WP:1,194)}dbyang chu la gong ma'i bka' yig bskur te srung skyel la mngags/gong ma rang nyid kyang hri h+phin {(WP:1,194)}bar du skyel mar phebs te rgya bod sbyin mgron rnams la gsol ston rgyas par bshams/rdzong de'i btson pa rnams glod bkrol btang/srog thog gi nyes chad bcad pa tshang ma gu yangs gnang/lo gcig ring rdzong de'i mi ser tshang mar khral med pa byas/de'i dran rten mtshon byed du rdzong de la cin khrin rdzong zhes ming bsgyur/kong jo bod du phebs rjes bod na rig gnas lag rtsal 'phel rgyas gtong ba dang/rgya bon sa mtshams kyi dmag 'khrug zhod 'jags btang ba sogs mdzad rjes chen po bzhag yod/bod rnams kyis srung skyel dmag dpon dbyang ju brgyud nas gong bar zhus pa ltar/hi zhi gyig chu'i {(WP:1,194)}sa cha rnams kong jo'i sa skal du sbyin/kong jo bod du phebs nas lo sum cu so gcig song rjes gong ma thang zhon tsung {(WP:1,194)}gi kha'i yon {(WP:1,194)}khri lo nyer bdun pa sa yos (739)lor 'das shing/lo der rgyal po khri lde gtsug brtan gyi sras 'jam tsha lha dbon yang 'das pa sogs zhib par (thang deb gsar rnying )dang (deb ther dmar po ) (tun hong gi yig rnying )bcas la gzigs par zhu}
kim hwa shang|{ki ya hA shang ngam nyi ma hA shang zhes mi 'dra ba kha shas 'dug kyang/kim hwa shang {(WP:1,194)}zhes 'khod pa 'di rang yi ge dag pa yin hA sang 'di la lo rgyus yod yig gi yig cha khag gang gi nang du mi gsal zhing/nye rabs lo shas gong nyi hong (ri pin )du bzhugs pa'i bod rig pa'i mkhas dbang ya ma khu chis sogs 'ga' zhig gis gsungs don du (rba bzhed )nang gsal ba'i kim hA shang ni nyi hong du nang chos thog mar dar spel mdzad mkhan ko ri ya'i rgyal sras gsum pa rab byung mdzad pa'i mtshan la kim hwa shang la mngon shes yod tshul gsal ba ltar/rgya yig gi (ban chen po'i rnam thar )nang du yang khod la mngon shes yod tshul 'khod yod pa dang/(rba bzhed )nang hA shang khong gis stag la ga sha 'gel nus tshulagasal ba ltar (ban chen po'i rnam thar )nang du yang khong gis mtshan mo nyal khri'i 'og tu stag gi kha spur 'chang nus tshul 'khod yod pas ra sprod thub tshul gsungs 'dug /de ltar byas na ko ri ya'i rgyal sras cin hA shang ni spyi lo'i dus rabs bdan pa'i 680nas 756bar gung lo bdu cu don bdun bzhugs pa dang/thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ma zhon tsung gi kha'i yon khri lo bcu drug pa sa 'brug (728)lor nyi hong nas krung go'i thang rgyal rabs kyi rgyal sa khran an du phebs nas nang chos dar spel mdzad skabs rgyal po khri lde gtsug brtan gyis blon po sang shi sogs thang gong ma'i drung du pho nyar mngags te khong rnams bod du log khar sang shis kim hA shang dang mjal te chos zhus pa dang/hA shang gis bod kyi dus babs gnas tshul mngon shes kyis gzigs te lung bstan gnang ba sogs (rba bzhed )du gsal ba ltar yin cing/btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyis srid dbang bzung rjes rba gsal snang dang sang shi sogs mi sum cu thang gong ma'i drung du rgya dpe'i nang chos skor 'tshol du btang skabs rba gsal snang gis chos zhu sa'i hA shang mngon shes can zhig yod yul (rba bzhed )du gsal ba de ni hA shang mngon shes can gzhan zhig yin tshod las kim hA shang ni min nam snyam pa zhig 'dug pas mkhas dbang rnams kyis zhib dpyad mdzad par zhu}
ku ku rA dzA|{rgya gar gyi grub chen zhig gi mtshan yin cing/bod skad du bsgyur na khyi'i rgyal po zhes zer/khong gi rnam thar du ye shes kyi mkha' 'gro ma khyir sprul pa zhig las rgyar bsten nas bzhugs pas mtshan la ku ku ri pa'am ku ku rA dza yang zer ba mar pa lo tsA bas ma hA ma ya'i rgyud dang gdams ngag gsan pa'i bla ma de yin}
ku co sgrog pa|{thag ring nas phan tshun skad chen po skad cha shod res byas pa}
ku cor rtogs ldan sangs rgyas dpal bzang|{rje tsong kha pa chen po'i dngos slob rtogs ldan lnga zhes grags pa'i nang tshan zhig yin/nyan long kong gsum du grags pa'i nyang po ku cor gyi grong tshor rab byung drug pa'i me stag (1386)lo nas rab byung bdun pa'i shang glang (1445)lo bar dgung lo drug cu bzhugs/dgung lo chung dus nas sngon gyi skye bo mang po thugs la dran pa dang/byin pa phal pa'i kun spyod las 'das pa zhig byung/rje tsong kha pa chen po dang mtsho kha chos rje/karma pa de bzhin gshegs pa/mi nyag rtogs ldan grags pa rin chen sogs bla ma lnga bcu lhag tsam la bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mtha' yas pa gsan cing/chos ldan gyi dgos pa khyed par can ma gtogs pa rgyun du gnas nges med kyis sgrub pa nyams bzhes gtso bor mdzad/thugs rgyud la rtogs pa'i yon tan khyad par can 'khrungs te grub pa brnyes pa'i rtags mtshan dngos su bstan pa'i ngo sprod mang po mig lam du mthong rgyu snang/sku rten du rgyal ba byams pa'i stong sku dang spyan ras gzigs kyi sku mang po/gsung rten du bka' 'gyur cha tshang/thugs rje du lha sa grong khyer dbus ri'i gnas bskor yongs rdzogs 'khor ba'i mchod rten brgya dang brgyad bcas bzhengs par mdzad/karma pa de bzhin gshegs pas lung bstan mdzad pa lta/spo bo yi gong nas yin pa'i bo mo sangs rgyas 'tsho mo zhes pa rig mar bzhes te sras lcam sring bzhi 'khrungs pa'i che ba dkon ma chog 'byung gnas/'bring ba mkhas grub 'jam dbyangs gzhon nu/chung ba 'phags pa lha sku phreng dang po bcas bstan 'gro'i don rgya cher mdzad pa'i skyes chen khyad du 'phags pa gsum byung/dgung la drug cu pa shing glang (1445)lor sku gshegs rjes sku gdung ril por gser 'bum zhig bzhengs pa rjes su dga' ldan sprul sku dgongs pa rdzogs pa'i rten du thub dbang gi sku bzhengs skabs ku cor ba'i dbu thod de thub sku'i gzungs su phul nas kong po de mo dgon gyi mchod khang gsar par bzhugs su gsol ba yin/gsung rtsom skor/(bka' brgyud gser phreng skyes rabs brgya rtsa/) mdo rgyud dgongs gsal/) (mdo sngags gsal sgron/) (thugs rje chen po bcu gcig zhal gyi zab khrid 'gro ba kun 'dren/) de'i chos 'byung (gtam rgyud bdud rtsi'i rgyun bzang mi rtar khrid drug/) (mgur 'bum )sogs pod dgu tsam yod tshul rnam thar du gsal/rnam thar lo rgyus cung zad tsam phan bde sprul sku shAkya lha dbang gis mdzad pa'i (zhal lnga bka' brgyud kyi thun mong ma yin pa'i chos 'byung )bris ma'i shog grangs 4nas 7bar gsal}
ku na la|{rgyal po mya ngan med kyi sras yin/bod yin gi lo rgyus mang che bar rgya gar gyi lo rgyus thog rgyal po mya ngan med snga rjes gnyis byung ba'i bshad srol mi snang yang/rgyus mang por zhig 'jug mdzad nas gsung don du/btsun mos dbyen sbyor phra ma bcug nas yab rgyal po mya ngan med kyi bka' yig brdzus pa zhig bzos te mig 'don du bcug pa'i sras ku na la zer ba de mya ngan med rjes ma de'i sras yin tshul gsungs yod pa ltar khungs dag gam snyam/bstan 'gyur gyi 'dul ba'i sde tshan nang (ku na la mig gi rtogs pa brjod pa )zhes pa zhig yod pa sde dge bstan 'gyur pod (su)pa'i nang bzhugs shing/jo nang tA ra nA thas mdzad pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )gi skabs brgyad pa rgyal po mya ngan bral gyi dus kyi gtam las/ku na la'i lo rgyus gnad bsdus shig gsungs yod}
ku na la mig gi rtogs brjod|{'di sde dge bstan 'gyur 'dul ba'i gras pod (su)par (ku na la'i rtogs pa brjod pa )de lo chen rin chen bzang pos bod skad du bsgyur gnam mdzad pa zhig yin cing/de dang 'dra ba (skyes rabs dpag bsam 'khri shing )yab 'dab nga dgu pa (ku na la'i rtogs brjod )ces pa zhig kyang yod pa nang don gcig mtshungs yin}
ku mA ra shri|{krung go'i lo rgyus thog nang pa'i chos lugs kyi lo tsA ba chen po bzhi yi gras/li yul du yab rgya gar ba ku mA ra yan dang yul li yul byang rgyud (deng sang shin cang khu khre khul )kyi rgyal po'i sras mo zhig gi sras su spyi lo'i dus rabs bzhi pa'i shing 'brug (344)lor 'khrungs/yab yum gnyis kyi mtshan bsdoms te ku mA ra shri ste bod skad du gzhon nu dpal zhes gsol/sku na chung dus rab tu byung zhing/kha che'i yul du phebs nas thog mar theg dman gyi chos la sbyangs shing/rjes su theg pa chen po'i chos la zhugs nas dbu ma'i lta ba 'dzin pa'i paN+Di ta chen por gyur/rgya gar nub phyogs kyi rgyab khab 'ga' zhig tu phebs nang nas chos 'chad spel mang po mdzad cing/chin sngon ma'i rgyal rabs kyi rgyal h+phu ci'an gyi cen yon {(WP:1,194)}khri lo bco brgyad pa (382)lor leng krU {(WP:1,194)} ru gdan drangs pa ltar der lo ngo bcu drug tsam bzhugs par brten rgya bod gnyis ka'i skad yig kyang byang chub par mkhyen chin rjes ma'i rgyal rabs kyi rgyal po ya'o shin {(WP:1,194)}gyi hung hri {(WP:1,194)}lo gsum pa lcags glang (401)lor rgyal sa shis an du rgyal khab kyi slob dpon dang 'dra ba'i gus bkur zhus de dus dgong lo nga bdun du phebs der lo bcu gsum gyi ring la (rdo rje gcod pa )la sogs pa'i sher phyin gyi mdo che chung sna tshogs dang (dam pa'i chos pad+ma dkar po/) (dri med grags pas bstan pa'i mdo )sogs mdo mang po dang mgon po klu sgrub kyi (dbu ma rtsa ba shes rab/) (dbu ma sgo bcu gnyis pa/) slob dpon 'phags pa lhas mdzad pa'i (dbu ma bzhi brgya pa/) mgon po klu sgrub kyis mdzad par grags pa'i (sher phyin chen mo bam po brgya pa )bcas bka' bstan bam po sum brgya dang gya bzhi rgya skad du bsgyur zhing slob ma yang mang po bskyangs mthar dgung lo bdun cu pa chu byi (412)lor dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das lo rgyus 'di bzhin mkhas pa'i dbang po ren ci yus yis gtso skyong gnang nas rtsom sgrib mdzad pa'i )chos lugs tshig mdzod )nas bod skad du bsgyur te drangs lo rgyus 'chad tshul 'di dang mi 'dra ba zhig (deb ther dmar po )lcags dpar ma'i grangs 13nas 16bar gsal bas der gzags par zhu rgyu lags so/}
ku rtsi phra mo|{sa 'og 'bu phra mo zhes pa'i don}
ka ru ri|{'di bod skad du bsgyur na sgra sgrogs zhes pa ste/bya ku ra ri zhes pa zhig yod pa de yin pa mngon brjod kyi gzhung mang por bshad}
ku rings sde lnga|{ku rings zer ba'i rus brgyud tsho pa lnga ste tsho pa lnga yi grangs 'dren skor dpyad gzhi da phan ma rnyed lags so/}
ku ru|{rgya gar byang phyogs kyi yul zhig gi ming ste/bod skad du bsgyur na sgra ngan dang sgra mi snyan du yang 'bod ces mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (gtam rgyud gser gyi thang ma )shog grangs 161las gsal ba de yin}
ku ru ku l+le|{(dpal sgyu 'phrul dra ba'i rgyud stong rag bcu drug pa )dang/(kyai'i rdo rje'i rtsa rgyud rgyas pa brtag pa sum cu rtsa gnyis pa/) (nang gses brtag pa bcu gnyis pa/) (kye'i rdo rje'i rtsa rgyud bsdus pa brtag pa gnyis pa) (nang gser brtag pa dang po'i le'u bcu gcig pa )bcas nas gsungs pa'i dbang sdud kyi lha mo zhig ste/'di la sku'i rnam 'gyur mi 'dra ba dkar mo zhal gcig phyag drug ma dang/dmar po zhal gcig phyag bzhi pa/dmar po zhal gcig phyag brgyad ma/dmar po zhal gcig phyag bzhi pa ma gtso 'khor gsum pa/dmar mo gsang sgrub mkha' 'gro rigs bzhis bskor ba/dmar po lha mo 'khor lha mo bcu bzhis bskor ba'i lha bco lnga ma bcas yod/de rnams so so'i 'grel bshad mdor bsdus gsham du gsal}
ku ru ku l+le dkar mo zhal gcig phyag drug ma|{(sgyu 'phrul dra ba'i rgyud stong phrag bcu drug pa )las gsungs pa'i ku ru ku l+le dkar po ste/slob dpon nag po spyod pa'i lugs kyi ku ru ku le yang zer/'di'i sgrub thabs rgya gzhung (sde dge bstan 'gyur )sngags phyogs pod (mu)pa'i nang yod}
ku ru ku l+le pa|{sngar rgya gar du nyan thos sde pa'i grub mtha' smra ba nang gses sde pa bco brgyad du gyes pa'i gras mang pos bkur ba'i sde pa la nang gses tshan pa gsum du gyes pa las ku ru ku l+le'i sde pa'am sa sgrogs ri pa zhes 'bod pa de yin/de yang sde pa bco brgyad du gyes rjes rgyal po'i khab kyi lho phyogs ku ru ku l+le'i brag phug yod sa der gnas gzhi mdzad de bzhugs pas na sde pa der bzhugs nags kyi sgo nas ku ru ku l+le'i sde pa zhes 'bod pa yin}
ku ru ku l+le dmar mo zhal gcig phyag brgyad ma|{rgyal po in+d+ra bo d+hi'i lugs kyi ku ru ku le ste 'di'i sgrub thabs kyi rgya gung rgyal po in+d+ra bo d+his mdzad pa (sde dge bstan 'gyur )sngags phyogs pod (mu)pa'i nang yod}
ku ru ku l+le dmar mo zhal gcig phyag bzhi ma|{(kye'i rdo rje'i rtsa rgyud rgyas pa )brtags pa sum cu so gnyis pa'i bcu gnyis par rgyas par gsungs shing/de las bsdus pa'i tshul du/(kye'i rdo rje'i rtsa rgyud brtag gnyis )kyi brtag pa dang po'i le'u bcu gcig par gsungs pa'i ku ru ku l+le phyi sgrub phyag bzhi ma ste/'di'i sgrub thabs kyi rgya gzhung slob dpon brtse ba chen pos tshigs bcad du bsdebs pa (sde dge bstan 'gyur )sngags phyogs pod (mu)pa'i nang yod}
ku ru ku l+le dmar mo zhal gcig phyag bzhi ma gtso 'khor|{gtso bo ku ru ku l+le dmar po zhal gcig phyag bzhi ma la/'khor du lha mo ral gcig ma dang rje btsun sgrol ma yod pa zhig /'di'i sgrub thabs kyi rgya gzhung ni (sde dge bstan 'gyur )pod (mu)pa'i nang yod}
ku ru ku l+le lha bco lnga ma|{slob dpon a b+h+ya ka ras mdzad pa'i (dkyil chog rdo rje phreng ba )nas gsungs pa'i dkyil 'khor rigs mi 'dra ba bzhi bcu zhe gnyis yod pa'i nang tshan bcu gnyis pa/gtso bo lha mo ku ru ku l+le la 'khor lha mo bcu bzhi ste/rim pa dang po'i phyogs bzhi dang/rim pa gnyis pa'i phyogs mtshams brgyad steng 'og gnyis bcas la lho mo re yod pa/bdag med lha mo bco lnga'i 'khor dang 'dra bas bskor zhig yin/zhib par (dbang rdo rje dbang chog )lcang skya ngag dbang chos ldan gyi gsung 'bod pod (ga)pa'i nang du yod pa der gsal}
ku lu ta|{kasmi ra'i byang phyogs kyi mtha' mtshams mnga' ris kyi yul dang thag che bar yod pa dang/mnga' ris pa rnams kyis nyung rda'i yul zhes 'bod pa'i nang tshan zhig yin par bshad}
ku lu ta'i yul|{rgya gar gyi yul zhig gi ming ste/bod skad du bsgyur na rigs ldan zhes pa'i don yin par (skad gnyis shan sbyar )las bshad /bu ston rin po ches mdzad pa'i (bde mchog chos 'byung )las/kha che tsha lan+d+ha ra'i yul gyi byang ngos mnga' ris kyi yul dag thag nye bar mnga' ris pa rnams kyis nyung rda'i yul zhes 'bod pa'i nang tshan zhig yin par gsungs/thang san {(WP:1,194)}bla mas mdzad pa'i (rgya gar zhing gi bkod pa'i dkar chag ) rgya yig nas bod yig tu bsgyur pa shog grangs 46pa las/yul de'i mtha' bskor du le dbar sum stong tsam/mkhar chen po'i khor yug tu rgyang grags bcu bzhi bco lnga tsam/sa gshin pa 'a sna gsum sogs 'debs rung ba/nam dus bzhir me tog dang shing 'bras 'bol ba/sman gyi rigs rnam pa sna tshogs skye ba/gser dngul zangs mu tig dmar po sogs 'byung ba dang/mi'i gshis sha rtsub cing gyon ba/dpal rtse che ba dang stobs che ba la rtsi mthong che zhing/nang pa'i gtsug lag khang nyi shu tsam gyi nang khyon bsdoms dge 'dun chig stong lhag tsam gnas pa rnams gtso bor theg chen gyi chos dang zhar la theg dman chos la yang slob sbyong mdzad pa dang phyi rol pa'i lha khang bco lnga tsam la phyi rol pa lta ba mi 'dra ba sna tshogs gnas yod pa dang/yul gyi nang rgyal po mya ngan med kyis bzhengs pa'i mchod rten zhig kyang yod ces gsal}
ku sha na'i rgyal rabs|{mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (gtam rgyud gser thang )shog grangs 314par sha ka dang pra thi na rnams rgya gar du chags pa'i skabs slar yang rgya gar du yu'i tsi bya ba'i mtha' mi'i 'brog sde chen po gzhan zhig tu slebs/'di dag gi rtsa ba'i yul rgya nag nub byang gi phyogs su chags pa las rim gyis shAkya'i yul dang li yul gyi byang phyogs rnams bzung zhing/o rgyan dang dri za'i yul sogs su slebs te khang khyim can du gyur/nang gses/su rigs lnga yod pa las ku sha na'i mchog tu gyur pa de'i rigs las rgyal po ka dwa li sha bya ba sangs rgyas 'das lo drug brgya pa'i (spyi lo'i dus rabs dang po'i mjug tsam )phyed snga ma'i nang du rgyal srid thob ste kha che'i yul gyi phyed bar du dbang bsgyur/de'i bu ka dwa li sha gnyis pas srid dbang bzung skabs rgya gar wa ra NA li la thug gi bar dbang bsgyur/de'i 'og tu rgyal po ka ni Sh+kas srid dbang bzung zhes gsungs pa ltar na rgyal po ka ni Sh+ka ni ku sha na'i rgyal rabs yi rgyal po yin pa lta bur snang/yang phyi rgyal du bzhugs pa'i bod kyi mkhas pa 'ga' zhig gis rgyal ko ka ni Sh+kas ku sha na'i rgyal rabs gtor nas dbus e shi ya dang/ab g+ha ne si than dang/rgya gar nub byang dang/rgya gar byang phyogs bcas mnga' 'og tu bsdus pa'i rgyal khab shin tu stobs chen zhig btsugs zhes gsungs 'dug pa gong gsal gsum tshul mi 'dra ba gnyis gang zhig khungs btsan pa yin min kho bos kha tshon bcad ma nus pas zhib dpyad gnang bar zhu}
ku sha la gu thug rgyal po|{yon rgyal rabs kyi ngo hu pi li nas rtsis pa'i ri rabs brgyad pa yin cing/ming tsung ku sha la zer/he hran khu lug gi bu chung ba yin/gong ma tha'i ting ye sun the'i mur nad kyis grongs pa'i rjes su thug the'i mur gyis gong ma'i khri bzung nas zla ba brgyad phyin rjes zas dug byung nas 'das tshab tu ku sha la gu thug rgyal po gong ma'i khri la bkod/de sngon gong ma rin tsung a yur par pa tas srid dbang bzung mus kyi skabs gong ma'i rgyal brgyud tshogs 'du'i thog ku sha la gu thug brgyud 'dzin rgyal sras su gtan khel thag gcod byas rjes/gong ma rin tsung gis skyes nas yun ring ma song ba'i rin chen dpal brgyud 'dzin rgyal sras byed dgos pa dang/ku sha la kra'u wang gi go gnas bskos nas yun nan mtha' mtshams su sdod dgos pa'i thag gcod byas/gnas tshul der ku sha las brtsi 'jog ma byas par hran zhis zhing chen ling ho'o krung h+phu nye 'gram du slebs mtshams dmag dpung btang nas 'gog rgol byas te ling 'o krung h+phu rim pa'i srid dbang bzung bar brten/gong ma rin tsung gas dmag btang nas ku la phan nyes byung ste ar the ri rgyud du phros/gong ma tha'i ting ye sun the mur nad kyis grongs rjes kun sha li'i 'og ma thug the'i mur sa gong ma byas pa ma zad/khong rang gi chab srid dgra bo rin chen dpal la phar rgol byas te gtor pham btang/1329lo'i zla ba dang po'i nang thug the mur gyis gcen po ku sha la nyeng sa khul du gong ma byas par brtsi bkur thog rang nyid gong ma'i khri nas phyir 'then byas pa'i khyab bsgrags byas/lo de'i zla ba brgyad pa'i 'gor ku sha la mo pa zhes khul brgyud pe cin du yong skabs thug the'i mur gyi dga' bsu zhus te/gcen gcung thug phrad byung ba'i dga' ston du kha g.yar te nyin mang por gsol ston bshams/zla ba de'i tshes lnga nyin gyi mtshan mor rgyal sras kyi slob dpon yan the'i mur gyis ngan bslab byas pa ltar a rag dang zas rigs kyi nang dug rgyab ste ku sha ral drangs/de'i phyi nyin ku sha la kha nas khrag skyugs te grongs so/_/'di'i lo rgyus rnams (krung go rgyal rab sa kyi gong ma rim pa'i dkar chag )rgya yig gi shog grangs 850las gsal ba ltar bris}
ku sA li chung ba|{mtshan dngos rin chen sde dang/thugs dam gyi nyams rtogs pa brten nas mtshan gsol ba ni byams pa'i rnal 'byor zhes grags/sku chung dus nas rab tu byung ste btsun pa'i mchog tu gyur cing/rim gyis bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/sde snod gsum dang rgyud sde bzhi'i gzhung lugs mtha' dag la sbyangs nas mkhas pa 'gran zla med par gyur/rgyun du byams snying rje byang chub kyi sems la thugs dam nyams bzhes gtso bor mdzad de/bdag gzhan mnyam brje'i rtogs pa brtan po mnga' bas dngos su gtong len mdzad thub pa dang/byang chub kyi sems la blo sbyong ba'i man ngag la mnga' brnyes pa zhig yin pas/jo bo rje dpal ldan a ti shas dam pa 'di'i drung nas byang chub sems sbyong gi man ngag cha tshang bar gsan pa yin/lo rgyus zhib pa tshe chog gling yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (lam rim bla brgyud kyi rnam thar )pod dang po'i nang du gsal bas der gzigs}
ku sA li che ba|{mtshan dngos la rin chen bzang po zhes su grags pa slob dpon seng ge bsam po'i dngos slob yin/slob dpon de'i drung nas rgya chen spyod brgyud dang zab mo lta brgyud kyi man ngag cha tshang ba gsan zhing bla ma rig pa'i khu byug gi drung nas gsang 'dus dang/slob dpon sangs rgyas kyi ye shes kyi drung nas gsang 'dus 'jam dpal rdo rje/slob dpon sangs rgyas gsang ba dang/sangs rgyas zhi ba gnyis kyi drung nas rnal 'byor rgyud kyi skor/slob dpon blo gros brtan pa'i drung nas dbu ma'i lta ba dang/byang chub sems sbyong gi man ngag mang po gnas pa bcas mdo sngags yongs rdzogs kyi rnam thar lo rgyus mdor bsdus shig tshe chog nga yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (lam rim bla brgyud rnam thar )pod dang po'i nang du gsal}
ku sA li che chung gnyis|{slob dpon senge bzang po'i dngos slob ku lA li che ba rin chen bzang po dang/de'i slob ma kun lA li chung ba rin chen sde'am yongs grags su bla ma byas pa'i rnal 'byor pa zhes zhu ba/jo bo rje dpal ldan a hi sha'i rtsa ba'i bla ma'i gras su bzhugs pa de gnyis yin/de gnyis ka'i rnam thar mdor bsdus tsam (lam rim bla ma brgyud pa'i rnam thar )lcags dkar ma'i shog grangs 102nas 105bar gsal ba der gzigs}
ku su lu'i brtul zhugs|{'du shes gsum pa ste zas za ba/gnyid nyal ba/chab gsang 'gro ba gsum ma gtogs gzhan gang mi byed pa'i chos pa}
kung gsum|{kung gsum ni blon chen/the we/yus hri ta'e h+phu bcas yin/blon chen la g.yas blon dang g.yon blon gnyis yod pa des gong ma la ram 'degs byas nas las don cag gcod byed pa/the we ni/dmag don gyi spyi khyab dpon chen yin cing/des gong ma la ram 'degs byes nas dmag don thag gcod byed pa/yus hri te'u h+phu ni/blon chen gzhon pa yin cing des srid 'dzin dpon rigs kyi las don la zhib 'jug byed pa yin}
kung gsum chin dgu|{kung gsum ni/blon chen dang we le/yus hri te'i h+phu bcas yin/chin dgu ni/h+phun khrang dang/lang krung lin/we we/the h+phu/thin we/ten khe/tsung krin/hre'o h+phu/kri so'u ne hri bcas yin}
kun dkris brgyad|{1 rmugs pa/2 gnyid/3 rgod pa/4 'gyod pa/5 phrag dog/6 ser sna/7 ngo tsha med pa/8 khrel med pa bcas brgyad po de ni nye ba'i nyon mongs nyi shu'i nang nas 'byung nye zhing spang dkar ba yin pa'i dbang gis zur du kun dkris brgyad ces bzhag pa yin/de dag so so'i ngos 'dzin dang/byed las/dmigs pa sogs kyi khyad par bcas (mngon pa kun btus kyi 'grel pa )mang po yod pa de rnams la gzigs}
kun mkhyen|{1 'di yi go don shes bya ji p+lata ba dang ji snyed pa kun mkhyen par go bo blangs tshe sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das la go dgos/2 rig gnas che chung bsdoms pa'i bcu phrag la sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa zhig la kun mkhyen zhes go dgos pa'i skabs kyang yod}
kun mkhyen klong chen pa|{snga 'gyur bstan pa'i sgron me chen po 'gran zla bral ba zhig ste/mtshan gzhan dri med 'od zer dang tshul khrims blo gros te kun mkhyen tshul blo yang zhu/g.yo ru grwa'i cha stod grong du yab sngags 'chang bstan pa srung dang/yum 'brom bza' bsod nams rgyan gnyis kyi sras su rab byung lnga pa'i sa sprel (1308)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga la phebs tshe yi ge 'bri klog rnams brda sprod zhus pa tsam gyis dkar tshegs med par mkhyen/dgung lo bdun la yab sngags 'a chang gi drung nas bka' brgyad bde 'dus/rta mgrin/phur pa/gu ru zhi drug rnams dbang lung man ngag phyag bzhes/sman dang rtsi la sogs pa gsan nas thugs su chud par mdzad/dgung lo bcu gnyis pa la babs yas su mkhan po bsam 'grub rin chen dang slob dpon kun dga' 'od zer gnyis las rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes te mtshan tshul khrims blo gros zhes gsol/gzhan yang slob dpon btsan dgon pa dang gzhon nur rin chen gnyis kyi drung nas phar phyin dang tshad ma/slob dpon gzhon nu rgyal po las dbu ma/dpang lo chen po las mngon pa dang zab mo mdo lnga'i bshad pa bcas gsan nas grwa sa chen po'i sde phar che bar grwa p+sakor mdzad pas mkhas pa'i snyan grags kyis khyab/slob dpon gzhon nu don grub las mdo sgyu sems gsum gyi gdams pa/slob dpon bkra shis rin chen las lam 'bras skor dang/zhi byed/rdzogs chen gyi man ngag sogs gsan cing/gzhan yang karma pa rang byung rdo rje dang/sa skya'i bla ma bdag nyid chen po/bla na 'jam dbyangs pa sogs bcu phrag lhag tsam la bsten nas gangs ljongs su dar ba'i mdo sngags kyi chos brgyud yongs su gsan bzhes gnas/lhag par du rig 'dzin ku mA rA dza'i drung nas gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi gdams pa mtha' dag nyams khrid du gsan nas dben gnas mang por sgrub pa nyams bzhes mdzad pa las gas pa chen po rang snang rim med kyi nyams rtog mthar phyin te grub pa'i go 'phang mthon por gshegs/gangs ri thod dkar du bzhugs nas skal ldan gyi slob ma mang po la snying thig gi chos rgya cher gsungs shing/yang tig skor gsum/rang grol skor gsum/ngal gso skor gsum/mdzod mun gyi phal che ba sogs gnas 'di nyid du brtsams par mdzad cing/dgon gnas btab pa'i ming la o rgyan rdzong gnas zhes 'dogs par mdzad/de ltar bstan 'gro'i don rgya cher mdzad nas dgu ko lnga bcu nga drug bzhes pa rab byung drug pa'i chu yos (1363)lor bsam/mchims phur dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/sku gdung zhugs la phul phas thugs ljags spyan gsum mes ma tshig pa dang ril bsrel grangs med byon pa rnams nang rten 'dra sku rin po che dang phyi rten byang chub chen po'i mchod rten kyang gnas de nyid du bzhengs pa sogs rnam thar gyi zhib pa chag ri nyi grags mchog sprul sku phreng drug pa thun bstan 'od gsal bstan pa'i nyi mas mdzad pa'i (gsang chen snga 'gyur nges don zab mo'i byung ba gsal bar byed pa'i legs bshad )shog grangs 214nas 222bar gsal ba der gzigs/gzhan yang/khams pa chos grags bzang pos mdzad pa'i (kun mkhyen dri med 'od zer gyi rnam thar mthong ba don ldan )bris ma shog grangs 31yod pa zhig yang mjal/de'i nang du gsungs pa ltar na/kun man mchog gi gsung rtsom gras/phyi'i gnas thun mong gi skor bstan bcos dgu bcu go lnga/nang gi gnas rgya cher bshad pa'i bstan bcos brgya dang nyer brgyad/gsang ba'i gnas de kho na nyid ston pa'i bstan bcos sum cu sde khyon chos tshan nyis brgya lnga bcu nga gsum yod par gsungs/sde dge dpar khang chen mor bzhugs pa'i gras su (mdzod bdun/(ngal gso skor gsum/) (rang grol skor gsum/) (mun sel skor gsum/) (snying thig skor gsum/) (yang tig skor gsum )sogs bsdoms pod bdun bzhugs/rnam thar skor (chos rje rin po che dri med 'od zer gyi rnam thar mthong ba don ldan/) de nyid kyi dngos slob ldan sgom chos grags bzang pos mdzad pa bris ma la shog grangs 31yod pa dang mdor bsdus tsam (gu bkra chos 'byung )krung go'i bod rig pa dpe skrun khang gi dpar ma shog grangs 214224bar gsal ba der gzigs/kun mkhyen 'di'i mtshan gyi rnam grangs kyang/mdzod bdun sogs las/klong chen rab 'byams dang/klong gsal dri med/rdo rje gzi brjid/rdo rje sems dpa'/med 'od zer/blo gros mchog ldan/tshul khrims blo gros /ngag gi dbang po/pad+ma las grol/sna tshogs rang grol/bsam yas pa sogs dang gzhan yang kun mkhyen 'jigs med dbang po'i gsol 'debs las mdo khams pa 'jigs med 'phrin las 'od zer/rgyal ba'i myu gu/mkhyen brtse'i lha bcas gsal bas mtshan de rnams gsal ba'i gsung rtsom rnams kun mkhyen 'di'i gsung yin no/}
kun mkhyen chos sku 'od zer|{gsang ba 'dus pa dang dus 'khor la mkhas shing grub pa'i go 'phang mthong por gshegs pa'i bla ma zhig yin/rab byung bzhi pa'i shing khyi (1214)lor yab gser sdings pa gzhon nu 'od dang/yum 'gar btsun shes rab rgyan gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga lon pa nas byis pa gzhan dang mi 'dra bar spyod pa khyad du 'phags pa/bla ma yab kyis chos gsungs tshad chad lhag med par thugs la zin nas ngag skyor gnang thub pa zhig byung zhing/mkhas pa mang pos de bden rdzun brtag dpyad mdzad kyang don dngos dang mthun par gyur pas kun gyis mo mtshar che ba'i bsngags mdzod mdzad/'gro mgon 'phags pas chos sku 'od zer zhes mtshan 'dogs pa gnang/bla ma yab la bzhugs pa'i chos rgyun thams cad cha tshang bar gnas nas nyams bzhes mdzad pas thugs rgyud la nyams rtogs gzhung nas gsungs pa ltar 'khrungs pas thams cad yid ches shing/mdo sngags rig gnas dngabacas pa'i gzhung ji 'dra zhig yin kyang gzigs thengs re la thugs su chud thub pa'i mkhyen rab kyi rtsal 'gran zla bral ba zhig yod/'gro mgon 'phags pa/chag lo tsA ba chos rje dpal/rgyal pa lo ras pa/rga lo tsA ba/'jam dbyangs gsar ma sogs bla ma mang du bsten nas khong rnams la bzhugs pa'i chos rgyun mtha' dag gsan/mag dge sding gi dgon pa btab nas der bzhugs te mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsungs/dgung lo don dgu pa rab byung lnga pa'i chu 'brug (1292)lor sku gshegs /bod kyi chos 'byung lo rgyus tshor mi gsal yang sog po gu shri blo bzang tshe 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (hor gyi chos 'byung rgyal ba'i bstan pa rin po che gsal bar byed pa'i sgron me )zhes pa sog po'i shing dpar de las/sku tshe'i smad du sog po'i gong ma ol jol thus gdan drangs pa ltar sog yul du phebs nas gong ma de dang/de'i rjes kyi he'i hran gnyis kyis bka' 'gyur sogs skad du bsgyur dgos pa'i bka' phab pa ltar/thog mar 'gro mgon 'phags pas gsar gtong gnang ba'i sog yig 'khor ma grub zhi des chos skad sog skad du bsgyur ma thub par brten/sa skya paN chen gyis gsar gtod mdzad pa'i yi ge bzhi bcu zhe gnyis thog slar yang mjug ma can gyi yi ge bcu bzhi dang/yi ge pho mo lnga bcu nga drug /ma nang gi yi ge bcu bzhi dang wa we gnyis bcas pho mo'i dbye ba med pa'i yi ge bcu drug /rjes 'jug yi ge bcu gcig /yang 'jug drug /byed 'brel gyi phrad la sogs pa mang po bsnan nas bka' 'gyur sog skad du bsgyur thob par mdzad pa yin tshul rgyas par gsungs 'dug kyang/deng skabs 'tsho bzhugs gnang bzhin pa'i sog rigs mkhas dbang rnams kyis gong gsal gyi bshad tshul de zhal gyis mi bzhes pa ma zad/kun mkhyen chos sku 'od zer ni rab byung lnga pa'i chu 'brug (1229)lor sku gshegs zin cing/skabs der gong ma hu pe li se chen han srid skyong gnang mus yin pas dus mi 'grig pa'i skyon cha zhig snang bas mkhas dbang rnams kyis zhib dpyad mdzad par zhu/dam pa 'di'i gsung rtsom skor yum rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum bsdoms pa tsam yod tshul rje shes rab rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i (dpe rgyun dkon pa 'ga' zhig gi tho yig )nang gsal zhing/rnam thar zhib pa (bla ma chos sku 'od zer gyi rnam thar )zhes kha byang 'khod pa'i mdzad byang la lha rje chos dbyangs kyis bris pa'o zhes shog grangs 43yod pa zhig dang/yang (kun mkhyen chos sku 'od zer gyi rnam thar kun spangs zhang gis mdzad pa )zhes kha byang du 'khod pa zhig kyang yod tshul rgyal khab dpe mdzod chen mo'i dkar chag gi nang gsal 'dug }
kun mkhyen jo mo nang pa|{mtshan dngos shes rab rgyal mtshan/mtshan gzhan kun mkhyen dol po yang zhu/gangs can gyi ljongs su byung ba'i dbu ma gzhan stong gi lta ba'i bzhed srol thog mar gtod par mdzad pa yin/'khrungs yul mnga' ris dor po ban tshang ka lo ri'i grong khyer du yab ye shes dbang phyug dang/yum lha mo tshul khrims rgyan gnyis kyi sras su rab byung lnga pa'i chu 'brug (1229)lor sku 'khrungs/bla ma skyi steng pa sogs bsten nas gsang sngags snga 'gyur skor dang/dbu ma rigs tshogs/rig gnas chung ba'i rigs bcas gsan sbyong mdzad/dgung lo bcu gcig la phebs skabs mkhan po tshul khrims snying po sogs las dge tshul sdom pa bzhes pa'i mtshan la shes rab rgyal mtshan zhes gsol/dgung lo bcu drug nas lo shar bar skyi ston 'jam dbyangs grags pa las/tshad ma dang/phar phyin/mngon pa/sngags phyogs kyi phreng ba skor gsum sogs mang po gsan/slob dpon rin chen ye shes kyi drung nas byams chos sde lnga sogs phar phyin dang dbu ma'i skor gsan nas mkhyen rtsal phun sum tshogs par gyur te kun mkhyen zhes pa'i bsngags brjod kun kyis sgrogs par gyur/rab byung lnga 'i me stag (13260lor gdan sa pa'i khrir phebs te/mdo sngags dbang lung khrid bshad sogs gdul bya'i dad mos dang mthun par chos 'khor rgya cher bskor zhing seng dbar la ris med kyi bla ma mang po'i drung nas thos bka' gsan bzhes dang/nyams bzhes zung 'brel du bskyangs pas gzhan stong dbu ma chen po'i lta sgom thugs la 'khrungs te de'i skor (nges don rgya mtsho )la sogs pa'i grub mtha'i chos bcu drug /dus 'khor skor chos tshan bco brgyad sogs gsung rtsom mang du mdzad de rang nyid kyi bzhed srol nges don dbu ma'i lta sgom lung rigs gnyis kyi sgo nas gsal bshad mdzad/gdan sar lo bcu bdun bzhugs ring sku 'bum chen mo gsar bzhengs mdzad pa sogs sku gsung thugs kyi mdzad 'phrin bsam gyis mi khyab pas sku tshe mthar 'khyol bar mdzad/dgung lo bdun cur phebs pa rab byung drug pa'i lcags glang (1361)lor dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/rnam thar zhu lu lo tsA ba dang/'ga' rong pas mdzad pa zhig yod tshod 'dug kyang bdag gis ma mjal zhing/'dir bkod pa ni mdo smad 'dzam thang gi mkhas dbang dge ba'i bshes gnyen ngag dbang blo gros grags pas mdzad pa'i (jo nang cho sa 'byung zla ba'i sgron me )nas gnad bsdus byas pa lags pas zhib par der gzigs}
kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa|{bod kyi nang bstan chos lugs thog dbus gtsang khams gsum/mdo smad/rgya sog bcas kyi yul gru mang por mtshan snyan shin tu che zhing/mes rgyal gong bu gcig gyur thog mdzad rjes rlabs chen ldan pa'i dge lugs kyi bla chen zhig yin/da ltar bar sku phreng drug phebs pa'i sku phreng dang po kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bshad pa'i rdo rje ngag dbang brtson 'grus rab yung bcu gcig pa'i sa byi (1648)lo nas rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags glang (1791)lo bar dgung lo re bzhi bzhugs/sku phreng gsum pa kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhes pa 'jigs med rgya mtsho rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu byi (1855)lo bar dgung lo ri bzhi bzhugs/sku phreng bzhi pa kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhes pa skal bzang thub bstan dbang phyug rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me 'brug (1856)lo nar rab byung bco lnga pa'i mi 'brul (1916)lo bar dgung lo re gcig bzhugs/sku phreng lnga pa kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa blo bzang 'jam dbyangs ye shes bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan rab byung bco lnga pa'i me 'brug (1947)lo bar dgung lo so gnyis bzhugs/sku phreng drug pa da lta zhal bzhugs pa blo bzang 'jigs med thub bstan chos kyi nyi ma rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa byi (1948)lor 'khrungs/sku phreng so so'i rnam thar lo rgyus skor gsham du kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i rdo rje shes pa nas sku phreng lnga'i rnam thar bkod yod pa der gzigs}
kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng dang po ngag dbang brtson 'grus|{rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa byi (1648)lo'i hor zla dang po'i tshes brgyad nyin rgan gya'i rting ring lhas khra ting zer bar bod rus chen bzhi'i ya gyal ldong shul chen bco brgyad kyi nang tshan dbal shul gyi rgyud du yab dpa' 'bum rgyal dang yul thar mo byams gnyis kyi sras su sku bltams/dgung lo bcu gsum la 'dus 'dzin khyu mchog ye shes rgya mtsho'i spyan sngar rab byung dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyer par dbus gtsang du chibs bsgyur mdzad/lha sar phebs nas mchod mjal skabs jo bo shAkya mu ne dang 'jam dbyangs gyang thim ma gnyis kyis snyan dar phyag gis bzhes shing zhal 'dzum mdzad pa'i gzigs snang byung/dgu pa'i nyer lnga nyin dpal ldan bkra shis sgo mang gi chos grwar zhugs te de nas dgung lo nyer dgu bar lcang skya ngag dbang chos ldan dang snye thang pa shes rab sbyin pa sogs bsten te bka' pod lngas mtshon gzhung lugs rab 'byams la dpe gzigs dogs gcod zhu ba sogs kyis nyin mtshan 'da' bar mdzad/dgus lo nyer bdun thog kun gzigs lnga pa chen po'i spyan sngar bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyer dgu lor rgyud smad grwa tsang du zhugs te lo bzhi'i rang la chos grwa chag med ngos rgyud don ma lus pa thugs su chud/rgyud chen dkon mchog yar 'phel dang/khri rgya nag po blo gros rgya mtsho/me rgan bla ma ngag dbang blo glos/phreng ba pa phun tshogs legs 'byor/nyag ri mkhan chen chos kyi grags pa sogs mkhas grub gnyis 'dzoms kyi bla ma mang po bsten te bde gsang 'jigs gsum mi tra rdor phreng sogs spyi zur gyi dbang bka' mang po nga rin 'byung brgya rgyam sogs rjes gnang lam rim che chung bskyed rdzogs man ngag gsum sogs mdo sngags kyi bshad khrid bka' bstan sogs rgya bod kyi gzhung mang po'i bklag lung mtha' yas pa gsan te mdo sngags yongs rdzogs kyi bstan pa'i bdag por gyur/de ltar mdo sngags kyi gsan sbyangs mtha' yin pa na tshe 'di'i 'khri ba btsan chod du spangs te sgrub pa snying por byed pa kho na thugs la bcags te sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos mnga' ris mtho lding ngam dga' p+ladan gyi gser khri mdzad dgos tshul dang/sgo mang dang rgyud kyi mkhan po'i 'os babs phul ba rnams kyang zhal bzhes ma gnang bar dgung lo 33nas 53bar gnas ma chog ri bo dge 'phel du thugs dam nyams bzhes kyis skal ldan gyi 'dul bya mtha' yas par dbang lung man ngag bshad khrid sogs zab rgyas kyang gdams pa bsam gyis mi khyab pa bstsal/dgung lo nga gsum pa lcags 'brug (1700)lor sgo mang grwa tshang nas gzhung la nan cher zhus pa ltar rgyal ma chog nas bka' nan phebs pas sgo mang bla ma cing kyang mdzad dgos byung/de nas dgung lo drug cu'i bar sgo mang bla ma mdzad ring lugs lugs rgya mtsho'i dgongs don la nang byan chud pa'i dge bshes kyis sa steng khyab/dgung lo drug cu pa me phag (1707)lor zur bzhugs mdzad pa la lha bzang han gyis pha bong kha'i gdan su phul/skabs der e ni ju nang gis dgos gsar 'debs kyi ched du mdo smad du gdan drangs pa ltar sa mo glang (1702)lo'i hor zla drug pa'i nang chibs kyi kha lo bsgyur thog pad+mo bkod/dpon tshang nas gtsos dad ldan gyi skye bo sprin ltar 'dus pas zang zing gi 'bul ba char bab pa lta bu byung/lcags stag (1710)lo'i hor zla gsum pa'i tshes bco lngar snga dro gso sbyong mdzad de gung tshigs skabs dpon tshang nas grwa pa bco lnga phul ba dang bcas dge 'dun brgya phrag lhag la lam rim gyi dbu nas gsung chos mdor bsdus shig bstsal/bzhi pa'i tshes la rgyal dbang mchog nas sgo mang e rti ni no min han zhes pa'i mtshan dang dbu gzugs tham ga sogs chen po 'os pa'i bka' yis gzengs bstod mdzad pa 'byor/bdun pa phyi ma'i tshes la dpon tshang nas phying gur gru bzhi tshogs pa brgyad brgya shong ba zhig phul ba tshogs gur byas/de nas dgon lung du phebs nas rgyud grwa gsar 'dzugs mdzad de chos srid gnyis char gyi spyan bskyangs bla na med pa mdzad/lcags byi (1720)lo'i hor zla drug pa'i tshes nyer dgu la gong ma khang shis rgyal po nas rje 'di la bstan pa 'dzin cing skyong bar byed pa'i paN+Di ta e rti ni no min han zhes pa'i cho lo dang/gser tham/gser yig sogs kyi gzengs bstod gnang ba 'byor/dgung lo don bzhi pa lcags glang (1721)lo'i hor zla dang po'i tshes bzhi nas bsnyung tshul bstan pa na bla slob dpon 'bangs spyi sger nas zhabs brtan phon cher bsgrubs te brtan gsol yang yang phul kyang bla mas 'a chad nyan dang grwa tshang gis sgrig lam gang cir mi nyams gong 'phel yong ba gyis gsung ba tsam las gsung lan gzhan ma gnang bar hor zla gnyis pa'i tshes lnga'i nyin hig mthong po zhig mdzad de mya ngan las 'das pa'i tshul bstan nas bdun phrag gcig gi ring zag med kyi ting nge 'dzin la rol bar mdzad}
kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng gnyis pa dkon mchog 'jigs med dbang po|{rje dkon mchog 'jigs med dpang po ni mdo smad snang ra'i gser khang gi nye 'dabs gram pa nang zhes bya bar ldong gi rigs las stong 'khor bsod nams rgya mtsho'i gcung gcan rtsa'i dpon po ngag dbang rnam rgyal dang TI ki'i mtshan ldan gnam skyid zhes bya ba gnyis kyi sras su gnam bskor yun krin rgyal po khri lo drug pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa sprel (1728)lo'i hor zla gsum pa'i tshes brgyad nyin sku bltams/dgung lo bdun la stong 'khor rin po che nas mtshan la sgo bla zhes gsol/sku zhang dge slong blo gros rgya mtshos yi ge 'bri klog dang sum rtags sngags kyi bklag thabs sogs bslab pas dka' tshegs med par thugs su chud/dgung lo grangs bcu drug pa chu phag hor zla bdun pa'i tshes bcu gsum la bla brang dgon du chos bzhugs mdzad thog /'gying rol ngag dbang bstan 'dzin yongs 'dzin du bsten te smra ba'i dbang phyug rin chen chos bzang sogs dge bshes du ma dang lhan cig bka' pod lnga'i gsan sbyong phul du phyin par mdzad/dgung lo nyer gnyis par lcang skya rol pa'i rdo rje'i spyan sngar bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes par mtshan dkon mchog 'jigs med dbang po ye shes brtson 'grus grags pa'i sder gsol/dgung grangs nyer lnga pa la dbus gtsang du byon te 'bras sgo mang grwa tshang gi chos grwa bzhugs/klu 'bum blo bzang dar rgyas pa dge rgan du bsten cing/rgyal dbang blo bzang skal bzang rgya mtsho dang/paN chen blo bzang dpal ldan ye shes/dpon slob byams pa rin po che/sa skya bdag chen kun dga' blo gros sogs mkhas pa dang grub pa'i skyes chen dam pa du ma'i zhabs la gtugs te lo ngo brgyad kyi bar du phyi nang gi g.yeng ba che phrag mtha' dag spangs pa te tsha grang ltogs skong sogs la ci mi snyam par dka' spyad shugs drug gi sgo nas dbu par mdzod 'dul rnam 'grel bcas pa rang rang gi rtsa ba'i steng du 'phags bod kyi dpyad pa zhib mos brgal brtag dang dka' gdan la dogs gcod mang du mdzad de tshig don lhag ma med par thugs su chud/de ltar dbus 'gyur chos kyi zhing sar mdo sngags gang cir gsan sbyong sogs thugs bzhes mthar dag legs par grub nas mdo smad kyi bstan 'gro'i don du chibs bsgyur kyi grwa sgrig mdzad skabs bod gzhung nas dge ldan bstan pa'i gsal byed paN+Dita no min han gyi cho lo dang tham ka sogs kyi gzengs bstod dang phebs rdzong gra rgyas mdzad mthar dgung grangs sog nyis pa sa yos (1759)lo'i hor zla lnga pa'i tshes 23nyin mdo smad du chibs kyi kha lo bsgyur/dgung lo so drug pa la dgon lung byams pa gling dang so brgyad pa la sku 'bum gyi gdan sa mdzad de gnyis ka'i lugs gnyis kyi sgo nas gong 'phel du mdzad/zhe gnyis par shar phyogs gser gyi rgyal khab chen por phebs te dgong lo zhe lnga pa (1772)lo mdo smad du chibs bsgyur gnang/de ltar lo bcu gnyis ring mdo smad lho yang gi yul gru yod do cog la phebs te dge 'dun gyi sde dang mdo sngags kyi bshad sgrub dar khyab tu spel bar mdzad nas dgung lo nga brgyad pa la yang bskyar dbus gtsang du phebs te dam pa'i chos kyi rgyun nub pa dang nyag phrag ba rnams gsos/sngar ma gsan pa'i chos rgyun du ma ched du gsan rjes dgung grangs drug cu pa me log lor gdan sa bkra shis 'khyil du phyir phebs nas chos skor rgya cher bskor zhing dgung lo re gnyis par bya khyung gi khrir phebs/lnga phyir bka' rtsom yang pod bcu phrag longs pa mdzad pa dang slob ma yang mkhan chen dge 'dun rgya mtsho/klong rdol grub dbang/rta tshag rje drung/sa skya bdag ched ngag dbang kun dga' chos skyong/lo chen sprul sku/brag yab che tshang chung tshang/thu'u bkwan chos kyi nyi ma/gung thang khri chen bstan pa'i sgron med sogs bla sprul dge bshes dpon rigs sogs bu slob sa'i dreg pa ltar shin tu mang/de ltar sku tshe ril por mkhas pa'i bya ba mchad rtsod rtsom gsum dang btsun pa'i bya ba bslab gsum nyams bzhes sogs bshad sgrub zung 'brel gyi sgo nas bstan pa'i snying po phyogs mthar spel zhing/byams chen mthong ba don ldan rten dang brten par bcas pa gsar bzhengs dang 'du khang chen mo gsar skrun mdzad pa ma zad/phyag dpe gsar bsgrigs gcig pu yang pod khri phrag brgal bas mtshon phyag rjes shin tu rlabs che ba bstan 'gro'i sman yon zla med par mdzad bzhin pa'i ngang dgung grangs re bzhi pa lcags phag (1791)lo'i ho zla bcu pa'i tshes nyer brgyad nyin ka mdo gdong dmar sna ru gzugs sku'i bkod pa chos dbyings su bsdu bar mdzad do/}
kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng gsum pa blo bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho|{rje 'di nyid ni mdo smad lho rgyud reb skong gser mo ljongs su gnyan thog 'brog zhes bya ba'i yul du gnyan thog dpon tho'u pA tshong du grags pa'i dpon rabs kyi rigs su yab klu 'bum rin chen rgya mtsho dang yum sha sbrang mkhar mo skyid ces bya ba'i sras su chan lung khro lo nga bdun pa rab 'dod chu byi (1792)lo'i hor zla brgyad pa'i yar tshes su sku bltams/rgyal dbang yab sras zung dang/gong ma ca ching/thu'u bkwan chos kyi nyi ma sogs kyis thugs khur che bzhes mdzad de lha sar jo bo shAkya mu ni sogs rten gtso khag gi spyan sngar mtshan byang dkrugs par 'di nyid la 'khrul med nges rnyed byung ste sa rta (1798)lo'i hor zla dang po'i tshes bcu'i nyin bla brang bkra shis 'khyil gyi gser khrir mnga' gsol/dgung lo bcu gnyis pa nas mtshan nyid gsan sbyong mdzad/dgung lo bcu gsum par 'jam dbyangs bla ma dkon mchog bstan pa'i sgron me'i zhal snga nas tshigs snga ma dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo bcu drug par thu'u bkwan blang brang nas gdan zhu phul ba ltar dgon lung du phyag phebs te gnas der bzhugs ring gzhis byes ser skya grangs med par chos sbyin sogs kyi re ba bskangs/dgung lo bco brgyad pa sa sbrul hor zla lnga pa'i yar tshes la dbus phyogs su chibs bsgyur mdzad de hor zla brgyad pa'i tshes la lha sar phyag phebs/jo shAkya rnam gnyis sogs rten gtso khag la mchod 'bul dang rgyal dbang yab zung la 'byor phyag thog dngos 'bul rgya cher bstar bas mtshon skyes chen dam pa rnams la dngos 'bul gyi mchod sprin spros/hor zla bcu pa'i nang gdan sa chen po gsum sogs dge 'dun gyi da rnams su mang 'gyed dang thugs smon gyi mtshams sbyar mdzad/'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang du chos bzhugs gnang nas klu 'bum ngag dbang tshul khrims dang sgo me blo bzang chos 'dzin gnyis yongs 'dzin du bsten na slob gnyer dpyis phyin par mdzad/chu sprel 91812)lor gtsang du phebs nas paN chen thabs cad mkhyen gzigs mchog gi spyan snga nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/skyabs mgon rgyal ba'i dbang po'i spyan sngar chos bka' ci rigs gnas cing/rgyal dbang mchog nas dbu gdugs rta dar 'bob lcags sogs mkhan chas kyi gzengs bstod dpe zla med pa mdzad/dgung lo nyer gnyis pa cha bya (1813)lo'i hol zla lnga pa'i tshes 13nyin mdo smad du phebs rdog thon te hor la dgu pa'i yar tshe la gdan sa chen por phyag phebs/de ni rim gyis gser dkon/chu bzang/dgon lung/sku 'bum/bya khyung so so nas gdan zhu phul ba ltar phebs te yam rim dang drang nges kyi bshad pa sogs chos kyi bdud rtsi rgya cher bstsal/dgung lo re bzhi pa shing yos (1855)lor gung thang rin po che tshogs chen khrir bsko gzhag dang/hor tshang khri chen la rgyal tshab mdzad dgos dang bla brang du spor dgos kyi bka' nan stsal te hor zla dgu pa'i tshes 6gi snga dro gzugs sku'i bkod pa chos dbyings su bsdu bar mdzad do/}
kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng bzhi pa bskal bzang thub bstan dbang phyug|{rje 'di nyid 'bri chu dal gyis 'bab pa'i rgyud kyi bkra shis lha lung zer bar yab gzhan phan bde legs 'byung gnas dang yul gzhan phan chos 'tsho gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i (zhAn h+phong khri lo drug pa )me 'brug (1856)lo'i hor zla dang po'i tshes 25la sku bltams/sde khri rin po che dus gsum rjen par gzigs pa'i bka' gsal dang skyabs rje sku phreng gsum pa'i zhal chems kyi yig bzhag sogs tshang ma mthun par byung bas yang sprul 'khrul med du nges pa rnyed/dgung lo lnga pa lcags sprel (1860)lo'i hor zla gnyis pa'i tshes gcig la bla brang bkra shis 'khyil gyi chos yi khril la mnga' gsol /sku gong ma'i gsung bkod ltar rdo sbis lha rams pa bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho yongs 'dzin du bsten nas yi ge sbyor klog sogs la sbyangs/'jam mgon la ma shes rab rgya mtsho dpal bzang po las rab byung dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes te mtshan khri rin po che'i gsung ltar bskal bzang thub bstan dbang phyug ces gsol/dgung grangs bcu bzhi pa nas bzung rags lung zhabs zhu tshugs te dgung lo nyi shu pa shing phag (1875)lor dbus su byon te 'bras sgo mang gi chos grwa gsar zhugs dang dge ba'i bshes gnyen chen po blo bzang rnam rgyal pa yongs 'dzin du bsten/dpon slob byams pa rin po che'i sprul pa'i sku las bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/dbus phyogs su lo bzhi'i rang gsan sbyong rlabs che ba mdzad de mdo smad du phyir byon/dgung lo nyer bzhi pa la kyai rdor grwa tsang gsar 'dzugs mdzad/dgung lo nyer brgyad pa chu lug (1883)lor bla brang dgon gyi tshogs chen khrir bzhugs te brtsi bzhag dang 'chad nyan sogs brtse gzigs dang sgrig lam dag ther mdzad mus su sku 'bum bla grwa nas gsol ba btab pa bzhin sku 'bum gyi gdan sar phebs te dgon sde gnyis ka chos sring zung gis bskyangs/dgung lo zhe gsum bzhes pa sa khyi (1898)lor gnas mchog ri bo rtse lngar phebs te gnas gzigs dang rten gtso khag la mchod 'bul tshad med pa gnang/de nas ma hA gser gyi rgyal khab tu phyag phebs/gong mar mjal phrad mdzad par gser yig sogs kyi gzengs bstod de 'phral gnang/de nas chen po hor gyi yul grur chibs zhal bsgyur te nyin re bzhin skye bo khri phrag du mar chos sbyin mdzad/dgung lo zhe lnga par gong ma kong shus ches cher skyobs mdzad sa ma ti pasha ki zhes pa'i bka' tham gser yig bcas 'byor par sri zhu bla med pa mdzad/de nas snga rjes su mgo log dang/li thang/dbul shul g.yon du/chab mdo/tsha ba dpa' shod/ri bo che/sde dge sogs su phebs te dgon sde so sor rten gtso khag la mchod 'bul dang dge 'dun gyi sde la zhabs tog /gzhis byes kyi skye bo du mar chos sbyin bcas bsam gyis mi khyab pa mdzad/de'i rjes tsam na gong sa mchog sku 'bum du phebs par mjal 'phrad mdzad de bsnyen bkur dang chos kyi gsung gleng 'phel/dgung lo nga bzhi pa sa bya lo'i bzhi pa'i hor zla nyer gnyis la slar yang dbus 'gyur chos kyi zhing du chibs ba sgyur thog hor zla dgu pa'i tshes brgyad la lha sar phyag phebs te dbus gtsang/sa skya/tsa ri/ding ri/skyid grong/brag dkar rta so/pu hrangs/ti se/mi pham g.yu mtsho sogs sug nas mjal du phebs/dgung lo nga drug par lha sa nas li thang sogs brgyud skal ldan gdul bya rnams kyi don mdzad bzhin du dgung lo nga brgyad pa chu glang hor zla gsum pa'i tshes brgyad la bla brang du 'byor/dgung lo re gcig pa me 'brug (1916)lo'i hor zla gnyis pa'i tshes nyer gnyis nyin sku gshegs}
kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng lnga pa blo bzang 'jam dbyangs ye shes bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{rje 'di nyid li thang grong tsho brgyad kyi nang tshan mtshe ma grong zhes bya bar yab mgon po don 'grub dang yum gu ru lha 'tsho gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bco lnga pa'i me 'brug (1916)lo'i krung hwa ming go srid lo lnga pa )hor zla gsum pa'i tshes bcu gnyis nyin sku bltams/sa lug lor kun gzigs paN chen rin po che mchog nas rje 'di nyid yang sprul 'khrul med du ngos 'dzin mdzad de blo bzang 'jam dbyangs ye shes bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan zhes mtshan gsol/'jam dbyangs mkhyen rab rgya mtsho dge bsnyen dang rab byung gi tshul khrims yang dag par bzhes/'jigs med 'phrin las rgya mtsho'i spyan sngar dge tshul gyi sdom pa mnos/dgung grangs dgu pa shing bya lor paN chen rin po che lan ju la phebs par mjal 'dzoms nga sbrags yul spyi'i bde sdug rgyu rkyen sogs tsong tu lu'u tA hru la snyan sgron zhu ba dang 'brel chibs bsgyur mdzad/'di'i skabs nas bzung sku mched blo bzang tshe dbang pa ngo 'khor hrag bsdus slar yang lan jur lo ngo gsum tsam ring rgyun bzhugs kyis tsong tu la sngar gyi rgyu mtshan dang 'brel 'khrug zing gis yul khams 'phung bzhin yod tshul sogs nan chags su bstud mar zhus pa'i mthar bla brang rang gi chos srid zung 'brel gyi bya bzhag thams cad sngar srol ltar sor chad 'jags gnas gang legs dang sa gnas sde ris bcas des nas bzung zhing chen lan ju'i mnga' khongs su bcug ste 'phral yul gyi bgyi ba mtha' dag legs lam byung/dgung grangs bcu gnyis pa me yos lor rje nyid kyi phu bo blo bzang tshe dbang pa la krung dbyang rgyal khab chen po nas si ling {(WP:1,194)} gi go gnas dang tham ga phebs dgung grangs bcu gsum par rgyud stod grwa tshang gsar 'dzugs kyi bca' yig bka' rtsom mdzad de gsang chen rje theg pa'i bstan pa mi nub gong 'phel du rgyas pa'i thugs smon gnang de nas dgung grangs nyer gnyis pa'i bar lo bcu'i ring la yongs 'dzin rin po che gtsos tshul khrims rgya mtsho dang the bo dkon ma chog sogs mtshan zhabs pa brgyad dang bcas bka' pod lnga'i gsan sbyangs mthar phyin par mdzad chu bya lo'i hor zla bcu gcig pa'i tshes lnga la rgyal dbang mchog dag zhing dug dgongs pa gtad tshul gsan 'phral mchod 'bul rgya gang che ngos yang srid myur gsal gyi gsol 'debs mtshams sbyor nan tan mdzad 'di skabs rje nyid kyi phu bo blo bzang tshe dbang paN chen rin po che 'tshams zhur gdan 'dren dang u yon krang cang ci hrir 'tshams zhu 'bul bar nan cin du phebs te paN chen rin po che nas gdan zhu phul bar zhal bzhes mdzad pa dang u yon krang cang ce hris 'tshams zhu phul bar dgyes pa'i bka' phebs pa dang 'brel skud med glog 'phrin dang me mda' sum brgya sogs bstsal ba ma zad kun mkhyen sku phreng lnga par rgyal khams phan ldan rgyal bstan spel mdzad bcud pa 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa hu thog thu zhes pa'i gzengs bstod bgyis pa yin ces gser thang dang shes bam bstsal rab rgyal me byi hor zla drug pa'i tshes bcur paN chen rin po ches mkhas slob sbrags ma mdzad de bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa yang dag pa bzhes dgung lo nyer gcig bzhes pa me glang (1937)lo'i hor zla lnga pa'i tshes lnga la dbus gtsang du chibs bsgyur mdzad cing hor zla bcu pa rjes ma'i tshes dgur bod gzhung dang rgyal tshab rwa sgreng bla brang 'bras bla spyi sgo mang grwa tshang ha gdong khams tshan dbal shul mi tshan le ra bye gzhung bcas kyi thab bsu gzhung sa nas rtse shod las tshan 'bras spungs mkhan po khag sogs chibs bsu dang bcas lha ldan du phyag phebs 'bras sgo mang grwa tsang du chos bzhugs mdzad de khang gsar rin po yi yongs 'dzin du bsten te chos grwa chag med ngos gzhung shes phyin la thos bsam phu thag chod pa mdzad pas gzhung lugs rgya mtsho'i phar mthar son lcags 'brug (1940)lo'i hor zla dang po'i tshes bcur lha sa nas phebs rdog thog te hor zla drug pa'i tshes bcu gsum la blang brang du phyag phebs khang gsar skrun legs bsgrubs mdzad par krung dbyang dang cang u yon krang nas d+ha sgor bdun khri lan ju tsu'u kru shis nas d+ha sgor sum stong gsang ba sogs krung dbyang rgyal khab nas gzigs pa che dgung lo nyer brgyad (1943)par cang ce hri go min srid gzhung gi kru'i zhir mnga' gsol ba'i dga' ston 'bul phyir phu bo blo bzang tshe dbang dang sku mched dbal mang sprul sku nu gu sprul sku sogs khrung ched du ched bskyod kyis cang ce hrir mkhar lding gru gsum cu legs 'bul bstar bar dgyes bzhes thog rje nyid la rgya gzhung bon sog las khungs kyi legs nyes stangs 'dzin du gzengs bstod kyi gser yig dang sku mched blo bzang tshe dbang la krung dbyang u yon gyi go gsan bstsal dgung lo so gcig pa me khyi lor cang ce hri dgung lo drug bzhes pa'i pa yar la tshogs chen 'du khang gi rwa bar mchod sprin sna lnga khri tshor dang 'brel legs mtshon bul bar phu bo blo bzang tshe dbang ngo 'khor nan cin du ched bskyod zhabs bcar zhus te dgongs 'brel krung kran zho thang 'dzug 'bul sogs zhus pas dgyes gzigs brtse skyong la na med pa bstsal de ltar bstan 'gro'i bde skyid gong 'phel gyi mdzad pa rlabs che ba'i ngang du bzhugs bzhin pa las glo bur du dgung grangs so gnyis me phag (1947)lo'i hor zla gnyis pa phyi ma'i nyer gsum la sku gshegs bod gzhung nas mkhan chung thub bstan bzang po dang lo tsA ba byams pa ngag dbang ngo 'khor dang cang ce hri nas bod sog las khungs kyi u yon krang gzhon pa shes rab tA zi ngo g.yog rdzong phebs bcas gdung mdun du cho ga rgyas par bsgrubs }
kun mkhyen 'jigs med gling pa|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi bstan 'dzin skyes chen mkhas grub gnyis ldan zhig yin/mtshan gzhan mkhyen brtse 'od zer yang zhu/lho kha 'phyongs rgyas dpal ri dgon gyi nye 'dabs su yab chos rje smon lam bzang po dang/yum mdo srib steng khang pa'i rigs su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa bya (1729)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo drug pa la phebs skabs dpal ri 'od zer theg mchog gling du chos skor zhugs te sprul sku ngag dbang pad+ma las rab tu byung/dgung lo bcu la phebs skabs paN chen shAkya shri'i sdom rgyun gnas gsar ba kun dga'i drung nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo bcu gsum nas lo shas ring grub dang thugs mchog rdo rje dang/drung dam chos blo gsal dbang po/chos rje theg chen gling pa/zhal sgom chen po/bla ma kun tu bzang po/kong smyon sbas pa'i rnal 'byor sogs bla ma mang du bsten nas/gsang sngags gsar rnying gi chos bka' mtha' yas pa gsan/mchims phu sogs bden pa'i gnas su lo mang po'i bar du sgrub pa nyams bzhes rtse gcig tu mdzad pas rig 'dzin gong rnams dang dbyer med pa'i grub pa'i go 'phang mthong por gshegs shing/snga 'gyur bstan pa yongs rdzogs kyi bdag por gyur/dgung lo so bzhi pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu rta (1762)lor tshe ring ljongs kyi sgrub sde phyag btab ste sku tshe hril por gtso cher sgrub gnas de nyid du thugs dam nyams bzhes la gzhol bar mdzad cing/mon dang/kong po/khams phyogs/gtsang sa skya sogs su gdan drangs pa ltar phebs te rang rang so so'i mos pa dang 'tshams pa'i mdo sngags chos mang du gnang bas/brgyud pa 'dzin spel nus pa'i slob ma yang mang po byung/snga 'gyur bstan pa'i srog rtsar smin nges kyi gsung rtsom yang (yon tan rin po che'i mdzod )rtsa ba dang 'grel pa/(snga 'gyur rgyud 'bum rin po che'i rtogs brjod/) (gtam tshogs theg pa'i rgya mtsho/) sogs sde dge dkar khang chen mor pod dgu tsam bzhugs/dgung lo bdun cu pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa rta (1789)lor dgongs pa gzhan du gshegs mdzad rnam zhib rgyas ma mngal yang mdor bsdus tsam (gu bkra chos 'byung )deb chen lcags dmar ma'i shog grangs 635nas 644bar gsal/rnam thar rgyas pa kha byang du (rdzogs chen mkhyen brtse 'od zer gyi rnam thar legs byas yongs 'du'i snye ma )zhes 'khod pa dpar ma la grangs 340yod pa der gzigs}
kun mkhyen rje btsun pa|{rje btsun chos kyi rgyal mtshan/se ra grwa tshang byes kyi yig cha mdzad mkhan/mdzad pa'i bstan bcos nang phar phyin/dbu ma/tshad ma/'dul ba/drang nges sogs yod/se ra grwa tsang byes dang dga' ldan byang rtse gnyis nas bla ma 'dis mdzad pa'i dpe char thos bsam gtso bor byed pa yin}
kun mkhyen don yod dpal ldan|{se ra theg chen gling gi mkhan thog bcu pa yin/rab byung bdun pa'i shing glang (1445)lor nyang stong rgyal rtse khul du 'khrungs/rgyal rtse dpal 'khor chos sder rab byung mdzad/slob dpon bzod pa dpal ba dge rgan du bsten nas gzhung chen mor sbyangs pa mdzad pas mkhas pa chen por gyur/dgung lo nyi shur phebs skabs 'dul 'dzin blo gros sbas pas mkhan po dang/chos rje 'jam dpal grags pas las slob/slob dpon ma ti bas gsang ston mdzad nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/mi ring bar dbus su phebs te nyan po shAkya rgyal mtshan dang/gnyal ston dpal 'byor lhun grub sogs bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/ser byes grwa tsang gi zur chos pa dang gsang pu'i mkhan po yang mdzad/dgung lo zhe gcig par rab byung brgyad pa'i shing sbrul (1485)lor ser byes grwa tsang gi mkhan po mdzad pas grwa tshang gi slob gnyer gong 'phel du gyur/dgung lo bdun cu don gnyis pa rab byung dgu pa'i me byi (1516)lor rje btsun chos kyi rgyal mtshan la sku tshab bskos gnang mdzad de se ra'i mkhan po'i khrir phebs/dgung lo brgyad cur phebs pa rab byung dgu pa'i shing sprel (1524)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs/slob ma yang/rje btsun chos kyi rgyal mtshan dang paN chen bsod nams grags pa sogs gzhung chen mo'i 'chad nyan gyi thugs khur bzhes pa'i mkhas dbang nyi shu lhag tsam byung 'dug lags so/}
kun mkhyen dol bu pa|{dol bu pa shes rab rgyal mtshan/kun spangs thugs rje brtson 'grus kyis jo mo nang du dgon pa btab/dol bu pa der bzhugs nas grub mtha' 'di rgya cher spel bas de nas bzung brgyud 'dzin rnams la jo nang pa zhes grags pa byung}
kun mkhyen 'phags pa 'od|{bo ston rin po chi rtsa ba'i bla ma gtso che ba'i gras dang/gsang ba 'dus pa'i bla brgyad du bzhugs pa de yin/'khrungs gshegs kyi lo tshigs dang rnam thar zhib par 'khod pa'i yig cha kho bos ma mjal yang/bu ston rin po che'i rnam thar nang bla ma 'di'i drung nas gsang sngags spyi dang gsang ba 'dus pa'i skor thengs mang po'i bar du gsan tshul gsal/'phags 'od yon tan rgya mtsho ni rje tsong kha pa dang rje btsun shes rab seng ge'i slob ma yin cing/gsang 'dus rgyud 'grel dang bskyed rdzogs mdzad pa po de yin}
kun mkhyen bar ma|{mdo smad khul du 'jam dbyangs bzhed pa sku phreng gnyis par mtshan 'bod bya tshul gzhan zhig ste/gong gi kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa 'jigs med dbang po zhes pa'i skabs su gzigs}
kun mkhyen bu|{bod ljongs yongs su grub mtha' ris med kun gyis gus bkur zhu ba'i paN+Dita chen po bu ston rin chen grub yin cing/khong ni gtsang stod kyi shab smad sgom gnas zhes pa'i grong du yab bla ma rgyal mtshan dpal bzang dang yul slob dpon ma bsod nams 'bum kyi sras su rab yung lnga pa'i lcags stag (1290)lor skur 'khrungs/sku gzhon du byis pa'i dus nas thugs rab dang kun spyod 'gran zla bral zhing 'bri klog sogs thengs re re tsam gyis mkhyen pa'i rtsal phun sum tshogs pa mnga'/dgung lo brgyad la phebs skabs khro phu bsod nams seng ge'i drung nas sems bskyed dang gsang sngags kyi dbang gsan/dgung lo bco brgyad la phebs p+sabs mkhan po las rab tu byung/slob dpon de nyid dge rgan du bsten nas phar phyin dang tshad ma la thugs gnyer mdzad de/dgung lo nyer gcig la phebs skabs bshad pa dang grwa skor mdzad pas mkhas pa gzhan gyis 'gran par mi nus pa'i mtshan snyan gyis yongs su khyab/slob gnyer gnang ba'i ring zhogs pa dus thong nang dpe ring mda' tshad ma (yig phreng ring thung skar ma 52phreng rer yig 'bru 55ngos rer yig phreng bdun re yod pa zhig )bdun re thugs la bzung bar mdzad/gzhan yang slob dpon de nyid kyi drung nas 'dul ba dang/mngon pa/dbu ma bcas dang/yang rtse ba rin chen seng ge las gsang bde 'jigs gsum/gshin rje gshed/'khor lo chen po/sgrol ma/phag mo/kun rig sogs rgyud sde bzhi'i dbang khrid shin tu mang ba dang/bla ma rnam snang ba'i drung nas ma gcig gi gcod skor/rang nyid kyi yab brag ston rgyal mtshan dpal bzang las phyag na rdo rje'i skor/mkhan chen dka' bzhi pa dkon mchog gzhon nu las spyan ras gzigs don yod zhags pa'i skor/thar pa lo tsA la nyi ma rgyal las sgra dang snyan ngag /kun mkhyen 'phags 'od las gsang ba 'dus pa/bla ma rdo rje rgyal mtshan las dus 'khor sogs bod 'dir chos rgyun gang bzhugs yongs su rdzogs pa gsan/dgung lo nyir gsum pa lam khan chen dka' bzhi pa grags pa gzhon nu dang slob dpon bsod nams grags pa gnyis kyi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/de nas mi ring bar khro phu dgon pa'i 'chad nyan kyi slob dpon mdzad de lo shas bar grwa slob rnams la mdo sngags gnyis kyi slob khrid dus skabs nam yod la sku ngal med par bskyangs shing/rgya gar dang kha sin+d+hu sogs kyi yi ge dang skad mi 'dra ba 'ga' zhig kyang slob sbyong mdzad de gzhi 'gyur gnang thub pa'i tshad lon par mdzad/mtshan mo'i dus su mnal ma gzims par thugs dmas nyams bzhes gtso bor mdzad pas mdo rgyud nas bshad pa ltar rtogs pa'i yon tan kyang thugs rgyud la 'khrungs pa sogs bstan pa yongs rdzogs kyi bdag por bzhengs/dgung lo so gcig pa rab byung lnga pa'i lcags sprel (1320)lor zha lu'i sku zhang grags pa rgyal mtshan gyis gdan drangs pa ltar zha lu'i mkhan por phebs/grwa slob rnams la gzhung chen po lnga'i slob khrid dang slob ma snod ldan nyung shas la gsang sngags kyi dbang khrid lung la sogs pa gnang zhing/zha lu ri phug gi sgrub p+sade yang phyag btab pas/skabs der zha lu'i chos sde rang la dge 'dun zhal grangs sum stong brgyad brgya tsam dang/ri phug tu sgrub pa nyams bzhes mdzad mkhan tshogs pa lnga brgya tsam 'dus thog /slob ma mkhas btsun bzang gsum 'dzoms shing bstan pa 'dzin pa'i skyes chen dang/gzhung chen po 'chad nyan gyi slob dpon sgrub pa'i rgyal mtshan 'dzin pa'i bya bral rnal 'byor pa sogs grangs las 'das pa zhig byung zhing/de dag gi zhor la sku gsung thugs rten bzhengs pa dang/dge 'dun gyi sde la bsnyen bkur mdzad pa/mdo sngags kyi gzhung chen mo mang po mdzad pa sogs gang dang gang la'ang sku tshe gcig ring de kho na mdzad nas bzhugs pa lta bu'i mdzad rjes blo yul du shong dka' ba zhig yin/dgung lo don lnga bzhes pa rab byung drug pa'i shing 'brul (1364)lor dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/gsung rtsom yang (chos 'byung chen mo )dang/(dus 'khor rtsa rgyud kyi 'grel pa )sogs dus 'khor gyi skor/(bde mchog rtsa rgyud kyi 'grel pa )sogs bde mchog gi sko/(gsang 'dus rtsa rgyud kyi 'grel pa )sogs gsang ba 'dus pa'i skor/(rgyud sde rgya mtsho'i gru gzings )sogs rnal 'byor rgyud kyi skor/(rgyud sde spyi'i rnam bshad )rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum/(phar phyin mngon rtogs rgyan gyi 'grel pa/) (mngon pa kun btus kyi 'grel pa/) (spyod 'jug gi 'grel pa/) (tshad ma rnam nges kyi 'grel pa/) (sgra mdo ka lA pa'i 'grel pa )sogs lha sa zhol dpar khang gi dpar mang pod 28bzhugs/rnam thar lo rgyus rgyas pa ni/thugs sras rin chen rnam rgyal gyis mdzad pa'i (dpal ldan bla ma dam pa mkhan po lo tsA ba'i rnam par thar pa snyim pa'i me tog )ces kha byang du 'khod pa thugs sras de nyid kyis gsung 'bum nang du yod/khong gi mdzad rnam mdor bsdus shig (deb ther dmar po'i mchan 'grel )(mi rigs dpe skrun khang gis (1981)lor par skrun byas pa'i deb gzugs lcags dpar ma )gyi mchan rtags ang 364par gsal bas der gzigs}
kun mkhyen blo gros rin chen seng ge|{se ra'i mkhan thog lnga pa yin/mtshan gzhan kun mkhyen mus krad pa yang zer/'khrungs long gsal ba'i yig cha ma mthong yang 'khrungs yul la stod yin/rje tsong kha pa chen po dang/mkhas grub rje/'jam dbyangs chos rje sogs rtsa ba'i bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags gzhung la slob gnyer mthar phyin pa mdzad/'bras spungs zur khang gi 'chad nyan slob dpon mdzad cing/rjes su se ra thig chen gling gi mkhan por gdan drangs pa ltar phebs shing gzhung chen po'i 'chad nyan rgyun ring du bskyangs pas slob ma yang gnyal ston dpal ston dpal 'byor lhun grub dang/slob dpon dpal ldan blo gros pa sogs gsung sgros brgyad 'dzin pa mang po byung ba rnams kun mkhyen nyid dgongs pa rdzogs rjes/gnyal ston chos rje dpal 'byor lhun grub kyis se ra'i mkhan po mdzad skabs sne'u rdzong dpon dpal 'byor rgyal po dang/dpon mo bu khrid dpal 'dzoms gnyis kyis kun mkhyen gyis slob ma rnams rmang gzhi byas pa'i grwa tsang zhig gsar 'dzugs bya rgyu'i bskul ma zhus thog grwa tsang gi tshogs khang dang/grwa shag bcas gsar skrun gyi sbyin bdag zhus te byes pa grwa tshang 'dzugs thub pa byung yod/gsum rtsom skor/(dbu ma'i rnam bshad dgongs pa rab gsal gyi de nyid gsal byed )(tshad ma'i stong thun mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog )bcas yod do/}
kun mkhyen tshul blo|{kun mkhyen klong chen po'i mtshan gzhan la tshul khrims blo gros kyang zhu ba mtshan cha tshang gi bsdus ming yin}
kun mkhyen zur phug pa|{'brug pa bka' brgyud kyi bla ma mtshan snyan che ba zhig yin cing/rgyal ba yang dgon pa rgyal mtshan dpal gyi dngos slob spyan snga rin chen ldan gyi slob ma yin/chos 'byung khag tshang mar mtshan tsam las mi gsal zhing/rnam thar zhig khong gi dngos slob mkhas btsun gzhon nu rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa bris ma dpe ring shog grangs dgu yod pa zhig 'dug kyang zhib par blta ba'i go skabs ma byung bas 'dir bri ma nus so/}
kun mkhyen yon tan rgya mtsho|{jo nang pa'i chos brgyud 'dzin pa'i mkhan dbang chen po zhig yin/gtsang stod mdog gzhung gi mkhar rnying du rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags sprel (1260)lor 'khrungs/'dar gyi gdan sa gtso bor byas pa'i grwa sa mang por gzhung chen rnams la sbyangs pa mdzad/sa skya'i 'jam dbyangs rin chen rgyal mtshan sogs gsang sngags gsar rnying gi mkhas pa mang du bsten zhing/shar pa 'jam dbyangs pa'i p+salob ma'i gtso bo dang zur chos pa yin/jo nang kun spungs pa thugs rje brtson 'grus la bsten nas jo nang gi chos skor dang khrid gsan/byang sems rgyal ba ye shes sku 'das rjes dgung lo re gcig pa rab byung lnga pa'i lcags sprel (1320)lor jo nang gi gdan sar phebs/jo nang sgrub brgyud kyi bstan pa bskyangs te lo bdun tsam song ba na/kun mkhyen nor po ba gdan sar bskos/dgung lo re brgyad pa rab byung drug pa'i me yos (1327)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs}
kun mkhyen rong po|{sa skya'i bstan 'dzin kun mkhyen g.yag rong gnyis zhes grags pa'i nang tshan rong ston shAkya rgyal mtshan zhu ba de yin/rgyal rong gi yul du bon po'i rigs rgyud cig tu rab byung drug pa'i me log (1367)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bco brgyad yan chad du bon kyi gzhung la thos bsam rgya cher mdzad/dgung lo bco brgyad pa la gsang pu ne'u thog gi chos grwar sgrigs zhugs mdzad de gling stod pa rin chen rnam rgyal dang/kong ston blo gros dbang phyug gi drang nas bsdus grwa dang/tshad ma/phar phyin bcas gsan/'phan yul gro sa'i mkhas pa chen po dmar ston pa'i drung du 'dul ba smad lugs dang/'dul 'dzin thag ma pa'i bshad srol gyi 'dul ba dang/mngon pa mchim lugs kyi bshad/thang sag pa gzhon no rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas pa tshab so tsA ba'i dbu ma thal 'gyur ba'i bshad srol/lo pa shAkya rin chen gyi drung nas mngon pa kun btus kyi bshad pa bcas gsan/dgung lo nyer gnyis pa la gro sa'i mkhan po dmar ston pa kun dga' rgyal mtshan dang dpal ldan rin chen rnam gnyis kyi drung nas rab byung dang bsnyen rdzogs bzhes/dgung lo nyer gnyis nas tshad ma rnam nges kyi Tik+ka brtsams par mdzad cing/de nas dgung lo gya gsum yi bar sku tshe gcig ring 'chad rtsod rtsom gsum gyi mdzad pa rgya cher bskyangs shing/gzhan la 'chad spel mdzad pa'i gzhung lugs drug cu rtsa bzhi dang/'grel bshad mdzad pa'i gzhu bzhi bcu lhag tsam yod par gsungs/gzhan yang yar lung pa seng ge rgyal mtshan dang/lo chen skyabs mchog dpal bzang/lo chen grags pa rgyal mtshan/kun mkhyen shes rab 'od zer/'jam dbyangs kha che/mun chen nam mkha'i rnal 'byor sogs bla ma mang po'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi lung khrid dbang bka' man ngag gi rgyun mtha' yas pa gsan/zhi byed kyi chos skor dang/phar phyin/dbu ma rang rgyu pa'i lta ba bcas 'chad spel dar rgyas su gtor bar mdzad par brten gsung skyes slob ma yang snga tshar gyi bu chen bzhi/bar tshar gyi bu chen bcu/phyi tshar gyi bu chen bcu drug /yang tshar gyi bu chen grags pa can bzhi/mdzad spyod rang dang mtshungs pa gsum/gsung sgros rgyun 'dzin gyi mkhas pa bcu gnyis bcas byung ba rnams bstan 'dzin gyi skyes chen mtshan don mtshungs shing mdzad 'phrin che ba sha stag yin/dgung lo bdun cur phebs pa rang byung bdun pa'i me 'brug (1436)lor 'phan po na len+d+ra'i chos sde btab cing/de nas lo bcu bzhir gdan sa de nyid rang du bzhugs nas gzhan phan gyi mdzad pa bskyangs/mdzad pa gzhan dag skor la rang rang gi grub mtha'i phyogs 'dzin gyis gleng phyogs mi mthun stabs 'dir ma bkod cing/gzigs par 'dod na dus thog mnyam pa'i skyes chen dam pa gzhan gyi rnam thar la gzigs pa zhu/gsung rtsom skor/(bshes springs 'grel pa/) (mdo sdud pa'i 'grel pa/) (brgyud stong don bsdus kyi 'grel pa/) (phar phyin mngon rtogs rgyan kyi 'grel pa/) (mdo sde rgyan)dang (rgyud bla ma dbus mtha' rnam 'byed//) (chos nyid rnam 'byed bcas kyi 'grel pa/) (dbu ma 'jug pa'i 'grel pa/) (dbu ma rgyan gyi 'grel pa/) (sgom rim rnam pa gsum gyi 'grel pa/) (mngon pa mdzod kyi 'grel pa/) ('dul ba me tog phreng rgyud kyi rnam bshad/) (tshad ma kun btus kyi 'grel pa/) (tshad ma rnam nges kyi 'grel pa/) (tshad ma'i spyi don che chung gnyis/) (tshad ma rigs gter gyi 'grel pa/) (gsang ba 'dus pa'i rtsa rgyud 'grel pa sgrol gsal gyi rnam bshad )sogs mang po zhig 'dug kyang 'dir yig tshogs kyis 'jigs nas bri ma nus so/_/rnam thar ni/paN chen shAkya mchog ldan gyis mdzad pa (kun mkhyen chen po rong po'i rnam thar )zhes kha byang du 'khod pa dpar ma dpe 'bring shog grangs 45can zhig yod/de las bsdus pa mang thos klu sgrub rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i (bstan rtsis gsal ba'i nyid byed )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 201nas 204bar dang/(deb sngon )lcags dmar ma'i smad cha shog grangs 1258nas 1260bar gsal}
kun mkhyen si tu rin po che chos kyi 'byung gnas|{'di skabs kyi kun mkhyen si tu rin po che ni/ka thog si tu chen po che chos kyi 'byung gnas yin par bshad/'di ni bod kyi rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags 'brug (1700)lor 'khrungs shing/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing rta (1774)lor 'das/dus thog der khong na bod du snyan grags me ba'i bka' brgyud chos lugs kyi rtsom pa po zhig yin/lo rgyus/snyan ngag /sum rtags/mngon brjod/sgra rig pa/sman gzhung/mtshan nyid rig pa sogs kyi rtsom yig pod chen 13tsam sde dge dpar khang du dpar yod cing/(si tu rin po che'i rnam thar dri bral me long )shog grangs 361yod pa de ni slob ma karma tshe dbang bstan 'phel gyis brtsams pa/dge dge dpar khang du dpar yod}
kun gyi mig lar 'doms pa gcod nges|{mi kun la mig dpe yong yir mi gcig la nyes chad nan po gcod rgyu nges can yin pa}
kun gyis bkur ba rnam pa gsum|{nyan thos sde pa bco brgyad kyi nang tshan kun gyis bkur ba'i sde pa'am/mang pos bkur ba'i sde pa la nang gses gsum du gyes pa ste sa sgrogs ri pa/srung ba pa/gnas ma bu bcas khag gsum du gyes pa la zer/de yang rgyal po'i khab kyi lho phyogs ku ru ku le'i brag phug la gnas gzhi mdzad nas bzhugs pa rnams la sa sgrogs rigs kyi sde zhes 'bod pa dang/slob dpon srung ba pa yi rjes su 'brangs pas na srung ba pa dang/slob dpon gnas ma'i bu yi rjes su 'brangs pas na gnas ma bu pa zhes zer/sde pa 'di gsum rtsa ba'i grub mtha' mthun pa yin cing/rtsa ba'i grub mtha' ni/gang zag phung po ng+la las gzhan ma yin la/phung po dang gcig kyang ma yin cing/sgo lnga'i rnam par shes pas 'dod chags skye mi nus la 'dod chags dang bral bar yang byed mi nus/shes bya thams cad bsdus na brjod du yod pa dang brjod du med pa gnyis sum 'dus pa med/mthong lam ni sems kyi skad cig ma bcu gnyis tshun chad yin cing/de phan chad 'bras bu'i khongs su 'dus pa bcas yin/'di las zhor du 'phros pa'i gnad don gal che ba ni/mang pos bkur ba'i sde lnga (1 gnas ma bu pa/2 bzang po'i lam pa/3 chos sbas pa/4 mang pos bkur ba/5 bla ma pa )yod pa'i nang nas gnas ma bu pas khang gi bdag khas len pas skyabs gnas dang las 'bras kyi thad nas nang par tshud tsam yin kyang/lta ba'i sgo nas nang pa'i khongs su mi gtogs pa yin zhes bzhed mkhan sa skya paN chen dang/rje btsun red mda' ba/paN chen bsod nams grags pa/lcang skya rol pa'i rdo rje sogs yin cing/mkhas grub rin po che'i dbu ma'i stong thun dang/gung ru rgyal mtshan bzang po/hor ston nam mkha' dpal ba/rje btsun chos kyi rgyal mtshan/phur lcog ngag dbang byams pa sogs mang po zhig gis ni/gnas ma bu pas gang zag gi bdag khas mi len pa dang/gang zag gi bdag med khas len pa'i nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i grub mtha' spyi mthun yin pa'i rgyu mtshan mang du gsungs shing/kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa ngag dbang brtson 'grus kyis mdzad pa'i (grub mtha' chen mo )las/gnas ma bu pas gang gi bdag yod par khas len zhes pa'i bdag dang/nang pa'i grub mtha' smra ba kun dang mthun par gang zag gi bdag med khas len zhes pa'i bdag nyis mi 'dra ba ste gnas ma bu pas gang zag rdzas yod du grub pa'i bdag la go dgos pa dang/de yang dbu ma pas rigs pa'i sgo nas gzhal na don gyis khas blangs par song ba'i rigs pa'i 'phul mtshon tsam yin pa las dngos su khas len la med pa dang/phyag rgya bzhi'i nang tshan gyi gang zag gi bdag med ni rtag gcig rang dbang can gyis stong pa'i bdag med la 'jog pas bdag med de nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i grub mtha' smra ba kun dang mthun par gnas ma bu pas kyang khas len pas lta ba'i sgo nas bshad na yang nang pa sangs rgyas pa yin zhes gsungs pa bcas bzhed pa mi 'dra ba gsum 'dug pa 'dir dpyad gzhi tsam du bkod pa las/kho bos ni bzhed pa gang zhig yang dag pa yin min kha tshon gcod pa'i spobs pa gang yang ma mchis so/}
kun dga' 'phags pa|{rgyal rtse dpon chen kun dga' 'phags pa ste/dpon chen 'phags pa dpal bzang zhes sa skya'i bzhi thog bla brang gi nang chen yin pa de dang zha lu sku zhang kun dga' don grub yi bu mo ma gcig pad+ma gnyis kyi bur rab byung drug pa'i me bya (1357)lor sa skya'i nang chen gyi go sar bskos/rang lo nyir gcig pa me sbrul (1377)lor rgyal rtse dpon chen gyi go nas bzung/rang lo zhe gcig pa me glang (1397)lor rgyal rtse'i gtsug lag khang chen mo bzhengs/rang lo nga gnyis pa sa byi (1408)lor rgyal rtse sgrub mchod chen mo zhes grags pa de thog mar btsugs shing/de la rgyud sde bzhi'i chos grwa mi 'dra ba lnga bcu nga gnyis yod/rang lo nga drug pa rab byung bdun pa'i chu 'brug (1412)lor rgyal rtse'i gzims khang shar du 'das/lo rgyus zhib pa (rab brtan kun bzang gi rnam thar )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 9nas 45bar gsal ba la gzigs}
kun dga' bo|{sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyi sku'i nye gnas mchog tu gyur pa zhig yin/sangs rgyas kyi yab zas gtsang ma la gcung po gsum (zas dkar/bre bo zas/bdud rtsi zas )yod pa'i nang tshad bdud rtsi zas kyi sras yin cing/sangs rgyas dgung lo zhe gcig tu phebs dus yab sras gtsang gis pho brang du gdan darangs pa ltar phebs skabs kun dga' bo 'khrungs nas dgung lo drug la phebs yod/sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das 'khrungs yul nas mnyan yod du phyir phebs mdzad skabs rjes su 'brangs nas phebs pa ltar mnyam du khrid gnang mdzad de 'od srung chen po la gtad nas rab tu byung/mgon po klu sgrub kyis mdzad par grags pa'i (sher phyin man ngag )las kun dga' bos bcom ldan 'das kyi nye gnas lo nyi shu rtsa lnga'i ring mdzad par gsungs pa ltar na bcom ldan 'das dgung lo lnga bcu nga lnga dang kun dga' bo dgung lo nyi shur phebs skabs kun dga' bos bcom ldan 'das la cha rkyen gnang na ngas nye gnas zhus chog ces khas len zhus pa ltar dge slong rnams kyis bcom ldan 'das la zhus pa'i tshe bcom ldan 'das thugs mnyes nas kun dga' bo mig rgyang ring ba'i mkhas mdzangs shing yin gsungs nas cha rkyen gsum po tshang ma zhal bzhes gnang ste nye gnas su bskos/skabs der kun dga' bos 'don pa gnang ba'i cha rkyen gsum ni/1 bcom ldan 'das kyis ma bzhes pa'i gsol zas dang na bza'i lhag 'phro mi gnang ba/2 dus nam yin kyang sku mdun du thad kar bcar chog pa/3 rang nyid bcom ldan 'das kyi drung du med pa'i skabs su chos mi gsung ba bcas yin/cha rkyen dang po dang gnyis pa ni mi gzhan gyis kun dga' bor lto gos tsam gyi don du nye gnas byas so zhes kha gtong mkhan mi yong ba'i ched dang/cha rkyen gsum pa ni kun dga' bo rang nyid la snyan du gsan tshad thams cad thengs gcig gis nang yang mi brjed par thugs la brtan por nges thub pa'i khyad chos yod par brten/bcom ldan 'das kyis gang gsungs pa'i chos thams cad thugs la nges nas bcom ldan 'das dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das rjes bka' bsdu cha tshang ba mdzad thub pa'i dgos pa yod pa yin/kun dga' bo dgung lo bzhi bcu zhe lngar phebs pa'i lo der bcom ldan 'das dgung lo brgyad cur phebs pa dgongs pa p+maya ngan las 'das khar 'od srung chen po rang nyid kyi zhal tshab tu bstan pa'i bdag por bsko gzhag mdzad pa dang chabs cig kun dga' bo dgra bcom pa'i go 'phang ma thob par du khyod mya ngan las ma 'da' bar nga'i bstan pa dang/kun dga' bo/dge slong gi dge 'dun da dang bcas pa skyongs shig /kun dga' bor dgra bcom pa thob rjes bstan pa khong la gtad nas khyod mya ngan las 'da' bar gyis shig ces gsungs nas dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs/skabs der kun dga' bo rgyun zhugs kyi 'bras bu thob tsam las dgra bcom pa'i 'bras bu thob med par brten dge 'dun gyi khongs nas gnas dbyung btang ste dma' phabs na dgra bcom pa'i 'bras bu myur du thob thub par mngon shes kyis gzigs te nyes pa chen po brgyad bgrangs te dge 'dun gyi gral nas phud/de nas bzung dge slong dang/dge tshul/slob dpon gcig pa sus kyang gtam mi smra ba dang/mnyam du chos dang zang zing gi longs spyod byed mkhan med stabs thugs skye ba la tshad med pa byung zhing/'on kyang sangs rgyas rgyun bzhugs gnang sa'i gzings khang phyi nang nye skor bcas la gad phyis dang/chu dang tshems shing (so'i dreg pa 'don byed kyi shing bu )'bul ba/gzims mal bsham pa sogs sangs rgyas zhal bzhugs dus dang khyad med gnang thog zhag bdun gyi bar du ting nge 'dzin sgo pa la 'bad brtson gnang bas dgra bcom pa'i go 'phang thob ste mngon shes dang rdzu 'phrul la thogs pa med par gyur/bka' bsdu dang po mdzad nye ba'i skabs kun dga' bo dgra bcom pa thob zin pa'i gnas tshul 'od srung chen po sogs dge 'dun rnams kyis mkhyen nas kun dga' bo mdo sde sdud pa por bskos/dgra bcom pa lnga brgya'i rnam sbyar bting ba'i steng du bzhugs nas/thugs la bzung ba'i mdo sde rnams thogs pa med par gsungs pa sogs bka' bsdu'i mdzad sgo grub nas mi ring bar 'od srung chen pos kun dga' bo bstan pa'i bdag por bsko gzhag mdzad de dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/de nas lo bzhi bcu'i bar du bstan pa'i bdag po mdzad nas dus dus su gdul bya'i blo dang 'tshams par chos gsungs pa dang rdzu 'phrul gyis 'dul gdos pa rnams la de dang 'tshams pa'i rdzu 'phrul bstan nas 'dul bar mdzad pas dgra bcom pa thob pa'i dge slong yang khri gcig lhag tsam zin pa sogs mdzad rjes sangs rgyas kyi dgongs pa dang mthun pa byung/dgung lo brgyad cu gya lngar phebs skabs slob ma'i tha ma nyi ma gung pa gling phran zhig tu khrid nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom gnang te thams cad dgra bcom pa thob/dgongs pa mya ngan las 'da' khar yul spong byed pa dang/ma ga d+ha pa gnyis sku gdung gi don du 'khrugs pa 'ong bar mkhyen nas gnyis kar sku gdung gi bgo bsha' thob chen yul gnyis kyi bar gyi chu bo gang+ga'i dbus su yod pa'i gling gi nang zhugs nas der mya ngan las 'das/sku gdung las rab byung gi me 'bar bas zhugs la sbyangs pa'i dum bu gnyis su gyur pa byang gi de spong byed pas khyer/lho'i de ma skyes dgras khyer nas rang rang so so'i yul du ma chod rten re brtsigs/'di'i lo rgyus zhib par (rgya gar chos 'byung )9nas 12bar gsal/zhal byung/bod kyi mkhas pa sngon byon rnams kyis sher phyin mdo gsungs skabs kun dga' bo bcom ldan 'das kyi 'khor du yod med dang/sangs rgyas rang nyid kyis sprul 'i nyan thos min nam/nyan thos rang mtshan pa yin sogs kyi dogs gcod mang po mdzad 'dug pa bshad gzhi che bar 'dir ma bkod lags}
kun dga' rwa ba|{'di la bod kyi lo rgyus thog tha snyad 'dogs tshul mi 'dra ba gsum yod/1 spyir btang goms gshis thog kun dga' ra ba zhes gsung rab gyi rten 'jog sa'i dpe khri la go ba len gyi yod pa/2 dge 'dun rnams chos kyi bya bar 'du 'tshogs gnang yul gyi 'du khang dang chos grwa la go ba len dgos pa/3 dge 'dun gyi gnas khang la go dgos pa bcas yod/gzhan yang 'bras spungs dga' ldan pho brang rgyab ngos kyi kun dga' ra ba zhes pa'i lha khang 'di ni rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags byi (1660)lo nas sa sprel (1668)bar lo ngo dgu'i ring sde srid 'phrin las rgya mtshos dga' ldan pho brang gi srid dbang bskyangs skabs thog ma'i 'dzugs skrun byas shing/de rjes sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i skabs yang bskyar nyams gso dang rgya bskyed gnang/de rjes rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags sbrul (1941)lo nas lcags stag (1950)lo bar lo ngo bcu'i ring stag brag rin po ches bod sa gnas kyi sring dbang bskyangs skabs slar yang nyams gso dang rgya bskyed kyis da lta'i bzo dbyibs 'di yung/pho brang 'dir rten gyi gtso bor snar thang 'chi med sgrol ma dang/rgyal rtse rtse chen sgrol ma/yar 'brog g.yu mtsho'i sgrol ma/slob dpon tsan+d+ra go ma'i thugs dam rten spyan ras gzigs sogs lo rgyus ngo mtshar can gyi sku brnyan mang po yod/sdebs bris skor/de sngon tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa zhal bzhugs skabs sde sde 'phrin las rgya mtshos kun dga' ra ba'i pho brang gsar skrun gnang ba dang dus mtshungs ljags bkod gnang ba ltar g.yas skor kyi ldebs bris la/bod du 'gro ba mi thog mar byung tshul nas sku phreng lnga pa chen pos po tA la'i pho brang dkar po gsar bzhengs ma gnang bar gyi rgyal rabs dang chos 'byung gi lo rgyus cha tshang bkod gnang mdzad yod cing/rjes su sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos ldebs bris der mthong chen gnang ste thang ka ngo grangs bi bcu zhe gsum gyi thog bshus gnang mdzad pa de gras kyi thang ga ngo grangs bco lnga (bod ljongs tha kha )zhes pa'i brnyan deb thog bkod yod}
kun dga' rwa ba pa|{me tog dang shing thog gi rwa sogs srung ba'i mi skya}
kun dga' rwa ba'i nyi 'od ldebs ris|{gong gsal kun dga' rwa ba zhes pa'i 'grel bshad der gzigs}
kun dga' rin chen|{sa skya'i khri pa bco lnga pa 'di nyid rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa yos (1339)lor yab mkhan btsun nam mkha' legs pa dang yum dge 'dun 'bum gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/gcen po zla ma dam pa dang bla ma mnyam med pa chen po gnyis las rab tu byung/lug lo zhig la tA'i si tu byang chub rgyal mtshan gyi phyag phyi mdzad nas chu mig tu phebs/de nas bzung bzhi thog pa'i gdung rgyud rnams kyis chu mig tu cho sa 'khor mang du bskor/'ga' zhig gnas der gdan chags pas phyis su bzhi thog pa rnams la chu mig bla brang pa zhes grags/gong ma mchod yon gyis kun ting gu shri'i mtshan dang shes dam che ba/dngul dam che ba sogs gnang/dgung lo so drug bzhes pa rab byung drug pa'i shing stag (1374)lor bzhi thog gi khrir phebs/gong thi li kya ho si tA dben gu shri'i mtshan gsol/dam ga chen mo thu shu dang bcas pa phul/dgung lo re gcig par ma byung bdun pa sa yos (1399)lor sku gshegs}
kun 'gro lnga|{dge ba dang mi dge ba lung ma bstan gyi sems thams cad kyi 'khor du 'gro ba'i rgyu mtshan gyis kun 'gro lnga zhes btags pa ste/1 tshor ba/2 'du shes/3 sems pa/4 reg pa/5 yid la byed pa bcas yin/de dag so so'i ngo bo dang/nang gser gyi dbe ba dang bcas pa so so'i ming gi 'grel bshad kyi skabs 'og nas gsal ba la gzigs}
kun nyon gzung rtog|{rang gi dmigs su gyur pa'i kun nas nyon mongs pa'i phyogs kyi chos la dmigs nas longs spyod byar bden par 'dzin pa'i bden 'dzin kun btags te/sbyor lam drod kyi gnas skabs su khong grong dang nga rgyal sa sogs pa'i nyon mongs pa'i chos rnams longs spyod byar 'dzin pa'i nyon mongs pa'i chos rnams longs spyod byar 'dzin pa'i bden 'dzin kun btags mngon gyur pa rnams mgo gnon par byed do/}
kun nyon gsum|{1 nyon mos pa'i kun nyon dang/2 las kyi kun nyon/3 skye ba'i kun nyon bcas yin/nyon mongs dug gsum gang rung gi rgyu byas nas las gsog par byed cing/las de'i dbang gis 'gro ba rigs drug tu rang dbang med par skye ba len dgos pa yi pas gsung po de 'khor ba'i sdug bsngal myong bar byed pa'i rgyu dang/rkyen/'bras bu gsum gyi thad nas 'brel ba dam po yod pas kun nas nyon mongs pa zhes brjod pa yin}
kun snying gi lugs|{slob dpon kun dga' snying po'i lugs/rgya gar gyi paN+Dita yin/gsang 'dus kyi bshad srol 'phags lugs dang cung zad mi mthun}
kun tu 'gro ba rnam pa lnga|{tshor ba/'du shes/sems pa/reg pa/yid byed do/}
kun tu rgyu|{nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i chos lugs rgya gar du ma byung gong gi gna' rabs chos lugs kyi lta ba sna tshogs pa drug cu lhag tsam dang/tshur bsdus na rtag par smra ba'i rtog ge sde lnga/(grangs can pa/phur bu pa/bye brag pa/rig pa can pa/gcer bu pa )bcas dang/par smra ba gcig (rgyang phan pa )ste rtog ge sde drug tu 'dus pa yin cing/de dag so so'i ston pa dang/lta tshul bcas rang rang gi ming gi skabs su 'grel bshad mdor bsdus bkod pa la gzigs}
kun tu rgyu mos skur ba btab pa|{'di ni (skyes rabs dpag bsam 'khri shing )yal 'dab lnga bcu pa las bcu spyad pa zhes pa de'i nang gses/mu stegs pa'i bud med cig gis rang gi lto ba la zangs gong bkab nas de'i steng du gos kyis dkris te sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das 'khor mang po la chos gsungs bzhin pa'i mdun du 'ong nas/khyed kyis nga'i lus la bzos pa'i phru gu 'di bdag po gyis shig ces zhus par gnas skabs ring cang mi gsung bar bzhugs shing/skabs der byi ba zhig gis bud med de'i rked par bcings pa'i sked rags la so brgyab nas chad pa dang chabs cig mo'i lto bar bcings pa'i gzhong pa sa la lhung nas thams cad kyis mthong ba sogs byung ba'i gnas tshul 'khod pa de yin/zhib par gong gsal gyi le'u der gzigs}
kun tu rgyu rab bzang|{sngon dus sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das zhal 'tsho bzhugs skabs ma stegs kun tu rgyu'i lta ba 'dzin pa mang po zhig 'dul bar mdzad pa'i nang nas tha ma dgongs pa m+payang na las 'da' khar chos gsungs nas bden pa mthong bar mdzad pa de yin}
kun tu sbyor ba gsum|{bshes springs las/tshul khrims brtul zhugs mchog 'dzin dang lus la/phyin ci log par lta dang the tshom ste/tshul khrims brtul zhugs mchog 'dzin dang/lus mi gtsang ba la gtsang bar 'dzin pa/thar lam la dogs pa za ba'am yid mi ches pa bcas gsum po yin pa la thar lam du 'khrul bar byed pa dang/gnyis pa des zag bcas nyer len gyi phung po 'di la sred zhen skye bar byed pa dang/gsum pa des thar pa thob rgyud yod med la dogs pa skye bar byed pas na de ltar brjod}
kun tu bzang po|{byang chub sems dpa' nye ba'i sras brgyad kyi nang tshan zhig ste/rgya nag glang chen 'gying ri ni byang chub sems dpa' kun tu bzang po bzhugs pa'i gnas chen yin par bshad srol yod}
kun tu bzang po sangs rgyas pa|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur bzhes srol la chos sku kun tu bzang po sangs rgyas tshul ni/tshogs ma bsags sgrib pa ma sbyangs par sangs rgyas pa zhig yin pa dang/de yang ('jam dpal mtshan brjod )las/skad cig gcig gis rdzogs sangs rgyas/_/skad cig gcig gis bye brag phyed/ces gsungs pa'i dgongs pa yin pa dang/sems kyi chos nyid rang ngo shes na de ma thag tu grol ba dang/de'i 'od lnga'i ye shes lnga dang sku gsum du shar ba sogs ni/lhan skyes kyi sku 'od gsal de nyid longs sku dang sprul skur 'char zhing/sems dri ma med pa 'di las cir yang snang du rung ba'i don gleng gzhi lta bu'i sgo nas gzhi lam 'bras gsum gyi rnam gzhag gsungs pa zhig las lo rgyus dngos bshad pa min par lo rgyus kyi tshul du nyams su blang bya'i chos kyi rnam grangs gsungs pa yin pa sogs gsal bshad mdzad pa 'dir go rgyu zab pa'i dpyad gzhi chen po zhig snang lags}
kun tu bzang po'i mchod pa|{byang chub sems dpa' kun tu bzang po'i phyag la nor bu gnyis yod pa dang/nor bu re re nas kyang nor bu re re thon pa de dag rangs mang las don dam nor bu'i mchod pa la zer ba yin}
kun btags|{nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i grub mtha' smra ba bzhi'i nang gses sems tsam pa rnams kyis khas len pa'i mtshan nyid gsum/(kun btags/gzhan dbang/yongs grub )yod pa las/dang po/kun btags zhes pa ni gzhi'am chos gang zhig la sgra dang rtog pa gang rung gis sgro btags pa'i cha zhig la zer zhi nga/de la nang gses kyis phye na 'di ni gzugs so zhes pa lta bu ngo bo la sgro btags pa dang/'di ni gzugs kyi skye ba'o zhes khyad par la sgro btags pa lta bu ste/de gnyis ni sgro 'dogs tshul gyi sgo nas phye ma yin cing/kun btags rang gi ngo bos sgo nas dgye ba phye na rnam grangs pa'i kun btags dang mtshan nyid yongs su chad pa'i kun btags gnyis yod/'dus ma byas kyi chos rnams ni rang 'dzin shes pa la ngo bo dang khyad par gyi gzhir rang gi mtshan nyid kyi grub par snang yang don dngos po'i gnas tshod la rang gi mtshan nyid kyis ma grub pa yin pas rnam grangs pa'i kun btags zhes brjod pa yin ci nga/gang zag gi bdag dang chos kyi bdag nyid lta bu dngos po'i gnas tshod la gtan nas med kyang/rang 'dzin rtog pa'i yul du 'jog pa lta ba ni mtshan nyid yongs su chad pa'i kun btags su khas len pa yin}
kun btags gnyis|{mtshan nyid yongs su chad pa'i kun btags dang rnam grangs pa'i kun btags so/}
kun btags nyid nyid ngo bo nyid med pa|{sgra rtog gis btags pa la ma ltos par grub pa med pa}
kun btus|{byams pa dang 'brel ba'i chos nyi shu'i nang gses sdom rnam gnyis kyi ya gyal zhig ste/theg pa thun mong gi sdom (chos mngon pa kun las btus pa )zhes pa slob dpon thogs med kyis mdzad pa bang po lnga'i bdag nyid can gyi bstan bcos shig /de'ang nyan thos pa dang thun mong du phyi rol gyi rnam par bzhag pa dang/rnam 'byor spyod pa dang thun mong du mtshan nyid rnam pa gsum dang/rnam par shes pa tshogs brgyad la sogs pa'i rnam par bzhag pa gsungs pa'i phyir theg pa thun mong gi sdom zhes pa dang/brjod bya mtshan nyid kun las btus pa dang/bden pa rnam par nges pa dang/chos rnam par nges pa dang/thob pa rnam par nges pa dang/'bel gtam rnam par nges pa ste bam po lngar bsdus nas ston/rgya gar gyi mkhas po dI paM ka ra shrI dz+nyA na dang lo tsA ba tshul khrims rgyal bas bsgyur cing zhus pa'o/}
kun rtog 'og 'gyu'i 'phros gleng|{sems la dogs pa dang the tshom sna tshogs shar ba'i dbang gis skabs 'phral gyi gnas tshul la dbye zhib dang ma 'ongs pa'i 'gyur ldog la tshod dpag med pa'i gtam gleng}
kun rtogs brgyad cu|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags bla med kyi gzhung phal che ba las gsungs pa'i kun rtog brgyad cu ni/snang ba'i rang bzhin gyi rtog pa sum cu so gsum/mched pa'i rang bzhin gyi rtog pa bzhi bcu/nyer thob rang bzhin gyi rtog pa bdun bcas yin cing/'dir grangs 'dren tsam las so so'i ngos 'dzin dang/skye tshul/phra rags kyi khyad par/ring bzhin 'gag tshul dang/slar yang rim bzhin skye tshul sogs zhib phra dpal gsang ba 'dus pa'i bskyed rdzogs kyi khrid yig rnams las gsal bas 'dir ma bkod lags}
kun brtags brgyad|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi rub mtha' smra ba bzhi'i nang gses dbu ma pa rnams kyis kun btags brgyad ces 'jog tshul yod/de yang/1 bdag /2 sems/3 srog/4 skye ba po/5 gsol ba po/6 gang zag /7 shed las skyes/8 shes bu bcas rnams grangs brgyad po de ni dngos po'i gnas tshod la dbang bsgyur byed mkhan bdag po med kyang/bdag po yod pa lta bur bcos nas gang zag gi rnam grangs brgyad du btags pa yin te/nyer len gyi phong po lnga la bdag dang bdag gi bar 'dzin pas na bdag dang/chos rnams kyi gnas lugs yang dag pa ji bzhin ma shes pa'i dbang gis rang gi lus srog la chags shing zhen par byed pas na sems can dang/rang nyid kyi tshe dang lhan cig tu gson zhing gnas pas na srog dang/yang nas yang du 'byung ba'i srid pa'i lam gyis rgyas par byed pas na gso ba po dang/skyes bu'i rtsal byed pas na skyes bu dang/yang dang yang du srid pa 'khor ba'i gnas su skye ba la mi ngoms shing tshod mi shes pas na gang zag dang/bskal pa dang por chags pa'i mi rnams pha ma'i khu khrag la mi ltos par yid kyi rnam pa tsam las skyes pas na shed las skyes dang/nga rgyal la brten nas mtho dman du 'gyur bas ni shed bu dang/las byed pa po yin pas na byed pa po dang/tshor ba bde sdug btang snyoms gsum myong ba po yin pas na tshor ba po ste/gang zag gi bdag med kyi stong gzhi gang zag de la ming gis rnam grangs brgyad kyi sgo nas btags pa yin no/}
kun bde gling|{ming gzhan brtan bzhugs chos 'khor gling yang zer zhing de ni rta tshag ho thog thu bstan pa'i mgon pos btags gnang mdzad pa zhig yin/dbus gtsang kun bde gling dgon pa zhes grags pa de ni/gong ma chan lung khri lo drug cu'i skabs gor kha btsan 'dzul dmag bod du 'byor pa rnams mthar skrod btang nas/dbus gtsang gnyis kyi sa che bde 'jags su bkod par dran gso zhu ba'i ched du gong mas dgon ming la dbus gtsang kun bde gling zhes btags te rgya sog bon man gyi yig 'brub bzhi'i sgo byang gnang ba de nas ming de thogs pa yin/gdon pa 'di bar ma ri'i lho ngor su bskrun yod pa dang tshan tsan kung ha'o lan khra pa thu sogs man ju'i dpon rigs mang pos zhal 'debs phul nas bskrun thog rje drung ho thog thu'i bzhugs gnas su phul ba yin cing/cha na lung lo lnga bcu nga dgur (1794)lor bskrun zin nas bod bzhugs am ban nang blon zhu'o hri dang le'u phre lang gnyis kyi rtsom yig 'bri sa yang byed kyi yod pa red/(deng sang rang skyong ljongs 'grim 'grul thing gi sne len khang yod sa de yin/) rje drung ho thog tu ni bod du mtshan snyan ha cang chen po yod pa'i bla sprul gyi gras shig yin cing der chos lugs kyi khyab khongs nas gnas bab shin tu mthon po yod pa ma zad/sku phreng drug pa'i rjes nas bod kyi chab srid khyab khongs su'ang gal che'i shugs rkyen yod la dbang cha'ang ha cang chen po yod pa red/gong ma tshan lung khri long lnga bcu nga bdun skabs gor kha'i btsan 'dzul dmag mthar skrod btang rjes h+phu khang an gyi gtso skyong 'og bod kyi las don phyed phyogs bcu bsgrogs byes pa'i rtsa 'dzin don tsam nyer dgu'i nang gi don tshan bco brgyad par slad phyid dgon sde khag gi mkhan po sprul sku 'debs bsko byed skabs tA la'i bla ma dang/bod bzhugs am ban/rje drung ho thog thu sogs grol mol gyis gtan 'bebs byed pa dang sbrags gsum po'i thab ga brgyab pa'i bka' yig spros dgos pa'i gtan 'bebs byas yod pa red/rje drug ho thog tu khyod bsdoms sku phreng bcu gcig byung ba'i nang sku phreng brgyad pa blo bzang ye shes bstan pa'i mgon po (khong gi lo rgyus zur du gsal/) bod kyi chos srid gnyis ka'i thog shugs rkyen che shos yin pa dang kun bde gling ni khong gis srid skyong gnang skabs skrun rgyu'i 'ga' bzhes gnang ba red/khong sku na gzhon nu'i skabs mkhas chen dpal ldan grags pa dge rgan du brten thog /1771lo nas 1781lo bar bka' ltar rgya nag tu slob sbyong la phebs shin phyir log phebs rjes slar yang 'bras spungs dgon sgo mang grwa tshang du slob gnyer gnang/1789lor slar yang bka' ltar rgya nag tu phebs nas pe cin gyi tham ga bla ma'i mtshan snyan thob pa dang bka' dang len gyis bod du phebs nas tA la'i la ma'i srid don phyag las la rab 'degs gnang stabs sbi lig thu no min han gyi go gnas thob/rta tshag rje drung nas srid skyong rgyal tshab 'gan bzhes gnang ring rgya bod mi rigs dbar gyi mthun sgril la phan pa'i bya ba mang po gnang yod cing/lhag par du ching rgyal rabs srid gzhung la gzhogs 'degs kyis gor kha'i btsan 'dzul rgol lan srog pa'i las don nang ching srid gzhung gi mthong chen thob pa dang/1792lor gong kha'i dmag thag chod rjes ching rgyal rabs kyi nang blon h+phu khang an gyis srid tshab rta tshag bstan pa'i mgon po dang mnyam gros kyis kun bde gling dgon pa gsar bskrun byas thog h+phu khang an ngo mas dngul srang bdun brgya zhal 'debs brgyab pa dang/ha'o lan khra sogs dpon mdag gis kyang gcig mjug gnyis mthud ngang zhal 'debs brgyab pa/rta tshag bstan pa'i mgon po mchog nas kyang dngos shugs 'bor chen gcig bton pa bcas byas nas ri steng ga 'od 'phro lha khang dang/re sked gyi kon tis lha khang/ri gsham gyi kun bde ling dgon pa bcas phyag btab gnang ba red/kun bde gling gzhi khyod ha cang che zhing dgon pa'i mtha' bskor du sngo ljang can gyi ljon shing gis khengs pa dang khang pa phan tshul sbrel nas yod pa de dag mdzes sdug lta bas mi ngoms pa zhig yod/kun bde gling gi thog brtsegs khang pa gtso bo thog so bzhi yod pa dang tshang ma rdo brtsigs yin khar rtsig pa'i steng du spen bad yod pa dang de'i steng du gser 'od 'phro ba'i rgyal mtshan/gan je ra bcas yod/khang pa gtso bo'i dkyil dbus su mtho zhing che ba'i mchod khang khang mig lnga yod ci nga/de'i dbus ni mtho tshad thog so gsum tsam yod pa/mchod khang gi rgyal ngos ni lha khang yin cing de'i dbus su ka ba bzhi ldan gyi khang mig gcig yod/de'i nang rten gyi gtso bo tsong kha pa dang/gzhan yang lha sku ha cang mang po yod/g.yas g.yon gnyis su ka phab gnyis yin pa'i rten mkhar re yod pa de'i nang srung ma sna tshogs kyi sku brnyan yod/blo bzang ye shes bstan pa'i mgon po'i sku mdung de gser zags thog rin chen sna tshogs kyi khra rgyan ldan yod/de min sku gdung gzhan gnyis yod pa ni sku phreng dgu pa rje drung sprul sku blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan dang sku phreng bcu pa rje drung sprul sku ngag dbang dpal ldan chos rgyal rgyal mtshan gyi dngul gdung yin cing/der gser gyi ga'u dang rin chen sna tshogs kyis brgyan yod/mchod khang lte ba'i bkod sgrig byed tshul la'ang 'gyur ldog btang yod cing dkyil dbus su sku phreng brgyad pa rje drung bstan pa'i mgon po'i bzhugs khro yod pa dang da dung gser zangs kyis bzhengs pa'i rje yab sras gsum gyi sku dang/bshad srol la dngul gyis lugs brgyab pa yin zer ba'i bstan pa'i mgon po sogs skyip+saku 'dra yon/mchod khang gi rtse thog tu yod pa'i gzim chung khag gi nang ching rgyal rabs kyi gong ma rim byung gis gtang ba'i bya dga'i sgo byang dang nor bu'i rigs bkal ba dang nyar tshags byas yod pa red/kun bde gling gi mdun ngos su rdo ring gi khang bu yod pa de'i thon ni rdza g.yam g.yu rtsi ma yin cing mtho tshad spyi khre gsum dang grangs chung bzhi yod pa de'i nang du yod pa'i rdo ring gi thug rgya bod yig rigs gnyis las gor kha'i mtshan 'dzul mthar skron du btang ba dang/kun bde gling mchod khang gi sgo khang dang/rgyal sgo/tshoms chen khag tha na mdzod khang bcas tshang ma'i bdun du sgo byang bkal yod pa de dag ni ching rgyal rabs dang/bod bzhugs am ban/de bzhin de'i gnam 'og dpon rigs bcas yis sprad pa zhig red/de ni rjes drung sprul skus mes rgyal gyi gcig gyur dang mi rigs mthun sgril gyi slad du legs skyes phul ba gsal por mtshon pa zhig red}
kun 'dus nor bu'i lugs|{bla ma bsgom stangs la lugs gsum yod/bla ma dang yi dang sangs rgyas sogs cha tshang bar sgom pa de la khrom tshogs kyi lugs/bla ma de yid dam gyi dbu'i steng na bzhugs par sgom pa de bla ma rigs bdag gyi tshul du sgom ba'i lugs/yi dam dang sangs rgyas bla ma sogs mang po sgom mi dgos par bla ma gcig bsgoms nas de nyid skyabs gnas thams cad kyi ngo bo yin par bsam pa de la kun 'dus nor bu'i lugs shes zer ro/_}
kun ldan gtsang pa ras chung pa|{mtshan dngos zhi ba tshul khrims zhu zhing/yongs grags su kun ldan ras pa zhes 'bod/'gro mgon phag mo grub pa'i p+salob ma grags cing zhig ste/rab byung gsum pa'i sa 'brug (1148)lor gtsang stod shab tu skru 'khrungs/dgung lo nar son nas rang nyid kyi khu bo rgyal tsha rin chen mgon mjal bar dbus su phebs pas khu bo mchog 'gro mgon phag mo grub pa'i sku drung du rje btsun mi la'i rnam thar gsan nas bzhugs pa dang mjal te mnyam du gsan nas nga yang de lta bu zhig byed 'don ces zhus/khu bos 'gro mgon la lnga ya lo rgyus zhus pas shin tu mnyes nas gdams ngag rnams cha tshang bar gnang/khams su phebs na gdul bya che zhes lung bstan gnang yang/khro phur phebs nas sgo sgrub la brtson par mdzad/gdan sa phag po gru'i gtsug lag gang gi nub rgyud rnams bzhengs pa'i 'gas bzhes mdzad/dgung lo bdun cu pa rab byung bzhi pa'i me glang (1217)lor gtsang stod 'dzad kyi shar phyogs bya phug tu sku gshegs/lo rgyus rags bsdus tsam zhig (lho rong chos 'byung )shog grangs 259nas 260bar gsal zhing (deb ther sngon po )dang (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )gnyis su lo rgyus mdor bsdus tsam las mi gsal}
kun ldan ras pa|{rin po che rgyal tsha'i gcung po/'di nyid rab byung gsum pa'i sa 'brug (1149)lor sku 'khrungs/phag mo grur gcen po'i rgyags skyel du byon pas rje btsun mi la'i rnam thar gsung ba dang thug /de 'dra ba zhig ngas kyang bya'o snyam nas chos grwa der mgo lcog lcog lan gsum byas/'gro mgon phag mo gru par gdams pa zhus te bsgoms pas rtog par khyad par can 'khrungs/grub thob chen por gyur te mu ge byung ba'i tshe khro phu'i mchod khang gi p+sago la phyag mkhar gtug gtug mdzad nas rnam 'byor ma rnams de ring rnal 'byor pa la bsod snyoms shig zhu'o gsungs pas mchod khang gi sgo bar nas nas phyir mang du byung/yul mi thams can kyis blangs kyang zhag lnga'i bar du nang ma zad pa'i grub rtags kyang bstan skad/mthar dgung lo bdun cu pa rab byung ba'i ci gling (1217)lor sku gshegs}
kun nas khru bzhi|{ngos snyoms gru bzhi pa'i phyogs bzhi kar khru bzhi re yod pa'i go don min par phyogs ngos rer khru gang re yod pa bsdoms pa'i khru bzhi longs par go dgos}
kun nas nyon mongs pa'i rten 'brel drug|{rnam par shes pa 'byung ba'i rten 'brel/skye ba dang 'chi 'pho 'byung ba'i rten 'brel/rgyun mi chad pa phyi'i rten 'brel/chags nags 'jig pa snod gyi rab tu dbye ba'i rten 'brel dang/zas bzhis 'tsho ba'i rnam par dbye ba'i rten 'brel dang/'dod pa dang mi 'dod par 'gro ba rab tu dbye ba'i rten 'brel rnams so/_}
kun nas mnar sems pa'i rgyu dgu|{'dis bdag la sngar gdon pa byas so/_/da lta byed do/_/ma 'ongs pa na byed par 'gyur ro snyam du sems pa gsum dang/bdag gi gnyen la sngar gnod pa byas so/_/da lta byed do/_/ma 'ongs pa na byed par 'gyur ro snyam du sems pa gsum/bdag gi dgra bo la sngar phan pa byas so/_/da lta byed do/ma 'ongs pa na byed par 'gyur ro snyam du sems pa gsum bcas dgu yod/de dag ni rang nyid kyis gzhan la gnod legs skye pa'i gzhi rtsa chen por 'gyur ba yin pas na ming de ltar btags pa yin}
kun spangs|{'jig rten 'di'i lto gos gtam gsum la dmigs pa'i bya spyod dang/gtam brjod/bsam blo bcas yongs rdzogs spangs nas chos rnam dag byed mkhan zhig la zer}
kun spangs chos grags dpal bzang po|{kun mkhyen jo nang pa'i thugs sras gtso bo bcu gsum du grags pa'i nang gses shig ste/'khrungs yul rgyal rtse ra lung du rab byung lnga pa'i chu lug (1283)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun pa chos sgor zhugs te /'dul mngon rig gnas rnams lam khas par sbyangs/dgos lo nyer gcig la dbus gtsang gnyis su grwa skor mdzad/dgung lo nyer gsum par jo nang mkhas btsun yon tan rgya mtsho'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyer lnga la kun mkhyen nor po ba dang mjal nas rang lugs kyi chos skor mtha' dag gsan zhing (gzhi lam 'bras bu'i rnam bzhag )sogs gsung rtsom kyang mi nyung ba zhig yod/dgung lo rgya gcig pa rab byung drug pa'i chu yos (1363)lor byang pa bdag po si rdi'i ming can gyis sku bkrongs so/_/lo rgyus mdor bsdus tsam (jo nang chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 32nas 33bar gsal}
kun spangs thugs rje brtson 'grus|{jo nang pa'i grub mtha'i bzhes srol thog mar srol gtod mdzad pa po ste gtsang stod mdog gi dang ba phyar du bar byung bzhi pa'i chu yos (1243)lor sku 'khrungs/sa skya dang 'dar sogs dbus gtsang gi grwa sa chal che bar slob gnyer mdzad/'dar dang don mo ri/skyang 'dur bcas kyi zur chos pa dang chos dpon mdzad/kun mkhyen chos sku 'od zer la mnga' ba'i chos rgyun thams cad gsan cing/spyir sbyor ba yan lag drug gi khrid rgyud mi 'dra ba khag bcu bdun tsam gsan nas nyams bzhes mdzad/chos 'chad nyan thogs kyi spros pa mi mdzad par sgom sgrub gtso bor mdzad pas kun spangs pa zhes mtshan thogs/sku tshe'i smad du jo nang gi dgon par phyag btab nas gtso cher gnas de nyid du bzhugs te bshad pa dang gdams ngag gnyis ka'i slob ma mang du bskyangs pas jo nang pa'i brgyud 'dzin thog mar byung/dgung grangs don gcig tu phebs pa rab byung lnga pa'i shing byi (1324)lor dgongs pa ngan las 'das/lo rgyus cong zan rgyas pa (jo nang chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 20nas 21bar gsal}
kun spangs lha dbang rdo rje|{sde srid gtsang pa'i mi thog dang po zhing shag pa tshe brtan rdo rje la bu rgan gzhon dug byung ba'i nang nas grags pa can gyi bu gsum ste karma mthu stobs rnam rgyal/kun spangs lha dbang rdo rje/karma bstan srung gsum yin zhes spel ser bas bris pa'i (karma bstan skyong dbang po'i khrims yig zhal lce bcu drug )gi 'go brjod nang gsal zhing/karma pa sku phreng dgu pa dbang phyug rdo rje'i rnam thar nang skabs der kun spangs lha dbang rjes gzhis ka bsam 'grub rtser srid dbang bzung ba dang/bstan srungs dbang po pa rnams nor bu khyung rtser yod tshul tsam las de min gyi lo rgyus gsal ba ma mthong}
kun phan nyin byed|{'di yang nyi ma'i ming gi rnam grangs nyi mas mi dang/dud 'gro/'jig rten khams kyi rtsi shing nag tshal sogs la drod gtong bas na kun phan dang/'jig rten tshang ma nyin mor bsgyur mkhan yin pas ni nyin mor byed pa dang nyin byed zer}
kun byang phyogs gnyis|{kun nas nyon mongs phyogs dang rnam byang phyogs gnyis/'di na bden pa bzhi'i nang nas rgyu kun 'byung bden pa dang/de'i 'bras bu sdug bsngal bden pa gnyis ni spang bya 'khor ba'i phyogs yin pas kun nas nyon mongs kyi phyogs dang thar pa thob byed kyi rgyu lam gyi bden pa dang de'i 'bras bu 'gog pa'i bden pa ni blang bya thar pa'i phyogs yin pas na rnam par byang ba'i phyogs zhes brjod pa yin}
kun byed kyi rgyud|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur rdzogs pa med po la klong skor dang phyi skor gnyid yod pa'i nang gses gnyis pa phyi skor la rnam grangs dang 'gyur lugs gnyis las rnam grangs la rgya gar du dgu yod/1 rgyud sde/2 sems sde/3 klong sde/4 bam po'i skor/5 mdo lung/6 rdzogs chen ma bu'i skor/7 man ngag rdzong 'phrang gi skor/8 man ngag snyan brgyud kyi skor/9 man ngag bsam gtan gyi skor )pa dang 'gyur lugs ni rgya gar gyi yul du rdzogs pa chen por rgyud sde mang du yod kyang bod du bsgyur ba bcu drug yod (rtsa ba'i rgyud lnga/yan lag gi rgyud bdun/bshad pa'i rgyud bzhi )cing/bshad pa'i rgyud bzhi'i nang gses gnyis pa ni kun byed rgyal po'i rgyud yin par (klong chen chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 293las gsal}
kun byed rgyal po ma bu dgu skor|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur rdzogs pa chen po'i bshad rgyud bzhi'i nang gses kun byed rgyal po'i rgyud la ma bu skor dgur phye ba ste/1 kun byed rgyal po rtsa ba'i rgyud thos pa'i shes rab la gdams pa le'u lnga bcu nga bdun/2 rgyud phyi ma bsal byung gi shes rab la gdams pa le'u bcu gnyis pa/3 rgyud phyi ma'i phyi ma sgom byung gi shes rab la gdams pa le'u bco lnga pa/4 kun byed bshad pa'i rgyud mdo bcu/5 spyi'i bshad rgyud 'khor ba rtsad gcod/6 lta ba nam mkha' dang mnyam pa'i rgyud le'u bcu gsum/7 sgom pa rgya mtsho dang mnyam pa'i rgyud le'u bdun pa/8 spyod pa nyi zla dang mnyam pa'i rgyud le'u bcu gcig pa/9 'bras bu rin po che dang mnyam pa'i rgyud le'u bcu gcig pa bcas yin par (myang stod smad bar gsum gyi lo rgyus )jo nang tA ra nA thas mdzad pa las gsungs shing (klong chen chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 294nas 11bar kun byed rgyal po ma bu skor dgu'i grangs 'dren tshul 'di dang mi 'dra ba zhig 'khod pa ma zad skor dgu'i nang nas gcig chad skyon byung 'dug pa ma dpe khungs dag cig nas kha skong mdzad gnang yod pa zhu'o/}
kun byed rgyal po ma bu sum skor|{'di'i grangs 'dren tshul gang yin da phan zhal gsal 'khod pa zhig ma mjal bas 'ol tshod kyis bri bar ma nus so/}
kun 'byung gnyis|{'khor bar 'phen pa'i las kyi kun 'byung dang/de kun nas slong byed kyi nyon mongs dug gsum gnyis ni sdug bsngal kun 'byung ba'i gzhi rtsa lta bu yin pas kun 'byung zhes brjod srol yod}
kun sbyor dgu|{rjes su chags pa'i kun sbyor/khong khro ba'i kun sbyor/nga rgyal gyi kun sbyor/ser sna'i kun sbyor ro/_/de yang kun sbyor dgu po ni 'khor bar 'phen byed kyi rtsa ba nyon mongs dug gsum dang 'brel ba dam po yod cing/dug po gang zhig kyang rang rgyud la ldan pa'i gang zag de 'khor ba'i gnas su sdug bsngal dpag tu med pa myong du 'jug par byed pas na kun sbyor zhes brjod srol yod}
kun rdzob|{spyir na stong pa nyid kyi lta bas ma zin pa'i byang chub kyi sems la zer zhing/zhib par phar phyin skabs dang po'i sems bskyed kyi skor dang (spyod 'jug gi 'grel pa )khag la gsal}
kun rdzob kyi snang ba|{kun rdzob te thams cad bslu bar byed pa'i don gyis so/_/grangs can pa'i lugs kyi kun rdzob kyi snang ba ni/ji srid rang bzhin dang/skyes bu gnyis gcig tu zhen nas/rnam 'gyur rnams rtsa ba'i rang bzhin gyis sprul pa'i tshul ma shes par yul la longs spyod pa de srid du skyes bu de'i rgyud la kun rdzob kyi snang ba dang bcas pa yin/nam zhig skyes bu des yul gyi nyes dmigs mthong nas chags pa dang bral bar gyur pa dang spyi gtso bo de 'khor ba'i rtsa bar mthong bas na gtso bo las rnam 'gyur gsar du mi spros shing/rnam 'gyur rnying pa rnams nye bar bsdus/skabs der gtso bo de bdag tu mi 'gro zhing bral bar 'gyur te 'ja' ltar yal ba de'i tshe skyes bu de'i rgyud la kun rdzob kyi snang ba thams cad dang bral ba yin zer/de yang dper na/mtshan mo mun nag gis khyab pa'i khang pa'i nang du skyes bu 'dod chags can dang bud med mdze can zhig dga' ba dang bcas pa las skyes bu der mdze nad bgos te sdug bsngal mi bzod pa myong ba bzhin dang/gang gi tshe nam langs pa na bud med mdze can yin pa shes pa de'i tshe skyes bu 'di nam yang de dang lhan cig 'dris par mi byed cing/bud med der ches bltas byas pas ngo tsha bas skyengs te 'dod chags kyi rnam 'gyur rnams nye bar bsdus nas bros pa bzhin no/_}
kun rdzob rgyu 'bras|{nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i grub mtha' smra ba'i nang nas dbu ma pa rnams kyis rgyu la brten nas 'bras bu 'byung ba dang rgyu dge sdig gnyis la brten nas 'bras bu bde sdug gnyis 'byung ba/rgyu 'bras gnyis kyi gnas lugs mthar thug ma yin kyang/tha snyad tshad ma'i snang ngor rang ngos nas grub pa ltar snang zhing/stong nyid mngon sum du rtogs pa'i 'phags pa rnams kyis ni rang ngos nam ma grub pa'i rgyu las rang ngos nas ma grub pa'i 'bras bu 'byung bar mkhyen pas na kun rdzob rgyu 'bras zhes zer}
kun rdzob 'jig rten pa'i dbang bzhi|{1 bum dbang/2 gsang dbang/3 sher dbang/4 tshig dbang bcas yin}
kun rdzob gnyis|{yang dag pa'i kun rdzob dang log pa'i kun rdzob ste nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i grub mtha' smra ba'i nang gses dbu ma rang rgyud pa rnams kyis kun rdzob yang dag kun rdzob dang/log pa'i kun rdzob gnyis yod par khas len zhing/yang dag kun rdzob ni tha snyan dpyod pa'i tshad ma'i snyed don yin pa gang zhig /rang nyin snang ba'i blo la nyi ltar snang ba ltar don byed dus pa'i chos shig la zer zhi nga/dper na/mngon sum gyi shes pa la snang ba'i gzugs sgra dri ro la sogs pa lta bu dang/log pa'i kun rdzob ni tha snyad dpyod pa'i tshad ma'i snyed don byed mi nus pa'i chos shig la zer zhing/dper na me long nang gi byad bzhin gyi gzugs brnyan lta bu yin/de yang yul gyi sgo nas phye ba ma gtogs yul can la yang dag kun rdzob dang log pa'i kun rdzob kyi dbye ba 'byed srol med/zhib par phan phyin gyi bde gnyis thad du gzigs par zhu}
kun rdzob bden pa|{1 bye brag smra ba'i lugs ltar na mdzod las/gang la bcom dang blo yis gzhan/_/bsam ne de blo mi 'jug pa/_/bum chu bzhin du kun rdzob tu/_/yod de zhes pa ltar chos ga ngal bcom byed kyis bcom pa dang/sel byed kyi blo cha gzhan bsal bas der 'dzin yi blo 'dor du rung ba'i chos ni kun rdzob bden pa ste/dper na bum pa dang bum pa'i nang gi chu lta bu'o//bum pa tho bas bcom pa na bum 'dzin gyi blo 'dor ba'i phyir dang bum nang gi chu'i kha dog dang dri ro sogs blos cha gzhan bsal ba na bum chu 'dzin pa'i blo dor ba'i phyir ro/_/2 mdo sde pa'i lugs ltar na/rtog pas btags tsam gyi chos de'i mtshan nyid/sgra don rnams de'i mtshan gzhi/bum pa'i sgra don can/khyod la kun rdzob bden pa zhes brjod pa'i rgyu mtshan yod de spyi 'dzin rtog pa ni blo kun rdzob pa yin la/khyod de'i ngo bor bden pas na kun rdzob bden pa zhes bshad pa'i phyir/3 sems tsam pa'i lugs ltar na/kun nas nyon mongs pa skye rung gi chos tha snyad pa de kun rdzob bden pa'i mtshan nyid/mtshan gzhi ni bum pa dang/ka ba lta bu'o/_/sgra bshad ni/btags pa dang shes pa dang brjod pa'i kun rdzob gsum gyi ngor bden pa'am yod pas na kun rdzob bden pa zhes brjod/de la dbye na/gzhan dbang dang kun btags kyis bsdus pa'i kun rdzob bden pa gnyis yod/dang po dang 'dus byas don gcig /gnyis pa dang don nam bden pa las gzhan pa'i 'dus ma byas kyi chos rnams don gcig /3 dbu ma rang rgyud pa'i lugs ltar na/rang mngon sum rtogs pa'i mngon sum tshad mas gnyis snang dang bcas pa'i tshul gyis rtogs par bya ba de kun rdzob bden pa'i mtshan nyid/de yang kun rdzob ni 'khrul bcas kyi blo'i shes ngor rang las tha dad du snang ba dang bden grub tu snang ba'i sgo nas rtogs par bya ba de la kun rdzob bden pa zhes brjod pa yin/mtshan gzhi ni bum pa lta bu'o/_/5 dbu ma thal 'gyur ba'i lugs ltar na/rtog pas btags tsam du grub pa'i chos de kun rdzob bden pa'i mtshan nyid/yang na/don dam par don byed mi nus pa'i chos de kun rdzob bden pa'i mtshan nyid/mtshan gzhi ni/nam mkha' dang/gang zag gi don spyi lta bu'o/_/kun rdzob bden pa/rtag pa/spyi mtshan rnams don gcig yin/sgra bshad ni/'dus ma byas kyi nang mkha' sogs chos can/khyod la kun rdzob bden pa zhes bya ste/blo kun rdzob pa rtog pa'i ngo tsam du bden pas na/kun rdzob bden pa zhes brjod pa'i phyir/kun rdzob bden pa zhes ba'i tshig zur gyi kun rdzob de rtog pa la byed cing khyod de'i ngo tsam du bden pas so/_}
kun rdzob byang chub kyi sems|{bdag gzhan mnyam brje'i byang chub kyi sems la stong pa nyid kyi lta bas ma zin pa la zer/zhib par phar phyin skabs dang po'i sems bskyed kyi skabs su gsal}
kun rdzob gsum|{nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i grub mtha' smra ba bzhi'i nang tshan sems tsam pa rnams kyis kun rdzob la sgras brjod rigs kyi sgo nas dbye na gsum ste/1 btags pa'i kun rdzob dang/2 shes pa'i kun rdzob/3 brjod pa'i kun rdzob dang/btags pa'i kun rdzob ces pa ni tha snyad dang ming 'dogs pa'i gzhir gyur pa la zer zhing/shes pa'i kun rdzob ces pa'i ni 'jig rten tha snyad pa'i shes pa'i yul yin pa la zer ba dang/brjod pa'i kun rdzob ces pa ni don gcig la tha snyad sna tshogs pa'i sgo nas brjod du rung ba la zer ba bcas yin/kun rdzob de gsum gang rung yin na kun rdzob yin pas khyab pa med kyang sgra bshad 'jug rung gi dbang du byas nas kun rdzob ces btags pa yin/zhib par phar phyin gyi drangs nges sems tsam pa'i skabs gsal lo/_}
kun gzhi|{'di sems tsam pas khas len pa'i kun gzhi'i rnam shes zhes pa de min/'dir kun gzhi ni bka' brgyud pa rnams kyis/'khor ba dang/myang 'das gnyis kyi gzhi rtsa sems gsal zhing rig pa de la zer/de nyid dang po nas sangs rgyas kyi ngo bor yod pa la/de ltar ngo ma shes na 'khor bar 'khyams pa dang de ltar rtogs na sangs rgyas rang ngo 'phrod pa yin pas/rang sems 'khor 'das kun gyi gzhi ma de sangs rgyas su khas len zhing dge lugs pas de ltar khas mi len no/_}
kun gzhi'i rnam shes|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi grub mtha' smra ba'i bzhi'i nang gses sems tsam pa rnams kyis rnam shes tshogs brgyad (1 mig gi rnam shes/2 rnam ba'i rnam shes/3 rna'i rnam shes/4 lce'i rnam shes/5 lus kyi rnam shes/6 yid kyi rnam shes/7 kun gzhi'i rnam shes/8 nyon yid bcas )khas len zhing/de'i nang tshan kun gzhi'i rnam shes de la rigs gnyis yod pa ste/rten du gyur pa rnam smin gyi kun gzhi dang/brten pa sa bon gyi kun gzhi gnyis yin/rten du gyur pa rnam smin gyi kun gzhi zhes pa ni/khyad chos bzhi dang ldan pa ste/1 dmigs pa'i khyad par ni gzugs sogs yul lnga dang/dbang po lnga dang/bdag dang/chos kun btags pa'i ngo bo de nyid la zhen pa'i bag chags la dmigs pa dang/2 rnam pa'i khyad par ni snod kyi 'jig rten dang bcud kyi sems can sogs rnam par shes pa rang nyid la snang yang nges shes 'dren mi nus pa/3 ngo bo'i khyad par dge mi dge gang gi yang ngo bor mi gnas pas ma sgrib lung ma bstan yin pa/4 grogs kyi khyad par ni/sems byung kun 'gro lnga/(1 tshor ba dang/2 'du shes/3 sems pa/4 reg pa/5 yid la byed pa )dang mtshungs ldan du yod pa bcas yin/de yang dge mi dge'i las dang sems bzang ngan kun gyi bag chags 'dzin zhing dus kun tu rgyun mi chad par/theg dman gyi lhag med myang 'das dang/theg chen gyi sgom lam rdo rje lta bu'i ting nge 'dzin gyi bar du 'jug pa zhig yin/brten pa sa bon gyi kun gzhi zhes pa ni/bag chags bsgo byed rnam shes kyis bag chags bsgo gzhi kun gzhi'i rnam shes kyi steng du rang nyid 'gag pa la mngon du phyogs 'i tshe dge mi dge lung ma bstan gsum gyi bag chags bzhag pa'i nus pa de la zer/de yang khyad chos lnga dang ldan pa zhig ste/1 glog lta bu'i mi brtan pa ma yin pas rgyun chags pa/2 dge mi dge'i sems ha cang gsal ba dang mi gsal pa med pas lung ma bstan yin pa/3 mi rtag pa yin pas bag chags bsgo bar nus pa/4 bsgo byed dang bsgo gi skye 'gag dus gcig tu byed pa'i 'brel ba dam po yod pa/5 mtha' gcig tu bag chags bsgo ba'i rten du gyur pa bcas yin/bag chags kyi go don skor log gi ba sde'i nang gi bag chags ces pa'i 'grel bshad kyi skabs su gsal}
kun gzigs mthong ba don ldan|{'di ni 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng gsum par che brjod kyis 'bod pa'i mtshan yin cing/rnam thar lo rgyus mdor bsdus kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa blo bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho zhes pa'i 'grel bshad du gzigs}
kun gzigs pho brang|{gdan sa chen po bkra shis lhun po'i bla brang rgyal mtshan mthon po dang 'dabs 'brel du yod pa'i pho brang gi ming ste/rab byung bcu bzhis pa'i me bya (1837)lor paN chen rin po che sku phreng bdun pa bstan pa'i nyi ma dgung lo nga bdun du phebs skabs gsar skrun gnang zhing/mtho tshad thog brtsegs bzhi dang/rgya khyon ka ba brgya dang drug cu re gnyis/steng thog la gzims chung phan bde kun 'khyil/gzims sbug shar nub bcas su sku rgyu li ma las grub pa'i tshe dpag med kyi stong sku gsung thugs rten grangs las 'das pa bzhugs yod}
kun bzang|{1 byang chub sems dpa' nye ba'i sras brgyad kyi nang tshan byang chub sems dpa' kun tu bzang po dang/2 gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi gzhung nas gsungs pa'i chos sku kun tu bzang po bcas gnyis kar go dgos pa'i skabs mi 'dra ba yod kyang skabs 'dir (mchan/skabs 'dir zhes pa ni (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )mi rigs dpe skrun khang gi 1986lo'i lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 291thog kun bzang la rig 'dzin gyis bskor nas chos rnams rang bzhin nyid kyis dag ces pa 'dir go dgos )ni phyi ma ste sku mdog dkar po yum dang bcas pa bzhugs stangs rgya ba rdo rje 'chang dang 'dra ba la sku la na bza' dang rgyan gang yang med par gcer bu pad zla'i gdan la bzhugs pa zhig yod do/}
kun bzang rdo rje grags pa|{stod mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal brgyud cig ste rgyal po khri kun dga' blo gros dang yum gu ge ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung dgu pa'i sa phyi (1528)lor 'khrungs/thog mar chos sgor zhugs te bkra shis nam gling dgon gyi spyi gnyer dang/chos dpon/mkhan po bcas rim par mdzad kyang/mnga' ris gung thang rgyal po'i gdung rgyud dkon thog rkyen gzhan du ma'i dbang gis rgyal po rnam 'phrul gyi phyag rogs dang sbrags khyim pa'i tshul du bzhugs dgos byung/de yang rang byung dgu pa'i shing stag (1554)lashor bdag mo yar 'brog ma dang mi ngan gzhan gros mthun gyis bdag mo gu ge ma bkrongs shing/khri kun bzang nyi zla grags pa dang/kun bzang rdo rje grags pa gnyis kyang bkrongs rtsis byas te gshed ma btang yang sgo mang/nam ling/phu lag gsum gyi ram 'dab slebs te bkrongs ma thub/bdag mo gu ge ma bkrongs mkhan rnams la srog thog gi khrims gcod dang/bdag mo yar 'brog ma rang yul du phyir slog btang/de'i phyi lo slar yang bdag mo yar 'brog ma'i rgyab skyor du rin spungs kyi dmag dpung gis dpal khud dang la stod lho yang bcom ste dbang du bsdus par brten kun bzang rdo rje grags pa rang nyid ngo ma dmag dpon du phebs nas rin spungs pa'i dmag dang 'thab ra sprad pas rin spungs pa'i dmag pham nas lho shel dkar rdzong blangs thog /lho bdag po'i rgyal bu rgan gzhon gnyis rin spungs pas mi gter 'dzin bzung byas pa yang rin spungs pa'i lag nas blangs te rgyal kha thob/dgung lo so brgyad pa rang byung dgu pa'i shing lang (1565)lor 'das/zhib par (bod kyi lo rgyus deb ther khag lnga )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 139nas 141bar gsal}
kun bzang me long brag dkar|{mdo smad khri ka'i mkhar gyi g.yon ngos ko ra'i lung pa dang nye ba'i srin po ri'i zhol du yod pa'i sgrub sde zhig ste/brag dkar sngags rams pa blo bzang bstan pa rab rgyas kyis thog mar phyag btab/dge 'dun pa nyi shu lhag tsam bzhugs pa rnams chos khrims dang chos kyi byed sgo gtsang zhing/dus bzang dang dus chen khag ma gtogs gtso bor mtshams bcad dge sbyor kho nar bzhugs srol/zhib par gong gsal (mdo smad chos 'byung )lcags dpar mar gzigs}
kun bzang tshogs ma bsags sgrib pa ma sbyangs par sangs rgyas pa|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi gzhung 'ga' zhig gi spyi bshad skabs gsung tshul de 'dra zhig yod 'dug par de la grub mtha' gzhan phyogs pa'i mkhas pa rnams kyis tshogs ma bsags sgrib pa ma sbyangs pa'i sangs rgyas shig yod par thal ba dang/rang ngo rang gis mi shes pa'i sangs rgyas shig yod par thal ba dang/sangs rgyas thams cad mnyam pa nyid gsum gyis mi mnyam par thal ba sogs kyi dgag pa mdzad mkhan byung yod kyang/gong gsal gyi gsung tshul de'i go don la dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng ba rang nyid kyis 'grel bshad mdzad skabs/'khor 'das gang yang med pa'i sngon ni chos nyid kyi ngo bo nyid la 'khor 'das gang yang med pa dang/chos nyid kyi rang ngo shes pas kun bzang tshogs ma bsags sgrib pa ma sbyangs par sangs rgyas pa ste/de ni/rgyud las skad cig gcig gis rdzogs sangs rgyas/_/skad cig gcig pa'i bye brag phyed/_/ces gsungs pa sems kyi rang ngo shes na skad cig nyid du grol ba dang de'i 'od lnga ye shes lnga dang sku lnga sogs kyi 'grel bshad mdzad 'dug pa 'dir rags bsdus tsam du bkod pa lags}
kun bzang la rig 'dzin brgyad kyis bskor ba|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur rnying ma'i gzhung nas gsungs pa'i kun tu bzang po la 'khor rig 'dzin brgyad kyis bskor ba ste/gtso bo chos sku kun tu bzang po sku mdog sngon po yab yum zhal sbyor rgyal ba rdo rje 'a chang gi bzhugs stangs dang 'dra ba la na bza' dang rgyan med pa'i gcer bur bzhugs pa de'i 'khor du rig 'dzin brgyad de/1 sku'i rig 'dzin slob dpon 'jam dpal bshes gnyen/2 gsung gi rig 'dzin slob dpon 'phags pa klu sgrub/3 thugs kyi rig 'dzin slob dpon hUM ka ra/4 yon tan gyi rig 'dzin slob dpon bi ma la mi tra/5 'phrin las kyi rig 'dzin slob dpon pra b+ha ha sti/6 dbyings kyi rig 'dzin slob dpon rom+bu guh+ya tsan+d+ra/smod pa drag sngags kyi rig 'dzin slob dpon shan+tim garba bcas kyis bskor ba zhig yin}
kun yang chu yi rgya mtsho chen por gyur|{gna' rabs bod kyi lo rgyus dpe deb mang po'i nang bod kyi sa cha 'di thog mar chus gang ba'i sa khul zhig yin pa dang/rjes su mtsho chu de rnams kong po smad kyi rgya la seng gtam zer ba'i ri'i khog pa brdol nas rgya gar shar phyogs kyi a sam dang/b+ham ga la brgyud hin d+hu rgya mtsho chen por 'bab pa nas rim gyis skam sa dang/nags tshal sogs chags pa yin zhes shod srol yod pa ltar krung hwa mi dmangs spyi mthun rgyal khab dbu brnyes rjes ri 'dzegs lus rtsal pa dang/tshan rig mkhas pa mang pos stod mnga' ris sa khul gyi jo mo glang ma'i ri rtser zhib tshags kyis rtog zhim dang brtag dpyad byas skabs lo ngo dung phyung lnga'i sngon nas bye ba gsum gyi gong bar gyi sa gshis dus skabs so so'i g.ya' rdo'i chags rim nang du rgya mtsho'i gting du 'tsho ba bskyal ba'i nya dang/byi ru/mtsho rtsa sogs srog chags dang/rtsi shing gi 'gyur rdo ha cang mang po rnyed pa de'i thog nas/lo ngo dung phyug nyi shu lhag tsam gyi gong du ri bo hi ma la ya'i sa khul de mtsho khul zhig yin par ra sprod byung ba dang chabs cig/sa babs de las dma' ba'i dbus gtsang khams gsum sogs skabs der chus gang ba'i sa khul zhig yin par gsal bshad byas yod/zhib cha (dri ba khri bcu )zhes pa'i rgya yig gi dpe deb ang 8par gzigs}
kun rig|{rnal 'byor rgyud kyi rtsa rgyud (de nyid bsdus pa )la nang gses dub bu bzhi (1 rdor dbyangs/2 khams gsum rnam rgyal/3 'gro 'dul/4 don grub )yod pa las/dum bu gnyis ngan song thams cad yongs su sbyong ba'i rgyud kyi khongs gtogs (bcom ldan 'das nang song thams cad yongs su sbyong ba gzi brjid kyi rgyal po'i rtog pa )nas gsungs pa'i lha zhig gi mtshan yin/yongs grugs su kun rig rnam par snang mdzad ces zer/'di la spyi bka' dang zur bka'i dbang gnyis yod pa'i spyi bka'i dbang ni mi tra brgya rtsa'i mthun mong ma yin pa'i lha drug cu re drug gi nang tshan nyi shu rtsa drug par yod cing/zur bka'i dbang ni tho yon bla ma rin po che ye shes don grub kyis phyogs bsgrigs mdzad pa'i (dkyil chog nor bu'i phreng ba )dang/sa skya blo gter dang pos phyogs bsgrigs gnang ba'i (chog sgrogs )pod (cha)pa'i nang yod}
