kun slong gnyis|{las bzang can 'bring gsum gang brtsams kyang thog mar las de bya 'dod kyi bsam pa zhig skyes nas las de brtsam gyi yod pas/de 'dra'i bsam pa de la kun slong zhes brjod pa cing/de la nang gses kyis dbye na gnyis te/1 rgyu'i kun slong dang/2 dus kyi kun slong gnyis yod/de'i dang po rgyu'i kun slong zhes pa ni/bya ba de ma brtsams gong gi bya ba de dang de byed 'dod gyi bsam blo zhig yod pa de yin/gnyis pa dus kyi kun slong zhes pa ni/bya ba de dngos su byed dus kyi bsam blo de la zer/de 'dra'i kun slong rigs gnyis po de yi nus pa mi 'dra ba ni/rgyu yi kun slong gis bya ba de la zhugs pa'i 'bad brtson skyed par byed cing/dus kyi kun slong gis bya ba de mthar thon par byed pa yin/der zhar byung kun slong de gnyis gtso bo che chung gi khyad par dang rgyu'i kun slong dang dus kyi kun slong la dge mi dge lung ma bstan rigs 'dra ba gsum dang/rigs mi 'dra ba gsum yod tshul/de gnyis bar mu bzhi yod tshul bcas (mchims mdzod )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 351nas 353bar gsal ba der gzigs}
kun+da lta bu'i byang sems|{me to ku mu ta'i mdog ltar kha dog dkar ba'i byang chub kyi sems zhen pa'i don te/skyes pa'i yul la khu khrag gnyis yod pa'i nang gses khu ba ni lus kyi zungs thams cad kyi gtso bo yin cing/de ma nyams par bzung ba la brten nas gnang sngags kyi rtogs pa gong nas gong 'phel du 'gro ba dang/mthar thug sangs rgyas kyi gzugs sku mtshan dpes brgyan pa 'grub thub pa yin pas na byang chub kyi sems zhes nus pa'i sgo nas ming btags pa yin}
