ke'u tshang nub ri khrod|{ra kha brag gi shar du yod pa'i ke'u tshang nub ri khrod ni dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i nang ser byes mkhan zur byams pa smon lam gyis btab/khong ni ke'u tshang sku phreng dang po yin/de gar gung thang bla ma zhang gi sgrub phug dang/rje tsong pa pa'i sgrub khang la nyams gsol dang/sgrub khang brtsigs te bzhugs skabs 'jog po blo bzang rnam grol sogs slob ma mang po 'dus/dge 'dun gyi sde chags/ke'u tshang sprul sku sku phreng na rim nas zhal 'dzin gnang/rten gtso gser zangs kyi rje btsun byams pa mgon po'i sku de dang/brag ldebs su thub dbang gi sku bskos pa de rnams se ra shar dur khrod kyi gtan chags khar zhal gzigs yod pas se ra shar du bskyal ba'i phung por 'pho ba mi dgos zer srol yod/ke'u tshang ri khrod chags dbyibs brag ri rngam brjid ldan pa'i steng du yin stabs sge khung nas bltas tshe g.yang gzar che bas thur du blta mi nus mkhan yang yod/bzo skrun ngo mtshar che ba des bod kyi ar las bzo pa'i blo gros dang/lag rtsal gyi khyad chos mngon pa zhig yin/rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag lor grwa tshad dge slong nyi shu rtsa yang yin yang bla brang gi las byed dang dge slong tsho'i dge phrugs sogs mi grangs 80 zin skad/dgon bdag ke'u tshang bla brang nas byed}
ke'u tshang byams pa smon lam|{ser byes kyi mkhan thog bcu bdun pa yin/rnam thar lo rgyus zhib gsal da phan ma mjal yang ser smad 'jog ri ngag dbang bstan 'dzin gyis mdzad pa'i (rang rnams dwangs shes me long )shing dpar shog grangs 28nas 30bar/byes mkhan chen byams pa smon lam dang/ser smad mkhan chen grags pa mkhas grub/ser sngags mkhan chen rdzi tho chos ldan pa rnam gsum mkhan thog gcig la dus mtshungs su 'khel ba ma zad/mkhas btsun bzang gsum gyi sku yon mnyam 'gran lta bur bzhugs pa dang/rgyun du mkhan rin po che rnam gsum phan tshun thugs nad mthun zhing/spyi don dang grwa tshang so so'i don skor gang la'ang phyogs ris su phye ba'i gsung gleng dang gnang sgo'i rigs mngon lkog gang du yang mthong thos med stabs/khong rnam pa gsum gyis mkhan po gnang ring gdan sa chen po'i 'dul khrims slob gnyer gang ci'i thad bstan pa'i mig rgyan du che ba'i mdzad rjes 'gran zla bral ba yung tshul mdor bsdus gsungs pa'i mjug tu/gdan sa chen po'i las sde gnang mkhan tshor sems la bcang rgyu'i bslab bya mang po zhig bkod par mdzad 'dug /sku tshe'i smad du mkhan po dgongs zhu gnang ste se ra'i rgyab ri'i shar ngos su yod pa'i ke'u tshang nub kyi ri khrod du bzhugs ste sgrub pa nyams bzhes rtse gcig tu mdzad /mthor rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags khyu (1790)lor dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/sku gshegs khar zhal chems phyag bris dang gnang rten kha btags bcas rdo ring bka' blon bstan 'dzin dpal 'byor dang lcam rnam rgyal sgrol ma gnyis la gnang ste /rab dbang 'dus tsam byung na rdo ring gi bur skyes thub pa'i re ba yod cing/de 'dra byung na nges par du chos sgor bcug thub pa gnang dgos zhes gsungs pa ltar dgongs pa rdzogs pa'i phyi lo lcags phag (1791)lor rdo ring bka' blos bstan 'dzin dpal 'byor gyi sras su 'khrungs/ser byes grwa tsang du slob gnyer mdzad pa de'i mtshan la yongs grags su ke'u tshang blo bzang 'jam dpal smon lam zhu ba de yin cing/gsum rtsom pod gnyis ke'u ri khrod du dpar shing yod pa de yin/nye dus su thon pa'i (gsung 'bum dkar chag )'ga' zhig nang tra hor du 'khrungs pa'i brag 'go ke'u tshang sprul sku dang/khams phyogs mu lir 'khrungs pa dga' ldan khri thog re bdun pa 'jam dbyangs smon lam dang nor nas dkar chag bkod 'dug kyang/dga' ldan khri chen 'jam dbyang smon lam ni khams smu lir 'khrungs shing 'bras spungs blo gsal gling du slob gnyer gnang ste shar rtse brgyud dga' ldan khrir phebs pa zhig yin lags}
ke'u tshang bla ma rnam grol|{ke'u tshang nub yi bla ma blo bzang rnam grol zhes lam rim bla brgyud kyi gras su bzhugs pa de yin cing/rwa sgreng khri chen bstan pa rab rgyas kyi slob pa yin/'di'i n+ma thar khong gi dngos slob chos mdzad blo bzang bkra shis kyis mdzad pa zhig yod tshul rje shes rab rgya mtsho'i (dpe rgyun bkod pa 'ga' zhig gi tho yig )nang 'khod 'dug da phan lag tu ma son pas rjes su 'tshol dgos}
