ko brag pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan|{chos lugs 'di yin gyi dmigs bsal med cing grub mtha' ris med kyi slob ma shin tu mang ba'i la chen zhig yin/'khrungs yul ding ri dang/rus rgyud ldong/yab gtso bo rgyal g.yung dang yun sdom mo rje ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i chu stag (1182)lor 'khrungs/chung dus 'bri klog dka' tshegs mi dgos par mkhyen/kha che paN chen shAkya shri dang/bla ma rdo rje dpal ba/rgya phug jo sras/paN chen rar+Na shri sogs bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/dgung lo nyi shur phebs skabs chos rje skos kyis mkhan po dang/phya ru 'dul 'dzin gyis slob dpon/slob dpon los gsang ston mdzad nas rab byung dang bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan la bsod nams rgyal mtshan zhes gsol/gangs ti ser lo lnga'i ring sgom sgrub la bzhugs pas nyams rtogs kyi rtsal phul du byung ba thob cing myang stod rgyal rtse'i ko brag dgon pa btab nas der gtso bor bzhugs pas ko brag pa zhes grags/bstan 'gro'i don rgya cher mdzad nas dgung lo brgyad cu pa rang byung bzhi pa'i lcags bya (1261)lor dgongs pa rdzogs/rnam thar zhib pa da phan kho bos ma 'jal lags}
ko bzo|{ri dwags sna tshogs kyi pags pa mnyed 'dul byas te gos dang/zhwa/lham/lto phad/phor pa/sder ma/sgam/khrab/ko gru/mi dang srog chags kyi 'dra gzugs sogs bzo ba'i lag rtsal la zer/bod du gna' rabs bskal pa ya thog zhing las ma dar ba'i sngon du 'tsho ba'i rten sa 'brog las dang/nya las/ri dwags rngon pa bcas yin pas thon skyed byed pa'i go rim nang ri dwags dang gcan gzan sna tshogs kyi 'gul bskyod chos nyid dang/lpags pa'i khyad chos/nad gso ba'i nus pa bcas shes rtogs thub ste pags rigs kyi gyon pa dang/zhwa lham lto phad sogs bzo shes pa dang/spyi lo'i dus rabs dang po'i yas mas su slebs skabs ko ba las bzos pa'i phor pa dang/sder ma/stabs bde'i go khrab bcas bzo shes pa red/dus rabs brgyad pa'i dkyil du rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis srid dbang bzung skabs rgyal pos rgyun du blta klog byed rgyu'i dpe cha'i gras ('bum rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum )dang gal che'i sman gzhung 'ga' zhig sha ba'i pags pa las bzos pa'i sgam gyi nang du 'jug pa'i dbang gis ming la yang rgyal po'i bla yig sha sgro can zhes 'bod pa'i gnang tshul skor (bka' 'gyur dkar chag )mang po'i nang 'khod yod/ko gru ni spyi lo'i dus rabs bdun pa'i 'khor rgya bza' 'un khren kong jo rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i btsun mor 'byor skabs dga' bsu zhus pa'i dmangs gzhas khag cig nang (chu mo rgya chu rong la zhed dgos med/_/ko ba nag chung brgya yi bsu ma yod )ces gtong srol 'dug cing/dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i mjug tu bu mo snang sa 'od 'bum zer ba nyang stod ri nang nas rgyal rtser bros byol la 'gro skabs myang chu'i nang ko gru btang nas bros pa'i shod rgyun yang yod/dus rab bco lnga pa'i 'gor grub thob thang stong rgyal po sku na gzhon dus khong gi 'khrungs yul gtsang stod lha rtse'i shar phyogs dam phug zer ba'i sa char ko gru'i 'bab tshugs shig yod tshul rnam thar nang gsal/po ta la'i pho brang dmar po gsar bzhengs skabs chu thog gi skyel 'dren yo byad gtso bo ni ko gru yin pa dang/der nyin lam gcig gi sar 'grul bskyod byed thub par brten/ar po'i rgyu cha shing sogs lho kha nas lha sar ko ba'i nang dbon 'dren byed pa dang/lha sa'i lho phyogs skyid chu'i 'gram bde chen ko sa nas lha gdong shan kha'i ko sa bar ko gru'i thog dbor 'dren byas pa'i gnas tshul skor (gser gdung 'dzam gling rgyan gcig )gi dkar chag nang gsal/de yang ko bo gru bzhi cha mnyam bzhi mgo mjug tu sbrel ba'i steng du spang leb rnams bzhag thog ka chen dang/rdo chen/ka ring dang/rdo ring bcas bsnyal nas bzhag pas chu thog gi skyel 'dren la stabs bde ba'i khyad chos mang po yod pa dang/chu dang/ko gru/spang leb gsum gyi lding lugs la tshan rig dang mthun pa'i bed spyod byas pa des rgya che'i bod rigs mang tshogs kyi blo gros cha tshad gsar por mthong bu/skabs der ko bzo ba khag gcig gis ko gru bzo nga ba dang/khag gcig gis ko ba'i sgam dang/ko 'bog /'breng thag /thab ka'i kha shur sogs bzos dgos ko bzo mkhas pa yod tshad phyogs bsdus byas pa'i nang (sne'u mgon po sogs )mi grangs brgyad bcu gya lnga yod cing/bod kyi ko bzo'i lag rtsal skor gong gsal dpe deb der gzigs}
