kong po de mo'i rdo brkos yi ge|{btsan po khri lde srong btsan gyis kong po'i dkar po mang po rje la gnang ba'i bka' gtsigs kyi yi ge rdo la brkos pa zhig yin/rdo bskor yi ge de'i gnas yul ni/bod rang skyong ljongs kong po nyi khri rdzong khongs sman ri chus go 'jo shang gi g.yung drung 'dzin grong tsho'i nye 'gram du yod pa'i pha bong chen po zhig gi lho nub kyi ldebs ngos su brkos yod cing/de nyi 'od dang char rlung gi gnod 'tshe phog tshad chung ba'i bya skyibs lta bu'i 'og tu brkos yod par brten/yang 'bru rnams kyang ngos chod thub nges kyi gsal po yod/rdo yig 'di brkos pa'i dus tshod thang bka' gtsigs 'di dang lo rgyus yig cha gzhan dag gang du yang mi gsal rung/btsan po khri lde srong btsan gyis srid dbang bzung ba'i dus skabs spyi lo 797nas 815bar gyi lo bco lnga'i ring der yin pas da phan mi lo 1200ma zin tsam zhig song zin bka' gtsigs 'dir bod kyi lo rgyun thog gal che ba'i gdan don khag drug gsal bshad byas yod/1 rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po nas gri gum btsan po phan chad gdung rabs bdun byung ba'i ring pho brang phying dbar stag rtser bzhugs pa/2 rgyal po gri gum btsan po la sras gnyis yod pa'i gcen ni nya khyi dang/gcung ni sha khyi yin pa gsal zhing/sras phya khri zer ba yod tshul mi gsal ba/3 kong dkar po mang po rje la yab khri srong lde btsan gyi skabs bka' gtsigs gnang ba der slar yang rgyab gnon gyi bka' gtsigs 'di nang tshul/4 sras gcen gcung gnyis ka rgyal po gri gung btsan po'i sras yin pa 'dra yang gcung po'i gdung rgyud rnams kyis btsan po'i rgyal srid bzung ba dang/gcen po'i gdung rgyud rnams kong dkar po mang po rje'i rgyal phran gyi go gnas tsam du bsdad pa der yab khri srong lde btsan gyi dus su dpya khral dang/lo re'i rten 'bul sogs gang yang mi dgos par kong po'i khul du rang skyong rgyal phran gyi tshul du gnas chog pa'i bka' gtsigs gnang yod pa/5 sa gnas kyi dpon rigs 'ga' zhig gis dkar po mang po rje'i sar nas khral gsar pa sdud pa'i bsnyad gtser byas pa de phyin chad yab ri srong lde btsan gyi bka' gtsigs su 'khod pa bzhin khral rigs