kong sprul yon tan rgya mtsho|{mtshan gzhan 'jam mgon kong sprul rin po che/yon tan rgya mtsho blo gros mtha' yas/pad+ma gar dbang 'phrin las 'gro 'dul rtsal bcas mi 'dra ba snang/rab byung bcu pa'i chu bya (1813)lor mdo stod 'bri zla zal mo sgang gi pad+ma lha rtse'i mdun rol rong rgyal sbas pa'i ljongs su yab khyung rgyal bstan 'dzin g.yung drung dang/yum bkra shis mtsho'i sras su sku 'khrungs/dgung lo chung ngu'i dus nas byin pa gzhan dang mi 'dra ba'i mdzad spyod ngo mtshar che ba zhig yod pa dang/bzo dang gso ba rig pa sogs thengs re gsan gzigs byung ba tsam gyis mkhyen zhing thugs rgyud drang la/spyod lam zhi zhing dul ba/gang brtsams mdzad pa mthar 'don pa la zhum pa med pa sogs skye bo phal pa las khyad du 'phags pa'i yon tan du ma mnga' ba dang/zhe chen paN+Di ta 'gyur med mthu stobs rnam rgyal/si tu rin po che pad+ma nyin byed/'jam dbyangs mkhyen brtse'i dbang po sogs grub mtha' ris med kyi bla ma dge ba'i bshes gnyen lnga bcu lhag tsam bsten nas sgrub brgyud shing rta chen po brgyad kyi chos brgyud bod yul du yod pa yongs rdzogs gsan bzhes mdzad/gang gsan pa thams cad nyams len la 'khyor bar gnang zhing/slob ma rnams la rang rang gi 'dod mos dang 'tshams pa'i pod dgu bcu lhag tsam yod pa'i nang nas gtso che ba ni mdzod chen po lnga ste/(shes bya kun la khyab pa'i mdzod )dang/(gdams ngag rin chen gter mdzod/) (rgya chen bka' yi mdzod )bcas yin/gzhan yang snga 'gyur gyi gdams pa mang po'i gter bzhes pa dang/sku gsung thugs rten gsar bzhengs dang nyams gso/dge 'dun yi sde mang por bsnyen bkur sogs mdzad 'phrin rgya cher bskyangs/dgung grangs rgya bdun bzhes pa rang byung bco lnga pa'i shing rta (1894)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs/rnam thar skor kha byang du (phyogs med ris me kyi bstan pa la 'dun zhing dge slong gi gzugs brnyan 'chang ba blo gros mtha' yas kyi byung ba brjod pa nor bu sna tshogs kyi mdog can )zhes 'khod pa rang nyid kyis mdzad pa la shog grangs 83yod pa der gsal}
kong tse|{'di la bod yig thog bshad tshul mi 'dra ba 'ga' zhig snang zhing/thu'u bkwan chos kyi nyi mas mdzad pa'i (grub mtha' shel gyi me long )gi nang gses ma hA tsi na'i yul du rig byed dang grub mtha' byung tshul gyi thad she'u 'am bzhu {(WP:1,194)}zhes grags pa'i gzhung rtsom pa po khung h+phu tsi'am kong tshe zhes su grags pa ming gi rnam grangs yin pa dang/rgya skad gyi sgra bod skad thog ji bzhin ma thon par kong tse zhes zur chag pa yin par gsungs shing (mdo smad chos 'byung )las kyang de dang 'dra bar gsungs/'di nyid byung ba'i dus tshod skor (thu'u bkwan grub mtha' )las/sangs rgyas 'jig rten du byon nas lo ha cang mi mang tsam na/Ti'u wang zhes pa'i rgyal rabs kyi mjug tsam Ti'u wing wang {(WP:1,194)}gi dus su rgya nag gi zhing sa chen po bcu gsum gyi ya gyal shan dung gi yul byung zhing/lo rgyus dang rnam thar rgya yul kun tu grags che zhing skyes mchog khyad par can zhig yin par snang zhes gsal/1979lor hrang he'i tshig mdzod chen mo )shog grangs 1119thog khung tsi zhes pa'i 'grel bshad nang gsal bar/khung tsi (spyi lo'i gong 551nas 479ni khrun chi'u dus mjug gi bsam blo mkhas can dang/chab srid mkhas can/slob gso mkhas can/ming gzhan khung chi'u {(WP:1,194)}dang/krung nyi yang zer/khrun che'u dus rabs kyi lu'u rgyal khab kyi sa gnas tso'u ye ste deng sang hran tung gi chus h+phu grong tsho'i mi red/gzhon nu'i dus skabs su lu'u rgyal khab kyi khrims dpon dang/blon chen gyi las tshab kyang byas myong/lo na mtho por slebs rjes slob gso'i las ka dang/gna' rabs kyi gzhung khag gcig phyogs bsgrigs byas pa'i nang nas lu'u rgyal khab kyi lo rgyun zin tho (khrun chi'u ){(WP:1,194)}la bcos sgrigs byas pa de ni rang rgyal gyi thengs dang po'i cha tshang ba'i lo rgyus ched rtsom zhig yin/khong la slob ma sum stong lhag tsam byung ba'i nang nas snyan grags yod pa'i slob ma bdun cu lhag tsam yod cing/gong gis byams skyong dang/gus bkur sogs chab srid skyong stabs kyi rnam bzhag mang po zhig bshad pa rnams slob ma rnams kyis rgyas 'grel byas pa la rgya skad du si hru'u zhes bod skad du deb bzhi'am yig cha bi zhes 'bod pa de yin par bshad/rgyal nang gi rgyal rabs mang po'i ring chab srid skyong stangs dang/khrims lugs/mi chos byed lugs sogs khung tsi 'dis byas pa'i lugs kyi bstan bcos tshad mar bzung ba dang/rgyal srid kyi slob dpon du rtsis nas khung tsi'i 'dra brnyan dang ming byang la rgyal po rim byung gis yag 'tshal ba dang/khung tsi'i mi brgyud la gung gi go gnas gnang srong yod pa'i thog /da lta'i gung 'di khung tsi nas rtsis pa'i mi rabs don gsum pa yin zhes (thu'u bkwan grub mthar )gsal/(mkhan nag lo tsA ba'i chos 'byung )las byams pa 'bum gling (deng sang kan su zhing chen gyi yung ching rdzong khongs rma chu'i 'gram du yod pa )gi byams pa de kong tshe 'phrul gyi rgyal pos bzhengs tshul gsungs pa de ni kong tse dang ming 'dra ba tsam las don mi 'dra/khung tsi'i lta grub skor mdor bsdus tsam (thu'u bkwan grub mtha' )kan su'u dpe skrun khang gis bton pa'i lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 394nas 296dang shog grangs 402nas 404bar gsal ba der gzigs}
