kong+ku na|{(gser gyi sa )rgya gar lho phyogs rgya mtsho chen po'i 'gram kong ku na pU ra zer ba'i yul de yin cing/(thang san rang rnam )bris ma'i shog grangs 133ba 1las/kong ka na pu ri'i yul de'i khor yug tu le dbar lnga stong lhag dang/mkhar grong chen po'i mtha' 'khor du le dbar sum cu lhag sa rgyu legs tsam dang/gnam gshis drod shas che bas 'bru rigs gang yang 'debs rung ba/mi'i rang bzhin te lus rtsub cing spro thung ba/slob sbyong la dga' zhing yon tan can la brtsi bkur che ba/gtsug lag brgya lhag tsam gyi nang dge 'dun khri tsho lhag bzhugs shing theg pa che chung mnyam par spyod pa/mu stegs pa'i lha khang yang brgya phrag mang po yod pa'i nang yi rol pa'i lta ba sna tshogs 'dzin mkhan 'dres mar gnas pa dang/rgyal po'i khang khyim gyi nye logs su gtsug lag khang chen po zhig la dge 'dun sum brgya lhag tsam bzhugs pa rnams 'dul khrims dang kun spyod gtsang bar skyong ba yod/gtsug lag khang de'i gtsang khang chen po rgya khyon khru brgya ('dom nyi shu rtsa lnga )tsam yod pa'i nang ston pa sangs rgyas sku gzhon nu'i skabs dbu la bzhes pa'i sprog tu mtho tshad khru do tsam la rin po che'i khra rgyan mang pos btab pa zhig rin po che'i sgrom gyi nang du bcug pa yod/grong khyer gyi nye 'dabs su gtsang khang zhig nang ro bzhin skyes sna ba bye ba ris bzhengs pa'i tsan+dan las grub pa'i rgyal ba byams pa'i sku brnyan yod pa dang/grong khyer gyi byang phyogs su shing tA la'i nags tshal rgya khyon rgyang grags sum cu ('dom chig khri lnga stong )tsam gyis khyab nas yod pa sogs gong gsal gyi rnam thar der gsal zhing/yul 'di dang mgon po klu sgrub kyi bzhugs gnas lho phyogs dpal gyi ri gnyis thag nye bar slob dpon zla ba grags pas mdzad pa'i (gsang rgyud rtsa rgyud kyi 'grel pa sgron las )las kyang gsungs so/_}
