ko'u ba chos rgya mtsho|{tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtsho dang paN chen sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyi dngos slob/sku 'bum gdan sa chen po'i mkhan thog gnyis pa yin/rab byung bcu pa'i ljags lug (1571)lor skar ma thang du yab bsod nams rin chen dang yum pad+ma 'tsho'i sras su 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun nas bcu bdun gyi bar 'khrungs yul dang thag nye ba'i dgon gsum du chos zhugs gnang ste/bla ma chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyi drung du chos bka' mang po gnas/tA la'i bla ma bsod nams rgya mtsho mtsho sngon du phebs pa dang mjal te rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo bcu dun pa la khu bo chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyis mthun rkyen gnang ba ltar dbus gtsang du phebs/dga' ldan khri chen byams pa rgya mtsho dang/sgom sde shar pa nam mkha' rgyal mtshan sogs bsten nas bsdus grwa dang/phar phyin/dbu ma/'dul mdzod bcas slob gnyer gnang/dgung lo nyer drug pa me spel lor dge bshes gling bsre'i dam bca' bzhag /de'i phyi rol bkra shis lhun por phebs/dkyil khang pa sangs rgyas rgya mtsho bsten nas rnam 'grel la slob gnyer mdzad/dgung lo nyer brgyad pa sa khyi lor dben dgon du phebs nas paN chen rin po che lo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes shing/gzhan yang mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/rgyud smad grwa tsang du yun mi rung tsam bzhugs nas/mkhan chen rnam rgyal dpal bzang gi drung nas gsang 'dus bskyed rdzogs dang 'grel pa sogs gsan/gzhan yang 'bras spungs sngags pa slob dpon nam mkha' bzang po/dga' ldan khri chen stag lung brag pa blo gros rgya mtsho sogs kyi drung nas gsang sngags kyi dbang khri lung sogs gsan/dgung lo so bzhi pa shing 'brug lor rang yul du phebs/dgung lo zhe bdun pa me sbrul (1416)lor sku 'bum dgon pa'i khrir phebs dus bskyangs te khri thog dgongs zhu gnang rjes an chung gnam rdzong/rgod po rdzong/brag dkar ri khrod bcas su thugs dam nyams bzhes gtso bor mdzad/dgon gsar ri khrod lhun grub chos rdzong btab rjes der bzhugs nas slob ma mang por rang rang gi 'dod mos ltar chos bka' stsal/dgung