kyai rdo rje|{nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i gsang sngags bla na med pa'i rgyud kyi nang tshan ma rgyud la rgyud sde mi 'dra ba mang du yod pa'i nang nas kyai'i rdo rje'am (dgyes pa rdo rje'i rgyud )nas gsungs pa yi dam gyi lha zhig yin/de yang kyai'i rdo rje rigs bsdus dang rigs ng+la so so'i lha gnyis yod pa las/rigs bsdus lha zhe lnga ma dang/rigs bsdus lha nyer lnga ma/de la sgo ma bzhi bsnan pa'i lha nyer dgu ma bcas kyai rdor gyi thun mong ma yin pa'i bshad rgyud (rdo rje gur )las gsungs/rigs so so ba la rigs lnga yod pa'i rdo rje'i rigs/1 sku kyai'i rdo rje zhal gcig phyag gnyis pa/2 gsung kyai'i rdo rje zhal gcig phyag bzhi pa/3 thugs kyai'i rdo rje'i zhal gsum phyag drug pa/4 snying po kyai'i rdo rje zhal brgyad phyag bcu drug pa bcas rigs bzhi'i dkyil 'khor (rtsa rgyud )las gsungs shing/de rnams yab gtso bor gyur pa'i dkyil 'khor yin/yum gtso bor gyur pa'i lha mo bco lngas bskor ba ni/(rtsa rgyud brtag gnyis )dang/kyai rdor gyi thun mong ma yin pa'i bshad rgyud (rdo rje gur )las gsungs/phyag bcu drug pa rigs gzhan bzhi ni (bshad rgyud rdo rje gur )las gsungs/kyai rdo rje zhal gcig phyag gnyis pa yum med pa dang/zhal gsum phyag drug pa lha mo drug gis bskor ba ni/bde mchog dang kyai rdor thun mong gi bshad rgyud (sam b+hu Ta )yi brtag pa dang po'i rab byed bdun par gsungs/kyai'i rdo rje drug po mtshon cha can lha bcu bdun ni (bshad rgyud sam b+hu Ta )yi rab byed dgu pa dang nyer brgyad pa gnyis las gsungs pa bcas zhib par mkhas grug chen po che dge legs dpal bzang pos mdzad pa'i (brtag gnyis rnam bshas rdo rje'i mkhar 'a gro ma rnams kyi gnang mdzod )dang/gzhan yang karma pa rang byung rdo je /bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan/theg chen chos rje kun dga' bkra shis/bo don paN chen 'jigs med grags pa/stag lung zhabs drung ngag dbang rnam rgyal bcas kyis mdzad pa'i (kyai rdor rtsa brgyud brtag gnyis )kyi 'grel pa rnams la gzigs/kyai rdor 'di la lugs mi 'dra ba bcu yod pa ste/1 'grel pa lugs sam mtsho skyes lugs/2 grong lugs sam mar lugs/3 Dom b+hi lugs/4 nA ro lugs/5 nag po lugs/6 man ngag lugs sam thod pa can/7 zhi ba sbas pa'i lugs/8 dz+nya na lugs/9 lus dkyil/10 mtshon cha can bcas yod pa dang/de dag gi dbang mang che ba ni tho yon bla ma rin po che ye shes don grub kyis phyogs bsgrigs gnang ba'i 9dkyilachog nor bu'i phreng ba )nang yod cing/'ga' zhig sa skya blo gter dbang pos phyogs bsgrigs gnang ba'i (sgrub dkyil kun btus )nang du yod pas de dag la gzigs par zhu}
kyai rdo rje man ngag lugs|{snying po kyai'i rdo rje grub chen bir wa pa'i lugs kyi ming gi rnam grangs ste/grub chen bir wa pa dang mkhyen rtogs mnyam par grags pa grub chen Tom b+hi he ru kaHyi man ngag la brten nas (bshad rgyud rdo rje gur )gyi rjes su 'brangs te slob dpon mi thub zla bas (sgrub thabs yan lag drug pa )sogs mdzad pa der kyai ra man ngag lugs zhes su grags shing/de'i dbang lung khrid sogs sa skya'i bla chen rim byon brgyud nas dge lugs phyogs su yang phyag bzhes kyi rgyun yod pa de yin}
