kyai rdor gyi rgyud gsum|{rtsa ba'i rgyud brtag gnyis/bshad pa'i rgyud rdo rje gur/man ngag gi rgyud rdo rje sam b+hu Ti'o/_/kyai rdor rje'i rtsa rgyud la rgyas pa 'bum phrag bdun yod pa dang/'bring po la 'bum phrag lnga yod/bsdus pa la brtag pa gnyis pa la le'u bcu gnyis bcas yod pa'i nang bsdus pa brtag pa gnyis pa ni thog mar 'brog mi lo tsA ba shAkya ye shes kyis bsgyur zhing/rjes su 'gos lo gzhon nu dpal gyis 'gyur ba rnams kha skong mdzad/(bshad rgyud rdo rje gur )'di rtsa rgyud 'bring po 'bum lnga la ltos te bsdus rgyud dang/(rtsa rgyud brtag gnyis )la ltos te bshad rgyud yin pa le'u bco lnga yod/'brog mi lo tsA ba'i 'gyur (bshad rgyud sam b+hu Ta )'di bod snga rabs yi bla ma mang po zhig gis kye rje'i bshad rgyud yin par bzhed/bu ston rin po ches rgyud 'di ma rgyud mang po zhig gi bshad rgyud yin par ma zad/lhag par du bde mchog gi bshad rgyud yin par bzhed pa bzhin sde dge zhus chen tshul khrims rin chen gyis kya bu ston rin po che'i bzhed pa de don la gnas par gsungs/rgyud 'di la brtag pa bcu dang/brtag pa re re la rab byed bzhi re yod pa/rgyud phyi ma dang bcas pa 'brog mi lo tsA ba'i 'gyur yin/gong gsal rgyud dang po gnyis sde dge bka' 'gyur rgyud pod (nga)pa'i nang yod cing/(rgyud sam b+hu Ti )ni rgyud pod (ga)pa'i nang yod}
