kyai'i rdo rje'i rgyud|{kyai'i rdo rje'i rgyud zhes pa gzhung gi ming yin/de yang nang pa sangs rgyas kyi chos lugs thom mar srol gtod mdzad pa po na pa sangs rgyas shAkya mu nes rdo rje 'chang gi rnam par sprul nas gsang sngags kyi rgyud sde'i rnam grangs mi 'dra ba mang du gsungs pa'i nang tshan ma rgyud kyi bye brag (kyai'i rdo rje'i rgyud )'di la rtsa rgyud dang/bshad rgyud/cha mthun gyi rgyud bcas gsum yod/de'i nang gses rtsa rgyud la rgyas pa brtag pa sum cu so gnyis le'u stong phrag sum cu/sho lo ka 'bum lnga yod pa de la ('bum lnga dgyes pa rdo rje )zhes zer zhing/'di bod du ma 'gyur ba 'dra/(rgyud brtag pa gnyis pa )ni rgyud rgyas bsdus te gsungs pa'i rgyud cig yin/'di la brtag pa gnyis yod cing brtag pa dang po la le'u bcu gcig dang brtag pa gnyis pa la le'u bcu gnyis yod/'di dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i 'khor 'brog mi lo tsA ba shAkya ye shes kyis bon skad du bsgyur/de rjes lo tsA ba chos kyi blo gros kyis zhun chen dang gtan 'bebs gnang ba las lo tsA ba gzhon nu dpal gyis 'gyur chad 'ga' zhig kha gsab gnang tshul (sde dge bstan 'gyur gyi dkar chag )nang gsal/rtsa rgyud 'di'i rtag pa gnyis kyi le'u so sos brjod don gtso bo gang bstan pa dang/don de dag lag len du khyer ba'i lam gyi go rim gang zhig yin pa'i skor mkhas grub chen po che dge legs dpal bzang pos mdzad pa'i (brtag gnyis rnam bshad )shog grangs 50nas 53bar gsal/kyai rdor rtsa rgyud brtag gnyis )'di la/rgya gar mkhas grub rnams kyis mdzad pa'i 'grel pa bcu gsum tsam (sde dge bstan 'gyur )rgyud pod (nga)pa dang (ca)pa'i 'gor bzhugs shing/bod kyi mkhas pas mdzad pa la/1 rngog chos sku rdo rje/2 rngog thogs med grags pa/3 mes ston tshon po bsod nams rgyal mtshan/4 mes kyi slob brgyud rgya mtsho grags pa/5 mkhas pa rgya nam/6 dpyal lo tsA ba bsod nams rgyal mtshan/7 slob dpon chos la dga' ba/8 rdog ston rtse'u ban+de/9 rdo rje mgon po/10 zhe sdang mgon po/11 cog ro chos kyi rgyal mtshan/12 'gar dam pa chos ldings/13 skyogs ston rin chen bkra shis/14 gnyos lo tsA ba yon tan grags/15 gtsang tsha rdo rje bla