klu gan rkyal|{'di'i skor la lha sgrung dang 'dra ba'i bshad tshul mang po mchis pa'i nang nas grags che ba ni/btsan po no mon han gyis mdzad pa'i ('dzam gling rgyas bshad )nang skyid grong nas bal yum du 'gro ba'i lam brgyud dang nye bar grong n+ya ko Ta dang mi ring ba'i ri khug cig tu sgo sAn s+thin zer ba'i gnas yod pa der 'khyil chu mtsho dang 'dra ba zhig gi nang rdo las rang byung du grub pa'i sku brnyan mi'i rnam pa can mdog sngo skya la gdong la gzan ngur smrig gis g.yogs pa lta bu'i sbrul mkho'i gdengs ka dgu yod pa de la rgya gar gyi mu stegs chos lugs 'dzin pa khag gcig gis lha dbang phyug gi skur ngos bzung nas dad pa chen po byed kyi yod kyang rgya gar dang bal yul gyi nang pa rnams kyis dad pa mi byed cing/lhag par du bod rigs nang pa'i chos la dad pa rnams kyis sku brnyan 'di la klu gan rkyal dang klu gdol pa zhes ha cang gis mi dad pa byed kyi yod pa dang/sku brnyan 'di ston pa sangs rgyas 'dzam gling du ma byon gong nas yod pa dang/skabs der 'jig rten thog mthu rtsal che shos dbang phyug yin par khas len pa'i dbang gis mi stegs pa rnams la lha dbang phyug gi sku brnyan du drags/rgya gar ba rnams kyis sku 'di'i ming la ni la kan+tha zer ba de bal po'i skad du zur chag nas li la kan cha zer ba lta bu zhig yod/bal po'i skad de bod skad du zur chag nas li la klu dang/kan cha la gan rkyal du go ba'i rgyu mtshan gyis klu gan rkyal du grags/'ga' zhig gis sku brnyan 'di klu zhig gnyid khug pa'i phung po rdo la gyur pa zhig yin pas gnyid sad na gson por longs srid zer ba yang yod tshul gsang sngags kyi gzhung 'ga' zhig nang gsal}
klu dga' bo|{dkar phyogs la dga' zhing sangs rgyas chos lugs srung skyob byed pa'i klu chen brgyad kyi khongs su mi 'du ba'i klu yi rgyal po chen po dga' bo dang nye dga' bo gnyis ni bskal bzang gi sangs rgyas stong tshang ma'i zhal mjal thub pa'i tshe ring po zhig yin pa dang/nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i dge slong dang dge tshul sogs kyis nyin re nyin gung gi zas bzhes grub nas bsngo ba gnang skabs/klu de gnyis kyi ming nas bod te bang ba nges par bya dgos zhes sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyis bca' khrims mdzad yod tshul ('dul ba'i gzhung )du gsal}
