klu sbug sgar sgrigs|{de sngon lha sa smon lam chen mo'i skabs kyi rta dmag ru sgrig gi byed sgo gco che ba'i gras shig ste/bod zla 1tshes 22nyin lha sa gtsug lag khag gi mdun ngos klu sbug gi bde thang du dkyil sgar lding gur yol 'khor dang bcas pa'i nang smon lam rta dmag ru chen gyi spyi khyab yA sor gnyis kyi khri dang/mdun gral g.yas g.yon gnyis la yA sor byings dang/byang ngos su 'dab brgya shog brgyad kyi sog po yA sor ngo las bcas gral la 'khod/dkyil sgar lho byang gnyis so sor lta dmag g.yas ru g.yon ru'i sgar gyi gur phub pa'i mtha' skor du ru khag so so'i mi rta go mtshon rang 'grig bcas gral sgrigs/smon lam rta pa'i spyi khyab yA sor gnyis la byed sgo'i ring dmigs bsal gyi tha'i ji'i {(WP:1,194)}go gnas dang gdan thob/yA sor byings la rim bzhi'i gdan thob yod pa ltar sgar sgrigs nyin yA sor khri pa gnyis nas gos rgyan bzhi 'a brug chen li hang gi phyu pa dang/gru'u tsi tshon snga lnga'i 'og mjug /zhwa mo wa sgir/rgya gri phor shubs/gser stod/bye ru phreng ba gser gyi bcu shad can/rdA las/'go snam mtshal kha'i lham 'ja' chen/mda' gzhu sag thag /khri 'khyog bcas drag can cha tshang dang/yA sor byings rnams kyi gos 'khor brgyad ser po'i lA shag /zhwa mo wa sgir sogs dang/sog po yA sor gyis gos chen stag zhun (tA hung )li hang sogs gza' 'phyor gang rgyas bcas spras srol dang/de nyid thog mar yA sor ngo g.yog rnams yA sor bgres pa'i gzigs shag nang lhan 'dzoms kyis rten 'brel byed sgo gzab rgyas/de nas smon lam dgongs za 'tshogs mtshams su gtsug lag khang gi khyams ra'i dbu g.yas thog bka' blon rnam pa dang lhan du tshogs mjal zhu skabs tshogs chen zhal ngos smon la rta dmag gi byed sgo'i bka' bsgyur tshogs gtam btang ba nyan rjes bka' blon rnams nas bka' shag gi bka' bsgyur gtong srol/de nas jo bo dbu skra'i mdun nas rta bzhon te jus yag dar chen la kha btags g.yogs rjes g.yas bskor gyis klu sbug sgar sar log mtshams rten 'brel byed sgo rnams zin 'phrul bud med rgyan bzang ma gna' rabs kyi rgyan gos gzab mchos spras pa rnams nas 'khrungs phud bteg /de nas yA sor mgron gnyer nas brda btang mtshams yA g.yog dang/brgya shog gi dpon bcas yA sor gyi gur nang du bcar nas gus 'dud phyag 'bul zhus te pus 'dzugs kyi bsdad par/yA sor khri pas tA la'i bla ma'i sbug dam 'khod pa'i bka' yig sgrog sbyangs byas rjes/smon lam rta pa'i byed sgo'i skor zhib phra'i gsal bshad bka' bsgyur btang ste de mjug rgyan bzang ma gnyis nas 'khrungs phud bteg nas sgar sgrig gi byed sgo grub pa bcas yis}
