as yA sor mgron gnyer nas brda btang mtshams yA g.yog dang/brgya shog gi dpon bcas yA sor gyi gur nang du bcar nas gus 'dud phyag 'bul zhus te pus 'dzugs kyi bsdad par/yA sor khri pas tA la'i bla ma'i sbug dam 'khod pa'i bka' yig sgrog sbyangs byas rjes/smon lam rta pa'i byed sgo'i skor zhib phra'i gsal bshad bka' bsgyur btang ste de mjug rgyan bzang ma gnyis nas 'khrungs phud bteg nas sgar sgrig gi byed sgo grub pa bcas yis}
klu sbug gi ljongs|{'di lha sa'i nub rgyud lcags po ri dang gtsug lag khang gnyis bar gyi thang chen zhig ste/sngon dus shing sna mang pos khengs pa gling kha chung che tsam zhig yin/deng sa bon rang skyong ljongs mi dmangs srid gzhung dang/g.yu thog zab pa yod sa'i khul de yin/dmangs khrod kyi kha rgyun shod srol la lha sa gtsug lag khang chen por bzhugs pa'i jo bo shAkya mu ne 'di sangs rgyas zhal bzhugs dus su bzhengs nas rgya gar du lo mang po'i bar bzhugs shing/de nas klu yul du long mang por bzhugs pa slar yang rgya gar rdo rje gdan gyi mchod rten du bzhugs nas lo mang po song rjes rgya nag tu gdan drangs/de nas rgyal po srong btsan sgom pos bod kyi srid dbang bskyangs skabs rgya bzang wun khren kong jo'i rten skal du bsnams phebs par klus ma 'ongs pa na lha sa grong khyer chub zhig skabs slar yang klu yul du gdan 'dren zhu rgyu'i smon lam btab yod pas/lcigs po ri'i brag cig gi ngos su klu'i gzugs brnyan lag pa g.yas pas mgo la sbar mo bkab pa zhig gtsug lag khang la kha gtad nas yod pa/brag lha klu sbug gi jo bo'i sku brnyan de mngon dus thog mar bzhengs skabs brag ngos su 'bur gzugs dod tsam las med kyang rim pas sku gzugs cha tshang mdun ngos su thon che ru 'khor ba dang/sku gzugs cha tshang 'bur du don mtshams lha sa grong khyer chus 'jig pa'i dus skabs yin pa dang/gong gsal klu'i gzugs brnyan lag pa dpral ba la bkab nas jo bo shAkya mu ne klu yul du nam phebs kyi bya ra byed pa zhig yod pa de la brten nas ming ngo ma klu sgug zer ba yin kyang/rjes su sgra 'gyur nas klu sbug zhes brjod gsol chags pa yin zer}
klu mes|{bod kyi bstan pa phyi dar skabs mdzad rjes che ba'i 'dul ba 'dzin pa chen po zhig yin/mtshan dngos tshul khris shes rab zer/'khrungs yul ni glag ba lam (deng sang lha sa grong khyer stag rtse rdzong khongs bde chen )khong byon pa'i dus tshon ni (deb sngon )shog grangs 102las/jo bo rje lha gcig bod du byon pa'i snga rol lo drug cu rtsa bzhi po de'i khongs su klu mes dpon slob kyis gtsug lag khang mang du mdzad de/sa mo bya yi (1009)lor la mor 'gyel gyi gtsug lag khang brtsigs zhes gsal ba ltar dus skabs de rang la byon par nges/'dul 'dzin chen po des 'bring ye shes yon tan dang/tshong btsun shes rab seng gai/lo ston rdo rje dbang phyug /sum pa ye shes blo gros/rgya blo gros shes rab/gzhon ban chos mchog bcas bdun dang mnyam du mdo smad du phebs nas bla chen dgongs pa rab gsal gyi dngos slob grum ye shes rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas lngas dge slong dang/rgya gzhon gnyis kyis dge bsnyen zhus/dbus su yar phebs nas klu mes dang 'bri gnyis kyis dbul khus du gnas bzhi bzung nas sdom rgyun spel bar mdzad pas khong rnam gnyis las slob brgyud mang du 'phel zhing/de'i nang nas klu mes la slob ma ka ba bzhi'am bu bzhi (1 rngog byang chub 'byung gnas/2 sna nam rdo rje dbang phyug /3 gru med tshul khrims 'byung gnas/4 glan ye shes shes rab )byung/rab byung dang po'i gong gi sa bya (1009)lor dbus da la mor 'gyel gyi gtsug lag khang phyag btab/de rjes zhang sna nam rdo rje dbang phyug gis zhabs 'bring mdzad de brag yer par byon skabs yer pa'i dge bshan klu mes 'brong chung gis sbyin bdag mdzad do/_/yer pa'i shug gseb tu shug pa'i yal ga bcad de spyil po chung ngu zhig phul nas thugs dgyes bzhin du bzhugs par brten nye gnas zhang sna nam pas dge bshes 'brom chung la sa gnas 'dir gnas gzhi chung ngu zhig gi sa chag nang bar zhus pa ltar shug gseb tu ba mo gcig nyal sa shong tsam gyi sa yod pa der gnas gzhi thog mar rtsig pa'i ming ral yer pa ba rang du thogs/de ni klus mes tsho pa'i gnas gzhi snga shos de yin cing/de nas sdom rgyun dang bshad rgyun spel bar mdzad pas slob brgyud ka ba bzhi dang/gdung bzhi/gral bu bzhi la sogs pa mang du byung/de nas 'khrungs yum ba lam du sha tsha lha khang bzhengs/de nas chu glang (1013)lor brum 'bar ba byang chub kyis mong mkhar 'bras mor (lho kha khul du yod )gdan grangs shing/gnas 'dren du yong mi gzhon nu rin chen/gnyags yon tan snying po/mchims lhun grub rgyal mtshan/btsun pa mchog bu bzhis klu mes kyi drung nas sdom pa zhus/ka chu'i lha khang nyams gso byas te ka char gnas gzhi bzung/klu mes kyis bsam yas dbu rtse'i gtsug lag khang la nyams gso legs par mdzad /sku tshe'i smad du gra thang du yod pa'i sngags sde dang klu mes kyi sde bar la 'khrugs rtsod byung ba'i nang klu mes kyi da la rgyal kha thob par brten/sngags pa rnams zhe nad ma khyog par mthu gtad byas pa'i rkyen gyis klu mes chen po dang khong gi slob ma gru mer tshul khrims 'byung gnas gnyis kar mdze nad byung ste sku gshegs/sku gdung spur bzhu ma byas par dmar gdung nyams med du thang po che'i mchod rten 'od 'bar gyi nang du bzhugs tshul (deb sngon )las gsungs/gong gsal lo rgyus rnams (lde'u chos 'byung )rgyas bsdus gnyis/(nel pa chos 'byung ) (deb sngon )bcas nas phyogs bsdus byas pa yin}
klu mes tshul khrims shes rab|{gong du klu mes zhes pa'i 'grel bshad du gzigs/gzhan yang (deb dmar )sogs yig cha 'ga' zhig nang klu mes shes rab tshul khrims zhes gsal ba de rang yin}
klu las skyes pa'i rnal 'byor ma|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags brgyud rim lo rgyus thog bshad srol la/gsang sngags kyi lam la ba rten nas o rgyan gyi rgyal po in+d+ra b+hu te sogs yul mi yongs rdzogs grub pa thob ste o rgyan yul de mtsho chen po klus gang ba zhig tu gyur pa la /gsang bdag phyag na rjes klu rnams smin par mdzad pa las rim gyis mir gyur te mtsho 'gram du grong khyer chags shing/gsang sngags kyi chos nyams su blangs pa la brten nas grub pa thob pa'i nang tshan yul de'i rgyal po mthong na dga' ba'i bu mo rol pa mo zhes brjod pa yin/de yang mkhan gzhan klu las gyur pa'i rnal 'byor ma dang/klu yi mkha' 'gro ma zhes brjod pa yang klu nas rim gyis mir gyur te rten de la gnas sngags kyi chos nyams len byas pa la brten nas mchog gi dngos grub thob pa zhig yin pa las/klu'i rten de rang la gsang sngags kyi chos nyams len byas pa dang grub pa thob pa de 'dra min}
klu las gyur pa'i mkha' 'gro ma|{gong gsal klu las skyes pa'i rnal 'byor ma zhes pa der gzigs}
klung shod|{lha sa'i skyid chu'i mgo stod du yod pa'i dbu ru stod kyi sa cha rnams la zer ba ste/de'i khongs su rwa sgreng/'bri gung/dbus stod/mal gro khul rnams yod/rgya ma khri sgang sogs skyid chu'i lho phyogs kyi smad rgyud rnams klung shong khongs su mi gtogs pa yin pa de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi yag cha 'ga' zhig gi rdzong khongs dbye stangs la gzigs}
klung shod nam po|{'bri gung dang mal gro brgyud kyi sa cha la klung shod zer}
klubs dkar 'dul 'dzin|{sha mi 'dul 'dzin smon lam 'bar gyi slob ma bu chen bzhi (1 klubs dkar 'dul 'dzin/2 jo stan pang tshul/3 sbal ti jo sras/4 thag ma 'dul 'dzin rdo rje gzhon du )yod pa'i gcig yin cing/lho kha yar klung klubs dkar dgon pa dang/rgya dur dgon pa 'debs par mdzad pa po de yin/mtshan dngos la tshul khrims grags zer/lo rgyus zhib gsal da phan ma mthong}
klubs dkar tshul khrims grags|{gong gsal klubs dkar 'dul 'dzin zhes pa der gzigs}
klu'i rgyal po sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das|{'di yongs grags su sangs rgyas klu dbang rgyal po la go dgos kyang/skabs 'dir ni srong btsan sgam po'i gzigs snang la shar ba'i sangs rgyas klu dbang rgyal po sku mdog dkar po spyan gsum yod pa zhig ste/de'i sku brnyan gtsug lag khang gi klu khang nang bzhengs yod}
klu'i rgyal po anan+ta u li|{klu chen bag+r+yad kyi nang gses klu'i rgyal po nye dga' bo'i ming gi rgya gar skad}
klo|{'di ni deng sang lho pa rigs su 'bod pa de yin te/sngar btsan po'i dus skabs su mtha' mtshams kyi mon sogs yar klung gi lho phyogs su yod pa'i yul mi tshor lho pa zhes 'bod pa de yis su sgra 'gyur nas klo pa zhes brjod pa dang/yul gyi goms gshis kyang gna' rabs ya thog gi 'tsho ba skyel stangs rgyun 'dzin byed te bod ljongs zhi bas bcings 'grol ma btang bar du gnas shing/deng skabs spyi tshogs dang/dpal 'byor/rig gnas bcas yar rgyas chen po byung yod}
klo pa stod byams khang|{bod ljongs 'phan po lhun 'grub rdzong mtsho stod shang khongs klo pa stod grong tsho'i dkyil du lha khang ser po zhig yod pa de ni klo pa stod byams khang zhes pa de yin/dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i 'khor zhang sna nam rdo rje dbang phyug gis bzhengs pa'i 'phan yul byams pa spun gsum gras kyi byams pa sprul sku'i cha chas can thog brtsegs gsum ldan dang 'khor nye sras nyis thog tsam byas pa'i 'jim brnyan bzhugs pa'i lha khang la nang p+sakor rgyag sa'i skor lam lcam gang ma'i sa sogs yod/lha khang de'i rdo rtsig ni rdor ril mi go tsam sha stag yin stabs gna' bo'i bzo skrun gyi khyad chos ldan pa zhig yin}
klog skya lo tsA ba shes rab brtsegs|{'di'i lo rgyus zhib gsal ma mthong yang thu'u bkwan rin po che blo bzang chos kyi nyi mas mdzad pa'i (mkha' spyod ma'i spyi don )las/lo tsA ba 'di lab po pham mthing pa p+saku ma ched bzhi yod pa'i nang gi che ba'i slob ma yin cing/khong gi drung du lo bco brgyad bzhugs nas bde mchog yab yum gnyis kyi chos skor gsan pa yin zhes gsungs}
klog grwa|{'di la go ba len tshul ma 'dra ba gnyis yod/1 dgon pa'i nang grwa btsun rnams yi ge 'bri klog gnyis slob sbyong byed sa/2 klog pa thos bsam gyi grwa zhes shes yon slob khrid dang slob sbyong byed pa'i slob grwa}
klog sbyong|{gong du gsal ba'i klog grwa'i zhes pa'i go don dang po ltar yin}
klong skor bco brgyad|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur rnying ma'i rdzogs pa chen po la sems sde/klong sde/man ngag gi sde bcas gsum yod pa'i nang gses klong sde la skor tsho bco brgyad yod ces snga 'gyur gyi chos 'byung phal che ba'i nang gsal yang mtshan byang mi gsal zhing/bod skad du bsgyur ba'i klong skor brgyad kyi mtshan byang ni/klong nag po thugs rje'i klong ma bug nyis/klong dkar po rgya mtsho'i klong ma bu gnyis /klong rab 'byams ma bu bzhi bcas klong ma brgyad bod skad du bsgyur zhes snga 'gyur gyi chos 'byung phal che bar gsal/gzhan yang klong sde la klong dkar po sems su smra ba dang/klong nag po rgyu med du smra ba/klo nga khra bo sna tshogs so smra ba/klong rab 'byams rgyu 'bras la bzla ba bcas bzhi yod cing/klong dkar po sems su smra ba la yang rang shar chen po'i klong dkar dang/lta sgom gnyis med kyi klong dkar gnyis /klong nag po rgyu med du smra ba la mdzad pa klong nag /thugs rje klong nag /sprul pa klog nag bcas gsum/klong khra bo sna tshogs su smra ba la yod smra sems sde dang mthun pa dang/med smra rang gnas dang mthun pa /yod med man ngag dang mthun pa bcas gsum /klong rab 'byams rgyu 'bras la bzla ba ba la bya ba dang bral ba phyi'i rab 'byams/grub mtha' rang byung smra ba nang gi rab 'byams/gegs bsal ba gsang ba'i ram 'byams/gnad grol ba de kho na nyid kyi ram 'byams bcas bzhi ste klong sde bcu gnyis kyi bzhed tshul yang yod pa bcas zhib par kun mkhyen klong chen rab 'byams pa'i (theg mchog mdzod dang dang )dang (yid bzhin mdzod )sogs 'brel yod gsung rtsom khag la gzigs}
klong gi skor|{gong gsal klong skor bco brgyad ces pa'i 'grel bshad la gzigs}
klong dgu|{(deb sngon )las (dpal nam mkha' dang mnyam pa'i rgyud )kyi don klong dgu dang tshig la bam po nyis khri zhes 'byung bas/bam po nyis khri na grub pa'i skyes bu rnams kyi phyag na bzhugs pa'i dbang du byas pa yin pas gung cha tshang bod skad du 'gyur ba med pa dang/nam mkha' dang mnyam pa'i rgyud chung ba'i don yang klong dgu yod pa ste/1 lta ba'i klong/2 spyod pa'i klong/3 dkyil 'khor gyi klong/4 dbang gi klong/5 dam tshig gi klong/6 sgrub pa'i klong/7 'phrin las kyi klong/8 sa lam gyi klong/9 'bras bu'i klong bcas yin pa dang/de dag kyang rgyud de'i le'u bcu gcig pa nas bcu dgu pa'i bar le'u re res bstan pa yin zhes gsal}
klong chen chos 'byung|{yongs rags su (klong chen chos 'byung )zhes 'bod cing zhal byang du (chos 'byung rin po che'i gter mdzod bstan pa gsal bar byed pa'i nyi 'od )ces 'khod pa 'di kun mkhyen klong chen rab 'byams pa'i gsung yin shag mdzad kyang dam pa de'i gsung yin min dogs pa 'dug ste/gang yin zhe na/mdzad byang du rgyal sras thugs mchog rtsal gyis zhes mdzad pa po'i mtshan gsal ba 'di kun mkhyen klong chen pa'i mtshan gyi rnam grangs mang po yod pa'i nang du yang mi gsal zhi nga/chos 'byung 'di'i chos bsgyur ba'i dkar chag gi tshigs bcad nang rgya nag slob dpon kA ma la zhes 'khod 'dug pa bzhin rab byung gnyis pa'i shing 'brug (1124)lo nas rab byung gsum pa'i shing byi (1204)lo bar byon pa'i mnga' bdag nyang nyi ma 'od zer gyis gter nas bzhes pa'i (bka' thang zangs gling ma )zhes rin chen gter mdzod kyi nang bzhugs pa de'i shog grangs 257par rgya nag gi yul nas slob dpon kA ma la shI la bya ba mkhas pa chen po bzhugs pa yang spyan drangs zhes gsal ba dang mthun par/nyang chen po rang nyid kyis mdzad pa'i (chos 'byung me tog snying po )dpe thung dbu med bris rnying zhig gi shog grangs 352bar rgya nag yul nas slob dpon kA ma la shI la spyan drangs zhes 'khod pa bcas de gnyis ka yig nor min par mnga' bdag nyang nyi ma 'od zer dang/(klong chen chos 'byung )yongs grags 'di'i mdzad pa po gnyis kas slob dpon kA ma la 'i la rgya nag nas gdan drangs par zhes pa gcig mthun yin pa ltar snang zhing/kun mkhyen 'jigs med gling pas mdzad pa'i (snga 'gyur rgyud 'bum rin po che'i dkar chag )nang kun mkhyen klong chen rab 'byams pa'i gsung gi gras su )chos 'byung rin po che'i mdzod )ces rangs gnas mdzad 'dug pa ma zad/(klong chen chos 'byung )du grags pa 'di'i lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 455par rje btsun grags pa rgyal mtshan zhi bar gshegs pa'i chos skor me byi (1216)lo la mdzad pa'i dus su rtsis pas sangs rgyas 'das lo sum stong sum brgya bzhi bcu zhe dgu yod par bzhed la/me mo glang gi (1277)lo la chu mig chos 'khor gyi dus su bla ma dam pa chos rgyal 'phags pa'i rtsis pas 'das lo sum stong bzhi brgya dang bcu 'das par bzhed do/_/de nas bla ma ti shrI kun dga' blo gros rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po bod du bsnyen rdzogs la byon pa'i dus su chu pho khyi (1322)lo yan chad la lo sum stong bzhi brgya dgu bcu rtsa gcig 'das la/da lta dgung bcu rtsa gnyis pa sa phaT (1359)lo'i steng na yod pas zhes gsungs pa 'di'i sa phag gi lo 'di kun mkhyen klong chen rab 'byams pa dgung lo lnga bcu nga gnyis pa'i sa phag lo la khri se khel bas (klong chen chos 'byung )yongs grags 'di kun mkhyen klong chen rab 'byams pa'i gsung rtsom ngo ma yid dgos pa lta bur dogs pa'i gzhir snang zhing/gal te kun mkhyen mchog gi gsung rtsom ngo ma yin pa'i dbang du btang na kun mkhyen klong chen rab 'byams pa ni gzhung chen bka' pod lngar sbyangs pa mthar son pa'i paN+Di ta mtshan dang don mthun pa zhig yin pas/slob dpon 'a ma la shI la rgya dkar nag gang gi mi rigs yin min gyi don gnad phra mo de tsam nor 'khrul yong mi srid pa bcas mkhas pa'i dbang po rnams kyis dpyad par mdzad du gsol lo/_}
klong chen snying thig|{kun mkhyen klong chen rab 'byams pas mkha' 'gro snying thig gi snying po mkha' 'gro yang thig dang/bi ma snying thig gi snying po bla ma yang thig dang/zab mo yang thig bcad mdzad de dmar spel gnang ba la spyi yi mtshan du klong chen snying thig ces zer}
klong chen pa|{gong du kun mkhyen klong chen po zhes pa der gzigs}
klong chen rab 'byams|{'di la go don mi ra ba gnyis yod pa ste/1 rdzogs pa chen po klong sde'i skor la bco brgyad yod pa'i nang gses (klong chen rab 'byams )la ba mu bzhi yod pa de'i ming/2 snga 'gyur gyi bstan 'dzin chen po kun mkhyen klong chen pa'i mtshan la yang klong chen rab 'byams zhu ba yin pas/skabs so so'i go don ma nor ba mdzad dgos}
klong thang sgrol ma lha khang|{sngar btsan po srong btsan sgam pos lha sa gtsug lag khang ma bzhengs gong du mtha' 'dul yang 'dul gyi lha khang bcu gnyis bzhengs pa'i nang nas mdo khams 'dan ma'i yul du klong thang sgrol ma lha khang bzhengs/lha khang de yang phyi mchod rten/nang lha khang/rtsa ba gzer mgo (zlum po/) rtse mo rgya phubs kyi dbyibs su yod par (nel pa chos 'byung )las gsungs}
klong du gyur|{dbang du gyur pa'am don yongs su rtogs pa}
klong rdol|{'di la go don mi 'dra ba gnyis yod pa ste/1 klong rdol ba zhes yon tan gyi gting mtha' med par gyur pa'i bya tshig /2 'a mgon gtsang pa rgya ras pa ye shes rdo rjes dgung lo so gsum pa rab byung gsum pa'i chu glang (1193)lor lha sa'i steng thang gi stod rgyud du btab pa'i klong rdol gyi dgon pa la yang klong rdol zer}
klong rdol bla ma ngag dbang blo bzang|{'khrul yul phu mdo zhes pa'i grong du yab sngags 'chang dbang 'bum dang/yum 'jam bzang 'bum skyid gnyis kyi sras rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa phag (1719)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi lnga la phebs skabs yab sngags 'chang gis yi ge 'bri klog dang chos spyod nyung shas bslabs par mdzad/dgung lo bdun par dge slong blo bzang dge 'dun gyi drung tu gtsug phud phul nas chos sgor zhugs/dgung lo bcu gnyis par phu bu lcog bla ma ngag dbang byams pa rin po che chab mdor phebs skabs rab byung dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa zhus/dgung lo nyi shu'i thog chab mdo dgon gyi gling stod grwa tshang du zhugs nas gsang sngags kyi cho ga phyag bzhes la sbyangs pa mdzad/chud bar bla ma rin po che dge 'dun bkra shis bla mar bsten nas chu dbar dgon du lo gcig tsam bzhugs te chos 'ga' zhig gsan/bla mas bka' phebs pa ltar 'bul sdud la phebs shing/thi thang dgon du lo gsum tsam bzhugs/bsdus grwa dang phar phyin la sbyangs/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa bzhi'i thog chu dbar bla ma rin po ches bka' phebs pa ltar dbus gtsang gi gdan sa chen por slob gnyer gdan bzhed kyis khams 'grul a cor mi brgyad dang mnyam du lha sar phebs/se ra byas grwa tshang gi lho pa khang tshan du sgrigs zhugs mdzad/sgom sde dge bshes brtson 'grus sogs yongs 'dzin du bsten nas bsdus grwa phar phyin sogs la sbyangs/dgung lo sum cu'i thog phur lcog ngag dbang byams pa rin po che dang/paN chen sku phreng drug pa dpal ldan ye shes/rgyal dbang bskal bzang rgya mtsho/lcang skya rol pa'i rdo rje bcas kyi drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos bka' mang du gsan/dgung lo so gsum thog gsang phu'i dge bshes grwa skor mdzad/dgung lo so dgu'i thog rgyud stod grwa tshang du sgrigs zhugs gnang ste lo gsum tsam bzhugs ring/mkhan chen ngag dbang chos grags kyi drung nas 'grel pa bzhi sbrags sogs rgyud pa'i chos skor gang yod gsan/de nas rgyud pa'i sgrigs khongs nas 'then pa gnang ste/rnam rgyal grwa tshang gi sde pa don grub rgyal mtshan gyis sbyin bdag zhus te/snye thang phu'i ri khrod klong rdol zer bar rgyun bzhugs gnang nas sgrub pa nyams bzhes mdzad cing/dgung lo zhe lnga nas bzung gtso bor mtshams bcad dang/zhar zhor la dad ldan mang pos gsol ba btab pa ltar lam rim blo sbyong bskyed rdzogs kyi khrid sogs bstsal/sku tshe'i ring snye thang rmog lcog tu lo gsum/klong rdol ri khrod du lo dgu/snye thang rin chen gling du lo brgyad bcas lo nyi shu rtsa gnyis ring ri khrod du bya bral ri khrod pa dkyus ma'i 'tsho ba la brten nas sgrub pa nyams bzhes kun gyi mig dper 'os pa mdzad pas slob ma grangs las 'das pa byung/dgung lo don grub pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing stag (1794)lor sku gshegs/sku gdung ni gdongs pa gzhan don du gshegs khar zhal chems gnang ba ltar/snye thang gi ri sgang sa gtsang sa zhig tu bya gtor zhus shing/dbu thod dang sku rus la rus chog mdzad nas mchod rten bzhengs pa ri khrod rang du bzhugs/gsung rtsom pod chen gcig dpar skrun zhus pa deng sang rgyal khag phyi nang du khyab brdal che/rnam thar lo rgyus skor/kun bde gling rta tshag blo bzang ye shes bstan pa'i mgon pos mdzad pa'i (kun spangs sems dpa' chen po grub dbang klong rdol bla ma rin po che'i rnam thar rgyal sras spyod pa'i rgyan )zhes pa lha sa zhor dpar ma'i shog grangs 168yod lags}
klong sde|{gong du klong gi skor zhes pa'i 'grel bshad la gzigs}
dka' mgo|{rka 'go /chu 'gro sa'i yur bu'i mgo /(tsa)}
dka' brgyud gser phreng|{1 bka' brgyud chos lugs kyi bla ma brgyud rim gyi rnam thar chos 'byung gi ming ste/dper na karma bka' brgyud gser phreng dang/'brug pa bka' brgyud gser phreng/'bri gung bka' brgyud gser phreng zhes pa lta bu/2 bka' brgyud chos lugs kyi bla ma rim byon la zer/skabs 'di (bka' thog rgyal rabs gser phreng )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 25na)ni la dwags kyi rgyal po seng ge rnam rgyal nas bzung 'brug pa bka' brgyud yi bla ma rim byon la go dgos}
dka' bcu|{gzhung chen po bka' pod lnga la sbyangs pa mthar son pa'i dge bshes la che bstod kyi mtshan yin}
dka' bcu ngag dbang bkra shis|{mdo smad re gong bse'i nya lung zhes par phal rin chen skyabs dang/yum snying byams gnyis kyi sras su rab yung bcu gcig pa'i sa rta (1768)lora'akhrungs/grub chen skal ldan rgya mtsho'i dngos slob mgar khong tshe brtan rgya mtsho'i drung du rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes nas mtshan sbyin pa rgya mtsho zhes gsol/dgung lo bcu drug la yul dbus su byon nas 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang du chos zhugs mdzad/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa/'od zer rgya mtsho sogs bsten nas gzhung chen la gsan bsam mdzad/dgung lo nyer drug par gsang phur dka' bcu'i mtshan btags kyang bzhes/'jam bzhad ngag dbang brtson 'grus kyis bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa gnang nas mtshan ngag dbang bkra shis zhes gsol/dgung lo nyer brgyan par dpal ldan rgyud smad grwa tshang du phebs/dgung lo so gnyis par kun mkhyen 'jam bzhad kyi zhabs phyir mdo smad du phyir phebs/dgung lo so gsum lo nas lo dgu'i ring dgon pa'i dge bskor mdzad nas 'dul khams kun spyod dam 'dzin gnang/dgung lo zhe gnyis nas lo nyi shu'i ring bkra shis 'khyil gyi gdan rabs gnyis pa'i la phebs/phyag rtsom la mtshon na/(zab mo rten cing 'brel bar 'a byung ba mtha' dpyod legs bshad rgya mtsho/) (bsam gzugs kyi mtha' dpyod legs bshad rgya mtsho) ('phrin las kyi rnam gzhag )sogs pod gcig tsam mdzad/dgung lo re gcig la phebs pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa rta (1738)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su gshegs}
dka' chen|{bkra shis lhun po'i gdan sar gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer mthar phyin pa'i dge bshes rnams la dka' chen zhes pa'i mtshan gnas 'bul srol yod pa dang/(ser 'bras dga' gsum gyi dge bshes lha rams pa'i mtshan gnas dang gcig mtshungs yin ) dge bshes dga' chen rnams gzhung chen po lngar slob gnyer gnang ba'i yul tshan kyang spyir na se 'bras dga' gsum dang khyad par cher med/dka' chen gyi grwa skor gnang ba'i dus tshon ni/bod zla bcu gcig pa'i tshes brgyad nas tshes bcu bzhi bar rnam 'grel grwa skor dang/bod zla dang po tshes gnyis nas dga' chen rab 'byams pa'i grwa skor mdzad srol yod 'dug }
dka' chen bcu gnyis|{paN chen nA ro pas/grub chen te lo pa la mar bsten nas gnang skabs thog mar chos gsum ba lta ci/gsum gleng legs pa gcig kyang ma gnang bar srog la thug pa'i dka' ba chen po bcu gnyis spyad du bcug pa ste/1 mkhar mthon po'i rtse nas mchod du bcug pa/2 mkhal khung la smyug ma'i thur ma brgyab pa/3 me dpung gi nang du mchong du bcug pa/4 mi gtsang ba'i 'dam rdzab zos su bcug pa/5 'bras chan gyi zas ston rku ru bcug pa/6 rgyal po'i bag ma 'phrog tu bcug pa/7 blon pa'i chung ma rku ru bcug pa/8 chung ma blangs su bcug pa/9 rdo rje tho bas rdung ba/10 rang gi chung ma bla mar phul ba/11 srin bu pad pas gang ba'i chu la sku lus kyi zam pa btsugs pa/12 rang gi sku lus kyi rtsa gtar nas khrag gis sa la chag chag btab pa bcas yin/zhib par (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )gyi karma kam tshang gi lo rgyus kyi nA ro pa'i rnam thar nang gsal}
dka' chen bzhi|{gzhung chen po lnga'i nang nas rnam 'grel phar phyin/dbu ma bcas gsum gyi steng mdzod dang/'dul ba gang mos bcas la dga' chen bzhi zer zhing/dka' bzhi pa zer ba'i mtshan yod pa rnams kyi go don de ltar yin}
dka' chen ye shes rgyal mtshan|{tshe chog gling yongs 'dzin sprul sku'i sku phreng dang po ste/chos 'a byung 'ga' zhig tu yongs 'dzin paN+Di ta ye shes rgyal mtshan yang zhu zhing/bod kyi lo rgyus thog grwa rkyang dkyus ma nas rim bzhin bkra shis lhun po'i dka' chen dang/tA la'i la ma sku phreng brgyad pa'i yongs 'dzin du phebs/skyes chen dam pa mdzad rjes ha cang che ba zhig yin/'khrungs yul ni gting skyes kyi gzar byang sbug tu yab tshangs pa dkar po dang/yum ri tshing dpal 'dzoms gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu sbrul (1713)lor sku 'khrungs/chung dus kyi mtshan la o rgyan tshe 'phel zhu zhing/yab yum gnyis zhal bral rjes rta nag ri khud dgon par thos bsam gling mkhan chen tshe brtan rgyal mtshan la gtsug phud 'bul gnang mdzad/dgung lo dgu la phebs skabs yab kyis bkra shis lhun por skyel ba ltar chos zhugs mdzad/paN chen rin po che blo bzang ye shes kyi drung nas rab byung dang/dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes te /mtshan la ye shes rgya mtshan zhes 'dogs par mdzad/dka' chen ye shes thogs med dge rgan du bsten nas tshad ma rnam 'grel dang/phar phyin/'dul mdzod bcas la gnas bsam sgro 'dogs chod pa gnang/thos bsam gling slob dpon tshe brten rgyal mtshan gyis dam pa 'di la dmigs bsal gyi thog nas mtshan btags gnang rgyu thugs thag chod skabs/sku thog mnyam pa'i slob gnyer ba 'gas ma bzod par gnod tshe'i bsam sbyor ci rigs brtsams par brten/rab 'byams pa'i mtshan btags mdzad kyang gzhan gyi sdig rkyen du 'gro bar gzigs te lcags pa dkar chen skal ldan dang mnyam du bros stabs yis mang yul skyid grong gi bla ma rin po che blo bzang rnam rgyal gyi drung du phebs nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/lo de nas lcags bya lo bla ma rin po che dgongs gzhan don du ma phebs par lo bdun gyi ring mdo sngags kyi chos bka' mang du gsan cing/gang gsan pa rnams nyams bzhes sgom sgrub dang ya ma bral bar mdzad/bla ma rin po che'i sku gdung zhugs 'bul gyis mtshon dgongs rdzogs zhabs 'jug gi rim pa rnams grub ches dbus phyogs su phebs te/phur bu lcog ngag dbang byams pa rin po che dang/dge ldan khri chen nam mkha' bzang po sogs kyi drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos bka' rgya cher gsan/slar yang skyid grong du phebs nas lo gsum ring 'tsho ba dka' thub ngan ngon tsam la bsten nas nyams bzhes sgom sgrub la chig dril mdzad/dgung lo zhe bi nas bzung rim bzhin slob ma 'ga' zhig la chos 'chad spel gnang/ma Ni la kha'i bkra shis bsam gtan gling/brag dkar theg chen gling gi ri khrod phyag btab/rim bzhin gtsang dang dbus khul du phebs nas/bkra shis lhun po dang/se 'bras dga' gsum sogs su slob ma stong phrag mang po so so'i 'dod mos dang mthun pa'i mdo sngags kyi chos bka' rnam grangs ha cang mang ba stsal/paN chen rin po che dpal ldan ye shes dgongs pa gzhan don du phebs rjes lcang skya rin po che rol pa'i rdo rjes gong ma chin lung la mtshams sbyor gnang ba bzhin/dgung lo bdun cur phebs pa chu stag (1782)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin du mnga' gsol/de nas dgongs pa gzhan don du ma phebs bar lo ngo bcu gnyis ring tA li'i bla ma rin po cher mdo sngags kyi dbang lung khrid kyi rim pa cha tshang bar 'bul gnang mdzad cing/skabs dang bstun nas gdan sa gsum dang/rme ru/po tA la bcas su dpyid ston gnyis rim lam rim dang/bla mchod khrid sogs chos bka' rgya che rnams grangs mang ba sku ngal 'dzems med du stsal bas/slob ma ni bod dbus gtsang khams gsum/a mdo/sog yul bcas la grangs las 'das shing/bstan 'gro'i don chen skyong thub pa'i bstan 'dzin skyes chen gcig pu yang brgya phrag brgal ba bzhugs/dgung lo gya gcig pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu glang (1703)lor dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/gsung rtsom skor (skyes rabs so bzhi pa'i 'grel chen/) (bstod pa brgya lnga bcu pa'i 'grel pa/) (blo gros khrid yig chen mo/) (bya rgyud don gsal/) lam rim bla brgyud rnam thar )sogs pod chen po bco brgyad/dgos gsar thig chen gling dang/tshe chog gling dgon par shing par yod/sku phreng rim yon rnams la tshe chog gling sprul sku zhub ho thog thu'i rim pa dang 'dra ba'i go gnas yon/rnam thar ni (yongs 'dzin paN+Di ta chos kyi rgyal po ye shes rgyal mtshan gyi rnam thar thub bstan pad+mo 'byed pa'i nyin byed (tA la'i bla ma 'jam dpal rgya mtsho dpal bzang pos mdzad pa la shog grangs 208lha sa'i shing par yod}
dka' thub spyod pa|{'di ni nang pa sangs rgyas pa dang/mu stegs kyi chos lugs gnyis kar yod cing/skabs 'dir (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )pa cin mi rigs dpe skrun khang gi lcags dpar ma'i grangs 34thog gi dka' thub spyod pa'i mu stegs gnas su bzhugs zhes pa )dka' thub ni mu stegs pa'i lugs kyi dka' thub la go dgos pa ste/zas gcod pa/mi lnga bsten pa/mdung rtse gsum steng du mchongs pa sogs sna tshogs yod}
dka' ba bcu gnyis|{gong gsal dka' chin bcu gnyis zhes pa dang don gcig }
dka' ba lo drug spyad|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la/sangs rgyas shAkya mu nes rang gi khyim spungs nas rab tu byung ba'i rjes su skabs der rgya gar du dar rgyas che ba'i mu stegs pa'i chos lugs la zas spangs pa dang/me lnga bsten pa/khang brtsigs mthon po'i steng nas mdung rtsi gsum gsum gyi sting du mchongs pa sogs lus kyis dka' thub mang du spyad na 'khor ba las thar bar khas len gyi yod pa ltar/ston pa sangs rgyas rang nyid kyis kyang thog mar lo drug ring zas spangs pa'i dka' thub spyad nas sku lus kyi sha rnams zad de/rus gong skam po pags pas g.yogs pa ltar gyur kyang/nyon mongs dug gsum spangs pa'i thar pa thob pa la phan pa gang yang med par gzigs nas rang nyid kyi rjes 'jug rnams la lus kyi dka' thub spyad pa tsam gyis thar pa thob mi thub par/rang nyid kyis sems nang du gnas pa'i nyon mongs dug gsum spong ba'i thabs shes yang dag par 'tshol dgos zhes brda ston mdzad pa yin}
dka' bzhi|{gong du dka' chen bzhi zhes pa'i 'grel bshad la gzigs}
dka' bzlog ma|{'di lha mo u ma'i ming gi mngon brjod de/lha dbang phyug dka' thub la gnas par 'dod pa na lha mo u mas rtag tu bzlog par byed pa'i cha nas btags}
dka' rams mtshan btags|{dge bshes lha rams zhes pa'i 'grel bshad 'og tu gsal ba la gzigs}
