dkar chag|{'di'i go don ni nyin dkar gyi dus su gzugs kyi khyad chos rnams ma 'dres par gsal por mthong ba ltar 'god bya'i don de gsal por bkod pa'i don dang/chag ces pa ni rtsa'i chun po bsdams pa ltar 'god bya'i don de sde mtshan ma 'dres par so sor yer nas gsal por bkod pa'i don yin/dkar chag gi rnam grangs la rigs mi dra ba lnga yod pa ste/1 gtsug lag khang dang pho brang po tA la'i dkar chag lta bu lha khang gi dkar chag /2 gdan sa gsum dang sku 'bum dgon pa'i dkar chag lta bu dgon pa'i dkar chag /3 gsir gdung 'dzam gling rgyan gcig gi dkar chag /jo nang mchod rten chen mo'i dkar chag /jo bo byang chub chen po'i sku brnyan gyi dkar chag lta bu sku rten dang mchod rten kyi dkar chag /4 bka' 'gyur dkar chag dang bstan 'gyur dkar chag lta bu gsung rab gyi dpe tho/5 gangs te se'i dkar chag dang/pha bong kha'i dkar chag /tsA ri'i dkar chag lta bu gnas yig la dkar chag gi ming btags pa lta bu bcas yin/de rnams ming 'dogs stangs mi 'dra yang dkar chag gi sde tshan khongs su 'dus pa yin lags}
dkar chag mchims phu ma|{btsan po khri lde srong btsan sad na legs 'jim yon gyi dus skabs su bsam pas mchims phu'i lha khang du bzhugs pa'i bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur gyi dkar chag gi ming/dkar chag 'di 'god par mdzad mkhan lo tsA ba su yid dang lo khams gang yin lo rgyus khag gi nang du mi gsal yang/bud ston rin po ches mdzad pa'i (chos 'byung gsung rang rin po che'i mdzod )kyi bka' 'gyur dkar chag gi skabs su mchims phu'i dkar chag las zhes dang dkar chag mchims phu ma zhes gsal ba ma zad/chos yung de'i mdzad byang nang du'ang pho brang stong thang ldan dkar gyi dkar chag dang/de'i rjes kyi bsam yas mchims phu'i dkar cha dang/de'i rjes kyi 'phang thang ka med kyi dkar chag dang/zhes gsal zhing/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dkar ma'i shog grangs 417las spyir khri srong gi dus kyi dkar chag pho brang ldan dkar ma dang/phyis mchims phu ma dang/'phang thang ma ste gsum du byung zhes gsal bas dam pa rnams gnyis dkar chag byung ba'i go rim gcig mthun byung ba ltar khos bus kyang ched rtsom gzhan du go rim de ltar bris yod cing/'jam mgon si tu rin po chi chos kyi 'byung gnas kyis mdzad pa'i (sde dge'i bka' 'gyur gyi dkar chag )dang zhu chen tshul khrims rin chen gnyis kyis bka' bstan dkar chag 'phang thang ma da nga/ldan dkar ma gnyis yin par bzhed cing/dkar chag mchims mu pha yod med kyi tshig zur tsam yang ma gsungs/bu ston rin po che zhal bzhugs skabs dkar chag 'phang thang ma dang/mchims phu ma gnyis kyi ma dpe yod med the tshom gyi gzhi ste/gal ta skabs der dkar chag de gnyis kyi ma dpe bzhugs yod na bu ston rin po che dgung lo bzhi bcu zhe lngar phebs pa rab byung drug pa'i shing khyi (1334)lor zha lu'i bstan 'gyur gsar bzhengs mdzad skabs/snar thang gi bstan 'gyur nang ma bzhugs pa'i ma dpe dkon pa'i gras gsar du btsal rnyed byung ba'i chos tshan chig ston tsam kha snod mdzad par gsungs pa'i nang nges par du 'jug pa gnang nges yin ni smros mi dgos pa yin cing/de'i rjes su rab byung drug pa'i chu stag (1362)lor tA li byang chub rgyal mtshan gyis sne dgong pho brang du bstan 'gyur bzhengs skabs kyi dkar chag bu ston rin po che'i thugs sras lo tsA ba rin chen rnam rgyal gyis mdzad dus/zha lu'i bstan 'gyur yi nang du ma tshud pa'i chos tshan nyi thu rtsa bdun kha snon mdzad pa sogs/snar thang bstan 'gyur dpar ma dang/sde dge bstan 'gyur/co ne bstan 'gyur sogs tshang ma nang de sngon med pa'i chos tshan gsar rnying rnams rim bzhin kha skong mdzad yod kyang/gong gsal dkar chag de gnyis 'khod med stabs/ma dpe phal cher rtsa stong song zin par tshod dpag byed thub}
dkar chag ldan dkar ma|{sngar bod kyi btsan po'i dus rabs su bkod pa'i bka' bstan gyi dkar chag khag gsum gyi nang tshan zhig yin/dkar chag 'di btsan po gang gi dus su bkod pa yin min skor bod kyi sngon byon mkhas pa rnams la bzhes srol mi 'dra ba gnyis byung ste/bu ston rin po che dang/dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng ba gnyis kyis dkar chag 'di btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi skabs su bkod pa dang/bka' bstan dkar chag bod yig thog bkod pa'i thog ma de yin par bzhed pa ltar kho bos chen rtsom 'ga' zhig thog de bzhin bkod yod cing/(dkar chag ldan dkar ma )las 'brug gi lo la pho brang ldan dkar na bzhugs pa'i ston zhes gsal bas/btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyis srid dbang bzung ring 'brug lo snga rjes gnyis byung ba'i snga ma ni bsam yas gtsug lag khang bzhengs 'go tshugs nas ma grub gang gi lo ngo gsum pa'i shing 'brug (764)lo la khes bas skabs der lo tsA ba rnams kyis bka' bstan 'gyur 'go tshugs tsam las dkar chag tu 'god bya'i bka' bstan mang po med cing/'brub lo de'i rjes kyi ma 'brug (776)lo bar lo bcu gnyis las med pas de'i ring la (dkar chag ldan dkar ma )las gsal ba'i chos tshan 'bor ched de tsam bod skad du bsgyur thub pa ha cang dkar ba ma zad/mi 'brug de nas lo ngo bzhi song ba'i sa lug (779)lo la btsan po khri srong lde btsan sku gshegs pa yin pas/(dkar chag ldan dkar ma )btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus la byung ba'i bzhed tshal de dogs gzhi che bar brten/rjes su kho bos (dkar chag rig pa )zhes pa'i ched rtsom de'i nang 'jam mgon si tu rin po che dang zhu chen tshul khrims rin chen rnam gnyis kyi bzhed par ltar (dkar chag 'phar thang ma )dang por dang (dkar chag ldan dkar ma )gnyis pa yin pa dang/de gnyis ka btsan po khri lde srong btsan sad na legs kyi dus su byung tshul sor bzhag byas pa yin/(dkar chag ldan dkar ma )brtsams pa'i 'brug lo de btsan po khri lde srong btsan gyis sa stag (798)lo nas shing lug (815)bar srid dbang skyong ba'i bzhed pa ltar byas na de'i ring la 'brug log nyis yung ba'i 'brug lo snga ma ni lcags 'brug (800)yod yin pa dang/'brub