dkar chag 'phang thang ma|{sngar btsan mo'i dus skabs su bod skad du bsgyur ba'i bka' bstan pho brang 'phang thang ma nang bzhugs pa rnams kyi dkar chag gi ming yin/dkar chag 'di'i mad pa po ni lo tsA ba ska ba dpal brtsegs dang/chon kyi snying po/de wan+d+re (lha'i dbang po/dpal lhun po bcas yin pa dang/dus skabs ni btsan po khri lde srong btsan sad na legs kyis skabs su pho brang 'phang thang ka med kyi gtsug lag khang dub zhugs pa'i bka' bstan rnams la/tsheg bar brgyad re la sh+lau lo ka re dang/sh+lau ka bkod pa der (dkar chag 'phang thang ma )zhes bod du bka' bstan gyi dkar chag bkod pa'i thog ma de yin par si tu rin chen po chos kyi 'byung gnas dang/zhu chen tshul khrims rin chen gyis gsungs pa ltar 'thad dam snyam/dkar chag 'di yang bu ston rin po ches (chos 'byung gsung rab rin po che'i mdzod )kyi nang tshig 'ga' zhig lung 'dren mdzad pa las/gzhung ngo ma gzigs med pa 'dra ste /skabs der ma dpe yod na lu'i bstan 'gyur gyi nang du nges pa kha snod mdzad kyi red snyam}
