dkar rtsis kyi rig pa|{(skar rtsis )phyi rol gyi nyi zla gza' skar sogs kyi 'khor bgrod la brten nas dus kyi dbye ba dang/gnam gshis kyi 'gyur ldog chos nyid shes thabs kyi rtsis rig cig la zer/rig gnas lnga'i gzhung phal che ba'i nang skar rtsis shes na rangs la mi rmongs zhes bshad pa ltar/gna' rabs skar rtsis kyis gtso bor brtsi bya ni dus kyi tshad brtsi ba dang de'i zhar la gzugs kyi tshad brtsi ba yang shes dgos shing/deng rabs kyi skar rtsis la dus kyi tshad dang/gzugs kyi tshad gnyis ka'i sgo nas brtsi dgos te/de yang nyi zla sogs kyi rgyu dang gza' skar rnams kyi 'khor 'gros phyur bul dang/'char nub sogs mang po zhig na dus kyi tshad 'jal ba'i sgo nas brtsi dgos la/de dag phan tshur bar gyi thag ring thung dang/'od kyi tshad sogs 'ga' zhig ni gzugs kyi bong tshad 'jal ba'i sgo nas brtsi dgos pa yin/de la dus kyi tshar 'jal tshul dang/gzugs can gyi tshad 'jal tshul/rtsi byed kyi grangs bcas gsum gyi sgo nas shes dgos/dang po/dus kyi tshad 'jal ba'i tshul ni/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi (mngon pa mdzod )dang ('dul ba lung )sogs las rtsi tshul mi 'dra ba 'ga' zhig bshad yod kyang skar rtsis rig pa dang (dus 'khor )las bshad pa'i brtsi tshul ni/skyes bu nad med pa zhig gi dbugs 'gro 'ong gnyis re la khug pa gcig tu rtsis pa'i dbugs drug la chu srang gcig dang/chu srang drug cu tham pa ste/dbugs cha sum brgya drug cu la chu tshod gcig /chu tshod drug cu tham pa la nyin zhag gcig tu rtsis pa yin cing/('di'i chu tshod de yongs grags kyi chu tshod dang bsdur nas rtsis na/yongs grags kyi chu tshod gcig la skar rtsis pa'i lugs kyi chu tshod gnyis dang/chu srang sum cu yin )nyin zhag gcig la dbugs nyis khri chig stong drug brgya yod/nyin zhag sum cu la zla ba gcig dang/zla ba bcu gnyis la lo gcig tu brtsi shing/de la dus bzhi dang/dus bzhi chen po dang/bskal pa dang/bskal chen sogs kyi rnam bzhag 'jog rgyu yod la/gzhan yang gza' dang/tshes grangs/skar ma/sbyor ba/byed pa bcas lnga ni rtsis kyi yan lag lnga dang/gza' lnga so so'i 'gyur ba dang/bul ba dang/drang po dang/'k