dkar yol|{da yod (rgya bod yig tshang )sogs dpyad gzhi'i yig cha 'ga' zhig gzhir bzung na/sngar dus rabs bdun pa'i mjug bod kyi btsan po 'dus srong mang po rjes srid dbang skyong skabs rgyal po'i bsnyun gzhir phan pa'i ja shing gi lo ma 'tshol du btang skabs mes rgyal kyi lho phyogs 'jang gi yul nas ja shing lo ma rnyed de bod du dbor 'dren byas shing/ja shing gi lo ma'i khu ba des btsan po 'dus srong mang po rje'i bsnyun gzhi seng dwangs byung bar brten btsan pos rgyun du ja 'thung ba'i goms gshis chags shing/ja 'thung ba'i snod spyad spyir btang ma yin pa zhig dgos par dgongs nas thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ma wu tse the'an {(WP:1,194)}la pho nya btang nas dkar yul ta dkar che chung sna tshogs dgos zhes re ba 'don gnang mdzad kyang dkar yol ngo ma bskur rgyur khas len ma byas par dkar yol bzo rtsal mkhas pa'i mi gnyis bod du btang 'byor byung zhing/skabs der lho kha gra nang sogs sa gnas 'ga' zhig nas dkar yol bzo ba'i rgyu cha'i thon khungs 'ga' zhig bed spyad nas dkar yol bzos pa las/dkar yol rgyu cha legs shos rdo'i rigs las bzos pa rnams la ri mo bya'i kha la ja shing gi lo ma khyer ba zhig yod pa dang/'bring gras kyi ri mo la mtsho yi nang du nya yod pa/dkyus ma'i gras kyi ri mo la spang ri shing dang bcas pa yis shig ces btsan pos bka' gnang/dkar yol legs gras khag gsum yi ming la shab tshe/lan tshe/shang tshe zhes btags shing/'bring dang dkyus ma'i mang la theg tshe/nges tshe/rdo tshe bcas su ming btags par bshad/dkar yol bzo ba'i lag rgyun ni bod kyi rab byung dgu pa'i mgor mkhas grub gan dkar zhes lho kha gra nang gi mkhas gru nor bzang rgya mtsho sku gzhon nu'i skabs dkar yol mi nyung ba zhig bzo gnang mdzad pa'i lo rgyus yig cha'i nang 'khod pa de la yongs grags su gra dkar zhes 'bod par bshad/de nas rgyu cha'i thon khungs dkon pa'i rkyen gyis yin nam bod dkar bzo ba'i lag rgyun chad 'dug /dkar yol bzo thabs kyi rig pa 'ga' zhig sde dge dis dmar dge bshes bstan 'dzin phun tshogs kyis mdzad pa'i (bzo yig pa tra'i )nang khag gnyis bkod yod ci nga/dkar yol l