dkar leb drung yig pad+ma rdo rje|{mtshan gzhan o rgyan rdo rje nang rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa rta (1858)lor gtsang phyogs la stod ding ri sher dkar rdzong khongs sku re zhes pa'i sa'i char 'khrungs shing/dkar leb dgon gyi drung yig mdzad myong bas yongs grags su dkar leb drung yig ces 'bod/dgung lo chung dus mthong brag rin po che dang/stag tsang bla ma rin po che/rdzogs rin rang shar gang grol sogs bla ma mang po sa'i drung du rim par bod yig dang lan war sogs yig rigs khag dang/lhag par brda sprod pa'i gzhung lugs kyis mtshon rig pa'i gnas mang spor slob gnyer mdzad/dgung lo nyi shu tsam nas brda sprod pa'i gzhung lugs la brdar sha chod pa'i sum rtags mkhan po khyad du 'phags pa zhig yin pa thog snyan dngags dang tshad ma'i gzhung lugs/dang don rig pa sogs gang gi thad mkhas pa'i go 'phang rnyed/dkar leb dgon nas drung yig dgongs zhu gnang ste stod khul du phyir log phebs rjes dbus gtsang spyi dang bye brag la stod kyi yogs su sam rtags gtso bor gyur pa'i rig gnas slob khrid rgya cher mdzad nas rim gras 'dra min ris su ma chad pa'i slob ma'i tshogs mang du bskyangs/'brog chu bzang rin po che sku mched dang/pa rnam khams brag sprul pa'i sku/nges don grub dbang thon bla kun bzang rdo rje'i sku tsha cho sa dar sku ma ched sogs sum rtags la mkhas pa'i slob ma du ma byung/snga rjes su (thon mi'i dgongs rgyan )dang/(rtags kyi 'jug pa'i dka' gtan snying po rab gsal/) (mtha' dpyod dwangs shel me long )sogs rtsom 'bri mdzad /de min brda sprod kyi gzhung la mkhas par grags pa'i 'bras ljongs bla ma o rgyan lags dang khu nu ba bstan 'dzin rgyal mtshan rin po ches gnang ba'i rtsod yig la rtsod lan dang/yang lan/khams brag sprul sku rin po che'i bzhed tshul dang/shar khum bu ba ngag dbang tshul khrims gyi 'dri bar dris lan mdzad pa'i rtsom yig dang/lhag par dris lan gan+d+hir+b+ha'i gling bu dang zhor 'thung rus pa zhes pa ni dgung lo bdun cu don lngar rtsom 'bri gnang ba zhig yin/mdor na bod kyi rig gnas bya gzhag ched du 'bad brtson lhod med mdzad/'das lo mi gsal}
