dkon mchog|{ha cang dkon pa'i nor bu rin po che las lhag pa dang/bsod nams gsog pa'i zhing mchog tu gyur pa yin pas na dkon mchog ces brjod pa dang/de yang chos gsungs pa po sangs rgyas dang/de gsungs ba'i chos/chos de nyams su len pa'i dge 'dus bcas gsum la dkon mchog gsum zhes brjod pa yin/rgya gar skad du rat+na zhes pa rgya nag gi skad du bsgyur skabs san sba'o {(WP:1,194)}ste nor bu gsum zhes bsgyur yang/bod skad du bsgyur dkon mchog ces bsgyur ba de rgya gar skad kyi don ma nor bar bsgyur yod}
dkon mchog gi dkor len pa|{dad pa can gyis sku gsung thugs rten dang/lha khang/dge 'dun bcas la phul ba'i mchod pa'i rdzas dang/spyi rdzas rgyu dngos/sa zhing/sems can la sogs pa bdag gnyer byed mkhan gyis rang don du byed spyod byas pa ste/sangs rgyas dang chos kyi ched du phul ba rang don du longs spyod rjes su tshab phul na nyes pa dag thub kyang/dge 'dun gyi spyi rdzas rang don du bed spyod byas na rjes su tshab phul nas bshags pa byas kyang nyes pa dag mi thub par (mdo mdzangs blun )dang (las brgya pa )sogs las gsungs}
