dkon mchog gi drung tu rang rtags rang gis blang|{de sngon dus rabs bcu pa'i 'go stod du mnga' ris khul nang bstan chos lugs bskyar gso ma byung gong du mnga' ris gu ge'i rgyal po lha bla ma ye shes 'od chos la dad pa ha cang che bar brten/rang byung gnang 'dod che yang sdom pa zhu yul med stabs ston pa'i sku brnyan gyi mdun du rab byung gi chas gos bzhes nas btsun pa'i gzugs su bsgyur gnang mdzad/mtshan yang ye shes 'od du bsgyur/rjes su rgya gar shar phyogs kyi paN+Di ti d+harma pA la spyan drangs nas sdom rgyun spel skabs gzhan dag dang mnyam du sdom pa zhu ba yin zhes (deb sngon )du gsal/mkhas dbang sngon byon 'ga' zhig gis gong gsal sho tshul ma dag rgyun 'byams yin pa dang/dgung lo mthon por ma phebs bar du srid bskyangs nas rjes su sras la srid skyong du mnga' gsol te paN+Di ta dz+nya na shri'i drung du khri thang pa ye shes bzang po dang mnyam du rab byung dang bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes shing/mkhan po dz+nya na shris khong gnyis la mtshan zur ye shes yod pa 'dogs gnang mdzad pas khri thang pa la ye shes bzang po dang/lha bla mar ye shes 'od ces mtshan thogs pa yin zhes gsungs pas gsungs tshul de gnyis gang khungs btsan min brtag }
dkon mchog dgu phrug gang zhe na|{phyi'i dkon mchog sangs rgyas cho sa dang dge 'dun gsum/nang gi dkon mchog bla ma yi dam mkha' 'gro gsum/gsang ba'i dkon mchog chos sku/longs sku/sprul sku gsum dang dgu'o/_}
dkon mchog rgyal po|{'khon dkon mchog rgyal po/rab byung dang po'i shing khyi (1034)nas rab byung gnyis pa'i chu rta (1102)lo 'khon shAkya blo gros la sras gnyis byung ba'i chung ba yin/thog mar gsang sngags rnying ma la mkhas par sbyangs shing/rjes su gsang sngags gsar ma la sbyangs/rma lo tsA ba dang/ba ri lo tsA ba/pu hrang lo tsA ba/gnam kha'u pa sogs bla ma mkhas pa mang du bsten/dbon po ri gling po che nyam ba 'dra ba'i mkhal khung g.yas pa'i thad du sa dkar zhing snum pa dang/chu bo g.yas su 'bab pa sogs sa bzang bar gzigs te der dgon pa zhig 'debs par dgongs nas sa cha spyi'i bdag po jo bo gdong nag pa la gnang ba zhus/sgos kyi bdag po zhal zhung gu ra ba da nga/bad de grong bzhi/lha mi grong bdun zer ba de rnams rta god pa dkar mo gcig dang/nor bu'i phreng ba/mo gos gcig la sogs pa gnang nas sa chu de nyos te rab byung dang po'i chu glang (1073)lor sa skya'i dgon pa btab/lcam gnyis yod pa snga ma la sras ma byung/rjes su ma gcig zhang mo zer ba khab tu bzhes pas sras chen kun dga' snying po 'khrungs/dgung lo drug cu re dug la sgo rum du sku gshegs/bla ma 'di'i rnam thar lo rgyus rgyas pa bdag chen a mes zhabs kyis mdzad pa'i (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )sde dge dpar ma'i shog grangs 9nas 13bar gsal}
dkon mchog rjes dran|{nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i chos pa rnams kyis nyin gung gi kha zas za ba'i sngon du 'don rgyu'i dkon mchog gsum gyi yon tan brjod pa'i mdo tshig lhug mar yod pa zhig}
dkon mchog bstan 'dzin 'phrin las rnam rgyal|{'bri gung gi gdan rabs nyer brgyad pa 'di nyid kong po'i yul gyi sa'i char 'khod pa'i mnga' bdag myang gi sku rgyud sngags 'chang zhig gi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags stag (1770)lor sku bltams/'bri gung gi gdan rabs nyir bdun pa dkon mchog bstan 'dzin chos kyi nyi ma mchog nas rje 'di nyid dgung lo bdun pa la 'bri gung gdan rabs nyer drug pa dkon mchog bstan 'dzin 'gro 'dul dpal ldan chos kyi nyi ma 'phrin las phyogs las rnam rgyal mchog gi yang srid du ngos 'dzin mdzad de me sprel (1776)lor chung srid 'bri gung du gdan drangs/de nas thil du chos rje rin po che'i drung du dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan dkon ma chog bstan 'dzin 'phrin las rnam rgyal zhes bstsal/'bri gung pa'i bka' chos phal che ba dang bde 'dus sogs gsar rnying gi zab chos mang du gsan/dgung lo bco lnga'i steng dge tshul gyi bslab sdom bzhes/mtshan bstan 'dzin pad+ma'i rgyal mtshan 'jigs med 'phrin las phyogs thams cad las rnam par rgyal ba'i sde zhes gsol/lho rin po che chos kyi rgyal las dbang chos mang du gsan/dgung lo bcu dgu la phebs pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa spel (1788)lor 'bri gung gi gdan rabs nyer brgyad pa'i khrir phebs/lcags sprel (1800)lor 'bri gung gi gdan rabs gser phreng zhes bya ba brtsams/dgung lo nyer gsum pa la rjes chos kyi nyi mas mkhan po dang/lho rin po ches las slob mdzad nus dge 'dus kha skong grangs tshang ba'i dbus su bsnyen par rdzogs/lo de rang la rje gong ma dgongs pa rdzogs pas 'bri gung gdan sa'i thugs 'gan yongs rdzogs bdag gis bzhes/sku tshe smad kyi mdzad rnam dang 'das lo sogs ma rnyed}
dkon mchog rnam gnyis|{sangs rgyas dang/'khor los bsgyur ba'i rgyal po gnyis la zer bar (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' stod )du gsal}
dkon mchog sprin|{mdo 'di sde dge bka' 'gyur (mdo mang (wa)pa'i nang yod/dkar chag tu lo tsA ba rin chen 'tsho dang chos nyid tshul khrims gnyis kyis bod skad du bsgyur zhes 'khod yod}
dkon mchog dbu yogs|{gna' rabs kyi brda rnying pa ste/dkon mchog gsum la lan ngan bsags pa'i nyes tshad tshe 'di rang la myong ba'am smin pa zhes pa'i don}
dkon mchog brtsegs pa|{bka' 'gyur gyi nang du yod pa'i mdo zhig gi ming/sngar rgya gar tu mdo 'di la le'u stong phrag brgya yod par grags kyang sangs rgyas chos lugs la dgra thems gsum byung ba'i rkyen gyis le'u bzhi bcu zhe dgu ma gtogs de 'phros mes tshig nas ma tshang bar gyur pa las/ma dpe le'u cha tshang yod pa mang che ba rgya gar nas rnyed pa dang/'ga' zhig li yul dang/rgya nag nas rnyed pa bcas lo tsA ba zhang ye shes sdes bap+sagayur zhing skad gsar bcad kyis bcos pa/nyung shas zhig lo tsA ba rdarma tA shI la dang/'gos chos grub kyis bsgyur ba bcas sde dge bka' 'gyur gyi mdo phyogs (dkon brtsegs )pod pa dang nas cha pa bar yod cing/dkar chag tu bam rangs dang 'gyur byang gsal por 'khod yod}
dkon mchog rin chen|{('bri gung che tshang sku phreng dang po )'bri gung gdan rabs nyer gnyis pa dkon mchog rin chen ni gdan rabs gnyer gcig pa dang yum gnyis gcig pa yin/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa'i 'os sprul du yod kyang yab nas 'bri gung gi bstan par dgongs nas gtong 'dod ma gnang/dgung lo dgu pa yab (rgan chos )gyi drung nas rab tu byung/mtshan dkon mchog rin chen du gsol/dgung lo bcu drug steng gcen zhwa dmar ba las dge tshul gyi sdom bzhes thog dus 'khor sogs kyi dbang gsan/de bzhin bla ma du ma bsten du gsung chos mang po gsan nas sgrub pa nyams bzhes mdzad cing/'bri gung dang/'phan po/tsa ri/lho kha sogs su phebs te chos 'khor rgya che bskor/dgung lo nyer drug skabs gdan sa'i khrir phebs/gser khang sogs la nyams gso rten bzhengs rgyas par gnang/ris med kyi dge 'dun sder bsnyen bkur rgya che mdzad/gdung rgyud spel bar ma mdzad stabs skyu ra'i gdung 'di nas chad/dgung lo re lnga'i steng sku 'das/che tshang sku phreng dang por 'dren/slob ma'i mchog tu gyur pa dkon mchog chos kyi rgyal po yang mal gro ba rab tu 'khrungs shing/rin chen brag sogs kyi bla ma mdzad do/_}
dkon mchog la bsngos pa'i nor|{chos dad can gyi mi dang tshogs pas dkon mchog gsum gyi ched du phul ba'i rgyu nor ste/sangs rgyas la phul ba ni sangs rgyas kyi sku dang mchod rten bzhengs pa'i rgyu cha'am mchod pa 'bul ba'i ched du phul ba/chos la phul ba ni sangs rgyas bzhengs pa'am/klog pa/chos 'a chad pa dang nyan pa sogs kyi med du phul ba/dge 'dun la phul ba ni dge 'dun gyi sde bzhengs pa dang bsnyen bskur 'bul ba sogs kyi ched du phul ba bcas la zer zhing/de yang phul yin pa'am 'bul rgyur thag bcad zin pa gnyis ka yod}
dkon mchog gsum|{sangs rgyas chos lugs la skyabs su 'gro ba'i dkon mchog gsum ste/1 chos gsungs pa po sangs rgyas/2 des gsungs pa'i chos/3 chos de nyams su len pa'i dge 'dun bcas gsum ni ha cang dkon pa rin po che las lhag pa dang bsod nams kyi zhing mchod du gyur pa yin pas dkon mchog zer/de yang dkon mchog gsum ni 'jig rten du byung ba'i dus skabs shin tu dkon pa dang/bsod nams gsog pa'i zhing lnga'i nang nas mchog tu gyur pa yin pas na dkon ma chog ces bod kyi lo tsA ba rnams kyis rgya gar skad rat+na zhes pa thad bsgyur ma mdzad par don 'gyur mdzad pa yin/de yang rje btsun byams pa mgon pos/'byung ba dgon phyir dri med phyir/_/mthu ldan phyir dang 'jigs rten gyi/_/rgyan gyur phyir dang mchog nyid phyir/_/'byung ba med phyir dkon mchod nyid/_/ces gsungs pa ltar yin bzhin gyi nor bu rin po che dang chos drug gi sgo nas mtshungs pas na dkon mchog ces pa'i mtshan gsol/chos mtshungs tshul ni dang po/yid bzhin gyi nor bu rin po che snod bcud skal ba phun sum tshogs pa'i dus 'ga' re la 'byung gi gzhan du mi 'byung bas 'byung ba shin tu dkon pa ltar/dkon mchog gsum po dang gdul bya'i bsod nams dang smon lam khyad par can 'dzoms na 'byung gi de las gzhan du mi 'byung bas 'a byung ba dkon pa/gnyis pa/yid bzhin gyi nor bu rin po cher g.ya' la sogs pa'i nyes spyon gyi dri mas ma gos pa bzhin du dkon mchog gsum yang nyes pa'i dri mas ma gos pas dri ma med pa dang/gsum pa/yid bzhin gyi nor bu rin po cher rgyal khams dbul phongs sel ba'i mthu dang ldan pa ltar/dkon mchog gsum yang gdul bya'i sdug bsngal sel ba'i mthu dang ldan pas mthu ldan/bzhi pa/yid bzhin gyi nor bu rin po che 'jig rten gyi rgyan yin pa ltar/dkon dkon gsum yang thar pa don gnyer ba rnams kyi rgyan yin pas 'jig rten gyi rgyan/lnga pa/de 'jig rten pa'i rgyan gyi mchog yin pa ltar/dkon mchog gsum yang skyabs gnas gzhan las mchog tu gyur pas ma chog tu gyur pa/drug pa/de la bstod smad sogs kyis rnam par 'gyur ba med pa ltar dkon mchog gsum yang rnam par gyur pa'i rang bzhin can ma yin pas 'gyur ba med pa'o/_/de lta bu'i dkon mchog rin po che rnam pa gsum gyi mtshan nyid dang/mtshan gzhi ni/don gnyis mthar phyin pa'i skyabs gnas mthar thug sangs rgyas dkon mchog gi mtshan nyin/sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa lta bu dang de'i sku gsung thugs kyi yon tan mtha' dag sangs rgyas dkon mchog gi mtshan gzhi yin/'gog lam gang rung gis bsdus pa'i 'phags pa'i rnam byang bden pa chos dkon ma chog gi mtshan nyid/nyon mongs ma lus pa spangs pa'i so sor brtags 'gog lta bu mtshan gzhi/rig grol gyi yon tan brgya da sogs gang rung dang ldan pa'i 'phags pa'i gar zag dge 'dun dkon mchog gi mtshan nyid/klu sgrub yab sras lta bu/de'i mtshan gzhi/theg pa gsum gyi 'phags pa'i gang zag re re ba dang/so skye'i btsun pa khris ldan bzhi sde yan chad dge 'dun dkon ma chog gi dod thub tu 'jog pa yin}
dkon mchog gsum gyi dkor 'phrog pa|{dad pa can rnams kyis dkon ma chog la phul ba'i rgyu nor rnams rang nyid la yod pa'i dbang cha bed spyad nas tshul 'phrog pa dang/yang na kha mchu rgyab ste tshur 'phrog pa}
dkon mchog gsum gyi rten|{1 dad pa can rnams kyi rten sku gzugs dang/mchod rten/2 chos dkon mchog gi rten gsung rab/3 dge 'dun dkon mchog gi rten dge 'dun gyi sde bcas yin}
