dkon pa rje gung stag|{chos rgyal khri srong lde btsan gyi nang blon/yab 'khon bar skyes dang yum btsan bza' lcam bu sgron gyi sras/'di nyid mthu stobs dang rdzu 'phrul che le/blo dang rig pa rgod pa/gzugs dang lang tsho 'dzoms pa/kun gyi yid 'phrog pa zhig yod pas 'di 'dra mi yi yul du skyes pa dkon zer nas mtshan yang dkon pa rje gung stag ces gsol/khong gis dge bcu tsang ba'i bsam yas la gnas bcas pas chos rgyal khri srong lde btsan gyi thugs la babs nas nang blon bcol/glang bza' de chung ma khab tu bzhes par sras gnyis 'khrungs pa'i che ba la 'khon klu'i dbang po dang chung ba la 'khon rdo rje rin chen zhu'o/_}
