dkor sgrom 'phrin yig|{dkor zhes pa nor rdzas la zer zhing/de blugs sa'i sgam la sgrom zer ba gnyis kyi ming bsdus nas dkor sgrom zhes brjod cing/'phrin yig ces pa 'di rang la 'bru 'grel brgyab na 'phrin ni brgyud nas bshad pa'i gtam la zer la/gtam de yig thog nas btang bar 'a phrin yig ces btags pa'o/_/de sngon bod kyi mtshan po'i dus skabs su rgyal po'i bka' yig rnams shing las bzos pa'i sgrom bu chung ngu'i nang du blugs gtong srol yod pa dang/rjes su bka' yig rnams shog bu'i yig rgya bzos nas gtong srol byung}
dkor gnyan po ril blugs|{dkor mdzod du sbas pa'i nor rdzas la mi ma yin gyis srung skyob byed bzhin yod pa rnams blangs na des gnod pa skyel ba'i rigs shig ste/de 'dra'i sgrung gtam mang po dmangs kyi ngag rgyun du shod srol yod}
dkor bdag spyan drangs tshul|{rgyal po khri srong lde btsan skabs slob dpon chen po pad+mas bka' gnang ba ltar lha sras mu rub btsan po dmag dpon du bskos nas b+ha ta hor gyi sgom grwa bcom te de'i nor rnams drangs pa'i rjes su rgyal po pe har 'brangs te 'ongs pa bsam yas gtsug lag khang gi srung mar bskos pa sogs kyi lo rgyus (bka' thang )gi nang gsal ba de yin}
dkor nor|{bu mag par btang ba'am bu mo mna' mar gtong skabs pha mas nor skal du sprad pa'i dngos po}
dkor blugs pa'i pho nyar btang ba|{dkor nor len pa'i sku tshab tu mngags pa ste pho nya zhes pa skabs re yi ge skyel mkhan sku tshab la go dgos}
dkor sbyong|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la dad pa can gyi gshin po dang gson pos phul ba'i dngos po la ba sngo ba dang smon lam sogs ma byas par gang byung du blangs pa dang/longs spyod pa sogs byas na skye ba 'di dang phyi mar rnam smin gyi 'bras bu sdug bsngal rgyun mi chad pa myong dgos pa'i rgyu mtshan gtam rgyud dang bcas (mdo mdzangs blun )dang/('dul ba lung gi gleng gzhi/) (mdo sde las brgya pa )bcas las gsungs pa de rnams yin}
dkor mdzod|{1 rgyal po dang srid gzhung gi rgyu nor 'jog sa'i bang mdzod/2 gsum rab dang gal che'i yig cha 'jog sa'i mdzod khang/3 mi rabs gong ma'i shul bzhag rgyu nor 'jog sa'i mdzod khang bcas go don mi 'dra ba yod pas/tshig snga phyi'i brjod don dang bstun nas go ba len dgos}
dkor mdzod du blugs pa|{bod snga rabs kyi brda rnying pa ste/sa gnas gzhan du yod pa'i gna' rabs kyi rgyu nor sbas shul bsngog 'don byed pa'i don}
dkor mdzod pe har gling|{sngar btsan po khri srong lde btsan skabs bsam yas gtsug lag khang gi byang ngos su bzhengs pa'i rgyal po pe har gyi rten bzhugs sa'i lha khang gi ming ste/'di'i nang du b+ha ta hor gyi sgom grwa'i rgyu nor rtsa chen mang po bod du drangs pa dang/rgyal po pe har gyi rten mdos sogs 'jig rten na dkon pa'i rgyu nor rin thang bral ba mang po lha khang der bzhag yod tshul zur tsam (bka' thang )gi nang du gsal zhing/'dir yi ge mang dogs nas ma bris so/_}
dkor zas|{chos dad yod pa'i mis phul ba'i zas rigs rnams longs spyad zin pa'i rjes su/dkor sbyong ba'i sngags dang/bsngo ba smon lam bcas ma bton na skye ba phyi mar rang gi lus thog nas bu len 'jal dgos pa yong tshul nang pa sangs rgyas kyi gsung rab (las brgya pa )dang ('dul ba lung )sogs las gsungs}
dkor sa dge khongs|{de sngon bod sa gnas srid gzhung btsugs rjes dgon sde khag nas rang yul gyi lung tsho yas mas rnams su 'brog khul nas mar phyur sogs dkar bsod dang/zhing khul du 'bru bsod slong mkhan mang ba'i rkyen gyis gzhung sger chos gsum gyi mi sel la brdab gsig che ba ma zad/dgon pa khag gcig gi dge 'dun pa sku rim pa 'bod mkhan mang zhing khag gcig la sku rim du gdan zhu byed mi lta zhog /lo gcig gi thengs re'i bsod snyoms kyang ster mkhan med stabs/dgon pa mang po rtsa stongs su ro ba'i nyen kha yod pa bcas sngon 'gog yong ched/tA la'i bla ma rin po che sku phreng lnga pas mchod gzhis dang mi ser med pa'i dgon pa rnams bsod snyoms slong sa dang/sku rim 'gro sa'i sa khul gtan khel dang/sa khul de nas brgal te bsod snyoms dang/sku rim la 'gro mi chog pa'i bcad mtshams bzos pa gnang yod cing/bcad mtshams sa khul de la dkor sa dge khongs zhes ming 'bod srol yod}
dkyil khang|{bkra shis lhun po'i grwa tsang khag bzhi'i nang gi gcig yin/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng dang po dge 'dun grub kyi dngos slob dpal ldan chos skyong gis mtshan nyid kyi 'chad nyan mdzad pa nas 'phel rgyas byung ste grwa tsang zur du chags pa yin/grwa tshang 'di'i mtshan la dkyil khang grwa tsang legs bshad gling zer zhing/sngon dus rje dge 'dun grub zhal bzhugs pa'i dus su mi tshan bcu yod pa'i thog /paN chen rin po che sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos rgyan gyi skabs grwa grangs 'phar te mi tshan drug bcas bsdoms pa'i mi tshan bcu drug yod pa na/1 dper thub mi tshan/2 gu ge /3 stag mo/4 lhun rtse/5 'dar pa/6 mdangs can/7 la kha/8 ri mkhar/9 rong pa/10 gnas snying (de rnams rje dge 'dun grub pa'i dus su byung ba/) 11 bde ba can pa/12 chos sbug /13 khal kha/14 o rgyan rdzong pa/15 glo sbug /16 rdo gdan bcas (de rnams paN chen rin po che lo bzang chos rgyan gyi sku dus su gsar 'phar byung )yin/slob gnyer gnang skabs kyi gtso bo'i yig cha ni/khri chen man lam dpal bas mdzad pa'i (rnam 'grel )le'u bzhi/'dul 'dzin blo gros sbas pas mdzad pa'i (rnam 'grel )le'u bzhi'i spyi don dang (rnam 'grel )le'u dang po dang le'u gnyis pa'i mtha' dpyod/rje bstan pa dar bzang gis mdzad pa'i (rnam 'grel lung rigs gter mdzod )dang (phar phyin spyi don dga' gnas gsal byed/) kun mkhyen legs pa don grub kyis mdzad pa'i (phar phyin spyi don/) shan+ti pa blo gros rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (dbu ma'i spyi don don gsal )dang/(dbu ma'i mtha' gcod legs bshad snang byed )dang/'dul ba lung rigs nyi ma/) paN chen dbe legs nyi mas mdzad pa'i (mdzod lung rigs gter mdzod )sogs yin/grwa tshang 'di'i gdan rabs ni p+salob dpon dpal ldan chos skyong/'phags pa 'char ga /sangs rgyas dpa'/sangs rgyas dbang phyug /drung chos kyi grags pa/mnga' ris lha btsun blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan/shan+ti blo gros rgyal mtshan/grags chen dpal 'bar/rje bstan pa dar bzang/mkhas pa blo gros rgya mtsho/zhal snga nas blo gros legs pa/sangs rgyas rgya mtsho/jo rdzong pa blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan/dpe thub pa sangs rgyas dpal/zangs mkhar ba sangs rgyas bzang po/gu ge ba 'jam dbyangs rgyal mtshan/zhal snga nas brtson 'grul rgyal mtshan/zhal snga nas chos dpal rgyal mtshan/zhal snga nas blo bzang mgon po/mgon po dpal bzang/blo bzang bkra shis/stag mo ba ye shes rgya mtsho/dpal 'byor rgya mtsho/bde chen pa blo bzang chos 'phel/blo bzang brtson 'grus/ye shes tshe brtan/gu ge ba blo bzang bstan 'dzin/zhal snga nas blo bzang rnam rgyal sogs rim par byon/grwa tsang 'dir bzhugs pa'i rten gsum gyi skor phung bo lcog rje ngag dbang byams pas mdzad pa'i (gdan sa chen po bzhi dang rgyud pa stod smad kyi dkar chag )deng skabs lcags dkar du dpar skrun byas yod par gzigs}
dkyil 'khor|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags nas bshad pa'i lha gtso 'khor yod pa'am/yang na gtso bo rkyang pa bzhugs ba'i gzhal yas khang ri mor bris pa'i ming ste/de yang rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta a b+h+ya ka ra'i bzhes srol rdo rje phreng ba nas bshad pa'i dkyil 'khor bzhi bcu zhe gnyis/kri ya nas bshad pa'i dkyil 'khor gsum/grub chen mi tra dzo ki nas brgyud pa'i mi tra'i dkyil 'khor brgya dang brgyad/(dkyil chog nor bu'i phreng ba )nas gsungs pa'i zur bka'i dkyil 'khor mi 'dra ba drug cu re drug sogs rang gi ming tshig so so'i thad du gzigs}
dkyil 'khor gyi cho ga rdo rje phreng ba|{rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta chen po a b+h+ya ka ras mdzad pa'i gsang sngags rgyud sde bzhi'i lha rnams kyi dbang bskur ba'i cho ga zhig ste/bstan 'gyur sde dge dpar ma'i sngags phyogs kyi pod (phu)pa'i mgor yod/lo tsA ba kher gad 'khor lo grags kyis thog mar bsgyur ba la/dus phyis lo tsA ba shes rab grags kyis bcos shing/de rjes paN+Di ta rak+Shi ta dang/ra hu la shri b+ha dra dang/ma Ni ka shri dz+nya na dang/chag lo tsA lo chos rje dpal gyis 'gyur bcos mdzad/slar yang dpa' lo tsA ba blo gros brtan pas bcos nas dag par mdzad pa yin/'di'i dkyil 'khor rigs mi 'dra ba zhi bcu zhe gnyis kyi dbang bskur tshul gsungs pa ni/1 gsang 'dul 'jam dpal rdo rje lta bcu dgu/2 gsang 'dus mi bskyod rdo rje lha so gnyis/3 rnam snang 'jam pa'i rdo rje lha zhe gsum/4 gshin rje gshed dgra nag lha bcu gsum/5 snying po kyai rdo rje lha dgu/6 thugs kyai rdo rje lha dgu/7 gsung kyai rdo rje lha dgu/8 sku kyai rdo rje lha dgu/9 mkha' 'gro rigs bsdus lha nga gsum/10 bdag med lha mo lha nyer gsum/11 bdag med lha mo bco lnga/12 ku ru ku le lha bco lnga ma/13 sgrol ma lha bcu gcig ma/14 snying po kyai rdo rje rtsa bcu bdun/15 thugs kyai rdo rje lha bcu bdun/16 gsung kyai rdo rje lha bcu bdun/17 sku kyai rdo rje lha bcu bdun/18 bde mchog rdo rje sems dpa' zhi ba lha so bdun/19 'khor lo sdom pa lha drug cu rtsa gnyis/20 'khor lo sdom pa zhal gcig phyag gnyis pa lha drug cu rtsa gnyis/21 'khor lo sdom pa ser po zhal gcig phyag gnyis pa lha drug cu rtsa gnyis pa/22 phag mo dmar mo lha so bdun/23 phag mo sngon mo lha so bdun/24 phag mo sar mo lha so bdun/25 hUM mdzad lha bcu gcig pa/26 bde mchog 'khor lo sgyur drug /27 rje bdud rtsi lnga nyer gcig /28 rdo rje hUM mdzad lha nyer dgu/29 rdo rje khrag 'thung lha nyer gcig /30 bdud rtsi 'khyil ba lha bcu gsum/31 sangs rgyas thod pa lha nyer lnga/32 sangs rgyas thod pa lha dgu/33 sgyu ma chen po lnga/34 rnam rgyal nam mkha' lha nga brgyad/35 ye shes mkha' 'gro lha bcu gsum/36 dus kyi 'khor lo lha drug brgya so bzhi/37 rdor dbyings lha nga gsum/38 gtsug dug lha so bdun/39 chos dbyings gsung dbang lha nyis brgya dang nyer gcig /40 phyag rdor 'byung po 'dul byed lha so gsum/41 'od zer can ma lha lnga/42 gra lnga lha bcu gsum bcas yod cing/dkyil 'khor de dag gi thang ka ni/deng skabs bkra shis 'khyil dang/khams phyogs kyi dgon sde 'ga' zhig tu mjal rgyud yod}
dkyil 'khor gyi steng|{lha sa gtsug lag khang gi 'od khang khyams gra nang ma'i dkyil du yod pa'i mchod 'bul smon lam 'don sa'i tshogs khang de yin/bshad srol la sngar mtsho bsubs pa'i skabs kyi mtsho'i lte ba khel sa yin zer ro/_}
dkyil 'khor gyi gtso bo|{'di la go rgyu gnyis yod/1 rang gis bsgom bya'i dkyil 'khor de'i lha gtso bo/2 sngags kyi cho ga gal che ba dbang bskur ba dang/rab gnas/sbyin sreg /'khrul 'khor/gtor ma'i lam sbyor bcas byed pa po'i rdo rje slob dpon la go rgyu yod pa bcas yin no/_}
dkyil 'khor nyer bsdu|{'jigs byed lta bur mtshon na/gzhal yas khang rang la thim pa dang/rang dam tshig sems dpa'/de ye shes sems dpa'/de ting nge 'dzin sems dpa' la thim/ting nge 'dzin sems dpa' zhabs kyu dang/ha'i mgo bo/mgo bo zla tshes/zla tshes thig le/theg le na da/na da yang mi dmigs pa sgom pa lta bu la 'jog }
dkyil 'khor gnyis|{1 phyi'i dkyil 'khor te/rdul tshon gyi dkyil 'khor dang ras bris kyi dkyil 'khor/2 nang lus kyi dkyil 'khor yin cing/de yang bsgom bya'i dkyil 'khor yi grub gzhi phyi'i rdul tshon dang/ras bris kyi dkyil 'khor la brten pa yin pas na yi'i dkyil 'khor zhes brjod pa dang/nang lus kyi dkyil 'khor na bsgom bya'i dkyil 'khor gyi grub gzhi rang gi lus kyi cha shas rnams la brten nas gzhal yas khang dang lha tshogs rnams bskyed pa yin pan nang rdo rjes lus kyi dkyil 'khor zhes brjod pa yin}
dkyil 'khor rnam gsum|{gzhi lhun grub rtsa ba'i dkyil 'khor dang lus kyi dkyil 'khor/lam gzugs brnyan thabs kyi dkyil 'khor rdul tshon ras bris dang tshom bu sogs/'bras bu rnam dag rang bzhin gyi dkyil 'khor ting nge 'dzin no/_/yang na/rang bzhin gyi dkyil 'khor/ting nge 'dzin gyi dkyil 'khor/gzugs brnyan gyi dkyil 'khor/yang na rgyud ma hA yo ga'i phyi snang srid gzhir bzhengs kyi dkyil 'khor/lang a nu yo ga'i nang sgyu ma lus kyi dkyil 'khor/man ngag a ti yo ga'i gsang ba rtog tshogs chos nyid kyi dkyil 'khor ro/_}
dkyil 'khor bri ba|{(rdo rje 'phreng ba )dang/(mi tra brgya rtsa )la sogs pa gsang sngags kyi gzhung nas bshad pa'i lha yi dkyil 'khor rdul tshon la brten bri ba dang chu tshon la brten nas bri ba/de yang rdul tshon gyi dkyil 'khor bri skabs lha gnas so sor lha sku mi 'god par pha mtshan dang sa bon gyi yi ge gang rigs bkod pa dang/ras bris kyi dkyil 'khor la lha sku bkod pa'i phyag srol yod/de yang thog mar dkyil 'khor so so'i cha tshad nges pa can gyi thig rtsa blor bzung nas slob dpon gyi drung du lag khrid dang slob sbyong/rgyugs len/dngos sbyong bcas slob khrid kyi rim pa rnams brgyud/gzhi nad dkyil 'khor bri ba'i lan kar dngos su zhugs chog pa yin/thig rtsa'i skor rgyas bsdus sna tshogs yod pa'i nang nas thig rtsa dang/tshon 'byed/tshon bzo/blos bslang bcas cha tshang 'jug pa bde ba ni/rong tha blo bzang dam chos rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i (thig gi lag len rim pa gal bar bshad pa bzo rig mdzes pa'i kha rgyan )lha sa dpar mar shog grangs 85yod pa de yin/'di'i nang gsang sngags kyi rdo rje slob dpon dang/mchod g.yog gis nges par du shes par bya dgos pa'i thig rtsa lag len dang bcas pa go bde zhing zhib cing ra bar gsungs yod pas/'di'i nang don ngo sprod ni bsham gsal thig rtsa zhes pa'i skabs su gsal bas der gzigs}
dkyil 'khor blos bslang|{bsgom bya'i gzhal yas dang tshogs kyi dkyil 'khor 'bul thon langs gzungs su bzhengs pa ste deng skabs 'dzugs skrun bye bkod pas ra langs gzugs can dang mtshungs pa yin/de sngon bod du gdan sa chen po bzhi dang/lha sa gtsug lag khang/sku 'bum/bkra shis 'khyil/sa skyi/ngam ring sogs dgon sde che ba phal che ba'i nang dkyil 'khor blos bslang che chung sna tshogs 'jim pa dang shing tsan dan/gser dngul sogs las bzhengs pa mang po yod cing/deng sang mthong rgyu yod pa ni/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa rin po che dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das rjes sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos dgongs rdzogs su bzhengs pa'i dus 'khor blos bslang deng sang po tA la pho brang dmar po'i dus 'khor lha khang du yod pa de dang/tA la'i bla ma rin po che sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtshos dgu lo zhe gnyis su phebs pa rang byung bcu gsum pa'i sa sbrul (1749)sor dben sa snyan rgyud dang/smad rgyud/srad rgyud pa rnams kyi blos bslang phyag srol rnams gung bsgrigs thog dga' ldan du rje tsong kha pa chen pos gsar bzhengs gnang ba'i gsang ba 'dus pa dang/bde mchog /rdor dbyings bcas kyi blos bslang/'bras spungs sngags khang gi blos bzang bcas la zhib gzigs mdzad de rgyu gser zangs la rin po che p+s+n+ya tshogs kyis khra btab pa'i bde mchog dang/gsang ba 'dus pa/'jigs byed bcas kyi blos bslang bzo bkod 'gran zla bral ba rim bzhin bzhengs gnang mdzad cing/de'i gnas tshul skor gang ma chen lung gis mkhyen rjes chu sprel (1752)lor dkyil 'khor gsum so so'i cha tshad dang mthun pa'i rta babs spus legs ngo grangs bcu gnyis la gong ma chen lung rang nyid kyi mtshan byang 'khod pa phyag rtags su 'bul gnang mdzad pa de bzhin deng sang po tA la pho brang dmar po'i blos bslang ni pho lha ba bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis rgyu sbyor sbyin bdag byas te rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu byi (1732)lor rgyu cha rnams tsan dan dkar po dang/drwa ba dra phyed rnams mu tig las bzos pa zhig gsar bzhengs byas/de'i thig tshad dang bzo bkod rnams zhogs don yod mkhas grub kyi slob ma dwags po dge bshes blo bzang sbyin pas mtshan pa zhig de sngon lha sa gtsug lag khang gi dbu rtse'i blos bslang khang du bzhugs yod pa der zer/de'i dkar chag ni/dwags po dge bshes sku ngo mas mdzad pa (gsang bde 'jigs gsum gyi blo bslang dkar chag legs bshad nor bu'i do shal )zhol dpar khang shar gyi dpar ma la shog grangs 66yod/dkyil 'khor blos bslang bzhengs stabs skor rong tha lo bzang dam chos rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i (thig gi lag len du ma gsal bar bshad pa bzo rig mdzes pa'i kha rgyan )lha sa dmar ma'i shog grangs 31nas 53b.radang/de'i dogs gcod skor bkra shis 'khyil rje shes rab rgya mtsho'i gsung 'bul lha sa zhol dmar ma'i pod (nga)pa'i nang (dkyil 'khor so so'i blos bslang gi phyag khrid gsan pa'i zin bris )shog grangs 8de'i gsung 'bum pod (kha)pa'i nang yod pa bcas phan tshun go bsdur gyi thog nas slob dpon mkhas pa'i mthong ba brgyud pa'i phyag len lag khrid dang dngos sbyong zur 'brel byas te slob dgos pa yin lags}
dkyil 'khor 'og|{lha sa gtsug lag khang gi sbug tu ngo bo rin po che bzhugs sa'i lha khang gi mdun ngos kyi dkyil 'khor sdings zhes pa de'i 'og }
dkyil 'khor la 'dzegs|{gtso bo dang 'khor cha lang ba'i gral gyi dbus su bzhugs zhes pa ste/skabs 'dir thang bod gnyis dbar dbon zhang mjal dum gyi chings yig 'jog par chings gros kyi las ka'i nang zhugs dgos nges kyi phyogs phan tshul gnyis ka'i mi sna gtso 'khor rnams gros ra'i sdings cha'i steng du 'dzoms pa'i don}
dkyil 'khor gsum|{'di la grangs 'dren tshul mi 'dra ba bzhi tsam yod pa ste/gcig /gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi gzhung rnams las/1 gzhi lhun grub rtsa ba'i dkyil 'khor dang lus kyi dkyil 'khor/2 lam gzugs brnyan thabs kyi dkyil 'khor rdul tshon/ras bris tshom bu'i dkyil 'khor/3 'bras bu rnam dag rang bzhin gyi dkyil 'khor bcas su 'dren pa dang/gnyis/1 bskyed pa ma hA yo ga'i phyi snang srid gzhir bzhengs kyi dkyil 'khor/2 man ngag a ti yo ga'i gsang ba rtog tshogs chos kyi dkyil 'khor zhes su 'dren pa yang snang/gsum/gzhung 'ga' zhig nang/1 lus lha'i dkyil 'khor/2 ngag sngags kyi dkyil 'khor/3 sems ting nge 'dzin gyi dkyil 'khor zhes 'dren par gsungs/bzhi/dge lugs phyogs kyi sngags rnams su/1 phyi rdul tshon/ras bris/tshom bu'i dkyil 'khor/2 nang rdo rje'i lus kyi dkyil 'khor/3 gsang ba bsam gtan gyi dkyil 'khor bcas su 'dren par gsungs pa sogs gsung tshul mi 'dra yang don la 'gal ba med}
dkyil zur blo bzang sbyin pa|{gtsang stong thang spe zhes pa'i yul du yab tshong dpon pa sangs dang yul chung skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags sprul (1821)lor sku bltams/dgung lo brgyad par bkra shis lhun por phebs te paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma'i drung nas rab tu byung zhing dge tshul gyi sdom pa mnos/yi ge 'bri klog legs par sbyangs/de nas gzhung bka' pod lnga la 'bad pas sbyangs te bka' bcu'i ming btags thob/dgung lo nyer bdun pa paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa mnos/dgung lo nyer gu par rab 'byams smra ba'i seng ge'i mtshan btags bzhes te rgyud pa grwa tsang du lo bcu gnyis rang gsang sngags skor kun thug gnyer mdzad/skabs der rje 'di nyid yongs 'dzin blo bzang bstan 'dzin gyi sprul sku yin zhes dbus gtsang yongs su grags shing/bka' zur mkhyen rab bsam gtan gyis yongs 'dzin blo bzang bstan 'dzin bzhugs gnas dpal 'byor lhun po'i ri khrod du gdan zhu byas/dgung lo zhe gcig par paN chen rin po nas bkras lhun dkyil khang grwa tsang gi bdag por bskos/dgung lo nga bdun pa rab byung bco pa'i me glang (1877)lor pad chen rin po che'i phyag phyir mdzad nas lha ldan du 'byor/'bras spungs dang se ra dgos sogs su mar 'gyed du bla mchod khrid chos sogs phul/mkhas pa rnams dang bgro gleng mang po mdzad de mkhas pa'i rgas pa thob/dgung lo re drug pa chu lug lor paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma'i rnam thar brtsams/dgung lo don gcig pa lcags yol (1891)lor nang rnam tshigs bcad ma ljags rtsom mdzad/de bzhin (bshes pa'i springs yid gi rnam bshad 'phags pa'i dgongs pa kun gsal/) (rje rin po cha'i bstod 'grel skabs bzang skye bo'i 'jug ngogs/) (byang chub sems dpa'i spyod pa la 'jug pa'i don rnam par bshad pa rgyal sras 'jug ngogs kyi snying po/) (rlung gi bstan bcos )sogs lugs zung gi bslab bya pod 'bring gsum lhag bzhugs/nam gshegs kyi lo dus ma rnyed}
