bka' thang shel brag ma|{'di slob dpon chen po pad+ma 'byung gnas kyi rnam thar gtso bor gsungs pa zhig yin cing/yar rje o rgyan gyi gling pa dang/sgom pa shAkya bzang po gnyis kyis yar lung shel brag gi brag phug nas gter du bzhes pa zhig yin cing (le'u brgya dang brgyad yod pa 'di yongs grags yin )skabs 'dir (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )mdzad pa pos shog grangs 596 9las 'di ltar gsungs te/spyir thang yig le'u brgya dang gcig par 'dod pa tshig bcad lhug gnyis snang ba 'di la lhad ha cang mang ches pas bdag gis mthong ba kho na yang mi 'dra ba lnga bcur zin pa snang bas yid rton mi nus par snang la zhes dang/yang shog grangs 626 1(pad+ma bka' thang )gi gter 'dir sbas zhes bshad pa rnams ni lhad med yin par snang la/gter ston lung bstan 'di bar skabs su lhad sna tshogs bsres te sa paN la skur ba gdab par 'dod nas rgya gar ma phyin kun snying lo tsA zhes zhes sogs log par bris pa dang/lha'i bu rab rtsal lung bstan pa'i mdo las zhes bar du yig nor byung ba tshun bris pas dpyad mi bzod cing gter ma la skur pa 'debs pa'i gzhi chen po gyur snang la zhes gsungs 'dug pa ma zad/de dang mtshungs par stag dge mkhan chen gu ru bkra shis kyis mdzad pa'i (snga 'gyur chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 384nas 385bar bka' thang gi ma dper yig nor byung tshul dang legs bcos yi dgongs tshul yang gsungs 'dug /bka' thang 'di'i skor la/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i rang rnams lcags dpar ma'i deb gnyis pa shog grangs 264nas 267bar (bka' thang shel brag ma'i )tshig don la 'gal 'du yod par 'ga' zhig gis dgag pa dang dgag lan byung ba'i skor dang/(mdo mdzangs blun )gyi nang don 'ga' zhig la dogs gnad yod pa dang/(skyes rabs so bzhi pa )la lung rgyun yi brgyud pa khungs yod dam med/dus 'khor rgya gar du phebs pa'i lo rgyus mi 'dra ba gnyis dang/bstan rtsis kyi lo tshigs/rje btsun mi la'i mgur 'bum yi ger 'debs pa po su yin/gzhan yang/sa chen grags pa rgyal mtshan dang/dwags po lha rje/bu ston rin po che/rje tsong kha pa chen po/slob dpon chen po pad+ma bcas kyi rnam thar nang dogs gcod bya dgos pa'i gnad don 'ga' zhig dpe mtshon du drangs nas dpyad gzhir 'god gnang mdzad yod kyang/'dir yig tshogs che dogs nas bkod ma nus pas rnam thar rang rtsom ngo mar gzigs par zhu}
