bka' gdams sku mched gsum|{dge bshes po to ba dang/dge bshes spyan snga ba/dge bshes phu chung ba bcas gsum ni/'brom ston pa'i thugs sras slob ma'i gtso bo yin pas bka' gdams sku mched gsum zhes zer/bla ma gcig gi drung nas bka' gdams kyi chos skor gsan pa'i mched grogs yin pa'i cha nas de ltar brjod pa las/gnyen tshan gyi 'brel ba yod pa'i sku mched la go rgyu min}
