bka' gdams glegs bam|{bka' gdams kyi man ngag thams cad kyi rtsa ba lta bu (byang sems nor bu'i phreng ba )zhes pa de yin cing/de ni (jo bo'i chos chung brgya rtsa )(sde dge bstan 'gyur mdo phyogs pod (kha)pa'i nang )dang/(bka' gdams pha chos )kyi 'khor yod/bka' gdams glegs bam zhes pa ni (bka' gdams pa chos )pod gcig dang (bka' gdams bu chos )pod gcig bcas bsdoms pa'i ming yin/glegs bam 'di'i brjod bya khag cig 'brom ston pa rin po ches dri ba zhus pa'i lan jo bo rje a ti shas gsungs pa dang/mang po zhig rngog legs pa'i shes rab kyis dri ba zhus pa'i lan jo bo rje a ti shas gsungs pa/nyung shas shing dge bshes khu ston gyis dri ba zhus pa'i na ngo bo rjes gsungs pa bcas yin cing/pha chos zhes pa pha ston pa rin po ches zhus pa la zer/bu chos zhes pa bu rngog legs pa'i shes rab dang dge bshes khu ston gyis zhus pa la zer/bka' gdams glegs bam phyogs bsgrigs thog mar mdzad mkhan ni rngog legs pa'i shes bar yin cing/de'i lung rgyun yang rngog nas bzung da lta'i bar rgyun mi chad par yod pa dang (bka' gdams pha chos )dang bu chos )kyi brjod bya dang lo rgyus skor gsham gsal (bka' gdams pha chos )dang (bka' gdags bu chos )zhes pa'i skabs su gsal bar der gzigs}
bka' gdams brgyud pa gsum|{1 dge bshes pho to ba nas sha ba ra la brgyud pa nas lo tsA ba chen po skyabs mchog dpal bzang po bar du brgyud pa'i bka' gdams gzhung pa'i brgyud pa dang/2 dge bshes spyan p+sang ba nas dge bshes bya yu ba la brgyud pa nas lho brag mkhan chen nam mkha' rgya mtshan gyi bar brgyud pa'i bka' gdams man ngag pa'i brgyud pa dang/3 dge bshes dgon pa ba nas dge shes sne'u zur pa la brgyud pa nas lho brag mkhan chen rim pa zhes brjod pa yin cing/brgyud pa de gsum ka rje tsong pa kha chen pos gsan pas de nas brgyud pa gsum ka chu bo gcig 'dres su gyur pa yin/brgyud pa gsung so so'i go don dang khrid rgyun mi 'dra ba'i khyad chos bcas gsham gsal so so'i ming tshig 'grel bshad kyi skabs su gsal}
bka' gdams chos 'byung|{bka' gdams kyi chos brgyud ji ltar byung tshul gyi lo rgyus la zer/(bka' gdams chos 'byung )dpe rgyun dkon pa'i gras/dbus pa blo gsal gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung )bkra shis lhun po'i gdan rabs gsum pa paN chen ye shes rtse mos mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung/) paN chen bsod nams grags pas mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams gsar rnying gi chos 'byung yid kyi mdzes rgyan )dpar rnying shog grangs 102yod pa/rtsed thang las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan (paN chen bsod nams grags pa'i rtsa ba'i bla ma )gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung gsal ba'i sgron me )'bras spungs pho brang gi dpar rnying la shog grangs 417yod pa 'di rgyas shos yin/'di'i nang don mdor bsdus ni/1 bka' gdams pa ngos bzung tshul dang bka' gdams pa'i chos spyi'i dbye ba bstan pa'i skabs/2 bka' gdams pa'i mdzad spyod spyir bstan pa'i skabs/3 jo bo rje dpal ldan a ti sha'i che ba'i yon tan brjod pa'i skabs/4 jo bo rje'i dngos slob ji ltar byung tshul gyi skabs/6 dge bshes spyan snga ba nas ba rgyud pa'i bka' gdams gdams ngag pa'i brgyud pa'i rnam thar/7 dge bshes po to ba nas brgyud pa'i bka' gdams gzhung pa'i rnam thar/8 dge bshes phu chung ba gzhon nu rgyal mtshan nas brgyud pa'i bka' gdams glegs bam gyi brgyud pa'i rnam thar/9 bka' gdams kyi gdams pa thor bu ba'i bla brgyud rnam thar/10 gzhung dang gdams ngag gnyis ka'i chu bo gcig tu 'dus pa'i bka' gdams gsar ma grags pa'i rnam thar bcas yod}
bka' gdams bstan pa'i spyi babs|{bka' gdams pa'i bzhed srol gtso bo ni/bcom ldan 'das kyi bka' la bzang ngan dang 'dor len mi byed par thams cad gang zag gcig 'tshang rgya ba'i gdams ngag tu khyer ba yin/de la rgyab rten gyi gzhung dang/lag len gyi man ngag gnyis yod cing/gzhung de la nang gses kyis dbye na gsum yod pa ste/1 lta ba gtso bor ston pa dang/2 spyod pa gtso bor ston pa/3 lta spyod gtso bor ston pa'i gzhung ni/jo bo rje a ti shas mdzad pa'i (bden gnyis la 'jug pa )dang (dbu ma'i man ngag )sogs yod/spyod pa gtso bor ston pa ni/jo bo rjes mdzad pa'i (spyod bsdus sgron ma )yin/gzhan yang gsham nas gsal ba'i bka' gdams gzhung drug dang/jo bo rjes gsungs pa'i (chos chung brgya rtsa/) mgon po klu sgrub gyis mdzad pa'i )dbu ma rtsa ba shes rab )dang/(stong nyid bdun cu pa/) (dbu ma rin chen phreng ba )bcas kyang yin/man ngag la yang lta ba gtso bor ston pa dang/spyod pa gtso bor ston pa/lta spyod zung 'brel du ston pa bcas gsum yod/1 lta ba gtso bor ston pa ni/jo bo rje'i man ngag dge bshes spyan snga ba nas ba rgyud pa'i bden bzhi'i khrid dang/dge bshes phu chung ba nas brgyud pa'i rten 'brel gyi khrid/rnal 'byor pa chen po a mes byang chub rin chen nas brgyud pa'i bden gnyis kyi khrid rnams yin cing/bden bzhi dang rten 'brel gyi khrid kyis thig pa thun mong ba'i gang zag gi bdag med dang bden gnyis kyi khrid la brten nas shin tu phra ba'i chos kyi bdag med la 'khrid pa yin/spyod pa gtso bor ston pa'i gdams ngag ni/theg chen blo sbyong gi gdams pa rnams yin cing/de'i khungs ni theg chen gyi mdo sde spyi dang/lhag par du (mdo sde phal po che )dang/mgon po glu sgrub kyis mdzad pa'i )dbu ma rin chen phreng ba/) (rmi lam yid bzhin nor bu'i gtam/) (sems can mgu bar bya ba'i tshigs su bcad pa/) rgyal sras zhi ba lhas mdzad pa'i (bslab pa kun las btus pa )dang/(spyod 'jug )bcas yin cing mdo dang bstan bcos de dag lag len gyi man ngag snying por dril ba ni/jo bo rje'i bla ma d+harma rak+Shi tas mdzad pa'i (blo sbyong mtshon cha'i 'khor lo )dang/(blo sbyong rma bya dug 'joms/) jo bo rje'i bla ma byams pa'i rnal 'byor gyis mdzad pa'i (gyer sgom rdo rje'i glu/) bla ma gser gling pas mdzad pa'i (blo sbyong sems dpa' rim pa )dang/(blo sbyong rtog pa 'bur 'joms )la sogs pa yin/de rnams kyi don phyogs gcig tu dril nas dge bshes glang thang pas mdzad pa (blo sbyong tshigs brgyad ma )dang/dge bshes glang thang pa'i slob ma dge bshes zhang ka ma ba dang/gnyan sna mo ba/dge bshes sha bo sgang pa pad+ma byang chub gsum gyi man ngag 'dres mar bkod pa (be'u bum khra bo/) dge bshes sha rab ba'i slob ma dge bshes 'chad ka bas mdzad pa'i (blo sbyong don bdun ma/) dge bshes khams lung pas phyogs bsgrigs mdzad pa'i (blo sbyong thun brgyad ma/) dge bshes kha rag sgong chung pas mdzad pa (kha rag skor gsum )sogs yod/lta spyod zung 'brel du ston pa ni/jo bo rje a ti shas mdzad pa'i )byang chub lam sgron )dang bka' gdams dge bshes rnams kyis mdzad pa'i (lam rim )dang/(bstan rim )rgyas bsdus sna tshogs yod/bka' gdams kyi skyes bu dam pa rim byon rnams kyi mdzad spyod spyi'i sdom ni/las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung gsal ba'i sgron me )grangs 14nas 26bar dang/de'i don bsdus nas gsungs pa (thu'u bkwan grub mtha' )lcags dmar ma'i shog grangs 105nas 106bar gsal}
bka' gdams thig le bcu drug gi dbang|{jo bo rje a ti sha nas brgyud pa'i bka' gdams thig le bcu drug gi dbang ste/grub mtha' ris med la dar che zhing/dbang gi cho ga ni/dge lugs phyogs tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa chen pos mdzod pa'i (bka' gdams thig le bcu drug gi rgyun khyer dbang khrid kyi legs bshad dgongs rgyan )shog grangs 16(gsung 'bum pod (tha)pa'i nang du yod ) 'jam dbyangs bde ba'i rdo rjes mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams thig le bcu drug gi sgrub dkyil legs bshad sgron me )shog grangs 26(gsum 'bum nang du yod )yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams thig le bcu drug gi cho ga ngag 'don gyi rim par bsgrigs pa )shog grangs 28gsung 'bum pod (da)pa'i nang du yod/) des mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams thig le bcu drug gi dkyil chog bka' gdams gsal byed )shog grangs 100(gsung 'bum pod (tsa)pa'i nang du yod (bcas gang rung gi steng nas gnang gi yod/grub mtha' gzhan phyogs la/'jam mgon kong sprul blo gros mtha' yas kyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams thig le bcu drug gi sgrub dkyil dbang chog dang bcas pa thugs rje rnam par rol pa'i rgyan )shog grangs 20gsang bdag blo gter dbang pos phyogs bsgrigs mdzad pa'i (rgyud sde rab 'byams yi smin grol kun btus )pod (za)pa'i nang du bzhugs pa de'i steng nas gnang srol 'dug /bka' gdams thig le bcu drug gi nyams len ni rjes dran lnga ste/1 bla ma rjes su dran pa'i bla ma'i rnal 'byor/2 lus lha'i rang bzhin du sgo pa/3 ngag la sngags kyi bzlas bstod dang ma bral ba/4 sems kyi gnas lugs stong pa nyid du sgom pa dang/byang snying rje sgom pa/5 dge rtsa rdzogs byang du bsngo ba bcas yin pas mdo sngags zung 'brel gyi nyams len yin}
bka' gdams gdams ngag pa|{yongs grags su bka' gdams man ngag pa zhes gsung srol yod pa de yin cing/de yang jo bo rje a ti sha dang 'brom ston pa rnam gnyis nas dge bshes spyan snga tshul khrims 'bar la brgyud pa'i bka' gdams kyi brgyud pa ste/gzhung gi bshad pa rgya chen po'i spros pa mi mdzad par/jo bo rje a ti shas mdzad pa'i (rten 'brel )dang/(bden gnyis )kyi khrid la brten nas slob ma skyong bar mdzad pas mtshan de ltar thogs pa yin}
bka' gdams gdung rten|{de sngon bod du bka' gdams kyi bstan pa dar rgyas che skabs bal yul nas lha bzo mang po bod du bos nas bzhengs pa'i mchod rten la zer zhing/de yi khyad chos skor rig 'dzin 'jigs med gling pas mdzad pa'i (gtam tshogs )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 125par bod rnying pad+ma rkyang sbyar gnyis pa mang/_/mas mthar mu tig spras dang bum stod rgyas/_/bre dpangs dmar la ma mthar the prog can/_/chos 'khor srid thung sbom la char khebs sbub/_/rtse mo pad 'bus tog gam nyi zla spras/_/dbus na lcags mngon lcags lte (rtse )ma ru grags zhes gsungs pa ltar/de sngon rwa sgreng dang thang sgrol ma lha khang gnyis su gdung rten de'i rigs che chung sna tshogs mjal rgyu yod cing/deng skabs snye thang sgrol ma lha khang nang du yang bka' gdams gdung rten che gras 'ga' zhig mjal rgyu yod}
bka' gdams pa|{ston pa sangs rgyas kyis gsungs pa'i bka' las yig 'bru gcig kyang ma lus par rang gis nyams su blang bya'i gdams ngag tu khas len pa/rab byung dang po'i lcags 'brug (1040)lor jo bo rje a ti sha bod du phebs nas lo ngo bcu bdun ring mnga' ris dang/lha sa snye thang/'phan po bcas su nang bstan chos lugs dar spel gnang zhing/bar byung dang po'i me bya (1057)lor 'brom rin po che rgyal ba'i 'byung gnas kyis rwa sgreng dgon pa phyag btab nas gnas gzhi bzung ste/jo bo rje'i gdongs pa dang mthun pa'i lta spyod gtsang mar 'dzin pa'i sgo ma 'ga' zhig bskyangs pa de nas dar spel byung ba'i chos brgyud la bka' gdams pa zer/rjes su sa rabs bco lnga pa'i 'khor rje tsong kha pa chen pos sngar yod bod kyi nang bstan srol bzang nyams pa rnams dag ther dang/cung zad gnas pa rnams gong 'phel du gtong bar mdzad pa dang chabs cig /mdo sngags zung 'brel gyi bstan pa'i gnas gzhi dga' ldan rnam par rgyal ba'i gling phyag btab pa nas/bka' gdams gsar ma'am dge lugs pa'i grub mtha' dar spel byung zhing bka' gdams kyi sde dgon rnams dge lugs su gcig 'dres byung ba yin}
bka' gdams pa'i sgrol ma bcu gnyis|{paN chen blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyis/gtso bo dmag zor ma/ma cig dpal gyi lha mo/ma cig rdo rje rab brtan ma/lha mo dud sol ma/lha mo phyag bzhi ma/lha mo dus mtshan ma/rab byung rgyal mo/lha mo e ka dza ti dang bcu gcig /bcu gnyis pa der mi gsal bas/kha cig gis ma cig rdo rje gshog rgod ma yin zer/kha cig gis la stod a phyi chos kyi sgrol ma yin zer/gong gi de rnams ngos 'dzin mdzad pa e waM las 'byung zhing/don du 'khor lo bde mchog gi snying po'i rnam 'byor ma bzhi dang/sgo mtshams ma brgyad yin pa dang/bka' gdams pa rang gis mtshan gsol ba ni/1 gser mtsho ma/2 'od mtsho ma/3 bstan skyong ma/4 yid 'dzin ma/5 stobs po che/6 drag shul can/7 khrag mdog ma/8 dud kha ma/9 thogs med ma/10 shugs can ma/11 dbang sdud ma/12 las 'joms pa dang bcu gnyis zer ro/_}
bka' gdams pa'i lha bzhi|{shAkya thub pa/'phags pa spyan ras gzigs/mi g.yo ba/rje btsun 'phags ma sgrol ma'o/_/de dang jo bo rje a ti sha nas brgyud pa'i thub pa dam tshig gsum bkod gyi bsgom bzlas/'phags pa spyan ras gzigs la brten nas smyung gnas kyi cho ga /rje btsun sgrol ma la brten pa'i mchod chog /khro bo mi g.yo ba la brten pa'i chos skor khag bcas dang/bka' gdams lha bzhi'i khrid bcas yod}
bka' gdams pha chos|{(bka' gdams glegs bam )pod gnyis yod pa'i nang gses pod dang po (bka' gdams pha chos )yin/de yang zhu ba po 'brom ston pas jo bo rje la dri ba zhus pa'i lan jo bo rje a ti shas gsungs pa dang/'brom ston pa ni jo bo rjes bstan pa'i bdag por mnga' gsol ba yin cing/bka' gdams kyi tan pa'i mes mo yin pa'i cha nas pha chos zhes bka' gdams pa'i bla ma rnams kyi gsung srol yod/glegs pham 'di'i nang (bla ma'i yon tan chos kyi 'byung gnas )shog grangs 23a ti sha'i rnam thar rgyas pa dang jo bo rje'i rnam thar lam yig 'brom ston pas mdzad pa bcas la shog grangs 125yod/dge bshes ston pas mdzad pa'i glegs bam gyi bka' rgya la shog grangs 5dang/zhus lan nor bu'i phreng ba lha chos bdun ldan gyi bla brgyud rnam thar shog shog grangs 154/jo bo yab sras kyi gsung bgros pha chos rin po che'i gter mdzod grangs 143bcas yod/'di'i brgyud rim dang lo rgyus skor (bka' gdams chos 'byung gsal ba'i sgron me'i )'gor gsal}
bka' gdams bu chos|{(bka' gdams glegs bam )pod gnyis yod pa'i nang gses pod gnyis pa yin/de ni jo bo rje'i slob ma rngog legs pa'i shes rab dang khu ston brtson 'grus g.yung drung gnyis kyis dri ba zhus pa'i lan jo bo rje a ti shas gsungs pa yin cing/rngog dang khu gnyis ni slob brgyud 'dzin pa'i bu dang 'dra bas na bu chos zhes zhu ba po'i ngos nas mtshan de ltar 'bod pa bka' gdams pa'i gsung rgyun du yod/'di la le'u nyi shu rtsa gsum yod pa bsham gsal/1 rgyal bu gsal ba'i le'u/2 rgyal bu chags pa med pa'i le'u/3 rgyal bu kun tu dga'i le'u/4 rgyal bu lha skyes kyi le'u/5 rgyal bu dkon mchog 'bangs kyi le'u/6 rgyal bu dad pa brtan pa'i le'u/7 rgyal po rab brtan gyi le'u/8 rgyal bu blo grol 'phel gyi le'u/9 khye'u dga' 'dzin gyi le'u/10 dge bsnyen btsun pa'i le'u/11 khye'u nor bu bzang po'i le'u/12 khye'u zla ba'i le'u/13 khye'u rin chen snying po'i le'u/14 khye'u pad+ma'i le'u/15 khye'u 'od zer gyi le'u/16 khye'u byams pa'i le'u/17 rgyal bu seng ge sgra'i le'u/18 rgyal bu bde mchog gi le'u/19 lha yi rgyal po'i le'u/20 khye'u dge 'dun 'phel gyi le'u/21 bka' rgya/22 khu chos sro long kun tu rgyu /23 rgyal po skyabs sbyin gyi le'u/mjug bsdus lung bstan bcas yod}
bka' gdams man ngag pa|{gong du bka' gdams gdams ngag pa zhes pa der gzigs}
bka' gdams gzhung drug|{(skyes rabs so bzhi pa )dang/(ched du brjod pa'i tshoms )ni dad pa'i gzhung/(bslab btus )dang/(spyod 'jug ni spyod pa'i gzhung/(byang sa )dang/mdo sde'i rgyan )ni ting nge 'dzin gzhung bcas te/skyes tshoms gnyis/bslab spyod gnyis/sa rgyan gnyis bcas gzhung drug dang sbyar nas slob khrid gnang srol yod pas ming de ltar btags pa yin}
bka' gdams gzhung pa|{'brom ston pa rgyal ba'i 'byung gnas kyi dngos slob dge bshes po to ba chen po nas dge bshes sha ra ba sogs nas gnyal grwa skor mkhan chen chos skyabs bzang po'i bar rin bzhin brgyud pa'i khrid srol la bka' gdams gzhung pa zer/de la bka' gdams gzhung pa zhes zer ba'i rgyu mtshan ni bka' gdams gzhung drug dang sbyar nas slob khrid gnang srol yod pas ming de ltar btags pa yin}
bka' gdams 'og ma|{gong gsal bka' gdams gong 'og ces pa der gzigs}
bka' gdams lam rim pa|{jo bo rje a ti sha nas dge bshes nag tsho lo tsA ba dang/de nas dge bshes rol pa phyag sor ba la brgyud pa'i bka' gdams 'og ma dang/dge bshes 'brom ston pa nas dgon pa ba dbang phyug rgyal mtshan la brgyud pa gnyis ka bka' gdams lam rim pa zhes tha snyad mdzad srol}
bka' gdams li rnying|{de sngon bod du bka' gdams kyi bstan pa dar rgyas che skabs dbus gtsang gnyis su dgon sde mang du byung ba dang skabs der bal po dang bod bzo pa mkhas pas li dkar dang/li dmar/li khrag sogs kyi sku brnyan mang du bzos pa de rigs la zer}
bka' gdams gsar ma|{rje tsong pa kha chen po'i brgyud 'dzin dge lugs pa'i ming gzhan zhig yin cing/jo bo rje nas brgyud pa'i bka' gdams kyi brgyud pa gsum ka'i gzhung bshad dang man ngag gi brgyud pa cha tshang ba'i thog gsang bde 'jigs gsum la sogs pa'i gsang sngags kyi nyams bzhes yang zung 'brel du mdzad pa'i dbang gis bka' gdams gsar ma zhes pa'i tha snyad 'bod srol byung}
bka' gdams lha chos bdun|{bka' gdams pa rnams kyis yi dang du bsten pa'i lha bzhi dang dang chos gsum bcas bsdoms pa'i ming ste/lha bzhi ni/1 bstan pa'i bdag po ston pa thub pa'i dbang po/2 zhi ba'i lha thams cad gcig tu 'dus pa spyan ras gzigs/3 khro bo'i lha thams cad gcig tu 'dus pa mi g.yo ba/4 lha mo thams cad gcig tu 'dus pa rje btsun sgrol ma bcas yin cing/chos gsum ni/1 lta ba'i skor rgyas par ston pa mngon pa'i sde sno/2 sgom pa ting nge 'dzin gyi skor rgyas par ston pa mdo sde'i sde snod/3 spyod pa tshul khrims kyi skor rgyas par ston pa 'dul ba'i sde snod bcas nyams len gyi khungs dang rigs pa'i gzhung lugs yin}
bka' mdo rgyud|{sangs rgyas kyis gsungs pa'i bka' mdo phyogs dang/sngags phyogs zhes 'bod tshul gzhan zhig yin}
bka' bsdu ba|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs pa'i lo rgyus thog sangs rgyas rang nyid kyis gsungs pa'i bka' yod tshad phyogs bsdus mdzad thengs gsum byung ba yongs grags dang/mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis bka' bsdu bzhi pa bar byung ba'i lo rgyus gsungs yod pa lta bu yin/bka' bsdu so so'i gnas tshul gsham du gsal bas der gzigs}
bka' bsdu gnyis pa|{'di'i skor don tshan bzhi thog nas bshad na go bde bas/gcig /bka' bsdu gnyis pa 'di'i 'byung rkyen ni bka' 'gyur 'dul ba'i skor (lung phran tshegs )bang po nga brgyad pa dang nga dgu pa (sde dge bka' 'gyur pod da pa'i mjug tu yod )gnyis las/sangs rgyas mya ngan las 'das nas lo brgya dang bcu (slob dpon legs ldan 'byed kyis brtsams pa'i (rtog ge 'bar ba )dang slob dpon dbyig bshes kyis brtsams pa'i (sde pa tha dad du 'byed pa )las sangs rgyas mya ngan las 'das nas lo brgya dang drug cu na yid zhes gsal )song ba na/yang pa can na yod pa'i dge slong rnams kyis rung ba ma yin pa'i gzhi bcu ste/1 hu lu lu yi rung ba dang/2 rjes su yi rang ba'i rung ba/3 sa rko ba dang rko ru 'jug ba'i rung ba/4 chang blugs pa'i snod dang chang hub gyis mi 'thung bar gzhibs nas 'thung bar rung bar byed pa/5 ji srid 'tsho'i bar du byin gyis rlabs pa'i lan tsha dus rung gi sman dang bsres par rung bar byed pa/6 lam thag dpag tshad gcig dang dpag tshad phyed du song ste mnyam du 'dus shing zas zos pas lam gyis rung bar byed pa/7 lhag por ma byas pa'i bza' ba dang bca' ba sor mo gnyis kyis rung ba byed pa/8 'o ma bre gang dang zho bre gang mnyam du dkrugs te dus ma yin par za zhing bsres pas rung bar byed pa/9 gding ba rnying pa nas mtho gang gi tshad kyis gding ba gsar pa la ma slan par longs spyad pas rung ba/10 lhung bzed la dri zhim pos byugs te me tog gi phreng bas brgyan pa dge slong gi mgo la bzhag ste lam po che dang bzhi mdor song nas lhung bzed 'di'i nang du sbyin pa byin pa dang/dngos po 'bul na bsod nams chen po yod tshul gyi bsngags byas tshe gser dngul sogs rin po che'i rigs la longs spyad kyang nyes pa med pa'i rung ba bcas ste rung ba bcu po de dag byas na sangs rgyas kyis nyes pa yod par gsungs pa rnams kyang nyes med du 'gyur thub zer nas rung ba ma yin pa'i gzhi bcur zer ba'i srol gsar du btod/rgyu nor dang bza' btung mang po gsog 'jog byas te chos khrims bag yangs su spyod pa'i gnas tshul byung ba de yin/gnyis/bka' bsdu 'di'i mdzad pa po ni ('dul ba lung phran tshegs )dang bod kyi mkhas pa snga phyis mdzad pa'i lo rgyus tshang mar dgra bcom pa grags pas mdzad par mgrin gcig tu gsungs shing/dgra bcom pa grags pa zhu bas su yin skor (mkhas pa lde'u chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i grangs 166nang tshe dang ldan pa grags pa zhes bya ste nyer sbas so zhes gsal zhing/(klong chen chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 140las kyang de ltar gsungs/(lde'u jo sras yi chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 83 nang tshe dang ldan pa grags pa zhes ya ste gang po'o zhes gsal ba ltar na grags pa dang gang po mi gcig yin par gsungs pa brtag dgos/gsum/bka' bsdu mdzad skabs kyi sbyin bdag ni (lung phran legs )las gsal bar gsung med kyang bod kyi mkhas dbang 'dus 'dzin thams cad kyis bka' bsdu gnyis pa'i sbyin bdag rgyal po d+harma a sho ka ste mya ngan med yin par gsung yod pa dang/sa skya paN chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyi gsung 'bum dpar ma yongs grags rnams su ma 'khod pa'i dpe rnying kha byang du (sdom gsum rang mchan 'khrul med bzhugs so )zhes 'khod pa lcags dpar dpe ring gi shog grangs 76 par bsdu ba gnyis pa mdzad ces grags zhes pa'i mchan bu'i yig chung du yang bya gag gi kun dga' ra bar chos rgyal mya ngan med kyis yod bdag byas nas/zhes gsal bshad gnang 'dug pa ltar kho bos (deb dmar mchan 'grel )du yang sngon rabs mkhan dbang rnams kyi gsung rgyun la ji ltar yod pa ltar bkod yod/'on yang nye rabs rgyal khab phyi nang gi mkhan pa mang po zhig gis gong gsal gsung rgyun de la dogs gnas mang po bkod gnang thog mjug bsdoms rgya gar du rgyal po mya ngan med snga rjes gnyis byung ba'i snga ma de la kA la a sho ka ste/mya ngan med nag po'am dus kyi mya ngan med ces 'bod pa de dgra bcom pa grags pas btul nas bka' bsdu gnyis pa'i sbyin bdag mdzad mkhan de yin cing/mya ngan med phyi ma ni de'i rjes kyi rgyal rabs lnga pa bin+d+hu sa ra ste snying po thig le'i bu d+harma a sho ka'am yongs grags su chos rgyal mya ngan med du 'bod pa de byung ba sogs gsal bshad zhig phrag gnang 'dug /bzhi/bka' bsdu mdzad pa'i gnas ni yangs pa can gyi kusma su ri'i gtsug lag khang yin/lnga/bka' bsdu mdzad pa'i thabs shes ni/yangs pa can gyi dge slong rnams kyis gsar gtor byas pa'i rung ba ma yin pa'i gzhi bcu re rer dgag pa zhib nan mdzad rjes/'dul ba'i gzhung nas gsungs pa ltar bskrad pa'i las kyi cho ga'i sgo nas gnas dbyung mdzad pa yin/zhib par (bu ston chos 'byung )dang (mkhas pa'i lde'u'i chos 'byung )gnyis su gsal bas der gzigs}
bka' bsdu dang po|{bka' bsdu 'di don tshan lnga'i thad nas bshad na go bde bas/gcig /bka' bsdu 'di'i 'byung rkyen ni/sangs rgyas mya ngan las 'das nas re zhig bar dge slong sogs slob ma rnams ting nge 'dzin sgom pa gtsor 'don mdzad de chos 'chad nyan la spro ba med par gyur pa la skye bo mang po zhig gis 'phya smod byed pa byung ba de yin/gnyis/bka' 'du 'di'i mdzad pa po ni/nyan thos 'od srung chen pos mngon pa'i sde snod sdud pa po dang/dgra bcom pa nye bar 'khor gyis 'dul ba'i sde snod sdud pa po dang/kun dga' bos mdo sde'i sde snod sdud pa po mdzad pa yin/de yang bcom ldan 'das kyi nye gnas kun dga' bo ni mang du thos pa 'dzin pa'i mchog tu gyur pa yin kyang/sangs rgyas mya ngan las 'das skabs rgyun zhugs la gnas pa las/dgra bcom pa'i go 'phang thob med par ba rten nyan thos 'od srung chen pos kun dga' bo la nyes pa brgyad bsgrangs te gnas skabs dge 'dun gyi nang nas gnas dbyung mdzad par brten/bsam p+sagom la nan tan mdzad de myur du dgra bcom pa thob rjes 'od srung chen pos 'dul ba'i gzhung nas gsungs pa'i bsko ba'i lam gyi cho ga'i sgo nas nyer bar 'khor la 'dul ba'i sde snod sdud pa po dang/kun dga' bo mdo sde'i sde snod sdud pa por bskos/'od srung chen po rang nyid dge 'dun rnams kyis mngon pa'i sde snod sdud pa por bskos bar mdzad rjes rim bzhin bka' bsdu mdzad pa yin/gsum pa/bka' bsdu'i skabs kyi sbyin bdag ni/skabs de'i ma g+ha rda'i rgyal po ma skyes dgra yin/bzhi bka' bsdu ba'i dus dang gnas ni/sangs rgyas mya ngan las 'das pa'i phyi lo ste phug lugs ltar na lcags sbrul (spyi lo'i gong gi 881)lo gnas brtan sde pa'i lugs ltar na sa rta (spyi lo'i gong 545)lor rgyal po ma skyes dgras srid dbang bzung gi khri lo dgu pa la babs pa rgyal po'i khab gyi shar lho phyogs bde can ma'i brag phug tu bka' bsdus dang po mdzad/lnga/bka' bsdu mdzad pa'i thabs shes ni/mang pa po rnams kyis de sngon sangs rgyas zhal bzhugs skabs dngos su gsan pa'i bka' rnams blo thog nas gsungs rjes dpang por bzhugs pa'i dgra bcom pa lnga brgyas tshig dang don la chad lhag dang go rim 'khrugs pa yod med dri ba mdzad skabs/tshang mas nor 'khrul byung med pa'i zhal bzhes dang bstod bsngags mdzad pa bcas yin/zhib par (bu ston chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 117nas 128bar dang/(mkhas pa'i lde'u chos 'byung )grangs 153nas 166bar gsal}
bka' bsdu gsum pa|{'di 'dul ba lung gi nang du gsal bar gsungs med thog /byung tshul la yang rgya gar du gsung tshul mi 'dra ba sna tshogs zhig yod pa'i skor (bu ston chos 'byung )shog grangs 131nas 134bar gsal zhing/'dir jo nang tA ra nA thas mdzad pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 78nas 81bar gsal ba dang/slob dpon legs ldan 'byed kyis mdzad pa'i (rtog ge 'bar ba )le'u bzhi pa nyan thos kyi de kho na nyid gtan la phab pa'i le'u dang/slob dpon dbyig bshes kyis mdzad pa'i (gzhung lugs bye brag bkod pa'i 'khor lo/) slob dpon dul ba lhas mdzad pa'i (sde pa tha dad par bstan pa bsdus pa )bcas gung bsgrigs nas don tshan lngar bsdus te bkod na go bde bas/gcig /bka' bsdu gsum pa'i 'byung rkyen ni/sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das nas lo brgya dang bcu lon pa na rgyal po mya ngan med sngon ma ka la ya sho ka ste mya ngan med nag po'am dus kyi mya ngan med byung zhing/de nas lo drug song ba'i skabs su/yul ma ru Ta'i phyogs su tshong dpon zhig gi bu lha chen po zhes 'bod pa zhig byung ba des pha bsad pa/ma bsad pa/dgra bcom pa dge slong bcas gsum bsad myong ba des rang gi sdig nyes la skrag nas rang yul du ma bsdad par kha che'i yul du bros te/rang gi nyes pa gsangs nas dge slob byas/rig pa rno bas nang pa sangs rgyas kyi gzhung lugs la mkhas par gyur/rang gi sdig nyes sbyang ba'i ched du dgon par song ste ting nge 'dzin bsgom pa las nang zhig bdud kyis byin gyis ba rlabs te/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung lugs la mkhas par gyur/rang gi sdig nyes sbyang ba'i ched du dgon par song ste ting nge 'dzin bsgom pa las nam zhig bdud kyis byin gyis brlabs te/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung dang mi mthun pa'i lta ba gsal pa mang po dar spel byas/de shi rjes su yang dge slong bzang po zer ba zhig gis kyang de dang mthun pa'i lta ba gsar pa dar spel byas pa ma zad/gso sbyong gi (so sor thar pa'i mdo )'don skabs/rgyun ldan gyi mdo tshig dang mi mthun pa'i tshig sna ring thung sna tshogs dang yul skad mi 'dra ba'i thog nas bton pas don la go ba