bka' phyag chu bo gnyis 'dres|{bka' brgyud bstan pa'i srol 'byed mar mi dwags gsum gyi nang tshan mnyam med dwags po lha rjes (rab byung dang po'i sa lug 1079nas rab byung gsum pa'i chu bya 1153lo bar )bka' gdams kyi dge bshes sha ba gling pa dang/dge bshes bya yul ba/dge bshes smug rum pa/dge bshes rgya lcags ri gong kha ba rnams kyi drung nas bka' gdams kyi chos skor mang po gsan/rjes su rje btsun mi la ras pa'i drung nas rje btsun mar pa nas brgyud pa'i phyag rgya chen po'i chos skor cha tshang ba gsan nas thugs rgyud la nyams rtogs khyad par can 'khrungs par brten/bka' gdams kyi lam rim dang/rje btsun mi la'i phyag rgya chen po'i gdams ngag phyogs gcig tu bsgril nas (lam rim thar pa rin po che'i rgyal )brtsams par mdzad pa nas bzung bka' phyag chu bo gnyis 'dres kyi srol bzang po bod yongs su khyab brdal byung ba yin/(mar mi dwags gsum gyi rnam thar )dang/(deb sngon )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 538nas 550bar dwags po lha rje'i rnam thar lo rgyus gsal ba der gzigs}
