bka' babs bzhi|{grub chen tai lo pa la bka' babs bzhi'i gdams pa yod pa ste/1 rgyal ba rdo rje 'chang/rgyal po in+d+ra bo d+hi/klu las skyes pa'i rnal 'byor ma/sa bdag bi su ka lpa/grub chen sa ra ha/mgon po klu sgrub/de nas grub chen tai lo pa la brgyud pa ste/gsang ba 'dus pa dang/rdo rje gdan bzhi/nA ro chos ga gi nang gses sgyu lus dang 'pho ba'i bka' babs yin/2 rgyal ba rdo rje 'chang/ye shes kyi mkha' 'gro ma/grub chen ku ku ri pa/grub chen tsar+ya pa (nag po spyod pa/) grub chen tai lo pa ste/sgyu ma chen po dang/nA ro chos drug gi rmi lam gyi bka' babs dang/3 rdo rje 'chang/phyag na rdo rje/grub chen Tom b+hi pa/b+hi nas badzra/grub chen la wa pa/grub chen tai lo pa ste/bde mchog sogs ma rgyud spyi dang/nA ro chos drug gi 'od gsal gyi bka' babs dang/4 rdo rje 'chang/phyag na rdo rje/TA ki ma skal ba bzang mo/grub chen tai lo pa ste/dgyes pa rdo rje dang/nA ro chos drug gi gtum mo'i bka' bab yin/zhib par thu'u bkwa' grub mtha' 108nas 109bar gsal}
