bka' blon|{bka' blon zhes pa'i tha snyad 'di snga rabs bod kyi lo rgyus thog mar gsal ba ni/btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi skabs bris pa'i lo rgyus kyi yi ge (rba bzhed )kyi nang/bka' yo gal 'chos pa zhes 'khod pa de yin cing/de'i 'grel bshad skor (mkhas pa'i lde'u'i chos 'byung )nang 'khod pa ltar dus rabs bcu drug pa'i dkyil du dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng bas brtsams gnang mdzad pa'i (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dge ston )lcags dpar ma'i stod cha shog grangs 190nang blo po che dgu'i go nags dang las 'gan gzengs rtags bcas kyi bshad pa'i skabs su bka' yo gal 'chos pa zhes pa ni bka' blon yin pa dang/dgung blon chen po'i 'og gi blon chen rim pa gnyis pa'i gras bka' lon che 'bring chung gsum yod pa/bka' blon gyi las 'das ni btsan po dang dgung blon chen pos bka' phab pa rnams lag len bstar 'os dang mi 'os kyi bsam 'char thad kar bshad chog pa'i dbang cha dang bshad rgyu'i lan 'gan yod pa/bka' blon chen po la gser yig chen po'i gzengs rtags dang/bka' blon 'bring bar gser yig chung ba/bka' blon chung ba phra men (gser dngul spel ma )gyi yi ge'i gzengs rtags yod tshul bcas gsungs/btsan po khri ral pa na gyi skabs (thang bod dbon zhang mthun 'brel rdo ring )gi chings don la zhugs pa'i bod kyi blon po'i ming tho'i nang/bka' yi 'phrin blon bran ka blon stag gzher hab ken zhes gsal bar 'khod yod pa de yang bka' blon gyi go gnas yod pa zhig yin/sde srin sangs rgyas rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i (khrims yig dwangs shel me long )gi le'u gnyis pa blon po'i byed sgo'i thad bka' blon shag gi las tshan pa zhes gsal ba dang/jun gar bas bod kyi srid dbang bzung nas de'i ngo gdong 'gebs byed du stag rtse zhabs drung lha rgyal rab brtan sde srid du bskos pa'i gsham 'og la bka' blon bkra shis rtse pa dang pak+shi zer ba gnyis yod pa rjes su jun gar bod nas mthar skrod btang rjes man ching gong mas mngags pa'i blon chen gyis khrims la sbyar nas srog thog btang tshul (mi dbang rtogs brjod )kyi nang du gsal/bka' blon bsko gzhag skabs sngon dus srid skyong so sor gang 'os pa zhig la bsko gzhag byed pa