bka' blon shag|{bka' shag ni sngon dus sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i dus btsugs pa yod pa sde srid rang nyid kyis mdzad pa'i (khrims yig dwangs shel me long )gi don tshan gsum pa bka' blon gyi byed sgo'i 'go brjod nang 'khod 'dug pa ma zad/(bod kyi las don skor gyi rtsa 'dzin )don tshan bcu gsum par bka' blon thams cad las ka dbye 'byed byas pa la snga sor nas bka' shag gi khang pa yod 'dug kyang/rjes sor pho lha nang kyi dus la bka' blon thams cad spyi khang bka' shag tu ma phyin par sger khang du las ka byed 'dug cing zhes gsal ba bcas bka' shag gi khang pa ni sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i dus nas yod 'dug cing/bka' shag 'tshogs yul gyi khang pa yang thog mar lha sa gtsug lag khang gi gzhung sgo'i yang steng gi tshoms chen khams gsum nang mnyam tshogs byed kyi yod pa )mi dbang rtogs brjod )nang gsal/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me yol (1747)lor bod sa gnas kyi srid skyong pho lha ba bsod nams stobs rgyal nad mdar gyis 'das rjes/khong gi bu 'gyur med rnam rgyal la gong ma chen lung gis tho kyun jun wang zhes pa'i go gnas gnang ste srid skyong du bskos nas lo ngo bzhi tsam srid dbang bzung ring bod sa gnas su yod pa'i am ban gnyis la brtsi 'jog mi byed pa ma zad/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho la yang rang gi pha'i dus kyi zhe nad 'khon 'dzin chen pos brnyas bcos skyon 'dogs kyi gnod 'tshe yang yang gtong gi yod pa bcas kyi gnas tshul skor am ban h+phu chin {(WP:1,194)}dang lab tun {(WP:1,194)}gnyis kyis gong mar p+sanyan zhu phul bar brten gong mas bka' phab pa ltar am ban gnyis kyis wang 'gyur med rnam rgyal dang rjes 'brang dpon g.yog khag gcig bcas khrom gzigs sgang du thugs spror bos thog /glo bur 'jab rgol gyi thabs shes la brten nas gcig kyang ma lus pa srog thog tu btang zhing/'gyur med rnam rgyal gyi mgron gnyer blo bzang bkra shis sogs kyis am ban gnyis sogs lha sar yod pa'i rgya yi dpon rigs dang tshong pa sogs dmar gsod gtong ba'i zing 'khrugs tshabs chen bslangs skabs tA la'i bla ma rin po che dang bka' blon rdo ring gung gnyis kyis zing cha bkag 'doms kyi bka' khyab bsgrags thog lha sar yod pa'i rgya yi dpon rigs dang tshong pa lhag lus mi grangs nyis brgya lhag tsam yod tshad po tA lar bsdu 'gugs srung skyong dang/'tsho ba'i thad lta skyong gang zag gnang ba/dus mtshungs gong ma chen lung la yang bde 'jags kyi gnas tshul snyan zhu 'bul gnang bcas la brten/gong mas slad phyin bod sa gnas kyi sde srid lam lugs mi dgos pa byas te bod kyi chos srid gnyis ka'i dbang cha yongs rdzogs tA la'i bla mas bzung gnang mdzad rgyu'i thog zhabs phyir bka' blon bzhi bskos pa'i bka' phab nas rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags lug (1751)lor bka' shag bskyar du btsugs shing/tshugs yul kyang gtsug lag khang gi lho sgo'i yang steng du spos te/rten gyi gtso bor rje tsong pa kha chen po'i sku brnyan bzhugs su gsol thog/bka' shag gi thang ka srid zhi bde skyid ces kha sis su 'khod pa gsar bskos/bka' blon rnams nyin lta bka' shag tu mnyam 'dzoms kyis srid don las ka byed pa'i srol bskyar gso gnang zhing skabs de'i bka' blon kyi dbu bzhugs bka' blon khri pa ni/rdo ring gung paN+Di ta/las rogs su mdo mkhar zhabs drung tshe ring dbang rgyal/thon pa sri gcod tshe brtan/bka' blon ser mo ba dza sag nyi ma rgyal mtshan bcas bzhi dang/bka' blon gyi 'og tu bka' drung gnyis dang/bka' mgron gsum/bka' blon rer 'gag pa re bcas yod/(de tsho'i go don skor gang gsal ming tshig 'grel bshad du gzigs )bka' shag la bka' shag steng dang bka' shag shod bcas gnyis yod pa'i bka' shag steng ni/bka' blon bzhi dang/drung yig gnyis/mgron gnyer gum bcas kyi srid don las ka tshogs yul de yin/bka' shag shod ni/shod skor rim pa bdun pa'i las tshan pa drung yig chung ba gum yod pa khong tsho'i las 'gan ni/rta khal lam yig thong 'dzin sgyur rgyu dang/rdzong gzhis khag gi gung gtogs dge sde rnams la nyi ldog zhabs brtan sgrub rgyu'i dpyad khra/dgyes ston khag gi sder gzhung/chibs rags gral tho/mchod 'bul lag deb/rdzong gzhi 'pho len gyi sprod rgya dang lam yig khag bka' shag brgyud rtse shod du snyan khur gtong rgyu/gzhan yang bka' ga gi don don tsag tsig gi thu zur yod ltar sgrub rgyu bcas yin/bka' shag ni de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi srid 'dzin dbang cha tshang ma yod pa'i las khungs mtho shos de yin cing/der chab srid dang/dpal 'byor/rig gnas/dmag don bcas kyi 'gan dbang yon pa dang/gnad don gal che'i rigs bka' lon bzhis gros bsdur thog nas thag gcod kyi 'char gzhi bzos te tA la'i bla ma dang srid skyong la 'bul dgos pa dang/'char zhig phul ba der phyag rtags gang phebs ltar bka' shag gis thag gcod byed dgos/bka' blon mi sger so sor las bgos dmigs bsal can gyi 'gan dbang gang yang med tshod red/bka' shag nang bka' blon thun mong gis gros bsdus byas nas thag gcod bya thabs med pa'i don gdan gal ches sa mtshams skor dang/dmag don/srid don rnyog 'dzing che ba'i rigs rnams drung rtsis brgyad sbrel (drung yig chen mo bzhi dang/rtsis dpon bzhi bcas mnyam tshogs )la gros bsdur gyis thag gcod dang des kyang thag gcod ma thub na bod ljongs tshogs 'du hrag bsdus rgyas pa ste/gdan sa gsum gyi mkhan po las sde/dza sag /tha'i ji/drung rtsis brgyad/dmag spyi/rtse mkhan mgron che ba/sne mgron mkhan chung/sku srung mda' dpon/rtse shod gnyis kyi lan tshan dang/drung dkyus 'thus mi bcas mnyam 'dzoms kyi tshogs 'du 'tshogs nas thag gcod bya rgyu dang/da dung des kyang thag ma chod 'i gdan don rnyog 'dzin can gyi rigs rnams bod ljongs tshogs 'du rgyas 'dzoms zhes gzhung zhabs ser skya yongs rdzogs dang lha sar yod pa'i bkra shis lhun po'i bla brang gi mi ser 'go pa/dmag sgar gang gi ru brgya lding gsum gyi las sde dbu chos/khang tshan so so'i dge rgan/dbus gtsang tsho chen/mdo smad khul gyi smar mdzo gsang gsum gyi mi ser 'go pa/gzhung sog mthus mi bcas mnyam 'dzoms kyi tshogs 'du 'tshogs nas gros bsdur thog 'char gzhi bkod de tA la'i bla ma'am srid spyod la phyag rtags su dgos pa bcas yin/zhib par (mi dbang rtogs brjod )dang/(bka' blon rtogs brjod/) (rdo ring paN+Di ta'i rnam thar )stod cha bcas su gzigs}
bka' 'bum|{bod kyang mkhas pa sngon byon rnams kyi gsung rtsom gang yod phyogs bsgrigs byas pa la bka' 'bum dang gsung 'bum zhes brjod srol yod cing/deng sang yongs grags kyi goms gshis la gsung 'bum zhes brjod pa las bka' bum zhes pa'i tha snyad 'bod srol med}
bka' ma log|{de sngon btsan po khri srong lde btsan dang/de'i sras khri lde srong btsan gyi skabs bod sa gnas kyi yogs bzhir mtha' srung dpung sde bzhag cing/bod dmag khri stong mang pos b+ha ta hor gyi sgom grwa bcom nas de'i nor rdzas rnams bod du drangs te phyir phebs gnang dus dpa' bo mi dgu dmag mang po dang bcas sa srung la bzhag /skabs der kho tshos nged rnams bod du nam phyir log byed dgos sam zhus par/nged kyi bka' ma byung bar du ma log par sdod ces gsungs par khong tsho yul der gzhis chags pas dpa' bo mi dgu'i brgyud pa la ming de ltar thogs pa yin/yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hu pi li se chen han gyi nang blon sam g+ha ching sang zer ba yang bka' ma log gi brgyud pa yin zhes shod srol dang/sa skya'i yul po che mi gsum (1 dpon chen shAkya bzang po/2 dge bshes rin chen brtson 'grus/3 hor chen ston tshul bcas )gyi nang tshan/dge bshes rin chen brtson 'grus kyang bka' ma log che brgyud/mtsho sngon gyi ska gsar pa dang/byag rong pa/cu dgu mer bcas yul khams chen po gsum gyi bdag po yin pa de byung ba dang khong gis yul sde rnams spun mched la 'dzin du bcug nas sa skyar phebs/'gro mgon 'phags pa rin po che sog yul nas bod du thengs dang po phebs dus mjal te sa skyar slob gnyer gnang ba sogs lo rgyus (rgya bod yig tshang )stag tshang rdzong pa'i lo rgyus kyi skabs su gsal bas der gzigs}
bka' gtsigs|{de sngon btsan po'i rgyal rabs kyi skabs btsan po'i bka' chems dang zhal bzhes kyi mna' yig gnyis kar bka' gtsigs zer zhing/de la rigs gsum yod pa ste/1 btsan po'i zhal chems zangs kyi byang bur bris nas bsam yas mchims phu'i bang mdzod kyi nang du sbas pa/2 btsan po khri lde srong btsad gyis nyang ting 'dzin bzang po la gnang ba'i zhal bzhes kyi mna' rig gong dkar po mang po rje la gnang ba'i gtsigs kyi yi ge lta bu/3 btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi skabs rgyal blon btsun mo dang bcas pas dam pa'i chos dang rten gsum bshig gtor mi byed pa'i mna' yig mthing shog gi ngos su gser bris byas te bsam yas gtsug lag khang gi dkor mdzod du bzhag pa'i bka' gtsigs dang po dang bka' gtsigs gnyis pa lta bu yin}
bka' gtsigs kyi rdo ring|{de sngon btsan pho khri srong lde btsan gyis bsam yas gtsug lag khang bzhengs grub cing/sad mi rnams rab tu byung nas dge 'dun gyi sde btsugs grub pa'i lug gi lo la bsam yas gtsug lag khang gi gzhung sgo'i gzhogs g.yas ngos su btsugs pa'i rdo ring gi yi ge de yin ci nga/rdo ring de yi nang btsugs pa'i lo khams mi gsal yang/mjug byang du gtsigs kyi yi ge zhib mo gcig ni gung na mchis so zhes 'khod pa ltar gyi bka' gtsigs dang po ngad gnyis pa gnyis ka (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' stod )lcags dpar ma'i bde dang po'i shog grangs 370nas 376bar cha tshang bkod 'dug pa de'i nang gses bka' gtsigs dang po'i zhal bshus kyi tshig der 'khod don dang/gtsug lag khang lhun gyis grub tu/lug gi lo dpyid zla ra ba'i tshes bcu bdun la rten btsugs pa'i tshe zhes gsal ba gnyis bsdur nas brtags na gcig bltas gcig gsal gyis ra 'phrod byung zhing/bka' gtsigs rdo ring mdor bsdus bsam yas gtsug lag khang gi sgo 'gram du yod pa de'i ming tshig 'ga' zhig gi go don gsham 'og nas rim bzhin gsal bas der gzigs}
bka' gtsigs gnyis pa|{btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyis bsam yas gtsug lag khang bzhengs grub cing/sad mi rnams rab tu byung nas dge 'dun gyi sde btsugs zin pa'i rjes su bka' gtsigs dang po bris te/de'i nang don mdor bsdus rdo ring gi ngos su bkod zin pa dang/de'i rgyab snon lta bur bka' gtsigs gnyis pa 'di bris pa yin nam snyam ste/'di'i nang gi dus bu bdun pa'i nang 'khod don du chos 'di btang ngam mdzad dam ci rigs zhes/'bangs su mnga' ba rgyal phran 'a zha rje la sogs pa dang phyi nang gi blon po rnams la bka'as rmas bka' 'gros su mdzad nas zhes sogs gsal bas bka' gtsigs dang po de btsan pos dbang shes kyis bcas pa min par/btsan po dang/rgyal phran gyi rje bo/blon po bcas nang gros nan tan byas te gros mthun byung ba'i chod yig yin tshul gsal bshad byas yod/bka' gtsigs 'di'i nang don gnad bsdus ni/1 kha byang/2 gling gzhi dum bu bzhi/3 nang bstan chos lugs kyi lta tshul ngo sprod/4 bka' gtsigs bcas dgos pa'i rgyu mtshan dang/dgos pa/mjug bsdoms bcas yin/'di'i ming tshig go dka' ba rnams kyi 'grel bshad ni gong 'og gi skabs so sor gsal bas der gzigs}
bka' gtsigs dang po|{btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi bsam yas gtsug lag khang bzhengs grub cing/sad mi drug gam bdun rab tu yung nas dge 'dun gyi da btsugs zin pa'i rjes kyi lug gi lo dpyid zla ra ba )bod kyi zla ba dang po )tshes bcu bdun la bka' gtsigs kyi yi ge dang po 'di shog bu mthing shog gi ngos su gser yig bris te bsam yas gtsug lag khang gi dkor mdzod du bzhag thog de'i 'dra bshu bcu gsum bris yod pa nas gcig tshang mdzod dang bcug /gnyis la tham ka mnan te/lha sa gtsug lag khang dang bsam yas gtsug lag khang du yod pa'i dge 'dun gyi sde rnams la re re bzhag /lha gam bcu ni/lha sa dang/khra 'brug /pho brang nyer 'khor gyi dge 'du/rwa mo che/khams gsum zangs khang gling/bru sha'i yul/zhang zhung yul/mdo smad/sde khag /blon po bcas la gnang yod pa bka' gtsigs 'di rang du gsal/bka' gtsags 'di'i nang don gnad bsdus ni/1 kha byang/2 gleng gzhi/3 dam bca' dum bu dang po/4 dam bca' dum bu gnyis pa/5 dpang du gsol ba/6 mna' tshig /7 mjug bsdoms/8 mna' skyel du zhugs pa'i rgyal phran dang/blon po bcas kyi go nags dang ming tho/mna' yig 'bri mkhan brang ti shI la warma (tshul khrims go cha )ming dang bcas pa bris yod/bka' gtsigs 'di cha tshang bar (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma'i deb dang po'i shog grangs 370nas 373bar gsal zhing/ming tshig gi dka' ba rnams kyi 'grel bshad gong 'og gi skabs so so'i thad du gsal bas der gzigs}
bka' bzhi|{(mkhas pa lde'u'i chos 'byung )las/btsan po srong btsan sgam po'i skabs kyi khrims lugs nang phyi yogs su 'brel ba bya rgyu'i gdon don thog bton pa'i bka' khrims bzhi ste/1 shar seng ge dkar mo la lcags thag mi gdags zhes pa thang bod dbar gyi 'grim 'grul che sa'i zab pa rnams srong skyob byed dgos pa/2 lho do sgrom nag po kha mi dbye zhes pa lho phyogs kyi klo dang mon gnyis bar gnyen sgrigs kyi 'brel ba mi 'jugs pa/3 nub bya dmar po'i ske mi gcod zhes pa rgya gar nas bod du phebs pa'i paN+Di ta rnams phar tshur phebs bzhud kyi 'grul mtshams mi gcod pa/4 byang sha spags skya mo la thig mi gdab zhes pa byang phyogs kyi hor dang sog po'i bar bod nas dmag 'khrug mi bslang ba bcas kyi go don yin par (lde'u jo sras kyi chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 139nas gsal bas der gzigs}
bka' bzang spyi smin|{chog mchan thob pa'i bka' yig bzang po spyi bo'i steng du smin pa zhes pa'i sdud tshig }
bka' 'od mchog grags pa|{bla chen dgongs pa rab gsal gyis lha rtse g+hig tig tu bzhugs skabs 'bum gyi 'grel pa dang (sa sde lnga )sogs mngon pa'i skor bla ma 'di'i drung nas gsan pa yin}
bka' yang dag pa'i tshad ma|{rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis mdzad pa'i gsung rtsom che shos gnyis yod pa'i nang tshan zhig ste/le'u bco lnga dang/bam por rtsis na bam po bdun/yig 'bru khri drug dang bdun stong nyis brgya yod cing/sde dge bstan 'gyur sna tshogs pod (co)pa'i nang du yod pa de yin}
bka' yi khrims yig chen mo rnam drug|{rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos gtan 'bebs gnang ba'i bka' khrims chen mo drug ste/1 khri rtse 'bum gzher gyi khrims/2 'bum gser thog sha ba can gyi khrims/3 rgyal khams dpar blangs kyi khrims/4 mdo lon zhu bcad kyi khrims/5 dbang chen bcad kyi khrims/6 khab so nang pa'i khrims bcas yin/de rnams so so'i ngos 'dzin gsham 'og tu rim bzhin gsal}
bka' yi sgrom bu rnam gsum|{bka' yig blugs pa'i sgom bu gsum ste/rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long sogs lo rgyus mang po'i nang srong btsan sgam po'i bal bzang btsun por bzhes skabs bal po'i yi ger bris pa'i bka' shog gi sgrog bu gsum la nang don mi 'dra ba re yod pa bskur ba'i bka' shog dang po'i nang dge ba bcu dang ldan pa'i chos khrims 'cha' rgyu/gnyis pa'i nang lha khang brgya rtsa brgyad kyi sgo bal yul du bstan zhes bzhengs rgyu/gsum pa'i nang dpal 'byor gong 'phel gtor rgyu'i skor 'khod yod ces gsal}
bka' yi sdud po|{sangs rgyas kyis sku tshe gcig ring gsungs pa'i gsung rab yod tshad phyogs gcig tu bsdus pa po la zer/de la rgya gar du sangs rgyas mya ngan las 'das rjes bka' bsdu ba thengs gsum byung ba'ip+sakor gong gsal bka' bsdu dang po dang/gnyis pa/gsum pa zhes pa'i tshig 'grel la gzigs}
bka' yo gal 'chos pa|{gong gsal bka' blon zhes pa'i mchan 'grel der gzigs}
bka' rams dge bshes|{bka' rab 'byams la byang chub pa'i dge bshes zhes pa'i bsdus ming/'og gi dge bshes lha rabs pa zhes pa'i mchan 'grel la gzigs}
bka' la sgra ji bzhin pas khyab|{bka' la nges don gyis khyab pa'i don te/sangs rgyas kyi bka' la sgra bzhin pa'i brjod don las dgongs don gzhan du 'grel rgyu yon par khas mi len pa'o/_/dbu sems gnyis kyis mdo'i drang nges 'byed pa'i tshe/sgra ji bzhi du khas blangs rung mi rung du 'byed cing/bye brag smra ba dang mdo sde pa gnyis kyis theg chen gyi gsung rab 'khor lo bar pa dang/tha ma gnyis sangs rgyas kyi bkar mi 'dod pas/bye brag smra ba phal che bas bka' la nges don kho nas khyab pap+sate sgra ji bzhin pas khyab par 'dod pa las/dgongs gzhi gzhan du 'grel rgyu yod pa'i drang don khas mi len no/_}
bka' la btags|{'di la go don gnyis yod/1 bka' go tu bsdus nas 'bangs su bcug pa/2 khrims thog nas bka' phabs pa bcas go rgyu mi 'dra ba 'ga' yod}
bka' la thogs|{1 bka' 'og tu gnas shing de las 'gal ba nam yang byed mi phod pa/2 bka' khrims kyi 'og tu bcug zin pa}
bka' la don ni dgu yis bstan|{ngo bo des tshig dbye ba dang/_/sngags dang mtshan nyid byed las dang/_/sa mtshams yon tan 'byung ba'i rgyu/_/ngo bo nam dag dgos pa tshang/_/bslad par mi 'gyur thub pa'i bka'/_/nges tshig lang kar gshegs pa las/_/'byung thos rtogs par dka' ba'i phyir/_/de phyir bka' la nges tshig yin/_}
bka' lung|{rim pa gong ma nas sprad pa'i yig cha dang bka' shog sogs/sangs rgyas kyi gsung gi lung bstan la yang bka' lung zer}
bka' shag|{gong gsal bka' blon shag ces pa'i mchan 'grel der gzigs}
bka' shag 'gag|{bka' shag gi mdor bka' drung dang/bka' mgron bcas 'tshogs sa'i khang pa}
bka' shag 'gag pa|{de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs bka' blon so sor 'gag pa re yod pa rnams kyis bka' blon rnams phyi 'gro thag ring thung gang la yang sku srung nyen rtog pa'i 'gan khur mkhan/bka' shag nye skor gyi sgrig khrims gnon sdoms/bka' shag ma chen gyi bka' blon tshor gsol ja 'degs skabs bka' blon gyi mchod zhal bzed 'bul sogs zhabs zhu'i byed sgo rnams sgrub rgyu'i 'gan khur yod}
bka' shag thugs spro|{de sngon bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi bka' blon dang/bka' drung/bka' mgron/'gag pa sogs bka' shag khongs gtogs kyi dpon rigs las byed tshang ma bod zla 8pa'i nang drung spyi gling gar nyin bdun brgyad ring gling kha dang sbrags spro skyid gtong ba der zer}
bka' shag shod pa|{bka' shag gi thad ka'i khongs gtogs lan don tsag tsig sgrub mkhan yin/der shod skor rim pa bdun pa'i las tshan pa drung yig chung ba gsum yod/kho tsho'i las 'gan ni rta khal lam yig thong 'dzin sgyur rgyu dang/rdzong gzhis so sor yod pa'i gzhung dgon khag la nyi ldog zhabs brtan sgrub rgyu'i dpyad khra 'bri gtong/ston chen khag gi sder gzhung sder yig /chibs bsgyur gyi chibs rags gral tho/mchod 'bul lag deb sgyur rgyu/rdzong gzhis gsar rnying 'pho len gyi sprod rgya lam yig khag bka' shag brgyud rtse shod du snyan zhur gtor rgyan bka' shag gi tshab byas te lan don tsag tsig dper na/gzhung gi dbu gur 'don 'jug /'u shang lha khang gi mchad 'bul/sad srung dang char 'bebs la lta rtog skor g.yeng sogs byed sgo'i thog yig nang 'khod pa ltar las 'gan sgrub mkhan yin}
bka' shog|{rim pa gong mas gsham 'og la btang ba'i bka' yig }
bka' shog she bam chen mo|{de sngon bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs/tA la'i bla ma rin po che da nga/paN chen rin po che/srid skyong rim byung bcas nas dgon sde dang sger pa khag la sa cha dang/mi ser/gzhis kha bcas kyi bdag dbang gtan 'jags su stsal ba'i bka' shog gi rigs la sher bam zer/she bam gnang thob byung rjes sa 'dres khag dang rtsod gleng mi 'ong ba'i ched du 'byed khral zhes pa'i deb gzhung zur du bkod srol yod}
bka' srung mgon po'i skor|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bka' srung mgon po'i skor la/mgon po phyag drug /mgon po gur/mgon po zhal/mgon po beng sogs mi 'dra ba mang du yod kyang/skabs 'dir rgya gar grub chen ra hu la gup+ta nas mkhas grub khyung po rnal 'byor la brgyud pa'i mgon po phyag drug pa'i chos skor ste/de la thog mar rjes gnang la mgon po bka' bcu gsum gyi rjes gnang/bla mgon dbyer med kyi khrid/grub chen mai tri pa nas 'khor lo bzhi khrid/mkha' spyod ma dkar mo dang/mgon dkar yid bzhin nor bu'i tshe khrid sogs dang/lung gi skor la/mgon po'i be'u bum gyi lung sogs yod}
bka' gsum|{zhal nas gsungs pa dang/byin gyis brlabs pa dang/rjes su gnang ba'o/_}
bka' bsrungs|{shAkya mu ne dang/de min gyi bla ma tshos chos lugs srung skyob byed dgos par bka' phab ste bsgo gzhag byas pa'i srung ma/chos lugs so sor rang rang gi bka' srung mi 'dra ba re yod kyang/spyi'i bka' srung mgon po phyag drug pa dang/rdo rje gur/zhal bzhi pa/lha mo dmag zor ma/rgyal po sku lta bu yin}
bka'as rmas|{bka' gnang ba'am gros bsdur gyi gzhi 'don pa gnang ba gnyis kar go chog }
bka'i dgung blon gnyis|{sde srid sta rtse ba lha rgyal rab brtan gyis srid dbang bzung skabs kyi bka' blon bkra shis rtse pa dang/bka' blon a chos gnyis}
bka'i dgung blon 'du ba'i khang bu|{bka' shag lhan rgyas tshogs sa'i khang pa zhes pa'i don}
bka'i chu bo chen po bzhi 'dus pa|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi bka' babs mang du byon pa'i nang nas gnyags lo tsA ba dz+nyA na ku mA ra la bka' babs kyi chu bo bzhi 'dus pa ste/1 dkyus bshad gzhung gi chu bo 'grel Tig stong thun dang bcas pa/2 snyan brgyud gdams ngag gi chu bo gnad yig dmar khrid dang bcas pa/3 byin rlabs dbang gi cho bo bskur thabs ngo sprod dang bcas pa/4 phyag bzhes 'phrin sgrub kyi chu bo bstan srung drag sngags dbang bcas pa cha tshang bar bzhugs pa la zer}
bka'i thang yig chen mo|{spyir bka' thang la rigs mi 'dra ba kha shas yod pa nas skabs 'dir (bka' thang sde lnga )la go dgos pa 'dra yang/gsham du drangs pa'i lung tshig rnams da lta'i (bka' thang sde lnga )dpar ma'i nang mi gsal bas ma dpe gzhan zhig gi nang yod nges pas 'tshol dgos}
bka'i mdun na 'don pak+Shi|{rgyal po lha bzang gis bod sa gnas kyi srid dbang 'dzin skabs bka' blon pak+Shi zer ba zhig yod pa de yin cing ming la bltas na phal cher sog rigs yid 'dra ba dang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng drug pa tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho po tA la'i gser khri nas phab skabs 'gan khur mkhan gtso bo'i gras yin }
bka'i sna bo|{bka' blon gyi ming gzhan/bka' don ltar gyi las ka sgrub mkhan sne khrid pa'am 'go khrid mkhan yin pa'i don}
bka'i phyag rgya drug|{rgyal po'i bka' btsan pos yul sde chen po la dbang bsgyur ba'i rtags mtshan mtshon byed drug ste/1 bka' rtags kyi phyag rgya sgrom bu/2 khrom rtags kyi phyag rgya ru mtshon dang ru dar/3 yul rtags kyi phyag rgya sku mkhar/4 chos rtags kyi phyag rgya lha khang/5 dpa' rtags kyi phyag rgya stag pags kyi slog pa/6 mdzangs rtags kyi phyag rgya yig tshang bcas drug yin/drug po so so'i ngos 'dzin skor gong 'og gi ming tshig so sor thad par gsal}
bka'i 'phrin blon|{btsan po'i bka' brgyud bsgrags byed mkhan gyi blon po'i go gnas kyi ming}
bkar rgya'i las 'dzin pa|{de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gis lo re'i ston kha sa gnas so sor khral 'bab bsdu mkhan btang ste/de nas bsdus pa'i 'bru khag gcig sa gnas so so'i rdzong gi 'bru khang nang bka' 'jug byed kyi yod cing/las don de byed mkhan gyi ming la bkar 'bru 'ded pa dang/bka' 'bru 'go pa/bkar rgya yong sdud pa/yong sdud pa/yong bzhes pa zhes zer}
bkar btags bzhi|{'dus byas thams cad mi rtag pa/zag bcas thams cad sdug bsngal ba/chos thams cad stong zhing bdag med pa/mya ngan las 'das pa zhi ba ste bzhi la bkar btags bzhi'am/bka' btags kyi phyag rgya bzhi ste lta tshul bzhi po de khas len na nang pa sangs rgyas kyi pa yin pa dang/de bzhi khas mi len na nang pa sangs rgyas pa min zhes sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyis kyis bka' khrims mdzad stabs rgyal po chen po'i tham ka yod pa'i khrims yig dang 'dra bas na ming de ltar brjod srol yod}
bkar rtsis|{gong gsal bkar rgya yong sdud pa'i khral 'bab byung ba dang chad pa'i rtsis bsher byas pa}
bkar rgya nyis gshor ba|{de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung nas rdzong gzhis khag la mngags gtor byas pa'i yong sdud pa zer ba zhig /des sa gnas khag gi mi ser tsho nas 'bru khral bsdus rjes khral 'bab kyi 'bru thog nas dgon pa khag la phogs sprod dgos sogs sprad zin nas lhag ma gang yod 'bru khang du bcug te bkar 'jug rgyag mkhan yin}
bkar yong|{gzhung gi 'bru mdzod du 'jug rgyu'i 'bru khral bsdu mkhan dang lo re'i khral 'bab bsdu mkhan}
bkar yong rdzong gsum gyi deb 'don|{de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi bkar rgyu'i 'bru mdzod dang/yong bzhes/rdzong khag bcas khag gsum gyi khral 'bab byung ba dang chad pa'i tho 'god deb gzhung bzos pa}
bkas mngags pa'i am pa|{de snga man ching srid gzhung gis bod sa gnas kyi las don byed sgor shugs snon byed ched du snga rjes su bkas mngags pa'i am ban dang/bod sdod am ban bcas btang yod pa las/bkas mngags pa'i am ban khag gcig ni/bod kyi gdan don gal che'i rigs dmigs bsal gyis thog gcod byed sgo grub mtshams nang sar phyir log byed pa las bod sa gnas su rgyun sdod byed kyi med cing/bod sdod am ban ni bkas mngags pa'i am ban yin pa'i thog /bod sa gnas su rgyun sdod byed mkhan yang yin pa bcas mi 'dra ba yod/man ching srid gsung gis bon sa gnas su rgyun sdod am ban mngags gtong byed 'go tshugs pa'i dus tshod rgya yig dang bod yig thog bshad tshul mi 'dra ba yod pa ste/rgya yig gi (ching rgyal rabs kyi bod sdod am ban las don zin bris ){(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i 'go brjod nang/gong ma khang shis khri lo zhe brgyad pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa glang (1709)lo nas bod sdod am ban gtong 'go tshugs tshul rgyu mtshan dang bcas pa bkod 'dug pa de ni bkas mngags am ban rnams bod sdod am ban yin pa'i dbang du btang nas/gong ma khang shing khri lo zhe brgyad pa sa glang lo (1709)nas man ching rgyal rabs kyi gong ma'i tha ma h+phu yis shon thung khri lo gsum pa lcags phag (1911)bar lo nyis brgya bcu med gnyis ring am ban gtong thebs ba rgya dang bzhi bcu zhe brgyad byung ba dang/de'i nang blon chen ngo ma'i gras brgya dang bcu med gsum/de 'phros rnams blon chen gzhon pa yin pa sogs 'khod 'dug /bod yig gi gzhung yig nang/man ching gong ma yung khreng khri lo lnga pa me lug (1727)lor bka' blon nga lum sbyar gsum yis da'i ching sba dur bsad pa dang/dbus gtsang dus zing byung ba'i rjes su don rkyen thag gcod byed po'i bkas mngags am ban seng ge ngal bod sdom am bad du bsgo gzhag gnang ba nas bod sa gnas su rgyun sdod am ban byung ba'i 'go tshugs zhes gsal yod/de skor zhib cha gong gsal rgya yig gi dpyad gzhi'i yig cha zhes par gzigs}
bkas bcad chen po rnam pa gsum|{rgyal po khri ral pa can gyis srid dbang bzung skabs bod sa gnas kyi gnas tshul dngos dang bstun nas bkas bcad rnam pa gsum mdzad yod/1 bod du gzhi thams cad yod par smra ba'i sde pa las gzhan pa'i sde pa gzhan 'dzugs mi chog pa de yin/de'i rgyu mtshan ni bod la rab byung gi sde thog mar 'dzugs skabs mkhan po ni bo d+hi sa twa yin cing/khong nyid kyang thams cad yod par smra ba'i sde pa las rab tu byung ba yin pa da nga/thams cad yod par smra ba'i sde pa las gzhan da pa gsum bar 'dul ba'i bcas mtshams dang lag len gyi thog bzhed pa mi 'dra ba yod pas bod la 'dul ba'i phyag bzhes gcig gyur du gnas pa'i ched yin/2 gsang sngags ma rgyud kyi p+sagor rnams bod skad du bsgyur mi chog pa de yin/de'i dgos pa ni skabs der bod la rab byung gi sde btsugs nas yun ring ma song ba'i dbang gis rang nyid la chos kyi go rtogs gang yang med bzhin du gsang sngags sgra ji bzhin du spyad nas 'dul khrims 'chal skyon yong ba sngon 'gog mdzad pa'i ched du yin/3 bre srang sogs kyi 'jal tshad rgya gar ma g+ha d+ha'i tshad gzhi dang mthun par gcig yur byed dgos pa de yin/de'i dgos pa ni/skabs der bod sa gnas su phul drug la bre gang du sa pa'i drug phul ma dang phul bdun la bre gang du rtsi pa'i bdun phul ma zhes mi 'dra ba gnyis yod pa'i thog /bod bre gang la drug phul rtsis na ma g+ha d+ha'i ra gang la bod bre do dang khyor ba gang yod pa bcas khyad par chen po yod pa dang/de bzhin ma g+ha d+ha'i gser srang gang la bod kyi gser srang do yod pa bcas kyi he bag chen po des bod dang rgya gar bar tshong 'brel byed skabs stabs bde yong ched/'jal gshor 'degs gsum gyi tshad gcig gyur gyi gtan 'bebs mdzad pa yin}
bkas rma bar ci gnang|{bka' dris gnang}
bkur bsti|{pha ma dang rgan rabs la brtsi zhing gong du bkur ba sogs dang/lus kyi p+sago nas phyag 'tshal zhing mchod pa 'bul ba/ngag gi sgo nas zhe sa 'bul zhing chi gsung bka' bzhin du sgrub pa bcas la zer}
bkog skyid phyug po dang brgyad stong dpe cha|{'phan po byang kha shang khogs bkog skyid phyug po zhes khyim tshang zhig yod pa der brgyad stong pa'i dpe cha bris ma pod chen zhig yod pa rje tsong kha pas ljags klog gnang myong ba'i byin can zhig yin skad la brgyad stong de mjal ba dang/zhal phye/dag sgrog zhu mkhan sogs mang po yong gi yod cing/dad mjal ba rnams la bkog skyid phyug po nas sne len gang drag zhu srol yod pa red/shod rgyun zhig yod pa ni sngon dus rje tsong kha pa de gar phebs skabs tshems snyun nas bkod pas skyid po byung gsungs shing/de nas bzung khyim tshang der bkog skyid phyug po zhes grags skad dang/de dus de ga'i khyim 'dzin ma des rje tsong kha par stod 'gag cig phul bas lan po 'dug gang gsungs pas yul der lan po zhes grags zer/bkog skyid phyug po zhes pa'i khyim tshang de de snga nyan po dgon pa'i gsham du yod cing/nyan po phyug po zer ba nas bzung yul nyan po phyug po de'i gzhis khang sa zhing sogs rjes su phur lcog bla brang la sbyar te khyim gzhis gsar rgyag byas par bkog skyid phyug po zhes 'bod/de snga rje tsong kha pa'i tshems kyang khyim tshang der yod pa rjes su tshems de gzhung nas blangs te bkog skyid phyug por khral chag cig byung skad/brgyad stong gi dpe che de rig gnas gsar brje'i skabs med par bzos kyang de'i glegs shing bkod skyid kyi bran g.yog cig gis nyar tshags byas pa da lta yod skad}
bkod rgya|{las khungs rang rang so sos gsham du btang ba'i yi ge la rang rang so sos ming 'bod dus de la bkod rgya zer}
bkod 'doms rim pa song ba|{bka' phab thems gcig gnyis tsam min par thengs mang po phab yod pa}
bkod pa rdzogs|{bkod pa tshang ba'i don te 'di'i bkod pa rdzogs zhes pa'i bkod pa ni sgra gdangs dma' ba'i ming tshig yin cing/bkod pa bshad pa zhes pa'i bkod pa de min par bzo lta la zer/dper na/khang pa bzo lta yag po la bkod pa yag po zer ba lta bu'o/_}
bkod pa'i pad+ma|{kha phye nas yun ring ma song zhing 'dab ma rgyas ran pa/bkod pa'i pad+ma de kha phye nas yun ring ma song stabs lo ma mang zhing che ba bzhin du bsam blo cung zad rnyed pa'i mi de bsam blo rnyed nas yun ring por ma phyin par brten blang dor gyi gnad gal ba rnams mi shes pa}
bkod lung 'gro min rigs|{bkod 'doms dang bka' phab par dang len mi byed mkhan gyi mi'i gras}
bkwan ting gu shri|{{(WP:1,194)} 1 de sngon sa skya bdag chen bzang po dpal gyi sras mkhas btsun nam mkha' legs pa'i blo gros rgyal mtshan la yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma ku sha la gu thug rgyal pos rab byung lnga 'i shing glang (1325)lor phul ba'i cho lo'i ming 2 phag gru'i sde srid khri rabs gnyis pa 'dzam dbyangs gu shri shAkya rgyal mtshan la tA ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hung wus rab byung drug pa'i chu byi (1372)lor gnang ba'i cho lo 3 phag gru sde srid khri rabs lnga pa dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan la tA ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hung wus rab byung bdun pa'i sa 'a brug (1388)lor gnang ba'i cho lo thengs dang po 4 karma pa sku phreng lnga pa de bzhin gshegs pa tA ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma yung los nan cin du gdan drangs pa ltar phebs skabs mnyam du phebs pa'i mtshur phu'i bla chen 'brong bu dang slob dpon dga' bzhi pa rin chen dpal slob dpon mgon blon pa bcas gsum la gnang ba'i cho lo bcas yin }
bkwan ting gu shri hran h+pha wang|{{(WP:1,194)}phag gru sde srid khri rabs gnyis pa dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan la tA ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma yung los rab byung bdun pa'i sa glang (1409)lor gnang ba'i cho lo'i ming zer}
bkye ba|{pho nya mngags pa'am ston mo bsham pa dang/'od zer dang sprul pa 'gyed pa sogs la 'jug go }
bkyed pa|{rgya bskyed pa'am 'gyed pa'i 'das par 'jug go }
