bkra dgu|{(mkhas pa lde'u'i chos 'byung )las/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i skabs khrims dang lugs srol 'chad skabs/bkra dgu la nang gses phye na dgu tshan gsum yod pa ste/1 srid pa dgu bkra/2 ston mo dgu bkra/3 byang chub dgu bkra bcas yod pa dang/'dir byang chub dgu bkra las gzhan gnyis 'grel bshad med tshul gsal zhing/byang chub dgu bkra shis gsham gsal ba sde'i nang gi skabs su gsal}
bkra thang blo bzang chos kyi nyi ma|{rje 'di ni je 'phel thog yab a 'a grug dang yum sgrol ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i cha lug (1763)lor 'khrungs/ring por ma lon par chos sde chen po dga' ldan don grub gling du mngal gsol/dgung lo bdun thog klu sgrub mchog sprul ngag dbang 'jigs med nas gtsug phud bzhes ta mtshan blo bzang nyi ma bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan du gsol/dge ba'i bshes gnyen blo bzang dpal sbyin gyi drung nas rab ma rab byung dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/khu bo klu sgrub kyi mdun nas yi ge 'bri klog gsan/de nas dbus phyogs su byon te 'bras blo gling gi chos grwar zhugs/gzhung pod lngar gsan sbyang mdzad/paN chen blo bzang dpal ldan bstan pa'i nyi ma'i drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/gling bsre'i mtshan btags mdzad de mdo smad du byon nas chos sde don grub gling dang/sbra nag bde chen/bkra thang sogs dgon sde khag la bshad sgrub kyi bya ba rgya cher mdzad/chos sde don grub gling du mtshan nyid kyi bshad grwa btsugs/bka' rtsom la mtshon na (yan lag bdun pa rgyas pa bya tshul bsod nams chu gter/) ('jigs byed gtso rgyang gi sgom bzlas bya tshul dngos grub 'byung gnas/) (smon lam rgyas pa 'dod don kun grub/) (rdza rag gser ldan gyi rnam thar mkhas blun kun gyi rnam bar 'jebs pa'i gling bu'i sgra dbyangs/) (dpal rdo rje 'jigs mdzad kyi drag po'i sbyin sreg gi tsho ga dgra bgegs bsregs pa'i me phung )sogs mang po mdzad/dgung grangs nga dgu la phebs par rab byung bcu bzhi pa lcags sbrul (1821)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
bkra shis khyung rdzong dkar po|{yongs grags su mnga' ris khyung rdzong dkar por 'bod pa de yin/rdzong de ni bod sil bu'i skabs mnga' bdag 'od srung gi gdung rgyud smad kyi lde gsum gyi nang tshan dpal lde nas rgyal rabs kha shas song rjes rgyal po 'bum lde mgon gyis rab byung bzhi pa'i chu glang (1253)lo nas rab byung lnga pa'i lcags 'brug (1280)lo'i bar srid dbang bzung skabs rang khongs mnga' ris gung thang gi sa khung du mkhar rdzong bcu bzhi brtsigs pa'i gras shig yin la/mnga' ris khyung rdzong dkar po 'di ni/thog ma'i sa ming la me rdo thang zhes yul gyi bdag po yang thog pa'i 'dzin khongs sa cha yin pa dang yul spyi'i sa dbyibs dang ri dpyad/phyogs bzhi'i sa ba kra bcas phun sum tshogs pa'i gnas der pho brang 'debs dgos par gzigs te sa cha'i bdag po yang thog pa la rin po che'i phreng ba dang/dngul gyi ga Ta/rta rgod ma dkar po gcig /dar gos yug gcig bcas sa rin du gnang nas nyos te/rang nyid dgung lo bcu bdun pa'am bco brgyad pa rang byung lnga pa'i lcags rta (1270)lor pho brang lcog gsum yod pa dang/btsun mo'i sdod gnas/mnga' khongs ba rgya mtsho bcu gsum gyi las shag /phyi la lcags ri chen mo gcig gis bskor ba bcas ba rtsigs pa yin/sa gnas de la phyis su mnga' ris rdzong dkar rang mnga' ris rdzong dga' zhes 'bod pa de yin/rdzong 'di'i gnas tshul skor snga 'gyur bstan pa'i srog shing ka thog ring 'dzin chen po tshe dbang nor bus mdzad pa'i (bod rje lha btsan po'i gdung rab mnga' ris smad gung thang du ji ltar byung tshul )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 96nas 102bar du gsal ba der gzigs}
