bkra shis 'khyil|{mdo smad lho rgyud kyi dge lugs dgon chen gyi ya gyal zhig ste/yongs grags su bla brang bkra shis 'khyil zhes 'bod srol yod/bkra shis 'khyil zhes pa dgon yin yin pa las 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i bla brang gi ming min kyang bla dgon chags cig tu ming 'bod srol de ltar yongs grags kyi kha rgyun du 'jags mus yin/dgon chen 'di 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng dang po ngag dbang brtson 'grub kyis rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa glang (1709)lor phyag btab/deng sang kan su'u zhing chen lho rgyud kyi shA ho shan {(WP:1,194)}gyi bsang chu 'bab rgyud kyi 'khor yod/dgon gnas 'di thog mar gsar 'debs kyi sbyin bdag ni mtsho sngon gyi dpon chen dga' ldan er ti ni ju nang gis byas shing/grwa pa brgya lhag tsam gyi rten gzhi byas te 'dzin grwa tshugs pa dang/rtsi bzhag gtong ba sogs kyi mdzad thabs la brten nas mtshan nyid grwa tshang gi rmang gzhi bting bar mdzad/gtsug lag khang ste ba'i mang bting nas ma grub par mkhan po no min han da nga/er khe da'i ching gnyis nas phul ba'i tshogs gur grwa pa brgyad brgya tsam shong ba zhag gi nang tshogs 'don 'chad nyan sogs mdzad/'chad nyan dang/chos thog /chos mtshams/sgrig khrims bcas 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang gi phyag srol ltar rgyun 'dzin gnang zhing grwa grangs kyang bkra shis 'khyil gyi grwa tshang gzhan las mang ba dgos pa dang/grwa grangs tshad 'dzin mi dgos pa'i bka' bcad mdzad/rjes su grwa tshogs che dus grwa grangs sum stong lha tsam yod pas 'du tshogs dang rtsod grwa sogs tshogs chen 'du khang du gnang srol 'dug /bkra shis 'khyil du grwa tshang drug yod pa ste/1 thos bsam gling/2 rgyud smad grwa tshang/3 dus 'khor grwa tshang/4 sman pa grwa tshang/5 kyai rdor grwa tshang/6 rgyud stod grwa tshang bcas yin/dang po/thos bsam gling ni gong du bshad pa'i mtshan nyid grwa tshang de la zer zhing/gzhung chen po lnga la slob gnyer mdzad mkhan 'dzin grwa bcu gsum la lo rgyun ring thung mi 'dra ba'i slob gnyer thon nas dka' rabs dge bshes kyi yon tshad gnang gi yod/gnyis pa /rgyud smad grwa tshang dgos pa btab nas lo bdun song ba rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me sprel (1716)lor 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng dang po ngag dbang brtson 'grus kyis dge bshes gsum la bla ma dbu mdzad dang/byang 'dren/dge bskos bcas bsko gzhag dang/grwa pa gsar pa mi grangs bcu gsum bdams nas smad rgyud grwa tshang gi phyag srol dang mthun pa'i rgyud grwa gsar 'dzugs gnang zhing/grwa tshad brgya dang lnga bcu tham par gtan 'khel gnang/gsum pa/dus 'khor grwa tshang/dgon pa btab nas lo lnga bcu nga gsum song bar rang byung bcu gsum pa'i cha lug (1763)lor 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng gnyis pa 'jigs med dbang pos dus 'khor grwa tshang gsar 'dzugs mdzad/grwa tshang der grwa grangs brgya tham pa yod cing/gtso bo dus 'khor gyi cho ga dang/skar rtsis dang nag rtsig sogs rtsis skor dang/gzhan yang kun rig da nga/rnam snang mngon gyi gi cho ga /blo kha dma' ba tshos/lha bris dang/'jim bzo dung rgya gling sogs slob sbyong byed srol gtan 'bebs mdzad yod/bzhi pa/sman pa grwa tshang ni/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng gnyis pa 'jigs med dbang pos rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing 'brug (1784)lor gtsang sman ye shes bzang po'i slob ma rdo rje rab 'byams pa sogs gsum la slob dpon bskos nas lha sa'i lcags po ri gso rig grwa tshang gi phyag srol dang mthun pa'i sman pa grwa tshang gsar 'dzugs thog grwa grangs brgya tham par tshad 'dzin dang zhor la mi 'khrugs pa lha dgu'i cho ga yang gsung rgyun/lnga pa/kyai rdor grwa tshang ni/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng bzhi pa skal bzang thub bstan dbang phyug mchog gis rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags sbrul (1881)lor kyai rdor grwa tshang gsar 'dzugs mdzad/grwa grangs brgya lhag tsam/grwa tshang 'dir cho ga sna tshogs dang/skar rtsis/sgra rig pa/ri mo sogs slob gnyer gnang srol 'dug /drug pa/rgyud stod grwa tshang/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng lnga pa 'jam dbyangs ye shes bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan mchog gis rgyud sdod mkhan chen yongs 'dzin gling rin po cher thugs re gnang ba ltar/mkhas btsun bzang po'i dpal 'dzin rong pa sngags rabs pa ye shes don grub dang/dkyil 'khor 'bri sgrub mchod bzhengs sogs kyi sgyu rtsal la byang chub pa'i grags pa sngags rams pa bstan pa chos ldan gnyis la bka' bkod gnang ba ltar rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa yos (1939)lor rgyud stod grwa tshang gsar 'dzugs bskyangs/grwa grangs kyang brgya dang lnga bcu yas mas tsham yod/gdan sa 'dir gung chen po lnga dang/gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer phyag bzhes skor dbus gtsang gdan sa chen po khag dang gcig mtshungs kyi p+sarol bzang 'a gral zla bral ba yod pa'i thog /'jam dbyangs bzhad sku phreng gnyis pa 'jigs med dbang pos dgung lo zhe gnyis pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa glang/(1769)lor bkra shis lhun po'i 'cham dpon (bla ma blo bzang dpal ldan )mdo smad du 'byor ba dang stabs bstun bkra shis lhun po'i phyag srol ltar gyi 'cham dang lcags mkhar gsar 'dzugs mdzad tshul (rnam thar rgyal sras rgya mtsho'i 'jug ngogs )su gsal bas skabs der paN rin chen po che sku phreng drug pa dpal ldan ye shes dgung lo sum cu so gnyis la phebs skabs yin/gzhan yang lha bris dang/'jim bzo/dpar brkor tshun chad kyi lag rtsal kyang dpe cha'i slob gnyer ma thub pa tshor slob sbyong gi go skabs bzang po yod par brten/gdan sa 'di nas thon pa'i bstan 'dzin gyi skyed dam pa yang 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng rim byon dang/gung thang bstan pa'i sgron me sku phreng rim byon/sde khri rim byon/dbal mang dkon mchog rgyal mtshan/rgyal mkhan chen grags pa rgyal mtshan/zhang bstan pa rgya mtsho/sgo mang blo bzang tshul khrims rgya mtsho/rje shes rab rgya mtsho/gung thang blo gros rgya mtsho sogs grangs las 'das pa da nga/gzhan yang sman rams pa dang/rtsis rams pa/lha bris pa/'jam bzo ba sogs mdzes rig sgyu rtsal la mkhas pa yang mang du byon yod/'dir gdan sa'i ngo sprod mdor bsdus tsam las zhib par dbal mang dpon mchog rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bkra shis 'khyil gyi gdan rabs lha'i rnga chen )lcags dpar ma dang/rgya rigs dge rgan chen mo mkhas dbang li an krad {(WP:1,194)} mchog gis mdzad pa'i (bod 'jug byas pa/) {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i rgya yig gi shog grangs 124nas 212bor gsal ba der gzigs }
bkra shis sgang gi 'dus sde|{lha sa grong khyer gyi nub ngos snye thang khul du grong tsho'i dkyil la yod pa'i sa lugs kyi dgon pa zhig ste/sa skya'i bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan (rab byung lnga pa'i chu byi 1312lo nas rab byung bdun pa'i me byi 1396lo'i bar )gyis phyag btab/thog mar bslab gtsang gi dgon pa yin kyang/dgon pa dang grong pa mnyam 'dres su yod stabs ser khyim pa zhig tu gyur pa pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis slar yang gtsang dgon du bsgyur ba yin}
bkra shis sgo mang|{'di la skabs dang sbyar nas go ba mi 'dra ba len dgos pa ste/1 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang gi mang cha tshang/2 a mdo kan su'u bla brang bkra shis 'khyil gyi ming gzhan/3 bde gshegs mchod rten brgyad kyi nang gses chos 'khor bskor ba'i mchod rten gyi mang bcas go tshul gsum yod/mchod rten bkra shis sgo mang ni/bde gshegs mchod rten brgyad ces sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das sku 'khrungs pa nas mya ngan las 'das pa'i bar sku tshe gcig gi mdzad pa'i gtso bo brgyad la dran gso zhu ba'i mchod rten brgyad (1 pad spungs mchod rten sku bltams pa/2 byang chub mchod rten sangs rgyas pa/3 bkra shis sgom mang mchod rten chos 'khor bskor ba/4 bdud 'dul mchod rten cho 'phrul bstan pa/5 lha babs mchod rten lha nas babs pa/6 dbyen bsdums mchod na dge 'dun phyogs gnyis su gyes pa'i dbyen bsdums pa/7 rnam rgyal mchod rten sku tshe byin gyis brlabs pa/8 myang 'das mchod rten sku mya ngan las 'das pa (yod pa la chos 'khor thog mar bskor bar dran gso zhu chen sa rA Na sIr dad pa can rnams kyis bzhengs pa de yin/de'i dbyibs ni sa 'dzin nas bad chen bar dang/bum stan pad+ma nas thog gi bar mchod rten gzhan dag dang 'dra ba la/tshang rim bzhi yi dbyibs gru bzhi/dkyil du glo 'bur phyogs bzhi kar yod pa/glo 'bur dang gzhogs ngos tshang mar p+sago mang po yod pa da nga/sgo mang shos la brgya dang brgyad/'bring la sgo lnga bcu nga drug /bsdus par sgo bcu drug bcas gtod srol yod/mchod rten 'di phyi mchod rten la nang kha lha du yod pa byas na bkod pa mdzes zhing brjid chags pa yod stabs rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i yang 'dul gyi gtsug lag khang bzhi dang/ldan yul klong thang sgrol ma lha khang bcas lnga ni phyi mchod rten dang nang lha khang gi dbyibs can yin par (nel pa paN+Di ta'i chos 'byung )las gsungs shing/bod kyi mchod rten chen po bzhir grags pa (1 rgyal dpal 'khor mchod rten/2 rgyang 'bum mo che/3 jo nang sku 'bum chen mo/4 gra nang byams pa gling gi mchod rten mthong grol )bcas bzhi ka phyi mchod rten bkra shis sgong mang la nang lha khang mang po yod pa sha stag yin}
bkra shis sgo mang gi rnam par 'dren pa ngag dbang phun tshogs|{'dir (mchan/'dir zhes pa ni 1987lor si khron mi rigs dpe skrun khang nas bton pa'i (mi dbang rtogs brjod )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 333'phreng bcu pa'i thog chos sde chen po dpal ldan 'bras dkar spungs pa'i bkra shis sgo mang gi rnam par 'dren pa ngag dbang phun tshogs jun gar du bskyod par phyogs pa la zhes pa go dgos )sgo mang grwa tsang gi mkhan po jun gar gyi sog rigs yin pa blo bzang phun tshogs la zer rgyu yin kyang yig nor byung ba 'dra ste/pho lha ba dang 'brel ba bzang po yod pa'i 'bras spungs sgo mang gi mkhan po jun khar gyi sog rigs yin pa de ni go shri han gyi dmag rogs bA thur hong tha'i ji la bu bdun yod pa'i bdun pa de yin cing/'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang du chos zhugs thog/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng dang po ngag dbang brtson 'grus rtsa ba'i bla mar bsten te gzhung chen pa lnga'i slob gnyer mthar phyin nas sgo mang grwa tshang gi mkhan po yun mi ring tsam gnang zhing/mkhan zur gyi skabs rgyal po lha bzang gis mtsho sngon du 'tshams 'dri'i mi snar mngags pa ltar phebs pa'i lam bar bar shis 'khyil du 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa mjal nas lung bstan bka' slob gnang tshul rnam thar nang gsal ba de yin/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags glang (1721)lor jun gar bod nas mthar skrod gtong rgyur man ching srid gzhung gis mngags pa'i dmag dpung bod du ma 'byor gong tsham du rang yul jun gar la phyir log mdzad par brten/gdan sa gsum gyi khongs su yod pa'i jun gar gyi grwa rigs rnams 'dzin bzung byed pa'i nyen kha las g.yol thub pa byung yod}
