bkra shis sgo mang grwa tshang pa|{'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang/'jam dbyangs chos rje'i dngos slob drung grags pa rin chen gyis phyag btab par lo rgyun yig cha mang por gsal/ngag rgyun du/'bras spungs tshogs chen 'tshogs yul thog mar sgo mang grwa tshang du yin pa dang/rjes su tshogs chen 'du khang gsar bzhengs grub rjes gnas spos mdzad pa yin zhes zer srol 'dug /rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing glang (1745)lo'i pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis sbyin bdag byas te da lta'i 'du khang ka ba brgya dang brgyad/sgo 'phyor ka ba bcu gnyis dang bcas pa'i rgya khyon ka ba brgya dang nyi shu'i sa/rung khang ka ba dgu'i sa yod pa bcas gsar bzhengs byas tshul (sgo mang grwa tshang gi dkar chag )nang gsal/grwa tsang 'dir khang tshan bcu drug yod pa ste/1 har gdong khang tshan ni/stod sog /a lag sha /shin cang bcas kyi sog rigs dang/sang sog khag gcig /'dam dang/nag chu'i 'brog pa/stod lung dang/yangs pa can/'phan po bcas kyi dbus pa khag gcig bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs yin/2 bsam blo khang tshan ni/a mdo khul khag gcig dang/mtsho sngon gyi sog rigs/bod byang khul gyi 'brog pa bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs/3 gung ru khang tshan ni/bar khams tsha ba dpa' shod/sho pa mdo/star rdzong/lho rdzong bcas dang/dbus nas 'bri gung pa bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs/4 bra ti khang tshan ni/co ne/chas pa bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs/5 klu 'bum khang tshan ni/mtsho sngon gyi reb gong/rdo sbis/a rig bcas kyi grwa rgyun thon khungs thob khungs/6 tA dben khang tshan ni/hor tshang yongs rdzogs/klu chu shis tshang rdzong gi bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs/7 the po khang tshan ni/zi khron khongs mdzod dge shog bcu gnyis/'phan phyi shog bdun/di nyag shog lnga/the po khul mang che ba/'brug chu rdzong gi phyed ka bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs/8 gzhung pa khang tshan ni/a mdo zam tsha rong pa yongs rdzogs/kan su'u bsang chu stod smad/'bo ra/a mchog bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs/9 'gag shing khan tshan ni/mtsho sngon gyi dan tig yang tig /mdzo mo mkhar bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs/10 gra nye khang tshan ni/kan su'u khongs gtsos lha khang/rdza yis/rgan gya/bkra shis 'khyil gyi tha ba/bsang chu khongs kyi rong pa bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs/11 zung chu khang tshan ni/a mdo khongs zung 'phan yongs rdzogs/rnga ba khu mang che ba/mgo log gi khang gsar/khang rgan bcas nas yong ba'i grwa rgyun thob khungs/12 chu bzang khang tshan ni/mtsho sngon gyi chu bzang dang dbus khul ston lung pa bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs/13 bya bral khang tshan ni/kan su'u bsang chu rdzong khongs kyi dngul ra/mdzod dge nyi ma chos 'khor khag gsum/mtsho sngon mgo log rdza chu kha/a rig bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs/14 reb rtsa khang tshan ni/kan su'u khongs res tsa khag bzhi bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs/15 chas pa khang tshan ni/co ne chas su shis pa/bde thang ya ru ma ru/sa dmar/a 'khor/phye ro khog bcas kyi grwa rgyun thob khungs/16 mnga' ris khang tshan ni/ston mnga' ris kyi gra rgyun thob khungs bcas yin/gzhan yang khang tshan khongs gtogs kyi mi tshan skor/har gdong khang tshan khongs mi tshan drug ste/1 hor/2 jur ched/3 mtsho kha/4 btsan po/5 thor khod/6 wa shul/) bsam blo khang tshan khongs mi tshan drug ste/(1 khal kha/2 dgon lung/3 bis mdo/4 tho ril/5 lam pa 6 dga' gdong/zung ju khang tshan khongs mi tshan gcig ste nyan po mi tshan bcas khyon bsdoms mi tshan bcu gsum la dge 'dun zhal grangs sum stong yas mas yod kyang/dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i mjug tsam nas a mad dag sog yul phyogs nas bod du grwa rgyun yong mkhan je nyung la song bar brten/har bsam gnyis sogs kyi grwa rgyun yang rim bzhin nyung du song/grwa tsang 'di nas bstan 'dzin gyi skyes chen ma tshan snyan mongs su khyab pa mang du byung ba'i nang nas grags che ba ni/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng rim byon dang/lcang skyi sku phreng rim byon/thu'u bkwan sku phreng dang/lcang lung paN+Di ta/gung thang khri chen/btsan po no min han/smin grol ho thog thu/rta tshag ho thog thu/'on rgyal sras sogs yin/dga' ldan khri la phebs pa'i gras/khri thog dgu pa blo bzang nyi ma/khri thog bcu drug pa rgya ra chos skyong rgya mtsho/khri thog sum cu pa blo gros rgya mtsho/khri thog zhe bzhi pa rgya nag pa blo gros/zhe bdun pa sbyin pa rgya mtsho/zhe brgyad pa don grub rgya mtsho lnga bcu pa dge 'dun phun tshogs/nga gcig pa dpal ldan grags pa/nga gsum pa rgyal mtshan seng ge /nga lnga pa nam mkha' bzang po/bdun cu pa ngag dbang chos 'phel/gya gcig pa ngag dbang nor bu bcas khri la phebs pa bcu gnyis tsam byung/mkhan rabs rin byon/slob gnyer yig cha/slob gnyer gyi sgrig srol/grwa tshang gi sgrig gzhi/mchod gzhis khag /dpal 'byor gyi gnas tshul bcas kyi yig cha bcas ring por mi thogs par thon par 'gyur bas 'dir yig tshogs la 'jigs nas ma bkod do/_}
bkra shis sgo mang gtsug lag khang|{mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal po 'bum lde mgon gyis rab byung lnga pa'i lcags rta (1279)lor mnga' ris khyung nga dkar po brtsigs grub pa'i rjes su mu mthun nas yab yum gnyis kyi dge rtsa'i ched du bzhengs pa'i gtsug lag khang gi ming ste/gtsug lag khang de'i rgya yon ka ba drug cu'i (sbug gi gtsang khang la ka ba nyi shu rtsa bzhi/mdo'i khyams chen la ka ba sum cu so drug )tshad dang/ka gdan rdo las grub pa'i rus sbal gzugs kyi ka ba dang bre gdan/bri phul sogs me tog dang srog chags kyi gzugs 'gros sna tshogs brko dkrol rgyan bkod phun sum tshogs shing/rtsig pa sra brtan gyi tshad kyang/rab byung lnga pa'i lcags rta ro nas rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me los bar lo bzhi brgya bdun cu don bdun 'das shing/dus phyis gtsug lag khang la sri zhu ches brtson pa yang dkon rung/zhig ral rdib 'khyom yo 'chug cung zad kyang ma song bar gnas pa 'di ni ngo mtshar ba'i yul du snang ngo zhes ka thog rig 'dzin chen po tshe dbang nor bus mdzad pa'i (mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal rabs der ther dwangs shel 'phrul gyi me long )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 104nas 6bar gsal/gtsug lag khang 'di'i 'dzugs skrun dang nang gi rten bzhengs bcas yongs rdzogs grub par lo brgyad 'khor te/rab byung gong gsal gyi me glang (1277)lor 'gro mgon 'phags pa rin po che hor sog gi yul nas bod du thengs gnyis pa phebs 'byor byung ba dang dus mtshungs grub pa zhib par gong gsal rgyal rabs der gzigs}
