bkra shis chos lung|{'phags pa lha ho thog thu rin po che'i sku phreng dang po 'phags pa lha (rab byung bdun pa'i sa lug 1439nas rab byung brgyad pa'i me lug 1487lau'i bar )dpal bzang po mchog gis nyan po dang/kong po/spo bo/'jang sa thang bcas su sgrub sde bcu dang/dgon p+sade nyi shu lhag tsam phyag btab pa gnang ba'i gdon p+sade dang po de yin/(deng sang kong po rgya mda' rgyan shar rlung chus kyi khongs ri ldebs su yod )gtsug lag thog par bzhengs skabs 'du khang dang sbug gi byams khang bsdoms pa'i ka ba bco brgyad kyi sa khyon dang/byams khang nang gi byams pa'i sku rgyu ni ar ka p+lata bu'i sa rgyu shin tu mkhregs po las grub pa/sku gzugs kyi mtho tshad khru bzhi bcu ste 'dom bcu (spyi khre nyi shu )sku gzugs hril por gser btul mar byugs pa bzang po'i bzhugs stangs can/g.yas g.yon gnyis su 'phags pa lha sku phreng dang po'i sku dmar gdung bzhugs pa'i gser gdung bkra shis 'od 'bar dang/lcags ra sku phreng dang po sangs rgyas dpal 'byor gyi sku dmar gdung bzhugs pa'i gdung rten bcas yod/dgon 'dir thun mong ma yin pa'i gsung rgyun 'phags pa lha khyab bdag bde chen rdo rje'i gsung rtsom bde mchog ngam rdzong snyan brgyud bdag mdun bun sgrub dbang chog bcas yod pa phud de byings sngags chog smad rgyud grwa tsang dang 'dra/grwa grangs brgya dang nyi shu yas mas/grwa rgyun 'gro khungs 'bras spungs blo gsal gling dang/ser smad grwa tshang/dwags po grwa tshang bcas su 'gro srol yod}
bkra shis rtags brgyad|{bkra shis rtags brgyad ni tshangs pa la sogs pas sangs rgyas la phul ba dang sangs rgyas rang gi sku la dbu gdugs ltar du yod pa sogs bsod nams dang ye shes kyi rang rtsal las so so'i mtshan ma yod pa de dang de la/rang gzhan gyi bsod nams bsag pa'i slad du lhag pa gzugs brnyan gyi dmigs rten tsam du byas su 'bul na/gdugs dkar po gser gyi phu ba can dar sna tshogs kyi 'phur lding g.yo ba rin po che'i tog gis mdzad pa dbu la phul bas rang gzhan sems can thams cad nyon mongs pa'i tsha gdung las skyob par shog cig /gser nya g.yu yi gshog pa can mnyen zhing lcug pa spyan la phul bas shes rab kyi mig thob pa dang/'dab stong rnam par bkra ba dri bzang dang ldan pa'i me tog pad+ma ljags la phul bas pa d+ma la chu mi chags pa ltar 'khor ba la gnas yang 'khor ba'i skyon gyis mi gos shing/tshe rabs kun tu rdzun spangs pa'i ljags pad+ma lta bu thob pa dang/byang chub sems dpa' gzhan don du skye ba bzung ba'i bkra shis pa'i chos dung g.yas su 'khyil ba tshems la phul bas tshems phreng bzhi bcu mngon zhing ro bro ba'i mchog thob cing dung gi tshems bar nas dam pa'i chos kyi sgra dbyangs sgrogs pa dang/bum pa 'chi med bdud rtsis gang ba dpag bsam shing gi kha rgyan can mgul la phul bas bum pa bcud kyis gang ba ltar rang rgyud chos kyis gang nas gdul bya'i rgyud tshims par dang/rin po che'i dpa' be'u 'ja' 'od kyi rang bzhin can thugs la phul bas sangs rgyas kyi mkhyen pa thog mtha' med pa gting dpag dka' ba'i stobs rang rgyud la thob pa dang/lha rdzas las grub pa'i dar lhab lhub kyis g.yo ba rin thang dang bral ba bstan pa mi nub pa'i rgyal mtshan sku la phul bas phas kyi grol ba dang mi mthun pa'i phyogs las rgyal zhing sangs rgyas kyi sku de mi phal pa las sum 'gyur gyis 'phags pa thob pa dang/srid pa'i dra ba nyon mongs pa'i rang bzhin rtsad nas gcod pa'i 'khor lo zhabs la phul bas pha rol gyi rgol ba thams cad zil gyis mnon te theg gsum dam pa'i chos kyi 'khor lo yongs su bskor bas gdul bya'i rgyud 'dul ba dang/de ltar rtags brgyad phul bas rang gzhan thams cad bkra shis rgya mtsho'i dpal la spyod par shog}
bkra shis don 'grub|{(1899nas 1961lo yas mas su )bod rang skyong ljongs lha mo tshogs pa'i tshogs gtso gnang mkhan dang po zhig dang/lha mo'i dge rgan grags can zhig yin/khong chung ngu'i dus na sa skya'i lha mo tshogs pa'i nang 'tsho ba bskyal zhing/gcen po phun tshogs kyi sa nas lha mo sbyangs pas ring por ma thogs par khong dmangs khrod p+laha mo ba'i nang gi sa skya'i sprul pa'i ka gdung ltar gyi grags can 'khrab ston pa gtso bo zhig tu gyur/khong gi mtshan la bshas gog bkra shis zer zhing/bshas gog ni khyim ming ste bshad gtong mkhan khyim tshang gi don yin/khong na mi rnams kyis rus rgyud dman par rtsis pa'i khyim tshang zhig tu 'khrungs pas lci rdzob kyi phyag las kyang mang po gnang myong/khong ni rig rtsal gyi mkhyen rgya mchog tu yangs pas sgra snyan 'phred rgyab gnyis kyi gtor rtsal mkhas pa ma zad/sbyi bor chang phor stegs nas tshoms chen dang mi tshogs kyi khrod du gzhal dang zhabs bro yun ring brgyab rung chang thig gcig kyang sa la mi bsho ba'i khyad rtsal ldan yod/khong gi rtag tu sa skya'i khral 'ul rgyugs nas byang dang gro mo'i dbar khal g.yag ded nas dngos zog skyel 'dren byed kyi yod/rjes su gro mo brgyud rgya gar la bros byol du song nas gzhas dang sgra stan gtang ste slong mo'i 'tsho ba bskyal dgos byung/thengs shig khong phag rir slong mor yong ba'i skabs der skyor mo lung lha mo tshogs pa'i gzhas dpon gyis gong gi 'khrab rtsal shes rtogs byung ste dgung lo nyer gcig son skabs snyan grags shin tu che ba'i lha mo tshogs pa de'i nang bsdu len byas/de nas bzung lo ngo nyi shu lhag tsam ring khong gi 'bad pa lhod med byas par brten skyor mo lung lha mo'i phyogs tshang ma'i 'khrab rtsal mi 'dra ba rnams khong du chud nas 'khrab rgya che ru phyin te pho mo rgan gzhon dang/rgyal blon/mkha' 'gro ma/bdud mo la sogs pa tshang ma 'khrab pa gnang/khong dgung lo zhe gcig la son skabs bod kyi rgyal tshab dang/bka' shag srid gzhung gi spyan lam du gyur nas ming bton thog dge rgan du bskos/ches mchog tu gyur pa zhig ni khong gis zam mi chad par brtson shugs chen pos gsar gtod gnang zhing/lan brgyar pham yang yid thang mi chad pa'i snying stobs dang/lha mo'i rgyun srol nang don dang rnam par zas mi 'chad par bsgyur bcos dang tshod lta phran bu byed pa'i khrod tshod 'dzin dang 'gog rkyen mang po 'phrad pa da nga/tha na rdung rdeg 'dra min phog kyang dpal mi zhum par brtson shugs cher skyed kyis rig pa bsgrims nas snying stobs chen pos gsar gtod kyi lam bu 'tshol zhib dang bsgyur bcos gnang yod/khong lha mo tshogs pa'i dge rgan gnang rjes rang gi lo mang 'tshol zhib byed pa'i bsam phyogs dang dmigs yul ltar blo rgya chen pos bod kyi lha mo'i sgyu rtsal thad phyogs yongs nas gsar gtod 'phel rgyas thog dmangs gzhan gyi rnam pa'i gzhan gdangs gzhan ma rnam thar gsar rtsom mdzad pa'i khar/lha mo rme ru spun bzang nang gi ngar nyams bsdus pa'i dge mtshan rnams bsdu len gyis skyo glu'i gzhan gdangs bsgyur bcos dang 'phel rgyas btang yod/(snang sa 'od 'bum )nang khong gis pha yul gyi yid skyo sems sdug gi sa skya'i dmangs gzhan snon 'ug dang/(pad ma 'od 'bar )nang sa skya dgon pa'i khyad ldan 'khrab ston byed pa'i (g+hing )kha snon gnang yod/da dung phyi rol gyi sgyu rtsal nang gi sngon thon sgyu rtsal dpyad gzhir 'dzin pa dang bsdu len byed mkhas shing/lha mo tshogs pa rgya gar dang/'grub yul/'bras ljongs sogs rgyal khang dang sa gnas khag la thengs mang 'khrab ston byed par bskyod pa'i go skabs spyad nas/rgya gar gyi khre khre dang khra sogs slob sbyong gnang zhing/der sdod bon rigs yul mi'i khrod kyi seng ge 'khrab ston ru khag sa nas rgya rigs nas chad pa'i dmangs khrod sgyu rtsal sbyang thub yod/ching rgyal rabs kyi bod sdod am ban sdod shag dang rjes kyi go ming tang bod sog u yon lhan khang gi bod sdod don gcod khru'u/de bzhin glog 'don khang/tang khar sogs las khungs nas rtag tu rgya dang/man/sog hud bcas mi rigs las don mi snas rang spel rol rtsed kyi 'khrab ston byed pa'i khrang zhi dang/gtam brjod glu gar chung ba/de bzhin dmangs khrod sgyu rtsal gyi 'khrab tshan mang dag cig slob sbyong gnang ba ma zad/rme ru spun bzang nang sbyong 'khrab byed pa'i rgya rigs kyi 'khrab ston sgyu rtsal 'brug dang/khyung/rma bya/seng ge /mi rgan/tshe ring sogs kyi 'khrab bya'i 'khrab ston tshang ma slob sbyong gnang yod/thog ma'i dus rim nang khong gis 'khrul ston pa sgrig 'dzugs kyis mi rigs khang gi glu gar dang dmangs khrod sgyu rtsal ched mngags 'khrab ston byas pa'i rjes su sgyu rtsal de rigs la bsgyur bcos byas te bod srol can dang gtam brjod can la 'gyur ched bar 'jug mnyam bsres thog lha mo'i 'khrab ston sgyu rtsal 'khrab thabs sam mtshon tshul nus pa phun sum je tshogs su gyur te dge rgan mig dmar rgyal mtshan gyi rjes su skabs shig nyams rgud du song ba'i skyor mo lung lha mtsho tshogs pa der slar yang dar 'phel byung yod/skyor mo lung gi phul byung lha mo 'od 'bar )gsum p+laha mo'i 'khrab tshan kun gyi dga' bsu thob pa dang/snyan grags gang sar khyab pa/snying bcud ngo mtshar ldan pa bcas byung yod/bkra shis don grub kyis 'bad pa lhur len gnang ba brgyud mthar mjug skyor mo lung lha mo tshogs pa de mgyogs myur bag phebs 'khrug po dang/grung sha dod la gson nyams ldan pa/sna mang phun sum tshogs pa/go don zab cing mchog tu gyur pa'i 'khrab ston gyi khyad chos ldan pa zhig byung bar brten rim bzhin lha mo'i sgyu rtsal gyi phyogs khag che ba zhig tu gong 'phel phyin yod/1959lo'i zing 'khrug zhod 'jags rjes su lha sa grong khyer dmag don do dam u yon lhan khang gi rgyab skyor 'og /skyor mo lung gi sgyu rtsal pa rnams skong 'gug gis gsar brje'i bod ljongs lha mo tshogs pa 'dzugs rgyu'i gra sgrig gnang ba dang sbrags khong gis gtso bo byed pa'i 'bring rigs deng rabs lha mo (bcings 'grol dmag gi bka' drin )zhes pa zhig rtsom sgrig 'khrab ston gnang ba dang/rgyun srol gyi rnam pa sgyur bcos dang bed spyod thog sgyu rtsal gsar pa'i 'khrab stangs bsdu len gyis dus rabs gsar pa'i nang don mtshon pa byas stabs rgya che'i gzigs mo ba rnams kyi gdeng 'jog dang bsngags brjod thob pa ma zad/deng rabs kyi khyad chos ldan pa'i lha mo gsar gtod bya rgyur blo sgo phye bar lam ston gnang/spyi lo 1960lo'i lo mjug tu gong rgyal yongs rig rtsal 'thus tshogs thengs gsum par zhugs nas krung dbyang 'go khrid kyi mjal 'a phran thob pa dang/tshogs 'du'i thog krung go'i rtsom rig sgyu rtsal mnyam ldan gyi rgyun las u yon dang/krung go'i zlo gar lhan tshogs kyi lan 'dzin la 'dems thon byung/spyi lo'i 1961lo'i zla ba 4par snyung gzhis rkyen pas dgung lo 61la lha sar dgongs pa rdzogs}
bkra shis rdo kha ma|{rje tsong kha pa'i sku brnyan zhig gi ming ste/sngar 'jam mgon bla ma tsong kha pa chen po dgung lo nga brgyad bzhes pa rab byung bdun pa'i shing rta (1414)lor phag gru sde srid dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan gyis gdan drangs pa ltar 'on bkra shis rdo khar phebs te mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsungs/dbu skra bubs re gzungs su bzhugs pa'i 'dra sku brgyad bzhengs pa la rje nyid kyis rab gnas mdzad pas/sku 'dra bzhengs pa'i gnas kyi ming sku brnyan la thogs pa zhig yin/'dra sku 'di dag ni paN chen rin po che sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan yis mdzad pa'i (bkra shis lhun po'i phyi'i mchod rten gyi dkar chag )dang (rong po skal ldan rgya mtsho'i rnam thar )bcas las paN chen byams pa gling pa bsod nams rnam rgyal gyi phyag bzo yin par gsungs/'dra sku de yi gras rtse po tA la dang/bkra shis lhun po/'bras spungs/bkra shis 'khyil/sku 'bum/gser khog bya khyung bcas su yod}
bkra shis lde mgon|{de sngon dus rabs dgu pa'i smad du bod sa gnas su 'bangs gyen log byung rjes/mnga' bdag dpa' 'khor btsan gyi btsun mo che ba'i sras skyid lde nyi ma mgon stod mnga' ris su byon nas btsun mo chog ro bza' la sras mgon gsum (1 dpal gyi rig pa mgon/=2 bkra shis lde mgon/3 lde gtsug mgon )byung ba'i 'bring po bkra shis mgon la zer/sras gsum la yab kyis mnga' ris so sor bgos nas gnang skabs bkra shis mgon la spu rangs kyi yul gru gnang ste srid dbang bzung ba yin}
bkra shis rnam rgyal|{mnga' ris la dwags kyi rgyal po bkra shis rgyal mtshan ni yab rgyal po b+ha gan la sras gnyis byung ba'i che ba lha dbang rnam rgyal dang/chung ba bkra shis rnam rgyal yin/chung ba g.yo sgyu che zhing srid dbang thob rgyu'i don du rang gi gcen po lha dbang rnam rgyal gyi mig bton nas lings sked sa char btsun mo dang mnyam du btson la bcug ste/rang nyid kyis srid bzung/(rgya gar rdi li la dwags zhib 'jug khang gi bkra shis rab rgyas kyis bsgrigs pa'i (la dwags sngon rabs/) lcags dpar ma shog grangs 150yig phreng dang po'i nang rgyal po 'dis spyi lo 1500nas 1530bar srid dbang bzung bar bshad pa ltar na/rab byung brgyad pa'i lcags spel nas rab byung dgu pa'i lcags stag bar yin dgos )rgyal po 'dis srid dbang bzung ring la dwags gle'i mkhar brtsigs nas ming la rnam rgyal rtse mo zhes btags shing/gsham tu chu 'bi'i grong tsho yang btab/mnga' ris skor gsung la dmag drangs/sems can rta g.yag ra lug mang po phrogs te la dwags la phyir log byas/'on kyang rang nyid la srid dbang brgyud 'dzin byed pa'i bu med stabs gdung rgyud kyi ched du rang gi gcen po long ba la btsun mo zhig bzhag ste/de la sras gsum byung/(1 tshe dbang rnam rgyal/2 rnam rgyal mgon po/3 'jam dbyangs rnam rgyal/) tshe smad la sngar byas kyi bya ba ngan pa rnams dran nas 'gyod pa skyes te bka' 'gyur cha tshang bzhengs shing/dgon sde mang por bsnyen bkur byas pa sogs zhib par (bod kyi lo rgyus deb ther khag lnga )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 189nas 190bar gsal}
bkra shis sna nag ma|{'di dbu ma'i gzhung du bshad pa ltar bkra shis zer ba'i mi zhig dang/sna nag ma zer ba'i spun gnyis lhan gcig tu gnas pa las de gnyis kha ma bral bar yod pa'i dpe zhig gsungs pa ltar bkra shis pa dang bkra mi shis pa gnyis gcig gi mjug tu gcig spel mar yong ba'i don yin}
bkra shis pad skor|{gus zhabs zhu ba'i lag 'khyer gyi 'khrab stangs shig }
bkra shis byams snyoms kyi gtsug lag khang|{khra 'brug gtsug lag khang gi ming ste/bod rang skyong ljongs lho kha sa khul sne gdong rdzong khongs yar lung gtsang po'i lho ngos rtsed thang gong po ri'i lho nub mtshams su gnas yod/de sngon spyi lo'i dus rabs bdun pa'i dkyil rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos lha sa gtsug lag khang ma bzhengs gong du rgya bza' wun khren kong jos spor thang brgyad cu'i skor gyi rtsis byas pa'i rtsis 'bras nas babs pa ltar lha sa'i phyogs bzhi dang/mtshams bzhi bcas la mtha' 'dul dang/yang 'dul/ru gnon bcas kyi gtsug lag khang bcu btab pa'i nang tshan g.yo ru khra 'brug bkra shis byams snyoms kyi lha khang 'di ni bod du sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi lha khang bzhengs pa'i snga shos yin cing/lo rgyus thog bshad srol la/thog mar yar lung gi phyogs der mtsho zhig yod pa der klu gdug pa can zhig gnas pa de 'dul ba'i ched du rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i bon po'i sngags pa cog la tsug sgra tsug snang dang/tshe mi snang grags gnyis la bka' phab pa ltar sngags pa de gnyis kyis rtsed thang gong po ri'i brag phugalho nub mtshams su kha gtad pa deng sang sgrub khang brag phug dang/khyung gi brag phug zer ba de'i nang du nam mkha' lding bsgrubs nas/klu 'dul ba'i nyin mi ha cang mang po tshogs pa'i dbus su klu 'dul ba'i chog byas pa dang/skabs der gnam sa 'gul ba'i sgra chen po zhig bsgrags pa dang chab cig bya khra 'dra ba la skad 'brug ltar sgrogs pa zhig nag mkha' nas 'ongs pa des/mtsho'i nang gi klu sbrul mgo lnga pa'i mgo bo lnga ka dus gcig tu bcad nas btul/de'i shul du gtsug lag khang bzhengs te/klu 'dul mkhan sngags pa gnyis la dran gso zhu chen gtsug lag khang gi ming la khra 'brug ces btags pa yin zer srol yod/lha khang 'di'i lo rgyus zhib pa (rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )dang (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )le tshan (ja)pa'i nang gsal zhing/gzhan yang lha khang 'di'i dkar chag rgyas pa zhig yod tshul kho thos byung yang da phan kho bos mjal ma byung bas de rigs yod med rtsad gcod bya dgos so/}
bkra shis rtse pa|{gtsang khul shangs bkra shis rtse'i dpon rigs/rjes su jun gar gyi rgyugs khyi byas stabs bka' blon du bskos pa dang/jun gar bod nas mtha' bskrod btang zin mtshams man ching srid gzhung nas sde srid stag rtse ba dang mnyam du ske bcad pa de red}
bkra shis rdzas brgyad|{me long la sogs pa bkra shis par byed pa'i rdzas brgyad /sngon sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das la gzugs kyi lha mo 'od 'chang mas me long phul ba sangs rgyas kyis bkra shis pa'i rdzas su byin gyis brlabs pa ltar/rang gis kyang dngul dkar gyi me long dwangs shing gsal ba phul bas rang gzhan thams cad kyis dam pa'i chos kyi don rtogs par shog cig /de bzhin du 'gres sbyar te/grong pa'i bum po legs skyes mas 'o ma phul ba ltar rang gis kyang 'o ma phul bas ting nge 'dzin gyi zas thob pa da nga/glang chen sa srung gi bus gi wang phul ba ltar gyi gi wang phul bas nyon mongs pa'i nad sel ba dang/khye'u rtswa 'tshong gis rtswa dUrba phul ba ltar rtswa dUrba phul bas skye 'chi rgas rgud med pa'i sku thob pa dang/shing gi lha mos shing tog bi wa phul ba ltar shing tog phul bas rten 'brel bcu gnyis lugs ldog tu dag nas myang 'das thob pa dang/lha'i dbang po brgya byin gyis dung g.yas su 'khyil ba phul ba ltar dung phul bas chos kyi sgra dbyangs sgrogs nus pa dang/bram ze skar rgyal gyis li khri phul ba ltar li khri phul bas khams gsum dbang du bsdu ba dang/phyag na rdo rjes yungs dkar phul ba ltar yungs dkar phul bas mthu stobs nus pa phun sum tshogs par shog/me long phul na gzugs bzang po dang blo gsal bar 'gyur ba sogs rgyu dang 'tshams pa'i 'bras bu 'byung ba yin no/_}
bkra shis rab brtan|{kong po khul gyi dgon chen bzhi'i (1 de mo/2 chab nag /3 bkra shis rab brtan/4 'brug la bkra shis bde chen )nang gses shig ste/sngar tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gnyis pa dge 'dun rgya mtsho (rab byung brgyad pa'i me sprel 1476lo nas rab byung dgu pa'i chu stag 1542lo'i bar )dpal bzang pos zhal slob rin chen rnam rgyal gyis phyag btab/thog mar mtshan nyid kyi bshad grwa yin cing/kong po kar srid kyi bskyangs langs dmag zing skabs me la bsregs par brten/rjes su nyams gso yas rjes mi ring bar sngags pa grwa tshang du bsgyur te sngags chog rgyud smad grwa tshang gi lugs dang/grwa grangs gnyis brgya bdun cu tsam yod cing/grwa rgyun se 'bras dge gsum gyi kong pa khang tshan du rang mos kyis zhugs chog}
bkra shis gso sbyong|{nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i dgon sde khag la gzhi gsum (1 gso sbyong/2 dbyar gnas/3 dgag dbye bcas )gyi lag len ma nyams par bya dgos pa'i nang tshan gso sbyong la/dus 'brel gyi gso sbyong dang/bkra shis kyi gso sbyong/gnod bzlog gi gso sbyong/dbyen bzlums kyi gso sbyong bcas mi 'dra ba bzhi yod pa'i nang gses gnyis pa ste/dge 'dun gyi gtsug lag khang gsar pa bzhengs skabs thog mar sa gzhi'i bdag po mi la gnang ba zhu ba dang de nas gsang sngags kyi gzhung nas bshad pa'i sa brtag pa/bslang ba/sbyang ba bcas kyi cho ga grub mtshams/dge 'dun rnams 'tshogs nas gnas gzhi gsar pa der bkra shis gso sbyong tshogs dgos pa'i phyag srol yod}
bkra shis lhun po|{dbus gtsang du yod pa'i dge lugs gdan sa chen po bzhi'i gras yin/gzhis ka rtse'i grong khyer dang 'dabs 'brel lta bur yod/rab byung brgyad pa'i me yos (1447)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng dang po dge 'dun grub kyis thog mar phyag btab/dgon ming cha tshang la bkra shis lhun po dpal gyi sde chen phyogs las rgyal par rgyal ba'i gling zhes zer/dgon gnas da'i thog mar 'debs pa gnang skabs kyi sbyin bdag ni dar rgyas pa bsod nams dpal bzang dang/skabs de'i gzhi ka rtse'i rdzong dpon 'phyongs rgyas pa hor dpal 'byor bzang po gnyis kyis sa te dgon gnas gtsug lag khang rten gsum dang bcas pa gsar bzhengs gnang zhing/phyug gzhung dpon dar rgyas pa bsod nams dpal bzang gis mchod gis khag gcig 'tsho ba'i mthun rkyen du phul/gtsug lag khang lte ba'i sbug gi gtsang khang ka ba drug dang 'du khang ka ba bzhi bcu zhe brgyad/gzims khang rgyal mtshan mthon po ka ba nyi shu rtsa bzhi'i rgya khyon bcas yod pa/grwa shag spyil bu dang bcas pa grub rjes/rten gtso thub dbang bdud 'dul ma'i sku brnyan sogs sku gsung thugs rten grangs las 'das pa gsar bzhengs thog /rgyun du gzhung chen po lnga'i 'chad nyan slob khrid gtsor 'don mdzad par brten dngos slob mkhas pa'i dbang po bcu phrag gsum lhag tsam dang grwa tshogs kyang thog mar zhal grangs brgya dang bcu skor las med kyang/sku tshe'i smad du grwa grangs chig stong drug brgya tsam du 'phel zhing/zhal slob mkhas pa'i dbang po rnams kyis zur chos slob dpon mdzad pa las thog mar grwa tsang gsum (1 chos bsam gling/2 dkyil khang/3 shar rtse )byung ba dang/rjes su kun gzigs paN chen rin po che sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan dpal bzang pos rje dge 'dun grub kyi dgongs bzhed dang mthun par rgyud pa grwa tshang gsar 'dzugs mdzad pa bcas bsdoms pa'i grwa tshang bzhi yod/gcig /thos bsam gling grwa tshang/rje dge 'dun grub kyi dngos slob mkhas dbang dri med bshes gnyen gyis 'chad nyan dang yig cha mdzad pa las 'phel rgyas byung zhing/rje dge 'dun grub zhal bzhugs dus mi tshan bcu yod thog /paN chen rin po che sku phreng bzhi pa'i dus gsar 'phar mi tshan bcu drug /paN chen rin po che sku phreng lnga pa'i skabs gsar 'phar mi tshan gcig bcas mi tshan nyi shu rtsa bdun yod pa ni/1 legs gling/2 bde 'byor/3 lhun rtse/4 nor bu dga' ldan/5 gcen lung/6 'brong rtse/7 rta nag /8 spang yul/9 gnas chos/10 gnas pa/(de rnams rje dge 'dun grub pa'i dus su byung )11 legs grub/12 bzhad pa/13 gser gling/14 rdzong kha/15 ba so/16 tre hor/17 g.yang pa/18 har gdong/19 co ne/20 gser khang/21 rgya khang tshan/22 tshul khang/23 grang mo che/24 lcags pa/25 rong pa/26 gting skyes/(de dag paN chen rin po che sku phreng bzhi pa'i dus su byung/) 27 srad pa mi tshan ('di paN chen rin po che sku phreng lnga pa'i dus su byung ba )bcas yin/gnyis/dkyil khang grwa tshang/rje dge 'dun grub kyi dngos slob mkhas dbang dpal ldan chos skyong gis 'chad nyan mdzad pa las 'phel rgyas byung zhing/grwa tsang 'dir rje dge 'dun grub pa'i skabs su mi tshan bcu yod pa ni/1 dpe thub/2 gu ge /3 stag mo/4 lhun grub rtse/5 'dar pa/6 mdangs can/7 la kha/8 rig mkhar/9 rong pa/10 gnas rnying bcas dang/paN chen sku phreng bzhi pa'i skabs gsar 'phar mi tshan drug ste/11 bde ba can pa/12 chos sbug /13 khal kha/14 o rgyan rdzong pa/15 glo sbug /16 rdo gdan bcas yod/gsum/shar rtse grwa tshang/rje dge 'dun grub kyi dngos slob mkhas dbang dri med bshes gnyen gyis zur chos 'chad nyan mdzad pa las 'phel rgyas byung zhing/grwa tshang 'dir rje dge 'dun grub zhal bzhugs skabs mi tshan drug yod pa ni/1 lha khang/2 gnas gsar/3 khron kha sbug pa/4 ba she/5 shar byang/6 las stod bcas dang/paN chen rin po che sku phreng bzhi pa'i skabs gsar phar mi tshan bcu ste/1 bde yangs/2 zhi gnas/3 thon pa/4 nor steng/5 sa lung/6 lho pa/7 yol dkar/8 spor thog /9 bsam blo/10 rgyal chen rtse bcas yod/bzhi/rgyud pa grwa tshang/paN chen rin po che sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyis rje dge 'dun grub gyi dgongs bzhed dang mthun par dgung lo bzhi bcu zhe bdun pa rab byung bcu pa'i me 'brug (1616)lor rgyud pa grwa tshang thog mar 'dzugs gnang mdz