shogs dang/zhwa nag gi 'chams gos phyag mtshan dang bcas pa cha tshang/khro bo'i 'bag brgyad/gong ma kha shi'i sras bzhi pas phul ba'i 'chams gos mngags btags ma cha tshang nyi shu rtsa brgyad bcas bkra shis lhun po'i sngags khang dang dben dgon gnyis la sbyor 'jogs gnang tshul gsung 'dug pas/skabs de dus gar 'chams kyi srol tshugs zin pa ra 'phrod byung/de min gdan sa 'di'i mkhan rabs rim byon dang/sku gsung thugs rten/'chad nyan gyi yig cha/sgrig srol/mchod gzhis ji yod sogs kyi lo rgyud rgyas pa ni/phyi rgyal du bzhugs pa'i mkhas dbang rdzong rtse byams pa thub bstan mchog gis rtsom sgrig mdzad pa'i (bkra shis lhun po dpal gyi sde chen phyogs las rnam par rgyal ba'i gling gi chos 'byung ngo mtshar dad pa'i sgo 'byed )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 730yod pa de dang/de las bsdus pa phur lcog ngag dbang byams pas mdzad pa'i (grwa sa chen po bzhi dang rgyud pa stod smad kyi dkar chag )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 164yod pa de dang bkras lhun dgos kyi lo rgyus rtsom sgrig tshogs chung gis bsgrigs pa'i (bkra shis lhun po dpal gyi sde chen phyogs las rnam par rgyal ba'i gling gi sngon byung gsal ba'i nyi ma )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 168yod pa bcas la gzigs}
bkrab sder|{de snga'i bod sa gnas kyi khrims khang nang kha mchu zhu gtugs byed skabs do bdag phan tshun su la bden pa yod med thad skabs re zhu gtugs byed mkhan ham pa che chung dang/kha bshad mkhas min gyi dbang gis dngos 'brel bden yod mkhan la pham nyes byung ba'i gnas tshul yong gi yod stabs de 'dra'i skabs su khrims khang nas do bdag so sor snum bskol ba'i lcags slang gi nang nas rde'i dkar lag pas 'dems len byed du 'jug gi yod cing/'dems blangs zin pa'i rde'i de blugs sa'i sder ma la bkrab sder zer ba ste bkrab ni 'dems sgrug byed pa'i don yin}
