rkang 'gro lag 'don|{de sngon bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs gtan 'bebs byas pa'i khral gyi lam lugs shig ste/rkang 'gro zhes pa ni rta khal mi gsum dang/dmag gron/dpon rigs dang dmag mi sogs gzhung don 'grul bzhud byed skabs tsha phogs dang zhag sa gang 'khel gyi sdod gnas sgrig cha dang/rta g.yog thab g.yog bcas gtong dgos pa der zer/lag 'don ni dngul dang dngos po'i thog nas 'jal dgos pa'i khral rigs la zer zhing/spyir btang khral 'jog pa'i mi ser dud tshang gnyis la rkang re dang/rkang gnyis la 'don re brtsis/de tsho tshang mar sa zhing che chung dang/khral che chung mang nyung 'dra min sna tshogs yod pa dper na lha sa dang thag nye zhing gzhung lam 'khel ba'i sa cha khral mang shog gras yis pa'i chu shul lta bur mtshon na mi ser rkang re la khral rten sa zhing zer ba son 'gro khal drug cu nas brgyad cu bar 'gro ba yod/de la 'khri ba'i rkang 'gro'i khral rigs ni me ser rkang re nas lo re rta 'ul lnga bcu p+sakor dang khal ma ba rgya dang lnga bcu skor/gzan pa 'degs khel brgyad cu skor/shing 'degs khal bdun cu skor/sgo nga brgya skor/snum cha dkar nyi shu skor/bod dngul srang bdun brgya lnga cu skor/gzhung 'brul khal nyi shu (rgya ma 506)skor/gras chag sran ma khal bcu gcig (rgya ma 308)bcas sgrub dgos/lag 'don gyi khral la/mi ser rkang re nas rgya shing brngod gsum zer ba rgya gsos bod dngul srang med zho drug skar phyed brgyad/shing dngul srang do zho gsum/smon brngod gro zhib khal bcu gcig dang bre bcu bzhi phul do/_/zho las khungs su gzhung rgyugs mi ser rkang drug cu lhag yod pa nas zhol pa las khungs su ljags gro zer ba gro spus gtsang zhol 'bo'i khal chig stong 'bul dgos pa der 'bo khyad khal drug cu skor 'gro bas khyon bsdoms gro khal chig stong nyis brgya skor 'gro ba dang/sgong khral gzhung rgyugs mi ser rkang re nas sgo nga rdog nyi shu/lcags rdo nag po do po snod phad rang 'grigs re/bla phyag lus khungs su bzhes chag zer ba lha sa smon lam dang tshogs mchod gnyis kyi thug pa'i rgyur 'bru bun btang ba rnams kyi skyed 'bab phon chen po dang/dmag phogs bu