skad gnyis smra ba|{lo tsA ba'i ming gi rnam grangs ste/lo tsA ba zhes pa'i rgya gar skad kyi go don bod skad du bsgyur na 'jig rten gyi mig ces zer/de yang mi rigs khag gi skad gnyis smra ba'i lo tsA ba ni rang gi mi rigs kyi skad yig thog nas mi rigs gzhan dang rgyal khab gzhan dag gi rig gnas shes yon rnams so so'i mi rigs rnams la tshig don cha tshang bar brda sprod mdzad de shes yon phun sum tshogs pa'i blo gros kyi mig sbyin par mdzad pa po yin pa'i cha nas 'jig rten gyi mig dang/lo tsA ba zhes che 'bod kyi bsngags brjod zhus pa'i mtshan yin/de sngon bod kyi lo tsA ba dang paN+Di ta'i thog ma ni thon mi bam b+ho Da yin cing/de nas dus rabs brgyad pa'i 'khor rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis srid dbang bzung ring bsam yas gtsug lag khang gsar bzhengs grub rjes gling bcu gnyis kyi nang tshan sgra bsgyur rgya gar gling du yig bsgyur khang 'dzugs gnang thog /shes rig gsal zhing smra brjod bde ba'i byis pa brgya dang brgyad bsdus nas lo tsA ba gso skyong gnang ste/de nas thon pa rnams la mkhyen yod kyi gnas tshad rim pa gsum du phye nas bsgyur zhus kyi las bgos mdzad yod pa ste/1 zhus chen gyi lo tsA ba/2 bar zhus kyi lo tsA ba/3 mtshan bu'i lo tsA ba bcas yin/dang po/zhus chen gyi tsA ba ni/lo tsA ba gzhan dag gis yig bsgyur byas zin pa'i ma yig la tshig dang don gnyis ka'i thad nas zhud dag tha ma de gnang nas 'grems spel byed chog pa'i gtam 'bebs mdzad mkhan yin/btsan po khri srong lde btsan skabs lo tsA brgya lhag tsam gso skyong gnang ba'i nang nas zhus chen pher ba'i lo tsA ba bco lnga yod pa ste/1 lce dz+nya na si d+hi/2 brang ti dza ya rak+Shi ta/3 pa gor bai ro tsa Na/4 gnyags dz+nya na ku ma ra/5 'khon klu'i dbang po/6 rma rin chen mchog /7 kha che a nan+ta/8 ska ba dpal brtsegs/9 cog ro klu'i rgyal mtshan/10 zhang ye shes sde/11 dbas 'jam dpal go cha/12 rat+na in+d+ra shI la/13 sna nam rdo rje bdud 'joms/14 ngan lam rgyal ba mchog dbyangs/15 nyang ting 'dzin bzang po bcas yin/gnyis pa/bar gyi lo tsA ba ni/lo tsA ba gzhan gad gis thengs dang pos bap+saga