skad rigs mi gcig pa sum brgya drug cu|{sngar rgya gar du sangs rgyas chos lugs thog mar dar skabs 'dzam bu'i gling du skad rigs mi 'dra ba sum brgya drug yod yod ces rgya gar gyi skad nas bod skad du bsgyur ba'i (mngon pa mdzod kyi 'grel pa )rnams su bshad kyang de dag gi ngos 'dzin bshad pa mi snang zhing/skabs der yig rigs mi 'dra ba drug cu rtsa bzhi yod pa'i grangs 'dren bkod pa ltar ni yi ge re la skad rigs mi 'dra ba re re yod pa dang/de yang 'ga' zhig rgyal khab mi 'dra ba dang/'ga' zhig gi mi rigs mi 'dra ba sogs sna tshogs shig yod 'dug }
skad rigs mi mthun pa bzhis lung 'don pa|{sngon dus rgya gar du dge slong rnams gso sbyong tshogs skabs dge slong bgres pa zhig gis (so thar gyi mdo )gsung dgos pa la/dge slong bgres pa'i gras gnas brtan sgra gcan 'dzin gyis saMskri ta'i skad du gsungs pa dang/gnas brtan 'od srung gis pra kri ta ste yul mi rang bzhin pa'i skad du gsungs pa dang/gnas brtan kat+ya ya nas pi sha tsi'i skad du gsungs pa/gnas brtan nye bar 'khor gyis zur chag gi skad du gsungs pa bcas las mdo nyan mkhan rnams kyis go ba len tshul mi 'dra bar byung ba'i dbang gis/sgra gcan 'dzin gyi rjes 'brangs pa rnams las gzhi thams cad yod par smra ba'i sde ba byung/'od srung gi rjes 'brangs pa rnams las phal chen sde pa byung/kat+ya ya na'i rjes 'brangs pa rnams las gnas brtan pa'i sde pa byung/nye bar 'khor gyi rjes 'brangs pa rnams las mang pos bkur pa'i sde pa byung bar 'dul ba'i gzhung mang che ba rnams las gcig mthun du gsungs yod/'on kyang (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma'i stong cha shog grangs 63nas 67bar sde pa bzhir gyes tshul gsungs pa'i thad du/gnas brtan sgra gcan 'dzin ni rgyal rigs su 'khrungs pa'i rigs mtho ba dang mang pos brtsi bkur zhu ba'i gnas yin cing/(so thar gyi mdo )zur chag gi skad du gsungs pa/('di la dogs gnas che/) kat+ya ya na'i rjes 'brangs pa rnams dge 'dun mang po yod pa zhig yin pa dang/(so thar gyi mdo )pra kri ta ste yul mi rang bzhin pa'i skad du gsungs pa dang/nye bar 'khor gyi rjes 'brangs pa rnams shes bya'i gzhi thams cad rdzas su yod par smra bas thams cad yod par smra ba'i sde pa yin pa dang/(so thar gyi mdo )legs sbyar saMskri ta yi skad du gsungs pa yin tshul 'khod 'dug pas bzhed pa byings dang mi mthun}
skad gsar bcad|{de sngon btsan po gong ma rim byung gi dus su bod kyi tsA ba rnams kyis rgya gar skad nas bod skad du bsgyur zin pa'i brda rnying pa 'ga' zhig go bde ru btang ba dang ye shes 'ga' zhig zor yang du btang ba'i bka' bcad gsar pa mdzad pa'i don yin/de yang bod yig gi yig srol thog bkas bcad rim pa gsum byung tshul zhA lu lo chen chos skyong bzang po'i dngos slob skyobs ston lo tsA ba rin chen bkra shis kyis mdzad pa'i (dag yig li shi'i gur khang )las gsungs pa ltar na/thon mi sam b+ho Ta nas btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi bar thog mar bsgyur ba'i gsung rab rnams kyi 'gyur ni bkas bcad dang po'i lugs su bsgyur ba/dper na (phal chen )dang/('dul ba lung sde bzhi/) (mdo sde )khag gcig /(sher phyin gyi mdo )'ga' zhig bcas yin pa dang/de rnams su gsal ba'i brad rnying pa dang brda gsar pa gnyis bsdur nas gsal bshad mdzad pa lta bu yin/bkas bcad kyi gnyis pa ni (sgra sbyor bam gnyis )su gsal ba'i rnam gsar rnying gi bkas bcad mdzad pa de yin cing/yod yig gi lo r+Yus phal che ba'i nang bkas bcad gnyis pa 'di btsan po khri rab pa can gyi dus su mdzad pa yin tshul gcig gyur lta bur gsal ba de ni ma dag rgyun 'byams shig byung 'dug kyang/sa skya'i rje btsun grags pa rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bod kyi rgyal rabs )sde dpar ma'i shog grangs 199par khri srong lde btsan gyi sku rim la dam pa'i chos dar zhing rgyas par mdzad/khri lde srong btsan gyi ring la skad gsar bcad kyis gtan la phab ces gsal ba ma zad/(rgya bod yig tshang )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 199nas 200bar khri lde srong btsan gyi mdzad pa'i skabs su yang gong dang mtshungs par gsal ba de (sgra sbyor bam gnyis )kyi brjod don dang yongs su mthun zhing/khri lde srong btsad dang ri ral pa can gnyis yab sras kyi 'brel pa yin par (dbon zhang mthun 'brel rdo ring )gi shar ngos bod yig ltar phreng sum cu so bzhi par/btsan po yab 'phrul khri lde srong btsan gyi zhal snga nas zhes gsal bar 'khod yod pas/(sgra sbyor bal gnyis )gyi 'gor gsal ba'i btsan po khri lde srong btsan ni khri rab pa can gyi yab yin pa dang/khong gi dus su bkas bcad gnyis pa mdzad pa yin par gsal bshad byung yod/bkas bshad 'di mdzad pa'i lo dus ni btsan po khri lde srong btsan gyis sa stag (798)lo nas me bya (817)lo'i bar du sring dbang bzung ba'i bzhed pa ltar byas na de'i ring la rta lo lnga rjes gnyis byung ba'i rje ma shing rta (814)lor btsan po khri lde srong btsan pho brang 'on cang rdo na bzhugs pa'i dus skabs der rgya gar gyi mkhan po dzi na mi tra sogs paN+Di ta lnga dang/bod kyi rat+na rak+Shi ta dang/d+harma tA shi la/lo 'a ba zhang ye shes sde dang/brang ti dza ya rak+Shi ta/dbang many+dzu shri warma/ratan+d+re shI la la sogs pa gdan 'dzoms pa rnams la btsan pos bka' phab pa ltar yig bsgyur gyi rtsa don chen po gsum dang/yig sgyur gyi thabs gtso bo bzhi/yig sgyur skabs do snang bya dgos pa brgyad bcas kyi rtsa 'dzin 'don pa gnang thog /btsan po dang/blon chen bran ka dpal gyi yon tan/ban+de chen po nyang ting 'dzin bzang po sogs blon po gtso che ba thams cad 'tshogs pas sar snyan zhu phul ba ltar bkas bad mdzad pa yin cing/'di ni bod kyi lo rgyus thog yig sgyur gyi nyams myong phun sum tshogs pa rnams phyogs bsdoms byas te gtan la phab pa'i las don rlabs chen zhig yin cing/zhib par (sde dge bstan 'gyur )sna tshogs sde tshan gyi pod (co)par bzhugs pa'i )sgra sbyor bam gnyis )dang/gsham gsal yig sgyur skor gyi ming dang tshig gi 'grel pa khag la gzigs}
