skar chung rdo rje dbyings lha khang|{'di la (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )dang (deb ther dpyid kyi rgyal mo'i glu dbyangs )gnyis su dkar chung rdo rje dbyings kyi lha khang zhes 'khod pa ni yi ge ma dag pa ste/de gnyis kar lha khang 'di'i go don 'grel bshad kyi skabs su lha khang 'di'i che tshad skar ma chung ba zhig gi tshad tsam yod par gsal ba ma zad/(skar chung lha khang gi rdo ring )ngo ma'i yig reng bcu drug par lde srong btsan gyi ring la yang/skar chung gtsug lag khang zhes dang/(lde'u jo sras kyi chos 'byung )dang (rgya bod yig tshang )sogs lo rgyun yig rnying mang che bar skar chung zhes gsal ba ltar yin/lha khang 'di btsan po khri lde srong btsan nas mtshan gzhan mu tig btsan po dang/sad na legs zhes 'bod pa des bzhengs pa'i lha khang zhig ste/lha sa'i skyid chu'i lho nub phyogs ra ma sgang gi nye 'dabs sangs rgyas dgon pa yod sa de yin tshul mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel dang lhan dus sa gnas der phebs myong ba'i sku zhabs hor khang bsod nams dpal 'bar mchog gis gsungs 'dug /lha khang 'di dus skabs gang du bzhengs pa'i lo khams gsar bar 'khod pa zhig da phan ma mthong zhing/skar chung lha khang gi bka' gtsigs yi ge rgyas pa (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma'i stod cha shog grangs 409nas 413bar gsal ba de'i mjug tu mna' gtsigs la zhugs pa'i blon po'i ming tho'i nang bad de bka' chen po ra gtogs pa bad de bran ka yon tan/ban de myang ting 'dzin/chab srid kyi blon po bka' chen po la gtogs pa blon chen po 'bro khri gzu rab shags/zhang mchims rgyal btsan gzher legs gzigs/dbas mang rje lha lod bcas yi ming 'god par brtags na btsan po khri lde srong btsan gyi sku tshe'i smad tsam la yin par tshod dpag byas pa yin/lha khang 'dir rten gyi gtso bo rdor dbyings kyi lha tshogs cha tshang bar bzhugs par ba rten skar chung rdo rje dbyings kyi zhes mtshan thogs pa yin 'dug kyang/rjes su 'brug pa bka' brgyud pa'i skyes chen dam pa zhig gis nyams gso dang rten bzhengs mdzad par snang ste srung ma'i lha sku'i gras su 'brug pa bka' brgyud kyi srung ma jag pa me len gyi sku yod pa las shes rtogs thub pa yin/lha khang 'di'i nye 'gram du bka' gtsigs kyi rdo ring gnyis yod par snang zhing de'i skor gsham gsal skar chung rdo ring zhes par gzigs}
skar chung rdo ring|{skar chung rdo ring ni lha sa skyid chu'i lho ngos kyi stod lung bde chen rdzong sne'u chus khongs ra ma sgang du sangs rgyas dgon zhes pa'i btsun ma'i dgon pa zhig yod pa de'i 'gram bye ma'i khrod du btsugs yod cing dus phyis chag skyon shor nas dum bu gnyis su song ba da lta nor bu gling khar nyar tshags byas yod/rdo nga de ni bod kyi btsan po khri lde srong btsan gyis chab srid mdzad ring gi spyi lo 798nas 815bar gyi lo zhig la btsugs par gsal bas da bar lo chig stong brgya lhag gi lo rgyus yun ring ldan yod/bod du lha tho tho ri snyan shal gyi dus su dam pa'i chos kyi dbu brnyes par grags pa dang/chos rgyal srong btsan sgam po'i ring la thon mi sam b+ho Tas da lta spyod bzhin pa'i bod yig gsar gtod mdzad nas chos mang po bod skad du bsgyur te sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa'i srol gtod/chos rgyal khri srong lde btsan gyi dus su rab byung gi sde thog mar tshugs nas sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa dar zhing rgyas par mdzad na yang/sangs rgyas chos lugs la ngo rgol byed pa'i stobs shugs da dung gnas yod pas yab khri srong lde btsan sku na ma son pa'i skabs dang bstun nas bon la dga' ba'i blon po 'ga' zhig gis mo dang rmi ltas la kha g.yar te chos mdzad na btsan po'i chab srid la gnod tshul gyi gtam zhus nas rgyal pos chos mdzad par bkag 'gog byed mi byung yod pa ltar slad ma byung sngon 'gog ched khri lde srong btsan gyis chab srid bzhes rjes yab mes kyi srol bzang rgyud 'dzin gnang nas sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa mi nyams gong 'phel yong ba'i don du gnam gyi skar ma chung ba gcig gi khyod la rgyang grags gcig yod pa'i bshad srol gyi tshad ltar gtsug lag khang bzhengs pa la skar chung rdo rje dbyings kyi lha khang du mtshan gsol zhing/de'i bdun du rje blon rnams kyis mi rabs rgyud bcas nas sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa dar zhing rgyas thabs byed pa las/nam yang mi bshig mi spong ba'i mna' skyel dam bcas pa'i bka' gtsigs kyi yi ge rgyas pa zur du yod pa ltar don bsdus pa'i rdo ring 'di btsugs pa red/bka' gtsigs de ni shog tu mthing shog thug gser yig gis bris pa dang/de'i nang don cha tshang ba ni (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang du 'khod cing mdor bsdus tsam ni/yab mes gdung rabs rgyud kyis dkon ma chog gsum gyi rten btsugs shing/sangs rgyas kyi chos mdzod pa 'di gces sprad byas thog/mo dang rmi ltas las brtsegs te khag 'dogs ci'i phyir yang rung/blon 'bangs che chung sum gsol kyang/sangs rgyas kyi chos mi gtang ma zhig /mi spang bar/gong rgyal blon nas 'og 'bangs mi ser bar thams cad kyis dam pa'i chos slob cing/der bkag 'gog mi byed pa dang/chos byed mkhan po dge ba'i bshes gnyen du bkur ba/chos sde'i rkyen ris su bcad pa'i sa zhing mi ser sogs nyung du mi 'khri ba bcas kyis sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa yun du gnas par byed dgos pa 'khod yod/(bka' gtsigs dang rdo ring gces bsdus )'di'i nang bkod pa 'di (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang du bkod mi 'dug pa der brtags na/skabs der dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng bas ma gzigs pa'am phyag tu ma 'byor ba gang rung zhig tu mngon te/smin grol gling lo chen d+harma shris mdzad pa'i (rtsis gzhung nyin byed snang ba'i rnam 'grel gser gyi shing rta )shing dpar ma'i shog grangs 61banas ba4bar bka' gtsigs 'di'i dum bu yig phreng bzhi drangs yod/yang bka' gtsigs 'di las rgyas pa zhig (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma stod cha'i shog grangs 409nas 413bar 'khod pa 'di'i nang don gong gsal gyi rdo ring bka' gtsigs de las rgyas shing/mjug tu bka' gtsigs la zhugs pa'i rgyal phran dang/blon chen/bka' blon/btsun mo sogs kyi ming tho cha tshang bkod 'dug pa der brtags na/bka' gtsigs kyi rdo ring gong gsal gyi smad cha yin pa dang rdo ring khag gnyis gcig tu bsgril na bka' gtsigs kyi nang don cha tshang zhig chags pa yin nges snyam pa ma zad/rdo ring khag gnyis kya nang don la do snang byed dgos pa'i don tshan kha shas 'dug pa 'di ltar/1 yab khri srong lde btsan gyis chos rgya cher thugs su chud de bsam yas lhun gyis grub pa sogs bod khams su gtsug lag khang mang po brtsigs pa dang/btsan po khri lde srong btsan nga'i zhal snga nas/chos thugs su chud de mdzad pa phan chad gdung rabs bdun kyi bar du mdzad kyis kyang/zhes gsal ba de las khri srong lde btsan dang/khri lde srong btsan gnyis yab sras yi 'brel ba yin pa dang/mes po srong btsan sgam po nas khri lde srong btsan rang nyid bar gdung rabs bdun yin par gsal por 'khod yod pa/2 mes po khri lde gtsug brtan gyi ring la brag dmar gyi ka chur gtsug lag khang brtsigs nas chos mdzad pa las/phyin chad chos byed du mi gnang bar/bka' khrims bris pa la zhes yab khri srong lde btsan dgung lo chung dus brag dmar gyi ka chung gtsug lag khang bshig nas phyin chad chos byed mi chog pa'i khrims bzos pa/3 yab khri srong lde btsan gyi dus chos mdzad nas phan 'bras chen po byung yang/yab gshegs pa'i rjes su mi 'ga' zhig gis chos byed pa 'di btsan po'i sku srog dang chab p+sarid la nyes skyon chen po yod pas/btsan po'i pho brang nang yod pa'i sku gsung thugs rten rnams logs su spangs nas chos byed mi rung zhes btsan po rje blon gyi sar zhu mkhan byung tshul 'khod yod pa/4 mjug tu dbu mna' bzhes nas bka' gtsigs bcas pa'i dam bca'i thog zhugs mkhan gyi mtshan tho bkod pa'i nang btsun mo gsum dang/rgyal phran gsum gyi rje dpon/bar byung yin pa'i blon chen gnyis/chab srid kyi blon chen drug gi nang zhang blon yin pa gsum/nang blon bcu bdun/sku srung gi blon po bcu bdun/phyi blon dang dmag dpon bsdoms pa'i mi grangs sum cu so drug gi ming rus bcas gsal por 'khod yod pa bcas zhib phra (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )gong gsal gyi shog grangs der gzigs}
