skar ma smin bdun|{yongs grags su byang skar spun bdun du 'bod cing nag rtsis kyi gzhung 'ga' zhig tu sme bdun zhes brjod pa de yin/gna' rabs bod kyi zhing 'brog sa khul du lho byang gi kha phyogs mi nor ba'i ched du byang phyogs nas 'char zhing phyogs de rang du nub 'gro ba'i skar ma 'od gsal ba bdun po de yod sa'i phyogs der byang du ngos bzung zhing/de'i kha gtad kyi phyogs de lho dang de gnyis kyi bar nyi ma 'char nub kyi phyogs der shar dang nub phyogs su ngos 'dzin byed srol yod pa de yin}
skar ma ri Shi|{skar ma ri Shi shar dus kyi chu bzang pa'i bshad srol mi 'dra ba mang po yod de/de yang chu la ngo bo'i sgo nas mi 'dar ba mang po yod de/de yang chu la ngo bo'i sgo nas bsil ba dang/yang ba/dwangs pa/'jam pa/zhim pa/dri mi nga ba bcas kyi ring bzhin ldan par ma zad/rlan 'dzin pa dang skom pa sel ba/tsha gdung sel ba bcas kyi nus pa'ang ldan yod/chu'i bzang ngan gyi skor la sngon byon mkhas pa chos chu rigs bdun las mchog gyur pa'i/_/chum go gangs la thug pa bzhin zhes sdom tshig bkod pa ltar rtsa ba'i 'byung khungs gyi sgo nas dbye na/yul dus gnyis kyi khyad par yod pa las/dang po yul gyi khyad par ni/rlan gsher che ba'i dug shing nags tshal can gyi yul/nyi 'od dang rlung gis reg chung ba'i yul bcas kyi skyes chu'i rigs la chu ngan zer/de las ldog pa'i yul phyogs kha lho lta yin pa/sa gzhi gtsang la nyi 'od legs par 'phog pa'i skyes chu'i rigs la chu bzang zer/da dung chu'i yan lag la char chu dang/gangs chu/gtsang chu/chu mig chu/khron pa'i chu/ba tshwa'i chu/shing chu sogs so so'i gnas dang 'bab pa'i dbang gis bzang ngan dbye ba mang po phye yod pa bod kyi gso ba rig pa'i gzhung lugs na gsungs yod/gnyis pa dus kyi khyad par gyi skor la rang re'i sngar rabs pa rnams kyis dpyid chu ngan/ston chu bzang zhes bshad pa bzhin da lta'ang de ltar yin no/_/de yang dpyad ka bas tshe dgun dus bsags pa'i kha rdul mi gtsang ba rnams dpyad ka dang sos ka'i drod rlung ches cher ldang bas sa rlung 'phel ba dang/sa rlangs dang mtsho rlangs bar snang du 'phyur ba'i kha char babs pas rdul rlung gi mi gtsang ba rnams sa steng gi chu nang du 'dres pa'i rkyen gyis skyes chu yang lci ba dang rtsub pa/dri cung zad nga ba/bskol na lbu ba che ba/btung na pho bar gnod pa/brgal na lus la gzan pa bcas kyi nyes pa yod pas dpyid chu ngan zer ba yin no/_/dgun dpyid gnyis la bsags pa'i mkha' rlung mi gtsang ba'i rigs tshang ma dbyar gyi dus su nyi 'od dang/rlung/char char bcas kyi stobs kyis yang yang zhi bar sbyangs rjes ston dus mkha' rlung rim bzhin gtsang bas mar chu dang skyes chu dwangs la yang ba/bskol na lbu ba med pa/btung na pho bar mi gnod pa bcas kyi yon tan yod pas ston chu bzang zer ba yin no/_/ston chu la skar rtsis rig pa'i thog nas bshad na mi snga rabs pa rnams kyis dus tshod nges ces zhig gi tshad 'dzin byas sa gtso bo ni gnam kyi skar ma rtags su bzung nas chu bzang ngan dbye ba 'byed pa yin la/dus bzhi yang de ltar ngos 'dzin byed pa ste/dper na/ska ma snron dang snubs kyis nam skyel ba'i dbyar dus drag char babs rjes su rnyog pa yin pas chu la brgal mi nyan/skar ma mgo dang rgyal gyis nam skyes pa'i dgun nyi ldog gi dus kyi chu shin tu grang bas chu la brgal mi nyan/ston zla 'bring po'i nang du lho ri'i rtse nas skar ma ri Shi tho rengs su du mthong dus chu dwangs shing tsha grang snyoms pa'i dus la ngos 'dzin byas te/bod kyi zhing 'brog mi dmangs rnams skabs der chu nang du khrus byed pa sogs lus kyi gtsang sbra byed pa'i srol yod cing/de snga dbus gtsang rgyud du bod zla brgyad pa'i tshes shar nas skar ma ri Shi'i chab bzhes kyi chab zhugs spro gseng tshugs/nor bu gling ga'i chab zhugs la mang tshogs zhugs srol med/dgon sde khag gi chab zhugs la lha mo 'khrab pa sogs byed sar mang tshogs ltad mor 'gro ba/grong mi phal cher gtsang 'gram sogs la chu brgal ba dang khrang 'khru rgyag pa sogs byed/dus der na gzhon tshos bya 'phur gtong gi yod pas bya 'phur nam dus zer zhing/lha sa khul du bod zla brgyad pa ma zin bar bya 'phur gtor mi chog pa yi/skar ma ri Shi'i 'od kyis rtswa chu je bzang du 'gyur ba'i bshad tshul de ni rtsis gzhung dag las drang srong ri Shi zhes zer/'di nyin mor zla ba drug gi ring gling 'di'i thad kar gnas/gling 'dir thog mar 'a char dus tho rengs dus su lho stod phyogs nas mthong ba 'di nyid nor bu ke ta ka las grub pa'i skar khyim yin stabs de'i 'od chu la phog pas zhag bdun gyi bar du chu bo thams cad yan lag brgyad ldan du 'gyur bas/de'i tshe khrus la zhugs na grib dang 'bag btsog thams cad dag par gsungs/'di sngon gyi drang srong rnams kyi smon lam gyi stobs yang yin zhes zer ro/'di'i skor zhib phra rtsis gzhung khag tu gsal}
