skar ma'i rig pa|{'di skar rtsis kyi gzhung dang 'brel ba dam po yod pa'i tshan rig gi sde tshan zhig yin cing/bod yig thog bsgyur ba'i gzhung ni/rgya rigs kyi mkhas pa khrin tsun ku'i sogs mi bcu gcig gis khag so sor bris pa dpe ming la (skar tshogs kyi 'jig rten ){(WP:1,194)}zhes pa/gnas lnga rig pa'i paN+Di ta tshe tan zhabs drung rin po ches bod skad du bsgyur zhing/mtsho sngon mi dmangs dpe skrun khang gis 1961lor dpar skrun 'grengs spel byas pa zhig 'dug pa de'i nang don ni/1 skar tshogs kyi 'jig rten/2 dgu tshigs kyi gsang rgya/3 nyi ma'i rtsa lag gi sder gtogs/4 mi'i 'gro ba gza' skar steng du 'tsho ba/5 gzar lhag pa dang pa sangs/6 gza' mig dmar steng srog ldan yod dam med/7 gza' phur bu dang spen pa/8 shin tu rgyang ring ba'i gza' skar/9 gza' skar chung ba/10 skar rtsis la brten nas lta 'jal byas pa'i grub 'bras bcas gnad bsdus 'khod yod/yang bod yig thog bsgyur med pa'i rgya yig ge deb {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i nang don chan che ba bcu bdun gyi thog nas rgyu skar dang/brtan skar/skar ma'i tshogs bcas ngo sprod byas yod pa bsham gsal/1 mi dang bar snang/2 gzhi rtsa'i dpyad chas dang thabs shes/3 rdul phran/4 rgyu skar dgu'i ngo sprod/5 rgyu skar gyi 'gul bskyod/6 srung skar gyi skor/7 rgyu skar chung ba dang/skar mda'/mjug ring bcas kyi skor/8 nyi ma'i khyim rgyud kyi lo tshad dang 'byung khungs skor/9 nyi ma'i skor/10 brtan 'jags kyi brtan skar skor/11 brtan 'jags min pa'i skar ma/12 brtan skar gyi 'phel 'gyur/13 gnyis tshogs kyi skar ma dang rgyu skar/14 skar ma'i tshogs pa/15/srung skar phan tshun bar/16 skar ma'i ma lag /17 'jig rten khams dang ltos bcas smra ba bcas yin cing/de rnams re re la'ang nang gses kyi don tshan mang po 'dug pa 'dir yig tshogs che bas bkod ma nus so/_}
skar rtsis kyi man ngag nyin byed snang ba|{snga 'gyur bstan pa'i gsal byed smin grol gling lo chen d+harma shri dgung lo nyer brgyad zhes pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags bya (1681)lor brtsams par mdzad pa'i phug lugs kyi bzhed pa gtso bor mdzad pa'i skar rtsis kyi gzhung zhig ste de yi rang 'grel (rtsis kyi man ngag nyid byed snang ba'i rnam 'grel gser gyi shing rta )zhes pa ni dgung lo so gsum pa me stag (1686)lor brtsams par mdzad/'di'i nang gzhung du ma gsal ba'i dka' gdan ches mang po zhig la dgag sgrub kyi rgyu mtshan mang po bkod nas gsal bshad gnad la 'khel ba mdzad yod/nye dus dpe skrun khang zhig nas lcags dpar thog 'grem spel byas 'dug pa dpar ma dang bsdur nas gzigs na legs}
skar rtsis kyi rig pa|{phyi rol rang byung khams kyi nyi ma zla ba sogs rgyu skar gyi 'khor 'gros nges can la ba rten nas sa yi go le'i thog nang dus mi 'dra ba dang/gnam gshis kyi 'gyur ldog sogs kyi chos nyid shes rtogs bya thabs kyi rtsis rig cig la zer/de yang rig gnas che chung gi rnam bzhag ngo sprod byed pa'i gzhung phul che ba'i nang/skar rtsis shes na grangs lami rmongs zhes bshad srol yod pa ltar/skar rtsis kyis gtso bo rtsis rig la brten nas rgyu skar gyi 'khor 'gros dang dus bzhi'i zhing 'brog gi thon skyed la phan yod kyi nam dus ngo sprod byed kyi yod cing/de'i gzugs kyi bong tshod dang/grangs 'bor sogs rtsi rgyu yang shes thub pas/bsgyur bgos bsnan gsum gyi rtsis rig ma shes na skar rtsi shes thabs med pa zhig yin/deng rabs skar rtsis rig pa dang/gzugs dang/dus dang/'od dang/spyi 'gros/rang 'gros sogs phyogs mang po zhig thad nas rtsi dgos pa ste/nyi zla/rgyu skar sogs kyi 'khor 'gros spyi 'khor dang/rang 'khor gyi 'gros myur bul dang/'char nub sogs chu tshod dang skar cha'i tshad la brten nas shes dgos pa dang/de dag phan tshun bar gyi thag ring thung dang/'od kyi tshad sogs 'ga' zhig gzugs kyi bod tshod 'jal ba'i sko nas rtsi dgos yin/dus kyi tshad 'jal tshul la sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi (mngon pa mdzod )dang/('dul ba )gnyis las rtsi tshul mi 'dra ba gnyis bshad yod/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi (dus 'khor )dang/rgya gar nas bod du dar pa'i skar rtsis kyi gzhung nas bshad pa'i dus kyi tshad rtsi tshul ni/skyes bu nad med pa gcig gi dbugs 'gro 'ong gnyis re la khug pa gcig tu rtsis pa'i dbugs cha drug la chung srung gcig /chu srung drug cu tham pa ste dbugs cha sum brgya drug cu thab pa la chu tshod gcig /chu tshod drug cu tham pa la nyir zhag gcig tu rtsis pa yin cing/rgyun srol yongs grags kyi chu tshod gcig la skar rtsis pa'i lugs kyi chu tshod gnyis dang chu srang lnga yod cing/nyin zhag gcig la dbugs 'a gro 'ong gi cha nyis khri chig stong drug brgya yod/nyin zhag sum cu la zla ba gcig dang/zla ba bcu gnyis la lo gcig /de la dus bzhi dang/so bsags pas dus bzhi chen po dang/bskal pa/bskal chen sogs rtsi rgyu yod/gzhan yang gza' dang tshes/skar ma/sbyor ba/byed pa bcas lnga ni rtsis kyi yan lag lnga yin cing/gza' lnga (mig dmar/lhag pa/phur bu/pa sangs/spen pa )bcas so so'i 'grus myur ba dang/dal ba/drang po/'khyog po bcas kyi 'gros bzhi dang/so so'i khyim dang/longs spyod/gzhan yang sgra gcan dang/dus mes nyi zla 'dzin pa'i rtsis dang/du ba mjug ring gi 'char nub/dbyar dgun gyi nyi ldog /dus sbyor/zhag gsum gyi rnam dbye la sogs pa'i rtsis (dus 'khor )las bshad pa rnams la skar rtsis sam dkar rtsis su grags shing/nag rtsis zhes pa ni/rgya bza' rnam gnyis bod du bon pa nas dar ba'i rme ba dgu dang/spar kha brgya/lo skor bcu gnyis/keg rtsis/bag rtsis/gshin rtsis sogs thang rgya rabs dang/ming rgyal rabs sogs kyi dus rgya nag nas bod du dar pa'i rtsis rig mang po yod pa de rnams la zer/bod du skar rtsi rig pa ji ltar byung tshul dang/rgya rtsis zer ba'i go don bcas kyi skor 'dir bkod na yig tshogs che bas/gnas lnga paN+Di ta tshe tan zhabs drug rin po ches mdzad pa'i (rgya rtsis kyi go don )zhes pa'i deb rkyang pa kan su'u mi dmangs dpe skrun khang nas dpar skrun byes pa de dang/pe cin dpe mdzod khang gi rtsis rig mkhan dbang hong rmin shin {(WP:1,194)}gyis mdzad pa (tsang rig gi sgor nas dpyad pa'i bod kyi skar rtsis go don )zhes pa dang/bod ljongs smin rtsis khang gi dbu 'dzin mkhas dbang byams pa 'phrin las kyis mdzad pa'i (bod kyi gnam rig skar rtsis kyi byung tshul dang 'phel rim skor gleng ba )zhes pa bcas su zhib rgyas gsal zhing/mkhas dbang rnam pa gsum gyi gsung tshul 'ga' zhig zur mi 'dra ba yod kyang/gzhi rtsa'i thad zhes pa gcig gyur tu 'dug pas de rnams la gzigs}
