skal ldan blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{chu bzang rwa lo thang du rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa lug (1859)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga pa sha ra bla brang du rje gong ma blo bzang 'phrin las rgya mtsho'i chos khri la phebs/rje btsun a rol blo bzang lung rigs rgya mtsho dpal bzang po las dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes te mtshan blo bzang bstan pa'i rgya mtshan zhes gsol/nags rgya'i yongs 'dzin dar rgyas rgya mtsho las chos spyod kyi rigs dang/a rol rdo rje 'chang las rab byung dge tshul 'jigs mdzad rgyal po'i dbang dngos sta sogs bzhes te gsang mtshan la mi bskyod rdo rje zhu/dgung lo bdun brgyad skabs 'jam dbyangs dkar po dang dbyangs can ma dkar mo gnyis la bstod pa mdzad pas snyan ngag pa rnams kyis ngo mtshar du 'dzin/dgung lo bcu pa nas gsan sbyong dbu tshugs/rwa stod mkhan chen dang/skyi ya'i rab 'byams pa blo bzang bstan 'dzin/gtsos khri sprul lo ba'ang 'jam dpal bstan 'dzin seng ge sogs las bsdus grwa dang/sum rtags/dag yig sgra'i sa ris/rtsis dkar nag sogs mthar thug par sbyangs/de nas sog yul du gnad drangs te khron chen la spyan ras gzigs kyi dbang sogs gnang/dgung lo nyi shu par blo bzang lung rig rgyal mtshos las thugs rdzogs bzhes/dgung lo nyer bzhi par rgya nag ri bo rtse lngar gnas mjal dang/cang he dgon par 'jam dbyangs zhi khro sbrags sgrub kyi bsnyen mtshams gnang/de nas pe cing nang khrin 'du sogs la phebs nas gnas gzigs mdzad/dgung lo nyer brgyad par dbus su phebs nas rgyal dbang thub bstan rgya mtsho mchog la stong 'bul dang chos 'brel zhus/gdan sa gsum la mang 'gyed bstabs gzhung sa chen mos 'ja' sa tham ga gru sgor/mkhan chas cha tshang/gdugs rta dar bcas dang bstan pa'i gsal byed er ti ho thog thu mkhan po zhes pa'i chos lo sngar srol ltar gnang ba spyi bor bzhes te phyir rang dgon du phebs/dgung lo so gcig par grub dbang 'jigs med bsam gtan rin po che las phreng kri'i dbang sogs bka' chos mang du gsan/dgung lo zhe lnga par gser khrir zhabs sor bkod de lo bzhi'i ring bka' chos mang du gsungs nas spyi sger gyi dka' ston brjod las 'das pa bskyangs te dgung lo zhe brgyad par khri khur bzhag /tshoms chen phun tshogs 'du khang dang mi pham mdun sa gsar bzhengs mdzad cing/gdan sa'i gos sku chen mo bzhengs/shing yos (1915)lor bsam bzhin mya ngan las 'das pa'i tshul bstan}
skal ldan bzhi|{sbyangs pa can las 'phros pa'i theg chen chos kyi dad pa can/mos gus che ba'i brtson 'grus can/sbyor ba rtsom pa'i shes rab can/rtogs pa skyel ba'i skal pa can bcas so/_}
skal ldan ye shes|{(za ra ba skal ldan ye shes seng ge )'gro mgon phag mo gru pa'i slob ma yin/'dis gra rab kyi sa char za ra dgon pa btab/'khrungs so gsal bar 'khod pa ma mthong yang/g.ya' bzang pa chos kyi smon lam dgung lo so brgyad pa me stag la g.ya' bzang dgon pa btab pa'i phyi lo (rab byung bzhi pa'i me yos spyi lo 1207)za ra ba skal ldan ye shes seng ge sku gshags par (deb ther sngon po )las bshad/lo rgyus cung zad (deb ther sngon po )lcags dpar ma'i smad cha shog grangs 766par gsal}
skal ldan rab tu 'byin|{rab tu byung ba'i bar chad bzhi (1 sdom pa skye ba'i bar chad sum cu so bdun/2 sdom pa gnas pa'i bar chad brgya dang zhe bdun/3 sdom pa mdzes pa'i bar chad sum cu so bdun/4 sdom pa gong 'phel du 'gro ba'i bar chad bzhi bcu zhe gsum bcas )dang bral ba'i gang zag rnams la rab byung gi sdom pa gnang ba}
skal ldan las 'phro can|{skabs 'dir (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )shog grangs 1311) gter du sbas zin pa'i gter kha rnams 'don pa'i skal ba yod pa dang/gter du sbas zin pa'i chos dar spel gtong thub pa'i nus pa yod par go dgos}
