skal dman|{skal ba dman pa zhes pa skal ba chung ba dang/skal ba med pa gnyis kar go dgos/spyir dman pa zhes pa ni nor ba dang/bral ba/chung ba zhan pa bcas don mang po la 'jug }
skal rdzongs|{de sngon bod sa gnas su bu bag par gtong ba dang bu mo mna' mar gtong skabs so so'i pha mas rang rango so'i dpal 'byor gyi 'khos bab la gzhigs pa'i rgyan cha da nga/gos/bzhon pa/sems can/sa zhing sogs skal ba blos bcad pa re sprad pa}
