skas dar|{skas 'dzegs kyi lag 'ju g.yas g.yon la dar gos las bzos pa'i shubs dang/skas gdang gi sting du zhabs ras bting ba}
skigs bu|{skyigs bu'am ig ga rgyag pa'i ming}
skigs bu 'byung|{ag ga rgyag pa /(tsa)}
sku kyai rdo rje zhal gcig phyag gnyis pa|{(kyai rdo rje'i rtsa rgyud brtag gnyis )las gsungs pa'i sku kyai rdo rje zhal gcig phyag gnyis pa lha dgu'i dkyil 'khor ste/gtso bo yab yum shar du lha mo gau ri/lhor tsau ri/nub tu be tA li/byang na g+hasma ri/shar lhor ri khrod ma/lho nub tu gdol pa mo/nub byang du g.yung mo/byang shar du du puk+ka sil bcas gtso 'khor dgu yod pa'i dkyil 'khor yin}
