sku mkhar|{gna' rabs bod kyi btsan po rim byung gi dus su bzhengs pa'i pho brang thog brtsegs can gyi ming yin zhing/dper na lho yar lung du gnya' khri btsan po'i pho brang yum bu brla mkhar dang/btsan po srong btsan sgam po'i dus bzhengs pa'i pho brang pho tA la'i thog ma'i bzo dbyibs lha sa gtsug lag khang gi ldebs bris thog bkod yod pa lta bu}
sku mkhar gyi rtse srung|{btsan po'i pho brang rtse nas phyogs bzhir nyen rtog gi 'gan khur mkhan zhig ste/de la go gnas dngul gyi yi ge chung ba'i thob thang yod pa (mkhas pa lde'u'i chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i grangs 267par gsal}
sku mkhar dgu thog|{rje btsun mar pa lo tsA bas rang nyid kyi slob ma mi la ras par sdig sgrib sbyang ba'i ched bzhengs su bcug pa'i sku mkhar thog tshad dgu yod pa zhig ste/gangs ljongs sgrub brgyud bstan pa'i gsal byed chen po rje btsun mi la ras pas dgung lo nyi shu rtsa drug la phebs pa me sbrul (1077)lor dam pa'i chos gsan pa'i ched du lho brag mar pa lo tsA ba'i drung du phebs/der bla ma'i gzims g.yog bas tog les par zhus kyang chos tshig gcig kyang ma gnang ba'i thog /sku tshe stod la a khu dang a ne'i dgra sha blangs chen mthu la brten nas mi sum cu so lnga phyi ma'i lam du btang ba dang/ser ba phab ste yul mi'i lo tog rmeg med du gtong bar mdzad pa sogs sgrib sbyong la dgongs ta mkhar zlum po dang/zla gam/gru gsum bcas brtsigs su bcad te thog tshad yongs pa dang yang bshig tu bcug pa sogs sdug sbyor tshad med brten nas sku rgyab tu sgal rma gsum byung ba'i bar du dka' ba tshad med spyad pa'i mthar/mkhar grub bzhi dgu thogs can zhig mi la ras pa rang nyid gcig pur brtsigs su bcug pa de yin/mkhar 'di'i thog so bdun bar mi la ras pa rang nyid gcig pus brtsigs gnang mdzad cing/de'i steng gi thog so gnyis las mi gzhan dag glas nas brtsigs pa red/de nas bla ma mar pas mi lam ras pa la dbang lung khrid la sogs pa man ngag cha tshang ba gnang ste thugs brtse chen pos bskyangs gnang mdzad/skur mkhar 'dir sras mkhar zhes 'bod pa'i rgyu mtshan ni/mar pa lo tsA ba'i chos brgyud 'dzin mkhan gyi thugs re gnang yul gtso bo'i gras rang nyid kyi sras dar ma mdo sde yin pas/de'i bzhugs yul du mkhar de brtsigs pa la brten nas ming de ltar thogs/(sras mkhar dag thog gtsug lag khang gi dkar chag )nang 'khod pa ltar na/mar pa lo tsA ba ring nyid kyi gzigs dpe'i gras mang po dang/sras dar ma mdo sdes bzhengs pa gnang ba'i (nyi khri/) mar pa lo tsA ba dang yul bdag med ma/sras dmar ma mdo sde bcas kyi 'dra sku/thugs dam rten thang ka rtsa chen kha shas/lho brag dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng bas bzhengs pa gnang ba'i mi la ras pa'i rnam thar cha tshang gi thang ka sogs rtsa che'i rig gnas dngos rdzas grangs las 'das pa yod pa dang/mar pa lo tsA ba rgyun bzhugs gnang yul mkhar ru zer ba'i gzims khang nang du yang mar pa lo tsA ba zhal bzhugs dus kyi rtse che'i rten gsum mang po yod pa/de yi nye 'dabs mi la ras pa'i sgrub khang stag gnya'i brag la yang rin thang che ba'i rten gsum mang po yod tshul bcas 'khod 'dug kyang/deng skabs lhag lus nyung shas tsam ma gtogs bsdad yod tshod mi 'dug /zhib phra gong gsal (sras mkhar dgu thog gtsug lag khang dang/lho brag gro bo lung/zangs phug /stag gnya' bcas kyi gnas yig rna ba'i bdud rtsi dad pa'i dga' ston )dpe rnying dbu can lho brag dpar ma shog rangs 27yod pa dpar slog brgyab pa zhig kho bos mthong byung lags}
sku mkhar nyi bzungs|{mnga' bdag dpal 'khor btsan gyi btsun mo che ba'i sras skyid lde nyi ma mgon mnga' ris su bros phabs nas spu rangs su bzhugs/dge bshes bkra shis btsan gyis 'bro bza' 'khor skyong btsun mor phul/mnga' ris skor gsum dbang du bsdus/spu rangs su sku mkhar nyi bzungs brtsigs/sras gsum byung ba'i che ba dpal gyi mgon la mnga' ris mar yul/(la dwags )'bring po bkra shis mgon la gu ge /spu rangs/chung ba lde gtsug mgon la zangs dkar sgo gsum/sbi ti/sbi cog bcas gnang nas srid bskyangs pa bcas zhib par bod ljongs spyi tshogs tshan rig khang gis dpar skrun byas pa'i (bod kyi lo rgyus deb ther khag lnga )zhes pa'i lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 183nas 185bar gsal bar der gzigs}
sku mkhar ma ru|{pha bong kha ri khrod kyi ming rnying pa yin/lha sa grong khyer gyi byang phyogs spyi lo brgyad tsam song ba'i nyang bran dbu gdugs ri'i g.yas ngos ri la 'dabs su gnas shing/sku mkhar 'di chags sa ni phrag rdo rus sbal gyi dbyibs can/sa ngos las spyi khre nyi shu tsam gyis mtho zhing/rgya khyon spyi khre sum brgya tsam dang/shar lho nub gsum g.yang gzar can gyi steng du yod/'dzugs skrun lte ba'i bzo dbyibs ni/brag rdo rus sbal dbyibs kyi rnam pa dang mthun par phyogs gsum zlum po dang/byang ngos gru bcad kyi dkyil du sgo byang blta rdo skas rim pa mang po yod pa sogs gna' rabs 'dzugs skrun gyi dmigs bsal khyad chos ngo mtshar can dang ldan yod/sngon dus btsan po srong btsan sgam pos lha sa gtsug lag khang ma bzhengs pa'i gong du gnas 'dir sku mtshams la bzhugs nas 'dul mdzad pa ste/nyin gcig btsan po dang blon 'khor bcas po tA la'i pho brang gi rtse nas phyogs bzhi'i yul ljongs la gzigs pas byang ngos su dngos po nag ril chen po zhig gzigs nas phyi nyin gnas der gzigs su byon pas/dngos po nag ri la chen po thag 'dom kha shas kyis 'jal thub pa'i pha bong chen po rus sbal gyi dbyibs 'dra ba zhig yin pas thugs mnyes te gnas der sku mtshams la bzhugs thog /pha bong chen po de'i steng du sku mkhar thog brtsegs dgu yod pa zhig bzhengs/thon mi sam b+ho Ta rgya gar nas bod du phebs rjes gnas der deng sang nga tshos rgyun spyod byed pa'i bon yig gsar gtod gnang zhing/de'i yig phud rdo la brkos pa'i ma Ni yig drug bzhengs pa yang deng sang mjal rgyu yod/btsan po srong btsan sgam pos thon mi sam b+ho Ta slob dpon du bsten nas bod yig slob sbyong mdzad cing/btsan po khri srong lde btsan skabs gnas 'dir dge 'dun gyi sde thog mar btsugs nas rab byung mang po rgyun bzhugs mdzad/rgyal po glang dar mas bstan pa snub skabs sku mkhar 'di me la bsregs/das rabs bcu gnyis pa'i 'gor dge bshes po to bas nyin kyi dngos slob dge bshes brag dkar ba dang lhan du gnas 'dir phebs nas tshes bcu phug tu bzhugs te chos mang du gsungs shing/gnas 'di nyams gso byas te dge 'dun gyi sde 'dzugs dgos pa'i bka' gnang ba ltar/dge bshes brag dkar pas nyams gso dang 'brel dge 'dun gyi sde slar yang gsar 'dzugs gnang bas dge 'dun sum brgya tsam 'tshog thub pa byung/de nas nyams chag je cher rgyur skabs tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i yongs 'dzin gyi gtso bo 'khon ston dpal 'byor lhun grub kyis ser byes mkhan po lo 'ga' zhig gnang nas dgongs zhu mdzad de gnas 'di'i slob dpon dang chabs cig rgyun ring bzhugs gnang mdzad cing/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng dang po ngag dbang brtson 'grus kyis gdan sa bkra shis 'khyil phyag 'debs rgyu'i sa 'dul rten 'brel gyi mdzad sgo yang gnas 'dir gnang/gnas 'dir yod pa'i sku gsung thugs rten dang/brag phug ngo mtshar can/mchod rten khag /dur khrod g.yas g.yon/chu mig gong 'og sogs kyi ngo sprod zhib par 'khon ston dpal 'byor lhun grub kyis mdzad pa'i (pha bong kha'i gnas yig mdor bsdus )dang/ser smad kong po ma chod khang rtse mchog sprul sku gong mas mdzad pa'i (pha bong kha'i gnas yig rgyas pa )pha bong kha'i dpar ma bcas la gzigs}
