sku 'gag rgyan drug ma|{de sngon bod du mkhan po dang bla sprul rnam pa tshos sku stod du bzhes pa'i na bza' phu thung med pa la/gong ba/gsham cha/seng ge dpung po bcas snam bu dmar po dang/rgyab kyi me long/rwa g.yas g.yon/glang chen mche ba g.yas g.yon bcas gzhi mtshon khra min pa'i gos chen dang/ras gang rigs ser po'am dpar po btang ba'i stong 'gag stabs dbe zhig yin cing/rus rabs bco brgyad pa'i g.yas g.yon la rgya gser gyi stod 'gag dang/chab blugs sogs ha cang rgyas spros bya srol dar ba dang/phyogs mtshungs mchod rdzas dang/mchod pa'i yo byad rgyas spros byed pa'i 'gran bsdur gyi dus skabs shig grub mtha' ris med kyi dgon pa che chung tshang mar dang 'dug pa ni nang bstan chos lugs bshad sgrub gnyis ka'i cha nas nyams chag tu song ba'i mtshon rtags yin par mngon}
