sku mched rje drung rnam gnyis|{tA la'i sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i yab chen a li dpal ldan don grub kyi sku mched rje drung a khu lags su grags pa blo bzang phun tshogs dang blo bzang dge 'dun gnyis la zer/khong gnyis rnam kun srid don thog dbang shugs che tsam byung bar brten/srid skyong tshe smon gling pe cin du bzhugs ring gor bod sa mtshams kyi rtsod nyog langs skabs gor kha dang zhi mthun chings 'grigs byas te chings dngul sprod thabs kho na ma gtogs gor kha'i dmag la gdong len 'thab rtsod bya mi dgos pa'i 'dod tshul bzung nas chings dngul 'bor chen sprod rgyu khas len byas pa'i chings yig bzhag pa bcas byed mkhan de gnyis red/der brten gor bod dmag 'khrug don gcod blon chen h+phu khang an gyis gtan 'bebs byas pa'i (lugs srol gsar 'dzugs kyi don tshar nyer dgu pa )zhes pa'i don tshan bcu gnyis par/tA la'i bla ma dang paN chen er ni ti zhal bzhugs ring sku'i nye rigs rnams nas las don byed mi chog pa da nga/zhing brjes ba'i rjes su sku rnams la shes 'khos dang bstun pa'i las don byas chog ces pa'i gtan 'bebs de ltar byung ba red}
