sku gdung gi mchod rten|{1 rang la bka' drin che ba'i bla ma dang/dge rgan/pha ma bcas sku gshegs rjes sku rus mer bap+saregs te rus chog byas yin pa rnams sa dang bsres te sAts+tsha btab pa de dag mchod rten bzhengs pa'i nang du bzhugs pa/2 yang na sku gdung mer ma bsregs par dgung sgrub sogs lag len mthong brgyud ltar byas pa'i dmar gdung mchod rten gyi bum pa'i nang du 'jog pa bcas gnyis kar sku gdung gi mchod rten zer}
sku gdung cha brgyad mnyam par bgos|{sngon dus sangs rgyas bcos ldan 'das sku mya ngan las 'das rje sku gdung zhugs 'bul byed skabs sdig can yul du gnas pa'i gyad mi rnams dang rtog g.yo'i yul gyi rgyal rigs pu lo ka dang/grong khyer sgra sgrogs kyi rgyal po krod+ha/khyab 'jug gling du gnas pa'i bram ze/grong khyer ser skya'i yul du gnas pa'i shAkya/grong khyer yangs pa can du gnas pa'i li tsA byi bcas khag brgyad snga rjes su 'ongs nas sku gdung nga tshor dgos zhes rtsod gling byung skabs/bram ze bro bo dang mnyam pas sku gdung cha brgyad du bgos pas ma g+ha d+ha yi khal re re byung ba sbyin pa de khyer nas rang rang gi yul du sku gdong yod pa'i ma chod rten re bzhengs/sku gdung sreg skabs kyi sreg bum de bram ze rang nyid kyi skal bar khyer bcas kyi lo rgyud yod pa de yin}
sku gdung nyams pa med par byin gyis rlabs|{sngar sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das dgongs pa mya ngan las 'da' kha brgyud 'dzin sku tshab tu nyan thos 'od srung chen po bsko gzhag mdzad pa ltar/lo gcig lhag tsam ring bstan pa'i bdag po mdzad nas dgongs pa mya ngan las 'da' khar/bcos ldan 'das kyis bka' mngags ji ltar mdzad pa bzhin kun dga' bo la sku tsab tu bsgos nas bstan pa gtad de ri bo bya rkang can du byon nas mya ngan las 'das te ma 'ongs pa'i sangs rgyas byams pa gnas der ma byon gyi bar du klu gdung nyams pa med par byin brlabs mdzad pa'i lo rgyud yod pa de yin}
sku gdung zhugs 'bul|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la rang gi bla ma dang/dge rgan/pha ma bcas rang rang so sor bka' drin che ba'i gang zag khyad par can sku gshegs rjes sku phung de sa phyogs gtsang ma'am dur khrod gtsang ma zhig tu gdan drangs te tsan dan dang/a ka ru/shug sogs dri zhim po'i shing brtsegs kyi dbus su ras dkar por sku gzigs yongs rdzogs dkris te/mar dang snum sogs blugs nas bsreg pa la zer/de yang mdo lugs gong du bshad pa de ma gtogs pa'i dmigs bsal gyi cho ga (rdo rje gur )dang/(ngan song sbyong rgyud )sogs las gsungs pa bzhin bu ston rin po che dang/'brong rtse lha btsun rin chen rgya mtsho/paN chen ye shes rtse mo sogs dge lugs phyogs kyi dam pa mang pos mdzad pa yod cing/grub mtha' ris med kyi skyed chen gzhan dag gis mdzad pa 'ga' zhig kyang mjal/spyir btang dge legs phyogs la thu'u bkwan rin po che blo bzang chos kyi nyi mas mdzad pa'i (rdo rje sems dpa'i sgo nas yul khyad par can gyi sku gdung mchod cing byang ba'i cho ga rin chen sgron me )zhes bya ba dam pa de'i gsung 'bum lha sa zhol dpar ma'i pod (nga)pa'i nang bzhugs pa de rang zhal gsal zhing 'jug pa bde ba yod la/de'i nang skyes ched dam pa dgongs pa mya ngan las 'da' khar thugs dam gsal 'debs ji ltar zhu ba dang sku gshegs rjes sku gdung lhar bskyed de gdung khrus dang/mchod 'bul/dgongs rdzogs cho ga/sku gdung zhugs 'bul/sa gnas gzhan dag nas gdan sa dang zhugs 'bul zhu yul gyi bar gdan drangs tshul/zhugs 'bul zhus zin pa'i sku rus dang ring bsrel sogs bdag gces zhu stangs/sku gdung zhugs 'bul zhu sa'i sa gnas der mchod rten bzhengs tshul sogs zhib cing ra bar gsungs yod cing/gsum pa de dag dpe thog bro brdung kyis shes rlom mi bya bar/mthong ba brgyud pa'i phyag len bzang po dang nyams myong tshad ldan mnga' ba'i dge ba'i bshes gnyen la bsnyen nas myong goms byang chub pa zhig nges par gal che bar snang ngo/_/gong gsal (gdung chog )der mi gsal ba'i mthong brgyud phyag len gzhan dag skor/rang la chos 'brel thob pa'i bla ma dang/dge rgan sogs dgongs pa rdzogs rjes sku gdung la phyag gsum phul te ras dkar po gtsang ma zhig gis zhal gyi ol sko'i 'og nas sku'i thugs kar bar bka' ste bzhag thog thugs dam grol ba'i rtags ma byung bar sku gdung la bsgul bskyod sogs mi gtong/thugs dam grol ba'i rtags shangs bug gnyis nas byang sems dkar dmar phebs mtshams sku gdung la dar gos dkar po'am dmar ser gang rigs kyis drug chings phul te ched gnyer gyis bzos pa'i gdung sgrom du bzhag nas de na bza' chos gos snam sbyar sogs rab byung gi cha dang/de'i steng du lha'i chas 'jug bsgron te dgung zhag ji tsam yos pa'i ring gdung khrus dang/gdung sgrub/dad ldan khag gi dgongs rdzogs mchod 'bul bcas grub mtshams/sa phyogs gtsang sa zhig tu so phag sogs kyis sku gdung sreg thab brtsigs te/de'i steng du zlum po mdun du me sgo yod pa zhig gi nang du stod kyi char lcags khras bkab pa'i steng du sku gdung bzhag ste/shug pa dang tsan dan sogs dri bzang po'i shing phyogs bzhi nas brtsigs pa la/til snum dang/mar khu bsres pa blugs nas sku rus rnams gtsang mar ma tshig bar du cho ga'i nang du gsal ba ltar zhugs 'bul zhus/nyin shas song rjes spur khang zhal phye nas sku gdung gi cha shas 'ga' zhig dad ldan slob ma dang yon bdag rnams la bgos 'grems thog /mang che ba sku gdung gi mchod rten dang 'dra sku bzhengs pa'i nang gzugs su phul dgos pa yin/sku gdung la drung chings 'bul tshul skor gnas lnga rig pa'i mkhas dang tshe tan zhabs drung rin po ches mdzad pa'i (rang rnam )dam pa de'i gsung 'bum lcags dpar ma deb dang po'i shog grangs 695nas 696bar gsal zhing/spyir btang gang zag phal ba'i phung po mer sreg bya tshul skor dge lugs phyogs la lcang skya ngag dbang chos ldan gyi gsum 'bum lha sa dpar ma'i pod (nga)pa'i nang (gshin po'i phung po sreg sbyang bya tshul gyi lag len gsal bar ston pa thar pa'i sgo 'byed )ces pa zhig yod pa der gzigs}
