sku mdun mkhan po|{yongs grags su sku bcar spyi khyab mkhan po zhes 'bod pa de yin/tA la'i bla ma p+saku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho mchog sku 'bum nas bod sa gnas su thog mar gdan drangs nas pho brang po tA lar gser khri mnga' gsol zhus pa'i snga rjes kyi spyi khyab mkhan po su yin rnam thar kyi nang gsal por ma 'khod pas brtag dgos/sku mdun mkhan po'am yongs grags kyi gzhung srong yig cha khag tu skur bcas spyi khyab mkhan po zhes 'bod pa de ni/tA la'i bla ma'i sku'i gam bcar rtse skor rim pa gsum pa'i gdan thob dang go gdan yod pa zhig ste (bod rang ljongs chab srid gros tshogs kyi lo rgyus dpyad gzhi'i yig cha bdams sgrigs )ang 13pa'i nang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa'i skabs gsar du byung ba'i dpon rigs shig yin par bshad/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i rnam thar nang bka' shag tshugs rjes nang sku mdun dar han mkhan po bskal bzang yon tan dang/gsol dpon mkhan po grags pa mtha' yas/gzims dpon mkhan po byams gling blo bzang tshe ring/mchod dpon sde drug mkhan po blo bzang rnam rgyal bcas kyi ming yang yang thon pa bcas la ba rtags na p+saku bcar mkhan po ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i skabs nas yod 'dra yang sku bcar nang ma khag dang/rtse drung yongs kyi 'go gtso lta bu zhig las srid don thog dbang cha gang yang med pa zhig yin/rjes su sku phreng brgyad pa'i skabs yab gzhis a khu lags gnyis kyis tA la'i bla ma'i mtshan gnas bed spyad nas srid don thog dbang cha bka' shag las kyang che ba lta bu'i skyon cha lhags pa'i rjes nas tA la'i bla ma zhal bzhugs ring sku nye rigs nas srid don las gnas bzung mi chog pa dang/de'i tshab tu sku mdun mkhan po'i go gnas bka' blon dang 'dra ba'i thog /tA la'i bla ma sku sger gyi sbug dmar gyi tham 'dzin las 'gan khur nas/sku bcar spyi khyab mkhan po zhes dbang cha che ru song ba yin 'dra snyam/sku bcar spyi khyab mkhan po'i byed sgo'i skor zhib par gong gsal gyi yig cha de'i shog grangs 19nas 22bar gsal ba der gzigs}
sku mdun dar han mkhan po bskal bzang yon tan|{tA la'i sku phreng bdun pa'i skabs sku bcar mkhan po'i go gnas bzung zhing/byas rjes su tshal gung thang bla brang gi 'dzin skyong gnang ba dang/gung thang gtsug lag khang la nyams gso bdag gces legs po byung yod tshul (gung thang gtsug lag khang gi dkar chag )nang gsal}
sku 'dab|{dgongs rdzogs kyi 'das mchod byas pa'i zhe sa}
sku nar ma son|{sku'i nang tshod ma lon pa ste rang rtogs kyis bsam shes byed thub pa'i lo tshad la ma slebs pa}
skal bal gyi ring bsrel|{gsang sngags kyi gzhung nas bshad srol la sangs rgyas byang sems dang/rang gi rtsa ba'i bla ma'i dbu skra phyag sen/na bza' bcas la zer}
sku ber|{bod sa gnas su gdan sa khag gi mkhan po chos 'du khang du tshogs la phebs skabs bzhes pa'i ras ber dang/bla sprul che khag chos tshogs la phebs skabs bzhes pa'i gos ber bcas rigs gnyis yod/1 ras ber ni dbyibs zla gam dang 'dra ba la/gzhi ma ras ser rkyang dang/gong ba gos chen tshon khra min pa'i gzhi dmar po rgyab kyi da char gos chen sngon po'i me long gru bzhi'i mthongs yod pa zhig yin/2 gos ber/dbyibs zla gam dang 'dra ba la/gzhi gdan gos chen ser rkyang dang/ser po tshon khra gang rigs las byas par gong bar gos dmar ser ris yod pa dang/dmar po tshon khra/rgya ser sogs gang rigs kyi steng du skud pa dkar sngon gyi stangs bcad rgya gram ris dang/de'i mthar sram rgyan/rgyab kyi stod char mthongs su gos chen sngon po'i me long gru bzhi byas pa zhig }
sku 'bag|{1 gser gdung sogs rin po che'i rigs dang/'jim pa sogs las ba zos pa'i 'dra sku/2 gdong gi dbyibs rkyang pa ma gtogs gzugs byings med pa'i 'dra 'bag gnyis kar go chog }
sku 'bum dgon|{yongs grags su sku 'bum byams pa gling zhes 'bod pa de yin/deng sang mtsho sngon zhing chen mi dmangs srid gzhung gnas yul zi ling grong khyer gyi lho nub phyogs spyi la nyer lnga'i sar yod/dgos pa 'di nyid thog mar rje tsong kha pa dgu lo nyi shu rtsa gnyis la phabs skabs rab byung drug pa'i sa rta (1378)lor ma yum gyis rang nyid sku na bgres pa dang bcas rang yul du mjal phrad la phebs dgos pa'i zhu yig dang dbu skra dkar por song ba'i lan bu bcas bskur gnang mdzad par/rang yul phyogs su phebs rgyu dgos pa chung bar gzigs te yum dang gcen mo gnyis la 'dra thang re dang/phyag bris re/rgyal ba seng ge nga ro'i sku dpar gcig /bde mchog gi bum sku bcas bskur gnang mdzad pa bzhin de'i phyi lo yum gyis thugs khur bzhes shing dad ldan mang pos rogs ram byas te/rje tsong pa kha chen po sku 'khrungs nas lte khrag bor ba'i sa gnas der shing tsan+da gyi sdom pa zhig skyes pa de nyid snying por bzhugs shing/rgyal ba seng ge nga ro'i sku brnyan 'bum gcig dpar du btab pa gzungs su phul ba'i mchod rten pad+ma spungs pa zhig bzhengs pa'i mtha' bskor du rdo rtsig gi rab bas bskor ba bcas yod pa'i steng du lha khang rdza g.yam gyi thog bkab pa gsar bzhengs gnang/rab byung bcu pa'i me glang (1577)lor sgom rin chen chen brtson 'grus rgyal mtshan gyis thugs khur bzhes te rgyal ba byams pa'i sku brnyan chen po zhig bzhugs pa'i byams khang gsar bzhengs gnang bcas lha khang snga rjes gnyis kyi gnas gzhi la brten nas sku 'bum byams pa gling zhes mtshan du grags/rab byung bcu pa'i chu lug (1583)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtsho sog yul du phebs thengs rjes ma'i skabs zhing skyong nang sos gnas 'dir gdan drangs pa bzhin phebs te nyin shas ring sku mtshams su bzhugs pa'i gzims khang zhig kyang bzhengs shing/sgom rin chen chen brtson 'grub rgyal mtshan dang/tsho pa lnga'i nang sos gtsos pa'i sbyin bdag rnams la tshong kha'i yul gyi lte gnas 'dir dgon sde zhig tshugs na 'phral phugs legs tshul gyi bka' slob gnang ba ltar dang len zhus shing/rgyal ba rang nyid kyi 'dra thang/lha mo dmag zor ma'i rten thang/gnas chung chos skyong gi rten thang bcas gnang nas rab gnas stsal/zi na klu rgya'i sde pa'i khyim rgyud la gnas chung chos skyong khog phebs dgos pa'i dam bsgrags mdzad pa bzhin de nas mi rabs bcu gsum kyi bar du khog phebs byung/rab byung bcu pa'i sa byi (1588)lor rgyal dbang mchog gi bka' bzhin gser sdong byang chub mchod rten gyi dbyibs su bsgyur ba sogs skabs babs kyi dgos pa dmigs bsal can la brten bzo dbyibs 'gyur ba btang zhing/phyogs mtha'i nye skor dang/thag ring sog yul bcas nas slob gnyer phebs mi je mang du song ste grwa tshogs 'phel rgyan chen po byung bar brten ring bzhin mtshan nyid grwa tshang dpal ldan bshad sgrub gling dang/rgyud pa grwa tshang gsang sngags bde chen gling/gso rig grwa tshang gzhan phan nor bu'i gling/dus 'khor grwa tshang rigs ldan blo gsal gling/'chams pa grwa tshang bcas grwa tshang lnga byung/tshogs chen 'du khang yang khri thog bcu drug pa a kya shes rab bzang po'i skabs rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa sbrul (1689)lor ka ba brgyad cu'i bar rgya skyed btang zhing/de nas rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me sprel (1776)lor a kya rin po che blo bzang chos kyi nyi ma /sA sar tA la'i bla ma blo bzang chos dar bcas kyis mthun rkyen sbyong gnang gis p+sangar yod tshogs chen 'du khang la ka ba bdun cu don bzhi gsar du kha snon mdzad de ka ba brgya dang lnga bcu nga bzhi yod pa zhig tu rgya skyed gnang zhing/g.yas g.yon rgyab mdun rnams kyi lha khang dang/gzims khangs gong 'og /grwa tsang khag gi 'du khang/btsan khang/spyi so khang/dpar khang bcas rgya khyon spyi khre gru bzhi ma stong phrag 'ga' zhig yod/1 mtshan nyid grwa tshang dpal ldan bshad sgrub gling rab byung bcu pa'i chu yos (1603)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bzhi pa yon tan rgya mtsho sog yul nas dbus su phebs pa'i lam bar dgon pa 'dir phebs skabs 'dul ba chos rje 'od zer rgya mtsho gdan sa'i khrir bskor gzhag thog /mtshan nyid grwa tshang zhig 'dzugs gos pa'i bka' phebs pa ltar rab byung bcu pa'i chu byi (1612)lor 'dul ba chos rjes thog mar bsdus chung/bsdus 'bring/bsdus chen/blo rigs/rtags rigs bcas rnam 'grel 'dzin grwa lnga dang/phar phyin 'dzin grwa gnyis yod pa'i mtshan nyid grwa tshang gsar du btsugs/de nas khri thog nyi shu rtsa gnyis pa stag 'tsher blo bzang rdo rje'i skabs dbu ma'i 'dzin grwa gsar 'dzugs gnang zhing/khri thog nyer brgyad pa chu bzang rin po che ngag dbang thub bat+na dbang phyug skabs phar phyin skabs bzhi pa'i 'dzin grwa gsar du btsugs pas phar phyin 'dzin grwa bzhi dang/dus tshon zhib khra ma gsal yang snga rjes su 'dul ba'i 'dzin grwa dang/mdzod kyi 'dzin grwa/dkar rabs 'dzin grwa bcas 'dzin grwa bcu gsum btsugs/lo gcig gi chos thog la dpyid chos sngon rjes gnyis la zla ba re re/dbyar chos zla ba gcig /dbyar nags chos thog zla ba gcig dang zla phyed/ston chos zla ba gcig /bar chos zhag bco lnga/dgun chos zla ba gcig bcas yod pa dang/slob khrid kyi yig cha thun mong ma yin pa rje btsun chos kyi rgyal mtshan dang 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa rnam gnyis kyi gsung rtsom spyi don dang mtha' dpyod rnams yin/khri thog nyi shu pa mkhan po no min han blo bzang don grub skabs rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa khyi (1718)lor lha sa smon lam chen mo'i phyag srol ltar smon lam rab 'byams pa'i dge bshes dam bca' 'jog srol btsugs yod/2 rgyud pa grwa tshang gsang sngags bde chen gling ni rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa glang (1649)lor ki na chos rje legs pa rgya mtshos grwa pa sum cu so gnyis la slob khrid dang sbyong brdar mdzad de gsar 'dzugs gnang zhing/rjes su 'phel rgyas 'gro rgyur dgongs te rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa stag (1798)lor ka ba bzhi bcu zhe brgyad yod pa'i 'du khang gsar bzhengs thog /dbus kyi rgyud smad pa'i phyag srol ltar gyi 'don chog dang/chos 'chad nyan sogs kyi sgrig srol cha tshang ba'i steng du lcags mkhar zur dgu pa'i cho ga yang 'dzugs par mdzad pa dang/mkhan thog nyer drug pa mgon gya grags pa rgyal mtshan skabs sngar yod 'du khang ka ba zhe brgyad kyi steng du ka ba bcu gnyis gsar du bsnan nas ka drug cu bar rgya skyed mdzad/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me bya (1837)lor rgyud pa'i mkhan rabs zhe bdun pa ser sa mkhan chen dgon ma chog bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho'i skabs/rgyud smad grwa tshang gi phyag bzhes ltar gyi rab gnas dge legs char 'bebs kyi chog tshogs 'don du 'dzugs par mdzad yod/3 gso rig grwa tshang gzhan phan nor bu'i gling ni thog mar rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags yos (1711)lor chu bzang rin po che blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyis sngags pa grwa tshang zhig 'dzugs gnang mdzad kyang de nas lo bcu gnyis song ba'i chu yos (1723)lor mtsho sngon ching wang blo bzang bstan 'dzin gyis man ching gong ma'i srid gzhung la ngo log gi dus zing bslangs pa lhing 'jags gtong skabs sku 'bum gdon par gtor bshig chen po byung ba'i rkyen gyis grwa tshang rtse med du song rjes sku 'bum khri thog nyer gcig pa ser dris tshul khrims rin chen gyis rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing sbrul (1725)lor sngags pa grwa tshang de sman pa grwa tshang du bsgyur nas rtsa rgyud sogs rgyud bzhi la 'dzin grwa bzhi dang/lam rim 'dzin grwa gcig bcas khag lngar phye ste bod sman gyi rig pa'i gzhung lugs dang/lag len sbyor brdar/rgyugs sprod bcas kyi phyag srol cha tshang gsar 'dzugs gnang yod/4 dus 'khor grwa tshang rigs ldan blo gsal gling ni rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me glang (1817)lor khri thog zhe lnga pa che shes rin po che ga dbang bshad sgrub bstan pa'i nyi ma'i skabs gra grangs nyi shu lhag tsam zhig la slob khrid sbyong brdar dang/'du khang gsar bzhengs bcas lo ngo gsum gyi ring legs par grub ste/khri thog zhe bdun pa gser tog rin po che ye shes thub bstan rgya mtsho'i skabs dus 'khor grwa tshang dngos su 'dzugs gnang mdzad pa yin/5 'chams pa grwa tshang ni khri thog nyi shu pa mkhan po no min han blo bzang don grub skabs rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa khyi (1718)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho sku 'bum du bzhugs pa'i go skabs dang bstun nas rtse rnam rgyal grwa tshang gi 'chams dpon zhig las 'chams khag 'ga' zhig bslab sbyangs byed du bcug ste 'chams pa grwa tshang gsar 'dzugs gnang ba zhig yin/dgon pa 'dir lha khang dang/gtsug lag khang/grwa shag bcas bsdoms pa'i khang mig dgu stong lhag tsam dang/lha khang gcig pu yang brgyad brgya lhag yod cing/dge 'dun zhal grangs mang ba'i dus su sum stong drug brgya tsam yod/dgon pa 'di nas bstan 'dzin gyi skyes chen grangs las 'das pa byon pa so so'i mdzad rnam da nga/lha khang khag gi nang sku gsung thugs rje gang dang gang yod/hos hos dang za lar gyi dmag 'khrug snga rjes skabs nyams rgud ji byung sogs zhib par gser tog rin po che blo bzang tshul khrims rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i (sku 'bum byams pa gling gi gdan rabs don ldan tshangs pa'i dbyangs snyan )mtsho sngon mi rigs dpe skrun khang gi lcags dkar ma der gzigs}
sku 'bum chen mo|{gung thang bla ma zhang rin po che sku ma gshegs gong tsam du bzhengs 'go tshugs nas 'phros rnams sku gshegs rjes nye gnas dar ma gzhon nu dang mnyam med shAkya ye shes kyis bzhengs pa de yin}
sku 'bum thang|{lha sa grong khyer gyi nye 'dabs shar phyogs su yod pa'i thang zhig ste/sngar rwa lo tsA ba rdo rje grags pa rab byung dang po'i gong gi me 'brug (1017)lo nas rab byung gsum pa'i sa rta 91198)lo'i bar dgung lo brgya dang brgyad cu bzhugs par dngos slob rwa ye shes seng ges mdzad pa'i rnam thar nang gsal zhing/dgung lo brgya dang lnga bcu yol nas phal cher lha sa'i shar phyogs ldan gyi lung par bzhugs pa las thengs gcig thang de'i thog dbang gnas skabs mi tshogs 'tshang ka shin tu che ba'i rkyen gyis sku 'bum gcig la sprul nas dbang gnang bas de nas bzung thang der sku 'bum thang du thogs pa yin zhes gong gsal rnam thar der 'khod 'dug /deng sang sa gnas de'i rgyud du grong mi'i sdod khang gis khengs nas yod}
sku 'bum mthong grol chen mo|{jo nang kun mkhyen du grags pa dol po bshes rab rgyal mtshan gyis rab byung lnga pa'i me stag (1326)lo nas lo bcu bdun tsam gdan sa mdzad cing/gdan sa'i lo lnga pa lcags rta (1330)lor yi mchod rten la nang lha khang brgya rtsa brgyad yod pa bzhengs gnas mdzad/yang rab byung bdun pa'i me lug (1427)lor rgyal rtse chos rgyal rab brtan kun bzang 'phags kyis rgyal rtse lha khang chen mo'i g.yas ngos su sku 'bum bkra shis sgo mang phyi mchod rten la nang lha khang brgya rtsa brgyad yod pa'i mtho tshad deng sang gi spyi khre ltar rtsis ni spyi khre gru bzhi bcu lhag tsam dang/rmang gzhi'i rgya khyon spyi khre gru bzhi ma nyis stong nyis brgya tsam gyi tshad yod pa bzhengs pa ni bod sa gnas su bzhengs pa'i mchod rten yod tshad kyi nang che shos yin/mchod rten de gnyis kar sku 'bum mthong grol chen mo zhes so so'i gnas yig dang dkar chag tu gsal}
sku tshab nyer lnga|{sku 'dra nyer lnga yod pa'i lo rgyus 'dra 'dug ste re zhig brtags par bya'o/_/'di nyid ri khrod pa byams pa ngag dbang gis mdzad pa'i (pad ma 'byung gnas kyi rnam thar ngo mtshar phun sum tshogs pa'i rgya mtsho )las gsungs so/_}
sku tshab gter lnga|{spyir sku tshab chen pa gu ru dngos dang khyad med pa'i sku 'dra lnga yin la/de gnas cher lngar gnyer du sbas pa la sku tshab gter lngar grags pa yin te/de yang rin po che sna lnga las grub pa'i sku 'dra khyed par du 'phags pa sku'i rten de nyid mkha' ri gangs kyi bsam 'grub tu sbas/bye ma a krong las grub pa'i sku 'dra sin+d+hu ras byug pa gsung gi rten de nyid mon kha seng ge bsam 'grub tu sbas/mkhar ba nag po las bzhengs pa'i sku 'dra thugs kyi rten de nyid rta mgrin brag khung gi bsam 'grub phug tu sbas/dri med shes las bzhengs pa'i sku 'dra 'phrin las kyi rten de nyid yar lha sham po'i bsam 'grub phug du sbas pa'o/_}
sku tshigs|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas gsungs pa'i mi gshin po'i rjes 'jug mchod 'bul bya thabs shig ste/bod du gshin po'i nye 'brel rnams kyis zhag bdun re'i mtshams su mchod 'bul byas pa der yongs grags su bdun tshigs zer ba de'i zhe sa'i tshig yin cing/bdun tshigs zhes pa'i go don dang/de'i lo rgyus dang khungs/byas pa'i dgos pa/ji ltar bya tshul bcas gsham gsal bdun tshigs zhes pa'i 'grel bshad der gzigs}
sku tshe brtan pa|{sku tshe brtan pa'i mchod rten zhes yongs grags su rnam rgyal mchod rten zhes 'bod pa de yin/mchod rten 'di'i bzo dbyings ni/sa 'dzin dang/dge bcu bum pa/chos 'khor sogs mchod rten brgyad spyi dang 'dra ba la/bang rim gsum las med pa dang de gsum ka'i dbyibs zlum por yod pa zhig yin}
sku tshe 'dir mchog gi dngos grub brnyes pa|{gsang sngags kyi lam bsgoms pa la brten nas skye ba 'di'i ring la sangs rgyas pa}
sku tshe'i lnga cha btang|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi lo rgyud thog bshad srol/sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa'i sku tshe'i tshad dgung lo brgya yin kyang/dgos pa'i dbang gis sku tshe'i tshad kyi lnga tsha gcig blos btang nas dgung lo brgyad cu tham pa la dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das pa yin zhes gsal}
sku tshe'i tshad|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung las/bskal bzang sangs rgyas stong gi sku tshe'i tshad ring thung mi 'dra ba sna tshogs gsungs yod/zhib par (mdo sde bskal bzang )las gsal}
sku tshom bu'i dkyil 'khor|{rgya gar gyi grub chen nA ro pa'i lugs kyi rje btsun rdo rje rnal 'byor ma'i byin brlabs dang bdag 'jug gi skabs ras bris dkyil 'khor gyi dbus su rnal 'byor ma'i p+saku mtshon byed sin d+hu ra'i tshom bu zhig 'jog srol yod pa de yin}
sku mtshams bcad|{dus tshod nges can cig gi bar du rang dang phyi rol mi'i bar gyi 'a brel ba mtshams bcad nas sgom sgrub la rtse gcig tu gzhol ba}
sku mtshal gnyer|{dgra sha dang/sha lan/khrag /lan len pa'i zhe sa'i tshig }
sku 'tsho ba'i bon po|{gna' rabs bod kyi btsan po ring yung mang che bar btsan po'i sku yi rim gro byed mkhan gyi bon po re yod tshul (bon gyi chos 'byung )nang gsal bas de la yongs grags su sku bon zer}
sku zhang|{sku zhang zhes spyir na ma rgyud kyi spun mched zhang po'am a zhang zhes pa'i zhe sa yin zhing/de yang a mes sangs rgyas ye shes kyi mi rgyud rim byon la sa skya bas pa sku zhang zhes che bstod kyi 'bod srol byung ba de ni lce btsun shes rab 'byung gnas kyi yab yul 'bum yi gces po stag gi rgyal mtshan la g.yu thog sgra gser bzang byung zhing/de khyim par babs rjes bu 'bum me dang 'bum dar gnyis byung ba nas rim bzhin sa mes sangs rgyas ye shes kyi mi rgyud mang po bar ma thad par byung/a mes sangs rgyas ye shes la sras lcam sring drug byung (rnga sgra/mgon po dpal/kun dga' bum/sro mo ma gcig mkhar 'gro 'bum/jo jo stag 'bum/jo jo ye shes 'bum bcas )pa'i nang nas sras mo bgres pa ma gcig mkha' 'gro 'bum ni sa skya'i bdag chen 'gro mgon phyag na rdo rje'i bdag mor bzhes shing/'gro gon phyag na'i sras d+harma pA la rak+Shi ta la bdag mo ma gcig mkha' 'gro 'bum gyi gcung mo jo jo stag 'bum blangs pa'i sras rat+na pha la rak+Shi ta 'khrungs pa bcas la brten a mes sangs rgyas ye shes kyi mi rgyud rim byung rnams la sa skya pas sku zhang zhes che bstod kyis 'bod srol byung ba yin}
sku zhang kun dga' don grub|{a mes sangs rgyas ye shes kyi sras bgres pa sku zhang rnga sgra la sras gcig las ma byung ba der grags pa rgyal mtshan zer zhing/de la sras kun dga' don grub/rin chen rgyal mtshan/ye shes kun dga' gsum byung ba'i bgres pa der hor tsa kun dga' don grub kyang zer/khong gis rab byung drug pa'i shing khyi (1334)lor zhwa la'i bstan 'gyur bris ma bzhengs shing zhwa lu'i gtsug lag khang gi phyogs bzhir rgyud sde bzhi'i dkyil 'khor ldebs bris sogs bzhengs/yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma tho kan the'i mur gyi khri lo dang po rab byung drug pa'i chu bya (1333)lor thong jing tu'u yon hro'o 'ja' sa dngul dam rta mgo nor bu 'bar ba bcas gnang nas zhwa lu'i khri skor gyi dpon du bsgos pa bcas (byang chos 'byung )du mdor bsdus tsam gsal}
sku zhang dkon mchog rgyal mtshan|{sku zhang kun dga' don grub la sras gnyis te dkon mchog rgyal mtshan dang dngos grub rgyal mtshan gnyis yod pa'i che ba yin}
sku zhang grags pa rgyal mtshan|{sku zhang rnga sgra la p+saras gcig las ma byung ba de yin/des dgung lo chung dus yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma o jol thu yi drung du phebs/shel gyi 'on tse rma bya'i gzugs chang gis gang ba gnang/dbus gtsang mnga' ris skor gsum gyi khyim bdag hu shri tu'u yon hro'i go gnas dang/dngul tham stag mgo ma nor bu gnyis pa dang/zhwa lu khri skor gyi lha sde mi sde thams cad kyi bdag thob gnang/sog yul dang rgya yul gyi bzo bo mkhas pa bod du bkug nas zhwa lu'i lha khang chen mo phyogs bzhir glo 'bur bzhi dang/steng ge lha khang phyogs bzhi'i steng rgya phibs g.yu rtsi ma/khor yug tu mda' yas g.yu rtsi can yod pa/nang du dus gsum sangs rgyas sogs kyi sku brnyan ha cang mang po bzhugs pa bzhengs shing/rab byung lnga pa'i lcags sprel (1320)lor kun mkhyen bu ston rin po che dgung lo sum cu so gcig la phebs pa spyan drangs nas/mdo sngags kyi 'chad nyan dang cho ga phyag bzhes kyi rgyun rnam par dag pa bod du gang yod btsugs pa'i sbyin bdag gi gtso bo gnang ba sogs mdzad rjes rlabs che/lo rgyus cung zad zhib par gong gsal (myang chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 168nas 173bar gsal ba der gzigs}
sku zhang dga' 'bum|{a mes chen po sangs rgyas ye shes kyi sras chung ba yin/'di'i lo rgyus ma rnyed}
sku zhang mgon po dpal|{a mes chen po sangs rgyas ye shes la sras gsum byung ba'i 'bring po yin/gcen po sku zhang rnga sgra'i rjes su zhwa lu'i khri dpon byas/gtsug lag khang gi glo 'bur byang ma dang/thub dbang gi gser sku khri rgyab yol dang bcas pa/'bum rgyal 'bring bsdus gsum bcas bzhengs tshul (myang chos 'byung )las gsal}
sku zhang snga sgra|{a mes chen po sangs rgyas ye shes la sras lcam sring drug byung ba'i che ba yin/'di'i lo rgyus gsal ba ma rnyed}
sku zhang rnga sgra|{a mes chen po sangs rgyas ye shes la sras lcam sring drug byung ba'i che ba yin/'di'i lo rgyus gsal ba ma rnyed}
