skor gsum|{1 pu hrengs (ma pham g.yu mtsho nas brtsis pa'i lho ngos )dang/mang yul (deng sang skyid grong du 'bod pa/pu hrengs kyi shar ding re'i nub ngos su thag nye sar yod/) zangs dkar (pu hrengs kyi nub khul du yin nam snyam)bcas gsum po de skor tsho gcig dang/2 li/bru sha/spal ti gsum skor tsho gcig ste/deng sang shin cang yu gur rigs rang skyong ljongs kyi khongs su yod dam snyam/3 zhang zhung (mnga' ris gu ge mtho lding yod sa'i brgyud )dang/khri sde stod/khri sde smad bcas de dag yang mnga' ris byang brgyud shin cang dang thag nye ba'i sar yod tshod la zhib cha ma nges pas 'bri bar ma nus so/_}
skor gsum spyi khyab|{rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me 'brug (1664)lor la dwags rgyal po seng ge rnam rgyal nas chos lugs grub mtha'i phyogs lhung gis phyogs de'i dge ldan ring lugs 'dzin pa ru thog mtho lding dgon dang/pu hrengs shes 'phel gling sogs la bsam sbyor ngan gshoms kyis chos byed dge 'dun pa rnams bzhugs bzod mi bde ba'i thog /mi sde rnams la'ang khral dmag mi mnar gcod ji snyed btang bar brten khul de'i yul dgos ser skya spyi nas tA la'i bla mar sku phreng p+lang pa chen por skyabs bcol re 'bod zhu bcar skabs tA la'i bla ma snga pa chen pos gdan sa chen po bkra shis lhun po'i chos khrims pa dga' ldan tshe dbang gtso bor gyur pa'i bod sog 'go dmag gtos che dang bcas mnga' ris su mngags rdzong gnang bas la dwags rgyal po dpung bcas cham la phab nas mnga' ris skor gsum dbang 'og tu bsdus pa de nas bzung thog mar rgyal po dga' ldan tshe dbang rang nyid nas skor gsum spyi la dbang sgyur gyis lho hin rdu/nub la dwags/byang shing cang bcas sa mtshams khag la so mi 'dzugs rgyu dang/nang khul du thog rdzong/mda' pa kha/rtsa hreng rdzong/pu hrengs rdzong/dge rtse shar nub/'brong pa lho byang sogs skor gsum lho byang yul 'brog so so'i thon khungs la zhib tshags kyi khral rigs 'bab deb gtan 'bebs dang/gser kha/tshwa kha/tshong 'dus khag bcas la do dam bya rgyu sogs kyi srol btod/lhag par sgar khongs rdzong 'go so sor spur 'bor mang nyung la ma ltos par gser kha khag mang yod stabs rtse 'phral bde las khungs nas lo ltar gser dpon gzhung tshong pa zhes gtong lam yod pa ltar rdzong 'go so so'i thon 'bor la gzhigs pa'i ('bab deb dbyig mdzod chen mo )nang gsal gyi gser khral 'jal dgos pa dang/de rjes skor gsum spyi khyab shog skor rim bzhi re gtong lam byung 'dug rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing lug (1835)lo tsam nas gnas lnga pa'i tog 'dzin shod drung gnyis la phyi'i tha'i ji'i go gnas bstsal te sgar dpon shar nub ces gtong srol yod/mnga' ris ni bod kyi mtha' mtshams kyi sa khul la brten lho nub byang bcas kyi sa mtshams so sor dogs can phyi'i mi rigs gseng shor mi 'byung ba'i 'a brel yod rdzong 'go so sor bkag 'doms thog /blo dogs chod min rigs skor gsum spyi khyab par snyan seng zhu dgos dang/sa mtshams skor sogs gal che'i don gdan thag gcod mi thub pa'i rigs bka' shag la dgongs skor zhu dgos pa/de min khral bsdu khrims snon dang/gser kha/tshwa kha/tshong 'dus khag bcas la do dam dang/rta lo nam shar la lha lo skor chen zhes bod dbus gtsang khams gsum dang/hin rdu/la dwags khul bcas nas gangs ti si dang ma pham g.yu mtshor gnas skor dad 'dus mi tshogs che zhing/sa zla'i yar tshes 15nyin sgar dpon khag gi bla ma las sde/dmag dpon zhes rdzong 'go so so'i khongs gi mi drag dpon rgyud khag bcas nas ti si'i skor lam du lo ltar dar chen sku bzhengs zhu rgyu sogs de snga rgyal po dga' ldan tshe dbang gi lam ltar byed srol yod/shing yol (1915)lor ja tshwa las khungs btsugs te dbus gtsang rgya khyab tu tshwa bal sho khral bsdu dam gtong lam bzhin skor gsum khul du thog dang/mda' pa pa/spu hreng/rgya nyi ma/yan chod steng kha bcas la tshwa bal sho khral bsdu dam rtse drung re gtong ba bcas so/_}
