skyabs mgon blo bzang snyan grags|{lha sa grong khyer gyi byang ngos spa ri khug dang 'bras spungs gnyis bar dgon pa gser rtse dang/dgon pa gsar shod gnyis yod/dgos pa gsar rtse bkra shis theg chen gling thog mar phyag btab mkhan ni se ra byes bya brag khang tshad kyi dge bshes blo bzang snyan grags zhu ba bya bral dgon gsar rin po che'i sku phreng dang po de yin/dam pa de'i 'khrungs yul sa ngan phyogs nas yin cing/dgung lo chung dus dbus su phebs nas ser byes grwa tshang du slob gnyer gnang ste dge bshes thon nas phur lcog ngag dbang byams pa dang/brag ri ngag dbang don grub sogs dam pa du ma'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos mtha' yas pa gsan thog /se ra rtse dang/ke'u tshang/ra kha brag /mkhar rdo sogs nyer skor gyi ri da mang por sgrub pa nyams bzhes gtso bor mdzad cing/thugs dam gyi rab gseng dang bstun nas dad ldan slob ma so so'i 'dod mos dang 'tshams pa'i dbang khrid long sogs rgyas bsdus skabs dang sbyar te gnang ba dang/slob ma rnams la ngo 'dzin sogs mi mdzad par bka' bkyon phyag 'bebs sogs 'phral 'phral du mdzad pa lho brag mar pa lo tsA dang dbyer med pa zhig yod tshul 'a brel yod dam pa 'ga' zhig gi rnam thar nang gsal zhing/brag ri ngag dbang don grub sku gshegs par dam pa de'i sku tshab tu bskor gzhag nang ba lta dgon gsar bkra shis theg chen gling du sku tshe tha ma'i bar rgyun bzhugs gnang 'dug /'khrungs lo gsal bar 'khod pa ma mthong yang/(rdo ring rnam thar )las gung paN+Ditas sa ngan du dmag drangs pa'i lo ste rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags bya (1780)lor sku gshegs tshul gsal}
