skyed lde nyi ma mgon|{mnga' bdag dpal 'khor btsan po btsun mo che chung gnyis yod pa'i che ba'i sras yin/btsan po glang dar ma bkrongs pa'i rjes su 'bangs gyen log byung ste mnga' bad dpal 'khor btsan bkrongs nas bod nas gnas kyi srid dbang mnga' bdag yum brten la shor bar brten/dpa' 'khor btsan gyi sras skyid lde nyi ma mgon dang/khri bkra shis brtsegs pa dpal gnyis stod phyogs su yul byol du phebs shing/skyid lde nyi ma mgon stod mkha' ris su phebs skabs dge bshes bkra shis btsan gyis spu rengs su bzhugs par zhus te 'bro bza' 'khor skyong btsun mor phul ba khab tu bzhes ba la sras gsum (che ba dpal gyi mgon/'bring po bkra shis mgon/chung ba lde gtsug mgon bcas )byung zhing/sku mkhar nyi bzungs brtsigs te mngar ris skor gsum dbang du bsdus nas sras gsum la skor gsum so sor bgos nas gnang zhing/che ba dpal gyi mgon la mnga' ris mar yul/'bangs khung nag btsan/shar ru thog dang/gser kha gog /lad kyi bde ma chog dkar po/mtshams kyi rwa ba mdar po/wam le yi mig gi pha bong g.yag lder/rdo bug pa can yan chad dang/byang gser kha mgon po/nub kha che'i la rtsa la gtogs pa rnams gnang/bar pa bkra shis mgon la gu ge spu hreng rtse dang bcas pa gnang/chung ba lde gtsug mgon la zangs dkar sgo gsum/sbi ti/sbi chog dang bcas pa gnang ba yin/zhib par bod ljongs spyi tshogs tshan rig khang nas dpar skrun byas pa'i (bod kyi lo rgyus der ther khag lnga )shog grangs 184nas 185bar gsal ba der gzigs/gzhan yang (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma'i stod cha grangs 434nas 435bar 'di dang bshad tshul mi 'dra ba 'dug kyang/'dir ka thog rig 'dzin chen pos mdzad pa'i (bod kyi rgyal rabs gser gyi phreng ba )nas gsungs pa de rang khungs btsan par bsams nas de ltar bris pa lags}
skyid sdug gi 'thab len|{khyim tshang phan tshun bar du skyid po byung dus legs gsol rten 'brel dang/mgron 'bod lag rtags skyel res yod pa dang/sdug po byung dus rogs rab byed res kyi 'brel pa dam po yod pa'i don la go }
