skyid sna g.yu thog khang gsar|{stod lung bde chen rdzong chu bzang shang khongs skyid sna sgang g.yu thog khang gsar zhes pa de ni g.yu thog yod tan mgon po'i 'khrungs khang yin pa dang/de yang g.yo thog yon tan mgon po'i mes po 'dre rje rgya gar brdza zhes pa de yul stod lung skyid snra bzhugs te 'gro ba nad pa'i don du skad cig tsam yang mi g.yel ba mdzad pa'i tshe dus shig nad pa zhig la bskor du byon pas stod lung zam mo che'i 'gram du bud med gcig byung ste khyed bdag gi yul du phebs par zhu zer nas thag ring nas brag nag po smug rum 'thibs pa (rdza nag rtse mo zhes pa'i ri bo )zhig 'dug pa de'i phyogs su dar dkar yug gcig brkyangs pa'i steng du zhabs bzhag ma thag sngar ma mthong ba'i yul mi mang po yod pa zhig gi dbus su mkhar chen po zhig rag g.yang na skya 'dzar re 'dug pa'i nang na klu bdud sngags pa nag po thor lcog can gyi gzugs can lus bong haa cang che ba zhig nad kyis btab ste 'khun sgra dang sdug skad 'don bzhin yod pa des bdag gis yul che ge mor lo tog la gnod pa byas pas/ser srung gi thun phog lags pas nad 'di las skyabs su gsol zer/'dre rjes gzigs pas sha rus pags pa rtsa rgyud rnams la yungs dkar thim nas 'dug par bya khyung lnga pa dang dngul chus nang nas phul/byug pa rgyan 'khor gyi nas byug pas de mar kho nad las grol/klu bdud de dad par gyur nas srog snying phul te rgyud 'dzin dang bcas par sdong grogs byed par khas blangs thog dgos 'dul byung ba'i nor bus gtsos longs spyod dpag med phul/gdan 'dren mkhan bud med des dar yug brkyangs pa'i steng zhabs bzhag ma thag zam sner 'byor/mos kyang bya dga' 'bul ba yin pas sang nyid 'dir phebs zer ba ltar byon pas/phu chu rgyas pa'i gseb nas bud med kyi ro gser g.yus brgyan pa zhig brnyed par snying rje chen po 'khrungs shing rgyan rnams nyar tshags mdzad nas gser yug rnams khang pa'i yang steng du bkram pas lug rdzi bas de mthong ste mkhas pa mthong ba don ldan la g.yu'i thog 'dug byas pase nas bzung g.yo thog ces grags so/_}
skyid pa'i gdung rabs phyed dang bcu gsum|{bod kyi lo rgyus yig cha mang che ba'i nang bshad srol la/btsan po lha tho tho ri nas btsan po khri las pa can gyi bar la gdung rabs bcu gsum song ba las/mu ne btsan po sku tshe thung ba'i dbang gis phyed du brtsis pa yin zhes dang/de yang btsan po mang p+sarong mang btsan ma bgrangs pa'i gdung rabs phyed dang bcu gsum zhes (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma'i stod cha shog grangs 419par gsungs pa ni dpa' bo gtsug lag gis bzhed par btsan po khri lde srong btsad dang mu tig btsad po gnyis gang zag tha dad pa gnyis yin par bzhes pa'i skyon gyis tshig la 'gal zla byung ba yin zhing/btsan po de gnyis ming gi rnam grangs yin par (rgyal po bka' thang )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 63na 6par slob dpon mtshan gsol mu tig btsan po zhes/yab kyi mtshan gsol khri lde srong btsan zhes/_/nang blon mtshan gsol mjing yon sad na legs/_/zhes ming gi rnam grangs su gsal por gsungs pod pa de rang khungs btsan par snang}
