skyid shod|{lha sa'i gtsang po la ming dgos skyid chu dang de'i 'bab yul gyi lung pa'i ming la skyid shog zer/de la stod smad gnyis te 'bri gung gi sa sde rdzogs mtshams ldan dang 'brom stod stag rtse khul yan chod 'di tsam la skyid stod dang/de'i man chad yang lung gtsang po dang skyid chu 'dres mtshams chu shul yan skyid smad la ngos 'dzin dgos pa 'dra}
skyid shod kyi zhabs drung a dpal|{'di'i ming ngo ba bsod nams rnam rgyal zer zhing skyid shod sde pa g.yul rgyal nor bu dang/ma zhogs bza' dgos dgos kyis bu yin/rab byung bcu pa'i me khyi (1586)lor skyes/'dis skyid shod dga' ldan gyi srid 'dzin byas pa'i rang gtsang pa rgyal po dang 'thab 'khrug byas te thog mar rgyal kha thob kyang rjes su pham nyes chen po byang nas se 'bras gnyis gtsang dmag gis gtor zhing/sde pa rang nyid kyang po tA lar yos pa'i 'phags pa lo ke shA ra'i sku brnyan khyer nas mtsho sngon gyi sog po skyabs bcol bya dgos byung ba sogs 'brel yod lo rgyus mang po zhig gi nang gsal ba de yin/deng rabs ro rgyus smra ba 'ga' zhig gis bris pa'i yod kyi lo rgyus nang skyid shod zhabs drung g.yul rgyal nor bu la sde pa a dpal zer ba yin zhes bris pa nor 'khrul yin}
skyid shod dga' ldan|{'di skor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga par mdzad pa'i (deb ther dpyid kyi rgyal mo'i glu dbyangs)lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 182nas 185bar gsal ba dang/skyid shod sde pa bkra shis rab brtan gyis brtsams pa'i (sde pa dga' ldan pa'i gdung rabs )bris ma gshis las gsal ba don bsdus te bkod par/skyid shod yang phyogs gling par mi chung don rgyal zhes 'bod pa zhig byung ba des tshal pa khri dpon dga' bde bzang po (rab byung drug pa'i me stag 1386lo nas rab byung bdun pa'i lcags stag 1410lo'i bar yin )gtugs nas g.yog khongs su bsdad/rab byung bdun pa'i chu sbrul (1413)lor skabs de'i tshal pa'i bla dpon zung 'brel mdzad po spyan snga dngos grub rgyal mtshan gyis tshal pa'i srid dbang yongs rdzogs phag mo grub pa'i dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan la rtsis phul skabs phag gru'i khongs gtogs gzhi ka sne'u pa'i g.yog byas te las don go chod byung stabs nyang bran dga' ldan (deng sang lha sa'i nye 'dabs nyan bran nang ste kha skad la nyang ral ze ba de yin )gyi mi dpon du bsko gzhag byung bar brten de'i ming rgyud rnams la skyid shog dga' ldan pa'i ming thogs pa'i rgyu mtshan de ltar yin pa dang/mi chung don rgyal la bu gsum byung ba'i (che ba nang so bsod nams rgyal po'am dbyi nag bsod rgyal/'bring ba nang so dbang dar/chung ba nar so rnam sras )che ba sod nams rgyal po la sne'u rdzong dpon dpal 'byor rgyal pos yang phyir chos lung dang/yang dgon nang so'i khongs su gtogs pa phud pa'i klan ka gzhis kas gtsos pa'i lo sprel sna gdong phyin bdag bzung chog pa'i dbang cha spyad pas dpyi nag bsod rgyal du grags/'bring po dbang dar gyis pa snam bon grong gi bdag po byas shing/chung ba rnam sras kyis 'brong ri sngon rdzong gi bdag po byed mus kyi skabs rin spungs pa'i dmag gzhis ka sne'u par drangs skabs rdzong bzung ma thub par brten 'brong ri sngon rdzong rin spungs par rtsis sprad nas tshal gung thar du sger khang bzung nas zur bzhugs byas/dbyi nag bsod rgyal ba spun mched kyi bu nang so nam mkhar rgyal pos bar skabs shig chu shul lhun po rtse'i rdzong bzung yang/gzhas ka sne'u pa nang bzlos byung ba dang stabs bstun rin spungs pa'i dmag snye thang du 'byor skabs chu shul rdzong rin spungs par rtsis sprad/nang so nam mkha' rgyal po'i bu che ba tshe brtan rgyal po dang/chung ba bsod nams gnyis che ba rab tu byung zhing/chung ba bsod nams la sne'u pa rdzong dpon spu ma chen gnyis kyi 'dod par ma babs pa mang du byung bar ba rten rin spungs par ngo gtad de dmag mi sne bsu byas nas rab byung brgyad pa'i lcags glang (1481)lor rin spungs don yod rdo rje'i dmag dpung dbus su drangs skabs rin spungs par mgo btags te gzhis ka sne'u dang po tA la sogs rin spungs pa'i lag tu 'byor pa'i rogs rab byas pa'i byas rjes su sngar yod kyi 'dzin dbang thog snye mda' chu so kha yan 'dzin bdag chog pa'i dbang cha byung/de nas mi ring bar sde gdong gong ma ngag dbang bkra shis grags pa'i dus sne gdong gi dmag gzhung po rar 'byor skabs yar rgyab dpon rin chen bkra shis kyis mtshams sbyor byas te dga' ldanapa dang shag pa gnyis sne gdong sde srid kyi zhabs phyir gyur thog shag pa la skyor mo lung dang skyid shod g.yas ru'i ru dpon bskos shing/dga' ldan pa la bde chen stong gi (deng skabs lha sa'i nye 'dabs stag rtse rdzong yod sa de yin )khongs su gtogs pa'i chu lho byang rnams dang/yar rgyab par sne'u'i rdzong dpon gyi go gnas gnang/nang so dga' ldan pa skyid shod stod khul gyi khrims bdag gi dbang cha gnang/de'i bu ra nu lha srung ngam dmag dpon bsod nams rgyal por 'bod pa (rab byung brgyad pa'i me stag 1506nas rab byung dgu pa'i me rta 1546lo bar )sne gdong sde srid ngag dbang bkra shis rags pa chu shul du bzhugs skabs rin spungs pa'i dmag nye 'gram tu slebs par rgol lan bslog ste pham nyes su btang bar dpag dpon bsod nams rgyal po zhes pa'i ming gnang/de rjes dbus stod bye ri stag rtse ba'i ('phan po mdar yod pa de yin )shag pa dpon drung tshe dbang rnam rgyal gyi mi rgyud rdzogs par brten rab byung dgu pa'i shing bya (1525)lor dga' ldan pa dmag dpon bsod nams rgyal pos bye ri stag rtse ba'i mna' ma rdo rje bstan skyong rgyal mo 'ol kha stag rtser go log nas yod sa der la zla bsgril te dga' ldan pa dang bye ri stag tshe (stag rtse rdzong khongs thang dkar chus yod pa de yin cing/der stag rtse mi dbang gi pho brang gi shul yod )gnyis ka'i shul 'dzin byas pa nas sde srid stag rtse ba'i mi rgyud rim bzhin byung ba yin/zhib par gong gsal gyi yig cha khag gnyis po phan tshun bsdur nas gzigs}
skyid shod dga' ldan pa'i gdung rabs|{'di la skabs 'gar skyid shog dga' ldan pa'i mi rgyud rim byung gi lo rgyus yig la skyid shod sde pa zhabs drug bkra shis rab brtan gyis brtsams pa der go dgos pa dang/skabs 'gar skyid shod dga' ldan pa'i mi rgyud la go dgos/sde pa skyid shog dga' ldan pa'i lo rgyus mdor bsdus shig gong du skyid shod dga' ldan zhes pa'i 'grel bshad der gsal zhing/nga rang gis da phan mthong myong ba ni gong gsal de yin/de'i smad cha mdo mkhar zhabs drug ngag dbang tshangs dbyangs kyis brtsams pa zhig yod tshul dkar chag 'ga' zhig nang gsal yang da phan ma mthong lags}
