skyid shod sde pa chos rje|{gung ru skyid shong zhabs drung rin po che sku phreng dang po yin/rab byung bcu pa'i chu sbrul (1593)lor yab skyid shog dga' ldan pa'i sde pa g.yul rgyal nor bu dang/yum zhogs bza' byang sems dgos dgos gnyis kyi sras bzhi pa (che ba p+sade pa bsod nams rnam rgyal lam a dpal/'bring ba sde pa yid bzhin nor bu/de'i 'og mar rab brtan/chung ba zhabs drung rin po che )yin/mkhas grub rje'i sku tsha zhang zhung chos dbang grags pa dang/sgom sde shar pa nam mkha' rgyal mtshan gyi yang sring grags pa che zhing/yi ge 'bri klog sogs gang la sku ngal cher ma thogs par mkhyen pa'i thugs rab kyi rtsal phun sum tshogs pa zhig yod/dgung lo bcu gcig pa rab byung bcu pa'i chu yos (1603)lor dga' ldan khri chen dge 'dun rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas rab byung dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes shing/mtshan la ba stan 'dzin blo bzang rgya mtsho zhes gsol/rgyal pa sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gnyis kyi drung dang dbang dang rje gnang mang po zhig gsan/rje 'di'i yab kyis thugs gnyer gsan bzhes kyi ched du mtshan nyid grwa tshang zhig 'dzugs par dgongs nas chos grwa bkra shis 'byung gnas zhes pa zhig btsugs/rtsed thang byang ma khar gsar ba dpal 'byor bsod nams lhun grub dge rgan du gdan drangs te bsdus grwa dang/phar phyin/dbu ma/'dul ba/mdzod bcas sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa mdzad cing/gsang sngags rgyud sde rnam bzhi'i dbang lung khrid sogs rgya cher gsan/dgong lo bcu lnga bzhes pa rang byung bcu pa'i me lug (1607)lor yab 'das shing/gtsang pa dang/kong po/'bri gung pa/phag mo sogs karma bka' brgyud kyi sbyin bdag rnams phyogs gcig tu bsgril ba'i dmag dpung 'bri gung rgyud du drangs nas dge lugs pa'i dgon pa 'ga' zhig bcom zhing/'ga' zhig chos gas dang zhwa stabs bsgyur/skyid shod sde pa yid bzhin dang/sras po rab brtan gnyis btson du bzung zhing/skyid shog dga' ldan pa'i 'dzin khongs rdzong gzhis rgyu nor dang bcas pa btsan 'phrogs byas par ba rten/zhabs drung rin po che rang nyid lho kha sogs kyi dben gnas mang por sgrub pa nyams bzhes dang/slob gnyer zung 'brel gnang ste re zhig dbus phyogs su bzhugs/dgung lo nyer gsum bzhes pa rab byung bcu pa'i shing yos (1615)lor bkra shis lhun por paN chen rin po che blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyis mkhan po dang/las slob/gsang ston gsum ka mdzad de dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/bkra shis lhun po dang/snar thang/khro phu/rong byams chen sogs su gzhung chen pod lnga'i grwa skor mdzad cing/slar yang bkra shis lhun por phabs te paN chen rin po che'i nga nas mdo sngags kyi chos mtha' yas pa gnang nas gtsang khul gyi dben gnas mang por sgrub pa nyams bzhes gtso bo mdzad/dgung lo nyer drug bzhes pa sa rta (1618)lor sog pa lha btsun rgan gzhon dang/se chen da'i ching sogs thu med kyi rgyal rgyud rnams dang/ha ru hU la dang/khun du le chos khur sogs hal ha'i rgyal rgyud sde pa skyid shod pa bsod nams rnam rgyal (a dpal )se 'bras gnyis kyi tshogs 'du'i 'og 'dzin pa rnams gros mthun yas te sog dmag dang/sde pa skyid shog pa'i skya dmag /sa 'bras kyi ser dmag bcas kyis gtsang pa'i dmag dpung la phar rgol gyi gra sgrig byas par/gtsang pa rgyal po phun sum rnam rgyal gyis khri skor bcu gsum gyi dmag khrid nas dbus phyogs su lhags/bod zla drug pa'i tshes bco lnga nyin dmag 'thab byas par gtsang dmag stong phrag mang po bsad smad btang/gtsang dmag gi gdong len pa khag gcig 'bras spungs dgongs pa gtor bar rgyab ri'i rtser slebs shing/de 'phros gtsang dmag phal che ba bsad/de'i phyi nyin lha sa'i gtsang po'i 'gram tu gtsang pa'i dmag sgar sngar las che ba zhig btab pas sog dmag rnams sgra te bros pa dang/se 'bras kyi grwa pa dang/sde pa skyid shog pa sogs tshang ma 'ur stabs kyis 'phan po dang stag lung sogs su bros rjes gtsang dmag gis se 'bras gnyis gtor zhing/sde pa skyid shog pa'i rdzong gzhis rnams gtsang pas grogs pa bcas dus zing che bar brten rje 'di nyid mtsho sngon phyogs su bros byol phebs dgos byung ste mdo sman gyi dgon sde phal cher bar phebs nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun rgya cher spel/dgung lo zhe drug bzhes pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa stag (1638)lor sku gshegs/sku