skyid shong zhabs drung yid bzhin|{skyid shod dga' ldan pa'i sde pa g.yul rgyal nor bu'i bu gnyis pa yin/rab byung bcu pa'i sa glang (1589)lor skyes/rab byung bcu pa'i me lug (1607)lor 'bri gung pa dang phag mo grub pa'i dmag gis 'bri khung rgyud du yod pa'i dge lugs dgon pa rnams bcom skabs sde pa skyid shod pa'i bu gnyis btson du bzung nas mi gter nyar nye rab byung bcu pa'i lcags bya (1621)lo'i bar lo bcu lnga'i ring btson du sdod dgos byung zhing/de nas mtsho sngon phyogs su yul gyar nas mi ring bar 'das pa de yin}
skyid shod zhabs drung a khu bkra shis|{skyid shod dga' ldan pa'i sde pa bkra shis rab brtan la zer/skyid shod dga' ldan pa'i nang so chung ba bsod nams la bu gsum (che ba ra nu lha srung mang dmag dpon bsod nams rgyal po/'bring ba nang so don grub rgyal po/chung ba bkra shis rab brtan )byung ba'i chung ba yin/rab byung dgu pa'i lcags yol (1531)lor bye ri stag rtse'i kha bzhir 'khrungs/rab byung dag pa'i shing yol (1555)lor yar rgyab pa sde gdong sde srid la ngo log ste dmag drangs nas gra phyi lhun grub gling bzung ba bcas la brten/gzhis ka brag dkar khongs gtogs rnams skyid shod dga' ldan par 'dzin bdag chog pa'i dbang cha sprad de skyid shod kyi dmag dpung rnams lho khar drangs te yar rgyab pa'i dpung rnams phyir 'bud kyi byas rjes bzhag rab byung bcu pa'i sa 'brug (1568)lor skyid shod dga' ldan pa'i nang so don grub rgyal po 'das rjes skyid shod dga' ldan pa'i srid 'dzin gyi 'gan khur byas/rab byung bcu pa'i sa yos (1568)lor brag dkar ba'i lcang rin chen rgyal mo 'das pa'i dge sgrub gyi ched du dga' ldan dngul gdung gi sgo rgyan gser sbyangs las grub pa gsar bzo dang/rab byung bcu pa'i lcags sbrul (1581)lor lha sa gtsug lag khang gi jo bo rin po che'i dbu thog gi rgya phibs gsar bzo dang/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtsho sog yul du phebs rjes phyag mdzod chos bzang 'phrin las kyis 'bras spungs dga' ldan pho brang rgya bskyed 'dzugs skrun gyi rogs ram rgya che/lha sa skyid chu'i chu rags nyams gso chen po'i skabs rang nyid ngo mas las grwa'i bkod 'doms dang chabs cig las mi dang mnyam du ngal rtsol la zhugs pa sogs sde dpon gzhan dang dang mi 'dra ba'i dmigs bsal gyi 'jon thang che bas dus skabs der dpon 'bangs tshang ma'i mig dper 'os pa byung 'dug /dgung grangs nga dgu par rab byung bcu pa'i sa glang (1589)lor 'das/'di'i lo rgyus skor (skyid shod dga' ldan pa'i gdung rabs )bris ma las gsal ba der gzigs}
skyid shod sho ma ra|{'di la (deb ther sngon po )lcags dpar ma'i smad cha shog grangs 854/mkhas grub khyung po rnal 'byor gyi rnam thar thad stong lung sho mar rar skor ni rU pa'i chos ma lus pa gsan zhes gsal zhing/(stag lung chos 'a byung ngo mtshar rgya mtsho )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 217pa'i nang stag lung thar pa rin po che phag mo grub nas stag lung du phyir log phebs pa'i lam bar sho ma ra'i chos grwa chen por mkhas po dge ba'i bshes gnyen stabs ka ba chen po'i thugs sras zhang bzhi'i ya rgyal sho ma ra pa lung sde snod gsum dang/mngon rtogs bslab pa gsum gyi mang 'bad gnas brtan chen po bgres pa'i mthar son pa zhig gi drung nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes tshul gsal ba gzhir bzung na skabs der stod shul sho ma rar dgos pa chen po zhig yod 'dug kyang rjes su rab byung gsum pa'i lcags byi (1240)lor yon rgyal rabs gyi dmag dpon dor rta'i dmag dpung bod du yong skabs byang rgyud kyi dgon pa mang po gto skabs rtse med song ba yin nam snyam zhing/rjes su nye dus grong khyer lha sa'i lo rgyus rtsom sgrig gi las don la zhugs skabs byang rgyud sa gnas khag la ga zhig gnang mkhan 'brel yod zhib 'jug pa khag gcig gis gsungs par/shar skyid mo dang nub phod mdo bcas 'khel ba'i bar gyi sag nas der sho ma ra zer ba'i sa ming deng sang yang bsdad 'dug ces go thos byung ba 'dir dpyad gzhir bkod}
skyid gshongs mkhan chen blo gros phyogs las rnam rgyal|{'di nyid rab byung brgyad pa'i shing glang (1505)lor 'dar skyid gshongs su sku bltams/dgung lo bco brgyad pa la mnyan yod du lcags thang chos rje'i drung du mdo phyogs la sbyangs pa mdzad/de nas rje gsal rgya mtsho dang rje kun dga' grol mchog gnyis kyi drung nas sngags kyi zab don mang du gsan/dgung grangs nyi shu rtsa lnga pa la dpal 'khor bde chen dang nyer drug pa la byang ngam rings su chos skor mdzad pas sna grags cher ches khyab/dgung grangs nyer bdun pa la dpal chos 'khor gling gi bshad grwa lo bcu bskyangs te mdo sngags kyi bstan pa spel/dgus grangs so brgyad pa la mnyan yod gdan sa'i seng khrir phebs nas lo brgyad ring lung rigs kyi bstan pa bskyangs/dgung lo zhe brgyad pa la rings chos sde'i dbu mdzad/de nas chos kyi rgyal po tshe dbang rdo rje yab sras kyi bkas skul ba bzhin ya ga chos sdings kyi bshad grwa lo bdun bskyangs/dgung lo lnga bcu nga lnga pa la gnas bzang gnyag phur gdan phab ste zab don nyams su bzhes/dgong lo drug cu re gcig pa shing glang (1565)lor chos kyi rgyal po kun dga' rin chen sku mched kyis dpal ngam rings kyi mkhan por mkha' gsol te chos kyi 'khor lo skor bar mdzad/mthar dgung grangs gya gcig la phebs pa rab byung bcu pa'i shing bya (1585)lo'i bod zla gsum pa'i tshes nyi shu dgu nyin ngo mtshar gyi ltas du ma dang bcas dag zhing du gshegs}
