skyegs gnas rnying|{rgyal rtse dpal chos dgon pa nas nub ngos su zab pa zhig yod pa brgal ba'i nub ngos kyi ri zur du yod/de sngon bstan pa snga dar gyi skabs rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi sku rim pa mdzad pa'i sngags 'chang rgya 'jam dpal gsang ba zhes pa des khri srong sku gshegs rjes rgyal po khri lde srong btsan gyi rtsa ba'i bla ma mdzad/btsan po khri rab pa can gyis 'u shang lha khang bzhengs skabs zhal bkod dang rab gnas thams cad dam pa des mdzad ci nga/btsan po khri rab pa can gyi sar byon nas nged la gnas gzhi 'dzin pa'i sa chag gcig nang bar zhu zhus pas btsan pos ston na ru lag khang gsum/smad she'u lung gsum/bar na skyegs rung gsum bcas dang/'bri khyung rje 'bangs dang bcas pa rgya 'jam dpal gsang ba brgyud bcas shes su chug pa'i 'ja' ra gnang zhing/'gos kyi sras khyung rgod rtsal gyis nye gdan kyi tshab mdzad nas/skyegs gnang rnying du gnas gzhi bzung ste mtha' lcags ris bskor ba dang/bla ma'i gzims khang lha khang dang bcas pa bzhengs/de'i nang du rgya 'jam dpal gsang ba'i nang rten du sras yang dag skyabs kyis spyan ras gzigs kyi sku li ma bzhengs/de'i nang du rgya 'jam dpal gsang ba'i nang rten du sras yang dag skyabs kyis spyan gzigs kyi sku li ma bzhengs/phyi rten du mchod rten bkra shis sgo mang bzhengs pa'i nang na rgya 'jam dpal gsang ba'i sku gdung rim por bzhugs yod cing/gzhan yang gnas rnying dgos pa 'dir che ba bcu'i sgo nas gnas gzhan las khyad par du 'phags tshul dang/'bre shes rab 'bar gyi rten khyed 'phags bcu gsum sogs yod tshul skor (myang stod smad bar gsum gyi chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 78nas 88b.ro gsal zhi nga/yang gnas rnying dgos pa'i gnas yig bris ma zhig yod pa go thos byung yang da phan bdag gis ma mthong lags}
