skyed tshul mkhan po 'jam dbyangs kun dga' chos bzang|{sa skya ba'i bstan 'dzin mtshan snyan che ba'i gras shig yin/rab byung bdun pa'i chu glang (1433)lor stod mnga' ris dang nye ba'i glo bo 'brog khul du 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu la phebs skabs brag dkar grags pa rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo bco brgyad pa la blo bo rgyal pos sa skyar grwa skor dang/dbus gtsang du slob gnyer la brgya phrag gsum tsam mngags rdzong byas skabs rje di nyid kyang de grus su tshud nas sa skyar grwa skor gnang zhing/ngor e wam chos ldan dgos par ngor chen kun dga' bzang po'i drung du dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo bcu dgu pa lcags lug lor 'bras yul skyed tshal dgon par phebs/byams chen rab 'byams pa sangs rgyas 'phel dang 'jam/dgung lo nyi shu pa chu spel (skabs 'dir mang thos klu sgrub rgya mtsho'i (bstan rtsis gsal ba'i nyin byed )bris ma mi 'dra ba gnyis mthong ba gnyis kar dgung lo nyi shur son zhing/rje byams chen chos rje'i zhes gnyis pa rab byung brgyad pa'i sa sbrul (1449)lor 'bras yul skyed tshal btab nas lo bzhi lon pa'i lcags sprel zhes gsal ba yig nor yin te gsham du dgung lo gsum pa shing sbrul/don gcig pa chu phag zhes gsal ba des dgung rtags chu gling yin pa dang khrig ger 'grig 'dug lags )lo nas dgung lo nga gsum pa shing sbrul gyi bar byams chen rab 'byams pa 'bral med du bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mtha' yas pa gsan/dgung lo nga bzhi pa me rta (1486)lor byams chen rab 'byams pa'i sku tshab tu 'bras yul skyed tshal dgon pa'i mkhan po mdzad/dgung lo don gcig pa rab byung brgyad pa'i cha phag (1503)lor dgongs pa rdzogs/gsum rtsom mang po yod 'dra yang ('dul ba lung rigs gter mdzod )dang/(bsdus grwa blo gsal rnams kyi smra ba'i rgyan )zhes pa gnyis tsam ma gtogs gzhan gyi dkar chag ma mthong lags}
