skyes pa la 'os pa'i rtsal sna dgu|{(pho stsal sna dgu/) skyes pa pho la yod 'os pa'i sgyu rtsal sna dgu ste/1 lo rgyus kyi dge thon pa zhes sngon gyi lo rgyus yid ches shing khungs dang ldan pa gling ba lab rten nas nyan pa po'i blo sgo 'byed nus pa/2 gtam gyis bzhad gad lhong pa zhes mang po tshogs pa'i dbus su rgod bro zhing ya mtshan pa'i gtang gleng ba la brten nas nyan pa po rnams rang dbang med par gad mo 'chor du 'jug nus pa/3 shags kyis pha rol gnon pa zhes gzhan dang shags 'byed byas pa la brten nas smra ba la mkhas pa rnams kyang lan med par byed nus pa/4 mtheb kyis sha non pa zhes lus shed la brten nas stobs chen sa la bsgyel nus pa/5 rkyal gyis cha chung gcod pa zhes drug tu rgyug pa'i chu klung chen po yang chu rgyal la brten nas pha rol tu bgrod pa/6 yang rtsal bya lta bu zhes mchongs pa dang/rgyugs pa/thag rtsed/shing rtsed sogs la lus po yang rtsal che ba bya lta bu/7 kha gsal ba gting mi rtogs pa zhes gtam smra ba'i tshe kha gsal yang sems kyi gdengs tshod sum kyang mi lon pa/8 mdzangs la blo 'gyu ba zhes bya ba sgrub pa'i thabs la mkhas shing sne mang gi 'gyur ldog 'phral du mthong thub pa/9 dpa' la bsran tshugs pa zhes dga' sdug la mi skrag cing bzod bsran che ba bcas dgu yin cing/de rnams kyi nang nas dang po gsum ni ngag gi rtsal/bar pa gsum ni lus kyi rtsal dang/mtha' ma gsum ni yid kyi rtsal yin}
