skyes bu gsum gyi nyams su blang ba'i rim pa|{tshe 'di snang gi bya gzhag la zhen pa bzlog thabs su dal 'byor don che ba dang/rnyed dka' ba/tshe 'dir ring du mi gnas par nges par 'a chi ba dang/nam 'chi la nges pa med pa bcas bsams pa skyes bu chung ngu dang thun mong ba'i lam dang/las dge ba byas pa las 'bras bu bde ba dang/las mi dge ba byas pa las 'bras bu sdug bsngal 'byung bar nges pa dang/rgyu dge sdig gnyis chung ngu zhig las 'bras bu chen po 'byung ba/rgyu dge sdig gnyis gang yang ma byas na 'bras bu bde sdug gnyis gang yang 'byung mi srid pa/rgyu dge sdig gnyis gang byas kyang 'bras bu bde sdug gnyis su 'gyur rgyu chud zos su 'gro mi srid pa bcas las 'bras bslu ba med pa dang/'khor ba'i gnas su skye ba blangs phyin chad sdug bsngal gyi rang bzhin kho na ma gtogs 'gyur ba med pa'i gtan gyi bde ba thob mi srid par brten/'khor ba nas thar pa'i thabs lam bslab pa gsum la nyams len bya dgos pa bcas skyes bu 'bring dang thun mong ba'i lam dang/de nas rgyu 'bras man ngag bdun dang/bdag gzhan mnyam brje'i blo sbyong tshul gnyis zung 'brel gyi sgo nas rab gces 'dzin med par bzos ste/byang chub kyi sems rgyud la skye ba'i 'bad brtson bya dgos pa ni skyes ba chen po'i lam dngos gzhi yin}
