skyes rabs|{spyir na skye ba snga ma rim byung gi lo rgyus la go dgos shing/skabs 'dir (mchan/(deb ther dmar po )pe cin mi rigs dpe skrun khang gi lcags dpar ma'i shog rangs 199thog gi rgyal bu chen pos byams chos dang skyes rabs zhus zhes pa 'di'i skabs su go dgos )karma pa rol pa'i rdo rjes yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma tho ken the'i mur gyi sras la skyes rabs gsungs zhes pa tsam las skyes rabs gang zhig gsungs pa yin min skor deb dmar la mchan 'grel 'bri skabs (skyes rabs so bzhi pa )yin shag gis 'grel bshad de ltar bris kyi rjes su si tu rin po che chos kyi 'byung gnas kyis mdzad pa'i (karma kam tshang gi chos 'byung )mjal skabs rgyal sras de la gsungs pa'i skyes rabs ni (skyes rabs brgya rtsa )yin par gsal 'dug pas/karma pa sku phreng gsum pa rang byung rdo rjes 'dzin pa'i (skyes rabs brgya rtsa )zhes pa de yin 'dug cing/de ni slob dpon dpa' bos mdzad pa'i (skyes rabs so bzhi pa )la skyes rabs gzhan dag mang po nas drug cu re bdun tsam kha skong mdzad de brgya dang gcig tshang bar mdzad pa de yin/dpar ma la shog grangs 487yod}
