skyo ston smon lam tshul khrims|{snar thang gi mkhan rabs brgyad pa yin/gtsang rta nag yang yul du rab byung bzhi pa'i sa yon (1219)lor 'khrungs/chung dus snar thar du chos sgor zhugs te sangs rgyas sgom ma dang mchims nam mkha' grags gnyis kyi drung nas bka' gdams kyi chos skor cha tshang bar gsan/mchims nam mkha' grags sku gshegs pa'i rab byung lnga pa'i shing bya (1285)lo nas lo bco lnga'i ring snar thang gi gdan sa mdzad de/de'i ring snar thang gi lcags ri chen mo dang gtsug lag khang chen mo bzhengs/dgung lo rgya gcig pa rab byung lnga pa'i sa phag (1399)lor sku gshegs/dam pa 'di'i rnam thar snar thang mkhan chen nyi ma rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i bris ma deb 'bring shog grangs 56yin pa zhig yod pa der gzigs/las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung chen mo )dpar ma shog grangs 255ba 4par skyo ston 'di'i dgung rnying byi ba yin par gsungs kyang lo khams mi gsal}
