skyo 'ong 'byung|{skyo 'od kyi 'byung gnas zhes dus rabs bcu gcig pa rab byung dang po'i dkyil tsam la byon pa'i bla ma zhig yin/rgya gar gyi grub chen a mo g+ha badzra chung ba'i slob ma yin/'khrungs yul gtsang gi pa rnam nya tshan phug yin zhing/mngon tshad ma phyogs tsam mkhyen cing/gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi sgyu 'phrul skor mkhas par mkhyen pa'i grwa gzhon 'byor pa che ba zhig yin/sa gnas gzhan dag la sman nyo ba dang/sku don gzhan dag kyang yod pa sgrub par phebs pa'i lam bar bra ma smu gu zer ba'i chu 'gram du bla ma a mo b+ha badzra dpon g.yog 'ga' zhig dang mjal te nang du gdan drangs/sne len bzang po zhus shing paN+Di ta dbus gtsang du phebs pa'i cha rkyen thams cad phul nas phyag g.yog legs par mdzad pas bla ma mnyes te/khong nyid kyi yi dam rdo rje 'jigs byed kyi dbang khrid man ngag thams cad cha tshang bar gnang ste mtshan la skyo 'od kyi 'byung gnas zhes btags/bla ma rgya gar du phyir phebs mdzad pa'i phebs skyel skyid grong bar du byos nas chibs rta bzang po zhig phul/tshur phebs 'bri mtshams kyi slob dpon dge 'dun bzang po'i drung nas sngar ma gsan pa'i gshin rje gshed dgra gdong 'jigs gsum skor tshang bar gsan/rang yul gyi nya tshan phug tu sgom sgrub gnang ste bzhugs skabs yab kyi spun ma ched cig gi sa zhing 'tshong ba de nyos te der dgos pa btab pa'i ming la pa tshab nyi ma lde zhes grags/dam de la sras 'jam dpal dang pad+ma gnyis byung zhing/slob ma thugs sras bu chen lnga byung ba rnams gshin rje gshed kyi chos skor la mkhas pa sha stag yin/skyo 'od 'byung gnas brgyud pa'i rdo rje 'jigs med lha bcu bdun ma la skyo lugs kyi 'jigs byed byer ba yin/dam pa 'di'i lo rgyus mdor bsdus shig jo nang tA ra nA thas mdzad pa'i (gshin rje gshed kyi cho sa 'byung yid ches ngo mtshar )lha sa zhol dpar ma'i shog rangs 65nas 68bar gsal ba der gzigs}
