skyob pa rin po che rin chen dpal|{skyob pa 'jig rten gsum gyi mgon po rin chen dpal ni 'bri gung bka' brgyud kyi srog thog mar gtod par mdzad pa po yin/mdo smad ldan stod kyi grong btsung ngu zhes pa'i yul du 'bru skyu ra'i rigs kyi yab rnal 'byor pa rdo rje dang/yum rag shi bza' btsun ma gnyis kyi rigs kyi myu gur rab byung gnyis pa'i chu phag (1143)lo sku bltams/rab byung bzhi pa'i me glang (1217)lo'i bar dgung lo bdun cu don lnga bzhugs/khong sku na phra mo nas 'bri klog la sbyangs pa phul du phyin/yab las rdo rje 'jigs byed kyi chos skor dang/gzhan yang khu bo dar ma/rwa sgreng sgrog chen sogs las mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/skabs der khong gi mtshan la btsun pa skyabs dang rdo rje dpal zhes pa sogs zhu/khong sku nar ma song gong yab dgongs pa rdzogs te khyim gyi 'tsho ba nyams zhan du gyur/de skabs khong nyid bka' bstan gsum rab klog rgyur sgra dag gsal gsum dang ldan la/shin tu ljags klog bde bas dad ldan sbyin bdag khag gis klog la gdan drangs pa'i yon gyis yum dang lcam sring sogs skyong ba mdzad pa ma zad/gzhan yang nad kyi mnar ba dang dbul zhing phongs pa nyam thag pa rnams la thugs snying rje chen pos phan 'dogs par mdzad/dbus phyogs nas mgo zla ba paN+Dita phebs par de'i drung nas 'gro mgo phag mo gru pa'i mtshan snyan gsan par thugs lhag par dad par gyur te phag gru'i drung du phebs rgyu'i thugs thag bcad de rab byung gsum pa'i me phag (1167)lor lam gyi ngal ba du ma khyad bsad mdzad de dbus kyi gdan la phag mo grur phebs (phag mo gru deng skabs zangs ri rdzong khongs yin )'gro mgon phag mo gru pa rdo rje rgyal po bla mar bsten/bla mas khong lam tshan byang chub sems dpa' rin chen dpal zhes gnang/mdo sngags kyi zab chos thams cad bum pa gang byo'i tshul dug nas nas 'a gro mgon phag mo grub pa'i slob ma'i mchog tu gyur/dgung lo so lnga par kung thang bla ma zhang brtson 'grus grags pa'i drung nas bsnyen par rdzogs pa dge slong gi sdom bzhes/bslab bya mtha' dag srung sdom shin tu zhib par mdzad de sku btsun pa'i yon tan yongs su grags so/_/'gro mgon phag mo gru ba dgongs pa rdzogs rjes rab byung gsum pa'i me bya (1177)lor skyob pa rin po ches phag gru'i gdan sa mthil skyong bar mdzad/bla ma'i dgongs rdzogs su dmigs gnas gzhi rgya che ba'i gser zangs kyis bkra shis sgo mang gi mchod rten bzhengs/rab byung gsum pa'i sa phag (1179)lor 'bri gung (deng skabs mal gro gung dkar rdzong khongs )su phebs/gdan sa 'bri gung mthil byang chub gling phyag btab nas 'du tshogs shin tu rgyas/de nas 'bri gung skyob pa'i chos brgyud 'dzin mkhan rnams la 'bri gung bka' brgyud pa zhes pa dang/khong la yang 'bri gung skyob pa zhes zhu ba red/de yang (lho rong chos 'byung )dang/(bka' brgyud gser 'phreng )sogs kyi nang gsal bar/rab byung gsum pa'i sa rta (1198)lor 'bri gung skyob pa byang nang rir phebs skabs lhan du dge 'dun khri gsum yod pa dang/yang snub rgyal ba lha nang pas bur 'gyed 'bul skabs dge da'un lnga khri lnga ston lnga brgya nyi shu rtsa lnga byung ba/yang (skyob pa'i rnam thar chen mo'i )nang 'khor phyogs gcig 'dus pa bdun khri la zhes pa dang (rnam thar phyag rgya me tog )nang bu zhabs tog can gyi rnal 'byor pa nyis stong bdun brgya ri la song/gcig dus kyi deng sang la khri phrag bcu gsum tshogs su tshogs zhes dang/gzhan yang paN chen gu ya gangs pas gtsos dge 'dun lnga khri lnga stong lnga brgya nyi shu rtsa lnga gangs te ser btang ba dang/dge bshes g.yag tu dpal grags kyis gtsos pa'i dge 'dun lnga khri lnga stong lnga brgya nyi shu rtsa lnga la phyi/rdor 'dzin mgo bo ches gtsos dge da'un lnga khri lnga stong lnga brgya nyi shu rtsa lnga tsa rir btang rjes/slar yang tshogs pa khri bco brgyad 'dus par gyur zhes gsal 'dug pas mdor na de'i skabs sgrub pa nyams bzhes mdzad mkhan 'du tshogs shin tu rgyas par gyur 'dug /chos rje skyong pa rin po che gang nyid slob ma'i tshogs shin tu rgyas te re zhig thugs sun pa'i tshul bstan te gnas mchog tsha 'ug ces par phebs nas ting 'dzin phug pa dang/tshogs khang sogs kyi gnas sgo phye ba mdzad de sku'i rjes dang phyag zhabs kyi rjes ha cang ngo mtshar ba 'jog pa mdzad pa dus da lt