bskal pa gnyis ldan|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la/'jig rten khams 'dir mi'i rigs thog mar byung ba'i skabs su mi'i cha snyoms kyi tshe tshad lo bcu la ring mtha' byed pa'i bar ring bzhin thog mar bskal pa rdzogs ldan zhes mi rnams rang bzhin gyis dge ba byed pa la dga' zhing/mi dge ba bcu'i ming yang mi grags pa'i dus skabs yin pa dang/de nas rim bzhin mi rnams dge ba bcu'i nang nas sna gsum ma gtogs mi ldan pas bskal pa gsum ldan dang/de nas dge ba bcu'i ming tsam ma gtogs mi dge ba sha stag la spyod pas ba skal ba rtsod ldan zhes mi rnams kyi cha snyoms tshe tshad ring shos lo brgya nas lo bcu'i bar rim gyis mar 'grib byed pa'i das yin zhes bshad srol yod cing/bskal pa gnyis ldan gyi dus yun ni (dus 'khor )las/stong pa stong pa mkha' dang rig byed ro dang lag 'a gro zhes bya gnyis ldan lo ni yang dag go zhes pa ltar gyi mi lo brgyad 'bum drug khri bzhi stong yod/skabs 'dir nye dus dpar bskrun byas pa'i (shes bya kun khyab )lcags dpar ma'i deb dang po'i shog grangs 227par/stong pa stong pa mkha' dang zhes stong pa lan gnyis dgos rgyu la gcig las ma gsal ba ni yig nor yin pas legs bcos dgos so/_}
