bskyed rim skabs 'chad bya'i don drug|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags la rgyud sde bzhi (1 bya rgyud/2 spyod rgyud/3 rnal 'byor rgyud/4 bla med rgyud )yod pa'i bla med kyi rgyud ma gtogs rgyud sde gzhan gsum la bskyed rim med cing/bla med rgyud kyi yi dam gang zhig gi bskyed rim yin kyang de bsgom pa'i sngon du bla slob gnyis kas 'chad nyan nges par du bya dgos pa'i don gnad gtso bo bdun yod/1 bskyed rim so so'i sbyang gzhi gang yin pa/2 rdzogs rim gang zhig gi smin byed du 'gro ba/3 mthar thug gi 'bras bu gang yin pa/4 bskyed rim de dang de bsgom pa'i dgos pa gang yin pa/5 bskyed rim gyi ngo bo gang yin pa/6 bskyed rim mthar phyin pa'i tshad gang yin pa bcas nges par shes dgos pa'i gnad don gyi gtso bo drung yin/zhib par yi dam so so'i bskyed rim gyi khrid yig rgyas pa rnams la gzigs na gsal}
