bskyed rim mthar phyin pa|{bskyed rim mthar phyin pa la nang gses dbye phye na gnyis ste/1 bskyed rim rags pa mthar phyin pa dang/2 bskyed rim phra mo mthar phyin pa gnyis yod/bskyed ring rags pa mthar phyin pa ni rags pa'i rten dang brten pa rnams gsal btab pa'i tshe de'i cha thams cad ma 'dres par gsal sing nge shar zhing/bying rgod gnyis kyi skyon dang bral bar nyin zhag gcig gi drug chu 'khyol thub pa ni bskyed rim rags pa brtan pa'i tshan yin pa dang/de lta bu'i sgo nas lo dang zla ba sogs rang nyid ji tsam 'dod kyi bar 'jog thub pa ni bskyed rim rags pa mthar phyin pa'i tshad yin/bskyed rim phra mo mthar byin pa'i tshad ni rags pa'i rten nas brten pa tsam ma yin par thig le yungs 'bru tsam gyi nang du rten dang brten pa'i bkod pa cha tshang bar 'char zhing bying gnyis kyi skyong dang bral bar nyin zhag gcig gis drug cha 'khyol thub pa ni bskyed rim phra mo brtan pa'i tshad yin pa dang/de lta bu'i sgo nas lo dang zla ba sogs rang nyid ji tsam 'dod kyi bar du 'jog thug pa ni bskyed rim phra mo mthar phyin pa'i tshad yin}
