kha skong dge 'dun|{bsgrub bya bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa zhu mkhan lo tshad lon pa rnams sdom pa zhu skabs las kyi kha skong du phebs mkhan dge slong lnga las mi nyung ba 'tshogs dgos shing/de rnams kyang gsham gsal gyi 'os chos bco lnga tshang dgos pa ste/1 spyod lam 'greng nas bzhugs pa ma yin pa/2 gang la bya ba'i yul ma yin pa/3 'dun pa phul ba ma yin/4 pham pa byung ste bslab pa nyams pa ma yin pa/5 bsnyen par ma rdzogs pa ma yin pa/6 mtshams med rnga gang rung yas pa ma yin pa/7 sdig lta can ma yin pa/8 /sa gnas na gnas pa ma yin pa/9 tha dad du gnas pa ma yin pa/10 bslab pa 'khrul ba dang bcas pa ma yin pa bcas ('dul ba lung gi )nas gsungs pa bcu dang/11 mtshams gzhan na gnas pa ma yin pa/12 mtshan mi mthun pa ma yin pa/13 dgon ma chog gzhan ma yin pa bcas (lung zhu ba )nas gsungs pa gsum/14 lus tha mal du gnas pa/15 tha snyad gsum dang ldan pa (smra shes pa/don go ba/shes pa rang bzhin du gnas pa )gnyis ni mdor bsdus sbyar ba bcas bco lnga yod/de skor 'dul ba'i 'grel pa khag gi nang rang rang so so'i 'grel bshad rgyu mtshan dang bcas pa zhig phra gsungs yod}
