kha gya dkon mchog dar rgyas|{bla brang bkra shis 'khyil gyi dge bshes mtshan snyan che ba zhig yin/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu khyi (1742)lor kha gya'i dpon rgyud du sku 'khrungs shing/g.yu dge bshes kyi skye srid yin zhes grags/thog mar kha gya dgon du chos zhugs mdzad kyang yun ring ma bzhugs par bkra shis 'khyil du phebs nas der gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer mthar phyin pa gnang sde dge bshes rgan gzhon tshang mas kha rgya dar rgyas zhes bka' 'dri zhu yul dang dogs gcod zhu yul du tshad mar 'dzin cing/dgung lo zhe gsum pa shing 'brug lor 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa 'jigs med dbang pos rdo rbas pa'i ming btags kyang grwa thog gcig pa gzhan las snga bar gnang ste dge bshes dam bcas mig dper 'os pa 'jog gnang mdzad/skyabs mchog 'jigs med dbang po dbus gtsang du byon pa'i zhabs phyir 'khrid pa gnang ba bzhin phebs nas klong rdol bla ma rin po che sogs skyes chen dam pa mang po'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun rgya cher gsan te so gsum la nye bar bzhugs/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me rta (1786)lor mdo smad du phebs rjes rgyud smad grwa tshang du lo gsum gyi ring chos grwa 'grims nas sngags rams kyi dge bshes dam bca' yang 'jog pa gnang/don gnyer can gyi slob ma mang por 'dod mos dang 'tshams pa'i dpe khrid dang/skabs mtshams nam yod du sku mtshams bcad rgya'i ngang du bzhugs/dgung lo nga bdun pa sa rta (1798)lor dus 'khor grwa tshang gi mkhan por khrir phebs nas lo shas bar 'dzin skyong gnang zhing/dgung grangs ji tsam bzhugs pa'i rnam thar lo rgyun da phan ma mthong lags}
