kha char gyi lha khang|{de sngon bstan pa phyi dar gyi 'og tshugs tsam gyi dus su mnga' ris chos rgyal bkra shis mgon gyi sras chung ba 'khor re'am (che ba srong nge yin cing/rjes su rab byung mdzad pa lha bla ma ye shes 'od zhu ba de yin )mtshan dngos 'khor lo lde zhes grags pa des sku tshe'i smad la dkar dung gi chos rje 'dzam gling grags pa bla mar bsten nas chos mang du gsan cing dzam phug tu bzhugs te dzam b+ha la'i bsnyen sgrub gnang nas bzhugs te zhag bdun song ba na gang nas 'ongs cha med pa'i a tsar+ya stobs ldan bdun 'ongs nas dngul mi khur bdun phul ba des rgyu byas te dkar dung du gser mkhar gtsug lag khang bzhengs pa de yin/de sngon bod sa gnas kyi spu hreng rdzong nas lho phyogs tsha lam gcig gi sar yod/lha khang 'di'i ming la khur chags zhes 'bod pa dang/yang 'khor chags zhes 'bod srol mi 'dra ba gnyis yod pa gnyis kar rgyun mtshan shod stangs mi 'dra ba 'dug pa ste/1 khur chags zhes 'bod pa ni/sngon dus su spu hrengs kyi sa gnas shig na sgom chen zhig bzhugs pa'i sar a tsar+ya mi bdun 'ongs nas khur po bdun bcol te rjes su len par yong rgyu yin zhes smras te rgya gar phyogs su song zhing/lo mang ring khur po len par yong rgyur sgugs kyang yong mkhan ma byung/khur po rnams kha phye nas bltas pa na ras thum ljid che ba sha stag yin pa dang tshang mar ye shes dzam zer ba yod cing/nang du dngul lhad med sha stag yin pa mthong nas dngul de dag gis rgyu byas nas jo mo'i sku bzhengs pa na sku smad bzhes zin rjes sku stod rang byung du byon pa de la brten nas la lha khang gi ming khur chags zhes thogs pa yin zer/2 'khor chags zhes kyang brjod srol yod pa ni chos rgyal 'khor res rten gtso jo bo 'jam dpal rdo rje bzhengs grub nas dkar dung gtsug lag khang du gdan drangs skabs shing rta 'khor lo thang dkyil der yod pa'i rdo chen po zhig la thogs nas 'khor lo kha 'gag pa dang/jo bos gsungs byos nas nga 'dir 'khor zhing chags so zhes gsung byon par brten jo bo'i sku brnyan 'di la 'khor chags jo bo zhes mtshan 'bod pa yin byung zhes shod tshul yang 'dug /lha khang 'di'i rten gtso rje btsun 'jam dbyangs kyi bzhengs sku bzhugs khri rgyab yol tra dang bcas pa thog mar bzhengs shing/skabs der sku'i g.yas g.yon gnyis su pad gdan stong pa re yod/mnga' bdag 'khor re'i rjes nas mi rabs kha shas phyin rjes/mnga' bdag gnam mgon ldes rten gtso ngo bo'i g.yas su sku rgyu dngul las grub pa'i 'phags pa spyan ras gzigs dang g.yon du sku rgyu gong mtshungs kyi phyag na rdo rje gnyis sngar yod pad gdan stong pa'i steng du bzhugs pa bzhengs/de nas bod sa gnas kyi srid gzhung rim pas gtsug lag khang der nyams gso rim par byas pa'i lo rgyus yod cing/rig gnas gsar rje'i skabs g.yas g.yon gyi dngul sku gnyis rtsa med song ba dang/sku stod shin cang du dbor 'dren byas pa/rig gsar mjug sgril rjes slar yang rang gnas su gdan drangs thog sku smad gsar bzhengs byas te deng sang 'khor chags lha khang nang bzhugs yod/zhib par 'khor chags lha khang gi gnang yig kha byang du (lhar bcas 'gro ba'i ma chod stong jo bo dngul sku mched gsum sngon byung gi gtam rabs brjod pa rin chen bai DUr+ya sngon po'i pi wang )zhes 'khod pa/ngor e wam gyi gdan rabs nga bzhi pa mkhan chen ngag dbang bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyis rang byung bco lnga pa'i lcags 'brug (1880)lor brtsams gnang mdzad pa/1988lor phyi rgyal nas dpar skrun byas pa zhig 'dug pa der gzigs}
