kha chi shri su b+hu ti shan+ta|{dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i 'gor mnga' ris rgyal po lha bla ma yi shes 'od kyis kha che'i yul nas gdan drangs pa'i paN+Di ta 'dul ba la mkhas pa zhig yin zhing/zhang zhung rgyal ba'i shes rab kyis paN+Di ta 'dir drung nas ('dul ba sum brgya pa (gnas nas 'gyur bcos mdzad yod}
