kha sbyor bdun ldan|{nang pa'i chos lugs kyi gsang sngags bla med kyi gzhung las/rgyal pa rdo rje 'chang gi mtshan gyi rnam grangs su gsungs pa ste/1 longs spyod rdzogs pa'i yan lag /2 kha sbyor gyi yan lag /3 bde ba chen po'i yan lag /4 rang bzhin med pa'i yan lag /5 rgyun mi chad pa'i yan lag /6 snying rjes yongs su gang ba'i yan lag /7 'gog pa med pa'i yan lag bcas yin/de rnams kyi go don mdor bsdus tsam ni/dang po longs spyod rdzogs pa'i yan lag ni mtshan dpe'i rdzogs par spras pa/gnyis pa kha sbyor gyi yan lag ni rang snang gi rig ma dang mnyam par sbyor ba/gsum pa bde ba chen po'i yan lag ni rlung dbu mar zhugs gnas thim gsum byas pa la brten nas lus kyi bde ba dang sems kyi bde ba chen po nyams su myong ba/bzhi pa rang bzhin med pa'i yan lag ni thugs zag med kyi bde ba'i ngo bo gnas pa der stong pa nyid rtogs pa/lnga pa rgyun mi chad pa'i yan lag ni 'khor ba ji srid bar mya ngan las mi 'da' bar bzhugs pa/drug pa snying rjes yongs su gang ba'i yan lag ni dmigs med kyi snying rje chen pos sems can gyi don mdzad pa la g.yel ba med pa/bdun pa 'gog pa med pa'i yan lag ni mdzad pa 'phrin las dus nam yang 'gog rkyen med par 'jug pa bcas yin/zhib par gsang sngags bla med kyi rdzogs rim rnam bshad rgyas pa rnams las gsal}
