khang zhi'i rdo ring dang chan lung rdo ring|{rdo ring de gnyis sngon ma lha sa'i pho brang po tA la'i mdun zhol gdung sgo'i phyi ngos da ltar gzhung lam 'khel sa der btsugs yod kyang rjes su 1965lor lha sa grong khyer gyi 'dzugs skrun dgos mkho dang bstun nas pho tA la'i rgyab klu khang gi gzhung sgo'i nang du spos yod/khang zhi'i rdo ring gi spyi'i mtho tshad la spyi khre 3 74yod pa dang/rdo ring mdun ngos kyi g.yas phyogs su rgya yig yig phreng 15dang/g.yon phyogs su bod yig yig phreng 46dang/rgyab ngos g.yas phyogs su sog yig yig phreng 15 dang g.yon phyogs su man ja yi ge yig phreng 15bcas yod/rdo nga gi yi ge ni ching rgyal rabs kyi gong ma khang zhi'i khri lo drug cu pa bod rab byung bcug nyis pa'i lcags glang (1721)lor gong ma rang gis brtsams shing yul kreng khri lo gnyis pa shing 'brug (1724)lor yi ge rdo ris thog bkod de btsugs shing/rdo ring yi ge'i nang du skabs de'i bod kyi gnas tshul rags bshad thog gang mas bod du dpung dmag btang ste sog po jun gar gyi 'khrung long zhod 'jags su btang ba yin zhes khyab bsgrags byas yod/de yang bod rang byung bcu gnyis pa'i me bya (1717)lor sog po jun gar pa tshe dbang rab brtan gyis sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i dgra sha len pa dang/dge lugs par rgyab skyor byed pa'i ming 'khyer nas rta dmag drug stong tsam khrid de bod du dpung 'jug gis lo gsum ring sa btsan bzung byas pa dang/gu shri bstan 'dzin chos rgyal gyi yang tsha rgyal po lha bzang dang/rnying ma'i bla ma grags can khag gcig bkrongs pa/rnying phyogs kyi dgon sde mang por gtor brlag 'phrog bcom byas pa sogs bod kyi spyi tshogs la yo 'khyoms chen po byung/ching gi gong mas bod rang byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa khyi (1718)lo (khang zhi'i khri lo 57)nas 1720(khang zhi'i khri lo 59)lo'i bar bod du dmag dpung snga rjes thengs gnyis btang ste bod sa gnas su yod pa'i jun gar bar ngo rgol byed pa'i stobs shugs dang mnyam 'brel byas te/1720lo'i zla 8par jun gar gyi dmag shugs yongs rdzogs bod nas mtha' skrod btang ba dang/bod kyi spyi tshogs bde la bkod pa red/chan lu