khang gsar ngag dbang thub bstan chos kyi dbang phyug|{rje 'di nyid ni bod ljongs lha sa grong khyer gyi shar phyogs sbra nag zhol (rnam rgyal ra )du jur nang gi rigs las yab skal bzang don grub dang yum lha mo sgrol ma gnyis kyi sras su bod rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa pho byi ba (1888)lor sku bltams/skabs der srid skyong rta tshag ngag dbang dpal ldan bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan mchog gi sprul sku zhi bar gshegs nas ring por gyur skabs tshang mas srid skyong dam pa'i yang srid du dogs shing dpyod par byas na'ang rkyen gzhan gyi dbang gis mkhan chen mkhyen par bstan pa chos 'phel mchog nas sgo mang mkhan po blo bzang rnam rgyal gyi yang srid du ngos 'dzin mdzad de dgung lo bdun du phebs pa'i tshe dpal ldan 'bras spungs su chibs zhal bsgyur thog wa shul khang gsar du gtan bzhugs mdzad pas khang gsar rin po che zhes mtshan chags/de nas sgo mang gi chos grwa zhabs ser bkod pa dang 'brel dge ba'i bshes gnyen chen po har gdong byams pa chos 'dzin rigs kyi cod ngan du bzhes/gzhung bka' pod lngar slob gnyer thob mas dpyis phyin pa mdzad mthar shing 'brug (1904)lor lha ldan smon lam chen mo'i skabs dge bshes kyi mtshan rtags bzhes/de nas gsang chen rdo rje theg pa'i dka' ba'i gdan mtha' dag la thos bsam phu thag chod pa zhig bya'o dgongs nas dpal ldan smad rgyud du zhabs ser bkod de 'jug sgo'i rim pa rnams kyang srol lam ltar mdzad/snga rjes rgyal mchog sku phreng bu gsum pa thub bstan rgya mtsho las dang tshul sdom pa dang bsnyen par rdzogs pa'i sdom pa yang dag pa nod/gzhan yang rgyal mchog thub tan rgya mtsho dang/'bul bsdus blo bzang ye shes bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan/sgo mang mkhan chen mkhyen rab bstan pa chos 'phel/gser skong ngag dbang tshul khrims don ldan/stag brag ngag dbang gsum rab mthu stobs bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan/pha bong kha pa dpal bde chen snying po/bka' 'gyur ba chen po blo bzang don ldan/stag phu ngag dbang ba bzang 'jam dpal bstan pa'i dngos grub sogs las dbang lung rjes gnang/man ngag sogs bum pa gang bya'o tshul du gsan/dad ldan ser skya mchog dman mtha' dag