khams sprul bstan 'dzin chos kyi nyi ma|{'brug khams sprul sku phreng gnyis pa ngag dbang kun dga' bstan 'dzin kyi sku phreng rjes ma yin/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags khyi (1730)lor rdza stod dpon tshang gi khyim du 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhir phebs skabs/mdo khams lha thog rgyal po'i mnga' khongs kha stag dkar mo'i rig khug khams pa dgon phugs tshogs chos 'khor gling gi sprul skur ngos 'dzin zhus/si tu rin po che chos kyi 'byung gnas dang/'brug pa bde chen chos 'khor gyi yongs 'dzin 'jam dpal dpa' bo sogs mkhas grub kyi bla ma mang po bsten nas mdo sngags rig gnas dang bcas par thos bsam ngoms pa med par gnang ste gzhung 'grel khag mang ljags rtsom mdzad cing/lhag par dam pa des rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags stag (1770)lor mdzad pa'i snyan ngag gi 'grel pa (rgyan gyi bstan bcos dbyangs can ngag gi rol mtsho )ni si tu rin po che chos kyi 'byung gnas kyi drung nas (snyan ngag me long ma )dang/(sgra tsan+d+ra pa/) (sdebs sbyor )sogs gsan grub rjes dgung lo nyer pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing khyi (1754)lor ljags rtsom gnang zhing/de nas la bcu drug gi ring mdzad 'phrin rgya che mang po'i zhor la kha snon dang dag bcom yang yang mdzad de mthar dgu lo zhi gcag pa rang byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags stag (1770)lor yongs su grub par mdzad nas dbus gtsang khams gsum du (khams 'grel chen mo )zhes mkhas dbang phal che bas bsngags brjod kyi mtshan snyan yongs su khyab pa zhig yin/dgung lo bcu drug pa shing glang (1745)lor kha stag dkar mo'i rig khung nas khams pa sgar (deng sang chab mdo rdzong khongs )du phun tshogs gling dgos pa gnas spos mdzad de dgos gnas rten gsum dang bcas pa gsar bzhengs/gying phung dpal gyi yar dben du mtshan nyid dgos rnam rgyal chos 'khor gling/sga nyag dkar mo ri'i yang dgon du sgrub sde gsang chen mthong grol gling bcas dgon sde chen po gsum phyag btab/bstan 'gro'i don rgya cher mdzad/mthar dgung lo lnga bcur phebs pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa phag (1779)lor phun tshogs chos 'khor gling du sku gshegs/dam pa 'dir khams sprul zhes pa'i mtshan thogs stangs skor/rab byung bcu pa'i sa sbrul (1548)lor khams kho tsha rin chen sgang du 'khrungs pa mas pa grub chen karma bstan 'phel zhu ba zhig byung ba des stag lung ma thang gi gdan sa rim bo cher chos zhugs mdzad de/rje drung mtsho skyes rdo rje sogs bsten nas stag lung gi chos rgyun cha tshang bar gsan/karma pa spu phreng dug pa dbang phyug rdo rje'i drang nas bsnyen rdzogs bzhes/rjes su 'brug pa bka' brgyud kyi bla ma lha rtse ba ngag dbang bzang po bsten nas 'brub pa'i chos rgyun cha tshang gsan te bla mas lung bstan pa ltar khams su byon/rdo rje'i yang rdzong dang TA ki'i gsang phug sogs su sgrub pa nyams bzhes gtso bor mdzad ci nga/zhor la slob ma rnams la chos 'chad spel gnang bas slob ma grags can rgya mtsho rnam dgus mtshon bsam gyis mi khyab pa byung bar brten rgyal ba mdo khams pa zhes yongs su grags pa'i mtshan chags/de'i sku phreng rjes ma khams pa ngag dbang kun dga' bstan 'dzin ni/yul dbus gangs dkar rdzong zhol bde skyid gling du rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags sprel (1620)lor 'khrungs shing/'brug pa skyabs mgon mi pham chos kyi dbang po la gtsug phud phul bas mtshan ngag dbang kun dga' bstan 'dzin du gsol/rig gnas spyi dang lhag par gso ba rig pa la mkhas/'brug khams pa grub dbang pa karma bstan 'phel gyi yang srid du nges par khams su gdan drangs/de'i sprul sku dge rgyal dpon tshang du sku 'khrungs shing/si tu rin po che'i slob mar rgyur pa de yin tshul sogs kyi lo rgyus mdor bsdus shig (gu bkra chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 588nas 589bar gsal}
