khams ri bo che|{stag lung sangs rgyas dbon grags pa dpal gyis dgung lo nyi shu rtsa bdun pa rab byung lnga pa'i me glang (1277)lor dbyi shod ri bo cher phyag btab pa'i dgon pa'i ming ste (deng sang bod rang skyong ljongs kyi chab mdo kron chus khams ri bo che rdzong yod sa )sangs rgyas dbon rin po ches thog mar sa gnas der gzims gur phub nas sa 'dul dang/byin 'bebs mdzad rjes zla ba dang por rtsig rmang 'ding ste/ka bzhi ma'i kha lha gnyis dang/ka drug gi lha khang/chos khri khang/nag tshang chen mo rnams brtsigs/de nas lo shas nang grwa pa mang du 'dus pa rnams kyis so so'i grwa tshang brtsigs pas gling yang rgya cher gyur/rab byung lnga pa'i chu lug (1283)lo nas rim bzhin sku gsum thugs rten rnams bzhengs pa'i 'og brtsams te/zhor la chos bka' yang yang gnas pas sku tshe'i smad du dgos pa der grwa pa sum stong tsam 'tshogs pa byung/de rjes chos rje u rgyan mgon pos dgung lo nyi shu rtsa brgyad pa rab byung lnga pa'i lcags sprel (1320)lor lha khang chen mo bzhes 'go tshugs te/phyi'i rtsig pa rim pa gcig gyang da nga/nang gi rtsig pa rim pa gnyis rdo chen/'og khang sku 'khor mtshon byed kyi lha khang phra mo mi tshad bdun gyi mtho dman tsam/steng khang thugs kyi 'khor lo mtshon byed lha khang dkar po mtho tshad mi phreng lnga'i tshad tsam yod pa/gtsug lag khang gi rgya khyon ngos gcig la gzhu 'dom brgya dang sum cu so gsum ('dom gang la spyi khre gang dang skar ma brgyad cu yod par cha bzhag na spyi khre 239 4)re yod pa/lha khang 'og ma'i rgya khyod ka ba drug cu dang ba re'i sbom tshad 'dom do lhag tsam/ka ba re'i bar thag spyir btang las ring ba zhig /gzhan yang zhabs drung bla brang/yang dgos bal brang/rnying ma grwa tsam/stag lung grwa tshang/gsar ma grwa tshang bcas la gser dngul/dze k+Shim/li dkar dmar/sman 'dam sogs las grub pa'i sku brnyan dang/mchod rten/sman thang/sgar bris kyi thang ka chig stong lhag tsam dang/chos rtsigs gcig pur yang pod grangs chig khri lnga stong tsam yod pa sogs zhib par ka thog si tu rin po che chos kyi rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i (dbus gtsang gnas ba skor lam yig )sde dge par ma'i grangs 14nas 21bar gsal}
khams lugs|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi chos skor che gras gsum (1 'dus pa mdo/2 sgyu 'phrul gsang ba snying po/3 sems phyogs )gyi nang gses sgyu 'phrul gyi skor rnams paN chen bi ma las lo tsA ba rma rin chen mgo la gnang zhing/lo tsA ba des bod skad du bsgyur nas gtsug ru rin chen gzhon nu dang/gye re mchog skyong gnyis la gsungs/de gnyis kyis dar rjes dpal gyi grags pa dang/zhang rgyal ba'i yon tan gnyis la gsungs/dar rje dpal gyi grags pas dbus gtsang dang khams khul du yang gsungs pas/khams phyogs su brgyud pa la mas lugs zhes grags so/_}
khams gsum|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la/rang cig 'tsho gnas byed pa'i 'jig rten gyi khams chen po 'di la nang gses khams gsum du phye ba ste/'dod khams/gzugs khams/gzugs med khams bcas yod pa dang/'dod khams la 'gro ba rigs drug dang/gzugs khams la gnas ris bcu bdun/gzugs med khams la gnas bzhi bcas yod par gsungs/de rnams kyi go don dang dbye ba bcas ming tshig so so'i thar kar bkod pa der gzigs}
khams gsum brtan g.yo'i chos kun|{'dod khams/gzugs khams/gzugs med khams gsum/brtan pa ni snod kyi 'jig rten gyi ming/g.yo ba ni bcud kyi sems can gyi ming/'jig rten gyi khams la brtan pa dang/de'i nang du yod pa'i sems can la g.yo ba zer}
khams gsum du cis 'khor|{khams gsum 'khor ba'i gnas su rgyu dang rkyen gang zhig la brten nas 'khor ba yin nam zhes pa'i dri tshig }
khams gsum rnam rgyal|{bya rgyud de bzhin gshegs pa'i rigs kyi khro bo khams gsum rnam rgyal gyi dbang ste/mi tra brgya rtsa'i nang gi dbang gi sde tshan sum cu so lnga pa khro bo khams gsum rnam rgyal lha lnga bcu nga bdun yod pa'i dbang de yin/(mi tra brgya rtsa'i dbang chog )gi nang du yod/'di'i zur bka'i dbang chog ni tho yon bla ma 'jam dbyangs 'phrin las kyi gsung 'bum (dkyil chog phyogs bsgrigs nor bu'i phreng ba )pod gnyis pa'i mjug tu yod}
khams gsum mi ldog sgrol gyi gtsug lag khang|{khams gsum zangs khang gling gi ming gi rnam grangs yin zhing/btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi btsun mo tshe spong bzang me tog sgron gyis bsam yas gtsug lag khang lte bar dpe byas nas bzhengs pa ste/bsam yas gtsug lag khang gi lho phyogs lcags ri'i phyi la yod pa de yin/lha khang lte ba thog so gsum yod pa'i steng thog la/rnam par snang mdzad mi bzhi rgyab sprod lta bu/sems dpa' sems ma khro bo gnyis bcas rdor dbyings kyi lha tshogs cha tshang 'jim sku la phra rgyan yod pa/bar khang gi rten gtsor sangs rgyas ma chags pad+ma'i spyan pad sdong gi khar bzhugs pa/khro bo kang dang king gnyis 'jim skul phra rgyan sna tshogs yod pa/skor khang la phyi nang gnyis bltas su zhi ro dam pa rigs brgya'i ldebs bris bal bris rnying ma/'og khang gi rten gtsor jo bo byang chub chen po thog tshad ma/g.yas g.yon du nye ba'i sras brgyad/khro bo gnyis bcas 'jim sku la phra rgyan mang po yod pa/de'i mtha' bskor gyi skor khang kha phyi bltas nang bltas gnyis kar (bka' thang )nang gsal ba bzhin gyi ldebs bris rnams bal bris rnying ma/dbu rtser g.yu rtsi can gyi rgya phibs bcas yod ci nga/de sngon ka thog si tu rin po che chos kyi rgya mtsho dbus gtsang gnas mjal du phebs skabs nyams chag med par bsdad yod tshal dam pa des mdzad pa'i (dbus gtsang gnas bskor lam yig )sde dge dpar ma'i shog grangs 103nas 104bar gsal}
