khal kha ngag dbang mkhas grub|{khal kha sog po'i ming rigs kyi dge bshes mtshan snyan shin tu che ba zhig /rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa phag (1779(lor sog yul du 'khrungs/sku na gzhon dus khal kha khu re dgon chen dang/dbus kyi gdan sa chen po se 'bras gang rigs shig tu bzhugs nas mu mthud slob gnyer gnang zhing/zhor pa 'on rgyal sras blo bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho dang/khri chen bstan pa rab rgyas/de mo blo bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho/khri chen dge 'dun tshul khrims sogs bla ma dam pa mang po'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos skor mtha' yas pa gnas nas rang yul du phebs/dad 'dus slob ma rnams la so so'i re 'dod dang mtshams pa'i chos gsungs/khal kha dgon chen kyai rdor grwa tshang gi mkhan po dang tshogs chen gyi mkhan po mdzad/dgung lo nga dgu pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me bya (1837)lor sku gshegs/gsung rtsom pod lnga khal khar shing dpar yod cing dkar chag ni bla brang bkra shis 'khyil gyi dpe mdzod dkar chag nang gsal/rnam thar gyi skor/dam pa de yi zhal slob ngag dbang ye shes thub bstan rab 'byams pas mdzad pa kha byang du (dpal ldan bla ma dam pa rdo rje 'chang ngag dbang blo bzang mkhas grub dpal bzang po'i rnam thar dad pa'i 'khri shing )zhes 'khod pa shing dpar la shog grangs 63yod pa zhig dam pa de'i gsung 'bum pod (ka)pa'i nang du bzhugs}
khal kha chos rje ngag dbang dpal ldan|{yongs grags su dpal ldan chos rje zer/mdo sngags rig gnas dang bcas par mkhas pa'i phul du phyin pa'i sog rigs kyi dge bshes dbus gtsang khams gsum sog yul dang bcas par mtshan snyan shing du che ba zhig yin/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me yos (1807)lor khal kha'i yul du 'khrungs/khu re dgon chen du mtshan nyid kyi slob gnyer dang rig gnas gsan bsam la dkar spyad 'bad brtson chen po mdzad/dgung lo bzhi bcur phebs pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me rta (1846)lor 'jam dbyangs bzhed pa ngag dbang brtson 'grus kyis mdzad pa'i (grub mtha' chen mo )nang gsal ba'i dkar gdan khag la mchan 'grel shin tu rgyas pa zhig mdzad/dgung lo nga gsum pa rab byung bcu pa'i sa lug (1859)lor (mngon rtogs rgyan gyi 'grel pa )dang/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags bya (1861)lor )dbu ma 'jug pa'i 'grel pa )bcas brtsams/dus skabs mi gsal yang ('bras spungs blo gsang gling dang sgo mang gi yig cha'i bzhed tshal mi 'dra ba phyogs bkod blo gsal dga' ston )zhes pa mdzad pa rnams blo gsal don gnyer ngan rnams gung chen por lta ba'i me long dang/blo sgo 'byed pa'i lde mig lta bur gyur yod/dgung lo ji tsam bzhugs pa sogs kyi rnam thar da phan lag tu ma son pas bri ma nus lags}
khal kha rje btsun dam pa blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{(khal kha sku phreng dang po )yon sog po'i rgyal rabs 'thor nas sog yul gcig pur srid dbang bzung ba'i khal kha'i rgyal po u ru tha'i rdo rje rgyal po zhes tA la'i bla ma bsod nams rgya mtshor mjal myong ba de'i sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing phag (1635)lor sku 'khrungs/dben sa pa chen po blo bzang don grub kyi drung du rab tu byung/'bras spungs sngags pa bla ma nam mkha' bsod nams yongs 'dzin du gdan drangs/dgung lo bco lnga pa sa glang (1649)lor sku 'bum dang bya khyung sogs brgyud nas dbus gtsang du phebs/paN chen rin po che blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan las dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes shing/paN chen ring po ches jo nang tA ra nA tha'i sprul skur ngos 'dzin gnang/dgung lo bcu drug thog tA la'i bla ma rin po che sku phreng lnga par mjal te mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan nas rang yul du phebs/dgung lo nyer gcig pa shing lug (1655)lor slar yang dbus gtsang du lan gnyis pa phebs te tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa rin po che dang paN chen ring po che sogs dam pa mang po'i drung nas chos rgyun mtha' yas pa gnas nas lo rjes mar rang yul du phebs/dgung lo nga gnyis pa me stag (1636)lor khal kha dang o rod jun gar gnyis 'khrungs pa byung bar dga' ldan khri rin po che rgya nag pa blo gros rgya mtsho dang lhan du 'dum 'grig gnang bar phan nus chen po thon te lo shas ring dmag 'khrug ma byung/dgung lo re gcig tu phebs pa'i shing phag (1695)lor jun gar gyi dpon skal ldan bo shog thus khal kha la dmag drangs te/khal khar pham nyer chen po khel bar brten/dam pa 'di nyid kyis gtsos pa'i khal kha'i dpon rigs rnams ching gong ma khang shing la skyabs bcol zhu gnang mdzad pa bzhin pe cin du gnas drangs te bsnyen bkur sne len gzab rgyas thog gong ma khang shis rang nyid ngo mas dmag 'di na khrid bkod 'doms mdzad de jun gar gyi dmag dpung khal kha nas mthar skrod btang thub pa byung/dgung lo drug cu re drug thog slar yang rang yul du phebs nas nas dmag 'khrug gi ring nyams chag byung ba'i yul da dang/dgon pa/rten gsum bcas nyams gso dang gsar bzhengs sngar las lhag pa mdzad/lo tsA ba mang po bod nas (dag yig za ma tog )sog skad du bsgyur/rje nyid kyis sog yag gsar bzo 'ga' zhig gnang/mthar dgung lo gya dgu pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu yol (1723)lor rang yul du sku gshegs/lo rgyus rnam thar rgyas pa zhig khal kha dge bshes ngag dbang ye shes thub bstan rab 'byams pas mdzad pa kha byang du (khyab bdag 'khor lo'i mgon po rje btsun dam pa blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi rnam thar bskal bzang dad pa'i shing rta )khal kha khu re dgon gyi shing dpar shog grangs 72yod pa zhig khong gi gsum 'bum pod (kha)pa'i 'gor yod kyang kho bor dpe cha lag tu ma son zhing/lo rgyus thar thor sum pa mkhan chen ye shes dpal 'byor gyis mdzad pa'i chos 'byung nang 'khod 'dug pa gzigs par 'dod na (chos 'byung dpag bsam ljon bzang )(sum pa chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 991nas 992bar gsal}
khal kha rje btsun dam pa blo bzang bstan pa'i sgron me|{9khal kha sku phreng gnyis pa )khal kha'i yul du yab ra han chin wang dang hA thon cha gan tA ra gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing 'brug (1724)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo drug pa phebs pa sa bya (1729)lor gdan sa'i khri la bkod/yongs 'dzin gyi drung nas rig gnas dang mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang po gsan/dgung lo bcu bzhi pa me sbrul (1737)lor pe cin du phebs nas gong ma chen lung dang mjal zhing gong ma dang lhan du khri gcig gi steng lhan bzhugs gnang 'ug pa sogs bkur bzos che zhing gong ma'i mgul phreng sogs legs 'bul g+r+yacher gnang/de nas rang yul du phyir phebs mdzad/mtshan nyid dang/rgyud pa/smad pa bcas gra tshang gsum yod pa'i dgon chen bstan pa dar rgyas gling phyag btab/dgung lo so bzhi pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me glang (1757)lor dgongs pa rdzogs/lo rgyus mdor bsdus krong go nang bstan slob gling gi slob deb bco brgyad pa'i grangs 998nas 1999bar gsal}
khal kha rje btsun dam pa ye shes bstan pa'i nyi ma|{(khal kha spu phreng gsum pa )khams yul mi thi dang du par dpon bstan 'dzin mgon po dang yum nor 'dzin dbang mo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa stag (1758)lor 'khrungs/gong ma'i bka' mngags blon chen li'u am ban dang/dza sag thu han sogs kyis li thang nas gdan drangs te mtsho bdun dgos par phebs der gong ma chen lung dang mjal zhing/lcang skya rin po che rol pa'i rdo rje'i drung nas rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes pa dang chos bka' mang du gnas/dgung lo bdun la phebs pa shing sprel (1764)lor khal kha'i khu re chen mo'i dgon pa'i khri la mnga' gsol zhus/yongs 'dzin no mon han gyi drung nas rig gnas mdo sngags dang bcas pa gsan bsam legs par mdzad cing/ngo mtshar gyi mdzad pa sna tshogs bstan bzhin pa'i mu nas/dgung lo bcu bdun pa rab byung de ga'i shing rta (1774)lor dgongs par mya ngan las 'das so/_}
khal kha rje btsun dam pa blo bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho|{(khal kha sku phreng bzhi pa )lha sa po tA la'i zhol jo lags nang zan zhig gi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing lug (1775)lor sku 'khrungs/tA la'i bla ma rin po che 'jam dpal rgya mtshos ngos 'dzin mdzad/tA la'i bla ma rin po che dang pan chen rin po che dpal ldan ye shes sogs dam pa mang po'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/khu re dgon chen du mtshan nyin dang/rgyud pa/sman pa bcas kyi grwa tshang gsum gsar 'dzugs gnang thog /rten bzhengs dang mchod rgyun rgya cher gsar 'dzugs gnang/dam pa nyid 'dul khrims gtsang zhing/nyin mtshan kun tu dpe gzigs dang thugs dam nyams bzhes kyi mdzad pa dang mi bral ba sogs sku na gzhon nu zhig la dpag pa'i mdzad pa skye bo kun gyi mig dper 'os pa zhig yod kyang/dgung lo so dag pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu bya (1813)lor ri bo rtse lngar phebs te der mya ngan las 'das/rnam thar mdor bsdus shig khal kha kyai rdor grwa tshang gi mkhan po ngag dbang blo bzang mkhas grub kyis mdzad pa (rjes btsun dam pa blo bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho dpal bzang po'i mdzad pa'i cha shas brjod byar byas pa'i gtang gi phreng ba (shing dpar ma la shog grangs 44yod pa dam pa de'i gsung 'bum pod (ka)pa'i mjug tu bzhugs}
khal kha rje btsun dam pa blo bzang tshul khrims 'jigs med bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{(khal kha sku phreng lnga pa )rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing phag (1815)lor sku 'khrungs/sku na phra mo'i dus nas dge ba'i bshes gnyen tshul bzhin bsten nas gsan bsam la thugs brtson che/tA la'i bla ma tshul khrims rgya mtsho dang/paN chen rin po che bstan pa'i nyi ma sogs dam pa mang po'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos bka' rgya cher gsan/paN chen rin po che'i drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/rang yul du phebs nas dgon sde khag gi slob gnyer dang/chos 'chad (nyan sogs gong 'phel gyi thabs tshul bad pa cher bskyed mdzad/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me bya (1837)lor dge ldan bshad sgrub dar rgyas gling gi grwa rigs thams cad grwa tshang bkra shis chos 'phel gling dang kun dga' chos gling gnyis su bsdus nas sgo mang grwa tshang dang/blo gsal gling grwa tsam gsar 'dzugs gnas/pe cin du phebs nas gong ma btwa bkwang dang mjal te sngar srol dang mthun pa'i gus bkur dang gnang sbyin mdzad/dgung lo nyer bdun pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags glang (1841)lor bod dbus gtsang du thegs gnyis pa phebs pa'i lam bar du sku gshegs/rnam thar skor/mkhan po no min han ngag dbang ye shes thub bstan rab 'byams pas mdzad pa'i 'jigs med bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi rnam thar las brtsams pa'i bstod pa dad pa'i shing rta (shing dpar ma shog grangs 7yod pa rtsom pa po'i gsum 'bum pod (kha)pa'i nang du bzhugs}
khal kha rje btsun dam pa ngag dbang blo bzang 'jam dpal bstan 'dzin tshul khrims rgya mtsho|{(khal kha sku phreng drug pa )rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu stag (1842)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun la phebs pa rab byung gong gsal gyi sa sprel (1848)lor ngos 'dzin zhus nas khri la bkod tsam la 'brum bu'i bsnyun gzhi la brten nas dgongs pa rdzogs}
khal kha rje btsun dam pa ngag dbang chos kyi dbang phyug 'phrin las rgya mtsho|{(khal kha sku phreng bdun pa )rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags khyi (1850)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu dgu bzhes pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa 'brug (1868)lor dgongs pa rdzogs}
khal kha rje btsun dam pa ngag dbang blo bzang chos kyi nyi ma bstan 'dzin dbang phyug|{(khal kha sku phreng brgyad pa )rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags rta (1870)lor rgyal ba 'phrin las rgya mtsho'i sku nyer gtogs pa zhol tsha gur du 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga la phebs skabs rgyal ba'i yongs 'dzin phur lcog byams pa rgya mtsho'i drung nas dge bsnyen dang rab byung gi p+sadom pa bzhes/skyor mo lung mnga' ris sprul sku yongs 'dzin du bsko gzhag gnang ste lhan rgyas tA khu re du gdan drangs/rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa sprel (1908)lor de sngon dpar brkos 'go tshugs nas mjug skyel ma grub par lus pa'i bka' 'gyur gyi shing dpar pod brgya dang lnga cha tshang mjug skyong gnang/rab byung gong gsal gyi lcags bya (1921)lor kha kha'i yul du gsar brje'i las 'gul byung zhing/srid gzhung gsar pa tshugs ti phyin chad rje btsun dam pa'i yang srid ngos 'dzin gdan zhu byed mi chog pa'i khyab bsgrags byas shing/dgung lo nga bzhi pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu phag (1923lor dgongs pa rdzogs}
khal kha tsho pa bdun|{'di skor gyi dpyad gzhi kha gsal zhig ma rnyed pas (sum pa chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 1004nas 1005bar gsal ba ltar bkod na/mdor dril na sog po snga dus khri skor bzhi bcu yod pa'i sum cu pe can du lus/bcu phyi logs la thon pa'i bzhi la o'i lod (jun gar smad )zer/bar du phyi'i sog po la rgyab kyi o'i lod dang/smad kyi mon gol gnyis las phyi ma la/g.yas ru gsum ni/or tu su/thu med bcu gnyis/a ru hor chen/g.yon ra gsum ni/cha har/hal ha/ur han zer/dus phyis mong gol dang/hal ha/o'i lod gsum du 'byed/de las mong gol tsho chen bzhi bcu zer ba gong smos ltar tshogs 'dus drug tu 'dus pa ni/rma chu'i phug gi or tu su'i sa cha ai khe jo bo na wang dang/had gin/'o thog /ta lang/a shang/jon gar drug mkhar sngon po'i rgyab kyi u yan chab na/dur bed/khu'u khed/chos khur/hal ha/u rang stod smad bar gsum ste drug /o'u han/ja rong/khe shig than/a ru hor chin dang bdun/zhi le'i na gel na/a pa gwa/so nyid/ong nyod/hu'i ching/han chen dang lnga/yo sog thun/thu med ja ling/hor los/ha tsho hor/a ma ga nar/hor chen dang drug /je re'i mu na/hor chen tsho bcu/u cu mu ji'o/_/hal ha la tsho bdu yod kyang/g.yas ru ja sag thu han/dbus su thu zhe'i thu/g.yon ru che chen han gyi shog kha gsum du 'du'o/_/zhes 'byung}
