khal kha'am brag ri dam tshig rdo rje grags pa dpal|{rje 'di ni hal ha yul grur jing gir gyi rgyal rgyud du yab tshe dbang bkra shis dang/yum bsod nams skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags glang (1781)lor 'khrungs/no yon ho thog thu ye shes don grub kyis mtshan tshe ring rdo rjer gsol/dgung lo bcu gnyis la khu re dgon par chos zhugs mdzad nas bsdus grwa sogs gzhung lugs la gsan sbyong mdzad/dgung lo bcu drug la dkar bcu ye shes don grub kyi drung du rab byung bsgrubs/dgung lo bcu dgu la thu'u bkwan rin po che'i drung du phebs nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/dgung lo nyi shu la dgon lung du phebs nas thu'u bkwan chos kyi nyi ma'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs/dgung lo nyer bzhi la khal kha rje btsun sku phreng bzhi pa dang lhan du dbus su phebs nas rgyal dbang 'jam dpal rgya mtsho dang mjal/se ra byas bsam blo khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad/hal ha blo bzang sbyin pa yongs 'dzin du bsten nas gzhung chen mor slob gnyer mdzad/khri chen ngag dbang snyan grags gyi drung nas kyang dam chos mang du gsan/mdo sngags kyi gzhung chen la mkhas pa'i grags pa rgyas/bod du slob gnyer lo bcu drug bzhugs nas dgung lo bzhi bcu tham pa la rje btsan dam pa sku phreng lnga pa'i mchog sprul khal khar gdan zhu gnang ba dang sbrags rang yul du phyir phebs/dgung lo re drug la rje btsun dam pa sku phreng lnga pa dgongs pa rdzogs pa'i mchod 'bul du dbus gtsang du phebs/rje 'di nyid 'chad rtsod kyi rig pa zab pa ma zad/rtsom pa la'ang mchog tu mnga' bas/(byang chub lam rim gyi khrid yig sman mchog theg chen blo sbyong gi dmigs rnam skyong tshul bdud rtsi'i nying khu )(dbu ma 'jug pa'i 'grel bshad rgyal sras rgya mtsho'i 'jug ngogs/) (sman mchog kha skong dang bcas pa nor bu'i mdzes rgyan/) (spyan ras gzigs lha lnga'i sgrub dkyil cho ga /) (rdo rje 'jigs byed lha bcu gsum gyi las rim/) (bde mchog dkar po'i mchog chog dpal ster/) (sgrub mchod rgyas pa dngos grub gter mdzad/) (sgrol dkar yid bzhin 'khor lo'i chos mchog rab rgyas/) (bla ma'i rnal 'byor sna tshogs kyi skor/) (tshe sgrub 'chi med srog shing/) kun mkhyen gnyis pa slob dpon chen po dbyig gnyen zhabs kyi (phung po lnga'i rab byed )sogs mdo sngags kyi bstan bcos po ti bcu drug tsam brtsams pa gnang/mthar dgung grangs don lnga la phebs pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing yos (1855)lor gzugs sku'i bkod pa re zhig chos dbyings su bsdu ba'i tshul bstan}
