khu ston brtson 'grus g.yung drung|{jo bo rje a ti sha'i slob ma'i gtso bo khu rngog 'brom gsum (1 khu ston brtson 'grus g.yung drung/2 rngog legs pa'i shes rab/3 'brom ston pa rgyal ba'i 'byung gnas )gyi nang gses/mtshan gzhan dge bshes khu chen po yang zer/rab byung dang po'i gong gi lcags phag (1011)lor yar lung sku 'khrungs/dge bshes nag tsho lo tsA ba dang dgung mnyam yin/grub mer tshul khrims 'byung gnas kyi drung du rab tu byung/dge bshes grwa pa mngon shes la yang chos 'ga' zhig gsan/rjes su rngog legs pa'i shes rab dang/'brel shes rab 'bar gnyis dang mnyam du bar khams ldan klong thang du byon nas bla ma se btsun gyi slob ma mdzad de chos mang du gsan/'brom p+saton pa jo bo ja a ti sha mjal bar mnga' ris su phebs pa'i phyi lo dbus su phebs/thango cher bzhugs nas mtshan nyid kyi bshad pa mdzad pas slob ma mang du byung zhing/dwags po dbang rgyal gyis khong gi drung du phar phyin gsan/jo bo rje a ti sha 'brom ston pas dbus su gdan drangs skabs phebs bsur rta pa mang po dang bcas te bsu ba zhu mkhan tshang ma'i sngon la phebs nas thang po cher gdan drangs/rjes su 'brom ston pas khu ston gyis ma mkhyen pa mdzad de lkog tu bsam yas dang snye thang du gdan darangs pas 'brom ston par shin tu ma mnyes/de nas 'brom ston pas mngon lkog gang sar dge bshes khu ston chen por bsngags brjod yang yang mdzad pa gsan nas jo bo rje dang 'brom ston par dgongs sel zhu bar thang po che nas brag yer pa bar zhabs thang gis phebs/'brom ston pa dang mjal ma thag sku phyag phul nas bzod gsol mdzad de de nas bzung 'brom ston pa la gus bkur gzhan dang mi 'dra ba gnang/mthar dgung lo re lnga pa rab byung dang po'i shing yos (1075)laur sku gshegs/dge bshes chen po 'dis mdzad pa'i bod kyi lo rgyus (log gnon chen mo )zhes kha byang du 'khod pa zhig dpar bo gtsug lag phreng bas gzigs myong tshul (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )bod kyi rgyal rabs kyi mjug tu gsungs 'dug na yang/deng sang de'i dpe rgyun da phan gtan nas ma rnyed/'dir bkod pa'i lo rgyus ni (deb sngon )deb gzugs lcags dpar m