khyab 'jug pa|{mu stegs kyi grub mtha' smra ba'i ming ste/lha chen po khyab 'jug ston par khas len pas na khyab 'jug pa zhes thogs pa dang/ming gzhan zla ba pa dang/klu'i chos smra zhes zer/grub mtha' 'di 'dzin mkhan gyi bla ma zla ba dang/ston pa gzhon nu ma len (slob dpon chos grags dang rtsod pa byed mkhan )la sogs pa yod/grub mtha' 'di'i 'dod tshul la/khyab 'jug ni grong khyer sgo ldan zhes bya ba na dpal mo la sogs pa'i chung ma khri drug stong gis bskor nas gsan pa dang/tshangs pa dang/brgya sbyin/nyi ma zla ba/rig byed bzhi/'byung ba bzhi/bram ze la sogs pa 'jig rten na grags che ba thams cad khyab 'jug rang nyid yin snyam pa'i spobs pa dang ldan zhing/de la zhi dang ma zhi gnyis yod pa'i zhi ba ni/lha rdzas kyi ngo bo/yod min med min gyi bdag nyid/'chi ba med pa'i ngo bo yin zhing/de bsgoms pas thar pa thob pa yin la/ma zhi ba ni nya dang rus sbal la sogs pa'i sprul pa bcu la khya 'jug gi 'jug pa bcu zhes pa'i rig byed kyi gtam rgyud bshad srol yod pa rnams yin par khas len/gzhan yang rtag pa cha med kyi bdag khes len cing/grol byed kyi lam ni yi ge om bsgoms pa dang rlung bum pa can bsgoms pa sogs yod pa dang 'khor ba las thar rgyu yod par khas len pas thar pa khas len mkhan gyi gras yin/spyir btang mu stegs khyab 'jug pa la lha khyab 'jug 'jig rten gyi byed pa por khas len pa zhig yod par ba dpon spyan ras gzigs brtul zhugs kyis mdzad pa'i (dbu ma rtsa ba'i 'grel pa shes rab sgron me'i rgya cher 'grel pa )las gsungs shing/(dus 'khor 'grel chen dri med 'od )las mu stegs khyab 'jug pa la rdul phran cha med 'jig rten gyi byed pa por 'dod pa zhig kyang yod par dam pa 'ga' zhig gis gsungs pa ni/dus 'khor 'grel chen gyi tshig gong 'og bsdus nas zhib tu ma gzigs pa'i skyon yin par mkhas grub chen po dge legs dpal bzang gis mdzad pa'i (dus 'khor Tika chen )las gsungs yod/mu stegs yab 'jug pa'i 'dod tshul zhib par slob dpon spyan ras gzigs brtul zhugs kyis mdzad pa'i (dbu ma'i 'grel chen )dang/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa ngag dbang brtson 'grus kyis mdzad pa'i (grub mtha