khyab pa'i dmigs pa bzhi|{rnam par rtog pa dang bcas pa'i gzugs brnyan/rnam rtog med pa'i gzugs brnyan/dngos po'i mtha'/dgos pa yongs grub/1 rnam par rtog pa bcas pa'i gzugs brnyan zhes pa ni/dmigs rten de la dmigs nas dpyad pa byed pa'i tshe dpon byed kyang rnam rtog yod par brten nas rtog dang bcas pa zhes dang/gzugs brnyan zhes pa dmigs rten rang mtshan pa de dngos min par de'i rnam pa sems la 'char ba la zer/2 rnam par rtog pa med pa'i gzugs brtan ni dmigs rten de la dmigs pa'i tshe dpyad pa ma byed par sems rtse gcig tu mnyam par bzhag pa yin zhing/de'i tshe dpyod byed kyi rnam rtog med pa'i nang nas de ltar brjod pa yin/dmigs pa de gnyis dmigs byed kyi sems yi sgo nas 'jog pa yin cing/dang po de lhag mthong gi dmigs pa yin pa dang/gnyis pa de zhi gnas kyi dmigs pa yin/3 dngos po'i mtha' ni/thar pa don gnyer gyi blang dor gyi gzhir gyur pa'i shes bya thams cad bden pa bzhir 'dus lugs bsam nas de'i rjes su grangs nges par thag bcad nas sems ma g.yeng bar 'jog pa yin/de ni dmigs pa bya yul gyi sgo nas bzhag pa yin/4 dgos pa yongs su grub pa ni/dmigs rten de dag gi gzugs brnyan la zhi gnas dang lhag mthong gnyis kyis dmigs nas rgyun mi 'a chad par bsam nas goms 'dris byas/yang nang yang du sgom pa la brten nas lus shin sbyangs dang/sems shing sbyangs skye be ni dgos pa'i gtso bo yin par dmigs pa bzhi pa 'di 'bras bu'i sgo nas 'jog pa yin/zhib par (lam rim )gyi zhi gnas skabs su gsal}
khyab byed 'byung ba lnga phrag lnga ste nyer lnga|{rang shar las/'byung ba chen po lnga ni rang gi lus la tshang/de yang rlung rnam pa lngas ye shes kyi gdangs byed do/_/me rnam pa lngas ye shes kyi rtsal byed do/_/sa rnam pa lngas ye shes kyi ngo bo byed do/_/chu rnam pa lngas ye shes kyi yul byed do/_/nam mkha' rnam pa lngas ya shes kyi gnas byed do/_/de la sa lnga'i gnas tshul ni/kun tu snang ba'i sa rig pa dang lhan cig tu gnas/mi 'gyur ba rje'i sa sgron ma dang lhan cig tu gnas/thams cad 'byung ba rin po ches sa thig le dang lhan cig tu gnas/snang ba stong pa kun tu mtha' yas pa'i sa dbyings ye shes gnyis dang lhan cig tu gnas/sgrub pa mthar phyin pa'i sa shes rab dang lhan cig tu gnas so/_/chu lnga las/'byung ba med pa'i cha rtsa thams cad la gnas/zhib gsal dag gi chu rus pa thams cad la gnas/yon tan rgyas pa'i chu khrag thams cad la gnas/chags pa med pa'i chu ser thams cad la gnas/'dzin med rdzogs pa'i chu mig gi nang nas gnas so/_/me lnga las/phyi nang kun tu khyab byed kyi me glo ba gnas/phyi nang kun gsal gyi me yig gnyis dang yan lag la gnas/phyi nang kun tu mnyam pa'i me sha pags bar na gnas/phyi nang gi byab rtog pa'i me rkang mthil gnyis na gnas so/_/rlung lnga las/srog 'dzin gyi rlung srog rtsa na gnas/bkrag dang gzi mdangs skyed pa'i rlung smin phrag na gnas/me dang mnyam du gnas pa'i rlung pho ba na gnas/kun tu khyab byed kyi rlung lus kun la khyab par gnas/snying rje med pa bskal pa las kyi rlung snying dang snying shun gyi bar na gnas so/_/nam mkha' lnga las/kun la khyab pa'i nam mkha' rig pa dngos dang dbyer med du gnas/yum med gsal dwangs kyi nam mkha' dbyangs rnam par dag pa dang dbyer med du gnas/ma 'dres dag pa'i nam mkha' dbyings rnam par dag pa dang dbyer med du gnas/don mtshon byed kyi nam mkha' rtags kyi ye shes thig le stong pa dang dbyer med du gnas/dag pa'i zhing du sgrol byed kyi nam mkha' sku dang ye shes kyi snang ba thams cad dang dbyer med du gnas zhes gsungs so/_}
