khyung po spungs sad zu tse|{rgyal po gnam ri srong btsan dang/srong btsan sgam po gnyis kyi ring blon po byas/thog mar rgyal po gnam ri srong btsan gyi dus su gtsang stod kyi rgyal po mar mun g.yo thabs kyis mgo bo bcad nas bsad/de'i mnga' 'bangs ma ser them dud khri gnyis tsam gnam ri srong btsan la phul/de rjes btsan po sku mched la mong sngon pos ngo log gi g.yu byus bshams pa khyung po zu tses shes nas ther 'dod byas pas rgyal po'i sku srog la gnod pa ma byung/khyung po zu tse ni spyang grung ldan la blo khog che ba dang/'jon thang che ba/ming mangs la shin tu mkhas pas sus kyang 'gran zla byed mi thub pa sogs la ba rten nas srong btsan sgam po'i blon chen gras su tshud/lo na mthon por slebs nas las gnas dgongs pa zhus te ngal gso byed chog pa'i gnang ba thob/de nas srong btsan sgam po sku bkrong rgyu'i jus ngan gra sgrig legs par byas rjes/btsan pa sku ngo ma zu tse'i khyim du sku mgron la gdan 'dren zhu skabs btsan pos zhal bzhes gnang thog /sngon la blon po mgar stong btsan zu ce'i khyim du rtog zhib byed par gtong gnas mdzad par/zu tses go skabs de dang bstun nas srong btsan sgam po sku bkrong rgyu'i gra sgrig yod pa mgar stong btsan gyis gsal por shes nas srong btsan sgam por snyan gseng zhus/mgar stong btsan btsan po'i drung du bros phyin pa zu tses shes rjes rang nyid kyi bu ngag re khyung la thabs shes bslabs pa bzhin zu tses rang srog bcad/bu des pha yi ro thog nas mgo bo bcad de srong btsan sgam por phul nas pha yi nag nyes mtshang 'dod byed khul byas par brten/bu la nyes khrims med par gu yangs thob thub pa byung ba bcas zhib par tun hong yig char gsal}
