khyung tshang pa ye shes bla ma|{rje btsun ras chung ba'i slob ma'i chos gtso grags can gris yin/rab byung gnyis pa'i shing lug (1115)lor stod lung du yab mgar ba rtse rgyal dang yul 'bum mo btsun ma 'bar gyi sras su 'khrungs/chung dus nas rab tu byung ba'i mtshan la ye shes bla ma zhes grags/dge bshes rgya dmar ba'i drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa zhus/zho 'phrang ba las 'dul ba/dar yon tan grags las dbu ma rigs tshogs/bzad pa dbang rdol las spyod phyogs/dge bshes rgya dmar ba las dbu ma dang tshad ma bcas gsan/rngog gi drung nas bde mchog dang kri ya gsan/'bri sgom gling kha ba'i drung dug dmas pa zhus pas ras chu pa'i drung du song gsungs pa ltar ras chung pa dang mjal/de dus ras chud pa dbu dkar por gyur yod kyang/gdams ngag cha tshang bar ston pa'i slob ma snod ldan ma byung stabs/slob ma tshor man ngag spyir btang yongs su grags pa rnams ma gtogs snyan ba rgyud kyi man ngag cha tshang bar 'dzin nus pa'i slob ma zhig sgug nas bzhugs pa dang stabs khel nas man ngag yongs su rdzogs pa khong lag nang ste nga ma shi'i bar du gzhan la ma ston par gsang nas nyams su longs/de nas slob ma 'byor pa che chung dang rigs bzang ngan la ma ltos par gdams pa khyad med du sbyin gsungs/de nas gnas nges med du byon nas sgrub pa nyams zhes gtso bos mdzad de rlung sems la rang dbang thob nas grong 'jug mdzad thub pa byung/rang chas pa sku gshegs nas gtso bor brag dkar khyung tshang la bzhugs nas sgom sgrub gtso bor mdzad pa'i zhor la slob ma 'ga' shas la gdams pa gnang bas brgyud pa 'dzin nas pa yang mi nyung ba byung/dgung lo drug cu re gnyis pa rab byung gsum pa'i me sprel (1176)lor sku gshegs/lo rgyus skor (deb sngon )lcags dpar ma'i stod cha shog grangs 528nas 530bar dang/(lho rong chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 115nas 119bar gsal}
