khral rigs bcog theb|{khral rigs rnams ched mngags med par bzo thabs}
khral rigs chag cha|{khral rigs med par bzos pa'i cha}
khri ka|{(mdo smad chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 17phreng 8par rgya yi gong gu rme ru bya bar rgya bod kyi sa mtshams byas te der bod btsan po'i gtsug lag khang dang/rgya rje'i gtsug la khang brtsigs par bshad pa mchod rten dkar por ngos 'dzin pa dang/mnga' bdag khri ral nyid dngos su phebs shing ral pa nang bzhugs kyi mchod rten khri kar yod pa grags che zhes dang/shog grangs 294bar an chung gnam rdzong dum khas pa mi gsum yun ring bzhugs shing sgom khrid bskyangs/ska phug blo bzang don grub pas ri rtser sgrub khang brtsigs te 'dzin skyong mdzad/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing stag (1794)lor bkra shis thang du kham ri'i grwa tshang btab/bya khyung rgyud pa chos dbar bteg pa la kham ri'i sde pas bsnyen bkur byed/'di nas gra ma'i la rgya ban khri ka gong mar slebs/zhes dang/de ga'i grangs 294khri ka gong 'og gi mtshams su srid po ri 'di phrag dkar gas rams pa'i rnam thar du/stod mi la smad sbrul mjug tu 'khyil bar 'jam dpal na ga ra k+Shar 'dra tshul dang/zhes dang/rma chu nub nas shar du 'bab pa'i tshur ngos ko ra/gong ba/kab ron te lung pa gsum gyi mdar khri ka'i rgya mkhar zhig yod pa der dus gsum sangs rgyas dang/'jigs byed/mgon chos sogs chos skyong yongs rdzogs bzhugs pa'i mi nyag mgon khang dang/mi nyag gu thog tu grags pa yod ces sogs gsal ba 'dir dpyad gzhir bkod pa}
khri kun dga' blo gros|{mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal po khri rgyal bsam 'grub lde dang/bdag mo rjes ma kan pa bza' shes rab rgyal mo gnyis la bu gsum (1 che ba khri bkra shis dpal 'bar/2 'bring ba lha btsun nam mkha' dpal mgon/3 chung ba kun dga' blo gros )byung ba'i chung ba de yin/sku tshe'i stod la sgo mang gtsug lag khang gi chos dpon mdzad cing sku gsum thugs rje mang du bzhengs/rjes su khri kun dga' rnam rgyal lde'i btsun mo gu ge ma dkon mchog bzang mo dang 'dus pa'i sras khri kun bzang grags pa rdo rje 'khrungs pa de yin}
khri kun bzang grags pa rdo rje|{mnga' ris gung thug p+sago mang gtsug lag khang gi chos dpon kun dga' blo blos dang/khri kun dga' rnam rgyal lde'i btsun mo gu ge ma dkon mchog bzang mo 'dus pa'i sras yin/rab byung dgu pa'i sa byi (1528)laur 'khrungs/thog mar bkra shis nam gling du chos skor zhugs te/dge 'dun spyi'i lam ris rnams mdzad nas chos dpon dang mkhan po yang mdzad/rjes su mnga' ris gung thang rgyal por gdung rgyud dkon par brten/lha rnam 'phrul rgyal po'i las rogs su phebs nas mnyam du bzhugs dgos byung/de yang khri bkra shis dpa' bar gyi btsun mo yang 'brog snang dkar rtse nas yin pa tshe ring rgyal mos mi ngan gzhan dang ngan gros byas te bdag mo gu ge ma dkon ma chog bzang mo lkog bkrongs byas shing/de rjes khri kun bzang nyi zla grags pa dang/kun bzang grags pa rdo rje gnyis kyi bkrongs nas mnga' ris gung thang gi srid dbang sde pa rin spungs par rtsis sprod rgyu'i bsam ngan bcangs te gshed ma mngags kyang/sgo mang dang nam gling bu lag gsum gyi gdong len pa 'byor ste khri sku ma ched gnyis bkrong ma thub cing/bdag mo yar 'brog ma rang yul du phyir slob thog /bdag mo gu ge ma bkrong mkhan rnams srog thog tu btang/de rjes slar yang bdag mo yar 'brog mas ring spungs nas dmag btang ste dpal khud bal blangs shing/lho shel dpar yang 'og tu ba sdus pa bcas byas stabs/khri kun bzang grags pa rdo rje dmag dpon mdzad de ring spungs pa'i dmag phab nyes su btang/lho shes dkar rgyal po'i sras rgan gzhon gnyis ring spungs pas mi gter nyar ba dang/sher dkar rdzong dang bcas pa tshur blangs nas sras che ba bye sa lho shel dkar gyi bdag po bskos shing/sras gzhon pa nam mkha' lhun grub rgyal rtse'i bdag mor dkon mchog rgyal mo'i mag par btang ba sogs dmag jus lam lhong byung/dgung lo so brgyad pa rab byung dgu pa'i shing glang (1565)lor gshegs/lo rgyus skor (bod kyi lo rgyus deb ther khag lnga )zhes pa'i shog grangs 139nas 141bar gsal ba der gzigs}
khri kun bzang nyi zla grags pa|{mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal po khri kun dga' rnam rgyal lde dang/btsun mo gu ge ma dkon mchog bzang po gnyis kyi sras su rab byung dug pa'i shing khyi (1514)lor 'khrungs/byis pa'i dus nas kun spyod bzang zhing blo gros che/dgung lo bcu drug par srid dbang bzung zhing/dpal rtsal ldan la srid don skyong mkhas pa zhig byung/gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi lugs la dad mos che bas rten gsum mang du bzhengs/rgyal po'i pho brang dga' ldan bkra shis rab brtan gsar du 'dzugs skrun thog /ldebs bris su sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyi 'khrungs rabs dpag bsam 'khri shing gi bkod pa dang/bod kyi btsan po rim byon gyi lo rgyus bcas ri mo'i sgyu rtsal phun sum tshogs pa zhig bzhengs/rang nyid gsang gas lnga 'gyur la dad pa che yang /grub mtha' gzhan la phyogs ris nye ring mi 'dzad/khrims lugs drang por srong zhing bya dga' chad gcod gang dang gang 'os dus thog tu gnang bas khrims sgo non zhing rgyal khams bde 'jags su gnas pa byung/gung thang chos grwa chen po gzhung chen po lngar slob gnyer dang grwa skor gyi srol bzang po btsugs/snga 'gyur gyi bstan 'dzin chen po rig 'dzin mchog ldan mgon po dang/dka' kun dga' gras pa/gter chen bstan gnyis gling pa/rig 'dzin yol mo ba shAkya bzang po sogs rtsa ba'i bla mar brtan nas snga 'gyur gyi chos mang po gsan/sku tshe'i smad la/khri rgyal bsam 'grub lde'i sras khri bkra shis dpal 'bar la srid dbang 'dzin du bcug ste rang nyid sgo mang gtsug lag khang gi chos dpon mdzad de mtshams bcas dmar por bzhugs/dgung lo bzhi bcu zhe bdun pa rang byung dgu pa'i lcags sprel (1560)lor gshegs/lo rgyus skor (bod kyi deb ther khag lnga )lcags dmar ma'i shog grangs 135nas 138bar gsal ba der gzigs}
khri bkra shis lde|{bod kyi btsan po'i gdung rgyud dpal lde'i rgyud pa yab khri chos skyong lde dang/yum sa skya bdag chen bzang po dpal ba'i sras mo kun dga' 'bum gnyis kyi sras su rab byung lnga pa'i chu byi (1312)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo sog dag pa rab byung drug pa'i lcags stag (1350)lor yab gshegs rjes srid dbang bzung/yab kyi dgongs rdzogs su ston mchog thub pa'i dbang po'i sku brnyan dang/yum gyi dgongs rdzogs su rje btsun sgrol ma'i sku brnyas rin po che du mas phra rgyan gyis mdzad pa bzhengs/rdzong dkar pho brang dang/chos sde'i lcags ri phyi ma/lcags ri chen mo'i lcags skor/stag tsang spe chen gyi lcags ri'i 'og nas rgyang ring por shar bskyod thub par dong lam dang gsang sgo spe'u/pho brang dang/chos sde'i nang du khron pa sogs srung skyob la mkho ba'i 'dzugs skrun mang po gnang/gangs rin po che'i shar phyogs dra la khul nas gser mang po rnyed pa rnams chud zos su mi 'gro ba'i ched du bstan 'gyur cha tshang gser yig bris pa bzhengs te de'i zhus dag nang mkhan la lo tsA ba chen po byang chub rtse mo sogs mkhan dbang mo spyan drangs shing/glegs bam tshang ba'i glegs shing la gser ris dang/bsdem thag si tA ho (si shan las bzos pa'i thag pa )las bzos pa'i glegs thag /dpe sgril bzang gos sha stag las grub pa rgyu tshogs dang spus tshad 'gran zla med pa zhig bzhengs nas rab byung drug pa'i chu yos (1363)lor legs par grub ste rab gnas zhus/da dung gser yig gis bris pa'i bka' 'gyur cha tshang bzhengs rgyu'i shog bu gra sgrig grub pa'i mtshams su/rab byung drug pa'i shing sbrul (1365)lor gshegs/de'i skor (bod kyi lo rgyus deb ther khag lnga )zhes pa'i shog grangs 113nas 117bar gsal}
khri bkra shis dpal 'bar|{mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal po khri rgyal bsam 'grub lde dang/btsun mo rjes ma kan pa bza' shes rab gnyis kyi sras yin/khri kun bzang nyi zla grags pa'i sku tshe'i smad la srid don gyi 'dzin skyong khong la bskos/rong pa dang sher pa ngo log pa rnams tshar bcad/lho shel dkar yang mnga' 'og tu bsdus/sgo mang gtsug lag khang gi ldebs bris rnams la nyams gso dang/gser yig rkyang pas bris pa'i bstan 'gyur bzhengs/de min lo rgyus zhib par mi gsal}
khri bkra shis brtsegs pa dpal|{mnga' bdag dpal 'khor btsan la btsun mo che chung gnyis yod pa'i chung ba mchims bzang btsun ne la sras khri bkra shis brtsegs pa dpal 'khrungs/yab dpal 'khor 'bangs gyen log gis bkrongs rjes la stod phyogs su byon/btsun mo cog ro bzang dpal mgon la sras dpal lde dang/'od lde/skyid lde gsum byung/chu 'brug lor yab mched so sor gyes nas sras gsum po grom pa lha rtser gzhis chags nas gtsang phyogs srid bzung ba yin}
khri skor bcu gsum|{'gro mgon chos rgyal 'phags pas se chen rgyal po'i bka' 'brel bzhin dbus gtsang la dbang sgyur skabs su btsugs pa'i khri skor sa khul te la stod lho byang gnyis dang/gur mo/chu mig /shangs/zha lu ste gtsang la khri skor drug /rgya ma dang/'bri gung/tshal pa/thang po che/phag mo gru/g.ya' bzang ste dbul la khri skor drug /dbus gtsang gi mtshams su yar 'brog stang lung khri skor gcig ste khri skor bcu gsum}
khri 'gyogs le tshan bdun|{khri gdan/khri gdong/khri rkang/khri rmang gnyis/ba gam/lan kan bcas bdun yin no/_}
khri rgya nag pa|{'og tu khri chen rgya nag pa blo gros rgya mtsho zhes pa'i 'grel bshad der gzigs}
khri rgya nag sprul pa'i sku|{gsham gsal khri chod mchog sprul blo bzang bstan pa'i nyi ma zhes pa'i 'grel bshad der gzigs}
khri rgyan bzhi|{khri drug 'gas ni seng ge sogs drug gis bteg pa'o/_/yang na rgyan bzhi ni/stobs glang chen/snying rje ri dwags/chu srin/srung ba ma 'dres pa bya khyung gi rgyan bzhi'o/_}
khri rgyab drug 'gyogs|{bya khyung dang/klu mo/chu srin/bu chung/kriSha Na sA ra/glang chen bcas kyis bteg pa'i sangs rgyas byang sems kyi khri'i rgyab yol}
khri rgyal bsam 'grub lde|{mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal po khri kun bzang grags pa rdo rje dang/khri kun bzang rnam 'a phrul rgyal po'i btsun mo glo bo bdag mo bsod nams rgyal mo 'dus pa las 'khrungs ('di'i 'khrungs lo gang yin mi gsal/'ga' zhig gis khri kun bzang rnam 'phrul rgyal po rang gi sras yid kyang zer/) rab byung dgu pa'i sa lug (1559)lor skyid grong sher pa (gzher pa )ngo log pa rnams tshar bcad/khri bsam lde rang nyid sa skyar phebs nas bdag chen kun dga' rin chen gyi drung nas chos gsan/bdag chen de'i sras mo rin chen sgrol ma btsun mor blangs shing lo shing ring du bde zhod 'jags byung/de nas dbon btsun he ru ka sogs skyid grong pa rnams ngo log ste gor kha dpon la mgo btags/gos khas rag ma'i rdzong bzung nas lo dgu'i ring se pa lo re nas sma ra zos sum cu gcig re bsdus/de nas dbon btsun pa sogs la dmag btang ste sra yang mnga' 'og tu bsdus/rab byung bcu pa'i chu sbrul (1593lor bdag mo dang gnyis ka gshegs/lo rgyus skor (bod kyi lo rgyus deb ther khag lnga )zhes pa'i shog grangs 141nas 142bar gsal}
khri rgyal bsod nams dbang lde|{mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal po khri phun tshogs lde dang/btsun mo byang pa tA dben gyi sras mo nam mkha' rgyal mo gnyis kyi sras/rab byung drug pa'i lcags phag (1371)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo gzhon dus byang pa tA dben gyis yab rgyal po dang sras gnyis bar phra ma bcug ste yab phun tshogs lde dgung lo so gsum pa lcags khyi (1370)lor bkrongs shing/byang pa tA dben gyis gung thang gi srid dbang lo lnga ris bzung zhing/gung thang gi srid don dang dpal 'byor la gnod 'tshe chen po byas par brten/blon po lha rje chos skyong sogs mi bzhes thabs shes sna tshogs kyi sgo nas byang pa phyir 'bud byas/sras sku mched gnyis la srid dbang 'dzin du bcug /de nas mi ring bar sras rgan pa mchog grub lde dang/chu ba bsod nams lde gnyis phran bu ma mthun pa byung bar brten chung ba bsod nams lde pu rang du bzhugs rgyu'i rtsis kyis phebs pa'i shul du gcen mchog grub lde rta bcag par phebs skabs rtas bskyur te gshegs/blon mo rnams kyis gcung bsod nams lde sa dga' gro shod du yod par phebs rjes zin te rdzong dkar du gdan drangs nas srid khrir bkod/gcen gshegs pa'i dgongs rdzogs rnams legs par bsgrubs/mnga' 'og rnams tsho bzhir bcas nas ('tsho ba rab/'bring/tha/yang tha bcas bzhi )dbul phyug lan gsum snyoms/dgung lo bcu dgu nas rig 'dzin chen po rgod kyi ldem phru can rtsa ba'i bla mar brten nas snga 'gyur gyi chos mang du gsan/rje btsun mi la'i sgrub nas ri bo dpal 'bar gyi dgos gzhi dngabacas pa phul/gzhan yang bo dong lo tsA ba grags pa rgyal mtshan/lo tsA ba ngag dbang grags pa/red mda' ba gzhon du blo gros rnams bsten nas gsang sngags gsar ma'i chos kyang mang du gsan/mnga' ris gung thang chos sde chen por grwa tshang bcu drug gi rmang gzhi btsugs pa sogs chos srid gnyis ka'i mdzad rjes rgya che ba'i ngang dgung lo so bzhi pa rang byung bdun pa'i shing sprel (1404)lor gshegs/'di'i sras nas chos rje kun bzang pa'i bar dpal lde'i sras dmar po lde bgrangs na nyi shu rtsa bzhi da nga/de ma bgrangs na rgyal rabs nyi shu rtsa gsum yod skor lo rgyud yig tshang du gsal lo/_/lo rgyus rgyas pa (bod kyi lo rgyus deb ther khag lnga )zhes pa'i shog grangs 117nas 121bar gsal}
khri sgra spungs btsan|{khri sgra dpung btsan zhes pa'ang snang )bod rgyal nyer drug pa/btsan lnga'i ya gyal/yab khri btsan nam dang yum sman bzang khri dkar gyi sras/blon po mgar sgra dzi mun dang thon mi glu mang dred pos byas/zhang zhung mu ha la rgyal gyis mu mthun sku bon byas/sman bza' klu steng ngang sman gsum klu steng khab tu bzhes}
khri chung|{bod kyi btsan po'i srid dbang sil bur 'thor ba'i rjes su gdung brgyud rnams stong smad bar gsum du kha 'thor nas chags pa'i gras smad kyi lde gsum (1 dpal lde/2 'od lde/3 0 skyid lde )byung ba'i lde la sras bzhi (1 pha ba de se/2 khri lde/3 nyag lde/4 khri chung )yod pa'i chung shos yin/'dis dbus su phebs te yum brtan gyi brgyud pa mgon de yar lung 'phying ba rtse khung du bzhugs pa la gyod btsugs de/de sngon yum brtan rgyud kyi 'od srung phyogs nas phrogs pa'i mkhar phying ba rtse khung slar yang tshur thob nas yar lung du gzhis chags te 'bangs rnams kyis rtsigs nas phul ba'i sku mkhar 'bangs brtsigs zhes grags pa byung zhing/de'i sras 'od skyid 'bar nas bzung rang byung bdun pa'i shing yos (1375)lor sa skya'i bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan sku gshegs 'i bar yar lung ngo bo'i gdung rgyud lha btsun tshul khrims bzang po zhugs yod tshul (yar lung chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 163nas 162bar gsal ba der gzigs}
khri chen|{1 sngar bod rje chos rgyal gyi gdung las brgyud cing/chos srid gnyis ka'i go gnas kyi lhag zhabs tsam skyong ba la khri chen gyi mtshan gyis gzengs su bstod pa e lha rgya ring khri chen/sa skya bdag chen nam khri chen/gra phyi smon grol gling khri chen lta bu dang/2 dga' ldan khri pa ri thog dang po rje tsong pa dang/gnyis pa rgyal tshab dar ma rin chen/gsum pa mkhas grub dge legs dpal bzang bcas phud de 'phros dga' ldan khri rim byon dang po 'bras dga' gsum sogs gdan che khag gi khri pa rnams la che stod tshul du khri chen zhes zhu srol snang}
khri chen gung thang pa|{dga' ldan khro thog lnga bcu pa dge 'dun phun tshogs yi sku phreng rim byon la zer/sku phreng dang po khri chen dge 'dun phun tshogs/gnyis pa gung thang ngag dbang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan/gsum pa gung thang dkon mchog bstan pa'i sgron me/bzhi pa gung thang dkon ma chog bstan pa'i rgya mtsho/lnga pa gung thang mchog sprul rin po che 'jigs med bstan pa'i dbang phyug bcas yin/sku phreng so so'i lo rgyus gsham gsal ga sde'i khongs su (gung nang )gsal bas der gzigs}
khri chen zhwa lu ba legs pa rgyal mtshan|{(dga' ldan khri thog bzhi pa ste/dga' ldan khri thog dang po rje tsong kha pa dang/gnyis pa rgyal tshab dar ma rin chen/gsum pa mkhas grub dge legs dpa' bzang bcas yin na'ang yab sras gsum la khri chen zhes che bstod zhu srog med stabs 'dir khri chen nang sgrig thabs dben pas de'i skor ka dam go rim ltar khungs so so'i nang gzigs/rab byung drug pa'i shing yol (1375)lor gtsang zha lur 'khrungs/sku gzhon dus zha lung rab tu byung zhing/zha lu ba grags pa rgyal mtshan dang/shangs pa kun mkhyen la sogs pa bla ma mang du bsten nas mkhas par gyur/rjes su rje tsong kha pa chen po'i zhabs drung du bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan cing/sku'i nye gnas dang/gsol thab pa bcas yun ring mdzad cing/rjes su mchod g.yog dang/sku rim gyi dbu mdzad kyang mdzad/gdan sa chen po dga' ldan phyag btab rjes nas mi ring bar dge bskos mdzad cing/skabs der phyag bzhes kyi khrims rgyug khru gang lhag tsam zhig sngon dus dga' ldan gser kong khang tshad du mjal rgyu yod/de nas dbu mdzad kyang rgyun ring gnang zhing/mkhas grub rin po che dgongs pa rdzogs rjes/zhal slob bgres pa rnams kyis dga' ldan gyi gdan sa mdzad dgos par re bskul zhus pa bzhin/dgung lo drug cu re lnga pa rab byung bdun pa'i sa lug (1439)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs te lo bcu gnyis kyi bar du bskyangs te/slob ma rnams la 'jigs byed kyi skor dang/man ngag rnam gsum gyi khri la sogs pa 'chad spel dang/dge 'dun rnams kyang chos dang zang zing gnyis ka'i sgo nas lags par bskyangs pas gdan sa dar rgyas chen po byung zhing/rje'i sku gdung rin po che'i yang thog gi rgya phibs bzhengs 'phro yang mjug 'khyongs bar mdzad/gser thog gi phud du lha bzo mkhas can sprul skur grags pa pad+ma mkhar pas gsang 'dus/bde mchog /dus 'khor gsum gyi gser sku mi tshad tsam re bzhengs par mdzad ('di de sngon khri thog khang gi gzings chung mdor yod )grub thob thang stong rgyal pas 'phan po brag ral gyi lcags zam 'dzugs gnang mdzad skabs dga' ldan dge 'dun rnams kyis rdo skyel 'dres gyi dang blangs rogs skyor gyi mig dpe ston ra mdzad pas lcags zab gyi lam gras skul lcag chen po thebs pa byung/nang so 'phyong rgyas pa hor dkon mchog rin chen la bu brgyud gnas ma byung bar brten skyabs 'jug zhus par/gshin rje gshed dmar po'i sgo nas srid spel ba'i thabs shes mdzad pas dgung rgyud la rim bzhin rdo rje tshe brten dang/dpal 'byor bzang po/hor bdun 'dul rab brtan sogs grags pa can gyi mi sna mang du byung/dgung lo don grub pa rab byung bdun pa'i lcags rta (1450)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs/sku gdung gzhug su phul ba'i dbu klad la rdo rje 'jigs byed zhal phyag yongs rdzogs rang byung du phebs pa dngul gdung gi nang rten du bzhugs pa/phying gur chen mo'i nang ri chen cho sa grags bzang po'i dngul gdung gi g.yas ngos su bzhugs/lo rgyus 'di las rgyas tsam 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i rdo rjes mdzad pa'i ('jigs byed chos 'byung )lha la zhol dpar ma'i shog grangs 177nas 179bar gsal ba der gzigs}
khri chen blo gros chos skyong|{(dga' ldan khri thog lnga pa )gtsang rong gi g.yag sder rab byung bdun pa'i sa sbrul (1389)lor 'khrungs/sku gzhon dus tshogs tshogs dge 'dun sgang pa nas rab tu byung/rje yab sras dang/gtso bor mkhas grub rje bsten nas mdo sngags kyi gsung rab la sbyangs pa mdzad pas mkhas pa'i phul du phyin/dga' ldan gyi khri pa mi mdzad dgongs nas bros byon pas thag ring por phebs ma thub gong du zhabs bsnyungs nas phebs ma thub pas dga' ldan du phyir gdan drangs/dgung lo drug cu re gnyis pa rab byung brgyad pa'i lcags rta (1450)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo co bcu gsum gyi bar mdo sngags kyi chos 'chad spel rgyun mi chad par gnang bas slob ma yang zhang zhung chos dbang grags pa dang/gtsang chung chos grags rgyal mtsho/rtag nag pa mkhas grub nor bzang rgya mtsho/khri chen smon lam dpal ba sogs mang du byon/dga' ldan du mchod khang gsar ma bzhengs pa'i nang ston pa thub pa'i dbang po'i gser skye dang/dngul dgung chen mo sogs bzhengs/gsum rtsom yang/mkhas grub rin po ches mdzad pa'i ('jigs byed bskyed rim )rtsom 'phro kha skong dang (dus 'khor Tika chen )rtsom 'phro'i kha skong bcas mdzad/de nas mkhas grub rin po che'i gcung ba so chos kyi rgyal mtshan la gdan sa gtad nas rje rang nyid kun spang mdzad nas zur bzhugs gnang/dgung lo don brgyad pa rab byung brgyad pa'i me khyi (1466)lor dga' ldan du sku gshegs/de nas rim bzhis sprul sku ngos 'dzin zhus pa rnams la yongs grags su mu le skyabs mgon sku phreng rim byon du grags pa'i gnyis pa sangs rgyas rgya mtsho (paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan gyi dngos slob )gsum pa 'jam dbyangs bzang po/(rab byung bcu pa'i me bya (1597)nas rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me sprel (1656)bar dgung lo drug cu bzhugs/sku phreng bzhi pa ngag dbang dkon mchog bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags byi (1660)lor mu li nang 'khrugs skabs gzhan sdes bkrongs/sku phreng lnga pa ngag dbang phun tshogs bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan 'khrungs lo ma rnyed/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i cha stag (1722)lor yang srid gtan 'khel zhus na