khri chen ba so chos kyi rgyal mtshan|{(dga' ldan khri thog drug pa )mkhas grub rin chen po'i gzhu ngo yin/gtsang stod ldog gzhung du yab bkra shis dpal bzang dang/yum mgron chog rgyal mo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bdun pa'i cha rta (1402)lor sku 'khrungs/rje tsong kha pa yab sras bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi gzhung la sbyangs/gsang phu dgon pa'i 'chad nyan la yang cung zad mdzad cing/de rjes sa bon dgon pa'i 'chad nyan kyi slob dpon yun ring tsam mdzad pas ba sa bar grags/shab stod seng ge rtse dang thag nye bar ri bo bde chen gyi dben gnas btab/thugs dam nyams bzhes lab rten nas rtogs pa mthor por phebs te bzhugs pa'i skabs shig khri chen blo gros chos skyong gis rgyal dbang dge 'dun grub pa dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs dgos pa'i zhu ba mdzad par da res dga' ldan gyi khri la mkhas grub rin po che'i gcung ba so ba 'di rang 'os pa yod pas spyan drongs gsungs pa ltar/dga' ldan du gdan drangs/dgung lo re gnyis pa rab byung brgyad pa'i chu lug (1463)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo ngo bcu gcig ring bskyangs te/de'i ring la mdo sngags kyi chos 'khor rgya cher bskor bas slob ma zung 'jug gi sku brnyes pa rdo rje mched gsum/(1 grub chen chos rdo rje/2 stod lung pa rdo rje dpal ba/3 khams pa dpal ldan rdo rje )byung/dga' ldan du rgyal ba seng ge nga ro'i gser sku lha khang dang bcas pa/khri chen gong ma rim byon gyi 'dra sku bcas gsar bzhengs mdzad/gsung rtsom skor/(dbu ma'i lta khrid chen mo/) (dus 'khor gyi bskyed rdzogs/) (gsang 'dus yig chung nyer gcig )sogs yod/dam pa 'di'i sku phreng bzhi pa sa bo lha dbang chos kyi rgyal mtshan yin par 'khrul nas 'grel bshad mdzad pa yod kyang de min/dam pa 'di'i sku phreng rim byon rnams la yongs grags su rta tshag rin po che zhu zhing/sku phreng gnyis pa 'phags pa lha sku phreng dang po'i dbon lha skyabs/sku phreng gsum pa li yul chos rgyal/sku phreng bzhi pa lha dbang chos kyi rgyal mtshan/sku phreng lnga pa ngag dbang chos kyi dbang phyug /sku phreng drug pa ngag dbang dkon mchog nyi ma/sku phreng bdun pa blo bzang dpal l