khri chen blo gros brtan pa|{(dga' ldan khri thog bdun pa )gtsang gi shangs mgron khang du rab byung bdun pa'i chu rta (1402)lor 'khrungs/gnas rnying dgon par slob gnyer mdzad nas dge bshes thon/mdo sngags kyi gzhung la mkhyen pa che zhing/gsang phu khu spe grwa tshang gi 'chad nyan dang/dga' ldan byang rtse'i slob dpon kyang mdzad/de nas yar lung phyogs la phebs nas dwags po bshad sgrub gling grwa tshang phyag btab nas 'chad nyan mdzad pas slob ma mkhas grags mang du byung zhing/slob dpon du mkhas chen ngag dbang grags pa bskos nas byang rtse chos rje'i khrir phebs/dgung lo don gnyis pa rab byung brgyad pa'i chu sbrul (1473)lor sku gshegs/gdung rten dben sdum mchod rten gyi g.yon du bzhugs/gsung rtsom skor/(mngon rtogs rgyan )ma gtogs pa'i byams chos phyi ma bzhi/(mdo sde rgyan/) (dbus mtha' rnam 'byed/) (chos dbyings rnam 'byed/) (rgyud bla ma )yi 'grel pa dang/(rnam 'grel lam bsgrigs/) (gzhi gsum rnam bzhag )sogs yod/rnam thar lo rgyus mdor bsdus las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung )'bras spungs dpar ma'i shog grangs 371nas 372bar gsal}
khri chen smon lam dpal ba|{(dga' ldan khri thog brgyad pa )g.yas ru byang rgyud du sngags pa zhig gi sras su rab byung bdun pa'i shing rta (1414)lor 'khrungs/rje dge 'dun grub pa'i drung du gzhung chen po lnga la sbyangs nas mkhas pa chen por gyur/rje btsun shes rab seng ge'i drung nas gsang sngags kyi chos skor mi nyung ba zhig gsan/rtsed thang chos grwar gzhung chen sum cu so drug gi grwa skor dang bshad pa mdzad/sne gdong pho brang du byams chen rab 'byams pa sangs rgyas 'phel dang rtsod gleng mdzad pas rab 'byams pa thugs dgyes pa'i rtser son/de nas gtsang gi grwa tshang chen mo/nyang stod dgon gsar/snye mo rgyal byed tshal/se ra theg chen gling/dga' ldan shar rtse bcas su 'chad nyan gyi slob dpon mdzad pas stod smad kun tu slob mas khyab pa byung/rab byung brgyad pa'i sa phag (1470)lor rje tsong kha pa sku gshegs nas lo drug re gcig pa yin stabs de'i skeg thog la shar rtse dang byang rtse'i bar rtsod gleng byung ba bar 'dums mdzad/dgung lo re bdun pa lcags byi (1480)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo ngo bcu'i ring skyong zhing/de'i ring 'bras spungs kyi khri pa yang chabs cig tu mdzad/dga' ldan dang 'bras spungs su sku gsum thugs na mang du bzhengs/dgung lo don brgyad pa lcags phag (1491)lor rtse po tA lar sku gshegs/sku gdung zhugs 'bul zhus par rten ngo mtshar can byon pa rnams rnam rgyal mchod rten 'di khri chen ba so chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyi gdung rten gyi g.yas ngos su yod/gsum rtsom skor/(rnam 'grel le'u bzhi'i Tik+ka )shin tu gsal ba yongs grags su smon Tika tu grags pa bkra shis lhun po'i dpar ma shog grangs 408yod/lo rgyus skor/las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan kyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung )dpar ma'i shog grangs 371par gsal}
khri chen rje dpon blo bzang nyi ma|{(dga' ldan khri thog dgu pa)mdo smad tshong kha'i yul du rje tsong kha'i p+saku tsha zhig gi sras su rab byung bdun pa'i sa lug (1439)lor 'khrungs/sku gzhon nu'i dus nas dbus su byon/bla ma byang rgyal ba/kun mkhyen mun srad pa/mkhas pa grags pa 'od zer bcas bsten nas gzhung chen po lngar sbyangs pa mdzad pas mkhan pa chen por gyur/gsang phur dka' chen bzhi'i grwa skor mdzad cing/rwa ba stod kyi 'chad nyan slob dpon mdzad/de nas bkra shis lhun por rje dge 'dun grub bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/de nas dbus su phebs par sne'i rdzong dpon dpal 'byor rgyal pos re bskul zhus pa ltar 'bras spungs kyi mkhan po mdzad/dgung lo zhe gsum pa lcags glang (1481)lor gsang phu gling smad kyi mkhan po mdzad/dgung lo nga gnyis pa ram byung brgyad pa'i lcags khyi (1490)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo gsum gyi bar bskyangs/dgung lo nga bzhi pa rang byung brgyad pa'i chu byi (1492)lor sku gshegs/lo rgyus mdor bsdus/las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung )dpar ma'i shog grangs 373par gsal}
