khri chen 'dar ston blo bzang grags pa|{(dga' ldan khri thog bcu gcig pa )gtsang stod 'dar yul du rab byung bdun pa'i sa bya (1429)lor 'khrungs/'dar chos rdzong dgon par rab tu byung nas bsdus grwar slob gnyer mdzad/dbus su byon nas/mkhan chen dpa' blo ba da nga/chos rje rab 'byams pa/khri chos ba so ba/'brom btsun shes 'byung blo gros sogs bsnyen nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun gsan rgya che/dbus stod thang skya dgon pa dang dbe chen gsang sngags mkhar gnyis su rnam 'grel gtso bor gyur pa'i 'chad nyan mdzad/rim bzhin shar pa chos rje'i khrir phebs nas mdo sngags kyi chos yang yang gsungs pas slob ma mkhas grags can mang du byung/dgung lo don gnyis pa rab byung brgyad pa'i lcags sprel (1500)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo ngo bcu gnyis ring legs par bskyangs/dgung lo gya gsum pa rab byung dgu pa'i lcags lug (1511)lor sku gshegs/lo rgyus mdor bsdus/paN chen bsod nams grags pas mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams gsar rnying gi cho sa 'byung nyid kyi mdzes rgyan )las gsal}
