khri chen paN chen bsod nams grags pa|{(dga' ldan khri thog bco lnga pa )rtsed thang gi nye 'dabs nang par lam pa'i sras su rab byung brgyad pa'i sa khyi (1478)lor 'khrungs/rtsed thang las chen bsod nams bkra shis las rab byung bzhes pa'i mtshan la bsod nams grags pa zhes gsol zhes lo rgyus gzhan zhig las gsal yang/rang nyid kyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams gsar rnying gi chos 'byung )las/'od sna'i bla ma la rab byung gi mkhan po zhus zhes gsungs yod pa ma zad/paN chen gyi dngos slob bya bral lha dbang rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i rnam thar las/rtsed thang las chen pa'i drung du dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes pa'i mtshan la bsod nams grags pa zhes btags par gsungs pa de rang khungs btsan par snang/rtsed thang chos sde dang/g.ya' bzang dgon pa gnyis su phar phyin dang rnam 'grel la sbyangs nas grwa skor yang mdzad/dgung lo bcu drug pa chu glang (1493)lor se ra theg chen gling du chos zhugs gnang thog /kun mkhyen don yod dpal bzang yongs 'dzin du bsten nas lo bcu gnyis bar tshad ma dang dbu ma'i bshad pa/gzhan yang rje tsong kha pa nas brgyud pa'i mdo sngags kyi chos skaur cha tshang bar gsan/gnyal ston dpal 'byor lhun grub sogs dge ba'i bshes gnyen mang po bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mtha' yas pa gsan/gzhan yang rtsed thang las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan/thon pa mkhas btsun yon tan rgya mtsho sogs kyi drung nas bka' gdams kyi chos skor mang po gsan/dgung lo so gcig pa rab byung dgu pa'i sa 'brug (1508)lor rgyud stod grwa tshang du sgrig zhugs thog /mkhan chen chos ldan blo gros pa bla mar bsten nas gnang bde 'jigs gsum gyi rgyud 'grel bshad pa dang/bskyed rdzogs kyi khrid/ngan ngag phyag len dang bcas tshang bar gsan/dgung lo so bzhi pa rab byung dgu pa'i chu sprel (1512)lor rgyud stod grwa tshang gi mkhan po'i khrir phebs nas lo bcu gsum ring rgyud kyi 'chad nyan dang/bskyed rdzogs kyi khrid sogs sngar srol nyams med gong 'phel thog /dge 'dun gyi 'tsho ba'i mthun rkyen ja tshul 'dzugs pa dang/'du khang gsar bzhengs sogs chos srid gnyis kyi sgo nas legs par bskyangs/dgung