khri chen rgya ra chos skyong rgya mtsho|{(dga' ldan khri thog bcu drug pa )dbus stod rgya ra gung ru rab byung brgyad pa'i chu sbrul (1473)lor 'khrungs/brag dbar dgon du rab byung mdzad/dgung lo chung dus su kun mkhyen klong chen pa'i gsung rab rnying thig skor gsan/'bras spungs su chos zhugs mdzad de 'jam dbyangs dga' ba'i blo gros bsten nas gzhung chen po la sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa mdzad/rgyud smad du zhugs nas rtse pa shes rab bzang po bla mar bsten nas rgyud 'grel gyi bshad pa dang/bskyed rdzogs kyi khrid/man ngag khag mang po'i phyag bzhes bcas cha tshang ba gnas/rgyud chen tshul khrims bzang po'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang po gsan/dgung lo zhe brgyad pa lcags 'brug (1520)lor rgyud smad kyi khrir phebs nas lo bcu bzhi'i ring rgyud 'grel gyi 'chad nyan dang/bskyed rdzogs kyi khrid gnang ba sogs gong 'phel du bskyangs pas/rgyud 'dzin slob ma yang mang po byung/byang rtse chos rje'i khrir phebs nas rgyud smad khrid chen brgyad du grugs pa'i man ngag mtha' dag dar spel thog (gsang 'dus bskyed rdzogs )rgyas bsdus gnyis dang/(dbu ma'i lta khrid )bcas mdzad/dgung lo gsum pa rab byung dug pa'i shing lug (1535)lor dga' ldan khyi khrid phebs nas lo bzhi'i bar bskyangs/(lo rgyus 'ga' zhig tu khri chen 'di'i ring 'bri gung khul du yod pa'i dge lugs dgon pa rnams kyi mchod gzhis 'bri khung pas phrogs pa dang zhwa stabs bsgyur ba sogs byung ba dang/khri ched 'di dang shar pa chos rje dkon mchog dar rgyas gnyis phan tshun gtor ma 'phen res mdzad pa sogs bshad pa ni lo rgyus ma dag rgyun 'byams shig yin pa ste (rgyal dbang dge 'dun rgya mtsho'i rnam thar )dang/('bri gung chos 'byung )gnyis kar gong gsal gnas tshul de ri chen rin chen 'od zer gyis dga' ldan das khri thog gnang ring gi me khyim (1526)lor byung tshul gsal bar 'khod 'dug /dgung grangs re bdun pa rab byung dug pa'i sa phag (1539)lor ngo mtshar ba'i ltas dang bcas te sku gshegs/sku gdung mchod rten ni dga' ldan du mkhas grub rin po che'i skug dung gi g.yon zur du bzhugs/gsung rtsom skor/(gsang ba 'd