khri chen rdo rje bzang po|{(dga' ldan khri thog bcu bdun pa )mdo smad mi nyag gi yul du rab byung brgyad pa'i lcags phag (1491)lor 'khrungs/dbus su byon nas ser smad grwa tshang du chos zhugs mdzad thog gzhung chen po lngar slob gnyer mthar phyin par mdzad nas ser smad grwa tshang gi mkhan po'i khrir phebs/de nas shar pa chos rje'i khrir phebs nas thung tsam bzhugs/dgung lo zhi dgu pa rab byung dgu pa'i sa phag (1539)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/lo ngo brgyad kyi ring legs par bskyangs nas gzings khang bde ba can du zur bzhugs mdzad/dgung lo re bzhi pa rab byung dug pa'i shing rta (1554)lor/the bo dang ldan ma gnyis 'khrugs zing byung skabs bar 'dum la phebs par mi zhig gis rdo 'phangs pa dbu la phog pa'i rkyen gyis sku gshegs/lo rgyus 'di las rgyas pa da phan ma rnyed pas 'dir cha tshang bar bkod yod lags}
khri chen rgyal mtshan bzang po|{(dga' ldan khri thog bco brgyad pa )'phan yul gyi mda' bye ri stag rtse'i stag skya bo'i gros du rab byung brgyad pa'i chu sbrul (1473)lor 'khrungs/rab tu byung nas gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer gdan sa gang du mdzad pa'i lo rgyus mi gsal/rgyud smad du zhugs nas rtse pa shes rab bzang po dang/khri chen rgya ra chos skyong rgya mtsho gnyis la bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang du gsan/rgya ra chos skyong rgya mtsho'i rjes su rgyud smad mkhan po'i khrir phigs nas 'chad nyan gnang bzhin pa'i mu nas byang rtse chos rje'i khrir phebs/dgung lo don gcig pa ram byung dgu pa'i chu yos (1543)lor sku gshegs/sku gdung zhugs su phul bas rten ngo mtshar can mang du byon/lo rgyus skor 'di las zhib pa da phan ma rnyed pas 'dir cha tshang bar bkod yod}
khri chen ngag dbang chos grags|{(snga ma )(dga' ldan khri thog bcu dgu pa )stod lung mda'i dngos gzhi grong tshor rab byung brgyad pa'i lcags bya (1501)lor 'khrungs/khri chen chos kyi bshes gnyen gyi sku tsha shar pa dkon mchog dar rgyas kyi sku mched yin pas rab tu byung nas 'bras spungs blo gsal gling du gzhung chen po lngar slob gnyer mdzad pas mkhas par gyur/kho pho khri chen dang/paN chen bsod nams grags pa/rgyal ba dge 'dun rgya mtsho sogs bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun rgya cher gsan/rgyud stod mkhan khri lo bdun mdzad/de nas shar rtse grwa tshang gi mkhan po dang/shar pa chos rje'i khri nyis lcogs mdzad/dgung lo zhi bag+r+yad pa rab byung dgu pa'i sa sprel (1548)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo ngo bzhi'i bar bskyangs mus su dgung lo nga gcig pa rab byung dgu pa'i lcags ('phags (1551)lor sku gshegs/sku gdung zhugs su phul bas gdung rus la rten ngo mtshar can 'ga' zhig byon/lo rgyus 'di las zhib pa ma rnyed pas 'dir cha tshang bkod yod}
khri chen chos grags bzang po|{(dga' ldan khri thog nyi shu pa )dbus stod stag phu dgon pa'i nye 'dabs kyi grong tsho zhig tu rab byung brgyad pa'i chu glang (1493)lor 'khrungs/stag phu chos sder rab byung mdzad/gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer grwa sa gang du mdzad pa'i lo rgyus mi gsal/gzhung chen slob gnyer grub nas rgyud smad du zhugs te/rgya ra chos skyong rgya mtsho dang chos rje rgyal mtshan bzang por bsten nas mdo gas kyi chos skor cha tshang ba gsan nas mkhas pa chen por gyur/rgyud smad kyi mkhan po'i khrir phebs nas 'chad nyan gong 'phel du skyong bzhin thog /byang rtse chos rje'i khrir phebs/dgung lo drug cu pa rab byung dgu pa'i chu byi (1552)lor bde chen gsang sngags mkhar du sku gshegs/sku gung zhugs 'bul zhus par rten ngo mtshar can mang du byas pa rnams dung gdung bzhengs pa'i nang du bzhugs/lo rgyus 'di las zhib pa ma rnyed pas 'dir cha tshang bkod pa lags}
khri chen bde ba can pa dge legs dpal bzang|{(dga' ldan khri thog nyer gcig pa )'ol kha lung gyang gsar du rab byung brgyad pa'i shing glang (1505)lor 'khrungs/rgyal pa dge 'dun rgya mtsho dang paN chen bsod nams grags pa sogs bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun rgya cher gsan/gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer gdan sa khang du mdzad pa'i lo rgyus mi gsal/mdo sngags gnyis kyi slob gnyer mthar phyin nas rgyud stod grwa tshang gi man po dang ra rtse chos rje bcas kyi khri la phebs/(byang chub lam rim chen mo )gzab bshad dang/gzhan yang mdo sngags kyi chos bka' rgya cher stsal bzhin pa'i mu nas/dgung lo nga bzhi pa rab byung dug pa'i sa rta (1558)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo bdun gyi bar 'chad nyan gong 'phel du bskyangs rjes gzims khang bde ba can du zur bzhugs mdzad pas/yongs grags su khri ched bde ba can pa zhes zhu srol yod/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum bsod nams rgya mtshos khri chen 'di'i drung nas bsnyen rdzogs dang mdo sngags kyi chos bka' mang po gsan/khri chen 'dis tA la'i bla ma rin po che mchog dang skyid shod sde pa bkra shis rab brtan gnyis la gsang phu nyag rong grwa tshang dang/dga' ldan shar rtse grwa tshang gnyis zla 'grel btang nas gzhung chen po'i ba gnyer 'phel rgyas legs po yong ba'i snyan skul dang re bdun zhu gnang mdzad/dgung lo re gsum pa rab byung bcu pa'i me yos (1567)lor sku gshegs/sku gdung zhugs 'bul tA la'i bla ma rin po che sku ngo mas mdzad cing/gzhung rus la rten ngo mtshar can byon pa rnams gung rten bzhengs pa'i nang du bzhugs/lo rgyus skor 'di las zhib pa ma rnyed pas 'dir cha tshang bar bkod yod}
khri chen dge 'dun bstan pa dar rgyas|{(khro thog nyer gnyis pa )rab byung brgyad pa'i chu glang (1493)lor 'phan po klung shod 'od snang sku 'khrungs/sku na gzhon dus su drung gzhon nu mdzes pa dpal gyis phyag btab pa'i lam dro cha dkar dgon par slob gnyer gnang zhing/rjes su se rab smad grwa tshang du gzhung chen po lngar slob gnyer mthar phyin par mdzad nas cha dkar dgon pa'i 'chad nyen gyi slob dpon du bskos/dus skabs der rin spungs don yodo rje dge lugs phyogs la ha cang sdang ba'i dbang gis gtsang dmag dbus su drangs te dge lugs pa'i sbyin bdag sde pa skyid shog pa dang/gzhis ka sde'i par dmag drangs nas dbang cha phrogs pa dang/de nas lo shas song mtshams khri chen 'di nyid dgung lo nyi shu tham par phebs pa chu sprel lor rin spungs don yod rdo rje 'das nas mi ring bar rin spungs pa'i stobs shugs nyams rjes 'bri gung pa'i dpon mgon po rgyal mtshan gyis 'phan po khul du yod pa'i dga' ldan dgon pa'i ma chod gzhis khag rnams phrogs pa sogs la brten nas dga' ldan shar byang gnyis kyi 'a chad nyan lo shas bar stongs su lus dgos pa byung stabs/dam pa 'di nyid cha dkar dgon pa nas dga' ldan du gnas drangs te byang rtse grwa tshang gi 'chad nyan slob dpon du bskos/de skabs dgung lo nyi shu rtsa lnga tsam las ma phebs pa'i sku gzhon nu zhig yin kyang/mkhyen rab rtsal phun sum tshogs pa'i dbang gis phar phyin dang dbyi ma'i rtsi bzhag rnams thugs thog nas gnang ste zhal slob tshos zin bris su bkod pa deng skabs ser smad grwa tshang gi yig char 'chad nyan yod pa de yin/dgung lo so bzhi pa rab byung dgu pa'i me khyi (1526)lor slar yang 'bri gung dpon chen ('grub gung gdan rabs bco lnga pa )gyi bka' slob gnang ba rnams la ma rtsis par 'bri gung khul du yod pa'i dge lugs dgon khag che chung bco brgyad tsam chos lugs dang zhwa stabs bsgyur ba'i btsan bshad byed par brten cha dkar dgon pa'i grwa pa rnams dga' ldan du gnas spos bya dgos byung/rkyen ngan de la brten nas rgyal dbang kun dga' rin chen yang thugs skyo nas lo rjes ma der dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/yun ring ma song