grub pa'i dbyen sdum mchod rten zhig de sngon dga' ldan yangs pa can gyi steng thog bla ma lha khang du bzhugs/khri chen 'di dang dga' ldan byang rtse mkhan po bstan pa dar rgyas ga nyis mtshan 'dra ba'i stabs kyis khri chen 'di byang rtse mgon po bstan pa dar rgyas yin zhes gsung mkhan 'dug kyang/mkhan po de ni shar skal ldan rgya mtsho byang rtse grwa tshang du slob gnyer mdzad skabs kyi mkhan po yin cing de ni rab byung bcu pa'i dus mjug tu byung ba yin pas dus mi mtshungs so/_}
khri chen tshe brtan rgya mtsho|{(dga' ldan khri thog nyer gsum pa )rab byung dgu pa'i lcags 'brug (1520)lor lho kha rtsed thang du sku 'khrungs/ma yul gyis slob gnyer hur thag yas nas dga' ldan gyi khri thob pa zhig byed dgos zhes mngags bya nan tan gnang ba ltar lha sar phebs nas gzhung chen po lnga dang gsang sngags bcas la mkhas par sbyangs/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa dug pa rab byung dug pa'i sa rta (1558(lo la/dga' ldan shar rtse grwa tshang gi p+salob dpon yang nyis lcogs gnas/rab tu dgu pa'i me stag (1566)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtshos bka' phebs pa ltar dga' ldan dgos nang du yod pa'i sde pa skyid shod pa'i dkyil bde ba can zhes pa'i sa khungs der shar rtse nor bu'i gling grwa tshang gi grwa khang gsar rgyag dang/skyid shod sde pa brag dkar khul nas mchod gzhis phogs pa'i mthun rkyen sa zhig sogs phul/gsang phu nyag rong grwa tshang gi slob dpon blo bzang bstan 'phel shar rtse grwa tshang gi slob dpon dang/nyi sdigs kyi slob dpon du bsko gzhag mdzad/rab byung bcu pa'i sa 'brug (1568)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs te mdo sngags kyi chos 'khor rgya cher bskor/khri lo bdun song mtshams dga' ldan rdo khang du zur bzhugs mdzad/rab byung bcu pa'i me glang (1577)lor/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtsho sog yul du phebs pa'i phyi mo nas lo shas ring smon lam chen mo'i tshogs dbur phebs/shar rtse grwa tshang gi 'du khang gsar pa'i ldebs bris dang spen rgyan sogs legs grub mdzad/dgung lo re bdun pa rab byung bcu pa'i me byi (1576)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs so/_}
khri chen byams pa rgya mtsho|{(dga' ldan khri thog nyer bzhi pa )rab byung dgu pa'i me byi (1516)lor 'phan po zhogs kyi gram phur 'khrungs/slob gnyer gnang sa gang du mdzad pa'i lo rgyus ma rnyed/dgung lo drug cur phebs pa rab byung bcu pa'i shing phag (1575)lor dga' ldan dgon par zur bzhugs mdzad pas khri chen mngon dga' bar grags/dgung lo don lnga pa rab byung bcu pa'i lcags stag (1590)lor sku gshegs so/_}
khri chen rgyal khang rtse pa dpal 'byor rgya mtsho|{(dga' ldan khri thog nyer lnga pa )'khrungs yul stod lung rab pa gad pa khar/yab sngags 'chang nor bu ri tshing dang yum dbang phyug mtsho gnyis la sras bgres gzhon bdun yod pa'i gsum pa yin/rab byung dug pa'i me khyi (1526)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo brgyad pa chu sbrul (1533)lor rgyal dbang dge 'dun rgya mtsho'i drung nas dge bsnyen gyi p+sadom pa bzhes/thog ma'i mtshan la rta mgrin tshe dbang zhes gsol/dgung lo bco lnga pa lcags byi (1540)lor skyor mo lung du gsang phu gling smad chos rje lha dbang dpal 'byor gyi drung nas rab byung dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhis/mtshan la dpal 'byor rgya mtsho zhes btags/gling smad chos rje chos kyi grags pa'i dus nas tshad ma la sbyangs ma mdzad/paN chen bsod nams grags pa 'bras spungs kyi mkhan po mdzad pa'i drung du bsten nas/'dul ba dang/mdzod skor/gzhan yang mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gnas/'bras spungs sgo mang slob dpon blo bzang e wam gyi drung nas phar phyin dang/sgo mang slob dpon zur pa co ne phyogs las rnam rgyal gyi drung du dbu ma dang 'dul ba can la sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa mdzad/dgung lo nyer lnga pa lcags khyi (1550)lor 'bras spungs su dge bshes gling bsre'i mtshan bzhes gnang/da dung thugs yid ma tshim par bkra shis lhun por phebs nas gnang rnying chos kyi rgyal mtshan mkhan po mdzad bzhin pa'i drung du bsten te lo gsum yi ring tshad ma rnams 'grel dang dbu ma la slob gnyer bskyar ma mdzad/de nas gangs can chos 'phel/rgyal rtse dpal 'khor sde chen/dbus phyogs bcas su phebs nas/paN chen nyi ma bzang po dang/paN chen bzang po bkra shis/mkhan chen don yod rgyal mtshan/khri chen bde ba can pa dge legs dpal bzang/khri chen dge da'un bstan pa dar rgyas/khri chen tshe brtan rgya mtsho bcas kyi drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan cing/dad ldan slob ma 'ga' zhig la slob khrid kyang mdzad/dgung lo so gnyis pa rab byung dgu pa'i me 'brug (1556)lor/dga' ldan khri thog khang du khri chen bde ba can pa dge legs dpal bzang gi drung nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo so lnga pa rab byung dug pa'i sa lug (1559)lor rwa stod grwa tshang gi mkhan por gdan drangs pa ltar phebs te sngar srol gyi 'a chad nyan gong 'phel du bskyangs/chos grwa dpal gyi rtsed thang sogs dgon sde mang po gdan drangs pa ltar phebs nas so so'i 'dod mod dang mthun pa'i chos bka' mang du gnang/dgung lo zhe gcig bzhes pa me stag (1566)lor rgyud sdod kyi mkhan po'i khrir phebs/de'i ring rgyud stod grwa tshang dbus stod byams pa gling do+u sa bar la phebs srol yod pa ltar phebs kyang/sa cha'i bdag pos gnas gzhi g.yar po ma phul bar brten/mkhan slob grwa dmangs dang bcas pa gur gyi nang du bzhugs/phyug po mgon po skyabs kyis chos thog gi gsol phogs dang/gnas gzhi phul/de bzhin rgyud stod grwa tshang se ra dgon par dbyar chos su phebs skabs rgyud khang med par co ne gzhung pa khang tshan la gnas g.yar gyis bzhugs dgos kyi yod stabs dam pa 'dis khang tshan rgan gras rnams la bka' gnang ba ltar da lta'i rgyud khang yod sa'i sa cha rnams phul ba bzhin/rgyud khang gsar bzhengs gnang zhing/co ne tsha rdor nang sos phogs thebs kyi sag zhung pa khang tshan dge rgan 'jam dbyangs rgyal mtshan gyis mthun rkyen zhal 'debs kyang phul ba nas se ra'i dbyar chos kyi chos phogs legs 'grub byung/dgun lo zhe drug pa rab byung bcu pa'i lcags lug (1571)lor shar pa chos rje'i khrir phebs (skabs 'dir rnam thar bris ma der dgung lo zhe dug pa lug gi lo zhes gsal ba dgung rnying khyi lo nas brtsis na zhes dgu pa khyi lo yin pas mi 'grigs )nas dgung lo dgu'i bar bskyangs/de'i ring la shing khyi (1574)lor nas bzung dbus stod khul du 'khrugs pa tshabs chen byung ba'i rkyen gyis chos sde rin chen gling zhes grwa pa slob gnyer ba sum brgya tsam yod pa de bzhin rtsa gtor btang bar ba rten dam pa des phag mo ba'i dpon rigs rnams zang zing gi 'byor pa chen pos tshim par mdzad de dgon pa bskyar gso chog pa'i re ba zhu gnang mdzad pa ltar/re zhig gra pa bcu skor yod pa'i dgos chung zhig bzung chos pa'i 'khrol cha yang ba de rim bzhin che rgyas su phyin skabs dgon sde 'di thog mar phyag 'debs mdzad pa po khri chen byams pa rgya mtsho rang la phyir 'bul mdzad/gzhan yang shar pa chos rje'i khri khur bskyangs pa'i ring/thang skya/phag mo/rin chen gling/don bu ri/klung shod 'bar tshag /gsang phu/skyor mo lung bcas kyi khri thog tu gdan drangs pa ltar phebs nas gang la gang 'os kyi chos 'chad nyan dang/sgrig lam dag ther/nyams gso/chos thebs sbyor ba sogs chos dang zang zing gnyis ka'i sgo nas skyong bar mdzad/dgung lo nga bdun pa cha rta (1582)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs te lo ngo brgyad kyi bar bskyangs shing/de'i ring khri thog khang gi nyams gso gsar bzhengs dang khyab par med pa zhig mdzad cing/zhol la mdo sngags kyi chos bka' yang rgyun mi chad par gnang nas sa glang (1589)lor rgyal tshab rje'i gzigs khang rgyal khang rtser zur bzhugs gnang bas khri chen rgyal khang rtse par grags/shing lug (1595)lor/skyid shod sde pa g.yul rgyal nor bur bka' gdang ste dga' ldan sgrub mchod chen po nyams gso mdzad pa dang dus mtshungs dga' ldan gser gdung gi rgya phibs nyams gso gsar bzhengs gnang ba sogs mdzad rjes rlabs che ba'i ngang nas dgung lo don bzhir phebs pa rab byung bcu pa'i sa phag (1599)lor sku gshegs/sku gdung zhugs 'bul zhus pa'i skabs byon pa'i rten khyad par can rnams nang rten du bzhugs pa'i dngul gdung lha babs mchod rten che ba zhig rgya gur chen mo'i mdun ngos phyi'i g.yas phyogs der bzhugs yod/rnam thar skor/(dpal ldan bla ma dam pa dpal 'byor rgya mtsho'i zhal snga nas kyi rnam par thar pa dad pa'i 'jug sgo rab tu gsal ba )zhes kha byang du 'khod pa dpe rnying dbu mes bris ma dge zhing shog grangs 80yod pa zhig bod ljongs dpe mdzod khang gi khri phyag dpe'i gras nas mjal byung zhing/mdzad pa po ni khri chen dam pa de'i zhal slob chos rje sku skye tshe ring mgon po yin tshul mdzad byang du gsal}
khri chen dam chos dpal 'bar|{(dga' ldan khri thog nyer drug pa )rab byung dug pa'i chu lug (1523)lor gtsang stod du 'khrungs/rwa sgreng gi bla ma mdzad cing/bdun cu'i steng rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa glang (1589)lor gser khrir byon nas dgung grangs don bdun pa rab byung bcu pa'i sa phag (1599)lor gshegs pa'i sku gdung la sku 'dra mang du byon/dgung lo re bdun la khrir phebs par bshad pa'ang snang}
khri chen sangs rgyas rin chen|{(dga' ldan khri thog nyer bdun pa )rab byung dgu pa'i lcags byi (1540)lor mal dro kla klo'i 'brog sder 'khrungs/dga' ldan shar rtse'am nyag rong grwa tsham du slob gnyer mdzad/dgung lo nga bdun pa rab byung bcu pa'i me sprel (1596)lor gser khrir phebs/khong la lha rtse dpon por grags pas lha zur phud lnga pa'i sprul pa dang bdud yin zhes rdzun lung bstan par brten nas log lta byas pa'am byung mod kyang/dga' ldan khri'i steng du skyes chen dam pa min pa zhig rje gshin rje chos rgyal gyis mi 'jog gang snyam zhes 'byung ngo/_/gzhan phyogs la tshos ji ltar smras kyang rje yon tan rgya mtsho'i rab byung gi mkhan po yang mdzad/dgung lo re bzhi pa chu yos (1603)lor zur bzhugs mdzad de dgung grangs don gsum pa rab byung bcu pa'i chu byi (1612)lor gshegs/(dgung grags don bdun la gshags zer ba yang snang}
khri chen dge 'dun rgyal mtshan|{(dga' ldan khri thog nyir brgyad pa )rab byung dgu pa'i chu 'brug (1532)lor lha sa'i lum pa shag tu 'khrungs te se ra chos rgyan las rab tu byung/byes pa grwa tshang du gzhung lugs la sbyangs nas chu bo gang gA tshun la snyan grags yis khyab pa'i mkhas pa chen por gyur/dgung lo bcu dgu la rje bsod nams rgya mtsho las rab byung dang/mnga' ris lha btsun pa bsod nams dpa' bzang po sogs las bsnyen par rdzogs shing/zhi bzhi pa shing phag (1565)or rgyud smad kyi bla mar phebs/dgung grangs nga brgyad pa sa glang (1589)la byang rtser phebs /dgung lo don gnyis su phebs pa rab byung bcu pa'i chu yos (1603)lor gser khrir 'khod nas rgyal mchog yon tan rgya mtsho'i rab byung gi slob dpon mdzad/don drug pa rab byung bcu pa'i me lug (1607)la zur bzhugs mdzad pa'i lo der gshegs/slob ma yang rgyas dbang thams cad mkhyen pa yon tan rgya mtsho dang/paN chen blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan/stong 'khor yon tan rgya mtsho/rje rnam rgyal dpal bzang/gzhu khang pa dge legs lhun grub/mkhas pa'i yang rtse stag lung grags pa rgya mtsho sogs mtha' yas pa byung}
khri chen bshes gnyen grags pa'am chos gnyer grags pa|{(dga' ldan khri thog nyer dgu pa )rab byung dgu pa'i me rta (1546)lor mdo smad co ne'i zung chur 'khrungs/ras chung gi rnam 'phrul du grags/dgung grangs re gnyis su phebs pa rab byung bcu pa'i me lug (1607)lor gser khrir phebs/bdun bcu'i steng zur bzhugs mdzad de dgung grangs don gsum pa rab byung bcu pa'i sa rta (1618)lor zhi bar gshegs}
khri chen stag lung brag pa blo gros rgya mtsho|{(dga' ldan khri thog sum cu pa )rab byung dug pa'i me rta (1606)lor stod lung mda'i stag lung brag tu 'khrungs/skyor mo lung du rab tu byung/lo tsA ba blo ldan shes rab kyi rnam 'phrul du grags/gung ru'i kun mkhyen chos kyi 'byung gnas rtsa ba'i yongs 'dzin du bsten cing/de nyid kyi gsung rgyun phal cher yi ger 'god par mdzad /gzhan yang stag tshar rwa ba stod du tshad ma ma la sbyangs shing/de rjes rwa stod mkhan po'ang mdzad/('jam bzhad kyi skabs brgyad par (grwa tshang 'di yi bla ma gong ma kun gyi rnam bshad gnyis ka bsgrigs shing/de bzhin du dus phyis kyi dge bshes stag lung grags pa dom 'brug sogs kyang mdzad 'dug pa bzhin/kho bos dka' gdan 'di dag g.yas 'jog byas ma bzos nas bas zhes 'jam bzhad gong mas kyang ches cher bsngags yos kyi sgo mang dge bshes grags can no/_/skyor mo lung gi dge bshes rgyun chad pa yang rje 'dis slar gsos/byang rtse grwa tshang slar gsos te thos bsam gling du btags/bdun cu'i steng rab byung bcu pa'i shing lug (1595)lor gser khrir 'khod de mtshan snyan gyis khyab/mdo sngags kyi rtsom pa mang/dgung grangs don gsum pa rab byung bcu pa'i sa rta (1618)lor gshegs/slob ma khri dkon ma chog chos 'phel sogs mang}
