khri chen lcang lo can pa tshul khrims chos 'phel|{(dga' ldan khri thog so gnyis pa )rab byung dgu pa'i lcags bya (1561)lor gtsang gi 'brong rtser 'khrungs/ser byes su mkhas par sbyangs te se rar rab 'byams pa'i grwa skor mdzad/dgung grangs drug cur phebs pa rab byung bcu pa'i lcags sprel (1620)lor rtse shar gang yang ma brgyud par gser khrir phebs/paN chen rin po che nas gtsang dmag srog skyob mdzad pa'i grogs su 'di dang khri dkon mchog chos 'phel gnyis ka phebs/dgung lo re gsum pa rab byung bcu pa'i chu phag (1623)lor gshegs}
