khri chen ngag dbang chos kyi rgyal mtshan|{(dga' ldan khri thog so bzhi pa )rab byung bcu pa'i shing phag (1575)lor 'phan yul mdar 'khrungs/khri ngag dbang chos grags kyi skye bar gsal bas gsal khang sku skyer grags/rgyud smad pa'i 'chad nyan mdzad bzhin par byang rtser phebs/rgyud pa dang 'brel te chos gsungs/dgung lo nga gsum pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me yos (1627)lor gser khrir phebs/lo ngo gsum khrir bzhugs nas paN chen blo bzang chos rgyal la byang rtse la phul te rje yi dngul gdung steng gi gser rtog rgya bskyed par zhus tshe chos rje nyid slar yang rgyud kyi 'chad nyan du bzhugs/(phyis su paN chen de nyid kyis sa sbrul )1629)lor bzhengs so/_/)khri pa 'di'i 'das lo mi gsal}
khri chen dkon mchog chos 'phel|{(dga' ldan khri thog so lnga pa )rab byung bcu pa'i chu bya (1573)lor gra nang mar 'khrungs/paN chen byams pa gling pa'i skye bar grags/dwags po grwa tshang dang rwa stod du slob gnyer mdzad/gzhon nu'i dus 'chad nyan shing tu dmar bas phrug gu rab 'byams par grags/rtsed thang du rab 'byams pa'i grwa skor mdzad/khri lo ma mthun par 'ga' zhig snang yang dgung grangs nga bzhi pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me stag (1626)lo nas lo dgu ring khrir bzhugs/de'i phyi rol zur bzhugs mdzad mur tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i yongs 'dzin du gdan drangs/gzhung chen po lnga'i gsan bzhes gtso bor gyur pa'i mdo sngags kyi chos bka' mang po gsan te bka' drin che ba'i bla mar 'dzin par mdzad/rab byung bcu pa'i lcags bya (1621)lor sog pa lha btsun che chung gi dmag gis gtsang pa rgyal po'i dpag dpung rnams srog thog gtong bar nye bar dam pa 'dis srog bskyams par mdzad/dgung lo don bzhi bzhes par rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me khyi (1646)lor dgongs pa rdzogs/rnam thar ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa rin po ches mdzad pa/kha byang du ('jam dpal dbyangs chos kyi rje dkon mchog chos 'phel gyi rtogs brjod mkhas pa'i rna rgyan )zhes 'khod pa gsung 'bum pod (nya)par shog grangs 117yod}
khri chen bstan 'dzin legs bshad|{(dga' ldan khri thog so drug pa )kong po bkra shis rab brtan tu 'khrungs/dwags po bshad sgrub gling du gzhung chen por sbyangs te mkhas par gyur/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa stag (1638)lor gser khril phebs kyang kong po ba rnams dga' ldan shar byang gang mos las krig car med pa dang/'di pa rtse shar thun mong ba yin stabs/khri lo bdun song ba ni de'i rjes thog tu shar pa nas nges can mi dgos zhes smras pa'i rkyen dbang gis shar pas khri btsan 'phrog dang/khri pa rang yang khams dpal 'bar du bros stabs kyis phebs pas yun ring ma bzhugs shing mchod stod dpal 'bar dgon du bzhugs/'di nas bzung sde srid gtsang pas rtse shar kyi bla ma res mos kyis gser khrir bzhugs pa dang/lo bdun nges can du byed par gtan 'bebs byas/rgyal mchog sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i sku dus shig nas de gar sor gnas thog /rgyud grwa gnyis kyi mkhan bla rim par brgyud dgos rgyu dang/skabs mtshams su gzhung 'brel bsko gzhag bskyangs te khri 'don dang po rgyal ba'i pho brang nang dang/de rjes dga' ldan du gnang rgyu bcas kyi srol tshugs/dga' ldan khri 'don gong du gtsang thog ces pa'i grong khyim zhig tu sngon rje rin po che dga' ldan du bzhugs skabs gsol zhib 'thag byed rab 'thag chung ngu bkol zad can gzhung gi dar 'byar ma zhig yod 'dug pa dus der gzhung nas ched btang gi 'bru yos tshad can 'khyer ba'i rtse zhabs kyi dam phrug bshigs te/khri las thog pas phyag bstar te gsol zhib btags par mang nyung ji thon gyis mtshan ma rtog srol yang dus skabs der byung bar snang ngo/_}
khri chen dge 'dun rin chen|{(dga' ldan khri thog so bdun pa )mdo khams dang rgya yi mtshams 'jam zhabs su 'khrungs/ser smad spom ra sogs su mkhas par sbyangs/rgyud sdod dang shar rtse brgyud rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing sprel (1644)lor gser khrir byon nas lo lnga khrir bzhugs te/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa byi (1648)lor khri thog de nyid du gshegs/'khrungs lo mi gsal/khri 'jam zhabs pa'ang zer}
khri chen bstan pa rgyal mtshan|{(dag ldan khri thog so brgyad pa )dwangs yul gro mdar bltams shing/dwags po grwa tshang sogs su mkhas par sbyangs/rgyud smad dang byang rtse brgyud rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa byi (1648)lor khrir 'khod de khri lo bdun zhes gsal yang lo der gshegs par bshad pa 'thad par snang}
khri chen dkon mchog chos bzang|{(dga' ldan khri thog so dgu pa )stod lung chu bzang du 'khrungs shing/chu bzang dgon du bstan pa'i sgor bzhugs/'bras spungs sgo mang du mkhas par sbyangs nas rgyud stod brgyud rab byang bcu gcig pa'i sa byi (1648)lor khrir phebs te lo bdun par chos 'khor bskor/dgung grangs gya bdun steng zhi bar gshegs zhes byung}
khri chen dpal ldan rgya mtsho|{(dga' ldan khri thog bzhi bcu pa )stod mnga' ris spi ti grang mkhar du bltams/dbus phyogs mnga' ris grwa tshang dang rgyud smad du mkhas par sbyangs/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing rta (1654)la gser khrir 'god nas lo bdun ring chos 'khor bskor/zur bzhugs mdzad nas mthar dgung lo don gsum bzhes zhes byung}
khri chen blo bzang rgyal mtshan|{(dga' ldan khri thog zhe gcig pa )rtsed thang du 'khrungs/rwa stod sogs nas mkhas par gyur/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu stag (1662)lor gser khrir phebs/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu byi (1672)lor gshegs so/_}
khri chen blo bzang don yod rnam dag rdo rje|{(zhog gur smon pa )(dga' ldan khri thog zhe gnyis pa )rab byung bcu pa'i chu stag (1702)lor 'phan yul du zhogs gram phur sku bltams/ser byes dang rgyud smad du mdo sngags la sbyangs nas dgung grangs re bdun pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa sprel (1668)lor khrir phebs shing/khri lo bdun ring bskyangs nas sa rta (16678)lor gshegs 'jam bzhad gong ma'i mdzad rnam du khri rin po che blo bzang don grub zhabs drung du 'jigs byed kyi rjes gnang dang mgon chos kyi rjes gnang gnas zhes 'byung ba 'di las 'os med pas mtshan 'di brtag dgos 'dra}
khri chen byams pa bkra shis|{(dga' ldan khri thog zhe gsum pa )rab byung bcu pa'i sa rta (1618)lor rgyal du 'khrungs/dwags po grwa tshang dang rgyud stod du byon/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing yos (1675)lor gser khril 'khod nas lo bdun ring gnas sa bskyangs/dgung grangs re bdun pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing byi (1684)lor gshegs/'di nas lo bdun re gdan sa mdzad do zhes byung}
khri chen rgya nag pa blo gros rgya mtsho|{(dga' ldan khri thog zhe bzhi pa )rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing phag (1635)lor a mdo stag phyug rgyud du 'khrungs/byis pa'i dus nas 'jigs pa sogs kyi tshe dmigs brtse ma dang/badzra pa ni gsungs pas dpyod ldan dag gis 'di ni 'di dang 'di'i skye ba'o zhes gleng brjod mang du byed kyang rje yi sprul par grags che/'bras spungs sgo mang klu 'bum du zhugs/mkhas grags shin tu che/rgyud smad du byon/bde yangs grwa tshang/sgo mang grwa tshang/dpal ldan rgyud smad/byang rtse rnams kyi mkhan khrir rim bzhin brgyud mthar rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu khyi (1682)lor gser khrir byon/gong ma khang shis tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa la bstan 'gror phan pa'i bla ma zhig dgos pa'i pho nya btang bar gong sa mchog nas rje 'di la 'ol tshul gyi phyag tham phebs pa spyi bor blangs te khri lo bzhi song mtshams shing glang (1685)lor gong ma'i rgyal sar byon/hal ha o lod 'khrugs grabs byed pa lo shas zhi bar byas/gong ma khang shis mjal 'phrad kyang gnang zhing/gong mas thugs dgyes pa byung stabs pe cin du rgyun rim bzhugs pas khri rgya nag par grags/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i 'brug (1688)lor snyun zug sogs med par chos dbyings su gshegs par mdzad/gdung la'ang rang byon gyi rnam pa mang du snang ba la dngul gdung bzhengs shing/slob ma 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa ngag dbang brtson 'grus dang/lcang skya ngag dbang chos ldan sogs mang}
khri chen 'jam dbyangs tshul khrims dar rgyas|{(dga' ldan khri thog zhe lnga pa )rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu sprel (1632)lor co ne zho bzang du 'khrungs/dbus la ma phabs gong smad 'dul gyi sdom rgyun bzhes/mtshan tshul khrims dar rgyas su btags/ser smad gzhung pa dang rgyud sdod du mkhas par sbyangs/dgung grangs zhi bdun steng rgyal mchog lnga pa las paN chen sdom rgyun gyi bsnyen rdzogs bskyar bzhes mdzad/dgung lo nga bzhir phebs pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing glang (1685)lor khri bshol/rgyal ba drug pa'am ngag dbang chos grags kyis dbang khrid mang po zhus/lha ldan tshogs mchod chen mo gsar 'dzugs kyi thog ma'i gral dbur phebs}
khri chen bsam blo sbyin pa rgya mtsho'am ngag dbang dpal bzang|{(dga' ldan khri thog zhe drug pa )rma chu'i phyogs kyi bis mdor 'khrungs/'bras spungs sgo mang nas mkhas par sbyangs/rgyal mchog lnga pa chen po las byang chub lam gyi rim pa chen mo'i khrid zla chos su rgyas par nod nas lung sogs kyi gsan rgya che/bka' 'gyur gyi lung dar khyab mdzad pas bka' 'gyur bar grags/de dus gangs ri'i khrod na bla ma 'di lung gsan rgya che bar grags/rgyud smad dang byang rtse brgyud rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu sprel (1692)lor gser khrir phebs kyang lo ngo bzhi nas gshegs par gyur la/skabs der shar rtse blo bzang chos 'phel mnga' ris mtho lding phyogs der rgyal blon rnams kyis yun ring bzhugs dgos tshul dang/gsar te gser khrir phebs bshol gang mgyogs kyis phyir phebs gnang dbang yang byang rtse mngon dga' sprul sku blo bur gshegs pas byang rtse nas skabs 'phral gser khri phebs chog med par 'gor gzhi yong ba sogs kyi bkag cha dang/shar chos kyang dus thog tu phebs min gyis bar stong lus par slar yang co ne tshul dar gyis shing phag (1695)lo nas lo lnga'i bar gser khri mdzad cing de'i ring la rgyal mchog tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho'i dbu bla mdzad de byang chub lam gyi rim pa'i bka' chos 'bul ba sogs kyi mdzad rjes che}
khri chen yang steng pa blo bzang chos 'phel|{(dga' ldan khri thog zhe bdun pa )rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lo 'gor tsam du mdo khams khul gyi 'dabs yang steng dgon dang nye bar spa smad rgyal po'am dbang nges dpon tsang du grags pa'i rigs rus kyi rgyud du sku bltams/sku na chung dus 'dabs yang steng dgos kyi sgrigs su zhugs kyang thugs la dbus gtsang gi grwa sa chen por song nas mdo sngags yongs rdzogs la sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa zhig byed rgyu byung na ci ma rung dgongs nas yod mur/rkyen gzhan dag gis kyang bskul te dbus su phebs/thog mar dga' ldan gdan sa chen po'i shar rtse grwa tshang gi sgrigs su zhugs nas lo shas slob gnyer mdzad cing bzhugs mus su kha phyir bltas kyi thos bsam slob gnyer 'di 'dra dgos pa mi 'dug dgongs te grwa sa'i sgrigs nas 'then thog pha yul gyi dben gnas shig la sgrub pa nyams len zhig byed dgongs te dbus stod 'bri gung bar du phebs nas sngon chad slob gnyer byas pa la dgos pa byung e 'dug dgongs nas thugs bsam bzhes pa na/rang mnyam gzhan dag gi slob gnyer byed tshul dang mi 'dra ba'i go rtogs bzang po byung yod pa mkhyen nas slar yang slob gnyer mu mthun nas gnang 'dod kyis phebs kyang/skabs 'phral dga' ldan gyi sgrigs khongs nas 'then te nyin shas las ma song bar brten ser smad grwa tshang du zhugs te phar phyin gyi mjug nas bzung gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer mthar phyin pa mdzad de dge bshes mtshan btags kyang thon/de rjes rgyud stod du mkhan chen dge 'dun grags pa dang/mkhan chen blo bzang dge legs sogs bla mar bsten nas gsang sngags kyi skor la/dbang/khrid/lag len bshad pa sogs cha tshang bar gsan cing byang chub par mdzad/zhar la bla ma bzang po'i drung nas mdo gas ka cho sa mtha' yas pa gsan/ring por ma song bar grwa dmangs kyi 'dod mos bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad kyi khrir phebs/de'i ring 'jam dpal rang bzhin ma'i dbyangs bka' rgya ma dang/mgo chos gnyis kyi dbyangs gsar pa khag bzhi gsar gtod kyi dbyangs yig kyang mdzad/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags lug (1691)lor rgyud sdod mkhan po'i khrir phebs shing mi ring bar shar pa chos rje'i khrir phebs te 'chad nyan dang gtong sgo sogs yar rgyas bzang 'gran lta bur mdzad mus su mnga' ris mtho lding dgon gyi mkhan por phebs/der lo shas bzhugs shing /las rim blo sbyong/dbang/lung/bshad/khrid sogs gang la gang 'tshams pa'i mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsungs/gsod nges kyi mi dang dud ro mang po'i srog skyob pa dang/dbul phongs rnams la nar ma dang 'phar ma'i sbyin gtong/yi ge dang/rtsis dang/sman sogs tha snyad ri gnas kyi slob sbyong la bskul ma/sde 'bangs phan tshul mthun sgril dang phan tshun rogs rab dgos pa'i bka' p+salob sogs yang yang gnang bas/mnga' ris dang la dwags khul gyi dpon 'bangs mang pos dam pa nyid sku tshe'i ring mnga' ris khul du bzhugs 'jags yong ba'i re ba skul sa gnas srid gzhung dang rje nyid la nan tan chen pos zhus par ba rten/khri chen bsam blo ba sbyin pa rgya mtsho khri lo gsum las ma bzhugs par sku gshegs pa'i rjes su dga' ldan khri la phabs res rje 'di yin kyang khri la phebs ma thub par mnga' ris su lo bzhi bzhugs pa'i ring khri chen tshul khrims dar rgyas kyis dga' ldan khri tshab mdzad dgos byung/de nas rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa yos (1699)lor gzhung dga' ldan pho brang nas dga' ldan gser khrir 'phral du phebs dgos pa'i bka' byung ba bzhin dbus su phebs nas/rgyal ba tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho dang/paN chen rin po che/sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho bcas la mjal 'phrad 'bul rten gya non pa phul zhing dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs te lo gcig lhag tsam nas dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/sku gdung zhugs 'bul zhus pa'i dngul gdung lha babs mchod rten zhig bzhengs pa yangs pa can gyi bla ma lha khang nang bzhugs yod/dam pa de'i rnam thar ser smad mkhan po grags pa mkhas grub kyis mdzad pa dpar ma la grangs bcu bzhi yod}
khri chen don grub rgya mtsho|{(dga' ldan khri thog zhe brgyad pa )rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing lug (1655)lor kre nag tshang gi phyogs su yab spen pa tshe ring dang yum dpal bsam 'dzoms pa gnyis kyi sras su sku 'khrungs/sku na chung dus nas nga dbus su chos byed par 'gro rgyu yin pas der skyol rogs zhes yab yum gnyis la yang yang gsungs par brten dgung lo bcu gsum pa mi lug (1667)lor gzhung gi nag tshang 'go pa dang mnyam du phebs te lha sar 'byor 'phral 'bras spungs sgo ma khongs har gdong khang tshan gyi hor mi tshan du sgrigs zhugs mdzad/grwa sar zhugs skabs nyin rer phyag dpe shog bu dma' tshad ma bcu re tsam thugs 'dzin thub pa'i mkhyen rab kyi rtsal phul du byung ba mnga' bar brten/gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer mtho phyin nas dgung lo nyer drug pa lcags sprel (1680)lor lha sa smon lam chen mor dge bshes lha rabs pa'i dam bca' nang po thon/smon lam grol 'phral rgyud smad grwa tshang du sgrigs zhugs mdzad de lo gnyis ring sngags phyogs kyi dbang/khrid/lung/bshad pa/cho ga phyag len sogs gsan bzhes dang/bslab sbyang mthar phyin pa mdzad/dgung lo nyer brgyad pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu khyi (1682)lor 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang gi mkhan por bskos/dgung lo zhe gcig pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing phag (1695)lor rgyud smad kyi mkhan po dang/byang rtse chos rje'i khri chags gcig tu bskyangs/dgung lo zhe brgyad pa chu rta (1702)lor dga' ldan gser khrir phebs shing rgyal ba tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin kyang mdzad/de nas mi ring bar sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho dang rgyal po lha bzang gnyis mi mthun pa'i 'gal zla che rung song ba dang/dus mtshungs rgyal ba tshangs dbyangs rgya mtshos rab byung gi sdom pa phul nas khyim pa'i tshul bzhes pa sogs rkyen mang po zhig 'dzoms par brten/rgyal ba tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho po tA la'i gser khri'i steng nas phab ste pe cin phyogs su gdan drangs/pan dkar 'dzin pa ngag dbang ye shes rgya mtsho khri la bkod pa sogs dza drag ha cang che ba'i skabs su yang khri chen 'dis tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho rgyal ba lnga pa chen po'i yang srid 'khrul med yin pa'i bzhed pa mtha' 'khyongs kyi sgo nas rgyal po lha bzang phyogs khag la mdung rtse kha sprod kyi rtsod gleng gnang yang/skabs der lha bzang phyogs khag la ching gong ma khang shis rgyab skyor thugs che ba yod stabs 'gog thabs ma byung bar snang zhing/khri lo bdun gtsang nas dbus stod bya yul dgon par zur bzhugs mdzad/dgung lo don gsum pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me lug (1727)lor sku gshags (gzhung gi yig cha'i khongs nas dpar bskrun byas pa'i gras)bod dang/bar khams/rgya sog bcas kyi bla sprul rnams kyi skye phreng deb gzhung )zhes kha byang du 'od pa de yi nang khri chen 'di'i sku phreng gis mtshon pa'i bla sprul mang po 'dug pa ni 'brel yod khungs so so'i dpyad gzhi'i yig cha gong phul zhu mdzad tshos ma shes 'ol tshod byas pa de rang gzhir bzung nas bkod par nges )sku gdung ring bsrel bzhugs pa'i mchod rten dngul gdung zhig 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang gi nang rten du bzhugs/rnam thar skor/ser smad mkhan po grags pa mkhas grub kyis mdzad pa (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (kha)pa shog grangs bcu yod/rnam thar 'di'i nang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng drug pa tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho po tA la'i khri thog nas phab pa'i skabs kyi snga rjes gnas tshul gal chen lo rgyus yig cha gzhan dag tu ma 'khod pa mang po zhig 'khod 'dug kyang yig tshogs che bas 'dir ma bris/khri chen 'di'i sku phreng gnyis pa/dge 'dun bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan/dbus stod bya yul du rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa sprel (1728)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo re gsum pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags khyi (1790)lor sku gshegs/sku phreng gsum pa/blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan/khams sde dger rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags phag (1791)lor 'khrungs/('bras spungs su chos zhugs mdzad skabs 'khrungs yul la brten nas sgo mang grwa tsang dang blo gsal gling bar rtsod gleng byung bar de mo srid skyong 'jam dpal bde legs rgya mtshos phyin chad blo gsal gling du chos zhugs gnang rgyur thag bcad pa nas bzung sku phreng rim byon blo gsal gling grwa tshang du chos zhugs gnang srol byung zhes deng skabs gas thon gyi yig cha 'ga' zhig tu gsal yang skabs der srid skyong rta tshag bstan pa'i mgon por yin pas dogs gzhi che/) dgung lo bcu dgu pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa sbrul (1809)lor sku gshegs (gong gsal gung yig der dgung lo nga gcig pa zhes 'khod pa nor/) sku phreng bzhi pa/ngag dbang lung rtogs yon tan rgya mtsho/sbo bo smad du rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags lug (1811)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo zhe lnga pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing yol (1855)lor sku gshegs/sku phreng lnga pa/blo bzang lung rtogs bstan 'dzin 'phrin las/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me 'brug (1856)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo zhe bdun pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu stag (1902)lor sku gshegs/sku phreng drug pa/yongs 'dzin gling rdo rje 'chang thub bstan lung rtogs rnam rgyal 'phrin las dpal bzang po/stong yung yab phur rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu yos (1903)lor 'khrungs/go thos su dgung lo gya gcig tu phebs pa rab yung bcu drug pa'i chu phag (1883)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs zer ba tsam las zhib cha ma shes}
khri chen blo bzang dar rgyas|{(dga' ldan khri thog zhe dgu pa )mdo smad khul co ne khag lnga'i khongs ma gzigs thang du rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu stag (1662)lor 'khrungs/byis pa'i dus nas na mnyam gzhan dang mi 'dra bar thugs rig gsal bab dang/gzhan la phan sems che ba sogs kun spyod bzang zhing/yab yum la gus bkur che ba rab shugs su yod par brten yab yum gnyis kas 'don chos kyi rigs mang po slob par mdzad/mi rang bar co ne dgon chen gyi khri pa thabs mkhas rgya mtsho'i drung nas dge bsnyen dang rab byung bsgrubs te mtshan la blo bzang dar rgyas su gsol/dgon pa'i chos spyod skor dang dag yig sngags klog sogs slob sbyong mdzad/dgung lo nyi shu pa lcags bya (1681)lor mdo smad nas dbus su phebs te ser smad grwa tshang gi gzhung pa khang tshan du sgrigs zhugs gnang/dge bshes blo gros rgya mtsho dge rgan du brten nas gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer mthar thon pa mdzad/dgung lo so gcig pa chu sprel (1692)lor gling bsre'i dge bshes dang/so gnyis par se ra tshogs chen dge bskos kyi 'gan bzhes gan nga/gser dbar rnams su rgyal rong khri chen nam mkha' lhun grub dang/khri chen yang steng pa blo bzang chos 'phel/byams gling mkhan chen blo bzang don grub/se re rtse sgrub khang dge legs rgya mtsho sogs bla chen dge bshes mang po'i drung nas mo sngags gnyis kyi lung dang/khrid dang/dbang bshad pa/man ngag sogs rgya cher gsan/dgung lo so bzhi bzhes pa/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing phag (1695)lor dge bshes lha rams pa'i grwa skor mdzad/dgung lo so lnga pa mi byi lor pha bong kha pa 'jam dbyangs grags pa'i drung nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes nas mi ring bar rgyud stod grwa tshang du sgrigs zhugs mdzad nas gsang sngags skor gyi slob gnyer gnang/dgung la so bdun pa sa stag (1698)lor rgyud stod bla ma dbu mdzad kyi khrir phebs/dgung lo so dgu pa lcags 'brug (1700)lor rgyud stod mkhan po'i khrir phebs nas lo dgu'i ring 'chad tan dang gtor sgo sogs gong 'phel du bskyangs/de'i rang rgyud stod grwa tshang tshogs che stabs se ra ba'i dbyar chos kyi rgyud khang sngar yod chung skyon gyis ka ba kha shas kyi sar rgya bskyed thog /chos thog ring gi dgos cha rnams gsar sbyor mdzad/dgung lo zhe lnga pa me khyi (17060lor dga' ldan shar pa chos rje'i khrir phebs/dgung lo zhe dgu pa sa byi (1708)lor dga' ldan gser khrir phebs nas khri chen rim byon gyi srol rgyun mdzad sgo rnams nyams med thog mdo sngags gnyis kyi bshad pa/dbang bka'/khrid lugs sogs gdul bya'i 'dod mos ltar gnang/dga' ldan spyi so khang sum thog g.yab skor dang bcas pa gsar rgyag mdzad/gzhan yang rje nyid dang 'brel yod dgon sde khag la gang dgos kyi sku rten dang/mchod rdzas/dbang rdzas/mchod cha sogs 'bul sbyor gnang/dgung lo nga dgu pa lcags byi (1720)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin du phebs te lo bzhi'i ring bsdus grwa nas phar phyin skabs brgyad pa'i bar gyi gsan bzhes dang/zhal la dbang lang sogs man ngag mang po 'bul bar mdzad cing/zhan yang bla chen dang dge bshes sogs slob ma yang ha cang mang/gsum rtsod pod gsum yod tshul rnam thar nang gsal yang deng skabs le tshan 'ga' zhig ma gtogs mthong rgyu mi snang/dgung lo drug cu re gnyis pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu yus (1723)lor sku gshegs/sku gdung zhugs 'bul zhus nas thugs ljags spyan gsum me ma bzhes pa dang/p+sapur rus gzhan rnams nang rten du bzhugs pa'i gdung rten zhig mar grol khul dag pa rnam grol gling gi ma chod khang du bzhugs/rnam thar skor ser smad mkhan po grags pa mkhas grub kyis mdzad pa'i (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )dpar ma le tshan (ga)shog grangs bcu yod/zhar byung/khri chen 'di'i spu phreng rim byon la dag pa khri chen rin po che zhu zhing/sku phreng gnyis pa/bslab gsum rgya mtsho/lha sa po tA la'i zhol du 'khrungs/dgung lo so bzhi pa sku gshegs/sku phreng gsum pa/blo bzang chos grags dpal ldan bstan pa'i nyi ma/'ol dga' rdzing phyi'i nye 'dabs su 'khrungs/dgung lo so dgu bar sa stag lo'i zla 10tshes 7la gshegs zhes (bod bzhugs am ban gyi tang tse )nang 'khod par gzhigs na/de'i rjes su yang sku phreng gcig gnyis shig phabs pa 'dra/da lta'i mchog sprul rin po che blo bzang 'jigs bral 'phrin las dar rgyas/kong po nga phod khul du rab byung bcu drug pa'i me yos (1927)lor 'khrungs}
khri chen dge 'dun phun tshogs|{(dga' ldan khri thog lnga bcu pa )mdo smad gcal zhes bya ba'i yul du dbal shul gyi rigs las/yab 'bum phyug dang/yum rdo rje mkha' 'gro gnyis kyi sras su bar byung bcu gcig pa'i sa byi (1648)lor sku 'khrungs/(dbal mang rin po che dkon ma chog rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bla brang bkra shis 'khyil gyi gdan rabs )las 'khrungs lo shing sbrul yin par gsungs pa brtag) dgung lo chung dus nas rab tu byung ste chos sgor zhugs/dgung lo bco lnga pa chu stag (1662)lor dbus su byon nas 'bras spungs sgo mang bya brag khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad de gzhung chen po sngar gsan sbyong mthar phyin pa mdzad/gser dbar nam byung la tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa rin po che/khri chen blo gros rgya mtsho/bka' 'gyur ba sbyin pa rgya mtsho/gtsang pa ngag dbang sbyin pa/'jam dbyangs bshad pa'i rdo rje ngag dbang brtson 'grus sogs bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyan ha cang mang po gsan/dge bshes lha rams ka'i mtshan btags grwa skor dam bca' 'gran zla bral ba gnang ste/rgyud smad grwa tshang du sgrigs zhugs mdzad nas/rgyud pa'i sgrig srol dang/cho ga phyag bzhes/khrid skyod sogs la byang chub par mdzad/rim bzhin rgyud smad bla ma dbu mdzad dang mkhan po'i khrir phebs/mkhan po mdzad ring bde chen gsang sngags mkhar rgyud smad 'du khang dang/lha sa'i rgyud smad 'du khang bcas gsar rgyag mdzad/byang rtse chos rje'i khri thog mdzad ring ('grel pa bzhi sbrags )la slar yang zhus dag nan tan gnang ste shing dpar gsar bskrun gnang/dgung lo re lnga pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu 'brug (1712)lor dga' ldan khrir phebs/khri pa'i rgyun ldan gyi mdzad sgo gong 'phel thog /dad 'dus slob ma rnams la rang rang gi 'dod mos dang mtshams pa'i chos bka' mang du gnang bas zhal slob grags pa can mang po byung/dga' ldan khri ma gnang ring mtsho sngon ching wang blo bzang bstan 'dzin la bka' gnang ste/rje bla ma'i dngul gdul gyi phyi nas gser sbyangs kyis g.yogs te gser gdung du bsgyur/dga' ldan khri pa'i lo dus gtsang nas sa gnas srid gzhung dang/dpon rigs khag nas re bskul zhus pa ltar tshal gung thang gtsug lag khang dgon pa dang bcas pa'i 'dzin bdag nang gnas zhig g.yo dang/gsar bzhengs sogs gang la gang 'os kyi 'dzin skyong tshags su tshud pa mdzad nas/dgung lo don bdun pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing sbrul (1725)lor tshal gung thang du sku gshegs/khri chen de'i sku phreng rim byon rnams la gung thang tshang zhes zhu ba'i rgyu mtshan yang de ltar yin/sku rus la rten ngo mtshar can mang du byon pa rnams bde chen gsang sngags mkhar dang/bla brang bkra shis 'khyil du gdan drangs nas sku brnyan khag gi nang rten du bzhugs/rnam thar skor/ser smad mkhan po grags pa mkhas grub kyis mdzad pa'i (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )le tshan (nga)par shog grangs drug yod/de rjes sku phreng gnyis pa ngag dbang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me lug (1727)lor sku 'khrugs nas dgung lo so gsum pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me yos (1759)lor sku gshegs/sku phreng gsum pa dkon mchog bstan pa'i sgron me rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu rta (1662)lor sku 'khrungs nas dgung lo re gnyis pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu lug (1823)lor sku gshegs/sku phreng bzhi pa dkon mchog bstan pa'i rgya mtsho rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing sprel (1824)lor sku 'khrungs te dgung lo so drug pa rab byung de ga'i sa lug (1859)lor sku gshegs/sku phreng lnga pa 'jam dbyangs bstan pa'i nyi ma rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags sprel (1860)lor sku 'khrungs nas rab byung bco lnga pa'i smad du sku gshegs/sku phreng drug pa da lta'i mchog sprul rin po che 'jigs med bstan pa'i dbang phyug rab byung bco lnga pa'i me stag (1926)lor stag zla/stag nyi/stag gi dus bcas stag gzhi 'dzoms la sku 'khrungs/da lta dgung lo bdun cu pa bstan 'gro'i mgon du sku tshe zhabs pad brtan bzhin par bzhugs so/_/sku phreng so so'i mdzad rnam cung zhib pa gsham du ga sde'i (gung )nang gsal ba der gzigs}
khri chen dpal ldan grags pa|{(dga' ldan khri thog nga gcig pa )mdo smad shar phyogs rgya da dang nye ba'i sa cha hor tshang gi dpon rgyud du sku 'khrungs/'khrungs lo gsal ba ma rnyed/rta tshag rje drung ngag dbang dkon mchog nyi ma mdo smad du byon skabs mjal nas rab byung zhus/dbus su byon nas 'bras spus sgo mang tA dben khang tshan du chos zhugs gnang ste gzhung chen po lnga'i gsan sbyong mthar phyin nas dge bshes lha rabs pa mdzad/rgyud stod grwa tshang du zhugs nas gsang sngags kyi blo gter gnang zhing/gseng bar nang yod la 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i rdo rje dang/khri chen dge 'dun phun tshogs/'jam dbyangs bde ba'i rdo rje sogs bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi zab chos mtha' yas pa gsan/rgyud stod bla ma dbu mdzad/mkhan po'i khrir phebs/mkhan po mdzad ring de sngon rgyud stod grwa tshang brag yar par dbyar gnas su phebs skabs gur nang du bzhugs rgyus las rgyud khang zur du med stabs/yer pa grwa tshang dang bka' mol mdzad de da lta'i rgyud khang yod sa'i sa cha de skabs der dur khrod yin par de phul bar thugs mnyes bzhin du bdag 'dzin mdzad de rgyud khang dang/rung khang/mkhan po dang/bla ma'i gzims chung/chos grub bcas gsar bzhengs dang/tshogs gdan/thab chas/mchod rdzas/mchod cha sogs nyer mgo gang dgos 'bul 'byor gan nga/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa phag (1719)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/khri pa'i mdzad sgo rnams legs grub thog /zhal slob mang por 'dod chos bar ma chad par stsal/khri lo drug pa shing 'brug (1742)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin du gdan drangs pa ltar phebs nas lo shas ring bsdus grwa dang/phan phyin gyi gsan bzhes dang/mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang po zhig 'bul bar mdzad mus su/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa bya (1729)lor sku gshegs /sku rus la rten ngo mtshar can mang du byon pa rnams rgyal dbang mchog dang yongs 'dzin khri chen ngag dbang mchog ldan rnam gnyis nas khag gcig rten skal du bzhes/byings rnams gdung rten bzhengs pa'i nang du bzhugs/rnam thar skor/ser smad mkhan chen grags pa mkhas grub gyis mdzad pa'i (dga' ldan khri pa rim byon gyi rnam thar )le tshan (ca)par shog grangs drug yod/dam pa de'i sku phreng rim byon la yongs grags su med rig pa'i seng ge ni hor tsang gi rigs rgyud de rang gi bur rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags phag (1731)lor sku 'khrungs zhes (mdo smad chos 'byung )las gsal yang sku gshegs pa'i lo khams mi gsal zhing/sku phreng rjes ma kha shas phebs tshod 'dug kyang da phan dpyad gzhi ma rnyed lags}
khri chen dwags po tshe 'phel|{(dga' ldan khri thog nga gnyis pa )dwags po stod rgyud du rab byung bcu gcig pa'i se sprel (1668)lor sku 'khrungs/dwags po grwa tshang du gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer mthar phyin pa gnang nas rgyud smad du bzhugs te gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer mdzad /bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po brgyud byang rtse'i chos rje'i khrir phebs/dgung lo re gsum pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags khyi (1730)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo bzhi bskyangs rjes sku gshegs/rnam thar skor/ser smad mkhan po grags pa mkhas grub kyis mdzad pa'i (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )le tshan (cha)par shog grangs brgyad yod}
khri chen rgyal mtshan seng ge|{(dga' ldan khri thog nga gsum pa )mdo smad zab tsha'i de'u 'khor yab tshe ring bkra shis dang yul snying mo lcags kyu sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa rta (1678)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu gcig pa tA dben tshul khams seng ge las rab tu byung/dgung lo nyer bdun pa shing sprel (1704)lor dbus su byon/'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tsang dang p+tA dben khan tshan du chos zhugs mdzad/kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhed pa'i rdo rje dang/paN chen rin po che blo bzang ye shes las bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo so dgu pa me sprel (1716)lor dge bshes lha rams kyi mtshan btags grwa skor mdzad/jun gar gyis bod la dbang bsgyur sbyangs skabs kong po 'bru la dgon pa'i mkhan por bskos/lo gsum song rjes rgyud stod grwa tshang du chos zhugs gnang nas gsang sngags la slob gnyer mdzad/dgung lo zhe dgu pa me rta (1726)lor rgyud stod bla ma dbu mdzad dang/dgung lo ca gcig pa sa sprel (1728)lor rgyud stod mkhan po'i khrir phebs nas lo gsum bskyangs/dgung lo nga lnga pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu byi (1732)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas dga' ldan khri ba'i mdzad sgo gang yod gong 'phel thog bla sprul dang dge bshes mang por mdo sngags kyi chos bka' rgyun mi chad par gnang bas slob ma snyan grags can mang du thon/dga' ldan khri pa'i lo dus gtsang nas lcags sprel (1740)lo nas lo brgyad ring/dge bshes bya yul ba'i gdan sa'i 'dzin bdag gnang nas gtso bor sku mtshams la bzhugs/mtsho sngon ching wang ser rti ni ju nang gis tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa rin po cher rje nyid kyi sku tshab tu khri chen 'di nyid gdan 'dren zhus chog pa'i gnang ba zhus pas bka' phebs su/dga' ldan khri rin po che sa gnas thag ring du phebs pa'i srol rgyun med kyang/ching tshang nyid dge lugs bstan pa'i sbyin bdag gzhan 'gran ma mchis pa yin par brten phebs chog ces gnang ma thob ste phebs khar rgyal ba rang nyid kyis bzhes pa'i dbu zhwa dang/sku ber/mi tra dang rdo rje phreng ba'i dkyil 'khor gyi thang ka cha tshang dang/thang ka ru sgor bcas gnang skyes su stsal gdung la bdun cu pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me yos (1747)lor mtsho sngon ching wang ju nang gi urger phebs/de'i phyi lor gtsos kyi gdon chen dga' ldan bshad sgrub pad dkar grol ba'i gling phyag btab/rim bzhin mtshan nyid kyi bshad grwa btsugs nas slob dpon dang dge rgan zur 'dzugs sogs mdzad pas slob gnyer 'phel rgyan chen po byung/dgung lo don dgu pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me byi (1756)lor sku gshegs/gsung rtsom pod bdun gtsos dgon chen du dpar yod/rnam thar skor/ser smad mkhan po grags pa mkhas grub kyis mdzad pa'i (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )le tshan (ja)par shog grangs bdun yod/rnam thar de las rgyas pa khri sprul blo bzang rgyal mtshan seng ges mdzad pa kha byang du (rje btsun bla ma mkhan dang grub pa'i dbang phyug khri chen rgyal mtshan seng ge'i rnam par thar pa nor bu'i chu shel dkar po'i phreng ba )shog grangs sum cu so gcig yod pa dam pa de'i gsung 'bum pod (ka)pa'i nang bzhugs/de rjes sku phreng gnyis pa khri sprul blo bzang rgyal mtshan seng ge rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me glang (1757)lor sku 'khrungs pa la gtsos khri sprul zer/dgung lo zhe gsum pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa bya (1849)lor sku gshegs/de nas sku phreng 'ga' zhig phebs tshod 'dug kyang dpyad gzhi ma rnyed lags}
khri chen ngag dbang mchog ldan|{(dga' ldan khri thog nga bzhi pa )rwa sgreng mchog sprul rin po che'i sku phreng dang po yin/mdo smad gcan tsha yul gyi le lag dkar mo phug tu yan nang so phyag rdor bkra shes dang yum sbo chog gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me sbrul (1677)lor sku 'khrungs/byis pa'i dus nas nam mnyam gzhan dang mi ra ba kun spyod bzang zhing mkhyen rab kyi rtsal zla med pa zhig ste/yam yum gnyis la rab byung gnang rgyu'i thugs bzhed yod tshul gsungs pa bzhin bya khyung dgon par mkhan po ngag dbang tshul khris kyi drung du gtsug phug phul nas rab byung mdzad par mdzad la ngag dbang mchog ldan zhes gsol zhing/dge tshul gyi sdom pa yang mkhan po de nyid kyi drung nas bzhes/dgung lo bco lnga pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags lug (1691)lor dbus su phebs nas ser byes grwa tshang bsam blo khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad /bsdus grwa nas mdzod kyi bar gzhung chen po lngar sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa mdzad/dgung lo nye shu pa me byi (1696)lor gsang phur phar phyin gyi grwa skor mdzad/dgung lo nyer lnga pa lcags sprul (1701)lor dge bshes lha rams pa'i grwa skor dam bca' mdzad/de nas khres po bsnams te bkra shis lhun por paN chen rin po che blo bzang ye shes mjal bar phebs nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/de nas rgyud smad grwa tshang du chos zhugs mdzad de mkhan chen dge 'dun phun tshogs kyi drung nas gsang sngags kyi chos skor mang po gsan zhing/sngags rabs pa'i dam bca'i grwa skor yang gnang/dgung lo nyer dgu pa shing bya (1705)lor rgyud pa'i dge bskos kyi khur bzhes/de nas yab yum gnyis nas nan gyis bskul ba bzhin rang yul du phebs nas lo ngo bzhi tsam bzhugs dgos byung/dgung lo so gsum pa sa glang (1709)lor slar yang dbus su phebs nas rgyud grwar mu mthud nas chos sgrigs gnang/dgung lo so bzhi pa lcags stag (1710)lor sa gnas srid gzhung gis mnga' ris mtho lding dgon pa'i mkhan po bskos pa bzhin phebs nas lo bdud gyi ring chos srid gnyis 'i thog nas 'dzin skyong legs par gnang/snga rjes su paN chen rin po che dang/rgyud smad mkhan chen dge 'dun phun tshogs/sgrub khang dge legs rgya mtsho/'jam dbyangs bde ba'i rdo rje sogs bla ma mang po'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun rgya cher gsan/dgung lo zhe gsum pa sa phag (1719)lor rgyud smad grwa tshang gi mkhan po'i khrir phebs/mkhan po lo bcu mdzad ring chos 'chad nyan kyi mdzad sgo gong 'phel thog /de sngon rgyud smad du gsang 'dus dang 'jigs byed gnyid kyi sgrub mchod ma gtogs bde mchog gi sgrub mchod mdzad srol med par brten rje 'dis gsar 'dzugs thog /de'i mthun rkyen chos gzhis sa gnas srid gzhung la zhu gnas mdzad pa bzhin glang ra'i gzhis ka phul/dgung lo nga gnyis pa sa sprel (1728)lor tA la'i bla ma rin po che sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin du gdan drangs pa ltar phebs te/gsang sngags kyi dbang khrid/lung/man ngag thams cad cha tshang bar 'bul gnang gis lo ngo nyi shu rtsa bzhi'i ring yongs 'dzin gyi khur bzhes/dgung lo re gsum pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa lug (1739)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/dga' ldan khri pa'i mdzad sgo gal che'i rigs sngar rgyud thog dbus gtsang khams gsum sog yul bcad nas dad 'dus kyi slob ma rnams la rang rang gi re 'dod dang 'tshams pa'i mdo gas kyi chos rgyun chad med par gnang bas zhal slob ni grangs las 'das/khri lo bdud gtsang nas lo shas ring po tA lar rgyun bzhugs mdzad mur/rgyal dbang mchog la rwa sgreng dgon pa rgyun bzhugs gnang yul du gsol stsol yong ba'i re 'dun zhu gnang ltar phul/de nas bzung sku phreng rim byon la rwa sgreng chen po chen zhes mtshan 'bod zhu gsol byung/dgung lo don lnga pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags lug (1751)lor rwa reng dgos par phebs te sku gshegs/rnam thar skor/lcang skya rin po che rol pa'i rdo rjes mdzad pa kha byung du (dga' ldan khri rin po che nor min han gyi rnam thar mkha' spyod grub pa'i gtam snyan lha'i rnga bo che )shog grangs go gnyis yod pa dam pa de'i gsung 'bum du bzhugs shing/de las bsdus pa/ser smad mkhan po grags pa mkhas grub kyis mdzad pa'i )dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs tshe lan (nya)par shog grangs bcu gnyis yod/sku phreng gnyis pa khri chen bstan pa rab rgyas/li thang du rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa yos (1759)lor sku 'khrungs te dgung lo nga bdun pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing phag (1815)lor sku gshegs/sku phreng gsum pa ngag dbang ye shes tshul khrims rgyal mtshan rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me glang (1817)lor 'khrungs te rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu phag (1863)lor sku gshegs/sku phreng lnga pa thub bstan 'jam dpal ye shes bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu byi (1912)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo so drug pa rab byung bcu drug pa'i me phag (1947)lor srid skyong stag brag rin po che dang 'gal zlar gyur pa'i nang dbyin jir dga' mkhan phyogs khag gis sku bkrongs zer/sku phreng ga pa da lta'i mchog sprul rin po che bstan 'dzin 'jigs med mthu stobs dbang phyug rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa byi (1948)lor sku 'khrungs te rab byung bcu bdun pa me glang (1997)lor sku gshegs}
khri chen nam mkha' bzang po|{(dga' ldan khri thog nga lnga pa )mdo sngags nya tshang sde bcu'i nang tshad d+ha zug bya bar rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing glang (1685)lor 'khrungs/'bras spungs sgo mang gzhung pa khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad/gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer mthar phyin nas dgung lo zhe gnyis pa me rta (17260lor rdo rabs pa'i dge bshes thon/de rjes rgyud stod du zhugs nas gsang sngags la sbyangs pa mthor de rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad da nga/mkhan po/shar pa chos rje bcas kyi khri la phebs/dgung lo re gnyis pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me stag (1746)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/khri pa'i mdzad sgo gong 'phel thog da 'dus kyi slob ma mang por mdo sngags kyi chos gang la gang dgos 'phral 'phral du gnang/khri lo lnga song mtshams bod sa gnas kyi srid 'dzin 'gyur med rnam rgyal dang/mnga' ris gung gnyis mi mthun pa'i 'gal zla che bar brten wang 'gyur med rnam rgyal gyis dam pa 'di la mnga' ris gung tshar gcod pa'i drag las mdzad dgos zhus par ma gsan pa'i rkyen gyis lcags rta (1750)lor dga' ldan khri pa'i go gnas nas phab pa'i bka' btang bar de 'phral dge 'dun rnams la bka' chos tha ma gnang ste khri thog khang nas the bo khang tshan du phebs 'phral sku gshegs/rnam thar mdo bsdus shig ser smad mkhan po grags pa mkhas grub kyis mdzad pa'i (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (ha)par shog grangs bdun yod/sku phreng rim par byon pa rnams la zam tsha khri chen zhes zhu zhing/sku phreng gnyis pa 'jigs med nam mkha' ban mun dza sag shog gi sa char yab je sang ngag dbang bstan 'dzin dang/yum ma ma'i sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa byi (1768)lor 'khrungs/(chen po hor gyi chos 'byung gser gyi phreng ba )mdzad pa po de yin/dgung lo nga bzhi pa rang byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags sprul (1821)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar lo rgyus dang sku phreng gnyis pa'i lo rgyus mdor bsdus bcas brag sgom pa bstan pa ram rgyas kyis mdzad pa'i (mdo smad chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 507nas 515bar yod}
khri chen blo bzang dri med|{(dga' ldan khri thog nga ga pa )li thang shog drug tu 'khrungs shing/'khrungs 'das kyi lo gsal bar ma rnyed/dgung lo chung dus lha sar phebs nas 'bras spungs blo gsal gling spom por khang tshan du chos zhugs gnang ste gzhung chen por slob gnyer mdzad/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu yos (1723)lor dge bshes lha rabs pa'i grwa skor gnang/rgyud smad du chos zhugs mdzad de gsang sngags la sbyangs shing/rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rje bcas kyi khri la phebs/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags rta (1750)lor dga' ldan khrir phebs/khri lo bdun mthar phyin nas dgung lo re gcig par skur gshegs zhes rnam thar du gsal yang lo khams mi gsal/rnam thar lo rgyus skor/ser smad mkhan po grags pa mkhas grub kyis mdzad pa'i (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (tha)par shog grangs lnga yod/sku phreng rim par byon pa rnams la yogs grags su thi thang shog drug skyabs mgon zhu ba de yin/lo rgyud dpyad gzhi ma rnyed}
khri chen bsam gtan phun tshogs|{(dga' ldan khri thog nga bdun pa )dbus stod phag mo zhol du rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu lug (1703)lor 'khrungs/'bras spungs blo gsal gling du chos zhugs mdzad de gzhung chen por sbyangs pa mthar phyin par mdzad/dge bshes lha rabs pa thon nas rgyud stod grwa tshang du gsang sngags la slob gnyer gnang/rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/shar pa chos rje bcas kyi khrir phebs/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me glang (1757)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas khri lo bdun mthar phyin par bskyangs/khri pa'i lo dus thim nas dbus stong phag mo chos rjes zur zhugs mdzad/dgung lo re brgyad pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags stag (177)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar lo rgyus gong gsal (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (da)par shog grangs bdun yod}
khri chen ngag dbang chos grags|{(dga' ldan khri thog nga brgyad pa )mdo smad byang khyung gi nye 'dabs mtshams ring bar shar du rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me phag (1707)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo nyer gcig pa me lug khang ngan du chos zhugs dang slob gnyer mdzad/rje blo bzang chos 'phel dang/brag ri ngag dbang don grub/khri chen ngag dbang chos ldan/phur lcog ngag dbang byams pa/khri chen rgyal mtshan seng ge /a pa bsod nams bzang po sogs bla mar brten nas mdo gas kyi chos rgyud mang du gnas/dge bshes lha rabs pa thon 'phral rgyud smad du bzhugs nas gnang sngags kyi slob gnyer mdzad thog /rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rje bcas kyi khrir phebs/dgung lo nga brgyad pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing sprel (1764)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs shing/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin yang mdzad/dgung lo don gnyis pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa phag (1779)lor sku gshegs/sku gdung la rten ngo mtshar can byon pa rnams mchod rten zhig bzhengs pa ser byes grwa tshang du bzhugs/rnam thar mdor bsdus shog gong gsal ( dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (na)par shog grangs lnga yod}
khri chen chu bzang pa ngag dbang chos grags|{( dga' ldan khri thog nga dgu pa )stod lung chu bzang du bar byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags stag (1710)lor 'khrungs/ser smad the bo khang tshad du chos zhugs mdzad nas gzhung chen po sbyangs pa lags par mdzad/dge bshes lha rams pa thon nas rgyud stod grwa tshang du gsang sngags la slob gnyer gnang ste rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/shar rtse chos rje bcas kyi khrir phebs/dgung lo zhe gnyis pa lcags yos (1771)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs /lo ngo gcig tsam bskyangs nas dgung lo re gsum pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu 'brug (1927)lor sku gshegs/sku gdung mchod rten the bo khang tshan du bzhugs/rnam thar skor gong gsal (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon kyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (pa)par shog grangs brgyad yod}
khri chen blo bzang bstan pa|{(dga' ldan khri thon drug cu pa )mdo smad tsha ba rong du rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags stag (1710)lor 'khrungs/dbus su byon nas ser byes tsha ba khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad/gzhung chen mor sbyang pa mthar son nas dge bshes lha rabs pa mdzad/rgyud smad du zhugs nas gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer thon te rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rje bcas kyi khrir phebs/dgung lo zhe brgyad pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu 'brug (1772)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/khri lo bdun mthar phyin nas tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin mdzad/lo shas nas ma 'gyangs par sku gshegs kyang lo khams gsal ba ma rnyed cing/yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po mchog yongs 'dzin khri chen sku gshegs pa'i tshab tu chu stag (1782)lor gdan drangs tshul rgyal ba'i rnam thar du gsal ba ltar na de'i lo sngon ma lcags glang (1781)lor sku gshegs pa 'dra snyam/rnam thar skor gong gsal (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (pha)par shog grangs lnga yod}
khri chen ngag dbang tshul khrims|{(dga' ldan khri thog re gcig pa )tshe smon gling ho thog thu'i sku phreng dang po yin/mdo smad co ne'i yul gyi bye brag dar 'o zhes par yab chos skyabs dang yum tshul chen gnyis sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags glang (1721)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo chung dus co ne dgon chen du chos zhugs thog 'don chos spyod skor thugs 'dzin gnang/dgung lo nyer gnyis pa chu khyi ((1742)lor bod du yongs pa'i grwa rgyun gzhan dag dang mnyam du dbus su phebs/ser smad grwa tsang dang tsha rdor khang tshad du sgrigs zhugs gnang nas lo ngo bcu bdu ring gzhung chen mo'i slob gnyer mthar phyin pa gdang/dgung lo so brgyad pa sa stag (1758)lor dge bshes lha rabs pa'i grwa skor dam bca' mdzad/de nas rgyud stod du sgrigs zhugs thog gsang sngags kyi skor la slob gnyer mdzad/dgung lo so dgu par rgyud pa'i dge bskos gnang/dgung lo bzhi bcu pa lcags 'brug (176)lor bla ma dbu mdzad dang/de'i phyi lo nas bla ma dbu mdzad dang mkhan po zung 'brel gnang/dgung lo zhe gnyis pa chu rta (1762)lor shar pa chos rje'i khrir phebs nas mi ring bar rgyal ba yab sras gnyis kas bka' bkod gnang ba ltar pe cin gyi tham ka bla mar phebs dgos byung/dgung lo nga bdun pa me bya (1777)lor bod kyi srid skyong de mo rin po che sku gshegs pa'i tshab tu gong ma chen lang gis bsko gzhag gnang ba ltar lha sar phebs nas bod kyi srid skyong lo ngo bcu'i bar mdzad/srid skyong gnang ba'i yi lo rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa khyi (1778)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas khri lo bdun mtha' 'khyor bar mdzad /dgung lo re drug pa me rta (17 86)lor dga' ldan khrir phebs nas khri lo bdun mtha' 'khyol bar mdzad/dgung lo re drug pa me rta (1786)lor pe cin du lcang skya rin po che rol pa'i rdo rje sku gshegs pa'i sku tshab tu phebs dgos tshul gong ma chen lung gis bka' phab pa ltar slar yang pe cin du phebs nas lo ngo drug bar bzhugs te chos srid gnyis ka'i mdzad pa rlabs chen bskyangs/de'i ring la bod du gor Shar btsan 'dzul dmag 'khrugs bslang 'go tshugs shing/bod kyi las don la 'thus shor chen po byung bar brten bka' thag nas gong ma chen lung la tshe smon gling ho thog tu bod kyi srid skyong la don mdzad rgyur gtong gnang yong ba'i snyan zhu phul ba ltar/dgung lo bdun cu pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags phyi (1790)lor bod du phebs nas srid skyong las don zla ba kha shas mdzad nas lo rjes ma'i lo 'gor gshegs/sku gdung ril por bzhugs pa'i mchod rten thog tshad longs pazhig se ra bshad sgrub gling bla brang gi shod tshongs chen du bzhugs/rnam thar rgyas pa ser smad dad pa mkhan po blo bzang thugs rjes mdzad pa/kha byang du (khri chen chos kyi rgyal po no min han sa ma ti pak+shi rin po che ngag dbang tshul khrims dpal bzang po'i skyes rabs rnam thar dad pa'i sgo 'byed )stod cha dang smad cha bsdoms pa'i le tshan bcu gsum yod pa pod gnyis yod/rnam thar bsdus pa/ser smad mkhan po grags pa mkhas grub kyis mdzad pa'i (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (ba)par shog grangs so dgu yod}
khri chen blo bzang smon lam|{(dga' ldan khri thog re gnyis pa )mdo smad rgyal rong gi yul gyi spro nang du rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa bya (1729)lor 'khrungs/'bras spungs blo gsal gling rgyal rong khang tshan du chos zhugs dang slob gnyer mdzad/dgung grangs nga bdun pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing 'brug (1784)lor rgyal rtse chos rje dang/de'i phyi lo dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas khri lo bdun bskyangs/sku gshegs pa'i lo grangs dang po lo khams ma rnyed/rnam thar skor gong gsal (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (ma)par shog grangs lnga yod}
khri chen blo bzang mkhas mchog|{(dga' ldan khri thog re gsum pa )'phan yul sbas grong du rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me 'brug (1736)lor 'khrungs/ser smad grwa tshang dang tsha rdor khang tshan du chos bzhugs dang slob gnyer mdzad/dgung lo nga brgyad pa rang byung bcu gsum pa'i chu byi (1792)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs kyang zla ba drug song nas sku gshegs shing/sku tshab tu slar yang khri chen blo bzang smon lam gyis lo gcig lhag tsam bskyangs/rnam thar mdor bsdus shig gong gsal (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (tsa)par shog grangs lnga yod}
khri chen blo bzang bkra shis|{(dga' ldan khri thog re bzhi pa )khams khul tre hor brag 'go dgon nye 'dabs su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa lug (1793)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo nye shu pa sa stag (1758)lor dbus su phebs/ser byes grwa tsang dang tre hor khang tshan du chos zhugs gnang ste gzhung chen mo'i slob gnyer mthar phyin/dgung lo so gsum pa lcags yos (1771)lor gling bsre'i dge bshes mdzad/de'i phyi rol rgyud smad du bzhugs nas lo shas ring gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer mdzad/dgung lo zhe bdun pa shing sbrul (1785)lor rgyud smad mkhan po'i khrir phebs/dgung lo zhe dgu pa me lug (1787)lor byang rtse chos rje'i khrir phebs/dgung lo nga drug pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing stag (1794)lor dga' ldan khrir phebs/khri lo bdun gtsang nas dgung lo re gsum pa lcags bya (1801)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar mdor bsdus shig /gong gsal (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (tsha)par shog grangs lnga yod}
khri chen dge 'dun tshul khrims|{(dga' ldan khri thog re lnga pa )mdo khams rgyal thang gi nye 'dabs yang thang zhes par bar byung bcu pa'i shing byi (1744)lor 'khrungs/dgu lo nyer lnga pa sa byi (1768)lor dbus su phebs/ser smad grwa tshang spom 'bor khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad nas gzhung bka' pod lngar slob gnyer mthar phyin gnang/dgung lo bzhi bcu pa chu yos (1783)lor dge bshes lha rams pa thon/lo der rgyud stod du zhugs nas gsang sngags la sbyangs pa mdzad/dgung lo zhe dug pa chu byi (1792)lor rgyud stod bla ma dbu mdzad dang/de'i phyi rol mkhan po'i khrir phebs/dgung lo nga gcig pa shing stag (1794)los sa gnas srid gzhung gis pe cin du g.yung o dgon pa'i mkhan por bskos pa ltar phebs dgos byung/dgung lo nga brgyad pa lcags bya (1801)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/khri lo bdun bskyangs nas dgu lo ri bzhi pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me yos (1807)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar mdor bsdus shig /gong gsal (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar le tshan )(dza)phyogs bsgrigs shog grangs brgyad yod}
khri chen ngag dbang snyan grags|{(dga' ldan khri thog re drug pa )mdo smad bya khyung khul du khri chen ngag dbang chos grags kyi sku nye'i rigs su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me stag (1746)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu par bya khyung dgon pa'i chos sgor zhugs/dgung lo bco brgyad pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu lug (1763)lor dbus su phebs/ser byes bsam lo khang tshan du chos zhugs thog grwa tshang chos mdzad gyi go nags bzhes pas sku phreng rjes ma rnams la gzigs khang chos mdzad sprul sku zhes zhu srol byung/gzhung chen mo'i ba gnyer thon nas dgung lo so gnyis pa me bya (1777)lor dge bshes lha rabs pa gnang/de nas rgyud smad du phebs te gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer gnang/dgung lo so drug pa lcags glang (1781)lor rgyud smad kyi dge bskos gnang/dgung lo zhe gcig pa me rta (1786)lor rgyud smad gyi bla ma dbu mdzad dang/dgung lo zhe bdun pa chu byi (1792)lor rgyud smad mkhan po dang/dgung lo nga brgyad pa chu phag (1803) lor byang rtse chos rjes bcas kyi khrir phebs/dgung lo re gnyis pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me yos (1807)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/dgung lo re drug pa lcags lug (1811)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng dgu pa lung rtogs rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin du phebs/de rjes sku phreng bcu pa tshul khrims rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin kyang gnang/mdo gas kyi chos rgyun gsan rgya dang phyag bzhes nyams myong phun sum tshogs pa'i thog /chos 'a chad spel rgyun mi chad par gnang bas slob ma yang grags las 'das/dgung lo don dgu pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing bya (1825)lor sku gshegs/de rjes sku phreng 'ga' zhig phebs tshod 'dug kyang lo rgyud dpyad gzhi ma rnyed/rnam thar skor gong gsal (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (wa)par shog grangs bzhi yod}
khri chen 'jam dbyangs smon lam|{(dga' ldan khri thog re bdun pa )mdo khams mu li'i yul du rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags rta (1750)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu bdun pa me khyi (1766)lor dbus su phebs nas 'bras spungs spom 'bor khang tshan du chos zhugs thog gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer mthar phyin par mdzad de dge bshes lha rabs pa thon/rgyud rgyud grwa tshang du gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer gnang ste/rim bzhin bla ma dgu mdzad dang mkhan po'i khrir phebs/mkhan po'i mdzad sgo rnams mthar phyin par sgrub rjes sa gnas srid gzhung gis bka' phab pa ltar pe cin du phebs nas chos 'a chad nyan sogs kyi mdzad pa mang pos lo shas bzhugs dgos byung de rjes bod du phebs nas shar rtse chos rje'i khrir phebs/dgung lo re lnga pa shing khyi (1814)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs kyang zla ba gsum las ma bzhugs par sku gshegs/rnam thar skor gong gsal (dga' ldan khri chen rim byon gyi rnam thar )phyogs bsgrigs le tshan (zha)par shog grangs bcu yod}
khri chen blo bzang dge legs|{(dga' ldan khri thog re brgyad pa )'phan po rgyal lha khang gi nye 'dabs tshong 'dus phyug po zhes pa'i khyim du yab bsod nams lhun grub dang/yum lha mo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me glang (1757)lor 'khrungs/byis pa chung ngu'i dus nas na mnyam gzhan dang mi 'dra bar sku spyod bzang bar brten/bla ma so gsar ba zhes pa'i skye bar ngos 'dzin byed pa'ang byung/se rar phebs nas smad grwa tshang gi tsha pha khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad/tsha ba dge bshes byams pa legs ldan sogs dge rgad du bsten nas gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer mthar phyin pa mdzad/dug lo so gnyis pa sa sprel (1788)lor dge bshes lha rabs pa'i mtshan btags bzhes/de nas lo shas rgyud grwar bzhugs te gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer mthar phyin nas sngags rams pa'i grwa skor dam bca' dang rgyud pa'i bla ma dbu mdzad bcas rim pa bzhin mdzad/dgung lo zhi dgu pa shing glang (1805)lor rgyud smad mkhan po'i khrir phebs/cho sa 'chad nyan sogs gong 'phel thog /'phan po sgrub rgya'i zhogs chos thog gi rgyud khang nyams gso dang dad ldan khag la chos bka' rgya tsher slar bzhin par mkhas po'i lo dus gtsang mar 'khyol bar mdzad/dgung lo nga gnyis pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa 'brug (1808)lor byang rtse chos rje'i khrir phabs nas lo ngo bzhi'i bar bskyangs/dgung lo nga brgyad pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing khyi (1814)lor khri chen 'jam dbyangs smon lam dga' ldan khri la phebs nas zla ba gsum las ma song bar sku gshags par brten rje 'di dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/lo ngo gnyis song tsam nas sku gzugs bsnyun gzhi je yod du phebs nas/dgung lo drug cu pa rab byung gong gsal gyi me byi (1816)lor sku gshegs/zhal chems ltar sku gdung dga' ldan du gdan drangs nas bya gtor zhus/sku rus la sa ts+tsha btab pa rnams bzhugs su gsol ba'i sa 'bum zhig nyan bran phu'i 'jog po ri khrod kyi nye 'dabs su yod/sku phreng rjes ma rim par phebs pa rnams la tsha ba khri sprul gnyis pa ngag dbang 'jam dpal tshul khrims kyis mdzad pa kha byang du (rje btsun bla ma dam pa khri chen rdo rje 'chang blo bzang dge legs dpal bzang po'i rnam par thar pa dad pa'i pad+ma 'dzum byed ngo mtshar nyin byed gsar ba'i snang ba )zhes pa dpar ma la shog grangs nyi shu yod}
khri chen byang chub chos 'phel|{dga' ldan khri thog re dgu pa )yongs 'dzin khri chen byang rin po che'i sku phreng dang po yin/mdo khams cha phreng gi yul du rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me byi (1756)lor 'khrungs /dgung lo chung dus lo shas ring cha phreng dgon du zhugs 'don chos spyod kyi thugs 'dzin legs par grub/dgung lo nyer gcig pa me sprel (1776)lor grwa rgyun dang mnyam du dbus su phebs/dga' ldan shar rtse rdo khang khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad/dge bshes chos 'phel rgyal mtshan dge rgan du bsten nas gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer dang/gsang sngags kyi cha ga phyag bzhes rnams byang chub par mdzad/gdong gral gsum bzang ba'i gral du yang lo shas bzhugs/dgung lo so gsum pa sa sprel (1788)lor dge bshes gling bsre'i mtshan btags bzhes/dgung lo so bdun pa chu byi (1792)lor dge bshes lha rabs pa'i mtshan btags bzhes/lo de'i ston kha'i chos thog skabs rgyud stod du zhugs nas lo ngo bdun par gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer dang/bla ma dge ba'i bshes gnyen mang po las mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mtha' yas pa gnas/dgung lo zhe bzhi pa sa lug (1799)lor rgyud stod bla ma dbu mdzad kyi khrir phebs/skabs der bla ma dbu mdzad sgrub khang rin po che dang/rgyud pa'i dge 'dun bgres pa rnams dang lhan rgyas thengs mang gros bsdur mdzad pa'i rmang gzhi'i thog /da yod sgrig yig chen mo gtan 'bebs gnang/dgung lo nga lnga pa lcags rta (1810)lor shar pa chos rjes khrir phebs/de'i phyi lo tA la'i bla ma sku phreng dug pa long rtogs rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin du phebs/dgung lo drug cu pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing phag (1815)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas khri lo bdun bskyangs/dgung lo re drug pa chu rta (1822)lor rgyal ba'i yongs 'dzin gyi 'gan bzhes dgongs zhu gnang ste chu bzang ri khrod du zur bzhugs thog sngar bzhin dad 'dus slob ma mang po dang dgon sde khag la mdo sngags kyi chos bka' rgya cher spel bar mdzad/dgung lo rgya gsum pa rab byung bcu bzhi'i sa khyi (1838)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs/sku phreng gnyis pa dga' ldan khri thog gya lnga pa blo bzang tshul khrims dpal ldan (gsham du gsal )sku phreng sum pa yongs 'dzin khri byang rin po che blo bzang ye shes bstan yongs rgya mtsho dpal bzang po'o/_/rnam thar skor ser smad kong po rgyal dbang chos rje 'phrin las rnam rgyal gyis mdzad pa/kha byang du ('jam mgon rgyal ba gnyis pa'i rgyal tshab dpal ldan bla ma dam pa khyab bdag khri chen byang chab chos 'phel dpal bzang po'i rnam thar dga' ldan bap+satan pa'i mdzes rgyan )dpar ma la shog grangs brgya dang nyer gnyis yod}
khri chen ngag dbang chos 'phel|{(dga' ldan khri thog bdun cu pa yongs 'dzin stag rag rin po che'i sku phreng dang po yin/lha sa'i byang rgyud 'dam khul mar rkyang du rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags 'brug (1760)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu gsum pa chu 'brug (1772)lor 'bras spungs sgong mang har gdong khang tshan du chos zhugs gnang/dgung lo bco lnga pa shing rta (1774)lor gtsang pa mkhan chen ye shes dpal 'byor gyi drung nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyi shu pa sa phag (1779)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i drung nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo so bdun pa me 'brug (1796)lor dge bshes lha rabs pa'i grwa skor dam bca' gnang/lo der rgyud smad du zhugs nas gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer mthar phyin pa mdzad/sngags rabs pa'i mtshan btags dang/dge bskos bcas rim bzhin mdzad/dgung lo zhe brgyad pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me yos (1870)lor rgyud smad bla ma dbu mdzad kyi khrir phebs thog man po yang chabs cig tu mdzad/kun bde gling ho thog thu'i yongs 'dzin gnang/dgu lo ra gsum rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu rta (1822)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo drug pa la tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu pa tshul khrims rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin du phebs/dgung lo re brgyad pa me phag (1827)lor stag lung brag ri khrod phyag btab /rgyud smad mkhan po gnang ba nas bzung sku tsha'i ring mdo sngags kyi chos bka' mang po 'chad spel gan nga/gsung rtsom skor/(gsang ba 'dus pa'i rgyud 'grel lde mig )sogs pod gcig yod/dgung lo brgyad cu pa sa phag (1839)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar skor rje nyid kyi rang rtsom kha byung du (dga' ldan khri thog bdun cu pa ngag dbang chos 'phel gyi rang gi spyod tshul 'ga' zhig brjod pa dge ldan ring lugs rgyas byed )dpar ma la shog grangs go gsum yod pa dam pa de'i gsung 'bum du bzhugs}
khri chen ye shes thar 'dod|{(dga' ldan khri thog don gcig pa )kong po 'bru la khul du rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me byi (1756)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu bzhi pa sa glang (1769)lor lha sar phebs/ser smad grwa tshang dang ko po khang tshan du chos zhugs gnang ste gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer mthar phyin pa mdzad/dgung lo so lnga pa lcags khyi (1790)lor dge bshes lha rams pa'i grwa skor gnang/lo de'i dgung thog tu rgyud stod du zhugs/lo shas ring gsang sngags kyi gzhung dang/lag len dbang khrid la sogs pa byang chub par mdzad/dgu lo zhi gnyis pa me sprul (1797)lor rgyud stod bla ma dbu mdzad kyi khri dang/de'i phyi rol rgyud stod mkhan po'i khrir phebs/dgung lo re gcig pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me byi (1816)lor shar pa chos rje'i khrir phebs/shar pa chos rje'i 'char can gyi mdzad sgo dus thog gnang ba las/kong po 'bru la dgon du rgyun bzhugs mdzad /dgung lo don gsum pa rab byung de ga'i sa byi (1828)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo gcig song mtshams su sku gshegs/rnam thar skor/dga' ldan the bo rin po che ye shes thub bstan rgya mtshos mdzad pa dpar ma la shog grangs bcu bzhi yod}
khri chen 'jam dpal tshul khrims|{(dga' ldan khri thog don gnyis pa )gtsang thob rgyal du sku 'khrungs/ser byes grwa tshang dang gtsang pa khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad/gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer mthar phyin nas rgyud smad du zhugs/rin bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rje bcas kyi khril phebs/rab byung bcu bzhi pa lcags stag (1830)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs (khri chen 'di'i skabs ser byas sba ti khang tshang gyi khongs gtogs gtsang ma mi tshan logs su thon nas phyed ser smad dang phyed ser byes grwa tshang rang 'jags thog gtsang khang tshan zur du btsugs pa yin zhes grwa bgres 'ga'i gsung rgyun la snang/) khri lo bdun gtsang rjes sku gshegs/rnam thar ngag rgyun tsam las ye shes 'khod pa mi snang}
khri chen ngag dbang 'jam dpal tshul khrims|{(dga' ldan khri thog don gsum pa )tshe smon gling ho thog thu'i sku phreng gnyis pa yin/'khrungs yul co ne mdzo gung shar zhes par yab mkhas grub rgya mtsho dang yum rin chen sgrol ma gnyis la sras bzhi yod (1 rje 'di/2 mgon po don grub/3 'jam dpal dbang phyug /4 lha khams dbang rgyal bcas yod )pa'i che ba yin/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu byi (1792)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi pa shing yos (1795)lor khri chen tshe smon gling ngag dbang tshul khrims kyi yang srid du ngos 'dzin gtan 'khel thog /gong ma chen lung la snyan zhu phul ba ltar chog mchan thob ste co ne dgon chen du gdan drangs nas khri la bkod/mtshan nyid grwa tshang gi lha rabs pa ngag dbang phun tshogs dge rgan du bsten nas yig 'bri dang/sum rtags dgon pa'i chos spyod skor/bsdus grwa bcas la slob gnyer mdzad/dgung lo bco lnga pa me stag (1806)lor dbus su gdan da rangs nas ser smad grwa tshang dang/tsha rdor khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad de gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer phul du phyin pa gnang nas dge bshes lha rabs pa ang dang po'i mtshan gnas bzhes/de nas rgyud stod grwa tshang du chos zhugs thog gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer dang/cho ga phyag bzhes/lung khrid man ngag skor gsan bsam rgya cher mdzad de rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/shar pa chos rje bcas kyi khri la phebs/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa brgyad pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa yos (1819)lor bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi gong ma ca cing la stan seng zhus pa ltar bod kyi srid skyong du bskos/de'i phyi rol gong ma ca ching gis dga' ldan shri ral thu sa ma ti pak+shi zhes pa'i cho lo sngar rgyun ltar gnang zhing srid skyong gnang nas lo bdun song rjes/dgung lo sor bzhi pa shing bya (1825)lor bzhi sde grang tshang gi nyer 'dabs shar ngos/dga' ldan khang gsar rnying pa'i sa khongs su thub bstan cos 'khor gling zhes pa'i dgon sde gtsug lag khang dang bcas pa phyag btab/de'i phyi rol gong ma ta'o kong gis rnam rgyal tshe smon gling zhes 'khod pa'i sngags brjod kyi pen gnang/de nas bzung dgos pa dang dgos bdag rin po che gnyis kar tshe smon gling zhes 'bod srol byung/dgung lo zhe drug pa me bya (1837)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas khri lo bdun mthor phyin pa bskyangs/dam pa 'dis srid skyong gnang ring chos srid gnyis pa'i las don bcun 'doms che ba dang/khrims 'gal rigs mtho dman su zhig yin rung nag nyes che chung la gzhigs pa'i khrims chad nan po gnang ba ma zad/snga rjes su bod sdom am ban 'un ken {(WP:1,194)}dang/sum h+phing{(WP:1,194)}hud shan {(WP:1,194)}shin kha'o {(WP:1,194)}chin klud {(WP:1,194)}he h+phu {(WP:1,194)}bcas brgyad tsam 'byor ba rnams dang mthun sgril legs po byung yang/srid skyong gnang rjes yi lo nyi shu rtsa lnga pa chu yos (1843)lor chis hran {(WP:1,194)}an ban 'byor nas bod kyi las don tshang mar dam pa 'dir rtsis med kyis dbang shed che ba dang bcas mi mthun pa'i 'ga' zla byung zhing/phyogs mtshungs bkra shis lhun po'i bla brang gi skyabs dbyings sman ri ba blo bzang sbyin pa dang paN chen rin po che'i yum sku zhabs sogs zhabs 'bring mtho gras khag gcig dang/sa gnas srid gzhung gi dpon rigs mtho 'bring khag gcig bcas tshang ma ngan mthun gyis chis hran am ban brgyud gong ma ta'o kong la (srid skyong no min han gyi nag khra )zhes ba'i ma nyes kha g.yogs kyi snyan zhu phul bar brten dgung lo nga gsum pa shing sbrul (1845)lor gong mas bka' pham pa ltar srid skyong gi khri las phabs te he lung tsang zhing chen du rgyang 'bud thog btson 'jug do dam 'og bzhag ste phyin chad yang srid rtsad gcod mi chog pa bcas kyi khyab bsgrags kyang byas/(srid skyong ri po che tshe smon gling nas 'dzin bzung do dam byas rjes ser smad kyi zing 'khrugs zer ba byung zhing /'di skor bshad gzhi che bas 'dir ma bris shing/'brel yod yig cha gzhan du gzigs/) lo shas song rjes co ne dgon chen gyi las sne dang/grwa dmangs/yul sde bcas nas gong mar snyan zhu yang yang phul ba ltar/rang yul gyi dgon pa bzhugs chog 'i chog mchan thob pa bzhin sku tshe'i smad du co ne dgon chen du bzhugs nas mdo smad phyogs kyi dgon khag mang por mdo sngags kyi chos 'chad spel gnang thub pa byung/dgung lo dun gcig pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu khyi (1862)lor sog yul thor god khul du gdan zhu byung ba ltar phebs nas chos 'chad spel 'ga' zhig gnang rjes sku gshegs/'di skor rnam thar lo rgyus yig char 'khod pa de sngon med pa'i thog phyis su bris pa ri zung kyang sgro btags 'khyog bshad mang stabs dpyad gzhir bya 'os ma mchis pas 'dir ma bris shing /gong 'phros kyi lo rgyus rnams dga' ldan khri thog rgya bdun pa tshe smon gling sku phreng gsum pa'i lo rgyun thog gsal}
khri chen blo bzang lhun grub|{(dga' ldan khri thog don bzhi pa )rgyal rong co ne'i yul du rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags (1781)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu drug pa me sbrul (1797)lor grwa rgyun dang mnyam du dbus su phebs/ser smad grwa tshang dang/rgyal rong khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad de/gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer thon nas/dgung lo so gsum pa shing khyi (1814)lor dgung kha'i dge bshes gling bsre gnang/dgung lo so drug pa me byi (1816)lor dge bshes lha rams pa'i grwa skor dam bca' mig dper 'od pa mdzad/de lo'i dbyar thog rgyud smad du zhugs nas lo bcu'i ring gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer gnang/dgu lo zhe drug pa me khyi (18260lor rgyud smad bla ma bdu mdzad dang/dgung lo zhe dbu pa sa glang (1829)lor rgyud smad mkhan po/dgung lo nga bdun pa me bya (1836)lor byang rtse chos rje bcas kyi khrir phebs/dgung lo re gsum pa cha yos (1843)lor dga' ldan khrir phebs/de'i phyi rol tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gcig pa mkhas grub rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin du phebs/dga' ldan khri pa'i khri lo bzhi bskyangs/dgung grangs re drug pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me lug (1847)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar mdor bsdus shig /dam pa de'i zhal slob rgyal rong dge bshes ('di'i mtshan brjed 'dug )shig gis mdzad pa dpar ma la shog grangs re dgu yod}
khri chen gling sprul ngag dbang lung rtogs yon tan rgya mtsho|{(dga' ldan khri thog don lnga pa )yongs 'dzin gling rin po che'i sku phreng yin par grags /mdo smad gling yul du 'khrungs/'bras spungs blo gsal gling du gzhung chen mor sbyangs pa mdzad de dge bshes lha rams pa'i grwa skor gnang/rgyud stod du zhugs nas gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer rnams byang chub pa gnang ste/rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/shar pa chos rje bcas brgyud rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me lug (1847)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas khri lo bdun bskyangs/'di'i ring tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gcig pa mkhas grub rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin kyang mdzad de khri pa'i lo dus gtsang rjes ring por ma lon par sku gshegs/rnam thar lo rgyus zhib gsal ma rnyed}
khri chen mkhyen rab dbang phyug|{(dga' ldan khri thog drug drug pa )sde drug ho thog thu'i sku phreng dang po yin/'khrungs yul rgyal rong yin cing/'khrungs lo gsal ba ma rnyed/sku gzhon nu'i dus su 'bras spungs blo gsal gling rgyal rol khang tshan du chos zhugs thog gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer legs par grub nas dge bshes lha rams pa'i mtshan btags dang de nas rgyud smad du zhugs te gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer dang gsan bzhes rgya cher mdzad/rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mgon po/byang rtse chos rje bcas kyi khrir phebs/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu glang (1853)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs te khri lo bdun ring gi mdzad sgo rnams legs par grub nas zur bzhugs gnang mus su tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gnyis pa 'phrin las rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin du phebs/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing byi (1864)lor yongs 'dzin khri zur mkhyen rab dbang phyug la gnas skabs ring srid skyong gi las don gnang rgyu'i skor sogs bod bzhugs an ban gyis thag gcod byas thog /gong ma thung khri {(WP:1,194)}la snyan zhu phul ba bzhin rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing glang (1865)lor srid skyong ngo ma'i cho lo dang sbrags bsko gzhag gnang don ltar lo bdun ring srid skyong gnang zhing lo ngo drug song ba'i lcags lug (1871)lor/spyi khyab mkhan po dpal ldan don grub dang bshad sgra bka' blon tshe ring dbang phyug mnyam 'brel thog bslangs pa'i dga' ldan zing 'khrungs zer ba byung/der sa gnas srid gzhung gi drag gnon byas rjes/de'i phyi rol srid skyong sde drug rin po che nyid kyang sku gshegs/de rjes sku phreng rim par byung ba sde drug ho thog thu zhu ba de yin/khri chen 'di'i lo rgyus skor/'brel yod bla ma khag gi rnam thar nas zur tsam las mi gsal zhing/de min lo rgyus yig chag gzhan dag ma rnyed}
khri chen tshul khrims dar rgyas|{(dga' ldan khri thog don bdun pa )spom 'bor gyi sa khul du 'khrungs/gdan sa khang du chos zhugs mdzad min dang/'khrungs lo ma rnyed/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa lug (1859)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo ngo gsum song mtshams su sku gshegs/rnam thar zur 'khod rigs med}
khri chen 'jam dbyangs dam chos|{(dga' ldan khri thog don brgyad pa )khams rgyal mo rung du 'khrungs/'bras spungs blo gsal gling du chos zhugs mdzad/dge bshes lha rams pa thon nas rgyud smad du zhugs te rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rjes bcas rim par brgyud de rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags bya (1861)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/khri lo bdun bskyangs nas gshegs/rnam thar zur du med}
khri chen blo bzang sbyin pa|{(dga' ldan khri thog don dgu pa )'ba' thang khul snang bzang du 'khrungs/dga' ldan shar rtse phu khang khang tshan du sgrigs zhugs mdzad de/gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer gnang rjes rjes su rgyud stod du zhugs/rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad nas bzung shar rtse chos rje bar gyi khrir phebs/rab byung bco lnga pa'i me yos (1867)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo bzhi bskyangs rjes sku gshegs/rnam thar zur du mi snang}
khri chen grags pa don grub|{(dga' ldan khri thog brgyad cu pa )a mdo'i yul du 'khrungs/'bras spungs sgo mang bsam blo khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad de gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer mthar phyin nas rgyud smad du zhugs/gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer dang mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mtha' yas pa gsan bzhes mdzad /rim bzhin rgyud smad bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rje bcas kyi khrir phebs/rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags rta (187)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas/khri lo bdun bskyangs shing/de'i ring tA la'i bla ma spu phreng bcu gnyis pa 'phrin las rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin kyang mdzad/skabs der spyi khyab mkhan po dpal ldan don grub rjes 'brangs bcas srid skyong sde drug rin po cher ngo rgol gyi gzhung gis dga' ldan du dmag dpung btang ste drang gnon dang tshar gcod byas stabs/khri rin po che srid skyong sde drug rin po che dang sa gnas srid gzhung la phyogs mang po'i rgyu mtshan gsal bshad gnang bar brten byed gte re zung la khrims gcod dang/de byings tshang ma gu yangs thag gcod kyi lding 'jags legs po byung/de min gyi lo rgyus zhib gsal ma rnyed cing/rnam thar yang zur du mi snang}
khri chen ngag dbang nor bu|{(dga' ldan khri thog gya gcig pa )mdo smad zung ju'i khul du 'khrungs/'pho ba grong 'jug gnang ba'i sprul sku yin tshul (dga' ldan gser kong rin po che ngag dbang tshul khrims don ldan gyi rnam thar )nang gsal/dgung lo chung dus zung ju ser po dgon dga' ldan chos gling du chos zhugs mdzad/dbus su phebs nas 'bras spungs sgo mang zur ju khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad/gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer mthar phyin nas dge bshes lha rabs pa'i mtshan btags bzhes/de nas rgyud stod grwa tshang du zhugs nas gnang sngags kyi slob gnyer dang chabs cig mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mtha' yas pa gsan bzhes mdzad/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags sprel (1660)lor rgyud stod bla ma dbu mdzad kyi khrir phebs shing/mi ring bar mkhan po yang mdzad/rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags 'brug (1880)lor sku gshegs/de rjes sku phreng gnyis tsam phebs tshod la khri ngag dbang nor bu zhes zhu gsol 'dug /khri chen de'i rnam thar (rje btsun khri chen ngag dbang nor bu'i rnam thar srid zhi'i legs tshogs gter mdzod )dbyangs can dgyes rol rdo rjes mdzad pa dpe ring bris ma shog grangs so drug yod pa zhig bla brang bkra shis 'khyil gyi dpe mdzod khang nang bzhugs kyang zhib cha blta long ma byung lags}
khri chen ye shes chos 'phel|{(dga' ldan khri thog gya gnyis pa )dar rtse mdor 'khrungs/'bras spungs blo gsal gling rgyal rong khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad/gzhung chen por thos bsam legs par grub nas dge bshes lha rabs pa dang/de nas rgyud smad du zhugs te bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rje bcas kyi khrir phebs/rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags 'brug (1880)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs te khri lo bdun bskyangs/rnam thar zur du mi snang}
khri chen byang chub nam mkha'|{(dga' ldan khri thog gya gsum )rgyal rong gi yul du 'khrungs/dbus su byon nas ser smad grwa tshang rgyal rong khang tshan du chos zhugs thog gzhung chen po lngar slob gnyer mdzad nas dge bshes lha rams pa thon/de nas rgyud smad du zhugs nas gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer dang gsan bzhes rgya tsher mdzad de shar rtse chos rje bcas kyi khri la phebs rab byung bco lnga pa'i me khyi (1886)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas khri lo bskyangs mus su sku gshegs/rnam thar zur du mi snang}
khri chen blo bzang tshul khrims|{(dga' ldan khri thog gya bzhi pa )rgyal rong cog rtse'i khul du 'khrungs/dbus su byon nas ser smad grwa tshang rgyal rong khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad de gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer mthar phyin nas dge bshes lha rabs pa'i mtshan btags bzhes/de nas rgyud smad du zhugs te gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer dang gsan bzhes legs par grub te rim bzhin rgyud smad bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rjes bcas kyi khri la phebs/rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags stag (1890)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs te khri lo bdun bskyangs/rnam thar zur 'khod mi snang}
khri chen tshul khrims dpal ldan|{(dga' ldan khri thog gya lnga pa )yongs 'dzin khri byang rin po che'i sku phreng gnyis pa yin/stod lung rag skor du rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa phag (1839)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo chung dus sku gong ma'i yang sprul du gsal ba'i mtshan rtags nges rnyed byung ba'i ngos 'dzin zhus/dga' ldan shar rtse rdo khang khang tshan du chos zhugs thog /grwa rkyang dkyus ma dang 'dra ba'i slob sbyong dang sgrig srol dang len gdan ste gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer legs par mdzad de dge bshes kyi mtshan rtags bzhes/de nas rgyud stod grwa tshang du zhugs nas gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer dang/mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mtha' yas pa gsan bzhes gnang ste/bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/shar rtse chos rje bcas kyi khrir phebs/dgung lo nga bag+r+yad pa ram byung bco lnga pa'i me sprel (1896)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/khri lo lnga'i bar bskyangs nas dgung lo re gnyis pa lcags byi (1900)lor glo bur du sku gshegs/sku phreng gum pa skyabs rje yongs 'dzin khri byang rin po che blo bzang ye shes bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho dpal bzang po rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags glang (1901)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo gya gcig pa lcags bya (1981)lor gdongs pa gzhan don du gshegs so/_/khri 'di 'di'i rnam thar zur 'khod kyi yig cha mi snang}
khri chen blo bzang rgyal mtshan|{(dga' ldan khri thog gya drug pa )yongs grags su srid skyong la mo shar zhes zhu srol yod pa de yin/gtsang thob rgyal du sku 'khrungs/ser byes grwa tshang gtsang pa khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad /gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer mthar phyin pa gnang ste dge bshes lha rams pa'i mtshan btags grub/de nas rgyud smad du zhugs nas gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer dang mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun gnas bzhes bcas chags cig tu mdzad/rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang chos rje bcas kyi khri la phebs/rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags glang (1901)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs khri lo bdun gyi bar bskyangs mus su khri lo bzhi pa shing 'brug (1904)lor dbyin ji btsan 'dzul dmag dpung lha sa'i nye 'dabs su 'byor bar brten tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa mchog mtsho sngon brgyud nas pe cin du phebs rgyu'i dgongs bzhed kyis phebs khar khri chen 'di nyid la bka' mngags dang bcas sku tshab tu bsko gzhag gnang ba bzhin lo bdun ring srid skyong gi 'gan bzhes gnang/dga' ldan khri pa'i lo dus gtsang nas zur bzhugs thog srid skyong rkyang ba'i 'ga' bzhes gnang/sku gshegs pa'i lo tshigs mi gsal zhing/rnam thar zur 'khod kyi yig cha mi snang}
khri chen ngag dbang blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{(dga' ldan khri thog gya bdun pa )tshe smon gling ho thog thu'i sku phreng gsum pa yin/mdo smad co ne rdzong gi nye 'dabs thang sgang sha zhes pa'i khyim du rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu phag (1863)lor sku 'khrungs/byis pa'i dus su na mnyam gzhan dang mi 'dra ba'i mdzad spyod ngo mtshar yod par brten co ne dgon dang/dpon rigs rnams kyis gong ma thung kri la khri chen tshe smon gling gi yang srid du ngos 'dzin chog pa'i snyan zhu phul yang don smin ma thub par dgung lo bcu drug ma slebs par du co ne dgon par grwa rkyang dkyus pa'i tshul du bzhugs dgos byung/ rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa yos (1879)lor cha kan ho thug thu byams pa mthu stobs kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis shing can du yod pa'i cang cun dang an ban gnyis brgyud nas bod kyi srid skyong gnang skabs gong ma chin po'i chab srid kyi zhabs 'degs dang bod kyi las don thog mdzad rjes chen po yod yang/an ban chis hran dang bod gzhung gi dpon ngan khag gcig gis mi bden rdzun sgrig byas te nag nyes 'di dang 'di byas kyi rgyu mtshan gang yang med par gong ma ta'o kong la dbyen sbyor zhu log phul bar brten/srid skyong gi go gnas nas phab ste he lung cang du rgyang 'bud dang/bla brang gi rgyu dngos gzhung bzhes/yang srid ngos 'dzin mi chog pa bzos pa 'di dag gong ma tshang gi chab srid thog zhabs 'dren chen po'i bya ba yin stabs/phyin chad de sngon gyi gtan 'bebs de dag skyon sel dkar 'don thog yang srid ngos 'dzin zhus te se ra dgon par chos zhugs mdzad chog pa zhes zhus par zhu don gzhan dag tshang ma don 'khyol thog /bla sprul che kha'i go gnas ma gtogs ho thog thu'i go gnas bzung mi chog ces bka' phab pa ltar/dgung lo nyer gcig tu phebs pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu lug (1883)lor co ne dgon chen nas dbus su phebs/tshogs chen sprul sku che ba'i go gnas tsam gyi thog ser smad grwa tshang tsha rdor khan tshan du chos zhugs gnang nas gzhong chen po'i ba gter mthar son te dge bshes lha rabs pa'i mtshan btags bzhes/de nas rgyud stod du zhugs nas gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer dang chabs cig bla ma mang po'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi slob gnyer gsan bzhes mdzad de/rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/shar pa chen rje bcas kyi khrir phebs (skabs de dag gi ring la mdzad spyod ngo mtshar ba'i bshad rgyud mang po 'dug kyang 'dir ma bris/) dgung lo zhe lnga pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i me lug (1907)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas khri lo bdun bskyangs/dga' ldan khri la phebs nas khri lo bdun bskyangs/dga' ldan khri la phebs pa'i lo bzhi pa lcags khyi (1910)lor lu tsi cun {(WP:1,194)}gyi dmag lha sar 'byor zhing bod rigs sa khul du dgon sde mang po gtor ba dang/bod mi grangs las 'das pa dmar gsod kyi don rkyen byung skabs/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa lha sar bzhugs bzod ma bde bar rgya gar phyogs su nyer g.yol du phebs par dam pa 'di nyid dga' ldan khri pa'i mdzad khur skyong bzhin par sku tshab tu bsko gzhag gnang ba ltar lo ngo bzhi'i ring srid skyong gi 'gan bzhes gnang/dgung lo nga gcig pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu glang (1913)lor lha sa'i rgya bod zing 'khrungs lding 'jags thog /tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa ma chog rgya gar nas bod sa gnas su phyir phebs gnang rjes rgya bod zing 'khrugs lhing 'jags skabs byas rjes che ba'i dgon sde khag dang/bla sprul/dpon rigs bcas la gzengs bstod bya dga' gnang zhing/dam pa 'di nyid la ho thog thu'i go gnas rang 'jags ba skyar gso thog /de sngon tshe smon gling dbu nyer byung skabs gzhung bzhes byas pa'i mchod gzhis khag nas nyung shas shig phyir log gsol ras gnang/dgung lo nga brgyad du phebs pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags sprel (1920)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar zur 'khod cig lo shas gong phyogs bsgrigs byas pa zhig mthong ba de'i nang/khri thog gya drug ser byes gtsang pa blo bzang rgyal mtshan dang/dam pa 'di'i mtshan 'dra mtshungs yod par 'khrul nas lo rgyus khag gnyis mnyam bsres byas 'dug pa 'dir yo bsrang byas yod cing/sku phreng bzhi pa dang lnga pa gnyis kyi lo rgyus skor gsham gsal (tsha)sde'i thad du bkod yod pa der gzigs}
khri chen mkhyen rab yon tan|{(dga' ldan khri thog gya brgyad pa )yongs grags su lcang rgyab khri chen zhu ba de yin/dbus stod 'bri gung rgyud du sku 'khrungs/lha sar phebs nas thog mar sgo mang gur rung khang tshan du sgrigs zhugs mdzad kyang/thob khungs la brten pa'i rtsod gleng byung bar 'bras spungs blo gsal gling du sgrigs zhugs mdzad dgos byung/gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer thon nas dge bshes lha rams pa gnang rjes/rgyud smad grwa tshang du chos zhugs mdzad nas gsang sngags kyi chos rgyun rgya cher gsan/rim bzhin rgyud smad bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rje bcas kyi khri la phebs/rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing stag (1914)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/snga rjes su mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang po 'chad spel mdzad/khri la phebs nas lo drug pa sa lug (1919)lor sku gshegs/zhal chems su nga'i yang srid med pas rtsad gcod ma byed ces bka' gnang ba ltar sku chas gang yod dgongs rdzogs mchod 'bul du btang zhes khri chen de dang dus thog gcig pa'i skyes ched dam pa 'ga' zhig gi zhal nas dngos su thos byung lags}
khri chen blo bzang thub bstan snyan grags|{(dga' ldan khri thog gya dgu pa )yongs grags su nyan re khri chen zhe ba de yin/brag g.yab grong re tshang du 'khrungs/dbus su phebs nas dga' ldan shar rtse'i nyag re khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad nas gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer dang dge bshes bcas mthar phyin par mdzad/rgyud stod du zhugs nas gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer dang gsan bzhes rgya cher gnang nas rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/shar rtse chos rje bcas kyi khri la phebs/rab byung co lnga pa'i sa lug (1919)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/lo gcig lha tsam song mtshams khri chen tshe smon gling dgos pa rdzogs pa mkhyen rjes lo de rang la sku gshegs/dam pa de'i yang srid dga' ldan nyag re khri sprul rin po che zhu ba zhig phebs pa kho bo grwa sar slob gnyer dang/de rjes rgyud stod du sgrigs zhugs skabs mjal myong ba rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags byi (1960)lor sku gshegs zhes kho bo pe cin krung dbyang mi rigs slob grwa yod skabs go thos byung}
khri chen byams pa chos grags|{(dga' ldan khri thog dgu bcu pa )mdo khams tre hor brag 'go khul du 'khrungs/dbus su byon nas 'bras spungs blo gsal gling tre hor khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad/gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer yang rtser son pa gnang nas dge bshes lha rams pa'i mtshan bzhes dang/de nas rgyud smad du sgrigs zhugs thog rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rje bcas kyi khri la phebs/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pas bka' mngags phebs pa ltar bal yul mchod rten 'phags pa shing kun nyams gso dang rab gnas kyi slob dpon du phebs te ngo mtshar che ba'i rtags mtshan phyi nang mi rigs kun gyi mthong chos su gyur/rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags bya (1921)lor/dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo bdun bar bskyangs/khri pa'i 'gan bzhes gnang ring mdzad sgo'i skabs khri pa'i thob thang gi chas gos dang/zhabs gras kyi rigs sogs rgyas spros med pa'i bab chags stabs bde zhig dang/rgyun du gzims khang nang bka' gdams pa'i dge ba'i bshes gnyen rnams kyi mdzad spyod grwa rkyang dkyus ma lta bur bzhugs te/zhabs zhu'i rigs kyang skabs 'phral dge phrug so sor zhal bkod gnang ba ma gtogs gsol gzims ma byan sogs kyi rnam grangs mang po'i ming 'dogs rigs gtan nas mdzad srol med pa dang/'bul dngos gang byung skabs 'phral lha khang gsar bzhengs dang/dge 'dun gyi bsnyen bkur/grwa rkyang dbul phongs rigs la zas gos kyi mthun rkyen sogs la gtong gnang mdzad pa dang/bdag 'dzin gnang ba'i dngos po gang yang gsog 'jog mi gnang yang/phyag tu byung ba'i dngos nor yod tshad chud zos gtong ba'i rigs kyang mi mdzad par rnam dkar dge ba'i phyogs su gtong gang thub mdzad pa'i khyad chos ngo mtshar ldan pa zhig yod/de sngon dga' ldan khri pa'i bla brang la bdag dbang yod na yang dam pa 'dis khri thog khang gi mchod rgyun gtong sgo phud pa'i yong 'bab lhag ma gang yod tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum par phul nas dga' ldan ston chos chen mo gsar 'dzugs kyi mthun rkyen du sbyor gnang mdzad pas slob gnyer gong 'phel gyi phan 'bras chen po thob thub pa byung/dgung lo brgyad cu gya brgyad pa la phebs pa na sku gshegs zhes yig cha 'ga' zhig nang 'khod pa dang/kho bo grwa sar sdod pa'i lo gnyis pa ste rab byung bcu drug pa'i me glang (1937)lor khri zur rin po che 'di nyid sku gshegs tshul go thos byung ba gzhir bzung nas sku 'khrungs pa'i lo ni rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags khyi (1805)lo yin par snang/rnam thar zur 'khod kyi yig cha ma mthong lags}
khri chen blo bzang rgyal mtshan|{(dga' ldan khri thog go gcig pa )mdo khams yag rar sku 'khrungs/dbus su byon nas ser byes lA ba khang tshan du chos zhugs thog gzhung chen mo'i slob gnyer mthar son nas dge bshes lha rams pa'i mtshan btags bzhes/rgyud stod du zhugs te rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/shar rtse chos rje bcas kyi khrir phebs/rab byung bcu drug pa'i me yos (1927)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas khri lo drug bskyangs te rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu sprel (1932)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar zur 'khod kyi yig cha mi snang}
khri chen thub bstan nyin byed|{(dga' ldan khri thog go gnyis pa )gtsang khul du 'khrungs/'bras spungs blo gsal gling gtsang pa khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad de dge bshes lha rams pa thon/de nas rgyud smad du zhugs te rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rje bcas kyi khri la phebs/rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu sprel (1932)lor dga' ldan gyi khril phebs rjes zla ba gsum nas gshegs/de rjes yang srid ngos 'dzin zhus par gtsang pa khri sprul zhes pa zhig kho bo grwa sar sdod skabs mjal/khri chen 'di'i rnam thar zur 'khod kyi yig cha mi gsal}
khri chen ye shes dbang ldan|{(dga' ldan khri thog go gsum pa )mdo khams mi nyag gi yul dan 'bag a mes tshang du 'khrungs/'bras spungs blo gsal gling mi nyan khang tshan du chos zhugs gnang/gzhung chen po'i slob gnyer mthar phyin nas dbe bshes lha rabs pa'i dam bcas ang dang por thon/rgyud stod du zhugs nas rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/shar rje chos rje bcas kyi khri la phebs/rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu bya (1933)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/gnod byed ma yin gdug pa can tshar gcod pa'i nus pa khyad par can mnga' tshul ngag rgyun du yod/dga' ldan gyi khri mthar phyin nas lo bzhi'i bar bzhugs te bstan rgyas gling du sku gshegs/de'i yang srid rim bzhi btsag ser khang pa'i sras su 'khrungs nas deng skabs phyi rgyal du bzhugs skad thos/khri chen 'di'i rnam thar zur 'khod yi yig cha da phan ma mthong lags}
khri chen lhun grub brtson 'grus|{(dga' ldan khri thog go bzhi pa )'khrungs sa'i yul ni rong dang g.yag sde'i mtshams kyi dkar cog spang spur gyi mi tshang zhig yin zhes gsungs pa thos/sku na chung dus shangs dga' ldan chos 'khor du sgrigs zhugs mdzad de byon nas ser byes grwa tshang gtsang pa khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad de gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer mig dper 'os pa mdzad/dge bshes lha rams pa'i mtshan btags dam bca' 'gran zla bral ba gan nga/rgyud smad grwa tshang du sgrigs zhugs gnang nas rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rje bcas kyi khri la phebs/rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags 'brug (1940)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas lo bdun bskyangs/khri chen 'di nyin gzhung chen po'i slob khrid gnang thabs la shin tu mkhas shing byang chub par brten dge bshes mtshan btags ma gnang gong nas slob ma mang por slob khrid gnang 'go tshugs te p+saku ma gshegs par gdan sa gsum gyi slob gnyer ba brgya phrag brgal bar dpyid dang dbyar dus kyi chos mtshams skabs bstun gyis sku ngal la ma 'dzems par zhogs pa snga dro'i zhal 'don grub pa nas nyi ma rgan mtshams bar slob khrid gnang gi yod pa ma zad/sku tshe'i smad du zhabs kyi bsnyun gzhi bzhes pa'i skabs su yang slob ma tshor bka' phebs la/de lta nga rang rkang pa na ba ma gtogs slob khrid byed ma thub pa med stabs nga rang gson por sdom ring khyed chos nga'i sar slob khrid hur thag zhus thub na legs/nam zhig nga rang shi rjes ma 'gyod pa yong gi red ces gsungs nas sku ma gshegs gong gi zhag gsum bzhi bar du mtshams 'jog ma mdzad par slob khrid rgyud 'khyongs gnang zhing/kho bos kyang khri chen 'di nyid kyi drung nas (lam rim chen mo )dang/(rim lnga gsal sgron )gnyis kyi slob khrid gnang ba lo ngo drug gi ring nyan rgyu'i skal bzang thob/rang byung bcu drug pa'i sa glang (1949)lor bstan rgyas gling du (spyod 'jug chen mo )bka' khrid gnang mus mjug ma rdzogs gong tsam du sku gshegs/sku gshegs kha'i zhal chems su/nga la yang srid phebs rgyu med pas khyed tshos de 'dra ma byed par/sku chas gang yod gtsang dag mchod 'bul du gtong dgos zhes bka' phebs pa ltar zhabs 'degs pa rnams kyis kyang bka' bzhin bsgrubs/khri chen dam pa 'di'i rnam thar zur 'khod med kyang kho bo mthong thos kyi yul du gyur pa rnams brjed par phangs nas mdor bsdus tsam bkod pa lags so/_}
khri chen bkra shis stong 'dus|{(dga' ldan khri thog go lnga pa )mdo khams mi nyag gi yul lhun po tshang du sku 'khrungs/'bras spungs blo gsal gling mi nyag khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad/gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer 'gran zla bra ba mdzad de dge bshes lha rabs pa ang dang po'i gnyis pa thob/rgyud stong du sgrigs zhugs mdzad nas gsang sngags kyi slob gnyer dang chabs cig dam pa mang po'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyud rgya cher gsan/rin bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/shar pa chos rje bcas kyi khril la phebs/rab byung bcu drug pa'i me phag (1947)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs nas khri lo bdun mthar phyin pa bskyangs/khri chen 'di nyid rgyun du thugs dam nyams bzhes gtsor 'don gnang bar brten grub pa'i nyams rtogs mthon por phebs pa zhig yin tshul go thos byung ba ma zad/rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa glang (1949)lo'i ston kha spom mda' tshang du g.yang sgrub zhig la rgyud pa'i las snes bkod sgrig gnang ba ltar song skabs khri chen 'di nyid rdo rje slob dpon du phebs pa dang stabs 'khel nas thog mar mjal/nyin gung gi ngal gso'i skabs chog grwa ba rnams rgyud pa'i tshogs la phebs shul dus yun chu tshod gnyis lhag tsam yod stabs de'i ring kho bos sku mdun du mjal kha zhus par thugs dgyes tshor chen po'i p+sagor nas blo dogs chod nges kyi bka' len gnang la 'khel ba phebs par dad gus tshad med skyes shing/rgyun du skabs re lha sa'i gling skor la phebs pa'i go skabs dang bstun nas kho bo'i sdod shag tu phebs te thugs mkho'i phyag dpe khag gzigs bzhin du nyin gang lhod bzhugs gnang gi yod pa de ni kho bos babaka' 'dri bka' slob zhu ba'i go skabs yag shos shig yin/dam pa de ni bka' gdams pa'i rnam thar ltar sbas pa'i tshul lta bur bzhugs pa ma gtogs/mdo sngags gang gi thad nas bka' 'dri zhus kyang nyams myong dngos kyi thog nas bka' ri zhu ba po'i dogs pa dang the tshom gang yod thad la gnad la smin pa'i bka' lan thogs pa med par gnang mkhan zhig yin/dga' ldan khri pa'i lo dus gtsang nas tshe chog gling du lo ngo bzhi'i ring thugs dam nyams bzhes gong 'phel du bzhugs mur ngo mtshar brjod las 'das pa'i rtags mtshan dngos su bstan bzhin pa'i ngang sku gshegs/khri chen dam pa 'di'i rnam thar zur du mi snang bas/rang nyid kyis dngos su mthong thos gang byung ba rnams mos gus 'phel ba'i rten du bris pa lags}
khri chen thub bstan kun dga'|{(dga' ldan khri thog go drug pa )lha sa'i nye 'khor du 'khrungs/ser byes har gdong khang tshan du chos zhugs mdzad/gzhung chen mo'i slob gnyer grub nas rgyud smad du zhugs/rim bzhin bla ma dbu mdzad dang/mkhan po/byang rtse chos rje bcas su phebs /rab byung bcu drug pa'i shing rta (1954)lor dga' ldan gyi khrir phebs/de nas rab byung bcu drug pa'i me sprel (1956)lor bod du krung go nang bstan mthun tshogs bod yan lag mthun tshogs 'dzugs skabs tshogs gtso dang dga' ldan khri pa'i mtshan bzhes chags cig mdzad de /rab byung bcu drug pa'i shing 'brug (1964)lo rab te lo bcu gcig bar bskyangs mus su sku gshegs/rnam thar lo rgyus zur du mi snang lags}
khri chen rab brtan rgya mtsho|{bla brang bkra shis 'khyil gyi khri thog bco brgyad pa yin/klu shod phyogs kyi g.yi zhes 'bod pa'i lung par rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu yos (1723)lor 'khrungs/chung dus bkra shis 'khyil du chos zhugs mdzad de/da khri rin po che blo bzang don grub kyi drung nas bsdus grwa gsan/kha dog dkar dmar gyi 'dzin grwa gong mar phebs skabs dge bskos gling don grub rgya mtshos 'dzin grwa'i skyor dpon du bskos/de nas rigs lam gyi bgro gleng bzang ba'i mig dper yos pa byung/dka' rabs 'dzin grwa thon nas kyang lo bcu bdun ring skyor dpon gnang/rdo rabs pa'i mtshan btags thon nas rgyud grwar zhugs te gnang sngags la legs par sbyangs shi nga/zhal la sman rtsis gnyis kyang slob gnyer gnang/gzhan rgyud sde khag gi dkyil 'khor bris thig nas ma chod gtor bca' bzo yan chad mthong brgyud phyag len mtha' dag zhib phra mkhyen par mdzad/dus 'khor grwa tshang gsar 'dzugs kyi chos thog gnyis par rdo rje slob dpon gyi khrir phebs/grwa tshang gsar tshugs kyi gnas tshul dang mthun pa'i skul lcag thabs la gang mkhas gnang bas 'phel rgyas legs po byung/sog yul du nyid g.yon ru tha'i ji las skyabs nas 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa 'jigs med dbang por yul phyogs der phan thogs nges kyi bla ma zhig gtong gnang yod pa zhes re skul zhus par dam pa 'di phebs dgos pa'i bka' phebs ltar de phyogs su yan nas spyi sger gyi rkyen sel rim gro dang chos 'chad spel sogs gang la gang 'os pa'i phan 'dogs 'dod pa khengs nges mdzad/lcags byi (1708)lor bkra shis 'khyil du phyir phebs mdzad/dgung lo re gcig pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu yos (1783)lor tshogs chen gyi khrir phebs/shing 'brug lor 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa mchog dbus gtsang du phebs khar dbu gdugs ser po dang 'bob lcag cha gcig gnang nas sku tshab tu bsgo gzhag mdzad/las don che chung gang 'dra zhig sgrub kyang tsha drag dang 'tshal 'tshub rigs med par thugs lhod chags pa'i sgo nas bkod sgrig 'phyugs pa med par gnang thub pa'i khyad chos chen po yod pa zhig yin/dgung lo re lnga par khri'i dgongs zhu gnang/dgung lo re brgyad pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags khyi (1790)lor gong 'pho mdzad de sku gshegs/lo rgyus skor (bkra shis 'khyil gyi gdan rabs lha'i rnga chen )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 433nas 442bar gsal}
khri chen bsod nams grags pa|{mdo smad gdan sa chen po bla brang bkra shis 'khyil gyi khri thog bcu bdun pa yin/de sngon rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa sbrul (1689)lor hal ha dang jun gar dmag 'khrug byung skabs khal kha'i mi 'ga' zhig mtsho sngon phyogs su bros byol du yong ba'i mi rgyud cig tu rab byung bcug nyis pa'i chu yos (1723)lor sku 'khrungs/chung ngu'i dus su bkra shis 'khyil gyi chos grwar zhugs/dge ba'i bshes gnyen chen po 'be ban bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho dge rgan du bsten nas bsdus grwa/blo rig /rtags rig /phar phyin bcas la legs par sbyangs/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i mchog sprul 'jigs med dbang po'i mtshan nyid bgro gleng gi zhabs phyi mdzad cing/drug yig dang/mchod g.yog gsol thab pa bcas zhabs zhu gang dang ci gos dgongs bzhed dang mthun par sgrub pa ma zad/gser dbar nam yod phyag dpe'i dge rgan dge bshes mchog la yang zhabs 'degs nam dgos sgrub par mdzad/rjes su lha sar phebs nas 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tsang du slar yang gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer mthar phyin pa gnang nas lha rams pa'i dge bshes thon/rgyud smad grwa tshang du phebs nas Tika'i skyor dpon mdzad cing/rgyud pa'i phyag bzhes cha tshang bar thugs la chud mes kyi sbyangs pa lhod med gan nga/de nas lo shar 'bras spungs dge 'phel ri khrod dang/gye re shar nub bcas la sku mtshams dam po'i thog nas gnyan khrod 'grim pa'i phyag len rtags thon par mdzad/gzhan yang paN chen rin po che dpal ldan ye shes dang/lcang skya rol pa'i rdo rje/phur lcog ngag dbang byams pa/khri chen ngag dbang mchog ldan sogs bla ma dam pa mang po'i drug nas mdo sngags kyi chos skor mtha' yas pa gsan/de nas 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i mchog sprul rin po che nas bkra shis 'khyil du phyir log phebs dgos pa'i gsung 'phrin 'byor ba ltar rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu 'brug (1772)lor bkra shis 'khyil du phebs/de yi phyi lor rgyud pa grwa tshang gi mkhan po bskos/de rjes urge grwa tshang gi bla ma mdzad/mtho dman su la yang ngo srung dang mdzes lam mi mdzad par thad kar bka' bkyon gnang ba zhig yod par grags/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa phag (1779)lor bkra shis 'khyil tshogs chen gyi khrir phebs nas slob ma rnams kyi 'dod mos dang skal bar 'tshams pa'i chos rgya cher gnang/dgung lo re bdun pa sa bya (1789)lor sku gshegs/lo rgyus skor dbal mang dkon mchog rgya mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bkra shis 'khyil gyi gdan rabs )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 422nas 433bar gsal}
khri chos skyong lde|{mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal po/khri rin chen bzang po pe cin du go gnas dang 'ja' sa zhu bar phebs pa'i lam zhor du sa skyar yun mi thung tsam bzhugs skabs thugs snang dag pa'i mdza' grogs shar pa kun dga' rin chen gyis mtshams sbyor re bskul zhus pa ltar shar pa kun dga' rin chen gyi sku zla dang 'das pa las 'khrungs zhes pa tsam las 'khrungs 'das kyi lo gnyis ka mi gsal zhing lo rgyus gzhan dag mi gsal}
khri mchog grub lde|{mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal po khri phun tshogs lde dang sa skya'i jo mo re mda' ma gnyis 'dus pa las sras gcig byung ba de yin/de nyid yum mi gcig pa'i sras bsod nams lde dang ma mthun par brten/gcung po bsod nams sde mnga' ris spu hrengs su yul thon nas phebs pa'i shul du rta bcag pas rtas bskyur nas 'das/de min lo rgyus gzhan dag mi gsal}
khri gnyan gzung btsan|{(khri snyan zung btsan zhes pa'ang snang )bod rgyal nyer dgu pa/yab lha tho tho ri gnyan btsan dang yum rno za mang dgar gyi sras su bod chu sbrul (333)lor 'khrungs skad/sras kyis rno la zhang du bos pa yis/_/zhang du rno lnga rus la der ming chags/_/de yan la zhang po la jo bo zhes 'bod skad/rgyal po 'di'i blon po dbas snang gzher lha btsan dang mgar khri 'bring gis byas/khu'i bon po mang sgra lags pas sku bon byas/rgyal po 'di'i dus bon kyi zhing sa dang 'brog sa 'brel mthun dang/mtsho dang mtshe'i yur bur 'brel sbyor byas nas de'i chu zhing kha la 'dren pa'i srol btsugs/'brong bza' mo dur yangs gzher rab 'bro bzang dung pyang bzher bya ba khab tu bzhes/khri gnyan mchad pa don mkhar mda' ru brtsigs/de yang phul med sa phung brdal pa 'dra}
khri ston|{yul gyi rgyal po dang/bla chen/dpon chen sogs khri la bkod pa'i dga' ston rten 'brel gyi mdzad sgor byas pa la zer zhing/yongs grags kha rgyun du khri dpon gnang ba zhes brjod srol yod}
khri ston brtson 'bar|{bstan pa phyi dar gyi 'go tshugs skabs dbus gtsang mi drug ces 'dul 'dzin drug byung ba'i nang tshan gtsang gi lo ston rdo rje dbang phyug la mkhan bu nyi shu rtsa bzhi tsam byung ba'i gras a mes gzhu gcig /de la mkhan bu bzhi byung ba'i gras khri ston brtson 'bar gyis gtsang stong shong snar bzung zhes pa tsam las lo rgyus gzhan mi gsal}
khri thang mgur mo|{(tshong 'dus mgur mo )de sngon dus rabs bcu pa'i dus dkyil du dbu gtsang gi mkhas pa mi bcus mdo smad du phebs nas bla chen dgongs pa rab gsal gyi slob ma brum ye shes rgyal mtshan gyi drung du dge slong zhus nas bod du phebs pa'i nang nas snga shol lo ston rdo rje dbang phyug gi 'khrungs yul gtsang gi mgur mo rab kha nas yin pas khong gis bod du phebs khar mched grogs gzhan gad rnams la khyed rnams gnas skabs bod du ma phebs par mdo smad 'dir bzhugs/ngas sngon la dbus gtsang du 'gro ba'i tshod pa rnams dang mnyam du song nas bod dbus gtsang du chos dar spel thub pa 'dug na nga yir ma log par dbus gtsang du bsdad kyi/de tsam na khyed rnams yar phebs/gal te dbus gtsang du chos dar spel byed ma nus na nga yang tshong pa dang mnyam du mdo smad 'dir phyir log yong rgyu yin gsungs nas tshong pa dang mnyam du dbus gtsang la phebs/khong rnams sum 'phrang du slebs mtshams chos pa rnams de gar tshong byas nas mdo smad du log rtsis byed skabs/lo ston gyis khyed rnams 'di nas ma ldog par gtsang du song la mgur mo rab khar slebs tshe nga'i pha lo nad tsug na zer ba zhig yod pa de la nga dbus na 'dug ces lan skyol zhes mngags te dbus gtsang du btang/tshong pa rnams kyis kyang khong gis gsungs pa ltar byas pas tshong yang legs po byung/de nas bzung gtsang gi mgur ma rab khar tshong 'dus chags pa'i ming la tshon 'dus mgur mo zer/('di sa gnas gang du yod med skor la 'ga' zhig gis deng sang bon rang skyong ljongs snye mo rdzong mar rkyang chos su yod zer/'ga' zhig gis gtsang gi zha lu dgos pa dang thag nye sar yod zer/) de sngon bod kyi gser dngul lding tshad thang zhi yang tshod 'dus mgur mo'i khrom ra'i rin thang gi tshad gzhir bzung nas chos khrims dang srid zhung gi khrims yig nang brkus pa 'jal gyi khrims yig skor bshad skabs tshong 'dus mgur mo'i gser dngul dang 'bru rigs kyi rin thang rtsi bar bshad/zhib par snga rabs bod kyi mkhas pa tshos mdzad pa'i 'dul ba'i 'grel pa dang/sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshon mdzad pa'i (khrims yig zhal lca bcu gsum )dang de'i dris lan bcas su gsal zhing/tshong 'dus mgur mo'i lo rgyus ni (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )le tshan (nya)pa'i shog grangs 5nas 6bar gsal ba'i gnad bsdus byas so/_}
khri thang dz+nyA nas bkod pa'i rnam par thar pa|{(lo tsA ba rin chen bzang po'i rnam thar )khong gi dngos slob khri thang pa dz+nya nas brtsams pa de yin/rnam thar 'di dpar slob byas pa'i dpe cha zhig phyi rgyal du 'gro skabs kho bos mthong yang bshu ma thub/(kha byang du (byang chub sems dpa' lo tsA ba rin chen bzang po'i rnam thar dka' spyad sgrol ma shes reng lu gu rgyud )ces 'khod 'dug/)}
khri thog khang|{rje tsong kha pa chen pos dga' ldan phyag btab rjes rgyun bzhugs gnang yul gyi gzims khang yin pa las rjes su dga' ldan khri pa rim byung rnams bzhugs yul der mdzad pas khri thog khang du grags/gzims khang de'i nang blos bslangs gsum bzhengs pa'i lugs phun du byon pa'i dpa' bo 'ja' tshon ma dang/tshe dpag med/rnam rgyal ma/gdugs dkar/'jam dbyangs sogs gser sku rnams sprul pa'i lha bzor grags pa sle'u chung bas bzhengs pa shin tu byon gtsang/gzhan yang li mi'i sku mang po/rje tsong kha pa rang nyid kyi rgyun gzigs yag dpe khag dang/na bza' sku chos sogs cha tshang/bzhugs 'bol/phyag dam dang bcas pa/gzigs phug 'od gsal phug gi nang/phyag rdo 'khor chen gyi blos bslangs/ldebs bris la rje'i sku brnyan 'od zer mar grags pa rnams yod cing/shar ngos kyi phyir rdo gcal chos grwa dang bcas pa yod/sngon dus khri thog khang gi mchod gzhis su mal dro'i klung shad shes ma gzhis/dga' ldan la zhol gtsang thog gzhis/mal dro rgyal bzang gzhis/lhas chu dbar gzhis/sdong po gzhis/'phan pa rta mgo gzhis/bde chen bde skyid khang gsar gzhis bcas yod pa de tsho'i yong 'bab thog nas yangs pa can gyi ma chod rgyun sogs gtong sgo khag mang po gtong dgos yod/khri thog dgu bcu pa 'bras blo gling kre bo byams pa chos grags rin po che nas dga' ldan dgon gyi dge 'dun mang po ston dus su grong gseb khag la zhing las kyi gla mir phebs te slob gnyer 'thus shor chen po 'gro ba sngon 'gog ched dga' ldan khri pa'i 'dzin khongs mchod gzhis khag rnams dga' ldan ston chos gsar 'dzugs kyi mthun rkyen du gtsang 'bul gnang ste dga' ldan ston chos chen mo gsar 'dzugs kyis slob gnyer 'phel rgyas chen po byung yod}
khri thog rje thog btsan|{(bod kyi btsan po'i rgyal rabs nyer bdun pa )btsan lnga'i nang gses khri sgra dpung btsan dang btsun mo sman bza' klu steng gnyis kyi sras yin/blon po mgar gnyan btsan ldom bu dang gnus skyes thog mong btsan gyis byas/rgyal po 'di'i ring la gling bu thog mar byung bar bshad srol yod/bon gyi chos dar spel mdzad de zhang zhung gi bon mu ha la rgyal gyis rgyal rabs gsum gyi ring sku bon byas/ru yong bza' stong rgyal mo 'tsho btsun mor blangs /rgyal po 'di'i gcung po rnung mtha' dang/snubs mtha' 'bring snya/snya 'bring rnams thang mtshams su phabs ('bangs byings las gnas babs mtho zhing rgyal po'i gdung rgyud las go gnas dma' ba ste dper na/ri dang thang gnyis kyi sa mtshams sa khul dang 'dar ba dpe la bzhag pa yin/)}
khri dar ma 'u dum btsan|{yongs grags su rgyal po glang dar ma zhes su 'bod pa/bod yongs la gcig gyur gyis dbang bsgyur ba'i btsan po'i rgyal rabs kyi rgyal po tha ma de yin/yab khri ston srong btsan sad na legs dang yul btsun mo chen mo 'bro bza' khri mo legs gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/btsan po 'di'i 'khrungs lo'i thad rgyal rabs lo rgyus khag tu bzhed pa mi 'dra ba mang ba ma zad/mang che bas khri ral pa can gcung po tha chung yin pa dang/dar ma gcen po che shos yin kyang spyod pa mi legs pa'i thog chos la brnag pa'i rkyen gyis rgyal po ma bskos par brten nas zhe nad khog bcangs byas te khre ral pa can bkrongs nas chos bsnubs pa yin zhes gsal yang (mnga' bdag myang gi chos 'byung )dang/(lde'i chos 'byung rgyas bsdus/) ka thog rig 'dzin chen po'i )bod rje lha btsan po'i gung rabs )bcas las khri rab pa can gcen yin par dang dar ma gcung yin pa'i bzhed pa de rang yang dag par mngon zhing/'khrungs long shing log yin par ka thog rig 'dzin chen pos gsungs pa ltar 'thad med ('on kyang ka thog rig 'dzin chen pos bzhes pa'i shing lug de ni rgyal po srong btsan sgam po dgung lo dug bcu go bzhin pa lcags khyi (710)lor sku gshegs pa dang/de nas lo brgya dang nyer brgyad 'das pa'i sa rta (838)lor khri srong lde btsan 'khrungs/dgung lo drug cu re brgyad pa shing glang (905)lor sku gshegs/de nas lo bco brgyad pa chu rta (922)lor khri ral pa can 'khrungs pa/de nas lo bcu bzhi pa shing lug (935)lor glang dar ma 'khrungs pa bcas yin pas thang bod dbon zhang rdo ris gi lo tshigs dang sgrig thabs med/der brten glang dar ma'i 'khrungs lo'i rang lugs kyi lo tshigs shing lug de ni 815lo de rang yin/btsan po 'di'i lo rgyus zhib rgyas (mkhas pa lde'u'i chos 'byung )dang/(mkhas pa'i dga' ston/) (bod kyi lo rgyus rags rim g.yu yi phreng ba )bcas nang gsal zhing/btsan po 'di'i lo rgyus skor la deng skabs rgyal khab phyi nang gi zhib 'jug mkhas dbang mang pos rang nyid kyi gzigs tshul 'khod pa'i ched rtsom mang po zhig 'dug pa'i nang gsung rgyu gdan don gtso bo bzhi ste/1 gling dar ma ring nyid chos la sdang ba zhig yin min/2 gling dar mas chos bsnubs zhes pa'i ngo bo gang zhig yin pa/3 chos snub dgos pa'i rgyu rkyen gang la thug pa/4 chos snub las 'gul des bod kyi spyi tshogs gong 'phel thad la phan gnon gang byung ba bcas yin cing/gal che'i don gdan de dag gi skor la kho bo ni chos srid gnyis ka'i thad nas blun mongs shes rgya ha cang dman pa zhig yin stabs 'di yin 'di min gyi kha tshon gcod pa'i spobs pa ma mchis pas mkhas dbang rnams kyis dpyad brjod yang dag shig mdzad par zhu'o/_}
khri drug 'gyogs|{seng ge dang/glang chen/rta mchog /rma bya/shang shang/gyad kyi mi rnams so/_/de yang/1 seng ge'i khri/2 glang chen gyi khri/3 rta mchog gi khri/4 rma bya'i khri/5 shang shang gi khri/6 gyad mi'i khri bcas drug go}
khri gdugs brdal ba|{1 nyi 'od kyis khyab pa/2 nyi ma shar ba}
khri 'don|{yul rgyal po dang/dpon rigs/bla ma chen po sogs khri thog tu phebs pa'i dga' ldan mdzad sgo byas pa'i ming}
khri 'don mngal gsol|{khri thog tu bton nas ming btags pa'i rten 'brel byed sgo}
khri lde|{yab smad kyi lde gsum gyi ya rgyal 'od sde la sras bzhi byung ba'i gnyis pa/'di nyid mdo khams su phebs nas mtsho sngon gyi gzhu bzung sde khri dpon mdzad/tsong kha yul chen bco bag+r+yad sogs mdo smad phal cher la mnga' mdzad pas smad du rgyal khrims lham tsam chags zhes grags/spyan snga don chen la sogs pa'i tsong kha'i rgyal rgyud rnams kyang de nas byung zhes gsungs/khri dpon de'i rgyud pa a mdo dpa' ris phyogs su yod pa las/'phan yul rang skad ma nyams pas khyi dpon du 'bod par snang zhes lo rgyus yig tshang du gsal}
khri lde mgon btsan|{yum brtan gyi rgyud pa/yab 'od po'i sras su sku 'khrungs/'od srungs kyi sras dpal 'khor btsan gshegs rjes g.yo ru'i 'bangs rnams gros byas te sras gcig gtsang nas spyan drangs sam byas pas/yum brtan rgyud kyi thugs gnag yas dogs nas dub ru nas khri lde mgon btsan spyan drangs te 'phyos kyi rje'u rnams kyis snyan g.yu ral sogs pa phyag tu phul/khong gis rgyal thabs ya rabs kyi tshul dang mthun par bskyangs pa bcas so/_}
khri lde gtsug brtan|{bod kyi btsan po'i rgyal rabs sum cu so bdun pa gzhon nu'i dus nas zhal rgyan sma ra dang bcas pa'i bgres nyams che ba zhig yod par brten mtshan la mes ag tshoms can yang zer/btsan po 'di'i 'khrungs lo 'brug yin par lo rgyus yig cha mang che ba mthun kyang lo khangs gang yin la gsum tshul mi mthun pa yod/tun hong gi yig rnyid las bshad pa ltar gzhi bzung na yab btsan me tog gnyis kyi sras su gnas brtan pa'i lugs kyi sangs rgyas 'das lo (1248)shing 'brug (704)lor 'khrungs/(thang hru'u rnying ma )las/thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ma u tshe tha'an gyi khrang an {(WP:1,194)}khri lo gsum pa chu yos (703)lor khri lde gtsug brtan btsan por bskos pa dang/de dus dgung lo bdun la slebs yod par bshad pa ltar na/gong ma u tsi tha'an gyi hrin li khri lo dang po sa khyi (698)lor 'khrungs dgos pas brtag /thog ma'i mtshan la rgyal gtsug ru zhes 'bod pa dang/'khrungs pa'i lo der yab rgyal 'dus srong 'jang yul du dmag la phebs pa dmag thog tu gshegs shing sras sku na phra ba brten yab 'dus srong gi yum dang btsan po 'di'i rmo bo yin pa 'bro bza' khri mo lod ces dbang grags ldan pa zhig byung ba des srid don bskyangs/thog ma'i lo shas nang blon 'bangs khag gcig gis ngo log byung ba rnams lhing 'jags gtong dgos byung tshul tun hong gi yig rnying nang gsal zhing/btsan po 'di dgung lo bdun la phabs pa sa bya (709)lor thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ma krung tsung {(WP:1,194)}gi cin lung {(WP:1,194)}khri lo gsum par bod nas blon chen zhang to re sogs mngags ti gong ma'i sras mo zhig slob bar rgyal sa khrang an du 'byor skabs re gong ma thang krung tsung gis skyed tshal gyi nang du gsol ston bshams te h+phu ma tu we'i go gnas yod pa'i blon po dbyang hrin ca'o dang bod kyi pho nya ba rnams phan tshun t+pathog po lo'i 'gran bsdus byas par thog mar bod la rgyal kha thob cing 'gran bsdus thems gnyis par gnyis ka mnyam kyi thob nas mtshams 'jog byas par bshad de'i phyi lo lcags khyi (710)lor gong mas yung wang gi go gnas yod pa li hrig li bya ba'i sras mo cin khrin kong jo gong ma rang gi sras mo yin pa'i tshul gyis bag mar byin pa sogs gong du kim shing kong jo zhes pa'i 'grel bshad du bkod pa ltar dang btsan po 'di'i dus su 'jang dang gnyen 'brel btsugs te ljang mo khri btsan mnar mar blangs pa sogs (thang hru'u gsar rnying )gnyis su gsal (rba bzhed )las lo khams gsal bar ma 'khod kyang rgya phrug blon po sang shi sogs mi bzhi thang gi gong ma'i drung du mngags te sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi chos dpe mang po slong du btang ba la gong mas mthing shong la gser chus bris pa'i chos dpe bam po stong gnang hwa shang mngon shes can kim hwa shang gis (dge ba bcu'i mdo/) (sher phyin rdo rje gcod pa/) (sa lu ljang pa'i mdo )bcas bskur nas btsan po khri srong lde btsan sku nar son pa dang bstun nas go rim ma nor bar 'bul bar gyis shig ces pa sogs bka' slob mang po gnang nas bod du log yong skabs de'i shul du yab khri lde gtsug brtan gshegs pa'i gnas tshul 'khod pa ltar na btsan po khri lde gtsug brtan gshegs pa'i lo der yin par mngon zhing btsan po gshegs pa'i lo ni dgung lo nga gcig pa shing rta (754)yin cing zhol ring phyi ma dang tun hong gi yig rnying las blon po 'bal ldong tshab dang lang mes gzigs gnyis kyis bkrongs zhes gsal zhing (rba bzhed )las blon po de gnyis chos la dad pa'i rkyen gyis zhang ma zhang gis nag nyes btsugs te bkrongs par bshad pa rdo ring yi ge dang mi mthun lo rgyus zhib pa (rba bzhed )dang (mkhas pa'i lde'u'i chos 'byung/) (bod kyi lo rgyus rags rim g.yu yi phreng ba )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 257nas 276bar gsal}
khri lde yum brtan|{btsan po glang dar ma'i sras ngo mo yin min la rtsod gzhi byung ba de yin/de yang lo rgyus mang che bar btsun mo chun ma'i sras 'od srungs ni lto bor gyi sras yin pa dang/btsun mo chen mas sras shig 'khrungs skad kyi rdzun byas pa der so yod stabs blon mo rnams kyis mdang skyes kyi bu la so mi yong yang yum gi bka' brtan du chug ces smras pas yum brtan zhes ming thogs pa yin tshul gcig mthun lta bur gsungs yod cing/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang gnyis ka glang dar ma'i sras ngo ma yin tshul rgyu mtshan dang bcas pa gsungs yod/'on kyang (lde'u chos 'byung )rgyas bsdus gnyis dang/(mkhas pa'i dga' ston )bcas kyi nang 'od srung la lto bor gyi sras zhes yab ma grongs gong du yum la sras chags nas ma skyes gong du yab grongs stabs lto bor gyi sras zhes brjod dgos pa'i rgyu mtshan de ltar yin pa rtsod med thog /btsun mo chen ma'i sras la lab gleng mang po yong dgos pa'i dogs gzhi zhig chags yod pa de'i rgyu mtshan gang yin skor gsung skabs lab gleng de ni 'od srungs phyogs kyis bzos pa yin par thag gcod gnang yod/rdzun shod pa la rang mkhas kyang rdzun rkub brtol ba la gzhan mkhas pas mdang skyes kyi bu chung so skyes pa zhig rang gi bu yin par rdzun bzo byed thub thabs bral ba zhig lo rgyus mkhan po 'ga' zhig gis rdzun bzo byas pa rang yin snyam pa ma zad/lto bor gyi sras yin mnyam la yab gshegs rjes su 'khrungs pa'i bar khyad zla ba dgu dang zla byed yas mas lhag yong mi srid cing/btsun mo chun ma'i sras yab gshegs skabs 'khrungs ran pa'i dus skabs khel ba dang/chen ma'i sras 'khor nas dus tshod ring po phyin med rtags thabs shes gang yod kyis phru gu rdzun bzo bya dgos pa yang yod srid pa red/rjes su srid dbang 'phrog len gyi ched du gcen su yin la ma 'chams par 'khrugs rtsom gzhi rgya chen po byung nas 'od srung phyogs gtogs la pham nyes 'khel te rtsa che'i rgyu dngos yod tshad yum brtan la thob nas gdung rgyud rnams gtsang dang mnga' ris phyogs su bros dgos pa byung ba sogs zhib par (mkhas pa lde'u'i chos 'a byung )dang/(mkhas pa'i dga' ston/) (bod kyi lo rgyus rags rim g.yu yi phreng ba (bcas su gsal}
khri lde srong btsan nam ldeng khri|{'dir (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )las khri lde srong btsan dang ldeng khri zhes pa mtshan gyi rnam grangs su gsungs/sa skya'i bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad par grags pa'i (rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )las/sad na legs lo bcu dgu bzhes pa na btsun mo lha rtse la sras ldeng khri bltams/lo bcu gsum na yab 'das shing/rgyal po der sras gcig las med/sras ldeng khri lo bcu bzhi la srid dbang bzung ba'i btsun mo rin la sras gsum dang/btsun mo chung ba gcig la sras lha rje dang lhun grub gnyis te sras lnga byung bar bshad pa ni rgyal rabs lo rgyus gzhan dag dang mi 'dra ba'i bshad tshul zur pa zhig yin thog /khungs brten sa'i yag cha 'di yin gyi gsal kha med stabs (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston (du khri lde srong btsan nam lding khri zhes mtshan gyi rnam grangs su gsungs pa rgyu mtshan che snyam/btsan po 'di la mtshan gyi rnam grangs gsum tshul gzhan dag mang po zhig 'dug kyang 'dir rang lugs ni (bka' thang )khag gi nang slob dpon chen po pad mas mtshan gsol ba mu tig btsan po/yab rgyal pos mtshan gsol ba khri lde srong btsan/blon po rnams kyis mtshan gsol ba sad la legs bcas yin tshul gsal bar 'khod pa khungs dag par ma zad/srid dbang bzung ba'i dus yun yang (thang bod dbon zhang mthun 'brel rdo ring )gi shar ngos yig phreng 42par btsan po khri lde srong btsan gyi gnas tshul bkod pa'i mjug ldog la btsan po dbon ni sku tshe gcig /rgya rje zhang na gdung rabs gsum gyi bar du bka' khon gyi gcugs pa ni ma byung zhes pa 'dir brtags na btsan po 'dis srid dbang bzung ba'i ring la thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ba gdung rabs gsum ste thang te tsung/hrun tsung/shan tsung/{(WP:1,194)}bcas kyi ring la thang bod bar dmag 'khrug gi gnas tshul byung med pa gsal por 'khod pa gzhir bzung na/btsan po 'dis srid dbang bzung ba'i dus tshod ni thang gi gong ma te tsung gi cen krung {(WP:1,194)}khri lo dang po lcags sprel (780)lo nas thang hrun tsung gi yung kren {(WP:1,194)}khri lo dang po shing bya (814)lo bar dang/thang shan tsung gi yo ha'o khri lo dang po me khyi (806)lo nas khri lo dgu pa shing rta (814)lo bar bcas pas bsdoms so sum cu so lnga bar srid dbang bzung ba ltar snang yang/zhib ta bshad na thang te tsung gi kren yon {(WP:1,194)}khri lo bcu gsum pa me glang (797)lor khri srong lde btsan gshegs pas sras mu ne btsan po rgyal sar 'khod/(kam kam chos 'byung )dang/(bde dmar gnar ma )sogs bod kyi lo rgyus yig cha khag cig ltar na mu ne btsan pos srid dbang lo gcig dang zla ba bdun bzung nas ltogs phyug lan gsum snyobs zhes pa gnyis gnang tshul dngos la de 'dra yong thabs med pas srid dbang lo bdun dang zla ba dgu bzung bar gsungs/(thang deb gsar rnying )las mu ne btsan pos srid dbang bzung rjes kyi lo gcig nas 'das par bshad pa gzhir bzung na btsan po khri lde srong btsan gyis thang te tsung gi kren yon khri lo bcu bzhi pa sa stag (798)lor da dbang bzung ba ltar bur snang zhing/de lta na btsan po 'dis khri ral pa can gyis srid dbang bzung ba'i lo shing lug (815)lo bar lo bcu bdun ring srid dbang bzung bar gsal bshad byed thub/bod kyi lo rgyus yig cha phal che ba'i nang btsan po 'di'i mdzad rjes mdor bsdus tsam las bkod med pa'i thog bkas bcas gnyis par grags pa'i yag bsgyur gyi rtsa 'dzin chen po de yang btsan po khri ral pa can gyis mdzad pa sogs nor 'khrul mang po byung yod pa yang btsan po 'di'i mtshan khri lde srong btsan dang khri rab pa can gyi mtshan khri gtsug lde btsan zhes pa phan tshun nor ba'i rkyen gyis byung ba yin/btsan po khri da srong btsan gyi mdzad rjes gtso che ba/1 yab mes kyi gtsug lag khang sngar yon rnams la nyams gso legs par mdzad pa/2 skar chung rdo rje dbyings kyi lha khang gsar bzhengs mdzad pa/3 rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta dang bod kyi lo tsA ba zung 'brel gyi thog nas chos dang rig gnas kyi gzhung mang po bod skad du bsgyur ba/4 bkas bcad gnyis par grags pa ste bod yig gi yig bsgyur rtsa 'dzin gyi yig cha (sgra sbyor bang mo gnyis pa )thog mar 'don gnang mdzad pa/5 srid dbang bzung ba'i ring thang bod gnyis kyi bar gzhi rgya che ba'i dmag 'khrug byung med pa/6 tha