khri rnam rgyal lde|{mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal po khri lha dbang rgyal mtshan dang/btsun mo lha rgyal mo gnyis la sras lcam sring gsum (1 khri rnam rgyal lde/2 khri nor lde/3 sras mo a sgrol chon gyi sgrol ma zhes bsam lding rdo rje phag mo mchog sprul rin po che'i sku phreng dang po )byung ba'i che ba de yin/rab byung bdun pa'i chu stag (1422)lor sku 'khrungs/rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi sprul par grags/chung dus nas blo gros che zhing/mda' gri mdung gsum gyi sgyu rtsal la byang chub pa/dpal rtsal snying stobs mchog tu gyur pa zhig yod cing/dgung lo bco lnga pa me 'brug (1436)lor srid dbang bzung/byang pa bdag po dang mi mthun pa'i 'gal zlar gyur te/ding ri sgang dgar khri tshang du lo shas ring bzang btson lta bur bzhugs dgos byung/mi ring bar gung thang pho brang du rang srid skyong bar phebs thub pa byung/rong pa dang sher pa sogs dgra bo mi srun pa rnams tshar bcad te mnga' zhabs su bsdus thog dpya khral lo re bzhin 'bul rgyu'i man rtsigs blangs/bo dong paN chen 'jigs med grags pa dang/gtsang smyon he ru ka sangs rgyas rgyal mtshan/mkhas grub dpal ldan sangs rgyas sogs bla mar bsten nas chos mang du zhus/mnga' ris gung thang gi chos da chen po gsar 'dzugs thog /bshad grwa dang/sngags grwa gnyis ka cha tshang yod pa dang/sku gsung thugs rten grangs las 'das pa bzhengs/dgon sde yas mas rnams la ma chod gzhes gser sbyor dang kha snon gang la gang dgos kyi re ba skong bar mdzad pa sogs mdzad rjes che/dgung lo gya gcig pa rab byung bag+r+yad pa'i chu khyi (1502)lor sku gshegs/zhib par ka thog rig 'dzin chen po tshe dbang nor bus mdzad pa'i (mnga' rim smad gung thang gi rgyal rabs/) (bod kyi lo rgyus deb ther khag lnga phyogs bsgrigs )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 124nas 129bar yod}
khri dpon|{rab byung lnga pa'i sa 'brug (1268)lor yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hu pe li {(WP:1,194)}se chen han gyis mngags pa'i gser yig pa a kon dang mi'i gling gnyis bod du 'byor nas dbus gtsang mnga' ris yongs su them dud zhib bsher byas/de nas lo ngo lnga song ba chu sprel (1262)lor gong gsal zhib bshes byas pa'i dud grangs gzhir bzung nas khro skor bcu gsum du phye nas khri skor rer khri dpon re bskos thog thu po shon wu'i si tu'u skor yon hra'o {(WP:1,194)}zer ba'i srid 'dzad do dam sa khul btsugs/khri skor bcu gsum gyi grangs 'dren rtsi tshul skor gsham gsal bod khri skor bcu gsum zhes pa'i 'grel bshad la gzigs}
khri sprul|{dga' ldan khri rin po che sku gshegs rjes 'ga' zhig la yang srid ngos 'dzin zhus yod pa de rigs la yongs grags kha rgyun du khri sprul zhes 'bod srol byung ba de'i bsdus ming ste/dga' ldan khri thog lnga pa khri chen blo gros chos skyong gi yang srid mu li skyabs mgon ni dga' ldan khri pa'i yang srid ngos 'dzin zhus pa'i thog ma de yin/de nas khri thog nye shu rtsa pa khri chen rgyal khang rtse pa dpal 'byor rgya mtsho (rgyal khang rtse khri sprul/) khri thog bco lnga pa paN chen bsod nams grangs pa (mnga' ris rin po che'i sku phreng/) khri thog zhe bzhi pa khri rgya nag pa blo gros rgya mtsho (la mo khri sprul/) khri thog zhe bdun pa khri chen yang steng pa blo bzang chos 'phel (ser smad spom 'bor khri sprul/) khri thog zhe brgyad pa khri chen don grub rgya mtsho (yongs 'dzin gling rin po che sku phreng/) khri thog zhe dgu pa khri chen blo bzang dar rgyas (ser smad gzhung pa dag pa khri sprul/) khri thog lnga bcu pa khri chen dge 'dun phun tshogs (bkra shis 'khyil gung thang rin po che sku phreng/) khri thog nga gcig pa khri chen dpal ldan grags pa ('bras spungs sgo mang hor tshang khri sprul sku phreng/) khri thog nga gnyis pa khri chen dwags po tshe 'phel (dga' ldan byang tsa khri dwags rin po che sku phreng/) khri thog nga gsum pa khri chen rgyal mtshan seng ge (gtsos khri sprul sku phreng/) khri thog nga bzhi pa khri chen ngag dbang mchog ldan (ser byes bsam blo rwa sgreng mchog sprul rin po che sku phreng/) khri thog nga lnga pa khri chen nam mkha' bzang po (mdo smad zab tsha khri sprul sku phreng/) khri thog re gcig pa khri chen ngag dbang tshul khrims (ser smad tsha rdor tshe smon gling ma chog sprul rin po che sku phreng/khri thog re gsum pa khri chen blo bzang mkhas mchog (ser smad rgyal rol khri sprul sku phreng/) khri theg re brgyad pa khri chen blo bzang dge legs (ser smad tshab khri sprul yongs grags su tsha sprul rin po cher grags/) khri thog re dgu pa khri chen byang chub chos 'phel (dga' ldan shar rtse rdo khang yongs 'dzin khri byang rin po che sku phreng/) khri thog bdun cu pa khri chen ngag dbang chos 'phel (yongs 'dzin stag gra rin po che sku phreng/) khri thog don ga pa khri chen mkhyen rab dbang phyug ('bras blo gling rgyal rong sde drug rin po che sku phreng/) khri thog gya gcig pa khri chen ngag dbang nor bu ('bras sgo mang zur ju khri ngag dbang nor bu sku phreng/) khri thog go gnyis pa khri chen thub bstan nyid byed ('bras blo gling gtsang pa khri sprul sku phreng/) khri thog go gsum pa ye shes dbang ldan 'bras blo gling mi nyag khri sprul bcas so/_}
khri sprul blo bzang rgyal mtshan seng ge|{dga' ldan khri thog nga gsum pa r+khi chen rgyal mtshan seng ge'i sprul sku yin/khrom thog gi yul du yab lcags po byams kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me glang 1757)lor sku 'khrungs/chung ngu'i dus nas sngon gnas rjes dran gyi mdzad spyod khyad par can gsal bas khri chen rgyal mtshan seng ge'i yang srid du ngos bzung/dgung lo bdun pa chu lug (1763)lor gtsos dgon pa dga' ldan bshad sgrub gling du gong ma'i khrir bkod/stag tshang lha mo'i dpon slob mkhas grub rgya mtsho'i drung nas dge tshal gyi sdom pa bzhes/gung chen po lnga'i mtshan nyid rig pa gsan bzhes kyi zhabs phyi 'ur du btsugs nas bsdus grwa slob gnyer gnang zhing/zhar la sum rtags dang/skar rtsis/snyan ngag /sgra rig pa bcas la sbyangs pa mdzad/paN chen rin po che dpal ye shes pe cin du phebs pa'i lam bar du mjal te dge slong gi sdom pa zhus/dgung lo nyer drug pa chu stag (1782)lor dbus su phebs nas tA la'i bla ma rin po che 'jam dpal rgya mtsho dang tshe smon gling khri chen ngag dbang tshul khris kyis srid dbang skyong gdan mdzad pa dang stabs khel bas mjal phrad mdzad rjes 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang du chos zhugs gnang nas gzhung chen po lngar ba gnyer yun ring gnang zhing/gseng bar nang yung la yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan dang/klong rdol zla ba rin po che /brag ti rgyal mtsho mtha' yas/nyi thang ngag dbang don grub/shar rtse mkhan chen blo bzang rgya mtsho sogs bla ma dge bshes mang po'i drung nas mdo gas kyi chos bka' mang po gsan pa bcas lo nyi shu rtsa lnga'i bar bzhugs/dgung lo nga drug pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu sprel (1812)lor rang yul mdo smad du phebs khar tA la'i bla ma rin po che sku phreng dgu pa lung rtogs rgya mtshos e rti ne paN+Di ta zhes pa'i cho lo dang las tshan gyi gzengs bstod gnang/rang yul gyi dgon par phebs rjes chos 'chad nyan dang/sgrig lam gyi rting bskul sogs gang la gang 'tshams pa'i thabs mkhas kyi sgo nas skyong bar mdzad pas phan 'bras chen po byung ste slob ma mkhas pa mang du thon/mdo smad lho rgyud kyi gdon