khri phun tshogs lde|{mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal po bkra shis sde dang bdag mo bsod nams 'bum gyi sras su rab byung drug pa'i sa stag (1338)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo nar son nas srid dbang bzung/byang pa tA dben gyi sras mo nam mkha' bum btsun mor blangs/lo kha shes srid dbang skyong mus su byang pa tA dben gyis rgyal po dang btsun mo'i bar dbyen sbyor byung bar brten/zhang po sna tshogs pa smon lam rgyal mtshan gyis dgung lo so gsum pa rab byung drug pa'i lcags khyi (1370)lor lkog tu bkrongs}
