khri gtsug lde btsan ral pa can|{bod kyi btsan po'i rgyal rabs zhe gcig pa btsan po khri lde srong btsan dang btsun mo che ba 'bro bzang khri mo legs kyi sras su gnas brten sde pa'i lugs kyi 'das lo chig stong bzhi brgya lnga bcu pa me khyi (866)lor 'khrungs/mtshan ni khri gtsug lde btsan dang/bla dwags kyi mtshan la ral pa can zer/dgung lo bcu la slebs pa'i shing lug (875)nas lo nyi shu rtsa bdun nam rtsa bzhi srid dbang bzung ring yab mes gong ma'i dus dang mi 'dra ba'i chos srid gnyis ka'i thog nas mdzad rjes gsar pa khag gsum yod par brten bod la bka' drin che ba chos rgyal mes dbon rnam gsum gyi ya gyal gcig tu 'dren srol yod pa ste/1 srid dbang bzung nas lo bdun la slebs pa lcags glang (821)lor thang bod phyogs gnyis kas mjal dum yong ba'i 'bad brtson lhod med byas pa brgyud bod kyi lo paN rnams dang rgya'i hwa shang rnams kyis dpang po mdzad de thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ma mu tsung gi khrang ching khri lo dang po dang/btsan po khri rab pa can gyi skyid rtag khri lo bdun pa lcags glang (821)lor thang gi rgyal sa khrang an gyi nub phyogs su chings 'grig byas shing/lo de'i rjes mar bod kyi grong khyer lha sa'i shar phyogs sbra stong tshal du chings 'grig byas/lo de'i rjes ma chu yos (823)lor gzhi nas rgyal sa khrang an dang/lha sa gtsug lag khang gi mdun/rgya bod sa mtshams kyi gung gu rme ru bcas su rdo ring btsugs (rdo ring gzhan gnyis deng sang mthong rgyu med kyang lha sa'i rdo ring ni da lta yang mthong rgyu yod )thog gung gu rme ru bya ba'i sa gnas de rgya bod kyi sa mtshams byas nas der bod kyi btsan po'i gtsug lag khang zhig dang rgya'i lha khang zhig brtsigs/gnang la nyi zla zung gcig /sa la btsan po dbon zhang gnyis las med do zhes pa'i brda mtshon du pha bong la nyi zla'i gzugs brkos/phyin chad bod bod yul na bde/rgya rgya yul na bde/sa mtshams yan chad la phan tshun dmag mi drangs/gal te sa mtshams ba gral nas rgya bod sum dmag grangs na dmag drangs mkhan de rang phung bar gyur cig ces phyogs gnyis kas dmon btsugs te mna' bskyal ba'i bka' gtsags kyi 