ug ste 'u shang rdo dpe med bkra shis dge 'phel gyi gtsug lag khang 'og thug gsum rdo brtsigs/bar thog gsum so phag /steng thog gsum shing las byas pa tsang mar mda' yab dang dbu rtse'i rgya phibs rlung gis bskyod na shar dang nus tu 'khor bskyod byed thub pa'i ngo mtshar can zhig bzhengs gnang thog /de'i nang gi sku rten thams cad li dkar dmar gyis lugs byas pa sha stag bzhengs/'on kyang lha khang de bzhengs nas rab gnas ma grub gong du blon pos sku bkrongs zhes (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )las gsungs/4 dam pa'i chos sgyur ba'i lo paN rnams kyis de sngon yab mes kyi dus su ma bsgyur ba'i mdo sngags kyi chos dpe mang po bsgyur zhing/yig gzugs legs pa rnams la gdan g.yas gral dang gla yon 'dod pa dang mthun pa/'tsho rten sa zhing dor gcig bcas gnang bas yig gzugs gong 'phel 'gro bar skul lcag chen po thebs yod/yon kyang gong du bshad pa ltar chos byed dge 'dun rnams la gzhan dang mi 'dra ba'i dmigs bsal dbang cha chen po gnang ba des gsham 'og gi blon po dang 'bangs rnams 'dod blor ma babs pa dang/de sngon blon po dang btsun mo la ma nyes par khrims gcod phog pa sogs kyi 'khon 'dzin yod pa bcas rkyen ngan mang po 'dzoms par brten/btsan po bkrongs ba'i bya thabs mang po gom pa rim bgrod kyis lag bstar byas thog sngar gyi 'khon 'dzin yod pa'i blon po sbas dang cog ro gnyis kyis btsan por chang gsos te ra gzi ba'i go skabs dang bstun nas zhal ltag par gcus te bkrongs/zhib phra'i lo rgyus chos 'byung phal che'i nang du gsal bas 'dir ma bris shing gzigs par 'dod na (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )dang/myang nyi ma 'od zer gyis mdzad pa'i (chos 'byung me tog snying po/) (lde'u chos 'byung rgyas bsdus )rnams phan tshun bsdur nas gzigs/bang so nang khri steng rmang ri zhes 'bod pa rgyal chen 'khrul bzher dang 'dus srong gi bang song gnyis kyi bar du yod}
