khri rtse 'bum bzher gyi khrims|{khod sum cu so drug gi nang gses dang po bka' yi khrims yig chen mo la drug yod pa'i nang nas nang po khri rtse 'bum bzher gyi khrims ni khri gcig gis 'bum go chod pa lta bu yin pas khri rtse bum bzher zer/de ni srid 'dzin sa khul khag gi dbye mtshams dang/srid 'dzin rim pa dang dmag don gyi sgrig gzhi/dpon rigs khag gi go gnas dang las 'gan/dmag dpung dang 'bangs mi'i dbye mtshams dang thob thang/sger bzung gi sde mi ser dang sa zhing dbang bi tshan gzhi bcas gtan 'bebs byas pa'i lam lugs la zer/de la (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang gsal ba'i lam lugs drug dang/(tun hong gi lo rgyus yig cha )nas kha bskang ba gcig bcas bdun yod pa ste/1 ru sde chen po lnga ste dmag srid gcig gyur gyi srid 'dzin sa khul chen po lngar phye ba/2 yul dbang ris zhes rgyal blon dang rus rgyud tsho pa khag gis sger bzung byas pa'i sa khul rnam pa bco brgyad du phye ba/3 rgod kyi stong sde zhes dmag dpung gi sde tshan drug co+u rtsa gcig tu phye ba/4 blon po che dgu zhes srid 'dzin spyi khyab rim pa'i blon chen dgur phye ba/5 dpon bdun sogs srid 'dzin rim pa dma' ba'i khag bcu gnyis su dbye ba/6 g.yung gi mi sde zhes 'bangs mi'i khongs su gtogs pa'i rje bran rim pa lngar phye ba bcas (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang du gsal la /7 sa zhing dbang ba'i lam lugs rim pa lngar phye ba ni chos 'byung de'i nang mi gsal bas (tun hong gi lo rgyus yig cha )las bshad pa rnams kyi gnad bsdus shig kho bos bris pa'i (btsan po srong btsan sgam po'i lo rgyus kyi byung ba brjod pa )zhes pa'i nang gsal}
