khri lha dbang rgyal mtshan|{mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal po khri bsod nams ldes zur du btsun ma sangs rgyas bzang po dang 'brel ba byung ba las rgyal po gshegs rjes sras shig rab byung bdun pa'i shing sprel (1404)lor 'khrungs pa de yin/dgung lo bco lnga'i skabs yum dang mnyam du gung thang pho brang du gdan drangs/de'i phyi lo sa phag (1419)lor srid dbang bzung/rje bzang po rgyal mtshan pa dang bla chen chos dpal bzang po bo dong paN chen 'jigs bral rnams rtsa ba'i bla mar bsten/pho brang byang thog so drug yod pa gsar du brtsigs nas der sku gsung thugs rten grangs las 'das pa gsar bzhengs dang/bo dong paN chen 'jigs bral gyi sku brnyan dang/dam pa de'i gsung rtsom (dpal de nyid 'dus pa'i 'grel pa (rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum cha tshang dang/gsum rtsom gzhan dag mang po'i shing dpar gsar bzhengs gnang/gung thang chos sde chen po'i 'du khang ka ba drug cu pa'i ldebs bris gsar bzhengs/gzhung chen po lnga'i bshad grwa gsar 'dzugs dang/rgyud sde'i sgrub mchod dang/sgrub sde khag gi mchod rgyun mchod gzhis gtan 'jags/mnga' khongs tshang mar ri rgya klung rgya bsdams pa/zam pa lam 'phrang gsar bcos sogs chos srid gnyis ka'i mdzad rjes rlabs che/dgung lo gya gcig pa rab byung brgyad pa'i chu khyi (15020lor sku gshegs/lo rgyus skor ka thog rig 'dzin chen po tshe dbang nor bus mdzad pa'i (mnga' ris smad gung thang gi deb ther dwangs shel 'phrul gyi me long (zhes pa dang/(bod kyi lo rgyus der ther khag lnga )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 122nas 129bar gsal}
