khro dpyal gyis mdzad pa'i rnam thar thor bu|{khro phu lo tsA ba byams pa'i dpal dang dpyal a mo g+ha gnyis kyis mdzad pa'i paN chen shAkya shrI'i rnam thar thor bu re yod pa'i nang nas/khro phu lo tsA bas mdzad pa'i dpag bsam 'khri shig tshigs bcad ma dpe ring shog grangs 3yod pa dang/('grel pa rin chen phreng ba )zhes bya ba mang+ga la ti Sh+Tha ar+ya zhes bod skad du bkra shis rab brtan 'phags pas mdzad pa dbu med bris ma dper ring shog grangs 35yod pa zhig rgyal kham dpe mdzod khang du bzhugs pa kho bos dngos su mjal lo/_}
khro phu|{khro phu dgon pa ste/rab byung gsum pa'i lcags yol (1171)lor 'gro mgon phag mo gru pa'i slob ma rgyal tsha rin chen mgon gyis btag pa yin/bo dong se'i dgon pa dang thag nye sar yod/dgon pa 'dir khro phu lo tsA ba byams pa'i dpal gyis bzhengs pa'i rgyal ba byams pa'i gser sku khru brgyad cu ('dom nyi shu )lon pa'i ngo mtshar can sogs yod}
khro phu bka' brgyud|{'gro mgon phag mo grub pa'i slob ma rin po che rgyal tsha rin chen mgon gyis khro phur dgon pa btab nas gnas gzhi bzung ste/slob brgyud mang du byung ba la khro phu bka' brgyud zer/de nas rim par dbon po kun ldan ras pa zhi ba tshul khrims dang/khro bo lo tsA ba byams pa'i dpal/khro phu sems dpa' chen po bsod nams seng ge/ma gcig reb ma dam ma byang chub sogs byung/bka' brgyud 'di'i byung tshul mdor bsdus (deb sngon )lcags dpar ma smad cha'i shog grangs 624nas 832bar dang (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma stod cha'i shog grangs 842nas 843bar gsal}
