khro bo rta mgrin|{'phags pa spyan ras gzigs khro bo'i rnam par bstan pa rta mgrin la sku'i rnam 'gyur mi 'dra ba mang po yod pa (sgrub thabs brgya rtsa )dang (rin 'byung brgya rtsa'i )nang du gsungs pa lta bu yin}
