khrom zher chen po|{dge bshes bya yul gyi slob ma yin/mtshan la 'od zer seng ge zer/rten sngags pa skya bo yin/rab byung gnyis pa'i lcags 'brug (1100)lor 'chums su sngags rgyud du 'khrungs/lha btsun byang chub yod kyi dge bshes bya yul ba rnams bla mar brten/dgung lo so brgyad pa rab byung gnyis pa'i me sbrul (1137)lor skam skam gyi gtsug lag khang bzhengs/grwa pa nyi brgya tsam 'dus/dgung lo bdun cu don gcig pa rab byung gsum pa'i lcags stag (1170)lor sku gshegs zhes (deb sngon )las gsungs/de min lo rgyus ma rnyed/(de sngon kho bos bris pa'i (deb dmar mchan 'grel )du 'di'i 'khrungs 'das kyi lo de khrom gzher rin chen seng ge'i 'khrungs 'dis kyi lo dang nor 'dug pa 'dir legs bcos byas pa yin/gzhan yang dge bshes khrom zher ba rin chen seng ge la yang khrom zher chen po zhes zhu srol yod cing (rab byung gsum pa'i chu lug 1163lor nas rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags 'brug 1220b.lo bar )lo rgyus zhib cha dang phan ma mthong}
khrom gzigs khang|{de sngon lha sa'i bar bskor byang rgyud du yod pa'i kham pa chen po spen bad yod pa zhig ste/sngar bod bzhugs am ban gyi las khungs yA mon tshugs sa byed kyi yod/khang pa de'i nang rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags rta (1750)lo bod bzhugs am ban h+phu wang 'gyur med rnam rgyal gsol ston la skad btang nas glo bur du bsad sa de yin}
khrom bsags|{nag can la khrims gcod byed skabs sa gnas der mang tshogs bskongs nas tshang mas mig gis mthong sar nag nyes khyab bsgrags thog khrims gcod byed srol yod}
mkhan brgyud|{rab byung dang bsnyen rdzogs kyip+sadom pa gnang mkhan gyi mkhan po'i brgyud pa ste/rgya gar sde pa bzhi'i khongs rtogs kyi mkhan po'i brgyud pa mi 'dra ba yod/bod du bstan pa snga dar skabs mkhan chen zhi ba 'tsho nas brgyud pa'i sdom rgyun sha stag yin pas/bstan pa phyi dar skabs smad 'dul bla chen dgongs pa rab gsal gyi sdom rgyun yang mkhas pa mi gsum gyi sdom rgyun yin cing/de gsum yang mkhan po zhi ba 'tsho nas brgyud pa'i sdom rgyun yin pa dang/mkhan po zhi ba mtsho ni thams cad yod par smra ba'i sde pa'i mkhan brgyud las byung ba dang/bstan pa phyi dar gyi skabs kha che paN chen shAkya shri nas brgyud pa'i sdom rgyun ni gnas brten sde pa'i mkhan brgyud las byung ba dang/gnas brtan sde pa ni thog ma'i 'byung khungs thams cad yod par smra ba'i sde pa nas logs su gyes pa yin pas rtsa ba'i 'byung khungs gcig yin/bstan pa phyi dar gyi bla chen sdom brgyud dang/paN chen sdom brgyud skor gyi dogs gcod mang po zhig mkhas grub rin po che dge legs dpal bzang gis mdzad pa'i (sdom gsum rnam bzhag thub bstan rin po che'i byi dor )dang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa rin po ches mdzad pa'i ('dul ba'i las cho rnam rgyal gser mdog )sogs las dgag sgrub kyi dpyad gtam mang po yod pas de rnams la gzigs /zhar byung dgos pa khag gi mkhan brgyud ni rab byung bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa'i mkhan brgyud ma yin par/dgos pa de yi mkhan po'i khri thog rim byung gi mkhan rabs la go dgos pa yin}
mkhan chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan|{(snar thang gi mkhan rabs bcu gsum pa yin )chu sgo'i lung du gro yi rigs su rab byung drug pa'i sa stag (1338)lor 'khrungs/mchims blo bzang grags pa'i drung nas bka' gdams kyi chos skor cha tshang bar gsan/rab byung drug pa'i shing yos (1375)lor snar thar gyi mkhan po'i khrir phebs nas lo cu bzhi'i bar bskyangs/dgung lo re bzhi pa rab byung bdun pa'i lcags sbrul (1401)lor sku gshegs zhes (snar thang gdan rabs )su gsal/mkhan chen 'dis mdzad pa'i (bslab btus kyi 'grel pa )sogs yod/lo rgyus mdor bsdus shig las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung chen mo )shing dpar ma'i grangs 256nas grangs 257bar gsal}
mkhan chen gu ra ba|{dbus stong gu ra ba'i gnas gzhi bzung nas mkhan po'i bya ba mdzad pas mkhan chen gu ra ba zhes thogs/mtshan dngos tshul khams rdo rje zhes zhu/'bri gung gi gdan rabs dang po yi/rab byung gsum pa'i shing khyi (1154)lor se'u gangs dkar mor yab sum pa rje dpal gyi sras su 'khrungs/sku tshad cher bskyed pa'i dus 'dul 'dzin grogs mkhar gtsang ston gyi drung nas rab byung gi sdom pa zhus/mtshan la tshul khrims rdo rjer gsor zhing/lo shas rang mkhan po de nyid kyi drung du bzhugs nas 'dul ba la mkhas par sbyangs/de nas stong tshul du 'dus 'dzin thag ma pa'i drung nas bap+sanyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes te slar yang 'dul ba'i skor la sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa mdzad/dbus stod du gu ra'i gnas gzhir bzung nas mkhan po'i bya ba mdzad/dgung lo zhe ga pa sa lug (1199)la 'bri gung skyob pa rin po che mngal nas slob ma'i gtso bor gyur te gdams pa thob cha tshang ba gnang zhing/lo mang ring 'bru gung gi mkhan po mdzad/dgung lo re bzhi pa me glang (1217)lor skyom pa rin po che dgongs pa mya ngan las 'da' khar zhal chems su nga 'das nas lo gsum gyi ring tshogs pa skyong la/de nas dbon rin po che la gdan sa gtod gsungs pa ltar lo gsum ring gdan sa mdzad /de nas dbon rin po che bsod nams grags pa gdan sar bskos nas/dgung lo re bdun pa rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags 'brug (1220)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar mdor bsdus shig 'bri gung gdan rabs nyer brgyad pa bstan 'dzin pad ma'i rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i ('bri gung chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 106nas 108bar gsal}
mkhan chen grags pa don grub|{(snar thang gi mkhan rabs bcu drug pa yin )gan rtsa'i grong du rab byung drug pa'i me sbrul (1377)lor 'khrungs/rus ni gro la tsho ba bzhi yod pa'i rog tsho yin/gzhon nu nas sku shin tu btsun zhing mkhan chen grub pa shes rab las bka' gdams kyi man ngag mtha' dag tshang gar gsan/mkhan rabs gong ma mkhan chen bsod nams mchog grub dang nye gnas thugs ma mthun pa'i dbang gis ma bzhugs par dbus su phabs nas rjes su slar byon na yang nye gnas pas 'gog rkyen byas par brten/mkhan chen gyi gcung po dang nye gnas bar 'thab rtsod dang shi rmas byung ba sogs la brten/lo bzhi'i ring gnas sa bar stong byung zhing/dgung lo re gnyis pa rab byung bdun pa'i sa rta (1438)lor mkhan po'i khrir phebs nas lo sum cu'i bar bskyangs/dgung lo go gcig pa rab byung brgyad pa'i me phag (1467)lor sku gshegs}
mkhan chen grags pa brtson 'grus|{(snar thang gi mkhan rabs bcu pa yin )myang stong rgya brag spel stod kyi chu mig lung du rab byung bzhi pa'i chu glang (1235)lor 'khrungs/gdung rus ze'u yin/sku na gzhon dus su yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma se chen han dang ol jol thu gnyis kyi bla mchod mdzad/dgung lo nga gsum pa rab byung lnga pa'i shing sbrul (1305)lo nas lo bcu gnyis kyi ring snar thar gi mkhan po mdzad/sku shin tu btsun zhing snar thar gi chos grwar phan thogs chen po mdzad cing/snar thang gi mthun rkyen longs spyod kyang mkhan chen 'di'i dus 'dzoms pas sku bsod che bar grags/lo rgyus zhib cha ma mthong}
mkhan chen grags pa gzhon nu|{tshogs chos lung pa'i mkhan po mdzad pas mkhas chen zhes zhu zhing/mtshan dngos grags pa gzhon nu yin/lha sa'i shar phyogs dbus stod kyi lha lcang ri mo can zhes pa'i grong gyang gsar du rab byung bzhi pa'i me sbrul (1257)lor 'khrungs/bka' gdams kyi dge bshes khams lung pa la gtugs/mkhan po grags pa 'bum gyi drung nas rab byung zhus te mtshan la grags pa gzhon nu zhes gsol/dgung lo bcu dug pa rab byung lnga pa'i shing phag (1275)lor rong g.yag sde'i dbang po zhes par mkhan chen bdag dang dpal gyis mkhan po dang slob dpon thugs rje dpal bzang gis las kyi slob dpon mdzad de bsnyen rdzogs zhus/mkhan chen pa'i drung nas (phar phyin )dang (spyod 'jug )blo sbyong )sogs mdo sngags kyi chos mang po gsan/zul phu'i mkhan ches chos grags rin chen dang/khro phu'i ba dpon gzhon nu mdzes pa/mkhan po yon tan 'bum /g.yag sde lo tsA ba bsod nams seng ge /rong pa shes rab seng ge /sron pa kun dga' rgyal mtshan/grub thob 'dar 'phyar sogs bla ma mang po bsten nas mngon pa 'og gong dang/tshad ma/'dul ba/gsang sngags kyi skor sogs gsan pa rgya cher mdzad/dgung lo so rgyus pa shing rta (1294)lor tshogs chos lung pa'i mkhan po mdzad cing/rjes su zha lus dgos pa'i mkhan po mang mdzad/dgung lo nga drug pa chu byi (1312)lor tshong 'dus mgur mo'i bla brang shar du gnang/zha la'i mkhan po mdzad ring/gzhung chen po lnga'i dpe khrid dang mdo sngags kyi chos mang po gsan mi chad par gnang bas slob ma mkhas grags can mang du thos/dgung lo nga dbu pa rab byung lnga pa'i shing yos (1315)lor sku gshegs/bu ston rin po ches gtso bor mdzad pa'i dge slong rnam sbyar bzhes pa nyis ba rgya lhag tsam gyi sku gdung tshong 'dus kyi grong khyer dang khad che bar gnas drangs/der zhugs 'bul zhus pas rten ngo mtshar can mang po phebs pa rnams tshong 'dus su mchod rten bzhengs pa'i nang du bzhugs/rnam thar skor las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog )'bras spungs dpar ma'i shog grangs 244nas 295bar dang/zha lu mkhan chen blo gsal bstan skyong gis mdzad pa'i (zha lu'i chos 'byung )shing dpar ma'i shog grangs 181nas 183bar gsal lo/_}
mkhan chen grags pa shes rab|{(snar thang gi mkhan rabs bcu gcig pa yin (mkhan chen grags pa shes rab snga rjes gnyis byung ba'i snga ma yin/mkhan chen grags pa brtson 'grus kyi gcung du rab byung bzhi pa'i sa lug (1259)lor 'khrungs/mchims nam mkha' grags dang mkhan chen grags pa brtson 'grus bla mar bsten nas bka' gdams kyi chos skor man ngag rnams cha tshang bar gsan/mkhan chen grags pa brtson 'grus sku gshegs pa'i lo de nas snar thang gi mkhan po mdzad de lo bcu gcig par bskyangs/dgung lo re bdun pa rab byung lnga pa'i shing glang (1265)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar lo rgyus zhib pa da phan ma rnyed}
mkhan chen grub pa shes rab|{(snar thang gi mkhan rabs bcu bzhi pa yin )snar thang gi nye skor rong gu zhes par dbang gi rigs su rab byung drug pa'i me bya (1357)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun la phebs skabs yi ge 'bri klog mkhas par mkhyen/dgung lo bcu par mkhan chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyi drung du rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan grub pa shes rab ces gsol/mkhan chen de nyid dang/slob dpon grags pa rgya mtsho/chos rje yon tan 'od sogs bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/dgung lo so gsum pa rab byung bdun pa'i sa sbrul (1389)lor snang thar gyi mkhan pa'i khrir phebs nas lo ngo sum cu bar bskyangs/dgung lo drug cu re gnyis pa sa khyi (1418)lor zur bzhugs mdzad de dgung lo re bdun pa rab byung bdun pa'i chu yos (1423)lor sku gshegs /dam pa 'dis mdzad pa'i (spyod 'jug gi 'grel pa )yod/lo rgyus mdor bsdus las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung )shing dpar ma'i shog grangs 257par yod}
mkhan chen dge 'dun rgya mtsho|{(rong pa reng gong dgon chen gyi mkhan thog dgu pa )yi ngogs mkhan chen bsam gtan rgya mtsho'i sprul sku yin/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa lug (1679)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu pa sa 'brug (1788)lor yi ngogs mkhan chen bsam gtan rgya mtsho'i sprul skur ngos bzung ste gdan sar bkod/sku dbon bla ma dngos grub pa'i+ung nas rab byung gi sdom pa zhus/chu dmar sgom chen blo bzang r+Ya mtsho/g.yer gshong 'jam dbyangs grags pa/bde chen dpon slob blo bzang bkra shis sogs kyi drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos 'ga' zhig gsan/la mo bde chen dang/chu bzang/dgon lung bcas la grwa skor dam bca' bzhag /dung lo nyer drug pa shing sprel (1704)lor dbus su byon nas 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tsang du chos zhugs mdzad nas sku mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i rdo rje dang mjal/dge tshul dang bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa zhus/'dul ba dang mdzod la sbyangs pa mdzad/zhal rol la mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mtha' yas pa gsan/dgung lo so drug pa shing rta (1714)lor dge bshes lha rabs pa'i mtshan rtags bzhes te/grwa skor dam bca' ang dang po thob/sog po jun gar gyis skabs der lha rabs dam bca' su bzang la dgon pa chen po'i mkhan po bskos rgyus thag bcad pa ltar dam pa 'di rgyal rtse dpal 'khor chos sde'i mkhan por bskos pa ltar lo bcu'i ring rtse chen chos sde dang zung 'brel du bskyangs/paN chen rin po che blo bzang ye shes/khri chen ngag dbang mchog ldan/'on rgyal sras 'jags med ye shes grags pa/'jam dbyangs bde ba'i rdo rje'i sogs bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos bka' mtha' yas pa gsan/dgung lo nga bzhi pa chu byi (1732)lor 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa dkon mchog 'jigs med dbang po dang/lha btsun dang so bsod nams dar rgyas gnyis nas mdo smad phyogs su gdan drangs ltar phebs/reb gong dgon chen gyi khrir bzhugs nas lo bcu gnyis ring chos srid gnyis ka'i sgo nas legs par bskyangs shing/mdo sngags kyi chos bka' yang rgya cher stsal bas zhal slob grags pa can mang du byon/(bsdus grwa'i rnam bzhag lung rigs nyi ma )zhes yongs grags su mkhan chen bsdus grwar 'bod pa de sogs gsung rtsom pod gnyis lhag tsam dpar yod/dgung lo gya bdun pa rang byung bcu gsum pa'i shing bya (1765)lor sku gshegs/sku gdung ril por bzhugs pa'i byang chub ma chod rten mkhan chen rang nyid kyi bla brang du bzhugs/rnam thar skor bde chen paN+Di tas mdzad pa kha byang tu (dpal ldan bla ma dam pa dge 'dun rgya mtsho dpal bzang po'i rnam par thar pa phyogs tsam brjod pa 'dod rgu'i 'byung gnas dpag bsam ljon shing )shing dpar ma shog grangs (466yod pa dam pa de'i gsung 'bum pod dang po'i nang bzhugs}
mkhan chen rgyal sras bzang po|{lho brag khul du shud phu'i rigs su 'khrungs ('khrungs 'das kyi lo tshigs mi gsal )dgung lo bcu gcig la mkhan chen seng ge bzang po'i drung du rab byung mdzad/sku mkhyen mtsho sna ba dang dge bshes mon gra ba sogs bsten nas dka' bzhi la sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa mdzad/mkhas chen seng ge bzang po'i drung nas lam rim gyi khrid dang bka' gdams kyi chos skor cha tshang ba gnas/lho brag sgro ba dgon pa'i mkhan po yun ring mdzad cing/sku gsung thugs na mang du bzhengs/dge bshes mon gra ba dge 'dun gyi sde dang bcas pa dgos par gdan drangs nas chos 'khor chen po btsugs/mkhan chen nyid kyis kyang dus dus su chos bka' yang yang gnang bas slob ma brgyud 'dzin pa grags can mang po byung/sku mya ngan las 'da' khar mkhan chen nam mkha' rgyal mtshan la bka' slob dang zhal gdams legs par gnang nas ngo mtshar ba'i ltas mang po dang bcas sku gshegs/lho brag phyogs su bka' gdams kyi bstan pa yun ring gnas pa'i rten 'brel gyi med du sku gdung ril por bzhag pa dgon pa'i gser 'bum gyi na du bzhugs/lo rgyus mdor bsdus yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (lam rim bla brgyud rnam thar )lcags dpar ma'i shog rngas 301302bar gsal}
mkhan chen ngag dbang chos grags|{sa skya'i mkhan chen ngag dbang chos grags/rab byung bcu pa'i chu sprel (1572lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun cu pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags sbrul (1641)lor sku gshegs gsung rtsom skor (phar phyin spyi don )(kyai rdor bskyed rim rnam bshad )sogs phyogs bsgrigs pod gnyis dpar ma yod/rnam thar lo rgyus zur 'khod da phan lag tu ma son}
mkhan chen chos skyabs bzang po|{lam rim gyi bka' gdams gzhung pa'i bla brgyud gras su bzhugs pa'i gra gor mkhan chen chos skyabs bzang po'am skyabs mchog dpal bzang zhes zhu ba de yin/dam pa 'di'i 'khrungs 'das kyi lo tshigs gsal ba ma rnyed cing/kun mkhyen mtsho sna ba'i sku nga nas bar byung dang bsnyen rdzogs gnyis ka bzhes te /bka' gdams gzhung pa'i lam rim gyi man ngag rnams gsan/sde snod gsum la mkhas pa'i paN+Di ta chen por gyur/mtsho sna ba chen po sku gshegs nas mon grwa pa tshul khrims bkra shis bsten nas mngon par mdzod dang bka' gdams lam rim gyi khrid dang man ngag cha tshang ba bskyal du gsan/sku tshe gcig gi ring sgom sgrub nyams bzhes gtso bor mdzad de/phyir mi ldog pa'i rtags thob zhes yongs su grags/rje tsong kha pa chen pos dam pa 'di'i drung nas bka' gdams gzhu gi lam rim gyi man ngag cha tshang bar gsan pas bka' drin che ba'i rtsa ba'i bla ma gtso bo zhig tu gus bkur mdzad pa'i lo rgyus mdor bsdus yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (lam rim bla ma brgyud pa'i rnam thar )lcags dkar ma'i shog grangs 271nas 272bar gsal}
mkhan chen nyi ma rgyal mtshan|{(snar thang gi mkhan rabs dgu pa )snar thang gi phu'i lteng karma kha rir rab byung bzhi pa'i shing bya (1225)lor 'khrungs/gdung rus ni ram yin/sku gzhon nu nas rab tu byung zhing/'brom ku ma ra dang/mchims nam mkha' grags/skyo ston smon lam tshul khrims sog blang ma 'ga' zhig gi drung nas bka' gdams kyi chos skor dang/gzhan yang gdams ngag mang du gsan/dgung lo don lnga pa rab byung lnga pa'i sa phag (1299)lor snar thang gi mkhan po'i khrir phebs nas lo bdun bskyangs te/dgung lo gya gcig pa rab byung lnga pa'i shing sbrul (1305)lor sku gshegs/dgung rten ni snar thang gdan sa gong ma'i gdung rten gyi shar ngos su bzhugs/lo rgyus rnam thar zhib pa ma mthong lags}
mkhan chen nyi ma bstan 'dzin|{rje 'di ni rgyal ba mnyam med chen po shes rab rgyal mtshan gyi khri 'dzin mkhan rogs nyer gnyis pa yin/mkhar chen mgon mdo khams bum por sgang sde dge'i khongs rkam tshang gdung la rab byung bcu pa'i chu bya (1813)lor sku 'khrungs/chung dus g.yung drung nyi ma rgyal mtshan gyis rjes su bzung nas phyi nang gsang ba'i bon sde'i dbang lung phyag len dang rig gnas sogs la gsan sbyangs gnang/shes bya kun la lan re gcig pa tsam gyis gsal rtogs mkhyen pa'i spobs pa rgyas/de nas khu bo rin po che dang mnyam du gtsang la byon nas ba kra shis sman ri dgos par sgrigs zhugs mdzad/skyabs mchog zla ba rgyal mtshan sogs skyes chen du ma'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags rgyud sde'i tshig don kun la mkhas par sbyangs/khyad par du drang srong gi sdom khrims nyis brgya lnga bcu dang gsang sngags kyi dbang lung khrid sogs mkhan chen bsod nams blo gros kyi dgongs bcud zab mo gsan bzhes gnang p+sate mkhas dang grub pa'i rtser so/g.yung drung bon gyi bstan pa skyong ba'i dge ba'i bshes gnyen gyi mtshan snyan rgya cher khyab/dgung lo nyer bzhi'i steng mnyam med rgyal ba'i rgyal tsham tu gser khrir mnga' gsol/sku gsung thugs kyi rten gsum byin can mang du bzhengs/rab lags g.yung drung gling skyabs mgon gyi bka' bzhin mtshan nyid gzhung chen drug gi bshad grwa btsugs nas yongs 'dzin du bzhugs/slob ma'i tshogs mang du bskyangs/hor 'brog klu phug g.yung drug bde chen gling sogs gshen bstan sman ri'i srol 'dzin dgos lag mang po phyag btab/khong gi phyag rtsom la (shes rab kyi bla na med par phyin pa mngon rtogs rgyan gyi 'grel pa dga' gdan rab gsal )dang/(rnam bshad gzhung 'grel/) (rgyal ba mnyam med chen po'i rnam thar/) (bstod phyag sku gsung lhun grub kyi 'grel pa/) (thun mong sdud grwa'i rnam gzhag/) (rtsis gzhung 'od zer 'bum ldan/) (bstan rtsis nor bu'i phreng ba/) (brda dag 'bel gtam nyi 'od gzhon nu )sogs shin tu ming /de nas rje nyid mkhan zur du bzhugs rjes bsnyen sgrub mthar son te yi dam lha'i zhal gzigs par grags/zhal slob mchog tu gyur pa bsod nams phun tshogs dang/'gro mgon shes rab g.yung drung/mkhan chen skal bzang nyi ma sogs mang dag byung/dgongs rdzogs kyi sa tshod gnyis tu ma nges par bzhed pa mi 'dra ba cung zad yod rung/mang che bas rje 'di nyid dgung lo so drung tu phebs pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa sprel (1848)lo la 'das par bzhed}
mkhan chen nam mkha' rgyal mtshan|{yongs grags su lho brag mkhan chen nam mkha' rgyal mtshan bzhes brjod srol yod/shud bu'i rigs su rab byung lnga pa'i me stag (1326)lor yab slob dpon nam mkha' bzang po dang yum rin chen rgyan gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/byis pa'i dus nas na mnyam gzhan dang mi ra ba'i mdzad spyod khyad par can mnga'/dgung lo bdun pa chu sprel (1332)lor nyid kyi khu bo rgyal sras bzang po'i drung nas dge tshal gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo bcu par shing phag (1335)lor nas kho bo mkhan chen de nyid kyi drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos skor mang du gnas/dgung lo nyi shu pa shing bya (1345)lor rgya ma rin chen sgang du byon/rin po che bkra shis rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/dge ba'i bshes gnyen ri zangs rtog pa dang/bla ma bde ba'i 'byung gnas/dge bshes mon gra pa sogs bsten nas gzhung chen po sngar slob gnyer legs par gnang/dgung lo so gnyis pa me sprel (1356)lor khru bo mkhan chen rgyal sras bzang po sku gshegs pa'i dgongs rdzogs su gser sku chen mo bzhengs/lo der sgro ba dgongs pa'i mkhan po'i khrir phebs te chos dang zang zing gnyis ka'i sgo nas bskyangs/dgung lo bdun cu pa rab byung bdun pa'i shing phag (1395)lor rje tsong kha pa chen pos mkhan chen 'di nyid dang mjal/bka' gdams kyi chos skor dang/man ngag pa lam rim pa'i gdams ngag mkhan chen nyid kyi dag snang chos skor lung bstan mang po bcas gnang nas slob ma'i gtso bor rjes su bzung/rgyun nas thugs dam nyams bzhes gtsor 'don thog /dad 'dus slob ma rnams la chos yang yang gnang bcas mdzad pa rlabs che zhing ngo mtshar ba mang/dgung lo don drug pa rab byung bdun pa'i lcags sbrul (1401)lor sku gshegs/sku gdung zhal chems ltar la mo dang dga' ldan bar gyi ri 'gram zhig tu sa 'bum chen po zhig bzhengs pa'i nang ma nyams par bzhugs su gsol ba der yongs grags su lho brag 'bum pa zer/gsung rtsom phyogs gcig tu bsdus pa lho brag bka' bum du grags pa pod gnyis yod/rnam thar lo rgyus rgyas pa las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung chen mo )shing dpar ma'i shog grangs 158nas 164bar gsal bas der gzigs/mkhan chen de'i yang srid skor bod kyi sprul sku rnam gsum gras sle lung rje drung rin po che sku rim byon rnams yin par grags/)}
mkhan chen pad+ma bzang po|{rngog gi gdung brgyud bdun pa spre'u zhing pa byang chub dpal gyi slob ma yin cing/rje tsong kha pa che po dang/'gos lo gzhon nu dpal dang dus mnyam par a khu shes rab rgya mtsho'i (rngog dkyil bdun gyi snyan bskul )las gsungs shing/khong gis chos brgyus sa skya'am bka' brgyud gang rung zhig yin nges kyang/rnam thar zhib gsar da phan ma mjal/'dis mdzad pa'i chos 'byung dang dus 'khor 'grel yod pa (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )dus 'khor gyi lo rgyus thad du gsal}
mkhan chen phyag rdor ba'i gnyen po lha gsum|{lho brag mkhan chen nam mkha' rgyal mtshan gyi thugs dam kyi lha 'ga' zhig yod pa'i gras nas/steng 'og bar gsum gyi gdon gyi gnod pa 'gog pa'i lha gsum ste/1 steng gdon gza' yi gnod pa srung ba'i lha phyag rdor/2 'og gdon klu 'i gnod pa srung ba'i lha khyung nag /3 bar gdon rgyal po dang btsan gyi gnod pa srung ba'i lha rta mgrin bcas yin cing/yongs grags su rta phyag khyung gsum yang zer}
mkhan chen bo d+hi swa twa|{bod du nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi rab byung thog mar 'dzugs skabs sdom pa gnang mkhan yin pas mkhan po dang/byang chub kyi sems thugs rgyud la mnga' bas bo d+hi sa twa ste byang chub sems dpa' zhes zhu srol yod/mtshan dngos ni rgya gar skad du shan+ta rak+Shi ta ste bod skad du byung na zhi ba 'tsho zer/mtshan gzhan rnam snang mdzad du yang grags/dam pa 'di ni rgya gar shar phyogs kyi yul bam g+ha la'am {(WP:1,194)}za hor gyi grong khyer du yab rgyal po gtsag lag 'dzin la sras lcam sring gsum (che ba d+harma rwa dza/'bring pa mkhan chen 'di nyid/chung ba lha lcam ma n+d+har ba zhes slob dpon chen po pad+ma 'byung gnas kyis gzungs mar gyur pa de yin )yod pa'i 'bring po yin/mkhas po 'di nyid sku 'khrungs pa'i dus skabs skor/bod kyi lo rgyus yig cha mang por dgung lo dgu brgya lhag tsam bzhugs dang/bod kyi btsan po lha tho tho ri gnyan btsan gyis srid dbang skyong skabs mkhan chen 'dis (mdo sde dpang skong phyag rgya )sogs bsnams nas bod du phebs pa skabs 'di'i mtshan li the si p+sate blo sems 'tsho zer ba dang/rgyal po khri srong lde btsan skabs gzhi nas bod du gdan drangs te byon pa/mkhas chen 'di sku tshe yang ha cang ring por bzhugs par brten sku tshe stong dang/bar/smad bcas kyi p+salob ma mang po yod ces gsung srol yod 'dug /jo nang tA ra nA thas mdzad pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )le'i nyi shu rtsa dgu pa'i thad 'di ltar gsungs te bod kyi yul du byon pa'i atsa r+ya bo d+hi swa twa ni rgyal po go pA la nas rgyal po rdarma pA la'i bar du nges par bzhugs par mngon la/bod kyi lo rgyus khungs che bar byas pa mang po zhig gi nang bod kyi rgyal po dgu mkhan po 'di'i sku tshe'i ring la 'das zer bar snang bas de ltar na/slob dpon 'phags pa thogs med sku mched gnyis kyi zhabs zin pa tsam du byed dgos te ji bzhin yin par dka'o zhes gsal ba de rang gzhir bzung na/rgya gar shar phyogs kyi rgyal po gau pA las srid dbang bzung ba'i dus ni tA ra nA thas (rgya gar chos 'byung )du gsungs pa'i pA la'i rgyal rabs kyi lo grangs gzhir bzung nas spyi lo'i dus rabs bdun pa'i (685nas 720)bar yin cing/de nas rtsis pa'i rgya rabs bzhi pa rgyal po d+harma pA las srid dbang bzung ba'i dus ni spyi lo'i dus rabs brgyad pa'i (790)nas spyi lo'i dus rabs dgu pa'i (853)bar yin cing/de la lo grangs brgya dang lnga yod pas sku tshe ring po de tsam zhig bzhugs nges can red/1988lorabod ljongs mi dmangs dpe skrun khang nas dpe skrun byas pa'i (bon gyi bstan 'byung legs bshad skal ba bzang po'i mgrin rgyan )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 123nas 124bar/bon bsnubs pa'i rgyu rkyen skor bshad skabs/mkhan po 'di smon lam log pa'i mi zhig spun mched gnyis bzang tshang byas pa las skyes pa'i nal phrug yin pa dang/bon pos cho ga byas nas rgya gar yul du phud par brten 'khon 'dzin bcang nas rgya gar du slob gnyer 'bad brtson byas te paN+Di tar gyur pa dang/de nas bod du 'ong nas bon bsnubs pa yin tshul sogs 'khod 'dug pa de ni bon rnams nang pa'i chos la ha cang mi dga' ba'i gsung rjen par phebs pa zhig yin nges pas lan 'debs zhu ba'i dgos pa ma mchis/mkhan po 'di rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis bod du gnas drangs pa'i lo ni rgyal po de chu rta (742)lor 'khrungs pa'i dgung lo nyi shu pa lcags glang (761)lor nang pa sangs rgyas kyi chos mdzad pa'i khrims khyab bsgrags gnang rjes su gdan drangs pa yin/mkhan po 'di r+Yal po khri srong lde btsan sa bod du thengs gnyis gdan drangs pa'i thengs dang po 'dir zla ba kha shas las ma bzhugs shing/bsam yas gtsug la khang gi sa 'dul dang rming bting ba tsam las mdzad lo ma byung bar bod nas bal yul du phyir phebs gnang dgos byung/de rjes slar yang slob dpon chen po pad+ma 'byung gnas dang mnyam du gdan drangs te bsam yas gtsug lag khang dngos su bzhengs nas rab gnas mdzad pa /de rjes sad mi drug gam bdun rab tu byung nas dge 'dun gyi sde btsugs pa bcas mdzad/mthar rtas phra ba brgyab (rdag rgyag bzhus )nas sku 'das pa sogs kyi lo rgyus go rim rnams yig cha mang che ba'i nang gsal bas 'dir yig tshogs chung khyad ma bris shing/gong gsal rnams kyi lo tshigs skor bzhed pa 'dra ming mang bas de skor gyi dpyad gtam zur du bkod yod pas der gzigs par zhu}
mkhan chen blo bzang grags pa|{(snar thang gi mkhan rabs bcu gnyis pa yin )yongs grags su mchims blo bzang grags pa zhes brjod srod yod/myang stod smon 'gro'i kha'ur mchims kyi rigs su rab byung lnga pa'i sa phag (1299)lor 'khrungs/mkhan chen grags pa brtson 'grus dang/grags pa shes rab/rgyang ro byang chub 'bum la sogs pa bla ma mang po bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgya cher gsan/dgung lo so dug pa rab byung drug pa'i me glang (1337)lor snar thang gi mkhan po'i khrir phebs lo sum cu lo dgu bar bskyangs te/'chad rtsod rtsom gsum gyi sgo nas bstan 'gro'i don rgya cher mdzad/chos rje don grub rin chen mdo smad du phebs khar bya khyung na sha sbrang dgon pa thob/slob ma khye'u ngo mtshar can zhig 'ong bas/de la nga'i ming 'di btags nas gces par skyongs shig ces lung bstan pa ltar chos rjes kyang rje tsong kha pa mkhan chen gyi mtshan de rang 'dogs par mdzad/mkhan chen 'dis mkhan po mdzad ring snar thang dgon pa sha khrims dang nag khrims dam par mdzad/dgu lo don bdun pa rab byung drug pa'i shing yos (1375)lor sku gshegs/gdung rten bkra shis sgo mang chen po zhig bzhengs par sngar snar thang gi rten gras su bzhugs/rnam thar lo rgyus mdor bsdus tsam las zhib pa ma rnyed}
