mkhan chen bsod nams mchog grub|{(snang thang dgon pa'i mkhan rabs bco lnga pa yin )gtsang khul gyi shar dge sdings su zur gyi rigs las rab byung bdun pa'i sa yos (1399)lor 'khrungs/slob dpon chos ldan skal bzang sogs kyi drung du rab tu byung ste/mtshan la bsod nams mchog grub ces gsol/dgung lo nyi shu pa la mkhan po de nyid kyi drung du bsnyen rdzogs bzhes mkhan chen gong ma rnam gnyis kyi drung nas bka' gdams kyi chos skor rnams cha tshang bar gsan/gzhan yang grub chen bsod nams blo gros dang/rje tsong kha pa/rje btsun shes rab seng ge/mkhas grub rin po che dge legs dpal bzang po sogs bla ma mang po'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mtha' yas pa gsan/dgung lo nyi shu pa sa khyi (1418)lor snar thang gi mkhan po'i khrir phebs nas lo bcu drug gi ring bskyangs/de nas nye gdas kyis dgongs pa dkrugs par brten dbus su byon nas phag gru bka' brgyud kyi gdan sa'i mkhan 'dzin mdzad cing/phag grub sde srid dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan gyi la mchod kyang gdams chos 'byang )las gsal yang dag dkar chag khag tu mi gsal bas 'tshol dgos/dgung lo nga lnga pa rab byung brgyad pa'i chu sprel (1452)lor phag gru'i gdan sa rang du sku gshegs/rnam thar ro rgyus skor las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung )shing dpar ma'i shog grangs 257nas 258bar gsal}
mkhan chen bslab gsum rgyal mtshan|{gdan sa chen po zhwa lu'i mkhan rabs phyi ma'i mkhan po'i gras su phebs pas mkhan chen zhes zhu ba yin/'u yug gi sdings ma dang khad nye ba'i sa char yab rgya lha dang/yum sgrol ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung dgu pa'i me khyi (1526)lor 'khrungs/mtshan gzhan mkhan chen sdings ma ba yang zer/yam yum gnyis kyis mtshan la 'tsho rgyal zhes gsol/lo tshad lon pa na ram sdings ma ba'i mkhan po 'ga' tshe ba'i drung du rab byung mdzad/mtshan la bslab gsum rgyal mtshan zhes gsol/de nas 'bras yul skyed tshal du gung chin mo'i slob gnyer mdzad pas legs par mkhyen/dgung lo zhe bzhi pa sa sbrul (1569)lor bo dong bya gshongs su 'jam dbyangs sangs rgyas rgyal mtshan gyis mkhan po mdzad nas bsnyen rdzogs gnang/lo der bo don e'i dgon pa'i mkhan po phebs/dgung lo ma nga gnyis pa me glang (1577)lor bo dong gi sgrub sder sku gshegs/lo rgyus rnam thar skor mkhan chen bslab gsum rgyal mtshan gyis rnam thar khyab bdag dbang phyug rab brten gyis mdzad pa kha byang du (rje btsun sdings ma ba chen po'i rnam thar byin rlabs kyi chu gter )shing dpar ma la shog grangs 14yod cing/de las bsdus pa zha lus mkhan chen slob gsal bstan skyong gis mdzad pa'i (zha lu'i chos 'byung )shing dpar ma shog grangs 146nas 147bar gsal}
