mkhan po|{'di la go ba len stangs mi ra ba gnyis yod pa las/dang po/'dul ba'i gzhung nas bshad pa'i mkhan po ste rab byung dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa gnang mkhan gyi mkhan po dang/dge slong gi snom pa gnang mkhan gyi mkhan po gnyis la zer zhing/de yang mkhan po byed 'os pa'i 'os chos sam cha rkyen bco lnga tshang ba zhig dgos pa ste/1 btsun pa'i yan lag pham pa bzhi'i nyes pas ma gos pa/2 brtan pa'i yan lag dge p+salong gi sdom pa blangs ma nas lo bcu'i bar sdom pa la skyon ma phog pa/3 mkhas pa'i yan lag 'dul ba la mkhas shing/lnga phrugs nyer gcig gang yang rung ba'i yon tan dang ldan pa/4 slob ma la snying rje dang ldan pa/5 khong khro chung zhing bzod pa dang ldan pa/6 nang gi 'khor rnams spyod pa gtsang ba/7 slob ma rnams la chos dang zang zing gnyis kyi sgo nas skyong mkhas pa/8 dus skabs dang 'tshams par gdams ngag dang bslab bya gnang ba/9 rang nyid dang dbang po mthun pa 10 lta ba mthun pa/11 smra shes pa/12 don go ba/13 shes pa rang bzhin du gnas pa/14 lus tha mal du gnas pa/15 sa rang bzhin du gnas pa bcas tshang dgos pa yin/de rnams so so'i go don ('dul ba )rab byung gi gzhi'i thad kyi 'grel pa khag la gzigs dgos/gnyis pa dgon pa khag gi mkhan po ste/grwa sa chen po'i mkhan po rnams gong gsal gyi che rkyen tshang yang dgon pa chung rigs kyi mkhan po la cha rkyen de tsho tshang ba dang mtshang ba sna tshogs yod}
