mkhan po grags pa seng ge|{snye thang mkhan chen grags pa seng ge zhu ba 'gro mgon 'phags pa rin po che bsnyen rdzogs skabs dbus nas ched gnyer gyis gdan drangs pa de yin cing/sa skya Na chen sku gshegs khar 'gro mgon 'phags pa la khyod bsnyen rdzogs zhus na bod dbus gtsang khams gsum na mkhan chen grags pa seng ge las mkhas btsun bzang gsum 'dzoms pa med pas de la ba snyen rdzogs zhus/khong gi rgya gar gyi paN chen shan+ti pa'i tshab byed thub pa yod ces bsngags brjod tshad med mdzad pa de yin/lo rgyus rnam thar yig cha da phan lag tu ma son}
