mkhan slob sbrags ma|{mkhan po dang las kyi ba dpon gnyis ka chabs gcig tu mdzad pa ste/dge tshal gyi sdom pa gnang skabs mkhan po ba zung 'grel gnang chos kyang slob dpon logs su mdzad srol yod cing/de'i rgyu mtshan ni las kyi slob dpon la 'os chos bcu gcig tshang dgos pa'i nang tshan bcu pa la mkhan pos bskos zhig yin dgos pa der thug yod/de skor gsham gsal las kyi slob dpon zhes pa'i 'grel bshad la gsal}
