mkha' 'gro|{gsang sngags ma rgyud kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la/'og tu bshad pa'i yul nyi shu rtsa bzhi na bzhugs pa'i mkha' 'gro ma nyi shu rtsa bzhi ste/sku yi gnas brgyad na bzhugs pa'i mkhan 'gro ma 'khor lo'i shugs can ma sogs sku'i rigs kyi mkha' 'gro ma brgyad/gsung gi gnas brgyad na bzhugs pa'i mkha' 'gro ma sa srung ma la sogs pa gsung gi rigs kyi mkha' 'gro ma brgyad/thugs gyi gnas brgyad na bzhugs pa'i mkha' 'gro ma rab gtum ma la sogs pa thugs kyi rags kyi mkha' 'gro ma brgyad bcas bsdoms pa'i nyi shu rtsa bzhi'o/_}
