mkha' 'gro lnga'i dkyil 'khor|{dpal 'khor lo bde mchog gi bshad rgyud (rdo rje gur )las rigs bsdus dang rigs rkyang gnyis gsungs pa'i nang gses rigs bsdus mkha' 'gro lnga'i dkyil 'khor ste/dbus su rdo rje mkha' 'gro yab yum/shar du sangs rgyas mkha' 'gro/lho rin chen mkha' 'gro/nub tu pad+ma mkha' 'gro/byang du las kyi mkha' 'gro bcas gtso 'khor lnga yod pa'i dkyil 'khor sde rgyal rtse'i dkar 'khor chos sde'i gtsug lag khang gi steng thog gzhal yas chen mo'i shar ngos kyi dkyil 'khor che ba dang po de yin}
mkha' 'gro bcu gcig|{mkha' 'gro shugs 'gros bcus/gseb lam mkha' 'gro dang bcu gcig go}
mkha' 'gro snying thig|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur rdzogs pa chen po man ngag sde la snying thig skor bzhi (1 bi ma snying thig /2 karma snying thig /3 klong chen snying thig /4 mkha' 'gro snying thig bcas )yod pa'i nang mkha' 'gro snying thig ni brgyud pa'i lo rgyus las gsus pa ltar na/rgyal ba rdo rje 'chang gis rig 'dzin dga' rab rdo rje la gsungs/des rig 'dzin shri sing ha la gan nga/de'i drung nas slob dpon chen po pa d+ma 'byung gnas kyis gsan te mkha' 'a gro ye shes mtsho rgyal la gnang/des phyi rabs kyi don du gter du sbas pa/kun mkhyen tshul khris rdo rje'am gsang mtshan pad+ma las 'brel rtsal du grags pa des dgung lo nyer gsum bzhes pa rab byung lnga pa'i chu glang (1313)lor dwags po dwangs lung khra mo brag nas gter ston par mdzad/karma pa rang yung rdo rje dang/rin chen gling pa/she'i rgyal sras legs ldan pa bcas gsum tsam la gsung rtsom cha tshang bar gnang/de nas rim par brgyud pa'i rnam grangs mang zhing/zhib par stag dge mkhan chen ngag dbang blo gros sam mtshan gzhan gu ru bkra shis su grags pas mdzad pa/yongs grags su (gu bkra'i chos 'byung )du 'bod par lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 240nas 242bar gsal}
