mkha' 'gro ma|{sangs rgyas chos gas kyi gsang sngags kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la sangs rgyas zin pa'i mkha' 'a gro ma ni lhan skyes kyi mkha' 'gro ma dang/gsang sngags kyi lam la zhugs nas rtogs pa'i gnas tshad mthon par slebs pa'i mkha' 'gro ma ni sngags skyes kyi mkha' 'gro ma dang/spyir btang gi bud med phal pa'i rigs kyi nang nas mtshan rtags dang ldan pa'i mkhan 'gro ma ni zhing skyes kyi mkha' 'gro ma yi zhes bshad srol yod}
