mkha' 'gro ma su kha sid+d+hi|{kha che'i yul gyi grong khyer khri brtan bzang mi bdun la rgyags su 'bras bum pa gang las med pa zhig khyim tshang gi rgan mo yin/nyen gcig sprul pa'i dge slong zhig gi byung ba la 'bras bum pa gang po de phul bas/khyim gyi nang mi kun gyis rgan mo khyim nas phun/de dus lo lnga bcu nga dgu lon/de nas u rgyan gyi yul du phyin nas 'bras brnga mkhan tshor 'bras slong pas khal gcig byung ba des 'bras chang bzos nas btsongs pas yang bskyar 'bras mang po byung ste chang bum pa re nam dgos su phul bas/nyin gcig grub chen gyis rgan mor dbang bskur zhing man ngag rnams gnang nas ye shes kyi mkha' 'a gro ma gzhon nur lang tshon ldan zhig tu gyur pa'i lo rgyus yod pa de yin/'di'i lo rgyus (shangs pa bka' brgyud gser phreng )le tshan (ka)pa (mkhas grub khyung po rnal 'byor gyi rnam thar )dbu med bris ma'i shog grangs 17nas 18bar yod}
