mkhas grub khyung po rnal 'byor|{yongs grags kyi mtshan la mkhas grub khyung po rnal 'byor zhes 'bod srol yod/shangs pa bka' brgyud kyi chos srol thog mar dar spel mdzad pa po yin/snye mo ra mangs su yab khyung rgyal stag skyes dang/yum 'gos bza' bkra shis gnyis kyi sras su rab byung dang po'i gong gi drug cu skor dang po'i lcags stag (909)lor 'khrungs/'khrungs ma thag pa'i dus su rgya gar gyi grub chen a mo g+ha badzra byon te bu chung 'dis bstan 'gro'i don rgya chen po byed thub pa zhig 'byung zhes lung bstan mdzad/rus khyung po yin cing/dgung lo bcu nas yi ge 'bri klog dang/skar rtsis mkhas mkhas par mkhyen/yab mes rnams kyi chos lugs bon yin stabs bon gyi slob dpon g.yung drung rgyal bsten nas bon phyi nang gi chos thams cad la mkhas par sbyangs te 'chad spel mdzad pas slob ma yang bdun brgya lhag tsam byung zhing/bon skor gyi sgrub thabs dang/bstan bcos/dka' 'grel sogs kyang mang po brtsams gnang mdzad de/bon la mkhas pa'i grub thob chen por gyur pa na/khong gi thugs la bon 'di rgya gar skad nas tshur bod skad du bsgyur ba ni min par 'dug /mi thams cad kyis khyod chos pa min par bon po yin par 'dug zer nas brnyas smod byas par brten/rgya gar du 'byon dgongs nas gser srang mang po gra sgrig nang bas yab yum gnyis kyis nged gnyis lo na rgas pas ma shi bar rgya gar du ma 'gro gsungs nas ma btang bar brten/gnas skabs ring byon gyi slob ma bu chen mkhas pa rnams la gnyer gtad mdzad/gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi slob dpon byung gnas seng ge la gser dang/dar gos/rta sogs phul nas rdzogs chen gyi chos skor cha tshang bar gsan sgom sgrub dang 'chad spel mdzad pas slob ma sum brgya tsam byung zhing/mtshan snyan phyogs thams cad du khyab par gyur/de nas da dung thugs ma thim par brten slob ma de dag bzhag ste/stod lung shom rar slob dpon skra ni rU pa'i drung du byon nas phyag chen dang do hA sogs mdo sngags kyi chos mang po gsan /da dung thugs blo ma khengs par rgya gar du byon par dgongs nas sru mos g.yu mang po phul ba dang/sa zhing btsongs pa'i rin dang/sngar gyi slob m