mkhas grub dge legs dpal bzang|{(dga' ldan khri thog gsum pa )rje tsong kha pa chen po'i thugs sras gtso bo zhig yin/la stong byang gi sa cha'i ldog gzhung du byang pa bdag po'i dpon rigs yab bkra shis dpal bzang dang/yum bu 'dres rgyal mo gnyis la sras gsum (che ba rje 'di dang/'bri ba ba so chos kyi rgyal mtshan/chung ba bsod nams bkra shis )yod pa'i che ba yi/rab byung drug pa'i shing glang (1385)lor sku 'khrungs/byis pa'i dus nas na mnyam gzhan dang mi ra ba'i khyer rabs kyi rtsal dang mdzad spyod khyad par 'phags pazhig yod pas 'ga' zhig gis mkhas grub lha dbang ba'i skye pa yin par gleng bas mkhas grub ces pa'i mtshan byis pa'i dus nas thogs pa zhig byung/dgung lo bdun la phebs pa lcags lugs (1391)lor gnas brtan 'dul ba 'dzin pa mkhan chen seng ge rgyal mtshan gyis mkhan po dang rgya ma ba yod tan yod kyis las kyi slob dpon mdzad nas dge tshal gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan la dge legs dpal bzang po zhes gsol/mkhan slob gnyis kyi drung nas 'dul ba'i bslab bya rnams gnas nas mig gi 'bras ba bzhin du srung bar mdzad/rje btsun red dma' ba chen po las tshad ma dang/mngon pa gong 'og /phar phyin/dbu ma/'dul ba bcas gsan nas sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa mdzad/bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan dang/lam 'bras pa ye shes dpal ba/paN chen sa bza' gsum las gsang sngags kyi chos skor mtha' yas pa gsan/dgung lo bcu drug pa ra byung bdun pa'i lcags 'brug (1400)lor bo don paN chen phyogs las rnam rgyal gyis sa skya paN chen gyis mdzad pa'i (tshad ma rigs gter )la dgag pa mdzad pa'i lan gnang dgos zhes sa skya'i mkhas pa rnams kyis re bskul zhus pa ltar ngam rings su phebs nas bo dong paN chen la rtsod gleng mdzad/de dus phan tshun rtsod pa mdzad pa rnams mkhas pa mang pos zin bris mdzad pa'i rtsod yig yod/mkhas grub rin po che nyid kyis mdzad pa'i (tshad ma sde bdun gyi dkar gnang gsal bar ston pa yid kyi mun sel )zhes bya ba 'di yang skabs der phan tshun rtsod gleng mdzad pa'i tshig rnams gzhir bzung ste/dgung lo nyer dgu pa chu sbrul (1413)lor nyang stong lcang ra dpal 'bar gyi dgon par bzhugs skabs su mdzad/bo dong paN rin chen po ches kyang rjes su mkhas grub rin po che'i mkhyen dpyod kyi rtsal la thugs lhag par dgyes nas (mkhas grub chos kyi rje dge legs dpal bzang po la ched du brjod pa'i bsngags pa bung ba rnam par rtsen pa'i rgyud mangs )zhes bya ba tshig sbyor phun sum tshogs pa zhig mdzad pa dam pa de'i gsung 'bum du bzhugs/dgung lo nyi shu pa shing sprel (1404)lor rje btsun red mda' ba gzhon nu blo gros kyis mkhan po/mkhas dbang dpal 'byor shes rab kyis las kyi slob dpon mdzad de bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/der rje btsun red dma' ba chen pos mkhas grub rin po che la khyed rje btsun tsong kha pa dang mjal nas bla mar bsten na gzhan dang mi ra ba zhig yod zhes bka' gnang ba ltar dgung lo nyer gsum pa me phag (1407)lor rje tsong kha pa se ra chos sdings su bzhugs pa dang mjal zhing/de ma thag rdo rje 'jigs byed kyi dbang dang man ngag mang du stsal zhing/de nas bzung zhing khams gzhan du ma gshags par thugs rtse chen pos rjes su bzung ste/mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun spyi dang thun mong ma yin pa'i gdams pa yongs rdzogs cha tshang bar gnang zhing/de dag thugs dmas nyams bzhes su mdzad pa'i bogs 'don gyi ched du dam bca' bcu zhes pa mdzad('di zur du bton yod )nas de las nang yang 'da' ba med par sku tshe mtha' 'khyor ba gnang/dgung lo zhe gsum pa me lug (1427 lor rgyal rtse da srid rab brtan kun bzang 'phags kyis rje 'di dang kan mkhyen rong ston pa gnyis rtsod gling mdzad dgos par bskul ma zhus pa bzhis rgyal rtse'i gtsug lag khang du phebs kyang kun mkhyen rong ston pas thabs sna tshogs kyi sgo nas rtsod gleng mdzad mi dogs pa'i 'bad brtson gnang bar ba rten de lugs kyi sbyar yig chen po zhig dpal 'khor chos sde'i rgyal sgo'i thog sbyar bar mdzad cing/de nas dpal 'khor chos sder ma bzhugs par dben gnas me tog dmangs can du phebs te bstan pa'i bya ba mdzad/rje btsun tsong kha pa chen po gdongs pa mya ngan las 'das pa'i rjes su yang dag pa'i snang bar lan lnga yi bar du zhal gzigs te chos gsungs pa'i bkod pa rje gzigs pa lnga ldan du grags pa yang yod/dgung lo zhe bdun pa lcags phag (1431)lor rgyal tsham rin po che dar ma rin chen zur bzhugs mdzad de bka' phebs pa ltar dga' ldan khrir phebs nas mdo sngags kyi bkang yang yang stsal zhing/rje bla ma'i dngul gdung gi dbu thog tu gser zangs kyi rgya phebs thog mar 'bum par mdzad cing/dga' ldan du gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer gyi bshad sgra 'dzugs pa gnang bas 'phel rgyas chen po byung/dgon sde khag mang por gdan 'dren byung yang ma phebs par dga' ldan rang du rgyun bzhugs mdzad nas rang bstan gyi bzhed srol ma nyams par skyong ba'i srog bzung bas slob ma yang grags pa can mang du byung/gsung rtsom skor/phar phyin dang/rnam 'grel/dbu ma bcas kyi rnam bshad dang/(gsang 'dus bskyed rim rnam bshad dngos grub rgya mtsho/) ('jigs byed bskyed rim/) (rgyud sde spyi'i rnam bshad/) (sdom gsum rnam bshad/) (kye rdor rtsa rgyud brtag gnyis kyi rnam bshad )sogs pod chen bcu gsum tsam yod/dga' ldan ri lo brgyad par bskyangs te dgung lo nga bzhi pa rab byung bdun pa'i sa rta (1438)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs/sku gdung zhugs 'bul zhus pa'i gdung na rje tsong kha pa chen po'i skug dang gi g.yon phyogs su bzhugs/rnam thar skor se ra rje btsun chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (mkhas grub thams cad mkhyen pa'i rnam thar )dpar ma la shog grangs 38yod pa dang/paN chen bde legs nyi mas mdzad pa'i (mkhas grub thams cad mkhyen pa'i rnam thar mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog )bris ma la shog grangs 15yod pa/brag g.yab blo bzang bstan pas mdzad pa'i (mkhas grub thams cad mkhyen pa'i rnam thar rin chen 'byung gnas )bris ma la shog grangs 14yod/rnam thar mdor bsdus tsam zhig yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (lam rim bla brgyud rnam thar )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 415nas 436bar yod}
mkhas grub chen po dkon mchog seng ge|{rje 'di nyid rang byung bcu gsum pa'i sa byi (17680lor yab snang ra'i be hu blo gros dang yum snying mo rgyal gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/rje 'jam dbyangs bzhed pa las rab byung dang dge tshul bsgrubs/cho rig thu dpon po'i drung nas yi ge bslabs/de nas gsol dpon gtsang p+saton pa'i nang du bzhugs nas dge rgan du bsten/chos bsam gling gi chos grwar rig lam la sbyangs pas rigs smra rtser son/dgung lo bcu bdun la phebs pa shing 'brug rol rje 'jam dbyangs bzhes pa ma chog gis dbus phyogs su khrid phebs/lha sar klong rdol zla ma rin po che las lam rim che chung gi bshad lung sogs chos bka' gang gnang chag med gsan bzhes mdzad/rigs lam la sngar nas byang zhing 'dzin skyor sbyangs la thugs brtson che bas gsar pa'i dus nas slob gnyer la grags can zhig tu gyur/tre bo dge bshes sangs rgyas bkra shis dang mnyam du phar phyin dang/tre bo dge bshes tshe dbang 'bum dang lhan du 'dul ba'i tshogs gleng yang gnang/smon lam sgra skor skabs p+salob gnyer ba grangs can yin stabs gdan sa gsum dang/rgyud grwa stod smad kyi dge bshes dregs rigs kyis rigs lung brag thog nas chu 'byor ba lta bu byung yang khas len la sus kyi ma gnod pas lha rams pa'i ang dang thon/rgyal dbang 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i drung nas theg chen gtso sbyong gi sdom pa mnos/khri chen rgyal rong ba blo bzang smon lam/khri chen tre bo/dge bshes khyab gdal sogs rtog ldan mkhas grub dum 'i zhabs la gtugs nas 'grel pa bzhi sbrags/sbas don kan gsal sogs gsan cing/klu bum rwa rgod dpon slob don grub dang/dge 'phel gnas brten pa rnam gnyis las nA ro chos drug gi nyams khrid gsan te/lung sbyong rlung sbyong la bslabs/dben sa snyan brgyud kyi gcod thugs nyams su bzhes pas mtshan mo 'gar sgo mang po chos gru'i seng gdong ma'i gnas dang/'bras spungs dur khrod rnams su lus sbyin btang bar gzugs med pa'i lag pa 'dzin la khad lta bu'i snang ba 'khrul med du byung/sa rta (1789)lor dgon par phyir phebs/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa sbrul (1809)lor bkra shis 'khyil gyi gdan rabs nyer lnga pa'i khrir phebs/mdzod dkar rams kyi slob gnyer ma byas pa lo nyung gi rigs gsham du phab nas bsdus chung tshugs/blo rig dman pa rnams dpar dang yi ge bslabs/grwa tshang khag la 'don rta dbyangs/thig rdul tshon/bca' bzo/rol mo 'bud dkrol sogs la gzigs rtogs dang do dam gang zhib/sgrig lam la dag ther sogs mdzad pas 'chad nyan gyi nyin mtshan 'da' ba zhig byung/rje nyid kyis mkhyen yon 'gran zla dang bral rung 'chad nyan gyi brtson pa mi lhod par dam pa mang po zas zab chos mtha' yas pa gsan/gnang 'dus 'jam rdor/'jam dpal gsang ldan/thub pa dam tshig gsum bkod rnams kyi dbang/sgrub thabs rin 'byung/nag po mda' 'geng gi rjes gnang sogs chos bka' mang du gnang/phyogs kyi dgon lag rnams la bla ma las sne bsko gzhag /lha sde gsar sgrig dang sngar yodo sor 'go dpon 'jog 'dzugs kyis mtshon bla brang chen mo'i sku don che phra mtha' dag gi khur babs kyang le shor skad cig kyang med pa gnang/de ltar chos srid kyi sku don grwa zur ma nyams par kun gzigs mchog gi phyag tu phul te tshogs chen khri dang phyag mdzod kyi dgongs pa rim khrol gyis zur bzhugs mdzad/de nas tsha gan po shing sogs yul dgon mang por zhabs kyis bcags te chos kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor/yum lang 'go dpon khag phan tshur 'khor ldang rtsod rnyog gi gling lang 'thab 'khrug sogs byung bar rje gang gi zhi 'dzam la shin tu sman pa byung/dgung lo drug cu la phebs pa me phag (1827)lor gdan sar phyir phebs nas chu 'brug bar lo lnga'i ring bcad rgya mdzad de thugs dam 'ba' zhig gnang/sngar klong rdol rin po che'i ma 'ongs sngon gzigs byung ba ji bzhin rje 'di la stong nyid kyi rtogs pa 'khrungs/mthar rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu sbrul (1833)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su gshegs}
mkhas grub chos rje|{'dir spyir na rje tsong kha pa'i thugs sras mkhas grub rin po che la go rgyu yin na'ang (deb sngon )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs (878nas 5pa'i thog gi mkhas grub chas rje zhes pa de ni shangs pa bka' brgyud kyi bla brgyud gras su bzhugs pa'i mkhas grub shangs ston zhu ba de yin}
mkhas grub thar shul ba dge 'dun chos skyong|{rje 'di ni mdo smad che ji'i klu mkhar du yab rdo rje rab brtan dang yul dpal 'dzoms gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa lcags rta (1810)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun la 'dul 'dzin pa dge 'dun yar 'phel gyi drung nas dge bsnyen dang/bar ma rab byung dge tshul gyi sdom pa rnams dkyus gcag la yang dag par mnos te mtshan dge 'dun chos skyong zhes gsol/dgung lo bcu bzhir bde chen dge logs gling du chos grwar zhugs/dag bsnyen chen po ngag dbang bzod pa yongs 'dzin du bsten nas gzhung chen pod lngar gsan sbyangs mdzad/dgung lo nyi shur rjes ngag dbang bstan 'dzin gyi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyer bzhir rje nyid kyi gdan sa bde chen chos gling gi chos khrir mkha' gsol/de nas gzhung brgya smra ba'i dbang po lha rabs pa byams pa dang rje ngag dbang bstan 'dzin gnyis kyi drung nas lo bzhi'i ring mdo sngags kyi lung gsan/dgung lo nyer brgyad la grub gnas chos lung gser dgon gyi ri khrod du bzhugs nas de'i ring mdo sngags kyi chos mang po nyams len gnang/dgung lo so brgyad la lha sar phebs/de'i phyi lor mdo smad du phyir phebs/dgung lo nga brgyad nas bzung phyag rdzas gang yod gong ma'i grwa tshang dang/'jam mo'i grwa tshang/cog ring/hor rgya'i grwa tshang/mi nyag grwa tshang sogs gsar bzhengs kyi dgos mkhor gtong gnang gis 'dul khang khag nyi shu bzhengs/dgung lo drug cu re gnyis bzhes pa na gong ba'i grwa tshang thos bsam gling du rje btsun blo bzang bstan pa rgya mtsho dang/mnga' bdag lha ri blo bzang 'byung gnas kyi sprul sku rin po che blo bzang bar shis sogs bla sprul kha shas la mdo gas yongs rdzogs kyi dge ba'i bshes gnyen shin tu mang por mdo sde kun gyi gsung bshad gnang/bka' rtsom yang (rnye dpon slob rin chen po blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi rnam thar )dang/(srad brgyud lugs kyi bla ma'i rnal 'byor gyi dmigs khrid skyong tshul mdor bsdus/) (blo sbyong don bdun ma'i khrid yig mdor bsdus don bzang bdud rtsi'i snying po/) (bslab bya sna tshogs skor gdung sel bdud rtsi'i thigs phreng/) ('jigs mdzad dus grwa'i dbang po'i bsnyen sgrub las brtsams pa'i zhal gdams kyi rim pa gsang ba'i snying nor )sogs pod 'bring gcig tsam mdzad/mthar dgung lo bdun cu don lnga la phebs pa rab byung bco lnga bdun cu don lnga la phebs pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing sprel (1884)lor zhi bar gshegs}
mkhas grub dar rgyal ba|{rje 'di ni byang thang lha'i nye logs su yab bsod nams mgon dang yum bkra shis gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/sku chung ngu nas dad pa dang snying rje che ba/sku gsung thugs kyi rten la dga' ba/dge 'dun la gus pa che ba zhig yod/dgung lo drug bdun la yig klog la mkhas par gyur/de nas karma rang byung rdo rje mjal bas dad pa drug po skyes te phyag phyir bde chen snying du byon/karma rang byung rdo rjes mkhan po dang mkhas chen gzhon nu byang chub pas slob dpon mdzad de dgung lo bcu dgu pa la rab tu byung zhing bsnyen par rdzogs/snye mdo ba kun dga' don grub dang/bla ma tshul rin/chos rje grags pa seng ge/bsod nams seng ge la sogs mkhas grub bla ma mang du bsten nas mdo rgyud bstan bcos du ma'i gsan pa rgya cher mdzad/khyad par man ngag la gtso bor gnang ste sgrub pa la thugs gzhol bar mdzad nas ri khrod dben pa rnams su sgom sgrub rtse gcig tu mdzad pas thams cad gus par gyur/rje nyid kyis dbu sngas la mi 'jog cing/rgyab rten la mi ba rten pa chu dang rdo'i dka' thub/rlung sbyor zab mos dus 'dab ba rnams kyis bsgrubs pas nyams myong mang du skyes/de nas thang lha'i ri khrod sogs su'ang yun ring bzhugs/phug mo'i ri khrod du chos rje grags pa seng ge'i zhabs la gtugs nas phyag phyir 'brangs/de nas grub thob chu sgaum pa'i phyag phyir 'brangs te bsnyen sgrub dang/snying thig /mkha' spyod bsnyen sgrub la sogs pa gdams pa bsam gyis mi khyab pa gsan/gnyan khrod kyang mang du 'grims nas cho 'phrul du ma snang ba rnams kyang rtogs pas zil gyis mnan/chos rje grags seng ba la slob ma mang yang ri khrod pa 'di nyid rgyud kyi sras dam par gzigs nas man ngag thams cad rdzogs par gnang/gnas nang gi gdan sar bskos/nA ro'i chos drug dang sbyor drug la sogs pas gdul bya yang dag par bskyangs te smin grol la bkod/byams dang snying rje stobs rgyas pas sdug phongs dang/nad pa/skye bo log par spyod pa rnams la rnag par phan dogs par mdzad/rje nyid kyis sku na gzhon dus nas brtson 'grus drug pas lus srog chos su btang bas tshe stod la dka' thub dang sgrub pa dang du bzhes/nyams rtogs yon tan kyi cha yang ci rigs skyes/sems can la phan pa rgya cher mdzad/mthar glang lo zla gsum par sku gshegs/(rje 'di nyid kyi 'khrungs 'das lo tshigs gsal po med mod/rtogs ldan grags pa seng ge'i slob mar gyur pas spyi lo 1300nang byung bar mngon/)}
mkhas grub nor bzang rgya mtsho|{(lam rim chen mo'i bshad lung )gi bla brgyud gras su bzhugs pa de yin/gtsang gi rta nag rang byung du rab byung bdun pa'i chu yos (1423)lor yam nam mkha' dpal bzang dang yul chos skyabs 'bum gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/dgung lo chung ngu byis pa'i dus nas 'bri klog sogs brda bstan pa tsham gyis dka' tshegs med par mkhyen/dgung lo bcu gsum pa shing yos (1435)lor brag dmar chos sdings su chos rje blo gros mgon pos mkhan po dang/byang sems chos 'phel rgyal mtshan gyis las slob mdzad de rab tu byung/ri khud chos sde'i slob dpon grags pa bzang po'i zhabs la gtugs te gzhung chen po'i slob bsam slob gnyer mthar phyin pa mdzad/'chums bde chen dang chos skor sgang sogs su byon nas stag tshang lo tsA ba shes rab rin chen sogs mkhas pa mang po bsten/mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mi nyung ba gsan/bkra shis lhun por phebs nas rgyal dbang dge 'dun grub (tA la'i bla ma sku phreng dang po )pa'i drung nas lam rim blo sbyong sogs gsan cing/yang bskyar gzhung chen po lngar sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa mdzad de gsung phu sogs gdan sa 'ga' zhig tu grwa skor yang gnang/dgung lo so lnga pa rab byung brgyad pa'i me glang (1457)lor dga' ldan du phebs nas khri chen blo gros chos skyong gi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes te mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang du gsan/dgung lo so bdun pa sa yos (1459)lor 'ol kha rin chen sgang dang/e'i rte'u ra/'ol kha chos lung/rgya sog phu/lha sdings sogs dben pa'i gnas du mar lo bzhi bcu tsam gyi ring thugs dam nyams bzhes rtsa gcig tu mdzad pa la brten nas gsang sngags bla med kyi zung 'jug gi go 'phang brnyes/dad ldan 'ga' zhig la mdo sngags kyi chos bka' yang zhar dang zhor la bstsal pas rgyud 'dzin slob ma yang grags can mang du byung/gsung rtsom skor (dus 'khor spyi don dri med 'od rgyan/) (rtsis kyi rnam bshad pad dkar zhal lung/) ('di yongs grags su phug pa lhun grub rgya mtshos mdzad ces brjod srol yod kyang don du dam pa 'di nyid kyis mdzad pa yin/) (dpal gsang ba 'dus pa'i rdzogs rim rnam bshad rim lnga yang gsal sgron me )sogs 'ga' zhig dpar la 'khod yod/dgung lo go gcig pa rab byung dgu pa'i chu bya (1513)lor gdongs pa mya ngan las 'das/sku gdung ril por bzhugs pa'i 'dra sku 'ol kha rin chen sgang sgrub sde'i rten gyi gtso bor bzhugs shing ngo mtshar ba'i gtam rgyud mang po ngag rgyun dang yig thog tu 'khod yod/lo rgyus rnam thar skor yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (lam rim bla brgyud rnam thar )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 166nas 167bar gsal}
mkhas grub blo gros mi zad pa|{bo dong paN chen 'jags med grags pa'i mtshan gyi rnam grangs gzhan zhig yin/gsham gsal bo dong paN chen phyogs las rnam rgyal zhes pa'i 'grel bshad la gzigs}
