mkhas grub legs chos pa|{'jam dbyangs lags pa chos 'byor/'di'i rnam thar rgyas pa gsham du 'jam dbyangs legs pa chos 'byor gyi skabs su gsal}
mkhas grub shangs ston pa|{shangs pa bka' brgyud kyi bla ma mtshan snyan che ba bdun gyi gras yin/rgyang yang sgang du rab byung bzhi pa'i shing rta (1234)lor yab dkon mchog bzang dang yum jo dge gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/dgung lo brgyad dgu la phebs dus yige 'bri klog sogs dka' tshegs mi dgos par mkhyen/dgung lo bcu gsum pa me rtag 1246)lor slob dpon nyi thog pas mkhan po mdzad de rab tu byung nas mtshan tshul khrims mgon po zhes gsol/slob dpon de nyid dang slob dpon shAkya 'bum gnyis las spyod 'jug dang phar phyin gsan nas dgung lo bco bag+r+yad pa la bshad pa mdzad thub pa byung/gzhan yang (byams chos )dang/(sa sde lnga/) (tshad ma sde bdun/) (dbu ma )sogs gsan nas mkhas pa'i phul tu phyin/chos rje sangs rgyas ston pa'i drung nas shangs pa'i chos skor dang/gzhu brag dmar ba'i bla ma dkon skyabs las gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi snying thig skor bcas gsan/de nas tsA rir phebs te sgrub pa rtse gcig tu mdzad pas grub pa'i go 'phang brnyes/dad 'dus slob ma rnams la chos 'a chad spel yang yang mdzad pas 'jag pa rgyal mtshan 'bul ma sogs pa'i slob ma mang po byung/dgung lo bdun cu don drug pa rab byung lnga pa'i sa bya (1309)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar lo rgyus skor (shangs pa bka' brgyud gser phreng )dbu med bris ma le tshan (cha)par shog grangs 12yod}
mkhas grub shangs ston tshul khrims mgon po|{rje 'di nyid yab dpon po dkon mchog bzang dang yum jo dge gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bzhi pa'i shing rta (1234)lor sku bltams/dgung lo brgyad dgu la phebs skabs yi ge 'bri klog bde blag tu mkhyen/byis pa'i dus nas 'jig rten la skyo shas che zhing rnam dkar gyi las la spro/dgung lo bcu gsum pa la nyi thog pas mkhan po/slob dpon tshu shes gnang nas dge tshul mdzad/mtshan tshul khrims mgon por gsol/slob dpon dang slob dpon shAkya 'bum phar phyin dang spyod 'jug bslabs nas dgung lo bco brgyad pa la de nyid kyi bshad gsar mdzad/de nas tshad ma rnam nges la sbyangs brtson mdzad pas mkhas par gyur te tshad ma'i ston pa bzang por grags/gzhan yang byams chos lnga/sa sde/tshad ma sde bdun/dbu ma rigs tshogs/bslab btus rnams dang gsang sngags kyang mang du gsan/bla ma sa ston lha rin la gsang sngags kyi rgyud sgrub thabs mang bar gsan/g.ya' lung dgon gsar ba'i mkhan po la bka' gdams/mdo por karma pa la khong gi zab chos rnams gsan te mkhas pa'i phul du phyin/rang gi yul gzhis thams bcad btsongs nas yab yum gyi ched du mchod 'bul rgya chen mdzad/sangs rgyas ston pa'i snyan pa gsan tsam gyis mos pa thob ste ri gong du byon nas gdams pa zhus pas snod ldan du dgongs te/ni gu'i skor ma lus pa gnang/nyams myong gis kyang bla ma dgyes te bsngags pa tshad med mdzad/de nas gzhu brag dmar ba'i bla ma dkon skyabs la snying thig gsan pas lta stangs mdzad pa tsam gyis chos nyid mngon sum gyis snang ba rgya chen po shar/tsa rir sgrub pa mdzad nas slob ma mang du byung/de nas 'jug tu bzhugs nas gzhan gyi don rgya chen po mdzad/'jag pa rgyal mtshan sogs rtogs ldan gyi slob ma mang du bskyangs/mthar dgung grangs bdun cu don drug la phebs pa rab byung lnga pa'i sa bya (1309)lo'i bod zla lnga pa'i tshes bco lnga la zhi bar gshegs so/_}
mkhas grub sangs rgyas ye shes|{gtsang rong gi lhan drug brgyar yab dge bsnyen bla ma rin chen dang yum chos bstan zhes bya ba'i sras su rab byung dgu pa'i shing bya (1525)lor 'khrungs/yab yum de gnyis la sras bzhi yod pa'i chung ba yin/byis pa'i dus nas mdzad spyod ngo mtshar ba yod cing mtshan la chos skyabs rje zhes btags/ba gso lhun grub bde chen dgon du dge bshes yon tan bzang po las dge tshal gyi sdom bzhes te mtshan la sangs rgyas ye shes zhes gsol zhing/dge bshes de'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos mi nyung ba zhig gsan/dung lo bco lnga pa sa phag (1539)lor bkra shis lhun por chos zhugs mdzad de re zhig bzhugs/de nas rje btsun chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyi dngos slob rta nag dge 'dun blo bzang gi zhabs la gtugs te gzhung chen po lnga'i slob mthar phyin par mdzad/dgung lo nyer drug pa lcags kyi (155)lor mkhan chen dge 'dun blo bzang gis bskor gzhag gnang ba ltar bkra shis lhun po'i dge bskos kyi khur bzhes te/dge 'dun rnams chos khrims dang zang zing gnyis ka'i sgo nas skyong bar mdzad/de nas mkhan chen de nyid kyis bka' slob gnang ba ltar dben dgon du phebs nas grub dbang dben sa blo bzang don grub kyi zhabs la gtugs te gdams pa 'ga' zhig gnas nas dbu phyogs su phabs te rgyud smad gra tshang du zhugs nas lo ngo gnyis tsam ring rgyud 'grel gyi bshad pa dang/cho ga phyag bzhes phra rags thams cad thugs su chud pa dang/byang chub par mdzad de gtsang phyogs su phyir phebs/dben dgon du byon nas grub dang bden pa sa chen po'i drung nas lam rim dang blo sbyong gi khrid gsan te nyams bzhes dang myong ba thon par mdzad/rje de nyid kyis lung bstan pa ltar shangs mdo ri bo dge 'phel nu byon nas mkhan chen phyogs las rnam rgyal bas mkhan po dang/slob dpon dge legs pas las kyi slob dpon mdzad de dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes shing/gzhan yang chos bka' 'ga' zhig gsan te slar yang dben dgon rang du rub pa nyams bzhes gtso bor mdzad pas nyams rtogs kyi mthar song/dben sa pa chen po'i drung nas dam pa de nyid la bzhugs pa'i mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun yongs su rdzogs pa gsan cing/de nas dben sa pa chen pos bka' nan phebs pa ltar re zhig shangs mdo ri bo dge 'phel gyi mkhan po'i khrir 'khod nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang du bstsal/dgung lo zhe gcig pa rab byung dgu pa'i shing glang (1565)lor grub dbang dben sa pa chen po sku gshegs rjes sgrub khang de la gzhi byas te dben sa dgon pa gtsug lag khang dang/gtsang khang/mgon khang/bla brang dang bcas pa gsar bzhengs mdzad de gtsang khang gi nang grub dbang dben pa sa chen po'i sku dmar gdung gi 'dra sku bzhengs te bzhugs su gsol/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtsho gtsang phyogs su phebs pa dang stabs 'grigs nas rab gnas la gdan drangs/de nas sman thang lha bris pa blo bzang rgya mtsho la bka' gnang nas khong dpon slob rnams kyis 'dul khang gi ldebs bris 'gran zla bral ba bzhengs/de nas lo mang ring dben dgon du bzhugs te slob brgyud rnams chos dang zang zing gnyis kyi sgo nas skyong bar mdzad/dgung lo nga brgyad pa chu rta (1582)lo'i gzhir ka bsam 'grub rtse nas re bskul zhus pa ltar slar yang shangs mdo ri bo dge 'phel gyi mkhan po'i khrir phebs te lo lnga'i bar bskyangs/de nas dben dgon du phyir phebs mdzad de sku tshe tha ma'i bar rgyun bzhugs mdzad/dad 'dus slob ma rnams la rang rang gi re 'dod dang 'tshams pa'i mdo sngags kyi chos rnams sku mtshams kyi bar gseng dang bstun nas bstsal/gsung rtsom yang (bla ma'i rnal 'byor skor )dang/(lam rim/) (gcod )kyi skor sogs phyogs bsgrigs pod chen po gcig yod/dgung lo'i bdun pa rab byung bcu pa'i lcags yos (1591)lor rong byams chen du phebs nas der sku gshegs/sku gdung dben dgon du gdan drangs nas zhugs 'bul zhus par rten ngo mtshar can mang du byon pa rnams gdung rten rnam rgyal mchod rten zhig bzhengs pa'i nang du bzhugs/rnam thar lo rgyus skor paN chen rin po che blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (mkhas grub chen po gsum gyi rtogs brjod )kyi shog grangs 34nas 51bar yod pa dam pa de'i gsung 'bum pod ka pa'i nang bzhugs}
mkhas brgyud|{de'i go don ni bstan pa phyi dar gyi skabs spang gong ye shes g.yung dang gis grum ye shes rgyal mtshan rab tu byung nas mkhan slob kyi grwa steng sdom rgyun spel ba'i gnas gzhi btsugs pa rnams 'dul khrims shin tu dam pas btsun brgyud ces brjod pa/snubs dpal gyi byang chub dang/an 'bar ba byang chub gnyis kyis mkhan slob kyi grwa logs su btsugs te dge 'dun gyi ched du zhing rmo ba/nor phyugs bdag gnyer byed pa/nyo tshong dang/bu lon gtong ba/srid don gyi las kar zhugs pa bcas byas pa des nang bstan chos lugs la 'phel rgyas la phan thogs chung yang ming la mkhas brgyus ces su grags pa'i lo rgyus (nel pa chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 36nas 37bar gsal bas der gzigs (bod ljongs dpe skrun khang nas 1983lor dpar skrun byas pa'i (myang chos 'byung )deb gzugs grangs 153 phreng 5 pa'i nang mkhan brgyud ces bcos nor byung ba las ma yig ngo ma'i nang mkhas brgyud ces yod pa de rang legs}
mkhas pa|{spyir mkhas pa zhes pa'i go don ni sa skya paN chen gyis mdzad pa'i (mkhas pa la 'jug pa'i sgo )las/mkhas gang shes bya'i de kho na/_/ji bzhin rtogs pa yin par 'dod/_/bye brag sbyangs pa'i don shes pa/_/de yang de la mkhas par yin/_/zhes gsungs pa ltar mkhas bya rig pa'i gnas che ba dang chung bar sbyangs shing/'chad pa dang/rtsod pa/rtsom pa gsum ka'ang gang rung zhig la mkhas pa ni mkhas pa yin cing/de gsum gyi nang nas 'chad pa ni sla zhing/de las rtsom pa dka' ba dang/de las kyang rtsom pa dka' ba ste/rtsom pa ni gang brtsam bya'i gzhung don rnams rang gis legs par sbyangs shing dogs pa bcad de go ba cha tshang ba lon pa zhig med na rtsom yig 'bri ba'i skabs mi 'dor ba sogs rtsom tshul yang ma dag pa'i skyon bco brgyad kyis gos par 'gyur bas rtsom pa la mkhas pa'i mkhas pa nyung ba'i gnad kyang der thug yod/yang mkhas pa zhes pa'i go don p+sagar yangs pa'i dbang du byas te bshad na/rang nyid kyis gang bslabs pa de legs par sbyangs shing shes pa zhig la'ang zer chog ste/de ni sna gcig la mkhas pa zhes zer zhing/rnam mang bslabs shing legs par shes pa/rnam gcig la sbyangs 'bras mthar phyin pa'i mkhas pa/der bstod bsngags dang mthong chen byed 'os zhig go}
mkhas pa sgo drug|{tA ra nA tha'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )las gsungs pa gzhir bzung na/rgyal po mahA pA la'i bu che ba sre Sh+Ta pA la yin cing/des rgyal srid bzung nas lo gsum song mtshams su 'das shing bu chung ba b+he ya pA la lo bcu bdun las ma lon pas rgyal po'i zhang po brang ze tsa na kas lo nyi shu rtsa dgu (bod kyi rab byung gong gi drug cu skor dang po'i sa stag 978lo nas me rta 100lo )bar srid dbang bzung ba de'i ring rgyal gar gyi nang bstan chos lugs kyi gzhi gi che gras bi ram la shI la zhes pa'i gdan sa der rgyun du mu stegs pa 'ong nas nang pa'i paN+Di ta dang rtsod pa byed kyi yod pas gal te rtsod pa pham na nang pa'i gnas gzhi dang/lha khang sogs phrogs pa ma zad/sa gnas de dang gzhan dag la yod pa'i nang pa thams cad chos lugs mu stegs par bsgyur du 'jug gi yod par brten bi kA ma la shI la'i lcags ri'i phyogs bzhir sgo srung mkhas pa chen po re dang/dbus su ka chen gnyis bcas sgo srung drug re bsko gzhag gnang srol byung zhing/1 shar sgo srung ba paN chen rat+na a ka ra shan+ti zhes pa bod skad du rin chen 'byung gnas zhi ba/2 lho sgo gsung ba pradz+nya ka ru gup+ta ste sher byung sbas pa/3 nub sgo srung ba ngag gi dbang yug grags pa/4 byang sgo srung ba paN chen nA ro pa bcas dang/5 dbus kyi ka chen dang po brang zer rin chen rdo je/6 dbus kyi ka chen gnyis pa dz+nyA shrI mi tra bcas kyis mdzad pa yin/paN+Di te de rnams kyi lo rgyus mdor bsdus gsham gsal rang rang so so'i mtshan gyi skabs su gsal bas der gzigs/gzhan yang mkhas pa sgo srung drug ces kyang brjod srol 'dug }
mkhas pa chen po mtsho sna ba|{gsham gsal mtsho snang pa shes rab bzang po zhes pa'i 'grel bshad la gsal}
mkhas pa chen po dz+nyA na shrI|{rgya gar gyi nang pa'i gnas gzhi che gras bi kA ma la shI la'i dbus kyi ka chen gnyis pa yin/rab byung dang po'i gong gi drug cu skor dang po me yos (967)lo nas rab byung dang po'i dkyil lcags stag (1050)lo bar gyi dus skabs der byung/jo bo rje a ti sha'i sku drin che ba'i bla ma'i gras yin/rgya gar gyi shar phyogs gauT yul du 'khrungs/thog mar theg pa chen po'i chos khas me len pa'i nyas tho sen+d+ha pa'i rub mtha' 'dzin par mdzad kyang/rjes su theg pa chen po'i chos la thugs dad 'khrungs nas mgon po klu sgrub dang/'phags pa thogs med kyi gzhung rnams la mkhas par sbyangs shing gsang sngags kyi rgyud sde rigs mi 'dra ba mang po mkhyen pa'i paN+Di tar gyur/mngon shes thogs med mnga' bas 'byung 'gyur 'phral 'phrul du lung ston par mdzad/mnga' ris su bstan pa phyi dar 'go tshugs rjes bod du yang byon/slob dpon 'dis mdzad pa'i (mtha' gnyis sel ba )zhes pa zhig yod tshul (rgya gar gyi chos 'byung )'dir gsungs pa (sde dge bstan 'gyur gyi dkar chag )nang btsal kyang ma rnyed pas bstan 'gyur gyi dpe gzhan zhig tu yod dam brtag }
