mkhas dbang ngag dbang chos grags|{mkhas dbang 'di nyid ni stod lung g.yu thog khang gsar zhes par rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags byi (1900)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo chung ngu'i dus nas chu bzang dgon par chos zhugs gnang/lha sa lcags po rir gso rig slob sbyong mdzad/me 'brug (1916)lor lha sa sman rtsis slob grwa gsar 'dzugs thog mkhas dbang mkhyen rab nor bus lcags ri grwa tsang gi dbu 'dzin gcig lcogs gnang skabs lcags po ro'i khongs nas sman slob gsum bsdus pa'i khungs su tshud/chu sprel (1932)lor lha sdings mda' dpon dang mnyam du chab mdor phebs nas bod dmag dmag sgar zhig gi sman pa lo lnga drug tsam gnang/sa stag (1938)lor lcags po ri'i sman pa'i dge rgan du lcags ri'i dpal ldings gzhis 'dzin dang rgyal zur rwa sgreng gi bla sman pa gnang zhing/me sprel (1956)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu bzhi pa'i bla sman pa dang rtse ga las tshan rim pa lnga pa'i go gnas thob/sa phag (1959)lor lha sa sman rtsis khang du gdan zhus kyis sman bcos las don nang bzhugs/chu stag (1963)lor sman rtsis khang gi dbu 'dzin gzhon pa dang grong khyer lha sa srid gros kyi u yon gnang/de skabs rang nyid kyi thun mong ma yin pa'i nyams myong (pho nad bcos thabs )zhes pi rtsom sgrig mdzad/de rjes sman rtsis khang gi dbu 'dzin gzhon pa'i thog gtso bcos dge rgan sman pa'i lag rtsal kho ming yang bzhes mur dgung grangs brgyad cur phebs pa bod rang byung bcu drug pa'i lcags bya 1981)lor zla 8tshes 3 la dgongs pa rdzogs so/_}
