mkhas btsun rgyal mtshan 'bum|{shangs pa bka' brgyud gyi bla chen mtshan snyan che ba zhig yin/rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags bya (1261)lor shangs kyi khong lam rtsa thang du yab phyug po chos skyong btsan dang yum dbyangs mo gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/chung ngu'i dus yi ge 'bri klog gzigs pa tsam gyis mkhyen 'i rtsal phun sum tshogs pa zhig yod/dgung lo bcu gnyis pa chu sprel (1272)lor bla ma shar pa kun dga' seng ge dang bla ma steng khang pa gnyis kyi drung nas rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/de nas bla ma steng khang pa dang slob dpon kun dga' 'bum gnyis kyi las phar phyin/sa skyar bla ma 'jam dbyangs pa dang/slob dpon kun dga' dpal las kye rdor/rong pa shes rab seng ge las dus 'khor sogs gsan/snga phyir bla ma bcu phrag tsam las mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun grangs las 'das pa gsan cing/mkhas grub thang ston pa las shangs pa bka' brgyud kyi chos skor mtha' ga cha tshang bar gsan/phyag tu yod pa'i dngos po thams da spong thag la btang nas sgrub pa nyams bzhes rtse gcig tu mdzad pas nyams rtogs gzhung nas bshad pa ltar thugs rgyud la 'khrungs/de nas slob ma dad 'dun rnams la gang 'tshams pa'i chos bka' bstsal gtso bor thugs dam nyams bzhes kho nas su sku 'khyor bar mdzad cing/shangs chos kyi khrid yig dang chog sgrog sogs yig cha mi nyung ba zhig ched rtsom gnang/dgung lo don bzhi pa rang byung drug pa'i shing khyi (1334)lor sku gshegs /rnam thar lo rgyus skor (shangs pa bka' brgyud gser phreng )dbu med bris ma le tshan (ja)par shog grangs 14yod}
mkhas btsun chen po nam mkha' legs pa|{sa skya'i gdung rgyud bla brang khag gzhi (1 gzhi thog blang brang/2 rin chen sgang bla brang/3 lha khang bla brang/4 dus mchod bla brang )byung pa'i nang gser gzhi thog bla brang gi gdung rgyud dang po yin/yab bdag nyid chen po bzang po dpal dang/yum glang mtsho'i na spe ma gcig nam mkhan rgyal po gnyis kyi sras su rab byung lnga pa'i shing sbrul (1305)lor 'khrungs/sras gsum mam bzhi yod pa'i che ba yin/gzhon nu'i dus nas mkhyen rab kyi rtsal che zhing gsung rtsom yang mi nyung ba zhig mdzad yod/yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma ko sa li gu thug rgyal pos bkwan ting go shrI go gnas dang shes dam gnang/gzhi thog bla brang gi bdag por bzhugs thog /dgung lo nyi shu pa rab byung lnga pa'i shing glang (1325)lor sa skya'i gdan sar phebs te lo bcu dgu'i ring chos dang zang zing gnyis kyi sgo nas bskyangs/dgung lo so drug pa rab byung drug pa'i chu lug (1343)lor gzhi thog bla brang tu sku gshegs/lo rgyus mdor tsam bdag chen a myes ngag dbang kun dga' bsod nams kyis mdzad pa'i (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 254nas 255bar gsal}
mkhas btsun mi drug|{sngar bod du bstan pa phyi dar skabs bar khams khul du thog mar dge tshul dang dge slong gi sdom pa gnang thub mkhan dmar gtso gtsang gsum lta bu mkhan slob tshad ldan bzhugs yod kyang/kha skong las gral du phebs mkhan dge 'dun kha grangs longs pa med stabs de'i ring zog po mi drug (1 'al rdo rje dbang phyug /2 snubs dpal gyi dbang phyug /3 spang gong ye shes g.yung drung/4 cog ro shes rab byang chub/5 shong chung pa shes rab grags pa/6 an 'bar ba byang chub bcas )gis grwa chas tsam gyon pa las sdom pa med pa'i grwa gzugs yin stabs zog po mi drug ces thogs shing/rjes su dge 'dun gyi kha grangs longs pa rnyed nas bla chen dgongs pa rab gsal gyis mkhan po gnang nas khong drug por dge tshul slong gi sdom pa gnang rjes mkhas btsan mi drug ('al dang snubs gnyis ni mkhan pa yin pa dang/spung dang cog ro gnyis mkhas btsan gnyis ldan/shong dang an 'bar gnyis btsun pa yin )ces brjod pa yin tshul (myang chos 'byung )du gsal zhing/(nel pa paN+Di ta'i chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i grangs 36nas 14bar gong gsal chos 'byung gi bshad tshul dang cung zad mi mthun pa yod cing/gang ltar chos 'byung de gnyis kas thog mar zog po mi drug ces 'bod pa de phyis su mkhas btsun mi drug tu gyur ba'i bshad tshul mthun par yod pa ma zad/yongs grags su dbus gtsang mi bcus bla chen dgongs pa rab gsal gyi drung nas sdom pa zhus pa'i bshad tshul nor 'khrul yin par bzhed pa gcig mthun du yod}
mkhas btsun gzhon nu grub|{shangs pa bka' brgyud bla ma mtshan snyan che ba zhig ste/myang smad kyi gcung pa yu ba gdong du yab rgyal po tshe 'phel dang yum rgyal mo phye 'dren gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/'khrungs lo mi gsal/dgung lo bcu lon pa na snar thang gi mkhan chen mchims nam mkha' grags kyi drung du rab tu byung/mkhan chen chu mig pa grags pa brtson 'grus bsten nas gzhung chen po lnga la sbyangs te mkhas par gyur cing dgung lo nyi shu lon pa na mkhas chen nam mkha' grags kyi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs bzhes/snga rjes su 'gro mgon 'phags pa rin po che dang sa skya'i dge shes mkhas pa khag sogs bla ma brgyad cu rtsa gsum tsam bsten nas bod du bzhugs pa'i mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun gang yod gsan/gtso bor chos rje sangs rgyas ston pa'i drung nas shangs pa bka' brgyud kyi chos skor yan lag dang bcas pa yongs su rdzogs pa gsan nas nyams bzhes mdzad pas thugs rgyud kyi rtogs pa mthon par phebs/rjes su bla ma'i bka' lung bzhin myang ston smad gnyis kyi mtshams pa snam jo mo lha ri'i mgul du bsam sdings dgon pa btab nas der zhugs te lam 'bras dang/phyag chen/ni gu chos drug sogs chos mang du gsungs pas slob ma grangs las 'das pa byung/bu ston rin po ches (phar phyin gyi Tik+ka )mdzad pa'i lo ste sa lug (1319)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar lo rgyus mdor bsdus (deb ther sngon po )ru 'khod pa de 'dir bkod pa lags}
