mkhyen rab nor bu|{sman rtsis mkhas dbang mkhyen rab nor bu mchog ni lho kha rtsed thang khul bya sa lha khang gi nye 'debs su yab rtsi rig smra ba krang mgo leb bam rtsis pa rnga bo cher grags pa dang/yum dbyangs can gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu lug (1883)lor sku bltams/chung dus rtsed thang lnga mchod grwa tshang du chos zhugs gnang/dgung lo bcu bzhi yas mas su dgos pas drag 'dems kyis lha sa lcags ri 'gro phan gling du gso rig slob gnyer du mngags/thog mar lcags po ri grwa tshang gi smad dge ngag dbang chos ldan gyi drung nas sman gzhung gsan sbyong gi dbu tshugs pa nas bzung slob gnyer la 'bad pa lhur len gyis nyin mtshan kun tu dga' ba drug po spyad de zas gos sogs la dang dod spu tsam mi gnang bar na bza' hrul por gyur kyang thugs snang gtan nas med par yon tan sbyong ba kho na la thugs brtson mdzad cing/de nas ring por ma thogs pa sman gzhung thugs 'dzin dang tshogs 'don chos spyod sogs kyi rgyugs 'bul sbyangs 'bras legs thob la brten/rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pa chen po'i sku'i bla sman dgos gzhi byams pa thub dbang mchog gi rgyud 'dzin slob grwa ba'i khongs su bdams tshud byung bas/mkhas mchog de las dpal ldan gso ba rig pa'i rgyud bzhi dang/gzhung 'grel bai sngon la sogs pa sman gyi gzhung lugs mang po'i lung 'khrid man lag lag len dang bcas par sbyangs brtson mthar phyin par mdzad/snga rjes su mkhan dbang 'tsho byed rdo rje rgyal mtshan dang/'jam dpal rol pa'i blo gros/'bras ljongs bla ma o rgyan bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho/'gu log bla ma 'jam dpal rol pa'i blo gros/mtshan nyid sprul sku 'jam dpal nor bu/'bras spungs khang gsar rin po che/pha bong kha bde chen snying po/lha btsun rin po che/rong thang chu tshang blo bzang dam chos sogs rtsod med mkhas dbang du ma las gso rig dang/snyan ngag /rgyud bzhi/dus kyi 'khor lo/g.yu thog snying thig /bai dkar bu dpe'i tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho'i 'khrungs rtsis thog nas tshe rabs las rtsis dang/bag rtsis/gshin rtsis/dbyangs 'char 'grel pa/dpal sgron steng nas le'u bcu ka'i 'khor lo bcas kyi khrid