'khor ni legs gnas|{sangs rgyas kyi 'khor rnam pa bzhi legs par gnas pa ste cha tshang bar yod pa la zer/de yang rgya gar dang rgya nag tu dge slong pha ma gnyis dang dge tshul pha ma gnyis bcas cha tshang bar yod kyang bod du dge slong pha dang/dge tshul pha ma gnyis/dge slong slob ma bcas bzhi ma gtogs dge slong ma med pa yin/de'i rgyu mtshan ni bod sa gnas kyi rab byung cha rkyen la brten nas bod rigs bud med rnams dge slong ma'i sdom khrims cha tshang bar srung mi thub pa'i dbang gis dge slong gi sdom pa zhu mkhan med pa ma zad/bod du nang pa sangs rgyas kyi chos lugs dar rgyas byung ba nas bzung da bar bod rigs bud med kyi dge slong gcig kyang byung ma myong ba yin pa las bod du bud med kyis dge slong byed mi chog ces pa'i khrims thog gi gtan 'bebs med}
