'khor ba'i nyes dmigs drug|{sdug bsngal drug la gzigs}
'khor ba'i sdug bsngal brgyad|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bden pa bzhi'i nang nas sdug bsngal gyi bden pa 'chad skabs 'khor ba'i sdug bsngal brgyad yod de/1 skye ba'i sdug bsngal/2 rga ba'i sdug bsngal/3 na ba'i sdug bsngal/4 'chi ba'i sdug bsngal/5 dgra dang phrad pa'i sdug bsngal/6 gnyen dang bral ba'i sdug bsngal/7 'dod pa'i dngos po btsal kyang ma rnyed pa'i sdug bsngal/8 'dod pa'i sdug bsngal thog tu babs pa'i sdug bsngal bcas yin/zhib phra'i 'grel bshad (lam rim gyi khrid yig )khag las gsal}
'khor ba'i sdug bsngal drug|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bden pa bzhi'i nang gses sdug bsngal bden pa 'chad skabs 'khor ba spyi'i sdug bsngal la drug gsung la yod pa ste/1 nges pa med pa'i nyes pa/2 mongs pa med pa'i nyes pa/3 lus yang yang 'dor dgos pa'i nyes pa/4 yang yang nying mtshams sbyor dgos pa'i nyes pa/5 yang yang mtho dman du 'gyur ba'i nyes pa/6 grogs med pa'i nyes pa bcas yin/de dag gi go don dang 'grel bshad (bka' gdams lam rim )dang rje tsong kha pa'i (lam rim che chung )sogs las gsal}
'khor ba'i sdug bsngal gsum|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bden pa bzhi'i nang gses sdug bsngal bden pa 'a chad skabs sdug bsngal gsum gyi rnam grangs yod pa ste/1 sdug bsngal gyi sdug bsngal/2 'gyur ba'i sdug bsngal/3 khyab pa 'du byed kyi sdug bsngal bcas yin/de rnams kyi go don dang ngos 'dzin skor (lam ring gyi khrid yig )khag gang nang rgyas par gsungs yod pas de dag la gzigs}
'khor ba'i rtsa ba gcig pu|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bden pa bzhi'i nang gses kun 'byung bden pa 'chad skabs las kyi kun 'byung dang/nyon mongs pa'i kun 'byung gnyis yod pa dang/kun 'byung de gnyis kyi rtsa ba mthar thug sa ni rang rgyud kyi phung po lnga la dmigs nas nga'o snyam du rang ngos nas grub par 'dzin pa'i gang zag gi bdag 'dzin dung chos thams cad rang ngos nas grub par 'dzin pa'i chos kyi bdag 'dzin gnyis yod pa de gnyis ka bdag 'dzin ma rig pa yin par mtshungs shing/bdag 'dzin de la brten nas nyon mongs dug gsum 'byung ba dang/de la brten nas las ngan bsags te 'bras bu sdug bsngal sna tshogs myong dgos pa de byung ba dang/bdag 'dzin de gnyis spangs na nyon mongs thams cad bcom nas 'khor ba las dus gtan du thar thub pa yin zhes gsungs srol yod/zhib par (dbu ma'i tshig cha )khag dang lam rim gyi khrid yig )khag rnams las gsal bas de dag la gzigs}
'khor ba'i rtsa ba drug|{1 'dod chags/2 khong khro/3 nga rgyal/4 ma rig pa/5 lta ba nyon mongs can/6 the tshong nyon mongs can}
'khor ba'i gzhi gcig pu|{bdag 'dzin lhan skyes kyi ma rig pa'o/_}
'khor ba'i lam gsum|{nyon mongs pa'i lam/las kyi lam/sdug bsngal gyi lam}
'khor mo 'jig|{'bri gung skyob pa rin po ches mdzad pa'i (thub ba'i dbang po'i bstod pa )las 'khor mo 'jig pa'i yul du bdud rnams btul/_/zhes gsungs pa ltar na ga ya'i grong khyer zhes yongs grags su rdo rje gdan zhes 'bod pa der ngos 'dzin dgos pa ltar snang zhing/de min dpyad gzhi gzhan da phan ma mjal}
'khor zhag|{de sngon bod du dgon pa khag dang/slob grwa khag gi bca' yig dang/sgrig yig nang gsal ba'i dgongs pa zhu gnang gi tha snyad cig ste go don ni/lo dang zla ba zhag sogs dus tshong ring thung gi grangs bcad nges gtan zhig gi ring dgon pa dang slob grwa nas dgongs pa zhus te phyogs gzhan du song ba la zer}
