'khor yug gi ri bdun|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags (dus 'khor )nas bshad pa'i ri rgyal lhun po'i mtha' skor du gling bdud re'i bar du rgya mtsho re dang/rgya mtsho'i re'i phyi rol tu ri re bcas nang nas phyir rim pa bzhin ri bdun yod pa ste/1 'od sngon can gyi ri/2 man d+ha ra'i ri/3 ni Sha Ta'i ri/4/nor bu'i ri/5 dro Na'i ri/6 bsil ri/7 rta gdong gi me ri bcas yod par gsungs pa de yin}
'khor re|{bod kyi btsan po'i gdung rgyud gras 'od srung gi brgyud pa mnga' ris phyogs su mched pa'i sras mgon gsum (1 rig pa mgon/2 bkra shis mgon/3 lde gtsug mgon )byung ba'i 'bring po bkra shis mgon la sras gnyis (srong nge'am mtshan dngos drang srong lde dang 'khor re'am mtshan dngos 'khor lo sde bcas )yod pa'i chung ba yin/(deb dmar )las mgon gsum gyi che ba kra shis lde dang/'bring ba dpal lde rig pa mngon yin pa dang/bkra shis mgon la sras gnyis kyi che ba 'khor re dang/chung ba srong nge yin par bshad/(lde'u chos 'byung )khag gnyis las mgon gsum gyi che ba dpal mgon gyi sras gnyis byung ba'i che ba 'khor re yin par bshad/(yar lung chos 'byung )dang/(rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )deb ther dpyid kyi rgyal mo'i glu dbyangs )las las nyi ma mgon gyi sras gsum las chung ba lde gtsug mgon la sras 'khor re dang srong nge gnyis byung bar bshad pa sogs mi 'dra ba kha shas 'dug kyang/'dir kha thog rig 'dzin chen po tshe dbang nor bus mdzad pa'i (bod rje lha btsan po'i gdung rabs tshig nyung don gsal )las gsungs pa de rang khungs mtshan par bsams nas bkod pa lags/lha sras 'khor res jo bo'i dngul sku de bzhengs/de min gyi lo rgyus gzhan dag da phan ma mthong lags}
