'khor lo sdom chen|{'di dus kyi 'khor lo sdom pa chen po zhes pa de yin/'di'i lha grangs dang mngon rtogs bkod pa'i dpyad gzhi lag tu ma son cing/dbang gi cho ga ni jo nang tA ra nA tha nas rim bzhin brgyud pa'i sgrub thabs sa skya mkhan chen blo gter dbang pos gsar bsgrigs gnang ba la shog grangs 26dang (de'i dkyil chog dbang bcas bdud rtsi'i chu rgyun )mkhan chen de nyid kyis gsar bsgrigs gnang ba la shog grangs 28babacas (smin grol kun btus )pod (tsa)pa'i nang bzhugs/yang a ma chog sku gong ma dkon mchog bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (dus kyi 'khor lo sdom pa chen po'i sgrub thabs rigs ldan zhal lung )la shog grangs 54dam pa de'i gsung 'bum pod (kha)pa'i nang bzhugs/yang (dpal dus kyi 'khor lo sdom pa chen po'i dkyil 'khor gyi cho ga dngos grub rin chen 'dren pa'i shing rta )la shog grangs 26dang de'i (sbyin sreg gi cho ga dngos grub char 'bebs )la shog grangs 14de'i (tshogs mchod bde chen myu gu bskyed pa'i char rgyun )la shog grangs 5 bcas a mchog rin po che 'jam dbyangs mkhyen rab rgya mtshos mdzad pa dam pa de'i gsung 'bum pod (ka)pa'i nang bzhugs yod}
