'khrungs skar dus chen|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs lo ltar tA la'i bla ma'i sku'i 'khrungs skar 'phel ba'i mdzad chen la rtse pho brang dang/nor gling pho brang yangs steng so sor mdzod chung nas grwa sgrig zhus pa ltar rgyags rngan lha bsang dang/'khrungs lha'i gsol mchod/sku'i khams dang mthun pa'i dbu lcog gsar du sgron 'dzugs zhus/yab gzhis sku 'khor rnams nas snga dro gzims chung du nang ma'i rten gsum mjal dar phul/drung bzhes tshugs/gsol ja/bzhes 'bras phebs/bka' shag dang/rtse mgron yan nas rgyun chas kha gsar thog rtse pho brang du gzims chung dga' ldan yang rtse dang/nor gling du bzhugs skabs mtsho dkyil lhun grub dga' tshal du bzhugs khri bde stan thog tA la'i bla ma bzhugs 'khod kyis sku'i yongs 'dzin rnam gnyis nas sku'i tshe rdzas 'bul gnang gis dbu gtugs mdzad/mdzod chung nas yongs 'dzin rnam gnyis la mgul dar dang/rtse phyag nas nam rgyu spu phrug bcas 'bul gnang mdzad de bzhugs zhabs 'khod/bka' blon rnam pas mtshon nang ma yan gyis rgyun chas kha gsar thog nas go 'babs kyi mjal dar dka' gtsang re phul te mjal kha zhus/phyag srung brtsal te mtsho dkyil pho brang la zhabs ba skor dang 'brel nyi 'od du phebs/phebs p+sago bzhes sgro da gsol ja gnyis pa phebs te drung bzhes grol/yab gzhis skur 'khor rnams nas nor gling mgon po khang du gnas gzigs bskang 'phar 'phrin bcol dang 'brel nor gling nas chibs hrag dang bcas lha sa'i shar phyogs 'khrungs lha zhes pa'i mgon khang dang/mtha' bskor gling kha yod sa der phebs te 'khrungs lha'i gsol mchod rgyas la tshugs yod pa bzhis dbu lcog gsar sgron dang 'brel lha rten rnams la gos sa mchog gi thugs smon snyan dar dang/rgyal ba'i yab yum sku 'khor dang bcas pa nas snyan thar 'bul gnang mdzad de de ga'i spro khang du phebs/rtse phyag las khungs nas sku 'khor rnams lag zhung gnas kyi gsol tshigs gzab rgyas nyin gcig dang/yab gzhis sku ngo rnam pas gzhung zhabs ser skya las tshan yan la gsol mgron gnyis stsal skabs sku mgron rnams na/sa 'byor 'phral rgyal ba'i yab yum la bkra shes bde legs zhu ba dang chag