'khrungs rabs|{nang pa sangs rgyas chos lugs thog mar gsar gtod mdzad pa po ston pa sangs rgyas kyi 'khrungs rabs ni/sku tshe sngon mar slob pa lam gyi gnas skabs su rgyal sras byang chub sems dpa'i spyod pa phar phyin drug la slob pa dang yang sku tshe sngon mar gzhan la gnod pa byas pa'i gnas tshul bcas skyes rabs kyi rnam thar bka' 'gyur nang kha thor nas yod pa rnams slob dpon dpa' bos phyogs gcig tu bsdus par mdzad pa (skyes rabs so bzhi pa )dang/der ma 'dus pa'i (skyes rabs sum cu rtsa lnga pa )slob dpon seng ge zhabs 'bring bas mdzad pa/(skyes rabs dpag bsam 'khri shing )chos rgyal dge ba'i dbang pos mdzad pa sogs bstan 'gyur de dge dpar ma'i pod (hu)(u)(ka)(kha)(ga)bcas pod lnga yod pa dang/jo bo rje a ti sha dang/'brom ston pa gnyis kyi 'khrungs rabs (bka' gdams bu chos )kyi nang rgyal po gsal ba nas rgyal po skyabs sbyin par le'u nyi shu rtsa gsum gyi sgo nas jo bo rje dang 'brom ston pa gnyis 'khrungs rabs mang po'i ring yab dang/yum/sras/dge ba'i bshes gnyen sogs kyi rnam par bstan nas 'bral med du 'khrungs pa'i lo rgyus gsungs yod pa gzhir bzung nas tA la'i bla ma rin po che dang/paN chen rin po che'i 'khrungs rabs rim byon gyi lo rgyus bsgrigs yod pa dang/bod du bla ma'i yang srid ngos 'dzin zhu ba'i lam lugs ma byung gong du yang 'khrungs rabs ngos 'dzin gyi srol yod mus yin/de nas karma zhwa nag pa'i sku phreng gnyis pa karma pak+shi rab byung lnga pa chu lug (1283)lor sku gshegs nas de'i phyi lor karma pa rang byung rdo rje sku 'khrungs shing/de nas lo ngo lang song ba rab byung lnga pa'i sa byi (1288)lor grub chen o rgyan pa sogs slob ma 'ga' zhig la nga rang skye ba sngon ma de dang de yin/nga rang ni karma pa yin zhes sogs sngon gnas rjes dran mang po gsungs par ba rten nas karma pa'i 'khrungs rabs ngos 'dzin zhu srol byung zhing/sku phreng da po mgon po klu sgrub kyi slob ma pradz+nya a lang+ka/gnyis pa slob dpon mtsho skyes kyi slob ma kA ma d+he nu/gsum pa grub chen d+harma b+ho d+hi/bzhi pa rgyal po kha srong lde btsan gyi blon po 'khon rgyal ba mchog dpyangs/lnga pa bka' gdams kyi dge bshes po to ba/drug pa karma pa sku phreng dang po yongs grags dus gsum mkhyen pa nas/de lta'i karma pa sku phreng rim byon ni klong rdol bla ma ngag dbang blo bzang gi gsung 'bum lcags dpar ma deb gnyis pa'i shog grangs 390nas 393bar gsal ba 'phags pa spyan ras gzigs nas tA la'i bla ma sku rang bag+r+yad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i bar sku phreng lnga bcu nga brgyad bgrangs par mdzad 'dug /paN chen rin po che'i sku phreng ni/yongs grags su 'phags pa'i gnas brtan rab 'byor nas g.yung ston rdo rje dpal bar bcu dang/de thog slob dpon chen po pad+ma 'byung gnas/jo bo rje a ti sha/mnyam med dwags po lha rje bsnan pas bcu gsum/mkhas grub rin po che dge legs dpal bzang nas da lta'i paN chen rin po che p+saku phreng bcu bcas bsdoms pa'i 'khrungs rabs nyi shu rtsa gsum yod pa dang/gzhan yang 'bum lcags dpar ma deb gnyis pa'i shog grangs 393nas 403bar 'on rgyal sras rin po dang/nag shod stag phu rin po che/kong po de mo ho thog thu/gung ru rta drung rin po che/khal kha rje btsun dam pa/kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa/lcang skya rol pa'i rdo rje/zi ling stong 'khor rin po che/brag g.yag skyabs mgon ho thog thu/brag g.yab chung tshang ho thog thu/chab mdo 'phags pa lha ho thog thu/chab mdo zhi ba lha ho thog thu/lcags ra ho thog thu/chab mdo rgya ra rin po che bcas kyi sku phreng so so'i mtshan tho tsam gsal ba der gzigs}
'khrungs rabs dpag bsam 'khri shing|{rgya gar gyi snyan ngag mkhan po rgyal po dge ba'i dbang pos mdzad pa'i (skyes rabs dpag bsam 'khri shing (la zhe sa byas pa'i mtshan yin/'di la le'u zhes pa'i tshab tu yab 'das ces smros pa'i yab 'dab brgya dang brgyad yod pa las/gsham gyi le'u gcig ni sras zla ba'i dbang pos kha skong mdzad pa yin/de sngon sa skya'i 'gro mkhan 'phags pa rin po che sog yul nas bod du phyir phebs thengs dang po'i skabs shong lo tsA ba rdo rje rgyal mtshan la bka' gnang ba ltar/rgya gar du lo mang ring slob gnyer mdzad nas phyir phebs skabs paN+Di ta la k+Shim ka ra bod du gdan drangs te/mang yul skyid grong gi 'phags pa lha khang du rgya gar skad nas bod skad du bsgyur nas sa skya'i gtsug lag khang du zhus dag mdzad/de rjes rab byung brgyad pa'i nang zhwa lu lo chen chos skyong bzang pos skad gnyis shar sbyar gyi sgo nas sla yang dag par mdzad/de rjes tA la'i bla ma ska phreng lnga pa'i skabs 'dar pa lo tsA ba ngag dbang phun tshogs kyis rin spungs ngag dbang 'jigs grags kyis phyag dpe rgya skad bod skad gnyis ka yod la khungs gtugs te zhus dag gnang ba rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing sbrul (1665)lor dpar skrun mdzad/(skyes rabs dpag bsam 'khri shing )gi nang don ston pa sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyi sku tshe 'di dang sngon rabs gtso bor byas pa'i zhar la 'brel yod gzhan dag gi lo rgyus bcas snyan ngag gi tshig sbyor la brten nas brtsams pa yin pas 'grel bshad med na go dka' bar brten/dpang lo tsA ba blo gros brtan pas mdzad pa'i mchan 'grel dang rin spungs ngag dbang 'jigs grags kyi mdzad pa nag mchan/lha rgya ri ba'i rigs sras lha 'jig rten dbang phyug gis mdzad pa'i dmar mchan/rin spungs ngag dbang 'jigs grags kyis mdzad pa (dpag bsam 'khri shing gtum rgyud dpag bsam 'bras bu )bris ma shog grangs 204dang/(dpag bsam 'khri shing gi snyan tshig gi don bkrol ba mthong ba don ldan )mdzad byang mi gsal ba dpar ma la shog grangs 223/mkhas dbang pad+ma chos 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (rtogs brjod dpag bsam 'khri shing las byis pas go bde bar bkod pa )lcags dpar ma shog grangs 525bcas yod/'khrungs rab dpag bsam khri shing gi ldebs bris skor/da yod kyi dpyad gzhi'i yig cha gzhir bzung nas/rab byung bdun pa'i shing sbrul (1425)lor rgyal rtse sde srid rab brtan kun bzang 'phags kyis rgyal rtse gtsug lag khang lte ba'i steng thog gi bar khyams/yal 'dab gnyis pa/dpal gyi sde'i rtogs brjod dang/yal 'dab bzhi pa/rgyal po nga las nu'i rtogs brjod/yal 'dab bdun pa/bu mo mu tig 'khri shing gi rtogs brjod/yal 'dab brgyad pa/khyim bdag dpal sbas kyi rtogs brjod/yal 'dab dgu pa/khyim bdag me skyes kyi rtogs brjod/yal 'dab bcu bzhi pa/chos 'phrul bstan pa/yal 'dab bco lnga pa/rgyal byed tshal yongs su bzung ba/yal 'dab nyer bzhi pa/rgyal po thams cad sgrol/yal 'dab nyer dgu pa/glang chen nor skyong btul ba/yal 'dab sum cu pa/ka shi mdzes dga'/yal 'dab zhe gcig pa/rgyal po u tra ya na/yal 'dab zhe gnyis pa/khyim bdag bu mkhas pa/yal 'dab zhe dgu pa/khyim bdag glang po skyong/yal 'dab nga gnyis pa/rgyal po bsod nams mi dman pa/yal 'dab nga gsum pa/rgyal bu legs bshad tshol/yal 'dab nga drug pa/klu ba lang skyong btul ba/'al dam nga dgu pa/rgyal sras ku nA la/yal 'dab re bdun pa/khye'u dge 'dun srung/yal 'dab brgya dang bzhi pa/rgan ring gong du bkur ba/yab 'dab brgya dang brgyad pa/rgyal po sprin gyi bzhon pa bcas yab 'dab nyi shu rtsa gnyis bdams nas bkod pa rnams/sman lugs kyi lha bris mkhas pa rdo rje rgyal pos bris pa de ni dpag bsam 'khri shing gi ldebs bris snga shos yin pa dang/de nas lo so dgu song rjes rab byung brgyad pa'i shing sprel (1964)lor gong dkar rdo rje gnad pa kun dga' rnam rgyal gyis gong dpar chos sde'i dgon pa phyag btab nas de'i 'du khang gi ldebs bris su mkhyen brtse chen mo'i phyag bris dpag bsam 'khri shing gi ldebs bris bkod pa phun sum tshogs pa yod tshul ka thog si tu rin po che chos kyi rgyal mtshan mdzad pa'i (dbus gtsang gnas yig )las gsungs/gzhan yang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i dus su 'bras spungs tshogs chen 'du khang rgya bskyed thog /shar nub kyi ngos gnyis la 'khrungs rabs dpag bsam 'khri shing gi ldebs bris cha tshang 'bri gnang mdzad pas mtshon gdan sa gsum gyi grwa tshang khag dang/lha sa gtsug lag khang/ra mo che/bkra shis lhun po/mdo smad kyi gdan sa bkra shis 'khyil dang/sku 'bum byams pa gling/rong po dgon chen sogs rims med grub mtha' khag gi dgos sde che ba rnams kyi 'du khang gi ldebs bris su dpag bsam 'khri shing gi bkod pa 'bri srol dar rgyal chen po byung/dpag bsam 'khri shing gi thang ka'i skor/'bri gung mthil du sman thang pa'i bris rnying dpag bsam 'khri shing gi thang ka ngo grangs nyi shu rtsa lnga byas pa spus legs shig yod tshul si tu rin po che chos kyi rgyal mtshos mdzad pa'i (dbus gtsang gnas yig )las gsungs shing/tA la'i bla ma rin po che sku phreng lnga pa dang/bdun pa/brgyad pa bcas kyi skabs dpag bsam 'khri shing gi thang ka tsha chang re re bzhengs gnang mdzad pa dang/lhag par du ka thog si tu rin po che chos kyi 'byung gnas mchog sku na phra mo'i dus nas ri mo'i phyag rtsal la byang chub par brten dgung lo so gnyis pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags phag (1732)lor dpag bsam 'khri shing gi thang ka ngo grangs nyi shu rtsa lnga yod pa gtso thang ma gtogs gan dag gi dbus su thub dbang gi sku brnyas mi dgos par mdzad thog nang don dang mthun pa'i mi'i gzugs brnyan rnams bod bris kyi 'a bri srol gzhir bzung yul ljongs kyi bkod pa rnams rgya rigs kyi 'bri srol ltar nye che ring chung dang/snang mun gsal 'gram gyi 'bur thon ri mo'i sgyu rtsal bde spyod mdzad pa'i thang ka 'gran zla bral ba de dag deng sang ma nyams par bzhugs pa de bzhin (1991)lor si khron mi rigs dpe skrun khang nas 'grel bshad dang chags cig lcags dpar mar dpe skrun gnang 'dug /lo grangs zhib cha mi gsal yang pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis snar thang bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur dpar brkos grub rjes/skabs der bod du yod pa'i sman thang pa'i lugs kyi 'bri rtsal mkhas pa 'dems sgrub thog dpag bsam 'khri shing gi thang ka'i shing dpar ngo grangs nyi shu rtsa gsum yod pa zhig dpar skrun byas te snar thang dpar khang chen mor bzhag par brten/dgon sde khag nas ras kyi gzhil btul ma'i thog snag tshas dpar 'debs byas rjes tshon bris byas pa'i thang ka ha ngang mang po ris med dgon sde khag la dar khyab yung yod cing/snar thang gi dpar shing de rig gsal gyi las 'gul skabs rtsa med song yod kyang de la dpar 'debs byas te tshon btang ba'i thang ka ni 'bras spungs grwa tshang gsum dang/se ra'i grwa tsang gnyis/lha sa gtsug lag khang bcas kyi nang deng sar mjal rgyu yod}
'khrungs rabs lha khang|{de yang 'khrungs rabs ces pa skye ba snga ma rim byung gi lo rgyus te skyes rabs kyi zhe sa yin cing/sku phreng rim byon gyi 'dra sku rnams bzhugs pa'i lha khang la 'khrungs rabs lha khang zhes zer/dper na pho brang pho ta la'i nang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng rim byon gyi 'khrungs rabs 'dra sku bzhugs pa'i lha khang la cha mtshon na dbus g.yas g.yon nas rim bzhin jo bo dang/sman bla bde gshegs brgyad/'khrungs rabs rags bsdus bcas yod pa ste/g.yas dang po nang gser lhad med la phyi rgyal dngul gyis gtums pa'i ngo bo shAkya mu de'i 'dra sku/g.yas gnyis pa sman bla/g.yas gsum pa mtshan legs /g.yas bzhi pa rin chen zla ba/g.yas lnga pa gser bzang dri med/g.yas drug pa mya ngan med mchog /g.yas bdun pa chos grags rgya mtsho/g.yas brgyad pa mngon mkhyen rgyal po/g.yas dgu pa shAkya thub pa bcas dang/g.yon dang po tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa/g.yon gnyis pa spyan ras gzigs sems nyin ngal gso/g.yon gsum pa nga btsan sgam po/g.yon pa 'brom ston pa/g.yon lnga pa sku phreng dang po dge 'dun grub/g.yon drug pa sku phreng gnyis pa dge 'dun rgya mtsho/g.yon gsum pa srong btsan sgam po/g.yon bzhi pa 'brom ston pa/g.yon lnga pa p+saku phreng dang po dge grub /g.yon bdun pa sku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtsho/g.yon brgyad pa sku phreng bzhi pa yon tan rgya mtsho/g.yon dgu pa tshang cher blo gsal rgya mtsho bcas dang/rgyab ngos su lha khang gi thog tshad dang mnyam pa'i sku dga' ra ba'i nang du rgya shog dmar po'i ngos gser bris byas pa'i bka' 'gyur cha tshang gcig dang/de bzhin rgya shog sngon po dngul bris dang/dkar po zangs bris/ljang khur mtshal bris byas pa'i bka' 'gyur cha tshang re re bcas bka' 'gyur cha tshang lnga/rgya shog kar por mtshal bris byas pa'i ba stan 'gyur cha tshang gcig bcas bka' bstan gnyis bsdoms par pod bdun brgya brgyad cu gya brgyad/gzhan yang sman/rtsis/bon chos/rje tsong kha pa yab sras kyi gsung 'bum/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng rim byon gsum 'bum bcas bsdoms pod chen dgu bcu go gsum bcas khyon pod chen brgyad brgya bdun cu lhag yod pa rnams bod mi rigs kyi gsung rab yi ger 'bri ba'i lag rtsal gyi chu tshad 'dzam gling gi khyon la ngoms chog pa sha stag yin cing/de lta nyams chag gtan nas ma song bar bsdad yod}
'khrungs lha|{spyir na skyes sa'i yul lha ste skye lha'i zhe sa yin cing/gzhan yang de snga lha sa'i shar ngos rnga chen don gcod khang khongs su 'khrungs lha zer ba'i grong tsho zhig yod pa de ni rgyal dbang bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i 'khrungs lha rma chen spom ra'i gsol yul sa gnas yin la/der lha khang yod pas phan bde legs bshad gling gis dge 'dun zhig bca' bzhugs mdzad nas lo ltar gzhung phyogs kyis shar khul du 'khrungs pa'i rgyal dbang na rim gyi 'khrungs lha gsol yul du gyur yod}
'khrul ba bdun|{phyi rol gyi yul nye bar gnas pa'i cha rkyen 'og rang nyid kyi dbang po bslad pa la brten nas khrung snang sna tshogs byung ba ste/de la rigs bdun yod/1 dbyibs la 'khrul ba ni/mgal me yar du bskor ba las 'khor lo 'khor ba lta bur snang ba/2 kha dog la 'khrul ba ni mkhris nad can la dung dkar po ser por snang ba dang/rlung nad can la gangs ri sngon por snang ba lta bu yin/3 bya ba la 'khrul ba ni gru nang du bzhugs pa'i thag nye ring gi ljon shing 'gro bar snang ba lta bu yin/4 grangs la 'khrul ba ni mig gi dbang po'i nus pa kha 'thor ba'i rkyen gyis nam mkha'i zla ba gcig zla ba gnyis su snang ba lta bu/5 ngo bo la 'khrul ba ni mig gi dbang po'i nus pa nyams pa'i rkyen gyis bar snang nas skra'i nyag ma 'dzag par snang ba ltar ba yin/6 dus la 'khrul ni rmi lam gyi skabs su nam phyed na nye ma shar bar snang ba lta bu yin/7 bongs tshad la 'khrul ba ni rtsa dang chu med pa'i mya ngam yi thang du rgyang ring po bltas pa'i tshe gong du chung ngu yang chen por snang ba lta bu yin}
'khrul ba'i rtsa ba sems las byung|{'dod chags dang/zhe sdang/gti mug /ngar 'dzin sogs 'khrul ba'i rtsa ba sems de nyid las byung zhes pa'o/_}
'khrul byed rgyu bzhi|{'khrul snang skye ba'i rgyu bzhi ste/1 'khrul rgyu yul la yod pa ni/gong gsal mgal me myur du bskor ba las 'khor lor snang ba lta bu yin/2 'khrul rgyu gnas la yod pa ni gru nang du zhugs nas thag nye ring gi ljon shing 'gro bar snang ba lta bu/3 'khrul rgyu rten la yod pa ni/mig gi dbang po'i nus pa kha 'thor ba dang nyams pa'i rkyen gyis zla ba gcig nyid zla ba gnyis su snang ba dang/bar snang nas skra'i nyag ma 'dzag par snang ba lta bu/4 'khrul rgyu de ma thag rkyen la yod pa ni mkhris nang can la dung dkar ser por snang ba dang/rlung nad can la gangs ri sngon por snang ba lta bu bcas yod}
'khrul zhig sbyor grol|{de ni 'jig rten chos brgyad kyi 'khrul snang zhig pa'i mdzad pa la go dgos pa ste (rdo ring rnam thar )zi khron gyi lcags dpar ma stod cha shog grangs 581phreng 13)nang lhag don skyabs rje sems dpa' gong mas 'khrul zhig sbyor grol gyi mdzad pa thugs nyams su bzhes par brten zhes bod kyi sprul sku rnams gsum (1 'on rgyal sras rin po che/2 'ol kha sle lung rje drung rin po che/3 lo sems dpa' rin po che )gras lo sems dpa' rin po che sku phreng brgyad pa blo bzang bshes gnyen grags pa rnam rgyal mchog gis sle lung rje drung rin po che dang 'dra bar rig ma sna tshogs shig bsten pa gnang zhing/da dung nam bka' grwa chas mdzad bzhin du chang bzhes pa dang/skabs me mda' gzhung bsnams te ri dwags brngon par phebs pa sogs ni 'jig rten chos brgyad kyi 'khrul snang zhig pa'i mdzad pa yin tshul skabs der dag nang can gyi mi tshos dad pa byed pa dang/mang che bas sems dpa' smyon pa zhes 'phya smod skur 'debs byed kyi yod pa der zer}
'khrul zhig rin po che|{bar bde gshegs chen po shes rab 'od dang/yum mkhar chu'i rnal 'byor ma byang chub sgron ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bzhi pa'i chu lug (1223)lor sku bltams/mtshan d+harma seng ge zhes btags/dgung lo bdun pa la bya ba'i rim pa'i tshogs mang du mkhyen/snye mdor bde gshegs chen po'i drung du klog dang kha 'don la sbyangs/de nas yum yar gyis slob gnyer byed du ma ster bar rta phyugs 'tshor bcug /rje 'di nyid byis pa'i dus nas chos thams cad rmi lam sgyu ma lta bur go/gang la yang zhen chags med pas rang gi zas gos su dga' ba la ster bas 'khrul zhig tu mtshan thogs/dgung lo bcu gnyis pa la yab kyis phur bu'i stod las kyi dbang bskur/sgrub pa la bcug ste bsnyen pa la 'bad pas rtags khyad par can byung/dug phur nag po'i lag len sogs dang phur bu'i lugs rgyas par gsan/dgung lo bco lnga pa la dge bshes kun dga' dang grub thob spyi bde ba las mngon rtogs rgyan dang dam rma lugs sogs gsan/nye shu rtsa dgu pa la rtse ba nga du bzhugs nas thang dbus pa sogs bu slob mang du bskyangs/snye mdo thams cad mkhyen pas gdan sa skyong dgos pa'i zhu nan mdzad pas/sum cu pa la ri khrod du bzhugs nas gdan sa bskyangs/so gnyis pa la 'bri gung du byon nas rje spyan snga nas dang lha dkon mchog 'phel bas rab tu byung/zhes gcig pa la stong lung dang mkha' chur byon nas gzhan don mdzad/zhe gsum pa la grub thob me long rdo rje la sogs pa yang gdams pas tshim par mdzad/de bzhi pa la rang gi sras sgrub pa po phag mo gru nas bos te ri khrod du gdan sar bskos/zhe dgu pa la spyan snga 'tshal ba ri khrod du bskos/dgung lo lnga bcu nga gcig nas lo sum cu so gcig ring bar zur stod du thags dam 'ba' zhig mdzad/mthar dgung grangs brgyad cu rgya gcig la phebs pa rab byung lnga pa'i chu yos (1303)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim/'di la sras p+lang byung ba ste/che ba sgrub pa po sangs rgyas rin chen/gnyis pa spyan snga dpal chen/gsum pa dus gsum mkhyen pa/bzhi pa spyan lnga 'tshal bar shAkya rgyal mtshan/lnga pa mkhan chen tshul khrims rgyal mtshan bcas so/_}
'khrul zhig seng ge rgyab pa|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi bstan 'dzin chen po zhig /'khrungs 'das kyi lo khams gsal bar ma rnyed/gu ru jo 'ber slob ma dang/grub chen me long rdo rje'i bla ma yin/g.yo ru gra'i phu so gad 'phrang du yab bkra shis dngos grub dang yum dpal le gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/dgung lo dgu nas chos phyogs la dag snang dang mos gus che/dgung lo nyi shu pa la mkhan po lde'u sgang pa dang/slob dpon bkra shis snang ba gnyis las rab tu byung/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa lnga pa la gri zhal du slob dpon seng ge rgyab pa bar pa'i drung du tshal pa bka' brgyud kyi chos skor rnams gsan/gzhan yang bla ma tsA ri ba dang/ras pa dri med 'od/lha ri dpal/gzhon nu 'bum/slob dpon jo sras la sogs pa mang por bsten nas zhi byed dang/phyag chen/gsang sngags gsar rnying la sogs pa'i chos skor mang dug nas/gtso bor gu ru jo 'bel gyi drung nas rdzogs chen snying thig gi chos skor cha tshang ba gsan nas mi med lung stong dang ri khrod kha/ga tu gnas nges med kyi sgo nas lo mang po'i bar nyams bzhes sgom sgrub mdzad/slob ma chung shas la snying thig gi chos skor dar spel gnang/dgung lo drug cu re bzhi par sku gshegs/rnam thar lo rgyus skor (deb sngon )lcags dpar ma deb dang po'i shog grangs 243nas 244bar dang/(gu bkra chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 207nas 21bar gsal}
