ga rong tshul khrims 'byung gnas|{'di la yongs grags su steng pa lo tsA ba zer zhing/bka' 'gyur gyi mdo phyogs phal che ba'i lung rgyun gnas nas bod du dar spel mdzad pa po yin/yab steng pa tog 'bar dang/yum mda' mo bu skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung gnyis pa'i me phag (1107)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bco lnga pa lcags glang (1121)lor myang stong du rgya 'dul 'dzin gyi drung du rab tu byung/mchims thams cad man pa'i drung du phar phyin slob gnyer mdzad/dgung lo bcu dgu la rgya 'dul 'dzin gyis mkhan po dang/gnyal pa dge 'dun skyabs kyis slob dpon mdzad de bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/de nas mi ring bar bal yul brgyud rgya gar du byon/rdo rje gdan du tsa mi lo tsA ba sangs rgyas grags bzhugs pa dang mjal nas gong gi drung du lo bcu bzhugs/de nas yab gshegs pa gsan nas dgongs rdzogs sgrub ched bod du phebs/yab kyis bzhengs 'phror lus pa'i 'bum rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum gyi mjug skyong mdzad rjes/gser srang lnga bcu tsam bsnams te rgya gar rdo rje gdan du phebs/tsa mi sangs rgyas grags sku gshegs zin nas ma mjal yang p+saku gdung la mchod 'bul mdzad/thems 'dir rgya gar du lo lnga bzhugs pa'i ring/paN+Di ta si ga ta bir wa/dA sa b+ha la shri sogs paN+Di ta bcu gsum bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyunamatha' yas pa gsan/kha che'i paN+Di ta spyan gsum pa'i slob brgyud a lang+ka de ba bod du gdan drangs/rgya dpe mi khur mang po longs pa bsnams nas (sgrub thabs bsdus pa chen po ('dul ba rang gi rnam bshad/) (nyi khri gzhung 'grel/) (skyes rabs so bzhi pa/) (dus 'khor rtsa rgyud/) (gsang 'dus 'phags skor dang lang+ka de ba'i lugs )sogs gsar 'gyur bcos mang du mdzad/slar yang rgya gar du byon sa lo gsum ring (bye brag tu bshad pa chen mo )la slob gnyer mdzad/de'i rgya dpe bod du gdan drangs nas bod skad bsgyur gnang mdzad mus su/sum chu gnyis tsam bsgyur zin skabs paN+Di ta sku gshegs pas bsgyur 'phror lus ('di'i dpe deng sang ma rnyed pa shing tu phangs )paN+Di ta'i dgongs rdzogs la chos khri bzhi bcu zhe brgyad tsam brtsigs nas chos 'khor chen mo zhig mdzad/kun mkhyen 