ging chen po tshangs pa|{yongs grags su la mo tshangs pa zhes 'bod pa ste de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gis bsten gsol byed pa'i srung ma'i gtso bo lnga (1 lha mo dmag zor ma/2 gnas chung rdo rje grags ldan/3 dga' gdong gdon sbyin shing bya can/4 la mo tshangs pa/5 bsam yas gnod sbyin tsi'u dmar po )yod pa'i nang gses shag yin cing/paN chen rin po che sku phreng rim byon gyis kyang bsten gsol gnang ba'i srung ma'i gtso bo'i gras su yang yod/'di'i mngon rtogs dang gsol mchod ni kha byang du (lha mchog srid gsum gyi bdag po tshangs pa chen po'i gsol mchod kyi rim pa don yod 'phrul gyi zhabs pa )zhes 'khod pa/paN chen rin po che p+saku phreng drug pa dpal ldan ye shes kyis mdzad pa'i zhig (rtse rnam rgyal grwa tshang gi zhal 'don phyogs bsgrigs )pod gnyis pa'i (dza)rtags can grangs 23nas 30bar yod/tshangs pa drag po ni yongs grags bse khrab par 'bod pa de yin pa dang/tshangs pa zhi ba ni t+pam chog ngang pa la zhon zhing/g.yas su sher gri dang g.yon du nor gzhung dang zhags pa 'dzin pa zhig yod/zhi drag gnyis sku'i rnam 'gyur mi 'dra ba las ngo bo gcig yin/lo rgyus thog shod srol la lo tsA ba chen po rngo blo ldan shes rab (rab byung dang po'i sa phag 1059lo nas rab gnyis pa'i sa glang 1109lo bar/) rab byung gnyis pa'i chu sprel (1092)lor rgya gar nas bod du phyir phabs mdzad skabs chos skyong 'di lo chen gyi rjes su 'brangs nas gsang phu dgon par gnas chags pa da nga/de nas bzung gsang phu dgon pa dang/rwa ba stod dgon pa gnyis kyi dge 'dun 'dus tshogs nam yin la lo chen blo ldan shes rab kyi bstod pa (yongs grags su (blo bstod )zer )chag med du gsung srol yod pa ma zad/chos skyong 'di nyid sku rten par khog zhugs byed pa'i skabs su yang (blo bstod )nges par du 'don srol yod/chos skyong 'di'i mngon rtogs dang gsol mchod skor/kha byang du (gnod sbyin chen po bse khrab can la mchod gtor 'bul tshul )zhes pa tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa rin po ches mdzad pa zhig (rtse rnam rgyal grwa tshang gi zhal 'don phyogs bsgrigs (pod gnyis pa'i (dza)pa shog grangs 21 nas 23