gu ge|{gu ge rgyal rabs chags yul gyi sa gnas zhig yin pa'i thog /rgyal yongs kyi rig dngos srung skyob da tshan khongs su gtogs pa dang/mnga' ris sa khul gyi ha cang gal che'i gna' rabs 'dzugs skrun gyi chags shul gras shig kyang yin/deng sang bod rang skyong ljongs kyi rtsa mda' rdzong khongs su yod/gna' rabs kyi ming rnying par zhang zhung zer zhing/bod kyi btsan po'i rgyal rabs ma tshugs gong gi zhang zhung rgyal rabs kyang sa gnas 'dir chags pa yin/rgya yig gi lo rgyus yig cha rnying pa'i nang yang thung {(WP:1,194)}zhes 'khod/de skor gyi tshig 'grel gsham gsal zhang zhung zhes pa der gzigs dgos/gu ge ni mngar ris khul lho nub phyogs su yod cing/nub dang/lho/byang ngos bcas rgya gar nang kasmi ra dang sa 'brel yin pa dang/spu hrengs rdzong dang 'brel yod/gling chen kha babs chu bo'i dkyil rgyud du gnas shing/rdzong yongs kyi sa cha'i rgya khyon spyi le gru bzhi ma 22500dang/mi 'bor 4549(1983lo yod pa'i nang mang che ba bod rigs yin cing/zhing las mi 'bor bsdoms grangs 2904dang/sa zhing gi rgya khyon mu'u 11800tsam yod pa des mi grangs bsdoms 'bor gyi brgya cha 63dang grangs chung 8zin/'brog las mi 'bor 727tsam yod pa des mi grangs bsdoms 'bor spyi'i brgya cha 16zin/nags tsham gyi rgya khyon mu'u 400lhag tsam yod pa des mnga' ris sa khul yongs kyi nags tshal rgya khyon spyi'i bzhi cha gcig zin/sa skya'i dgon pa 12/bka' brgyud dgon pa 20/dge lugs dgon pa 35/bon po'i dgon pa 1/chos lugs nges gtan med pa'i dgon pa 1bcas yod pa dang/dgon pa gzhan dag la grwa pa dang a ne grangs 'bor ji yod dpyad gzhi ma rnyed kyang/bod ljongs zhi ba'i bcings 'grol thob rjes rdzong gnyis zla sgril btang ste rtsa mda' rdzong zhes rdzong rim pa'i srid 'dzin sa khul btsugs pa red}
gu ge rgyal po|{mnga' ris gu ge'i khul du srid dbang bzung ba'i rgyal po zhig ste/bod na gnas su rgyal po glang dar mas lcags bya (841)lor nang bstan bsnubs pa'i rjes nas/de'i sras 'od srung dang yum brtan gnyis lo mang ring srid dbang phrogs res kyi dmag 'khrug byas shing /de nas sa glang (869)lor bod sa gnas yongs sug zhi rgya che ba'i 'bangs gyen log byung mthar mnga' bdag dpal 'khor btsan rang lo so gcig pa shing yos (895)lor 'bangs gyen log gis rgyal rtser bkrongs/sras che ba skyid lde nyi ma mgon mnga' ris dang sras chung ba ri bkra shis ba rtsegs pa dpal la stod du bros/skyid lde nyi ma mgon gyis mnga' ris skor gsum du dbang bsgyur/de la sras gsum (1 dpar gyi mgon/2 bkra shis mgon/3 lde gtsug mgon )byung/rgyal pos sras gsum so sor rang rang gi srid 'dzin mnga' khongs su bgos nas gnas bas yongs grags su mnga' ris skor gsum zer/de yang sras che ba dpal gyi mgon la mar yul la dwags gnang ste srid dbang bzung bas la dwags kyi rgyal brgyud byung/'bring po bkra shis mgon la gu ge ste zhang zhung gnang bas de nas gu ge'i rgyal brgyud byung/chung ba lde gtsug mgon la mang yang gung thang gnang bas de nas gung thang rgyal brgyud byung ba yin/rgyal brgyud dang po dang/gsum pa gsham gsal ming tshig so so'i thang du bkod yod cing/skabs 'dir gu ge'i rgyal rabs kyi brgyud pa mdor bsdus su bkod na/rgyal po nyi ma mgon gyi sras 'bring po bkra shis mgon ni gu ge'am zhang zhung gi rgyal rabs rjes ma'i rgyal po dang de yin cing/rgyal po de la sras che ba srong nge'am mtshan gzhan drang srong lder grags pa dang/chung ba 'khor re'am mtshan gzhan 'khor lo lder 'bod pa gnyis byung/sras che ba p+sarong nges rab byung ma gnang gong la srid dbang bzung zhing rab tu byung rjes lha bla ma (rgyal rigs las byung ba'i rab byung zhes pa'i don yin pa las gnam gyi lha'i go don min )ye shes 'od zhu ba de yin/khong na rab byung gong gi lo rabs dang po'i sa lug (959)loral 'khrungs nas dgung lo don brgyad pa rang byung dang po'i me byi (1036)lor sku gshegs par ka thog ring 'dzin tshe dbang nor bus gzigs myong ba'i (gung thang rgyal rabs )rnying pa zhig nang 'khod ces gsungs/skyid da nyi ma mgon mnga' ris su bris pa'i shing yos (895)lo nas lha bla ma ye shes 'od 'khrungs pa'i lo rab byung gong gi lo rabs dang po'i sa lug (959)lo rab lo drug cu re bzhin yod pa de'i ring lha bla ma'i mes po skyid lde nyi ma mgon dang/yab bkra shis mgon gnyis kyis srid dbang bzung bar snang/gu ge'i rgyal rabs gnyis pa lha bla ma ye shes yod la sras gnyis (1 khri lde mgon btsan/rab tu byung ba'i mtshan de ba rA dza/2 lha 'khor btsan/rab tu byung ba'i mtshan nA ga rA dza )dang/sras mo lha yi me tog bcas gsum byung yang/lha bla mas dgung lo mthon por ma phebs bar du srid dbang bzung nas de rjes sras gnyis dang sras mo bcas yab sras bzhi ka dus gcig tu rab byung mdzad/srong nges dgung lo sum cu pa me sprel (996)lor mtho lding gtsug lag khang bzhengs zhes zer ba dgung rnying shing glang (965)lor 'khrungs pa nas rtsis pa yin/phyis yab mes kyi yig chang gzigs pas thugs skyo ste/rgyal srid gcung 'khor re la gtad nas dgung lo lnga bcu nga gnyis pa me 'brug (1016)lor yab sras gsum (yab dang sras gnyis sras mo gcig bcas bzhi yod )ka rang rtags rang gis blangs te dgon drung du skra phun phul nas rab tu byung zhes lo rgyus yig lam 'ga' zhig tu gsal ba ni ma dag rgyun 'byams yin te/de ltar min pa ni rab byung gi mgon po ye shes bzang po yin pa dang/skabs der rab byung gi ming gsar pa gnang skabs mkhan po'i mtshan zur ye shes de las dras te ye shes 'od ces btags pa yin tshul mang thos klu sgrub rgya mtshos gsungs pa ltar yin la/lo 'di ni stod mnga' ris su bstan pa phyi dar 'phel rgyas kyi lo'i thog ma yin par rigs pas sgrub pa lags/gu ge'i rgyal rabs gsum pa gcung po 'khor re la sras gsum (1 btsan srung cog re/2 tsha la lde/3 lha lde bkra shis btsan bcas )byung ba'i sras gsum pa lha lde btsan gyis srid dbang bzung/gu ge'i rgyal rabs bzhi pa mnga' bdag lha lde de la sras gsum (1 'od lde btsan/2 bkra shis 'od/rab tu byung ba'i mtshan byang chub 'od/3 yong srong lde/rab tu byung ba'i mtshan zhi ba 'od bcas )byung ba'i che ba 'od lde btsan gyis srid dbang bzung/(gu ge'i rgyal rabs bzhi pa )sras gzhan gnyis rab tu byung/mnga' bdag lha lde bkra shis btsan la sras gsum (1 blog tsha btsan srong/2 phye tsha rtse lde/3 lho tsha grags btsan lde )byung ba'i 'bring ba rtse ldes srid bzung/gu ge'i rgyal rabs lnga pa mngar bdag rtse lde la sras bzhi (1 seng grags/2 tsa me dI Ta/3 zangs kha tsha khri bkra shis 'bar lde btsan/4 cho chen tsha bsod nams rtse bcas )byung ba'i gsum pa khri bkra shis 'bar lde btsan gyis srid bzung/gu ge'i rgyal rabs drug pa khri bkra shis 'bar lde btsan la sras gsum (1 bkra shis rtse/2 0jo bo rgyal po/3 'od bar rtse )byung ba'i dang po gar log gis bkrongs/gsum pa gar log gis btsun du bzung nas 'das/gnyis pa jo bo rgyal pos srid bzung/gu ge'i rgyal rabs bdun pa dang po bkra shis rtse la sras lnga (1 a ga rA dza/2 tsan+d+ra bo d+hi/3 a mi sog tsa/4 phyogs tsa/5 'bar btsan bcas )byung ba'i lnga pa rtse 'bar btsan gyis srid bzung/gu ge'i rgyal rabs brgyad pa jo bo rgyal po la sras gcung lde/de'i sras zhong lde/de'i sras jo bla ma bcas rim pa byung yang srid ma bzung/'od 'bar rtse'i sras e lo mis srid gsum/gu ge'i rgyal rabs dug pa rtse 'bar btsan la sras bzhi (1 skyid lde btsan/2 rtse ldan ngal/3 dpal 'od btsan/4 'dul srid 'dul btsan )bcas byung ba'i dang po skyid lde btsan gyis srid bzung/gu ge'i rgyal rabs bcu pa skyid btsan la sras gnyis (1 nyi lde btsan/2 rnam lde btsan )bcas byung ba'i dang po nyi lde btsan gyis srid bzung/gu ge'i rgyal rabs bcu gcig pa nyi lde btsan la sras gsum (1 gung lde btsan/2 nyi ma lde/3 lha btsan lde )bcas byung ba'i dang po nyi ma ldes srid zung/gu ge'i rgyal rabs bcu gnyis pa nyi ma lde la sras gsum (1 dge 'bum/2 byams pa/3 sems dpa' )bcas byung ba'i dang po dge 'bum gyis srid bzung/gu ge'i rgyal rabs bcu gsum pa dge 'bum la sras gsum (1 skyid rdor/2 la ga /3 thos pa )bcas byung ba'i gnyis pa la gas srid bzung/gu ge rgyal rabs bcu bzhi pa la ge'i sras chos rgyal grags pa las med pa des srid bzung/gu ge rgyal rabs bco lnga pa chos rgyal grags pa la yang sras lha chen grags pa da las ma byung ba des srid bzung/gu ge rgyal rabs bcu drug pa lha chen grags pa lde la sras gnyis (1 khri rnam rgyal lde/2 dpal 'bar lde )byung ba'i dang po khri rnam rgyal ldes srid bzung/gu ge rgyal rabs bcu bdun pa khri rnam rgyal lde la sras nam mkha'i dbang po yun tshogs lde las ma byung ba des srid bzung/gu ge rgyal rabs bco brgyad pa khri nam mkha'i dbang po phun tshogs da la yang sras rnam ri sangs rgyas lde las ma byung ba des srid bzung/gu ge rgyal rabs bcu dgu pa khri rnam ri sangs rgyas lde la yang sras blo bzang rabs brtan las ma byung ba des srid bzung/ge ge rgyal rabs nyi shu pa rgyal po 'di rje tsong kha ba'i slob ma gu ge mkhan chen ngag dbang grags pa dang dus mnyam zhing/mkhan chen des (gu ge'i rgyal rabs nyi shu pa'i bar du gsal ba rnams 'dir gnad bsdus yas te drangs pa lags/rgyal po blo bzang rab brtan man chad kyi gdung rabs kha shas sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i (bai ser )nang gsal}
