gu ge chos 'byung|{rje tsong kha pa'i dngos slob bstan pa phyogs mthar spel ba'i dar chen drug gi gras/gu ge mkhan chen ngag dbang grags pas mdzad pa'i (gu ge'i rgyal rabs chos 'byung )la zer/'di'i ma dpe dbu med ris rnying mjug nas ma tshang ba zhig bod ljongs spyi tshogs tshan rig khang gi dbu 'dzin ma gcig lags kyi phyag tu bzhugs pa de bzhin ngo bo pe cin krung dbyang mi rigs slob grwar sdom skabs mjal myong zhing/'di'i nang gu ge'i rgyal rabs dang po bkra shis mgon nas rgyal rabs nyi shu pa blo bzang rab brtan bar gyi gnas tshul 'khod 'dug pa dpyad gzhir yid rton rung ba zhig yin kyang/bar gyi rgyal po glang dar ma'i mjug nas skyid lde nyi ma mgon gyi mjug kar shog lhe gcig dang gu ge'i rgyal rabs bcu bdun pa khri rnam rgyal lde'i lo rgyus thad shog lhe gcig ma tshang bar brten 'brel yod khag la rtsad gcod zhus par se rar bzhugs pa'i mnga' ris kyi dge 'dun zhig gi phyag tu rgyal rabs 'di'i ma dpe cha tshang zhig yod skad thos kyang khong gi mtshan nges gsal zhig gsung mkhan gtan nas ma byung stabs kha skong bya thabs ma rnyed lags}
gu ge chos 'byung gi bstan rtsis la dpyad pa|{'di'i nang gsal ba'i sangs rgyas 'das lo'i bstan rtsis nang/lha bla ma zhi ba 'od sku gshegs pa'i lo lcags yos yin pa dang/bstan pa rgyal mtshan bsnams nas (bstan pa'i khur bzhes )lo bzhi bcu zhe bzhir bstan pa bskyangs zhes dang/me sprel lo la rab tu gshegs nas zhi ba 'od du mtshan gsol zhes pa tsam las dgung lo ji tsam bzhugs pa dang/'khrungs lo gang yin mi gsal zhing/rab byung mdzad nas lo bzhi cu rtsa gcig bzhugs zhes pa ltar na/bstan pa'i bya ba mdzad na lo gsum song rjes rab byung bzhes pa zhig yin par gsal bas de dus dgung lo nyi shu lhag phebs zin par mngon/sku gshegs pa'i lo'i lcags yos de a ti sha p+saku ma gshegs gong gi lcags yos yin na rab byung dang po'i lcags yos (1051)lo yin pa dang/jo bo rje a ti sha sku gshegs rjes kyi lcags yos yin na rab byug gnyis pa'i lcags yos (1111)lo yin pas lha bla ma zhi ba yod de jo bo rje a ti sha sku gshegs nas kyang lo lnga bcu nga brgyad par bzhugs dgos shing/de ltar na chos 'byung rang gi gnang/lha bla ma zhi ba 'od kyis lo tsA ba mdzad nas jo bo rje a ti sha dang lhan du (dpal mchog rtsa 'grel )dang/(tshan ma rgyan gyi 'grel pa )sogs mang po bod skad du bsgyur bar gsungs pa dang gnam du lo tsA ba blo ldan shes rab dang/brang ti dar ma snying po/ar byang chub ye shes ('bre shes rab 'bar gyi slob ma )bcas gdan darangs nas chos 'khor bskor bar gsungs pa bcas bsdur na/lha bla ma zhi ba 'od gshegs pa'i lcags yos de rab byung gnyis pa'i lcags yos (1111)lo de yin pa dang/jo bo rje a ti sha bod du phebs skabs paN+Di ta'i lo tsA ba mdzad nas chos bsgyur thub pa'i mkhyen rgya can du gyur zin pas de dus dgung lo bdun cu lhag tu bzhugs pa yin snyam}
gu ge yongs 'dzin blo bzang bstan 'dzin|{(bkra shis lhun po'i gu ge khang tshan du zhugs shing paN chen rin po che'i yongs 'dzin mdzad )gtsang khul dge rgyal bye ma gling gi nye 'dabs rgya ma mkhar gyi g.yul rgyal brtan grong du yab tshe ring dpal 'byor dang yum 'dzoms ma chog gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa 'brug (1748)lor 'khrungs/yab yum gnyis kyis mtshan la bkra shis don grub ces gsol/dgung lo dgu pa me byi lor dkyil khang mkhan chen blo bzang brtson 'grus kyi drung du rab byung zhus pa'i mtshan la blo bzang bstan 'dzin zhes gsol/de nas re zhig bar dben dgon du bzhugs te chos skyod thugs 'dzin dang/yi ge 'bri klog la byang chub par mdzad/dgung lo bcu pa me glang (1757)lor dben dgon slob zur ye shes rgyal mtshani drung du dge tshul gyi sdom pa zhus/de'i phyi lor bkra shis lhun por sgrigs zhugs gnang ste rab 'byams pa ye shes tshul khrims dang/mkhan chen blo bzang brtson 'grus sogs dge rgan du bsten nas gzhung chen po lngar slob gnyer mthar phyin pa mdzad de dkar chen gyi mtshan gnas bzhes/de nas sgra rig pa dang sdeb sbyor sogs rig gnas khag la sbyangs pa mdzad/dgung lo nyer brgyad pa shing lug (1775)lor paN chen rin po che dpal ldan ye shes kyi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes nas yun ring ma song bar tshogs chen dge bskos kyang gnang/de nas rgyud pa grwa tshang du sgrigs zhugs thog /rgyud kyi 'chad nyan dang/dbang lung khrid gsum/phyag bzhes sogs la sbyangs pa dang gnas bsam mthil phyin pa mdzad cing zhor la mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang po zhig gsan bsam nyams bzhes zur 'brel du bskyangs/gzhan yang yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan dang/'on rgyal sras rin po che/brag ri rgya mtsho mtha' yas/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa 'jigs med dbang po bcas kyi drung nas kyang mdo gas kyi chos rgyun ha cang mang ba zhig gsan/dgung la zhe lnga pa chu byi (1792)lor dkyil khang grwa tshang gi mkhan po'i khrir phebs/dgung lo zhe brgyad pa shing yos (1795)lor rgyud pa grwa tshang gi sngags chen gyi khrir phebs nas sngar srol 'chad nyan dang/phyag bzhes nyams med gong 'phel mdzad/de'i phyi lo me 'brug lor paN rin po che bstan pa'i nyi ma'i yongs 'dzin du phebs te dbang lung khrid sogs mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mtha' yas pa zhig 'bul gnang mdzad/gsung rtsom skor gsang bde 'jigs gsum sogs kyi khrid dang phyag rgya chen po rtsa 'grel gyi rnam bshad sogs phyogs gcig tu bsgrigs pa pod chen lnga dpar ma yod/dgung lo re drug pa ram byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu bya (1813)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar lo rgyus zur du 'khod pa da phan ma mjal lags}
