gu ru chos kyi dbang phyug|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur rnying ma'i gter kha 'og mar grags pa thog mar dar spel mdzad pa po yin/lho brag la yag khul du yab sngags 'chang spang ston grub pa'i snying po dang/yum dkar bza' mgon skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bzhi pa'i chu sprel (1212)lor sku 'khrungs/yab kyis ('jam dpal mtshan brjod )gser yig zhig bri bzhin yod pa'i tshig mtshams/chos kyi dbang phyug chos kyi rgyal zhes pa'i skabs su slebs pa dang sras 'khrungs pa dus mnyam par brten mtshan la chos kyi dbang phyug ces gsol/dgung lo bzhi nas yal kyis yi ge 'bri klog dang/sgra rag pa'i bstan bcos/skar rtsis/gso ba rig pa/lo rgyus/sgrung dang zlos gar/bon gzhung/gsang sngags gsar rnying sogs thos pa rgya cher mdzad/dgung lo bcu bzhi nas bcu drug bar/tshad ma dang phar phyin/dbu ma/spyod 'jug /phyag chen/zhi byed/rdzogs chen la sogs par slob gnyer nang gsan bsam mdzad/dgung lo bcu bdun pa la mnga' bdag nyang nyi ma 'od zer gyi sras 'gro mgon dang mjal nas gter chos mtha' dag gsan/dgung lo nyer gnyis pa chu sbrul (1233)lor lho brag gnam skas brag nas gdams skor bzhi dang/man ngag brgya rtsa brgya sogs gter 'don gnang mdzad/bla rdzogs thugs gsum gyis mtshon pa'i gter kha bco brgyad kyi bdag por gyur/slob ma skal ldan mang por so so'i skal ba dang mtshams pa'i chos dang man ngag gnang/nyams rtogs 'phral 'phral tu skyes/gtsang gi tshong 'dus mgur mo'i lha khang dang/bsam 'grub bde chen gyi lha khang/lho la yag gu ru lha khang bcas gsar bzhengs gnang nas/mthar dgung lo nga dgu pa rab byung lnga pa'i lcags rta (1270)lor sku gshegs/rnam thar skor (gu bkra chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 386nas 393bar gsal}
