gu ru pad+ma'i brgyad lnga'i che ba ste|{sku gsung thugs dang yon tan 'phrin las che ba ba bzhi bcu yod pa ste/dang po'i sku'i che ba'i brgyad ni/1 pha ma'i rgyu rkyen ma skyed sku bltams che/_/2 rgyal sras phyung ba'i che ba mi dgos che/_/3 rol rtsed snang tshogs do nyams med pas che/_/4 tshe las 'das grangs med pas sku yi che/_/5 gdul bya dang 'dren bgres rgud med pas che/_/6 sku la 'byung bzhi'i dgras ma tshugs pas che/_/7 so thar sngags nas sdom gsum bsrungs pas che/_/8 mtshan bzang so gnyis dpe byad brgyud bcus che/_/o rgyan pad 'byung sku yi che ba yin/_/gnyis pa gsung gi che ba rnam brgyad ni/1 tshangs pa'i dbyangs dang ldan pas gsung gi che/2 gsung gleng yi dam lha dang sgrogs pas che/3 skad rigs 'gyur tshad thams cad mkhyen pas che/_/4 tha lam gsung ni ye mi byon pas che/_/6 rigs drug skad rigs chos ston gsung gi che/_/7 lha 'dre dam 'og tshud pas bka' nyan che/_/8 gsung dbyangs dri za tshangs pa'i dbyangs bzhin che/_/rol mo'i mchod pa gsung gi che ba yin/_/gsum pa thugs kyi che ba brgyad ni/1 thugs la ye nas 'khrul pa med pas che/2 chos la phyogs ris pa thugs kyi che/3 rtogs pa nam mkha' mo bas thugs kyi che/4 sgom pa ri bo brtan pas thugs kyi che/5 spyod pa nyi rdul zhub pas thugs kyi che/6 'grus pa gzhan don bsgrubs pas thugs kyi che/7 dus bzhi mngon par mkhyen pas thugs kyi che/8 'gro drug sems rgyun mkhyen pas thugs kyi che/bzhi pa yon tan che ba brgyad bstan pa ni/1 mtho ris yon tan bdun po thos pas che/2 yongs grags mas pa chen po'i grub thob ni/_/pho mo stong rtsa brgyad ni bstan pas che/3 rig pa'i gnas lnga mkhas pas yon tan che/4 sde snod gsum la sbyangs pas yon tan che/5 byang chub thugs bskyed nyer lnga brgya'i che/7 dgon gnas bdag ma bzung bas yon tan che/8 'phags pa'i nor bdun phyug pos yon tan che/lnga pa 'phrin las che ba brgyad pa la yang 1 snyigs mar bstan pa rgyas pas che/2 bstan pa 'phel 'grib med pas che/3 bstan zhabs gter gyis skyong bas che/4 mchog dman grogs su 'grogs pas che/5 chos dang chos min 'byed las che/6 lha 'dren bran du 'kh