gu ru mtshan brgyad|{gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi lo rgyus nang gsungs pa ltar na/slob dpon chen po pad+ma 'byung gnas kyi sprul pa'i bkod pa mi 'dar ba brgyad la mtshan mi 'dar ba brgyad thogs pa'i lo rgyus yod pa ste (rin chen gter mdzod )kyi gter ston brgya rtsa'i rnam thar las gsungs pa ltar na/1 gu ru mtsho skyes rdo rje ni/nub phyogs o rgyan gyi yul du shar dang/lho/byang gsum du mtsho re re yod pa'i lho phyogs kyi rgya mtsho'i gling du pad+ma'i sdong po kha dog sna tshogs yod pa'i sbugs su mgon po 'od dpag med kyi thugs ka nas gser gyi rdo rje yi ge hrIs mtshan pa zhig spros pa las khye'u lo brgyad pa'i tshod tsam zhig 'khrungs te lha dang mtsho gling gi mkha' 'gro rnams la chos gsungs te bzhugs/yul de'i rgyal po in+d+ra bo b+hi la sras med stabs sras tshab tu gdan rangs nas mtshan la pad+ma 'byung gnas sam mtsho skyes rdo rje zhes gsol/2 rdo rje drag po rtsal ni/o rgyan gyi rgyal po'i khab tu bzhes nas rgyal srid bskyangs/de nas rgyal srid spangs par bzhes kyang yal rgyal pos gnang ma ma thob par brten rtsed mo'i tshul gyis blon po tri nu'i bu la mdung rtse gsum pa kha shor ba ltar mdzad nas bu bsad/de'i rkyen gyis dur khrod du rgyang 'bud btang bas dur khrod sna tshogs su bzhugs nas mkha' 'gro ma rnams dbang du bsdus pa sogs mdzad pas mtshon la rdo rje drag po rtsal zhes gsol/3 gu ru shAkya seng ge ni de nas rdo rje gdan du phebs nas sprul pa sna tshogs bstan pas mi rnams kyis khyod su yin dris par nga ni rang byung gi sangs rgyas yin zhes gsungs pas mi rnams kyis yid ma ches par skur pa btab par brten/za hor yul (b+hang+gal )du byon te slob dpon pra b+ha hasti las rab byung zhus pa'i mtshan la gu ru shAkya ge zhes gsol/4 gu ru blo ldan mchog sred ni gong gsal slob dpon pra b+hi hasti las yo ga'i rgyud rnams tshar bco brgyad gsan/ye shes kyi mkha' 'gro ma gsang ba ye shes dge slong mar sprul pa kun dga' mo la gsang sngags kyi dbang gsan/rig 'dzin chen po brgyad las sgrub pa sde brgyad kyi skor/slob dpon sangs rgyas gsang ba las sgyu 'phrul gyi skor/slob dpon shrI sing ha las rdzogs chen gyi skor bcas yongs su rdzogs par gsan nas gang gsan pa thams cad tshar res mkhas par mkhyen pas mtshan la gu ru blo ldan mchog sred du gsol/5 de nas za hor gyi rgyal po gtsug lag 'dzin gyi sras mo man+d+hi ra ba yag rgyur bzhes/brag phug ma ti kar zla ba gsum gyi rim tshe sgrub mdzad cing/tshe dpag med kyis dngos su dbang bskur te tshe yi rig 'dzin brnyes/za hor gyi rgyal pos sku gson por mer bsregs btang skabs slob dpon yab yum gnyis ka ma tshigs par mtsho 'khyil ba'i dbus su pad+ma'i sdong pa skyes pa'i yab yum gnyis ka lhan cig tu bzhugs pa'i sprul pa bstan cing/slar yang o rgyan yul du phebs pa na/der yang blon po ngan pa chos ngo shes te tsan+dan me'i nang du bsregs kyang sngar bzhin pad+ma'i sdong po'i rtser yab yum gnyis kyis thod phreng sku la gsol ba'i rdzu 'phrul mdzad pas mtshan la pad+ma thod phreng rtsal zhes gsol/6 gu ru pad+ma rgyal po ni/de nas o rgyan gyi yul du lo bcu gsum gyi rim rgyal po'i mchod gnas su bzhugs te rgyal blon btsun mo dang bcas par bka' 'dus kyi rgya mtsho'i chon bstan nas smin grol la bkod pas mtshan la gu ru pad+ma rgyal po zhes gsol/(skabs 'dir (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )las/pad+ma thod phreng rtsal dang pad+ma rgyal po gnyis dus skabs gcig la thogs pa'i mtshan gyi rnam grangs yin par gsungs/) 7 gu ru nyi ma 'od zer ni/rgyal po mya ngan med 'dul ba'i don du dge slong dbang po'i sder sprul nas chos bstan te phyir mi ldog pa'i dad pa la bkod/'dzam bu'i gling du nub gcig la sangs rgyas kyi rim bsrel bzhugs pa'i mchod na bye ba gcig bzhengs su 'jug pa dang/nang pa'i bstan pa la sdang ba'i mu stegs kyi rgyal po btul/dur khrod chen po rnams su byon nas mkha' 'gro ma rnams la chos bstan/lha 'dre gdug pa can rnams kyi srog gi snying po bzhes te bstan srung du bkod par mdzad pa'i mtshan la gu ru nyi ma 'od zer zhes gsol/8 gu ru seng ge sgra sgrog ni/rgya gar rdo rje gdan du mu stegs pa'i ston pa lnga brgyas nang pa'i chos la ngo rgol rtsod pa byed du 'ongs skabs slob dpon gyis rtsod pa dang mthu nus 'gran pas slob dpon rgyal/mu stegs pas ngan sngags btab nas mthu btang ba drag sngags kyis phyir log te mu stegs pa'i grong khyer mes bsregs/lhag ma rnams nang pa'i chos la bkod pas mtshan la gu ru seng ge sgra sgrog ces gsol ba ste/mtshan brgyad kyi byung tshul mdor bsdus tsam gsungs pa 'dir bkod pa lags shing/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 597nas 599bar/gu ru mtshan brgyad kyi byung tshul 'di dang mi 'dra ba zhig gsungs pa 'dir yig tshogs che stabs ma bkod cing/gong gsal (gter ston brgya rtsa'i rnam thar )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 596nas 599bar/gu ru mtshan brgyad kyi byung tshul 'di dang mi 'dra ba zhig gsungs pa 'dir yig tshogs che stabs ma bkod cing/gong gsal (gter ston brgya rtsa'i rnam thar )las/gu ru rdo rje grol lod mi gsal zhing/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )du gu ru nyi ma 'od zer mi gsal ba bcas ni rang rang gi khungs gtugs sa'i dpyad gzhi'i yig cha mi 'dar ba'i dbang gis gsung tshul mi 'dra ba byung ba zhig yin}
gu rub|{gna' rabs btsan po'i dus skabs su rta la gu rub ces 'bod pa'i brda rnying}
gu rub legs|{bod kyang btsan po'i dus rabs su rgyal po sa yi legs drug byung ba'i gsum pa dang yab rgyal po thi sho legs dang/yum klu sman mer mo gnyis kyi sras yin/khong gis dbon gsas bon po 'be sho phram bsten/sku bon bco 'phan grags kyis mdzad/gsas khang sa le bang bang dang/sku mkhar phri brtsig 'bum rgyugs brtsigs btsun mo mtsho sman blangs pa'i sras 'brong zher legs 'khrungs/bang lo g.ya' dang spang gi mtshams su btab ces lo rgyus 'ga' las gsal}
gu lang|{de sngon dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i nang/stod mnga' ris khul du gser gyi gter kha thon pa'i lo rgyus yod pa dang/de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gis lo ltar mnga' ris khul du gser sdud par gtong srol cing/(deb ther sngon po )lcags dpar ma smad cha'i shog grangs 855nang mkhas grub khyung po rnal 'byor (rab byung gong gi lo rabs dang po'i lcags stag 990lo nas rab byung gnyis pa'i sa lug 1139lo bar gyi rnam thar nang gu lang gi gser kha rdol ba dang thug ces gsal}
gu shri|{{(WP:1,194)}de sngon rang rgyal gyi yon rgyal rabs skabs gong ma hu pe les rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags sprel (1260)lor srid dbang bzung ba nas sa skya'i bla chen rim byon la gu shri dang/ti shri'i {(WP:1,194)}go gnas gnang zhing/sa gnas de gnyis rgyal po'i bla mar bkur ba rnams la dmigs bsal gyis gnang ba zhig yin/yon rgyal rabs skabs sa skya'i bla chen rim byon la gu shri'i go gnang gnang ba bcu byung yod/1 sa skya'i gzhi thog bla brang gi mkhan btsan chen po nam mkha' legs pa'i rgyal mtshan dgung lo nyi shu rtsa lnga pa rab byung drug pa'i sa sprul (1329)lor/yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma ku sha la gu thug rgyal pos bkwan ting go shri'i mtshan gnas dang shel tham gnang/2 bdag chen de'i gcung chung ba nam mkha' rgyal mtshan la yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma wen tsung thug the'i mur gyis shu shri'i mtshan gnas dang shel tham gnang/2 bdag chen de'i gtsang chung ba nam mkha' rgyal mtshan la yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma wen cung thug the'i mur gyis gu shri'i mtshan gnas gan nga/3 gzhi thog mkhas btsun chen po'i sras kun dga' rin chen la yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma tho kan the'i mur gyis bkAn ting go shri'i mtshan gnas gnang/3 gzhi thog pa mkhas btsun chen po'i sras kun dga' rin chen la yon rgyal rabs ka gong ma tho kan the'i mur gyis bkAn ting go shri'i mtshan gnas dang shel dam gnang/4 gzhi thog pa kun dga' rin chen gyi sras blo gros rgyal mtshan la yang yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma tho ken the'i mur {(WP:1,194)}gyis tA yon gu shri'i go gnas dang tham ka gnang/5 rin chen sgang bla brang gi bdag chen kun dga' nyi ma la 'on rgyal rabs kyi gong ma shus rdi pa la {(WP:1,194)}yi dus tA yon go shri'i go gnas dang/shel dam che ba gnang/6 bdag chen bzang po dpal gyi sras rin chen sgang bla brang pa 'jam dbyangs don yon rgyal mtshan la gong ma a yur par pa tas tA yon gu shri'i go gnas dang shel tham gnang/7 bdag chen bzang po dpal gyi sras lha khang bla brang pa kun dga' rgyal mtshan la yon rgyal rabs kyi go mang (ming mi gsal )ching gu'i gung gu shri go gnas gnang/8 bdag chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyi sras chos kyi rgyal mtshan la yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma a yur par pa tas tA yon gu shri'i go gnas gnang/9 bdag chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyi sras chang ba blo gros rgyal mtshan la yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma tho ken the'i mur sa tA yon gu shri'i mtshan dang tham kha gnang/10 dus ma chod bla brang pa bdag chen kun dga' legs pa'i blo gros la yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma tho ken the'i mur gyis tA yon go shri'i go gnas dang/shel dam che ba gnang bcas byung yod/zhib par (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )la gzigs}
gu shri kun dga' nyi ma|{sa skya'i rin chen sgang bla brang gi bdag chen dang po yin cing/yab bdag chen bzang po dpal dang yum lu sku zhang mgon po dpal gyi sras mo ma gcig gzhon nu 'bum gyi sras su rab byung lnga pa'i sa bya (1309)lor 'khrungs/sku na gzhon nu'i dus nas yab mes kyi chos dang mdo sngags gnyis kyi chos rgyun rgya cher gsan zhing/'gro mgon 'phags pa'i bzhugs khri'i steng nas chos yang yang gsungs pas mtshan snyan che/yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma shus rdi pa la'am {(WP:1,194)}bod skad du ke ken han gyis pe cin pho brang du gdan drangs te tA 'on gu shri {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i mtshan gnas dang/shel tham che ba/tho shu dang bcas pa gnang yang/sku ma brtan par dgung lo bcu bzhi pa rab byung lnga pa'i chu khyi (1322)lor pe cin pho brang du sku gshegs/lo rgyus mdor bsdus 'di tsam las mi snang bas 'dir cha tshang bkod pa lags}
gu shi kun dga' legs pa'i blo gros|{sa skya'i dus mchod bla brang gi bdag chen yin/yab pa'i len wan grags pa rgyal mtshan dang yul byang pa bdag po'i dpon nam mkha' tshe brtan gyi sring mo ma gcig lha rin gyi sras su rab byung drug pa'i me bya (1357)lor 'khrungs/'dir (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )las/(yab kyi dgung lo nyer gnyis pa sa bya zhes gsal ba yig nor te yab kyi 'khrungs lo me byi yin pa nas rtsis pa'i nyer gnyis pa me bya las sa bya mi 'ongs lags )dgung lo chung ngu'i dus nas bdag chen kun dga' rin chen dang/sa bzang ma ti paN chen gnyis las rab tu byung/bla ma dam bsod nams rgyal mtshan dang/bla chen bsod nams blo gros/bla ma mnyam med pa bcas bsten nas yab mes kyi chos rgyun dang mdo sngags spyi'i chos bka' rgya ches gsan zhes mdzad cing/slob ma tshogs chen por mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsungs /bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyis rin chen sgang bla brang gi gdan sar bsko gzhag mdzad/yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma tho ken the'i mur gyis tA yon gu shri'i go gnas dang/shel dam chen mo/tho shu dang bcas pa gnang/dgung lo nyer brgyad pa rab byung drug pa'i shing byi (1384)lor lta nag ri khud du sku gshegs/lo rgyus mdor bsdus 'di tsam las mi snang bas 'dir cha tshang bar bkod pa lags}
gu shri chen po|{phag gru sde srid khri rabs gnyis pa gu shri shAkya rgyal mtshan la zer/'og tu 'jam dbyangs gu shri shAkya rgyal mtshan zhes pa der gzigs}
gu shri chos kyi rgyal mtshan|{ka thog si tu'i sku phreng dang po dang/mtshan dngos rin chen 'byung gnas zer/karma pa de bzhin gshegs pa'i slob ma'i gtso bo'i gras yin/ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma yung los {(WP:1,194)}bkwan ting yon thung me'u tsi go shri {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i go gnas gnang/karma pa de bzhin gshegs pa nan cin du phebs shul du gdan sa mtshur phur gser dngul spel ma'i bka' 'gyur bstan 'gyur dang/gser bris gyi bka' 'gyur bzhengs/sku tshe'i smad du kun spangs mdzad pas kun spangs rin po che zhes zhu/lo rgyus zhib pa (karma kam tshang chos 'byung )shing dpar gyi shog grangs 240nas 241bar gsal}
gu shri don grub 'od zer|{karma pa de bzhin gshags pa'i slob ma gtso bo'i gras dang/mtshan gzhan 'jam dbyangs don grub 'od zer du 'bod/mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang po zhig karma pa de bzhin gshegs pa las gsan zhing nyams rtogs kyi rtsal rdzogs/gzigs rgya dang mkhyen rgya dus skabs der 'gran zla med/mtshur phu'i gdan sa lo zhe gsum ring mdzad/nang bstan chos lugs kyi gdan la gzhan du mi 'dra ba'i dgongs tshul dang 'chad tshul dmigs bsal can yod pas slob ma mkhas grags can mang du byung/tA ming gi gong ma yum los bkwan ting gu shri'i go gnas dang gser thang gnang/karma pa rang byung rdo rjes mdzad pa'i (rtsis kyi bstan bcos kun btus )kyi rjes su 'brangs nas rab byung brgyad pa'i me yos (1447)lor (rtsis gzhung chen po )brtsams nas mtshur phu'i lo tho zhes pa 'don gnang mdzad/'khrungs 'das kyi lo dang/lo rgyus zhib gsal gyi dpyad gzhi da phan ma rnyed}
gu shri nam mkha' legs pa'i rgyal mtshan|{sa skya'i gzhi thog bla brang gi bdag chen dang po yin/yab bdag chen bzang po dpal dang/yum ma gcig nam mkha' rgyal mo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung lnga pa'i shing sbrul (1305)lor 'khrungs/sku gzhon nu'i dus nas yab mes kyi chos rgyun thams cad gsan bzhes dang/gsung rtsom (phyag rdor 'khor lo chen po'i mngon rtogs)sogs mdzad/yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma wen tsung thug the'i mur {(WP:1,194)}gyis bkwan ting sho shri'i go gnas dang shes tham che ba gnang/gzhi thog blang brang gi gdan sar lo ngo bcu dgu bar bskyangs/dgung lo dgu pa rab byung drug pa'i chu lug (1343)lor gzhi thog bla brang rang du sku gshegs/lo rgyus cung zad tsam (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 254nas grangs 255bar gsal}
gu shri dpal 'byor don grub|{karma pa zhwa dmar chos dpal ye shes kyi slob ma yin/karma pa mthong ba don ldan sku gshegs khar rten gsum dang sa bza' sogs la phyag thang gnang ste rgyal tshab tu bskos pa ltar mtshur phu'i chos srid gnyis ka'i 'dzin skyong gi khur legs par bzhes/tA ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma cing thung {(WP:1,194)}gis gu shri'i go gnas dang/gser tham/las zhwa bcas gnang/dgung lo re gsum gyi bar du bstan 'gro'i don mdzad nas gshegs/lo rgyus mdor bsdus shig (karma kam tshang chos 'byung )gsal}
gu shri blo gros rgyal mtshan|{karma pa de bzhin gshegs pa'i slob ma dang gu'i gung gi las don mdzad mkhan yin/mtshur phu'i gdan sa'i chos srid kyi 'gan bzhes yun ring mdzad/tA ming gong ma yung los gu shri'i go gnas gnang/kong pa rtse lha sgang du sku gshegs/lo rgyus mdor bsdus 'di tsam las zhib gsal ma rnyed}
gu shri blo bzang tshe 'phel|{sog yul du rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags 'brug (1760)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo nyir gcig pa lcags byi (1780)lor paN chen rin po che dpal ldan ye shes kyi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa zhus/bla brang bkra shis 'khyil dgon du 'jam dbyangs bzhed pa 'jigs med dbang po dang/gung thang rin po che bstan pa'i sgron me bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang du gsan cing/zhar la gzhung chen po lnga rig gnas dang bcas par sbyangs pa mthar phyin mdzad de dka' bcu'i mtshan gnas bzhes/sog yul du phebs nas bstan 'gro'i don rgya cher mdzad/khal kha rje btsun dam pa rin po ches gu shri'i go gnas gnang/dgung lo drug cu pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa yos (1819)lor (chen po hor gyi chos 'byung rgyal ba'i bstan pa rin po che gsal bar byed pa'i sgron me )brtsams gzhan yang )rgyal ba'i gsung rab rin po che dang lam rim gsol 'dabs lam mchog sgo 'byed shan sbyar te bshad pa bde gshegs gzhung lam )pod chen gcig /(lam rim mtha' dpyod thar lam gsal bar byed pa'i sgron me )sogs gsung rtsom phyogs bsgrigs pod chen dgu yod/sku gshegs pa'i lo dang rnam thar ma rnyed lags}
gu shri shAkya rgyal mtshan|{phag gru sde srid yi khri rabs gnyis pa yin/drung chen bsod nams bzang po dang/bdag mo nye ru ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung drug pa'i lcags 'brug (1340)lor 'khrungs/bla ma kun lung pa dge rgan du bsten nas yi ge 'bri klog bslabs/tshes bzhi rnying ma grags pa rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes pa'i mtshan la grags pa bzang por gsol/dgung lo dgu pa la mkhan chen gzhon nu dbang phyug dang/gzhon nu tshul khrims gnyis kyi drung nas dge tshul sdom pa bzhes pa'i mtshan la shAkya rgyal mtshan zhes gsol/tshes bzhi rin po che grags pa rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas 'bru gung dang phag gru'i chos skor cha tshang bar gsan/dgung lo bcu gsum pa chu 'brug (1352)lor rtsed thang gdan sar phebs/gzhung chen po lnga la sbyangs pa mthar phyin par mdzad nas bshad pa yang mdzad/kun mkhyen bu ston rin po che'i drung nas gsang sngags kyi chos skor mtha' yas pa gsan/dgung lo bcu dgu pa sa khyi (1358)lor bla dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyis mkhan po dang/mkhan chen bsod nams dbang phyug dang gzhon du dbang phyug gnyis kyis las slob dang gsang ston mdzad de dag slong gi sdom pa zhus/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gcig pa lcags byi (1360)lor lha sar chos mang po gsungs pas mkhas pa rnams thugs dgyes pa'i rtser son/dgung lo nyer drug pa shing sbrul (1365)lor/phag gru'i srid skyong gi khrir phebs/lo der yon rgyal rabs ka gong ma tho bkan the'i mur {(WP:1,194)}gyis ching gu'i gung bkwan ting go shri {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i go gnas dang/bon cho kha gsum du go gnas bsko 'bebs ci byed na'ang khyod brgyud pa dang bcas pa shes su chug ces pa'i bka' shog gi 'ja' sa gnang/phag gru'i srid skyong lo ngo dgu bar bskyangs te/dgung lo so bzhi pa chu glang (1373)lor/bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan gdan drangs nas/dge 'dun khri phrag kha shas 'dus pa'i chos 'khor chen mo zhag bcu'i bar du mdzad/de rjes srid 'dzin khri bshol mdzad nas mi rang bar sku gshegs/lo rgyus 'di rnams kyi khungs ni gu shri shAkya rgyal mtshan sku gshegs pa'i lo nas lo lnga bcu nga gsum pa sa khyi (1418)lor spyan snga bsod nams rgyalam tshan gyis mdzad pa'i (chos 'byung mig 'byed 'od stong )dpe rnying dbu med bris ma'i shog grangs 33gsalab nas 'dir drangs pa lags}
gu shri kAkya bzang po|{gu shri chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyi tsha bo yin/khams su karma lha steng dgon pa'i gdan sa mdzad/tA ming gong ma yung los/bkwan ting gu shri'i go gnas dang las ka gnang/lo rgyus mdor bsdus 'di tsam las mi snang}
gu shri bsod nams grags pa|{phag gru sde srid kyi khri rabs bzhi pa yin/dpon rin chen rdo rje dang do brag dpon mo rin chen 'tsho gnyis kyi sras su rab yung drug pa'i sa phag (1359)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo dgu pa me lug (1367)lor mkhas chen gzhon nu dbang phyug dang/slob dpon tshul khrims rgyal mtshan gnyis kyi drung nas rab tu byung ste mtshan la bsod nams grags pa zhes gsol/dgung lo bcu gnyis pa lcags khyi (1370)lor dge bsnyen mdzad/de nas rtsed thang du phebs nas slob gnyer mdzad/lo chen byang chub rtse mo dang/mkhan chen gzhon dbang pa/tshul rgyal ba bcas kyi drung nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyer gsum pa rab byung drug pa'i lcags bya (1381)lo nas lo lnga'i ring phag gru'i srid skyong gi khrir bzhugs/'di thad bod yig gi lo rgyun tshang mar mi gsal yang/rgya yig gi ming rgyal rabs kyi lo rgyus su dam pa 'dis srid dbang bskyangs ring mi rgyal rabs kyi gong ma tha'i tsu'u kru'u yon krang {(WP:1,194)}gi hong wu {(WP:1,194)}khri lo nyer gcig pa rang byung bdun pa'i sa 'brug (1388)lor bkwan ting gu shri'i go gnas gnang bar bshad pa/bod yig gi lo rgyus su skabs der srid 'dzin khri bshol gnang nas gdan sa thel gyi spyan snga'i khrir lo nyi shu bzhugs shing/de'i ring mdo sngags kyi chos 'chad spel rgya cher mdzad/dgung lo lnga bcu pa rab byung bdun pa'i sa byi (1408)lor sku gshegs/de nas lo bcu gsum ring sku gdung ril por bzhugs shing/de rjes zhugs 'bul zhus par ltas ngo mtshar can mang du byung zhes gsal/lo rgyus 'di (chos 'byung mig 'byed 'od stong )nas gnad bsdus te bkod pa lags}
gu shri han|{bod kyi lo rgyus thog yongs grags su gu shi bstan 'dzin chos rgyal zhes 'bod pa de yin/(gu shri han gyi gdung rgyud rgyal rabs mu tig phreng ba )nang 'khod pa ltar na/jing gir han {(WP:1,194)}yum gcig pa'i gcung po ha'o thu ha sar gyi sras ed khe su mer tha' ci nas brtsis pa'i mi rabs lnga pa sag sa gal ta'i no yon la sras gnyis (1 a rug the'u mur/2 o rug the'i mur )yod pa'i chung ba o rug the'i mur/de'i sras rin thu ci gan/de nas mi rabs dgu song ba na bo bo'i mur dzan zhes 'bod pa'i dpon chen zhig byung/de'i sras o rod jun gar tsho ba bzhi'i gras ho shod la dbang bsgyur ba'i dpon che ha na'i don yon gyi btsun mo che ba a ha ha thon la sras lnga 'khrungs pa'i gsum pa gu shri han yin/rang byung bcu pa'i chu rta (1582)lor 'khrungs/chung dus kyi mtshan la sog skad du thu ral pa'i hu zhes 'bod pa bod skad du bstan srid la rgya 'dzin mkhan zhes pa'i don yin/chung dus nas blo stobs dang/dpal rtsal 'dzoms shing blo rgya che ba zhig yod pa dang/dgung lo nyer lnga pa me rta (1606)lor yum gshegs pa'i 'das mchod du mchod 'bul dang sbyin gtong rgya chen po mdzad cing/khal kha dang o rod (jun gar )gnyis dmag 'khrug byung skabs khal kha'i dmag khrod du phebs nas phan tshur bar 'dum 'grig mdzad par grub 'bras chen po byung bar brten/stong 'khor chos rje dang/khal kha'i rgyal blon rnams mgu nas tA gu shri {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i cho lo phul/rang yul du phyir phebs rjes (mdo gser 'od )sogs mdo sde mang po sog skad du bsgyur ba'i sbyin bdag mdzad/skabs der rab byung bcu pa'i chu glang (1613)lo nas gtsang pa rgyal po phun tshogs rnam rgyal gyis bod dbus gtsang yongs la dbang bsgyur zhing/bar khams khul du bon la dad cing nang bstan chos byed yongs la sdang ba'i be ri rgyal po don yong rgyal gyis rdzas dkar nag nas mi nyag gi yul la thug pa'i bar mdo khams khul sa cha gsum cha gnyis tsam la dbang bsgyur byas /sog pa cha har chog thus nang bstan la shin tu sdang ba des mtsho sngon khul du dbang bsgyur byas pa'i skabs yin pas/gtsang pa rgyal po dang/be ri don yod/sog po cha har chog thu bcas nyam 'brel mna' mthun btsugs ste so so'i mnga' khongs su yod pa'i chos lugs gzhan dag rtsa med gtong ba'i dmag 'khrug yang yang bslangs pa bcas bar khams dang sog yul du nang bstan spyi dang/bod dbus gtsang du dge lugs par gnod 'tshe tshabs chen phog pa'i skabs la brten/dgung lo nga drug pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me glang (1637)lor thog mar mtsho sngon du yod pa'i sog po chog thu'i dpung dmag khri bzhi ma zin tsam yod pa rnams tshar bcad nas lha sar phebs/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa rin po che dang mjal te 'bul rten rgya chen po phul nas chos 'brel zhus/tA la'i bla ma rin po ches gu shri han la bstan 'dzin chos kyi rgyal po zhes pa'i mtshan bstod gnang/phyir log mdzad pa'i lam zhor dga' ldan du phebs nas rang yul du 'byor rjes lo shas bzhugs ring/bar khams kyi be ri rgyal po don yod kyis chab mdo khul du dmag drangs te ri bo che dgon pa gtor zhing bon po phud pa'i chos lugs gzhan dag gi bla ma grags can mang po 'dzin bzung byas te btson la bcug /gtsang khul du gtsang pa rgyal po karma bstan skyong gis bkra shis lhun po'i 'khris su chos sde gsar pa bkra shis zil gnon zer ba brgyab nas paN chen rin po che blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan bkra shis lhun por bzhugs bzod mi bde ba bzos pa sogs kyi gnas tshul gsan rjes/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa yos (1639)lor thog mar gtsang pa rgyal po'i mna' 'brel be ri rgyal po don yod rgyal la dmag drangs te gtor pham btang zhing/de nas gtsang pa rgyal po mgo 'khrul du 'jug ched bar khams nas mtsho sngon du thad kar phyir log gnang khul gyis nyin shes bar mtsho sngon phyogs su phebs pas gtsang pa rgyal pos gu shri han gyi dmag dpung dbus gtsang phyogs su yong rgyu min par bsams nas gra sgrig gang yang med pa'i go skabs dang bstun nas glo bur du gtsang pa rgyal por dpung 'jug byas te rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu rta (1642)lor gtsang pa rgyal po'i srid dbang gtor nas bod sa gnas kyi srid dbang yongs rdzogs tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa rin po cher phul te dga' ldan pho brang gi srid gzhung thog mar 'dzugs par rgyab skyor shugs chen mdzad cing/gu shri han rang nyid srid dbang gsar pa'i rgyab gnon srung skyong gi tshul du bzhugs/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu sbrul (1653)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa rin po che pe cin nas bod du phyir phebs gnang skabs/gong ma hrun kris gu shri han la tsun zhing wenadabyi min hu gu shri han {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i go gnas thang ka bcas gnang ba bod skad du bsgyur na gzhung bzang rtsi srung drang bden las skyong mdzangs can gu shri han zer/'di'i tshig mjug gi go shri han zhes pa de sngon khal kha'i rgyal blon rnams kyis bsngags brjod byas pa'i tshig de rang 'jags yin pa'i thog /de min gyi tshig rnams gsar du kha snon byas pa zhig red/dgung lo don gsum pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing rta (1654)lor sku gshegs/'das mchod kyi byed sgo ha cang rgya che ba zhig tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa sku ngo mas bkod sgrig gnang/lo rgyus zhib pa tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa rang nyid kyis mdzad pa'i (rang rnam du ku la'i gos bzang )lcags dpar ma deb dang po dang (bod kyi lo rgyus deb ther khag lnga )phyogs bsgrigs lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 280nas 294bar 'khod pa der gzigs}
gu shri han gyi gdung rabs|{gu shri han gyi mi brgyud sngon ma ni/hor sog po'i rgyal po stan grags can jing ger han gyi yum gcig pa'i gcung po lnga (1 ha'o thu ha sar/2 bo kho bel khe ta'i/3 o chi ga 4 ha ra thu ha ci gu/5 bu ge ban dar bcas )byung ba'i che ba ha'o thu ha sar gyi sras ed khe su mer tha' ci nas brtsis pa'i mi rabs lnga pa ag sa go ta'i yin/de la bu gnyis (1 a rug the'i mur/2 o rug the'i mur )yod pa'i chung ba o rug the'i mur la gu rin thu chi gan/po lod bu ha/a nan ta'i/the gu ta'i/a hu ha'i/se mal gu thig chi bcas rim par byung ba'i drug pa se mal gu tshig chi la bu brgyad yod pa'i drug pa khu'i ching sang la bu gnyis (1 e bug ching sang/2 bo bo'i mur dzan )byung ba'i che ba ba e bug ching sang nas bu rgyud rim bzhin ya ta'i ching sang/a hur/u'i ching chos khur/ho tho'i ser te zhi ching sang/'dul ba chos rje bcas byung/chung ba bo bo'i mur dzan la bu gnyis (1 ha na'i no yon hong gor/2 ha mug )che ba ha na'i no yon la btsun mo che chung gnyid yod pa'i che ba a ha'i ha thon la sras lnga byung (1 be'i ba gas bA thur/2 thu mi'i ud jid khun ti ling dur ge che/3 thu ral be'i hu gu shri han/4 to no'i ja sag thu bA thur/5 bo yan 'od han ha than bA thur )bcas byung ba'i gsum pa gu shri han yin/gu shri han la sras bcu byung ba ste/btsun mo che ba thor god dpon mo la sras bzhi (1 cig she thu dA yan rgyal po/bstan 'dzin rdo rje'am bstan 'dzin dA yang yan zer/2 a tsa ra hung tha'i ji/3 a yu shi dA la'i u pa shi/4 dA yan the ge bcas )dang/btsun mo 'bring pa ho thon bza' la sras lnga (5 el thu chi tshe ring/6 rdo rje dA la'i hung tha'i ji/7 hu rim shri er te ni dA'i ching/8 mgon po tshe dbang/9 sang g+ha rgyal )btsun mo chung ba dang po g.yog mo yin kyang rjes su btsun mor gyur pa bod bza' eng khe ha thon la sras gcig ste bkra shis pA thur bcas sras bcu byung zhing/sras brgyad pa mgon po tshe dbang la bu rgyud ma byung ba las gzhan dgu'i bu rgyud gang byung gi re'u mig (sum pa chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 995nas 1001bar gsal dang brgyad pa de dag gi nang nas bod sa gnas khag dang 'brel yod grangs can khag gi lo rgyus skor (mdo smad chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 37nas 51bar gsal ba de rnams la gzigs}
gug cog sde lnga|{rus rgyud tsho pa lnga ste/1 'bro/2 khyung po/3 mgar/4 snubs/5 gnyan bcas lnga yin par (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )dang (mkhas pa'i lde'i'u chos 'byung )gnyis kar gsal}
gung bka' blon|{gung dang bka' blo gnyis bsdoms pa'i bsdus ming/sngar ming rgyal rabs kyi skabs su karma pa sku phreng bzhi pa rol po'i rdo rje dang/phag drug sde srid shAkya rgyal mtshan gnyis la ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma dang po tA ming hung wus {(WP:1,194)}kyis spyi lo 1372lor ching gu'i gung {(WP:1,194)}gi go gnas phul ba dang/de'i rjes tsam du byang pa bdag po chos grags dpal bzang la ching gu'i gung gi go gnas yul yod cing/ching rgyal rabs dpon rigs skya bo'i gras la go gnas mtho shos ni wang dang/de 'og rim pa gnyis pa ni gong/gung 'og tu bka' blon yin}
gung gi dro 'phyis pa|{nyin gung gi dgung tshigs gtong rgyu'i tshod 'phyis drags pa ste/dro ni gda' rabs kyi brda rnying du zas kyi ming la go dgos}
gung bsgrigs pa'i lag len|{gzhung phan tshun dgongs pa sbyar rung du yod pa rnams thad kar sbyar shes pa'i lag len lam khas pa'i don yin/dper na dge lugs pa'i lo rgyus nang kha gsal med pa rnams dpe che gzhan nas btsal te 'di'i dgongs pa dang thad kar sbyar shes pa'i lag len la mkhas pa lta bu yin}
gung thang|{yongs grags su tshal gung thang zhes dgon pa lho byang gnyis kyi ming mnyam du bsdus nas 'bod srol yod/de yang byang ngos kyi dgon pa der tshal yang dgon zer ba dang/lho ngos kyi dgon pa der gung thang zer/dgon pa 'di gnyis lha sa grong khyer nas skyid chu sgrol te shar phyogs su le dbar bcu tsam song ba'i sar yod/rab byung gsum pa'i shing lug (1175)lor thog mar tshal yang dgon phyag btab cing/de nas lo bcu gsum pa me lug (1187)lor gung thung gtsug lag khang phyag btab/thog ma'i rgya khyod ji yod skor gyi dpyad gzhi'i yig cha gsal ba da phan lag tu ma son kyang rang byung bdun pa'i me lug (1427)lor tshal pa'i bla dpon gang rung zhig gis mdzad pa'i )bod kyi yig tshang gsal ba'i me long )dbu med bris ma shog ngos rer yig phreng brgyad re dang khyon bsdoms shog grangs 23yod pa de'i nang/gung thang bla ma zhang rab byung gsum pa'i chu glang (1193)lor sku gshegs khar nye gnas dar ma gzhon nu dpon chen du bskos pa nas/dpon rabs bcu drug pa spyan snga dngos grub rgyal mtshan bar gyi lo rgyus zhib tsam 'khod 'dug pa dang/lhag par du dpon rabs bdun pa dga' bde dpal gyis bar byung lnga pa'i lcags 'brug (1280)lo nas lcags bya (1321)lo bar lo bzhi bcu zhe gsum ring khri dpon gyi go gnas bzung ba'i ring der yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hu pe li dang 'brel ba dam zab dang rgyal skyob shugs chen thob yod par brten/rgya rigs kyi shing bzo ba dang/rdza mkhan mkhas pa/bod kyi shing bzhi ba mkhas bsdus bcas bskongs nas/gtsug lag khang lte ba'i steng du rgya phugs drug dang/mda' yab/glo 'bur bzhi la rgya phubs da nga/gser tog /gzhung sgo'i steng du rgya phubs/steng 'og gnyis kar lha khang bzhi re/mdun du khyams grwa chen mo bcas la sku rten grangs las 'das pa dang gsung rab lha khang nang du dra mig sum brgya bzhi bcu yod par khyon bsdoms gsung rab pod che chung bsdoms nyis khri sum stong lnga brgya tsam yod tshul (bod kyi yig tshang gsal ba'i me long )nang gsal zhing/tshal pa kun dga' rdo rjes mdzad pa'i (drung chen smon lam rdo rje'i rnam thar )dbu med bris ma dpe ring zhig nang 'khod don du drung chen smon lam rdo rje'i skabs rtsa che'i rten gsum dang rig dngos grags las 'das pa zhig phyag tu 'byor tshul 'khod 'dug /gzhan yang mtshan nyid grwa tshang chos 'khor gling dang/sa lugs sngags pa grwa tshang/dbul gling sogs su yang rtsa che rten gsum rig dngos grangs las 'das pa zhig yod tshul/rje 'jog ri ba ngag dbang bstan 'dzin gyis mdzad pa'i (gung thang gtsug lag khang gi gnod pa byung ba dang/de rjes rab byung dgu pa'i me rta (1546)lor gung thang gtsug lag khang yas mas la mep+sakayong byung nas rten gsum rig dngos nyung shas las ma lus pa'i gnas tshul lo rgyus mang por gsal/de rjes tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i sku tshe'i stod la gung thang gtsug lag khang nyams gso'i ched du dga' ldan khri thog lnga bcu pa dge 'dun phun tshogs kyis lo mang 'dzin bdag dang nyams gso gnang zhing/khri chen de nyid sku gshegs rjes/mchod dpon zha lu mkhan po bskal bzang yon tan gyis lo mang ring 'dzin bdag dang nyams gso mdzad/de nas lo mang zhig la bka' blon kun bzang rtse pas bdag 'dzin byas pa'i lo rgyus 'dug }
gung thang khri chen dge 'dun phun tshogs|{(gung thang tshang sku phreng dang po )rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa byi (1648)lo nas rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing sbrul 1725lo bar )dga' ldan khri thog lnga bcu pa yin zhing/khri chen de'i sku phreng rim byon la/gung thang tshang zhes da lta'i gung thang 'jigs med bstan pa'i dbang phyug bar sku phreng drug byung/khri chen 'di'i mdzad rnam cung zhib phra kha sde'i nang dga' ldan khri thog rim byon nang gsal}
gung thang ngag dbang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{(gung thang tshang sku phreng gnyis pa )gdan sa chen po dga' ldan gyi shar lho'i phyogs cha zhes pa'i grong du bar byung bcu gnyis pa'i me lug (1727)lor sku 'khrungs/rgyal ba yab sras gnyis dang/chos skyong khag gi lung bstan rnams mthung par khri chen gung thang pa'i yang srid du thag bcad pa ltar/dgung lo gsum pa sa bya (1729)lor sku gong ma'i phyag mdzod ngag dbang phun tshogs kyis yab yum dang lhan cig gung thang bla brang du gdan drangs/dgung lo lnga pa lcags phag (1731)lor 'on rgyal sras rin po che 'jigs med ye shes grags pa'i drung nas gtsug phud bzhes te mtshan la ngag dbang blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan zhes gsol/dgung la bdun pa'i skabs dge tshul gyi sdom pa yang rgyal sras rin po che'i drung nas bzhes shing/lo der 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang du chos zhugs thog tsha kho rab 'byams pa bsod nams dar rgyas dge rgan du bsten nas bsdus grwar gsan sbyong gnang ste lo ngo bzhi bar bzhugs/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa rin po che mgar thar nas bod du phyir phebs mdzad rjes/bkra shis 'khyil gyi khri rgan tshang dang/sde rgan tshang gnyis nas dpon mo rnam rgyal sgrol ma (mtsho sngon dpon dga' ldan er te ni ju nang gi btsun mo )la re 'dun zhus pa ltar/dpon mos tA la'i bla ma rin po cher mtshams zhu dang/dpon 'das po'i dgongs rdzogs mchod 'bul bcas chags cig mi sna mngags pa'i mdun/paN chen rin po che dang po lha bsod nams stobs rgyas gnyis la dam pa 'di bkra shis 'khyil du gdan drangs chog pa'i dgongs 'khrol zhus par chog mchan thob pa bzhin dgung lo bcu pa me 'brug (1736)lor mdo smad du gdan drangs shing/lo de'i ston khar bkra shis 'khyil gyi chos grwar zhugs te dgung lo bcu gcig nas dgung lo nyi shu pa me stag (1746)lo bar lo bcu'i ring sde khri rin po che blo bzang don grub dge rgan du bsten nas gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer la thugs brtson lhod med kun gyi mig dper 'os pa mdzad cing zhal ra dam pa du ma'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang po gsan bzhes dang thugs su chud nges kyi slob sbyong gnang/gzhan yang rong po mer gen chos rje ngag dbang rgyal mtsho dang smad pa ngag dbang nor bu gnyis las rig gnas gzhan dag gi skor yang gsan sbyong gnang/dgung lo nyi shu pa me stag (1746)lor a mdo rnga ba khul du phebs nas/sku gong ma khri chen dge 'dun phun tshogs kyi dngos slob gnyan rtse ngag dbang chos 'phel gyi drung nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes shing/gzhan yang mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang po gsan/lo de'i ston kha nas 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa rin po che 'jigs med dbang pos rgyud smad grwa tshang gi mkhan por bsko gzhag mdzad pa ltar lo ngo gsum ring legs par bskyangs/dgung lo nyer gnyis pa sa 'brug (1748)lor bkra shis 'khyil tshogs chen gyi khrir phebs nas lo ngo lnga'i ring chos 'chad nyan dang/sgrigs khrims/slob gnyer sogs kyi rting bskul dang/bsngags brjod/tshar gcod sogs gang la gang 'os kyi gsung bkod nan tan mdzad/dgung lo nyer dgu pa shing phag (1755)lor tshogs chen gyi khri'i dgongs zhu mdzad nas/dgon pa'i byang phyogs rgyab yol gyis sa char ri khrod yid dga' chos 'dzin phyag btab nas lo ngo bzhi'i bar thugs dang nyams bzhes la rtse gcig tu bzhugs/dgung lo so gsum pa sa yos (1759)lor gong ma chen lung gis rta tshag rje drung dpal ldan rgyal mtshan pe cin du sku gshegs pa'i tshab tu phebs dgos pa'i bka' phab pa ltar pe cin du phebs/gong mas bla chen la 'os pa'i bkur bzos dang gnang skyes dang/ho thog thu'i gdan thog gnang zhing/gong ma'i zhabs brtan rim gro dang/chos 'chad nyan bcas rgya cher gnang bzhin pa'i ngang lo de'i dgung thog nas sku bsnyun nas zhabs brtan dang sman bcos gang gis kyang ma phan par pe cin rang du sku gshegs/sku gdung dang sku chos bcas lo rjes mar pe cin nas bkra shis 'khyil du gdan drangs te gdung rten ma chod rten bzhengs/gsung rtsom sna tshogs phyogs bsgrigs pod gcig yod/lo rgyus zhib par dbal mang sku phreng gnyis pa dkon mchog rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bla brang bkra shis 'khyil gyi gdan rabs rang bzhin dbyangs su brjod pa lha yi rnga bo )lcags dpar ma shog grangs 353nas 375b.ragasal}
gung thang dkon mchog bstan pa'i sgron me|{(gung thang tshang sku phreng gsum pa )mdo smad mdzod dge smad du yab lcags po byams dang yum bo cog gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu rta (1762)lor sku 'khrungs/byis pa'i dus nas na mnyam gzhan dang mi 'dra ba'i mkhyen rab kyi rtsal che zhing/kun spyod phun sum tshogs pa mnga'/dgung lo lnga la phebs skabs gung thang mchog sprul rin po che'i yang srid ngos 'dzin zhu mi rnams 'byor bas ngos 'dzin 'khrul med du mdzad/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa rin po che 'jigs med dbang pos gung thung mchog sprul rin po che'i yang srid du thag gcod gnang/dgung lo bdun pa sa byi (1768)lor/bkra shis 'khyil du gdan drangs/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa rin po che 'jigs med dbang po'i drung nas rab byung dang dge tshul chabs cig tu bsgrubs te mtshan la dkon mchog bstan pa'i sgron me zhes gsol/dge ba'i bshes gnyen blo bzang rin chen dge rgan du bsten nas lo lnga'i ring yi ge 'bri klog dang/chos spyod skor dang/gzhung chen po lnga'i rtsa ba sogs thugs 'dzin gan nga/bar gser la 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa rin po che'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang po zhig gsan/dgung lo bcu bdun pa sa khyi (1778)lor bod dbus gtsang du slob gnyer la byon nas 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang du chos zhugs thog phar phyin 'dzin gra gzhung gsar nas dbu tshugs te gsan sbyong mdzad/rigs smra'i dbang phyug hor bskal bzang dngos grub dge rgan du bsten nas dgung lo nyi shu rtsa lnga'i bar lo dgu'i ring gzhung chen po gzhan bzhi'i slob gnyer bla chen kun gyi mig dper 'os pa mdzad/dgung lo nyer gcig pa chu stag (1782)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i drung nas dge slong gi sdom pa zhus gnang mdzad de sku tshe'i ring bslab khrims srung sdom mthar phyin pa gnang/dbus su bzhugs ring yongs 'dzin rin po che ye shes rgyal mtshan dang/klong rdol zla ba rin po che gnyis bla ma'i gtso bor bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun sngar ma gsan pa mang po zhig gsan/dgung lo nyer lnga pa me rta (1786)lor lha sa smon lam chen mor dge bshes lha rams pa'i mtshan btags grwa skor dam bca' 'gran zla bral ba mdzad/de nas mi rung bar 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa rin po che dang lhan du mdo smad phyogs su phyir phebs gnang ste lo shas rang thugs dam nyams bzhes gtsor 'don thog /dad 'dus slob ma yang ngor rang rang gi 'dod mos dang 'tshams pa'i mdo sngags kyi chos rgyan rgya cher 'chad spel mdzad mur dgung lo so gcig pa chu byi (1792)lor bla brang dpon tshang dang grwa dmangs rnams nas re bskul zhus pa ltar tshogs chen gyi khrir phebs nas lo bdun ring sngar srol dang 'phar ma'i chos rgyun 'chad nyan dang/slob gnyer/sgrigs khrims sogs zhi drag thabs mkhas gang la de 'tshams kyi sgo nas nyams chags byung rigs slar gso dang cung zad gnas pa rnams gong 'phel yong ba'i dam 'dzin nan tan mdzad pas grwa tshogs dang/slob gnyer/bsnyen bkur sogs sngar las lhag pa'i gong 'phel chen po byung/dgung lo so bdun pa sa rta (1789)lor/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa rin po che'i yang srid mchog sprul 'jigs med rgya mtsho gdan sa'i khri la bkod rjes tshogs chen gyi khri'i thugs khur dgongs zhu gnang ste/lo shas ring dgon lung gi khri khur bskyangs/dgung lo zhe gnyis pa chu phag (1803)lor mchod rten mthong gros chen mo gsar bzhengs kyi dbu tshugs nas/dgung lo zhe bzhi pa shing glang (1805)lor yongs su grub ste rab gnas dang dga' ston rgyas par mdzad/dgung lo nga bzhi pa shing phag (1815)lor rong bo phyogs nas bla brang bkra shis 'khyil du dmag chen yong skabs dge 'dun 'gres gzhon sus kyang mtshon cha khyer nas dmag 'thab nang zhugs mi chog pa'i dam bsgrags nan mo gnang bas lha khang 'ga' shas bshig ma gtogs grwa pa su la yang gnod 'tshe ma byung ba'i thog nas dmag dpung rnams phyir log dgos pa byung/gzhan yang mdzod dge dang/co ne/rgyal rong/rnga ba sogs sa gnas mang por gdan drangs pa ltar phebs nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun 'chad spel dang/dgon sde khag gi slob gnyer dang sgrigs khrims nyams gso/'khrug rtsod 'dum pa/bya ri dwags nya sogs srog gcod pa spong sdom sogs bstan 'gro'i don rlabs chen mdzad pas slob ma yang bstan 'dzin gyi skyes chen dam pa grangs las 'das pa zhig byung/gsung rtsom skor/gung chen po'i dka' gnad kyi dogs gcod (drangs nges kyi mchan/) (kun gzhi'i mtha' dpyod/) (bden pa bzhi'i rnam bshad/) (rten 'brel gyi mtha' dpyod )sogs gsang sngags kyi skor mang po/(rje bla mar bstod pa don ldan gyi rang 'grel/) (chu dang shing gi bstan bcos/) (rgan byis 'bel gtam/) ('jam dbyangs bzhad pa 'jigs med dbang po'i rnam thar/) (sde ri blo bzang don grub kyi rnam thar/) (thu'u bkwan chos kyi nyi ma'i rnam thar/) (sgo mang mkhan po chos dar gyi rnam thar )sogs gsung rtsom phyogs bsgrigs pod brgyad yod pa de dag bkra shis 'khyil dang lha sa gnyis kar shing dpar yod la/lhag par gsung rtsom mang bi thog blo bar 'bring tha gsum gyi sems rgyud la phan pa'i bka' slob gson nyams ldan pa ha cang mang po yod par brten dbus gtsang khams gsum mdo stod smad bcas pa'i mkhas dbang kun gyis mgrin gcig tu khong la gung thang 'jam dbyangs zhes bsngags brjod dang bcas mtshan brjod zhu gi yod/dgung lo re gnyis pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu lug (1823)lor dgongs pa gzhan do du gshegs shing /p+saku gdung la na ngo mtshar can 'ga' zhig byon pa rnams dgung na bzhes pa'i nang du bzhugs/lo rgyus skor rgyas pa dbal mang dkon mchog rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i kha byang du (rgyal ba'i ring lugs pa chen po 'jam dbyangs bla ma dkon mchog bstan pa'i sgron me'i rnam par thar pa dad pa'i pad+mo bzhad pa'i nyin byed )lha sa zhol dpar ma la shog grangs 194yodapa dam pa de'i gsung 'bum lha sa dpar ma'i pod (nya)pa'i mjug tu yod}
gung thang dkon mchog bstan pa'i rgya mtsho|{(gung thang tshang sku phreng bzhi pa )bla brang dgon dang thag nye ba'i tsa yul grong du rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing sprel (1824)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo drug pa sa glang (1829)lor 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa 'jigs med rgya mtsho mchog nas brtag sgril mdzad de dam pa 'di gung thang rin po che'i yang sprul 'khrul med du thag bcad nas bkra shis 'khyil gyi gung thang blang brang du khri thog mnga' gsol zhus/de'i phyi lor 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa rin po che 'jigs med rgya mtsho'i drung nas rab byung dang dge tshul sdom pa bzhes/sku phreng gong ma'i drung yig dkon mchog kun dga'i drung nas yi ge 'bri klog sbyangs par mdzad/hor tshang rdo rabs pa ngag dbang rab brtan dge rgan du bsten nas bsdus grwa'i rigs lung gsan bzhes gnang/dgung lo bcu gnyis pa shing lug (1835)lor bkra shis 'khyil gyi chos grwar zhugs te lo bdun ring phar phyin kyi gzhung la sbyangs pa mdzad/dgung lo bco brgyad pa lcags glang (1841)lor bod dbus gtsang du phebs nas lo bzhi lhag tsam bzhugs ring gtso bor gzhung chen po'i rigs lam gsan bzhes dang/bar gseng dang bstun dbus gtsang gnyis kyi gnas mjal la phebs/dgung lo nyer gnyis pa shing sbrul (1845)lor hor tshang rin po che dang lhan du mdo smad phyogs su phyir phebs mdzad/de nas dgung lo so gcig pa shing stag (1854)lo bar mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang po 'chad spel dang/zhor la rig gnas skor gsan bzhes mdzad/dgung lo so gnyis pa shing yol (1855)lor bkra shis 'khyil gyi tshogs chen khrir phebs te lo lnga'i ring/sngar srol dang 'phar ma'i chos 'chad nyan dang/sgrigs lam dang slob gnyer gyi rting skul/bslab bya/rgyugs len/bya dga' chad gcod sogs gang la gang 'os kyi bkod 'doms nan tan bstsal/zhar la dad ldan slob ma mang por mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mang du bstsal bas slob ma grags can yang mi nyung ba byung/gsung rtsom skor (mngon rtogs rgyan dang 'grel ba'i sa bcad/) (dbu ma 'jug pa'i sa bcad )sogs phyogs bsgrigs pod gcig tsam yod/dgung lo so drug pa rang byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa lug (1859)lor tshogs chen khri'i dgongs zhu mdzad cing de nas mi ring bar sku gshegs/lo rgyus skor zur du 'khod pa da phan ma mjal zhing/'di las cung zad rgyas pa zhig (zla zer )1989 lo'i dus deb dang po'i nang 'khod 'dug pa der gzigs}
gung thang 'jam dbyangs bstan pa'i nyi ma|{(gung thang tshang sku phreng lnga pa )mdo smad rma chu'i 'gram ngos bca' khog tu yab bde chen dar rgyas dang/yum bsod nams skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags sprel (1860)lor sku 'khrungs/byis pa'i dus kyi mtshan la dbang chen tshe ring zhes gsol/dgung lo bzhi la phebs pa chu phag (1863)lor 'os sprul byis pa mtshan rtags ldan pa lnga 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa rin po che bskal bzang thub bstan dbang phyug dpal bzang por phul bar zan brtag gnang ste dam pa 'di'i mtshan thon par brten/lo de'i rjes ma bkra shis 'khyil du gdan darangs nas gung thang bla brang gi khri la mnga' gsol zhing/rje shes rab rgya mtsho'i drung nas rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes pa'i mtshan la 'jam dbyangs bstan pa'i nyi ma zhes gsol/dge slong bskal bzang rgya mtsho dge rgan du bsten nas yi ge 'bri klog la sbyangs pa mdzad/dgung lo bdun pa me stag (1866)lor rje shes rab rgya mtsho'i drung nas dge tshul sdom pa bzhes shing /mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun mi nyung ba zhig gsan/dgung lo bcu gsum pa chu sprel (1872)lor bkra shis 'khyil gyi thos bsam gling du sgrigs zhugs thog /dge ba'i bshes gnyen don yod rgya mtsho dge rgan du bsten nas bla chen gyi che 'gying dang spros pa dor nas grwa rkyang dkyus ma spyi dang 'dra bar sgrigs khrims khur bzhes kyis chos grwar rtsod pa dam bca' sogs ma chag par phebs pa sogs skyes chen dam pa'i mdzad bzang phyi rabs skye sprul kun gyi mig dper 'os pa gnang/dgung lo nyer gcig pa lcags 'brug (1880)lor bra nye mkhan chen ngag dbang thub bstan rgya mtsho ba'i drung nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/dung lo nyer bzhi par 'dzin grwa mdzod du phebs skabs thugs gnyer mu mthun gnang bzhed yod kyang bla brang dgon par nang 'khrug byung ba'i rkyen gyis bar chad du gyur/de'i phyi lo dbus gtsang du phebs te/dbus gtsang lho kha bcas kyi gnas mjal dang sbrags mchod 'bul rgya cher mdzad/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa dang/srid skyong rta tshag rin po che sogs mjal phyogs thog dngos 'bul dang gdan sa gsum dang smon lam chen mo bcas la bsnyen bkur sogs mdzad nas tshogs mchod gral rjes mdo smad phyogs su phyir phebs nas bkra shis 'khyil du 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa rin po che'i drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun sngar ma gsan pa mang po zhig gsan cing/nye 'khor gyi dgon sde khag nas gdan zhus ltar 'dod chos blo dang 'tshams par bstsal/dgung lo so lnga pa shing rta (1894)lor phyi sog gi dpon hung tha'i jis gdan rngas pa lta khal kha dang de nas jun gar/thor god khag bzhi bcas su phebs nas gang la gang 'tshams kyi chos bka' rgya cher bstsal/dgung lo so brgyad pa me bya (1897)lor bkra shis 'khyil du phyir phebs mdzad/dgung lo bzhi bcu pa sa phag (1899)lor shin cang gi thor god da nga/de nas phyi sog khul du phebs nas lo ngo bzhi'i ring mdo sngags kyi chos bka' rgya cher bstsal/dgung lo zhe gsum pa chu stag (1902)lor bkra shis 'khyil du phyag phebs/dgung lo rnga lnga par slar yang phyi sog khul du phebs te bstan 'gro'i don rgya cher mdzad/dgung lo nga bdun pa me 'brug (1916)lor bkri shis 'khyil du phyir phebs/dgung lo nga dgu pa sa rta (1918)lor zi ling dmag spyi mA chi dang bkra shis 'khyil bar 'gal zla byung ba'i don skor la sku ngal khyad bsad kyis gdan sar gnod 'tshe mi 'byung ba'i thabs bkod gang zag gnang bar brten yul lung bde 'jags la gnas ba pa byung/gsung rtsom sna tshogs phyogs bsgrigs pod gcig tsam yod/dgung lo re drug pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing glang (1925)lor sku gshegs/lo rgyus rnam thar ni/bla kho rin po che 'jigs med 'phrin las rgya mtshos mdzad pa kha byang du (khri chen 'jam dbyangs bstan pa'i nyi ma dpal bzang po zhal snga nas kyi rnam par thar pa bskal bzang mgrin rgyan (shing dpar ma la shog grangs 24yod pa zhig rje de nyid kyis gsung 'bum pod (cha)pa'i nang bzhugs}
gung thang mkhan po bskal bzang yon tan|{tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho mchog sgra dang snyan ngag skar rtsis sogs gsan bzhes gnang skabs yongs 'dzin gyi khar bzhes shing/rjes su zha lu dgon pa'i mkhan 'dzin dang/sku sger gyi mchod dpon mkhan po bcas yun ring gnang zhing/dgung lo mthon por phebs skabs mchod dpon gyi 'og khur dgongs zhu gnang ba'i gzigs gsos su gung thang bla grang gi bdag gnyer go gnas gnang bar brten tshal gung thang dgon pa lho byang gnyis kar nyams gso gsar bzhengs dang khyad med pa gnang thog /dgon pa'i sgrigs lam da nga/cho ga phyag bzhes/mchod rgyun gtong sgo bcas phyogs gang ci'i thad da bdag gnyer do dam nan tan mdzad pa bcas kyi lo rgyus (gung thang dpal gyi gtsug lag khang byung ba rabs dang bcas pa'i dkar chag 'gro mgon zhal lung )zhes ser smad 'jog ri ngag dbang bstan 'dzin gyis mdzad pa shing dpar la shog grangs 76yod pa rje de nyid kyi gsung 'bum pod (kha)pa'i nang du bzhugs pa der gsal}
gung thang gi mi la ras pa|{gangs can gsang sngags gsar ma'i snyan brgyud man ngag yongs kyi srol 'byed chen po mar pa lo tsA ba la thugs sras ma chog tu gyur pa ka chen bzhi (1 gzhung gi rngog ston chos rdor/2 dol gyi mtshur ston dbang gi rdo rje/3 gtsang gi mes ston tshon po bsod nams rgyal mtshan/4 gung thang gi mi la ras pa rje rgyal mtshan bcas )byung ba'i nang gses zhig ste/yongs grags su rje btsun mi la ras pa zhes brjod srol yod/gsham gsal rje btsun mi la ras pa zhes pa'i tshig 'grel la gzigs}
gung thang sgo bzhi|{de sngon bod sil bu'i dus skabs su mnga' ris mang yul gung thang khul du sger btsan dbang sgyur byas pa'i dpon rigs phyi tshul du rab byung gi chas bzung ba'i mkhan po sde bzhi la gung thung sgo bzhi zer ba ste/1 lo paN gyis che ba yang thog /2 mthu yis che ba go tsho (de gnyis mnga' ris rdzong dkar gyi nye 'dabs 'dzangs gzhung na yod/) 3 'bangs kyis che ba ro kam gshong/4 zam 'phrang gis che ba gsar tsho (de nub ra yod )pa bcas sa skya'i mnga' 'og tu ma 'dus par yod skabs mnga' bdag 'bum da mgon gyis srid dbang bzung skabs mnga' go tu bsdus nas/sde tshan brgya tsho bcu gsum du gtan la phab yod pa ste/1 gung thang/2 skyid grung/3 nub ra/4 ma zhal rgya tsang pa/5 glo stod/6 glo smad/7 dol gru/8 bzang rgyud pa/9 gnyams/10 dang 'u/11 phu ri mtsho 'khor/12 gtsang po zangs tsha/13 pha bzhi chags kyi brgya skor )sa skya'i lnga nyi ma 'bum yi skal rdzongs la gnang )bcas yin/brgya rtsi 'di dag don dngos su bcu tsho yin kyang brgya tshor brtsis nas gtan 'bebs byas pa yin zhes ka thog rig 'dzin chen pos mdzad pa'i (mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal rabs )su gsal}
gung thang chos sde chen po|{mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal po khri 'bum lde mgon gyir rab byung lnga pa'i lcags rta (1270)lor gsar bzhengs gnang ba'i gtsug lag khang chen po zhig ste/mnga' ris rdzong dkar nga gi nye 'dabs su yod/gtsug lag khang ka ba drug cu tham pa (sbug gi dri gtsang khang la ka ba nyi shu rtsa bzhi/mdo'i khyams skor la ka ba sum cu so drug )yod pa ka gdan rnams rdo chen brkos ris ma dang/ka ba rnams ka chen sha stag /logs zhal rnams la bla brgyud dang/sangs rgyas/byang sems/yi dam/chos srung bcas kyi ldebs bris ngo mtshar shin tu che ba dang/gtsug lag khang gi bkod pa legs shing brtsig pa sra brtan gyi tshad ni rab byung lnga pa'i lcags rta (1270)lor thog mar bzhengs pa nas rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me yos (1747)lor ka thog rig 'dzin chen po tshe dbang nor bus lor (mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal rabs )brtsams pa'i lo bar lo bzhi brgya dang bdun cu don bdun song ba dang phyis su gtsug lag khang la bdag gnyer legs po byung med zhig ral rdib 'khyom yo 'chug cung da kyang ma song bar gnas pa 'di na ngo mtshar ba'i yul du snang zhes (rgyal rabs )gong gsal nang 'khod 'dug /gtsug khang lag 'di'i rten gtso bo gser zangs kyi mchod rten bkra shes sgo mang rin po che'i phra rgyan tu son pa slob dpon dbyig gnyen gyi dbu thod dang/mgon po klu sgrub kyi thugs dam rten gser bris kyi brgyad stong pa/slob dpon chen po pad+ma 'byung gnas kyi thugs dam rten rdo rje/lo chen bai ro tsA na'i phyag mkhar/mkha' 'gro ye shes mtsho rgyal gyi sku rgyan sogs rtse che'i rten mang du bzhugs par (mnga' ris gung thang gi rgyal rabs )der gsal}
gung thang pa bde ba'i blo gros|{'brang spangs shag skor grwa tshang gi mkhan rabs drug pa yin cing/snyan ngag la mkhas pa'i (snyan ngag me long gi 'grel pa )zhig mdzad yod tshul dkar chag 'ga' zhig tu gsal ba las dngos su ma 'jal lags}
gung thang blo gros rgya mtsho|{rje 'di mdo smad du rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags phag (1851)lor 'khrungs/sku chung dus nas skyes sbyangs kyi shes rab ches cher 'phel bas mdo sngags dang rig gnas sogs la mkhas pa'i grags pa phyogs yongs la khyab pa zhig byung zhing/bla brang bkra shis 'khyil gyi dge bshes khyad du 'phags pa zhig yin/mdo sngags kyi bstan bcos kyang mang du mdzad pa ste/(chos 'dul ba rgya mtsho'i dgongs don gsal bar byed pa'i tsit+ta ma Ni'i phreng mdzes blo gsal mgul rgyan) ('dul ba rgya mtsho'i dgongs don gzhi smad/) (dbu ma'i mtha' dpyod lung rigs gter mdzod dgongs don gsal bar byed pa'i nyin byed snang ba/) (rtags rigs kyi mtha' dpyod dka' gnad/) (blo rig gi mtha' dpyod sogs kyi dka' gnad cung zad bshad pa rin chen phreng ba/) (phar phyin skabs bzhi pa'i bsdus don gyi 'grel pa blo gsal mgrin rgyan)sogs pod 'bring dgu tsam mdzad/sku gshegs pa'i lo zla kha gsal ma da rung dgung lo brgyad cu lhag tsam bzhugs}
gung thang bla ma zhang|{gung thang bla ma zhang brtson 'grus grags pa ni 'khrungs pa'i yul ngam shod tsha grur zhang gi rigs las byung bi yab sngags 'chang rdo rje sems dpa' dang yum mang skyid gnyis kyi sras su bod rab byung gnyis pa'i cha stag (1122)lor sku bltams/rab byung gsum pa'i chu glang (1193)lor gshegs/dgung la don gsum bzhugs/dgung lo lnga drug skabs nas yab kyis dmyal ba'i sdug bsngal bshad pas 'jigs skrag chen po bskyed nas yab la ci phun zhus pas yab kyis phyag dang bskor ba la brtson na phan pa gsung/de nas nyin mtshan kun tu de ltar brtson/lo bdun la son skabs yi ge bslab pas myur bar mkhyen/dgung lo dgu la bye'u stong pa la (mdo sdud pa )dang/(mngon rtogs rgyan )gsan/lo bcu gcig la slob dpon rngog sde/las dgyes pa rdo rje/gum mahA ma ya sogs gsan/'jam dpal gsang ldan la bshad pa mdzad/saM bu lo tsA ba las mngon pa dang/tshad ma sogs gsan/dgung lo bco brgyad la son skabs pha tshan gyis brnyas pa byung bas de dag la lo gsum bar mthu bsgrubs nas tshar bcad/dgung lo nyer gsum la khams su byon nas slob dpon blo ston bya la las sdom pa blangs/lo gcig tsam gyis mngon spyod mdzad/'khor ba la snying po med par gzigs nas 'phro bcad/dgung lo nyer drug la son skabs mkhar 'go pas man po dang grab mkhar bas slob dpon mdzad nas bsnyen par rdzogs/mtshan brtson 'grus grags pa zhes gsol/lo gcig ring la na bza' brje ba ma gtogs sku rags ma bshig par byang chub ltung bshags la thugs dam mdzad cing bzhugs/dpal gra lo chen po sog tu phebs pa'i spyan sngar byon/zhal mthong ba tsam gyis dad pa lhag par skyes/gsang sngags kyi gdams pa mang po zhus/de rjes gegs sel mdzad nas dka' thub kyis ri khrod 'grims/slar lo gsum song rjes dpal rga lo dang mjal/gdams ngag lhag ma gsan/dgung lo sor gsum par dwags sgom pa tshul khrims snying po dang mjal nas dwags pa bka' brgyud kyi chos gsan/lhan gcig skyes sbyor gnang ba bsgom pas shes rab kyi rtsal 'khrungs/gsung rab rnams kyi tshig don mkhyen/slob dpon gyis de thams cad brtag dpyad byas pas shes pa yin pas de brtag dpyad ma byas par rtse gcig tu sgoms shig gsungs pas de bzhin du bsgoms pas stong pa nyid kyi ltab mngon sum du rtogs te 'khor 'das/sa lam/bya byed thams cad gzhi rtsa dang bral ba thugs su chud/dgung lo so gsum pa la dwags sgom tshul khrims snying po dang mjal nas dwags po bka' brgyud kyi chos gsan/de nas lo mang ring ri khrod nges med du sgom sgrub mdzad de nas sku tshe'i dkyil nang sku tshe'i smad du ma slebs bar lho kha dang 'bri khung 'ol kha sa khul gyi sger btsan dpon rigs mang por dmag drangs te kho tsho'i mi sde rnams dbang 'og tu bsdus par mdzad sku tshe'i smad du karma pa dus gsum mkhyen pas re 'dun zhus pa ltar de nas bzung sku tshe ma rdzogs par du dmag mtshams 'jog pa gnang rab byung gsum pa'i shing lug (1175)lor tshal yang dgon dang de nas lo bcu gsum song bar rab byung gsum pa'i me lug (1187)lor gung thang gi dgon par btab nas lha chen dpal 'bar bzhengs de nas dar spel byung chos lugs la tshal pa bka' brgyud zer zhing ming gzhan dwags po bka' brgyud kyang zer sgom pa tshul khrims snying po'i bka' bzhi lha sa'i ra sa 'phrul snang gi gtsug lag khang nyams gso bdag gces dus mchod pa bla na med pa spros te zhabs tog rgya chen por mdzad tshal dang gung thang gnyis ka'i bdag gces dang 'chad nyan rgyu mi chad par mdzad spyir chos 'brel thob pa'i bla ma bzhi bcu rtsa bzhi dang gtso che ba'i bla ma drug ste rtsa mi sangs rgyas grags pa dpal chen rga lo gling kha ba'i lo ma mal yer pa byang sems 'ol kha ba dwags po sgom pa tshul khrims snying po grub tho bai ro tsa na ste de dag gi yon tan bum pa gang byo'i tshul du gsan slob ma yang lha ri ba nam mkha' 'od lha phrug nyi ma 'od kha rag grwa pa 'dul ba 'od 'bri shAkya 'od mnyam med shAkya ye shes brag dkar shes rab ye shes sogs dang 'gro mgon gtsang pa rgya ras sogs mang po yod gsum rtsom zhang rang gi dus phyag bstar ma'i phyag bris ngo ma pod lnga tsam gung thang bla brang gi nang rten du yod 'dug ma dpe de nas bshus pa'i bris ma mi rigs pho brang dang po tA la bla brang bkra shis 'khyil bcas su yod rnam thar rgyas pa ni (deb ther sngon po'i )le tshan (nya)pa'i shog grangs 136nas 138bar dang (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )le tshan (na)pa'i shog grangs 35nas shog grangs 37bar gsal yang tshal pa kun dga' rdo rjes brtsams pa'i (lba ma zhang gi rnam thar rgyas pa )zhig yod ces dkar chag tu 'khod kyang bdag gis da phan ma mthong lags}
gung thung gtsug lag khang|{gong gsal gung thang zhes pa'i 'grel bshad der gzigs}
gung paN+Di ta|{rdo ring bka' blon kun paN+Di ta/ming dngos la mgon po dngos grub rab brtan zer/'di'i pha na da'i cha'ing sba dur gyi gcung po mnga' ris sgar dpon tshe brtan bkra shis dang ma bsod nams lha sgron la bu gsum yod pa'i (che ba rnam rgyal tshe brtan/'bring ba gung paN+Di ta chung ba lho brag nyi lde sprul sku blo bzang gar dbang mchog grub )'bring po yin/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags glang (1721)lor 'khrungs/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu byi (1792)lo 'das/dgung lo chung dus smin grol gling du slob dpon chos rdzong pa'i sar lo bdun ring yi ge dang rig gnas slob sbyong mdzad rjes/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho dang/pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas gnyis kyi mdun sgra dang sdeb sbyor/skar rtsis/snyan dngags bcas cha tshang ba'i rgyugs 'bul byas par brten/bya dga'i dngos po mang po sprad thog no yon paN+Di ta zhes pa'i ming gi gzengs bstod sprad cing/de nas mi ring bar gcen po gung rnam rgyal tshe brtan nad mnar gyis 'das rjes tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa dang/pho lha tha'i ji gnyis nas gung rnam rgyal tshe brtan 'das pa dang/khong gi gcung po no yon paN+Di ta la rig gnas kyi shes yon dang chab srid kyi 'jon thang yag po yod pa'i gnas tshul skor gong ma chen lung la zhus par brten chen lung khri lo lnga pa (1740)lor bka' phab ste gcen po gung rnam rgyal tshe brtan gyi gung gi go gnas de gcung po no yon paN+Di ta la mu mthun nas brgyud 'dzin byed tu bcug pa red/chen lung khri lo bco lnga'i (1750)lor bka' phab pa ltar pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas kyi bu 'gyur med rnam rgyal bod sdom am ban h+phu chin dang lab tun gnyis kyis srog thog btang rjes/de'i rjes 'brang mgron gnyer blo bzang bkra shis sogs kyis lha sar sdom pa'i am ban gnyis dang las byed/tshong pa sogs rgya rigs mang che ba bsad pa'i zing 'khrugs byung skabs/no yon paN+Di ta nas thabs mkhas kyis ngo log byed gte rnams 'dzin bzung byas nas skabs 'phral kyi lhing 'jags yong ba byed thub pa brten/de'i yi lo bka' shag gsar du 'dzugs skabs bka' blon gyi gtso bo no yon gung paN+Di ta la byed du bcug pa/de nas bzung chen lung khri lo zhe bdun pa (1782)lo bar lo sum cu so gnyis ring bka' blon gyi las 'gan 'khur rjes na gras lus gcong gis dgongs zhu byas shing/dgongs pa zhus rjes su'ang las don gal che'i rigs la bka' yig byung 'phral las ka sngar bzhin byed dgos byung yod}
gung ri gung btsan|{yongs grags kyi bod yig lo rgyus yig cha phal che ba'i nang/srong btsan sgam po dgung lo brgyad cu lhag bzhugs pa dang/btsun mo mong bzang khri lcam la sras gung ri gung btsan 'khrungs pa/sras de dgung lo bcu gsum lon skabs rgyal srid la bskos nas lo lnga ring srid dbang bskyangs pa/sras de dang btsun mo 'a zha bza' mong rje khri dkar gnyis la sras mang srong mang btsan 'khrungs pa bcas bshad tshul gcig gyur lta bu yin/mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel sogs deng skabs rgyal khab phyi nang gi mkhan dbang mang pos srong btsan sgam po me glang (617)la 'khrungs nas dgung lo nyi shu rtsa lnga pa lcags glang (641)lor rgya bza' btsun mor bzhes pa dang/de nas dgung lo so bzhi lcags khyi (650)lor gshegs par bzhed pa de'i dbang du byas na srong btsan gyi sras gung ri gung btsan dgung lo bco brgyad la yang srong btsan gong du gshags pas gung ri gung btsan gyi sras mang srong mang btsan yab kyi dgung lo bcu bdun yas mas la 'khrungs dgos pa dang/mes po srong btsan sgam po gshegs dus tsha bo mang srong mang btsan dgung lo bcu gsum lon yod pa ltar na/yang gung ri gung btsan dgung lo lnga la slebs dus sras mang srong mang btsan 'khrungs dgos pas ha cang rgod bro ba'i gnas shig yin/dbal mang dkon mchog rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (rgya bod hor sog gi lo rgyus )su gung srong dang mang srong gnyis sku mched yin par bzhed pa de khungs gang 'dra zhig la brten nas gsungs pa yin min ma gsal ba sogs dogs gcod bya dgos pa mang po yod pas 'dir yi ge mang dogs kyis mi bris so/_/btsan po 'di'i bang so ni don mkhar mda' (srong btsan bang so'i mdun ngos kyi ri )la brtsigs shing/mes po gnam ri srong btsan gyi bang so'i g.yon ngos su yod cing/bang so'i ming la gung chen gung ri zer}
gung ru mkha' 'gro ma|{mdo smad rgan rgya khul du byung ba'i bud med kyi sprul sku zhig ste/'di'i sku phreng dang po lha rtse dpon mo bsod nams rgyan/de'i sku phreng gnyis pa mdo smad khul du 'khrungs pa blo bzang chos sgron/sku phreng gsum pa blo bzang sgrol ma/sku phreng bzhi pa dkon mchog chos sgron/(gung thang bstan pa'i sgron me dang dus mtshungs )sku phreng lnga pa dkon mchog rig 'dzin sgrol ma/sku phreng drug pa dkon mchog rig 'dzin dpal mo bcas mtshan tho tsam (sku 'bum gdan rabs )las gsal zhing sku phreng drug pa 'di'i drung nas thu'u bkwan yongs 'dzin bstan pa rgya mtshos chos 'grel mang po gsan pa dang/rnam thar yang dam pa des mdzad pa kha byang du (gung ru ye shes kyi mkha' 'gro ma'i rnam par thar pa pad dkar 'khri shing )la shog grangs 18yod pa zhig dam pa de'i gsung 'bum pod (ka)pa'i nang bzhugs/sku phreng bdun pa dkon mchog bstan pa'i dbang mo/sku phreng brgyad pa da lta zhal bzhugs pa dkon mchog dam chos sgrol ma (1990)lor dgung lo lnga bcu lhag tsam du phebs yod skad 'dug }
gung ru rgyal mtshan bzang po|{rje tsong kha pa chen po'i zhal slob gyi nang nas 'phrin las nam mkha' nga mnyam pa'i bu chen bzhi zhes grags pa'i ya gyal zhig yin/mdo stod lho rong du rab byung drug pa'i chu phag (1383)lor 'khrungs/dbus su phebs nas rje tsong kha pa dang/byang sems rwa sgreng pa shAkya bsod nams sogs bsten nas dgung lo nyi shu lhag bzhes skabs rje tsong kha pas mkhan po dang/'dul 'dzin grags pa rgyal mtshan gyis las slob/rgyal tshab rin po ches gsang stong mdzad de bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/chen po dwags po ba dang/slob dpon dge legs rgyal mtshan gnyis rtsod pas pham par mdzad/gsang phu'i be ser grwa tshang gi 'chad nyan slob dpon lo shas mdzad rjes se ra'i mkhan por phebs te/de'i zhor la btsun mo tshal gyi dgon pa yang zhor skyong gnang ste long sum cu lhag tsam gyi ring 'chad nyan gyi thugs 'gan bzhes pas slob ma yang grags che ma mkhas grub dpal ldan seng ge dang/sgo mang mkhan po gung ru rin chen byang chub/'brong steng bla ma sangs rgyas tshul khrims/kong po ri kha dgon gyi bla ma grags pa 'od zer/kong po spungs mkhar dgon gyi bla ma rgyal mchog pa sogs mang du byung/lcags rta (1440)lor se ra dgon pa rang du sku gshegs/sku gdung ril por bzhag pa'i gdung rten dngul las bzhengs pa'i dbyen bsdums mchod rten khyim gyi nang rje tsong kha pa'i sku brnyan bzhugs pa de'i nang yod (se ra sngags pa grwa tshang gi steng thog 'od dpag med kyi lha khang gi g.yas ngos su bzhugs pa de yin/gsung rtsom skor/(phar phyin mngon rtogs rgyan gyi mi pham dgongs rgyan/) (mdo sde rgyan gyi 'grel pa/) (dbus mtha' rnam 'byed kyi 'grel pa/) (chos nyin rnam 'byed kyi 'grel pa/) (rgyud bla ma'i 'grel pa/) (dbu ma rtsa ba shes rab kyi 'grel pa/) (dbu ma 'jug pa'i 'grel pa/) (dbu ma'i stong thun/) (tshad ma'i bstan bcos mkhas pa dga' skyed/) (mdzod kyi 'grel pa/) ('dul ba'i spyi don )bcas yod par bla brang a khu rin po che shes rab rgya mtshon mdzad pa'i (dpe rgyun dkon pa 'ga' zhig gi tho yig )las gsungs shing/gsung rtsom de rnams sngon dus se ra smad grwa tsang gi yig cha yin kyang rjes su dar spel ma byung ba ni/rje 'dis mdzad pa'i (dbu ma'i 'grel pa )khang gi nang lta ba sgom tshul thad rje tsong kha pa'i gsung rgyun bkod pa'i zhar la yang na zhes dam pa gzhan gi lta ba'i bzhed tshul rnams grangs tsam du bkod yod par brten mkhas grub rin po che sogs rje tsong kha pa'i dngos slob gzhan gyi dgongs par ma babs pa'i dbang gis dpe rgyun dpar skrun byed rgyur 'gog rkyen byung ba yin zhes gsung srol yod pa'i dbang gis rjes su dga' ldan khri thog nyer gnyis pa ser smad rgyal rong dge 'dun bstan pa dar rgyas mchog ser smad kyi 'chad nyan slob dpon mdzad skabs su phar phyin dang dbu ma gnyis kyi spyi don dang mtha' dpyod bcas cha tshang gsar rtsom mdzad pa yin}
gung ru chos kyi 'byung gnas|{mtshan dngos rin chen byang chub zer/'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang gi yig cha rnying pa mdzad pa po yin/'dis mdzad pa'i phar phyin skabs dang po la shog grangs 209/skabs gnyis par shog grangs 39/skabs gsum par shog grangs 17/skabs bzhi par shog grangs 88/skabs lnga par shog grangs 18/skabs drug pa dang bdun pa gnyis la shog grangs 3/skabs brgyad par shog grangs 30bcas dang/dge 'dun nyi shu shog grangs 46/rten 'brel la shog grangs 32/drang nges la shog grangs 99/bsam gzugs la shog grangs 27/dbu ma la log grangs 20bcas yod par klong rdol bla ma rin po ches gsungs}
gung ru rin chen byang chub|{'bras spungs gdan rabs gsum pa yin/'di ni mdo stod gung ra'i sa char 'khrungs/dbus su phebs nas gsang phu'i be ser grwa tshang du gung ru rgyal mtshan bzang po dang/dga' ldan du rgyal tshab dam pa rin chen rnam gnyis la brten nas gzhung chen mor sbyangs pa mdzad/rjes su gsang phu'i be ser grwa tshang gi 'chad nyan slob dpon du byon nas (phar phyin gyi spyi don )yang brtsams par mdzad/rjes su gsang phu'i gling stod kyi chos rje'i khrir phebs te (tshad ma rnams 'grel gyi spyi don )mdzad/de rjes 'bras spungs kyi mkhan por phebs nas byams chos sde lnga'i 'chad nyan mdzad mus su sku gshegs/lo rgyus zhib pa da phan ma mjal lugs}
gung srong gung btsan|{(gung ri gung btsan yang zhu )bod rgyal so bzhi pa/yab srong btsan sgam po dang yum mong bza' khri lcam gnyis kyi sras su bod sa sprul (spyi lo 669)lor 'khrungs zhes grags/'di nyid 'khrungs yul brag lha bkra shis gzhal yas khang du yin/rgyal sras zla ba gsar pa gangs can shar ri'i rtse nas lhags pas rgyal po yab yum blon 'bangs dang bcas pas thugs yid kyi spro ba rab tu brtas shing/btsas ston yang rgya che gzab rgyas mdzad/dgung lo bcu gsum la phebs skabs yab kyis rgyal sar bskos/blon po myang mang po rje zhang snang dang snubs btsan to res byas/'a zha bza' mong rje khri dkar khab tu bzhes/rgyal po 'di'i dus su rgya nag nas ja dang rol mo bod du dar zhes grags/rang gi yum dang lhan du dpal gyi yer pa'i lha khang bzhengs/rgyal srid lo lnga bskyangs te dgung lo bco brgyad la phebs pa me khyi (686)lor yab kyi sngon du sku gshegs par grags/gung srong bang so don mkhar mda' ru brtsigs/gral ni gnas ri srong btsan g.yon na yod/ming gi gung chin gung ri lags so skad}
