gur pa grwa tshang|{rgyal rtse dpal 'khor chos sde'i dgon par sa skya'i grwa tshang bzhi dang/dge lugs grwa tshang bdun/bu ston lugs grwa tshang lnga/sa dge mnyam 'dres grwa tshang gcig bcas bsdoms pa'i grwa tshang khag bcu bdun yod ('di gsham yi rgyal rtse dpal 'khor chos rje zhes pa'i 'grel bshad nang gsal )pa'i nang gses sa lugs grwa tshang bzhi'i (1 mngon dga' grwa tshang/2 khang gsar grwa tshang/3 bde ba can pa/4 gur pa grwa tshang bcas )gras yin/grwa tshang 'dir phyag bzhes yod pa'i cho ga ni/1 rdo rje gur rigs bsdus mkha' 'gro lnga'i cho ga dang/2 sa lugs rdo rje phur pa/3 bde mchog nag po lugs/4 bdag med lha mo bco lnga/5 kyai rdor mtshon cha can/6 sgrol ma lha bdun/7 gsang 'dus jo bo lugs 'jig rten dbang phyug /8 'jigs byed gdong drug /9 bde chen ral gcig /10 tshe dpag med lha dgu bcas kyi cho ga dang/sa lugs rdo rje phur pa'i gar 'cham bcas yod tshul (rab brtan kun bzang gi rnam thar )las gsal (grwa tshang 'di rgyal rtse mchod rten chen po'i mdun ngos lho phyogs su yod/)}
