ge sar rgyal po|{bod kyi lo rgyus thog grangs che ba'i ge sar rgyal po zhes pa 'dir bshad tshul rigs ma 'dra ba mang po byung yod pa ste/gcig /1 ge sar dmag gi rgyal po/2 gling ge sar rgyal po/4 khrom ge sar rgyal po bcas mi gcig yin nam so so ba yin pa/gnyis/de gsum lo rgyus thog byung myong yod dam med/gsum/de gsum dus skabs gang du byung yod med bcas/skabs 'dir (skabs 'dir zhes pa ni (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )shog grangs 156thog ge sar rgyal po shing la rta ltar 'tshab ces par go dgos )bshad pa'i ge sar ni/khrom ge sar rgyal po ste/lo rgyus yig cha mang por ge sar dmag gi rgyal po zhes bshad srol yod pa de yin cing/de ni gling ge sar rgyal po zer ba de min par/sog po jun gar gyi mi ba rgyud sngon mo sog rigs kyi ge sar la go dgos pa ste/thu'u bkwan blo bzang chos kyi nyi mas mdzad pa'i (lcang skya rol pa'i rdo rje'i rnam thar )lha sa dpar ma las/ge sar dmag gi rgyal po jun gar zhes/dpa' rtsal dregs pas dgra sde'i snying 'dar ba/_/de yi chab srid mkha' la bdud rtsi'i 'od/_/'grems pa'i mi yi zla ba mang zhig shar/_/zhes gsungs pa ltar go dgos pa ma zad/sog po'i rgyal rabs 'ga' zhig nang bod kyi rgyal po gri gum btsan po'i sras gsum gyi tha chung nya khri sog skad du bor ta ze ba zhes par kong po'i yul nas btsun mo ga ma ral zhes pa zhig blang ba khrid nas sog yul du byon te/pe ta zhes pa'i mi sde rnams kyis dpon du bskos pa la bor ta che no zhes grags pa de byung tshul bshad yod pa khungs btsan min ji ltar yang/srong btsan sgam po'i sngon nas sog yog du snyan grags can gyi rgyal brgyud mang tsam byung yod pa nges can dang/de 'dra'i gras nas dpal rtsal can gyi rgyal po zhig byung ba de la bod kyi lo rgyus (bka' chems ka khol ma )sogs las khrom ge shar dmag gi rgyal po zhes pa'i bshad srol de byung ba yin nam snyam zhing/jun gar gyi rgyal rabs skor/'og tu jun gar gyi rgyal po tshe dbang rab brtan zhes pa'i 'grel bshad la gzigs/gzhan yang ge sar rgyal po'i skor gyi dpyad brjod khag mang po yod pa dang/de'i nang nas rgyas bsdus 'tshams la dpyad gzhi cung zad c