gong dkar rdo rje gdan|{sa skya'i bla chen brag thog pa bsod nams bzang po'i slob ma thu mi kun dga' rnam rgyal las yongs grags su gong dkar rdo rje gdan pa kun dga' rnam rgyal zhu ba des skyid smad chu shul dang thag nye bar rab byung brgyad pa'i shing sprel (1446)lor phyag btab pa'i dgon pa zhig ste yongs grags su gong dkar chos sde zer ba de yin/ka thog si tu rin po che chos kyi rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i (gnas yig )las dgon 'di'i 'du khang la ka ba drug cu re bzhi dang 'du khang gi g.yas su mgon khang ka brgyad pa'i nang mkhyen brtse chen mo'i phyag bzo mgo po gung lha bcu gnyis pa'i 'jim sku mtho 'dom do dang phyed ka tsam re/'du khang nang du ldebs bris pa mkhyen rtse chen mo'i phyag bris sangs rgyas 'khrungs rabs dpa' bsam 'khri shing bris cha 'gran zla bral ba 'du khang sbug gi mchod khang ka bzhi'i nang grub chen ga ya d+ha ra'i dbu thod bzhugs pa'i thub dbang gi sku thog so gsum tsam dang/g.yas g.yon du sku tshad 'dom gsum re yod pa'i nyer ba'i sras brgyad/nyan thos mchog zung gnyis dang ma 'gags pa/kun dga' bo bcas/yab yum gnyis/lha tshangs pa dang brgya byin bcas sku tshad 'dom do re tsam/gzhan yang 'du khang g.yon du lha khang ka gnyis ma'i nang 'jigs byed dang/rdo rje phur pa/dkar bdud lcam dral/las gshin dang/tsa mun+di sogs yod pa/steng thog gi kyai rdo rje'i lha khang ka bzhi ma'i nang kyai rdo rje sprul sku sle'u chung gi phyag bzo/gzhan yang kyai rdor dang/'jigs byed/bde mchog /dus 'khor bcas dang/legs bris ma/rgyus sde'i dkyil 'khor cha tshang ba'i ldebs bris mkhyen brtse chen mo'i phyag bris spus legs bcas/g.yon ngos su lam 'bras lha khang ka bzhi ma dag bka' 'gyur lha khang/bar khang du rdor dbyings lha khang ka brgya ma/dbu rtse bla ma lha khang ka ba bcu drug yod pa'i nang man brtse chen mo'i phyag bzo/lam 'bras bla brgyud kyi 'dra sku cha tshang mi tshad lhag tsam/bzhugs khri dang/na bza' sogs bkod pa legs shing/'dra p+saku rnams bla ma de dang de dngos yin pa lta bu'i gson nyams ldan pa'i sgyu rtsal phu du phyin pa bcas yod/dgon gnas 'dir grwa grangs brgya dang drug cu lhag tsam dang khang tshan bzhi (1 rin chen sgang/2 kun bzang rtse/3 kun snang/4 'bras spungs )bcas yod cing/sngags sde yin/dgon 'dir gsang sngags kyi sgrub mchod yod pa ni/1 dus 'khor/2 rdor dbyings/3 dpal mchog /4 rtse mo/5 sam bu Ta/6 rnam snang mngon byang/7 rje gdan pa'i 'jigs byed/8 sa lugs rdo rje phur pa sogs yin/dgon 'di'i gar 'chang rnams sa skya'i phyag bzhes ltar yod pa'i thog thun mong ma yin pa'i khyad chos ldan pa'i gar 'cham ni/gong dkar chos sde'i rnga 'cham zhes bod yongs su snyan grags pa zhig yin/gzhan yang dpe mdzod khang du sa skya dang/rnying lugs kyi yig cha bris ma mang po dang shing dpar sna tshogs yod/zhib par ka shog si tu rin po che chos kyi rgyal mtshos 'dzin pa'i (gnas yig )sde dge dpar ma'i grangs 77nas 80bar yod pa der gzigs}
gong dkar rdo rje gdan pa kun dga' rnam rgyal|{mtshan gzhan thu mi kun dga' rnam rgyal yang zhu/lho kha ra nang rgyal chen gling du yab thon mi sam ho Ta'i gdung rgyun rgyal ba shes rab dang/yum rdo rje dbe ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bdun pa'i chu byi (143)lor 'khrungs/de dus rkyen sel rim gro la (gzung grang lnga )klog pa la brten nas chung dus su mtshan la gra lnga rgyal por 'bod cing/yi ge 'bri klog sogs dka' tshegs chen po ma dgos par man pas yum gyi thugs la 'jig rten gyi srid skyong ba mkhyen pas yum gyi thugs la 'jig rten gyi srid skyong ma zhig yong rgyur dgongs nas (skye bo gso thigs )dang/(sa skya legs bshad/) (mi chos gnad phreng )sogs 'jig rten lugs kyi bstan bcos sna tshogs klog tu bcug par/phyi tshul du yum gyi bka' mi bcag pa'i ched du de dag gzigs nas lkog tu nang bstan chos lugs kyi gzhung mang po gzigs par mdzad/dgung lo bcu gsum pa shing byi (1444)lor yum gyi thugs 'dod ltar sde gdong gong ma grags pa 'byung gnas kyi zhabs gras su phebs/dgung lo bco lnga pa me stag (1446)lor/gzhis ka gong dkar gyi rdzong dpon du bskos pas yongs grags kyi lo rgyus yig cha 'ga' zhig nang dpon chen gra lnga zhes 'khod yod/bu mo zhig khab tu bzhes te sras kyang yo/dgung lo nyi shu pa rab byung brgyad pa'i lcags lug (1451)lor brag thog pa bsod nams bzang po'i drung du rab byung mdzad/dgung lo nyer bdun pa sa stag (1458)lor paN chen byams pa gling pa bsod nams rnam rgyal gyi drung nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa zhus pa'i mtshan kun dga' rnam rgyal zhes gsol/dgung lo bzhi bcu zhe gsum pa shing rta (1474)lor paN chen de nyid kyi drung nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/brag thog pa bsod nams bzang po las sa lugs kyi chos skor dang/paN chen byams pa gling pa las rig gnas dang dus 'khor/shar chen/gzhan yang rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta nags kyi rin chen dang/snye mdo sngags 'chang shakyA dpal sogs bla ma nyi shu rtsa bzhi tsam bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos rgyun ha cang mang po zhig gsan/dgung lo so gsum pa shing sprel (1464)lor gong dkar rdo rje gdan gyi chos sde chen po phyag btab ('di la (zha lu'i chos 'byung )dpar ma'i shog grangs 88par/dgung lo so gsum pa se sprel zhes gsal ba'i lo khams nor yod/don la shing sprel yin/) chos sde chen po 'di'i rten dang brten gnas yongs rdzogs grub par lo p+sakor gcig ste lo bcu gnyis 'gor zhing/gong du 'khod pa ltar rgyud sde khag mang po'i sgrub mchod phyag bzhes rigs gsar 'dzugs gnang/rgyun tu thugs dam nyams bzhes gtsor 'don mdzad/nyams rtogs phul du byung ba brnyes/dgung lo drug cu re lnga pa rab byung brgyad pa'i me 'brug (1496)lor gdan sa 'di rang du sku gshegs/gsung rtsom skor (rdo rje glu gar gyi bshad pa kun bzang rol pa'i dpung gnyen/) ('cham yig )sogs le tshan nyi shu tham pa'i dkar chag cig bla brang rje shes rab rgya mtsho'i mdzad pa'i (dpe rgyun dkon pa 'ga' zhig gi tho yig )shog grangs 56nas 57bar gsal/rnam thar lo rgyus skor zha lu blo bzang bstan skyong gis mdzad pa'i (zha la'i chos 'byung )shing dpar ma'i shog grangs 86nas 88bar gsal}
