gong ma|{rgya skad kyi ho'am d+hi {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i don bod skad du bsgyur ba ste/snga rabs rgyal nang du rgyal rabs thog mar byung skabs san ho'ang 'u d+hi zhes {(WP:1,194)}rgyal po ho'ang gsum dang d+hi lnga byung ba de dag yon tan che zhing/srid skyong ba la mkhan pas 'bangs rnams bde skyid dang ldan pa'i dus skabs yin pas/rgyal rabs rjes ma rnams kyi rgyal pos rang nyid ho'ang gsum dang d+hi lnga lta bu'i mdzad rjes yong rgyu'i ched du chin rgyal rabs kyi gong ma chin hri hong {(WP:1,194)}gis krung go rgyal yongs gcig gyur byas pa'i rjes su rang nyid la ho'ang d+hi {(WP:1,194)}rgyal rabs mjug ma sgril bar rgyal rabs rim byung gi rgyal po ho'ang d+hi zhes 'bod srol byung ba yin/bod kyi lo rgyus mang por rgya nag gi rgyal rabs 'dren pa'i skabs su/ci'u'i rgyal po sum cu so drug nas grangs 'dres pa las/de'i gong du rgyal rabs gzhan byung ba'i gsal kha mi snang zhing/(rgya nag chos 'byung )las de'i gong du ho'ang {(WP:1,194)}gsumadang d+hi {(WP:1,194)}lnga byung ba'i rjes su Te'u'am ce'u'i rgyal rabs byung bar bshad la/de bzhin du (deb ther dmar po )dang/(deb ther sngon po/) (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )rnams las yig nor dang ma dag rgyun 'byams 'ga' zhig 'dug pas/'dir (rgya nag chos 'byung )rang khungs mtshan par bsams nas de nyid gzhir bzhag thog /der mi gsal ba (deb ther sngon po )sogs nas khap+sakong ste mdor bsdus su bri bar/thog mar ho'ang gsum las/1 ho'ang dang po tha'i ho'u h+phu Shi zhi ('dis rigs rus mi 'chol ba'i phyir bag ma gtong len gyi srol 'dzugs/gya yig kyang 'di skabs thago mar byung ba/dbyibs la dpe bltas pa'i ri mo lta bur yod ces grags/smyug ma'i sam Ta la spra rtsi bri ba'i srol btod/) rgyal sar lo brgya dang bco lnga bsdad nas 'das/'di la rgyal rgyud bco lnga byung bar bshad kyang/rabs dang lo ji tsam thob pa'i gsal kha mi snang/2 ho'ang gnyis pa yan prati shen nung zhi/('di'i skabs zhing las dang brje tshong gi srol dang/chis pha zhes pa'i sman pa mkhas pa byang/) rgyal sar lor brgya dang bzhi bcu bsdad nas 'das/gdung brgyud rgyal po bdun byung ba rnams kyis lo sum brgyabadun cur rgyal sril bzungaba'i mthor/yu'i dbangargyal po skyong lugs mi mkhas pas/rgyal rigs blon chen Tha yi'u zer bas ngo log byas te dmag 'khrug bslang/rgyal po khri las phab/mda' gzhu gri mdung la sogs pa'i mtshon mang po thog mar bzos/'bangs rnams la khrims kyi chad pa shin tu lci ba'i rkyen gyis bzod mi thub par gyur/3 ho'ang gsum pa Sha'an yu'an 'di yon tan phun sum tshogs pa yod pas khams kyi r+Yal po 'di la (rgya nag chos 'byung )shog grangs 14las rgya nag gi yul ring por dbang ma thob kyang 'og tu rgyal phran 'ga' zhig yod pa ni khams kyi rgyal po'o/_/tsi na'i lugs la khams rgyal che shos rnams la shing rta stong par 'bod pa'i rgyu mtshan ni/'bangs mi khyim brgyad re la dmag mi gcig btsugs te/de 'dra'i dmag mi nyi shu rtsa lnga la khal rta bzhi res pradarangs pa'i shing rta chen po gcig phog par byas te/de 'dra'i shing rta chen po stong tshang ba'i dmag dpung gi bdag po yin pa'i rgyu mtshan gyis yin zhes dang rgyal phran (pA'i las ka dang dbang ma thob cing shing prata stong du ma tshang ba shing rta brgya pa la sogs pa rgyal phran yin )zhes (rgya nag chos 'byung )las bshad/gzhan dag dang 'bangs mi kun gyis gros mthun par spyi dpon du bskos/glang chen dang 'brug la sogs pa'i sgra gdangs 'dra ba'i mkhar rnga dang/rnga bo che dang/rag dung phra rags la sogs pa'i rol mo/khrab rmog /phub ring thung/ru 'dren gyi dpal rtags rgya mtshan dang ba dan/ru mtshon che chung sogs lag cha rnams thog mar bzos/de nas blon po Thi yi'u bzung ste bsad pa ni bsad khrims kyi thog ma yin/de nas ho'ang d+his kyangs rgyal po byas te/ming la hu'ang hi yi'u Shang zhi zer/'diskabs gru gzings dang/phyogs brtag 'okhar lo/rta 'then 'khor lo/rtsis sogs byung/dud 'gro rnams so so'i rang bzhin dang khyad chos la brtags nas bkol spyod byas/gzhan yang tshong khrong dang mkhar rdzog sogs gsar du btsugs/lo brgyar srid bzung nas/lo brgya dang bcu gcig la 'das/1 de nas d+hi dang po zhe'u ho'u kin thi yan/hu'ung d+his yi bu gnyis pa ste /lo brgyad cur srid bzung lo brgya tham par 'das/2 d+hi gnyis pa thu'un Sh+ya'i ka'u yang zhi (d+hi dang po'i bu che pa Thang yi zhes bya ba'i bu )'dis lo bdun cu rtsa brgyad srid bzung nas lo go bdun par 'das/rgyal po ka'u yang zhi 'di la bu bcu gnyis yod pa las mang du 'phel te/gong nas 'byung ba'i d+hi yo'u dang/d+hi zhun/dbang gsum/chin shi hu'ang (chin hri ho'ang )han gyi rgyal rabs sogs rgyal po chen po dang/rgyal phran mang du byung/d+hi gnyis pa'i nu bo byang phyogs kyi rgyal phran du bskos pa de'i rigs brgyus ni phyis kyi yu gur gyi rgyal brgyud rnams yin/yang d+hi gnyis pa'i yang tsha kyan len zer ba zhig pheng khams kyi rgyal por bskos pa d+hi yo'u'i dus nas bzung De'u'am ci'u rgyal rabs btsugs pa'i bar lo brgyad brgya thub pa/pheng tshur grags pa zhig kyang byung/3 d+hi gsum pa d+hi ku ka'u sin zhing/d+hi dang po'i tsha bo lo bdun cur srid bzung nas/lo brgya dang lnga la 'das/de rjes de'i bu d+hi Dis rgyal srid bzung bar lugs dang mthun par ma byas pas rgyal phran rnams dang mi dmangs gros mthun gyis khri las phabs/4 de rjes d+hi bzhi pa d+hi yo'u tho'u thang zhing/d+hi gsum pa'i bu chung ba yin/de sngon rgyal srid la ming zur pa med kyang/'di'i dus nas rgyal srid la ming zur pa med kyang/'di'i dus nas rgyal srid la thang gi ming btags lo brgyad cu srid bzung nas lo brgya dang bco lngar 'das/5 d+hi lnga pa d+hi zhun yi'u yus rgyal po ka'u yang zhi'i gdung brgyud las /rgyal phran ku ze'u zhes pa'i bu che ba yin/lo bzhi bcu zhe brgyad (go brgyad )ring srid bzung/srid kyi ming la yus zer/lo brgya dang bcur 'das/'di yan d+hi lnga'o/_/de nas dbang gsum ste/1 dbang dang po/Shi ya yu'i dbang/'di ka'u yang zhi'i tsha bo hu wang d+hi'i yang tsha mi rabs gnyis pa/'dis zhun gyi rgyal tshab so nyer brgyad/rgyal po lo bcu bdun byas/de nas rgyal rabs lnga pa d+hi Shang gi skabs rgyal phran han khru zhes pas rgyal srid phrogs pa ni/'bangs kyis rgyal por rgol nas rgyal srid 'phrogs pa'i thog ma yin/de nas blon chen rnying pa lI zhes pas rgyal srid tshur blangs nas/d+hi Sh+yang gi bu zho'u Shang rgyal srid la bzhag /2 dbang gnyis pa cheng thangs/de nas brtsis pa'i rabs bcu gnyis pa ki yi ye zer ba'i rgyal po des rgyal srid lugs dang mthun par ma bskyangs shing/rgyal phran rnams kyang rgyal po de dang mthun par ha cang gdug rtsub che ba'i rkyen gyis/hu'ang d+hi'i gdung brgyud rgyal phran cheng thang gis mgo 'khrid pa'i dmag gis mi dmangs la grogs byas te/rgyal po de dang rgyal phran ma rung ba rnams tshar bcad/rang nyid kyis rgyal srid bzung/rgyal srid kyi ming shang yin kyang de nas rgyal rabs bcu bdun pa phan keng rgyal pos yen du bsgyur/phan keng nas rabs bcu gnyis pa rgyal po ci'u zhes pa rgyal srid skyong lugs rgyal ngan ki si dang mtshungs par brten rgyal sa shor ro/_/3 dbang gsum pa wen u/ci'u rgyal po'i dus kyi rgyal phran zi pa zer ba de'i bu/ming dngos u dbang zer/ka'u zin zhi'e yang tsha mi rabs bcu drug pa yin/rgyal srid kyi ming Te'u zer/(lo rgyus rnams ce'u'am ce'u zhes snang/) 'di nas Te'u'i rgyal rabs mgo tshugs/Te'u rgya rabs 'di la rgyal po sum cu so drug byung ba/lo brgyad brgya bdun cu don gsum ring srid bzung/('di la (deb ther dmar po )sogs bod kyi lo rgyus tshang mar ci'i rgyal po sum cu so drug /lo brgyar srid bzung zhes bshad pa ni ma dag rgyun 'byams kho na ste/rgyal po sum cu so drug bsdoms pa'i yun la lo brgya las med du rgyal po re'i thob skal cha mnyam pas lo gnyis lhag mi 'byung bas/'dir gung mgon po skyabs kyi (rgya nag chos 'byung )rang khungs btsan par bsams nas de ltar bris/de ltar De'u'i rgyal rabs rnams khams kyi rgyal po rnams kyis bcom pa'i mthar/yan dbang/chu' dbang/tshin dbang/chi dbang/jo'u dbang/we'u dbang/han dbang bcas pa'i bdun (chi bdun/btsan po bdun )tsam lus pa mthar chin dbang (chin shi dbang/chin hri ho'ang )gis dbang du bsdus/lo bcu gnyis kyi ring rgyal srid bzung/de'i ring rgya dang sog po'i sa mtshams su lcags ri ring po zhes 'dzam gling thog snyan grags dang ldan pa de brtsigs/blon po rnams kyis phogs blangs te rgyal khab kyi las don sgrub pa'i srol btsugs/ho'ang gsum dang d+hi lnga las rang gi yon tan lhag go zhes ho'ang dang d+hi gnyis ka'i ming mnyam gshibs te btags nas bzung go ma rim can tshang mar hu'ang d+hi'i {(WP:1,194)}ming chags pa yin zhes (rgya nag chos 'byung )las bshad/de rjes de'i bu tha chung hor gyi ming can rgyal sar bzhag pa lo gsum gyi thog nyug rum pa co'u ga'u ngo log nas rgyal po bkrongs/rgyal khab rnams kha 'thor/de nas han ka'u d+his (han ka'o dzung )lo lngar srid bzung/d+hi ni yo'u rgyal po'i bu brgyud yin pas/hu'ang d+hi'i gdung brgyud yin la/sngar chin hri ho'ang gi skabs khams kyi r+Yal po dang rgyal phrin mi dgos par byas pa rnams sngar shul du gnas bcug ste/khral len zhing srog la mi dbang bar byas/rgyal srid kyi ming la han zer/de nas rgyal rabs bcu gnyis pa'i skabs ang mang zhes pa'i blon po gcig gis ngo log byas nas lo bco brgyad la srid bzung/de nas han gyi brgyad pa gle'u gong bu (gle slong bu )zhes pas ang mang bsad de srid bzung/de'i bu han min ti nas bzung han gyi rgyal rabs nyi shu rtsa drug byung/han gyi rgyal po rnams rang bzhin bzang zhing yon tan ci rigs dang ldan pas ma tshad/blon po rnams kyang dpa' mdzangs dang ldan pa mang po byung zhing 'jig rten gyi dgos mkho dang bstun pa'i lugs srol ji snyed cig btsugs pa rnams shin tu dpyad bzod par brten/da lta yang rgya rigs la han ren dang rgya yig la han wen ces 'bod pa yang han rgyal rabs kyi bag chags las byung ba yin zhes (rgya nag chos 'byung )las bshad do/_/de nas han gyi rgyal rabs nyi shu rtsa gnyis man chad rnams (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )gyi le tshan bcu drug pa'i shog grangs 5 nas mjug ma rdzogs mar dang/(deb ther sngon po )le tshan dang po'i shog grangs 23nas mdzug ma rtogs par/(deb ther dmar po'i tshig 'grel )rnams la gzigs dgos shing/de gnyis ma mthun pa 'ga' zhig (deb ther sngon po )las drangs pa de dag pa dang/'ga' zhig (chos 'bang mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nas drangs de dag la 'dug cing/(deb ther dmar po'i )ma dpe la yang yi ge 'dra min gsum tsam 'dug pa bcas/de rnams phan tshun bsdus nas zhib cha bris na yig tshogs shin tu che bas/'dir zur tsam yang 'god par ma