gong ma thog the mur|{krung go'i yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma khri thog bcu gcig pa yin cing/gong ma 'u tsung he hran {(WP:1,194)}dang bod skad du he hran khu lug tu 'bod pa de'i bu chung ba yin/rab byung lnga pa'i shing 'brug (1304)lor 'khrungs/pha rgyud kyi gcen po hro rdi pa la g.ying tsung {(WP:1,194)}dang ma mthun pa'i dbang gis ho nan ching kra'u (deng sang kong tung zhing chen gyi ching hran rdzong )la rgyang 'bud btang/rjes su pha rgyud spun mched rgan pa tha'i ti ye sun the'i mur gyis tshur bkug nas ho'i wang gi go gnas gnang ste/cang lin (deng sang gi hu pe zhing chen khongs cang lin rdzong )rang lo nyi shu rtsa lnga pa rab byung drug pa'i sa 'brug (1328)lor gong ma'i khrir 'khod nas yon kren {(WP:1,194)}lo gsum/tA te {(WP:1,194)}lo bcu gcig bcas bsdoms pa'i lo bcu gsum ring srid dbang bzung/ming gzhan ol ce yang zer/khri la 'khod nas lo gnyis par kha lo'i ming yon kren zhes bsgyur/gong ma 'di'i dus su sa skya'i bla chen chos kyi 'od zer gdan drangs nas sngar sa skya paN chen gyis gsar gtong gnang ba'i log yig la yi ge mjug ma can mang po kha snon mdzad pa yin zhes bod yig gi lo rgyus thog 'khod yod kyang phyi rabs sog rigs kyi mkhas dbang rnam pas lo rgyus 'di zhal sami bzhes par snang/chin rgyal rabs skabs kyi rgyal thab mar skabs brlag bor song ba yang khong gi phyag tu song nas cha har rgyal brgyud mjug ma rdzogs bar du srid tham du bed spyod byas/gong ma 'di nang bstan chos lugs la dad pa che bas ri bo rtse lnga lha khang chen po zhig kyang bzhengs/rjes su khong yun ring bsnyun gzhi bzhes nas srid don rnams blon chen gyis bskyangs te/rab byung lnga pa'i me lug (1347)lor 'das/gshegs skabs dgung lo zhe gsum yin cing/bang so ni cha'i nyan mu deng sang nang sog rang skyong ljongs kyi dbyi cin hu'u lo chis a theng li'an grong rdal gyi shar lho phyogs su yod/gong ma 'di yi lo rgyus mdor bsdus tsam (krung go'i rgyal rabs rim pa'i gong ma'i lo rgyus phyogs bsdus )shog grangs 840par gsal}
