gong ma yung los|{{(WP:1,194)}krung go'i ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma khri thog gsum pa yin cing/gong ma dang po kru'i yon krang {(WP:1,194)}gi sras bzhi pa yin/rab byung drug pa'i lcags byi (1360)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo zhe bzhin pa rab byung bdun pa'i cha lug (1403)lor gong ma'i khrir 'khod nas lo nyi sho rtsa gnyis ring srid dbang bzung/khri lo'i ming yung los yin pas de yongs grags su gong ma'i mtshan du 'bod srol chags shing mtshan dngos ni kru'u tis {(WP:1,194)}zer/thog ma'i go nags kyi ming yan wan yin cing/pe h+phing ste deng sang gi pe cing sa khul gyi 'go 'dzin du bskos/gong ma'i khril la 'khod nas lo bdun pa sa glang (1409)lor byang shar gyi sa khul khag mo po mnga' 'og tu bsdus te khongs gtogs rgyal phran dmag dpung dbang cha med par bzos shing/dmag dpung mngags nas yon rgyal rabs stobs shug lhag 'phror rdung rdeg btang ste/krung dbyang gi gcig sdud dbang cha sra brten bzos/khri lo bcu dgu pa lcags glang (1421)lor rgyal sa nan cin nas pe cin du spos shing/'dzam gling thog snyan grags ldan pa'i le dbar khri phrag gi lcags ri ring por 'dzugs skrun dang (yung los tshig mdzod chen mo ){(WP:1,194)}rtsom sgrig gi rig 'dzugs gnang ba bcas rang rgyal 'phel rgyas dang srung skyob thad la tshad nges can gyi byas rjes chen po bzhag yod/gong ma yung los rang nyid kyi chab srid dbang bsgyur 'phel rgyal gtong ched bod sa gnas su skabs der snyan grags che ba'i karma bka' brgyud chos lugs dang/gsar dar dge ldan pa'i chos lugs stobs shugs bcas bed spyad nas khri lo lnga pa me phog (1407)lor karma pa sku phreng lnga pa de bzhin gshegs pa nan can du gdan drangs shing/de'i phyi lo sa byi (1408)lor rje tsong kha pa'i dngos slob byams chen chos rje shAkya ye shes pe cin du gdan drangs ste/mthong bzos gus bkur chen po zhus shing/gong ma'i bla mar bsngags pa'i 'ja' sa dang thag ka bcas phul ba'i gnas tshul dam pa so so'i lo rgyus thad gsal ba ltar yin cing/phyogs mtshungs nang bstan mdo sngags gnyis kyi srol rgyun thang ka dang/mchod cha'i rigs sogs sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad pa ltar rgya rigs bzo bo mkhas par bzo skrun byed du bcug pa de tsho'i rgyu cha dang/cha tshang/bzo dbyibs sogs gang ci'i lag rtsal 'gran zla bral ba yod pa ni deng sang mi nyung ba zhig mthong rgyu yod pa ltar yin cing/khro lo brgyad pa lcags stag (1410)lor nan cin du bod yig gi bka' 'gyur dpar skrun gyi thog ma yin pa bcas nang bstan chos lugs gong 'phel gtong rgyu'i thad la yang mdzad rjes phul du phyung ba zhig 'jog gnang mdzad yod pa bcas legs phyogs kyi lo rgyus mdor bsdus yin/zhib par gzigs par 'dod (krung go'i rgyal rabs rim pa'i gong mi'i lo rgyus phyogs bsdus )kyi shog grangs 873nas 876bar gsal/khri lo nyi shu rtsa gnyis pa ste dgung lo drug cu re lnga pa rab byung bdun pa'i shing 'brug (1424)lor byang 'dul dmag 'khrug gi bkod 'doms la phebs nas phyir log mdzad pa'i lam bar du bsnyun gzhi bzhes te sog yul yus mu rod se deng sang nang sog rang skyong ljongs kyi to lon rdzong gi nub byang khul du sku gshegs/sku phung bang so ni khrang lin (deng sang pe cin byang rgyud khran h+phing rdzong gi hre san lin )la yod}
gong ma g.yung Teng|{{(WP:1,194)}krung go'i man ching rgyal rabs kyi gong ma khri thog gsum pa yin cing/gong ma khas shi'i sras bzhi pa yin/rang byung bcu gcig pa'i sa rta (1678)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo zhe drug pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu yos (1723)nas gong gsal rab byung gi ma 'brug (1736)bar lo bcu gsum ring srid dbang bskyangs/khri lo gnyis par khri lo'i ming yung kreng zhes ming bsgyur byas pas rjes su gong ma'i mtshan du chags shing mtshan dngos la dbyin kren zer/khri la 'khod rjes slad phyin gong ma'i mtshan gnas 'phrog rtsod yong dogs kyis gcen po yu'an this rgyun ring btson 'jug dang/gcung po yu'an si dang yu'an thang gnyis go gnas phab ste rgyu nor gzhung bzhes byas/gong ma yab chen khang shis skabs blos 'khel ba'i blon chen dang dpon rigs mi chung ba zhig go gnas nas phab pa bcas byas thog /rgyal yongs su so myur ba mang po btsugs te dam bsgrags gang che'i sgo nas rang nyid kyi gong mi'i dbang char srung skyob byas yod/khri la 'khod pa'i lo dang por mtsho sngon gyi dbang 'dzin pa ching wang blo bzang bstan 'dzin (gu shri han gyi sras chung ba bkra shis pA thur bu yin )sogs mtshosngon bod sog dpon rigs mang po zhig gis man ching srid gzhung la ngo rgol gyi 'khrung zing bslangs pa brten/lo rjes ma der cang cun nyan keng ya'o sogs kyis sne khrid pa'i dmag dpung khri phrag kha shas mngags ste cham la phab cing/gser khog dang dgon lung sogs zing 'khrug der the jus yod pa dang dogs pa yod pa'i dgon sde mang po me la bsregs/sku 'bum dgo gyi grwa pa rgan gzhon bsdoms pa'i bdun brgya lhag tsam ske bregs/sku 'bum khri pa chung bang rin po che blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan mchog zing 'khrug der the jus gang yang med rung skabs der khri pa las thog pa yin pa'i dbang gis zi ling nye 'dabs grong lang du sku gson por mer sreg btang ba sogs lo shas ring mtsho sngon khul du yod pa'i grwa btsun rnams khyim pa'i chas spros te sdod dgos pa bcas byung/rjes su tA la'i bla ma rin po che sku phreng bdun pa dang/lcang skya rin po che/thu'u bkwan rin po che bcas nas gong gsal