gor rgyal|{gor Sha rgyal po zhes pa'i sdud tshig ste/dus rabs bcu drug pa'i mjug nas bco brgyad pa'i 'go bal yul gling gsum (1 ka Ta man du'am yum bu/2 par tan/3 spag gon )ni rgyal khag gsum gyis dbang bsgyur byed mus su yod/skad rigs ni hin rdu'i skad khongs su gtogs pa dang/gtso bo nang pa'i chos la dad pa byed mun dang/de min hin rdu dang/bram ze'i chos la dad pa byed mkhan yang yod cing/zhim las dang ri dwags brngon pa sogs byed/rab byung dug pa'i sa lug (1559)lo nas rgya gar gyi rgyal brgyud du grags pa zhig gis bal yul nub brgyud kyi yul da btsan bzung gis rgyal phran zhig btsugs te rim bzhin stobs shugs che ru song nas rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu rta (1642)lor pri thi ra na ya nas gor Sha'i rgyal po byas/rgyal khag gsum phan tshun nang 'khrug byung nas stobs shugs nyams rgud du song ba'i go skabs dang bstun nas phar grol byas te rab yung bcu gsum pa'i sa byi (1768)lor ka Ta man du mnga' 'og tu bsdus shing/de rjes su pan tan yang mnga' 'og tu bcug /de'i lo rjes mar spag gon dbang du bsdus nas gor Sha'i srid dbang btsugs/chub srid kyi sgrigs srol gsar pa gtan la phab nas lab shes bzo las gong 'phel/khyim mtshes rgyal khab dang/bon sa gnas sogs bar phan tshun tshong don gyi 'a brel ba byer rgyur shugs snon/zhing phyugs las rigs bdag gnyer legs bcos/gter kha sngog 'don sogs dpal 'byor stobs shugs 'phel rgyas btang ba bcas byas par brten/dmag don gyi stobs shugs kyang je cher song ste/nye skor gyi rgyal phran 'ga' zhig mnga' 'og tu bsdus nas mi ring bar 'das shing/de'i bu ha khu la tha rgyal por bskos/des kyang pha'i dus ltar rgya bskyed srid jus mu mthud lag bstar byas te bal yas nub ngos kyi rgyal phran khag cig mnga' 'og tu bcug kyang 'dod pa ma khengs pa'i ngang nas yun ring ma song bar 'das/de rjes de'i bu rat+na sba dur rgyal por bskos yang lo na phra bas (lo brgyad las slebs med )a khu sba dur sa heb kyis srid don bskyangs shing/de'i ring yab yul shar ngos rdo rje gling/nub phyogs kyi mar zhing/byang phyogs su hi ma la ya'i ri rgyud khul yul sde mang por bt