gos bzo ba|{spyir btang yongs grags su gos bzo ba zhes pa'i ming de thos pa tsam gyis gyon gos bzo 'tshem byed mkhan gyi bzo pa lag rtsal par go ba len gyi yod dgos pa lta bu snang yang don du de'i nang gos chen gyi rigs sna tshogs dras drub gyi thang ka dang/yol ba/dra phyed/mchod rdzas/gyon gos bcas bzo 'tshem dang dras drub byed mkhas kyi lag rtsal mi sna yang tshul yod cing/da yod kyi dpyad gzhi'i yig cha khag gi nang gsal ba ltar na/sngar rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i dus su rgya bza' wen khrin kong jo btsun mor phebs skabs/gong ma thang tha'i cung gis srong btsan sgam por phyag rtags su phul ba'i gos chen gyi na bza' dang/bzhugs stan/ber chen bcas bod du thog mar 'byor ba nas/bod kyang rgyal blon rnams gos chen dras drug kyis bzos pa'i nab zang gyon pa'i dar srol chags shing/de'i bzo dbyibs ni/ta sig rgyal khab (dbyi ran )dang a rab rgyal khag gyi gyon gos dang 'dra bar bshad/yon rgyal rabs skabs sa skya'i bla dpon rnams dang/ming rgyal rabs skabs pad+ma pa sku phreng rim byon dang/phag gru sde srid/dge lugs kyi bla chen/'bri gung dang tshal pa'i dpon chen sogs kyang nang sog rigs dang rgyal rigs kyi dpon chen tshos chas dang dbyibs 'dra ba'i gyon gos dar srol che ba ma zad/dgon sde che ba tsho'i nang gos sku dang/ka 'phan/dra ba dra phyed/mchod rdzas/'cham gos bcas gcig la gcig 'gran gyi bzo 'tsher dar rgyas che ba byung/gos sku bzhengs pa'i sngo shos ni rab byung bdun pa'i byi (1408)lor rgyal rtse chos rgyal bar brtan kun bzang 'phags pas bzhengs pa'i gos sku mthong ba don ldan zhes dang/zheng tshad 'dom lnga ste/mi gzugs 'bring tshad kyi 'dor re la spyi skar brgya dang brgyad cu re brtsis pa'i spyi khri dgu'i tshad tsam yod/gos chen las bzos pa'i yol ba 'tshem drub ma snga shos ni rab byung brgyad pa'i lcags byi (1480)lo nas rab byung dug pa'i chu sprel (1512)lo bar sde pa rin spungs pas dbu gtsang gi srid dbang bzung skabs ring spungs mkhas dbang ngag dbang 'jigs grags kyis zhal bkod gnang nas bzhengs pa'i rigs ldan yol ba zhes sham b+ha la'i rigs rgyal p