grib ma gnyis pa|{rang dang lta spyod mthun pa'i grogs bzang po'i dpe ste/rang gi lus kyi grib ma ni rang nyid kyi bya spyod gang byas pa dang mthun pa de bzhin du grogs bzang po rang dang lta spyod mthun po yod pa de ni rang gi lus kyi grim pa gnyis pa dang 'dra ba/grib tshe chog gling/gri tshe chog gling gi ming cha tshang la tshe chog bsam gtan gling zhes 'bod cing/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me lug (1787)lor gor Sha btsan 'dzul dmag gis bod gtam nang dang/rong shar/skyid grong bcas la btsan 'dzul gtor bcom byas skabs skyid grong bsam gtan gling gi gras pa rnams gnas thabs bral nas lha sar tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa'i yongs 'dzin dka' chen ye shes rgyal mtshan (skyid grong bsam gtan gling phyag 'debs mkhan )la bde sdug zhu bar yong skabs dka' chen rin po ches grwa pa rnams la chos gsung rjes rang so so'i gang 'don sar song gsungs par tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pas khyed tsho'i bla ma ngas gdan drangs pas grwa slob gang sar btang na ma 'grig pas lha sa'i nye 'dabs sa babs gang dga' cig la dgon gnas 'debs dgos gsungs pa ltar dka' chen rin po ches po ta la nas brtag dpyad gnang skabs skyid chu'i lho ngos grib kyi sa der dgon pa 'debs bzhed ltar sa bya (1789)lor grib tshe chog gling phyag btab/grub mtha' dge lugs dang grwa grangs 108yin cing dgon bdag tshe chog gling bla brang yin/tshe chog gling dgon pa'i shar ngos ri ldebs su rdzong btsan sku mkhar zhes lha khang du grib rdzong btsan gyi sku gsob sogs yod/de'i lho ngos ri ldebs su grib ri bo gru 'dzin zhes thugs rje chen po'i lha kha yod pa rnams tshe chog gling dgon pa nas bdag gnyer byed/grib kyi phur dkar mo rong zhes pa'i brag phug cig yod pa der dus rabs brgyad pa'i nang lha lung dpal rdor gyis sgrub pa mdzad de bzhugs pa'i lo rgyus yod la brag phug de'i nang brag brkos sku brnyan mang po yod skad}
