grub chen me long rdo rje|{rnying ma'i grub thob 'di nyid rab byung bzhi pa'i chu yos (1243)lor yab sgrags phur rnal 'byor bsam yas dang yul 'bar ma gnyis kyis sras su 'khrungs/dgung lo dug par mkhan po se lung pa dang/grub thob za lung pa las rab tu byung/de dus gshin po'i dge rtsar yum rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum kho na sgrog cing/dgung lo bcu drug la phebs skabs brgyad stong brgya rtsa brgyad mdzad pas gnang lugs kyi don rtogs/mngon shes phra mo'ang shar/de nas phyogs nges med 'grims te mtshur phu'i do bo ras pa sogs bla ma mang du bsten/nas bre gang gis zla ba gcig dang zhag nyi shu'i 'tsho ba mdzod pa sogs dka' thub la shin tu bzod pa zhig yin/dgung lo bco brgyad pa la seng ge rgyal pa sangs rgyas dbon po las man ngag snying tig thob/sgom par rtse gcig tu gzhol bas rdo rje sems dpa'i zhal mngon par gzigs/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gsum par sangs rgyas rabs pa las rdo rje phag mo la sogs pa'i gter chos da ma gsan nas sgrub pa mdzad pas yi dam sangs rgyas mang po'i zhal mjal ba dang/phyag mdzub yis brag la phyag bris gnang ba so skye'i chu 'bur mig gis dngos su 'jal rgyu yod pa sogs sgrub rtags mang du thon/spyir bla ma mang po'i zhabs la gtugs shing/khyad par du grub thob za lung pa/mtshur phu'i do bo ras pa/'khrul zhig seng ge rgyab pa sogs las zab chos mang du gsan nas snying po'i don rnyed/mkhan pa ljongs dang/mkhan pa gling/seng ge rdzong/kun bzang gling/mkhar cha rnams su sgrub pa'i rgyal mtshan btsugs shing 'gro don mdzad/dgung lo drug re gcig tu phebs pa rab byung lnga pa'i chu yos (1303)lor dur khrod la bar du sku gshegs pa'i tshe 'od chen po sgra dang bcas pa kun gyis mthong/pur rnam pa sbyong dus nam mkha'i lam nas pur khang 'od lnga'i snam bu rkyang lta bu sogs ngo mtshar ba'i ltas dpag tu med pa byung}
grub chen u rgyan pa|{'di ni 'brug pa bka' brgyud kyi bla ma bod kyi lo rgyus thog snyan grags che ba zhig yin/bon kyi rang byung bzhi pa'i lcags stag (1230)lo nas rab byung lnga pa'i sa bya (1369)lo bar rus ni rgyus rigs mdo smad nas bod dbus gtsang du 'khyar ba zhig /yab rgyus dbon jo 'phan dang yum phyug mog ge mar bu bzhi dang bu mo gsum bcas byung ba'i chung shos de yin/dgung lo nar sos nas yab kyis chung ma len rtses byas kyang ma bzhes par rang gi yab kyi drung du gsang sngags kyi cho sa mang po gsan nas mkhas par sbyangs/dgung lo bcu drug la bo dong e dgon par byon nas/chos rje rin re rtse mo'i drung du mngon par gong 'og dang tshad ma/dbu ma bcas gsan/chos rje rgod tshang pa mgon po rdo rje'i drung nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyi shu lon pa dang/bo don chos rje rin chen rtse mos mkhan po dang/zhang bsam gling pas slob dpon/slob dpon bsod nams 'od zer gyis gsang ston mdzad nas rab byung bsnyen rdzogs cig car du bsgrubs par mtshan rin chen dpal du gsol/de nas lo bcu gnyis ring sta gcig pa'i brtul zhugs bzung nas sha mi gsol/chos rje rin chen rtse mo dang/go lung pa nam mkha' rgyal mtshan/dus 'khor ba sangs rgyas rdo rje bcas ba sten nas dus 'khor 'bro lugs dang/chag lugs /rtsa mi lugs bcas slob sbyong gnang ste dus 'khor dang skar rtsis las shin tu mkhas par gyur/chos rje rgod tshang pa bla mar bsten nas bka' brgyad kyi chos skor mtha' dag gsan/de nas mang yul skyid grong la lam byas kha cha'i yul du byon/de nas o rgyas kyi yul du gsang sngags kyi chos mang po gsan/dgung lo so gnyis pa lcags bya (1261lor slar yang rgya gar rdo rje gdan du byon nas mchod rten la zhig gsos gnang/dgung lo re gsum pa rab byung lnga pa'i chu 'brug (1292)lor yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hu pa li se chen han gyis gdan drangs te rgyal po dang blon po 'phangs bcas la chos mang po gsungs/rgyu nor gyi 'bum ba tshad las 'das pa nga yang sna gcig kyang ma bzhes par bod du phyir phebs/dgung lo brgyad cu pa rab byung lnga pa'i sa bya (1309)lor sku 'das/'di'i lo rgyus cung zad zhib par 'os lo gzhon nu dpal gyis brtsams pa'i (deb ther sngon po )le tshan (nya)pa'i shog grangs 129nas 123bar dang/dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng bas brtsams pa'i (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston gyi )le tshan (pa)pa'i shog grangs 30nas 32bar gsal ba der gzigs}
grub thob|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags kyi gzhung nas bshad srol la/gsang sngags kyi lam la brten nas thun mong gi dngos grub brgyad thob pa'am sku tshe de la sangs rgyas pa ste mchog gi dngos grub thob pa de gnyis la grub thob zer/thun mong gi dngos grub rgyan ni gsham du thun mong gi grub rtags brgyad ces par gsal}
grub thob brgyad|{shar du in ba ti/lhor klu grub snying po/nub tu pad+ma badzra/byang du ku ku ri pa/shar lhor Da bi pa/lho nub rdo rje dril bu pa/nub byang tu lu hi pa/byang shar du ra ha pa/de rnams dur khrod kyi chas dang/rang rang gi phyag rgya dang bcas te zhugs kyi spyod pa sna tshogs mdzad cing ma chod rten rnams kyi mdun du gnas pa'o/_}
grub thob chen po bco lnga|{'phags yul du grub thob glu dbyangs mkhan gyi lugs/zhabs g.yon brkyang du mdzad pa nag po'i rdo rje'i lugs/gzhan yang ka ma haM sa ka mA ri'i lugs/lha tshogs thams cad sku mdog nag por yod pa d+harma pa yi lugs/lha tshogs thams cad gdong brnyan can du 'dod pa kuk+ka Ti pa'i lugs/yab yum sku mdog mtshungs shing lha gzhan tham cad sku mdog ma nges par yang 'dod pa g+huN+Ta ri pa'i lugs/gzhan yang tsa TI pa/nA Ti pa/g+han+d+hi ta pa rnams kyi lugs/lha tshogs thams cad gnyis par yang 'dod pi sha pa'i lugs/zhan yang taN+Ta pa/b+ha de pa rnams kyi lugs/ta Da ka pa/kaM ka la pa'i lugs/lha tshogs thams cad sku mdog ser por 'dod pa dza nan+di pa'i lugs rnams so/_}
grub thob nyag re se bo|{grub thob nyag re se bo 'gro mgon phag gru ba'i slob ma yin/lo rgyus zhib cha ma mthong}
grub thob nyang ri khrod pa|{mnga' bdag myang nyi ma 'od zer gsang sngags rnying ma'i bla chen mtshan snyan shin tu che ba zhig rab byung gnyis kyi shing 'brug (1124)lo nas rab byung gsum pa'i shing bya (1204)lo bar dgung lo brgyad cu gya gcig bzhugs/lo rgyus zhib pa rin chen gter mdzod pod dang po'i (gter ston brgya rtsi'i rnam thar )nang gsal}
grub thob ti shri ras pa|{'di gung thang bla ma zhang gi slob ma yin/lo rgyus zhib pa bdag gis ma mthong}
grub thob thang stong rgyal po|{gong du grub chen thang stong rgyal po zhes par gzigs}
grub thob thar pa'i rgyal mtshan|{grub thob thar pa'i rgyal mtshan (a ra grub thob yang zer )ni lha sa'i byang ngos nyan bran na kha can pa'i khyim du yab chos skyong dang yum 'dzoms kyi gnyis la bar byung dgu pa'i shing lug (1535)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo brgyad la son pa'i chu stag (1542)lo se ra smad grwa tsam khongs a ra khang tshan la sgrigs zhugs gnang/mkhan po thar pa'i rgyal mtshan zhes mtshan gsol/thos bsam slob gnyer la brtson par mdzad/grwa sa'i slob gnyer mthar phyin nas dgung lo so gcig la son skabs rgyan smad kyi grwa bzhugs te sngags la thos bsam gan nga/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa dang pha bong kha'i mkhan po paN chen bde legs nyi ma sogs nas chos mang po gsan te nyams len la 'bad pa gnang/brag yer pa dang/pha bong kha'i gser phug 'ol dga'/tsa ri sogs la sgrub pa mdzad nas bzhugs/lhag par rab byung bcu pa'i shing sprel (1584)lo nas bzung chos 'khor rgyal lha thog steng du bzhugs shing/de gar sgrub de 'debs pa dang/slob ma skyong bar mdzad/sgrub pa nyams bzhes gtso bor mdzad cing/gsung mgur zhal gdam tshig bcad 'ga' rnam thar du gsal/dgung lo lnga bcu nga lngar phebs pa'i rab byung bcu pa'i sa glang (1598)lo'i hor zla gnyis pa'i gnam gang nyin sku 'das/khong gi sku brnyan se ra a ra khang tshan du mjal rgyu yod}
grub thob dpal 'dzin|{('bri khung grub thob dpal 'dzin )dpal 'dzin nyi 'od bzang po rgya mtsho sprin gyi 'brug sgra glog gi phreng ba can yang zer zhing/dpal 'dzin ma he'i mgo can yang zer/bod kyi sngags pa mkhas pa zhig rgya gar du phebs nas lam bar du rgyal po'i chad pa byung nas mgo bo bcad/mi'i mgo bo gson po ma rnyed par ma he zhig bsad ma thag pa'i mgo bo drod ma yal ba zhig dgu'i steng du sbyar nas 'byar ba'i rkyen gyis gson por bzhugs pa yin zer/lo rgyus zhib cha jo nang tA ra nA thas mdzad pa'i ('jam dpal gshin rje gshed kyi chos 'byung )nang gsal}
grub thob bai ro tsa na|{'di bod kyi rgyal po khri srong lde btsan dang dus mnyam pa'i lo chen bai ro tsa na min cing/de dang mtshan 'dra ba'i bka' brgyud chos lugs kyi bla ma zhig yin/de'i lo rgyus da phan ma mthong}
grub thob dbu se|{karma pa dus gsum mkhyen pa ste gong gi ka sde'i nang gsal}
grub thob mi tra dzo ki|{rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta bod du yang phebs myong ba zhig yin/wa ra Na si rgyal po'i sras su 'khrungs shing/mtshan la dza ga tra 'a nan+ta zhes bod skad du bsgyur na skye 'gro kun dga' zer/chung dus yab yum gnyis la chos byed chog pa'i gnang ba nan gyis zhus te bros/rdo rje gdan du ba dpon rgyal ba'i lha'i drug du rab byung dang bsnyen rdzogs zhus/rjes su mkhas pa chen por gyur te o rgyan gyi yul (deng sang gi a h+phu han)du lo mang po'i ring sgrom sgrub mdzad cing bzhugs/bod kyi khro phu lo tsA ba byams pa'i dpal dgung lo nyer drug bzhes pa rab byung gsum pa'i sa rta (1198)lor bal yul du bzhugs pa'i tshe/bod zla drug pa'i nang bla ma 'di dang mjal nas bod du gdan drangs te khro phor zla ba drug tsam bzhugs ring skye bo dmangs la skyabs 'gro sems bskyed sogs theg pa thun mong gi chos gsungs shing/slob ma nyung shas la gsang sngags kyi chos gsang ba chen po mdzad de gsungs/gzhan gyis dngos po gang 'bul mkhan byung yang rten bzhengs dang/mchod 'bul/dge 'dun gyi bsnyen bkur/dbul phongs la sbyin gtong/dmag 'khrug bzlums pa sogs la 'phral 'phral du gtong ba las rang nyid kyis cung zad tsam yang bdag bzung mi mdzad pa sogs nga mtshar che/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la slob dpon 'di sku tshe'i rig 'dzin brnyes nas sangs rgyas chos lugs 'dzam gling thog med par ma gyur bar du sku lus ma spangs par rgya gar lho phyogs dpal gyi ri la dngos su bzhugs pa dang/bod du lo re la thengs re phebs rgyu'i zhal bzhes yod ces zer srol 'dug /'di'i lo rgyus zhib pa (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )gyi le tshan (ta)pa'i shog grangs 4nas 8bar gsal}
grub mtha'|{spyir grub mtha' zhes pa ni lung rigs gang rung la brten nas rnam rtog gi sgro btags pa'i cha gzhan bkag ste rang gi blo ngor yang dag par 'thad pa'i don de nyid grub pa'am dam bcas te 'dzin pa'i tshule las gzhanadu med do snyam nas thag bcad pa'i cha de la grub mtha' zhes bya ba dang/thag bcad pa de gzhan la smra bas na grub mtha' smra ba zhes zer/de yang grub mtha'i skad dod la/sid+d+h+yan+ta zer zhing sid+d+hi ni dngos grub dang/rtog pa /grub pa sogs la 'jug pas skabs 'dir grub pa dang/an+ta ni zad pa dang/phyogs dang/mtha' bcas la 'jug pas skabs 'dir mtha' la go dgos pas de gnyis mtshams sbyar bas grub mtha' zhes pa yin te/rang gi rigs pas grub cing/de las phar yang 'gro ba med pas na mtha'o/_}
grub mtha' chen mo|{snyan pa'i grags pa phyogs bcur khyab pa'i mkhas pa'i dbang po kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i rdo rjes rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa yos (1699)lor grub mtha' chen mo'i rang 'grel dang bcas pa brtsams/mtshan yongs rdzogs la (grub mtha'i rnam bshad rang gzhan grub mtha' kun dang zab don mchog tu gsal ba kun bzang zhing gi nyi ma lung rigs rgya mtsho'i skye dgu'i re ba kun skongs )zhes zer zhing/rje nyid kyi phyag rtsom la mdo sngags rig gnas kyi gzhung pod bco lnga longs pa yod pa las/'di ni chen mo rnam bzhi zhes yongs su grags pa'i ya gyal (grub mtha' chen mo )zhes pa de yin}
grub mtha' gnyis|{phyi rol pa'i grub mtha' (mu stegs pa )dang nang pa'i grub mtha'o/_}
grub mtha' lta ba'i rtsa ba brgya rtsa bcu|{sangs rgyas pa/'dzin pa med pa/'tshe ba pa/lo ma can/gtsang sbra can/khyab 'jug pa/khyab 'jug sems pa ba/dbyug gu gsum pa/ko lpags dum bu can/mnyam par spyod pa/lha mchod pa/chos kyi mchog sbyin can/gdung ba can/lag pa gdung ba can/rgyal por smra ba/rgan mor smra ba/me yo u da ri/rigs dang rjes su mthun pa/bcings nang 'dug pa/'khor lo skyong ba/ri la gnas pa/rgyal po'i bsod snyoms can/glang po che'i rgyal mtshan can/klog can/nang can/rta 'dul ba/ka lan da ka pa/snod gtsang ma can/slong mos rgyu ba/yan lag ral pa'i nang du bstums pa/sgron ma lhag pa can/gser can/grub par smra ba/dbang po chenapo/zha nye can/byang phyogs kyi 'gram na gnas pa/lho phyogs kyi 'gram na gnas pa/'ug pa ba/dge sbyong ba/lus la gnod pa med pa/ka kan d+ha ba/lha'i grong ba/sa khung na gnas pa/chos sems pa ba/zla ba phyed pa/nags na gnas pa/bai shi Sha ka /tshangs par spyod pa/gau ta ma ba/pha la gus pa ba/ma la gus pa ba/zla ba shar ba pa/nyi ma shar ba pa/lag par za ba/snying gis 'tsho ba /phung po gsum pa ba/shin tu khrus byas pa/ba ri'i spyod pa can/'thor byed pa/'khor ba las grol ba/pa taM dza la ba/lha mchod pa/gzhan la mi 'dud pa/gos kyi dam bu can/'ug pa'i gshom pa can/lan gsum du chur 'jug pa/mkha' lding ba/khyim gyi rab na gnas pa/ba lang dang/ri dwags dang/rta dang/khyi dang/gsol ba mi 'debs pa'i brtul zhugs pa/zhib mo'i brtul rgyal mtshan can/klog can/nang can/rta 'dul ba/ka lan da ka pa/snod gtsang ma can/slong mos rgyu ba/yan rdo 'thag pa ba/chus dag par lta ba/skyes nas dag par lta ba/las kyis dag par lta ba/chu la byi 'dzul byed pa/dgon pa ba/sa/chu/me/rlung/nam mkha' las sems yon par lta ba/nam mkha' 'byung ba/shing rta mang po can/bsam gtan la dga' ba/chos can pa/zas grang mo can/phrag pa'i gos can/don thams cad pa/phru ba gcig pa/grang can gyi rnal 'byor pa/so'i gtun rdungs can/mtshe'u'i 'gram na gnas pa/b+ha ra d+ha dza ba/gcer bu ba/gnyen bu ba/mes po ba/phyug bdag pa/dung sgra can/lha sten sbyin pa'i bu/ka rgyu'i bu ba/sna tshogs lta ba'o/_}
grub mtha' smra ba gnyis|{phyi pa dang nang pa sangs rgyas par go}
grub mtha' smra ba bzhi|{gong gsal grub mtha' bzhi zhes pa dang don gcig }
