grub mtha' bzhi|{1 nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i theg pa che chung gi grub mtha' smra ba bzhi ste/bye brag smra ba dang/mdo sde pa/sems tsam pa/dbu ma pa bcas so /ston pa nyams med shAkya'i rgyal po 'di nyid mngon par rdzogs pa sangs rgyas kyi go 'phang bzhes nas rigs can gsum la chos kyi 'khor lo rim pa gsum ba skor bar mdzad/de'i phyis rjes 'jug rnams kyis 'khor lo so so'i dgongs pa bkral tshul la brten nas grub mtha' smra ba bzhi byung/de yang bka' dang po bden bzhi'i chos 'khor gyi rjes su 'brangs te theg dman grub mtha' smra ba nyes thos sde gnyis dang/'khor lo bar pa dang tha ma'i rjes su 'brangs te theg chen gyi grub mtha' smra ba dbu sems gnyis byung ngo/_/2 dbang bzhi'i lam sgom pa'i grub 'bras mthar thug pa ste/sa dang po nas drug pa'i bar bum dbang gi grub mtha' 'khor 'das dbyer med bya ste 'khor 'das mnyam nyid du rtogs pa'i ye shes gtsor byed pas so/_/sa bdun pa nas bcu pa'i bar gnang dbang gi grub mtha' ma 'dres yongs rdzogs te so so yang dag rig bzhi la dbang 'byor bas sems can so so'i bsam pa dang skad dang mthun par chos ma 'dres par ston pas so/_/sa bcu gcig pa dang bcu gnyis pa ni shes dbang gi grub mtha' bde stong gi yul tshad dang bcas pa'i phyir ro/_/bcu gsum pa'i phyed 'og ma ni dbang bzhi pa'i grub mtha' bde stong gi yul tshad dang bcas pa'i phyir ro/_/bcu gsum pa'i phyed 'og ma ni dbang bzhi pa'i grub mtha' bde stong rgya che ba zhes bya ste/mkhyen pa'i skad cig gcig gis brtan g.yo thams cad la khyab nus pa'i phyir ye shes kyi yul tshad ma mchis pas so/_}
grub mtha' 'og mas 'dod pa'i sems med pa'i skabs lnga|{'gog snyoms/'du shes med pa/snyoms 'jug /gnyid mthug pa/rgyal ba'i skabs}
grub mtha'i dbang gis 'dzin pa|{dbu ma rang rgyud pa'i lugs la bden par grub na blo la snang ba'i dbang gis phar bzhag pa tsam ma yin par yul rang gi ngos nas grub pa zhig yod dgos pas/de gtan nas med par khas blangs pa dang/de ltar yod par 'dzin pa bden 'dzin phra mo dang/bya dang/khyi/phag pa sogs grub mtha' la ma zhugs pa'i gang zag rnams kyi bden 'dzin ni lhan skyes dang/mdo sde pa dang/sems tsam pa lta bu/grub mtha' la zhugs pa'i gang zag rnams kyis grub mthas blo bsgyur ba'i dbang gis 'dzin pa ni kun btags su 'jog pa yin}
grub mthas blo bsgyur ba|{grub mthas blo bsgyur ba ni tshe 'di'i bde ba tsam gyis mi chog par shes bya la rtogs dpyod cung zad zhugs te rang gi blo ngor 'thad pa'i gzhung lugs la brten nas dngos po'i gnas tshul la blang dor byed pa rnams la zer/grub mtha' smra ba rnams kyi sha thal rkyang 'phen pas kyang rang gi rigs pa ltar snang gis skye ba snga phyi dang rgyu 'bras sogs yod med la dpyad pa byas nas/rang gi gzhung smra ba'i phyir ro/_}
grub mthas blo ma bsgyur ba|{spyir grub mtha' la ma zhugs pa dang zhugs pa gnyis te dang po ni shes bya'i gnas tshul dang 'jig rten phyi ma phan chad la rtog dpyod gang yang mi byed par rang dgar tshe 'di kho na'i bde ba tsam don du gnyer ba la zer zhing/sems can 'di gad ni grub mthas blo ma bsgyur ba'o/_}
grub pa|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la/stong pa nyid rtogs nas mthong lam thob na grub thob chung ngu/sa brgyad pa thob nas sgom spang spangs na grub thob 'bring po/sangs rgyas na grub thob chen po zhes bshad srol gcig dang/gsang sngags kyi dbang du byas na bskyed rim mthar phyin la grub thub chung ngu dang/rim pa bzhi pa don gyi 'od gsal thob na grub thob 'bring po/mi slob pa'i zung 'jug thob na grub thob chen po zhes bshad srol yod}
grub pa brgyad|{sgrol bo dang/legs sgrol/sgrol mthar phyin/mgu gyur/nyams dga'/rab dga'/dga' ba/mchog dga' rnams so/_}
grub pa'i 'khor los bsgyur ba dge legs rab rgyas|{bkra shis lhun po'i sngags pa grwa tshang gi slob dpon sngags chen dge legs rab rgyas zhu ba paN chen sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyi slob ma/rjes su sog pa jun gar gyi dpon dga' ldan bo shog thus jun gar du gdan drangs nas dge lugs pa'i chos dar spel gnang mkhan de yin}
grub pa'i grong|{grub pa thob pa'i gang zag rnams bzhugs pa'i gnas}
