grub pa'i dbang po|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad tshul la/gsang sngags kyi lam la brten nas thun mong gi dngos grub brgyad dam/yang na sku tshe de la sangs rgyas pa'i mchog gi dngos grub thob pa la grub thob dang grub pa'i dbang po zer/grub chen 'di rnams dus skabs gang du byung ba ni/jo nang tA ra nA thas mdzad pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )las nang pa'i slob dpon grub thob brgyad chu rtsa bzhir grags pa phyed ka lha tsam rgyal po tsan na kas srid dbang bzung ba yan chad du byon pa dang/rgyal po gau pA la nas rA ma pA la'i bar pA la bdun brgyud kyi ring grub pa thob pa shin tu mang bar byon zhes bshad pa ltar na grub thob brgyad cu'i nang gi mang che ba bod kyi rab byung gong gi shAkya'i 'das so ('di'i nang gi shAkya'i 'das lo rnams kha che paN chen shAkya shri'i lugs kyi 'das lo gzhir bzung ba yin/) 1165lo nas rab byung gsum pa'i 'go bar dang/spyi lo'i dus rabs bdun pa nas bcug nyis pa'i mjug bar gyi lo drug brgya tham pa'i ring der byung bar mngon/'di dang 'brel ba yod pa'i nang don 'ga' zhig /(tshig mdzod 'di'i nang )mchog dang thun mong gi dngos grub kyi go don dang rnam grangs/grub chen brgyad cu gya bzhi'i mtshan bcas kyi khongs su bkod yod pa der gzigs}
