grub dbang dkon mchog 'phrin las dpal bzang po|{mtshan gzhan dge slong dpa' chung zhu/rje btsun 'di nyid 'bri gung sbra ga zhes pa'i 'brog sder yab bco lnga dang yum sgrol ma lha gnyis kyi rigs kyi myur gur rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags byi (1900)lor sku bltams/dgung lo drug la be gung lug rtogs rgya mtshos dbu skra gtsug phud bzhes/dgung lo drug bdun nas bcu bdun bar rang khyim du phyugs rdzi mdzad de bzhugs skabs zha dang zhor la yig drug dang sgrol ma 'bum ther gsungs pa ma zan/rdo rje gcod pa chag med dang brgyad stong pa brgya tshar gsungs/byis pa'i dus nas khyim nas khyim mer par rab tu byung ba'i spyod par thugs shin tu mos par mdzad/dgung lo bcu bdun par 'bri gung rin chen dpal gyi gdan sar phebs te dbu skra breg /sgrub grwa'i khri dpon grub dbang tshe brtan rin po che'i drung nas sgrub brgyad lam gyi yang snying phyag rgya chen po lnga ldan gyi gdams pa gsan te nyams len la 'bad/dgung lo nyer dgu par bsnyen par rdzogs te mtshan dkon mchog 'phrin las su gsol/de nas zho smad dben pa'i ri'i bshad grwar phebs te 'tsho ba ngan ngon tsam la ban nas nyin mtshan bstud de dka' spyad snying rus chen pos thos bsam mdzad pas gzhung chen po'i dgongs pa'i gdan tshang ma thugs su chud pas bshad sgru'i mkhan po'i 'os su phebs/dgung lo so bzhi par gzhung chen bcu gsum cha lag dang bcas pa dang/theg chen bsten snying dang/dam chos dgongs pa gcig pa/rdzogs chen snying thig gi dbang dang khrid cha tshang bar gsan bsam mthar phyin mdzad/skyabs rje zhi ba'i blo grongs dang chos kyi 'byung gnas drung nas bka' brgyud gong ma'i gdams zab bum pa gang 'jo'i tshul du gsan pa sogs gdams pa'i mdzod kyis phyug pa'i mkhas btsun gyi phul du byung/bdag nyid chen po 'di nyid thos bsam gyi bya ba mjug bsgril rjes sgrub par gzhol ched 'bri gung gdan sa mthil du phebs nas mtshams grwa'i sgrigs su zhugs/grub dbang tshe brtan chen po che'i drung nas lnga ldan chos drug gi gdams pa mthar phyin zhus/mtshams khang gog hrug du nyin re phyur rtsam sbar phyed tsam la brten nas lo drug smra bcad 'dag sb