gla phogs|{las yul dngos su bkod 'doms byed mkhan 'go pa dang/bzo rigs khag gi lag rtsal mi sna bcas la zla ba rer gla phogs sprod pa'i lam lugs la zer/da yod kyi dpyad gzhi'i yig cha khag gzhir bzung na de sngon bod du bsam yas gtsug lag khang thog mar bzhengs skabs nas bzo ba lag rtsal pa rnams la gla phogs sprod pa'i lugs chags zin pa dang gla phogs mtho na bzo rigs pa rnams kyis so so'i lag rtsal khyad chos gang yod 'don thub pa'i skor skabs der bris pa'i bsam yas gtsug lag khang gi lo rgyus (rba bzhed )kyi nang gsal por bkod yod pa dang/bod sil bu'i ring dgon pa khag gsar bzhengs dang nyams gso'i skabs bzo pa lag rtsal pa'i rigs tshang mar gla phogs yod pa'i gnas tshul lo rgyus khag tu gsal yang gla phogs yod pa'i gnas tshul lo rgyus khag tu gsal gla phogs kyi bsdoms grags mi gtogs zhib cha'i gnas tshul mi gsal zhing/de dang 'dra bar sa skya ba dang/sde srid phag mo grub pa/sde srid gtsang pa bcas kyi dus skabs nyin re 'bru bre gsum gyi tshad du brtses pa'i zla rer gla phogs 'bru khal gsum yin pa dang/po ta la'i pho brang dmar po bzhengs skabs srid gzhung sngon ma tsho'i skabs las mtho ru btang ste 'go pa dang bzo rigs lag rtsal mi sna tsho'i gla gas mtho dman rim pa drug tu phye nas gla phogs mtho shos la zla ba rer nyin gla 'bru bre drug phul bzhi rtsis (deng sang ltar na rgya ma brgyad dang srang bdun yin )za 'bru chang rgyu bsdoms nas khal bcu (deng sang gi thang gzhir brtsis na khal rer rgya ma nyi shu rtsa brgyad yin pas nyer re rgya ma brgya brgyad cu tham pa yod )nas gla gas dma' shos la nyin gla 'bru (deng sang gi rin bab ltar na nyin re rgya ma bzhi dang srang gsum lhag tsam yin )brtsis pa'i zla ba rer za 'bru chang rgyu bsdoms na khal lnga (deng sang gi thang gnyi ltar na 'bru rgya ma brgyad yin )deng sang gi ring gong ltar na sgor bcu gnyis yin/dma' shos la mar nyag gang dang spor gang (deng sang gi thang gzhi ltar na 4rgya ma gang dang srang bzhi yin )bar dang/bza' sha lug khog gcig nas phyed ba kar/thug pa'i rdor lug mgo gnyis nas yod med sna tshogs/ja spus legs nyag gsum nas ja dkyus ma spor do bar/tsha dang snum bre gang gnas yod med sna tshogs bcas gtan 'bebs bzos yod}
