glang chen 'gying ri|{{(WP:1,194)}de yang rgya nag gi nang pa'i gnas ri rtsa chen bzhi'i ya gyal o me hran te glang chen 'gying ri ni zi khron zhing chen lo hran {(WP:1,194)}sa khul du yod cing/'phags pa kun tu bzang po'i gnas yin la nang pa'i chos gzhung du bshad pa'i ri bo 'od zer can zhes pa de yang ri 'di yin zhes rgya'i yig char gsal la/yig cha kha shas nang han rgyal rabs kyi dus nas gnas 'dir lha khang sogs yod tshul 'khod 'dug kyang glang chen 'gying ri'i dkar chag ltar na ches snga shos ni we rgyal rabs skabs bzhengs pa'i chu nag dgon pa ste/cin rgyal rabs skabs gnas 'dir 'phags pa kun tu bzang po'i sku brnyan bzhengs shing phu shan si zhes mtshan gsol/thang rgyal rabs kyi dus su slar yang bden nyan si zhes mtshan brjes/sngar dgon pa 'dir lha khang bdun yod kyang phyis su me bzhes te sreg za'i khams su thim/1953lor nyams gso byas nas dgon pa'i dkyil gyi dbus khang du glang chen mche ba drug ldan la chibs pa'i 'phags pa kun tu bzang po'i sku brnyan ljid tshad la tun 62yod pa zhig bzhengs shing/dgon pa 'di ni glang chen 'bying ri'i dgon pa thams cad kyi nang nas che shos dang snga shos yin/ri bo 'di'i rtse mtho shos la rgya mtsho'i ngos las spyi khre sum stong dgu cu go dgu yod pa dang sangs rgyas khri yi ri bo zer}
glang thang pa rdo rje seng ge|{dge bshes glang ri thang pa ni 'phan yul gnyan gong (gsum 'phreng shang )gser ma gshongs su yab jo bor dar ma mdo bzang gi sras su rab byung dang po'i shing rta (1054)lo sku 'khrungs rus shugs tshang khong rang gi zhal po bshes gnyen grogs mo mkhar las rab tu byung mtshan rdo rje seng ge btags dang por 'tsho ba dka' thub la gnas nas sde snod gsum la sbyangs shing sde snod gsum gyi brjod bya'i don skyes bu gsum gyi lam gyi rim par dril nas nyams su len pa'i man ngag byang chub lam rim la tshig sgril du mdzad nas bka' gdams sku mched gsum ga la gtugs shing gtso bor ni dge bshes po to ba la bka' gdams gzhung drung gi bshad pa dang lkog chos su bdag pas gzhan gces kyi byang sems sgom pa'i man ngag rnams mthil phyin gsan po to ba gshegs rjes glang thang gi shar gyi ri de'u de'i khar byon dpon shAkya bas zhabs tog byas nas lo gsum sgrub pa mdzad glang thang dgon btab bka' gdams gzhung drug sogs gsungs mkhas grub khyung po rnal 'byor gyis bsnyen rdzogs kyi mkhan po mdzad glang thang pas rtag tu 'khor ba'i nyes dmigs dang}
