glang dar ma 'u dum btsan|{bod kyi btsan po'i khri rabs zhe gsum pa ste/btsan po'i gdung rabs kyi nang nang nag chang la dga' zhing gdug rtsub che la spyod pa ngan pa'i dper 'os pa zhig yin par rgya bod kyi lo rgyus yig cha tshang ma'i nang gsal/'di ni rgyal po khri lde srong btsang la sras lnga byung ba'i gnyis pa yin zhing/'khrungs 'das kyi lo'i skor la bshad tshul mi 'dra ba mang zhing/'das lo ni (thang bde gsar rnying )ltar na thang ru tsung li yan gyi hos khrang khri lo gnyis pa chu khyi (842)lor lha lung dpal rdor gyis bkrongs/rang lo so dgur slebs pa lcags bya (841)lo nas lo gcig dang zla ba kha shas rgyal po byas shing/thog ma'i zla ba drug ring sngar srol ltar tshul mthun byas te/'bri yi gtsug lag khang dang spa bro stag khug gi gtsug lag khang sogs bzhengs/de nas ring por ma song bar rgya nag nas bon po 'ga' zhig gis bod kyi chab srid phung ba'i mthu sngags byas pa'i dngos po khag gsum rgyal po dang/btsun mo/blon po bcas la lag rtags su bskur ba 'byor rjes rgyal blon btsun mo rnams sems gyur nas chos khrims bshig pa'i ngan gros bshams/dbas rgyas to rig stag sna dang/sna nam rgyal cha khri gsum rje'i blon por bskos/sngar gyi chos blon rnams la dbang med par byas/skabs der sangs rgyas chos lugs med par bzo ba'i khag 'dogs byed sa ma rnyed lus pa'i dus der lha sar sad dang/ser ba/mu ge /nad yams yang po byung ba'i go skabs dang bstun nas thog mar bod 'bangs rnams la dril bsgrags kyi las ka byed don du/de sngon mes po srong btsan sgam po'i skabs rgya mo kong jo zer ba'i 'dre mo zhig bod du yong ba dang/deng lha yul dang/o rgyan yul/rgya gar/rgya nag bcas phung la gtad mkhan lha shAkya mu ni zer ba'i sku de bod du khyer yong ba ma zad/sa dpyad brtag pa la mkhas pa yin zer nas bod kyi ri dang sa dpyad bzang po yod tshad la mchod rten dang lha khang bcas rtsig tu bcug /mes po khri srong lde btsan dang ral pa can gyi skabs bod 'bangs mang po rab byung byed du bcug pas bod kyi mi rgyud gong 'phel yong rgyur gnod skyon chen po byung ba yin zer ba la sogs pa'i chos lugs bsnubs pa'i gleng phyogs mang po bton nas chos byed mi chog pa'i khrims bzos/rab byung btsun pa rnams rtags dang phral nas khyim par babs su bcug /bka' la mi nyan pa'i grags can chos pa mang po zhig bkrongs/de 'phros rnams mda' gzhu dang/ma lang/dung la sogs pa bskur nas ri dwags rngon par btang/lha khang gshib thub pa thams cad bshig bshig ma thub pa bsam yang dang lha sa gtsug lag khang sogs kyi sku brnyan 'ga' zhig sa la sbas/la la chu la bskyur/lha khang gi sgo la 'dam zhal byas/skabs der sngags pa dang/khyim pa/blon po dad pa can rnams kyis sku dang/gsung rab mang po sbas bskungs byas te srung skyong thub tsam byung/slob dpon chen po'i yangap+salob zhal bzhugs pa rnams kyis lkog tu bka' bgros gnang ste srung skyob gnang rgyur las bgos bskyon pa ltar gsang sngags kyi chos skor ha cang mang po zhig dang/btsan po'i skabs kyi khrims yig /bka' gtsigs/lo rgyus sogs 'brug yul/mon yul/lho brag /'bri gung/gtsang khul sogs sa btsan po gar yod kyi brag phug nang du sbas nas bros thub pa rnams bas shing/bros ma thub pa rnams gab gang thub mdzad/'ga' zhig rgyal blon gyis bzung nas sku bkrongs/skabs der sa gnas mang che bar rgyal pos mngags pa'i so myul ba yod stabs/lo paN 'ga' zhig mnga' ris nas li yul brgyud rgya bod kyi mtha' mtshams bskor nas mdo smad mtsho sngon phyogs su bros so/_/btsan po 'dir chos lugs bsnubs nas zla phyed bdun tsam song ba na lha lung dpal gyi rdo rje brag yer par gab nas bzhugs yod pa shes ste sku bkrongs mkhan gyi gshed ma gtong rtsis yod skabs lha lung dpal gyi rdo rjes rgyal po sdig can gsod pa'i dus la babs par mkhyen nas rta dkar po la sol ba nag po byug /ber phyi nag po nang dkar po byas pa zhig bzhes/phyag tu lcags mda' dang lcags gzhu thogs nas lha sar phebs/skabs der rgyal po sems cung zad ma bde ba'i rkyen gyis gtsug lag khang gi sgo 'gram du dpon zhang mthun 'brel gyi rdo ring yi ge klog nas bsdad yod pa dang stabs 'khel te rgyal pos gzigs pa dang rta las babs/phyag gsum 'tshal ba'i dang po la gus phyag dang/gnyis pa la mda' stong kh