gling bcu gsum|{de yang (mi dbang rtogs brjod )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 391nang yul dbus dang gtsang gi ljongs su gling bcu gsum du grags pa'i bshad sgrub kyi 'dus sde gsar du btsugs pa zhes pa de ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i skabs sa gnas srid gzhung btsugs pa'i rjes su dbus gtsang khul du dge lugs dang rnying ma'i dgon pa bsdoms nas bcu gsum gsar du btab pa de la zer zhing/de yang/1 sa gnas srid gzhung btsugs nas lo ngo bzhi pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing bya (1654)lor gsar 'dzugs byas pa gtsang smad g.yas ru'i shangs khul dga' ldan chos 'khor/(shangs dga' ldan chos 'khor/dge lugs/mtshan nyid grwa tshang/2 de nas lo ngo gsum pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me phag (1647)lor lha sa'i nye 'dabs brag yer par dga' ldan gsang sngags yang rtse/(brag yer pa/dge lugs/sngags pa grwa tshang/3 lo de'i rjes mar chu shul lhun po rtse'i rdzong 'og sgyug lar dga' ldan chos 'khor yang rtse/(chos 'khor yang rtse/dge lugs/mtshan nyin grwa tshang/) 4 lo de kha'i nang lho kha dol khul du dga' ldan gsung rab gling/(dol gsung rab gling/dge lugs/mtshan nyid dang sngags zung 'brel/) 5 lo de'i rjes ma la gtsang khul ru lag gi char gtogs rnam rgyal lha rtse dga' ldan 'og smin gling/(lho brag don gnyis gling/dge lugs/mtshan nyid gtso bor dang zhar byung du gas chog /) 6 lo de ga'i nang lho brag do bo rdzong khul dga' ldan don gnyis gling/(lho brag don gnyis gling/dge lugs/mtshan nyid grwa tshang/) 7 de nas lo ngo gsum pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags yos (1651)lor lho kha yar lung gi stod sham po gang nye 'dabs su dga' ldan thos bsam dar rgyas gling/(yang stod som bsam dar rgyas gling/dge lugs/mtshan nyid dang sngags chog zung 'brel/) 8 lo de ga'i nang mnga' ris khyung rdzong dkar por dga' ldan 'phel rgyal gling/(sa dga' 'phel rgyas gling/dge lugs/sngags pa grwa tshang/) 9 lo de ga'i nang sngar cha shul khul du rnying lugs kyi sngags pa grwa tshang rnam par rgyal ba phan bde legs bshad gling pa de nyid rjes su tA la'i bla ma mes rgyal nang sar phebs skabs sku zhabs grwa tshang du bsgyur (de nas bzung mang po'i ring rtse po ta ral gtan 'jags thog rnying lugs kyi cho ga rnams byed mus la sog po jun gar gyi dmag bod du yong skabs rtse'i rnam rgyal grwa tshang dang/smin grol gling sogs rnying pa'i dgon pa phal che ba gtor zhing/rjes su slar yang lo shas bar bskyar du tshugs/de nas lo 'ga' shas song ba gong ma yung Ting khri lo dang po rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu yos (1723)lor pho lha tha'i jis sngar yod grwa pa rnams rtsed thang o rgyan gling du spos/rgyud smad pa nas grwa mang po bsdus te dge lugs kyi grwa tshang tu bsgyur thog ming sngar de 'jags su btags pa yin zhing yongs grags su rnam rgyal grwa tshang zer )ba de'i tshab tu gong gsal lcags yos lor gsar du tshugs pa gsang sngags byang chub gling/(byang chub gling/rnying ma/sngags pa grwa tshang/) 10 de nas lo bzhi song ba rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing rta (1654)lor lha sa'i smad rgyud pho brang gong ri dkar po'i (da lta'i lho kha gong dkar )nye 'dabs thod pa rir dga' ldan bshad sgrub gling/(gong dkar bshad sgrub gling/dge lugs/mtshan nyid dang sngags chog zung 'brel/) 11 de nas lo ngo bcu drug pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa byi (1669)lor gtsang g.yas ru'i cha nyug du dga' ldan chos 'khor gling/(nyug dga' ldan chos 'khor gling/dge lugs/mtshan dang sngags chog zung 'brel/) 12 de nas lo ngo bcu gcig pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa lug (1670)lor gtsang smad khul du phung po ri bo cher/gud dpud zil gnon gling/(phung po ri bo che/rnying lugs/sngags pa grwa tshang/13 de nas lo ngo bzhi pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu khyi (1682)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa gshegs pa'i lo der lho brag khul mchar chur dga' ldan 'dud 'joms gling/(rnying lugs/sngags pa grwa tshang )bcas rnams dang du dung bka' brgyud pa'i dgon pa 'ga' zhig gis ngo log byas pa ming med du song ba'i tshab dge lugs pa'i dgon pa gsar du tshugs pa dang 'ga' zhig grub mtha' bsgyur bsogs dbus gtsang khams bcas su bsdoms pa'i nyi shu rtsa drug tsam yod pa sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i (dga' ldan chos 'byung bai DUr+ya ser po )shog g