gling ras pad+ma rdo rje|{'brug pa bka' brgyud kyi srol gtod pa po/rje 'di nyid rab byung gnyis pa'i sa sprel (1128)lor yab rgyal po skyab be bya ba sngags dang sman rtsis kyi yon tan ldan pa dang/yum gzus mo dar chung gnyis kyi sras su gtsang myang stod du sku 'khrungs/mtshan la pad+ma rdo rje zhes btags/dgung lo dgu la klog bslabs/dgung lo bcu bdun lor slob dpon gling ras las dge bsnyen mdzad/dgung lo so brgyad par 'gro mgon phag mo gru pa'i slob mar gyur/phag gru'i sku mdun nas lhan cig skyes sbyor gsan pas chu bo gang+gA tshun na lta ba bzang bar grags dbyar zla gsum phag grur bzhugs bud med sngon mo zhig gis mdo rgyud kyi lung gnang ba'i snang ba byung ba de nas mdo rgyud rang dbang du 'grel ba'i spobs pa thob bka' 'gyur thugs la zhugs spyir rgyud kyi rnam bshad dang sems kyi rdo rje'i bstod pa dang rnal 'byor 'jug pa dang bde mchog gi dkyil 'khor gyi cho ga la sogs pa brtsams shing bla ma sgrub pa'i phyag bzhes kyang rje btsun gling ram pa nas byung ba yin phyis sna phu chos lung du dgon pa'i gzhi bzung nas gzhan don mang du bskyangs mthar dgung lo re gcig pa rab byung gsum pa'i sa sprel (1188)lo'i dbyar zla ra ba'i nyer brgyud la sku gshegs yab sras 'di nyid las brgyud pa'i chos 'byung la 'brug pa bka' brgyud zer}
