glud 'gong|{(glud ma )srog tshab tu gtong ba ste/bon gyi chos lugs/mi gson po'i srog tshab tu nor phyugs sogs sems can ngo ma gsod ma dgos par zan dang mar sogs las sems can de'i 'dra gzugs bcos nas sngags dang smon lam btab te gtong srol yod pa de 'dra zhig yin/yul mi dang grong mi mang po'i don du mi gson po glud du brdzangs pa'i srol ni sngar bod sa gnas srid gzhung gis srid dbang bzung ba'ip+sakabs su yang bon chos kyi goms gshis dang 'dra bar tshogs mchod gtor rgyag skabs bod ljongs mi dmangs spyi'i tshab byed pa'i gling 'gong rgyal po zer ba mi gnyis glas te gcig bsam yas pe har lcog dang gcig 'phan po rgyal khang du gtong srol yod pa ste/lo ltar bod zla gnyis pa'i tshes nyi shu dgur gsang sngags rnying ma byang chub gling pa'i tshogs yongs nas rnying lugs gtor sgrub dang 'brel ba'i sku glud du mi gnyis 'gro dgos pa 'khri khungs zhol las khungs nas pho yan mi gcig dang 'phan po glud 'gong sgang nas mi gcig bcas la chas gos ni 'go snam phyir nar bslog pa'i mgo shub/sked par shog bus bzos pa'i 'bo dang/bre nyag ga /sho bcas btags/lag tu g.yag gi rnga nag thogs pa/ras dkar gyi zhwa cog rtse ring la rnga nag gi tog dang/ras nag gi lcog dar can/'gram g.yas nag po/g.yon dkar po bzos pa glud 'gong rgyal po'i gzugs su bya ba gnyis yod/de'i skabs bla steng (bla brang )steng ste sa gtsug lag khang gi 'khyams ra'i yang steng)zur 'phyong rab gsal du tA la'i bla ma chibs bsgyur yod na dang med tshe mgron gzim nas na bza' gdan zhu byed pa dang/khams gsum rab gsal du bka' blon rnam pa/rdo gcal gyi byang ngos su 'bras spungs tshogs chen dge bskos/chab bdag ma/sku tshab rnam gra'i sku zhabs dbu paN dang/sku ber/stong tshab kyi dom ra bskyon pa zhig dang/byang chub gling pa'i slob dpon bcas gdan thog 'khod/lha sa tsho par 'khri ba'i dpa' bo dang/dpa' mo zhes gzhon nu gnyis la rgyas gos rgyas spros kyis g.yog bzhi bcas langs nas sdod pa/byang chub gling pas dkyil 'khor mthil du rgyal po btsan mdos sgrub gzhag sngon zin ltar rdor slob kyis dbu zhwa nag bdun sgo 'phyor 'og gsung c