glegs bam|{de sngon bod du gsung rab gyi dpe cha rnams phyogs bsgrigs byed skabs tsheg bar sum cu so gnyis nas so drug gang rung la sho lo ka re dang sho ka sum brgya la bam po rer byas te glengs shing gnyis kyi bar du bsdams nas 'jog pa la glegs bam gcig tu brtsis pa dang/rjes su glegs pham che bar shog grangs lnga brgya yas mas dang 'bring bar shog grangs sum brgya nas bzhi brgya tsam chung bar shog grangs nyis brgya lhag tsam yod bod tshig gi shog grangs ni gong shog ngos rgyab mdun gnyis shog grang gcig tu rtsi ba yin glegs bam rnams la khyad chos bdun dang ldan pa ste 1 yig 'bru mtha' sne mi 'chol ba'i ched du mtha' thig 2 shog ngos so so'i rgyab mdun mi nor ba'i ched du yig mgo 3 shog ngos snga phyi'i go rim ma 'jol ba'i ched du shog grangs 4 le tshan phan tshun mi 'khrugs pa'i ched du mtshan byang 5 glegs bam hril por srung skyob bya ba'i ched du glengs shing 6 glegs bam phan tshun mi 'dres pa'i ched du na bza' dpe sgril bcas yod de dag kyang bod mi rigs rang nyid kyi khyad chos ldan pa'i sgyu rtsal gyi bzo khyad phul du byung ba dper na tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i skabs bzhengs pa'i bka' 'gyur 'dzam gling g.yas bzhag (deng skabs 'bras spungs su yod )tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa sku gshegs rjes sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos dgongs rdzogs su bzhengs pa'i bka' 'gyur srid zhi'i mdzes rgyan (deng skabs rtse po ta la pho brang dmar po'i 'khrungs rabs lha khang du bzhugs/) pho lha tha'i ji bsodanams stobs rgyas yis rang nyid kyi skyes ma zhabs drung bde ldan sgrol ma 'das pa'i dgongs rdzogs su bzhengs pa bka' 'gyur gser bris (de sngon dga' ldan gser gdung khang gi zhal ras lha khang du yod )sogs lta bu yin}
