dga' ldan dgon pa|{'brog ri bo dga' ldan rnam par rgyal ba'i gling ni/lha sa nas shar phyogs su lam thag spyi le 40lhag tsam gyi sar stag rtse rdzong khungs dbang bskur ri'i ldebs btsun mo sdings kyi mdun ngos 'gog pa ri'i steng ras gzhi la sor mos bris pa bzhin chags yod/(mtho tshad rgya mtsho'i ngos las spyi khre 4075tsam yod/) dgon pa de ni bod kyi lo rgyus thog bshad srol la sngon byon rgyal ba sras bcas kyis lan du mar lung bstan cing 'phags pa mo 'gal bus zhabs bcug ste chos dung dkar po gter du sbas pa sogs dge mtshan khyad par can dang ldan pa sku gsung thugs rten gyi dbyibs can gyi rang byon mang po mtha' bskor ba'i dbus su bzo bo mkhas pa'i sor mos 'du byed pa ltar ri ldebs su gzigs thog gcig brtsegs su gnas zhes yongs su grags/rje tsong kha pa chen pos bod rab byung bdun pa'i sa glang (1409)lor phyag btab/de yang rje tsong kha pa dgung grangs gnyis la phebs shing sa gnas gang du byon yang zhabs rjes su 'brang ba'i slob ma mang bas gnas nges med phebs bzhud sku ngal gyi gzhir brten sbyin bdag dad can mang pos de snga nas dgon rnying phul ba dang/dgon gsar 'debs dgos pa'i re skul zhus rkyen/jo bo rin po che'i drung du mar me brtag pa sogs brtag pa du ma gnang ste/'brog ri bo cher dgon gsar 'debs par bzang bar phebs pas smon lam grol 'phral rje rang nyid sku 'khor du ma dang bcas 'brog ri bo cher byon te sa gzhi byin gyis brlabs/dgon pa'i mdun ngos su yod pa'i spyi gso chu mig de yang ngag rgyun thog sa der chu med par gzigs nas phyag mdzub gtad pas chu rdol zhing/mi mngon pa'i sgo nas chos rgyal zhal 'bag dang/dung dkar gnyis gter nas bzhes pa bcas bshad srol yod/de rjes slob dpon dar ma rin chen dang/'dul 'dzin grags pa rgyal mtshan gnyis kyis gtso mdzad dge 'dun lnga brgya tsam 'dir phebs te 'dul ba'i phyag len dang mthun par rmang bting ba dang brtsigs pa sogs kyis de lo rang la gzim khang gis thog drangs grwa khang bdun cu tsam dang/gzhi 'ding ba brgya lhag tsam byung/lcags stag (1410)lor rje bla ma rang nyid 'khor dang bcas pa dga' ldan du phebs te mdo sngags kyi chos mtha' yas pa gsungs/mkhan chen phyag rdor bas lung bstan pa ltar dga' ldan zhes pa'i ming btags/dgon de'i nang gses grwa tshang gnyis yod pa'i nang gi shar rtse grwa tshang ni rje tsong kha pa'i dngos slob shar pa rin chen rgyal mtshan gyis thog mar btab cing grwa tshang 'dir khang tshan bcu gnyis yod pa ste/rdo khang/phu khang/lho pa/nyag re/co ne/the bo/zung ju/sog po/rta dbon/mnga' ris/gung ru bcas yin/byang rtse grwa tshang ni rje tsong kha pa'i slob ma hor ston nam mkha' dpal bas zur 'khrid slob dpon gnang nas thog mar chags/grwa tshang 'dir khang tshan bcu gnyis yod pa ste/har gdong/bsam blo/tsha ba/tre hor/gser kong/rdo ra/klu 'bum/rgyal rong/go bo/pha ra/kong po/bra nye bcas yin/dgos pa 'di'i grwa grangs ni/sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i skabs zhal grangs chig stong lhag tsam yod cing dmangs gtso'i bcos bskyur gong bzhi stong lhag tsam yod/tshogs chen dang/yangs pa can/lnga mchod khang/byang rtse ri khrod/gzim chung 'od zer sbug /rgyud khang bcas rim grub thog bod me sprel (1416)lor gsang sngags kyi sgrub mchod gnang yul yangs can gtsug lag khang ka ba don gnyis yod pa gsar skrun gnang/dgon sde de'i sbyin bdag gi gtso bor mi dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan dang/gzhis ka sne'u pa/drung rin chen dpal dang/brag dkar nang so rin chen lhun po/rgya ma khri dpon zla ba bcas yin/khong tshos 'bri gung klung shod khul dang/dga' ldan dgon pa'i nye 'dabs khul nas mchod gzhis khag phul ba dang/skya btsun mtha' dag gis zhabs tog tshul bzhin sgrub/dgon pa 'di'i sku gsung thugs rje dang rig dngos sngar yod skor/rje tsong kha pa sku gshegs pa'i sa phag (1419)lor dngul gdung khang gsar rgyag mdzad de je bla ma nyid kyi sku gdung ril por bzhugs pa'i dngul sdong mthong ba don ldan dang/de'i g.yas g.yon du 'jam dbyangs gtsang pa bdun rgyud kyi sku gdung sogs mang du bzhugs/dngul sdong mthong ba don ldan de phyis su khri thog lnga bcu pa dge 'dun phun tshogs kyis gser sbyangs btso ma 'ba' zhig las grub pa'i gser sdong du bsgyur/li ma lha khang/'og gi gtsang khang nang gtso bor rje nyid kyis bzhengs pa'i thub dbang tshul khrims sogs gser zangs kyi lha sku mang po/mgon khang/gser khri khang sogs dang/ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma zhon tes byams chen chos rje'i slob ma a mo g+ha dang/bsod nams shes rab gnyis la phul ba'i tsan+dan gyi gur la nang yol bla bre/gos btags kyi gtso bor ston pa dang gnas brtan bcu drug dge bsnyen ha zhang/rgyal chen bzhi/gsang 'dus mi bskyod pa bcas pa'i thang ka (dga' ldan gser thang )sogs gna' rabs rig rdzas kyi shul dngos rin thang che ba mang po dang/gzhan yang pho lhas bzhengs pa'i gser bris kyi bka' bstan 'gyur dang/lha khang mtha' dag gi nang du gdung rten dang/dkyil 'khor/ldebs ris/thang ga mchod rdzas sogs byur bur gang ba bcas bzhugs/'jam mgon bla ma nas bzung khri thog go bdun gyi bar byon pa'i mtshan tho zur du gsal ba ltar mkhas pa'i bya ba rnam gsum gyis bstan pa 'dzin skyong spel gsum gnang srol yod/1969lor rig gnas gsar brje'i god chags kyis rkyen pas dgos pa yin thams cad rtsa med du song zin pa'i khongs nas si'u thang gtso 'khor thang kha nyi shu rtsa gsum bod ljongs rig dngos cud nas nyar tshags gnang yod pa dang/gser bris kyi bstan 'gyur sngar pe cin mi rigs rig gnas pho brang du bzhugs yod pa phyis su lha sar gdan drangs pa da lta bzhugs/1980lo nas bzung tang gi chos dad rang mos kyi srid jus spel ba dang/dpal 'byor thog shugs che'i rogs skyor gnang ba'i 'og dgon pa de'i grwa pa lhag 'phro dang/rgya che'i mang tshogs mtha' dag gis dka' ngal khyad bsad ngang rgyab skor byas te thog mar lnga mchod khang nyams gso dang/de rjes gser sdong chen po bzhugs yul gsar bzhengs thog rig gsar skabs sku gdung gdan zhu ba nas rje bla ma'i dbu thod cha shas ma tshang ba dang/ring bsrel/gdung thal gang tsam bcas gsang nyar thub pa sogs bzhugs su gsol ba'i gser gdung khru gang tsam zhig dang/gzhan yang gzungs zhugs rnying pa dang/rje yab sras gsum gyi gsung 'bum/lam rim chen mo grangs mang sogs gzungs su bzhugs pa'i dngul dgung chen mo mtho tshad spyi khre lnga lhag tsam yod pa phra rgyan dang/bzo bk