dga' ldan pho brang|{de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gis rang nyid la che bstod byas pa'i ming yin/'di ni sngar 'bras spungs su rdo khang sngon mo zer ba zhig yod pa rjes su sne'u gdong dpon rigs rnams 'bras spungs su yong skabs kyi gnas khang yin pas 'bras spungs dpon khang yang zer zhing/phag gru sde srid khri rabs bcu gcig pa dbang bkra shis grags pa rgyal mtshan gyis srid dbang bzung rjes/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gnyis pa dge 'dun rgya mtsho 'bras spungs mkhan po gnang skabs rab byung dgu pa'i sa stag (1518)lor bzhugs gnas su phul zhing/tA la'i bla ma p+saku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtsho sog yul du phebs shul phyag mdzod sku mdun ring po che chos bzang 'phrin las kyis 'gan blangs shing/skyid shod sde pa bkra shis rab brtan gyis 'char 'god thog 'ul mi rdo shing bcas kyi zhal 'debs phul te pho brang 'di rgya bskyed gser bzhengs byas pa nas tA la'i bla ma sku phreng rim pa'i bzhugs gnas gtso che ba'i gras su gyur ba dang/sku phreng lnga pas bod sa gnas kyi srid dbang skyong ba gnang skabs slar yang nyams gso rgya skyed thog srid gzhung gsar pa'i ming la dga' ldan pho brang zhes 'dogs pa gnang ba'i rgyu mtshan de ltar yin}
dga' ldan byang rtse grwa tshang|{grwa tshang de ni rje tsong kha pa'i dngos slob hor ston nam mkha' dpal bzang pos btab ste bla nas bzung nas chos zur 'chad mdzad pas rje dge 'dun grub pa sogs mkhas grub mang pos chos zhus pa sogs byung/grwa khang rgyab ngos thog brtsegs bzhi dang/mdun ngos nyis thog /sgo 'phyor ka ba brgyad/'du khang ka ring brgyad dang bcas ka ba brgyad cu rgya bzhi/'du khang nang rten gtso thub dbang tshul khrims mdang/rje tshul khrims chos 'phel gyi 'dra sku sogs sku gsung thugs rten du ma/gyang ldebs su gzhi ser por mtshal bris kyi tshe dpag med dang/sgo 'gram g.yas g.yon du zhal yar gzigs su chos srung/gser g.yab tu rje rin po che sogs/sgo 'phyor du rgyal chen ba zhi sogs kyi bris sku/sgo 'phyor steng rab gsal/gseng g.yab kyi khor yug dang/thog brtsegs gsum pa yan dpe mdzod khang dang las shag le lag khag /thog brtsegs bzhi par rgyal ba'i gzim chung sogs dang/grwa khang gi phyi'i lho nub mtshams su chos ra bcas yod/grwa khang rnying pa 'du khang ka ring bzhi dang bcas ka bsum cu dang/'du khang nang gnas brtan brag ri'i 'jim brnyan byon legs/mo khang du dpal ldan mo sogs kyi sku brnyan/yang nga du mkhan po'i bzhugs khang sogs yod/hor ston nam mkha' dpal nas bzung don grub rgya mtsho bar bai ser nang mkhan rabs nyi shu rtsa dgu'i mtshan gsal ba dang/rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag lo mkhan po las thog go bo ye shes dga' ba yin/rgyud du 'chad nyan yig cha gtso bo rje yab sras dang/se ra rje btsun pa'i yig cha rnams yin/srong ma'i gtso bo dpal ldan lha mo bsten/stag rtse sgrub mchod skabs 'don bzang ba rnams nas gsang 'dus mi bskyod pa'i rdul tshon sgrub mchod tshugs srol}
