dga' ldan shar rtse grwa tshang|{shar rtse grwa tshang ni rje rin po che'i dngos slob gnas brten rin chen rgyal mtshan gyis phyag btab cing/grwa khang mdun ngos nyis thog dang/rgyab phyogs bzhi thog /sgo 'phyor ka ba drug /'du khang ka ring brgyad dang bcas ka ba bdun cu/'du khang sbug tu zhar las lha khang ka ba bzhi/rten gtso mthe po sprul sku sku phreng dang pos bzhengs pa'i rje yab sras gsum gyi 'jim sku thog tshad ma/paN chen bsod grags kyi 'dra sku/mkhan po rang sangs rgyas kyi gdung rten/g.yu thog sku phreng dang po'i thugs dam kyi rten sgrol ma gas sgrom ma/mal gro rgyal bzang gi ngo bo sogs sku gsum thugs rje mang po yod/gyang ldebs shar ngos su tshong kha brgyad cu dang/nub ngos gzhi mtshal la gser bris kyi tshe dpag med/sgo 'gram g.yas g.yon du chos srung/gser g.yab tu rje rin po che sogs kyi bla sku/sgo 'phyor du rgyal chen sde bzhi sogs ldebs bris/sgo 'phyor steng rab gsal de'i mtha' skor du las shog sogs khang mig mang po dang/rtse thog tu rgyal ba'i gzim chung dang gzhan yang mkhon po'i bzhugs khang le lag dang bcas pa yod/'du khang gi shar ngos cho sa ra yin/gnas brtan rin chen rgyal mtshan nas spom por blo bzang chos 'phel bar mkhan rabs sum cu so drug gi mtshan ber ser nas du gsal ba dang/rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag lo la mkhan po las thog phu khang kha ru ba blo bzang chos 'phel yin/'chad nyan gtso bo rje yab sras dang paN chen bsod grags kyi yig char gzhi 'dzin/srung ma bse khrab pa bsten gyi yod 'dug /stag rtse sgrub mchod skabs 'don bzang ba rnams nas yangs can du 'jigs byed bcu gsum gyi rdul tshon sgrub mchod tshugs srol}
dga' ldan lha'i gnas|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung (mngon pa mdzod )nas bshad tshul la khams gsum gyi nang nas 'dod khams la 'gro ba ris drug dang de'i nang gses lha la 'dod lha ris drug tu phye ba (1 rgyal chen ris bzhi/2 sum cu rtsa gsum/3 'thab bral/4 dga' ldan/5 'phrul dga'/6 gzhan 'phrul dbang byed bcas )las bzhi pa dga' ldan lha'i gnas ni sa bcu'i byang chub sems dpa' skye ba gcig gis thog pa rnams bzhugs pa'i dag pa'i zhing khams shig yin par bshad}
