dga' ba gdong|{stod lung bde chen rdzong dga' gdong dgon pa ni spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu gsum pa'i nang zhig po shes rab kyis phyag btab/de rjes rim bzhin 'phel rgyas su phyin te dbus kyi gdan sa chen po drug gi gras yin pa dang/spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu bzhi pa'i nang rje tsong kha pas de gar bla ma dbu ma ba dang lhan du sgrub pa mdzad nas 'jam dbyangs kyi zhal gzigs pa sogs lo rgyus mang/bar lam dgon pa de nyams rgud byung nas ser khyim dgon du song/dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i smad tsam nas gtsang dgon du slar gso byas/de gar gnas srung shing bya can khog zhugs byed cing de ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i sku dus nas lha khog zhugs byed srol byung zhing/dga' gdong gnas srung gnod sbyin shing bya can zhes de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi bsten gsol byed pa'i lha'i gras shig yin la/sku bsten gyi khyim tshang la dga' gdong gzing khang zhes 'bod/sku bsten la bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi rim pa bzhi pa'i rtse skor mkhan chung gi go ming yod pa dang sku bsten de dag khyim brgyud kyis byed dgos la/sa zhing mi ser sogs bdag thob kyang gang tsam yod 'dug }
