dga' bzhi|{shar du chu sna 'dzoms pas klu rnams dga'/lho ru shing sna 'dzoms pas bya rnams dga'/byang nu rtswa sna 'dzoms pa'i yugs rnams dga' zhes pa dga' ba bzhi ldan gyi sgo nas ming de btags so/_/sa ming rgyal rtse rdzong/lcang ra chus/dga' bzhi}
dga' bzhi 'phrul gyi lha khang|{lha sa gtsug lag khang gi ming gi rnam grangs ste/ming gzhan dga' bzhi 'phrul snang yang zer/(ma Ni bka' 'bum )las/dga' bzhi zer ba ni/1 gtsug lag khang sgo bzhi dkyil 'khor ris su byas pas bla ma dga'/2 ka ba phur pa'i dbyings su byas pas sngags pa dga'/3 zur bzhi g.yung drung ris su byas pas bon po dga'/4 mig mangs ris su byas pa'i bod rnams dga' ba ste dga' ba bzhi dang/sprul pa dang 'dra ba'i bzo bos bzhengs pas na 'phrul snang du thogs pa yin zhes bshad}
