dge mi dge lung ma bstan pa gsum|{dang po dge ba ni thams cad mkhyen pa'i sangs rgyas bsgrub pa dge slong 'khor lo bzhi dang ldan pa gcig dgos te/'khor lo bzhi gang zhe na/klu sgrub kyis/mthun par gyur pa'i yul gnas pa dang/skyes bu dam pa rnams yi bsten pa dang/bdag gi legs smon sngon bsags bsodanams kyi/_/'khor lo chen po bzhi ni khyod la mnga'/_/zhes gsungs pas/skyes ba dam pa la brten nas dam pa'i chos la nyon pa dang/tshul bzhin yid la byed pa dang/chos kyi rjes su mthun par sgrub pa la brten nas dge ba sgom pa ni dge ba'o/_/de yang bya ba las kyi 'khor lo/dge 'dun gyi bya gzhag rnam dag klog pa thos bsam gyi 'khor lo mdo rgyud kyi bslab sbyangs/spang ba bsam gtan gyi 'khor lo rtse gcig gi nyams len brtson pa gsum la 'dus par gsungs so/_/mi dge ba gang zhe na/de bzhin du skyes bu dam pa ma yin pa la bsten pa dang/dam pa'i chos ma yin pa la nyan pa dang/tshul bzhin ma yin pa yid la byed pa dang/lus dang ngag dang yid kyi nyes pa spyod pa'o/_/lung ma bstan ni/de gnyis dang mi ldan cing kun slong drag po med pa'o/_}
