dge bshes chen po khams pa lung pa|{'phan yul yung bar rab byung dang po'i shing mo glang (1085)lor sku 'khrungs/rab byung gsum pa'i shing lugs (1175)lor sku gshegs/rten dge bsnyen/mtshan dngos shAkya yon tan/snye thang du jo bo dang mjal zhing/phyis rwa sgreng du dge bshes ston pa yun ring du bsten cing lung rtogs kyi yon tan la mnga' 'byor te tshogs pa yang ston phrag re tsam 'tshogs/khyad par byang chub sems dal thugs 'byongs pa'i skye bu grags/lo rgyus rgyas pa las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung mkhas pa'i yig 'phreng )nang gsal/khams pa lung ni dgon pa'i ming yin nam dpyad}
