dge slong ma'i thun mong ma yin pa'i ltung byed brgya dang brgyad|{ma lon pas nye bar 'jog pa/'khor nye bar 'jog pa/'khor mang po nye bar 'jog pa/lo bcug nyis ma lon par bsnyen par rdzogs par byed pa/lo nyi shu ma lon par bsnyen par rdzogs par byed pa/khyim so bzung ba tshigs las 'das par bsnyen par rdzogs pa byed pa/khyim so ma bzung ba tshigs las 'das par bsnyen rdzogs byed pa/bslab pa la bslab pa bsnyen rdzogs mi byed pa/chos 'tshong ba/'drid pa/'khor mang po gsog pa/ma gnang ba sdud pa/'khrul ba mo sdud pa/sbrum ma sdud pa/mya ngan gyis gzir ba sdud pa/rtsab krol can sdud pa/phan mi 'dogs pa/bar chad mi 'dren pa/bslab pa la mi slob pa/nad g.yog mi byed pa/'dod pa bsnyen pa/'dod pa bsnyen pa ltar 'chos pa/'dod pa bsten pa ltar gnod pa/bsten par bya ba 'chos/dben pa skyabs yod par khyim dang lhan cig 'greng ba/der dge slong dang lhan cig 'grel ba/bla gab med par khyim pa dang lhan cig 'greng ba/der dge slong ma dang ldan cig 'greng ba/khyim pa'i rna bar gshub cing smra ba/khyim pas gshub cing smra ba nyan pa/dge slong gi rna bar gshung cing smra ba/dge slong gis gshub cing smra ba nyan pa/khyim pa las rig pa len pa/khyim pa la rig pa klog pa/sgyu thabs kyis rma bcings shing 'grol du 'jug pa/bu 'tsho ba/khyim gzhan dum tshan mo nyal ba/mtshan mo dge slong ma gzhan med par nyal ba/longs spyod cing gnas pa btang ba/rang gi lus la dge slong ma dang/dge tshul ma dang/khyim pa mo dang/mu stegs mos dril phyis byed du 'jug pa lnga dang/bod med gzhan gyis bkru bshal byed du 'jug pa/lus la dri zhim pos skud pa/'bru mar gyi tshigs mas skud pa/chu la longs spyod pa/pu shel tsis skra shad pa/de gsum char gyis skra shad pa skra brnyan bkab pa khyim pa'i rgyan thogs pa bro rdung ba glu len pa rol mo byed pa gdugs thogs pa mchil lham byon pa khri'u'i bsnyen bkur nyams su myong ba thugs thub tu phyin gnod byed pa khyim pa la log thabs byed pa dge slong ma'i tshogs kyi gos bdag gis byed pa zas 'tshong ba khyim gyi bya ba byed pa chang las byed pa rjen btsos byed pa lto 'dun las gyu