dgon lung byams pa gling|{tsong chu byang chub kyi ma dgon du grags pa'i dgon lung byams pa gling {(WP:1,194)}ni da lta'i mtsho sngon zhing chen hu'u kru'u hor rigs rang skyong rdzong bu'u hri shang gi kre ca zhes pa'i sar gnas yod cing/yul de'i ming la dgos lung zer bas dgon par yang dgos lung zhes ming de ltar thogs pa yin zhes bshad srol yod/mdo smad kyi dgon chen 'di nyid kyi thog ma'i chags tshul ltar na bod rang yung bcu pa'i chu lug (1583)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtsho sog yul du phebs skabs kre ca zhes pa'i sar phebs lam 'khel zhing/sa 'dir phebs 'byor skabs phyis su sa 'dir sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa rgya cher spel ba'i skyes bu dam pa 'byung bar nges (zhes ra lung bstan gnang myong ba dang/bod rab byung bcu pa'i chu yos (1603)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bzhi pa yon tan rgya nang sog nas dbus gtsang du phebs pa'i lam bar sa gnas 'dir phebs skabs sag nas de ga'i dad ldan ser skya mang tshogs kyis sa der dgon gzhan shig phyag 'debs dgos pa'i re ba zhus par zhal bzhes thob rung skabs der rgyu rkyen du ma'i dbang gis myur 'grub ma thub cing/de'i phyi lo hu'u kru'u hor rigs phyogs kha bcu gsum gyi 'og dpon rnams dbus gtsang du song nas skyar du re ba zhus par tA la'i bla ma dang paN chen rin po che rnam gnyis nas rgyal sras sku phreng bdun pa don yod chos kyi rgya mtsho mngags te shing 'brug (1604)lor dgon pa phyag btab/thog ma'i dus su mtshan nyid grwa tshang gcig pu las med kyang phyis su lcang skya dang/thu'u bkwan/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa bcas kyis rgyud pa grwa tshang btsugs te bshad sgrub zung 'brel gyi chos sder gyur thog grwa grangs brgya lhag zin/ching gong ma khang zhi'i dus skabs su dgon gnas 'di nyid dang rgyas shin tu chen po byung ste 'du khang che chung dang/nang chen (bla brang )grwa shag sogs nyid stong lhag dang grwa grangs bdun stong bdun brgya bar 'phel rgyas byung ba ma zad/sa gnas de ga'i hor rigs dang/bod rigs/rgya rigs/sog rigs sogs kyi dad ldan mang tshogs dang/da dung nang sog dang/khams brgyad/kan lho sogs nas mjal skor yong mkhan chu bo'i rgyun bzhin 'dzad med du gyur de rjes bod rang byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing 'brug (1724)lor sog rigs kyi ching wang blo bzang bstan 'dzin gyi dus rkyen nang dgon lung grwa pas ching srid gzhung la ngo rgol byas stabs ching srid gzhung gis khron sAn spyi khyab pa nyan kun ya'o dang zi khron gyi tha pu'u yo krung chis btang nas dgon lung dgon du dmag drangs thog skabs de'i skor (ching rgyal rabs kyi lo rgyus nyan kun ya'o yi rtogs brjod ) {(WP:1,194)}nang rkun jag (ching srid gzhung la ngo rgol byed mkhan grwa pa )drug stong lhag bsad dgon pa gtor nas thal rdul tu btang zhes bkod 'dug cing de nas bzung dgon gnas 'di nyid thal rdal gyi rjes shul tsam du gyur pa ma zad srog nyen las thar pa nyung shas yod pa de dag tsong chu'i 'gram ngos kyi brag phug dang nags tshal khrod du yib nas phyir 'gro dus chos gos thog tu stod gos dkar po gyon nas 'gro dgos pa byung tshul (mdo smad chos 'byung )du gsungs de nas lo ngo bcu lhag song rjes skabs der pe cin du bca' bzhugs gong ma'i dbu bla lcang skya dang thu'u bkwan rnam gnyis nas thugs re thengs mang bton gnang brten nas chu byi (1732)lor ching p+sarid gzhung nas 'gro gron btang ste dgon gnas 'di nyid nyams gso zhus thog de'i skor {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i rdo ring yi ge'i nang grwa pa nyis brgya rgyun zhugs kyis nang bstan spel ba dang mi skya rnams la 'gro 'dug gi khang pa yod pa sngon chad kyi dgon ming rna bar mi snyan dgon ming gsar du btags pa la dbyig gnyen dgon {(WP:1,194)}zer zhes bkod yod de rjes bod rab yung bcu bzhi pa'i me stag (1866)lo'i zla bcu gnyis par nub byang sa khul gyi hos rigs kyis ching srid gzhung la ngo grol byas pa'i 'thab skrod nang dgon lung dgon par slar yang chag sgo byung ste 'du khang dang lha khang (bka' 'gyur )du pod bdun (bstan 'gyur )pod bzhi thang ka dang 'bag sku chos dpe mchod rten bcas mer btang ste grwa pa nyi shu bsad dgon lung dgon pa thal rdul gyi rjes shul tsam du gyur zhes (dbyeg gnyen dgon pa'i gdan rabs )(nang du gsal zhing dus zing zhod 'jags byung nas yun