mgar khri 'bring|{yongs grags su blon po mgar gyi bu 'bring dang/mang srong dang 'dus srong yab sras gnyis kyi blon po/'dis mang srong gi sku dus su rang gi gcen po mgar btsan snya ldom bur gzhogs 'degs byes nas dmag don dang/chab srid/dpal 'byor bcas kyi 'gan chen po khur ba ma zad/rang gi gcen po 'das rjes btsan po'i bka' bzhin blon chen gyi 'gan khur nas btsan por chab srid bskyangs rogs zhus/'dis blon chen gyi 'gan blangs rje 'a zha'i yul du dmag drangs shing/rgya'i dmag dpon 'o zhang sho (wang zha'o ce )dang g.yulap+saparaded pham par byas nas shar phyogs su rgyal khams rgya bskyed pa sogs byas par grags na yang/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang mgar khri 'bring gis rgyal po khri gnyan gzungs btsan gyi blon po byas par gsungs pa dang/tun hong nas thon pa'i rgyal rabs lo tshigs nang bod sa khyi (698)lor btsan po 'dus srong dbyar dus byang phyogs su phebs pa dang/dgun dus blon chen po mgar khri 'bring btsan brod kyis mdo smad cong kha che chung du dmag drangs/dgung dus de rang la btsan pos mag ral bkyon phab ces gsal ba dang/khri 'bring gnas dbyung btang ba'i phyi rol ri shi brgyab ces rgya'i yig tshang du gsal zhes pa sogs mdor na/tun hong nas thon pa'i lo rgyus yig cha'i nang mgar khri 'bring ni blon po mgar stong btsan gyi bu 'bring ba yin pa dang rgyal po srong btsan sgam po 'das rjes blon po mgar stong btsan gyis mang srong ma ma btsan la rogs ram byas nas srid dbang lo bcu lnga'i ring bskyangs te 'das/de nas lo mang song mtshams btsan po 'dus srong mang po rje sku na gzhon dus mgar khri 'bring gis blon chen byas te dus skabs der mgar gyi mi rgyud rnams rgyal po las ga pa'i dbang cha yod pa lta bur gyur rkyen btsan po dgung lo nar son mtshams ri dwags rngon pa kha g.yar nas mgar khri 'bring la dmag drangs shing/mgar khri 'bring rang nyid rang shi brgyab pa sogs kyi gnas tshul mang po 'dug pas/mgar gyi mi rgyud la khri 'bring snga rjes gnyis byung ba yin nam brtag }
mgar gyis rgyal yul phung bar byas|{(rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )sogs bod yig gi lo rgyus mang po zhig gi nang/rgya bza' 'un khren kong jo bod la thon grub rjes blon po mgar stong btsan gyis nad brdzu btab nas rgya nag gi yul du bsam can gyis gnod 'tshe mang po byas tshul 'khod 'dug pa de la zer}
mgar stong btsan yul srul|{(blon po mgar ba stong btsan )rgyal po srong btsan sgom po'i med thabs med pa'i blon chen bzhi'i nang gi gcig yin cing/'khrungs yul stong lung ram pa nas yid pa deng sang gnas der mgar gyi pho brang chags pa'i yul yin zer ba mthong rgyu yod/mgar 'di rig pa rno zhing chab srid dang dmag don la mkhas pas snga rjes su rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos mngags pa ltar bal yul du song nas bal bzang khri btsun gdan drangs pa dang/btsan po mang srong mang btsan gyis srid dbang bzung skabs lo bco lnga'i ring btsan por chab srid kyi rogs rab byas pa/gong ma thang ka'o tsung gi sar 'tshams 'dris song ba sogs snyan la ring ba'i lo rgyus ngo mtshar che ba mang po shod rgyu yod cing/bod sa gnas su ru bzhi dang stong sde drug bcu rtsa bzhir bgos nas dmag srid zung 'brel gyis srid dbang 'dzugs pa dang/sa zhig gi rgya khyon rtsis nas khral bsdu ba'i lam lugs 'dzugs pa/sa zhing 'bangs la dbang ba dang/dmag dpung la dbang ba/dmag dpon la dbang ba/blon chen la dbang ba/rgyal po la dbang ba sogs rigs lngar bgos te bka' bkod brgyud 'dzin gyi lam lugs 'dzugs pa sogs byas rjes chen po bzhag yod par brten/bod sa gnas su blon po mgar stong btsan la stag grags chen po yod/gong ma thang tha'i tsung gis kyang blon po mgar stong btsan gyis bshad pa'i skad char blo la babs po byung nas rang nyid kyi tsha mo kong jo zhig bag mar sprad kyang thabs la mkhas pas dang du ma blangs shing/gong mas slar yang blon po mgar la yang g.yi'u g.yu tha'i cang nyung g.yas ru'i sku srung dmag spyi chen po zhes pa go gnas sprad/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po 'das rjes su'ang mang srong mang btsan gyis srid dbang bzung ba'i lo bcu lnga'i ring rogs rab byas shing/tshe smad du 'a zha'i yul du snga rjes bsdoms lo drug dang gru gu'i yul du lo gcig bcas mtha' srung lon chen gyi las 'gan khur/thang ka'o tsung gi chen h+pheng khri lo gnyis pa me yos (667)lor 'a zha'i yul nas bod sa gnas su phyir log byas pa'i lam bar zing mda' zer ba'i sa char slebs skabs gnyen 'bras kyi na tsha byung nas 'das/bod kyi dmangs khrod shod rgyun du blon po mgar yang tshe mjug la rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos btson khang nang bcug thog mig bton nas bsad par bshad pa ni/blon po mgar gyi spun mched mgar btsan nyen gung ston zer ba zhig yod pa de rgyal po 'dus srong mang po rje'i blon po yin pa rjes su rgyal po la blo log pa rgyal pos shes nas shing lug (695)lo la khrims kyi chad pa bcad de srog thog btang ba'i skor tun hong nas thon pa'i bod kyi lo rgyus shog dril nang gsal ba de 'dra zhig la go nor thebs pa yin tshod las/blon po mgar stong btsan btson 'jug dang khrims gcod byas pa'i lo rgyus khungs btsan gang yang med pa/blon po mgar la bu lnga yod (mgar btsan snya ldom bu/mgar khri 'bring/mgar btsan brod/blon zi mdo yi/blon 'bal lon )pa las bu che ba btsan snyan pha 'dabs rjes lo ngo drug song ba chu sprel (672)lo nas lon chen gyis go gnas bzung zhing/bu gzhan gsum gyis dmag dpon byas/shing bya (685)lor blon mang nyen stag tshab dang ma mthun par nang dme byung ste mang nyen stag ba kyis bsad/de rjes de'i tshab tu bu gnyis pa khri 'bring gis blon chen byas/de nas lo ngo bcu bzhi song ba sa khyi (698)lor rgyal po 'dus srong mang po rje dang ma mthun par rgyal pos khri 'bring la dmag drangs te khri 'bring rang srog bcad/btsan brod dang spun mched gzhan rnams kyis rang gi 'khor g.yog khrid de thang rgyal rabs la mgo btags zhu bar song/skabs der thang gi gong ma ni btsun mo 'u tsi thi'an {(WP:1,194)}yin pas sku srung dmag btang nas bsu ba byas te/btsan brod la the'u tsin dang/go dmag dpon chen po kos de jun wang zhes pa'i cho lo dang/mang po rje la tso'u ling ta'i jang gun an gu'i gung (g.yon ru'i dmag spyi chen po )zhes pa'i cho lo sprad de thang gi blon po'i gras su bzhag }
mgar ba'i bu khra|{spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu dgu pa'i dus mjug tu rwa sgreng dgon pa'i shar ngos su yod pa'i ri phug sgang zhes par sdod mkhan mgar ba'i bu khra zhes mi stobs chen zhig byung zhing/kho ni gzugs stobs ha cang che la shed shugs 'gran zla med pa zhig yin 'dug /lus stobs che bas lto bza' shugs kyang ha cang chen po yin pas rab skabs shig rwa sgreng bla brang nas gso nyar byas te lha sa'i smon lam grol nyin gsung chos rar be ga rdo 'gyogs la rwa sgreng bla brang nas mi gcig gtodadagos par mgar ba'i bu khra gtong rtses la lto chas ga tshod bzas pa ltar ster dus nyen re rtsam pa 'bo gang (rgya ma nyer brgyad skor )dang/lug sha bzhi ling re bza' yi yod cing/sar be ga 'gran nyin kha gtad de dang 'khyud thengs gcig la kha gtad de sgal tshigs chag nas shi stabs de lo nas bzung rwa sgreng bla brang nas be ga la 'gran mkhan gtong mi dgos pa byung skad/rjes su kho pa lto ba ma rgyags stabs rkun ma ma rku thu med byung ste ri nas gnag phyugs brkus te bshad btang nas 'tsho thabs byas kyang nye 'khor grong sde nas rku gi med/kho pa lung pa'i phu mda' gang du 'gro min yul mi tshos shes kyi yod pa ni rdo chen sgong dbyings can brgya ma nyis brgya skor byas pazhig yod pa de kho pa'i kham pa'i nye 'gram gad pa'i steng bzhag na kho pa phu la yod pa dang/khang pa'i gsham ngos yi zhing 'gram du bzhag na mda' la song ba'i rtags red/mi tshos rdo der mgar ba'i bu khra'i shed rdo zhes zer/yul der rdo chen de ma gtogs med la nye 'khor du yod pa'i rdo ni nag hrug dang g.yam rdo sha stag yin/mgar ba'i bu khras g.yag pang du bkyag nas 'gro ba dang/g.yag gi mjing tshigs bcus nas gsod pa/g.yag ko lag pas phur nas mnyes pa/g.yag ko'i sgal gzhung gi ko ba breng ste skad par bcings nas dbugs sgom tshe dum bur chad 'gro ba sogs kyi shed shugs ldan stabs mi rnams skrag snang chen po byas te kho pa gsod rgyu'i gros byas shing/mtshan mo zhig kho pa dogs med du khyim nang gnyid la yul skabs yul mo tshosap+sangar nas gra sgrig byas pa bzhin khang pa gtibs nas bsad thog kho pa 'dre ngan yin pa ltar 'jigs skrag byas nas khang shul la yang bdag po rgyag mkhan byung med/(1967)lo tsam la khang shul de nas sa rul len skabs kho pa'i mgo rus don skabs mgo rus shin tu che ba de rdo gzhus nas bcag 'dug /khang shul gyang ro dang/shed rdo de da lta mthong rgyu 'dug }
mgar btsan snya ldom bu|{(mgar gnyan btsan ldem bu zhes pa'ang snang )mang srong gi blon po/blon po mgar stong btsan gyi bu che ba yin zhing/pha 'das rjes btsan pos 'di blon chen du bsko gzhag byas/'di blon chen du bsko bzhag byas pa'i lo de rang la mgar khri 'bring btsan brod sogs gzhon pa gsum gyis dmag dpon byas te rgya'i sa mtshams su dmag drangs nas ljang rigs kyi yul tshan bcu gnyis tsam bcom pa dang/de rjes bod dmag gis nub phyogs gru gu tsho chen bcu bod kyi chab 'og tu bcug /slar bod dmag dang li yul (shin cang )pa rnams nyam du bsdebs nas rgyu'i yul tshan mang po bzung bcas la brten thang gong mas kyang dmag dpon zho'i rin kon nas dang go zhi phAn zer ba gnyis dmag dpung 'bumaphrag gcig tsam khrid dang bod dmag la 'thab par btang/'on kyang kho tshos bod dmag las rgyal kha len ma thub par pham nyes 'khel zhing/mthar bod kyi blon chen mgar btsan snya ldom bu dang/thang gi dmag dpon zho'i ren kos gnyis kyis 'dus byas te dmag dpon de rgya yul du log par grags/de nas blon chen mgar btsan snya ldom bu dang/mgar khri 'bring btsan brod gnyis kyis gdong ka'i ne tsho lung zer ba'i sag nas su 'dun tshogs bsdus nas 'brog las la slar yang zhib bshes chen po zhig byas pa dang/de rjes blon chen po btsan snyam zhims kyi gu ran zer ba'i yul du zhang zhung gi khos bgyis pa ste zhang zhung yongs kyi las kar zhib bshes dang lam srog gtan 'bebs byas 'dug /shing bya rol shangs gyi sum cu bo zhes pa'i sa char blon chen po mgar btsan snya ldong bu dang/mgar gyi bu rgyud mang nyen stag tshab zer ba gnyis spun mched nang dme byung nas blon btsan snya grongs par grags}
