mgon po spun gsum|{'brom thod gnyan mgon phug tu spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i nang gnyan lo tsA bas bzhengs par mdzad pa'i mgon po brang gzugs kyi sku brnyan de dang/bde chen grong tshor rab byung bdun pa'i lcags glang (1421)lor mkhas grub dge legs dpal bzang gis bzhengs par mdzad pa'i mgon po phyag drug pa/chos lung grong tsho'i phu zab lung du spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu gnyis pa'i nang gung thang bla ma zhang gis bzhengs gnang ba'i mgon po phyag bzhi bcas kyi sku gsum po de nyid gcig la mjal thub na tsa ri skor ba dang mtshungs zhes shod srong yod pa ltar lha sa sogs nas yong ba'i gnas skor ba tshos 'brom thod du zhag snod byas te sang nyin zhogs pa snga po nas 'brom thon mgon po mjal te ko grub bskyod nas bde chen mgon po mjal ba dang/nyi nus gong chos lung phur zab long mgon po mjal de de nub de gar sdod kyi yod 'dug /rig gnas skabs lha khang gsum po'i phya nang gtor skyon tshabs chen byung yang (1986)lo'i yas mang nas khang dang sku nyams gso gsar bzhengs kyis deng sang gnas mjal zhu mkhan mang po yod}
