mgon po byams pa'i bstan pa|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la/rang cag gnas pa'i 'jig rten gyi khams 'di chags nas ma stongs kyi bar la sangs rgyas stong phrag gcig dang lnga byon rgya yod pa'i nang nas da lta phan byon zin pa'i sangs rgyas bzhi ste/mi rnams kyi tshe lo bzhi khri bskal pa rdzogs ldan gyi dus su sangs rgyas 'khor ba 'jig byon/de nas mi rnams kyi tshe lo nyis khri bskal ba gnyis ldan gyi dus su sangs rgyas 'od srung byon/de nas mi rnams kyi tshe lo brgyad pa bskal pa rtsod ldan gyi dus su sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa byon/sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa'i bstan pa lo lnga stong ring gnas pa dang/de nas bstan pa nub ste sangs rgyas byams pa ma byon bar du lo dung phyur mang po yod par gsungs/sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa'i bstan pa nub nas sangs rgyas byams pa 'dzam bu'i gling du ma byon bar du log grangs ji tsam yod pa'i skor la bu ston rin po che dang/'gos lo gzhon nu dpal gyis gsungs pa ltar na/sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa mya ngan las 'das nas sangs rgyas byams pa ma byon bar du mi lo bye ba phrag lnga bcu nga bdun dang sa ya phrag drug yod pas/deng sang gi dur phyur rtsi gzhir byas pa'i grangs dung phyung lnga dang/bye ba bdun/sa ya drug yod/sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa'i bstan pa la sdom pa thob pa dang/dad pa ldan pa/byang chos lnga la thos bsam slob gnyer byas pa rnams sangs rgyas byams pa'i zhal mjal te de'i bstan pa la thar pa thob nges yin par sangs rgyas shAkya mu des gsungs pa'i (byams pa lung bstan pa'i mdo )las gsal stabs/bod du yod pa'i dgon sde tshang ma'i nang du sangs rgyas byams pa'i sku brnyan che chung sna tshogs ma bzhengs pa med cing lhag par dgos pa 'ga' zhig la byams pa'i smon lam gyi dus mchod kyang ched gnyer gyis btsugs pa dang/lha sa smon lam skabs bar skor du rgyal ba byams pa'i sku shing rta 'khor lo'i steng du gdan drangs pa bcas byas pa'i dgos pa dang rgyu mtshan de ltar yin}
