'gos lo tsA ba chos 'grub|{bod rgyal khri rab pa can gyi sku dus su byon pa'i bod rigs lo tsA ba chen po zhig yin zhing/lo tsA ba 'di nyid kyis (mdo dkon mchog brtsegs pa las 'phags pa go cha'i bkod pa bstan pa )zhes pa dang/(lang kar gshegs pa rin po che'i mdo las sangs rgyas thams cad kyi gzhung gi snying po )zhes pa/('dzangs blun zhes bya ba'i mdo/) ('phags pa legs nyes kyi rgyu 'bras bstan pa )zhes bya ba'i mdo sogs mdo khag mang po rgya yig nas bod yig tu bsgyur cing/bod yig gi mdo sde khag mang rgya yig tu bsgyur ba ma zad/rgya bod kyi sa mtshams su phebs nas lo nyi shu lhag tsam ring la dam chos 'chad rtsom gyi 'phrin las rgya cher spel gnang mdzad}
'gos lo gzhon du dpal|{bod kyi rab byung bdun pa'i chu sprel (1392)lo nas rab byung brgyud pa'i lcags glang (1481)lo bar dgung lo dgu bcu go gcig bzhugs/sku tshe'i smad du kun bzang rtse'i ri khrod dub zhugs pas ye bzang rtse pa yang zhu/khong ni lho kha 'phyongs rgyas khul rgyan sman lha khang gi mda' 'am pa ra'i grong nag me dgu zer ba'i khyim du yab 'gos ston 'byung gnas rdo rje dang yum sri thang skyid gnyis la sras lnga (che bas khyim bzung yang ring min 'das shing de'i 'og ma yang chung dus nas 'das/gsum pa 'gos lo rang nyid/bzhi pa nam mkha' dpal 'byor/lnga pa mgon po rdo rje )dang sras mo gsum/(rdo rje skyid/bu 'dren/rin chen skyid )yod pa'i nang gi sras gsum pa yin/dgung lo dgu pa la rab tu byung/de nas slob dpon shes rab dar rgyas dang/bcas bzang pa/thang sag pa ye shes rgya mtshan/skyor mo lung don grub/karma pa de bzhin gshegs pa/rje tsong kha pa/shangs pa kun mkhyen/snam thang lo tsA ba sang+ga shri/rtag nag chos rje sgrol ma ba sogs dge ba'i bshes gnyen dang mkhas pa mang du brten nas chos lugs grub mtha' khag dang/rig gnas lnga la mkhas pa'i paN+Di ta chen por gyur te (dus 'khor 'grel pa )dang/(deb ther sngon po )sogs gsung rtsom dpon bcu lhag tsam byon kyang dpe rgyun ha cang dkon/khong gis chos lugs grub mtha' ris med kyi bla ma mang po bsten nas rang rang so so'i lugs kyi chos skor mang po gsan bzhes gnang bar brten/rnying ma dang/bka' brgyud/dge lugs bcas kyi chos 'byung lo rgyus tshang ma'i nang rang rang gi chos lugs 'dzin pa'i gras su rtsis nas rnam thar rgyas bsdus sna tshogs bkod yod/khong gi rnam thar yang/nyid kyi dngos slob skyes mchog pas mdzad pa kha byang du (rje btsun thams cad mkhyen pa gzhon nu'i zhabs kyi rnam thar par pa (zhes 'khod pa bris ma la shog grangs 73 yod/chag lo rin chen chos rgyal gyis mdzad pa'i (dus 'khor chos 'byung dpag bsam snye ma )bris ma zhig yod pa de'i nang du yang rnam thar ro rgyus rgyas tsam 'dug }
'gyur ba brgyad|{1 dga' ba'i 'gyur ba/2 rgod bro ba'i 'gyur/3 'bral dgos pa'i mya ngan gyi 'gyur ba/4 khro bo'i 'gyur ba/5 sems kyi gzengs mtho'i 'gyur ba/6 skrag pa'i 'gyur ba/7 skyug bro ba'i 'gyur ba/8 ngo mtshar ba'i 'gyur ba}
