'gyur med rtag pa dam pa'i gnas|{nam yang 'gyur ba med pa sra zhing brtan pa'i gnas ste/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/rgya gar rdo rje gdan ni sangs rgyas rnams mchog gi sprul skur sangs rgyas tshul bstan pa'i gnas yin pas bskal pa 'jigs pa'i skabs kyang me chu rlung gsum gang gis kyang 'jig mi nus par zom stong pa nam mkhar bteg pa ltar gnas zhes zer}
'gyur med rnam rgyal|{pho lha ba bsod nams stobs rgyal gyi bu gnyis pa yin zhing/'dis yab gshegs rjes rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me yol (1747)lor pha'i go sa shul 'dzin byas nas bod kyi lan don pha dus ltar bskyangs/gong mas tho run jun wang gi cho lo dang tham ga gnang/sa 'brug (1748)lor srid skyong dA la'i bA thur 'gyur med rnam rgyal gtsang khul du gzigs skor phebs pa dang sbrags kun gzigs paN chen ring po che'i yang srid dpal ldan ye shes la mjal phyag thog 'bul ba rgya che dang/lhag par mdzad brgya rtogs brjod dpag bsam khri shing gi thang par grangs su cu so gcig dang/tsong kha brgyad cu'i thang par bco lnga/gnas bcu'i thang par bdun/rgyal dbang kan chen 'khrungs rabs bcas sman lugs bris tshugs ldan pa'i thang sku'i shing par ngo mtshar can rnams 'bul ba mdzad/sa sbrul ( 1749)lor rang gi gcen po mnga' ris spyi khyab gung 'gyur med tshe brten dmar 'khon 'khrug yo langs che tsang byung ste 'gyur med tshe brtan rkyen lam tu btang/lcags rta (1750)lor srid skyong dA la'i bA thur 'gyur med rnam rgyal nas slar yang gong ma dang bod sdod tA zhin gnyis la lha sar bca' sdod rgyu'i dpon dmag nyung phyir 'then rung/lha sdod an ban dang 'brel ba je sdug song ba ma zad/ching gong ma'i dpon dmag bod du 'jog rgyur ma 'dod pas/le de'i hor zla bcu pa'i tshes bcu gsum nyin tA zhing phu chen dang lan tun gnyis nas tshang 'gyur med rnam rgyal khrom gzigs khang du gdan zhus thog ngo g.yog gsum bkrongs/'gyur me rnam rgyal gyi mgon gnyer blo bzang bkra shis dang ya sor gnyis sogs nas bod dmag bskul te tA zhin gnyis kyi srog la rgol ba dang/rgya'i zhi drag las byed brgya lhag tsam dus gcig tu khrom gzigs khang gi nye 'gram bu bkrongs pas sa cha der phyis rgya 'bum sgang zhing ming chags/skyon ma byung ba sbi cha'i chis gnyis dang/phogs dpon/am ban gnyis kyi zla bo/dmag mi/tshong pa bcas mi grangs nyis brgya bzhi bcu skor rtse pho brang du rgyal ba'i sku drung du skyabs zhur bcar/lcags rta lo mjug tu rang du mgron gnyer blo bzang bkra shis dang dpal grong shar pa srang sbug pa sogs lha ldan lcing lo can gyi sgo ra'i nang drag po'i khrims bcad pa dang/dA la'i bA thur 'gyur med rnam rgyal gyis lcags rta bar lo bzhi srid skyong ring/dge ldan tshogs chen dang/gsang phu ne'u thog gi 'du khang gser bzhengs/la mo byang chub lcog la rgya phibs sogs gsar bzhengs/dge 'dun gyi sde la sri zhu che zhing dga' ldan du stag rtse grub mchod gsar 'dzugs/btsan brjid chen pos khrims non shin tu che yang cung ma brtag pa'i skyon dang rgyun du kun spyod drag shul che tsam yang yod par snang ngo/_}
'gyur med yongs grub|{yongs grub la sgras brjod rigs kyi sgo nas gnyis su dbyer med pa'i ya gyal zhig ste/'khrul gzhi gan dbang dang 'khrul pa kun btags gnyis kas stong pa'i dgag bya bcad tsam gyi mid dgag de bzhin nyid dang chos thams cad la khyab pa zhig go /mtshan gzhi ni/gzugs dang gzugs 'dzin tshad ma rdzas gzhan gyis stong pa'i stong nyid lta bu'o/_}
'gyed|{grwa pa rnams la me rir gos/ska rags/gos chen/mar/ja/dngul dang kha btags sogs kyi dngos po bgo bshar 'gyed pa}
