'grang|{grang/'dri tshig la 'jug pa'i 'byed sdud kyi sgra gang ngam sogs dang cha 'dra ba'i gna' bo'i phrad cig }
'gram pa chags|{ma mgal chag pa}
'grigs|{'di ni bod du dar srol yod pa'i rtsed mo'i rigs kyi gras rgyun du rtsed chog pa'i rigs gcig dang rtsed mi chog pa'i rigs gcig bcas khag gnyis yod/rtsed chog pa'i gras ni/rde'u dkar nag gnyis ka grangs ka mang nyung mnyam pa'i sgo nas so so'i rde'u'i bar du rde'u gzhan dag med pa'i gral ba'i 'grigs po byung na phar phyogs kyi rde'u nas gcig zos chog pa yin/de la gsum 'grigs yin te rde'u dkar po bcug nyis dang nag po bcu gnyis dgos la/gzhi 'grigs yin na rde'u dkar po nyi shu rtsa bzhi dang nag po nyi shu rtsa bzhi/lnga 'grigs yin na rde'u dkar po sum cu dang nag po sum cu dgos shing/gang ltar yang phyogs kyi rde'u gral gang 'grig thub thub dang/gzhan phyogs kyi rde'u gang thub ci thub gyi gral 'grig po mi yong ba'i thabs byas te bkag pa zhig yin pas mthun sgril gyi rtsed mo yin zer srol/'dir rgyun du rtsed mi chog pa'i 'grigs kyi rtsed mo ni/yongs grags su rgyal po rgyal 'grigs zer ba/mi ser gyis rgyal po la mtha' bskor nas rgyal po pham par bzos thub na rgyal po dang/rgyal pos mi ser gtor nas thar na rgyal po la rgyal kha thob pa zer ba yin pas rtsed mo de na 'brel ngan par rtsis nas rtsed chog gi med pa red}
'gribs|{nyams rgud dam/nyung ngur phyin pa/(tsa)}
grul 'grim pa|{'phar 'gro tshur yongs byed pa}
'greng mgo nag yongs kyi rje|{gna' rabs bod kyi bshad srol la/rkang pa gnyis sa la btsugs te gzugs po ker ker byas nas langs te 'gro ba'i mi la 'greng ngam ker zer zhing/leb zhes pa sa zhing dang rtsa thang/sgur zhes pa rkang lag bzhi ka sa la btsugs te gzugs po sgur nas 'gro ba'i dud 'gro phyugs rigs la go dgos pa yin}
'greng ni btson|{'greng du 'gro ba'i mi rnams btson du 'jug pa}
'grel pa drug|{spyi don legs bshad las/'grel pa drug tu nges par gsungs pa ni/1 tshig 'grel/2 don 'grel/3 'byed 'grel/4 rgya cher 'grel/5 dka' 'grel/6 sgrung 'grel drug go/yang na lung gi dgongs pa bung ba rtsi tshol ba lta bu'i nga ro bka' 'grel dang/'du srin nus 'grel lta bu'i nges tshig 'bru 'grel dang/rgyus las bsdus/gdams pa las bsdus khrigs su bsdebs nas bshad na/dbye na don 'grel dang/lugs rigs kyis bdag rig bsgrubs nas gzhan rig dgag pa/seng ge'i ngar skad lta bu'i grub mtha' gsang 'grel du bshad pa'ang gsungs so/_}
'grel pa rigs gsum|{tshig don dkar gsum ste/1 tshig 'grel/gzhung gi tshig re re bzhin du go ba skye ba'i 'grel bshad byas pa dang/2 don 'grel/thog mar nang don bsdus pa'i sa bcad bstan pa/rjes su dka' gdan la dogs pa chod nges kyi gsal bshad/tha mar bshad zin pa'i don gyi snying po go bde bar 'chad pa/3 mchan 'grel/gzhung gi brjod don dkar gnad yod pa'i rigs la gsal bshad byas pa}
'grel bshad tshig gsal|{dbu ma rtsa ba shes rab kyi 'brel pa tshig gsal bya ba'i bstan bcos de yin zhing/de ni 'phags pa klu sgrub kyi dgongs pa gsal bar mdzad pa'i slob dpon dpal ldan zla ba grags pa zhu ba des mdzad cing/gtso bo chos rnams kyi gnas lugs stong pa nyid rigs pa brgya phrag gi sgo nas gtan la 'bebs pa'i gzhung zhig yin/bstan bcos 'di dang slob dpon 'dis mdzad pa'i (gsang ba 'dus pa'i rtsa rgyud kyi 'grel pa sgron gsal )gnyis la sngon gyi mkhas pa rnams kyis mkha' la nyi zla rnam gnyis/sa la gnas ba rnam gnyis zhes sa'i steng na 'gran zla med pa'i bstan bcos su bsngags so/('grel pa tshig gsal )'di ni rgya gar gyi mkhan po rtog ge pa chen po mahA su ma ti dang bod gyi lo tsA ba pa tshab nyi ma grags kyis kha che'i dpe dang mthun par bsgyur ba yin zhing/gzhung chen bka' pod lnga dbus ma'i khongs su gtogs}
'gres rkang|{rjod byed sne tshan so sos brjod bya khag mi 'dra ba rnams la dgag bya 'gog tshul rigs 'gre gcig pa'i sgo nas bstan pa'i brjod bya khag mi 'dra ba rnams dang rjod byed tshig gi sne tshan so so la'ang 'gres rkang zhes brjod pa yin}
'gres rkang bdun|{phung po/skye mched/khams/rten 'brel/zas/bden pa/byang phyogs kyi chos rnams so/_}
'gro mgon phyag na rdo rje|{'gro mgon 'phags pa'i sku'i gcung po 'di nyid rab byung bzhi pa'i sa phag (1239)lor yab zangs tsha bsod nams rgyal mtshan dang/yum ma gcig kun dga' skyid gnyis kyi gras su g.yas ru mdog gi gad lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo drug pa la chos rje sa paN gyi phyag phyir hor yul du phebs/sku gzhon nu nas chos rje khu dbon las dbang dang gdams ngag mang du gsan nas thos pas rgyud phyug par mdzad/hor rgyal po se chen gyis pe len dbang gi lung dang/gser tham/sras mo me kha bdun (mam g+ha na bzang )bya ba de'i btsun mor gnang/byang song su lo bcu brgyad tsam bzhugs/dgung lo nyer lnga pa chu phag (1263)lor gdan sa chen po sa skya chos 'khor la phebs/de nas lo bzhi tsam gyi bar du grub pa'i spod pas 'gro ba smin grol gyi don mang du mdzad/dgung lo nyer dgu pa la phebs pa rab byung lnga pa'i me yos (1267)lor sgo rung dpe khang du sku gshegs}
'gro mgon 'phags pa blo gros rgyal mtshan|{'gro mgon chos rgyal 'phags pa rab byung bzhi pa'i shing lug (1235)lo nas rab byung lnga pa'i lcags 'brug (1280)lo'i bar/zangs tsha bsod nams rgyal mtshan la lcam lnga yod pa'i nang gi ma gcig kun dga' skyid kyi sras che ba yin/yab dgung lo nga gnyis pa la 'khrungs/dgung lo chung dus nas yi ge 'bri klog sogs rig gnas lnga la dga' tshegs chen po ma dgos par mkhyen/dgung lo brgyad la phebs dus tshon bshad mdzad thub pa byung/shing 'brug (1244)lor dgung lo bcur phebs dus rang nyid kyi khu bo rje btsun sa skya paN+Di ta rgyal po go don gyis gdan drangs pa ltar phebs skabs phyag phyir byon/dgung lo bcu bdun pa lcags phag (1251)lor rje btsun sa skya paN+Di te sku gshags khar rang nyid kyi chos brgyud 'dzin pa'i bdag po bskos/dgung lo bcu dgu pa chu glang (1253)lor hu pi li si chen han gyis mchod gnas su gdan drangs pa ltar phebs/lo der rgyal pos zhus pa ltar rgyal po rang nyid kyis gtso bo byas pa'i mi ti shu rtsa lnga la gsang sngags kyi dbang thengs dang po gnang/de'i dbang yon du bod khri skor bcu gsum gnang ba dang ti shri'i go gnas dang/g.yang khri las byas pa'i tham ka /mu tig gis brgyan pa'i snam sbyar/sku chos sogs dngos 'bul mang po phul/de'i phyi rol baN+De shed skyed kyi 'ja' sa bod yig ma (bdag chen a mes zhabs kyis mdzad pa'i (sa skya'i gdung rags rim chen bang mdzod )kyi shog grangs 95nas 98bar gsal )dang/dngul bre chen lnga bcu nga drug ja sig nyis brgya/gos yug brgyad cu/dar yug stong dang brgya bcas phul/skabs der 'gro mgon 'phags pas rgyal por zhus pa bzhin grwa pa'i khang par gser yig bas mtsher mi 'bab pa dang/'o lag dang/khral mi bskul ba'i bka' yig gnang/thengs gcig rgyal pos bla ma la bod sa gnas su sa skya pa'i chos ma gtogs gzhan byed dumi 'jug pa'i bka' gtong rgyu yin zhes dris pas/bla mas rgyal pos de ltar byas na khyed rgyal po'i chab srid dang/nged sa skya ba'i chos lugs gnyis kar phan thogs med/de bas chos lugs rnams rang rang gi 'don mos ltar skyong du bcug na legs zhes zhus pas rgyal po yang dga' nas de ltar bka' phab/gal te 'gro mgon 'phags pa de chos lugs kyi phyogs zhen che ba 'i bla ma zhig yin tshe rgyal pos de ltar dris skabs bkag 'gog byed rgyu lta zhog de las ldog te thabs shes gang yod kyis rgyal po la bskul nas chos lugs gzhan dag rtsa med gtong ba'i go skabs yag po zhig thob pa red/'on kyang 'gro mgon 'phags pa skabs der dgung lo nyi shu lan lon med pa'i sku gnod nu zhig yin kyang/chos lugs thog mkhas pa'i phul dus phyin pa ma zad/chab srid thog nas gzigs rgya yangs pa'i gros 'go de 'dra 'dod pa gnang ba des yon rgyal rabs kyi chab srid dang/sa skya pa'i cho sa lugs gnyis ka'i snyan grags gong mthor song ba dang brtan por gnas thub pa byung yod/slar yang gong mas gsang sngags kyi dbang thengs gnyis pa zhus pa'i dbang yon tan bod chol kha gsum gyi srid dbang yongs rdzogs kyang phul nas bod sa gnas kyi chos srid gnyis ka'i dbang gi bdag por bskos/dbang thengs gsum pa zhus pa'i dbang yon du/chos dung dkar po rgyang grags dang rgya yi mi yur chen mo sogs phul/de rjes rab byung bzhi pa'i shing yol (1255)lor khams kyi sar char phebs nas snar thang mkhan chen grags pa seng ge gdan drangs te dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/gong mas bka' phab pa ltar ri bo tha'i hang hran gyi sa khul du yod pa'i mu stegs zin shing gi chos lugs mkhas pa rnams dang rtsod gleng gnas nas phab par mdzad/de nas rab byung bzhi pa'i shing bya (1264)lor bod du phebs khar gong mas slar yang 'gro mgos 'phags pa la bod kyi chos srid gnyis ka'i bdag po bskos pa'i 'ja' sa mu tig ma ('di'i ngo bshus cha tshang bdag chen a mes zhabs kyis mdzad pa'i (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )kyi shog grangs 95nas 95bar gsal )phul/de'i phyi lo shing glang (1265)lo sa skyar phebs/mchod rten bkra shis sgo mang la nang du rdor dbyings kyi lha tshogs bzhugs pa dang/bla ma gong ma rnams kyi sku 'bum bdun la gdugs dang chos 'khor gser zangs las grub pa/gser bris kyi bka' 'gyur pod nyis brgya lhag tsam sogs gsar bzhengs gnang/bod du lo ngo gsum bzhugs ring la kha che'i baN+Di ta chen po shrI ta thA ga ta b+ha dra dang/blo bo lo tsA ba shes rab rin chen/snar thang mkhan chen mchims nam mkha' grags sogs mkhas pa chen po nyi shu lhag tsam bsten nas rig gnas lnga dang/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi mtshan nyid rig pa/mdor dang sngags sogs la slob gnyer dang gsan bzhes gnang/de nas slar yang gos mas gdan 'dren bzhengs gnang/de nas slar yang gong mas gdan 'dres kyi bka' yig 'byor pa ltar phebs skabs las tshan bcu gsum gyi rgyas spros dang bcas te hor gyi yul du byon/hor yig gsar ma (deng sang 'gro mgon 'phags pa'i yi ge zer zhing don du bod yig dbu can la gzugs bsgyur byas pa'i 'khor yig zhig yin )gsar gtong gnang ba gong mar phul nas rjes su thag ka'i thog byed spyod byed srod yol/dgung lo so drug pa rab byung lnga pa'i lcags rta (1270)lor slar yang g.yal pos gsang sngags kyi dbang zhus pa'i yon du/mi nyag rgyal rgod rgyal po'i shes dam la bcos byas nas shel dam gling drug ma dang/gnam gyi 'og /sa yi steng na rgya gar lha'i sras po/sprul pa'i sangs rgyas/yi ge rtsom mi/rgyal khams 'jags su 'jug pa po/gnas lnga rig pa'i paN+Di ta 'phags pa ti shri zhes pa'i 'ja' sa dang go gnas/dngul bre chen stong phrag /gos dar lnga khri dgung stong sogs phul/de nas bod du phebs khar gong ma se chen han gyis dngos 'bul rgya chen po dang bcas bzhugs par zhus kyang ma gsan par phyir phebs pas rgyal pos dpon dmag khri phrag mang po'i dpung dang bcas te zla ba mang po'i lam bar du srung skyel zhus shing/rab byung lnga pa'i me byi (176)lor sa skyar phyag phebs/lo der gtsang chu mig ring mor dge 'dun khri bdun ga yongs pa la chos 'khor gnang ba de la chu mig chos 'khor zer/de nas lo ngo lnga'i bar sa skya'i gdan sa gnang nas dgung lo zhi drug pa la lha khang bla brang du sku gshegs/(lo rgyus 'ga' tu nye gnas zhig gis shor dmag bod du khrid yong ba de bla mas mkhyen gyi dogs nas hor dmag bod du ma 'byor gong klog tu dkrongs par bshad/) gsung rtsom gang yod phyogs gcig tu bsgrigs pa pod gsum sde dge dpar khang du dpar yod/rnam thar lo rgyus kha shar yod kyang/rgyas pa ni bdag chen a mes zhabs kyis