rgya phrug gar mkhan|{khri srong lde btsan 'khrungs nas lo gcig 'khor bar rten 'brel zhu bar yong ba'i thang gi blon chen 'ba' de'i yu bu sang shi ni chung dus nas zlos gar mkhas po yod cing/khri srong lde btsan sku na chung dus kyi rtsed grogs yod pa dang rgyal po khrid gtsug brtan ma gshegs gong thang gi rgyal sa khrang an du sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi chos dpe khag gcig le par btang zhing/'das/rgyal po khri p+sarong lde btsan sku na chung ba'i ring lo shas bar blon po ma zhang sogs kyis sangs rgyas chos lugs byed mi chog pa'i khrims bcas/btsan po rang nyid kyis dngos su srid dbang bzhes rjes sang shi yang blon por bskos shing/rgya gar du chos dpe len par thang gi rgyal sar mtshams 'dri zhu bar song bas sogs skabs 'di'i lo rgyus gong 'og rnams su gsal}
rgya 'bum sgang|{lha sa grong khyer gyi dkyil brgyud ra mo cher 'gro ba'i lam chen/shar phyogs rje btsum lha khang dang/nub phyogs lcang khyab khang gsar 'khel ba'i bar gyi gzhung lam la zer/sngar pho lha tha'i ji'u bu 'gyur med rnam rgyal bsad rjes zing 'khrug byung ste/lha sar yod pa'i rgya rags phal cher nyes pa med par bsad pa'i sdig bshags su rgya rigs shi po rnams kyi rus pa bsregs pa'i sa ts+tsha 'bum yod pa'i ts+tsha khang ring po zhig brgyab pa nas lam brgyud der rgya 'bum sgang du grangs pa yin zhes ngag rgyun la 'dug cing/deng sang ts+tsha gang gtor nas rlangs 'khor 'gro lam bzos yod}
