rgya ma khri dpon|{khu dbon gyis lugs gnyis kyi byed sgo bskyangs pa'i lha sde'i khongs su snye gnas la 'phen yul tshun dbang ba'i khri dpon gyi las ka blangs pa nas byung zhing/rgya tshal gnyis kas sa skya ba mnga' thang rgyas ring de'i shes bzung nas 'dri gung pa dang 'thab/skabs der dbus stod pa rnams kyis dgra rgya tshar bka' gsum zer ba byung/phag mo grub pas srid dbang bzung rjes rgyal chen rtse pa'i 'og tu khri skor phal cher shor nas/yar snon nam res 'ga' mkhar rtse dang sbrel ba'i steng du sne gdong rtse nas khri dpon gyi las ka rim pas zhus par snang la phyis dpon legs ldan pa'i dus su phag mo grub pa'i sde srid dang bzlos shing/mnga' khongs kyi dge lugs pa rnams kyi chos gzhis phrogs pa dang/cong kha pa'i 'dra sku bshig pa/dge lugs pa rnams chos lugs bsgyur ba sogs chos lugs kyi gas zhen che ba'i dbang gis dus mi bde ba mang du byung ngo (deb ther dmar po gsar ma )shog grangs 60bar gsal}
rgya dmag bod du 'ong|{'di la mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (deb ther dkar po )yi nang rgya dmag lha sar slebs pa'i lo rgyus rgya yig nang 'khod pa med ces gsungs/(rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )nang rgyal po srong btsan sgom po 'das rjes rgyi dmag bod du byung ste/pho ta la me la bsregs/jo bo mi bskyod rdo rje snga dro gcig gi bar khyer zhes rgya yig gi der ther zhig gi nang 'khod pa rtsom pa po rang nyid kyis dngos su gzigs par gsungs pas rjes su zhib dpyad yod pa zhu}
rgya dmar ba byang chub grags|{'di nyid gangs pa she'u blo gros byang chub dang khyung rin chen grags gnyis kyi slob ma yin zhing/'khon phu ba'i sras zla ba'i 'od zer la yang man ngag mang po zhus/khong dang ar gnyis kyis lho pa dkon mchog dpal la sems sbyong gi man ngag dpyis phyin par zhus/rgya dmar ba ni bshad pa ra ma zad man ngag dang yang ldan/khong gis myang ro la sogs par bshad pa mdzad/cha pa chos seng la dbu tshad dang/stong lung se thang du karma dus gsum mkhyen par byams chos dang dbu tshad gsungs/phag gru rdo rgyal la yang chos gsungs/tshad ma rnam par nges pa dang dbu ma bden gnyis la sogs pa'i TIka dang/bsdus pa'ang mang du mdzad/'di nyid la slob ma mkhas pa chen po cog ro chos kyi rgyal mtshan dang/dpal phag mo grub pa/'bal tshad ma ba/skyil mkhar lha khang ba/dus gsum mkhyen pa sogs mkhas pa mang du byung}
rgya brtson 'grus seng ge|{khong gi mes po'i rgyud ni srong btsan sgam po'i sku dus su jo bo spyan 'dren mkhan gyad mi lha dga' dang/khri srong skabs kyi rgya sang shi dang p+sab gsal snang bcas yin par grags/rgya brtson 'grus seng ge rgya gar la chos slob par bzhugs skabs nag lo lo tsA ba tshul khrims rgyal ba rgya gar du slob gnyer la phebs pas rgya brtson 'grus seng ges mgo gnyer mdzad de jo bo la sogs pa'i paN+Di ta'i sa gnas chos mang du gsan/nag tsho slar gung thang du phebs pa na btsun pas jo bo spyan 'dren pa mngags/rgya brtson 'grus seng ges nag tsho jo bo'i spyan sngar khrid de jo bor bod kyi rgyal pos jo bo spyan 'dren pa la sku las ji tsam skyon pa dang ngo bo bod du phebs tshe sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa la phan thogs chen po yod tshul sogs thengs mang du zhus pas jo bo bod du phebs phebs rgyu'i zhal bzhes/rab byung dang po'i sa yos sam lcags 'brug (039'am 1040)lor jo bo gdan drangs nas bal yul du phebs skabs rgya brtson 'grus seng ge sku gshegs/'di nyid kyi 'gyur la/bka' 'gyur las (lag na rdo rje gos sngon po can gyi cho ga dang bcas pa'i gzungs )bstan 'gyur las (dpal mgon lo sdom pa'i bstod pa don thams cad grub pa sna gdam gtsug gi nor bu )zhes bya ba mchog gi dngos grub brnyen pa slob dpon dA ri ka bas mdzad pa/(dpal rdo rje rnal 'byor ma'i sgrub thabs )zhes bya ba rnams rje dI paM kA ra shrI dz+nyA nas mdzad pa/(lha mo sgrol ma nyi shu rtsa gcig la bstod pa rnam dag gtsug gi nor bu )zhes bya ba sogs mang mo/_}
