rgyang grags|{mi yi nang nas skad shugs che shos shig gi skad btang na go thub pa'i tshod kyi thag ring thung gi tshad de la zer zhing/rgya gar gyi skad nas bod skad du bsgyur ba'i (mngon pa mdzod )las bshad pa'i sa ngos gyi rgyang thang ring thung 'jal byed kyi tshad gzhi rim pa bco brgyad yod pa'i nang gi gras shig yin/de yang rim pa mtho shos kyi ming la dpag tshad zer zhing/de la rgyang grangs brgyad yod/rgyang grags gcig la mi'i tshad ldan gyi 'dom lnga brgya tham pa'am gzhu lnga brgya tham pa yod cing/rgya gar skad du kro sha zer/'dom gang la spyi khri gnyis/'dom lnga brgya ni spyi khre chig stong ste spyi le gcig (hri le gnyis )gi ring thung dang mnyam/'on kyang (bod rgya tshig mdzod chen mo )stod cha grangs 542las/rgyang grangs zhes pa'i go don 'grel bshad rgya yig thog bris pa de'i nang de ni hri khri nyes brgya lnga bcu'i tshad dang mnyam zhes gsal ba de nor 'khrul yin te/de ltar na hri khre gcig la 'dom gnyis yod dgos pa dang/hri khre gsum ni spyi khre gcig yin pas/'dom grub dang spyi khri gang tshad mnyam dgos shing/spyi khre gang la 'dom drug lta ci 'dom gang yang longs med pas mngon sum gyis grub pas/gong gsal (bod rgya tshig mdzod chen mor )gsal ba'i 'grel bshad de 'dir legs bcos bya dgos byung lags/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi 'dul ba'i gzhung las/gzhung 'dom lnga la srog shing/srog shing nyi shu la ngal gso/ngal gso brgyad cu la g+r+yang grangs zhes bshad pa ltar na rgyang grags gcig la gzhung mdo brgyad stong p+sate/'dul ba'i lugs kyi gzhung 'dom bcu drug la mngon pa'i gzhu 'dom gang yin pa dang 'dul ba'i lugs kyi gzhung 'dom gang yin pa dang 'dul ba'i lugs kyi gzhu 'dom bzhi la mngon pa'i lugs kyi 'dom bzhi la mongan pa'i lugs kyi 'dom gang ste/dus 'khor lugs kyi 'dom gang dang/mngon pa'i lugs kyi khru gang tshad mnyam par 'byung ba lta bu yin}
rgyang 'phen pa|{rgya gar du sangs rgyas chos lugs ma byung gong gi mu stegs pa'i grub mtha' smra ba mang du yod pa'i nang nas grags che ba'i gras rgyang 'phen pa'i rigs pa'i gzhung lugs te/'di'i lta tshul ni tsher ma rno ba dang/sran ma zlum pa dang/rma bya'i sgro mdongs kyi kha dog rnam par bkra ba rnams rang bzhin gyis byung ba las rgyu dang rkyen gang yang med par rang bzhin gyis byung ba yin par dang/sems ni lus kyi bdag nyid yin pa dang/lus kyi 'bras bu yin pa/lus kyi khyad chos yin pa/lus glo bur ba las sems glo bur ba grub pa bcas yin zhing/lus 'jig pa na sems yang mar me shi ba ltar med par 'gyur bas/skye ba snga ma nas 'dir 'ongs pa dang/skye ba mang por goms 'dris byed pa med pas thams cad mkhyen pa med cing/sdug bsngal ni rgyu med rkyen med du byung ba yin pas sdug bsngal las thar pa'i lam dang thar pa yang med/tshad ma mngon sum tshad ma gcig pu ma gtogs tshad ma gzhan dag med/'bras bu rnams rgyu'i dus su mngon par mi gsal ba'i tshul du yod pas rgyu 'bras gnyis rang bzhin gcig kyang rnam 'gyur tha dad pa tsam yin pa dang/shes bya la nyi shu rtsa lnga khas len pa sogs kyi lta tshul zhib par slob dpon legs ldan 'byed kyis mdzad pa'i (dbu ma rtog ge 'bar ba )dang/slob dpon zla ba grags pas mdzad pa'i (dbu ma 'jug pa )rtsa 'grel/slob dpon chos kyi grags pas mdzad pa'i (tshad ma rnam 'grel )sogs tshad ma'i gzhung dang/'jam bzhag ngag dbang brtson 'grus kyis mdzad pa'i (grub mtha' che mo ) lcang skya rol pa'i rdo rjes mdzad pa'i (grub mtha'i rnam shad )bcas su gsal}
rkyang bu'i lha khang|{myang chos 'byung du/lha khang 'di sngar bstan pa snga dar gyi dus su srong btsan sgom po btab pa'i lha khang yin pa/rgyal rtse khul rgyang ro dang thag mi ring ba'i sa na yod cing/rjes su bstan pa dar gyi 'khor lo chen rin chen bzang po'i slob ma dge bshes rgyang bu chos blo zhu ba rgyang ro'i spel dmar du 'khrungs pa des gtsug lag khang 'dir rnal 'byor rgyud dang/gsang 'dus ye shes zhabs lugs kyi bshad sgra 'dzugs par mdzad tshul gsal}
rgyang bu'i lha khang|{myang chos 'byung du/lha khang 'di sngar bstan pa snga dar gyi dus su srong btsan sgom po btab pa'i lha khang yin pa/rgyal rtse khul rgyang ro dang thag mi ring ba'i sa na yod cing/rjes su bstan pa dar gyi 'khor lo chen rin chen bzang po'i slob ma dge bshes rgyang bu chos blo zhu ba rgyang ro'i spel dmar du 'khrungs pa des gtsug lag khang 'dir rnal 'byor rgyud dang/gsang 'dus ye shes zhabs lugs kyi bshad sgra 'dzugs par mdzad tshul gsal}
