rgyan drug|{gsang sngags nang pa la/'khor lo rna cha mgul rgyan gdu bu dang/_/mchod phyir thogs dang thal chen gyi tshom bu/_/rim bzhin brtson 'grus bzod pa tshul khrims dang/_/sbyin pa bsam gtan shes rab dag tu gsungs/_/zhes so/_/rim bzhin brtson 'grub bzod pa tshul khrims dang/_/sbyin pa bsam gtan shes rab dag tu gsungs/_/zhes so/_/sngags phyi pa ltar na/dbu rgyan/snyan rgyan/mgul rgyan/phyag gdub/zhabs gdub/ska rags/do shal/se mo do brgyad do/_/gzhan yang rgyun drug mchog gnyis zhes pa klu sgrub dang/A r+ya de ba/thogs med/dbyig gnyen/phyogs glang/chos grags bcas rgyan drug dang/yon tan 'od dang shAkya 'od rnam gnyis la mchog gnyis zer}
