rgya'i hur zhes bya ba'i gtsug lag|{rgya yul ston pa khung tsi sogs kyi tshad ldan gyi gzhung zhig tu rtsis pa'i gzhung lnga'i nang gses (hru'u gzhung )zhes pa zhig yod pa de yin nam yang na de min pa'i dge ba cu'i nang don 'khod pa'i dpe deb gzhan dag cig yod med brtag }
rgya'i hwa shang|{rgya rigs kyi nang nas sangs rgyas chos lugs la dad pa skyes nas rab tu byung ba'i rigs la hwa shang zhes 'bod pa ste/bod skad du btsun pa'am grwa bzhi don yin zhing/spyi lo'i dus rabs dang po'i dus dkyil nas ching rgyal rabs kyi gong ma chen lung gi bar mkhas shing grub pa brnyes pa'i hwa shang grags can ha cang mang po byung ba'i skor sog po lo chen mgon po skyabs kyis brtsams pa'i (rgya nag chos 'byung )nang du gsal}
rgyal khab chen po gong ri dkar po|{de sngon sde srid phag mo grub pas bod kyi srid dbang bzung skabs sde srid 'ga' zhig skabs re pho brang de'i nang du sdod pa dang rjes su sde rid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho dang rgyal po lha bzang gnyis mi mthun pa'i 'gal ba cher song ste lha bzang gis sde srid la dmag drangs shing/sde srid dmag pham rjes sa skyid chu'i thog gzhung ko btang nas gong dkar du bra sa pa'i lo rgyus yod (deng sang bod rang skyong ljongs gong dkar rdzong )cing/sde srid phag mo gru pa'i skabs pho brang byas myos bas pho brang la rgyal khab kyi ming btags pa yin}
rgyal khams dper blangs kyi khrims|{yul lung spyi'i goms srol bzang po la dper blangs pa'i khrims ste/skabs de'i bod kyi spyi tshogs de shes rig ldan pa'i ra rgyas kyi dus skabs su slebs pa'i mtshon rtags su ya rabs kyi goms srol chags zin pa rnams khrims lugs thog gtan khel byas pa zhig yin/de la nang gses kyis phye na rgyal khrims bco lnga yod/1 phyi yi dgra bo 'gog cing rang gi ya khams bde bar skyong ba/2 khyim gyi dpal 'byor gong 'phel dang 'bangs dang 'khor g.yog nyer ring med par skyong ba/3 tshe phyi ma la phan pa'i ched du dam pa'i lha chos bya ba ('di gsum la mdzad pa gsum zer/) 4 gsang sngags kyi chos nor gyi ched du mi btsong zhing snying gi dkyil du bcang ba/5 chos la dad pa med pa'i mi la chos kyi nang don mi bshad pa/6 mi ngan rnams la dbang dang go sa mi sprod pa ('di gsum la mi mdzad pa gsum zer/) 7 dpal bo byas rjes can la stag stod dang stag gdan gyi bstod pa/8 mkhas mdzangs can gyi mi la yig tshangs kyis byang chub sprad nas bstod pa/9 bya ba bzang po sgrub mkhan la bya dga' gsol ras kyis bstod pa ('di gsung la bstod pa gsum zer/) 10 dmag sa nas bros pa'i sdar ma la wa yi mjug ma'i zhwa bskon nas smad pa/11 mi ngan g.yo rgyu can la chad pa bcad nas smad pa/12 nyes can gyi mi la khrims dang chad pa bcas nas smad pa ('di gsum la smad pa gsum zer/) 13 rang nyid kyi lus skyed pa'i pha ma la mnar gcod mi gtong ba/14 rang nyid kyi sha nas chad pa'i bu la mnar gcod mi gtong ba ('di gsum la mi mnar ba gsum zer/) de tsho re re bzhin gyi dgos pa dang rgyu mtshan bcas (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang du gsal}
rgyal khrims kyi che 'degs|{rgyal po'i khrims lugs kyi che ba gong du mthon por 'debs pa'i khrims 'debs zer ba ni khrims gtugs mkhan do bdag phan tshun gnyis pos khrims bdag la phul ba'i dngos po}
rgyal khrims bco lnga|{rgyal khams dper blangs kyi khrims bco lnga zer ba de yin pas gong du song ma thag pa der gzigs}
rgyal khrims 'chal ba|{khrims lugs med pa'i bya spyod rang snang gang dran}
rgyal mkhan po grags pa rgyal mtshan|{mdo smad lho rgyud 'bo ra'i rgya sgar thang zhes par yab yum skyabs dang yum lha mo mtsho gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu rta (1762)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun pa nas bzung mang nge dge slong tshul khrims rgya mtsho las yig klog dag 'don chos bslabs/dgung lo bcu gcig par se ra dpon slob blo bzang chos 'phel las rab tu byung/mtshan blo bzang don grub ces gsol/chu sbrul lor bkra shis 'khyil gyi chos grwar dpon slob ngag dbang 'phrin las pa las brtsi bzhag gsan/phun tshogs lha bris pa'i dbon po blo bzang dpal ldan dge rgan du bsten/grub mtha' rin chen phreng ba sogs thugs 'dzin dang tshogs zhugs phul/lo der sgo mang bla ma sangs rgyas rje'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin mdzad de khrir bkod/de nas lha zhes dka' bcu ba dang kha gya dar rgyas rnam gnyis slob dpon du bsten nas gzhung pod lnga sogs la go rim bzhin du gsan sbyong mdzad/dgung lo nyer gcig par skyabs mgon mchog gi drung nas bsnyen par rdzogs/mtshan grags pa rgyal mtshan du gsol/rigs grwa blo bzang 'jigs med dang ku shrI skal bzang rnam gnyis las snyan ngag sogs rig gnas sbyangs/bsod grags dpon slob dang khri chen blo bzang snyan grags sogs las chos mang du gsan/chu yos (1782)lor dbus su phebs/rgyal dbang 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i gser zhal mjal/'bras sgo mang chos grwar zhugs/hor skal bzang dngos grub dang gung thang 'jam dpal dbyangs gnyis dge rgan du bsten/nyer lnga pa me rta (1786)lor sde pa gzhung nas chos 'khor rgyal gyi mkhan por bskos/skabs der bka' pod lnga'i slob gnyer mthar phyin mdzad/sa smon lam chen mor dam bca' ang dang po byung/dge bshes lha rabs pa'i mtshan rtags thob/lcags khyi (1790)lor mdo smad bkra shis 'khyil du phebs/'jam dbyangs bzhad pas rje 'di bla brang mgon por bskos/'chad rtsod rtsom gsum gyis bstan 'gror phan pa'i bya ba mdzad/rten gsar mang du bzhengs/dgung lo sum cu par bkra shis 'khyil gyi chos dang 'jig rten gyi bya ba yongs kyi 'gan 'khur bzhes/dgung lo bzhi bcu par bla brang tshogs chen gyi gdan khrir phebs/lo gsum gyi ring gtong sgo phal cher bla brang chen po nas khur blangs pas sngar srol gong 'phel du bskyangs/dgung lo zhe gsum par khri 'dzin gdongs pa zhus te 'jam bzhad yang srid tshogs dbus su gdan drangs/shing bya lo nas bzung dben gnas bkra shis dge 'phel du sku mtshams lo lnga drug tsam bzhugs te sku mjug tu sgrub pa nyams len kho nar 'bad de dus 'da' bar mdzad/dbal shul gyi sa'i rma 'gram gser lung du sgrub sde btsugs/gsung rtsom (mnyam med shAkya'i rgyal po dang 'dzam gling mdzes byed rgyan drug mchog gnyis kyi rtogs brjod lha'i dpag bsam ljon shing/) (mdo sde rgyan gyi mchan 'grel/) (byang chub sems dpa'i spyod pa la 'jug pa'i TIk+ka rin po che'i phreng ba/) (bstod tshogs dngos grub 'gugs pa'i lcags kyu/) (dge ba rdzogs byang du bsngo ba'i smon tshig) (dran pa shes rab bkra shis kyi rnam thar du mu thi li'i phreng ba/) (spyod 'jug) (lam gtso/) ('dul ba rgya mtsho'i snying po/) (rgyal sras lag len/) (gung thang rin po che'i lta mgur sogs kyi TIk+ka/) ('jigs byed bskyed rim )sogs po ti drug tsam mdzad/gsung gi bdud rtsis bskyangs pa'i bu slob khri ched ngag dbang chos 'phel/rdo khri rin po che 'jam dbyangs thub bstan nyi ma/lcang lung paN+Di ta ngag dbang blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan/theg chen smyung gnas pa/cha har bka' 'gyur ba sogs mkhas grum dang pa mang du byung/dgung lo don drug la phebs pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me bya (1837)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs}
rgyal mkhar rtse|{mkhar rdzong 'di ni gzhis rtse sa khul rgyal rtse rdzong khongs su chags yod/de ni bod rab byung drug pa'i shing 'brug (1364)lor nang ched 'phags pa dpal bzang gis rdzong btsan mang po brtsigs pa'i nang gi gcig yin/'dir rgyal rtse chos rgyal rim byon rnams bzhugs myong ba dang/pho lha mi dbang gis nga lung sbyar gsum la phar rgol byade skabs kyi rten gzhi byas pa/de bzhin shing 'brug (1904)lor lo rgyus kyi don rnying ldan pa'i dbyin ji btsan 'dzul dmag la 'gog rgol byed skabs kyi g.yul sa bcas byas pa'i rdzong btsan 'di ni dus rabs kyi dngos dbang rtsa chen zhig yin/mgar shul de dag ni rtsig zheng che la ngos 'dzam pa sra zhing brtan pa bcas la gzhigs na bod rigs mes po rnams ni las la brtson zhing mkhar las kyi lag rtsal byang chub pa yod pa ra 'phrod/lo rgyus thog bod rigs mi dmangs kyi dpa' rgod tshos mkhar rdzing 'di'i g.yul sa'i thog dbyin ji btsan 'dzum par rgol rdung tsha nan sprad pa pha yul srang skyob byed pa'i dmag 'thab nang ji srid bar nub thabs med pa'i byas rjes bzhag yod/rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa byi (1888)lor thung thu lar dbyin 'gog dmag 'khrug byung nas lo bco lnga song ba'i rjes kyi chu yos (1904)lo'i lo stod du rong khe pheng gis dbyin dmag 'bor chen khrid nas slar yang bod du btsan 'dzul byed 'go btsugs te bal ram gro mo dang/phag ri/khang dmar sogs bod khongs sa cha mang po bzas nas lo de'i zla bzhi par rgyal rtse grong brdal bzung/dbyin ji btsan 'dzul pa gar slebs sar mi bsad jag bcos gyi las man ma byas pa'i sam de/lo de'i zla lnga pa'i tshes gcig nyin tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum rgyal rtse sa khul gyi r+khal rkang la gzhigs te na gzhon go thang sum stong skong sgrig gis mtshon go cha sgrig thog zla gcig gi dmag rgyags dang rdzas mdel 'don sprod byas te bstan dgra dbyin ji'i btsan 'dzul 'gog rgol byed dgos zhes pa'i skul tham phebs don bzhin gzhis byes dmag dmangs tsho mda' dpon bkras gling pa dang rngon mo lung gnyis kyi sne khrid 'og dus yun zla gcig kyang ma 'gor bar rgyal rtse dgra lag nas tshur blangs pa dang/phyogs mtshungs rang phyogs kyi 'don dmag dang yul dmag khag gcig gis dbyin dmag dpung sgar la 'thab grol byas nas btsun 'dzul pa rnams thal ba'i rdul du brlags te rong khe pheng yang gson bzung thub la khad byung/lo de'i zla drug pa'i nang rong khe pheng dpung snon skyabs zhur gro mo'i sa mtshams bar ngo bskyod kyis zla bdun pa'i nang dbyin ji btsan 'dzul pa'i rgyab snod dpung rgyal rtser 'byor nas slar yang dza drag chen po ba'i g.yul 'gyed byed 'go tshugs/bod kyi dmag dmangs rnams kyis dmag mkho'i dngos zog dbon 'dren byed dga' ba dang/dgra dang rang phyogs dmar go mtshon bzang zhan gyi te bag shin tu che ba sogs kyi gnas bab ha cang sdug po'i 'og gnya' ma zhus par sngar mus bzhin dpar ngas chen po dgra bos srog dang bsdos pa'i 'gog rgol drag po byas te dgra dmag rnams rgyal rtser rang du bkag nas lha sa'i phyogs su gom pa gang yang btang med/nyin zhig dbyin dmag gis drag shugs yod rgu spyad nas rdzong rtser me sgyogs ser drag babs pa ltar 'phangs nas 'ur mchongs byed rtsis byas kyang rgyal tshe dpal chos dgon dang/rtse chen dgon so so nas dbyin dmag la rgol rdung tsha nan sprad stabs btsan 'dzul pa rnams rdzong 'gram du bcar thabs ma rnyed/'on kyang stabs mi legs pa zhig la bod dmag cig rdzas khang du rdzas mdel len par skyod skabs gzab nan ma byung ba'i stabs kyis me yod pa'i sbi sdi rdzas mdel gyi khrod du lhung nas rdzas khang 'bar gas song bas dgra bos go skabs de dang bstun nas rdzong rtser tshur rgol drag po byas shing/kho tshos rdzong gi phyogs gsum nas bskor te shi 'thab ro 'thab kyis rdzong rtser 'dzegs/rdzongap+sarung bod dmag rnams rdzas mdel zad khar/'thung chu yang chad pa'i dkal ngan dang nyen kha shin tu che bas byang yang kho tshos rdo dang/dbyug pa/'ur rdo sogs la ban nas mu mthun 'gog rgol byas te rang dmag khag gcig dgra bo'i bskor rgya las thar te dpal chos dgon du thos/de byings bod dmag rnams rdzong steng du dgra bo dang dmar 'dzing drag po byas nas mthar mang sde nyung gis mi ba rten pa'i dus su rang lus sha khrag gi grib ma tsam yang dgra bo lag tu ma bskur bar rdzong rtse'i g.yas sa nas mchongs te pha yul srung skyob byed pa'i ched du yi lus rin chen lags skyes su bshams so/_/shod rgyun ltar na sngar gyi rdzong btsan de ni star pa re la mkhar bcu skor yod pa dang/mkhar gyi mtho tshad la thog brtsegs gsum tsam yod skad kyang/de dag tshang ma dmag 'khrug nang btsan 'dzul pas gtor brlags btang bas da yod kyi mkhar shul rgyang ro'i thog nas dbyin tsi btsan 'dzul pa'i ldig nyes ra sprod thub rgyu yod la/pho brang rgyal mkhar rtse'i sa sa rdog gcig dang/rdo rdo rdog re'i thog nas bod rigs dmag dmangs tsho'i zhum pa med pa'i dpal stobs dang/btsan rgol rgyal gces kyi bla na med pa'i snying stobs bcas mtshon rgyu yod/da cha pho brang rgyal mkhar rtse 'di'i bzhin dpal nyams gso legs par zin nas mi rigs khag gi mi dmangs rnams la rgyal gces ring lugs kyi slob gso gtong ba'i gnas su 'dzin pa ma zad/rgyal khab phyi nang gi gnas skor ba rnams yul skor spro 'cham byed yul gyi gnas chen zhig kyang yin}
