rgyal sde skar chung rdo rje dbyings kyi lha khang|{rgyal sde skar chung rdo rje dbyings kyi lha khang bsdus ming la skar chung lha khang zhes yongs su grags pa'i lha khang 'di'i gas yul ni grong khyer lha sa'i skyid chu'i lho nub ngos su ra ma sgang zhes pa der gnas/de nas bod pur rgyal dus skabs kyi bod rje mu tig btsan po'am khri lde srong btsan sad na legs mching yon gyis spyi lo 800yas mas su btab pa rgyal rabs chos 'byung phal cher rtse mthun/skar chung lha khang zhes 'bod don ni/de'ang bod kyi lo rgyus chos 'byung gi deb ther spyi las khri lde srong btsan gyis snga mo yab mes rim pas lha khang mang du bzhengs 'dug /bod kyi rgyal po la nga che bas/da ni 'dzam gling du che tsha da thub pa'i la khang nyi ma tsam zhig brtsigs dgos gsungs par mdzod kyi nang du nyi mar dmag tshad lnga bcu nga gcig yod par bshad pas bod 'dir mi shong zhes zhus/zla ba tsam zhig brtsigs dgos gsungs par/de yang nyi ma dang 'dar tshul zhus/skar ma tsam zhig brtsigs dgos gsungs par/skar ma la'ang rgyang grangs bco brgyad yod par bshad pas/byang 'brog gi thang yangs sa zhig tu brtsigs dgos zhes bka' gnang bar/blon 'bangs byin po blor ma 'khyud de/blon 'bangs kun gyis byang du brtsigs na lha khang stong par lus 'gro tshul zhus te/rje 'bangs kun gros mthun te skar ma chung ba zhig la rgyang grags gcig (rgyang grags gcig la 'dom lnga brgya rtsis srol )yod pa'i bshad tshur ltar rgyal sde skar chung rdo rje dbyings kyi lha khang bzhengs pas skar chung lha khang zhes ming thogs/skar chung lha khang 'di dgos pa'i dbang gang la brten nas bzhengs pa yin nam zhe na de ni skar chung nga gi dam bca'i rtsa tshig thog bkod pa ltar/sprul pa'i sha btsan po mes chos rgyal rong btsan sgam po'i sku ring la lha ldan ra sa'i gtsug lag khang la sogs pa bzhengs shing dkon mchog gsum gyi sku gsung thugs rten bzhengs te btsugs pa dang/mes po khri 'dus srong ring gling gi khri rtse la sogs pa bzhengs/mes po khri lde gtsug btsan mes ag tshom gyi sku ring brag dmar gyi cu dang/mchims phur gtsug lag khang brtsigs/yab