dor na mi ma yin pa rgyal po dang btsan/yul lha/gzhis bdag la sogs pa de dag kyang dpang tu btsugs te/'dir bzhugs rgyal po dang/rje blon sogs mi kun gyis kyang dbu mdar bskyal ba dang dam bcas mdzad do/_/de ltar nan tan dam bcas ba'i rtsa tshig gi yi ge zhim mo ni yab khri srong lde btsan gyi ring la nan tan dam bca' ba'i rtsa tshig gi yi ge bris te bsam yas mi 'gyur lhun gyis grub pa'i gtsug lag khang chen por bzhag pa de dang zla bsgril du bzhag go zhes rdo ring gi yi ge'i nang gsal yod pas gzigs par zhu/skar chung lha khang de'i bzo dbyibs ni bsam yas gtsug lag khang dung 'dra bar phyogs bzhir mchod rten bzhi yod pa ste/tshe sgrub 'bum pa dang/nor rgyas 'bum pa/g.yul rgyal 'bum pa/sgo bzhi 'bum pa bcas yod pa de dag la yul mi sa bskor ba byed kyi yod/de min gyi sku gsum thugs rten mang dag cig yod par gsungs kyang zhib pa ma rnyed/lo ngo chig stong gi lo rgyus 'phel rim nang 'pho 'gyur byung yod kyang/skar chung ha khang de sngar bzhin gnas thub pa dang lhag don du skar chung rdo nga de lta'ang mjal rgyu yod skad}
rgyal po|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi mngon pa mdzod nas bshad srol la/gna' rabs su 'jig rten thog mi yi 'gro ba byung skabs mi rnams la dpon dang 'bangs kyi tha snyad med cing sger la dbang ba'i dpal 'byor yang med par tshang mas thun mong gi 'tsho ba spyod kyi yod/dus tshod ring po song rjes thon skyes nyams rgud du song ba'i rkyen gyis sa zhing sger bzung byed 'go tshugs te/rim bzhin rgyu nor rku ba dang/phan tshun gsod res byed pa sogs rang shugs kyis byung ste spyi tshogs bde 'jags med par brten tshang mas thun mong du bgros te kun gyis blo mos yod pa'i mi zhig dpon du bskos pa de la zhing dpon zer/de ni 'jig rten thog dpon gyi dang po yin pa dang/dmangs kyi tshab byed mkhan dang las don byed mkhan zhig yin pa las/dmigs bsal gyi dbang cha gang yang med/zhing dpon de la thun mong gi thon rdzas mgo 'grems dang/spyi pa'i bde 'jags kyi las don sgrub rgyu sogs las 'gan mang 'i dbang gis zhing dpon byed mkhan dkon po byung ste/rjes su tshang mas rang nyid kyis thon skyed byas pa'i yong 'bab kyi thog nas bcu cha drug gi 'bab sprod rgyu byas pa de rim bzhin dpyad khral gyi lam lugs su 'gyur ba byung ba de ni drug cha'i khral zer ba khral gyi dang po yin/de rjes zhing dpon de la bran g.yog mang po byung ste dpon g.yog gi khyad par dang/ring bzhin 'bangs dang/dmag dpung/sa cha bcas mang po yod pa'i rgyal po byung/rgyal po'i dang po dang mang por bkur ba'i rgyal po yin/= de la bsod nams che chung dbang gis gser dang/dngul/zangs/lcags bcas las grub pa'i 'khor lo zhig yod pa de btang nas 'khor lo des gang du slebs tshad kyi sa char tshang ma mnga' 'og tu bsdus thub pas 'khor los bsgyur ba'i rgyal po zhes kyang zer/zhib par (mngon pa mdzod )kyi le'u gsum pa dang/de'i thad kyi 'grel pa rnams la gzigs}
rgyal po kri kri'i rmi ltas bcu|{1 glang po che'i lus skar khung nas thon kyang mjug pa thogs pa rmis pa/2 glang po che phab pas spos kyi glang po che skrod pa/3 mi gtsang ba gos pa'i spre'us spre'u gzhan la mi gtsang ba skud pa/4 spre'u gcig gis spre'u'i tshogs la dbang bskur ba/5 tsan dan sbrul gyi snying po dang shing phal pa mgo snyom pa/6 phye bre gang dang mu tig bre gang brje ba/7 gtsug lag khang gi nyer 'khor na yod pa'i me tog dang 'bras bu rkun pos khyer ba/8 gtsang zhing yid du 'ong ba'i khron kas skom pa'i mi'i rjes su bsnyegs kyang mi 'thung ba/9 skye bo mang po sde rim su bcad nas rtsod pa/10 ras yug gcig gi bco brgyad kyis bgos pas thams cad la tshang ma re thob cing/rtsa ba'i ros yug ma nyams pa/de sangs rgyas 'od srung la zhus pas/rgyal ba la skyon med/ma 'ongs pa na shAkya thub pa'i nyan thos rnams kyi spyod tshul ngan pa sna tshogs 'byung ba'i ltas yin zhes lung bstan/de yang rmi ltang dang po ni shAkya thub pa'i bstan pa la khyim nas khyim med par rab tu byung yang gtsug lag khang la khyim gyi 'du shes spong mi thub pa'i sngar ltas/gnyis pa ni tshul khrims 'chal bas dge slong gnas nas skrod pa'i snga ltas/gsum pa ni tshul khrims 'chal bas tshul khrims dang ldan pa nyes pa gleng ba'i snga ltas/bzhi pa ni mkhan slob kyi mtshan nyid dang mi ldan pas gzhan gyi mkhan slob byed par 'gyur ba'i snga ltas/lnga pa ni sangs rgyas kyi bka' dang mu stegs can gyi gzhung mgo snyom pa'i snga ltas/drug pa ni zang zing gi chen du chos ston pa'i snga ltas/bdun pa ni dge 'dun gyi yo byad kyis khyim pa gso ba'i snga ltas/brgyad pa ni chos kyis phongs pa'i gang zag la chos bstan kyang don du mi gnyer ba'i snga ltas/dgu pa ni rab tu byung ba rnams grub mtha'i dbang gis sde ris su bcad nas chags sdang 'byung ba'i snga ltas/bcu pa ni shAkya thub pa'i bstan pa la sde pa bco brgyad 'byung zhing/thams cad kyis rang rang gi lta spyod dang mthun par nyams su blangs na byang chub sgrub nus la/rtsa ba'i byang chub sgrub pa'i yang nang ma nyams par yod pa'i snga ltas so/_}
rgyal po kri kri'i rmi lam bco brgyad|{snyan ngag dpag bsam ljon shing dang/mdzod kyi 'grel bshad las bcur bzhin cing bstan pa sngar dar gyi dus su byung ba'i chos brjed byang zhes bya ba la brgyad de bcu brgyad 'byung ba rim pa bzhin bsdus na/1 glang chen mjug ma skar khung 'thog pa dang/2 khron pas mi bsnyegs/3 phye dang mu tig brje/4 ngan pa'i shing dang tsan dan mnyam du byed/5 gling gi phru gus gling chen gnas nas skrod/6 mi gtsang spre'us mi gtsang gzhan la byug /7 spre'u mang pos spre'u ngan rgyal po bskur/8 bco brgyad mi yis rus yug so sor dras/9 ra ba'i me tog 'bras bu rkun pos khyer (chos byed kyi nor mi thub/) 10 'thab par mi 'ong (brjed byang las/sgra bshad sil bur 'gro bar byas pa'i )sde rigs phan tshun 'thab/11 me tog dag ni chod cig sengs ni bskul (skyes pas bud med gnyer bar rigs min par bud med kyis tshud gnyer ba/) 12 rdzing bu gsum ni bar ma stong bar mthong/13 rgan po spyi ther du ni gnas pa dang (chos dang po dar ba nas nub dus yang der nub/) 14 rta yi kha 'phags gnyis kas za ba dang (rgyal blon gnyis ka la brten dgos pa lta bu/) 15 che ba'i khyi bas chung ba kha ni drag (skyes pa bas bud med kha drug po lta bu/) 16 be'u skye ma thag tu ba la nu (nor rdzas bu la gtan cing bdag kyang de la re ba lta bu'o//) 17 snga dron gzhon nu phyi dro rgas ('dus byas mi rtag) 18 seng ge'i ro ni rang gi sran bus zos (chos 'jig na phyi rol pas mi 'jig nang pa rang mi mthun nas 'jig pa'i rtags/) bco brgyad rmis pas 'ong srung la zhus pas/bram ze'i khyi'u bla ma 'ong bar 'byung ba'i ltas zhes gsungs so/_/snga sngon tshe lo sum khri'i dus sangs rgyas 'od srung byon pa'i tshe rgyal po kri kri la rmis ltas bcu byung/rgyal po de nyid na nang pa sangs rgyas dang phyi ba'i mchod gnas gnyis yod pa las/rmis ltas rnams spyi rol pa'i ston pa la zhus pas/'di ni rgyal po 'grongs pa'am/grongs pa la thub par gyur pa yin pas snying dang 'dra ba zhig klung la gtong dgos so zhes zer ro/_/de yang rgyal po'i bu mo gser phreng can bya ba sangs rgyas la shin tu dad pa cig yod pa de la snying nad bya bar bsam nas smras so/_/de nas rgyal po thugs mi bder 'dug pa la/bu mos dris pas sngar gyi rgyu mtshan rnams gsungs pas yab rgyal po'i sku srog la phan na bdag 'gum pa bla mod gyi phyi rol pa 'di dag ma rig pa'i ling tog gis sems rgyud ldongs pas ma 'ongs pa lung ston pa'i mthu med/yang dag par rdzogs pa'i sangs rgyas ni shes bya thams cad la mngon sum gyi spyan dang ldan pa yin pas/de nyin la zhu bar rigs so zer/rgyal po de nyid 'thad gsungs nas sangs rgyas 'od srung la zhus pas/'di ni rgyal po 'khor bcas la ngan pa cung zad kyang med kyang ma 'ongs pa ni shAkya thub pa'i bstan pa la nyan thos rnams la spyod tshul ngan pa sna tshogs 'byung ba'i rmi ltas yin no/_/zhes lung bstan to/_}
