rgyal po de wa pA la|{rgyal po 'dis bi kra ma la shrI la'i gtsug lag khang bzhengs pa yin te mdo da dran pa nyer bzhag bam po zhe gsum pa 'di'i 'gyur byung du 'di ltar/rgyal po de wa pA las bi kra ma la shI la'i gtsug lag khang bzhengs pa dang rgyal po rA ma pA la'i ring la pa tshab tshul khrims rgyal mtshan gyis dran pa nyer bzhi gi 'phros cha tshang bar bsgyur zhes gsal}
rgyal po d+harma pA la|{(rgya gar chos 'byung )nang rgyal po 'di dang bod kyi rgyal po khri srong lde btsan dus mnyam par gsungs pa yig nor yin 'dra ste (deb dmar )lcags dpar ma shog grangs 10pa dang (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )lcags dpar ma shog grangs 99gnyis kar rgyal po 'di dang bod kyi rgyal po sad na legs mjing yon gnyis dus mnyam pa yang lung bang so'i rdo ring la yod ces grub chen u rgyan pas gsungs zhes gsal zhing/rgyal po 'di'i yab gau pA la yin par (mkhas dga' )dang/dge chos dang/(deb sngon gsar ma )bcas mthun pas/(rgya gar chos 'byung )nang rgyal po gau pA la'i sras de wa pA la dang/de'i sras d+harma pA la yin par gsungs pa go rim nor 'dzol byung ba 'dra snyam}
rgyal po mdo lnga|{bzang po spyod pa smon lam gyi mdo/rdo rje rnam 'joms khrus kyi mdo/shes rab snying po lta ba'i mdo/'das ka ye shes sgom pa'i mdo/byang chub ltung bshags (phyag 'tshal ba'i phung po dang bshags pa'i phung po/bsngo ba'i phung po gsum po )bshags pa'i mdo rnams yin no/_}
