rgyal po lde brgyad|{1 rgyal po sa yi legs drug gi tha ma i sho legs dang btsun mo rmu lcang rmang legs gnyis kyi bu za nam zin lde/2 de dang btsun mo mtsho sman khri dkar gnyis kyi bu lde 'phrul nam gzhung btsan/3 de dang btsun mo ser gnyen mer mo gnyis kyi bu se snod nam lde/4 de dang btsun mo klu mo mer mo gnyis kyi bu snol po sde/5 de dang 'o bzang te mo mtsho gnyis kyi bu lde snol nam/6 de dang btsun mo khri sman rje mo gnyis kyi bu lde snol/7 de dang btsun mo khri le btsun gnyan mo gnyis kyi bu sde rgyal po/8 de dang btsun mo sman btsun lug skor gnyis kyi bu lde sprin btsan bcas yin/tun hong go bod yig lo rgyus shog dril nang rgyal po de brgyad 'dren skabs ming bdun las mi snang bas ma yig gi nang chad skyon byung ba'am ma tshang ba gang yin brtag }
rgyal po 'phags skyes po|{rgyal po gsal rgyal gi btsun mo phreng ldan ma la skyes pa'i bu yin/rgyal po gsal rgyas la blon po'i gtso bo dum bu zhes pa zhig yod pa de la bu sa skyong dang/seng ge gnyis/seng ge la bu mo gnyis yod (gos can dang nye gos can )pas de gnyis nor nas gong can rgyal po gzugs can snying pos btsun mor blangs pa las bu skyes pa'i ming la rgyal po ma skyes dgra zer/rgyal po 'phags skyes po'i lo rgyus zhib cha 'dul ba lung gi gos gzhi'i skabs su gsal/rgyal po 'dis shAkya la dmag drangs te bsnubs pa'i lo ni 'dul ba lung gi gling gzhi'i tshigs rnams la brtags na/bcom ldan 'das dang rgyal po gsal rgyal gnyis dgung lo brgyad cu lon pa'i lo der yin par mngon}
