rgyal po gzugs can snying po|{rgya gar gyi grong khyer rgyal po'i khab kyi rgyal po pad+ma'i snying po'i bu yin cing/bcom ldan 'das dang gdung mnyam rgyal po bzhi'i gras yin/dge chos kyi (gser thang )las/rang lo bco lnga pa la yab kyi bkas rgyal sar 'khod/khri lo bcu drug pa la bcom ldan 'das dang mjal nas chos thos slob mar gyur rjes lo so bdun ring srid bskyangs pa bcas snga rjes bsdoms lo lnga bcu nga gnyis ring srid dbang bzung bar brten bu ma skyes dgra srid dbang bzung rgyur rngams nas mthar rang gi pha gzugs can snying po bkrongs ste srid dbang bzung/bcom ldan 'das kyis mnyan yod du cho 'phrul bstan skabs tshes bco lnga'i nyin gyi sbyin bdag gzugs can snying po yin}
rgyal po ru pa ti|{sngar rgya gar gyi rgyal rigs skya seng bu lnga dang/dgra ngan dpung tshogs bcu gnyis zhes 'thab pa'i dus su rgyal po ru pa ti (dgra ngan dpung tshogs kyi gras shig )'khor dmag stong phrag dang bcas pa bud med kyang chas su zhugs te ri gangs can gyi khrod du bros zhes pa de dang/bshad sro gcig la rgyal pa skya seng dang/rgyal po dmag brgya pa gnyis rgyal srid rtsod pa na skya seng gi bu srid sgrub kyis dmag brgya pa'i pha dang bu dgu bcu go dgu bsad cing/tha chung ru pa ti mtshan bzang dang ldan pa de btson du khrid nas 'ongs/gsod par phangs nas zangs shig gi nang du phas skom dang bcas te chur bskyur ba zhing pa zhig la rnyed nas gsos/phyis bod du byon nas rje bo mdzad ces 'dug pa gang zhig bden brtag dgos pa las/gang ltar gya gar gyi rgyal rigs bod phyogs su yul gyar ba zhig go/'di'i lo rgyus (lha las phul byung gi bstod 'grel )nang yod pa de yin}
