rgyal po seng ge rnam rgyal|{stod kyi mgon gsum gyi ya gyal rig pa mgon gyi rgyud pa/yab 'jam dbyangs rnam rgyal dang yul rgyal mo kha tun gnyis la sras gnyis byung ba'i bgres pa/'di nyid sku stobs che la sgyu rtsal gyi gnas kun la byang chub pa zhig byung bas gu ge phyi 'brog dang/gu ge bcas la snga rjes su dmag drangs nas rta nor ra lug la sogs pa mang po lon/la dwags su stag tshang ras chen pa gdan drangs nas yab kyi dgongs rdzogs la gser zangs kyi byams pa dgung lo brgyad pa'i sku tshad la sogs pa'i rten gsum mang po gsar bzhengs dang/rgyun mchod dge slong gi sde btsugs/paN chen blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyi drung du yum gyi dgongs rdzogs la gser 'bul dang/dngul 'bul cha tshang/gzhan yang rin po che'i rigs brgya rtsa/lha sa dang/khra 'brug /bsam yas sogs gtsug lag khang dang/chos sde che chung la mchod sprin dang bsnyen bkur rgya che ba/wam le/rgod yul/kha nag /gtsang dmar/skyu dmar nang/me ru/dar rtse sogs kyi sa khul dang/la dwags stod gsham dang/mnga' zhabs gang yod nas mchod gzhis su sa phud re re bskal pa nam gnas bar phul zhing/stag tshang ras chen la rang zhabs kyi khongs nas sa phud mchod gzhis gya chen phul ba dang/stang tshang ras kyis he mi byang chub bsam gling dgon dang/lce bde theg mchog dgon/wam le bde chen dgos bcas dgon chen gsum gyis gtsos pa'i gtsug lag khang mang po bzhengs pa'i sbyin bdag gi mthil len mdzad/seng ge rnam rgyal gyis ru shod bdag mo skal bzang sgrol ma khab tu bzhes par sras bde ldan rnam rgyal dang/in+d+ra b+ho ti/bde mchog rnam rgyal rnams rim par 'khrungs shing/sras 'di dag las brgyud pa'i gdung rgyud kyis la dwags khul la dbang bsgyur gnang bar mnga' thang dar gud ci rigs byung ngo/_}
rgyal po srong btsan sgam po|{lo rgyus thog mdzad rjes che zhing gzigs rgya yangs pa'i bod kyi rgyal po mtshan snyen che shos gras shig yin/bod yig lo rgyus rnying pa'i nang btsan po khri srong btsan zhes 'khod yod/khong dus skabs gang du 'khrungs pa dang/dgung lo ji tsam bzhugs pa'i skor lo rgyus thog bshad srol 'dra min sna tshogs yod pas 'dir re zhig de'i skor shod mi dgos par byas te/gtso bor srong btsan sgom po'i lo rgyus nang gi gtso che ba'i donag nas rnams gnad bsdus byas te 'bri gyur/rgyal po srong btsan sgom po ni bod kyi lo rgyus thog rlabs chen mdzad rjes che ba'i chab p+sarid mkhan can zhig yin zhing/khong gi mdzad rjes gtso che ba ni khag lnga ste/dang po/deng skabs nga tshos bed spyod byed mus kyi bod yig 'di thog mar gsar gtod byed du bcug pa/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i yi ge yod pa'i mi rigs kyi chab srid dang/dpal 'byor/rig gnas bcas kyi 'phel rgyas mgyogs po yod pa dang/yi ge med pa'i mi rigs rnams de las ldog ste rjes lus yin pa'i gnas tshul gsal por gzigs te ring nyid kyi blon po'i nang nas rig pa rno shos dang/de min gzhon nu rig pa can bsdoms mi bcu drug gya gar du mngags nas skad yig slob sbyong byed par btang yang tshad pas gdungs nas 'gro ma thub/da dung yid thang ma chad par thon sam b+ho Ta sogs khag gcig btang nas kho tshos lo shas ring rgya gar dang kha che'i yul du slebs te phyi rgyal gyi skad yig rigs mi 'dra ba mang po dang/de dag rang rang gi sgra rig pa bcas la mkhas par sbyangs nas bod du slebs rjes/skabs de'i bod skad gyi khyad chos la zhib 'jug byed pa brgyud/deng sang nga tshos bed spyod byed mus yin pa'i yi ge 'di bzo thub pa byung zhing/yi ge 'di bzos nas da phan lo chig stong sum brgya lhag tsam song yod rung/(mkhas dbang tshe tan zhabs drung gis )bstan rtsis kun lus btus pa )zhes pa'i nang spyi lo 646(me rta )lor thon mis yi ge bzos par bzhed/) skabs der bsgyur ba dang bris pa'i yi ge da lta yod pa rnams bod yig gi cha tshad mthon po yod pa'i mis brgya cha brgyad cu tsam klog thub pa dang go ba yang len thub kyi yod pa 'di byung zhing/yi ge 'di gsar gtod byas rjes rgyal po rang nyid kyis kyang yi ge slob sbyong gnang ba ma zad/khrims kyi nang du'ang 'bangs mi rnams kyis yi ge slob dgos pa'i don tshan dmigs bsal gyis bkod yod/gnyis pa/rus rgyun tsho pa khag gcig gyur byas te mi rigs kyi rnam pa ldan pa'i khrims lugs thog mar btsugs pa/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i gong du rus rgyud tsho pa khag bco brgyad tsam yod pa tshang ma phan tshun bar mthun sgril med pa dang/bde 'jags med stabs rus rgyud tsho pa tshang mar gnod 'tshe chen po yong gi yod pa tsho pa khag gi mi mang pos shes rtogs byung ste gcig gyur yong ba'i re 'dun chen po yod pa ltar/rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos srid dbang bzung rjes thog mar tsho kha khag tshang ma gcig gyur byas shing/de nyid sra brtan du gtong ba la khams lugs shig nges par du gal che bar gzigs nas spyi'i khrims chen po drug la nang gses rigs mi 'dra ba mang por phye ba'i khrims yig gtan 'bebs byas pa bsham gsal/1 khri rtse 'bum bzhir gyi khrims ni/dmag don dang srid 'dzin zung 'brel gyi lam lugs la khrims zhes btags pa zhig yin/(1) de yang bod sa gnas ru lngar ste/ru lnga po so sor stong lde bcu re dang/spyi khyab dpon chen re dang/dmag dpon rgan gzhon gnyis re/ru dar gyi mdog dang tshos gzhi mi 'dra ba/(2) rus rgyud tsho pa khag bco brgyad la sa khul re re bgo skal du sprad nas tshad nges can kyi sger dbang khas len pa/(3) 'bangs kyi nang rgyal phran bzhi/dpon rigs bdun/bran g.yog dang yang bran/bzo rigs/tshong pa sogs rim par bya ba/(4) bka' gros chen po drug /yig tshang drug /bka' yi phyag rgya drug /rkyen drug /dpa' mtshan drug bcas kyi bya thabs bzung ba/2 'bum gser thang sha ba can gyi khrims ni/bre srang zho cha sogs gcig gyur byas te/zhing 'brog gi tshong las gong 'phel dang stabs bde yong ba byas pa/3 rgyal khams dper blangs kyi khrims ni/byed dgos pa gsum/byed mi chog pa gsum/bstod bsngags byed dgos pa gsum/sma 'bebs byed dgos pa gsum/mnar gtod byed mi rung ba gsum bcas rgyal khrims bco lnga/lha chos dge ba bcu/mi chos gtsang ma bcu drug bcas kyi khrims bcas te spyi tshogs thog gal che ba'i spyod bzang rnams dar spel btang ba/4 mdo lon zhu bcad kyi khrims ni/phyogs gcig bden pa la yod pa phyogs gcig bden pa med pa'i rigs thag gcod tshul/5 dbang chen bcad kyi khrims ni phyogs gnyis kar nyes pa yod mnyam la rim gras mi 'dra ba'i khrims thag gcod tshul/6 khab so nang pa'i khrims yig ni/phyogs gnyis kar nyes pa che chung dang yod med 'dra ba la khrims gcod tshul bcas yin/gsum pa/dmag don dang srid 'dzin zung 'brel gyi gcig gyur lam lugs cung zad tsha chang tsam zhig btsugs pa/srid 'dzin lam lugs thad/blon chen gsum gyis phyi'i srid 'dzin gyi lan don sgrub pa/nang blon gsum gyis nang gi las don sgrub pa/bka' blon gsum gyis rgyal po'i bka' la yo bsrang dang legs bcos byas pa bcas blon po che dgus phyi nang gi las don rnams thag gcod pa'i lam lugs btsugs pa/bzhi pa/mi rigs kyi rang nyid sngar yod rig gzhung gong 'phel gtong ba'i rmang gzhi'i thog mi rigs gzhan dag gi rig gnas dang lag rtsal slob sbyong byas pa/snga rjes su gong ma thang tha'i tsung la re 'dun zhus te/dar 'ub gso mkhan dang/chang bzo mkhan/shel bzo ba la sogs pa'i rgya rigs kyi bzo pa mang po bkug ste kho tshos lag rtsal bod du dar spel btang ba dang/bal yul nas bzo ba dang/ri mo mkhas pa/rdo bzo ba sogs mang po bskongs nas kho tsho'i lag rtsal dar spel btang ba/de bzhin thang rgyal rabs kyi rgyal sa khran an du bod rigs gzhon nu rig pa rno ba khag gcig gya yig dang rgya skad slob sbyong byed par btang ba sogs lab rten nas mi rigs gzhan dag gi rig gzhung shes yon slob sbyong byas te rang gi mi rigs kyi sngar yod rig gzhung gong 'phel gtong ba'i phan yod kyang nus pa mthong thub pa ni chab srid thog ha cang mthong rgya che ba'i mtshon rtags shig red/lnga pa/rgya bod mi rigs bar dang/bal bod mi rigs bar ga mthun sgril la shugs snon brgyab pa/rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos bod sa gnas su sangs rgyas chos lugs dar spel gtong ba dang/mi rigs gzhan dag gi rig gnas dang lag rtsal bod sa gnas su dar spel yong ba'i ched du snga rjes su bal po'i rgyal po'