rgyal po in tra b+hu ti|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/o rgyan gyi yul (deng sang gi a h+phu han )du rgyal po in+d+ra b+hu ti snga rjes gnyis byung ba'i rjes ma de ni sangs rgyas mya ngan las 'das nas yun ring ma song ba'i dus su byung ba yin zer/skabs der o rgyan gyi yul du grong khyer 'bum tsho lnga dang/rgyal po gnyis yod pa grong khyer sam b+ha sa'i grong 'bum tsho gnyis dang phyed yod pa rgyal po in+d+ra b+hu ti la dbang zhing/grong khyer mang+ga la pu ra na grong 'bum tso gnyis dang phyed yod pa rgyal po dza len+d+ra la dbang/rgyal po in+d+ra b+hu ti sangs rgyas chos lugs la dga' zhing bu mo gcig yod pa ming la legs smin ka ra zer/rgyal po dza len+d+ra mu stegs pa'i chos lugs la dga' zhing/de la bu gcig yod pa pha mas chung dus nas gnyen sgrig byed du bcug rjes su bu mo rang nyid khyo mo'i sar mna' mar 'gro skabs khyo bo rgyal po'i sras des bag ma'i ston mo bya ba'i ched du ri dwags ha cang mang po bsod pa mthong nas sems la skyo ba skyes te/nga'i pha sangs rgyas chos lugs la dad cing/sems can gyi srog gcod pa spang ba'i chos rgyal yin bzhin du/nga mu stegs kyi rgyal po sdig can 'di 'dra zhi gal bag mar gtong phod pa nga la snying rje gtan nas med pa'o snyam nas bag ma'i nor rdzongs su sprad pa'i gser dngul rgyan gos sogs tshang ma rang nyid bsu skyel byed mkhan gyi 'khor g.yog kun la bgo bsha' brgyab ste nga rgyal sras sdig can de'i mna' mar mi 'gro zer nas smyo brdzu btab/de'i gnas tshul phyogs gnyis kas shes nas bu mo rang gang 'dod byed du bcug pa las bdag sprod ma byas/rjes su bu mos nyin mo smyo brdzu btab/mtshan mo chos byas te grub pa thob nas/thengs gcig rgyal po dza len+d+ra ri dwags rngon par phyin pa'i dus su lam nor te bu mo yod sa'i brag phug tu slebs nas blta skabs grub pa thob par shes nas chos nyan/rang nyid kyi rgyal srid bu la gtan nas bu mo'i drung du chos byas/bu mo'i pha ma la yang de 'i gnas tshul yi ge btang bas bum mo'i pha rgyal po in+d+ra b+huti yang rgyal srid bu la gtan nas chos byas te lo bcu gnyis song ba na grub pa thob/de nas rgya po dza len+d+ra yang yun ring ma song bar grub pa thobs nas rang nyid kyi mnga' 'bangs thams cad sangs rgyas chos lugs la bsgyur nas rang yul du gtsug lag khang bdun brgya tsam bzhengs zhes bshad srol yod/rgyal po 'dis brtsams pa'i bstan bcos bod skad du bsgyur zhing grags che ba ni/grub pa sde bdun gyi nang tshan (ye shes grub pa )dang (lhan cig skyes grub (gnyis yin/dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i mgor lo tsA ba rin chen bzang po dang 'bro lo tsA ba shes rab grags kyis bod skad du bsgyur ba/bstan 'gyur sngags phyogs pod (mi)(tsi)gnyis su yod/'di'i lo rgyus cung zad zhib pa/rgya gar gyi slob dpon a b+h+ya ra ka bod skad du 'jigs med 'byung gnas kyis mdzad pa'i (grub thob brgyad cu rtsa bzhi'i rnam thar dang lo rgyus )pa tsha lo tsA ba tshul khrims rgyal mtshan gyis bsgyur ba de'i nang gsal/'di sde dger shing par yod}
rgyal po u tra ya na|{'di la ('dul ba lung )gi lo rgyus su/rgyal po 'di rgya gar mtha' 'khob gyi rgyal po sangs rgyas la ha cang dad pa che ba zhig yin par bshad}
rgyal po'i sku mkhar|{mal gro gung mkhar rdzong rgya ma mda'i shar ngos kyi ri sna zhig gi steng du rgyal po'i sku mkhar zhes srog btsan rang gis phyag btab par grags pa'i lha khang zhig yod pa de'i rten gtso srong btsan dang/rgya bza'/bal bza' bcas kyi 'jim brnyan yod pa de sngon rig gnas gsar brje'i skabs gtor ba zhig byung 'dug kyang/deng sang mang tshogs nas rgyal po'i sku mkhar nyams gso dang 'brel sngar bzhin rten g.yo rnam gsum gsar bzhengs byas thog der rgyun gtan mang tshogs nas chos kyi byed sgo byed kyi yod pa dang/de'i khris su rgyal po'i dur khrod zer ba rdo pha bong zhig yod pa de la srong btsan gyi sku phyag phul gnang ba'i rjes kyang yod par grags}
rgyal po'i khab|{(rA dza gre ha'am yang na ra ja gi ri )de sngon rgya gar du sangs rgyas shAkya mu ne sku bzhugs skabs kyi rgyal po gzugs can snying po'i pho brang yod sa'i grong khyer gyi ming ste (thang zan tshang gi lam yig )mdor bsdus bod skad du bsgyur ba las/rgya gar rdo rje gdan nas shar phyogs su le dbar nyis brgya dang drug cu lha tsam yod pa dang/skabs der grong khyer gyi shul tsam las med rung/lcags ri'i mtha' bskor la le dbar sum cu tsam yod par bshad/sa gnas der rgyal po'i khab zer ba'i rgyu mtshan ni rgyal po gzugs can snying pos rgyal po byed skabs kyi mkhar grong sngon ma de grong khyer nang du yod skabs 'bangs kyi khang khyim nas me shor ba rgyal po'i pho brang du mched pa thengs kha shas byung ba'i rkyen byas/sus khyim nang me shor ba byung na de'i khang khyim nang mi dang bcas pa dur khrod nang du phyir 'bud byed dgos rgyu'i khrims bcas/yun ring ma song bar rgyal po rang gi khyim nas me shor bas/rgyal pos rang gis gtan 'bebs bzos pa'i khrims rang gis bshig mi rung zer nas pho brang dur khrod du spos nas bsdus par rgyal po'i khab zer ba'i ming thogs/de rgyal po gzhan dag gis nyes te gsang ba'i rkun dmag btang ba'i gros byas pa rgyal pos go thos byung bas/lcags ri bskongs te kham khyim mang po btab nas grong khyer du bsgyur ba zhig yin kyang ming bsgyur ma byas par sngon ming rnying pa rang 'jags su 'jog pa yin zhes ('dul ba'i gling 'bum )du gsal/rdo rje gdan nas shar phyogs su phyin pa na bud+ha ba na zer ba'i nags tshal dang/grub thob ba lang skyong gi sgrub phug sogs brgyud nyin zhag gnyis gsum tsam phyin pa na grong khyer rgyal po'i khab tu slebs/de ni phyogs bzhir ris bap+sakor ba'i thang de thams cad sngon grong khyer chags pa'i shul yin zhing/gya gar bas grong khyer der pa hA ra g+ha ra dang/nang gi mkhar dngos la dzA tsa ma hal dang/rdo rje gdan dang rgyal po'i khab sogs kyi ri byung spyi la shri Ni pa dA zer/gnas der rgyal po gzugs can snying po dang/smin rgyal 'tsho byed gzhon du bcas kyi khang shus dang/mkhar gyi phyi rol ri 'gram du b+h+ra ma'i sa la dang nye bar sngon gyi rdo mkhar chen po zhig yod pa de ni rgyal po'i khams gsar pa bya ba rgyal po ma skyes dgra (adzA ta sha tru )yi pho brang gi shul yin/thang zan tsang gnas der phebs dus cha tshan nyi shu tsam yod pa dang/seng sang gsum tsam las ma lus shing/chu tshan yod sa'i gnas de ni chu dron gyi kun dga' ra ba'i shul dang/chu tshan yod sa'i ri de ni rgyal po'i khab tu yod pa'i ri lnga'i nang gi ri bo ngos yangs (bi pU la )bya ba de yin/nyan thos chen po 'od srung sogs dgra bcom pa lnga brgyas bka' bsdus dang po mdzad pa'i gnas sde can ma'i phug bya ba'i phrag phug de yang chu tshad gyi thag nye sar yod/chu tshan gyi ri de'i thad ka'i byang ngos na yod pa'i re di ni ri bo skya sangs zer ba de yin pa dang/ri 'di gnyis kyi mtshams su sngon dus grong khyer gyi rgyal sgo yod pa'i rtsig shul kyang mthong rgyu yod/cha tshad kyi than nas 'ongs pa'i chu 'bram byang phyogs sa 'bur mtho ba'i phyogs shig yod sa ne di 'od ma'i tshal (bi lu pa na )gyi shul yin zhing/der ston pa lo shas bzhugs/rgyal po'i khab kyi byang gi sgo nas nyer bya rgod phung po'i ri bo (gri d+ha ku Ti )rgyal yol gyi tshul du yod cing/re de ni ngos mtho zhing rtse mo rgya che la mtha' 'khor du brag bya skyibs kyis bskor ba ri rtse nub ngos su cung zad g.yol ba zhig yod/de ni ston pas sher phyir gsungs sa yin zhing/der gyo mo las bzos pa'i dang gang gi nang du thub pa chos 'khor ma'i sku brnyan ston pa'i sku tshad dang mnyam pa/de'i shar du mdo sde pad+ma dkar po gsungs sar ston pa'i bzhugs khri rdo leb chen po zhig dang/de naso ngos su brag bya skyibs can gyi 'og tu ston pa bzhugs sa'i rdo khang/de'i phan tshun du dgra bcom pa mang po'i bsam gtan gyi khang pa/rdo khang dang nye bar rdo'i steng du ston pa'i sku chos bkrus nas nyi mar bskam pa'i skud ris rnams brkos pa lta bur gsal ba yod tshul (thang zan tsang gi lam yig )las gsal/rgya rgod phung po'i ri bo'i mdun gyi thang du/ma ga d+ha bzang mo'i rdzing bu'i shul yod cing/de nas mar la 'bab pa'i chu de la chu bo dbyangs can ma (sa ra swa sti )zhes grangs/chag lo tsA ba'i rnam thar nang/rgya rgod phung po'i ri bo de mthon po med/spyir rgya gar na ri nyung zhing/rgya rgod phung po'i ri bo de ni bod kyi ri 'bring po tsam zhig yin zhing/ri zur yod pa/rtse mo zlum 'khyil le ba/phyogs thams cad nags kyis khengs pa/ri lus la la nas chu 'bab pa/la la na brag yod pa/stag dang dom dang/dred sogs gcan gzan mang po gnas pas mi phal pa der 'gro mi nus pa/grub pa thob pa'i paN+Di ta dug sbrul dang gcan gzan gyis mi tshugs pa 'ga' re tsam bzhugs pa/dbyar dus rtswa shing thams cad skyes pas ri mdog sngon por snang zhing/dgus dus rtswa dang 'jam mag gang yod skad pas mdo skya bor snang ba/bya rigs dang shing sna mang po 'dzoms pa zhig yin par gsungs/deng sang ri pin gyi bla ma phu ci gu ru zhu ba zhig gis ri 'di'i rtse mor 'dzam gling zhi bde'i mchod rten ngo mtshar can zhig dang gnas bskor ba rnams bgrod bde ba'i ched du yi gnas nas ri rtse bar glog 'phrul gyi sbreng zam btsugs pas dad mjal mkhan rnams la stabs bde yod/grong khyer rgyal po'i khab dang/yul tsam pa gnyis kyi bar sho gar 'jal ba'i sa tshigs yod par gnas brtan me skyes kyi lo rgyus nang gsal}
rgyal po'i khab bsam 'grub rtse|{(gzhis ka rtse rdzong )sngar bod kyi rab byung drug pa'i sa glang (1349)lor ta'i su tu byang chub rgyal mtshan gyis sa skya ba'i lag nas srid dbang phrogs te bod yongs la dbang bsgyur byas rjes rdzong chen bcu gsum brtsigs pa'i tha ma yin par paN chen bsod nams grags pas mdzad pa'i (deb ther dmar po gsar ma )'am (rgyal rabs 'phrul gyi lde mig )las bshad cing/rjes su gtsang pa rgyal po phun tshogs rnam rgyal gyis bod yongs la dbang bsgyur byas rjes pho brang lta bu yin}
rgyal po'i rtags chen lnga|{thor tshugs/lham khra bo/gdugs/ral gri/rnga yab nor bu'i yu ba can}
rgyal po'i nus pa gsum|{rje bo'i nus pa/dpa' bo'i nus pa/sngags kyi nus pa}
rgyal sprul|{bla ma sprul sku'i nang nas bod kyi rgyal po gnang myong ba'i sprul sku ste/1 de mo ho thog thu ngag dbang 'jam dpal bde legs rgya mtsho tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa gshegs rjes rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me glang (1757)lo nas rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me bya'i (1777)lo'i bar khri lo 21/2 dga' ldan khri thog drug cu re gcig pa tshe smon gling sku phreng dang po ngag dbang tshul khrims gong gi lo 'phros nas rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me rta (1786)lo'i bar khri lo 10/3 kun bde gling rta tshag rje drung blo bzang ye shes bstan pa'i mgon po rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags phag (1791)lo nas rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags rta (1810)la'i bar khri lo 20/4 rwa sgreng ho thog thu ngag dbang ye shes tshul khrims rgyal mtshan rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing sbrul (1845)lo nas rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing bya (1864)laro'i bar khri lo 19/5 stag brag sprul sku ngag dbang gsum rab mthu stobs bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan lo (rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags sbrul (1941)nas rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags stag (1950)lo'i bar khri lo 10sogs gong gsal rnams rgyal sprul yin}
rgyal phran|{'di la rgyab khab chenapo gcig gi gcig gyur bkod 'doms 'og nags pa'i sa gnas rang bzhin ldan pa'i rgyal khab chung chung ngam/yang na rgyal khab chen po gcig kha 'thor nas sa gnas rang bzhin ldanapa 'i rgyal khab chung chung mang po gcig 'og tu gcig ma 'dus par gnas pa ste rigs gnyis yod pa las de snga rang rgyal gyi lo rgyus thug byung ba'i kra'o rgyal rabs kyi rjes su rgyal phran bdun dang/han rgyal rabs kyi rjes su rgyal phran gsum/cin shar ma'i rgyal rabs kyi rjes su rgyal khab bcu drug /thang rgyal rabs kyi rjes su rgyal rabs lnga dang rgyal khab bcu zer ba lta bu sogs tshang ma krung go'i rgyal khab chen po gcig gi nang rgyal khab chung chung mang po byung ba'i gnas tshul sha stag red/rgyal khab zer ba dang rgyal po zer ba'i ming bed spyod byed pa tsam gyis rang btsan rgyal khab yin pa'i go ba len rgyu med}
rgyal phran nyer lnga|{rang lag tu son pa'i deb ther dag tu de ltar bshad pa las re re bzhin du ming dang lo rgyus gsar ba ma mthong bas ngag rgyun tsam zhig yin nam snyam}
rgyal phran bzhi bcu|{(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )gyi rtsom pa po nyid kyis rgyal phran bzhi bcu'i rgyal blon gyi ming dang yul ming bkod pa'i tshig gi 'go mjug dum bu re drangs par mdzad pa las cha tshang ba zhig bkod med pa dang/tshig de rnams bod yig gi dpe rnying gang 'dra zhig nas drangs par mdzad pa yang gsal bar ma gsungs pa'i rgyu mtshan gang yin brtag }
rgyal phran sil ma bcu gnyis|{'di rnams rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po ma byung gong gi rgyal phran yin zhes (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )las gsungs pa ma zad/rgyal phran bcu gnyis so so'i rgyal po'i ming dang blon po'i ming bcas drangs yod pa rnams (tun hong nas thon pa'i bod kyi lo rgyus yig cha'i )le'u bcu par bkod pa dang phal che ba gcig mtshungs 'dug pas/de rnams bod yig gi dpe rnying zhig las tshur drangs pa'i tshig ces sogs gra go gsungs yod pa der brtags na rtsom pa pos gzigs myong ba'i dpe gang yin rjes su bat+ga dpyad mdzad dgos pa 'dug lags}
rgyal ba sku phreng rim byon|{rgyal ba zhes pa ni sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la bdud bzhi'i g.yul lam sdig pa'i tshogs ma lus pa las rnam par rgyal bas na rgyal ba zhes brjod pa yin te yongs grags su tA la'i bla ma sku phreng rim byon la de ltar che bstod zhu srol yod}
rgyal ba dge 'dun grub pa|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng dang po )rje tsong kha pa chen po'i dngos slob rgyal dbang thams cad mkhyen pa dge 'dun grub pa mchog ni/gtsang ru lag gi sa 'i dpal ldan sa skya'i nye 'dabs srad kyi lung lag /zhal dang ban snying gnyis kyi mtshams sug nga mo ru ba zhes pa'i 'brog sde zhig tu yab mgon po rdo rje dang yum jo mo nam mkha' skyid gnyis kyi sras su rang byung bdun pa'i lcags lug (1391)lor sku bltams/mtshan pad+ma rdo rjer gsol/dgung lo lnga bzhes skabs grong pa gzhan gyi ra rdzi mdzad skabs rdo la ma Ni mang po bris gnang ba mjal rgyu yod par grags/dgung lo bdun la phebs pa'i tshe yab 'das/lo der snar thar du phebs/zas gos shin tu bkren na yang sku yod sbyong ba la lhag par spro/de nas dpal snar thang gi mkhan rabs bcu bzhi pa'i sprul sku rje grub pa shes rab las dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan pad+ma rdo rje rang sor bzhag /brgya ston tsan+d+ra dang shAkya dpal las bod yig dang/lany+dza war hor yig sogs gsan sbyong mdzad pas mkhas par mkhyen/dgung lo bcu lnga pa shing bya (1405)lor dpal snar thang gi mkhan chen grub pa shes rab dang chen po blo ldan gnyis kyi drung las rab tu byung zhing dge tshul gyi sdom pa mnos te mtshan dge 'dun grub pa dpal zhes gsol/de rjes snar thang gi paN+Di ti chen po sang+g+ha shrI la snyan ngag me long dang/mngon brjod 'chi med mdzod/sgra mtshams sbyor lnga pa sogs dang/gtum mo dkar po'i rjes gnang sogs chos bka' du ma gsan/dgung lo nyi shu pa lcags stag (1410)lor grub pa shes rab kyis mkhan po dang/slob dpon chen po blo ldan pas las chog pa dang/chen po grags pa shes rab pas gsang sde ston pa mdzad de bsnyen par rdzogs pa'i dge slong gi dngos po brnyes/mkhan rin po che las kyai rdor dang/don zhags sogs mang du zhus/rnam 'grel dang TIk+ka thugs 'dzin mdzad/dgung lo nyer lnga pa shing lug (1415)lor dbus la phebs te khra 'brug tu sems pa chen po kun bzang dang/thar po cher rong ston shAkya rgyal mtshan gyi zhabs la gtugs nas dbu ma dang phar phyin gsan/'on bkra shis rdo khar rje tsong kha pa dang mjal te tshad ma rnam nges/drang nges rnam 'byed/rtsa she/rtsa ma lnga bcu pa/rtsa ltung rnam bshad sogs mang du zhus/thar po cher nyi ma rgyal mtshan las gsung 'dus mi bskyod pa/'jigs byed bcu gsum ma/gshed dmar bcu gsum ma/lha lnga sogs gsan/gsang phu ne'u thog dang ri bo dga' ldan du phar byon tshur byon mdzad nas lo gsum tsab bzhugs/dung lo nyer bdun bzhes pa nas 'bras spungs dgon dang/se ra chos sdings/'phan yul rgo pa sogs su byon/dmar ston dpal ldan rin chen dang/rgya mtsho rin che gnyis las lo gnyis ring mdo rtsa ba dang mngon pa legs par gsan/dgung lo ngo lnga pa shing sbrul (1425)lor gsang phu'i 'chad nyan mdzad/de ltar dbus la lo bcu gnyis bzhugs/so drug pa me rta (1426)lor rje shes rab seng ge dang lhan du gtsang la phebs/byang chen/ri khud/brag dmar sogs su bzhugs/'chad nyan smra zhing grwa tshogs 'phel bar mdzad/dgung lo bzhi bcur 'jug TIk+ka brtsams/la stod lho byang rnams su bya bral 'chad nyan mdzad/dgung lo zhe gnyis par bo don phyogs las rnam rgyal dang mjal te sgrol ma nyer gcig pa dang/bcu bdun ma/dkar sngo sogs chos dpag med gsan/dri ba du ma mdzad par lan bde blag tu phul bas thugs shin tu mnyes te thams cad mkhyen pa zhes pa'i mtshan gsol/de nas sa skya rgyang 'bum cher phebs skabs rten 'byung mtha' bral gyi don la nges pa rnyed cing de tsam la tshad ma rnam 'grel gyi TIk+ka brtsams/dgung lo zhe gsum na dbu ma rtsa she'i rnam bshad rin po che phreng ba brtsams/dgung lo zhe drug la byang chub du theg chen pho brang chen mo btab/dgung lo zhe bdun nas don dgu bar tshad ma rigs rgyan dang/'dul ba'i gleng 'bum/so thar gyi TIk+ka/'dul ba'i bslab khrims chen mo sogs dpe cha mang po ljags rtsom gnang/dgung lo zhe brgyad pa sa rta (1438)lor dbus su phebs/byang rtse chos rje nam mkha' dpal ba dang/zur khang bsod nams lhun grub/spyan snga rin chen 'phel sogs las chos mang du zhus/dgung lo lnga bcu pa lcags sprel (1440)lor shes rab seng ge dang lhan du slar gtsang la phebs te snar thang dang/byang chen sogs su 'dul ba'i 'chad nyan gtso bor mdzad/de nas rje shes rab seng ge'i dgos rdzogs su nang rten thub chen bzhengs/dgung lo nga bdun pa rab byung brgyad pa'i me long (1447)lor bkra shis lhun po dpal gyi chos sde chen po phyogs thams cad las rnam par rgyal ba'i gling phyag btab nas byams chen sku gsum thugs rten bsam gyis mi khyab pa bzhengs/dgon pa'i sbyin bdag dar rgyas pa dang bsod nams dpal bzang gis mdzad/dge 'dun sum stong lhag 'dus/dpal gnang 'dus kyi sgo nas rab gnas mdzad/dgon pa'i gzhi rten du dar rgyas dpon gyis gzhis mkhar gyi yong sgo phul/shing rta lo cho 'phrul smon lam chen mo gsar 'dzugs gnang dgon pa btab nas lo nyi shu rtsa brgyad kyi bar bstan pa'i bdag po mdzad de 'chad nyan nang yang chag pa med par gnang paN chen dge 'dun grub pa zhes mtshan snyan gyi gdan sa pa sus mdzad la paN chen zhes pa'i mtshan snyan grags khyab dgung lo gya bzhi pa rab byung brgyad pa'i shing rta (1474)lo'i bod zla bcu gnyis pa'i tshes bdun nyin sras kyi thu bo 'dul 'dzin dpal ldan bzang po sogs sku drung du 'bos nas zhal bkod rim par mdzad mtshan mo'i ring thugs dam la rtse gcig tu mnyam par bzhag tshes brgyad kyi tho rengs zhabs rdo rje dkyil krung phyag gnyis mnyam bzhag mdzad de gzhi'i 'chi rim lam gyi 'od gsal dang bsres nas thams cad stong pa 'od gsal la zla ba de'i nyer gnyis bar bzhugs sku gdung bkras lhun gyi dngos stong mthong ba don ldan nang bzhugs thams cad mkhyen pa dge 'dun grub pa dpal bzang po mchog gis snga phyir yongs 'dzin lnga bcu skor gyi zhabs la gtugs pa rnams kyang nang nas khyad par bka' drin mtshungs med mkhan chen grub pa shes rab dang rje shes rab seng ge gnyis skyes ba thams cad du bka' drin che ba rje btsun tsong kha pa chen po blo bzang grags pa'i dpal zhes gsungs spyir dgung lo so lnga nas gya bzhi'i bar dam pa'i chos kyi 'chad nyan mdzad pas skal ba dang ldan pa'i gdung bya mkhas pa dang btsun pa dang bzang po dang rnal 'byor la brtson pa'i slob mas gangs ri'i khrod ma khyab pa'i mi snang la gtso bo ni 'dul 'dzin dpal ldan bzang po dang rdo rje slob dpon bzang po bkra shis 'jam dpal dbyangs kun+padaga' bde legs rin chen rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po rab 'byams pa bstan pa'i nyi ma smon lam dpal legs pa'i blo gros mkhan chen bzod par dpal grub mkhan chen shes rab rgyal mtshan sogs mang bka' rtsom la (shar gangs ri ma sogs nyams mgur sgrub thabs bstod tshogs dang dbu ma'i lta khrid (chab shog) (smon lam)sogs gsung thor bu ba sna tshogs kyis skor (theg pa chen po'i blo sbyong don bdun ma'i 'khrid yig) (dpal gsang ba 'dus pa'i sgo nas rab gnas byed pa'i cho ga mdor bsdus pa/) (dbu ma rtsa ba shes rab kyi ngag don bshad pa rin po che'i phreng ba/) (dbu ma 'jug pa'i rnam bshad dgongs pa rab tu gsal ba'i me long ) ('dul ba'i gleng 'bum chen mo/) (mdo TIk+ka )sogs pu ti bdun tsam bzhugs}
rgyal ba dge 'dun rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gnyis pa )rje dge 'dun rgya mtsho ma chog ni gtsang rta nag bsregs te bzhad mthong smon rdzong khongs su gsang sngags gsar rnying gi bstan pa'i bdag po rdo rje 'chang kun dga' rgyal mtshan dang/ma gcig kun dga' dpal mo'i sras su rang byung brgyad pa'i me sprel (1476)lor sku 'khrungs/mtshan sangs rgyas 'phel zhes gsol/dgung lo gsum dang bzhi'i ring sho ma lung ri khrod du yab kyis sku yon sgron/dgung lo bdun la thos bsam gling gi kun mkhyen chos 'byor dpal bzang gis rgyal ba dge 'dun grub pa'i sprul skur ngos 'dzin mdzad/dgung lo brgyad la bkra shis lhun por phebs nas paN chen lung rigs rgya mtsho dang mjal/dgung lo bcu pa la paN chen lung rigs rgya mtshos las rab tu byung/mtshan dge 'dun rgya mtsho'i dpal zhes gsol/paN chen rin po che'i drug du tshad ma rna 'grel gyi gzhung yang rgyugs 'bul mdzad nas gzhung chen po la slob gnyer gan nga/lo der gnas rnying chos rje kun dga' bde legs par dge tshul bsgrubs/dgung lo bcu bdun la dbul phar gyi gzhung la thugs gnyer mdzad/dgung lo bco brgyad par dmu ba'i 'dzin grwar phebs/dgung lo bcu dgu la 'jam dbyangs legs pa chos 'byor gyi gdan zhus ltar 'bras spungs su phebs/dgung lo nyer gcig la gnas rnying chos rje'i drug du bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyer gsum pa paN chen mchog 'od zer gyis 'phyongs rgyas ri bo bde chen du gdan drangs nas chos kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor/der gnas pa'i mkhas pa rnams kyis sku na phra mo 'di lta bu la blo gros phul du byung ba de 'dra ba ni rgyal dbang nyid kyi 'phrin las gzugs su grub pa gor ma chag ces dad gus phul du byung ba mdzad/sne gdong gong ma ngag dbang bkra shes grags pa rgyal mtshan chen pos kyang gzigs skyong chen po gnang/rje mchog gis rtsed thang khyams ra chen mo'i gyang ldebs su rgyal ba tsong kha pa'i 'dra sku bzhengs/dga' ldan lnga mchod kyi mchod pa bzang po gsar du btsugs/dgung tsho nyer lnga la lha sar phebs/'jam dbyangs dga' ba'i bshes gnyen dang mkhas grub nor bzang rgya mtsho sogs bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi gdams pa yongs su rdzogs pa gsan/'chad rtsod rtsom gsum gyis bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan bla ru bsgrengs/dgung lo so bzhi pa rab byung dgu pa'i sa sbrul (1509 )lor dwags ston rgyal du dpal ldan dpar zor ma'i bla mtsho mjal bar phebs te lha mo'i bla mtsho'i nye 'gram du chos rgyal a mo g+has sbyin bdag mdzad nas chos 'khor rgyal gtsug lag khang kha ched bdun cu dang/gtsang khang ka chen brgyad/mgon khang ka bzhi bcas brgyad kyi chos 'khor rgyal me tog thang gi dgon par phyag btab/rten gtsor bzo bo bal po nyi ma dpal gyis bzhengs pa'i gser zangs gi byams chen bzhugs/dgung lo so bdun la rgyal po lha thog tu lha mo'i bla mtsho'i gnas sgo bye bar mdzad/de nas paN chen ye shes rtse mo'i gdan zhus ltar bkra shes lhun por phebs te khri thog lnga pa mdzad/dgung lo so brgyad la 'ol dga' dang chos 'khor rgyal khul du kong dmag dang 'bri gung pa'i dmag lhags/dgung lo zhe gnyis la thob bsam gling gi blo bzang bshes gnyen dang/shar rtse blo gros rgya mtsho gnyis khri tshab tu bap+sako gzhag gnang nas gdan zhus ltar 'bras spungs su phebs/dgung lo zhe gsum pa 'bras spungs kyi khri pa dgung pa mdzad/rje tsong kha pa mchog gis lha ldan smon lam chen mo gsar 'dzugs gnang nas lo dbu bcu go gcig ring star chags su tshugs kyang skyid shong gi kha bdag rin spungs pas mdzad nas lo nyi shu'i ring gsang phu ba dang/karma pa sogs kher rkyang gis smon lam tshugs pa de skor rje nyid kyis phag gru gong mar se 'bras gnyis smon lam la zhugs chog pa'i snyan seng bka' 'khrol byung don sa stag (1518)lor smon lam gyi tshogs dbu mdzad/'di'i lo nas se 'bras dge gsum slar yang sngar rgyun ltar smon lam chen mo tshugs par phebs/gdong gi mi dbang gong ma chen po bkra shes grags pas 'bras spungs kyi mtsher shag rdo khang sngon mo rje 'di la phul rjes ming dga' ldan pho brang du bsgyur/dgung lo zhe dgu la chos 'khor rgyal dug ser zangs kyi rje btsun mi pham mgon po'i sku mtho bcu'i tshad dang ldan pa zhig gsar bzhengs mdzad/dgung lo nga gnyis la da da ngag dbang bkra shes grags pas sogs kyis gsos ba btab pa bzhin se ra theg chen gling gi gdan sa yang mdzad/dgung lo re drug la 'on mnga' ris grwa tshang du chos grwa btsugs/snga phyir bkras lhun dang/'bras spungs/se ra so so'i mkhan po mdzad/bka' rtsom (mtshan brjod drang nges rnam dbye )dang/(dbu ma'i lta khrid/) (bstod tshogs/) (stong nyid bdun cu pa/) (smon lam bdun cu/) (sgrol ma nyer gcig gi rnam bshad/) (grub mtha' rgya mtshor 'jug pa'i gru gzings )sogs po ti lnga tsam bzhugs shing/rgya gar gyi chu bo gang+ga'i tshun chad snyam ngag la mkhas par grags/gsum las skyes pa'i slob ma khri rin chen po bde ba can pa chos rje dge legs dpal bzang sogs mang du byon/dgung la re bdun la phebs par rang byung dgu pa'i cha stag (1542)lo'i bod zla gsum pa'i tshes brgyad nyin 'bras spungs dga' ldan pho brang du zhi bar gshegs/sku gdung dngul sdong zhig 'bras spungs tshogs chen du bzhugs}
rgyal ba bsod nams rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa )lha sa skyid shong smad stod lung mda' skyar po rtse khang gsar gong du yab sde pa rnam rgyal grags pa dang/yum dpal 'dzoms bu khrid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung dgu pa'i chu yos (1543)lo'i bod zla dang po'i tshes bco lnga nyin sku bltams/'khrungs ma thag ra ma dkar mo'i 'o ma zhal la gsol ba dang mtshan yang ra nu sri chod dpal bzang zhes gsol/dgung lo gsum nas rgyal ba dge 'dun rgyal mtsho'i dus kyi mdzad pa rnam thar rjes su dran te de dang de'i ngang tshul kho na mdzad cing/zhal nas kyang de bzhin du gsung ba zhig byung bas rgyal ba dge 'dun rgya mtshor snyan grags khyab pa bzhin zhabs drung gdung rgyud rin po che mi dbang bsod nams grags pa rgyal mtshan sogs nas rgyal ba dge 'dun rgya mtsho'i sprul skur ngos 'dzin zhus/dgung lo bzhi la phebs skabs phyag bris 'bri klog sogs la brtson par mdzad/de'i lo 'bras spungs dga' ldan pho brang gi gser khrir phebs/paN chen bod nams grags pa'i drung nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan bsod nams rgya mtsho dpal bzang po bstan pa'i nyi ma phyogs las rnam rgyal du gsol/dgung lo lnga la chos 'khor rgyal du phebs/dgung lo bdun thog paN chen bsod nams grags pa mchog gi sku drung nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/de nas paN chen mchog las tshe dbang grub g+r+yal ma dang/rnam sras ser chen/'dod khams dbang mo sogs kyi rjes gnang dang dbang/chos rje legs pa'i don grub kyi drung nas 'jigs byed kyi sngags btu/shar rtse legs pa don grub nas 'jam dpal sogs mdo dang sngags kyi zab chos mang po gsan pa dang/chos sde rnams su gsung chos kyang bstsal/dgung lo bdun yan la tshe dmag med kyi sngags 'bum phrag bcu gsum/dbyangs ngan ma'i bsnyen pa sa ya lnga/skyabs 'gro 'bum phrag bzhi/dgung lo bcu pa chu byi (1552)lor 'bras spungs kyi khrir phebs/de'i phyi lor lha ldan smon lam chen mo'i tshogs dbur phebs/dgung lo bcug cig yan la gur grags kyi sngags 'bum phrag nyis brgya/dgung lo bcu gsum la chos 'khor rgyal du phebs/ye shes khyung nag gi sngags 'bum gcig /de lo yang 'bras spungs su dmigs brtse ma 'bum phrag bzhi bcas mdzad/me 'brug (1556)lor yar klung sde gdong pa dang/'phyongs rgyas nang so ma mthun par sde gzar che ba langs pas rab 'dum du phebs te zhi 'jags byung ba sogs kun gyis spyi mos che/sa lug (1559)lor sne gdong gong ma chen mo ngag gi dpal phyug bkra shis grags pa rgyal mtshan nas kwan ting ta'i gu shrir hong hang gi mtshan gnas dang/phyag dam dmar po gnang chog pa'i bka' shog phul/chu khyi (1562)lor char gas rgyas cher lha sar chu nyen chen po byung rkyen de'i phyi lo lha ldan smon lam chen mo'i rjes 'brel dge 'dun rnams nas jo bo'i rags rdo skyel ba'i srol bzang 'dzugs par mdzad/dgung lo nyi shu rtsi gcig la mkhas grub dge legs dpal bzang pos mthun po dang/bstan pa dar rgyas kyis las slob/dge 'phel chos rje phyogs las rnam rgyal bas gsang ston/rje btsun bsod nams dpal bzang gis dus bsgo ba mdzad de dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/de nas dge ba'i bshes gnyen kun bzang rtse pa dang/dpal ldan sa skya pa'i bstan 'dzin chen po tshar chen blo gsal rgya mtsho/rje bde ba can pa sogs mkhas grub du ma las chos bka' mang po dang gzhung chen la gsan mas mdzad/dgung lo nyer lnga lor gtsang du phebs nas se skya rnams la chos 'khor rgya cher bskor/dgung lo nyer drug thog 'bras spungs su phan bde legs bshad lang gsar 'dzugs gnang/dgung lo nyer brgyad thog chos 'khor rgyal gyi gdan sa'i chos srung phyi nang gsum gsum gyi rten rnams gsar du bzhengs/dgung lo so gsum la yar lung du dus zing skabs rje nyid kyis chings mdzad de zhi bar gyur/dgung lo so gcig la rnam rgyal grwa tshang phyag btab/dgung lo so lnga la phebs pa rab yung bcu pa'i me glang (1577)lor sog pa al than chos kyi rgyal pos spyan 'dren snga phyir zhus pa bzhin byang phyogs sog yul du ris med rgyal bstan spyi dang/bye brag zhwa ser cod pan 'chang ba'i ring lugs spel bar chibs kha bsgyur/rwa sgreng nas chibs thog tu 'khyol khar/sa skyong bkra shis rab brtan pas chibs yol la 'jus nas/bstan pa'i dpal gyur bla ma'i zhabs pad brtan/_/bstan 'dzin skyes bu sa steng yongs la khyab/_/ces tshig rkang gnyis 'phral rtsom mdzad thog /mchi mas brnangs te gsung rgyu ma byung bas/bstan pa'i sbyin bdag mnga' thang 'byor pa rgyas/_/bstan pa yun ring gnas pa'i bkra shis shog /ces chibs thog nas gnang bas tshig don zab cing byin rlabs che bar grags/al than dang mjal nas dbu lhar gyur te rje mchog la mi rigs mi gcig pa ma'i dbus su gser las grub pa'i dbu rgyan/bum pa/rigs lnga'i phyag mtshan/gser srang brgya las grub pa'i tham ka kha ris la/ 0 rdo rje 'chang tA la'i bla ma'i tham ka rgyal zhes zhes pa zhig dang/tA la'i bla ma'i badzra d+ha ra zhes bdag rdo rje 'chang gi mtshan bstod phul/de nas bzung rgyal dbang sku phreng rim byon la tA la'i bla ma ste rgya mtsho'i bla ma zhes pa'i mtshan snyan grags/rgyal dbang mchog nas al than la chos kyi rgyal po lha'i tshangs pa zhes pa'i mtshan gnang/sog yul la dam pa'i chos rgya cher bskor/sog po brgya phrag mang po rab tu byung/phyugs zog bsad nas mchod pa'i lam srol bcos par mdzad/al than dam chos la mos nas byang chab chos 'khor gling btab/rab byung bcu pa'i lcags 'brug (1580)lashor rgyal dbang mchog chab mdo byams pa gling dgon gyi byang sems chos rje'i khrir phabs te ser skya yongs la chos kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor bar mdzad/sku 'bum byams pa gling rgyas 'debs phyogs su phebs nas bka' chos du ma gnang/chu lug (1583)lor rgyal ba tsong kha pa sku bltams pa'i gnas chen sku 'bum du phebs/der bshad sgra 'dzugs pa'i zhal bkod mdzad/shing sprel (1584)lor sog yul du bskyar phebs gnang ste sog po nang 'khrug 'dum 'grig mdzad pas kun bde la 'khod/shing bya (1585)lor se chen ta'i ching gi sde thog tu phebs te phun tshogs dar rgyal gling gi dgon pa phyag btab/gsum rtsom la/(dpal rdo rje 'jigs byed kyi drug po'i sbyin sreg gi las mtha' srid gsum za ba'i sreg khang 'bar ba )zhes bya ba dang/(byang chub lam gyi rim pa'i 'khrid gser gyi yang zhun/) (dpal mgon zhal bzhi pa gdong brnyan 'khor dang bcas pa'i sgrub mtha' rgyas pa dgra bgags kyi sde 'joms pa'i gnam lcags kyi spu gri me lce'i phreng ba )sogs pod 'bring gcig lhag mdzad/mthar dgu lo zhe drug la phebs pa rab byung bcu pa'i sa byi (1588)lo'i bod zla gsum pa'i tshes nyer bdun nyin sog yul kha ra chin du sku mya ngan las 'da' ba'i tshul bstan/sku'i gdung thal dpal ldan 'bras spungs su gdan drangs te dngul sdong rin po cher bzhugs}
rgyal ba yon tan rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bzhi pa )'di nyid rab byung bcu pa'i sa glang (1589)lo'i bod zla dang po'i tshes gcig nyin yab sog po jing ger gyi rgyal rgyud thu med tha'i ji dang yum bA khen spur gnyis kyi sras su sog yul mkhar sngon po'i se chen chos 'khor du sku bltams/'khrungs ltas bzang po du ma byung ba'i phyi rgyal skad grags chod kyang yab tshang gis gsang rgya chen po mdzad/skabs der bod phyogs nas rgyal dbang bsod nams rgya mtsho'i yang srid rtsad gcod skor lha bla'i lung bstan rtse mthun byung bas/sku gong ma'i gsol dpon bsod nams rgya mtsho sogs sog yul du ched brdzong gis chu srid 'di nyid dgung lo gsum pa'i thog bsod nams rgya mtsho'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin zhus/rab byung bcu pa'i chu 'brug (1592)lor bod nas phyag mdzod chen mo dpal ldan rgya mtsho dang sne gdong gong ma/gong dkar zhabs drungs sogs dbus gtsang gi sde dpon mi drag khag dang/gdan sa gsum gyi 'thus mi bcas nas mchog sprul rin po che gdan 'dren phyir sog yul du thon skabs dga' ldan khri zur rgyal phang rtse pa dpal 'byor rgya mtshos thams cad mkhyen pa yon tan rgya mtsho dpal bzang po zhes pa'i mtshan 'bul shog lde dang sbrags bod du 'phral mngar gnas zhu thub thabs byas kyang yab yum gnyis sras la thugs brtse che bas rim 'gyangs kho nas bshol te 'a spungs dga' ldan pho brang gi bzhugs khril zhabs sor 'khod/de rjes lha ldan gtsug lag khang du jo bo shAkya mu ne'i spyan sngar dga' ldan khri zur sangs rgyas rin chen gyis mkhan po mdzad de rab tu byung nas dge tshul gyi dngos po bzhes/paN chen blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan mchog nas mdo sngags kyi chos bka' mang po 'bul bzhes mdzad/paN chen rin po che rje 'di'i dbu blar bzhes/de nas rgyal dbang mchog mal gro ba dang rdzing phyi sogs la gnas gzigs gnang zhing/rgyal me tog thang gi gdan sar phabs te gnas gzigs dang chos 'khor rgya cher bskor/rgyal ba'i bka' bzhin 'on rgyal sras don yod chos kyi rgya mtshos mdo smad a mdo'i yul du dgon lung phyag btab/me rta )1607)lor gtsang phyogs su gnas gzigs su byon/lcags phag (1611)lor 'bras spungs su bzhugs te paN chen rin po che gdan zhus kyis rdo rje rje phreng ba sogs chos 'brel rgyal cher gsan/lo der gtsang pa dbon zhang thugs 'dod ma mnyam par brten gtsang dpung gtos che ba yar rgyab tu 'byor/yar rgyab zhabs drung ngag dbang bdud 'dul grags pa dpon blon gsol skal gyi steng du bzhugs dgos pa'i nang zhig rtags thon yung rkyen rgyal ba rin po che'i mtshan la mthu stobs rgya mtsho zhes bsgyur/chu byi (1612)lor lho 'brug phyogs su chibs bskyod gyis spa sprom/thib phu/dar dkar sogs su rim phebs mdzad de chos 'brel rgya cher gnang/phyag dang ma Ni grangs gsog dang/srog gcod spong ba sogs kyi dam bca' zhu mi mang du byung/dgung lo nyer drug par paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan gyis mkhan po dang/sprul sku bsod nams dge lags dpal bzang gis las slob gnang ste bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/de rjes 'bras spungs dgon gyi khri thog bcu gsum pa dang/se ra dgon gyi khri thog bcu lnga pa'i thugs 'gan gcig lcogs su bzhes/dge 'dun rgya mtshan dang/paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan/gzing khang gong sprul sku/rje nor bu ba sogs las mdo sngags kyi chos tshul rags rim gsan bzhes mdzad/me 'brug (1616)lor rgya nag tA ming rgyal pos bla ma bsod nams blo gros can gdong yab bdag rdo rje 'chang zhes pa'i mtshan dang/tham ga /'bul ba bcas phul te rgya yul du khang gsar bzhengs la rab gnas su gdan drangs kyang 'bras spungs dga' ldan pho brang nas rab gnas mdzad de rgya yul du bzhengs pa'i mchod khang nang phyag nas 'khyag rgyu yod pa dang/rten 'ga' zhig gi thugs kar me tog dngos su bzung ba/gsang yib chu tshad khar rdo la zhabs rjes gsal bar byung ba sogs rdzu 'phrul bstan par mdzad/lo de'i bod zla bcu gnyis pa'i tshes bcu bzhi nyin dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs/skabs der dgung lo nyer bdun la phebs/rgyal ba yon tan rgya mtsho sku gshegs pa'i gdung zhugs su phul bar thugs ljags spyan gsum dang dbu thod sogs nas ring bsrel mang po phabs pas khal kha cho khur gyis dad rten du dbu thod dang/thu med tha'i nyis thugs sogs rang rang gi yul du spyan drangs/khal kha cho khur gy