rgyal ba blo bzang rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa )'di nyid ni rgyal ba sku phreng rim byon gyi nang nas chos srid gnyis ka'i thog mdzad rjes dang mtshan snyan shin tu che ba'i gras shig yin/khong ni lho kha 'phyongs rgyas 'phying dbang stag rtser yab bdud 'dul rab brtan dang yul khri lcam kun dga' lha mdzes kyi sras su bod rab byung bcu pa'i me sbrul (1617)lor sku 'khrungs/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu khyi (1682)lor sku gshegs/dgung lo re drug bzhugs/paN chen blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan dang dga' ldan khri chen dkon mchog chos 'phel gnyis kyis rwa sgreng gi ngo bo 'jam dpal rdo rje dang lha sa'i jo bo shAkya mu ne'i sku mdun du zan ril brtag pa mdzad pa dang/chos skyong khag gi bka' lung rnams gcig mthun byung ba ltar tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bzhi pa yon tan rgya mtsho'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin zhus kyang skabs der gtsang pa rgyal po'i dbang shugs la brten nas 'bras spungs pho brang du gdan zhum thub par lo shas lus shing/paN chen blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan mchog nas gtsang pa rgyal por thabs mkhas dum 'i sgo nas zhu bskul gnang bar brten sku reng rim byon gyi gdan sa 'bras spungs dga' ldan pho brang du gdan zhu thub tsam byung/dgung lo dgu par paN chen rin po ches man po dang/khri chen dkon mchog chos 'phel gyis las slob mdzad de dag tshul gyi bslab sdom bzhes/mtshan ngag dbang blo bzang rgya mtsho zhes gsol zhing/dge lugs kyi dbang lung khrid sogs man ngag mang po gsan/khri chen dkon mchog chos 'phel gyi drung nas gzhung chen bka' pod lnga yi slob khrid cha tshang dang/smon 'gro 'jam dbyangs dbang rgyal rdo rje'i drung nas sgra rig pa dang snyan ngag /khyab bdag dbang phyug rab brtan gyi drung nas sa skya'i chos skor/'khon ston dpal 'byor lhun grub kyi drung nas gsang sngags rnying ma'i chos skor gsan te grub mtha' ris med dang/rig gnas skor yongs su rdzogs pa gsan bsam mdzad/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gnyis pa sa stag lor sa'i gtsug lag khang du jo bo shAkya mu ne'i drug du paN chen rin po ches mkhan po dang/dga' ldan khri chen dkon mchog chos 'phel gyis las slob mdzad de grangs tshang ba'i dge 'dun gyi dbus su dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/bsnyen rdzogs bzhes nas lo grangs lnga song ba nas sku tshe ma rdzogs bar bsgrub bya stong phrag mang por dge tshul dang dge slong gi sdom pa bstsal zhing bslab khrims gtsang mar bsrung bar mdzad/dgung lo nyer lnga bzhes pa bod lcags sbrul (1641)lor gau shri bstan 'dzin chos rgyal gyi dmag dpung dbus su'ong te gtsang pa rgyal po'i srid gzhung gtor pham btang rjes/de'i phyi rol gzhis ka rtser gdan drangs thog dngos 'bul shin tu rgya che ba dang bcas bod sa gnas kyi srid dbang yongs rdzogs phyag tu phul ba ltar bod sa gnas dga' ldan pho brang gi srid dbang 'dzugs pa gnang zhing/thog ma'i sde srid du phyag mdzod bsod nams chos 'phel bsko bzhag mdzad/dgung lo nyer dgu pa shing bya (1645)lor po ta'i pho brang rnying pa'i shul sngon yod kyi shar ngos su rgya bskyed thog pho brang dkar po gsar bzhengs mdzad cing/pho brang grub ches bzhugs yul 'bras spungs pho brang nas po ta lar spo ba gnang ste chos srid gnyis ka'i mdzad sgo gal chen khag der spel ba gan nga/pho brang dkar po grub pa'i lo des nas bzung lo 'ga' shas ring man ching srid gzhung ging gong ma dang po hrun kris tA la'i bla ma mchog rgyal sa pe cin du gdan 'dren zhu yig thengs mang 'byor ba bzhin dgung lo so drug pa cu 'brug (1652)lor sku 'khor sum stong lhag tsam dang bcas byang lam dang/mdo sngon brgyad lam bar phebs bsu ba'i bkod pa bsam gyis mi khyab pas sna drangs te rim gyis phebs pa na/gong mas dngos su bsu bar ma phebs kyang ri dwags brngon par nan yon skyes tshal du phobs pa dang lam bar du stabs legs kyis mjal ba'i tshul gyis sa gnas der mjal 'phrad gnang zhing/gong ma nyin khri las babs te phan tshun gnyis ka mnyam bzhengs thog mtshams 'dri gnang zin rjes so so'i khri la mnyam bzhugs dang/gsol ja/gsol tshigs bcas mnyam bzhes mdzad/de rjes nyin mang por gzhes len gyi ston mo dang/dngos 'bul zam mi chad par phul zhing/gong mas ched gnyer gyis bskrun pa'i pho brang ta'i khar nyin shas bzhugs/gong ma pe cin du phabs grub chen tA la'i bla ma rin po che nyid kyang pe cin du phebs te gong ma'i mdzod nas dngul srang khri phrag dgu'i mgron dngul btang ste ched gnyer gyis bskrun pa'i bzhugs yul lha khang ser por grags pa zhig yod pa der bzhugs shing/lo gsar ma shar gong der gong mas nang blon ka pa la a ma dang/as khan sa ma gnyis ched gnyer gyis mngags pa'i mdun/gdugs dang/rgyal mtshan/ba dan/'phan/spos phor/nyi yol/dung rgya gling sogs gong ma'i ti shrir 'os pa'i chas rnams cha tshang ba gnang/chu sbrul lo'i lo gsar skabs gong ma chen po dang/btsun mo/ching wang/phyi nang gi blon chen sogs tshang mas nyin grangs mang po'i bar dga' ston dngos 'bul rgyas par phul zhing/pe cin nas zhal gyes khar gong mas phebs rdzongs su gser srang lnga brgyad dang/gser gyi sder ma mang po/dngul srang khri/gos chen yug chig stong sog rnam grangs shin tu mang ba phul/gong ma hrun kri rang nyin nas kyang nan yon skyed tshal du phebs nas dga' skyel gsol ston rgyas par bshams/tA la'i bla ma mchog pe cin nas zhal gyes te ta'i kha pho brang du bzhugs skabs/gong mas li pu hrang hru'u lu'o lang chi'u sogs mngags pa'i mdun gser srung nga bcu tham pa las bzos pa'i gser gyi tham ka'i ngos su/nub kyi lha gnas ches dge bar bde bar gnas pa'i sangs rgyas kyi bka' lung/gnam 'og gi skye 'gro thams cad bstan pa gcig tu gyur pa/'gyur med rdo rje 'chang rgya mtsho'i bla ma zhes rgya sog bod gsum gyi yi ge gsum gshibs byas pa'i gser thang dang gser gyi byang chub tshos shog 'thub shos dang mnyam pa/zheng la sor bzhi dang gdus su mtho gang yod pa ngo grags bco lnga 'phrul mig tu sbrel nas ldebs chog pa'i ngos su bstod bsngags rgya cher bkod pa'i 'jug tu/khyed la nub phyogs kyi phul byung zhi ba sangs rgyas rgya chen khyon la sangs rgyas bstan pa'i mnga' bdag thams cad mkhyen pa rdo rje 'chang tA la'i bla ma zhes pa'i mtshan gnas tshul rgyu yin/zhes sogs 'khod yod pa red/gong ma hrun kris tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga par de lta bu'i gus bskur zhub ni/tA la'i bla ma'i mtshan gnas bde spyad de sog rigs rnams dbang d