rgyal ba tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng drug pa )'di nyid yab smyos rigs gter ston pa d+ma gling pa'i dbon rgyun sngags 'chang rig 'dzin bkra shis bstan 'dzin dang/yum tshe dbang lha mo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu phag (1683)lo'i zla gsum pa'i tshes gcig la lho mon la 'og yul gsum du sku 'khrungs/sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos lnga pa chen po'i yang srid la ngos 'dzin zhus te thog mar mtsho snal gdan drangs nas yi ge dang 'don cha chos spyod sogs kyi sku yon bsgron/dgung lo brgyad la phyag bris shog thog tu phab/dgung lo bcu gcig thog thol byung tu rta mgrin la bstod tshig sho lo ka lnga skor tshig don phun sum tshogs pa zhig brtsams gnang mdzad/dgung lo bco lnga pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me glang (1697)lor rgyal dbang drug pa'i sring khrir mnga' gsol/chu rta (1702)lor paN chen blo bzang ye shes mchog gis rab byung gi sdom pa phul/mtshan rin chen tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho zhes gsol/paN chen rin po che mchog dang sde srin rnam gnyis kyis gtsos bla slob sbrags mar bsten nas bka' chos gsan pa'i khur bzhes/snga gzhug tu tshul khrims dar rgyas dang dge legs rgya mtsho sogs yongs 'dzin du bsten nas rtsa ba sngags kyi rgyud/byang chub lam rim sogs mdo sngags kyi chos dang dbang lung gsan pa ma zad/rig gnas dang mtshan nyid sogs kyang sbyangs te ras spungs grwa tshang bzhi dang gzhan pa'i chos thog la'ang phebs par mdzad/sku yon gsan bzhes gnang rigs kyi nang nas kyang phyag bris kyi brad dag dang bka' rtsom gyi rigs sku gong ma'i bag chags khyad par du sad pa shin tu ngo mtshar zhing/dad pa 'phel bar snang/ljags rtsom kyang rta mgrin sgrub thabs dang/se ra rta mgrin mchod pa'i drin lan sogs mdzad/gdan sa gsum dang/chos 'khor rgyal la sogs pa bka' chos bstsal ba dang/bka' 'gyur gyi par gsar brko bskyang rgyu'i dub 'dzugs gnang ste pod nyi shu lhag tsam legs par grub/lha ldan gtsug lag khang gi yang steng gser zangs gyi mda' g.yab dang/rten bzhengs sogs kyang mang po gnang bas mtshon chos srid kyi mnga' thang skyong ba'i 'phrin 