s dwags po zhabs drung dang/dwags po bla ma sogs su 'bod/lo bcu'i ring la mtsho sngon a rig nas bzung ste tsha ba rong dang/tsha kho/dar rtse mdo/gling chen 'gying ri/khams kyi 'ba' li thang/lha kho/tsa ri/kong yul/mon yul/bal yul/rgya gar sogs sa cha mang po gsan stabs kyis gnas mjal gnang/lcags byi (1720)lor dpa' ris dger khog dgon du phebs skabs blo bzang dpal ldan zhwa la legs pa rgya mtshan gyi sprul skur ngos 'dzin gnang/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags glang (1721)lor rje nyid a lag sha nas dpa' ris gser khog dgon du phebs skabs jag rung rgod ri dgon gyis zhus pa ltar dgon de'i mkhan khri'i khur bzhes/me lug (17270lor rgyal dbang mchog gis bod sog gi yon bdag bcal nas brag 'gag gi gnas su yar yul dgos thos bsam dar rgyas gling gsar bzhengs kyi 'og brtsams te lo lnga'i nang grub cing/dge 'dun gyi sde mang po btsugs/dgung lo so dgu'i steng jag rung dgon rnying gi mkhan khri'i thugs khur bzhengs nas dgung lo re bzhi'i bar lo nyer lnga'i ring la jag rung yar lung dgon pa'i dgon bdag dang mkhan po gcig lcogs gnang/shing stag (1734)lor te thung rdo rje 'chang gi dkar chag pad dkar ljon bzang zhes pa dang/ma rung srin po'i gzugs can khro gtum che zhes pa'i gur mgon 'phrin bcol ljags rtsom mdzad/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me stag (1746)lor mdo smad du dgongs pa rdzogs par gsungs so/_}
rgyal ba bskal bzang rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa )khong ni rgyal ba sku phreng rim byon gyi nang nas mtshan snyan ha cang che ba'i gras shig yin/'khrungs yul ni mdo khams li thang byams pa gling gi lha zhol du rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa byi (1708)lor yab bsod nams dar rgyas dang yum bsod nams chos mtsho gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga bcu pa me glang lor sku gshegs/thi lang chos skyong nas rgyal ba'i yang srid yin pa'i lung bstan bzhin p+saku zhang pas dge bkra shis nas skal bzang rgya mtsho zhes mtshan gsol/gnas tshul de rim bzhin dbus gtsang tu khyab rjes/rgyal po lha bzang gis phyogs der lkog nyan byed mi mda' dpon nor bu dngos grub can mi gnyis btang/mda' dpon nor bu dgon grub kyi 'di tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho'i sku skye yin zhes brjod na phan thogs med ces yongs grags su brjod pa dang gsung ba'i thog nas sku skye 'di sa khul gzhan zhig tu gdan zhu byas na lags tshul bslab bya yang byas par brten de nub rang yab kyis 'brog pa'i sa char gdan drangs shing/de nas shing rta (1714)lo'i zla 3tshes 14nyis sde dger gdan zhu byas/de'i gnas tshul mtsho sngon phyogs kyi sbyin bdag sog po ching wang ba thur tha'i ji sogs kyis thos te lha bzang khang gi tshangs dbyangs rgya mtshor mi 'tshams pa zhus pa dang/da dung yang srid la'ang gnod 'tshe btang dogs gdan zhu'i mi snang btang ste lo de rang du sde dge nas mtsho sngon dga' ldan e ti ni ju nang gi sdod sgar la phebs pa dang dbus phyogs nas gdan sa gsum dang/stag rtse sde srid sogs gzhung 'bangs bsam shes can rnams nas gsang stabs kyis yang srid rin po cher gzhung thog nas tA la'i bla mar ngos 'dzin zhus pa dang/bod sog yongs nas yang srid rin po che 'dir ngos 'dzin khas len zhus/dgong lo brgyad la phebs skabs man ching gong ma khang shis ni kyang sngar yab dus su tA la'i bla ma lnga pa chen po dang 'brel ba dam zab yod pa'i srol rgyun ltar/sku tshab chen btang gis rgya bod hor sogs kyi chibs hrag zab rgyas dang bcas yang srid rin po che sku 'bum byams pa gling du gdan drangs/rgyal dbang bsod nams rgya mtsho'i bzhugs khrel mnga' gsol gyi mdzad sgo dang sbrags/gong ma'i bka' phab pa'i nang don du/tA la'i bla ma'i sprul sku 'di de phyogs la phebs pa nas bzung nged sengs shin tu bde/nged dang bstan 'dzin chos rgyal gyi gdung rgyud thams cad sbyin bdag yin/sprul pa'i sku 'di tA la'i bla ma gong ma'i ming srid 'khrul med yin pas/mchog dman thams cad kyis gus 'dud zhu dgos dang/thams cad mkhyen pa 'dzam gling la nyi ma shar ba lta bur sbar mos 'geb thub pa mi yong bas/gong rang gi thugs rje dang 'phrin las kyi 'od zer sa steng thams cad la khyab pas sangs rgyas kyi ba stan pa dar zhing rgyas pa 'byung/zhes khyab bsgrags byas/de nas bzung/cha gan no yin han dang/chu bzang no min han sogs yongs 'dzin du bsten nas nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i gzhung chen po rnams la tshig spyi tsam ma min par gsan bsam gtso bor mdzad/mep+saparel lo'i hor zla 10nang sku 'bum dngul gdung chen mo'i drung du yongs 'dzin chu bzang rin po che'i drung du rab tu byung bar mdzad/mdo sngags gzhung lugs yongs la gnas bsam sgom sgrub thog /chos 'chad spel sogs kyi sgo nas gdul bya grangs las 'das pa bsam pa chos phyogs su 'god par mdzad/sbyin bdag gi gtso bo bstan 'dzin ching wang dang dga' ldan ju nang gis gtsos sog yul dang mtsho sngon phyogs yod pa'i dpon khag yod do cog nas sku 'bum du yod pa'i sprul sku rim po che dbus phyogs su gdan 'dren zhu rgyu'i gros mthun byung ba dang/ching gong mas kyang rje bla ma ma chog nyid dbus gtsang phyogs su gdan drangs te pho brang chen po po ta la'i gser khrir mnga' gsol dgos tshul gyi bka' rgya dang mi sna 'byor ba'i mdun tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa chen po'i dus kyi srol ltar 'ja' sa tham ka sogs kyang phul/dgung lo bcu gsum dus sku 'bum byams pa gling nas bod phyogs su chibs kha bsgyur ba'i tshe/gong ma'i sras bcu bzhi pa cang jun phebs skyel du mngags pa dang de bzhin sog po dang mtsho sngon khul gyi sbyin bdag nang/gong ma'i sku tshab tu thu'u bkwan ho thog thu/bka' 'gyur tA bla ma/khal kha don grub wang sogs shin tu gtos che ba'i chibs zhabs dang