dgon lus/sku bum sogs a mdo khul gyi dgon khag mang po gtor bcom dang mi sde khri khrag mang por gnod 'tshe/skabs de'i sku 'bum mkhan po chu bzang rin po che gson por mer ba sregs/se skya pho mo mang po bsad rmas btang bcas byung bar brten/rgyal dbang mchog nas man ching gong mar dmag mtshams 'phral du 'jog dgos skor thad kar phyag bris dang/thu'u bkwan rin po che ngag dbang chos kyi rgya mtsho brgyud thengs mang 'bod bskul gnang bcas kyi thugs rjes dmag mtshams bzhag ste/gong ma'i mdzod nas gong gsal gtor bshig byung ba'i dgon khag nyams gso byed rgyu'i bka' phab pa ma zad/bod gzhung nas kyang dgon sde tshang mar nyams gso'i mthun rkyen dang/bzo rigs mkhas pa mang po mngags ste rogs ram rgya cher byas yod/bod mi ser skya mchog dman tshang mas rgyal dbang mchog la dad gus rtse gcig tu zhus par brten/skabs de'i bod kyi srid skyong mi dbang pho lha'i srid don gyi lam phyogs la 'gal rkyen lta bur mthong ste/bod sa gnas su nga lum sbyar gsum gyis bslangs pa'i zing 'khrug gi byed gte gtso bo tA la'i bla ma rang la thug yod pa'i snyan zhu zhig pho lha ba ngo mas gong mar phul bar brten/bka' phab pa ltar tA la'i bla ma mchog kyang yab rjes dbus zhabs gras nyis brgya bcas lha sa nas phebs thon gyis thi lang byams pa gling brgyud mkhar thang du phebs nas lo shang ring bzhugs dgos byung/der bzhugs pa'i ring mgar thang dgon pa phyag btab/der dge 'dun lnga bcu tham pa 'dzugs gnang thog skye 'gro grangs med par chos yang yang gsungs/shing yos (1735)lor bod mi mang skye ser yongs kyis re ba zhus pa ltar/mang ju gong mas gzhi nas lcang skyang rol po'i rdo rje sku tshab tu ched mngags gtong gnang mdun mgar thar nas bod ljongs su phyir phebs dgos rgyu'i bka' phab pa dang sbrags gong ma'i sras dang/lcang skya ho thog thu yang lhan du bod du chibs ka bsgyur nas lha ldan du phebs/gong ma chen lung gis bka' phab pa ltar/bod rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags lug (1751)lor tA la'i bla ma mchog nas chab srid kyi thugs 'gan bzhes te/zhabs zhur bka' bzhin bsgo gzhag byas shing bka' shag thog mar btsugs te bka' blon gyi gtso bo dga' bzhi gung paN+Di ta dang/mdo mkhar zhabs drung tshe ring dbang rgyal/thon pa sri chos tshe brtan/ser mo ba dar han nyi ma rgyal mtshan bcas dang/bka' drung/bka' mgron bcas bsko bzhag bstsal te bka' shag gi dam phrug bde skyid mar thugs smon dang bcas bka' blon gung thun mong gi phyag tu gsol ras bstsal/bod shing khyi (1754)lo'i zla gnyis pa'i nang/bod kyi rig gzhung thun mong ma yin pa sku rten bzhengs kyi bris tshugs dang/sgra/snyan ngag la sogs pa'i rig gnas/tsany+tsa dang/wartu ral sogs pa'i yig gzugs bcas slob sbyong byed pa'i rig gnas slob grwa gsar 'dzugs dang pho brang chen po'i zhol du bzo grwa 'dod 'jo dpal 'khyil (zhor 'dod dpar zhes pa de yin )gsar 'dzugs mdzad lo de'i rjes mar rtse yig tshang las khungs kyang ched 'dzugs gnang ba sogs mdzad rjes bka' drin shin tu che ba byung 'dug /rgyal ba'i dbang po 'di nyid nas sku gzhon nu'i skabs sku'i yongs 'dzin cha gan no min han dang/chu bzang no min han/khri blo ba'ang dar rgyas/khri chen dpal ldan grags pa sogs nas gzhung chen bka' pod lnga sogs mdo sngags rig gnas rgya mtsho lta bur gsan sbyong dang/nyams len la brtson pa chu bo'i rgyun bzhin mdzad de/paN chen thams cad mkhyen pa dpal ldan ye shes dang/lcang skya ho thog thu rol po'i rdo rje sogs dngos slob grangs las 'das par rab byung dang/bsnyen rdzogs kyip+sadom pa gnang ba sogs dang/byang chub lam gyi rim pa'i bshad khrid kyis mdzod/mdo rgyud man ngag du mas snod ldan gyi gdul bya rnams thar pa dang thams cad mkhyen pa'i lam bzang por 'god par mdzad/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho ni mdo sngags rig gnas dang bcas par mkhas pa'i phul du byin pa dang/sdom pa gsum gyi bslab khrims gtsang mar srung ba/thugs rgyud bzang zhing nyams thag pa'i 'gro ba rnams la snying rje che ba/dge lugs pa'i bstan pa'i bdag por bzhugs kyang chos lugs grub mtha'i phyogs ris med pa/dpal 'byor rgya chen po la mnga' brnyes kyang rgyas spros gtan nas mi mdzad pa/man ching gong ma sogs mchog dman kun gyis gus bkus zhus kyang khengs dregs kyi rnam 'gyur gtan nas mi mnga' ba bcas yin stabs rgya sog bod gsum gyi sa gnas yongs la mtshan snyan gyis yongs su khyab pa zhig yin/gsum rtsom gras dpar du 'khod pa bod bdun yod}
rgyal ba 'jam dpal rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa )rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa stag (1758)lo'i bod zla drug pa'i tshes nyi shu rtsa lnga nyin gtsang ston thob rgyal lha ri sgang du yab bsod nams dar rgyas dang yum phun tshogs dbang mog nyis kyi rigs sras su sku bltams/('khrungs khang de paN chen sku phreng drug pa'i yab gzhis dang gnyen tshan gyi 'brel pa yod pa dang/rgyal ba sku phreng de 'khrungs rjes gong gi go gnas dang gzhis ka mang po thob ste bod kyi mi drug che gras su gyur nas deng skabs klu zhes grags pa de yin )sku chung ngu'i skabs rgyal tshab de mo'i sku tshab dang/gdan sa gsum kyi sku tshab/paN chen dpal ldan ye shes mchog bcas nas rgyal ba'i yang srid rin po cher ngos 'dzin thog /dgung lo gsum la bkra shis lhun por dgon du gdan drangs/kun gzigs paN chen rin po che nas byad 'grol gnang/dgong lo lnga pa chu rta (1762)lor paN chen rin po ches dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa 'bul bzhes bskyangs te/mtshan blo bzang bstan pa'i dbang phyug 'jam dpal rgya mtsho dpal bzang po zhes gsol/dgung lo bzhi la gtan tsam nas yongs 'dzin phur lcog ngag dbang byams pa dang/bya khyung pa ngag dbang chos grags gnyis nas mdzad de sku na'i bab dang bstun pa'i sku yon 'bul bzhes kyang dbu tshugs/dgung lo brgyad pa'i thog paN chen rin po che dbus su phebs te dge tshul gyi bslab sdom 'bul ba gnang/bsdus grwa nas brtsams te gzhung chen la gnas bsam mdzad/sku'i na tshod ches phra yang skye bo khri phrag tshogs pa'i dbus su zab lam bla ma'i rnal 'byor sogs kyi bshad lung bstsal/dgung lo bcu bzhi'i thog snyan ngag dang mtshan nyid kyi brtsi bzhag gsan nas rtsod grwa gnang bzhin dgongs pa'i klong mngon du gyur pa dang/de rjes bsam yas gtsug lag khang zhig gso gsar skrun dang/mchod rdzas/dkar me sogs nyams pa sor chud gnang/dgung lo bcu bdun thog yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas byang chub lam rim gyi rnam bshad gsan/me bya (1777)lor kun gzigs paN chen rin po ches mkhan po dang/gsang ston/kha skong/dge 'dun zhal grangs tshang ba'i dbus su bsnyen pa rdzogs te dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes thog /khyung nag gi rjes gnang sogs mang po gsan/de nas lho gnas dang/rwa sgreng yangs pa ngan dgos sogs la gnas gzigs su phebs/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa bzhi par rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags glang (1781 lo'i bod zla drug pa'i tshes gcig nyin lugs gnyis kyi thugs 'gan bzhes gnang mdzad rung/rgyun du chos phyogs kho nas nyams bzhes thugs gzhol che bas srid skyong khri chen no mo han phyags rog zhabs zhur sngar rgyun ltar bzhugs/gong mas rje mchog la man ju/rgya sog bod yig bcas skad bzhi shan sbyar las grub pa/yod yig tu/nub phyogs mchog tu dge ba'i zhing gi rgyal dbang sa steng rgyal bstan yongs kyi bdag po thams cad mkhyen pa rdo rje 'chang tA la'i bla ma'i tham ka zhes 'khod pa'i gser tham phul/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa lngar bod rgya khyab khag gi rdzong gzhis su nag can dong bcug dang mtha' 'bud btang ba'i nyes can mtha' dag la mi 'jigs srog gi sbyin pa bstsal/shing 'brug (1784)lor nor gling skal bzang pho brang gsar bzhengs kyi chab bzhugs mdzad sgo rgya che gnang ba de nas bzung sku phreng rjes ma rim byon nas dbyar thog phal cher rgyun bzhugs mdzad de rim pas rgya bskyed gnang/shing sbrul (1785)lor bkra shis lhun por chibs bsgyur gyis paN chen mchog sprul rin po che'i dbu skyes gtsug phug 'bul bzhes dang 'brel/rje btsun blo bzang dpal ldan bstan pa'i nyi ma phyogs las rnam rgyal dpal bzang po zhes pa'i mtshan gsol mdzad pa dang/dge bsnyen gyi bslab sdom bstsal/me lug (1787)lo'i zla ba drug pa'i nang zhwa dmar ba'i g.yog gras karma mchog sbyin sogs kha shas kyis sa na lam rgyus byas te bod khongs gnya' nang dang/rong shar/skyid grong bcas sa mtshams khang gsum la gor Sha'i dmag gis glo bur du btsan 'dzul byas/sa sprel (1788)lor gor Sha skyid grong du bzhag pa'i bod gor chings don dang rgyal 'gal gyis bod la btsan 'dzul thengs gnyis pa byas te gtsang shes dkar bar dmag gis bcom/bkras lhun gyi sku gsung thugs rten sogs brku 'khyer byas/gor dmag gis rkyen pas skyid grong bsam gtan gling gi dge 'dun phal cher yul rgyar nas lha sa'i phyogs la chibs gshis rgyal dbang 'jam dpal rgya mtsho mchog nas lcags khyi (1790)lor grib tshe mchog gling gi dgon pa phyag btab/dgung grangs sum cu so dgu'i lor rtse pho brang du bzhugs pa'i sku 'dra che chung bzhi stong la nye bar zhal gser spyan 'byed gyi sri zhu mdzad/(chu byi (1792)lor dngul zho gang skar lnga'i ring thang can gyi bod Tam gsar 'grengs gnang/lo 'dir rgya bod kyi dpung bshams te gor dmag rnams phal ches mthar skrod btang/lcags bya (1801)lor rgyal dbang ma chog gis mkhan po mdzad de kun gzigs paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma mchog la bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa phul/dga' ldan 'khyil pa zhes de lta'i byams khang na dang brten par bcas pa gsar bzhengs gnang/chu phag (1803)lor hal ha rje btsun dam pa ho thog thu bod phebs kyis rgyal dbang mchog la bsnyen rdzogs dang gal che'i dbang bka' rjes gnang sogs zab chos 'ga' shas gsan/rgyal dbang mchog gis dge ba'i bshes gnyen yongs 'dzin dpal ldan ye shes dang/phur lcog ngag dbang byams pa/byang rtse ngag dbang chos grags/yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan sogs gus sbyor gyis tshul bzhin bstan mkhan thog thugs rus chen pos gsan bsam mthar phyin mdzad/bstan pa'i bya ba rlabs chen po gyis ris med da dang gdul bya rnams dge ba'i lam yangs por bkod/(yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan gyi rnam thar )dang/(mkha' 'gro ma sgyu ma chen mo lha lnga'i dkyil chog bde chen 'jug ngogs )(bla ma'i rnal 'byor gyi rim pa phyogs gcig tu bsgrags pa dbyar skyes sprin gyi sgra dbyangs )sogs bka' rtsom mang du mdzad/mthar dgung lo bzhi bcu zhe bdun bzhes pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing byi (1804)lo'i bod zla bcu pa'i tshes bco brgyad nyin pho brang chen po po ta lar gzugs sku'i bkod pa chos dbyings su thim tshul bstan par mdzad/sku gdung po ta'i gser sdong dge legs gzi 'bar du bzhugs}
rgyal ba lung rtogs rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng dgu pa )khams ldan chos 'khor dgos kyi nye 'gram chos 'khor dpon tshang (sku phreng dgos pa'i yang srid dang lhan du lha sar 'byor rjes gnas thob che mthor song zhing phyis su bod kyi sku drag che gras lcang lo can zhes pa de yin )du yab bstan 'dzin chos skyong dang/yum don grub sgrol ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing glang (1805)lo'i bod zla bcug nyis pa'i tshes gcig nyin ngo mtshar gyi ltas bzang po dang bcas sku 'khrungs/dgung lo gsum pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me yos (1807)lor rgyal ba'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin zhus te lo de'i bod zla dgu par yab tshang sku 'khor dang bcas ldan zhing du gdan drangs/sa 'brug (1808)lo'i bod zla gnyis pa'i tshes bcu bzhi nyin kun gzigs paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma mchog nas dbu skra gtsug phun bzhes te/mtshan blo bzang bstan pa'i dbang phyug lung rtogs rgya mtsho zhes gsol/yongs 'dzin du 'on rgyal sras sprul pa'i sku dang/de mo ho thog thu thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho gnyis bsko gzhag gnang ba ltar gsan bsam la rtse gcig tu gzhol bar mdzad/lo de'i bod zla dgu pa'i tshes nyer gnyis nyin po ta la'i tshoms chen srid zhi phun tshogs 'jigs bral gser gyi khri 'phang mthon por zhabs sor 'khod/lcags rta (1810)lor pho brang chen po'i zhabs brtan lha khang steng shod/shar brgyud skor/gsol thab steng shod/sa bza' khang steng shod/gzi chung 'gag sogs kyis mtshon pho brang chen po'i shar nub/lho byang shing tu rgya che ba dang/nye skor gyi gzhung khang bcas zhig gso legs par mdzad/chu bya (1813)lo'i bod zla dgu pa'i nang paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma mchog gtsang nas gnad zhu dang 'brel ston pa lha las babs pa'i dus chen gza' skar 'phrod sbyor bzang ba'i nyin mchog sprul rin po ches dge tshul gyi sdom pa rnam par dag pa bzhes te mur smrig rgyal mtshan sgreng ba rnams kyi gtsug rgyan du gyur/rgyal dbang sku phreng dgu pa mchog sku na phra yang/sku yon gsan bzhes kyi mdzad sgor gus rtag sbyor ba'i thugs brtson lhag par che bas/dbus 'gyur gdan sa'i chos spyod phal mo che thugs 'dzin grub pa ma zad/skal bzang rgyan phreng dang/rgyan 'jug gnyis/mdzod rtsa ba sogs rgya gzhung du ma thugs la bzhugs shing/yongs 'dzin rnam gnyis las tshan ma gsum gyi gzhal bya'i gnas kun la 'bebs pa'i bsdus gzhung gi brtsi bzhag legs par bzhes nas bdag nyid kyi dang bca' 'dzin la mkhas pa dang/gzhan gyi dam bca' yang mi dag pa bsun 'byin pa la mkhas pa'i tshul bzhes pa sogs bstan 'gror sman pa'i lugs gnyis kyi gtsug rgyan dam par 'gyur ba'i re 'bras ma smin gong dgung grangs bcu gcig la phabs par byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing phag (1815)lo'i bod zla gnyis pa'i tshes bcu drug nyin lo bur du dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim/sku dgung po ta la'i gser gdung sa gsum mngon dga' ru bzhugs}
rgyal ba tshul khrims rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu pa )mdo khams sgang drug tu grags pa'i nang tshan spo 'bor sgang gi khongs gtogs li thang shog drug sgro mdongs su 'bod pa'i sa 'i char grong stod nor bu tshang bya ba'i khyim du yab blo bzang snyan grags dang yul rnam rgyal bu khrid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me byi (1816)lo'i bod zla gsum pa'i tshes nyer dgu nyin sku bltams/dgung lo drug par rgyal ba'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin zhus/chu rta (1822)lo'i bod zla dang po'i tshes bco brgyad nyin kun gzags paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma mchog nas snye thang bde ba can du chung srid rin po che'i dbu skra gtsug phud bzhes te/mtshan ngag dbang blo bzang 'jam dpal tshul khrims rgya mtsho dpal bzang po zhes gsol gnang mdzad thog /zla ba gnyis pa'i tshes bcu gsum nyin rab tu byung ba'i bslab sdom yang 'bul bzhes gnang/lo de'i zla brgyad pa'i tshes brgyad nyin rgyal dbang mchog pho brang chen po po ta la'i gzim chung nyi 'od 'khyil bar phebs skyod kyis mi 'jigs gser khri chen por zhabs sor 'khod/dga' ldan shi ge thu su ma ti pak+Shi dang/dga' ldan khri zur ngag dbang snyan grags/sprul sku 'jam dpal ye shes bstan pa'i rgya mtsho bcas yongs 'dzin dub sko gzhag mdzad de chu srid rin po cher sku yon sgron 'go tshugs/rgyal dbang mchog sku chung dus nas slob gnyer la thugs brtson che bas/gtso bo mdo sngags gzhung lugs rgya mtsho'i gsan bsam la gcig tu 'grus par mdzad pa'i mthu las lung rtogs kyi sku yon rnam par rgyas/sa glang (1829)lor 'bras spungs dgon du bka' chos gsan sbyong thog /de nas se ra dgon pa sogs su chibs bsgyur mdzad/lcags stag (1830)lor dbus phyogs rdzong gzhis khag gi gzhung sger chos bcas la sa zhing dang/rjes 'brel rkang 'gro lag 'don gyi khral rigs tshang ma mos snyom zhib gcod kyis sa gnas so so'i sde snod dang/gtso drag /rgan po/sa bdag gzhis byes 'khur mnyam len thog nas sa rab 'bring mtha' gsum la bskor te sger chos 'don dang/gzhung rgyugs krang du brtsis pa'i rtsis khang phun tshogs bkod pa'i rtsa 'dzin lcags stag zhib gzhung zhes pa'i bde gzhi gtan 'bebs gsar bsgrigs gnang/shin rta (1834)lo'i zla bzhi pa'i tshes bdun nyin kun gzigs paN chen rin po ches rgyal dbang mchog la bsnyen rdzogs kyi bslab sdom yang dag par 'bul bzhes legs par bskyangs/lo der rgyal dbang mchog nas khal kha rje btsun dam pa dang/thog rgod rgyal po rnams la gzim chung du dmigs bsal mjal kha dang/chos 'brel gnang ba ma zad/thor rgod rgyal po'i zhu mos ltar/thor rgod yul du dus 'khor sgrub mchod gsar 'dzugs byed par grwar tshang grwa rigs ched rdzong mdzad/mthar dgu grangs nyi shu rtsa gnyis la phebs pa mi bye (1836)lo'i bod zla dgu pa'i tshes gcig nyin gzim chung phun tshogs 'dod 'khyir du khri'u shing gi khar byams pa'i bzhugs stangs kyis bzhugs te/bzhad mo'i rnam pa bcas mdzad bzhin pa'i ngang mdzad pa'i mtha' ma bya ngan las 'das pa'i tshul bstan par mdzad do/_/sku gdung rin po che po ta la'i gser gdung khams gsum rgyan mchog tu bzhugs}
rgyal ba mkhas grub rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gcig pa )mkhas grub rgya mtsho mchog ni khams kyi dar rtse mdo'i khongs mi nyag mgar thar dgon pa'i nye 'dabs su man chos kun brtsegs gshis tshang (phyis su phun tshogs khar gsar zhes sa'i nang yab gzhis phun khang zer ba de yin )du yab tshe dbang don grub dang yum g.yung drung bu khrid bya ba gnyis kyi rigs sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa khyi (1838)lo'i bod zla dgu pa'i tshes gcig nyen sku bltams/lcags glang (1841)lo'i bod zla gnyis par dbus ljongs su gdan zhus thog /zla ba lnga par rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu pa chen po'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin zhus/zla drug pa'i tshes lnga nyin kun gzigs paN chen blo bzang bstan pa'i nyi ma mchog nas dbu skra gtsug phud bzhes ste mtshan mkhas grub rgya mtsho zhes gsol/lo der la dwags dang sing pa bsgril ba'i dmag dpung khyod ches mnga' ris bskor gsum la btsan 'dzul byas/chu stag (1842)lo'i bod zla bzhi pa'i tshes bco lnga nyin pho brang chen po po ta la'i gser khrir zhabs sor 'khod/me rta (1846)lo'i bod zla bzhi pa'i tshes bdun nyin kun gzigs paN chen rin po ches mkhan po mdzad de lha ldan jo bo rin po che'i sku mdun du rgyal dbang mchog rab byung gi bslab sdom bzhes/lo 'dir rgyal rtse dang/pa snam khul sa mi zhib gcod bsko stsal gyis gzhung rgyugs khral tsho ma zin pa'i nyam thag dngos 'brel rnams sger chos khag la glang ske bel 'dogs lta bur rtsis sprod dang/sa zhing rgya che bar ma dor 'phrol 'khyil bsdad pa rnams lar rkang gzhung gsar bkod tog /me ga zhib gzhung zhes rtsis khang las khungs kyi rtsa 'dzin ma deb gtan la phab/sa sprel (1845)lor nor gling bskal bzang pho brang gi dbu g.yab gzim chung gsar rgyag dang/de'i phyi lo nas gzim chung chab zhugs rjes 'brel chos ra'i nang gar pa rnams nas gar rol rtsed 'jo'i gzigs mo 'khrab ston byas pa 'di ni nor gling du zho ston gzigs mo'i srol gtod pa yin/de nas bzung je rgyas su phyin te lo ltar zho ston zhes zlo gar lha mo ba rnams dang/skabs re rme ru grwa tshang gi dge 'dun pa rnams nas spos sangs skabs nor gling pho brang du sangs rgyas dang/byang chub sems dpa' rnam par thar pa 'khrul ston byed pa sogs kyi srol 'dzugs mdzad/chu byi (1852)lo dang/chu glang (1853)lo so sor rgyal dbang mchog gdan sa gsum la gnas bsam dbu 'dzugs kyi grwa skor dang/dad bsdus ser skya khri stong la mjal kha dang bka' chos gnang thog lho khul ga gnas gzigs sogs la phebs lo 'dir kun gzigs paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma mchog dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim pa'i tshul bstan par dgongs rdzongs thugs smon rgya che dang sbrags mchod sprin gnad smin rgyas par mdzad rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shis yos (1855)lo'i bod zla dang po'i tshes bcu gsum nyin rgyal dbang sku ngo mas bod kyi chos srid gnyis ka'i thugs 'gan bzhes kyang lo 'di'i hor zla bcu gnyis pa'i tshes nyer lnga'i tho rengs stag gi dus pho brang po ta las sku mya ngan las 'das gdung rin po che po ta la'i gser gdung phan bde'i 'od 'bar du bzhugs}
rgyal ba 'phrin las rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gnyis pa )rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me 'brug )1856)lo'i zla bcu gnyis pa'i tshes gcig nyin rgyal ba sku phreng brgyad pa'i yab gzhis te lha klur yab phun tshogs tshe dbang dang yum ri chen g.yu sgron gnyis kyi sras su sku bltams/me sbrul (1857)lo'i bla bcu par chu srid rin po che lha sar gdan drangs/sa rta (1858)lo'i zla dang po'i nang rgyal dbang gong ma'i yang srid rin po cher ngos 'dzin thugs gtan 'khel/tshes bco lnga nyin srid skyong rwa sgreng rin po ches dbu skra gtsug phud bzhes te mtshan ngag dbang blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan 'phrin las rgya mtsho zhes gsol/lcags sprel (1860)lo'i zla bdun pa'i tshes gsum nyin mchog sprul rin po che pho brang chen po po ta la'i gser khrir mnga' gsol/chu khyi (1862)lo'i zla gnyis pa'i nang rgyal dbang mchog chos srid gnyis kyi 'gal bzhes gnang dgos byung yod/de skabs sku na phra stabs phyag rogs su bka' zur bshad sgra dbang phyug rgyal por srid skyong bsko bzhag mdzad/shing byi (1864)lo'i zla bzhi pa'i tshes bcu gsum nyin lha ldan gtsug lag khang gi jo bo shAkya mu de'i spyan sngar yongs 'dzin khri zur blo bzang mar rab dbang phyug gi drung las rgyal dbang mchog gis rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/sa 'brug (1868)lor gong sa mchog cho 'phrul smon las chen mor tshogs phebs gnang/de nas bzung rgyal dbang mchog tshogs phebs gnang ba'i 'og tshugs/lcags rta (1870)lor rgyal dbang mchog gdan sa chen po dpal ldan 'bras spungs dang/se ra theg chen gling so sor sngar lam grwa bskor dam bzhes su chibs bsgyur mdzad rjes rtse pho brang du phyir phebs gnang/chu bya (1873)la'i zla gnyis pa'i tshes bcu bzhi nyin lugs gnyis kyi thugs 'gan yongs su bzhes/shing khyi (1874)lor rgyal dbang mchog sngar lam ltar gdan sa chen po dga' ldan rnam par rgyal ba'i gling du grwa bskor dam bcar chibs bsgyur dang/de nas chos 'khor g+r+yal sogs lho khul gnas gzigs la thebs te de khul dad ldan ser skye mi dmangs la mjal phyag dang chos 'brel sogs yid kyi re 'dod skong bar mdzad/lo 'dir rgyal dbang mchog nas khal kha rje btsun dam pa'i yang srid bstan 'dzin dbang phyug la dge tshul gyi bslab sdom bstsal cing de 'brel khal kha'i khu ral mkhan po/tA bla ma sogs la gnang rten yang bstsal/mthar dgung grangs nyi shu'i ngor phebs pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing phag (1875)lo'i zla gsum pa'i tshes nyi shu nyin rtse po ta la'i gzing chung nyi 'od kyi bzhugs khri chen mo'i sku mdung du bde stan thog sku bzhugs gnang mur sku mya ngan las 'das pa'i tshul bstan/sku gdung rin po che po ta 'i gser gdung tshe sbyin 'od 'bar du bzhugs}
rgyal ba thub bstan rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa )khong ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng rim byon gyi nang nas chos srid rig gnas gang ci'i thad la gzhan 'gras ma mchis pa'i mkhyen dpyod dang dgongs pa zab la dkyel che ba dang/dus babs kyi 'gyur ldog la tshod dpag gnang mkhas pa/bcas shugs che ba'i phya nang gi dgar bo dang/bzlog thabs bral ba'i dga' ngal gang la'ang zhum pa med pa'i thugs stobs brtan pa'i sgo nas rgyal kha len phod par mdzad mkhas pa zhig yin/khong rab byung bco lnga pa'i me byi (1876)lor dwags po glang mdun du yab kun dga' rin chen dang/yum blo bzang sgrol ma gnyis kyi sras su sku 'khrungs/rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu bya (1933)lor sku gshegs/dgung lo nga brgyad bzhugs/sku 'khrungs pa'i lo de rang la sa gnas srid gzhung gis rgyud ston mkhan zur blo bzang dar rgyas chog grwa dang bcas gzhung bsten srung ma'i gtso bo khag gi lung bstan ltar bod shar phyogs kyi yul phyogs mang por brtag dpyad byed par btang mthar dwags po glang mdun du 'khrungs pa'i yang srid de rnyed nas paN chen rin po che sku phreng brgyad pa dang srung ma khag bcas tshang mas tA la'i bla ma'i yang srid 'khrul med yin par ngos 'dzin gcig mthun byung ba bzhin lo de rang la bod sa gnas yongs su gtam snyan dril bsgrags byas rjes man ching srid gzhung la sngar lam gser bum brtag dpyad zhu ma dgos par thag gcod chog pa'i snyan zhu phul ba ltar chog mchan bkod/dgung lo bzhir phebs pa sa yol lor dwags po nas lha sar gdan drangs/gung thang gtsug lag khang du paN chen rin po che dang mjal phrad gnang thob rab byung dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes te mtshan la ngag dbang blo bzang thub bstan rgya mtsho 'jigs bral dbang phyug phyogs las rnam par rgyal ba'i sde zhes gsol/dgung lo nyi shur phebs pa shing lug (1895)lor yongs 'dzin phur lcog rim po che byams pa rgya mtsho'i drung nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/gung lo nyer bzhes phebs pa sa phag (1899)lor dge bshes rabs pa'i grwa skor mtshan bzhes gnang zhing/dge lugs/rnying ma bcas kyi chos skor rgya cher gsan/sku tshe gang po'i mdzad pa gtso gras rnams phyogs bsdus byas khag gnyis te/gcig srid dbang bzhes pa'i rjes nas dbyin 'gog dmag 'khrug gi bar/rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing lug (1895)lor skya ser mchog dman tshang mas re 'dun zhus pa ltar srid dbang phyag tu bzhes te/sku na phra yang srid don gyi bya gzhag che chung gang cir gzhan dring mi 'jog pa'i sgo nas bkod 'doms kyis khyab par mdzad cing/mngon chung thams mkhas kyi thog nas mchog dman bar gsum gyi bde sdug dang/bod ljongs phyi nang gi gnas tshul legs nyes gang ci rtog zhib byed mkhan thugs blos 'khel ba skabs dang bstun te gtong gnang mdzad pas dbu skor g.yu zhus kyi dbang dumi 'gro ba dang/zhi drug gi lan don che chung gang la yang zhun pa yod pa'i shes ldan mi snar deng 'jog dang skul spyod mdzad mkhas pa zhig yod/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pas srid dbang skyong gnang ba'i dus skabs de ni/mes rgyal nang khul dang 'dzam gling thog gnas tshul rnyog 'dzings che zhing lha par man ching srid gzhung gis phyi nas yong ba'i dgra bo'i btsan 'dzul gyi mdun du gnyod chung nus med kyi rnam 'gyur bstan pa dang/nang khul du mi rigs grangs nyung dang/de'i nang nas bod kyi las don skor la rgyas gces lhag bsam can gyi dpon rigs dang rgya che'i mang tshogs bcas kyi drang bden bya spyod la rgyab skyor byed rgyu lta bzhag /bsam ngan khog bcangs kyi sgo nas 'gog gnod bya thabs bzung yod pa dang/go skabs de dang bstun nas dbyin ji btsan rgyal ring lugs pas kyang bod sa gnas su btsan 'dzul byas te/dmag don gyi 'jigs skul 'og drung bden min pa'i chings yig snga rjes 'jog dgos byung ba sogs rnyog 'dzin dang dka' ngal ha cang che ba'i dus skabs shig yin/gnas tshul de 'dra'i 'og tA la'i bla ma mchog nyid kyis da dung btsan rgol rgyal gces kyi langs phyogs mtha' 'khyongs gnang ste bod sa gnas kyi nyen kha'i gnas tshul skor man ching srid gzhung la re 'bod yi ge thengs mang gtong gnang mdzad kyang rgyab skyor byed rgyu lta zhog /ma nyes khag g.yogs kyi skyon brjod byas yod 'on kyang sku ngo mas man ching srid gzhung la dge skyon gnas lugs thad kar gsungs na bden pa'i rgyab skyor thob pa zhig yong ba'i re ba gnang nas rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing 'brug (1904)lo'i bod zla drug pa'i zla dkyil du lha sa nas zhal gyes khar dga' ldan khri chen blo bzang rgyal mtshan rang nyid kyi sku tshab tu bskos nas lam thag ring po'i sku ngal la ma 'dzems par byang lam brgyud thog mar phyi sog du phebs shing/de nas sgo mang spi ti sprul sku dang/khar kha rje btsun dam pa'i gsol dpon bcas rang nyid kyi sku tshab tu mngags rdzongs kyis pe cin du gtong gnang thog /man ching gong ma kon zhus yum sras mjal nas zhib phra'i bka' mos zhu rgyu'i yi ge 'bul bar mdzad/'on kyang skabs der man ching sring gzhung gis btsan rgyal dbyin jir 'jigs snang chen po byas pa tsam las bod kyi gnod don skor tA la'i bla ma'i dgongs bzhed dang mthun pa 'i thag gcod yag po byung na rgya bod mi rigs bar gyi mthun sgril dang/mes rgyal gong bu gcig gyur sngar las sra brtan tu 'gro ba thub pa'i gal che'i gnas babs te gtan nas ma mthong ba'i dbang gis kha ya ma byas pa ma zad/da dung lha sdod am ban yu'i thas kyi bsam 'char ltar tA la'i bla ma thub bstan rgya mtsho'i mtshan gnas med pa bzos te/tA la'i bla ma gsar pa ngos 'dzin dang bsko gzhag byed dgos zhes thengs dang por bka' phab pa dang dus mtshungs dbyin ji btsan rgyal ring lugs pas kyang yul tha'i a ban dang nang gros byas te tA la'i bla ma mchog bod du phyir phebs gnang rgyu bkag 'gog gang thub byas rkyen tA la'i bla mas u ru su hra hrong gong mar 'brel ba gnang ste dbyin ji bod nas mthar skrod gtong thub pa'i re ba gnang yang/ri pin dang su ru su gnyis dmag 'khrug g+r+yag pa'i nang su ru su pham nyes byung bar brten dbyin jis bod du btsan 'dzul byas pa'i don gnad skor byed rgyu'i nus pa med pa bcas phyi nang gnyis ka nas btsir gnon byas pa'i dbang gis me rta (1906)lor phyi sog nas sku 'bum dgon par phebs te lo ngo gnyis btsam bzhugs dgos byung/man ching srid gzhung gis tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i mtshan gnas med pa bzod pa der bod kyi rgya che'i mi dmangs kyi ngo rgol shugs chen phog par brten gzhi nas sa sprel (1908)lo'i zla bdun par gong ma kong shus blon chen zhig mngags te 'phral du pe cing du gong ma dngos mjal gnang rgyu'i chog mchan bkod pa ltar ri bo rtse lnga brgyud/pe cin du phabs nas bod kyi gnas tshul zhib phra zhu gnang thog /phyin chad bod kyi gnas tshul skor bod sdod am ban sogs gsham 'og gi dpon rigs brgyud ma dgos pa rang nyid sku ngo mos gong ma rang lar thad kar zhu yig 'bul chago pa'i re bskul gnang yang dgongs bzhed dang mthun pa'i thag chod gang yang ma byas pa ma zad/dus skabs de dang bstun nas de sngon bod sa gnas kyi mnga' khongs nyag rong sa sde rnams phyir len dang/'ba' thang dang pha phreng sogs su yod pa'i bod sa gnas kyi dpon rigs rnams kyi tshab gsar du bskos pa/dgon pa khag la chos lugs las don bcos bsgyur/ngo rgol byed mkhan ha cang mang po dmar gsod gtong ba/kra'o er h+phung si khron dang/bod/yun nan bcas kyi spyi khyi gcig lcogs su bskos pa/bod sdod sam ban lan yus kyis bod sa gnas su srid 'dzin lam lugs mang po bsgyur bcas byas pa/si khron nas dmag mi stong phrag gnyis bod du btang ba sogs byas pa'i rkyen gyis tA la'i bla ma mchog gis man ching srid gzhung la re bcol gnang ba de rbad de stong zad du phyin stabs rgya gar du phebs nas dbyin ji btsan rgyal ring lugs par mthun 'brel ma gnang ka med byung ba dang/skabs der man ching srid gzhung gis slar yang tA la'i bla ma'i mtshan gnas med par bzos pa'i khyab bsgrags thengs gnyis pa byas te dgra phyogs la phan zhing rang la gnod pa'i srid jus mu mthun lag len bas+t+ra bar brten man ching srid gsung gis bod gyi don gdan skor dgongs bzhed dang mthun pa'i thag gcod yag po zhig byed 'dod med par gzigs nas (1929)lo'i bar lo ngo nyi shu'i ring rgya bod bar 'brel lam bcad de bzhugs dgos byung ba'i 'gan gtso bo ni man ching srid gzhung gis khur dgos pa ha cang gsal po yin/tA la'i bla ma mchog gis gzhi rtsa'i thog dbyin ji btsan rgyal ring lugs pa'i lkog g.yo'i ngan jus gsal por mkhyen yod stabs mes rgyal gong bu gcig gyur gyi 'brel lam rtsa ba nas bcad de dbyin jir rgyal rten gnang rgyu'i dgongs pa med pa'i rkyen gyis 1930lor go min tang krung dbyangs dang 'brel gtugs snga rjes rim par gnang ste nan cin du bca' sdod don gcod las khungs gsar 'dzugs thog g.yung mgon mkhan po dkon cog 'byung gnas nan cin du bca' sdod bod kyi mthun mir bsko bzhag bstsal ba sogs btsan rgol rgyal gces kyi langs phyogs mtha' 'khyongs gnang yod/gnyis/rgya gar nas bod du phyir phebs gnang ba nas dgongs pa ma rdzogs bar gyi srid don mdzad rjes skor/rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu byi (1912)lo'i mjug rgya gar nas bod du phyir phebs mdzad rjes dgongs pa ma rdzogs bar du lo ngo nyi shu ga tsam bar srid don mdzad sgo bskyangs ring gdan sa gsum gyis gtsos pa'i dgon pa khag gi chos khrims dag ther nan po gnang ba dang dus mtshungs/gdan sa gsum gyi slob gnyer la snga las lhag pa'i shugs snon dang/nyen can la chad pa dang/byas rjes can la bya dga' gzengs bstod gnang bar brten dgon pa khag gi chos khrims dang slob gnyer gong 'phel du 'gro rgyur skul lcag chen po thebs yod cing/lhag par du bod sa gnas kyi phyi nang las don bcos bap+sagayur byed phyogs skra la rdzong gzhis khag gi 'thus mi'i grog tshogs bskong bsdu gnang bas kho tshos kyang blop+satobs chen po'i sgo nas phan yod kyi bsam 'char mang po bton pa ltar rgyal nang du krung dbyang srid gzhung dang mu mthun 'brel ba rgyun 'khyongs byed rgyu dang/phyi 'brel thog khyim mtshes rgyal khab rgya gar dang 'brel ba btsugs rgyu dang/gdan sa gsum phud pa'i dgon khag dang/srid gzhung gi dpon rigs tshang mas gzhis kha rgya che chung la gzhigs pa'i khral 'jal dgos pa dang phyin chad srid gzhung la khral rgyugs mi dgos pa'i gzhis khag sprod rgyu mtshams 'jog byas nas srid gzhung gi dpon rigs rnams la phogs dngul sprod rgyu/dmag phogs su dngul sprod rgyu bcas rim bzhin phyag len bstar rtsis gnang yang mtho rim dpon rigs dang dgon pa khag gi 'dod blo dang ma mthun pa'i dbang gis don thog tu 'khyol ma thub/gzhan yang khrims khang nang du mang tshogs kyi 'thus mi 'dams te khrims rtsod pa gsar 'dzugs byed rgyu dang/rlangs 'khor 'gro lam bzo rgyu bcas kyang 'gog rkyen mang po phrad de mtshams 'jog gnang dgos byung yod/mtho rim dpon rigs kyi bu phrug nang nas byang ngos pa rig 'dzin rdo rje sogs mi bzhi 'dams nas dbyin ji'i lon ton tu btang ste glog 'don rgyu dang/glog 'phrin gtong len/gter kha 'don rgyu/dmag don sgyu rtsal bcas slob sbyong byed rgyu'i 'gan khur du bcug pa gnang bas/kho tshos slob sbyong thon nas lha sar log rjes gter 'don dang dmag rtsal slob sbyong byed mkhan gnyis kyi las don sgrub ma thub kyang/skyid sbug dbang 'dus nor bus lha sa nas rgyal bar gyi glog 'phrin skud pa 'dzugs rgyu dang/byang ngos pa rig 'dzin rdo rjes lha sar chu shugs glog khang dang 'phrul 'khor bzo grwa chung ba zhig 'dzugs gnyer thub pa byung yod/bod du sman pa dkon pa'i gnas tshul bsgyur bcos dang/gso ba rig pa'i lag len dang sbrag rtsis rig pi rgyun srol nyams chag mi 'gro ba'i ched du 'bras spungs sman pa mkhas dbang mkhyen rab nor bu dge rgan du bskos nas sman rmis khang gsar 'dzugs thog /dbus gtsang/mnga' ris/khams bcas kyi sa gnas khag nas slob gras ba bskongs bsdu byed rgyu'i bka' phab par brten sman rtsis dang skar rtsis rig pa lam khas pa mang po byung yod pa sogs zhib par yig tshogs la 'jigs nas 'dir bkod med/mdor bsdus na tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa ni/chos phyogs nas mdo sngags rig gnas dang bcas par mkhyen rab gyi rtsal yongs su rdzogs shing srin don skyong ba gnang ring phyi nang gnyis ka nas 'gog gnon byed mkhan mang po byung yang zhum pa med pa'i snying stobs kyi sgo nas skabs dang 'tshams pa'i mdzad phyogs zhi drag gnyis ka'i thabs la mkhas pa sogs dgongs pa rgya che zhing gting zab pa yin pa'i skor deng skabs kyi mkhas pa mang po'i rtsom zhig tu gsal}
rgyal ba bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho|{(tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu bzhi pa )rgyal ba sku phreng bcu bzhi pa 'jam dpal ngag dbang blo bzang ye shes bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho ni rab byung bcu drug pa'i shing phag (1935)lo'i zla 5tshes 5nyin mdo smad sku 'bum nye 'dabs stag 'tsher zhes pa'i sar yab cho cho tshe ring dang yum bsod nams skyid gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/(sku mched bdun las sku'i gcen po thu bstan 'gyur med nor bu dang/rgya lo don grub/blo bzang bsam gtan/sku'i gcung po mnga' ris sprul sku/sku'i gcen mo tshe ring sgrol ma dang gcung mo ye shes pad+ma bcas yod )de yang rgyal dbang bcu gsum pa chen po dgongs pa rdzogs rjes bod gzhung gis sngar lugs bzhen yang srid rtsad chod skor bkod 'doms thog /rgyal tshab rwa sgreng rin po che sku dngos lha mo'i bla mtshor ched du mtsho mjal thengs gsum gnang ba'i gzigs snang byung rigs gzhir byas/bod yul so sor mi snag khag bzhes bgos te yang srid rtsad chod skor gang sar 'os sprul dogs 'char tshang ma bsreg bcad brdar gsum bzhin brtag dpyad byas mthar/ke'u tshang sprul sku ngo las nas mdo smad cong kha'i yul gru sku 'brum byas pa gling gi shar smad stag 'tsher zhes par khye'u ngo mtshar gzhan dang mi 'dar ba zhig 'khrugs tshul skad grags che ba dang/yul gya khor yug sogs kyang mtsho gzigs ji bzhin byung bar brten rgyal po'i 'os sprul du lha sar gdan 'dren zhus skabs/gong min tang sa gnas dpon rigs mA pu h+phang {(WP:1,194)}gis blun yon dngul sgor 'bum phrag bzhi tsam dgos lugs zer ba sogs 'gog rkyen mang po 'phrad rung mthar dngul sgor chig 'bum sprad de 'ol sprul dang yab yum 'khor bcas lha sar gdan 'dren zhus/rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa yos (1939)lor rgyal tshab rwa sgreng rin po ches gtsos bod ljongs tshogs 'du rgyas 'dzoms nas mgrin gci gis yang srid ngos 'dzin zhus te chibs bsu ring thung gis gzab rgyas ngang lha ldan nor gling pho brang du gdan drangs shing/phyi lo'i tshes mgor rgyal tshab rwa sgreng rin po che dang mtshan zhabs stag brag ngag dbang gsung rab mthu stobs bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gnyis kyis yongs 'dzin bgres gzhon gyi thugs 'gan bzhes thog /rgyal tshab rwa sgreng rin po ches yang srid mchog gi dbu skyes gtsug phud bzhes par mdzad/rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags 'brug (1940)lor mdzad sgo sogs sngar lugs ltar g.yab rgyas ngang pho brang chen po gru 'dzin gnyis pa'i mi 'jigs gdong lnga'i khri la mnga' gsol legs par zhus/skabs der go min tang krung dbyang srid gzhung gis bod sog su yon lhan khang gi u yon krang wu krung zhin {(WP:1,194)}gtsos pa'i sku tshab mngags gtong byas pa rgyal gar brgyud lha sar 'byor te rgyal ba sku phreng bcu bzhi pa'i khri phebs mdzod sgor zhugs te dga' ston rten 'brel zhus}
rgyal ba mchog dbyangs|{(ngan lam rgyal ba mchog dbyangs kyang zhu )chos rgyal khri srong lde btsan gyi sku dus su byung ba'i sad mi bdun gyi ya gyal/'di nyid kyi 'gyur la/bstan 'gyur las/('phags pa 'jig rten dbang phyug yi ge drug pa'i sgrub thabs yid bzhin nor bu )zhes bya ba slob dpon 'phags pa klu sgrub kyis mdzad pa zhig }
rgyal ba 'jam dpal snying po|{dge lugs pa'i grub mtha'i srol gtod pa po rje tsong kha pa chen po mchog ste cung zhib tsam gsham du tsa sde'i nang tsong kha pa zhes par gsal}
rgyal ba thog rdugs pa grags pa brtson 'grus|{(rgyal ba rin po che grags pa brtson 'grus )rje 'di nyid yab phag gru'i dpon sangs rgyas skyabs dang yum ye shes mtsho rgyal gnyis kyi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i chu phag (1203)lor sku bltams/dgung lo bco lnga la phebs skabs mkhan po ston pa dang/slob dpon lan pa las rab tu byung/mtshan grags pa brtson 'grus su gsol/dgung lo bcu drug la dbus su phebs/dgung lo bcu dgu la 'bri khung du byon/mkhan po stod pa dang las slob shar gling pa/gsang ston yung ba pa rnams las bsnyen par rdzogs/de nas sgrub pa mdzad pas sprul bsgyur nus pa byung/dgung lo sum cu so sum pa rab byung bzhi pa'i shing lug (1235)lo phag gru'i gdan sar phebs nas sku mched nye gnas rdo rje dpal ka bzhi'i dpon byed bzhin yod pa rje 'dis tshur bkug gnang ste khri dpon gyi las ka gnang/gdan sa thel du byas pas phag gru pa dang/rgyal sa sne gdong du byas pas sne gdong pa zhes grags/rgyal ba thog rdugs pas gdan sa lo sum cu so gsum bskyangs/lan cig thog babs pas sku chos kyis gtums pas gnod pa med pas thog rdugs pa zhes pa'i mtshan byung/grub thob smon lam 'bar sogs thugs sras shin tu mang po byung/dgung lo drug re lnga bzhugs/lo rgyus rgyas pa (lho rong chos 'byung )dang (deb ther sngon po )le tshan (nya)pa'i shog grangs 77nas 78bar gsal}
