rgyal ba pa|{gcer bu pa'i grub mtha'i ming gi rnam grangs shig ste/gcer bu pa'i ston pa rgyal ba pa zhes brjod}
rgyal ba 'bum phrag gsum pa|{rje 'di nyid 'jam gsar lha sdings zhes grags pa'i 'dabs khang dmar brag khang du rab byung bdun pa'i chu glang (1433)lor sku bltams/dgung lo bdun pa la sems pa chen po gzhon nu rgyal mchog las rab tu byung/de nas paN chen sangs rgyas seng ge /byang sems blo gros rin chen/dol phrug chos bzang bcas las gzhung chen po la gsan pa btsal/dpal ldan sa skya dgon du bka' bcu'i bshad pa mdzad/'bras yul skyed tshul du kun mkhyen byams chen rab 'byams pa'i zhabs pad bsten/rje 'di dang/rtsed thang sangs lhun/zha lu dka' bcu pa legs bshad bdud rtsi'i mchod pas mnyes te/'bum phrag pa zhes pa'i mtshan snyan thob/de nas sgra pa shes rin dang/shangs pa kun dga' dpa' ldan la sgra ka btsan sogs rig gnas che chung la sbyangs pa dpyis phyin pas paN+Di ta zhes pa'i mtshan thogs/dgung lo sum cu pa la byams chen chos rjes mkhan po/go rams chen pos las slob/zha lu ba dka' bcu pas dus go ba mdzad de bsnyen par rdzogs/dgung lo so gcig pa chu lug (1463)lor ngam rings su sher phyin stong phrag brgya pa la bshad pa'i srol chen mo btod/dgung lo so gnyis pa la blo go smon thang gi chos sder 'bum gyis gtsos pa'i gzhung lugs brgya la mkhas pa'i dga' ston bsgrubs/rgyal blon 'bangs bcas pa ngo mtshar gyi dpal la bkod pas 'dod rgu'i mchod pa rgya cher phul/dgung lo so bzhi pa nas lo bcu gsum ring blo gsal don gnyer nyis brgya skor la legs bshad kyi bdud rtsi ci dgar bstsal/dgung lo zhe bdun pa nas lo bcu'i ring gnas nges med du 'chad pa'i rtsol ba la zhugs/dgung lo lnga bcu nga bdun pa sa bya (1489)lor gtsang ston bsod rgyal gyis mthun pa'i rkyen sbyar te dpal mnyan yod bya rgod gshongs kyi chos grwa chen po btab/de'i phyi lo 'phags mchog klu sgrub rgyal tshab tu dbang bskur/rje nyid lo bcu gsum ring gnas nges med du zab sngags kyi chos kyi 'khor lo bskor/dgung lo bdun cu pa la 'phags mchog dag pa'i dbyings su gshegs pas/rje nyid kyis slar mnyan yod du sngags kyi chos 'khor bskor/ston pa 'khar gnas brtan gyis bskor ba dri'i gtsug lag khang dang bcas pa bzhengs/rje 'di nyid kyis mdo sngags kyi zab chos gsan tshul yang/rje ngor chen yab sras la sa skya ngor lugs/bdag chen rgya gar ba dang rnal 'byor pa bstan 'dzin dpal sogs la sa skya rdzong lugs/bshes gnyen blo gros rgyal mtshan la rje btsun bo dong pa'i dwags po bka' brgyud dang rangs chung snyan brgyud sogs mkhyen rab yod dpal byung la shangs pa bka' brgyud dang ri chos sogs mang du gsan nas legs par dgongs pas dus 'da' zhing/bshad sgrub kyi bstan pa ches cher blo gsal la nges pa bde blag tu skye ba la rje 'di nyid bka' drin bla na med du che/thugs las skyes pa'i slob ma yang/thugs sras 'phags mchog klu sgrub/ar ston/blo gros rgya mtsho/kun mkhyen lcags thang chos rje/rgyal ba dkon mchog dpal ba/lho byang gi lha dbang rnam gnyis/'jam mgon blo gros bkra shis sogs bsam gyis mi khyab pa byon/mthar dgung grangs don gnyis la phebs pa rab byung brgyad pa'i shing byi (1504)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs}
rgyal ba yang dgon pa|{rje 'di nyid la stod lho'i dgon pa lha gdong du yab jo bsam dang yul rnam rgyal ma chos mthong zhes bya ba gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bzhi pa'i chu bya (1213)lor sku bltams/yab kyis mtshan gdung so ba 'bar zhes gsol/dgung lo lnga la phebs skabs yi ge 'bri klog legs par mkhyen/de'i tshe sangs rgyas mi bskyod rdo rje zhes bya ba zhig byon pa la thugs spro snang chen pos 'brel 'dris mdzad thog /bla ma de las mnga' bdag myang gi gter kha'i skor rnams dang zhi byed gsan/dgung lo drug bzhes pa'i tshe phul dmar ba'i thad du byon nas sgyu 'phrul gyi dbang dang rdzogs pa chen po'i rgyud gdangs ngag dang bcas pa dang/bka' gdams/zhi byed/gcod yul/lam 'bras snying po skor zhal gdams rgyab chos dang bcas pa'i chos dpag tu med pa gsan/der lo gsum bzhugs/dgong lo dgu pa la lha gdong gi gdan sa mdzad/bu chung gi dus nas mon par shes pa mnga'/de nas bla ma ko brag pa/rgod tshang pa/sa skya paN chen/rje spyan snga/sangs rgyas ras chen sogs las chos mang du gsan/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gnyis pa la mkhan po lha btsun sog kha pa/las slob ko brag pa/gsang stod drod chung/las gral ba brgyad cu'i drung du bsnyen par rdzogs/mtshan rgyal mtshan dpal du gsol/phyis shrI ri gnas ldings kyi dgon pa btab/der lo gcig bar rdo rje skyil krung du bzhugs/bu le la sogs pa'i gnas rnams su yang khrid skyang zhing dben pa bsten/spyir sku'i snyan pa che bas phyogs mtha' dag nas 'dus pa'ip+salob ma khri phrag brgal/ri chos skor gsum dang ma drug la sogs pa'i brtsams chos kyang mang du mdzad/slob ma yang spyan snga rin ldan dang/lo ras chos skyong dpal/dar ma rgyal mtshan gnyis/zur pa rin chen dpal sogs kyis gtsos rtogs pa dang ldan zhing 'jig rten la chags pa'i sgrub pa po mang du byung/mthar dgung lo zhe drug la phebs pa rab byung bzhi pa'i sa rta (1258)lor gshegs}
rgyal ba yum|{sangs rgyas rnams kyi yum dang 'dra ba'i zab mo stong pa nyid}
rgyal ba rigs lnga|{rnam snang dang/rin chen 'byung gnas/'od dpag med/don grub/mi bskyod pa bcas lnga}
rgyal ba rigs drug|{rnam snang/mi bskyod/rin 'byung/'od dpag med/don yod grub/rdo rje 'chang dang drug tu p+salob dpon pad+mas gsungs so/_}
rgyal ba lo ras pa|{'di phag gru'i brgyud 'dzin grub chen gling ras pa zhes 'brug pa bka' brgyud pa'i chos lugs thog mar 'dzugs par mdzad pa po der slob ma mang du byung ba'i nang nas/slob ma'i gtso bo 'gro mgon gtsang pa rgya ras pa yin cing/de la yang slob ma mang du byung ba'i nang nas sku tshe smad gyi slob ma'i gtso bo lo ras pa dang rgod tshang pa gnyis yin/lo ras pa'i mtshan la grags pa dbang phyug gam dbang phyug brtson 'grus kyang zer/khong rab byung gsum pa'i me lug (1187)lor 'khrungs/gdung rus lo yin pas lo dang/rten las gos 'chang ba'i rnal 'byor pa yin pas ras pa zhes thogs pa yin/rjes su dge slong mdzad/gnas nges med du chos mdzad/dgung lo drug cu re bzhi pa rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags khyi (1250)lor gshegs/lo rgyus rgyas pa rgod tshang pa mgon po rdo rjes mdzad pa dang/(deb ther sngon po )le tshan brgyad pa dang/('brug pa chos 'byung bstan pa'i nyin byed )bcas su gsal bas der gzigs}
rgyal ba'i bka' 'gyur ro cog|{spyir sangs rgyas kyi bka' bod du bsgyur ba dang ma bsgyur ba gnyis las ma bsgyur ba ni shin tu mang zhing/bod du bsgyur ba rnams phyogs gcig tu bsdus pa la bka' 'gyur zer/'di'i skor gyi lo rgyus zhib cha (bka' 'gyur dkar chag )lha sa dpar gsar gyi shing dpar shog grangs 483nas 488bar gsal ba der gzigs}
rgyal ba'i 'khor bzhi|{dge slong/dge slong ma/dge bsnyen/dge bsnyen ma}
rgyal ba'i rgyal tshab|{rgyal ba ni rnam 'dren bzhi pa sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa ste/bdud bzhi'i g.yul lam sdig pa'i tshogs ma lus par pham par mdzad pas na rgyal ba zhes brjod/rgyal tshab ni rnam 'dren lnga pa byams pa mgon po ste/bdag cag gi ston pa shAkya thub pa ni/sngar sangs rgyas 'od srung gi spyan sngar bram ze'i khye'u bla mar gyur nas/tshangs par spyod pa spyad de tshe 'phos nas dga' ldan gyi gnas su lha'i bu dam pa tog dkar po (shAkya thub pa dga' ldan yid dga' chos 'dzin na bzhugs pa'i mtshan )zhes bya bar skye ba bzhes te/dga' ldan chos kyis mtho ba zhes bya ba'i khang bzang du seng ge'i khri la bzhugs nas lha'i 'khor dpag tu med pa la chos ston cing bzhugs/chos kyi sgra 'byung ba'i sil snyan dang glu dbyangs rnams kyi mchod pa mang pos mngon par mchod par byed do/_/dus ji tsam na/'dzam bu'i gling gi gdul bya rnams gdul ba'i dus la bab pa dang/sngon gyi smon lam gyi mthu dang/sangs rgyas rnams kyi byin rlabs kyis rol mo'i sgra de dag las byang chub sems dpa' 'dzam bu'i gling du byon pa'i dus la bab pa'i lung bstan/de nas byang chub sems dpas 'khor rnams la kho bo 'dzam bu gling du 'tshang rgya ba'i phyir 'gro'o zhes gsungs pas/de thos pa'i mod la dga' ldan gyi lha rnams yid shin tu skyo bas byang chub sems dpa'i zhabs gnyis la 'jus te/skyes bu dam pa khyed mi bzhugs na dga' ldan gyi gnas 'di mdzes par mi 'gyur ro/_/slan chad kyang ston par 'os pa su zhig yod ces zhus pas/khyed rnams sdug bsngal bar ma byed cig byang chub sems dpa' byams pa 'dis khyod rnams la dam pa'i chos ston par 'gyur ro gsungs nas/rang gi la thod dang cod pan byams pa'i dbu la bcings te/skyes bu dam pa khyod ni nga'i 'og tu dga' ldan na chos bstan nas de rjes 'dzam bu'i gling du mngon par rdzogs pa 'tshang rgya bar gyur ro/_/zhes lung bstan te/dga' ldan du chos ston pa'i rgyal tshab tu dbang bskur nas gzigs pa rnam pa bzhi'am lngas 'jig rten du gzigs nas dgun dus 'das de dpyid kyi dus dpyid zla tha chung skar ma sa ga nya ba'i tshes bco lnga rgyu skor rgyal dang ldanapa 'i dus sbyor la dga' ldan gyi gnas nas 'pho bar mdzad do/_}
rgyal ba'i stobs bcu|{bsam pa'i stobs/lta ba'i stobs/sbyor ba'i stobs/shes rab kyi stobs/smon lam gyi stobs/theg pa'i stobs/spyod pa'i stobs/rnam par 'phrul pa'i stobs/byang chub pa'i stobs/chos 'khor bskor ba'i stobs so/_}
rgyal ba'i bstan pa|{sangs rgyas chos lugs pa rnams kyi bshad srol la/sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyis gdul bya rnams thar pa dang thams cad mkhyen pa'i go 'phang thob pa'i ched du bstan pa'i lam srol de la sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa zer zhing de la nang gses kyis phye na lung gi bstan pa dang rtogs pa'i bstan pa gnyis yod/lung gi bstan pa nas da snod gsum la thos bsam dang 'chad nyan byed pa la zer zhing/rtogs pa'i bstan pa ni thos bsam byas pa'i don rnams ring nyid kyis lag len bstar ba dang sgom sgrub byed pa la zer ba dang/de 'dra'i gang zag la bstan 'dzin gyi skyes pu zhes gsung srol yod}
rgyal ba'i dus chen bzhi|{cho 'phrul chen po'i dus chen/mngon par byang chub pa'i dus chen/chos kyi 'khor lo bskor ba'i dus chen/lha las bab pa'i dus chen no/_}
rgyal ba'i mdo bcu|{1 shes rab snying po'i mdo/2 'da' ka ye shes bsgom pa'i mdo/3 bzang po spyod pa smon lam gyi mdo 4 rdo rje rnam 'joms khrus kyi mdo/5 byang chub ltung bshags bshags pa'i mdo (phyag 'tshal ba'i phung po/bshags pa'i phung po/bsngo ba'i phung po/) 6 de'i steng gtsug tor gdugs dkar mo bzlog pa'i mdo/7 gos sngon can ni gzungs kyi mdo/8 a yu dz+nyA na tshe'i mdo/9 nor rgyun ma ni longs spyod kyi mdo/10 yi ge gcig ma snying po'i mdo'o/_}
rgyal ba'i dpe byad bzang po brgyad cu|{(mngon rtogs rgyan )las/thub pa'i sen mo zangs mdog dang/_/mdog snum mtho dang sor mo rnams/_/zlum rgyas byin gyis phra ba dang/_/rtsa mi mngon dang mdud pa med/_/lang bu mi mngon zhabs mnyam dang/_/seng ge glang chen bya dang ni/_/khyu mchog stabs gshegs g.yas phyogs dang/_/mdzes gshegs drang dang 'khril bag chags/_/byi dor byas 'dra rim par 'tsham/_/gtsang dang 'jam dang dag pa'i sku/_/mtshan ni yongs su rdzogs pa dang/_/sku yi kho lag yangs pa dang/_/gom snyoms pa dang spyan gnyis ni/_/dag dang gzhon ca can nyid dang/_/sku zhum med dang rgyas pa dang/_/shin tu brims pa'i sku nyid dang/_/yan lag shin tu rnam dbyes dang/_/gzigs pa grib med dag pa dang/_/sku zlum skabs phyin ma rnyongs dang/_/phyang nge ba dang lte ba ni/_/zab dang g.yas phyogs 'khyil ba dang/_/kun nas lta na sdug pa dang/_/kun spyod gtsang dang sku la ni/_/rme ba gnag bag med pa dang/_/phyag ni shing bal ltar 'jam dang/_/phyag ris mdangs yod zab ring dang/_/zhal ni ha cang mi ring dang/_/mchu ni bim pa ltar dmar dang/_/ljags mnyen pa dang srab pa dang/_/dmar dang 'brug gi sgra nyid dang/_/dpung mnyen 'cham dang mche ba zlum/_/rno dang dkar dang mnyam pa dang/_/byin gyis phra dang shangs mtho dang/_/mchog tu dag pa dag dang ni/_/spyin yangs pa dang rdzi ma stug /pad ma'i 'dab ma 'dra ba dang/_/smin tshugs rings dang 'jam pa dang/_/snum dang spu ni mnyam pa dang/_/phyag ris rgyas dang snyan mnyam dang/_/nyams pa rnam par spangs pa dang/_/dpral ba legs par 'byes pa dang/_/dbyes che ba dang dbu rgyas dang/_/dbu skra bung ba ltar nag dang/_/sdug dang 'jam dang ma 'dzings dang/_/mi bshad dri zhim skyes bu yi/_/yid ni 'phrog par byed par dang/_/dpal gyi be'u dang bkra shis ni/_/sangs rgyas dpe byad bzang po bzhed/_/ces pa ltar ro/_}
rgyal ba'i dbang po yab sras|{'di bod kyi lo rgyus thog shod srol la paN chen rin po che ni mgon po 'od dpag med kyi rnam sprul yin zhing/tA la'i bla ma ni mgon po 'od dpag med kyi thugs sras spyan ras gzigs kyi rnam sprul yin pas/chos lugs kyi dbang du byas na paN chen rin po che ni yab dang/tA la'i bla ma ni sras yin zhing/tA la'i bla ma dang/paN chen ser ti ni sku phreng rim byon rnams su bgres pa des bla ma dang gzhon pa des slob ma gnang te phan tshun bar chos lugs kyi dbang du byas na bla slob kyi 'brel pa ltar gus zhabs brtsi bkur gnang srol dang/srid kyi dbang du byas na tA la'i bla ma ni bod sa gnas kyi chos srid gnyis ka'i bdag po yin pas/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa dang/paN chen er te ni sku phreng dug pa bar dngos 'brel blo slob kyi 'brel pa ha cang yang po yod kyang/rjes su bod sa gnas kyi bka' shag dang paN chen nang ma sgang gi zhabs gras tsho'i bar mthun sgril med par 'gal zla je cher song ba'i rkyen byas/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa dang/paN chen er ti ni sku phreng dgu pa bar phran bu'i thugs nang mi mthun pa byung te/de'i rkyen gyis paN chen rin po che yang byang lam brgyud nas sog yul dang mes rgyal nang khul du bros byol la phebs dgos byung ba ma zad/bod du phyir log phebs bzhed kyi rdza skye rgu mdo bar du phebs kyang/bod sa gnas kyi bka' shag nas paN chen rin po che'i sku srung dmag nang zi ling nas btang ba'i rgya rigs kyi dmag dpung mang po yod par khag btags nas bod du phyir log phebs su ma bcug pa'i rkyen byas/sa gnas de gar dgongs pa rdzogs pa sogs byung yod/krung hwa mi dmangs spyi mthun rgyal khab dbu brnyes pa'i rjes su krung dbyang mi dmangs srid gzhung dang bod sa gnas srid gzhung gnyis bar bod zhi bas bcings 'grol 'byung thabs skor gyi gros mthun bzhag rjes paN chen rin po che sku phreng bcu pa yang bod du phyir log phebs te tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu bzhi pa dang phan tshun thugs nang dag pa'i mthun sgril bzang po byung nas lo rgyus thog lus bsdad pa'i bod sa gnas kyi bka' shag dang paN chen nang ma sgang gnyis bar gyi rtsod gzhi yang mthun 'brel legs po'i thog nas thag gcod thub pa byung}
rgyal ba'i myu gu|{rgyal ba ni sangs rgyas dang/de'i myu gu zhes pa byang chub sems pa ste/de sangs rgyas kyi gras dang 'dra ba'i cha nas btags pa yin zer}
rgyal ba'i mdzad chen brgyad|{lhums zhugs/bltams pa/rab tu byung ba/sangs rgyas pa/chos 'khor bskor ba/cho 'phrul bstan pa/lha las babs pa/myang 'das}
rgyal ba'i mdzad pa bcu gnyis|{dga' ldan gyi gnas nas 'pho ba dang/lhums su zhugs pa dang/sku bltams pa dang/btsun mo'i 'khor gyis rol pa dang/bzo yi gnas la mkhas pa dang/khyim nas mngon par byung ba dang/dka' ba spyad pa dang/byang chub snying por gshegs pa dang/bdud sde bcom pa dang/mngon par byang chub pa dang/chos kyi 'khor lo bskor ba dang/mya ngan las 'das pa'i mdzad pa rnams so/_}
rgyal ba'i yab rje bsod nams dar rgyas|{tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i yab ste/thog ma 'bras spungs pa'i grwa rigs dkyus ma (rdob rdob )zhig yin zhing/lo mang po'i bar smon lam gyi dge g.yog (dge bskos kyi g.yog po )byas/de nas rjes su sku drag cig gi g.yog por li thang du phyin nas chos 'tsho ma zin par khyim tshang bzung ba yin zhing/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng rim byon gyi yab gzhis rnams sa gnas srid gzhung dang/se 'bras dge gsum/sku drag che khag bcas kyi pha gzhis nas gras rgyab nas 'jugs dgos shing lha sar khang pa bzung nas gzhis chags pa nas yab gzhis zer la/yab gzhis drug byung ba ste tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i yab gzhis bsam 'grub pho brang/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa dang bcu gnyis pa'i yab gzhis lha klu/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gcig pa'i yab gzhis phun khang/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i yab gzhis glang mdun/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu bzhi pa'i yab gzhis stag tsher/yang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu pa'am gang rigs kyi yab gzhis g.yu thog bcas drug yod}
rgyal ba'i yon tan gsum|{de'i sku gsung thugs kyi yon tan}
rgyal ba'i lung ston pa bzhi|{rigs la gnas pa lung ston pa/sems ma bskyed pa la lung ston pa/de bskyed ma thag la lung ston pa/lkog tu mngon sum du lung ston pa}
rgyal ba'i sras po ye shes grags pa|{'on rgyal sras rin po che zhu ba'i sprul sku zhig /'di'i lo rgyus gsal ba ma mthong}
rgyal ba'i gsung rab yan lag dgu|{gleng gzhi/rtogs brjod/de lta bu byung ba/skyes rabs dang bzhi gcig tu bsdus shing/mdo sde dbyangs bsnyad sogs brgyad rnams so/_}
rgyal bu jim kim|{hor rgyal po'i sras shig gi ming}
rgyal bu thi mur sbo kha|{'di bod yig gi lo rgyus su hu pi li se chen han gyi bu yin par bshad}
rgyal bu mong kha ldan sku mched|{jing ger han gyi btsun mo che ba la bu bzhi byung ba'i bzhi pa tho los la/bu bzhi ste/mong gol han dang hu pi li/hu la'i hu/a ri b+ho ga bcas yin/hu pi li phyogs gcig dang bu gzhan gsum phyogs gcig byas te srid dbang 'phrog pa'i 'thab rtsod byung ba'i skor (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )gyi le tshan (pa)karma pa k+Shi'i rnam thar gyi thad du gsal}
rgyal bu rarna shris|{rgyal po rin chen dpal/yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma mi rabs bcu gcig pa yin/rab byung drug pa'i chu sprel (1332)lor zla ba gsum ring srid dbang bzung nas 'das}
rgyal blon gyi yon tan drug|{(mkhas pa'i rna rgyan )las/gnas dang/bsdums dang/'thab pa dang/chas dang/nor gtong/zhen brten pa/'di dag ni rgyal po dang blon po la dgos pa'i yon tan drug go}
rgyal dbang chos rje blo bzang 'phrin las rnam rgyal|{rje 'di ni spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu dgu pa'i 'go tsam la 'khrungs/sku gzhon dus ser smad grwa tshang du chos zhugs mdzad nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bzhes gnang/rje 'dis rgyal dbang bcu pa tshul khrims rgya mtsho dang bcu gcig pa mkhas grub rgya mtsho sku phreng gnyis kyi mdzad rnam dang ('jam mgon bla ma tsong kha pa chen po'i rnam thar thub bstan mdzes pa'i rgyan gcig ngo mtshar nor bu'i phreng/) (rigs dang dkyil 'khor rgya mtsho'i khyab bdag khri chen rdo rje 'chang blo bzang ye shes bstan pa rab rgyas dpal bzang po'i 'khrungs rabs dang rnam thar mkhas pa'i mgul rgyan/) (bla ma mchod pa dngos grub 'dod 'jo/) (phyag chen rtsa ba'i gsung bshad zin bris zag med bdud rtsi'i bum bzang )sogs pod chen bzhi lhag bzhugs/'khrungs 'das dang mdzad rnam zhib par ma rnyed}
rgyal mo ga gon|{nyung ma che legs shig }
rgyal mo rngul chu|{chu bo 'di ni gdang la'i lho phyogs a mdo rdzong khongs nas babs te nag chu dang/'bri ru/sbra chen/sog /dpal 'bar/steng chen/lho rong/dpa' shod/mdzo sgang sogs rdzong khag brgyud nas yun nan tan bzhur rjes 'bar ma'i sar wun gtsang po brgyud mthar rgya gar rgya mtshor 'bab/bod khongs su rgyal mo rngul chu'i bzhur rgyun ring tshad spyi le chig stong sum brgya dgu bcu go gsum yod pa dang bzhur yul rgya khyon spyi le gru bzhi ma chig 'bum khri med nyis stong lnga brgya tsam yod pas chu bo 'di ni bod kyi chu chen gnyis par grags}
rgyal mo g.yu sgra snying po|{rgyal po mu ne btsan po dang/lo tsA ba bai ro tsa na/rgyal mo g.yu sgra snying po gsum gyis ldan dkar ta mo rar bka' nges pa'i lung don man ngan rnams rgya skad las bod skad du bsgyur/de nas g.yu sgra snying po tsha ba'i yul du bzhud ces grags}
rgyal rtse chos rgyal rab brtan pa|{rab byung bdun pa'i sa sbrul (1389)lor sa skya dpon chen kun dga' dpal gyi khyim du 'khrungs/na tshod dar la bab pa'i tshe sne dgong gong ma'i gzim dpon byas te yun ring ma song bar rgyal rtse rdzong gi dpon du bskos/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa lnga pa chu sbrul (1413)lor lcang ra chos sde btab/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa drug la phebs pa shing rta (1414)lor myang chu'i thog lcang lo zam chen btsugs/dgung lo sum cu pa sa khyi (1418)loral ta'i si tu'i 'ja' sa thob/le der mkhas grub rje rgyal rtser gdan drangs te dpal 'khor chos da dgon btab/sku tshe smad kyi mdzad pa ma rnyed}
rgyal rtse dpal 'khor bde chen|{bod ljongs gzhis rtse sa khul khongs myang chu stod rgyud kyi rgyal rtse rdzong du yod pa'i dgos pa zhig ste dgos pa der dge lugs grwa tshang bdun dang/sa lugs bzhi/zha lu ba gcig /dus 'khor ba bzhi/sa dge thun mong gsal khang 'og pa bcas bcu bdun la bla khag bcu bdun yang zer}
rgyal rtse tshong spyi|{shing yos (1915)lo bod dbyin 'brel ba tshugs rjes rgyal rtse nas gnas su tshong spyi mkhan chung gcig bsko gzhag gnang zhing/de'i las 'gan ni skabs der rgyal rtser dbyin ji'i sbrag tar babs tshugs la lag bcas btsugs yod pa de dag la do dam dang/dbyin chi'i tshong don spyi khyab ngo las dang/slob grwa'i dge rgan che chung/dmag mi bcas rgyal rtse ljang lor bca' sdom gtan 'khel rjes dbyin ji'i mi snar gzan shing dar/gzhan yang yul babs kyi nye mkho spus 'don/bod phrug dbyin ji'i skad yig slob grwa ba rnams bskong 'gugs kyi bkod sgrig byed phyogs/tshong don 'gag sgo'i las don bcas la spyi 'doms rgyal rtse spyi mkhan chung dang/rgyal rtse rdzong sbrel zhogs 'degs kyis las don sgrub dgos pa bcas red}
rgyal tsha rin chen|{(rgyal tsha rin chen mgon )rab byung gnyis pa'i sa khyi (1118)nas rab byung gsum pa'i shing yos (1195)lo bar dgung lo don brgyad bzhugs/'gro mgon phag mo grub pa'i dngos slob yin/dgong lo lnga bcu rnga bzhi pa/rab byung gsum pa'i lcags yos (1171)lor zhang btsun dbon chung zer ba'i sa cha khro phu la sa rin sprad nas nyos pa gnang/dge 'dun nyi shu tsam 'dus pa'i dgos pa btab nas gnas gzhi bzung/de nas dar spel byung ba la khro phu bka' brgyud byung/lo rgyus rgyas pa (lho rong chos 'byung )shog grangs 133nas 134bar gsal}
rgyal tshab dar ma rin chen|{dga' ldan khri thog gnyis pa thams cad mkhyen pa dam pa rin chen mchog ni rab byung drug pa'i shing 'brug (1364)lor yab blon po rba'i rigs rgyud rta dpon pa dang/yum jo mo shes rab ma gnyis kyi sras su gtsang nyang stod kyi yul du 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu par gnas rnying dum khan chen rin chen rgyal mtshan gyi drung du rab tu byung/mtshan dar ma rin chen du gsol/de nas slob dpon dpal mgon pa'i drung du yi ge 'bri klog phul du phyin par bslabs/bka' bzhi pa rin chen rdo rje dang/rje btsun red mda' ba gzhon nu blo gros sogs mkhan chen du ma spyi bor bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/lhag par du rje btsun red mda' ba las phar phyin dang/tshad ma/'dul ba/mngon pa/dbu ma sogs mdo phyogs kyi gzhung rnams dang/gsang 'dus sogs gsang sngags kyi gzhung phal che ba gsan sbyong gnang ste red mda' ba'i thugs sras rab 'byams pa bdun gyi nang tshan rtsol bzang mchog gyur gyi mtshan yang thogs/de nas sa skya dang/gsang phu/rtsed thang bcas su pu ti dka' ba bcu'i grwa skor gnang/rong ston shAkya rgyal mtshan dang mkhan chen g.yag pa sogs sa skya'i mkhan chen rnams dang rtsod gleng lags par mdzad de mkhan pa'i grags pa thob nas dka' bcu pa'i mtshan rtags bzhes/bod la dka' bcu pa zhes pa'i mtshan yang thog mar 'di nas byung bar grags/dgung lo nyer lnga pa la bsnyen par rdzogs/de nas dbus phyogs kyi grwa sa rnams su grwa skor mdzad/'jam mgon bla ma'i grags pa gsan pas rtsod pa mdzad par gnyal gyi ra grong du byon pas rje bdag nyid chen po'i sku gsung thugs kyi yon tan la shin tu dad de slob ma'i gtso bor gyur/lo bcu gnyis kyi bar du rje rin po che'i zhabs phyir rgyun mthud nas dga' ldan gsar bzhengs kyi mkhar las kyang bsgrubs/rje'i chos gsungs tshad gsan/gsan tshad bzung/bzung tshan brjed du ma bcug par mdo sngags mtha' dag la thogs pa med pa'i mkhyen pas mkhas pa rnams legs bshad kyis yid 'phrog par mdzad cing/rje tsong kha pa zhing gzhan du gshegs khar rje 'di la dbu paN dang sku ber gnang ste gdan sar bzhugs par don gyis go bar mdzad pa bzhin 'dus ba 'dzin pa dang gnas brtan rin chen rgyal mtshan sogs bu slob thams cad kyis mgrin gcig tu gsol ba btab pas/dgung lo nga drug pa rab byung bdun pa'i sa phag (1419)lor rje thams cad mkhyen pa zhing gzhan du gshegs pa dang rje 'di dga' ldan gser khrir phebs te khri pa'i gdan rabs gnyis par gyur cing/rgyal tshab ces pa'i mtshan thob/khri thog tu lo ngo bcu gsum bzhugs ring 'chad rtsod rtsom gsum gyi bya ba rgya cher spel/rje bdag nyid chen po'i rnam thar bzhin du 'dul ba'i 'chad nyan dang/gzhi gsum gyi phyag len sogs rnam par dag pa dang/gsang sngags spyi dang khyad par du gsang bde dus 'khor kyai rdor 'jigs byed rnams kyi rgyud kyi bshad pa rim gnyis kyi khrid sogs mdor na bod snga ma rnams kyi blo'i spyod yul du ma gyur pa'i ja bla ma'i legs par bshad pa mtha' dag rang gi nyams myong dang lung rigs dri ma med pas 'chad par mdzad pas rje'i dngos slob phal che ba dang skal ldan rnam dpyod can mtha' dag rang dbang med par yid 'phrog ste rje rin po che dang khyad par med pa'i gus 'dus mdzad par brten pha rjes bus zin pa rje'i bshad sgrub kyi bstan pa rkang tshugs par gyur/de nas dgung lo re brgyad la phebs pa lcags phag (1431)lor mkhas grub dge legs dpal bzang dga' ldan khri thog gsum par rang gi rgyal tshab tu dbang bskur/dgung lo re dgu la phebs pa rab byung bdun pa'i chu byi (1432)lora'i bod zla lnga par rtse po ta lar chos dbyings su gshegs/gsung las skyes pa'i slob ma mkhas pa ratA bkra shis dang/byams pa gling pa/rin chen dpal/'dul dga' ba grags pa dpal ldan/blo gros mgon po/gling smad yon rgyam pa chen po rin byang pa/'dul 'dzin bsam 'phel ba/sangs rgyas bzang po/blo brtan pa/dpal ldan bzang po sogs bstan 'dzin gyi skyes bu dam pa shin tu mang po byung/bstan bcos kyang (rnam 'brel gyi rnam bshad thar lam gsal byed )dang/(rnam nges dgongs pa rab gsal/) (rigs thigs kyi TIk+ka rin po che'i gter mdzod/) (tshad mdo'i mthar 'dzin gdung sel/) (shes rab kyi pha rol du phyin pa'i man ngag gi bstan bcos mngon par rtogs pa'i rgyan gyi 'grel pa don gsal ba'i rnam bshad snying po/) (dbu ma rin chen phreng ba'i rnam bshad snying po'i don gsal ba )la sogs pa'i gzhung chen po'i 'grel pa dang/gsang 'dus dang/dus 'khor sogs kyi bka' rtsom gcig tu bsgril ba pod chen brgyad bzhugs so/_}
rgyal tshab pa'i skyes rabs bdun|{'o bran dpal gyi dbang phyug /rje btsun zhi ba 'od/go shri dpal 'byor don grub/grags pa dpal 'byor/grags pa don yod grub/dpal ldan grags mchog dbyangs/nor bu bzang po'o/_}
rgyal tshab ma pham pa|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa 'dzam bu'i gling 'dir skye ba ma bzhes gong dga' ldan du lha'i bu dam pa tog dkar po skye ba bzung nas bzhugs pa sku mya ngan las 'da' khar rang gi slob ma byams pa mgon po rgyal tshab tu bskos nas mtshan la ma pham pa zhes btags pa la brten nas byams pa mgon po'i mtshan gyi rnam grangs su ma pham pa zhes grags pa'i lo rgyus yod/zhib par bka' 'gyur nang gi (mdo rgya cher rol pa )dang (mdzad brgya dpag bsam 'khri shing )sogs su gsal}
rgyal mtshan|{mi mthun phyogs las rgyal ba'i rtags mtshan mtshon byed du srog chags gsum gyi mtshan ma yod pa la rgyal mtshan zhes zer/srog chags gsum ni mthun thabs med pa'i dgra bo yin pa dung dang chu srin gnyis dang/nya dang sram/seng ge dang khyung bcas yin zhing/dung dang chu srin 'dus pa las byung ba'i phru gu lus po dung la mgo dang mjug ma chu srin yin pa zhig byung ba dang/nya dang sram 'dus pa'i phru bu gus po sram la mgo bo nya yin pa/khyung dang seng ge 'dus pa'i phru bu song po seng ge la gshog pa yod pa dang mgo bo khyung yin pa bcas byung ba der zer}
rgyal rabs|{bod yig thog 'khod pa'i lo rgyus zhig cha'i nang gses dang po ste/de ni mi rigs rang nyid dang/'brel yod mi rigs gnas dag gi dus rabs rim byung skabs kyi srid dbang bzung mkhan rgyal po dang/blon po/de bzhin de'i skabs kyi dpal 'byor dang/chab srid/rig gnas stobs shugs khyab khongs sogs gsal por bris pa la zer/de la nang gses kyis phye na/dus skabs de rang gi mis bris pa rdo ring gi yi ge dang (rba bzhed )lta bu dang/sngar gyi lo rgyud dpyad gzhi'i yig cha gzhir bzung nas phyi rabs kyi rtsom pa pos bris pa (rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )lta bu sogs yin}
rgyal rabs lnga|{lha tho tho ri snyan shal lam lho sho sho ri snyan btsan/khri snyan gzung btsan/'brong snyan lde'u/stag ri gnyan gzigs/gnam ri srong btsan no/_}
rgyal rabs dpag bsam ljon shing|{byang ji ston pa shes rab 'bum gyis brtsams pa'i bod kyi lo rgyus deb ther zhig gi ming/dpe cha 'di da phan 'bad rtsol chen po byas kyang ma rnyed cing/(rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )sde dge dpar ma'i shog grangs 28par gsal bar/rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po nas srong btsan sgom po'i yab gnam ri srong btsan yan chad kyi lo rgyus rgyas par bshad yod kyang chos dang 'brel ba'i lo rgyus med stabs 'dir ma bris pa dang/blta 'dod yod na de dag tu ltos zhes gsal ba ltar na/gong gsal gyi rgyal rabs dpe deb der dpyad gzhi mang po yod tshod 'dug }
rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long|{'di sa skya'i bla ma dam pas sa 'brug lo la brtsams zhes gsal ba ltar na/dgung lo bcu bdun pa sa 'brug gang yang na dgung lo don bdun sa 'brug gang rung yin dgos pas brtag /'di skor khri pa rin chen 'od zer gyis mdzad pa'i bstan rtsis su dogs gcod yod pa khungs dag par snang ngo/_}
rgyal sras|{rgyal ba'i sras te/theg chen tshogs sbyor dang sa bcu la gnas pa'i byang sems 'phags pa rnams so/_/de rnams ni sangs rgyas kyi thugs las skyes pa'i sras yin la/sras zhes pa'ang theg chen mthong lam thob pa'i tshe sangs rgyas rnams kyi rigs su skyes pa dang mthar sangs rgyas pa na sangs rgyas kyi gdung 'tshob pa dang/de'i tshe chos 'khor bskor ba sogs sangs rgyas kyi bya ba byed pa'i rgyu mtshan gyis sras zhes pa yin}
rgyal sras kun tu bzang po|{byang chub sems dpa' nye ba'i sras brgyad kyi nang tshan zhig ste/rang rgyal gyi si khron zhing chen du yod pa'i glang chen 'gying ri ni byang chub sems dpa' kun tu bzang po'i bzhugs gnas yin zer srol yod}
rgyal sras kyi spyod pa drug|{sbyin pa dang/tshul khrims/bzod pa/brtson 'grus/bsam gtan/shes rab bcas drug go}
rgyal sras kyi mdzad pa chen po gsum|{dang po thugs bskyed/bar du tshogs bsag /mthar sangs rgyas mngon du mdzad pa}
rgyal sras kyi sems bskyed dam bca' bzhi|{sems can thams cad bsgral ba/dgrol pa/mngon par byang chub par bya ba/yongs su 'da' bar bya 'dod}
rgyal sras sku mched gsum|{po to ba dang/spyan snga ba/phu chung ba rnams so/_}
rgyal sras rtag tu ngu|{shes mdo brgyad stong pa'i rtag ngu'i le'u skabs gsungs pa bzhin rang gi yongs 'dzin byang chub sems dpa' chos 'phags 'tshol ba'i bsam pa las gzhan sems par med pa'i sgo nas nyin mtshan 'da' bar byas pas na byang chub sems dpa' rtag tu ngu zhes mtshan snyan yongs su grags pa zhig byung}
rgyal sras thogs med bzang po dpal|{rje 'di nyid rab byung lnga pa'i shing lug (1295)lor lho phul chung du sku bltams/dgung lo bcu bzhi la phebs skabs bsam gling pa dpal 'bar dang/rin chen dpal bzang gi drung tu rab tu byung/mtshan bzang po dpal zhes gsol/dgung lo bcu lnga pa la bo dong ser slob dpon kun dga' rgyal mtshan pa'i drung du mngon pa sogs gsan sbyong mdzad/'jam dbyangs nyi ma rgyal mtshan pas mngon pa las dri ba gnang bar lan thogs med du btab pas/thogs med bzang po dpal zhes snyan par grags/de nas dpa' lo dang bu dol chos rje bla ma sogs pa'i mkhas grub dam pa bsten nas dgung grangs bcu dgu pa la bshad pa'i dga' ston spel/dgung lo nyer gcig pa nas 'chad po'i ring lugs bskyangs/dgung lo nyer dag pa la byang sems rin mgon dang/nam mkha' sangs rgyas thogs las bsnyen par rdzogs/dgung lo so gnyis pa nas zhe gcig gi bar du bla brang lta ra'i gdan sa mdzad/de nas e'i chos kyi khrir gsol ba btab kyang ma gnang bar/dpang lo chen po spyan drangs te e'i chos kyi khrir mngal gsol/bshad sgrub kyi bstan pa ches lhag par bsgrubs te re bdun lor dbus su byon/slob ma'i mchog ni bu dol chos rje bla ma lo chen byang rtse sogs mtha' yas pa byung zhing/gtso bo'i rgyud 'dzin ni dpal ldan seng ge sogs yin/dgung grangs don lnga la phebs pa rab byung drug pa'i sa bya (1369)lor zhi bar gshegs}
rgyal sras me tri pa|{(mnga' bdag me tri pa )phyi nang gnyis ka'i grub mtha' la mkhas pa'i paN+Di ta chen po zhig /de nas bla ma mar pa la brgyud pa'i lta ba bod du dar ba la phyag rgya chen po'i lta ba zhes bka' brgyud chos lugs kyi phyag rgya chen po'i lta ba'i khungs khong la thug pa yin zhes gsung}
rgyal srid sna bdun|{rgyal srid sna bdun las 'khor lo rin po che ni sngon dus 'khor los bsgyur ba'i rgyal po rnams kyi bsod nams kyi stobs las pho brang gi rtse nas bden tshig brjod pas shar phyogs kyi nam mkha' nas rgyal po'i mdun du babs te gang du 'gro 'dod pa'i yul der 'khor lo des sna drangs nas 'gro ba dang/de dang mnyam du rgyal srid gzhan rnams kyang 'byor 'ongs pa de yin/nor bu rin po che ni mdog mthing ka dri ma med pa 'od kyis dpag tshad brgyad cu ma du snang bar byed pa'i nus pa dang ldan pa/gling bzhi'i 'gro ba thams cad kyi dbul phongs sel ba/'dod rgu yid bzhin du skong ba la sogs pa'i yon tan dang ldan pa de'o/_/btsun mo rin po che ni gzugs mdzes shing blta na sdug pa/bud med kyi skyon thams cad dang bral zhing yon tan dang ldan pa/yid du 'ong ba'i dri dang reg bya dang ldan pa la sogs pa de'o/_/blon po rin po che ni rnam thos kyi bu lta bur longs spyod dpal 'byor phun sum tshogs pa/rgyal pos stong gsum gser gyis khongs shig ces bskal stsal na'ang skad cig gis sgrub nus shing gtong phod che ba'i bsod nams dang ldan pa'o/_/glang po chen po che ni thar dkar mche ba drug dang ldan pa spyi gtsug dmar zhing dpangs mtho ba/nor bu'i dra bas g.yogs shing glang phal ba stong gi stobs mnga' ba/shin tu mgyogs khyad dang ldan pa glang chen sa srung gi bu lta bu'o/_/rta mchog rin po che ni mdog sngon po rma bya'i mgrin pa'i spu lta bu yid du 'ong ba/nad med cing 'tsher skad kyis 'dzam gling khyab pa/rgyal po'i thugs la gang shar shes pas cang shes pa/'dzam gling nyin gcig la lan gsum bskor nus pa'i bang shugs rlung dang 'dra ba rta yi rgyal po cang shes pa la ha lta bu'o/_/dmag dpon rin po che ni snying stobs dang ldan pa/sgyu rtsal dang g.yul 'gyed pa'i thabs la mkhas pa/dpung tshogs yan lag bzhi dang bcas pa/gzhu bdungs pa tsam gyis pha rol gyi dgra sde thams cad dpa' zhum pa'i gzi byin bstod par dkar ba rgyal po 'phags skyes po lta bu yin no/_}
rgyal srin yan lag bdun|{rje bo/blon po/yul 'khor/rdzong/mdzod/dmag dpung/grogs}
rgyal srung dgon|{{(WP:1,194)}pe cing grong khyer nang gi nang bstan dgos pa che gras shig ste de yang lho byang gnyis las bya nga ma ni thog ma yon rgyal rabs kri yod khri lo nyer gcig pa (1284)lor skrun 'go brtsams te ta ru'u phrung go'i dgon zhes 'bod cing ming gong ma shon rde khri lo bzhi par (1429)lor tA lung hran dgon zhes dang khren hwa khri lo brgyad par (1472)tA lung hran rgyal sras dgon zhes btags/dgos nang rdo ring thog rgya yig las tA lung hran hu'u go hre zhes 'khod yod pas pe cin ba rnams kyi kha rgyun la rgyal srung dgon rang du 'bod/dgon nang man ju shun tsi lo'i skabs bzhengs pa'i bod yig rdo rig thog dgon pa 'di'i rten gyi gtso bo dus gsum sangs rgyas dang rjes su chos rgyal 'phags pa'i sku yin zhes dang/yang dgon pa de'i khang rim bcu pa'i rgyab ngos steng thog khang mig gsum gyi 'og rim rab gsal nang bla ma'i mchod rten gcig yod par rdo thal dkar po gsol/spyir 'phags pa bla ma'i ma chod rten du grags zhes sogs 'khod yod cing/'phags pa bla ma ni 'gro mgon chos 'phags kyi mtshan gzhan yig yin par nges/bod rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu sprel (1932)lor mchod rten 'di cha shas log skyon byung skabs tsha tsha'i mchod rten chung ngu gang sar rnyed rgyu yod pas de bod lugs kyi mchod rten chung gras shig yid pa gor ma chag }
rgyal gsol|{srung mar mchod 'bul mnga' gsol gyi cho ga bsgrub pa}
rgyal lha khang dang byams pa spun gsum|{'phan po rgyal lugs lhas kyi lha khang zhes pa de'i bsdus ming la rgyal lha kha zhes 'bod cing/grong khyer lha sa lhun grub rdzong gi mtsho stong grong tsho'i nye 'dabs su yod/'phan po rgyal lha khang ni bod kyi bstan pa phyi dar skabs bzhengs pa'i gnas gzhi che gras bzhi'i nang gses shig yin pa dang/lha khang de ni bstan pa'i me ro smad nas gso mkhan gyi gtso gras klu mes kyi slob ma grags can bzhi'i ya gyal zhang sna nam rdo rje dbang phyug gis bod kyi rab byung ma tshugs gong drug cu skor de'i chu byi (1012)lor phyag btab/khong ni yab sna nam jo sras dang yum zhang lcam sgrol ma'i sras su bod rang byung gong gi lo skor snga ma'i me pho byi ba (976)lor 'khrungs/lcags byi (1060)lor rgyal lha khang du gshegs/khong dgung lo gsum bzhes pa'i sa stag (978)lor 'dul ba'i bstan pa mdo smad khams nas me ro blangs/dgung lo bco brgyad chu mo sbrul (993)lor ra ba zlum po zhes pa'i gnas su klu mes kyi drung nas rab tu byung/dgung lo so bdun pa chu pho byi ba (1012)lor 'phan por rgyal lha khang btab cing/dgon pa de'i mkhan rabs dang po mdzad/lha khang rim bzhin rgya cher btang ba dang/dge 'dun mang du 'dus/rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags byi (1240)lor yon rgyal rabs kyis mngags pa'i blon po dor rta'i dmag bod du 'byor nas rgyal lha khang mer bsregs/ser skya lnga brgya lhag bkrongs/de rjes hor dmag dmag dpon dor rtas shin tu 'gyod nas gser dngul sogs rin chen mang po btang nas lha khang nyams gso byas/lha khang bar pa zhang lhas gsol/dar gyi lha khang gso ma thub/bya grags lha khang gsos pa'i rten gyi gtso bo thub pa bzhengs/rab gnas legs par byas/lha khang 'di'i 'gram du rdo ring zhig kyang yod pa'i gnas tshul zur du gsal/de rjes slar yang gdan rabs nyi shu tsam bskyangs pa'i mkhas dbang mang du byon/de ltar (1953)lo'ibar mkhan brgyud gdan rabs bar mi chad pa byung/rten gtso rje btsun byams mgon kyi 'jim klu thog tshad gnyis lhag tsam zhig yod/lha khang gi sgo 'gram du rdo ring zhig yod pa de'i shar ngos su yig phreng bcu bzhi dang/don tshan bcu yod pa'i yi ge'i nang don ni dkon mchog skyabs su 'dzin pa dang/ngan sems 'gog dgon pa sogs yin/sog po'i dmag dpon dor rta nag pos rgyal lha khang mer sreg skabs byams pa'i sku de mes ma tshig skad/rgyal gyi byams pa de dang/rag ma'i byams pa/klo pa stod kyi byams pa de gsum zhang sna nam rdo rje dbang phyug gis bzhengs par mdzad pa dang/de gsum nyin gcig la mjal thub na byin rlabs shin tu che bar grags/rig gsar skabs gna' shul gsum por gtor skyon byung yang da cha nyams gso zin nas gnas mjal ba mang po yong bzhin yod}
rgyas btab rwa mo che|{sngar rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i dus bod kyi rab byung dang po ma tshugs gong gi lo bdun brgya tsam gyi sngon spyi lo 640nas 650lo'i bar rgya bza' kong jos rgya yi bzo bo mkhas pa mang po bos nas lha khang bzhengs/mes rgyal nas gdan drangs pa'i jo bo shAkya mu ne'i sku sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das dgung lo bcu gnyis pa'i sku tshad yin zer ba yang 'dir bzhugs su gsol/sgo yang rgya nag gi phyogs su bstan nas yod/gtsug lag khang 'di la ming 'bod tshul mi 'dra ba gnyis yod de/1 gtsug lag khang 'di rgya bzas bzhengs pas rgyas btab ra mo che zhes zer ba dang/2 skabs der ra mo che'i steng gi rgya phibs sngar gyi rgya nag gi lha khang tsho'i rgya phibs ltar so phag las bzos pa'i rgya phibs rgyang nas bltas na gcan gzan stag gi spu ris ltar bkra bas na rgya stag ra mo che zhes 'bod tshul gnyis yod pa gang byas kyang chog /lha khang 'di'i nang du bal bzas bal yul nas rten skal du gdan drangs pa'i jo bo shAkya mu ne dang/tsan dan gyi sgrol ma/rje tsong kha pa rang nyid sku bzhugs dus su bzhengs pa'i 'dra sku sogs yod/steng gi lha khang mang che ba dang/tA la'i bla ma'i gzim chung sogs ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa sku 'das rjes nas bzung/sku phreng rim byon skabs rim bzhin rgya bskyed byas pa yin/'di'i lo rgyus zhib cha tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lngas pas brtsams pa'i (gtsug lag khang gi dkar chag )dang/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pas brtsams pa'i (ra mo che'i dkar chag )gnyis su gsal bas der gzigs/rgyal btab ra mo che'i gtsug lag khang la nyams gso mdzad pa'i dkar chag skor rgyal dbang thub bstan rgya mtsho'i gsung 'bum (ca)pa'i nang gsal}
