rgyud stod grwa tshang|{rje kun dga' don grub kyis rab byung brgyad pa'i shing rta (1474)lor rgyud kyi bshad pa btsugs pa nas dpal ldan stod rgyud grwa tshang du grags pa 'di nyid chags pa yin la/de nas 'dus tshogs kyang je 'phel du song/dus der byams pa gling dang chums mda' sogs su bzhugs shing/rje kun dga' don grub kyi sku tshe'i smad tsam la lha sa'i skyid chu rgyas nas chu log gi nyen kha chen po byung nas sde pa skyid shod pas rje kun dga' don grub cho bzlog tu phebs dgos tshul zhes pa ltar chu bzlog mdzad par phan nus mngon gsal thon te lha sa'i grong mi khri stong mang po srog gis 'jigs pa las skyabs pa'i legs 'bul du rgyud stod lha sar phebs skabs kyi bzhugs gnas su ra mo che'i 'du khang (da lta'i gnas yul gyi rten dang brten pa'i skor gsham du ra mo che'i gtsug lag khang zhes par gzigs )de phul skad/'di gar thos bsam mdzad pa po ni dbus gtsang mdo khams sogs nas phebs pa'i grwa rgyun thos bsam slob gnyer don du gnyer ba rnams yin/khong rnams thog mar grwa sa chenapo gsum (se 'bras dge gsum )gang rung du sgrig zhugs gnang nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar sbyangs pa mthar phyin gnang ste thun mong phar phyin theg pa la legs par bslabs/de nas rgyud grwar 'bras bu rdo rje theg pa'i man ngag mthar thug rnal 'byor bla na med pa'i rtsa rgyud kyi don rang rang bshad rgyud kyis gsal bar gtan la phab pa'i paN grub kyi gzhung rnam dag rnams la 'chad nyan gyis/gsang sngags sgras zin tsam ma yin par dgongs pa can gyi gzhung tshig gis nges don gyi snying po sbas te bstan pa rnams la sgro 'dogs legs par bcad de rgyud sde rgya mtsho'i tshig don lami 'jigs pa'i gdengs thob pa'i sgo nas rgyud sde'i snying po nyams bzhes gnang gi yod/rgyud stod grwa tshang gi sgrig gzhi'i mi sna'i khongs su mkhan po dang/bla ma dbu mdzad/byang 'dren che mo/bla ma zhal bltab/bag bde dbu mdzad/de dag gi gnang sgo nas mkhan pos chos lugs kyi gtso 'gan bzhes rgyu dang/bla ma dbu mdzad kyis sgrig lam gnon 'dems dang tshogs 'du'i 'go mdzad rgyu/byang 'dren gyis 'don chos khab gi dbu bskul dang rta 'dur dbyangs sogs 'then gtong gnang rgyu/dge skos kyis rgyun gtan gyi sgrig lam gnon 'doms thog rang thag ma chod pa rnams bla ma dbu mdzad la dgongs skor zhu rgyu dang/chogs su skyabs zhu dang snyan seng/grong chog gtong rgyu sogs gnang dgos/rgyud gzhung byang 'dren gyis byang 'dren che mo tshogs su phebs med na 'dod pa skul rgyu dang/byang 'dren che mo'i phyag rogs zhu rgyu/phyag mdzod lnga pos grwa tshang gi dpal 'byor 'du 'god gyi 'gan 'khur rgyu/chab ril dang/chos ra dkor gnyer gyis dge skos gyi phyag g.yog zhu rgyu/zhal blta bas lag bde (ja thug zhu mkhan )nyi shu rtsa lnga'i 'go byed rgyu sogs yin/grwa tshang gi 'og tu a mdo dang/mi nyag /rong po/phu khang/grags pa bcas khang tshan lnga yod par khang tshan so sor yang khang tshan dge rgan re dang mi tshan dge rgan re yod/las sne che gras bsko gzhag dang grwa tshang gi las don gal che'i rigs tshugs 'du ba ste las sne thon zin rnams tshogs 'du 'tshogs nas gros bsdus byas rjes bla ma dbu mdzad kyis thag gcod gnang dgos pa yin/gdan gsum po gang rung zhig la sgrig zhugs zin nas gzhung chen po bka' pod lnga brgal brtag legs par zin pa'i dge bshes dang/yang na gdan sar bzhugs nas mtshan nyid la sbyangs pa ma gnang yang rgyud don la sbyangs brtson gnang 'dod mkhan zhig yin na rgyud grwa zhugs chog pa yin zhing khong tshor bskyed rim pa zhes zer zhing/mkhan po dang/bla ma dbu mdzad/dgun chos dge skor rnams dge bshes kyis gnang dgos la/byang 'dren che mo dang/dge skos gzhan gnyis bskyed rim pas gnang dgos/dge skos byas zin pa'am yang na dge skos blun pa (gtong sgo btang nas dge skos byed mi dgos pa )rnams la las sne thon zin zhes dmigs bsal gnang re 'ga' ma gtogs rgyun gtan tshogs la phebs mi dgos/gzhis khag gi sde pa (gzhis ka bla ma zer )rnams phyag mdzod khang nas bsko gtong byed cing/phyag mdzod ni 'jig rten gyi 'gro stangs cung mkhas pa zhig la 'os 'dzugs byas te khang tshan re nas grwa pa 'ga' zhig re bsdus thog mgon por zan rtag phul rjes mi lngas 'gan 'khur byed dgos pa dang/phyag mdzod mi lnga nas mi gsum lha sar gtan bzhugs dang mi gcig tsang srad gzhis sdod/gcig gis chos thog gnyer pa byed dgos/'gan 'khur dus tshon lnga re yin pa de'i ring phyag mdzod 'khyur nas rtsis sprod ma zin par grwa tshang dang 'don pa gcig lta bu yin/phyag mdzod zur par las sne thon zin gyi dmigs bsal med/'on kyang skabs re las na thon zin gras nas phyag mdzod byed mkhan yang yod/phyag mdzod khang ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i sku dus su gsar 'dzugs gnang zhing/de'i gong rgyud pa'i dpal 'byor do dam de bla brang zhes mkhan po nas gnang srol yod par/bar skabs shig gtong sgor gtong phyogs dang/spyi 'jog sogs kyi thad 'thus sgo tshang po zhig ma byung stabs mkhan po dang bla ma dbu mdzad bar thugs ma mthun nas gzhung btugs byas par tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pas bka' bcad gnang don du mkhan po dang bla ma dbu mdzad la skal 'phar 'os 'tshams las rgyud grwa'i dpal 'byor 'du 'god rnams phyag mdzod khang gsar btsugs kyis khang tshan lnga po so so nas mi re bsko gtong byas pa de tshos phyag mdzod kyi 'a gan 'khur lo lnga re byed dgos pa'i ring phyag mdzod khang du gtan sdod bya dgos pa lang rang shag tu bsdad mi chog pa dang/bca' btung tshang ma phyag mdzod khang rang nas byed dgos/phyag mdzod kyi las 'gan gtso bo ni chos gzhis dang/chos thog khag gi gtong rtsa skyed 'bab gtong bsdu/rgyun tshogs dang chos thog so so'i gtong sgo gtong rgyu/chos phogs rgyag rgyu sogs dpal 'byor 'du 'god kyi las ka rnams byed dgos kyi yod/phyag mdzod gsar pa'i 'os mi rnams mgon po'i mdun zan brtag zhus nas gang don pa der bsko gzhag byas rjes gsar pa des las 'khur blangs pa dang rnying pa rnams bde gsal zhes pa'i khang pa der spo sdod kyis rtsis sprod byed dgos shing/phyag mdzod rtsis sprod zin rjes rang shag tu bsdad chog pa yin 'dug /rgyud grwar zhugs dus rgyud chas dge rgan dang/snyan seng dge rgan/khrid mkhan dge rgan/dpe cha'i dge rgan bcas yod dgos shing/rgyud chas dge rgan nas zhwa gos lham sogs rgyud chas rnams gra sgrig dgos pa ste/rgyud grwar zhugs pa rnams la rgyud chas zhes gzan gsham stod 'gag sogs grwa pa spyin mtshungs thog da dung chab blug gzer byed shing gi ral gri dang/rgyud gri/chab blug gi 'dogs lung la lcags kye thel tshe chung ngu zhig /rgyab 'jog dang mdun 'jog ces rtsam snod tshogs khug gnyis/gding ba/'bog thag /rgyud phor/zhwa mo rtse zhwa/zla gam/dge slong tshor chos gos sogs dgos pa yin la/lo re rgyud chas rgyug spros ces grwa bgres gzhon dbyer med kyi rgyud chas la mkhan po dang/bla ma dbu mdzad/dge skos bcas nas zhib bsher thengs re gnang srol yod/gzhan yang snyan seng dge rgan gyis bya spyod tshul mthun phyas rgyu'i khag theg dgon pa/khrid dge rgan gyis sgrig lam kun spyod slob ston byed dgos pa/dpe cha'i dge rgan gyis 'don chos rta 'dul dbyangs sogs bslab dgos pa yin/dge rgan ni rgyud du zhugs nas lo bzhi yan phyin pa zhig gis byed dgos la gsar zhugs ma byas gong snyan seng dge rgan des gza' 'khor gsum gyi nang mkhan por snyan seng thengs gsum 'bul dgos/rgyud du zhugs pa'i cha rkyen 'dzoms med tshe snyan seng gsum pa ma phul gong snyan seng 'then chog /tshogs su gting ba bting ba'i nyid nas rgyud pa'i gras su tshud pa yin/de min rgyud stod kyi sgrig lam dang chos thog gi skor sogs zhib pa (rgyud stod kyi sgrig yig gser gyi them skas )dang/phur lcog ngag dbang byams mdzad pa'i (grwa sa chen po bzhi dang rgyud pa stod smad chags tshul )sogs la gsal}
