rgyud drug gi slob dpon drug|{shAkya thub pas sems can byang chub pa'i don du mdzad/phyag na rdo rjes lha srid dbang du bsdu ba'i don du mdzad/'jam dpal dbyangs kyis rgyal bu mu khyud 'dzin gyi don du mdzad/rgya gar mkhan po Ar+ya many+dzu shris chu bo rany+dza ra'i 'gram bu phyi rabs rnams kyi don du mdzad/rgyud chad pa rnams kyi don du slob dpon nA ga rdzu nas rgya mtsho 'gram du klu dbang du bsdu ba'i don du mdzad/slob dpon ny+dza na ka ma la mi tras dal bzhengs dus lha sbyin drangs su khams gsum gyi sems can la sbyin pa gtong ba'i don du mdzad pa rnams so/_}
