rgyud smad grwa tshang|{dpal ldan rgyud smad grwa tshang ni rje tsong kha pa'i dngos slob 'phrin las nam mkha' dang mnyam pa'i chu chen bzhi'i ya gyal rje btsun shes rab seng ges (mdzad rnam zhib pa gsham du rje shes rab seng ge zhes par gzigs )dngos su 'chad nyan gyi rgyun 'dzugs par mdzad pa ste/rab byung bdun pa'i sa phag (1419)lor rje tsong kha pas 'grel pa bzhi sbrags kyi glegs bam phyag tu bsnams nas khyed cag mkhas pa rnams kyi khrod na dpal gsang ba 'dus pa'i rgyud kyi bshad srol 'dzin nus pa su yod ces bka' lan 'ga' zhig stsal ba na/mkhas pa gzhan sus kyang zhal gyis bzhes ma nus pa'i tshe rje shes rab seng ges zhal gyis bzhes par mdzad pas rje tsong kha pa shin tu dgyes te gsang ba 'dus pa'i gser sku dang/'grel pa bzhi sbrags kyi glegs bam/chos rgyal gyi zhal 'bag /'cham gos/dbyug to/zhags pa sogs gnang nas sngags kyi bstan pa'i bdag por mnga' gsol/de nas lo shas rjes gnang phu mthong smon grwa tshang gi bla ma'i mdzad 'khur de rje dge 'dun grub la gtad de rje shes rab seng ge nyid gtsang shab stod lhun po rtser byon pas si tu bsod nams dpal dang bdag mo shAkya dpal gyis sbyin bdag mdzad de rje tsong kha pa'i phyag len bzhin sgrub dkyil bzhengs mchod dang gsang ba 'dus pa'i rgyud kyi bshad rgyun btsugs/srad rin chen rtses pas sbyin bdag mdzad de srad gzhung du dga' ldan pho brang zhes pa'i grwa tshang btab pas gtsang gi srad rgyud ces rgyud stod rnying par grags pa byung/lhun po rtse'i bla rabs bzhi pa 'phags 'od yon tan rgya mtsho sogs kyis chos zhus shing zhabs la gtugs par chos rgyal gyi zhal 'bag dang/'cham gos sogs kyang rten du bstsal/srad dga' ldan pho brang du rgyud kyi rgyal po gsang ba 'dus pa'i 'chad nyan 'dzugs par mdzad nas 'dug nag dpal ldan bzang po 'chad nyan par bsko gzhag mdzad de rje tsong kha pas gnang ba'i 'grel pa bzhi sbrags kyi glegs bam bstsal/de nas dbus phyogs su phebs te chu glang (1433)lor dga' ldan du rgyud kyi 'chad nyan btsugs par dbus kyi rgyud smad ces su grags/de nas bzung rje shes rab seng ge dpon slob rnams phyogs phyog