bsgran bang|{bsgrun bang/'gran bsdur/(tsa) bsgral ba'i zhing bcu bcu po de rnal 'byor kun gyis dang du blangs pa ste 1 dkon mchog gsum gyi spyi dgra 2 slob dpon gyi sku dgra 3 mched lcam kyi dgos dgra 4 rnal 'byor rang la 'khu ba 5 sems can yongs la gnod pa 6 mtshams med pa lnga byed pa 7 rang rgyud ngan pa'i ngang tshul can 8 rnal 'byor pa spyi'i dgrar gyur pa 9 dam las log pa 10 ngan song gsum gcig tu brtsis te bcu'o/_/bsgral ba'i zhing bcur gyur pa ni ma mo srid pa'i rdzogs lung las zhe sdang me ltar 'bar ba dang gcig phrag dog rlung dmar ltar 'tshub pa dang gnyis 'dod chags zhing ltar gtams te gsum gti mug ri ltar spungs te bzhi nga rgyal ser ltar khams te lnga ser sna rtsi ltar 'byar te drug gtum po khro chu 'dra ste bdun gsod gcod srin po 'dra ste brgyad phrag dog rlom pa srin po 'dra ste dgu log chos kha dpon byed de bcu zhes so/_/yang dpal mgon gyi bskul byang las sangs rgyas bstan pa bshig pa dang/_/bla ma'i sku la bsngo ba dang/_/dben gnas gnyen po 'joms pa dang/_/dge 'dun dbyen pa'i dbyen byed dang/_/sems can yongs la 'tshe ba dang/_/gsang sngags chos la smad pa dang/_/rje dgon yo byad rku ba dang/_/bsam gtan pa'i sems dkrugs pa dang/_/skye bo sdig la dga' ba dang/_/dge la sdig par bsgyur byed pa'i/_/bsgral ba'i zhing bcu tshang ba yin zhes gsungs so/_}
