nga phod ngag dbang 'jigs med|{nga phog ngag dbang 'jigs med ni rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags khyi (1910)lor yum hor khang gi sras mo byams pa lags su rgya mar sku 'khrungs/chung dus bod kyi yig rtsis sogs la sbyangs pa gnang/grong drag dmag gi ru dpon gyi 'gan bzhes/nga phod kyi go mag tu phebs te de ga'i ming thog nas zhabs sdod zhus rjes snga rjes su bsher dpang dang/rtsis dpon thog zhib khang do dam/bka' blon sogs kyi go sa bzhes/mi dmangs bcings bkrol dmag chab mdor 'byor skabs mdo smad spyi khyab pa yin/rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags yos (1951)lor bod zhi bas bcings bkrol 'byung thabs skor gyi gros mthun 'jog skabs bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi dbang cha tshang ma yod pa'i sku tshab gnang/bod zhi bas bcings bkrol byung rjes bod dmag khul gang gi si ling yon gzhon pa dang/gong rang skyong ljongs gra sgrig u yon lhan khang gi drung yig che mo/rgyal yongs mi dmangs 'thus tshogs kyi 'thus mi/rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag (1959)lor zing 'khrug lhing 'jags btang rjes bod rang skyong ljongs gra sgrig u yon lhan khang gi kru'u ren gzhon pa/ljongs mi dmangs 'thus tshogs rgyun ud kyi kru'u ren sogs dang/skabs gsum pa dang brgyad pa dgu pa'i rgyal yongs srid gros kyi kru'u zhi gzhon pa dang/skabs bzhi pa nas skabs bdun pa bar rgyal yongs mi dmangs 'thus tshogs rgyun ud kyi u yon krang gzhon pa sogs gnang}
