nga lum sbyar gsum|{nga phod pa rdo rje rgyal po dang/gung lum pa ba bkra shis rgyal po/sbyar ra ba blo gros rgyal po bcas gsum ste rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags byi (1720)lo'i zla 9tshes 15nyin tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho gser khrir mnga' gsol/lcags glang (1721)lor mnga' ris skor gsum gyi gtso bo nga phod rdo rje rgyal po/lam pa bkra shis rgyal po/sbyar ra blo gros rgyal po/pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas bcas bka' blon du bskos pa'i gtso bo da'i ching bA dur gyis mdzad/gong ma khang shis de'i ching bA dur dang/nga 'od par pa'i si zhes pa'i cho lo gnang/bka' blon rnams nas srid dbang lo bdun bskyangs ring phan tshul dad mos dang/nye phyogs sogs kyi rkyen pas rim bzhin mi mthun par gyur te da'i ching bA dur dang/pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas phyogs gcig dang/nga phod/lum pa/sbyar ra gsum phyogs gcig tu gyur skabs pho lha bas da'i ching la dogs zon dgos tshul zhus kyang da'i ching gis do snang ma byas shing/dus der go ma g.yung Teng gis da'i ching bA dur la shes kyi tham ga sogs gzengs bstod kyi bkas mngags blon chen gnyis bcas btang ba lha sar ma 'byor sngon nga lum sbyar gsum sogs kyis da'i ching bA dur med pa bzo bar brtsams/) me log (1727)lo'i bod zla 6tshes 18nyin nga lum sbyar gsum gyis lha sa'i gtsug lag khang gi sgo mchor gyi yang steng tshogs chen khams gsum nang da'i ching la snyan zhu ring po zhig phul bar gzigs bzhin pa'i dus su nga lum sbyar gsum dang/khong tsho'i khongs mis gri rub brgyab ste bkrongs pa ma zad/phyi rol du yod pa'i zhabs phyi dang/mdzod pa/ri mo mkhan sogs kyang bsad/da'i ching gi bzhugs gnas phun tshogs rab brtan dpal 'byor du btsun mo che chung gnyis bkrongs pa sogs byas te nga lum sbyar gsum nas gong ma g.yung Teng la da'i ching gis tA la'i bla mar (sku phreng bdun par )dad gus phra mo tsam yang med pa dang/bod kyi srid dbang sger gcod byed pa/jun gar ba dang ngan 'brel/rgya gar rgyal po dang 'brel ba byas pa sogs kyi nyes pa bgrangs pa'i snyan zhu phul/kho tshos srid dbang bzung nas gong ma'i rgyab skyob y