ngag dbang thub bstan rgya mtsho|{rje 'di ni mdo smad rma chu lho rgyud du kha gya'i rus nyang 'ban khyim tshang du yab mgon po don grub dang yum sgrol ma mtsho gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me sprel (1836)lor 'khrungs/mtshan 'jam dbyangs bstan 'dzin du gsol/dgung lo bdun la bkra shis 'khyil gdan sar chos zhugs mdzad/skyabs mgon blo bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho'i drung du rab byung bsgrubs/mtshan ngag dbang thub bstan rgya mtshor gsol/dgung lo bcu gcig la 'jam dbyangs thub bstan nyi ma'i sa nas chos gsan/rje shes rab rgya mtsho yongs 'dzin du bsten nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bzhes mdzad/dgung lo bcu drug la phar phyir mtha' dpyod dang po dang/gnyis pa/rten 'brel/kun gzhi sogs thugs 'dzin mdzad/dgung lo bcu bdun la drang nges dka' 'grel dang/grub mtha' sogs thugs 'dzin gnang/dgung lo nyi shu la skyabs mgon mchog gi drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrub/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa drug la dka' rabs 'dzin grwar phebs/de'i phyi lor dka' rams pa'i grwa skor dam bca' mdzad/dgung lo bzhi bcu par rgya nag pe cin du phebs/stong 'khor sprul sku dang/khri rgya nag pa'i sprul sku rnam gnyis dang mjal/dgung lo bzhi bcu zhi bzhi la dbus su phebs nas se 'bras dge gsum lab snyen bkur zhus/rgyal dbang thub bstan rgya mtsho dang khri rin po che ngag dbang nor bu gnyis la mjal kha zhus/snar thang bstan 'gyur cha tshang blu yon zhus te rang dgon du gdan drangs/dgung lo zhe drug lor gsang sngags dar rgyas gling gi khri mdzad/phyag rtsom (dpal rdo rje 'jigs byed dpa' bo gcig pa'i lam rim gnyis dang 'brel ba'i smon lam gyi rgya cher 'grel pa gsang gsum rgyan gyi snang ba/) (mi tra'i dbang gi phyag len gsar bar bkod pa gnang ches bdud rtsi sgo 'byed/) ('jam chog byin rlabs bdud rtsi 'dzags pa'i zla shes )sogs pod 'bring bzhi tsam mdzad/dgung lo nga bzhi pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa glang (1889)lor gshegs}
ngag dbang bsod nams grags pa rgyal mtshan|{dpal ldan sa skya dgon gyi khri pa nyer gsum pa 'di nyid rab byung brgyad pa'i sa lug (1499)lor yab kun dga' rin chen dang yum dgong dga' ma bsod nams legs 'dzoms dkar mo gnyis kyi sras su sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu gcig pa sa sbrul (1509)lor spyan snga ngag dbang chos grags kyi drung du rab tu byung/dgung lo bcu gnyis bzhes pa lcags rta (1510)lor dpal sa skya dgon gyi gdan khrir phebs/dgung na chung ngu de tsam nas dge 'dun 'dus pa rgya mtshor thub pa dgongs gsal chen mo nyen gsum gyi bar du bstsal bas thams cad yid dbang 'phrog par gyur/dgung lo bco drug pa rab byung dgu pa'i me glang (1517)lor chos rje nam mkha' dbang phyug gis mkhan po mdzad de paN chen lugs kyi bsnyen rdzogs bzhes/rab byung dgu pa'i lcags sprel (1560)lor rtse dgong gi gdan sar spyan drangs/yi dam lha tshogs kyi zhal gzigs/de nas rje nyid dgung grangs drug cu re gsum bzhes pa rang byung dgu pa'i lcags bya (1561)lor dge sding chos kyi pho brang du phyag phebs/lo de'i bod zla dang po'i tshes bcu'i snga dror gzugs sku'i bkod pa bsdu bar mdzad}
