ngo bo nyid sku|{chos sku la gnyis su dbye ba'i bye brag dag pa gnyis ldan gyi dbyings mthar thug pa'i sku ste/zag pa med pa'i yon tan thams cad ldan pa'i chos kyi dbyings de dgod ma nas rang bzhin gyis rnam par dag pa kyang sems can rnams rang snang gi sgrig pas bsgrigs nas mkhas pas chos kyi sgo sna tshogs kyis gdul bya'i blo rim par sbyangs nas/mthar thug dbyings de'i rang bzhin shes shes mngon du byed pa lab rten nas glo bur gyi dri ma thams cad dang bral bas na dag pa gnyis ldan kyi bral 'bras ngo bo nyid du gyur pa ni ngo bo nyid sku'am chos sku ste/(mngon rtogs rgyan )las/thub pa'i ngo bo nyid sku ni/_/zag pa med pa'i chos gang dag /thob gyur rnam kun rnam dag pa/_/de dag rang bzhin mtshan nyid can/_/zhes gsungs pa ltar ro/_/de la dbye na rang bzhin rnam dag dang glo bur dril bral gyi ngo bo nyid sku gnyis so/_}
