ngo mtshar lnga ldan 'dzam gling|{'dzam gling 'dir gling gzhan na med pa'i phyi'i khyad chos chen po lnga yod de dbus su rgya gar rdo rje gdan/shar du rgya nag ri bo rtse lnga/lho na ri bo po ta la spyan ras gzigs kyi zhing/nub na o rgyan mkha' 'gro'i gling/byang na sham b+ha la chos rgyal rigs ldan gyi zhing bcas so/_}
