ngo mtshar gzhan phan phul byung sangs rgyas rgya mtsho|{mtshan gzhan tshangs sras bzhad pa'i rdo rje mchog ni a lag sha mkhan po sku phreng lnga par grags shing/rje 'di nyid rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags lug (1871)lo'i bod zla bcu pa'i tshes bco brgyad la a lag sha rgyal rigs su sku bltams/sku chung da nas pA ring khe dga' ldan bstan rgyas gling du gdan drangs te gdan sar mnga' gsol/tshad ma rig pa sogs rig pa'i gnas kun la sbyangs pa mthar phyin mdzad/gzhon nu'i skabs dbus su phebs te 'bras spungs dgon du slob gnyer gnang/de nas lo 'ga'i rjes su phyir byon te dpa' ris yar lung dgon dang a lag sha pA ring khe dgon pa sogs chos sde bcu phrag du ma bskyangs/dge ba'i bshes gnyen chen po rje blo bzang rab gsal mtsho byung rol pa'i blo gros yongs 'dzin du bsten nas mdo sngags rig gnas kun la dpyis phyin par sbyangs brtson mdzad nas dge bshes lha rams pa'i mtshan btags bzhes/slar yang dbus su phebs nas rtse rnam rgyal grwa tshang gi mkhan pa mdzad/rjes mchog nas rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pa dang paN chen sku phreng dgu pa rnam gnyis su chos dang/rgyal dbang tshangs dbyangs pa'i sku gdung bdag skyong gnang tshul/bstan 'gro'i bde skyed dang dgon pa'i chos srid sogs 'khod pa'i chab shog mang du phul/rtse rnam rgyal grwa tshang dang 'bras spungs/bsam yas dgos bcas la gser zangs las grub pa'i ka 'phan rgyal mtshan mang du phul/rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags sprel (1920)lor dpal ris yar lung dgos pa'i bla ma khri'i bca' yig mdzad/ljags rtsom khyon pod brgyad bzhugs/rje 'di nyid kyis rgyal ba gnyis pa'i bstan pa rin po che sog yul du 'dzin skyong spel gsum gyi mdzad 'phrin rgya cher bskyangs/lhag par du rgyal dbang tshangs dbyangs pa'i klu gdung bzhugs kha rgya cher bzhengs pa dang dus bzhi'i chos thog btsugs sku tshe'i smad du a lag sha'i chos srid gnyis ka bdag gir bzhes/mtha' dgung lo don bzhir phebs pa rab byung bcu drug pa'i shing sprel (1944)lor sku gshegs}
