ngor chen kun dga' bzang po|{sa skya'i bla ma kun dga' bzang po mchog ni rab byung drug pa'i chu khyi (1382)lor yab dpon tshang grub pa yon tan dang yum bsod nams dpal ldan zhes pa gnyis kyi sras su dpal sa skyar sku 'khrungs/dgung lo drug par chos rje ye shes rgyal mtshan slob dpon dub sten nas yi ge 'bri klog sbyong bar mdzad/dgung lo dgu par ye shes rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas dge bsnyen dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/de nas rim bzhin chos rje ye shes rgyal mtshan nas dge slong dang/byang sems/gsang ba sngags kyi sdom pa yang dag par bzhes/mdo sngags kyi chos ma lus pa thugs la btags/khyad par dpal ldan sa skya'i lugs kyi dkyil chog dang sgrub thabs rnams legs par gsan te mkhas pa'i snyan grags thob cing chos rje ye shes rgyal mtshan gyi sras kyi thu bor gyur/dgung lo nyer lnga par rje ye shes rgyal mtshan sku gshegs pas shangs chos 'khor sgang dang zhe dgon du phebs nas lo tsA ba skyabs mchog dang grub chen bud+ha shrI'i drung du gsung ngag gi bdud rtsi sogs snying bcud tshim par rol/de nas sa skya dgos par byon te bla ma gzhon du blo gros bsten nas dam chos yun ring gsan/grub chen bud+ha shrI'i drung du gsung ngag gi bdud rtsi sogs snying btsun tshim par rol/dgung lo nyer dgu pa rab byung bdun pa'i lcags stag (1410)lor sa bzang dgon pa'i bdag po mdzad de dgung lo zhe dgu bar gdan sar bzhugs/bshad khrid dang/dbang lung/sdom pa 'bogs pa sogs chos spyin rgya cher mdzad/dgung lo zhe brgyad pa sa bya (1429)lor ngor chos sde btag /dgung lo zhe dgu pa lcags khyi (1430)lor na bza' phug gi ri khrod dang/bsam gling ri khrod/e waM bcas la phebs nas 'chad nyan mdzad/dpal ldan sa skya pa'i rgyud man ngag dang/rgyud sde bzhi'i bstan pa spyi khyab/khyad par bya spyod kyi bstan pa legs par dar spel mdzad/sku gsum thugs kyi rten mang du bzhengs/bshad grwa btsugs pa sogs mdzad pas/e waM chos ldan gyi gdan sa chen po chags/skal ldan gyi slob ma la mtshon na sa skya'i gdung rgyud gzhi thogs pa kun dga' dbang phyug /bdag chen chu mig pa blo gros dbang phyug /ngor mkhan po dkon mchog rgyal mtshan/kun mkhyen go rabs 'byams pa bsod nams seng ge/paN chen 'bum phrag sum pa/kun mkhyen dga' sdong pa/smra khams pa grags pa bzang po sogs kyis gtso bor gyur pa'i bstan 'dzin kyi skyes bu bsam gyis mi khyab pa byon/rtsom pa la/gsung chos sgrub thabs kyi skor dang/thob yig /cho ga /rnam thar/springs yig sogs e waM bka' 'bum du grags pa pod bzhir bsdus/mthar dgung lo bdun cu don lnga la phebs par rab byung brgyad pa'i me byi (1456)lor e waM dgon du dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
ngor snang btsan mong|{(khri ngos snang btsun mong gi bu zhes pa'ang snang )bod rgyal stag ri gnyan gzigs kyi blon po dang/'phrul blon mdzangs mi bdun gyi gsum pa yin/'di nyid kyis bre dang srang bcos nas 'brum bar 'jal byed bzos pa dang/las sdeb dang tshong byed pa sogs dar rgyas btang}
