dngos gzhi byams pa thub dbang|{dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i nang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i sku dus su bla sman pa dngos gzhi (stod lung nam mkha' dngos gzhi )zhes pa zhig byung 'dug pa dang de rjes dngos gzhi spyi khyab mkhan po byams pa thub dang ni dus rabs nyi shu pa'i nang bod kyi gso rig yar rgyas gong 'phel 'gro bar mdzad rjes shin tu che ba'i mkhas dbang zhig yin/chung dus nas yig rtsis yon tan la sbyang brtson gnang zhing/sku na son skabs gdos gzhi'i ming thog nas sa gnas srid gzhung gi rtse drung dkyus ma dang/de rjes rtse mgron kyi go gnas bzhes par grags/khong lho brag rdzong dpon gyi phyag las gnang dus snyun gzhi drag po zhig phog par sa gnas de ga'i sman pa zhig gis bcos dkar seng drug byung ba des sman dpyad bslabs na nad par phan thogs yod pa dngos su gzigs pas rkyen byas te thog mar lho brag gi sman pa de'i drung nas rtsa rgyud dang/rtsa chung 'khrid sbyong gi sman gzhung blo sbyong gnang ba dang/de rjes khams kyi bla ma rig gnas spyi dang khyad par gso rig la ma chog tu gyur pa zhig gi sa nas smad dpyad slob gnyer gnang rgyu mthar skyel mdzad pas rim bzhin gso rig gi gzhung dang lag len gnyis kar byang chub pa byung bar brten me bya (1897)lo'i zla 5tshes 5nyin tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pas dmigs bsal bdag rkyen dang bcas pa'i sgo nas mkhas dbang byams pa thub dbang la mkhan chung gi go gnas thog sku bcar bla sman bgres par bsko gzhag gnang/shing 'brug (1904)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa pe cin sogs su phebs skabs byams pa thub dbang skur bcar bla smad mdzad de lhan du phebs myong zhing/dus der sman dpyad kyi mdzad 'phrin rgya cher byung nas mtshan snyan grags ha cang che ba byung/lhag par khong gis nad pu gzhan dang gtsang btsog gi dbye ba med pa rtsa chu'i brtag dpyad skabs nad ngo 'phrod phyir chab rtags kyi ro myong ba sogs gnang gi yod pa dang/bod du sman don mi sna 'bor chen gso skyong gnang nas mkhan dbang mang po byung/de rjes lcags khyi (1910)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcug sum pa rgya g