mngon brjod|{shes bya'i chos re re la ming gi rnam grangs mang po'i sgo nas brjod pa zhig la zer/dper na/nyi ma ni yongs su grags pa'i ming yin cing/de min nam mkha'i nor bu/srid pa'i sgron me/pad+ma'i gnyen zhes pa sogs khyad chas dang 'dra chos sogs kyi sgo nas btags pa'i ming sum cu lhag tsam yod pa lta bu ni ming gi mngon brjod/lag pa/zung/mig zer ba lta bu grangs gnyis kyi mngon brjod yin pa sogs grangs kyi mngon brjod/'phur 'gro zhes pa/mda' dang/bya/lha sogs don mang po la 'jug pa ni ming gcig don mang yin pas mngon brjod shes na ming la mi rmongs zer ba'i rgyu mtshan yang de yin/zhib par ni slob dpon 'chi med seng ge mdzad pa'i (mngon brjod 'a chi med mdzod )dang/de'i 'grel pa ('dod 'jo'i ba mo )zhes pa rgya gar skad nas bod skad du bsgyur ba yod/gzhan yang bod kyi mkhas pas mdzad pa der na/zha lu lo tsA ba chos skyong bzang pos mdzad pa'i (mngon brjod legs bshad gser gyi lde mig )de'i slob ma skyogs ston rin chen bkra shis kyis mdzad pa'i (mngon brjod kyi bstan bcos/) snar thar lo tsA ba sang+ga shrI'i (mngon brjod gser phreng rol pa )dge ye ba tshul khrims seng ges mdzad pa'i (mngon brjod ming gi tshogs gsal bar byed pa blo gsal rna cha/) snye thang blo brtan bzhi pas mdzad pa'i (tshig gter gyi 'grel pa/) mkhyen rtse lo tsA bas mdzad pa'i (mngon brjod sde tshan bdun pa/) rin spungs ngag dbang 'jigs grags kyis mdzad pa'i (mngon brjod mkhas pa'i rna rgyan/) ('di dpar ma'i nang 'go mjug bsdoms yig phreng sum cu lhag tsam chad skyong byung 'dug) dngul chu d+harma b+ha dras mdzad pa'i (mngon brjod rgya mtsho'i chu thigs )dang grangs kyi mngon brjod sogs yod}
