mngon par shes pa drug|{1 lha'i mig /lha'i rna ba/sems kyi rnam grangs shes pa/zag pa zad pa shes pa dang drug go/chos kyi rnam grangs kyi brjed byang las/de la thag rin po dang dus ring po na gnas shing 'byung ba lkog tu gyur pa'i chos rnams lad ltar mngon sum du drung na 'dug pa dang 'dra bar rtogs shing shes pa ni mngon par shes pa zhes bya ste/de ltar gyi lus nye ring ji snyed pa dang shi nas gar skyes pa'i gzugs thams cad mthong ba de dang shes nas gar skyes pa'i gzugs thams cad mthong ba de ni lha'i mig go /sgra dang skad dang brdas tshogs thos shing go bo ni lha'i rna ba'o/_/sems can gyi bsam pa dang bag la nyams shas che chung kun shes pa ni sems kyi rnam grangs shes pa'o/_/'bar ba dang/'phur ba dang/mang nyung dang/bzang ngan dang/chu la 'gro zhing sa la 'bying ba dag shes pa ni lus kyi rdzu 'phrul gyi shes pa'o/_/de ltar gyi dus nas bzung ste/tshe rabs snga ma la gnas gang na gnas gnas las ci byed byed pa'i lo rgyus dran pa ni sngon gyi gnas rjes su dran pa'o/_/mthong ba dang bsgom pas spangs pa'i nyon mong pa ci spangs ci ma spangs pa'i rim pa shes bzhin zad pa dang mi skye ba'i ye shes thob pa shes pa dag ni zag pa zad pa shes pa'o/_/zhes gsungs so/_/2 klong rdol gsung 'bum las/rdzu 'phrul gyi yul shes pa'i mngon shes/lha'i rna ba'i mngon shes/gzhan sems shes pa'i mngon shes/sngon ga nas rjes dran gyi mngon shes/'chi 'pho ba dang skye ba shes pa'i mngon shes/zag zad kyi mngon shes dang drug go /zhes gsungs so/_/'di rnams zag med ye shes kyi nyer gcig gi khongs su gtogs la/rnam grangs rgya mtsho'i gter las/lnga pa'i don du lha'i mig gi mngon shes drang ngo/_/3 rnam grangs shes ldan yid kyi dga' ston las/mig gi mngon shes/rna ba'i mngon shes/sna'i mngon shes/sngon gnas rjes dran gyi mngon shes/rdzu 'phrul gyi mngon shes/gzhan sems shes pa'i mngon shes/zag zad kyi mngon shes rnams so/_/zhes drang ngo/_/mngon shes drug ces pa'am 'di nyid do/_}
