mngon sum gyi tshad ma|{mdo sde pa ltar na/rtog pa dang bral zhing gsar du mi bslu ba'i rig pa mngon sum tshad ma'i mtshan nyid/de la dbye na/dbang po'i mngon sum tshad ma dang/yid kyi mngon sum tshad ma/rang rig mngon sum tshad ma/rnal 'byor mngon sum tshad ma dang bzhi'o/_/bye smras 'di bzhi las rang rig mngon sum khas mi len pas mngon sum gsum du 'dod pa yin/'di la yang thal 'gyur ba'i thun mong min pa'i bzhed tshul yod de/mngon sum la rtog bral mi dgos par/rtogs la mi bltos par rang gi 'dzin stangs kyi gzhal bya mngon sum pa la mi bsla ba tsam zhig mngon sum du 'dod/mngon sum tshad ma la rtog med mngon sum tshad ma dang rtog bcas mngon sum tshad ma gnyis su 'dod pa'i dang po ni gzugs 'dzin dbang po'i mngon sum lta bu dang/gnyis pa ni/sgra mi rtogs kyi rjes dpag skad gcig gnyis pa dang/sngo 'dzin dbang mngon gyis drangs nas skyes pa'i sngon po don mthun dang dran pa'i dran shes lta bu'o/_}
