rngog dkyil bdun|{rje mar pa lo tsA ba'i thugs bcud rngog chos sku rdo rje la bka' babs pa'i dkyil 'khor bdun te/1 kyai rdo rje lha dgu/2 yum bdag med lha mo bco lnga/3 rdo rje gur rigs bsdus lha zhe dgu/4 rdo rje gdan bzhi'am rnal 'byor nam mkha' lha go bdun/5 de'i yum bka' ye shes mkha' 'gro lha bcu gsum/6 mahA ya ya'am sgyu ma chen mo lha lnga/7 smin ti nas rngog la brgyud pa 'jam dpal gsang ldan lha ga gsum ma bcas yin no/_}
rngog chos sku rdo rje|{mar pa'i slob ma ka chen bzhi'i ya gyal lho'i ka ba/('di'i 'khrungs lo dang gshegs lo la bshad tshul mi 'dra ba gsum tsam 'dug /(deb sngon )ltar na )'di nyid yab rngog ban chen kha pa dang yum 'od ldan ma'i sras su rab byung dang po'i me byi (1036)lor gzhung ri por sku 'khrungs/gzhon nu'i dus yab chos sogs la thos bsam mdzad pas mkhas mkhar gyur/pa bzang chos 'tsho khab tu bzhes/dge bshes dgyer chung pas gsol ba bzhin mar pa'i drung du byon/snga rjes su phyag rten gtos che ba phul nas dgyes rdor dang/gdan bzhi/mahA mA yA rnams kyi rgyud man ngag dang gdams ngag dpag med gsan/'di nyid gzhung bshad chu bo'i rgyun lta bu'i bka' bab yin/ri bo khyung lding gi lha khang btab/mthar dgung lo drug cu re bdun pa rang byung gnyis pa'i chu rta (1102)lor sku gshegs/khong gi slob ma ba ram rtsa can dang/pa wa ba can/rngog mun pa can/sum pa phod ka can te can bzhi sogs rim par byung/lo rgyus rgyas pa ri bo che dpon tshang tshe dbang rgyal gyis brtsams pa'i (lho rong chos 'byung )shog grangs 37nas shog grangs kha shas yod pa dang/(deb ther sngon po )le tshan (nya)pa'i shog grangs 3pa'i nang/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )le tshan (na)pa'i grangs 20nas 21bar bcas su gsal}
rngog pa'i chos skor|{mar pa lo tsA ba'i slob ma rngog chos sku rdo rje la gsang sngags kyi rgyud mi 'a dra ba bdun gyi chos skor man ngag dang bcas pa cha tshang yod cing/de'i nang gses mar pa lo tsA ba dang rang la gsan pa drug ste/1 kyai rdo rje lha dgu/2 bdag med lha mo bco lnga/3 rdo rje gnas bzhi lha mang/4 ye shes dbang phyug ma/5 mahA mA ya lha lnga/6 gur rigs bsdus bcas dang/7 khams pa shes rab rdo rje las gsan pa 'jam dpal gsang ldan bcas bdun la zer}
