rngog byang chub 'byung nas|{klu mes kyi slob ma ka ba bzhi'i ya gyal/'di nyid lcags khyi (1010)lor klu mes kyi drung du rab tu byung/rngog gis lcags phag (1011)lor yer pa ba reng bzung/bzad kyi lding pa/chu shul na bo/sbus sde lho gong/yol thang/lab so/gral ma thang/kha rag so gcig /gzhung kun dga' ra ba/tsha mig sogs bzhengs/lho nub kyi lha mdo la sogs pa'i 'brel tsho yang rngog gi skor lags/de rnams la rngog skor du grags/jo bo rje mnga' ris nas dbus gtsang du phebs pa'i phyi lo rngog gis brag yer par gdan drangs nas bsnyes bkur gzab rgyas thog chos mang po gsan/'di nyid ngo bo'i slob ma yang yin}
rngog blo ldan shes rab|{rngog lo tsA ba blo ldan shes rab/bod kyi lo rgyus thog skad grags yod pa'i lo tsA ba chen po zhig ste/bod kyi rab byung dang po'i sa phag (1059)lor 'khrungs shing/rab byung gnyis pa'i sa glang (1109)lor sku gshegs/rngog ni rus ming yin zhing rngog lo tsA ba legs pa'i shes rab kyi gcung po che chung bzhi'i nang nas gsum pa chos skyabs kyi sras yin/chung dus sku ngal shin tu che bas dgung lo bcu bdun skabs khu bo rngog legs pa'i shes rab kyi drung du bros nas lo gcig tsam bzhugs/de'i phyi lo khu bos bka' slob dang mthun rkyen gnang ste rgya gar du slob gnyer la brdzangs pa ltar mnga' ris brgyud nas rgya gar du byon pa'i lam grogs su rgya gar du chos slob par phebs pa'i lo tsA ba btsan kha bo che/khyung po chos brtson/rA lo tsA ba/gnyan lo tsA ba rnams mnyam du byung/rgya gar yul dbus dang kha che bcas su lo bcu bdun ring mdo dang/sngags/sgra rig pa/tshad ma rig pa sogs la dka' spyad 'bad brtson blo yul dumi shong ba gnang nas sbyangs pa mthar phyin te/dgung lo so lnga pa rab byung dang po'i chu sprel (1092)lor bod du phyir phebs/tshad ma rig pa dang phar phyin sogs gzhung rigs mi 'dra ba stong phrag kha shas rgya gar skad nas bod skad du bsgyur bar mdzad pas/bod kyi lo tsA ba'i nang nas gzhung bsgyur mang shos dang mkhas shos yin/'on kyang nga rgyal dang khengs sems mi gnang bar sngon byon bod kyi lo tsA ba mkhas pa nyi zla lta bu'i drung na rang nyid rgyu skar chung ngu zhig gi gras su tshud pa tsam yin zhes gsungs/chos gsungs pa la shin tu mkhas pas chos thems re gsung dus nyan mkhan khri lhag dang nyung mthar stong phrag las mi nyung ba 'dus/zur khrid kyi 'chad nyan byed thub pa'i slob ma rkyang pa yang chig stong brgyad brgya tsam yod zer/dgung lo nga gnyis pa la sku gshegs/'di'i lo rgyus cung zad rgyas pa nyid thang sprul sku ngag dbang gzhon nus mdzad pa'i (gsang phu'i dkar chag )tu gsal}
rngog legs pa'i shes rab|{bka' gdams kyi mes po jo 'brom yab sras gsum gyi ya gyal yin la/jo bo rje'i slob ma snyan grags can dbus kyi khu rngog 'brum gsum gyi ya gyal yang yin/chos rgyal khri srong lde btsan gyi blon po rngog chen po'i rgyud pa yang 'brog do'i phyi rol gyi mtsho chen po'i 'gram du grong chags pa'i sngags rnying ma ba'i dge bshes rdo rje gzhon nor sras lnga yod pa'i che bar sku 'khrung/'bring ye shes yon tan las rab tu byung/sku na chung ngu'i dus mnga' ris gu ge rgyal pos kha che'i yul du mngags te nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i cho sa lugs slob gnyer mdzad nas mkhas par gyur/phyis su lo chen rin chen bzang por rogs mdzad de bka' chos bsgyur/rab byung dang po'i shing bya (1045)lor dbus su phebs skabs rngog gis sar spyan drangs/spyan ras gzigs kyis mi dkar po zhig tu byas nas bsu ba mdzad/nag tsho dang lhan du jo bo dang mjal te jo bo'i thugs sras su gyur/rngog gis lo paN la zhus nas rtog ge 'bar ba bsgyur/de nas kho ston brtson 'grus g.yung drug dang lhan du jo bo'i drung nas bka' gdams bu chos zhus/rab byung dang po'i chu glang (1073)lor gsang phu ne'u thog dgon pa btab/rngo lo yab sras (legs pa'i shes rab dang blo ldan shes rab gnyis la zhu )kyis tshad ma rnam nges dang byams chos gzhir bzhag gis gsang phur rigs lam nas drangs pa'i 'chad nyan shin tu dar po byung}
rngog lo'i bshad rgyud|{rngog lo tsA ba chen po blo ldan shes rab nas brgyud pa'i phar phyin dang/byams chos/dbu ma/tshad ma/mngon pa bcas kyi bshad pa'i rgyun la zer zhing/bshad rgyud der 'dul ba ma gtogs gzhung bka' pod bzhi'i bshad rgyud cha tshang ba yod/'di'i skor gyi lo rgyus cung rgyas pa las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung gsal ba'i sgron me )dang (deb ther sngon po )le tshan (cha)pa rngog lo pa tshab brgyud pa dang bcas pa dang/dbu tshad byams chos sogs ji ltar byung ba'i skabs gnyis su gsal}
