sngags 'chang grags pa blo gros rgyal mtshan|{dpal sa skya mgon gyi khri pa nyer bzhi pa 'di nyid kyi mtshan gzhan 'jam dbyangs bsod nams rgyal mtshan zhu zhing rab byung brgyad pa'i chu phag (1503)lor yab ngag dbang kun dga' rin chen bkra shis grags pa rgyal mtshan dang yul gdong dga' ma lha cig dkar mo g.yang 'dzoms gnyis kyi sras su dgong dga' rdzong gi yang rtser sku 'khrungs/dgung lo brgyad pa la phebs pa rab byung dgu pa'i lcags rtag (1510)lor yab rje chos kyi rgyal po'i rgyal tshab tu mnga' gsol/gzhon nu nas bzo gnas la'ang shin tu mkhas pas phyag bris mdzad pa'i zhal thang rnams gzhan las ngo mtshar ba snang/dgung lo nyer bdun pa nas nga lnga'i bar la gdan sa'i khur mtha' dag bzhes nas rdzong chung bla brang/sgrol ma lha khang/mgon khang nub/rje btsan gyi sku 'dra mdze thod ma zhugs pa'i zur khang gtsug lag khang/phu ma'i lha khang/phu ma'i lha khang/gzhi thog bla brang gi rig 'dzin lha khang/dbu rtse 'jam dbyangs gzi 'od 'bar ba'i dbu thog gi gser thog chen mo sogs gsar bzhengs mdzad/dgung lo nga lnga pa rab byung dgu pa'i me sbrul (1557)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su gshegs}
sngags 'chang ngag dbang kun dga' rin chen|{dpal sa skya dgon gyi khri pa nyer gnyis pa 'di nyid rang byung brgyad pa'i me glang (1457)lor yab 'jam dbyangs nang mkha' don grub tshe brtan bkra shis rgyal mtshan dang/yum 'bu 'dren skyed gnyis kyi sras su sku 'khrungs/dgung lo dug pa la 'jam dbyangs kun dga' bsod nams grags pa rgyal mtshan gyi drung las dge bsnyes dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan 'jam dbyangs ngag gi dbang po kun dga' rin chen bkra shis grags pa rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po zhes gsol/dgung lo bcu drug pa rab byung brgyad pa'i chu 'brug (1472)lor sa skya'i gdan khrir phebs/dgung lo nyi shu'i bar sa lo chen po bral med du bsten nas gang gi gdangs pa mtha' dag bum pa gang byo'i tshul du gnas/sa lo chen po sku gshegs kha'i bka' slob thugs dbus su bcings te dpal ldan sa skya'i bstan pa rgyas pa la brtson pa chen po mdzad/chu mig rdzing khar bde mchog pho brang gsar bzhengs dang/dus mchod bla brang gi gser khang du grags pa rten dang brten par bcas pa/nang so pu tra khang dang pho grang bcas gser bzhengs thogs sa chen phug sogs la nyams gso rgya cher gnang zhing/chos grwa chen po thub bstan lha chen dang gsang sngags bde chen gling phyag btab/kha'u skye lhas kyi sgrub gnas dang/chos rdzong khams gsum zil gnon/de dag tu bzhugs pa'i dge 'dun 'dus pa rgya mtshor bsnyen bkur rgya cher bsgrub pa'i rgyun btsugs/de nas bla ma dge bshes dang sa skyong sbyin bdag bcas nas gdung rgyud spel rgyu'i gsol ba btab pa bzhis btsun mo gsum khab tu bzhes nas sras 'jam dbyangs dbang po grags pa rgyal mtshan dang grags pa blo gros rgyal mtshan gnyis 'khrungs/mthar dgung lo re brgyad pa rab byung dgu pa'i shing sprel (1524)lor lhun grub pho brang du zhi bar gshegs}
