lcags po ri bod sman slob grwa chen mo|{dpar ra sa 'phrul snang gi gtsug la khang chen po'i 'dabs su chags shing rigs gsum mgon po'i bla ri dmar lcags bong gsum du grags pa'i ya gyal/phyag na rdo rje'i bla ri lcags ri 'di seng ge gnam du mchongs pa lta bu'i dbyings su snang ba sogs bkod pa ngo mtshar zhing lcags dang gser la sogs pa'i gter yang yod par grags/skyes chen du mas mchod pa'i gnas su mdzad cing/lag par du grub pa'i dbang phyug thang stong dgung lo bdun cur phebs pa rang byung brgyad pa'i lcags khyi (1430)lor sgrub gnas lta na sdug pa 'di nyid dum chod khang dang bcas pa gsar bzhengs thog yun ring bzhugs/sman rgyal mi yi zlos gar sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i dpal gyis zhabs bcags te sman gyi ri bo'i gzigs snang bsam gyis mi khyab pa byung bar brten/de sngon tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas 'bras spungs su dga' ldan pho brang nub mar nyi thang zhabs drung blo bzang rgya mtsho slob dpon dang/byang ngos bstan 'dzin dar rgyas nas do dam byed pa'i gso rig 'gro phan gling gsar 'dzugs/de bzhin gzhis rtse bsam 'grub rtser tsha rong pas do dam byed pa'i go rig drang srong 'dus pa'i gling/rtse lha dbang lcog tu byang ngos pa dang dar mo sman rams pa blo bzang chos grags sogs kyis do dam byed pa'i gso rig slob grwa khag cig bcas 'dzugs gnang mdzad kyang yun ring gnas ma thub par brten/gong sa lnga pa chen po dgongs pa chos dbyings su gshegs nas lo bco lnga 'khor ba rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me byi (1696)lor sman pa'i slob grwa lcags ri bai DUr+ya lta na ngo mtshar 'gro phan rig byed gling zhes su grags pa phyag btab par mdzad cing/gso rig gi lag len slob rgyud 'phel rgyas 'byung slad sa gnas kyi ris med dgon sde khag nas grwa slob go pher re gtan 'dzugs dgos pa'i bka' rgya rtsa tshig dang bca' yig chen mo/grwa rgyun 'dzugs khongs kyi dgon deb sbug dam 'byor ma/grwa tshang drug cu re bzhir 'tsho rten chos gzhis dang/de'i 'byed khra/she bam chen mo sogs sbug dmar 'byar ma'i gtan tshig khag bcas ma khyab pa med pa'i mthun rkyen rnams 'jog gnang mdzad/slob grwa'i s