lcags bzo|{lcags bzhu btul byas te dngos rigs sna tshogs bzo ba dang/tshags rgyag pa/lugs su blugs pa/0phye ma bzo ba/lcags skud 'then pa/mnyam nyes khro lcags bzo ba sogs kyi lag rtsal la zer/_/bod kyi lcags bzo'i lag rtsal ni da yod kyi dpyad gzhi'i yig rigs khang gi nang 'khod pa ltar na/spyi lo'i dus rabs dang po'i g.yas g.yon du bod kyi rgyal po gri gum btsan po'i dus su gri bzo ba la mkhas pa zim po spun dgu ze ra ba byung zhing/de tshos brdungs pa'i gri la dgu zi zer ba'i ming thogs pa dang/de dus smra khams su lcags kyi khrab bzo ba'i lag rtsal dar nas gri gum btsan pos gyon pa'i khrab kyang smar khams nas blangs zhes gsal zhing/(thang deb bod kyi lo rgyus )zhes pa'i nang/bod kyi khrab ni mig gnyis ma gtogs lus po yongs rdzogs khebs thub pa dang mda' gri rnon pos kyang chod dka' ba'i btsan po yod ces bkod yod pa dang/rgyal po srong btsan sgom po'i dus dmag dpon byas rjes can la lcags kyi byang bu'i yi ge gnang ba bod kyi lo rgyus mang por 'khod 'dug kyang (thang deb bod kyi lo rgyus )zer ba'i nang 'khod don du/rgyal po khri lde gtsug brtan gyis srid dbang bzung skabs (spyi lo'i dus rabs brgyad pa'i 'khor)dbyangs dang pis zer ba'i sa char chu chen po'i thog bod dmag gis lcags zam btsugs yod pa dang/ten khri zer ba'i mtsho'i 'gram du lcags kyi ka ba rin po zhig btsugs pa de'i thog skabs de'i dmag don la rgyus rnams bod yig brkos yod pa bcas gsal ba de la rgyus rnams bod yig brkos yod pa bcas gsal ba de la bstan na p+sapa'i lo'i dus rabs dang po'i yas mas nas bod mi rigs kyis gri dang khrag bzo ba'i lag rtsal shes yod pa dang/dus rab brgyad pa'i 'gor slebs dus bod mi rigs kyis cha chen po'i thog lcags zab 'dzugs pa'i lag rtsal shes yin pa gsal por mthong thub/lcags khrab dang lcags zab bzo rgyu ni spyir btang gi thon skyed yo byad bzo rgyu las ha cang dka' zhing/lag rtsal chu tshud mtho po med na bzo mi thub pa dang/lcags khrab dang lcags zab bzo thub na spyir btang gi thon skyed yo byad bzo thub pa ni smos mi dgos/'on kyang spyi lo'i sa rabs dang po'i yas man nas rmon pa brgyab nas sa zhing 'debs las byed 'og btsugs te/de nas bzung lo stong phrag gcig lham tsam gyi bar bod kyi zhing las thog gshol lcags bed spyod ma byas pa des lcags kyi thon skyed yo byad bzo ma shes pa dang/lcags bzo'i lag rtsal mtho po med pa'i gsal bshad byed mi thub cing/dus yun ring po'i nang bod kyi zhing las thog lcags bzo'i thon skyed yo byad bde spyod ma btang ba ni mkhrigs shing (ber do shing sogs )gis bzos pa'i thong gshol des lcags kyi thong gshol dang 'dra ba'i nus pa thon thub kyi yod stabs lcags kyi thong gshol las ma gnas chung ba dang/stabs bde ba/lcags bzo ba med kyang shing bzo spyir btang shes pa zhig gis kyang bzo thub pa sogs kyi khyad chos mang po yod pa'i rgyu mtshan la brten nas byung ba zhig yin/de nas rab byung bdun pa'i lcags phag (1431)lor grub thob thang stong rgyal po dgung lo bdun cu don gcig la slebs skabs/khong gis bkod 'doms dang rgyu cha 'dod spel gnang nas lha sa'i mdun skyid chu'i lcags zam (deng sang gi zag pa gsar pa yod sa )thog mar btsugs pa nas dgung lo brgya dang nyer lnga la ma phebs bar stod lung/lha rtse/lho kha 'on/'phan po brag ral/shar gru kha/'bri gung zhu/lcags zab chu bo ri/rdza chu kha/'bri chu/nyang chu/dar rtse mdo sogs dbus gtsang khams gsum gyi sa char khyon bsdoms lcags zam lnga bcu nga brgyad btsugs pa'i tham sku gshegs kar lho kha'i nya mgo kru kha'i lcags zab 'dzugs gnang mdzad/lcags zam rnams kyi lcags thag sbom tshad khru gu lo brgyad lon pa'i lag ngar gyi phra smos dang mnyam pa sha stag yod la/lcags zab gyi bzo pa so so'i ming mang po zhig (thang stong rgyal po'i rnam thar )nang gsal bas thams cad bod rigs bzo pa sha stag yin/po ta la'i pho brang dmar po gsar du bzhengs skabs bod sa gnas yongs kyi lcags bzo mkhas pa mang po bsdus pa'i nang rim pa gnyis su phye 'dug pa ste/rim pa dang po dbu mdzad (dbo tshang ba sogs )mi gsum/byings dang dkyus gras (gra phyi thong dkar ba sogs )mi grangs bdun cu don bzhi yod}
lcags bzo mkhas can bkra shis don grub|{bkra shis don grub (}?{ 1965)ni lha sa khul du skad grags yod pa'i lcags bzo mkhas pa zhig yin/khong lo na gzhon dus rtse drung smon grong thub bstan chos dar gyi g.yog po yin zhing/dus rabs nyi shu'i lo rabs nyi shu pa'i nang nyin zhig bkra shis don grub kyis rtse pho brang gi rtsig rgyab tu gcin pa btang skabs mgron gnyer che mo bstan pa dar rgyas (che mo a ra dkar po zer )kyis nyer 'dzugs rtsad zhib byas rjes sbyin bdag smon grong thub bstan chos dar la dngul chad nges can zhig btang ba dang/bkra shis don grub gra gzhi glog 'phrul bzo grwar tshe gang lcags bzo (bod rnying pa'i dus lcags bzo ba rigs mi gtsang bar rtsis te mthong chung byed kyi yod )byed dgos rgyu'i nyes chad btang stabs khong gis dge rgan gyi sa nas lag rtsal hur thag yang shes thub pa ma zad/rang nyid nas kyang rig pa btang sta lcags chas 'ga' zhig gsar gtod byes pa dper na bod bzo'i sgo lcags chung chung gcig la ldeng mig phyogs gnyis nas rgyu dgos pa zhig bzos par mang tshogs kyis dga' bo byed cing/gzhan yang bod sa gnas srid gzhung nas me mda' (dbyin mda' kha zlum dang 'dra ba )gsar bzo tshod blta byed rgyu'i las ka'i nang du zhugs dgos pa'i bka' phab pa ltar bkra shis don grub kyis las ka gtso gdan khag gi lan 'gan blangs stabs lo rabs bzhi bcu pa'i nang bod sa gnas srid gzhung nas khong la lcags bzo las tshan pa'i go ming sprad/lha sa ba tshos grwa bzhi'i che mo las tshan pa zhes 'bod}
