lcags ri ring po|{de snga bod skad nang kha rgyun du rgya nag lcags ri zer ba de yin cing/de ni khrun chi'u kran go'i dus skabs su rgyal phran khag phan tshul 'gog ched khag so sos sa bab 'gag gnad che sar lcags ri ring po brtsigs shing/rgya'i lo rgyus yig tshags (tsu'o kron ){(WP:1,194)}nang shi kun {(WP:1,194)}lo bzhi pa (spyi lo'i gong gi lo 657)lor khru'u rgyal khab {(WP:1,194)}kyis lcags ri brtsigs tshul 'khod pa de ni lcags ri ring po'i skor yig thog lo rgyus snga shos de yin pa dang/kran go'i dus skabs su chi {(WP:1,194)}dang/khru'u {(WP:1,194)} wus {(WP:1,194)} g.yan {(WP:1,194)} kra'o {(WP:1,194)} chin {(WP:1,194)} krung hran {(WP:1,194)} sogs rgyal khab kyis snga rjes su bzo skrun byas chin hri hong gis rgyal phran tshan pa drug dbang du bsdus te gcig gyur byas rjes byang phyogs shung nu'u sku drag gi btsan 'dzul 'gog chen spyi lo'i gong gi 214lor chin dang kra'o g.yan bcas rgyal phran gsum gyi byang mtha'i lcags ri ring po rnams nyams gso byas nas khyod mu gcig tu sbrel ba da nub lin kra'o (da lta'i kan su'u zhing chen min rdzong )nas byang ngos dbyin hran {(WP:1,194)}dang shar ngos le'u tung {(WP:1,194)}bar la le dmar khri yi lcags ri ring po {(WP:1,194)}zhes da lta'ang gyang rol mthong rgyu yod de rjes han dang {(WP:1,194)}wung bya ma chi byang ma kra'u byang ma {(WP:1,194)} sus {(WP:1,194)} sogs kyi rgyal rabs tshang mas byang ngos kyi phyugs rigs spo 'tsho'i mi rigs dang sa mtshams 'khel sar lcags ri rgyag myong yod pa dang ming rgyal rabs kyi skabs su rtA tan {(WP:1,194)}dang wa tshi {(WP:1,194)}rigs kyi btsan 'dzul 'gog ched hung u {(WP:1,194)} nang dban li {(WP:1,194)}bar te (1368)lo nas 1619)lo tsam bar khyod lo nyis brgya lnga bcu lhag tsam nang snga rjes su nyams go thengs bco brgyad tsam byas te nub ngos kan su zhing chen gyi hran ha'i kon {(WP:1,194)}bar yod pa der pan chang {(WP:1,194)}zhes zer shun hwa {(WP:1,194)}dang tA thung {(WP:1,194)}grong sde gnyis kyi lho ngas te gre rlu {(WP:1,194)}dang hran shi {(WP:1,194)}zhing chen gnyis kyi sa mtshams su da dung lcags ri nang ma yod pa der tshe pan {(WP:1,194)}zhes 'bod pa khyon bsdoms rim tshan spyi khri drug stong bdun brgya tsam yod pa de dag da bar spyir na sngar bzhin nyams med du gnas yod cing lcags ri ring po de ni brjid chags shing blta na sdug pa zhig yin pa ma zad 'dzam gling lo rgyus thog gi bzo skrun rlabs po che zhig kyang yin (gong gsal nang don rnams rgya yig gi tshig mdzod che mo'i {(WP:1,194)}khrang khran {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i 'grel bshad gzhir bzung ba'o/_/)}
