lcang skya ngag dbang blo bzang chos ldan|{mdo smad tshong kha'i nye 'dabs g.yi dge'i char gtogs rta phyug ces pa'i grong du yab khe ba cang e har dang yum lo bza' thar mo mtsho gnyis kyi rigs sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu rta (1642)lo'ibod zla bcu gcig par sku bltams/dgung grangs gsum bzhir phebs skabs smra mi shes pa'i tshul bzhes/dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes rjes rim gyis gsung bgros bstsal/dge 'dun skyabs zhes pa'i mtshan gsol/thang ring dgon gyi khri pa tshul khrims rgya mtsho dang paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan gyis bla ma gong ma grags pa 'od zer gyi sprul skur ngos 'dzin mdzad/de rjes bla ma tshul khrims rgya mtsho dang phun tshugs bzang po gnyis kyi drung nas rab tu byung/mtshan bstan 'dzin legs bshad rgya mtsho zhes gsol/yi ge sbyor klog dang chos dpe blo 'dzin gyi dbu tshugs/dgung lo nyi shu la phebs pa lcags glang (1661)lor dbus lha ldan zhing du phebs/kun gzigs lnga pa chen po blo bzang rgya mtsho mchog gi spyan sngar dge tshul gyi sdom pa mnos/blo bzang chos ldan zhes pa'i mtshan gnang/de nas 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang gi chos grwar zhugs/sgo mang dpon slob ngag dbang blo gros rgya mtsho las bka' chos mang du gsan/dgung lo nyer gsum la phebs pa shing 'brug (1664)lor rgyal mchog lnga pa chen po'i sku mdun du bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyer bdun par gling bsre dang lha sa p+samon lam chen mor grwa skor mdzad/dgung lo so gsum par gtsang du phebs/shar rtse'i mkhan po blo bzang pad+ma la rje'i gsung 'bum sogs kyi khrid dang/sngags pa dpon slob dge 'dun grub pa las dbang lung rjes gnang mang po zhus/sngags chen dkon mchog rgyal mtshan dang drung pa rgyal tshab pa sogs mkhas pa mang po'i zhabs la gtugs te mdo sngags kyi gzhung la sbyangs pa mthar byin mdzad/mkhas pa'i grags pa thob/dgung lo zhe gnyis pa chu phag (1683)lor mdo smad du phebs/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me yos (1687)lor khri chen klu 'bum ngag dbang blo gros rgya mtsho'i zhabs phyi mdzad de rgya nag pe cing du phebs/chu bya (1693)lor gong ma khang shes gdan 'dren ltar slar yang pe cin du phebs/mkhyen brtse nus pa'i gzi byin gyis gong mas dbu blar bkur/de na sa lo bzhi tsam rgya nag tu gsang bde 'jigs gsum gyi dbang dang rjes gnang khrid lung bcas gnang ba dang dge bsnyen dang rab byung gi sdom pa 'bogs pa sogs dam pa'i chos kyi sbyin pa rgya cher bstsal dgung lo nga drug pa me glang (1697)lor rgyal dbang mchog la gser yig 'bul bar dbus su phebs phyi lor byang lam bag+r+yud de pe cing du log gong mas mtsho bdun du lha gang gsar rgyab byas pa'i gtsug lag khang rten gsum thams cad rje 'di la gtad me khyi (1706)lor gong mas kwon ting phu'u shan bkang chi tA gau shri'i lung dang gser thang gnang dgung lo re dgu pa lcags stag (1710)lor dgon lung du phebs pa'i lam du sog yul gyi dgon sde yongs la zhabs bcags te dam chos kyi bdud rtsi phab bdun cu pa lcags yos (1711)lor slar pe cin du phebs yA dur jin 'brel rnying po'i TIk+ka bde gshegs dgongs rgyan byin rlabs myur du 'jug byed bla lha'i rnal 'byor skor sogs pod lnga tsam mdzad mthar dgung lo don gsum la phebs par ma byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing rta (1714)lor sku gshegs}
lcang skya rol pa'i rdo rje|{mtshan gzhan ye shes bstan pa'i sgron me dpal bzang po zhu ba 'di nyid tsong kha yang gi phyogs mdo smad yul gru lang gru sde bzhir rags pa'i nang tshan nub pad+mo sde'i chur gtogs pa'i 'brog nags brag dkar zer ba'i lung par yab ci kyA tshangs pa gu ru bstan 'dzin dang yum bu skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu ga nyis pa'i me bya (1717)lor sku bltams/mtshan grags pa bsodanams zhes gsol/dgung lo bzhi pa lcags byi (1720)lor chos sde chen po dgon lung byams pa gling gi lcang skya bla brang du phebs/'jam bzhad 'jigs med dbang pos lcang skya sku phreng gnyis pa blo bzang chos ldan gyi sprul skur ngos 'dzin mdzad/chu bzang rin po che blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi drung du skra phud phul te mtshan ngag dbang chos kyi grags pa bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan dpal bzang por gsol/sku gong ma'i slob ma rtse chos rje blo bzang chos 'dzin pa'i drung du gzab gshar gyi yi ge 'bri klog tshegs med par thugs su chud cing/chos spyod gsol 'debs kyi rim pa/bde gsang 'jigs gsum gyi sgrub thabs sogs 'phral mkho'i chos tshan phal che ba thugs 'dzin mdzad/dgung lo bdun pa chu yos (1723)lor rje blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi drung du yongs rdzogs dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa dang bar ma'i tshul khrims legs par bzhes/dgung lo brgyad pa shing 'brug (1724)lor gong ma g.yung Teng gis gdan drangs te zung gru zi dgon par sku gong ma'i chos kyi rgyal srid kyi khrir bkod/de nas rje khri chen mchog sprul blo bzang bstan pa'i nyi ma dang/dkar chen shes rab dar rgyas/a rtse chos rje blo bzang chos 'dzin bcas slob dpon dub sten nas rgyan drug mchog gnyis kyi gzhung chen rnams kyis gtsos mdo sngags kyi gzhung chen mo kun la gsan sbyong legs par mdzad de gzhan dring mi 'jog pa'i spobs pa brnyes/dgung lo dgu pa'i skabs byang chub lam gyi rim pa'i dmigs rnam gsol 'debs tshigs bcad ma ljags rtsom gyi thog mar mdzad/dgung lo bcu gcig pa'i dus nas skyabs 'gro'i khrid dang/dbang chen gyi rigs ma gtogs gang zhus ci dgar bstsal/dgung lo bcu bdun nas gzhung lugs la sbyangs pa'i rtsod par zhugs nas rgol ba'i spobs pa 'joms par mdzad/rgya dang sog po man chu bcas kyi skad yig kyang thugs su chud/gong mas rje 'di la sngags brjod gser gyi bka' lung dang bcas sku gong ma'i dus bzhin bkwan ting phu'u shan bkwan chi tA gau shri zhes bod skad du byams brtsis 'gro ba yongs kyi spyi bo nas dbang bskur ba'i kun mkhyen bla ma chen po zhes pa'i mtshan gyis gzengs bstod dang gser srang brgyad cu las grub pa'i tham ga /sngags brjod kyi gser yig bcas phul/shing yos (1735)lor skyabs mchog bskal bzang rgya mtsho mgar thar nang dbus su gtan 'dren par phebs/skyabs mchog de dang khri ngag dbang mchog ldan yab sras las ri bo dge ldan pa'i snyan brgyud kyi gdams pa yongs rdzogs gsan/me 'brug (1736)lo'izla bcu par gtsang du paN chen blo bzang ye shes las dge tshul gyi sdom pa mnos/mtshan ye shes bstan pa'i sgron me dpal bzang po zhes gnang/tshes bcu bdun nyin paN chen mchog gi drug nas dge slong gi sdom pa mnos/lo der rgya nag pe cin du phebs nas gong ma chen lung dang mjal/gong ma chen lung la thog mar skyabs 'gro'i khrid mdor bsdus dang/bod yig gzab gshar gyi 'bri klog /dag yig /byang chub lam rim/bde mchog dril bu lha lnga'i dbang bcas rim par gnang/dgung lo nyer lnga pa lcags bya (1741)lo'i zla ba bcu pa'i tshes shar nas rgyal ba'i bka'i dgongs 'grel gyi bstan bcos 'gyur ro cog lo tsA ba dum dang mnyam du sog skad du sgyur 'go tshugs /phyi lo zla gsum pa'i tshes lnga nyin yongs su grub ste par phud rgyal mchog bdun pa chen por phul/bka' 'gyur rin po che hor gyi yul gru kun la khyab par mdzad/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa sbrul (1749)lor rang yul mdo smad du phebs/dgon chen sku 'bum dang/dgon lung/gser khog gsum la gong mas phul ba'i rtsi pen bstsal zhing/zab chos bdud rtsi'i gru char phab ste 'gro don rgya cher mdzad/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i rdo rje'i sprul pa'i skur bsnyen rdzogs dge slong gi dang po bsgrubs te mtshan blo bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho zhes bstsal/lo de'i zla ba brgyad par pe cing du byon nas bod lugs kyi dgos pa mang po gsar du bzhengs/dgung lo zhe gcig par slar dbus su phebs/gong sa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho rgyal ba'i sprul skur ngos bzung/rgyal dbang bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i rnam thar brtsams/shing sprel (1764)lor dgon lung gi khri pa mdzad nas tshad ma rnam 'grel gyi 'dzin grwa gsar du btsugs/de nas dgung lo ca gcig par khri pa dgongs zhu gnang/me phag (1767)lor ri bo rtse lngar phebs nas e dang dga' 'khyil zhes pa'i sgrub khang btab/dgung lo nga lnga la phebs pa lcags yos (1771)lor gong ma'i ngo skul ltar bka' 'gyur chen mo man ju skad du sgyur ba'i dbu tshugs te bla ma mkhas pa dang yon tan ha cang bzang ba'i lo tsA ba bsdus te bsgyur/bdag nyid chen po 'di'i gsung las skyes pa'i slob ma'i nang nam pa'i skyes rabs 'dzin pa'i sprul sku dang/bka' pod mang po sbyangs pa'i dge bshes/sgrub pa snying por byed pa'i spong ba pa/skad gnyis smra ba'i lo tsA ba/'dul ba dang mdo sde la mkhas pa'i hwa shang/dad pa'i nor gyis phyug pa'i khyim bdag sogs mtha' dbus nor 'dzin gyi rgya khyon gang sar gnas/legs bshad kyi gsung rtsom yang (rgyal dbang thams cad mkhyen pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i rnam thar dpag bsam rin po che'i snye ma/) (grub mtha'i rnam gzhag thub bstan lhun po'i mdzes rgyan/) (dag yig mkhas pa'i 'byung gnas/) (byang chub lam gyi sgron ma'i sa bcad byang chub kyi sems bskyed tshul bshad pa theg chen 'jug sgo/) (gsang 'dus bsnyen yig dngos grub bdud rtsi'i bum bzang )sogs po ti dgu tsam bzhugs mthar dgung grangs bdun cu la phebs pa ram byung bcu gsum pa'i me rta (1786)lo'i bod zla bzhi pa'i tshes gnyis nyin ri bo rtse lnga'i e waM dga' 'khyil du gshegs}
