lcang lung khri rgan 'jam dbyangs thub bstan rgya mtsho|{lcang lung khri rgan rin po che 'jam dbyangs thub bstan rgya mtsho ni/mdo smad rma chu lho rgyud gyi rtse gzhung seng ge'i lha zhol gyi char gtogs dgon shul zhes pa'i tsho par yar skar ma dang yum mtsho mo skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me stag (1866)lor sku 'khrungs/mtshan gur mgon skyabs zhes gsol/dgung lo drug pa lcags lug (1871)lor rong po dgon chen du sku gong ma'i bzhugs nags kyang khrir bkod/lha sde dge 'dun yon tan las klog dang chos spyod kyi rigs tshegs med par thugs su chud/dgung lo brgyad pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu bya (1873)lor mkhan chen rin po che blo bzang lung rigs rgya mtsho'i drung du rab tu byung ba'i tshul khrims dang tshigs snga ma dge tshul gyi sdom pa yang dag par bzhes/mtshan 'jam dbyangs bstan 'dzin rgya mtshor gsol/shing bza' rdo rje 'chang blo bzang bstan pa'i dbang phyug tshul khrims phun tshogs las dbang lung mang du gsan/bcu gcig par rong po dkon chen bden chen chos 'khor gling gi rtsod grwar bzhugs/dge ba'i bshes gnyen dge 'dun bstan 'dzin yongs 'dzin dub sten/gzhan mkhan chen yongs 'dzin dge 'dun 'od zer dang dge bshes skyi rams pa sogs la dpe khrid ci rigs zhus/dgung lo bcu dgu pa shing sprel (1884)lor mkhan chen blo bzang lung rigs rgya mtshos mkhan slob sbrags ma dang/kun spangs 'dus 'dzin chen po dgon rong tshul khrims rgya mtshos gsang ste ston pa'i slob dpon mdzad de dag slong gi dngos por bsgrubs shing mtshan 'jam dbyangs thub bstan rgya mtsho dpal bzang por gsol/dgung lo nyer gsum pa nas rdo rje 'chang dge 'dun bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho dang/blo bzang skal ldan bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan phyogs las rnam rgyal/grub chen 'jigs med bsam gtan/rwa rgya'i sprul sku blo bzang tshul khrims rgya mtsho sogs mkhas grub dam pa mang po'i zhabs la gtugs te zab gsang chos kyi bdud rtsis thugs kyi bum bzang yongs su bkang/dgung lo nyer dgu par gnas sa chen po'i mkhar khris bzhugs te gdul bya mtha' yas pa'i don mdzad/so lnga par dpal ldan rgyud pa grwa tshang gsang sngags