chu byi dmag 'khrug|{rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa sprel (1908)lo'i zla 10par tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa pe cin nas bod du phebs rdog thon te sa bya (1909)lo'izla 9 tshes 30nyin lha sar phebs/lo der ching krung dbyang srid gzhung nas kra'o ar h+phung bod sdod am ban dang/zi khron dang yun nan mtha' mtshams don gcod blon chen du bskos pa dang/kra'o ar h+phung gis zi khron skam dmag nas hrag sgrug mi nyi stong tsam chab mdo brgyud lha sar btang ba de dag dmag khrims ha cang zhan stabs lam bar mi ser la rdab sig che ba'i thog ga gsod rdung sreg bcom byas kyen mi rigs 'brel bar gnod skyon chen po byung zhing/kra'o ar h+phung gi dmag mi lha sar 'byor skabs srung dmag mir (skabs de'i bod kyi sa srung dmag mi tsho gyon pa snam bu sngon po dang zhwa mo sog zhwa gyon gyi yod skad (me mda' brgyab ste bsad/de nyin lcags byi (1910)lo'i bod zla 1tshen 3yin stabs lha sa smon lam gyi gral 'dzin 'khel bas smon lam spyi khyab phun khang tha'i ji bkra shis rdo rje dang/las rogs rtse mgron 'jam dbyangs rgyal mtshan gnyis pho brang po ta la nas gtsug lag khang du yong ba'i lam bar klu sbug rgyal sgo'i (sman rtsis gang gi lho ngos thog rtseg tshong khang yod sa'i rgyud )'gram du zi khron dmag dang thug pas der mi mda' brgyab ste rtse mgron 'jam dbyangs rgyal mtshan dang phun khang tha'i ji'i zhabs gras gcig bsad/phung khang tha'i ji rmas pa sogs byung/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa dang/blon chen bshad sgra dpal 'byor rdo rje/zhol khang don grub phun tshogs/chang khyim mkhyen rab dpal ldan/bka' blon gsar byung ba dang/bsam pho ba/bka' chab gung thang pa sogs lha sa nas phebs thon zin pa ma zad/dga' ldan khri thog rgya bdun pa tshe smon gling sku phreng gsum pa bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan la srid skyong bskos pa sogs dpon rigs byings tshos shes rtogs med khar/rdzong rgyab spro khang du 'char can gyi tshes gsum thog mda'i dus chen mdzad sgo spel bzhin pa'i sar gnas tshul thos skabs dpon rigs 'ga' shas sa cha de rang nas nyi 'dabs grong gseb khag tu bros 'gro mkhan yang byung skad/zi khron dmag nas gang byung dumi gsod rku 'phrog sogs byas stabs de tshor ngo rgol byed mkhan je mang du song bas drag zing langs pa ma zad/zi khron dmag nang khul du'ang 'gal ba chen po byung nas zing cha mang po langs pa sogs lab rten lha sar mi bde ba'i drag zing chen po byung/skabs der bka' blon tsha rong dbang phyug rgyal pos bka' shag gi gtso 'gan 'khur bzhin pa des nyin mo rtse pho brang du bka' shag lhan rgyas sar 'gro ba dang/mtshan mo klu sbug ya mon am ban sar 'gro ba sogs (re 'gas lha sar bde 'jags yong re byas pa zer ba dang/la las tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i nyan rna mkhan yin skad/de 'ga' zi khrod dmag dpung gi nyul ma red zer ba sogs shod stangs mi 'dra ba 'ga' zhig yod )byas par lha sar/snga dro gser bya yin zer/_/po ta la la phebs kyis/_/dgongs mo g.yu bya yin zer/_/ya mon gzhung la phebs shag /zer ba sogs yig skyur sbyar ba dang glu gzhan gtong ba sogs byas te gleng phyogs bzos mthar tsha rong bka' blon dang de'i bu bka' mgron po ta la'i mdun du dmar gsod btang/gzhan yang smon grong mgron gnyer chen mo dang de'i tsha bo rtse drung zhig sogs zi khrod dmag gis dga' nye yin tshul gyis bsad 'dug /lha sa'i grong khul de lho byang gnyis su gyur te lho ngos rnams bod dmag gis bzung/de snga sa phag (1899)lor bstan rgyas gling gi dgon bdag srid skyong zur pa de mo ngag dbang blo bzang 'phrin las rab rgyal yi cha bo nor bu tshe ring dang don ldan sogs nas tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa bkrong ste de mo bla brang nas mu mthud srid dbang 'dzin rgyu'i re ba bcangs te khams kyi nyag sprul dang 'phyong rgyas dpar ri sprul sku sogs la mthu gtad thabs byas tshul gsang ba gyar stabs de mo srid zur dang bla brang gi las na le thogs yod rigs 'dzin bzung thog 'dri zhib kyis ngos len byas pa bzhin de mo srid zur bstan rgyas gling chos rar mtshams su bzhugs rgyu dang/nor bu ri tsheng sogs la nyes chad nan po bcad thog de mo srid zur ring min sku gshegs/bstan rgyas gling grwa tshang gi bdag thob gzhung bzhes sogs byas par bstan rgyas gling grwa tsh