chu bzang ngag dbang thub bstan dbang phyug|{chos rje don grub rin chen gyi sku skyer grags pa 'di nyid rang byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing sbrul (1725)lor lcang skya rol pa'i rdo rje'i sku mched du 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu bdun par dbus lha ldan zhing du phebs/'bras spungs sgo mang chos grwar zhugs/sku gong ma zlo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan rgyal mchog bdun pa'i thog ma'i yongs 'dzin yin pas rje 'di la bkur bzos che bar mdzad/rgyal dbang mchog dang/khri chen ngag dbang mchog ldan/rje ngag dbang byams pa sogs kyi zhabs la gtugs nas slob gnyer mdzad pas gzhung lugs la nang byan chud par gyur/rgyal dbang rin po cher bsnyen rdzogs zhus/khri chen ngag dbang mchog ldan las 'jigs byed bskyed rim gnas pas mthar yin nas rdzogs rim la myong ba thon/dgung lo nyer bzhir phebs pa sa 'brug (1748)lor mdo smad de phebs te dgon lung/gser dgon/sku 'bum rnams kyi khrir bzhugs/chos srid gnyis char gyis bskyangs/de nas rgya nag pe cin du phebs nas lcang skya rin po che dang rol bo mtshan sgrogs las 'grel ba bzhi sbrags sogs chos bka' gang zab mnos/gong ma chan lung gis lcang skyang rol pa'i rdo rjer lo tsA mdzad du bcug nas rje 'di la khyab pa'i dmigs pa sogs zhi gnas las brtsams te bka' 'dri zhus/dgung lo so drug steng bya khyung du thog mar phebs nas bsnyen mtshams dang/rgyud pa grwa tsang la gsang sde 'jigs gsum gyi dbang dang tshogs chen la kun rig gi dbang bstsal/dgung lo zhe brgyad la phebs pa ram byung bcu gsum pa'i chu 'brug (1772)lor bya khyung dgon pa'i mkhan rabs so dgu pa'i seng khrir phebs/dgung lo lnga bcu tsam nas sku 'bum mkhan po las thog pa mgon rgya tshang ma bzhugs pa'i rkyen gyis gdan nas g.yas g.yon gnyis ka zung 'brel du bskyangs/de ltar lo bcu'i ring 'chad nyan la gzigs rtog gang drag dang/zla ngo re gnyis su sku mtshams la bzhugs pa/snga phyir thugs rje chen po/gdugs dkar/'jigs byed bcu gsum pa rnams kyi dbang bstsal ba sogs 'dod chos ci rigs so so'i mos pa bzhin gnang nas bstan pa'i bya ba rlabs gang tshe mdzad/bya khyung 'du khang chen mo ka brgya dang nyer brgyad can phyi nang bar gsum zhig gso dang/bya khyung gi chu bzang bla brang gsar gsos gnang/'du khang du spyan ras gzigs kyi li sku rgyab yol bzhugs khri dang bcas pa/btsan khang du stag lpags kyi rgyal mtshan/bla bre/dngul gyi bkra shis rtags brgyad sogs gsar bzhengs thog gzhan lha khang 'du khang so sor stong mchod dang mchod rdzas kyi thebs dngul phon chen phul/dgung lo nga bdun la phebs pa lcags glang (1781)lor khri dgongs zhu mdzad/dgung lo re gcig la phebs pa'i shing sbrul (1785)lor ched du gdan zhus ltar dan tig dang/gong skya/tshe tan sogs kyi dgon par phebs shing/rim par de dag gi khri pa mdzad de chos srid nyis kyis bskyangs/khyad par dan tig this pa yang tig rnams la gnas mjal skabs dag pa'i gzigs snang mang du byung zhing/brag la rang byon gyi lha sku 'di dang 'di res ces bstan par mdzad/me lug (1787)lor bya khyung gdan rabs dang lcang skya rol pa'i rdo rje'i rnam thar brtsams/dgung lo don gnyis la phebs pa rang byung bcu gsum pa'i me 'brug (1796)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
chu bzang sku phreng dang po rnam rgyal dpal 'byor|{rab byung bcu pa'i sa rta (1618)lo stod lung dkar leb khang gsar du sku 'khrungs/rwa stod dang 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang du bzhugs/gling bsre zhes pa'i mtshan rtags blangs/gtsang pa rgyal pos sa skya dang bka' brgyud pa'i dge bshes gnyen dge lugs pa dang rtsod pa rgyag tu bcug par pha rol pham par byas shing/rjes su mdo smad du gdan drangs te mtsho srib tu log gcig tsam da dung thang kher zhes par lo shas bzhugs/de nas sku 'bum gyi khri dang/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa glang (1649)lo 'bum lung bkra shis thang nu chu bzang dgon dga' ldan mi 'gyur gling zhes pa phyag btab pa nas bzung sku phreng rin byon la chu bzang zhes pa'i mtshan thogs/lcags yos (1651)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
