chos kyi phung po|{spyir chos kyi phung po brgyad khri bzhi stong lta bu nyon mongs 'dul byed kyi gnyen por gsungs pa'i lung gi chos thams cad la chos kyi phong po zhes bya ste/brjod bya don dang rjod da kyi tshig du ma spungs pa'i phung por snang ba'i phyir ro/_/chos kyi phung po la brgyad khri dang/brgyad khri bzhi stong gi bzhed tshul gnyis las/kha che bye brag smra ba la sogs pas/chos kyi phung po brgyad khri dag /gang rnams thub pas gsungs de dag /ces pa'i mdzod kyi tshig dang mthun par brgyad khri las brgyad khri bzhi stong gi rnam gzhag khas mi len kyang sde pa kha cig brgyad khri bzhi stong du 'don pa'ang yod par gsungs la/theg chen pa rnams ni chos phung brgyad khri bzhi stong las brgyad khri'i rnam bzhag mi byed de/ji skad du thub pa chen pos chos phung po/_/brgyad khri bzhi stong gsungs pa las/_/zhes pa ltar khas len no/_/chos kyi phung po re re'i tshad la 'dod tshul mang yang/mngon pa gong map+latar na tsheg bar sum cu so gnyis la sho lo ka gcig /de stong du longs pa na chos phung gi tshad du 'jog pa dang mngon pa 'og ma ltar na glang po che sa srung gi bus theg tsam gyi snag tshas chos kyi phung po gcig 'bri bar nus pa'i tshad phung po rer brtsi ba sogs yod pa las/spyir 'dod chags sogs nyon mongs pa brgyad khri bzhi stong re re'i gnyen por chos phung re re bstan cing rang rang gi gnyen po'i bya ba yongs su rdzogs pa'i gtan gyi tshogs la chos kya phung po zhes bya ste/mngon las/spyod pa rnams kyi gnyen por ni/_/chos kyi phung po mthun par gsungs/_/zhes pa ltar ro/_}
chos kyi phung po brgyad khri bzhi stong|{'dod chags zhe sdang gti mug gsum/de gsum cha mnyam nyis khri chig stong gi gnyen por 'dul ba mdo mngon pa sde snod gsum cha mnyam pa nyis khri chig stong re re gsungs pas chos kyi phung po brgyad khri bzhi stong ste/tshad ni glang po che sa srung gi bus theg tshad gyi snag tshas chos phung gcig bris nus so/_/yang rang grol dbang drag rgyal mtsho'i zhal nas chos kyi phung po brgyad khri bzhi stong yang/nyon mongs pa brgyad khri bzhi stong gi gnyen por gsungs pa ste/de yang rtsa ba 'dod chags las gyur pa'i nyon mongs pa nyis khris chig stong gi gnyis por 'dul ba nyis khri chog stong gsungs te/de yang dbye na gnyen po dam bcas la brten pa'i khri phrag gcig /rang bzhin la brten pa'i khri phrag gcig /zung 'jug la brten pa'i khri phrag gcig gsungs so/rtsa ba zhe sdang las gyur pa'i nyon mongs nyis khri chig stong gi gnyen por mdo sde nyis khri chig stong gsungs ste/de yang byang sems smon pa lab rten pa'i khri phrag gcig /'jug pa la brten pa'i khri phrag gcig /zung 'ug la brten pa'i khri phrag gcig /rtsa ba gti mug las gyur pa'i nyon mongs pa nyis khri chig stong gi gnyen por mngon pa nyis khri chog stong gsungs te/de yang dbye na/skye med la brten pa'i shes rab khri phrag gcig /'gag med la brten pa'i shes rab khri phrag gcig /gnyis med zung 'jug la brten pa'i shes rab khri phrag gcig gsungs so/_/rtsa ba dug gsum la cham mnyam las gyur pa'i nyon mongs pa nyis khri chig stong gi gnyen por yo ga nyis khri chog stong gsungs te/de yang bskyed rim la brten pa'i khri phrag gcig /rdzogs rim la brten pa'i khri phrag gcig bskyed rdzogs zung 'jug la brten pa'i ye shes khri phrag gcig gsungs so/_/ces gsungs so/_}
