chos sku|{sbyor ba bzhi bsgoms stobs kyis thob pa'i 'bras bu mthar thug de chos sku'o/_/gang zag gcig 'tshang rgya ba la shes par bya ba yul mkhyen par gsum dang/nyams su len pa'i sbyor ba bzhi bsgoms pa'i rnam smin nam 'bras bu mtha' thug pa chos kyi sku ste/(don bsdus rin chen sgron me )las shes bya'i yul du mkhyen pa gsum/sgom pa'i dus su sbyor ba bzhi/_/'bras bu mthar thug chos kyi sku/_/zhes gsungs pa ltar ro/_/'ga' zhig tu nyon mongs pa dang shes bya'i sgrig pa gnyis bag chags dang bcas pa ma lus pa bcom pa spangs pa phun tshogs ni ngo bo nyid sku dang/shes bya ji lta ba dang ji snyed pa mkhyen pa'i ye shes kyi chos thams cad kyi mtshan nyid ji lta ba bzhin gzigs shing thugs su chud pa rtogs pa phun tshogs ni chos kyi sku'o zhes rnam par bzhag pa'ang yod/chos sku mtshon byed kyi sku bzhi ste/ngo bo nyid sku/ye shes chos sku/longs spyod rdzogs pa'i sku/sprul pa'i sku bzhi'o/_}
