chos khrims|{ston pa sangs rgyas kyis dge slong dang dge tshul/rab byung bcas la so so'i bsam blo'i chu tshang dang mthun pa'i khrims gtan 'bebs gnang ba de la chos khrims zer/kho tshos khrims de las 'gal ba byung na sang gi nang ma langs tshun chad rang gi khrims grogs dang yang na rang dang sdom pa rigs mtshungs yin pa'i sdom ldan zhig la rang gi nyes pa ngos len zhus tshe zla ba kha shas ring dman pa'i bya spyod lnga dang len zhus te nyes chad bcas pa tsam gyis 'thus pa las/sgrigs 'dzugs nas phud pa'i nyes chad gcod mi dgos/gal te khrims 'gal byed pos khrims las 'gal nas ngos len ma zhus pa rang sang nyin gyi nang langs na khrims las 'gal nas zhig gcig song zin pas tshogs pa'i sgrigs 'dzugs nang nas phun pa'i chad las thob pa sogs nyes chad lci yang gi rim pa mi 'dra ba yod pa ma gtogs lus kyi thog nyes brdung dang/'dzin bzung byas pa/btson du 'jug pa sogs kyi khrims gcod byed mi chog pa yin/'on kyang/bod du chos srid zung 'brel gyi lam lugs dar rjes gong du bshad pa'i chos khrims des dgon pa'i nang du yod pa'i grwa pa'i chos khrims legs po yong ba'i 'gan srung byed mi thub par gyur pa dang chabs cig /dgon pa khag la bran g.yog dang/mi ser/mchod gzhis bcas yod pa'i dbang gis kho tshor bkas bkod brgyud 'dzin gyi khrims lugs lag bstar byed pa dang 'dra bar dgos pa'i nang gi khrims 'gal grwa pa tshor yang nyes brdung dang btson 'jug sogs bkas bkod brgyud 'dzin gyi khrims lugs lag bstar byed kyi yod stabs khrims lugs lag bstar byed stangs thad bkas bkod brgyud 'dzin gyi srid gzhung dang khyad par med pa de 'dra byung ba yin}
chos khrims kyi bya ba'i khur bzod par byed pa|{chos khrims pa'i 'gan khur byed pa'i don ste/chos khrims pa dang/dge bskos/zhal ngo zhes pa rnams don gcig /'on kyang dgos pa so sor ming 'bod stangs mi 'dra ba yod/se 'bras dga' gsum gyi tshogs chen dge bskos la grwa pas ming 'bod dus tshogs chen zhal ngo'am zhal ngo zhes zer zhing/sa gnas srid gsung nas ming 'bod skabs tshogs chen dge bskos dang chos khrims pa zer/grwa tshang so so dang dgon pa gzhan dag chung chung gi dge bskos la dge bskos dang/yang na chos khrims pa zer ba las/zhal ngo mi zer/las 'gan ni dgon pa'i mkhan po'i bka' dang bstun nas/grwa pa'i chos lugs kyi sgrig lam lta rtogs byed rgyu dang/sgrigs dang 'gal ba la nyes pa gcod pa/tshogs gzhung du snyan gsan zhu rgyu'am tshogs gtam gtong rgyu bcas dgon pa che chung tshang ma 'dra ba yin/dgon pa 'ga' zhig la dge bskor zer ba las 'gan gong ltar gyi thog dgon pa'i spyi rdzas do dam/gzhan gyis phul ba'i dngul gyi do dam/dgon pa'i mi ser dang mnyam du srid gzhung gi khral sgrub rgyu dang/tshogs 'dur 'gro rgyu sogs byed dgos/da dung dge bskos 'khyur na grwa pa la dge bskos lhag mchod yin zer ba'i gtong sgo chen po zhig gtong dgos/sngar mi dmangs dang sbyin bdag nas phul ba'i gtong sgo'i thebs rtse bod dngul srang sum cu'i skyed thog nas gras pa brgya tsam la ja thug zhig gtong dgos pa sogs yod pa ma zad/dge bskos so so'i gras mtshams su slebs nas byed pa'am yang na dgongs pa zhu dgos/dgongs pa zhus tshe grwa par dgongs zhu'i gtong sgo gtong dgos pa sogs yod stabs/dgon pa 'ga' zhig la dge bskos ming mtshams slebs dus yul byol du 'gro mkhan yod/se 'bras dge gsum sogs dgon pa chen po'i dge bskos ni sa gnas srid gzhung ngam bla ma'i phyag mdzod nas bsko bzhag byed dgos stabs/sku drag tshos bod dngul rdo tshad lnga brgya nas khri bar bskyal nas yong thabs byed kyi yod/chos lugs rang gi khrims dang bstun te nyes can btang na phyag 'tshal rgyu dang/spyi rdzas nyams gso byed rgyu/shag nang du bzang btson du 'jog rgyu/nyes pa che shos dgon pa nas phud pa bcas de las lhag pa'i khrims gtong mi chog }
