chos grags|{(slob dpon chos kyi grags pa )slob dpon phyogs kyi glang po'i slob ma slob dpon dbang phyug sde'i dngos slob yin/slob dpon 'di dang bod kyi rgyal po srong btsan sgom po gnyis dus thog gcig yin par jo nang tA ra nA thas brtsams pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )las bshad/rgyal gar lho phyogs tri ma la ya zer ba'i yul du 'khrungs/yab bram ze'i rigs kyi mu stegs ro nan+d+ra zhes zer/chung ngus rig gnas lnga dang mu stegs kyi grub mtha' la shin tu mkhas par sbyangs nas lo bco brgyad son tshe mu stegs kyi lta ba la shin tu mkhas par gyur/rjes su sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung la gzigs nas mu stegs kyi grub mtha' dor bas pha ma zhang po dang bcas pas khyim nas bskrad/rgya gar yul dbus su byon nas de'i slob dpon chos skyong gi drung du rab tu byung nas sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsung rab mtha' dag la mkhas par sbyangs/slob dpon dbang phyug sde'i drung du (tshad ma kun btus )tshar gsum gsan/na len+d+rar rtsod gleng du 'ongs pa'i mu stegs pa'i mkhas pa grags can mang po snga rjes su pham par mdzad/rgya gar shar phyogs dang lho phyogs kyi rgyud du phebs nas mu stegs pa mang po btul zhing sangs rgyas chos lugs dar bar mdzad de lha khang dang chos gzhi brgya lhag tsam gsar du btsugs/slob ma khri phrag mang po yod kyang mnyam du gnas pa ni lnga las med/sku tshe'i mthar rgya gar lho phyogs kyi rgyud du bzhugs nas/yul ka ling+kar mya ngan las 'das/slob dpon 'dis brtsams pa'i bstan bcos mang po yod kyang yongs su grags shing bod du bsgyur ba'i gras (tshad ma rnam 'grel )dang/(tshad ma rnam nges/) (rigs pa'i thigs pa )bcas gsum dus rabs bcug cig pa'i mjug tu rngog lo tsA ba blo ldan shes rab kyis bsgyur zhing/(gtan tshigs thigs pa )dang/('grel pa brtag pa/) (rgyud gzhan sgrub pa/) (rtsod pa'i rigs pa )bcas dus rabs brgyad pa'i dkyil du lo tsA ba ban+de nam mkha' sogs kyis sgyur ba bstan 'gyur mdo phyogs pod (ce)par yod/slob dpon 'di'i lo rgyus rgyas pa bu ston rin po ches mdzad pa'i (bu stong chos 'byung )dang ngo nang tA ra nA thas brtsams pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )gnyis su gsal bas der gzigs}
chos grwa'i slob dpon|{chos slob slob grwa'i slob dpon/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i skabs chos kyi slob grwa'i slob dpon dang lo tsA ba gcig lcogs lta bu ni thon mi sam b+ho Ta yin pa las gzhan dag yod pa'i gnas tshul lo rgyus khag tu mi gsal zhing/rgyal po khri srong lde btsan skabs bsam yas su chos kyi slob grwa thog mar btsugs te der slob grwa ba mi grangs nyi shu rtsa lnga dang/chos slob slob dpon bcu gsum yod pa dang/de rnams la zla ba rer phogs ji tsam yod pa'i skor bcas rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi lo rgyus skabs su gsal bas 'dir ma smros}
chos rgyal 'khon phu ba|{'di nyid ma gcig zha ma'i ming po yin cing/rab byung dang po'i sa byi (1069)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun brgyad nas yab mched las yig klog bslabs/gnyam pa'i drung du dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa dang smon 'jug gi sems bskyed mnos/spyod phyogs kyi gzhung che phra mang po gsan/dgung lo bcu bzhir phebs skabs rong zos chos bzang gi drung du byon/smra sgo sogs mkhas par bslabs/rma lo tsA bas skad rigs mang po mkhyen pas khong la yang sbyangs pa mdzad/shab tu rma'i phyag phyir byon/rma gshegs khar phyag dpe la sogs pa thams cad gnang nas/zhal chems bzhag pa bzhin thog mar bod kyi mkhas pa dge bshes zhang dang/rgyang rong gangs pa sha'u/mar pa seng rdzi la sogs pa bsten nas chos mang po gsan/dgung lo nyer drug la phebs skabs bal por byon nas ye rang ba'i spyan sngar mai tri ba'i chos rnams gsan/de bzhin pham mthing pa dang/'khon sgye chu/dam pa sangs rgyas/rwa lo sogs las gsan pa mang du mdzad/slar yang bal por byon nas rgya gar gyi bla ma mi mnyam rdo rje las lU nag dril gsum nA ro pa'i lugs dang bcas pa'i bde mchog dbang dang bcas pa gsan/de nas bod du phebs te dgung lo so gcig nas 'khod phu rdzings kyi brag dmar du sgrub pa mdzad/lo gnyis song ba dang lcam dral gnyis lam 'bras gsan du byang la byon/de rjes jo mog nyis kyang khab tu bzhes/slar 'khon phur sgrub pa mdzad nas dam bca' rdzogs par mdzad/dgung lo bzhi bcu rtsa bzhir phebs skabs 'khon phu'i gnas mi 'dra ba mang po dang/brin snye nam/pha drug /la stod lho byang gi gnas mang por bzhugs nas gdul bya mang po la grub snying la thogs pa'i khrid bskyangs nas chos kyi 'khor lo legs par bskor/sgrub pa dang bshad pa'i grwa gnyis ka stobs che bar mdzad/de'i tshe zha ma lcam sring zhes yul thams cad du snyam pas khyab/de ltar rjes 'khon phu ba zhes grags shing/mtshan dngos chos kyi rgyal po zhes zhu ba des gzhan don rgya cher mdzad nas mthar dgung lo bdun cu don grub par rab byung gnyis pa'i shing byi (1144)lor sku gshegs}
chos rgyal sgrub phug|{po ta la pho brang dpar po'i byang zur du yod pa'i brag phug lha khang gi rnam par par yod pa zhig ste/sngar rgyal po srong btsan sgom pos po ta la'i pho brang ma brtsigs gong sgom sgrub gnang ba'i gnas yin/'di'i nang rgyal po srong btsan sgom po/rgya bza'/bal bza'/mong bza'/sras gung ring gung btsan/blon po mgar/thon mi/rje tsong kha pa/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa sogs kyi 'dra sku yod}
chos rgyal phun tshogs bkra shis|{('bri gung gdan rabs nyi shu pa )chos rgyal phun tshogs bkra shis ni mal dro gung mkhar rgya ma khri khang du yab lha sras gnyis pa rin chen phun tshogs dang yum rig 'dzin bu khrid kyi sras su me lug lor sku bltams/mtshan nor bu zhes btags/dbu la gtsug tor dang yi ge a gsal yod par grags/sku na chung ngu nas 'jig rten gyi gtsug lag rnams la mkhas shing/dgung lo bdun la spro lung du phebs/yab rje rin chen phun tshogs kyi drung nas 'bri gung gi chos spyi dang/gsar rnying gi dbang chos bsam gyis mi khyab pa sogs gsan/de nas rgyal mar bzhugs/dgung lo bcu gcig thog yab sku gshegs/khu bo rin chen rnam rgyal gyi drung nas rab tu byung/yab gshegs nas lo gsum gsang rgya mdzad pa dus yol nas tshogs mang du dgongs rdzogs kyi 'phro dang/dngul gdung bzhengs/de rjes yum gshegs pa'i 'das mchod rnams mdzad/sde pa mkhar rtse bas rgya mar dmag byas pas ka tshal du phebs/snye mo sgrub sde sogs mtshams grwa khag lo gsum re nas brje len gnang ba'i rgyun tshugs/bla ma mang po las zab chos du ma gsan pa dang/sgrub pa nyams bzhes la thugs brtson par mdzad/chos 'khor rgya cher bskor/rwa sgreng dang/nyang po sogs su phebs nas chos phyogs kyi mdzad pa sna tshogs bstan/long po nas dpon sa nor bu sgrol ma khab tu bzhes par sras shig byung yang zhag bcu gsum las sku ma 'tsho zhing mi ring bar dpon sa (lcam )yang gshegs/nga phod sde pa'i sras mo a lce g.yang khug khab tu bzhes par sras che ba nA ro gnyis pa 'khrungs/'bri gung du bzhugs skabs sde pa mgon po dpal gyis sku la bsdo par brtsam pa mkhyen te byang 'bab rong tu phebs/sde pa skyid shod pa yon bdag tu gyur/sgom pa rin chen rnam rgyal phag mor khab tu byon pa nas 'phri phag phan tshun gdung gcig tu yin yang rje 'di 'bri gung gi gdan sar bzhugs par 'phri phag ('bri gung la thog kha nang so dang phag mor khang gsar nang so zer zhing bsdus ming la khang thog gnyis zer )ma mthun pas dus 'khrug mang du byung yang rim gyis 'jags/lcags glang lo gzhu sman phu gu gdong du rdzong gsar bkra shis phyag 'debs pa'i sa 'dul gnang/de nas yangs ri sgar gyi 'dus pa rnams la zhal gdams nan che bstsal te sku mtshams la bzhugs/chu stag lo dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim tshul bstan/rje 'di la bu slob byang bdag bkra shis stong rgyal yab sras dang chos lung mkhan chen byams pa chos 'phel sogs du ma yod/rigs sras ni gdan rabs nyer gcig pa nA ro gnyis pa bkra shis phun tshogs grags pa rgyal mtshan dang/zhwa dmar drug pa dpal ldan chos kyi dbang phyug /gdan rabs nyer gnyis pa rje btsun dkon mchog rin chen rnams yin/gong gsal rigs sras rnams kyi 'khrungs yul yang 'bri gung gi sa char yin pa dang/zhwa dmar drug pa ngag dbang chos kyi dbang phyug ni rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing sprel (1584)lo sku bltams/zhwa dmar sku phreng drug par ngos 'dzin zhus te gdan sa yangs pa can gyi chos khrir phebs/rab byung bsnyen rdzogs sogs sdom bzhes dang/sku yon gsan bzhes kyis mkhas btsun bzang po'i mdzad pas gdul bya bskyangs nas dgung grangs zhe brgyad thog sku gshegs}
chos rgyal mes dbon rnam gsum|{'di la drangs tshul 'dra min gnyis las/gcig ni/lha tho tho ri snyan shal/srong btsan sgam po/khri srong lde btsan gsum du byas pa dang/gzhan zhig ni srong btsan/khri srong/khri ral pa can gsum la ngos 'dzin pa yin/'dres tshang dang po de ni/lha tho tho ri snyan shal gyi dus su chos kyi dbu brnyes/srong btsan gyi dus su srol btad/khri srong gi dus su dar zhing rgyas par mdzad ces pa'i tha snyad sbyar srol ltar dang/'dren tshul gnyis pa de ni/spyan ras gzigs kyi sprul pa srong btsan/'jam dbyangs kyi sprul pa khri srong lde btsan/phyag na rdo rje'i sprul pa khri ral pa can zhes rigs gsum mgon po'i sprul pa'i rgyal po gsum zer ba'i tha snyad sbyar srol ltar yin}
