chos sgo ba rdo rje ye shes|{'bri gung gi gdan rabs bdun pa 'di nyid snubs nam mkha'i snying po dang sangs rgyas ye shes kyi rgyud las rab byung bzhi pa'i chu lug (1223)lor bltams/gcung rdo rje grags pa las rab tu byung/de nyid dang thog kha ba las 'bri gung gi chos rnams gsan/mtshams bcad pa rin po che dag zhing du phebs nas bcu gnyis rin po che dgung lo phra stabs rje nyid dgung lo re drug la phebs pa sa phyi (1288)lor sa skyas 'bri gung bcom pas 'bri gung gling log ces pa byung/de skabs gling rin po che skyob pas bzhengs pa'i bkra shis sgo mang/dbon dang spyan snga grags 'byung gis bzhengs pa'i+o mang dang rten gsum bsam gyis mi khyab pa/gcung rin po ches bzhengs pa'i lha khang chen mo sog rten grangs las 'das pa mer bsregs/dge 'dun mang po bkrongs/chos sgo ba rdo rje ye shes mchog gis bcu gnyis pa rin po che sku mched dang/'bri gung gi nang rten khyad 'phags can 'ga' zhig dang bcas kong po'i phyogs su phebs/skabs der 'bri gung gi mi sde phal cher yul 'khyar/khang pa thams cad zhig ral du gyur/sa zhing thams cad 'jag skyar song ba sogs das mi bde ba chen po byung/rje nyid dgung lo don gcig la phebs pa rab byung lnga pa'i chu sbrul (1293)lor sku gshegs}
chos sgra chen po lan gsum du bsgrags|{1 dpal mgon klu sgrub kyis lo bcu gnyis bar 'tsho bas phongs pa med par mdzad rjes bar skabs shig na bslab khrims 'chal bar spyod pa mang po zhig gis sa'i steng khyab ste rgyal ba'i bstan pa nang mdzod 'dul ba ches cher nyams par byas pa thugs kyis ma bzod nas bslab khrims 'chal par spyod pa stong phrag mang po gnas nas phyung/skal ba dang ldan pa rnams la sde snod gsum gyi chos rgyal cher bstan cing/lhag par dam pa'i chos 'dul ba rgya cher bsgrags pa ni/chos sgra las gsum gyi dang po yin/2 stong nyid kyi don ma rtogs nas thar pa dang thams cad mkhyen pa gang gi'i lam bgrod pa'i thabs med par gzigs nas thugs snying rje chen pos rang dbang med par bskul te chos rnams kyi gnas lugs rten cing 'brel bar 'byung ba don dam par rang bzhin gyis grub pa rdul tsam yang med pa dang/tha snyad du dkar nag gi las 'bras yang bslu ba med par nges pa gnyis 'gal med du rtogs pa dbu ma'i lam bzang po rgya cher bsgrags te/gang gis rten cing 'brel bar 'byung/_/zhes sogs (dbu ma rtsa ba'i tshig le'ur byas pa )dang/de'i yan lag (rigs tshogs )rnams mdzad de 'dzam bu'i gling du sher phyin gyi mdo sde rin po che'i don ches cher gsal bar mdzad de theg pa chen po'i chos kyi sgra bsgrags par mdzad pa ni chos sgra chen po gnyis pa bsgrags par 'jog /3 bstan pa nam yang mi nub par yun ring du gnas pa'i phyir rdo rje gdan la rdo'i dra mig gi ra ba dang mchod rten brgya phrag mang po dang/dpal ldan 'bras spungs kyi mchod rten la lcags ri btab cing/dge 'dun gyi sder mchod gzhi mang po btsugs/sku tshe smad la gtso cher lho phyogs dpal gyi rir bzhugs shing mdo sngags gnyis ka'i chos kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor/lhag par (chos dbyings bstod pa )sogs mdzad nas chos kyi gra chen po gsum pa bsgrags pa yin no/_}
chos brgya|{sems kyi chos brgyad dang/sems las byung ba'i chos nga gcig /gzugs kyi chos bcu gcig /sems dang mi ldan pa'i 'du byed kyi chos nyer bzhi/'dus ma byas pa'i chos drug dang bcas so/_}
