chos 'chad skabs kyi skyon lnga|{bshad bya'i chos ma shes pa/man ngag med pa/bla ma'i gsung dang lung med pa/bshad bya'i chos kyi skyon brjod pa/rnyed bkur ched du bshad pa/yang dag chub par ma byas pa/gdams ngag med pa/don med par spros pa la dga' ba/chos de la ma dad pas skyon brjod pa/rnyed bkur sngon du btang ste 'chad pa}
chos 'chad dus kyi 'du shes lnga|{rang la sman pa/chos la sma/nyan pa po la nad pa/de bzhin gshegs pa la skyes bu dam pa/chos kyi tshul la yun ring du gnas pa'i 'du shes bskyed pa}
chos 'chad dus rnam pa ldan pa'i gtam nyi shu|{dus gsum bsgrim pa/go rim/mtshams sbyar ba/rjes su mthun pa/dga' bar bya ba/'dor bar bya ba/mgu bar bya ba/spro ba bskyed pa/mi smad pa/rig pa/'brel ba/ma 'dres pa/chos dang ldan pa/'khor ji lta ba bzhin/byams pa/phan sems/snying brtse ba/rnyed bkur mi bsten pa/bdag bstod/gzhan smod mi bya'o/_}
chos 'chad pa'i skabs kyi skyon gsum|{lus ngag yid kyi chos 'chad skyon}
chos 'chad pa'i skabs kyi nyes byas sde tshan nyer drug|{mi na bar 'dug pa la 'greng ste bshad pa/nyal ba la 'dug ste ston pa/stan mthon po dang bzang por 'dug pa la dma' ba dang ngan par 'dug ste bshad pa/mdun nas 'gro ba la rgyab nas ston pa/mgo g.yog pa dang/gos brjes pa dang/chos gos phrag pa gnyis kar gzar ba dang/lag pa gnya' gong du bsnol ba dang/ltag par bsnol ba dang/do ker can (mgo skra gtsug tor ltar bcings pa )dang/zhwa gyon pa dang/cod pan can dang/mgo la phreng ba bcings pa dang/mgo thod kyis dkris pa dang/glang po che la zhon pa dang/rta la zhon pa dang/'do la sogs khyogs la 'dug pa/bzhon pa'i steng na 'dug pa dang/mchil lham gyon pa dang/lag na 'khar ba thogs pa dang/gdugs thogs pa dang/mtshon thogs pa dang/ral gri thogs pa dang/dgra sta thogs pa dang/go cha gyon pa la chos bshad pa'o/_}
