chos 'chad pa'i gdams ngag brgyad|{'dod chags/zhe sdang/gti mug /nga rgyal/rnam rtog /rtag chad kyi lta ba dang/lam 'bras bu ma thob kyang thob snyam pa'i gnyen po ston pa}
chos 'chad tshul lnga|{brda dag pa/'brel chags pa/'tsham pa/'thad pa/snyan gsal}
chos 'chad yul min pa 'dul bar gsungs pa tshan lnga|{'greng sogs lnga/mgo g.yog sogs lnga/do ker can sogs lnga/glang chen sogs bzhon lnga/lag na 'khor ba thogs sogs lnga la mi 'chad de zhib phra gong du chos 'chad pa'i skabs kyi nyes byas sde tshan nyer drug ces par gzigs}
chos 'chad yul rung mi rung dbang po spyod pa sogs brtag par bya ba lnga|{rnam par rtog pa/'gro lugs spyod pa smra ba/mig dang gdong gi rnam pa yis nang gi sems rtogs par bya ba}
chos rje kun dga' rgyal mtshan|{rje 'di nyid mon mtha' yul stan char zhes par ma sangs ar pa spun brgyad kyi rigs su rab byung brgyad pa'i me sbrul (1497)lor 'khrungs/chung ngu'i dus skye ba sngon ma'i bag chags gsal bar gsungs/dgung lo bcu bzhi pa la dbus su byon nas spyan snga chos grags pa'i drung du rab tu byung/kun dga' rgyal mtshan zhes pa'i mtshan gsol/snga rjes su chags lo rin chen chos rgyal/'bum ral pa rin chen chos dbang/lo chen chos skyong bzang po/sprul sku rdo rje seng ge /g.yul rgyal ba chos kyi shes rab/kun bzang gling pa chos kyi dpal la sogs bshes gnyen du ma las mdo sngags tha snyad dang bcas pa'i zab chos gsan sbyong gis chub par gyur/g.yul rgyal chos rjes bkra shis dge 'phel dang/nyi lde'i gdan sar mnga' gsol/phyis lhun grub chos sde yang bskyangs/de nas grub chen kun bzang rdo rje las gsang ba bla na med pa'i dbang khrid man ngag dang bcas gsan te nyams len nan tan mdzad pas nyams rtogs phun sum tshogs pa 'khrungs/gdul bya rnams la so so'i mos blo dang 'tshams par rgyal ba'i bka' 'gyur ro cog gis mtshon dam pa'i chos kyi sgo thams cad bstan pas bu slob kyang 'bri gung pa rin chen phun tshogs yab sras/chos lung mkhan po kun blo/skyed tshal ba shes rab g+r+yalam tshan sogs che btsun mkhas pa'i bshes gnyen mtha' yas pa dang/sprul sku sna tshogs rang 'grol dang rdzogs chen pa bsod nams rin chen sogs snying po'i bstan 'dzin du ma byung/sku tshe'i smad la gnas nang dang yangs pa can gyi gdas na mdzad pas mtshon gzhan phan 'gro don rgya cher bskyangs nas dgu ngalo bdun cu don gnyis la phebs pa rang byung bcu pa'i sa 'brug (1568)lor 'das}
chos rje bkra shis dpal brtsegs|{chos rje 'di nyid yab kun dga' bshes gnyen dang yum 'jam dpal skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung drug pa'i sa phag (1359)lor sku bltams/dgung lo drug pa la slob dpon sgom pa rin gzhon gyi drung du yi ge 'bri log la sbyang brtson mdzad/dgung lo bcu gcig bzhes pa'i tshe bka' brgyud kyi chos skor thams cad kyi bdag po slob dpon rin chen dpal ba las rgyud gsum man ngag dang/spyod 'jug dang shes rab brgya pa/khyad par du brtag gnyis sogs gsan sbyong mdzad/dgung lo bcu bdun la phebs skabs rin po che nam mkha' dpal bzang pos mkhan po dang/gnas brtan rin chen 'od kyis slob dpon mdzad de rab tu byung/mtshan bkra shis dpal brtsegs nyi ma'i dbang po bsrung ba'i go cha zhes gsol/de nas chos dbang gnyis pa sogs mkhas dbang mang po'i zhabs la gtugs nas dpal dus kya 'khor lo'i dbang yongs su rdzogs pa dang/nA ro'i chos drug /phyag rgya chen po/bka' brgyud kyi chos rin po che ma lus pa'i dbang khrid lus gsum zhus pas lam gyi drod rtags bsam gyis mi khyab pa 'khrungs shing/ting nga 'dzin gyi du ma phyes/gzhan yang sha ba ra'i sbyor drug /chos rje bsod nams rgyal mtshan pa'i sbyor drug gsang 'dus ris lnga'i khrid dang nag khrid skor dmar khrid/dbu sems kyi sems bskyed/blo sbyong don bdun ma/yab 'bras sogs ji snyed gsan/dgung lo bco brgyad la phebs pa me 'brug (1376)lor stag lung gi gdan sar phebs nas chos kyi 'khor lo rgya chen por bskor/dgung lo nyi shu par lha sar phebs/lo che na byang rtse dang mjal/de nas lo chen gyis mkhan po dang/lo tsA ba grags pa rgyal mtshan gyis slob dpon/lo tsA ba nam mkha' bzang pos gsang ste mdzad nas bsnyen par rdzogs/lo chen las chos dpag tu med pa gsan/de nas stag lung du phebs nas khrid kha grangs med pa btab/gling gseb tu sha mi 'grim pa'i khrims mdzad/dbus gtsang gi sde dgon thams cad du mang skol gyi rnam gzhag rgya chen po mdzad/stang lug thang pa'i sku 'dra bzhengs/snga phyir byang ris dang khams stod du byon nas chos kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor/gong nas rgyal po ya dbang gis gu shrA'i las ka /dngul gyi tham ka ka'o ming dang bcas phul/mthar dgung lo drug cu re drug pa rab byung bdun pa'i shing 'brug (1424)lor ngo mtshar gyi bltas bzang po du ma dang bcas te dgongs pa chos kyi dbyings su gshegs}
chos rje sku mched gnyis|{dpal chen 'od po'i sras sa skya paN+Di ta kun dga' rgyal mtshan dang zangs tsha bsod rnams rgyal mtshan rnam gnyis so/_}
chos rje grags pa byang chub|{mtshan gzhan che bzhi gsar ma ba zhu ba 'di nyin yab drung rin rdor ba dang yum zin za bkra shis skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung drug pa'i me sprel (1356)lor dpal khra 'brug gtsug lag khang gi 'dabs su chags pa dgon gsar du sku 'khrungs/mtshan byang chub rdo rje zhes gsol/dgung lo bzhi pa nas yi ge sbyor klog sbyangs/rgyal sras grags rin pa la brtags gnyis kyi lung mnos nas gsan sbyong mdzad/dgung lo bcu gnyis la spyan snga rin po che grags pa shes rab las dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan grags pa byang chub tu gsol/chos ga gi khrid kyang gsan/dgung lo bco lnga par rje bsod nams rgyal mtshan dpal bzang pos mkhan po dang/mkhan chen gzhon dbang pas slob dpon/chos sgo ba brtson 'grub bzang pos dus sgo ba gnang ste dge tshul gyi brtul zhugs yang dag par blangs te rab tu byung/dam pa 'di nyid srid 'byor la snying po med par gzigs nas phag gru'i sde srid du phebs dgos zhu nan che yang spyan snga bsod nams grags pa sku na ma song bar lo brgyad ring srid khrir bzhugs rjes thel gyi tshogs pa mu mthud bskyangs/gang gis phag gru'i sde srid gnang ring rdzong gong 'og thams cad la chos 'phrul gyi zla bar srog gcod spong 'jug sogs chos ldan rgyal po'i mdzad pa lhur bzhes dang bshad pa dang rub pas bstan pa'i don che ba'i mdzad pa kho nar gzhol/de nas dge nga gi dngos po thob/spyan snga rin po che grags pa shes rab dang/lo chen byang chub rtse mo/rgyal sras thogs med bzang po/mkhan chen d+harma shI b+ha dra/'jam dbyangs shAkya rgyal mtshan/mkhan chen gzhon du dbang phyug /dpon chen po tshul khrims rgyal mtshan/zla ma 'bri gung pa rin chen 'bum pa sogs mkhas grub dam pa mang po spyi bor bstan nas rgya gar nas bod du bsgyur ba'i sngags dang mtshan nyid kyi dbang bshes lung man ngag mtha' dag dang/sa skya pa yab sras thams cad kyi bka' 'bum/dpal phag mo grub pa dang/chos rje 'bri gung pa/spyan snga rin po che yab sras kyi bka' 'bum sogs grags che ba phal mo che gsan par mdzad de mkhas pa'i grags pa sa steng du khyab nyams dang rtogs pa'i yon tan khyad par can 'khrungs/rje tsong kha pa chen pos kyang spyan snga grags pa byang chub la mi 'phrog pa'i dad pa tshad med 'khrungs te (spyan snga grags pa byang chub dpal bzang po'i rtogs brjod snyan dngags byin rlabs kyi lhun po )zhes bya ba yang bka' rtsom gnang/spyan snga rin po ches kyang rje tsong kha pa chen po'i rmad du byung ba'i mkhyen rab kyi gsung rab mtha' yas pa gzigs nas sngags pa rgya cher mdzad/de ltar bstan pa dang 'gro ba'i don 'ba' zhig la sman pa'i lung dang rtogs pa'i chos kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor nas dgung lo so gnyis la phebs pa rab byung drug pa'i me stag (1386)lo'i bod zla gnyis pa'i tshes lnga nyin sku gshegs}
chos rje dge 'dun rgyal mtshan|{gong du kha sde'i nang khri chen skabs su gsal}
chos rje rgod tshang pa mgon po rdo rje|{rje 'di nyid yab chu chal mon grags dang yum zug mo dpal rgyan gnyis kyi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i sa bya (1189)lor lho brag du lu chung gi khrir sku bltams/gcen po gnyis sngar bar grongs pa la brten sri'u gso ba'i slob dpon zug ston bya ba la gtad/mtshan mgon po dpal du gsol/sku chung dus nas mjal spro la/thugs bzang ba/bro ba'i ba shi mdzad pas ba shi don grub seng ger/de nas slob dpon wa zhwa las lam rim/slob dpon stod las dbu ma/slob dpon yu pi ba las spyod 'jug /slob dpon zhang las 'grel chung bcas gsan te phal cher tshar res mkhyen pa byung/dgung lo bcu dug pa ra la lung dgon du phebs te chos ja rgya ras pa bshes gnyen du bsnyen nas rab tu byung/mtshan mgon po rdo rjer gsol/rje bla ma las skyabs 'gro sems bskyed/sems bskyed chen mo/rnal 'byor bzhi/lhan cig skyes sbyor/thabs lam gyi khrid/ro snyoms kyi dmigs pa mang po/rabs bdun/chig chog sogs dang/rtsa ltung bcu bzhi pa la sogs dam tshig gi chos skor/sgrub thabs bcu gsum ma dang zhal gnyis ma la sogs pa thams cad kyi lung gsan/de nas 'brug dang/'bri gung/rwa sgreng bcas la byon nas chos mang du 'chad nyan mdzad de slar chos rje rgya ras pa'i drung du phyir phebs/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gsum pa la lho brag mkhar chur byon te lo gsum bzhugs/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa lnga la gangs ti se dang/kha che'i yul/dza lan ra sogs par byon te lo bzhi bzhugs/dgung lo nyi rtsa dgu la pho ma lha khab tu byon nas spyil po zhig tu lo gsum du bla ma sgrub pa mdzad/de nas dbon ras kyi drung du byon nas bsnyen par rdzogs/dgung lo sog nyagis pa la tsa ri la byon nas lo gsum bzhugs/dgung lo so drug la khyung dkar dang yang dkar gnyis su lo gsum bzhugs pas thugs dam shin tu 'phel/dgung lo so brgyad thog rgod tshang du 'dus nas chod nyan pa mthong bas sngar gzhan don mi mdzad par snyam pa'i blo yod pa der log /de nas rgod tshang nas byon te las stod kyi ri sul rnams su phebs te gsang spyod mdzad/sku tshe'i smad du steng gro dang/bde chen stengs/spud dra/byang gling/bar 'brog /rdo rje gling sogs dgon pa mang po phyag btab/dgon pa re re nas kyang dge 'dun sgrub pa po stong tsho mang po thon pa byung/mthar dgung lo bdun cu la phebs pa rab byung bzhi pa'i sa rta (1258)lor dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das/'di nyid la slob ma mang du byung bas lus thugs kyi sras kyang yang dgon pa/grub chen u rgyan pa/byang gling pa/chos rje ni rings pa/phu ri ba/mnyam med pa ri spyil dkar ba/rje ma bdun pa/zhi byed mgon po/sangs rgyas khrom ras/dpal skyer shing ras pa/shAkya ras pa/'dar ras la sogs mang du byon no/_}
chos rje sgang pa|{karma dus gsum mkhyen pa'i slob ma chos rje sgang pa ni yab gsang sngags rnying ma ba zhig gi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i shing lug (1165)lor yul gyi bar sku 'khrungs/rab tu byung ba'i mtshan la rin chen 'od zer zhu/'bri khung chos rje dang/stag lung thang pa/rmog lcogs pa/la yag pa/dwags po 'dul 'dzin/nye gnas gsal byang/kha che paN chen la sogs pa'i bla ma mang du bsten/gtso bo mdo bo ras te/de las phyag rgya chen po'i rtogs pa brnyes/ngo bo gangs kyi pha bong dkar leb la sogs pa'i gnas rnams su sgrub pa mdzad/sa 'gro don rgya chen po mdzad/gong gi sku tshe'i mtha' la hor dmag bod du lhags/mthar dgu ngalo bdun cu rtsa lnga pa rab byung bzhi pa'i sa bya (1249)lor sku gshegs}
