chos pa blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{'di nyid rje skal ldan rgya mtsho'i yum mi gcig pa'i gcen po yin/rab tu bcu pa'i lcags sbrul (1581)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu bzhi pa shing rta (1594)lor chos rje rin po che bsam 'grub las rab tu byung/nyi shu pa lcags byi (1600)lor co ne chos rje sangs rgyas rgya mtshan las bsnyen par rdzogs/nyer gsum pa chu yos (1603)lor rgyal ba yon tan rgya mtsho'i zhabs zhu mdzad nas dbus su phebs/nyer bzhi pa shing 'brug (1604)lor rwa stod chos grwa 'grims/'jam dbyangs bla ma dkon mchog chos 'phel las chos mang du zhus/lo de'i dbyar dus rgyud grwar zhugs/stag lung brag blo gros g+r+ya mtsho las rim lnga'i dmar khri sogs snga phyir chos mang du gsan/gzhan yang paN chen thams cad mkhyen pa/skyid bu chos rje ngag dbang chos grags/khri dge 'dun rgyal mtshan/grub chen brtson 'grus snying po/lam pa rab byams pa bsod nams grags pa sogs las dbang lung man ngag bcas 'dod rgur gsan/nyer brgyad pa sa sprel (1608)lor rang yul mdo sde du phebs te rong po dgon pa lugs gnyis kyis bskyangs/so lnga pa shing yos nas sgrub pa tsa gcig tu gzhol/so bdun pa me sbrul (1617)lor slar dbus su phebs/bla ma snga ma rnams dang 'khon ston dpal 'byor lhun grub/de mo lha dbang chos kyi rgyal mtshan/rta tshag ngag dbang chos kyi dbang phyug sogs las chos bka' rgya cher gsan/sa rta rol rang yul du phebs/shing sprel nas rong po dgon du 'du khang gser phibs mdzad/gdul bya rnams chos dang zang zing gis bskyangs/dgung lo don dgu pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa phag (1659)lor sku gshegs}
