mchod rten|{mchod rten ni saMskri ta'i skad du stUs zhes 'bod cing don du mchod pa'i zhing ngan rten gyi don yin/saMskri ta'i skad du stUs zhes pa de yang don ngo mar rten mchog lta bu dang bang so lta bu gnyis ka la 'jog cing/rten mchog ces pa dran rten gyi bzo skrun lta ba la 'bod cing bang so ni ro 'jug sa'i pur sgam gyi don yin/bdag cag gi ston pa ma byon gong nas rgya gar du yod pa zhig ste/rgyal po so so'i bang song la'ang stUs zhes 'bod pa yin/rang re bod kyi yul du cha bzhag na'ang gna' rabs bon gyi cho sa dar ba nas 'go tshugs te/yul lha/gzhi bdag /btsan dang/rgyal po mchod yul rten nam/rten mkhar de bod yul gyi mchod rten las snga bar 'dod do/_/de yang de skabs mchod rten dang gdung rten gyi dbye ba de tsam 'byed mi shes pa'ang mang bas spyir mchod rten la sku rus sam pur thal med pa dang yod pa gnyis las sku rus pur thal yod pa la gdung steng zhes 'bod na go bde ba dang/mchod rten yin na gdung rten yin ma dgos kyang gdung rten ni mchod rten gyi bye brag go/de yang lugs gnyis las bu ston lugs dang sde srid lugs gnyis po'i mchod na gyi spyi'i mtho tshad cha chung drug cu re bzhi gcig mthun thog bu ston lugs la sa 'dzin gyi rgyar cha chung sum cu rtsa gnyis dang/sde srid lugs la cha chung sum cu so dgu yod pa'i khyad yod la/bum pa'i rgya dang/chos 'khor bcu gsum gyi tshad gzhi la yang khyad par cung zad yod/dbyings gzugs thad bde gshegs mchod rten brgyad rang du nges shing pad spungs ni dbyibs zlum po pad+ma'i rnam pa can/bang ring bzhi pa can )bang rim brgyad du bzhed pa'ang yod )byang chub mchod rten ni dbyibs gru bzhi bang rim bzhi dang ldan pa/bkra shis sgo mang ni dbyibs gru bzhi glo 'bur dang bcas pa/sgo rab brgya rtsa brgyad/'bring la sgo nga drug /tha ma sgo bcu drug sogs ci rigs dang/sgo bzhi ris byas pa bden pa bzhi'i mtshon byed/brgyad re byed pa rnam thar brgyad du mtshon/bcug nyis su byed pa rten 'brel bcu gnyis/bcu drug tu byed pa stong nyid bcu drug gi mtshon tshul bcas mang bar gsungs so/_/cho 'phrul ni grub zhi pa dang rang bzhi bzhi dang ld