jun gar ba'i dbang sgyur thor ba|{jun gar ba tshe ring don grub kyis bod kyi srid dbang bzung rjes me bya (1717)lo'i lo mjug tu stag rtse mi dbang rgyal rab brtan ming tsam gyi srid skyong la bskos/khong ni dgung lo bdun cu lhag tsam gyi 'gres po zhig yin pas don du dbang cha jun gar bas bzung/gsang gas rnying ma'i dgon pa gtso bo rdo rje brag dang/smin grol gling la sogs pa'i rnying pa'i dgon sde bshig /rdo rje brag rig 'dzin pad+ma 'phrin las dang/smin grol gling gi gdung sras pad+ma 'gyur med rgya mtsho/lo chen d+harma shrI sogs snga 'gyur bstan pa'i gsal byed dam pa mang po bkrongs/gser stong 'dzam gling rgyan gcig kyang bshig rtsis byed skabs stag rtse lha rgyal rab brtan gyis bkag nas ma bshig tsam byung/dus rgyun mi ser la brdab gsig che ba'i thog snga 'gyur bstan par gnod chabs che ba sogs gdug rtsub kyi spyod ngan ha cang mang po byas stabs bod kyi mi rnams yid mi rang bar gyur/sa phag (1719)lor ching rgyal rabs kyi gong ma khang shing kyi sras bcu bzhi pa yun this spyi khyab dmag spyi gnang ba'i dpung sde chen po drug mdo khams sogs brgyud nas jun gar ba bcom dus yong skabs jun gar ba'i dmag dpung mnga' ris brgyus nas bros stabs mnga' ris skor gsum dang/dbus gtsang kong po bcas kyi dmag dpung nas gong ma'i dpung chen la ram 'degs kyis jun gar bar rgol brngung byas nas lcags byi (1720)lor jun gar ba yongs rdzogs bod nas mthar sprod btang/gong ma'i dpung chen lha sar 'byor rjes srid skyong stag rtse lha rgyal rab brtan gnas dbyung 'dzin bzung thog jun gar gyi skabs las gnas 'dzin pa po khag gcig dang jun gar nas yin pa bla ma grwa pa sogs 'dzin bzung 'dri zhib byed skabs stag rtse lha rgyal rab brtan gyis nyes pa med tshul brjod kyang lha bzang khang gi sras chung ba sut+ya bzungs ste jun gar bar rtsis sprod mkhan stag rtse ba yin tshul sogs brjod de stag rtse lha rgyal rab brtan dang/bka' blon bkra shis rtse pa/a chos sogs lha sa skyid chu'i 'gram du mgul bcad}
jun gar tshe dbang rab brtan|{'di ni sngar sog po'i dmag dpon dga' ldan bya ba'i gcen pa'i bu yin/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me sprel (1716)lor jun gar tshe dbang rab brtan nas dmag dpon chenapo tshe ring don grub gyis gtso bor byas pa'i sog dmag drug stong bod du 'byor te der mdag 'thab lan 'ga' byas kyang ma thub pas lha bzang dpung dang bcas brel rtab kyi sa lha sar thon nas rtse pho brang gi chag sgo rnams bsdams te bsdad/de dus kyi dmag dpon che ba ni dbus mda' dpon o rong pa dang/'bum thang pa 'das po'i bu gnyis/gtsang dpung gi dmag dpon dung pho lha tha'i nyi bsod nams stobs rgyal/bsam grub gling pa/bkra shis rtse pa/sog dpung gi dmag dpon du ral tha'i nyi bcas yin/lo de'i zla ba bcu gcag pa'i tshes bcu gsum nyin jun gar dmag lha sar 'dzul/bod dmag srung bya rnams kyis glags ma rnyed par kha thor/pho lha ba'ang 'bras spungs la bros/jun dmag gis grong khyer nang bcom 'phrog tshod med byas/zla ba bcu gnyis pa'i tshes gsum nyin jun dmag gis rtse pho brang gi lho phos nas 'dzul thabs byas kyang thar dkar bas rgyal sgor me rgyag rtsis byed skabs lha bzang khang rang nyid dang/zhabs 'bring blo bzang chos 'phel gnyis ltag rgyab nas rta bzhon te bros 'gro skabs rta 'dam la byings te 'gro ma thub pa'i ngang rjes 'ded jun dmag 'byor ba dang lag 'dzings kyis dmag mi kha shas bsad mthar khong gnyis jun dmag gis lag rub brgyab ste bkrongs/de'i tshe jun gar ba'i dpung gi gtso bo rnams bros te dgung na mthon por phebs pa bye ri stag rtse'i zhabs drung lha rgyal rab brtan bod kyi srid skyong ba'i khrir bskos/de nas po ta la'i rnam rgyal grwa tshang gi dge 'dun tshang ma skyid chu'i khar 'khrid nas na bza' rnams bshus/skya chas g.yogs te so so'i gzhis dang pha ming gar yod sar btang/rdo rje brag dang smin grol gling gi bla ma gtso bo rnams dang/lha bzang gi zhabs 'bri gtso che rnams bzung ste btson du bcug gzhung zhabs rnams bskongs te pad dkar 'dzin pa ngag dbang ye shes rgya mtsho rgyal dbang lnga pa chen po'i yang srid yin min 'dri rtsad byas par tshang mas 'dod gcig gis min par thag bcad pas khong khri las phab ste lcags po rir do dam bkag nyar byas/zla 12tshes 24nyin bla brang steng du dbus gtsang gi bla dpon rnams bskongs thog /jun gar gyi blon chen tshe ring don grub dang/gdugs dkar/chos 'phel ja'i sang gsum bcas nas slad phyin gsang sngags rnying ma'i chos rtsa ba nas byas mi chog pa dang/sku gsung thugs na rnams dor dgos pa'i khrims bsgrags/de nub smin gling lo chen d+harma shrI dang/rdo rje 'dzin pa blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan/gdung sras pad+ma 'gyur med rgya mtsho sogs skyid chu'i 'gram du 'khrid de bkrongs/lo chen rin po che gnas tshang nas phyir phebs pa dang sbrags zhal 'don dbu tshugs shing/lcags po ri'i rgyab tu phebs nas smon lam 'debs pa yin pas cung zhogs gsungs nas de khar zhing la gshegs/de nas ma 'gyangs bar smin gling gdung sras sku gzhon dang/phyag mdzod zhabs drung legs grub/rdor brag rig 'dzin chen po pad+ma ma 'phrin las/lha bzang khang gi gzhung zhabs gtso gros bu chung dang/dngos gzhi ba/pad+ma tshe ring/rgyal lca mo can pa sogs bkrongs/o rgyan sangs rgyas gnyis pa'i sgrub gnas mang po'i sgo brtsigs nas bkag /rdo ja brag dgon pa dang/smin grol gling/chu shul thar pa gling/gsang gas byang chub gling sogs rnying lugs kyi dgon pa mang po rmeg med du btang/smin grol gling gi phyag dpe yod tshad sa phung ltar spungs nas de steng phar 'gro tshur 'gro byed bcug /gdan sa gsum dang bkra shis lhun po bcas kyi 'dabs gnas grong rnams rgya ring por bshigs spo byed bcug pa sogs brdab gsig chen po byung/jun gar ba'i dpon dmag rnams kyis bod dpung gtsang khul du rang snang gang drug gi dbang sgyur lo gsum tsam byas ring dge lugs par rgyab skyor yin khul shod mkhas tsam las/rnying ma'i bstan pa la ha cang gi sdang zung chen po byas te gtor brlag tshabs chen btang mthar khang chen nas dang/pho lha nas/sde pa nga phod sogs kyis jun gar bar ngo rgol byas pas jun gar dpon dmag rnams sdod thabs med par 'phags mchog lo ke shwa res dbus sku gsung thugs rten sogs bod kyi dngos nor khyad 'phags pon che 'khyer te rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags byi (1720)lor phyir 'then byas/nag tshang brgyud thon pa'i jun dmag rnams khang chen nas kyis rjes 'ded btang ste jun dmag mong po bsad/'phags mchog lo ke shwa re dang rtse che'i dngos nor khyad 'phags mang po tshur blangs so/_}
