jo nang kun spangs thugs rje brtson 'grus|{yu mo mi skyod rdo rje'i slob brgyud 'di nyid rab byung bzhi pa'i chu yos (1243)lor la stod byang gi ngab phyar spang sgang du sku 'khrungs/bar pa 'jam dbyangs bzhi thog pa rin chen rgyal mtshan la lam 'bras gsan/gzhon nu'i dus su sde snod mang po la mkhas par sbyangs/rkyang 'dur gyi chos grwar dge 'dun mang du bskyangs/rtsod pa yang shin tu bzang/kun mkhyen chos sku 'od zer ba las dus 'khor kyi bshad pa rdzogs par gsan/rkyang 'dur du 'chad nyan yang mdzad/man ngag zhus nas sgom pa'i tshe ting nge 'dzin mang po'i sgo phye/skabs shig snyun che bzhes pas 'chad nyan gyi spros pa dor te sgom pa la gzhol bas kun spangs par grags/bod na sbyor drug mi 'dra ba yod do cog la gsan pa mdzad/byang gi ri rgyud rnams su sgom sgrub la gzhol ba'i tshe thugs dam gyi stobs kyis mi ma yin pa mang po dbang du 'dus/gtsang gi lha rtse rdzong khongs jo nang du dgon pa phyag btab/bshad pa dang gdams pa gnyis ka'i slob ma mang du bskyangs/de dag gi nang nas byang sems rgyal ba ye shes/la stod pa dbang rgyal/mun mi brag kha ba/sron po kun rgyal rnams la kun spangs pa'i bu bzhir grags/mthar rab byung lnga pa'i chu glang (1313)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs}
jo nang phyogs las rnam rgyal|{dol po shes rab rgyal mtshan gyi slob ma 'di nyid rab byung lnga pa'i me rta (1306)lor mnga' ris dor po'i sa'i char 'khrungs sku gzhon du nas dbus su byon te chos 'khor gling du phar tshad la sogs pa'i mtshan nyid kyi sde snod la sbyangs pas mkhan pa chen por gyur/dbus gtsang gnyis grwa skor mdzad/de nas kun mkhyen shes rab rgyal mtshan dang mjal bas shin tu dad de jo nang du phebs/kun man chen po'i drung du dus kyi 'khor lo'i dbang brgyud bshad pa man ngag dang bcas zab chos gzhan mang du gsan/man ngag nyams su bzhes pas ting nge 'dzin bzang po 'khrungs/byang bdag chen twa dben nam mkha' brtan pas/kun mkhyen dpon slob gnyer mnga' ris su spyan drangs/phyogs las rnam rgyas pas ngam ring chos sde'i bla brang/'du khang rnying pa/shar nub kyi grwa shag la sogs pa btab/kun mkhyen chen po'i bka' bzhin phar tshad gtso bor gyur pa'i sde snod kyi bshad pa yun ring du mdzad/de nas gdan sa mkhas chen bstan rgyal ba la gtad de/dgung lo zhe dgu la phebs pa rab byung drug pa'i shing rta (1354)lor jo nang gi gdan sar phebs/lo lnga nas de yang gtan nas dbus su phebs/'tshal dbus gling du dus kyi 'khor lo'i dbang rgyud bshad man ngag gi khrid rnams slob ma'i sde chen por gsungs/de nas yar klung phyogs la phebs/lo tsA ba byang chub rtse mos dus kyi 'khor lo'i mchog dbang gsan/khra 'brug la sogs par bzhugs te gdul bya dpag med legs pa'i lam du bkod/de nas gtsang du phebs te ser mkhar chung du bzhugs/dus 'khor sogs kyi 'chad nyan gnang nas/sa ga li 'grem pa sum brgya tsam gyi nang nas gsol cha rgyug pa'i chos dpon brgyad cu tsam byung/dgung lo brgyad cu gya gcig la phebs pa rab byung drug pa'i me stag (1386)lor zhi bar gshegs}
jo bo rje a ti sha|{(dI paM ka ra'am mar me mdzad )(sung tha'i cung rgyal po kra'o kus kyi tha'i phing shin go r+khi lo bdun pa chu rta spyi lo 982rab byung dang po'i shing rta 1045bar )khong bod du phebs nas bka' gdams kyi chos lugs gsar gtod mdzad pa'i paN+Di ta chen po zhig yin/'khrungs yul ni rgya gar shar phyogs b+hang g+ha la (deng sang rgya skad du mang ca la zer )yin cing/mkhan chen zhi ba 'tsho dang gdug rgyud gcig pa'i za hor gyi rgyal po dge ba dpal dang yul dpal mo 'od zer can gnyis kyi sras 'bring po yin/dgung lo lnga lon pa nas chos gsungs mkhyen pa dang/nang don phun sum tshogs pa'i tshigs bcad kyang zhal nas thogs med du gsung thub pa zhig yin/dgung lo bcu'i bar sgyu rtsal sna tshogs la sbyangs shing/de nas dgu lo bcu'i ring mu stegs pa dang/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi sgra rig pa dang/tshad ma rig pa la slob gnyer gnang/dgung lo nyi shu lhag tsam lon dus yab yum gnyis kyis rgyal srid bzung ba'i re ba gnang ste rgyal rigs kyi bu mo mdzes ma ha cang mang po bdam nas gnyen sgrig gnang bar zhus kyang gtan nas zhal bzhes ma gnang bar mthar dgung lo nyer dgur rgya gar rdo rje gdan gyi ma hA bo d+hi'i gtsug lag khang du rab byung mdzad/slar yang sgra rig pa'i gzhung chen po brgyad dang/phyi nang gnyis kyi tshad ma rig pa/gso ba rig pa/skar rtsis/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi mtshan nyid rig pa/mdo sngags kyi gzhung sogs sbyangs pa mthar 'khyol ba mdzad/paN+Di ta chen po'i mtshan thogs/gser gling pa la sogs pa'i bla ma sum cu so bzhi tsam bsten nas rgya gar du mkhas pa'i grags pa che ba ma zad/thugs sems ha cang bzang ba zhig yin pas/mnga' ris gu ge rgyal po bla ma ye shes 'od kyis gser mo po'i 'bul ba dang bcas lo tsA ba rgya brtson 'grus seng ge mngags te bod du gdan 'dren par btang yang gdan drangs ma thub/da dung lha bla ma yid thang ma chad par gser 'tshol du phebs pas mu stegs mtha' 'khor gyi rgyal pos 'dzin bzung byas te btson du bcug /sku lus kyi rtsa sgo thams cad mer bsregs pa sogs mnar gcod tshad med pa'i 'og tu sku gshegs/khong gi zhal chems ltar tsha bo lha bla ma byang chub yod kyis slar yang nag tsho lo tsA ba tshul khrims rgyal ba mngags nas bod du gdan zhu gnang bar rgya gar gyi rgyal po dang bri kA mal shi la'i dgon pa'i mkhan po dge 'dun dang bcas pas bod du lo gsum bzhugs chog pa'i gnang ba thob nas dgung lo nga dgu pa rab byung dang po'i lcags 'brug (1040)lor bal yul brgyud nas mnga' ris su phebs te lo gsum ring bzhugs/(byang chub lam gyi sgron ma )sogs mdzad/lo gsum song ba rab byung dang po'i chu rta (1042)lor rgya gar du phyir phebs rtsis la skabs der yab yul mtha' mtshams su 'khrug pa langs nas phebs ma thub par gnas skabs phyir 'gyangs gnang ste bzhugs mus la 'brom ston pa phebs te bod dbus gtsang du gdan zhu gnang ba ltar thob mar bsam yas/yang lung sogs su zla shas bzhugs nas 'brom ston pas snye thang du gdan drangs/der lo dgu dang/'phan po dang/yer pa/lha sa sogs su lo lnga bcas lo bcu bdun gyi ring chos gsungs pa dang/bsgyur ba/sgyur bcos sogs mdzad/dper na bstan 'gyur gyi khrod du (dbu ma'i gzhung rtog ge 'bar ba )sogs jo bo rje nyid dang nag tsho lo tsA ba gnyis kyis bsgyur gnang mdzad pa mi nyung ba zhig yod pa gsum rtsom khag brgya lhag tsam bstan 'gyur mdo phyogs le tshan (ki)(khi)(gi)gsum la yod/bod du bzhugs ring dge bshes khu ston brtson 'grus g.yung drung dang/rngog lo tsA ba legs pa'i shes rab/dge bshes 'brom ston pa/'gos lo tsA ba khug pa lha btsas sogs slob ma mkhas pa mang du byung/mthar dgu ngalo bdun cu don gsum la phebs pa shing rta (1054)lo'i bod zla dgu pa'i tshes bco brgyad la snye thang du sku gshegs/sku gdung rnams snye thang na mo cher bzhugs la phul/snye thang 'or du sku gdung bzhugs pa'i gtsug lag khang bzhengs pa sogs zhib par ni 'brom ston pas mdzad pa'i (bla ma'i yon tan chos kyi 'byung gnas )dang/las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis brtsams pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog /) dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng bas brtsams pa'i (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )gyi le tshan (da)pa bcas su gsal}
