jo bo rags kha|{lha sa'i shar ngos sku 'bum thang grong tsho'i 'gram gyi skyid chu'i rags steng gi jo bo rags kha ni dus rabs brgyad pa'i nang gtsang chu shor nas lha sar chu nyen shin tu che ba byung stabs nyang nyi ma 'od zer gyis rags thog mar bzos pa dang/de rjes dus rabs bcu gnyis pi nang gung thang bla ma zhang gi slob ma lha rje dge ba 'bum gyis cha rags la zhig gso gnang ba ma zad/sku gshegs rjes sku gdung yang chu rags kyi 'gram du mchod rten bzhengs pi nang bzhugs pas sku 'bum thang mchod rten zhes grags/chu rags kyi kha dor rdo spungs chen po zhig yod pa der ja bo rags kha zer zhing/de ni dus rabs bcu drug pa'i nang lha sar cha nyen chen po byung skabs tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pas ser 'bras kyi grwa pa rnams skul slong gis chu rags khar rags rdo skyel ba'i srol gtod/de nas bzung jo bo rags gso zhes bod zla 1chen 25nyin smon lam chen mor tshogs bzhugs dge da'un rnams nas rang mos kyis bco lnga mchod pa'i 'tsho 'dzin khog rdo nyos te jo bo rags rgyag tu rags rdo kha gsos skyel ba dang/dga' ldan khri rin po che rab gnas su phebs rgyu bcas de skabs thog mar srol gtod/de nyid rtse gzim 'gag nas sngon tshud brda gsal rtse drung las tshan gnyis dang/shod drung las tshan gnyis/rtse shod drung dkyus drug re chibs zhabs su khri pa bzhugs gnas su 'dzoms/khri pa bla ba rang nas gsol ja bzhes 'bras btang/de nas sde shan rtse drug dang/gsol gzim/gzim 'gag /spos 'dzin bcas kyis chibs gral bsgrigs nas rags 'gram du phebs/bka' shag gzhan gnyer nas dbyi mtshor zhal phyogs pa'i bzhugs khri dang/chibs zhabs kyi gdan bcas la zhabs sor 'khod/bka' shag gsol thab khongs nas gsol ja bzhes 'bras phebs/rab gnas dang thugs smon g.yab rgyas kyi mtshams sbyor gnang sgo legs sgrub dang bstun khri pa bzhugs gnas bar chibs gral gong bzhin phyir phebs gnang srol yod}
jo 'ber|{(rnying pa jo 'ber )'di nyid yab nyi 'bum gyi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i me 'brug (1196)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bco brgyad par khu bo dang 'grogs shing gsang ba bla na med pa'i gdams pa ma lus pa gsan/dgung lo bcu dgu nas nyi shu'i bar sa skya paN chen las rgyud gsum gdams pa dang bcas pa dang bde mchog mal gyo'i lugs gsan/chu mig pa las tshad ma bsdus pa gsan/dgung lo nyi shu rtsi gnyis pa la khro phu lo tsA ba las grub thob mi tra'i gdams pa rnams dang/bal po grags pa 'bum me las phyag rgya chen po kha 'thor gyi gdams pa rnams gnas te dgung lo so drug la phebs skabs thos bsam gyi spros pa bcad/gzigs snang rnams phal cher mi gsungs/lha sar jo bo la mchod pa phul dus 'od kyi thig le'i nang nas phyag rdor dang spyan ras gzigs mjal/mthar rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags yos (1231)lor ngo mtshar ba'i ltas dngabacas te sku gshegs}
