jo mo sman mo|{rje 'di nyid ni e yul rig pa'i 'byung gnas kyi gu ru'i sgrub phug zar mo lung dang nye bar yab dwags brgyud sngags pa rdo rje rgyal po dang yum pad+ma dpal 'dzoms kyi rigs su rab byung bzhi pa'i sa sprel (1248)lor 'khrungs/lho nub la yag yang grong du phebs/gu ru chos dbang dang mjal ba tsam gyi rtsa kha phye ba'i brda thabs su brten nas gling la rtogs pa thod brgal 'khrungs te chu bo gang+ga'i tshun la rtogs pa mtho bar grags pa de byung/sbas tshul gyis 'gro don lhun gyis grub nas mthar dgung grangs so drug te phebs pa ram byung lnga pa'i chu lug (1283)lo'iston zla ra ba'i tshes bcu'i nyin yul grogs ri'i rtse mor phebs/dpon gsum gyis tshogs kyi mchod pazhig mdzad de gsum kas lus ma spangs par 'dab chags rgyal po mkha' la 'phur ba ltar nam mkha'i dbyings su je mtho je mthor o rgyan mkha' 'gro'i tshogs gral du thogs med gshegs par grags so/_}
