'jam dpal snying po'i bla ma'i rnal 'byor|{rje tsong kha pa la brten nas bsgom pa'i bla ma'i rnal 'byor la khag gnyis te/1 mkhas grub rje la tshig brgyud du gnang ba'i bla ma'i rnal 'byor dang/2 'dul nag pa dpal ldan bzang po nas brgyud pa'i sras rgyud lugs kyi bla ma'i rnal 'byor gnyis las rjes ma der yongs grags su dga' ldan lha brgya ma'i bla ma'i rnal 'byor zhes brjod srol yod}
'jam dpal smra ba'i seng ge gsum ldan ngur smrig 'chang ba|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/'jam dpal dbyangs la smra ba'i seng ge zer/de yang 'jam dpal dbyangs lha la bsten na bsten mkhan de smar ba'i bya ba 'chad rtsod rtsom gsum la 'jigs pa med pa seng ge lta bur 'gyur 'gro gi yod pa red zer/gsum ldan ngur smrig 'chang ba ni sku la na bza' chos gos dmar po ste sham thab/chos gos ser po gnyis te bla gos dang snam sbyar gsum bzhes pa'i don}
'jam dpal rtsa ba'i rgyud|{spyi lo'i dus rabs dang po'i mjug tu lo tsA ba shAkya blo gros kyis rgya gar skad nas bod yig tu bsgyur ba'i sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi dpe cha zhig gi ming/'di'i nang don ni gtso bo 'jam dpal dbyangs kyi yon tan bshad yod pa dang zhor la rgyal po mi yi lha nas 'od ldan bar rgyal po bcu'i ming bstan nas mthar rgyal srid nyams te mi rigs gzhan dag gis srid dbang bzung bar bshad yod cing/(deb ther sngon po rtsom po 'gos lo gzhon nu dpal dang/(mkhas pa'i dga' ston )rtsom pa po dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng ba gnyis kas gong gsal 'jam dpal rtsa rgyud kyi tshig de rnams la 'grel bshad gnang skabs/rgyal po mi yi lha nas 'od ldan bar gyi rgyal po bcu ni srong btsan sgam po nas 'od srung bar gyi rgyal rabs bcu yin pa dang/de nas bod sil bur rgyus rjes mthar bod kyi srid dbang de mi rigs gzhan dag sog po sogs kyis bzung ba sogs lung bstan byas pa yin zhes gsungs 'dug /dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i bod kyi lo rgyus shog dril nang/gong gsal ('jam dpal rtsa rgyud )kyi dpe che de rgya gar yi ge'i thog bkod pa kho rang gis dngos su gzigs myong ba ma zad/bal yul du yod pa'i rdo ring zhig gi ldebs su yang gong gsal gyi tshig dum bu de cha tshang bkod yod pa dang/rgya gar yi ge'i thog gi ('jam dpal rtsa rgyud )kyi nang gsal ba'i rgyal po bcu po de ni bal po'i rgyal po'i ming yin par bal po'i lo rgyus su yang gsal bas de ni 'gos lo dang dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng ba sogs kyis bal po'i lo rgyus yin pa ma mkhyen par bod kyi lo rgyus la sbyar nas 'grel bshad ba zhig yin zhes bris gnang 'dug pa dpyad gzhi chen po yod pa zhig yin snyam/('jam dpal rtsa rgyud )ma yig gzigs 'dod na le'u sum cu so drug yod pa ste bka' 'gyur snar thang dpar ma'i le tshan (da)pa'i nang du yod}
'jam dpal gshin rje gshed|{(rdo rje 'jigs byed )'jam dpal gshin rje gshed la sku'i rnam 'gyur mi 'dra ba mang du yod kyang skabs 'dir ni yongs su grags pa rdo rje 'jigs byed la ngos 'dzin dgos shing/de'i sku mdog dang phyag mtshan bzhugs stangs bcas (rin 'byung brgya rtsa dang sgrub thabs brgya rtsa'i lha sku'i snang brnyan kun gsal me long )shing dpar las gsal bas der gzigs}
