'jam dbyangs kun dga' chos bzang|{rje 'di nyin rab byung bdun pa'i chu glang (1433)lor glo bo 'brog gseb tu sku bltams/dgung lo bcu pa la brag dkar rags rgyal ba las dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo bco brgyad pa la glo bo bdag pos sa skyar grwa bskor dang dbus gtsang du slob gnyer ba brgya phrag gsum tsam rdzong brda gnang ba'i skabs su rje 'di nyid sa skyar byon pas blo gros gzhon nu'i bshad gsar dang/ngor du rje btsun rdo rje 'chang dang mjal/chos mang du gsan/dgung lo bcu dug pa la e waM chos ldan du rdo rje 'chang gis mkhan po/brag dkar sems dpa' chen po kha char bas slob dpon/gcung gzhon nu seng ges dus go ba mdzad de rab tu byung/dgung lo nyi shu pa la byams chen rab 'byams pa bsten nas mdo sngags kyi zab bcud tshim par rol/dgung lo sum cu pa la byams chen rab 'byams chos rje dang go rams chos rje mkhan slob las bsnyen par rdzogs/dgung grangs so bzhi pa nas paN chen 'bum pa gnyis kyi zur 'chad gnang/rgyal ba'i bstan pa rin po che rgyas par mdzad/dgung grangs nga bzhi pa nas skyed mos tshal gyi gdan seng ge'i khril zhabs sor bkod nas zhi bar ma gshegs par du mdo sngags kyi bstan pa bskyangs/thugs sras mang du byon zhing/slob ma paN chen dngos grub dpal 'bar gyis chos 'khor lhun po btab/lha dbang blo gros kyis gzha' ri dgon gsar btab/mthar dgung grangs don gcig la phebs par byung brgyad pa'i chu phag (1503)lor zhi bar gshegs}
'jam dbyangs kun dga' bsod nams grags pa rgyal mtshan|{dpal ldan sa skya dgon pa'i khri pa nyer gcig pa sa lo tsA ba chen po yang zhub 'di nyid rab byung bdun pa'i shing sbrul (1425)lor yab nam mkha' bkra shis rgyal mtshan dang yum hor mo dma' ze bza' ma cig tshe brtan gnyis kyi sras su rtse gdong du sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu gcig pa shing yos (1435)lor mkhas chen bsod nams lhun grub legs pa'i 'byung gnas rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po'i drung nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes nas rab tu byung ba'i brtul zhugs la gnas par mdzad/lo der e waM chos sder rdo rje 'chang dkon mchog 'phel bas mkhan po dang chos rje glo bo mkhan chen pas slob dpon mdzad de dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan 'jam dbyangs kun dga' bsod nams grags pa rgyal mtshan dpal bzang por gsol/dgung grangs bcu gnyis pa rab byung bdun pa'i me 'brug (1436)lor sa skya'i gdan khrir phebs/dgung lo bcu bzhi pa sa rta (1438)lor gzhi thog gi gdan sa mdzad de bstan pa'i bdag por mnga' gsol/dgung grangs nyi shu pa shing byi (1444)lor rdo rje 'chang dkon mchog 'phel bas mkhan po dang/'jam dbyangs sangs rgyas rin chen dpal bzang pos las slob/ra ston yon tan 'byung gnas kyis gsang ston pa mdzad de dad pa'i dge 'dun grangs tshang ba'i dbus su bsnyen par rdzogs/mkhan chen dkon mchog 'phel ba dang/mus pa sangs rgyas rin chen/zha lu lo tsA ba rin chen chos skyong bzang po sogs las bde kyai dus 'khor rgyud sde chen po rnams kyi dbang bka' man ngag sogs mdo sngags rig gnas dang bcas pa la gsan bsam mthar phyin pa mdzad/mkhas shing grub pa da pa'i slob ma ha cang mang po byon/dgung lo zhe dug pa rab byung brgyad pa'i chu sbrul (1473)lor sku gshegs}
