'jam dbyangs mkhyen brtse dbang po|{rje 'di nyid la yongs grags su rdzong gsar mkhyen brtse'am dil mgo mkhyen brtse dang/pad+ma 'od gsal mdo sngags gling pa zhes mtshan gyi rnam grangs 'ga' mchis/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags 'brug (1820)lo'i bod zla drug pa'i tshes lnga la mdo khams sde dge gter klung dil mkho'i grong gi dbyar ru khyung chen brag nye 'dabs su yab rin chen rnam rgyal dang yum bsod nams mtsho gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi lnga tsam nas yi ge 'bri klog la sbyangs pas tshegs med du mkhyen/dgung lo bcu gnyis thog e waM thar pa rtse'i mkhan chen byams pa nam mkha' 'chi med kyi yang srid du ngos bzung/mtshan 'jam dbyangs mkhyen brtse'i dbang po kun dga' bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po zhes gsol/dgung lo nyer gcig par smin gling mkhan chen rig 'dzin bzang po las bsnyen par rdzogs/smin gling khri chen 'gyur med sangs rgyas kun dga' dang/zhe chen 'gyur med mthu stobs rnam rgyal/sa skya pa rdo rje rin chen sogs sa dge bka' snying gi bla ma skyes bu dam pa dang/rig pa'i gnas la byang chub pa'i mkhas dbang du ma'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags rig gnas dang bcas thun mong dang thun min gyi gzhung lugs mtha' dag sbyangs pa dpyis phyin mdzad/snga 'gyur rnying ma'i bka' gter dag snang gi chos bka' rnams dang/bka' gdams gsar rnying gi chos grub chen bu ru pa'i thugs bcud dpal ldan sa skya pa yab sras las byon cing sa ngor mtshar gsum sogs su brgyud pa'i lam 'bras bu dang bcas pa'i gdams ngag /bka' brgyud che bzhi chung brgyad bcas bka' bzhi brgyud pa'i ngag man/dpal ldan shangs pa bka' brgyud kyi ni gu'i gser chos/dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i rdzogs rim rdo rje'i rnal 'byor rtsal du bton pa sbyor ba yan lag drug pa sogs gangs can ljongs su man ngag gtso bor byed pa/sgrub brgyud shing rta brgyad du grags pa de dag gi dbang lung khrid dang bcas pa thugs la gtams/de bzhin rgyal ba'i bka' 'gyur rin po che dang/rnying ma rgyud 'bum/bstan 'gyur sogs kyis gtsos 'phags bod rim med kyi gsung chos yongs bsdoms glegs bam bdun brgya tsam gyi bklag lung mtha' dag gsan bzhes mdzad/mdor na/gsang gsang gsar rnying dang/sa gter/yang gter/dgongs gter/rjes dran/dag snang/snyan brgyud bcas bka' bab bdun dang ldan zhing/rnying ma dang/bka' gdams/lam 'bras/mar pa bka' brgyud/shangs chos/zhi gcod rdo rje'i rnal 'byor/bsnyen sgrub bcas sgrub brgyud shing rta brgyad kyi ring lugs gsal bar mdzad pa'i dpe gzhung dang/sgra/snyan ngag /gso rig skor sogs kyi gsung rtsom par du 'khod pa glegs bam bcu gsum bzhugs shing/zhal slob kyang kong sprul yon tan rgya mtsho dang/'ju mi pham 'jam dbyangs rnam rgyal rgya mtsho/rdo grub chen 'jigs med bstan pa'i nyi ma/sa skya khri chen bkra shis rin chen/na len+d+ra'i gzigs 'og /rgyal ba karma pa sku phreng bcu bzhi pa dang bco lnga pa/si tu sku phreng bcu pa dang bcu gcig pa/stag lung pa rin po che dkon mchog bstan pa rab rgyas/brag g.yab no mi han sogs sa bka' rnying gsum dang dge lugs pa/g.yung drung bon gyi bstan pa 'dzin pa sogs mkhas grub bstan 'dzin gyi skyes bu grangs las 'das pa byon/gzhan yang sku gsung thugs rten brgya phrag lhag dang/de dag bzhugs su gsol ba'i lha khang che chung sum cu skor gsar bzhengs mdzad pa sogs sku tshe hril por bstan 'gro'i don 'ba' zhig la gzhol nas rlabs chen gyi mdzad pa re zhig mthar son te dgung grangs don gsum bzhes pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu 'brug (1892)lo'i bod zla gnyis pi tshes nyer gcig nyin sku mya ngan las 'das}
'jam dbyangs mgon ma chen po'i lung gi gzhung la'i tA pa'u ba wang zi then rtsi tsu'u hu'u zhes 'bod pa|{{(WP:1,194)}mi rgyal rabs kyi gong ma ming khreng tsu'u yung los khri lo lnga pa spyi lo 1407lor karma pa sku phreng lnga pa de bzhin gshegs pa pe cin pho brang du gdan drangs nas chos zhus/gzhu la'i tA pa'u ba wang zi then rtsi tsu'u hu'u ste bod skad du de bzhin gshegs pa rin chen chos rgyal nub phyogs kyi phul byung gi byams pa chen po zhi ba sangs rgyas zer ba'i go gnas dang gser srang brgya yod pa'i 'ja' sa/g.yang Ti'i dam kha bcas phul yod skor (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )le tshan (pa)pa'i shog grangs 80nas 81bar gsal}
'jam dbyangs dga' ba'i bshes gnyen|{'phags pa spyan ras gzigs la mtshan gyi rnam grangs mang du yod pa'i nang gi gcig yin}
'jam dbyangs mgon po|{rje lo ras kyi slob ma 'di nyid yul myang stod bye phrag kham gong du yab khyung po bsod nams dpal dang yum 'gre mo khye 'dren dpal gyi sras su rab byung bzhi pa'i sa 'brug (1208)lor sku bltams/mtshan bsod nams mgon por btags/dgung lo bzhi lnga nas skye ba mang po dran/dgung lo drug bdun du slob dpon lce ston sangs rgyas sogs kyis chos gsungs pa gsan nas byis pa gzhan la 'chad pa'i blo gros ldan/jo gzungs kyi drung nas klog bslabs pas zla gcig tsam nang legs par mkhyen/dgung lo bcu pa la rab tu byung nas mtshan shes rab 'byung gnas su gsol/de nas 'o yug sogs su mtshams dam por bcas te sgom la bzhugs/rin po che mngar ston gyis mkhan po dang/dung lung pas slob dpon/slob dpon gcung pos gsang ston mdzad de bsnyen par rdzogs/khro bo lo tsA bas byang tham du sems nyin ngal gso dang rin chen 'bru dgu rnams zhus/stan gcig lo bcu bzhi dang/sha mi bzhes par lo bcu bdun bzhugs/de nas dbu re ba bsten nas lo brgyud bzhugs/'brug pa'i chos skor dbang bka' thams cad gsan/sa gdon gyi rtog pa chenapo byung bas 'dag 'byar byas nas 'jam dpal gyi bsnyen pa bskyal nas nad kyi rtog pa bsal/de nas lha ri mo dang myong stod dang chos lung rnams su 'dab 'byor mdzad de thugs dam la bzhugs/mkhan po ston lung pa dang/mkhan po dung lugs pa dang/slob dpon sba ba glan ston/stong nag chos kyi so ser/bla ma lha sgang pa sogs las 'dus ba dang/tshad ma/dus 'khor gyi dbang rgyud/dbu ma/sa sde/spyod phyogs/gsang 'dus 'phags skor/sgra'i bstan bcos sbyor drug sogs mang du gsan nas sku gsung thugs kyi yon tan ches cher rgyas pas/don yod rdo rje dang/'jam dbyangs mgon po sogs kyi mtshan bstod byung/stod smad kyi mtshams ku ru lung du dgon pa btab/chos kyi 'khor lo bskor te gzhan don zad mi shes pa bskyangs/rje 'dis mdzad pa'i bstan bcos kyang/sngags kyi dbang rgyud 'grel man ngag gi skor dang/mtshan nyid kyi gzhung bka' spyi bsdus mang po/mi dpyad dang rta dpyad sman dpyad la sogs pa'i 'jig rten gyi bstan bcos kyang mang po yod/'das lo ma rnyed}
'jam dbyangs chos rje bkra shis dpal ldan|{rje tsong kha pa chen po'i dngos slob 'jam dbyangs chos rje bkra shis dpal ldan mchog ni rab byung drug pa'i sa lug (1379)lor bsam yas su yab dge bsnyen zha ba zhig gi sras su sku 'khrungs/rtsed thang du rab tu byung p+sate gral 'dzin mdzad/der legs bshad gser phreng thugs 'dzin gnang/gsang phur gnyal rgod rin chen bsam grub dang ldan ma dkon mchog seng ge las phar tshad dang/skyor mo lung du mkhan chen dka' bzhi pa las 'dus mngon/dga' ldan du 'jam mgon chos kyi rgyal po tsong kha pa las grangs nges rnam 'byed dang/rtsa 'jug gi rnam bshad/lam rim che chung/sngags rim chen mo sogs mdo sngags kyi gzhung lugs rgya cher gnas nas mkhyen rab zla dang bral bar gyur/de nas ja tsong kha pa chen pos mkhan po dang/'dul ba 'dzin pa grags pa rgyal mtshan gyis las slob/rgyal tshab dam pa rin chen gyis gsang stong mdzad nas bsnyen par rdzogs/rje tsong pa chen pos 'gog pa rir nas gter bzhes pa'i chos dung gnas te dgos pa zhig 'debs dgos pa'i bka' bzhin dgung grangs so brgyad la phebs pa me sprel (1416)lor sde'u pa nam mkha' bzang pos sbyin bdag mdzad de chos rje chen po dpal ldan 'bras spungs dgos legs par btab/de yang gnas der phebs nas thog mar dgon pa'i shar phyogs kyi gzim spyil deng sang brag thog khang zer ba der bzhugs te mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsungs/dgon gnas legs par thebs nas chos rje nyid kyis grwa tshang so sor slob dpon bsko gzhag mdzad cing/rje rin po che'i bshad sgrub kyi srol gong du 'phel bar mdzad/chos rje rang nyid kyis cho sa thog nam tshugs su mdo phyogs kyi pu ti brgyad brgyad rong rang gi bol 'grel re dang sbyar nas gsungs shing/spyir na gzhung lugs kyi pu ti chen mo brgya dang sum cu la bshad pa mdzad/gzhan yang gsang 'dus 'phags lugs dang/bde mchog lU nag dril gsum la sogs pa yi dam gyi lha mang po'i bsnyen pa rgyun du mdzad/zhag re la a rA pa tsha stong phrag gnyis ri dang/mtshan brjod tshar gsum re/yig drug khro tsho re cha ga med bzla bar mdzad pas phyis ma Ni dung phyung gnyis lhag par longs/rje nyid 'chad nyan phun sum tshogs pa byung ba dang bde stong dbyer med kyi rdzogs rim mnga' bas rlung 'od zer lnga pa gzigs/phyag rdzas rnams chos phyogs dang slob ma skyong ba/sbyin par gtong ba las chags zhen ye nas mi gnang/mkhas grub kyi slob ma mus srad pa blo gros rin chen seng ge dang/nyan po shAkya rgyal mtshan/mkhan chen dpal blo ba/ba dpon sga leb/snar thang pa rab mchog /nyag re rdo rje rgyal mtshan sogs du ma 'dus/dgung lo so brgyad nas dgung lo bdun cu bar lo so gnyis ring gdan sa chen po 'dir mdo sngags kyi chos 'khor rgya cher bskor/sa 'brug (1448)lor bslab btus kyi brtson 'grub le'u'i mjug chos thun gnyis kyis rdzogs par mdzad/de bzhin (rje tsong kha pa chen po'i gsang ba'i rnam thar gsol 'debs )dang/(sher phyin gyi don las dang po bas nyams su len bde ba )sogs bstan bcom mang po ljags rtsom gnang/dgung lo don gcig la phebs pa na mya ngan las 'da' ba'i ltas byung ba'i tshe gzim chu du phebs/zhabs gnyis skyil krung dang phyag gnyis mnyam bzhag mdzad de thugs dam la thugs gtad pas/sku smad nas drod yar la rim gyis bsdus pa'i tshe rje btsun 'jam dbyangs kyi zhal gzigs bris sku de spyan drangs pas de la spyan gdangs te ol sko sku dpung g.yon pa'i steng du bzhag nas zhag 'ga' bzhugs pas phal cher gyis sku'i gzi mdangs la dpags nas 'khrul pa yang skyes/de ltar rab byung brgyad pa'i sa sbrul (1449)lo'i sa ga zla ba'i tshes bco brgyad nyid zhi bar gshegs so/_}
'jam dbyangs thub bstan rgya mtsho|{gong du lcang lung khri rgan 'jam dbyangs thub bstan rgya mtsho zhes par gsal}
'jam dbyangs dang bde ba can gyi zhing bkod|{rje btsun 'jam dpal dbyangs dang sangs rgyas 'od dpag med gnyis kyi zhing khams bkod pa bka' 'gyur nang gsungs pa ltar bris}
'jam dbyangs don yod rgyal mtshan|{sa skya'i khri pa bcu gnyis pa rin chen sgang pa 'jam dbyangs don yod rgyal mtshan ni rab byung lnga pa'i lcags khyi (1310)lor yab bdag chen bzang po dpal dang/yum ma cig gzhon nu 'bum gyi sras su sku 'khrungs/sku chung ngu nas yi ge 'bri klog sbyangs pas tshegs med du mkhyen/de nas dpang lo blo gros brtan pa dang/chos rje na bza' ba bsod nams dpal/rgyal sras thogs med sogs dge ba'i bshes gnyen du ma'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags la mkhas par sbyangs/gzhi thog mkhas btsun chen pos skul ma gnang ba bzhis tshogs chen mor rnam 'grel dang rig gter sogs nyin rer chos thun bdun re chag med dang/blo gsal don gnyer can rnams la 'dod chos rgya cher bstsal bas 'jam dpal dbyangs zhes pa'i mtshan snyan 'byung/rigs sras kyang 'ga' zhig bskrun/dgung lo nyer gnyis pa la mkhan chen bsod nams grags pa'i drung du gcung zla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan dang ldan du bo dong bya rgod gshong rnying pa'i gtsug lag khang du bsnyen par rdzogs/tA dben gu shrI mtshan gsol/shel gyi dam ga yang bstsal/dgung grangs bcu bzhi la phebs pa rab byung lnga pa'i chu phag (1323)lor dpal ldan sa skya dgon gyi gdan khrir phebs/dgung grangs so lnga la phebs pa rab byung drug pa'i shing sprel (1344)lo'i bod zla lnga pa'i tshes bcu gcig nyid rin chen sgang bla brang gi gzim khang gong mar sku gshegs}
'jam dbyangs don yod dpal ldan|{se ra theg chen gling gi khri thog bcu pa 'jam dbyangs don yod dpal ldan mchog ni nyan stong du rab byung bdun pa'i shing glang (1445)lor sku bltams/dpal 'khor bde chen du rab tu byung nas dam pa'i chos la don gnyer mdzad pa'i dbu tshugs/slob dpon bzod dpal ba'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags rig pa'i gnas zab mor sbyangs pas dpyis phyin mdzad pas mkhas pa chen por gyur/mkhas grub byang sems 'dul dkar ba sogs la bsten par rdzogs/de nas dbus su phebs te rin chen brag dgon tu nyan shAka pa dang se ra theg chen gling du chos mang du gsan/dgung lo zhe gcig la phebs pa rab byung brgyad pa'i shing sbrul (1485)lor se ra byes pa'i grwa tshang gi 'chad nyan pa mdzad/de nas dgung grangs dog nyis la phebs pa rab byung dgu pa'i me byi (1516)lorase ra dgon gyi khri mthon por phebs/dgung lo brgyad cu la phebs pa rab byung dgu pa'i shing sprel (1524)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs}
'jam dbyangs bde ba'i rdo rje|{rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu khyi (1682)lor lha sar sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu nas 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i rdo rje dang/stag phu bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan/thang sag dngos grub rgya mtsho/sa skya ngag dbang kun dga' lhun grub sogs bla ma mang po bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan de mkhas pas gyur/mi dbang pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyal ni khong gi sbyin bdag yin 'dug /khong gi mtshan gyi rnam grangs su blo bzang 'jam dpal rgya mtsho dang/many+dzu shri sa lu tra/su kha badzra/'jam dbyangs bde ba'i rdo rje bcas zhu/gsung rtsom pod chen gcig yod/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags bya (1741)lor sku 'das/khong ni mdo sngags kyi gzhung lugs gsan rgya che zhing/khyad par sa dge gnyis kyi phyag len la mkhas pas grub pa'i dbang phyug chen po zhig yin 'dug }
'jam dbyangs nam mkha' rgyal mtshan|{dpal sa skya dgon gyi khri thog bcu bdun pa rin chen sgang bla brang 'jam dbyangs nam mkha' rgyal mtshan mchog ni rab byung bdun pa'i sa stag (1398)lor yab zla ba rgyal mtshan nam mtshan gzhan bla chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan dang yum ma cig zhal lu ma nam mkha' rgyal mo gnyis kyi sras su sku bltams/ka chung dus nas thugs rig shin tu skyen zhing blo gros yangs pas slob gnyer mdzad skabs nyin gnyis la rtags gnyis thugs su chod pa dang nyin gcig la bde mchog sgrub dkyil thugs su chud pas kun gyis 'jam dbyangs chen por mtshan gsol/slob dpon pa la ma'i rnam sprul du grags shing/bstan srung bran du 'khor ba sogs mthu stobs kyi mnga' bdag tu bzhugs/dgung lo nyer gsum pa lcags byi (1420)lor sa skya'i gdan khrir phebs/dgung grangs drug cu yas mas bar gdan sa mdzad/rab byung brgyad pa'i chu 'brug (1472)lor sku gshegs}
'jam dbyangs mi yi gzugs can|{'di gong ma tshang la zer te/nang pa'i chos lugs pa rnams kyi bshad srol la/gong ma rim byon tshang ma rje btsun 'jam dpal dbyangs kyi sprul pa yin pa dang/mnga' zhabs su yod pa'i rgya rigs tshang ma 'dzam gling na yod pa'i mi rigs kun dang mi 'dra bar shes rab che ba/mnga' 'bangs kyang shar phyogs kyi rgya mtsho nas nub phyogs kyi g+r+ya mtsho'i mthar slebs thub pa lta bu'i sa khyon che ba'i stabs kyis lo grangs stong phrag mang por song mtshams 'dzam gling na stobs ldan rgyal khab sus kyang 'gran du med pa zhig yong zhes shod srol yod pa de yin cing/de'i skor zhib phra gong du gong ma zhes par gzigs}
'jam dbyangs gtsang pa bdun brgyud|{rgyal tshab dar ma rin chen/mkhas grub dge legs dpal bzang/zha lu ba legs pa rgyal mtshan/g.yag sde blo gros chos skyong/ba so chos kyi rgyal mtshan/rje blo gros brtan pa/'jam dbyangs smon lam dpal pa rnams so/_}
'jam dbyangs bzhad pa|{bod kyi nang bstan chos lugs thog dbus gtsang khams gsum dang/mdo smad/rgya sog bcas kyi yul gru mang por mtshan snyan shin tu che ba'i blo chen 'jam dbyangs bshad pa'i rdo rje ste gong du ka sde'i kun mkhyen zhes pa'i nang sku phreng rim byon ltar cung zhib tsam bkod yod pas der gzigs}
'jam dbyangs rin chen rgyal mtshan|{(shar pa 'jam dbyangs rin chen rgyal mtshan )rab byung bzhi pa'i sa rta (1258)lo nas rab byung lnga pa'i me rta (1306)lo bar/'gro mgon 'phags pa'i dngos slob shar pa shes rab 'byung gnas rab byung ma mdzad gong gi sras gsum pa yin cing/sa skya'i gdung rgyud dngos min kyang gdan sa skyong ba'i mdzad rjes gzhan dang mi 'dra ba'i mtshan snyan can gyi bla ma zhig yin/'gro mgon phyag na'i sras d+harma pA la sku ma gshegs pa'i gong bdag chen bzang po dpal ba sa skya'i gdung rgyud min pa'i gleng brjod sna tshogs bzos te gong mas rgya nag shar phyogs kyi rgya mtsho'i gling phran zhig tu phud/dus yun rim po ma song bar d+harma pA la yang sku gshegs nas sa skya'i gdung rgyud chad la nye ba'i lo mang po'i ring chos 'chad nyan dang/lha khang rnying pa khag gi nyams gso mjug skyong sogs mdzad pa ma zad/rab byung lnga pa'i shing sbrul (1305)lo'i zla ba lnga pa nas 'go tshugs te/lha khang chen mo'i yang thog thigs khang gi khor yug tu rnal 'byor rgyud man chad kyi dkyil 'khor chen po brgya dang bzhi bcu zhe brgyad/rigs bsdus kyi dkyil 'khor drug brgya sum cu so dgu bcas dkyil 'khor bdun brgya brgyad cu rgya bdun so so'i brgyud rim dang bcas pa 'bri bar mdzad pa da lta'ang ma nyams par yod pa 'di dang bcas mdor na d+harma pA la sku gshegs pa nas bdag chen bzang po dpal ba bod du ma phebs par gyi lo ngo bcu gnyis ring dang bdag chen bzang po dpal ba bod du phebs pa nas gdan sa ma gnang gi bar lo ngo bco brgyad bcas lo sum cu'i ring sa skya'i gdan sa mdzad nas sa skya ba'i chos lugs sngar las legs par 'phel rgyas yong ba'i mdzad rjes chen po bzhag yod pa zhig yin/rab byung lnga pa'i me rta'i (1306)lo 'gor/bdag chen bzang po dpal ba la gdas sa phul rjes/yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma ol jo'i thus gdan drangs kyang lo de'i lo mjug dgung lo bzhi bcu zhe dgu par sku gshegs/lo rgyus rgyas pa (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )shog grangs 145nas 146bar gsal}
'jam dbyangs legs pa chos 'byor|{mtshan gzhan 'jam dbyangs dga' ba'i blo gros zhu ba mchog ni 'bras spungs dgon gyi gdan rabs brgyad pa yin/rab byung bdun pa'i sa bya (1429)lor lha sa tshal gung thang du 'khrungs/sku gzhon dus gsang phur chos zhugs kyis gung ru chos blo dang slob dpon dpal blo las phar tshad gsan/slob dpon gnas brtan las 'dul ba dang mngon pa gsan/ba so chos rje'i sa gnas gsang sngags skor gsan te mkhas pa chen por gyur/dgung lo nyer lnga'i lo gsang phur ba smad pa'i 'chad nyan mdzad/de nas mdo khams su phebs/phyir phebs rjes 'bras spungs blo gsal gling du 'chad nyan lo nyi shu lhag tsam mdzad de/dgung lo re lnga bzhes pa chu glang (1493)lor 'bras spungs kyi khrir phebs/gzhung chen mo'i bshad pa gtso bo mdzad/sne'u pas sbyin bdag mdzad nas 'bras spungs kyi byams chen kyi sku bzhengs/bka' rtsom la mtshon na/(rten 'brel gyi rnam bshad thar ba'i them skas/) (theg pa chen po mdo rgyan gyi gzhung 'grel kun bzang mchod sprin/) (dbu ma 'jug pa'i gzhung 'grel gdongs pa rab gsal )sogs mang du mdzad/zhal slob pa yang thams cad mkhyen pa dge 'dun rgya mtsho/dga' ldan chos rje chos kyi bshes gnyen/rtse shar gyi chos ja paN+Di ta bzang po dang/chos skyong rgya mtsho/nyi sding bla ma dpal ldan 'od zer/go mal rab 'byams sku mched/sems dpa' chen po'i sku skye smon lam blo gros/bye rdzing mkhan po rab 'byor seng ge/go rams pa bkra shis seng ge/kong ston dkon cog 'byung gnas/'ol dga' dka' bcu ba blo gros grags sogs shin tu mang/mthar dgung grangs don lnga la phebs pa rab byung brgyad pa'i chu phag (1503)lor sku gshegs}
'jam dbyangs shAkya rgyal mtshan|{phag gru sde srid khri rabs gnyis pa 'di nyid rang byung drug pa'i lcags 'brug (1340)lor yab phar gru dpon bsod nams bzang po dang yum mang nya ma gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/chus dus bla ma klu lung grags pa las yi ge 'bri klog bslabs/tshes bzhi grags pa rgyal mtshan gyi drung du dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa mnos pa'i mtshan grags pa bzang po dang/dgung lo dgu la mkhan chen gzhon dbang dang slob dpon gzhon brtson las rab tu byung ba'i mtshan shAkya rgyal mtshan du gsol/dgung lo bcu gsum par rtsed thang gi gdan sa mdzad/thil gyi gdan sar rtags gnyis kyi bshad pa dang/bka' pod bzhi sogs bshad pa mdzad pas mkhas pa'i grags pa thob/rtsed thang gi tshogs pa lo bcu gsum bar du bskyangs/bu ston rin po che sogs las mdo sngags kyi gdams pa ru ma mnos/sde gdong chos 'khor chen mo mdzad/dgung lo bcu dug par chos rje bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyi drung du bsnyen par rdzogs/dgung lo nyer drug pa rab byung drug pa'i shing sbrul (1365)lor pho brang sne'u gdong rtse'i khri thog tu phebs nas ta'i si tus phag gru'i bla dpon du dbang bskur/chos srid zung du 'brel ba'i khrims lung sngar bzhin bskyangs/hor thog gan the mur rgyal pos ta si tu chang gu'i gung kwa din gu shri'i mtshan phul/rab byung drug pa'i chu byi (1372)lor gong ma tha'i tsu'u kru'i yon krang gis ta'i si tu dang kwa din shri'i mtshan dang dam kha phul/shAkya rgyal mtshan mchog gis phag gru sde da kyi srid 'gal bzhes ring srid dbang skyong thabs ni byang chub g+r+yal mtshan gyis gtan la phab cing ji ltar gdams pa rgyun 'dzin gnang btsam las 'gyur bcos sogs gang yang ma gnas bar srid lo dgu bskyangs mthar rab byung drug pa'i chu glang (1373)lor sku gshegs}
'jam dbyangs bsam 'grub rdo rje|{gsang sngags rnying ma'i bla ma chen po 'jam dbyangs bsam 'grub rdo rje zhu ba 'di ni rab byung lnga pa'i shing lug (1295)lor gtsang rta nag gnas gsar yul du sku 'khrungs/sku na gzhon dus zur byams pa seng ge'i drung du chos rgya chen gsan/lhag tu sgyur 'phrul skor la mkhas par gyur/de nas glan nya tshang ba bsod nams mgon po las sgyu 'phrul dbang yang dag par zhus/bye ma seng ger rdzogs pa chen po snying thig la thugs dam rtse gcig tu mdzad pas/thig le chen po'i skur gyur nas thugs dam shin tu mtho bar mnga'/dben pa'i zur shAkya 'byung gnang dang/'ug pa lung pa'i bla ma seng ge ba/shangs pa kun mkhan pa bcas mkhas grub chen po 'di gsum po yang rje 'jam dbyangs bsam rdo rjes chung ngu nas zhabs drug du bzhag nas legs par bskyangs pas/phyis zur pa'i rgyun la shin tu phyag rjes dang bka' drin che bar gyur/rje 'di nyin dgung lo gya gnyis la phebs pa rab byung drug pa'i me 'brug (1376)lor 'das}
'jam dbyangs a ra pa tsa na|{'jam dbyangs rigs lnga yod pa'i nang gi 'jam dbyangs sa ra pa tsa na zhes pa de yin/a ra pa tsa na legs sbyar gyi skad yin/bod skad la 'gro ba smin byed ces zer}
