'ja' tshon chu mig|{lha sa grong khyed khred kon chus nyan bran shang khongs brag ri khug (lha sa ba'i kha rgyun du spa ri khug zer )grong tsho'i nye bskor du 'ja' tshon chu mig ces pa'i gling ga'i nang sngar chu mig cig yod pa der dbyar dus gling gtong spro gseng du yong mkhan mang po yod pa dang/chu mig de'i nang nya 'dra min sna tshogs yod pa de tsho'i rim mor gzhigs te nya spa phrug gyon pa dang/mthur mgo gyon pa/rta sga brgyab pa sogs kyi ming brtags yod cing/deng sang yang dbyar kha de gar gling gtong spro gseng gtong mkhan yong gi yod}
