'jig rten gyi khams grub tshul zung bdun te nyer brgyad|{1 lho'i dmar po 'bar ba mched pa'i mtshan nyid can gyi mthu las dus me/nyi ma/mig dmar/phur bu/spen pa ste drag gza' lnga dang/glog /rta gdong me bcas bdun/2 byang gi dkar po 'bar ba snang ba'i mtshan nyid can gyi mthu las sgra gcan/zla ba/lhag pa/pa sangs/mjug ring ste zhi gza' lnga dang/char/rgya mtsho ste chu bdun/3 nub kyi ser po 'bar ba rags pa'i mtshan nyid can gyi mthu las sa phra sbom/rdo phra sbom/skar ma phra sbom/'ja' tshon te bdun/4 de ltar shar nub gnyis sa rlung zung bdun/lho byang gnyis me chu zung bdun no/_/(gzhan shar gyi nag po 'bar ba nyer thob kyi mtshan nyid can gyi mthu las phyi rol gyi mnyam gnas la sogs pa'i rlung bdun zhes bkod do/_/)}
