'jig rten gyi mig mahA paN+Di ta d+harma shrI|{(lo tsA ba d+harma shri )rgya gar skad du lo tsA ba zhes pa bod skad du bsgyur na 'jig rten mig zer zhing/lo tsA ba rnams rang gi mi rigs kyi skad dang yi ge la mkhas pa ma zad/mi rigs gzhan gyi sde dang yi ge la yang mkhas pas mi rigs phan tshul gyi rig gzhung dar spel btang ba la 'jig rten 'di'i mig dang 'dra ba yin pas ming de ltar thogs shing/smin grol gling gi mkhas pa chen po lo chen d+harma gri yang rgya gar gyi skad yig dang bod kyi skad yig gnyis ka'i thog nas rtsom yig 'bri bar la mkhas pa'i lo tsA ba chen po zhig yin/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing rta (1645)lo nas rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me bya (1717)lo bar dgung lo drug cu re bzhi bzhugs/smin grol gling gter bdag gling pa 'gyur med rdo rje sogs bla ma mkhas pa mang po bsten nas gsang sngags gsar rnying dang rig gnas lnga la mkhas par sbyangs shing gsum rtsom yang phug lugs (rtsis kyi 'grel chen nyin byin snang ba )rtsa ba dang 'grel pa/(bu yig )0(snyan ngag le'u gsum gyi dpe brjod )sogs sha cang mang po yod/rjes su sog po jun gar tshe dbang rab brtan gyis btang ba'i dmag dpung bod du 'byor skabs sku bkrongs pa yin zhes lo rgyus 'ga' zhig tu gsal/lo chen 'di'i rnam thar zhig nges par yod tshod 'dug kyang da phan bdag gis ma mthong lags}
