'jig rten pa'i theg pa gsum|{'jig rten pa nyid kyi theg pa (phyugs bdag dang/drang srong/lha/'byung po/gsang ba pa/sngags mkhan sogs so so skye bos byas pa ste 'jig rten pa dngos so/) nges pa la 'jug pa'i 'jig rten pa'i theg pa ('dod pa dang/gzugs kyi rig pa 'dzin pa dang/gzugs med pa lte khams gsum gyi mchog sngags kyi sbyor bas bgrod par byed pa rig pa 'dzin pa'i sde snod las 'byung ba rnams so/) sems sems kyi 'jig rten pa'o (tshogs kyi lam du sbyor ba'i lam ste/phyi ma gnyis ni 'jig rten pa las 'das pa'i sder yang gtogs shing de ston byed kyi rgyud rnams kyang de'i sde snod du gtogs so/_}
