rje dkon mchog rgya mtsho|{khri chen bsod nams grags pa'i sprul sku rje dkon mchog rgya mtsho mchog ni yab ngag dbang bkra shis dang yum a rig g.yas chen bza' skyid mtsho gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags khyi (1790)lor sku bltams/dgung lo lnga'i thog bkra shis 'khyil gyi gdan sar bkod/g.yag shul 'dus 'dzin chos bzang dar rgyas klog gi slob dpon du bsten/dgung lo drug pa la gung thang 'jam dpal dbyangs kyi drung las rab tu byung/dgung lo brgyad dgu nas chos grwa 'grim ring zhag bcu nyi shu la rtsam pa kha la sbyar ma myong ba yod gsungs/dgung lo bcu gcig par chos grub zhugs/lo der bsdus grwa'i tshogs rgyug phul/thog god chos ldan dge rgan du bsten nas bka' pod yongs rdzogs la sbyangs pa dpyis phyid pa mdzad/dgung lo bcu drug la yab rje d+h+wa dza'i mtshan can tshul bzhin du bsten nas bzung bka' chos gang gnang chag med du gsan/'dzin grwa gzhung du slebs pa nas dbu ma gsar ma'i lor smon lam rab 'byams pa'i mtshan rtags mdzad/gung thang 'jam dpal dbyangs las bsnyen rdzogs dang/nam mkha' sgo 'byed kyi dbang sogs gsan/de nas kun gzhi gas thams cad mkhyen pa/khri chen 'jigs med rig pa'i seng ge /bka' 'gyur ba chen po dkon mchog dpal 'dzin bcas las chos bka' mang du gsan/bka' 'gyur gyi lung zhus/chu lug rigs grwar rdo rabs pa'i dam bca' bzhag /bde mo thang dga' ldan chos 'khor gling gi khrir bzhugs/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags stag (1830)lor dbus su phebs/lha ldan chos sde khag la mang 'gyed zhal 'debs dang/dga' ldan/brag yer pa/la mo/phun tshogs gling/mal dro spang gsar/rin chen gling/gar phug sogs yol kha'i rje'i sgrub gnas rnams dang/'phan po/gzhis rtsi sogs kyi gnas rten rnams zhib mjal zhus/de nas khri chen ngag dbang chos 'phel drung du sngags rim chen mo'i bshad dbang lung dang/shar rtse dpon slob blo bzang bkra shis las zhogs don yod mkhas grub pa'i gsung 'bum/chu bzang dge bshes skal bzang mkhas grub las sha bar ba yod tan grags kyi lam rim 'bring po'i lung rnams gsan te sman yon chen por gyur/lcags yos lor mdo smad du byon/urge sgar gsang sngags smin rgyal gling gi khrir phebs/mdo sngags chos kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor/shing 'brug (1844)lor bkra shis 'khyil gyi tshogs chen khrir 'khod de brtse bzhag chag med mdzad/chos rgyud 'dzin pa'i bu slob sa khyab pa byung/de bzhin du rnga ba/mdzod dge/dbal shul/sog po mda' bcu gcig /hor/rong tsho chen bco brgyad sogs phyogs gar sar zhabs kyang bcags te so so'i re ba yid bzhin du skong bar mdzad/gzhan yang brag dkar byang chub gling/rgyal lung rnam rgyal gling/gzhung ba kha gsum gyi dgos sde sogs la phebs te chos bka' ci rigs bstsal/de nas ri khrod du sku mtshams la lan mang bzhugs/dge tshul slong snga phyir mang du bsgrubs/ci mdzad gzhan phan 'ba' zhig tu dgongs shing kun la mthun grub kho na mdzad/de nas sngar sor zhig la yab rje d+h+wa dza'i zhabs kyis rje 'di la khyed kyi sku gong ma'i dgung gegs de 'dzur na bzang/de phan chad nyid nas bab la gzigs/ha cang bgres na skus thegs dkar rgyu red ces gsungs pa zhal gyis bzhes pa bzhin re bdun gyi dgung gegs 'dzur ba'i lo gnyis pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa rta (1858)lor mkha' spyod dag pa'i zhing khams su re zhig gshegs pa'i tshul bstan/thugs dam grol rim la rlung phra mo tsam yang mi rgyu bar nam mkha' g.ya' dag pa sogs rdzogs rim nas bshad tshod ltar gyi rtags mngon mtshan can byung/thugs sras shes rab rgya mtsho sogs mang du byon}
rje dkon mchog bstan 'dzin 'gro 'dul|{'bri gung gdan rabs nyer drug pa 'di nyid kong yul o rong zhes par yab sde ba tshe ring dbang rgyal dang yum bu khrid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing 'brug (1724)lor sku bltams/dgung lo bzhi pa la jo shAka yid bzhin nor bu'i drung du rtag dril phul bar rje 'phrin las bzang po'i yang srid 'phrul med du chung srid 'di nyid phebs shing/chos rje rin po che'i drung du gtsug phud phul/btsan dkon mchog bstan 'dzin 'gro 'dul du gsol/dgung lo bdun pa la rje gong ma chos kyi rgyal po'i drung du rab tu byung ba'i mtshan sngon ma'i mjug tu dpal ldan chos kyi nyi ma 'phrin las phyogs las rnam par rgyal ba bzang po'i sde zhes sbyor ba gnang/dgung lo dgu pa nas chos kyi rgyal po'i drung du phyag chen chos drug sogs 'bri gung gi chos ma lus pa dang/rngog dkyil bdun/rdo rje phreng ba dkyil 'khor zhe brgyad pa/myang lugs bka' brgyad bde 'dus/sangs gling dgongs 'dus/pad+ma gling pa'i skor sogs gsang sngags gsar rnying gi chos bsam gyis mi khyab pa dang/lho dkon mchog chos kyi rgyal mtsho las kyang rje skyob pa chen po che'i zab chos thugs kyi nying khu sems bskyed chen mo sogs mang du gsan/dgung lo bcu gsum par rgyal dbang bskal bzang rgya mtsho mgar thang du bod ljongs su chibs bsgyur gnang skabs rwa sgreng du phebs bsur bcar te der rgyal dbang mchog la gtsug phud phul bar mtshan kun bzang dkon mchog nyi ma zhes gnang/de nas yi ge 'bri klo gnas brtsams rang lugs kyi 'dod chos skyor gar thig dbyangs gsum dang byed grub kyi rtsis dkar nag /snyan ngag /gso dpyad rgyud bzhi/lha bris sogs la sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa gnang/phyis si tu chos kyi 'byung gnas las sgra ka lA pa sogs mdo rgyud rig gnas mtha' dag la mkhyen rab phul du phyin/dgung lo bcu drug la nang chen sde thog te phebs/lho mgar gyis dbus bla grwa mang tsam gyis zhabs btegs te bka' brgyad bed 'dus kyi sgrub dbang chen mo 'dzugs par gnang/skal ldan gyi 'dus pa khri phrag lhag la dam chos bstsal/wang 'gyur med rnam rgyal dang rje 'di sku nyer gyur pa ma zad/rje nyid la gus 'dud shin tu che ba bcas 'dam dang/bye ri stag rtse sogs su gdan zhus byung ba ltar lan mang du phebs/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me yos (1747)lor gdan sa byang chub gling gi theg chen chos kyi khrir mnga' gsol/de nas spro lung du yang khril zhabs bkod/der 'jam dbyangs chos kyi rgyal pos mkhan po gnang ste bsnyen par rdzogs/lcags lug (1751)lor rdzong gsar gyi yig drug 'khor chen gsar bzhengs/ston pa'i 'khrungs rabs bag+r+ya pa'i grwa thang bco lnga che legs gsar bzhengs/gu ru pad+ma'i sku za hor ma yum gnyis mtshan brgyad/rtsa gsum rdo rje gzhon nu khro bo bcu yab yum bcas gsar bzhengs/rtse ba'i mgon khang gsar skrun thog mgon po phyag bzhi sogs sku rten du ma gsar bzhengs/gzhan yang spro lang gi ma chod khar rtser gu ru pad+ma' sam+b+ha'i dngul sku gang blugs ma/gnas bcu bka' thang chos srung rdzogs sogs bris sku mang rab/rje skyob pa rin po che nas rje don grub chon rgyal bar gyi gong ma rnams kyi bka' 'bum ji yod dang/gsar rnying gi chos skor sogs po ti mang ba gsar bzhengs/gnas chen tsA ri tra'i yul smad zhig gsos dang sbrags lta khang thog gnyis pa/gdan rabs bla brgyud rnams kyi sku gsar bzhengs gnang ba sogs brjod las 'das/sku tshe ril por dam 'i chos kyi 'khor lo 'bar zhig bskor bar mdzad de/thugs kyi sras kyang lho rin chen po chos kyi rgyal mtshan/dge slong ngag dbang sogs sbas pa'i rnal 'byor mang du byung/mthar dgung lo zhe gsum la phebs pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me khyi (1766)lor gzugs sku'i dkyil 'khor chos dbyings su bsdu ba'i tshul bstan}
rje dkon mchog 'phrin las bzang po|{'bri gung gdan rabs nyer bzhi pa 'di nyid bya kong long po'i phyogs glang grong zhes par yab sngags rgyud sa pho lha rgyal dang yum g.yo dpyad pa'i rigs rdo rje rgyal mo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me sprel (1656)lor sku bltams/rje chos kyi grags pas sa khyi (1658)lor 'bri gung du spyan drangs/rje chos kyi grags pa'i drung du dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan dkon mchog 'phrin las bzang por gsol/dgung lo lnga pa la lha ldan du phebs/rgyal dbang lnga pa chen po las dge tshul gyi sdom pa mnos/de nas 'bri gung du gsum pa tshul khrims rdo rje dang/thugs sras sprul sku las bla ma dgongs 'dus dang/pad gling gi skor sogs rnying ma'i chos mang po gsan/dge slong ra khyim pa dang/nyi khri rin 'byung las yi ge 'bri klog dang rang lugs 'don chos spyod sogs la sbyangs/dgung lo drug pa lcags glang (1661)lor gdan sa chen po byang chub gling du gser khrir mnga' gsol/lo de nyid du spro lung du 'dus tshugs la dbang chos thog mar gnang/skabs shig thel gyi khang gsar byang ma'i gzim chung du zla gsang gi gzhal bsnyen gnang ba'i tshe yi dam dngos su zhal gzigs/phyis mal der zhal bar rang byon byon pa dngos su mjal rgyu yod/rje nyid kyis mgon po dang/a phyi'i gtso 'khor/bka' srung smug nag lcam dral/ha ra/chos rje'i dge bsnyen rnam bzhi/tshangs pa/thang lha/yab yum/pe har/gnod sbyin rtsi dmar sogs rang lugs chos skyong tshang ma'i gar 'cham ngo mtshar ba gsar 'dzugs gnang/phyis thel du yang de mtshungs 'dzugs par mdzad/de nas bzung rung lugs dgon gnas 'ga' zhig la dar/dgung lo nyer gsum pa sa rta (1627)lor lha ldan du pho brang dmar po rir rgyal dbang thams cad mkhyen pa ngag dbang blo bzang rgya mtsho'i sku drung du bsnyen par rdzogs pa'i dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes pa'i mtshan ngag dbang chos grags phun tshogs zhes gnang/smin gling gi skyes mchog chos rgyal gter gling pa byon par/g.ya' ma lung/shel brag /gnam lcags brag gsum gyi zab gter gyi chos rnams gsan cing/gter gsar drag po'i chos bdag rje 'di la zin pas/de nyid zung 'brel rtse nang grwa tshang de skabs 'dzugs pa gnang/drug po'i 'dzin las bzlog gzhung/yang bzlog gi dkyil sogs bstan bcos 'ga' zhig mdzad/snga rjes su ja dgon pa chog rin chen dang chos kyi grags pa rnam gnyis kyi bka' 'bum rnams mthing shog la gser gyis bris pa bzhengs/rgyal ba'i bka' 'gyur ro 'tshal yongs rdzogs snga 'gyur rgyud 'bum bcas mthing shog gi ngos la gser dngul phra can las grub pa'i glegs bam bag+r+ya dang nyi shu dang/de mnyam 'phags pa gnas brtan bcu drug gi rtogs brjod grwa thang nyer gsum bzhengs/bka' 'gyur rnying rgyud glegs bam bag+r+ya dang nyi shu shog dkar gyi ngos su bzhengs/de bzhin sangs rgyas gling pa'i bka' thang/ston pa'i 'khrungs rabs mdzad brgya/grub thob brgyad cu'i rtogs brjod/bka' brgyad bde 'dus grwa thang/dngul gar blugs dang/tsan dan dkar dmar las grub pa'i sku 'dra sogs sku gsung thugs kyi rten mang du bzhengs/de bzhin sbrag yang thog lhun rtsi dga' 'khyil gsar bzhengs dang/rdzong gsar bkra shis tshugs pho brang gsar skrun gnang/thugs kyi sras la mtshon na/don grub chos kyi rgyal po dang/lho rin po che cho kyi rgyal mtsho sogs mang du byung/mthar dgung lo re gsum la phebs pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa khyi (1718)lor zhi bar gshegs}
