ebs nas 'phags yul gyi paN+Di ta wA tsaspa ti zhes pa bod du byon pa de las sgra rig sogs rig gnas mtha' dag la gsan bsam dogs gcod mtha' chod pa mdzad/de nas yangs ri sgar gyi gdan sa'i khur bla ma spangs mda' ba bkra shis dar rgyas la gnang/rje nyid spyan drangs pa bzhin snga rjes su bsam yang dang/spro lung/rngod/nyang po brag dkar lha chu/spo bo/ma bskungs lung/tsA ri tra/pu ri rgyab skor/sgam po/e sogs yul lung dang gnas mchog khyad par can du mar phebs te snod ldan rnams la zab chos dang gnas skor mdzad/dgung lo so gnyis la phebs pa me stag (1626)lor 'bri gdan seng khrir zhabs sor bkod/chos srid kyi mdzad 'phrin rgyas/bya khyung pa pad+ma rdo rje 'bri rdzong tu gdan zhus kyis bla ma dgongs pa 'dus pa'i dbang che chung tshang ma/rdzogs chen gser zhun ma/lam 'bras nyams khrid chos skor yongs rdzogs kyi lung bcas dang/sangs rgyas gling pa'i gter chos phal cher gsan/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me yos (1627)lor gtsang nas sde srid kyi sras mo lcam drung khab tu bzhes/rje nA ro pa'i gdung rten rnam rgyal mchod rten bzhengs pa gnang/mthing shog gi ngos la gser dngul spel mas rgyal ba'i bka' 'gyur rnying ma rgyud 'bum dang bcas po ti brgya dang nyi shu bzhengs/de nas gdung rgyud mi 'byung ba mkhyen nas shing bya (1645)lor sku sngags chas dor nas bsnyen par rdzogs/rgyal dbang thams cad mkhyen gzigs lnga pa chen pos rje nyid la dbugs dbyung ba'i bka' tham dang mchod yon du bka' mchid gsung nan bcas sku'i nyes dmigs la grol zhing/snyan grags cher rgyas par gyur/chu 'brug (1652)lor rgyal dbang lnga pa rgya nag tu chibs kha sgyur skabs 'dam thang 'brog tu phebs skyel du byon/shing rta (1654)lor bal bod kyi bzo bo nyi shu skor gyi la grwa tshugs te thugs dam rten cho 'phrul chen po'i mchod rten gser dngul las grub pazhig bzhengs/rgyal dbang mchog gi bkas bskul ba'i gshin rje lcags sdig gi mchod rten bcas chog rdo rje 'bar ba'i mtshon rnon ljags sgrig mdzad nas 'bul gnang bar mchog dbyes nas bka'i glegs bu rten bzang po dang bsngags brjod rgya che ba gnang/gzhan (bka' brgyad kyi