ljags smin gsol mar|{de sngo bod sa nags srid gzhung skabs lha sa'i zhol pa las khungs nas rtse (tA la'i bla ma )gsol tha btu ljags smin gsol mar zhes nyin ltar mar sos pa (dkar ldi zhes phal cher g+r+ya ma bdun brgyad tsam )'bul dgos pa de tsho ljags smin she ma zhes pa mal gro gzi sbug dang/rin chen gling/lcang gshongs/ru thog sogs su bog pa yod pa so sos nam dus res mos kyis 'bul dgos rnams gsor mar u'u zhes mi gnyis yod par zhol chibs ra la khungs nas bzhon rta dang/ljags smin gsol mar a'u zhes mi gnyis yod par zhol chibs ra las khungs nas bzhon rta dang/ljags smin gsol mar blag sgam 'gel rta g.yer kha dang sga chas cha tshang gtong dgos pa'i thog sa gnas so so'i ljags smin dkar khang nang nyin ltar res mos kyis 'bul dgos pa de dag zhol lus khungs kyi nang gzan gsol bar zhal ngos rtse gsol thab tu 'bul bar 'gro srol yod/ ljang 'di la mkhas pa 'ga' zhig gis bod skad du ljang dang 'jang zer ba rgya skad du chang zhes 'bod pa'i sgra zur chag pa ma las don du chang mi rigs la zer zhing/mi rigs de ni bod mi rigs kyi mes po yid pa dang rjes su mtsho sngon kan su'u phyogs nas bod dpung gtsang du spos pa yin gsum yang/bod mi rigs kyi mes po bod dpung gtsang gi sa gnas rang du skyes nas 'tshar longs byung ba zhig yid pa las sa gnas gzhan nas spos pa yin pas/de'i skor rgyal nang gi bod rig pa'i mkhas dbang du mas ched rtsom spel gnang yod pa de dag nang gzigs}
ljang gi yul|{'di ni rang rgyal kyi lho nub sa khul du gnas pa'i yul sde zhig yin cing/bod yig gi chos 'byung lo rgyus mang po zhig gi nang yul de btsan po srong btsan sgam po'i dus dmag drangs te mnga' 'og tu bsdus par bshad cing/tun hong nas thon pa'i gter yig las/btsan po 'dus srong mang po rje'i dus su mnga' 'og tu bsdus par bshad de/de nyid las/btsan po khri 'dus srong sku chung nas gzhon gyis kyang phag rgod la bshad gyis mdzad/g.yag rgod sgrog tu bcug /stag gi rna ba la bzung ces pa nas/'ung gi 'og tu 'jam la chab srid mdzad de mya dkar po dpya' phab/mya nag po 'bangs du bkug pa la stsog ste/rgyal po 'di las dbu rmog btsan zhing chab srid mtha' skyes pa ni sngon chad gdung rabs kyis ma mdzad do/_/zhes 'khod pa ltar na/'jam yul mnga' 'og tu bsdus pa ni btsan po 'di nyid kyi skabs yin par gsal/gang ltar btsan po'i dus su yul 'di'i spyi ming la 'jang ces 'bod pa dang/nang gser mya dkar po dang nag po gnyis yod pa las dkar po lad mag drangs te mnga' 'og tu bsdus nas dpyar khral 'jal bcug pa dang nag po la dmag drangs ma dgos par mnga' go tu bsdus pa yin/'jang bod gnyis skabs re mnyam 'brel byed pa dang skabs re phan tshul bar dmag drangs res byed pa sogs sna tshogs byung myong/de yang sngon dus 'jang la de thang gi mnga' 'og tu gtogs pa'i rgyal phran zhig yin kyang/thang gis can nan ce tu hrir bskos pa'i dpon rigs shon yu'i krung tung gis thang 'jang bar gyi gdan don 'ga' zhig thag gcod 'tshams po ma byung ba'i rkyen gyis thang 'jar bar dmag 'khrug langs te 'jang pa pham nyes chen po byung stabs/'jang gi rgyal po kag lo bong zhed nas bod kyi rab byung gong gi lcags yos (756)lor bod la mgo btags zhus shing/btsan po khri gtsug brtan gyis 'jang bza' khri btsun mnar ma blangs pa la sras 'jang tsha lha dpon 'khrungs/de rjes btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyis srid dbang bzung nas lo gsum la slebs pa bod kyis srid dbang bzung nas lo gsum la slebs pa bod kyi rab byung gong gi me sprel (756)lor blon ri bzang dang/zhang stong btsan/'jang gi rgyal po kag lo bong gsum gyis m