ljongs chen po bcu drug|{'di la mngon pa mngon gnas gsum pa'i 'jig rten chags tshul gyi (mchims mdzod ) ('grel pa mngon pa'i rgyan )shog grangs 160nas 'di ltar/'dzam gling 'di na yul chen po bcu drug dang (de'i 'og gi mtshan du )mtha' 'khor thod skor du/1 rgya yul dang/2 hu na dang/3 phu na dang/4 kam po rtse/5 sha kha /6 sbal kha/7 khyi gdong/7 khyi gdong/8 wa gdong/9 kri ba shi'i gdong/10 gnam gdong/11 phyir phyogs gdong/12 gshog thogs dang/13 gcer bu/14 rgyu te 'gro ba/15 sna med/16 glag kra ste zhes gsal/yang gsum pa mkhan chen ye shes dpal 'byor gyi gsung 'bum (kha)pa'i dang gi (sum rab rnams las bshad pa'i grangs 'dren 'ga' zhig bsdus pa me tog phreng spel )shog grangs 30las/yul bcu drug ni/1 ang+ga/2 mag+ha d+ha/3 ko sA la/4 kA shi ka /5 pri dzi/6 ma la ya/ka ma/10 a ban+ti/11 ku ru/12 lnga len/13 ba sa ta/14 dpal d+he/15 ya ba na/16 kam bo zhes gsal zhing snga ma ni 'dzam gling spyi'i dbang du byas pa dang/phyi ma ni rgya gar kho na'i dbang du byas pa yin no/_}
