nyag rong spyi khyab|{de snga'i sa gnas srid gzhung gi mtha' mtshams dang/tshong lam/0sa gnas 'du khag che sa khag la spyi khyab srid 'dzin bskor 'dzugs byas pa'i las khungs gras shig yin/'di ni rab byung bco lnga'i chu glang (1853)lor nyag rong mgon po rnam rgyal phyogs gtogs dang bcas nas brag 'go dang/stong 'khor/sde dge/'bar li sogs la rim bzhin dpung 'jug gis blangs te sa khul de tsho'i mi ngan 'ga' zhig la 'go ming btags thog mthar bod du dpung 'jug bya rgyu'i dmigs yul yod par brten skabs der sde dag sa spyod pa lo na phra stabs mdun 'khor rnams dang/yul dgon 'og mi gros bsdur gyis sa gnas su ya bzung thub re med stabs mthun lam gang mkhas byas pa dang/nyag dgra'i cho spyod gnas tshul dang rting ma'i dmigs yul bcas zhib phra 'khod pa'i lha sar gnas tshul skyel mi bdun 'khor bsam khang lha dar can nam nyin shad rdzong byas don ltar sa smad gyi gnas tshul zhib phra bod sa gnas srid gzhung nas shes rtogs byung rjes srid skyong dang bka' shag /bod ljongs tshogs 'du bcas go bsdur gyis nyag dgra mthar skrod gtong rgyu'i spyi khyab zhabs pad phu lung pa tshe dbang rdo rje dang dbus mda' khri smon pa/mdo mkhar ba che dbang nor bu/dgus gtsang dmag dpung tshig stong brgyad brgya skor/phogs dpon rtse mgron skal dar dang/shod drung las phan tshar lci ma ngo las bcas 'phral thon dgos pa'i bka' bsgyur dang 'brel/khams khul nas ri chab (ri bo che dang chab mdo/) sho star lho gsum (sho pa mdo/star rdzong de dpal 'bar/lho rdzong/) smar mdzo sa gsum (smar khams/mdzo sgang/sa ngan bcas nas yul dmag mi go rang 'grigs skong 'gugs kyis 'go 'doms yul dgon so so nas 'ongs 'debs thog dmar phogs rang khungs rdzong gzhis so so'i bka' khongs nas 'don 'dren dgos rgyu'i bkod mngags bcas rtse drung las tshan chang khyim dang/shod drung gnas gsar ba shad rtsol gyis btang thog dngos gzhi'i dmag dpung dang/spyi khyab ngo las lha sa nas 'phral thon bgyis shing/mdo smad du gzhis byes mnyam 'dzoms kyis skyi khyab bka' blon ngo las dang/dmag dpung gtor che bcas sa smad du thon dang thon rtsis yod