grwa phyi phun rab pa tshe ring dpal ldan la tha'i ji'i go gnas dang/las bya sho drug gnyis bcas bap+sako gzhag gis sa mtshams skor sogs gal tshe'i rigs bka' shag la dgongs skor zhu dgos pa las/de byings khral bsdus khrims 'doms tshang ma nyag spyi ngo las nas byed pa dang/sa srung 'go dmag zur du yod/nyag spyi dza sag hor khang pa'i rjes su spyi khyab zur dum dgos par sa srung mda' dpon nas gcig lcogs byed lam yod pa bcas yin}
nyang gi khri bzang yang ston|{srong btsan sgam po'i skabs kyi blon chen bzhi'i nang gi gcig yin cing/bod kyi blon po mdzangs pa'i mi bdun gyi nang gses lnga pa yin/skyes yul lha sa'i nye 'dabs nyang ser (nyang bran )nas yid pa dang ri khyim rnams klung thang du spos nas grong khyer du bsgyur ba'i thabs shes gsar pa bton pa des zhing 'brog gi thon rdzas brje 'tshong dang gong 'phel 'gro rgyur nus pa chen po thon yod}
nyang gi nyi ma 'od zer|{gsang sngags rnying ma'i bla ma dang/gter ston nyang nyi ma 'od zer ni/rab byung gnyis pa'i me 'brug (1136)lor lho rag gtam shul du 'khrungs/de rjes sku nar son rjes lho brag kho mthang rnam snang gi sku rgyab nas/gter sgrom smug po dang/skya bo gnyis/sgrom smug nang nas bka' brgyad 'dus pa'i brgyud lung chos tshan sum cu pod bcu drug sogs gter nas ston tshul gsal/slob ma zhig po bdud rtsi smyos zhig tshan po sogs byung mthar dgung lo drug cu re brgyad bzhes pa'i shing pho byi lo (1204)tsam la 'das/gong gsal dpyad gzhi 'di ni tA la'i bla ma lnga pa'i rnam thar du ku la'i gos bzang glegs bam gsum pa'i 'phros glegs bam bzhi pa'i shog grangs 92nas 94bar gsal/nyan nyi ma 'od zer la nam rgyun mnga' bdag nyang zhes 'bod/mkhyen brtse'i gnas yig nang lho brag shar du mnga' bdag nyang gi gdan sa smra'o lcog ces dang de sngon lho brag khul du rdzong gzhis bzhi yod cing de ni do bo rdzong/lha khang rdzong/seng ge rdzong/dar ma gzhi sdod bcas bzhi yod}
