nyang chu skya mo|{nyang stod gnod sbyin gang zag gi ri nas 'bab cing rgyal rtse brgyud dbus kyi skyid smad chu shul bar 'bab pa'i gtsang gi chu 'di la nyang tshula'am myang chu zer}
nyang stod|{myang chu'i stod khul te rgyal rtse nas gzhis rtse'i bar myang chu 'bab tshul gyi sa khul}
nyang stod kyi glang lung dgon pa|{nyang stod rgyal rtse khul gyi bka' gdams gyi dgon pa zhig }
nyang stod 'brong dkar rtse|{gtsang khul nyang stod 'brong rtse zer ba de yin}
nyang stod shar kha|{rgyal rtse sde srid rim byung la zer/rgyal rtse sde srid rim byung gi lo rgyus mdor bsdus tsam ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas mdzad pa'i (deb ther dpyid kyi rgyal mo'i glu dbyings )nang gsal zhing/rgyal pa ni bo don phyogs las rnam rgyal gyis mdzad pa'i (rgyal rtse chos rgyal rab brtan kun bzang 'phags kyi rnam thar dad pa'i lo ga rgyas byed dngos grub kyi char 'bebs )ces pa'i nang gsal}
nyang gnon rtog zhib|{mngon chung sgo nas zhib 'jug byed pa}
nyang bran grong smad pa|{nyang bran grong smad pa ni sngon dus nyang bran khul gyi sger gzhis che ba zhig yid pa de'i zhal ngo ja sang sde pa 'phrin las rgya mtshos dga' ldan pho brang pa'i las sde bzung ta gtsang pa rgyal po dang 'thab rtsod byed pa'i nam byas rjes gzengs thon byung/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me bya (1657)lor sde srid bsod nams rab brtan sku gshegs rjes lcags byi (1660)lo ja'i sang sde pa 'phrin las rgya mtshos sde srid kyi 'gan lo brgyad bzhes nas 'das/sa lug (1679)lo ja'i sang sde pa 'phrin las rgya mtsho'i cha bo sangs rgyas rgya mtshos sde srid gnang/gong gsal sde srid gnyis kyi khyim tshang dang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa thugs 'dris che stabs tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga grong smad du yang yang phebs pa'i lo rgyus yod/grong smad gzhis ka nas nub ngos ri 'dabs sur ma rtse zhes pa'i byang ro zhig gi mthar skor du star kha dang/kham bu'i sdom po 'ga' zhig yod sa der grong smad kyi spro khang yod pa dang/sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho de gar 'khrungs pa yin zer/bod rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu lug (1703)lo sde srid kyi 'khan bzhes mkhan ngag dbang rin chen yang grong smad kyi mi rgyud yin 'dug shing bya (1705)lo nas bzang khang gis srid dbang bzung rjes grong smad gzhis ka gzhung bzhes kyis rgyu dngos phar cher se ra'i grwa par bgos pa sogs byas shing/de rjes grong smad gzhis ma lag dang bcas pa'i bdag po thab se ra skyi sor sprad de se ra spyi so gnyis grong smad gzhis kar gtan sdod byas thog /gzhis ka'i mtha' bskor du chags pa'i grong khyim la spyi so bskos pa zhes 'bod/se ra skyi sos grong smad kyi thon 'bab nas le re se ra'i grwa dmangs la 'bru phogs rgyag dgos kyi yod}
nyang bran chu bzang|{se ra'i nub tu yod pa'i nyang bran chu bzang (chu bzang bsam gtan gling yang zer )ni dus rabs bcu bdun pa'i nang grong smad pa ja'i sang p+sade pa 'phrin las rgya mtshos (sde srid 'phrin las rgya mtsho ) tA la'i bla ma lnga par grong smad pa'i 'dzin khongs su ri khrod cig 'debs rgyu'i sa brtag zhus 'don bzhin gnas der tA la'i bla ma snga pa ngo phebs kyis chu bzang ri khrod 'debs sa'i zhal bkod dang chu bzang zhes pa'i ming/rten gtso thub dbang gi rdo sku sogs gnang/skabs der grwa grangs 18yod pa dang dgon bdag se ra spyi so yin/chung bzang gi nor ngos su pha bong kha'i ri khrid yod}
nyang bran ljags smin chu 'khor|{nyang bran lung tsho'i khongs su ljags smin chu 'khor zhes khyim tshang zhig yod pa des de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung sbas tA la'i bla ma'i ljags smin gsol zhib 'thag las byed dgos shing yim tshang der lo ltar zla re'i bod tshes 15dang 30bcas la 'char can rtse gsol thab pa ser skya gnyis nas 'gan 'khur gyis tA la'i bla ma sku 'khor rnams kyi gsol zhib dang/gzim chung gi ma chod pa dang/tshogs tsam sogs phal cher rtsam khal drug bdun skor 'thag las byed dgos kyi yod stabs khyim tshang der ljags smin chu 'khor zhes ming thogs}
nyang sbas gnon gsum|{myang tseng gu dang/dba' dbyi tshab/gnon 'gron po gsum la zer/de yang zing po rje stag skya bo'i bran myang rtseng gu/dbas to re phru gu re sron/de'i bu dbas dbyi tshab/de'i zhang po gnon to re sron/de'i bu gnon bang sum 'gron po bcas kyis zing po rje dang kha bral te stag ri gnyan gzigs la mgo btags zhus te 'bangs su tshud pa yin la/rjes su gnam ri nga btsan la rogs ras zhus te zing po rje gtor/de'i bya dgar khong gsum la bran khyim mang po gnang ste blon por bcug pa sogs zhib par (tun hong gi yig char )gsal}
nyang smad rgyan gong|{gtsang bkra shis lhun po'i nye skor zha lu dgon pa'i 'og la yod pa'i dgon pa zhig gi ming/deng sang med do/_}
nyang smad nyi ma'i ri bo'i spo|{nyang smad nyi ma gdong zhes pa gzhis ka rtse'i rdzong la bsam grub rtse zhes ming ma btags gong gi ming yin}
nyang tsing gu|{sngar 'phan po na yod pa'i zing po rje stag sku bo'i bran yin pa la rjes su rgyal po stag ri gnyan gzigs la mgo btags zhus shing rgyal po gnam ri srong btsan kyi dus zing po rjes gtor rjes blon po byas pa sogs kyi lo rgyus cung zad zhib tsam (tun hong gi yig cha )deb dang po las gsal}
nyang zhib na mar bgyis|{mngon chung gi thog nas lta rtog zhib 'jug byas pa}
nyang yul rnam gsum|{'di kong po ba la brgal nas zho kha yan gyi lung pa der nyan po zer zhing/lung pa de'i rgyud kyi chu la nyang chu zer}
nyang ral nyi ma 'od zer|{rje 'di nyid yab nyan ston chos kyi 'khor lo dang yum pad+ma bde ba rtsal gnyis kyis sras su rab byung gnyis pa'i shing 'brug (1124)lor lho brag gtam shul gyi bye brag 'dzed sa ser dgon zhes par sku 'khrungs/sku chung ngu'i dus rnal 'byor gyi spyod pa sna tshogs mdzad pas kun gyis m+sabyon par 'dzin zhes grags yab kyi sa nas rta mgrin sogs kyi dbang gsan te 'dzed phu gangs rar bsgrubs pas lha'i zhal gzigs pa dang/gter gyi kha byang mang po gnang bas kho mthing dang/bsam yas/gnam skas can gyi srin bya brag /dben gnas bri ri lha khang sogs nas gter kha mang po spyan drangs/slob dpon pad+ma'i rnam thar zangs gling mar grags pa le'u zhe gcig can khams gsum zangs khang gling du gter la sbas pa bton/'di jo mo mkhar chen bza' ye shes mtsho rgyal gyis yi ger btab pa yin/yar nyang ston chen po dang/rgya smyon pa don ldan/zhig po nyi ma seng ge /ngal ka ba can pa/ston pa kha che sogs bla ma mang dub sten nas sngags dang mtshan nyid kyi gnas pa rgya cher mdzad/mu tig shel gyi spa gong sogs su sgrub pa la nan tan mdzad pas grub pa'i rtags mtshan du ma byung/jo 'bum ma khab tu bzhes par sras nam mkha' 'od zer dang/nam mkha' dpal ba gnyis 'khrungs/sku tshe hril por sgom sgrub dang 'chad spel mdzad cing/rdzu 'phrul mtha' yas pa bstan par grags pa sogs kyis grub mtha' rim med kyis tshan mar 'dzin/rnying ma'i gter ston brgya rtsa'i nang nas rje 'di nyid la gter ston gong ma dang/gu ru chos dbang la gter ston 'og ma zhes grags snyan shin tu che/(chos 'byung me tog rnying po sbrang rtsi'i bcud) ces pa'i de'i 'di nyid kyis brtsams par grags/mtha' dgung grangs drug cu re dgu pa rab byung gsum pa'i chu byi (1192)lor ngo mtshar ba'i ltas mtshan du ma dang bcas sku'i bkod pa bsdus/chags lo tsA bas gdung zhus pas me spar ma nus/slar zhugs rang 'bar du gyur te rten ring bsle khyad par can mang du byon zhes grags/slob ma'i gtso bo ni/sras 'gro mgon nam mkha' dpal ba yin cing/khong la smin grol yongs rdzogs kyi bka' babs gtad de bstan pa'i bdag por gyur/'di nyid skyis lha sa skyid chu'i 'gram du jo bo'i chu rags mdzad pa dang/bal ris kyi thang ga thog tshad ma brgya dang brgyad kyang bzhengs/gu ru chos kyi dbang phyug sogs slob ma mang du bskyangs pa bcas so/_}
