nyams rtogs tshad ma|{nyams rtogs tshad ldan/nyams rtogs rnam dag /nyams rtogs khung dag ste/thar 'dod kyi skyes bu'i 'dod don la mi bslu ba'i nyams thogs der nyams rtogs tshad mar 'jog pa yin}
nyams ldan gyi rgyan brgyad|{snyan ngag gi don rgyan sum cu so lnga'i nang gses bco brgyad pa nyams ldan gyi rgyan ni nang gi bsam pa'i 'gyur ba la brten nas phyi rol lus kyi rnam 'gyur sgeg pa la sogs pa'i nyams dang ldan pa ston pa'i rgyan zhig ste/de'i nang gses rnam grangs brgyad ni/1 sgeg pa'i nyams dang/2 drag shul gyi nyams/3 dpa' ba'i nyams/4 bzhad gad kyi nyams/5 mi sdum pa'i nyams/6 bzhad gad kyi nyams/7 rmad byung gi nyams/8 'jigs rung gi nyams bcas so/_}
nyams snang sbugs pa'i mngon shes|{rtsa dang nga gi nyams snang sbugs nas de mngon shes yin khul yis pa'i don la go}
