snye thang sgrol ma lha khang|{snye thang sgrol ma lha khang ni grong khyer lha sa'i lho nub phyogs kyi cha shul rdzong gi khongs su gnas shing/rab byung dang po'i shing lugs (1055)lor jo bo rje'i dngos slob ka ba shAkya dbang phyug gis gtsos jo bo'i slob ma rnams kyis thun mong du btab/snye thang zhes pa'i ming yang de sngon snye'i na mo che zhes sa snye bri srol 'dug kyang (mi dbang rtogs brjod )nang gsal bar/jo bo a ti sha zhabs sor bskyod de gshegs pa las/yul gyi dge mtshan gyis thugs 'phrog nas mnyes pa'i gsung gis dbugs dbyung ba'i yul mnyes thang du grags zhes gsal ba ltar na nyis thang du yang 'bod srol byung 'dug /ngo bo yar lung du dge bshes khu ston brtson 'grub g.yung drung gis spyan drangs pa'i dus ston pa'i thugs dgongs la/dge bshes khu yang thugs rgyal che bas ngo bo'i zhabs tog che ba mi 'ong dgongs nas yar lung du jo bo spyan 'dren par byon/ngo bo dang mjal bas yun zla ba gcig las ma song yang de'i ring ha cang sku mnyel po byung/der jo bo'i zhal nas/u pa si ka chen po/nga rang dang po gang nas 'ong ba'i sar skyol/bka' 'khor 'di kun yang 'o rgyal/rta khal 'di kun kyang ma rgan yin/khu ston ni 'khor los bsgyur ba'i rgyal po lta bu/kho bo ni dmangs phal pa lta bu/khu ston su cu rtsa gsum gyi longs spyod dang ldan pa lta bu/kho bo ni pre ta pu ra'i grong khyer na gnas pa lta bu gsungs nas spyan chab byon pas ston pa yang spyan chab byon te/bdag gis jo bo'i bzhugs gnas snye thang du 'bod pa/dbyar bsil ba/dgun dro ba/nags tshal dang ne'u sing yod pa dgung yang me tog skye ba zhig btsal yod zhus pas de la dgyes nas u pa si ka chen po da ltar rang gshegs gsungs/yar par dbyar gcig bzhugs/de'i dus bang ston (snye thang gi mi chen )gyis spyan 'dren la byung nas mnyes thang du byon/bod khams gsum gling dgu'i mi thabs dang der tshogs nas ngo bo la chos mang du zhus/dogs pa yod pa'i dkar gdan mang po dri ba zhus par jo bos lan gnang/nang gcig jo bo'i zhal nas u pa si ka khyod na re/dgung yang me tog yod zer ba me tog ga re gsungs pas/dge bshes ston pas snye'i na mo cha'i khar jo bo gdan drangs nas gsing ma'i me tog bstan pas ngo bos zhal nas rdzun ma byas tsam 'dug gsungs nas mnyes/jo bo mnyes thang du lo dgu bzhugs/dgung lo bdun cu don gnyis la gnas der rab byung dang po'i shing rtag (1054)lo'i ston zla 'bring po'i tshes 18la gshegs so/_/de rjes ka ba shAkya dbang phyug gis 'or du yang mchod rten brgya pa dang/shAkya thub pa gtso 'khor/sman bla sogs lugs sku mang du bzhengs nas bzhugs/jo bo'i gdan sa lha khang bre tsam zha zhig bzhengs dgongs/mnyes thang 'or gyi gtsug lag khang (sgrol ma lha khang )ni jo bo mnyes thang du bzhugs ring gi bzhugs gnas yin par nges/deng skabs sgrol ma khang gi shar ngos su yod pa'i grong tshor 'or zer ba dang snye'i na mo che ni gzhung lam gyi lho ngos su yod cing/de gar yang jo bo'i gzim khang zhes pa'i lha khang chu chung zhig dang/sku 'bum zhes pa sa 'bum chen po gnyis yod pa nas lho ngos de bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyi gdung rten dang/byang ngos de jo bo rje'i gdung rten yin par grags/sgrol ma lha khang gi rten gtso/jo bo'i thugs dam na thung bstan sgrol ma zer ba de bzhugs/sgrol ma des jo bo bod du byon bstan 'grol phan par 'dug ste sku tshe lo nyi shu thung du 'gro zhes lung bstan par grags/gzhan yang jo bo'i thugs dam rten thub dbang gi sku brnyan shar li las grub pa gcig /jo bo rje'i thugs dam rten 'bral med mchod rten gcig /jo bo'i sku gcig /paN chen na ro pa'i gdung rus bzhugs pa'i bka' gdams mchod rten gcig /li ma'i thub dbang sku mi tshad ma gcig /bka' gdams mchod rten che ba gsum/lha khang shar nang/jo bo chos gsung sa'i bye ma'i bzhugs khri dang/tshe dpag med dang nye ba'i sras chen brgyad/khro bo gnyis/phyis pho lha ba bsod nams stobs rgyas skabs bzhengs pa'i gser zangs kyi sgrol ma nyer gcig bcas bzhugs}
snye thang jo bo'i gdung rten|{jo bo'i sku gdung rin po che ni de sngon snye thang sgrol ma lha khang gi grong dkyil du bzhugs/lha btsun byang chub 'od kyi dus skabs su bod 'dir rgyal bstan dar rgyas yong ched khu bo ye shes yod kyi zhal chems ltar nag tsho lo tsA ba tshul khrims rgyal ba sogs la gser mang po'i rten dang bcas rgya gar nas jo bo rje gdan 'dren du btang ba bzhin yod rab byung dang po'i lcags 'brug (1040)lor mnyam med jo bo chen po gdangs can ljongs kyi thog mar mnga' ris su 'khod de lo gsum ring bzhugs thog mdo gas kyi chos thams cad kyi gzhi rtsa/byang chub lam gyi sgron ma zhes gdams pa'i chu bo gsum 'dres kyi man ngag /skyes bu gsum gyi lam gyi rim pa'i rtsa ba de nyid 'chad spel mdzad rjes/dgus kyi 'brong ston pa chen pos jo bo dbus su gdan drangs pa ltar snye thang/lha sa/yer pa/'phan po/yar lung/bsam yas sogs su zhabs bcags shing/bzhugs gnas gtso bo snye thang du mdzad de lo dgu tsam bzhugs/skal ldan 'dul bya mchog dman yongs las so so'i skal ba dang 'tshams pa'i thabs cad pa'i chos kyi man ngag gis rim pa'i chos kyi 'khor lo skor ba sogs mdzad zin rjes dgung lo bdun cu don gsum skabs snye thang du sku gshegs/dngos slob 'brom ston rgyal ba'i 'byung gnas nas byang rwa sgreng dgon du sku gdung rin po che gdan drangs te bzhugs 'bul mdzad rjes phur thal ring bsrel rnams bzhugs pa'i gdung rin po che bzhengs nas rwa sgreng gtsug lag khang gi rten gtsor bzhugs su gsol nas bzhugs mus dang sku gdung gi cha shas khag gcig snye thang du mchod rten bzhengs pa der bzhugs yod kyang/rig gnas gsar brje'i snga rjes sug tor bshig thebs nas deng slar gsar bzhengs byas yod}
snye mdo kun dga' bzang po|{rje 'di nyid yab bsod nams dpal (mtshan gzhan snye mdo thams cad mkhyen par grags )pa'i sras su rab byung bzhi pa'i sa rta (1258)lor snye mthor sku ba bltams/dgung lo bzhi na klog yig phul du phyin/dgung lo bcu gcig pa'i bar du yab las rnying ma'i rgyud sgrub thabs mang du gsan zhing/mkhyen pas gzhan la gsungs shing phyag len slob ma'i slob dpon mdzad/bcug nyis pa la phyogs ris kyi bu slob bsdus shing/chos kyi khri brtsigs/yab kyis phyag dpe thams cad gtad/mdo sngags lung rigs mang du gsungs/bcu gsum pa la dpal gsal ba 'dus pa'i rgyud gsungs/bcu bzhi pa dang bco lnga pa la sku mtshams bsdams nas sgrub pa mdzad/shangs pa tshul she dang lhan du gsang snying gi chos bka' shin tu mang dang zhi byed snga phyi bar gsum gsan/dgung lo bcu drug pa la ri ba'i skup+sakaye yin par nges pa rnyed/spyil dkar ba dang chos mang po phan tshun gsan bzhes mdzad/bcu bdun pa la 'bri gung du byon pa'i lam du 'tshal la gser khang pa dang mjal zhing chos mang du zhus/'bri gung du rab byung mdzad/me glang (1277)lor nya mdor grub thob seng ge grags dang mjal/gdams pa yang gnang/chu lug (1283)lor g.yam bzang dad 'dod mkhar du grub chen pa la dus 'khor rgyud 'grel tshar re gsan/dgung lo so drug pa chup+saparul (1293)lor bcom ldan rig ral la sha ra ba'i gzhung sogs zhus/sa khyim (1298)lor lo tsA ba grags pa rgyal mtshan las dgyes rdor/nA ro 'grel chen/dbang mdor bstan gyi 'grel pa/man ngag snye ma/ka lA pa sogs 'phags bod yi sgra rig mang dug san/mkhas pa'i go 'phang brnyed/phyis mi g.yo ba'i rgyud dang bya ba btus pa gsan/de ltar gzhung zab mo la gnas bsam rgya che zhing mkhyen pa'i klong rdol/sku tshe gang por rnam dkar yi bya ba 'ba' zhig la 'bad mthar dgung grangs nga dgu la phebs pa rab byung lnga pa'i me 'brug (1316)lor chos sku zhi bar chen po'i dbyings su gshegs so/_}
snye mdo thams cad mkhyen pa|{snye mdo smra ba'i seng ge la sras gsum byung ba'i dang po snye mdo thams cad mkhyen pa ni rab byung bzhi pa'i me byi (1216)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun la phebs skabs klog brda bstan pa tsam gyis mkhyen/gnyags ston rnal 'byor 'bum la rig pa klog la sogs pa'i gra'i bstan bcos rnams kyang bslabs/yi ge bshar ma zhag bdun gyis 'jam 'drong thub/phyis ni gya gar nag u rgyan la sogs pa'i yi ge ris lder la sogs pa'i bzo thams cad mkhyen/dgung lo brgyad pa la bka' brgyud kyi lag len gzhung 'drongs/dgung lo bcu pa la yab dang lhan cig tu yi dam gyi bsnyen pa bskyal bas nyin mtshan 'das pa mi tshor ba'i ting nge 'dzin 'khrungs/de ltar yon tan du ma skye bas thob pa bzhin du gyur pa'i rig ldan des spyir bla ma bcu drug lhag tsam bsten pa las mtha' yas lung gi snang ba rgya thams cad mkhyen pa las rnyed/phyi nang dkyil 'khor gyi bya ba 'dzi ri ba las rnyed/dpe rgyud dag pa'i nag chags ldum ra ba las rnyed/gzhan don 'phrin las kyi tshul 'bri khung pa las rnyed/gdams pa gnad kyi mtshang bang rim pa las snyed/lta gdongs don gyi tshul rigs bdag nyid la rnyed ces bya ste/lan re gzigs pa dang gsan pa tsam gyis thugs su chad pas thams cad mkhyen par grags/mtshan dngos la bsod nams dpal zhes zhu/'dis gsar rnying gi rgyud sde dang rig pa'i gnas du ma la bstan bcos kyang mang du mdzad/khyad par du mkhas pa tre bo mgon po'i gsung rnams ldum ra ba las da pas tre bo'i lugs la shin tu mkhas/sgrub pas gsang sngags kyi dngos grub kyang mang du lon/mthar dgu ngalo drug cu rtsa gnyis pa rab byung lnga pa'i me glang (1277)lor sku gshegs}
