gter chen kun skyong gling pa|{rje 'di nyid rab byung bdun pa'i me byi (1396)lor shangs lha phu bi rdzing zhes pa'i yul du yab dpal bo rgyal mtshan mgon dang/yum bde mchog dpal mo'i sras su 'khrungs/sku gzhon nu'i dus nas skye ba mang po thugs dran gsos shing/skyes stobs kyi shes rab che ba zhig byung/dgung lo bcu bzhi tsam nas gter gyi kha byang phyag tu son pas/de nas rim par zag gter sna tshogs pa bzhes shing/dgung lo ter gcig pa la rdo rje legs par bskul te bsam yas mchod rten dkar po'i gter kha bzhes pas/de nas chos gter dpag med dang/gter gyi kha byang/bram ze'i sku sha/de bzhin gshegs pa'i rim bsrel la sogs pa'i byin rlabs rten mang po dang/bod phung 'tshengs nub pa'i drag sngags mang po yang thon/phyogs mtha' kun tu dpa' bor gter ni zhes grags shing/'gro don dang 'phrin lan rgya cher byung/slob ma yang sku sras lnga dang rgyal tshab dam pa gnyis sos mkhas pa 'ga' byon/kun mkhyen ba lu me tog pa dang zha lu mkhyen rab chos rje sogs phyogs mtha'i gang zag khyad par can mang po dang/dbus gtsang dwangs kong khams sogs nas dad 'dus sna tshogs dang/khyad par du khrus gad lo tsA ba bsod nams rgya mtsho'i sde dang/mdo sngags rigs gnas kun la mkhas pa 'gos lo gzhon du dpal/rdza yig pa kun mkhyen tshul khrims rgyal mtshan sogs skyes chen rnams kyis zhabs la gtugs shing bsnyen bkur phul/skyes ched de dag la sogs pa'i skal ba dang ldan pa'i gang zag rnams la gter chos kyi gdams pa rgya cher spel bar mdzad/rin spungs pa dang sne gdong gong ma chen po sogs dang yon mchod 'brel/yar rgyab dpon po thag chod sgom pos grwa byams pa gling du mchod rten bzhengs pa'i dus su yang gdan drangs/sku tshe rim la por 'gro don gyi 'phrin las rgya cher mdzad nas/dgung lo brgyad bcu gya gnyis bzhes pa ram byung brgyad pa'i me bya (1477)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su gshegs}
