gter chen chos kyi rgyal po|{(gter bdag gling pa 'gyur med rdo rje )bod kyi rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me khyi (1646)lo nas rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing rta (1714)lo bar dgung lo re dgu bzhugs/dgung lo nyer lnga pa bod kyi bar byung bcu gcig pa'i ljags khyi (1670)lor smin grol gling gi dgon pa'i rmang gzhi bting shing/dgung lo so gcig pa mi 'brug (1676)lor smin grol gling gi gtsug lag gang gsar du bzhengs/khong ni bod kyi mdo gas gnyis kyi chos skor dang rig gnas lnga la mkhas pa'i phul du phyin pa zhig yin la khong gis gsar du gter bzhes nas dar spel gnang ba'i mkha' gro ma gsang ba ye shes kyi chos skor la gter gsar zhes zer/khong gi lo rgyus rnam thar rgyas pa (rang nyid kyi rtogs pa brjod pa 'di snang 'khrul pa'i brdzun ris )zhes pa'i rang rnam bris ma zhig yod cing/rnam thar lo rgyus cung zad bsdus pa kong sprul yon tan rgya mtshos phyogs bsgrigs mdzad pa'i (rin chen gter mdzod )pod dang po'i nang (gter ston brgya rtsa'i rnam thar )zhes pa zhig yod pa der gsal}
gter chen rig 'dzin rgod ldem|{rnying pa'i gter chen 'di nyin yab slob dpon srid 'dul dpal dang yum jo lcam bsodanams khye 'dren gyis gnyis kyi sras su rab byung lnga pa'i shing glang (1325)lo'i bod zla dang po'i tshes bcu nyin 'khrungs/mtshan dngos grub rgyal mtshan zhes gsol/sku gzhon nu la yab gshegs pas yum gyis yige 'bri klog sogs bslabs/dgung lo brgyad pa la pha chos sgyu 'phrul dang ma rmo sogs mkhas par mkhyen/de nas mkhas pa snang ldan rgyal po las gu ru chos dbang gi chos bka' rnams gsan/myang ma las myang ral gyi gter chos rnams gsan/sgrub pa sgrub rtags rnams tshad du long/dgung lo nyer bzhi pa la grod kyi ldem 'phru lnga 'khrungs/brag lung pa mkhas btsan rin chen dpal bas las rdzogs chen po'i chos rnams gsan/mnyam bzhag kho nar thugs rtse gcig tu bzhugs/de nas grom pa rgyang gi lha khang dang rgyang gi 'um bu lung gnyis nas rta mgrin dbang phyug gi sgrub thabs dang/mgon po byams pa'i sgrub thabs/'phags pa spyan ras gzigs kyi sgrub thabs/phyag na rdo rje'i sgrub thabs sogs shog dril lnga bcu rtsa lnga gter nas bzhes shing/gzhan yang zang zang lha brag nas bla ma yi dam Dak+ki'i grub thabs dang kun tu bzang po dgongs pa zang thal gyi thog drangs pa'i gang zag gcig la dgos pa'i chos tshan tshang ma dang/phur pa/shog dril/dbu sgra sogs byin can gyi rdzas khyad par can mang po gter nas bzhes/de nas ri bo bkra bzang du phebs nas rab gyi gi cha byad mdzad de gnas chen der dgon pa btab/o rgyan gu ru chen po pad+ma 'byung gnas kyi sku brnyes chen po zhig bzhengs/gang nyid rdo rje phur pa'i sgrub par thugs rtse gcig tu gzhol/gter chen gyi snyan grags dbus gtsang mdo khams dang bcas pa'i yul gru kun la khyab pas chos dbang zhu bar yong ba'i gdung bya bkrang gis mi langs par 'gro don rgya chen mdzad/de nas 'bras mo gshongs su byon nas lo bcug nyis ring bstan pa dang 'gro ba'i don chen bsam gyis mi khyab pa mdzad/sku tshe'i smad du gnang sngags bla med kyi khrid dbang kho na gtso bor mdzad/lo rer rdzogs chen gyi khred re ma chags par mdzad nas gang zag mang po smin grol gyi lam du bkod/gang nyid ni rig 'dzin bzhi slob lam nas mi slob pa'i rab gyi sa'i rig 'dzin gyi dbang brnyes pa zhig yin pas/rig 'dzin rgod kyi ldem 'phru can zhes yongs su grags/mthar rab byung bdun pa'i chu rta (1402)lor sku lus ma bor bar pad+ma 'od kyi zhal yas su gshegs nas gu ru'i thugs kar thim par grags so/_/(bod rgya tshig mdzod chen mo'i )nang rje 'di nyid rang byung drug pa'i me glang (1327)loragatsang ngam ring sku 'khrungs shing/rab byung bdun pa'i sa byi (1408)lor gshigs par gsungs pas dpyad par zhu}
gter chen sangs rgyas gling pa|{snying ba'i gter chen 'di ni yab rnal 'byor pa stag lung smyon pa zhes pa dang yum a hUM rgyanazhes pa'i sras su rab byung drugapa'i ljags 'brug (1340)lor brag gsum rdo rje brag tu sku 'khrungs yab kyis mtshan rig 'dzin du gsol/dung lo lnga pa la mkhan po gzhon nu dpal la dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa zhus/mtshan dkon mchog rin chen du gsol/slob dpon rin chen bya ba la las 'bri klog bslabs pas tshegs med du mkhyen/yab 'das rjes tsa ris byon nas dgon pa lhun grub steng du mkhan slob de gnyis las chos mang du zhus/de nas nyan phor byon te 'bri gung sngon sogs bla ma mang po dang mjal zhing chos bka' rgya cher gsan/lha ris kyang shin tu mkhas par mkhyen/rdzong dkar du lo gsum sgrub pa'i dam bca' mdzad/dgung lo nyer lnga la phebs pa shing 'brug (1364)lor spu ri phug mo che nas bla ma dgongs pa 'dus pa dang thugs rje chen po'i skor rnams gdan drangs/bla ma chos kyi blo gros lag ter rdzas rnams gzigs su phul bas shin tu dgyes nas gter ston rin po che zhes mtshan gsol zhing gter chos rnams gsan te thugs nyams su bzhes/lo de nas bzung dkar zug 'phrang dang/dgyes bo rong/lang po ka mda' 'phrang/kong po mchims yul/spu ri rin chen 'bar ba/tsa ri/rgya la gshin rje'i rba dong/bsam yas mchims phu sogs nas gte kha chen po bco brgyad bzhes shing/gzhan phran lags kya gter ni grongs kyis mi chod pa bzhes/chos bdag slob bu'i grangs kyang gdongs 'dus kho na la'ang gtso bor bka' babs brgyad pa'i chu bo chen po nyi shu yod par grags shing/gter chon gzhan dang gzhan gyi chos bdag sogs rtsis las 'das par bzhugs/kun gyi gtso bo ni rgyal ba'i dbang po nag con pan 'dzin pa karma rol pa'i rdo rje dang/de bzhin du zhwa dmar ba mkha' bskyod dbang po/sne gdong gong ma chen po/sa skya bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan/g.yag sde paN chen/jo ston mkhan chen bsodanams bzang po/'bri gung chos kyi rgyal po sogs bla chen mi chen grangs las 'das/gzhan yang bya khung pa dpal ldan seng ge sogs chos brgyud 'dzin pa'i slob tshogs kyang mang du byon zhing bstan pa bod khams yongs la khyab par gyur/snying phul bde chen bsam grub dgon btabs nas gdan sa'i mthil mdzad/skabs shig bdud rtsi ma sna gyi sgrub pa mdzad pa de la sangs rgyas gling pa'i sman nag tu grags/bstan pa dang sems can gyi don dpag tu med par mdzad nas sku dngos gyis dgu la bar 'os pa rnams legs par btul te/mthar dgung lo lnga bcu nga bdun ba par byung bdun pa'i me byi (1396)lor dgon pa lhun grub steng du dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
gter ston gling pa dgu|{1 dbus su sangs rgyas gling dang/2 shar du rdo rje gling/3 lhor rat+na gling/4 nub tu pad+ma gling/5 byang chub karma gling/6 shar lhor o rgyan gling/7 de bzhin bsam gtan gling/8 zhig po gling/9 kun skyong gling zhes pa rin chen gter snying gling bcas la zer}
gter ston nyi ma grags pa|{gter ston chen po 'di nyin mdo khams zab mo sgang gi sa'i cha lung pa ban du rgu ya grong zhes bya bar yab karma rnam rgyal dang yum bsod nams mtsho gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me phag (1647)lor sku bltams/sku na phra ba'i dus nas dad pa dang nga rjes thugs rgud legs par gtams shing/spyi btang phyis pa phal ba'i ngang tshul dang yongs su mi mthun par yi ge 'bri klog gi sku yon sgron ma tsam gyis tshegs med mkhyen te skye stobs kyi shes rab lhag par che/grub thob rdzogs chen pad ma rig 'dzin las yongs rdzogs dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/rgyal dbang lnga pa chen po sogs grub mtha' ris med kyi mkhas grum mang por bsten nas mdo rgyud bka' gter rnams kyi gdongs 'grel man ngag nyams khrid dang/tha snyad rig pa'i gnas thams cad la thos bsam rgya cher gnang zhing/'chad rtsom gyi mdzad 'phrin spel/chags ri nyi grags dgon nam sring rdzong 'od gsal sgrub sde phyag btab cing 'dzin skyong mdzad/mdo smad khul stag mo dgon sogs dgon sde mang po gsar bzhengs thog /gtsug lag khang khag dang dgon pa gzhan rnams nyams gso dang sku gsung thugs rten bzhengs/bya btang mdzad nas lum 2bI'i tshal sogs ston pa'i mdzad chen rnams kyis gtsos 'phags yul dang/bal bod kyi gnas chen khag slob dpon rin po che dang rje btsan mi la'i sgrub gnas sogs gangs can ljongs kyi dgon pa dang gnas chen phal che bar zhabs kyis bcags /gter lung dang rtse mthun zab gter mang dub zhes pa sogs bstan 'gro'i don rgya cher mdzad/mthar rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags stag (1710)lor dgongs pa zhi dbyings su gshegs}
gter ston rdo rje gling pa|{rnying ma'i gter ston 'di nyid yab bsod nams rgyal mtshan dang yum dkar mo rgyan gnyis kyi sras su rab byung drug pa'i me khyi (1346)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu gsum pa la khra 'brug jo mo'i sku rgyab nas kha byang phyag tu byung/de nas grwa phyi'i brag po che'i gnam lcags 'bar ba'i gras ces pa nas shog dril che chung brgya/bla dpe pu sti bzhi/che chu bum pa bzhi/rdzogs chen lta ba klong yangs sogs chos tshan bsam gyis mi khyab pa gdan drangs te/khrom gter mdzad pas kun yid chen shing dad pa'i sa la bkod/snga rjes su gter kha chen po bzhi bcu lhag bzhes shing khrong gter mang po mdzad/gter chos kyi rnam grangs kyang bla ba bde gshegs 'dus sogs 'dus pa skor bzhi/snying tig bcu gsum/sku rten du'ang le dkar las grub pa'i rdo rje sems dpa'i sku dang/rta phag gi sku/tshe bum sogs dang/dam rdzas skye bdun gyi rigs sogs dpag tu med pa spyan drangs/gdan sa'i mthil gling mo khar mdzad/gzhan yang lho brag mon spa gro/bzad kyi 'og skad dgo pa sogs bzung nas 'gro don rgya cher mdzad/de nas kong por phebs te shes rab me 'bar dang mjal/des shog ser spyan sngar phul ba'i don rnams bkros bas ngo mtshar bsam gyis mi khyab pa'i gnas la bkod/gter ston 'di'i sa'i gter rgyud du'ang rdo rje gling pa nges par gdan 'dren par snang/sras dang slob rgyud phal cher lho brag dang/mon gyi phyogs na bzhugs/mthar dgung lo drug cu la phebs pa ram byung bdun pa'i shing bya (1405)lor lho brag chus khyer b+hany+tsa lha khang du dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
gter ston zhig po gling pa|{gter ston 'di nyid dbu ru jo shAka rnam gnyis bzhugs pa'i yul dang nye ba stod lung rtse zhes par yab nam mkha' dbang chen phun tshogs dang yum tshe dbang bstan ma'i sras su rab byung dgu pa'i shing sprel (1524)lor sku bltams/dgung lo lnga pa la rje sman chu ba nam mkha' rin chen pa'i drung du dbu skra gcod pa dang lus sgyur zhus pas sngags sdum byin nas mtshan nam mkha' tshe dbang rgyal por gsol/dgung lo nyer gcig gi dus gter sgrub mdzad pas rma lam du byung ba zin bris btab nas lo der gsang phug nas tshe sgrub rgyal ba 'dus pa'i skor dang/dam rdzas skye bdun/che chu sogs mang du bzhes/de nas zangs yag brag zur mkhar rdo rje'i mchod rten/dbu ru zhwa'i lha khang/gzhung stong gter sgrom/lha sa dang/bsam yas kyi gtsug lag khang sogs nas thugs mad zab pa skor bdun/thugs rje chen po 'khor ba las sgrol/rta mgrin nA ga klu 'dul/drag po gnam ljags me'i 'khor lo sogs gter chos mang po dang/sku tshab rten gsum dang rdzas la sogs pa mang du gdan drangs/bka' gter gong ma rnams la thugs gtsigs rje mtshan pas/gsang chen rnying ma la bka' gter thams cad kyi bstan pa'i bdag por gyur te 'chad nyan gyi 'phrin las rgya cher bskyangs pas bstan pa'i rtsa lag tu gyur pa'i zhal slob kya gtso bo ni/thams cad mkhyen pa dkon mchog yan lag /sa skya bdag chen ngag gi dbang po/gdong bdag chen kun dga' bsam grub/'brug pa zhabs drung mi pham chos rgyal sogs dang chos brgyud 'dzin 'i slob ma'i tshogs/khams kong/byar dwags/e gnyal/lho mon/dbus gtsang thams cad sa bsam gyis mi khyab par byon pags dang chen rnying ma'i srog mthud ltar byung zhing/gter chen 'di nyid dang sog zlog pa blo gros rgyal mtshan/gong ra lo chen bcas la snang sog gong gsum du grags/'di rnams kyi sku ring la bka' gter thams cad rgya cher 'phel/gter chen 'di nyin kyi 'das lo ma gsal}
gter ston 'og ma gu ru chos dbang|{rnying ma'i gter ston brgya rtsa'i nang nyang ral pa nyi ma 'od zer dang 'di rnam gnyis la gter ston gong 'og gnyis zhes snyan grags shin tu che ba zhig yin/rje 'di nyid lho brag tu yab spang ston grub pa'i snying po dang yum dkar bzang mgon skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bzhi pa'i chu sprel (1212)lor sku bltams/mtshan chos kyi dbang phyug tu gsol/de nas bon gyi gzhung chen dang/mdos gzhung chen mo sogs la thos bsam rgya chen mdzad/yab dang 'gro mkhan mthun ston yab sras gtso bor gyur pa'i gsar rnying gi bla ma mang po'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo dang gsang sngags gsar rnying/bka' gter gyi smin grol dang bshad rgyun/zhi byed gcod yul chos drug phyag rdzogs la sogs pa'i gdangs ngag mtha' yas pa gsan/dgung lo bcu pa la gsar ma'i phyag rdor lugs drag gnas te bsgrubs pas bum chu 'khol/bcu gcig pa la sgyu 'a phrul gyi dbang rgyun man ngag thams cad rdzogs/bcu gnyis pa la ka ka ni grang lnga/sgrub thabs brgya rtsa sos mkhan par mdzad cing yig brgya'i sgrub pa mdzad/bcu gsum pa la yang dag dang ma gshin thugs rje chen po lugs gnyis dang/rta mgrin la sogs gter rnying mang po gsan shing bsgrubs/bstan pa spel zhing gdul dkar 'dul ba'i lung bstan thob/de nas tshad ma dang/mngon pa kun btus/spyod 'jug /dgyes rdo la sogs pa'i gzhung che dang/phyag rdzogs zhi byed chos drug la sogs mdop+sangags kyi gzhung mang du gsan/dgung lo bco brgyad par sa skya paN chen las sems bskyed dang chos 'brel gsan/de rjes grwa pa mngon shes gyi gter ma kha byang zhig phyag tu 'byor pa la brten nas dgung lo nyer gnyis la chu sbrul (1233)lor yag nyin gyi lung pa gnam skas can nam yang byang bzhes/gter gyi lde mig dang/gter bcud/gter byang ltar sgo phye nas gter kha chen po bco brgyad/thugs gter dang bcas bcu dgu bzhes pa sogs ngo mtshar ba'i mtshan 'phrin yi snyan pa gang sar khyab pas/yon yul spyi'i bla chen mi shes ris su ma chad pas zhabs la gtugs shang dad gus tshad med zhu ba dang/kun mkhyen 'phags 'od/chos 'od/bu ston rin po che sogs kyis gu ru chos dbang gi sku'i yon tan la bsngags brjod chen po mdzad/'gro ba'i bsodanams gsog pa'i shing du tshong 'dus mgur mo'i lha khang dang/bsam 'grub bde ba chen po'i lha khang gnyis mdzad/gsung las skyes pa'i slob ma yang gnyal nyi ma 'od zer/sman lung pa mi bskyod rdo rje/bal po b+ho ro gtsug 'dzin/snod ldan yi bu gu sogs mang du byon sa 'dres bal dang bod mkhas mtha' dbus kun tu zab chos rgyun mi chad du spel/rab byung lnga pa'i chu bya (1273)lor sku gshegs/rnying rgyud dkar chag tu lcags rta (1270)lor gshegs gsungs}
gter ston ra mo shel sman|{rje 'di nyid rab byung bzhi pa'i (1207nas 1266)nang gtsang yar stong ra mo sman chu khar sku 'khrungs/dgung la chung ngu'i dus nas rdzogs pa chen po'i chos la thugs gzhol te rim bzhin thos bsam dpyis phyin par mdzad/shel brag dang/smin chu 'od gsal rdzong brag ri'i phug pa sogs nas bla rdzogs thugs gsum dang/gso ba rig pa skar rtsis sogs kyi skor sna tshogs gter nas bzhes/thog ma nas smad spyad nyug nyug mdzad pas 'gro don cher ma byung mod/'on kyang phyis gnang sman sogs chu bcos kyi skor dang/'bam bcom smad dkar sman nag sogs la man ngag kha tshar dang bcas mdzad pas/phyag len ma nyams par gnas/dus de tsam la lo paN chen po byung zhing/bod kyi mkhas btsun yang rgya gar dang hor yul du byon pa mang/rje ra mo shel sman 'di nyid kyi 'khrungs 'das lo tshigs zhib cha ma gsal yang gter ston gu ru chos dbang gi gong tsam la byon par bzhed}
gter ston rat+na gling pa|{gter ston 'di nyid lho brag gru shul du yab phyug po mdo sde dar dang yum sri thar sman gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bdun pa'i chu lug (1403)lor 'khrungs/mtshan rin chen dar zhes gsol/dgung lo drug pa la yab kyis yi ge 'bri klog bslabs pas tshags med du mkhyen/chos kyi gsan pa'ang rgya cher mdzad/sku gzhon nu'i dus thugs rgod cing lus stsal sogs la gzhan gyis 'gran du med par grags shing/bzo/gso ba/sgra snyan ngag sogs dang/glo gro tshun la shin tu mkhas/dgung lo nyer gnyis nas srid kyi bya ba mdzad/dgu ngalo nyer bdun la phebs skabs gu ru rin po ches gter gyi kha byang dngos su gnang/dgung lo sum cu par khyung chen brag nas dbu btsugs te 'bri thang ko ro brag dang/lho grag gnam skas/mkhar chu dpal gyi phug ring sogs nas snga rjes su gter nyi shu rtsa lnga bzhes/shing yos (1435)lor karma pa mthong ba don ldan mjal bar phebs nas bka' chos mang du gsan/dgung lo so drug par chos rje zla ba grags pa dang mjal nas rdzogs pa chen po'i chos bka' ji snyed gsan/mngon shes dang rdzu 'phrul gyi bkod pa mang po bstan/thugs sgrub/sman sgrub/skye bdun ril sgrub mdzad skabs dang/dbang khrid gdams ngag bstsal ba sogs kyi dus su 'ja' 'od me tog dang/smin yos kyi dri bzang khyab pa'i ngo mtshar brjod las 'das/sku thog sum gyi gter skal sku thog 'di rang du bzhes pas zhig po gling po/'gro 'dul gling/rat+na gling pa zhes mtshan gsum du grags/stod ngas ri ti se nas smad mdo khams rgyal mo rong yan chad 'gro ba dpag med la dam pa'i chos kyi skal ba bstsal/gsung mgur dang/rtsod zlog /chos 'byung/dbang khrid/zhal gdams sogs bstan bcos kyang mang du mdzad/brgyud 'dzin slob ma'i tshogs kyang karma pa mthong ba don ldan/sne gdong gong ma chen po/kun dga' legs pa'i 'byung ba'i gnas/'brug pa rgyal dbang chos rje smyos mthing ma ba yar lung sprul sku'i rgyud pa sman rtse pa bsam grub rgyal po/rtag mgos chos rje/za ra ba/brag sna chos rje sas mang du byung/de ltar gdung bya dang phrin las mthar phyin nas dgung lo don drug la phebs pa rab byung brgyad pa'i sa khyi (1478)lor gzugs sku'i bkod pa bsdus so/_}
gter ston las 'phro gling pa|{gter ston chen po 'di nyin ku gcig la mtshan gsum yod pa ste/gter na las 'phro gling pa/rigs 'dzin 'ja' tshon snying po/sngags 'chang hUM nag me 'bar bcas so/_/rje 'di nyid kong yul wa hu gnam tshal du yab chos skyong mgon po dang yum ma sangs bu khrid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu pa'i shing bya (1585)lor sku 'khrungs/sku chung ngu'i dus nas chos kyi bag chags ldan zhing/dgung lo gsum pa la phebs skabs yige 'bri klog la sbyangs pas tshegs med du mkhyen/rdo la phyag zhabs kyi rjes kyang mang du byung/gdung lo bcu gnyis nas nyi shur ma phebs par slob gnyer dang/lhag par gso rig la sbyangs pa mdzad pas mkhas par gyur/sku gzhon nu nas chos kho na la rtse gcig tu thugs 'dun gtad cing/'khor la skyo shas drug po 'khrungs ti chos rje mi pham bkra shis blo gros kyi drung du rab tu byung/mtshan ngag dbang chos rgyal dbang por gsol/gsang sngags kyi dbang khrid lugs sogs gdams pa mtha' yas pa gsan cing rtse gcig tu sgrub pa kho nas dus 'da' bar mdzad/zhabs drung nor bu rgyan pa/'brug pa thams cad mkhyen pa/mnyam med lha rtse ba sogs las mdo sngags bka' gter gser rnying mtha' yas pa gsan/khyad par lha rtse ba las bsnyen rdzogs zhus/lo ngo bcu bdun du 'dag sbyar gyis sgrub pa mdzad pa'i dus su gter gyi lung bstan mang du byung rung ji mi snyam ra bzhag kyang chos rje rin chen mi pham bkra shis blo gros kyis thugs skul mdzad 'og lcags sprel (1620)lor gter gyi thog mar mtsho rgyal gyi phyag bris ma dang gter gyi kha byang bzhes/de nas brag lung ham 'phrang lcags kyi+o mo nas yang zab dkon mchog spyi 'dus sogs gsang gter du bzhes nas gter sgrub dang gsang rgya mthar phyin pa mdzad/gzhan yang kong po bu chu dang dang/byang 'ang mdzes zhes ljon pa lung gi gnas sgo dang/snyel mo lha ri/kong 'phrang dge 'dun gnas dbu ru zhwa'i lha khang sogs nas zab gter mang po spyan drangs thog /dkon mchog spyi 'dus sogs 'ga' zhig gnang gter las pher cher khrom gter mdzad/skal ldan mang po rjes su bzung nas bka' gter gsar rnying gi chos tshul mang po'i smin grol gyi bdud rtsi bstsal/rje nyid sku btsan zhing dge slong gi dngos po las mi 'da' bar kun spang gi mdzad pa spyod bzhin du gdul bya rnams kyang tshul der bkra shis te yang dag pa'i lam la gzhol zhing bab par mdzad/bang ri 'jog pa zhes nyid kyis gnas sgo sa pa'i gnas khyad pa 'phags der sgrub sde btab/dngos brgyud rnams kyis legs par bskyangs/chos bdag gi gtso bo sgam po zhabs drung nor bu rgyan pa dang/de bzhin karma chos dbyings rdo rje/zhwa dmar ba chos kyi dbang phyug /thams cad mkhyen pa dpag bsam dang po/'bri khung rig 'dzin chos kyi grags pa sogs chos bdag chen mang zhing chos brgyud kyang phyogs thams cad du dar rgyas che/zab chos 'di nyid nyams su blas pas 'od lus grub pa'i lo rgyus mi dbang bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis dwags po'i yogs su gnyis byung bar gsungs/de ltar bstan 'gro'i don rgya cher mdzad cing/skal ldan gyi gdul bya du ma smin grol gyi lam du bkra bzhin par dgung grangs donag nyis la phebs par rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me sprel (1657)lor bang ri'i 'jog por 'das}
gter ston sangs rgyas bla ma|{'di nyid rang byung dang por (dus rabs bcu gcig pa )la stod mtsho bar du sku 'khrungs/rtsa gsum dril sgrub dang/rta mgrin dregs pa zil gnon sogs gter chos mang du bton zhing/gnyer ston thams cad kyi thog ma yin/dgung grangs brgyad cu lhag bzhugs te sku gshegs so/_}
gter du bzhag|{gnas skabs mi mngon par sbas nas 'jog pa}
gter bdag gling pa|{mtshan dngos la pad+ma gar dbang 'gyur med rdo rje zhu/rje 'di ni yab smyos ston gsang bdag 'phrin las lhun grub dang yum lha 'dzin dbyangs can sgrol ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gcig pha'i me khyi (1646)lor gra nang dar rgyas chos gling du sku bltams/mtshan kun dga' dngos grub rin chen dbang rgyal zhes gsol/dgung lo bzhi la yab las gsang rdzogs kyi dbang gnas/rjes dgon par phebs te yi ge 'bri klog sbyangs/dgung lo bcu gcig pa la rgyal mchog lnga pa chen po'i drung du dbu skra gtsug phud phul te btsan ngag dbang pad+ma bstan 'dzin zhes bstsal/dgung lo bcu gsum tsam nas bzung rtsa rgyud gnang ba snying po dang/rgyud bla ma seng nyid ngal gso/yid bzhin mdzod rtsa 'grel rnams thugs la bung nas yab rje las gsung bshad rim par gsan/dgung lo bco brgyad pa la g.yang ma lung nas rig 'dzin thug thig gi skor sogs dang/dgung grangs nyer gnyis pa la rdzu 'phrul gyi bkod pas sher brag nas 'jam dpyas gshin rje dregs 'joms kyi chos skor spyan darangs pa sogs shin tu mang skad/dgung grangs so gcig pa me 'brug (1676)lor o rgyan smin grol gling gtsug lag khang gsar bzhengs thog chos grwa dang sgrub grwa btsugs/bzhi gsum gyi phyag bzhes rnams kyi srol btod/o rgyan smin grol gling gi rig gnas 'khrid rgyun ha cang khungs dag cing skad grags ldan pas dgon pa de las rig gnas mkhas dbang du ma dang/gsang chen snga 'gyur rnying ma'i ba stan gnas gyi skyes bu mang po bskyangs/gter gling pa mchog dgung grangs sum cu yas mas su brag dmar mchims phu dang/g.yar ma lung sogs dpe na gnas su mtshams la zhugs nas yi dam gyi lha sum cu rtsa lnga tsam gyi bsnyen sgrub dang/rdzogs pa chen po khregs chod kyi nyams bzhes pas ma dag pa'i snang ba 'gog pa'i bskyed rim la brtan pa thob ste las bzhi gang yang thogs med du grub/dgung grangs so dgu pa shing byi (1648)lor bla brang chos 'khor lhun po dang/bsam grub gling/bkra shis rab brtan bcas dang/dgung grangs zhi drug par sku 'bum mthong grol chen mo dang/phyogs mtshams gzhan rnams su byang chen la sogs pa'i mchod rten lhag ma bdun sogs rten gsum shin tu mang po gsar bzhengs mdzad/dgung grangs nga lnga la dkyil 'khor du mi'i grub mchod dang/gsang sngags pho brang gsar du bzhengs/mdor na/rje 'di nyid kyi yab rje dang rgyal mchog lnga pa chen po mchog gi dus snying grol zab lam gsan pas bsten 'dzin chen po bcu drug /zab chos sna tshogs gsan pa'i yongs 'dzin sum cu rtsa lnga rnams bsten te/yul dus ci rigs par yongs 'dzin dge bsnyen/byang sdom bka' srol gsum sogs las snga 'gyur bka' ma deng sang rgyud yod do cog dang/gter ma'i rdo phreng/sgrub thabs brgya rtsa sogs spyi bka' dang/bde mchog /gshed skor skri yog sogs kyi zur bka'/mdo phyogs mang po dang bcas pa'i dbang khrid bshad lung/de thams cad kyi rtsa bar gyur pa bka' 'gyur ro cig gi lung sogs chos bka' gsan pa ni mtha' yas pa'o/_/rje 'di nyid ni kyi zhal slob tu gyur pa ni gtso bor rgyal mchog lnga pa chen pos snga 'gyur rgyud 'bum rin po ches mtshon zab kyi chos skor ji snyed pa zhig gsan nas ti shrIr brkur/sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho mgon nas kyang zur lugs kyi lung rgyun bzhes/sa phug 'bri stag sogs chen po'i go sar bzhugs pa'i skye mchog du ma dang/mi chen/bstan pa gsal bar mdzad pa'i bshes gnyan sogs rgangs med dang/de bzhin yab yul dang/'brug yul/'bras ljongs sogs nas dad 'dus kyi skal ldan mchog dman mtha' yas pa byung ngo/_/phyag rtsom la mtshon bka' ma'i skor gyi sgrub dbyings dbang chog sogs dang/bka' bstan gyi gzhung 'grel/rig gnas skor sogs snga na med pa'i legs bshad smad du byung ba'i bstan bco glegs bam pod chen bco lnga tsam bzhugs/dgung grangs re drug phebs pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing rta (1714)lor gzugs sku'i bkod pa chos dbyings su bsdus so/_}
gter yig|{gter yig ces pa ni gter nas bzhes pa'i chos gzhung mang de'i thog bkod pa'i bod yig yig gzigs dmigs bsal can rnams ste dper na/rat+na gling pa'i gter yig lta bu}
