rta mgrin lha mo|{rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu phag (1923)lor chab mdo go 'jo rdzong khongs ra chu rka do'i nyag bla sgar zhes pa'i sar yab nyag bla byang chub rdo rje dang yum dri med dbang mo gnyis kyi rigs kyi myu gur 'khrungs/yab kyi gter chos pod chen bzhi bcu tsam yod par bka' 'dus chos kyi rgya mtsho sogs kyi dbang lung khrid man ngag bcas pa gsan bzhes nyams len mdzad/lhag par du yab kyi gter chos phag mo'i rlung khrid rgyud du mdzad nas bcud len bdun tshar nyer gcig tsam dang nam mkha' bcud len bdun gcig bzhugs/khyad par du yab kyi gter chos kyi nying khu lta bu yang tig nag po gser gyi rgyan can zhes par nyams len mdzad/DA ki ma 'di nyid kyi dbus sgras mig gi ling tog mngon sum du phye nus pa dang/nu chus mig nad dang grib nad la sogs pa sbyong ba'i mchog yin/dgra la sdang sems dang gnyen la chags sems zer ba gtan nas mi mkhyen/grwa bu sogs slob ma mang du bskyangs/de ltar don gnyis lhun grub kyi ngang nas dgung lo nga bdun hrir por phebs pa sa lug (1969)lo'i bod zla gnyis pa'i tshes nyer bdun gyi zhogs ra bzhugs sa'i nye skor gser rkang dang rtsi rong sogs su yod pa'i gnyen nye bu slob tshang ma bos de gsungs par/da khyed tsho sdug ma byed/skyes pa'i mtha' mar shi rgyu las ma mchis/nga rang gi tshe tshad lo lnga bcu gnyis yin kyang/bla ma rin po che'i thugs rje dang bu chu chung chung de skyes pa gnyis kyi rkyen byas te lo shas tshe bsring thub pa byung/rang la phag mo'i zhal mjal yang thengs kha shes byung/de re zhig g.yo lo bkod pa'i zhing 'gro dgos/nga'i phung po la zhen chags byas nas nyar ma sdod ces sogs gsungs te de nub mtshan mor dgos pa gzhan don du gshegs/sku gdung nyin bdun bzhag ring 'od du zhu nas sku lus hril po spyi skar nyer drug gam mkhyen gang lhag tsam las ma lus/tshul de yul de'i mang tshogs stong phra mang po'i thun mong gi mig lam du mngon sum snang ba byung/mi ming pos sngar bskur 'debs zhus myong bar bzod gsol yang zhus skad}
rta rgyug mda' 'phen|{rta rgyug mda' 'phen ni bod ljongs sa khul gang sar dar khyab che zhing/lha sa khul du de bas dar po yod/rta rgyu mda' 'phen la gna' rabs kyi dmag rtsal rang bzhin mngon gsal dod po yod cing/gna' dus btsan po'i dus su bod dmag dpung stobs ha cang che skor (thang deb gsar rnying )nang du yang 'khod yod/de skabs kyi dmag dpung gang 'dra zhig yin kyang de tshos spyod pa'i mtshon che mda' gri mdung gsum yin pa ltar bod dmag rnams kyang de ltar yin par nges/rta rgyu mda' 'phen gyi thog nas de snga'i rta dmag gi dmag rtsal rnams dmangs khrod du khyab nas rjes su lus rtsal gyi rnam par gyur pa 'dra zhing/bod ljongs kyi sa khul gzhan dang 'dra bar lha sar de snga bod zla dang po'i tshes nyi shu drug nyin rdzong rgyab zhar 'phen zhes rdzong rgyab klu khung gi rgyab tu lo ltar rta rgyug rtsal ston la ltad mo lta srol yod/rta pa ni de lnga'i sku drug gi khyim tsha che khag sde dpon bzhi dang lan tshan rjes 'brel ltar g.yas ru dang g.yon rur phye zhing/rta pa chos mgo la sog zhwa dang pa Ta can gyi gos yan thog dma' gzhu sag thag dang bod mda' 'khyer te rta rgyug bzhin dang ched btsugs 'ben la mda' dang mi mda' rgyag pa'i rtsal 'gran byed srol yod/de bzhin lo bzhi lnga tsam nas thems re byed pa'i drung 'khor rtsal rgyugs zhes pa de snga sa gnas srid gzhung gi gsar bsgo byas pa'i dpon rigs skye bo tshang mas rta rgyu mda' 'phen thengs re byed dgos pa de'i thogap+ta pa rnams kyis rta rgyug pa dang mda' rgyag pa/'bi shu zhes pa dang me mda' rgyag pa'i rtsal 'a na byed srol yod/lha sa smon lam che mo'i byams pa gdan 'dren nyin rta rgyug mi rgyug ces mi hreng gi rgyugs ra dang/rta hreng gi rta rgyug tong ba'i mi rta rnams gtan 'khel khri khungs yod pa de tshos byams pa gan 'dren zin mtshams bar ma ri dang yas sna'i ri zur gnyis nas rgyug brda bsgrags pa dang rta rkyang rnams 'bras spungs dgos gsham gyi spyi ri'i zur nas bar skor brgyud ngo bo rags rgya par spyi lo bcu tsam sar rgyug pa dang/mi hreng rnams kyang thang sgang nas bar skor nang gi me tog rdum ra zhes pa'i bar spyi lo bdun tsam sar rgyug gi yod/mi rtag rnams ngo bo rags rgyab dang me tog ldum ra so sor snga rting gis 'byor mtshams sang rim sprod srol yod/da dung zhing grong du dbyar kha 'ong skor dang/'brog khul du tshong 'dus sogs dus chen la rta rgyug mda' 'phen dang/la lar rta rgyug lam du kha btags bkram te rta rgyug bzhin rta thog nas kha btags rnams sgrub pa dang/de min rta rtsal ston pa'i byed sgo 'khrug po spel srol yod}
rta chag sgang|{bod ljongs mal gro gung dkar rdzong khungs 'bri gung mthil dgon pa'i rgyab ngos kyi ri bo'i spo ru rta chag sgang zhes pa'i sa char skyob pa 'khor nyung bsdus dang bcas pa skyo bsangs su byon/de 'khor rnams la rdzu 'phrul sna re ston dgos zhes gsungs pas gnyos rgyal ba lha nang pas rgya gar gyi a ru ra rlon pa blangs nas phul/dpal chen chos yes bla ma'i thugs kar thim/ja ma p+sabo bo bkra shis seng ges chos gos dang ja tshags gzar bu rnams nyir zer la bkal ba sogs kyi rdzu 'phrul sner bstan pa'i skabs su nye gnas rin chen grags kyis rdzu 'phrul bstan ma thub pas skyengs nas de gar gshegs/der skyob pa rin po che nyid kyi phyag 'khar de sku gdung gi snying gar btsugs te 'pho ba rten 'phyag steng ma zhes mdzad nas ring bsreg 'phyag rgya yod pa byung bas phyis rten 'phyag sgang zhes pa'i ming du gyur/skyob pa rin po ches gnang der rdo bcal gyi 'og tu ngan song sbyong ba'i zhi khro'i dkyil 'khor bkod cing/de'i steng du rdo bcal bka' nas rab gnas dang gnas 'dir phung po bskyal ba thams cad ngan song las thar thub pa'i rten 'brel dang smon lam yang yang mdzad pas dus phyis bod kyi skad grags can gyi dur khrod du gyur te deng sang yang lha sa dang/kong po/byang khul/de bzhin sa khul gzhan dag nas kyang phung po skyer bar nyin lam kha shas kyi sa nas yod mkhan yod}
rta mchog skyong ba po|{chibs dpon dang/rta dpon/rta 'tsho mkhan bcas don gsum la go dgos}
rta steng nas mda' mo 'phen pa|{de ni gna' rabs su 'brog pa skyas spo ba dang/ri dwags rngon pa/dmag don bcas dang 'brel ba dam zab yod pa zhig yin/sngar chos rgyal srod btsan sgom po'i sku dus su bod du rta dmag ru khag stobs dang ldan pa 'bor chen yod pas dmag dpung nang rtag tu rta rgyug dang/rta rtsal/mda' mo 'phen pa bcas kyi dpa' rtsal sna tshogs 'gran pa'i byed sgo spel bas rjes sor de srol rgyun gyi lus rtsal byas sgo'i rnam grangs su yar nas lo ltar bod zla dang po'i nang lha sar gzhi rgya shin tu che ba'i rta rgyug dang/rta rtsal/mda' mo 'phen pa sogs kyi byed sgo spel ba dang 'gran bsdur nang zhugs mkhan mi rangs lnga brgya drug brgya tsam zin pa yin}
rta ston jo bo ye shes|{rnying ma rta ston jo bo ye shes ni yab jo 'bum gyi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i chu lug (1163)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu gnyis la phebs skabs bla ma dmar ston 'jam gyi sar byon te bde mchog dang yag na rdo rje bdun rtsi thigs pa'i chos skor zhus shing/gzungs ring la bsnyen pa lo gnyis mdzad/bde mchog gi dpal yab dang na du brgya rtsa brgyad zhus/kha rag ston snying gi sar sgyu 'phrul lo gnyis gsan/bla ma lgas dang se dur lung pa gnyis la rdzogs chen skor lugs gzhung gdams ngag dang bcas pa zhus/dgung lo bcu drug la rdo rje sems dpa' nam mkha' che la bshad pa mdzad/de rjes yab kyi slob ma rje btsun hags las phyag rgya chen po sgang lugs gsan/'jam dpal gsang ldan sogs mang du zhus/bla ma rlung phyag dum las do ha skor gsum grags pa'i chos skor ma lus pa dang/gtor rgyud chen po gsan/dgung la nyer lnga par bla ma zhig po'i drung du byan te chos gsan pa las/de yang rgyud kyi skor la/kun byed rgyal po ma bu gsum bskor/bshad rgyud mdo bcu/'khor ba rtsad gcod kyi rgyud la bshad rgyud sde bzhi/rtsa ba 'grel pa rgyun chos ngan ngag dang bcas pa gsan/gdams pa snyan brgyud kyi skor la/skor lugs rong lugs khams lugs gsum gyi gdams ngag phyag bzhes khrid dang bcas pa rnams la nan tan cher mdzad/zhig po'i zhabs la gtugs shing/gsung gi chu rgyun dri ma med pa pa legs par 'thungs pas thugs dgongs longs/bying rlabs zhugs/jo yes spyir bla ma thams cad la zhabs tog ma grub pa med/khyad par zhig po la yul gzhis thams cad bcongs nas spong thag byas te chos 'khor lan bzhi btsugs/gdams pa gsung sgros thams cad yi ger bkod pas phyi rabs rjes 'brang rnams la drin che ba lags/spyis bo dong gi bla ma brag dkar mo ba las rin po che gal ba sgron ma'i rgyu dang/'phags lam bkod pa'i rgyud gnyis gsan/gdams ngag phra mo dag kyang zhus/chos zhus tshad kyi bla ma brtsis na bcu drug /slob gnyer nan tan byas pa bcu gsum/de'i nang nas kyang rtsa ba'i bla ma drug /de las kyi khyad par du drin che ba gsum/'gran zla dang bral ba zhig po rin po che'o/_/'di nyid kyis sku tshe'i smad du gdan sa'i bya ba dang zhig po'i 'phrin las bsgrub phyir rgyal khams kun tu byon zhing 'gro don rgya cher mdzad/lha sa'i jo shAka rnam gnyis kyi zhabs gtog kyang sngar phyi sdoms pas lo drug mdzad/mthar dgung lo drug cu re brgyad pa rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags stag (1230)lo'iston zla ra ba'i tshes bcu dgu la sku gshegs}
rta ston jo 'bum|{'di nyid yab rta bon dbang grags kyi sras su rab byung gnyis pa'i shing 'brug (1124)lor sku 'khrungs/sku chung dus gzad kyi grub bu lung pa'i bla ma mda' byang chub sems dpa'i spyan sngar pho to ba'i bka' gdams kyi chos rnams gsan/de nas rang yul gyi 'khor 'bangs dang yul gzhis nyin thu 'dzoms par yod pa de dag lap+sakayo ba skyes zhen pa log nas g.yog bzhi khrid de lha rje glan nya tshal ba'i thugs srad gnyos bu bo ri pa'i spyan sngar byon te dpon g.yog lngas stabs gcig tu chos sgor zhugs nas sngags rnying ma'i chos mang du gsan/khyad par du rdzogs chen skor lugs gzhan gdams ngag dang bcas pa la shis tu mkhas pa gyur/bla ma phag mo grub pa'i khyad sngar byon nas lam 'bras dang phyag rgya chen po'i gdams pa ma lus pa gsan/gzhan yang dbu ru stod kyi bla ma 'tshar ston las phyag rgya chen po sgang lugs kyi do ha skor gsum gsan/zangs ri 'gro ras las lo ro ras chung pa'i chos skor rnams gsan/dmar ston 'jam las bde mchog gsan/bde mchog gi dbal brgya rtsa brgyad zhus/de ltar bla ma mang bsten kyang gnyos chu bo ri pa dang/phag mo grub pa la rtsa ba'i bla mar 'dzin/gnas pa thugs thag chod dang chu bo ri la bzhugs te sgrub pa mdzad/gdul bya'i tshogs kyang mang du 'dus ta gzhan don rgya cher bskyangs/'di nyid la r+sa rta ston jo yes dang dbus pa jo bsun gnyis yod/mthar ngo 'bum dgung lo lnga bcu rtsa gnyis pa rang byung gsum pa'i shing rta (1174)lo'i cho 'phrul gyi tshes bcu gsum la 'das}
rta brtag pa|{rta yi rgyud bzang ngan dang/spu mdog gzugs dbyibs/gdong/mjug ma/rmig pa/gom 'gros sogs brtag pa ste/bstan 'gyur nang (rta dpyad sha mi ho sra )zhes pa zhig yod pa de'i le'u dang por gong gsal gyi nang don rnams zhib phra'i p+sago nas bshad yod}
rta thab g.yog|{rta g.yog dang/thab g.yog }
rta bdun|{rlung/yid mgyogs/mdog lnga pa/thig le can/nges brjod/shin tu rgyal mtshan/ri bo 'dzoms}
rta mdo ba cang shes|{mi rung yun ring 'grogs 'dris te mi'i skad cha spyir btang go thub pa'i rta}
rta nag ri khud|{bzhad mthong smon rdzong/dar dmar chus/rta nag ri khud}
rta phug pa blo bzang dam chos rgyal mtshan|{rje 'di ni stong mnga' ris zangs dkar du yab chos rgyal gyi gdung brgyud dpal ldan dang yum skyid 'dzoms kyi sras su rab byung bcu pa'i me lug (1607)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bco gcig pa yi ge 'bri klog bslabs/drung pa blo bzang rnam rgyal dang rang gi yab gnyis stong gu ger paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan mjal bar phebs/dgung lo bcu gsum la drung pa'i sku mdun du dbu skra gtsug phud phul/mtshan blo bzang rgyal mtshan zhes bstsal/dus phyis bkra shis lhun por phebs nas paN chen rin po che dang mjal te blo bzang dam chos rgyal mtshan zhes pa'i mtshan gnang/de rjes yab yum du phebs nas drung pa dang slob dpon dkon cog dpal sogs kyi drung dbang dang rjes gnang sogs gsan sbyong mdzad/dgung lo nyer lnga la dbus su phebs nas dwags khul brgyad gangs dkar ti si sogs lag nas 'jal du phebs/ngam rim brgyud bsam grub dga' ldan dgon du byon te slob gnyer gyi 'go de nas brtsams/de rjes bkra shis lhun por sgrigs la zhugs/dka' bcu rgyal tshab pa dge rgan du bsten nas gzhung chen la gsan bsam gyi dbu tshugs/de'i lo smad du paN chen rin po che'i ba'i ltar bkras lhun rang du bzhugs nas gzhung chen la gnas bsam mdzad/dgung lo nyer bdun pa la dbus su gnas 'jal du phabs skabs lha sa smon lam chen mo tshugs pa dang stabs 'khel gyis tshogs gral du phebs/de skabs rgyal dbang lnga pa dang sprul sku grags pa rgyal mtshan gnyis la mjal/de nas rwa sgreng dang dga' ldan sogs mjal nas gtsang du phebs/dgung lo so gsum skabs paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan drung du bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/lo mang ring mdo gas kyi chos mtha' yas pa gsan/de nas bla brang gsar bzhengs kyi las grwa ngos phebs kyis phyi rgyal ma grub par ar las la zhugs/de nas bla ma'i bka' bzhin rta nag khul ri khrod du bya bral gyi spyod pa la gshegs/dgung lau drug la rtag nag khul du sog po'i dmag 'byor/de'i lor sde srid gtsang pa gtor pham btang/de'i rkyen gyis gtsang khul skya sag la mu ge che ba byung/dgung lo re gnyis la bkra shis lhun por lam ring sogs kyi bka' chos mdzad/dgung lo re gung la khro phu'i smon lam la phebs/de'i lor lho brug zab phu lung du phebs/o rgyan rin po che'i sku brnyan sogs zab phu'i rten gsum rnams dang gter ston las brgyud pa'i nang rten dang/rdo ka ha ra pa las grub pa'i slob dpon rin po che'i sku bsnyen mjal/zangs mdo dpal rig la gnas bstod brtsams/dgung lo re dgu pa bkra shis lhun por phebs nas paN chen rgyal ba bsam grub kyi thugs dam rten rje tsong kha pa chen po'i sku brnyan gser sku rgyal yol dang de min li sku sogs 'bul gnang mdzad/rtag phug rig khrod du snga phyir lo sum cu tsam bzhugs/(byang chub lam gyi rim pa'i sngon 'gro'i chos gsal bar byed pa las las dang po'i skor blo bzang dam chos rgyal mtshan gyis sgo gsum legs par spyad pa'i phyogs rnam par thar pa dad pa'i ljon shing (zhes bya ba sogs gsung ma pod gcig tsam mdzad/dgung lo brgyad cu phebs pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i smad tsam du sku gshegs}
rta babs|{sgo'i mdzes rgyan zhig ter ba ming mtho dman rim pa gsum nas lnga bar dang 'og nas gong du rgya che chung dang dpangs je mthor song ba'i mchod sprin bar rim ltar yod/de la rgya gar lugs kyi rta babs ni gsang sngags kyi gzhung nas bshad pa'i dkyil 'khor blos bslang gi rta babs lta bu dang/rgya nag lugs kyi rta babs ni mes rgyal nang khul gyi pho brang rnying pa khag dang/lha khang 'ga' zhig /snga rabs kyi gling kha sogs kyi+o chen thog yod pa lta bu/bod lugs kyi rtag babs ni dgon pa dang lha khang/pho brang khag gi gzhungo chen mo'i steng du yod pa'i rta babs lta bu yin}
rta babs bang rim brgyad|{'og nas pad+ma sgrol bu gnyis/rtag rkang za rang tshag dang bzhi/shar bu chud 'byang gnyis dang drug /rin ched khyung mog rnam pa'o/_}
rta dbang dga' ldan rnam rgyal lha rtse|{(mon lta dbang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas bod yongs rdzogs gong bu gcig gyur byung ba'i rjes su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags sprel (1680)lor mon me rag bla ma blo gros rgya mtsho dang mtsho sna'i lding dpon nam mkha' 'brug grags gnyis btang nas mon du srid dbang btsugs/de'i rgyal skyor du rta dbang dga' ldan rnam rgyal lha rtse'i dgon (yongs grags su mon rta dbang dgon pa zer )btab/rjes su rgyal po lha bzang bod kyi srid skyong byas nas lo shas song mtshams 'brug dang mthun par brtan phun tshul 'khrug rtsod byung ba'i skabs sa gnas srid gzhung nas rta dbang dgon pa'i rgyab skyor du dmag drangs te 'brugapa'i dbang dpung rnams mtha' bskrod btang}
rta bres|{rta 'dogs sa'i ra ba}
rta rtsed po lo|{nye ba'i dus rabs su rta rtsed po lo rgyag pa mthong rgyu med yang gna' dus bod la dar ba'i lus rtsal gyi rnam grangs shig yin/gna' dus thang bod dbar mdza' mthun 'gran rtsed kyang byed myong ba (thar deb rnying pa'i )glegs bam brgya dang go drug pa'i stod char cing lung khri lo gsum pa'i zla ba bcu gcig par bod nas blon chen zhang btsan to sogs kong jo (kim shang kong jo )bsu bar mngags/gong ma rung tshung gis skyes los tshal gyi po lo rtser rar gsol ston bshams te/h+phu ma tu'u we yi thabs yod pa dbyang hrin ca'o bya ba dang/bod kyi pho nya bas po lo rtse ba la/gong ma krung tsang yang der gzigs su phebs zhes 'khod yod/rgyal yul du rta rtsed po lor mU chi'u {(WP:1,194)}zhes brjod cing/dbying skad nang rta rtsed spo mo lor pho lo {(WP:1,194)}zhes (dbyin skad nang po lo'i rigs gzhan la {(WP:1,194)}zer )bul nyar pa ne bar nu kan g.yal ba lang yin pa deng dus dbying yig mkhas pa mang par bzhed yod cing rta rtsed po lo ni thog mar bod rang du byung ba dang de nas rim bzhin phyir dar bar mngon}
rta tshag sku phreng dgu pa ngag dbang blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{rje 'di ni rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags lug (1811)lor 'khrungs/sku gzhon dus 'bras spungs su chos zhugs mdzad nas gzhung chen la gsan bsam gnang/rgyal dbang tshul khrims rgya mtsho dang paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma sogs kyi drung nas mdo sngags kyi chos gsan/dgung lo sum cu'i skabs rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gcig pa mkhas grub rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin mdzad/rtsom pa la )thub pa'i dbang po'i ka bstod/) (dris lan kun gsal me long/) (klu bsangs dang klo spo ba'i 'dod gsol )dang (rta rgya'i bsangs mchod/) (snubs chen sangs rgyas ye shes kyi rtogs brjod mdor bsdus/) (ba so sku phreng gong ma'i gnas sa rta tshag lhun grub bde chen gyi dge 'dun rnams kyi khrims su bca' ba )sogs pod gcig bzhugs/dgung lo so brgyad la phebs pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa sprel (1848)lor sku gshegs}
rta tshag sku phreng bcu pa ngag dbang dpal ldan chos kyi rgyal mtshan|{rje 'di yul yar lung sde pa yab tshe ring dar rgyas dang yum a lags gnyis kyi sras su rab yung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags khyi (1850)lor sku 'khrungs/mtshan nor bu nor grub tu gsol/dgung lo bzhi la phebs skabs lha sa kun bde gling la gdan drangs/rwa sgreng sku phreng bzhi pa ngag dbang ye shes tshul khrims la gtsug phud phul/mtshan ngag dbang dpal ldan chos kyi rgyal mtshan zhes bstsal/rgyun stong mkhan zur ngag dbang nor bu yongs 'dzin du rten nas yi ge 'bri klog dang chos spyod sogs kyi rim pa rnams gsan sbyong mdzad/dgung lo drug la 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang du chos zhugs mdzad nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bzhes dbu tshugs/dgung lo bcu dgur lha gnas su phebs/dgung lo nyi shu la 'on rgyal sras ngag dbang thobs med bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs/brag ri blo bzang chos 'byor dang phur lcog byams pa bya mtsho sogs bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos 'byor dang phur lcog byams pa rgya mtsho sogs bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/dgung lo nyer gnyis la lha ldan smon lam chen mo grwa sgor mtshan rtags mdzad/dgung lo nyer drug nas so bdun bar bod kyi rgyal tshab gnang/gdung lo so gsum la rgyal ba'i yongs 'dzin mdzad nas gong sa mchog la bar byung gi sdom pa 'bul ba zhes gnang/rtag tshag sku phreng bcu pa 'di nyid kyis bod kyi srid skyong lo bcu gnyis gnang ring bstan srid la la thugs khur che khar/mi mang gi bde sdug la rgyud par gzigs rtogs yang shing/bod ljongs su rdo rje mtsher ma'i nad yangs drag po yong skabs rgya khyab yongs la rim srung gnang sgo lhod med bskyangs pas byis pa khri phrag mang po nang la thar gshis mang tshogs nas rta tshag lha 'brum dkar mo zhes grags/chab 'bangs la byams gzigs che bas dbus gtsang du glo bur 'bru gong 'phar bar srid skyong mchog nas sku sger kun gling bla brang gi bkar 'bru stor ni ring gon gcig thabs gnang ba sogs 'di dang de 'dra'i mdzad bzad ji snyed mchis/mdo sngags kyi gung lugs la'ang mkhas che bas bka' rtsom yang ( dang bcas pa'i skye rgu ma lus pa'i gtsug nor rta tshag rje drung ho thog thu yongs 'dzin srid skyong ngag dbang dpal ldan chos gyi rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po'i rnam thar srid zhi'i mdzes rgyan/) (chab shog rim pa rnams phyogs gcig tu bsgrigs pa/) (chos sde chen po zha lus ri phug gi bca' khrims yi ger bar gsal nor bu)sogs pod chung gcig tsam mdzad/mthar dgung grangs so bdun la phebs pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i me khyi (1886)lo'i bod zla bzhi pa'i tshes brgyad nyin rtse shar rgyud du sku gshegs}
rta tshag bstan pa'i mgon po|{kun gling rta tshag sku phreng gsum pa ste rta tshag sku breng rim byon gyi nang nas bod kyi srid skyong thems dang po dang chos srid gnyis ki thog nas mdzad rjes dang mtshan snyan che shos zhig yin/khong ni mdo stod s+pho por yab dar la tshe ring dang yum zla ba bu khrid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcug sum pa'i lcags 'brug (1760)lor sku 'khrungs/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags (1810)lor sku gshags dgung lo lnga gcig bzhugs/dgung lo ng+la pa shis sprel (1764)lor dpa' shod kyi pho brang dga' ldan rnam par rgyal ba'i gling du zhabs sen bkod/ring po ma lon par shing bya (1764)lor man ching gong ma chen lung gis rta tshag sku phreng rim byon spyi dang nang tshan rje gong ma blo bzang dpar ldan rgyal mtshan nyid gong mar rang nyid kyi dbu bla gnang myong ba'i dbang gis sprul sku 'di nyid la tham ka dang 'ja' sa sngar rgyun dang sko gong ma'i dbu zhwa sogs kyang gdan sar bzhes cog pa sogs bka' bzang zhib rgyas bstsal/gong ma chan lung gi khri bzhugs lo sum cu pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me khyi (1766)lor gser yig gi lam nas bdag rkyen gzengs bstod bla na med pa'i bka' lung stsal bar mdzad/dgung lo bcu gnyis pa lcags yos lo la dpar shod dga' ldan 'phel rgyas gling nas pe cin du gong ma mjal bar phebs/bod zla drug pi nang du gong ma chen po dang thog mar mjal te tshe lha'i sku brnyan sogs dngos 'bral gtor che ba dang bcas bka' 'dri gnang ba'i phebs lam sogs zhum pa med pa'i sgo nas thogs med du zhu bar mdzad/zla ba bdun pa'i nang mtsho bdun lha khang chen mor lcang skya ho thug thu sku phreng gsum pa rol pa'i rjes mkhan po mdzad de dge 'dun grangs tshang ba'i dbus su bar ma rab byung dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa lags par bzhes shing mtshan yang paN chen thams cad mkhyen pas stsal ba'i steng na lcag skya nyid kyi mtshan sgra gsar du bsnan te ye shes bstan pa'i mgon por gsol/rje nyid dgung lo nyer gnyis par phebs par lcags glang (1781)lor gsar grub rjes pe cin nas bod du phyir phebs kyis hor zla brgyad pa'i tshes lnga nyin gyi snga drol dpa' shod dga' ldan rnam rgyal gling du phebs 'byor byung/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu stag (1782)lora'i zla ba gsum par lha sar phebs thon gnang ste/rje nyid dgung lo nyer gsum pa'i thog chu stag lo'i bla lnga pa'i tshes brgyad nyin lha sar 'byor/hor zla drug pa'i tshegs nyis nyin gnas sa chen po 'bras spungs su phebs te tshogs can/grwa tshang/khang tshan so sor chos bzhugs kyi mdzad sgo gnang ste dge 'dun la bsnyen bskur sku 'gyed mchod 'bul spyi 'jog sogs dang/sku gsung thugs rten bzhengs pa sogs sngar srol ltar mdzad/grwa sa chen po 'dir bzhugs nas mtshan nyid gnas bzhes mdzad skabs sgo mang mkhan po skal bzang dngos grub yongs du bsten nas lo ngo bdun gyi ring gzhung chen bka' pod lngar thugs sbyong nyin mtshon 'khor mo yug tu brtson par mdzad de ring por ma lon pa lung rig gi rtsal yongs su rdzogs pa'i mkhas mang grangs med pa'i dbus su mtshan gyis khyab pa byung/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa bya (1789)lor pe cin du slar yang phebs rgyu'i gra sgrig nang zhing de dag gi skabs su bod mi ser skya phal mo ches gangs can mgon po'i chos srid kyi 'phrin las spel ba'i byed por mgon po 'di nyid kho na 'os so zhes bsngags shing smon par 'gyur ba'i khar rje nyin lha sa pe cin phyogs su phebs thon gnang nas ring por ma lon pa'i dus nyin du bka' shag dang/tshogs 'du thun mong nas am ban brgyud gong ma chen por rta tshag rje drung ho thog thu 'di bzhin gong ma chen po dang/tA la'i bla ma'i zhabs 'degs su smin nges yod pas bod 'phangs rnams la brtses pas dgongs te myur du phyir bskyod kyis tA la'i bla ma'i 'phrin las kyi zhabs 'degs pa dang/srid kyi lan don byed por bkas mngags thub pa zhig dgos zhes snyan zhu zhus pa ltar res 'bras smin pa'i bka' bzang cho lo dang bcas gral rtse'i lam nas zi ling am ban brgyud de bstsal/bod phyogs su chibs zhal bsgyur rjes snga 'phros srid skyong gi khri 'don lha ldan gtsug lag khang gi khams gsum rnam rgyal du mdzad de rgyal dbang mchog dang lhan du lugs gnyis kyi srid skyong bar mdzad/lo shas song mtshams tshe smon gling ngag dbang tshul khrims bod du phebs kyang ring min sku gshegs shing/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa sprel (1788)lor gor khas bod du btsan 'dzul byas te lcags phag lor gor Sha'i dmag dpung bkra shis lhun po 'byor pa sogs gyi yo lang ci cher brten lo der bal bod sde gzar gyi 'khrug zing lhing 'jags gtong chen gong mas mngags pa'i krung thang chen po dpung dang bcas pa rim bzhin 'byor/rgyal dbang mchog dang/krung thang (hu khang an )chen po sogs dang/bka' 'gros kyi bstan dgra gor Sha 'cham la phab te bod khams dkar po'i snang bar 'god rgyu'i bka' 'doms bstsal/gor Sha btsan 'dzul dmag pham nyes su btang rjes nang blon chen po krung thang sogs nas bod kyi bsten srid la sri zhu rgya cher mdzad pa'i lag rtags su rin gnyis srang bdun stong skor gyi rgyu sbyor ba dang bcas 'jam dpal dbyangs kyi gnas zhes grags pa'i bongs ba ri'am ba ma rir gor k+Sha btsan 'dzul dmag bod nas mthar skrod btang ba'i rgyal kha chen por rten 'brel zhu chen du rgya bod gnyis ka'i lha khang dgon sde bcas gsar 'dzugs byas nas dgon bdag kyang rta tshag rin po cher 'bul rgyu'i rtsis kyis gong ma chen lung khri lo nga bdun pa rang byung bcu gsum pa'i chu byi (1792)lor dgon pa dang/ge sar lha khang gsar bzhengs kyi 'go tshugs te rgya yi lha khang mtshon byed 'jam dbyangs lha khang dang/rgya yi man ching rgyal rabs kyi srung ma kon yun chang gi lha khang/(deng sang gi sar lha khang zer ) bod kyi lha khang dang dgon pa gsar bzhengs thogs gong ma chen lung gis dbus gtsang kun bde gling zhes (go don ni gor Sha btsan 'dzul dmag bod nas mthar sprod btang ste dbus gtsang gi ljongs kun bde ba la 'od pa'i gling zhes pa'i don )pa'i pen gnang ba dang rta tshag rin po che rang nyid nang dga' ldan brtan bzhugs chos 'khor gling zhes 'dogs gnang mdzad/kun bde gling gi dgon pa gsar rgyag gi 'go tshugs nas ma grub gong der gong ma chen lung gis karma zhwa dmar pa'i yang srid ngos 'dzin byed mi chog pa dang/yangs pa can gyi dgon pa de kun bde gling gi 'dzin khongs dang grub mtha' dge lugs par bsgyur dgos pa bcas kyi bka' phab/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing byi (1804)lo'i zla ba bcu pa'i tshes bco brgyad nyin tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa bsnyun gzhi dwangs skyed ma byung bar sku mya ngan las 'das/sku gdung bzhugs gnas gser sdong dang/gtsug lag khang dang bcas pa gsar bzhengs thugs 'gan bzhes/de'i phyi lo shing glang (1805)lo'i zla ba bzhi pa'i nang mag ching gong ma cA ching gis bod kyi chos srid skyong ba'i rgyal tshab tu bsko gzhag byas pa'i gser yig dang bod kyi las don 'khur 'dzin zhwa ser bstan pa 'dzin byade dpal ldan no min han gyi tham ka rnam par rgyal lo zhes 'khod pa'i dngul tham dang bcas ched du mngags pa'i hong lo ye ched 'byor byung don ltar bod kyi srid skyong 'gan bzhes gnang/de nas rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i thog ma me yos ((1807)lo'i hor zla gnyis pa'i nang rgyal dbang mchog gi yang srid rtsad gcod du ldan chos 'khor du gzim 'gag rab brtan rgya mtsho dang/a mdor rtse drung dpal mgon/li thang du 'brong pa rje drung/rag rtsig pa/gtsang dang kong por rtse gnyis 'gyur med dge legs dang spyi khang lcang grong pa bcas mngags rdzong mdzad pa ltar chung srid khag lha sar gdan drangs/gzings chung nyi 'od du skyabs mgon nyid dang zhabs pad rnam bzhi sogs tshang 'dzoms kyi sar gnas chung chos skyong chen po spyan 'dren gyi thog rgyal dbang mchog gi yang srid skor la bka' lung gsal dwangs dgos tshul zhus par ldan chos 'khor du 'khrungs pa 'di nyid 'gyur med rdo rje'i tshig gis gsal por lung bstan pa dang/phyogs mtshungs yang srid rin po che ngos 'dzin mdzad par paN chen thams cad mkhyen pa dang/skyabs mgon nyid/bstan gling mchog phul/bshad gling no mi han/gzhung drung mi drug tshad pa dang/drung byings sogs tshang ma gung thang du phebs te mchog sprul rin po che gdan zhus kyi bzhugs khrir phebs bstun mjal dar sogs phul rjes rdor dril sogs sku'i nyer chas ngos 'dra gnyis re phul te ngos 'dzin mdzad du bcug par ngo ma gang yin rnams nor 'khrul med par ngos 'dzin gyi phyag tu bzhes pa na/sku gsung thugs kyi mdzad spyod/bla lha'i lung bstan sogs gang nas gcig mthun byung ba'i gnas tshul gong mar snyan zhu 'bul gnang mdzad/rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa 'brug (1805)lo'i zla ba brgyad pa'i tshes nyer gnyis kyi snga char tA la'i bla ma sku phreng dgu pa lung rtogs rgya mtsho mchog tshoms chen srid zhi'i phun tshogs su gdan zhus mdzad de gser khrir mkha' gso/rta tshag sku phreng 'dis bod kyi srid skyong lo nyi shu tham pa gnang ring srid kyi mdzad phyogs thad de sngon srid skyong de mo ho thog thu'i srol ltar nyams med skyong zhing/rgya bod mthun sgril dang zi 'jugs kyi las don mdzad mkhas pa bcas lab na skya ser mchog dman yongs kyis bsngags brjod gus bskur zhu yul zhig yin/gsung rtsom skor (dpal ldan mo'i lo rgyus/) (lo gsar tshes gtor gyi bca' sgrigs dang rol tshig /) (yi dam chos srung gi gtor bzo'i phyag len zin bris )sogs pod gsum de sngon kun bde gling du dpar yod}
rta zom|{rtse drug rigs kyis gyon pa'i gzhung skabs bzhon rta dang khal rta'i 'u lag 'di la sa tshigs gcig nas sa tshigs gcig bar skyel dgos pa'i shas shig dang/rdzong gi mnga' khongs gcig nas rdzong gzhan dag gi mnga' khongs bar skyes dgos pa zhig bcas rigs gnyis yod}
rta 'ul|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs bzhon rta dang khal rta'i 'u lag 'di la sa tshigs gcig nas sa tshigs gcig par skyel dgos pa'i gras shig dang/rdzong gi mnga' khongs gcig nas rdzongs gzhan dag gi mnga' khongs bar skyel dgos pazhig bcas rigs gnyis yod}
rta ring|{'don pa'i sgra gdangs ring po}
rta la rgal rma mi bzo na sga la rgal rma'i dpe|{rta la rgal rma ma bzos nas sga la rgal rma bzo ba gtan nas mi srid pa de dper bkod pa}
rta lam gong ma|{po ta la'i pho brang gi rgyab ngos su ri gnas nas stag sgo'i 'khris bar rta bzhon nas 'gro sa yod pa de la tA la'i bla ma dang/srid skyong/blon chen/ho thog thu sogs rta bzhon nas de'i bar du phebs chog pa de la rta lam gong ma zer zhing/de min gyi dpon rigs/ser 'bras dge gsum gyi mkhan po sprul sku sogs rta lam 'og ma yan la rta bzhon nas 'gro mi chog pa red}
rta lam sgor mo|{po ta 'i pho brang gi rgyab phyogs su dpon rigs rim pa mtho gras rnams rta zhon nas ri'i sked pa brgal tsam bar phyin rjes de yan la rta zhon nas 'gro mi chog par rang sar 'jog sa'i lcags re can gyi rdo gcal sgor mo zhig yod pa de'i ming}
rta so|{po ta la'i pho brang rgyab mdun g.yas g.yon gyi lam rgyud du yod pa'i bang rim can gyi rtsig pa}
rta so yan|{po ta la'i mdun gyi ri gsham pho brang nas du 'gro sa'i gzhung lam g.yas g.yon gyi mtha' yod pa'i bang rim can gyi rtsig pa}
rtag gcig rang dbang can|{rtag pa/che med gcig pu/rgyu rkyen la ma ltos pa'i rang dbang can bcas yin}
rtag gcig rang dbang can gyi bdag|{spyir bdag tu 'dzin pa de la bdag 'dzin lhan skyes dang kun brtags gnyis las/shes bya rig pa'i gnas la sbyangs pa gang yang mi byed pa'i skye 'gro mtha' nas grogs 'bur yan rnams la dus skabs thams cad du ngam ngam shugs kyis nga zhes shar ba de bdag 'dzin lhan skyes yin zhing/nga de'i don du las sna tshogs pa bsags pa las nga zhes pa de'i ngo bo la blo dpyad pa gang yang mi byed/gzhan sde rnams ni tshe 'di tsam gyis chog pa'i 'jig rten pa de rnams la ltos nas blo gros kyi rtsal shin tu che ste/rang rang gi ston pa dang deng gsungs pa'i lung rigs gang rung la bsten nas bcings grol gyi gzhir gyur ba'i bdag de yi btags don btsal nas nga zhes bya ba de ci 'dra zhig 'dug snyam nu btsal te mthar phyi rol mu stegs kyi lta ba'i gtso bo rtag gcig rang dbang can gyi bdag grub par 'dod pa de la bdag 'dzin kun btags zhes bya ba yin no/_/de yang skye 'jig med pa'i cha nas rtag pa/cha shas la ma ltos pa'i cha nas gcig pu/rang skya bar grub pa'i cha nas rang dbang can zhes khyad par gsum dang ldan pa'i bdag grub par 'dod do/_/de dag zhib tsam bshad na/phyi rol pa rnams kyis phung po ni 'dus byas mi rtag par 'dod kyang/bdag ni sngar mthong ba nyid da ltar ngo shes par rlom pa dang skye ba snga phyi rgyud nas 'gro ba sogs kyis rtag par 'dzin pa dang/phung po rnams gzugs dang tshor ba la sogs pa'i cha shas du ma las grub kyang bdag ni cha shas gang la yang ma ltos par gcag pur gnas par 'dzin pa dang/phung po rnams ni rgyu rkyen dang skye 'jig gi gnas dbang can yin par 'dod kyang/bde ni rgyu rkyen sogs la ma ltos par nga'o zhes tshugs thub tu grub pa'i rang dbang can du 'dzin pa yin/rtag gcig rang dbang can gyi bdag de la khyad pa yin/rtag gcig rang dbang can gyi bdag de la khyab chos gsum ldan kyi bdag cas kyang zer ro/_}
rtag chad|{rang sems de rang nyid phung po gzhan dag gang la yang ltos mi dgos par rang tshugs thub pa'i rtags mthal dang/lus 'jig na sems kyang rgyud chad par lta bas na chad mtha'o/_}
rtag chad kyi mtha'|{med pa yod par 'dzin pa'i rtag pa'i mtha' dang/yod pa med par 'dzin pa'i chad pa'i mtha' gnyis so/_/dang po ni dper na/bde par grag pa'i chos cig kyang med bzhin du chos rnams rang ngos nas bden par grub par 'dzin pa lta bu/gnyis ni dper na/tha snyad du ming rgyan btags pa tsam zhig yod bzhin du chos thams cad gtan med du 'dod pa lta bu'o/_}
rtag chad kyi mtha' spangs lugs bcu|{'dus byas thams cad skad cig gis 'jig pas rtag pa'i mtha' spong la/rdul phra rab che med bden par grub pas chad pa'i mtha' spong ngo/_/mdo da bas rgyun rnams kyi rang rang gi ngo bo 'gag pas rtag pa'i mtha' spong la/rang dang rjes su mthun pa'i 'bras bu 'byin pas chad pa'i mtha' spong ngo/_/sems tsam pas kun brtags ring bzhin med pas rtag pa'i mtha' spong la/gzhan dbang bden par grub pas chad pa'i mtha' spong ngo/_/dbu ma pas ni rang bzhin spros pa dang bral ba'i rtag pa'i mtha' spong la/kun rdzob rten cing 'brel bar 'byung bas chad pa'i mtha' spong ngo/_/gzhan stong pas kun rdzob gzhan byung du gyur pa'i chos thams cad gdod nas ma grub pas rtag mtha' spong la/don dam rang byung mi 'gyur ba'i bde gshegs snying po gshis lugs su gnas par tshad mthar spong ngo/_}
rtag chad gnyis|{rtag lta'am/rtag mtha' dang/chad lta'am chad mtha'i ste/rtag mtha' ni chos thams cad rang rang gi rgyu'am rkyen lab rten nas byung ba min par yul kho rang gi steng nas tshur grub pa ni rtag pa'i mtha' dang de ltar du grub par 'dzin pa rtag lta yin la/chos thams cad gtan nas med pa ni chad mtha' dang/de ltar du grub par 'dzin pa ni nyan mtha' yin zhing/rtag chad kyi mtha' gnyis po de dang bral ba'i dbus la gnas pa ni dbu ma zer ba dang/dbu ma'i ltab dang stong nyid kyi lta ba rtogs zin na/rtags chad kyi mtha' gnyis gang la'ang 'jigs skrag bya mi dgos pa'o/_}
rtag chad mu bzhi|{yod par 'dzin pa/med par 'dzin/bdag tu 'dzin pa/dngos po mtshan ma can du 'dzin pa'o/_}
