stag phu 'jam dpal bstan pa'i dngos grub|{mtshan gzhan pad ma badzra ni rab byung bco lnga pa'i me byi (1876)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu gsum la 'bras spungs su chos zhugs mdzad nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bzhes gnang/dgung lo bcu dgu la nags shod gdan sar phyir phebs/dgung lo sum cu la dbus khul du gnas mjal la byon/dgung lo so dgu lor slar nga dgus ri bor bskor ba la phebs nas mya phug gu ru'i grub phug la bcad rgyar bzhugs skabs tshes nyer lnga nyin mkha' 'gro'i brda yig gi char lan gsum babs te/gu ru yab yum dang rje 'bangs nyer lnga'i zhal gzigs byung zhes khod pa dang de rjes pha bong kha byams pa bstan 'dzin mchog la gsang chos rgya can bcu gsum gyi dbang lung sogs gnang/dgung lo zhe gsum skabs gnang rdzong e wam lcog tu phebs skabs bshad sgra srid dpal gyi sgrub sde gsar bzhengs mdzad/bka' rtsom yang (gar gyi dbang phyug pa'i 'khrul 'byams gsang ba'i lo rgyus rgya can skor )zhes pa dang/(dpal stag pu'i gsang chos rgya can bcu gsum gyi smin byed dbang chog chu 'babs su bkod pa don gnyis 'bras bus brjid pa'i yongs 'du'i dbang po )zhes bya ba/(mchog dman mgron la bsang dang gser skyems 'bul tshul dang/'phrin las bcol/snyan dar smon tshig (sogs phyogs gcig tu bsdebs pa pod chung gnyis tsam mdzad/dgung lo zhe bdun la phebs pa rang byung bco lnga pa'i chu khyi (1922)lor sku gshegs}
stag phu sprul sku blo bzang chos kyi dbang phyug gam gar gyi dbang po|{yul nyang long kong gsum du grags pa'i bye brag nyang po'i gying phu g.yu lung zhes par yab phun tshogs bstan 'dzin dang/yum bde chen bu khrid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing bya (1765)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga pa paN chen dpal ldan ye shes kyis stag phu blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi sprul skur ngos 'dzin mdzad nas mtshan blo bzang chos kyi dbang phyug ces gsol te khri 'don mdzad/dgung lo bdun par bka' bcu blo bzang thabs mkhas slob dpon du bsten nas klog bslabs/dgung lo bcu gcig par dbus su phebs te rgyal dbang 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i drung du gtsug phud phul te mtshan blo bzang bstan 'dzin dbang phyug ces gsol/lo der de mo ngag dbang 'jam dpal bde legs rgya mtsho'i drung du dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/mes po kun dga' bstan 'dzin zhes pa las dkar nag rtsis dang gso rig sman dpyad la yang thugs gnyer mdzad/de nas dka' bcu bstan 'dzin shes rab dge rgan du bsten te bsdus grwa sogs sbyangs pa mdzad/dgung lo bcu bdun skabs dga' ldan brgyud dbus su phebs te dpal ldan 'bras spungs blo gsal gling gi chos grwar zhugs te mkhan po mu li blo bzang sbyin pa dang tre hor blo bzang bsam gtan rnam gnyis dge rgan du bsten nas gzhung chen la gsan sbyong mdzad/dgung lo bcu dgu la rgyal dbang 'jam dpal rgya mtsho mchog gi sku drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/rje drung blo bzang rab rgyas las lany+tsa dang wartu sogs kyi yig sna sbyangs brtson mdzad/sku tshe ring po ma bzhugs rung blo gros kyi mkhyen gter yangs pas gsung rtsom du ma mdzad yod pa ste/(dben gnas b+ho d+hi di pa'i gnas kya yon tan brjod pa'i gtam) (dga' ldan phyag rgya chen po'i man ngag las brtsams pa'i dris lan zab don/) (bstan srung dam can rgya mtsho'i ni bcol gter gtad mnga' gsol rten 'dzugs/) (rje btsun rdo rje rnal 'byor ma nA ro mkha' spyod pa'i sgo nas gshin po rjes su 'dzin pa'i cho ga /) (kun rig rnam par snang mdzad kyi cho ga shin tu bsdus pa/) (dpyod ldan mgu ba bskyed pa'i 'phrin yig gi rim pa/) (dpal ld