stag phu blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{mtshan gzhan blo gros rgya mtsho mchog ni kong stong nyang po rgya nang du gnubs kyi rigs su yab sngags 'chang dkon mchog snyan grags dang yum 'dzoms pa gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing rta (1714)lor 'khrungs/sku chung ngu'i dus do bo mgo'i bla zur chu mkhar sprul sku'i drung du dbu skar gtsug phud phul/btsan ngag dbang ye shes gsol/dgung lo lnga la chos 'don mkhas pa rdo rje rgyal mtshan gyi sar yi ge 'bri klog bslabs/dgung lo bcu gnyis la bsang ngo bo dgon gyi bla ma mdzad/dgung lo bcu gsum la stag phug ngag dbang chos grags kyi yang srid du ngos 'dzin zhus/dgung lo bco lnga la nyang po brag dkar lha chu'i dgon par zam mo'i ting nge 'dzin la sgrub pa rtse gcig tu bzhugs/dgung lo bcu drug la rgyud smad mkhan po ngag dbang mchog ldanapa mdo smad mgar mthar du rgyal ba bskal bzang rgya mtshor bka' chos 'bul bar phebs pa'i lam zhor du bar ma rab byung bsgrubs/mtshan ngag dbang blo gros rgya mtsho zhes bstsal/de lor nags shod stag phu ban dkar dgon du gdan drangs/rje yon tan dar rgyas bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/dgung lo bcu dgu la dbus su phebs nas 'bras spungs blo gsal gling du chos zhugs mdzad/dge bshes 'jam dbyangs phun tshogs dang/lho pa dge 'dun bde legs sogs bsten nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bzhes mdzad/de nas rgyal ba bskal bzang rgya mtsho dang/rtsa ba'i bla ma grub dbang 'jam dap+la rgya mtsho sogs bsten nas chos mang du gsan/dgung lo nyer brgyad lor rtsis skar nag sogs gsan/dgung lo nyer dgu la dbus su phebs nas rgyal dbang bskal bzang rgya mtsho dang/mi dbang bsod nams stobs rgyas sogs mjal/dgung lo sum cu la rgyal dbang bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/de lor nags shod du chibs bsgyur gyis rab brtan dgon sogs la gzhi gsum phyag len dang/mdo sngags kyi chos 'khor bskor/dgung lo drug lor sku mtshams su bzhugs/dgung lo bzhi bcu la dgus su phebs nas 'bras spungs su bka' chos mang du gnang/dgung lo zhe drug la rgyal dbang bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i gser stong la mchod 'bul mdzad phyir lha sar phebs/rje 'dis gsung rten bka' 'gyur sogs mang dag bzhengs/bka' rtsom la mtshon na/(rje btsun rdo rje rnal 'byor ma na ro mkha' spyod kyi rim gnyis zab mo'i nyams len bai DUr+ya zhun ma'i them skas/) ( lha mo 'od zer can gyi brgyud 'debs/) (byang chub kyi sems mnga' ba'i bya mgrin sngon zla ba'i rtogs pa brjod pa 'khor ba mtha' dag la snying po med par mthong ba rnams kyi rna rgyan/) (dpal ye shes kyi mgon po legs ldan beng chen 'dzin gtor la brten nas rgyun gyi nyams len bya tshul )sogs pod chung gnyis tsam mdzad/dgung lo zhe dgu la phebs pa rab byung bcu gsum pa chu rta (1762)lor sku gshegs}
