stag brag ngag dbang gsung rab|{stag brag khri sprul gsum pa ngag dbang gsung rab mthu stobs bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan ni lha sa'i nub ngos shun grong chung (stod lung bde chen rdzong gnas chung grong rdal khongs grong chung gong tsho )gzhis ka zhes par yab kha tshar ba nang ma go Sha (mtshan dngos gang yin ma shes )dang yum tshe brtan sgron ma gnyis kyis grong chung gzhis ka bogs mar bzhes skabs rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing khyi (1874)lor sku 'khrungs/stag brag sprul sku sku phreng gsum par ngos 'dzin zhus nas 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang du chos zhugs mdzad de 'don chos 'dzin skyor dang/gzhung chen bka' pod lnga gsan sbyong brgal brtags mdzad nas dgung grangs sum cu'i yas mas su rams dam bca' mdzad nas skabs der lha rams pa'i dge bshes ang dang po thob/sgo mang 'bul bsdus rin po che blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan dang/phur lcog byams pa rgya mtsho sogs mkhas grub dum yongs 'dzin du bsten nas mdo sngags kyi gsung rab rgya mtsho lta bur gsan sbyong dang nyams bzhes mdzad/rab byung bcu drug pa'i me yos (1927)lo tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i bka' bzhin po ta la'i zhor la par khar du bka' 'gyur par shing gsar brko'i zhu dag gi thugs 'gan bzhes/lcags rta (1930)lo mtshan zhabs gnang/chu bya (1933)lo tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa sku gshegs pa'i sku gdung gdung chog dang/gser gdung dge legs 'dod 'jo'i thig tshad zhugs khang gi ldebs sa sogs gsar bzhengs kyis gtso 'gan bzhes/sa yos (1939)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu bzhi pa'i yongs 'dzin gzhon pa dang/lcags sbrul (1941)lor rgyal tshab rwa sgreng dgongs zhu mdzad tshab chab srid skyong thog yongs 'dzin bgres pa gnang ste tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu bzhi par rab byung sdum pa dang mtshan nyid/sngags kyi skor rnams 'bul gnang mdzad/stag brag bsam gtan gling ri khrod nyams gso dang rgya skyed thems gsum gnang ste grwa grangs brgya dang nyer lnga 'phar bsnon gnang/lcags stag (1950)lo srid skyong zur nas stag brag bsam gtan gling du gtan bzhugs mdzad mur chu 'brug (1952)lor dgung grangs bdun cu don dgu bzhes pa'i lo de'i bod zla 11pa'itshes 30nyin dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
stag btsan gdong gzigs|{chos rgyal khri srong lde btsan gyi blon po/'phrul blon mdzangs mi bdun gyi bdun pa/'dis 'bangs mi khyim re la rta re dang/mdzo re/ba re/glang re la sogs pa gnyer skyong byed dgos pa'i gtan 'bebs bzos shing/dbyar kyi dus su rtswa sngon po brngas te bskams nas dgung dus kyi phyugs gsos gsog 'jog byed dgos pa'i lam srol btsugs nas 'brog las thon spel gyi bya bar dmigs bsal gyi byas rjes bzhag yod/de bzhin khong gis skabs de'i ban bon gnyis dbar gyi grub mtha'i rtsod gleng dza drag chen po der bar dum mdzad nas bden rdzun gyi phu thag gcod par byed pa'i ban de kun gyi kha 'dzin dpang por bzhag ces lo rgyun yig tshang du gsal}
stag rtse mi dbang|{stag rtse mi dbang lha rgyal rab brtan ni bod rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa khyi (1718)lo nas lcags byi (1720)lo bar bod kyi srid skyong gnang zhing (mi dbang rtogs brjod )nang khong ni rang bzhin bzang la gya gyu med pa/phyogs ris chung ba/rang gshis bzang po ji bzhin gzhan la de ltar yin pas bsam bzang po ji bzhin gnas la de ltar yin par bsam mkhan zhig yin la/dgung grangs kyang mtho bas zhabs gom 'phyor ba dang gsung sgros sgra mi gsal ba sogs bgres nyams shin tu che ba zhig yin pa de jun gar bas bod du dbang sgyur byas rjes dbang med srid skyong gi ming btags/jun gar bas tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i gser sdong dang/dbus gtsang khul gyi gdon sde gling bcu gsum zhes pa rnams bshigs par brtsams pa na stag rtse mi dbang gis thabs shes kyis srung skyob gnang ba dang/dga' ldan sgrub mchod slar gso'i mthun rkyen gnang ba sogs mdzad/jun gar gyi dbang bsgyur skabs lha bzang khang gi sras sur ya bros 'gro skabs stag rtse'i mi ser rnams jun gar bar 'jigs nas sur ya bzung ste jun gar bar rtsis sprad pa de rjes su jun gar pham nas bros rjes don de stag rtse mi dbang gis byas pa red zer ba'i nyes ming byung nas gong ma'i khrims nyes phog ste bkrongs}
stag rtse rdzong gi mkhar shul|{stag rtse grong tsho'i shar ngos ri sne'i steng du gyang gog chen po zhig yod pa de phag gru'i dbang bsgyur skabs rdzong chen bcu gsum brtsigs pa'i gras kyi bye ri stag rtse rdzong zhes pa de yin pa dang/bde chen grong tsho'i rgyab kyi ri steng du mkhar shul zhig yod pa de yang bde chen brag dkar rdzong zhes phag gru'i dus su brtsigs pa'i rdzong chen zhig yin 'dug /bde chen rdzong rtser rje tsong kha pa dang/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa sogs phebs pa'i lo rgyus yod la phyis su rdzong mkhar rnams zhig ral du song yang bde chen rtser rgyal po sku lnga'i mgon khang zhig yod}
stag tshang lo tsA ba shes rab rin chen|{snar thang lo tsA ba sang+ga shri'i dngos slob 'di nyid yab don grub rgyal po dang yum lha mo skyabs zung gi sras su rab byung bdun pa'i shing bya (1405)lor sku bltams/mtshan dkon mchog skyabs su gsol/dgung lo bdun pa la yi ge 'bri klog mkhas par mkhyen/slob dpon gzhan du byon skabs yig phrug rgan gzhon bco lnga skor gyi slob dpon mdzad thub/dgung grangs nyi shu bar yab yum gyi dgongs pa bskang phyir phral phral rab tu ma byung na yang/de'i lo mjug seng ge rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po'i drung du rab tu byung/ka ri ka lnga bcu pa sogs mdo phyogs la sbyangs pa mdzad de bshad pa yang brtsams/de nas chos 'khor ba yab sras kyi drung du mdo phyogs kyi chos thams cad legs par gsan zhing/sngags kyi dkyil chog dum dang/thig rtsi la sbyangs pa mdzad pas mkhas pa chen po rnams la yang dgag sgrub dum mkhyen pa byung/de nas 'bras spungs dgon du 'jam dbyangs bkra shis dpal ldan la mdo phyogs mang du gsan cing grwa skor gzhung shin tu mang ba mdzad/grwa skor gyi tshe yang chos 'brel zhu mkhan mang du byung/yang res rje byams sems pa'i drung du lam 'bras dus 'khor sogs gsang sngags kyi chos tshul mang du gsan/sems dpa' chen po skad gnyis smra ba thugs rje dpal bzang po'i drung du phebs nas snga dro ka lA pa dang phyi dro tsun+d+ra pa'i bstan bcos tshugs/rig gnas 'di la snga mo'i bag chags ma gtogs sku tshe 'dir thugs rtogs ma chug cing/yig cha dkon pa dang/rnam rgyal 'joms/dus 'khor sogs sngags du ma'i skad dod sbyor ba dang/yig rigs du ma mkhyen yar gar yang ma phyin pa ltar bur song/yig cha thams cad thun par la bris/shog las mtshan mo mdzad/tsha dra'i bar la gzhung bzung/srod tho rangs skyong ran mdzad pas shin tu bsnyel ba byung yang rags rim thugs su chud/slar lo chen chos 'khor du spyan drangs/tha snyad rigs gnas lnga char yongs su rdzogs par gsan cing mkhyen/bo dong paN chen dang mjal nas gsung chos mang du gsan/de nas chos 'khor gyi gdan sar phebs/'khor lo gsum gyi mdzad pas yul ring du bstan pa bskyangs/nang du ting 'dzin zab mol brtson par mdzad/dgung grangs nga gcig la shing phag (1455)lor dus 'khor spyi don brtsams/mdo sngags kyi bstan bcos mang du mdzad cing/rig gnas kun shes kyi 'grel sogs dus ma ljags rtsom dang/ldeb sbyor rin chen 'byung gnas sogs 'gyur yang mang po mdzad/thugs sras la yang/'ug tshang rin po che dang/slob dpon 'dul 'dzin smon mo/rta nag rab 'byams pa shes rab chos 'byor/slob dpon dkar bcu pa skyes rgyal 'phel/se ra ba blo gros seng ge/zha lus ba blo gros seng ge /dwags po blo gros mtha' yas/khyad par slob ma'i mchog ni zha lu lo chen yin no/_/('das lo ma rnyed/)}
stag gzig|{gong du ta zig nor gyi rgyal po zhes par gsal}
stag gzig spungs yig|{gna' rabs kyi bod yig yig gzigs shig ste zhang zhung gi smar yig kyang stag gzig spungs yig la dpe byas nas byung bar grags}
stag ri gnyan gzigs|{(stag bu snya gzigs zhes pa'ang snang )bod rgyal so gcig pa/yab 'brong gnyan lde thog mar btsas skabs dmus long zhig yin pas mtshan yang dmus long dkon pa bkra zhes gsol/yab kyi zhal chems bzhin 'di nyid kyi 'a zha'i yul nas sman pa gdan drangs te spyan phye skabs skyid shod stag mo ri la ri dwags gnyan 'dug pa gzigs pas mtshan yang rtag ri gnyan gzigs su thogs/khri ngor snang btsan mong/sna nam mang gnya'/sbrang ri zung lan pa rnams kyis blon po byas/ra sangs khri ne khod kyis sku bon byas/stong btsun 'bro dkar ram 'ol god bzang stong btsun 'bro ga khab tu bzhes/rgyal po 'dis ban pa rje dang/'a zha rje/drang gar rje/zing po rje/zhang zhung rje rnams btul nas mnga' 'og tu 'du bar byas/rgyal po 'di'i dus su 'phrul blon mdzangs mi bdun gyi gsum pa ngor snang btsan mong gis tshong las dang 'jal byed bre srang sogs gsar du gtod/rgyal po 'di ni dbu rmog btsan la snyan grags che ba zhig byung/rgyal po 'di'i dgung gi bang so don mkhar mda' ru brtsigs pa dang/gral ni khri gzung bang so'i g.yon na yod/de yang phul med sa phung brdal ba 'dra}
stag ri seng ri mjug ma sbrel ba|{bod kyi lo rgyus thog bshad srol la/lha sa grong khyed nang dmar po ri spyan ras gzigs kyi bla ring glang po che bres la nyal ba lta bu de'i steng du rgyal po'i pho brang bzhengs nas lags pa bzhin da lta'i po ta la pho brang chags pa'i ri 'di yin pa dang/phyag na rdo rje'i bla ri seng ge gnam du ma tshang ba 'dra ba zhes pa ni yongs grags su ljags po rir 'bod pa 'di yin cing/'jam dpal dbyangs kyi bla stag mo khung du 'dzul ba lta bu ni yongs grags su bar ma ri ste ming ngo ma mar bong ba ri zhes 'bod pa 'di yin/rgya bza' cin khren kong jos stag ri dang seng ri gnyis kyi mjug ma sbrel ba de bcas ces (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang 'khod pa ltar na/lcags po ri dang bong ba ri gnyis kyi mjug brel ba de bcas pa der go dgos pas brag sgo ka }(1494){ Ni'i lo rgyus bshad srol dang mi mthun pas dpyad par zhu}
stag ri seng ri'i bar ka|{ }(1494){ Nis sbrel ba gna' rabs bod kyi ngag rgyun thog bshad srol la/brag sgo ka }(1494){ Ni mchod rten 'di ni de sngon rgya bza' cin khren kong jos sa dpyad nyams su 'jug ched seng ge gnam mchong 'dra ba'i ljags po ri dang glang po che bres la nyal ba 'dra ba'i dmar po ri gnyi sa kyi mjug ma sbrel ba bcad/rjes su sras khri srong lde btsan gyis rang nyid skyes pa'i yum rgya bza' yin par khas len gnang ste rgyal khab rgya bzar thob pa'i dbang gis ri 'di gnyis kyi mjug ma sbrel ba bcad pa'i nyams gso'i ched du ri sna gnyis kyi bar mchod rten 'di bzhengs pa yin zhes zer rgyun 'dug /lo rgyus yig cha khag mang po'i nang/ri sna gnyis mjug ma sbrel ba bcad pa'i ri ni stag ri ste yongs grags su bar ma rir 'bod pa de dang/seng ri ni lcags po ri yin par gcig mthun byung bas gang yin brtag dgos}
stag lung bka' brgyud|{phag gru'i slob ma stag lung thang pa bkra shis dpal ('di'i lo rgyus mdor bsdus gsham du stag lung thang pa bkra shis dpal zhes par gzigs (gyis po to ba'i bzhugs shul du dgon pa btab/de nas bzung stag lung bka' rgyud ces pa byung bar grags}
stag lung chos rje ngag dbang grags pa|{rje 'di nyid rab byung bdun pa'i sa khyi (1418)lor sku bltams/rje gang gis sku chung dus nas skyes bu dam pa mang po'i zhabs la gtugs nas pha rol du phyin pa dang/rgyud sde/sgrub brgyud kyi gdams pa mang du gsan/khyad par gtsang phyogs la byon nas thams cad mkhyen pa chos kyi rgyal po la sogs pa'i skyes chen dam pa mang dub sten nas zab chos du ma gsan/dpal mo chos sding dang la phyi la sogs pa'i gnas mang por bzhugs/snyan pa'i grags pa phyogs thams cad du khyab/dgung lo bzhi bcu zhe bzhi bzhes pa lcags sbrul (1461)lor stag lung gi gdan sar phebs/nang gi mkhyen pa dang thugs dam thams cad 'gran zla bral zhing/gtsug lag khang chen po'i zhabs tog 'dzin tshugs thams cad khyad par du 'phags par mdzad/dge 'dun gyi sde chen po dar rgyas su gyur/dpal stag lung thang pa'i 'jig rten phyogs kyang chos rje rin po che 'di'i sku ring kho nar dar rgyas che/sde snod 'dzin pa ji snyed zhabs drung du lhags pa na man pa'i gting mi dpogs par zhum/'bral gyi mdzad spyod rnams thar yang shin tu bzang/lha chen bzhengs pa dang sbyin gtong rgya chen mdzad pa sogs 'phrin las bsam gyis mi khyab pa byung nas chu sbrul (1473)lor chos rje bkra shis dpal ba gdan sar bkod nas kun spang mdzad de zhabs brtan par bzhugs/dgung lo bdun cu don dug la phebs pa rab byung brgyad pa'i me 'brug (1496)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
stag lung chos rje rat+na ka ra|{rje 'di nyin yab thugs rje skyabs dang yum gzungs lcam gnyis kyi sras su rab byung lnga pa'i lcags byi (1300)lor sku 'khrungs/mkhan chen bsodanams ye shes dang slob dpon sangs rgyas bzang po las rab tu byung/mtshan rin chen 'byung gnas su gsol/mkhan chen shes mgon pa dang blon dpon bsod nams dbang phyug pa sogs las bsnyen par rdzogs/sa skyar byon nas bla ma bdag nyid chen po dang bla chen kun blo la sogs dang/dpang lo tsA ba/'jam dbyangs don yod pa/chos rje bsod nams rgyal mtshan rnams kyi drung nas zab chos mang du gsan/de nas jo mo nang du phebs nas byang sems rgyal ye las sbyor drug gi khrid dang/sems 'grel skor rnams yongs su rdzogs par gsan pas ting nge 'dzin gyi sgo phye/de nas stag lug du byon te rat+na gu ru'i drung du bka' brgyud kyi chos ma lus pa gsan/dgung grangs bzhi bcu la phebs pa ram byung ga pa'i sa yos (1339)lor stag lung gi gdan sar phebs/lha chen rgyab mtho nyi shu rtsa gcig pa dang/gser 'bum mtho nyi shu yod pa dang bstan 'gyur sogs bzhengs/rgyud sde dang sde snod kyi bshad pa btsugs/chos drug /lam 'bras/sbyor drug la sogs pa'i khrid rnams btab/bla ma gong ma rnams kyi bca' khrims bzhin gdan sa bskyangs/dgung lo drug cu re gnyis la phebs par rab byung drug pa'i lcags glang lo (1361)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
stag lung chos rje rat+na gu ru|{rje 'di nyin yab thugs rjes skyabs dang yum gzungs lcam gyi sras su rab byung lnga pa'i sa byi (1288)lor g.yang shod bong ra stengs la sku 'khrungs/mkhan chen bsodanams ye shes pa dang slob dpon seng bzang pa las rab tu byung/dgung lo bcu drug pa la 'jam dbyangs rin chen rgyal mtshan las chos mang du gsan/dgung lo bcu dug pa la dbus su byon/rin po che sangs rgyas dpal bzang po'i drung du kyai rdor dang/bde mchog gshin rje dgra nag gdon drug la sogs pa'i bka' lung mang po dang/nA ro chos drug la sogs pa'i chos bzhugs pa thams cad gsan/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gcig la phebs pa rab byung lnga pa'i sa bya (1309)lor rin po che chos rjes dpal bzang pos rje rat+na gu ru stag lung gdan sar bzhugs su gsol/lo der sa skyar byon nas 'jam dbyangs rin chen rgyal mtshan dang/grags pa rgyal mtshan/kun dga' seng ge rnams bsten nas chos mang du gsan/de nas rje kun spangs pas mkhan po dang/bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyis slob dpon/kun mkhyen yon tan rgya mtshos gsang ste mdzad pas bsnyen par rdzogs/kun spangs pa'i drung du dus 'khor gyi dbang chen mo/sbyor drug la sogs pa gdams pa dpag tu med pa gsan/yon tan khyad par can 'khrungs/de nas lcags khyi (1310)lor phyir phebs/gser bum bzhengs pa la sogs pa'i bya ba rgya chen mdzad/dgung lo lnga bcu nga gnyis la phebs pa rab byung drug pa'i sa yos (1339)lor zhi bar gshegs}
stag lung thang pa bkra shis dpal|{'di ni phag gru'i slob ma khams pa mi gsum zhes pa'i gras yin/'khrungs yul ni mdo stod ku g.yung sgang gi nang tshan g.yang nga g.yang shod du 'bod pa der yab klu dge shan blon dang yum shing bzang dge gsum phro mo zhes pa'i sras su rab byung gnyis pa'i chu khyi (1142)lor sku 'khrungs/rab byung bzhi pa'i sa 'brug (1208)lor sku gshegs/dgung lo drug cu re bdun bzhugs/dgung lo chung dus nas chos sgor zhugs te rab byung gnang 'dod yod kyang yab kyi gnang ba ma thob/yab dang ma yar sogs kyis thabs shes sna tshogs kyi sgo nas khyim du bzhugs par bskul yang ma gsan par dgung lo bco brgyad pa la mkhan po lha khang pa shes rab rdo rje dang/slob dpon mtshar ston sgo mang pa gnyis kyi drung du dge bsnyen dang/dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan la bkra shis dpal zhes gsol/dge bshes bra gdon pa'i drung du bzhugs nas/phar phyin dang/dbu ma/gsang sngags skor mang po gsan/lhag par du khong gis 'gro mgon phag mo grub pa'i khyad chos dang bstod bsngags mang po gsan pa tsam gyis dad pa cher skyes nas phag mo grub pa'i dngos slob dge bshes rmog chos blo'i drung du phebs nas 'khor lo bde mchog gi dbang dang/phyag chen gyi khrid sogs phag gru bka' brgyud kyi chos skor mang po gsan/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa bzhi pa shing bya lor rang yul du bzhugs pa'i rtsa ba'i bla ma rnams la phyi phyag mdzad nas dbus su phebs/'gro mgon phag mo gru pa mjal ba nas bzung bla mar bstan nas bka' gnang ba ltar phag mo gru pa sku ma gshegs par lo mang po'i ring nye gnas kyi 'gan bzhes gnang bas slob ma'i nang nas bla ma la mos gus mthar phyin pa stag lung thar pa zhes grags pa byung zhing/bla mas chos gang gsung ba rnams tshig 'bru gcig tsam yang mi brjed par thugs la 'dzin thub pa'i mkhyen rab gyi rtsal phul du yin pa zhig yin cing bla ma'i nye gnas mdzad bzhin pa'i ngang nas gnas lugs stong pa nyid kyi don mngon sum du rtogs te/bla mas chos kyi bdag por mnga' gsol nas man ngag thams cad yongs su rdzogs pa gnang/dgung lo nyer dgu pa lcags stag lor 'gro mgon phag mo grub pa gshegs rjes dgongs rdzogs mchod 'bul dang/gdung rten bzhengs rgyu sogs mthil phyin pa grub/de nas dgung lo so brgyad la ma phebs bar lo mang po'i ring seng gling sogs gnas nges med du sku mtshams dam por bzhugs/dgung lo so dgu par rab byung gsum pa'i lcags byi (1180)lor dar spras rong gsum nang 'khrug byung ba'i rkyen gyis 'dum 'grig la gdan drangs pa ltar phebs nas 'dum 'grig legs par mdzad pas kho tsho so so'i lung par spyan drangs nas yum gzhis longs spyod thams cad stag lung bka' brgyud 0du grags pa byung/gsung rtsom skor/sku gzhon dus su ljags rtsom mdzad pa mang che ba kha thor du song nas phyogs bsgrigs ma thub kyang/sku ma gshegs bar du ljags rtsom gnang ba gang rten rnams stag lung zhabs drung ngag dbang rnam rgyal gyis phyogs bsgrigs gnang ba ste dad ldan gyi skye bo yid ches par byed pa rnam thar dang lo rgyus skor dang/rtsa ba'i bla ma'i bka' drin dran pa'i gdung dbyangs gsol 'debs kyi skor/sdom pa gsum dang lam rim skor/dge 'dun sde khag la gnang ba'i bca' yig skor/bslab bya dang 'phrin yig gi skor/gsang sngags kyi sgrub thabs skor/gsang sngags kyi khrid skor/zhal gdams dang mgur ma sna tshogs kyi skor bcas sde tshan brgyad du phye ba'i pod che ba lnga tsam yod/lo rgyus rgyas pa (lho rong chos 'byung )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 717nas shog grangs 765bar/stag lung zhabs drung ngag dbang rnam rgyal gyis mdzad pa'i (stag lung chos 'byung ngo mtshar rgya mtsho )bcas su gsal bas de rnams su gzigs}
stag lung pa|{stag lung thang pa chenapo bkra shis dpal bas rab byung gsum pa'i lcags byi (1180)lo la stag lung gi dgon pa btab ste gnas gzhi bzung zhing/dar spras rong gsum dbang du bsdus pas gtsug lag khang gnyis kyi bdag por gyur/tA ming yung lo rgyal pos stag lung chos rje bkra shis dpal brtsegs la dbang gi 'ja' sa sprad cing/'di pa rje tsong kha pa dang dus mtshungs/dbon po chos rje bkra shis dpal 'byor las tshong kha pa las chos zhus te slob mar gyur thog /dge lugs pa dang 'brel ba bzang/de'i dbon chos rje ngag dbang grags pa dang/hor khang pa tshe dbang grags pa spun mched kyis dus stag lung pa'i chos brgyud dar rgyus byung ba ma zad/srid kyi phyogs nas stobs 'byor che ba dang rten bzhengs rgya che/de la dbon po bkra shis dpal ba dang/gcung bsod nams grags pa gnyis byung ba'i thog mar gcen po la gan sa gdan rkyen med par gcung la gdan sa gtad cing/rjes su slar yang gcung gdan sar yod pa la rtsod pa chen po bslangs ('di sngar stag lug pa rnams snga gong sangs rgyas yar yon gyi dbon po bkra shis bla ma dang sangs rgyas dpal ba gnyis gdan sa su thob la rtsod pa'i le lan yin zer/) gcung bsod nams rgas pa gshegs nas gcen po sku spangs bkra shis dpal ba nyid stag lung gi gdan sar yun ring bzhugs shing/lha chen bzhengs pa dang/ri bo che'i dgon pa btab pa sogs chos srid gnyis ka'i thad nas stobs che bar gyur/stag lung pa la yang thag ga stag mchog ma yod cing/'bri gung pa dang stag lung pa stobs shugs che mnyam du yod pa la stag lung pa'i zhal ngo cig gis chu rta lo la thog kha nas so'i dmag dpung 'phan yul du drangs pa'i sna 'khrid mkhas byas pa'i rkyen gyi sne gdong sde srid dang cung zad ma mthun par gyur/'di'i khog lon pa lta bur tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtsho'i dus phag mo ba nas dpung bteg te snyong rgyug gi sde rnams blangs/de'i lan du thog kha ba dang mnyam 'grel byas te phag mo bar dmag drangs te snyong rgyug gi sde tshur thob na'ang thog kha nang so'i gzhan dang du song nas ser dmag snga rjes kyi dus su thog kha'i rjes su 'brang dgos pa dang/'bring gung pa dang gdan sa mthil 'khrug pa'i skabs la gnas bzod mi bde ba mang du byung zhes grags/(deb ther dmar po gsar ma )shog grangs 67las gsal}
stag lung mang+gal gu ru|{'di nyid rang byung bzhi pa'i lcags yos (1231)lor yab chos yags kyi sras su 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu drug pa la mkhan po thang skya ba dang slob dpon mkhas pa grags bzang po las rab tu byung/mkhas slob las 'dus ba dang/lam sgron/jo bo rje nas brgyud pa'i chos mang du gsan/bla ma mkhas grub chen po lar lam lnga'i bshad pa dang/man ngag gi go rim pa mang po/bshad brgyud/snyan brgyud/dbang byin rlabs kyi bka' sogs mang du zhus/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa lnga la dbus su byon/de nas mkhan po thang dkar ba 'od zer 'byung gnas/slob dpon mkhan dpon pa rin chen bkra shis sogs las bsnyen par rdzogs/sangs rgyas yar byon gyi drung du nA ro'i chos drug dang phyag rgya chen po la sogs gdams pa mang du zhus nas lo bcu drug ring sku mtshams dam par mdzad de rtag tu bsam gtan la mnyam par bzhag pas ting nge 'dzin bsam gyis mi khyab pa rnyed nas ro gcig gi sgom thugs la 'khrungs/de nas 'gro mgon 'phags pa dang mngal nas byin rlabs sgrub thabs dang bka' lung mang po zhus/dgung lo zhe gsum la phebs pa chu bya (1273)lor stag lung gi gdan sar phebs/stong gsum zil gnon gyi thub pa'i sku chen po bzhengs/shar sgo'i nang du gyang ris dang/lder sku rnams bzhengs pa sogs mdzad/lo nyi shu rtsa lnga'i bar du gdan sar bzhugs/mthar dgung lo re bdun bzhes pa rab byung lnga pa'i me bya (1297)lor sku gshegs}
