stod kyi stong sde drug cu re gcig|{sde sde mtshams gnyis com pa 'bre mtshams gnyis/phyugs mtshams mtshams gnyis/skyid stod skyid smad gnyis/spel bar stong bu chung sku srung shar phyogs pa dang bcu ni dbu ru'i sde bcu/yar lung 'phying lung gnyis/yar mtshams g.yu 'bangs gnyis/dwags po nyag nyi gnyis/dmyal dang lho brag gnyis/lo ro stung bu chung sku srung byang phyogs pa rnams g.yo ru'i stong sde bcu/stong chen shangs chen gnyis/la mi phod dkar gnyis/nyen gang 'bras mtshams gnyis/sbo rab gzong sde gnyis/shangs stong bu chung sku srung nub phyogs pa rnams g.yas ru'i stong sde bcu/mang kar khri phom gnyis/grong ma lha rtse gnyis/mtsho ngos stong bu chung sku srung lho phyogs pa ste ru lag gi stong sde bcu/(bod dang gru gu'i mtshams na )'o co mang ma gnyis/gnye ma tsa mo gnyis/phag stong bu chung sde zhang zhung stod nyid kyi stong lde lnga/(bod dang sum ba'i mtshams na )gu ge cog pa gnyis/spyi gtsang yar gtsang gnyis/ci de stong bu chung sde zhang zhung smad kyi stong sde lnga ste zhang zhung gi stong ste bcu/rtse mthon po 'thon gnyis/rgod tshang rgod smad gnyis/'jong stod 'jong smad gnyis/dre stod dre smad gnyis/kha ro kha zangs gnyis/nags shog stong bu chung ste sum pa'i ra stong khyab rgya ldan gyi stong sde bcu gcig go /de rnams la rgod kyi stong sde zer don ni 'bangs rab tshan dmag gi las byed pa'i ming yin pa'o/_}
stod kyi gdung rgyud rgyal po mgon gsum|{dpal lde rig pa mgon gyis mang yul bzung/bkra shis lde mgon gyis spu hrengs bzung/lde gtsug mgon gyis gu ge bzung bar grags so/_}
stod kyi dpa' ba'i sde gsum|{stod zhang zhung dang gtsang nas thon pa'i dpa' sde gsum gyis gru gu la dmag drangs nas btul ba la zer}
stod rgyud|{gong du rgyud stod grwa tshang zhes par gzigs}
stod mnga' ris skor gsum|{mnga' ris sa gnas la khul gsum du phye nas spu hrengs/mang yul/zangs dkar gsum skor gcig dang/li/bru sha/sbal ti gsum skor gcig /zhang zhung/khri sde stod/khri sde smad gsum skor gcig bcas yin/mnga' ris zer ba'i go don ni rgyal po'i chab 'bangs zer ba ste/mnga' bdag dpal 'khor btsan 'bangs gyen log skabs bsad rjes de'i bu chung ba khri bkra shis brtsegs pa dpal dang/che ba skyid lde nyi ma mgon gnyis mnga' ris su bros shing/bkra shis brtsegs pa dpal gyis la stod khul du bsdad/skyid lde nyi ma mgon mnga' ris su song nas bu gsum (dpal lde rig pa mgon/bkra shis lde mgon/lde gtsug mgon )byung ba'i che ba dpal gyi rig pa mgon gyis la dwags bzung/de las la dwags kyi rgyal rgyud byung/'bring bkra shis lde mgon gyis spu hrengs bzung/chung ba lde gtsug mgon gyis zhang zhung bzung/de las gu gu bzung/de las gu ge rgyal rgyud (ya tshe'i rgyal rgyud )rnams byung/zhing pa'i gyen langs kyi rjes su srong btsan sgom po'i gdung rgyud kyis sa khul de gsum mgos nas dbang bsgyur byas pas de gsum gyi mnga' 'og gi 'bangs la mnga' ris zer/de la sa dbyings kyi thog nas bshad na spu hrengs gangs kyis bskor ba gcig /mang yul mtsho dang nags kyis bskor ba dang gnyis/zhang zhung g.ya' yis bskor ba dang gsum du phye ba'o/_}
stod 'brug pa'i khrid chen brgyad|{lam zab mos gus kyi khrid/phyag rgya chen po lhan cig skyes sbyor gyi khrid/thabs lam khyad par can gyi khrid/gsang spyod ldog sgom gyi khrid/dag snang zhing sbyong gi khrid/chos brgyad 'go snyoms kyi khrid/byams snying rje'i khrid/rgyu 'bras rten 'brel gyi khrid bcas so/_}
stod smad kyi dbang blon|{'di ni rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis bsam yas su btsugs pa'i bka' gtsigs rgyas pa (chos 'byung mkhan pa'i dga' ston )nang du yang de dag gcig mtshungs su gsal bas stod kyi dbang blon ni gtsang dang stod khul gyi spyi khyab phyi blon dang/smad kyi dbang blon ni mdo smad mnga' khul gyi spyi khyab phyi blon la zer ba yin nam snyam ste brtag }
stod gzhas|{stod gzhan ni gtso bo stod mnga' ris rgyud nas dar ba'i gzhan dang zhabs bro la ngos 'dzin pa dang de yang bod kyi dmangs khrod zhabs bro dang rol mo gcig tu 'dres pa zhig yin/stod gzhas dbus gtsang khul du dar tshul thad dmangs khrod gla gar sgyu rtsal pa dag dang stod kyi lha mo tshogs pa'i shugs rkyen chen po thebs yod/stong gzhas kyi thog ma'i nyams 'gyur ne zhabs bro rgyag skabs rkang pa'i 'debs 'jog che la shugs dang ldan pa yod pa ste skyes pa rnams kyi rtsa ba'i stangs stabs ni gzhu mo bkang nas mda' mo 'phen pa'i bzo dang/bud med rnams kyi rtsa ba'i stangs stabs ni spun bkal nas 'thag las byed pa'i bzo byed pa yin/stod gzhas 'di nyid lha sa khul du dar khyab byung rjes de'i thog ma'i nyams 'gyur la 'gyur ldog phran bu song ba ni stod gzhas kyi sgra gdangs 'gyur khug sogs la yul dus rjes 'brangs kyis dmangs khrod glu gar mkhas pa dag gis rim bzhin lha sa'i dmangs khrod glu gar gyi khyad chos dang bstun nas bsgyur bcos byas stabs lha sa khul du stod gzhan rgyag lugs ni zhabs bro rgyag skabs rkang pa'i 'degs 'jog yang sha dod la gar stabs nyams 'gyur mdzes pa/lus stod la 'khrug che med par lag 'khyer yang lus kyi pho la yan nas 'das mi chog pa sogs stod gzhas mkhas min ni zhabs bro rgyag skabs mgo bo'i steng du chang dkar yor gang bzhag ste chang rnams phyi la ma bor bar rgyag pa ni stod gzhan mkhas par brtsi ba yin/stod gzhan ni glu gzhas dang zhabs bro zur du sprel ba dang rol dbyangs kyi gdangs 'gyur pas pho mo gzhon dar rnams kyis stong gzhan rgyug rgyur dga' po byed pa ma zad/rgan byis gnyis kyis kyang stong gzhas rgyag rgyur dga' po byed pa yin/zhabs bro de rigs la lha sa'i sgra snyan zhabs bro'am zer/stod gzhas 'dir da dung rgyag lugs lho byang gnyis su dbye srol yod pa lho ni stod kyi lho rgyud du go zhing glu gar dar cing lhod la snyan 'jebs ldan pa dang/byang ni stod byang rgyud la snang bas gla gar dpa' nyams ldan zhing blo gshogs che la bag phebs pa bcas yod/de sngon dal gzhas zer ba la rgyang gzhas dang zhabs bro dang sbrags mgyogs gzhas gtong ba der 'khrug gzhas zhes rigs gnyis su dbye ba yin}
stod rims|{stong rim ni mi ya rabs can}
stod lung khri zam|{(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )sogs kyi nang stong lung mda'i chu 'gran khri dang khri'u steng du 'dug ste khrims bcad ces 'khod par gzhigs na srong btsan gyi sku dus su khul der khri'i steng du bsdad nas chad pa bcad pa dang/de rjes sa gnas der thog mar 'grim 'grul gyi zam pa zhig bskrun stabs dmangs khrod du khrims zab zer ba yang grags skad/dus rabs nyi shur pa'i ro rabs sum cu pa'i nang khri zam rnying pa der lo ltar chu skyon che bas yang yang nyams gso byed dgos stabs shun pa 'du spyi'i (gdong dkar rdzong 'og )mang tshogs la khral 'khri'i dka' ngal che bar brten/bod rang byung bcu drug pa'i me glang (1937)lor sa gnad gzhung nas dza sag tsha rong pa zla bzang dgra 'dul dang/mgron che thub bstan ngag dbang gnyis la las gra'i 'go 'dzin bsko gzhag gis phyi lugs lcags zam zhig gsar skrun byas pa de ni bod du ar 'dam gyi lcags zam thengs dang po yin pa dang de'i zam shul yang da lta bsdad yod/de'i khris su 1965lor mi dmangs srid gzhung nas ar 'dam gyi zab ma zhig gsar skrun gnang yod}
stod lung mda'|{deng sang gi stod lung bde chen rdzong yod sa}
stod lung pa rin chen snying po|{rje 'di nyid rab byung dang po'i chu sprel (1032)lor sku 'khrungs/rab byung gnyis pa'i chu lug (1103)lor stod lung btsan gro dgon pa phyag btab/tshogs pa sum brgya re btsam 'tshogs/dgung lo rgya lnga pa rab byung gnyis pa'i me sprel (1116)lor sku 'das}
stod lung 'bum mo che|{stod lung bde chen rdzong bde chen shang khongs kyi mig lung gi ri ldebs su stod lung 'bum mo che zhes mchod rten grags che tsam zhig yod pa der dge bshes spyan snga ba sogs bka' gdams pa'i bla ma gong ma'i byin rten gzungs bzhugs su yod skad la sa khul gang sa nas de gar phyag mchog dang bskor ba rgyag par yong mkhan mang po yod cing/de lta mchod rten der zhig gso byas zin pa ma zin/mang tshogs rnams kyi rgyus gtan phyag bskor byas yul zhig tu gyur yod}
stod lha rabs|{srid pa'i lha rabs nas gnya' khri btsan po yan chad lha'i brgyud pa yin pas na stod lha rabs zer}
ston chos|{ston kha'i chos thog zer ba'i bsdus ming/se 'bras dga' gsum sogs dgon pa khag la lo gcig gi nang dpyid ka dang/dbyar kha/dgung kha bcas dus tshos zla ba gcig yas mas ring chos lugs kyi slob sbyong bya rgyu'i dus tshod yin pas ston kha'i dus tshigs kyi slob sbyong la ston kha'i chos thog zer}
ston thog gi drug cha|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung (mngon pa mdzod )nas bshad srol la/bskal pa ya thog gi mjug tu sgril la dbang ba'i dpal 'byor lam shu byung ba'i rjes su spyi tshogs bde 'jags yod ched dmangs kyis rang mos thog dpon zhig 'debs bsko byes pa de la la dbang ba'i sa zhing gi stong 'bab khal re'i thog nas bre gsum dang phul gnyis (khal rer bri nyi shu tham pa dang bre gcig gi drug cu gcig yin pa'i dpyad khral sprod pa de la drug cu'i khral zer zhing/dpon po'i lam lugs byung ba dang dpya phral lam lugs byung ba dus mnyam yin zer}
ston pa|{phyi nang gi grub mtha'i khyad par 'byed chos gsum gyi ston pa ni p+saton pa spyi tsam pa der go zhing/de nas rang rang gi blor dpyad nas sdug bsngal las thar byed dang bde ba thob byed kyi 'dod tshul dang/de sgrub byed kyi gtan tshigs kyi rigs pa bkod pa'i gzhung sna tshogs brtsams pa la brten nas lam srol gsar du 'byed pa po der go}
ston pa dga' ldan nas gshegs|{sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das mi yul sku ma 'khrungs gong dga' ldan lha yul du lha yi bu dam pa tog dkar por la skye ba bzhes pa dang de nas sku mya ngan las 'das te mi yul du sku 'khrungs pa yin zhes bshad srol yod}
ston pa bla na med pa'i bstan pa|{spyir sangs rgyas thams cad thar pa dang thams cad mkhyen pa'i lam ston mkhan yin la/de'i nang nas shAkya thub pa ni/nang pa'i chos lugs pa spyi la drin che ba'i ston pa yin pas na ston pa bla na med pa zhes zer zhing/des bstan pa'i chos lugs sam lam srol la bstan pa zer/'di go don rags pa tsam gyi dbang du byas pa yin}
ston pa tsug sbed pa tsug byas pa|{be'u bum lag mthil tsam la thos bsam byas te/rang nyid mkhas par rlom nas phyed ston pa ltar byas/phyed sbas pa ltar byas pa'i don yin}
ston pa shAkya thub pa'i sku gzugs rigs lnga|{1 chos 'chad ma/2 bdud 'dul ma/3 mnyam bzhag ma/4 chu lon ma/5 grong gshegs ma dang lnga'o/_}
ston pa'i dgung mnyam|{sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das dang lo gcig gi nang du skyes pa'i skyes mo gcig pa yin pa'i don}
ston pa'i dgu lo brgyad pa'i sku tshad|{sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das dgung lo brgyad la phebs pa'i sku tshan sngar sangs rgyas sku bzhugs skabs bzo bo bi shwa karmas bzhengs te sangs rgyas kyis rab gnas mdzad/rgyal po srong btsan sgom pos bal bza' khri btsun btsun mor bzhes skabs yab rgyal pos rang gi sras mo bod du mna' mar byon pa'i rten skal du gnang/sngar 'phrul snang gtsug lag khang gi rten gtsor bzhugs pa rjes su srong btsan sku 'das nas mang srong btsan po'i dus ra mo cher gdan drangs nas jo bo rnam pa gnyis bzhugs yul brjes pa yin zhes lo rgyus mang por gsal}
ston pa'i dus chen rnam bzhi|{bod zla dang po cho 'phrul dus chen dang/bzhi pa sa ga zla ba/drug pa tshes bzhi/dgu pa lha babs bcas bzhi'o/_}
ston pa'i mdzad pa'i dus chen bzhi|{mngon par sangs rgyas/chos 'khor bskor ba/lha yul nas babs pa/cho 'phrul bstan pa}
ston zla tha chung|{'di rgya gar gyi skar rtsis pa'i lugs gzhir bzhag pa'i ston zla tha chung ste/bod dang hor lugs kyi zla ba bcu pa yin}
ston zla ra ba|{skar rtsis pa'i lugs ston zla ra ba ni bod zla brgyad pa'i yin pa dang/rgya nag pa'i 'byung rtsis lugs gyi ston zla ra ba ni bod zla lnga pa yin/de rnams rang rang gi yul du ston las 'go tshugs pa nas rtsi ba yin pas bod sa gnas las rgya nags babs dma' ba'i dbang gis nam zla bzhi'i dus tshod zla ba gsum res snga ba yod/skabs 'dir stong zla ra ba bod lugs zla ba brgyad pa yin cing/dus skabs de ni rtswa kha bzang zhing char char che chung snyoms pa/'o ma sha chang sogs 'bol po yod pas thag ring du 'gro ba'i 'grul pa 'gro bskyod kyi dus skabs bzang shos yin}
ston shid|{dga' spro'i ston mo dang mya ngan gyi shid chos byed pa'i ming}
stobs kyi 'khor los bsgyur ba'i rgyal po bzhi|{gser gyi 'khor lo can gyi rgyal po dang/dngul gyi 'khor lo can gyi rgyal po/zangs kyi 'khor lo can gyi rgyal po/lcags kyi 'khar lo can gyi rgyal po bcas bzhi las gser gyi 'khor lo can te gling bzhi char dbang byed de mi dge bcu spangs nas dge ba bcu la bkod pa/dngul gyi 'khor lo can te shar lho nub gsum gyi gling la dbang byed de rang nyid phar byon nas rim gyis bsnyen bkur sogs byed pa/zangs kyi 'khor lo can te shar lho'i gling gnyis la dbang byed de g.yul gsham pa'i tshul gyis bsgo ba nyan pa/lcags kyi 'khor lo can te 'dzam bu gling pa la dbang byed de rgyal phran rnams la mtshon gyis bsdigs nas bka' bsgo nyan pa/de la lus la mtshan dpe dang yo byad rin po che nyi shu rtsa gcig gi bdag nyin can no/_}
stobs lnga|{dad pa dang/brtson 'grus/dran pa/ting nge 'dzin/shes rab steng byang phyogs so bdun gyi nang tshan stobs lnga/yang na/'phen pa'i stobs dang/goms pa'i stobs/sun 'byin pa'i stobs/dkar po sa bon gyi stobs/smon lam gyi stobs ste blo sbyong don bdun ma'i stobs lnga'o (blo sbyong las byung ba'i stobs lnga/)}
stobs bcu|{1 de bzhin gshegs pa'i stobs bcu ste gnas dang gnas ma yin pa mkhyen pa'i stobs/las kyi rnam par smin pa mkhyen pa'i stobs/mos pa sna tshogs pa mkhyen pa'i stobs/khams sna tshogs pa mkhyen pa'i stobs/dbang po mchog dang mchog ma yin pa mkhyen pa'i stobs/thams cad du 'gro ba'i lam mkhyen pa'i stobs/kun nas nyon mongs pa dang rnam par byang ba mkhyen pa'i stobs/sngon gyi gnas rjes su dran pa mkhyen pa'i stobs/'chi 'pho ba dang skye ba mkhyen pa'i stobs/zag pa zad pa mkhyen pa'i stobs bcas bcu dang/2 byang chub sems dpa'i stobs bcu ste/bsam pa'i stobs/shes rab kyi stobs/smon lam gyi stobs/byang chub kyi stobs/chos kyi 'khor lo rab tu skor ba'i stobs bcas bcu'o/_/rgyas par phar phyin skabs bzhi pa dang dbu ma 'jug pa'i 'grel pa'i mjug tu gsal}
stobs bcu gsum|{bsam pa'i stobs/lhag pa'i bsam pa'i stobs/gzungs kyi stobs/ting nge 'dzin gyi stobs/yang dag par 'byor ba'i stobs/dbang gi stobs/spobs pa'i stobs/smon lam gyi stobs/pha rol tu phyin pa'i stobs/byams pa chen po'i stobs/snying rje chen po'i stobs/chos nyid kyi stobs/de bzhin gshegs pa thams cad kyis byin gyis brlabs pa'i stobs dang bcu'o/_}
stobs drug|{thos pa'i stobs/bsam pa'i stobs/dran pa'i stobs/shes bzhin gyi stobs/brtson 'grus kyi stobs/yongs su 'dris pa'i stobs so/_}
stobs bzhi|{rten gyi stobs dang/rnam par sun 'byin pa'i stobs/nyes pa las slar ldog pa'i stobs/gnyen po kun tu spyod pa'i stobs bcas bzhi las/rten gyi stobs ni/skyabs 'gro dang sems bskyed gnyis/rnam par sun 'byin pa'i stobs ni/sngar dag pa byas pa la 'gyod sems skyes pa/nyes pa las slar ldog pa'i stobs ni phyin chad sdig pa mi byed dpa'i dam bca' ba/gnyen po kun tu spyod pa'i stobs ni sdig pa dag pa'i ched du dge ba byas tshan thams cad la zer}
brtag gnyis me lugs|{kyai rdo rje'i rgyud 'grel bshad byed stangs 'ga' zhig yod pa'i nang gi mar pa lo tsA ba'i slob ma mes ston chen po'i lugs}
brtag thabs brgyad|{1 nad pa'i rtsa la brtag pa/2 chu la brtag pa/3 lce la brtag pa/4 mig la brtag pa/5 tsha ba brtag pa/6 dbugs gtong lugs la brtag pa/7 nad kyi slong rkyen la brtag pa/8 na lugs dri ba'i sgo nas brtag pa bcas yin par sman gyi (rgyud bzhi rtsa 'grel )las gsungs}
brtag pa rnam pa brgyad|{rgya mtsho dang chu dang sa gzhi brtag pa/rin po che brtag pa/gos brtag pa/ri dang ljon shing brtag pa/skyes pa brtag pa/bud med brtag pa/rta brtag pa/glang po che brtag pa rnams so/_}
brtag pa gsum|{mdo sde dang mthun/'dul ba las snang/mngon pa'i chos nyid dang mi 'gal ba ste/de la sngags kyi 'dul ba ni/spyir dang khyad par gyi dam tshig dang/mdo sde ni bskyed rdzogs kyi ting nge 'dzin/mngon pa'i chos nyid ni lta ba phyin ci ma log pa'o/_}
brtags shing chags pa'i lha srin sde brgyad|{so so'i yul la ming brtags shing chags pa ste/1 gnyan thang lha/2 g.ya' spangs skyes/3 skyes bu klu btsan/4 ban chen ru tra/5 he le 'bar ma/6 zur phud can/7 rgyal po/8 shing bya can}
brtad pa|{glo bur ba'am brel ba}
brtan pa dang sbungs cher gyis shig|{dam bca' brtan pa dang brtson pa cher gyis shig ces pa ste sbungs ni stobs dang brtson pa'i brda rnying ngo/_}
brtan pa mi 'gyur ba'i rdzas yod|{de'i mtshan gzhi ni/'dus ma byas kyis nam mkha' lta bu/'dus byas kyi nam mkha' chos can/khyod la brtan pa mi 'gyur ba'i rdzas yod ces brjod pa'i rgyu mtshan yod de/brtan pa mi 'gyur ba'i cha'am brten pa mi 'gyur ba'i rdzas su btags pa yod pas na de ltar du brjod pa'i phyir}
brtan ma bcu gnyis|{gsham gyi bstan pa bcu gnyis zhes pa dang don gcig }
brtan g.yo'i dngos|{brtan pa snod kyi 'jig na dang g.yo ba bcud kyi sems can}
brtul zhugs|{tha mal rang ga ba cig 'dod du byed pa'i spyod pa brtul ba'ang mjug sgril te thun mong ma yin pa'i spyod pa'i gnas la zhugs pa'o/_}
brtul zhugs grub pa|{spyir brtul zhugs grub pa ni grub pa thob pa'i rnal 'byor pa la zer ba yin/'di la mes mi tshig pa dang/dus gis mi gnod pa sogs yod zer}
brtul zhugs pad+ma rgyal po|{brtul zhugs pad+ma rgyal po ni/grub pa thob pa'i slob dpon pad+ma 'byung gnas kyi mtshan gyi rnam grangs}
brtul zhugs spyod pa|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags bla men kyi gzhung nas bshad srol la/gsang sngags kyi rtogs pa mthon por slebs rjes de la bogs 'don pa'i ched du brtul zhugs kyi spyod pa mi 'dra ba gsum byed dgos par bshad pa de yin}
brten nas btags pa'i gtan tshigs|{dbu ma'i rta ba gtan la 'bebs byed kyi gtan tshigs chen po ts+lang nang gses chos thams cad bden med du sgrub pa'i rigs pa'i rgyal po rten 'grel chen po'i gtan tshigs te/rten 'brel gyi skor gong du rten 'brel zhes pa'i nang mdor bsdus bshad zin la skabs su 'babs pa rten 'brel gyi gtan tshigs la brten nas mtha' gnyis sel tshul ni thal 'gyur ba'i lugs 'dir lta ba rnam par dag pa'i gol sa'i gtso bo rnam pa gnyis te/gcig ni chos thams cad rang gi mtshan nyid kyis grub par 'dzin pa'i sgro 'dogs kyi cha rtag lta ba dang/gcig shos ni dgag bya'i tshad ma zin par thal drags pas bcings rol dang rgyu 'bras la sogs pa thad snyad tsam du'ang rang ngos nas nges par darangs du med par song ba'i skur 'debs kyi cha chad lta bu'o/_/de gnyis ka'ang chos thams cad rang bzhin gyis med yang tha snyad du rnal gzhag thams cad 'thad pa'i rten 'grel gyi gtan tshigs la brten nas sel nus te/(rtsa shes )las/rten cing 'brel bar byung ba gang/_/de nyid dbu ma'i lam yin no/_/zhes gsungs pa ltar/dbu ma zhes pa'i nges tshig gi don yang rtag chad kyi mtha' las 'das pa la zer ba yin pas/de ji ltar mtha' las 'das tshul la/don dam par yod med gang du'ang rang lugs su khas blangs cung zad yang med kyang/dgos pa'i dbang gis tha snyad ming rkyang btags yod tsam zhig gzhan nor skyel mi dgos par rang lugs su bsnyon med du 'jog shes pa yin te/phyi nang gi dngos po 'di dag chos can/bden par ma grub ste/rten cing 'grel byung yin pa'i phyir/zhes pa rtag pa'i mtha' sel tshul dang/yang de chos can/tha snyad du'ang med pa ma yin te/rten 'brel yin pa'i phyir/zhes pa chad pa'i mtha' sel tshul yin cing/'di ni dbu ma thal 'gyur ba'i khyad chos thun mong ma yin pa'o/_}
