bstan 'gyur|{ston pa sangs rgyas kyis gsungs pa'i gsung rnams kyi gdongs pa 'grel ba'i ched du brtsams pa'i gzhung gang yin pa la bstan bcos zer zhing/de dag las rgya gar dang rgya nag gi mkhas pas brtsams pa'i bstan bcos kyi nang nas bod skad du bsgyur zin pa la bstan bcos 'gyur zer/'on kyang bstan 'gyur gyi mjug tu bod kyi kyang/sangs rgyas chos lugs snga dar gyi dus su yung ba'i bod kyi mkhas pas mdzad pa khag gcig tsam ma gtogs mi 'jug pa ni/bod kyi mi 'ga' zhig gis brtsams pa'i bstan bcos rdzun ma rnams bstan 'gyur gyi nang du lhad 'dres mi 'byung ba'i ched du sngon byon bod kyi tsA ba mkhas pa rnams kyis bkas bcad mdzad pa yin/rgya gar du bstan 'gyur zer ba'i tha snyad med la/0 rgya nag dang bod du tha snyad de byung ba yin/'on kyang bod du bka' 'gyur phyogs bsgrigs kyi dkar chag brtsams pa dang bstan 'gyur phyogs bsgrigs kyang dkar chags brtsams pa'i lo rgyus phal che ba gong du ka sde'i nang bka' 'gyur zhes pa'i tshig 'grel nas gsal ba dang phal cher 'dra zhing/'on kyang bod yig gi bstan 'gyur cha tshang ba thog mar bsgrigs pa ni gong gsal (ka sde'i nang )snar thar bka' 'gyur dang chabs cig phyogs bsgrigs byas pa yin la/rab byung drug pa'i shing khyi (1334)lor zha lu sku zhang kun dga' don grub kyis sbyin bdag byas te/bu ston rin po che zhus dag gnang mkhan du gdan drangs nas bstan 'gyur cha tshang zhig bzhengs pa zha lu'i gser khang gi gtsug lag khang du bzhugs shing/de'i dkar chag kyang bu ston rin po ches mdzad pa (bstan 'gyur kyi dkar chag yid bzhin dbang gi rgyal po'i phreng ba )bu ston rin po che'i gsung 'bum (pa)pa'i nang yod pa'i dpe rgyun mang che ba snar thang dang/de rjes su bstan 'gyur cha tshang ba zha lu'i bstan 'gyur la ma dpe byas te bzhengs srol 'dug /tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa sku 'das rjes sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos dbus gtsang gi yig 'bri mkhas pa yod tshad bsdus te bzhengs pa'i bstan 'gyur gser bris cho tshang gcig da ltar rtse po ta la'i pho brang dmar po'i tshongs chen nub ma'i sbugs kyi lha khang du yod mus/de rjes rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me sbrul (1737)lor sde dge rgyal po bstan pa tshe ring gis bstan 'gyur cha tshang dpar brkos byas te sde dge dpar khang du bzhag pa la sde dge bstan 'gyur zer/de rjes rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags bya (1741)lor pho lha ba bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis bstan 'gyur cha tshang zhig dpar brkos byas te snar thang du bzhag pa la snar thang bstan 'gyur zer/de dang dus mtshungs gong ma chan lung gis bka' phab pa ltar pe cin du rgya sog bod gsum gyi lo tsA ba mkhas pa mang po tshogs ste bstan 'gyur cha tshang man ju'i skad du bsgyur ba'i 'go tshugs/de rjes rab byung bcu gsum pa'i 'go spyi lo'i dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i dkyil co ne dpon yi bstan 'gyur cha tshang zhig dpar du bskor te co ne dgon par bzhag pa la co ne bstan 'gyur zer/de'i dkar chags 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng gnyis pa 'jigs med dbang pos mdzad pa (bka' yi gdangs pa 'grel ba'i bstan bcos 'gyur ro cog gi dkar chag yid bzhin nor bu'i phreng ba (gsung 'bum pod (ca)pa'i nang du yod/zhib par gong gsal bstan 'gyur gyi pod grangs dang/nang don/shog grangs bcas so so'i dkar chag nang gsal bas 'dir ma bris so/_}
bstan rgyas gling|{de ni lha sa'i gtsug lag khang gi nub byang ngos su gnas pa dang de sngon 'dzugs skrun gzhi rgya che shos gras shig yin/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me glang (1757)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho sku zheng la phebs pa dang zla ba bzhi par gong ma chan lung gis de mo 'jam dpal bde legs rgya mtshor ho thog thu ni min han gyi go ming gnang ste tA la'i bla ma 'tsho bzhugs skabs ltar chos srid gnyis kyi 'gan dbang 'dzin rgyu ma zad/bya ba sgrub mkhas yid gza' dang gdan don 'phran tshe tA la'i bla ma 'tsho zhugs skabs kyi lam srol ltar de mo ho thog thu dang grol mos byed pa las rang dga' dkar lung phab pa dang dbang cha spyad de zing cha slong rgyu med pa'i bka' phab cing/de nas de mo ngag dbang 'jam dpal bde legs rgya mtshos bod kyi chos srid gnyis ka'i dbang cha chen po bzung zhing/gong ma chan lung gis zhwa ser bstan pa 'dzin byed dpal ldan no mon han zhes pa'i cho lo gnang/de nas lo ngo gnyis song ba sa yos (1759)lo nas bzung tA la'i bla ma sku gong ma zhing la phebs rjes yang srid gsar pa nges brnyed byung nas dgung lo bco brgyad la ma phebs par gyi dus skabs de'i ring gdan sa gsum gyi ho thog thu'i gras nas su yos pas sridap+sakayong gnang nas chos da gnyis ka'i dbang cha bzung ba'i 'go tshugs/de mo bden legs 'jam dpal rgya ngam tshos srid dbang bzung nas lo ngo lnga song ba rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu rta (1762)lor sa gnas srid gzhung gi khang khongs bla ma khang gsar zer ba'i sag nas der bstan rgyas gling dgon pa 'di bzhengs 'go tshugs pa dang/chu lug (1763)lor las mjug 'grel zhing de mo ho thog tu rang nyid kyis dgon pa 'dir btags pa'i min ni dga' ldan gsang sngags dga' tshal zer/yang gong ma chan lung gis bstan rgyas gling zhes pa'i sgo byang rgya bod man sog bzhi'i yi ger bkod pa zhig gnang ba nas yongs grags su dgon pa'i ming la bstan rgyas gling zhes 'bod pa de byung zhing dus skabs shig gi ring lha sa'i gling khag (tshe smon gling/kun bde gling/tshe chog gling/bstan rgyas gling )gi nang gzhi khyon che shos yin la/de mo 'jam dpal ngag dbang dge legs rgya mtsho dang/blo bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho/blo bzang 'phrin las rab rgyas bcas nas snga phyir bod kyi srid skyong gnang ring grwa tshang dang bla brang shin tu dar rgyas che ba byung/da ltar gnas pa'i bstan rgyas gling thog brtsegs khang chen 'di ni dgon pa'i byang ngos kyi shul lhag cha shas shig yin/de sngon lu'u cun dmag 'khrug ma byung gong gi bstan rgyas gling ni lha sa'i gling bzhi'i nang gi snga shos dang/'dzugs skrun gyi gzhi yon che shos yin zhing/skabs de'i shar gyi rgya sgo de phyir khung nas brgyud du yod pa dang/nub kyi rgyal sgo de zas zhing gyi brgyud (da lta'i lha sa slob grwa chung ba ang dang po/) lho'i rgyal sgo de steng bkod lcang gser gyi brgyud du gnas pa bcas yin mod/rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu byi (1912)lor dgon pa 'di'i nang lu'u cun dmag lkog 'dzul thog dgon pas rgya dmag dang mnyam 'brel thog nas bod sa gnas srid gzhung la ngo log byas rkyen bod sa gnas srid gzhung gis gzhung bzhes btang bas da lta thogs gsum ldan gyi thog brtsegs khang chen gcig las lhag med cing/de ni dgon pa'i byang ngos kyi lha khang khag gi cha shas gcig yin pa dang/kha lhor bstan shing rgya khyon spyi khre gru bzhi ma 1270dang/sbug thag ring tshan spyi khre 27lhag tsam yod cing/'og rim gyi sar las ni khang pa de'i grub cha gtso bo yin pas ha cang brjid nyams ldan pa zhig yod/'dzugs skrun de shar nub gnyis su dbye nas shar ngos mdun phyogs de mchod khang gru bzhi dang 'brel nas yod pa dang gzhi khyon khang mig lnga dang/sbug thag ring tshad khang mig lnga/rgya khyod spyi khre rgu bzhi ma nyis brgya bzhi bcu bcas yin zhing/mchod khang gi rgyab phyogs su khang gsum yod pa'i nang dkyil gyi lha khang cung che ba der zheng tshan phyi khre drug dang grangs chung brgyad dang/sbug thag ring tshan spyi khre lnga dang grangs chung bzhi/ka ba bzhi bcas yod/g.yas g.yon gnyis cung chung ba der cha stobs zheng tshad spyi khre bzhi dang/ka ba gnyis re yin zhing lha khang gsum po tshang ma'i sgom chor khang nang bltas pa dang sgo nyis sgrig yin/khang dang mchod khang dbar gyang gnyis kyis chod yod pa dang gyang de gnyis kyi bar la zhing tshad spyi khre gcig dang grangs chung brgyad kyi bar khyams shig yod pa de tsho ni mthong dkon pa'i ar las byed stangs shig yin/mchod khang gi rgyal ga mdun mar zheng tshad spyi khre gsum dang grangs chung drug dang/sbug thag ring tshad spyi khre gnyis drangs chung gsum yod pa'i sgo 'phyor gcig yod/der ka ba gnyis yod pa de ar las kyi khyad chos ldan pa zhig yin/shar ngos kyi khang pa rnams rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa byi (1948)lo nas bzung bka' shag srid gzhung gis 'bras spungs dgos pa'i go bo khang tshan la do dam bya rgyur sprad pas lo ltar smon lam tshogs skabs go bo khang tshan gyi dge 'dun pa rnams de gar gnas tshang du bzhugs thog /khong tsho da dung de'i nang gi srung ma gtso bo tsi'u dmar po la gsol mchod mu mthud du byed srol yod/nub ngos kyi khang 'i mdun ngos su khang mig bzhi dang/gzhi khyon khang mig bcu/rgya khyon spyi khre gru bzhi ma nyis brgya lnga bcu bcas yod pa'i mchod khang gcig dang rgyab phyogs su ltar pa khod mi snyoms pa'i mdzod khang zhig yod/de dag de snga sa skya dgon par bdag pa dang/da dung par khang yang byed myong/rjes su slar yang bsam yas dgon par bdag nas lo ltar bsam yas dgon pa nas mi drug re srung mar 'phrin bcol byed par gtong ba dang/lo ltar thengs re brje srol yod/nub ngos kyi khang pa'i rtse thog tu da dung lha khang gcig yod pa der gzhi khyon spyi khri bcu dang grangs chung gcig dang sbug thug ring thum spyi khri bco lnga yod cing lha khang mdun gyi mchod khang la ka ba bzhi dang rgyam ngos kyi ldings che khre rtse kha shas kyi mtho ba yod pa ni lha khang gtso bo dang der ka ba bzhi yod cing/khang gi rtsig pa'i phyogs bzhir de snga ldebs ris kyis khengs yod/dgon pa 'dir gtor skyon ma byung gong gi sku gsung thugs rten skor/gtsang khang dbus ma dbang grags dgal rtsal du yi dam chos nga gi sku brnyan mang dag yod cing/rten gtsor 'bras spungs sngags khang gi 'jigs byed kyi sku'i 'dra cog bzhes te sku tshad de dang mnyam pa bcom ldan 'das 'jigs mdzad rdo rje dpal bo gcig pa'i sku brnyan yod/shar sbug dri gtsang dngos grub dga' tshal nang rgyal ba mi phab mgon po gtso bor gyur 'i dus gsum sangs rgyas kyi sku brnyan thog tshad ma khri rgyab dang bcas dang/g.yas g.yon du nye ba'i sems dpa'i ldem sku drug /sgo srung phyag rdor dang rta mgrin bcas thog tshad ma/rgyal rtse brtse chen nas spyan drangs pa'i byams pa'i sku brnyan gser zangs las grub pa gtso 'khor sogs bzhugs/gtsang khang nub mgon khang gtum chen rnam rol te snye thang chos rdzong nas spyan drangs pa'i chos rje bla ma dam pa bsodanams rgya mtshos kyi thugs dam rten bse pags las grub pa'i gur mgon lcam dran gyi 'chang sku dang/gnyan mgon bram ze'i gzugs can/gzhan yang sa lugs kyi yi dam srung ma bris 'bur byin can sogs bzhugs/(dgon pa der de mo dgung 'cham zhes 'cham gzab rgyas shig kyang rgyag srol yod 'dug /)}
bstan rgyas gling lcog|{rang byung bco lnga pa'i shing lug (1894)lo'i rjes su de mo srid zur lo bzang 'phrin las rab rgyas dbu nyes byung rjes dang/chu byi (1912)lo'i rjes su bstan gling grwa tshang rtsa 'thor du song nas de snga'i dgon shul gyi 'du khang sbug tu rdo rje 'jigs byed kyi 'jim brnyan spyi khre gsum lhag tsam byas pa zhig dang/thub dbang/gnas brtan bcu drug gi 'jim sku mi tshad/rab thog tu gur zhal gyi mgon khang/rtse thog tu gnod sbyin tsi'u dmar po'i lcog bcas yod pa'i 'og gi 'du khang 'bras spungs kong po khang tshan dang bdag skyong byed pa dang bar thog gi gur zhal gon khang dang rtse thog gi tsi dmar lcog bsam yas dgos pa nas bdag skyong byed}
bstan bcos|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/rtsom po po sangs rgyas chos lugs la dad pa ldan pa'i rjes 'brangs pa rnams kyis sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyi gsung rab kyi dgongs pa 'grel ba'i ched du brtsams pa'i rtsom rig rnams la zer zhing/bstan bcos de rigs bod skad du bsgyur ba la (bstan 'gyur )zer la/bstan bcos zhes pa'i ming gi go don yang/rtsom yig de la brten nas lta klog byed mkhan rnams kyi sems rgyud la yod pa'i nyon mongs dug gsum bcos thub pa dang/ngan song dang 'khor ba'i skye gnas las skyob thub pa yin pa'i don te/de ni bstan bcos yang dag gi khyad chos yin zhes phar phyin gyi gzhung las gsungs/gzhan yang sangs rgyas chos lugs pa ma yin pa'i rtsom pa pos brtsams pa rnams bstan bcos ltar snang yin pa las bstan bcos yang dag ma yin zhes gsung srol yod}
bstan bcos kyi rtsis mgo lnga|{zla grags pa'i sgrol gsal las gsungs pa'i bstan bcos kyi rtsis mgo lnga ni/rtsom pa po gang gis mdzad pa/gzhung gang las btus pa/phyogs gang du gtogs pa/dgos ched gang yin pa/dbu nas zhabs su bsdu ba'i don bcas so/_}
bstan bcos dgu|{don med pa'i bstan bcos/don log pa'i bstan bcos/don dang ldan pa'i bstan bcos/ngan g.yo'i bstan bcos/brtse bral gyi bstan bcos/sdug bsngal spong ba'i bstan bcos/thos pa lhur len pa'i bstan bcos/rtsod pa lhur len pa'i bstan/sgrub pa lhur len pa'i bstan bcos rnams so/_/de dag las/drug po spang zhing don dang ldan pa dang/sgrub pa lhur len/ngan song dang ngan 'gro'i sdug bsngal 'byin par byed pa'i bstan bcos gsum ni blang bya'o/_}
bstan bcos bcu gcig|{rnal 'byor spyod pa'i sa/gsung rab rab tu 'byed pa/mngon rtogs rgyan/tshan ma kun las btus pa/sa bcu pa'i rnam bshad/dmigs bya'i rkyen brtags pa/nyi shu pa/dpung dang mtha' rnam par 'byed pa'i 'grel pa/chos mngon par kun las btus pa/theg pa chen po bsdus pa/rnal 'byor bstan pa'o/_}
bstan bcos ltar snang drug|{don med pa'i bstan bcos dang don log pa'i bstan bcos/ngan g.yo'i bstan bcos/brtse bral gyi bstan bcos/thos pa lhur len pa'i bstan bcos/rtsod pa lhur len pa'i bstan bcos so/_}
bstan bcos rnam dag gsum|{don dang ldan pa'i bstan bcos/sdug bsngal spong ba'i bstan bcos/sgrub pa lhur len pa'i bstan bcos}
bstan bcos rnam gsum|{bstan bcos rnam dag gsum dang mtshungs}
