bstan pa|{bstan pa ni rdzogs pa'i sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyi bstan pa zhes so/_/'o na lung rtogs kyi ba stan pa rin po che 'di las rtog pa'i bstan pa gang zhe na/rtog pa'i chos lhag pa bslab pa rin po che rnam pa gsum ste/lhag pa tshul khrims kyi bslab pa dang/lhag pa rin 'dzin 'dzin gyi bslab pa dang/lhag pa shes rab kyi bslab pa rnams so/_/de yang lhag pa zhes pa ni skye bo phal pa dang mu stegs pa las khyad par du 'phags pa'am lhag pas na lhag pa zhes so/_/lung gi bstan pa gang zhe na/lung sde snod gsum te sangs rgyas kyi bka' thams brjod bya bslab pas gu gtso bor ston pa'i dbang du byas nas rjod byed sde snod gsum du bzhag pa ta 'dul ba'i sde snod/mdo sde'i sde snod/mngon pa'i sde snod gsum mo/_/de yang lhag pa tshul khrims kyi bslab pa brjod bya'i gtso bor ston pa'i ris su gnas pa'i gsung rab ni 'dul ba'i sde snod kyi mtshan nyid spyod pa gtso bor ston pa zhig ste/chos sgor zhugs pa rnams kyi lung ngag gi tshul 'chal mtha' dag spong ba'i bslab khrims ston pa zhig yin/lhag pa sems kyi bslab pa brjod bya'i gtso bor ston pa'i rim su gnas pa'i gsum rab ni mdo sde'i sde snod kyi mtshan nyid/sgom pa gtso bor ston pa zhig ste gdul bya'i rgyud kyi rnam g.yeng gi sgrib pa spong ba'i ched du gsungs pa gsang sngags kyi chos rnams kyang sde snod gsum du phye ba'i skabs su mdo sde'i sde snod kyi khongs su bsdu bar gsungs/lhag pa shes rab kyi bskal pa brjod bya'i gtso bor ston pa'i ris su gnas pa'i gsung rab ni mngon pa'i sde snod kyi mtshan nyid/lta ba gtso bor ston pa zhig ste gdul bya'i rgyud kyi bdag 'dzin gnyis kyi gnyen po lam bdag med gnyis rtogs pa'i shes par gtso bor ston pa zhig yin/de yang dper na/shes rab kyi bslab pa ni nyon mongs pa'i ljon shing gcod byed kyi sta re dang 'dra/ting nge 'dzin gyi bslab pa ni shing mkhas gyi dpung po brtan po dang 'dra/tshul khrims kyi bslab pa ni shing mkhan gyi lus stobs ma nyams par gnas pa dang 'dra ba yin gsungs/sde snod gsum dang bslab pa gsum du ma 'dus 'i lung rtogs kyi chos med/sde snod gsum ni sangs rgyas kyi bstan l