rgyal blon/yul mi thams cad kyis dad gus che ba'i slob dpon chen por gyur/spyir rgya nag nas rgya gar du phebs pa'i hwa shang mkhas pa chen po ha cang mang po yod slob dpon 'a 'dra ba'i mdzad rje che ba dang snyan grags che ba byung ma myong ba yin zhing/rgya gar du slob dpon 'di'i mtshan la mahA yA na de ba ste theg chen lhar 'bod/de nas rgyal po tshul khrims nyi ma sogs la dgongs zhu gnang ste rgya nag tu phyir log phebs khar/rgyal po btso brgyad kyi sa dga' skyel ston mo dang dngos 'bul mang po phul te rten gsum sna tshogs glang po che'i khal gyi sum cu gnyis/na bza' cha tshang/khal ma glang po che gcig /gser Tam khri/dngul Tam sum khri/kha cha'i ras lugs brgya tham pa sogs phul/de nas lam zhor rgya gar shar phyogs kyi rgyal kham khag tu phebs te kong krer 'byor/skabs der khal ma glang po che de shi ba gong ma thang tha'i cung gis thos nas 'u lag btang nas skyel 'dren byed du bcug pas shing rta 'khor lo bcu bzhi'i khal byung/phan tshun gyi lam bar lo gsum dang rgya gar sa gnas rang du lo bcu bzhi bzhugs pa bcas lo bcu bdun ring dkar spyad 'bad rtsod chen po gnang zhing/drin kon khri lo bcu dgu pa shing sprul (645)lor rgyal sa khrang an du bde bar phyag phebs/gong mas blon chen tsi phu li'ang sogs blon chen 'ga' shas dang/dge 'dun mang por bsu ba byed du bcug /zla ba gnyis pa'i nang gong ma dang mjal zhing/tA la'i lo mar bris pa'i chos dpe po ti drug brgya lnga bcu nga bdun/sangs rgyas kyis ring bsrel rdog brgya dang bcu/tsan+dan las bzhengs pa'i sangs rgyas kyi sku brnyan che chung gsum/gser zangs las bzhengs pa'i sangs rgyas kyi sku brnyan che ba gnyis/kha cha'i ras dang/gser dngul gyi dong tse sogs dngos skyel mang po phul/gong mas de rnams la bdag gnyer yag po byas te khran an shung h+phu si {(WP:1,194)}bzhugs gnas su gnang/dgon pa de'i hwa shang li bzhun sogs dge bshes mkhas pa bcu gnyis rogs ram dang/blon po li'ang ko kung do dam par bskos nas (rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum )dang/(byams chos sde lnga )sogs bka' bstan po ti bdun cu don lnga (le tshan chig stong sum