dus 'khor rgya nag pa 'jam dbyangs bstan pa'i nyi ma|{rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me stag (1686)lor hor yul a ru ho chen du sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa sbrul lor sde ri rin po che blo bzang don grub nas dus 'khor rgya nag pa ngag dbang phun tshogs kyi yang sprul du thugs thag bcad/dgung lo bdun par sde khri rin po che las rab tu byung/yi ge sbyor klog gi dbu brtsams/bcu gcig par bkra shis 'khyil du phebs/mkhas grub dam pa du mar mjal/zab rgyas chos kyi bgo skal thob/rang byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing khyi (1694)lor 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i rdo rjes brtsi bzhag thog mar gnang skabs chos grwar sogs/gsung gi bdud rtsi tshim par bzhes/bla ma 'jam dpal dbyangs la byams chos dang dbu ma rigs tshogs tshig rgyugs phul te legs so thob/dgung lo bcu drug par spyi don rigs rgyan dang blo rtogs sogs tshad ma'i skor gyi 'bel gtam mdzad/dgung lo nyer gcig nas nyer gsum bar gzhung po ti lnga sbyang pa mthar phyin mdzad cing go rig zung 'brel gyi rigs smra 'gran la med pa byung/nyer lnga bar kun mkhyen bla ma'i bka' bzhin bka' pod lnga yi brgal lan mdzad de rdo rams pa'i dam bca' thon zhing/mkhas pa'i grags pa thob/rje 'di sku tshe stod la bla brang bkra shis 'khyil du slob gnyer mdzad pa dang/sku tshe smad la hor sog kyi yul khal kha sogs su bzhugs pa ma zad/skabs 'gar skor rgyug kyang mdzad de dbang lung man ngag gi rgyun mang du spel/g.yon ru'i sar hu be hung wang gi sbyin bdag byas te bde mchog blos brlangs ltar gyi gtsug lag khang bzhengs/sgo bzhi la rgyud dang/dus 'khor/sman pa/rig gnas kyi grwa tshang bzhi btsugs/thang dga' ldan chos 'khor gling dang bla brang dus 'khor grwa tshang gi khrir bzhugs te mdo sngags kyi 'chad nyan rgya cher spel/tsong kha brgyad bcu'i lha khang g.yu thog can bde yangs bcas pa gsar du bskrun/dgung lo nga gsum pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa rta (1738)lo u chi mu chen g.yon ru'i shog e rin gyi sar sku gshegs gsung chos (dbus mtha' rnam 'byed kyi 'grel pa/) (dge 'dun nyi shu'i rnam gzhag) (dpal ldan rig pa 'dzin pa'i 'khor los bs