deb ther dmar po|{'di ni tshal pa kun dga' rdo rje rab byung drug pa'i me khyi (1346)lor brtsam 'go tshugs te karma pa sku phreng bzhi pa rol pa'i rdo rje rgya nag nas bod du phyir phebs mdzad pa'i lo ste rab byung drug pa'i chu yos (1363)lor legs par grub cing/deb ther 'dir de sngon bod kyi lo rgyus ma khas pa rnams kyis ha cang mthong chen gnang gi yod pa ma zad/'di'i nang gi (thang deb )bod kyi skor gyi dum bu de yang cha tshang ba drangs nas thang bod rgya rabs gnyis dus mtshungs bsgrigs pa'i dpyad gzhir bkod pod pa dper na mkhas dbang 'gos lo gzhon nus dpal gyi (deb ther sngon po )bod yi rgyal rabs nang gong gi dum bu cha tshang drangs yod pa dang/dpa' bo (30) gtsug lag phreng ba'i (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )le tshan (ma)pa'i nang khong rang nyid kyis gzigs pa'i dum bu cha tshang zhig drangs yod pa lta bu dang de bzhin deb ther 'di'i dpe bshus ma khag mang po 'phel rgyas byung ba bcas bod kyi lo rgyus dang thang bod 'brel ba'i thad la rtog zhib byed skabs med du mi rung ba'i dpyad gzhi'i yig cha yin deb ther 'di'i thog ma'i kha byang du (deb ther dmar po rnams kyi dang po bzhugs so )zhes 'khod pa ma zad 'jog ri ngag dbang bstan 'dzin gyis mdzad pa'i (tshal gung thang gi dkar chag )tu yang (deb ther dmar po ('di la lhan thabs su (deb ther mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog )zer ba zhig yod ces 'khod pa ltar de sngon rig gnas gsar brje chen po'i gong ljongs srid gros kyi phyag dpe'i gras su (deb ther dmar po'i kha skong mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog )ces 'khod pa'i dpe ring bris ma zhig kho bos mthong myong ba de'i nang don ni thog mar bod kyi rgyal rabs bkod pa phal che ba ni gnad bsdus tsam dang nang don gtso bo ni gung thang bla ma zhang nas bzung tshal gung thang gi bla rabs dang dpon dar ma gzhon nu nas bzung rang nyid kyi yab smon lam rdo rje'i bar gyi lo rgyus 'khod 'dug pa' di'i gras da dung yod med 'tshol zhib byed dgos pa bcas lo rgyus mdor bsdus tsam yin}
