drug pa drug gi de kho na nyid dang ldan pa|{ye shes lnga don dam chos nyid drug /rigs lnga bsam gyis mi khyab pa'i rigs dang drug /rigs lnga'i sa bon yi ge lnga mi 'gyur ba'i yi ge dang drug /sku lnga yongs su rdzogs pa'i sku dang drug /mahA 'o ga la sogs thabs lnga snying po don dang drug /shes rab lnga don dam blo las 'das pa dang drug /de ltar drug pa drug gi de kho na nyid dang ldan pa'o/_/yang na sku lnga ngo bo nyid dang drug /rigs lnga rdo rje 'chang dang drug /ye shes lnga rang byung ye shes dang drug /mkha' 'gro lnga dbyings kyi mkha' 'gro dang drug ces gsungs so/_}
drug pa tshes bzhi|{bod zla 6pa'i tshes 4nyin drug pa tshes bzhi'i dus chen yin/de ni sngon ston pa shAkya thub pa sangs rgyas nas nyin zhe dgu song ba na yul wa ra na si'i drang song lhung ba ri dwags kyi nags su kun shes kau'u Din+ya dang/rta thul/rlangs pa/ming chen/bzang ldan bcas 'khor gyi thogs ma lnga sde bzang por bka' dang po bden bzhi'i chos 'khor skor bar rjes dran zhu phyir de nyin grong mi mang pos lha sa'i nye 'dabs ri da khag la gnas mjal du bskyod nas phyir log skabs na gzhon tshos se 'brum dang ri kham phreng ba gyon te gra bzhi gling sogs la ngal gsol brgyab rjes ra mo che brgyad gzhan dang rnam thar gtong bzhin yong srol yod}
