drung yig chen mo|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs kyi drung yig chen mo zhes par cha mtshon na/yig tshang gi 'gan dbang lag bstar bkod 'doms kyis dgon pa khag dang gzhung zhabs ser mo ba yongs kyi las don bkod sgrig dang spyi 'doms byed cing/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gi mtshan thog nas bcad yig dang/rtsa tshig /gtan tshigs she bam/bkod rgya/lam yig /tha na spring yig dang bcas pa'i zin bris bzo 'god byed dgos pa ma zad/tham ka rnams bdag gces kyis tA la'i bla ma'i sku mdun du phab rgyag byed dgos/spyod ma tshugs srid skyong dang srid blon gnyis kyi rtsa tshig dang/lag khyer/bkod rgya bcas gtong dgos rigs kyi ma zin yang bzo bkod dang/tham ka phab rgyag /thag ka tshang ma'i phyi snod sde mig bdag gnyer bcas byas te phyi sdang dam sgam khar tA la'i bla ma rang gi mgul tham la thel zhu dgos/de bzhin rtsi drung gsar bsko nas bka' blon bla ma'i bar las tshan bsko 'then gyi 'char gzhi dang/grwa sa khag gi mkhan po lan sde bsko gzhag sogs kyi 'char gzhi bzos te tA la'i bla mar chog mchan zhu rgyur 'bul dgos pa dang/(gong gsal yig tshang rang nyid kyi byed sgo'i las don snyan zhu dgos rigs tA la'i bla ma dang/srid skyong/srid blon bcas kyi bdun du thad kar zhu ba las bka' shag brgyud mi dgos pa'i dmigs bsal yod/) bka' shag gi bod gtong ltar gal che'i chab srid kyi lam don drung rtsis mnyam tshogs gros sdur thog tshogs 'du rgyas bsdus kyi 'go khrid kyang byed dgos/gzhan yang rtse slob grwa dang/snye mo yon bdag /e pa yon bdag /'dod dpal sogs bzo rigs khag gcig la yang yig tshang gi 'gan dbang ltar bkod 'doms byed pa yin}
