gdags gzhi'i phung po|{phung po de gang zag ces pa'i ming gdags sa'i gzhi yin pas na gdags gzhir 'jog pa yin cing/phung po gdags gzhir 'jog tshul grub mtha' gong 'og lta stangs mi mthun pa yin/rang rgyud pa yan chad kyis gang zag gi tha snyad 'dogs chog pa'i gang zag gi mtshan gzhi zhig rnyed rgyu med na gang zag 'jog mi nus shing/phung po gang zag gi gdags gzhir yang 'jog mi nus pas/phung po'i steng du gang zag gi mtshan gzhi zhig khas len pa yin/rang rgyud pas yid kyi rnam par shes pa gang zag dang/sems tsam pas kun gzhi rnam shes gang zag tu 'jog /mdo sde pa ni rang rgyud pa dang mtshungs/bye brag smra bas phung po'i rgyun gang zag tu 'jog /thal 'gyur bas phung por brten nas gang zag ces ming rkyang btags yod tsam las gdags gzhi phung po'i steng du gang zag btsal nas rnyed rgyu gtan nas mi srid pa dang/de ltar srid na gang zag tha snyad btags pa'i btags don btsal nas rnyed rgyu yod dgos pa dang/btags don btsal nas rnyed rgyud yod na bden par grub pa yod dgos par khas len pa yin/bden par grub pa/rang ngos nas grub pa/rang gi mtshan nyid kyis grub pa/rang bzhin gyis grub pa sogs rdul tsam yang med par khas blangs pa gong du song ba bzhin yin}
