gdong gzhug ngag dbang chos grags|{mdo smad bya khyung dgon gyi mkhan rabs so gnyis pa 'di nyid kyi mtshan gzhan 'on 'ja' tshang dang mtsher mo che yang zhu/'khrungs yul rong po'i tshe rug yon 'ja' la yin/thog mar bya khyung gi chos skor zhugs nas zab chos gsan sbyong mdzad/ (52) de nas dbus su phebs te ser byes grwa tshang du gzhung lugs gsan sbyong thog lha ldan smon rams pa mdzad sum rtags snyan ngag rtsis dkar nag sogs la yang sbyangs pa che de nas rang yul du phebs te rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags glang (1721)lor bya khyung dgon gyi seng khrir phebs dbu ma 'jug pa tshogs 'don du btsugs brag dkar sngags rams pa gdan drangs te bka' chos mang tsam zhus dam can mgar nag gi gsol kha gsar 'dzugs dang skyes ri la bde ldan lhun po'i la btsal bstad nas bsang yig gsar rtsom gnang de ltar lo lnga'i bar du gdan sa bskyangs nas 'chad nyan 'phel ba dang don gnyer ba so sor yi ge 'bri klog rtsis dkar nag snyan ngag sogs kyi khrid dpe dang byams khang gi sku brnyan la zhig gso dang rgyud gyi mdzad spyod legs pa bcas tshang ma gtsug tu bkur gsum rtsom yang lca bsdus nas bzung gza' 'dzin par gyi rtsis gzhi gsar spos dang spyi so'i deb yig sems bskyed kyi bshad sgrig la snga sgrig dang phyi sgrig 'ga' re bcas mdzad rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing sbrul (1725)lor gdan sa bzhag nas mtsher mo che'i ri khrod du sku tshe dang sgrub pa snyoms par mdzad ('khrungs 'das kyi lo tshigs mi tshigs/)}
