bdag 'dzin rlu tra sde gsum|{lus kyi bdag 'dzin la ti rlu tra ni bzung ba chos kyi bdag /ngag gi bdag 'dzin a kar sha rlu tra ni las rgyu 'bras med par smra ba chad par lta ba/sems kyi bdag 'dzin tra ga tra ni 'dzin pa gang zag gi bdag tu bzung ba'o/_/sems kyi bdag 'dzin tra ga rlu tra ni 'dzin pa gang zag gi bdag tu bzung ba'o/_}
bdag gzhan mnyam brje|{sngon chad rang gces par 'dzin cing/gzhan yar bal 'dor ba'i bsam blo yod pa de go sa brjes nas rang yal bar 'dor zhing gzhan gces par 'dzin pa'i bsam blo skyes pa la zer}
bda' ba|{zhim pa'i don te (mngon brjod legs bshad gser gyi lde mig )las/bda' ba bsod pa kha zas mchog gi ming zhes gsungs so/_}
bdar|{ster ba'am sbyin pa'i don la 'jug pa ste (lam rim chen mo'i brda dkrol )las sems can la bdar ba ni sems can la ster ba'am sbyin pa'i don yin zhes gsungs gzhan yang ral gri bdar dang bden pa bdar zhes skabs thob kyi don gzhan la 'jug pa'i skabs kyang yod do/_}
bdud|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la chos la mi dga' ba'i gdon 'dre'i rigs la bdud zer}
bdud kyi mda' lnga|{(bdud kyi lam 'dod pa'i mda' lnga yang zer )de la 'dren tshul gsum las/1 chags par byed pa'i mda'/sems rmongs par byed pa'i mda'/sems nga rgyal bar byed pa'i mda'/'thabs par byed pa'i mda'/'du 'dzi dang rnyed bkur la brten te sems g.yeng bar byed pa'i mda' dang lnga'o/_/2 slob dpon dpal 'dzin byed kyis/myos byed/'da' byed/rmongs byed/lhung byed/brgyal byed dang lnga bshad do/_/3 a ma ra ko'i sha'i 'grel 'dod 'jo las/myos byed/sred byed/yang dag rmongs byed/bsnyems byed/'ching byed kyi mda' lnga bshad do/_/'di ni lha'i bu'i bdud rags pa ste/gzhan 'phrul dbang byed kyi bdag po dga' rab dbang phyug ste me tog mda' can nam chu srin rgyal mtshan can yang zhes pa de yin la/bslab pa lhod pa'i rab byung rnams la mda' 'di lnga po 'phen par byed do zhes klong rdol gsung 'bum gyi deb (nya)pa las gsungs so/_}
bdud rgyal klu btsan sde bzhi|{bdud (bdud bzhi lta (58) bu/) rgyal (rgyal po zhes pa mi ma yin gras shig) btsan ('dre'i bye brag gcig) klu bcas bzhir zer}
bdud lnga|{lung a nu yo ga'i dam tshig skabs su dgra bzhi 'dul ba dang/bdud lnga bzlog pa zhes pa'i nang gses bdud lnga ni/1 rnam rtog 'phrog pa'i bdud/2 btang snyoms le lo'i bdud/3 yongs spyod 'du 'dzi'i bdud/4 tshig rtsub mtshon cha'i bdud/5 khro gtum ngang thung gi bdud dang lnga'o/_}
bdud btul|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul/chos lugs kyi go rtogs mthar phyin nas sangs rgyas pa na bdud bzhi las rgyal ba'i go 'phang thob pa yin cing/de yang nyon mongs pa'i bdud bcom nas de'i bag chags dang bcas pa rtsa ba nas spangs pa/phung po'i bdud bcom nas lus sha rus rdos bcas kyi gzugs phung gnas 'gyur nas 'ja' lus mtshan dpes brgyan pa'i skur 'gyur ba/lha'i bu'i bdud bcom nas mnyam rjes gcig tu 'dres pa/'chi bdag gi bdun bcom nas skye 'chi spangs pa'i rdo rje'i sku brnyes pa bcas la bdud btul ba zer/'di mdo lugs kyi dbang du byas shing/gsang sngags kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul de las gting zab cing go dga' bas 'dir ma smros so/_}
bdud 'dul mchod rten|{shAkya mu nes mnyan yod du mu stegs ston pa drug dang cho 'phrul 'gran nas pham par byas rjes shAkya li tsi byi sogs kyis bzhengs pa/khri dbyibs gru bzhi pa'i steng du bar mang bzhi ka gru bzhi pa/phyogs bzhir glo 'bur yod pa zhig (tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i gser gdung dkar chag )shog grangs 259par gsal}
bdud rtsi|{khong du song na nad med pa dang/tshe ring ba/lang tsho dang ldan pa zhig tu sdod thub pa'i btung ba}
bdud rtsi lnga|{dri chen/dri chu/byang sems dkar dmar/rkang mar rnams so/_}
bdud rtsi zas|{shAkya mu ni'i yab zas gtsang ma de'i 'og ma zas dkar/bre bo zas/bdud rtsi zas ste bu spun bzhi'i tha chung}
bdud rtsi gsum|{zag med ye shes kyi bdud rtsi/'chi med tshe yi bdud rtsi/nad med sman gyi bdud rtsi'o/_}
bdud rtsi'i chu|{gangs ti si nas 'bab pa'i chu bo gang+ga la zer/rgya gar gyi sgrung gtam nang chu bo gang+gA 'di lha dbang phyug chen pos lha yul nas phabs te gangs ti se brgyud nas 'dzam gling du babs pa dang/de la khrus byas na sdig sgrib thams cad lhag mad du dag ces shod srol yod pa de la zer}
bdud bzhi|{nyon mongs pa'i bdud dbang phyug dkar po/phung po'i bdud tshangs pa ser po/lha'i bu'i bdud lha dbang khams ser/'chi bdag gi bdud khyab 'jug nag po bzhi'o/_}
bdud las bzhi|{rang gi bla ma la mi gos pa/yid mi bde byed pa/khengs tshig smra ba/tshe 'di la gtso bo sems pa'o/_}
bdun rnam dag|{bshags pa dang/yi rang ba/don dam sems bskyed pa/skyabs 'gro/smon sems bskyed pa/'jug sems bskyed pa/bsngo ba ste bdun}
bdun tshigs|{mi de shi ba'i rjes su de'i pha ma nye 'brel dang/slob dpon slob ma bcas kyis zhag bdun phrag bdun te zhag zhe dgu'i bar du dge sgrub mchod 'bul byas na gshin po de la phan thogs chen po yod pa dang/lhag par du gshin po de skye ba rjes mar ngan song gsum du skye ba len mkhas zhig yin kyang skye ba bzang por 'phos thub pa'i phan thogs chen po yod ces zer srol yod}
bde skyid kyi gshed ma|{yul gyi bde skyid la gtor bshig gtong mkhan gyi gshed ma ste dgra bo}
bde skyid 'khos su phebs pa|{lus bde sems skyid kyi sgo nas gnas su thub pa}
bde khang ba blo bzang rab brtan|{mdo smad bya khyung dgon gyi mkhan rabs so lnga pa 'di nyin yab gnam lha 'bum dang yum pad+ma mtsho gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu phag (1683)lor tsong kha skyes ri'i g.yas 'dabs tsher phug yul du 'khrungs/a gro chos rjes shes rab rgyal mtshan gyi sku skyer grags/dgung lo bcu pa la rab tu byung/mtshan blo bzang rab brtan du gsol/grong dge zhig las klog dang 'don cha bslabs/dgung lo bcu gsum par bya khyung du phebs/de'i phyi rol chos grwar zhugs/mkhyen brtson che bas 'phrul du skyor dpon khur/dgung lo bco brgyad thog sku 'bum gyi smon lam thog dam bca' bzhag /dgung lo nyer gcig thog dbus gtsang du phebs/bsam blo'i dkar chen sna rgya gang dbang brtson 'grus dge rgan du bsten nas bka' pod tshang mar sha chod rus chod dup+sabayangs pas mkhas par grags/dgung lo nyer dgu'i thog sgrub khang ring po che la bsnyen rdzogs zhus shing 'jam dbyangs zhal lung gi khrid rdzogs par gsan/so gnyis thog rgyud smad grwa tshang 'grims/sngar phyir chub zang bla ma/'jam dpal grags pa/bzod pa bzang po/mnga' ris zhabs drung/bla ma byams pa/paN chen blo bzang ye shes sogs las chos rgyun mang tsam gsan/dgung lo so lnga'i thog slar mdop+sadam rang dgon du phebs/de'i phyi rol lung g.yon dga' ldan chos 'phel gling gi ri khrod du phebs nas so gsum gyi rim shin tu dben par bzhugs/der dad 'dus kyi slob ma 'ga' byung bas sgrub sde btsugs nas lam rim blo sbyong dang sdom gsum bslab bya sogs khrid cing gzhi gsum gyi phyag len 'jigs byed kyi sgrub mchog btsugs/dgung lo lnga bcu pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu byi (1732)lor bya khyung gi chos khrir phebs nas lo bcu bzhugs ring lam rim chen mo'i gzab bshad kyis gtsos chos bka' rgya cher gnang/slob gter 'phel ba'i thabs su smon lam rab 'byams pa'i ming btags gsar du btsugs/lha khang rten gsum rnying pa yod tshad zhig gsos mdzad/dgung lo don gcig pa nas bzung lo gsum gyi ring gang ci'i 'gan bsnams nas rgyud pa'i 'du khang gsar bzhengs dang/mchod rten che ba bcu gnyis sogs rten bzhengs rgya cher mdzad pas mtshon lha khang phyi nang dang/dgon pa'i nye 'khor rnams su mchod rten che chung drug cu rtsa bdun bzhengs/dgung lo don bzhi pa la gdan zhus ltar dan tig dgon par phebs/der rten gsum rnams la mchod 'bul/dge da'un la sku 'gyed/phyogs 'dun mi ming la chos sbyin rgya cher bstsal/bka' rtsom pod gcig lhag mdzad/chos 'brel gsan pa'i slob ma che gras mkhan chen ngag dbang don grub/mkhan po ngag dbang mkhas grub rgya mtsho/rwa lo sprul sku/dan tig zhabs drung 'jam dbyangs grags pa sogs 'dra 'dren dam pa mang du byung/mthar dgung grangs gya bzhi la thebs pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me khyi (1766)lor zhi bar gshegs}
bde mkhar tshe dbang rab brtan|{bde mkhar (klu khang pa )tshe dbang rab brtan ni 'phan po khul nang so zhes pa'i sger pa zhig ste bde mkhar nang so (yul skad du dan khang nang so zer ba )dang/rgyal grong nang so/_/khang gsar nang so (sger rta rkyang zhes gzhung zhabs med )bcas yod pa las sger bde mkhar ba'i khyim du rab byung bco lnga pa'i me sprel (1896)lor bltams/sa'i rdzong rgyab klu khang gi byang ngos su sa cha dang khang pa yod par brten klu khang ba zhes 'bod/tshe dbang rab brtan chung dus (60) yig rtsis slob sbyong byas te rtsis khang (bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi dpon rigs skya bo'i sbyong brdar byed sa )du 'dzul nas shod drung zhus rang lo nyi shu tsam la rtsis pa dang de nas bka' blon bla ma byams pa bstan dar gyi las byar mdo smad du bskyod de bka' drung byas rang lo nyi shu rtsa bdun steng lha sar bka' drung (bka' shag gi drung yig )gi 'gan 'khur ring 'jon thang che ba'i grags pa che tsam byung de rjes lha sa gnyer tshang ba'i 'gan 'khur thog de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi bod ljongs tshogs 'du hrag bsdus kyi 'thus mi dang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i gser stong dge legs 'dod 'jo gsar bzhengs las bya byas mi ring bar rtsis dpon (rim pa bzhi pa'i go gnas yod pa'i shod skor yongs kyi 'go dpon )bskos stod lung sogs la sa zhib byas bod rang byung bcu drug pa'i lcags stag (1950)lor mi dmangs bcings 'grol dmag chab mdor 'byor skabs bod zla bcu gcig pa'i nang srid blon las tshab kyi 'gan blangs srid blon las tshab las sbrel blo bzang bkra shis dang mnyam du bod zhi ba'i bcings 'grol 'byung thabs skor gyi gros mthun don tshan bcu bdun la ngo rgol byas pa sogs kyi rkyen pas blo bzang bkra shis dang bde mkhar (klu khang pa )tshe dbang rab brtan gnyis srid blon las tshab nas phyir 'then byas rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu glang (1963)lor 'das}
bde mgon gyi bsnyen pa mdzad|{yi dam bde mchog dang/chos skyong mgon po'i rtsa sngags dang snying po'i sngags sogs cho ga'i gzhung ltar sngags grangs gsog pa}
bde 'gro|{las bzang po bsags nas 'bras bu bde ba myong mkhan gyi 'gro ba gsum ste/1 mi/2 lha/3 lha ma yin bcas/dge ba chen pos mi dang/'bring gis lha/chung bas lha ma yin du skyes zhes bshad}
bde 'gro zung|{lha dang mi gnyis la zer}
bde chas|{so so'i go gnas kyi rim pa dang ma mthun pa'i stabs bde'i chas gos la zer}
bde chen ro brgyad|{rtag pa dang/mi gdung ba/bsil ba/gcig pa/bde ba/dri ma med pa/dga' ba/yin dang ba rnams so/_}
bde mchog|{'di la/1 bde mchog lu i pa lha cu re gnyis/2 bde mchog nag po lugs lha/3 bde mchog dril bu lus dkyil dang lha lnga/4 bde mchog ngam rdzong snyan brgyud sogs yod}
bde mchog gi rdzogs rim rim pa lnga|{bdag byin brlabs kyi rim pa/sna tshogs rdo rje'i rim pa/nor bu 'gengs pa'i rim pa/dza lan d+ha ra'i rim pa/bsam mi khyab pa'i rim pa'o/_}
bde mchog dril bu lha lnga|{gsang sngags kyi yi dam zhig gi mtshan/bde mchog dkyil 'khor la lha lngar byas pa slob dpon dril bu pa'i lugs yin pas/ming la'ang bde mchog dril bu lha lnga zhes brjod}
bde mchog drug cu rtsa gnyis|{gsang sngags kyi yi dam zhig gi mtshan/gtso bo yab yum gnyis/snying po'i rnal 'byor ma bzhi/dpa' bo nyer bzhi/dpa' mo nyer bzhi/sgo mtshams ma brgyad bcas yin}
bde mchog sdom 'byung gi rgyud|{de sngon bod sil bu'i dus mjug bstan pa phyi dar gyi 'gor rwa lo tsA ba dang dus thog mnyam pa'i rgyus lo tsA ba smon lam grags kyis rgya gar skad nas bod skad du bsgyur ba/sde dge bka' 'gyur rgyud (kha)pa'i nang du yod}
bde mchog mai tri bcu gsum ma|{gsang sngags skabs kyi yi dam zhig /slob dpon mai tri pa'i lugs kyi bde mchog lha bcu gsum byas pa'i dbang lung man ngag}
bde mchog yan lag bdun|{bde ba chen po'i sku la ldan pa'i bde ba chen po'i yan lag bdun ni/1 zag pa med pa'i bde ba/2 rang bzhin can gyi bde ba/3 'du byed kyi bde ba/4 gnyis su med pa'i bde ba/5 bsam gyis mi khyab pa'i bde ba/6 rang bzhin med pa'i bde ba/7 ngo bo nyid kyi bde ba ste/de ltar yan lag bdun dang/ldan pas na/bde ba chen po'i sku zhes bya'o/_}
bde mchog lhan skyes|{gsang sngags bla med kyi rgyud nas bshad pa'i yi dam 'khor lo bde mchog yab yum zhal sbyor zhal gcig phyag gnyis pa 'khor med pa'i gtso bo rkyang pa}
bde stong skabs su kha sbyor bzhi|{'khor lo bzhi la rtsa rlung brten pa rang bzhin kha sbyor/bol ka ko la sbyor bas gnyis shor gnyis gnas tshe ched du byas pa'i kha sbyor/lha dang dbyer med bstim pa byin gyis brlabs pa'i kha sbyor/snang stong dang rig stong dbyer med ni rtogs pa'i kha sbyor bcas so/_}
bde stong gi ye shes|{dpe yi 'od gsal dang/rim pa bzhi pa'i don gyi 'od gsal lta bu/bde ba ni dga' bzhis drangs pa'i bde bas stong nyid yul dus pas na/bde stong gi ye shes su 'jog pa yin}
bde ldan zhing gi mgon po|{mgon po 'od dpag med kyi mtshan gyi rnams grangs yin cing/kun gzigs paN chen rin po che sku phreng rim byon la de ltar che bstod zhu srol yod}
bde sdug snyan zhu|{sdug bsngal zhu 'bod yas pa'i snyan zhu}
bde ba can|{sangs rgyas 'od dpag med bzhugs sa'i sangs rgyas kyi zhing khams sam yang na snye thang bde ba can zhes deng rwa stod dgon par 'bod pa de yin/sngar dbus kyi gdan sa ser 'bras dge gsum ma byung gong du dbus kyi gdan sa chen po drug zer ba zhig yod pa ste/1 gsang phu/2 bde ba can/3 tshal gung thang/4 dga' gdong/5 skyor mo lung/6 zur phu bcas yod pa'i nang tshan zhig yin}
bde ba chen po'i sku'i yan lag bdun ldan|{gong du bde mchog yan lag bdun zhes par gzigs}
bde ba gnyis|{gnas skabs mngon mtho'i bde ba (lha mi'i gong 'phang/) mthar thug bde ba nges par legs pa/(byang chub gsum gyi go 'phang/) yang na/zag bcas kyi bde ba dang/zag med kyi bde ba'o/_}
bde ba'i mchog gcig pu|{sems skyid pa}
bde bar gshegs pa|{1 legs par gshegs pa/2 phyir mi ldog par gshegs pa/3 ma lus par gshegs pa/yang/1 bden bzhi'i de nyid mngon sum du mkhyen pa/2 mkhyen pa brtan pa/3 ma lus par mkhyen pa bcas/yang/spangs pa bde gshegs dang/rtogs pa bde gshegs gnyis/spangs pa bde gshegs la/1 legs par spangs pa/2 ma lus par spangs pa/3 phyir mi ldog par spangs pa'o/_}
bde bar gshegs pa nyid kyis shis brjod kyi me tog snyil ba|{sangs rgyas rang nyid kyis dngos su rab gnas dang shis brjod mdzad pa}
bde bar gshegs pa 'od srung chen po|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/sangs rgyas shAkya mu ne ma byon gong gi sangs rgyas te 'das pa'i sangs rgyas yin zhes bshad}
bde bar gshegs pa shAkya|{(jo shag rnam pa gnyis )jo bo shAkya mu ne'i sku rnam pa gnyis te/gcig /rgya bza' kong jos rgya nag nas gdan drangs pa deng sang lha sa gtsug lag khang na yod pa de dang/(sngar rgya nag nas gdan drangs pa de thog mar rwa mo cher bzhugs yod cing/de yang rgya bza' dang bal bza'i lha khang gnyis po so so'i (62) yul du kha bltas pa bzhengs zhes gsal ba ltar deng sang yang lha khang gi sgo phyogs ma 'gyur bar gnas yod na'ang rgya bza' rjes mas jo bo gnyis bzhugs sa brjes pa yin/) gnyis bal bza' khri btsun gyis bal yul nas gdan drangs pa'i jo bo sku gnyis la zer 'di skor gyi lo rgyus zhib cha gzigs par 'dod na (rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )dang (dpyid kyi rgyal mo'i glu dbyangs 4nang yod pas der gzigs}
bde bar gshegs pa'i mtho gang|{mi 'bring tshad kyi khru phyed dang do yin}
bde bas rgyud brlan|{sdug bsngal med pa'i gtan gyi bde ba sems rgyud tshim par byas pa}
bde zhib las khungs|{de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs kyi las khungs shig ste/rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa stag (1938)lor gsar du btsugs pa zhig yin/der do dam drung rtsis gnyis dang/las bya ser skya bzhi yod cing/gtso bo'i las 'gan ni/spyi tshogs bde 'jags skor la lta rtog dang/lhag par lha sa grong khyer gyis mtshon rgya khyab rdzong gzhis khag la slob grwa gsar 'dzugs kyis slob khang gsar rgyag dang 'brel zhing 'brog mi dmangs kyis bu phrug gcig rgya ma chung tsam skong 'gugs thog rdzong bzhis so so'i las bya drung khang/gtso rgan/gzhan yang sger chos khongs nas dge rgan ji dgos 'os 'dzugs kyi phogs thob gzhung gnas nas bstsal thog zla drug re'i mtshams rdzong gzhis da snod so sos slob 'bras gang 'dra byung yod med zhib 'jug dang 'brel bde zhib las khungs su thad ka snyan seng zhus thog rnam kun slob khang la lta rtog gnyer skyong byed dgos pa sogs kyi gtan 'bebs yod/de 'brel lha zhol grong khyer nang lugs la dang zhen byed pa'i pho mo'i chas gos ya ma gzugs spras pa dang/nyal tha lkog tshong dang 'then 'thung mi chog pa/tho phi cu dang mA cang brgyab nas rgyan 'dzugs mi chog pa/gtan 'bebs chang khang las brgal ba'i myos rdzas gang byung du btsong mi chog pa bcas kyi khrims 'doms mjug snon byed dgos pa dang/gzhan yang yul lung yar rgyas kyi ched du sam zhib 'char 'god zhu dgos pa bcas so/_}
bde legs kun gyi rtsa ba gcig pu|{bla ma dge ba'i bshes gnyen}
bde legs kyi re kha can|{(kha btags nang mdzod nyin mo bde legs )kha btags kyi sne thar g.yas g.yon gnyis su/nyin mo bde legs mtshan bde legs zhes sogs sho lo ka gcig bod yig dbu can gyis thags su btags yod pa'i kha btags/yongs grags su nang mdzod nyin mo bde legs zer zhing/ring ba la 'dom gsum lhag tsam yod}
