bden gnyis|{bden pa gnyis te kun rdzob bden pa dang don dam bden pa gnyis yin/go bde bar bshad na/phyi rol dngos po rnams kyi snang tshul mi 'dra ba sna tshogs pa ni phyi tshul tsam yin pas kun+paradzob bden pa zhes zer zhing/dngos po rnam kyi ngo bo ngo ma de la don dam bden pa zhes (65) brjod pa yin}
bden gnyis ngo bo tha dad du 'dzin pa|{bden gnyis ngo bo tha dad du 'dzin 'i cha ni mtha' 'gyur ba'i lugs la/bden gnyis bden stong du ngo bo dbyer med pa'i ngo bo gcig la/rang rang gi ltos gzhi'i ldog cha nas tha dad pa yin pa byas pa dang mi rtag pa lta bu yin te/de gnyis ngo bo tsam yang mi gcig pa'i tha dad yin na gzigs bden med gzungs kyi gnas lugs mthar thug pa ma yin par thal ba dang/gzugs bden stong 'jal ba'i tshad mas bden 'dzin gyi sgo 'dogs mi chod par thal ba dang/gzugs la bden pa bkag tsam gzugs kyis chos nyid ma yin par thal ba dang/sangs rgyas 'phags pa'i rgyud la'ang bden 'dzin dang bden med rtogs pa'i shes rab gnyis cig car du 'jug par thal ba'i skyon bzhir 'gyur ba dgongs 'grel las gsungs so/_/bden gnyis ldog pa tsam yang tha dad du dbye rgyu med par gcig yin na/so so skye bos kyang don dam bden pa mngon sum du rtogs par thal ba dang/gzigs bden stong der dmigs nas chags sogs skye bar thal ba dang/rnal 'byor pas lam gong ma sgom pa don med par thal ba dang kun rdzob spong ba bzhin du don dam par yang spong bar thal ba'i skyon bzhir 'gyur bar gsungs so/_/des na kun rdzob bden pa dang don dam bden pa gnyis ngo bo gcig la ldog pa tha dad cing med na mi 'byung ba'i bdag gcig 'brel grub pa byas pa dang mi rtag pa lta bu yin zhes bzhed}
bden gnyis chos|{kun rdzob pa'i chos dkon mchog dang/don dam pa'i chos dkon mchog te/dang po ni/bka' dang bstan bcos ye re bris pa'i dpe cha la zer zhing/gnyis pa ni/de'i nang don rnam brjod bya sangs rgyas thob byed kyi spangs pa dang/rtogs pa gnyis la zer}
bden pa mngon du rtogs|{stong pa nyid mngon sum du rtogs pa/stong pa nyid ni cho sa thams cad kyi bden don dngos de yin pas de rtogs na bden pa'i don mngon sum du mthong ba yin zer}
bden pa mthong ba|{(stong pa nyid rtogs pa )sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/dngos po dang dngos po ma yin pa'i chos thams cad kyi gnas lugs ngo ma yang dang dag par rtogs pa la bden pa mthong ba zhes zer/de yang dngos po'am dngos po ma yin pa'i chos thams cad rang rang gi rgyud dang rkyen la brten nas byung ba ma gtogs rgyu dang rkyen gang yang med par rang bzhin gyis byung ba gtan nas med pa de ni ngo bo ngo ma yin zhing/ngo bo de yang dag par rtogs pa ni/bden pa mthong ba'am bden pa'i don mthong ba yin zer la/stong pa nyid zer ba'i stong pa ni/bum pa'i nang du cha med pa'i stong pa dang gtan nas med pa'i stong pa la go rgyu min par/rang bzhin gyis byung ba ma yin pa'i stong pa la go dgos}
bden pa bsdar|{de sngon bod du rgyal blon rnams mna' skyel bka' gtsigs 'jog skabs rang rang so sor dad pa byed yul lha rnams kyi ming smos nas dpang po 'bod pa'i tshig brjod pa la zer}
