mdo mkhar zhabs drung tshe ring dbang rgyal|{mdo mkhar zhes pa ni khyim rgyud kyi ming ste/sngar mes po'i dus byang stag lung dgon pa'i khri pa dang/dpon rigs kyis phod mdo rdzong dang lhun grub rdzong gnyis bdag tu bzung bzhin pa'i mu nas skabs shig phra ma mkhan 'ga'i 'phrul la brten nas khyim tshang nang phan tshun mi mthun par rtsod gleng byung ba'i mthar/byang stag lung gi dgon gnas gtsug lag khang dang rdzong gzhis sogs 'dzin dbang yod tshad de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gis rtsis blangs te/'di'i pha dang mes po sogs la bskal ba cung zad sprad nas zur 'jog byas/gzhis kyi ming la mdo mkhar (phun tshogs rab brtan )zer ba deng sang bod rang skyong ljongs lho kha sa khul khongs mtsho sna rdzong mdo mkhar chus mdo mkhar zer bar yod/'di nyid ni byang stang lung du yab ngag dbang tshangs pa dang yum mda' drung gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me glang (1697)lor 'khrungs/(rang rnam (bka' blon rtogs brjod )nang 'khrungs lo me glang yin par gsungs pa tsam las rab byung dang zla tshes mi gsal yang 'di pas gnas srid gzhung gi bka' blon gnang bzhin pi me glang lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho gshegs pa'i gnas tshul 'khod pa la brten nas 'khrungs lo rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me glang (1697)lo yin par ra 'phrod/) lo drug nas bcu bzhi bar bod kyi yig rtsis snyan ngag bcas sbyangs/lo bco lnga nas lo gsum ring sman gling du lo tsA ba d+harma shri'i drung snyan ngag le'u gsum dang/rtsis skor/yig rigs sna tshogs/sdeb sbyor/rnying ma'i chos lugs bcas la sbyangs/de skabs sgra rig pa'i ri mo (73) yongs rdzogs kyi rgyugs 'phrod pa'i byas rjes su lo chen d+harma shri nas kun bshad kyi ming tshangs sras dgyes pa'i blo ldan zhes gnang rab byung bcu gnyis pa mi sprel (1716)lor gzhis ka rtse'i yong bzhes su bskyod de'i phyi lo gzhis ka rtsi'i rdzong dpon gyi las 'gan bzung bzhin pa'i skabs sog po jun gar gyi dmag bas nas rgyal po lha bzang lha sar dmag thog tu bsad pa sogs la brten rdzong dpon 'pho 'gyur byas stag rtse sde srid lha rgyal rab brtan bod kyi rgyal por bskos de'i phyi lo lcags rtse gri gu rdzong gi rdzong dpon gyi las 'gal log nyis bzung bzhin pa'i skabs (gzhon nu zla med kyi rtogs brjod )mgo brtsams nas mjug mdo mkhar du rdzogs par byas rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags byi (1720)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho sku 'bum nas bod du thog mar gdan drangs nas lo ngo gnyis song ba'i rab byung gong gsal gyi cha stag lo bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi drung 'khor gras su zhugs lo de'i rjes mar gong dkar rdzong gi rdzong dpon byed bzhin pa'i thog pho lha tha'i ji byang khul du gong ma'i bka' bzhin bskyod pa'i tshab tu rtsis dpon gyi las 'gan blangs rab byung gong gsal gyi me lug (1717)lo bka' blon nga phod pa sbyar ra ba lum pa ba gsum phyogs gcig tu bsgril nas pa'i se khang chen nas bsad pa sogs kyi rkyen la brten nas dbus gtsang gnyis dpon rigs nang phan tshun ma mthun pa'i 'khrug zing langs te lo phyed gsum tsam song ba'i rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa bya (1729)lor gong ma'i (yung Ting )bkas mngags pa'i blon chen a li han am ban sogs bod du 'byor te bka' blon gsum sogs nyes can tshang ma tshar bcad pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas bka' blon gyi go gnas rang 'jags thog de'i las rogs su dza sag tha'i ji'i go gnas dang sbrags bka' blon bskos de nas lo ngo nyi shu rtsa bzhi song ba rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags rta (1750)lor wang 'byung med rnam rgyal am ban h+phu cin dang yab tun gnyis kyis tshar bcad pa'i rkyen gyis 'khrugs zing byung ba'i skor la slar yang gong ma'i bkas mngags blon chen a li han am ban 'byor te nyes can rnams khrims kyis tshar bcad pa'i rjes kyi phyi lo der byas rjes gzengs bstod du bka' blon gyi go gnas rang 'jags kyi bka' shog dang slad bod kyi las don skor don tshan bcu gsum du bsdus pa'i rtsa tshig bzos te khyab bsgrags byas ('di skor zhib phra (tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i rnam thar )dang (rdo ring paN+Di ta'i rtogs brjod )gnyis kyi nang gsal/) tA la'i bla ma'i bka' don ltar bya bsgrub mkhan gyi las khungs lta bu bka' shag ces drung 'khor skya bo'i khongs nas mi gsung dang rtse drug gras nas gcig (bka' blon bla ma )bcas bka' blon bzhi (sa dbang zhabs pad )mgron gnyer bzhi (bka' mgron/) drung yig bzhi (bka' drung/) 'gag pa bzi bcas nas tshugs rgyu'i lam lugs thog mar byung mdo mkhar ba 'dis bka' shag ma tshugs gong pho lha tha'i nyi dang mnyam sbrel gyis rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa bya (1729)nas rab byung bcu gsum pa'i ma yos (1747)lar lo bcu dgu'i ring dang de rjes pho lha tha'i nyi 'das pa'i tshab tu de'i bu wang 'gyur med rnam rgyal dang mnyam sbrel gyi lo ngo gsum wang 'gyur med rnam rgyal bsad pa'i rjes rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags lug (1751)lor nas chu rta (1762)lo bar bcas khyon lo ngo sum cu so bzhi tsam bka' blon bya khong ni dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i skabs bod kyi dpon rigs nang gi chab srid mkhas can zhig yin la lhag par skya bo'i khrod kyi rtsom rig mkhas can zhig kyang yin pas mtshan snyan chen po yod cing gsung rtsom ni (mi dbang rtogs brjod )dang (gzhon nu zla med kyi gtam rgyud/) (sangs rgyas (74)  kyi 'khrungs rabs skad gnyis shan sbyar )le'u mang po yod pa (rgya gar skad dang bod skad gnyis shan sbyar gyi nyer mkho'i brda' sprod gsal byed kwa li'i 'phreng bar bsgrigs pa )sogs yod rang rnam (bka' blon rtogs brjod )zhes pa de rang lo re drug pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu rta (1762)lor brtsams nas de'i phyi lor 'das khong gis brtsams gnang ba'i rtsom rigs mang po'i nang nas (gzhon nu zla med kyi gtam rgyud )dang (mi dbang rtogs brjod )ni rgyal khab phyi nang du skad grags che zhing shugs rkyen chen po yod pa dang tshab mtshon rang bzhin ldan pa zhig yin (gzhon du zla med kyi gtam rgyud )ni khong gzhon nu'i dus su brtsams gnang ba zhig yin cing snyan 'jebs tshig sbyor gyi lam nas bshad pa'i gtam rgyud ring po de ni bod mi rigs kyi gtsug lag rgya mtsho chen po'i nang gi 'od stong 'phro ba'i gces nor gyi gras shig red gtam rgyud nang rtsom po pos gson nyams ldan pa'i gtam dpe mang po bkod nas mi'i gzugs brnyan dang yul gyi mdzes ljongs bsam pa'i 'char sgo sogs sne mang phun sum tshogs pa mngon sum bzhin bris yod pa ma zad tshig sbyor dang mngon brjod rnams spyad de snyan 'jebs dang go don zab pa bod mi spyi yis go ba'i phal skad kyi rmang gzhi'i thog phun sum tshugs pa'i gna' bo'i bod kyi brda sbyor mang dag spyad pa bcas kyis rtsom yig des klog pa po tsho'i yid dbang 'phrog thub pa byung ba ma zad snga mo nas bod mi rigs la gzhan dring mi 'jog pa'i rnam par bkra la zad mtha' med pa'i ming tshig yod pa mtshon pas mi rigs gzhan gyi skad yig thog gi dpe deb yod pa rnams kyang bod mi rigs kyi skad yig thog nas mtshon mi thub pa med pa ra sprod byas yod yul gyi mdzes ljongs bya ba don rkyen gang zhig la 'dzin pa'i lta ba sogs tshig bcad snyan ngag gi thog nas bris pa dang bya ba'i brgyud rim dang gzugs brnyan du bkod pa'i mi sna'i bsam blo gtong tshul sogs tshig lhug thog brid pas bcad lhug spel ma'i rtsom lugs kyi rnam pa ldan pa gtam rgyud de lang tsho phun sum tshogs pa'i lus la rgyan gos bzang pos spras pa dang 'dra bar gtam rgyud kyi srog ste rtsom pa po nyid kyis brjod bya ma lus pa snyan ngag me long gi gzhung tshad mar 'jog pa mtshon pa skabs 'phral dgos mkhor gzhigs te tshig rkang mang nyung ci rigs spyad pa'i thog brjod bya'i don dang 'tshams pa'i rgyan rnams kyang mnyam bsres kyi spyad nas mngon par mtshon tshigs bcad rnams tshig skad ring thung ci rigs sdang yang tsheg bar 'dra mtshungs kyi tshig rkang bzhi rer sde pa re brtsis nas rgyan te ston pa'i snyan ngag gi rtsa ba'i rgyun srol gtor nas tshig rkang mang nyung ci rigs rgyan rnams mnyam bsres kyi bris yod pa des (snyan ngag me long )ma'i gzhung dan gyi 'jug sgo yangs par gyur pa'i legs skyes phul yod (mi dbang rtogs brjod )ni rtsom po dar ma'i dus su bris gnang ba zhig yin (1733)lor grub/) 'di ni snying don gsal la tshig don shin tu zab pa rtogs brjod kyi brjod bya brling zhing phal ba'i rgyun du ma song ba sngar srol bzang po'i rtsom rgyun gyi nyams dang ldan pa nang don lo rgyus yin pa la rig rtsom gyi khyad chos kyang yod pa rtsom tshul zad bcas lhug spel ma'i rgyun srol rtsom lugs la brten nas bcad lhug spel ma'i rgyun srol rtsom lugs la brten nas nas brtsams pa zhig yin rtsom rtsal byang chub pa dang rtser son gyi gnas su slebs yod khong gis tshig lhug gi thog nas don brjod pa la la tshig nyung la don zab pa la la phra zhing zhib tshags pa tshigs bcad skabs su la lar nyams 'gyur phun sum tshogs pas spras shing gnas lugs kyi zab don bshad pa sogs kyis klog pa po tsho'i yid dbang 'phag pa dang (mi dbang rtogs brjod )'di'i nang dus rabs gcig gi dngos yod gnas tshul (75) gcig sdud kyis mtshon yod la skabs de dus bod sa gnas srid gzhung dang gong ma'i krung dbyang srid gzhung bar gyi 'brel ba ji yin yang bstan thub pa bcas kyi lo rgyus kyi yig rigs gtsigs chen po zhig yin}
