mdo sde rgyan gyi Tik+ka|{byang chub sems dpa' byams pas mdzad pa'i (mdo sde rgyan )la rgya gar gyi mkhas pa dang bod kyi mkhas pa mang pos brtsams pa'i 'grel bshad yod cing/rgya gar gyi skad nas bod kyi skad du bsgyur ba'i mdo sde rgyan gyi 'grel bshad la/slob dpon dbyig gnyen gyis mdzad pa'i (mdo sde rgyan gyi bshad pa )(bstan 'gyur por (phi)pa'i nang yod/) slob dpon btsun pa ngo bo nyid med pas mdzad pa'i (mdo sde rgyan gyi 'grel bshad/) (bstan 'gyur pod (bi)pa'i nang yod/slob dpon blo gros brtan pas mdzad pa'i (mdo sde rgyan gyi 'grel bshad/) (bstan 'gyur pod (mi)dang (tsi)gnyis la yod )sogs kha shas dang/de min bod kyi chos lugs ris med kyi mkhas pa 'ga' (76) zhig gis kyang 'grel bshad mdzad pa yod gong gsal rgya gar nas bod du bsgyur ba rnams ni rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus lo tsA ba ska ba dpal brtsegs la sogs pas bsgyur ba yin}
mdo sde du ma dang sman dpyad sogs bsgyur|{btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus su (dge ba bcu yi mdo )dang (rten 'brel bcu gnyis kyi mdo/) (sa lu ljang pa'i mdo/) (sher phyin rdo rje gcod pa )bcas bsgyur bar (rba bzhed )las bshad cing/mdo sde gzhan dag gang dang gang bsgyur ba'i skor gyi dpyad gzhi ma rnyed/dpyad kyi skor nas rgya bza' cing khrin kong jos bod du khyer yod ba'i (sman dpyad zla ba'i rgyal po )'am ming gzhan (smad dpyad so ma rA dza )yang zer ba'i de hA ma hA kyin nA dang/rgya phrug sang shing/khyung po tse tse/khyung po dum tshugs/cog la smon lam 'bar rnams kyis bsgyur ba deng sang sde dge bstan 'gyur gyi nang du yod/khrom gyi yul nas sman pa mkhas pa bi dzi tsan pa shi la ha zer bas (rgyud shel gyi me long/) (byang khog stod smad kyi dmar byang/) (yan lag gi bcos thabs/) (de rnams kyi 'grel pa ma gsum dung bu bcu bdun/) (thun mong ma yin pa gsang ba'i bu bzhi/) 'bring gi skor (be'u bum smug po Tik+ka yang tig gnyis/) (gso dpyad rin chen dbyig) (ro bkra 'phrul gyi me long )sogs gzhung che chung bcu gsum tsam bod skad du bsgyur bsogs zhib par sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i gso rig gi khog dbub )las gsal bas der gzigs}
