mdo smad spyi khyab|{rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu glang (1913)lor lu'u cung rgya dmag bod sa nas phyir 'bud byas rjes mdo smad khul zhi drag spyi 'dogs bka' blon bla ma byams pa bstan dar ngo las bsko zhag gis chab mdo sa gnas su bka' shag spyi khyab las khungs dngos su btsugs shing/der las bya rim bzhi ser skya gnyis dang/phogs dpon mkhan rim gnyis/mgron las gnyis/bka' drung gcig /bka' mgron gcig /gzim 'gag gcig /las bya dkyu ma rtse shod ser skya bcu skor bcas yod/las 'gan ni/mdo smad khul gyi sa srung dma' dpon dang/rdzong 'go gzhis sdod bcas kyi mi 'gro bod sa gnas srid gzhung nas bsko gzhag byas rung/sa srung 'go dmag sa gnas gang du bca' sdod dgos min mdo spyi nas thag gcod gnang rgyu dang/rdzong gzhis so so'i khral bsdu khrims 'doms byed phyogs/'char 'phar rkang 'gro lag 'don gyi khri rigs nye rgyang mi snyoms pa'i rigs la sa mi'i zhib gcod/dmag phogs 'du 'god/sa 'gag khag tu ja tshwa spu bal/pags rigs/sman rdzas la sogs pa'i sho khral bsdu dam bsko gtong bcas mdor na khul de'i zhi drug byed sgo'i nang nas sa mtshams thob shor gyi rtsod bsnyad yo lang rigs bod sa gnas srid gzhung la dgongs skor dgos pa las/de bying mdo spyi rang nas thag gcod byas chog pa bcas red}
