'dul 'dzin grags pa rgyal mtshan|{'dul 'dzin grags pa rgyal mtshan mgon ni dbu stong sbram (dbu stod 'brang mda' zhes kyang snang )du rab byung drug pa'i shing stag (1374)lor sku 'khrungs/chung ngu nas gdan sa mthil du spyan snga chos kyi rgyal po'i gzim dpon mdzad/de nas rje tsong pa chen po la mi phyed pa'i dad pa brnyes (84) te mdo sngags kyi chos rgya cher gsan sbyong gnang nas rje bdag nyid chen po'i sras kyi thu bor gyur te rje'i slob ma thams cad kyis rje nyid dang 'dra bar gus par byed cing chos zhus mdo sngags spyi dang khyad par 'dul ba la mkhas pas 'dul TIka gleng 'bum bslab bya gzhi gsum cho ga sogs chog bsgrigs mang po brtsams te 'dul 'dzin zhes pa mtshan dan dang mthun par grags dga' ldan dgon pa bzhengs pa'i tshe rje'i bka' bzhin gtsug lag khang rten dang brten par bcas pa yongs su rdzogs pa ma grub pa'i bar 'khur bzhes rje tsong kha pa chen po zhing du gshegs rjes rgyal tshab rje gdan sar mnga' gsol rje'i gdung rten bzhengs pa sogs mdzad rje rin po che'i dgongs rdzogs su sngar rgyal po srong btsan yab yum gyi skyed mos tshal te btsun mo rnams rgyun du bzhugs pas btsun mo tshal zhes grags 'i sar chos sde btab nas dge 'dun brgyad brgya tsam bsdus 'jam dbyangs chos rje bkra shis dpal ldan gyi bsnyen rdzogs las slob kyang mdzad bka' rtsom ('dul ba'i bslab bya chen mo )dang (rtsa ltung bcu bzhi'i 'grel pa gsal byed 'khrul spong/) (bcom ldan 'das thams cad rig pa'i dkyil 'khor cho ga'i rnam bshad lags bshad snying po )sogs pod 'bring gnyis tsam bzhugs dgung lo re gcig la phebs pa rab byung bdun pa'i shing stag (1434)lor btsun mo tshal du sku gshegs sku dgung ril bu btsun mo tshal gyi dgon par bzhugs}
