'dus srong mang po rje|{btsan po mang srong mang btsan gyi sras yin cing/tun hong gi gter yig sogs bod kyi lo rgyud mang por btsan po mang srong mang btsan sku gshegs pa'i lo der 'khrungs par bshad/'khrungs lo la bshad tshul mi 'dra ba sna tshogs 'dug /tun hong gi gter yig nang/byi ba'i (676)lo la khri mang srong dgung du gshegs nas/btsan po khri 'dus srong sku bltams par bshad/(thang rgyal rabs kyi yig tshang rnying ma )las/btsan po mang srong gshegs pa'i lo der 'dus srong mang po rje khri la 'khod pa dang/de dus 'dus srong dgung lo brgyad la phebs yod par bshad pa sogs mi mthun pa yod pa de skor gyi dpyad gzhi rnams 'dir ma bris shing/bod yig gi lo rgyus mang por btsan po sku na gzhon dus nas dpa' mdzangs ldan zhing stabs rtsal che ba zhig yod ces gsal ba ltar/(tun hong gi gter yig )las kyang/phag rgod la bshan gyis mdzad/g.yag rgod sgrog tu bcug /stag gi rnab la bzung ba sogs pa/thugs sgam pa'i steng du sku rtsal chen pos bsnan te/mi dang mi 'dra bar 'phags pa nyi 'og rgyal po thams cad dang/'bangs mgo nag phyogs kyis mtshan bla dwags 'phrul gyi rgyal po zhes btags ste/bka' mchid kyi dper brjod do zhes gsal por 'khod yod pa sa dpa' mdzangs can zhig yin/dgung lo chung dus chab srid kyi las don rnams blon po mgar stong btsan gyi bu mgar khri 'bring gis bskyangs shing/mgar gya bu gzhan dag rnams dmag dpon du bskos yod stabs lo nyi shu tsam gyi rim bod kyi zhi drag dbang cha yongs rdzobs blon po mgar gyi mi rgyun rnams kyi lag tu bzung ste/btsan po ni ming tsam las don dngos gyi dbang cha blon po'i lag tu shor ba zhig byung/thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ma 'u tse then gyi hrin li khri lo gnyis pa sa phag (699)lor btsan pos ri dwags brngon par kha g.yar te dmag dpung bsdus nas mgar khri 'bring 'a zha'i yul du dmag dpon la bsdad skabs btsan pos dmag sa nas bod du phyir log (87) byed dgos pa'i bka' rgya zhig btang khri 'bring gis kyang blo dogs byung ste btsan po'i mdun du log ma 'ongs par brten glo bur du khri 'bring la dmag drangs thog kho'i phyogs gtogs mi nyin stong tsam bsad rjes khri 'bring rang srog bcad mgar gyi bu btsan brod rang g.yog stong phrag gcig lhag tsam khrid nas thang gi gong ma 'u tse then la mgo btags zhus te go gnas kyang byung gong ma 'u tse then gyi khrang an khri lo gsum pa chu yos (703)lor btsan po'i mnga' 'og tu yod 'i 'jang pa rnams kyis ngo log byas par btsan po rang nyid ngo mas dmag sde khrid nas 'jam la dmag drangs te slar yang mnga' 'og tu bsdus shing dmag thug tu 'das rgyal po 'di'i dus su blon po rtsal chen mi bdun byung ba dang rgyal po bsnyung ba'i rkyen gyes de la phan pa'i ja 'tshol du btang nas bod du ja thog mar byung ba ja de bzhes pa'i snod bzang po dkar yon bzo ba'i lag rtsal mkhas can dgos zhes thang rgyal rabs ra re 'dun zhus pa ra bon du ra bzo'i lag rtsal mkhas can btang nas dka' yol bod dkar bzos pa sogs zhib par (rgya bod yig tshang )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 123nas 126bar dang ja yi bshad pa )dang (dkar yol brtag 'i bstan bcos )bcas gong gsal (rgya bod yig tshang )gi shog grangs 171nas 174bar 'god pa der gzigs/_/btsan po 'di'i bang ni so yab mang srong mang btsan gyi bang so'i g.yon ngos su yod pa dang mtha' la lcags ri yang yod ces gsal zhing bang so 'di 'bangs gyen log gi skabs breng 'khyos 'khus brus zin pas deng sang bang so'i shul tsam las med lde'u jo sras kyis mdzad pa'i (chos 'byung )las btsan po 'di'i gung po gsum yod pa thang mtshams su phab par bshad}
