'don cha rgyugs sprod|{de snga dgon pa khag gi tshogs 'don rgyugs sprod byed stangs rigs gnyis yod/1 so sos dgon pa der sgrigs zhugs byas rjes tshogs gzhung gi 'don cha yongs rdzogs blo 'dzin byas nas dgon pa de'i mkhan po'am bla ma dang/yang na dbu mdzad bcas kyi (90) mdun du ngag thog nas rgyugs sprod byed kyi yod pa dang 2 grwa dmangs rnams tshogs khang du 'tshogs nas ja thug 'thung ba'i skabs dang bstun te blo thog nas rgyugs sprod srol yang yod}
