'dre|{bon po'i chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/mi ri re la so sor srung skyob byed mkhan gyi lha re dang/gnod 'tshe gtong zhing srong gi bdag po byed mkhan 'dre re yod zer/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol/mi de shi khar rkyen ngan pa sna tshogs kyis shi na 'dre la skyes zer/'dre yod par khas len pa'i lta tshul de'i rtsa ba thug sa ni/skyes ba snga ma nas 'dir 'ong ba dang 'di nas phyi mar 'gro mkhan gyi rnam shes khas len pa la thug gi red zer ba'i shod tshul de zhib cha byed dgos pa ste/dper na bod kyi bon chos khag mang po'i nang nas 'ga' zhig gis 'dre yod par khas len kyang/mi'i rnam shes de lus po dang bral tshar rjes sgron me shi ba ltar yal nas 'gro ba ma gtogs/skye ba snga phyi zer ba gtan nas med zer gyi yod pa dang/kho tshos yod zer ba'i 'dre de ni/shi mkhan mi de yi bla srog la rngams nas sdod mkhan gyi gdon 'dre zhig yin pas mi de shi rjes de med par ma bzos na des khyim tshang dang/mi rgyud rjes ma mu mthun nas gnod pa skyel gyi red zer ro/_}
