'dres rkang brgya rtsa brgyad|{'dres rkang bdun (phung po/skye mched/khams/rten 'brel/zas/byang phyogs so bdun bden pa bzhi/bsam gtan tshad med gzugs med pa'i/_/rnam thar brgyad dang snyoms 'jug dgu/sgo gsum mngon shes drug ting 'dzin/_/gzigs sgo stobs bcu mi 'jigs bzhi/_/so sor rig bzhi byams pa che/_/snying rje ma 'dres bco brgyad dang/_/zang bzhi rang rgyal byang sems dang/_/sangs rgyas ma mkhyen gsum lnga bcu lnga/_/rnam byang 'dres te brgya rtsa brgyad ces pa'i sdom ltar ro/_}
'dres khrid|{bod du dmangs khrod kyi rgyun la mi 'ga' zhig sems pa mi bde ba'i nad zog nas dus tshod ring po ma song gong la gar song med par gyur pa de ni gdon 'dres sems bsgyur te khrid pa red ces shod srol yod pa de red}
rdul ches|{rdung ches song ba zhes 'gyel ba'i don la 'jug }
