rde'u rtsed|{bod du dar srol yod pa'i rtsed mo'i rigs shig yongs grags su spyang khu ra lug zer ba/'gro lam drug las med pa'i thog lug gcig la spyang phu gnyis kyis bskor nas spyang khu gnyis kyi bar du lug tshud na lug shi zer ba lug pham pa dang/lug gi rjes su spyang khu yod na lug mo spyang khus 'ded pa zer bas lug g.yas g.yon du bros dgos pa/lug gi sngon du spyang khu yod na lug blo bde zer ba lug la rgyal kha thob pa yin zer srol yod}
rdo grub chen 'jigs med bstan pa'i nyi ma|{(grub chen sku phreng gsum pa )rab byung bco lnga pa'i me yos (1867)nas me stag (1926)lo'i bar rdo stod gtsang chen dngos grub dpal 'bar gling zhes pa'i dgon par gsang rnying ris med kyi mdo sngags bshad sgrub kyi chos grwa btsugs te mkhas grub kyi bla ma mang du byon/snying thig dum gnyis dang/mdzod bdun/rdo grub chen 'jigs med bstan pa'i nyi ma'i gsum 'bum sogs kyi par shing sna tshogs bzhugs pa'i rnying pa'i dgon pa grags can zhig tu bsgyur/mdzad rnam zhib pa dang 'khrungs 'das kyi lo tshigs ma rnyed}
rdo grub chen 'jigs med 'phrin las 'od zer|{rje 'dis rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags rta (1810)lor grub chen dgon gyi gdan sa'i thog mar yar lung pad+ma bkod ces pa khams kyi wa shul gser tha'i stod yar lung gi sa char rdo grub chen dgon pa phyag btab/'khrungs 'das sogs kyi mdzad rnam zhib pa ma rnyed}
rdo sgor|{rdo sgor ni de snga bod du dar khyab che la/rgyag stangs thad lung tshan so sor cung mi 'dra ba yod/lha sar rdo sgor rgyag stabs ni/g.yag gi rwa tso dang yang na sa rdo'i tho 'bog gi 'ben btsugs shing/rgyang thag spyi khre lnga bcu tsam gyi sa nas rdo g.yugs dgos/rdo sgor rgyag mkhan rnams kyis g.yugs byed rdo yi ljid tshad spyi rgya gang tsam yod pa dbyibs sgor mo dang gru bzhi gang rung mang (92) nyung gcig mtshungs so so'i mdun du spungs nas snga rting gis rdo sgor g.yugs te 'ben de dag gtor thub byed kyi yod yang 'bri g.yag gi rwa co'i rtse la rnga dmar bkon te rdo sgor gyis gtor thub min 'gran pa dang rnga dmar g.yugs thub na legs par brtsi srol yod rdo sgor g.yugs skabs rgyang rdo gzhus pa ltar min par lag pa dang rdo kha bslangs te 'drong por gzhus nas dmigs sa'i 'ben la phog pa dang de gtor thub pa bya rgyu de yin}
rdo rje|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags nas bshad pa'i lha yi phyag mtshan gyi rigs shig yin/'di la yang rdo rje rtse lnga pa dang/rtse dgu pa/rdo rje phyed pa sogs mi 'dra ba yod/zhib par mkhas grub chen po che dge legs dpal bzang gis mdzad pa'i (rnal 'byor rol pa'i dga' ston )dang sog po dam tshig rdo rjes mdzad pa'i (gsang sngags kyi dam tshig gi rdzas dang yo byad kyi rnam bzhag )gnyis su gsal bas der gzigs}
