rdo ston shes rab grags|{'di nyid rab byung gnyis pa'i me mo lug (1127)lor shab kyi drang mda'i thu lung du sku 'khrungs/dge bshes gong ma nyid kyis legs par bskyangs nas bka' gdams kyi gdam pa ma lus pa thugs su chud/dgung lo bzhi bcu'i thog snar thar gi gdan sa mdzad de lnga bcu rtsa dgu'i bar lo nyi shu'i ring tshogs dpon mdzad pas snar thar pa chen po zhes phyogs thams (98) cad du grags pas khyab tshogs pa'ang che bar bsdus shing bka' gdams kyi bstan pa nyi ma ltar gsal bar mdzad rab byung gsum pa'i shing sbrul (1185)lor mya ngan las 'das gdung rten ni gdan sa dang po'i gdung rten gyi shar na bzhugs so/_}
