rdo ring bka' blon gung paN+Di ta|{mtshan dngos/mgon po dngos grub rab brtan te/bod rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags glang (1721)lor yab mnga' ris sgra dpon tshe bstan bkra shis (da'i ching sba dur gyi gcung po )dang/yum bsod nams lha sgron gnyis kyi sras su sku 'khrungs/sras gsum yod pa nas che ba rnam rgyal tshe brtan/'bring ba gung paN+Di ti 'di nyid/chung ba lho brag nyi lde sprul sku blo bzang gar dbang mchog grub bcas gsum yod/dgung lo chung dus smin grol gling du slob dpon chos rdzong pa'i sar lo bdun gyi ring yi ge dang rim gnas slob sbyong mdzad rjes/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho dang pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas gnyis kyi mdun sgra dang sdeb sbyor/skar rtsis/snyan dngags bcas cha tshang ba'i rgyus 'bul byas par brten bya dga'i ngo bo mang po gnang ba ma zad no yon paN+Di ta zhes pa'i mtshan bstod kyang gnang/de nas mi ring ba'i gcen po gung rnam rgyal tshe brtan nad mnar gyis 'das rjes tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa dang/pho lha tha'i nyi gnyis nas 'das po'i gcung po no yon paN+Di ta la rig gnas kyi shes yon dang chab srid kyi 'jon thang yag po yod pa'i gnas tshul skor gong ma chad lung la zhus par brten chan lung khri lo lnga pa (1740)lor bka' phab ste gcen po gung rnam rgyal tshe brtan gyi gung gi go gnas de gcung po no yon paN+Di ta la mu mthun nas brgyud 'dzin byed bcug pa dang/chan lung khri lo bco lnga pa (1750)lor bka' phab pa ltar pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas kyi bu 'gyur med rnam rgyal bod sdod am ban h+phu cin dang la btun gnyis kyis srog thog btang rjes/'gyur med rnam rgyal gyi rjes 'brang mgron gnyer blo bzang bkra shis sogs kyis lha sar sdod pa'i am ban gnyis dang/las byed/tshong pa sogs rgya rigs mang che ba bsad pa'i zing 'khrug byung skabs/no yon paN+Di ta nas thabs mkhas kyi ngo log byed gte rnams 'dzin bzung byed thub pa'i thog skabs 'phral gyi lding 'jags 'ong ba byed thub par brten/de'i phyi lo bka' shag gsar du 'dzugs skabs bka' blon gyi gtso bo nor yon gung paN+Di ta la byed du bcug thog /de nas bzung cha