rdo ring bstan 'dzin dpal 'byor|{sde dpon dga' bzhi rdo ring zhes pa ni sngar bod sa gnas srid gzhung dus su ming grags che la 'byor stobs rgyas pa'i dpon rigs rnying khungs sde dpon che khag bzhi'i gras shig yin cing/rdo ring gi pha mes rnams tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i dus nas drung 'bring dkyus ma lus pa'i dpon rgyun yin pa dang/bstan 'dzin dpal 'byor gyi spo ba'i gras khang chen po da'i ching ba dur ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng drug pa dang/rgyal po bzang dus gzhis bka' yongs kyi las tshan byas myong zhing stod sgar dpon las thog skabs mnga' ris brgyud bros 'gro ba'i sog po jun gar ba'i dmag (101) rnams rmeg med du btang nas kho la tshos rku 'khyer byas pa'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi nang rten srong btsan sgam po'i thugs dam rten 'phags pa lo ke shwa ra dang rin chen rgyan cha sogs dgra nas blangs te nyams med rtsis 'bul zhus par brten gong mas khong la pa'e se'i cho lo dang sbrags bka' blon gtso bo'i las 'khur bskor gzhag mdzad bod rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me lug (1727)lo bka' blo dang lus sbyar gum gyis da'i ching ba dur bsad cing dbus dmag myang stod phyogs su lhag skabs da'i ching ba dur gyi gcung po bstan 'dzin dpal 'byor gyi spo bo ngo drung mnga' ris sgar dpon tshe brtan bkra shis la pho bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis mngags pa ltar mnga' ris skor gsum dpung gi sne khrid de rgyal rtser dbus dmag la g.yul las rnam par rgyal te bod kyi srid skyong gi khrol 'khod ma thag dga' bzhi par gzigs bskyangs chenapo byung skabs de'i gzhung sger chos srid kyi byed sgo gang sar goms 'dris 'jon thang che ba'i rdo ring paN+Di tas (mgon po dngos grub rab brtan )mdo mkhar zhabs drung gi bo mo ring chen skyid 'dzoms chung bar blangs nas dga' bzhi'i rgyud 'dzin pa bstan 'dzin dpal 'byor rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags 'brug (1760)lor 'khrungs bstan 'dzin dpal 'byor la chung dus nas rdo nga paN+Di tas rgyun srol gyi slob gsol dang sbyor brdar gtong rgyur do nan chen po mdzad de dgung lo lnga tsam nas yi ge 'bri klog mdzad 'og tshugs pa dang dgung lo brgyad nas bzung snga r