sde khri 'jam dbyangs thub bstan nyi ma|{sde khri 'jam dbyangs thub tan nyi ma'am gsang mtshan rat+nA badzra ni mtsho sngon g.yon ru rtse drug snying bdun rtse nA yo che ba bco brgyad du grags pa'i nang tshan be len nA gran zhes par yab sog rigs ka 'bum smad pa ngag dbang phun tshoms dang yum mo skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa phag (1779)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi la phebs dus rong po'i shar no mon han rin po cher yab (112) yum gnyis nas btsan zhus par 'jam dbyangs thub bstan nyi ma zhes gsol skyabs mgon mchog gis dgung lo lnga la sku gong ma 'jigs med lung rigs rgya mtsho'i sprul skur ngos bzung dgung lo drug la phebs skabs dga' ldan bkra shis 'khyil rgyud pa grwa tshang la gdan drangs kun mkhyen 'jigs med dbang po'i drung du rab tu byung ste mtshan sngar ltar 'jam dbyangs thub bstan nyi ma zhes gsol dgung lo dgu nas bcu bar kun mkhyen chen po'i sa nas mdo sngags kyi chos gsan dgung lo bcu gcig la bkra shis 'khyil thos bsam gling gi chos grwar zhugs nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bzhes mdzad dgung lo bcu bzhir gung thang bstan pa'i sgron me'i drung rab byung sdom pa bzhes dgung lo nyi shu tham par rje gung thang pa'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs dgung lo nyer bzhi par dka' ram 'dzin grwar phebs dgung lo nyer bdun skabs grwa tshang tsha gan be shing gi khri pa lo gnyis mdzad dgung lo sum cu tham par a ru hor chen gyi dpon be li yum sras gyis gdan zhus ltar rgya sog yul grur phebs nas do lon bu lag dgon gsar bzhengs dang har chin be li'i dgon par dus 'khor grwa tshang btsugs dus 'khor dbang lan grags kha shas dang sgrub thabs brgya rgyam sogs dbang rjes gnang lam rim blo sbyong gi khrid sogs chos 'khor rgya cher bskor chu ltar bar lo bcu lnga'i ring bzhugs dgung lo zhe lnga lor rgya sog yul rga nas phyir log phebs 'jam dbyangs kun gzigs gtsor bzhugs kyi stong sku'i lha khang rten dang brten pa gzing gang dang bcas gsar bzhengs mdzad dgung lo zhe drug lor bkra shis 'khyil gyi khri par phebs do dgon pa'i 'dul khrims dang tshogs chos ra'i sgrig 'khur bslab pa slob gter gang car do dam zhib tig yang yang mdzad pas 'chad rtsod kyi chos grwar shin tu 'phel bar gyur dgung lo zhe brgyad par rje nyid slar yang sog yul du phebs mkhas grub rje'i dkyil chog yongs rdzogs sog skad du bsgyur te sa skya'i dus ltar hor gyi rang skad du 'don rgyu'i srol 'dzugs mdzad rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags byi (1840)lor chos 'khor sgar sher phyin gling gsar 'debs mdzad der bde gsang 'jigs gsum gyi dbang bstsal dgung lo re gsum la lcang skya bla brang zung kru sir phyag phebs te lcang skya rin po che dang mjal khong la dus 'khor dang kun rig dbang bstsal do lon bu lag tu de gar bsnyen rdzogs brgya dang re brgyad dang dge tshul sum cu rab byung bcup+sagarub pa sogs mdzad dgung lo re bzhi la phebs skabs be la'i gdon du so gsar gyi dgyes ston la lam rim chen mo'i bshad lung sog skad du bsgyur nas nyin bco brgyad rim rgyas par gnang bka' rtsom (rje btsun 'jam dbyangs thub bstan nyi ma dpal bzang po'i zhal snga nas yi rnam par thar pa gsang gsum bkra shis ri mo )dang (rje btsun byams pa mgon po'i rtogs brjod pad dkar phreng ba/) (dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i bskyed rim rnam bzhag 'jam dpal zhal lung/) (rdo rje dbyings kyi dkyil 'khor gyi cho ga yid bzhin nor bu'i do shal/) (bcom ldan 'das rdo rje mi 'khrugs pa la brten pa'i smyung gnas cho ga) (bstan srung rnams kyi gtor 'bul )skor sogs mang du mdzad phyis su ri bo rtse lngar thengs gsum phebs pa dang phyi log nang log gi dgon pa mchod gzhis dang bcas par chos bka' ci rigs gnang rab byung bsnyen rdzogs brgya phrag du ma gsar sgrub mdzad pa sogs bstan 'gror gcig tu sman pa'i mdzad bzang bsam gyis mi khyab dgung grangs gya bzhi la phebs pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu khyi (1862)lor bod zla gnyis pa'i tshes bzhi nyin dgongs pa chos dbyings su gshegs}
sde dge spyi khyab|{rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing stag (1914) (113) lor mdo spyi bka' bla byams pa bstan dar nas mdo smad khul sa srung 'go dmag khag bgos kyis gtong gnang mdzad khongs sde dge khul du dmigs bsal spyi khyab zur du ma dgon pa rnam kun khrims 'doms byed sgo sa srung mda' dpon nas gcig lcogs kyis sa mtshams dang gzhan yang don don che gras mdo spyir snyan seng zhu dgos pa las de byings sa srung mda' dpon nas thag gcod bya rgyu'i srol 'dzugs ltar lam byang du gyur pa red}
sde brgyad|{'di la grangs 'dren tshul mi 'dra ba 'ga' zhig yod tshul 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa dkon mchog 'jigs med dbang pos mdzad pa'i (gsung rab rnams las byung ba'i grangs 'dren gyi rim pa phyogs gcig tu bkod pa )las gsungs pa ltar bris na/rgyud sde las gsungs pa'i sde brgyad ni/1 lha/2 klu/3 gnod sbyin/4 lto 'phye/5 mkha' lding/6 lha min/7 grul bum/8 mi'am ci rnams so/_/yang lugs gcig la/1 dkar po lha'i sde/2 nag po bdud kyi sde/3 dmar po btsan gyi sde/4 smug po dmu'i sde/5 khra bo gza' yi sde/6 sha za srin po'i sde/7 dkor bdag rgyal po'i sde/8 nad bdag mo mo'i sde bcas su 'dren tshul dang/yang rnying ma'i gzhung las gsungs pa'i sde brgyad grangs 'dren tshul khag bzhi las/dang po/phyi'i sde brgyad ni/1 lha yi dbang po brgya sbyin/2 lha min gyi dbang po thags bzang ris/3 klu'i rgyal po dga' bo/4 srin po'i rgyal po lang ka mgrin bcu/5 bdud kyi rgyal po dmu rje btsan po/6 mi'am ci'i rgyal po 'jon pa rta mgon can sogs/gnyis pa/nang gi sde brgyad ni/1 klu sog ma med pa/2 ma mo tsa muN+Ti/3 gshin rje dmar po/4 gza' bdud nag po/5 btsan yam shud dmar po/6 bdud mo gser mig ma/7 yul lha mahA de ba/8 sman mo 'brug sgrog /gsum pa/gsang ba'i sde brgyad ni/1 dbang phyug mahA de ba/2 klu 'chi bdag mgo dgu/3 gshin rje chos kyi rgyal po/4 ma mo e ka dzA ri/5 bdud po ral pa rkya gcig /6 srin po yak+sha dag po/7 gnod sbyin so ga /8 gza' khyab 'jug bcas dang/bzhi pa/drag po sngags kyi sde brgyad ni/1 btsan sbrul mgo can/2 dmu bdun ya ba ti/3 bdun nag po bkrag med/4 srin po srog gcod nag po/5 klu bdud nag po sprul zhags can/6 sgrol gying yam shud dmar po/7 gnod sbyin srog gcod nag po/8 ma mo nag po 'jigs ma bcas so/_/da dung de min pa'i 'dren tshul gzhan 'ga' zhig yod kyang 'dir ma bris so/_}
