sde srid 'khrungs khang|{sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho ni grong khyer lha sa'i byang ngos spa ri don gcod khang khongs nyan bran nang (se ra dgon pa'i nye 'dabs )sngar grong smad ces se ra dgon pa'i mchod gzhis shig yod pa der spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu bdun par yab da pa a sug dang yum bu 'khrid gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs shing/khong gi sku zhang 'phrin las rgya mtshos kyang sde srid kyi thugs 'gan bzhes pas khyim tshang 'di nas sde srid gnyis byung zhing/rten du sde srid kyi bzhugs khri dang snum gyi rgyun yod yos snum rgyun de las sde srid kyis ma thebs bzhag gnang ba'i se ra'i rigs grwa'i kha zas bsreg gi yod/rjes su lha (115) bzang gis sde srid bkrongs pa nas khang khyim rnams se ra spyi so'i khongs su sprad pa lags so/_}
sde srid ngag gi dbang po|{phag gru sde srid khri rabs brgyad pa 'di nyid rab byung bdun pa'i sa lug (1439)lorarags pa 'byung gnas kyi sras su sku bltams/dgung lo bcu drug par thel gyi spyan sngar phebs/nang so mtsho skyes pas blon chen dang/thon pa rin chen dar rgyas kyis ka bzhi bzung/sde srid gang dbang dbang po dgung lo zhe bdun du phebs pa rab byung brgyad pa'i shing sbrul (1485)lor rgyal rtse dang dbus su sde gzar byung rung ngag gi dbang po nying gang la'ang ma phyogs par spyi dpon du bzhugs te bar 'dum khon mdzad pas sde gzar gyi lo 'khyoms che ba ma byung/de dus rin spungs pa shug rgyas pa'i skabs la brten chos lugs kyi kun slong 'then 'khyer byas te sne'u pa'i lag nas rdzong gzhis 'ga' shas 'phrog skabs bder lta rigs rlangs kyi dgung 'dzin pa spyan snga nyid ma gtogs med pas blon po 'ga' shas gros te rdzong kha ba'i sras mo zhig gong ma ngag gi dbang po'i bdag mor phul ba de la sras ngag dbang bkra shis grags pa 'khrungs/sde srid 'di nyid kyis 'gos lo gzhon nu dpal gyi zhabs la gtugs pa dang/dpal chos kyi grags pa yongs 'dzin du bsten nas zab chos mang pos gsan bsam mdzad/rtsed thang gi mtshan nyid pa rnams dang/sgrub mchod che mo bcas la bdag rkyen bzang po mdzad/thang stong rgyal po snying po gru la lcags zab 'dzugs par mthun rkyang gang legs sbyar ba sogs rnam dkar gyi mdzad pa rgya che ba yab las lhag pa bskyangs te mthar dgung lo nga gnyis la phebs pa ram byung brgyad pa'i lcags khyi (1490)lor sku gshegs/chu glang (1493)lor ming gong mas sde srid ngag gi dbang por wang zhes pa rgyal po'i cho lo dang gnang sbyin gnang/spyan snga rin po che dgongs pa rdzogs zin stabs gnang sbyin rnams phyag mdzod la bstsal nas gong ma'i pho nya phyir log }
sde srid phag mo gru pa|{yon rgyal rabs kyi dus su rlangs lha gzigs kyi gdung rgyud rgyal ba thog rgyugs pa'i nye gnas rdo rje dpal phag gru'i khri dpon gyi gos thog mar byung ba dang/de rjes drung chen byang chub rgyal mtshan la tA si tu'i 'ja' sa byung bas de nas sde srid phag mo gru pa zhes 'bod de dbus gtsang yongs la dbang bsgyur byas}
sde srid phag mo gru pa'i rgyal rabs rim byon bcu gnyis|{1 si tu byang chub rgyal mtshan (1354nas 1371/) 2 shAkya rgyal mtshan (1372nas 1384/) 3 grags pa byang chub (1385nas 1390/) 4 bsod nams grags pa (1391nas 1408/) 5 grags pa rgyal mtshan 1409nas 1434/) 6 sangs rgyas rgyal mtshan (1435nas 1439/) 7 grags pa 'byung gnas 1440nas 1468/) 8 kun dga' legs pa (1469nas 1473/) 9 rin chen rdo rje (1474nas 1513/) 10 spyan snga ngag gi dbang po (1514nas 1564/) 11 ngag dbang bkra shis grags pa (1565nas 1578/) 12 'gro ba'i mgon po (1579nas 1617/) (sa skya'i rgyal rabs 'phros/lo 264la chos srid bskyangs so/_}
sde srid 'phrin las rgya mtsho|{ja'i sang da pa'am grong smad pa 'phrin las rgyal mtsho 'di sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i mes po yin/grong smad ces pa'i khyim gyi ming yin zhing/lha sa'i nyang bran gyi mdar yod/gtsang pa sde srid kyis dbang sgyur skabs bka' dge'i bar gyi 'khrug rtsod nang grong smad pas dga' ldan pho brang par sman pa'i bya ba du ma mdzad yod cing/grong smad 'phrin las rgya (116) mtshor ja'i sang sde pa zhes kyang 'bod dga' ldan pho brang pa'i srid dbang btsugs rjes rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu 'brug (1652)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa pe cin du phebs skabs ja'i sang da pa 'phrin las rgya mtsho chibs zhabs su phebs gong ma shun krin tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga par mjal 'phrad gnang skabs ja'i sang sde pa 'phrin las rgya mtsho yang 'jal 'phrad nang zhugs yod pa ma zad gong mas gnang cha yang bstsal rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me bya (1657)lor sde srid bsod nams chos 'phel (bsod nams rab brtan nam rgya le chos mdzad yang zer )sku 'das shing lcags byi (1660)lor 'phrin las rgya mtshos sde srid kyi 'gan bzhes las tham nag po gling gsum ma zhig yod nyan brad du yod pa'i grong smad pa'i 'dzin khongs su tA la'i bla ma'i sku phreng lnga par sa brtags zhus nas chu bzang ri khrod btab chu stag (1662)or 'bras mo ljongs kyi rgyal po phun tshogs rnam rgyal gyi sras rgyal por bstan srung rnam rgyal mchog lnga pa chen po mjal bar lha sar phebs skabs sde srid mchog las khrims yig zhal lce bcu drug skor la slob ston mang po zhu gnang mdzad shing sbrul (1665)lor gong ma khang shis kyi re skul ltar byams gling mkhan po tshul khrims rgyal mtshan dang khang gsar rab brtan gnyis ched gtong gis rgya sog sa mtshams 'khel ba'i sog po'i sde dpon rnams la rang da rang bzung dang sa mtshams 'khel gyi rgya sde rnams la sun gtser ma byas par sngar lugs tshong gi 'brel ba dam zab byed dgos pa'i bka' slob gnang bas 'khon rtsod zhi 'jags dang tshong 'brel sngar song chad pa byung tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i bka' bkod dgongs don ji bzhin bstan sred bya ba lo dgu bsg