sde srid bshad sgra dbang phyug rgyal po|{pa snam khul sger spel bzhi pa'i mi ste/rgyud thog chung dus spel bzhi chos mdzad zer ba ste/thog mar bshad sgra bka' blon don grub rdo rje bsam yas nyams gso rab zhugs skabs phan tshun ngo shes byung ba dang 'brel ba dam po byung zhing/dbang phyug rgyal po bsam yas dkar me'i las ka byas rjes rtsis chad kyi rkyen pas zhol las khungs su do dam gnang ba dang/rtsis chad sgrub dmigs med rkyen sker sgo zhag bdun g.yog te rdol gzhis su sa 'dzin gtong rgyu'i sngon du zhol rdo ring sgang du 'jog ring bka' blon don grub rdo rje rtser phebs skabs gzigs te/bka' shag la bka' mos zhus nas dkar me'i rtsis chad rnams bshad sgra rang nas sgrub 'bul zhu rgyu dang/do bdag spel bzhi chos mdzad bshad sgrar gsol ras zhus chog pa zhes snyan zhu phul bar rgyal blon bka' 'phrol byung ba ltar zhol las khungs nas bslus te bshad sgrar nyar gnang gis phyi 'gro sogs las don bya mur bshad sgra'i sras mo dang gnyen sgrig byung zhing/dbang phyug rgyal po 'di nyid 'jon thang che la yig rtses yag po yod pa dang bshad sgra bka' blon don grub rdo rje ni mi dpyad brgya par mkhas shing/rigs sras med pa bcas la ban bshad sgra'i ming thog nas zhabs sdod zhu gnang mdzad/de nas rim bzhin rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing rta (1834)lor bod dang la dwags dmag 'khrug skabs dbus mda' dpon dbang phyug rgyal pos dbus gtsang yul dmag gi 'go 'khrid nas mnga' ris phyogs su bskyod nas pha rol po'i dmag dang 'thab lag 'phrod de bod dmag nas gdong gtug lag 'dzings byed pa'i snying por la sing gi dmag sum brgya skor bsad pa dang/bdun brgya skor gson bzung byas pa'i khongs su la dwags pa'i bka' blon gnyis kyang yod (117) pa tshang ma skyel mi dang bcas dbus gtsang gi phyogs su brdzangs de dang de 'dra'i dmag 'thab rim pa byas pa brgyud mthar rgyal kha yongs su thob pa'i byas rjes su bshad sgra dbang phyug rgyal por bka' blon gyi go gnas thob de nas mon pa shes rab rags pas phyi rgyal la mgo bcol nas mon khul zang zing skabs rta dbang du phebs te mtha' 'doms zhig dpyod mdzad rab byung