sde srid bsod nams chos 'phel|{(mtshan gzhan bsod nams rab brtan dang rgya le chos mdzad kyang zer )rab byung bcu pa'i shing lug (1595)lor stod lung rgya ler sku 'khrungs/sku nar son rjes 'bras spungs dga' ldan pho brang pa'i las sner zhugs/de rjes phyag mtshan kyi 'gan bzhes/chu khyi (1622)lo tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa dgung lo drug steng 'bras spungs su gdan zhu mdzad/skabs der gtsang pa rgyal pos tshos lugs grub mtha'i phyogs ris kyis dga' ldan pho brang par sdang zug byas par brten rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu bya (1633)lo phyag mdzod bsod nams chos 'phel gyis sog po lha btsun chung ba blo bzang bstan 'dzin dang mnyam du sog dmag khrid nas dbus kyi sde pa skyid shod pa'i dmag dpung dang mnyam 'brel gyis gtsang pa rgyal por rgol lan sprad/dga' ldan pho brang gi bla brang la lha sa rags man chad kyi (123) chos gzhis bdag dbang yod pa dang phyag mdzod bsod nams cho sa 'phel 'bras spungs su bzhugs chog pa byung de rjes phyag mdzod bsod nams chos 'phel dang skyid shod bye ri stag rtse ba'i sde pa mtsho skyes rdo rje sogs jun gar ba'i phyogs su bskyed de sog po'i rgyal blon rnams la dpung rogs yong ba zhus pas rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags sbrul (1641)lor gu shI khang gi dpung chen gyis gtsang pa sde pa'i mthun phyogs be ri tshogs pa sogs cham la phab cing bsam grub rtse dang dbus gtsang mtha' dag dbang du bcug pa sogs kyi rgyal kha'i dran gsor phyag mdzod bsod nams chos 'phel gyi ldan gtsug lag khang gi bdun phyogs su byus yag dar chen zhes pa 'di btsugs rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu rta (1642)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas bod kyi chos srid dbang cha mang tsham bzhes pa dang dga' ldan pho brang dbu brnyes pa dang 'brel zhal ngo bsod nams chos 'phel la sde srid bsko bzhag bstsal lo der sde srid kyis gtsang dang stod khul mnga' sde rnams la blta bskor dang sa mi zhib bsher khral bzo khungs 'jug byed mi'i las byed pa rim bzhin bsgo rdzong gnang zhing shing bya (1645)lor tA la'i bla ma lnga pa mchog nas sde srid bsod nams chos 'phel dang bka' gros kyis rtse 