sdeb sbyor|{rgya gar gyi skad lci yang gi sgra sdeb pa'i rtsom tshul zhig /spyir sdeb sbyor la rgya gar skad kyi dbang du byas pa'i sdeb sbyor dang/bod skad kyi dbang du byas pa'i sdeb sbyor gnyis las skabs 'dir bshad pa'i sde sbyor ni dbang po'i dbang du byas pa yin zhing/de ni yi ge lci ba dang yang ba sbyar ba'i sgo nas tshigs su bcad pa'i rigs zhig ste/de la lung las 'byung ba'i tshigs su bcad pa dang/bstan bcos nas bshad pa'i tshigs bcad pa gnyis yod/dang po ni (mngon pa kun btus )las tshigs bcad rkang pa gnyis pa nas drug pa'i bar du yod par bshad/gnyis pa ni/sdeb sbyor gyi bstan bcos rnams las/tshigs bcad kyi sde sbyor la rkang pa bzhi re cha mnyam du bsgrigs pa zhig ste de la yige bgrang ba zhig yin cing/de la mnyam pa dang/phyed mnyam pa dang/mi mnyam pa bcas gsum dang/dzA ti ni yi ge'i phyi mo bgrang ba ste/de la 'phags ma dang/ro langs can/phyi mo mnyam pa dang gsum/sdeb sbyor gyi rnam bzhag ston pa'i gzhung ni/rgya bar du phyi rol 'i paN+Di ta dmar ser can gyis brtsams pa (sdeb sbyor gyi rtsa ba'i mdo )dang/de'i dper brjod slob dpon rgyal ba'i lhas brtsams pa yod med kyang/slob dpon rin chen 'byung gnas zhi bas mdzad pa'i (sdeb sbyor gyi bstan bcos rin chen 'byung gnas )dang/de'i rang 'grel gnyis ni gzhung ha cang legs po zhig yin la/bod du ni/zha lo lo chen chos skyong bzang pos mdzad pa'i (sdeb sbyor gyi rtsa ba bsdus pa/) lo tsA ba byang chub rtse mos mdzad pa'i (sdeb sbyor rtsa 'grel gyi gzhung )la (124) bsgyur bcos stag lung lo tsA ba nam mkha' bzang pos (sdeb sbyor rtsa 'grel )bsgyur bcos mdzad pa lo chen d+harma shris mdzad pa'i (deb sbyor rin chen 'byung gnas kyi 'grel pa don gsal me long/) smon 'gro paN+Di ta tshe dbang don grub yab sras kyis mdzad pa'i (deb sbyor gyi 'grel pa )dang dper brjod sogs grub mtha' ris med kyi khas pa tshos mdzad pa'i sdeb sbyor gyi gzhung mi nyung ba yod gnyis pa bod skad gyi dbang du byas pa'i sdeb sbyor ni tshigs bcad la rkang pa drug pa nas sum cu so lnga'i bar du yod pa dang de dag sde ba sbyor byed skabs tshig p