nor bu gling ga|{nor gling ni gna' bo'i grong khyer lha sa'i g.yu'i phra tshom zhig dang 'dra bas ljongs nang khul tsam ma zad/rgyal khab phya nang gi skyi bo du ma'i sems pa dbang med du 'gugs pa'i gnas mchog mdzes sdug bsngal pa zhig yin/gna' bo'i dus su da lta'i nor gling chags yul de ni gla ba la sogs pa'i nags tshal stug par dkrigs pa'i dbus su dwangs shing gtsang bzhi chu phran lhung lhung du babs pa dang 'dab chags sna tshogs skad snyan 'gyur zhing/ri dwags dang gcan gzan yang thar thor du gnas pa'i rang byung gi gnas dben zhing nyams dga' ba zhig yin pa der gna' nus su gla ba tshal du 'bod/de snga tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa blo bzang rgya mtshos dbyar dus su gnas der dbu gur phub nas chab spro gseng la byon myong ba dang sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho thog ma 'bras spungs su bzhugs pi skabs gnas der chab zhugs 'phrod bzhes gnang gi yod pas khong gis srid dbang bzhes rjes sku tshe'i smad du zhabs la 'bam grum gyi snyun gzhi phog par brten/der chab zhugs dang chab rdzing bzo skrun byas nas chab bzhes thengs mang gnang bas snyun gzhir phan 'bras thon/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing phag (1755)lor chab zhugs mdzad yul gyi shar ngos su pho brang thog tshad gnyis yod pa zhig gsar skrun mdzad par rgyal ba'i mtshan de pho brang la thogs nas bskal bzang pho brang du grags/de ni nor gling du pho brang skrun pa'i thog ma yin zhing/dus de nas bzung dben zhing nyams dga'i nor gling de nyid tA la'i bla ma sku phreng rim byon sku na chung ngu sa'i skabs gsan bsam mdzad yul dang srid dbang bzhes rjes kyi dbyar dus bzhugs gnas su gyur/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i skabs su bskal bzang pho brang byang ngos kyi chos ra dang/mtsho dkyil pho brang klu khang dang bcas pa/nub ngos kyi gru 'dzin pho brang/pho brang de dag gi mthar 'khor lcags ri ser po bcas gsar bskrun gnang zhing ra ba'i nang du me tog dang shing sna 'bor chen 'debs 'dzugs gnang ba bcas kyi nor gling 'di nyid yid du (147) 'ong ba'i skyed tshal zhig tu gyur de rjes tA la