med nor gling du sngar da spyan gzigs sna tshogs kyi khar dus phyis sha ba'i ra ba dang spre'u'i tshogs gnas pa'i bcos pa'i brag ri me tog gi ra ba la sogs pa'i rnam grangs kha snon byas yod nor bu gling ga ni bod mi dmangs kyi blo gros kyi nying khu bsdus pa las grub pa'i 'bras bu g.yur du za ba zhig yin pa dang de nyid phyogs bsdus dngos mang gsham ston khang zhig dang 'dra bar gnas der blta skor la phabs mi tshor bod kyi lo rgyus dang rig gnas sgyu rtsal sogs phyogs gang na nas rang rang gi dgos mgo dang mthun pa'i shes bya'am shes rtogs mi nyung ba zhig yong rgyu can lags}
