gnam bskos dga' ldan pho brang|{'di ni de sngon sde srid phag mo grub pa'i skabs rdo khang sngon mo'am ming gzhan 'bras spungs dpon khang yang zer ba sne gdong pa'i dpon rigs rnams 'bras spungs su yong skabs 'tsher shag byed mus la phag gru sde srid khri rabs bcu gcig pa ngag dbang bkra shis grags pas srid dbang bzung rjes rab byung dgu pa'i sa stag (1518)lor tA la'i bla ma'i sku phreng gnyis pa dge 'dun rgya mtshor phul zhing/dga' ldan pho brang zhes ming bsgyur gnang ba nas tA la'i bla ma sku phreng rim byon 'bras spungs su bzhugs dus kyi bla blang lta bu yin/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtsho sog yul la phabs pa'i shul skyid shod sde pa bkra shis rab brtan pas rdo shing dang 'ul mi sogs kyi 'gro gron rgyab skyor shugs chen byas pa'i 'og /sku sger mdzod pa sku mdun pa chos bzang 'phrin las kyis rgya bskya gsar skrun gnang ba ma zad/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas bod sa gnas kyi srid dbang bzung ba gnang rjes nyams gsor dang ldebs (150) bris mang po gsar bzhengs gnang ba sogs zhib par sku phreng rim byon so so'i rnam thar nang gsal zhing srid gzhung gi ming yang dga' ldan pho brang zhes 'bod pa'i rgyu mtshan de ltar yin cing gnam bskos zhes pa ni gnam bskos gong ma zer ba'am de sngon rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po nas rgyal po khri la pa can bar du lo rgyus yi ger 'khod pa'i nang gnam lha babs kyi bdag po zer ba dang 'dra bar rang nyid kyi srid gzhung la che bstod byed pa'i ming yin de yang rang rgyal lo rgyus thog gi gong mar gnam bskos gong ma zer ba dang bod kyi snga rabs lo rgyun nang rgyal po la gnam lha babs kyi bdag po zer ba gnyis ka bon po'i chos lugs kyi lo rgyus lta tshul tsam mthud rgyud 'dzin byed pa zhig yin pa dang sangs rgas chos lugs pas de 'dra gtan nas khas mi len cing rgyal po dang 'bangs ni sngon las bsod nams gyi stobs che chung la brten nas las dbang gis bsko bzhag byas pa zhig yin pa las gnam dang gnam gyi lhas bsko bzhag byas pa gtan nas min zer rgyun yod}
gnam go la|{gza' rnams bgrod gnas go la zhes grags la/rgyu skar la sogs lha yi gzhal med khang/_/'degs byed rlung gi de mtho/_/mi rir nye ba'i gas med mda' ba ste/_/mtho dman sgang gshong gis rgyu khyim gyi gzhi/grub ste de steng rgyu skar nyer brgyad chags/_/g.yas su 'khor las lhe gling dbus ma 'dir/_/tha skar thog mar snang phyir rgyu skar gyi/_/dang po'i khyim gyi thog mar lug khyim nyid/_/de yang gro bzhin byi bzhin skar khong gcig /byas pa'i rgyu skar nyer bdun re re yang/_/yul gyi sa khyon chu tshod drug cu steng/_/skar ma gnyis dang bzhi cha khyim re'i tshad/_/bzhi cha'i rkang pa re la chu tshod ni/_/bco lnga de 'dra dgu la mda' yon zla/_/bgrod bya'i khyim skar chags rjes bgrod byed gza'/_/skye ba'i shar gling dbus ma'i tshangs thig steng/_/ka Ta'i khyim gyi thog mar nyi ma skyes/_/de nas zla ba tha skar mig dbang 'chu/_/lhag pa lha mtshams phur bu mi bzhi dang/_/pa sangs nab so spen pa snubs la skyes/_/rang rang skyed zhag dbang phyir res gza' grags/_/sgra gcan nag pa dus me nam grub dang/_/mjug ring chu smad steng skyes de rnams kyang/_/rang rang skyes skar zhing la bdag tu bzung/_/de ru dgra zla zhugs nas rtsod ces grags/_/skar khyim go la 'di nas snang ba bzhin/_/g.yas skor ri rab nyin zhag re yis 'khor/_/rang bgros gdong 'jug g.yas skor nyi ma sogs/_/gza' gzhan ri rab g.yon skor skar khyim spyod/_/dal rkang rang rang skyes skar las brtsams shing/_/myur rkang dal ba las brtsams ril ril min/_/snga ya'i rkang par 'phel dang 'grib pa yis/_/spyod mthar nye ma nub sogs bgros kyis 'khor/_/zla lhag pa sangs 'jug ring zhi gza' g.yon/_/dmar phur spen pa drug gza' g.yas nas rgyu/_/sgra gcan mnyam po'i bgros su phal cher 'dod/_/de nas gnam gyi go la'i 'khor tshul yang/_/mu stegs lus su rmog rtsegs zhes bya ba/khyim skar bzhin du ma can gza' rnams kyang/_/lho byang bgrod gnyis med par ster rim du/brtsegs pas khyim dang khyim can 'jug med 'dod/gza' rnams bgrod gnyis 'don pa'i lugs la yang/_/phyed bskyed steng dus mnyam yin par 'dod/_/phyed bskyed lugs de snye thang gr