gnam mda'|{sngar bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs bod zla 1tshes 27nyin te gnam mda' dang smon lam gyi grol ston chabs cig skor/gong tshes nyin mdzad sgo tshugs yul rdzong rgyab dbu g.yab 'og tu bka' shag gdan gnyer nas bzhugs gdan rgyag phyogs gra bi rtsis bsher dang 'dra ba yin/de nyin cho 'phros smon lam chen mo'i mdzad ces grol stan chen mo'i nyen der snga dro bka' blon dang/gung/dza sag /tha'i je/rim bzhi bcas na bza' tshos gzhi ser po dang/mi drag sras rnam pa dang nam pa'i las tshan bka' shag shod pa yan tog zhwa dang/na bza' tshos gzhi sngon po'am gang rung/rtsis pa dang/rtsa rtsam/las tshan chung khag /dmag drung bcas na bza' rgya smug /drung dkyus rgyun chas kha gsal bcas bzhes dgos/mdzad sgo'i gong gzigs lam du rta pa'i gsol go khag dang/'dam sog 'khor bcas kyis rta rgyud mda' shar re rgyugs/bla phyag nas tsha dar g.yogs te phyir phebs/spro (153) khang dbu g.yab 'og mdzad sgo dngos tshugs bka' shag ma byan gyis gsol bzhes rim bstar zhus ya sor khri pas sne khrid dbus mda' gnyis dang/_/dmag drung go mdzod gnyer pa gzim lding zla gcig drung 'khor bcas gral bsgrigs zin rjes dbus mda' nas bcas gdan thog 'khod rta pa'i go mtshon zags pa rnams bslu ba dang rgyugs ring chen mo'i rta rgyugs mi rgyugs bar rgyugs bcad par gnang cha gnang brgyang ma'i dmigs tshad mi gom lnga brgya nas stong bar rgyang mda' 'phan par mtshan grangs bcas mdzad sgo grol bla phyag nas bka' gung dza tha'i rnam par sgrog tse (rgya lugs ston mo )dang byings la sha 'bras 'bul de rjes smon lam chen mo'i mdzad sgo thog mtha' bar gsum legs grub zin te grol ston spro seng 'go tshugs skabs der bka' gung dza tha'i ri bzhi tog yod bcas kyis na bza' rgya zer dang rgya 'dra gang rung bzhes nas ga langs tshul du 'khod pa dza tha'i yan gyis sog zhwa chung chung bzhes srol dza tha'i man nas drung dkyus yan pho rtsal gyi rnam grangs lag len yod mi nang tsha 'phog par bla phyag nas tsha dang re g.yog te mda' mjug bsgril rjes tshang ma tog zhwa bzhes nas bzhugs gral du 'khod sa dbang rnam pa'i sku mdun du gar