gnam lde 'od srungs|{(mnga' bdag 'od srungs kyang zhu )'di nyid yang glang dar ma 'u dum btsan dang yum btsun mo chun mo tshe spong bzang gnyis kyi sras su bod chu phag (903)lor yum bu bla sgang du sku 'ar+khungs zhes pa dang chu khyi (842)lor 'khrungs sogs gsungs tshul mi 'dra ba mang tsam mchis/sku chung ngu'i dus yab kyi btsun mo chen mo sna nam bzas gsod dam 'phrog par dogs nas mtshan mor mar me'i 'od dang ba bral bar bsrungs pas mtshan de ltar chags skad/mnga' bdag 'di sku nar ma son yang rgyal srid la dbang bskur zhing/blon po dgu khri thog sgra dang/rngog dpal gsum sgra che/rngog rgyal to re rgyal rnams kyis byas/rgyal po 'di'i sku dus su yab kyis bstan pa bsnubs pa'i bya ba de mtshams 'jog thub pa dang rten gyi spyan sngar skyabs 'gro khas blangs nas dkon mchog gsum la mchod pa byas/jo bo rnam gnyis dang byams mgon rnams sa 'og nas bton te rang rang gi la bzhugs su gsol nas mchod pa'i rgyun btsugs/lha khang zhig pa rnams slar gsos/de skabs thang dmag gis bod kyi shar phyogs dang byang phyogs kyi sa cha dbang du bsdus/de nas 'od srungs dang yum brtan gnyis mnga' ris la ma 'char par 'khrug long chen po byung ste 'od srungs kyis g.yo ru dang yum bat+na gyis dbu ru bzung/de'i phyogs bod yul phal cher la khyab ste yul gra re rer yang che srid chung srid mang tshan nyung tshan gser pa g.yu pa sha zan rtsam zan zhes sde gnyis su chad de rtsod/mthar 'bangs gyen ldog byung nas btsan po'i bang so brus pa sogs bod sil bur gyur/lo rgyus deb ther mang che ba'i nang dar ma pha spad gsum la bsod nas zad pa'i rgyal po zhes grags so/_/'od srungs kyis cog ro bza' rgyal po khab tu bzhes par sras dpa' 'khor btsan sku 'khrungs/mthar 'od srungs dgung lo re gsum bod shing gling (905'am 965 (154) bzhed tshul mi gcig )lor sku gshegs zhes dang dgung lo so dug pa bod shing sbrul (945)lor sku gshegs sogs gsung tshul mi 'dra ba mchis 'od srungs kyi bang so ni 'od srung gral ni 'phrul rgyal rgyab na yod ming ni skyes bu lha bsten bya ba lags/_/de ni btsan po'i bang so mtha' ma yin zhing de nas bzung btsan po'i bang so brtsigs pa'i srol yang nub skad}
