gnam ri srong btsan|{(gnam ri slon btsan nam slon brtsan rlung nam zhes pa'am snang )bod rgyal so gnyis pa/yab stag ri gnyan gzigs dang yum stong btsun 'gro dkar gyi sras su sa stag (558)lor 'khrungs skad/dbas snang bzher dang/tshe spong na gnag ser/nyeng tsing gu rnams kyis blon po byas pa dang/gtso'i bon po khri khyung grags pas sku bon byas/tshe spong bzang 'bri ma thod dkar khab tu bzhes/gcung po la god tsha slon ger legs bya ba thang mtshams su phab/rgyal po 'di'i ring la rgya nag gi yul nas rtsis dang sman dpyad blangs/mtha' yi rgya dang gru tu 'og tu btul/sbrang dga' bo dang rmu dpung ri bya ba'i gyad gnyis kyis zhabs tog byas te phung g.yag thal ka ru ring bya ba'i 'brong smyon pa bsad nas sha rta sga la btags pas lhung ba la tshwa 'gos pas bro ba tshor te lan tshwa ngo shes nas tshwa len pa'i srol byung skad/gzhan yang de skabs rgyal po sku ngo mas dmag mi khri phrag tsam khrid nas g.yul bshams te mkhar yu sna ni gtor/dgu gri zing po rje ni brlags/_/mang po rjes gsum bu ni grung gu'i yul du bros/phag gi yung ba sna man chad kong po bre sna yan chad bcas po'i phyag tu lon zhing/btsan pos bka' thab ste sngar yul ngas po zer ba la 'phan yul zhes ming brjes so/_/de skabs myang tseng sku dang/dbas dbyi tshab/mnon 'dron po/tshes pong nag seng bcas kyis spur rgyal la blo dkar byas pas bran g.yog khyim dud mang po dang yul chen po gnang ba ma zad/rgyal po'i blon por bcug pa dang/khyung po spung sad kyis rtsang bod kyi rje bo mar mun zhes pa'i mgo bcad de rtsang bod gyi 'bangs mi khyim dud khri phrag gnyis spur rgyal btsan po'i mnga' 'bangs su phul ba dang/seng go mi chen gyis dwags po yongs rdzogs slar yang btsan po'i mnga' 'bangs su phul ba dang/seng go mi chen gyis dwags po yongs rdzogs slar yang btsan po'i mnga' bangs su bkug pa sogs dbus gtsang phal che ba spu rgyal gyi mnga' (155) zhabs su tshud skabs der rgyal po'i bzhugs gnas kyang yar lung gtsang po'i byang phyogs su spos te mal gro'i pho brang byams pa mi 'gyur gling bzhengs par snang mthar rgyal po 'di ny