gnas chung rdo rje sgra dbyangs gling|{gnas chung dgon ('bras spungs dgon pa'i mdun du yod )ni thog mar 'bras spungs bde yangs kyi mkhan po lcog pa byang chub dpal ldan gyis gling 'di nyid ni rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags byi (1660)lo nas sa sprel (1668)lor bar dgu'i ring srid 'phrin las rgya mtsho'i sku dus su rtsig rmang bting grub rung chos skyong nas nga'i gnas gzhi las sngags khang rgyag dgos tshul gsungs pas lus shing/de rjes rgyal ba sku phreng lnga pa chen pos bka' bstsal pa ltar thog ma'i shog phra dang bcas gang ci'i ljags bkod sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho ras nas gnang zhing/las gra do dam skyid stod bstan pa rgyal mtshan dang/phu lung pa phun tshogs skal bzang/de bzhin rdo shis las mi khyon lnga stong nas lcags bya (1681)lor 'go btsugs te de'i phyi lo bzo ston ltar/chu phag (1683)lor rten dang brten par bo sna brgyad kyis 'phags pa'i ngo btsal khyad chos dang bcas te bskrun zin pa dang/lo de'i bod zla dgu pa'i tshes bcu bzhi nyin dge slong 'jam dbyangs grags pas rdo rje slob dpon gnang phan bde legs bshad gling gi 'dus tshogs kyis rab gnas cho ga rgyas pa dang bcas legs par grub cing/de skabs de snga'i gnas chung g.yu lo bkod dgon dang sgro sdong lha khang zhes pa gcig tu sgril tu dgon ming dug nas chung rdo rje sgra dbyangs gling zhes gsol/dgon pa'i nang mi sna mtho shos gnas chu sku rten tA la'i bla ma dang/de nas rim bzhin gnas chung da pa'am gnyer pa/mchog sprul rin po che/slob dpon/dbu mdzad/dge bskos/chos skyong gi drung yig dang sku mdun zhes chos skyong sku phebs skabs zhabs zhu ba gnyis bcas yod pa dang/dge 'dun gyi zhal grangs ni sde srid skabs brgya dang gcig 'dzugs pa gnang ba nas rgyal pa sku rang bcu gsum pa'i skabs grangs brgya dang bco lnga'i tshad gzhi bzo gnang mdzad/sgrig lam thad lo ltar zla gci ring gi dgung seng dus tshod las rnam kun phar tshur gang byung 'gro bskyod mi chog cing/gal te dmigs bsal gyi don gdan yod tshe dgongs zhu byed dgos/grwa shag tu rang gi nang mir yang zhag sdod gnas g.yar mi chog pa dang/grwa shag nang sma