gnas chen po brgyad|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das kyi sku tshe gcig ring gi mdzad pa gtso che ba rnams bstan sa'i gnas la zer/de rnams mdor bsdus nas bshad na/1 lum bi'i tshal/'di ni sangs rgyas sku 'khrungs pa'i gnas yin/rgya yi slob dpon chen po thang zan tsang gi (rgya gar lam yig )rgyal yig nang bod yig thog bsgyur ba las/mnyan yod rgyal byed tshal nas shar phyogs su be dbar bdun brgya song ba na grong khyer ser skya zhes bcom ldan 'das kyi yab rgyal po zas gtsang ma'i pho brang gi shul dang/grong stong bcu lhag lha khang gog po mang po yod/pho brang gi lte bar lhums su zhugs pa'i mchod rten gyi shul gcig pu las gzhan du mi med/pho brang yod sa de'i shar phyogs le 'bar brgya tsam na lum+bu'i tshal gyi lha khang da dung yod ces gsal/mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (rgya gar gnas yig )las/rgya gar byang phyogs bal yul dang thag nye ba'i sag nas deng sang ming la tu man de zhes 'bod pa de yin pa dang/gnas der sangs rgyas kyi yum sgyu 'phrul mi'i sku brnyan dang/rgyal po mya ngan med kyi rdo ring rgyal po khri lo nyer gcig pa la phyogs der slebs nas phyogs 'dir sangs rgyas 'khrungs so zhes rdo ring bslangs pa yin zer ba'i rdo ring yi ge can zhig yod ces gsal/2 wA rA Na si/sangs rgyas kyis thog mar chos gsungs pa'i gnas yin/slob dpon thang zan tsang gi lam yig rgya yig nas ba yig tu bsgyur ba las/grong khyer ser skya nas rtsis pa'i lho nub (lho phyogs )mtshams le dbar bdun brgya lhag tsam na chu bo gang+ga'i 'gram du grong khyer wA rA Na si dang/de nas byang shar mtshams chu bo wA rA Na si brgal nas le dbar bcus chod pa'i sa na drang srong lhung ba ri dwags kyi nags yod/der rta babs dang khang brtsegs sogs kyis bkod pa mdzes pa'i dge 'dun stong phra gnyis tsam/rten gtso thub pa chos 'khor ma dang/rang sangs rgyas kyi mchod rten lnga brgya bcas yod par gsungs/dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis mdzad 'i (rgya gar gnas chen khag gi lam yig )las/ga 'a'i grong khyer nas nub byang phyogs su le dbar bcu phrag kha shas song na wa r