gnas nyer bzhi|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags kyi gzhung mang po nas ming tsam 'byung )dang pan chen er ti ni dpal ldan ye shes kyi gsung )sham b+ha la'i rnam thar )nas rgyas par bshad pa gnyis gung bsgrigs nas don bsdus te bkod par/1 pU li ra ma la ya (rgya gar shar gas b+hang g+ha la yi lho ngos ma la ya'i chu klung 'bab pa'i gnas) 2 dza lan+d+ha ra (chu bo gang+ga mtsho ma phab nas mnga' ris kyi yul brgyad nyid 'ga' zhig lho nub phyogs su kha gdan sa 'bab cing/Ti li'am d+hi la'i byang phyogs ha ri dA war nas shar phyogs su 'khyogs nas 'bab pa'i byang ngos dzA la mug gam dza la mu khi ste rdo la mer 'bar ba'i gnas/) 3 au Ti ya na ('di ni o rgyan gyi yul zhes bshad pa de yin/) 4 a rbu ta (rgya gar lho phyogs kyi ri dbus mthu la mtha' dma' ba 'brang rgyas sam snying gi gzugs can zhig gi ming/) 5 gau da wa re )lam po'i yul byang ngos rang rgyal gyi gnya' nang rdzong gi nye 'dabs la phyi gangs ra zhes gangs ri chen po zhig yod par bshad/'di rje btsun mi la'i rnam thar du/stod gnya' nang du yod pa'i la phyi gangs ri zhes gsal zhing/la phyi gangs ri zhes pa hi ma la ya'i ri yi rgyud gcig yin pas sa bkra'i nang sgo sa yin than zhes gsal ba de dang sang yongs grags rgya skad du shi sha spang ma zhes pa de yin nam/de min la phyi gangs ra zhes pa tshogs su yod med brtag dgos/) 6 rwa me sho ri (rgya gar gyi sa dbyibs gru gsum du chags pa'i rtse mo rno shos lho phyogs su gtad pa'i rgya mtsho'i 'gram gyi sne der yod/'di nas shar lho'i phyogs su grub btang nas song na lang ka'i grong khyer ram las kha'i gling phran zhes rgyal po r+pama' nas srid yul du dmag drangs par bshad pa'i yul de yin pas/deng sang sing ka la'ang/shri lang+ka'am si li lang+ka zer/) 7 de wi ko tri ('di bod skad du lha mo'i mkhar zhes zer zhing/'di la ngos 'dzin tshul mi 'dra ba gnyis te/kong po'i yul dang/dwags po/glo yul gsum gyi mtshams su yod pa'i rtsa ri la ngos 'dzin pa gcig dang/rgya gar a lam gyi shar phyogs gang tsha rang+ga zhes pa'i nang tshan ti ru phur zhes pa'i ri bo der ngos 'dzin pa gcig yod/8 mA la wa (rgya gar nub phyogs rgya mtsho'i gling phran zhig yin par bshad/) 9 kA ma ru pa (bal yul dang thag nye ba'i gangs rgyal mo mthon mthing gi 'gram nas rgya gar skad du chu bo lo hi ta rgya skad du mA chon ho )bod skad du rta mchog kha 'bab tu grags pa de nyid gzhis ka rtse nas myang chu dang 'dres/lha sa'i lho nub chu shul nas skyid chu dang 'dres nas yar lung brgyud du 'bab pa la yar lung gtsang po zer/de nyid kong po yul nas kha lhor bltas nas rgya gar shar phyogs su thon pa'i sa der ngos 'dzin/de nas rgya gar shar phyogs a lam gyi yul nas rgya mtsho chen por 'bab pas gong gsal chu bo de'i dub bu la rgya gar ba rnams kyis b+ha ram pu d+ha zer/) 10 o tri (rgya gar lho phyogs rgyal po shing rta bcu pa'i yul la ngos 'dzin par bshad kyang sa gnas ngos ma zin/) 11 tri sha ku ne (rgya gar nub phyogs chu bo gang+ga dang/gan ti su ru pa gsum gyi 'dus mdor der yod/) 12 ko (161) sa la (rgya gar yul du dbus gnyan yod ces pa de yin/) 13 ka ling+ka (rgya gar lho phyogs rgya mtsho'i 'gram gyi yul la tri ling+ga la sogs pa'i ling+ga'i ming can brgyad tsam yod par bshad pa'i nang nas gcig yin/) 14 lam pa ka (o rgyan gyi yul gyi shar phyogs su yod par bshad/) 15 kany+tsi (rgya gar lho phyogs kyi dkyil tri ling ka zhes pa de yin par bshad/) 16 ti ma la ya (bod skad du ri bo gangs can zhes rgya gar gyi byang phyogs su yod pa'i ri rgyun shin tu ring ba zhig gi ming 17 pre tA (mnga' ris gu ge'i yul du yod/) 18 gri he ta wa ta (li yul lcang ra smug po'am deng sang shin cang du 'bod pa'i gnas kyi nub ngos su yod par bshad/) 19 so ra Sha trI ('di bod skad du bzang po can zer zhi4ngargya gar nub phyogs kyi yul zhig yin par bshad pa ltar rang rgyal nas dpar bskrun byas pa'i sa bkra'i nang du rgya gar nub phyogs rgya mtsho'i 'gram gyi yul zhig la su la tha'o zhes 'khod pa de yin snyam/) 20 su warna dI pa ('di bod skad du gser gling zer zhing deng sang in rdu nyi shi ya'i rgyal sa la ca tA yi nub byang ngos kyi gling phran che ba su man ta la zer ba de yin zhes rgyal rigs kyi mkhas pa'i dbang po 'ga' zhig gis gsungs pa thos/) 21 nA ka ra (rgya gar phyag phyogs bal yul dang khad nye bar chu bo gang+ga'i 'gram du grong khyer pa tra li bu tra'am bod skad du skya bo'i bu zer pa Tha na zhes nA ga ra'i yi ge 'byung ba'i yul de yin par bshad) 22 sin rdu gangs ri ti se'i byang ngos nas 'bab pa'i chu bo sin d+hu zhes pa (bod skad du seng+ga kha 'bab zer de mnga' ris kyi yul brgyud ngad por byang dang de nas pa li ca si'i lho ngos nas re zhig bar nub rda rang po dang de nas karmira'am kha hri smir gyi shar ngos nas nub byang bar 'khyogs nas 'bab cing mtha' pa ki si than gyi byang ra nas dkyil drang po brgyad rgyal sa ka ra tri'am snga dus kha ra Thar 'bod pa'i nye 'dabs nas a ra pi'i rgya mtshor 'bab pas rgyal sa'i nye 'dabs su gong gi gnas de yod par bshad/) 23 ma ru (karmir gyi byang phyogs dza lan+d+ha ra'i nye 'dabs su yod par bshad/) 24 ku lu ta (karmir gyi byang phyogs kyi mtha' mtshams mnga' ris yul dang thag nye bar yod pa dang mnga' ris pa rnams kyis nyung rda'i yul zhes 'bod pa'i nang tshan zhig yin par bshad/)}
gnas rnying|{(khang dmar rdzongs phud sgang chus gnas rnying shang )rgyal rtse khul nyang ston gnas rnying dgon pa ni jo bo hi ti sha mnga' ris nas dbus gtsang du phebs dus nyan tsho gnas rnying dgon por zhabs sor 'khod skabs rab gnas zhus par gnas kyi nga por 'jug gsungs pas gnas snying du grags zer/deng sang gnas rnying las gnas snying 'bri srol mi 'dug /gnas rnying dgon pa 'di gsang sngags rnying ma'i bla ma rgya 'jam dpal gsang ba'i rgyud 'dzin bla ma rim pas 'dzin skyong mdzad/de'i rjes su 'jam dbyangs rin chen rgyal mtshan gyi dus su tsong kha pas gnas rnying du grwa skor mdzad pa dang/rgyal tshab dar ma rin chen gyi gzhis dgon yin stabs/mkhas grub rje dge legs dpal bzang yang gnas rnying du gdan drangs pa tsam nas dge lugs su rang lugs kyis 'gyur/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gnyis pa dge 'dun rgya mtsho sku na gzhon dus chu byi (1492)lor rjes 'jam dpal snying pos gdan drangs shing/de dus gnas rnying ri po ches bzhengs pa'i gos sku mjal ba sogs bkra shis lhun po dang/gnas rnying dgon pa gnyis 'brel lam zab po byung/la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i skabs su rgya'i 'jam gsang gi gdung rgyud chad tshul tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i rnam thar du gsal ba dang/de rjes gung paN+Di ta rtse ched dga' bzhir gzhis skor phebs dus lho pa tshe dar zer ba zhig la gnas rnying dgon pa'i gnas tshul ji ltar yod med 'dri rtsad byas pas lan la/gnas rnying dgon ma lag byings (162) yar 'brog bsam sdings bla blang nas 'dzin skyong byed bzhin nyams gog cher med tshul bshad 'dug}
gnas brtan|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi 'dul ba'i gzhung nas bshad tshul la/bsnyen par rdzogs (dge slong gi sdom pa zhus )nas sdom pa la skyon ma byung bar lo bcu lon pa brtan pa'i yon tan dang/'dul ba shes shing lnga phrugs nyi shu rtsa gcig gi nang nas gang yang rung ba'i yon tan dang ldan pa ni mkhas pa'i yon tan yin pas brtan mkhas kyi yon tan de gnyis dang po ldan pa la gnas brtan zhes bshad srol yod/zhib par 'dul ba'i gzhung gi 'grel pa mang che ba'i nang gsal}
gnas brtan bcu drug|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/ston pa sangs rgyas mya ngan las 'das khar sgra gcan 'dzin la sogs pa'i dgra bcom pa bcu drug /(1 gnas brtan yan lag 'byung/2 ma pham pa/3 nags na gnas/4 dus ldan/5 rdo rje mo'i bu/6 bzang po/7 gser be'u/8 b+ha ra d+ha dza gser can/9 ba ku la/10 sgra gcan 'dzin/11 lam phran brtan/12 bsod snyoms len/13 lam bstan/14 klu'i sde/15 sbed byed/16 mi phyed pa bcas )la 'dzam bu'i gling du nga'i bstan ma nub kyi bar du khyed rnams kyang mya ngan las mi 'da' bar nga'i bstan pa skyong dgos zhes bka' phabs pa ltar/khong rnams kyang gling bzhi dang 'dzam bu'i gling gi bya rgod phung po'i ri dang/lo ma bdun pa'i ri phug /chu bo ya mu na'i gling/gsang ri ti se sogs gnas mi 'dra ba bcu drug la bzhugs nas bstan pa dar spel mdzad pa yin zhes bshad srol dang gnas brtan gyi gras su yod pa'i hA shang de ni thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ma thang tha'i tsung gis rgyal sa khrang an du gnas brtan bcu drug dngos su gdan drangs skabs gnas brtan rnams la len zhu mkhan dang rgyun du gong ma'i mchod gnas dang/gong ma'i sras brgyad kyi dge rgan du bzhugs pa de yin pa dang/gnas brtan gyi gras su yod pa'i dge bsnyen d+harma tA la ni/dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i 'gor jo bo rje a ti sha bod du phebs nas brag yer par bzhugs skabs nyin gcig gnas brtan bcu drug dngos su phebs te 'brom ston pas gnas brtan rnams gsol stan gyi byin len zhu mkhan mdzad pa de yin zhes bshad srol yod pa dang/bod la ha shang dang dge bsnyen gnyis gnas brtan khongs su ming bgrang zhing rgya nag gi lugs la ha shang dang dge bsnyen gnyis na gi rtogs pa'i gnas tshad gnas brtan rnams dang mnyam pa yod pa'i dbang gis gnas brtan bco brgyad {(WP:1,194)}ces 'dren pa'i rgyu mtshan de ltar yin/bod kyi gnas brtan bcu drug gi sku brnyan bris thang dang 'jim sku ni thog mar dus rabs bcu pa'i mjug tu bla chen dgongs pa rab gsal gyi slob ma klu mes 'brom chung mdo smad du bzhugs pa'i skabs shig ri bo rtse lnga sogs nang pa'i gnas rten khag mjal bar phebs pa'i lam zhor thang rgyal rabs kyi rgyal sa khrang an du yun ring bzhugs skabs/gong du bshad pa ltar tha dang gi gong ma ming tsung gis gnas brtan bcu drug dngos su gdan drangs nas zla ba kha shas bzhugs te ra phebs gnang khar gnas brtan rnams la na ba'i mtshon byed du rgya lugs ha shang gi chas dang 'dra ba'i gos chen ting phon mngags btags ma re phul te/dran rten du mi ro mkhas pa rnams nas gnas brtan rnams kyi 'dra thang re bris pa de dngos su gzigs par brten klu mes kyang 'dra thang de la dpe byas te rang nyid kyis dngos su 'dra bshus gnang nas bod du bsnams phebs rjes brag yer par gnas bcu lha khang zhig bzhengs gnang ste/'dra thang bshus bris la ma dpe byas pa'i gnas brtan bcu drug gi 'jim bzhengs pa gnang ba ni bod du gnas brtan bcu drug gi sku bzhengs pa'i thog ma yin cing/de nas (163) bzung bod du bzung bod du rgya nag ha shang gi chas gos bzhes pa'i gnas brtan bcu drug gi bris sku dang 'bur sku mang po dar spel byung dgon pa che chung tshang mar bris 'bur gyi sku mthong rgyu yod pa de ni rgya bod mi rigs bar rig gzhung brje res gyi de mtshon gson pa zhig yin la gnas brtan bcu drug po tshang ma rgya gar gyi dgra bcom pa sha stag yin kyang bon kyi ri mo'i lag rgyun du tshang ma rgya nag gi ha shang dang 'dra bar na bza' phu thung can sha stag bris srol yod pa'i rgyu mtshan yang de yin gnas brtan bcu drug po so so'i lo rgyus zhib pa tshe chog gling yongs 'dzin rin po che ye shes rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (gnas brtan bcu drug gi rtogs brjod )gsum 'bum (tha)pa'i nang yod pa dang gnas brtan bcu drug gi sku brnyan bod du ji ltar byung ba'i lo rgyun ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lang pas mdzad pa'i (gnas brtan phyag mtshan rgyal bstan 'dzad med )kyi gleng gzhi'i nang dang sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho dang karma pa mi bskyod rdo rjes mdzad pa'i (rin po che dang gos dar rnam dbye'i bshad pa )las gos chen ting phan gyi lo rgyus 'khod pa rnams la gzigs par zhu}
