gnas nang ri khrod|{mkhar rdo ri khrod kyi shar ngos (lha sa'i shar ngos )lung shur nang chags pa'i gnas nang ri khrod nu dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i dus mjug tu mkhar rdo sprul sku sku phreng gsum pa rig 'dzin chos rdor gyis btab/de gar ri chu brag phug sogs ngo tshar che la zangs mdog dpar ri zhes brag ri zhig la ri skor rgyag sa dang/slob dpon rin po che'i sgrub phug ces pa'i phug pa sogs yod/ri khrod de thog mar mkhar rdo rig 'dzin chos rdor gyis mkhar rdo'i gter chos thun mong ma yin pa rnams nyams bzhes gnang sa'i btsun ma'i sgrub sde zhig yin rung/rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags rta (1930)lo'i yas mas su rkun ngag gis btsun ma rnams sdod bzod mi bde ba bzlos stabs gnas sgo gdong gi grwa pa dang/gnas nang gi mtshan ma rnams kyi sdod gnas brjes te gnas nang grwa dgon dang gnas sgo gdung btsun dgon du gtan 'khel bar byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag lo gnas nang la grwa grangs 17yod pa dang dgon bdag mkhar rdo bla brang yin/gong gnas mkhar rdo dang/gnas sgo gdong/gnas nang bcas lam khar rdo'i sgrub sde gsum zhes 'bod}
