gnubs sangs rgyas ye shes|{(snubs zhes pa'ang snang )'di nyid chos rgyal khri srong gi sku dus su byung nas bod dang/bal po/rgya gar/bru sha'i mkhas pa mang po brten cing/'di la mdo sgyu sems gsum gyi bka' thams cad gcig tu babs pa yin par grags/'di dang so ye she dbang ga zur shAkya 'byung gnas bcas la so zur gnubs gsum zhu zhing/gsang sngags snga 'gyur bka' ba'i brgyud pa'i chu 'go rnying ma'i slob dpon chen po gsum yin/rgyal po glang dar ma'i skabs rgyal pos 'di nyid bkug nas ngas sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa bsnubs zin pas khyod la nus pa ci yod brjod par 'dis sngags bzlas pa'i nus pa la brten nas rgyal por 'jigs skul byas pas rgyal po skrag ste du 'khor bcas lag nod pa mi byed do zer nas btang/de nas khong gis yer par phyin te lha lung dpal rdor la ngas rgyal po sdig can skrag par byas yod kyi da kyis dgrol cag zer nas bskul te bkrongs zhes skad/gnubs sangs rgyas ye shes la sras drug yod pa las bzhi dbu ru'i kheng log skabs bkrongs pa dang/gcig zla yar/gcig khrel med du shor zhes lo rgyus yig tshang du gsal}
