rnam rgyal grwa tshang|{de sngon rab byung bcu pa'i shing khyi (167) (1574)lor sog po'i rgyal po al tan gyis tA la'i bla ma bsod nams rgya mtsho sog yul du gdan drangs skabs chu shul du yod pa'i gas pa grwa tshang phan bde legs bshad gling pa zer ba'i dgon par de nas grwa pa nyi shu rtsam mnyam du 'khrid de kho tshor nyin ltar lha mo rnam rgyal ma'i tshe chog 'don du bcug thog ming la rnam rgyal grwa tshang zhes btags te sku zhabs grwa tshang du bsgyur de nas bzung sog po jun gar tshe dbang rab brtan gyis dmag dpung bod du ma 'byor bar lo mang ring dge lugs dang sa lugs rnying lugs bcas kyi cho ga sna tshogs 'don gyi yod pa la jun gar tshe dbang rab brtan gyis bod sa gnas kyi srid dbang bzung skabs bod du yod pa'i rnying ma'i chos lugs rtse med bzos pa dang chabs cig med pa bzos shing de nas slar yang lo shas ring bskyar gso byung yang ching rgyal rabs kyis gong ma yung Ting gis srid dbang bzung rjes bod du dge lugs pa'i chos gtso bor byed dgos pa dang chos gas gzhan dag ched du med pa ma bzos par chu mig rang skam la 'gro ba ltar gyi bya thabs lag len bstar dgos zhes bka' phab pa ltar skabs de'i bod sa gnas kyi srid dbang 'dzin mkhas de'i ching sba dur ram khang chen bsod nams rgyal pos po ta lar yod pa'i rnam rgyal grwa tshang gi grwa pa rnams rtsed thang o rgyan gling du gnas spo byas te gsar du rgyud smad grwa tshang nas grwa pa khag gcig bsdus nas dge lugs gtso bor byas pa'i rnam rgyal grwa tshang gsar du btsugs gzhung dgon du gtogs pas dgon bdag yig tshang nas byed cing rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag lor grwa grangs 125skor yod lags zhib par (sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i )bai T+yAr+ya ser po )dang (mi dbang rtogs brjod )sogs la gsal}
