rnam bcu|{1 nam mkha'/2 rlung/3 me/4 chu/5 sa/6 brtan pa/7 g.yo ba/8 gzugs med pa'i khams/9 nyi ma/10 zla ba bcas te/sna tshogs pad+ma nyi ma zla ba dang/_/sgra gcan dus me la sogs gdan gyi steng/_/rlung khams ya ljang rang dmar me yi khams/_/wa dkar lcags khams la ser sa yi khams/_/ma ni sna tshogs khams las grub pa ste/k+Sha ni chos kyi bdag med rtogs gyur pa/_/de steng ham dkar skye med chos ston pa/_/sna tshogs pad+ma'i steng du zla ba dkar/_/de steng me shel las grub nyi ma dmar/_/nA da sngon po du ba'i mdog can so/_/sprin ris smug po pad+ma'i tshal dang mnyam/_/yig rkang mang nyung rgya gar yul rigs khyad/_/ces byung ngo/_}
rnam bcu dbang ldan|{dus kyi 'khor lo'i snying po yin/de ni/ya/ra/ba/la/ma/k+Sha/ha zhes pa'i yi ge bdun dang/yi ge gzugs 'gyur ba 'i rjes su sna ldan (168) nam zla tshes thig le srog gi a yig mtshon par byed pa'i nA da bcas yi ge rnam pa bcu brtsegs par gnas zhig ste gnam bcu dbang da zhes rtag tup+mathong rgyu yod de ni legs sbyar skad kyi yig gzugs lany+dza ltar bris pa zhig yin lany+dza'i yig gzugs 'bri stangs rgyas bsdus las phyi shad mang nyung gi khyad par cung zad re yod 'di'i mtshon don ni 'jig rten khams la sbyar na ya ni rlung gyi khams ri ni me'i khams ba ni chu'i khams la ni sa'i khams ste phyi snod kyi 'jig rten 'byung ba rim brtsegs kyi snying po'am mtshon byed yin sna ldan zla tshes ni sems can gyi srog dang thig le ni sems can gyi dran mtshon byed yin nA da ni srog gi a yig nam mkha' stong pa'i khams mtsho byed yin/_/de'i mtshon mdog ni 'og gi 'byung ba rim brtsegs bzhi so so'i rang mdog ste ya ljang khu ra dmar po ba dkar po la ser po ma 'dod pa'i khams 'dod yon lnga mtshon byed kha dog lnga ldan k+Sha gzugs khams mtshon pa'i dkar po zla tshes sna ldan ni srog zla ba'i khams dkar po thig le ni drod nyi ma'i khams dmar po nA da nam mkha'i khams sngon po yin 'di ni khams gsum gyi 'jig rten snod bcud thams cad bsdus pa'am mtshon byed yin pas 'di khang steng du bkal na sa dpyad ngan pa thams cad zil gyis gnon nas bkra shis par byed gza' skar ngan pa'i gnod pa thams cad bzlog nas gnod pa srung khyim du bzhag na rkyen ngan dang bar chad srung dge shing bkra shis par byed pa sogs kyi phan yon yod tshul shod srol yod par brten phal che bas khang steng dang gtsug lag khang sogs kyis gyang ngos su 'bri srol chags yod don dngos thog 'dir dus 'khor lo nang gzhan gsum mtha' dag bsdus yon pas gzhung gzhan la gzigs par mdzod}
