rnam dbye|{ming le/kun bshad krita dang bcas pa rnams kyi bsgyur ba dang dbye ba ni rang bzhin dang rkyen gnyis 'brel ba la brten nas byung ba yin zhing/mtshams sbyor le'u lnga'i bsgyur ba dang dbye ba ni yi ge tsam dang 'brel ba'i rnam 'gyur yin pa sogs zhib par sgra rig pa'i gzhung las gsal}
