rnam smin gyi skye ba bcu|{sa dang po la gnas pa'i byang chub sems dpa' de phal cher dzam+bu'i gling la dbang sgyur ba'i 'khor los sgyur ba'i rgyal por skye/sa gnyis pa de gling bzhi la dbang ba'i 'khor los sgyur ba'i rgyal por skye/sa gsum pa sum cu rtsa gsum la dbang ba'i brgya byin la skye/sa bzhi pa rab 'thab bral gyi lha'i dbang po la skye/sa lnga pa dga' ldan gyi lha'i dbang po la skye/sa drug pa rab 'phrul dgu'i lha'i dbang po la skye/sa bdun pa dbang sgyur kyi lha'i dbang po la skye/sa brgyad pa stong spyi phud kyi bdag po tshangs pa la skye/sa dug pa stong gnyis bar ma'i 'jig rten gyi lha'i dbang po la skye/sa bcu pa gnas pa'i byang chub sems dpa' de gnas gtsang ma'i dbang po dang dbang phyug chen po rnams su skye ba 'dzin par gsungs so/_}
rnam smin gyi yon tan brgyad|{tshe ring ba/kha dog phun sum tshogs pa/rigs phun sum tshogs pa/dbang phyug phun sum tshogs pa/tshig btsun pa/dbang che bar grags pa/skyes pa yin pa/stobs dang ldan pa rnams so/_}
rnam smin 'bras bu|{'bras bu lnga'i nang gses (rnam smin (173) gyi 'bras bu dang rgyu mthun gyi 'bras bu bdag po'i 'bras bu skyes bu byed pa'i 'bras bu bral ba'i 'bras bu bcas )te zag bcas kyi dge ba dang mi dge ba gang rung gi rnam par smin pa'i rgyu las skyes pa ste zag bcas nyes len gyi phung po lta bu la zer 'di'i rnam smin gyi 'bras bu zhes pa ni skabs re rnam smin la go ba yang yod dper na rnam smin gyi yon tan rigs mtho bar skye ba sogs brgyad yod pa de la zer ba lta bu brgyad po de 'bras bu gsum gyi nang gi rgyu mthun gyi 'bras bu yin pa ma gtogs rnam smin gyi 'bras bu min rnam smin yon tan brgyad ni rigs mtho bar zhes pa tshe ring ba skyes pa yin pa stobs dang ldan pa dbang che ba nad med pa tshig btsun pa gzugs bzang ba bcas brgyad}
