rnam bzhi'i rig 'dzin|{rdzas kyi rig 'dzin/longs spyod kyi rig 'dzin/lus kyi rig 'dzin/tshe'i rig 'dzin te bzhi/rdzas kyi rig 'dzin ni/mig sman dang rdzas kyis thun mong gi dngos grub thob pa lta bu'o/_/longs spyod kyi rig 'dzin ni/rang snang du 'khor bsgyur gyi longs spyod thob pa lta bu la zer ro/_/de dag gi steng du tshe'i rig 'dzin bsnan nas rnam bzhi'i rig 'dzin zer ro/_}
rnam g.yeng gi rtog pa bcu|{ngo bo med par rtog pa/ngo bor rtog pa/sgro 'dogs pa'i rtog pa/skur ba 'debs pa'i rtog pa/gcig tu rtog pa/tha dad du rtog pa/ngo bo nyid du rtog pa /khyad par du rtog pa/ming ji lta ba bzhin du don rtog pa/don ji lta ba bzhin du ming rtog pa'o/_}
rnam g.yeng drug|{sgo lnga'i shes pa lta bu gtso bor nyid kyi g.yeng ba/de nyid la 'jug pa phyir du g.yeng ba/ting nge 'dzin gyi ro myong zhing byong grod kyi dbang du song ba nang gi g.yeng ba/chos brgyad kyi sgo nas chos skyod pa mtshan ma'i g.yeng ba/shin sbyangs k+khayi bde ba sred pa gnas ngan len gyi g.yeng ba/yul gyi dmigs pa gcig ma rdzogs par gcig la 'jug pa yid la byed pa'i g.yeng ba'o/_}
rnam g.yengs|{yul gcig la sems mi gnas par gang byung g.yengs 'gro ba zhig la zer/'di la rgod pa dang 'phro ba gnyis yod/rgod pa ni/dug gsum gyi yul la sems g.yengs pa/'phro ba ni/skabs de'i dmigs pa la mi ldog par gzhan dag la sems g.yengs pa ste 'di rgyu che zhing rgod pa rgya chung ba yin}
