rnam sras|{byang phyogs kyi bstan pa srung zhing skyong ba'i rgyal po chen po rnam thos sras la sku'i rnam 'gyur mi 'dra ba bco lnga yod pa de dag gi sku mdog zhal phyag gyi grangs dang phyag mtshan sogs zhib par sa skya mkhan chen ngag dbang chos grags dang chos rje ngag dbang blo bzang don grub gnyis kyi gsung 'bum nang rnam sras bka' bco lnga'i rjes gnang bya tshul re yod pa der gzigs}
rnam sras gan mdzod|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs pho brang po ta lar yod pa'i rin chen bang mdzod cig ste/de snga tA 'i bla ma sku phreng rim pa'i skabs lo ltar gser dngul gos dar ja bcas bka' 'jug zhu gos pa'i mdzod khang de'i 'don 'jug gtso bo'i 'gan 'khur spyi khyab mkhan po dang/bka' shag thun mong nas byas te lo ltar zla bcu gnyis pa'i nang sngar lam bkar 'jug zhu dgos gras/zhol gnyer/bsher dpang/snang rtse shag /gnyer tshang las khungs kyis mtshon las khungs khag dang/dkon gnyer dpon bcas nas lo ltar sgrig 'bul zhu dgos khongs snang che'i gser dngul gos dngar/mtha' dbus dad 'dus khag nas skyabs mgon rtse shod gnyis la dad mthul 'bul na khongs nas rtse shod phyag mdzod gnyis la sngar lam gyi 'bab sgo khag phud/de 'phros gser gdungs gos dar gang yod dang/gzhung gnas nas lo gnang chags su rtse shod phyag mdzod gnyis kyi 'bab khongs nas snam rigs/sman rigs spos sogs mngon sman khul du mgo ba'i dngos rigs bskul nas gzhung drel lag do dang dos rta lam yig bcas ja dar sogs mkho sgrub byed po bdo skar dpon zhes rtse phyag nang zhig ched bskos gyis gtong lam bzhin rtse ja dang/dar gos rgya dngul sogs mdo zog 'byor rigs nas thugs mkho phud/de byings ja dar/rgya dngul/gzhan yang mkhan khongs gzhung khang gi khang glang dngul Tam dkar dang/rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing stag (1914)lo ya mon 'phrul bzo khang/gro stong nor bu mtsho skyid nang zangs Tam/rjes su lor khang bcas nas Tam dkar dang/pad shag /shog lor bcas par 'grems gnang ba'i ma 'jog gam /bar lta bur lo ltar gser dngul/Tam dkar phon chen/sa rta (1918)lor nor thod gser Tam las khungs btsugs pa nas gser Tam par rgyag gi gser Tam rer pad lo srang nyi shu re rtsis khrom ra gang sar sprod len byed pa'i dza thang bar khyad gzhung khe lta bur lo ltar rgya dngul sa phag dang/rta mig ma/gser Tam do pa/so nam las khungs khongs kyi gzhung khang/mi rtsa pho mo'i mi bogs/ja tshwa las khungs nas do dam byed pa rgya khyab tshwa bal/rnga ma/pags rigs sogs kyi shor la lngar lam Tam dkar zhe gcig bsdus len byas 'bab/nag chu/lha ri 'go /gro mo/phag ri bcas sa 'gag khag nas ja khral sgam ja dang/'khor drug /ja ril bcas do grangs chig stong brgal ba sogs lo ltar rtse man gan mdzod khang steng shod bkal shag dang/spyi mkhan/drung rtsis/rtse shod sku tshab bcas thun mong nas bcug phra dang sbrags bsdu 'jug zhu dgos kyi yod pa red}
