rnal 'byor mngon sum|{rang gi thun mong ma yin pa'i bdag rkyen du gyur pa'i zhi lhag zung 'brel gyi ting nge 'dzin la brten nas skyes pa gang zhig /rtog bral ma 'khrul pa'i 'phags rgyud kyi gzhan rig gi mkhyen pa de rnal 'byor mngon sum gyi mtshan nyid/mtshan gzhi ni/phra ba'i mi rtag pa mngon sum du rtogs pa'i blo dang/gang zag gi bdag med phra rags mngon sum du rtogs pa'i blo lta bu'o/_/de la dbye na/rnal 'byor mngon sum du gyur pa'i tshad ma dang/dpyad shes gnyis las der gyur pa'i snang la ma nges pa'i blo med do/_/rnal 'byor mngon sum la rten gyi sgo nas dbye na/nyan thos/rang rgyal/theg chen 'phags pa'i rnal 'byor gsum/de re re la (177) yang mthong lam sgom lam mi slob lam gsum yod do/_}
rnal 'byor mngon sum gyi tshad ma|{rang rgyud pa ngan chad kyis rnal 'byor mngon sum la 'phags pa'i ye shes kyis khyab par bzhed kyang lugs 'di la bdag med phra mo ma rtogs pa'i snga rol du yang bden bzhi'i khyad chos rags pa bcu drug dang gang zag gang bdag med rags pa sogs rtogs pa'i rnal 'byor mngon sum yod par bzhes pas so so skye bo'i rgyud la'ang rnal 'byor mngon sum yod par gsungs so/_}
rnal 'byor mngon sum bzhi|{nyan thos kyi rnal 'byor mngon sum/rang rgyal kyi rnal 'byor mngon sum/byang sems 'phags pa'i rnal 'byor mngon sum/sangs rgyas kyi rgyud kyi rnal 'byor mngon sum mo}
rnal 'byor chen po a mes|{'di nyid kyi mtshan cha tshang la a mes byang chub 'byung gnas sam byang chub rin chen zhu zhing rab byung gong gi shing yos (1015)lor mdo smad tsong khar sku 'khrungs/jo bo'i slob ma bden gnyis la shin tu mkhas pa ni rnal 'byor chen po yin zhing/des gro lung pa dang spyan snga ba la gsungs/dge bshes ston pas gdan drangs pa ltar 'di nyid byang du phebs/rab byung dang po'i shing sbrul (1065)lor bka' gdams bstan pa'i chu 'go rwa sgreng gi gdan sa bskyangs/rab byung dang po'i sa rta (1078)lor rnal 'byor pa chen po 'das nas gdan sa 'dzeng dgon pa ba dbang phyug rgyal mtshan gyis bskyangs}
rnal 'byor nam mkha'|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags nas bshad pa'i lha zhig gi mtshan ste/'di la gtso 'khor bsdoms lha lnga bcu nga brgyad (gtso bo yab yum bsdoms pas gcig /mkha' 'gro ma bzhi/gdong can ma bzhi/phyogs bzhi'i lha mo bcu gnyis/mtshams bzhir mo bsdoms brgyad/chos skyong brgyad/'jig rten pa'i 'khor bcu drug /ye shes mkha' 'gro ma lnga )yod/de rnams kyi bzhugs stangs dang/sku mdog /phyag mtshan sogs zhib par (dkyil chog rdo rje phreng ba )nang dkyil 'khor rnam grangs so bzhi pa'i thad du gsal bas der gzigs}
rnal 'byor rnal 'byor che dang 'byed rtogs la nang gses bzhir dbye rig 'dzin bcu drug|{dbang bzhi rjes dran las thob rgyu yi sa la/rnal 'byor gyi sa/rnal 'byor chen po'i sa/'byed pa'i rnam 'byor gyi sa/rtogs pa'i rnal 'byor gyi sa zhes spyir dbang du sgyur ba dang ma sgyur ba gnyis gnyis te brgyad du yod kyang bye brag nang gses ba bzhir dbye na/1 rnal 'byor/bya ba'i rnal 'byor/spyod pa'i rnal 'byor/sgyu ma'i rnal 'byor/2 shin tu rnal 'byor gyi sa/rang sa nges pa'i rnal 'byor gyi sa/spros pa'i rnal 'byor/bya bral rdzogs pa'i rnal 'byor gyi sa/3 brda'i sa/don gyi sa/brda don dbyer med kyi sa/ma 'dres pa'i sa/4 rdzu 'phrul 'phrul ba'i sa/khyad par rtogs pa'i sa/mngon par 'byung ba'i sa/dpa' bo rigs 'byed kyi sa bcas so/_}
rnal 'byor pa|{rnal zhes pa ni gnas te phyi rol yul la sems g.yeng ba zhi bar byas nas rang gi sgom bya'i dmigs pa la sems rtse gcig tu gnas par byed pa'o/_/'byor zhes pa lhag mthong ste/zhes gnas la brten nas so sor rtog pa'i shes bar sa shes bya'i gnas lugs yang dag pa'i lhag par du mthong ba'o/_/de ltar thabs dang shes kyi bdag nyid can de la rnal 'byor pa zhes pa'o/_}
