rnal 'byor spyod pa'i dbu ma rang rgyud pa|{dbu ma rang rgyud pa la gnyis yod pa'i nang gi rnal 'byor spyod pa'i dbu ma rang rgyud pas spyi thon med pa chos bdag med rags pa 'jog pa sems tsam pa dang mthun pa yin pas ming la'ang rnal 'byor spyod pa zhes btags pa yin/des na phyi don khas mi len zhing/rang rig khas len pa'i dbu ma pa de rnal 'byor spyod pa'i dbu ma rang rgyud pa'i mtshan nyid/lugs 'di slob dpon zhi ba 'tshos srol 'byed par mdzad do/_/de la dbye na rnam bden pa dang mthun pa'i dbu ma dang/rnam rdzun pa dang mthun pa'i dbu ma pa gnyis yod/rnam rig pa/sems tsam pa/rnal 'byor spyod pa gsum don gcig ming gi rnam grangs yin}
