sna dkar rtse pa|{(bod ljongs lho kha sa khul sna dkar rtse (179) rdzong )hor rgyal po se chen han gyis yar 'brog nas bzung lho brag tshun chad kyi sa cha la dbang ba'i khri dpon gyi 'ja' sa lon pas sde tshugs che sa skya dpon chen ang len dang grags pa'i dpon drag shul can de yang 'di'i mi brgyud yin khri dpon nam mkha' bzang po dang he ru kun dga' rgyal mtshan khu dbon gyi ring bo dong paN ched 'jigs med grags pa bla mar bsten yar 'brog pa tshang ma khong gi slob mar gyur sde pa rin spungs pa dang gnyen srid du 'brel (dpon nam mkha' bzang pos bo dong paN chen gyi rnam thar chen mo brtsams )bas zhong 'jags po byung ba na'ang bar skabs shig nas dus mi bde ba'i 'go tshugs rdzong 'di dus skabs gang gi skabs su byung ming gsal bar ma mthong yang rigs pas dpyad na tA la'i si tu byang chub rgyal mtshan gyis rab byung drug pa'i 'khor sa skya pa'i srid dbang phrogs rjes dbus gtsang gnyis su rdzong chen bcu gsum brtsigs par bshad pa'i nang gi gcig yin nam snyam ste brtag 'di'i skor zhib pa (deb ther dmar po gsar ma )nang gsal}
