snang ston zla ba rgyal mtshan|{snang stong zla ba rgyal ma tshan dpal bzang po 'di nyid rang byung bcu gsum pa'i me 'brug (1796)lor rnga ba khul du ba snang zhig gdung rigs nor bu dang yum mkhar slebs gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/dgung grangs drug la phebs pa nas yi ge 'bri klog 'don gsum zab par sbyangs pas rang grol du mkhyen/dgung lo bcu gsum bzhes pa'i dus a khu shes rab blo gros kyi drung nas bon sngon 'gro'i 'khrid kha zhus pa dang/dgung lo bco brgyad bzhes skabs dbus gtsang khul du gnas mjal bar phebs/g.yung drung bon gyi gdan sa gtsang thob rgyal bri shis sman ri dgon du phebs nas der mkhan chen shes rab dgongs rgyal gyi drung du dge tshul gyi sdom pa zhus pas mtshan zla ba rgyal mtshan zhes (181) gsol de nas thob rgyal sman ri dgon du sgrigs zhugs mdzad de dgon pa'i phyi nang bar gsum gyi sgrig lam dang dkyil 'khor phyi nang gsang gsum gyi thig rtsa gyer gdangs 'phrin las dang dung 'bud gtor bzo 'cham sogs la sbyangs pa nang byan chud par mdzad de nas sa skya'i dgon lag chos sde chen po 'bras yul skyid tshul du mkhan po skal bzang chos 'phel slob dpon du bsten nas bsdus grwa tshan pa le'u bco brgyad dang rtsa gzhung 'dul ba mngon pa mdzod tshad ma phar phyin dbu ma sogs gzhung lugs rgya mtsho lta bul sbyangs pa mdzad pas 'char rtsod rtsom gsum la mkhas par gyur gdung la nyer lnga pa la sa skya'i gong ma chen po pad+ma bdun 'dul gyis dge ba'i bshes gnyen chen po bka' rab 'byams pa'i mtshan rtags gsol de nas bskyar du thob rgyal bkra shis smin ri dgon du zhabs 'khor bskyod par mdzad der mkhas chen shes rab dgongs rgyal gyi drung nas dag pa drang song gi sdom pa nyis brgya lnga bcu tham pa zhus te sha chang dang dus min kha zas sgog btsong sogs la spang bya mdzad mkhan rin po che'i sku gam nas phyi nang gsang ba'i skor gyi bon rgyun bum pa gang byo'i tshul du mnon nas lo bdun ring skyes rdzogs sgom gsum gyi dka' spyad dge sbyor nyams su len ched nges med ri khrod sogs la mtshams sgrub byams pa la bzhugs par mdzad de nas smin ri'i mkhas chen shes rab dgongs rgya