snang ba gzugs kyi gzhi|{snang ba gzugs kyi gzhi ni dbang po lnga/don lnga/rnam par rig byed ma yin pa'i gzugs te bcu gcig go /(mdzod )las/gzugs ni dbang po lnga dang don/_/lnga dang rnam rig byed min nyid/_/ces gsungs pa ltar ro/_/dbang po lang ni/mig rna ba sna rtse lung te dbang po lnga/don lnga ni/gzugs sgra dri ro reg bya'i skye mched lnga'o/_/'di bcu'i nang gses gyi dbye ba/der na gzugs kyi skyed mched la dbyibs dang kha dog gnyis/dbyibs brgyad ngad kha dgo bcu gnyis sogs kyi 'jog tshul spyir mdo sde pa dang mthun la/rnam par rig byed ma yin pa'i gzugs ni gyi g.yo 'gul 'debs 'jog sogs byed pa na de'i snga logs kyi kun slong ni rang gi yid shes kho na'i yul du snang zhing gzhan gyi rnam shes kyis rig par ra med pa'i gzugs yin pas na rnam par rig byed ma yin pa'i gzugs zer ba yin/0'ed la dbye na sdom pa dang/sdom pa ma yin pa/bar ma'i gzugs te gsum yod/bye brag smra ba dang thal 'gyur ba gnyis kyis rnam par rig byed ma yin pa'i gzugs 'dzin par 'dod cing/mdo sde pa sogs kyis de ltar mi 'dod do/_}
