snang rtse shag las khungs|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs thog mar lha sa dang/zhol khul gnyis ka zhol pa las khungs na nas do byed kyi yod tshod ni (mi dbang rtogs brjod )nang lha zhol gyi bya ba'i sne mo 'dzin pa nga phod blo bzang zhes gsal zhing/snang rtse shag ni rjes su btsugs pa zhig yin 'dug /de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi rtsa 'dzin (bka' shag rgya deb )ces pa'i nang rim pa lnga pa snang rtse shag mi dpon gnyis zhes gsal/snang rtse shag las khungs kyi khyab khongs ni gling skor lam gyi nub ngos nas/lho gling skor lam gyi byang rgyud/nub g.yu thog zam pa'i phyed nas thad drangs pa'i shar ngos/byang gling skor byang lam gyi lho rgyud bcas kyi nang du yod pa'i grong khul rnams yin/las khungs de'i gnas yul sa gling skor byang lam gyi lho rgyud bcas kyi nang du yod pa'i grong khul rnams yin/las khungs de'i gnas yul lha sa gtsug lag khang gi phyi rol byang ngos su gnas pa der snang rtse shag ces pa ni khang pa'i ming yin/de gar 'go 'dzin mi dpon gnyis dang/drung yig gcig /gnyer pa gnyis/khang gnyer gcig /pu li si dmag sgar gyi brgya dpon gcig /bskor ba bya ba'i nyi shu skor/btson srung pa gcig bcad yod/rags stobs 'go pas rag stobs pa dang/pi gtong ba rnams kyi 'go 'dzin byed dgos/las khungs de'i las 'gan gtso bo ni/lha sa grong khul gyi khrims 'dod dang/bde 'jags do dam/cha sa khag bgogs kyis blta mkhas sa res bskor bya ba re yod pa des so so'i sa khongs su gnas tshul ji byung dus thog tu snyan seng zhu dgos/sa gnas 'gag che sar pu li si dmag mi re nyen mtshan rtag sdom kyis skor g.yeng rgyag rgyus mtshan bde 'jags dang/gtsang sbrar blta bskul byed rgyu/mi gsod gyon don che rigs mi dpon nas bka' shag la dgongs skor snyan seng zhu rgyu dang/gyon don chung tsag de ga nas thag gcod byed dgos/_/da dung lha sa grong khul du chang ma khyim tshang dgu bcu tham pa gtan 'bebs kyis chang khral bsdu 'bab sogs gzhung rtsis zhu rgyu bcas yin/snang rtse shag drung yig gis sa tsho ba'i 'go 'dzin byed dgos pa yin/lhas grong khul du khang pa gsar rgyag byed dgos tshe lha sa gnyer tshang las khungs su snyan seng thob 'god byed dgos pa sogs yin/gong gsal snang rtse (184) shag gi khyab khongs kyi nang dang zhol pa las khungs kyi khongs su grong khul du yod pa'i mi ser rnams kyi dpon khungs zhib gsal dbye 'byed dkar rung don du mi ser dkyus ma (gzhung zhabs ser skya'i nang mi ngo ma pho mo dang grwa pa phud )tshang ma gzhung sger chos gsum rung zhig gi khongs su zhugs nas dpon khungs de nas lag 'khyer zhig blangs te lo re mi bogs dngul gtan 'bebs ltar sprad na mi bdag tu gyur te gzhan gyi brnyas 'tsher byed mkhan byung yang dpon khungs des 'gan 'khur gyi yod yon kyangi gcig gis dpon khungs gcig las bsten mi chog}
snang tshul|{'di lta tshul dang bsam tshul la go rgyu yod la/skabs gzhan du phyi'i lta snang dang/mngon sum du mthong ba'i gnas tshul la'ang go rgyu yod}
snang yul|{blo de'i snang ngo la snang ba'i sgo nas rig par bya ba blo de'i snang yul gyi mtshan nyid/de dang blo de'i bzung yul don gcig /mdo sde pa'i lugs ltar na/mngon sum tshad ma la snang yul rnams mngon sum gyi snang yul du 'jog pa yin/mngon sum gyi snang yul dang dngos po don gcig /rtogs pa'i snang yul dang rtag pa don gcig bar chad med la mngon sum yin pas gang zag gi bdag med mi snang zhing bdag med shugs la gas nas bdag gis dben pa'i 'du byed dngos su rtogs pa khas len pa yin/dper na/bum pa de bum 'dzin dbang mngon gyi snang yul yin te/bum 'dzin dbang mngon gyis rang la gsal bar snang nas bzung bar bya ba de bum pa las gzhan 'jog rgyu med pas so/_/des na dngos po yin na snang yul yin pas khyab ste/rang rang 'dzin pa'i mngon sum gyi snang yul yin/rtog pa thams cad kyi snang yul la don spyi zhig dgos/dper na bum pa'i don spyi du bum 'dzin rtog pa'i snang yul yin te/bum 'dzin rtog pa rang gi snang ngo la snang ba de bum pa'i don spyi de yin pas so/_/des na rtag pa yin na snang yul yin pas ma khyab ste don spyi las gzhan pa'i rtag pa thams cad snang yul min no/_/de la dbye na/rtog med 'khrul shes kyi gzung yul dang gsum yod/'khrul shes dang shog shes ma gtogs pa'i shes pa thams cad la snang yul yod}
snang g.yel|{phyi rol thams cad mthong ba'i skar khung sogs kyi ming}
snang ra'i grong brgyad dam bdun|{snang ra/glas gsum/tsho bzhi/nang khog /glas rkang/steng so/gcan tsha rnams yin}
snang la ma nges pa'i blo|{blo rig bdun gyi nang gses shig ste/rang gi 'jug yul du gyur pa'i rang mtshan gsal bar snang yang de la nges pa 'dren mi nus pa'i rig pa de snang la ma nges pa'i blo'i mtshan nyid/mtshan gzhi ni/yig gzugs mdzes pa la ga par chags bzhin pa'i gnas skabs kyi sgra 'dzin nyan shes lta bu'o/_/de la dbye na/snang lam nges pa'i blor gyur pa'i dbang mngon/yid mngon/rang rig mngon sum bcas gsum yod}
snang gshen bal thod can|{bon shes pa bcu gnyis kyi gras nas g.yang shes phywa mi bon zer ba de yin cing/'dis phywa g.yang 'gugs pa la brten mi rgyud dang nor phyugs rgyas par byed pa yin zer srol 'dug }
snang sa 'od 'bum|{de sngon bod kyi rab byung gsum pa'i 'go dang spyi lo'i dus rabs bcug nyis pa'i dkyil tsam du byung zhing/myang stod rgyal rtse ri nang sa khul du zhing bran rgan gon gnyis kyi bu mo snang sa bod 'bum zhes pa ri nang dpon po sgra chen gyi bu grags pa bsam grub gyi mna' mar btsan shed kyis blangs rjes mnar gcod tshad med myangs pa'i lo rgyus yod pa de yin}
snang sems 'dres|{phyi rol gyi yul snang dang rang sems (185) logs su med par gcig tu 'dres pa'i 'char snang}
