snam stod|{snam bus bzos pa'i stod thung}
snam phyis|{chab khang gi ming ste (lam rim chen mo'i brda bkrol )las/rnam phyis ni chab khang ngam phyi sa khang ste mi gtsang ba dor ba'i khang pa zhes gsungs so/_}
snam phran glegs bu|{dge slong gi chos gos la snang phran nyer lnga dang/chos gos che tshad la glegs bu bdun/chung tshad la phyed dang lnga yin}
snam sbyar gyi gra rtags bzhi|{ut+pal/pad ma/rin po che/shing lo'o/_}
sna'i dbang mngon|{dri dngos su snom byed sna'i dbang po'i mngon sum}
sna'i dbang po|{rang 'bras sna shes kyi thun mong ma yin pa'i bdag rkyen byed pa'i rigs su gnas pa'i nang gi gzugs can dwangs ba/de'i mtshan nyid/sna'i dbang po dang/sna'i khams/sna'i skye mched rnams don gcig /dbye na rten bcas kyi snang dbang dang/de mtshungs kyi sna dbang gnyis yod/dri snom bzhin pa'i skabs kyi snang dbang de rten bcas kyi sna ba dang dang gnyid log pa'i skabs kyi sna dbang de/de mtshungs kyi sna dbang yin no/_}
snar thang|{snar thang dgon pa/de yang ri bo glang po che'i sna zhags brkyangs 'dra'i 'dabs su btab pa 'brel ba rgyu mtshan du byas nas snar thar zhes ming byung bar grags/bod kyi lo rgyus thog snyan grags che ba'i bka' gdams kyi dgon pa zhig yin (deng sang bod rang skyong ljongs gzhis rtse sa khul gzhis rtse rdzong chu mig chus khongs su yod )rab byung gsum pa'i chu bya (1153)lor dge bshes sha ra ba'i slob ma gtum ston blo gros grags pas phyag btab/dgon pa 'di nas mchims nam mkha' grags pa sogs mkhan pa chen po mang du byon/sngar dus rabs bcug nyis pa'i mgor/bcom ldan rig pa'i ral gri dang dbus pa blo gsal bzang sangs rgyas 'bum sogs kyis bod sa gnas su yod pa'i bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur gyi bod sa gnas su yod pa'i bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur gyi ma de yod chad bsdus nas phyogs bsgrigs nang ba'i bka' 'gyur bstan 'gyur cha tshang dang/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags phag (1731)lor pho lha ba bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis sbyin bdag byed te bzhengs pa'i bka' 'gyur pod brgya tham pa'i dpar shing dang/de'i rjes su mu mthun nas bzhengs pa'i bstan 'gyur pod nyis ba rgya nyi shu rtsa lnga'i dpar shing/ston pa sangs rgyas kyi 'khrungs rabs dpag bsam 'khri shing gi thang ka nyi shu rtsa lnga'i dpar shing/rje tsong kha pa'i rnam thar cha tshang gi thang ka bco lnga'i dpar shig sogs dpar shing shin tu mang ba dang/gzhan yang lag bris dpe cha rtsa cha'i rigs kyang mang po yod/snang thang dgon du de snga grwa tshang gnyis dang mchod khang gtso gras khag bcu bsum tsam yod pa de dag gi nang rten gtso bor rgya gar nas gdan drangs pa'i sman 'jim las grub pa'i rgyal ba byams pa mgon po dang rgya gar rdo rje gdan gyi mchod rten dang shing brkos re/gser zangs kyi shAkya thub pa sogs bzhugs/de min sku rten dang ldebs bris sogs mang po bzhugs pa phud/de dung ming dang ching rgyal rabs dus kyi sku thang rnying ma yang mi nyung tsam yod/gzhan yang gdung rten lha khang du gdan rabs rim byon gyi sku gdung li ma las grub pa'i (186) bka' gdams mchod rten che ba thog tshad ma dang chung shos mtho gang tsam bar yod pa brgya phrag brgal ba dang rgyal ba'i bka' 'gyur gser chos cha tshang bzhugs pa bcas yin kyang da cha shul tsam las lhag med}
snar thang pa kun dga' rgyal mtshan|{rje 'di nyid rab byung drug pa'i sa stag (1338)lor chu sgo'i khung bya bar gro'i rigs su sku bltams/mchims blo bzang grags pa las bka' gdams kyi gdams pa rnams rdzogs par gsan/dka' bcu pa gzhon nu seng ge las kyang gdams pa gzhan mang du gsan/rab byung drug pa'i shing yos (1375)lor snar thar gyi gdan sar phebs/bslab btus kyi TIk+ka sogs rtsom pa mang du mdzad/tsong kha chen pos kyang rje 'di'i zhabs la gtugs/gdan sa lo nyi shu rtsa bdun bskyangs te dgung lo drug cu re bzhi bzhes pa rab byung bdun pa'i lcags sbrul (1401)lor sku mya ngan las 'das}
snar thang pa grags pa don grub|{rje 'di nyid rab byung drug pa'i sa rta (1378)lor gan rtsar 'khrungs/sku na chung ngu nas rab tu byung ste thugs btsun shin tu che bar gyur/mkhas chen grub pashes rab las bka' gdams kyi chos rdzogs par gsan te mkhas pa'i mnga' rnyed/gdan sa gong ma khri gzhol mdzod kyang rje nyid khri la ma phebs pas gdan khri lo bzhi ring stong par lus/rab byung bdun pa'i sa rta (1438)lor snar thar gdan sa'i khrir phebs nas lo sum cu'i ring gnas sa bskyangs mthar dgung lo dgu bcu bzhes pa rab byung brgyad pa'i me phag (1467)lor sku gshegs}
snar thang pa grags pa shes rab|{(phyi ma )rje 'di nyid rab byung bdun pa'i shing 'brug (1424)lor snar thang du sku 'khrungs/mkhan chen grags pa don grub las rab tu byung/thams cad mkhyen pa rje dge 'dun grub dang/rab 'byams smon lam dpal ba/mkhas pa dbang ldan cho sa skyong sogs spyi bor bsten nas sde snod gyi yon tan mtha' yas pa gsan/snar thar khron sbug grwa tshang gi 'chad nyan yang thogs shig mdzad/dgung lo drug cu re gsum bzhes pa rab byung brgyad pa'i me rta (1486)lor snar thang chos sde'i khrir phebs te 'chad nyan 'gro don rgya cher spel/sku tshe smad kyi mdzad pa mi gsal}
snar thang pa grub pa shes rab|{rje 'di snar thang gi nye 'khor rong gu zhes bya bar dbang gi rigs su rab byung drug pa'i me bya (1357)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun par klog yig mkhas par mkhyen/dgung lo bcu par mkhan chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan nas rab tu byung/mtshan grub pa shes rab tu gsol/dgung lo nyi shu par bsnyen par rdzogs par mdzad/mkhan po kun dga' rgyal mtshan dang/slob dpon grags pa rgya mtsho/chos rje yon tan 'od sogs yongs 'dzin tu bsten nas mdo rgyud man ngag gi skor sogs legs par gsan/khyad par mkhan chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan las bka' gdams kyi skor rnams rdzogs par mnos/dgung lo sum cu so gnyis bzhes pa sa 'brug (1388)lor snar thang gi gdan khrir phebs/gzhung dang gdams ngag gi sgo nas mkhas pa rnams kyi thugs yin thim par mdzad cing/skye bo rnams la thar pa'i sa bon legs par btab/dpal yid bzang rtse ba dang rjes shes rab seng ge kyang zhabs la gtugs/thams cad mkhyen pa dge da'un grub pas rje 'di las dge bsnyen dang/dge tshul/dge slong/gsang sngags kyi sdom pa bcas mnos shing/zab chos kyang mang du gsan/ming rgyal rabs gong mas mkhan chen la spu ma dpar po'i ka 'phan dang sgo 'phan zhig kyang phul spyod 'jug gi TIk+ka sogs ljags rtsom mdzad/gdan sa lo bcu bskyangs te mkhan zur du phebs/ (187) dgung lo drug cu re bdun bzhes pa rab byung bdun pa'i chu yos (1423)lor ngo mtshar gyi ltas dum dang bcas dgongs pa chos dbyings su gshegs}
snar thang pa nyi ma rgyal mtshan|{mkhan chen 'di nyid snar thang gi phu'i steng karma kha rir rab byung bzhi pa'i shing bya (1225)lor sku 'khrungs/sku gzhon nu nas rab tu byung/'brom sku ma ra las glegs bam cha lags dang bcas pa gsan/khyad par mchims dang skyo ston pa gnyis nas gdams pa yongs su rdzogs pa'i bka' drin mnos/sa khyi (1298)lor snar thang gdan khrir phebs/tshul khrims stag brgyas bskos/chos khrims dam par mdzad/gdan sa lo bdun bskyangs nas dgung lo brgyad cu gya gcig bzhes pa rab byung lnga pa'i shing sbrul 1305)lashor sku mya ngan las 'das}
snar thang pa bzod pa dpal grub|{rje 'di nyid rab byung bdun pa'i lcags sbrul (1401)lor chu sgo gzhung du sku 'khrungs/mkhan chen gru ba pashes rab las rab tu byung/mtshan bzod pa dpal grub ces gsol/snga rjes su mkhas grub dge legs dpal bzang dang/rje shes seng ge /thams cad mkhyen dge 'dun grub pa sogs mkhas grub mang po'i zhabs la gtugs nas sde snod la shin tu mkhas par gyur/snar thang du mtshan nyid kyi 'chad nyan yang mdzad/dgung lo drug cu re brgyad bzhes pa rab nga brgyad pa'i sa byi (1468)lor snar thang chos sde'i gnas khrir phebs nas gdan sa lo gsum bskyangs mthar dgung lo bdun cu tham pa rab byung brgyad pa'i lcags stag (1470)lor sku gshegs}
snar thang pa shes rab rgyal mtshan|{rje 'di nyid shab stag la dang nye ba'i grong spo khar zhes par rab byung bdun pa'i lcags glang (1421)lor 'khrungs/sku chung ngu nas rab tu byung zhing thugs rab che la sgo gsum bag dang ldan pa zhig yod/_/de nas thams cad mkhyen pa dge 'dun grub kyi zhabs la gtugs te mdo sngags kyi gzhung ji snyed gsan pas sde snod 'dzin pa chen por gyur te rtsed thang du po ti bco brgyad kyi grwa skor mdzad/mthil du byon te chos rje bsod nams mchog grub pa dang mjal/chos rje byams pa gling pa las sgra bslabs/lo der dga' ldan du byon te rgyud chen sbyin pa dpal las gsang 'dus kyi rgyud 'grel rdzogs par gsan/slar yang gtsang du phebs nas snar thar du mtshan nyid kyi 'chad nyan mdzad/de nas rje 'di nyid kyis tshe 'dir mthong lam thob pa zhig byed gsungs te byang chub chen po'i dben gnas dang rkang bzhi phu'i bden gnas sogs su thugs dam gtso bor mdzad/skabs de shes su nye gnas chen pos snar thang gi mkhan por gdan drangs kyang phebs dkar bar byung ba la/thams cad mkhyen pa rje dge 'dun grub kyi bka' lung phebs pa zlog mi nus par dgung lo lnga bcu nga gsum bzhes pa chu sbrul ((1473)lor snar thang chos sde'i khri la phebs/lo bcu bzhi'i ring gdan sa bskyangs te khri zur du phebs nas dben gnas kho nar thugs dam dub zhugs 'das lo mi gsal}
snar ma|{sdar ma'i ming ste/(bod kyi rdo ring yi ge dang dril bu'i kha byang )las/ma gum na ma phyung ba'i chad par/snar ma 'o dom btags zhes pa lta bu'o/_}
