snubs rje sris pa la sogs pa'i rje dgu|{1 gnubs rje sris pa/2 stong rje glang pa/3 rdo rje gle ba/ (188) 4 mchims rje brus pa 5 nyag gnyi phyag pa 6 bra sa bskos pa 7 khyegs gle ba 8 shi'u chang pa 9 so phye pa}
