snubs mtsho|{(yar 'brog g.yu mtsho )bod rang skyong rdzongs sna dkar rtse rdzong khongs dpal ti chus yar 'gro ba grong tsho'i nye 'dabs su yod/sngar bod kyi rus rgyun khungs snubs kyi rus rgyud tsho pa rnams sa gnas der sdod kyi yod stabs rus kyi ming yul btags te snubs yul gling dgu zhes chags pa dang/snubs kyi rigs las byung ba'i sngags pa dang mkhas pa mang po zhig rong gi snubs su 'khrungs pa'i lo rgyus yod/bod kyi dmangs khrod ngag rgyun du srol la/yar 'brog gi mtsho'i khor yug gi rgya khyon la rta pa'i nying lam gnyis kyis khor yug gi rgya khyon yod pa dang chu'i 'byung khungs tshad mtho zhing/nya rigs mi 'dra ba mang po yod pa'i mtsho zhig yin}
sne gdong|{'di thug mar 'bri gung sgom pa rdo rje dpal gyis khri dpon byed skabs thog mar brtsigs pa'i gzhis kha'i gras yin kyang/rjes su tA la'i si tu byang chub rgyal mtshan gyis khri dpon bye rjes sne gdong gzhis ka rgya brgyad byas shing tA sis bod sa gnas yongs kyi srid dbang bzung rjes pho brang gi ba yin/deng sang bod rang skyong ljongs lho kha sa khul khongs sde gdong rdzong yod sa de yin}
sne mo ba|{srid gzhung gi las don byed mkhan gras}
sne mo las 'dzin|{spyir na bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi gzhung yig nang gsal ba'i sde mo las 'dzin zhes pa ni rdzong gzhis khag gi rdzong dpon dang/dgon pa'i nang gi mkhan po dge bskos sogs la go dgos}
