sne'u rdzong shul|{(stong lung bde chen rdzong khongs )ta'i si tu byang chub rgyal mtshan gyis rab byung drug pa'i sa glang (1349)lo nas lo bcu drug rim srid dbang bzung skabs btsugs pa'i rdzong chen bcu gsum gras kyi mkhar shul yin pa dang/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu rta (1642)lor gu shri bstan 'dzin chos rgyal gyis gtsang ba sde srid gson bzung gis sne'ur btson 'jug byas rjes bskyar log bya rtsis gyi gnas tshul yig 'grul thunastabs sa gnas de ga nas skyid chur g.yugs te bkum pa sogs kyi lo rgyus yod}
