pa tshab nyi ma grags|{rab byung dang po'i shing lug (1055)lor 'phan yul pa tshab stod du sku 'khrungs/gzhon nu'i dus kha cher byon te sadz+dzI na'i sras gnyis la sogs pa'i paN+Di ta mang po las chos lo nyi shu rtsa gsum gsan sbyong mdzad/bod du phebs rjes spu hrengs pa'i dge 'dun spyis g.yu bo che phag skur zer ba zhig phul nas gang ba spel gyis mdzad pa'i mdzod kyi 'grel pa bsgyur bar zhus pa bzhin bsgyur/'phan yul du dbu ma'i 'chad nyan legs par tshugs te slob ma mang du bskyangs/slob dpon zla bas mdzad pa'i rtsa 'jug gzhi gsum/rig pa drug cu pa rnams kyi 'grel pa legs par bsgyur/phyis ra ma chen paN+Di ta ka na ka warma dang lhan cig tu yul dbus kyi de dang mthun par bcos/yang slob dpon zla bas mdzad pa'i stong nyid bdun cu'i pa'i 'grel chen ltar a b+ha ya dang/snur d+harma grags kyis bsgyur ba de'i khrod nas bam po gnyis lhag tsam paN+Di ta mu ti ta dang ldan du bsgyur bcos pa dang/gsang 'dus 'grel pa sgron gsal gyi bsgyur bcos kyang yang dag pa mdzad/'dus pa'i skor mang po bsgyur ba dang 'chad nyan yang mdzad/slob ma (191) rnams kyi nang nas gtsang par sbos rma bya byang chub ye shes dar yon tan grags de bzhin btsan thang pa rgyal dpal la sogs pa'i slob mang po byung zhing dbu ma shin tu dar bar mdzad pa bcas so/_}
