paN chen sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan|{'khrungs yul ni gtsang stod lhan drug brgya ba'i spe'u zhes pa'i yul du yab drung 'tsho ba kun dga' 'od zer dang yum mtsho rgyal gnyis kyi sras su bod kyi rab byung bcu pa'i lcags rta (1575)lor 'khrungs shing rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu stag (1662)lo bar dgung lo go gsum bzhugs/dgung lo lnga la phebs skabs dben pa sa blo bzang don grub kyi slob ma mkhas grub sangs rgyas ye shes kyis bden sa pa'i sprul sku ngos 'dzin zhus te mtshan la blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan zhes gsol/dgung lo bcu bzhi'i thog dben dgon gyi khrir bkod/dgung lo so gcig pa rab byung bcu pa'i lcags glang (1601)lor bkra shis lhun po'i mkhan po mdzad/dgung lo zhe bzhi pa chu glang (1613)lo nas lo drug gi ring sa smon lam chen mo'i tshogs dbur phebs shing/se 'bras dge gsum gyi slob gnyen thon pa'i dge bshes chu tshad mtho shes rnams sa smon lam chen mor dam bca' 'jog rgyu dang/ang rim bya dgos gnang rgyu sogs dge bshes lha rams pa'i lugs srol thog mar gsar gtod gnang zhing/gzhung chen po lnga'i slob gnyer 2gong 'phel 'gro rgyur bskal pa chen po thabs pa byung/rab byung bcu pa'i chu khyi (1622)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa ngos 'dzin mtshan gsol mdzad de 'phyor rgyas nas 'bras spungs su gdan drangs shing sku gong ma'i khrir bskos pa'i 'gan bzhes gnang/se 'bras gnyis ka ba'i mkhan po gcig lcogs lo drug ring mdzad/bod kyi rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags 'brug (1640)laur tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa dang gros mol gnang ste se chen cho sa rje gdong byang shar hrin yang du man ju'i gong ma dang po hrun kri {(WP:1,194)}la 'tshams 'dri yi ge dang rten bcas bskur ba gnang zhing/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing sprel (1644)lor gong ma hrun kri khril 'khod rjes tA la'i bla ma dang paN chen rin po che gnyis kar bsngags brjod yi ge dang mtshams rtags bcas phul/gsum rtsom rang nyid kyi rnam thar sogs pod lnga yod}
paN chen sku phreng lnga pa blo bzang ye shes|{rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu yos (1663)lo'i bod zla bdun pa'i tshes bco lnga nyin yab zhabs drung bsod nams grags pa dang yum tshe brtan bu khrid gnyis kyi sras su gtsang thob rgyal brul tshang du sku bltams/gdung rgyu dbon yin par grags/shing 'brug (1664)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa chen po'i bka' gdongs bzhis bkras na du gdan drangs te gser khril mnga' gsol/dgung lo brgyad la phebs pa lcags khyi (1670)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa chen pos dge tshul gyi sdom pa bstsal/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gnyis la sngags chen rdo rje 'dzin pa dkon mchog rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/gong ma khang shis po nya mngags te gdan zhu lan du ma byung rung ma phebs ma thub/rang byung bcu gnyis pa me glang (1696)lor rgyal dbang drug pa tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho mchod la dag bsnyen dang/rab byung/dge tshul bcas kyi sdom pa 'bogs par mdzad/dgung lo nga gcig pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu sbrul (1713)lor gong mas paN chen er ti ni (paN zhes pa legs sbyar gyi skad paN+Di ta'i bsdus ming/bod skad du mkhas pa'i don dang/ (195) er ti ni zhes pa sog skad bod skad du rin po che zhes pa'i don )zhes pa'i mtshan 'phar dang 'ja' sa tham ga phul de nas bzung sku phreng rim byon la tha snyad de ltar grags me bya (1717)lor sog po jun gar tshe dbang rab brtan gyis dmag khrid de shin cang nas bod du 'dzul nus paN chen rin pa che lha sar bar 'dum byed du phebs kyang don 'bras ma byung bas bkras lhun du phyir phebs lcags byi (1720)lor rgyal dbang sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho mchog la dge tshul gyi sdom pa 'bogs par mdzad rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags khyi (1670)lo nas rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me sbrul (1737)lor bal bkras lhun gdan sa lo drug cu re brgyad bskyangs lam rim myur lam dmar khrid dang rang rnam sogs bka' rtsom pod bzhi bzhugs dgung lo don lnga la phebs pa me sbrul (1737)lor bla brang yid dga' chos 'dzin du dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim sku gdung ril po bzhugs pa'i mchod sdong chen po bkra shis lhun por rab byung bcu drug pa'i me rta lo bar bzhugs}
paN chen sku phreng drug pa dpal ldan ye shes|{rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa rta (1738)lo'i bod zla bcu gcig pa'i tshes bcu nyin gtsang shangs rnam gling rdzong khongs gram bkra shis rtse zhes pa'i yul du yab thang dang yum la dwags rgyal po'i sras mo nyi zla dbang mo gnyis kyi sras su sku 'khrungs/dgung lo gsum par slob dpon bsten nas ljags klog slob sbyong mdzad/rgyal dbang bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho mchog nas paN chen sku phreng lnga pa'i sprul skur ngo 'dzin gnang/dgung lo bzhi la phebs skabs bkras lhun dgon du gser khrir mnga' gsal/dgung lo bdun par dbus su phebs nas rgyal dbang bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i drung nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan blo bzang dpal ldan ye shes zhes gsol/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu sprel (1752)lor wang da las ba dur gyi gdan zhu byas pa bzhin dbus su phabs nas rgyal dbang drung nas (dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i sku gsung thugs yongs su rdzogs pa'i dkyil 'khor rdul tshon la brten pa rgyas pa mtha' dag) (rgyud kyi rgyal po chen po'i 'grel chen dri med pa'i 'od kyi dgongs pa/) (mkhas grub rje'i rgyud kyi 'grel chen )sogs gsan bzhes kyis dbang dang/rjes gnang/khrid lung sogs mtha' yas pa thob/dgung lo nyi shu pa me glang (1757)lor yongs 'dzin blo bzang chos 'phel las bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/lo der rgyal dbang sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho mchog zhi bar gshegs pas de 'phral dgongs rdzogs mchod 'bul rgya cher mdzad/rgyal tshab de mo sprul sku dang bka' blon sogs kyis skul ba bzhin rgyal dbang bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i gser gdung rin po che'i dkar chag brtsams par mdzad/rgyal tshab de mo sprul sku dang bka' blon sogs kyis skul ba bzhin rgyal dbang bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i gser gdung rin po che'i dkar chag brtsams par mdzad/lha sar phebs nas rtse pho brang dug ser gdung chen mo bkra shis 'od bar gsar bzhengs la rab gnas legs par bskyangs/lcags 'brug (1760)lor rgyal ba'i yang srid btsal 'tshol ngo 'dzin gyi thugs 'gan bzhes/lcags sbrul (1761)lor rgyal ba'i chung srid rin po che'i dbu sgra gtsug phud bzhes te blo bzang bstan pa'i dbang phyug 'jam dpal rgya mtsho zhes pa'i mtshan gsol/me khyi (1776)lor rgyal dbang 'jam dpal rgya mtsho mchog la bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa 'bul gnang mdzad/me bya (1777)lor dbus su phebs nas pho brang chen po po ta las rgyal dbang 'jam dpal rgya mtsho mchog dang zhal 'dzoms/rgyal dbang la bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa dang/dbang lung rjes gnang sogs zab cho sa mtha' yas pa phul/dgung lo zhe gcig thog mdo smad khul du phebs nas sku bum dang/hor (196) yul dgon sde khag la skye bo khri phrag du mar mdo sngags kyi chos kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor dgung lo zhe gnyis pa sa phag (1779)lo'i zla ga par rje nyid sku 'khor dang bcas pa gong mchan lung gis gdan drangs pa ltar rgya nag tu phebs paN chen rin po ches gong mar chos dang rjes gnang mang po bstsal (bcom ldan 'das ma gdugs dkar mo'i sgrub thabs dngos grub bdud rtsi'i bum bzang )zhes pa bdag bdun dang bcas pa gsar rtsom mdzad gong mas g.yang Ti'i tham ga dang 'ja' sa phul gsung chos (sham+b+ha la'i smon lam )dang (sham+b+ha la'i lam yig/) (dpal ldan ye shes dpal bzang po'i rnam thar nyi ma'i 'od zer/) (ma gcig 'dod khams kyi dbang mo la brten pa'i mo sho 'debs tshul/) ('dod gsol smon lam/) (yul lha gzhi bdag rnams la mchod gtor 'bul tshul gyi rim pa )sogs pod 'bring dgu tsam mdzad lcags byi (1780)lor pe cin hong si zhes pa'i dgon par sku gshegs sku gdung gtsang bkra shis lhun po'i dgon pa gdan drangs te gser sdong gser bzhengs kyis bzhugs su gsol}
paN chen sku phreng bdun pa bstan pa'i nyi ma|{gtsang nyang smad pa snam skyid gshongs su yab dpal ldan don grub dang yum 'chi med rgyal mo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu stag (1782)lo'i bod zla bzhi pa'i tshes brgyad nyin sku bltams/lo der rgyal dbang sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho mchog nas paN chen sku phreng bdun pas ngos 'dzin mdzad/lo mjug tu yang srid rin po che pa snam thar pa dgon du gdan drangs/shing sbrul (1785)lor rgyal dbang mchog nas dbu skyes gtsug phun bzhes te blo bzang dpal ldan bstan pa'i nyi ma phyogs las rnam rgyal dpal bzang po zhes pa'i mtshan gsol/dgung lo bdun pa sa sprel (1788)lor bkra shis lhun por paN chen sku gong ma'i khri mthon por phebs/dgung lo brgyad pa sa bya lor rgyal dbang 'jam dpal rgya mtsho mchog las dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo bcu pa lcags phag (1791)lor gor Sha pas bod du dmag btegs pas dpa' bo am ban nas paN chen rin po che dbus su phebs re zhus pa ltar lha sar phebs te rgyal dbang yas sras gser zhal lhan du 'dzoms/dgung lo nyi shu pa lcags bya (1801)lor rgyal dbang 'jam dpal rgyal mtsho ngos 'dzin gnang/de nas ma 'gyangs par rgyal dbang dgu par bar byung sdom pa phul te mtshan blo bzang bstan pa'i 'byung gnas ngag dbang lung rtogs rgya mtsho zhes gsol/chu bya (1813)lor paN chen rin po ches mkhan po mdzad de rgyal dbang mchog la dge tshul gyi sdom pa phul/chu rta (1813)lor paN chen rin po ches mkhan po mdzad te rgyal dbang mchog la dge tshul gyi sdom pa phul/chu rta (1822)lorargyal dbang tshul khrims rgyal mtsho mchog gi dbu skyes gtsug phud bzhes nas yongs rdzogs dge bsnyen gyi bslab sdom phul te mtshan ngag dbang blo bzang 'jam dpal tshul khrims rgya mtsho zhes gsol/dgung lo nga gsum la rgyal dbang mchog sprul rin po cher bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa gnang/lcags glang (1791)lor rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gcig pa ngos 'dzin mdzad/de das rgyal dbang yang srid rin po che'i dbu skyes gtsug phud bzhes nas mtshan ngag dbang bskal bzang bstan pa'i sgron med mkhas grub rgyal mtsho dpal bzang po zhes gsol/dgung lo re gsum la phebs pa rab byung bcu bzhi ba'i shing 'brug (1844)lor tshe smon gling 'jam dpal tshul (197) khrims srid skyong gnang dbyung gnam tshab zla brgyad pa'i tshes drug nas phyi lo'i zla bzhi pa'i tshes nyer drug bar lugs gnyis kyi srid skyong thugs 'gan yongs su bzhes me rta (1846)lor rgyal dbang mkhas grub rgyal mtsho mchog la so thar rab byung gi bslab sdom phul ljags rtsom (sham b+ha la'i smon lam gyi 'grel pa/) (yongs 'dzin blo bzang byams pa'i rtogs brjod/) (rje btsun blo bzang dpal ldan ye shes kyi dpal bzang po'i zab dang rgya che ba'i chos kyi gsan yig bai DUr+ya'i phreng ba/) (gsung rab kun gyi snying po lam gyi gtso bo rnam gsum gyi khrid yig gzhan phan snying po/) (dpal gsang ba 'dus pa'i dbang don dngos grub bang mdzod/) (rnam rgyal ma'i sgrub dkyil 'chi med bdud rtsi/) (tshad ma'i lam khrid rig pa'i sgo brgya 'byed pa'i lde mig (bskal bzang sangs rgyas stong gi mchod chog mchog thun mong dngos grub kyi 'dab brgya mngon par grol ba'i nyin byed dbang po/) (dri lan gyi rim pa )sogs gcig tu bsgrigs pa sogs phyag rtsom po ti dug tsam mdzad dgung lo bdun cu don gnyis la phebs pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu glang (1853)lo'i bod zla dang po'i tshes brgyad nyin dgongs pa chos dbyings su gshegs sku gdung ril po'i mchod sdong bkra shis lhun por rab byung bcu drug pa'i me rta lor bar bzhugs}
paN chen sku phreng brgyad pa bstan pa'i dbang phyug|{gtsang thob rgyal bral tshang zhes par yab bon rigs bstan 'dzin dbang rgyal dang yum bkra shis lha mo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing yos (1855)lo'i zla brgyad pa'i tshes brgyad nyid sku 'khrungs/dgung lo gsum thog paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma'i mchog sprul yang srid du ngos 'dzin zhus te bkra shis lhun po'i dgon par gdan 'dres zhus/dgung lo drug la dgon pa'i gser khrir phebs nas srid skyong rwa sgreng a chi ho thog thus ngag dbang ye shes tshul grims rgyal mtshan mchog gi drung du rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo bdun nas nyi shu rtsa gcig bar gzhung chen bka' pod lngar thugs gnyer mdzad/sa skya'i 'dul 'dzin chen po me trai d+harma wa rta dpal bzang po'i drung nas paN chen shAkya shri'i sdom rgyun gyi bsnyen rdzogs sdom pa bzhes/smin gling khri chen gyi drung nas gsang sngags lnga 'gyur gyi chos bka' kha shas gnas/shing phag (1875)lor rgyal dbang sku phreng gnyis pa shing phag (1875)lor rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pa gshegs 'phral paN chen rin po che mchog gis sprul sku myur byon gsol 'debs bka' rtsom mdzad/dgung lo nyer gsum la phebs skabs phur lcogs yongs 'dzin byams pa rgya mtsho'i drung nas bla chen brgyud kyi dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyer bzhir phebs skabs dbus su phabs nas rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i dbu skra gtsug phud bzhes te/mtshan ngag dbang blo bzang thub bstan rgya mtsho zhes gsol/rje 'di nyid kyis thob gling zhal snga rnam rgyal bzod pa dang/rdo rje 'chang blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan/phur lcog yongs 'dzin blo bzang tshul khrims sogs mang du gsan zhing/phyag rtsom yang (snyam dngags me long ma'i le'u gsum gyi dper brjod/) (rab brjid rdo rje'i gser gyi gnya' shing zhes 'i dpal bkra shis lhun po'i bca' yig chen mo/) (rje btsun blo bzang dpal ldan chos kyi grags pa bstan pa'i dbang phyug dpal bzang po'i rnam thar dad ldan pad tshal bzhed pa/) (myur mdzad ye shes mgon po phyag drug dang mgon dkar bcas kyi bskang gso chog bsgrigs/) (thub pa'i dbang po'i 'khrungs rabs bzhi'i gsung bshad sngon 'gro )sogs pod 'bring gsum tsam bzhugs/rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu rta (1882)lor bkra shis lhun po'i dge 'dun gyi 'dul khrims dang/bla brang zhabs 'bring las byed pa'i byed sgo bcas la zhib 'jug gnang/mthar lo de'i bod zla drug pa'i tshes bcu (198) drug nyin sku mya ngan las 'das sku dgung hril po mchod sdong chen po bkra shis lhun por rab byung bcu drug pa'i me rta lo bar bzhugs}
paN chen sku phreng dgu pa blo bzang thub bstan chos kyi nyi ma|{dwags po ka shar yul du yab rta mgrin dang yum dam chos mtsho mo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu lnga pa'i chu lug (1883)lo'i bod zla dang po'i tshes bcu gnyis nyin sku bltams/lha ldan jo bo shAkya mu ne'i spyan sngar gser bum dkrugs te pan chen sku phreng brgyad pa'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin zhus/sa byi (1888)lorargyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pa chen po thub bstan rgya mtsho mchog gis dbu skra gtsug phud bzhes pa dang 'brel rje btsun blo bzang thub bstan chos kyi nyi ma dge legs rnam rgyal zhes pa'i mtshan gsol/de nas yongs 'dzin dpon brang bstan 'dzin dbang rgyal drung nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bzhes mdzad/chu 'brug (1892)lor bkras lhun gdan sa'i khri thog tu phebs/chu stag (1902)lor lha ldan gtsug lag khang du rgyal ba'i dbang po ngag dbang blo bzang thub bstan brgya mtsho'i zhal snga nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing 'brug (1904)lor dbyin ji'i dmag lha sar 'byor ba'i phyi lo dbyin chis gdan zhus ltar rgya gar la phebs/me rta (1906)lor gtsang tu phyir log mdzad/shing stag (1914)lor gdan sa chen po bkra shis lhun por gser zangs las grub pa'i rgyal ba byams pa'i sku brnyan bod ljongs na sngar ma grags pa'i sku tshad thog rtseg bdun pa'am khru brgyad cu gya lnga'i bdag nyin can 'gran zla bral ba zhig gsar bzhengs mdzad/de ni 'dzam gling na gser zangs kyi sku brnyan che shos yin par grags/sa lug (1919)lor lha sar phebs nas rgyal dbang chen po mchog dpal rdo rje 'jigs byed kyi ljags bsnyen grub pa'i legs 'bul 'jal phyag gi chos mthun mdzad sgo'i zhor du bkras lhun bla brang gi chos gzhis zhing 'brog dmag phogs dang/lam thog 'khri sgrub skor bka' 'khrol mchod pa rnams skyabs zhu'i bka' mos gnang bsogs bdun phrag kha shas sku bshags rjes gtsang du phyir phebs/de rjes zla gzhung bar gyi 'gal zla'i dbang gis chu phag (1923)lo'i zla bcu gcig pa'i tshes bco lnga'i mtshan mo kun gzigs paN chen rin po che ston 'khor go hrag dang bcas byang thang brgyad bros byol tu phebs te lam bar mtsho sngon dang/lan kru'u/shis an/tha'i yon tan bcas brgyud pe cin du shing glang (1925)lo'i zla gnyis pa'i tshes gnyis nyin phebs 'byor byung te krung nan ha'i yi ying tha'i ru bzhugs/gong min tang gzhung nas sne len phebs bsu rgya che zhus/de snga'i mdzad srol bzhes gser sam dang gser tham phul/de nas nang sog dang/nan cin/hang kro'u/mtsho sngon sogs su phebs te bka' chos gnang/rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu bya (1933)lor khams skye dgu mdor phebs 'byor skabs bod sa gnas srid gzhung gis paN chen bod du phebs na rgya'i dmag mnyam du khrid mi chog pa dang/yar lam sar phebs mi chog pa/slad bod gzhung gi bka' la srung brtse dang len dgos pa sogs don tshan gsum bton pa'i khar/bla brang gi zhabs 'bring pa 'ga' shas kyi bya spyod kyi rkyen ngan sna tshogs 'dzoms par brten nas bod du chibs bsgyur ma thub par me glang (1937)lor sku dgu mdor sku gshegs/sku gdung rin po che gdan sa chen po bkra shis lhun por drangs te rab byung bcu drug pa'i me rta lo bar bzhugs/(lam rim tshigs bcad ma )dang/gsung rtsom (lam sgron 'grel pa/) (sa shing gi bcos )sogs po ti bzhi tsam bzhugs}
paN chen sku phreng bcu pa chos kyi rgyal mtshan|{paN chen er te ni sku phreng bcu pa chos kyi rgyal mtshan mchog gi (199) thog ma'i mtshan la mgon po tshe brtan zhu zhing rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa stag (1938)lo'i zla ba dang po'i tshes gsum nyin mtsho sngon zhing chen gyi zhun hwa rdzong khongs bis mdo shang gi ngo mtshar zhes pa'i grong tshor sa skya 'khon gyi rigs las mched pa'i bis mdo dpon tshang du yab bis mdo stong dpon gur mgon tshe brtan dang yum bsod nams sgrol ma gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs lcags sbrul (1941)lor paN chen bzhugs sgar nang sgang nas paN chen sku phreng dgu pa'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin zhus pa dang sa glang (1949)lo'i zla ba drug pa'i tshes gsum nyin skabs de'i ming go srid gzhung nas chog mtshan phul ba bzhin gser bum dkrug 'don mi dgos par paN chen sku phreng bcu pa'i mtshan bzhes pa dang skyabs rje rdo rje 'chang bla kho 'jigs med 'phrin las rgya mtsho rin po che mchog nas rje btsun blo bzang 'phrin las lhun grub chos kyi rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po zhes pa'i mtshan gsol lo de'i zla ba brgyad pa'i tshes bcu nyin sku 'bum byas pa gling dgon nas khri gsol gzab rgyas zhus sku na phra ba'i skabs nas dngul cha rin po che dang bka' chen ang nyi ma sogs yongs 'dzin du bsten nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngas mtshon dam pa'i chos kyi gzhung lugs khag la gsan sbyangs dang nyams bzhes mthar phyin mdzad pa ma zad dgon sde nyams gso dang sku gsung thugs rten gsar bzhengs chos lugs kyi slob grwa 'dzugs gnyer dgon sde khag la bshad grwa 'dzugs rgyu sogs la thugs 'khur rgyun mar mdzad pas grub 'bras gzengs su thon pa thob pa dang de 'brel rgya che'i dad ldan ser skya mang tshogs la dus 'khor dbang chen dang 'jigs byed dbang chen byang chub lam rim gyi bka' khrid sogs chos 'khor rgya cher bskor te sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa mi nyams gong 'phel dang bstan pa yang dar la mdzad rjes 'gran zla bral ba 'jog gnang mdzad pa dang lhag par du bod ljongs kyis gtsos bod rigs sa khul gyi dpal 'byor dang rig gnas slob gso sogs gong 'phel yong ched 'bad pa lhod med gnang yod rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa glang (1994)lo'i zla ba bcu pa'i tshes gcig nyin krung hwa mi dmangs spyi mthun rgyal khab dbu brnyes pa'i mdzad sgo'i nyin der paN chen rin po ches mtsho sngon gyi shang sde nas kru'u zhi ma'o tse tung dang spyi khyab dmag spyi kru'u te rnam gnyis la glog 'phrin btang gnang ste krung go gsar pa dbu brnyes par brtsi bkur zhus gnang lcags yol (1951)lo'i zla ba bzhi par paN chen rin pa che sku ngo mas paN chen bzhugs sgra nang sgang gi dpon rigs gtso bo khrid gnang ste bod zhi bas bcings bkrol 'byung thabs skor gyi gros mthun 'jog rgyur skul 'ded dang rgyab skyor gnang ba ma zad gros mthun la ming rtags bkod rjes paN chen rin po che dang nang sgang gis gsal bsgrags spel nas brtsi bkur zhus chu 'brug (1952)lo'i zla ba bzhi pa'i tshe nyi shu brgyad nyin paN chen rin po che dang sku 'khor rnams lha ldan du phebs 'byor zin pa dang pho brang po ta lar rgyal ba yab sras rnam gnyis lhan 'dzoms byung bas de ni bod mi rigs nang khul du mthun sgril byung ba'i mtshon rtags bzang po zhig yin lo de ga'i spyi zla drug pa'i tshes nyi shu gsum nyin gdan sa bkra shis lhun por zhabs sor 'khod de nas bzung chos srid gnyis ka'i mdzad pa mang po spel gnang mdzad cing shing rta (1945)lo'i zla dgu par skabs dang po'i rgyal yongs mi dmangs 'thus tshogs kyi gros tshogs thengs dang por zhugs gnang ba dang rgyal yongs mi dmangs 'thus tshogs rgyun las u yon lha khang gi kru'u zhi gzhon par 'dams thon byung me sprel (1956)lo'i zla ba bzhir par bod rang (200) skyong ljongs grwa sgrig u yon lhan khang dbu brnyes skabs paN chen rin po che nas rang skyong ljongs gra sgrig u yon lhan khang gi kru'u rin u yon gzhon pa dang dang po gnang lo de ga'i zla ba bcu gcig par rgya gar srid gzhung gi gdan zhus ltar rgyal ba yab sras rnam gnyis rgya gar du chibs bsgyur gnang ste sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa sku mya ngan las 'das nas lo ngo nyis stong lnga brgya 'khor ba'i dran gso'i mdzad chen nang zhugs rgya gar du bzhugs ring gang nyid la wa rwa na si nang bstan slob gling nas mtshan 'dzin nang bstan paN+Di ta'i mtshan gnas phul ba bzhes sa khyi (1958)lor gdan sa bkra shis lhun po'i bka' chen gyi mtshan gnas bzhes sa phag (1959)lo'i zla ba gsum pa'i tshes nyi shu brgyud nyid bod rang skyong ljongs gra sgrig u yon lhan khang gi kru'u rin u yon lam tshab tu bsko gzhag dang lo de ga'i sa gnyis pa'i rgyal yongs mi dmangs 'thus mi tshogs chen gyi gros tshogs thengs dang po'i thog rgyal yongs mi dmangs 'thus tshogs rgyun las u yon khang gi u yon krang gzhon par 'dams thob byung lcags glang (1961)lo'i zla ba dgu par pe cin du phebs nas rgyal ston dus chen gyi mdzad sgor zhugs rjes mes rgyal nang khul du lo phyed tsam bzhugs rim mtsho sngon sogs sa khul du las don la gzigs zhib gnang bar phebs pa dang mtsho sngon sogs sa khul du byung ba'i gnas tshul rnams bod kyi gnas tshul dang zur 'grel gnang ste zla shas ring nang mol dang dgongs bzhes gnang brgyud chu stag (1962)lo'i zla ba lnga par pe cin tu rgyal srid spyi khyab khang la (bod kyi spyi dang bye brag gi gnas tshul dang de bzhin bod kyis gtsos pa'i bod rigs sa khul gyi bde sdug dang slad phyin gyi re sgug dang re 'dun gyi snyan zhu/) (de rjes su (yig 'bru bdun khri'i gong 'bul yi ge)zhes pa de yin )zhes mgo brjod du 'khod pa'i phyag bris phul ba dang snyan zhu de'i nang go rim ldan pa dang sba gsang med pi thog nas bod dang de bzhin bod rigs sa khul gzhan dag gi las don skor la skyon brjod dang grol 'go bton gnang mdzad 'on kyang de rjes g.yon gyi nor 'khrul dang rig gnas gsar brje'i ring drang bzhag ma yin pa'i lta stangs bzung ste lo ngo dgu'i ring btson du bzhugs dgos byung tang gi skabs bcu pa'i krung u tsha 'dzoms gros tshogs thengs gsum pa'i 'tshogs rjes nor 'dzol dag sel dang dbu gnas slar gso byung ba ma zad teng zha'o phing mchog nas khyed ni rgyal gces pa che shos yin zhes gdeng 'jog shin tu chen po mdzad sa rta (1978)lo nas bzung paN chen rin po che'i rgyal khab dbu khrid gyi go gnas slar gso byung ba dang de rjes lo bcu'i nang rgyal yongs sa gnas khag dang bod rigs sa khul du las don gzigs gnang bar phebs te spro sems chen pos bod khul gyi las don thad 'dzin pa'i tang gi byed phyogs srid jus dril bsgrags gnang ba zhing bod khul gyi 'dzugs skrun bya gzhag khag dang mi dmangs kyi thod skyed dang 'tsho bar thugs 'khur gnang zhing tang gi mi rigs srid jus dang chos lugs srid jus don 'khyol byed pa dang bod rigs sa khul khag yar rgyal da nga dar rgyas yong bar sku ma yong ba'i thad legs skyes shugs che phul gnang ba ma zad sku tshab tshogs par na khrid mdzad de po le we ya dang a'o ta li ya bal yul bcas su 'tshams 'dri gnang bar phebs pa dang rgyal nang du phyi rgyal gyi sku mgron dang mjal 'phrad thengs nang gnang ste phyi rgyal gyi grogs po tshor dngos thog bden 'tshor ngang rang rgyal gyi srid jus khag dang las don khag ngo sprod gnang ba dang phyogs mtshungs su rang rgyal nas bsgyur bcos sgo dbye dang krung go'i khyad chos ldan pa'i spyi tshogs ring lugs 'dzugs skrun byed par sems shugs kyis khengs tshul gsungs par phyi rgyal gyi grogs po tsho'i tshad mtho'i bstod bsngags dang yid ches thob yod paN chen rin po ches bod mi rigs kyi (201) las don gong 'phel dang yar rgyas 'gro rgyus thugs 'khur che bzhes dang bod rigs kyi phul du byung ba'i srol rgyun rig gnas rgyun 'dzin dang gong 'phel 'gro rgyur thugs 'khur gnang che bzhes gnang yod cing lo bcu lhag gi mdzad 'phrin gtso gras ni 1 mi rigs sa khongs rang skyong gi bca' khrims lag bstar byed rgyur thugs 'khur che bzhes gnang nas dus rgyun du rtsa khrims dang bca' khrims la brten nas mi rigs sa khongs rang skyong gi dbang cha gang legs dang yang dag pa'i sgo nas spyod dgos pa'i nan gsung gnang gi yod la mi rigs mthun sgril ha cang mthong chen gnang nas bod rigs dang rgya rigs dbar dang bod rigs dang mi rigs gzhan dag dmar bod rigs nang khul bcas kyi mthun sgril la shugs snon rgyag dgon pa'i nan gsung yang gnang yod 2 bod dang bod khul gzhan dag gi dpal 'byor 'dzugs skrun la rogs skyor byed chen paN chen rin po che mchog dang nga phod ngag dbang 'jigs med mchog rnam gnyis nas gros 'kho bton gnang ba ltar rab byung bcu bdun pa'i me yos (1987)lo'i zla ba bzhi pa'i tshes bco lnga nyid bod dar rgyas rogs skyor thebs rtsa lhan tshogs btsugs gnang mdzad 3 bod kyi skad yig slob sbyong dang bed spyod gong 'phel gtong rgyur lhag par du mthong chen gnang zhing me yos (1978)lo'i zla ba bdun par u yon krang sku gzhon nga phod ngag dbang 'jigs med mchog dang lhan du gros 'ag 'don gnang mdzad nas bod rang skyong ljongs mi dmangs 'thus mi tshogs chen gyi gros tshogs thog (bod kyi skad cig slob sbyong bed spyod gong 'phel bcas gtong rgyu'i skor gyi gtan 'bebs 'ga' zhig )ces par gros 'a cham byung ba bod rgyud nang bstan chos lugs kyi khyad du 'phags pa'i gtso 'dzin zhig gi ngos nas phyogs gcig nas btang dang srid gzhung la gzhogs 'degs kyis chos dad rang mos gyi srid jus lag len mthar phyin gnang te dgon pa dang gra btsun gyi khrims mthun khe dbang la srung skyong gnang ba dang phyogs gzhan zhig nas spyi tshogs 'phel rgyas 'gro ba dang bstun gnang ste bod rgyud nang bstan chos lugs de rim bzhin rang rgyal spyi tshogs ring lugs kyi lam lugs dang 'tshams pa yod ched phan yod kyi phyag las mang po gsang yod pa ste bod rgyud nang bstan chos lugs mi nyams gong 'phel dang tan pa yang dar yong phyir sku ngo mas pe cin du krung go'i bod rgyud nang bstan slob gling btsugs gnang ba dang 'brel dbu 'dzin yang gnang nas chab srid thad mes rgyal la dga' zhen byed pa dang chos lugs thad nang bstan chos lugs kyi sku yod che tsam yod mkhan bla sprul gso skyong mdzad pa sogs 'grel pa )dang (skye rdor lhan skyes kyi cho ga gsum bskyed )ces pa sogs yod mthar sa sbrul (1989)lo'i spyi zla dang po'i tshes dgu nyin gtsang ljongs kyi gdan sa chen po bkra shis lhun por paN chen sku phreng lnga pa nas dug pa'i bar gyi mnyam bzhugs sku gdung mchod khang shar bkra shis rnam rgyal bskyar bzhengs mdzad chen gtso skyong gnang bar phebs mdzad brel che drags pa'i rkyen gyis glo bur du sku snying la snyun gzhi phug te phyogs gang thad nas myur skyob zhus kyang phan 'bras ma thon par lo de'i spyi zla dang po'i tshes 28nyin gzhis rtse grong khyer gyi bde chen skal bzang pho brang gi gzim chung bshad sgrub 'phel rgyas gling du dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs sku gshegs skabs gdung lo lnga bcu nga gcig la phebs yod sku 'tsho bzhugs ring skabs dang po'i rgyal yongs mi dmangs 'thus mi'i tshogs chen rgyun las u yon lhan khang gi u yon dang skabs gnyis pa dang lnga pa drug pa bdun pa bcas kyi rgyal yongs mi dmangs 'thus mi'i tshogs chen gyi rgyun las u yon lhan khang gi u yon krang gzhon pa skabs gnyis pa dang lnga pa'i rgyal yongs srid gros kyi kru'u zhi (202) gzhon pa skabs gsum pa dang bzhi pa'i rgyal yongs srid gros kyi rgyun las u yon krung go nang bstan mthun tshogs kyi mtshan 'dzin tshogs gtso bod rang skyong ljongs gra sgrig u yon lhan khang gi kru'u ren u yon gzhon pa dang dngos po dang kru'u ren u yon las tshab bcas kyi thugs 'gan bzhes myong yod cing sku gshegs rjes krung dbyang dang 'brel yod sa gnas kyi mya ngan zhu tshig nang khong nyid ni rlabs chen gyi rgyal gces ring lugs pa dang skad grags yod pa'i rgyal don gnang sgo mkhas can krung go'i gung khran tang gi lhag bsam zol med kyi grogs po/_/grung go'i bod rgyud nang bstan chos lugs kyi khyad du 'phags pa'i gtso 'dzin zhig bcas yin zhes gdeng 'jog shin tu chen po zhus yod}
paN chen bde legs nyi ma|{rje 'di ni byang du kre ba'i rigs su spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu drug pa'i dkyil tsam du 'khrungs/sku gzhon dus bkra shis lhun po'i thob bsam gling du chos zhugs mdzad nas gzhung chen bka' pod lnga la gsan bsam mdzad/de rjes dbus su phebs nas phar phyin dang/tshad ma'i skor sogs se ra rje btsun pa'i drung du gsan pas mkhas par gyur/byang pa rab 'byams pa zhes thugs rgyud 'byongs pa'i tshad du byed/de nas ngam ring spang 'bul grwa tshang gi bshad nyan mdzad/se ra byes kyi bla mar phebs nas 'dul ba'i spyi don dang/mdzod kyi spyi don/phar phyin spyi don sogs legs bshad mang du brtsams/snyan pa'i grags phyogs mthar/rgyal dbang bsod nams rgya mtshos se ra'i khri par phebs dgos gsungs spyan mi gsal bar dgongs zhu mdzad/'khrungs 'das mdzad rnam zhib pa ma rnyed}
paN chen nang sgang|{de yang nang sgang u yon lhan khang ni rgyal srid spyi khyab khang nas chog mchan gnang ba rgyud rab byung bcu drug pa'i shing rta (1954)lor sngar yod sa smad bzhugs sgar paN chen nang ma sgang gi rmang gzhi'i thog bskyar sgrig byas nas btsugs pa zhig yin pa dang/de nas paN chen sku phreng bcu pa rin po che'i dbu khrid 'og de snga'i phyag mdzod skyabs dbyings dza sag bla ma'i 'gan dbang spyod pa'i bla brang rgyal mtshan mthon pa'i srid 'dzin skyi khyab mtho shos yin cing/skabs der rim pa gnyis pa'i dza sag bkras mthong 'jigs med grags pa (ci'i 'jigs med kyang zer )dang lha smon ye shes tshul khrims gnyis nas kru'u ren rgan pa gnang ba'i khyon kru'u ren rgan gzhon dang yun sum bsdoms mi grangs bcu bdun yod/tshad pa de'i 'gan dbang ni nang sgang khongs kyi ser skya zhabs 'bring gsar bsko dang/gnas spar rab gnas dbyung/las khungs khag dang rdzong gzhis khag gi mi 'gro bsko 'then snyan zhu phul te phyag rtags zhu rgyu/rtse skor las khungs phud de min las khungs sam rdzong gzhis khag la spyi 'doms 'gro khrid bya rgyu/gsham 'og gi las don snyan seng 'byor rigs thag gcod bya rgyu sogs dang/phyi phyogs su rgyal srid spyi khyab khang dang krung gung bod las don un yon lhan khang la skabs bstan snyan seng dgongs bskor zhu 'os rigs zhu rgyu dang/gzhis rtse yan lag las don u lhan dang 'brel yod las don gang ci gros bsdus mnyam las bya rgyu/bod sa gnas srid gzhung da 'brel gtugs grol mo bya rgyu sogs yin/nang sgang gi rgyud gtan las don che phra tshang ma'i gtso skyong thag gcod kru'u ren dza nag gnyis rang nas gnang ba ma gtogs kru'u ren gzhon pa dang u yon rnams rgyun phabs dgos kyi med/mthar rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags glang (1961)lo'i spyi zla drug pa'i tshes bcu dgu nyin lha sar bod rang skyong ljongs gra sgrig u yon lhan khang gi rgyun ud rgya che'i gros tshogs thengs bzhi bcu zhe gcig 'i thog de snga'i paN chen nang sgang u yon lhan khang gi las tham rtsis 'bul zhus te de'i lo rgyus las 'gan mjug bsgril ba'i khyab (203) bsgrags byas pa dang nang sgang gi las tham a ma ni li mar brkos pa'i (bla brang rgyal mtshan mthon po'i srid 'dzin nang sgang u yon lhan khang gi thag ka )zhes bod rgya yi ge gnyis ldan gru bzhi chen po gcig dang rgyun spyod tham ga tsan+dan dmar por brkos pa'i (paN chen nang sgang u yon lhan khang )zhes gru bzhi chung ba gcig yod}
paN chen bzang po bkra shis|{la stod byang du bar byung bdun pa'i lcags stag (1410)lor sku bltams/sku gzhon dus rje shes rab seng ge dang/rgyal dbang dge 'dun rub pa/rje blo gros chos skyong sogs la bsten nas mdo rgyud rig gnas zab mo lam gas par sbyangs/dgung lo zhe gsum pa la gnyan yod byar shongs dgon gyi khrir phebs/lo bdun ring 'chad nyan mdzad/dgung la ze dgu pa la ngam ring dgon gyi dbu mdzad dang/dpal ya ga chos sdings kyi bshad grwa mdzad/dgung lo re lnga pa la phebs pa rang byung brgyad pa'i shing rta (1474)lor chos sde chen po bkra shis lhun po'i khri thog gnyis par phebs nas bstan pa'i mdzad 'phrin spel/de'i sbas gangs can chos 'phel dgon phyag btab/spyir na rje 'di nyid kyis rje shes rab seng ge dang/thams cad mkhyen pa dge 'dun grub/'dul 'dzin blo gros sbas pa/chos rje blo gros chos skyong/dwags po kun bkras pa/bla ma tsan+dan pa/chos rje tshul rgyal ba/'phags pa yod pa la sogs mkhas grub kyi bla ma mang por bsten nas mdo sngags kyi dam chos mang du gsan/sa dge rnying gsum gyi gsang sngags la mkhyen pa che/gsung rtsom yang (sdom pa nyi shu pa'i TIk+ka) (grub mtha'i rnam gzhag) (zab lam nA ro chos drug gi sgo nas khrid pa'i rim pa yid ches gsum ldan/) (gur mgon 'khor bcas kyi mngon rtogs )sogs sgrub thabs dang/gdams pa'i skor la rab tu byed pa brgya lhag tsam gyi bstan bcos kyang mdzad/thams cad mkhyen pa dge 'dun grub gyi sku gdung la dngul gyi gdung ring po che'i rgyan spras pa zhig bzhengs/mthar dgung lo re dgu la phebs pa rab byung brgyad pa'i sa khyi (1478)lor dgongs pa chos kyi dbyings su thim}
paN chen ye shes rtse mo|{chos sde chen po bkra shis lhun po'i khri thog bzhi pa 'di nyid rang byung bdun pa'i chu glang (1433)lor srad kyi sa'i char sku 'khrungs/_/mkhar chen brag nas rab tu byung/sku gzhon nu'i dus nas sngags kyi phyag len la mkhas/de nas bkra shis lhun por phebs te rje dge 'dun grub dang/dre med bshes gnyen gyi zhabs la gtugs nas zab chos mang du gsan/sa skya dang snar thang sogs su po ti mang po grwa skor mdzad/paN chen bzang po bkra shis las gsang sngags kyi dbang lung sogs rgya cher gsan/dbus su phebs te rgyud sde 'dzin pa sbyin pa dpal ba dang chos rje ba so ba'i drung du gsang sngags kyi gdams pa mang po zhus/slar gtsang du phebs nas rje dgu 'dun grub pa las sgra dang snyan ngag sogs gsan/rab byung brgyad pa'i me lug (1487)lor bkras lhun dgon gyi gdan khrir phebs/zab chos kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor/dgon pa'i shar ngos kyi skyid na'i (deng skabs skyid skyid na ga zer ba de yin )sa cha rnams su mtshe'u dang/lcang ra gsar skrun gnang/gtsug lag khang bdun gyi chab sgron khang pa dang bcas pa gsar rgyag mdzad/gdan sa lo nyi shu rtsa bzhi bskyangs te rab byung dgu pa'i lcags rta (1510)lor khri ru du phebs/(rje dge 'dun grub kyi rnam thar nor bu'i phreng ba )dang/(bka' gdams chos 'byung )sogs brtsams par mdzad/'das lo ma gsal}
paN chen lung rigs rgya mtsho|{chos sde chen po bkra shis lhun po'i khri thog gsum pa 'di nyid rab byung bdun pa'i sa khyi (1418)lau+or la stod byang du sku 'khrungs/rje dge (204) 'dun grub pa dang 'dul 'dzin pa rje btsun bzang po bkra shis la sogs pa'i mkhas grub mang po'i drung las mdo sngags kyi zab chos mang du gsan rab byung brgyad pa'i sa khyi (1478)lor bkras lhun dgon gyi khrir phebs nas lo bcu'i ring gdan na bskyangs bla blang steng du dga' ldan lha khang dang de'i ka sbug rtse gsol thab de'i nye 'gram gyi nang chung gnyis bcas khang mig brgyad dang lcags byi (1480)lor 'du khang steng dug nyer gtad gnas bcu lha khang gsar bzhengs mdzad de nas gdan sa paN chen ye shes rtse mo la gtad de dben par thugs dam la bzhugs 'das lo ma gsal}
paN chen shAkya mchog ldan|{sa skya'i bla ma 'di nyid rab byung bdun pa'i sa sprel (1428)lor gsang phu'i bar tshigs zhes par sku 'khrungs/dgung lo brgya da pa la skyor mo lung du rong ston chen po las rab tu byung/mtshan shAkya mchog ldan dri med legs pa'i blo zhes gsol/dgung lo bcu pa la nA len+d+rar dge tshul bsgrubs/_/dgung lo nyer gcig gi bar long ston chen po'i zhabs la gtugs nas rgyan drug mchog gnyis kyi gzhung sogs zam chos mang du gsan/dgung lo nyer lnga pa la ngor dgon du ngor chen/brag dkar sems dpa' chen po/mus chen gsum gyis mkhan po dang las gsang mdzad de bsnyen par rdzogs/mkhan slob de gsum dang/lcang lung pa gzhon nu blo gros/paN chen nags rig sogs las gsung ngag sbyor drug gi gtsos zab rgyas kyi chos mang du nod/dgung lo bco lnga pa la gsang phu'i gnas sgo grwa tshang gi 'dzin bdag mdzad/de nas dpal ldan sa skyar (gzhung lugs brgya la bshad pa'i dga' ston )dang/) (gau sgra las drangs pa'i gnas bstod dang nga brgyad ma )sogs mdzad/dgung lo zhe gnyis pa sa glang ((1469)lor gser mdog can du 'dus tshogs brgya phrag bdun la 'chad rtsod rtsom gsum gyis bstan pa spel te/dgun chos la mngon par gong 'og /dpyid chos la dbu ma/dbyar chos la 'dul ba gtso bar 'doms par mdzad/de nas chos rgyal rnams gnas mdog can du dri lan gser gyi thur ma mdzad/mdor na mkhas grub 'di gnyid kyis yongs 'dzin bcu phrag bzhi lhag las gsan pa rgya cher mdzad/mdor na mkhas grub 'di nyid kyis yongs 'dzin bcu phrag bzhi ga las gsan pa rgya cher mdzad/blo brtan bzhi pa dang de'i nye gnas blo ldan pa'i drung du ka tsan snyan ngag sogs sbyangs shing/rig gnas lnga la snyan pa'i grags pas khyab/yongs rdzogs paN+Di ta chen por gyur/spyir rig gnas lnga dang/khyad par sgra rig pa dang/nang rig gi snying po/bka' bar mtha' dang/lugs gnyis kyi srol sa byung ba'i rang stong gan stong gi lta ba'i gdan zab mo la 'di kho na bka' drin che/phyis gsar pa/mgon khang/gos sku sogs bzhengs/phyag rtsom la yang/(tshad ma'i dka' 'grel spyi don che chung gnyis/) (rnam rig TIka chen gnyis/) (phar phyin TIka lung snying spyi don gsum/) (rtsa 'jug TIka stong thun chen mo gsum/) ('dul ba'i bka' 'grel las brgya TIka )dang/(bde gnang rnam bshad gser thub chos tshan )sogs rtsom pa'i rnam grangs shin tu mang bar mdzad/gsung las skyes pa'i slob ma shangs chen pa dang/lcang ra ba/rdor rgyal ba/blo bzang sogs mang du byon/de ltar mdzad pa mthar phyin te dgong lo brgyad cu la phebs pa rab byung dug pa'i me yos (1507)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs}
paN chen shAkya shri|{(kha che paN chen )rab byung gnyis pa'i me lug (1127)lo nas rab byung bzhi pa'i shing bya (125)lo bar dgung lo dgu bcu go dgu bzhugs/'khrul yul ni gya gar nub phyogs kha cha'i yul (deng sang gi kasmir )du grong khyer wa su rar yab tshong dpon chen po (205) sa ma dza ya'i sras su 'khrungs dgung lo bcu nas bzung rig pa'i gnas lnga la sbyangs pa mthar phyin dgung lo nyer gsum la rab tu byung de nas rgya gar shar phyogs su phebs te dgung lo sum cu bar sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi mtshan nyid rig pa la slob gnyer gnang de nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes nas gnang sngags kyi chos la slob gnyer gnang ste 'jam gling yongs su grags pa'i paN+Di ta chen por gyur rab byung dang po'i mjug dus rabs bcu gsum pa'i lo 'gor nub phyogs du ru ka'i dmag drangs nas rgya gar lho phyogs dang shar phyogs ma gtogs nub dang byang dbus bcas yongs rdzogs du ru'i ka'i mnga' 'og tu tshud de paN+Di ta dang mkhas pa rab byung mang che ba gya gor shar phyogs 'bar ma dang tha'i go can pu kre sogs sar bres phebs shing kha che paN chen sogs nyung shas shig rgya gar byang phyogs bod kyi mtha' mtshams gro mo'i sa khul dang nye ba'i bai DUr+ya'i tshong 'dus su bros phebs der lo ngo gcig tsam bzhugs mtshams rab byung gsum pa'i shing byi (1204)lor bod kyi khro phu tsA bas byams pa'i dpal gyis grong mo brgyud nas bod du gdan drangs skabs der che khe paN chen dgung lo bdun cu don brgyad la phebs shing khro pho lo tsA ba dgung lo sum cu la slebs med pa'i sku gzhon nu zhig yin stabs khong la chos 'ga' zhig gsungs nas rang nyid gya gar du phyir phebs dgongs pa byung rjes gsung gi slob ma paN+Di ta 'ga' zhig yod pa rnams dang chos kyi gsung gleng gnang ba de paN chen gyis zhor la gsan pas ha cang thugs mnyes te bod la lo tsA ba la skad bsgyur gnang du bcug phyag tu 'bal ba'i dngos po gang yod lo tsA ba la gnang lo bcu'i ring bod du bzhugs te sangs rgyas chos lugs dar spel gnang dgung lo brgyad cu gya brgya da pa rab byung bzhi pa'i shing khyi (1214)lor bod nas kha che'i yul du phyir phebs gnang bod du bzhugs ring mang tshogs dang dad ldan phyug po rnams kyis dngos po 'bul ba rnams sa gnas so so'i dgon pa dang rten bzhengs sogs lag nang ba las rang nyid kyis sne gcig kyang sger 'dzin mi mdzad kha cher yang lo bcu gnyis ring sangs rgyas chos lugs dar spel mdzad de dgung lo go dgu la sku gshegs paN chen 'di'i lo rgyus rgyas pa (deb ther sngon po )le tshan (ba)pa'i mgo nas shog grangs 5nas 6bar dang (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )le tshan (nya)pa'i shog grangs 13nas 20bar gsal}
