pu de gung rgyal|{(spu de gung rgyal zhes pa'ang snang )bod rgyal dgu pa/bar ram stod kyi stengs gnyis kyi ya gyal/'di stod kyi stengs gcig yin par bzhed mkhan yang yod/yab gri gum btsan po dang yum klu sring mer lcam gnyis la sras gsum bltams pa las 'bring po phya khri zhub de yin zhes lo rgyus chos 'byung ming che bar gsal na'ang/lo rgyus kyi yig rnying khag gcig nang sras gnyis byung ba las chung ba sha khyi'am sha khri zhu ba de yin zhing/sha khyis dmag sum stong sum brgya khrid du sku'i sha lan len du gshegs zhes 'khod/yab blon po lo ngam gyis bkrongs rjes sras gsum kong yul du bros phebs pa'am spyugs shing/mthar ru las skyes kyis 'bring po bya khri spo bo'i yul nas nas lha la dpod 'bor bas nam mkha' las khyod kyi bu de kun las rgyar 'gyur zhes sgra byung bas de ltar mtshan du chags/'on kyang rjes su 'bangs kyis sgra nyams nas pu te gung rgyal du grags/btsan po 'di'i sku ring la zhang nga nas gshin po du ma spyan drangs shing/bon gyi de mang du bsgyur na slar yang bon gyi bstan pa rgyas par mdzad pa dang/mdo sde 'byung ba'i ltas su sgrung rnams dar/mngon pa'i sde snod 'byung ba'i ltas lde'u spyod/bon sgrung lde'u gsum gyi tshul lha sa'i gdung rnams la bris nas yod skad/sku mkhar phying ba stag rtse bzhengs/'om thang sman mtsho'am bom thang rmang gnya' khab tu bzhes/de'i dus su 'phrul blon mdzangs mi bdun gyi dang po rus la skyes kyis gser dngul zangs lcags bton pa dang/rmon pa dor bsdebs kyis sa zhing rmo ba/chu la zam pa (208) btsugs pa sogs mdzad de skabs lho rgyud yar lung khul du rgan mo bal ma zhes pas zla ba'i dkar cha'i 'phel grib la brten nas zla tshes brtsis pa la rgan mo bal ma'i zla rtsis su grags pa'ang byung stod kyi stengs gnyis kyi bar so rdzas dang g.ya' la btab ces 'khod yod do/_}
pu rang rgyal rabs|{pu rang gi rgyal brgyud ni gu ge nas chad pa dang gu ge dang pu rung srid dbang gcig 'dzin gyi dus skabs lha bla ma ye shes 'od kyi gcung po 'khor res pu rang gi srid dbang bzung/pho rang ni pu rang gi sku mkhar nyi bzungs su mdzad pa sogs 'khor chags gtsug lag khang gi lo rgyus su gsal/rang byung bcu gcig pa'i nang du pu rung gi gdung rgyud rdzogs pa yin tshul ka thog (btsan po'i gdung rabs )su gsal}
