po to ba|{'brom gyi dngos slob bka' gdams sku mched gsum du grags pa'i ya gyal dge ba'i bshes gnyen po to ba ni 'phan yul spras kyi bra'o thang (gsum 'phreng shang )du yab sku gshen srid la phyug ste srid ces grags pa dang yul me lo zhes grags pa gnyis kyi sras su rab byung dang po'i me mo yos (1027)lor sku 'khrungs/gdung gnyos/byas pa'i dus nas gzhan sdug bsngal ba gzigs na 'di'i sdug bsngal 'di thabs gang gis sel bar nus snyam pa dang/gzhan bde ba gzigs na thugs dga' bzhi 'di'i dbe ba 'di nam yang mi mnyam par gong du song na snyam pa zhig yod/yab kyi bla mchod sba sgom zhes pas bskul nas yar pa ba rngog byag chub 'byung gnas lam rab tu byung/mtshan rin chen gsal zhes btags/khu ston sogs mkhas pa mang po bsten nas sde snod gsum la sbyangs pa phul phyin mdzad/yer par jo bo rje la sgom rim bar pa gcig gsan/thos bsam dang bsam gtan la brtson par mdzad/sgom par bzhed nas sba sgom la gros zhus par sba sgom gyis byang rwa sgreng na 'brom ston pa bya ba bzhugs pas de la man ngag zhus na legs gsungs pa ltar rwa sgreng du dge bshes ston pa'i spyan sngar byon nas gdams ngag zhus/lo bdun gyi ring du 'bral med bzhugs nas bsam sbyor gnyis kyis tshul bzhin du bsten nas byang chub lam gyi rim pa'i khrid zhus par 'brom ston pas spyan gyi 'bras bu ltar bskyangs/'brom ston pa 'das khar po to bar bshes gnyen mdo sde la gyis la sems bzang po gyis gsungs/dgon pa ba 'das rjes rwa sgreng bskyangs par dgongs kyang rmi ltas kyi rkyen byas chas dngos gang yod dor te gcig pur gshegs/po to ba dang/spyan snga ba/phu chung ba gsum klung shod na 'gor sogs su byon te sgoms/sgro lag dgon pa sogs su chos mang du gsungs/dgung lo drug cu re gcig pa la spras kyi po to dgon na bzhugs dus 'phan yul stod du sde rtsod chen po byung bar bros pa mang po spras su bsdad bcug nas sdud mo btab/dge bshes po to ba dang de'i 'khor rnams kyang zang zing gi dngos por mi chags pa sha stag yin pa dang/po to ba ni sde snod la mkhyen pa rgyas shing/de thams cad gdangs ngag du shar ba zhig yin/sku tshe'i smad la po to dgon pa phyag btab pas dge bshes po to ba zhes grags/bka' gdams zhes pa'i sgra de yang de dus su grags pa yin/dgung grangs don dgu pa rab byung gnyis pa'i shing bya (1105)lor sku gshegs/bu chen brgyad sogs byung/khong ni bka' gdams pa'i dge bshes slob ma la chos 'chad pa la mkhas pa'i mchog tu gyur pa yin zhing/khong la slob ma mang du yod pa las/gtsang nar ma snang gnyis/gtsang stod du bya phag gnyis/gnyal gyi glang gnyos gnyis/dol na 'be rog gnyis te chen po brgyad dang/khong rnams ni gtso bo'i slob ba rnams so/_/slob ma dag gis bla ma 'di nyid kyi gsung sgros bsgrigs te 'grel par sbyar ba la (210) be'u bum sngon po zhes zer/_/lo rgyus zhib pa sa chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung mkhan pa'i yid 'phrog )gi shog grangs 216nas 222bar gsal bas der gzigs par zhu}
