dpag tshad|{ji skad du/gzugs mtha' phra rab rdul bdun rdul phran gcig /de bzhin lcags chu ri bo lug dang glang/_/nyi rdul sro ma shig nas sor tshigs sor/_/nyi shu (211) rtsa bzhi khru gang de bzhi la/_/gzhu 'doms zhes grags lnga brgyar rgyang grangs gcig dgon pa'i tshad de de brgyad dpag tshad do/_/zhes sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi (mngon pa'i gzhung )dang (dus 'khor )gyi gzhung nas bshad pa'i rgya thag ring thung 'jal byed tshad gzhi mtho shos kyi ming yin cing dpag tshad rtsi stangs ni phra rab kyi rdul bdun la rdul phran gcig rdul phran bdun la lcags rdul gcig lcags rdul gcig bdun la chu rdul gcig chu rdul bdun la ri gong gi rdul (spu rtser chags pa'i rdul )gcig ri bong rdul bdun la lug rdul (spu rtser chags pa'i rdul )gcig ri bo rdul bdun la lug rdul (spu rtser chags pa'i rdul)gcig lug rdul bdun la glang rdul (spu rtser chags pa'i rdul )gcig glang rdul bdun la nyi zer gyi rdul gcig nyi zer gyi rdul bdun la nas 'bru )gcig nas 'bru bdun la sor mo dbus ma'i tshigs gcig sor nyi shu rtsa bzhi la khru khang khru bzhi la gzhu 'dom gang gzhu 'dom lnga brgya la rgyang grags gcig grong las rgyang grangs gcig gis 'phags pa la dgon pa rgya grangs brgyad la dpag tshad gcig tu brtsis pa yin te spyir na mi gzugs tshad ldan gyi khru ba la spyi skar {(WP:1,194)}lnga bcu tham pa yod khru bzhi ste spyi skar nyis brgya la 'dom gang 'dom lnga brgya ste spyi skar tshig 'bum mam spyi khri chig stong ste spyi lo gcig dang rgyang grangs brgya da kyi tshad mnyam pa de la dpag tshad gcig ces 'bod pa yin 'on kyang (bod rgya tshig mdzod chen mo (deb gnyis pa'i shog grangs 1622nang dpag tshan gcig ni hri le nyi shu rtsa drug gi tshad dang mnyam zhes gsal ba ltar byas na hri le gnyis la spyi le gcig yin cing hri le nyi shu rtsa drug la spyi le bcu gsum ste spyi khre chig khri sum stong yod de rigs pas gzhal la spyi khri chig khri sum yod de rigs pas gzhal na spyi khri chig khri sum stong yod de rigs pa gzhal na spyi khre chig stong sum stong cha brgyad du bgos pa'i cha gcig ste spyi khri chig st