dpang lo tsA ba blo gros brtan pa|{lo tsA ba 'di nyid rab byung lnga pa'i me byi (1276)lor la stod spyang lung gi 'o 'bu gyam du sku bltams/yum snga mor gshegs nas lug gi 'o mas gsos pas lu gu zhes pa'i mtshan thogs/dgung lo lnga pa la chos rje spyang gling pa las dge bsnyen don/mtshan blo gros brtan par gsol/dgung lo bdun pa la mkhan chen gser khang pa dang mi ston 'dul 'dzin pa las rab tu byung/dgung lo bcu gcig pa la dge ba'i bshes gnyen 'di gnyis las mdo rtsa rdzogs par bslabs/dgung lo bcu gsum nas bcu dug par rtag bde sang rgyal gyi zhabs la gtugs te phar tshad mngon gsum dang/dbu ma/khyad par du dus 'khor la sbyangs pas mkhas par mkhyen/dgung lo bcu dgu pa la rtag bde ba gshegs nas mang mkhar khra tshang du lo tsA ba lo mchog las dus 'khor shong lugs/ka lA pa dang tsan+d+ra pa/snyan ngag me long sogs gsan/rtag bde ti phug gi mkhan po shes rab dpal dang/sa skya'i 'jam dbyangs gi thog pa/'jam skya ba/rong pa shes rab seng ge sogs kyi zhabs pad bsten/dus 'khor lugs brtag gnyis/rnam 'grel/rig gter sogs gsan/dgung lo nyi shu pa la mkhan chen gser khang pa dang mi ston 'dus 'dzin pa las bsnyen par rdzogs/a ra tsa byung tshad las phral skad bslabs/'jam dbyangs gzhi thog pa dang paN+Di ta'i dbang gi lo tsA mdzad pas lo tsA bar grags/nyer gcig pa la bal yul du byon nas sgra snyan ngag la mkhas par sbyangs/bal yul la khyon lan bdun phebs/bal po paN+Di ta phal che bas man snye dang dgongs rgyan sogs zhus/dgung lo so gnyis pa la gung thung gnas po cher chos gzhi btsugs te gung thang pa bde blo sobs slob ma'i tshogs mang du 'dus pa la dbyar dus 'khor/dgun phar chad mngon gsum gyi dus chos gsungs/snyan pa'i grags pa rgya gar dang hor yul tshun khyab/ya tshe dang hor rgyal pos gdan 'dren byung ba la bar chad du gzigs nas/springs yig gong 'og can gyis ya tshe bzlog /cad pu dag gsal ra seng ge gling du btags te der bzhugs pas hor bzlog /sdig pa'i grogs po'i g.yo ba ring du spangs/skabs der sa skyar byon nas lo mchog la mnga' ba'i bka' lung mtha' dag bum pa gang byo'i tshul du gsan bzhes mdzad/dgung lo drug cu re gnyis pa la rgyal sras rin po che'i zhu 'bul bzhin bo dong se'u gdan khrir phebs/gung thang bde blo sogs slob bu mang du byon/rgyud 'dzin gyi sras dbon lo tsA ba byang chub rtse mo yin/dbus su phebs nas lha sa/bsam yas/gung thang/stag lung/rwa sgreng/gsang ne'u thog rnams su dus 'khor/dgongs rgyan/phar tshad mngon sum/dbu ma rgyan/sgra snyan ngag zab mo'i mdo lang sogs chos mang du gsungs pas skabs kyi dge ba'i bshes gnyen phal mo ches gsan/snar thang du mchims blo bzang pa sogs la dgongs rgyan snyan ngag gnang/mkhas pa'i bdag nyid bu dol/rgyal sras pa/lo chen byang chub rtse mo/gung thang bde blo/ma ti paN chen/kun spangs chos grags dpal/'jam dbyangs dod yod rgyal mtshan/de ring pa 'jam dbyangs mtshan ces sogs kyis dpang lo chen po'i zhabs la btud/mkhas pa'i grags pa shin tu che/nyin mtshan kun tu thugs dam las mi g.yel/rje 'di nyid kyi 'gyur la mtshon na/dpal rdo rje snying po rgyan zhes bya ba'i rgyud kyi rgyal pos skya paN+Di tas ma 'dres pa'i chos bco brgyad kyi skabs thugs kyi 'phrin las thams cad yod zhes sngon du 'gro ste ye shes kyi rjes su 'brang ngo zhes pa'i bar bsgyur ba'i 'phro rnams rdzogs par bsgyur/bstan 'gyur las/(dpal ldan dri ma dang bral ba'i 'od kyi rgyud la 'jug pa'i bshad sbyar mi g.yo ba'i (213) snying po snang ba )zhes bya ba (rnal 'byor yan lag drug gi brjed byang yon tan gyis 'gengs pa )zhes bya ba mkhas pa chen po gsan brtan nyi ma dpal ye shes kyis mdzad pa (dbang mdor bstan gyi 'grel pa dpal dus 'khor gyi 'khor lo paN+Di ta rnam par rgyal ba dbang pos mdzad )rgyal dbang blos mdzad pa dang si sogs kyi mtha' dpyad 'jam dbyangs grags pas mdzad pa (tsan+d+ra pa'i yi ge'i mdo) (ting mtha'i bya ba slob dpon gtsang kha shas mdzad pa'i 'grel pa mdor bstan sogs gzhi 'gyur dang zhu chen mang po du mdzad cing (dus 'khor 'grel chen gyi bstod 'grel ka lA pa )snyan ngag me long gi 'grel pa tshogs gsum gsal ba )sogs bstan bcom mang du bka' rtsom mdzad cing gzhan don gyi bya ba rdzogs gnas dgung lo drug cu re bdun 