dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng ba|{rab byung brgyad pa'i shing byi (1504)lor gnyags kyi phyogs las byung ba yab bla ma dar dang/yum lam rnyed sgrol ma gnyis kyi sras su snye thang du sku 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga par dge bsnyen cha lung pas dpa' bo sku phreng dang po chos dbang lhun grub kyi sku skyer ngos 'dzin zhus te lho brag rgo bo dgon pa'i gdan sar spyan drangs/bla ma rtogs ldan dge 'dun rgya mtsho dge rgan du bsten nas bod yig 'bri klog sogs la sbyangs brtson mdzad/dgung lo dgu pa la karma zhwa dmar sku phreng bzhi pa chos kyi grags pa'i drung nas dge bsnyen dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes pa'i mtshan la mi phab chos kyi rgya mtsho zhes gsol/_/dgung lo bcu gnyis par shar dwags po paN+Di ta chos rgyal bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas gsang sngags gsar rnying gi chos mang po dang/dbus smyon heHru (214) ka kun dga' bzang po'i drung nas phyag chen gyi khrid gsan de rjes zhu lu lo chen chos skyong bzang po'i drung nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes dgung lo nyi shu rtsa dgu la kong por phebs skabs zing po 'bum pa sgang du karma pa mi bskyod rdo rje dang mjal te chos 'brel zhus shing mtshan la dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng ba zhes gsol de nas bzung mdo sngags rig gnas dang bcas pa'i gsan sbyong mang che ba zla ma 'di'i drung du mdzad pa dang 'brel mkhas pa'i dbang po du ma'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags dang rig gnas spyi la gsan sbyong dpyis phyin pa gnang bsam khas pa'i phul tu phyid dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng ba zhes snyan pa'i grags pa rab tu 'bar gsung chos la (spyod 'jug 'grel chen )dang (rtsis kyi bstan bcos/) (phag mo'i rnam bshad chen mo/) (gos ba rig pa'i rgyud bzhi'i rnam bshad/) (sman dpyad zin bris snying po bsdus pa/) (rdo zhun gsal sgron/) (rtsis gzhung rin chen gter mdzod/) (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )sogs mang du mchis (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )ni rab byung dgu pa'i shing sbrul (1545)lor brtsam 'go btsugs te lo ngo nyi shu rtsa gcig ring yongs su cha tshang bar mdzad lo rgyus kyi der ther 'di shes bya'i gnas kun lta ba'i me long dang mtshungs sh