dpa' ris dge bshes blo bzang rab gsal|{dpa' ris blo bzang rab gsal zhu ba 'di nyid rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags byi (1840)lor dpa' ris yul gyi 'brog sa'i khyim zhig tu sku 'khrungs/sku na ches phra ba'i dus su jag rung yar lung thos bsam dar rgyas gling du tshogs zhugs mdzad cing/thugs rab shin tu che bas dgon pa 'don cha sogs myur bar thugs su chud/de nas dpal ldan bkra shis 'khyil gyi gdan sar phebs/ (215) dge ba'i bshes gnyen bcu phrag du ma bsten nas mdo phyogs bka' pod lnga sngags phyogs rgyud sde chen po bzhi la sogs pa'i thun mong dung thun mong ma yin pa'i gzhung lugs la thugs gnyer rgya cher mdzad de mkhas grub gyi go 'phang brnyes shing rgyal ba'i bstan pa rin po che rang gi spyan 'bras bzhin du gces par bzung nas gdan sa mchog gi dge 'dun stong phrag mang po'i gtsug rgyan dung rgyu dmigs bsal gyis rdo rabs pa 'phar ma'i mtshan rtags bzhes gdan sa mchog gi rtsod rgyugs phul tu byung ba'i mtshan snyan thob dgung lo nga lngar phebs pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing rta (1894)lor kan lho dang dpa' ris mtsho sngon gyi sku 'bum byams pa gling rong bo dgon chen a rig dgon chen sogs kyi dgon sde che phra du mar phebs nas mdo smad bshad grwar grwa skor mdzad 'ju mi pham gyi dgag rtsom la dgag lan brtsams gar nang ba sogs 'chad rtsod rtsom pa'i bya bas dus 'da' bas mkhas pa'i grags snyan sa steng du khyab me rta (1906)lor rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pa' chen pos rje nyid las mdo sngags rig gnas kyi gdams pa mang po gsan phyis yab sras gnyis mnyam du pe cin dang ri bo rtse lnga sog yul la sogs par zhabs kyis bcags shing skal ldan gyi slob ma nam mkha'i skar tshogs ji bzhin bskyangs par mdzad lcags khyi (1910)lo'i yas mas su bdag nyid chen po 'di nyid slar yang phyi sog yul du phebs te zab rgyas chos kyi sgo brgyad phyes skal ldan gyi gdul bya mtha' yas pa smin grol gyi lam bzang la nye bar 'god bzhin pa'i tshe na gzugs sku'i bkod pa re zhig bsdu ba'i tshul bstan to/_}
