dpal 'khor chos kyi sde chen po|{(rgyal rtse dpa' 'khor chos sde )dgon pa de gzhis rtse sa khul khongs rgyal rtse grong nang du gnas shing/rab byung bdun pa'i chu sbrul (1413)lor rgyal rtse chos rgyal rab brtan kun bzang 'phags pas thog mar nang stod lcang ra dgon pa btab/rje tsong kha pa'i dngos grub mkhas grub chen po che dge legs dpal bzang slob dpon du gdan drangs te rang nyid kyi yab nang chen kun dga' 'phags kyi dgongs rdzogs su dmigs nas gsang sngags rgyud sde bzhi'i dkyil 'khor sgrub mchod chog grwa sum cu so bdun yod pa btsugs shing/de'i mchod rgyud du dmigs pa'i mchod gzhis son 'bru khal bzhi brgya dgu bcu go dgu dang bre bzi tsam 'gro ba thebs su sbyar/de nas lo ngo drug song ba rab byung gong gsal gyi sa khyi (1418)lo'i bod zla drug pa'i tshes gnyis la da lta'i dpal 'khor chos sde'i dgos pa 'di gsar du btab nas sngar yod lcang ra dgon pa'i chos gzhis dge 'dun dang bcas pa 'dir spos shing/dgon pa 'dir grwa tshang bcu bdun yod ni/dge lugs grwa tshang bdun/sa lugs grwa tshang bzhi/zha lu'i grwa tshang gcig /dus 'khor grwa tshang bzhi/sa skya dge lugs thun mong gi grwa tshang gser khang 'og pa bcas yin/dgos pa 'dir grags che ba lha khang chen mo dang/sku 'bum mchod rten chen mo bkra shis sgo mang/bka' 'gyur gser chos rgyal rtse them spangs ma bcas yin/lha khang chen mo ni/dpal chos dgon pa 'debs pa'i phyi lo sa phag (1419)lo'i lo mjug tu bzhengs 'go tshugs shing/phyi la 'bur chen bcu gnyis/mda' yab lan kan dang bcas pa/gtsug (216) lag khang gi gtsang khang dbus mar ka chen brgyad mdun kyi khyams la ka chen bzhi bcu zhe brgyad glo 'bur shar nub kyi lha khang gnyis so sor ka ba drag re bcas khyon ka ba brgya dang lnga bcu'i rgya khyod yod cing gtsang khang chen mo'i dbus su rten gtso thub dbang byang chub chen po'i gser sku zangs khal chig stong la gser srang brgyad brgya bcu tham pa 'gro ba'i gser chus byugs pa khri drug 'gyogs dang bcas pa bod kyi bzo dpon mo che skyabs pas bzhengs pa dang de'i g.yas g.yon gnyis su 'jam dbyangs dang spyan ras gzigs kya gser sku re la zangs khal nyis brgya dang gser srang sum brgya'i gser chus byugs pa bal po'i lha bzo dza'i te tsa sogs kyis bzhengs pa rten gtso byang chub chen po'i gas ngos su 'das pa'i sangs rgyas byams pa de rnams kyi g.yas gral du byang chub sems dpa' byams pa sogs sems dpa' brgyad dang g.yon gral du byang chub sems dpa' 'jam dbyangs sogs sems dpa' brgyad bcas byang chub sems dpa' bcu drug gi ldem sku thog tshad ma bar stongs su sangs rgyas byang sems kyi ldebs bris yod pa glo 'bur nub kyi lha khang ni rab byung bdun pa'i chu stag (1422)lol bzhengs shing lha khang 'di'i nang rdo rje dbyings kyi lha tshogs gtso bo sum cu so bdun rnams 'bur sku dang de min gyi mgron thabs kyi lha tshogs byang chub sems dpa' dge brgya dgu bcu go drug rnams ldebs bris su bris yod glo 'bur shar gyi chos rgyal lha khang ni gong gsal gyi phyi lo der bzhengs shing khang 'di'i nang rdo rje dbyings kyi lha tshogs gtso bo sum cu so bdun rnams 'bur sku dang de min gyi mgron thabs kyi lha tshogs byang chub sems dpa' dge brgya dgu bcu go drug rnams ldebs bris su bris yod blo 'bur shar gyi chos rgyal lha khang ni gong gsal gyi phyi lo der bzhengs shing lha khang 'di'i nang du slob dpon klu sgrub lugs kyi spyan ras gzigs bcu gcig zhal phyag bzhi bcu zhe gnyis 'bur sku gzhas yang bod la bka' drin chen ba'i mkhas slob chos gsum sogs bla brgyad rags rim gyi 'bur sku ldebs bris la spyan ras gzigs kyi sku'i rnam 'byor mi 'dra ba mang po dang sangs rgyas sum cu so lnga sogs lha sku stong phrag lhag tsam yod gzhan yang 'du khang dang khyams g.yas g.yon steng gi seng g.yab sogs la mdo rgyud nas bshad pa'i sangs rgyas byang sems mang po'i zhing bkod dang logs bris rnams yod rab byung gong gsal gyi shing sbrul (1425)lor gtsang khang chen mo'i steng gi gzhal yas chen mo'i ka ba brgyad yod pa'i dbus su dus 'khor gyi dkyil 'khor gtso bo byas pa'i dkyil 'khor che ba bdun dang g.yon phyogs su zla med ma rgyun nas bshad pa'i dkyil 'khor che ba bdun bcas dkyil 'khor che ba bco lnga dang dkyil 'khor che ba de dag gi