 mdo dang rgyud sde nas bshad pa'i lha sku'i rnam 'gyur mi 'dra ba'i 'bur sku dang bris sku dkyil 'khor mchod pa'i mo sogs bar mtshams med par khengs shing lha khang steng shod kyi bar du steng 'gro'i rdo skas rgyu ma'i 'khyog 'gros ltar rim par brtsegs pas 'gro lam bde ba dang bang rim so so'i steng du bad chung bad chen pu shu lan kan bcas brtsegs mar bkod pas mig las la mdzes shing char chu'i gnod pa skyob nus pa sogs bzo bkod ngo mtshar 'phrul dang ldan pa dang bka' 'gyur gser chos rgyal rtse them spangs ma ni rgyal rtse chos rgyal rab brtan kun bzang 'phags pas rab byung bdun pa'i lcags phag (1431)lor thog mar bzhengs pa'i bka' 'gyur gser chod pod brgya dang bcu gcig yod pa deng sang lha khang chen mo'i sbugs kyi gtsang khang g.yon ma'i nang dub zhugs pa 'di yin gzhan yang bka' 'gyur gser chos ma bzhengs gong du skya chos cha tshang gcig kyang bzhengs pa dang gser chos bka' 'gyur bzhengs tshar rjes bstan 'gyur skya chos dbu med bris ma tshar gcig la pod nyis brgya dang lnga yod pa rnams kyang lha khang chen mo'i sbugs kyi gtsang khang nang du yod mus red mdor na rgyal rtse dpon 'khor chos sde'i dgon pa 'di yi nang rin thang che ba'i rten gsum dang ldebs bris sogs ha cang mang zhing ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hung wu'i khri lo 23pa (rab byung bdun pa'i lcags rta spyi lo (1390)lo nas bzung da bar lo co drug brgya lhag tsam gyi lo rgyus yun ring ldan pa'i dgon pa zhig yin stabs rgyal srid spyi khyab khang gi thad ka'i srong skyong sde tshad du gtogs pa dang rig gnas gsar brje chen po'i skabs grwa tshang khag rnams gtor bshig song yang lha khang chen mo dang der yod sku gsung thugs rten sku 'bum mchod rten bcas da ltar yang rtsa ba'i cha nas nyams chag ma byung bar gnas yod pa dang 'bras bu nyams chag byung rigs rnams rgyal khab nas gron dngul gnang ste nyams gso byed mus kyi skabs su mchis rgyal rtse dpal 'khor chos sde'i lo rgyus cung zad zhib par (myang yul stod smad bar gsum gyi ngo mtshar gtar gyi legs bshad mkhas pa'i 'jug sgo)shog grangs 48nas 64bar dang rgyal rtse chos rgyal gyi rnam thar kha byang du (d+harma rA dza'i rnam thar dad pa'i lo tog rgyal byed dngos grub kyi char 'bebs )bris ma shog grangs 241yod pa der gzigs}
dpal 'khor btsan|{yab gnam lde 'od srungs dang yum cog ro bzang rgyal mo gnyis kyi sras su bod shing bya (925)lor yar lung 'phang thang du sku 'khrungs zhes dang/bod chu glang (893mam 953bzhed tshul mi gcig )lor 'khrungs sogs gsungs tshul mi 'dra ba mchis/'di nyid dgung lo bcu gsum la phebs skabs yab 'od srungs gshegs pas gtsang gi grom pa lha rtser gshegs rdzong chos (218) 'khor rgya cher bskor pa dang dus mtshungs rgyal rgyud kyi khri la 'khod blon po 'bro tsug sgra lha snang dang chang 'a pho gnyis byas dgung lo bcu drug par yab mes kyi bang so la thigs tshags byas nas chu khung shur kha btsugs de nas sgrol phu'i sman lung la sogs pa'i gtsug lag khang brgyad bzhengs gsung rab dang bris sku la sogs pa byas mes kyi spyod pa la dmad cing chos la gus pa zhig byung 'di nyid dgung lo nyer drug la phebs skabs bod du rab byung sogs las kyi cho ga dang klog pa thob bsam gyi 'khor tshugs pas bstan pa phyi dar dbu brnyes sku tshe'i smad du gtsang du byon te grom pa lha rtse'i brag la pho brang mdzad nas bzhugs mthar dgung lo so gcig par grom pa lha rtser stag rtse snyags kyis bkrongs de yang mnga' bdag dka' 'khor stag rtse snyags kyi bkrongs rgyu mtshan snyags phyed gtsang dub shugs par byas pa dang gtsang gi 'bre phyed mar yar lung du dbab par byas pas so zhes (mkhas pa'i lde'u'i chos 'byung )nang gsal dpal 'khor btsan gyis btsun mo gnyis khab tu bzhes par chun ma mchims bza' btsun ne la gcen khri bkra shis brtsegs pa dpal dang chen ma sna nam bza' legs btsun la gcung skyid lde nyi ma mgon gnyis 'khrungs so/_}
dpal gyi chas brgyad|{1 gzi brjid 'bar ba chu srin brjid pa'i chas/2 thabs dang shes rab zung 'brel nyi zla'i chas/3 gdug pa can bsreg ye shes me'i chas/4 skye shi rtsad gcod mche ba zla tshes chas/5 khyab mdzad re rdzogs rdo rje'i gshegs pa'i chas/6 mnga' thang yongs rdzogs rdo rje slog pa'i chas/7 sangs rgyas sar bgrod dbang gi bse khrab chas/8 gnod gdug bzlog byed rgya bye'u lcags kyi chas zhes pa'am/yang na/1 dbu skra gyen brdzes 'khor ba ru bzlog chas/2 rdo rje khyung shog thabs dang shes rab chas/3 mthing nag con pan dpa' rtags zil gnon chas/_/4 spyi gtsug rdo rje lhag pa rig pa'i chas/_/5 dbang gi bse khrab gzi 'bar bgrod pa'i chas/6 gnyis med sbyor ba shes rab yum gyi chas/7 gnod gdug bzlog byed rgya bye'u lcags kyi chas/8 nyon mongs can bsreg rdo rje me yi chas/de rnams dpal gyi sku la ye nas rdzogs}
