dpal mgon bdun bcu rtsa gnyis|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang gnas gzhung nas bshad pa'i srung ma bdun cu rtsa gnyis ste/lha chen po brgyad/klu chen po brgyad/gza' chen po brgyad/rgyu skar nyi shu rtsa brgyad/phyogs skyong bcu/rgyal po chen po bzhi/'jigs byed chen po dgu ste dpal mgon bdun cu rtsa lnga yod kyang/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang du dpal 'khor bdun cu rtsa gnyis zhes gsal 'dug pa gang yin brtag dgos shing/gong gsal de dag so so'i grangs 'dren ni (gsung rab rnams las bshad pa'i grangs 'dren )zhes pa zur du yod pa der gzigs par zhu}
