dpal chen rga lo|{gong du dpal rga lo zhes par gzigs}
dpal chen chu bo ri|{(lcags zam chu bo ri )lha sa grong khyer nas lho nub phyogs su rta lam nyin gnyis kyi sar (lho kha gong dkar rdzong khongs )yod pa'i ri chung ngu zhig ste/lo rgyud thog shod srol la/rgyal po khri srong sde btsan skabs gnas 'dir grub pa thob pa'i sgom chen mang po byung dang/dus rabs bco lnga pa dang bcu drug pa gnyis kyi ring sku bzhugs pa'i bka' brgyud chos lugs kyi grub thub mtshan snyan can thang stong rgyal po'am brtson 'grus bzang pos gnas 'dir yun ring dub zhugs shing lcags zam zhig kyang 'dzugs par mdzad pas yongs grags su gnas 'dir lcags zab chu bo ri zhes 'bod pa yin}
