dpal dus kyi 'khor lo|{'di la skabs re dus kyi 'khor lo zer ba'i gsang sngags kyi yi dam zhig la go ba len dgos pa dang/skabs 'gar(dus 'khor gyi rtsa rgyud )dang 'grel pa sogs la go ba len dgos pa gnyis yod/dus 'khor gyi chos 'di thog mar rgya gar du dar zhing/de nas bod du dar ba zhig yin/rgya gar du thog mar ji 'dra byas te dar ba ni sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol 'dra min gnyis yod pa ste/gcig ni sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa sangs rgyas pa'i lo de'i phyi lo zla ba gsum pa'i tshes bco lnga la gsungs pa yin zer ba dang/yang shod tshul gcig la sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa sku mya ngan las 'das pa'i sngon gyi zla ba gsum pa'i tshes bco lnga la gsungs pa yin zer ba'i shod tshul gnyis yod pa las/bod kyi mkhas pa mang che ba ni bshad srol snga ma ltar khas len/dus 'khor gyi nang don ni/phyi 'jig na khams kyi nyi zla rgyu skar sogs kyi 'khor tshul rnams nang du mi yi lus kyi 'byung ba lnga dang/rtsa rlung gi thig le bcas kyi chags tshul nges can yod pa dang zur 'brel byas nas gsang sngags kyi lam sgom tshul bshad pazhig yin/dus 'khor gyi chos 'di bod du thog mar dar ba'i dus tshod gang yin skor la bshad tshul sna tshogs yod kyang bod kyi lo rgyus mkhas pa mang po zhig gis gsungs pa ltar na kha che paN chen shAkya shrI'i lugs kyi sangs rgyas 'das lo (1171)bod me yos (1027)lo la gyi jo lo rtsa bas bod sa gnas su thog mar dar spel btang ba dang dus mtshungs/mu stegs pa'i byed rtsis lugs kyi me mkha' rgya mtsho'i 'das lo 403lo grangs rdzogs pa yin pas/me yos lo de lo 'gor rtsis nas rab byung skor gcig 'og tshugs pa'i rtsis srol dar ba yin/dus 'khor gyi chos bod du bsgyur zhing rags che ba ni bka' 'gyur sngags phyogs (ka)(kha)(ga)(nga)(ca)par bar yod lnga yod la/dus 'khor rtsa rgyud 'grel pa sogs le tshan bzhi bcu zhe brgyad tsam yod pa rnams kyi jo lo tsA ba dang/'bro lo tsA ba/rwa lo tsA ba sogs kyis bod skad du bsgyur ba yin zhing/gzhan yang bod 'dir rnying ma/sa (220) skya bka' brgyud dge lugs sogs chos lugs ris med kyi mkhas pa mang pos dus 'khor gyi skor la bstan bcos