dpal ldan 'bras spungs kyi mchod rten|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/ston pa shAkya thub pas bya rgod phung po'i rir sher phyin gyi mdo gsungs pa dang dus mnyam du dus 'khor rtsa rgyud gsungs pa'i gnas kyang 'di yin/_/legs sbyar skad la shri d+ha n+ya ka Ta ka zhes dang bod skad la dpal ldan 'bras spungs zhes mchod rten 'di'i rtsa ba'i 'khor yug rgyang grags bzhi bcu yod pa/rgyang grags kyi tshad kyang rdul phra rab bdun 'gyur gyis rdul phran gcig/rdul phran bdun 'gyur gyis lcags ldur gcig lcags rdul bdun 'gyur gyis chu rdul gcig /chu rdul bdun gyis ri bong gi rdul gcig /ri bong gi rdul bdun gyis lug rdul gcig /lug rdul bdun gyis glang rdul gcig /glang rdul bdun gyis nyi zer gyi rdul gcig /nyi zer gyi rdul bdun gyis sro ma gcig /srong ma bdun gyis shig gcig /sor tshigs nyi shu rtsa bzhi la khru gang/khru bzhi la gzhu gang/gzhu 'dom lnga brgya la rgyang grags gcig rgyang grags brgyad la dpag tshad gcig bcas yin/mchod rten 'di rgya gar shar phyogs b+hang+ga la'i mtha' nas rgya mtsho ra gru btang nas nyis gsum tsam phyin pas slebs par gsung/mchod rten gyi mdun gyi shar nas lcags ri phyi ma'i shar sgo bar du grong khyer dpal yon can mi khyim dngos chas sna tshogs yod par gsungs}
