dpal lha'i ri khrod|{bod dbus khul gyi dus chen zhig ste/bod zla bcu pa'i nang lha ldan sprul pa'i gtsug lag khang gi gnas srung gtso bo dpal ldan lha mo'i gsol mchod dus chen yin cing/zla ba de'i tshes gcig nas bzung lha sa khul du rnam kun slong mo ba 'dra min khag btsam ma zad/byin pa dang lha khang khag gi dkon gnyer sogs nas dpal lha'i mdun chang zhes dngul slong srol yod/tshes brgyad dgu tsam nas gtsug lag khang gi dpal lha lcog la rme ru dgon pa'i tshogs yongs nas gtor sgrub tshugs/de sngon gung thang bla ma zhang gi gter bzhes dpal lha drag mo'i zhal 'bag gsol ba'i sku gsob de na bza' dang rgyan cha gzab par sgron thog gtsug lag khang gi thog khar dpal lha lcog gi sgo 'gram gyi ka phibs 'og tu gdan drangs/zhal lho ru gcig nas bzhugs su gsol ba'i mdun du mchod sprin bshams/lha sa ba tshos bsang gsol gser skyems 'bul ba sogs byed/dpal gsol ma zhes dpal lha'i gsol mchod byed mkhan mi drag khag gcig la khral 'khri'i rang bzhin gyis 'dzugs dgos pa'i bud med bcu grangs shig yod pa de tshos lha sa'i bud med kyi rgyan gos gza' shos bklubs te dpal lha lcog gi sgo 'gram du gral la 'khod nas bsdad/khong tshor yang dbu mdzad ces lo na rgan pa rgyus mnga' che ba zhig gis 'go 'dzin byed/lcog gi sbug tu rme ru dgon gyi dge 'dun pa tshos zhal 'don gsungs skabs dpal gsol ma phal che bas kyang dpal ldan zhi drag gi bskang bshags bstod 'phrin sogs mnyam 'don byed/tshes bcu bzhi nyin kyi tho rengs snga char sku gsob 'di nyid gtsug lag khang gi yangs steng khyams 'og tu gdan drangs nas khrus gsol dang 'brel byi dkon gnyer nas zhal bsil zhus te rtse phyag nas zhal gser 'bul mi rtse phyag nang bgres pa gcig dang/gtan 'jags zur 'phyongs lha bris pa bcas nas sgron 'bul zhus/rtse 'phral sde phyag mdzod dang/bla phyag so so nas thugs smon snyan shal sna lnga sgron 'bul zhus thog gser zhib sogs rin chen sna lnga zhib zhib dngos su yod pa'i gser skyems 'bul lam zhus/bka' shag lhan tshugs gnang ma thag tu bka' blon lhan rgyas 'phrin bcol la phebs/de mjug gzhung zhabs ser skya ngo ma rnams dang/ma ming pho mo che 'bring chung gsum mtha' dag gzab 'chor dang ldan pa 'tshangs gshibs kyis 'ong ste 'phrin skyems dang/snyan shal 'bul/rme ru tshogs yongs nas gza' gsol gyi cho ga dang/tshogs gtor bshams 'bul zin rjes dngos grub gtor ma zhes gtsug lag khang gi dkyil 'khor mthil gyi gnam yangs steng nas rgya phibs 'og tu 'dzoms pa'i mjal dmangs tshor tshogs gtor ster ba hab thob kyi dngos grub thob par rtsi/de'i dgong mo dpal ldan drag mo de bzhin jo bo rin po che'i mdun thang pang bcal steng gdan zhu zhus te ngo bo ngad zhal sprod kyis zhugs su gsol/tshes bcu lnga nyis zhogs pa snga po nas lha sa ba'i khyim 'dzin ma rnams rgyan gos gang gzab gyon te dpal ldan gsol mchod byed/nyi drod tsam du dpal lha sbal gdong gi sku gsob de jo khang 'og shod kyi lha khang lho ma rnams kyi mdun brgyu da 'khyams ra'i mtha' du gdan drangs/phyag g.yas pa'i phyag mtshan be con blangs nas ral gri me ris can zhig phul/rme ru dgon gyi dge 'dun tshos na bza' gzab bzhes thog 'phyar dar dang/spos na ba'i da khrid 'og rnga rol pa tshos rtse zhwa dang/sgro lu sgrog gdan sgar ba'i zla gam bsnabs/spos phor pa (223) chos rje zhwa dang gos chen phrag khebs gyon dngul gyi spos phor thogs pa sogs byas nas gral bstar sgrig pa'i rjes su dpal lha'i sku gsob de'i nang sku bsten pa zhes rmi ru'i grwa pa sdom ldan bsnyen pa song ba gcig 'dzul te g.yas g.yon nas sku mdun pa grwa pa kha shas yod pa tshos skyor te jo khang nang ma'i lho ngos nas seng ldeng sgo mo dang 'khyams ra brgyud lha sa'i bar bskor du phebs skabs mi mang pho mo dang bal 'brug sogs tshang mas snyan dar phul lha mo'i sku rgyab tu rma bya'i gdugs 'khyer mkhan grwa pa phrag khebs khyon pa gcig zhwa nag gi chas gos gyon pa'i grwa pa rnga 'khyer ba bzhi dang rol mo ba gcig sku 'bum thang gi khral pa 'ga' zhig gis gras po rgyal zhes ras dkar po'i phyu pa dang lham rdo gcig ma gyon pa sgal par dar tshon sna lnga'i dar 'phyang lag g.yas par rgyug ris khra bo gcig dang g.yon du phub 'khyer skyes pa rgas pa rgya bo 'dzum bsnyer gdod pa ral pa dkar po thor cog can gyi gdong 'bag cig gyon pa'i 'khor du thod khog dkar ril gnyis dang a tsa ra gnyis sogs dpal gsol ma bcas gtsug lag khang nas thon te thog mar klu sbug (deng sang mang tshogs sgyu rtsal khang gi thang sder )tu gtor zor 'phang de nas khrom gzigs khang gi thang sder )deng sang khrom gzigs khang gi tshor ra )rab skor shar gyi lam dkyil sger bshad sgra'i khang pa'i lho ngos bcas su gtor zor zer 'phen de nyin karma shag gi chos rjes chos skyong bya khri ba khog zhugs kyis mo'i rjes su 'brangs nas dga' ldan dar smyon gyi 'gram nas lha mor gus btud dang bcas phyir log lha mo phebs sa'i mal 'khel du yod pa'i sku drag tsho dang mi drag khag tshos gser skyems dang snyan dar sgron 'bul lam kha'i g.yas g.yon nas mang tshogs tshos mjal kha zhu ba dang snyan dar phul phyir 'khor mtshams 'khyams ra'i ka ring lho ngos su lha mo'i gos thang chen po zhig bkrangs pa'i mdun mchod pa sgrig lha mo'i sku gsob zhal jo khang du phyogs nas bzhugs/_/de gang mnga' gsol gya zhal 'don grub bstun sku gsob lha khang du gdan zhu byed lha sa ba'i bu mo spa phrug thog mar g.yog mkhan phal che bar de nyin spa phrug g.yog mang tshogs tshos de nyin nas dgun chas pags tshag gyon de nub dgongs zas su sha 'bras bza' ba dang po ta la'i zhol du yod pa'i dga' nye tshor yang sha 'bras skyel srol yod}
