dpe cha'i dge rgan|{de sngon gdan sa chen po khag tu slob khrid gnang mkhan gyi dge rgan zhig ste/gzhung chen por slob sbyong byed 'dod pa'i slob gnyer ba der los shis 'tshams pa'i dge rgan zhig khag theg dge rgan gyis 'tshal te de'i drung du slob gnyer mngags bcol zhus pa dang/'dzin grwa gcig gi slob ba tshang mas mos mthun byas te dpe cha'i dge rgan gcig 'tshol ba yang yod/dpe che'i dge rgan gcig gis nyin ris mos gyi thog nas 'dzin grwa mang por dus dang khag bgos te slob khrid gnang mkhan yang yod}
