spur rgyal btsan po'i bang so|{spur rgyal btsan po'i bang so zhes pa 'di ni bod kyi btsan po'i dus skabs su btab pa'i chos rgyal gyi bang so ste bod ljongs lho kha 'phyongs rgyas rdzong khongs mu ra ra'i 'dabs su btab yod/chos rgyal bang sor bang lo ji tsam yod med skor (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )dang/(rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )gnyis ltar na sa der bang lo nyi shu rtsa gcig tsam yod 'dug kyang/da cha de lta bu'i mang po mthong rgyu med pa ni la la dmag 'khrug dang dus zing nang gtor brlag song ba'am/yang na la la char chus 'jig pa gang rung byung bar nges/yang snying bang so kha grangs ji tsam yod med ni mkhas dbang rnams kyis rtog zhig gnang gzhir gyur/da cha ra ri'i 'dabs su bang lo brgyad dgu tsam zhig dngos su mthong rgyu yod kyang bang lo de dag gi nang du btsan po sung dang su bzhugs yod med thad la yang yongs su gtan 'khel ba'i tshig thag gcod par dka'/'on kyang srong btsan sgom po dang/khri srong lde btsan/khri rab pa can bcas kyi bang so ngos 'dzin rgyu'i thad phal che ba gcig mthun yin/da yod kyi bang so rnams ni sa rdos brtsigs pa'i thog leb mo sha stag red/bang so'i zhig kha nas gyang shul bang ring gsal po mthong rgyu 'dug pas gyang star re'i dbar la mtho tshang li'i rmis bco lnga nas nyi shu bar zin/dang thog bang so de dag sten dbyibs gru bzhi yin srid kyang dus yun ring po'i nang nas char chus bshal ba'i dbang gis da cha bang so'i steng thog rnams dbyibs sgor ma yin/mu ra ri'i ri sked mtshams su bang so zhig yod pa de ni/khri lde btsug brtan mes ag tshom gyi bang so yin par grags/bang so de'i g.yas gsham gyi zhing kha'i nang 'gram du rdo ring btsugs pa'i bang so che ba zhig yod pa de ni mnga' bad khri ral pa can gyi bang so yin skad kyang/yang dag min thad zhib dpyad gnang dgos pa yod/_/khri srong lde btsan gyi bang so ni mu/ri'i shar ngos ri zur du btab yod/lo rgyus kyi deb ther nang chos rgyal khri srong lde btsan dgung lo nga drug shing mo glang gi lo la zung mkhar du gshegs/de yang bang so mu ra ri la brtsigs/gral ni yab gyi rgyab ngos g.yas na yod/de ni ma grongs dus nas nyid kyis brtsigs/ming ni 'phrul ri gtsug snang bya ba btags/de yi rtsa na rdo ring gcig kyang yod la/bang songi rgyan can du grags par gyur zhes 'khod yod/chos rgyal srong btsan sgam po'i bang so ni bang so dang po'i g.yon ngos ri gsham gyi chu bo'i 'gram du yod cing/de yang mtha' lcags ris bskor ba'i nang bang so'i sgo nub tu gtan pa la gyang rim pa gnyis kyis bskor zhing/nang du rdo rtsig nyis bskor can steng thog phub pa de'i steng lha khang dmar po sgo shar du (232) gtad pa da yod lha khang mdo sbug gnyis la rgya khyon ka drug gi sa nang rten du rgyal ba byams pa 'khor du phyag g.yas nas brtsis 'phags pa lo ke shwa ra mar me mdzad rgyal ba tshe dpag med phyag rdor bcas dang phyag g.yon du spyan ras gzigs phyag stong spyan stong shAkya thub pa gu ru snang srid rta mgrin dpa' 'jigs dang mdo ru chos rgyal srong btsan sgom po g.yas su rgya bza' blon po mgar ba stong btsan g.yon du bal bzang dang thon mi sam b+ho Ta sogs rten mang du bzhugs la da dung skyi ldebs su mkhan slob chos gsum dang gu ru mtshan brgyad la sogs pa'i ldebs bris kyang mang po yod de bzhin sngar srong btsan lha khang gi nang sgo'i lho ngos su srong btsan bang so'i dkar chag bkod yod skad dang dkar chag nang srong btsan bang so chu bo'i mda' ru chags/_/che chung tshan ni dpa' chen mda' rgyang gang/_/steng gi zheng ni nyag gi rdo rgyang gang/_/nang du lha khang lnga yi bzhugs su gsol/_/bang so nang rgyan can du grags pa yin/_/gsang ba'i mtshan ni mu ri smug po zhes 'dzam bu gling gi nor phud lan gsum bsdus/_/lha klu mi yi skye 'gro'i bde skyid bskrun/_/zhes 'khod yod pa dang da dung lo rgyus kyi yig cha 'ga' re'i nang bang so 'dir re'u mig dgu yod pa'i dbus su btsan po'i sku phung gser gyis btums pa bzhugs shing nang gi re'u mig thams cad nor gyis bkang ba snyigs ma'i dus su bu bos 'jig ste gnas sgo bye rgyu yin pa sogs brjod 'dug mkhas pa la las chos rgyal srong btsan sgom po'i bang so de bang so ang lnga par rtsi ba dang khri srong lde btsan gyi bang so de bang so ang brgyad par 'jog pa gnang yod de ltar phul rgyal btsan po'i bang so de dag gi nang nas khang rnams rtsa zhig song ba phud da lta lhag bsdad rnams rgyal yongs kyi gtso gdan rig dngos sde tshan gyi khongs su gtogs pas rgyal khab nas do dam srung skyob mdzad bzhin yod}
