spyan lnga|{sha'i spyan/lha'i spyan/shes rab kyi spyan/chos kyi spyan/sangs rgyas sam ye shes kyi spyan te lnga/de dag rim bzhin du/1 sha'i spyan rgyal chen bzhi la yod do/_/rgyu gang las byung na zag bcas kyi dge ba las byung/dngos po gcig gis gcig la sgrib par gzigs/2 lha'i spyan ni sum cu rtsa gsum gyi lha la yod do/_/zag bcas kyi dge ba las byung/snod dus gcig la gzigs/3 chos kyi spyin ni sa bcu'i byang chub sems dpa' la yod do/_/dmigs med kyi dge ba las byung/chos so cog kun sgyu mar gzigs/4 sangs rgyas kyi spyan ni sangs rgyas la yod do/_/lta ba sgom las byung/yul kun sku dang ye shes su gzigs/5 shes rab kyi spyan ni rtogs pa dang ldan pa la yod do/bla ma'i drin las byung/yul rnams stong par gzigs so/_}
