spyan snga grags pa byang chub|{lho kha khra 'brug dang 'dab chags pa dgon dkar du dpon rin rdor ba dang/yum za bkra shis skyid kyi sras su rab byung drug pa'i me sprel (1356)lor sku 'khrungs/me stag (1386)lor sku gshegs/dgung lo bcu gnyis la spyan snga rin po che grags pa shes rab kyi zhabs la gtugs te dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa mnos/mtshan yang grags pa byang chub ces gsol/chu mo lo la chos rje bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyis gtsos pa'i dge 'dun nyi shu rtsa gsum gyi dbus su bsnyen par rdzogs par mdzad/rje tsong pa khas kyang 'dir chos 'brel mang po gsan te/rje tsong kha pas mdzad pa'i 'di pa'i rnam thar zhig kyang yod/thob bsam sgom sgrub mdzad tshul sogs lo rgyus kyi yig cha gzhan las shes par bya'o/_}
spyan snga grags pa 'byung gnas|{yab rlangs kyi gdung rgyud yon chen rgyal ba skyabs dang yum 'bro ldog bzang khu byug sman gnyis kyi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i shing lug (1175)lor sku 'khrungs/rje 'di sku gzhon nu'i dus 'bri gung skyob pa 'jig rten mgon po'i zhabs la gtugs te dgung lo bco brgyad nas so bzhi bar bla ma dang 'bral med dug zim g.yog zhus pas spyan snga ba zhes pa'i mtshan yang de nas thogs/phyis rlangs kyi gdung rgyud kyis thel gyi gdan sa 'dzin pa rnams dang/'bri gung ba'i bla ma'i mtshan gnas lta bur gyur nas spyan snga zhes bya ba'i 'bod srol byung/bka' rgyud bstan pa'i chu 'go dpal phag mo grub pa'i thel gyi gdan sa nyag phra bar gyur skabs 'bri gung skyob pas spyan snga grags pa 'byung gnas la gzengs bstod dang bcas rab byung bzhi pa'i sa 'brug (1208)lor phag mo grub pa'i thel gyi gdan sar bsko gzhag gnang bas 'khor lo gsum gyi mdzad pas yar rgyas 'gran zla dang bral ba byung/de nas 'bri gung du dbon rin po che zhi bar gshegs pa'i gdung 'bul du phebs dus gtsang rin po che dang/'bri gung gling pa sogs kyis zhu nan mdzad pa ltar 'bri gung gi gdan sa yang 'dzin skyong gcig lcogs gnang/der (236) bzhugs pa'i lo bdun pa lcags byi (1240)lor hor dmag bod du lhags nas rwa sgreng dang rgyal lha khang mer bsregs pa dang so ston sogs skya ser lnga brgya bsad de skabs hor dmag 'dam du slebs pa'i 'ur byung bas 'bri gung thel gyi dge 'dun rnams kyis 'bros par brtsams pa'i mi 'jigs pa'i gsung gis dbyugs phyung nas bzhugs de yang thog mar hor rgyal dmag dpon mi li byi byung ba sku mthong ba tsam gyis dad pa skye nas phas dang bu'i 'du shes byung nas phyis 'bul ba skyel bar khas blangs te mi phyugs gang la yang gnod pa med par phyir log de nas zhag nyi shu rtsa brgyud nor rtas dmag dpon byas nas dmag slebs byung ba yang 'di nyid kyis thabs mkhas la brten pas zhi ba chen por gyur te dmag rnams tshong pa 'grim pa bas kyang 'jam zhing khu co med par log te phyin chad stabs nyes re tsam ma gtogs mi bsad pa dang lha khang bsregs pa sogs cher ma byung ba bod khams spyi la bka' drin gyis khyab par mdzad de bzhis 'bri gung gi da yang cher 'phel nas khri tsho bco brgyad du grags pa yang dus der byung ring po ches las bsgrubs pa'i sgo mangs gnyis kyang bzhengs rgya gar dang bod kyi lha gdong pa la sogs pa'i dam pa thams cad kyang chos kyis tshim par mdzad mthar dgung lo gya gcig pa rab byung bzhi pa'i shing yos (1255)lo'i hor zla bcu gcig pa'i tshes bco brgyad la sku gshegs gdung bzhu bas ring bsrel dpag tu med pa'am byon bu slob rnams kyis kyang dgongs pa rdzogs pa'i phyir sgo mangs khyad par can zhig kyang bzhengs phyin chad kyang shin tu bkra shis par gyur to/_/bu slob kyang rgyal ba rin po che gcung rin po che rgyal ba yang dgon pa rgyal sras thog kha ba ring po che grags bsod rin po che gtar rgyab pa spyan snga sgo mangs pa snye mdo thams cad mkhyen pa la sogs pa mang du byon no/_/lo rgyus rgyas pa (lho rong chos 'byung )shog grangs 290pa'i nang shog grangs 'ga' zhig dang (deb ther sngon po )le tshan (nya)pa'i shog grangs 74nas 77bar gsal}
spyan snga grags pa rin chen|{rje 'di la phag grub gcung rgya bo'am gnyis mchod pa grags pa rin chen yang zer/rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags khyi (1250)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi bcu pa rab byung lnga pa'i sa glang (1289)lor thel gyi gdan sar phebs te khri dpon zur du ma bskos par bla dpon sbrags ma mdzad/do sngon/rgyal thang/smon mkhar/man kha sogs phag gru'i 'dzin dbang sa sde sngon shor mang po phyag rdzas kyis blu bar mdzad pas/phag gru'i khri bskor la bka' drin shin tu che ba byung/dam pa 'di nyid kyis thel du chos srid kyis mdzad pa lo nyer gnyis bskyangs mthar/dgung grangs drug cu re gcig pa rab byung lnga pa'i lcags khyi (1310)lo'i bod zla gnyis pa'i tshes nyer gcig nyin sku gshegs}
spyan snga ngag gi dbang po|{gong du sde srid ngag gi dbang po zhes par gzigs}
spyan snga nyer brgyad po rdo rje rgyal po|{'bri gung gdan rabs dug pa 'di nyid rin po che rdo rje rin chen gyi gcung por rab byung lnga pa'i shing sprel (1284)lor sku 'khrungs/de nas rim gyis bskyed bsrings te gcen rin po che rdo rje rin chen gyi drung du rab tu byung/mtshan rdo rje rgyal po zhes gnang/dgung lo bdun pa la gling log byung ste kong por grub thob ar rtse la sogs pa rnams kyis spyan drangs/slob dpon pad+ma la sogs bla ma rnams dang/zhi khro rab 'byams kyi dkyil 'khor du ma zhal gzigs pa skyi dgu kun gyis thos/grub thob ar rtse las 'jig rten gsum gyi mgon po'i chos mdzod kun gnas cing/nyams len la brtson pa mthar phyin mdzad/de nas 'bri gung du phebs/dgung lo bcu gsum par (237) gcen rin po che dang mkhas grub dge bshes du ma las mdo sngags rgyud sde'i chos ma lus pa gsan cing don rnams la byang zhing chub par mdzad de nas gnas chen gter sgrom gyi dben gnas rnams su bzhugs shing gnas gsar ma la sogs pa gnas sgo yang mang du phye gzigs snang rnams gtan la phab rdo rje 'jigs byed kyi sku dang tshogs zangs glang lung ma sogs nor gter kha shas bzhes de nas sding rgyal gyi dben gnas su sgrub sde 'debs par mdzad dgung lo so gcig pa shing stag (1314)lor gcen rin po che dag zhing du gshegs pas rje nyid seng khrir mnga' gsol paN chen shAkya shrI'i ring lugs 'dzin pa chos logs tshogs pa'i mkhas chen las bstan pa la yongs su rdzogs shing 'dul ba'i gnas la byang bar mdzad mkhan chen dang dge 'dun rnams la zab chos kyi bzhed pa bskongs sngar gyi lha khang chen mo'i shul du ka brgya dang brgyad cu'i gtsug lag khang grug ste rten gsum bsam gyis mi khyab pa bzhengs dgung lo lnga bcu par bkra shis ljongs kyi gtsug lag khang rten gsum dang bcas pa bzhengs shing gling gi mgon khang a phyi khang du grags pa 'di yang grub cing ye shes kyi mgon po phyag bzhi pa bya seng beng yul bcas bzhengs gzhu smad g.ya' ma rir mgon khang dang sgrub sde yang btab gnas gsum gyi ri pa yang stong phrag tsam brdzangs ri khrod phal cher rim gnyis la brtson pa'i sgom chen gyis khyab par mdzad dus kun tu chos gal che ba rnams sbrug sgo nas gsung ba ma gtogs smra bcad 'dag sbyar la bzhugs shing zab mo'i rnal 'byor las skad cig kyang mi g.yo dbus gtsang gi che dgu zhal mjal la yong ba rnams kyang yol ba phyi nang gi mjal lugs tsam las dngos su zhal mjal dang 'jig rten gyi gsung gleng mi mdzad pa sogs 'phags chen dam pa'i mdzad pa kho nas dus 'da' de ltar lo mang gdan sa bskyangs shing dgung lo drug cu re bdun la phebs pa rab byung drug pa'i lcags stag (1350)lor chos 'phrul du ma dang bcas mya ngan las 'das}
spyan snga pa blo gros rgyal mtshan|{spyan snga pa blo gros rgyal mtshan mchog ni/yul dbus stod lhas lung ba chos grwa dgon gyi zhol grwa rnam khang zhes bya bar yab dgyes dpon chos skyabs dang/yum jo mo bla ma 'bum zhes pa gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bdun pa'i chu rta (1402)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo gsum bzhi nas yi ge sbyor klog sbyangs/dgung lo bdun pa sa byi (1408)lor khu bo kun dga' blo gros kyi drung du rab tu byung/mtshan blo gros rgyal mtshan dpal bzang por gsol/de nas grwa dgon du mkhas chen bsod nams shes rab pa'i drung du phar tshad mthar phyin par mdzad/skyor mo lung du mkhan chen chos rgyal dpal bzang po dang/slob dpon shes rab bzang po gnyis kyi drung du mdo rtsa gsan sbyong gnang/dgung lo bcu bdun pa sa khyi (1418)lor gtsang phyogs su byon/ri bo mdangs can du mkhas grub thams cad mkhyen pa dang/chos rje blo gros pa rnam gnyis kyi drung du tsa 'jug gnyis dang mdo gas kyi chos gsan sbyong rgya cher mdzad/dgung lo bco brgyad par zhu lu gnas snying du phar tshad dang/mdo rtsa/rtsa 'jug sogs kyi grwa skor mdzad/dgung lo bcu dgu pa lcags byi (1420)lor mkhas po yon tan rin chen dang/las slob slob dpon nor bzang/gsang ston rnam par dag pa rnams kyi dbus su bsnyen par rdzogs/de nas sngar gzhug tu rje tsong kha pa chen po dang/rgyal tshab rje/mkhas grub rje/chos rje blo gros pa bcas dga' ldan gyi khri thog phebs pa bzhi dang/gzhan rje btsun 'jam (238) dpal rgya mtsho rje btsun bzang skyong ba gnas brtan chen po chos skyong ba dgyer kun dga' blo gros rin po che gzhon du 'od sogs bcug phrag la nye ba'i mkhas grub dam rnams legs par bsten nas mdo sngags kyi gzhung kun la mkhas shing bstan pa rin po che'i gtsug rgyud du gyur de nas rin chen por 'gro ba'i don mdzad nas mal gro rin chen sgang dang skam dgon du bzhugs te sgrub pa rtse gcig tu mdzad rab byung brgyad pa'i shing phag (1455)lor rin chen nga gi gdan sar phebs ste khri thog bzhugs rje 'di'i zhal slob tu gyur pa bstan pa'i bdag po mang du byon gtso bor rab 'byams pa smon lam dpal chos rje kun legs pa chos rje rab 'byams pa blo bzang sogs ni khyad du 'phags pa yin gsung rtsom yang (theg pa chen po'i bzod pa'i blo sbyong phan bde'i char 'bebs/) (byang chub lam gyi rim pa'i khrid yig gzhan phan snying po'i zung 'jug rin po che/) (dbu ma'i lta khrid chen mo/) (bshes spring gi bsdus don dgongs pa rab gsal )sogs pod 'bring gsum tsam mdzad dgung grangs don gci gal phebs pa rab byung brgya da pa'i chu 'brug (1472)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
spyan snga dpal ldan bzang po|{rje di nyin yab bdag po shAka rin pa dang yun zi na rin 'dzom pa gnyis kyi sras su rab byung drug pa'i chu phag (1383)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo gsum pa la spyan sngar grags pa byang pa las dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa zhus/mtshan dpal ldan bzang por gsol/dgung lo dgu pa la brtan gnyis kyi slob gnyer mdzad/dgung la bcu pa la spyan snga kun spangs pa las chos khrid rnams gsan/mkhan chen grags rdor ba dang slob dpon zhi ba dpal gnyis las rab tu byung/mtshan grags pa blo gros zhes gsol/bla ma chos dpal ye shes kyis chos sgo phyes/dgung lo bcu bzi la rtsed thang du brtag gnyis gsungs/dgung lo nyer gcig la mtshams bcad dpon po mdzad/dgu ngalo nyer gnyis pa mkhan chen sang blo ba dang/mkhan chen rgyal bzang pas las slob/gsang ston mkhas chen dka' bcu pas mdzad de nyen par rdzogs/dgung grangs nyer gsum pa rab byung bdun pa'i shing bya (1405)lor phag gru'i gdan sar phebs/bla ma rin gzhon pa las bka' brgyud kyi gdams pa rnams rdzogs par gsan/phrag gru'i gdan sa 'og gnyis bskyangs nas dgung lo nyer lnga la phebs pa rab byung bdun pa'i me phag (1407)lau'i bod zla bcu ba'i tshes nyer dgu nyin gshegs}
spyan snga tshul khrims 'bar|{dge bshes spyan snga rab byung dang po'i sa stag (1038)lor 'phan po nyan sna ra sgang du yab dbas shAkya rdo rje dang yum me mo ye shes sgron gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/rab byung gnyis pa'i chu lug (1103)lor sku gshegs/dgung lo don drug bzhugs/dgung lo nga brgyad pa rab byung gnyis pa'i shing phag (1095)lor la dgon pa btab/lo rgyus zhib pa las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung )las gsal}
spyan snga rin chen ldan|{rje 'di ni stod ding rir yab yab bsags pa can gyi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i chu khyi (1202)lor sku bltams/dgung lo lnga drug la phebs tsam nas chos la dad zhen drag po 'khrungs/phyis la gnong pa lo lnga bzhes pa ring rir bzhugs pa dang mjal/mos gus thun mong min pa byung/chos 'brel zhus pas bla ma'i rnal 'byor dang/phyag rgya chen po ye shes bzhi pa gsan/de nas pha jo ston pa la 'bri klog la (239) sogs gsan sbyong mdzad lha gdong la dgung lo bcu gcig la phebs skabs slar mjal bas phyag phyir 'brangs te zhi bar gshegs kyi bar lo sum cu so lnga'i ring zhabs drung zhag gcig dang ma bral bar spyan sngar bzhugs pas spyan snga par grags chos rje las gsar rnying gi dbang gdams pa lus la sogs pa thams cad gsan ko brag pa la'ang chos mang du zhus rgod tshang pa'i drung du'ang 'brug skor thams cad gsan sa paN la sa skya ba'i chos skor rnams zhus gzhan yang bla ma mang po'i zhabs la gtugs nas zab chos du ma gsan sgrub pa'i rgyal mtshan btsugs gnas lugs kyi rtogs pa shar phyis ding rir bzhugs nas tshogs pa mtha' yas pa bskyangs pas zur phug pa dang sgrub thob nyi ma mgon la sogs pa'i rtogs ldan gyi slob ma mang du byon 'das lo ma gsal}
spyan bstar zhu rgyu|{mig lam du bsgrigs te bstan rgyu yod par go}
spyan 'dren byed du mi rung ba'i mgron bzhi|{bdag stobs chen/shri pa tra/hon pan klu/yi dwags gter srung bcas bzhi'o/_}
spyan ras gzigs|{(byang chub sems dpa' nye ba'i sras brgyad kyi nang tshan zhig )sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi yi dam gyi lha ngo bo phyogs bcu'i rgyas ba thams cad kyi snying rje'i rang gzugs yin pa/rnam pa longs spyod rdzogs pa'i skur rol pa sku mdog dkar po zhal gcig dang/phyag bzhi ldan/spyi bor rigs ldan bdag po rgyal ba 'od dpag med pa'i dbus brgyan pa zhig tu ngos 'dzin la/spyan ras gzigs kyi sprul pa sna tshogs mdzad pa'i sku'i rnam 'gyur mi 'gyur ba mang du yod pa ni (sgrub thabs rin 'byung brgya rtsa dang ) (sgrub thabs rgya mtsho'i )nang du gsal}
spyan ras gzigs kyi mdo rgyud nyer gcig|{za ma tog bkod pa/phyag stong spyan stong gi gzungs/pad+ma snying po'i mdo/zhal bcu gcig pa'i mdo/bcu gcig zhal gyi gzungs/don yod zhags pa/don zhags phyi ma/pad+ma mchog /dbang bsgyur 'khor lo/cho ga sngags kyi rgyud/yid bzhin nor bu'i gzungs/nga rje chen po mi bshol/'od zer rnam bkod/pad+ma cod paN gyi rgyud/yi ge drug pa'i mdo/dam chos pad dkar/puN+Di ri ka'i mdo/chu klu sna tshogs pa'i mdo/snang ba rol pa'i mdo/mtshan brgya rtsa brgyad pa/mtshan rab yongs su bstan pa'i mdo'o/_}
spyan ras gzigs kyi bye brag lnga bcu|{'phags pa spyan ras gzigs kyi sku yi rnam 'gyur mi 'dra ba lnga bcu lhag tsam yod pa ste/(ba ri brgya rtsa )nas bshad pa dgu/(sgrub thabs rgya mtsho )nas bshad pa nyi shu/(rin 'byung brgya rtsa )nas bshad pa bcu drug /(snar thang brgya rtsa )nas bshad pa bzhi bcas bsdoms bzhi bcu zhe dgu yod cing/de yang 'dra mtshungs rnams phud pa'i rnam grangs yin/zhib par gong gsal rgya gzhung so so'i nang gsal}
spyan ras gzigs 'jigs pa brgyad skyobs|{1 shar phyogs me'i 'jigs skyobs mdzad/zla mdog zhal gcig phyag bzhi pa/_/g.yas pa skyabs sbyin rnga yab 'dzin/_/g.yon pas pad+ma cha shel 'dzin/_/2 shor lhor chu'i 'jigs skyobs mdzad/_/dkar po zhal gcig phyag bzhi pa/_/g.yas pas skyabs sbyin rin chen 'dzin/_/g.yon pas pad+ma 'khor lo 'dzin/_/3 lho ru seng ge 'jigs skyobs mdzad/_/gser mdog zhal gcig phyag bzhi pa/_/g.yas pas skyabs sbyin nor bu 'dzin/_/g.yon pas pad+ma po ti 'dzin/_/4 lho nub glang po'i 'jigs skyobs mdzad/_/dmar gsal zhal gcig phyag bzhi pa/_/g.yas pas skyabs sbyin ut+pal 'dzin/_/g.yon pas pad+ma me shel 'dzin/_/ (240) 5 nub tu rgyal po'i 'jigs skyobs mdzad dmar gsal zhal gcig phyag bzhi pa g.yas pas skyabs sbyin lcags kyu 'dzin g.yon pas pad+ma zhags pa 'dzin/_/6 nub byang klu'i 'jigs skyobs mdzad/_/dkar sha'i mdog can zhal gcig phyag bzhi pa g.yas pas skyabs sbyin rgyal mtshan 'dzin/_/g.yon pas pad+ma gu d+he bsnams/_/byang du mkha' 'gro'i 'jigs skyobs mdzad/_/sngon po zhal gcig phyag bzhi pa/_/g.yas pas skyabs sbyin rtse gsum 'dzin/_/g.yon pas pad+ma b+han+da 'dzin 8 byang shar mi rgod 'jigs skyobs mdzad/_/an+t+ri'i mdog can phyag bzhi pa/_/g.yas pas skyabs sbyin rdo rje 'dzin/_/g.yon pas pad+ma dril bu 'dzin/_/kun kyang zla dkyil zhal 'dzum ldan/_/cung gros dar dang rin chen brgyad tag sham dang bcas sku yid tsam/_/bzung zhing zhabs gnyis sems dpa' yi/_/phyed skyil tshul dub zhugs pa'o/_}
spyan ras gzigs zhi khro|{'phags pa spyan ras gzigs la sku'i rnam 'gyur mi 'dra ba'i dbang du byas na zhi ba dang khro bo rigs gnyis yod pa dang/zhi ba la yang sems nyid ngal gso/don yod zhags pa/lo kai shwa ra/seng ge sgra/yid bzhin nor bu/phyag bzhi pa/phyag stong spyan stong sogs dang/spyan ras gzigs khro bo la/rta mgrin/'khor lo bde mchog /mgon po legs ldan sogs zhi ba dang khro bo bsdoms pa'i rnam grangs lnga bcu tsam du phye srol yod}
spyan ras gzigs rang byon gyi rdo ring|{rdo ring 'di mnga' ris sa khul spu hrengs rdzong zhi bde grong tsho'i lam zur zhig tu yod pa/de ni btsan po'i dus su 'gro khri btsan dgra mgon po rgyal gyis bzhengs}
