spyi mkhan dpal ldan don grub|{mdo smad mu li nas yin pa'i dga' ldan shar rtse'i grwa pa dpal ldan don grub ces pa sger bshad sgra ba dang 'brel 'dris che khar lhag par bshad sgra dbang phyug rgyal pos srid skyong rwa sgreng la ngo rgol byed pa'i 'thab rtsod nang byas rjes che tsam bzhag pas bshad sgra sde srid kyis dpal ldan don grub gzhung zhabs ser mo'i khongs su bcug thog las gnas gal che 'ga' shes 'khur ring gzhung don sems rtsa 'khol zhing/zhib khang las khungs gsar btsugs dang/gzhung rtsis chad lus gtsang bsher sogs byas/de nas dar han mkhan po dang/spyi khyab dang/mkhan po'i 'gan 'khur skabs ham sems je cher song nas bod kyi srid dbang yongs rdzogs rang lag tu thob res tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gnyis pa pha bong kha ri khrod du bzhugs su bcug rgyu dang/srid skyong sde drug gi phyag nas srid 'gan 'phrog sde dpal ldan don grub rang nyid nas srid dbang bzung rgyu sogs kyi 'char gzhi bkod thog sde drug ja sag grags pa shes rab dang/tsha ba a tan sogs dang ngan 'brel gyis bya spyod lag bstas byed bde yong ched bka' blon mtsho sgo mig dmar tshe ring dang phu lung pa tshe brtan rdo rje/mda' dpon khri smon 'chi med rdo rje sogs gzhungs zhabs 'ga' zhig snga rjes su thabs rnam pa 'dra min gyis bkrongs pa sogs kyi gnas tshul 'bras spungs blo gsal gling gi cha ba tsha phyag mdzod nas shes pa dang/don de mkhan po dar mdo sprul sku brgyud sde drug srid skyong la zhus stabs sde drug dza sag dang tsha ba a tan sogs 'dzin bzung byas rjes dpal ldan don grub 'dzin bzung byed nyer kho pas bka' blon bshad sgra tshe ring dbang phyug 'khrid de dga' ldan dgon par bros nas de ga'i grwa pa don dngos mi shes pa khag cig la ngan skul gyis rjes 'ded mkhan gzhung dmag la gog rgol byas stabs dga' ldan dus zing zer ba byung mthar dpal ldan don grub bros 'gro skabs rgya mi'i phur rang nyid kyi dge phrug mgon pos bsad/dus der dga' ldan dgos par gtor bshig phran bu byung ba dang/bshad sgra'i bka' blon tshe ring dbang phyug gnas dbyung gis rgyang 'bud thog bshad sgra'i mkhar dbang gzhung bzhes sogs byas/de nas bzung dga' 'bras drung spyi zhes pa'i tshogs 'du yang 'thor 'dug }
