spyod 'jug|{(byang chub sems dpa'i spyod pa la 'jug pa/) 'di ni rgya gar gyi slob dpon chen po zhi ba lhas mdzad pa zhig yin/mgo nas 'jug bar tshig bcad yin pa go bde zhing blo la 'dzin bde ba yod pa dang/nang don ni theg pa chen po'i byang chub sems sbyong gi man ngag gtso bor ston pa zhig yin/'di la le'u bcu yod cing thog mar rgyal po khri lde srong btsan gyi dus su lo tsA ba sarba dz+nya de ba dang/bod kyi lo tsA ba ska ba dpal brtsegs kyis bod skad du bsgyur ba las sngar phyi 'gyur bcos thengs gnyis byas pa/bstan 'gyur snar thang dpar ma'i mdo phyogs le tshan (pa)pa'i nang yod cing/de'i 'grel pa la rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta mang pos mdzad pa'i nang nas khag bcu tsang gos gsal bstan 'gyur snar thar dpar ma'i mdo phyogs le tshan (sha)pa'i nang yod la/bod du yang grub (244) mtha' ris med kyi mkhas pa mang pos rgyas bsdus sna tshogs mdzad yod pas 'dir 'bri bar ma langs (spyod 'jug )ni bod kyi mkhas pa mang pos cha tshang blo 'dzin thog rgyud du ngag skyor gnang mkhan mang po yod pa zhig yin}
