spyod pa'i rgyud spyir dam tshig khyad par ba bcu bzhi|{lus kyi mi dge ba gsum/ngag gi bzhi/yid kyi gsum bcas mi dge ba bcu spangs pas dge ba bcu la gnas pa dang/dam pa'i chos gtong ba/byang chub kyi sems spang ba/chos nor la ser sna byed pa/'gro ba la gnod pa byed pa ni rtsa ba bzhi ste bsdoms pas spang bya'i dam tshig go}
