sprul sku rim pa lnga|{bod dbus gtsang gnyis su bla ma sprul sku la go sa mtho dman gyi dbang gi rim pa lnga ni/1 rgyal sprul (bla ma sprul sku'i nang nas bod kyi rgyal po gnang myong ba'i sprul sku/) 2 ho thog thu (rgyal po'i sprul sku min kyang man ching gong ma'i srid gzhung dang/tA la'i bla ma/paN chen gsum gang rigs nas ho thog thu'i go gnas sbyin pa'i bla ma'i sprul sku/) 3 tshogs chen sprul sku/ho thog thu'i 'og gi sprul sku go gnas mtho ba tshogs chen 'du khang nang khri mthon po thob pa/) 4 khri sprul (dga' (246) ldan khri pa'i sprul sku/) 5 mkhan sprul (se 'bras dge gsum dgon pa khag gi mkhan po'i sprul sku rnams te grwa tshang sprul sku/)}
sprul sku gsum|{bzo bo sprul sku dang/skye ba sprul sku/mchog gi sprul sku ste gsum/yang na rang bzhin sprul sku dang/'gro 'dul sprul sku/ma dag sprul sku'o/_}
sprul sku bsod nams ye shes dbang po|{sprul sku bsod nams ye shes dbang po ni paN chen bsod grags kyi sprul sku yin zhing/stod lung lam pa'i nye 'khor du rab byung dgu pa'i me 'brug (1556)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi la 'bras spungs su spyan drangs/tA la'i bla ma spu phreng gsum par gtsug phun phul nas bsod nams ye shes dpon po zhes mtshan gnang/dga' ldan khri zur bde ba can pa dang/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa so sor nas dge tshul slong gi sdom pa bzhes/yongs 'dzin dam pa chos dpal 'bar brten nas gzhung lugs la mkhas par sbyangs/dgung lo nyes gnyis la son skabs tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa'i phyag phyir sog yul du byon/al than rgyal pos me tre pa zhes gzengs bstod phul/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gsum pa'i bka' bzhin chab mdo'i kha mchu bsdums pa dang/li thang gi chos sde dang/thub chen gyi sku bzhengs pa'i thugs 'khur bzhes/dbus su byon rjes chos rje chen po skyor mo lung gi khrir phebs te chos 'khor mang du bskor zhing bstan bcos kyang mang du brtsams/chab mdo'i bla mar gdan 'dren byung yang dgung lo so bdun pa rab byung bcu pa'i chu 'brug (1691)lor 'ol khar sku gshegs}
sprul sku'i ngos 'dzin|{bod rab byung lnga pa'i shing sprel (1284)lo ka rma pa rang byung rdo rje sku 'khrungs nas dgung lo lnga la phebs skabs grub thob u rgyan pa rin chen dpal gyis karma pak+shi'i yang srid 'khrul bral du ngos 'dzin zhus/de ni bod du sprul sku'i yang da ngos 'dzin byed pa'i lam srol thog ma de yin/de nas rim bzhin rgyal ba sku phreng rim byon rnams dang/paN chen sku phreng rim byon sogs dgon sde so so'i sprul sku ngos 'dzin zhu ba'i lam srol dar khyab byung yod/bla ma'i sku skye ngos 'dzin zhu ba'i lam srol de ni sangs rgyas chos lugs nang gang ga khyad du 'phags rnams 'gro ba'i don phyir snying rje'i dbang gis 'khor bar yang srid pa len pa zhes pa'i lung la brten nas dar ba zhig yin}
sprul sku'i mtshan nyid lnga|{zhi ba'i lam ston pa/gdul bya smin par byed pa/lung ston par byed pa/'phrin las sna tshogs pa'i rgyun gang 'dul ba'i gzugs ston pa/gzhan gyi rnam rnam rig la snang ba'o/_}
sprul sku'i zhing|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la/sangs rgyas rnams gang la gang 'dul gyi sprul pa ston pa'i gnas/dper na sangs rgyas sku dngos kyis mdzad pa bcu gnyis bstan pa'i gnas rgya gar gyi gnas chen khag lta bu}
sprul sku'i ye shes gnyis|{chos nyid ji lta ba mkhyen pa dang/chos can ji snyed pa mkhyen pa'o/_}
sprul pa'i ldog pas phye na brgyad|{rten/rgyu/zhing/dus/rang bzhin/'jug par byed pa/smin par byed pa/grol bar byed pa'o/_}
sprul pa'i sras brgyad|{chos rgyal srong btsan sgam po/chos rgyal khri srong lde'u btsan/rgyal sras gnya' khri btsan po/'khor 'bangs klu yi dbang po/rgya gar a tsa ra nag po/snyigs ma'i skyabs mgon jo bo rje/te lo prany+dzA pa ra/lha rje tsan dra go mi'o/_}
spre'u rdzing gi gtsug lag khang|{yangs pa can du yod pa'i gtsug lag khang zhig yin par sman gyi gzhi'i nang du gsal}
sprel zla tshes bcu'i gar 'cham|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs lo 'khor re'i sprel lo nam shar gyi bod zla lnga pa'i nang skyor mo lung gi gzhong pa lha chu'i tshes bcu ba'i skyid sdug nang gu ru mtshan brgyad dang/lo 'khor bcu gnyis kyi gar 'cham rgyag gi yod/de dus lo chung zhig gis spre'u'i gdong 'bag dang shubs gyon te lus kyi rtsal rtsed sna tshogs byed cing/rnga rol dang dung rgya 'bud dkrol mkhan tshos zhwa mo 'bog to dang/phrag pa g.yon pa'i steng si shan nam 'bu ras kyi lem ldeng zhig gyon srol/rol mo dkrol mkhan/rnga rdung mkhan sogs tshang ma khyim pa sha stag yin/gu ru rin po che don skabs tshes bcu pa tshos spos sde dang/spyan rgya gtong ba/'jam pa byings rnams mtshan brgyad so so'i zhal 'bag gyon zhing phyag mtshan thogs te 'char rar gral bsgrigs nas don gyi yod/bud med gzhan nu ma gnyis kyis 'cham gos dang 'bag ma na par lha sa khul gyi bud med kyi rgyan gos gza' mtshor spras te gcig gis lag tu me tog gis rgyan pa'i bum pa zhig dang/gcig gi lag tu thod pa zhig thog nas gtso bo'i g.yas g.yon du yong ba de gnyis lha lcam man da ra ba dang/mkha' 'gro ye shes mtsho rgyal gyi tshul byed pa/khong tshos lha sa gtsug lag khang gi khyams ra dang/pho brang po ta la/nor bu gling kha/zhol pa las khungs kyi mdun bcas su 'cham rgyag pa dang/bos sa gnas srid gzhung gi bla brang phyag mdzod dang/rtse phyag /zhol pa las khungs sogs nas kha btags nang gnang sbyin sprod srol yod/= 'cham pa ba'i 'khri khungs thad de snga gzhong pa lha chu'i tshes bcu sogs pa zhes gdong pa lha chu'i nye skor dang/gnam stod/zhang ston/brag smad sogs lung pa phu mda' khag ga mi tsang che khag gi them dud nyi shu skor yod skad dang/spyi zhing son khal gsum tsam yod 'dug kyang rjes su nyung du phyin nas mthar lha chu btsan khang dang/zam gdong chu 'khor/sgrub phug /bde skyin gzhis ka sogs mi tshang drung po des gzhong pa lha chung zla re tshes bcu'i cho ga re gtong gi yod/spel lo shar skabs tshes bcu'i skyid sdug nas gdong dkar rdzong (gzhis )la snyan zhu nas 'cham pa bsdu rub kyis rgan gras tshos byis pa tshor slob pa dang/'jam 'bag phyag mtshan sogs rtsis sprod yod pa phud/dung rgya dang 'cham gos rnams skyor mo lung dgon pa nas g.yar lam yod/gu ru'i lha lcam 'khrul mkhan gnyis gsar byung gzhis dang/rgyang mkhar gzhis la 'khri ba bzhin rgyan gos kyang gzab rgyas gra sgrig byed dgos/'cham pa bo tsho'i 'tsho ba dang/gar 'cham rgyag yul/spyi rdzas do dam sogs kyi 'gan 'khur mkhan spyi khyab pa zhes mi gnyis la rogs byed kha shas bcas yod 'dug }
sprel lo sprel zla|{lo 'khor re'i sprel lo nam shar la sprel lo sprel zla zhes dus chen zhig yod pa ni lo de'i bod zla 5pa'i tshes 15nyin 'bras spungs dgos 'dabs kyi gnas chung dgon par gnas chung chos skyong dang/dga' gdong/bstan ma/phu shar/dan bag zhang kho/yal sna'i klu btsan/pa ro btsan khang/rgyang mkhar/gdong dkar a ril sogs lha khag rnams kyi sku rten la lta khog zhugs kyis gnas chung dgon par skor bar 'gro ba dang/de dus tA la'i bla ma yang gnas chung dgon par phebs kyi yod/de nyid se ra dgon par yang karma shag chos skyong dang nyag bran rgyal chen gyi gtso skyong 'og lcags rong dang/gtsang ral/lcags grongs/nyan bran gra phyi shar/dog bde'i gzhi bdag /sku 'bum thang sogs kyi lha phebs mkhan tsho se ra tshogs chen mdun la phebs te se (248) ra'i gling skor du 'gro skabs lha bdag khang tshan so so'i khang tshan nas lha der zhal ja (ja khu grang mo )dang snyan dar 'bul srol yod}
spro bde khang gsar|{lha sa grong khul rnying pa'i lho ngos su (rgyal kha lam grong lhan khongs )yod pa'i spro bed khang gsar ni dus rabs bcu bdun pa'i nang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas gzim khang sprul sku grags pa rgyal mtshan drags par bzhengs pa rdo rje shugs ldan gyi rten mkhar du gsar skrun gnang ba'i bdag 'dzin dbang cha lho kha ri bo chos gling gi bla ma don grub rgya mtshor gnang ba nas bzung ri bo chos gling dgon nas bdag 'dzin gyis rgyud du bskang gso ba mi gcig yod pa dang/rdo rje shugs ldan sku gsol byed cing/de'i phyi sgo'i 'gram gyi shar ngos su yod pa'i smon skyid khang gsar zhes pa de yang ri bo chos gling nas bdag po byed pa der btsan rgod kha che dmar po sogs khog zhugs byed kyi yod/spro bde khang gsar gyi 'du khang gi rgyal sgo'i steng rgya yig gi ban zhig yod pa de ching rgyal rabs kyi gong ma tA kong skabs bod bzhugs am ban nas gong mar snyan zhu phul te bka' 'khrol byung ba bzhin tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gcig pa dang am ban gnyis gtso bzhugs kyis gnas chung sku brten dang spro bde khang gsar gyi chos rje so sor am ban nas ban re gnang tshul (tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gcig pa'i rnam thar )nang gsal/_}
sprog ma|{me tog 'jog sa'i snod lcug ma las byas pa}
spros pa bcad|{chos kyi bya ba kho na ma gtogs bya ba gzhan dag mtshams 'jog byas pa}
spros pa chod pa|{rang sems kyi spros pa rtsa ba nas chod pa ste sems mi rtog pa'i ngang las g.yo med du gnas pa}
spros bral|{rnam 'byor bzhi'i nang gi gnyis pa spros bral gyi rnal 'byor ni/rang sems skye 'gag gnas gsum gyi spros pa dang bral bar rtogs pa ste/rje rgod tshang pas 'di mdo lugs kyi mthong lam dang/sa bcu'i dbang po rab tu dga' ba'i dod yin par gsungs}
spros med mi rtog ngang la sdod|{sems de yul gzhan la spros pa med pa ste/ma yengs pa'i sgo nas rtog med du 'jog pa'am rnam rtog bzang ngan gang gis kyang dbang du mi gtong bar sems rnam par mi rtog pa'i ngang la rtse gcig tu zhog cig ces pa'o/_/bka' brgyud pas sems la dmigs nas ting nge 'dzin bsgom pa'i skabs rnam rtogs bzang ngan gang gi dbang du yang mi gtong bar sems ga med du 'jog pa ting nge 'dzin dang por bsgom pa'i skabs dang/rnam ga gang skyes pa de nyid la spang blangs ma byas par rang babs su yal bcug pa ting nge 'dzin la goms 'dris cung zad byung ba na de ltar byed pa yin zer}

pha gu|{rtsig pa'i steng du phyi la 'bur ba'i pha gu ska rags bcings pa ltar yod pa/'di brnyan dpar gyi nang mi gsal zhing/yig thog nas ngo sprod byed mi thub/gang ltar spen bad dang rtsig pa dngos gzhi gnyis kyi bar du ska rags lta bu'i rdo rtsig rim pa gcig yod pa de la zer}
pha rgyud|{'di la gsung srol 'dra min yod kyang rje tsong kha pa'i dgongs pa ltar 'chad na/gsang sngags bla na med pa'i rgyud kyi nang sgyu lus gtso bor ston pa zhig la zer/dper na gsang ba 'dus pa'i rtsa rgyud lta bu}
pha rgyud skor gsum|{slob dpon che po b+ha li ma ta a tsa ras bod kyi kha rag gnyos lo tsA bar gnang ba'i pha rgyud skor gsum ste/1 gsang 'dus ye shes zhabs lugs/2 gshin rje dgra nag /3 rdo rje 'jigs byed bcas}
pha gcig bla ma|{rang gi pha dang mtshungs pa'i bla ma'am rang gi pha gcig pa dang mtshungs pa'i bla mar zer}
pha dam pa sangs rgyas|{zhi byed chos lugs bod du thog mar dar bar mdzad pa po ste/'di nyid bod du lan lnga byon zhing/de yang dang po mgrin thang las sgo nas tsA rir byon/gnyis pa kha che nas mnga' ris su byon/gsum pa bal po nas byon pa na yar lung gi smang ra ser po dang mjal te de dang 'grogs nas gtsang du skyo bsod nams bla ma dang/sman ra seng po la gcod skor gnang/bzhi pa shab 'ug ltag sgo nas dbus su rma so kam gsum sogs kyi don mdzad/lnga pa ni de nas rgya gan tu byon/lo bcu gnyis bzhugs nas slar ding rir phyag phebs pa'o/_/pha dam bod du byon pa'i tha ma rab byung gnyis pa'i chu sbrul (1113)lo yin zhing/'di dus pha dam pa'i mkhyud dpyad dkar nag khra gsum khams klong thang sgrom mar gter du sbas/bod kyi lo rgyus thog shod srol la dgung lo lca brgya bzhugs zer ba yang snang/de yang pha dam pa nas brgyud pa'i gcod skor la pho gcad dang mo gcod gnyis las/dang po ni smang ra sen po nas brgyud pa dang/gnyis pa ni ma gcig nas brgyud pa la zer ro/_/lo rgyus cung zad tsam (deb ther sngon po )lcags dpar mar smad cha'i shog grangs (1015nas 1020bar gsal}
pha spad gnyis|{pha dang bu gnyis}
pha bi|{pha rol}
pha bong kha|{pha bong kha'ang sku mkhar ma ru ni grong khyer lha sa'i byang ngos su spyi le brgyad tsam 'das pa na (dbu gdugs ri )yi lho ngos ri 'dabs sug nas la/mtha' 'khor gdugs dang rgyal mtshan sogs sa byad bzang pos rnam par mdzes shing/gtso bo'i 'dzugs skrun sku mkhar ma ru ni shin tu che ba'i rus sbal mo'i dbyibs can rdo pha bong gi steng du 'gying nger gnas/rdo pha bong de ni sa ngos las spyi khri nyi shu tsam gyis mtho zhing/rgya khyon spyi khre sum brgya tsam yod pa dang/mtha' 'khor g.yar gzar che/pha bong kha'i 'dzugs skrun gyi bzo dbyibs ni lho ngos sgor dbyibs dang/byang ngos grub bzhi'i dbyibs dang ldan pa/sgo byang blta rdo skas rim pa dang ldan pa sogs gna' rabs 'dzugs skrun gyi dmigs bsal khyad chos ngo mtshar dang ldan pa mig lam du mngon thub/sku mkhar ma ru ni/pha bong kha'i dkar chag nang gsal bar/gna' dus chos rgyal srong btsan sgom po'i sku ring bal bza' khri (249) btsun gyis lha sa gtsug lag khang bzhengs par dgongs nas rgya tsho bar rtsis brtsis pas rgya bzas bod kyi sa dbyibs 'di srin mo gan rgyal du nyal ba'i dbyibs su gzigs shing khyad par 'o thang gi mtsho 'di srin mo'i snying khrag lta bur yod pa 'di yi gegs ser ched du mtsho srub nas lha khang bzhengs dgos par lung bstan pa ltar mdzad pa'i lha khang nyid mo mis bzhengs pa mtshan mo lha 'dres bshigs nas brtsigs ma thub pas slar yang rgya mtsho bza' la rtsis brtsis pas gnam chago 'di nyid du sa bdag gser gyi rus sbal gyi dbyibs pha mo chen po 'di'i steng du rgyal po'i pho brang zhig bzhengs dgos par bstan pa ltar so phag khro chus bsdams pa las dgu brtsegs bzhengs phyogs bzhir mi 'gyur ba'i gas thag bzhis brtan par byas zhes 'khod par gzhigs nas pha brang 'di lha sa gtsug lag khang gi sngon du bzhengs par nges des chos rgyal yab yum rnams lo gsum tsam bsgrub pa mdzad nas dam bca' ba gnang zhes dang yang bshad srol gzhan zhig la nyin zhig gi zhogs pa srong btsan sgom po dang blon po rnams pho brang dkar po'i yang steng du phebs nas phyogs bzhi'i yul ljongs la gzigs zhib gnang skabs glo bur du byang ngos kyi bde mchog ri 'dabs kyi ljon shin gi khrod du nag ril chen po zhig yod pa gzigs nas rgyal blon thams cad ngo mtshar chen po skyes phyi nyin srong btsan blon po 'ga' dang mnyam du bde mchod rir phebs skabs dngos po nag ril de ni thag zhags kha shas kyis 'jal thub tsam yod pas rdo nag rus sbal pa dang 'dra ba zhig yin srong btsan thugs dgyes nas ngas rgya gar nas phebs grags yod pa'i thu mo sam b+ho Ta mchog la bo brang zhig bzhengs nas bod yig gsar gtod gnang ba'i mthun rkyen bskrun dgos pas sa 'di ni dben zhing nyams dga' ba zhig 'dug la rus sbal 'di yang ngo mtshar can zhig 'dug pas da ni rdo 'di'i steng du pho brang zhig bzhengs chog ces gsungs pa dang btsan pos bka' pham ma thag (sku mkhar ma ru )bzhengs pa'i las 'go tshugs dka' ngal gang 'dra zhig 'phrad kyang de ga'i las mi tshos 'bad pa cher bskyed kyis btsan pos gtan 'khel gnang ba'i thig tshad ltar rtsig rmang brkos shing gyang brtsigs de'i thog khro chu 'khol ma blugs nas rdo dang brtsigs pa yug gcig tu sbrel de nas rim pa re re bzhin rtsig pa bslangs thog brtsegs dgu yod pa'i pho brang zhig mgyogs myur du rdo yi rus sbal gyi sgal ba'i steng du 'gying nger bzhengs pho brang bzhengs nas yun ring ma song bar thu mi sam b+ho Ta rgya gar nas lha sar phyir phebs pa dang chos rgyal srong btsan sgom pos da khyed phebs pa yag byung lam seng sku mkhar du phebs shig bod yig gsar du gtod pa'i las 'gan de khyed kyis bsnams dgos pas khyed kyis khyed nyid gcig pu yin snyam pa'i skyo shas gnang mi dgos ngas kyang nam yang khyed kyi bya bzhag legs 'grub yong ba'i smon lam 'debs chog ces gsungs pa ltar rgya gar gyi yig gzugs lha'i dper byas nas bod kyi dbu can bris te rten 'brel gyi slad yi ge drug ma'i gzungs thu mi rang nyid kyis thog mar bris te rgyal po la yi ge gzigs phud du phul ba de nyid rdo brkos su mdzad pa da cha pha bong kha'i rigs gsum lha khang du bzhugs yod rgyal blon gnyis pho brang 'di ru bzhugs nas lo mang po'i bar rang gi yige dang rig gnas thams cad mkhas par sbyangs mnga' 'og kun la'ang mkhas par bslab tu bcug ste bod yig tho mar spel bar ma zad chos rgyal srong btsan sgom po yab yum blon 'bangs rnams kyis gnas 'dir bzhugs nas mi chos gtsang ma bcu drug gi srol gtod de bod 'bangs rnams chos la bskul mdo rgyud nyer gcig sogs rgya gar nas gdan drangs pa rnams bsgyur sgra mdo gsum dang kun tu bzang po'i bstan bcos brgyad bcas brtsams (250) rje 'di nyid kyi sku dus rgyal po rang nyid kyi thugs bcud phyung ba'i bka' 'bum rin po cher bzhugs pa'i bskyed rdzogs skor sogs nyams su bzhes pa nas rgyal po khri srong lde btsan bar dus skabs de'i ring gos dkar lcang lo'i phreng 'a 'chang ba brgya phrag du mas bsgrub pa mdzad nas bzhugs khyad par bod rje khri srong lde btsan skabs da mi bdun rab tu byung ba nas gnas 'dir dge 'dun gyi sde chags shing de nas rab tu byung ba mang po rgyun du bzhugs nas chos khrims ngad rgyal khrims gnyis ka dar mnga' bdag khri ral par gyi mi rabs mang por mdo sngags kyi chos tshul rmad du byung ba dar rgyas che ba byung yang glang dar mas sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa snubs pa'i skabs thog mar gnas 'di'i dge 'dun gyi da rnams phyir bskrad nas pho brang dgu brtsegs kyang mer bsregs rjes su bka' gdams sku mched gsum gyi nang tshan dge ba'i bshes gnyen po to ba chen pos slob ma bka' babs ming chen brgyad kyi nang tshan ma chod pa kun tu bzang po'i mchod sprin la 'dren nus pa'i bka' babs pa dge bshes brag dkar ba dang 'grogs nas gnas 'dir phebs tshes bcu phug tu bzhugs nas brag dkar ba la gdams pa mang po gnang ba dang sgrub gnas khyad par can 'di nyams rgud gyur pas pha bong kha 'dir dge 'dun gyi sde tshugs la bstan pa dar ba gyis bod 'bangs sems can la bde skyid 'byung ba zhes lung bstan pa ltar brag dkar bas bka' dang du blangs nas tshes bcu ga tu sgrub pa yun ring mdzad de nas pha bong kha chen po 'khod ston dpal 'byor lhun grub gdan sar phebs tshogs pa bzhi brgya tsam 'dus nas dgung lo brgya dang bcu bzhugs pa sogs bka' gdams pa'i dge ba'i bshes gnyen sha stag gdan rabs bdun tsam phebs nas bka' gdams pa'i bzhed la rmad du byung ba zhugs theg chen gyi stod ngos kyi mchod rten brgya rtsa brgyad bka' gdams pa rnams kyis bzhengs shing dge ba'i bshes gnyen rnams kyi gdung dang ring bsrel bzhugs pa'i byin can sha stag dang bka' gdams pa rnams kyi chos gsung dus kyi khri sogs kyang yod de nas skabs shig ring gnas 'dir nyams chags byung yang 'gro ba'i mgon po chos rgyal 'phags pa rgya yul du phebs skabs mar zhor gnas 'dir ched phebs kyis zhig gso mdzad tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa ngag dbang blo bzang rgya mtshos bod yongs la lugs zung gis dbang bsgyur ba'i ring ma chog nyid gnas gnas 'dir pho brang gsum thog dang 'khon ston rin po che'i sku brnyan mi tshad ma bzhengs tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa nas gdan 'dir ched mngags zhabs kyis bcags shing bsnyen sgrub kyi sku mtshams sogs thugs dam nyams bzhes rgyun mi thung bar mdzad chos rgyal srong btsan sgom po pho brang mi 'gyur byams pa gling du yum gyi mnga' du lhums su bzhugs pa dang dus mnyam par rdo'i ldebs la 'od dpag med kyi snang brnyan zhig ri mi ha cang mi gsal ba lta bu byung zhing ji ltar mnga' du gzhon nus 'phel ba de ltar rdo'i snang brtan yang rim bzhin gsal bar byon te chos rgyal gyi mtshan dpe'i sku mchog mngal gyi sbubs las grol ma thag rdo sku rin po che'ang mtshan dpe'i snang brnyan gsar por kun gyi 'dren byed lam du gsal ba zhes bshad srol yod pa de yang pho brang gi rten gtsor bzhugs pha bong gi byang ngos su rtses bcu lha khang du grags pa'i phug par gnas 'di'i sgo srung yin zer ba'i dpal ldan lha mo gtso 'khor gsum snang brnyan rang byon du yod cing der chos rgyal khri srong lde btsun yab yum dang mkhan chen b+ho ti sa twa slob (251) dpon pad+ma sam b+ha ba bcas kyang dngos su zhabs kyis bcags pa yin zer gzhan yang lha bzhi thim pa yin zer ba'i rdo sku spyan ras gzigs sogs khyad 'phags ngo mtshar can gyi sku gsung thugs kyi rten mang dag cig bzhugs deng sang sku mkhar ma ru thog rtse dgu yod pa'i pho brang mthong rgyu med rung rnon gi rus sbal mo'i dbyibs ni sngar bzhin bsdad yon pa de'i thog rgyang ro'i mthong rgyu yod pa 