phag gru khri skor|{thog mar 'bri gung dang phag mo grub pa gnyis sde dgon gcig gi khongs su gtogs pas spyi'i dpon sgom pa shag rin gyis byas/de rjes nyes gnas ldan ma sgom brtson nas spyan snga grags pa 'byung gnas kyi gsol dpon mkhan po chen rgyal bar khri dpon rim par byung/de rjes nye gnas rdo rje dpal ba mdo khams nas bod du slebs te spyan snga grags pa 'byung gnas kyi gsol ja ba byas/bya ba gang la'ang mkhas pas rgya nag tu brdzangs nas/gong ma'i bdun du zhu thabs mkhas pas phag gru khri skor mi rabs nas mi rabs bar 'bri gung par gtan 'jags su dbang ba'i bka' shog dang dam kha bcas thob/rab byung bzhi pa'i shing stag (1254)lo nas lo bcu gsum ring khri dpon byas pa'i ring la/sde gdong/ha la sgang/sna mo/zangs ri pho brang sgang/tshong 'dus brag kha /thang po che gling smad/'phyos gzhis ka /mon mkhar bkra shis gdong/rgyal thang/lcags rtse gri khu/mchod rten gling/chad dkar bcas gzhis ka (254) bcu gnyis brtsigs de nas de'i nu bo gzhon du rgyal mtshan byang gzhon gzhon nu rgyal mtshan gyi tsha bo gzhon du yon tan de rjes ti shri grags pa 'od zer gyis gong ma'i drung du zhu grogs byas te rinapo che gtsung rgyal bo la khri dpon gyi 'ja' sa byung/_/khong gshegs nas rin po che grags pa rgyal mtshan gyi gcen po rgyal mtshan dpal gyis khri dpon byas de nas grags pa bzang po gzhon du rgyal mtshan gyi btsun rgyal mtshan skyabs kyi bar byung de rje tA si'i byang chub rgyal mtshan gyis khri dpon gyi go gnas bzung ba yin zhib par (lho rong chos 'byung )dang stag tshang pa dpal 'byor bzang pos bsgrigs pa'i (rgya bod yig tshang/) spyan snga bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (chos 'byung mig 'byed 'od stong )bcas la gsal}
phag gru rdo rje rgyal po|{'gro mgon phag mo grub pa/phag grub bka' brgyud kyi grub mtha'i srol gtod pa po/rje 'di nyid yab dbas we na a thar dang yum btsun ne gnyis kyi sras su rab byung gnyis pa'i lcags stag (1110)lor mdo khams kyi lho rgyun 'bri lung rme shod kyi stag ngos sab khang du sku bltams/dgung lo dug par bya khri lha khang du mkhan po lding nge ba tshul khrims 'bar dang 'od zer rgyal mtshan las rab tu byung zhing/mtshan la rdo rje rgyal po zhes gsol/mdo khams so lo nyi shu lhag tsam bzhugs ring mkhas grub kyi bla ma bcu drug tsam bsten nas mdo gas kyi chos mang po la gnas bsam legs par mdzad/dgung lo nyer gnyis pa la dbus su byon/bka' gdams dge bshes mang po'i drung nas bka' gdams kyi chos gsan/dgung lo nye shu rtsa lnga pa la zur phur bya 'dul ba 'dzin pas mkhan po dang/dge bshes rgyal dmar gyi las slob/ar gyis gnang ston mdzad nas bsnyen par rdzogs pa dang/mkhan slob las 'dul ba/gsang ston las phar phyin/myang bran las spyod 'jug sogs gsan pas mkhas pa'i rtse mor son/de nas dgung lo zhe gcig pa lcags lug (1151)lor bla ma zhang dang mnyam du sgom por byon nas mnyam med dwags po lha rje'i drung nas chos mang po gsan te slob mar gyur nas lo gsum bzhugs/phyag rgya chen po'i rtogs pa mchog tu yar/zon tu phebs nas mtshal sgang du lo ngo lnga tsam gyi bar bzhugs ring slob ma 'dus pa rnams la dwags po'i gdams pa gtso bor gyur pa'i chos kyi rnam grangs mang pos tshims par mdzad/dge 'dun gang bzhugs pa rnams la rnam pa kun tu dam pa'i chos 'dul ba las mi 'gal ba'i spod pa 'dzin dgos zhes nan gyis gsungs pa dang/gdams ngag btab pa rnams thebs sla zhing bsam gtan gyi sgo mang du skyes pas phyogs thams cad du bstan pa rgya cher 'phel/de yang rje sgom po ba de bka' gdams dang/rje btsun mi la'i phyag chen lugs gnyis ka 'dzin pas bka' phyag chu bo gnyis 'dres su grags pa bzhin mtshal sgam du mdzad pa'i gar gyi nyams dgu yang de dang mthun/de nas dgung lo zhe dgu par rab byung gsum pa'i sa stag (1158)lor phag gru'i gdan sa thel btab ste mnyam med dwags po lha rje'i gdams pa gtso bor gyur pa'i mdo gas kyi 'chad nyan rgya cher spel ba'i rang lugs thun mong min pa de la phag gru bka' brgyud ces grub mtha'i mtshan thogs/byang chub sems dpa' bla ba rgyal mtshan gyi gsung dang mthun par zla ba mar ngor mtshams la bzhugs pa dang/zla ba yar ngo la yang snga dro mtshams mdzad pa dang phyi dro khrid dang tshogs chos gsungs/dge 'dun rnams kyang shing tu dad pas gzim spyil nas chos khri'i bar gyi lam thams cad du zhwa gos dang dar kha la sogs pa 'dings/dge 'dun de rnams nas re re gnyis gnyis tsam ma gtogs sgom btab pa thams cad la myong ba phun sum tshogs pa skyes pas (255) phyogs thams cad du phag mo gru ba'i zhabs drung du slebs pa kho nas chog pa'i snyan pas khyab yon bdag gi bsnyen bkur dang 'bul ba gang byung dge 'dun gyi sde'i thug tshul kho nar smin gtong mdzad gdan sa der sa stag nas lcags stag bar lo ngo bcu gsum bzhugs ring grub pa thob pa'i skyes mchog gi slob ma mang du byung zhing grwa pa brgyad brgya la gdugs thogs lnga brgya zhes pa yang byung bka' brgyud chos lugs la che bzhi dang chung brgyad zer ba'i tshogs pa mang por gyes pa'i nang gi bka' ba rgyud chung brgyad du grags pa ste 'bri gung bka' brgyud dang stag lung bka' brgyud 'brug pa bka' brgyud g.ya' bzang bka' brgyud khro bo bka' brgyud shug gseb bka' brgyud yer pa bka' brgyud smar ba bka' brgyud rnams kyang phag gru bka' brgyud las gyes pa shag stag yin dgung lo drug cu re gcig pa rab byung gsum pa'i lcags stag (1170)lor sku gshegs khong gi slob ma'i gtso bo mthar thug gi bu bzhi ste mos gus mthar thug stag lung thang pa bkra shis rtogs pa'i mthar thug sna phu ba gling ras pad+ma rdo rje shes rab mthar thug spar phu ba blo gros seng ge nus pa'i mthar thug mtshan bu rgyal ras rnams dang gdams pa'i bu bzhi ste skal ldan ye shes seng ge rtogs ldan mi nyag sgom rings grub thob nyag ras se bo kun ldan gtsang pa ras chung de bzhis ro gcig rtogs pa phyed dang bzhi thugs kyi sras bzhi yi ge ma'i bu bzhi nye ba'i sras bzhi gzhan yang grub pa thob pa'i slob ma grangs las 'das pa