phar phyin|{skabs 'di'i phar phyin ni phar phyin drug dang bcu sogs la go rgyud min par phar phyin gyi gzhung la go dgos/phar phyin gyi gzhung ni byang chub sems dpa' byams pas mdzad pa'i (byams chos sde lnga/) (1 (mngon rtogs rgyan/) (mdo sde rgyan/) (rgyud bla ma/) (dbus mtha' rnam 'byed) (chos nyid rnam 'byed )bcas yin/) bstan 'gyur pod (phi)pa'i nang yod cing/slob dpon 'phags pa thogs med kyis brtsams pa'i (sa sde lnga/) ((sa'i dngos gzhi/) (gtan la dbab pa bsdu ba/) (rnam thar bshad pa'i sgo bsdu ba )bcas yin )bstan 'gyur gyi pod (dzi)(wi)(zhi)(zi)('i)(yi)bar pod drug yod cing/de rnams las mang che ba ni rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus lo tsA ba zhang ye shes sdes bod skad du bsgyur ba yin la/'ga' zhig dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i mjug tu rngog lo tsA ba blo ldan shes rab kyis bsgyur ba yin/phal phyin gyi gzhung gi nang don gtso bo ni (yum rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum )gyi brjod don du sbas pa'i dgongs pa rnams/dngos po brgyad (mkhyen pa gsum/sbyor ba bzhi/'bras bu chos kyi sku )dang don bdun cu (rnam mkhyen mtshon byed kyi chos bcu/lam shes mtshon byed kyi chos bcu gcig /gzhi shes mtshon byed kyi chos dgu/rnam rdzogs sbyor ba mtshon byed kyi chos bcu gcig /rtse mo'i sbyor ba mtshon byed kyi chos brgyad/mthar gyis sbyor ba mtshon byed kyi chos bcu gsum/skad cig ma'i sbyor ba mtshon byed kyi chos bzhi/chos sku mtshon byed kyi chos bzhis )bcas su bsdus nas bshad pa yin zhing/gong du bshad pa'i phar phyin gyi gzhung de rnams kyi nang don dbye tshul dang go rim bshad tshul bcas rgyas bsdus 'dra min sna tshogs yod kyang nang don gtso bo ni de dag yin/gzhan yang bod kyi chos lugs ris med kyi mkhas pa mang pos brtsams pa'i phar phyin gyi gzhung gi 'grel pa ni mtha' yas so/_}
phar phyin gyi sems bskyed nyer gnyis|{byang sems tshogs lam chung ngu ba'i rgyud kyi 'dun pa dang mtshungs ldan gyi sa lta bu'i sems bskyed/byang sems tshogs 'bring po ba'i rgyud kyi bsam pa dang mtshungs ldan gyi gser lta bu'i sems bskyed/byang sems tshogs lam chen po ba'i rgyud kyi lhag pa'i bsam pa dang mtshungs kyi zla ba tshes pa lta bu'i sems bskyed/byang sems sbyor lam pa'i rgyud kyi sbyor ba dang mtshungs ldan gyi me lta bu'i sems bskyed/('di bzhi la mos pa spyod pa'i sems bskyed zer )sa dang po ba'i rgyud kyi sbyin pa dang mtshungs ldan kyi gter lta bu'i sems bskyed/sa gnyis pa'i rgyud kyi tshul khrims dang mtshungs ldan gyi ring po che'i 'byung gnas lta bu'i sems bskyed/sa gsum pa ba'i rgyud k+khayi bzod pa dang mtshungs ldan gyi rgya mtsho lta bu'i sems bskyed/sa bzhi pa ba'i rgyud kyi brtson 'grus dang mtshungs ldan gyi rdo rje lta bu'i sems bskyed/sa lnga pa ba'i rgyud bsam gtan dang mtshungs ldan gyi ri'i rgyal po lta bu'i sems bskyed/sa drug pa ba'i rgyud kyi shes rab dang mtshungs ldan gyi sman lta bu'i sems bskyed/sa bdun pa ba'i rgyun gyi thabs kyi phar phyin dang mtshungs ldan gyi dge ba'i bshes gnyen lta bu'i sems bskyed/sa bdun pa ba'i lhag bsam dag pa'i sems bskyed zer )sa brgyad pa ba'i rgyud kyi smon lam gyi phar byin dang mtshungs ldan gyi yid bzhin nor bu lta bu sems bskyed/sa dgu pa ba'i rgyud kyi stobs ldan gyi phar phyin dang mtshungs ldan gyi nyi ma lta bu'i sems bskyed/sa bcu pa ba'i rgyud kyi ye shes kyi phar phyin dang mtshungs ldan kyi dri za'i glu dbyangs lta bu'i sems bskyed/yang dag pa gsum la gnas pa'i sems dpa'i rgyud kyi (258) mngon shes lnga dang mtshungs ldan gyi rgyal po lta bu'i sems bskyed yang dag pa gsum la gnas pa'i sems dpa'i rgyud kyi bsod nams dang ye shesi tshogs gnyis dang mtshungs ldan gyi bang mdzod lta bu'i sems bskyed yang dag pa gsum la gnas pa'i sems dpa'i rgyud kyi byang phyogs so bdun dang mtshungs ldan gyi lam po che lta bu'i sems bskyed yang dag par gsum la gnas pa'i sems pa'i rgyud kyi snying rje dang lhag mthong dang mtshungs ldan gyi bzhon pa lta bu'i sems bskyed yang dag pa gsum la gnas pa'i sems dpa'i rgyud kyi gzungs dang spobs pa dang mtshungs ldan gyi bkod ma'i chu lta bu'i sems bskyed byang sems sa bcu pa ba'i rgyud kyi chos kyi dga' ston dang mtshungs ldan gyi sgra ldan lta bu'i sems bskyed (sa brgyad pa ba'i rgyud kyi smon lam phar phyin dang mtshungs ldan gyi yid bzhin gyi nor bu lta bu'i sems bskyed nas sgra snyan lta bu'i sems bskyed sangs rgyas kyi sa'i sbyor bas bsdus pa 'di man gyi sems bskyed dgu ni rnam par smin pa'i sems bskyed yin no )gtso bo longs sku'i rgyud kyi bgrod pa gcig pa'i mal dang mtshungs ldan gyi chu bo'i rgyun lta bu'i sems bskyed gtso bo sprul sku'i rgyud kyi thabs mkhas dang mtshungs ldan gyi sprin lta bu'i sems bskyed dang nyer gnyis so/_/(mtha' ma gnyis ni sangs rgyas kyi sa'i sems bskyed de rig pa spangs pa'i sems bskyed zer/)}
