phu tho hran|{{(WP:1,194)}rgya nag gi nang pa'i gnas ri rtsa chen bzhi'i nga rgyal zhig ste kre cang zhing chen phu tho rdzong khongs su yod cing/kra'u hran gling tshom gyi khongs su gtogs/phu tho zhes pa ni legs sbyar gyi skad po ta la zhes par zur chag pa dang/grub 'dzin gyi don yin pas bod mis grub 'dzin dang po zhes (bon gyi pho brang po ta lar grub 'dzin gnyis pa zer )brjod/nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i shod tshul la ri bo de lung gis zin pa'i spyan ras gzigs kyi gnas ri yin pa dang gna' rabs rgya gar gyi grub chen zhig gis 'dir sgrub pa yun ring mdzad stabs 'phags mchog spyan ras gzigs kyi zhal dngos su gzigs te khong la kha mdog bdun ldan gyi nor bu zi 'od 'bar ba zhig gnang ba nas bzung mahwa tsi na'i skye bo rnams kyis ri bo 'di 'phags mchog spyan ras gzigs dngos su bzhugs pa'i gnas su ngos bzung nas (260) rgyal rabs rim byung nang dge 'dun gyi sde btsugs shing rten bzhengs bsam gyis mi khyab pas zhe rgya'i yig char gsal la phu tho hran gyi phyogs bzhi mtsho yis bskor cing yul ljongs rab tu brjid pas mi tshos gnas 'dir mtsho gling chos kyi zhing khams {(WP:1,194)}zhes mtshan gsol}
