pho brang 'phang thang|{rgyal po khri lde gtsug brtan gyi dus gsar du brtsigs pa'i pho brang zhig yin cing/sa gnas gang du yod med dpyad gzhi ma rnyed/pho brang 'di rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis bsam yas gtsug lag khang ma brtsigs gong du chu log byung ste chus khyer zhes bshad/(dkar chag 'phang thang ma )zer ba de pho brang 'di'i nang du bzhugs pa'i bka' bstan 'gyur rigs dkar chag tu bkod pa zhig yin pa de ni btsan po'i skabs bkod pa'i dkar chag gsum gyi nang nas tha ma de yin paragasungs pas/pho brang 'di rjes su slar yang nyams gso byas pa dang/khri lde srong btsan gyi skabs pho brang 'dir bzhugs pa'i bka' bstan 'gyur rnams dkar chag tu bkod pa yin 'dug }
