pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas|{mi dbang po lha bsod nams stobs rgyas ni rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa sbrul (1689)lor yab pad ma rgyal po dang yum sgrol ma bu khrid gnyis kyi sras su 'brum pho lhar (deng skabs pa snam rdzong 'dus byung chus )'khrungs/khong 'tsho bzhugs ring la bod du rgyal po lha bzang gis sde srid dmar gsod btang ba dang/jun gar bas bod kyi sa gnas mang po drag shugs kyis btsan bzung byas te/bod la lo bdun cu don lnga tsam dbang sgyur byas pa'i go shri'i mi rgyud k+khayi rgyal po mtha' ma lha bzang dmag thog tu bkrongs nas jun gar bas lo gsum tsam ring bod la dbang bsgyur ba dang/gong ma'i dpung tshogs kyis tA la'i bla ma bskal bzang rgya mtsho spyan drangs te lha ldan du 'byor nas stag rtse sde srid sogs dmar gsod btang ba/jun gar bas bod kyi sa gnas mang po drag shugs kyis btsan bzung byas te/bod la lo bdun cu don lnga tsam dbang sgyur ba'i sa pa'i go shri'i mi rgyud kyi rgyal po mtha' ma lha bzang dmag thog tu bkrongs nas jun gar bas lo gsum tsam ring bod la dbang bsgyur ba dang/gong ma'i dpung tshogs kyis tA la'i bla ma bskal bzang rgya mtsho spyan drangs te lha ldan du 'byor nas stag rtse sde srid sogs dmar gsod btang ba/yang lo shas nas dgung blon rnams 'gal zlar gyur te nang khul du dmag 'khrug shugs chen byung ba'i mthar man cing gong ma'i dmag dpung thengs gnyis pa bod du 'byor nas nga lum sbyar gsum sogs khrims kyi chad pa drag pos dmar gsod btang ba sogs g.yul 'gyed zang zing yo lang che zhing/chab srid thog g.yo 'gul che ba'i dus skabs shig yin la/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho dang/paN chen sku phreng drug dpal ldan ye shes/zhogs don yod mkhas grub/mdo mkhar zhabs drung tshe ring dbang rgyal sogs bod kyi lo rgyus thog tu chos dang/srid dang/rig gnas bcas thad kyi grags can mi sna 'bor chen thon pa'i dus skabs shig kyang yin pa dang/mi dbang pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas kyang dmigs bsal gyi dus skabs de 'dra zhig tu thon pa'i grags can mi sna'i gras shig yin/khong ni byis pa'i dus nas smra mkhas shing/drag shul che ba/mtshon cha'i rigs la gces par 'dzin pa/'thab 'byed kyi rtsed 'jor shin tu spro ba zhig yin/shes byar slob gnyer byed pa'i dus su bri klog gi rim pa mtha' dag la byang chub par gyur/rjes su smin grol gling du song nas rig pa 'dzin pa gter bdag gling pa'i zhabs la gtugs nas slar yang sbyangs shing thog yi ge 'bri ba nas bzung ste rig pa'i gnas la sbyang brtson zab pa mdzad thog /pho rtsal dgu la sogs pa'i sgyu rtsal gyi rnam par byang chub pas na lha bzang khang gi gzigs pa chen po thob ste srid kyi bya ba'i rim pa dang yig rtsis bslabs pa ma zad/rgyal rtse'i rdzong dpon du bskos/lcags stag (1710)lor 'dam ku sha tshal du lha bzang gi sger nyar drung yig tu bskos/pho lha bas lha bzang khang la bsam pa rnam dag gis bya ba bsgrubs shing hor sbra nag khag bzhi ngo log pa slar yang rang khongs su bsdu ba'i g.yul 'gyed dang/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing rta (1714)lo'i bod 'brug dmag khug skabs bcas la g.yul gyi kha lo bar song nas byas rjes bzhag pa ma zad/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me bya (1717)lor jun gar pa tshe ring don grub kyis rgyal po bzang la tshur rgol byas par 'gog rgol gyi dmag 'thab nang du dpung gi kha lo bsgyur te g.yul bshams pas pho lha ba rang gi rkang par mdel phog nas rmas par gyur pa sogs rgyal po lha bzang nam bzhugs kyi bar du zhi drug gi bya ba thams cad 'bad pas bsgrubs/jun gar pas rgyal po bzang bkrongs te dbang bsgyur cing/lha bzang gi mnga' zhabs dpon rigs dang mnyam du mi dbang pho lha yang btson du bcug /lo na bdun cu lhag tsam slebs pa'i sde pa stag rtse ba lha rgyal rab brtan sring skyong la (276) bskos pa'i rjes su stag rtse bas zhu ngo byas te mi dbang po lha khrims mun nas glod bkrol btang sa khyi (1718)lor pho lha bas thabs mkhas kyis sde srid stag rtse pa dang jun gar tshe ring don grub la re zhus ltar gnya' nang rdzong sdod du bsko gzhag byung de rjes pho lhas nad brdzun btab ste steng gdon gyis zin nas zhabs g.yon ma sa la 'dzugs mi 'thub pa'i rdza la brten nas 'brum po lhar gnas bcas te gong ma'i dmag rogs bsgugs pa dang yang phyogs gcig nas khang chen nas la sogs pa'i sde dpon rnams dang 'brel mthud kyis jun gar par rgol rgyu'i skul slong grabs gshom legs par byas rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags byi (1720)lor stod gtsang phyogs nas pho lha nas dang khang chen nas kyis dmag bskul ba dang ding si cang jun gyis gtsos gong ma'i dpung tshogs kyis mdo khams brgyud yong ba/yan cang jun gyis gtsos gong ma'i dpung tshogs kyis tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa spyan drangs te byang brgyud nas lhags pa dbus nas sde pa nga phod sogs kyis jun gar bar ngo log ste sku 'bum phyogs su skyabs zhur bcar ba sogs la brten jun gar ba'i dpung tshogs rnams phyir 'then mi byed ka med du gyur de nas sde pa stag rtse ba sogs jun gar bas bskos pa'i dpon rigs rnams khrims kyis tshar bcad pa dang sbrags lcags glang (1721)lor pho lha bar tha'i ji'i cho lo dang sbrags bka' blon du bskos chu yos (1723)lor man ching gong mas pho lhar dbus gtsang gi bka' slob kyi bya byed mkhan rdo ring rol pa'i li'i tham ga zhes pa zhig gnang skabs de'i bka' blo gtso bo da'i ching bA dur dang nga lum sbyar gsum pho lha ba bcas mnyam sbrel gyi dbang bsgyur lo drug byas ring mthun sgril mnyam rub ma thub pas 'gal zla che cher song nas nga lum sbyar gsum gyis khang chen nas dang pho lha ba gnyis tshar gcod bya rgyu'i gros mthun byung mtshams pho lha bar mdo mkhar zhabs drung gi gnang brda byung ste gzhis bzhugs lha lcam chab gzhi'i snyun gzhir kha 'dogs kyis gzhis 'khor du dgongs zhu byas te gsang ba'i thog 'brum po lhar thon mi ring bar rab byung bcu gis pa'i me lug (1727)lo'i hor zla drug pa'i tshes bco brgyad la srid skyong khang chen nas da'i ching ba thur nga lum sbyar gsum gyis bkrongs shing skyid pa thang pa sogs kyis sne drangs te dpon dmag sum brgya skor 'brum po lhar mngags te pho lha ba yab sras tshar gcod bya rtsis byas kyang pho lha bar de sngon nas gsang brda byung yod stabs yul gzhan du byol zin pas 'bad pa stong zad du gyur de nas pho lha tha'i jis stod mnga' ris su song nas da'i ching ba thur gyi gcen po mnga' ris sgar dpon dga' bzhi pa dang sa dga' phyogs kyi us ching no yon la sogs pa'i dpon rigs dang mda' dpon khag gi dpung shugs zla bsgril te da'i ching ba thur bsod nams rgyal po'i dgra sha len rgyu'i 'bod tshig gi 'og tu rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me lug (1727)lo'i bod zla bdun pa'i tshes bcu bdun nyin sa dga' nas pho lha ba dang lcang lo can pas gtsang dang stod mnga' ris kyi dmag khrid te dbus la shar lum pa ba dang sbyar ra ba dbus dang dwags kong gi dpung tshogs gtsang du btegs nas phan tshul dgra 'thab lan 'ga' byas lo der gtsang dmag re zhig rgyal rtse nas phyir 'then byed dus pho lha bas lha rtse dmag sar nas gong ma g.yung kreng la dpung rogs yong ba'i yi ge btang dbus gtsang sde gzar gyi ming gsod khrag sbyor de la gtsang nas paN chen rin po dang dbus nas dga' ldan khri pa se 'bras dga' gsum rgyud grwa stod smad bcas kyi bla ma las sde sogs kyis chings mol gnang bar pho lha bas khas ma blangs 'di tsam nas bzung ste pho lha tha'i jir mi dbang skur zhabs zhes (277) dbus gtsang gi ljongs kun tu grags par gyur lam bar du skyid grong dang khyung rdzong dkar po'i na mo las 'dzin lcags sbrag pa zhes bya ba dang yang grong pa zhes bya ba gnyis la bka' bgros te ne pa la'i ma chod rten chen po bya rung kha shor de nyid gsar du bskrun pa dang mi gnyis pa'i nyams gso dpyis phyin pa byed dgos pa'i mngag bya byas de nas kha rol la dang 'bras khud bcas kyi sa gnas su nga lum sbyar gsum gyi dpung dang g.yul mon par bsres kyang gnas skabs kyi pham nyes byung ste sa dga' bar du phyir 'then byas pha rol gyi dpung tshogs rnams kyis rjes 'ded nas ngam ring bar slebs te stod gtsang gi mi sel la rdab gsig chen po btang bas mi rnams khong khro ba'i skabs der pho lha bas slar yang skul slong byas te dpung 'jug thengs gnyis pa'i shul lam du zhugs rim bzhin lam bar du rgyal rtse sogs la g.yul bsre ba cung zad re byas te mthar 'phan yul brgyud gar ba'i nye 'dabs su 'byor nas dmag sgar btab de'i tshe dgung blon lum pa ba dpung dang bcas pa dga' mo 'brang bsrung ba'i slad du lhags nas rgyab ri dang 'phrang lam gyi btsan sa bzung nas 'dug pa na pho lha bas mtshan thog tu me'i 'khrul 'khor ldan pa'i dmag mi sum brgya mngags nas dga' mo 'phrang gi ri bo mtho zhing mtho ba'i ri rtse bskor te ri rtser btsan sa bzung nas gnas pa'i lum pa ba'i dpung tshogs rnams rim gyis pham par byas shing tho rengs nam langs su nye ba na mi dbang ring nyid kyis ru sne drangs te drag shugs chen pos phar rgol gyi g.yul bsres pa na pha rol gyi dpung tshogs rab tu pham te byer zhing lum pa ba rang nyid kyang 'khor nyung du dang bcas ral gri yang bor nas lha ldan pho brang chen po'i chab sgo'i nang du ma slebs bar la ral rgyugs su bros de mur mi dbang pho lha ba dang dpung tshogs kyis rjes bsnyegs te lha ldan ra sa dang bcas pa blangs nas skabs der rgyal yab bsod nams dar rgyas dang nga lum sbyar gsum dang dpung gi lhag ma rnams gnas bca' yul gru 'dzin gnyis pa'i pho brang gi mtha' nas dpung tshogs chen pos bskor te rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa sprel (1728)lo'i zla lnga pa'i tshes nyer drug nyin nas bzung mi dbang pho lhas bod kyi mnga' ris dang bcas par dbang bsgyur skabs der mi dbang pho lhas tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho ni de'i ching ba thur dmar bsod gtong mkhan dang dmag 'khrug slong mkhan gyi byed gte zhig la ngos bzung ste lha rtse nas gong mar phul ba'i zhu yig nang du tA la'i bla mas btang ba'i dbus kong sog po dang bcas nas gtsang pa'i pho rnams mthong tshad bsad mo rnams bkol spyod khang pa mer bsreg 'di lo'i lo thog thams cad gtor brlag tu gtong ba sogs mdor na bsam spyod gyi yul dang bral ba byed 'dug pas bod kyi skye 'gro'i bde skyid dang bstan pa rin po cher dgongs pa'i bdag po chen po'i dpung chen bden thog tu 'khyol ba zhig gis tshar gcod rjes 'dzin 'phral du brtse bas ma bzung tshe gtsang mnga' ris dang bcas pa'i dmag mi rnams blo pham che nges yong 'dug pas nged rnams snying rje'i ra ba nas ma 'dor ba zhig mkhyen zhes bkod yod pa ma zad rtse pho brang chen po dpung tshogs kyis bskor ba'i rjes su tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun par bzhugs bzod mi bde ba'i 'jigs skul dang sbrags zhi thabs kyi sgo nas nga lum sbyar gsum rtse pho brang gi phyir phyungs thog rang rang so so'i shag tu dmag mi sum rgya res bskor te bzang btson lta bur bzhag rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa bya (1729)lo'i bod zla bcu pa'i tshes gnang gang nyin a li khan am ban dang mi ring 'dzang gi dpung dmag stong phrag bcu dngabacas lha sar 'byor zhing de nas mi ring bar pho lha ba dang gong ma'i dmag (278) dpung gis lha sa ba ma ri'i 'dabs su nga lum sbyar gsum gyis gtsos pa'i le gtogs pa rnams 'khrid de lus kyi cha shas lcags kyus bzung zhing sha bcad nas kha la 'dzud pa dang mig ya gcig bton nas ya gcig la ston pa lto ba nas rgyu ma drangs te khar 'dzud pa sogs zad mi shes pa'i sdug la sbyar nas bkums pa dang de dag gi nye du dang bu phrug tsho yang dus gcig la srog thog tu btang lo de'i bod zla bcu gcig par rgyal dbang sku phreng bdun pa mchog dang gang gi yab rje sogs mdo smad phyogs su phebs dgos byung bas bod kyi srid dbang cha tshang pho lha bas bzung lcags sprel (1740)lor gong mas pho lha phar dbus gtsang gi bka' slob kyi bya ba byed mkhan rdo ros kyun wang gi tham ga dang gzengs bstod bya dga' dngul srang chen khri phrag gsum bstsal nas bod kyi srid skyong du bskos pho lha bas bod kyi chab srid lo bcu dgu skyong ring thog mar chos srid gnyis thad kyi dgos par gzhigs nas se 'bras dga' gsum so sor gzhis 'phangs gang 'tshams sbyor 'jags su phul ba dang ris ma ma mchis pa'i dge 'dun gyi sde mang por gdan sa gsum gyi tshogs chen nyams gso dang gsar bzhengs bod yul du jag rkun dang khram pa sogs gtsang bsher rta zam gyi srol 'dzugs lha ldan gtsug lag khang du gser zangs las grub pa'i byams chen dang rtse mor bde gsang 'jags gsum gyi blos blangs dkyil 'khor dga' ldan gser khri'i dbu thog rgya phibs dga' ldan du rgyal ba'i bka' 'gyur rin po che gser bris ma g.yas bzhag sogs bzhengs lhag par rgyal mchog tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho'i skabs rgyal ba'i bka' 'gyur rin po che par shing brko rgyu 'phro lus kyi 'phro bskyangs bstan 'gyur rin po che'i gsung par dbus gtsang phyogs su med gshis shing par ma phyi par brkos kyis dpal snar thang phyogs su bzhugs su gsol gdan sa gsum gyi mtshan nyid kyi yig cha mtha' dag par du brkos dngos 'brel dga' ngal lci che ba'i chab 'bangs kyi rkang 'gro lag 'don sogs kyi khral rigs rtsa chag gtong bsogs byas kyang rgyal dbang mchog la snga phyir dgongs babs shig rang ma zhus pa lcang skya rol pa'i rdo rje'i rnam thar nang bod kyi srid skyong pho lha ba bsod nams stobs rgyas spyir bstan pa dang bstan 'dzin bcas par gus mchod lhur len pa dang dpa' mdzangs brtul phod pa sogs lugs gnyis char nas bsngags 'os pazhig yin 'dug kyang rgyal dbang thams cad mkhyen par gting nas mi dad cing log sgrub mang du bgyis zhes gsungs so/_/mthar rab byung bcu gsum pa me yos (1747)lo'i zla gnyis pa'i tshes gnyis nyin pho lha ba'i mthing par gnyan 'bur drug pos zin te gshegs}
phogs khang las khungs|{'di ni de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi gsham 'og las khungs shig ste bod rang byung bcu gsum pa'i chu stag (1782)lor gong ma tshan lung gis rgya sbyong dmag gsar 'dzugs dang 'brel dmag phogs ma rtsa dngul 'bab kyang gnang ba las btsugs pa'i las khungs shig yin/las khungs 'dir las byed do dam mi sna ni rtse shod mkhan rim gnyis rang las med cing/'di la lha sa phogs khang yang zer/'dis gong gsal dngul 'bab skyed gtong gis dmag phogs rgyag sprod dang/phyin rdzogs gnyis gzhung 'dzin rjes drung rigs ser skya dang/dmag sgar khag sogs kyi phogs yig skur gtong byed rgyu'i 'gan dbang spyod pa yin}
