phod mdo'i mkhar shul dang phod mdo lcags zam|{'phan po lhun grub rdzong phod mdo shang phod dam grong tsho'i byang sos ri sna'i steng mkhar shul de rwa sgreng dgon pa 'debs sar phul te dpon po dang rang 'brom ston gyi lung bstan pa bzhin skyid shod lung pa'i phu dang zhang lung pa (rwa sgreng chags pa'i rgyud )dang/sprag lung pa (stag lung gi rgyud )dbu ru lung pa bcas kyi mdo phu gcig dang mtho gsum 'khel yul der rdzong mkhar brtsigs nas gzhis chags pa'i shul yin la bar skabs shig phod mtho rdzong khang dang yang der byas shing/rjes su rdzong de grong gi dkyil du gsar rgyags byas nas ri steng gi rdzong de gyang ror song skad/phod mdo gtsang po'i thog gi phod mdo lcags zam ni spyi lo'i dus rabs bco lnga pi nang grub chen thang stong rgyal pos lcags zam mang po gsar skrun gnang ba'i thog ma de yin skad dang/bod rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags glang (1961)lo bar zam pa de bod kyi byang phyogs nas lha sar yong sa'i 'grul lam lte ba zhig yin/sngon dus ching rgyal rabs skabs am ban gyis phogs khang zhig phod mdor btsugs myong la/bo sa gnas srid gzhung gi tshwa sho zhig kyang yod thog bod zhi bas bcings 'grol thub nas khron bod dang mtsho bod gzhung lam sde mthun ma zin par mi dmangs bcings 'grol dmag gi phogs khang zhig kyang 'dzugs myong yod/lcags thag bzhi bsgrigs kyi steng pang leb bting ba dang g.yas g.yon lag 'jug rgyun bu 'grim pa'i thag pa sbom po zhig yod cing/dbyar kha bu bos rgyas dus zam lcags la chu thug pa dang/mi 'gro skabs yom yom che bas yul de'i mi phud/de min 'grul pa zam steng 'gro mkhan tshang ma zhed sdang skye yi yod stabs dmangs gzhas su yang/phod mdo lcags kyi zam pa/_/dmyal ba'i 'phrang las dog pa/_/zhes zer srol byung/dmangs gtso'i bcos bsgyur rjes zam pa gsar skrun gyis ar 'dam rdo rtsig gzhu dbyibs can gyi zam chen rlangs 'khor shar gtong thub pa zhig bskrun kyang/zam rnying gi lcags thag rnams gna' shul khongs su srung skyob byas te da lta tshang ma mthong rgyu yod}
