phyag rdor zhi khro|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags nas bshad pa'i phyag na rdo rje la zhi ba zhal gcig phyag gnyis pa dang/zhal gsum phyag drug pa sogs mi 'dra ba dang/khro bo la 'byung po 'dul byed/gos sngon can/gtum po khyung lnga/'khor lo chen po/mdud rtsi'i thigs pa/lcags sbugs can sogs mi 'dra ba 'ga' zhig yod pa de dag gi bzhugs stangs du sku mdog phyag mtshan bcas zhib par (sgrub thabs rin 'byung brgya rtsa )nang du gsal}
phyag na rdo rje'i che ba dgu|{phyag na rdo rje me lce sde brgyad gnad la 'bebs pa'i che ba bsnan na dgur yang grags}
phyag na rdo rje'i che ba brgyad|{1 'khor lo chen po dbang gi che ba/2 gos sngon can chos skyong gi che ba/3 'byung 'dul me dmigs kyi che ba/4 rnam 'joms khrusi che ba/5 a tsar+ya drag sngags kyi che ba/6 gtum po khyung gi che ba/7 phyag rdor mdo lugs mdze sogs kyi che ba/8 b+ha ba ma gdams ngag gi che ba rnams so/_/de'i steng du phyag na rdo rje me lce sde brgyad gdan la 'bebs pa'i che ba bsnan nas dgu 'dren pa'ang snang ngo/_}
phyag nang|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs rtse po ta (281) la'i 'phral bde las khungs dang bla phyag las khungs kyi las bya skya bo dkyus ma'i gras te phyag mdzod nang gzan zhes pa'i tshig sdud byas pa yin}
phyag phyi la gnyug mar gnas pa|{phyag phyi ni zhabs phyi'am g.yog po/gnyug mar gnas pa ni rgyun du lhan du gnas pa'am gnas der zla phyed yan gnas pa zhig la 'jog }
phyag sbal|{yig mdzod dang bang mdzod kyi ming ste/lha sa'i gtsug lag khang mdun gyi (khrang ching mthun 'brel rdo ring )gi yi ge las/rgyal po chen po gnyis kyi ni phyag rgyas btab/blon po rtsigs 'dzin pa la gtogs pa rnams yis ni lag yig tu bris te rtsigs kyi yi ge so so'i phyag sbal du bzhag go zhes pa lta bu'o/_/yang btson khang la go ba'i skabs kyang yod de ('dul ba'i gleng 'bum )las/phyag sbal rim pa phyag g.yom yod pas de mi gte po yin pa'i phyir steng rim du bzhag po zhes gsungs so/_}
phyag sbug|{rgyu nor mdzod sbug dang de'i gnyer pa phyed mkhan gnyis ka'i ming ste/de sngon se 'bras dge gsum gyi grwa tshang so so'i mchod gzhis thog nas khral bsdu rgyu dang grwa par gtong sgo gtong rgyu sogs dpal 'byor gyi dbang cha dang/chos khrims kyi dbang cha tshang ma mkhan po'i lag tu bzung yod stabs grwa pa dmangs dang mkhan po'i bar gyi 'gal zla tshabs che ru song te sa gnas srid gzhung la zhu gtugs byed dgos pa sogs byung bar brten mkhan por grwa tshang nas phogs sprod rgyu ma gtogs/dpal 'byor thog gi dbang cha med pa bzo nas grwa tshang gi dpal 'byor do dam byed mkhas phyag mdzod sbug pa zer ba mi kha shar zur du bsko bzhag byas yod pa de yin}
phyag rtse sprod|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gus lugs lam srol la/mkhas pa chen po phan tshul bar bla ma dang slob ma'i 'brel pa yod pa yin nam mjal phrad gnang dus phan tshun mnyam phyag gnang ba la zer}
phyag tshang|{thab ka pa'am za ma bcos mkhan te ma chen}
phyag mtshan|{chos kyi brda mtshon pa'i rtags su phyag tu bsnams pa'i rdo rje dang la bu'am bgrang phreng sogs zer ro/_}
phyag mtshan gsum|{kha T+wAM/rdo rje/mi mgo'o/_}
phyag 'tshal ba gsum|{rkyang phyag pus mo la 'khyud phyag yan lag lnga phyag bya ba}
phyag 'tshal ba'i nges pa gsum|{rab lta ba brda 'jal ba'i phyag /'bring bsgom pa goms pa'i phyag /tha ma mos gus ya rabs kyi phyag go }
phyag 'os kyi khyad par bzhi|{khyim pa'i phyag yul rab byung sde lnga dang/rab byung gzhan gyi phyag yul dge slong dang/dge slong gi phyag yul rang las bslab pa rgan pa dang/thams cad kyi spyi'i phyag yul sangs rgyas so/_}
phyad ma phyod|{dran pa 'thor nas gang yang sems la 'char mi nus par gyur pa}
phyar gru phyar stod|{de sngon bod sa gnas srid gzhung dang/bkra shis lhun po'i zhabs sdod rtse drung/de min se 'bras dge gsum gyi spyi so dang/bla brang che khag gi phyag mdzod sogs rtse drung gi go gnas yod mkhan tshos grwa chas steng du gyon pa'i gzan la gos chen gyi mtha' 'jags byas pa la phyag gru zer zhing/de dang rigs 'dra ba'i snam bu'i sdod thung la gos chen gyis mtha' 'jags dang gong ba yod pa la phyar stod zer}
phyar ba gru 'degs|{sle'u gru bzhi sne bzhi nas mnyam du bzung nas 'gyogs pa ste/las don la tshang mas hun skyed byed dgos pa'i don}
