phyi rgol tshar gcod pa'i gnas su gyur pa bdun|{'dri ba khas blangs nas btang snyoms su 'jog pa/grub gsal zhugs pa'i 'dri ba/skabs su ma babs pa 'dri ba/skyon brjod rgyu yod kyang mi brjod pa/skyon brjod pa rnams so/_}
phyi rgyal las khungs|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs kyi las khungs shig ste/de'i nang gtso bo rtse shod dza sag gnyis dang/las bya shod skor rim bzhi gcig /rtse shod drung dkyus mi 'ga' zhig bcas yod/'di tshugs yul ni lha sa'i gtsug lag khang gi shing ra'i yang steng rab gsal bar skor lho lta'i nang yin/las khungs 'di bod rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu rta (1942)lor srid skyong stag brag gi dus phyi rgyal gyi ngan skul 'og gsar du btsugs shing/thog ma'i do dam du dza sag g.yung dgon dkon mchog 'byung gnas dang/dza sag zur zur dbang chen tshe brtan gnyis la bskos shing/las byar phyi rgyal gyi skad yig shes pa cha rkyen du byas te mi drug tsam bskos/phyi rgyal las khungs 'di phyi phyogs rgyal khab khag la gang ci'i 'grel ba byed mkhan zhig yin stabs bod rang btsan yin khul gyi rnam pa dang nang don mtshon byed cig yin pa ni smos ma dgos pas des byas pa'i las doran ni lo rgyus kyi 'gro phyogs dang mi mthun pa zhig yin}
phyi thag bstung ba|{'di dpe dang sbrags pa'i don zhig dper na/rang gi lag par thag pa'i sne gcig bzung nas sne gcig rgyab ngos su brud de 'gro skabs thag pa'i mjug ring po byas nas yod pa lta bu'am yang na mi la las mdun la yod dus dga' mdog kha po byed pa dang/rgyal ba bstan tshar nas dga' bo mi byed pa lta bu phyi thag bstung ba zer/'di'i bstung ba zhes pa bya byed tha dad pa'i bya tshig yin}
phyi don khas mi len pa|{sems tsam pas chos thams cad sems kyi bdag gnyis tsam las phyi rol don grub pa khas mi len te/rang re so skye rnams la gzugs sogs phyi rol don du rtog pa'i zhen gzhir tshugs thub tu tshur ling nger grub rgyu yod pa ltar snang ba de dag thams cad ni thog ma med pa'i dus nas ma rig pha'i rnam rtog sna tshogs goms pa'i bag chags sems la bzhag pa de nyid kyi mthu las snang ba'i rnam pa nyid du shar ba ma gtogs sems las gzhan gyi phyi don ni gang yang ma grub ste/dper na/'khrul pas med kyang yod par sgro 'dogs pa bzhi'i nang ba bskyed pa ni/rab rib kyi skra shad lta bu dang/sems las don gzhan du med na ji ltar sems kyi spyod yul du 'gyur snyam pa bzlog pa'i phyir sgyu ma lta bu/don med na sems sems byung ji ltar skye snyam pa bzlog pa'i phyir smig rgyu lta bu/0 don med kyang dge mi dge'i 'bras bu 'byung ba'i dpe gzugs brnyan lta bu sogs gsungs shing/gzhan yang/phyi don bden par yod na 'phags pa'i mnyam bzhag ye shes kyi ngor yod dgos pa las de'i ngor med pas phyir sogs lung dang rigs pa/dpe'i tshul mang pos phyi don 'gog par mdzad do/_}
phyi don khas len pa|{dbu ma thal 'gyur ba'i lugs kyi thun mong ma yin pa'i khyad chos chen po brgyad kyi nang gses shig ste/lugs 'di la sems tsam pa ltar phyi don med par 'dod pa ni mi 'thad de/don dam dpyod pa'i shes pa'i (283) ngor phyi don dang shes pa gnyis ka rigs pas btsal nas 'jog par mi nus la 'jig rten grags pa'i dbang du na shes pa yod pa bzhin du phyi don yang yod de sher mdo las bzung ba dang 'dzin pa gnyis tha snyad du yod mnyam dang don dam dpyod pa'i skabs su med mnyam du gsungs pa ltar ro/_/gzhan yang khams gsum po 'di ni sems tsam mo/_/zhes pa'i mdo tshig de'i tsam sgras kyang phyi don gcod pa ma yin gyi khams gsum po mtha' dag kyang las kyis byas la las ni sems pa dang bsam pa gnyis su nges par khams gsum sems kyis byas par grub pas de'i phyir sems las gzhan pa'i dbang phyug la sogs pa 'jig rten gyi byed po yod pa dgag pa'i tshad du tsam sgra smon pa yin zhes gsungs so/_}
phyi don bden grub|{yul can shes pa rang nyid las phyi rol du rdul phra rab bsags nas rags pa'i chos sna tshogs kyi don snang yul du bden par grub pas na phyi don bden grub zer/de yang/phyi don bem po rnams kyi dang po'i rtsom gzhi ni bden grub zer/de yang/phyi don bem po rnams kyi dang po'i rtsom gzhi ni cha shas bsal rgyu med pa'i rdul phra rab cha med gcig /de bdun la bsags rdul phra rab gcig /de lta bu'i phra rab rnams phan tshul ldab chags par 'gyur ba las gzugs la sogs pa'i rags pa rnams byung ngo/_}
phyi na yar phyin|{de'i rjes su'am/de'i rgyab la rjes 'ded byas te phyin pa}
phyi nang gi grub mtha' smra ba'i khyad par|{rang gzhan nam phyi nang grub mtha' smra ba'i khyad par 'byed chos mkhas pa rnams kya bzhed srol tha dad ming po zhig yod de/ston pa/bstan pa/lta ba gsum gyi sgo nas 'byed pa dang/yang na/lta ba/sgom pa/spyod pa/'bras bu ste rgyu mtshan bzhi'i sgo nas 'byed pa sogs yod/'byed tshul dang po de (grub mtha' rin chen phreng ba )nang gsal bzhin/ston pa skyon kun bral yon tan kun ldan de (khyad par 'phags bstod )las/bdag ni ston pa gzhan spangs nas/_/bcom ldan khyod la skyabs su mchi/_/de ci'i slad du zhe na khyod/_/spyon mi mnga' la yon tan ldan/_/zhes ston par 'dzin tshul gsungs pa ltar dang/bstan pa sems can la 'tshe ba med pa ste/(khyad par 'phags bstod )las/gzhan dag rang don mchod sbyin la/_/gzhan gyi srog ni sbyin sreg byed/_/gzhan gyi don du khyod gcig pu/_/rang gi srog gis sbyin sreg mdzad/_/ces gsungs pa ltar dang/lta ba rtag gcig rang dbang can gyi bdag gis stong pa 'dod de/(khyad par 'phags bstod )las/rtog ge ba dag dngos po rnams/_/ltos pa med par grub par 'tshal/_/tshig dbang khyod kyis cung zad kyang/_/mi ltos med ces legs par gsungs/_/zhes pa ltar ro/_/khyad par 'byed tshul gnyis pa de ni lta ba bkar btags kyi phyag rgya bzhi khas len mi len/sgom pa srid rtse'i gnyen por 'gro mi 'gro/spyod pa ngal dub kyi mtha' dang 'dod pa bsod nyams kyi mtha' gnyis spong mi spong/'bras bu spang bya spangs pa'i bral 'bras 'gog bden 'dod mi 'dod rnams kyis 'byed pa sogs bzhed pa mang yang/phyi nang gi khyad par ston pas 'byed pa dang/rang gzhan gyi grub mtha' smra ba so so'i khyad par ni gtso bo ta bas 'byed pa yin te/dkon mchog gsum skyabs gnas yang dag tu khas len pa ma zad/lta ba bkar btags kyi phyag rgya bzhi khas len pa'i grub mtha' smra ba ni rang sde'i grub mtha' smra ba dang/de ltar khas me len pa'i grub mtha' smra ba dang/de ltar khas mi len pa'i grub mtha' smra ba ni gzhan sde'i grub mtha' smra bar 'jog pa yin/de nas phyi rol pa'i lta ga gtso bo ni rtag gcig rang dbang can gyi bdag tu grub par 'dod pa dang/nang pa'i grub mtha' smra bas gang zag de gsum gang gi ngo bor yang ma grub pas/rtag gcig rang dbang (284) can gyi bdag gis stong par 'dod pa yin rang sde gnas ma bu pas brjod du med pa'i gang zag zhig khas len pas phyi nang grub mtha' gang yin dpyad pa gong du na sde'i nang gnas ma bu pa zhes par gzigs}
phyi nang gi rig pa|{rig gnas chung ba lnga (snyan dngags/mngon brjod/sdeb sbyor/zlos gar/skar rtsis )ni phyi rol mu stegs pa dang nang pa sangs rgyas pa gnyis kas bslabs su rung ba'i rig gnas yin pas phyi rig pa zer zhing/rig gnas che ba lnga (sgra/tshan ma/bzo/g.yo ba/nang rig pa )yi nang nas dang po bzhi yang nang thun mong bas bslab bya'i rig gnas yin pas phyi rig pa dang/nang rig pa sde snod gsum ni nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i bslab bya'i yon tan yin pas nang rig pa zhes brjod srol yod}
phyi nang med pa'i sems|{phyi yi shangs pags skra sen sogs dang/nang gi don lnga snod drug sogs cha shas gang la yang khyad par med par la khyab pa'i sems}
phyi nang gzhan gsum|{phyi 'jig rten gyi khams/nang sems can gyi lus/gzhan chos nyid dbyings kyi dkyil 'khor re/_/yang na phyi 'jig rten/nang sems nyid/gzhan yang lus zhes (las byang me tog phreng mdzes )'grel par dka' chen rab 'byams kyis gsungs so/_/gnas gsum kyang de'o/_}
phyi nang gsang gsum|{gsang ba dang gsang ba min pa'i las don tshang ma}
phyi nang gsang gsum gyi mchod pa|{phyi dngos su bshams pa'i mchod pa/nang yid kyis sprul pa'i mchod pa/gsang ba de kho na nyid kyi mchod pa bcas yin}
phyi pa dang nang pa'i khyad par|{phyi nang tsam gyi khyad par dkon mchog gsum skyabs gnang yang dag tu khas len mi len gyis 'byed pa yin te/ngo bo rjes/phyi pa nang pa skyabs 'gro'i khyad ces gsungs pa ltar snying thag pa nas dkon mchog gsum la skyabs su 'gro ba'i gang zag de nang pa dang/de ltar khas mi len pa phyi pa'o/_}
phyi pa'i lta ba mtha' bzhi las skye ba|{bdag las skye ba/gzhan las skye ba/de gnyis ka las skye ba/rgyu med las skye ba/yang bden par grub pa'i rtag mtha' tha snyad du'ang med pa'i chad mtha' de gnyis ka bden par grub pa de gnyis rang gi dman sgrib gnyis}
phyi 'phred|{phyi dro'i ming ste/('dul ba'i gleng 'bum )las/de dag phyi 'phred mnyan yod du 'jug 'dod nas/zhes ba lta bu'o/_}
phyi blon|{sngar btsan po'i dus skabs su sring gzhung gi phyi'i las don la bkod 'doms byed mkhan gyi blon po la zer zhing/phyi don blon chen zhes pa'i ming bsdus te phyi blon zhes zer/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i skabs phyi blon drug yod par (chos 'byung mkhas ba'i dga' ston )nang du gsal yang/de rnams kyi go gnas mtho dman rim pa dang/thob rang yig tshang gang gi khongs su gtogs pa'i skor chos 'byung de'i nang du mi gsal/rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi skabs su phyi blon bcu gsum yod pa'i so so'i ming dang bcas pa bka' gtsigs rdo ring nang gsal zhing/khri lde srong btsan gyi skabs phyi blon yod pa bka' gtsigs kyi nang gsal yang phyi blon dang/stod smad kyi dbang po/dmag dpon bcas kyi mang tho mnyam du sbrel nas bkod pa las mi grangs ji yod kyi gsal kha med/rgyal po khri rab pa can gyi skabs su phyi blon 'ga' zhig yod ces kyang/dpon zhang mthun 'brel gyi rdo ring btsugs dus grol mos nang mnyam du zhugs pa'i phyi blon go gnas mtho dman gnyis kyi ming 'khod yod pa las/phyi blon gzhan dag gi ming 'khod mi 'dug /gzhan yang sngon dus sus mtshams (285) la so lta byed mkhan dang lta rtogs byed mkhan blon po bzhag pa de la'ang phyi blon zer zhes (deb ther dkar po )yi nang gsal}
phyi ma gnyis|{sems tsam pa dang dbu ma la gnyis la zer}
phyi ma'i snang shas zlog pa|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/las rgyu 'bras bslu ba med pa dang 'khor ba'i sdug bsngal shes rtogs byas te 'khor ba'i bde skyin la zhen pa log pa'i nges 'byung gi bsam pa skyes pa}
phyi ma'i lam chen|{shi ba'i ming la phyi ma'i lam chen zer}
phyi mo|{spyir btang rang gi ma'i ma la go dgos kyang/skabs rer ma dpe la yang go dgos}
phyi mo nub|{ma dpe ngo ma rtsa med song ba}
phyi myug ma|{phyogs nas 'ongs pa'i sprang mo}
phyi yi chas brgyad|{thang yig las/yongs su 'dzin pa dge ba'i bshes gnyen dbang/phyi yi chas brgyad sprul pa'i sku ru bskur/zhes pas de la/1 thang gos 2 snam sbyar 3 sham thabs 4 lhung bzed 5 'khar gsil 6 po ti 7 gding ba 8 chu tshags dang brgyad do/_}
phyi rabs pa|{klu sgrub yab sras byung ba'i rjes kyi bye brag smra ba'i grub mtha' 'dzin pa dang mdo sde pa'i grub mtha' 'dzin pa rnams la de ltar 'bod srol yod}
phyi rol gyi sgo khang|{khang pa'i sgo chen yod sa'i bdun gyi khang pa ste/dgon pa'i 'du khang gi mdun gyi sgo 'phyor zer ba de'o/_}
phyi rol rtag chad gnyis|{rtag par lta ba grangs can pa/chad par lta ba rgyang 'phen pa'o/_}
phyi rol rtag dpyad gnyis|{du rtags dpyad dang me btsa gnyis so/_}
phyi rol don stong|{rdul phran cha med bsags pa'i rags pas stong pa ste gzugs sgra sogs rags pa de'i ngo bor ma grub pas phyi rol don stong du 'jog pa yin}
phyi rol pa|{dkon mchog gsum la skyabs su mi 'gro zhing/de las gzhan pa'i skyabs gnas 'tshol ba'i gang zag de la phyi rol pa zhes pa dang/de'i gras bshad ni rang sde nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i bstan pa 'di las phyi rol tu phyogs te 'jig rten pa'i shes rab kyis dngos po'i gnas la dpyod kyang lugs mthun gyi thar pa'i rjes su mthun pa'i lam med pas na phyi rol pa dang/ming gi rnam grangs la/rang sde nang pa sangs rgyas pa las gzhan gyi sde yin pas na gzhan sde dang/rtag chad kyi lta ba ngan pa'i mu'am mtha' la brten zhing grub mtha' log 'i lam la stegs 'cha' bas na mu stegs pa zhes so/_}
phyi rol pa gnyis|{mu stegs pa dang bon nag }
phyi rol pa'i grub mtha' bcu gnyis|{lha'i bla ma'am phur bu'i rjes 'brang rgyang 'phen pa/drang srong ser skya'i rjes 'brang grangs can pa/lha tshangs pa'i rjes 'brang rig byed pa/tshangs pa'i rjes 'brang brdar sprod pa/tshangs pa'i rjes 'brang brda' sprod pa/tshangs pa'i rjes 'brang rig byi mtha' ba/tshangs pa'i rjes brang gsang ston pa/lha khyab 'jug gi rjes 'brang khyab 'jug pa/mu stegs rgyal dpog gi rjes 'brang dpyod pa ba/lha dbang phyug chen po'i rjes 'brang yi sred pa'am dbang phyug pa/ma stegs gzan dang thub pa 'ug pa'i rjes 'bras 'ug phrug pa'am bye brag pa/mu stegs rkang mig pa'i rjes 'brang rig pa can/mu stegs rgyal ba dam pa dang khyu mchog gi rjes 'brang zad byed pa dang bcu gnyis so/_/'di'i dang po de la chad par smra ba ngad gzhan bcu gcig la rtags par smra ba zer bas phyi rol rtag chad gnyis kyang zer ro/_}
phyi rol pa'i grub mtha'i dbye ba|{mu stegs pa'i lugs mtha' yas pa zhig mchis pa de dag thams cad kyi rtsa ba ni (286) grangs can pa dang gzhan rnams de las gyes pa yin te (dbu ma 'jug pa )las de dbye cung zad cung zad la brten nas/_/mu stegs can rnams lugs ni tha dad 'gyur/_/zhes gsungs pa ltar grangs can pas btags pa'i bdag de'i khyad par las cung zad cung zad bsnon 'bri'i tshul mi 'dra ba la brten nas mu stegs can rnams kyi lugs phan tshul tha dad par 'gyur ro/_/zhes gsungs de la dbye na mdo tshangs pa'i 4dra ba las lta ngan drug cu re gnyis dad pa cher 'byung gi mdo las dam pa min pa'i lta ba nyer brgyad dang gzhan yang lung ma bstan gyi lta ba bcu bzhi ya mtshan can gyi lta ba dgu bcu rtsa drug lta ngan nyi shu sogs lta ba ngan pa grangs kyis mi langs pa yod pas dpal ldan chos kyi grags pas log pa'i lam la mu med phyir zhes gsungs pa ltar spyi log rtog gi lta ba ngan pa la 'di 'byung dang 'di mi 'byung zhes kha tshon gcod dkar bas gzhan sde la mtha' gcig tu grangs nges bzung bya ba mi rigs kyang bod kyi mkhas pa snga ma phal che ba'i gzhung las grangs can pa bye brag pa rig pa can pa dpyod pa ba gcer bu pa rgyang 'phen pa rnams la rtsa ba'i drug ces gsungs la mu stegs pa kun de'i nang du 'dus shing de yang bsdus na rtag chad kyi sde gnyis su ma 'dus pa med do zhes gsungs de dag las dang po lnga ni rtag par lta ba dang phyi ma ni chad pa lta ba yin no/_}
phyi rol pa'i rtag par smra ba'i rtog ge sde lnga|{grangs can pa/dbang phyug pa/bye brag pa/rig pa can pa/gcer bu pa rnams so/_}
