phywa pa chos kyi seng ge|{gsang phu'i mkhan thog drug pa phywa pa chos kyi seng ge ni gsang phu'i mkhan po mdzad mkhan gyi nang nas dbu ma dang tshad ma la shin tu mkhas shing gdan sa'i slob gnyer lam lugs gsar gtod mdzad mkhan yi slob dpon grags can mi rgyal khab phyi nang du mkhas pa'i snyan grags yod pa zhig yin/khong ni rab byung gnyis pa'i sa glang (1109)lor phywa zhes pa'i yul ('ga' shas kyis cha yang zer )ste/deng skabs lha sa grong khyer gyi stag rtse rdzong la mo chus kyi khongs su bltams/rab byung gsum pa'i sa glang (1169)lor sku gshegs/khong sku na chung dus nas thugs rig gsal zhing mgul ram sna tshogs gsum thub mkhan zhig yin pas/dge bshes rgya dmar bas pha ma las slong te zhabs phyir khrid nas khong gi drung nas tshad ma dang dbu ma gsan sbyong gnang/zhang tshe spong chos kyi bla ma'i drung du rab tu byung nas mtshan la chos kyi seng ge zhes btags/khong dang de'i slob ma nyan bran chos kyi ye shes gnyis kyi drung du phar phyin dang spyod phyogs skor gsan/gsang phu'i gdan sa lo bco brgyad kyi rab tu mdzad/phywa pa chos kyi seng ges gdan sa'i slob gnyer srol gtod gnang ba'i mdzad rjes gtso bo ni/1 gzhung bka' pod lnga'i slob gnyer thabs las gsar du gtod/2 slob rtsod gnyis dus gcig du spel ba'i lam srol gtod pa/3 dge rgan so so'i khyad chos la gzhigs te slob khrid kyi las 'gan gtan 'khel gnang nas dge rgan so so'i khyad nus 'don spel gang legs byed du bcug pa/4 'dzin grwa bgo ba'i lam lugs gsar du gtod cing/'dzin grwa so so'i slob yun gyi lo tshad gtan 'khel gnang ba/5 lo gcig gam slob dus so so'i chos thog gi slob tshan nang don gtan 'bebs gnang ba/6 'dzin grwa phan tshun gtugs res ('gran bsdur )byas pa'i thabs lam gsar du gtod pa/7 chos thog skabs bgro gleng gtso bo dang slob khrid zhar byung/chos mtshams skabs slob khrid gtso bo dang bgro gleng zhar byung rgya rgyu'i srol gtod pa/8 slob gnyer legs gras rnams rang mos thog dgon pa gzhan dang grwa tshang gzhan la grwa skor dam bca' 'gro ba'i srol gsar du gtod pa/9 slob gnyer thon pa'i rigs la slob gnyer gyi sbyangs 'bras legs nyes la gzhigs nas mtshan gnas sprod pa'i srol gtod pa/10 tshad ma rig pa'i gzhung rnams kyi snying bcud bsdus pa'i (bsdus grwa )chung 'bring che gsum gsar rtsom mdzad cing de ltar slob sbyong byed dgos rgyu'i gtan 'bebs gnang ba/11 mtshan nyid rtsod skabs kyi dri ba dang dris lan 'debs tshul dang/rtsod gling gtong mkhan gyis 'dzin grwa'i dbus su langs te thog mar khas len (293) bzung mkhan la gus 'dud kyi rnam 'gyur dang bcas te gzan skyur 'bebs nas skad gsang mthon pos bgro gling 'go tshugs pa'i d+hi skad gtong ba dang de nas gzan sked par dkris te skabs su babs pa'i gzhung las 'phros pa'i khas len dri ba dang thal 'gyur 'phen pa dang chabs cig las pas thal mo rdeb pa khyab mtha' 'god pa rgyu mtshan 'dri ba 'khor gsum bskor ba sogs kyi dam bca' khas len dang mtshan nyid rtsod 'i tha snyad dang bya thams cad bcas pa'i ngo mtshar khyad du 'phags pa'i slob gnyer la lam zhig gtod gnang stabs bod kyi gdan sa khag tu khong gi srol gtod de dar khyab gong 'phel shugs chen byung ba ma zad da ltar yang khong gi slob gnyer lam lugs la mnyam gong 'phel 'gro bzhin yod pa bcas yin khong sku tshe'i ring slob ma grangs kyi mi langs pa yod pa'i nang grags che shos ni rigs pa'i dbang phyug seng chen brgyad yod pa ste gnang nag pa brtson 'grus seng ge dar bag smra ba'i seng ge bru sha bsod nams seng ge rma bya rtsod pa'i seng ge rtsegs dbang phyug seng ge nyan brang chos kyi seng ge 'dan ma dkon mchog seng ge gnyal pa yon tan seng ge bcas yin slob ma grags chen brgyad nang gnas gnyal pa dang bra sha ba gnyis ma gtogs de min tshang mas tshad ma dang dbu ma phar phyid bcas kyi gzhung rgyas bsdus du ma mdzad yod khong gi gsum rtsom skor la (byams chos sde lnga'i 'grel pa/) (tshad ma rnam nges kyi 'grel pa/) (tshad ma yid kyi mun sel/) (shes bya gzhi lnga'i rnam gzhag ))rgyas bsdus gnyis/) (dbu ma bden gnyis kyi 'grel pa/) (dbu ma snang ba'i 'grel pa/) (spyod 'jug chen mo'i 'grel pa )bcas mang du yod gzhan yang khong gi mdzad rjes mang yang 'dir yig rdzob che bar 