phywa g.yang 'gugs|{bon gyi chos skad la phywa g.yang zhes pa'i go don ni/mi dang lha sogs tshe ring por sdod pa rnams kyi tshe'i g.yang dang/bsod nams can gyi nor g.yang/snyan grags can gyi grags pa/rigs rgyud mang po can gyi srid 'phel ba'i g.yang sogs 'jig rten 'di'i nang gi legs pa'i phyogs thams cad tshang ba la g.yang dang/de ma tshang ba rnams 'gugs thabs kyi cho ga la brten nas tshur sdud pa la phywa g.yang 'gugs pa zhes zer srol 'dug /rjes su sangs rgyas chos lugs pas nang don bsgyur nas rnam pa rang sor bzhag pa yin stabs/bod kyi grub mtha' tshang mar rang rang gi g.yang 'gugs cho ga yod}
phywa g.yang 'gugs pa'i bon po|{lug dmar mo'i lag pa'i sha dang tshigs gsum can gyi mda' la dar tshon sna lnga dang/gzi/spos shel/byu ru/g.yu/me long bcas btags pa'i mda' dar phye mar bcas lag tu thogs te tshe dang bsod nams dbang bar byed pa'i bon chog cig ste/sngar rgyal po gta' khri btsan po'i gong nas bod kyi bon po shes pa can bcu gnyis zhes pa zhig byung ba de'i nang nas g.yang shes phywa bon gyis g.yang sgrub byed pa'i srol yod cing/rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis bon chos bsnubs pa'i skabs su g.yang chog sogs phan thogs yod pa'i rigs 'ga' zhig ma bsnubs par bzhag pa ma zad/rjes su sangs rgyas chos lugs pas bon gyi g.yang chog byed srol gyi rnam pa rang sor bzhag nas dang don sangs rgyas chos lugs dang mthun par byas pa yin nam snyam}
phra rgyas go brgyad|{nyon mongs pa phra ba las rgyas par byed pa ste ngo bo mthong dkar bas na phra ba dang/dmigs pa dang mtshungs ldan gang rung gi sgo nas rgyas par 'gyur bas na rgyal pa'o/_/de go brgyad 'dren tshul ni sdug bden la lta ba'i bcu dang/kun 'byung dang 'gog bden la 'jig rten log lta ba rdul zhugs mchog 'dzin ma gtogs pa'i bdun dang/lam la mthong spangs dang po 'jig rten log lta gnyis las gzhan brgyad dang/'dod pa'i sgom spangs lta ba bzhi dang the tshom ma gtogs lta min bzhi ste 'dod pa'i so drug /khams gong ma gnyis na de thams cad kyi nang gi khong khro ma gtogs gzhan rnams 'dod pa'i de rnams dang rabs thams cad bsdoms go brgyad}
phra men|{gser dang dngul spel nas bzos pa'i dngos rigs ste/dper na thang gi gong mas rgyal po khri srong lde btsan la phul ba'i phyag rtags nang phra med gyi zhwa zhes gsal ba lta bu yin}
phra men gyi rig pa 'dzin pa|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad srol la/phra men ma zhes pa ni nyin mong mi dang mtshan mo gdong 'drer gyur te mi yi bla srog phrogs pa la zer zhing/skabs re yi nang nas 'ga' zhig gis mdun du kha mkhas 'dra chags bshad de rgyab tu lkog g.yo sna tshogs kyi sgo nas gnod 'tshe gtong bzhi rigs rnams phran men ma dang 'dra ba'i dper blangs pa yin/de yang mthun po yod pa'i mi'i bar dkrugs shing byed mkhan la zer/phra men ni 'dre dang rig pa ni sngags te/'dra'i bsngags bzlas mkhan zer ba'i don}
phra men ma|{nyin mo'i dus spyir btang gi mi dang 'dra ba la mtshan mo'i dus gdon 'dre'i rigs su gyur nas mi la gnod 'tshe byed mkhan zhig dang/nyin mo'i dus sug zugs mi 'dra ba sna tshogs la sprul bsgyur thub pa'i mi ma 'dre bcas rigs gnyis yod par bshad}
phra men ma brgyad|{shar du lo rtsa ma/lhor me lce gdong/nub tu Ta kyi ma/byang du rgan byed ma/shar lho rdo rje ma/lho nub tu hu lu ma/nub byang du dreg pa ma/byang shar na sna tshogs ma ste sangs rgyas kyang zhing lpags mnab cing rus rgyan can/mtshon cha sna tshogs thogs nas ro la rngam pa'o/_}
phra mo nyi shu rtsa gcig|{gsang sngags kyi cho sa tshan thar thor nyi shu rtsa gcig }
phra mo'i rgyan gnyis|{don rgyan sum cu so lnga'i nang gses bcu bzhi pa phra mo'i rgyan ni bsam blo sngon btang gi sgo nas go bya'i don brda thabs zur gyis thon pa dang/bsam blo sngon btang med par 'phral la lus kyi rnam 'gyur gsar pa zhig ngang gis gsal ba'i sgo nas nang sems kyi 'a char sgo mtshon pa'i phra zhing rtogs dka'i rgyan zhig ste/de'i nang gses rnam grangs gnyis ni zur gyi phra mo dang/rnam pa'i phra mo'o/_}
phra bzo|{rdo'i rigs kyi rin po che rnams brdar bzo dang/gshag bzo/dbyibs bzo/rdzas 'gyur gyi chu'i nang sbangs nas 'khru bsogs kyi bzo las la zer/bod mi rigs kyis rin po che rigs legs nyes dbye 'byed shes pa ni spyi lo'i dus rabs brgyad pa'i g.yas gyon du bod kyi gso rig mkhas dbang g.yu thog yon tan mgon pos brtsams pa'i (sman gyi rgyud bzhi )yi nang rin po che'i rigs mang por nad bcos pa'i nus pa yod lugs gsal bshad gnang yod pa dang/spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu drug pa'i 'khor karma chag med ra ka a s+yas (rin po che brtag pa )dang/gos dkar rol mo dkar yol brtag pa sogs kyi rtsom yig mi nyung ba yod/'on kyang rdo'i rigs kyi rin po che brdar bzo dang gshags las kyi lag rtsal thad bal po dang kha cher nyams myong phun sum tshogs pa yod pa dang/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i dus nas lha sar gzhis chags (295) te sdod pa'i bal po dang kha che'i tshong pa mang po yod pa nas po ta la'i pho brang dmar po gsar bzhengs skabs bal po bzo rtsal mkhas pa mang po bsdus pa'i nang phra rgyan bzo rtsal la mkhas pa'i bal po dza na tsan dar sogs mi zhe drug yod}
phrag dog|{gzhan gyi phun tshogs la dmigs nas sems mi bzod pa'i rnam can gyi sems byung}
phran bu'i nad bcu|{nywa log /'khru/skyugs/mes tshig /khab bam mde'u khong du shor ba/gre bar gra ma zug pa/sha'am zan gyis brnangs pa/gnya' rings/bse dri/nu ma skrangs pa'o/_}
phri|{phyi'i shun pa'i nang gi bar shun srab mo'i ming yin}
phru rtog btsugs pa|{thab khang btsugs pa'i ming ste/('dul ba'i gleng 'bum )las ci yin brtag go snyam nas legs 'ongs kyi ming gis phru rtog btsugs pa dang chung zos shing bdag gi ming gis btsugs pa de tsho nas des bsam pa zhes pa lta bu}
phru dpon|{'brog las do dam byed mkhan gyi dpon rigs yin pa dang/nor phyugs dang 'brog sde'i do dam byed mkhan yin zhes (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang gsal}
