phru blugs pa|{phye ma'am sa cung rags pa blugs pa'i don te ('dul ba'i gleng 'bum )las so phag gi phur ma blags pas sdug bsngal bar gyur nas phye ma'am sa'i phra blugs par bya'o zhes gsungs so/_}
phru ma|{mo ma'i ming ste/(brda sprod dpag bsam ljon pa'i snye ma )las/phru ma ni mo ma zhes gsungs so/_/(tsa)}
phru ma btab|{pho brang ngam dmag sgar btab pa'i don}
phru gzar gnyis|{khog ma dang gzar bu gnyis}
phrug phrig|{rkang lag gis sa gtor ba'i don}
phrugs gcig|{zung gcig lta bu'am lnga lnga yod pa la lnga phrugs dang drug drug yod pa la drug phrugs lta bu}
phrum phye|{phyur ra'i ming}
phrum tshud|{'o ma dang dar ba bskol ba'i snyigs ma'i ming ngam zho'i snod kyi ming}
phrul phyal|{grod pa'i zhe sa'o/_}
phreng phreng po|{thang thang po'ang mkhregs po'i ming}
phreng ba skor gsum|{a b+ha ya ka ras mdzad pa'i (dkyil chog rdo rje phreng ba/) (sgrub thabs rnal 'byor rdzogs phreng/) (sbyin sreg 'od kyi snye ma )rnams so/_}
'phag pa|{'gro ba'am mjug pa'i don}
'phags rgyal|{(rgya gar chos 'byung )las yul 'di ma la wa'i nang gses khyad par ba zhig yin par gsungs pa dang/'dul ba'i gleng 'bum )las 'di sngar sangs rgyas zhal bzhugs skabs kyi rgya gar sha phyogs kyi grong khyer zhig gi ming yin par gsungs shing/dge chos kyis mdzad pa'i rgya gar gnas yig las deng sang u chen zer ba de yin pa dang/de ni rgyal po rab snang gi grong khyer 'phags rgyal yin cing 'phags pa ka t+ya nas bstan pa dar bar mdzad pa'i gnas yin par gsungs}
'phags rgyud kyi lam|{theg pa gsum gyi mthong sgom mi slob lam gsum lag nas pa'i 'phags pa'i gang zag de'i rgyud kyi rtog pa}
'phags pa|{1 so so skye bo'i sa nas ring du 'phags pa'i gnas su phyin par byed pas na 'phags pa ste/nyan rang byang sems gsum gyi mthong lam rang rgyud la nam thob pa na theg pa de dang de'i 'phags par gyur pa yin pas/mthong lam yan la gsan pa rnams 'phags pa'i gang zag (296) go 2 'gro ba'am bskyod pa'i don dang yang na tshad nges can zhig las brgal ba'am lhag par du zhes pa'i don la 'jug go}
'phags pa grol sde|{slob dpon dbyin gnyen gyi slob ma mchog bzhi'i nang tshan/phar phyin rang las mkhas pa 'phags pa rnam grol sde ste/rgya gar yul dbus su slob dpon sangs rgyas 'bangs kyi dbon sras su 'khrungs/gzhon nu'i dus nas rgyal ba'i bstan pa la rab tu byung zhing bsnyen par rdzogs pa'i sdom pa bzhes/ba dpon dbyig gnyen gyi drung du phebs te gus pas bsnyen cing rig pa'i gtsug lag nga mang po thugs su chud pa dang/khyad par du sher phyin gyi mdo sde rin po che rnams rdzogs par gsan nas tshig don gnyis ka thugs su chud de shin tu mkhas par gyur nas/rje btsun byams pa'i mngon rtogs rgyan dang nyi khri sbyar ba'i bstan bcos chen po nyi khri snang ba zhes bya ba mdzad do/_}
'phags pa mched bzhi|{spyi lo'i dus rabs bdun pa'i skabs su yab yul lho mtshams su skyes pa'i tsan dan shing sdong gcig dub bu bzhir bshad nas bzos pa'i 'phags pa spyan ras gzigs kyi sku wa ti dang/dbu khang/'ja' ma yi/lo ke sharaHste bzhi}
'phags pa 'jig rten dbang phyug|{'phags pa spyan ras gzigs la mtshan gyi rnam grangs mang du yod pa'i nang gi gcig yin}
'phags pa nye bar 'khor|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/'di nyid sangs rgyas shAkya mu ne dngos gyi slob ma skra gzhar mkhan gyi rigs las rab tu byung zhing/dgra bcom pa'i rtogs pa thob pa dang/'dul ba'i bslab khrims kyi gdan don mang por dogs pa yod pa rnams sangs rgyas rang nyid la dngos su dri ba zhus nas dogs pa gcod par mdzad pas 'dul ba la shin tu mkhas pa dang/sangs rgyas mya ngan las 'das rjes nyan thos 'od srung chen po sogs slob ma dgra bcom pa lnga brgyas mgrin gcig tu 'dul ba'i sde snod sdud pa por bskor thog rang nyid kyi blo la yod pa'i 'dul ba'i sde snod rnams bton nas phyogs bsdus byas/'di'i lo rgyus zhib pa bka' 'gyur gyi ('dul ba lung )du gsal}
'phags pa thogs med kyi sa sde lnga|{sa'i dngos gzhi/rnam grangs bsdu ba/rnam par bshad pa'i sgo bsdu ba/gzhi bsdu ba/rnam par gtan la dbab pa bsdu ba bcas so/_}
'phags pa na gA rdzun|{'di bod skad du 'phags pa klu sgrub ces pa ste/zab mo'i lta ba ston pa la klu dang/srid sgrub dang 'dra bas na de ltar btags zhes nang pa'i chos lugs pa rnams kyis bshad srol dang/lo rgyus ni rgya gar chos 'byung nang gsal}
'phags pa gnas brtan bcu drug|{gong du gnas brtan bcu drug zhes par gzigs}
'phags pa rnam gsum|{rigs gsum mgon po la zer ba ste 'jam dpal dbyangs/phyag na rdo rje/spyan ras gzigs te sngags lugs bya rgyud kyi mgon po gsum}
'phags pa blo gros rgyal mtshan|{gong du 'gro mgon 'phags pa blo gros rgyal mtshan zhes par gzigs}
'phags pa ma pham|{sa bcu pa'i rtogs pa brnyes zin pa'i 'phags pa byams pa mgon po'am sangs rgyas byams pa la zer}
'phags pa wa ti|{'phags pa mched lnga'i nang tshan mang yul skyid grong du bzhugs pa tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i skabs la dwags rgyal pos nang 'khrug bslangs skabs zla ba kha shas ring po ta lar gdan drang/rjes su slar yang mnga' ris su rang 'jags gnang zhu skabs 'phags pa lo kai shwa ra'i g.yas ngos su bzhugs pa'i 'dra cog de bzhengs gnang mdzad pa yin}
'phags pa 'od srungs chen po|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/'di sangs rgyas shAkya mu ne dngos kyi slob ma/bram ze'i rigs las rab tu byung zhing dgra bcom pa'i rtogs pa thob pa dang/sangs rgyas rang nyid mya ngan las 'da' khar rang nyid kyi sku tshab tu bskos shing/mya ngan las 'das rjes slob ma dgra bcom pa lnga brgyas mgrin gcig tu mngon pa'i sde snod sdud pa por bsgos nas/ring nyid kyi lo la yod pa'i mngon pa'i sde snod rnams bton nas phyogs bsdus mdzad/mthar ri bo bya rkang can du phebs nas 'gog pa'i ting nge 'dzin lam nyam par bzhag te sangs rgyas byams 'dzum bu'i gling du ma byon bar sku gson por bzhugs pa yin zer/'di'i lo rgyus zhib pa bka' 'gyur gyi ('dul ba lung )gi nang gsal}
'phags pa la chos kyi bdag med mngon sum du rtogs pas khyab|{bzhed tshul 'di yang thal 'gyur ba'i thun mong min pa'i khyad chos chen po brgyad kyi nang gses shig yin te/dbu ma rang rgyud pa man chad kyis sangs rgyas 'thob pa la stong nyid rtogs dgos par bzhed kyang/thar pa tsam thob pa la chos kyi bdag med rtogs mi dgos par mi rtag sogs bcu drug rtogs zin goms pa la brten nas nyon mongs zad par spangs pas grol ba dgra bcom pa'i 'bras bu 'thob par bzhed do/_/lugs 'dir thar pa tsam thob par 'dod pas kyang stong nyid rtogs dgos par bzhed do/_/nyan rang 'phags pa rnams kyis kyang chos k+khayi bdag med phra mo ma rtogs na sems bden 'dzin gyi dmigs pa dang bcas te bden 'byin khyi zhen yul rigs pas sun 'byin mi nus pas gang gi bdag med kyang mtshan nyid rdzogs par rtogs pa med cing/ji srid sems bden 'dzin dang bcas pa rnams kyis de srin sangs rgyas 'thob pa lta zhog theg dman gyi mya ngan las 'das pa'ang thob mi nus pas/nyan rang 'phags pa rnams kyis kyang chos kyi bdag med mngon sum du rtogs nas rang gi byang chub mngon du byed par bzhed do/_}
'phags pa lag na pad+mo|{'phags pap+sapayan ras gzigs ming gi rnam grangs mang du yod pa'i nang nas gcig ste phyag mtshan du me tog pad+ma dkar po 'dzin pa'i cha nas btags}
'phags pa lag na pad+mo kha sar pA ni|{'phags pa spyan ras gzigs la sku'i rnam 'gyur mi 'dra ba mang du yod pa'i nang gi kha sar pA ni ste/'di'i sku'i rnam 'gyur phyag mtshan bzhugs stangs sogs (rin 'byung brgya rtsa'i lha sku'i snang brnyan kun gsal me long )shing dpar mar gzigs}
'phags pa lag na pad+mo nam mkha'i rgyal po|{spyan ras gzigs bcu gcig zhal la mgon po klu sgrub lugs dang/rgyal po lugs/dge slong ma dpal mo lugs sogs sku'i rnam 'gyur mi 'dra ba kha shas yod pa'i nang nas lha sa gtsug lag khang gi nang du yod pa'i thugs rje chen po'i sku na rgyal po lugs te mtshan gzhan spyan ras gzigs nam mkha'i rgyal po yang zer/'di'i sku yi rnam 'gyur thad zhi ba'i zhal bzhi dang/khro bo'i zhal bdun bcas zhal bcu gcig yod pa ma zad/rtsa ba'i zhal dkar po gsum dang/de'i steng khro zhal ser po gsum/de'i steng du khro zhal dmar po gnyis/de'i steng du khro zhal nag po gnyis/de'i steng du zhi ba'i zhal gcig bcas brtsegs tshul yongs grags dang mi dra ba ma zad/phyag mtshan yang yongs grags dang mi 'dra ba yod pa zhib par rgyal po srong btsan sgam po rang nyid kyis mdzad pa'i bstod pa las gsal zhing/steng gi zhi ba'i zhal man chad rgyal po srong btsan sgom po rang nyid bzhengs nas bzhugs pa'i sku tshad dang mnyam par bshad srol yod}
'phags pa lag na pad+mo rang byon lnga ldan|{(lha (298) sa'i gtsug lag khang gi thugs rjes chen po rang byon lnga ldan/) sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la sku rgyu byang chub shing gi yal ga rgya mtsho'i gling 'jag ma chu bo nai rany+dza'i bye ma tsan+dan nor sha ]kha 'i dum bu gnas chen brgyad kyi sa sna rnams ba dmar po'i 'o ma dang r+pa dkar mo'i 'o mas sbrus pa'i 'jim pa las spyan ras gzigs kyi sku rgyal po srung btsan sgam po rang gi sku tshad dang mnyam pa zhig bzhengs rtsis byed pa'i skabs 1 spyan ras gzigs nam mkha'i rgyal po'i sku rang byon du phebs pa dang 2 sprul pa'i dge slong a ka ra ma tis gdan drangs pa'i tsan+dan sbrul gyi snying po'i rang byung bcu gcig zhal ye shes sems dpa'i tshul du bzhugs pa 3 slar yang chos rgyal srong btsan sgam po thugs rje chen po'i thugs kar thim pa 4 kong jo dang 5 yal bza' yang nu ma g.yas g.yon la thim pa bcas yin zhes bshad srol dang zhib cha (rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )gi lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 60nas 63b.ragasal}
'phags pa lag na pad+mo'i rnal 'byor pa|{'phags pa spyan ras gzigs yi dam du brten mkhan gyi sgom chen pa zhes pa'i don}
'phags pa lag na pad+mo'i pho brang ri bo gru 'dzin|{'di la rgya gar skad du po ta la zhes bod skad du bsgyur na ri bo gru 'dzin zhes pa ste/'di sa gnas gang du yod pa'i skor la bshad srol mi 'dra ba gnyis te/1 nang pa'i chos gzhung phal che ba'i nang du/rgya gar lho phyogs sing+ga la zhes lan glin gling phran dang lho phyogs su song ba na ri bo po ta la zhes pa'i ri bo'i gling phran zhig yod par bshad/2 rang re'i kre cang zhing chen gyi byang shar gling phran che chung mang du yod pa las/che shos ting he'i rdzong gi shar phyogs gling phran chung ngu zhig la rgya skad du h+phu tho hran zhes don dngos su shar phyogs rgya mtsho'i nang gi gling phran zhig yin de la ngos 'dzin pa yang 'dug /ri bo 'di rang rgyal tu snyan grags dang ldan pa'i ri bo zhig ste/rgya mtsho'i ngos la spyi khre sum brgya bcu med dgus mtho ba yin}
'phags pa lag na ral gri can|{'jam dpal dbyangs}
'phags pa shing kun|{bal yul du bzhengs pa'i mchod rten zhig ste nang du sangs rgyas kyi ring bsrel bzhugs pa zhig /'di'i lo rgyus da phan ma mthong}
'phags pa lha|{(sku phreng dang po )rje 'di ni gnyan chen thang lha'i mdun rno pa zhes bya ba'i 'dabs su zab mo rdo rje theg pa la rnal 'byor du mdzad pa yab ku cor rtogs ldan sangs rgyas dpal bzang dang yum sangs rgyas mtsho mo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bdun pa'i sa lug (1439)lor 'khrungs/(gang 'di'i rnam thar chen mo )las chu log la 'khrungs pa mdzad 'dug kyang yi ge nor ba'i skyon du song bar nges te 'dir (dga' ldan chos 'byung )dang shAkya dbang gis mdzad pa'i (zhal snga bka' brgyud thun mong min pa'i chos 'byung )zhes pa ltar byas shing/da ni rje tsong kha pa 'das nas lo bcu dgu song zin pa de yin/rgyal pa 'phags pa lha lug lor 'khrungs pa dang/long po glang mjug gi brag la yig drug rang byon shar ba dus mtshungs byung bar grags/) dgung grangs gsum du yab kyis dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa gnang zhing/mtshan 'jam dpal du gsol/yab kyi drung nas dbang dang rjes gnang sogs kyi chos bka' mang du gsan/gdung lo brgyad du son skabs sems dpa' chen po chos 'phags las rab tu byung zhing/chos 'phags kyis khyod rdzu 'phrul can zhig 'dug pas mo'u gal gyi bu zhes ming thogs gsungs par nga la 'phags pa lha zer ba yin zhes zhus pas mtshan de ltar mdzad/gtso bor slob dpon nam rim pa dang/slob dpon mgon po/bka' bcu pa nam blo/rtogs ldan (299) brtson 'grus 'bum byang sems shAkya rim chen dpal rgyal sras shar lung pa drung pa 'jam dbyangs gzhon nu mkhas grub gnyis ldan gyi bla ma bzhi bcu lhag bsten nas zab rgyas kyi chos bka' dpag tu med pa gsan cing bsam sgom tshul bzhin du mdzad pas mkhas par gyur dgung lo bzhi bcu pa rab byung brgyad pa'i sa khyi (1478)lor 'brog dga' ldan rnam par rgyal ba'i gling chen por 'jam dbyangs chos rje dang khri rin po che ba so chos kyi rgyal mtshan pas mkhan po dang rab 'byams pa bkra shis rgyal mtshan gyis slob dpon sems dpa' chen po dpal ldan don grub pas gang ston bcas mdzad de dad pa'i dge slong bcu tshogs kyi dbus su ba snyan rdzogs kyi sdom bzhes legs par bskyangs yer pa lha ri snying po dang long po ri bo chos 'phel bkra shis chos lung dang nyi zla thang nyi ma gling de mo blo gsal gling spo bo chu mdo dgon rgyu ri bo che sogs sa dgon sde nyi shu tsam phyag btab pa dang de rnams la sku gsum thugs rten yang bsam gyis mi khyab pa gsar bzhengs bskyangs brtsams chos kyang (bde mchog snyan brgyud kyi dkyil 'khor zin bris che chung )dang (spyi don blo gsal mgul rgyan )sogs mang du mdzad dgung grangs zhe dgu bzhes pa rab byung brgyad pa'i me log (1487)lo'i hor zla bcu gcig pa'i tshes nyer bzhi nyen brag gsum mtsho chu'i phu ma nang lung pa zhes bya bar zhi bar gshegs sku gdung ril po thog mar mda' phu mdo chen dgon du gdan drangs de nas bla ma byang chub snying pos thabs mkhas nang nas bkra shis chos lung du gdan drangs te gser sdong bkra shis 'od 'bar du bzhugs su gsol zhes grags}
'phags pa sangs rgyas|{(sku phreng gnyis pa )'di nyid ni sku gong ma zhing du gshegs nas lo ngo nyi shu song ba rab byung dgu pa'i me yos (1507)lor yab rnal 'byor gyi dbang phyugs sangs rgyas bkra shis dang yum chos ldan sgrol ma gnyis kyi sras su chos khang rtsa zhes par sku 'khrungs/dgung grangs bcu gdu bar sus kyang brtag dpyad gdan 'dren zhu mkhan byung med cing/de'i lor gzim khang nas bros te de mo la brgyud dga' ldan du phebs/slob dpon nam mkha' dpal gyis mkhan po dang/de mo slob dpon bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyis las slob/slob dpon lha dbang dpal 'byor gyis gnang ston mdzad nas bsnyen par rdzogs/dgu ngalo nyer gsum nas khams phyogs su sbo bo yi ge dang/chu mdo sum rdzong/sbud mda'/tsha ba'i khul/nyag bre sogs su phebs te chos 'khor rgya cher bskor/de rjes thi lam la phebs bzhugs skabs 'jang gi dmag gsang thabs kyis slebs nas li thang grong bskos bas gang nyid bar 'dum du byon te mtha' sa dam rgyal pos dmag mi rgyag rgyu'i khas len dam bca' zhus/de nas kong po phyogs su byon rtsis skabs bod nas chos rje khri thog pa chos skyong rgya mtsho la zur bzhugs pa paN chen bsod nams grags pa/'bras spungs nas thams cad mkhyen pa dge 'dun rgya mtsho bzhes kyis 'jang zhabs su rje'i bstan pa la dgongs nas bzhugs dgos bka' yig bstsal don ltar sa dam rgyal po'i pho brang du phebs te zla gcag tsam ring rgyal po 'jam dbyangs grags pa'i thugs bzhes yongs su gang ba'i bka' chos nyin mtshan sbrel nas gnang bar 'bum ba bsam gyis mi khyab pa phul/dgung lo drug cu bzhes pa rab byung dgu pa'i me pho stag (1566)lo'i hor zla bcu gcig par phan bder sku gshegs/mdzad rnam cung zhib tsam bod ljongs srid gros kyis (bod kyi lo rgyus rig gnas dpyad gzhi'i rgyu cha bdams bsgrigs )dgu pa (spyi'i don thengs 18)nang gsal ba der gzigs}
'phags pa la mthong ba don ldan|{(sku phreng gsum pa )rje 'di ni 'phags pa sangs rgyas kyi sku skyer grags shing/rab byung bcu pa'i me yos (1567)lor long po stod du sku bltams/ngag dbang shAkya rgyal mtshan pa las rab tu byung/mtshan 'phags pa bsod nams rnam par rgyal ba dbang po'i sder gsol/me glang (1577)lor chab mdor phebs me khyi (1586)lor 'jam sa dam gyi yul du phebs/rje drung lha dbang chos kyi rgyal mtshan las bsnyen par rdzogs shing rta (1594)lor chab mdo byams pa gling gi mkhan po mdzad/dpon mgon po bsod nams kyis sbyin bdag byas te 'phags pa lhas spom mda' gsang sngags bde phyag btab/cha ba gangs dkar bde chen dgon zhes 'dogs par mdzad/dgung lo so brgyad la phebs pa rab byung bcu pa'i shing 'brug (1604)lor zhi bar gshegs}
'phags pa lha chos kyi rgyal po|{(sku phreng bzhi pa )rje 'di ni rab byung bcu pa'i shing sbrul (1605)lor long po stod du sku 'khrungs/'phags pa lha mthong ba don ldan gyi yang srid du ngos bzung/'phags pa lha thams cad las rnam pa rgyal ba chos kyi rgyal po'i sde zhes mtshan gsol/skyabs mgon rgyal ba'i dbang po pad dkar 'chang ba blo bzang rgya mtsho dang mjal zhing gsung gi bdud rtsi ngom med myangs/de nas paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan las bsnyen par rdzogs shing dam pa'i chos kyi zab chos ji snyed gsan/dgung lo bcu rug la phebs pa lcags sprel (1620)lor chab mdo'i gdan khrir phebs/bstan 'dzin chos kyi rgyal pos kyang gong du bkur zhing 'phrin las che ba'i mus dgung grangs sum cu so dgu la phebs pa rab byung bcu gcig pa chu lug (1643)lor sku gshegs}
'phags pa lha rgyal ba rgya mtsho|{(sku phreng lnga pa )rje 'di nyin rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing sprel (1644)lor rdza rgyud gnas chen go pho khyung phyug gam 'dab chags 'du zhes bya ba'i grong du sku bltams/paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan mchog gis 'phags pa lha'i sku skyer ngos 'dzin gnang zhing mtshan rgyal ba rgya mtshor gsol/zab chos mang du bstsal/dgung lo brgyad pa'i thog dpal ldan 'bras spungs dgon du thams cad mkhyen pa ngag dbang blo bzang rgya mtsho'i drung du dbu skra gtsug phud phul/mtshan blo bzang 'phags pa bsod nams lhun grub bde legs dpal bzang por bstsal/dgung lo dug la phebs pa ra byung bcu gcig pa'i chu 'brug (1652)lor chab mdo'i khrir phebs/dgung lo nyer gci gal phebs pa shing 'brug (1664)lor rgyal dbang lnga pa chen pos bla chen po dang paN chen brgyad de sdom pa'i chu bo rnam pa gnyis ka'i sgo nas bsnyen par rdzogs me lug (1667)lor slar yang dbus su phebs nas rgyal dbang mchog las zab chos du ma gsan/sa bya (1669)lor lcags ri'i dngul gdung chen mo legs par grub/sa lug (1679)lor dbus su byon nas gong ma chen po dang mjal 'dzoms kyis mdo sngags kyi gzhung la thos bsam mdzad/dgung grangs bdun cur phebs pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu sbrul (1713)lor dgongs pa zhi ba'i dbyings su thim}
'phags pa lha 'jigs med bstan pa'i rgya mtsho|{(sku phreng drug pa )chab mdo rdza rgyud gnas chen go bo phug gi lha zhol spu thog ces par yab lha rje tshe dbang nor bu dang yum tshe ring skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing rta (1714)lo'i hor zla gnyis pa'i tshes nyer bdun nyin sku 'khrungs/paN chen blo bzang ye shes mchog nas 'phags pa ye shes bstan pa'i mgon po zhes pa'i mtshan dang mtshan spel gyi brtan bzhugs gsol 'debs rgyas par bstsal/dgung lo dgu pa chu yos (1723)lor dbus su phebs te rgyal dbang bskal bzang rgya mtsho la (301) gtsug phud phul mtshan 'phags pa 'jigs med bstan pa'i rgya mtsho zhes bstsal paN chen blo bzang ye shes kyi drung nas dge bsnyen dang dge tshul gyi bslab pa rdzogs par bzhes zhogs don yod mkhas grub kyi drung nas lam gyi gtso bo rnam gsum sogs gsan zhing dka' gnad kyi dogs gcod rnams gnang rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa phag (1719)lor gong mas bod gangs ti ser thig phyin tshad len par mngags pa'i dpon dmag rnams la cham mdo nas sa tshugs kyi zhabs zhu'i byed sgo gang legs zhus pa dang gong ma'i zhabs brtan nas bstan 'gro'i phan bde spel ba'i bya ba rlabs po che sgrub par brten gong mas er ti ni no mon han gyi mtshan gnas tham ka gser yig bcas bstsal sku phreng 'di nas rgya nag tu gong mar 'tshams zhu'i sba yer 'bul mi mngags srol thog ma byung dgung grangs zhe gcig tu bzhes pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing khyi (1754)lor zhing du gshegs so/_}
'phags pa lha 'jigs med bstan pa'i mgon po|{(sku phreng bdun pa )mdo smad sbo 'bor sgang li thang thub chen byams pa gling gi zhol du yab a brtan mgon po dang yum rgyal mchog bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i yum gyi sku mched sde pa a 'bum gyi sras mo sgrol ma 'phel gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing phag (1755)lor sku bltams/dgung grangs bdun du bzhes pa lcags sbrul (1761)lor dbus su chibs sgyur bskyangs te paN chen dpal ldan ye shes kyi drung du dbu'i gtsug phud phul nas mtshan ye shes 'jig med dpal ldan bstan pa'i mgon po zhes gsol/slar chab mdor phyir phebs kyis chos skyong dang yig klog sogs gsan sbyong gnang/dgung grangs bcu bdun bzhes pa lcags yos (1771)lor dbus su byon te ser byes grwa tshang du chos zhugs mdzad nas lo lnga'i ring dbu tshar sogs mtshan nyid gsan sbyong gnang/paN chen rin po che'i drung nas bsnyen rdzogs bzhes/dgung grangs nyer gcig bzhes pa'i shing lug (1775)lor chab mdo dgon du phyir phebs mdzad khar rgyal dbang sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho mchog dang de mo mchod yon nas gzengs bstod rgya cher mdzad/me sprel (1776)lor bla brang gi pho brang rnying pa bshigs nas gsar skrun gyi dbu 'dzugs bskyangs te sa phag (1779)lo rten dang brten pa'i tshon rtsi ldebs ris dang bcas legs grub byung/rgya dpon krung thang bal bod 'khrug rtsod skor gyi don gcod du yong nas pe cing du phyir logs skabs chab mdor 'byor bas 'phags pa lha sku 'khor nas sne len phebs rdzong gzab rgyas gnang/dgung grangs bzhi bcur bzhes pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing stag (1794)lo'i hor zla drug pa'i tshes bcu nyid gyi phyi'i dro sku rlung 'phar ldang che ba'i tshul bzhes kyis gzugs sku chos dbyings su thim tshul bstan pa'o/_}
'phags pa lha blo bzang 'jigs med dpal ldan bstan pa'i nyi ma|{(sku phreng brgyad pa )rab byung bcu gsum 'i shing yos (1795)lor li thang du 'khrungs/mi 'brug zla ba brgyad pa'i tshes gcig nyid rgyal dbang sku phreng brgyad 'jam dpal rgya mtsho dang/srid skyong rta tshag no mon han/bod sdod sung am ban/heng am ban bcas lha 'dzoms kyis 'phags pa lo ke shwa ra'i spyan sngar gong ma'i 'dra thang bdun gser bum brtag nas thon pa bzhed gong mar gser snyan sgron par bod sdod sung am ban brgyud gong mar gser yag dang kha btags sogs bstsal ba'i gzigs bzos thob/dgung lo zhe gsum pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me lug (1847)lor sku gshegs}
'phags pa lha mkhas grub ngag dbang blo bzang 'jigs med bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{(sku phreng dgu pa )rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa bya (1849)lor (302) li thang du 'khrungs chu bya'i zla 6tshes 12nyin rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gcig pa mkhas grub rgya mtsho mchog la snyan zhus dang 'brel srid skyong rwa sgreng ngag dbang ye shes tshul khrims sogs nas lha ldan gtsug lag khang gi ngo bo shAkya mu ne'i spyan snga dang po ta lar gong ma'i 'dra thang mdun gser bub dkrugs te thon pas gong mar gser snyan sgron pa dang 'brel mi 'brug (1856)lo'i zla 9tshen22la gdan sar 'khod sku phreng 'di nyid nas brag g.yab yu bde zhod 'jags yong ba'i las don la sku na phra yang rang 'og mi rigs la bkod pa btang ste zhabs 'degs bshad mo phul ba'i gzigs bzos su gong ma chen po'i lung mong go la sbyor khang brgyud bod sdod am ban nas man ju'i yi ge'i thog bka' bsgyur byas pa'i nang gsal mi dbyon chan zhe zhes pa'i cho lo bstsal yang thung kri khri bzhugs drug pa zla gnyis pa'i tshes gnyis la bstan dgra nyag rong mthar skrod gnang skabs chab mdo dang dpag dang phogs kyi zhabs 'degs byung ba'i gzigs bzos su jin yod chan zhi'i mtshan dang bstod bsngags yig rigs shan sbyar gyi ban sogs bstsal thung kri khri bzhugs drug par gong ma chen po nas 'phags pa lhas mkhar srung dpon dmag gi phogs thob khongs su zhal 'debs spam mi mda' tsam dad 'bul zhus pa sogs kyi skor la gzigs bzos su ho thog khe thu'i gser yig dang zhwa ser bstan pa ches cher gsal bar mdzad pa'i er ti ni ho thog thu'i tham ga zhes 'i dgung tham bcas 'tshams zhu zhabs brtan sba yer 'bul mi mkhan po 'phags pa shes rab brgyud de bstsal dgung grangs nga gnyis bzhes pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags byi (1900)lor sku gshegs}
'phags pa lha blo bzang thub bstan mi pham tshul khrims rgyal mtshan|{(sku phreng bcu pa )rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags glang (1901)lor smar khams rdo 'bum sgang du yab ye shes chos 'phel dang yum tshul khrims sgrol dkar gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i skabs jo bo shAkya mu ne'i spyan sngar gser bum dkrugs thon gyis chab mdo'i khrir bkod/dgung grangs bcu gcig pa chu byi (1912)lor kra'o er zung gi rjes 'jug phin thun lin nas chab mdo bla dgos phyi nang snod bcud mer bsreg rtsa brlag btang bas chags gnas bral te rten g.yol dang chabs cig lha sar chos lugs slob gnyer du phebs nas gsan bsam slob gter gnang ba dang rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pas blo bzang thub bstan mi pham tshul khrims rgyal mtshan zhes pa'i mtshan gsol/dgung grangs bcu bdun pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa rta (1918)lor dgon gnas nyams gso'i don du tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum par snyan zhu phul don slob gnyer mjug skyong mtshan btags len rgyu dang bsnyen rdzogs sgrub rgyur dgon pa gzhi rkang nyams gso tshar bstan slar yang gdan sar zhabs bcar zhu rgyu'i dgongs khrol zhus smin gyis rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa lug (1919)lor dgung grangs bco brgyad bzhes skabs chab mdor phyir phebs kyis dgon gnas gsar bzhengs kyi rtsa 'dzin gtan tshigs sa lug she bar gnyan phebs sogs kyi las don gnang mur lcags sprel (1920)lor dgung grangs bcu dgu bzhes lor rigs ma bsten zhes la brten rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pas phyin chad dge ldan gyi bstan 'dzin bla sprul che khag nas bstan rtsa so thar gyi bca' khrims ras su bor ba'i bag med 'chol spyod mi yong ba'i phyis lar 'chun 'doms ched 'phags pa lha'i ho thog thu'i go gnas dbyangs te gser yig las tham mdo spyi bka' bla nas dam bsnan dang 'brel chab bla nas dpon g.yon bdun gyi gsol phogs phul te dben pa'i ri khrod cig tu bshags sdom kyi bcad rgyar sdod dgos pa sogs kyi bkod rgya tsha nan phebs 'brel 'phags pa lha'i chos srid kyi las (303) tshab zhi ba lha sku phreng drug pa bstan 'dzin 'phrin las bsko gzhag gis 'phags pa sku phreng bcu pa de nyid mar thang grong khul bzhugs khang zhan po zhig tu zur bzhugs gnang dgos pa byung yod 'on kyang sde dgon mi ser bcas pas brtsi bkur dad gus sngar mus zhus pa dang gang nyid nas dgon 'phangs thugs blos su ma btang bar dgon pa nyams gso'i las don la mu mthun thugs 'khur bzhes shing dpa' shod rap+saparul gdan drangs te 'dus grwa dge tshul slong gi sdom pa 'bog 'jug pa dang dbang lung zhu 'jug pa kar mda' khri sprul gdan drangs te rgyud sde'i dbang dang bka' bstan gyi lung rgyun spel thabs mdzad cha bya (1933)lor sde mgon spyi mgrin nas rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum par 'phags pa lha gang 'di'i go ming bskyal gso yong ba'i re 'dun snyan zhu dang sbrags spyi 'thus rtse bla brang gi mgron gnyer don rgyal lha sar mngags gtong byas skabs der bka' thag ma mchod gong sku phreng bcu gsum pa chen po dgongs pa rdzogs rung srid skyong rwa sgreng thub bstan 'jam dpal ye shes nas gnang ba'i srid tham 'go mchan du 'phags pa lha'i mtshan lung go gnas sngar lugs bskyar gso chog 'thus dang chos phyogs rab byung sdom pa 'bog chago sogs bla tshab dkon rdor sprul sku nas khur bzhes dgos zhes phebs don ltar rab byung bcu drug pa'i shing khyi (1934)lor dgung grangs 33bzhes lo hor zla 9tshes 22 nyin 'phags pa lha sku phreng bcu pa'i btsan gnas bskyar gso'i khri gsol mdzad sgo bskyangs shing phag (1935)lo'i hor zla 9tshes 22lha bab dus chen nyid pha bong kha rin po che chab mdor zhabs sor 'khod skabs phebs bsu ser sbrengs sogs bkur bsti sri zhu bla med mdzad dgung grangs so drug pa me glang (1937)lo'i zla dgu pa'i tshes nyer brgyad nyin sku khams cung bsnyun tshul bstan pas zhabs ri dang brtan bzhugs gsol ba thengs mang btab kyang dwangs bskyed ma byung bar chab mdor sku gshegs}
'phags pa lha blo bzang bstan 'dzin dge legs rnam rgyal|{(sku phreng bcu gcig pa )rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa yos (1939)hor zla 12tshes 8nyin li thing dgon chen dang nye ba mtsho gsum pa'i khongs a mdo grong sna lu tshang ngam chu bskor zhes par yab blo bzang ngag dbang dang yum rig 'dzin sgrol ma gnyis kyi sras su sku bltams/sngar lam gser bum dkrugs 'don zhu srol yang de skabs de ltar bya rgyu'i cha rkyen mer khar rgyal ba sku phreng bcu bzhi pa sku na phra bas srid skyong stag brag la gnas tshul snyan zhu phul bar ched mngags lha sar mi sna mngags gtong gis zla ba bzhi pa'i tshes shar la snyan zhu'i bka' lan phyir phebs su 'phags pa lha'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin khri gsol byas 'thus zhes srid tham 'go mchan bstsal 'byor skabs dga' bsu'i mdzad sgo bstar/tA la'i bla ma nas mtshan bstan 'dzin 'jigs med dge legs rnam rgyal zhes dang srid skyong stag brag nas gos chen ser po'i thog 'phags pa lhar ngag dbang blo bzang lung rtogs bstan pa'i gsal byed dpal bzang zhes pa'i mtshan yig dam 'byar dang mtshan spel gyi zhabs brtan gsol 'debs bcas gnang/dge bshes mkhyen rab mthar phyin yongs 'dzin du bsten nas phyag bris yig klog dang phyag dpe thugs 'dzin gnang/dge bshes byams pa mtha' yas kyi drung du dge bsnyen dang dge tshul gyi bslab sdom bzhes/dge bshes thub bstan dam pa brten nas gzhung chen bka' pod lags na bsam thugs gnyer rgyu 'khyongs mdzad/dgung gras bcu gnyis bzhes pa lcags stag (1950)lor chab mdo mtshan nyid grwa tshang du rigs chung tshogs bzhengs gnang/gong lo'i zla 10pa'itshes 19nyin te chab mdor bcings 'grol dmag 'byor ba'i nyin gsum par 'thab sa mdun ma'i bkod 'doms dmag spyi wang chi med bla brang du phebs (304) nas phan tshun 'tshams 'dri mdzad rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu 'brug (1952)dgung lo bcu bzhi'i thog dbus phyogs su chibs zhal bsgyur zhing de nas mi ring bar se rar chos zhugs mdzad pa nas bzung se rar gtan bzhugs kyis rigs lam che chung gi slob gnyer dam bzhes gas legs grub zin nas lcags byi (1960)lor dgung grangs nyer gnyis su phebs skabs lha rabs mtshan rtags bzhes 'char yod kyang sa phag (1959)lo'i zing 'khrug dus dbang gi rkyen pas lha rabs mtshan bzhes gnang thabs bral sku phreng 'di'i srid phyogs kyi mtshan gnas thad thog ma (1951)lo'i zla dang por krung hwa mi dmangs spyi mthun rgyal khab mdo smad mnga' khul mi dmangs bcings 'grol u yon lhan khang gi mi dmangs 'thus tshogs kyi kru'u ren bzhon pa dang po'i mtshan gnas bzhes pa nas snga rjes su bod rang skyong ljongs gra sgrig u yon lhan khang gi rgyun las u yon kru'u ren u yon gzhon pa rang skyong ljongs mi mdangs u lhan gyi kru'u zhig gzhon pa rdzongs mi dmangs srid gzhung gi kru'u zhig gzhon pa rang srid grong skabs gsum pa dang bzhi pa lnga pa drug pa bdun pa bcas kyi u yon dang kru'u zhi gzhon pa bcas gnang thog skabs brgyad pa'i rgyal yongs mi dmangs 'thus tshogs rgyun las u yon lhan khang gi u yon krang gzhon pa'i mtshan gnas bzhes te da ltar bar byung bcu bdun pa'i shing phag (1995)lor dgung grangs nga bdun du 'tsho zhing bzhes pa lags so/_/'phags pa lha sku phreng rim gyi mdzad rnam zhib tsam gzigs 'dod tshe bod rang skyong ljongs srid gros lo rgyus rig gnas dpyad gzhi'i rgyu cha a yon lhan khang gis rtsom grib byas pa'i (bod kyi lo rgyus rig gnas dpyad gzhi'i rgyu cha bdams bsgrigs )deb dgu pa (spyi'i 'don theng 28)nangagasalab der gzigs}
'phags pa lha khang|{pho brang po ta la'i khang zhig ste/de'i nang rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos rgya gar dang bal yul gyi mtha' mtshams nags khrod cig nas gdan drangs pa'i rang byung 'phags pa mched bzhi'i nang tshan 'phags lo ke shwa ra'i snang brnyan bzhugs sa'i lha khang yin pas nag 'phags pa lha khang du btags pa yin/sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i (gser gdung 'dzam gling rgyan gcig gi dkar chag )nang 'khod pa ltar na/'phags pa lha khang dang chos rgyal sgrub phug gnyis gna' rabs kyi shul ma nyams par gnas yod pa byin rlabs can yin pa'i dbang gis bshig ma nus par rang 'jags bzhag yod par bshad/lha khang 'di'i dkyil du rgyal po srong btsan sgom pos bal yul nang gnas drangs pa'i tsan dan las grub pa'i 'phags pa lo ke shwa ro'i sku dang/de'i g.yas ngos su mnga' ris skyid grong dub zhugs 'i 'phags pa wa ti'i 'dra cog /tA la'i bla ma sku phreng pa pe cin du phebs pa'i lam bar sog po'i wang nas phul ba'i tsan+dan dmar po rnams bod du bsnams nas gsar du bzhengs pa'i nye ba'i sras chen brgyad sogs lo rgyus rang bzhin ldan pa'i sku brnyan che chung ha cang mang po bzhugs pa da lta nyams chag med par gnas yod}
