'phan po'i sgor gzhas|{'phan po khul du sgor gzhas dar so che bar brten lo gsar dang/'ong skor sogs kyi skabs yul lung so so'i pha mo rnams sgor gzhas rgyag srol yod cing/skabs re mtshan mo me skong brgyab nas mtshan gang sgor gzhas rgyag gi yod/lhag par dar yul du gla gzhan dar so che stabs glu gzhas dar ba'i dar yul yin zer/'phan po'i sgor gzhas lag zhas gdangs dang gzhas tshig /rkang pa'i 'degs 'jog /lag pa'i ngas stabs sogs la dmigs bsal gyi khyad chos yod/gzhan tshig phal cher yul lung dang/grangs can skye bo lag ka'i brgyud rim/nam zla dus bzhi sogs la dpe blangs pa yin 'dug }
'phan yul stong sde|{'phan yul stod smad la gnas pa'i stong sde}
'phan yul dar rgyal|{deng sang gi sa bkra'i thog 'phan po'i lung par dar rgyal zer ba'i sa ming ma 'khod pas sa gnas de 'dra yod med zhib 'jug dgos}
'phan yul zal mo sgang|{sa gnas 'di 'phan por yod nges kyang/deng sang 'phan por sa ming de 'dra byas pa'i sa cha yod med zhib 'jug byed dgos}
'phar bskul dngos dod|{khral 'phar ma bskul ba'i dngos dod}
'phar 'khri 'gel sgrub|{rnam kun sgrub mi dgos kyang skabs der btsan dbang gis 'phar ma mtshan 'gel byas stabs mi ser rnams gang yang zer ma nus par sgrub dgos byung ba}
'phul rten gnyis|{yi ge'i sngon rjes gnyis}
'phul yig lnga|{sngon 'jug yi ge ga da ba ma 'a ste lnga}
'phen byed rgyu dang 'bras bu'i yan lag bcu gcig|{'phen par byed pa rgyu'i yan lag /'phangs par 'bras ba'i yan lag /mngon par 'grub par byed pa'i yan lag /mngon par grub pa 'bras bu'i yan lag /gang gis 'phen pa'i yan lag /ji ltar 'phen pa'i yun lag /gang la 'phangs pa'i yan lag /gang gis 'grub pa'i yan lag /nyes dmigs kyi yan lag /ji ltar 'grub pa'i yan lag /gang 'grub pa'i yan lag go}
'phen byed rdzogs byed kyi las gnyis|{'chi kha'i mtshams sbyar bzang ngan dang dkar nag las gyi bye brag }
'phen byed las gsum|{bsod nams kyi las/bsod nams min pa'i las/mi g.yo ba'i las bcas gsum dang/yang na las byas shing bsags pa/bsags pa ma byas pa/byas la ma bsags pa gsum mo/_}
'phen byed las gsog dus kyi bsam pa gsum|{'du shes/nyon mongs/kun slong bcas gsum mo/_}
'phen rdzogs kyi lam bzhi|{'phen byed dge bas 'phangs shing rdzogs byed mi dge bas rdzogs pa/'phen byed mi dge bas 'phangs shing rdzogs byed dge bas rdzogs pa/'phen rdzogs gnyid ka dge ba dang/gnyis ka mi dge ba'o/_}
'phel gyi mang lugs|{mang du 'gro lugs sam/mang du 'gro stangs}
'phel zad 'khrugs gsum|{lus kyi 'byung khams 'phel zad 'khrugs pa'i don}
'pho skyas|{sa gnas gcig tu gtan 'jags su ma bsdad par yang nas yang du spo bskyod byas pa/dper na/'brog pa'i ru ba dbyar dgun 'pho skyas byed pa/(tsa)}
'pho ba'i skabs kyi bu ga dgu|{tshangs bug /smin mtshams/mig /rna/sna/kha/lte ba/chu lam/bshang lam bcas so/_}
'pho ba'i dbye ba bcu gcig|{sbyangs te 'pho dang ting nge 'dzin/_/srog dang rtsol bas 'pho ba dang/lus kyi rtsol bas 'pho ba dang/_/rnam shes bla mar 'pho ba dang/_/btsan thabs dag tu 'pho ba dang/_/spros med chos sku'i 'pho ba dang/spros bcas gzugs sku'i 'pho ba dang/logs spyod rdzogs sku'i 'pho ba dang/sprul pa sku yi 'pho ba dang/yid 'ong mkha' 'gro'i 'pho ba bcas yin no/_}
'phong gi gnas lnga byang ba|{1 rim gyis bsgrims na phog pa dang/2 bsgrim mi dgos par phog par 'byang la/da dung sbyangs pas rgyang ring por phog pa dang/3 gang la 'phangs kyang mi 'chor bar phog pa/4 gang la gtad sa ltar gdan du phog pa/5 shugs sam tshabs che bar phog pa dang gzugs ma mthong yang sgra grags pa la gtan nas 'phangs pas phog par byang ba'o/_}
'phongs rkyen sna lnga|{mda' rtsal gnas lnga la byang chub (309) pa'i don te 1 gnad du phog pa 2 chags che bar phog pa 3 rgyang ring bar phog pa 4 sgra grags par phog pa 5 mi 'chor bar phog pa bcas yin}
'phyang mo nyug|{the tshom gyi dra ba'i khong du chod pa ltar yin min rnam 'byed mi shes pa}
'phyang mo sel byed|{the tshom sel byed ces pa'i don/'phyang 'khrul ni mtha' gnyis kar dngos po yod pa ltar phyogs gnyis kar dogs pa za ba}
'phyan rgyu|{'phyan ni dbang med du yul rgyal ba'ang 'khyam pa la zer}
'phyar g.yeng byed|{spyir btang la sems g.yengs pa dang/rtse mo rgod bro byed pa lta bu bag med pa'i don la 'jug }
'phying ba rtse drug|{sngar bod rgyal legs drug skabs 'phyongs rgyas su btab pa'i pho brang drug ste/stag rtse dang/rgod rtse/yang rtse/khri rtse/rtse mo khyung rgyal/khri brtsegs 'bum gdugs bcas so/_}
'phyur|{long long gis 'thon pa'i rnam 'gyur gyi ming}
'phyon po|{skyes pa 'chal po'i ming ste/(bod kyi brda skad mig gzhi gsal bar ston pa'i bstan bcos )las/'phyon po gzhan gyi bud med bkod mkhan de/zhes gsungs pa ltar ro/_/(tsa)}
'phyor 'dod|{phyi logs la 'dra chags po zhig 'dod pa}
'phrang|{'og tu chu dang brag g.yang gzar po yod la/steng du yang 'gro sa'i lam chung ngu zhig las med pa/gom pa spos stabs ma 'grig lam ser zags 'gro sa de 'dra zhig la zer}
'phral gyi thabs rdugs|{bsam blo brtan brtan ma btang bar sems shar tshad lag len la bka' ba'i don}
'phral thes phugs thes|{don dag che chung yod tshad nges pa'i don te/(be'u bum sngon po )las/'o skol de'i dus su 'bral thes phugs thes thams cad gcod de sre mong gi gtam du 'gro nyen che ba yin/zhes pa ltar ro/_}
'phral bde las khungs|{'di ni de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi gsham 'og las khungs te rtse phyag las khungs zhes de yin pas gsham du tsa sde'i nang rtse phyag las khungs zhes par gzigs}
'phral 'phral rtsa 'dzin byed|{dus thog tu skyon brjod byed dgos pa la skyon brjod dang nyes chad gtong dgos pa la nyes chad gtong ba}
'phrin pa mkhan|{spyir btang na pho nya'am/bang chen la go dgos}
'phrin byang|{bka' yig byang bu}
'phrin las|{spyir 'phrin las ni mdzad spyod kyi 'phro 'du'am sangs rgyas kyi mdzad pa'i 'phrin las la go dgos te/sangs rgas kyi 'phrin las ni rang gi rgyur gyur pa'i ye shes chos sku'i bdag rkyen las byung ba'i rnam dkar gyi yon tan de rigs sangs rgyas kyis gdul bya'i rgyud la 'jug par byed pa'i las de yin/rdzogs pa'i sangs rgyas rnams kyi 'phrin las ni 'di dang 'di lta bu bya'o snyam pa'i rnam par rtog pa dang 'bad rtsol cung zad kyang mi mnga' bzhin du sngon gyi thugs bskyed dang smon lam rgya chen po'i mthun yid bzhin nor gyi nor bu'i 'bad rtsol med par 'od zer spro ba sku gsum thugs kyi 'phrin las mtha' yas pas gdul bya bsam gyis mi khyab pa'i don 'bad med lhun gyis grub par 'byung ste/rgyud bla ma las/gang zhig gang gis gdul ba yi/_/bya gang gang du gang gi tshe/_/de yi rnam rtog skye med phyir/_/thug pa rtag tu lhun gyis grub/_/ces gsungs}
'phrin las kyi kha lo pa|{'di zhe sa byas pa tsam las don du las don sgrub mi'i gtso bo zhes pa'i don}
'phrin las kyi lhag ma|{sku 'das skabs mjug /skyong ma grub par lus pa'i mdzad pa'i lhag ma ste mdzad rjes kyi (310) 'phro lus}
'phrin las sgrub pa la brten pa'i ltung ba bco lnga|{me tog phog pa'i lha dor gzhan bzang rtog /rang lha'i bskyed rdzogs nyin mtshan dus las yol/phyi rol ltar dkar bskyed rim dngos por zhen/rang gis dbang ma rdzogs pa gzhan la bskur/tshe 'di'i ched du zab mo'i don rnams ston/bslab pa 'og mar brnyas dang tshul 'chos byed/nus med las sbyor don med g.yeng bas 'da'/_/skyabs nus mi skyob 'og ma'i spyod la dga'/zang zing la chags dam nyams 'dul mi byed/spyod pa dus skabs mi 'brel spyad bco lnga'o/_}
'phrin las brgyad|{rol rtse la sna tshogs mdzad/rdzu 'phrul sna tshogs mdzad/bam ro'i rub mdzad/pha ma a bu mdzad/sangs rgyas byang sems mdzad/bod yul zhabs btags mdzad/rin chen gter sbas mdzad/srin po'i kha gnon mdzad do/_}
'phrin las lnga|{zhi ba/rgyas pa/dbang/drag po/lhun gyis grub pa'o/_}
'phrin las gnyis|{byed pa po rang la yod pa dang/bya ba yul la 'jug pa'i 'phrin las so/_}
'phrin las rnam bzhi|{zhi rgyas dbang drag bzhi'o/_}
'phrul 'khor brgyad|{thang rdzong gcig par bya ba'i phyir rdo'i 'phrul 'khor/chu rdzong 'jig pa gru'i 'phrul 'khor/ri rdzong 'joms me'i 'phrul 'khor/brtsigs pa 'jig pa gur gyi 'phrul 'khor/rang phyogs sam pho brang srung ba byed pa rlung gi 'phrul 'khor/gzhan bde bar spod pa rtse mo byed pa rlung gi 'phrul 'khor/me tog dag bzang shing gi ra ba'i don du chu byed du 'dren pa'i 'phrul 'khor/go cha 'jig pa lcags mda'i 'phrul 'khor lo/_/('di ni dus 'khor lugs so/)}
'phrul 'khor bcu gnyis|{dus 'khor nas bshad pa'i 'phrul 'khor bcu gnyis te/sgyogs kyi 'phrul 'khor/gru'i 'phrul 'khor/gri gug gi 'phrul 'khor/gur yi 'phrul 'khor/lcags mda'i 'phrul 'khor/ral gri'i 'phrul 'khor/me'i 'phrul 'khor/rlung gi 'phrul 'khor/shing rta'i tshad/khang bzang/khyogs kyi mtshan nyid/chu gyen du 'dren pa'i 'phrul 'khor dang bcug nyis so/grangs 'di me tog phreng spel las/'di la ngo mtshar ba'i sbyor ba bcu gnyis zer yang/gzhan rnams kha mtshungs so/_}
'phrul 'khor bzhi|{sbyin sreg /yan+t+ra rdzas/man+t+ra sngags/tan+t+ra ting nge 'dzin no/_}
'phrul gyi me long srid gsum mthong ba|{sngar rgya dkar nag dang/bod kyi lo rgyus sgrung gtam mang po'i nang shel rdo'i rigs las byung ba'i me long zhig gi dus bltas nas 'jig rten khams gnas tshul tshang ma mthong dub pa de dar yod tshul bshad pa ma zad/rgya gar gyi sman pa mkhas pa 'tsho byed gzhon nus shel rdo'i rigs kyi nor bu zhig rnyed pa de nad pa'i mgo thag tu bzhag pa tsam gyis nad pa de'i lung po'i nang gi na gzhi gang dang gang yod mthong thub pa byung tshul ('dul ba sman gyi gzhi'i gleng gzhi )nang gsal}
'phrul thig|{shing las bzos pa'i mi'i gzugs brtan mi 'dra ba rnams sgul byed kyi thag pa'i sne mo nas 'then pa na gzugs brnyan rnams mi gson po dang 'dra bar g.yo 'gul byed thub pa'i thag sgul 'dra gzugs kyi sne mor yod pa'i thag pa}
'phrul snang gi gan+d+ho la|{'di lha sa gtsug lag khang la bstod bsngags byas pa'i ming ste/sngar bal bza' khri btsun gyis gtsug lag khang 'di bzhengs skabs mthil zhal rnams me long phyis pa ltar dwangs shing de'i ngos su steng gi logs bris dang 'bur brkos sogs kyi gzugs (311) brnyan gsal bar snang ba zhig yod de rgyal po srong btsan sgom por gzigs su phul bar rgyal pos khyed kyis bzhengs pa'i lha khang 'di 'phrul du snang ngo zhes gsungs pa la brten nas 'phrul snang du thogs pa dang gan+d+ho la zhes pa'i rgya gar gyi skad de bod skad dub sgyur na dri gtsang khang zhes dbus su sangs rgyas kyi sku gzugs dang gsung rten bzhugs pa'i lha khang dang de'i mtha' bskor du khyams bcas yod pa zhig la zer de dag skor zhib phra lha sa gtsug lag khang 'di'i lo rgyus tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas mdzad pa'i (lha ldan sprul pa'i gtsug lag khang gi dgar chag shel dkar me long )dang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pas mdzad pa'i (lha ldan sprul pa'i gtsug lag khang la nyams gsos bgyis pa'i dkar chag (bcas su gzigs deng skabs kyi lo rgyus yig cha 'ga' zhig tu gtsug lag khang 'di rgya bza' kong jos bzhengs pa yangs zer ba dang rgyas phas gdan drangs pa'i jo bo shAkya mu ne'i gzugs gnas kyi ched du bzhengs pa yin zer ba sogs ni lo rgyus la rgyus mnga' med pa'i gtam yin no/_}
'phrul blon bcu drug|{rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i skabs gyi grags can blon po bcu drug yod de/med thabs med pa'i bka' yi 'phrul blon bzhi/nang blon bzang po drug /phyi blo btsan po drug bcas yin/de rnams ming ni (rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )dang (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang gsal}
'phrul blon mdzangs pa'i mi bdun|{gna' rabs bod kyi btsan po rim byung gi skabs blon po gzhan dang mi 'dra ba'i byas rjes yod pa'i blon po mkhas mdzangs can bdun la zer/de ni/1 rgyal po pu te gung rgyal skabs kyi blon po ru las skyes ('dis blon po lo ngam btul zhing/shing me la bsregs te song ba'i me'i nang gser dngul zangs lcags bzhu ba/shing la mig phug nas gnya' shing bzo ba/rmon phyugs gnyis bsgrigs nas rmon pa rgyag pa/phu chu yur bar drangs te zhing la chu gtong ba/spang thang sbol nas zhing 'debs pa/chu la zab pa 'dzugs pa bcas/) 2 rgyal po i sho legs skabs kyi blon po lha bu mgo dkar ('dis sa zhing gi rgya khyon dor kha rtsis nas tshad 'jal ba dang/'brog las la thub ka brtsis te sems can kha grangs mang nyung 'jal thabs gtan khel bzos/) 3 rgyal po stag ri gnyan gzigs skabs kyi ngor snang mang btsan ('dis shong tshang 'jal ba'i bre phul gyi tshad gzhi dang/ljid tshad 'degs pa'i srang gi tshad gzhi thog mar bzos te zhing 'brog gnyis kyi tshong las la stabs bde dang gong 'phel chen po byung/) 4 rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i skabs kyi slob dpon thong mi sam b+ho Ta ('dis bod spyi'i phal skad dang mthun pa'i deng skabs kyi bod yig gsar gtod dang brda sprod rig pa'i bstan bcos brgyad mdzad/) 5 rgyal po srong btsan sgom po'i skabs kyi blon po gnyags khri bzang yang ston ('dis 'bangs kyi ri khyim klung thang spos te mkhar grong dang grong khyer du bsgyur/) 6 rgyal po khri srong lde btsan skabs kyi blon chen 'gos khri bzang yab lhag ('dis khrims khang du zhu gtugs byed skabs phan tshun kha gtad gnyis phyogs nas phul ba'i zhu ba las gzhir bzung nas bden rdzun brtag dpyad bya thabs kyi byang chub rigs dgu bzos te gsos thang dang/dgung blon chen po nas 'bangs kyi rab rim pa mthong dman dang bstun nas rmas pa dang bsad pa'i stong 'jal che chung gi stong thang gsar pa gtan 'bebs byas/7 rgyal po khri srong lde btsan skabs kyi blo po stag btsan ldong gzigs ('dis 'bangs mi khyim res rta re dang/mdzo re/ba re/glang re bcas gso dgos pa dang/dbyar kha rtswa mang po brngas te dgun rtswa gsog 'jog bya dgos par gtan 'bebs byas pa )bcas kyi byas rjes des bod kyi khrims lugs dang/skad yig /tshong las/zhing 'brog thon (312) skyed bcas la phan yod kyi nus pa chen po thon pa mthong thub}
'phrul yig|{'phrul yig la go don gnyis yod de gcig ni brda yig dang gnyer yig lta bu gsang bar spyod byed kyi yig gzugs dmigs bsal zhig la zer/dper na bka' btags 'phrul yig chen pa rat+na gling pa'i gter yig lta bu dang/gnyis pa ni chu yig dang/me yig rlung yig sogs 'bri bya dmigs bsal gyis bris pa'i yi ger zer}
'phrul gshen bal mtshon can|{'di ni bon shes pa can bcu gnyis kyi nang tshan smra shes gto rgu'i bon zer ba de yin/bal tshon sna lnga'i skud pa la brten nas nam mkha'/sa gzhi/khang bzang sogs lhas te mdos khang bzos pa'i mdun du nar pa'ang rkyen sel bya yul gyi 'dra brnyan bzhag /mtha' bskor du lha 'dre mthu ba'i mthun rdzas sna tshogs kyis gang ba bshams te gnod byed gdon 'dres bsngos pas bar chad sel ba dang/lha 'dre rnams kyi lo rgyus smra shes pa dang/de yi chos nyid dang phan gdon shes pa'i bon zhig la zer srol 'dug /mdos de yang gong bzhin bod kyi sangs rgyas chos lugs tshar mang yod}
'phreng ba'i tshul|{snying nye ba'i don}
'phrog byed|{'di lha dbang phyug dang/brgya byin/gshin rje/seng ge/ri dwags/nam mkha'/nyi ma/tsad+nan dkar po/a ru ra/lo ma'i 'khri shing/na la sham dkar po/dpa' bo bcas la 'jug }
'phrog byed dga' bo|{rgya gar lho phyogs nas byung ba'i mu stegs pa'i ston pa drug gi nang nas gtso bo zhig yin/'di sa paN gyis rtsod pas pham par byas te nang pa la btsud/mu stegs ston pa drug po'i mgo'i rab pa sa skya'i dbu rtse rnying ma na yod zer}
'phrod pa nyer brgyad|{kun dga' dus gyi dbyig pa dang/_/dul ba skye dgu gzhon bya rog /rgyal mtshan dpal be'u rdo rje tho/_/gdugs grogs yid 'dod mgal me dang/_/rtsa bton 'chi bdag ma 'grub pa/_/mdung dang bdud rtsi gtun shing dang/_/gling po stag myos zad g.yo brtan/_/'phel ba dang bcas nyer brgyad do/_}
'phrod sbyor bcu|{sa nang 'phrod pa dngos grub sbyor/chu nang 'phrod pa bdud rtsi sbyor/me nang 'phrod pa 'phel 'gyur sbyor/rlung nang 'phrod pa tshogs sbyor/_/sa chu 'phrod pa mi 'phrod sbyor/chu rlung 'phrod pa mi mthun sbyor/_/sa me 'phrod pa bsreg pa'i sbyor/me chu 'phrod pa 'chi ba'i sbyor dang bcu'o/_}
'phros khyab gang 'doms re shod rgyu|{phan tshun gnyis kar skad cha phan thogs yod pa re shod rgyu}
'phros bshad byas pa|{dogs pa sel ba'i gsal bshad byas pa}

ba ku la yi shing|{'di nyi ma dang zla bas kha 'byed mi nus par mdzes ma'i kha yi 'gram chu 'thor bas kha 'byed ces (mngon brjod )du bshad}
ba grus ma|{ba drus ma'am bzhon ma ste/be'u 'brangs pa'i ba mo}
ba glang rkyal 'jug|{ba glang chu'i nang du rkyal rgyag tu bcug pa ltar mi gzhan la rang snang gang dran byed du bcug pa}
ba dan|{mchod rdzas shig ste/dar gos tshogs zhi sna tshogs sprel ba'i rtse mo yul gsum can gyi lce lhe gsum brtsegs dang bzhi brtsegs sne mor g.yeng kha 'khrol ba/deng sang 'phan zer ba de yin/lha sa gtsug lag khang dang/po ta la/dgon pa khag bcas kyi ka 'phan la gzigs}
ba spos zan ma|{rtsa dang sman sna mang po skyes pa'i ri la ba dmar po gso tshags byas pa de rigs la zer}
ba byung lnga|{ba las byung ba'i ba'i chu dang/lci ba/'o ma/mar/zho'o/_}
ba ma ri|{lha sa'i nub phyogs kun bde gling gi rgyab ri la zer zhing/de'i skor gsham du bong ba ri zhes par gzigs}
ba ya be|{char pa gtor ba'i rlung gi ming la drang srong ba ya be zer}
ba rag|{lha sa'i shar phyogs kyi thang chen zhig }
ba ri rin chen grags|{(ba ri lo tsA ba yang zhu )'di nyid rang byung dang po'i lcags 'brug (1040)lor stod mnga' ris (khams su 'khrungs zhes pa'ang snang )su sku 'khrungs/gtso bor don zhags kyi skor la 'phrin las rtse ba lags/rgya gar du mu stegs kyi rgyal pos mi brgya phrag glud du gsod pa gser gang yod kyis blus/sas chen kun dga' snying po'i bla ma mdzad/sa skya gong ma 'khon dkon mchog rgyal po sku gshegs dus sras sa chen nar ma sod pas bla ma 'di nyid kyis gdan sa lo bcu'i bar bskyangs/mthar dgung lo don gnyis pa rab byung gnyis pa'i lcags yos (1111)lor sku gshegs/dgung lo don gnyis bzhugs shing/lo rgyus rgyas pa da phan ma mthong lags/'di nyid kyi 'gyur la/bka' 'gyur las/('phags ma 'od zer can zhes bya ba'i gzungs/) (bya rgyud/) (de bzhin gshegs pa thams cad kyi gtor rnam rnam par rgyal ba )zhes bya ba'i gzungs rtog pa dang bcas pa/('phags pa don yod zhags pa'i snying po zhes bya ba theg pa chen po'i mdo )sogs dang/bstan 'gyur las/(dpal dgyes pa'i rdo rje'i rgyud kyi rim pa las bdag byin gyis brlabs pa ku ru ku le'i sgrub thabs/) (rdo rje gur nas gsungs pa'i ro sreg gi cho ga) (dpal 'khor lo sdom pa'i dka' 'grel )sogs mang ngo/_}
ba Sh+Sha shi yi dus sbyor|{ba shi zhes pa rnam gnas sam nges pa can zhes las la rag las pa'am/las kyi gzhan dbang can zhes pa'i don du byas na cung go bde zhing/des na las 'bras rang steng du 'khor ba bzlog tu med pa'i dus sbyor dang 'dra ba zhes pa'i don yin nam snyam ste/mkhyen ldan rnams kyis dpyad par zhu}
ba shi|{bod kyi gdung rus shig gi ming ste/(deb ther sngon (313) po )las sangs rgyas dge slong ni yul rngog can gdung ba shi zhes pa ltar ro/_}
ba so ngag dbang dkon mchog nyi ma|{mdo smad 'ba' li thang chab dkar gyi mdo zhes bya bar yab ya snye dang yum tshe dbang mtsho gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu sbrul (1653)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga la sprul skur ngos 'dzin zhus/dgung lo bcu gcig la rgyal dbang lnga pa'i drung du rab byung bsgrubs/mtshan ngag dbang dkon mchog bstan pa'i nyi ma zhes bstsal/dgung lo bcu gnyis pa lag dan sar chos zhugs mdzad/dgung lo bco lnga la sa smad khul du 'bul sdud la phebs/dgung lo bcu drug la rgyal ba'i bka' bzhis ser byas grwa tshang du chos zhugs mdzad/dgung lo bcu gdu la phar phyir tshogs langs mdzad/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gnyis par stag tshang ra ba stod du tshad ma'i thugs gnyer la bzhugs/dgung lo nyer gnyis pa lha ldan smon lam chen mor dkar bcu'i grwa skor mdzad/'dar pa lo tsA ba ngag dbang phun tshogs kyi drung nas rtsis dang sgra rig po gas gsan bzhes mdzad/dgung lo nyer bzhi la rgyal dbang lnga pa'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs/de'i lo smad du khams phyogs su phebs/nags shod/sho mdo/rdzi tho sogs dgon pa khag la gnas mjal dang/skye 'gro mang por chos 'khor bskor/dpa' shod brgyud chab mdo byams pa gling dgon du phebs/dgung lo nyer drug la dbus su phebs/rdo rje 'jam dbyangs grags pa dang/ngag dbang blo gros sogs kyi drung nas dus dgra'i dbang po'i 'khrul 'khor/rta mgrin sgrub thabs brgya rtsa sogs kyi dbang lung gsan/dgung lo nyer brgyad lo la rgyal dbang lnga pa chen po dang ldan du 'bras spungs kun dga' ra ba'i bzhugs gral chen mo'i sar se 'bras dge bshes chen po bdun gyis dus gcig tu bgro gleng phul bas so sor thogs med kyi yan gnang nas pha rol pham par mdzad/gong sa mchog nas bsngags brjod thob/dgung lo sum cu la mdo sngags dar rgyas gling du phyir phebs/dgung lo so gcig lor mdo smad sog yul sogs la phebs nas 'gro don bskyangs/dgung lo zhe gcig lor dbus su phebs nas gong sa mchog sprul rin po che dang sde srid sogs mjal/dgung lo bzhi bcu zhi gnyis la bzhugs gnas dga' ldan rnam rgyal gsar skrun mdzad/phyag rtsom la mtshon na/snyan ngag me long le'u gnyis pa'i dper brjod ngo mtshar snyan tshig gtam gyi 'dab brgya) (grub pa'i dbang phyug tshem bu zhabs nas brgyud pa'i thugs rje chen po'i dmar khrid kyi zin 'bris rin chen do shal/) (sgar gyi bca' tho 'dod 'jo'i bum bzang/) (bi shwa karmA'i rjes su 'jug pa )sogs pod gcig mdzad/mthar dgung lo nga lnga la phebs pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me phag (1707)lor sku gshegs}
ba so ngag dbang chos kyi dbang phyug|{rje 'di ni dbus stod spun drug rdzong du yab sde pa sgam bu dang yum bsod nams bu khrid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu pa'i me rta (1606)lor 'khrungs/sku gzhon dus paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan gyi drung du rab byung bsgrubs/de nas ser byes grwa tshang du chos zhugs mdzad nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bzhes mdzad/dgung lo nye rtsa rtsa bzhi la rgyal ba lnga pa blo bzang rgya mtsho'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs/dgung lo nye shu rtsa drug la sa smon lam chen mor grwa skor dam bca' mdzad pas mkhas pa'i grags pa thob/de nas gzhis dgon du phyir phebs nas phyag phug mdo sngags dar rgyas gling dang rta lag dgon pa sogs khag sum cu tsam dang/dge 'dun stong phrag gnyis tsam/mi ser dud khag stong phrag bdun la nye ba'i bla ma dang dpon po gnyis ka mnyam du mdzad/ (314) dgung lo zhe bzhi lo rgyal ba lnga pa chen por rang rnams ljags rtsom yong ba'i zhabs skul zhus mkhas pa'i bya ba rnam gsum gyi sgo nas lta sgom spyod sum nyams su len pa'i rim pa gcod kyi gdams pa'i skor gyi dbu phyogs gzhi lam 'bras gsum gyi sga nas lus sems kyi rdo rje sbas pa'i don rgyud kyi dgongs pa ltar bris pa gsang ba 'dus pa'i sngags kyi lha sku'i rnal 'byor rgyud kyi rdo rje gsum 'dus pa'i dkyil 'khor sgrub mchod phyag rgya chen po'i khrid kyi rnam bshad paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan gyi gsang ba'i rnam thar sogs mdo sngags bka' rtsom pod gnyis tsam bzhugs dgung lo zhe bdun la phebs pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu 'brug (1652)lor sku gshegs}
ba so chos kyi rgyal mtshan|{dga' ldan khri thog drug pa chos kyi rgyal mtshan mchog ni mkhas grub rje'i sku'i gcung po yin zhing/'di nyid kyi mdzad rnam skor gong du kha sde'i nang khri chen rim byon skabs su gzigs}
ba so lha dbang chos kyi rgyal mtshan|{mdo smad khul du rab byung dgu pa'i me bya (1536)lor 'khrungs/chung ngu'i dus mtshan chos skyong mgon po dang dpa' bo rdo rje yang zhu/dgung lo bdun la phebs skabs yab yum la rab tu byung dgos pa'i zhu ba gsol/bla ma kun dga' bzang po dge rgan du bsten nas chos spyod sogs 'dzin skyor mdzad/dgung lo bcu gnyis thog rgyal ba dam pa 'phags pa sangs rgyas kyi drung du rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan lha dbang chos rgyal mtshan du gsol nas sgar thog dgon gyi chos grwar bzhugs/spyod 'jug dang/blo sbyong sogs gsan bsam mdzad/dgung lo nyer gcig thog dbus su phebs te gsang phu sogs la lo bcu gcig ring bzhugs nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar thugs gnyer mdzad/rgyal ba sod nams rgya mtsho mjal bar 'bras spungs su phebs te dam pa'i chos kyi bdud rtsi thob/dgung lo so ba zhi'i thog rang yul du phyir phebs/dgung lo zhe gcig chu 'brug lor chab mdo byams pa gling dgon gyi khrir bzhugs/phyogs de'i 'dul bya rnams smin grol gyi lam bzang du bkod/gsum rtsom rta mchog rgyal po'i sgrub thabs mdor bsdus/dpal gsang ba 'dus pa'i smon lam gyi tshig don cung zad mchan gyi sgro nas gsal bar byed pa/rang gzhan don gnyis sgrub tshul mdor bsdus/rje btsun blo bzang grags pa'i rnam thar mdor bsdus sogs mang du mdzad/dgung lo re dgu la phebs par byung bcu pa'i shing sbrul (1605)lor sku gshegs}
