ban khos gung bu ris|{rgya bza' wun khren kong jos lha sa'i sa dpyad brtag sa'i nang bshad pa'i ri zhig ste/spyi lo'i dus rabs bdun pa'i nang btsan po srong btsan gyi btsun mo bal bza' khri btsun gyis lha sa'i gtsug lag khang gsar bzhengs lam lhong ma byung bar rgya bza' kong jor rtsis zhu bar btang bas rgya bza' wun khren kong jos spor thang bkram ste rtsis par lha sa'i sa bkra gsal bar bton pa'i nang khyad du 'phags pa'i ri bzhi zhes pa'i ya gyal shar du ban khos gung bu ri mchod rten lta bu (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )zhes gsal ba de stag rtse rdzong khongs bde chen grong tsho'i nub ngos gyi ri zur de nas sne zin te shing tshang phu'i rdza ri nas spungs zhes pa'i bar du yin zhes bshad srol yod}
ban chen pos mna' tshigs bton|{tshal ba'i deb dmar las lha sa'i thang du bod kyi blon po tshogs/ban chen pos mda' tshigs bton zhes de ni skabs der bod kyi na chen phyi nang gnyis kar dbang cha chen po yod pa ban de chen po dpal gyi yon tan yin par lha sa gtsug lag khang gi mdun ngos rdo ring gi yi ge'i nang du gsal zhing/rdo rje de la khrang tshing mthun 'brel rdo ring zer/rdo rje 'di ni/thang rgyal rabs kyi go ma bcu drug pa thang mu'i tsung li hin gyi khrang ching khri lo dang po lcags glang (821)lo'i dgun zla ra ba'i (bod zla bcu gcig pa )tshes bcu nyin rgya bod gnyis bar dmag mtshams bzhag ste khran an rgya sa'i nub phyogs su mjal dum gros mol byas/de'i phyi rol rgyal po khri rab pa can gyi srid lo skyid rtags so brgyad pa lo stag (822)lor dbyar zla 'bring po'i (bod zla drug pa )tshes drug gi nyin lha sa'i shar phyogs sbra stod tshal du rgya bod gnyis kyi zhi drug blon chen rnams 'tshogs nas mjal dum gros mol byas/de'i phyi lo rgyal po khri rab pa can gyi srid lo skyid rtags lo dgu pa/gong ma thang mu'u tsung gi khrang cing khri lo gsum pa chu yos spyi lo (823)lo'i dpyid zla 'bring po'i (bod zla gsum pa )tshes bcu bzhi nyin sa gtsug lag khang gi mdun du rdo ring 'di btsugs te/dga' ston rten 'brel rgyas par byas pa'i gnas tshul zhib phra thang rgyal rabs kyi deb ther (thang deb gsar ma )nang du gsal/rdo rje 'di'i mtho tshad spyi khre 4 78dang/zheng tshad spyi khre 0 95/mthug tshad la spyi khre 050yod/rdo rje 'di'i rtse mor char khegs dang tog yod/phyogs bzhir yi ge bkod pa'i nub phyogs kyi g.yon ngos su bod yig dbu can yig phreng 77dang/g.yas ngos su rgya yig 'phred bris yig phreng (319) 6yod nang don ni bka' gtsigs 'di'i mgo brjod gleng gzhi yin byang phyogs kyi ldebs su mna' gtsigs su zhugs pa'i bod phyogs kyi dpon rigs bcu bdun gyi mang tho bod rgya shar sbyar gyis bkod yod lho phyogs su mna' gtsigs su zhugs pa'i rgya phyogs kyi dpon rigs bco brgyad kyi mang tho rgya bod shan sbyar gyis bkod yod shar phyogs su skabs de'i rgya bod gnyis bar gyi 'brel ba ji ltar yin pa dang sa mtshams su dmag 'khrug thengs mang byung yang phan tshul gyi mthun sgril la gtor bshag nam yang byung med pa sogs mna' gtsigs 'di'i nang don dngos gzhi rnams bris yod pa de ni thang bod gnyis bar gyi 'brel ba'i thad la zhib 'jug byed skabs bden don ra sprod byed pa'i dpang yig lcags lta bu zhig yin zhing da ltar yang lha sa gtsug lag khang gi mdun ngos su nyams chag med par gnas yod rdo rje gi yi ge 'di'i mjug tu {(WP:1,194)}zhes rdo ring 'di dang 'dra ba zig thang gi rgyal sa keng shing shir yang btsugs yod pa dang ma yig gi zin bris kyang rgya bod gnyis ka'i yig chang nang nyar tshags byas yod tshul gsal}
ban de bran ka dpal yon|{(ban de zhes brjod pa ni rten rab tu byung ba yin )khri lde srong btsan dang khri ral pa can yab sras gnyis kyi blon chen/blon po 'di nyid kyis rgyal po yab sras gnyis la chos dang mthun pa'i srid skyong rogs zhus/yab khri lde srong btsan gyi sku dus su btsan pos blon chen po bran ka dpal yon la sogs par rgya dang mjal dum byed pa'i chab srid kyi don chen bka' brtsal lugs chab mdo'i ldan ma brag brkos kyi yi ger gsal yod la/sras khri rab pa can gyi sku dus su rgya bod gnyis phan tshul dmag mi drang rgyu'i chings yig 'jog skabs 'di nyid bod phyogs kyi blon po'i gtso bo yin pa lha ldan gtsug lag khang mdun gyi rdo ring gi byang ngos su skabs der mjal dum la zhugs mkhan bod phyogs kyi blon po'i khongs nas 'di nyid kyi mtshan ang dang por bkod yod pa nas mkhyen thub/'on kyang rjes su chos la gnag pa'i blon po dbas to res phra ma bcug ste/blon chen po bran ka dpal yon dang rgyal po'i btsun mo dpal gyi ngang tshul ma lkog tu nyal bshams so zhes rgyal po'i snyan du gsol bas khrims la sbyor zhig ces gsungs pa na btsun mo ngang tshul ma shin tu sdug bsngal te rang srog lcebs pa dang blon chen po bran ka dpal yon gyis kho rang bsad na rgyal po bkrongs kyi dogs nas byang du bros/mthar byang thang du bkums nas dmar gdung snye thang rgya grong na yod ces grags/gzhan yang lo rgyus yig tshang du blon chen po bran ka dpal yon nyes med du bsad rkyen mthar gnod sbyin du skyes nas bod sil bu'i skabs kheng log gi ngan skul byed mkhan yin pas gtam rgyud kyang mi nyung ba zhig yod}
ban de myang ting nge 'dzin|{bod rgyal khri lde srong btsan byis pa'i dus kyi sku rdzi yin zhing/phyis rab tu byung nas lo bdun ting nge 'dzin gcig la mnyam par bzhag /mngon shes mnga' bas myang ban sha'i spyan can zhes grags/paN chen bi ma la mi tras snying thig man ngag rdzogs par gnang/bod rgyal khri lde srong btsan dang khri ral pa bcas gnyis kyi chos blon mdzad/dbu ru zhwa lha khang bzhengs/de nyid kyis btsan po khri lde srong btsan gyi sku phywa srung skyong dang/srid kyi zhabs 'degs lhag bsam zol med kyis bsgrubs stabs btsan pos 'di nyid kyi byas rjes la bsngags brjod gnang phyir dbur stod zhwa lha khang gi rdo ring de ched du btsugs shing/rdo ring de'i steng ban de myang ting nge 'dzin gyi mdzad rjes bkod pa ma zad/slad phyin btsan po'i gdung rgyud kyis myang ting nge 'dzin gyi mes po blon snang bzang 'dus kong gi bu tsha'i nang nas (320) 'jon thang che ba zhig bdams nas 'khor du 'jug rgyu dang rang nus la dpag pa'i go gnas sprad de khong tsho'i bran khyim dang sa zhing phyogs zog nags tshal la sogs pa nam yang btsan po'i phyag tu mi bzhes la gzhan la yang mi ster ba'i gtsigs kyi dbu snyung gnang ba 'di phyin chad bu sras phyi rabs pas chab srid mnga' mdzad skabs dang chab da la dbang byed pa'i blon po rnams kyis mi 'phri mi bcos mi bsgyur ba byed dgos pa'i skor bris yod}
