bar du chod cing ma chod pa'i zung ldan gsum|{rkang pa'i dang po na yod pa'i zur ldan gyi nang gses gsum pa bar du chod cing ma chod pa'i zung ldan rnam grangs gsum ni/snga ma gnyis 'dra zhing phyi ma gnyis 'dra ba chod cing ma chod pa dang rkang pa snga phyi gnyis 'dra zhing bar ma gnyis 'dra ba chod cing ma chod pa/rku pa bzhi ka 'dra ba chod cing ma chod pa bcas so/_}
bar du chod pa'i zung ldan bcu gsum|{rkang pa'i dang po na yod pa'i zung ldan gyi nang gses gnyis pa rab du chod pa'i zung ldan la dbye ba mi 'dra ba bcu gsum ni/rkang pa gnyis la yod pa drug ste/1 rkang pa dang po gnyis kyi thog mar chod pa/2 dang po dang gsum pa'i thog mar chod pa/3 dang po dang bzhi pa'i thog mar chod pa/5 gnyis pa dang bzhi pa'i thog mar chod pa/6 rkang pa phyi ma gnyis kyi thog mar chod pa bcas dang/rkang pa gsum la thod pa gsum ste/7 rkang pa dang po gsum gyi thog mar chod pa/8 dang po dang phyi ma gnyis kyi thog mar chod pa/9 phyi ma gsum gyi thog mar chod pa/10 rkang pa bzhi yod pa (gcig/) rkang pa bzhi la chag gnyis su yod pa gsum ste/11 rkang pa dang po gnyis 'dra zhing phyi ma gnyis mi 'dra ba/12 dang po dang gsum pa 'dra zhing gnyis dang bzhi pa 'dra ba/13 snga phyi gnyis 'dra zhing bar ma gnyis 'dra ba bcas so/_}
bar do|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la/skye ba snga ma nas shi 'phos pa'i rjes su skye ba phyi mar skye ba len pa thun par gnas pa'i ring de la bar do zer de yang tha mal pa'i mi phal che ba shi ba'i rjes su rnam par shes de tshe 'di'i lus dang kha bral te skye ba yi ma'i lus ma blangs kyi bar bzhag bdun phrag gcig nas bdun 'phra bdun bar du sdod dgos pa yong zhing/de 'dra'i bar do ba de yi lus ni yid kyi rang bzhin gyi lus yin par rang gi gang bsam pa der slebs thub pa dang dbang po kun tshang ba/las las skyes pa'i rdzu 'phrul dang ldan pa/ma yi mngal sgo dang/rten gsum yod par na ma gtogs sa rdo ri brag sogs gang la yang thogs pa med pa bcas kyi khyad chos dang ldan pa yin/bar du ba de la rang nyid skyi ba phyi ma 'gro ba rigs drug gi gnas gang du skyes na de'i 'char snang gsar po yod pa dang/mi rnams shi ba'i rjes su zhag bdun phrag bdun gyi ring pha ma bu phrug dang/nye 'brel rnams kyis mchod 'bul sogs dge ba stobs chen bsgrub thub na gshin mo de nyid skyi ba phyi ma ngan song du skye mkhan zhig yin kyang las ngan bzlog nas skye ba bzang por gnas 'pho thub pa yong zhes bshad srol yod/zhib par bka' 'gyur nang gi (ngan song sbyong rgyud kyi mdo )las gsal}
