bi kra ma la shI la|{(mdo sde dran pa nyer bzhag )gi 'gyur byang du/rgyal po byang chub sems dpa' de pA las (327) mdzad pa'i gtsug lag khang chen po bstan pa'i mig tu gyur pa bi kra ma la shI la na'ang zhes gsal zhing jo nang tA ra na tha'i (rgya gar chos 'a byung )shog grangs 262las rgyal po d+harma pa las bzhengs par bshad pas mi mthun pa 'dug kyang pa tshab tshul khrims rgyal mtshan ni paN chen a b+h+ya ra'i slob ma yin pas gong gi lo rgyus de khungs dag par mngon pa ma zad (lho brag chos 'byung )le'u bzhi pa rgya gar gyi rgyal rabs su yang gtsug lag khang 'di rgyal po de wa pA las bzhengs par gsungs la ('dzam gling rgyas bshad )las grong khyer Tha na yi nub 'gram brgyud de chu bo gser ldan an d+ha na ti dang shar 'gram brgyud de chu bo ne rany+dza na gnyis lho nas byang du gang+gar 'bab pa las chu bo gser ldan dang bo bo gang+ga gnyis kyi 'dus mtshams dang ha cang mi ring ba'i sar bri brag chung ngu zhig gi steng na rdo khang 'ga' re yod pa de ni mi kra ma la shI la'i shul yin pa dang der sngon dus gdon sde dag gtsag lag khang mang po yod dus ru ka'i dpung gis gtor ba yin cing deng sang yang nang pa'i bar byung rgyud sngags pa 'ga' zhig rgyud du gnas cer atsar+ya dag zer ces gsal gzhan yang ka tar 'gro ba'i lam du sul tan gan ji bya ba'i gru zan la slebs der grong dang nye ba'i gang+ga'i chu dkyil na brag ri lha khang can zhig yod pa'i tshul ngos kyi chu 'gram brag ri chung ngu zhig yod sa de bi kra ma la shI la'i dgon shul yin kyang sa ma brkos pas sa mig 'di yin da dung mi shes de nas song pas b+hang gal pur du slebs shing de ni sngun gyi b+hang+ga la'i rgyal khab ste slob dpon zhi ba 'tsho dang jo bo rje 'khrungs sa'i gsan yin cing yul tsam+pa yang de yin za hor ram sa hor yang de dang nye ba na sngon gyi pho brang gi shul sogs yod zer ka li ka ta nas rel dang 'ja' tsi las shar phyogs su cher mi ring ba na tsi Da gong yod der ma shA mu ni'i gtsug lag khang sogs dang dge 'dun gyi sde mang du bzhugs yul der ni sngar nas da lta'i bar bstan pa ma ma nyams par bzhugs shing paN+Di ta nags kyi rin chen byon sa yang 'di yin par sems gsal}
bi byi dga' byed dang bi lha dga' mdzes|{yab rnga chen po dang yum gangs lha'i sras bi byi dang yum ril bzo'i sras mo bi lha yin gsungs/'di gnyis chung dus nas gso dpyad gyi bstan pa la zhugs/rgyud shes kyi ba dang 'tsho byed gzhon nu lags so ba'i gdams pa mang du zhus/bdud rtsi sman gyi sgrub pa mdzad pas 'chi med tshe'i dngos grub brnyes/rje btsun ma sgrol mas bskul ba ltar rgya gar nas bod du byon/lha tho tho ri gnyan btsan gyis pho brang yum bu bla sgang du spyan drangs/rgyal pos bod la gso dpyad dar ba'i ched lha lcam mam sras mo yid kyi rol cha bi byi dga' byed kyi chung mar phul bar sras sman pa dung gi thor cog 'khrungs/sras cher 'tshar ba na yab kyis (sman dpyad 'tshol ba'i mdo )dang/('grel bshad khog 'bugs/) (sa bcad lag len )dang bcas pa gnang ste lcam sring gnyis rgya gar du phyir byon no/_}
bi ma la mi tra|{('di legs sbyar kyi skad yin pas bod skad du dri med bshes gnyen zhes )bod rgyal khri srong lde btsan gyi sku dus su bod du byon pa'i rgya gar gyi slob dpon zhig /'di nyid rgya gar nub phyogs glang po'i nga gi grong khyer zhes par khyim bdag bde chen 'khor lo'i sras su sku bltams/slob dpon shrI sid+ha la sogs pa bsten te rig pa'i gnas bcu phrag la mkhas shing/rdzogs pa chen po'i phyi nang gsal ba'i skor thugs nyams su bstar bas mchog gi dngos grub brnyes/'di nyid kyis rgyal po khri srong lde btsan dang ban+de dz+nyA ku mA ra (328) gnyis la phyi nang gsang ba'i dbang rnams rdzogs par bskur rgyal por gsang mtshan tshangs pa lha'i me tog ces gsol bod kyi lo rgyus chos 'byung nang mkhas pa bi ma la mi tra dang sangs rgyas gsang ba shan+ti garba bi shud+ha sid+hi sogs pa dang bod kyi sad mi bdun dang chos kyi snang ba ban d+he nam mkha' sgro rin chen sde rnam par mi rtog pa shAkya 'od la sogs pas lo tsA byas te chos mngo bsgyur zhes gsal ba dang bstan rtsis kun btus nang khri srong lde btsan nas ral pa can gyi bar rgya gar du slob dpon bi ma la mi tra snga phya gnyis byung bas las snga mas skyabs 'gro yan lag drug pa dang sher rnying rgya cher 'grel sogs brtsams phyi ma ni 'dul ba mang po lnga bcu pa mdzad pa po'o zhes deb sngon las bshad ces gsal}
bir wa pa|{(grub chen bir wa pa )'di rgya gar du grags che ba'i grub thob cig yin/dus skabs gang du byung min gsal bar bshad pa'i lo rgyus ma mthong/rigs ni rgyal rigs yin kyang rgyal srid spangs nas na len+d+ra dgon par rab tu byung/mkhan po d+harma mi tras shri d+harma pa la zhes (bod skad du dpal ldan chos skyong du grags )btags/mkhan po de nyid slob dpon du bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mtha' dag pa sbyangs te mkhas par gyur/mkhan po de sku 'das rjes na len+d+ra dgon pa'i mkhan po mdzad/de nas yun ring ma song bar grub pa thob pa'i rtags sna tshogs mis mthong nas rang nyid la dma' 'bebs byed pa gsan te dgon pa'i sgrig nas kha bral te spyod pa la gshegs/slob dpon 'di'i lo rgyus gzhan dag skor sangs rgyas chos lugs la dad pa yod pa tshor ma gtogs dgos pa med stabs 'dir ma bris/gzigs par 'dod na (lam 'bras bla ma brgyud pa'i rnam thar )pod gsum sde dge par khang du shing dpar yod pa der gzigs}
bis pa ngag dbang mi pham zla ba|{mdo smad mar nang tsha lngar bis thang 'ja' mo'i rigs su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me phag (1767)lor 'khrungs/mkhan chen dngos slob bis pa dge bshes shes rab rten 'dzin gyi sku skye ru ngos bzung/dgung lo bcu gsum pa sa phag lor chos grwar zhugs/bde chen pa shes rab 'od zer las sum rtags dang/a khyung ngag dbang mkhyen rab las snyan ngag bslabs/shar mchog sprul rin po che skal ldan dge 'dus 'phrin las rab rgyas nas bsnyen par rdzogs/mkhan chen chad rung yig blo ba zang rgya mtsho dang/khri rgan sprul sku ngag dbang 'jam dbyangs bkra shis/tshe mgon bla ma/dgon lung du wang skal bzang ye shes dar rgyas/zhang ba sgom chen blo bzang bla ba rnams las bka' chos ci rigs gsan/khyad par du thu'u bkwan rin po che blo bzang chos kyi nyi ma'i drung du sngags lugs thun mong ma yin pa'i phyag rgya zab khrid bcas legs par gsan/thu'u bkwan gyi zhal nas/gung thang sprul pa'i sku dang 'di pa lta bu'i mdo sngags rig gnas thams cad la mkhas pa deng sang dkon gsungs/rong po dus 'khor grwa tshang gsang sngags dar rgyas gling gi khrir bzhugs/rab byung bcu pa'i me yos (1807)lor rong po tshogs chen gyi khrir phebs/'on kyang 'a chad nyan gyi bdud rtsi spro khom ma byung bar lo der sku gshegs/phyag rtsom shar sprul pa'i sku dge 'dun 'phrin las rab gyis rnam thar dang/rtsis gzhung mkhas pa'i snying nor sogs po ti gsum tsam yod/dus thog der ma pa legs pa'i tshad byed du grags}
