bu ston rin chen grub|{lo tsA ba chen po 'i nyid gtsang stod khro phu'i phyogs kyi shab smad sgom gzhas zhes bya ba'i yul du ba rnying ma'i bla chen brag ston rgyal mtshan dpal bzang dang yum bsod nams 'bum gnyis kyi sras su rab byung lnga pa'i lcags stag (1290)lo'i bod zla gsum pa'i tshes nyer bzhi nyin ngo mtshar gyi ltas bzang po du ma dang bcas sku bltams/dgung lo lnga nas ya mu las yi ge'i sbyor klog dang/dbon rgyam seng las rtsis dang yi ge'i rig pa la sbyangs/dgung lo bdun par khro phu bsod nams seng ge'i drung du thag chen sems bskyed gsan/dgung lo brgyad la rnying ma'i bla ma tshul khrims dpal bzang gi spyan sngar gsang sngags rnying ma'i chos skor yongs rdzogs gsan/gzhan yang g.yo ba rig pa'i skor gyi sman dpyad dang bzo rig skor gyi thig tshad kyang sbyang brtson gnang/dgung lo bco brgyad la phebs pa me lug (1307)lor khro phur mkhan chen seng ge dpal dang slob dpon tshad ma'i skyes bu las rab byung dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/slob dpon bsod nams mgon po las phar phyin dang 'du ba tshad ma'i gzhung sogs mang lus pa gsan te lo gnyis tsam gyi ring nyin mo gso ba dal lhod kyis bzhes long dang na bza' ral pa'ang tshems long med la/mtshan mo dkar me'i 'od la dpe gzigs mdzad pa sogs dkar spyad brtson pa chen pa mdzad pas gzhung lugs rgya mtsho'i pha rol du son/dgu ngalo nye gcig bzhes pa na dbus gtsang gi chos sde chen po rnams su grwa skor mdzad/dbus nas mkhas pa shAkya gzhon du dang kha rag byang gzhon/gtsang nas mkhas pa dpal ldan seng ge dang/'jam skya sogs lung rigs kyis btul bas snyan grags dbus gtsang kun tu khyab/mkhas pa'i khrod du pha ston pa la bu'ang ston pa byung 'dug ces bu ston zhes pa'i mtshan yang de nas thogs/dgung lo nyer gsum pa chu byi (1312)loram khas chen bka' bzhi pa grags pa gzhon no dang/slob dpon bsod nams grags pa las bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa mnos/khro phur phar phyin dang/'dul/mngon pa bcas kyi 'chad nyan legs par mdzad/de nas thar pa gling du phebs nas lo tsA ba chen po thor lo nye ma rgyal mtshan slob dpon du bsten/lo bzhi tsam 'b