bod kyi 'jal gshor 'degs gsum gyi tshad|{da lta nyar tshugs byas pa'i bod yig gi lo rgyus khag gzhir bzung na/rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po nas rtsis pa'i rgyal rabs sum cu pa stag bu gnyan gzigs kyi dus zhing 'brog gi bar phan tshun dngos zog brje res kyi tshong las 'phel rgyas chen po byung bar brten 'jal gshor 'degs gsum gyi tshad gtan khel zhig bzo rgyur kha tsha dgos gtugs byung bar brten/blon po khri ngor snang mar btsun gyis bre dang srang thog mar bzos thog /zhing pa'i sa khul nas thon pa'i 'bru rigs rnams brel la 'jal nas sprod len byas pa dang/'brog pa'i sa khul nas thon pa'i mar dang bal sha sogs srang la 'jal nasap+saparod len byed dgos par gtan 'bebs bzos yod/yin na'ang de dus kyi bre dang srung gi tshan gzhi gang 'ad+r+ya yin min lo rgyus nang gsal por 'khod med/de dang phyogs mtshungs tun hong nas thon pa'i bod yig gi rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i lo rgyus nang rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos bod kyi bre dang srang gi 'jal tshan gcig gyur med par go thub kyang/srong btsan sgam po'i gong du sa gnas khag gi 'jal gshor gdegs gsum gyi tshad la khyad par chen po gang 'dra yod med bshad med pa ma zad/srong btsan sgam pos gang 'dra byas nas gcig gyur bzos gnang gab yang gsal bshad byas med/rgyal po khri srong lde btsan skabs 'jal gshor 'degs gsum gyi tshad gzhi'i skor skabs der brtsams pa'i bod sman gyi gzhung 'ga' zhig nang ya khyor nyi shu rtsa gcig la bre gang/de cha bdun la bgos pa'i cha gcig te ya khyor gsum la phul gang/phul bdun la bre gang dub rtsis pa de la bdun phul zhes bshad srol gcig dang/yang lugs gcig la ya khyor nyi shu rtsa gcig dum bu drug du bgos pa'i cha gcig ste/ya khyor gsum dang khyer ka la phul gang/phul drug la bre gang dub rtsis pa der drug phul zhes rtsi srol yod lugs bshad yod/yon rgyal rabs kyi skabs brtsams pa'i bod kyi sman gzhung 'ga' zhig nang bshad pa'i 'jal (343) tshad dang gshor tshad ni nas 'bru che ba gnyis 'bring ba gnyis chung ba gnyis bcas bsdoms pa'i drug kham tshig 'bring gi tshad kham tshig drug la star phul gang sta