bod kyi dpar skrun|{da ltar nyar tshags byas pa'i bod yig gi lo rgyus yig cha gzhir bzung na ming rgyal rabs gong ma yung los kyi sngon la bod yig dpar skrun gyi las rigs dar srol mi 'dug cing/yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma u tsung ha'i hran {(WP:1,194)}gyi skabs dbus pa blo gsal byang chub ye shes dang/bcom ldan rig pa'i ral gri gnyis sa bod du yod pa'i bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur yongs rdzogs gcig bsdus nas cha tshang gcig thog mar bzos pa bod du yod pa'i bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur phyogs bsgrigs byed thems bzhi pa yin cing/de nas bzung bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur gyi ma dpe cha tshang thog mar byung ba dang/mtshur phu dgon pa/sa skya/mnga' ris/khams/sog khul/mes rgyal nang khul bcas la dar khyab byung ba de tsho tshang ma bris ma sha stag yin/bod rab byung bdun pa'i sa byiM 1408)lor ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma yung las kyis nang blon tha'i kyen (nyug rum )bzhi bod du mngags nas rje tsong kha par 'tshams 'dri zhus shing/tsong kha pas rang nyid kyi sku tshab tu rang nyid kyi slob ma byams chen chos rje shAkya ye shes btang nas mes rgyal nang khul du dge lugs pa'i chos thog mar spel/gong ma yung lus kyis nan cing du bod yig gi bka' 'gyur zangs dpar de thog mar dpar (345) brkos byas thog sa skya pa dang karma pa tsong kha pa bcas la bod yig zangs dpar gyi bka' 'gyur cha tshang re phul rgyu bskul ba rnams bod 'byor rjes bod du yod 'i mkhas pa mang po dga' tshor che po byung ba ma zad mthong rgya che ru phyin pa red de sngon ma gzhi bod du rgyal po nga btsan sgam po'i sa nas bzung shing gi ldebs dang rdo ngos la shing lo dang me tog srog chags kyi gzugs ris bcas brkos shes kya yod kyang de tsho'i gras bskos ris mkhas pa tshos rang nyid kyi lag rtsal chu tshad mtho dman la gzhigs pa'i gang 'dod ltar brkos chog pa las gcig gyur gyi tshad gzhi ces can med pas cung zad stabs bde yang shing leb thog tu yi ge brko rgyu ni ma dpe bris pap+latar tshad gzhi can can la gzhigs nas brko dgos pas lag rtsal gyi cha tshad mthon po dgos kyi yod zangs dpar dang khro dpar lugs brgyab nas brko rgyu de shing dpar las stabs bde yang skabs der bod du zangs dang khra yi gnyer kha dkon po yid pas dpe cha phon chen po dpar skran byed rgyur rgyu cha'i thad dkar ngal chen po yod pa dang bod rang gi dpar skrun rgyu cha'i thad shing brkos dang rdo brkos kyi lag rtsal mtho po yod pa bcas kyi gnas tshul dngos yod dang bstun nas phag ru da srid khri rabs lnga pa dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan gyis thog mar sa skya gong ma lnga'i gsung 'bum thog par dpar brkos gnang shing tsong kha pa 'das rjes sne'u rdzong dpon nam mkha' bzang pos sbyin bdag byas nas tsong kha pa'i gsung 'bum cha tshang dpar brkos byas pa'i dpar shing der yongs grags su dga' ldan dpar rnying zer gi yod pa dang dpar shing de'i thog dpar 'debs byas pa'i dpe cha khag mang der ngas se ra 'bras spungs po ta la bcas su mang po mthong rgyu yod pa de tsho'i khyad chos ni dpar shing gi 'khor yod pa'i lha sku rnams dbu che zhing sked pa dang rkang lag phra ba stod zheng che ba bcas brkos ris de tsam legs po med rung dpar yig gi yig gzugs ni zangs dpar ngad khro dpar thog bkod pa'i yag gzugs ltar ha las dgos pa'i lag rtsal yod bod yig gi dpar skrun lag rtsal bdod du dar ba nas bzung bod kyi rig gzhung sngar las lhag pa'i dar rgyas byung ba ma zad yig gzugs dang dag cha'i thad sngar las cung zad khyab che ba'i gcig gyur byung ste bod kyi sag nas khag gcig yul skad phan tshul go brda mi 'phrod pa khag cig yod par phud de min gyi skad rnams bod kyi sa gnas khag mang che ba go thub kyi yod pa de'i thog nas dpar skrun lag rtsal dar ba des bod yi skad yig sngar las lhag par gcig gyur yong bar skul 'ded gdong thub pa'i ra sprod gsal po byung yod gong du bshad pa ltar ming rgyal rabs gong ma yung los bod yig gi bka' 'gyur cha nang nan cin tu dpar skrun byas te skabs der bod sa gnas su skad grags yod pa'i chos lugs mi snas skya ba dang karma pa tsong kha pa bcas la dpar phud du cha tshang re phul ba des bod sa gnas su dpar brko'i lag rtsal gsar gtod byed pa'i sgo gsar pa phye ba ma zad de nas bzung dbus gtsang mnga' ris mdo khams sde dge yun nan si khron kan su'u mtsho sngon nang sog phyi sog bcas su'ang bod yig gi shing dpar dang khro dpar bcas mang po 'phel rgyas byung ba de tsho'i nang nas dpar khang che shos ni bzhi yod pa ste 1 bod rang byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags bya (1741)lor skabs de'i bod sa gnas kyi srid 'dzin pho lha ba bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur cha tshang shing dpar thog brkos te paN chen sku phreng lnga pa blo bzang ye shes la phul ba de snar thang dgon pa'i nang bzhag pa de red 2 bod rang byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing byi (1744)lor sde dge rgyal po bstan pa tshe (346) ring gis sde dge dgon chen du bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur sogs sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi dpe cha khag mang po dpar brkos byas pa'i dpar khang der yongs grags su sde dge dpar khang zer 3 rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu sprel (1752)lor co ne dpon bstan srung tshe ring dang me mo rin chen dpal 'dzoms gnyis kyis dbus dpar dang pe cin gyi dpar ma snar thang dpar ma bcas la phyi mo byas te bka' bstan shing dpar brkos te dpar skrun byas pa'i co ne dpar khang 4 dus rabs nyi shu pa'i 'khor tA la'i bla ma sku rang bcu gsum pa rgya gar nas phyir log phebs rjes po ta la'i zhol du de sngon ta la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i skabs nas yod mus kyi dpar khang rnying pa rgya skyed byas thog bka' 'gyur sogs chos dpe khag mang po dpar skrun byas pa deng deng sang zhol dpar khang zer de min se ra dang 'bras spungs dga' ldan bkra shis lhun po chab mdo byams pa gling bla brang bkra shis 'khyil sku 'bum sogs dgon pa che chung mang por bod yig gi chos dpe dang rig gnas sman gzhung lo rgyus dag yi sogs kyi dpar shing ha cang phon chen po 'di 'dra 'dzam gling thog ha cang mthong dkon pa zhig red}
