bod kyi rtsom rig|{rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i skabs deng sang gi bod yig 'di gsar gtod byas nas bzung bod rigs mi dmangs kyi rig gzhung cha tshad mtho ru song bar brten/go bde zhing tshig snyan la don zab pa'i sgrung dang/snyan dngags/gzhan tshig sogs 'phel rgyas chen po byung/dper na/tun hong gi sa 'og nas thon pa'i rta sgrung dang/gyim po spun drug gi sgrung/rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po'i lo rgyus/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po dang/mang srong/'dus srong bcas kyi lo rgyus sogs ni tshig 'brel chags shing dpe dang don sbor stangs snyan la yid dbang 'phrog pa'i sgyu rtsal gyi cha tshang dang/mi rigs kyi khyad chos zung 'brel byas pa'i rig rtsal gyi rtsom rig legs pa'i gras shig yin/dus rabs bcu bzhi pa'i mjug tu bod la sangs rgyas chos lugs bskyar gso byung zhing/de nas rim bzhin bka' gdams pa'i chos lugs dang/sa skya ba'i chos lugs dar rgyas byung ba'i 'og tshugs pa dang chabs cig /sa skya paN chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis bod kyi snyan ngag rtsom stangs dang sgrarig pa'i skor gyi rig pa'i gzhung lugs rnams phyogs bsdoms byas pa'i gzhung (mkhas pa la 'jug pa'i sgo )zer ba brtsams gnang ba ma zad/bod du skad grags yod pa'i rtsom yig (sa skya legs bshad )zer ba brtsams nas bod kyi rtsom rig chu tshang gong mthor 'gro rgyur skul 'debs chen po byung ba dang/phyogs mtshungs 'gro mgon 'phags pas shong ston lo tsA ba rdo rje rgyal mtshan la gser mang po bskur nas bal yul dang rgya gar du sangs rgyas chos lugs dang/rig gnas slob sbyong byed par btang zhing/khong bod du log rjes rgya gar gyi mngon brjod dang snyan ngag gci gzhung me long ma sogs mang po bod skad thog bsgyur du bcug pa nas bzung bod gyi rig gzhung chu tshad thad sngar las lhag pa'i gong 'phel gsar pa byung zhing/dus rabs bco lnga pa'i dkyil du bka' brgyud chos lugs kyi rtsom pa po skad grags can gtsang smyon sangs rgyas rgyal (347) mtshan gyis (mi la'i mgur 'bum )rtsom sgrig byas de nas dus rabs bcu drug pa nas dus rabs bcu bdun pa'i mjug bar (ja chang lha mo'i gtam rgyud )dang (rdza tsig gtam rgyud/) (by