bod kyi tshad ma rig pa'i gzhung lugs kyi 'byung khungs|{dus rabs lnga pa'i dus dkyil tsam ste/spur rgyal bod kyi rgyal rabs nyer bdun pa lha tho tho ri gnyan btsan gyi dus su rgya gar yul dbus su nang pa sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa dang/de'i gzhung lugs sogs dar rgyas shin tu che zhing/khyad par du phyi nang thun mong gi rig gnas sam shes bya gzhung lugs sogs dar rgyas shin tu che ba byung la/rig pa'i gnas la mnga' brnyes pa'i ma ha paN+Di ta dang/mkhas pa'i go 'phang mthon por gshegs pa'i dge ba'i bshes gnyen chen po mang du byon pa'i nang nas mgon po klu sgrub dang/ar+ya de wa/'phags pa thogs med/slob dpon dbyig gnyen/slob dpon phyogs glang/dpal ldan chos grags/yon tan 'od/shwakya 'od bcas la 'dzam gling mdzes par byed pa'i rgyan drug mchog gnyis zhes grags shing (rgyan drug ni/klu sgrub dang/thogs med/phyogs glang/chos grags/dbyig gnyen/ar+ya de wa bcas drug dang mchog gnyis gi yon tan 'od dang/shwakya 'od do/) slob dpon chen po 'phags pa thogs med kyi sku mched slob dpon dbyig gnyen la slob ma khri phrag kha shas yod pa'i nang nas 'dul ba rang las mkhas pa yon tan 'od/phar phyin rang las mkhas pa 'phags pa grol sde/mngon pa rang las mkhas pa blo gros brtan pa/tshang ma rang las mkhas pa phyogs kyi glang po zhes slob dpon rang las mkhas par gyur pa'i slob ma mkhas dbang chen po bzhi byon la de yi nang nas tshad ma'i gzhung la mkhas pa'i slob dpon phyogs glang gis slob dpon dbyig gnyen gyi drung du byon nas theg pa chen po chung gi chos mang po gsan/lhag par du rig gnas che ga lnga'i ya gyal tshad ma rig pa'i gzhung lugs la ches mkhas par sbyangs te nang pa sangs rgyas par rtsod du 'ong ba'i mu stegs pa'i rgol ba rnams re re bzhin rtsod pas pham par byas/de nas slar ya nga rgya gar shar phyogs o Ti bi sha shang du phyir phebs/slob dpon phyogs kyi glang pos (mngon brjod mdzod kyi 'grel pa gnas kyi sgron me )sogs mdzad/khong rang bzhugs sa'i brag phug tu/tshad mar gyur pa 'gro la phan zhes pa sogs rtsom par dam bca' bri bar mdzad de mthar tshad ma'i mdo (kun las btus pa )zhes tshad ma rig pa'i gzhung lugs thams cad kyi gzhir rtsar gyur pa rig pa'i gzhung lugs kun gyi nang nas khyad par du 'phags pa'i tshad ma'i bstan bcos chenapo 'di nyin legs par mdzad/slob dpon phyogs kyi glang po'i slob ma'i gtso bo slob dpon dbang phyug da zhes bya ba la dpal ldan chos kyi grags pa zhes slob ma mkhas mchog cig byon/slob dpon chos grags chung dus nas blo rig shin tu gsal bas rig nas lnga dang mu stegs kyi grub mtha' la mkhas par gyur/rjes su nam pa'i chos kyi (348) gzhung lugs la gzigs te mu stegs pa'i gzhung dang bstan bcos sogs shin tu mi 'thad pa'i gnas su mthong nas dor bas pha ma zhang po dang bcas pas khyim nas bskrad rgya gar yul dbus su byon nas slob dpon chos skyong gi drung du rab tu byung slob dpon dbang phyug da las (tshad ma kun btus )lan gsum gsan lan cig gsan pas slob dpon slob dpon phyogs glang dang mnyam lan gsum pa gsan pas slob dpon dbang phyug sdes slob dpon phyogs kyi glang po'i dgongs pa ma lon par 'ga' zhig nor bar shes nas slob dpon nyin la zhus pas slob dpon thugs shin tu dgyes te tshad ma kun btus kyi 'grel pa yang rtsoms shig ces slob dpon gyis bskul zhing brtsam pa'i gnang ba thob rgyal po me tog kun tu rgyas pa zhes bya bas sbyin bdag mdzad de dpal chos gyi grags pas rang gi blo gros kyi rtsal gyis tshad ma kun btus nyid kyi 'grel pa tshad ma da bdun ste rgyas pa'i bstan bcos (tshad ma rnam 'grel )dang cung zad bsdus pa (tshad ma rnam nges/) shin tu bsdus pa (tshad ma rigs thigs )bcas gtso bo lus lta bu'i bstan bcos gsum dang gtan tshigs thigs pa/) (rtsod pa'i rigs pa/) ('grel pa brtag pa/) (rgyud gzhan sgrub pa )bcas 'phros pa yan lag lta bu'i bstan bcos bzhi rnams legs par mdzad na len+d+rar rtsod gleng du 'ongs pa'i mu stegs pa'i mkhas pa grags can mang po snga rjes su pham par mdzad cing sangs rgyas chos lugs dar bar mdzad sku tshe'i mthar rgya gar lho phyogs kyi rgyud du bzhugs nas yul ka ling kar mya ngan las 'das tshad ma rig pa'i gzhung lugs kyi 'byung khungs dngos ni rig pa'i dbang phyug rnam gnyis zhes p