bod kyi rig rtsal|{bod kyi zlos gar dang gla gzhan ni rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i gong nas dar so chen po yod pa dper na rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i mes po stag ri gnyan gzigs dus su 'phan po klum ya gsum na yod pa'i rgyal phran zing po rje la na po drug gis ngo log byas te lho khar bros byol phyin thog /nyin mo shing nags kyi gser tu gab nas mtshan mo'i dus rgyal po stag ri gnyan gzigs kyi sar 'gro ba de mang tshogs kyis mthong nas glu gzhas btang ba'i gzhas tshig dang/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i yab gnam ri srong btsan dang/srong btsan sgam po rang nyid bcas kyis blon po gsar pa bsko gzhag byed skabs rgyal blon rnams mnyam du mna' bskyal ba'i glu (356) gzhas kyi tshig tun hong gi sa 'og nas thon pa'i bod yig lo rgyus thog bkod pa deng sang yang mthong rgyu yod pa ma zad blon po mgar gyis thang tha'i tsung sar phyin nas rgya bza' wun khren kong jo rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i btsun mor bslong skabs rgya bza' kong jo thog mar thug phrad byas pa'i nyin der blon po mgar gyis bod sa gnas kyi yul ljongs dang thon khungs kyi khyod chos bcas la bstod bsngags btang ba'i gla gzhas kyi gzhas tshig rnams lo rgyus kyi dpe deb mang po'i nang 'khod yod pa dang deng sang bod du gtong srol yod pa'i (rgya bza' bod la phebs pa )zer ba'i glu gzhas de rgya bza' kong jo lha sar thog mar slebs pa'i nyin mo der bod kyi rgya che'i mang tshogs kyis bsru ba zhu ba'i gzhal tshig yin zer ba'i bshad rgyun yod stabs gzhan tshig der bod kyi rgyal che'i mang tshogs kyis ha cang dka' bo byed kyi yod pa dang da dung rgya bza' kong jo la bstod bsngags byed pa'i gzhas tshig mi nyung ba zhig yod pa de tsho'i nang rgya bzang kong jo bod la phebs pa deng bod kyi zhing las dang 'brog las gso ba rig pa bcas le 'phel rgyas chen po byung lugs gsal por bkod pa de ni rgya bod mi rigs bar nam yang brjed par dka' ba'i mdza' brtse gting zab yod lugs gsal por mtshon zhig red bod la skad grags yod pa'i stod gzhan ni dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i 'gor mnga' ris sa khul du sangs rgyas chos lugs dar spel chen po byung ba'i dus skabs nas yod pa zhig ste dper na mnga' ris rgyal po lha bla ma byang chub 'od kyis rgyal gar nas a ti sha (mong cA la yi rgyal sras )gdan 'dren skabs mnga' ris rgyal po'i blon po dang mang tshogs kyis brtsams pa'i (zor ma'i glu )zer ba gsar rtsom byas nas bsu ba zhus pa'i gzhan tshig khag gcig 'brom ston pas brtsams pa'i (a ti sha yi rnam thar )nang bkod yod pa de tsho gzhas tshig spyir btang dang mi 'dra ba'i tshig cung zad ring po yod pa zhig red}
