bod kyi lo gsar|{spyir na bod dbus khul gyi mi dmangs tshos rang rang 'khor sbyor la gzhigs te bod zla 12pa nas bzung so gsar gyi nyer mkho'i sta gon rim bzhin byed 'go tshugs te shar mar 'bru snam sogs lo gsar gyi nyer mkho dang/gzab spros yan nas sna tshogs/sder kha'i kha zas dang/lug mgo/lo phud/phye mar gyi rtsibs sgro dang so gsar me tog sogs gro so phye mar gyi yo chas/khang pa'i dar lcog dang/dar shing/sham bu sogs nyo sgrub byed pa dang/tshang btso ba dang/sbo lug dang khur ba sogs kha zas sna tshogs 'gar ba ma zad/khyim tshang so so'i thab tshang gis gtsos khang pa'i phyi nang gi du ba dang thal ba rnams gtsang bar 'phyag pa sogs lo gsar gyi sta (357) gon byed cing bod zla 12tshes 29nyin gyi dgong mo dgu thug ma 'thung gong khyim mi tshang mar spags gong chung ngu re sprad nas des mi so so'i gzugs po'i stod smad tshang mar phur ste lo gcig zla ba bcu gnyis zhag ma sum brgya drug cu'i gegs bar tshang ma sel ba'i smon lam btab rjes dri glud bzos nas rdza khog chag dum zhig nang blugs pa dang de rjes sa srod tsam la dgu thug 'thung 'go tshugs dgung thug ces pa thog pa bag thug nang zas sna sde grangs dgu 'dzoms dgos pa'i thag bag thug cung che ba khag cig nang sur pan dang sol ba dkar yol tshwa bal spos sogs blugs pa dang de bzhin nyi zla bcas kyi dbyibs bzos te de rnams su'i phor ba'i nang nas thon rung phan tshun dbar de dag gi mtshon byed gang yin 'grel bshad brgyab nas tshang ma bzhad bshad ring nger gyur zhing mi res dgu thug phor pa dgu re 'thung dgos pas phor ba dgu ma son par khu ba thig pa res phor pa re'i tshab byas te gong gsal dri blud blugs snod rdza khog chag dum de'i nang dkar yol nang gi thog pa 'thung 'phros rnams kyang blugs thog da dung sbang pa dang ja ro blugs nas rdza khog chag dum de bum mo zhig gis 'khyer ba dang bu zhig gis sog ma chags pa zhig la me spar te kham pa tshang mar me yul brgyab nas mar don shog ces gdon 'dre phyir 'bud byed pa'i ngar sgra sgrog bzhin du so so'i khyim tshang nye 'khor gyi lam mdo zhig tu bskyal te de'i mjug