bod kyi sangs rgyas chos lugs|{deng sang rgyal khab phyi nang gi lo rgyus mkhas pa la las bod kyi sangs rgyas chos lugs la bla ma'i chos lugs zer ba de ni bod kyi sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi dmigs bsal khyad chos la gzhir bzung nas btags pa zhig yin pa las/bod rang gi lo rgyud thog ming de 'dra 'dogs srol med/lo chig stong sum brgya lhag tsam gong gi bon po'i chos lugs dang/de rjes la gsar du dar ba'i sangs rgyas chos lugs gnyis la rgyal khab gzhan dag la yod pa'i bon po'i chos lugs dang sangs rgyas chos lugs gnyis dang mi 'dra ba'i dmigs bsal gyi khyad chos 'ga' zhig yod pa'i dbang gis chos lugs de gnyis la mi rigs rang bzhin ldan pa zhig byung yod/bod kyi bon po'i chos lugs der bon rnying ma dang bon gsar ma zer ba gnyis dang/bon rnying ma de la dkar po dang nag po gnyis yod/bod dkar po ni/bod kyi rgyal po srong btsan sgam po ma byung gong gi lo bdun brgya sum cu so gcig gi sngon spyi lo 117lo yas mas la bod kyi rgyal pa'i thog ma gnya' khri btsan po byung/skabs der bod sa gnas kyi 'on mda' ngam shod du tshe mi gshen gyi rmu rgyal zer ba zhig byung ba des bon po'i chos lugs thog mar gsar gtod byas pa de ni gdod ma'i chos lugs shig red/de'i khyad chos ni sa/chu/me/rlung/ri/shing/thog /glog /ser ba/skyes lha/pho lha/mo lha sogs yod pa dang/mi shes rjes gshin po de'i rnam shes gnas pa'i bla srog 'phrog mkhan gyi 'dre yod pas de 'dul dgos pa sogs khas len gyi yod pa dang/gzhan yang/mo rgyag pa dang bla 'gugs pa/nor sgrub pa sogs byed kyi yod/de nas rgyal rabs bdun song rjes rgyal po gri gum btsan po'i skabs mnga' ris zhang zhung gi yul du bon ston pa gshen rab zer ba zhig byung ba des/tA sig a la po'i rgyal khab nas dbyi rang brgyud bod du dar ba'i mu stegs dbang phyug pa'i lta ba de bod du sngar yod bon po'i chos dang mnyam du bsres nas rigs pa'i gzhung lugs shig brtsams pa de la bod nas kyi lo rgyus thog 'khyar bon zer/chos lugs des mi shi ba dang na ba'i skabs su sku rim la sems can pho mo stong phrag nas bcu phrag bar gsod dgos yod pa dang/rgyal po shi na de'i blon po dang/btsun mo/g.yog po bcas gson por dur gyi nang du sbas kyi yod skad lab rten chos lugs de la bod kyi lo rgyus thog bon nag po zer/rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po nas bzung/khra thog rje thog btsan gyi bar rgyal rabs nyi shu rtsa bdun gyi ring (lo lnga brgya lhag tsam )sgrung dang lde'u bon gsum gyis srid dbang bzung zhes bshad srol yod/dus rabs bdun pa'i 'khor rgyal po srong btsan sgom pos srid dbang bzung rjes rgya bza' kong jo dang bal ba'i gnyis mna' mar blangs rjes/jo bo rnam gnyis sogs sangs rgyas chos gyi sku rten mang po bo du gnas drangs pa dang dus mtshungs/deng sang nga tshos bde spyod byed pa'i bod yig gi yig gzugs gsar gtod byas te/spyan ras gzigs kyi mdo rgyud nyi shu rtsa gcig rgya gar skad nas bod skad du bsgyur ba de nas bzung bod la sangs rgyas chos lugs thog mar dar ba'i 'go tshugs shing chos lugs kyang nang don gtso bo dge ba bcu lagazhi bzhag nas mi chog gtsang ma bcu drug zer ba'i khrims lugs bzos pa de red/'on kyang skabs der sangs rgyas chos lugs de bon mi rigs kyi rnam pa (362) can zhig tu 'gyur thub med dus rabs brgyad pa'i dkyil du bod kyi rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis srid dbang bzung rjes slob dpon pad+ma 'byung gnas dang mkhan pa bo d+hi swatwa gnyis bod du gdan drangs nas bod du gsang sngags kyi chos thog mar dar spel byas thog sngar yod bon po'i chos nang nas khag gcig nang don bsgyur nas rnam par rang sor bzhag ste bon po'i chos la dga' ba'i mi rnams blo 'gugs thabs byas pa ma zad bsam yas gtsug lag khang gi lha sku'i rnams bod mi'i bzo dbyibs can du bzhengs pa dang chos khrims dang grwa pa'i chas gos sogs bod kyi mi rigs kyi rnam pa ldan pa zhig tu 'gyur ba byas pa'i skor (rba bzhed )nang 'khod yod pa red de thog da dung bod kyi sangs rgyas chos lugs la bla ma'i yang srid ngos 'dzin byed pa'i lugs srol zhig byung yod pa de ni dus rabs bcu gsum pa'i sa byi (1288)lor grub thob u rgyan pa rin chen dpal gyis karma pa pa rang byung rdo rje karma pak+shi'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin byas pa de nas bzung bod la bla ma'i yang srid ngos 'dzin byes pa'i li lugs gzhi nas byung ba ma gtogs de sngon bod la sangs rgyas chos lugs thog mar dar ba nas bzung lo lnga brgya drug cu lhag tsam ring bla ma'i yang dngos 'dzin byas pha'i lam lugs de med lam lugs de ni bod mi rigs kyi khyad chos ldan pa zhig red der ma zad da dung bo kyi chos lugs rang nyid kyi ral mo dang glu dbyangs mgur 'cham dus chen zlos gar ri mo sogs tshang mar mi rigs rang nyid kyi khyad chos mang po yod}
bod kyi gso ba rig pa|{bod kyi gso ba rig pa la lo rgyus yun ring po yod pa zhig yin la mi rigs kyi khyad chos yod pa zhig kyang yin/(blon po bka' thang )gi nang 'khod pa ltar na spyi lo'i sngon gyi dus rabs kha shas nang bod rigs mi dmangs kyis dug yod na sman yod pa'i rgyu mtshan shes rtogs thub dang/'brog las 'phel rgyas byung rjes mar gyis khrag gcod pa dang/khyi'i tshil gyis rma bcos pa dang/chung gi sbang lums kyis rma bcos pa sogs kyi bya thabs shes rtogs byung ba dper na dus rabs brgyad pa'i dkyil du rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis srid dbang bzung skabs/bod kyi lo tsA ba mkhas pa bai ro tsa na dang rgyal rigs kyi smad pa mkhas pa ha shang ma hA kyin dA gnyis kyis rgya yig nas bsgrigs bsgyur byas pa'i sman gzhung (sman dpyad zla ba'i rgyal po )zer ba de'i nang 'khod pa'isman dper na/lug mur/sum tig /bong nga dkar po/bya rgod spos/ba sha ka /spang rtsi do bo/pa yag rtsa ba/g+gang chung ba/'bri mug sogs sman rdzas nyis brgya lnga bcu yas mas shig yod pa tshang ma bod sa gnas rang nas thon pa'i sman sha stag yin/sman bcos byed thabs thad la mtshon na/rtsa brtag skabs/'phar rtsa/sdod rtsa/tsha ba'i rtsa/grang ba'i rtsa sogs rtse sne mi 'dra ba'i dbye ba phye thabs dang/'phar rtsa dang p+sadod rtsa rnams don lnga snod drug dang 'brel nas lus po yongs la khyab tshul bshad yod pa dang/klad pa'i chags tshul skor la/klad pa che chung dang gzugs dbyibs mi 'dra ba'i klad pa phan tshun ltebs brtsegs brgyab nas gnas pa'i rnam par bshad pa bcas tshan rig gi chu tshad mtho tsam yod/da dung spyi lo'i dus rabs brgyad pa'i mjug tu/bod kyi sman pa mkhas pa g.yu thog yon tan mgon pos mdzad pa'i sman gzhung rgyud bi ni bod du skad grags yod pa'i sman gzhung chen po zhig yin cing/de ni khong gis rgya khyab ngang bod mi dmangs kyis nad rigs dang 'thab rtsod byas pa'i nyams myong phun sum tshogs pa rnams phyogs bsdoms gnang ba'i rmang gzhi'i thog /de sngon tA sig dang/zhang zhung/rgya gar/bal po/mes rgyal nang khul bcas nas bod yig thog bsgyur ba'i sman gzhung dang/rang nyid kyis lo mang (363) ring rgya gar bal po sing ga la mes rgyal nang khul bcas su sman bcos slob sbyong byas pa'i nyams myong bcas gcig bsdus byas te brtsams pa zhig yin pa'i skor bod kyi lo rgyus mkhas pa bcu lhag tsam gyis gcig gyur thog khan len gnang yod pa de ni rgyu mtshan khungs lung ldanapa zhig rang yin rgyud bzhi 'di'i nang krung lugs sman gzhung gi bshad tshul skor phud pa'i bod rang gi dmigs bsal thon rdzas min pa'i sman rigs nyis brgya ma zin tsam 'khod pa de'i thog nas rgyud bi ni g.yu thog yon tan mgon po sku ngo mas mdzad pa zhig yin par ra sprod byed thub de ni dus rabs brgyad pa'i nang brtsams pa'i bod kyi sman gzhung nang mi'i lus po'i rtsa thig skor zhib phra 'khod pa dang de bzhin sman gyi ngo sprod sman thang sogs ha cang mang po yod pa bcas bod rigs sman pa mkhas pa dus mas rgyun ring dka' spyad 'bad brtson byas pa'i grub 'bras sha stag red}
bod khams|{(deb ther dmar po )dang (lho brag chos 'byung )gnyis kyi nang bod sa gnas su mi ma byung gong mi ma yin rigs dgus dbang sgyur byed skabs yul gyi ming mi 'dra ba re re btags pa'i nang nas/bdun ma sangs rus dgus dbang bsgyur skabs bod kha nyag drug zer ba'i ming btags pa yin zhes bshad/mkhas dbang dge 'dus chos 'phel gyis mdzad pa'i (deb ther dkar po'i )nang/g.yung drung bon rnams kyi bshad srol ltar na/thog mar bon gyi yul zhes grags pa la rjes su bod kyi yul zhes zur chag pa yin zer ba 'di gad mo slong ba'i gtam 'dra ba zhig tu snang yang phran bu bsam blo gtong dgos pa yin te rgyal po gnam ri srong btsan yan chod la bod yul gang po na bon po'i chos lugs rkyang dar bas bon gyi yul zhes grags na'ang ya mtshan rgyu cher med/rgya nag pa rnams sngon dus su bod kyi yul la phon gyi yul zhes 'bod pa yang bon gyi yul zhes 'bod pa'i sgra dang thag nye po yod/der ma zad rjes 'jug gi da na gnyis phan tshun brjes pa yang shin tu mang ba dper na/btsan po dang btsad po/chun po dang chud po sogs nges med du bris pa ltar bon dang bod gnyis kyang phan tshun brje srid/kha che'i yul du dar rgyas che ba'i i se lan gyi chos lugs la kha tshe'i chos zhes grags pa bzhin du sngon dus su bod yul bon gyi chos dar ba'i rgyu mtshan gyis yul gyi ming bon zer ba de chos lugs la phar thogs pa yin nam/bod zer ba'i chos kyi ming tsam la tshur btags pa yin sus kyang thag gcod mi thub ces gsungs 'dug /nga rang gi bsam tshod la/bod kyi dpe cha'i nang sangs rgyas kyi sku chos sku la bon gyi sku dang bon sku zhes bris 'dug pas bon zer pa de yul gyi ming yin zer ba la dogs pa 'dug }
bod khams chus gang ba|{gna' rabs bod kyi lo rgyus dpe deb mang che ba'i nang bod kyi sa cha 'di thog mar chus gang ba'i sa khul zhig yin pa dang/rjes su chu de rnams kong po sman rgya la se gtam zer ba'i ri'i khog par brtol te rgya gar a sam dang meng cha la brgyud hin rdu rgya mtsho chen por 'bab pa nas bzung rim gyis skam sa dang nags tshal chags pa yin zer srol yod cing/lo rgyus smra ba kha cig gis bod kyi sa cha chus gang ba zer ba ni sa dang yar lung gnyis sa cha chus gang ba la zer ba las bod yongs rdzogs kyi sa cha chus gang ba la zer ba min/bon kyi sa chag yongs rdzogs chus gang nas med na bod kyi skam sa ma chags gong gi zi khron dang/kan su'u/nang sog /mtsho sngon sogs bod sa gnas las sa babs ha cang gis mda' bas de tsho yang chus gang nas yod dgos/sa khul de tsho ni bod kyi skam sa ma chags gong nas skam sa chags te mi yi rigs byung zin pas gong gi shod tshul de mi 'grig zer mkhan yod/(deb ther sngon po )yi nang bod dang/ (364) rgya gar rgya nag bal yul sog yul bcas tshang ma skam sa chags pa dang mi byung ba sogs dus skabs phal cher gcig pa yin zhes bshad bod sa gnas 'di skam sa ma chags gong chos gang nas yod pa'i bshad tshul der bod du dmangs gtso'i bcos bsgyur ma byas phan chad tshan rig gi thog nas ra sprod byed thub pa byung med rung deng skabs tshan rig gis brtag dpyad byas par lo ngo dung phyur lnga'i sngon nas lo ngo bye ba gsum snang bar mtshon byed kyi sa gshis dus skabs so so'i g.ya' ra'i chags rim nang du rgya mtsho'i gting du yod pa'i byi ru dang nya mtsho rtsa sogs srog chags dang rtsi shing gi 'gyur rdo ha cang mang po rtsed pa des la ngo dung phyur nyi shu lhag gi gong du hi ma ya la'i khul de mtsho khul zhig yin par ra sprod byas pa dang chabs cig sa babs de las sha cang gis dma' sar gnas pa'i dbus gtsang khams gsum sogs skabs der chus gang ba'i sa khul zhig yin par ra sprod byed thub kyi red zhib cha (dri ba khri bcu ){(WP:1,194)} zer ba'i rgya yig gi dpe deb ang brgyad par gzigs}
bod khams yul gyi rnam pa gsal por dod|{de ni rgya mtsho rnams bris nas skam sa chags pa dang/skam sa'i thog srog chags byung ba nas mi'i 'gro ba chags pa bcas la zer/de'i skor la bod yig gi lo rgyus yig rnying mang po zhig gi nang/bod ljongs 'di thog mar chas gang ba rnams rim gyis stod mnga' ris skor gsum la g.ya' ri dang gangs ri/bar dbus gtsang ru bzhi la brag ri dang spang ljongs/smad mdo khams sgang gsum la rtsi shing dang nags tshag gyis gang sogs sa khams chags tshul rags tsam bshad yod cing/yang lo rgyus 'ga' zhig tu stod mnga' ris skor gsum ni sha rkyang la sogs pa'i ri dwags kyi gling dang/bar dbus gtsang ru bzhi ni stag gzig la sogs pa'i gcan gzan gyi gling/smad mdo khams sgang gsum ni 'dab chags bya yi gling yin par bshad pa des rab byung gi khor yug gong gsal der gnas pa'i srog chags 'byung khungs bshad yod/deng sang rang rgyal gyi sa gshis rig pa mkhas can sku zhabs kra'o tsung po'o dang/gzhan yang lo rgyus mkhas can sku zhabs h+phan wen lan la sogs pa mang po zhig gis tshan rig brtag dpyad gnang ba'i gnas tshul ngo sprod kyi chen rtsod nang 'khod don/de ban ha lam lo ngo dung phyug gcig dang phye ba drug gi snga rjes su bod ljongs 'di chus gang ba'i mtsho chenapo zhig yin pas stod gsar dus rabs (sa gshis rig pa'i thog gi lo rabs rtsi tshul )kyi lo sa ya gnyis dang 'bum lnga'i gong la slebs yod/rjes su rim bzhin sa babs mtho ru song ste skam sa chags pa dang/stod gsar dus rabs kyi skabs hi ma lA ya'i ri rgyud rim bzhin mtho ru song ba ('di las gshis rig pa'i thog hi ma lA yi 'gul bskyod zer )dang lhag par du bod ljongs sa khul gyi rang byung khor yug la shugs rkyen ha cang chen po thebs te/nub dang nub byang phyogs sa babs dma' ba'i khyad chos de chags shing/sa shun 'gul bskyod kyi go rim de'i nang gna' bo'i srog chags rigs dang rtsi shing sna tshogs skye 'phel byung brgyud rim bzhin bod sa gnas rang du skye 'phel dang 'tshar longs byung ba'i 'gro ba mi'i rigs yod pa'i mtshon rtags su srog chags dang rtsi shing sna tshogs kyi 'gyur rdo dang/rdo chas dus rabs nyang pa dang gsar pa'i skabs kyi mis bzos yod byad mang po btsal rnyed byung ba'i gnas tshul dngos yod rab dang rim pa drangs yod/khong rnam pa tshos tshan rig zhib 'jug gnang ba'i chod gtam de tshong dang/gna' rabs bod kyi lo rgyus thog gi bshad tshul gnyis phyogs mang po zhig gi thad nas mthun po yod 'dug pas zhib par 'brel yod kyi dpyad gzhi'i (365) yig cha gzhan khag la gzigs gnang zhu}
bod khri skor bcu gsum|{sngon gyi sa skya ba'i yig rnying zhig nang gsal ba (tA la'i bla ma lnga pa'i rnam thar rang rtsom )pod dang po'i shog grangs 20nas gos grangs 21bar drangs pa dang/sa skya bdag chen ngag dbang kun dga' bsod nams gyis brtsams pa'i (sa skya'i gdung rabs ngo mtshar rin po che'i bang mdzod )kyi shog grangs 90par gsal ba gnyis gnad bsdus byas te bkod na yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hu pi li se chen han gyis 'gro mgon 'phags pa la gnang sngags kyi dbang thems dang po zhus pa'i dbang yon tan bod khri skor bcu gsum phul bar bshad pas/de la khri skor re la lha sde bzhi stong dmi ldan drug stong yod pa dang/de yang khang pa ka ba drug gi sa yod pa/mi bza' mi gnyis/bu pho mo gnyis/g.yog pho mo gnyis te mi drug /phyugs rta bong gnyis/ba lang ra lug re rnams dang/zhing hor gyi son khal bcu gnyis kyi sa yod pa rnams la hor dud chung gcig zer ba yin/dud chung nyi shu rtsa lnga la dud chen gcig /de gnyis la rta mgo gcig /de gnyis la brgya skor gcig/de bcu la stong skor gcig /de bcu la khri skor gcig /de bcu la klus gcig /de bcu la zhing gcig zin zhing/hor se chen rgyal po'i mnga' 'og tu zhing bcu gcig yod cing/bod chol kha gsum la zhing gcig ma longs kyang/bla ma bzhugs sa dang bstan pa dar sa zhing pas zhing gcig tu rtsis nas phul ba yin no zhes gsal zhing/bod khri skor bcu gsum nang dbus gtsang gnyis ma gtogs mang ris dang mdo khams khul 'di'i khongs su rtsis med/skabs der dbus gtsang gnyis kyang par khri skor bcu gsum rtsis stangs dang/de'i them dud dang mi 'bor bcas kyi re'u mig gsham gsal khri skor ming them dud mi 'bor la stod lho 1990 11940 la stod byang 2250 13500 chu mig 3003 18018 gur mo 5570 30720 zha lu 3892 33342 shangs 1500 9000 rgya ma 5950 25700 'bri gung 3630 21680 phag gru 2430 12580 tshal pa 3700 22200 bya yul 5950 35750 g.ya' bzang 3000 18000 yar 'brog 750 4500 gong du gsal ba'i khri skor bcu gsum kyi them dud kyi ga grangs ni sa skya'i ba'i lo rgyus yig rnying nas (tA la'i bla ma sku reng lnga pa'i rnam thar rang rtsom )nang drangs pa ltar na mnga' ris man chad nas yu yan chad kyi them dud zhib bsher byed mkhan rgya'i mi chen ar mgon dang do bu a nu gan gnyis kyis brtsis shing zha lu nas 'bri gung yan gyi sa cha'i theng dud zhib bsher byed mkhas sa skya ba'i sbyin bdag su thu a skyid zer ba des rtsis pa dang de min gyi sa che'i them dud zhib bsher byed mkhan ni sa skya'i dpon chen dngo shAkya bzang po zer ba yod rgyal rabs kyi gong mas zam glu gun ming dben hu'i zer ba'i go gnas sprad pa des brtsis pa yin tshul sa skya'i deb ther shog dril gyi der them dud zhib bsher zhib chags byas pa lta bu zhig 'dug rung gang gsal re'u mig ltar gzhir bzung na (366) dbus gtsang khri skor bcu gsum gyi them dud bsdoms 'bor bzhi khri gsum stong drug brgya bco lnga dang them dud rer mi drug re brtsis pa'i mi 'bor nyis 'bum drug khri chig stong drug brgya dgu bcu )khri nyi shu rtsa drug dang chig stong drug brgya dgu bcu )las med pas da dung de'i thog nga mnga' ris skor gsum la de las mi grangs nyung zhing sman mdo khams sgang gsum dbus gtsang gnyis la sa ma 'bor mang bas mnga' ris skor gsum dang smad mdo khams sga gsum bsdoms pa'i mi 'bor de dbus gtsang gnyis las ldab gcig dar da ka yod par brtsis na yang mi 'bor khri drug cu re lnga dang bzhi stong nyis brgya nyi shar rtsa lnga las med la de'i thog gong gi dbus gtsang khri skor bcu gsum gyi mi 'bor bsdoms grangs de bsnan na yang skabs de'i bod kyi mi 'bor dgu 'bum chig khri lnga stong dgu brgya bco lnga (khri dug cu go gcig dang lnga stong dgu brgya bco lnga )las med stabs skabs der bod la mi 'bor de tsam las med pa e yin snyam 'i dogs gnas kyi gzhir 'dug pas lo rgyus mkhas can tshos brtag dpyad gnang rgyu'i dpyad gzhir bkod}
bod mkhas pa mi pham dge legs rnam rgyal|{rje 'di ni rab byung bcu pa'i sa rta (1618)lor 'khrungs/bka' brgyud pa'i grub mtha' 'dzin zhing/bod kyi snyan ngag pa chen por grags can zhig yin pa ma zad/sman dpyad kyi rig pa la'ang shin tu mkhas/zur lugs dang 'brug pa pad+ma dkar po'i lugs phyag bzhes kyis (sman gyi ro nus bshad pa bai DUr+ya'i me long/) (drin las legs bshad rin po che'i snang ba gsar pa/) (lus thig zla ba nor bu )sogs gso rig gi phyag rtsom dang/dug lo re gcig la phebs pa rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa rta (1678)lor (snyan 'grel daN+Di'i dgongs rgyan )zhes bya ba phyag rtsom mdzad}
bod chol kha gsum|{sa skya a mes ngag dbang kun dga' bsod nams kyis brtsams pa'i (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )shog grangs 9par yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hu pi li se chen han gyis sa skya 'gro mgon 'phags pa la dbang thems gnyis pa zhus pa'i dbang yon la bod chol kha gsum phul ba'i chos kha gsum ni/mnga' rings gung nas sog la skya bo yan dbu gtsang chos kyi chos kha/sog la skya bo nas rma ju khug pa yan mdo stod mi'i chol kha/rma chu khug pa nas rgya mchod rten dkar po yan mdo smin rta'i chol kha zhes grags/dbus gtsang chos kyi chos la mi grags mang po med stabs chol kha gsum la zhing chen gcig gi tshan ma longs kyang bod dpung gtsang ni bla ma bzhugs sa yin pa dang sangs rgyas chos lugs dar sa yin pas bod chol kha gsum la zhing chen gcig tu brtsis nas phul ba yin tshul gsal}
bod ljongs spyi tshogs rgyas pa|{bod sa gnas su bka' shag btsugs nas bzung/las don ha cang gal chen gras la tshogs 'du rgyas 'dzoms zer ba zhig 'tshogs rgyu yod pa der bka' blon bzhi dang/drung yig chen mo bzhi/rtsis dpon bzhi/dza sag /tha'i ji sogs mtho ris dpon rigs mang che ba bzhugs dgos pa'i thog /da dung se 'bras dge gsum gi mkhan po dang/spyi so/dga' ldan khri pa'i phyag mdzod sogs zhugs dgos}
bod dang bod chen po|{sngar rgyal po'i mnga' 'og tu yod 'i mnga' ris tsam la bod dang de'i lhag ma'i yul rnams la bod chen po zer ba yin/'ga' zhig gis dbus gtsang gnyis la bod dang/mdo khams la bod chen po zer ba yin tshul bshad mkhan yod kyang de mi 'grig ste 'brom ston pas i ti sha la bod chen po na bsam yas gtsug lag khang dang dge 'dun dpag med bzhugs pa der phebs par zhu ba phul tshul jo bo rje'i rnam thar du (367) gsal bas so/_}
bod du grags pa mdzad pa bcu gcig|{o rgyan pad+ma'i bod du grags pa mdzad pa bcu gcig ni/'gro drug don mdzad brgyad lnga che ba mdzad/_/lha 'dre btul mdzad gtsug lag khang bzhengs mdzad/_/mdo rgyud bsgyur mdzad 'phrin las rnam bzhi mdzad/_/sbyor sgrol gnyis mdzad mnan bsreg 'phang gsum mdzad/_/dus bzhi mkhyen mdzad bstan zhabs gter skyong mdzad/_/rgya bod drin chen gang la gang 'dul mdzad/_/o rgyan rnam thar mdor bsdus pa 'di/_/sus bris pa dang mthong thos gzhan la ston/_/de dag 'jig rten bde ba can du skye/_/zhes gsungs so/_}
