bod mi'i nye rabs kyi rgyan gos|{de yang gtso bo bod kyi grong khyer lte ba lha sa'i bud med tsho'i nye rabs kyi gyon chas ni bod mi gzhan dang 'dra bar phyu pa gyon par byed/de yang gos chen dang/ther ma/ras/snam bu sogs kyis bzos te ston dpyid gnyis la phu yod dang/dbyar kha phu med/dgun dus su pags tshags bcas gyon/rkang lham ni zom pa dang 'jur rta rang 'dod ltar byed/chung dus nas ska la lcang lo rgyag pa dang/bu mos lcam lo'i thog ltag 'dzar zhes g.yu dang byu ru spel mar bsgrogs/mi drug che gras kyi bu mo rnams ltag 'dzar gyi stod du ga'u rgyag pa dang/rna bar mu tig dang pha lam sogs rang gi dpal 'byor 'khos bab las dpag pa'i rin po che'i rna rgyan 'dra min 'dogs par byed/bu mo rnams lo gzhon dus te mna' mar ma 'gro gong du pha mas dus tshes bzang ba zhig la bu mor spa phrug g.yogs te rten 'brel byed/de nas bzung gzhi nas bo mos sku nyis lhas byed pa dang/spang gdan 'ching bar byed/spyir btang lha sa'i bud med rnams dbyar dus su zhwa mo mi gyon yang/cung lo na che ba rnams gling skor sogs nyi 'og tu 'gro skabs bskal bzang bsil g.yab ces (tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i skabs byung ba )smyug ma'i rtsibs rus can/rgyu ther ma dang/gos chen sogs gang rung las bcos pa dpral ba'i mdun phyogs su nyi sgrib tu brkyangs pa zhig og sgrog gis bcings/dgun dus su bu mo tshos yang zhwa zhes ther ma sogs kyis bzos pa'i zhwa mo rgyab mdun gnyis la rna cog (lce leb )che ba re dang g.yas g.yon gnyis la chung ba re pags pa'am spu ma gra ring gis brgyad pa zhig yod par byed/na tshod cung che ba rnams kyi sked skabs su sked pa nas 'phongs tshos bar khebs pa'i pags pa'ang bar tshong can gyi sked dkris dkris par byed/nye rabs lha sa'i skyes pa rnams kyi gzhi rtsa'i gyon can ni phyu chen rang yin pa las bud med ltar phu med gyon srol med kyang/dbyar dus su phu thung g.yas pa 'bud pa dang dgun dus su rgyab sha 'dra min kyi pags tshags gyon par byed/lo na gzhon pa rnams kyis phyu ba'i rgyab phyogs su rkub sul bzhi'am drug sgrig pa dang la las las gyi sta zur la zur ltebs rig par byed/rkang par ko lham dang/zom pa/'jur rta ru rin can rang 'dod ltar gyon/mgo la dbyar dus su phying zhwa dang/dgus dus su tshe ring skyin khebs/'jam btang pags slob bcas gyon/spyir na skyes pa mang che ba chung dus na skra lcang lo rgyag pa dang/rna cog g.yas par g.yu byur dung g.yon mar a yong 'dogs par byed kyang mi drug rnams kyi bu tshos lcang lor ga'u rgyan pa dang rna gcog yon mar sog byis 'dogs srol yod/lha sa'i dpon rigs rnams kyi chas gos ni rang rang so so'i las gnas la gzhigs pa'i las gos rnams grangs mang zhing/ (368) rgyu cha dang bzo dbyibs tshos gzhi sogs rnam par bkra ba mang po yod chas gos de rnams kyi khrod du de snga bod rigs rang gi chas lugs su gyur pa rin chen rgyan cha dang rgya lu chas sogs yod pa ma zad bar skabs mong gol dpon rigs kyi chas sug gtugs pa khar kha su dang ta lab chi zhwa mo wa ger sogs kyang yod dpon rigs rnams ni nam dus so so dang mdzad sgo 'dra min so sor gtan 'bebs gzhir bzung gi chas lugs mi 'dra ba gyon par byed la de lnga tA la'i bla ma'i chibs bsgyur skabs ser skya dpon rigs khag rang rang so sor tha dad pa'i gzab bzhes chas su zhugs pa ma zad bzhon la'ang gser tshags kyis mdzes par shing g.yu byil sogs kyis legs par brgyan pa'i gser sga dang gser srab gser rmed dang dam dom dpral khebs gzar chen gzar chung sga shubs sogs kyi rgyan spros mdzes par spud pa sogs dpon rigs rim dang las tshan so so'i rgyan gos re re bzhin 'god pa la rnam grangs shin tu mang bas yig tshigs kyi rkyen pas ma bris shing lha sa'i bud med rnams gzab mchor skabs gyi rgyan cha ni lhag par mdzes shing 'jig rten gyi mi rigs gzhan pa su dang yang mi 'dra bar yod mi rigs rang gi dmigs bsal khyad chos gas chen ldan pa zhig yin pas mdor bsdus tsam zhus na gna' dus bod kyi bud med rnams kyi rgyan cha rnam kun nas lus por 'dogs par byed nye rabs su lo gsar sogs dus chen khag dang gzhan gyi khyim du mgron por 'gro ba gling kha sogs spro skyid gtong ba bcas kyi skabs su bod med rnams kyis rang nyid lha mo lta bu'i yid 'ong gi mdzes pa zhig tu brgyan par bya rgyur spro snang che bas rgyan gos gzab mchor gang che byed pa'i srol dar zhing lha sa'i bud med kyi rgyan gos kyi dpe mtshon du gyur ni mdzad ston che khag tu rgyan bzang ma zhes pa'i rgyan gos gzab par spud pa'i khrung zhu ma rnams yin rgyan bzang ma'i rgyan gos ni dpon rigs che gras kyi lha lcam rnams kyi rgyan gos dang ha lang gcig mtshungs su snang pa ste rgyan bzang ma rnams kyis rgya dra rgya se'am the'u rgya smug sogs kyi phyu pa'i 'og tu gru'u rtse sna lnga'i 'og phyu gyon lus smad kyi phyug pa'i thog tu sham thabs nag po gnyer ma bsnol sgrig gi gos dang phyu ba'i steng du steng brtsegs zhes bya sa'i phu med zhig gyon mdun du 'dzar pang zhes skyin khegs rta mig ma dang dngos rtse ma sogs kyis bzos shing sne mor si shan gyi khrom 'dzar ldan pa'i pang gdan bcings rkang lham rta so ma zhes rtse drung gi ras zom lta bu zhig gyon mgo bo'i skra ni mgo dal du rtse gtsug zhes sgom mo zhig lhas dpral ba'i mdun gyi sgra rnams skra mtshams dkyil nas phye zhing g.yos g.yon so sor nas 'then pas sna ba gnyis ka 'gebs par byes te rgyab phyogs su nyil skra lhas skra rtse re rer skra gzhug re bcings lcags sgrom sems can gyi rwa co 'dra ba (zur phud )khung bu du ma can zhig gi thog tu si gyon te rwa co g.yas g.yon gnyis nas skra rdzas rnams sgal steng bar sil bur glod de nas sgra nyis lhas sa da skabs kyi mtshams su mu tig phreng brgyad bcu grangs shing gser gyi phreng kang gsum gyis sbrel zhing g.yu byis gyi rgyan spros mdzes par byas khred rtse gcig lhag tsam yod pa'i nor bu dga' khyil gyis skra rdzus kyi lan bu gnyis sbrel skra rdzus kyin mo gnyis la skra gzhug re bcings pa de ha lam sa mthil la ma reg tsam du 'phyang khrul du glod skra rdzus kyi thog tu mu tig rdog po stong phrag drug bdun tsam gyis bzos shing byi ru rdog chen bcu bzhi dang byi ru gnyis re'i dbar du bod g.yu spus legs re mtshams 'jug byas nas sne mor dang mtshams rnams mdzes rgyan spras pa'i mu tig spa phrug zur gsum zhig gyon spa phrug la gser gyi lcags khyu bzhi yis skra rdzus kyi lcags sgrom dang (369) skra'i rtse gtsug tu bsgrogs spa phrug dkyil gyi stong cha zur gsum de'i thog tu rtse g.yu thag pa zhes gtsug g.yu'i gzhi gdan du gyur pa mu tig skud par bsgyur te dam por sgrog 'tshem byas pa che chung rag mthil tsam dbus su gtsug g.yu bsgar ba zhig gis bkab rtse g.yu thag pa'i thog tu mi tig rdog po chig khri lnga stong tsam gyis bzos pa'i mu tig thod khegs yongs grags su mu tig thug khegs zhes khog ma kha sbug slob ma dang 'dra ba zhig gyon rna ba gnyis la a dbril 'brum 'dzar zhes gser gyi rnam rgyan sgom mo che chung nyis sbrel da mor 'brum 'dzar khred rtse gcig tsam ring ba zhig rna ba'i mdun du btags shing 'brum 'dzar rnam brang kha g.yas g.yon gnyis su dpyangs a dbril 'brum 'dzar brtan por rna ba gnyis kyi mdun du gnas phyir 'brum 'dzar yar 'then zhes mu tig lcags dbril dang ger gyi dra bkag g.yu yi phra rgyan bcas kyis grub pa zhig mtshog ma'i thog tu btang nas sne gnyis su g.yas g.yon gyi sa dbril 'brum 'dzar re bsgrogs ske la dkar shar dmar shal zhes g.yu dang byi ru spos shel bcas kyi do shal pus mo grol ba gsum gyon pa'i thog la da dung mu tig dang byu ru gzi bcas sprel mar brgyus pa'i lung thag gis gser sbyangs brdung gi ga'u zur brgyad ma g.yu dang rdo rje pha lam rin chen phral la sogs pa rin po che sna tshogs kyi phra tshom brgyab pa zhig brang kha'i dkyil phyogs su btags de nas ga'u gsum sgrom zhes gong gsal ga'u las cung chung ba'i gser gyi ga'u gsum mu tig dang gzi byu ru spel mar brgyus pa'i lung thag tu bsgrogs te ga'u gnyis brang kha'i g.yas g.yon dang dkyil gyi ga'u dag ha lam grod pa'i steng du btags shing ga'u'i yar 'then zhig mu tig phreng brgyus nyi shu tsam ring thung khred rtse gcig leb bsgrigs kyis dkyil du yar 'then mgo sgor zhas gser gyi ga'u gser tshags can g.yu dang rin chen phra yi rgyan pa dang 'go mjug gnyis la gser gyi phra bkag re bskal ba zhig gis ga'u gsum sgrom gyi dbus kyi ga'u che ba dag dpung pa g.yon du btags te g.yon phyogs kyi rag kha ni yar 'then gyis mdzes par byas brang kha g.yas par 'phrul 'phrul zhes mu tig dang gzi ma rgad sogs se shan gyi skud par bsgyur te dbyibs gzugs mdzes par bsgrigs de ni bzo grwa'am yang na chen las kyi bzos pas bcos pa ma yin par rgyan cha'i bdag po rang gi sor mo'i 'du byed las grub pa yin pas bdag po'i blo gros dang mdzes rig mtshon pa'i sgyu rtsal gyi dngos po zhig kyang yin der brten lha sa'i bud med rnams kyi 'phrul 'phrul ni gzhi rtsa gcig mtshungs yin kyang bye brag tu bkod pa 'dra min tha dad du gyur pa'i rgyan cha ha cang mdzes pa zhig ste steng brtsegs la sked rags med pas steng brtsegs lus thog tu dam por 'khril phyir sked skabs su gser gyi sdig ra zhes sne gnyis la gser gyi lcags kyu ldan pa zhig brgyab sdig ra'i dkyil du me tog zhal kha phye ba'i 'dab ma lta bu'i dbyibs la g.yu byil gyi phra tshom btab pa zhig dang de'i dam gcig nas mu tig gi phreng ba gcig dang sne mo kha gcig nas byu ru'i ngab gcig pang gdan thog tu 'phyar 'phrul tu btang zhing phreng ba gnyis kyi sde mo gci gshos dag sdig ri'i dkyil gyi pad 'dab la bsgrogs pas phreng ba gnyis pa gdan thog tu sgor mor dpyangs 'ba' khug khab shubs zhes rgyu dngul las gser tshags dang g.yu yi phra rgyan btab pa bzo dbyibs 'ba' khug dang kha shubs kyi gzugs ltar mtshon byed tsam du bcos shing sne mor 'phrul 'phrul gyin brgyan pa gnyis lus po'i g.yas g.yon gyi zur lteb dang nye bar sked rags su bsgrogs lus stod kyi sgal par gos chen 'ja' bsgrigs kyi gos gzan pang dan lta bu zhig 'phred du gyon nas sne mo gnyis brang khar thig gus bsgrogs de la 'ding ba rin chen sne lnga (gzan sde lnga )zhes 'bod gong du brjod pa ni rgyan bzang ma'i rgyan (370) gos yin nye rabs kyi spyir btang bud med dang lhag don du gzhon nu ma mang che ba ni de lta bu'i rnyog 'dzing can gyi rgyan gos ni rang gi dpal 'byor gnas bab dang dus rabs 'phel phyogs sogs dang 'tshams par ma gyur pas so gsar dang gnyen sgrig bcas kyi mdzad skor spa phrug sogs gyon te gzab mchor byed pa las dus ston dang spro skyid bcas kyi skabs su spa phrug mi gyon par zhwa mo yang zhwa zhig gyon brang khar ga'u rdzas zhes rdo ja pha lam dang dzus sogs rin thang che ba'i rin po che yi phra rgyan btab cing bzo dbyibs me tog dang phye ma leb sogs shin tu mdzes par ci rigs ga'u'i tshab tu 'dogs par byed la ga'u rdzus kyi 'dogs thag la'ang rin thang che ba'i gzi dang mu tig bcas kyis mdzes par rgyan brang kha g.yon mar 'phrul 'phrul yid du 'ong ba zhig btags phyis su gser gyi rna rgyan tshigs khebs de bzhin ga'u dang ga'u rdzus la rdo rje pha lam sogs rin thang che ba'i rin po che yis khra tshom rgyag rgyur dang zhen che ba sogs rgyan cha stabs bder gtong ba dang rin thang je cher gtong ba'i phyogs su 'phel rgyas su song lha sa'i bu med rnams ni mdzes rgyan la dar zhen che zhing bzo bkod gsar gtod byed rgyur rnam rig bkra bas rgyan gos gong 'phel gtong rgyur rig stobs ldan pazhig yin par brten lha sa'i bud med kyi rgyan cha ni lo ngo stong gi snga rol nas da ltar bar gcig tu nges pa ma yin par mi thog gcig gi ring la'ang rgyan gos la 'gyur ba yong tshul kun gyi mthong snang du gyur rgas po'i ngag las mched par gzhigs na lha sa'i bod med rnams kyi spa phrug ni de snga sgor sgor yin pa dang de nas zur gsum du gyur nga tsho'i pha ma'i mi rabs de rang du spa phrug gi zur gsum po de dag rim bzhin je rnor song ste mthar nye rabs kyi spu phrug rwa co 'dra ba der gyur yang gser gyi ga'u la mtshon na de snga'i ga'u ni ha cang chen po med la gzugs dbyibs gru bzhi yin na'ang rjes su rig bcos kyis zur brgyad du zur drug sogs 'dra min btags pa ma zad phyis su ga'u rdzus zhes ga'u'i mtshon byed tsam du dbyibs nges med rang mos ltar gsar gtod kyis 'dogs par byed bod kyi bud med kyi rgyan cha ni bzo dbyibs gcig las gcig mdzes pa'i phyogs su 'phel rgyas song zhing ring nang yang je mthor song ste phyis su 'byor ldan pa rnams kyi rgyan cha la na lta'i thang gzhi brtsis na mi dmangs shog sgor khri brgya zin pa'ang mi nyung ba zhig yod lha sa'i bud med kyi rgyan gos la zhib tu dpyad na mi nyung ba zhig ni rnam kun gyi 'tsho ba dang thon skyed mkho chas rang yin rang nyid mdzes par rgyan spros bya rgyur rab tu spro ba rnams kyis mkho spyad de rnams rgyu gser dang dngul dzus sogs kyis bcos shing dkrol tshags rgyag pa dang rin po che yi phra rgyan rgyag pa sogs kyis mdzes par byed pa dper na ser skya dpon rigs kyi chab blugs dang rgya gri phor shubs ser ril smyug sgrog sogs ni rnam kun 'tshob dang las ka'i khrod du bed spyod gtong byed kyi yo chas yin pa dang de snga bud med mang che ba'i lag pa g.yas par gyon pa'i dung 'khor ni gna' rabs su 'brog pa'i thon skyed kyi mkho byad cig yin zhing de yang ba phyugs sogs kyi 'o ma 'jo ba'i skabs su 'o ma'i thigs pa rnams lag ngar brgyud de phu thung nang du ma song bar dung 'khor thog nas thad kar 'o zom nang du lhung ba'i ched du gyon pa dang rjes su 'o ma 'jo dgos min la ma ltos par tshang mas gyon te rgyan char gyur skyes pa'i mthe bong du gyon pa'i krad kor ni mda' 'gengs pa'i skabs su gzhu krad bskon byed yin de bzhin yid du 'ong ba'i khad gdan ni bud med rnams thab las sogs byed skabs kyi phyu ba'i zon skyor yin 'phrog pa'i rgyan gos rnams ni 'tsho ba'i nyams myong dang thon skyed lag bstar gyi khrod du rim bzhin byung ba zhig (371) yin la de nyid gzhir bzung nas rim bzhin mdzes snang la dga' zhing gsar gtod kyi rig stobs ldan pa'i lha sa ba rnams kyis 'phel rgyas su btang nas byung ba yin pa gsal por mtshon yod 'ga' res spa phrug ces pa ni rgya nag gi skad du {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i sgra 'gyur ba yin zhing de ni 'jam dpal dbyangs kyi zhing khams su gsan pa'i bud med kyi rgyan char dpe bltas nas bzos pa red ces rgya nag gi yul gru kun tu spa phrug gyon srol med bzhin du de ltar smra ba byung yod kyang don dngos spa phrug ces pa'i tha snyad ni bod skad rang yin te spa zhes pa ni spa lo dang phrug ces pa ni snam bu'i don yin gna' dus su spa phrug ni dang thog spa lo 'ching byed kyi snam ba dmar po zhig rang yin pa dang rjes sor rim bzhin 'phel rgyas song ste g.yu byil mu tig sogs kyis rgyan pa'i spa phrug zur gsum de lta bu zhig la 'gyur ba red yang bod kyi rgya lu chas ni rgya gar gyi rgyal po in dra bo d+hi'i chas red ces brjod pa ma zad da d