bod sa gnas srid gzhung|{de yang btsan po'i thog ma gnya' khri btsan po nas rtsis pha'i dus rabs bdun pa'i nang rgyal rabs so gsum pa chos rgyal srong btsan sgom po'i bod yongs la chos srid yun du skyong ba'i cha rkyen med du mi rung ba chos dge ba bcu dang mi chos gtsang ma bcu drug snying por bzhag pa'i sgrig gzhi khod chen po sum cu rtsa drug (rgyal blon bka' gros zhib nan gyis gtan la phab pa der bka' gros chen po drug dang/yig tshangs drug /bka'i phyag rgya drug /rkyen drug /dpal mtshan drug /khrims yig drug bcas (tu 'bod pa gsar gtod kyi phyag bzhes su bstar nas rgyal khams bskyangs shing/chab 'bangs 'phral yun bde skyid kyi dpal la bkod pa sogs (392) lo rgyus mdzad rjes kyi ri mo nyams gsal bar gnas pa ltar dang de rjes dus rabs brgyad pa'i nang rgyal rabs so brgyad pa chos rgyal khri srong lde btsan gyi sku dus mes srong btsan dus kyi srid skyong sgrig gzhi rgyun mthud thog mkhan slob chos gsum zhal 'dzoms te bsam yas gtsug lag khang sogs bzhengs pa dang mdo smad yan chad du bshad grwa sgom gra sogs dge 'dun gyi sde mang po btsugs shing chos dpe mang po bod skad du bsgyur lha khang gi mchod rgyun dang dge 'dun so sor chos 'bangs khyim dud bstsal thog rgyal mdzod nas ro rer 'bru mar dang na bza' snag shog sogs dgos mkho bstsal zhing chos bdag mkhan por gser yag chen po'i go gnas dang blon chen tshang ma'i gral 'gor sdod rgyu blon chen gyi gros tshogs chung bar zhugs chog pa bcas kyi thob dbang bstsal te chos lugs mi sna srid gros su zhugs pa'i lam srol thog ma chags dus rabs dbu par rgyal rabs zhe gcig pa chos rgyal khri ral pa can gyi dus su yab mes gong ma'i khrims srol rgyun bskyangs thog khri tsa 'bum bzher gyi khrims dang 'bum gser thog sha ba can gyi khrims rgyal khams dpe blangs kyi khrims mdo lon zhu bcad kyi khrims dkon mchog gi chos khrims jo mo mnga' bdagi khrims dang drug tu phye ste bar skabs nyams lad du gyur rigs dag ther mdzad de dril bsgrags gzhan yang smin gyi bcos lugs bzhi dpyad mkhan gyi gab rtse lnga ya rab kyi rkyen bdun mdzad pa mig bc