bon gyi mkhan dbang g.yung drung rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po|{g.yung drung bon gyi rje 'di nyid mdo smad dngul rdza zin sgang stod ster gtogs yul rgya ba lung nang zer ba yab bsod nams bstan dar dang yum bsod nams gnam mtsho gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bco lnga pa'i me bya (1697)lor 'khrungs/mtshan bsod nams bstan 'dzin zhes gsol/dgung lo bdun pa la bya bral drang srong rgyal ba tshul khrims dge rgan du bsten nas yi ge 'bri klog la sbyangs/skyabs 'gro dang/sems (397) skyed snying po rnam gsum gsol 'debs sogs khri phrag re bsags shing yi ge rdzab shar dkar nag gang la'ang klog 'don thogs med du byung dgung lo bcu gcig nas dpal gsas bon skyongs khri khro gri mchod khro bo'i bsnyen sgrub ma mo sbod gtong sogs 'don rim dang dkyil 'khor gyi thig rtsa 'bri stangs gtor bzo gyer dbyangs dang phyag rgya sman rtsis ris sogs la sbyangs pa phul du phyin lcags phag (1919)lor dge slong sgo ston nyi ma rgyal mtshan rin po che dang dge slong drang srong rgyal ba tshul khrims mchog gnyis kyi drung nas rab tu byung ba'i sdom pa nyer lnga yang dag par bzhes mtshan g.yung drung rgyal mtshan du gsol sa lug (1919)lor dbus gtsang du phebs gtsang thob rgyal sman ri dgos gyi mkhan chen phun tshogs blo gros la bsnyen rdzogs zhus mtshan g.yung drung rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po zhes gsol smin ri'i sgrub chen gyi dbang lung yongs rdzogs gsan de nas spun nye dang rta khal rnams pha yul du brdzangs te phyogs med ri khrod 'grim rgyu la thugs phyogs dpal ldan grwa sa gong 'og bar gsum la phebs nas mkhas grub bla ma gshen gnyen mang du bsten phyi nang gi dbang lung khrid gsum rgya cher gsan gnas chen sgrub gnas brag phug khag dang dur khrod la'ang bskyed rdzogs zung 'brel gyi zab mo'i sgrub pa na bzhes nyams len rgyas par mdzad rgya gar dang bal yul za hor o rgyan bru sha sogs kyi gdan rten rnams mjal tsa ri'i sgrub gnas su lo shas ring nyams len gyi phyag rgya zab par spel de nas khyung lung ri khrod du mtshams sgrub nyams len lo gsum mdzad rjes gangs dkar ti se dang gur rgyal lha mtsho mtsho ma pham