bon gyi ston pa shes rab mi bo che|{'di nyid zhang zhung (stag gzig ces pa'ang snang )yul gyi 'os mo lung ring du yab rgyal po thod dkar dang yum yo phyi rgyal bzhad ma gnyis kyi sras su sku 'khrungs/lo rgyus yig tshang 'gar 'di nyid spyi lo'i dus rabs ma tshugs gong gi lo drug brgya yas mas shig la byon par gsungs/bon gyi bstan pa ni bod kyi gdod ma'i chos lugs yin pa de ston pa gshen rab mi bo ches gsungs shing/de la g.yung drung bon zhes grags/g.yung drung gi rtags 'di bon gyi bstan pa mtshon byed kyi bstan rtags te mi 'gyur rtag brtan gyi mtshon don yin/spyir bon gyi bstan pa la phyi nang gsang gsum gyi dbye ba yod de/ston pa gshen rab kyi yar sngon du bon sku'i ston pa kun tu bzang pos grol lam rdzogs chen mo'i bstan pa spel ba la gsang rgyud dang/longs sku'i stod pa gshen lha 'od dkar gyis gsang sngags kyi bstan pa spel ba la snga rgyud/phyis su sprul sku'i ston pa gshen rab mi bos spel ba'i mdo phyogs kyis gtsos pa'i bstan pa phyi rgyud zer/phyi rgyud bod kyi gzhung lugs (398) tshang ma theg pa rim pa dgu'am bon sgo bzhi mdzod sogs su 'dus shing thig pa rim pa dgu ni phywa gshen snang gshen 'phrul gshen srid gshen te rgyu'i theg pa bzhi dang dge bsnyen drang srong a dkar ye gshen te 'bras bu'i theg pa bzhi dang khyad par chen po'i theg pa gcig dang bcas dgu'o/_/lha bon sgo bzhi'i khongs su mo dang pra gto bcos rtsis sman dpyado gas kyang 'dus yod lo rgyus yig tshang 'gar bod rgyal pu de gung rgyal gyi sku dus su ston pa gshin rab mi bo ches khams chen po brgyad la sogs pa bon po'i chos thams cad zhang zhung gi yul nas bsgyur te dar zhing rgyas par mdzad de dus g.yung drung gi bod byung zhes pa'ang snang}
