byang ngos|{yon rgyal rabs kyis rgyal yongs gcig gyur ma byas gong hor rgyal po mi rabs gsum pa tha'i cung o go ta'i khri lo bdun pa shing lugs (1234)lor he lin {(WP:1,194)}(deng sang mong gol rgyal khab kyi rgyal sa a )lan pa tho'i lho nub er hun gtsang po'i stod rgyud an har he lin )la rgyal sa byas/de rjes hu pi li se chen shan gyis rgyal po byas nas kri yon khri lo brgyad pa lcags lug (1271)lor rgyal sa pe cin du spos pa nas/he len shon wu'i si tu'u yon hro'i h+phu {(WP:1,194)}zhes ming bsgyur byas shing/de rjes yang he nying klu'u cung kon h+phu {(WP:1,194)}dang lin se sogs su ming bsgyur byas te de nas rgyal sa byang ngos zhes ming thogs/yon rgyal rabs 'thor rjes gong ma tho ken thu'u mur sa gnas der bros nas ching rgyal rabs ma btsugs bar du rgyal rgyud lhag 'phro rnams kyi srid dbang bzung yul yin}
byang ngos gyi mkhan po sher yes|{sa skya paN chen hor rgyal po go dan gyis gdan drangs skabs su bzhengs pa'i byang ngos dgon pa'i mkhan po shes rab ye shes zer ba sa skya'i dge bshes mkhas pa rgya yig dang bod yig gnyis kar mkhas pa zhig }
byang ngos pa rig 'dzin rdo rje|{byang ngos pa rig 'dzin rdo rje ni rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags byi (1900)lo stod lung gi sger rin sgang pa'i khyim du 'khrungs/rjes su sger byang ngos pa'i bag par phebs gshis sger byang ngos pa'i thog ming sgyur byas shing/chu glang (1913)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pas bod du tshan rig rig gnas gong 'phel yong phyir sku ga gi bu phrug khag gcig dbyin ji'i lon kron du slob sbyong la gtong gnas mdzad pa'i gras yin/khong gis 'bad brtson chen pos slob sbyong gnang ste glog las kyi lag rtsal sbyang brtson gtso bor mdzad de slob thon lag khyer yang thob nas chu phag (406) (1923)lor bod du phyir log gnang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pas dgyes mnyes chen po mdzad shing byi (1924)lor bod kyi glog khang dang po ste lha sa'i byang ngos dog bde glog khang gsar rgyag gi jus 'god dang thig len 'phrul 'khor sgrig bshom sogs khong ngo mas bkod jus gnas nas sa 'brug (1928)lor chu shugs glog khang dngos su legs bsgrubs zin te skyon med ngang glog 'don thub pa byung ba dang khong gis bon rigs glog las mkhan yang gso skyong gnang ba bcas bod du glog las thog mdzad rjes bzhag gnang yod khong gi 'bad brtson chen pos glog 'phrul gyi phyag la rgyun mthun gnang mur de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi lha sa gnyer tshang ba'i 'gan 'khur thog dmigs bsal rim pa bzhi pa'i go ming yang byung ba red}
byang ngos pa'i rgyal po|{yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hu pi li se chen han gyis rgyas pa pe cin du ma spos gong gi rgyal sa ni bod skad du shang to mkhar (rgya skad du hrang tu'u )zer ba de yin cing/sa gnas der srid dbang bzung ba'i rgyal po la byang ngos pa'i rgyal po dang rgyal po byang ngos pa zer ro/_}
byang chub|{('di sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi ming tshig )skyon thams cad byang nas dag pa dang yon tan thams cad khong du chud pa'i don yin cing/'di rgyun ldan skad cha'i nang du bed spyod byas pa'i byang chub pa zer ba dang go don gtan nas mi 'dra}
byang chub kyi mchog tu thugs bskyed|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi theg pa chen po'i lam gyi bshad srol la rang nyid gcig pu'i don du zhi bde don gnyer gyi bsam pa spangs nas nam mkha' khyab pa'i 'gro ba sems can thams cad kyi don du sangs rgyas thob par 'dod pa'i bsam pa thog mar skyes pa'i zhe sa'i tshig ste/dper na/(drin lan bsabs pa'i mdo )las byang chub sems dpa' dga' ba'i rgyal po zhes bya bas bcom ldan 'das la thog mar sems gang du bskyed zhus pa la/sngon so so skye bo 'ching ba thams cad dang ldan pa'i dus su las kyi dbang gis dmyal bar lhungs te/me'i shing rta'i dmyal bar dmyal srung a wang sdod pa'i me'i shing rta 'dren mkhan gyi gyad du 'khrungs pa'i tshe nyid kyi zla bo de stobs chung bas shing rta 'dren mi nus pas na/a wang gis lcags kyi mdung rtse gsum pa brang la bsnun nas khrag gi chab bab cing sdug bsngal gyis mi bzod par smre sngags 'don pa na/de la bzod glags med pa'i snying rje rab tu rgyas pa'i rkyen gyis byang chub tu thugs bskyed de a wang la 'di la snying rje'i sems cung zad skyed par gsol bas/de khros te lcags kyi mdung rtse gsum pa gnya' bar btsugs pas bskal pa brgyal bsags pa'i sdig pa dag cing/dmyal ba'i gnas las tshe 'phos te sum cu rtsa gsum gyi lhar skyes par gsungs so/_/'di bcom ldan 'das kyis byams pa'i thugs bskyed pa'i thog ma yin pa dang/de nas bzung mngon par rdzogs pa sangs rgyas pa'i bar du sems can thams cad la byams pa dang snying rje'i sems rgyun ma chad par bskyed par sngon gyi mkhas pa rnams kyis bzhed do/_/'on kyang gdul bya'i dus skabs kyi bsam pa'i ya par dang/stod pas sngon de bzhin gshegs pa bgrang las 'das pa'i spyan sngar thugs bskyed pa'i khyad par sogs dgongs gzhi mang pos tha dad pa mang du gsungs pas thugs bskyed kyi thog ma 'di kho na'o/_/zhes kha tshon gcod par snying po med par gsungs so/_}
byang chub kyi snying por gshegs|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/sangs rgyas shAkya mu nes lo drug ring dka' ba spyad pa'i rjes su rdo rje gdan gyi byang chub kyi shing gi 'og tu ting nge 'dzin la bzhugs te bdud bzhi (407) btul nas sangs rgyas kyi go 'phang brnyes pa yin zer 'di skor zhib cha bris kyang chos lugs kyi rmang gzhi'i shes yon med pa'i mi rnams kyis go brda lon dka' bar bsam nas ma bris so/_}
byang chub kyi sems|{gzhan don don gnyer gyi bsam pa dang byang chub don gnyer gyi bsam pa gnyis zung du 'brel ba'i sems shig ste/nam mkha'i mtha' khyab sems can thams cad kyi don rang nyid gcig pus byang bar 'dod pa'i bsam pa ni gzhan don don gnyer gyi bsam pa yin la/sems can thams cad sdug bsngal las bskyabs pa'i ched du rang nyid sangs rgyas kyi go 'phang thob par 'dod pa'i bsam pa de la byang chub kyi sems zer/sems de ni rgyu 'bras man ngag bdun dang bdag gzhan mnyam brje'i sgo nas blo sbyong ba'i man ngag gnyis la brten nas rgyud la skyes dgos pa yin cing/sems de med na chos zab mo gang 'dra zhig byas yang sheg pa chen po'i chos su mi 'gro ba yin/byang chub sems de la dbye sgo mang du yod kyang/ngo bo'i sgo nas dbye na byang chub tu smon pa sems bskyed dang/byang chub tu 'jug pa'i sems bskyed gnyis so/_/dang po ni spyod pa nyams len gyi bya ba dngos su zin pa la ltos mi dgos pa'i sems bskyed dang/gnyis pa ni spyod pa nyams len gyi bya bas dngos su zin pa la ltos dgos pa'i sems bskyed yin/dbye ba de gnyis dpe'i sgo nas bstan na/dper na/nyi ma lha sa lta bu zhig la 'gro ba la dang po nga lha sar gcig 'gro'o snyam pa ltar du/dang po ngas sems can thams cad rdzogs pa'i sangs rgyas kyi go 'phang thob pa zhig bya snyam pa 'gro bar 'dod pa lta bu smon pa'i sems bskyed dang/lha sar 'gro ba dngos kyi 'gro chad dang khal rta sogs sta gon byas nas dngos su lam du zhugs te 'gro ba ltar/sems can thams cad rdzogs pa'i sangs rgyas kyi go 'phang thob par bya ba'i ched du sbyin pa gtong ba dang/tshul khrims srung ba/bzod pa bsgom pa/brtson 'grus brtsam pa/bsam gtan la mnyam par 'jog pa /shes rab la blo sbyang snyam nas lam pha rol tu phyin pa drug la dngos su slob pa ni/'gro ba dngos lta bu 'jug pa sems bskyed yin no/_}
byang chub dge mdzes|{sne'u zur pa'i slob ma byang chub dge mdzes ni rang byung dang po'i shing byi (1084)lor mnga' ris su sku 'khrungs/gzhon nu la rab tu byung zhing bsnyen par rdzogs/'dul ba bslabs/gnyags lo tsA ba'i paN+Di ta su ga ta shrI gdan drangs pa'i phyag phyir yar lung du byon/lo paN la sher phyin bag tsam mnyan/btsan la byams chos shes par bslabs/tsha rong pa la 'dul ba bslabs/phu chung ba/glang ri thang pa/karma pa/kham pa lung pa rnams la zhal mjal/chos skyong mgon po zhal gzigs/nga'i so sor thar pa nas rig 'dzin gyi bar la 'gal 'khrul yod na khyed kyis snying khrag phyung zhig byas pas/mgon po'i zhal nas/dge slong gi dam bca' 'jigs gsungs/sne'u zur pa la shin tu dad nas lam rim gsan/dge bshes sgre pa sne'u zur pa la rtogs pa 'bul du byon pa'i phyir g.yer byon nas khong gi bla mchod mdzad/sne'u zur pa gshegs rjes bya yul ba la chos tshan zhig zhus/byes tshan dgon par thugs dam mdzad/mthar dgung lo brgyad cu rtsa bzhi bar rab byung gsum pa'i me phag (1167)lor 'pho ba mdzad nas gshegs}
byang chub rgyal mtshan|{(ta'i si tu byang chub rgyal mtshan )phag mo grub pa'i sde srid mi rabs dang po (rab byung lnga pa'i chu stag (1302)lo nas rab byung drug pa'i shing 'brug (1364)lo bar dgung grangs drug cu re gnyis bzhugs/'di yang (lho rong chos 'byung )ltar byas na/'bri gung (408) pa'i dpon rin chen skyabs la lcam gnyis yod pa'i chung ba khra smon 'bum skyid kyi bu gsum yod pa'i che ba yin lo bdun nas tshes bzhi nyang ma grags pa rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa blangs te ming la byang chub rgyal mtshan du btags lo dgu pa la mkhan chen tshul dar ba dang slob dpon pu hrengs pa'i sar rab tu byung rang lo bcu bzhi pa las skyar bdag chen bzang po dpal gyi zhabs phyir bsdad rang lo nyi shu pa rab byung lnga pa'i lcags bya (1321)lor sa skya'i ti shrI kun dga' blo gros kyis phag gru'i khri dpon du bskos shing yod rgyal rabs gyi gong ma shud d+hi pha la dbyi tsung ka ken han gyis dam kha stag mgo ma nor bu gsum pa dang ta'i si tu'i go gnas sprad sne gdong rdzong khang gi mkhar las dang mdun gyi sham chu la zab ba 'dzugs pa dang rang nyid chang dang phyi dro'i kha zas spong ba sogs rab byung gi sdom pa bsrungs ring por ma lon par g.ya' bzang pas kha mchu bslangs te g.ya' bzang pa dang dmag 'thab thengs kha shes byas kyang thog mar pham de nas 'bri gung pa dang g.ya' bzang pa tshal pa bcas lkog tu kha mthun nas g.ya' phag gnyis kyi kha mchu sa skya'i dpon chen gyi mdun du gtugs bsher byas skabs slar yang si ti pham 'on kyang si tus khri dpon gyi go gnas dang tham ka rtsis ma sprad pa'i dbang gis dpon chen rgyal ba bzang pos dbus gtsang khri skor bcu gsum gyi dmag yar lung du drangs nas rjes su si tu bar chings sgrigs byed gyur kha g.yar te si tu 'dzin bzung thog btson 'jug dang srog la thug pa'i nyes rdung thengs kha shas btang yang khri dpon gyi go gnas dang tham ka rtsis ma sprad par re zhig btsun 'jug byas rjes su sa skya'i dpon chen rgyal ba bzang po dang dpon chen dbang brtson bar 'gal ba cher song zhing sa skya'i gdung rgyud ngom mang che ba dpon chen dbang brtson gyi phyogs su langs te dpon chen dbang brtson la yon rgyal rabs kyi gong mas dpon chen gyi 'ja' sa byung bar brten dpon chen rgyal ba bzang pos si tu btson khang nas shor ba'i khul byas te glod dkrol btang de rjes dpon chen dbang brtson dang sa skya'i ti shrI kun dga' rgyal mtshan sku mched gnyis kyis rab byung drug pa'i chu sprel (1332)lor lha rtse rdzong du btson 'jug byas thog khri skor bcu gsum gyi dmag yar lung du drangs nas yun ring dmag 'thab byas glags ma rnyed par si tur rgyal kha thob ste rab byung drug pa'i sa glang (1349)lor bod sa gnas yongs la dbang bsgyur byas de rjes dmag chen khrid de sa skya'i mtha' bskor ba dang sbrags dpon chen rgyal ba bzang po btson nas bton zhing dmag 'khrug slong ba'i 'go gtso rnams la khrims gcod byas te sa skya'i da dbang yongs rdzong rtsis blangs nas phag mo grub pas bod yongs la dbang bsgyur ba'i 'go tshugs pa yin de nas rab byung drug pa'i shing 'brug (1364)lor bar lo bcu drug ring srid dbang bzung rab byung drug pa'i me sprel (1357)lor lcags rtse gri gu rdzong dang 'ol kha stag rtse rdzong gong dkar rdzong sne'u rdzong bcas brtsigs shing de'i phyi lo me bya lor gzhis ka brag dkar rdzong brtsigs gzhan yang gzhis ka bsam 'grub rtse'i rdzong dang rin spungs rdzong pa snam lhun grub rtse sogs rdzong chen bcu gsum brtsegs nas rdzong so sor rdzong dpon bsko gzhag dang lo gsum re nas rdzong dpon gsar pa gtong rgyu srid dbang 'dzin mkhas so sos lo res mos su sa gnas so sor ngo bskyod rtog zhi btu 'gro dgos pa bcas lam lugs btsugs rang lo nga dgu pa rab byung drug pa'i lcags glang (1361)lor rang nyid kyi lo rgyus (bka' chems deb ther )brtsams de yi phyi lor bu ston rin po che'i dngos slob thugs sras lo tsA ba rin chen rnam rgyal sogs dge bshes mkhas pa mang po zhus dag tu gdan drangs te rtsed thang dgon par gser (409) bris kyi bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur cha tshang bzhengs rang lo drug cu re gsum pa rab byung drug pa'i shing 'brug (1364)lor rang nyid srid khri'i las 'gan dgongs pa zhus te tshab tu 'jam dbyangs gu shri shAkya rgyal mtshan bskos nas ring po ma song bar 'das 'di skor gyi lo rgyus zhib pa ni tA si rang nyid kyis brtsams pa'i (bka' chems deb ther )dang gong du gsal ba'i (lho rong chos 'byung )gnyis khungs dag par bsams nas de ltar du bris pa yin zhib cha de gnyis su gsal}
byang chub mchog tu sems bskyed|{gong gi byang chub kyi mchog tu thugs bskyed ces pa dang don gcig }
byang chub mchod rten|{shAkya mu ne sangs rgyas pa'i skabs su rgyal po'i khab tu rgyal po gzugs can snying pos bzhengs pa dbyibs ni khri'i steng du bang rim bzhin yod pa la glo 'bur med pa zhig }
