byang chub phyogs chos|{btsan po khri lde srong btsan gyi dus su bod lo tsA ba ska ba dpal brtsegs sogs kyis mdzad pa'i (chos kyi rnam grangs kyi brjed bya )las gsungs pa'i don bsdus na/byang chub ra gsum yod pa (nyan thos/rang rgyal/bla med kyi byang chub )de dag gi phyogs kyi chos zer ba ni byang chub gsum po de thob kyi rgyud dang thabs lta bu dang de'i grogs su gyur pa'i don yin pa dang/de la nang gses kyis phye na sum cu so bdun yod/dran pa nyer gzhag bzhi/yang dag spong ba bzhi/rdzu 'phrul gyi rkang pa bzhi/dbang po lnga/stobs lnga /byang chub yan lag bdun/'phags lam yan lag brgyad bcas yin pa nang gses so so'i ming dang go don bcas gsal por gsungs pa yod par bstan 'gyur gyi mjug bod kyi mkhas pa snga ma 'ga' zhag gi gsung rtsom gras su bzhugs yod/rgyas par gzigs 'dod na (phar phyin )dang (mngon pa mdzod )gnyis su gsal}
