byang chub shing|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/sangs rgyas bcom ldan 'das thog mar sangs rgyas pa'i mdzad pa ston skabs rgya gar rdo rje gdan gyi nub phyogs su yod pa'i shin tu sku rgyab gtad nas bzhugs pa'i shing de la byang chub kyi shing zhes brjod srol yod}
