byang chub sems dpa' shar lhor sku bltams pa|{'di ni srong btsan sgom po'i bka' chems (ma Ni bka' 'bum (gyi dpe cha mang che bar byang chub sems dpa' shar phyogs sku bltams pa zhes gsal ba de (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )mdzad pa po dpa' bo gtsug lag phreng bas bzo bcos gnang ba'i yin zhes tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa sogs bod kyi mkhas pa mang pos gsung rgyun du yod}
