byang chub sems dpa'i chos ma 'dres pa bco brgyad|{1 nye bar ma bstan pa'i sbyin pa can rnams/2 nye bar ma bstan pa'i tshul khrims can rnams/3 nye bar ma bstan pa'i bzod pa can rnams/4 nye bar ma bstan pa'i brtson 'grus can rnams/5 nye bar ma bstan pa'i bsam gtan can rnams/6 nye bar ma bstan pa'i shes rab can rnams/7 bsdu ba'i dngos pos sems can thams cad sdud pa rnams/8 yongs su bsngo ba'i chos shes pa rnams/9 thabs lam khas pas sems can thams cad kyi spyod pa'i dbang gis theg pa'i mchog gis 'byung ba bstan pa rnams/10 theg chen lam ma nyams pa rnams/11 'khor ba dang mya ngan las 'das pa'i sgo ston pa rnams/12 zung dang sel zhi'i rgyud la mkhas pa rnams/13 ye shes khyi sngon du 'gro bas mngon par 'du ba mi byed cing kha na ma thob med pa'i tshe rabs thams cad du mngon du bzhugs pa rnams/14 lus dang ngag dang yid kyi las kyi mtha' dge ba bcu ldan pa rnams/15 sdug bsngal gyi phung po thams cad bzod pa'i lus len pas sems can gyi khams thams cad yongs su mi gtong ba rnams/16 'gro ba thams cad mngon par dga' bar ston pa rnams/17 byis pa dang nyon thos mi bzad pa ji snyed cig gi nang na yang dge ba mang po'i rin po che'i shing dpag bsam ltar brtan pa'i thams cad mkhyen pa nyid sems yongs su ma nyams pa rnams/18 chos thams cad kyi thabs sbyin pa'i dbang bskur ba thob par bya ba'i phyir sangs rgyas kyi chos rtsol ba bstan pa las phyir mi ldog pa rnams}
byang chub sems dpa'i mnyam nyid lnga|{bdag gzhan mnyam nyid dang/phan gnod mnyam nyid/'jig rten chos brgyad mnyam nyid/sangs rgyas sems can mnyam nyid/srid zhi mnyam nyid rnam pa'o/_}
byang chub sems dpa'i stobs bcu|{1 bsam pa'i stobs/2 lhag pa'i bsam pa'i stobs/3 sbyor ba'i stobs/4 shes rab kyi stobs/5 smon lam gyi stobs/6 theg pa'i stobs/7 spyod pa'i stobs/8 rnam par 'phrul ba'i stobs/9 byang chub kyi stobs/10 chos kyi 'khor lo rab tu bskor ba'i stobs}
