byang bdag bkra shis stobs rgyal|{rab byung dgu pa'i lcags byi (1540)lor sku bltams/rje 'di nyid rnying ma'i bla ma zhig yin/rab byung dgu pa'i dus mjug tsam la gsang sngags theg mchog gling grwa tshang gsar du btab/rig 'dzin legs ldan rje dang/dkyil khang pa/dpal sdings rab 'byams pa/bya gshongs pa gzhung brgya smra ba sogs mkhas pa mang po 'dus/sgyu 'phrul gsang ba snying po'i rgyud bshad gtso bor gyur pa'i mdo sngags rig gnas dang bcas pa'i bshad sgrub kyi bstan pa gong du 'phel ba'i skabs sde pa zhig shag tshe brtan rdo rjes byang bdag bkra shis stobs rgyal mchog la 'tshe sdang byas te mthar phud pas dbus su byon dgos byung ste chos sde yang 'jig mthar dgu ngalo so gdug bzhes pa rab byung bcu 'i sa stag (1578)lor sku gshegs}
byang bdag rnam rgyal grags bzang|{rje 'di nyid gtsang ngam ring gi rgyal sde chen por yab chos grags dpal bzang dang yum 'bum skyong rgyal mo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bdun pa'i shing phag (1395)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi lnga nas ye shes 'bri glog sbyangs pas tshegs med du mkhyen/dgung lo bcu'i thog paN chen nags kyi rin chen dang/bo dong phyogs las rnam rgyal/lnga pa dpal 'byor shes rab/seng ge rgyal mtshan/rin chen dpal bzang/rgya gar rdo rje gdan gyi mkhan chen shA ri phu tra sogs mkhan dbang du ma'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags dang khyad par 'chi med 'khrul 'khor dang ga'u gdams pa'i rlung sbyor sogs gso ba rig pa dang dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i skor sogs la sbyang brtson dpyid phyin par mdzad/mkhas pa'i dbus na sman rtsis la byang chub pa'i snyan grags phyogs bzhir khyab/hor ba'i bzhi pa seng ge rgyal mtshan la dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa zhus pas mtshan chos rgyal rnam rgyal grags bzang du gsol/mkhas dbang 'di nyid kyis smin gyi gzhung lugs dang nyams len zung du sbrel rgyur thugs brtson chen po mdzad/sman gyi dri ro nus pa'i skor la phyag len dngos kyi nang brtag zhib gnang dpal ldan rgyud bzhi'i gzhung lugs kyi thog /bod byang phyogs kyi sa babs dang/gnam gshis/mi rnams kyi 'tsho ba'i goms gshis sogs la nyams len mdzad de sman bcos gnang ba'i myong ba phyogs bsdoms dang 'grel sngar bas zhib cha che ba'i rgyud bzhi'i 'grel pa gsar rtsom dang/sman sbyor gsar bzo/sman rdzas kyi ngos 'dzin sogs thun mong ma yin pa'i khyad chos la brten nas byang lugs kyi srol phyes/rje 'di nyid (413) kyis bo dong phyogs las rnam rgyal rang gi rtsa ba'i bla mar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos tshul mtha' yas pa gsan phyis bo dong chen po'i gsung 'bum pod brgya phrag brgal ba dngos su bzhugs sa ni byang bdag chen po'i 'di nyid kyi mdzad rjes dang bral thabs med rab byung bdun pa'i shing stag (1424)lor ngam ring gser zangs kyi byams chen sku tshad shin tu che ba zhig bzhengs pa dang gtsug lag khang gi rmang bting dgung grangs bzhi bcu tham par dngul las grub pa'i dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i blos bslangs dkyil 'khor rang lugs ji lta ba bzhin du thugs gsung sku'i dkyil 'khor dag kyang rgya cher rol pa'i mdo'i nang gsal ba 'i bcom ldan 'das yum gyi lhums su bzhugs pa dang rjes su mthun pa'i bkod pas khyad par 'phags pa gsar du bzhengs te ngam ring gi pho brang la bzhugs su gsol gsung rtsom yang nang ring pa'i skor bstod tshogs dang sgrub dkyil rtogs brjod gzhung 'grel sogs khyod bsdoms len tshan brgya dang gsum bzhugs pa dang de bzhin sgra rig pa bzo rig pa skar rtsis sogs dang khyad par du gso ba rig pa'i skor la (yan lag brgyad pa thams cad kyi snying po bsdus pa yid bzhin nor bu rin po che )bya ba'i bstan bcos le'u brgya dang nyi shu yod pa zhig dang (rtsa ba'i rgyud kyi bshad pa rgyud don gsal byed sgron me/) (bshad rgyud kyi rgya cher 'grel pa bdud rtsi chu rgyun/) (TIka chung don gsal/) (sman gzhung rin chen sgron me/) (bshad rgyud kyi rgya cher 'grel pa bdud rtsi chu rgyun/) (rgyud bzhi'i dka' 'phrang mun sel/) (gso thabs sum brgya drug cu'i ngos 'dzin/) (rtsa bshad gsal ba'i sgron me/) (rtsis kyi bstan bcos byis pa bde 'jug/) (grub rtsis chen mo/) (gsal byed yid bzhin nor bu'i phreng ba/) (gza' 'dzin brtag pa dka' ba'i gnas shin tu rgyas par bshad pa )la sogs bstan bcos mang po gsar rtsom gnang thugs sras mi yi nyi ma mthong ba don dan sogs slob rgyud mang du bskyangs thun mong ma yin pa'i byang lugs kyi khyad chos rnams rim bzhin bod khams yongs la dar 'phel byung ba sogs phyag rjes rlabs chen 'jog gnang mdzad mthar dgung lo brgyad cu gya gcig pa rab byung brgyad pa'i shing lug (1475)lor sku gshegs}
byang bdag rig 'dzin ngag gi dbang po|{byang bdag dbang po'i sde'i rigs sras su rab byung bcu pa'i lcags 'brug (1580)lor sku 'khrungs/chung dus nas rnying ma'i chos sgor zhugs te mdo sngags rig pa'i gnas kun la sbyangs pa mthar phyin mdzad/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu sprel (1632)lor thub bstan rdo rje brag med waM lcog sgar btab/(gdong thog pas gsungs/) de ni snga 'gyur rnying ma byang rgyud lugs kyi gdan sa gtso bo zhig yin/byang bdag rig 'dzin ngag gi dbang po mchog rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa yos (1639)lor sku gshegs}
