byang pa bdag po|{byang pa'i zhal ngo grags pa 'od zer gyi skabs 'gro mgon 'phags pa rgya nag tu phebs skabs chibs zhabs su song nas 'phags pa 'das rjes se chen han gyi mchod gnas byas te ti shri'i go gnas byung bas ti shrI grags pa 'od zer zhes zer/hor dkar grags 'od ma yang 'di dus byung zhing/rgyal po'i lung gis skyar skya nas 'jad yan gyi la stod byang gi yul ljongs la dbang (414) ba'i khri dpon gyi 'ja' sa lon pa nas stobs che rdzong ji grags pa rin chen gyis 'go byas pa'i phag mo grub pa'i dmag lan gcig slebs kyang skyon che ba ma byung bdag po rnam rgyal grags bzang (rgyal po paN+Di ta zhes zer )dang dkon mchog legs pa spun mched gnyis kyi dus lho byang gnyis srid gcig tu bsgril bar brten nas lho pa'i sa cha 'ga' tshul chod ngar ring chos sder dngul las grub pa'i dus 'khor gyi blos bslangs bzhengs gzhan yang gser zangs las grub pa'i rten mang po dang gser chos bka' 'gyur bzhengs ngam ring chos dar mtshan nyid kyi bshad grwa btsugs chos lugs ni sa skya pa nyag gcig la jo nang pa dang bo don pa byang chub gzhon nu rgyal mchog sogs bla mar bsten cing mnga' 'og tu yod pa'i dge lugs pa la'ang mchod bkur byed dpon blon rnams sdod tshugs pas khri skor gyi da la shor god ma byung zhing mnga' thang che bar yod}
byang spyi|{de ni bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs nag chu khul gyi spyi khyab yin zhing/spyi khyab pa rim bzhi skya ser gnyis yod pa dang/gnas yul nag chu grong brdal du yod/rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu rta (1942)lor ra tsho so dgu de snga gnas lnga pa'i rdzong 'go khag drug ta bgos te rdzong sdod ser skya nyis sbrel re bsgo gzhag byas shing/nag chu 'di bzhin de snga gnas lnga pa'i rdzong 'go che gras shig yin rung chu ta lo nag tshang shan rdza rdzong dang gnam ru rdzong sogs byang rigs sde bzhi dang/ru drug dpon 'go /shor tsho pa so dgu'i khongs rdzong khag drug bcas byang rigs khul gyi spyi 'doms byang spyi nag chu mkhan rim gnyis las bya ser skya gnyis bcas bskor gzhag gis las don gal che'i rigs ma btogs de bying zhi drug gi spyi 'doms byang spyi mkhan rim gnyis nas thag gcod dgos pa yin}
