byang sems kun dga' bzang po|{rje 'di ni rgyal tsong kha pa chen po'i dgos slob yin zhing/rab byung drug pa'i me rta (1366)lor zur mkhar du lci rigs su sku 'khrungs/de nas grub chen nam mkha' rgyal mtshan dang/'jam mgon chos rgyal po las mdo sngags yi chos mang du gsan/dgung lo don gsum la phebs pa rab byung bdun pa'i sa rta (1438)lor gtsang po byang kha zur mkhar nang du chos sde mdo sngags gling btab/dbu tshad dang gsang bde gnyis kyi 'chad nyan btsugs/byang sems rin po cher slob ma 'jag dbyangs chos rje bkra shis dpal ldan/tshal pa chos rje bod nams rin chen/chos rje blo gros rnam rgyal/dge slong bsod nams grags pa/dge slong thub pa/dge slong rang sangs rgyas thogs che grwa mang du 'dus/dgung lo don dgu pa la phebs pa rab byung bdun pa'i shing byi (1444)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs}
