byams chen chos rje|{byams chen chos rje shAkya ye shes ni rje tsong kha pa'i dngos slob gong ma'i ti shrir gyur pa'i bla chen gnyis kyi gras yin pa dang/khong ni tshal gung thang du thal pa'i dpon brgyud kyi rigs su rab byung drug pa'i shing rta (1354)lor sku bltams/gzhon nu nyid nas yi ge 'bri klog sogs gsan bsam mdzad/rab tu byung ba'i mtshan shAkya ye shes zhes gsol/bla ma mang po bsten nas gsung rab la sbyang pa mdzad de mkhas par gyur/khyad par rje tsong kha pa bla mar bsten zhing bka' chos gnang ba thams cad thugs la mnga' ba yin/rje'i gsol 'debs pa gnang/rje tsong kha pa las bsnyen par rdzogs/mdo sngags kyi gsung rab kun lam khas pa'i grags pas khyab/rab byung bdun pa'i sa byi (1408)lor ta ming rgyal pos rje tsong kha pa gdan drangs pa phebs ma thub stabs byams chen chos rje sku tshab tu gtong gnang mdzad pa ltar gong ma yung lo {(WP:1,194)}khri lo bcu gnyis pa shing rta (1414)lo'i zla bcu gnyis pa'i zla smad du dbus nas phebs rdog thon te nan cin du phebs nas gong ma'i dgongs pa ltar rgyud sde'i sgrub mchod 'dzugs pa dang dgon sde 'debs pa sogs zhwa ser gyi bstan pa rgya cher spel bar mdzad de khong ma yung los chos rje 'di nyid la thams cad mkhyen pa/blo gros chen po/kun gyi skyob pa/byams pa chen po/yangs pa'i rgyal khams thams cad bde bar sbyor ba/kun gyi gtsug tu dbang bskur ba/nub phyogs kyi rgyal ba'i sras po/skyid pa'i rgyalap+sarid mi 'gyur brtan pa'i bla ma chen po/tA ko'u shri byams chen chos rje zhes pa'i mtshan dang/gser nag las grub pa'i thams ka dang bcas phul te bstan 'dzin mtha' dag gi gtsug rgyan du mnga' gsol/de nas ri bo rtse lngar byon nas bstan 'gro'i don rgya cher mdzad de me sprel (1416)lor bka' 'gyur par phud bsnams nas bod du phyir phebs/sa phag (1419)lor rje tsong kha pa'i bka' ltar se ra theg chen gling phyag btab ste mthun rkyen phal che ba phag gru'i blon po sne'u rdzong pa nam mkha' bzang pos sbyar/de rjes slar yang gong mas spyan drangs pa ltar sa bya ((1429)lor rgya nag (pe cin )thengs gnyis pa phebs te chos sde 'debs pa dang chos skor sogs rgya cher mdzad/zhon te {(WP:1,194)}khri lo dgu pa shing stag (1434)lor skyar du chos rje 'di nyid la cho lo dang zang zing gi dngos po mtha' yas pa phul thog /pe cin nas bod du phebs pa'i mal bar mdzo mo mkhar )lo rgyus re 'gar pe cin du gshegs zer )du dgung lo gya gnyis la phabs pa shing yos (1435)lo'i bod zla bcu pa'i tshes nyer bzhi nyin sku 'das/de nas bzung bzhi mchod ces bod zla bcu pa'i tshes nyer bzhi'i dgong po gling me spar ba'i srol dar}
byams chen rab 'byams pa|{rje 'di nyid rab byung bdun pa'i lcags yos (1411)lor rong gi snar rdo spe zhes par sku bltams/dgung lo bdun pa la chos 'khor sgang du seng ge rgyal mtshan las rab tu byung/dgung lo bcu gsum pa gsang phu ne'u la phebs te shangs ston rin chen grub pa la gsan pa mdzad/dgung grangs bcu bzhi pa la mngon dga'i chos grwa dka' ba'i grwa skor gnang bas skyog po dka' bzhi par grags/dgung lo bco brgyad par (417) rtsed thang du dka' bcu'i grwa skor gnang zhing gsang phu'i chos lung du bzhugs sa mdzad pas chos lung dkar bcu par grags dgung lo nyi shu rtsa brgyad pa lag zhung lugs rab 'byams rgya mtshor sa skya dgon du bshad pa'i dga' ston spel bas byams chen rab 'byams pa zhes grags de nas sems pa chen po gzhon nu rgyal mchog rong chung sher dpal sogs las mdo phyogs kyi gsan pa rgya cher mdzad e waM chos ldan du rdo rje 'chang gis mkhan po rje 'khor lo sdom pas las gsang mkhas mchog gzhon seng gis dus go bar mdzad de bsnyen par rdzogs dgung grangs so dgu pa sa sbrul (1449)lor ring spungs nor bu bzang pos mthun pa'i rkyen sbyar te 'bras yul skyed tshal phyag btab nas 'chad rtsod rtsom gsum gyis rgyal ba'i bstan pa nyin mo ltar gsal bar mdzad bstan 'dzin gyi thugs sras mkhas grub bstan gsal rtsed thang sangs lhun go bar 'byams pa 'bum phrag gsum pa 'jam pa'i dbyangs kun dga' chos bzang sogs mang du byon mthar dgung grangs don lnga la phebs pa rab byung brgyad pa'i shing sbrul (1485)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
byams chos|{(byams chos sde lnga )rgyal ba byams pa mgon pos 'phags pa thogs med la gsungs pa'i chos te/1 rje btsun byams pa mgon pos mdzad pa'i (bstan bcos mngon rtogs rgyan )skabs brgyad yod pa/dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i dkyil du bod kyi lo tsA ba blo ldan shes rab kyis rgya gar skad nas bod skad du bsgyur ba/bstan 'gyur snar thang dpar ma'i mdo phyogs le tshan (ka)par yod/2 rje btsun byams pa mgon pos mdzad pa'i (dbus mtha' rnam 'byed )dus rabs brgyad pa'i mjug tu bod kyi lo tsA ba zhang ye shes sdes rgya gar skad nas bod skad du bsgyur ba/4 rje btsun byams pa mgon pos mdzad 'i (chos nyid rnam 'byed )dus rabs bcu gcig pha'i 'khor nag tsho lo tsA ba tshul khrims rgyal bas bsgyur ba zhig dang/yang lo tsA zha ma seng rgyal gyis bsgyur ba bcas mi 'dra ba gnyis/5 rje btsun byams pa mgon pos mdzad pa'i (rgyud bla ma )dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i dkyil du bod kyi tsA ba ldan shes rab k+khayis rgya gar skad da nas bod skad du bsgyur bcas gong gsal bstan bcos phyi ma bzhi po bstan 'gyur snar thang dpar ma'i mdo phyogs kyi le tshan (phi)par yod cing/bstan bcos ga lnga po de'i 'grel la rgya gar mkhas pas brtsams pa rigs mi 'dra ba sum cu lhag tsam bstan 'gyur gyi nang du bzhugs}
byams chos sde lnga|{gong du byams chos zhes par gzigs}
byams dang snying rje|{'di sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol ltar na/rang gi bu la byams pa rtar sems can thams cad bde ba dang ldan 'dod kyi bsam pa ni byams pa dang/rang gi bu la sdug bsngal byung na mi bzod pa bzhin sems can gzhan gyi sdug bsngal la sems mi bzod pa ni snying rje yin cing/byams pa la goms par gyur na theng pa chen po'i chos rtsa ba snying rje ma lus pa rang rgyud du skye bar 'gyur/de yang rdzogs pa'i sangs rgyas byang chub sems las byung/_/byang chub sems pa snying rje las byung/de byams pa las byung bas/byams pa sgom pa shin tu gnad che zer}
byams pa chos 'khor|{1 byams pa mgon po chos 'khor gyi phyag rgya mdzad pa/2 bal bza' khri btsun srong btsan (418) sgam po'i btsun mor gdan drangs skabs yab rgyal pos rten skal du gnang ba'i rgyal ba byams pa'i sku brnyas li ma lha sa gtsug lag khang gi gtsang khang g.yon ngos su bzhugs}
byams pa mched bzhi|{lo rgyus thog bshad srol la rgyal po glang dar ma'i skabs lha sar bzhugs pa'i paN+Di ti tshul khrims nor gyis gtsug lag khang gi shar ngos sgo 'gram gyi lha khang du bzhugs pa'i dzam b+ha la'i mdun du bsnyen sgrub gnang bas dngos grub kyi rtags gang yang ma byung skabs paN+Di ta khros nas dzam b+ha la'i sku'i lto bar mkhar gsil bsnun pas sku'i lto pags pa'i nang nas rgya dngul yi gter mang po thon pa des rgyu byas nas spyan ras gzigs kha sar pA Ni dang/gser bris kyi nyi khri/dngul gyi bya ma bum la/sogs pa bzhengs shing/de'i nye gnas kha che ut+pa las dngul las byas pa'i rje btsun byams mgon gyi sku bzhi bzhengs pa la byams pa mched bzhi zer zhes kyang bshad srol 'dug }
byams pa mchod pa'i lha mo|{lha sa gtsug lag khang gi 'og khang jo ngo rin po che bzhugs sa'i lha khang gi g.yon ngos kyi lha khang nang gi rten gyi gtso bor bal bza' khri btsun srong btsan sgam po'i btsun por phebs skabs bod du gdan drangs pa'i byams pa chos 'khor dang g.yas g.yon du mchod pa'i lha mo brgyad kyis bskor ba yin yod/zhib par (lha sa gtsug lag khang gi dkar chag )nang gsal bas der gzigs}
byams pa nyi shu|{dran pa dang ldan par 'gyur ba dang/blo gros dang ldan par 'gyur ba dang/blo dang ldan par 'gyur ba dang/brtan pa dang ldan par 'gyur ba dang/shes rab dang ldan par 'gyur ba dang/'jig rten las 'das pa'i shes rab rjes su rtogs par 'gyur ba dang/'dod chags chung bar 'gyur ba dang/zhe sdang chung bar 'gyur ba dang/gti mug chung bar 'gyur ba dang/bdud kyis de la glags mi rnyed par 'gyur ba dang/sangs rgyas bcos ldan 'das rnams kyi dgongs par 'gyur ba dang/mi ma yin pa rnams de la bsrung bar 'gyur ba dang/lha rnams de la gzi byin bskyed par 'gyur ba dang/mi mdza' ba rnams kyis de la glags rnyed par mi 'gyur ba dang/de'i mdza' bshes rnams mi phyed par 'gyur ba dang/tshig btsun par 'gyur ba dang/des mi 'jigs pa thob par 'gyur ba dang/yid bde ba mang bar 'gyur ba dang/mkhas pas bsngags par 'gyur ba dang/de'i chos kyi sbyin pa de yang rjes su dran par bya bar 'os par 'gyur ba'o/_}
byams pa dang 'brel chos nyi shu|{de yang sangs rgyas 'das nas lo dgu brgya lhag stong du nye ba na slob dpon thogs med kyis mgon po byams pa bsgrubs te bka' tha ma don rnam par nges (mdo sde sa bcu pa la sogs mi yul du gdan drangs )pa gtan la dbab par mdzad de/de yin mdo sde rgyan dang mngon rtogs rgyan gnyis/dbus dang mtha' rnam 'byed dang/chos dang chos nyid rnam 'byed gnyis/theg pa chen po'i rgyud bla ma ste/byams chos sde lnga gnas nas mi yul du byon te ye ger bkod/thogs med rang gi gzhi bsdu ba/rnam par bshad pa'i sgo bsdu ba/rtsa ba lta bu'i sa'i dngos gzhi bsdu ba ste/rgyas pa'i bstan bcas sa sde lnga/theg pa thun mong gi chos/mngon pa ('di mngon pa gong mar grags )kun las btus dang/theg pa chen po'i sdom theg bsdus te/bsdus pa'i bstan bcos sdom rnam pa gnyis mdzad de/theg pa chen po rgya chen spyod pa'i srol phyes so/_/de'i gcung slob dpon dbyig gnyen gyis kha che'i slob dpon 'dus bzang bsten te ye shes 'jug la sogs mngon pa sde bdun gnas skabs su gcen thogs med la/byams chos sde lnga/sa sde (419) lnga sdom rnam gnyis sogs gnas nas dbyig gnyen gyis sems tsam pra ka (pra ka ra ni bod skad du rab tu byed pa'o )sde brgyad mdzad de nyi shu pa'i bar tu byed pa dang sum cu pa'i rab tu byed pa phung po lnga rab tu byed pa dang rnam bshad rig pa las grub pa'i rab tu byed pa ste rang rgyud du brtsams pa lnga dang rten 'brel mdo'i 'grel pa mdo de rgyan gyi 'grel pa dbus mtha'i 'grel pa ste gnas 'grel du brtsams pa gsum ste rab tu byed pa'i rgyud sngar gyi bcu gnyis dang bsdoms pas byams pa dang 'brel ba 'i chos nyi shu'o de nas slob dpon dbyig gnyis gyis mngon par mdzad brtsams te mngon par 'og mar grags pa'o/_/slar yang de dag gsal bar bya ba'i phyir mngon pa mdzod rang 'grel ('di pa tshab lo tsA ba nyi ma grags kyis bod skad du sgyur )dang bcas pa brtsams pa'o/_}
byams pa gdan 'dren|{rgyal ba shAkya thub pa'i bstan pa rdzogs rjes tshe lo bco pa 'char rgyu ldog nas rje btsun byams pa mgon po'i bstan pa myur du 'char ba'i stabs dang rten 'brel ched de snga bod zla dang po'i tshes nyer lnga nyin kyi snga dro nang langs snga char lha ldan gtsug lag khang gi mchod khang lho ma'i rten gtso byams mgon sku brnyes shing rta 'khor lo chen po'i nang sngon du gdugs dang/g.yas g.yon du rgya mtshan dang phye phur sogs kyi brgyan te gdan 'dren zhus/'khyams ri'i sgo 'phyor mdun du dge slong brgyad gras khrus gsol dang/de nas rme ru dang bzhi sde'i dge 'dun nas mchod rdzas sna tshogs thogs pa'i ser phreng gi 'dun nas mchod rdzas sna tshogs thogs pa'i ser phreng gi sngun bsus te bar bskor du gdan 'dren pa ste/byed sgo de'i thog ma'i srol gtod mdzad mkhas 'jam mgon bla ma tsong kha pa chen po yin cing/byams mgon gsung chos ra bar phebs mtshams rme rnying nas 'khyams ra'i lho sgo brgyud gnang chung chos skyong phebs te snyan dar 'bul gnang mdzad pa dang chabs cig bla phyag las khungs nas zhal ja sgron dar phul/gzhan yang lha sa'i mi dmigs ser skya mang pos 'tshang kha shig shig gis snyan shar 'bul gyi yod/byams mgon sa sbog sgang du phebs mtshams klu sbug dang/zhol/ba ma ri bcas nas gnam lcags me sgyogs gsum rim len gyis brgyab ste gsum 'i mtshams dan bag mdun nas rgyugs rim spyi khyab rim bzhi dang/las bya chibs che/rgyugs ma zhal ngo bcas nas gzhung sger gyi rgyugs rta rnams dus gcig tu glod/de bstun 'bras spungs mdun yan sna'i ri zur nas mi rgyugs glod/ba ma ri zur nas bar rgyugs zhes mi rta rang 'grigs rnams bskyod/rta rgyugs/mi rgyugs/bar rgyugs rnams rtse pho brang gi mdun lam chen brgyud gsung chos ra ba'i mdun nas 'gro zhing/de skabs tA la'i bla ma mchog rgyugs gzigs su gzhung zhabs yongs rdzogs dang bcas gsungs chos ra ba'i zur 'phyong gzim chung du zhabs sor 'khod/bar rgyugs rnams gzigs lam du 'byor mtshams rta thog nas gus btud kyi rta rtsal rnam 'gyur sna tshogs ston cing/de skabs jo bo rags rgyab zur nas rta pa 'byor snga rting gi shing byang ang rim sprod mi sku tshab dza tha'i gcig /las bya/chibs che/bka' shag sku tshab bcas phebs te ang rim gnang/mi rgyugs rnams bla brang rnying pa'i mdun nas ang rim sprad de sku tsam rnams nas rta tho dang mi rgyugs kyi thog zhung snyan zhur phul/snyan zhu lam 'phral thon rgyu de mtshams bka' shag sku tshab bka' drung dang/gnang cha legs dar sprod mi bla phyag ngo ma las bcas nas gzigs lam bsam po'i mdun bskal bzang dar chen 'khris shing stegs mthon po'i steng nas zhal pho brang du phyogs te bka' drung nas thog mar rta tho dang de mjug mi rgyug gi tho klog /bya phyag nas lnga las gzengs dar dang gos sna'i tshan grangs/ja 'khor drug sogs song gsal sprad de dar chen la g.yas bskor gyis khungs so sor log /rgyugs ring spyi khyab nas rtse gzim (420) 'gag tu zhu sgo rnams 'thus tshang byung lugs snyan seng zhus 'phral phyag srung stsal te thugs rje che zhu'i sku phyag phul de'i skabs rtag pa rnams phyir log ma 'byor ba'i dbar zur 'phyong gzim chung spyan lam 'og tu gzing sbyor pa krang dmag g.yas ru dang g.yon ru gnyis kyi mi stobs shugs can gcer hrang gnyis re nas shugs rtsal ab thang tshad pa dang gyon pa yod pa 'ga' shas nas mon do gnyis lhag tsam (rgya ma 160bal )gyi ljid tshad yod pa'i rdo ril 'khyir 'gyogs kyis bskal bzang dar ches la bap+sakor ba lag gcig tsam brgyab yong de dag la bla phyag las khungs nas rgyugs ma ang ki dang por kha btags a she gcig dang gos chen kha phyed gsum yod pa'i tshos tshogs dgu tshan ja 'khor drug gcig rta lags pa gcig ang gnyis par kha btags zub she dang gos tshos tshogs bdun tshan ja 'khor gsum gcig rta 'bring gcig ang gsum par gos tshos tshogs lnga tshan dang ja 'khor gnyis gcig rta dkyus gcig rang bzhi pa nas bco lnga bar gos tshogs tshogs gsum tshad re dang ja sbag re ang bcu drug nas nyer lnga bar tshang grangs gsum re ang nyer drug nas kha btags zub she ra bcas dang de bzhin mi rgyugs par gnang cha gong mtshungs bar rgyugs ang dang por lnga tshan dang ja 'khor drug gcig ang gnyis par gsum tshad dang ja 'khor gsum ang gsum par nyis tshan dang ja sbag gnyis de byings la kha btags re de nas gzigs yong g.yas ru dang g.yon ru gnyis kyi ber ga dang stobs shugs 'gran sdur rdo mgyogs bcas par sge dar re rgyal kha thob mkhan la dngul srung gsum re bcas gsol ras sprod srol yod snga dro'i mdzad sgo de dag grub rjes 'bras spungs tshogs chen zhal ngo ngo las lha ldan bla brang steng gzing chung 'gag tu thon phyag zhus te 'bral mar 'bras spungs su phyir log byed cing smon lam las bya ba rnams kyis las mjug tshang ma de nyin rang la gtsang mar zin pa byas te sang nyid byed 'bro gtan nas ma lus pa byed dgos pa bcas de nyin nas smon lam chen mo legs par grol zin pa yin}
byams pa byon pa'i dus|{bu ston chen po che dang 'gos lo gzhon nu dpal gyis gsungs pa ltar na sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa mya ngan las 'das nas sangs rgyas byams pa ma byon gyi bar du mi lo bye pha phrag lnga bcur nga bdun dang sa ya phrag drug yod pas deng sang gi rtsi stangs ltar byas na mi lo dung phyung lnga dang phye ba bdun dang sa ya drug yod}
