byar po paN chen|{rab byung brgyad pa'i nang (1447)lor nas (1506)lho phyogs byar yul du sku 'khrungs/dgung lo chung ngu'i dus nas rig gnas spyi dang par du zur lugs kyi bzhed pa gzhir bzung ba'i gso ba rig pa la mas pas gyur pas karma pa chos grags rgya mtshos byar po paN chen zhes mtshan gsol zhing gzings su bstod/sku tshe hril por gso ba rig pa 'chad rtsod rtsom gsum kho na mdzad de lho rgyud du gso ba rig pa'i bstan pa spel/gsung rtsom yang rig gnas spyi'i skor sna tshogs dang khyad par gso ba rig pa'i skor la (dpal ldan rgyud bzhi'i 'grel pa/) (sman gyi khog 'bub legs bshad gser gyi snye ma/) (bye ba ring bsrel gyi dkar chag )sogs mdzad/ (421) rgyud 'dzin gyi slob ma 'phyongs rgyas 'tsho byed kun rdor sogs mang du bskyangs mdzad rnam zhib pa ma rnyed}
byar med|{phyag 'tshal ba dang/mchod pa 'bul ba/sbyin pa gtong ba sogs kyi dge ba'i bya ba gang yang byed mi dgos pa}
