byi glang sde gzar|{rab byung bcu pa'i chu byi (1612)lo dang chu glang (1613)lo gtsang pa rgyal po phun tshogs rnam rgyal gyis dmag dpung btang ste 'phan po dang/gzhis ka sne'u sogs blangs nas bod yongs la dbang sgyur rjes tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bzhi pa'i yang srid ngos 'dzin mi chog pa bzos pa dang de'i lan du dge lugs pa'i sbyin bdag skyid shad sde pa bsod nams rnam rgyal gyis khal kha cho khur dpon po spun mched gnyis la rtse po ta la'i rten gtso 'phags pa lo ke sha ra'i sku bskur nas dge legs par rgyab skyor gyis gtsang par dmag rgyag dgos pa'i re skul ltar me sbrul (1617)lor khal kha cho khur dpon po'i dmag dpung mi grangs sum stong lhag tsam dbus su thon nas dbus dmag dang mnyam du gtsang pa rgyal po phar rgol byas/de'i phyi lo gtsang pa rgyal po phun tshogs rnam rgyal gyi dmag dpung chig khri tsam lha sar btang nas rgol lan bslogs te se 'bras gnyis dmag gis gtor zhing/rgyab ri'i ngos mi grags lnga stong tsam bsad/se 'bras gnyis yi grwa pa tshang ma mtsho sngon du bros 'gro rtsis kyis stag lung (lhun grub rdzong khongs )du 'byor sbas stag lung zhabs drug ngag dbang rnam rgyal gyis se 'bras grwa pa stong tsho kha shas la zla ba bzhi tsam 'tsho ba sbyar thog gtsang pa rgyal por se 'bras kyi grwa pa rang gnas su bsdad chos pa'i rgyu mtshan gsungs pa gtsang pa rgyal pos khas blangs/se 'bras kyi grwa pa rnams rang gnas su log skabs khang pa'i sgo dang sge khung sogs kyang med par gyur/dbus sog dmag phab thog se 'bras nas gtsang pa rgyal por chings dngul 'bor chen sprod dgos stabs/dga' ldan pho brang pa'i phyag mdzod bsod nams chos 'phel (bsod nams rab brtan dang rgya le chos mdzad kyang zer )gyis chos 'khor rgyal du 'gro khul gyis mtsho sngon gyi gu ru hon tha'i ji dang blo bzang bstan 'dzin spun mched gnyis la dmag rogs zhus/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags lug (1631)lor gtsang pa rgyal po phun tshogs rnam rgyal grongs shing/chu sprel (1632)lor karma bstan skyong dbang pos gtsang pa rgyal po'i srid dbang bzung/chu bya (1633)lor phyag mdzod bsod nams chos 'phel dan