brag dkar blo bzang dpal ldan|{rje 'di ni dkar mdzes 'khrigs lung ri khrod du yab bsam gtan tshe ring dang yum tshe ring ma'i sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa me stag (1866)lo'i bla ba dang po'i tshes gcig nyin 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi la brag dkar byang chub rgyal (428) mtshan gyi yang srid du ngos bzung mtshan blo bzang dpal ldan bstan 'dzin snyan grags zhes gsol dgung lo lnga la dge rgan rdo rje 'bum lam ye shes 'bri klog gsan dgung lo dgu nas yongs 'dzin blo ldan chos 'phel gyi drung nas dag yig dang sum rtags snyan ngag mdo sngags kyi gzhung ches skor gyi bshad khrid sogs sbyangs drung sar bla ma blo bzang dpal ldan bstan 'dzin tshul khrims las rab tu byung rgyal rong bla ma dkon mchog bzang po dang khang gsar blo bzang mthun stobs rgya mtsho gnyis las dbyangs can sgra mdo dang snying thig gi rtsa rlung 'phrul 'khor lag khrid 'jigs byed lha bcu gsum gyi dbang sogs gsan dgung lo bcu bdun thog dbus lha ldan du phebs te 'bras spungs blo gsal gling tre bo kha tshan du zhugs gzhung bka' pod lnga la gnas bsam rgya cher gnang thog rigs lam rtsod grwa'i nang du grwa skor mdzad skabs mang thos dge bshes rnams kyis bsngags brjod gnang zhing mkhas pa'i snyan grags brtas de nas mu mthun rig pa'i gnas sgo kun la sbyong ba'i thugs ban ches cher sbyin te grub dbang d+harma seng ge las gso ba rig pa dang gcod kyi dbang khrid gong sa lnga pa'i gsang ba rgya can klong chen snying thig gi dbang lung khrid gsum kun mkhyen klog chen pa'i gsung chos sogs zab chos mang du gsad te rigs kyi bdag por gyur dgung lo nyer gnyis thog mdo smad du phyir phebs nas brag dkar byang chub gling du bzhugs der yang gling yongs 'dzin mchog sprul rin po che dang seng rong 'jam dbyangs dbang phyug rab brtan nya rgyas mchog sprul sogs mkhas grub gyi yongs 'dzin ji snyed spyi bor bkur te bstan 'gyur gyi lung dang gsang bde'i dbang bde mchog gi lus dkyil dus 'khor sbyor drug sogs mdo gas kyi rig gnas 'byams klas par mang thos mkhas pa'i mnga' brnyes dgung lo nyer bdun nas bzung brag dkar ri khrod mA la nang dang chos dbyings dgon srag mgo'i dge thar lung sogs su gdan sa mdzad de gzhung byams chos sde lnga dang dbu ma rtsa ba 'jug bzhi gsum rigs tshogs bstod tshogs sogs 'chad khrid mdzad gzhan yang dkar mdzes snying thig zhi gcod sogs kyi dbang lung khrid gsum dang bka' bstan 'gyur dang rje tsong kha pa'i gsung 'bum bla ma so so'i gsung 'bum sna tshogs kyi lung gnang ba sogs 'dul bya rnams skal ldan gyi lam bkod a mdo dge bshes 'jam dpal rol pa'i blo gros dang dge thog mchog sprul blo gros 'gyur med chos kyi dbang phyug rwa sho mchog sprul 'jam dbyangs grub pa'i dbang po sogs mkhas grub gnyis ldan gyi skye chen du ma zhal slob tu gyur bka' 'gyur gser bris gnang ba dang rdo rje sems dpa' dang byams pa sogs gser zangs kyi sku mang po bzhengs snyan ngag gi dper brjod dang bstod tshogs bla ma rgyud pa'i rnam thar gsang 'dus rtsa rgyud sngags rdzogs skor gyi 'grel bshad sogs par du 'khod pa glegs bam bcu bdun tsam bzhugs mthar rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa sbrul (1929)lo'i zla brgyad pa'i tshes gsum nyin sku gshegs}
brag dkar blo bzang dpal ldan bstan 'dzin snyan grags|{rje 'di ni yum mdo smad kyi sa'i cha dzi ka zhes par rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa sbrul (1809)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga la phebs dus gdan sa brag dkar gyi khrir bzhugs/yi ge 'bri glog sogs sbyangs/dgung lo bcur 'khrungs sar mchog sprul rin po che'i drung du rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo bcu bdun la (429) dbus phyogs su phebs nas 'bras blo gsal gling grwa tshang du chos zhugs mdzad gzhung chen pod lnga la slob gnyer gnang dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gsum skabs mi phab rnam rgyal rgya mtsho'i spyod 'jug sher le'i 'grel pa ke ta 'i gong 'og rnams su rung rig yang dag dang 'gal tshabs che ba yang tsam gzigs pa klan ka bgyis pa dang lo de nang du (zab mo dbu ma'i gdan cung zad brjod pa blo gsal dga' ba'i gtam )gsar du brtsams khri chen rdo rje 'chang nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes dgung lo nyi shu rtsa bdun thog mdo smad du byon te shor khog dgon du gzhung pod lnga'i rtsod grwa dang gsang sngags kyi rgyud gra gsar du btsugs te de khul yul gru stod smad gyi gdul bya rnams la dam pa'i chos kyi char phab bka' rtsom (byang chub lam gyi rim pa kun phan bdud rtsi'i chu rgyun/) (smyung gnas bla ma rgyud pa'i rnam thar yig drug dang smyung gnas kyi phan yod bcas legs par bshad pa gser gyi phreng mdzes/) (rgyud sde bzhi'i rnam gzhag dang sa lam gyi bgrod tshul ji lta ba bzhin 'chad pa rgyud sde nor bu'i dbang mdzod/) ('dul ba'i rtsab 'i spyi don dag dga' dan rab tu bshad pa 'dul gzhung nor bu'i phreng ba/) (phar phyin rnam bshad snying po'i rgyan gyi dka' ba'i gdan rnam pa 'byed pa'i tan bcos legs bshad kun gyi yang snying )skabs dang po nas brgyad pa bar (dbu ma la 'jug pa'i rnam bshad dgongs pa rab tu gsal ba'i sgron me/) de bzhin tshad ma dang grub mtha'i skor gyi phyag rtsom sogs khyod pod 'bring dgu tsam bzhugs 'das lo dang sku tshe smad gyi mdzad pa ma rnyed}
brag kha ba grags pa seng ge|{rje 'di nyid rab byung bzhi pa'i shing yos (1255)lor la stod byang gi rgyal sde thang dkar du 'khrungs/gdung rus glan yin/gzhon nu la khra pho rin po che bsod nams seng ge las rab tu byung/mtshan grags pa seng ger gsol/phyis mkhan po khro bo rin po che bsod nams seng ge dang dbu ma pa sher 'bum gyis slob dpon/bu ston seng gi 'od kyis gsang ston mdzad de bsnyen par rdzogs/sa skyar phya ru ba seng ge dpal las rnam 'grel gsan/byams chos/rigs tshogs/rgyud sde sogs la mkhas pa shin tu che yang bstan pa'i nyang po sgrub pa la dgongs nas jo mo nang du kun spungs pa dang byang sems rgyal ba ye shes la sbyor ba yan lag drug gi khrid zhus/rga lo'i srang chung ba A ka ra sid+d+hi las rgyud 'grel cha lag dang bcas pa gsan nas ga'u lung gi ri khrod du sgrub pa gtso bor mdzad/zhar la rgyud 'grel gyi bshad pa dang khrid kyis slob ma yang rjes su bzung/phyis lo be ba kun bzang gis sbyin bdag byas nas brag khar phyag btab/der mtshams bcad de dus 'khor gyi bsnyen pa bya ba dang sbyin ba rag 'bum phrag bcu mdzad pas me lce rnams rin po che'i rnam par byung ba la sogs pa'i mtshan ma khyad par can byung/bskyed rdzogs kyi thugs dam gtso bor mdzad/sbyor drug /dmar khrid/gcod/gzer lnga rnams la khrid chen bzhir ming btags nas gtso bor skyong ba gnang/dbyar dus phal cher rgyun gcod la bzhugs/dngos po byung tshad dge sbyor la gtong bar mdzad/mngon par shes pa mnga' bas sa skya pa'i bde don la sogs pa lung bstan thams cad mngon sum du byung/slob ma chos rje bla ma dam pa dang/dka' bcu pa gzhon nu seng ge blo gros/bang mo zhu ba gzhon nu dpal sogs mang du byung/dgung lo gya dgu bzhes pa rang byung drug pa'i chu lug (1343)lor ngo mtshar gyi ltas dang bcas dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
brag dgon pa dkon mchog bstan pa rab rgyas|{rje 'di ni kan su'u zhing chen bsang chu rdzong khongs gtsos bstan 'dzin sde khrod du rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags (430) bya (1801)lor sku 'khrungs dgung lo lnga la phebs skabs kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng gsum pas brag dkon pa blo bzang shes rab kyi sprul skur ngos 'dzin mdzad dgung lo drug pa dbal mang paN+Di ta las rab tu byung sde mtshan dkon mchog bstan pa rab rgyas su gsol dgung lo dgu pa nas dga' ldan chos 'khor gling dang lhag par bla brang bkra shis 'khyil du mdo sngags rig gnas dang bcas par thugs gnyer dpyis phyis pa gnang thog dbus su lan gnyis phebs stag phu yongs 'dzin ye shes rgya mtsho sogs spyir bla ma sum cu rtsa grangs kyi zhabs la gtugs nas dbang lung man ngag gi gdams pa rgya cher gsan lhag par du dgong lo dgu pa nas nga gsum gyi bar dbal mang paN+Di ta dkon mchog rgyal mtshan gyi drung du bcur bzhugs gnang ste lab sbyor gnyis sa tshul bzhin bsten cing mkhas pa'i dbang por son de nas dbal mang paN+Di ta dang dga' ldan the bo sprul pa'i sku dpa' ris sngo kho ngag dbang legs bshad nyi ma sogs mkhas grub dag gis yang yang skul ma mdzad pas kun bslangs te rjes bstan pa rab rgyas mgon gyis bka' chems dang chos 'byung deb ther lo rgyus rnam thar bstan rtsis 'khrungs rabs gdung rabs rgyal rabs gdan rabs rtogs brjod dkar chag rus mdzod sogs lo rgyus rig pa'i rtsom gzhung rnam grangs lnga brgya sum cu lhag gsan gzigs dang rma chu klu chu bsang chu dgu chu tsong chu'i rgyud sogs yul gru dang sa khul mang por chibs bskyod kyis dri gtugs dngos gyi thog nas (mdo smad chos 'byung )rtsom sgrig mdzad rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing glang (1865)lor legs par grub chos 'byung de'i nang don a mdo'i yul gri khag gi dgon pa lag so sor byon pa'i bstan 'dzin gyi skyes bu dang grwa rgyun mang nyung sa tshigs ring thung 'byor pa thon khungs sogs zhib tu gsungs shing khyad par du mdo smad ljongs kyi bstan pa'i 'phel 'grib dang chab srid dpal 'byor rig gnas slob gso rab byung gi khams dgon sgrub sde'i gdan rabs lha rten chos gsum dpe mdzod gtsug lag bcas zhib cing rgyas pa gsal ba ma zad dbu na chos 'byung rgyal rabs rnam grangs drug cu lhag tsam gyi mtshan byang dang rtsom pa po sogs bkod yod rje 'di nyid kyi gshegs lo kha gsal ma rnyed}
brag go kak+Ni|{brag sgo kak+Ni ni lha sa'i dmar po ri dang lcags po ri gnyis kyi bar du gnas shing/mchod rten che chung gsum yod pa las mchod rten che ba kak+Ni ni lam gyi dbus dang/gzhan chung ba gnyis ni dmar po ri dang lcags po ri gnyis kyi sne so sor gnas/brag sgo kak+Ni ni lo rgyus yun ring ldan pa dang lha sar skad grags che tshe yod pa'i mchod rten zhig yin/gnas der mchod rten de 'dra zhig bzhengs pa'i dgos pa ni sngar dus lcags po ri dang dmar po ri gnyis mu 'brel nang glang po che dang seng ge mjug pa sbrel blta bu yod pa ni sa dpyad gyi dbang du ha cang dge mtshan ldan pa zhig yin pa ste/rgya bza' wun khren kong jos bod du bsnams phebs pa'i sa dpyad yig rigs dang thang rgyal rabs dus dkyil du rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta du har nag pos bod du bsnams phebs pa'i sa dpyad yig rigs khag gnyis kyi nang/yul grong dang rgyal po'i pho brang chags sa'i thang gi dkyil du ri chung gi sne phan tshun sbrel ba yod na yul sde de'i mi brgyud nang shes yon 'dzoms shing 'jon thang ldan pa'i brgyud pa bar mtshams ma chad pa yod ba dang/ri sna phan tshun na de las ldog pa'i skyon chag 'byung tshul bshad yod/yon kyang rgyal po khri srong lde btsan skabs yin zer ba'i lo rgyus yig cha 'ga' zhig nang lha sgrung lta bu'i sgro btags kyi gtam rgyud mang po zhig yongs grags kyi bshad srol (431) rgyun 'byams su gyur te rgya bza' rjes ma cin khren kong jos rang gi bu khri srong lde btsan rgyal po'i btsun mo che ba sna nam bzas 'phrogs pa'i dgra she len ched du lha sa dang lho khar bod kyi yar rgyas la phan thogs yod pa'i ri dpyad bzang po khag gtor skabs dmar po ri dang lcags po ri'i bar ri sna 'brel ba bcad pa dang rjes su rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis rang gi yum rgya bza' yin par ngos 'dzin gnang bar brten rgya bza' sems dga' nas bod kyi ri dpyad nyams su bcug pa de tshor 'gyod pa skyes de dmar lcags gnyis gyi ri sna bcad pa nyams gso byed ched ri sna gnyis su mchod rten re dang ri sna mthun mtshams su mchod na chen po'i 'og tu 'gro lam yod pa bzos pa yin zhes grags pa ma zad skabs der rgya dkar nag gnyis nas bod du sa dpyad kyi gzhung las thang chen po'i dkyil du ri sna chad pa yod na yul gyi snod bcu la gnod pa yod pa'i rgyu mtshan mang po bshad yod pa khus su byas nas bod kyi rgyal rabs rim byung skabs yang yang nyams gso byas pa'i lo rgyus yod pa ste karma bstan skyong gis srid dbang bzung skabs dang de rjes bod rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me glang (1637)lor sde srid bsod nams rab brtan gyis nyams gso gnang ba de yang 'gyel zhig tu nye bas bod rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me rta (1666)lor sde pa 'phrin las rgya mtshos gsar bzhengs rgyas skrun gnang rtsis kyang rtsig rmang tshad long ma byung bas gas skyon byung bod rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me lug (1667)lor bskyar du gsar bzhengs mdzad mchod na de phyi g.yu rtsis gtum par dgongs kyang de'i thad bzo bo'i lag rtser gdeng 'khel ba med pas gser zangs kyis btums pa'i chos 'khor bcu gsum pa dam dang thugs rje mdo gzungs bcas gsar bzo dang gnam rgyan du ngan song sbyong rgyud kyi dkyil 'khor bcu gnyis dang dbus su tshe dpag med lha sku'i dkyil 'khor gsar bris mchod rten gsum la lcags thag dang rlung dril ngo grangs sum cu de bzhin nang rten gzungs bzhugs dang bcas pa gsar bzhengs mdzad de rjes rgyal ba sku phreng brgyad pa'i dus su'ang nyams gso gnang ba dang rgyal ba sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i dus su gzhi'i che ba'i nyams gso gsar skrun gnang ste thugs dam dgongs don bzhin gzungs bzhugs sa dbang 'dus 'khor lo zab rgya can kha shas dang bla rdo khag bar chad sel phyir bsod rgyas kyi gter phur gtso bor bzhag pa'i phur pa'i dkyil 'khor dang 'brel phu pa cha tshang phur pa'i sku brnyan 'bum phrag ston pa 'jigs byed o rgyan sogs kyi sku brnyan so sor 'bum phrag bka' 'gyur rin po che cha tshang bcas dang gzhan yang chos 'khor bcu gsum gyi tsa mo nas lcags thag du 'brel ba phyogs rer dril bu bdun rer gter lung dgongs don bzhin zangs kyi dril rtser byang bur dbang 'dus kyi sngags dang 'byung bzhi'i gnod bzlog sngags dngabacas rtsig pa sra zhing brtan pa dang bzo bkod brjid legs pa rnam par bkra ba'i mchod rten de dag skye bo kun gyi mig lam du khra lam mer mthong rgyu yod la lha sa'i nub phyogs nas yongs mkhar rnams brag sgo kak+Ni brgyud nas yong gi yod pas de ni lha sa'i nub ngos kyi gzhung sgo lta bu yin mchod rten gsar bzhengs kyi rgyu 'gro sa rdo shing sogs ma tshud pa'i zangs dmar kho na mkhar khal sum brgya dgu bcu go drug lhag tsam dang gser 'dam zho lnga stong lnga brgya bzhi bcu zhe lnga dngul chu zho chig khri sum stong dgu brgya bzhi bcu zhe lnga bal po'i bzo bo tshud pa'i zangs bzo ba sum cu tsam la gla yon 'brur phab na 'phru khal chig stong drug brgya skor bcas btang ba yin 'dug de rjes bod rab byung bcu drug pa'i me rta (1966)lor rig gnas gsar brje chen po zhes pa'i zing 'tshub skabs mchod rten gsum ka gtor brlag btang mthar bod rab nga bcu bdun pa'i (432) shing phag (1995)lor srid gzhung nas po ta la'i thang ches gsar skrun skabs mchod rten rnam gsum bskyar bzhengs kyi gna' bo'i brjid nyams slar yang mngon par byas brag sgo kak+Ni'i mchod rten gsum yod pa'i dbus kyi mchod rten ni cho 'phrul mchod rten gyi bzo dbyibs dang dmar po ri'i sner bskrun pa'i mchod rten ni rnam rgyal mchod rten gyi gzugs dbyibs lcags po ri'i sner bskrun pa ni byang chub mchod rten yin dmar po ri'i sne'i rnam rgyal mchod rten dang nye bar brag sgo rab 'byams pa'i bzhugs gnas su grags pa'i sgrub khang chung chung zhig yod pa ni rgyal pa lnga pa blo bzang rgya mtshos brag sgro rab 'byams pa sku gshegs pa'i rjes dran du rab 'byams pa bya bral gyi brtul zhugs 'dzin te bsnyen sgrub mdzad pa'i gnas dang dgongs pa mya ngan las 'das pa'i shul rdo skyor bskong ba'i sa de rang la sgrub khang zhig bzhengs thog der brag sgo rab 'byams pa'i dbu thod nang rten du bzhugs su gsol zhing lnga pa chen po sku dngos gyis rab gnas mdzad yod par grags pa de yang da lta gsar bzhengs gnang yod}
