brag ble ba'i khams chu|{(kha mchu)rab byung lnga pa'i lcags sbrul (1281)lor gung du spyan snga bcu gnyis pa rin chen rdo rje sku gshegs pa'i tshab tu spyan snga rin po che grags ye shes khrir bskos/khong gis rang nyid kyi dbon po snag tsha grags sle ba sa skya'i bla ma ye shes rin chen la phul/de la sa skya bas 'bri gung gi gdan sar bsko rtsis byas skabs spyan snga bcu gnyis pa rin chen rje'i gzung rgya bo rgyas pa rin chen gyis bkrongs/de'i don du sa skya bas 'bri gung par kha mchu slong rtsis byas kyang/gcung rgya bo grags pa rin chen gyi rgyab tu 'bri gung pa yongs rdzogs langs par brten sa skya ba dang 'bri gung ba'i bar dmag 'khrug byung ba'i 'go tshugs pa yin/de'i skor zhib phra (lho rong chos 'byung )nang gsal}
