brag yer pa|{(grong khyer lha sa'i nye 'dabs stag rtse rdzong khongs )brag yer pa ni grong khyer lha sa nas rtsis pa'i byang shar mtshams kyi spyi le 45tsam gyi sar gsan shing/lo ngo chig stong sum brgya lhag tsam gyi lo rgyus yod pa dang sngon byon skyes bu dam pa du mas byin gyis rlabs pa'i gnas mchog khyad par can zhig yin par brten phyogs 'grub dad mjal zhu mi mang zhing/de snga na gnas srid gzhung gi rtse yig tshang las khungs nas thad kar 'dzin skyong byed pa'i gal che'i dgon gsal gras shig yin/de ni spyi lo'i dus rabs bdun pa'i nang btsan po srong btsan sgom po'i btsun mo mong bzang khri lcam yum sras kyi rten skal du bzhengs shing/(rgyal rabs gsal ba'i me long )nang yum sras (mong bzang khri lcam dang sras gung ru gung btsan )gnyis kyi thugs dam du yer ba'i gnas ri brag gi dbyibs ni 'phags ma sgrol ma bzhugs pa dang 'dra ba'i pang du lha khang nang mchod rten bzhengs te ra btu gnas pa mdzad nas ra sa 'phrul snang gi gtsug lag khang dang bstan pa'i srog rtsa gcig par yab (srong btsan sgam po )kyis smon lam btabs so zhes dang/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )sogs su'ang mong bza' khri lcam gyis yer pa'i gtsug lag khang bzhengs zhes gsal ba bcas srong btsan sgam po'i btsun mo mong bza' khri lcam yum sras kyi rten skal du bzhengs pa'i lha khang ni ma Ni lha khang zhes pa de yin 'dug pa de'i nang pha bong zhig la dar gong gi ma Ni yig drug 'bur thon gyi rang byon gsal ba zhig dang/srong btsan dang/rgya bza'/bal bza' rnams kyi 'jim sku mi tshad sogs yod/brag yer pa'i brag phug la thun mong ma yin pa'i ngo mtshar ldan pa dang/brag phug re rer lha sgrung ltar gyi snyan 'jebs ldan pa'i shod rgyun re yod/de'i nang nas rgas ches shos thab skas (nyi ma phug yang zer )dang zla ba phug ni slob dpon pad+ma 'byung gnas kyi sgrub phug yin/zla ba phug nang slob dpon pad+ma 'byung gnas dang lha lcam gnyis dang/gu ru mtshan brgyad sogs kyi sku brnyan yod/chos rgyal brag phug ni/chos rgyal srong btsan sgam po'i sgrub phug yin/de'i nang rig 'dzin ku ma ras bzhengs pa'i sku rgya shar li yin pa'i spyan ras gzigs phyag stong spyan stong gi sku brnyan dang/de'i phyag na rje btsun sgrol ma'i sku brnyan gsung sbyong yin zer ba gcig sogs yod/lha lung dpal rdor gyi sgrub phug ni/rgyal rabs chos 'byung khag nas gsar ba ltar na lha lung dpal gyi rdo rjes btsan po glang dmar ma bkrongs gong grub phug der bzhugs nas sgrub pa mdzad myong ba dang/glang dar ma bkrongs rjes phrug phug der yab nas bzhugs pa yin zer/der lha lung dpal rdor dang/bai ro tsha na'i 'dra sku yod pa dang/de'i gzhogs su mgon po ber sogs kyi 'dra sku yang yod/lha lung dpal rdo rjer ni brag yer par byung ba'i sgrub pa po'i nang nas grags che ba zhig yin pa ni/spyi lo'i dus rabs dgu pa'i dus dkyil du btsan po glang dmar pas sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa bsnubs pas yer par sgrub pa mdzad bzhin pa'i lha lung dpal rdo rjer rab tu khros te skad cig nyid nu lha sar phebs te ra sa 'phrul snang gtsug lag khang mdun gyi rdo ring gi yi ge klog bzhin pa'i btsan po glang dmar ma mda' 'phen thengs gcig la bkum/rjes su mdo khams khul du bros phebs te sangs rgyas bstan pa'i re mo gso phyir mdzad rjes chen po bzhag /yer pa'i dril bu chen po de yi yer par yod pa'i ches snga ba'i rtsa che'i rig dngos mang du yod pa'i nang nas gcig yin zhing/ (434) dril bu de'i thog rgyal ba rnams kyi dam pa chos 'dzin cing byang chub spyod pa kun tu snang bar byed/_/bzang po spyod pa rnam par sbyang ba yang/_/ma 'ongs bskal pa kun tu spyad par bgyi/_/zhes 'khod yod pa ma zad sne pad 'dab kyi dbyibs la 'dab ma re re'i thog brdungs na skad mi 'dra ba re thon rgyu yod pa'i ngo mtshan can zhig yin pa'i lo rgyus zur du yod phal cher btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyis sangs rgyas kyi tan pa rgya cher spel ring dril bu 'di lugs su blugs pa zhig yin par mngon shod srol gzhan zhig la dril ba 'di slob dpon gyis cong thang spang sgang nas gter nas bzhes pa red ces zer rgyun yang 'dug gnas bcu lha khang gi nang du yod pa'i gnas brtan bcu drug ni dus rabs bcu pa'i mjug tu bla chen dgongs pa rab gsal gyi slob ma klu mes 'brom chung gis khrang an rgyal sar phebs nas gong ma thang tha'i cung gis gnas brtan dngos su spyan drangs skabs bzhengs pa'i 'dra 'bag la dpe bshus mdzad de lha sar phebs de la dpe byas te brag yar pa'i gnas brtan bcu drug gi 'dra 'bag bzhengs pa des bod kyi gtsug lag khang mang por 'phel rgyas byung rten 'brel phug ni jo bo rje dpal ldan a ti sha'i sgrub phug yin zhing der bzhugs ring 'brom rngog gnyis mjal te rten 'brel legs po byung bas rten 'brel phug tu grags he ti sha'i chos khri na spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i nang a ti sha bod du phebs nas yer par bzhugs ring (bka' gdams pha chos/) (bu chos )sogs chos mang du gsungs 'brog ston pa sogs slob ma nyung shar la bka' gdams chos bdun ldan gyi man ngag thig le bcu drug gi dbang dang man ngag dang rngog legs pa'i shes rab kyis ngo bo yab sras la maN+Dal phul te gsol ba btab par ngo bos 'brom gyi skye rabs zab mo dang 'brom gyis sprul pa'i glegs bam zhes bka' rgya shin tu dam par mdzad pa deng sang bka' gdams glegs bam du grags pa de bcas gsung skabs jo bo'i bzhugs khri yin pa da lta'ang shul bsdad yod byams khang ni jo bo rje a ti sha bod du ma phebs gong bstan pa snga dar gyi dus 'khor khams nas phabs pa'i dmar ston chos kyi 'byung gnas kyis bzhengs nang du gtso bo byams pa dang 'khor sems dpa' drug dang sems ma drug sgo srung rta mgrin bcas yod pa shin tu byin can du brtsis brag yer ba'i rten gtso bo ni yar pa'i dkar chag tu 'khod pa ltar na sku'i rten spe'u dmar ser gnyis dang gsung gi rten yig drug 'bum thugs kyi rten mchod rten gsum chos skyong rten shug pa'i nags tshal ting nge 'dzin sgom pa la bod gyi brag phug brgya rtsa brgyad sprul 'phrin las gyi rten du ri bo sgrol ma'i skur sprul yod yer pa'i gnas kyi gal che rang bzhin skor (yer pa'i dka' chag )nang gzhan du lo brgya bsgom pa las yer pa zhag re bsgoms pa stobs che lha sa bon kyi srog shing yin lha sa'i srog shi yer pa yin zer ba sogs sar nyams pa gang zhig byung yang yer par de dang 'tshams pa'i nyams gso bya rgyud yod pa'i skor shod rgyu mang dag cig bkod 'dug kyang 'dir tshang ma ma bkod gong bkod de dag dngos dang mthun par zhig yin rung yer pa'i gnas babs kyi gal che'i rang bzhin gsal ston byas yod yer par grwa tshang ni rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me phag (1647)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas dga' ldan gsang sngags yar rtse zhes pa'i dge lugs dgon pa phyag btab phyis yer pa grwa tshang zer rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag lo'i gong grwa grangs 108tsam yod pa dang da dung dus rabs bco brgyad par dga' ldan khri thog nga gcig pa rta yon dpal ldan grags pas bzhengs pa'i rgyud stod kyi tshogs khang yang yod yer pa'i gnas mchog chags sa'i yul ljongs ni rngam brjid g.yang gzar che la chags dbyibs sna tshogs (435) pa'i brag ri'i ldebs su sgrub phug ming can rnams dang ser ba la sogs nags tshal rab tu rgyas pa 'bab chu'i rgyun bzang las lhung lhung gi sgra snyan par sgrog pa dpyid dbyar gnyis su spang ljongs ne tso'i gshog pa brkyangs pa 'dra ba'i steng du me tog sna tshogs rnam par bkra ba khu byung dang 'jom mo la sogs 'dab chags rnams gre 'gyur 'gran zhing bya rgod dang go ba sogs gshog rtsal ngom pa rna ba dang gla ba sogs bya ri dwags rnams ci dgar bag phebs kyis rgyu zhing se 'bru rnams smin pa'i tshe mngar ba'i ro la chags pa'i byis pa tshogs kyis ci dga' 'thog pa smug sprin gyis mgul bar dkris pa'i brag ri rnams ni lhag par yid dbang 'phrog pa smin gyi rtsi shing dang me tog dag las dri bzung kun tu 'thul ba dad mjal ba dang yul skor spro gseng mkhan rnams pad+ma bung ba 'du ba ltar gang sa nas 'du ba'i mdzes ljongs shig yin de gar dpal ldan rgyud stod grwa tshang gi 'dus tshogs nas lo ltar dbyar phyi ma zhal bzhes mdzad pa dang 'brel grwa gsar tshos thig rtsa dang rta dbyangs kyang sbyong dgos kyi yod lo re'i bod zla bdun pa'i tshes bcu nyis yer pa grwa tshang nas yer pa tshes bcu zhes gnas der dmigs gsal gyi dus chen zhig byed srol yod la de skabs lhas khul dang nye 'khor gyi zhing 'brog mang tshogs bcas 'du 'dzoms kyis de nyid jo bo rje a ti sha'i 'dra sku gtso bzhugs kyi thang ka 'grems pa dang a ti sha'i gsol sde