brag g.yab rtogs ldan 'jam dbyangs blo gros|{rje 'di mdo smad gyi sa'i cha rmi stod byang dkar zhes bya ba'i yul gru der yab dra rgyas dang yum rnal 'byor ma'i rigs can du grags pa lo yag sgron gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa byi (1888)lor 'khrungs/mtshan don grub tshe ring zhes gsol/dgong lo lnga pa'i dus yi ge bslabs par tshegs med du mkhyen/dgung lo bcu gnyis nas bcu drug bar cho sa 'don du byon/dgung lo bcu bdun skabs grub chen bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan ngag dbang ye shes zhes gsol/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gnyis la rgyal ba blo bzang chos nyid kyi drung du zab chos mang du gsan te mtshan 'jam dbyangs blo gros zhes bstsal/dgung lo nyer gsum la dbus su phabs nas 'bras blo gling gi chos grwar zhugs/tre hor blo bzang sbyin pa dang/mi nyag 'jam dpal blo gros/gser khang rje byams pa bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho sogs nas mdo sngags chos tshul mtha' klas pa gsan cing/pha bong kha byams pa bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho'i drung nas dge slong gi sdom pa mnos/rje 'di grwa rkyang bya bral du ri khrod e gsang phug tu 'tshob gang byung la chog shes brten nas sgrub pa la brtson/dgung lo so lang la mdo smad du phebs/brag g.yab bu dgon du lam rim bde chen zhal lung ljags bsgrigs mdzad/dpa' sho dgon du gung chen po lnga'i rtsod grwa btsugs/tshogs gzhung du btung ba myos chang gi rgyun bcad/rdza rgyud rtsa ra khar lam (436) rim gyi sgrub grwa btsugs nas rmar khams dgon khag so sor lam rim go na la gzhol ba mdzad gtsug phur ri khrod phyag btab bka' rtsom yang (lhag mthong chen mo'i dka' gdan rin chen phreng ba/) (nyams mgur gyi tshogs thabs shes gsang ba'i bang mdzod/) (lhag mthong chen mo'i dka' gnad gyi 'grel pa rig pa'i lcags thur )sogs pod chen gcig bzhugs dgung lo nga bzhi la phebs pa rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags sbrul (1941)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
brag g.yab blo bzang bstan pa|{rje 'di ni go 'jo lha thog yul du rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu phag (1683)lor sku 'khrungs/sku gzhon dus gsang phu gon du slob gnyer mdzad de khri chen sbyin pa rgya mtsho dang bka' 'gyur blo bzang chos 'dzin sogs kyi zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/mkhas dang grub pa'i go 'phang brnyes/sku tshe hril po 'chad rtsod rtsom gsum gyis dus 'da' bar mdzad/gsum rtsom la mtshon na/(khams gsum 'gro ba'i bla ma chos kyi rgyal po thams cad mkhyen pa shar tsong kha pa blo bzang grags pa'i dpal gyi rnam par thar pa yon tan chu gter/) (rgyal dbang lnga pa'i rigs gsum spyi sgrub gyi rnam bshad chen mo phan bde'i 'byung gnas/) (snying po don gsum gyi khrid yig rgyas bsdus gnyis su phye ba/) (sems bskyed cho ga bzung tshul (sogs chos dpe pod gcig ga bka' rtsom gnang mthar dgung lo lnga bcu nga bdun la phabs pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa lug (1730)lo sku gshegs}
