brag lung mkhan po dge 'dun lung rtogs rab rgyas|{mdo smad bya khyung dgon gyi mkhan rabs gya bdun pa 'di nyid nag rtsa yul gdong du yab lis zi dang yum ka kro gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing lug (1895)lor sku 'khrungs/rje zhwa dmar paN+Di ti las rab tu byung/mtshams ring khong dge rgan du bsten/mkhyen bar che ba'i grags pa rgyas/rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pa chen po bya khyung du phebs nas 'dzin grwa so sor dpe khrid gnang skabs da'i pas don bdun cu'i thog sde bzung nas rgyal dbang dang mnyam gzigs mdzad pa'i skal ba byung/dgung lo bco brgyad thog bsdus grwa'i dam bca' bzhag ra dge bshes rnams pa'i thugs zin/sa ral mkhan chen dge 'dun chos 'byor rgya mtsho las bsnyen rdzogs bzhes/gser tog blo bzang tshul khrims rgya mtsho dang/che shod rin po che/a lags kho tshe sogs kyi drung nas chos bka' ci rigs gsan/dgung lo nyer lnga'i thog lha khang nyams gso'i don du sog yul du phebs/phyir phebs nas lha khang rten brten pa gsar bzhengs dang/gser zangs las grub pa'i sgrol ma nyer gcig /'du khang chen mor gan ji ra sogs rten bzhengs/de'i rjes rgya sog yul du gcig byon/dgung lo so drug pa lcags rta (1930)lor bya khyung gdan khrir phebs/slob gnyer la rting skul dang bsnyen bkur zab/dgung lo so brgyad steng mkhan khri dgongs pa zhus/brag lung gi 'du khang gsar bzhengs mdzad/dgung lo so dgu'i steng nas rje a b+h+ya zhabs yab sras kyi zhabs pad bsten/mi tra rdor phreng gi dbang dang bka' 'gyur gyi lung sogs chos bka' mnog che ba gsan/'jigs byed bsnyen chen snga phyir lan gnyis gtang/bya khyung du snga phyir phabs nas khong gi thugs mos bzhin chos rgyun mi nyung tsam spel/dgung lo (437) nga brgyad bzhes pa rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu 'brug (1952)lo'i bod zla dang po'i tshes gcig la zhi bar gshegs so/_}
