bla brang rgyal mtshan mthon po|{de'i ming gi 'byung tshul ni rgyal dbang sku phreng dang po rje dge 'dun grub pas rab byung brgyad pa'i me yos (1447)lor dgon pa bkra shis lhun pu phyag 'debs gnang mdzad thog rje nyid kyi bzhugs gar nas bla brang gsar skrun gnang zhing/nub gcig ja nyid kyi mnal lam mtshan ltas su bla brang gi rtse mor rgyal mtshan bcu gcig btsugs pa zhig rmis pa la brten nas ming de ltar btags par grags la/rjes su bod rab byung bcu pa'i lcags glang (1601)lor paN chen sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gdan sa bkra shis lhun po'i khrir mnga' gsol ba nas bkras lhun 'di nyid paN chen sku phreng rim byon gyi skyong yul gdan sar gyur pa dang chabs cig bla brang rgyal mtshan mthon po de yang paN chen sku phreng na rim gyi bzhugs gnas bla brang lta bur gyur pa yin 'dug }
bla brang rnying pa|{lha sa'i bar skor lho ngos su yod pa'i bla brang rnying pa zhes pa'i khang pa de ni dus rabs bco lnga pa'i nang rje tsong kha pa de gar bzhugs skad dang du dus rabs bcu bdun pa'i nang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas kyang de gar bzhugs gnas gnang zhing/de rjes lha ldan gtsug lag khang 'khyams ra'i yang steng du bla brang steng gsar skrun gyis bzhugs par brten de snga bzhugs yul der bla brang rnying pa zhes grags}
bla brang phyag mdzod las khungs|{'di ni lha sa gtsug lag khang gi nub tu yod pa'i dbang gi las khums bla brang phyag mdzod ces pa de yin zhing/tshugs yul 'khyams ra'i steng yin pa 'di tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i skabs gsar du tshugs/las khums 'dis mnal lam gyi gtong sgo'i las 'gan 'khur bas smon lam thog mar srol 'dzugs mdzad mkhan rje tsong kha ba'i bla brang gi ming de chags/'di'i 'og 'dzin bla phyag mkhan chung gnyis dang ring bzhi drung 'khor gcig /rjes su bla phyag las 'phar zhes rtse shod gang rung zhig 'phar 'dzugs byas pa'ang byung 'dug /de 'og phyag drung gcig (drung gtogs )dang/phyag nang nyi shu rtsa bzhi/sha'o li bzhi/(phyag nang 'os sgug )bla brang khang gnyer dang bzo khang do dam pa rtse drung re/gad pa mi brgyad tsam bcas yod/lus khungs 'dis rdzong gzhis khag gi lo 'khor yong 'bab 'bru rigs shar mar sogs bsdu len dang/thebs sbyar ma dngul (phyis thebs sbyar ma dngul je rgyas su song ste thebs gtong dang skyed 'bab gyis smon lam dang tshogs mchod skabs grwa par 'gyed dngul dang/ja thug /se 'bras dga' gsum gyi tshogs chen rgyun ja bcas kyi 'gro gron gtong rgyu'i do dam byed pa/gtsug lag khang gi nye bskor du yod pa'i las khungs khag gi dgos mkho sprod rgyu/tA la'i bla ma lha sa bla brang steng bzhugs skabs kyi dgos mgo nar gtong dang bel de gar bzhugs ring gi 'bul ba bdag gnyer dang/gnang cha sprod pa/nang gzan (phyag nang )res 'khor gyis mtsho sna dang/phag ri/gting skyes bcas par 'bras sgrub par btang ste smon lam (445) 'tshog skabs kyi bzhes thug gi rgyu dang snga dus ya mon dang am ban sogs bod du sdod skabs kyi bza' 'brur 'bras spus 'don yang byed pa bcas kya 'gan dbang spyod pa sogs mdor na lus khungs 'di na sa gnas srid gzhung gi nor srid yong 'babs bsdu len dang 'gro gron gtong sgo'i don dam las khungs che shos shig yin bla brang phyag mdzod las khungs (bla phyag )gyi las byed dom mi sna so so'i go ming ltar 'gan dbang spyod phyogs ni 1 bla phyag mkhan chung dang rim bzhi 'di dag gis gong gsal bla phyag gi 'gan dbang dang 'brel ba'i las don la bkod 'doms thag gcod byed pa dang 2 phyag 'bri'i bya ba rnams byas te bka' shag la mtshon na bka' drung dang 'dra 3 bzo khang do dam pas lha bris pa dang 'jim bzo ba 'tshem bzo ba bcas kyi 'go khrid byas te gtsug lag khang gi jo bo sogs la zhal gser 'bul mkhan byung rigs kyi gser tA la'i bla ma'i spyan zhur gtong ba'i spus tshan len pa dang gzhung khral bskul 'deb bcas byed pa 4 bla brang khang gnyer 'dis bla brang steng gzim chung khag dang de 'brel dngos rdzas bdag gnyer dang gad pa rnams la skong tha'en 'go 'doms byed 5 phyag nang bla brang phyag mdzod las khungs te bla phyag gi nang gzan yin pas phyag nang zhes bya zhing 'di dag gis mtsho sna dang phag re gting skyes bcas pa'i 'bras sgrub dang stod phyogs sogs sa gnas khag la yod pa'i bla phyag gi gzhung ru'i she 'bab bsdup+len sogs phyi 'gro'i rigs dang bla phyag ngo ma mkhan chung dang rim bzhi'i skul 'og 'bru dngul sha mar 'dod 'jug sogs la mig lta rgyang srung dang gang mkho'i tsag tsig gi las don rnams sgrub par byed 6 sha'o li 'di ni phyag nang 'os sgub yin pas khral bsdu khrims gnon sogs phyi 'gro'i rigs la 'gro dbang med cing rgyun du las khungs nang phyag nang byings dang rab bla phyag ngo ma'i bkod don ltar las don sgrub dgos pa yin 7 gad pa 'di dag gis bla brang khang gnyer gyi bkod don 'og gzim chung sogs las khungs kyi phyi nang bar gsum la gad bdar dngos rdzas bdag gnyer sogs gar mkho'i lci las rnams byed}
bla bres|{sku mgron sogs bzhugs sa'i gdan dang khri'i steng gi gnam rgyan du bres pa'i yol ba lta bur mtha' rgyan gong ba dang/mthong 'jug can la bsham bu 'phyang ba zhig }
