bla ma chen po yon tan gzungs|{(rnying ma yon tan gzungs kyang zhu )'di nyid rab byung gnyis pa'i me rtag (1126)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bcu gcig la phebs skabs slob gter mdzad/khu bo rgya nag gi sku mdun du dgung lo bcu gsum ring bka' bskyed rdzogs gsum gyi rgyud lung man ngag dang bcas pa kun las slob gnyer rdzogs par mdzad/dgung lo nyer bzhis phebs skabs khu bo sku gshegs nas gdan sa mdzad/slob gnyer gyi dras thag ma chod pa bag le yod pa kun dbus pa ston shAkya dang dbus pa zhig po la sogs pa bu slob rnams la dras thag bcad pa yin no/_/mthar dgung lo bdun cu pa rab byung gsum pa'i shing yos (1195)lor sku gshegs}
