bla ma rdo rje rgyal mtshan|{rje 'di nyid rab byung lnga pa'i chu lug (1283)lor sku bltams/sku gzhon nu'i dus su 'bri glog la sbyangs pas tshegs med du mkhyen/'jam dbyangs rin rgyal dang slob dpon shes rgyal la mkhan slob zhus nas rab tu byung/dgung lo bcu drug pa la dben dmar ga gdan sa bzung/dus 'khor gyi bshad grwa bskyangs/mkhan po bka' bzhi pa dang mkhan po zhal snga ba las bsnyen par rdzogs/thar pa lo tsA ba las sgra tsan+d+ra pa dang yi ge'i rigs thams cad bslabs/mngon pa dang man ngag sgrub thabs mang po gsan/bla ma shes rab seng ge ba las dus 'khor gyis gtso byas pa'i dbang bka' thams cad gsan/de bzhin mkhan po zhal snga ma la 'dul mdzod/jo bo lhas pa sangs rgyas gsang 'dus/jo bo lugs kyi bde mchog /lam 'bras la sogs pa'i man ngag dang gzhan rgyud mang dag zhus/de nas sri'u chung ba blo ldan seng ge las gsang 'dus/yo ga /gsang ldan/gdan bzhi la sogs pa'i rgyud mang po gsan/bla ma shes rab seng ge gshegs nas sham+b+har dang gnyis ka bzung nas dus 'khor gyi bshad nyan yun ring mdzad/snyan pa'i grags pa phyogs kun tu khyab/rgyal blon rnams kyis rje nyid kyi sku yon la shin tu dad cing spyi bor bkur/slob ma bu rin po che sogs mang du byon/dgung grangs bzhi bcu zhe gsum la phebs pa rab byung lnga pa'i shing glang (1325)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
bla ma rin chen grags gu shri|{'gro mgon chos rgyal 'phags pa sog yul du phebs skabs lo tsA ba bla ma rin chen rgas pa ni bod sog rgya gsum gyi skad lam khas pa yin pas hu pe li se chen han gyis khong la gu shri zhes (sog skadadu mkhas pa zhes zer )pa'i go gnas sprad yod}
