blang dor gsal bar ston pa'i drang thig dwangs shel me long nyer gcig|{de ni bod rang byung bcu gcig pa'i sa lug (1679)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng ng+la pas skabs de'i sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshor bka' btang nas gtan 'bebs byed pa'i khrims yig cing yin zhing/sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos sngar gyi (khrims yig zhal lce bcu drug )phyogs bsdus kyis ma yig la dag bco dang kha gsab gnang ba ma zad/don tshan re 'ga' tshig 'grel dang gyod gzhi 'ga' shas kyi 'dir zhib dang thag gcod byed stabs skor yig thug tu bkod nas de dag cung cha tshang ba'i khrims yig cig tu gyur yod}
