blon po mgar gyi bu che ba|{blon po mgar gyi bu che ba su yin min la bshad tshul mi mthun pa'i dogs gzhi 'ga' zhig 'dug pa'i gsal bshad gnad bsdus/gcig (thang deb rnying ma )las mgar gyi bu khri 'bring dang/btsan brod/blon zi mdo ye/blon po lon no zhes mgar khri 'bring bu che ba dang/btsan brod de'i 'og ma yin par bshad/gnyis/tshal pa kun dga' rdo rjes mdzad pa (drung chen smon lam rdo rje'i rnam thar )nang tshal pa'i mi brgyud byung tshul dang tshal gung thang gi gnas tshul zhib rgyas 'khod pa'i dpe rnying bris ma shog grangs 69yod pa zhig 'dug pa'i nang 'khod don/blon po mgar stong btsan gyi sras bzhi ste/1 gong ma thang tha'i tsung gi tsha mo zhig la skyes pa'i sras li khyim ('di thang deb nang bshad pa dang mthun )mi rgyud byung tshul mi gsal/2 btsan po yon tan rgyal gzungs ('dis thang gi rgyal mo 'u dza then gyi blon po byas/sras gsum byung/btsan po breng po/btsan gnyan gung ston/btsan gnya' ldom bu bcas gsum/btsan po bred pos stag grod 'dul thub cing/btsan gnyan gung ston gyis stod zhang zhung gi yul dpon dang dgung blon byas/gser yig gi byang bu'i bdag thob yod/btsan gnyan ldom bus snye mo'i yul dpon byas zhes dang de nas rim par tshal pa kun dga' rdo rje rang nyid kyi yab smon lam rdo rje'i bar gyi mi brgyud byung tshul gyi gnas tshul zhib rgyas bkod 'dug pa ma zad/lo rgyus de rnams mgar yul ram pa (stong lung ram pa )nas lcags kyi byang khram dum bu gsum dang mnyam du rnyed pa'i yig tshang khag gcig nang gsal ba de dang/rgya'i yig tshang (thang deb )bcas phan tshul zhib bsdur byas te mgon pa yis zhes gsungs 'dug pa de ltar na blon po mgar gyi bu che ba li khyim/'bring ba btsan po yon tan rgyal gzungs yin pa dang/'bring ba btsan po'i bu gsum gyi chung shos btsan snya ldom bu yin pa ha cang gsal po yin/gsum/tun hong nas thon pa'i yig cha (deb dkar )nang drangs pa der 'khod don du/blon po mgar yos lor 'das rjes de nas sprel lo'i bar lo drug gi rang mgar gyi tsha bo zhang blon phra mo dang dbas mang zham sum snang gnyis kyis blon po byas/bya yi lo la mgar btsan