dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan|{phag gru sde srid khri rabs lnga pa 'di nyid rab byung drug pa'i shing stag (1374)lor yab shAkya rin chen dang yun zi na bzang gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/dgung lo bun par mkhan chen gzhon dbang pa'i drung du rab tu byung/mtshan grags pa rgyal mtshan dpal bzang por gsol/dgung lo brgyad par rtsed thang gi gdan sar phebs te tshogs pa lo bzhi bskyangs/dgung lo bcu gnyi pa rab byung drug pa'i shing glang (1385)lor phag gru'i khrir phebs/dgung lo bcu drug pa sa sbrul (1389)lor tA ming gong ma kyen 'un gyis dbang gi mtshan dang gser gyi dam kha phul/sde srid 'di nyid lugs gnyis kyi mkhyen sgo yangs shing/zhabs 'bring mi drag rnams bod snga rabs kyi chas lu bang po mi nyams gyon pa las hor chas sogs lung ma bstan gyi zhwa gos gyon pa rnams la mi mnyes shing/lhag par lo gsar sogs mdzad chen khag la nang blon mi drag rnams nas sngar bod rje chos rgyal skabs kyi chas gos rin chen rgyan cha gyon srol gsar 'dzugs gnang ba dang/gzhan yang thel dang rtsed thang gi sgom grwa bshad grwa rnams la bdag rkyen dge tshogs blos mi 'khyud cing/rje thams cad mkhyen pa/spyan snga kun spangs pa/mtshungs med rin gzhon/karma ba de bzhin gshegs pa sogs dam pa mang por chos gsan zhing gus mchod mdzad/dbus gtsang rdzong chen khag gi rdzong dpon lo bcad res bskor bya rgyu de rdzong chen rnams blon po che gras lami rgyud dang bcas pa shes su 'jug pa'i shel (460) dam gnang ste srid 'dzin lam lugs bcos bsgyur gyis rdzong gzhis sger bdag gnang bzang po'i spyod pa dang mi mthun na yid la shar tshad lag tu mi len pa'i rgyas btsan gtan na phab pa sogs las mchog dman gyi skye rgun mtha' dag nas gong ma cho sa rgyal chen po zhes mtshan dngos ming du chags pas de nas bzung mtshan gyi che bstod du gong ma chos rgyal chen po dang gnyis mos kyi gros chod dang blos blangs kyi gan rgya khag la lugs gnyis gong ma khrims bdag rin po che zhes rgyag rgyu'i srol tshugs grags pa rgyal mtshan mchog gis ris su ma chad pa'i grub mtha' mtha' dag gi dge 'dun gyi sde la bsnyen bkur dang kha che p