dbang grags pa 'byung gnas|{phag gru sde srid khri rabs drug pa 'di nyid rab byung bdun pa'i shing rta (1414)lor yab sangs rgyas rgyal mtshan dang yum kun dga' dpal 'dzoms gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/dgung lo bo lnga par rtsed thang gdan sar bzhugs/dgung lo bcu dgu pa rab byung bdun pa'i chu byi (1432)lor phag gru sde srid kyi khrir phebs/lugs zung gi mdzad pa rnams gong ma na rim gyi srol rgyu ma nyams par phyag bzhes gnang/de'i dus yar lung thel du dus zing langs te dus mi bde ba chen po byung/'di la shing stag (1434)lo'i sde gzar chen mo'am phag gru nang zhig gi lo yang zer/shing yos (1435)lor nas rin spungs pa'i shugs je rgyas dang phag gru'i mnga' thang cung zad nyams gud du song zhes gleng/me sbrul (1437)lor gong ma grags pa 'byung gnas skyid shod du phebs pa nas so ru dben sha chen pos gung mchod legs par mdzad/dus mi bde ba'i dbang gis gtsang phyogs su phebs ma thub/gong ma 'di'i skabs rtsed thang dang/rtse'i gtsug lag khang/lha khang chen mo/gser gyi bka' 'gyur sogs gsar bzhengs dang/nag chang gi khrims bsdams/sgrub mchod mang po btsugs/paN chen nags kyi rin chen dang/rgya ma spyan snga ba gzhon 'od/rgod phrug rags pa sogs dang/lhag par du mkhas grub dge legs dpal bzang dang/gsang sne'u'i chos rje rnam gnyis/dran chen dpon slob sogs la gus 'dud dang bdag rkyen che ba mdzad/rje 'di nyid kyang thugs rab che zhing gsang gas kyi mkhyen pa shin tu rgyas/byang phyogs kyi so kha srung ba'i phyir 'od yug gling dkar gyi rdzong brtsigs/'gos lo tsA ba gzhon nu dpal zhes rtsod med kyi mkhas pa chen po de yang gong ma 'di'i zhabs 'bring du rgyun ring bzhugs/srid kyi zhabs zhur rin spungs pa nor bu bzang po dang 'phyongs rgyas pa hor dkon mchog rin chen gnyis nas byas/rang byung bdun pa'i lcags sprel (1440)lor tA ming rkyen tha'i kreng thung rgyal pos dbang gi 'ja' sa phul/dgung lo so gnyis la phebs pa rab byung bdun pa'i shing glang (1445)lor sku gshegs/tshes lnga la gshegs pas spyan snga tshes lnga pa yang zhu/khyon srid lo bcu gnyis bskyangs}
dbang ngag dbang bkra shis grags pa rgyal mtshan|{phag gru sde srid khri rabs dgu pa 'di nyid rab byung brgyad pa'i sa sprel (1488)lor yab spyan snga ngag gi dbang po dang yum rdzong kha ma'i sras su 'khrungs/dgung (461) lo bcu gnyis pa rab byung brgyad pa'i sa lug (1499)lor phag gru sde srid kyi khri la phebs shing byi (1504)lor rin spungs nas sring mo zhig bdag mor phul ba de la sras 'gro ba'i mgon po 'khrungs dgung lo nyer gnyis par sde srid dang rin spungs la dpon blon dbar gyi 'khon gzhi'i 'go tshugs dgung lo nyer lnga par tA ming gong mas dbang gi mtshan phul rab byung dug pa'i chu rta (1522)lor rin spungs pasap+salarayang sde gzar tshan che bar bslangs kyang sde srid kyi mtshan jus la skyon ma byung rin spungs pa mtsho skyes rdo rjes dpon tshab thel gtong skabs rab byung brgyad pa'i sa rta (1498)lo nas lha sa smon lam chen mor se bas dge gsum gyi dge 'dun phebs mi chog pa bzos te de'i tshab tu nye 'dabs kyi bka' brgyud pa dang sa skya pa'i dgon khag nas dge 'dun pa phebs rgyu'i lam bzos pa de sde srid ngag dbang bkra shis grags pas rab byung dgu pa'i sa stag (1518)lor ser 'bras dge gsum gyi dge 'dun pa smon lam la phebs srol sngar rgyun bskyar gso gnang ba dang rgyal ba dge 'dun rgya mtsho so ltar smon lam gyi tshogs dbur gdan drangs 'bras spungs rdo khang sngon mo rgyal pa dge 'dun rgya mtshor phul ming dga' ldan pho brang du bsgyur sde sred 'di nyid kyi sku ring la rin spungs pa sogs kyis phag gru'i srid dbang la bsdo ba'i sde gzar mang tsam byung yod rung sde srid mchog lugs zung skyong stangs mkhas shing phan tshun mthun thabs gtso bzung mdzad pas sde srid kyi mtshan jus nyams pa cher ma byung rje 'dis gser chos kyi bka' bstan 'gyur ji snyed dang gos thang mang po gsar bzhengs kyis rnam dkar dge ba'i mdzad pa rgya cher spel chos lugs grub mtha'i zhen pa med par kun la bsnyen bkur zhabs tog mdzad srid lo drug cu lhag bskyangs shing dgung lo brgyad cu yas mas bzhugs}
