dbang rin chen chos rgyal|{dbang rin chen chos kyi rgyal po ni 'bri gung gi gdan sar dngos su ma bzhugs kyang chos brgyud la bka' drin che ba yin zhes ('bri gung gdan rabs gser phreng )du gsal zhing/rje 'di nyid ni gzhu smad mkhar thog gzhis su yab gdan rabs bcu gsum pa chos rgyal rin chen dpal bzang dang yum chos rgyal bzang mo'i sras su sa 'brug (1448)lor sku 'khrungs/gdan rabs bcu bzhi pa rin chen chos kyi rgyal mtshan dang yum mi gcig pa'i gcen po yin/dgung lo bcu gsum nas chos lung tshogs pa'i mkhas chen nyi ma rgyal mtshan bsten nas thun mong dang thun mong min pa'i rig gnas la sbyangs pa mthar phyin mdzad/dus de 'bri gung gi dbang byed phal cher bdud dbang du song nas 'chad nyan mdzad po nyer ma dar bas chos brgyud phal cher chad pa la rje 'dis sgrub brgyud kyi bstan pa nyams pa gso phyir dam gtsang mkhas grub rnams las khengs dregs spangs te mos gus kyis phyag chen lnga dang/na ro chos drug /'jig rten gsum mgon gyi zab chos ma lus pa sogs gsan bsam mdzad nas 'bri gung du phebs/mkhas shing grub pa'i dbang phyug tu gyur/stag lung pa'i gdung las byung ba'i rig ma zhig dang/khri khang pa'i rigs kyi rig ma zhig khab tu bzhes kyang gdung sras ma byung/gcung rin chen chos gyi rgyal mtshan sku gshegs rjes gdan sa'i khrir mnga' gsol yang ma phebs par bya bral gyi brtul zhugs kho na bzung/ming rgyal rabs kyi gong mas kyang shang gi lung las gnang/wang mkhar thog par grags/thub dbang gi gser sku dang bstan 'gyur sogs bzhengs par mdzad/skye bo mi bsun pa 'gas dug gi sbyor ba nang mchod du btab nas drangs par/kho bo dug lnga'i dug las rgyal ba la/'jig rten dug gis rdzi bar ga la nus/_/zhes sogs mgur gsungs nas dug gis ma thub/de nas 'bri gung byang chub gling rin po cher bzhugs/chos brgyad thams cad rgyal dbang kun dga' rin chen la gnang nas bstan pa gtad/bu slob gzhan la yang zhal bkod rgya che ba dang bcas bstsal te shing byi (1504)lor dgung grangs nga brgyad steng gzugs sku'i bkod pa bsdus so/_}
