dbal mang dkon mchog rgyal mtshan|{mdo smad rma g.yang phyug mo'i gzhung du yab dbang grags skyabs dang yum bde za lha mo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing sprel (1764)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo drug tu bkra shis 'khyil dgon du chos zhugs mdzad/rje 'jigs (466) med dbang po'i drung nas rab byung sdom pa bzhes te mtshan dkon mchog rgyal mtshan zhes bstsal dgung lo bdun lon skabs rgyud pa rgan bsam gtan seng ge nas klog bslabs dgung lo brgyad la 'don na yongs rdzogs thugs 'dzin grub dgung lo bcu gcig skabs chos grwar bzhugs na sa gzhung chen la gsan bzhes mdzad rdo rams pa tshul khrims seng ge dge rgan du bsten bsdus grwa blo rtags rtags rigs rang lugs grub mtha' rin chen phreng ba dge 'dun nyi shu mtha' dpyod chen mo gung ru'i rten 'brel drang nges rnam 'byed chen mo phar phyin skabs bzhi pa yan grub mtha' chen mo rnams thugs 'dzin gnang skabs 'di dag tu sku ches bkra pas brag ja dag gtor skam gyi bzhes thug bskol bzhugs gdan tsam yang med par nyin mtshan kun tu sa rjen la bzhugs gzim shag tu yang grang dus zla gam bzhes nas bzhugs las na bza' gzhan med pa sogs sku ngal chen po byang yang zhum pa med par thos bsam kho na la gzhol chu stag dgun chos la phar phyin ston mo mdzad dgung lo nyi shur phebs skabs bla ma ngag dbang rgya mtsho'i drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes dgung lo nyer gnyis thog smon lam rab 'byams pa'i grwa skor mdzad dgung lo nyer lngar gser khang gsar bzhengs kyi ched mtsho sngon khul la 'bul sdud la phebs bla ma blo bzang yar 'phel dang gtsang rab 'byams pa bstan pa dar rgyas gnyis la rtsis skor dang mer rgan chos rjes sogs kyi drung nas dbyangs can sgra mdo'i rim mo lag bris bslabs skabs mtshams nam 'grig la dpe mtshams dang bsnyen pa las rung 'ga' zhig gnang dgung lo nyer dgu'i thog rdo rams pa'i mtshan rtags bzhes dgung lo sum cur rgyud pa'i khrir phebs dgung lo so bzhir kun mkhyen 'jigs med dbang po'i yang srid ched lha sar phebs rgyal dbang paN chen rnam gnyis kyi gser zhal mjal te chos 'brel dang tre bo khri chen blo bzang bkra shis ba ri dge bshes khyab bdag bkras lhun yongs 'dzin zhal snga rnam gnyis sogs las bka' chos rgyun dkon mang du gsan sa rta lor mdo smad du chibs bsgyur de nas mdzod dge dgon gsar rab rgyas gling gsar 'debs kyi rdo rje slob dpon du bskos sku gsung thugs rten dang mchod rdzas gsar bsgrigs rnam grangs du ma bzhengs gzhan yang dgon sde mang por sgrub mchod du ma gsar 'dzugs gtor thebs dang spyi mchog mang 'gyed 'tshem lus med par gnang dgung lo zhe gcig nas zhe drug bar bkra shis 'khyil gyi khri thog nyi shu rtsa bzhi'i thugs 'gan bzhes dgung lo zhe bdun na lnga bcur bar rab rgyas gling dgon pa'i khrir bzhugs dgung lo nga gcig nas don lnga'i bar a chog dgon nas bstan 'phel gling gi khri 'dzin mdzad de so sor mdo sngags kyi 'chad nyan sgrib lam dag ther dang bcos bsgyur yang yang mdzad de bshad sgrub bstan pa'i rkang tshugs byang gru gu nas lho zi khron bar dgon sde dang ri khrod sogs lag zab rgyas kyi chos 'khor shin tu rgya cher bskor (bkra shis 'khyil gyi gdan rabs )dang (rje bla ma dgon mchog rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po'i rnam thar thar 'dod 'jug ngogs/) (grub mtha'i dril lan phyogs lhung mun sel/) (mdo sde rgyan gyi 'grel pa thub bstan rgyas pa'i me tog/) (lta ba'i zin bris 'od zer stong 'bar/) (rje btsun dkon mchog bstan pa'i sgron me'i rnam thar dad pa'i pad mo bzhad pa'i nyin byed/) (rten 'brel bstod pa'i TIk+ka rin chen ljon shing/) (bde lam zin bris nyang gi me long )sogs bka' rtsom pod bcu gnyis tsam mdzad sku gsung thugs rten bgrang gis mi lang pa gsar bzhengs gnang snga lo nas na bzang dang nyer spyad 'gangs chen ji yod spong thag gi tshul du 'gyed btang ste dgung lo (467) dgu bcu la phebs par rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu glang (1853)lo'i bod zla drug pa'i yar tshes la bsam bzhin du gzugs sku'i bkod pa bsdus tshul bstan}
dbas rgyal to re stag rna can|{(sbas stag rna can zhes pa'ang snang )'di nyid rgyal po glang dar ma'i blon po gtso bo yin/rgyal po khri ral pa can gyi sku dus su 'di nyid kyis blon chen po bran ka dpal yon dang btsan po khri ral pa can gyi btsun mo dpal gyi ngang tshul ma lkog tu nyam bshams so zhes phra ma bcug nas khrims la sbyar te mthar blon chen po byang thang du bkums pa dang gzhi med kyi phra ma der btsun mo yid mug ste pho brang gi yang steng nas mchongs te rang srog lcebs/de nas mo ma dang phywa mkhan rnams la ngan skul byas te btsan po'i gcen po lha sras gtsang ma 'dir bzhugs na rgyal khrims 'jig pas spyugs dgos zer nas mon du spyugs/mthar dbas to re la sogs pas rgyal po khri rab pa can zhal rtag par gcus nas bkrongs pa sogs de ni rgyal po glang dar ma'i skabs sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa snub mkhan gyi ngan skul mkhan dang gdong len pa zhig yin no/_}
dbas ta ra khong lod|{(stag sgra khong lod )(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dag ston )nang blon po 'di btsan po khri 'dus srong gi blon po yin par gsungs kyang/tun hong nas thon pa'i gter yig nang/blon po 'dis rgyal po khri lde gtsug brtan gyi dus su yos lo'i dgung dus nas 'brug lo'i nang bar lo gcig ma lon tsam blon po byas nas bkyon phab (khrims chad bcad pa'i don )par bshad/thang rgyal rabs kyi yig tshang rnying pa las/thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ma zhon tsung gi khe yon khri lo bco lnga pa me yos (727)lor bod kyi dmag dpon chen po stag sgra khong lod dang 'bro lung mang po rje gnyis kyis bkwa' kre'o mkhar la dmag drangs te yul sde mnga' 'og tu bsdus/de dus blon po stag gra khong lod snyan grags che ba'i dbang gis/gong mas hi zhi sa cha'i ce tu'u hrir bskos pa'i pin pu'u hrang hru'u yi go gnas yod pa dpon chen zho sung gis sa gnas gang sar blon stag sgra khong lod ni thang dang ngan 'brel yod tshul gyi 'jal gtam bkram pas btsan po thugs dogs skyes te blon po stag gra khong long bod dub skong nas srog thog btang bar bshad pa khungs dag par mngon}
