dbu can|{bod yig gi yig gzugs rnams kyi thog ma ste/yi ge rnams la 'phred du bcad pa'i mgo yod pa'i dbang gis ming de ltar btags/dbu can gyi yig gzugs la li lugs dang ldan lugs gnyis yod pa'i nang nas li lugs ni nyams zin nas lo brgya phrag mang po song zhing/ldan lugs ni rgyal po khri srong lde btsan skabs kyi lo tsA ba ldan ma rtse mangs kyi phyag rgyun yin pa dang/de yang rjes su bzo dbyibs gcig tu ma nges par brten/khyung po g.yu khris thig ris gtan 'khel mdzad/de yang 'gyur ba byung nas gcig tu ma mes pa'i dbang gis dus rabs bco lnga pa'i 'khor rgya rtse sde srid rab brtan kun bzang 'phags pas bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur bzhengs pa dang stabs bstun skabs de'i yig mkhan mkhas pa yod tshad bsdus nas 'bru chen dang 'bru chung gi thig bshad brtsams nas sngar las zhib chags che ba'i thig tshad lag rgyun dar spel btang/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa (468) 'brug (1688)lor sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos gong gsal thig bshad de la 'grel pa brtsams te (bai DUr+ya g.ya' sel )gyi nang bkod gnang mdzad dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i 'gor sku 'bum che shes rin po che sku phreng 'di pa'i gong ma blo bzang byang chub tan pa'i sgron mes kyang yig ris sna tshogs kyi dpe rin dpar bskrun mdzad pa da lta sku 'bum che shos bla brang du bzhugs mus su yod}
