dbu ra'i stong sde bcu|{(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston (nang gsal ba ltar na/dor sde (dog sde )sde mtshams gnyis/phyugs mtshams 'brang mtshams gnyis/com pa 'bri mtshams gnyis/skyid stod (dbus stod )skyid smad (lha sa nas chu shur bar/) yel rab bcas las tun hong gi yig char thog ra zing po rje stag skya bo'i mnga' khongs su yel rab sde bzhi bya ba yod pa rjes su zing po rje'i blon po gnyan 'dzi zung gis ngo log byas te zing po rje khri bang gsum la ngo ltas nas stag skya bo bsad nas yul yel bar sde bzhi dang klum ya gsum bcas zing po rje khri bang gsum gyi mnga' khongs su bsdus/rjes su zing po rje'i bran myang tseng sku sogs mi bzhi zing po rjer ngo log nas stag ri gnyan gzigs lam go btags zhus pa kho tshos thabs jus bton pa'i 'og gnam ri srong btsan gyis dmag drangs te zing po ja khri bang gsum gtor ba/yul gyi ming 'phan yul du btags pa/myang sogs mi bzhi la zing po rje'i yul bran sogs mang po bya dgar sprad nas (470) blon po'i nang du bcug pa sogs zhib par tun hong nas thon pa'i lo rgyus yig cha le'u bzhi par gsal zhing (blon po bka' thang )las yel zhabs stong chung bran ka'i stong sde yin zhes kyang gsal ba'i bran kan ni 'phan yul du yod pa'i rus rgyud tsho pa zhig yin par (jo bo rje'i rnam thar chen mo )las gsungs}
