dbyig gnyen|{(slob dpon dbyig gnyen )'di slob dpon 'phags pa thogs med dang yum gcig pa'i gcung po yin cing yab ni bram ze'i rigs yin/slob dpon 'phags pa thogs med rab tu byung ba'i phyi lo der 'khrungs/chung ngu'i dus na len+d+ra dgon par rab tu byung/theg pa chung ngu'i sde snod gsum cha tshang bar slob sbyong gnang/da dung kha che'i yul du byon nas slob dpon dge 'dun bzang po'i drung du thag pa chung ngu'i grub mtha' rigs mi 'dra ba bco brgyad dang mu stegs kyi lta ba rigs mi 'dra ba drug gi rig pa'i gzhung lugs mtha' dag khung du chod par mdzad de yul dbus ma g+ha d+har byon/slob dpon 'phags pa thogs med kyi drung du theg pa chen po'i chos mtha' dag gsan/skabs der mi yul du yod pa'i sangs rgyas kyi bka' theg pa che chung gi mdo da kun bsdoms par mdo lnga brgya tsam thugs lab zung nas lo rer thengs re blo thog nas zhal 'don gnang/slob dpon 'di theg pa chen po'i chos la zhugs pa'i shugs rkyen lab rten nas theg pa chung ngu'i mkhas pa lnga brgya tsam theg pa chen po'i chos la zhugs/rgyun du sa gnas gzhan dag tu ma byon par ma g+ha d+ha rang du bzhugs nas chos 'chad nyan dang lha khang rnying pa rnams nyams gso zhus/theg pa chen po'i chos gzhi brgya dang brgyad gsar du btsugs/rgya gar shar phyogs o Ti bi shar thengs gcig byon nas zla ba gsum lhag tsam ring chos gsungs shing/chos gzhi brgya rtsa brgyad gsar du btsugs/rgya gar lho phyogs kyi rgyud du ma phebs kyang bka' bsgos te chos gzhi mang po btsugs pa bcas bsdoms na chos gzhi drug brgya dang lnga bcu rtsam bzhi tshugs zhes grags/slob (478) dpon 'di bzhugs pa'i dus su rgya gar shar lho dbus sogs su yod pa'i slob ma theg pa chen po'i dge slong gcig pu bsdoms na yang khri drug tsam dang slob dpon nyid dang mnyam du gnas pa'i dge slong yang stong phrag longs pa yod sku tshe'i smad du slob ma mkhas pa stong phrag lnga tsam mnyam du khrid nas bal po'i yul du byon nas chos gsungs pa dang chos gzhi btsugs pa sogs mdzad mthar dge slong zhig gis rab tu byung ba'i chas yan bzhin du zhing rmo ba gzigs pa'i rkyen byas te bal yul du sku gshegs der slob ma rnams kyis mchod rten yang bzhengs dgung lo brgya ma zin tsam bzhugs slob dpon 'dis mdzad pa'i bstan bcos ha cang yang po yod kyang grags che zhing bod skad du bsgyur ba'i gras la ('phags pa sgo drug pa'i gzungs kyi rnam par bshad pa/) (chos bzhi pa'i mdo'i rnam par bshad pa/) (sa bcu pa'i mdo'i rnam par bshad pa )'di gsum bstan 'gyur mdo phyogs pod (ngi)par yod blo gros mi zad pa'i mdo rnam par bshad pa )bstan bcos 'gyur mdo phyogs pod (ci)par yod (bzang spyod smon lam gyi mdo'i 'grel pa )bstan 'gyur mdo phyogs pod (nyi)par yod (mdo sde brgyan gyi 'grel pa )bstan 'gyur mdo phyogs (phi )par yod (dbus dang mtha' rnam par 'byed pa'i 'grel pa )dang (chos dang chos nyin rnam 'byed kyi 'grel pa )'di gnyis bstan 'gyur dom phyogs skor pod (bi)par yod (sum cu pa'i tshig le'ur byas pa/) (nyi shu pa'i tshig ler byas pa/) (de'i rang 'grel/) (rang bzhin gsum nges par bstan pa/) (phung po lnga'i bar byed pa/) (rnam bshad rigs pa/) (las grub pa'i rab byed/) (theg pa chen po'i chos brgya gsal ba'i sgo ba'i bstan bcos )'di rnams bstan 'gyur mdo phyogs (shi)par yod (chos mngon pa mdzod kyi rtsa ba )dang (de'i rang 'grel )bstan 'gyur mdo phyogs pod (gu)(ngu) gnyis la yod 'di rnams nas re gnyis ma gtogs mang che ba rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus lo tsA ba zhang ye shes sdes bod skad du bsgyur ba yin slob dpon 'di'i lo rgyus skor bu ston rin po ches mdzad pa'i (bu ston chos 'byung )dang jo nang tA ra nA thas brtsams pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )le'u nyi shu rtsa gnyis par gsal gzhan yang slob dpon 'di la snga rjes gnyis byung skor (deb ther ser po )las gsal zhing yang rgyal po lha tho tho ri gnyan btsan dang dus mnyam zhes grags pa yang 'thad do zhes (rgya nag chos 'byung )shog grangs 159par gsal}
