dbyin 'gog 'thab rtsod|{bod rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing 'brug (1904)lor dbyin ji btsan rgyal ring lugs pa'i btsan 'dzul dmag bod du lhags shing/bod rigs (479) mi dmangs tshos btsan rgol 'thab 'dzing byas kyang ching rgyal rabs srid gzhung nas dbyin ji btsan 'dzul par rgol lan sprod pa'i rgyab skyor nus ldan ma byas stabs mthar dbyin dmag lha sar yong ste lha sa'i byang ngos tshes gsum thang du sgar babs tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa dbyin dmag lha sar ma 'byor gong nas nang sar nyen g.yol du phebs dbyin ji ba'i rta dmag dang rkang dmag rnams sbyong brdar yin khul gyis 'jig skul dgu ngoms byas bod phyogs nas lha sa'i shar phyogs 'brom thod dang bde chen tshal gung thang sogs nas 'dod dmag (sa zhing rkang 'don gzhir bzung bskul ba'i dmag mi (sum stong tsam bsdu rub kyis dbyin dmag la kha gtad gcog rgyu'i gra sgrig byas nyin zhig bod sa gnas kyi dbang 'dzin pa dang dbyin dmag 'go pa gros mos byed skabs se ra'i grwa pa dben cha nga dmar ris zhes pas gri dpa' dam zhig 'khyer te tshes gsung thang gi dbyin dmag sgar sar 'dzul rjes dmag dpon gcig dang dmag mi 'ga' shes bsad smad btang nas gri 'dzin byed bzhin phyir 'gro skabs gur thag la rkang pa 'khon te ril stabs dbyin dmag gis bzung zhing grwa sa ga nas yin min 'dri skabs lan tshig gcig kyang ma btag pa ma zad dbyin jir dga' nye brten mkhan 'ga' shes kyis grwa sa ga nas yin dogs dgos tshul 'jam rtsub sna tshogs kyis 'dri skabs khyed tshos spa phrug re gyon nas shog ngas bshad chog (khyod tsho bud med dang 'dra bas skyes pa'i snying stobs med zer ba'i don yin )ces brjod bzhin par sdang mig blta ba dang yas sos ma mchu mnan zhing bsdad par brten dbyin btsan dpon dmag rjes rgyugs pa bcas bya thabs bral nas dmar gsod btang de nyid dgong mo dang phyi nyin lha sa gtsug lag khang che chung du ser skya mang tshogs ha cang mang pos rang mos ngang gser kong brje ba dang mchod thig rgyag pa bsngo ba zhu ba sogs byas 'dug skabs der lha sa'i khrom gzhung du yig bskyur yang mang po sbyar nas dbyin ji dang 'brel ba mi chog pa