'ba'|{de snga'i bod sa gnas srid gzhung gis khrims lugs thog gnyan 'bebs byas don du/kha gtad phyogs gnyis bar dpang po yod pa'i gan rgya bzhag zin rjes de dang 'gal ba'i bya spyod byung na 'ba' nyes zhes pa gan rgya'i nang don dang 'gal mkhan gyi mi der dngul gyi nyes chad gcod kyi yod/de la nyes pa che chung rim pa bcu gsum yod pa'i nang nas 'dir nyes chad mtho shos ang dang po dang/dma' shos ang bcu gsum pa gnyis dpe mtshon du bkod na/khrims 'degs ang dang por/kha btags nang mdzod legs pa (rin srang 2 8/) sman rtse rnying pa yug gcig (rin srang 13/) gos chen rgyan bzhi kha nyi shu tham pa yod pa yug gcig (rin srang 33/) rgya zab yug gsum (rin srang 113/) la dwa legs pa kha drug yod pa yug gcig (rin srang 1 5/) ja chung byugs 'khor drug la khal lnga dang nyag lnga longs pa/(rin srang 10 13/) ras chen yug gcig (rin srang 1 2/) smyug gu'i rin srang 2 9bcas bsdoms srung brgyad bcu rgya gnyis dang zho gsum skar phyed bdun drug /khrims 'degs ang bcu gsum par/kha btags (rin srung 0 5/) sman rtse (rin srang 1 35/) la dwa yug gsum (rin srang 0 9/) ka dan sgrim ma yug gcig (rin dngul srang 0 15/) snag tsha rin sring 0 7/) smyu gu'i rin srang 0 1/) khyon srang gsum skar phyed brgyad thob kyi yod/khrims 'debs rim pa so so'i dngul 'bab thob che chung gi gnas tshul zhib par de sngon bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi gsher khang las khungs kyi khrims 'debs deb nang gsal bas der gzigs}
'ba' rom pa dar ma dbang phyug|{'ba' rol pa bka' brgyud kyi srol gtod pa po/rje 'di nyid yab ston pa 'byung gnas bla gros dang yum jo mo lo chung ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung gnyis pa'i me lug (1127)lor 'phan yul gyi dka' ba yul sna zhes par sku 'khrungs/mtshan 'bum skyabs gsol/gdung lo brgyad la phebs skabs mkhan po ka ba dar ma seng ge dang/slob dpon dbang phyug gzhon nu gnyis la rab tu byung/mtshan dam pa dbang byug gsol/dge bshes bya yul ba dang/po to ba'i bu chen grub 'bu lung pa la bka' gdams kyi chos skor rnams gsan/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa gnyis pa phebs skabs sgam por phebs shing/de nas bzung rje sgam po ba dang bla slob tu gyur te bka' brgyud kyi chos rnams bum pa gang byo'i tshul du gnang/dka' tshegs med par rtogs pa cig car du 'khrungs/dgung lo nyer brgyad lor byang 'ba' rom du phebs nas lo bdun gyi bar du sgrub pa mdzad cing/phal cher ting nge 'dzin gyis dngos su 'tsho (482) ba byung de skabs bka' brgyud kyi bla ma'i gsol 'debs sogs mgur chen nyi shu rtsa dgu'i skor rnams gsungs la stod byang du 'ba' rol gyi dgos pa phyag btab rab byung gsum pa'i lcags sbrul (1161)lor nag chu'i sa char ri bo che btab bde stong phyag rgya chen po dang gnas lugs phyag rgya chen po mdo sngags zung 'brel gyis nyams bzhes mdzad pas slob ma mang du 'dus pa de nas 'bar rom bka' brgyud ces pa'i grub mtha' dar mthar dgu ngalo bdun cu rtsa gsum pa rab byung gsum pa'i sa lug (1199)lo'i zla ba gnyis pa'i tshes gnyis kyi nam phyed la ngo mtshar ba'i ltas du ma dang bcas te zhi bar gshegs so/_/'ba' rol gyi gdan sa de khong gi gdung rgyud ram pas bskyangs kyang mthar nang ma 'tshams pas rim gyis nyams par gyur}
