'bras bu'i bon rigs lnga|{'di'i 'grel bshad zhib pa zhig sngon chad ma mthong bas (thu'u bkwan grub mtha' )las gsungs pa ltar rkang grangs tsam smos na/1 dge bsnyen/2 a dkar/3 drang srong/4 ye gshen bcas bzhi'i steng khyad par chen po'i theg pa gcig bsnan pas lnga yin pa dang dge bsnyen la (snod bcud 'byung rdzogs kyi mdo sde )sogs dang/a dkar la rgyud lung du ma yod pa dang/drang srong la 'bum sde bzhi/ye gshen la sems lung sde bzhi/khyad par chen po'i theg pa la man ngag sde lnga yod/rgyu'i bon bzhis gzung 'dzin gyi rtog pa cha bzhi spong/dge bsnyen dang drang srong gnyis kyis nyon sgrib sbyongs/a dkar dang ye gshen gnyis kyis shes sgrib sbyong/khyad par bla na med pa'i theg pas lhan skyes rtsa ba nas gcod/yang na rgyu'i bon bzhis bskal pa du mar sbyangs pas mos spyod kyi sa bzhi thob/dge bsnyen dang drang sog gis bskal pa grangs med gsum la lam bgrod nas thar pa thob/a dkar dang ye gshen gnyis kyis skye ba gcig sha thar pa thob/khyad par bla na med pa'i theg pas tshe gcig nyid la bon sku thob ces bshad do zhes gsungs pa'i mjug tsam la lta sgom dang theg pa sogs kya 'dod tshul 'di dag yul mang mkhar gsang ba'i bon phug tu/stag gzig /rgya dkar nag /bod la sogs pa'i rig 'dzin mkhas pa mtha' dag 'dus nas/bon gyi sgo mo brgyad khri bzhi stong las bsdus pa'i (gsang sngags rdzong 'phrang nyi 'od rgyan )zhes bya ba las 'byung ba ltar bris zhes gsungs 'dug}
'bras bla spyi|{'bras spungs sogs dgon pa che ba 'ga' zhig gi nang chos khrims dang/srid 'dzin gyi bdag (493) gnyer byed mkhan rim pa mtho shos rnams mnyam du gros bsdur byed pa'i tshogs 'du'i ming yin tshogs 'du de'i nang grwa tshang khab so so'i mkhan po dang tshogs chen dbu mdzad tshogs chen zhal ngo gnyis spyi so rgan gzhon tA la'i bla ma'i pho brang ('bras spungs pho brang sde pa )gi do dam bcas zhugs dgos}
'bras blo gling dge bshes ngag dbang chos grub|{mtshan gzhan gdan ma stong phud zhu ba mchog ni rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags stag (1890)lor khams ldan ma khul du sku 'khrungs/sku chung dus dbus su phabs nas 'bras spungs blo gsal gling du chos zhugs mdzad/ldan pa blo chos sogs dge ba'i bshes gnyen du ma'i zhabs la gtugs nas gzhung chen la slob gnyer gnang/rjes su lha rams pa'i grwa skor mdzad nas mkhas pa'i grags pa thob/dgung lo nga lnga tsam la sbyin bdag gis gdan zhus ltar rgya nag ri bo rtse lngar phebs nas chos 'khor rgya cher bskor/bka' rtsom (tshul dang tshun ma yin pa rnam par 'byed pa'i bstan bcos rig pa'i nyin byed )(chos kyi dbyangs gsal bar 'byed pa'i gtam klu sgrub dgongs rgyan )dang de'i rang 'grel sogs mdzad/dgung lo drug cu la phebs pa rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa glang (1949)lor sku gshegs}
'bras mi nyag mkhan sprul blo bzang skal ldan|{rje 'di ni spyi lo'i sa rabs bcu dgu pa'i nang khams mgar thang du sku 'khrungs/sku chung ngu'i dus su mi nyag skyid lags dgon du chos zhugs kyis yi ge 'bri klog dang gzhung la gsan bsam mdzad/de nas dbus su byon te mkhas mchog khri rin po che ngag dbang nor bu mchog dang/ke'u tshang blo bzang bstan 'dzin yar rgyas/gling sprul blo bzang lung rtogs bstan 'dzin 'phrin las sogs mkhas grub du ma'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/rtsom pa la yang thugs rab phyogs te/(yi dam spyi 'gro'i tshogs mchod dang de'i dam tshig gi rim pa rgyas par bshad pa tshogs gnyis rin po che 'dren pa'i shing rta/) (rta mgrin gsang sgrub kyi 'phrin las kyi byang bu gsang gtam snying gter dang de'i bsnyen yig rjes gnang/) (slob dpon rin po che la brten pa'i bla ma'i rnal 'byor ram bla mchod cho ga )sogs mang du mdzad/'khrungs 'das kyi lo tshigs zhib cha mi gsal}
'bras gzugs bcu gcig|{dbang po gzugs can lnga/de'i gzung don lnga/chos kyi skye mched pa'i gzugs so/_}
'bras gsum|{gong gi 'bras ba gsum zhes pa dang don gcig }
'bri gung bka' brgyud|{skyob pa 'jig rten mgon po rin chen dpal gyis rab byung gsum pa'i sa phag (1179)lor 'bri gung mthil gyi dgon pa btab/de nas bzung gnas ne de'i chos brgyud ni sa ming chos la thogs pas 'bri gung bka' brgyud ces pa'o/_}
'bri gung skyob pa 'jig rten mgon po|{yongs grags su 'bri gung skyob pa rin po che la mtshan de ltar 'bod srol dang/lo rgyus yig cha khag gi nang mtshan 'bod srol mi 'dra rab kha shas 'dug /rang byung gnyis pa'i chu phag (1143)lo nas rab byung bzhi pa'i me glang (1217)lo bar dgung lo don lnga bzhugs/'khrungs yul mdo khams 'bri klung dam pa cho sa phyug gi yul tsa ra stod g.yon lung gi grong/yab sngags 'chang rdo rje dang yum btsun ma gnyis kyi sras su 'khrungs/mtshan btsun pa skyabs su thogs/dgung lo drug nas bzung yi ge 'bri klog mkhas par mkhyen/dgung lo nyer lnga pa me phag gi lo la phag mo grub pa dang mjal nas chos mang po gsan/dgung lo so lnga pa la gung thang bla ma zhang gis mkhan po dang slob dpon rtsi lung pas las slob mdzad de bsnyen rdzogs gnang/dgung lo so bdun pa rab byung (494) gsum pa'i sa phag (1179)lor 'bri gung gi mthil gyi dgon pa btab te gnas gzhi bzung de nas dar spel byung ba'i chos brgyud la 'bri gung bka' brgyud zer gsung rtsom gang yod phyogs bsgrigs kyis gsung 'bum pod lnga yod lo rgyus zhib par ri bo che dpon tshang tshe dbang rgyal gyis brtsams pa'i (lho rong chos 'byung )shog grangs 282rjes kyi shog grangs kha shas dang (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )le tshan (pha)pa'i shog grangs 4nas 7bar gsal}
'bri gung khri dpon|{'bri gung skyob pa 'jig rten mgon pos rab byung gsum pa'i sa phag (179) lo la 'bri gung dgon pa btab rjes gnang sa pa rim par byung ba'i lnga pa gcung rin po che'i dus su sgom pa la khri dpon gyi 'ja' sa thob pa nas byar dwags po tshun la lung bsgyur/dpon chen gsum gyi ring sa skya pa dang 'thab cing/thog mar rgyal pham spel mar byung zhing thog kha rin chen seng ges 'bri gung gi gdan sa byed pa'i dus su stod hor gyi rgyal po hu li'i hu'i dmag dpung bod du khrid nas sa skyar dmag drangs pa'i lan du sa skya'i dpon chen ang len gyis hu pi li se chen han gyi rgyal sras thi mur b+ho kha'i dmag dpung dang khri skor gyi dmag dpung 'bri gung du drangs te 'bri gung gling log byas pa nas bzung mnga' khongs kyis cha phal cher sa skya ba'i lag tu shor/chos rje nyer brgyad pa'i dus su si tu shAkya bzang pos sgom pa'i sa las ka bzung ste khri khang lhun grub gling brtsigs/sa skya ba'i steng du tA sis dmag drangs skabs dpung rogs gtong ba sogs byas/skabs re si tu byang chub rgyal mtshan dang ma mthun par shAkya btsan gyi bu gnyis gros bstun nas 'ol kha stag rtse la bslus brtsams pa shAkya btsan gyis shes rjes si tu byang rgyal la zhus par brten bu gnyis chu la bskyur/phyis su tA si byang rgyal gyis/nga'i mgo dang stag mgo /sga rtse gsum yod pa shAkya btsan gyi drin yin zhes zer skad/'bri gung chos kyi rgyal po'i dus su rdzong ji bsod nams rin chen gyis dpon gyi khur bzung ba na bya ba gang yin gyong po'i stobs kyis skyong ba dang/khyung po ru ba dang/rong pa sogs bcom zhing/bar byed mkhan su byung yang mi nyan par}
'bri gung grub dbang dkon mchog 'phrin las|{gong du grub dbang dkon mchog 'phrin las dpal bzang po zhes par gzigs}
'bri gung rgyal ba rin chen phun tshogs|{'bri gung gdan rabs bcu drug pa 'di nyid gzhu'i sa cha las sku gnyer sgang zhes par yab bstan pa'i rgyal ma tshan dang yum bsod nams sgrol ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung dgu pa'i sa sbrul (1509)lor sku bltams/dgung lo brgyad pa la gnas sa thel du zhwa dmar bi pa chos kyi grags pas mkhan po dang las slob dus sgo sogs kha bskong grangs tshang gi dbus su bar ma rab byung du bsgrubs/mtshan rin chen phun tshogs kyi rgyal po rgyal por gsol/de nas 'phyongs rgyas su rje zhwa dmar bzhi pa dang lhan cig phebs/rje de las gsar ma'i rgyud 'bum la sogs pa gsang sngags kyi chos skor dum dang/dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i dbang chen sogs dbang rjes gnang mang po gsan/yar 'on/'phyong rgyas/sne'u gdong rtse rnams su lo bzhi'i bar bzhugs/de nas spun drug rdzong/yar bon/bkra shis do kha /gser la sogs brgyud stong lung bde chen dang yangs pa can du phebs/mtshungs med d+harma kirti'i drung du dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i rdzogs rim rnams gsan pa'i tshe du ba la sogs rtags bcu mngon du gyur/dgung lo bcu gsum par 'phags ma yin bzhin 'khor lo'i bsnyen sgrub gnang ba'i tshe yid bzhin nor mchog gi gdams pa rnams byung/de ltar lo bdun gyi bar yangs (495) can nyid du bzhugs nas rje zhwa dmar bzhi pa sogs yongs 'dzin du ma bsten cing gsang sngags kyi dbang rjes gnang du ma karma zhwa dmar nag na rim gyi bka' 'bum gzhan yang gdams pa'i chos mang du gsan gsar rnying rgyud sde'i bskyed rdzogs dkyil dbang las rab 'byams sogs rdo rje slob dpon gyi bya ba dang sgra kA la pa dang dus 'khor gyi rtsis sogs la sbyang pa mdzad pas thogs med du mkhyen dgung lo bcu drug pa la rgyal ba kun dga' rin chen gyi drung du mos gus srog 'khor dbang khrid zhal gdams bcas pa dang phyag rgya chen po lnga ldan dgun chos skabs zab lam nA ro chos drug gi khrid gsan cing ras phud mdzad pas sgrub rgyud rin po che'i lam 'dir nges shes nyams myong gi gnas lugs kyi rtogs pa'i don mngon du gyur dgung lo nyi shu pa sa byi (1528)lor chos lung tshogs pa'i mkhan chen grags pa rgyal mtshan dang slob dpon bsod nams dpal bzang gsang ston grub chen tshe 'phel bzang po sogs kha bskong grangs tshang gi dbus su bsnyen par rdzogs pa'i sdom pa bzhes lo der 'bri gdan chos srid kyi khril mnga' gsol gangs ti se la phyi tsA ri tra sogs gnas gsum gyi rdo rje 'dzin pa'i khri pa bsko gzhag dang dbyar chos dgun chos sogs sngar srol je rgyas rje skyob pa'i thugs dam thun mong ma yin pa bcom ldan 'das 'khor lo sdom pa lhan skyes lha lnga'i dkyil chog mdzad pa dam pa'i chos dgongs pa gcig pa'i gsungs par bzhengs te rgya ches spel ba sogs 'bri bstan la bya ba rlabs che yi dam chos srung rnams kyi bsnyen sgrub gnang zhing khyad par rgya ston dbon po rig 'dzin gsang ba las 'jam dpal gshin rje gshed kyi skor ji snyed pa gsan bsnyen sgrub mdzad pa'i tshe rtags mtshan gzhung dang mthun pa mngon du gyur grub chen dzA hi pir gyi dngos slob gu ru badzra nA tha las rlung khrid kyi gdams pa gsan te nyams su bzhes pa'i tshe sku lus lhar bsgyur ba dang mdun mkhar rnam bzhi'i mgon gyi tshogs gzigs shing 'gro drug gi bya spyod dang sems rgyud gsal bar mkhyen pa sogs ltas ngo mtshar ba byung dgung lo nyer drug la phebs pa shing rta (1534)lor rje rin chen rnam rgyal phyi ma de nyid gdan khrir mnga' gsol nas rje nyid gzhung smad spro lung du bzhugs de nas bstan 'gro'i don 'ba' zhig thugs dbus su 'chang ste thub bstan chos grwa chen po yangs ri sgar gyi lcog grwa 'dus sde 'dzugs par mdzad bde mgon gyi las rim gzhung sogs la gdangs dbyangs mdzad cing gar dbyangs gyi rnam bzhag sogs dar de nas sgar pa dang bcas rgyal shod a la rngod gangs shod rnams su phebs nas gang la gang 'dul chos kyi bdud rtsis tshim par gnang zla dgon du phebs te lugs gnyis kyi sgo nas dgon gnas nyams pa gsos shing sgrub brgyud 'di nyid kyi ring lugs dar bar mdzad snga phyir mnga' ris rig 'dzin bdud 'joms rdo rje las gyang lugs bka' brgyad bde 'dus bla ma dgongs 'dus byang gter sogs dang rgya ma mi 'gyur kun dga' dpal las yang bskyar bka' brgyad dang snying thig ya bzhi sogs dang mnga' ris paN chen las kyang sngar 'gyur gyi chos mang gsan cing khyad par bka' brgyud bde 'dus gyi dbang sgrub khro rol gar 'cham sogs phyag bzhes mdzad pas dus de nas bstan pa gnyis ldan gyi bdag por gyur de nas dam chos dgongs pa yang zab kyi chos skor rnams rim gyis 'babs par mdzad zhi khro'i lha dbang chen mo dang mkha' 'gro snying thig nA ro'i chos drug dzA har pir gyi rlung gi nyams len sogs la khrid yag bcas dang mgon po phyag bzhi pa'i gtor bzlog bya mgo ma sogs drang nges kyi bstan bcos mang po mdzad bod khams bde thabs su lha sar cha rags la rab gnas chu bzlog jo bo rin po cher brtan bzhugs (496) bsam yas sogs mtha' dul yang 'dul gyi gtsug lag khang rnams la rab gnas mchod 'bul smon lam mdzad par yang nas yang du phebs hor jing ger gyis spyan drangs par 'dam gzhung 'khor tsha'i sde rnams su lan 'ga' phebs 'bri hor mchod yon gyi sku rim dang mtha' dmag bzlog phyir khro rol gyi gtor bzlog sogs kyang gnang khri thog rim chen rnam rgyal paN chen dpal gyi rgya mtsho mkhan slob chos gsum bla ma grwa slob rnams la dus kun rgyal ba ri gung pa'i zab chos spyi dang gsar rnying gi dbang chos bsam gyis mi khyab pa bstsal skabs shig phag rga dpon blon nang 'khrugs te dus zing che ba byung bar rje nyid sne gdong du spyan drangs pas gong ma mes dbon la lugs gnyis kyi thugs bzhed bskangs nas 'bri gung du phebs snga rjes su grwa rab bkra shis chos rdzong gter sgrom bkra shis gangs ra bsam yas sa sbug 'phrang po o rgyan chos rdzong byang gling gi nub ngos yangs ri'i mtshams grwa bcas sgrub sde du ma btab slob ma la mtshon na chos srid kyi rgyal tshab dam pa rin chen rnam rgyal grags pa rgyal mtshan paN chen rin chen bsod nams dpal gyi rgya mtsho rje nyid kyi rigs sras chos rgyal phun tshogs sogs grangs kyis mi lang ba byung mthar dgung lo zhe dgu la phabs pa rab byung dug pa'i me sprul (1557)lor zhi bar gshegs}
'bri gung che tshang dang chung tshang|{skyob pa rin po ches 'bri gung mthil dum khan chen gu ra ba gdan sar bskos pa nas bzung gdan rabs nyer gnyis pa dkon mchog rin chen bar gdan rabs rim par byon pa dang/gdan rabs nyer gsum pa rig 'dzin chos grags nas sprul sku ngos 'dzin zhu srol dar zhing/gdan rabs nyer gnyis pa dkon mchog rin chen gyi sprul sku dkon mchog 'phrin las bzang po nas bzung 'phrin las lhun grub bar che tshang sku phreng drug /rig 'dzin chos grags kyi sprul sku na grub chos rgyal nas bzung bstan 'dzin chos kyi snang ba bar chung tshang sku phreng bdun byung}
'bri gung chos kyi rgyal po|{'bri gung gdan rabs bcu pa 'di nyid gzhung smad 'jon ma yul du yab kun dga' rgyal mtshan dang/yum dbur pa dar 'jam gnyis kyi sras su rab byung drug pa'i shing phag (1335)lor sku bltams/dgung lo brgyad bzhes tshe chos kyi rje rdo rje rgyal po'i drung du rab tu byung/mtshan 'dzam gling chos kyi rgyal por gsol/gsang 'dus/dus 'khor la sogs pa'i bde mchog /gsang 'dus/dus 'khar la sogs pa'i dbang dang gdams pa gsan/dgung lo dgu la 'dul 'dzin rin chen rgyal mtshan gyis mkhan po dang/chos sko ba gzhon du dpal gyis slob dpon sogs kha bskong grangs tshang gi dbus su dge tshul bsgrubs/stag phur chos rje stag chen pa las dgyes rdor la sogs rgyud 'grel du mar gsan sbyong mdzad/dgung lo bcu gcig par rje rdo rje rgyal po las zab mo lnga ldan/nA ro'i chos drug /mos gus srog 'khor/theg chen bstan pa'i snying po/dgongs pa gcig pa/skyob pa'i zab chos sogs bka' brgyud kyi chos rnams gsan/lcags yol (1351)lor 'bri gung gdan khrir mnga' gsol/de nas dpal ldan sa skya la sogs pa nyang stod rnams su phebs te chos kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor bar mdzad/dgung lo nyi shu pa la mkhan po sa skya ba 'dul 'dzin kun dga' rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po dang/slob dpon chos lung pa sde snod 'dzin pa chos kyi rgyal mtshan/gsang ston pa bde legs bzang po sogs dge 'dun gyi dbus su rgyal ba'i bstan pa la yongs su rdzogs par mdzad/de nas mkhan po de nyid las 'dus ba/byams chos sde lnga/spyod 'jug la sogs gsan cing/gzhan yang g.yag sde paN chen/rtse chen pa don 'grub (497) dpal bzang lo chen tshul khrims mgon po 'jam dbyangs bsod nams rgyal mtshan sogs rtsod bral gyi mkhas grub du ma bsten nas mdo sngags rgyud sde sogs du ma gsan cing rgyal ba'i gsung rab rgya mtsho'i dgongs don la mkhas par gyur gnas gsum gyi ri khrod 'dzin par rtogs pa mngon du gyur pa rnams brdzongs pa gnang mdo rgod rdzong gi sgrub grwa btsugs pa sogs sgrub brgyud kyi lugs ches cher 'phel bar mdzad dbyar chos dang dgun chos kyi phyag srol sngar bzhin mi nyams rgyas pa'i steng dpyid kyi dus su theg chen bstan snying dgongs pa gcig pa ston gyi dus mos gus srog 'khor sogs dus bzhir zab pa dang rgya che ba'i chos kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor de nas karma rol pa'i rdo rje dang mjal nas chos kyi 'bel gtam dang mdo sngags kyi chos zab mo 'ga' zhig snyan ngag sdeb sbyor sogs tha snyad du ma gsan dgung lo nyer dgu pa la rgyal ba'i bsti gnas ri bo shAn+ti zangs lung dang kong phyogs phal cher du phebs nas dad ldan rnams la chos kyi 'brel ba gnang gnas chen tsa ri trar phebs te tshogs kyi 'khor lo lan grangs du mar bskor nas mi ring bar 'bri gung du phyir phebs skabs 'dir shar tsong kha pa blo bzang grags pa mdo smad nas phabs par 'bri gung du byon skabs rje'i drung du chos 'brel gnang rje 'di nyid kyis rgyal ba'i bka' 'gyur rin po che'i glegs bam gsar bzhengs mdzad dgung lo nga gcig pa shing glang (1385)lor yig mkhan du mas shog dkar gyi ngos la bris pa bstan 'gyur dang dwags po bka' brgyud kyi skye mchog rim byon gyi rnam thar gsum 'bum bcas bzhengs dgung lo re gcig pa rab byung bdun pa'i shing phag (1395)laur chos srid kyi khur rnams chos rje don grub rgyal por gtad rje nyid gter sgrom dang lhun po la sogs pa dben gnas rnams su rnal 'byor gyis dus 'da' bar mdzad gsung rtsom yang lnga ldan nor bu'i phreng ba lhan cig skyes sbyor chos drug gi khrid yig ye shes mgon po dang a phyi'i sgrub skor rtogs brjod dang nyams mgur sogs bstan bcos mang du mdzad thugs kyi sras nam mkha' rgyal mtshan sa bzang 'phags pa 'bri gung lo tsam sogs kyis mchog khyad par du ma byung mthar dgung lo don gsum bzhed pa rab byung bdun pa'i me phag (1407)lor sku mya ngan las 'das}
