'bri gung rig 'dzin chos grags|{(chung tshang sku phreng dang po )rje rig 'dzin chos grags ni 'bri gung gdan rabs nyer gsum pa yin zhing yab chos rgyal phun tshogs dang yum g.yang khug ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu pa'i shing lug (1595)lor rtsa bar 'khrungs/bod kyi lo rgyus thug gdung rgyud chen po bzhi yod pa'i nang 'bri gung skyu ri'i rigs sras kyi nang nas chung shos de yin/yab rje'i drung du gtsug phud phul/mtshan dkon mchog phun tshogs zhes gsol/mkhas grub gnyis ldan gyi dge ba'i bshes gnyen du ma'i drung du mdo sngags gnyis kyi gtsos pa'i gzhung lugs la gsan bzhes mdzad pa dang/da bzhin bka' rnying gi bla ma dpa khyad 'phags rnams bsten nas mad sngags rang lugs sogs kyi chos dang thun mong rig gnas la sbyangs pa mdzad nas mkhas grub gnyis ldan gyi go 'phag la mnga' brnyes pa'i mkhas pa'i snyan grags thob/sgrub pa nyams bzhes la brtson par mdzad/re zhig sku sngags 'chang gi chas su bzhugs nas gtsang sde srid kyi sras mo lcam drung khab tu bzhes/lcam drung ma'i bzhugs nas bye ri stag rtse'i pho brang gsar rgyag dang/gdan sa sogs la rten bzhengs mang du mdzad/shing bya (1645)lor bla ma ba log pa sbyin pa phun tshogs kyis mkhan po gnang nas bsnyen par rdzogs/lhag par gso rig thad kyi slob dpon ni tshe yi rig byed 'dzin pa gu Na kA ra'i mtshan can bsten nas dpal ldan rgyud bzhi gtsor gyur gyi gzhung dang man ngag lag len skor rnams thugs rgyud gcig 'dres kyi gdams pa'i gdan rnams ma lus pa mkhyen nas de dag rim bzhis sman dpyad lag len skor la thun mong ma yin pa'i khyad chos mang po nges par rnyed de 'bri lugs zhes pa'i srol gtod thog mar mdzad pa sogs gso rig thad shin tu mkhas par gyur/skabs de dus tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas 'bri gung chos grags las bka' rnying gi gdams pa khag cag gsan bzhes gnang bar brten rin chen sna lnga las grub pa'i sman bzo'i yo byad ngo mtshar can kha shas 'bul gnang mdzad/rje 'di la rgyud 'dzin zhal slob phul du phyin pa sman rtsis gnyis kar mkhas pa paN chen dkon mchog lhun grub dang/dgon mchog 'gro phan dbang po'am tshe dbang brten pa/lho 'phrin las rnam rgyal sogs slob ma shin tu mang/rje nyid kyi brtsams chos thad grags can (rgyud bzhi'i bka' mchan )dang/(rin chen phyag len/) bshad rgyu rkyang ser skol la sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos bka' 'dri gnang ba'i lan (dka' gnad dogs sel/) 'bri lugs kyi khyad chos rmad du byung ba'i ('bam bcos tshe 'dzin srog skyob/) (rims nad kun gyi gnyen po 'bri lugs sman nag 'phrul 'khor chen mo'i zhal shes phyag len )sogs phul du phyin pa'i sman bcos kyi nyams myong rnams phyi rabs nad pa'i don du 'jog gnang mdzad/dgung grangs re gsum sa phag (1659)lor sku 'das/sman dpyad la mkhas pas sman pa rig 'dzin chos grags zhes zhu mkhan yang yod par snang/rje 'di nas bzung 'bri gung gdan sar skye sprul brtsad gcod zhu srol dar zhing/khong na chung tshang sku phreng dang po yin}
'bri gung ang kong rin po che|{'bri gung ang kong rin po che ni dus rabs nyi shu pa'i lo rabs sum cu'i nang snyan grags che tsam yod pa zhig yin/khong ni da lta'i mi mo p+sagang shang gi ra se grong tshor sku 'khrungs/mtshan ang kong dkon mchog blo gros zhes zhu ba dang/'bri mthil dgon du chos zhugs gnang ste gsan bzhes mthar phyin rjes sgrub pa nyams bzhes gtso bor mdzad cing/ngo mtshar che ba'i mdzad pa mang po bshad srol mchis stabs rgyal tshab rwa sgreng thub bstan 'jam dpal yang 'bri gung mthil du ched (504) phebs kyis ang kong dang mjal mol yang gnang ang kong rin chen po mjal mkhan mang po yod par re 'gas gang phul ba rnams bzhes pa ma zad da dung gyon pa bzhes rgyu lta ci tha na zhal mjal yang mi gnang ba'i thog nga kha rogs zhog ang ces gsung gi yod 'dug skabs re dur khrod khar phung po bya gtor byed par yang phebs kyi yod skad dgung grangs brgyad cu lhag tsam bzhugs}
'bri chu|{rang re'i rgyal khab kyi nang khul du 'bab pa'i chu bo chen po ang dang po yin la/'dzam gling thag tu grags che ba'i chu chen zhig kyang yin/chu bo 'di'i chu mgo mtsho sngon zhing chen lho nub kyi ri bo gdang la'i dge lab stan stong nas byung ste ring bzhin mtsho stong dang/bod ljongs/zi khron sogs zhing chen dang rang skyong ljongs brgyud de mthar hrang had grong khyer nas shar rgya mtshor 'bab cing/spyi'i ring tshan la spyi le drug stong gsum brgya yod pa dang/rgyugs yul rgya khyon li gru bzhi ma khri brgya dang brgyad cu lhag yod/chu bo chen po 'di ni byang phyogs nas lho phyogs su 'bab ste mtsho sngon dang si khron nub rgyud du ma slebs bar sa mtho'i ring rgyun nas 'bab pa'i dbang gis chu shugs che la 'bab tshad kyang mgyogs/'bri chu zi khron gyi shar brgyud nas hu'u pe dang/hu'u nan/cang su'u/cang shis/an hu'i bcas zhing chen mang po'i sgang gshong mi snyoms pa'i sa chu brgyud de cung zad dal po'i sgo nag gtsang lag mang po'i chu dang mnyam du shar rgya mtshor 'bab pa zhig yin}
'bri yi se ru gung ston|{('bri si ru gung ston nam 'bri si ru gung thun zhes pa'ang snang )srong btsan sgam po'i skabs kyi blon chen bzhi'i nang gi gcig yin/skye yul 'bri gung nas yin cing/blon po mgar stong btsan la mi 'dod pa'i phrag dog byed mkhan gtso bo'i gras yin cing/srong btsan gyi bka' bzhin 'di nyid mgar stong btsan yul zung dang mnyam du rgya nag tu rgya mo bzang kong jo slong bar bskyod pa dang/'dis rgya yul du blon po mgar la phrag dog byas rkyen mgar re zhig rgya yul du sdod dgos byung skad}
