'bru chung|{gong gsal 'bru chen las yig gzugs chung zhing rkang pa thung ba zhig ste/deng sang tshugs thung zer/de la yi ge'i rkang ring thung gnyis yod pa'i ring ba ni de sngon bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi bka' rgya dang/gtan tshigs/khrims yig rtsa tshig bcas la byed spyod byed srol 'dug /tshugs thung gi nang gses dpe tshugs ni deng sang yongs grags su e tshugs dang ai bris yang zer ba yig gzugs kyi sha che bas blta klog byed dus gsal ba dang rkang pa thung bas shog grangs gcig gi nang yig 'bru mang po shong bsogs kyi khyad chos ldan pa zhig yin}
'bru chen|{(sha chen )bod yig dbu med kyi yig gzugs tshugs dang ldan zhing yig gzugs kyi sha tshugs chen po yod pa ste/tshugs ring dang tshugs thung lta bu yin cing/'bru chen de la li lugs dang ldan lugs gnyis yod pa las li lugs kya 'bri srol ni rgyun chad zin pa dang ldan lugs zer ba ni rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus lo tsA ba ldan ma rtse mangs kyi phyag bris 'bri srol la zer zhing/rjes su khyung po g.yu khris de la thig ris kyang mdzad yod/de yang yig gzugs 'dra min sna tshogs su 'gyur ldog yod pa mthong nas dus rabs bco lnga pa'i mgor rgyal rtse (505) sde srid rab brtan kun bzang 'phags pas srid dbang bzung dus skabs de'i ldan lugs kyi yig mkhan mkhas pa rnams bsdus nas bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur sogs bzhes pa dang bstun 'bru chen dang 'bru chung gi thig bshad brtsams shing gtan 'khel ba'i thig tshad kya ga rgyun dar spel btang ba dang de rjes rab byung bcu gcag pa'i sa 'brug (1688)lor sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos (bai DUr+ya g.yal sel )brtsams pa'i nang gong gsal gyi thig bshad rnams cha tshang bar drangs yod yang de rjes dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i mgo tsam du gong gi thig bshad ltar gyi thig dang yig gzugs zung 'brel byas pa'i dge ris shig mtsho sngon zhing chen gyi sku 'bum dgon par dpar skrun byas pa'i shing dpar yang deng skabs ma nyams par bsdad yod}
