'bru tsha|{bod yig dbu med 'bru chen gyi yig gzugs rigs gcig ste 'di'i yig mgo rnams zur gsum gyi rnam pa dang stod sgur zhing rkang pa ring ba zhig yin la spyir btang dpe deb kyi kha byang dang/srid gzhung gi bka' rgya/rtsa tshig /khrims yig sogs skabs 'gar yig gzugs 'dis bris pa yang yod/rgyun kyi dpe deb rigs la yi ge 'di zur mang zhing rkang pa ring ba'i rkyen gyis yig 'brug shong rgya chung bas bed spyod mi byed pa yin/'bru tsha la 'bru tsha sgong zhabs ma/'bru tsha zhabs ring/'bru tsha zhabs thung ba sogs yig gzugs khag gsum yod/'bru tsha'i dpe ris skor kan lho bod rigs rang skyong khul gyi slob gra'i dge rgan mkhan dbang sman lam rgya mtshos bris pa gnang ba'i (yig gzugs blo gsal spyi nor )gyi shog grangs 82nas 84bar dang/grangs 97nas 104bar gsal ba der gzigs}
'brug|{gna' rabs lo rgyus thog bshad srol yod pa'i srog chags 'brug ste/dmangs khrod kyi bshad rgyun du lus la gshog pa med kyang nam mkha' la 'gro thub pa dang/skabs re lus nas me stag 'phro ba ni rgyun du mthong rgyu yod pa'i glog zer ba de yin pa/lus la nya dang 'dra ba'i pags pa khrab ris can zhig yod pa/'brug gi skad bsgrags na rma bya'i lus la sgo nga chags kyi yod pa sogs bshad srol sna tshogs yod/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la gzhung ngo ma gang gi nang du'ang 'brug zer ba de srog chags shig yin par gtan nas khas mi len pa ni bstan 'gyur mdo phyogs sde dge dpar ma'i le tshan (khu)pa'i nang bzhugs pa spyi'i los dus rabs dgu pa'i mgor bon kyi btsan po khri lde srong btsan sad na legs mjing yon gyis srid dbang bzung skabs rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta dzi na mi tra dang bod kyi lo tsA ba zhang ye shes sde gnyis kyis bod skad du bsgyur ba'i ('jig rten gdags pa )zhes pa'i bstan bcos nang 'khod don/ci'i phyir 'brug zer zhe na/smras pa/phyogs gnyis nas rlung chen po dag ldang ste brdabs pa las sgra 'byung ste/rgyu des na 'brug ces zer ro/_/zhes dang/yang ci'i phyir glog 'byung zhe na/phyogs gnyis nas rlung shin tu tsha ba dag ldang ste/de dag phan tshun thug pa glog 'byung ste/rgyu des na glog 'byung ngo/_/zhes gsal zhing gong gsal chos de de bod du ma bsgyur (506) gong gi rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus brtsams pa'i (rgyal po bka' thang )las mtsho yi rlangs pas mkha' la sprin du chags/_/de nyid 'thab pas mkha' la 'brug sgra sgrogs/_/'byung ba tsha grang 'phrad pas glog tu 'khyug drag cang ngar na gnam lcags thog tu babs/_/dper na me lcags rdo la brdabs pa bzhin/_/bar nas me dang rin chen 'od zer 'phro/_/zhes mkhar rlung mi 'dra ba gnyis thug nas brdabs pa na skad chen po sgrog zong bas rgyu mtshan de tsam zhig lab rten nas 'brug ces ming btags pa dang glog 'khyug pa ni mkha' rlung tsha grang gnyis thug nas brdabs pa'i 'od yin pas rgyu mtshan de la brten nas glo 'byung bar bshad yod pas de ni ding sang gi tshan rig mkhas pa rnams kyi bshad tshul dang yongs su mthun gyi yod yon kyang mi rnams kyi 'tsho ba dngos kyi nang 'brug zer ba'i srog chags dngos su yod pa dang dngos su mthong myong ba lta bu'i bshad rgyud mang po yod pa ma zad de la brten nas lha khang gi ldebs bris dang gos dar dkar yol kha gdan rdo skas gnam rgyan sogs kyi thog 'brug rim gyi rgyan spros byed srol yod pa de dag mes rgyal nang khul nas bod du dar pa'i shugs rkyen zhig yin nam yang na chos lugs gzhan dag dang phyi rgyas nas bod du dar ba'i bshad rgyun zhi yin min skor da phan dpyad gzhi ma rnyed cing nye rabs kyi tshan rig mkhas pa rnams kyis brtag dpyad byas pa'i mjug bsdoms la bskal pa ya thog gi srog chags gras khung lung {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i 'brug gzugs kyi rus pa cha tshang zhig btsal rnyed byung yod pa de ni rgya mtsho'i nang gi srog chags min la nam mkha' la 'gro thub pa dang shugs drag che ba'i skad sgrog thub pa de 'dra zhig kyang min par bshad yod pas deng rabs kya da rig dang sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol gang gi dbang du byas na yang 'brug zer ba'i srog chags dngos su mthong rgyu gtan nas med do/_}
'brug pa pad+ma dkar po|{mchims yul dgon gyi grong na yab jo sras klu'i dbang po dang yum chos skyong sgrol ma rnam gnyis kyi sras su rab byung dgu pa'i me phag (1527)lo'i sos ka'i dus mtha' ma lo tog snye ma'i khur gyis lci'i skabs kyi dus bzang po la dge ba'i ltas dang bcas te sku 'khrungs/dgung lo gsum gyi steng rang gi sngon gyi dge ba'i bshes gnyen chen po 'brug pa rin po che ngag dbang chos kyi rgyal po mjal/dgung lo dgu pa'i steng du sngon gyi gnas lho phyogs yangs pa'i rgyal khams su phebs/rin po ma lon par me pho spre'u'i lo rgyal bas cho 'phrul chen po bstan pa'i dga' ba dang po la gdan seng ge'i khri chen por mngon par dbang bsgyur te chos kyi rgyal srid skyong bar mnga' gsol/de nas bzung ste slob dpon shes rab go cha la yi ge'i phyi mo 'bri ba dang glog pa tshul bzhin du bslabs/slob dpon chos grags bstan 'phel ba dang/kun mkhyen bkra shis rnam pa sogs mkhas chen mang po bsten nas thun mong dang thun min gyi rig gnas mkhas par sbyangs/bstan pa'i bdag po kun mkhyen ngag gi dbang por gtsug phud phul/yongs su rdzogs pa'i dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa mnos/dbang lung rjes gnang mang po thob/dgung lo bcu bdun pa mdzes byed kya lo la chos gra chen po dpal 'khor bde chen du kun dga' bkra shis rnam rgyal dpal bzang pos mkhan po mdzad/las slob sde snod 'dzin pa dkon mchog rin chen pa/gsang ston slob dpon sangs rgyas ye shes/grib tshod nyang rang pa/grogs ldan pa dge slong sangs rgyas lhun grub/dad pa'i dge 'dun grangs tshang ba'i dbus dge bsnyen/dge tshul/gsol ba dang bzhi'i las kyi bsnyen par rdzogs pa tshig rdzogs su mnos/ngag dbang kun dga' rnam rgyal nor bu dpal bzang por mtshan btags/byang chub tu sems bskyed pa'i mtshan ni mi pham pad+ma dkar po phyogs las rnam (507) par rgyal ba'i sde'o/_/bstan 'gro'i bya ba mang po mdzad phyi nang rig pa'i gsung rtsom pod bcu bzhi brtsams rang byung bcu pa'i me sprel (1596)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su bsdus}
