'bre chen po shes rab 'bar|{rngog lo tsA ba blo ldan shes rab kyi slob ma gtso bo bzhi'i gras yin cing/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi mtshan nyid rig pa spyi dang lhag par du phar phyin la mkhas pa'i mchog tu gyur pa zhig yin/'dis mdzad pa'i mchog tu gyur pa zhig yin/'dis mdzad pa'i (phar phyin gyi 'grel pa )dang/(nyi khri'i 'grel pa/) (mdo sdud pa'i 'grel pa )bcas yod par dkar chag khag tu bshad/'di'i lo rgyus rgyas pa ma mthong zhing/mdor bsdus shig (deb ther sngon po )le tshan (cha)pa'i grangs 2paragasal}
