'brel sgra'i grub stangs bcu gcig|{'brel gzhi dang 'brel chos gnyis kyi 'brel ba'i tshig phrad grub stabs gtso bo bcu gcig ni/1 bdag po dang yul gyi 'brel ba/2 rgyu dang 'bras bu'i 'brel ba/3 bdag nyid gcig pa'i 'brel pa/4 khyad gzhi dang khyad chos gnyis kyi 'brel pa/5 gzhi mthun gyi 'brel pa/6 rten gnas gyi 'brel pa/7 yan lag dang yan lag can gyi 'brel pa/8 byade pa po dang mtshan mtshon gyi 'brel pa/9 mtshan mtshon gyi 'brel pa/10 yul dang yul can gyi 'brel pa/11 dbye gzhi dang dbye chos kyi 'brel pa rnams so/_}
