'bro bzang khri ma lod|{mang srong gi btsun mo/dbos sras khri lde gtsug brten sku gzhon nu'i skabs btsan po yab sras kyi chab srid skyong rogs gnang bas bod btsan po'i rgyal rabs kyi btsun mo'i nang nas chab srid kyi mkhyen rgya dang/dbang thang snyan grags bcas che shos shig byung bar grags/mang srong gshegs pa'i lo de rang la 'dus srog 'khrungs pas 'dus srong nar ma son bar chab srid kyi 'gan dbang yum khri ma lod kyis bzung/'dus srong gshegs skabs khri da gtsug brtan sku na phra bas phyi nang gi chab srid thugs 'gan 'bro ba zang khri ma lod kyis bzhes/dus der blon 'bangs khag gcig gis ngo log brgyab par drag gnon byas pa dang/khu mang po rje lha zung bya ba blon chen por bsko gzhag gnang 'on kyang phyi mo khri ma lod kyi snyan du phra ma byung bas ring por ma lon par gling ring tshal du khu mang po rje lha zung la khrims nyes phab nas/de'i tshab tu dbas khri gzigs zhang nyen bya ba blon chen du bskos/gzhan yang se rib ces pa'i rgyal phran sogs nas ngo log brgyab pa rnams kyang dpag dang khrims kyis mnan cing/sa bya (709)lor se rib kyi rgyal po yang gson bzung byed thub pa sogs bod btsan po'i chab srid je brtan dang/bod yul bde 'jags su gnas gyur mdzad rjes chen po 'jog gnang mdzad yod/chu byi (772)lor btsan mo 'bro bzang khri ma lod sku 'das par grags}
