'brog la thul rtsis|{'brog khul gyi sems can mang nyung gi tshan gzhi rtse stangs te phyugs kyi rwa dang sha sogs rtsi gzhir byas nas tshad ldan mi 'ong bas pags pa'i ngo grags la tshad gzhir byas pa ste/de yang nor phyugs che ba'i rigs kyi pags pa bzhis thul pa gcig ste mal thul gcig ldeng ba 'byung/ra lug ltar bu nor phyugs chung rigs kyi pags pa brgyad la mal thul gcig gi tshad yin nam snyam ste mkhas pa'i dbang po rnams kyi dpyad par zhu}
'brong gnyan lde ru|{('brong gnyan lde'u'am 'bro gnyen lde ru zhes pa'ang snang )bod rgyal sum cu pa/yab khri gnyan gzung btsan dang yum 'brong bzang mo dur yangs gzher gyi sras su shing rta (394)lor 'khrungs skad/blon po gnyags thang ba yar rje dang gnubs khro dar re mthong pos byas/khu'i bon po mang rje lod pos sku bon byas/rgyal po 'di'i gcung po rmu btsan dang bon bu rgyal mtshan gnyis thang mtshams su phab/rgyal po 'dis dwags po'i yul nas mchims bza' klu rgyal bya ba mdzes ma zhig khab tu bzhes/phyis mi mdzes par gyur nas rgyu mtshan dris pas rang gi yul na zas shig yod pa de med pas lan zer/de len du chug gsungs pas g.yog mos sbas pa mar la btsos pa blangs te mdzod du sbas nas btsun mo la drangs pas mdangs shin tu mdzes par gyur stabs rgyal pos zas de nga rang yang za'o dgongs nas lde tshab kya sgo phye nas gzigs skabs sbal ro mthong bas rnam rtog skyes pa las sku la mdze nad phog /de skabs dwags po sbas zan gyi yul zhes pa de na nya za zhing nya la sbal par grags pa yin skad/rgyal po'i btsun mo la sras dmus long zhig bltams shing/de cung zad cher longs pa na yab kyis khyod 'a zha'i yul nas sman pa bos te mig phye nas rgyal sa zungs/gal te mig 'byed ma thub na sum pa'i yul du bon po'i chung ma rgya mtsho rgya lcam bya ba la nga'i bu sum ri ring po bya ba zhig yod pa de bos nas khyod rang gshegs rdzu thob la rgyal sar snyags thang pa yar rje dang bcas pa dgung rgyud la snyun mi phog pa'i ched du yar lung zhal dmar bang so brtsigs nas gson por dur du bzhugs par grags shing/bang so'i ming la'ang gson mchad zlum po zer/'brong gnyen lde ru'i sku dus su bod la sngar ba'i dkar yol byung zhes lo rgyus yig tshang du gsal}
'brom ston pa rgyal ba'i 'byung gnas|{(dge bshes ston pa )rab byung dang po'i gong gi lo skor tha ma'i shing 'brug (1004)lo nas rab byung dang po'i shing 'brug (1064)lo bar/dgung lo drug cu re gcig bzhugs/'dir 'brom ston pa'i 'khrungs lo dang dgung grags 'das lo bcas la mi mthun pa khag bzhi tsam 'dug pa 'dir ma bris/'dir ni lan chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung mkhas pa'i yid (510) 'phrog )ltar bris pa yin 'khrungs yul ni byang gi gnyan chen thang lha'i 'og rtsa sgye mo ('dam gzhung rdzong yangs pa can chus zam gsar shang bye lung ru khag gsum pa/) rus yang gzher yab rta gsum sku gshen dang yum khu yod bza' lan gcig ma gnyis kyis ras su 'khrungs chung du nas yum gshegs rjes shab kyis ma yar gcig blangs pas rgyun du sdang po byas pa'i rkyen gyis khams su bros phebs bla ma se btsun gyi sar bzhugs nas nyin mo nang g.yog rta phyugs gso ba phye 'thag pa sogs mdzad pa'i zhor la slob sbyong dang ma bral bar gnang mtshan mor bla ma'i zhing srung sogs mdzad de bla ma'i zhabs 'debs dang rang nyid kyi slob gnyer 'thus shor med pa mdzad zhol la paN+Di ti smri ti las sgra rig pa dang saM skri ta'i skad bslabs de nas mnga' ris su jo bo rje a ti sha phebs pa gsan ste khams nas mnga' ris su zhabs thang gis mgyogs por phebs pas jo bo rje nyin gnyis gsum nas ma 'gyangs par rgya gar du phyir phebs gnang nye'i dus su pu hrengs rgya zhing zer ba'i rong gi nang du mjal de nas dbus gtsang gi dge bshes mkhas pa tshor jo bo rje lta bu'i paN+Di ta rgya gar nas bod du phebs pa thengs gcig yin pas nges par du bod dbus gtsang du gdan 'dren zhu dgos zhes phyag bris gnang ba ltar dbus gtsang gi mkhas pa rnams kyis ngo bo bod dbus gtsang du gdan drangs de nas jo bo rje khu ston brtson 'grus g.yung drung gi sar zla ba gsum tsam bzhugs yun ma gtogs sku tshe gcig ring 'bros kyis nang g.yog gtso bor mdzad de zhar la go skabs byung chos zhu bar mdzad jo bo rje sku mya ngan las 'das nas sku gdung dang phyag dpe sogs slob ma tshor gnang dgos rigs gnang nas sku gdung thugs dam rten bcas dang jo bos gso skyon gnang ba'i slob ma tshogs pa khag rnams khrid de rwa sgreng du phebs rab byung dang po'i me bya (1057)lor rwa sgreng dgon pa btab dngul gyi mchod rten zhig gi nang jo bo'i sku gdung rnams bzhugs de nas jo bo'i slob ma rnams 'brom gyis chos dang 'tsho ba gnyis ka'i sgo nas bskyangs sku tshe gcig gi ring rten dge bsnyen du bzhugs pa las rab byung ma mdzad kyang bslab khrims bsrung ba la dge nga las kyang lhag par mdzad mthar dgung lo re gcig pa la rwa sgreng du sku gshegs rnam thar lo rgyud rgyas pa las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan kyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog )dang ri bo che dpon tshang tshe dbang rgyal gyis brtsams pa'i (lho rong chos 'byung thub bstan gsal byed )kyi shog grangs 14nas shog grangs bcu lhag tsam dang (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )le tshan (da)pa'i shog grangs 14nas 30bar gsal}
'brom ston pa'i 'khrungs khang rtswa sgye mo|{de ni jo bo rje'i sras kyi thu bo 'brom ston pa rgyal ba'i 'byung gnas kyi 'khrungs yul lam 'khrungs khang ste 'dam gzhung rdzong yangs can chus gnyen chen gangs lha dang mi ring bar yod la sngar gyi ming la rtswa sgye mo zer/deng sang 'khrungs khang sogs rtsa 'thor du song zin rung de'i shul deng skabs gsar rgyag byas pa'i mchod rten dkar po che ba shar byang mtshams su bltas pa zhig la dar tshon sna lngas dpyong ste 'dug go}
'brom thod mchod rten|{'brom thod grong tsho'i rgyab ri'i 'dabs su mchod rten zhig yod pa de'i nang 'brom ston rgyal ba'i 'byung gnas kyi dbu thod yod cing/de sngon yul der 'brom ston ces 'bod kyang phyis mchod rten de nas ming dras te 'brom thod ces brjod 'dug /rig gnas skabs mchod rten nang bzhugs 'brom ston gyi dbu thod dang mchod zhal sogs mchod rten bshig skabs yul mi zhig gis gsang stabs ngang lha sar nyar zhing bod rang byung bcu drug pa'i me stag (1986)lor mchod rten (511) nyams gso zhus pa dang sbrags nang rten rnams nyams chag med par gzungs su phul 'dug}
