rba 'bring gi sde 'khrug|{bod du sangs rgyas chos lugs thog mar bskyar gso gnang mkhan dbus gtsang gi mkhas pa mi bcu'i gras dbus pa mi lnga'i nang gi rba tshul khrims blo gros kya 'phan por lan pa spyil bu'i dgon pa btab nas gnas bzhi bzung/de nas dar spel byung ba'i tshogs pa la bra tsho zer zhing dbus pa mi lnga'i nang gi 'brel ye shes yon tan gyis 'phan por ngan lam spyi bo'i dgon pa btab nas gnas gzhi bzung/de nas dar spel byung ba'i tshogs pa la 'bring tsho zer/tsho pa sde gnyis po rjes su 'phel rgyal chen po byung nas dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i dkyil dang dus rabs bcu gnyis pa'i 'khor phan tshun bar lha khang dang dgon pa 'phrog res kyi dmag 'khrug yang yang byung ba ma zad/bod kya rab byung gsum pa'i lcags 'brug (1160)lor/lha sa khul du yod pa'i rba rag tsho pa gnyis kyi bar dmag 'khrug yun ring byung ba dang/dmag 'khrug gi ring lha sa gtsug lag khang dang ra mo che gnyis lag tor skyon chabs che tsam byung skabs dwags sgom tshul khrims snying po phebs nas phan tshun gnyis kar rgyu dngos 'bor chen gnang ste bar 'dum mdzad rjes/dmag 'khrug ring gtor skyon byung ba'i lha sa gtsug lag khang la nyams gso lags par mdzad nas/skabs der lha sa dang lho kha khul du dpal 'byor dang dmag don gnyis ka'i thad nas stobs shugs che shos yin pa'i gung thang bla ma zhang rin po cher rtsis 'bul gnang ba bcas (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )gyi le tshan (ja)pa'i dang (na)pa gnyis dang/ri bo che dpon tshang tshe dbang rgyal gyis brtsams pa'i (lho rong chos 'byung )gnyis su gsal}
rba bzhed|{rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus blon po rba gsal snang gis brtsams pa'i lo rgyus yig cha zhig gi ming/(rba bzhed )'di lo rgyus khungs btsan dub zhed pa dang/lhad can yin par bzhed pa/rba bzhed gtsang ma dang lhad can rigs gnyis yod par bzhed pa bcas khag gsum yod/mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel sogs bod kyi lo rgyus mkhas can mang po zhig gis (rba bzhed )kyi stod cha rnams ni rgyal po khri srong lde btsan skabs kya chos srid gnyis ka'i lo rgyus gsal zhing de'i nang nas chos phyogs kyi mdzad pa kho na gtsor 'dod byas te bshad pa dang/'di nyid mdzad pa po yang bra gsal snang gcig pus mdzad pa ma yin par rgyal po khri srong lde btsan nyid dang thun mong du mdzad nas gtan 'bebs gnang ba zhig yin par bzhed/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng ng+la pa sogs mang po zhig gis (rba bzhed zhabs btags ma )ni slob dpon rin po che'i rnam thar (bka' thang sde lnga )sogs dang ma mthun pa'i lhad can yin par bzhed/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )mdzad pa po yang dgongs tshul de dang phyogs 'dra ba yod na yang/khri srong lde btsan gyi rnam thar thad (rba bzhed )dang yang mi mthun pa yang 'ga' zhig gsungs yod pa rnams khungs gang 'dra zhig la brten nas gsungs pa yin min mi gsal/rang nyid kyis da phan (rbad bzhed zhabs btags ma )khag 'dra min gnyis dang/zhabs btags med pa gcig /sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos (bai DUr+ya g.ya' sel )du lung drangs pa'i (rba bzhed )kyi tshig 'ga' zhig/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang/(rba bzhed zhabs btags ma )zhig gi lung phal che ba drangs pa rnams bsdur skabs dogs pa yod pa'i gnad don mi nyung ba zhig 'dug pas rjes su mkhas pa'i dbang po rnams kyis zhib dpyod mdzad thog (512) gsal bshad yod pa zhu rgyu las 'dir tshig 'grel gyi skabs su gleng na mang bar dogs pas ma bris so/_}
rba bzhed gtsang ma|{(sba bzhed (mjug tu lha sa mu ne btsan po nas glang dar ma'i bar gyi lo rgyus rnams kha skong sbyar ba de la zer/de'i rgyu mtshan ni kha skong de rtsom pa pos(rba bzhed )kyi tshig nang slob dpon pad+ma'i lo rgyus zhig yod pa dang dkar po chig thub kyi lta ba dang ha shang mahA yA na'i lta ba gcig mtshungs yin par bshad pa sogs kyi tshig de rnams kha skong rtsom pa pos bcug pa yin pa'i don}
