sba gsal snang|{(rba bzhed pa'ang snang )sba ye shes dbang po yang zhu/chos rgyal khri srong lde btsan gyi blon po/sad mi bdun gyi ya gyal/'di btsan pos mang yul gyi kha blon du bsko'o gsungs nas mang yul du mngags/skabs der ma zhang grom pa skyes kyis chos byed mi chog pa'i khrims bcas pa dang 'gal te gsal snang re zhig rgya gar du gnas mjal la phebs dgos byung/phyir lam bal yul du mkhan chen bo d+hi sa twa mjal te bal rje la zhus nas mar yul du gdan drangs/lha khang gnyis kyang bzhengs/mkhan po slar yang bod du 'byon par gsol ba zhal gyis bzhes nas re zhig bal yul du phyir phebs par grags/de nas gsal snang btsan po'i drung du byon nas btsan po la lha chos bzang po mdzad par rigs pa dang/mkhan po bo d+hi sa twa'i mkhas shing btsun pa'i yon tan rnams zhus shing/slad dge ba'i bshes gnyen du 'byon par gsol ba la mkhan pos ji ltar gsungs pa zhib tu zhus/'on kyang de skabs ma zhang grom pa skyes sogs chos la gnag pa'i khang blon rnams dbang shugs che bas rgyal pos re zhig gsal snang yib tu bcug /ma zhang grom pa skyes tshar bcad rjes btsan pos gsal sngon bal yul du mngags nas mkhan po bo d+hi sa twa bod du spyan drangs te zla shas chos gsungs pa na mu ge dang nad yangs sogs byung bas chos byas pas lan zer nas mkhan po slar yab yul du phyir phebs dgos byung/de nas btsan pos sba gsal snang rgya yul du pho nyar 'gro dgos pa'i bka' gnang ba ltar rgya yul du bskyod nas hwa shang las chos kyi sgom lung zhus te bod du log phebs/gsal snang rgya nag nas 'khor ma thag btsan po'i bka' bzhin slar bal yum du bskyod nas mkhan po bo d+hi sa twa bod du gdan drangs/bod d+hi sa twa'i drung du gsal snang sogs bod mi bdun rab tu byung bar sad mi bdun zhes grags/gsal snang rab tu byung rjes chos kyi tshugs dpon blar bskos/mkhas pos gsal snga la ye shes dbang po zhes ming btags/mkhas po gshegs khar zhal chems spa ye shes dbang po la bzhag /mkhan po gshegs rjes btsan pos ye shes dbang po chos kyi ring lugs su bskos/rgyal blon 'bangs bcas kyi dge ba'i bshes gnyen sangs rgyas kyi sku tshab 'dra bar thob thang yang bcom ldan 'das kyi ring lugs su bkas bskos te btsan po'i gong du bkur/de nas ye shes dbang pos btsan por dkon mchog gi mchod pa'i rten du 'bangs mi khyim tshang nyis brgya dang/grwa btsun re (513) la 'bangs mi khyim dud gsum re rtsis gzhir byas nas zur du bcad thog de'i dbang dge 'dun la gnang nas lha ris kyi 'bangs mi ser sa zhing dang bcas par gong nas dbang cha mi gnang ba mdzad na dus nam du yang brtan por gnas shing legs par 'ong zhes gsol ba bzhin bstsal 'on kyang ban d+he myang ting nge 'dzin la sogs pa khag gcig gis ye shes dbang po'i zhal la mi nyan pa ma zad log bshad kyi nyes pa bsags pas ye shes dbang po thugs 'byung ste btsan po la sgom du 'gro chog par gsol nas lho brag mkhar chu btsan gyi dben gnas su gsang stabs kyis bros te phebs de rjes ston rtsed gyi rtsod pa byung bas btsan pos ji ltar thag gcod dgos min ma mkhyen par pho nya mngags te ye she dbang po bkug nas bka' gros mdzad ye shes dbang pos gsol ba ltar bal yul nas bo d+hi sa twa'i slob ma ka ma la shI la gdan drangs te ston rtse gnyis rtsod pas ston min pa pham nas ston rtsen gyi rtsod pa mjug 'gril mthar ye shes dbang po rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi sngon tsam du sku gshegs par gsungs (sba bzhed )dam (bsam yas kyi dkar chag chen po )zhes zhub de yang sba gsal snang gis brtsams par grags la de ni chos rgyal khri srong lde btsan sku dus kyi lo rgyus cung zad zhib par zhig yin zhing de'i nang don gtso che ba bsam yas gtsug lag khang bzhengs nas bod du sangs rgyas kyi chos spel ba'i lo rgyus yin}
