ma hA mA ya|{'di yang sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags gzhung nas bshad pa'i lha zhig gi mtshan yin/'di rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum yod pa las 'bring po gtso 'khor lnga yod pa'i bzhugs stangs dang sku mdog phyag mtshan sogs zhib par (dkyil chog nor bu'i phreng ba )las gsal}
ma hA tsi na|{'di la thu'u bkwan chos kyi nyi ma'i (grub mtha' shel dkar me long )le tshan bcu pa'i shog grangs 1las/rgya gar ba rnams kyis rgya nag gi yul la mahA tsi na zhes 'bod de/mahA ni chen po dang tsi na zhes pa rgya skad kyi chin {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i sgra zur nyams pa ste/g+r+ya yi rgyal po rnams kyi nang nas chin gyi rgyal srid la chin hri ho'ang {(WP:1,194)}bya ba'i rgyal po stobs dang mnga' thang shin tu che ba zhig gi mtha' dbus kyi yum grang mang po dbang du bsdus pa'i ming la yang rgyal srid kyi ming gis 'bod de/chin gyi rgyal khams zhes pa sgra nyams nas tsi na zhes grags par snang ngo zhes bshad/sngar gyi bshad rgyun du shan Ta'u {(WP:1,194)}zhes lha gling du yang 'bod pa yin tshul gung mgon po skyabs kyis brtsams pa'i (rgya nag chos 'byung )bod yig las 'byung}
mA la wa|{bu ston chen po ches mdzad pa'i (bde mchog gi chos 'byung )las/rgya gar nub phyogs rgya mtsho'i gling phrag zhig yin zhes gsungs pa dang/tA ra nA tha'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )las kyang nub phyogs mA la wa zhes gsungs/mA la wa zhes pa bod skad du bsgyur na 'phreng ba can zhes pa'i don yin par skad gnyis shan sbyar gyi gzhung 'gar bshad}
