mang thos klu sgrub rgya mtsho|{mkhas dang grub pa'i bdag nyin chen po 'di nyid stod zang zang byang rgyud kyi lung pa 'brong zhes bya ba'i nang tshan shel lung du yab lha mo lnga dar dang yul sems la rgyal 'dzom gnyis kyi sras su rab byung dgu pa'i chu lug (1523)lor sku bltams/mtshan klu rgyal nor bu zhes gsol/dgung lo chung dus nas chos dang yi ge sbyong bar dad brtson shin tu che/dgung lo bcu bzhi pa la chos 'khor gling du gdan drangs te 'jam mgon bla ma dang mjal ba yongs 'dzin dub tan nas bshad gsar gyi gzhung 'dzin dang sag zhung ngo sprod sbyor ba sogs kyi dbu tshugs shing/de sbas tshad ma rnam 'grel gyi snga gzhung phyi gzhung kun thugs 'dzin grub/dgung lo bco lnga par lcags thang rab 'byams pa byams pa bsod nams kyis mkhan po dang/paN grub bzang po bkra shis kyis slob dpon mdzad de rab tu byung/mtshan klu sgrub rgya mtsho zhes gsol/dgung lo nyi shur phebs skabs chos 'khor gling du 'jam mgon bla ma phyogs las rnam rgyal pa'i drung du lags bshad chos kyi bdud rtsi mtha' yas pa thugs lab zung/rnam 'grel le'u bzhi pa la zin bris gnang/dgung lo nyer gsum skabs tshar chen gyi drung du sa lugs kyi chos zab mo mang du gsan/de nas 'jam mgon bla ma dang ldan du mang mkhar kha'i phu'i grog phug tu phebs te thugs la gzhol ba nas bzung rlung zin pa'i nyams snang rgyun du byung/dgus lo nyer drug par jo nang kun dga' grol mchog gi drung du chos phur phebs te dbang lung man ngag mang po zhu gnang mdzad/dgung lo nyer bdun pa ra pa mtshal gung mkhas grub dpal 'bar rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas dbang bka' mang po zhus nas dwags shangs bka' brgyud gdams pa'i nying khu rnams thugs su bskyil/lhag par sems 'dzin 'phrul 'khor bslab sbyang shing du 'phel/dgung lo sum cu par cho gling gi slob dpon mdzad/lor 'di'i ngam rim chos sde'i dgung chos steng mkhan chen bzang po bkra shis kyis mkhan po dang/'jam dbyangs bla ma phyogs las rnam rgyal gyis las slob mdzad de bsten par rdzogs/dgung lo so gsum nas dug lo nga gcig bar sa ga chos sdings kyi slob dpon mdzad ring phar tshad gnyis dang/'dul mdzod zung/dbu sdom gnyis/byams chos rigs gter rnams la 'chad nyan rus thon pa mdzad/dgung lo nga gnyis par mnyan yod bya gshongs kyi khrir phebs pa nas dgung lo re bzhi bar lo hril po bcu gnyis gdan sa bskyangs/dgung lo drug cu re gcig par 'dar grang che chos 'khor yang rtse'i chos khrir phebs te gnas sa nyis lcogs lta bu gnang/dgung lo re bzhi par mnyan yod bya gshongs kyi khri pa mdzad/de nas rang gi gdan tshab du chos rje 'ga' rong pa bsko gzhag gnang/khri thog ring dgon pa'i 'chad nyan ha cang gong 'phel byung khar/'du khang gsar bzhengs dang/chos grwa (531) nyams dga' bar bskrun pa sogs phyag rjes che dgung lo re brgyad par dgon pa seng rdzong gi phyogs su thugs dam la bzhugs yul slob bshad nor bu'i gling bskrun te de gar dad 'dus slob ma'i tshogs la rang rang re'i zab chos ci rigs bstsal dgung lo bdun cu par dpal ngam ring chos sde'i gdan khrir phebs mkhas grub 'di nyid kyis kun mkhyen lcags thang rab 'byams pa bsod nams paN chen bzang po bkra shis 'jam mgon bla ma phyogs las rnam rgyal tshar chen blo gsal rgya mtsho jo nang pa kun dga' blo gros mchog sogs mkhas shing grub pa brnyes pa'i bla ma mang por bsten gnang gis mdo sngags chos tshul rgya mtsho'i pha mthar son par mdzad de mtshan rtsod rtsom gsum dang mkhas btsun bzang gsum gyi sgo nas bstan 'gro'i don 'ba' zhig lhur bzhes shing gsung las skyes pa'i slob ma'i tshogs kyang chos rje dga' rong pa dang chos rje 'bum pa sher blo ba chos rje cha lung pa sogs chos rje'i mtshan thob pa dang rab 'byams smra ba dka' bcu pa sogs brgya phrag brgal ba byon gsung rtsom la mtshon na (bstan rtsis gsal ba'i nyin byed/) (tha snyad rig gnas lnga'i byung tshul/) (phyag chen rtsod spong/) (phyag chen yang lan/) (rgyud man ngag gi brgyud 'debs/) (klu sgrub kyi bstod pa dang 'grel pa/) (rab gnas kyi rtsa ba/) (bzang drug gi lag len )sogs le tshan brgya phrag brgal ba dpar la 'khod pa dang ma 'khod pa khyon bsdoms pod chen bcu gsum yod par grags 'dir bar mkhas grub gang nyid dgung lo don gnyis bar gyi mdzad rnam rags bsdus shig yin gyi nam zhi bar gshegs pa'i lo dus ma rnyed}
