mi shes pa'i rgyu bzhi|{sangs rgyas kyi chos mi shes pa dang/yul gyis bskal pa/dus shin tu bskal ba/don rab tu dbye ba mtha' yas pa bcas te mi shes pa'i rgyu bzhi'o/_/de bzhi las sangs rgyas kyi chos mi shes pa ni/ngo bo'ip+sago nas bskal pa mi shes pa ste/dngos po'i rang bzhin phra ba'i dbang gis rtogs dka' ba/dper na/gnas brtan shA ri'i bus de bzhin gshegs pa'i tshul khrims kyi phung po la sogs pa mi shes pa lta bu'o/_/dus kyis bskal ba mi shes pa ni/dus yun ring ba'i dbang gis rtogs dka' ba/dper na/shA ri'i bus dge slong legs skar gyi rgyud la thar pa cha mthun gyi dge rtsa ma mthong ba lta bu'o/_/don rab tu mtha' yas pa mi shes pa ni/don gyi dbye ba shin tu rgya che bas rtogs dga' ba/dper na/mong 'gal gyi bus sems can gyi khams dang/'gro ba/skye gnas/ye ba la sogs pa'i bye brag sna tshogs mi shes pa lta bu'o/_/'di bzhi ni bye mdo gnyis kyi lugs su nyon mongs ma yin pa'i mi shes pa yin par 'dod do/_}
