mi'i khog tu brlams pa|{chos skyong sogs mi'i khog par zhugs pa/sngar spyi tshogs rnying pa'i skabs lha phebs pa'am lha babs pa zhes zer ba de yin/lha phebs pa'i srol 'di na sngar slob dpon pad+ma 'byung gnas bod du phebs pa'i rjes su thog mar byung/de yang rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis mkhan po bo d+hi swa twa spyan drangs nas mkhan po chos gsungs pa'i dus su/bod kyi lha srin rnams ma dga' bar mi nad dang gas nad lo nyes gtong/'phang thang gi gtsug lag khang chus khyer/lha sa'i dmar po ri la thog brgyab pa sogs byung bas/bod kyi lha srin gdug pa can 'dul ba'i slob dpon pad+ma rgya gar nas spyan drangs/bod du phebs rjes bu dang bu mog tsang ma la phra phabs pa dang/lha phabs pa sogs mdzad nas/sngar gnod par byed pa po lha srin sde brgyad su yin drin nas dam la btags shing/de nas rim gyis lha phebs pa'i srol du byung/de nas rab byung dang po'i nang bka' gdams kyi bstan pa dar ba nas de'i srol nyams/de nas karma pa'i bstan pa dar ba nas slar yang lha phabs pa'i srol gong 'phel du phyin pa yin nam snyam/('di'i skor bskyar du brtag dpyad dgos/)}
