mi'i nyi ma mthong ba don ldan|{mtshan gzhan byams pa dkon mchog rin chen mchog ni sngar bod kyi chos rgyal gyi gdung rgyud grags pa bsod nams rdo rje zhes bya ba'i sras su sku bltams/sku chung srid nas yod tan la dad brtson che zhing/dbul phongs dang dman pa rnams thugs brtse ba dang snying rje che ba'i byang sems ldan pas kun gyi (549) bkur yul du gyur yi ge 'bri klog skabs snying rus che la thugs rig shin tu skyen dgung lo bcu yas mas su 'phags yul gyi paN+Di ta chen po nags kyi rin chen dang lo chen bsod nams rgya mtsho byang bdag po rig gnas rnam rgya grags bzang sogs bsten nas sde snod gsum dang rgyud sde bzhi sogs rig gnas spyi dang khyad par du gso ba rig pa la sbyangs pa mthar phyin mdzad pas bod gangs can gyi yul 'dir dar ro cog gi gso dpyad mtha' dag la mkhyen pa rab tu brtas pa'i snyan grags sa steng khyab slob ma rnams la byams shing thugs brtse che bas yon tan bum gang byo'i tshul du bslabs nad pa la snying rje dang ngang rgyud 'dzam shing mchog dman dbyer med du 'bad pas gso bar mdzad (gso dpyad kyi rgyal po dang/) (rgyud bzhi'i 'grel pa/) (bkod pa rnam bzhi/) (ma la ya'i bka' 'grel 'dod 'jo che chung ) (gso dpyad kyi rgyal po/) ngo mtshar spyi sman rtsa mdo'i 'grel pa snyan brgyud rdo rje'i tshig rkang )sogs smad dpe mang po phyag rtsom mdzad yod pa bcas kyis bod kyi gso ba rig pa'i thad byang bdag po rnam rgyal grags bzang gi bzhed srol thon mong min pa rgyun 'dzin 'phel rgyas gtong bar phyag rjes shin tu che'o/_/('khrungs 'das kyi lo tshigs ma rnyed rung dam pa 'di nyid byang pa rnam rgyal grags bzang gi thugs sras yin pas bod rab byung bdun pa'i nang byon par snang/)}
