me mkha' rgya mtsho|{de ni grangs nges can zhig mtshan bye kyi ming brda zhig te (grangs kyi mngon brjod )ltar na me ni gsum dang/mkha' ni klad kor/thig dang rgya mtsho ni bzhi yi ming gi rnam grangs su bshad pa ltar byas na 304yin rung rtsis kyi rtsa tshig las/'bri bgrang snon pa rang gi g.yas/_/sgyur bgos 'phri ba g.yon la brtsams/_/zhes gsungs pa ltar grangs kyi mngon brjod ne bzlog te klog dgos pas grangs 403la ngos 'dzin dgos shing/de yang sham+b+ha la'i rigs ldan rgyal po bcu pa dang bcu gcig pas srid bskyangs pa'i yun bsdoms na bzhi bag+r+ya dang gsum zin pas phyis su rigs ldan rgyal po de gnyis kyi khri lo'i bsdom grangs mtshon byed kyi tha snyad du gyur to/_/sham+b+ha la'i rigs ldan brtsi tshul de ni dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i lugs yin la sangs rgyas dgung lo gya gcig (lo 'dir mya ngan las 'das )steng sham+b+ha la'i rgyal po zla ba bzang po sogs la dus 'khor rtsa rgyud gsungs pa nas mgo tshugs/mkhas dbang 'jigs med rig pa'i blo gros kyi (bod gangs can gyi sgra rig pa'i bstan bcos )nang bdag cag gi ston pa shAkya thub pas dgung lo rgya gcig pa dpa' bo lcags 'brug gi nag zla'i nya la dus 'khor gyi rgyud gsungs pa sham+b+ha la'i rgyal po zla bzang gis nyan te (lo bzhir rgyal srid bskyangs zhes gsungs pa de ni bsdus rgyud la lo 'di nas ni drug brgya'i lo yis gsal bar mi bdag grags pa sham+b+ha la zhes bya bar byung )zhes gsungs pa dang phal cher mthun zhing/khong gi bzhed pa ltar na ston pa'i 'das lo ni spyi lo ma tshugs sngon gyi brgyad brgya gya gcig lo la nges/'on kyang kun mkhyen 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i (bstan rtsis )dang sum pa ye shes dpal 'byor gyi (chos 'byung dpag bsam ljon par )gsal ba ltar na ston pas dus 'khor rtsa rgyud gsungs pa'i lo ni mngon par sangs rgyas pa'i phyi lo ste dgung lo so drug steng yin gyi mthar zhi bar gshegs pa'i lo ma yin zer yang des na bsdus rgyud kyi lung dang 'gal bas snga ma gtsigs che'o snyam/spyir dus 'khor lugs ltar na ston pas dus 'khor rtsa rgyud gsungs (spyi lo'i sngon gyi 882lo )nas lo gnyis par sham+b+ha la'i rgyal po zla bzang gis rgyud stong phrag bcu gnyis pa'i 'grel pa stong phrag drug cu pa mdzad/zla bzang gi rjes su rgyal po drug gis lo brgya brgya la chos bstan/de rim par brjod na rgyal po lha dbang/gzi brjid can/zla bas sbyin/lha'i dbang phyug /sna tshogs gzugs/lha'i dbang ldan te drug po lo drug brgyar bzhugs/zla bzang sogs bdun po la chos rgyal bdun zhes grags pa ni ston pas rtsa rgyud gsungs pa'i lo de nas lo drug brgya dang bzhi song ba'i lor sham+b+ha la'i khrir bzhugs/bsdus rgyud mdzad cing dus kyi 'khor lo'i dbang bskur bas drang srong nyi ma shing rta sogs thams cad rdo rje rigs gcig la mdzad pas 'di phyin la rigs ldan zhes grags/de yang thog mar rigs ldan 'jam dpal grags pa nas/gnyis pa pad+ma dkar po/gsum pa bzang po (bzang po'i khri lo don brgyad pa la spyi lo 'go tshugs/) bzhi pa rgyal rnam/lnga pa bshes gnyen bzang po/drag pa rin chen phyag /bdun (555) pa khyab 'jug sbas pa brgyad pa nyi ma grags dgu pa shin tu bzang po sogs ni re res srid lo brgya brgya bskyangs pas lo dgu brgya de nas rigs ldan bcu pa rgya mtsho rnam rgyal gyis lo brgya dang gya gnyis la chos bstan pa dang bcu gcig pa rgyal dkas lo nyis brgya dang nyer gcig bstan pas rigs ldan de gnyis kyis chos bstan pa'i yun tshad bsdoms pas bzhi brgya dang gsum byung ba ne mkha' rgya mtsho'i lor bzhag pa de yin de nas bcu gnyis pa nyi ma (me mkha' rgya mtsho rdzogs pa'i phyi lo ste rigs ldan nyi ma'i khri lo dang po dang spyi lo 1027nas rab byung dang po'i 'go tshugs/) bcu gsum pa sna tshogs gzugs bcu bzhi pa zla 'od bco lnga pa mtha' yas bcu drug pa sa skyong bcu bdun pa dpal skyong bco brgyad pa seng+ga bcu dug pa rnam gnon nyi shu pa stobs po che nyer gcig pa ma 'gags pa nyer gnyis pa mi yi seng+ga nyer gsum pa dbang phyug chen po nyer bzhi pa mtha' yas rnam rgyal te de dag kyang srid skyong ba'i yun tshan brgya re yin de nas nyer lnga pa drag po 'khor lo can te 'jam dpal grags pa nas 'di'i bar la sham+b+ha la'i rigs ldan nyer lngar grags gzhan yang rgyal po zla bzang nas drag po 'khor lo can bar la c