mon khul 'go 'dzin rta dbang bla gnyer|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs mon khul gyi 'go 'dzin gyi dpon gnas shig ste/mon yul ni sngar btsan po srong btsan sgom po'i skabs nas bod khongs bsnyon med thog rgya bzang kong jos bod kyi sa bkra brtsi skabs mtha' 'dul gtsug lag khang gi ya rgyal legs po sa gnas su ru gnon lha khang brtsigs shing/bod rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag lo phan la mon sha 'ug stag sgo zhes pa'i lha khang der lo ltar bod sa gnas srid gzhung nas mtha' 'dul yang 'dul lha khang spyi dang 'dra ba'i mchod sprin spro mus sogs kyi yun ring lo rgyus yod pa dang/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags sprel (1680)lo tA la'i bla ma lnga pa chen pos zhal slob me rag bla ma blo gros rgya mtsho dang/mtsho sna lding nam mkha' 'brug grags gnyis mon yul du gtong gnang gis chos dang srid kyi sgo nas sngar gyi lo rgyus 'chad/rim bzhin rta dbang dga' ldan rnam rgyal gling dgon btab/me rag bla ma sku tshe'i ring dgon gyi bla ma dang yul sde'i 'tsho tshis mdzad/de'i rjes thogs su rim bzhin rta dbang bla gnyer zhes gnas lnga pa'i rtse drung re bsko gzhig gis rta dbang dgal ldan rnam rgyal lha rtse dgon gyis gtsos mon khul lha mi'i sde dgon tshang ma'i khral bsdu khrims gnon dang/sa mtshams skor sogs dmigs bsal gal che'i rigs gzhung gnas la dgongs skor zhu dgos pa dang/de byings rta dbang bla gnyer dang/mtsho sna rdzong sbrel/dgon pa'i las sne/'tsho shog khag gi lding dang/'go 'gran bcas sngar lam bzhi sbrel lam/drug sbrel gyi thog nas thag gcod byed pa las/rta gnyer gcig pus thag gcod byed dbang med/spyir btang mon khul 'di bzhin sa rgya sha cang che la gdod ma'i nags tshal gyi gseb tu rtsa che'i gcan gzan dang bya/ri dwags che chung sna tshogs kyis khengs pa/rtswa sman/shing sman/rdo sman/shing 'bras sna tshogs/gla rtsi/dom mkhris/khrag rwa sogs rtsa che'i smag rigs/btsod dang/gla rdzab/shug rdzab/be rdzab la sogs pa'i rtsa che'i shing rigs sogs rang byung khams kyi thon khungs phun sum tshogs po yod}
