myang mang po rje zhang snang|{rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i blon po zhig gi ming yin pa dang/rgyal po dang blon po 'di gnyis kyi bar blon po khyung po spungs sad zu tses phra ma bcug ste zu tses rang dang blo nye ba'i mi mang po zhang snang gi bran g.yog la mngags te zhang snang bsad pa dang mkhar grang yang gshigs pa bcas tun hong nang thon pa'i bod kyi lo rgyus yig char gsal zhing/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang blon po de rgyal po mang sro mang btsan gyi blon po yin par gsungs pa dpyad gzhi'i yig cha gzhan zhig gzigs nas gsung pa yin nges snyam}
