dmag rkang|{dmangs gtso'i bcos bsgyur skabs brtag dpyad byas pa'i dpyad gzhi'i yig rigs ltar na/gzhung rgyugs mi ser dpag rkang re nas dmag mi re gtong dgos pa dang/de yang dbus khul du gnyis sna'i dmag re/gtsang khul bzhi sna'i dmag re 'khri/rjes su brgyad sna zer ba yang bskul yod/rkang gnyi nas dmag mi re 'khri ba lag nyis sna'i dmag zer ba dang/rkang zhi nas dmag mi re 'khri ba la bzhi sna'i dmag zer zhing/rkang brgyad nas dmag ma re 'khri ba la brgyad sna'i dmag zer/sger pa khag dang gdon pa khag gi mi ser nas srid gzhung la 'don bzhi nas dmag mi re gtong dgos/dmag phogs zla ba re la 'brul khal gnyis/ja/mar/tshwa/bul/shing bcas kyi dod dngul srang re/dmag mi la/lo re dbyar dgun gyi gyon chas cha tshang re sprod dgos pa'i dbyar gos la/phying zhwa/ras gyi stong thung gos thung/snam bu spu phrug gi phyu pa/lham 'jur rta bcas dang/dgun gos la/zhwa mo lpags zhwa/snam bu'i stod thung dang gos thung cha tshang/lham shol rtse/dmag phogs che bar mi rer 'bru khal 36/'bring la khal 24/chung bar khal 18/lag dngul che bar bod dngul rdo tshad bco lnga (srang 750) 'bring bar rdo tshad bcu (srang 500) chung bar rdo tshad brgyad (dngul srang 400) phogs snod sgye phad re/nyal chas btsugs phrag re/slel bu re/gal te mi gzhan dag glas pa yin tshe/dmag gla che bar lo gcig la bod dngul rdo tshad brgya tham pa (srang 5000) 'bring bar rdo tshad dgu bcu (srang 4500) chung bar rdo tshad brgyad cu (srang 4000) da dung dmag spyi las khangs kyi gzhung khra nang gsal ba ltar lo gnyis gsum re'i mtshams su dmag rkang re nas dmag chas snam bu spu phrug spus legs 'dom tshad 16long pa re sprod dgos pa dang/ru spyi'i las dod zer ba dmag rkang re nas pho lo'i skabs bod dngul srang 30skor dang/mo lo'i skabs dngul srang 40skor sprod dgos/dmag mi yul byol du song tshe/do bdag la nyes pa gser srang 10(dngul srang 96) dmag mi'i tshab gsar pa ma btsugs bar du nyin grangs ji song gi 'gyang chad nyin re la dung zho gsum re'i 'bab sprod dgos/dmag mi gsar pa slebs nyin dmag spyi dang/mda' dpon/ru dpon/brgya dpon/bcu dpon bcas la go gnas mtho dman dang bstun pa'i 'jal rten 'bul dgos pa bcas yin}
