dmag dpon|{de snga btsan po'i dus skabs su spyi khyab blon (564) chen gyi bkod 'doms 'og ru chen lnga'i dmag dpung khag so sor 'go byed mkhan zhig ste de'i las 'gan ni rang nyid kyi sa khongs de'i bde 'jags srung skyob dang tshur rgol byed mkhan gyi dgra bo 'gog pa rgyun du zhing 'brog thon skyed la bkod 'doms byed pa dmag mi bsdu len byed rgyu bcas yin de'i go gnas kyi rim pa'i dbang du byas ni rim pa lnga yod 1 ru dpon 2 sde dpon 3 stong dpon 4 stong bu chung gi rje 5 lnga brgya chen po bcas yod pa so so'i ngos 'dzin ka mad go rim lta khag so so'i nang gsal}
dmag spyi las khungs|{de snga bon sa gnas srid gzhung skabs kyi dmag spyi las khungs zhes pa 'di ni rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu byi (1912)lo lu'u can rgya dmag mtha' 'bud btang rjes chu glang (1913)lo tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa chen po ston 'khor rgya gar nas lha sar zhabs sor 'khod 'phral lha sa'i dmag don spyi khyab mkhan drung byams pa bstan dar la dmag don byas rjes su bka' blon bla ma bsko gzhag thog mdo smad khul gyi zhi drag spyi 'doms su las bya dpon rigs ngad bcas bsko rdzongs gnang tshab spyan bsal gnam gang zla bzang dgra 'dul la dza sag thag dmag spyi che ba'i go gnas dang/rtsis dpon khri smon nor bu dbang rgyal la tha'i ji'i thog dmag spyi chung bi go gnas bcas bsko gzhag gis bod ljongs dmag spyi las khungs sam dmag spyi khang zhes rtse po ta la'i mdun ngos zhol go mdzod rdo rje gling du drag po'i spyi 'doms las khangs gsar du 'dzugs gnang mdzad/thog mar las khungs der rgyun tshugs las bya'i khongs su dmag drung gnyis/las bya rtse drung gnyis/lha sdod dmag sgar khag nas yig 'bri lding dpon kha shas/phyis 'phar las bya shod skor rim bzhi gcig dang/rtse skor lan tshan pa gcig bcas las grub cing/las khungs de'i gtso bo'i las 'gan ni srid gzhung de'i drag dpung khag gi spyi khyab 'go 'doms byed dgos pa dang/lha sdod dmag sgar dang/phyogs thon dmag sgar khag gi phogs 'bru skyel 'dren dang/dbyar dgun gyon bsdu/go lag rdzas mdel skyel 'dren gyi dos lta lam yig sogs las khungs de gi mda' dpon bsko 'then bka' shag nas 'char phul gyis tA la'i bla ma'i phyag rtags zhu dgos pa dang/ru dpon bsko 'then skabs dmag spyi khang nas 'char phul gyis bka' shag gi phyag rtags zhu dgos pa/brgya lding gnyis dmag spyi khang nas bsko 'then byed lam yod/chu byi (1912)lo nas bzung mdo smad khul sa srung g+r+ya che khag bgos kyis gtong dgos pa dang/lha sar gtan sdod tA la'i bla ma'i sku srung dmag sgar/grong khyer bde 'jags srung dmag bcas kyi dgos mkhor gzhigs te de snga'i bod dmag sum stong tham pa'i thog 'don dmag nyis sna/bzhi sna/brgyad sna/bcu gnyis drug sna (gzhun