rme ru rnying pa|{sa'i gtsug lag khang gi shar sgo ste se ra ltag sgo'i 'gram du yod pa'i rme ru rnying pa ni dus rabs dgu pa'i nang btsan po khri ral pa can gyis gtsug lag khang gi shar lho byang gsum la lha khang drug bzhengs pa'i gras shar du rme ru zhes pa de yin skad/skabs de'i lha khang ni da lta sgo shar blta yin pa'i 'og khang de yin pa dang/rten gtso sangs rgyas mar me mtshan la nye ba'i sras brgyad kyis skor ba'i 'jim brnyan thog tshad ma dang/lho byang gnyis su dzam la dang/rnam srang ljang seng gi sku yod/de'i dzam b+ha de ni paN+Di ta da ni shi las dzam lha'i lto ba nas dngul phye bton pa'i lo rgyus yod/rjes su rme ru dgon pa de lha sa'i byang ngos su spos stabs de gar rme ru rnying pa zhes ming chags/lha khang de'i 'dzin bdag rme ra grwa tshang nas byed/de'i nye 'gram rgya skyed kyis lha khang rnying pa'i steng du la sogs kyi mgon khang nang rten gtso bo 'jigs byed krong bskyed dang/mgon po bram gzugs sogs kyi sku brnyan yod pa de'i 'dzin bdag lho kha gong dkar chos sdes byed/rgyal sgo byang blta'i shar ngos gyi ma khang gsum thog 'du khang dang bcas pa de'i 'dzin bdag gnas chung grwa tshang nas byed cing/smon lam dang/tshogs mchod skabs gnas chung sku brten de gar gzhis phab kyi yod/'du khang nas gnas chung rdo rje drag ldan gyi sku gsob sogs yod}
