smad rgyud|{(rgyud smad )grwa tshang 'di thog mar 'dzugs pa po rje tsong kha pa'i slob ma rje btsun shes rab seng ge (rab byung drug pa'i mjug nas rab byung bdun pa'i shing glang bar )yin/chung dus su rje tsong kha pa'i drung du mdo sngags kyi chos mang po gsan/rje tsong kha pas sngags kyi grwa tsang 'dzugs dgos par bka' gnang ba bzhin rab byung bdun pa'i chu glang (1433)lor dga' ldan du thog mar btsugs/thog mar gnas nges med du chos dbar bsteg nas phebs pa la/pho lha tha'i ji'i dus skabs tsam nas lha sa rme ru dgon pa'i 'khris kyi rgyud khang de gsar du bzhengs pa de nas bzung chos thog skabs ma gtogs lha sar bzhugs pa 'di byung ba yin/zhib cha phur lcog ngag dbang byams pa'i gsung (grwa sa chen po bzhi dang rgyud grwa stod smad chags tshul )zhes pa de'i nang gsal}
