smad byang sems shes rab bzang po|{rje 'di ni rab byung bdun pa'i (1387nas 1420)nang ri bo che yor spe dge stong dpon gyi rigs sras su 'khrungs zhing/sku chung dus karma pa'i chos sgor zhugs/de nas dbus gtsang gi phyogs su byon te rgyal pa gnyis pa shar tsong kha pa chen po rtsa ba'i bla mar bkur/mkhas mchog dar ma rin chen dang/mkhas grub dge legs dpal bzang/rje dge 'dun grub pa sogs kyi zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags rab 'byams la gsan bsam rgya cher mdzad/de nas kun mkhyen byang chub 'bum pa'i bka' lung dang/rgyal tsham du ma rin chen gyi bka' bzhin mdo khams su phebs te rab byung bdun pa'i shing byi (1444)lor gdan sa chen po chab mdo byams pa gling phyag btab/de rjes bka' chen gyi bshad pa mdzad pas chos rje rnam rgyal grags pa dang/slob dpon rnam pa lngas gtsos dge ba'i bshes gnyen shin tu mang po bsdus/rgyu mtshan de la brten nas byang sems chen po zhes snyan grags bzang pos (578) mdo khams kyi tha gru kun tu khyab byang sems shes rab bzang po sku 'das rjes zhang zhung chos dbang grags pa dang stod lung pa mtshur ston nam mkha' dang shes rab dpal brtsegs gzhon nu dpal shod pa chos rje kun dga' dpal ldan sogs mkhas grub rin pas gdan sa bskyangs}
