sman khang pa ngag dbang chos 'phel|{rje 'di ni gtsang khul du yab dar rgyas dang yum tshe ring bsam grub gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing phag (1635)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga la shel dkar chos sde'i mkhan po lags pa don grub drung du gtsug phud phul/dgung lo bcu gcig la sher dkar chos sder chos zhugs mdzad/gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bsam gnang/dgung lo bco brgyad la rgyal dbang lnga pa blo bzang rgya mtsho'i drung du rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo bcu dug pa la rta nag rje dam chos rgyal mtshan pa nas byang chub lam rim sogs kyi bshad lung gsan/dgung lo nyer bzhi la mkhan po bkra shis rgya mtsho'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs/dgung lo so gnyis la ngar rim chos sder grwa skor mdzad/dgung lo so gsum la rgyal ba'i bka' 'gyur khongs 'bum pod bzhi dang/shes rab khri pa sogs pod 'ga' thugs 'dzin gyis tshogs gzhung la rgyugs 'bul mdzad cing/dgung lob zhi bcu nas lo shas ring dgon pa zhig gso'i phyag las 'gan bzhes/gdung lo zhe gnyis nas lo shas ring kha shas rags pa rgyun gcod mdzad de mtshams sgo 'dag sbyar gyis sku mtshams la bzhugs/dgung lo zhe bdun thog dge slong don grub dang lhan du rta nag tu phebs nas rje dam chos rgyal mtshan dang mjal/de nas dbus su phebs te se 'bras dang/rwa sgreng/lho dwags sogs la gnas mjal du phebs rjes gtsang du paN chen blo bzang ye shas mjal bar byon/stod khul rje btsun mi la'i sgrub gnas chu dbar brag dmar du sgrub pa rtse gcig tu mdzad/dga' ldan chos 'phel du gsung chos ji snyed gnang/shel dkar dgon sogs la rten zhes kyi bya ba rgya che mdzad/phyag rtsom (ngo mtshar med kyang ngag dbang chos 'phel gyi bya phran khyung rjes rnyog 'dra'i rnam thar/) ('khrungs rabs gsol 'debs gsang ba dri med )sogs pod gnyis tsam mdzad/dgung lo don gsum la phebs pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me phag (1707)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su gshegs}
