sman rtsis khang|{lha sa smin rtsis khang ni rab byung bco lnga pa'i me 'brug (1916)lo'i zla 9pa'i nang gsar du btsugs shing/khang pa dbus ma gnyis thog dang/shag khor thog gcig ma/mdun ngos su sngo sman 'debs 'dzugs byed sa'i ldum rwa sogs yod/de gar bod sman dang/skar rtsis/snyan sum/sgra rig pa sogs slob gnyer byed sa yin pa dang/thog mar 'dzugs skabs tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i bla sman dngos gzhi byams pa thub dbang gis spyi dang/mkhas dang mkhyen rab nor bus do dam pa'i 'gan bzhes shing/lo 'khor gtong gron dngul 'bab rtse rnam gan dngul bskyed dwags kong bcas kyi gzhis dgon khag nas sman rtsis slob gsar shes rig ldan pa'i grwa gzhon skong bsdu byas chog pa'i 'gan dbang yod pa dang/slob ma rnams sman rtsis dang sgra rig la sogs pa slob gter mthar phyin byung rjes slob thon lag 'khyer blangs te rang gnas su log srol yod/sman rtsis khang du sman dang/rtsis/sgra rig pa sogs kyi dpe cha'i par shing dang/sman thang sogs rig gnas kyi slob sbyong la mkho ba'i dpe ris mang po yod}
