smon grub sbug thub bstan rgyal po|{rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu stag (1902)lo lha sar 'khrungs shing/dgung lo brgyad du son skabs tsa rig nas slob grwar (de lnga'i sa gnas da gzhung gi dpon rigs ser mo ba gso sbyong byed pa )slob sbyong gnang ba dang/zhabs sdod zhus (rtse drung byas pa )rjes mdo spyi'i (mdo smad spyi khyab )las bya dang/yig tshang las byed/yig tshang gnyer pa/rtse phyag ngo ma (rim pa bzhi pa )mkhas che sogs kyi 'gan bzhes/dgung lo gzhon skabs snyan rtsom dang/sgyur rtsal la shin tu mnyes pa yod stabs mo'i sgyu rtsal la brtson zhib gnang ba ma zad/lha mo'i 'khrab rtsal nges can khong du chud nas rnam thar gtong mkhas la snyen 'jebs ldan pas khong gi btang gnang ba'i rnam thar skad par 'khor lor sgra 'jug byed myong yod/khong gis rtse phyag ngo ma'i 'gan bzhes rjes zho ston gong mo tshogs pa khag gi lha mo'i tshod 'khrab chen por zhib bsher rgyug len gnang thog / mo'i sgyu rtsal yar rgyas gong 'phel gtong thabs gnang nas mo'i 'khrab 'khyer dang/rnam thar gtong stobs sogs khong ngo mas slob khrid gnang gi yod/dmangs gtso'i bcas sgyur rjes ljongs srid dros kyi u yon dang/ljongs nang bstan mthun tshogs kyi las 'dzin gnang/rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu glang (1973)lor dgung lo don gsum thog sku gshegs}
