smon lam chen mo|{de snga bod zla dang po'i tshes gsum nas lha sa gtsug lag khang du smon lam gyi gral 'dzin 'go tshugs pa nas chos sde chen po 'bras ser dga' gsum gtso bor gyur pa'i dge 'dun nyis khri nas sum khri bar 'tshogs te 'dus tshogs su bsnyen bkur mchod sprin spel ba'i smon lam chen mo tshogs srol yod pa de ni sngon ston pa shAkya mu nes rgya gar gyi grong khyer chen po gnyan yod ces pa'i yul du spyi'i lo sngon gyi 511lo mi 'brug zla 1tshes ka nas tshes 15bar mu stegs pa'i ston pa drug dang rdzu 'phrul 'gran pa dang/tshes 8nyin rdzu 'phrul gyis dngos gzhi'i mtho rlabs 'phyur te mi tshogs rgya mtsho lta bu'i dbus su mthar mu stegs pa'i ston pa drug 'khor tshar bcad de rnam par rgyal ba der dran gso zhu ched rgya gar du chos 'phrul ma chod pa'i dus ston chen mo bya srol dang dus mtshungs par rab byang bdun pa'i sa glang (1409)lor rje bla ma tsong kha pa chen pos sne gdong mi dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan dang sne'u rdzong dpon nam mkha' bzang por slob ston mdzad de dad sbyin khag nas gtsug lag khang zhig gso gsar bzhengs lta bu mdzad cing/khyad par ston pa dgung grangs bcu gnyis kyi sku tshad rin po che rna lnga las grub pa khyad par can jo bo rin po cher 'bod pa ma 'ongs klu yul du gshegs pa'i lung bstan yod pa ltar de las phyir bsrings phyir nges pa lnga ldan gyi longs skur zhal bsgyur ba'i rin chen dang po'i dbu rgyan dang mchod pa sna tshogs bshams shing/tshes pa brgyad dang bco lnga la gser chab kyis mtshon bsnyen bkur tshogs mchod dpag tu med pa mdzad/phyi rol du phyogs skyong gi dar chen bco (584) lnga rang rang gi phyogs su btsugs dge 'dun khri phrag 'gar bsnyes bkur ba'i srol bzang tshugs te rgyal ba'i bstan pa rin po che dri ma med pa spyi dang khyad par 'jam mgon rgyal ba gnyis pa'i lung rtogs kyi bstan pa rin po che phyogs dus gnas skabs thams cad du dar zhing rgyas la yun ring du gnas pa de 'dzin bstan pa'i srog zung chen po gang na su bzhugs pa rnams gdul bya'i don dub skal pa rab 'byams zhing gi dus rnyed du 'tsho zhing bzhes pa mtha' dbus kyi sk