tsan+d+ra bdun|{rgya gar gyi lo rgyus su/rgya gar shar phyogs b+hang g+ha la (deng sang rgya skad du mong ca la )zer ba tsan+d+ra'i rigs las rgyal po tsan+d+ra'i ming can bcu dgu byung ba'i (1 hi ri tsan+d+ra/2 a k+Sha tsan+d+ra/3 dza ya tsan+d+ra/4 ne mi tsan+d+ra/5 pha ni tsan+d+ra/6 b+hang sa tsan+d+ra/7 sa la tsan+d+ra/8 tsan+d+ra gas dro/9 shri tsan+d+ra/10 d+harma tsan+d+ra/11 karma tsan+d+ra/12 bri k+Sha tsan+d+ra/13 pi ga ma tsan+d+ra/14 kAmatsan+d+ra/15 bing+ga tsan+d+ra/16 bA la tsan+d+ra/17 bi ma la tsan+d+ra/18 go bi tsan+d+ra/19 la li ta tsan+d+ra bcas so/_/de dag (590) gi nang nas gnyis pa a k+Sha tsan+d+ra dang gsum pa dza ya tsan+d+ra bcu pa d+harma tsan+d+ra bcu gcig pa karma tsan+d+ra bcu gsum pa pi ga ma tsan+d+ra bcu bzhi pa kA ma tsan+d+ra bcu bdun pa bi ma la tsan+d+ra bcas bdun po de rnams srid dbang bzung yun ring zhing sangs rgyas chos lugs la dad pa gus dang byas rjes chen po can yin pas rgya gar gyi lo rgyus thog gong gsal rgyal po bdun po der tsan+d+ra bdun zhes zer rgyal po 'di rnams dus skabs gang du byung ba dang srid dbang bzung ba'i lo grangs bcas gsal bar bshad pa ma mthong zhing tsan+d+ra'i rigs kyi rgyal po dang po hi ri tsan+d+ra ni slob dpon klu sgrub kyi slob ma bram ze sgra gcan 'dzin dang dus mtshungs par (rgya gar chos 'byung )las bshad pas der gzhi bzung na spyi lo ma tshugs gong gi lo brgya lhag tsam gyi sngon du byung ba 'dra zhing tsan+d+ra'i rigs kyi rgyal po tha ma la li ta tsan+d+ra ni (rgya gar chos 'byung )las slob dpon chos kyi grags pa'i rjes tsam du byung bar bshad pas gong gsal tsan+d+ra'i rigs kyi rgyal po bcu dag ni spyi lo'i gong gi lo brgya lhag tsam gyi sngon nas dus rabs bdun pa'i dkyil tsam bar byung ba yin tshod las zhib cha'i lo rgyus gsal bar 'khod pa da phan ma mthong bod yig thog 'khod pa ni jo nang tA ra nA thas brtsams pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )le'u bcu bzhi pa nas le'u nyi shu rtsa bdun par gsal bas der gzigs}
