tsong kha pa|{rje tsong kha pa chen po blo bzang grags pa ni bod rab byung drug pa'i me bya (1357)lor mdo smad kyi sa'i cha shar tsong kha'i yul (deng sang mtsho sngon zhing chen khongs sku 'bum dgon pa chags yul der yin 'dug )du yab da ra kha che glu 'bum dge dang/yum shing bza' a chos kyi sras su sku bltams/dgung lo gsum la chos rje karma pa sku phreng bzhi pa rol pa'i rdo rje las dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes shing/mtshan kun dga' snying po zhes gsol/dgung lo bdun la chos rje don grub rin chen pas mkhan po mdzad pa dang/tha bden gzhon nu seng ge'i slob ma gzhon du byang chub pas slob dpon mdzad de dge tshul gyi (591) sdom pa bzhes nas mtshan blo bzang grags pa zhes gsol chos rje don grub rin chen gyis rje tsong kha pa sku byis pa'i dus nas bdag skyong gis shin tu gces par mdzad de bskyangs rab tu byung zhing rdo rje theg pa'i sgor smin par mdzad klog pa thos bsam dang spong ba bsam gtan la rtse gcig tu brtson pa dgos pa'i zhal ta bstsal ba dang dbus su byon pa'i cha rkyen yang bskrun par mdzad dgung lo bcu drug la son pa'i skabs 'bring gung pa'i 'bul dpon ma rin chen dpal gyis gdan 'dren pa'i grogs dan dang bcas bod du byan skyabs dam chos 'chol ba'i thugs 'dun kho na'i dbang du gyur pas sku ngal gyi cha phra mo tsam gyis ma gos par chab mdo brgyud dbus su byon te chu glang (1373)lo'i ston dus 'bri gung mthil du phebs nas spyan snga chos kyi rgyal po mjal zhing theg chen sems bskyed sogs zhu gnang mdzad de rjes tshal pa'i sman pa mkhas pa dkon mchog skyabs zhes pa'i gang du byon nas (sman dpyad yan lag brgyad pa )sogs thugs 'dzin dang phyag len slob sbyong mdzad nas ring min nyid du gso rig la shin tu mkhas par gyur de nas chos grwa chen po bde ba can (deng sang rwa stod dgon pa )du byon nas snye thang pa bkra shis seng ge dang gnang sa pa dge bsko gnyis las chos 'brel gsan bde ba can gyi bla ma 'jam rin par byams chos gsan zhing thugs su chad par mdzad snye thang chos rdzong du bla ma dam pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyi drung nas bde mchog dril bu lus dkyil gyi dbang sogs zhu bar mdzad lo gnyis tsam nas phar phyin gyi tshig don la shin tu mkhas par gyur nas dgung lo bcu dgu'i steng gsang bu dang bde ba can sogs su grwa skor la byon gzhan yang snga phyir sa bzang paN chen ma ti pa las chos bka' ci rigs dang sgra jo nang chos rje phyogs las rnam rgyal gyi drung nas sbyor ba yan lag drug pa snar thar lo tsA ba don bzang pa las mdzod dang mtshan ma'i TIk+ka rje btsun red mda' ba las mdzod rang 'grel dbu ma tshad ma mngon pa kun btus dang skyor mo lung gi mkhas po blo gsal ba las 'du ba dang mdzod mal gro lha lung bla ma bsod grags las chos lung mang po bo don lo tsA ba nam mkha' bzang po las snyan ngag me long la bshad rgyugs gdan sa mthil du spyan snga chos grags pa las nA ro chos drug dang sgra sogs bla ma ye shes rgyal mtshan las dus 'khor gyi 'grel chen sogs bu ston gyi dngos slob gong gsum bde chen pa chos kyi dpal ba las dus 'khor dang rdor 'phreng khyung po lhas pa gzhon nu bsod nams las yo ga'i skor sogs bla ma dbu ma pa dpa' bo rdo rje las dbu ma 'jug pa'i rang 'grel sogs gsan pa dang dbu ma lo tsA mdzad de rje btsun 'jam dbyangs las dbu ma'i lta ba sngags dbu ma la dpal bo rdo rje las dbu ma 'jug pa'i rang 'grel sogs gsan pa dang dbu bas lo tsA mdzad de rje btsun 'jam dbyangs las dbu ma'i lta ba sngags mtshan nyid kyi khyad par gas bla med kyi lam gyi gnad dang rim lnga'i go rim drang nges sogs di rogs legs par bcad pa gnang lho brag grub chen las snyan rgyud dang bka' gdams lam rim pa dang gdams ngag pa'i rgyud pa grwa skor mkhan chen chos skyabs bzang po las bka' gdams gzhung pa ba'i gtsang du byon tshun bshes gnyen bcu phrag bzhi tsam bsten gsang phu dang bde ba can sogs gdan sa chen po rnams su mdo sngags gzhung lugs la thos bsam sgom gsum dang 'chad rtsod rtsom pa rgya cher gnang nas bshad sgrub kyi bya bas dus 'da' bar mdzad dgung lo nyi shu lhag tsam du son skabs yar lung rnams rgyal du phebs te kha che paN+Di ta shAkya shri b+ha dra'i mkhan rgyud tshogs chen pa'i mkhan po dkar bzhi tshul rin pas mkhan po dang tshogs pa bye rdzing mkhan po 'dul 'dzin sher dkon gyis las slob sdom brtson bsod nams rdo rjes gnang ston mdzad nas (592) bsnyen par rdzogs pa'i sdom pa bzhes dgung grangs so drug pa chu sprel (1329)lo'i zla bcu par 'jam dpal dpal ldan bzang po dang gnas brtan rin chen rgyal mtshan gnas brtan bzang po skyong gnas brtan byang seng bcas dbus pa bzhi dang rtogs ldan 'jam dpal rgya mtsho dang dge bshes shes rab grags pa dge bshes 'jam dpal bkra shis dge bshes dpal skyong ste mdo smad pa bzhi bcas 'khor dag pa rnam brgyad dang lhan du dpon slob dgu skyor mo lung nas 'ol dga' chos lung du phebs te bsags sbyang dang sgrub pa gtso bor mdzad cing dben gnas lha sdings su thugs dam nyams bzhes skabs zab mo dbu ma'i lta ba thugs su 'khrungs mdor na dbus gtsang gi gdan sa chen po rnams su mkhas par sbyangs shing dben pa'i gnas rnams su sgrub pa snying por mdzad mdo sngags kyi gsung rab thams cad kyi don sangs rgyas kyi dgongs pa ji bzhin bkral ma zad don nyams su bzhes te phyi ru nyan thos kyi spyod pa zhi zhing dul ba dang nang du rim gnyis kyi rnal 'byor la gzhol ba'i lta spyod gtsang ma'i lugs bzang spel te gangs can mkhas grub kun gyis gtsug tu bkur zhing mtha' dbus skye 'gro thams cad kyis gus shing btud khong gi bla ma red mda' bas kyang gangs can mkhas pa'i gtsug rgyan zhes bsngags par mdzad pa ma zad mkhas dbang 'gos lo gzhon du dpal gyis kyang de yi dus su sa chen po 'di rje tsong kha pa'i gdugs dkar gcig gis khyab nas yod pa yin zhes gsungs yod me byi (1396)lor gnyal stod grwa grong du dka' bcu dar ma rin chen dang mjal zhing sras kyi thu bor gyur dgung lo zhe drug pa rab byung bdun pa'i chu rta (1402)lor gnam rtse lding du dbyar gnas mdzad de 'dul ba'i phyag len la dag ther dang lo der rwa sgreng yang dgon du byang chub lam rim che mo gsar rtsom mdzad tsong kha pa chen po dgung grangs nga gcig pa me phag (1470)lor se ra chos sdings mkhas grub dge legs dpal bzang gis mjal bar phebs te zhabs la gtugs pas sras kyi thu bor gyur lo der gong ma tA ming yung lo rgyal po thugs