 logs su skrun bzhed ltar dgung grangs nga dgu pa shing lug lo de'i dbyar dus su yangs can gtsug lag khang ka ba bdun cu don gnyis dang gtsang khang khyams dang bcas pa'i rmang bting nas de'i phyi lo me sprel (1416)lor legs par grub me bya (1417)lo'i zla gsum pa'i nang bzo rig mkhas pa sprul sku sle'u chung ba sogs du ma bskongs nas yang can gtsug lag khang gi rten gtso thub dbang tshul khrims ma'i gser sku che mos gtsos gser zangs kyi sku che ba rnams dang blos bslangs kyi dkyil 'khor gum sogs yangs can gtsug lag khang gi rten rnams gsar bskrun dang 'brel rgyud sde'i dgongs pa bzhin phyag len rnam par dag pas brgyan pa dga' ldan sgrub mchod che mor grags pa 'dzugs gnang mdzad sa khyi (1418)lor yangs can chos rgyal lha khang gi mgon khang du rten gtso rdo rje 'jigs byed kyi 'jim brnyan che ba dang srung ma'i gtso bo dam can chos rgyal yab yum mgon po gtso 'khor rnams so so'i rgyud nas bshad pa ltar cha tshad ldan pa gsar skrun thog sku rten rnams la rab (594) gnas dang rten bzhengs legs sgrub kyi dga' ston rgya cher mdzad tsong kha pa chen po dgung grangs re gsum du phabs pa sa phag (1419)lo'i ston dus stod lung dang 'bras spungs lha sa se ra gsang gas mkhar gru bzhi rnams su phebs nas chos mang du gsungs slar yang dga' ldan du phebs nas thub dbang tshul khrims ma'i mdun dum chod 'bul dang smon lam rgyas par mdzad rjes gzim khang (khri thog khang )du phebs te sras kyi thub bo dar ma rin chen la sku ber dang dbu zhwa gnang ste rang nyid kyi rgyal tshab tu don gyis go bar mdzad rab byung bdun pa'i sa phag (1419)zla bcu pa'i tshe nyi shu lnga nyid snga rdo nyi drod tsam la gzim khang 'od gsal sbug tu sku gshegs gsum 'bum pod bco brgyad yod pa sku gshegs rjes rgyal tshab rjes bskul ma gnang ba ltar gzhis ka brag dkar nang sos dpar skrun byas te dga' ldan du phul ba dga' ldan par rnying zhes de sngon zung chu khang tshad du bzhugs yod rgyal tshab dar ma yin chen dang mkhas grub dge legs dpal sogs dngos slob grags che ba brgya dang bzhi bcu zhe bdun byung skabs der rgyal tsham dar ma rin chen dang 'dul 'dzin grags pa rgyal mtshan rnam gnyis kyis gtso 'gan bzhes te tsong kha pa'i dngos slob gzhan rnams dang mos bsdur thog dngul bre chen (dngul sras lnga bcu la bre chen gcig )bco brgyad las grub pa'i rnam rgyal mchod rten phra rgyan phun sum tshogs pas spras pa bskrun te bum nang du sku gdung ril po ma nyams par snam sbyar sgron pa tsan dan gyi sgrom dang bcas pa bzhugs su gsol de rjes sne gdong dang 'bri gung sne'u sogs nas gdung 'bul gser dngul mang du byung slob dpon rnam gnyis kyis dngul gdung mchod rten bzhugs yul gtsug lag khang bzo bkod phun sum tshogs pa bskrun te dngul gdung der gdan drangs nas rab gnas rgyas par mdzad tsong kha pa chen po sku gshegs pa'i phyi lo lcags byi (1420)lo'i zla bcu pa'i tshes nyi shu lnga nyid dga' ldan du rdo rje slob dpon brgya phrag du mas gsang bde 'jigs gsum sogs kyi dkyil 'khor gyi cho ga bdun phrag mang po'i ring bsgrubs pa dang tsong kha pa chen po'i 'das mchod rgya cher mdzad de nas bzung gling me spar zhing dga' ldan lnga mchod che mor grags pa'i srol da nas bod ljongs mtha' dbus mtha' dag tu lo ltar bod zla bcu pa'i tshes nyer lnga'i dgong mo khang pa'i phyi nang kun tu mchod me mang po 'bul srol de dar}
tsa ri tsA gong|{bod du skad grags yod pa'i gnas ri zhig ste deng sang bod rang skyong ljongs lho kha sa khul nang rdzong rtsa ri chus su yod cing/bde mchog rtsa rgyud nas bshad pa'i yu nyi shu rtsa bzhi'i nang tshan zhig yin par bod kyi mkhas pa mang pos ngos 'dzin gnang gi yod/de ni 'gro mgon 'phags mo gru pa'i slob brgyud 'gro mgon dung mtsho ras pas rab byung lnga pa'i shing stag (1314)lor gnam sgo phye ba yin zhes lo rgyus 'ga' zhig las gsal/ri'i dbyibs ni ri rab bang ris gsum pa'i tshul dug nas pa der bskor ba byed tshe rtsa ba rgya che sar bskor ba byas pa der rong bskor dang/rtse mo la bskor ba byas na rtse bskor zhes brjod srol yod/ri 'di'i khyod yongs kyi dbyibs ni rje 'phred la bzhag pa ltar bur yod pa'i rwa shar ma ni/tsA ri gsar ma bkra shis ljongs yod sa de yin cing/rwa nub ma ni tsA ri rnying ma yod sa'i gnas de yin la/rdo rje'i lte ba lta bu ni tsA ri mtsho dkar yod sa'i gnas de yin/ri de'i khor yug gi mtha' bskor du/klo dang/mon/gnyal sbyar/dwags po/kong po bcas kyis bskor nas yod/gnas 'di'i khyad chos ni/me tog gi rigs sna mang po dang/rtswa sman klu bdun nag po dang/'bri ta sa 'dzin/sngo (595) 'od ldan kun+da bde skyid sogs sman gyi rigs ri klung kun khengs pa mi lpags rong 'od 'bar rong stag tshang rong dom tshang ro ste rong bzhi skyob chen la sha skam la dga' yo la sha dus la bcas la bzhi skyob chen phug dang 'od 'bar phug rdo rje phug mig ra phug bcas phug pa bzhi pho brang g.yu mtsho sogs mtsho ngo mtshar bcu gnyis kyis mtsho che chung brgya phrag mang po ngo mtshar can gyi bzo dbyibs ldan pa'i brag rim mang po bcas yod pa nags tshal stug po'i gser na gcan gzan dang ri dwags sna tshogs rgyu zhing bya dang bye'u rigs sna mang po gnas pa ri'i bar mtshams su 'brug pa bka' brgyud kyi bla ma mang pos 'debs pa gnang ba'i lha khang che chung mang po yod pa sogs zhib par 'brug pa pad+ma dkar pos mdzad pa'i (gnas chen rtsa ri Ta'i gnas yig ngo mtshar snang ba pad dkar legs bshad )shog grangs 34byas pa zhig gsung 'bum (ka)pa'i nang bzhugs shing gzhan yang 'di'i lam yig phyogs bsdus le tshan (ka)nas (tha)bar dum bu bcu gnyis mgo dang mjug nas ma tshang bar khyon shog grangs 314yod pa zhig kyang kho bos mthong gnas der deng rabs can gyi yul skor spro 'cham byed sa zhig 'dzugs pa'i cha rkyen bzang po zhig yod}
gtsang|{1 shing phra sbom ran pa 'dom do ba sogs mang po phreng bsgrigs su bskor ba'o/_/2 chu klung chen po la gtsang por 'bod pa las/de'i rgyud na chags pa'i yul sde rnams la gtsang pa zhes pa'i tha snyad thogs/3 gtsang zer ba yul gyi phu la zer te/lung pa'i phu mdo zer ba la gtsang mda' dang/lha khang sbug ma la gtsang khang grags pa ltar yin/4 bod kyi rung ming zhig ste (deb sngon )las/de nas gnyal du gtsang ston dkon ne yab sras la chos mang du gsan/zhes pa lta bu'o/_}
gtsang dkar|{dag sel byed mkhan nam/dkar 'don byed mkhan/(tsa)}
gtsang khang sgo lnga|{gtsang khang sgo lnga ste lha sa gtsug lag khang gi 'og khang du lha khang khag lnga yod pa ste/shar ngos su lha khang gsum dang/lho dang/byang du re re yod pa la zer}
gtsang khang byang|{lha sa gtsug lag khang gi 'og khang gi byang phyogs lha khang dkyil ma/lha khang 'di'i nang rgyal po srong btsan sgom po'i thugs dam rten rang byung thugs rje chen po'i sku brnyan rgyal po rang nyid kyi sku tshad dang mnyam pa zhabs 'og na gdan khri med pa zhig dang/g.yas phyogs su spyan ras gzigs 'jig rten dbang phyug dang/sgrol ma khro gnyer can/lha mo dbyangs can ma/sgo 'gram du khro bo bdu rtsi 'khyil ba bcas bzhi dang/g.yon phyogs su spyan ras gzigs kha sar pA Ni/rje btsun sgrol ma/lha mo 'od zer can/sgo 'gram du khro bo rta mgrin bcas bzhugs pa zhib par (gtsug lag khang gi dkar chag )nang gsal}
gtsang khang dbus ma|{gtsang khang zer ba'i go don ni dge 'dun rnams chos kyi byed sgor 'tshogs pa'i tshogs khang gi sbug tu yod pa'i lha khang gi don yin/dper na/lha sa gtsug lag khang gi steng 'og bar gsum du lha khang mang po yod pa'i nang gses jo bo shAkya mu ne bzhugs pa'i lha khang lta bu yin zhing/lha khang 'di'i nang du rten gyi gtso bo jo bo rin po che/sku rgyab tu jo bo mi 'gro gsung byon/de'i sku rgyab kyi rten gtsor thub dbang gangs can mtsho/g.yas g.yon du nye ba'i sras brgyad/sgo srung khro bo rta mgrin dang phyag rdor bcas rgyal po srong btsan rang nyid kyi sku dus su bzhengs pa sogs yod pa (lha sa gtsug lag khang gi dkar chag )las bshad}
gtsang khang g.yas ma|{lha sa gtsug lag khang gi 'og khang jo bo shAkya mu ne bzhugs sa'i lha khang dbus ma'i g.yas ngos/lha khang 'di'i nang rten gyi gtso bo sangs rgyas 'od dpag med/g.yas g.yon du byang chub sems dpa' nyi ba'i sras brgyad bcas bzhugs yod par zhib cha (lha sa gtsug lag khang gi dkar chag )nang gsal}
gtsang khang lho|{lha sa gtsug lag khang gi 'og khang lho ngos su yod pa'i lha khang dkyil ma/lha khang 'di'i nang rten gtso bo thub pa mi bskyod rdo rje dang g.yas g.yon du ston chen rab 'dzoms/lha mo so sor 'brang ma/khro bo gshin rje mthar byed dang shes rab mthar byed/pad+ma mthar byed/bgegs mthar byed bcas dang/'gram gnyis na rnam thos sras dang dzam b+ha la bcas bzhugs yod par (lha sa gtsug lag khang gi dkar chag )nang gsal}
gtsang gi bar snang sgang|{gtsang gi sa khul du yod pa'i sa cha zhig gi ming yin/stag tshang dpa 'byor bzang pos bris pa'i (rgya bod yig tshang )las shangs kyi pho brang sgang yin zhes pa'i mchan bu btab 'dug pa ltar na/bod rang skyong ljongs gzhis rtse sa khul rnam gling rdzong khongs mdog chos chus pho brang sgang zer ba'i sa cha de yin 'dra snyam}
gtsang 'gram|{gtsang stong rgyal rtse'am gzhis rtse'i sa gnas shig tu bzhengs pa'i lha khang ste srin mo'i gzugs dbyibs kyi dpyi g.yas pa non pa'i ched du bzhengs pa}
gtsang sgar gyi 'jam dbyangs gsum|{bkra shis 'khyil gyi snga mo'i grwa rgyun 'jam dbyangs a rdzis/'jam dbyangs rag pa/'jam dbyangs kha che bcas}
gtsang cha|{khral rigs khag rnams sgrub mi dgos pa'i chog mchan thob zin pa}
gtsang chu mig ring mo|{gzhis ka rtse'i nub ngos kyi chu mig chus 'di rang yin/rgyal rtse'i mu mig de gtsang chu mig ring mo yin tshul (rgya bod tshig mdzod )kyi ma zin nang gsal rung mkhyen brtse'i gnas yig nang de min tshul gsal bshad byas 'dug }
gtsang chen|{sngar btsan po'i rgyal rabs skabs kyi go gnas che gras zhig gi ming ste/(tun hong gter yig )las/gtsang chen man chang dang dmangs tha ma yan chad cig gi zhes pa lta bu'o/_/(tsa)}
gtsang ljongs kyi g.yul gyi kha lo pa|{(mi dbang rtogs brjod )nang de ltar che bstod bya yul ni gtsang mda' dpon nu ma ba yin cing/'di pa khang chen nas kyi gnyen tshad du gyur pa yin kyang/bka' blon nga phod pa/lum pa ba/sbyar ra ba bcas gsum nas da'i ching bsad pa'i rjes su/bka' blon gsum gyi rgyug khyi nang rul ba/rjes su pho lha tha'i jis 'dzin bzung byas nas rgyal rtse'i pho brang nas g.yang du bskyur te bsad pa de red}
gtsang stod sde pa phun tshogs rnam rgyal|{gong du karma phun tshogs rnam rgyal zhes par gzigs}
gtsang gnas rigs lnga|{mi tsha ba/mi gdung ba/gya nom snang ba/shin tu mthong ba/'og min no/_}
gtsang pa mkhan chen ye shes dpal 'byor|{rje 'di ni gtsang rong rin spungs chos rgyal kyi gdung rgyud du yab sngags 'chang blo bzang rdo rje dang/yum dpon mo lha dga' dga' ldan 'dzin gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing rta (1714)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga la phebs skabs yab kyis sku yon sgron/dgung lo bcu la bkra shis lhun por chos zhugs mdzad/dgung lo bcu gcig la sngags chen dam chos dpal 'byor drung du bar byung bsgrubs/de'i lor gzhung chen la gsan bsam gyi dbu tshugs/dgung lo bcu drug la tshad ma rnam 'grel thugs gnyer mdzad/dgung lo nyi shu la dbus su phebs nas 'bras spungs su chos zhugs gnang/dgung lo nyer lnga lor phur lcog ngag dbang byams pa'i drung du bsnyen (597) rdzogs bsgrubs dgung lo nyer dgu la khang tshan dge rgan mdzad dgung lo so bdun lor lha ldan smon lam chen mor grwa skor dam bca' bzhes sa ang dang po thob dgung lo zhes gsum lor gong sa chen po'i bka' bzhin smar khams go bo dgon gyi bla mar phebs dgung lo zhe brgyad lor 'bras spungs su phyir phebs nas mdo sngags kyi chos 'khor rgya cher bskor phyag rtsom (rje btsun bla ma dam pa ye shes dpal 'byor gyi zhal snga nas gang gi rtogs pa brjod pa ngo mtshar lhan gcig skyes pa'i rol mo/) (nyams mgul zhal gdams bslab bya gsol 'debs smon lam )sogs pod chung gcig tsam mdzad dgung lo bun cu la phebs pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu yos (1783)lor sku gshegs}
gtsang pa rgya ras ye shes rdo rje|{(gtsang pa rgya ras rje gzhon nu yang zhu )'brug pa bka' brgyud kyi srol gtod pa po/rje 'di nyid yab rgya zur bo tsab pe dang yum mar bza' dar skyid kyi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i lcags sbrul (1161)lor gtsang myang stang khu le'u yul du sku 'khrungs/gdung rus rgya bya ba'i rgyud yin/chung ngu'i dus mtshan g.yung drung dpal zhes zhu/phyis bla ma zhang las rab tu byung ste mtshan ye shes rdo rje zhes gsol/dgung lo nyer gnyis par gling ras pa bsten pas de'i bu chen du gyur/gling ras pa'i sku mdun nas nA ro'i chos drug dang/lhan cig skyes sbyor la sogs pa'i gdams pa gsan/dgun 'dag sbyar mdzad nas bsgoms pas rlung phyi nang bsre nus pa sogs ting nge 'dzin gsal stong nam mkha' dang mnyam par 'khrungs/tsa ri'i gnas sgo phye/rje btsun ras chung pas gter du sbas pa'i ro snyoms skor drug bton/bla ma zhang gis lung bstan pa ltar klong rdol gyi dgon pa btab/yi dam gyis lung bstan pa ltar ra lung btab/gling ras pas lung bstan pa ltar gnam phur 'brug dgon pa phyag btab cing/dgan+papa 'di rmang 'ding dus 'brug sgra drag po thengs 'ga' grags pas dgon pa'i ming yang 'brug ces btags/de la brten nas grub mtha' 'di'i rgyud 'dzin rnams la 'brug pa zhes thogs/gtsang pa rgya ras 'tsho bzhugs skabs 'brug tu slob ma khri tsho lnga tsam 'tshogs zer/khong gi slob brgyud bzang po ches mang du 'phel bas mi phyed 'brug pa/'brug phyed sprang po/sprang phyed grub thob ces grags/mthar dgung lo lnga bcu nga gcig pa rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags lug (1211)lor sku gshegs/khong gi slob ma'i mchog ni dbon sras dang/chos sras gnyis so/_}
gtsang pa rgyal po karma bstan skyong dbang po|{gong du karma bstan skyong dbang po zhes par gzigs}
gtsang pa dung khur|{gtsang pa dung khur ba dbang phyug bkra shis/gung thang bla ma zhang gi slob ma/thog mar shis zhA rgyal po'i bla mar gdan drangs te mi nyag gi yul du tshal pa bka' brgyud kyi chos lugs thog mar spel/rjes su jing ger han gyis shis zhA (mi nyag )rgyal khab gtor rjes sog yul du gdan drangs nas jing ger han la tshos bshad du sog yul du tshal pa bka' brgyud gi chos lugs thog mar spel/'di'i 'khrungs lo dang 'das lo sogs lo rgyus zhib pa ma mthong}
gtsang pa bdun brgyud|{tsong kha pa gshegs rjes dga' ldan khri ba byed mkhan gtsang pa kho na yin pa'i rgyal tshab rjes dang/mkhas grub rje/zha lu ba legs pa rgyal mtshan/blo gros chos skyong/ba so chos kyi rgyal mtshan/blo gros brtan pa/smon lam dpal ba ste bdun}
gtsang pa blo gros bzang po|{rje 'di nyid rab byung drug pa'i lcags byi (1360)lor sku 'khrungs/byis pa'i dus yab rin spungs na bzhugs pas der brten nas khang gnyer mdzad/de nas chos la thugs mos pa chen po skyes (598) te bla ma chos dbyings pa'i zhabs la gtugs de dang mi ring bar chos rje 'ba' rab bsten nas gdams pa mang du zhus mkhas grub kyi bla ma mtha' yas pa'i zhabs la gtugs shing zab chos mang du gsan de'i stobs kyis slob ma la khrid rim bogs pa yang gdams ngag sna mi gcig pa brgya dang brgyad cu gya gnyis yod par grags gangs ti se la byon te sgrub pa mdzad de nas chos kyi ched du rgya gar nub phyogs lcam be dang rgya gar shar phyogs shing gi rir phebs tshur byon nas la stod lhor lo shas bzhugs te si tu chos rin bsten phyis skyid shod du spang po kha dang ldan rdzong du bzhugs de rjes g.yon phyogs su phebs nas yar rgyal ba dpon chen dge bsnyen pas bla mar bzung de ltar sa yar mar du 'gro don rgya chen po mdzad nas gra phyi 'brug gi dgon par rab byung bdun pa'i chu yos (1423)lor sku gshegs}
gtsang pa rin chen nam mkha' rdo rje|{'di nyid yab snubs a la la bya ba'i sngags pa chen po zhig dang yum ral rgyags bza' lcam mi bya ba gnyis kyi sras su rab byung dang po'i me sbrul (1077)lor gtsang gi snubs yul rong du sku 'khrungs/rngog lo dang/gnyan lo/ba ri lo tsA/rwa lo/btsan kha bo che ste bla ma lnga tsam gyi zhabs la gtugs/btsan kha ba che las mdo da rgyan gsan pas tshar gcig la mkhyen/de nas thugs dgongs la g+r+ya gar du yan nas paN+Di ta gcig gnyis la gtugs dgos snyam nas byon pas ding rir dam pa dang mjal/dam pa bzhengs pa dang skabs 'khel bas kun gyis mi 'di bsod nams che zer/de skabs yab yul la mu ge che zer bas phyir log nas skyid shod du byon/de nas bya yul mjal du byon nas chibs bye nag bzang po gcig dang gser srang gang phyag rten du phul/zhal mjal ba tsam gyis mchi ma 'khrug pa'i dad pa skyes/tshogs chos shig kyang gsan/lo pa rnams kyis spyan drangs nas lo'i gdan sa mdzad/phyis bya yul bas 'phrin btang bar mis go ma chod pas 'da' khar ma mjal yang bya yul ba sku 'das rjes lo bya gnyis ka'i bdag mdzad/mthar dgung lo bag+r+yad cu rtsa lnga pa rab byung gsum pa'i lcags sbrul (1161)lor sku 'das/slob ma ni gtsang pa'i bu bzhi la sogs pa bcu bzhi thon skad}
gtsang pa sum pa|{ras chung pa'i slob ma thugs kyi sras bcu gsum gyi ya gyal/'di nyid las stod cung pa'i smad kyi sum pa nye'u mkhar bya bar yab sum dbang phyug dang yum rma mo khye mkhar gnyis kyi sras lnga'i che dag tu 'khrungs/myang stod stag tshal du rgya dmar ba dang rog mngon pa gnyis kyi grwa sar byon nas rab tu byung ste lo gcig bzhugs/de nas rjes ras chung pa'i spyan sngar byon pas shin tu mos par gyur nas phyag g.yas pa'i na lag bcad de mar me byas nas phul skad/zhal mjal tshad la mthong phyag gsum gsum mdzad pa dang/zhag re la phyag bag+r+ya brgya mdzad par dam bcas te bzhugs/ras chung pa sku gshegs rjes gdan sa bzung/de'i dus na chu bo gang+gA tshun la bzang bar grags/gdams ngag ni rgya bod gnyis ka na che/thugs rjes ni sems can thams cad rjes su 'dzin pa zhig bzhugs/yang sde snod 'dzin pa nas ma de bud med dang byin pa yan chod mi dad pa dang bskur ba 'debs po ni gcig kyang med/khong gi mdzad spyod sna re mthong bas sems la phan zhing/slob dpon gzhan la chos dang gdams ngag tshar mang po nyan pa bas/nad ka 'di yin gyi tshig re gsungs pas dan mang po khrol nas 'gro ba/thugs la yon tan rgya che mnga' yang zhal nas khengs skyung 'ba' zhig mdzad pa zhig yod/'di dang ras chung pa la slob ma thun mong ba 'ga' re yang yod do/_}
gtsang 'bul gleng med zhu ba|{bu lon yongs rdzogs gtsang mar 'bul rgyu khag 'dogs kyi gleng phyogs phran bu (599) tsam yang med pa byed}
