gtsang smyon heHru ka rus pa'i rgyan can|{'khrungs yul gtsang myang stod stag tshal du myang ral pa can dang nyi ma 'od zer sogs kyi rgyud pa yab sngags 'chang sangs rgyas dpal ldan dang/yum sangs rgyas 'dren gnyis kyi sras su rab byung brgyad pa'i chu sprel (1452)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun pa sa stag (1458)lor mkhas chen kun dga' sangs rgyas kyi drung du bar tu byung ste mtshan sangs rgyas rgyal mtshan zhes gsol/de nas bzung dgung lo bcu bdun gyi bar rang yul du slob gnyer mdzad/dgung lo bco brgyad par tsa rir byon te rjes btsun sha ha rab 'byams pa sangs rgyas seng ge dang mjal/ri chos skor gsum/thar gru skor gsum/nA ro chos drug /phyag rgya chen po lnga ldan lhan gcig skyes sbyor/do ha skor gsum dang mdzod drug ro snyoms sogs bka' brgyud kyi chos skor phal mo che'i lung gsan/rje btsun ma lhan cig skyes ma'i dkyil 'khor du dbang bskur te gsang mtshan mi bskyod rdo rje zhes gsol/de nas dpal 'khor chos sder byon nas g.yu lung la yon tan rgya mtsho'i drung nas chos mang po gsan cing/de bzhin slob dpon kun dga' nyi ma dang/paN chen don grub grags pa sogs bsten nas gsang sngags kyi dbang dang rgyud kyi bshad pa bskyed rdzogs kyi gdams pa sogs mang po yul nges med du byon/cha lugs kyang skabs 'ga' zhig tu sku gcer bu la mi'i g.yang gzhi khrag can gsol/rgyun rlon gyis ga sha dang gdu bu byas/mi thod rlon par klad pa dang rgyu ma sogs rtsibs mas dkrugs te gsol/phal cher heHru ka'i cha byad rus rgyan dang thod pa/rkang gling/kha T+wAM rnams 'chang zhing dur (600) khrod dang grong gseb nges med du byon nas tha mal gyi blor mi chud pa'i tho co'i spyod pa sna tshogs mdzad pas gtsang smyon zhes grags mdzad pa ni bal yul gyi 'phags pa shing kun zhig gso dang grub gnas mang por bka' brgyud kyi sgrub sde btsugs snyan brgyud glegs bam du bkod pa po ti bcu gsum la zhu dag gtsang ma dang rab byung brgyad pa'i sa sprel (1488)lor rje btsun mi la'i rnam thar ljags rtsom mdzad nyams mgur phyogs gcig tu bsgrigs shing par du brkos grub pa'i go 'phang mthon por gshegs kyang la 'bras la