btsan po glang dar ma bkrongs pa|{spyi'i lo dus rabs dgu pa'i nang lha lung dpal gyi rdor rjes btsan po glang dar ma bkrongs pa'i don rkyen byung zhing/de yang bod kyi btsan po zhe gnyis pa glang dar ma 'u dum btsan gyis srid bzung/thog mar spyod pa tshul mthun zhig byas na'ang/phyis grogs ngan gyis bslus te chos bsnubs shing/lo paN rnams yul gzhan du bros/ma byon pa 'ga' zhig bkum/rab byung rnams khyim du phab/mi nyan pa rnams rngon pa byed du bcug /gsum rab phal cher brag la sbas pa dang/me chur skyur/lha sa dang/ra mo che/bsam yas rnams kyi gtsug lag khang gi sgo la zhal ba byas te btsun pa chang 'thung ba'i gzugs bris pa sogs byas nas chos dang rig gzhung/khrims lugs sogs nyams par byas stabs/lha lung dpal rdor gyis rta dkar por sol (603) ba byugs gos nang ma dkar po phyi ma nag po zhig gyon te yer pa (lha sa'i shar phyogs )nas lha sar yong ste btsan po gtsug lag khang mdun gyi rdo ring gi yi ge klog bzhin yod pa'i skabs su mda' 'phangs te bkrongs skyid chur rab bcad cing phyi gos nag po chu la skyur rta la byugs pa'i sol ba chas dag par byas nas bros pas blon 'khor tshos zin ma thub pa sogs byung chos 'byung la lar btsan po rta phyags sar lha lung dpal rdol gyi gri g.yug nas bkrongs zhes dang 'ga' zhig tu nyi ma bsro skabs mda' 'phangs zhes sogs mi 'dra ba 'ga' shas 'dug kyang 'dir (dpyid kyi rgyal mo'i glu dbyangs )sogs dang mthun pa bris pa yin}
