btsun mo tshal|{(lha sa grong khyer stag rtse rdzong khongs )spyi lo'i dus rabs bdun pa'i nang thon mi sam b+ho Tas bod yig dbyangs gsal gtan 'bebs gnang ste/zhal ras gsal la ngang mdangs gang ba bzang/_/gdams ngag zab la ma 'chad tha dad dang/_/las ngan bag chags thams cad bsal mdzad pa/_/'phags pa ma pham yang dag dam pa la/_/bde gshegs bden nges ye shes te/_/ting 'dzi zhi nyid rig cing gzigs/_/nyon mongs tshogs bcom mgon po mchog /dus gsum bdud 'dul kun tu thul/_/zhes sogs yig phud phul ba'i yig gzugs 'khod pa'i brag rdo de btsun mo tshal dgon pa'i rgyab ngos su yod pa ni (bai ser )nang byin chen mdar thu mi sam b+ho Tas yig phung phul bas 'khor snang lha khang du grags pa sogs rgyal po yab yum gyi skyed mos tshal te btsun mo rnams rgyun du bzhugs pas btsun mo tshal du grags zhes gsungs pa ltar sngon dus srong btsan gyi btsun mo rnams der bzhugs nas ming de ltar chags pa dang/brag brkos yi ge de rig gnas gsar brje'i gong mthong rgyu yod skad/btsun mo tshal gyi dgon pa ni dus rabs bco lnga pa'i nang rje tsong kha pa'i dngos slob 'dul 'dzin grags pa rgyal mtshan gyis phyag btab 'dug }
