rtsa chag|{khral rigs khag 'ga' zhig chag pa tsam min par khral rigs yongs rdzogs rtsa ba nas chag pa}
rtsa nyon drug|{gnam du rtsa ba'i nyon mongs drug ces par gsal}
rtsa ltung bcu bzhi|{1 gang phyin rdo rje 'dzin pa'i dngos grub slob dpon rjes 'brang/2 bde gshegs bka' las 'das pa ltung ba/3 rdo rje spun la khros pa nyes par brjod pa/4 sems can la byams pa spang ba/5 byang chub sems dpa' spang ba/6 rang ngam gzhan gyi grub mtha'i chos la smod pa/7 ma smin pa'i sems can la gsang sngags sgrogs pa/8 sangs rgyas lnga ldan bdag nyid la brnyas byed/9 rang bzhin dag pa'i chos la som nyi za ba/10 gdug la rtag tu byams ldan byed pa/11 ming sogs bral ba'i chos la rtog pa/12 sems can dad ldan du sun 'byin pa/13 dam tshig rjes ji bzhin ma bsten pa/14 shes rab rang bzhin bud med la smod pa'o/_}
rtsa ltung sbyor ba bdun|{bsam pa nyon mongs pas kun nas bslangs pa/lus ngag gi sbyor ba gang gis nyes pa skyed pa de brtan pa/bar bcad ces ltung ba so so'i dngos gzhi la zhugs pa dang/'gyod pa med pa yi rang ba dang/sems ma 'khrul ba dang/bla ma bzhugs na lo gcig gam gsum tshun du ma bshags nas tshad las 'das pa ste bdun tshang na pham pa dang/tshad las 'das pa'i yan lag drug tshang na ltung ba zhes so thar gyi lhag ma dang/de bas kyang smad na ltung byed dang/yan lag gzhan med pa'i dngos gzhi'ang nyes byas so/_}
rtsa ltung bzhi|{mi tshang spyod dang/ma byin len/rdzun smra ba/srog gcod pa ste rtsa ba'i ltung ba bzhi'o/_}
rtsa mdud mi grol thabs lam|{lus kyi spyi bo dang/mgrin pa/snying kha/lte ba/gsang gnas bcas gnas lnga yi rtsa ba mdud pa yod pas de ma grol gong du bud med bsten thabs kyi lam lag len bstar na dmyal bar 'gro ba yin zer srol dang/thabs lam ni rtsa mdud yongs rdzogs grol ba'i rjes su khyab byed kyi rlung rkyang pa sdud pa'i thabs su bud med bsten thabs kyi lag len la zer}
rtsa dres ma|{lo mang skye ba'i rtsa rigs shig yin/a ra 'dra ba'i rtsa ba mang la mkhregs pa lo ma spungs na skye ba/me tog gi mdog mu skya/'dab ma drug pa/bod zla dang po nas gnyis pa'i bar me tog shar ba/rang ljongs kyi klung thang dang/ri ldebs/lam zur bcas la skye ba zhig ste/de'i nus pa ni tsha ba dang dug nad gcin pa 'gag pa'i nad/khrag mang po babs pa bcas la phan pa zhig yin kyis mdzad pa'i (shel gong dang shel phreng )las gsal}
rtsa ba brgyad|{yab kyi sna g.yas pa'i khrag /yum gyi pad+ma'i khrag /srid pa chags pa'i lte khrag /g.yul du bsad pa'i dpa' bo'i snying khrag ste nang gi rtsa ba bzhi dang/stag gzig la sogs pa gcan gzan gyi khrag /bya rgod la sogs pa 'dab chags kyi khrag /rta bong la sogs rmig zlum gyi khrag /g.yag sogs rmig brag gi khrag ste phyi'i rtsa ba bzhi dang brgyad do/_}
rtsa ba brgyad spang tshul khrims kyi yan lag|{chang spang ba bag yod kyi yan lag /gar sogs phrengo gas dang mal chen mthon po dang/phyi dro'i kha zas gsum brtul (606) zhugs kyi yan lag dang brgyad do/_/dge bsnyen gyi gtan khrims lnga ni gsod rku rdzun smra log g.yem chang lnga'o/_}
rtsa ba blo bzang rgyal mtshan|{mdo smad bya khyung dgos mkhan rabs so brgyad pa 'di nyid rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags 'brug (1700)lor rtsa ba'i a sde yul du sku 'khrungs/blo bzang chos dbyangs pa'i drung nas rab tu byung/bya khyung du slob gter mdzad/dgung lo bcu gsum thog dbus su phebs te ser byas su zab chos gsan/lha rams mtshan rtags bzhes/de nas smad rgyud du zhugs/rgyal ba yab sras dang/khri gang dbang mchog ldan/bla ma byams pa sogs bsten/slar rang dgon du phebs nas rgyud pa gsar 'dzugs kyi rdo rje slob dpon lo bcu gnyis mdzad/'chad nyan dang sgrub chos kyi srol btod/drang nges rnam 'byed kyi bshad pa sogs gsung rtsom 'ga' re bzhugs/dgung lo re gcig la phabs pa lcags 'brug (1760)lor bya khyung seng khrir phebs nas lo bcu gsum bskyangs/lam rim/skyes rabs/spyod 'jug sogs kyi bshad pa dang/bde gsang 'jigs gsum gyi dbang/mgon bka'i rjes gnang sogs chos bka' ci rigs pa dang/rtsod grwa la rting skul shin tu smar/tsong kha brgyad cu/rigs ldan nyer lnga sogs kyi zhal thang grangs mang bzhengs/sde dge'i bka' 'gyur mtshar par ma gdan zhu mdzad/paN chen dpal ldan ye shes mchog la chos sde rgyab rten gyi bka' shog zhus/thugs kyi bzhes don yod grub grub nas mthar dgung lo gya drug la phebs pa rab byung bcu gsum pa shing sbrul (1785)lor mya ngan las 'das}
rtsa ba bzhi|{'dul ba'i skabs su/mi tshangs spyod/mi byin len/brdzun/srog gcod de bzhi las gang byas na yang sdom pa sngar yod rtsa ba nas nyams pas grwa pa'i gras nas bud pa yin}
rtsa ba lus lta bu'i bstan bcos gsum|{rgyas pa rnam 'grel/'bring po rnam nges/bsdus pa rigs thigs so/_}
rtsa ba sum cu pa|{le'u phyi rnams kyi rten gzhir gyur pas rtsab dang/mchod brjod dang brtsams par dam bcas ba dor ba'i lhag ma sho lo ka sum cu yod pas sum cu pa zhes sam/mkhas pa la las kA li sum cu'i brjod bya gtso bor ston pas de skad ces btags par bshad}
rtsa ba gsum|{bla ma dang/yi dam/mkha' 'gro ste gsum}
rtsa ba lha khang|{'bri gung bla brang gi khongs rdza rdzong mthil gsum zhes pa'i ya gyal rtsa zhol shang khongs su yod pa'i rtsa ba lha khang ni btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi sras chung ba sad na legs 'dzing yon gyi sku dus su bzhengs pa'i lha khang zhig yin skad/yang de khul gyi bgres song 'ga' zhig nas de ni skar chung rdo rje dbyings kyi lha khang yin skor dkar chag tu gsal tshul gsungs/thog brtsegs bzhi ldan gyi lha khang de'i rten gtso rgyal po don grub ces ston pa shAkya thub pa dgung lo gsum gyi sku tshad du grags pa dz+hi k+Shim gyi ston pa longs sku'i sku brnyan sogs rten gsum dpag med bzhugs shing/rig gnas gsar brje'i skabs lha khang rmang nas bshig dus sa 'og nas rdul tshon gyi dkyil 'khor zhig thon pa sogs byung/rang byung bcu drug pa'i shing glang (1985)lor lha khang chung ngu zhig nyams gso zhus pa'i rten gtsos de snga'i rten go rgyal po don grub kyi sku'i dum bu zhig nang bzhugs kyi 'jim sku sogs bzhengs pa dang/rtsa ba dgon pa nas shar phyogs lam 'phreng zhig gi steng dum chod rten chen po zhig yod pa de'i nang byang sems kyi ring bsrel yod pas de gar skor ba brgyab na gza' grib kyi nad sogs la phan tshul brjod srol yod pas bskor ba rgyag mkhan mang tsam yod}
rtsa ba'i kha dog bzhi|{sngon po/ser po/dkar po/dmar po dang bzhi}
rtsa ba'i grub mtha' bzhi|{bye brag smra ba dang/mdo da pa ste theg dman gyi grub mtha' gnyis dang sems tsam pa dang dbu ma pa ni theg chen grub mtha' gnyis bcas bzhi}
rtsa ba'i nyon mongs drug|{1 'dod chags/khams gsum gyi gnas lus longs spyod la zhen pa/2 khong khro/gnod byed sems can dang gnad pa sdug bsngal dang gnod pa'i rkyen dug mtshon sogs la dmigs te kun nas mnar sems pa/3 the tshom/bden pa dang las 'bras la yid gnyis za ba/4 nga rgyal/rang gi yon tan sogs gzhan dag las lhag go snyam du sems pa/5 ma rig pa/de kho na nyid la rmongs pa dang bde bzhi'i don la rmongs pa gnyis las phyi ma'i don/6 zhe sdang/rang las gzhan thams cad 'khon du 'dzin pa bcas so/_}
rtsa ba'i dud tshang|{de ni (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bzang mdzod )nang/mi bza' mi gnyis/bu bu mo gnyis/brag g.yog pho mo gnyis/phyugs rta bong/ra lug /ba mdzo bcas re re/khang pa ka ba drug gi sa/sa zhing hor son khal bcu gnyis bcas yod par dud chung gcig yin}
rtsa ba'i sde drug|{bye brag pa dang/rig pa can pa dang/grangs can pa dang/dpyod pa ba dang/gcer bu ba dang/rgyang 'phen pa rnams so/_/'di ni phyi rol grub mtha' smra ba'i dbye ba du ma zhig yod pa las dbye tshul grags che ba zhig go }
rtsa ba'i sde bzhi|{phal chen pa'i sde dang/thams cad yod par smra ba'i sde pa/gnas brtan pa'i sde pa/mang pos bkur ba'i sde pa te theg chung gi rtsa ba'i sde pa bzhi/de dag chos kyi lag len byed tshul la gu yangs dog dang lta ba'i cha nas mi 'dra ba yod pa zhig ste/bzhi po de la nang gses phye na bco brgyad yod}
rtsa ba'i nad drug|{rlung/mkhris/bad kan/khrag /rtsa ser/srin 'bu}
rtsa ba'i rnam rtog kun gzhi'i rnam shes sam rnam rtog brgyad|{yul du 'dzin pa mtshan ma'i rnam rtog rnam shes drug mtshan snang ba'i rnam rtog /bde sdug tshor ba sogs mtshan ma 'gyur ba'i rnam rtog /rnam shes drug gi 'gyur ba las bang ba mtshan ma snang bar 'gyur ba'i rnam rtog /chos dang chos ma yin pa thos pa'i rjes su blo gzhol ba gzhan gyis bstan pa'i rnam rtog /mi rtag pa sogs tshul bzhin gyi rnam rtog /lta ngan la mngon par zhen pa'i rnam rtog /bdag lta sogs tshul bzhin ma yin pa'i rnam rtog go }
rtsa ba'i bla ma|{1 rang la so thar gyi sdom pa dang byang chub sems dpa'i sdom pa/gsang sngags kyi sdom pa bcas gsum ka bla ma de'i sar nas thob pa yin na bla ma de rang nyid kyi rtsa ba'i bla ma yin pa/2 rang nyid kyis blam de la chos mang po zhu myong na blam de rang nyid kyi rtsa ba'i bla ma yin pa lta bu}
rtsa ba'i ro drug|{mngar ba dang/skyur ba/kha ba/bska ba/tshwa ba/lan tshwa ba ste drug go }
rtsa ba'i rlung lnga|{srog 'dzin dang/thur sel dang/gyen rgyu dang/mnyam gnas dang/khyab byed kyi rlung ste lnga}
