rtsa dbu ma'i khyad par gyi chos bzhi|{pad ma'i snal ma ltar phra ba/chu shing gi sdong pa ltar drang ba/til mar gyi mar me ltar gsal ba/rgya skyegs kyi me tog ltar dmar ba'o/_}
rtsa mi shing mi|{mdo smad mi nyag gi yul te/go don ni mdo stod mi yi chol kha'i nang nas mi nyag ni mi mang ba/ (608) rtsa dang shing yang thag ring po nas bltas na mi la 'khrul dgos pa lta bu'i don yin pa las rtsa las bzos pa'i mi dang shing las bzos pa'i mi dang 'dra zer ba'i go ba blangs na don dngos dang gtan nas mi mthun}
rtsa mi sangs rgyas grags pa|{rtsa mi lo tsA ba sangs rgyas grags pa/lo tsA ba 'di gung thang bla ma zhang gi rnam thar nang gsal bas gong dang dus thog phal cher mtshungs par mngon/'khrungs yul mdo khams mi tog gi yul rtsa mir 'khrungs/lo tsA mkhas par mkhyen cing/mdo sngags gnyis kar mkhas pas rgya gar rdo rje gdan dgon pa'i mkhan po yang mdzad/khe'u gad pa 'khor lo grags dang/spang zho gsal ba grags gnyis dang mnyam du paN+DaNi ta a b+ha ya ka gup+ta bsten nas dus 'khor/phreng ba skor gsum/thub pa dgongs rgyan/man ngag snye ma bcas bsgyur ba dang/rgya gar rdo rje gdan du ston pa'i rgyal tshab kyang mdzad}
rtsa tshig rim song|{rtsa ba'i don gnad yi ger bkod pa'i bka' yig rim pa mang por btang zin pa}
rtsa 'dzin rgyun 'khyongs yong ba byed|{de sngon gtan 'bebs byas zin pa'i rtsa don dam 'dzin mu mthud nas byed dgos pa'i skul tshig }
rtsa 'dzin g.yo med dgos pa|{rtsa don 'di la dam 'dzin 'gyur ba med par byed dgos pa}
rtsa ra gtong|{khrims 'gal byung ba rnams lus thog tu tsha 'dri byed pa}
rtsa ra yan por ma song ba|{khrims gcod gu yangs por ma song ba}
rtsa ri|{'di'i skor gong du tsA ri tsA gong zhes par gsal}
rtsa ri tra|{gong du tsA ri tsA gong zhes par gsal}
rtsa rlung skabs kyi 'khor lo drug|{gtsug tor nam mkha'i 'khor lo/dpral ba chu'i 'khor lo/mgrin par me'i 'khor lo/snying khar rlung gi 'khor lo/lte ba sa'i 'khor lo/gsang gnas su ye shes mkhas bde stong gi 'khor lo'o/_}
rtsa rlung bsgoms pa'i gnad bzhi|{bca' ba lus kyi gnad/srog rtsol rlung gi gnad/dmigs pa sems kyi gnad/lus sbyong 'khrul 'khor gyi gnad do/_}
rtsa rlung thig le|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la/mi'i lus khams kyi gnas pa rtsa/g.yo ba rlung/bkod pa byang chub kyi sems bcas gsum thogs pa la brten nas chags pa dang/de yang/rtsa yi gtso bo gsum/'khor lo bzhi/rtsa 'dab bdun khri nyis stong bcas yod la/rlung la yang rtsa ba'i rlung lnga dang yan lag gi rlung lnga sogs rlung nyi khri chig stong drug brgya thig le rigs bzhi sogs de dag so so'i 'grel bshad rgyas pa ni gsang sngags kyi gzhung las rgyas par bshad pas 'dir zur tsam las ma smros so/_}
rtsa lag 'tsho'i me tog|{me tog nus ldan nam/ban+d+hu dzi bag zhes pa me tog dmar po khrag mdog ltar 'char ba zhig gi ming}
rtsa gsum|{lus kyi rtsa dbu ma/ro ma/rkyang ma gsum mo/_}
rtsang nan|{btung ba ste/bod chang ngam chang gi ming la 'jug cing/dper na chang bre gsum dang rtsa khur gcig ces par rtsang nan yam gsum dang jan ran khur gcig ces pa ltar ro/_}
rtsad gcod babs bkod byed|{nyes can gyi gnas tshul gsar pa thon na 'byung khungs rtsad gcod byas te gnas tshul dngos dang bstun pa'i skyon brjod dang nyes chad gcod pa sogs gang la gong 'os byed dgos}
rtsabs|{ru ma'i ming ste zho'i ru ma lta bu la rtsabs zhes kyang bya'o/_}
rtsabs mo|{('dul ba'i gleng 'bum )las/'bras dang khre sogs btsos nas rtsi med par bsnyal ba'i khu ba skyur po tsang shu zhes pa ste/'di la pham mi btab ste phab btab na chang du 'gyur bas rab byung la mi rung ngo zhes gsungs so/_}
rtsam pa|{rtsam pa ni bod rigs kyi gtso zas shig yin cing/rtsam pa'i rigs la spyir na nas rtsam dang sran rtsam gnyis su phye yang zhib tu phye na drus brgyab ste ches zhib mor btags pa'i nas rtsam spus legs la zhib rtsam dang/sras lpags phud pa'i ches zhib mor btags pa'i sran rtsam spu legs la sran zhib ces dang/da dung nas sran 'dres mar btags pa la rtsam pa spel sran zer}
rtsam 'bru|{rtsa ma 'thag rgyu'i 'bru rigs}
rtsam bzhes lus khungs|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs kyi las khungs shig ste/de'i do dam mi sna rim pa lnga pa'i las tshan se skya gnyis (skabs 'gar sras rnam pa'ang yod )tshugs yul shing ra'i bar gsal gyi lho phyogs thog brtsegs gnyis pa'i nang yod/da dam ser skya gnyis kyi gsham 'og las byed lta bur sger 'dzugs nang gnyer gnyis dang/gar dgos gnyer pa gnyis/'bo kha ba gcig dang/las g.yog pho mo bco lnga skor bcas yod/'di ni gtang sgo'i las khungs shig yin pas rdzong gzhis khag nas rtsam pa dang snum sogs kyi khral 'bab bsdu len dang/de yang rtsam snum dngos mdog khag gcig dang de byings sngar gyi 'bru snum gong tshad dma' ba'i thang gzhi lta dngul sgril zhus pa la skal pa bzang po'i dus kyi rin thang zhes pa'i go don mtshon pa'i skal bzang thang ga'i dngul sgril 'bab deb gzhir bzung lta lha srol lam ltar 'bul dgos pa dag bsdu len dang/khral 'bab cha rigs rnams 'bab 'ded ched rdzong gis bsdu len bcas byas te yong 'bab kyi thog nas sman lam dang tshogs mchod skabs grwa pa tsha gra zhes smon lam la grwa pa rer rtsam pa 'bo bcu re dang/tsha mchod la bcu 'bo re/sman lam dang tshogs mchod gnyis la 'char can nyin re grwa pa rer dngul skar phyed gsum re rgyag rgyu dang/srid skyong gis gtsos pa'i gzhung zhabs yongs la gro rtsam snum gsum gyi phogs so gsar skabs rtsa'i dkyil ston nyin dang gnyis kyi dkar spro sgrig gshom/chibs sgyur dang/gzab gsol khag gi gtor sgo'i kha zas kyi 'gro gron gtong sgo 'gan len bkod sgrib bcas byed dgos shing/tA la'i bla ma khri phebs sogs mdzad sgo 'phar ma'i rtsam gro snum gsum gyi 'gro gron mig skor rngod 'phar bya ba'i do dam zur bkod kyi rdzong gzhis khag nas khral 'bar bsdu len byed rgyu dang/da dung gar mi hreng gtong dgos pa/rtswa gnyer gyi gzan pa 'dren byed bong bu nyi shu dang shing gnyer gyi shing 'dred byed bong bu nyi shu khungs 'dzugs gar dgos su gtung dgos pa bcas rtsam len do dam gyi las 'gan ha cang rgya zhing che sne kha mang ba yin}
rtsa'i 'khor lo lnga|{sman gzhung las bshad pa ltar mi lus kyi spyi bo dang/mgrin pa/snying ga /lte ba/gsang gnas bcas so sor yod pa'i rtsa mdud lnga'o/_}
rtsa'i 'khor lo drug|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags kyi gzhung nas bshad srol la/1 spyi bo bde chen gyi 'khor lo/(yang na gtsug tor nam mkha'i 'khor lo/) 2 mgrin par longs kyi 'khor lo/3 snying ga chos kyi 'khor lo/4 lte ba sprul pa'i 'khor lo/5 gsang gnas bde stong gi 'khor lo/6 nor ba'i dbus kyi 'khor yo (yang na dpral ba bde ba'i 'khor lo )dang drug go }
rtsal kha|{bka' brgyud bsgom pa'i nyams rtogs kyi rtsal la rtsa khal zhes gsung srol yod}
rtsal po che yi blon 'bangs mi bdun|{btsan po khri (610) 'dus srong gi skabs su byung ba'i blon 'bangs rtsal chen bdun yod 'di rnams kyi ming dang stobs rtsal gyi khyad chos (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang gsungs shing (rgya bod yig tshang )shog grangs 122nas 123bar bshad tshul 'di dang mi 'dra ba bkod yod pa dper deb der gzigs}
