rtsibs kyi lha karma yol sdes spyan drangs|{rtsibs zer ba'i yul gyi lha karma yol sdes rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po mi yul du gdan drangs pa yin zhes bon gyi lo rgyus nang du bshad yod}
rtsibs brgyad 'khor lo|{lha sa chags yul 'di la khyad 'phags kyi sa bkra gzhan dang mi 'dar ba gnam la 'khor lo rtsibs brgyad 'khor lo ni lung tshan brgyan gnam kha sho ba de nyi gdugs kyi lcags rtsibs nang bzhin phyogs mtshams su 'khel ba lta bu'i dbyibs 'dra ba dang/yang de la gnam p+samangon mog yu bya'i gdugs su phub/ri zur gsum brag gzhung gnam du mtho/sa rtse brgyad lung pa phyogs su gyes zhes sogs gsal ba'i sa dbyibs dang gnam dbyibs zur brgyad rtsi stangs ni (gser gdung 'dzam gling rgyan gcig gi dkar chag )nang gsal ba ltar na/1 'phan po'i mda' stag rtse'i phyogs kyi byang ri dang brag dkar gyi lho ri gnyis bsnol mtshams mal dro brgyud du 'gro ba'i lam chen gyi thad kar zur gcig /2 chos lung/3 sgam po lung/4 grib rnams kyi lung pa dang ri rtse bsnol mtshams su zur gcig /5 sne'u dang stod lung gnyis kyi bar mtshams/6 chu shul lam chen la 'gro ba'i gzhung brgyud/7 stod long gi lam chen dang skyor mo lung gi rgyab ri bsnol mtshams/8 nyang bran phu dang dog bde brgyud kyi ri sul gnyis kyi bar bcas zur brgyad yod par snang}
