rtsis khang las khungs|{'di ni de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs gtsug lag khang gi phyogs bzhir yod pa'i rgyal dbang drag bzhi'i las khungs kyi ma gyal shar du rgyas pa'i las khungs (rtsis khang srid zhi phun tshogs )bya ba de yin zhing/las khungs 'di tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i skabs gsar du btsugs pa'i sa gnas srid gzhung gi nang gi ba lta bu'i las khungs shig yin la/shod skor (611) spyi khyab kyi las khungs shig kyang yin lus khungs 'dir gong 'og las byed mi snang rtsis dpon gsum (skabs 'gar rtsis dpon las 'phar gcig dang bzhi/) (rim pa bzhi pa )dang rtsis pa (rim pa drug pa'i las tshan chung khag )gsum yig tshags (rim pa bdun pa )gcig rtsis phrug pa bco lnga skor bcas yod las khungs 'di'i 'gan dbang ni gzhung zhabs shod skor drung 'khor rnams thog mar rtsis phrug par gsar zhugs byed skabs drung rgyud bsnyon med yin min brtag dpyad dang rigs rus la lab gleng med pa'i spyi sgrig gan rgya (drung rgyun min pas zhabs sdod zhus mi chog pa'i srol lam ltar )len rgyu dang rtsis phrug par zhugs rjes kyi mi snang rnams kyi yig rtsis sbyong brdar gyis chu tshad lon mtshams gzhung zhabs dngos su zhu rgyu'i 'os 'char gong 'bul zhu rgyu pho rtsal gyi rnam grangs rgyugs len byed ched so gsum mam bzhi rer drung 'khor rtsal rgyugs zhes rtsal rtsed kyi byed sgo bkod sgrib byed rgyu lo ltar smon lam skabs sras rnam pa yan gyi drung 'khor gsar zhus gnyis te ya sor spyi khyab par 'gro srol yod pa'i mi sna bkod sgrig byed pa bka' blon gyi las 'gan 'khur myong ba phud de byings drung 'khar so so'i ming tho'i gsham du rang lo dang zhabs sdod zhus lo las tshan gang 'khur bcas kyi mchan bkod de rtse 'gag dang shod 'gag bka' shag bcas la shod skor mtshan tho zhes pa 'bri 'bul zhu rgyu rnam kun shod skor drung 'khor rnams la sgrig khrims gnon sdem byed rgyu rgya khyab rdzong gzhis khag la bkar rgya ba dang bka' 'jug pa yong sdud pa zhes pa'i khral bsdu mi 'gro 'os sgrig gis bka' shag dang mnyam tshogs thog mi 'gro gtan 'khel byed pa 'bab theb gzhi kho dang gsal rdzong gzhis khag nas lo re'i yong 'bab ji byung rtsis rgyag gis than skor gral sgrig ces byas byung rnam dbye'i ang rim bkod de bya dgos sprod pa bka' shag gi bkod don ltar las don gal che'i rigs la drung rtsis mnyam tshogs kyis gros 'char 'don rgyu dang tshogs 'du rgyas bsdus kyi 'go khrid byed rgyu bcas yin gong gsal las byed do dam mi sna so so'i go ming ltar 'gan dbang spyod phyogs thad rtsis dpon gyis gong gsal rtsis khang dang 'brel ba'i 'gan dbang khag rtsis khang la bkod 'doms kyis lag bstar byed pa dang rtsis pa gsum nas rtsis dpon gyi bkod don 'og rgyun du rtsis phrug pa rnams la yig rtsis sbyor brdar dang sa zla'i ma dngul dang drung spyi'i ma dngul zhes pa'i dngul 'bab skyed gtong gis skyed 'bab nang lo ltar sa ga zla ba'i tshes 15nyin mtha' 'dul yang 'dul gyi gtsug lag khang khag la mchod sprin bteg 'byung gi 'gro gron gtong rgyu bkod sgrig drung spyi'i ma dngul kyi skyed 'bab nas spyi rdzas gsar bzo dang dbyar skyid kyi 'gro song kha snod gtong rgyu dang 'bab zhib 'bru skyed do dam bcas kyi rtsis khra dang 'byed khra gsar 'god bya mi'i mi phyi zhus dag bcas byas te bka' shag tu dam zhur 'bum rgyu rgya khyab rdzong gzhis khag nas khral bsdu'i mkhar 'pho dang mkhar bre gsar bzo rigs rtsis khang du tshad bsdur bya srol yod pa lta gtan tshigs mkhar ru ma dang mkhar bre'i dpe tshad rtsis khang du yod pa dang tshad gzhal dang 'brel rtsis khang gi rtags tham phab rgyag bya rgyud bcas ni rtsis pa'i 'gan dbang yin yig tshags la rgya khyab rdzong gzhis khag gi khral rigs yong 'bab kyi bsdu gzhung khag dang lcags stag zhib gzhung gis mtshon gzhung sger chos gsum so so'i sa khang mi gsum gyi bdag thob 'byed khra khag gi ma phyi sogs rtsa 'dzin yig rigs rnams la bdag gter nyar tshags bya rgyu'i 'gan dbang yod}
