'dom gang 'dom lnga brgya la rgyang grags gcig rgyang grags brgyad la dpag tshad gcig tu rtsis pa'i tshad gzhi des rgya che chung dang thag ring thung 'jal bar byed pa ni gna' rabs kyi rtsis tshul yin la deng sang rgyu skar so sor bar thag ring thang ni 'od kyis lo gcig la ji tsam 'gro ba'i mgyogs tshad la 'od lo zhes pa'i tshad gzhi'ip+sago nas rtsi srol yod gzhan yang ljid tshad 'jal ba la srang dang nyag khal sogs dang shong tshad 'jal ba la phul dang bre khal sogs yod pa tshang mar gzhi 'dzin sa'i grangs ka nges can zhig dgos de 'dra'i grangs ka'i ming la yang gcig nas grangs med kyi bar du grangs gnas drung cu tham pa yod pas grangs kyi bar stong 'dzin byed klad sgor dang grangs snga ma'i steng du phyi ma snon pa'i bsdoms rtsis dang snga ma'i steng nas mar phri ba'i 'phri rtsis grangs snga ma gong du spel ba'i bsgyur rtsis rtsis gzhi'i de cha mnyam mang por bgos pa'i bgos rtsis rim pa nas rtsi ba'i mgyogs rtsis bcas yod rgya rtsis dang bod rtsis dus 'khor gyi skar rtsis bcas bod du ji lta byung ba'i lo rgyus skor gnad bsdus shig lnga rig mkhas dbang bla med tshe tan zhabs drung rin po ches mdzad pa'i (rgya rtsis kyi go don )zhes pa kan su'i mi dmangs dpe skrun khang nas dpar bskrun byas pa de dang bod rang skyong ljongs sman rtsis khang skar rtsis zhib 'jug tshogs pa nas bton pa'i (bod kyi skar rtsis lo rgyus/) pe cing dpe mdzod khang gi rtsis rig zhib 'jug mkhas can blo mthun hong min shan gyis brtsams pa'i (tshan rig gi sgo nas dpyad pa'i bod kyi skar rtsis go don )zhes pa bcas la gzigs zhib gnang rogs zhu}
