rtse dgu gtor|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs lo ltar bod zla bcu gnyis pa'i tshes nyer dgu nyid rtsi dgu gtor zhes pho brang shar brgyud gzim chung du tA la'i bla ma zhabs 'khod kyis drung bzhes tshugs/rtse gzim 'gag nas smon lam spyi khyab ser skya rnams la byed sgo'i bka' bsgyur bstsal/srid blon dang bka' shag bcas so so'i gzigs zhib rab gsal dang/shod skor dza tha'i sogs bde yangs shar gyi lho ngos thog steng du dbu gur nang dang/rnam grwa'i rol cha ba rnams bde yangs shar gyi mya ngos dbu gur nang bzhugs te phan bde legs bshad gling tshogs yongs nas dug gtor 'cham dang/lcags mkhar bsregs blugs sogs gnang thog dgong dro dge 'dun tshogs yongs nas zhol rdo ring phyi ma'i sum mdor sog phung yod sar zor 'phen gnang skabs zor ne gdan zhur shod drung lnga mchod kyi zhabs gsar ba gnyis nas spos phra 'khyer te bcar dgos shing/zor 'phel mtshams gzim sbyong pa nas bod mda'i dgur shog rgyag la yod pa dang/de nyin rme ru dgon par rme ru dgu gtor zhes pa'i 'chal rgyab skabs a tsa ras lta mo blta mkhan khrod nas phru gu lo bcu grangs skor 'ga' zhig res mos kyis bslangs te ber ka (ab thang )tshad du bcug /rgyal kha thob mkhan der a tsa ras mthe bong bsgrengs nas bstod bsngags byed pa sogs kyis bzhad gad slong srol yod/gong gsal dgung gtor gnyis la ltad mo ba mang po 'dzoms/de sngon bzhi sde dgon pa dang/tshe smon gling/bstan rgyas gling rnams la 'chams yod 'dug kyang dus dbang gis rkyen pas phyis su med par gyur/de min da dung se ra dgon du se ra dgu gtor zhes grwa tshang byes smad sngags gsum nas gtor zer 'phen pa mjal mkhan lha sa ba dang nye skor zhing 'brog sogs mang tsam yod/dgong mo khyim tshang tshang mar nang mi mnyam 'dzoms kyis dgu thug 'thung zhing/de ni lo gsar gyi 'go tshugs lta bu yin}
rtse mgron|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs rtse gzim chung 'gag gi 'go 'dzin te/'gan dbang ni mjal kha zhu mi sang rting bsgrig pa dang/srung mdud g.yogs pa/snyan shog 'bri rgyu/nyin ltar mdzad sgo ji byung mgron deb ('di nyid tho 'god pa yin zhing/srol lam ji byung slad lta zhib byed yul dang/tA la'i bla ma 'das rjes rnam thar sgrig skabs gzhi 'dzin sa'ang byed pas gal cher brtsi ba yin )la 'god pa dang/bkar khang khag nas dngos po 'don 'jug skabs tA la'i blam 'i rtags tham khyer te rtse'i sku tshab tu bskyod dgos pa/de bzhin khrims 'gal gzhung bzhes sgo rgyal them gnon byed dgos pa'i rigs la rtags tham rngo tre ma khyer te sgo thel rgyag pa/gdan sa gsum gyi bla sprul che khag chos zhugs dang mtshan btags (dpe cha thon pa'i skabs grwa tshang khang tshan sogs la gtor sgo rgya che gtong dgos pa'i byed sgo )kyi skabs bcas la sku tshab tu 'gro dgos}
