rtse rnam gan dngul skyed las khungs|{rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa lug (1919)lor sman rtsis khang sogs kyi gron dngul gtor dmigs su rtse rnam gan bkar khongs nas Tam dkar 'bor chen zhig p+sager chos tshong rigs khag la ma 'dzugs gnang ba'i rtse rnam gan dngul skyed do dam zhes rtse skor mkhan che gcig dang/drung rtsis gnyis/shod gzim 'gag gnyis/rtse nga las tshan pa gnyis/shod drung rtsis pa gcig /las bya rtse drung bcu skor bcas bsko gzhag gis skyed dus dus bkag so sor skyed 'bab tshad med bsdu len byas nas lo ltar bka' shag la rtsis khra phul te dag mchan zhus thog lo 'khor rer do dam ngos las brje len dgos pa yin}
