rtse phyag las khungs|{'di ni bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs kyi las khungs shig ste/tshugs yul ni rtse pho brang dkar po'i mdun ngos kyi gzim chung ka brgyad ces tshogs 'du hrag bsdus tshugs yul gyi rab gsal 'og ma de'i nang yin/rtse phyag las khungs sam rtse 'phral bde las khungs ni (rtse phyag ni rtse'i phyag mdzod dang 'phral bde zhes pa rtse pho brang nang gi skabs 'phral gyi me skyon sogs bde 'jags srung rgyu'i 'gan 'khri'i go don dang/yang skabs 'phral gyi mkho 'don stabs bde byed mkhas zhes pa'i go don yod zer/) sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i skabs tsam nas gsar du btsugs/'dir do dam byed mkhan dang las byed mi sna ni/rtse phyag mkhan chung gnyis dang/rim bzhin shod drung gcig /phyag drung gcig (drung tog )phyag mdzod nang gzan te phyag nang nyi shu skor/phyag nang 'os sgug ste sha'o li bzhi bcas yod/las (615) khungs 'di'i gtso bo'i 'gan dbang ni tA la'i bla ma dang srid skyong la 'bul ba byung rigs bdag gnyer dang gnang cha sprod pa dmigs 'dzugs kyi rdzong gzhis khag nas dngul dang sha mar tA la'i bla ma'i nam rgyu dbus snam sogs bsdu len kyis tA la'i bal ma dang srid skyong rgyun du rtse po ta lar bzhugs skabs kyi dgos mkho nar gtong rtse dang nor gling gi las khungs khag la 'char 'phar gyi gtong sgo gtong ba po ta la dang nor gling gi khrims 'doms zho ston skabs lha mo 'khrab mkhan khag la do dam rgyugs len rgya gar nas ras cha sogs mkho sgrub tshong pa dang stod gser dpon 'bri chu gser sdud pa bcas kya sa 'khur la phyag nang res 'khor gyis btang sta gser khral bsdu ba dang ja sogs spus sgyur gyis tshong rgyag pa 'bri chu gser sdud pas re dkar sog gsum nas spus mar zhes pa bsdu len dang chab mdo yang tshong pa ched rdzong gis lam 'khal rdzong 'go so sos rogs gang legs byed dgos pa'i nang don 'khod pa'i t+pala'i blam 'i sbug dam 'byar ma'i bka' yig dang gnang cha ja sbag ras 'thum re lam 'khel rdzong 'go khag la sprod pa de bzhin lha sa dang dpal di sogs la gzhis sdod phyag nang re bsko mngags kya byung song gtong len do dam byed rgyu bcas yin gong gsal las byed do dam mi sna so so'i go ming ltar 'gan dbang spyod phyogs ni bla phyag dang 'dra bas 'dir zhib phra ma bkod la gong 'khod mtho rim dbang 'dzin las khungs rnams phud de byings 'di man gyi las khungs khang gi mi ngad gzhi rtsi'i 'gan dbang tsam las re re bzhin 'god pa'i ngal ba ma zhus so/_}
