rtse gzim chung 'gag|{'tshogs yul rtse dang nor gling nyi 'od gzim chung khag gi sgo 'gag tu yin/'di tA la'i bla ma'i sku mdun du rtse drung rnams drung nga dang mdzad sgo khag la 'du 'dzoms byed sa'i rtse 'gag ces pa de yin/'di'i 'go 'dzin rtse mkhan mgron che ba (mgron gnyer chen mo yang zer )dang/de 'og rtse mgron bcu drug gzim 'gag bzhi bcas yod/drung ja 'tshogs grol 'di yang tA la'i blam sku phreng lnga pa'i skabs gam zhabs ser mo ba nyung shas las med pa de rnams rtse po ta lar gtan sdod kyis ja rtsam sogs gzhung nas nar gtod byed srol yod pa de tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i skabs nas ser mo ba rnams drung 'khor dang 'dra ba'i srid las byed po'i gras su zhugs te rtse drung zhes pa'i ming chag rjes kyang mu mthud rgyun 'dzin byas pa zhig yin/drung ja 'tshogs yun chu tshod gnyis tsam gyi dus tshod 'di ni tA la'i bla mas nyin re'i chos srid kyi mdzad sgo ci ris gnang ba'i dus tshod yin zhing/nyin ltar zhogs pa chu tshod 11thog rtse drung yongs rdzogs dang/shod skor bzhugs bya bka' blon/(nor gling du bka' blon sdod res )rtse phyag /phabs byams 'go pa bcas drung ja 'thung bar 'du 'dzoms kyi mdo sbug gral gnas so sor 'dzol med bsdad thog gzim 'gag gis phreng ba 'dzin zhing sgrig khrims gnon pa dang/ (616) de byings tshang mas phreng ba'ang 'dzin mi chog cing gleng mol dang skad cor gyi rigs med par mdzes lam gang chags kyis sdod dgos pa yin rtse 'gag gi 'go 'dzin dpon rigs mgron gter chen mo dang rtsi mgron gzim 'gag bcas so so'i 'gan dbang spyod phyogs sogs kyi skor ka mad go rim ltar sde pa sa so'i nang yod pa der gzigs}
