ba thob pa ltar (tshad ma sde bdun )brtsams par mdzad cing/(tshad ma sde bdun )ni gtso bo lus lta bu'i bstan bcos gsum/(rgyas par ston pa (tshad ma rnam 'grel/) 'bring du ston pa (tshad ma rnam nges/) bsdus nas ston pa (tshad ma rigs thigs )bcas )dang 'phros pa yan lag lta bu'i bstan (628) bcos bzhi (rang don le'u las 'phros pa (gtan tshigs rigs pa )dang ltag chod kyi 'brel pa gtan la 'bebs pa ('brel pa brtag pa ) gzhan don le'u las 'phros pa/) (rgyud gzhan grub pa )dang )rtsod pa'i rigs pa )gnyis bcas yin )bcas bzhi yod de dag gi nang nas (tshad ma rnam 'brel )la le'u bzhi ste rang don le'u tshad ma grub pa'i le'u mngon sum le'u gzhan don le'u bcas yod de dag gi nang nas (tshad ma rnam 'grel )la le'u bzhi ste rang don le'u tshad ma grub pa'i le'u mngon sum le'u gzhan don le'u bcas yod (tshad ma rnam nges )la le'u gsum ste mngon sum le'u rang don le'u gzhan don le'u bcas yin (tshad ma rnam 'grel )la slob dpon lha dbang blo dang shAkya blo gnyis kyi 'grel pa yod cing slob dpon dul ba lhas (tshad ma sde bdun )ka la 'grel pa yod la rgyan mkhan po shes rab 'byung gnas kyis (tshad ma rnal 'grel )las 'grel pa mdzad slob dpon chos mchog gis (tshad ma rnam nges kyi 'grel pa 'thad ldan chen mo/) (rigs thigs kyi 'grel pa slob ma la phan pa )sogs tshad ma'i gzhung mang po yod tshad ma'i bstan bcos de dag bod du bsgyur ba ni thog mar rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus su bod kyi lo tsA ba rma dge ba'i blo gros kyis (tshad ma rnam 'grel )thog mar bsgyur rjes su dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i mjug tu rngog lo tsA ba blo ldan shes rab kyis (tshad ma sde bdun )bod skad du bsgyur zhing (tshad ma rnam nges )la 'grel bshad mdzad sa skya paN ne kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis (tshad ma rigs gter/) 'grel pa dang bcas pa mdzad gzhan yang sa skya'i mkhas pa chen po g.yag rong pa paN chen shAkya mchog ldan 'u yug pa rigs pa'i seng ge nya dbon kun dpal ba rje btsun red mda' ba sogs dang rje tsong kha pa rgyal tsham dar ma rin chen mkhas grub dge legs dpal bzang paN chen mchog lha 'od zer grwa chung b