tshal gung thang|{de yang bka' rgyud che bzhi'i ya gyal tshal pa bka' rgyud kyi gdan sa tshal gung thang dgon pa ni lha sa skyid chu'i lho ngos lha sa grong khyer dang bar thag le dbar bcu lhag tsam gyi sar (stag rtse rdzong khongs )gnas yod cing/tshal gung thang zhes pa tshal dang gung thang gnyis ming sdeb nas 'bod pa ste/byang ngos kyi tshal dgon par yang dgon dang dbus gling zhes grwa tshang gnyis dang/lho ngos gung thang du cho khri lcogs dang/gzim khang shar/chos 'khor gling bcas khag gsum yod pa las tshang yang dgon ni gung thang bla ma zhang brtson 'grus grags pas rab byung gsum pa'i shing lug (1175)lor phyag btab/de nas lo ngo bcu gsum song ba'i me lug (1187)lor gung thang gtsug lag khang btab /nye gnas dar ma dbang phyug gis blam zhang sku gshegs rjes dgon pa dang mi ser gyi bdago byas te dgon pa'i mjug skyong thog sku 'bum sogs bzhengs nas rgya bskyed/de nas dpon rabs kha shas song rjes bla ma zhang gi yon bdag rgyal ba 'byung gnas kyi sras sangs rgyas dngos grub kyi sras rin chen rgyal mtshan rgya nag tu byon/gong ma se chen rgyal pos tshal pa khri dpon gyi 'ja' sa gnang/des gung thang gzing khang shar bskrun/se 'bras dga' gsum ma chags gong gung thang bshad grwa dar rgyab che bas bde gsang gung gsum/dga' skyor zul gsum zhes dbus kyi gdan sa drug tu grags pa'i gung zhes pa de yin/tshal pa khri dpon mnga' thang dar skabs gung thang dar rgyas shin tu che yang tshal pa'i mnga' thang rim gyis nyams pa dang/lhag par rab byung dug pa'i me yos (1507)lor me skyon byung nas gtsug lag khang dbus mar lha chen dpal 'bar (thub dbang )sogs rten rnying dga' shas dang/chos khri/gzim khang shar grwa tshang chung chung gnyis bcas ma gtogs phal cher nyams/dga' ldan khri thog dug pa rje dbon blo bzang nyi ma'i dus nas dge lugs dar khyab che ba byung/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i dus gang gi dbu bla zur chos dbyings rang grol gyis zhal 'dzin gnang/de rjes lha bzang khang gis dga' ldan khri thog lnga bcu pa bya bral dge 'dun phun tshogs la dgon gzhis ma lag dang bcas phul/de'i yang srid bstan pa'i sgron me bla brang bkra shis 'khyil (kan su'u )du bzhugs par gung thang tshang zhes 'bod pa des tshal gung thang gzhung 'bul gnang stabs tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i klog slob sku zhang bsam gtan rgya mtsho dang sku tsha dar han mkhan po skal bzang yon tan sogs la gnang bar brten de nas gung thang dgon pa'i bdag thob de gung thang bla brang zhes sger gung tham pas byed/'chad nyan sogs kyi thad dpon rin chen rgyal mtshan gyi slob dpon dga' bde dpal (de'i skor gsham du tshal pa dga' bde dpal zhes par gzigs )bas grwa tshang chos 'khor gling btab nas mtshan nyid rig pa'i slob gnyer btsugs shing/dbus gling du sngags pa grwa tshang btsugs/tshal pa khri dpon kun dga' rdo rje'i dus bu ston rin po che gdan drangs nas tshal pa bka' 'gyur zhes bod kyi mkhas pa yongs kyis tshad ldan gyi dper byed pa de bzhengs pa sogs zhib par 'jog ri ngag dbang bstan 'dzin gyis mdzad pa'i (tshal gung thang gi dkar chag 'gro mgon zhal lung )zhes pa'i nang gsal}
tshal pa kun dga' rdo rje|{tshal pa'i si tu kun dga' rdo rje (si ti dge ba'i blo gros )ni rab byung lnga pi sa bya (1309)lor 'khrungs/rab byung drug pa'i shing sbrul (1364)lor sku gshegs/'di pa'i yab drung chen smon lam rdo rje dgung lo nyi shu pa chu yos nas sum cu so gsum bar khri dpon byas/dgung lo zhe lnga pa/rang byung (632) lnga pa'i sa 'brug (1328)lor jo gdan mkhan chen bsod nams dpal ba dang yang dgon mkhan po byang chub dpal ba gnyis kyi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs mdzad cing rtsom yig kyang mang pod yod pa zhig yin pa dang lha sa gtsug lag khang la bdag gter ha cang legs po gnang yod tshal pa kun dga' rdo rje ni drung chen smon lam rdo rje'i sras che ba yin zhing dgung lo lnga nas yi ge 'bri klog legs par mkhyen tshal pa bka' bag+r+yud kya chos skor dang mdo sngags rig gnas gang la mkhas pa'i snyan grangs can du gyur dgung lo bco lnga pa rab byung lnga pa'i chu phag (1323)lor khri dpon du bskos dgung lo bcu bdun pa shing glang (1325)lor yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma ye sun the'i mur gyi drung du byon dngul bre chen dang dngul gyi tham ka gser gyi rgyan gos dar sogs mang po dang tshal pa'i mi da dbang rigs thams cad shes su bcug pa'i 'ja' sa bcas byung 'dis lo nyi shu rtsa brgyud ring khri dpon gyi go gnas bzung zhing de'i ring tshal gung thang gi gtsug lag khang dang lha sa gtsug lag khang po ta la bcas la bdag gces dang nyams gso legs par mdzad bu ston rin po che gdan drangs te snang shang gi bka' 'gyur sogs skabs der bod du yod pa'i bka' 'gyur mang por zhib bsdus zhus dag mdzad de gser dngul 'dres ma'i bka' 'gyur pod nyis brgya drug cu bzhengs pa der tshal pa bka' 'gyur zhes bod kyi mkhas pa mang pos tshad ldan gyi ma dper brtsi ba de byung 'on kyang rjes su ta'i si tu byang chub rgyal mtshan dang ma mthun pa'i rkyen gyis rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu 'brug (1352)lor da dbang shor te rang nyid kyi las rgyun 'dzin mkhan gcung po grags pa shes rab la gtad nas mkhan chen don zhags pa sangs rgyas rin chen gyi drung du rab byung dang bsnyen rdzogs mdzad mtshan dge ba'i blo gros su gsol karma pa sku phreng bzhi pa rol pa'i rdo rje rgya nag nas bod du phyir phebs gnang rjes tshal gung thang du gdan drangs te mdo sngags kyi chos mang du zhus bod sa gnas su si tu thams cad mkhyen pa zhes bstod bsngags chen po byed pa zhig byung 'dis mdzad pa'i rtsom yig la tshal ka bka' 'gyur gyi dkar chag dang (deb ther dkar po/) (deb ther dmar po/) (de'i lhan thabs der ther mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog )rgyal rabs lo rgyus (deb ther khra bo/) (gung thang bla ma zhing gi rnam thar )rang nyid kyi (yab smon lam rdo rje'i rnam thar )bcas yod (deb ther dmar po )ni rab byung drug pa'i me khyi (1346)lor brtsam 'go tshugs karma pa sku phreng bzhi pa rol pa'i rdo rje rgya nag nas bod du phyir phebs mdzad pa'i lo ste rab byung drug pa'i chu yos (1363)lor brtsams grub pa yin deb ther 'di yi kha byang du (deb ther dmar po rnams kyi dang po bzhugs so )zhes 'khod pa ma zad 'jog ri ngag dbang bstan 'dzin gyis mdzad pa'i (tshal gung thang gi dkar chag )du yang (deb ther dmar po )'di la lhan thabs su (deb ther mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog )zer ba zhig yod ces 'khod pa ltar de sngon rig gnas gsar brje chen po'i gong bod rang skyong ljongs chab srid gros tshogs kyi phyag dpe'i gras su (deb ther dmar po'i kha skong mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog )ces 'khod pa'i dpe ring bri ma zhig kho bos mthong myong ba de'i nang don ni thog mar bod kyi rgyal rabs bkod pa phal che ba ni gnad bsdus tsam dang nad don gtso bo ni gung thang bla ma zhang nas bzung tshal gung thang gi bla rabs dang dpon dar ma gzhon du nas bzung rang nyid kyi yab smon lam rdo rje'i bar gyi lo rgyus 'khod 'dug pa 'di'i gras da dung yod med 'tshol zhib byed dgos pa bcas lo rgyus mdor bsdus tsam yin gong gsal rtsom pa po'i lo rgyus rnams (bu ston rin po che'i rnam thar )khong gi thugs sras rin chen rnam rgyal gyis mdzad pa dang (633) 'jog ri ngag dbang bstan 'dzin gyis mdzad pa'i (tshal gung thang gi dkar chag 'gro mgon zhal lung )grangs 35nas 27bar dang karma tshe dbang kun khyab kyis mdzad pa'i (karma bka' brgyud kyi chos 'byung )dang (deb dmar )nang gsal bi karma pa rol pa'i rdo rje'i lo rgyus bcas phan tshun bsdur nas bris pa yin pas zhib cha gong gsal gyi lo rgyus yig cha de tshor gzigs par zhu}
