tshal pa dga' bde dpal|{btsan po srong btsan sgam po'i blon po mgar stong btsan gyi rigs rgyud las byung ba mkhar rgyal ba 'byung gnas dang gung thang blam zhang gnyis mchod yon du gyur/mkhar rgyal ba 'byung gnas la sras sangs rgas dngos grub 'khrungs pa dpon du bskos/dge 'dun tshal pa'i bstan pa'i rtsa ba btsugs/de'i sras dpon chen rin chen rgyal gyis dpon gyi las kha bzung ste/gong du byon/se chen rgyal pos skyid shod stod smad dang stod lung/dgra dol/'phyong po/rgyal sman/e dwags gnyis gsum sogs lha khang zhig gso byed pa'i mi da shes su chug gi 'ja' sa gnang/gung thang du byon te gzing khang shar dang/khyams ra chen mo brtsigs/de'i sras gnyis pa dga' bdes dpon gyi go sa bzung/tshal pa'i dgon sde'i don du gong ma'i drung du lan bdun byon/mi chen zab kha dang ma mthun nas thog mar zam kha dbang che ba byung yang rjes su dga' bdes rgyal kha blangs nas/nged rang gnyis po khyad par che/_/nga ni dge 'dun tshal pa yin/_/dge bde dpal/blo bde dpal/skyid bde dpal/de lta tshal pa'i dga' bde dpal zhes glu blangs/de nas rgya'i bzo bo mkhas pa bos te rgya phibs dang gser 'phrul sogs rten dang brten pa bzhengs/chos 'khor gling du mtshan nyid kyi bshad grwa dang/dbus gling du sngags grwa btsugs pa sogs mdzad pa rgya che ba byung/dga' bde'i sras chung ba smon lam rdo rje'i dus chos phyogs kyi mdzad pa rgya che ba'i thog srid kyi mnga' thang yang rgya cher 'phel/de'i sras che ba dpon kun dga' rdo rje yin}
