tshal pa'i dpon rabs rim byung|{1 nye gnas dar ma gzhon nu/rab byung gsum pa'i me lug (1187)lor dpon du bskos nas rab byung bzhi pa'i chu khyi (1202)bar lo nyer gcig ring srid dbang bzung/2 dpon 'byung gnas brtson 'grus/rab byung bzhi pa'i chu phag (1203)nas shing phag (1215)bar lo bcu gsum ring srid dbang bzung/3 dpon ye shes gzungs/rab byung bzhi pa'i shing phag (1215)nas sa (634) stag (1218)bar lo ngo bzhir srid bzung 4 dpon sangs rgyas dngos grub bar byung bzhi pa'i sa yos (1219)lo nas rab byung bzhi pa'i chu stag (1242)lo bar lo nyer bzhi ring srid dbang bzung 5 dpon rgyal mtshan rin chen rab byung bzhi pa'i chu yos 1242)lo nas rab byung lnga pa'i sa 'brug (1268)lo nas sa yos (1279)bar lo bcu gcig ring srid dbang bzung 7 dpon dga' bde dpal rab byung lnga pa'i lcags 'brug (1280)lo nas chu khyi (1322)lar lo zhe gsum ring srid dbang bzung 8 dpon rin chen seng ge gong 'phros nas me stag (1326)bal ro bzhi ring srid dbang bzung 9 dpon drung chen smon lam rdo rje rab byung drug pa'i chu yos (1303)lo nas rab byung lnga pa'i chu phag (1323)bar lo nyi shing ring srid dbang bzung 10 dpon chen kun dga' rdo rje rang byung lnga pa'i chu phag (1323)lor nas rab byung drug pa'i lcags stag (1350)bar lo nyer brgyad ring srid dbang bzung 11 spyan snga grags pa shes rab gong 'phros nas rab byung drug pa'i chu rta (1342)bar lo lnga'i ring srid dbang bzung 12 si ti dge legs bzang po rab byung drug pa'i chu rta (1342)lo nas rab byung drug pa'i sa khyi (1358)shalar lo bcu bdun ring srid dbang bzung 13 tre hos dpal 'byor bzang po gong 'phros nas rab byung drug pa'i sa rta (1378)bar lo nyer gcig ring srid dbang bzung 14 drung slob dpon legs ldan pa gong 'phros nas rab byung drug pa'i shing byi (1384)bar lo bdun ring da dbang bzung 15 kre hos dga' bden bzhang po gong 'phros nas rab byung bdun pa'i me glang (1397)bar lo bcu bzhi'i ring srid dbang bzung 16 spyan snga dngos grub rgyal mtshan gong 'phros nas log nyis tsam srid bskyangs nas tshal pa'i mi da gtsug lag khang dang bcas pa na gdong dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan la phul te 'dzin skyong du dge rgyan mkhan po chu lug (1403)lor 'byor de nas lo ngo dgu song ba'i lcags yos (1411)lor dgung thang la dmag gi gnod pa byung zhing de nas rab byung dgu pa'i me lug (1547)lor gung thang gtsug lag khang la mi skyon byung}
