tshe gling do dam|{bod rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa yos ching rgyal rabs kyi gong ma rin tsung cang ching khri lo nyi shu rtsa bzhi pa'i (1718)lor/skabs de'i bod sag nas kyi srid skyong de mo 'jigs med rgya mtsho 'brum nad kyis 'das tshab tu tshe smon gling ho thog tu sku phreng gnyis pa 'jam dpal tshul khrims (dga' ldan khri thog don gsum pa )srid skyong du bskos te lo nyi shu rtsa lnga'i ring srid dbang bzung zhing/de'i ring chos khrims dang srid khrims gnyis kar (638) ha cang dam drags pa dang lhag par du bka' shag sogs mtho rim dpon rigs dang paN chen er te ne'i zhabs gras bod du bca' sdod am ban bcas dang mthun po ma byung ba'i rkyen gyis bod kyi rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing 'brug ching rgyal rabs gong ma zhon tsung ta'o kong khri lo nyi shu rtsa bzhi pa'i (1844)lor skabs der lha sar rgyun sdod am ban chis hran {(WP:1,194)}gyis gong mar snyan zhu phul rjes bka' phab pa ltar bod zla 8tshes 3nyin glo bur du tshe smon gling gi dza sag bskal bzang rnam rgyal am ban gyi yA mon du bskongs te 'phral du 'dzin bzung thog rtse po ta la'i ltag rgyab tu btson 'jug byas srid skyong tshe smon gling rang nyid skabs der gling khar spro skyid gtong bzhin pa'i mur bka' blon zur khang pa yong nas srid skyong gi tham pa rtsis len byas shing tshes drug nyid srid skyong gi las tham paN chen er te ni bstan pa'i nyi mar phul te srid skyong las thab tshu bskos bod zla 12tshes gsum nyin tshe smon gling srid skyong 'dzin bzung byas thog rtse po ta la'i ltag sgo rgyab tu btson 'jug dang dza sag bskal bzang rnam rgyal lha sa snang rtse shag gi btsun khang du btson 'jug byas rjes tshe smon gling bla brang dang dgon ba'i rgyu dar rnams dbus gtsang khul gyi dgon pa khag la bgo bsha' dang mchod gzhis khag rnams gzhung bzhes btang ste de'i do dam byed mkhan dpon rigs zur du bskos pa la tshe smon gling don dam pa zer zhing do dam rtse drug mkhan chung gcig dang drung yig gcig gad pa khang gnyer mi gnyis bcas yod}
