tshe mchog gling|{tshe mchog gling bkra shis bsam gtan gling ni lha na skyid chu'i lho ngos grib grong tshor gnas/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags khyi (1790)lor gzhung nas gtso 'gan 'khur te btab/lha sa'i gling bzhi'i gras shig yin/de ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin dka' chen ye shes rgyal mtshan gyi bzhugs gnas su bskrun/dka' chen ye shes rgyal mtshan tA la'i bla ma 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin du gdan zhu byung ba ltar skyid grong nas lha sar phebs/skabs der yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan la bzhugs gnas dgon pa med cing/sngon gyi bzhugs gnas dgon pa skyid grong bsam gtan gling la gor kha'i dmag gi 'phrog bcom do phog tshabs che byung nas de'i dge da'un pa rnams skyid grang du gnas ma thub pa'i nang nas khag gcig lha sar 'byor ba yongs 'dzin nyid nas skyong dgos thog /gong mi'i zhabs brtan la'ang dmigs te dgon pa gsar bzhengs kyis mchod gzhis rten khungs dang sbrags gzhung nas gsar sbyor gnang rgyu yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan (639) la snyan seng zhus par kho bo ban rgan la sdod yul gsar rgyag byas nas ci byed de 'drami dgos zhes zhal gyis mi bzhes kyang rjes su yang skyar dgon pa zhig gsar 'dzugs kyis yongs 'dzin mchog nas zhal 'dzin gnang na bstan spyi dang bye brag la dgos phan chen po yod skor u nan zhus mthar zhal gyis bzhes tsam byung ste grib ni sa dpyad bzang bas der gzhi nas dgon pa 'debs pa'i las grwa'i 'go btsugs tA la'i bla ma rang nas thugs 'khur chen po gnang ba ltar gzhung nas las grwa'i do dam dang 'brel gron dngul srang nyis khri lhag tsam btang zhing yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan rang nas dngul srang tshig stong rnga bag+r+ya tsam gnang de min dad can khag nas kyang rgyab skyor zhus gtsug lag khang dang rung khang sgrub khang sogs 'du ba dang mthun pa dgos pa bzhin bzo skrun spyi'i rgya khyon spyi khre gru bzhi ma bdun stong yod pa'i gtsug lag khang ka ba sum cu so gnyis nyis thog dang khyams ka ba nyi shu brgyad kyi sa spyil bu drug cu re brgyad bcas las dus yun zla ba lnga tsam las ma 'gor bar bskrun dgon pa 'dir gtsug lag khang gi dbus su rten gyi gtso bo thub pa sku tshad lha'i jo bo'i sku tshad dang mnyam pa re gzus rdo rje rgyal mtshan gyis bzhengs par grags pa'i g.yas su yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan gyi dngul gdung thog tshad ma de'i g.yas g.yon du dngul sku sku tshad ma re brag sgo rab 'byams pa'i thugs dam gyi rten tsong kha pa chen po'i sku brnyas gong gral g.yon du byams pa'i sku brnyan dang de'i g.yas g.yon du a ti sha dang tsong kha pa'i sku brnyan sogs sku brnyan mang po yod pa dang de dung snar thang dpar ma'i bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur cha tshang yod pa'i bka' 'gyur pod so so'i dbu shog gsum re gser bris dang dka' bstan tshang mar mdzod gos kyi na bza' gdong dar rang 'grig rje tsong kha pa chen po'i gsung 'bum gser bris ma sogs gsung rab du ma yod gtsug lag khang gi ldeb bris su ston pa shAkya thub pa gnas brtan bcu drug gis bskor ba dang rgyal ba seng ge sa ro de bzhin gshegs kun gzigs sangs rgyas mar me mdzad rgyal ba byams pa 'od dpag med yongs 'dzin ye shes rgyal mtshan kyi sku brnyan sogs sku brnyan mang po yod pa dang gdung ma rnams la gsang bde 'jigs gsum dang tshe lha rnam gsum sogs kyi rtsa sngags lany+tsa la gser shog sbyar ma sogs kyis rnam par bkra ba yod kyang da lta shul phran bu las bsdad med}
