tshe tan zhabs drung|{gnas lnga rig pa'i paN+Di ta chen po tshe tan zhabs drung mchog ni mtsho sngon zhing chen shun hA rdzong gi rgya nag mkhar mo che ya rdzi zhes pa'i sa char rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags khyi (1910)lo'i zla 4tshes 22nyid yab g.yang tse 'am blo bzang bkra shis dang yum lha mo thar gnyis kyi sras su sku bltams/dam pa 'di nyid kyi rigs ru cho 'brang thad rang rnam las (bdag gi mes po gong ma rnams ni ri4gas gzhan gyi rtsi dang ma 'dres pa'i rgya nag gi rigs yin zhing/bdag gi pha nas bzung rgya bod gyi rigs 'dren pa can du gyur pa ma zad/nga rang ni skad yig goms srol gnas yul bzhi'i sgo nas rigs 'byed pa'i dbang du btang na bod kyi rigs su gtogs )zhes dang/(ma'i mched khungs ni rgya nag ri bo rtse lnga dang khad nye ba'i hran shi tha'i yon grong khyer chen po'i bzang sman sna tshogs 'tshong mkhan zhig rim gyis sa 'dir (640) slebs nas gzhis chags pa zhig gi rgyud yin )zhes gsungs dgung lo gsum la phebs skabs zhwa dmar paN+Di tas mar me'i brtag pa la brten nas tshe tan zhabs drung sku gong ma'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin zhus te mtshan blo bzang chos 'phel du gsol de rjes sku tshe 'di'i dge ba'i bshes gnyen dang po rje ngag dbang chos 'dzin las klog bslab dgung lo bdun la phabs pa mi 'brug (1916)lor mthu ba dgon pa'i mtshams khang bsam gtan pho brang du rje gser ri'i ma Ni paN+Di ta sku phreng lnga pa dge 'dun bstan 'dzin rgya mtshan dpal bzang po'i drung nas dge bsnyen dang bar ma rab byung dge tshul gsum gyi sdom pa dus gcig tu zhus shing mtshan du dge da'un bshad sgrub rgya mtsho zhes gsol dgung lo dgu pa sa rta (1918)lo nas btsugs te dge ba'i bshes gnyen blo bzang zla ba rgyun bcar gyis bla ma mchod pa sogs chos spyod kyi 'don khag rim gyis gsan sbyong mdzad lo der glo bur du yab bsnyun gzhis rkyen te sku tshe ma zin pas yum la thugs gso'i ched du phebs te skabs shig ring gzim khang du bzhugs de rjes slar yang mthu ba dgon du phebs nas 'don cha rnams blo 'dzin grub rjes rgyan 'jug gnyis thugs 'dzin mdzad de nas rim bzhin klog pa'i slob dpon rje ngag dbang chos 'dzin dpal bzang po'i drung nas bsdus grwa'i kha dog dkar dmar sogs kyi rtags gsal khyab brda gtong lugs kyi rig pa rnams bslab pa'i dbu tshugs de rjes yongs 'dzin blo bzang dpal ldan gyi drung nas lam gtso rnam gsum sogs mdo sngags kyi phyag dpe mang po'i bka' khrid thob dgung lo bcu bzhir phebs pa chu phag (1923)lo nas bzung ta yongs 'dzin rin po che'i drung nas 'grel dbyangs can dgyes glu gtso bor gyur pa'i snyan ngag gi dpe brjod khag slob khrid zhus de nas yongs 'dzin rin po che'i drung nas gzhung chen mngon mdzod sogs mdo phyogs kyi gzhung chen khag la gsan bsam dang kun rig sogs sngags phyogs kyi phyag dpe rnams kyi dbang lung bshad khri sogs bum pa gang byo'i tshul du cha tshang gshegs par gsan dgung lo nyi shur phebs pa rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa sbrul (1929)lor rje 'jigs med dam chos rgya mtshos mkhan slob sbrags ma dang yongs 'dzin blo bzang dpal ldan mchog gis gsang ston mdzad de dge ba'i bshes gnyen grangs bcu tshogs pa'i dbus su dge slong gi sdom pa mnos te mtshan du 'jigs med rig pa'i blo gros zhes gsol dgung lo nyer lngar phebs pa shing khyi (1934)lor gtso bor nying kyi bshes gnyen dam pa'i gsung pod rnams dpar brko bya rgyud dmigs te mthu ba dgon du par rko'i grwa tshang zhig gsar 'dzugs gnang dgung lo so brgyad la phebs pa me phag (1947)lo nas bla ma rdo rje 'chang chen po'i bka' bum sogs kyi bshad lung gi chos rgyun spel gnang mdzad de nas rim bzhin rab byung dang bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa 'bog chog bskyangs dgung lo zhe gsum pa rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu sbrul (1953)lor mtsho sngon zhing chen rtsom sgyur u yon lhan khang gi 'gan khur bzhes shing sgyur rtsom gyi mdzad pa gnang ba mang kru'o tsung lis sgos su chog mchan gnang ba'i go gnas kyi yi ge dang bcas mtsho sngon zhing mi dmangs u yon lhan khang gi gzhung las khang gi kru'u rin gzhon pa'i 'gan khur bzhes dgung lo zhe dgu nas nga bzhi bar mtsho sngon mi rigs slob grwa chen mo'i dge rgan mdzad de rjes ge sar sgrung gi bstan bcos par 'god legs sgrig zhus dag gang dgon gtong rogs dang sbrags zhing chen mi rigs slob grwar skyes rabs so bzhi pa'i steng nas ston pa'i rnam thar rnams snyan ngag gi gzhung 'grel dang 'brel te slob khrid gnang dgung lo lnga bcur phebs pa sa phag (1915)lor gal che'i yig cha 'ga' re sgyur rtsom dang zhus dag gi don du mi rigs dpe skrun (641) khang gis re 'dun bzhin pe cin du phyag las gnang bar phabs te der mkhas dbang dmu dge bsam gtan dang lhan du khang mig gcig nang zla gsum tsam bzhugs tshul rang rnam las gsal dgung lo nga bzhir phebs pa chu yos (1963)lor dam pa nyid kyi yum chen tshe'i 'phen pa rdzogs dgung lo nga drug bzhes pa shing sbrul (1963)lor dam pa nyid kyi yum chen sku tshe'i 'phen pa rdzogs dgung lo nga drug bzhes pa shing sbrul (965)lo'i lo mjug nas rig gnas gsar brje zhes pa'i las 'gul tshugs te nyes med nyes 'gel gyis zi ling nan tha'an {(WP:1,194)}btson khang du lo ngo bcu gnyis lhag tsam bzhugs dgos byung dgung lo re dgu bzhes pas sa rta (1978)lor krung gung mtsho sngon zhing chen u yon lhan khang gi chog mtshan thob ste btson 'grol byung rjes nub byang mi rigs slob grol nas re skul zhus pa bzhin phebs te slob ma kun la mi shes pa'i mun pa sel ba'i blo gros kyi snang gang la ci 'dod du bstsal rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags bya (1981)lor nub byang mi rigs slob grwa'i bod yig zhib 'jug 'dzin grwa'i slob ma rnams sa sne khrid mdzad de dbus gtsang phyogs su phebs nas lha sa dang lho kha gzhis rtse sogs kyi gnas grags che'i gras mang che bar phebs pa ma zad rig gzhung rtogs zhib dang snyan sgron sogs ka mdzad pa rgya cher bskyangs sku tshe gcig rin mi rigs kyi slob gso'i bya gzhan ga la thugs nus yod rgu 'don gnang mdzad de slob ma grangs las 'das pa gso skyong mdzad mthar dgung grangs don grub zhes pa rab byung bcu drug pa'i shing glang (1985)lo'i zla 6tshes 30nyin gyi zhogs pa'i chu tshod 5dang skar ma 50thog chos sde chen po bra brang bkra shis 'khyil du du gdongs pa chos dbyings thim dam pa 'di nyid sku 'tsho bzhugs skabs ka'an su'u zhing chen nang bstan mthun tshogs kyi tshogs gso gzhon pa dang ka'an su'u zhing chen srid gros kyi u yon krung go mi rigs skad yig slob tshogs kyi las 'dzin pa krung go nang bstan mthun tshogs kyi las 'dzin pa bcas kyi go gnas bzhes myong yod khong gi gsung rtsom ni rnam thar dang lo rgyus dam chos bslab bya skar rtsis snyan ngag sum rtags dag gsum lany+dza dang wartu ma phyi sogs le tshan lnga bcu lhag yod pa de dag phyogs bsdus kyi lcags dpar ma deb lngar dbye ste me yos (1987)lor mtsho sngon mi rigs dpe skrun khang nas dpar skrun byas yod gzhan yang dam pa 'di nyid kyi mdzad rnam zhib btsam gzigs 'dod na gong gsal gsung ma phyogs bsgrigs kyi pod dang po'i nang (mnyam med shAkya'i dbang po'i rjes zhugs pa 'jigs med rig pa'i blo grong gi byung ba brjod pa bden gtam rna ba'i bdud rtsi )zhes bya bar gzigs par 'tshal}
