tshe smon gling|{dgon pa 'di ni ra mo che gtsug lag khang gi nub ngos su chags yod pa dang/bzhi sde grwa tsang gi 'dabs 'brel yin/tshe smon gling zer ba'i ming de ni (642) dgon pa 'di btab rjes man ching gong ma tA kong gis btags pa zhig yin dgon pa 'di tshe smon gling sku phreng gnyis pa 'jam dpal tshul khrims kyis bod sa gnas kyi srid skyong gnang nas lo ngo drug song ba'i bar byung bcu gsum pa'i shing bya (1825)lor thog mar btab cing se ra smad grwa tshang gi khongs gtogs yin dgon pa 'di'i chags dbyibs ni byang nas lhor gtad yod cing 'dzugs skrun gyi g+r+ya khyon ni spyi khre gru bzhi ma (6240)tsam yod la shar nub lho gsum gyi phyogs rnams shag skor dang byang ngos thog brtsegs bzhi yod pa'i gtsug lag khang shar nub gnyis yod grwa shag dang de'i phyir bar khyams steng shod gnyis yod gtsug lag khang lte ba'i 'dzugs skrun thad shar nub gnyis su bcad nas yod pa de la bltas na dus skabs snga rjes gnyis su rim bzhin 'dzugs skrun byas pa zhig yin pa gsol po mthong thub shar ngos kyi gtsug lag khang de'i 'dzugs skrun dang bzo bkod la bltas na dgon pa 'di thog mar btab pa'i skabs kyi bzo dbyibs yin pa dang nub ngos kyi gtsug lag khang steng shog bzo bkod sha ngos las legs pa yod pas rjes su rgya bskyed byas pa zhig yin pa mthong thub shar ngos kyi gtsug lag khang la pho brang dkar po dang nub ngos kyi gtsug lag khang la pho brang dmar po zer shar ngos kyi pho brang dang gtsug lag khang gi rgya khyon la spyi khre gru bzhi ma 800yod pa de'i nang sbug thag ring tshan spyi khri 13 4lon pa'i 'du khang yin cing gseng g.yab mthongs skor la ring tshan spyi khre 6 6dang zheng tshad la spyi khre 4lon pa'i ral gsal mtho po yod 'du khang gi mdun du sbug thag spyi khre 3 4lon pa'i sgo 'phyor yod pa dang de'i g.yas g.yon gnyis su rung khang dang mdzod khang yod cing de tsho'i bzo skrun gyi spus tshan zhan tsam yod 'du khang gi sbug ngos nas mchod khang yin cing de'i nang 'jim bzo'i yi dam chos srung gi sku 'dra kha shas dang tshe smon gling sku phreng gnyis pa 'jam dpal tshul khrims kyi dngul gdung dang sku phreng gsum pa bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi dngul gdung gnyis kyi mtho tshad la thog so gcig longs pa yod bar thog gi byang ngos mgon khang nam 'jim bzos rta mgrin dang gzhan yang dge lugs chos skyong srung ma khag drug gi sku brnyan brtsigs ldebs su ras bris dang tshem grub ma'i thang ka sna tshags sum cu lhag tsam yod steng thog thog so gnyis pa dpe mdzod khang nang bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur gsum 'bum lo rgyun rig gnas la sogs pa'i dpe cha bris ma dang dpar ma khyon bsdoms pod khri gnyis lhag tsam yod (dpe mdzod khang 'di'i nang gi dge cha gal che ba khag gcig po ta la dang zhol dpe mdzod khang du dbor zin )rtse thog thog so bzhi pa'i dkyil ni tshoms chen dang de'i g.yas g.yon gnyis su gzim chung shar nub gnyis dpe gzigs khang nyi 'od bar khyams bcas yin nub ngos kyi gtsug lag khang dang pho brang dmar pa ni shar ngos kyi pho brang las spus tshad legs shing bod pa thon po yod pa der bltas na shar ngos gtsug lag khang rnying pa las lo bcu phrag kha shas kyi phyi ba yod de'i khyad chos ni ka gdung sogs la brkos dkros gyi rgyan ris mang la zhib tshags che ba brtsig ldebs tshang ma ldebs bris yod pa tshos mdog rnams la ri mo ha cang phra zhib yin pa bcas red gtsug lag khang de'i mdun ngos ni sgo 'phyor dang de'i sbug tu 'du khang 'thu khang gi sbug tu mchod khang mchod khang gi zur g.yas g.yon gnyis su khang re re bcas yod 'du khang sbug gi mchod khang re zhing tshad spyi khre 15dang sbug thag spyi khre 13 8go bsgrigs lnga lnga yod pa bcas yin (mchod khang nang dngul las bzhengs pa'i sgrol ma dang gser zangs las grub pa'i rgyal ba (643) byams pa rje tsong kha pa sogs kyi sku brnyan mang po dang tshe smon gling sku phreng rim byon gyi bzhugs khri sku phreng gsum pa blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan dang sku phreng bzhi pa thub bstan mkhas grub gnyis kyi gser gdung bcas yod cing brtsigs ldebs su ldebs bris kyis khengs yod/) 'du khang gi gseng yag mthongs skor la spyi khre 8 3dang ring tshad spyi khre 7 5lon pa'i rab gsal bsgrigs yod pa'i 'du kha