tshes bzhi rnying ma grags pa rgyal mtshan|{rje 'di nyid rab byung lnga pa'i chu sbrul (1293)lor yab dpon rin chen skyabs dang/yum zhang lcam ma'i sras sa sku bltams/sku gzhon nu'i dus su mkhan po tshul dar dang/slob dpon zhang btsun bu hrangs pa las rab tu byung ba'i mtshan grags pa rgyal mtshan du gsol/gnyis mchod pa las chos khrid rnams zhus/bla ma lha khang bas chos sgo phyes/bram brag rin chen las chos skyong rnams gsan/blam ti (649) se ba dar ma rgyal po sogs las bka' brgyud kyi gdams pa'i zhib cha rnams gsan lcags khyi (1310)lor phag gru'i gdan sar phebs nas lo lnga nga gcig bar tshogs pa bskyangs khyad par can gyi slob ma bcu gnyis rin po che dang bla ma mkhar thog pa bla ma sde'i pa rdor 'dzin sangs rgyas rgyal mtshan zhes pa sogs mang du byung dgung lo drug cu re brgyad la phebs pa rab byung drug pa'i lcags byi (1360)lo'i bod zla bcu pa'i tshes gsum la sku gshegs}
