tshogs mchod chen mo|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs lo ltar bod zla gnyis pa'i tshes bco brgyad nyin nas nyin bcu gnyis ring lha ldan 'phrul snang gtsug lag khang du (650) lha sa smon lam chen mo dang 'dra ba'i dge 'dun gyi tshogs 'du ba dang mchod 'bul shin tu rgya chen byed srol yod pa de la tshogs chen mo zhes su grags de ni rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing khyi (1694)lor mkhas pa'i dbang po sne srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos tA la'i blam sku phreng lnga pa'i dgongs rdzogs kyi dus mchod gsar 'dzugs mdzad pa zhig yin 'dug de'ang thog mar zla gnyis pa' tshes nyes gsum gyi dgong ja gral 'dzin nas bzung nyin bdun las med kyang rjes su tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i sku mchod sogs rim snod nyin bcu gnyis chags phyis su bod zla gnyis pa'i tshes bco brgyad nyid gtsug lag khang du dgong cha gral 'dzin gnang ba nas bzung tshogs mchod nyin bcu gnyis ring gdan sa chen po gsum sogs kyi gdan 'dren rangs chig khri yas mas 'du 'dzoms thog gzhung phyogs nas mang ja 'gyed dngul bcas pa'i gtong sgo de min 'byor ldan khag gi thebs sbyar 'phar 'gyed gzhan yang 'bras spungs tshogs chen zhal ngos lha sa'i khrims bdag byed srol sogs lha sa smon lam chen mo dang phal cher mtshungs kyang se 'bras dge 'dun grangs tshad smon lam nang bzhin mang po med la 'byor na khag gi bsnyen bkur zhi ma'ang smon lam las nyung ba yod tshes nyer lnga nyin dgongs rdzogs kyi das mchod dngos gzhir brten dge 'dun tshor 'gyed dngul 'phar ma dang ja thug sogs gzab cing rgyas pa'i bsnyen bkur bya srol yod pa ma zad dad can rnams kyis kyang tshogs mchod ring dang lhag par de nyid phyag mtshon sogs gang les bya srol yod lo ltar tshogs mchod ring gdan sa gsum gyi dge bshes mi grangs brgyad kyis gzhung chen bka' pod lnga'i grwa skor dam bca' 'jog pa dang tshogs mchod ring dam bcas 'jog mkhan gyi dge bshes de rnams la tshogs rams dge bshes zhes zer}
