tshogs gnyis|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung spyi'i bshad srol la/bsod nams kyi tshogs dang ye shes kyi tshogs gnyis la zer zhing/bsod nams kyi tshogs ni sbyin pa gtang ba dang tshul khrims srung ba lta bu dang/ye shes kyi tshogs ni ting nge 'dzin sgom pa dang/stong pa nyid kyi lta ba rtogs pa lta bu ste/de yang zhib tsam zhus na chos gzugs kyi sku gnyis sgrub pa'i thabs su gyur pa'i dge ba dang thabs dang shes rab ci rigs kyis bsdus pa ni tshogs kyi rang bzhin yin no/_/de la dbye na bsod nams kyi (653) tshogs dang ye shes kyi tshogs gnyis so/_/bsod nams kyi tshogs ni mchod sbyin la sogs pa 'bras bu sangs rgyas kyi gzugs sku sgrub byed kyi dkar po dge ba'i las de yin de yang rang rgyud smin par byed pa'i phar phyin drug las sbyin pa tshul khrims bzod pa gsum ni bsod nams kyi tshogs dang sangs rgyas kyi gzugs sku ste sprul pa'i sku dang longs spyod rdzogs pa'i sku gnyis sgrub byed kyi rgyu'o/_/ji skad du dbu ma 'jug par sbyin sogs chos gsum 'di dag phal mo/_/bde bar gshegs pas khyim pa rnams la bsngags/_/bsod nams zhes bya'i tshogs kyang de nyid de/_/sangs rgyas gzugs kyi bdag nyid sku yi rgyu/_/zhes gsungs pa ltar ro/_/ye shes kyi tshogs ni stong nyi byang chub sems kyis rtsis zin pa'i 'bras bu ye shes chos sku thob par byed pa'i zag med dge ba'i tshogs de yin de yang rang rgyud smin par byed pa'i phar phyin drug las bsam gtan dang shes rab gnyis yin ye shes kyi tshogs dang sangs rgyas kyi chos sku ste ye shes chos sku dang ngo bo nyid sku gnyis sgrub byed kyi rgyu'o/_/ji skad du (rin chen phreng ba )las sangs rgyas rnams kyi gzugs kyi p+saku/_/bsod nams tshogs las 'khrungs pa ste/_/chos kyi sku ni mdor bsdus na/_/rgyal po ye shes tshogs las 'khrungs/_/de lta bas na tshogs 'di gnyis sangs rgyas nyid ni thob pa'i rgyu/_/zhes gsungs pa ltar ro/_/phar phyin drug la brtson 'grus ni bsod nams dang ya shes kyi tshogs gnyis ka'i rgyu yin te dbu ma 'jug par )yon tan thams cad brtson 'grus rjes 'gro bzhin/_/bsod nams blo gros tshogs ni gnyis kyi rgyu/_/zhes gsungs rgyu tshogs gnyis bsags pas 'bras pu sku gnyis su grangs nges pa yin tshogs 'di gnyis ma rdzogs na dag pa gnyis ldan gyi sangs rgyas thob pa'i thabs med de bzhin du tshogs gnyis yongs su ma rdzogs par stong pa nyid kyi nor ma nor ba de yang rgyud la skye mi nus te mdo las ji srid tshogs gnyis dam pa de ni ma rdzogs pa/_/de srid stong nyid dam pa de ni rtogs mi byed/_/ces gsungs so/_}
