tshong 'dus mgur mo|{de sngon dus rabs bcu ba'i dkyil du dbus gtsang gi mkhas pa mi bcus mdo smad du phebs nas bla chen dgongs pa rab gsal gyi slob ma grub ye shes rgyal mtshan gyi drung du dge slong gi sdom pa zhus rjes lo shas nas bod du phebs/de'i nang nas la ston rdo rje dbang phyug gi 'khrungs yul gtsang mgur mo rab kha nas yin pas khong gis mched grogs gzhan rnams la khyad rnams gnas skabs bod dbus gtsang du log ma phebs par mdo khams 'dir bzhugs/ngas sngon la dbus gtsang du 'gro ba'i tshong pa dang mnyam du song nas chos dar nus pa 'dug na ngas log ma yong bar dbus gtsang du bsdud kyis/de tsam na khyed rnams yar phebs nas 'thun/gal te dbus gtsang du chos dar bar byed ma nus na nga yang tshong pa dang mnyam por mdo smad du log yod rgyu yin gsungs nas tshong pa dang mnyam du bod la phebs/khong rnams sum 'phrang du slebs tshams tshong pa rnams de gar tshos byas te mdo smad du log rtsis yod skabs lo na gyis khyed rnams 'di nas ma ldog par gtsang la song nas mgur mo rab khar slebs tshe nga'i pha lo nad gtsug na zer ba zhig yod pa de lang dbus na 'dug ces lan skyol zhes mngags te gtsang du btang/tshong pa rnams kyis kyang khong gis gsungs pa ltar byas pas tshong lags po byung/de nas bzung gtsang gi mgul mo rab khar tshong 'dus chags pa'i ming du chos 'dus mgur mo zer/(deng sang bod rang skyong ljongs nya mo rdzong khongs ma rkyang tshus su yod )de sngon bod kyi gser dngul gyi ljid thang shang gzhi yang tshong 'dus ma gor mo'i khrom ri'i rin thang gi tshad gzhir bzung nas chos khrims dang srid gzhung gi khrims yig nang brkus pa 'jal gyi khrims yig skor bshad skabs tshos 'dus mgur mo'i gser dngul dang 'bru rigs kyi rin thang gzhir bzung bar bshad/zhib par snga rabs bod kya mkhas pa tshos mdzad pa'i ('dul ba'i 'grel pa )khag dang/(gtsang pa rgyal po'i khrims yig/) sde srid sangs rgyas rgya tshos mdzad pa'i (khrims yig zhal lce bcu gsum )nang du gsal zhing/gong gsal tshong 'dus mgur mo'i lo rgyus ni (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )len (nya)pa'i shog grangs 5nas 6bar