mtshan nyid med pa'i chos kyi 'khor lo|{chos thams cad rgyu dang rkyen la brten nas 'byung zhing/rang gi mtshan nyid kyis ma grub par ston pa'i chos (yum rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum )lta bu ste/bka' 'gyur gyi nang yum rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum bsdoms pa'i pod nyi shu tham pa yod pa de/yum rgyas pa (sher phyin 'bum pa )(ka)(kha)(ga)(nga)(ca)(cha)(ja)(nya)(ta)(tha)(da)(na)bar pod bcu gnyis la bam po sum brgya/le'u don gnyis/sho lo ka chig 'byung yod/yum 'bring po (sher byin stong phrag nyid shu lnga pa'am )yongs grags su (nyi khri )zhes 'bod pa pod (ka)(kha)(ga)bar pod gsum la bam po brgyad cu/le'u bdun cu don gnyis/sho lo ka nyis khri lnga stong/'bring gi 'bring po (khri brgyad stong pa )pod (ka)(kha)(ga)bar pod gsum la bam po drug cu/le'u brgyad cu rtsa bzhi/'bring gi bsdus pa (khri brgyad stong pa )pod gcig la bam po (658) sum cu rtsa bzhi le'u so gsum sho lo ka brgya pa yum bsdus pa (brgyad stong pa )pod gcig la bam po nyer bzhi le'u so gnyis sho lo ka brgyad stong sher phyin rgyas bsdus sna tshogs phyogs gcig tu bsdus pa shes phyin sna tshugs pod gcig bcas gong gsal rnams mang che ba rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus lo tsA ba zhang ye shes sde dang dzI na mi tra sogs kyis bsgyur ba yin}
