mtsho sna ba shes rab bzang po|{rab byung lnga pa'i lcags khyi (1310)lo'i yas mas su lho kha mtsho sna khul du khyim thab dbul po zhig nang sku bltams/chung dus snar thar grong lding dpon gyi sar ba rdzir bzhugs/thugs rgyud bzang zhing blo rig bkra ba/rdo dkar gong 'dab ma ltar brdzis nas sgam chung dang rlung thab kyi dbyibs lta bur bcos pa sogs thun mong ma yin pa'i mdzad pa sna tshogs spel/skabs de'i mtshams lding dpon gyis chos rgyags 'bul rgyu'i zhal bzhes te rje nyid gnya' bral go dgon par cho la zhugs par phebs/bzang chen pas dbu skra gtsug phud bzhes te mtshan shes rab bzang por gsol/de nas ye shes 'bri klog la sbyangs/lo shas mtshams gzhung chen la thugs sbyong mdzad pas mkhas par gyur/dgung lo nyir gcig nas dbu brtsams te 'dul ba mdo rtsa ba'i 'grel pa legs bshad nyi ma'i 'od zer pod che ba stod smad gnyis dang/mdo rtsa ba'i mchan 'grel pod gcig brtsams/brag gor 'du khang ka ba brgyad tsam gyi rten dang brten pa bcas dang dge 'dun gyi da dgon gsar 'dzugs gnang/mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsungs pas bshad sgrub kyi bstan pa nyi ma lta lar gsal bar mdzad/phyis rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pa chen pos rje shes rab bzang po'i 'dul ba mtsho TIka dang/mdo rtsa mchan 'grel shing par la brkos gnang mdzad pa dang/gnas sa ser 'bras dga' gsum gyi zhung chen pod lngar slob gter byed mkhan tshor 'grel pa 'di nyid rtsa 'dzin dgas pa'i bka' bzhin nyams len rgyun 'jags su byung/'dul ba mtsho TIka der sa dge rnying gsum sangs rgyas chos pa yongs rdzogs kyis cha 'jog tshad 'dzin gnang ba dang/rje 'di nyid dgung lob zhi bcu'i nang sku gshegs (670) nang rje tsong kha pa chen po kun mkhyen 'di nyid kyi yang srid du byon pa brag gor mkhan chen chos skyabs bzang pos mdzad pa'i mtsho sna ba chen po'i gsol 'debs las lam tsam gsal}
mtsho smad dgon|{stod lung bde chen rdzong khongs mtsho smad dgon pa ni spyi li dus rabs bdun pa'i nang btsan po srong btsan sgam pos lha sa'i jo bo rnam gnyis bzhugs yul gtsug lag khang gnyis bzhengs par mdzad rjes mtsho smad du rnamap+s+n+yang gtsor gyur gyi rigs lnga'i lha khang zhig zhal shar du gzigs nas gsar bzhengs mdzad/bstan pa dar gyi 'gor dbus gtsang mkhas pa mi bcu'i ya gyal klu mes tshul khrims shes rab kyis der dge 'dun gyi sder gsar 'dzugs gnang/'du khang nas du sku rgyu'i las las grub pa'i jo bo thog tshad tsam byin can sogs yod la gso rig mkhas dbang shAkya dbang phyug gis mkhan po mdzad skabs dar rgyas che zhing tsho smad mkhan chen zhes mtshan snyan che ba byung/rig gnas gsar brje'i skabs nyams chag che tsam byung yang deng skabs dgon par nyams gsol dang 'brel chos kyi byed sgo rnams kyang skyar gso byung 'dug }
mtsho smad du yod pa'i sde srid 'khrungs khang|{stod lung bde chen rdzong dmar shar mtsho smad grong tsho'i byang ngos su khang pa nyis thog cig dang/sbyar sdong chen po mang po yod pa'i gling kha zhig yod pa der de ga'i mang tshogs chosap+sadep+sarid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i 'khrungs yin tshul brjod kyang/tshad ldan yig cha tshang mar sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i 'khrungs yul lha sa'i byang phyogs nyang bran grong smad du yin tshul gsal ba dang/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i sku dus su sde srid lnga byung nas sde srid bsod nams chos 'phel ne stong lung rgya le nas yin pa dang/sde srid 'phrin las rgya mtsho dang sangs rgyas rgya mtsho gnyis nyan bran grong smad nas yin pa yig char gsal zhing sdesrid gsum pa blo bzang mthu stobs dang blo bzang sbyin pa gnyis kyi 'khrungs yul gang yin yig cha ma mthong bas shod tshod ma thig kyang mtsho smad du yod pa'i shod rgyud te blo bzang mthu stobs dang blo bzang sbyin pa su rung zhig min na snyam pa dpyad dgos}
