dza lan+d+ha ra|{(dza lan d+ha ra )chu bo gang+gA mtsho ma pham nas mnga' ris kyi yul brgyud de nyid 'ga' zhig lho nub phyogs su kha gtad nas 'bab cing/Ti li'am rdi li'i byang phyogs ha ri dA wa nas shar phyogs su 'khyogs nas 'bab pa'i byang ngos rgya gar dang kha che'i bar gyi gnas dza la mug gam dza la mu khe ste/deng sang kang ra zhes 'bod pa'i gnas de yin cing/mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis ni de ni gnas chen nyer bzhi'i nang gi nub phyogs dza lan d+ha ra bya ba'i grags chen de yin zhing/rje rgod tsam pa mgon po rdo rje dang/de'i p+sal bo ma yo rgyan pa dang/stag tshang ras pa/rang rig ras pa sogs sngar phyogs 'dir byon pa so so'i rnam thar du gsal/lhag par rgod tshang pa de 'dir lo byed tsam bzhugs shing gnas bshad zhib tu gsungs pas the tshom thams cad chod pa yod/mjal sa gtso bo kAng ra man dir nang du mgo lta bu'i ling+ga de yin/kAng rar ma slebs gong du dzA la mu khi bya bar slebs/der sa la me 'bar mjal rgyu yod cing/de yang rgod tshang rnam thar du gsal zhes gsungs la/dza lan d+ha ra zhes pa bod skad du bsgyur na 'bar ba 'dzin dang dra ba 'dzin zhes pa'i don yin pas skad gnyis shan sbyar gyi zhung 'ga' zhig las gsal}
