dzA ya blo bzang 'phrin las|{sog po jing ge'i rgyud yab sa mthar ming ca dang yum au khi ta gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu rta (1642)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi'i thog 'dul 'dzin blo gros rgya mtsho'i drung nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung grangs lnga nas bcu yi bar slob dpon shes rab rin chen gyi drung nas 'jigs byed dang/gdugs dkar/gsang 'dus sogs thugs 'dzin mdzad/dgung lo nyer gcig la dbus phyogs su phebs nas gtsang du byon/paN chen blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan dang mjal te chos 'brel ljags lung gsan/de nas rgyal dbang lnga pa chen po thog mar mjal zhing dga' bdes tshim/rgyal dbang chen po'i drung nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa zhus/gling stod zhabs drung blo bzang rgya mtsho'i drung nas spyod 'jug dang/gso rig rtsa rgyud kyi lung zhus/bkra shis lhun por gsar zhugs kyis rnam 'grel yongs rdzogs thugs lab zung nas rtsod pa sogs brtson 'grus mdzad/dgung lo nyer gsum thog po ta lar rgyal dbang mchog gi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs/mtshan blo bzang 'phrin las zhes bstsal/dgung lo so gsum la rgyal ba'i drung du sdom rgyun gsar pa bskyar sgrub mdzad/bkras lhun du snga rjes sug zhung chen po lnga la gsan bsam rgya cher mdzad rjes dgung lo so brgyad la sog yul du phyir log phebs nas gdul bya rnams smin par mdzad/rje 'dis rgyal dbang lnga pa chen po dang/paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan/khyab bdag dge 'dun don grub/slob dpon 'jam dbyangs grags pa/dga' ldan khri pa blo bzang don yod sogs dge ba'i bshes gnyen du ma bsten nas gsan bsam dpyid phyin gnang/rje nyid sog yig la mkhas par gyur pas chos bka' mang po sog yig tu phab bsgyur mdzad/ljags rtsom la mtshon na (sher phyin dngos brgyad don bdun cu'i rnam bshad legs bshad sgron me/) (skye ba snga 'i brtag pa bstan bcos dngul dkar me long/) (rang gis 'khor bar spyod tshul shin tu gsal ba'i sgron me/) (bcom ldan 'phags ma gdugs dkar gyi mngon dkyil dngos grub gter mdzod )sogs bstan bcos pod lnga tsam mdzad/dgung lo re bdun la phebs pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa byi (1708)lor sku gshegs}
