rdza dpal sprul 'jigs med chos kyi dbang po|{yongs grags su rdza dpal sprul rin po che zhu ba mchog ni rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa 'brug (1808)lor khams byang 'brog dge rtse rdza chu kha'i sder gtogs rgyal thog ces pa'i gdung las sku 'khrungs/rdo grub chen 'jigs med 'phrin las 'od zer gyis dpal dge bsam gtan phun tshogs kyi sprul skur ngos bzung/o rgyan 'jigs med chos kyi dbang po zhes mtshan gsol/sku na chung ngu'i dus nas yi ge 'bri klog rnams tshegs med du mkhyen/mkhan chen shes rab bzang po las rab tu byung/rdo bla 'jigs med skal bzang dang/rgyal sras gzhan phan mtha' yas sogs kyi drung nas ngal gso skor gsum dang/spyod 'jug rtsa rgyun gnang ba snying po sogs mdo sngags kyi gzhung mang po dang/rig gnas bcas gsan/zhe chen dbon sprul mthu stobs rnam rgyal dang 'jigs med rgyal ba'i myu ngu sogs mkhas mchog du ma las bka' bstan 'gyur ro cog dang/rnying ma'i kun mkhyen yab sras/sa paN/rje tsong kha pa sogs gsar rnying skyes chen rnams kyi legs bshad mtha' dag /klong chen snying thig gi sngon 'gro'i lam khrid/rtsa rlung dang rdzogs chen gyi khrid sog mtha' yas pa gsan zhing sgom sgrub la gzhol bas rtog pa tshad med pa 'khrungs/mkhas pa'i pha rol du son/dgung lo sum cu'i nang slob ma'i tshogs la rgyud gnang ba snying po'i ljags khrid rgyas par gnang/gser thar dang rdo stod smad kyi 'dus sde yongs la (spyod 'jug )dang/ma Ni bka' 'bum/) (bde smon )sogs kyi chos sbyin grangs med bstsal/rkun jag gi rgyun bcad/dmar ston gyi srol bsnubs/rdza rgyal dgon gyi nye skor du chos 'khor gyi gdan sa mdzad/rdo 'bum chen mor kha gso'i (678) tshul du sngon gyi rdo 'bum las kyang rgya che zhing dpangs mtho ba 'byon sgron shing spus legs pa zhig bzhengs te dpal sprul rdo 'bum zhes su grags rje 'di nyid sku tshe hril por gnas nges med du phebs shing kun spangs bya btang gi mdzad pa spel thog thos bsam sgom gsum dang 'chad rtsod rtsam gsum gyi rnam thar bskyangs te khams stod smad bar gsum du (spyod 'jug )dang (byams chos/) (sdom gsum/) (yon tan mdzod )sogs kyi 'chad nyan sa dar rdo dar du gyur pa dang lhag par du (rgyud gsar ba snying po'i bshad rgyun )dang (klong chen snying thig gi rtsa rlung dang khrid )sogs kyi chos rgyun rje 'di nyid kyis nyams pa sor chud kyis ches cher dar bar mdzad rje nyid snga 'gyur gsar sngags rnying ma'i bka' gter gyi chos sgo spyi dang yang sgos rdzogs pa chen po klong chen snying thig gi zab las gdams pa'i bla brgyud du gyur pa ma zad sa dge bka' gsum grub mtha' ris med gzhung lugs la gnas bsam mthar phyin mkhas pa'i rtse mo son te rdza dpal sprul rin po che zhes snyan pa'i grags pa kha ba'i ljongs phyogs kun tu khyab rgyal sras zhi ba lha'i (spyod 'jug chen mos )gtsos pa'i gzhung chen ljags khrid gnang bas spyod 'jug bla ma zhes pa'i mtshan snyan yang thogs dam pa 'di nyid kyis kaHthog si tu mchog sprul chos kyi blo gros dang rdzogs chen sku phreng lnga pa thub bstan chos rdor rgyal rong nam sprul sku bzang theg mchog rdo rje 'ju mi pham rnam rgyal a lags mdo sngags rgya mtsho sogs rnying ma'i mkhas grub kyi skyes bu du ma dang ser shul lha rams pa thub bstan dpal spungs bla ma bkra shis 'od zer sogs sa dge bka' brgyud kyi bla ma de dag gis gtsos pa'i slob ma mang du bskyangs slob ma sogs rang rang gi blo dang 'tsham pa'i ljags rtsom mtha' yas pa gnang yod 'od kyang slob mo sos de dag gtsigs chen byas te nyar tshags byas pas mang che ba par du 'khod ma thub sngon mar par du 'khod cing deng mjal rgyu yod pa ni glegs bam phyin drug gi grangs kyis brgyan pa rnams so/_/gsum rtsom de dag nang (byams chos )dang (spyod 'jug yon tan mdzod )sogs kyi gzhung 'grel sa bcad dang (gtam pad ma'i tshal gyi zlos gar )sogs gtam tshogs dang gzhal gdams bstod tshogs sogs pod bdun tsam mchis so/_/rab byung bco lnga pa'i me phag (1887)lo'i sa ga zla ba'i tshes bco brgyad nyin sku gshegs}
rdza bzo dbu chen dkon mchog shes rab|{rdza bzo dbu chen dkon mchog shes rab ni dus rabs nyi shu pa'i lo rabs sum cu pa'i yas mas su grags che ba zhig yin/khong rdza chas kyi rigs bzo bar shin tu mkhas pa ma zad/lhag par g.yu rtsi sngon ljang ser smug gtong ba'i lag rtsal ha cang mkhas par brten tA la'i bla ma'i sku phreng bcu gsum pas nor bu gling khar g.yu rtsi'i rgya phibs bzo bar yong dgos pa'i bka' ltar nor bu gling ga'i rgyal sgo sogs kyi steng g.yu rtsi'i rgya phibs bzo rgyu'i lag rtsal gzengs su thon pa byung stabs dbu chen gyi go ming gnang bas rjes su rdza bzo che mo zhes ming grags/khong gi skye yul ni da lta'i 'phan po lcang ra shang khongs skyid lung grong tsho nas yin}
rdza bzo dbu chen bsod nams|{stag phu grong tshor rdza bzo'i lag rgyun dar rgyas che tsam yod par brten tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pas nor bu gling ga'i kho brang khag gcig dang/gzhung sgo'i steng rtsi ser po btang ba'i rdza kho'i rgya phibs gsar bzo'i lag rtsal pa stag phu sogs nas bskong 'gugs gnang ba'i nang stag phu'i rdza mkhan bsod nams kyis lag rtsal gzengs su thon pa bton pa'i byas rjes su dbu chen gyi go ming thob stabs stag phu'i rdza bzo che mo zhes grags/rgyun gtan gyi rdza kho'i snod chas tsam ma yin par rdza khos mdzes chas sna tshogs sogs (679) bzos shing khong gis bzos pa'i rgya phibs dang bya ri dwags kyi gzugs brnyan sogs 'ga' zhig da lta'ang nor bu gling gar mthong rgyu yod}
