rdzu 'phrul gyi rkang pa bzhi|{rdzu 'phrul gyi cho 'phrul rnam pa mi 'dra bar ston byed kyi nus mthu'am rgyu med du mi rung ba zhig yin cing/de la goms 'dris mthar phyin pa ni rdzu 'phrul la dbang thob pa dang/tshe ring du gnas pa la rang dbang thob pa sogs kyi khyad chos yod par bshad cing/rdzu 'phrul gyi rkang pa bzhi ni/1 'dun pa'i ting nge 'dzin spong ba'i 'du byed dang ldan pa'i rdzu 'phrul gyi rkang pa/2 sems kyi ting nge 'dzin spong ba'i 'du byes ldan dang pa'i rdza 'phrul gyi rkang pa/3 brtson 'grub kyi ting nge 'dzin spong ba'i 'du byed dang ldan pa'i rdzu 'phrul gyi rkang pa/4 dpyod pa'i ting nge 'dzin spong ba'i 'du byed dang ldan pa'i rdzu 'phrul gyi rkang pa bcas bzhi ste/rgyas par (mngon pa mdzod )gnas drug pa dang (phar phyin )skabs bzhi par gsal}
