rdzogs rim gyi brtan pa thob pa'i spyod pa'i dam tshig bcu|{zas thams cad nang gi sbyin sreg dang/rtag tu ting nge 'dzin gyi dkyil 'khor bzhengs pa/gang ci mthong ba thams cad rdo rje gsum du shes pas rab gnas byed pa/ngag sngags su shes pas bzlas pa rgyud mi 'chad pa/rtag tu ye shes mi 'bral ba/mi dang mi ma yin pa'i slob ma rnams la gdams ngag ston pa/tshar gcod rjes 'dzin gyis sems can gyi don byed pa/bdag nyid mchod pas sangs rgyas thams cad mnyes par byed pa/'od gsal gyi gnyid nang yang mi spong ba/grong ba'i chos mi spong ba/dbang po rnams 'dod yon la mi dgag pa rnams so/_}
rdzogs rim gyi dpyad pa'i gnas bcu gcig|{rdzogs rim de dag gi ngo bo gang yin pa/rten gang la gnad du bsnun pa/tshul ji ltar gnad du bsnun pa/de'i nyams rtags gang 'byung ba/de las yon tan ci zhig bskyed pa/de'i rgyu mtshan gang yin pa/dngos rgyud nas spang bya ci tsam spong ba/mthar phyin pa'i tshad gang yin pa/sa dang lam gyi mtshams gang yin pa/gegs sel dang bogs 'don ji lta bu bya ba/gtso 'khor gyi khyad par gang yin pa'o/_}
