rdzong rgyab klu khang|{pho brang po ta la'i rgyab tu rdzong rgyab klu khang zhes ljon shin du mas khengs pa'i skyed tshul nang chu rdzing gi dbus su thog brtsegs gsum ldan gyi pho brang yang steng du rgya phibs zur drug tog can gyis brgyan pa zhig yod pa de ni tA la'i blam sku phreng lnga pa'i sku dus su rtse pho brang dkar po bzhengs skabs dang/de rjes sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos pho brang dmar po bzhengs pa sogs kyi skabs su 'dzugs skrun la mkho ba'i sa rnams de nas blangs stabs der gzhi rgya che tsam gyi sa dong zhig chags/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng drug pa tshang dbyangs rgya mtshos de gar chu bskyil ba'i dbus su pho brang de bzhengs shing/mtshe'u dang pho brang gi dbyibs rnams klu'i dkyil 'khor la dpe blangs nas bzhengs/thog tshad so so'i gyang ngos su ldebs bris la slob dpon pad+ma 'byung gnas kyi rnam thar dang/pad+ma 'od 'bar gyi gtam rgyud sogs ri mo mang po yod pa klu mal gro gzi can la klu chen brgyad kyis bskor ba'i 'jim brnyan sogs yod/chu dkyil pho brang de'i lho nub ngos su tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa'i skabs su bskrun pa'i glang khang phun tshogs ra ba zhes glang po che 'jug sa dang/de'i nub ngos su tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu pa'i skabs bzhengs pa'i byang chub mchod rten zhig kyang yod/klu khang gi dkon gnyer ni rtse rnam rgyal grwa tshang nas 'dzugs srol yod}
rdzong rgyab zhar 'phen|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs bod zla dang po'i tshes nyer drug nyin lha klu skor du yod pa'i rdzong rgyab spro khang gi nub ngos thang ster du gur phug thog rdzong rgyab zhar 'phen zhes rta dmag rnams kyi drag rtsal mda' me bcas rgyugs bzhes mtshon byed zhig yin 'dug /de nyin bka' shag gus par rta rgyugs sa'i sa gnas lha klu'i mdun ngos su bka' shag gi dbu g.yab dang/de'i nye 'gram du las dkyus khag /de'i gsham bla phyag bzhugs yul byang blta/kha nub blta phyi rgyal sku mgron gyi bzhugs gur/gdan gnyer nas bzhugs gdan khag brgyab/zhol gnyer nas gro phye chang phud dang/mda' ma'i 'ben bcas gra sgrig /bka' blon dang dza tha'i na bza' hor gos mtshon khra ser po dang/rim bzhi rnams rgyan gzhi ser po/sras rnam pa dang/las tshan che khag /mgron drung bka' shag shod pa bcas kyis tog zhwa dang rgyan gzhi sngon po/rtsis pa dang/rtswa rtsam/dmag drung bcas tshos man rgya smug /drung dkyus rnams rgyun chas kha gsar bcas bzhengs nas mdzad gzigs la phebs pa dang/ya sor ngo las rnams phyag 'bul du bcar/rang rang gdan thog rgal la 'khod pa dang/gsol ja bzhes 'bras/gro phye phud gtor zhus rdzes ya sor rkan pa yar bzhengs nas g.yas ru'i ru gzhung bka' blon rnam pa'i gsol lcog thog kha phye gnang mdzad pa dang/bka' blo khri pas rta pa'i ming smos gnang ba zhol ma nang gzan gcig gis gzigs lam la zhwa phun pus btsugs kyis nyan rjes rta skad rgyag stangs gra bzhi rtsis bsher skabs ltar yin/g.yas ru dang po dga' bzhi pa'i lta snang 'khrid mi gsol gos mda' shar rgyugs dgos pa dang/de byings rta pa rnams kyis me mda' dang/mda' rgyag dgos/dmag rung gnyis nas tsha tho bkod de rta pa rnams gral bsgrigs te yong/dbus mdas tsha tho klog gnang mdzad/bla phyag gis tsha dar g.yog /me tsha dang/mda' tshar tshad dar thems gnyis re/rta pa rnams kyis mdun phyogs su gom pa gsum spos te pus mo ya gcig btsugs tsam byas te dzo yol zhus/phyir bgrod gsum thog phyir log /rta bzhon nas ki so'o bsgrags/rang gi sgar sar log /de bzhin 'khri khungs kyi rta pa rnams re re bzhin rgyugs stangs gong ltar yin/g.yas ru mjug (684) 'gril ba dang ya sor rgan pas ru gzhung phyir zhu gnang ste mdzad sgo grol bka' shag dbu gur du phebs gsol ja bzhes 'bras dang bla phyag nas bka' blon rnam par gsol tshigs sgrog rtse (rgya lugs kyi gsol tshigs gtong stangs )dang mgron drung dang dza tha'i drung dkyus yan la rgya khog zhal tog shing 'bras bcas sgrig dgos dgong dro g.yon ru rgyugs skabs ya sor gzhon pas ru gzhung 'bul rgyus mtshon byed stangs gong ltar gyis rta pa rnams mjug 'gril ba dang ya sor byings bcus mda' shar re rgyugs srol dgong dro ya sor ngo las dang sog po ya sor bcas gsol tshigs grub pa dang gzim shag so sor phyir phebs de nyid yid dbang 'phrog pa'i rta rtsal 'gran bsdur gyi ltad mor mi dmangs ji snyed kyang rang gi 'khos bab la gzhigs pa'i bza' bca' sogs 'khyer de ltad mo dang sbrags bag yang gang skyid kyi tshul du bskyod srol yod 'dug}
