wa gling hud rigs phyag khang|{lha sa'i wa gling hud rigs phyag khang ni ming rgyal rabs kyi dus mjug nas ching rgyal rabs kyi (1628nas 1662) lo bar la btsugs/da yod phyag khang gi rgya khyon p+s+yi khre grub zhi pa 2600tsam yod/phyag khang de ni de snga rgya nag nas hud rigs khag gcig sa tshong la yong nas rim bzhin gzhis chags par brten sa'i rags rgyab rgyud la khyim gzhis btsugs nas sa cha der rgya skad la wa pa gling {(WP:1,194)}zer/de'i skabs hud rigs rnams phyag 'tshal ba dang nang mi 'das grongs kyi dur 'jug sogs byed sgo spel sa'i phyag med par lha sa'i ka shi rmir phyag khang la 'gro ba dang/de rjes mi grangs rim bzhin 'phel bar brten wa gling sa gnas rang du phyag khang chung chung zhig btsugs/ching rgyal rabs kyi gong ma chad lung skabs rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing stag (1794)lor gor dmag bod nas mthar skrod btang nas rgya'i dpon dmag phyir log skabs lha sa'i bong ba ri'i kon tis lha khang sogs gsar rgyag byas pa dang chabs cig gra bzhir hud rigs kyi phyag khang zhig kyang gsar du brgyab/de rjes gong ma ci ching skabs (1997nas 1821)lo bar gra bzhir sdod pa'i rgya rigs dpon dmag rnams lha sa'i wa gling phyag khang khongs su sprad/de rjes wa gling rgyud du yod pa'i bod rigs kyi sdod khang dang grwa bzhir yod pa'i phyag khang gi sa cha phan tshul brjes nas phyag khang de rgya skyed dang nyams gso rim par byas/rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag (1959)lor zing 'khrugs skabs phyag khang mer bsregs thebs kyang zing 'khrug rjes srid gzhung nas rogs ram gyis phyag khang dang nang gi sgrog dngos cha tshang gsar bzo byas/rig gnas gsar brje'i rjes lha khang la nyams gso dang thor gyar song bi phyag khang nang gi sgrig dngos gsar bzo byas te da cha hud rigs tshos phyag 'tshal sogs rgyun gtan chos kyi byed sgo spel gyi yod pa dang/da dung lha sar yul skor spro 'cham sogs la yong mkhan dbyi si lan gyi chos la dad pa byed mkhan phyi rgyal pa yang der phyag 'tshal sogs chos kyi byed sgo spel bar yong gi yod}
