wun khren kong jo|{{(WP:1,194)}bod kyi lo rgyus thog shod srol la/rgya bza' wun khren kong jo ni gong ma'i sras mo yin pa dang/rig gnas dang/skar rtsis/sa dpyad bcas la mkhas pa zhig yin stabs rgyal nang dang rgyal phyir snyan grags ldan pa zhig yin pas tshang mas khong slong bar yong zhing/bod kyi rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos kyang rgya bzang kong jo btsun mor gdan drangs na rgya mi rigs kyi rig gnas dang/lag rtsal/chos lugs sogs bod sa gnas su dar spel byung nas/bod mi rigs rang nyid kyi rig gzhung dang/chab srid/dpal 'byor bcas sngar las rtag par gong 'phel yong rgyur skul 'ded gtong thub bsams nas kren kon {(WP:1,194)}khri lo bcu pa me sprel (636)lor blon po mgar ba stong btsan dang/thon mi sam b+ho Ta/'bri se ru gung p+saton sogs kyi mdun gser dngul sogs dngos po mang po'i rten dang bcas bskur nas gong ma thang tha'i tsung gi sar mngags te/rgya bza' kong jo bun mor slong bar btang yang thog mar khas ma blangs stabs srong btsan sgom pos dmag btang nas lo shas ring dmag 'khrug byas mthar slar yang blon po mgar ba stong btsan mdun gser srang lnga stong dang/rin po che'i rgyan dang/khrab sogs bskur nas bzod gsol byas thog /rgya bza' kong jo btsun mor slong bas ster bar khas blangs te/kren kon khri lo bco lnga pa lcags glang (641)lor rgya bza' wun khren kong jo rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i btsun mor gnang/kong jo bod du skyel bar gong ma rang gi sku mched rgyal rgyud cang hra wang li ta'o tsung {(WP:1,194)}mngags/jo bo shAkya mu ni'i sku brnyan dang/lo rgyus/rtsis rig /sman gzhung/deb bzhi {(WP:1,194)}gzhung lnga {(WP:1,194)}sogs dpe deb mang po/dar gos khri phrag mang po/bzo rigs kyi lag rtsal mi sna/rol mo ba sogs mang po rgya bza'i rdzongs su bskur/rgya bza' bsu bar srong btsan sgom po rang nyid mtsho sngon gyi po he'i zer ba'i sa cha bar du phebs/lha sar 'byor pa'i nyin mo rgyal blon 'bangs ngad bcas pas dga' bsu'i rten 'brel rgya chen po zhus/de nas bal bza' khri btsun gyis lha sa'i gtsug lag khang bzhengs skabs rgya bzas sa dpyad lta ba dang/bzo pa lag rtsal mkhas pa khag gcig rogs ram la btang nas rgya bal gyi btsun mog nyis phan tshun rogs ram gyi mig dpe bzang po gtod/rgya bzang rang nyid kyis lha sa'i byang phyogs su ra mo che'i gtsug lag khang sgo rgya nag tu bstan nas bzhengs/der brten lo rgyus kyi don dngos dang mthun mi mthun gang ltar yang bod kyi dmangs khrod du gtong rgyun yod pa'i gzhas tshig gi nang g+r+ya bzang kong jo la bstod bsngags byed pa'i nang don mang po yod pa dang/bod kyi lo rgyus yig cha'i nang/gnam la nyi zla zung gcig dang/sa la btsan po dbon zhang zhes rgya mi rigs la zhang po dang/bod kyi rgyal po'i gdung rgyud la dbon zhes pa'i tha snyad de nas byung zhing rgya bod kyi sa mtshams su dmag 'khrug thems mang po byung myong yang/rtsa ba'i mthu sgril la gnod skyong gang yang ma byung ba'i lo rgyus gzi brjid ldan pa'i shog lha gsar pa zhig kha phye ba yin/bod kyi lo rgyus mang po zhig gi nang/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po dang/rgya bza' dang bal bzang bcas gsum po dus gcig tu gshegs par bshad kyang/thang rgyal rabs kyi deb ther bod kyi skor bshad pa'i gsar rnying (687) gnyis ka'i nang gong ma thang ka'o tsung gi yun lung {(WP:1,194)}khri lo dang por wun khren kong jo gshegs nas pho nya ba mngags te gtam zhus pa dang gong mas kyang 'das mchod gtong ba'i pho ta mngags par bshad pa ltar na thang ka'o tsung gi yun ho'i khri lo dang po lcags khyi (650)lor rgyal po srong btsan sgam po sku gshegs pa nas rgya bza' wen khren kong jo gshegs pa'i bar lo ngo sum cu so gcig tsam song bar snang la tun hon nas thon pa'i bod kyi lo rgyus shog dril nang btsan po khri 'dus srong gis srid dbang bzung nas lo snga song ba'i lug gi lo (683)la btsan mo mun chang kong jo'i mdang btang zhes gsang ba dang bsdur na gong gi bshad tshul de dang 'di'i bar la lo gsum bar khyad yod pas rgya bza' kong jo gshegs rjes gong ma'i sar 'phral du pho nya mngags nas gnas tshul zhus kyang bod sa gnas rang du lo gsum ring gsang ba byas rjes gzhi nas dngos su 'das mchod btang ba 'dra}

