zha lu dgon pa|{bod ljongs gzhi rtse sa khul gzhis rtsi rdzong khongs su gnas shing/bstan pa phyi dar gyi dus 'gor btab pa'i grags can gyi dgon gnas rnying khungs shig yin te/rab byung gong gi chu yos (1003)lor sku zhang grags pa rgyal mtshan gyis sbyin bdag mdzad nas lo ston rdo rje dbang phyag gi slob ma lce btsun shes rab 'byung gnas kyis zha lu gser khang rten dang brten par bcas par bzhengs/mkhan rabs gsum pa rtse g.yu thog sgra gser bzang gi thob rgyal bye ma g.yu zur nas rang byon thugs rje chen po gtsang 'gram bye ma'i lha khang du bzhugs pa zha lus spyan drangs/gnas der lcags ri btab pa dang chos sde'i nang du khron pa brkos/bod rab byung lnga pa'i shing stag (1314)lor bu stong rin chen grub kyis zha lu ri phug bde chen chos kyi pho brang gi gtsug lag khang chen po dge 'dun gyi sde dang bcas pa gsar bskrun mdzad nas rten gtso dpal dus kyi 'khor lo dang/thub dbang byams pa sogs rin po che las grub pa du ma dang/gsum rten du bka' bstan 'gyur/thugs rten du bu ston chen grub kyis dgung grangs drug cu re gsum pa chu 'brug (1352)lor bzhengs pa'i sku 'bum byams pa mthong grol mar grags pa sogs du ma bzhengs shing/bshad grwa btsugs/bu ston gyi dngos slob sngags 'chang g.yu ston rdo rje dpal gyis zha lur ma he mchod pa'i 'cham gyi srol rgyun btsugs/zhal lur gna' bo'i rig dngos mi nyung ba zhig yod pa'i nang chos rgyal 'phags pa'i bka' shog khag brgyad nyar tshags byas yod/zha lus dgon ni da cha bod rang skyong ljongs kyi rtsa che'i rig dngos srong skyob sde tshan gyi gras yin}
zha lu lo chen chos skyong bzang po|{lo chen 'di nyid gtsang zha lu gser khang gi khang gsar gong ma zhes bya bar 'gos lo tsA ba snga rjes sogs grags can gyi dpon rigs kyang mang du byung ba'i rus rgyud las yab bsam grub dpal bzang dang/yum rin chen chos 'dzoms gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bdun pa'i lcags bya (1441)lor sku bltams/mtshan chos skyong 'bum zhes gsol/sku chung dus su sngon gyi bag chags kyi dbang gis dad brtson shes rab snying rje la sogs pa phun sumo gas shing sku rtsed kyi tshe yang chos 'chad pa dang/sgra bsgyur ba/yi ge 'bri ba la sogs pas dus 'da' bar mdzad/de nas dge ba'i bshes gnyen bkra shis dpal ldan drung nas bod yig 'bri klog gsan sbyong mdzad/dgungo brgyad la phebs skabs rgyal rtse sed pa dang rin spungs pa gnyis dmag 'khrug byung ste yab kyang rgyal rtse'i dmag gi 'go byed du phebs nas mdag thog tu 'das/de nas rgyal rtse chos rgyal bkra shis 'phags pa'i zhabs 'bring du mngags/de'i ring rig gnas dag la thos pa (688) rgya cher mdzad dgung lo bco brgyad bzhes pa'i tshe chos rgyal bkra shis 'phags pas gnang ba thob pa ltar rgyal rtse dpal 'khor chos sder man chen dkon mchog bzang po'i drung du rab tu byung mtshan rin chen chos skyong bzang po zhes gsol dgung lo nyer drug par rje don grub grags pas mkhan po dang dka' bcu pa bsod nams grags pas las slob mkhar grags pa bsod nams blo gros kyis gnang ston gnang ste dpal 'khor chos sder bsnyen par rdzogs de nas sku zhang mkhan chen chos grub pa dang brag dmar rab 'byams pa bla don rin pa sogs yongs 'dzin bcu phrag lnga tsam ton nas bod du 'gyur ba'i bka' dang bstan bcos phal mo che dang mdo phyogs kyi bshad tshul mtha' yas pa sngags phyogs dbang byin rlabs rjes gnang rgyud bshad snying po phyung ba'i don khrid la sogs pa mtha' dag slob gnyer gyis bsam pa'i sgro 'dogs rgya cher bcad pa yin la lhag par rig gnas kyi bshad rgyun nyams pa gso phyir sgra rig pa chen po gnas brtan legs pa rgyal po dang dpal sdings sgra pa lo chen grags pa rgya mtsho rgya ston lcags ri ba thar pa bzang po stag tshang lo tsA b