hegs pa thams cad la bstod pa/) (bcom ldan 'das shAkya thub pa'i bstod pa )slob dpon dkon mchog 'bangs kyis mdzad pa (bla ma dam pa la bstod pa )shi ri puny+dza'i dge slong chos kyi nyi mas bkod pa saMskri ta la bod skad kyi mchan bu (dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i sgrub thabs (689) rnal 'byor rab gsal )zhes bya ba dbu ma chen po'i paN+Di ta mai tri pa'i zhal snga nas mdzad pa (sher phyin bdun brgya pa/) (sher snying/) (rdo rje gcod pa'i 'grel pa/) (mngon rtogs rgyan )'grel chung dang bcas pa (byams chos phyi ma bzhi/) (rgyud zla 'grel chen/) (dkon brtsegs/) (byang chub sems dpa'i sde snod/) ('dul ba mdo rtsa/) (so thar mdo/) (sum brgya pa/) (me tog phreng rgyud/) las phyogs )sogs kyi bstan bcos phon chen dang (tshad ma rnam nges/) (rnam 'grel/) (gtan tshigs thigs pa/) (rgyud gzhal grub pa/) ('brel ba brtag pa/) (tshad ma rnam nges/) (rnam 'grel/) gtan tshigs thigs pa/) (rgyud gzhan grub pa/) ('brel ba brtag pa/) (bstod pa bzhi/) (bshes spring/) (slob springs/) (spyod 'jug/) (mngon brjod 'chi med mdzod/) (mngon brjod kyi bstan bcos sna tshogs gsal ba )zhes pa (sgra gcig don mang nor bu'i phreng ba/) (rgyud sde las mtshan brjod 'grel pa phan yon dang bcas pa/) (bsdus rgyud rtsa 'grel/) (don dam snye ma/) (rta 'dod mdor bstan/) (brtan gnyis/) (sam+bu TI/) (gsang 'dus rtsa rgyud/) ('grel pa sgron gsal/) (rdo rje snying 'grel/) (tsan+d+ra pa sogs gzhi bsgyur dang bsgyur bcas gnang ba pod bcu phrag mang po zin gsum rtsom yang ka tsan gyi spyi don dang 'grel pa rnam pa gnyis byings mdo'i bsdus don ka lA pa'i sa bcad nyer bsgyur gyi 'grel pa rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum snyan ngag me log gi 'grel pa sdeb sbyor gyi gnad bsdus pa dag yig za ma tog aSh+Ta'i byings sgrub pa sogs sngags kyi byings sgrub mang po mtshams sbyor gyi 'grel pa gnyis sum rtags kyi 'grel pa brda sprod rig pa'i skor gyi bstan bcos kyang mang du gsar rtsom mdzad mdor na lo chen 'di nyid gzhung mang po la 'gyur bcos sam hor kong bsabs pa sogs kyi sgo nas legs par ma 'gyur ba dang log par bsgyur ba 'gyur chad pa sogs mtha' dag gi dri ma bkrus nas ji lta ba ji snyed pa'i rig gnas kyi rgyun bzang po shin tu gsal bar mdzad pa ma zad bstan bcos kyang mang po gzhi bsgyur dang brtsams gnang ba bcas gangs ri'i khrod kyi blo gzu bor gnas pa thams cad bkur sti'i gnas dam pa dang lhag par rig gnas la phyag rjes shin tu che lo chen chos skyong bzang po'i thugs sras la mtshon na sa lo kun dga' bsod nams grags pa rgyal mtshan dang lo tsA ba ran+ta b+ha dra mthu stobs chos kyi ngag dbang bsod nams nyid kyi dbon po lo chen pad ma dkar po skyogs ston lo tsA ba ngag dbang rin chen bkra shis g.ya' bzang mkhas btsun dbang po sogs lo chen dgu dang sngags kyi bshad rgyun 'dzin pa'i slob ma mkhas grub o rgyan rdzong pa rtsed thang 'bum rabs pa mkhan po chos grub seng ge sogs mang du byung nas gangs can gyi ljongs thams cad du khyab par gyur mthar thug grangs rgya bdun la phebs pa rab byung dgu pa'i me phag (1527)lor thugs sras dpar ma dkar po grwa thang gi gdan sar bsko bag mdzad nas dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim lo rgyus zhib pa paN chen 'bum phrag gsum pa rin chen chos kyi dbang pos mdzad pa'i rnam thar dang skyogs lo rin chen bkra shis kyis mdzad pa'i rnam thar gnyis su gsal bas der gzigs}
