zhang zhung|{'di ni sngar bon chos dar rgyas che ba'i yul zhig yin par bod dang bod kyi lo rgyus mang che ba mthun zhing sa gnas gang du yod med dang/sa rgya che chung gi skor la bshad tshul mi mthun pa sna tshogs 'dug /bon gyi lo rgyus las/zhang zhung gi rgyal po khri wer la gung las gser gyi byu ru can la sogs pa grags che ba bco bag+r+yad byung ba de dag gis zhing zhung sgo phugs bar gsum ste mdo smad kyi phyogs la sgom dang/dbus gtsang gi phyogs la bar/mnga' ris la dwags kyi phyogs la phugs ces brjod par bshad/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )las zhang zhung gi stong sde 'dren pa'i skabs bod dang gru gu gnyis kyi mtshams na 'o co mang ma gnyis sogs zhang zhung stod kyi stong sde lnga/bod dang sum pa'i mtshams na gu ge /cog la gnyis sogs zhang zhung smad kyi stong sde lnga bcas zhang zhung gi stang de bcu yod par bshad/zhang zhung bod gyi btsan po'i rgyal rabs kyi mnga' khongs su tshad pa'i dus ni rgyal po srong btsan sgom po'i gong yab gnam ri srong btsan gyi dus su ngo log byas pa dang/de rjes rgyal po srong btsan sgom pos rang nyid kyi sring mo srad ma ka ma la thig bya ba de zhang zhung gi rgyal po lig mi rgyal ba bag mar btang rjes/zhang zhung slar yang mnga' 'og tu bcug thog sbug gyim btsan smang chung zhang zhung gi spyi dpon du bskos par bshad/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang da dung rgyal po stag rig nyan gzigs kyi dus su ban pa rje/'a zha rje/drang gar rje/zing po rje/zhang zhung rje rnams btul ba dang/nyang sbas gnon gsum 'bangs su tshud pa sogs gsungs pa rnams phan tshun gung bsgrigs skabs/rtsom po pos gsungs pa'i lo rgyus kyi nang dan mang po zhig tun hon gi bod yig lo rgyus thog nas ra sprod byed thub pa byung ba der brtags na/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )mdzad skabs tun hong gi lo rgyus yig rnying dang 'dar ba'i dpyad gzhi'i yig cha khungs thub mang po zhig skabs der phyag la son yod pa gsal por mthong thub kyi 'dug }
zhang zhung chos dbang grags pa|{stod mnga' ris skor gsum zhes pa'i char gtogs pa/bod chos rgyal kyi gdung gis bzung ba'i yul gru zhang zhung zhes par grags pa la yab yum rigs rus cha 'brang phul du phyin pa'i rgyud du rje 'di nyid rab byung bdun pa'i shing sprel (140)lor sku 'khrungs/chung dus yi ge'i phyi mo slob pa nas bzung bslab par bya ba'i chos gang dang gang la'ang slob dpon gyi zhal nas lan re gnyis thos tsam gyis tshegs (693) chung ngus thugs su chud de rjes dbus su byon te rje rgyal ba yab sras gsum dang mtshungs med chos rje dam pa rnams kyi zhabs la gtugs nas mdo rgyud kyi bshad tshul dang zab mo'i dbang khrid rjes gnang bum pa gang byo'i tshul gyis gsan zhing sgra tshad snyan ngag sogs thun mong gi rig gnas mtha' dag la yang sbyangs pa mthar phyin mdzad pas bla ma dam pa'i mkhas pa'i go 'phang rnyed de zhang zhung chos dbang grags pa zhes rgyal 'a 'jam dpal snying po'i slob ma'i nang mus sad pa blo gros rin chen seng ge dang 'di pa gnyis la rnam dpyod phul du byung ba'i mkhas pa gnyis su grags dgung lo so lnga pa sa rta (1438)lor (rgyal po rA ma Na'i rtogs brjod )mdzad rje 'di tha snyad kyi gtsug lag ma lus pa dbang 'byor pas dga' ldan pa'i bstan pa 'dzin pa'i nang la snyan ngag 'di las mkhas pa ma byung skad de nas nags shod spus mda'i gdan sar phebs nas legs par bshad pa'i dga' ston gyis blo gsal gyi tshogs skyong bar mdzad tshig chos rdzong dgon btab nas 'phags pa lha mthong ba don ldan la phul dgong lo nga lnga pa rab byung brgyad pa'i sa stag (1458)lor thar 'dod skye bo'i 'jug ngogs chab mdo byams pa gleng zhes grags pa'i chos sde che po'i khri thog gnyis pa la phebs te phar phyin dang rgyud sde rgya mtsho'i chos kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor gzhan dgon sde chen po gu ru dpal 'khor gyi khri la zhabs pad bkod de mkhas pa'i bya rnam gsum gyis bstan 'grol sman pa'i mdzad 'phrin spel dgung lo drug cu re drug pa rab byung brgyad pa'i sa glang (1469)lor nags shod spus mda' rnam rgyal dpal 'bar du sku gshegs (dus 'khor gyi bskyed rdzogs )sogs ljags rtsom mdzad cing mkhas grub chen po che'i dus 'khor TIka chen rtsom 'phro lus pa mjug rdzogs par mdzad gzhan yang snyan ngag gis yongs su spud pa'i lha dang bla ma'i bstod pa rA ma Na'i rtogs brjod la sogs pa gangs can bod kyi snyan ngag mkhan kun gyi gtsug gi nor bu ltar gyur pa'i snyan ngag gi lam nas drangs pa'i bka' rtsam yang mang po mdzad}
zhang zhung rje|{zhang zhung ni gna' rabs btsan po'i dus skabs ma byung gong du rgyal phrin bcu gnyis dang/sil ma bzhi'i nang gi rgyal phrag zhig yin par tun hong nas thon pa'i bod kyi lo rgyus yig rnying dang/(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang bshad cing/(bon gyi chos 'byung )dang lo rgyus 'ga' zhig las/zhang zhung gi rgyal po khri wer la gu lang gser gyi byu ru can la sogs pa grags che ba bco brgyad byung ba dang/skabs der bod kyi sag nas yong la zhang zhung sgo phug bar gsum zhes mdo smad kyi phyogs la sgo dang/dbus gtsang gi phyogs la bar/mnga' ris la dwags kyi phyogs la phug ces zer ba yin par bshad pas/skabs der bod kyi rgyal po zhes mi zer bar zhang zhung gi rgyal po zhes zer pha ni/skabs de'i bod spyi la dbang pa'i rgyal po ni zhang zhung gi yul du gnas pa'i dbang gis ming de ltar thogs pa yin cing/rgyal rabs gang yin kyang rang nyid kyi dbang 'og tu 'dus zin pa'i yul de la rgyal po rang nyid gnas sa'i yul des spyi ming byas pa dang/rang nyid kyi dbang 'og tu 'dus med pa'i yul de la yul so so'i ming 'bod pa de 'dra'i dpe mang po yod pas/btsan po'i rgyal rabs kyis bod dbus gtsang sogs dbang du ma 'dus gong du bod spyi'i ming la zhang zhung gi yul zhes 'bod pa dang/btsan po'i rgyal rabs kyis zhang zhung dbang du 'dus rjes zhang zhung rgyal po rang nyid gnas sa'i yul tsam la zhang zhing gi yul zhes 'bod pa yin/rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos srid dbang bzung ma thag pa'i dus skabs su zhang zhung dang sum pa sogs kyis ngo log byas pa'i gnas tshul tun hong gi yig rnying (694) las gsal bas (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang 'khod pa'i lo rgyus rnams khungs btsun pa yin par ra 'phrod byung yod}
zhang zhung stod kyi stong sde lnga|{(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang gsal bar/bod dang gru gu gnyis kyi bar du yod pa'i 'o co dang mang ma gnyis/gnye ma dang tsa mo gnyis/ba ga stong bu chung bcas lnga yin par gsungs 'dug 'di zhang zhung smad kyi sa cha dang phan tshur nor ba min nam snyam}
zhang zhung smad kyi stong sde lnga|{(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang gsal bar/bod dang sum pa'i mtshams su yod pa'i gu ge dang cog la gnyis/skyi gtsang dang yar gtsang gnyis/ci di stong bu chung dang lnga yin par gsungs/de ltar na zhang zhung smad ni stong mnga' ris kyi sa khul yin dgon pas stod mnga' ris dang li yul gyi bar sum pa zer ba'i yul zhig yod dgos pa dang/'og tu bshad pa'i sum pa'i stong sde yang der yod pa lta bu zhig snang bas rtsom pa pos bod dang sum pa'i mtshams su zhang zhung smad kyi stong sde lnga yod gsungs pa'i go don bod dang sum pa gnyis kyi bar du yod pa la go rgyud yin na 'og tu bshad pa'i sum pa'i ru'i khongs kyi rgod tshang stod smad gnyis dang/nags shod bcas ni bar khams sa khul gyi sa ming yis sum pa'i sa gnas dang bod kyi bar du mnga' ris stod kyi gu ge cog la sogs yod mi srid/der brtan kho bo'i bsam par/mdzad pa pos gsungs pa ltar bod dang gru gu'i mtshams na zhang zhung stod rgyud kyi stong sde yod pa dang/bod dang sum pa'i mtshams su zhang zhung smad kyi stong sde yod pa ni zhang zhung rgyal pos bod la dbang bsgyur byed skabs mdo khams gsum gtsang mnga' ris bcas la zhang zhung sgo bar phug gsum du 'bod pa dang mthun pas sa ming 'dren pa gnang skabs zhang zhung stod smad gnyis kyi sa cha phan tshul nor ba 'dra snyam}
zhang zhung bza' li thig sman|{(zhang zhung bza' khri btsun yang )srong btsan gyi rigs mthun btsun mo gsum gyi ya gyal/mos bzang khri btsun dang/zhang zhung bza' khri btsun/mi nyag ru yong bza' bcas la ja mo bod mo zhes bod kyi lo rgyus yig tshang nang dmigs su bkar nas gsungs pa ltar de dag bo mi'i rigs can gyur pa'i dbang gis yin/'di nyid zhang zhung gi rgyal po li mig rkya'i sras mo yin zhing/phyag rjes su thim bu lkog gi lha khang bzhengs zhes grags/'on kyang lha khang 'di'i chags yul sa cha 'di yin zhes da lta nges bzung dka' ba'i gnas su gyur/bod kyi lo rgyus 'gar de ni g.yung drung bon gyi lha khang yin zhes 'khod 'dug }
zhang ye shes sde|{chos rgyal khri srong lde btsan gyi sku dus su byung ba'i lo tsA ba ska cog zhal gsum gyi ya gyal yang yin la/'di nyid kyi 'gyur la/bka' bar pa sher phyin gyi skor la/(sher rab kyi pha rol tu phyin pa stong phrag brgyad pa/) (yum 'bring po stong phrag nyi shu lnga pa/) (khri brgyad stong pa bam po drug cu/) (shes rab khri pa bam po sum cu rtsa bzhi pa/) (shes rab kyi pha rol tu phyin pa ral rtsal rnam gnyis kyis zhus pa'i mdo/) (sher phyin lnga brgya pa dang/) (shes rab kyi pha rol tu phyin pa sum brgya bar grags pa rdo rje gcod pa )sogs dang/'khor lo tha mar gtogs pa/) mdo sde phal po che la spyir sho lo ka 'bum dang le'u brgya yod pa la/sngon na lan+da bi ha ra la me dgra byung ba'i rkyen gyis ma tshang ba'i 'phro ji tsam bzhugs pa bsgyur pa la khyon le'u bcu bdun yod pa rnams ye shes da la sogs pas bsgyur cing lo chen bai ro tsA nas zhus chen mdzad par bshad}
zhang rin po che|{gung thang bla ma zhang brtson 'grus grags (695) pa ste gong du gung thang bla ma zhang zhes par gzigs}
zhang gsum|{1 sna nam/2 mchims/3 'bro}
zhang gsum blon bcas bzhi|{srong btsan sgam po'i skabs su 'bro dang mchims nang sna nam ste/zhang blon gsum dang zhang po min pa'i blon po sbas bcas mi bzhis mnyam du srid 'dzin gyi las do sgrub pa la zer/blon po la zer zhing/blon po de dag gi ming 'bod skabs dngos ming gi 'gor zhang zhes brjod srol yod/de'i rgyu mtshan ni zhang po ni a ma'i phyogs kyi gnyen tshan yin pas a khu dang mi 'dra bar tsha bo la sha tsha dang brtse dung che ba'i dbang gis blon po'i nang du zhang blon mang tsam yod na btsan po'i bde 'jags la phan pa yod pa red}
zhabs dkar pa tshogs drug rang grol|{grub pa'i dbang phyugs zhabs dkar pa tshogs drung rang grol mchog ni rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags glang (1781)lor mdo smad reb gong gser mo ljongs kyi char gtogs zhor 'ong pa'i sras su 'khrungs/mtshan ngag dbang bkra shis zhes btags/dgung lo brgyad pa'i steng pas mes ngag dbang gi mdun du yig ge sbyor klog sbyangs shing tshegs med par thugs su chud/dgung lo bcu par zho yong sngags mang chos thog gi gral du zhugs/bcu bdun steng gling rgya'i lha bzo bstan pa dar rgyas las lha bris bslabs pas ri mo legs po 'bri shes pa byung/de nas 'jam dbyangs g+r+ya mtsho dang mdo sngags chos kyi gdams pa gang mang gsan/dgung lo nyer gcig pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags bya (1801)lor a rig dge bshes byams pa dge lugs rgyal mtshan gyis mkhan po dang/rgyal mkhan chen gyis gsang ston mdzad de rab byung dang bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs/mtshan byams pa chos dar zhes gsol/de nas rgyal mkhan chen dang lhan du rtse gzhung du phebs te ching wang ngag dbang dar rgyas (mkhas dbang chos rgyal ngag gi dbang por )las mdo sngags chos kyi gzhung lugs rgya mtsho lta bu la thos bsam dpyis phyin par mdzad cing/mkhas btsun bzang gsum gyi yon tan la mnga' brnyes nas mkhas pa'i go 'phang mthon por song/dgung lo nyer drug nas bzung rgyal khams phyags med 'grims te sgrub pa nyams len snying por mdzad/gangs can bod kyi gnas chen yod do cog la zhabs kyis bcags/stod kyi gnas chen tsA ri/gangs dkar te si/sa phyi sogs dang/smad kyi gnas chen rma chen/mtsho snying/bra dkar sprel rdzong sogs dben gnas brgya phrag la lo ngo sum cu'i ring sgrub pa lhur len gnang nas 'gro dun bsam gyis mi khyab pa mdzad/pad+ma rang grol dang/skal ldan rang grol/sangs rgyas rin chen/lcang lung sprul pa'i sku sogs mtshan snyan grags pa'i bu slob ma mang po byung/ljags rtsom rje zhabs dkar ba'i rang rnam sogs pod nyer lnga yod par grags/dgung lo donag cig pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags phag (1851)lor rang yul du sku gshegs}
zhabs rnyongs pa|{zhabs 'khums pa'am rid pa'i don}
