zhabs brtan las khungs|{(zhabs 'phar las khungs zhes kyang zer srol skad )de ni de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs las khungs der do dam mkhan drung re 'khor (696) thog las bya rtse drung gnyis dang rtse gnyer nang gnyis bcas yod pa de dag gi las 'gan ni tA la'i bla ma'i sku phywa dang bstan srid zhabs rim sgrub dgos pa'i dgos dngul gzhung dngul khang nas zhu dgos pa dang dgon 'bru nye 'khor nga gzhis ngad bstan bla gzhung chod gzhis khag nas bton rgya zhus te 'bru dngul gnyis ka 'bor 'khur lag 'dzin du bkod de lo re bsdad song rtsis khra khams dwangs 'bul dgos pa yin (las khungs tshugs yul zhol du yin/)}
zhabs drung gnas|{nye 'khor gyi g.yog mo'am/zhabs 'bring ba/zham ring ba zhes pa rnams don gcig yin}
zhabs 'degs bka' gsung ci sgrub zhus|{zhabs 'debs zhu dgos thad bka' gang gnang ltar nus pa gang yod bton nas zhu ba}
zhabs pad gser khri mngon mtho'i drung du|{gong rim gyi zhabs gnyis me tog pad+ma'i gzugs su bkod pa dang/gsham 'og nas 'bul ba'i snyan zhu rnams lcog rtse'i steng dang zhabs kyi pus mo'i steng du bzhag pa lta bum yin par/zhabs 'og gi ha cang dma' sa gser khri'i mdun du phul ba'i don}
