zham ring pa dag gi gras su bya ba'i khur 'dzin pa|{zhabs 'degs pa'i gras su zhugs nas de rnams kyis bya dgos pa'i las 'gan sgrub pa}
zhar dang zhor la|{'di kha skad la bshad srol yod pa'i zhal lung ste zhal nas gsungs pa'i lung ngang ma zhal las byung ba'i lung zer/zhor zhor la zhes pa dang/zhar dang zhor la zhes pa de yin/go don/thengs gcig gi zhor tsam min par zhor nam byung la zhes pa'i don}
zhal dkyil|{zhal gyi dkyil 'khor te zhal ras}
zhal bkod mdzad|{bar 'dum mam ngag thog nas bkod sgrig byed pa'i zhe sa}
zhal gyi lung|{zhal lung ta zhal nas gsungs pa'i lung ngam zhal lus byung ba'i lung zer}
zhal rgyan|{kha spu dang og tshom gyi zhe sa}
zhal ngo|{dpon rigs ngo ma'am gdung rgyud kyi mi ngo ma dang/yang na dgon pa'i nang gi las sne zhig }
zhal ngo gnyan|{ngo ldog ma nus pa'am ngo gcog ma nus pa'i don}
zhal bcu gcig pa|{'phags pa spyan ras gzigs la sku'i rnam 'gyur mi 'dra ba mang po yod pa'i nang gses zhal bcu gcig pa de le zer/de'i zhal phyag gi mdog dang phyag mtshan bcas zhib par (rin 'byung brgya rtsa'i )nang du gsal}
zhal bce|{zhal lce ste rgyal khrims sam khrims bcad pa'i ming}
zhal lce bcu gnyis|{sngar tA la'i bla ma lnga pa nas bod la dbang sgyur byed skabs zhal lce bcu gsum nang gi na mo las 'dzin gyi zhal lce dor nas zhal lce bcu gnyis su gtan la phab pa'i khrims lugs don tshan bcu gnyis}
zhal lce bcu drug|{sngar gtsang pa sde srid karma bstan skyong (697) dbang pos bod la dbang sgyur byed skabs spel ser ba la sgrig tu bcug pa'i khrims yig nang gsal khrims kyi don tshan bcu drug ni dang po dpa' bo stag gi zhal lce gnyis pa sdar ma wa'i zhal lce gsum pa da mo las 'dzin kyi zhal lce bzhi pa zhu bzhes bden rdzun gyi zhal lce lnga pa bzung bkyigs khrims ra'i zhal lce ga pa nag chen khrag sbyor gyi zhal lce bdun pa dran 'dzin chad las kyi zhal lce brgyad pa hor 'dra za rkang gi zhal lce dgu pa bcas pa stong gi zhal lce bcu pa rmas pa khrag gi zhal lce bcu gcig pa bsnyen han mna' dag gi zhal lce bcu gnyis pa brkus pa 'jal gyi zhal lce bcu gsum pa nyes 'brel 'bral 'dum gyi zhal lce bco bzhi pa byi byas byi rin gyi zhal lce bco lnga pa nam phar tshur gyi zhal lce bcu drug pa kla klo mtha' 'khob kyi zhal lce rnams so/_}
zhal lce bcu gsum|{gtsang pa sde srid karma bstan skyong dbang pos bod la dbang sgyur byed skabs/zhal lce bco lnga nas dpa' bo stag gi zhal lce dang/sdang mar we'i zhal lce gnyis dor nor zhal lce bcu gsum du gtan la phab pa'i khrims lugs don tshan bcu gsum}
zhal lce bco lnga|{sde srid phag mo gru byang chub rgyal mtshan gyis bod la dbang sgyur byed skabs/zhal lce bcu drug nas kla klo mtha' 'khob gyi zhal lce nor nas zhal lce bco lngar gtan la phab pa'i khrims lugs don tshan bco lnga'o/_}
zhal chen lnga|{1 mi stong dge'i zhal che/2 gnyen byed tshis kyi zhal che/3 smyon thol dkar gyi zhal che/4 mdo lon zhu bcad kyi zhal che/5 nye du lhum chos kyi zhal che bcas}
