zhig po bdud rtsi|{gsang sngags rnying ma'i bla ma mtshan snyan shin tu che ba zhig yin/rab byung gsum pa'i sa sbrul (1149)lor yab sangs rgyas dwags chung gi sras su sku 'khrungs/dgung lo gnyis tsam nas yab gshegs te yum gyis bskyangs/cher skyes pa dang gos bcos pa thams cad lam zad pa snying rje ba zhig yod pa la byin/yum gyis 'bar bas kyang ma phan/zhang po dam pa se sbrag pa'i sar lo gsum tsam slob gnyer gnang nas rdzogs chen rong lugs kyi chos skor rnams gsan/khyad par sgang dril mkhas par mkhyen zhing gab phyung yang legs par thos/dgung lo bcu drug bzhes pa'i tshe na zhing po dam pa sku gshegs nas skya mkhar khang pa yon tan gzhungs kyi zhabs la gtugs/der lo mang bzhugs nas gsan pa bskyed rdzogs gsung ga la thugs thag chod pa mdzad/de nas chos mgo thon te grags pas khyab kyang dgu ngalo sum cu can chad slob gnyer mdzad de bla ma lha khang pa'i zhabs drung du lo bcu bzhi bzhugs/bar skabs kun tu zhang (701) po'i gdan sa se sbrug tu bzhugs te sgom sgrub dang bshad pa bag re yang mdzad 'ug skad dgon pa dang gtsang du se sbrag dang chos sdings la sogs pa mang du bzung de lta sku bsod rgyas shing thugs dgongs nam mkha' lta bu la thugs rje'i nyi ma zla lta bur shar nas snyan pa'i grags pas phyogs mtshan thams cad du khyab cing gdul bya'i tshogs bsam gyis mi khyab pa 'dus nas bla ma'i zhabs tog dang 'gro ba'i don rgya chen po dpag tu med pa mdzad skyes bu chen po 'dis byang phyogs kyi rgyud gangs ri'i khrod 'dir yul phyogs thams cad du byon nas skye rgu rnams chos la bskyur nas thar pa'i lam la bkod gzhan yang bstan pa'i bya ba bde bar gshegs pa'i sku gsung thugs kyi rten bzhengs pa dang gso ba dang gzhan dag bzhengs pa la yo byag tong ga sogs dpag tu med pa mdzad rdo rje gdan la mchod pa lan gsum bskyal ba dang lha sa'i rdo rags lan bzhi mdzad pa'i phyi mar sku gshegs de skabs dngul lo lnga bcu nga gcig pa rab byung gsum pa'i sa lug (1199)lo yin btsan po dang dbon po slob mar gyur pa rnams kyis skyes bu chen po 'di'i gdan sar dgongs nas gzad thang skya'i gtsug lag khang bzhengs shing chos gsungs pa dang bzhugs sa'i gdan sa che chung kun tu yang sku gsung thugs kyi rten mang du bzhengs so/_/zhig po la slob ma mang yang thugs sras su gyur pa ni rta ston jo yes dang mahA lhun po mkhas pa jo man dbus pa jo bsod bzang ston hor grags gnyos ston bla ma dang drug go lo rgyus zhib pa (gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi chos 'byung )dang (deb ther sngon po )le tshan (ga)pa'i shog grangs 14nas 19bar gsal}
zhig po rin chen shes rab|{rog shes rab 'od kyi gcung po 'di nyid yab bkra shis grags pa dang yum chos kyi dge gnyis kyi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i lcags yos (1171)lor sku 'khrungs/lo gsum lon tsam nas 'khor ba'i sdug bsngal dran/lo lnga drug la yum gyis klog yon gsol bas klog shegs par mkhyen/dgung lo bdun pa nas gsang spyod mdzad de lkugs rdzu bzhes/bcu drug pa la yab gshegs pas gsang spyod grol te grang chog mang du gnang zhing yum gyi zhabs tog mdzad/bco brgyad lon pa'i tshe phug pa gcig tu sgrub pa la gcig pur bzhugs pa na/srin bya'i skad thos pas dang por thugs ma bde/thugs ma bde ba'i ngo bo brtags pas rang bzhin gyis stong pa'i sems kyi ngo bo mngon sum du rtogs/de nas gcen po la chos dang gdams ngag mang du zhus/rgyal khams mang du bskor te bla ma bzang dgu la gdams pa btsal/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa drug pa la bla ma chen po te ni la dbang khrid zhus/blo sbyong gi bsnyen pa zas khom med par zhag nyer gsum bskyal bas/rtags dang yon tan thams cad rdzogs/_/mtshan rim chen shes rab tu btags/_/de nas sgom pa sman gcig pa dang/'chos pa brtson seng/'char bu rgya ras/ri khrod sbug ston/gcod brul tsho drug pa/rgyal ba dkon skyabs/rog ston btsan po/zhig po bdud rtsi/kha rag skyi ston sogs bla mang po bsten nas so lugs dbang rab gyi chos dang/rje btsun ma bu hrangs lugs /ga ga Ni/rnam 'joms/bdud rtse chen ma/gsang 'dus rgyud rkyang/rdzogs chen snyan brgyud/'pho ba spyi brtol sogs zab chos mtha' yas pa gsan/bla ma mang du yod kyang rtsa ba'i bla ma te ni kho na la mdzad/'bri khung nas slar byon te sgrub pa la thugs gzhol/tsa ri/mkhar chu/sham+bu/mu tig /pho (702) ma gangs bzang rnams su sgrub pa rtse gcig tu mdzad gdung lo so bdun pa ral ri khrod du phyag phab bka' brgyud kyi gsung rab rnam gser du bzhengs pas phal chen tsam zhig byung ba bsnams nas bzhi bcu pa la ding rir byon glang 'khor du phabs nas byang chub chen po la sogs pa'i rten rnams la mchod pa rgya cher phul slob ma rnams la chos kyi char phab lam rim che chung dang bshad 'bum la sogs pa'i rtsom pa yang mang