zhing skyong grags pa bkra shis|{mdo smad bya khyung dgon gyi mkhan rabs nyer gsum pa 'di nyid rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags lug (1631)lor sku 'bum mchod gzhis zhing skyong kra gya sde zhes bya bar sku 'khrungs/rje lhun grub rgya mtsho las rab tu byung/sku 'bum chos sgor zhugs/mkhas dbang don grub rgya mtsho brten nas phar tshad dbu gsum la sbyangs/dgon lung dang bya khyung sogs su grwa skor mdzad/de nas dbus su phebs nas 'bras spungs sgo mang du zhugs/bka' pod la sbyangs pa dpyis phyin pa dang/rgyud sman grwa tshang du zhugs nas rgyud da la gnas bsam mdzad/paN chen rin po che blo bzang chos rgyan drung nas bsnyen rdzogs bzhes shing chos bka' ci rigs gsan/rgyal dbang lnga pa chen po las dbang rdo rje phreng ba sogs mang du zhus/de nas slar sku 'bum du phebs nas rgyud grwar zhugs shing rgyud pa'i mkhan po mdzad/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing yos (1675)lor bya khyung gi khrir phebs/'chad nyan bskyangs shing dgon pa'i sgrig khrims shin tu dam par mdzad/'du khang dbus 'bum gyan dgu ma dang blang brang phyi nang skor bcas gsar bzhengs mdzad/mdzad bcu/gnas bcu/tsong kha brgyad cu/'jigs byed dang chos skyong khag /mkhan brgyud dang rje btsun dam pa'i 'khrungs rabs/zhal thang/byams pa'i gser sku/gsang 'dus blos bslangs/tshogs khro che tshad sogs rten dang mchod rdzas mang tsam bzhengs/dbyar gnas skabs su gnang 'dus bdag 'jug dang 'dus pa'i rgyud gzhung gsung pa'i rgyun btsugs/slar yang dbus ljongs su phebs nas jo shAka rnam gnyis dang/rgyal dbang lnga pa rin po che/sde srid sangs rgas rgya mtsho bcas la mchod bkur bsnyen gsum (703) dpangs mtho ba zhus sngon chad bya khyung gi gdan sa ba rnams la mkhan po'i cho lo ma byung na yang rje 'di bar rgyal dbang lnga pa rin po ches mkhan po'i bka' tham bstsal nas bzung bya khyung gi mkhan rabs rim byon la mkhan po'i cho lo yod par gyur sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i rgyal ba tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho'i rnam thar du bya khyung mkhan po'i mtshan snga phyir ri gnyis thon pa'ang 'di pa yin par mngon de ltar lo bco lnga'i ri