zho ston|{zho ston zhes pa'i go don ni dus skabs der se 'bras sogs la dbyar gnas tshugs skabs snga dus tshogs gzhung du zho gtong gi yod pas zho'i ston mo btang bas zho stod zhen 'bod skad/de yang sngon dus rgya gar du sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi rab byung rnams dbyar kha zla ba gsum gyi ring dgon pa'i phyi rol du phebs mi chog pa dang/gal srid phebs dgos byung na yang zhag bdun lhag bzhugs mi chago pa'i dbyar khrims yod stabs/de'i ring dge 'dun gyi mnga' 'bangs mi sde dang/de'i do dam pa zhal ta ba zer ba zhig yod pa nas dge 'dun rnams la 'o ma dang zho'i ston mo thengs 'ga' shal 'bul ba'i srol yod pa ltar/bod du yang gdan sa se 'bras gnyis su dgon pa'i nor srid dang mi ser kyi spyi dpon du bskos pa spyi so zhes pa rgan gzhon kha shas yod cing/de tshos dbyar gnas 'og tshugs rjes kyi zhag bdun phrag gnyis song ba bod zla drug pa'i tshes sum cu nyid 'bras spungs dang se ra'i dge 'dun pa yongs la gsol zho bzhes spyad gar re 'bul srol dang/de'i sang nyin tshes gcig nas tshes bco lnga'i bar grwa tshang so so'i slob gnyer ba tshos gzhung bka' pod lnga'i thog nas bkra gleng gi tshogs chen 'go tshugs pa yin/tA la'i blam sku phreng lnga pa'i skabs nas zho ston gyi nyin bod kyi bkra shis zhol pa dang/bro pa/shel rong 'brong rtsed pa bcas 'bras spungs su yong nas dga' ldan pho brang gi mdun zlo gar dang lha mo'i 'khrab ston gzigs mo 'bul gyi yod/de ni nyin der 'bras spungs gos sku chen po bkram pa'i mdun zhal ngo gsar rnying brje ba'i rten 'brel la bsu ba zhu ched red/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gcig pa mkhas grub rgya mtsho dgung lo bcu gcig la phebs par rab byung bcu bzhi 'i sa bya (1849)lor nor bu gling kha'i bskal bzang pho brang gi rgyab ngos su dbu g.yab gzim chung gsar rgyag thog /de nas bzung dbyar kha'i ring nor bu gling khar bzhugs pa'i srol byung zhing/zho ston dang chags cig bskal bzang pho brang shar ngos sdings cha'i steng du skabs der yod pa'i bod kyi zlos gar skad grags che ba rnams yong nas 'khrab stob gzigs 'bul gyi srol byung/de la brten nas bod la lha mo'i tshogs pa mang po je rgyas che 'phel song ste/dgon pa khag gi nang du yang dge 'dun lo gzhon rnams nas dbyar gnas grol rjes kyi chab zhugs gung sang dang stabs bstun lha mo 'khrab srol 'phel rgyas byung zhing/lhag par du sde drug rin po ches srid skyong gnang ring kyang de rigs la no snang chen po gnang ste/ru'i ba'i dge 'dun pa rnams nas bod kyi rgyun srol mo'i sgyu rtsal rgyun 'dzin thog 'khrab ston gyi nang don dngos gzhi chos rgyal dad pa brtan pa'i rnam thar dang/bar 'jug gi 'khrab ston la spyi tshogs thog gi dpon rigs bka' blon nas/rdzong dpon/gzhis gnyer tshong pa/dgon pa'i zhal ngo/tha na sprang po yan gyi 'tsho ba'i spyod tshul dngos yod sbas gsang med par 'khrab ston byed pi sgyu rtsal dang nang don gsar pa gsar gtod gdang ba de yang 'khrab ston byed srol byung/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pas dungs su srid dbang bzhes rjes/bod kyi rgyun srol lha mo dang/zlos gar tshogs pa grags che ba rnams kyi sgyu rtsal mi nyams gong 'phel 'byung ched/dbus gtsang lho kha bcas su yod pa'i lha mo'i tshogs pa dang/bro pa/gzhan ma/shel rong 'brang da pa sogs yod tshad bskong 'gugs gnang ste lo ltar zho ston ring nor bu gling khar 'khrab ston gzigs 'bul dgos pa dang/'khrab ston skabs rang rang so so'i 'khrab ston sgyu rtsal gyi nyams 'gyur khyad chos ma nyams par rgyun 'khyongs byed dgos pa'i bka' gnang thog /sku ngo mas nan tan gyis gzigs rtogs gnang gi yod cing/de nas bzung zho ston ni bod kyi rig rtsal dus chen zhig tu gyur te lo ltar bod zla bdun (709) pa'i nang zho ston dus chen gtong srol byung de yang zla drug pa'i tshes bco lnga nas bzung 'bras se dga' gsum gyi dge 'dun tshos dbyar snga ma zhal gyis bzhes (dbyar gnas zer )shing zla ba gcig dang phyed kyi ring dbyar gnas la bzhugs skabs bdud kyi bar chad mi 'jug ched bdud sder gtogs pa rnams spro ba skyed pa'i slad 'dod cho sa dang mthun pa'i rnam pa mngon gsal can dgos pa sogs dgos pa du mar gzhigs te bod zla drug pa'i tshes nyer dgu nyin 'phyongs rgyas spun bdun pa dang yar lung bkra shis zhol pa snye mo bya sgo ba thon pa ba snang rtse ba rin spungs rdzong khongs rgyal mkhar chos rdzong pa ngam rim rdzong khongs gcung ri bo che rnam gling rdzong khongs shar gram bkra shis rtse pa lha sa'i skyor mo lung pa chu shul rdzong gi shel grong 'brong rtsed sogs nas thog mar rtse pho brang dang de nas nor bu gling kha dgong dro 'bras spungs pho brang bcas par lha mo'i glu gar gyi gzigs phud phul tshes su cu nyin gyi snga dro 'bras spungs dgon pa'i nub ngos ri ldebs su ston pa shAkya thub pa gtso g.yur gyi gos sku 'grems pa'i mdun du mchod 'bul dang tshogs chen dge bskos (zhal ngo )gsar rnying brje ba'i mdzad sgo gnang sar gos sku'i zhal mjal dang ltad mo ba mang po yong gi yod yar lung bkra shis zhol pa sogs mo ba tshos chos sku'i mdun gzigs phud kyi lha mo 'khrab rjes bsam blo khang tshan sogs su lha mo nyin 'khyongs 'khrab pa sogs byed nyin der sa se ra dgon par yang tshogs chen sgo mtshor rab gsal steng nas gos sku bkram pa'i mdun karma shag gi chos skyong khog zhugs kyis lo re'i legs nyes brtag gzhi ston pa dang lha sa'i rags stobs pa dang skor bya ba sogs kyis byis pa dang skyes pa bud med thod skam sogs kyi 'cham rgyag pa phyi dro karma shag gi lha chas su gsob brgyangs ste rta la skyon thog chos rje (lha phebs mkhan )ngo g.yog gzab mchor gyon te rta bzhon pa'i snga rjes su se ra bla spyi'i ngo tshab 'khor g.yog bcas rta hrag sgrig pa'i mdun du rags stobs pa tshos lag tu brtag gzhi'i dngos po rnams 'khyer te ru bstar bsgrigs bzhin lha sar logs bod zla bdun pa'i tshes gcig nyin nor bu gling gar lha mo tshos gzigs phud rgyas par re 'khrab pa dang karma shag gi 'cham pa bsam 'cham brgyab tshes bco lnga nasab zung nor bu gling gar nyin bzhi'i ring rgyal mkhar chos rdzong pa dang gcung pa ri bo che ba shangs gram bkra shis rtse pa skyor mo lung pa bcas nas nyen re rgyal rabs 'khrab gzhung mi 'dra ba re 'khrab pa sogs byed tshes bco lnga tsam la zhol pa las khungs nas lha mo blangs rjes gling skor gyi nang du mo 'khrab pa sogs byed tshes bco lnga tsam la zhol pa las khungs nas lho mo blangs rjes gling skor gyi nang du lha mo 'khrab mi chog de'i gong nor bu gling ga'i zho ston tshar rjes grong nang gi sku drag tshe khag dang bla brang che khag tshos mo len ('khrab tu bcug pa )gyi yod zho ston ring lha sa'i grong mi dang de 'dabs grong gseb pa sogs mang po nor bu gling gar ltad mor 'dzoms srol yang se 'bras bu dbyar gnas 'khel bas grwa pa ltad mor yong mi chog gong gsal lha mo ba rnams khral 'khri'i rang bzhin yin la gtan 'bebs bzhin lo ltar lag thag ring po nas la chu mang po brgal te bod zla drug pa'i tshes nyi shu nyin yas mas su rtse phyag las khungs su 'byor tshes zhu dgon gyi yod 'dug}
