zhogs gur smon gyi 'dus pa'i sde|{'di lha sa'i nye 'dabs stag rtse rdzong thang dkar chus khongs zhogs shang du yod/'di sngar kha che paN chen gyi slob ma rga lo tsA ba rnam rgyal rjes rab byung bzhi pa'i me bya (1237)lo nas khong gshegs lo'i bar gong rung zhig la btab pa nges cing/rjes su rim bzhin nyams ste nang pa gur smon pa zer ba'i khyim grong zhig tu gyur pa las dge 'dun gyi sde med khar/rin chen sgang zhes pa'i dge lugs pa'i dgon pa zhig dmag 'khrug gi rkyen gyis mer bsregs/grwa pa rnams 'thor ba'i lhag ma bcu tsam zhig 'phan po zhogs phu'i sa khug sogs la sdod dgon byung bar brten (dga' ldan khri thog nyer lnga pa rgyal khang rtse pa dpal 'byor rgyal mtsho'i 'di'i rnam thar mdor bsdus (bai DUr+ya ser po'i )shog grangs 70 nas 71bar gsal/) dga' ldan khri pa 'khyur ba'i rjes su dgon pa mang po zhig gso gnang skabs sngar gyi khyim grong de gnas gzhan du spos te/rin chen sgang gi grwa pa lhag 'phros la gzhi byas te/rab byung bcu pa'i me sprel (1596)lo'i yas mas su btab cing/dge lugs kyi sngags pa grwa tshang zhig yin}
zhogs don yod mkhas grub|{'phan yul smad cung pa chu skor zhes pa'i khyim du yab tshe ring lha srung dang yum a sang gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags phag (1671)lor 'khrungs/mtshan tshe dbang ldan zhes gsol/dgung lo bdun la dga' ldan khri chen blo bzang don yod kyi drung du dge bsnyen dang bar ma rab byung sngon du 'gro ba'i dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan la don yod mkhas grub ces gsol/dge slong chos grub bsten nas klog slob la sbyangs pa mdzad/dgung lo brgyad nas bco brgyad bar la zhogs gur smon dgon du sgrigs zhugs gnang/dgung lo bcu dgu la dga' ldan byang rtser bzhugs te mkhas dbang blo bzang dge lugs bsten nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan sbyong mdzad/dgung lo nyer lnga la phebs skabs zhogs dgon pa'i dge bskos gnang/dgung lo nyer drug skabs 'khor ba'i snang tshul la thugs skyo shas 'khrungs te grub dbang byams pa chos ldan dang/rje btsun bsod nams don grub sogs bsten nas lo mang ring dben sar dka' thub drag po spyad de sgrub pa la brtson/dgung lo zhe gnyis thog sog po jun gar ba'i dmag dpung skyid shod du slebs/dgung lo zhe drug nas lo gsum ring zhogs gur smon gyi chos grwar lo ltar zla ba gsum ring lam rim gyi khrid dang/'jigs byed kyi dbang chen sogs bstsal/dgung lo nga gsum pa mi dbang bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis srid 'gan blangs nas rje nyid khong gi rtsa ba'i bla mar gyur/sku tshe gang por 'chad rtsod rtsom gsum gyi sgo nas bstan 'gro'i don mtha' yas pa mdzad/bka' rtsom la mtshon na/(bla ma mchod pa'i zab khrid thun mong ma yin pa brgyud ldan bla ma'i zhal gdams/) (lam gyi gtso bo rnam gsum gyi khrid yag rgyas pa/) (dpal gsang ba 'dus pa'i bskyed rim dngos grub rgya mtsho'i snying po/) (bra ti dge bshes rin chen don grub kyi lta ba'i skor gyi dri ba dang de'i drin lan )sogs pod gcig tsam phyag rtsom mdzad/dgung lo ri bdun bzhes pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me sbrul (1737)lor sku gshegs}
zhon wi hri|{{(WP:1,194)}las tshan zhig ste rim pa phal gras gnyis pa yin pas sa skya dpon chen las rim pa gcig gis mtho ba yod skad}
zhol chibs ra las khungs|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs zhol chibs ra las khungs zhes do dam chibs che shod drung (gnas lnga pa 'am drug pa'i las tshan pa/) (711) gnyis dang chibs drung zhes drung yig nang zan gnyis zhol chibs ra mdo sbug gi zhal ngo gsum gzim la zhal ngo rgyugs ma zhal ngo bcas yod pa 'di dag gis rnam kun gzhung rta gzhung drel lag gso tshags dang rta drel rnams rin spungs khung dang yar 'brog dkar mo gling du rtswa gsos su gtor rgyu bka' shag shod pas btang ba'i thong 'dzin ltar rta 'ul gtong rgyu rdzong gzhis khag nas rta drel gyi sga dang sga gdan sogs kyi khral bsdu len byed rgyu kong khul rdzong khag bzhi la gzim drel gyi ma rta rtsis sprod yod pa ltar lo ltar drel phrug bsdu len byed rgyu chibs sgyur skabs tA la'i bla ma'i chibs rta sga stong rgyan gyis spras pa stong khrid byed rgyu sogs kyi las 'gan yod}
zhol chibs ra'i rtswa bza'i skor|{de snga'i sne'u rdzong khul nu zhol chibs ra sbug gi chibs gdang zhes ston dus 'gro yul zhig byed kyi yod pa lo ltar bod zla bdun pa'i zla mjug lam la ra ma sgang ko sar mi hreng bco lnga skor dang ko ba bcas sgug sdod kyis chibs chen lags pa rnams chu sgrol skabs chibs chen gnyis re tsam byas te ko khrid brgyab nas 'don dgos pa/de nas lags par rnams mi hreng gis dal por khrid nas 'gro dgos pa/yam g.yas g.yon du rdo bstar dang/dkar thig bsangs bcas gtong srol yod pa/de bzhin rta rnams nyin mo rtswa bkag ces par mi hreng lnga drug tsam nas 'tsho dgos pa dang/mtshan mo gong gsal chibs rta legs par rnams chibs rar 'jug dgos la de dag la mtshan mo ster byed rtswa yang rnga dgos kyi yod/byings rtswa bkag nang mtshan mo mi bzhes zur bzhir nyal nas srung dgon kyi yod/de nas lo tog smin mtshams mang tshogs rnams bcas ma brngas zin rim bzhin snor shul du nyin mo chibs rta yongs rdzogs gtong grol yod pa de'i skabs btsas ma mjug sgril gtsang ma ma zin pa'am yan na snye sgug gtsang ma ma zin gong chibs chen zhal ngo'i sar bskyod nas nyin shar 'gyangs thabs zhes zhu ngo byed dgos kyi yod pa dang/de nas snor shul du bskyod skabs chibs ra'i lag do mi gnyis re re bskor gyis bskyod dgos par mang tshogs nas de nyid za 'thung ster dgos kyi yod/de bzhin mtshan mo bster byed gzan slong zhes rta gnyis 'khrid de gzan sgye drug bdun tsam 'khyer nas lag do go thang gcig gtong srol gyis rjes su gzan rtswa khang pa gcig gnyis tsam tshong sgyur byed kyi yod pase da'i skabs dngul rdo tshad drug cur skor yong ba de dag chibs chen zhal ngor bdag gi yod/bod zla bcu pa'i tshes bco lnga nyin zhol chibs rwar 'char can log skabs ra ma sgam ko sa bar gong gsal nas skyel sgrol dgos pa yin}
zhol gnyer las khungs|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs zhol gter las khungs zhes rtse pho brang gi 'og zhal du yod cing/'dir las byed do dam mi sna ni/zhol gnyer rtse drung mkhan chung gcig dang/shod drung rim bzhi gnyis (de snga gnas lnga pa'i las tshan pa yin )gter chung gsum/zhol drung bco lnga skor bcas yod/las khungs 'dis gtor sgong dang khrims lugs lag bstar gyi 'gan dbang zung 'brel du spyod pa yin te/de yang lha sa'i glung skor phyi'i zhol 'og gzhis khag bco brgyad la khral bsdus khrims gnon byed lugs mi dpon dang 'dra ba dang/nye 'khor gyi chu 'khor yod tshad la ljags smin zer ba'i tA la'i bla ma'i gsol zhib 'thag las kyis rtse gsol thab dang las khungs khag la gtong ba/ljags gro zhes tA la'i blam 'i bzhes gro dang/gsol mar (a'u yang zer )bsdu len bya mi gnyer nang ched 'dzugs thog nyin gnangs chags kyis mar gsar blangs te sprod gtong byed rgyu/'bri khung nas sol ba dang yangs can nas sa kar gyi khral (712) bsdus te gzhung las bzo rigs la sol ba mkho 'don dang rtse pho brango gas la dkar rag mkho 'don dang gsol rgyu'i do dam zhol dpal lding zhes pa'i btson khang la do dam dang khrims 'gal nyen can rnams la khrims gcod byed rgyu bcas yin}
zhol 'dod dpal|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs las khungs 'di rtse zhol 'dod dpal nang yod cing/'dod dpal bya ba'i khang pa 'di ni thog mar mtshur phur bka' rgyud zhwa dam ba'i dgon pa thog brtsegs bzhi ldan zhig yod pa de yin la/phyis nyis thog tu phab te bzo khang du bsgyur ba la 'dod dpal las khungs zhes grags pa yin 'dug /las khungs 'di ni lag shes bzos las pa'i 'go 'doms do dam byed mkhan dang/lag shes bzo grwa zhig yin pa 'dir do dam rtse drung (gnas drug pa )gnyis dang/bzo rigs khongs su lag rtsol mtho dma'i go rim gyi drung tog gdan thob yod pa'i dub che chung sogs rim pa yod cing/lag shes bzo las khongs gser dngul zangs lcags kyi lugs pa/dkrug pa/lcags dkrol/hrob tshags/'jam tshags/gser dngul tir tshags sogs mdor na gser dngul zangs lcags kyi bod lugs mkho chas ma tshang ma bed par bzo skrun byed thub pa'i lag rtsal mi snam mkhas can brgya phrag kha shas yod cing/snga dus spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu bdun par rgyal dbang lnga pa'i sku dus su bzo las kyi sgrig gzhi chags/rgyal dbang bdun pa'i sku dus su bzo las kyi tshogs pa btsugs nas der 'dod 'jo'i dpal 'khyil zhes btags/bzo las thad gser/zangs/lcags bcas kyi bzo dang/zhar byung du shing bzo ba 'ga' shas kyang yod/khyon bzo pa mi grangs brgya lhag tsam la/spyi'i dbang 'dzin pa ni so so'i lag rtsal mkhas can rim pas byas pa dang de min las rigs so sor yang bzo pa re yod/las rigs de'i khong su min pa'i phyi'i bzo pas lo rer 'dod dpal la bogs ma phul te/de'i 'og tu zhugs nas lag shes bzo las byas chog pa las/de 'og 'dus mi dgos par lkog tu grong dang grong khyer khag la las ka byas na tshogs pa des nyes chad gcod pa'i dbang cha yod/zhol 'dod dpal nas bzhengs pa po ta la tshe dpag lha khang nang tshe dpag stong sku/gzim chung nyi 'od nang yod pa dzek+Shim gyi sgrol ma nyer gcig de dang khyad med sgrol ma nyer gcig bkras lhun nang yod/po ta la'i gzim chung dang mchod khang khag gi lcags khra steng bkrol log bkros yod pa/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me 'brug (1716)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa'i bka' ltar gzim chung phun tshogs 'dod 'khyil du bzhugs rgyu'i nyi ma sbas pa'i lugs kyi sgrol ma nyi shu rtsa gcig dzek+Shim las grub pa dang/de'i phyi lo gzim chung bka' gdams lha khang nang gi lam rim bla rgyud dang/smyung gnas bla rgyud/gnas brtan bcu drug bcas kyi gser sku rnams zhol 'dod dpal bzo khang nas bzhengs tshul rnam thar du gsal}
zhol rdo ring phyi ma|{zhol gzhung sgo'i mdun gzhung lam gyi lho ngos su yod pa'i rdo ring phyi ma ni spyi lo'i dus rabs brgyad pa'i nang btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi sku dus su btsugs pa de'i ring tshad spyi khre bdun skor dang/zhabs stegs rdo rtsig bang rim gsum/rtse mo char khegs gru bzhi bar ring can tog dang bcas pa de'i ngos su btsan pos blon po stag sgra klu khong la gnang ba'i bka' gtsigs (zhal bzhes )kyi yi ge 'khod yod pa las nub tu yig phreng drug cu dang/shar du yig phreng bcu drug /lhor yig phreng bdun cu don bzhi bcas yod cing/byang du yi ge med}
zhol spos bzo khang|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs zhol spos bzo khang zhes par do dam rtse drung gcig (713) dang rtse phyag nang gcig rtse gnyer nang gnyis bcas yod pa de'i las 'gan ni tsan+dan dkar dmar gyis mtshon spos rgyu gang dgos rtse phyag las khungs nas zhu dgos pa dang spos brdung las mi sngar lam yar 'brog gling gzhis 'og nas rkang 'don cha gses kyis mi grangs sum cu skor lo lta zla ba bcu gnyis pa nas zhol shar sgo'i lcog tu spos brdung las 'go btsugs te zla bcu pa'i tshes shar bar spros bzo'i las grwa de nas gtso bor gzim chung gzim spos dang gzim 'dra dkyus spos bcas sang grangs gsum du dbye ste rtse phyag las khungs kyi 'bab deb nang gsal spus 'bor las ma zhan pa lo ltar zla bcu pa'i tshes nyer lnga nyin rtse phyag las khungs su rtsis 'bul zhus dgos pa yin}
zhol spyi phogs khang|{las khungs 'dir las byed do dam mi sna dza tha'i mkhan chung rim bzhi gang rung gcig dang/rtsi mgron gcig yod/'dis rgya 'bru zhes 'bru khral dang/mdo smad me she zer ba'i mar khral bsdu len thog yas mas rdzong gzhis khag nas phogs 'bru 'don 'dren gyis la sar bca' sdom dmag sgar khag la phogs sprod rgyu'i 'gan dbang spyod}
zhol las khungs|{pho brang po ta la'i ri 'dabs su yod pa'i zhol pa las khungs ni rab byung bcu gcig pa'i shing yos (1675)lor sde srid blo bzang sbyin pas btsugs shing/de thog mar zhol lcags ri phyi nang gi khrims 'doms byed po mi sna kha shas las med rung/de rjes nye 'khor rdzong gzhis khag bco brgyad zhes 'bras gling/gra bzhi/glang ru/lho mos/tshal/bde chen/chos lung/'brom thod/gdong dkar/mnyes thang/gnam/ljang/sne'u/rnam sgang/shel grong/sbrags/phreng sgo/lum pa bcas kyi khral bsdu khrims gnon dang/gyod don tshe rigs bka' shag la snyan seng zhu dgos pa las/de min rang khongs nas thag gcod byed dgos/de gar do dam pa gnas drug pa'i las tshan ser mo ba gcig dang/skye bo gnyis yod thog /skabs re las 'phar bsko srol yod pa dang/mtshams re do dam pa rim bzhi ser skyas kyang 'gan 'khur byed pa byung/do dam pa tshor gzhung yig nang zhol gter zhes 'khod pa dang/mang tshogs kyis sde pa zhol pa zhes 'bod/do dam pa'i 'og tu gnyer chung drung tog mi gnyis dang/yong bzhes khang gnyer (yong khang zer )mi gcig /zhol drung mi nyi shu skor/de'i 'og nang gzan mi nyi shu rtsa lnga yod par zhol pa nga la zer/de rnams nas rgyun gan las khungs kyi yong 'bab bsdu gtong nar mar zhu dgos/nang gzan rnams nas 'bab bsdu gtong gshor 'jal dang/nor bu gling khar bang chen du 'gro rgyu/las khungs rang khongs kyi gtong 'bru rdzong gzhis khag nas 'dren rgyu dang/tshwa/sol ba sogs bsdu ba 'gro rgyu/btson pa srung rgyu/nyes can par rta lcag bzhu rgyu/zho ston sogs mdzad sgo khag la bde 'jags tshar gshang zhu rgyu sogs kyi byed sgo'i 'go pa yong khang gis byed kyi yod/de bzhin las khungs kyi steng shod sogs gad pa mi brgyad yod pa khus so so'i sa khongs la gad brdar gtsang sbra zhu rgyun mtshon sa gnas so sar me rkun srung chu zhu dgos/de min bcu dpon mi bzhod yod pa rnams nas zhol lcags ri phyi nang dang/zhol khongs nye 'khor mang tshogs gnas yul khag la brda gtong skad rgyag byed dgos pa sogs yin/zhol skor gzim pa zhes mi bcu gnyis dang/zhal ngo gcig yod pa tshos nye skor rdzong gzhis khag sogs la zhol lus khungs kyi yi ge dang/de bzhis rtse shod khab gi yi ge skyel rgyu sogs byed dogs/zhol pa las khungs ni rtse gsol thabs tu ljags smin rgyu 'bru 'bul dmigs dang/mchod rgyun mi 'og sogs gtong 'gros che bas rgyu 'bru bsdu gtong dang khrims gnon byed rgyu ma zad/lha sa skyid chu'i chu rags la zhib bsher nyams (714) gso che chung gang dgos byed rgyu'i 'gan 'khur dang rnam kun 'char 'phar zhu bya sne mang yod pa zhig red}
zhwa gos ya ma gzugs|{mgo la gyon pa'i zhwa mo dang/lus la gyon pa'i gos gnyis mthun po med pa}
zhwa rnga ma can|{zhwa thog tu gcan gzan wa mo'i rnga ma'i 'phru btsugs pa}
zhwa thod ring po|{deng sang mtsho sngon po'i 'brog pa tshos gyon pa'i zhwa mo ring po phyu pa'i phu thung gi rtse bsdus nas bsdams te mgor gyon pa lta bu zhig 'dug pa de la zer}
zhwa mthon mthing dar phod can rma bya'i sgro phod rgyab tu 'phyang ba|{ching rgyal rabs kyi skabs su dpon rigs rnams kyis gyon pa'i zhwa mo sngon po mtha' la pags pa nag po'am/spu ma nag po'i thog skor yod pa/zhwa mo'i steng stong rgyud dmar po'i 'dzar dang/tog gi gdan gyi mtshams nas rma bya'i sgro phod rgyab tu 'phyar ba zhig /dpon rigs mtho ba rnams byu ru'i rtog dang sgro phod gnyis re yod}
zhwa 'bog|{sde pa gzhung gi drung 'khor shod drug rigs kyis gyon pa'i zhwa mo 'bog chen zer ba zhig }
zhwa dmar sku 'phreng drug pa chos kyi dbang phyug|{'bri gung gzho lung du yab 'bri gung chos rgyal phun tshogs dang yum long mo bza' g.yang 'gugs gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu pa'i shing sprel (1584)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga phebs pa sa phyi (1588)lor karma pa p+saku phreng dag pa dbang phyug rdo rjes zhwa dmar sku phreng lnga pa'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin mdzad/dgung lo bcu drug la ma phebs bar du thugs 'dzin gnang ba'i gzhung rkyang pa yang dpe tshan sum cu so gcig tsam yod/byang ngar ring dgon pa sogs dgon pa 'ga' zhig la rnam 'grel dang/dbu ma/phar phyin/'dul ba/mdzod sogs kyi grwa skor dam bca' mdzad/dgung lo bcu dgur phebs pa chu stag (1602)lor ka rma pa dbang phyug rdo rje'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/karma pa de nyid dang/mtshur phur rgyal tshab rin po che sogs bla ma mang du bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mtha' pa gsan/dbus gtsang kong po/dwags po/lho kha bcas kyi sa gnas phal che bar phebs nas so so'i 'dod mos dang mthun pa'i chos bka' gang dgos bstsal/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa drug pa sa bya (1609)lor 'jang sa tham rgyal po karma mi pham bsod nams rab brtan gyis bka' 'gyur dpar bskrun bya rgyu'i ma phyi legs pa zhig dgos zhes zhus pa ltar/de sngon rin spungs dan yod rdo rjes dbus gtsang yongs su dbang bsgyur byas skabs tshal gung thang du yod pa'i tshal pa bka' 'gyur cha tshang zhwa dmar sku phreng bzhi pa chos grags ye she la phul ba de bskur ba gnang zhing/'jam rgyal pos snga rjes su gnas 'dren yang yang 'byor ba ltar khams khul dang mtsho sngon brgyud 'jang sa tham pho brang du phebs/bka' 'gyur dpar bskrun gyi las mjug ma grub bar du lo shas bzhugs shing/de'i ring mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsungs/bka' 'gyur gyi dpar bskrun grub nas dpar khang dang bka' 'gyur la rab gnas gnang ('di rjes su li thang dgon par gdan drangs par brten yongs grags su thi lang mtshal dpar zer )de nas bar khams lho brgyud mtshur phu'i gdan sar phyir phebs gnang/dgung lo zhe drug pa sa sbrul (1629)lor stod mnga' ris brgyud nas bal yul du phebs/de khul gnas dang/mchod rten/sgrub phug sogs mjal ba gnang zhing/bal po'i rgyal po nas kyang bal yul du bzhugs ring na len gus bkur phun sum tshogs pa zhus/de nas rje btsun mi la ras pa'i sgrub gnas la phyir chu dbar du phebs/der bzhugs ring sku bsnyun nye dgung lo zhe bdun pa lcags rta (1630)lor dgongs pa bya ngan las 'das/sku gdung mtshur phur (715) spyan drangs te zhwa dmar sku phreng rim byon gyi sku gdung zhugs 'bul ma byas par dmar gdung ring por 'jog pa'i srol bzhin dngul gdung lha babs mchod rten gyi bum pa'i nang du bzhugs gsung rtsom rnams phyogs gcig tu bsdus pa'i gsung 'bum dang dkar chag mjal ma myong yang ljags rtsom gang gnang gi tho rags tsam rma thar nang 'khod 'dug cing rnam thar lo rgyus rgyas pa (karma tshang chos 'byung )pod gnyis pa'i shog grangs 128nas 150bar gsal}
zhwa dmar mkha' spyod dbang po|{rje 'di nyid yul byang bye ma lung na kha na bar ba zhes bya ba'i sa 'i char yab lha rgyal dang yum 'brog mo'i sras su rab byung drug pa'i lcags stag (1350)lor sku bltams/dgung lo drug pa la rtogs ldan grags pa seng ge'i sku skyer zhal bzhes shing/sngon gyi spyod pa rnams zhib tu gsungs/dgung lo bdun pa la ka rma rol pa'i rdo rje las dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa dang byang chub sems bskyed mnos/chos ga dang phyag rgya chen po sogs kyi khrid gsan/bde chen mkhan chen rin po che don grub dpal ba dang/slob dpon karma rol pa'i rdo rjes mdzad nas rab tu byung/mtshan ye shes dpal zhes gsol/de nas mkhan chen don grub dpal ba dang/chos rje g.yung ston pa/rje ri khrod pa sogs mkhas grub du ma'i drung las sgrol dkar gyi tshe sgrub/rgyud 'bum/mdo mang phal che ba'i lung dang/dbang rjes gnang sogs mang du gsan/khyad par du bka' brgyud kyi man ngag zab cing rgya che ba phal mo cher nan tan gyis gzigs/de nas sku mtshams dam par mdzad nas bsgoms pas/gnas nang gi sgom chen thams cad kyi spyod lam ma lus pa mngon sum du gzigs te/so so tshar gcod pa dang rjes su 'dzin pa'i zhal tog nang bas thams cad ya mtshan du gyur/dgung lo bco brgya pa la mkhan chen don grub pa dang/slob dpon 'jam dbyangs chos kyi rdo rje/gsang ston gzhon du dpal ba dge 'dun dang bcas pa'i dbus su bsnyen par rdzogs/de nas bde ba can pa slob dpon 'jam rin/0mkhas chen kun dga' 'od zer sogs las (byams chos lnga )dang/(tshad ma rnam nges/) ('dul ba mdo rtsa/) (rdo rje phreng ba'i dbang )sogs gsan/byang gi 'dam dang sog la brgyud de re shod kyi bar du phebs/skal ldan gyi gdul bya rnams la zab chos rgya cher skor/rje ri khrod pa bde bar gshegs rjes gnas nang gdan sa bla ma bsod nams 'bul ba la gtad nas ri khrod kho nar bzhugs/nyin mtshan dbyer med du rgyud gzhung la gzigs rtog dang/gtso bor thugs dam ting nge 'dzin kho na ma mi g.yel ba mdzad/de nas kong po'i yul khams thams cad du phebs/khyad par tsa ri gsar ma byin legs su yun ring du bzhugs/stag ma phu dang lkog 'phreng la bzhugs skabs grwa pa'ang sum brgya zin tsam tshogs pa la rang rang gi 'dod pa bzhin chos gsungs/dbyar dgun du zla ba gsum gsum gyi mtshams bsdams nas khrid nar mar gnang/rab byung drug pa'i sa rta (1378)lor stag rtse rnam rgyal sgang dgon pa btab/dge 'dun brgya phrag gnyis tsam 'dus/me stag (1386)lor dga' ma mo'i dgon pa phyag btab/karma de bzhin gshegs pa chung srid dang mjal pas bka' lung mang du phul zhing bzhed pa rdzogs par mdzad/karma de bzhin gshegs pa dbus su phebs pa na dpon slob stabs su mtshur phur byon/chos drug gsungs shing sog dpon rigs ral pa sogs la smin par mdzad/slar kong yul du byon sa gtso cher ri khrod kho nar bzhugs dad ldan rnams la chos kyi tshim par mdzad/shin tu rmongs pa'i gdul bya dag la'ang thabs sna tshogs kyis 'dul bar mdzad pa'i rnam thar bskyangs/gdams pa zab mo rnams mi gsal ba ches gsal bar mdzad pa'i khri (716) phreng dang nyams mgur dang bstan bcos thor bu ba'ang mang du mdzad slob mnga' karma da bzhin gshegs pa dang bka' bzhi pa rigs pa'i ral gri rin chen bzang po rdza dgon kun spangs chos kyi ye shes lha gzigs rin chen rgyal mtshan 'khrul zhig bsod nams 'bum sogs mang du byung mthar rab byung bdun pa'i shing bya (1405)lo'i bod zla bdun pa'i tshes nyer dgu la zhi bar gshegs}
zhwa dmar dge 'dun bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho|{rje 'di mdo smad du yab pad mig dang yum ma cig gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu byi (1852)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi la la mo bde chen dgon du dge bshes rong po a lags bsten nas klog bslabs/chos spyod sogs blor 'dzin mdzad/dgung lo brgyad la rje thar shul rin po che'i drung nas rab tu byung/bde chen dgon du bzhugs nas mdo sngags la gsan bsam yas dag par mdzad/dgung lo bcu drug nas bla gzhung gi drug yig gnang/dgung lo nyer bdun la khu lugs dge bshes nyi ma rin po che'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs/dgung lo so bzhi la ra rgya dgon du dam bca' 'jog par mdzad/dgung lo nyer dgu nas lnga bcu bar sku mtshams la bzhugs/dgung lo nga gcig la thar shul rin po che'i gsung 'bum dkar chag gsar rtsom gnang/dgung lo grangs nga gnyis la phebs pa ram byung bco lnga pa'i chu yos (1903)lor lde tsha bkra shi chos sdings gsar du bskrun nas mtshan nyid btsugs/dgung lo nga bdun lor chos sde chen po la mo bde chen dgon par rgyun ja'i thebs btsugs/bka' rtsom la mtshon na/(skyabs rje kirti rin po che blo bzang 'phrin las kyi rnam thar )dang/byang chub bde lam gyi khrid dmigs skyong tshul shin tu gsal bar bkod pa dge legs 'od snang 'gyed pa'i nyin byed/) (rngog dkyil bdun las ma rgyud dkyil 'khor drug dang rdor dbyangs dbang gi brjed byang gdung sel bdud rtsi'i khrus rdzing/(rgyal ba'i bka' 'gyur rin po che'i thob yig nor bu'i phreng mdzes/) (me tog bcud len gyi zin bris mdor bsdur dka' thub spyod pa'i rgyan/) (dpal gsang ba'i bdag po 'khor lo chen po'i sgrub thabs mdor bsdus bdud sde zil gyis gnon pa'i bzhad sgra/) (blo sbyong tshig brgyad ma'i khrid kyi zin bris skal bzang spyi nor/) (snyan ngag gi bstan bcos chen po me long gi rgyan rnams kyi dogs gcod 'phro can/) de bzhin 'gro mgon shing bzang rin po che'i rnam thar dang zhwa dmar lam rim sogs kyi bka' rtsom pod 'bring dgu tsam bzhugs pa dang/rgyal dbang thub bstan rgya mtsho mchog la gsung chos kyang phul/dgung grangs re gcig la phebs pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu byi (1912)lor dgongs pa gzhan du gshegs}
zhwa dmar dge slong nam mkha' 'od|{zhwa dmar tshul khrims dpal gyi sku skye dge slong nam mkha' 'od ni rab byung gnyis pa'i chu glang (1133)lor yab dgon pa don grub bla ma dang yum lha mo lcam gnyis kyi sras su ru mtshams kyi sa'i char sku 'khrungs/dgung lo brgyad dgu la phebs skabs chos rje dus gsum mkhyen pa la phul nas phyag phyir 'bral med du lo brgyad dgu tsam bzhugs/byis pa'i spyod pa med pas mos gus kyis bla ma bsten zhing gdams pa dmag med mdzad/chos rje khams su gshegs rjes gangs dkar dang/se mo do dang/kha rag dang/thang lha la sogs pa'i dben pa rnams su bsgoms/mtshams bar du 'gro mgon zhang dang/lho pa dang/skyer sgang pa dang/gling la sogs pa dam pa mang du mjal zhing gdams pa gsan/khyad par bde gshegs (717) stag lung thar pa la dad pa rab tu thob nas chos zhus gtso bo sgrub pa kho na mdzad chos rje dbus su phebs rjes gdams pa lhag ma dang rjes su gdams pa dpag tu med pa gnang de nas lo bcu bdun du mtshams 'bab zhig mdzad grub pa'i rtags mtshan yang 'ga' re rnyed par gyur mthar dgung lo drug cu rtsa bdun rab byung gsum pa'i sa lug (1199)lor sku gshegs}
zhwa dmar chos dpal ye shes|{rje 'di nyid yab bsam grub dar yum bar bza' gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bdun pa'i me khyi (1406)lor yum myang po khre brag mdor sku 'khrungs/sku chung ngu nas bla ma chos bzang ba dang dge slong dbon grags pa la zab chos mang du gsan/dgung lo brgyad zhes pa la kong dbus kyi sa mtshams bar mdor chos rje de bzhin gshegs pa dang mjal nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/de nas stag rtse chos rjes mkhan po dang/blo gros rgyal mtshan dpal bzang pos slob dpon mdzad nas rab tu byung/chos rje'i drung du khrid dang dbang dang lung la sogs pa dpag tu med pa gsan/dgung lo bcu gsum la snye bor byon/de nas kong po'i dgon gnas rnams kyi dar rgyas spel zhing/ba yo la sogs par bzhugs/tsa ri bkra shis rdzongs su che dpag med kyi sgrub pa mdzad pas zhal mngon sum du gzigs/de nas 'ol kha bkra shis thang du phebs nas mtshal min rin po che bsod nams bzang po dang mjal te bsnyen par rdzogs/brag gsum dang/'jam ne/dmar tsha thung/rngon a rigs rnams su phebs nas chos mang du gsungs/de nas byang lam brgyud de mtshur phur phebs/bla ma gangs pa dbang phyug rgyal mtshan la ni gu'i chos skor/'tshal pa'i chos skor/do ha la sogs pa gsan/de nas dbur stong nas myang po brgyud kong por phebs/mtshur ston chos kyi rin chen dang/chos rje mthong ba don ldan/mkhan chen shAkya grags pa sogs las zab chos mang du gsan/sum mkhar gyi sa char sku mtshams shin tu dam par mdzad de bzhugs/de nas kong po brgyud lho rong dang/ri bo che rnams su byon/yor mda' dang lha stengs rnams su rab byung bsnyen rdzogs kyi mkhan po zhu ba mang du byung/mthar dgung lo bzhi bcu zhe bdun la phebs par rab byung brgyad pa'i chu sprel (1452)lor dga' ma mor zhi bar gshegs}
zhwa dmar rtogs ldan grags pa seng ge|{zhwa dmar sku phreng dang po 'di nyid yab stag chung dang/yum a rgod bza'i sras su rab byung lnga pa'i chu lug (1238)lor sku bltams/dgung lo lang nas sgrol ma'i zhal gzigs pa dang/byis pa'i dus nas mngon par shes pa thogs med du byung/dgu lo bcu gsum la rje khol pa'i slob ma blo gros grags pa'i drung du dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa mnos/der lo gnyis bzhugs rjes bsnyen pa la brtson par mdzad/dgung lo bcu bdun pa la bla ma ye shes seng ge'i drung du rab tu byung/de la lhan bskyed dang/jo mo hrIHbskyed bcas gsan/khyad par du thabs lam gyi khrid zhus pas drod par can skyes/na bza' ras rkyang res chog pas dbrang gu ras par grags/de nas dbus su byon nas sa sprel (1308)lor mtshur phur phebs/der slob dpon tshul rin dang slob dpon bsod nams seng ge /gnam bar gyi slob dpon dbu ma ba bcas las gsang 'dus kyi dbang dang/lnga tshan lnga'i dbang/bde dgyes kyi dbang sogs mang du gsan/de nas gsang phur byon nas bla chos pa 'jam dbyangs shAkya gzhon nu dang/zur chos pa slob dpon blo gros mtshungs med la gtugs nas mtshan nyid kyi sde snod sa sde lnga dang/byams chos lnga dang/tshan ma rnam nges dang/sdud pa dang spyod 'jug la sogs pa mang du zhus/khyad par phar phyin gyi TIka zhig brtsams/ (718) phar phyin la mchog tu mkhas pas gtsang phyogs la grwa skor du byon te phar phyin gyi chos skad byang ba'i snyan pa thob gsang phur bzhugs dus rgya brag chos rje la zhi byed mtha' bral gsum gyi gdams pa ngo sprod dang dbu ma lugs kyi sems bskyed zhus der lo bdun bzhugs de nas sgom pa la zhugs pas nyams bzang po thon cing sgyu lus dang rmi lam la rtsal thon pa byung sa skyar phebs skabs lo tsA ba blo gros brtan pa dang mjal nas don dam bsnyen pa dang sgrub thabs rgya mtsho'i lus zhus de nas rdzong drug la byon te brag dkar dang khu byug dben pa rdzong dang brag dmar gsum du shas cher bzhugs shing thugs dam yang shin tu 'phel de'i phyogs su lo gsum bzhugs lo ril po lnga'i rab tu bde chen du thugs dam la bzhugs shing chos mang du gsan mkhan chen gzhon du byang chub dang slob dpon bkra shis rin chen la sogs pa las bsnyen par rdzogs bde chen gyi gdan sar bskos kyang zhal ma bzhes de nas gsang phur blam ston dur la nA ro mkha' spyod skor zhus de la thugs dam gyi mthil mdzad bya lo nas gnas nang btab dge 'dun yang brgya lhag tsam tshogs der 'gro don yun ring du mdzad rje 'di nyid kyis zhing khams mang du gzigs pa dang bar do mngon sum du gzigs pas de dag gi don rgya chen mdzad pa dang sgom chen pa'i gegs mang du bsal ba la sogs pa rnams ni bgrang gis mi langs mthar dgung lo drug cu re bdun bzhes pa rab byung drug pa'i sa glang (1349)lor dgongs pa zhi dbyings su gshegs rje 'di la slob ma shin tu mang po byung yang bu chen bzhir grags pa ni g.yag sde paN chen mkhas grub dar ma rgyal mtshan bcas so/_}
zhwa dmar ba tshul khrims dpal|{'di nyid yab dge bsnyen 'byung song dang yum sgrol ma 'bum gnyis kyi sras su rab byung gnyis pa'i me byi (1096)lor dbu ru stod du sku 'khrungs/rje sgam po khu dbon gyi spyan sngar byon/gdung lo bcu dgur phebs skabs khu dbon gyi drung du tshig rdzogs mdzad/mtshan tshul khrims dpal du gsol/bka' gdams kyi dge ba'i bshes gnyen mang po dang/rje ras chug pa sogs bla ma mang du bsten/gtso bor rje khu dbon gnyis la sangs rgyas dngos kyi 'du shes skyes pas rtsa ba'i bla mar bzung/mthar dgung lo so bdun pa rab byung gnyis pa'i chu byi (1132)lor sku gshegs}
