gzhung 'bru spyi mdzod khang|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung 'og gi las khungs shig ste/bod rab byung bcu drug pa'i me bya (1957)lor gzhung 'bru spyi mdzod khang btsugs pa der do dam pa thog ma srid zur glang mdun kun dga' dbang phyug (gung )dang/dza tha'i gnyis/mkhan rim gnyis/las bya ser skya nyi shu skor/drung yig gsum bcas yod cing/las khungs de btsugs rjes de snga'i rdzong gzhis khag gi gzhis 'bru'i 'bab deb tshang ma (726) rtsis khang lam khungs dang 'bab zhib las khungs su yod pa rnams dang so nams las khungs dang rtse shod gnyer tshang las khungs zhol gnyer zhol spyi phogs khang lha sa tshe gling do dam dbus gtsang 'bru phogs chos 'bru do dam bcas 'bru rigs bsdu gtong las khungs khag gi khongs nas zhol gnyer nas rtse shod gsol thab tu ljags gro ljags smin phug dkar 'bul dgos pa sogs rang 'jags su bzhag pa phud de byings 'bru rigs las khungs tshang ma zla bsgril nas gzhung 'bru spyi mdzod khang nas sngar lam mchod rgyun khag dang gzhung zhabs ser skya rtse shod nang gzan gad khang khag gi phogs thob dmag phogs gzhan yang ar las dgos 'bru sogs 'char 'phar gyi 'bru rigs gong gzhi gang yod nar gtong dgos pa yin}
