bzhi mchod|{bod zla bcu pa'i tshes nyi shu bzhi nyin ni/chos sde chen po se ra theg chen gling thog mar phyag 'debs par mdzad mkhas byams chen chos rje shAkya ye shes gang nyid dgongs rdzogs dus mchod nyin mo zhig yin/de'ang sngar twa ming gong mas shar rgyal ba tsong kha pa chen po'i snyan pa gsan nas gseng yig pa mang po lung dang 'bul skyes rgya nom pa dang bcas gdan 'dren par mngags pa la dang por cung zad bden pa 'drar mngon chung du bzhugs te mjal du ma gnang/rjes su mi dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan dang dpon nam mkha' bzang po bcas ngo chen du sbran nas gser yig pa rnams la mjal kha gnang rung/rgya yul du 'byon par dgag cha che zhing dgos pa chung ba'i zhal ta nan gyis gnang nas gser yig pa rnams phyir log /gong mar rgyu mtshan zhus pas slar yang rje nyid phebs mi thub pa de bzhin yin na'ang/rjes nyid dang khyed med pa'i slob ma zhig dbu blar dgos tshul phebs pas bod rang byung bdun pa'i sa byi (1408)byams chen cho sa rje shAkya ye shes gang nyid rje tsong kha pa'i bka' slob ltar nang sar phebs nas gong ma yung lo rgyal po dang mjal/gong ma'i snyun gzhi bcos shing dgon pa btab pa dang/ri bo dga' ldan pa'i phyag len dar bar mdzad pas gong ma rgyal pos 'phrin las sna tshogs la mkhas shing gsal ba/chos nyid dam pa mchog tu rgyal ba/shes rab rnam dag snang ba chen po kun tu khyab cing rgyal khams skyob pa/bstan pa rgyas mdzad rab tu dge ba byams chen chos kyi rgyal po zhes pa'i mtshan dang/'ja' sa/'bul ba bsam gyis mi khyab pa mdzad nas 'gran zla med pa'i dbu blar mnga' gsol/de nas lo shas (728) bzhugs te bod du phyir phebs de rjes slar yang gdan zhu byung ba ltar gong ma'i pho brang du phebs nas sras zon tes yab rgyal po las kyang gus btud che bar mdzad rab byung bdun pa'i shing yos (1435)lo'i zla 10tshes 24nyid dbus su phebs pa'i lam bar mdzo mo mkhar du zhi bar gshegs chos rje 'di nyid mdzad rjes shin tu che bar brten gya bod hor gsum grub mtha' ris med kyi skya ser mtha' dag gis khong la dran gso zhu ba'i 'das mchod kyi mchod sprin rgya cher spro ba'i rgyun srol byung ba ltar de nyid kyi gdong mor se 'bras dka' gsum sogs chos sde khag dang rtse pho brang gtsug lag khang de bzhin lha zhol grong mi bcas pa'i yangs steng ngam sge'u khung gi mdun ngos su mar me'i phreng ba tshar du dngar ba'i gling me'i me mchod spor ba de la bzhi mchod ces 'bod pa yin pas lo ltar bod zla bcu pa'i tshes nyi shu bzhi'i nyin bzhi mchod dang de'i phyi nyin tshes nyer lnga nyin rje tsong kha pa chen po'i dgong rdzogs mchod pa 'bul dga' ldan lnga mchod ces pa yin pas nyin de gnyis kyi mtshan mo bod ljongs kyi grong khyer lte ba lha sar cha mtshon na pho brang po ta la dang gtsug lag khang dgon sde khag yul mi so so bcas nag thog stengo gas la mchod me spar lhag par tshes nyer lnga nyin mchod me zab rgyas spar thog pho brang po ta la dang gtsug lag khang dgon sde khag bcas kyi yar steng nas dung chen dang rgya gling gi snyan gsan btang byis pa tshos g.yag gi lgang bzhu 'khyer te bar skor du bskyod de nyid phyag skor mchod 'bul byed mi mang la dgong zas su bag thug 'thung srol de yang mya ngan mtshon byed yin zer de nyid nas dpon rigs rnams dgun chas gyon rtse pho brang du mdzad sgo yang yod}
bzhi sde snyung gnas lha khang|{bzhi sde dgon pa'i shar lho'i mtshams su yod pa'i snyung gnas lha khang ni spyi lo'i dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i nang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin tshe chog gling dkar chen ye shes rgyal mtshan gyi slob ma snyung gnas bla ma ye shes bzang pos bzhengs shing/rten gtso spyan ras gzigs bcu gcig zhal phyag stong spyan stong gi sman sku thog tshad sogs yod pa'i lha khang ka brgyad ma der bod zla bzhi pa'i nang lha sa ba tshos snyung gnas tshugs srol yod cing/lha khang de'i 'dzin bdag bzhi ste grwa tshang nas byed}
bzhi sde bsam gtan gling|{de ni lha sa ra mo che'i lho nub phyogs rgyang thag le dbar gang tsam sar gnas yod cing/(chos 'byung bai DUr+ya ser po )yi nang/ra mo che bzhi sde ni tshal pa khri dpon dga' sde bzang pos rgyas btab gtsug lag khang (ra mo che )du mchod 'bul ba bzhi grwa btsugs pas ming bzhi sde ba zhes btags par grags shing zhes gsal ba dang/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i rnam thar (dpag bsam rin po che'i snye ma )zhes pa'i nang bzhi sde grwa tshang 'di nyid mnga' bdag khri ral gyi dus lha ldan sprul pa'i gtsug lag khang gi phyogs bzhir dge 'dun gyi sde re btsugs pa'i gras dga' ba zhes pa yin tshul dang/phyis tshal pa khri dpon gyis kyang 'phel rgyas su btang skad 'dug na'ang zhes sogs gsal la/spyi lo'i dus rabs dgu pa'i nang rgyal po glang nar mas sangs rgyas chos lugs snubs kyis skabs dgon pa 'di yang gtor bshig phog pa dang/yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hu pi li'i skabs tshal pa khri dpon dga' bden dpal (rab byung lnga pa'i me glang (1277)nas rab byung lnga pa'i lcags glang (1301)lo bar khri dpon byas )gyi rgyab skyor 'og bzhi sde grwa tshang de sngon ma'i mang gzhi'i thog rgya bskyed dang dge 'dun zhal grangs nyi shu lhag tsam 'phar snon thog tshal pa'i mnga' khongs nas mchod gzhis khag gcig (729) 'bul sbyor byas rab byung bcu gcig pa'i nang gtsang pa'i dmag 'khrug ma byung bar du rme ru grwa tshang gi mkhan pos gcig lcogs su 'dzin skyong gnang mun yin kyang de nas rme ru ba dang bzhi sde gnyis grwa tsang so sor kha bral te slob dpon zur du bsko ba'i 'go tshugs dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i mjug tsam la rwa sgreng ho thog thu sku phreng gnyis pa khri chen bstan pa rab rgyas (khong gi sku phreng gong ma ngag dbang mchog ldan gyis dga' ldan khri pa gnang myong stabs sku phreng 'di la yang khri chen gyi mtshan thogs pa tsam las dngos su dga' ldan khri pa gnang myong med )chos phyogs kyi mdzad 'phrin rgya che zhing chos lugs kyi mdzad sgom nga che ba bzhi sde dgon par gnang bar brten bzhi sde grwa tshang dang bla slob kyi 'brel ba dam zab chags te dgon pa'i las na grwa dmangs spyi mos thog nas re 'dun zhus pa ltar dgon pa'i 'dzin bdag nang thog dgon pa 'di sngar bas gzhi rgya che ba'i nyams gso rgya bskyed byung ba nas bzung rwa sgreng ho thog thu sku phreng rjes ma rnams lha sar bzhugs yul gyi lte ba lta bur gyur cing man ching gong mas kyang dga' ldan bsam gtan gling zhes pa'i bsngags brjod sgo byang yang gnang yod la sku phreng snga ma'ip+sakabs ltar no mon han gyi mtshan gnas rang 'jags yod pa'i thog tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gcig pa dang bcu gnyis pa sku na phra mo'i skabs rwa sgreng nas bod sa gnas kyi srid skyong 'gan bzhes snga rjes thengs gnyis tsam gnang ring slar yang bzhi sde dgon par sngar las lhag pa'i rgya bskyed byung ste lha sar yod pa'i gling khag bzhi'i nang nas bkod pa legs shing rgya khyon che shog kyi gras shig tu rtsi thog pa byung bod rba byung bcu bzhi'i chu khyi (1862)lor 'bras spungs rigs grwa'i gtong sgo dngul bsgyur btang ba'i rkyen dang srid 'dzin las dam thugs 'dod ltar gnang ba sogs kyis rkyen byas 'bras spungs dang dga' ldan khongs gtogs kyi gzhung zhabs mtho dman mang pos ngo log byas te srid skyong rwa sgreng dgongs zhu gnang dgos pa'i las 'gul byung ba dang dus mtshungs se ra dgon pa dang sa gnas srid gzhung bar dmag zing langs te dgon pa 'dir gtor skyon che tsham phog pa ma zad rwa sgreng srid skyong ring nyid kyang srid 'dzin gyi phyag thab bsnams te sku 'bum brgyud rgya nag tu bros byol phebs dgos byung zhing sa gnas srid gzhung nas rwa sgreng gi srid skyong mtshan gnas med par bzos te ho thog thu'i go nas rang 'jags thog yangap+sarid mu mthun gdan 'dren zhus chog pa dang rwa sgreng sku phreng gong ma tsho'i skabs kyi 'dzin dbang mchod gzhis mi ser rnams sngar rgyun 'dzin bdag chog pa ma gtogs srid skyong 'di'i skabs srid gzhung gis gsar du phul ba'i mchod gzhis mi ser rnams gzhung bzhes byed rgyu'i gdan 'bebs byas de rjes rwa sgreng sku phreng bzhi pa ngag dbang ye shes smon lam gyis tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum par snyan zhu phul thog rwa sgreng bla brang gi 'dzin khongs