zur chung shes rab grags pa|{(bde gshegs rgya bo pa yang zhu )gsang sngags rnying ma'i slob dpon zur mes dbon rnam gsum gyi ya gyal/bod shing stag 1014)lor sku 'khrungs/zur po che'i slob ma rtse mo bzhi'i ya gyal lta dgongs kyi rtse mor gyur pa yin/zla ma'i bka' bzhin mdo dgongs 'dus gsungs pas dus gcig la dpe 'grems sum brgya byung/brag rgya bo dgu 'dus kyi rtser sgrub pa mdzad de rdzogs chen mngon par spobs pa mtha' yas par gyur pas bde gshegs rgya bo par grags/spyir bde gshegs 'di rje 'ug pa lung pa'i dgongs pa ji ltar ba bzhin du longs pa/mkhyen pa thams cad bum pa gang bya'o tshul du mnga' ba/chos kyi don la blo gros kyi spobs pa mchog dang ldan pa lags so/_/mthar rab byung dang po'i shing stag (1074)lor 'bum pa'i bsnyun gyis sku 'das/'di nyid la slob ma ka ba bzhi/gdung brgyad/lcam bcu drug /dral ma sum cu gnyis/sgom chen mi gnyis/yus po che mi gcig /dkyus pa mi gnyis/sta gur mi gnyis/go ma chod mi gsum la sogs pa mang du byung ngo/_}
