zur po che shAkya 'byung gnas|{gsang sngags rnying ma'i slob dpon zur mes dbon rnam gsum gyi ya gyal/'di nyid bod chu stag (1002)lor sku 'khrungs/tshangs spyod kyi dge bsnyen du bzhugs/'ug pa lung gi lha khang bzhengs pas 'ug pa lung pa zhes grags/chos lung gi myang ye shes 'byung gnas la sogs pa bla ma mang po bsten nas sgyu 'phrul dang/sems phyogs/bdud rtsi/gsang dbang dang thabs lam sogs zhus/rtsa rgyud dang bshad rgyu 'grel pa sgrub thabs so sor phyes te gsungs/khong gis bstan pa phyi dar la snga 'gyur gyi bstan pa'i rtsa ba btsugs/sgro phug gi lha khang brtsigs/mthar dgung lo drug cu rtsa gnyis par rab byung dang po'i chu stag (1062)lor sku gshegs/'di nyid la slob ma rtse mo bzhi rtse lkog dang lnga/sgom chen brgya rtsa brgyad sogs mang}
