zla ba grags pa|{(slob dpon zla ba grags pa )tshal pa kun dga' rdo rjes mdzad pa'i (deb ther dmar po )nang slob dpon 'di 'dzam gling rgyan drug gi gras su bgrangs 'dug kyang/bod kyi lo rgyus yongs su grags su slob dpon ar+ya de ba bgrangs pa las/slob dpon 'di bgrang srol med/slob dpon 'di slob dpon klu sgrub kyi dngos slob yin min la bshad srol mi 'dra ba sna tshogs 'dug kyang slob dpon rang nyid kyis mdzad pa'i (gsang ba 'dus pa'i rtsa rgyud kyi 'grel pa sgrol gsal )nang slob dpon klu sgrub kyi dngos slob yin par gsungs pa ma zad jo bo rje dpal ldan a ti shas mdzad pa'i (byang chub lam sgron )las kyang/slob dpon 'di slob dpon klu sgrub kyi dngos slob yin par gsungs pas de la nor 'khrul med/sku 'khrungs pa'i yul rgya gar lho phyogs a man+tar yin cing/chung dus nas rig gnas mtha' dag lam khas par sbyangs/lho phyogs kyi rgyud de nyid du rab tu byung/slob dpon klu sgrub dang/slob dpon sangs rgyas bskyangs dang/slob dpon legs ldan 'byed kyi slob ma mang po las mdo sngags kyi chos mang po gsan cing/lhag par du dbu ma'i gzhung nang gsang sngags kyi gzhung la sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa mdzad/na len+d+ra yi dgon pa'i mkhan po yun ring du mdzad de sku tshe'i smad du rang nyid kyi 'khrungs yul lho phyogs kyi rgyud byon nas lha khang dang dgon pa mang po btab/dgung lo sum brgya tsam bzhugs zer ba bden min ji ltar yang sku tshe ring po bzhugs par mngon te gong gi slob ma rigs pa'i khu byung che ba dang/de'i slob ma rigs pa'i khu byug chu ba )bla ma byams pa'i rnal 'byor pa )yin la/de'i slob ma jo bo chen po a ti sha yin cing/jo bo chen po ni bod kyi rab byung gong gi chu rta (982)lor sku 'khrungs pa dang/dgung lo drug cu re gcig pa bod kyi rab byung dang po'i lcags 'brug (1040)lo'i lo mjug la rgya gar nas bal yul brgyad mnga' ris su phebs pa yin pas mgon po klu sgrub kyi sku tshe'i smad du dus rabs dang po 'go tshugs pa nas/jo bo chen pa 'khrungs pa'i bar dus rabs dgu la lo dgu brgya lhag tsam yod pa tshang mas mkhyen gsar ltar sangs rgyas chos lugs la lhag bsam rnam dag gis dad