zlos gar gyi mtshams sbyor lnga dang de'i yan lag dang bcas nga dgu|{mtshams sbyor lnga ni/sgo/lan gyi sgo/snying po/mi bzod pa/nges thub bo/_/de'i yan lag la/1 nye bar len pa/nye bar mgo ba/yongs su 'jog pa/rnam par sred pa/rig pa/thob pa/dbye bar byed pa'o/_/2 yongs su 'gro ba/rnam par 'dar ba/gdung ba/rtsed mo/rtsed mo'i mdangs/rab tu 'gro ba/'gal ba/nyer bar gnas pa/ma dag pa/skye bo 'god par rtsom pa/ye ge bsdu ba'o/_/3 ma byung ba/dper brjod pa/lam gyi rang bzhin dper brjod pa'i rim pa bsdu ba/rjes su dpag pa/slong ba/brtag dpyad/gzer ba/stobs lhag pa/yid 'byung ba/'tshab pa'o/_/4 rgol ba/'thor ba/'dzag pa/nus pa/phan tshun du gnas pa/'gro ba pa gsal ba/'byed pa/'gog pa/'gal ba len pa/'drid pa/rab tu sred pa/5 mtshams sbyor/'gog pa/spel ba/gtan la phab pa/smod pa gsal ba/rab dwangs/kun dga'/dus/nyes par sbed pa/bsam pa snga ma 'chad pa/snyan ngag bsdu ba/rang gi ston pa bcas so/_}
