gzim khang sprul sku grags pa rgyal mtshan|{sprul sku grags pa rgyal mtshan ni paN chen bsod grags kyi sprul sku sku phreng bzhi pa yin pa dang/stod lung gad kha sar rab byung bcu pa'i sa lug (1619)lor sku 'khrungs/dang thog rgyal ba'i yang srid du re yang paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan nas gzim khang gong gi sprul skur ngos 'dzin gnang nas dgung lo drug steng khri la mnga' gsol zhing/paN chen nyid kyis grags pa rgyal mtshan zhes mtshan du gnang/paN chen sku phreng bzhi pa nas dge tshul slong gi sdom pa bzhes/paN chen sku phreng bzhi pa dang/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa sogs du ma bsten nas mdo lugs kyi chos mang du gsan/'bras spungs blo gsal gling dang/skyor mo lung/rwa ba stod sogs su mtshan nyid la gsan sbyong gis 'chad rtsod mdzad/'ol dga' chos lung dang/ri bo dge 'phel sogs su bsnyen sgrub la brtson par mdzad pas mkhas btsun bzang po'i grags pa che ba byung/dus der grags rgyan dang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa gnyis ka mtshan snyan che/rgyun du 'bras spungs gzim khang gong 'og ces 'bod cing/ (750) lha sa'i smon lam gyi gral dbur yang rgyal ba'i bzhugs khri'i 'khris su gzim khang gong gi sprul sku bzhugs khri'i thob gzos che khams sogs kyi 'grub pa gtos che lha sar yong ste gzim khang gong gi sprul sku grags rgyal la mjal kha zhu mkhan ni tA la'i blam sku phreng lnga pa las lhag pa lta bu byung ba sogs rgyu rkyen du mar sde srid bsod nams chos 'phel gyis gtso mdzad dga' ldan pho brang ste gzim khang 'og gi las byed rnams phrag dog gis grags rgyan sku bkrongs rgyu'i skabs 'tshol ba'i dus der dgung grangs so brgyad la son skabs grags rgyan gyi 'khrungs khang gad kha sa pa'i mag pa nang so nor bu zhes sde srid bsod nams chos 'phel gyi sku mched yin pa des me sprel (1656)zla 5tshes 13nyin mgul mgrin nang dar brdzangs dang bkrongs rjes gdung rten dngul gdung bzhengs te 'bras spungs gzim khang gong dub ga kyang rjes su sprul sku dregs par bzhengs tshul gyi gleng brjod dang bcas gdung rten khang pa dang bcas pa bshigs te dmar gdung gtsang chur bshams pa lho kh