'u shang lha khang|{'u shang rdo dpe med bkra shis dge 'phel gyi gtsug lag khang zer/'di grong khyer lha sa'i lho nub skyid chu'i che 'gram du (du lta chu shul rdzong tshal sna chos khongs )gnas shing/de ni bod rgyal zhe gcig pa khri gtsug lde btsan ral pa can (815nas 836)gyis srid dbang bzung ring bzhengs pa'i lha khang zhig yin/rgyal po'i thugs dam gyi rten zhes bzhengs pa'i sa phud lha sar byams pa chos 'khor gyi sgo gsung tshangs pa dang/brgya byin/shing phud gnam yangs ka ba bzhi rin po ches brgyad te phul/ri mo'i bris phud du be'u 'bum brgya dang brgyad bris/lugs ma'i phud du cong dril rnams phul/yang phud la yer par yang mchod rten bzhengs so/_/de nas rgyal po ral pa can gyi sku tshe'i smad spyi lo'i dus rabs dgu par/li'i yul nas rig byed lam khas pa'i bzo bo dang/bal yul nas lha bzo/rdo bzo ba mang po bos nas lha khang khyung nam mkha' dang brgya khyon lha sa 'phrul snang gi gtsug lag khang dang mnyam pa dgu thog 'og gi thog gsum sgo dpe dang bcas pa rdo las grub/bar gyi thog gsum sgo dpe dang bcas pa so phag las grub/steng gi thog gsum sgo dpe dang bcas pa shing las grub/thog re rer bya 'dab dang pha gu dra phyed shar bu mda' yas rnams kyis mdzes par byas pa/bya 'dab rnams kyi bar du lo paN chos bsgyur ba 'chad rtsom gyi bya ba mdzad bzhin pa'i ri mo/thog re re nas glo 'bur gyi sgo dang/sgo khyams dang rta babs kyis mdzes pa/yang rtse'i bya 'dab kyi rtser gser gyi gany+dzi ra rtse mo rgyab ri mdun ma'i rtse dang mnyam pa'i g.yas g.yon du g.yu 'brug spras pa de yang rtse'i rgyal phebs steng rlung gis bskyod pa na bar snang du dbu gdugs 'khor ba ltar 'khor thub pa/rlung che ba na zur bzhir lcags thag btang ste rdo'i seng ge la btags pa/rgya phebs kyi mtha' la rin po che sna tshogs pa'i phreng ba dang/gdugs dang/rgyal mtshan dang/'phan dang gser gyi dril bu'i 'phreng ba phyogs kun tu 'khrol ba/lta bas chog mi shes pa/'gran zla med pa'i gtsug lag khang de bzhengs pa'i steng thog gsum nang thugs dam gyi rten sku gsung thugs rnams bzhugs/sku rnams rgya gar yul db