'og min gyi gnas nyer bzhi|{dza lan d+ha ra (kha che dang rgya gar bar rdo la me 'bar/) purna gi ri/ra me shwa ro/de wi ko ta (lha mo mkhar/) ko sa la (rgyal po gsal rgyal gyi yul/) ko ling ka (lho phyogs dpal gyi ri )zhes mkha' spyod brgyad do/_/a bur ta/ma ha wa (lho phyogs rgya mtsho'i 'gram gling phran nub phyogs d+ho 'jog /) lam pa ka o Te/ka ma ru (shing gi ri ste gam po gnas )kan+tsi na (rdo rje gnas kyi lhun po/) twi sha ku ne/so so raSh+Ta (tu ru ka'i sa )zhes sa spyod brgyad/hi ma la ya )bod tsa ri'am gangs ti se/) pre ta pu ri (bod yul/) g+h+rI ha d+he wa/su lta/su waN gling (rgya gar shar phyogs gser gling/) ma ru/nA ga ra (nA ga ra'i yi ge 'byung ba'i yul )zhes sa 'og spyod pa brgyad}
'og min stug po|{'og min dang 'og min sdug pa gnyis don mi gcig ste/'og min ni theg dman 'phags pa rnams skye ba len pa'i gnas shig dang/theg pa chen po'i mdo las gsungs pa'i 'og min chen po rgyan stug po bkod pa ni/gnas ris bcu bdun gyi 'og min de'i steng du dbang phyug chen po'i gnas 'og min stug po bkod pa zhes sa bcu pa'i dbang byug rnams skye ba'i gnas rigs bco brgyad pa zhig yod pa de yin pa'i phyir te/(lang gshegs )las/'dod pa khams dang gzugs med du/_/sangs rgyas rnam par sangs mi rgya/_/gzugs kyi khams kyi 'og min du/_/'dod chags bral khyod 'tshang rgya'o/_/zhes gsungs so/_/'on kyang theg dman grub mtha' smra ba gnyis kyis 'og min stug po bkod pa'i zhing khas mi len no/_}
