'og min smin cing grol ba'i gling|{(o rgyan smin (766) grol gling )gsang sngags rnying ma'i gdan sa chen po gnyis kyi nang tshan o rgyan smin grol gling ste rtsod med yongs su grags pa'i gter ston brgya rtsa'i nang tshan gter bdag gling pa 'gyur med rdo rjes rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags phag (1671)lor dgon pa 'di'i thog ma'i rnam gzhi bting zhing de nas lo ngo lang song ba'i me 'brug (1676)lor gtsug lang khang lte ba gsar du btab (deng sang bod rang skyong ljongs gra nang rdzong gra phyi chus/) bod kyi rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me bya (1717)lor sog po jun gar tshe dbang rab brtan gyis btang ba'i dmag dpung bod du 'byor nas dgon pa 'di sogs bod sa gnas su yod pa'i rnying ma'i dgon pa mang che ba gtor zhing rdo rje brag rig 'dzin chen po pad+ma 'phrin las dang lo chen d+harma shri sogs rnying ma'i bla chen mang po sku bkrongs pa sogs gtor bshig tshabs chen byung de nas pho lha tha'i ji bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis bon sa gnas kyi srid dbang bzung rjes rim bzhin dgos pa 'di sogs rnying ma'i dgon sde che ba rnams rim bzhin sngar rgyun bskyar gso byed thub pa byung ba yin}
