'od 'jo ba zhabs drung bkra shis chos kyi rgyal po|{'od 'jo zhabs drung bkra shis chos kyi rgyal po ni rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags byi (1660)lor yab gi zi'i gdung las 'khrungs shing/gong sa lnga pa las dge tshul slong bsgrubs pa'i mtshan kun dga' bsod nams mchog grub ces gsol/sa bya (1669 )lo nas sa lug (1679)lo bar stang lug gi khrir bzhugs/dbon bgres pa rdzong zhabs drung gi thugs sna gdon gyis zin nas gzhung sar zhu gtugs kyis khri las phab te 'od 'jor bzhugs pa'i mtshan yang 'od 'jo zhabs drung du grags/zhal ngo nang ma gshin pa'i rkyen gyis stag lung gi lugs gnyis kyi mnga' thang rnams sa lug (1679)lor gzhung bzhes kyis rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags bya (1641)lor bar lo bzhi bcu zhe gnyis ring ser byes grwa tshang nas kha 'dzin mkhan thog re gnyis byas kyang bdag skyong med pas gog hrul du gyur/de nasab zung ga zi'i gdung rgyud las byung ba'i stag lung gi khri pa'i rgyun chad pa (767) dang stag lung sde pa zhes dar spras rong gsum bcas la dbang bsgyur ba'i srid dbang de nyid kyang lha sa'i nye 'dabs kyi sde pa rag pa stongs shul gyi gzhis kar gnas 'phos nas rim bzhin gzhung sa'i ru dpon byes pa'i byas rjes su lho mdo mkhar gyi gzhis ka sprad rjes sde dpon mdo mkhar ba'am ra kha shag ces grags so/_/bar der chos rgyud 'dzin pa'i sprul sku dang gdung rgud kyi sras zhabs drung kha shas byung ba ste mchog sprul bkra shis 'jam dpal rgyal mtsho ni lho mon gyi yul che brag ces par 'khrungs la zhabs drung ma chen bkra shis dpal grub kyi sku skyer grags ga zi'i gdung rgyud ni ma yin stag lung gi khri la bzhugs med}
