'on rgyal sras skal bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho|{rje 'di ni dbus stod la mor yab chos rje bsod nams dbang 'dus dang yum nyi ma dbe skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu phag (1743)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi la 'on nges gnang dar rgyas gling du gdan drangs/dgung lo lnga pa tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i drung du gtsug phud phul/mtshan bskal bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho zhes gnang/dge slong rgya mtsho rdo rje bsten nas ye ge 'bri klog dang chos spyod sogs gsan sbyong mdzad/dgung lo bcu la rgyal ba rin po che'i drung du rab byung bsgrubs/dgon lung bka' bcu grags pa yar 'phel bsten nas bsdus grwa blo rtags bcas gzhung chen la slob gnyer mdzad/dgung lo bco lnga la rgyal dbang bskal bzang rgya mtsho sku gshegs/dgung lo nyi shu la phur lcog ngag dbang byas pa'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs/de'i lo rgyal dbang 'jam dpal rgya mtsho gser khri mnga' gsol gyi mdzad sgor phebs/dgung lo nyer bzhi la lha ldan smon lam chen mor grwa skor dam bca' mdzad/dgung lo nyer lnga la bkra shis lhun por paN chen rin por che mjal bar phebs/rje 'dis phur lcog ngag dbang byams pa/paN chen dpal ldan ye shes/lcang skya rol pa'i rdo rje sogs bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/dgung lo nyer drug nas mi lo nga gsum tsam ring 'on phur sgrub pa nyams len la rtse gcig tu gzhol/gsung rtsom yang/(yi dam lha tshogs kyi sgrub thabs rjes gnang tshe sgrub rab gnas sbyin sreg yul khrus bsangs mchod sogs 'dod dgu'i char 'bel )zhes bya ba dang/(sdeb sbor dang daN+Di'i gzhung las le'u gnyis pa'i dper brjod kun 'khor sman bshad dbyangs 'char lung gsal ba'i sgron me/) (mi tra brgya rtsi'i dkyil 'khor gyi mngon rtogs blo gsal mgul rgyan/) ('phags pa thugs rje chen po dpal mo lugs kyi dkyil 'khor gyi sa chog gi ngag 'don bde legs kun 'byung gi dgongs pa rab gsal )sogs pod 'bring gsum tsam mdzad/mthar dgung lo re dgu la phebs pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa lcags lug (1811)lor gshegs}
'on rgyal sras 'jigs med ye shes grags pa|{rje 'di ni lha lung rnying par rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me byi (1697)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bzhi la 'on chos sdings nges gsang dar rgyal gling du gdan drangs/de'i lor rgyal dbang tshangs dbyangs rgya mtshor dbu skra'i gtsug phud phul/mtshan blo bzang ngag dbang 'jigs med ces bstsal/mkhas grub bstan dar ba'i sku skye mdo smad pa dge slong ngag dbang rab brtan dge rgan du bsten nas (769) yi ge 'bri klog chos spyod rgyan 'jug sngags skor bcas gsan bzhes mdzad dgung lo brgyad la 'on mnga' ris grwa tshang du chas zhugs mdzad bsdus grwa dang tshad ma sogs la gsan sbyong gnang dgung lo bcu bzhi la 'bras spungs dgon du chos zhugs mdzad nas gzhung chen la slob gnyer dang dgung lo bco brgyad la paN chen blo bzang ye shes mjal bar bkra shis lhun por phebs dgung lo nyi shu la paN chen rin po che'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs dgung lo nyer bzhi la nges gsang dar rgyas gling du phebs nas smad dang rtsis dkyil 'khor gyi thig rtsa sogs gsan sbyong mdzad dgung lo so gsum la tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho mdo sman du phebs zhus smon lam gyi tshogs dbur lo brgyad ring phebs rje 'dis tA la'i bla ma bskal bzang rgya mtsho dang dus 'khor ba yon tan dar rgyal rje kun dga' legs 'byung sogs bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan gsum rtsom yang (rang la gros 'debs dang bsnyen bskul gyi rim pa )zhes pa dang (rje btsun sgrol dkar la brten pa'i brtan bzhugs dang de'i bla rgyud gsol 'debs smon lam shis brjod/) (lho sgo'i cho ga) (dpal snar thang rwa sgreng dgon lung byams pa gling dgon ma lag bcas kyi bca' yig) (spyan ras gzigs phyag stong spyan stong gi cho ga )sogs du ma mdzad dgung lo nga gnyis la rgyud grwar bzhugs sku tshe gang por chos 'khor rgya cher bskor nas dgung lo nga lnga la phebs pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags rta (1750)lor sku gshegs}
