ya mon 'phrul bzo khang|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs kyi dmag mkho'i yo byad thos skyed byed sa'i bzo grwa zhig ste rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing stag (1914)lor gsar du btsugs te do dam mkhan drung rtse ru tA bla ma dang b+h+rum pa sras gnyis bsko gzhag thog las bya mgon las gnyis dang drung dkyus ser skya gnyis/rtse shod gnyer nang drug yod pa dang/lcags shing gnyis kyi dbu chen dbu chung gtsos lag shes bzo las khongs nas zhol 'dod dpal gyi dbu che chung phud de byings lag shes drag gras mi grangs brgya cu skor nas grib mda' bzo grwa khag gcig btsugs te thog mar bod rdzas dang/mde'u/sta re/mdung sogs bzos pa ma zad/shing 'brug dbyin 'gog dmag 'khrug gi skabs su spyod pa'i 'phrul mda' grib yang chang zer ba dang me sgyogs 'khor lo can yang bzo grwa 'dis bzos pa yin 'dug /rjes su lcags sprel (1920)lor gro stod nor bu mtsho skyid du 'phrul 'khor 'don 'dren gyis bzo grwa khag gcig btsugs te zangs kyi pan shag zho gang dang/skar phyed brgyad/skar lnga/skra phyed gsum sogs dang/zangs dang lcags kyi dngos rdzas sgrib sbyor par 'debs dang 'jam hrob tshags sogs brgyab ste mkho 'don byed myong yod lags}
ya rtse dzum lang gi rgyal rabs|{na ga lde'i sras btsun phyug ldes ya rtse'i mnga' bdag mdzad pa nas ya rtse dzung lang gi rgyal brgyud byung/deng sang bal po'i mnga' khongs su yod/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa chen po'i skabs/rgyal po bi kra ma sha dang de'i sras na ra sing ha zhes pa'i bar lo lnga brgya tsam gyi ring thub pa'i bstan pa spyi bor mchod/'di la'ang dzum lang (li)rA dza/nar lang rA dza/kha la rA dza/gu ye rA dza sogs spun mched lnga las rgyal rgyud gyes pa rnams spyir nang bstan dang/sgos su 'bri gung pa'i sbyin bdag gtso bo yin cing/rgyal po na ra sing has kyang nang bstan la mchod bkur che/de rjes rgyal po kany+dza dang/b+hi Sh+NA rwa dza zhes byung ba rnams lha dbang phyug dang/lha mo u ma/khyab 'jug (771) sogs lhar bsten nas mu stegs pa'i chos lugs bzung ste 'bangs la man ra gcod che rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags bya (1801)lor bal yul gyi rgyal po gor Sha rA dza Na b+ha dur gyis dzum lang btsan bzung byas te 'bangs su btsud rgyal po'i dbang cha shor yang rgyal brgyud tsam da lta'ang yod skad zhib par shes 'dod na (gser thog pa rin rdor gyis bris pa'i yig tshang )zhes pa zhig yod skad la de rtsad gcod bya dgos}
