yang 'dul bzhi|{bod kyi sa dbyibs srin mo gan rkyal 'dra ba'i gru mo g.yas g.yon gnyis dang/dpung mo g.yas g.yon gnyis bcas tshigs chung bzhi non pa'i ched du bzhengs pa'i lha khang bzhi ste kong po bu chu/lho brag mkho mthing/byams sprin dge gnas/byang pra dum rtse'o/_}
yang rtsal bya lta bu|{thag ring le dbar mang por gom 'gros la brten nas rgyugs pa dang/rtsig pa dang lcags ri sogs mthon por mchongs pa/gcong rong g.yang gzar che bar thag shur la brten nas bgrod pa/rta rgyugs zhor du mda' gri mdung sogs 'phangs pa dang/gru gu rtsa ba sogs lus rtsal rigs sna tshogs byang chub pa}
