yang log kun rdzob gnyis|{dbu ma rang rgyud pas/shes pa rang gi mtshan nyid kyis grub par snang ba ni snang ba ltar du grub par 'dod pas shes pa yin na yang dag kun rdzob pa'i phyir yul can la yang log gnyis su'i mi phye yang/yul la snang ba ltar don byed nus pa dang mi nus kyi sgo nas yang log gnyis su 'byed do/_/thal 'gyur ba'i lugs la/kun rdzob pa'i yul yul can gang du'ang yang log gnyis su mi 'byed de/yang dag kun rdzob med pa'i phyir te/kun rdzob yin na log pa yin dgos pa'i phyir te/kun rdzob pa'i chos thams cad ni tha snyad tsam du'ang (772) gnas tshul gzhan du gnas nas snang tshul gzhan du snang ba'i rdzun pa yin pas khyab pas na dbang po'i shes pa rnams kyang rang yul 'khrul zhing ma 'khrul ba'i cha gzhan yang med pas na kun rdzob pa'i yul yul can gang la'ang yang log gnyis su mi 'byed do/_/mdor na rang rgyud pas yang dag kun rdzob 'jog pa'ang tha snyad du rang gi mtshan nyid kyis grub par khas len pa la thug cing thal 'gyur bas yang dag kun rdzob khas mi len pa'ang tha snyad du'ang rang gi mtshan nyid kyis grub pa mi bzhed pa'i gnad der thug pa yin zhes gsungs so/_/'on kyang thal 'gyur bas 'jig rten shes pa lhan skyes rags pa'i ngo la ltos te yang log gnyis su 'byed de spyir 'phral gyi 'khrul rgyus ma bslad pa'i shes pa yul dang bcas pa de 'jig rten shes ngo la ltos te yang dag dang des bslad pa'i shes pa yul dang bcas pa de 'jig rten shes ngo la ltos te log pa'i kun rdzob yin mtshan gzhi ni gzugs dang gzugs 'dzin mig shes lta bu ngad po dang me long nang gi byad bzhin gyi gzugs brnyan dang gzugs brnyan de 'dzin pa'i shes pa lta bu gnyis 'dod de dbang po gsal dang dbang po skyon ldan no/_/zhes so/_}
yang gsang mi min lugs|{'di (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )gyi nang ming 'don byas pa tsam las de'i nang du rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po'i lo rgyus gang 'dra bshad yod med skor bkod mi 'dug pa de'i rgyu mtshan gang yin gsal por ma bshad kyang/de ni rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po spo bo'i yul nas byung ba'i bshad tshul de yin cing/de lo rgyus thog gsal bar bkod na dus skabs der bod kyi lo rgyus smra ba mang che bas rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po rgya gar nas bod du bros byol du yong ba'i rgyal po ru pa ti zer ba de yin pa dang rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po ni shAkya mu ne'i rus rgyud nas byung ba yin zer ba'i bshad tshul de khas len gyi yod par brten/bshad tshul de dang mi mthun pa'i lo rgyus bkod na tshang mas khong khro chen po byed nges yin par bsams nas rtsom pa pos gsal por bkod ma nus pa yin tshod 'dug snyam}
yangs can la thog kha|{deng skabs 'dam gzhung rdzong khongs yangs pa can chus la thog kha}
yangs pa can|{(bai shA li nra )sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/sangs rgyas shAkya mu nes theg pa chen po'i chos mang po gsungs pa'i gnas yin srol dang/(thang zan dzang gi lam yig )las/chu bo wa ra Na brgyud nas shar phyogs su le dbar stong phrag gcig gi sa na yangs pa can gyi grong khyer chags pa'i shul dang/de'i khor yug tu le dbar bdun cu skor yod pa la/mi grong shin tu nyung zhing gnas rtags mchod rten brgyad yod par bshad/btsan po'i ('dzam gling rgyas bshad )du/chu klung yid 'ong ldan brgal nas lho phyogs su song ba nas yangs can gyi grong khyer du slebs shing/rgya gar pa rnams kyis bai shA la gri hA'am be sar g+har zhes zer/sngon dus su grong khyer der lcags ri rim pa gsum dang/nang du gser dang/dngul dang/zangs kyi rgya phibs can kyi khang brtsegs mang po yod pa'i stobs 'byor che ba zhig yin par mdo sdang dang 'dul ba'i gleng gzhi'i nang gsal yang deng sang grong 'di'i lho phyogs chu bo gang+gA dang/byang phyogs gaN+Taka la thug yod pas grong khyer lho ngos kyi lcags ri yang chus khyed nas med cing/shar phyogs su chu klung yid 'ong ldan gyi 'gram du grong khyer gsar du chags pa'i ming la ha tsi pu ru zer zhes gsal/yangs pa can nas shar lho'i phyogs su nyin phyed tsam song ba na mya ngan med kyis sbyin bdag byas te dgra bcom pa lnga brgyas bka' bsdu gnyis pa mdzad pa'i gnas/de'i yang shar lhor nyin phyed tsam song (773) ba na sangs rgyas bzhi'i bzhugs r+khi dang mdzad pa bstan pa'i gnas lho phyogs chu bo gang+gA'i 'gram phan tshun na kun dga' bo'i ring bsrel bzhugs pa'i mchod rten re yod do/_}
yangs pa can dgon pa|{dgon pa 'di ni karma zhwa dmar ba sku phreng bzhi pa chos grags ye shes (rab byung brgyad pa'i chu bya 1453lo nas rab byung dgu pa'i shing sprel 1524lo bar dgung lo bdun cu don gnyis bzhugs )kyis rab byung brgyad pa'i chu phag (1503)lor phyag btab/dgon pa 'dir yangs pa can zhes thogs pa'i rgyu mtshan ni rgan rabs tsho'i ngag rgyun la/de sngon rgya gar khul du yangs pa can zhes ming thogs pa'i dgon pa zhig yod pa de 'thor zhig tu song ba'i rgya phibs dum bu zhig bod du dbor nas bzo bcos brgyab rjes dgon pa'i thog khar bkab par brten dgon pa'i ming yangs pa can zhes thogs pa yin zer srol 'dug /dgon pa 'di thog mar 'debs skabs kyi rgya khyon la gtsug lag khang dang bla brang bcas par ka ba bdun cu don drug gi sa dang/rdo gcal chen mo'i mtha' bskor du grwa khang brgya dang go 'dun yod pa rnams rin spungs sde pa don yod rdo rjes sbyin bdag byas thog /dbus dang byang 'brog nyer 'khor khul bcas kyi las mi bskul nas brtsigs te/las rgyud bod zla bzhi pa'i tshes bcu dgu nas zla ba dgu pa'i tshes shar bar zla ba bzhi dang phye brag tsam 'gor zhing/phyi rtsigs ldebs zhal bcas yongs rdzogs grub pa yin/rab byung bcu pa'i sa rta (1618)lor gtsang pa sde srid phun tshogs rnam rgyal dang/karma pa mchod yon gyi dmag dpung dbus su drangs te se 'bras gnyis la gtor skyon tshabs chen btang ba'i dgra lan du rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu rta (1624)lor go shri han gyi dmag dpung gis gtsang pa sde srid gtor skabs dgon pa 'dir yang zhor la gtor skyon tshabs chen byung/de rjes yangs can dgon pa bskyar gso byung nas zhwa dmar sku phreng dug pa chos kyi 'byung gnas bar nyams chag med par gnas kyang/zhwa dmar sku phreng bcu pa chos grub rgya mtsho de paN chen rin po che sku phreng drug pa dpal ldan ye shes kyi sku mched du gyur zhing/paN chen rin po che sku 'das rjes phyag mdzod rje drung ho thog thu dang zhwa dmar sprul sku gnyis rgyu nor bgo bsha' bya rgyur ma 'chams par brten zhwa dmar bas gor Sha rgyal por mgo btags zhus shing/sa sna lam rgyus ya te rab byung bcu gsum pa'i 