yar klung gtsang po|{chu bo 'di ni nyi ma la ya'i byang rgyud 'brong pa rdzong khongs bye ma g.yung drung zhes pa'i gangs ri las 'bab cing lo rgyus yig cha'i nang spyir yar chab gtsang po zhes 'khod la sgos su legs rtse'i rgyud du rta mchog kha 'bab gtsang po zhes 'bod pa dang/lha rtse khul du myang chu/lha rtse'i nub rgyud du yang rtag mchog kha 'bab ces rta pho'i kha 'dra ba'i ri khog nas 'bab pa 'brel ba rgyu mtshan du byas nas mi 'bod byed pa/cha shul khul nas bzung yar klung gtsang po zhes 'bod pa yul ming chu ru thogs pa bcas phyis su yongs khyab la yar klung gtsang po zhes 'bod/yar klung gtsang po ni g.yu 'brug sngon po 'phyo ba bzhin bod kyi lho phyogs brgyud nas shar la brgyugs thog sman gling phad chos khul nas kha byang shar ngos su phyogs te bzhur zhing ri bo gnam lcags 'bar bar skor ba rta mig gzugs shig brgyab rjes slar yang lho nub khul gyi gcong rong zab mo 'grims nas mthar glo yul brgyud rgya gar du 'bab pas gtsang po pu la ma bo the la {(WP:1,194)}zer/de nas b+hang la brgyud b+hang la mtsho khug tu 'gril/yar glang gtsang po'i khyon yongs kyi ring tshad spyi le 2900yod pa nas rang rgyal gyi mang 'khongs nang tshad du spyi le 1787yod pa dang/bzhur yul gyi rgya khyon spyi le gru bzhi ma khri 93 5yod pa nas rang rgyal mnga' khongs su spyi lo gru bzhi ma 24 16zin pa/gtsang po'i rgyud kyi sa'i cha stongs mtho tshang rgya mtsho'i ngos las brtsis spyi khre gsum stong yan zin yod/yar klung gtsang po ni rang rgyal gyi gtsang chen khag gi khrod nas ring tshad ang rim lnga par slebs shing gtsang rgyud kyi sa rgya che (777) chung ang drug pa zin la gtsang chu'i rgyug 'bor ang rim gsum par slebs pa gtsang chu'i nus pa che chung ang gnyis pa zin thub pa bcas yin gtsang po 'di'i g.yas g.yon du gtsang lag mang po yod pa ste chu gsog rgya khyon spyi le gru bzhi pa khri tsho brgal ba'i rdog zhong gtsang po dang myang chu skyid chu nyang chu phar lung gtsang po bcas yod yar klung gtsang po bzhur rgyud du mi grangs brgyad 'bum bdun khrir nyer zhing sa zhing son khal sa