yul nyi shu rtsa bzhi|{'di nang pa'i sngags kyi gzhung mang po nas ming tsam 'byung zhing/bu ston rin chen grub kyi gsung (bde mchog chos 'byung )dang pan chen er te ni dpal ldan ye shes kyi gsung (sham b+ha la'i rnam bshad )nas rgyas par bshad pa gnyis gung bsgrigs nas don bsdus te bkod par/1 pU li ra ma la ya (rgya gar shar phyogs b+hang g+ha la yi lho ngos ma la ya'i chu klung 'bab pa'i gnas/) 2 dza lan+d+ha ra (chu bo gang+gA mtsho ma phab nas mnga' ris kyi yul brgyud nyin 'ga' zhig lho nub phyogs su kha gtan nas 'bab cing/Ti la'am d+hi li'i byang phyogs ha ri d+ha lar nas shar phyogs su 'khyogs nas 'bab pa'i byang ngos/dzA la mug gam/dza la mu khe ste rdo la me 'bar ba'i gnas/) 3 au Ti ya na/(o rgyan gyi yul/) 4 arbu ta/(rgya gar lho phyogs kyi ri dbus mtho la mtha' dma' ba 'bur rgyas sam snying gi gzugs can zhig gi ming/) 5 gau da wa ri (bal po'i yul gyi byang ngos rang rgyal gyi gnya' nang rdzong gi nye 'dabs la phyi gangs ri (788) zhes gangs ri chen po zhig yod par bshad pa ltar na deng sang gi sa bkra'i thog tu sgo sa yin than ri bo zhes sang yongs grags su shis sha pang ma'i ri bo zhes pa de yin nam snyam ste brtag 'di rje btsun mi la'i rnam thar du stod gnya' nang du yod pa'i la phyi gangs ri zhes gsal zhing la phyi gangasi zhes pa hi ma la ya'i ri rgyud gcig yin pa sa bkra'i nang sgo sa yin than zhes pa de yin nam de min la phyi gangs ri zhes logs su yod med brtag dgos/) 6 ra me shwa ri (rgya gar gyi sa dbyibs gru gsum du chags pa'i rtse mo rno shos lho phyogs su gtad pa'i rgya mtsho'i 'gram gyi sne der yod 'di nas shar lho'i phyogs su gru btang nas song na lang ka'i grong khyer ram lang ka'i gling phan zhes rgyal po r+pama' Nas srin yul du dmag drangs par bshad pa'i yul de yin pas deng sang sing ga la'am shin lan zer/) 7 de wi ko tri ('di bod skad du lha mo'i mkhar zhes zer zhing 'di la ngos 'dzin tshul mi 'dra ba gnyis ste gcig kong po'i yung dang dwags po klo yul gsum gyi mtshams su yod pa'i tsa ri la ngos 'dzin pa gcig dang gnyis rgya gar a sam gyi s