yul thang po che|{'di la ming gzhan sol nag thang po che yang zer/lha sa nas rtsis pa'i lho phyogs lho khar ma slebs tsam la grwa phyi nang zhes pa'i lung pa zhig yod pa der/sngar rgyal po glang dar mas chos bsnubs pa'i rjes su dbus gtsang gi mkhas pa mi bcus khams su phebs nas bla chen dgongs pa rab gsal ba snyen rdzogs byas te/bod du 'dul ba'i chos rgyun slar yang gso bar mdzad pa'i nang tshan dbus pa lnga'i gras klus mes tshul khrims shes rab kyi slob ma/gru mer tshul khrims 'byung gnas ('brug pa chos 'byung gi shog grangs 171par gru mer ye shes 'byung gnas zhes gsal )kyis btab pa yin zhes gsal la/dus skabs chi tsam la btab pa ni/'gos lo gzhon nu dpal gyis mdzad pa'i (deb ther sngon po )le tshan gnyis pa'i shog grangs 12par/zhang sna nam rdo rje dbang phyug gis 'phan po rgyal lugs lhas lha khang (rgyal lha khang )btab nas lo drug song ba'i me sbrul por btab par gsungs shing/khong dgung lo brgyad cu gya lnga pa rab byung dang po'i lcags bya lor gshegs zhes 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa'i bstan rtsis re'u mig tu gsal ba de gnyis bsdur na/thang po che 'di rab byung dang po ma shar gong gi drug cu skor tha ma'i nang tshan gyi me sbrul (1017)lor btab par gsal/'di sngar bod du bka' gdams kyi chos brgyud ma byung gong gi mtshan nyid pa'i sde dgon shin tu che ba'i gras yin la/grub mer gshegs rjes de'i slob ma khu ston brtson 'gros g.yung drung gis gdan sa bskyangs skabs/jo bo rje a ti sha gdan drangs pa yin}
