yul dpon tshan bcu drug|{bod kyi ru bzhi la yul dpon (790) tshan pa bcu drug re yod pa la ze ru lag gi yul dpon tshan pa bcu drug ni 1 mang yul 2 snye nam 3 dpa' chad 4 drangs sa 5 brom lung 6 shab lung 7 srad lung 8 myang mda' 9 khri thang 10 thang 'brang 11 nul po 12 g.yu lung 13 dung lung 14 myang stod 15 gad sram 16 spa rong bcas bcu drug dang g.yas ru'i tshan pa bcu drug ni 1 byang phug 2 zangs zang 3 zangs dkar 4 dung lung 5 gdeg lung 6 bgyig lung 7 shag lung 8 'byad lung 9 rta nag 10 zhan thag 11 mtsho nyang 12 rta nu 13 gtsang shod 14 'o yug 15 snye mo 16 dgra yag bcas bcu drug po yin dbu ra'i yul dpon tshan pa bcu drug ni 1 stod lung 2 'phags rgyal 3 klung shod 4 mal gro 5 'dam shod 6 za gad 7 rag sha 8 ba lam 9 ngan lam 10 brang yul 11 dbul sde 12 zad chu shul 13 'phrang po 14 gnon lung 15 gsang 16 brag rum 17 'phan yul bcas bcu bdun yin g.yo ru'i tshan pa bcu drug ni 1 nga rab 2 gung po 3 gangs bar 4 yar mda' 5 'chings lung 6 grong nga 7 rog pa 8 lo ro 9 ban pa 10 gtam shul 11 kho mthing 12 brag lung 13 dol gzhung gnyis 14 grang lung 15 khab so 16 yar 'brog rnam gsum bcad bcu drug yin}
