ye shes lnga|{de bzhin nyid dag pa gnyis ldan ni chos dbyings ye shes/ye shes thams cad ma lus par ye shes gcig gis mkhyen pa me long lta bu'i ye shes/shes bya thams cad rang bzhin med par mnyam pa nyid du mkhyen pa mnyam nyid ye shes/ji snyed pa'i chos thams cad ma 'dren par mkhyen pa sor rtog ye shes/gdul bya 'dul ba'i bya ba me bya grub ye shes so/_/bsdu na/chos dbyings ye shes/me long ye shes/mnyam nyid ye shes/sor rtogs ye shes/bya grub ye shes so/_/(rnam grangs rgya mtsho'i gter )las 'di rnams re re la lnga re yod pa gsungs la de dag so so'i rnam grangs las gsal lo/_/yang (ma Ni bka' 'bum )las/rnam par snang mdzad (793) chos dbyings ye shes dang mi bskyod rdo rje me long ye shes dang rin chen 'byung ldan mnyam nyid ye shes dang nang ba mtha' yas sor rtog ye shes dang don yod don grub bya grub ye shes te/_/sku la ye shes lnga la phyag 'tshal bstod/_/ces gsungs so/_}
