ra sa spang lung ri khrod|{phur bu lcog ri khrod kyi rgyab tu yod pa'i sa ra spang lung ri khrod ni spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu gnyis pa'i nang ma gcig lab sgron gyi bla ma skyo ston bsod nams bla mas sgrub sde btab cing bzhugs skad dang/bar lam zhig nas nyams chags byung bar dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i nang ser smad mkhan zur blo bzang thugs rjes ri khrod bskyar bskrun gyis bzhugs/khong la spang lung blo bzang thugs rje zhes 'bod cing/spang lung sprul sku sku phreng dang po yin/rang byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag lor grwa grangs 17yod pa dang/dgon bdag ser smad spom sbor ra khang tshan yin}
