rat+ka'i rtsa ba brgyad|{yab kyi sna g.yas pa'i rak+ta/yum gyi pad+ma'i rak+ta/srid pa chags pa'i lte khrag /g.yul du bsad pa'i dpa' bo'i snying khrag ste nang rtsa ba bzhi/stag gzig la sogs gcan gzan gyi khrag /bya rgod la sogs 'dab chags kyi khrag /rta bong la sogs rmig zlum gyi khrag /g.yag sogs rmig dbrag gi khrag ste phyi'i rtsa ba bzhi'o/_}
rak+ta'i yan lag so lnga|{mtshal/li khri/btsag /sdong ros/rdo dreg ste ma'i rak+ta lnga/tsan dan dmar po/seng sding/mdzo mo shing/gor+shi Sha/shir shing dmar po ste shing gi rak+ta lnga/pad ma ra ga /byu ru/mchong dmar/me shel/rdo rgyus dmar po'am sbal rgyab gang rung ste rdo'i rak+ta lnga/ha lo/ug chos/glang sna/se rgod/lug ru dmar po ste me tog gi rak+ta lnga/ra mo shag /nye shing/snyan lo/gro ma/smyug ma dmar po ste rtswa'i rak+ta lnga/rgun 'brum/mab bu/kha sran bre/ba ma khal smug po/skyu ru ra ste 'bru'i rak+ta lnga/rgya skyeg /sin d+hu ra/'bri mog /bu ram/brag zhun te rtsi'i rak+ta lnga'o/_}
rag btsun dgon|{rag btsun dgon (lha sa'i rnga chen glog khang gi nye 'dabs su yod )ni dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i nang sde dpon mdo mkhar (rag shag )ba'i mi ngo btsan ma zhig gis btab/rag shag nas bdag 'dzin byed/bod rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag lor rag shag gi mi ngo btsun ma dpon g.yog gnyis yod 'dug }
