rang snang|{phyi rol gyi yul gang 'dra zhig rang gi sems la 'char yang 'char snang de rang sems kyi snang cha yin pa las/rang sems kyi snang cha de las logs su rang tshugs thub pa'i dngos po'i rigs gtan nas med ces bka' brgyud kyi bla ma gong ma tsho'i gsung rgyun du yod/tshig 'di la deng sang mi mang po zhig gis go nor thebs nas mi shes (812) shes mdog byas te sangs rgyas chos lugs pas sems ang dang po dang dngos po ang gnyis pa yin pa phyi rol gyi dngos po a ma sems lab rten nas byung bar khas len gyi 'dug ces dgag pa dang skyon brjod kyi rtsom yig mang po bris pa ni zla ba lnga pa dang rgyal pa lnga pa nor ba kho na ste de 'dra bshad pa'i sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung gtan nas med do/_}
