rang rig mngon sum mi 'dod|{rang rig mngon sum mi 'dod pa de yang thal 'gyur ba'i lugs kyi thun mong min pa'i khyod chos chen po brgyad kyi nang gses shig yin/rang rig mngon sum mi 'dod de rang rig mi 'dod pa'i phyir/spyod 'jug las/'jig rten gyis ni mgon po kyang/_/sems kyis sems mi mthong zhes dang/_/ral gri'i so ni rang la rang/_/dmigs pa gang yin pa de bzhin yid/_/ces gsungs pa ltar/dmigs pa gang yin pa de nyid sems yin na sems kyis sems ji ltar mthong bar 'gyur te/dper na ral gri'i so de nyid kyis ral gri'i so de nyid gcod par mi nus la/sor mo'i rtse mo de nyid kyis sor mo'i rtse mo de nyid rig par mi nus pa ltar ro/_/der ma zad mar mes rang gzhan gnyis gsal ba ltar sems kyi rang gzhan gnyis rig pa yang bkag par mdzad de/ji skad du/mar mes rang dang gzhan gyi dngos/_/gal te snang bar byed 'gyur na/_/mun pas rang dang gzhan gyi dngos/_/sgrib par 'gyur bar the tshom med/_/ces mun pas kyang rang sgrib nas mun pa mi snang bar thal ba dang/mes kyang rang nyid bsreg par thal ba sogs kyi skyon brjod nas rang rig bkag pa mdzad do/_}
rang rang gnyen pos non|{sa dgra khag brgyad la rang rang gi gnyen por/dung dang/dbang phyug sogs kyi gzugs brnyan ston dgos par bshad pa de yin}
rang las nges kyi tshad ma|{tshad ma gang zhig /rang nyid (816) tshad ma yin par rang stobs kyis nges pa 'dren pa dper na rang nyid tshad ma yin par rang stobs kyis nges pa 'dren pa'i rjes dpag}
rang las nges kyi tshad ma lnga|{don byed snang can gyi dbang mngon tshad ma/rang rig mngon sum gyi tshad ma/rnal 'byor mngon sum gyi tshad ma/rjes su dpag pa'i tshan ma bcas lnga'o/_}
rang sa 'dzin pa'i yi ge bcu|{kha cha tha pha tsha wa zha ya sha a}
rang sems ngo shes pa|{rang sems chos sku'i ngo bo ngo 'phrod pa}
rang gsal|{rang sems kyi ngo gsal zhing rig pa shel lta bu dri mas ma gos pa}
rat+na de wa|{'di yang bal bza' khri btsun rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i btsun mor gdan darangs skabs yab rgyal pos nor skal du gnang ba'i nor bu'i rigs shig ste/'phrul snang gtsug lag khang bzhengs skabs gzi'i sgrom bu'i nang bcug nas gnod sbyin dzam b+ha la'i 'og tu sbas zhes lo rgyung mang por gsal}
