ran|{rtswa zhig gi ming ste/('dul ba lung rnam 'byed )las/bdag gis dgung bdun gyi bar du glang de dag brags su btags te ran yang rtsa bar mi bgyi/chab kyang rtsal bar mi 'gyur bar zhes pa ltar ro/_}
