rab tu dga' ba'i sa|{byang sems 'phags pa'i sa bcu yod pa'i nang gi sa dang po rab tu dga' ba zhes pa de yin/sa bcu drangs 'dren tshul/1 rab tu dga' ba/2 dri ma med pa/3 'od 'phro ba/4 'od byed pa/5 sbyang dka' ba/6 mngon du gyur pa'am mngon du phyogs pa/7 ring du song ba/8 mi g.yo ba/9 legs pa'i blo gros/10 chos kyi sprin bcas so/_}
