rab tu byung ba'i gos kha bsgyur du mi rung ba'i tshon brgyad|{de yang rab byung lami rung ba'i tshon brgyad de/1 li khri dmar ser/2 mthing zhun sngo nag 'od can/3 rgya skyegs tshor dmar smug /4 mtshal dmar chen/5 gur gum ser smug /6 btsod gtsang chos/7 sman shing dmar nag /8 le brgan rtsi dmar ser 'od can bcas so/_}
rab tu byung ba'i phan yon lnga|{rang don ma 'dris par 'thob pa/gzhan gyis mchod bstod bya ba/myang 'das 'grub pa/bde ba bla med 'thob pa/dam pas bsngags pa la zer}
