rab tu 'byams klas pa'i mtshan gyi me tog|{rab 'byams pa'i ming btags blangs pa/sngar bod du se 'bras dge gsum ma byung gong du sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi mtshan nyid rig pa la slob sbyong byed pa'i dgon pa che shos gsang phu/rwa ba stod/tshal gung thang/dga' gdong/skyor mo lung/zul phu bcas dbus gtsang gdan sa chen po drug zer zhing/de dag tu thos bsam (817) slob gnyer gyi chu tshad mtho dman la gzhigs pa'i ming btags kyi yig tshad gtong ba'i lam lugs med cing rab 'byams pa sangs rgyas 'phel gyis gzhung chen pa lnga pa thos bsam slob gnyer thon ris bzhin gong gsal gyi gdan sa chen po drug la grwa skor gnang ste rab 'byams pa'i ming btags len pa'i srol btsugs de'i nang nas gnas tshad tho dman gyi dbang gis rim pa gsum du phye yod 1 dka' bcu gzhung chen po lnga (mngon pa gong 'og gnyis dbu ma phar phyin rnam 'grel bsdus grwa 'dul ba )cha tshang bar slob gnyer thon pa 2 dka' bzhi pa gzhung chen po lnga yi nang nas bzhi la slob gnyer thon pa 3 rab 'byams pa gzhung chen po lngI nang nas gnyis tsam la slob gter thon pa bcas yin rjes su rab byung bcu pa'i chu glang (1613)lo nas lo drug ring paN chen er ti ni sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyis lha sa smon lam chen mo'i grwa skor dam bca' 'jog pa dang ang ring sprod pa'i lam srol gsar 'dzugs gnang ba de nas dge bshes lha rams pa'i srol thog mar byung ba yin}
