rab btags kyi rgyan gsum|{sems ldan rab btags kyi rgyan/sems med rab btags kyi rgyan/bzhin sgra can gyi rab btags kyi rgyan no/_}
rab rtog gi rgyan gsum|{don rgyan sum cu so lnga'i nang gses bcu gnyis pa rab rtog gi rgyan ni sems ldan nam sems med kyi dngos po'i gnas lugs rang bzhin ji ltar gnas pa de nyid dgos dbang gi 'dod pas rnam pa gzhan zhig tu sgro btags nas brjod pa'i phyag zhig ste dpe'i nang gses rnam grangs gsum ni/sems ldan rab rtog dang/sems med rab rtog /ting nge 'dzin gyi rab rtog bcas so/_}
rab rtog sgra bdun|{rab rtog gi rgyas las 'phros pa'i rab rtog gsal byed kyi sgra bdun yod de/1 snyam/2 dogs/3 nges/4 'dra/5 min nam/6 cis ma yin/7 ji ltar min zhes pa rnams snyan ngag mkhan nam rtsom po rang gis bsam pa'i tshul gsal bar byed pa'i nas bzhin sgra dang mtshungs so/_}
rab gnas|{'di sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi chos kyi byed sgo gtso che ba'i gras yin/sku gsung thugs rten bzhis zin rjes bgegs skrod dang rab gnas ma byas na gdon 'dre yi dwags sogs kyis rten de bdag tu bzung nas gnas de mi la gnod 'tshe gtong bar bgegs skrod byas dgos pa dang/de rjes rten de gang gi yin pa'i ye shes pa gdan drangs nas bstims bzhugs byas pa la rab gnas zer/de la rgyas pa nyin gsum/'bring po nyin gnyis/bsdus pa nyin gcig bar byed srol yod cing/bod kyi sangs rgyas chos lugs rim med grub mtha' khag tshang mar rang rang gi bla ma gong ma tshos mdzad pa'i rang gnas kyi cho ga rgyas 'bring bsdus gsum sna tshogs yod}
rab gnas kyi rjes dran bzhi'i skabs su 'dren pa'i dran pa nye bar bzhag pa gsum|{chos ston na nyan par 'dod pa la chags pa med/nyan par mi 'dod pa la sdang ba med/des nyan res mi nyan pa la chags sdang gnyis ka med par btang snyom dran pa dang ldan par gnas pa'o/_}
rab spel gyi rgyan gnyis|{don rgyan sum cu so lnga'i nang gses sum cu so bzhi pa rab spel gyi rgyan ni/tshig sbyor gcig la dpe rgyan dang gzugs rgyan/'gog rgyan sogs (818) rgyan gsum las mi nyung ba zhig mnyam du bsres pa'i rgyan zhig ste de'i nang gses rnam grangs gnyis ni gcig la gcig ltos kyi rab spel dang stobs mtshungs kyi rab spel lo/_}
rab byung gi sdom ldan lnga|{dge tshul pha ma gnyis/dge slong pha ma gnyis/dge slob ma}
rab byung gi bar chad dri ba bzhi|{ma ning la sogs sdom pa mi skye ba'i bar chad/rgyal pos ma gnang ba logs su gnas pa'i bar chad/bya rog skrod mi nus pa la sogs khyad par du 'gro ba'i bar chad/skra ser la sogs mdzes pa'i bar chad do/_/(rab byung gi bar chad bzhi yang zer/)}
rab byung gi bslab bya gzhi lnga|{bslab pa yongs su sbyong ba'i gzhi/bde bar gnas pa rkyen gyi gzhi/cho ga khyad 'brel las kyi gzhi/nyes pa dag byed phyir bcos kyi gzhi/mtha' gnyis spangs pa gnas mal gyi gzhi'o/_}
rab byung gcig|{rab byung ni lo rgan drug cu skor gcig gi ming ste/rab byung (me mo yos/) rnam 'byung (sa pho 'brug )dkar po (sa mo sbrul/) rab myos (lcags pho rta/) skyes bdag (lcags mo lug/) ang+gir (chu pho sprel/) dpal gdong (chu mo bya/) dngos po (shing pho khyi/) na tshod ldan (shing mo phag/) 'dzin byed (me pho byi/) dbang phyug (me mo glang/) 'bru mang po (sa pho stag/) myos ldan (sa mo yos/) rnam gnon (lcags po 'brug/) khyu mchog (lcags mo sbrul/) sna tshogs (chu pho rta/) nyi ma (chu mo lug/) nyi sgrol byed (shing po sprel/) sa skyong (shing mo bya/) mi zad (me pho khyi/) thams cad 'dul (me mo phag/) kun 'dzin (sa pho byi/) 'gal ba (sa mo glang/) rnam 'gyur (lcags pho stag/) bong bu (lcags mo yos/) dga' ba (chu pho 'brug/) rnam rgyal (chu mo sbrul/) rgyal ba (shing pho rta/) myos byed (shing mo lug/) gdong ngan (me pho sprel/) gser 'phyang (me mo bya/) rnam 'phyang (sa pho khyi/) sgyur byed (sa mo phag/) kun ldan (lcags pho byi/) 'phar ba (lcags mo glang/dge byed (chu pho stag/) mdzes byed (chu mo yos/) khro mo (shing pho 'brug/) sna tshogs dbyig (shing mo sbrul/) zil gnon (me pho rta/) spre'u (me mo lug/) phur bu can (sa pho sprel/zhi ba (sa mo bya/) thun mong (lcags po khyi/) ('gal byed (lcags mo phag/) yongs 'dzin (chu pho byi/) bag med (chu mo glang/) kun dga' (shing pho stag/) srin bu (shing mo yos/) me (me pho 'brug/) dmar ser can (me mo sbrul/) dus kyi pho nya (sa pho rta/) don grub (sa mo lug/) drag po (lcags po sprel/) blo ngan (lcags mo bya/) rnga chen (chu pho khyi/) khrag skyug (chu mo phag/) mig dmar (shing pho byi/) khro bo (shing mo glang/) zad pa (me po stag )bcas yin/bod kyi rab byung dang po 'go tshugs mtshams ni me yos (1027)lo yin pa dang/gyi jo lo tsA ba zla ba'i 'od zer gyis rtsis srol btod pa'o/_}
