rab 'byams|{rab 'byams ni grangs gnas mtho ba zhig ste stong gsum gyi stong chen po'i 'jig rten gyi khams bye ba phrag brgya la rab 'byams rgyud kyi 'jig rten dang/de bye ba phrag brgya la rab 'byams rgya mtsho'i 'jig rten zhes/rab 'byams de la'ang nang gses kyi dbye ba che chung (819) gsum gsungs so/_/'o na stong gsum gyi stong chen po'i 'jig rten gyi khams zhes pa'i tshad ji lta bu zhe na mngon pa mdzod las gling bzhi pa dang nyi zla ba/_/ri rab dang ni 'dod lha dang/_/tshangs pa'i 'jig rten stong la ni/_/stong ni spyi phud yin par 'dod/_/de stong la ni stong gnyis pa/_/bar ma'i 'jig rten khams yin no/_/de stong la ni stong gsum mo/_/mnyam du 'jig cing byung ba yin/_/zhes pa ltar gling bzhi gling phrag brgyad dang nyi zla rgyu skar ri rab 'dod lha drug dang bsam gtan dang po man chad stong phrag gcig la stong dang po ste stong spyi phud kyi 'jig rten gyi khams zhes zer zhing stong dang po'i 'jig rten de 'dra ba stong phrag gcig la stong gnyis pa bar ma'i 'jig rten khams dang stong gnyis pa'i 'jig rten de 'dra ba'i stong phrag gi gal stong gsum gyi stong chen po'i 'jig rten gyi khams zhes bya ba yin de lta bu'i stong gsum gyi stong chen po'i 'jig rten gyi khams bye ba phrag brgya la ni rab 'byams zhes pa yin no/_}
rab 'byams pa|{gong du rab tu 'byams klas pa'i mtshan gi me tog ces par gzigs}
rab 'byams pa ngag dbang thub bstan|{(mkhan po no mon han )rje 'di sog po'i yul du spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu dgu pa'i nang 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun la phebs skabs dge slong grags pa ri tshing gi mdun du dge bsnyen bsgrubs/mtshan blo bzang thub bstan zhes gsol/de nas khu re dgon par chos zhugs mdzad de gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bsam gnang/dgung lo bcu bdun la rje ngag dbang mkhas grub las rab tu byung ba dang/dge tshul gyi sdom pa sbrel bar mnos/mtshan ngag dbang thub bstan zhes bstsal/sku nar son pa dang dbu gtsang dgon khag rnams mjal ba dang sbrags rgyal dbang tshul khrims rgya mtsho dang/paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma/khri byang chub chos 'phel sogs dge ba'i bshes gnyen bcu phrag bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/dgung lo sum cu par paN chen blo bzang bstan pa'i nyi ma'i drung du dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/sog yul du phyir log rjes khu re dgon pa'i mkhan khrir phebs/gong mas khu ru mkhan po no mon han zhes pa'i mtshan snyan stsal/dgung lo brgyad cu gya gnyis su phebs skabs kyang legs bshad phyag rtsom gnang/bka' rtsom la mtshon/bstan pa'i gsal byed rgyal khang rtse rje blo bzang dpal 'byor lhun grub kyi rnam thar dang/bstan bcos mngon rtogs rgyas kyi zhal bzhes man ngag bdud rtsi/shing rta'i srol 'byed kyi rnam gzhag /chos skyong dregs rtsam la brten nas gtor sgrub byed tshul/sgrol ma'i rgyud kyi 'byung khungs gsal byed lo rgyus gser phreng/snyan ngag me long gi zan bris tho gsal 'debs sogs mang du mdzad/sku gshegs pa'i lo dus ma rnyed}
