rab gsal btsan khang|{rab gsal btsan khang (lha sa grong khyer nang rab gsal u yon lhan khang khongs (du klu btsan mthu bas dbang phyug khog zhugs byed cing/do dam se ra dgon pa nas byed kyi yod/mang tshogs kyi bshad srol du spyi lo'i dus rabs bdun pa'i nang btsan po srong btsan sgam po'i btsun mo rgya bza' wun khren kong jo de gar bzhugs myong ba dang/'o thang mtsho'i klu btsan gnas gzhi'i rdo zhig don pa der btsan khang de bzhengs skad}
