ras chung ba rdo rje grags|{rje 'di nyid rab byung dang po'i shing byi (1084)lor la stod gung thang du sku 'khrungs/sku chung dus klog legs par mkhyen/dgung lo bcu gcig la phebs skabs rje btsun mi la bsten nas chos kyi rkang tshugs/dgung lo bco lngar phebs skabs sku la mdzes nad phog pas rje btsun gyi drung du ma bzhugs par khang stong rnams su nyal zhing bzhugs/de'i tshe a ra tsa gsung byung nas de rnams kyis snying rje byas te rgya gar du khrid nas bla ma ba la tsan+d+ra la gtugs/ba la tsan+d+ras gtum po khyung sham can gnang nas bzlas pa byas pas/ring por ma lon par mdze nad lhag ma med par sos/de nas bal por phebs nas a tu la da sha la sogs pa nas bde mchog la sogs pa'i rgyud 'ga' re yang gsan/slar rje btsun kyi drung du 'khor ba na/rje btsun gyis ras chung pa rgyal gar du chos skor len par mngags/ras chung pas bla ma'i gsung la mnyan te slar rgya gar du byon nas nA ro ma dang mai tri gnyis kyi dngos slob ti phu ba la lus med mkha' 'gro'i chos skor cha tshang ba zhus/gzhan yang gdams pa mang du btsal nas bla ma'i drung du byon/chos skor dgung po cha tshang ba mi la phul/mi las ngam rdzong ston pa la gnang/ngam rdzong bas de la yig sna yang brtsams shing/de nas mched pa la bde mchod snyan brgyud zer zhing/ras chung pa nyid nas gzhan la mched pa la ras chung snyan brgyud du grags/de ltar ras chung pas rje btsun mi la bsten nas rtogs pa khyad par can brnyes/de nas rje btsun la zhus nas dbus su byon/gnyal dang lo ro gnyis su bzhugs nas sgom sgrub byas te nyams mgur mang po dang mi la ras pa'i rnam thar yang gsungs/zhal slob mang du bskrun/mtha' dgung lo bdun cu rtsa brgyad pa rab byung gsum pa'i lcags sbrul (1161)lor sku gshegs so/_/'di nyid la slob ma mang du yod pa las/thugs kyi sras bcu gsum ni/lo byi mgo ba/gtsang pa sum pa/byar bo par sher snang/lo ro glan byi mgo ba bla ma sgom chos/lo ro mi sna ba sum ston chos dar/bum sgom nag po/la stod pa zangs ri ras pa/g.ye chen mo ba 'bri sgom don grub/gra phyi ma gnyal rdo rje 'od/gnyal smad pa cung ston rgyan ni/gnya'