rig pa 'dzin pa pad+ma dgyes pa'i rdo rje|{sle lung bzhad pa'i rdo rje/bod kyi sprul sku rnam gsum du grags pa'i nang tshan/'ol kha sle lung bzhad pa'i rdo rje'am 'ol kha gsang bdag rje drung blo bzang 'phrin las/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me glang spyi lo (1697)lor 'khrungs/'das lo mi gsal/'ol kha sle lung gi dgon par bzhugs pas sle lung dang/paN chen blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyi slob ma rje drung dge 'dun chos rgyal dbang phyug gi sprul sku yin pas rje drung sprul sku/lho brag mkhan (827) chen gsang bdag nam mkha'i sprul sku yin pas gsang bdag rje drung zhes zer zhing khong gi chos lugs ni dge lugs dang rnying ma gnyis kyi chos brgyud dang man ngag phan tshun bsres par mdzad pas de gnyis gang du'ang mi gtogs pa zhig yin gsung rtsom pod bcu lhag tsam de sngon zol kha sle long dgon par dpar yod rnam thar rang nyid kyis brtsams pa pod gcig tsam khong gi gsung 'bum nang du yod}
rig pa 'dzin pa gsum|{rdzas kyi rig 'dzin/longs spyod kyi rig 'dzin/lus kyi rig 'dzin gsum zer ro/rdzas kyi rig 'dzin ni mig smad dang rdzas kyis thun mong gi dngos grub thob pa lta bu'o/_/longs spyod kyi rig 'dzin ni rang snang du 'khor bsgyur gyi longs spyod thob pa lta bu la zer ro/_/lus kyi rig 'dzin ni mi lus ma spangs par 'dod pa'i lha dang skal ba mnyam pa'i 'ja' lus thob pa lta bu la zer ro/_}
