rig byed|{sngon rgya gar du byung ba'i mu stegs pa'i lta ba dang grub mtha' mang du yod pa'i nang gses rig byed kyi gzhung la zer zhing/(spyir rig byed ces pa'i phyi nang thun mong ba'i rig gnas mtha' dag la 'jug cing/rig byed kyi skad dod bdeHzhes pa ni rig pa'am gsal ba la 'jug pa yin )de la bzhi las/1 snyan ngag gi rig byed/2 srid srung gi rig byed/3 nges brjod kyi rig byed/4 mchod sbyin gyi rig byed bcas yin/dang po snyan ngag gi rig byed ni go sla zhing/gnyis pa srid srung gi rig byed ni 'jig rten gyi lugs bzang can ston pa/dper na (lugs kyi bstan bcos )lta bu la zer/gsum pa nges brjod kyi rig da ni rig byed kyi sngags lab rten nas nad zhi ba/tshe spel ba/rigs rgyud spel ba/rlung bsgom pa sogs mang po yod par bshad/bzhi pa mchod sbyin gyi rig byed ni/tshangs pa dang/dbang phyug sogs la mchod pa 'bul ba'i ched du rta dang/ba glang/ra lug /mi la sogs pa khri stong mang po bsad pa'i sha khrag (828) gi mchod rgyun byas na lha'i zhal mthong ba dang dngos grub thob pa sogs khas len pa la zer rig byed bzhi'i 'byung khungs la tshangs pa'i gdong bzhi las rig byed bzhi byung bar 'dod pa dang tshangs pa'i bu bzhis byas par 'dod pa dang tshangs pa'i mtsho zhes bya 'i chu las rig byed kyi yi ge'i sgra rnams gdangs kyi tshul gyis 'byung ba dang yang rig byed su gang gis ma byas gdod ma nyid nas yod par 'dod pa dang sus kyang ma byas rang byung nam mkha' lta bu yin zer ba sogs sngon gyi mkhas pa rnams kyi bzhes tshul du ma zhig mchis deng sang gi mkhas dbang 'gas ha tsam spyi lo'i sngon gyi lo tshig stong nyis brgya'i sngon rjes su rgya gar nub byang phyogs nas hin rdu'i chu bo'i 'bab yul du zhugs pa'i ya li an mis gna' bo'i ta zig las khyer 'ong ba'i rig gnas shig yin par bzhed pa sogs rib byed bzhi'i 'byung khungs la bzhed tshul mi 'dra ba mang po zhig yod pa las dpyad pa bas rig byed ni skyes bu ma byas pa'i cha med rtag pa rang byung nam mkha' lta bu dang sus kyang ma byas pa na bdes pa'i don can dang tshad mar 'dod pa yin no/_}
