rig 'dzin chos dbyings bzang mo|{shug gseb rje btsun rin po che rig 'dzin chos dbyings bzang mo 'di nyin yab khe smad pa'i rigs las byung ba don grub rnam rgyal dang yum bal mo bza' mtshan mtshar ram spen pa sgrol ma gnyis gyi sras mor rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu glang (1853)lor yab yum gnyis gya gar za hor gyi yul mtsho pad+mar gnas bskor du phebs skabs sku bltams/tshes bco lnga zhig la 'khrungs pa'i tshes cha dang sbyar te mtshan bco lnga lha mor gsol/khyim gyi 'tsho thabs dbul yang chung dus nas thugs rig rgyas la chos kyi bag chags zab pas nang chos kyi thos pa sgrub pa dang zhar la 'tsho thabs mchid pa'i ched du dgung lo lnga'i thog rnal 'byor ma tshe ring bu khrid kyi g.yog tu yum dang lhan du bzhugs/dgung lo drug tsam nas bla ma ma Ni bshad bskul mdzad/la dwags rgyal po'i dbu bla bla ma bkra shis rgyal gyi drung nas bod yig 'bri klog legs par bslabs/'tsho thabs zhan pas yab kyis gnas dang rje btsud nyid kyis zhabs bro bskyon te slong mo mdzad kyin mnga' ris dang/de nas gnas bskor dang sbrags yum gyi 'khrungs yul bal yul du (830) phebs nas mchod rten rnam gsum sogs gnas khyad par can phal mo che mjal zhang po 'brug pa 'phrin las rnam rgyal gyi drung nas 'brug pa bka' brgyud kyi sngon 'gro phyog len lnga ldan yongs rdzogs gsan dgung lo bcu gsum thog za hor rgyal pos rje btsun rin po che pho brang du gnas drangs te rgyal rgyud 'dzin pa'i sras 'byung thabs kyi rim 'gro zhus shing rje btsun gyi bka' bsgos bzhin bsgrubs te rjes su btsun mor sras shig 'khrungs pas rje btsun nyid rgyal po'i dbu blar bkur 'on kyang tshe 'dir bsnyen bkur la mi chags par skyid grong du bla ma pad+ma rgya mtsho mjal bar phebs par bla mas gdangs yod yod rgud bum pa gang byo'i tshul du bstsal ba zhus te sbas lung he ri khrod du sgrub pa lo gsum mdzad dgung lo bcu bdun thog nga bum pa can du sgom sbyong mdzad cing slar bal yul du phebs nas mchod rten rnam gsum sogs la sku dkar gsol mchod rten bya rung kha shor gyi dkar chag par du brkos de nas phyir phabs kyis ding rir shri rtsibs ri dang b