rig 'dzin lha khang|{'di'i nang gsang sngags rnying ma'i bla brgyud rig 'dzin brgyad dang/slob dpon pad+ma 'byung gnas kyi sprul pa'i rnam 'gyur mi 'dra ba gu ru mtshan brgyad bcas kyi sku brnyan bzhugs pa'i lha khang yin/dbus su slob dpon pad+ma 'byung gnas dang/de'i g.yas g.yon du lha lcam man ra ba dang/mkha' 'gro ye shes mtsho rgyal/g.yas kyi gral 'go nas rim bzhin rig 'dzin brgyad kyi sku (gong du rig 'dzin brgyad ces par gsal )dang/g.yon ngos nas rim bzhin gu ru mtshan brgyad kyi ste/1 gu ru pad+ma 'byung gnas/2 gu ru pad+ma sam b+ha ba/3 gu ru blo ldan mchog srid/4 gu ru pad+ma rgyal po/5 gu ru nyi ma 'od zer/6 gu ru shakya seng ge/7 gu ru seng ge sgra sgrog /8 gu ru rdo rje gro lod bcas kyi sku yod}
