rigs ldan nyer lnga|{shAkya mu nes dus 'khor rtsa rgyud thog mar gsung skabs zhu pa po sham b+ha la'i rgyal po zla ba bzang po yin la/des dus 'khor rtsa rgyud kyi 'grel pa sho lo ka stong phrag bcu gnyis pa mdzad/rtsa rgyud gsungs pa'i lo rjes ma der rgyal po rang nyid kyis pho brang de'i lho phyogs ma la yi'i skyed mos tshal chen po'i dbus dus 'khor gyi blos bslangs bzhengs nas 'das/de'i rjes su rgyal po zla ba/lha dbang/gzi brjid can/zla ba'i byin dang/lha'i dbang phyug /sna tshogs gzugs/lha'i dbang ldan rnams kyis chos bstan nas rgyal po mdzad pas de rnams la sngon gyi chos rgyal mtshan zhes bya zhing/sngon gyi chos rgyal bdun gyi tha ma lha'i dbang ldan dang btsun mo sna tshogs yum gyi sras su/1 rigs ldan rgyal po'i thog ma 'jam dpal grags pa 'khrungs/drang srong nyi ma'i shing rta sogs la dus 'khor gyi dbang bskur zhing/lo brgyar chos bstan/de nas/2 rigs ldan pad ma dkar pos 'grel chen dri med 'od brtsams shing lo brgyar chos bstan/de nas rim bzhin/3 bzang po/4 rnam rgyal/5 bshes gnyen bzang po/6 phyag dmar ram rin chen phyag /7 khyab 'jug sbas pa/8 nyi ma grags/9 shin tu bzang/10 rgya mtsho rnam rgyal/11 rgyal dka'/12 nyi ma/13 sna tshogs gzugs/14 zla ba'i 'od/15 mtha' yas/16 sa skyong/17 dpal skyong/18 seng ge /19 rnam par gnon/20 stobs po che/21 me 'gags pa (da lta ma 'gags pa rgyal sar 'khor nas lo sum cu so bdun song zer/) 22 mi yi seng ge /23 dbang phyug chen po/24 mtha' yas rnam rgyal/25 drag po 'khor lo can ste rigs ldan nyer lnga'o/_/rgyas par sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i (bai DUr+ya dkar po )dang/) (g.ya' sel )klong rdol zla ma'i gsung 'bum gyi le tshan (ca)pa'i nang du gsal}
