rin chen rgyan cha|{sngar bod kyi chos rgyal gong rim gyi chas gos ring chen rgyan cha zhes gser ga (gser gyi ga'u )bod g.yu zhes gcig gi phra tshongs can che chung bre tshad tsam skor gzugs ma gcig dang/sog sgor zhes de las cung chung ba nor gzugs ma/sog rna bcas g.yu khra gong mtshungs/rna brgyangs zhes bod g.yu the bong tsam nyi shu skor dngul gyi mtha' skyor thog gral bstar sgrig pa ring thung skum khru gang tsam/shal dmar zhes byu ru dkrugs ma che chung kham tshig che ba tsam rdog grangs brgya dang sum cu skor yod pa'i do shal gcig /shal ser zhes spos shel rnying ma zhe gcig ngang sgong che tshad tsam rdog grangs nyi shu skor yod pa'i rdo shal gcig (do shal dmar ser zer )ko lham 'go snam mtshal ljang gi yu sbyar/gos thon mthing sngo khra'am/dpyad ldan gang rung gi rtsi gos dang/rtsi ber sram rgyan ma/gtsug zhwa sgro gzugs bcas yod cing/de snga pho brang po ta lar rin chen rgyan cha cha tshang sum cu so bzhi yod pa de dag cha tshang rer 'jug sdod stag sgam re bcas sgam grangs sum cu so bzhi yod pa rnams dgung gsar dang chibs bsgyur sogs mdzad sgo khag la 'don pa ma gtogs rnam kun rtse dus 'khor lha khang 'og dzam lha khang du bsdu 'jug zhu dgos pa yin}
