rin po che grags pa ye shes|{rang byung bzhi pa'i lcags byi (1240)lor yab dpon mgon po rgyal gyi sras su 'khrungs/gzhon nu la rje spyan snga dang mjal/zla dgon du yi ge 'bri klog bslabs/de rjes rgyal ba'i bkas phag mo grur byon nas rab tu byung/chos khrid rnams rdzogs par gsan/de nas sa skyar 'gro mgon 'phags pa'i drung du phebs/zhogs pa re la mdo sdud pa tshar re tsam mkhyen pa byung nas sher rab che bar grags/sla bcu gnyis pa la zab chos gnas nas sgrub pa mdzad/zhe gnyis pa lcags sbrul (1281)lor dpal phag mo gru pa'i gdan sar phebs nas lo brgyad bzhugs/dgung lo zhe dgu pa rab byung lnga pa'i sa byi (1288)lor sku gshegs}
rin po che rgyal tsha|{(rgyal tsha rin chen mgon yang zhu )khro phu bka' brgyud kyi srol gtod pa po/rje 'di nyid rang byung gnyis pa'i sa khyi (1118)lor yab gnubs kyi gdung rgyud dang/yum lha gcig gi sras su shab smad 'dzal du sku 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga nas yig rtsis bslabs/sku chung ngu'i dus nas 'jig rten pa mi mnyes shing chos la dgyes pa zhig yod/slob dpon gan chag pa dang/gnur nyi ma/ram sding ma ba/dge ba'i rtsi nyan sogs bla ma mang po bsten nas chos mang du gsan/dgung lo bcu dgu par dbus su phebs te g.yog po lugs smad du pu hrengs lo tsA ba'i dngos slobs mngar chos kyi rgyal po/mes ston kun snying/rngog mdo sde sogs bsten/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa lnga par rang yul du byon nas che 'don mdzad cing/chos 'ga' re yang gsungs/de nas brag dkar pa bo/zhu don mo ri ba sogs blam mang po las chos gsan/blam dmar gyis phag mo grur brdzangs pa ltar byon nas phag mo gru pa'i sku mdun nas chos gdams ngag mang du gsan cing/der phyag rgya chen po'i rtog pa khyad par can 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga bcu rtsa bzhi par don mi rim byon nas mkhas po zhang zhi mdzes las bsnyen par rdzogs/rab byung gsum pa'i lcags yos (1171)lor khro phu dgon pa btab nas dge 'dun nyi shu tsam bsdus/de nas bzung khro phu bka' brgyud bya ba byung/mtha' dgung lo bdun cu rtsa brgyud pa rab byung gsum pa'i shing yos (1195)lor sku gshegs}
