rin spungs don yod rdo rje|{yab kun bzang pa'i sras su rab byung brgyad pa'i chu rta (1462)lor 'khrungs/sku nar son skabs rdzong chen bcu gnyis kyi las ka bzung/rab byung brgyad pa'i sa phag (1479)lor zhwa dmar chos kyi grags pa dang mchod yod 'brel nas yangs pa can du dgon pa 'debs pa dang/karma pa chos grags rgya mtsho'i bzhed pa ltar chu phag (1503)lor sa'i nye 'dabs sa nag mar karma dgon gsar thub bstan chos 'khor btab na'ang se 'bras kyis bshig pa sogs dus mi bde ba chen po byung/lcags byi (1480)lor don yod rdo rje dang g.yung pa tshe dbang gnyis nas mdag gtos che ba drangs te yar lung mthil du slebs shing/ka bzhi pa shar nub gter thog nas bton pa dang/gzhas ka brag dkar ba dang/chu shul lhun po rtse'i rdzong sogs snel pa'i lag nas phrogs/la stod byang du byang bdag pa nam mkha' rdo rje nga/la stod lho pa rdzong kha chos rgyal nor bu'i sde sogs kyi sa khul la yang dmag kha yar byas/skyid shod du dpung 'jug sgo brtsams/sa lug (1499)lor don yod rdo rjes rin spungs pa mtsho skyes rdo rje sogs sde dpon rnams dang gra sa te 'brug chen ngag dbang chos kyi rgyal po sne gdong gi khrir bton thog gzhis ka rin spungs pa'i skyed tshal kha ru gdan drangs shing/mi dbang don yod rdo rje yab yum gyis tshogs kyi 'khor lo rgya cher bskor/don yod rdo rje dgung lo nga gcig la phebs pa rab byung dgu pa'i chu sprel (1512)lor sku gshegs}
rin spungs nor bu bzang po|{rab byung bdun pa'i chu lug (1403)lor yab nam mkha' rgyal po'i sras su 'khrungs/des sne gdong dbang grags pa 'byung gnas kyi blon po mdzad/yab mes k+khayi dus ltar rdzong sdod dang khri dpon gyi las ka blangs/yar lung pa a 'bum gyis bkod pa'i rin spungs pa'i gdung rabs nang/nor bu bzang pos dgung lo bcu gnyis nas rin spungs kyi 'gan bzhes/dgung lo bco lnga la shangs 'brong po sgam pa dang dpon g.yog mdzad/stag gling skyur gsum btul/shangs lung pa kha gtsang zhabs su bcug /byang rgyud mun 'tshubs pa de bde 'jam yug gcig tu btang/shangs rong gi dmag dang bcas gzhis ka bsam grub rtse brtsis bzhes/'phyong rgyas pa rang yul du brdzangs/gtsang rong shangs gsum lhad med kyis skyong dar gnang zhes 'khod par ltar shing yos (1435)lor nor bu bzang pos bsam grub rtse'i rdzong dpon de gzhung phal cher gyi srid dbang bzung pas 'di nas phag gru'i srid dbang 'thor 'go tshugs/rab byung bdun pa'i me lug (1437)lor nor bu bzang pos rong byams chen gyi cho sa sde dang gtsug lag khang chen po'i gzhi bting nas lo ngo bdun la grub pa dang/dge 'du rnams la 'tsho ba'i mthun rkyen gya nom pa sbyar/dgung lo so lnga bzhes pa me sbrul (1437)lor 'bras yul skyed tshal chos sde phyag btab pa bcas chos sde yas mas la dbyar dgun dpyid chos kyi phogs sogs mthun rkyen sbyar/dgung lo drug cu re drug par gser zangs las grub pa'i rong byams chen sku tshad zal pa thog so dgu yod pa bzhengs 'go tshugs nas lo drug la legs par grub pa dang 'brel sku gsung thugs rten dpag tu med pa bzhengs/rab gnas su rgyal gar nas paN chen nags kyi rin chen spyan drangs pa dang/brag dmar chos sde rnying pa'i 'dabs su spyil bu brgya phrag (841) tsam brtsigs te thos bsam sgom pa tshul bzhin byed pa'i 'dus grwa btsugs pa sogs ris med kyi grub mtha' thams cad la bsnyen bkur bla na med pa mdzad phag mo gru pa'i gdung rgyud rnams dang dbon zhang 'brel bas chab srid kyi nang la mthong bzos che byams chen bzhengs grub nas mi ring bar gshegs}
rin spungs pa kun bzang pa|{yab rin spungs pa nor bu bzang po'i sras 'dis gong ma grags pa 'byung gnas sku mched kyi zhabs la gtugs shing/yab mes kyi 'ja' sa dang las ka blangs te rin spungs pa'i rdzong dpon mdzad skabs dpal ldan sa skya pa'i ring lugs 'dzin pa kun mkhyen sangs rgyas 'phel dang go ram pa bsod nams seng ge dang mchod yon 'brel te 'bras yul skyed tshal gyi bshad grwa btsugs shing/rta nag thub bstan dgon 'debs pa'i mthun rkyen yang mdzad/'khrungs 'das kyi lo tshogs dang mdzad rnam zhib par ma rnyed}
rin spungs pa ngag dbang 'jigs grags|{rab byung brgyad pa'i chu stag (1428)lor yab rin spungs ngag dbang rnam rgyal kyi sras su sku 'khrungs/slob dpon mkhas pa dum bsten nas rig nas che chung la gzhan dring mi 'jog pa'i spobs pa brnyes shing mkhyen rab gyi klong rnam par yangs pas rgyal po paN+Di ta'i rnam thar bzung zhing/rab byung dgu pa'i sa yos (1519)lor sa skya paN+Di ta'i rnam thar skal bzang legs lam mdzad pa dang/lcags sbrul (1521)lor (mngon brjod mkhas pa'i rna rgyan )dang/me khyi (1526)lor (snyan 'grel mi 'jigs seng+ge'i nga ro )me sbrul (1556)lor (sham b+ha la'i lam yig )sogs tshig sbyor phun sum tshogs pa'i bstan bcos mang du mdzad de bod kyi rtsom rig 'phel rgyas la phyag rjes che/rje 'dis hor gong bzang po'i rgyu las grub pa'i rigs ldan yol bar grags pa'i bkod pas khyad par du 'phags pa bzhengs shing/rje kun dga' grol mchog rab gnas su gdan drangs/sa skya dang byang bdag pa ma mthun pas sa skya'i rgyal rogs ngag dbang 'jigs grags pas mdzad/chu phag (1563)lorarin spungs pa'i dmag g.yas ru byang pa'i steng du btegs pa'i tshe sde pa ngag dbang 'jigs grags rang yang dpung hrag dang bcas dmag rgyab tu phebs skabs lam zhor du bya rgod gshongs pa rnams brdungs pas dge 'dun pa tsho la'ang 'o brgyal che ba byung/lo de gar 'bangs gyen log lta bu byas/de rjes rin spungs pas rgyal rtse ba dang/'brong rtse ba/snar thang sogs la'ang dpung 'jug kha yar byas na yang de dag gi rgyab skyor zhing shag pas byas stabs rin spungs pa pham kha bstud mar byung ste ngag dbang 'jigs grags kyi mnga' thang phal cher shor nas rin spungs pas bod la dbang bsgyur ba'i mjug kyang de'i dus su bsgril to/_}
rin spungs mtsho skyes rdo rje|{rab byung brgyad pa chu rta (1462)lorayab rin spungs dor bzang pa'i sras su 'khrungs/des dpung stobs la brten nas yar lung mkhar thog gi rdzong bzung/da'i tshe sne gdong sde srid ngag gi dbang phyug gshegs te gdung rgyud sku na phra skabs pho brang sne gdong rtse'i dpon tshab dang thel gtong mdzad/rab byung brgyad pa'i lcags phag (1491)nas lo dgu'i ring rin spungs mtsho skyes rdo rjes dpon tshab thel gtong zhes bya ba don du phag mo gru pa'i srid kyi kha lo bsgyur/khong gis dpon tshab dbang byug byed ring phag gru'i blon po gzhan rnams ma mgu bas yar lung nang sde gzar yang yang byung rung rin spungs pa'i dpung stobs la 'gran thub pa zhig ma byung zhing/rin spungs pa'i stobs shugs je cher rgyas pas dbus gtsang yongs la dbang sgyur byed thub pa'i rmang gzhi chags/rin spungs mtsho skyes rdo rje dang don yod rdo rjes gtso byas pa'i sde dpon rnams sne gdong (842) du 'tshogs te sa lug (1499)lor ngag dbang bkra shis grags pa dgung lo bcu gnyis gzhes pa sne gdong gi khrir bton rab byung dgu pa'i lcags rta (1510)lor mtsho skyes rdo rje 'das}
