ris su ma chad pa'i bstan pa|{bod du ni rnying ma sa skya bka' brgyud dge lugs sogs nang pa sangs rgyas pa'i (843) chos lugs kyi grub mtha' ris mi 'dra ba mang du yod pa de dag tshang mas rang nyid kyi phyogs bzung nas gzhan la dma' 'bebs dang mthong chung bkag 'gog sogs mi byed pa'i thog grub mtha' rang rang gi lta spyod gtsang mar skyong ba de la grub mtha' ris med zer zhing de las ldog pa la grub mtha' phyogs ris can zhes brjod pa yin la grub mtha' phyags ris med pa yin khul gyis chos lugs so so'i chos skad dang man ngag lag len lta tshul bshas phar bsres tshur bsres byas pa ni grub mtha' ris med kyi don la go nor thebs pa zhig yin na go ba log sgrub byas pa zhig red bod kyi lo rgyus thog chos lugs grub mtha'i phyogs zhen bzung nas phan tshun mthun sgril ma byung ba'i skabs su mi rigs nang khul gyi mthun sgril la yang gtor bshig chen po thebs pa ma zad skabs de'i dbang bsgyur gral rim dang phyi nang gi dgra bos go skabs de bzung nas dmag 'khrug dang nang 'khrug bslabs te rang nyid kyi chab srid la zhabs 'degs zhu thabs byas pa'i dpe mtshon mang po yod pa de yi thog nas bslab bya blangs te chos lugs grub mtha' khag rnams phan tshun bar mthun sgril byed rgyu ni rang nyid kyi mi rigs hril po mthun sgril yong ba byed rgyu'i gal che'i 'gan len zhig yin}
