res gza' bdun|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi dus 'khor skar rtsis nas bshad srol la/nyi ma la sogs pa'i gza' bdun po rnams rang rang thog mar skyes pa'i zhig de la dbang byed pa yin pas na res gza' zhes btags pa yin/de yang thog mar nyi ma dang rgyu skar gyi gnas sa khyim bcu gnyis chags pa dang/de rjes rgyu skar nyer bdun chags shing/de rjes khyim dum bu bcu gnyis po rnams rlung 'gros kyis g.yas bskor du 'khor ba'i nang gses kar+Na'i khyim de shar gling dbus ma'i tshangs thig gi steng du yod pa'i skar ma skag gi thad kar slebs pa na me'i rang bzhin ldan pa'i 'od kyi gong bu zhig thog mar thon pa de ni nyi ma yin zhing/de nas sa yi go la'i thog nyin mtshan gyi dbye ba thog mar byung ba yin pas na gza' nyi ma de gza' rnams kyi dang por bzhag /nyi ma de byung rjes su de nyid skar khyim gyi thog nas rang 'gros g.yon bskor du 'khor te slar yang rang gi skyes khyim kar+Na'i khyim du slebs pa dang nyi ma de ring nyid kyi skyes skar skag dang mnyam du 'grogs nas lho gling dbus ma'i lug khyim gyi steng du yod pa'i skar ma tha skar gyi thad du 'byor ba na chu'i rang bzhin ldan pa'i zla ba byung ste de'i yar ngo dang mar ngo'i 'phel 'grib kyi 'gyur ldog la brten nas zla ba gcig gi tha snyad byung/de bzhin du nyi ma g.yos skor du 'khor nas skar ma mchu'i thad du slebs pa na mig dmar/lhag mtshams kyi thad du slebs pa na lhag pa/me bzhi'i thad du slebs pa na phur bu/de rjes slar yang nyi ma nag pa'i thad du slebs pa na sgra gcan/nam gru'i thad du slebs pa na dus me/chu smad kyi thad du slebs pa na mjug ring bcas rim par skyes/gza' dgu po de'i nang nas sgra gcad dang du me gnyis ni mgo mjug gi khyad par tsam ma gtogs ngo bo gcig yin pas de gnyis gcig tu brtsis pa'i gza' brgyad po de rnams rang rang gi thun mong ma yin pa'i 'gros la brten nas g.yon bskor du 'khor ba dang/phyi ma phyi ma ma skyes kyi bar du snga ma rnams kyi zhag gnyis res dang gsum res sogs kyis res bskor byas nas 'khor zhing/gza' spen pa skyes rjes gza' bdun po (850) rnams kyis rang rang thog mar skyes pa'i go rim dang mthun par res mos kyi thog nas skar khyim so sor longs spyod pa'i rgyu mtshan de la brten nas res gza' zhes ming btags pa yin}
res gza' bdun dang lhan cig tu 'grogs pa'i 'bras bu|{skar rtsis kyi gzhung las res gza' bdun po de dang rgyu skar nyer bdun po so so lhan gcig tu 'joms pa na 'bras bu bzang ngan sna tshogs 'byung bar bshad cing/de la skar rtsis pa'i lugs su 'phrod ces ming btags pa yin/de la skar rtsis pa'i lugs dang rgya nag gi 'byung rtsis pa'i lugs gnyis yod pa'i nang nas dang po skar rtsis pa'i lugs ltar na/gza' bdun gyi nang nas nyi ma dang mig dmar gnyis ni me khams/zla ba lhag pa chu yi khams/phur bu dang sgra gcan gnyis ni rlung khams/pa sangs dang spen pa gnyis sa yi khams yin/de bzhin du rgyu skar nyer bdun gyi nang nas smin drug /rgyal/mchu/gro/sa ga /khrums stod/bra nye bcas bdun ni me khams/snar ma/lham mtshams/snron/chu smad/bro bzhin/mon gru bcas drug ni sa khams/mgo/nabs so/dbo/me bzhi/nag pa/sa ri/tha skar bcas ni rlung khams/lag /skag /snubs/chu stod/mon bro/khrums smad/nam gru bcas bdun gyi chu khams yin pas sa gnyis/chu gnyis/me gnyis/rlung gnyis/sa chu/me rlung bcas 'phrod pa rnams bzang ba dang/sa rlung/chu rlung/sa me/me chu bcas 'phrod pa rnams ngan pa yin par bshad/gzhan yang 'phrod sbyor nyer brgyad dang/thu mong ma yin pa'i 'phrod gsum 'grub sbyor bdun sogs bshad tshul mang po yod pa zhib par (bai DUr+ya dkar po )dang/(rtsis gzhung nyin byed snang ba )sogs kyi nang gsal bas 'dir ming tsam las ma bris so/_}
res gza' 'od zer bdun pa|{'di gza' spen pa'i ming ste gza' spen pa'i mtha' yod kyi a long lta bu bdun yod ces bshad srol yod}
res gza' lha yi bla ma|{nyin zhag bdun la res mos kyis 'khor ba'i gza' bdun gyi nang tshan gza' phur bu ste/mu stegs pa'i rig byed kyi gtam rgyud du gza' phur bur ni lha'i dbang po brgya byin la sgra rig pa slob mkhan gyi slob dpon yin pas na lha yi bla ma zhes ming du btags par bshad}
ro rkyang gnyis|{lus kyi rtsa gtso bor gsum gyi dbu ma'i g.yon la rkyang ma dang g.yas su ro ma yod pa gnyis}
ro rkyang du rgyu ba bkag|{rtsa ra mo dang rkyang ma gnyis kyi nang du rlung rgya ba bkag te las rlung thams cad rtsa dbu ma'i nang du zhugs gnas thim gum byas pa la ban nasab de stong gi ye shes skye ba'i thabs shig ste zhib par gsang sngags bla med kyi gzhung rnams las gsal bas 'dir ma bris so/_}
ro skam pa lo sgom nyi ma shes rab|{gung thang bla ma zhing gi slob ma/ro skam gyi dgon pa btab pas mtshan la ro skam par thogs/lo rgyus zhib par ma mthong lags}
ro brgya|{zas rigs la ro dang bro ba'i dbang du byas na rtsa ba'i ro drug ste/mnga' ba/skyur ba/kha ba/bska ba/tshwa ba/lan tshwa ba bcas yin/de re re la nang gses kyis drug drug phyed ba'i nyis bsres sum cu so drug /sum cu so drug po re re la ro mi 'dra ba sna tshogs bsres na brgya phrag kha shas su 'gyur 'gro bas ro brgya pa zer}
ro brgya dang brgyad|{ro sum cu so drug po la lce shes la phan pa'i ro dang/'ju bar mngon du phyogs pa'i tshe lus sems la mi gnod pa'i ro dang/zhu tshe lus sems la phan pa'i ro ste re re la gsum gsum phye bas brgya dang brgyad yod pa'i phyir}
ro brgyad kyi sha za ba'i phra men ma brgyad|{gsham du ro chen za ba'i phra men ma brgyad ces par gzigs}
ro bsgrubs pa|{'di'i lo rgyus (rgya gar chos 'byung )nang du gsal}
ro gcig|{rnal 'byor bzhi'i nang gses gsum pa ro gcig gi rnal 'byor ni phyi rol yul gyi snang ba dang ring gi sems gyi ngo bo ro gcig tu 'dres pa'i nyams 'char ba ste/rje rgod tshang pas 'di mdo lugs kyi sa gnyis pa dri ma med pa nas sa bdun pa ring du song ba'i bar gyi dod thub par gsungs}
ro bcu gnyis|{kha ba/skyur ba/tshwa ba/bska ba/lan tshwa/mngar ba/yid du 'ong ba/yid du mi 'ong ba/gnyis ka ma yin pa/lhan cig skyes pa/sbyar ba las byung ba/gyur pa las byung ba'o/_}
ro bcud bda'|{ro bcud bro ba'am/kha skad la bro ba kha ba zer}
ro chen brgyad|{1 shar na stobs bzang ye shes kyi ro/2 lho na 'chi bdag spros pa'i ro/3 nub na stobs ldan mnan pa'i ro/4 byang na khyab 'jug 'tshogs pa'i ro/_/5 sharo na dga' mar yi chad kyi ro/6 lho nub na 'tshogs (pa'i )gsal shing gi ro/7 nub byang na 'brong gi rgod pa'i ro/8 byang shar na smin drug gdengs pa'i ro bcas la zer}
