ro snyoms skor drug|{rnam rtog lam 'khyer/nyon mongs lam 'khyer/na tsha lam 'khyer/lha 'dre lam 'khyer/sdug bsngal lam 'khyer/'chi ba lam 'khyer bcas drug go }
ro snyoms chos brgyad|{bde ba dang/rnyed pa/snyan pa/bstod pa bcas 'dod pa'i phyogs bzhi dang/sdug bsngal dang/ma rnyed pa/mi snyan pa/smad pa bcas mi 'dod pa'i phyogs bzhi ste/brgyad po de la dga' mi dga'i bsam pa med pa la chos brgyad ro snyoms sam ro snyoms chos brgyad zer}
