ro drug|{mngar ba/skyur ba/kha ba/bska ba/tshwa ba/lan tshwa ba ste drug go}
ro smad myi theg|{gzugs smad mi khyog pa/(tsa)}
ro 'dzin dbang mngon|{ro 'dzin pa'i dbang po'i mngon sum ste/rang gi bdag rkyen lce'i dbang po las dngos su skyes pa'i gzhan rig shes pa rtog bral la ma 'khrul ba la go}
ro langs gser sgrub gyi sgrung|{yongs grags su ro sgrung zer/'di ni rgya gar gyi slob dpon chen po klu sgrub kyis ro longs sgrub nas lus gser du bsgyur ba 'i gtam rgyud le'u mang po yod pa zhig yin/sgrub shod mkhan ni ro dngos grub rdo rje zer ba'i ro langs de slob dpon gyi slob ma bde spyod bzang pos btul rjes sgal par khur nas khyer yong ba'i lam bar du ro dngos grub rdo rjes bshad pa yin zer srol yod/'di la le'u nyi shu rtsa gcig yod pa/nyi shu rtsa bdun yod pa/sum cu so bdun yod pa sogs sna tshogs 'dug /mtsho sngon mi rigs dpe skrun khang dang/mi rigs dpe skrun gang gnyis nas dpar skrun byas yod}
ro so drug|{mnga' ba'i mngar ba/mngar ba'i skyur ba/mngar ba'i kha ba/mngar ba'i ska ba/mngar ba'i tshwa ba/mngar ba'i lan tshwa ba drug yod pa bzhin du lan tshwa ba'i bar re re la yang drug drug phye bas so drug yod pa'i phyir}
rog ston dkon cog skyabs|{rab byung gnyis pa'i nang mang mkhar tsha lung du gdung rgyud ming la rog ces pa'i sras su sku 'khrungs/dgung lo chung ngu'i dus nas thugs brtson chen pos mdo rgyud sogs thun min dang thun mong gi rig gnas rnams gsan/khyad par du dbus su byon nas grwa pa mngon shes can gyi slob ma dge bshes khul ston dbus pa dar grags kyi zhabs la gtugs te gso ba rig pa'i dpal ldan rgyud bzhi rdzogs par zhus/'phags yul du thengs gcig phebs nas thams cad mkhyen pa shan+ti pa phyi ma las gso dpyad yan lag brgyad pa gsan/gzhung gi sa bcad bsdus don rin po che'i dra ba zhes brtsams pa bcas rang gi slob ma'i thu bo gangs ri'i khrod kyi sman pa'i rgyal po gnyis pa g.yu thog gsar ma yon tan mgon po la bka' babs so/_}
rog shes rab rgya mtsho|{(dol ba dmar zhur ba yang zhu )rje 'di nyid po to ba'i slob ma chen po brgyad kyi ya rgyal yin/rab byung dang po'i sa phag (1059)lor sngags pa yon tan shin tu che ba gcig gi sras su sku 'khrungs/rab tu byung nas rogs mngon pa ba dang/rgya 'dus 'dzin gnyis la mngon pa dang 'dul ba gsan/po to bo gung lo nyer gnyis bar bsten/de rting 'gro don rgya cher mdzad/tshogs pa yang yang gang du stong lhag pa byung zer/rje 'di nyin la 'gro mgon phag mo grub pas chos 'brel gsan/mthar dgung lo don gsum pa rab byung gnyis pa'i lcags phag (1131)lor sku gshegs}
rog shes rab 'od|{yab bkra shis grags pa dang yum chos kyi dge gnyis kyi sras su bar byung gsum pa'i me khyi (1166)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga pa la mes po shes rab bla mas yig rtsis bslabs/dgung lo bdun pa la phabs skabs klog mkhas par gyur nas nyin gcig la nyi khri tshar gcig thon/dgung grangs bcu bar du yab mes gnyis lag nang sngags kyi chos rnams bslabs/bcu nas bcu gsum gyi bar du yab kyis phur pa'i bsnyen pa mtshams byas nas skyel du bcug pas grub rtags kyang mang du byung/dgung lo bcu gsum nas bcu bzhi bar du rog ston btsan po las lo gsum nas bcu bzhi bar du rog ston btsan po las sog lugs kyi mdo sgyu sems gsum/sgrub thabs rnam gsum/a ro gsang skor/bi ma la/zhe byed yas brgyud kyi gdams pa rnams gsan zhing mkhas par gyur/de nas rog stong klu sbyin las kyi la'i sgrub thabs mang po dang/'phags skor 'gyur gsar/bde mchog mar do lugs rnams gsan/dgung lo bco lnga pa la lhab dres ma gong ba la mdo sgyu skyo lugs dang lung gi rgyud bu chung drug /snga 'gyur gyi rgyud lnga/bdud rtsi khangs lugs/rta mgrin lha bzhi/sgron sprul la sogs zhus/bcu drug nas nyi shu'i bar slob dpon yam shud dngos grub las mdo sgyu zur lugs gsan/der tshogs pa rnams kyis sus kyang rtsod pa ma thub pas sngar mtshan rgya mon zer ba la/yam shud kyis shes rab 'od du btags/bco brgyad pa la sgyu 'phrul ram rim gyi TIka dang gzhi lam gyi stong thun brtsams/bcu dgu pa la gtsang du byon nas so dar seng dang/lang ston jo pad/rgya bsod nams 'bar/gtsang nag brtson 'grus seng ge /grub thob dngos grub sogs mkhas grub kyi bla ma mang po la mdo sngags kyi zab chos mtha' yas pa gsan/de nas dbus su byon nas grwa thang du phebs/nyi shu rtsa gcig nas nyan bshad thun mong thog bla ma mang po la gsan pa mdzad/gdung lo nyi shu rtsa lnga pa'i rgyal gyis nya ba'i mtshan mo thun (853) bcud kyi tshul du nyams su blangs pa'i tshe rtogs pa'i ye shes phyin ci ma log pa thugs la 'khrungs 'khor 'das kyi chos thams cad ming tsang du grol bar gyur de nas skam lugs kyi sgrub pa mdzad par dgongs nas dngos po thams cad btang ste gsol zhal tsam yang ma lus par mdzad de rtse ba sgang gi dbus khang du lo gsum 'dag 'byar dang 'tsho ba bcud len na bza' bem po smra bcad mdzad nas nyams su ba langs pas lam rtags dang rdo rus phrad te zag pa'i rgyun chad zla ba gcig gi bar du nyin mtshan med pa'i snang ba shar gdung lo bzhi bcu pa la rgyal tsha mdo dbang gis snye mdo phul ba bzhes nas gdan sa smra ba'i seng ge la gtad re brgyad pa la chos grwa chen po sum cur zla ba phyed kyi bar du chos kyi 'khor lo chen po bskor dgung lo bdu cu don dgu la phabs par rab byung bzhi pa'i shing 'brug (1244)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
rong ngur smig|{rin spungs rdzong gi rong byams chen gyi nye skor la yod/lo tsA ba chen po rwa lo'i dus nas yod pa'i dgon pa ches snga ba zhig yin}
rong ston shAkya rgyal mtshan|{rje 'di nyid shar rgyal mo rung du yab bon po ge god rgyal po dang/yum rgya gar sman zhes bya ba'i sras su rab byung drug pa'i me lug (1367)lor sku bltams/thog mar yab kyi drung du bod chos la sbyangs shing lugs de la brten pa'i 'phrin las kyang du ma mdzad/dgung lo bcu brgyad pa la dbus gtsang du byon te gsang phu ne'u thogs kyi chos grwar phebs/gling stod pa rin chen rnam rgyal la byang sems kyi sdom pa bzhes/rje 'di dang kong ston blo gros dbang phyug gi drung du rngog lo nas brgyud pa'i phar tshad bsdus gsum dang/dbu ma rang brgyud pa'i bshad srol/skyor mo lung gi mkhan chen dka' bzhi pa dang/'phan yul gro ba'i mkhas pa dmar ston la 'dul ba sman lugs bya 'dul dang thog dka' chen gyi bshad srol/mngon pa mdzod mchims lugs kyi bshad srol/thang zag pa sprul sku gzhon nu rgyal mtshan la dbu ma thal 'gyur ba tshab gyi bshad srol/lo pa shAkya rin chen gyi drung du mngon pa gong ma sogs la sbyangs/dgung lo nyer gnyis pa la gro sa mkhan chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan dang dmar ston pa'i drung du bsnyen par rdzogs/mtshan shAkya rgyal mtshan dpal bzang por gsol/rnam nges kyi TIka brtsams shing 'chad pa'i 'khur bzung/dgung lo nyer bdun pa la mkhas chen g.yag sde pa dang mjal te sa lugs kyi mdo'i bshad srol dang/theg chen chos rje las gsung ngag sogs kyi zab don bzhes nas sa rngog rnam gnyis kyi bshad srol rgyun bsrings te/phya pa chos seng da nga/bcom ldan rig ral/kun mkhyen 'di gsum las 'chad pa'i rgyun dang/dngos slob bstan 'dzin gyi thon che ba ma byung zhes grags/dgung lo lnga bcu tsam la stod ding ri dang mus sogs su sngags kyi zab don bzhes pa dang/mdo phyogs kyi 'phrin las spel ba kho na mdzad/dgung lo drug cu re gcig pa la sde dpon so so'i bsod nams kyi mgron dang/mdo sngags kyi chos 'khor rgya che bar bskor/dgung lo re dgu pa shing yos (1435)lor 'phan po nA len+d+ra'i chos grwa btab nas gzhan don mdzad/phar phyin bstan pa dang/dbu ma rang brgyud pa'i bstan pa la kun mkhyen 'di bka' drin che/dgung lo nyer gnyis pa la tshad ma rnam nges 'chad pa nas brtsams te ya ngan las 'das pa'i bar nyin re la tha na slob ma gcig tsam la yang gtsug lag gi tshigs su bcad pa gcig yan chad kyi chos kyi sbyin pa mdzad par dam bcas/gzhan la gnod pa dang/tho 'tsham pa/phrag dog gi rnam pa cung zad kyang mi mnga'/dgung lo brgyad cu gya gsum bzhes pa'i tshe yang gzhung chen po dag kyang thugs nas thogs pa med par gsung thub/ (854) dbus gtsang gi grwa sa chen po rnams su gzhung po ti bcu la grwa skor mdzad pas rtsod pa'i khyu mchog du grags shing rong ston smra ba'i seng+ge zhes pa'i mtshan snyan gsol mkhan chen sangs rgyas dpal ba'i mdzad srol gtso bor bzung nas mngon par rtogs pa'i rgyan 'grel pa dang bcas pa rgyun mi chad par gsungs shing de'i man ngag zhi byed brgyud pa phyi ma la gtso bor mdzad gsum rtsom la (tshad ma rnam nges kyi 'grel pa rtog ge'i snang ba )dang ('bum gyi 'grel pa rgyas bsdus )gnyis la sogs pa gzhung chen bzhi bcu zhe gcig gi rnam bshad kyis gsos tshos tshan sum brgya lnga bcu'i grangs su brtsams par mdzad gsum las skyes pa'i slob ma'i gtso bo ni snga tshar gyi bu chen bstan pa 'degs pa'i ka chen bzhi bar tshar gyi bu chen gangs can mdzes pa'i rgyan brgyad dang mchog gnyis gsung thugs kyi mdzad spyod mtshungs pa'i bu chen gsum phyi tshar gyi bu chen bstan pa'i gsal byed bcu drug yang tshar gyi bu chen grags pa can bzhi la sogs pas gtsos sde snod 'dzin pa stong phrag 'ga' bskyangs dgung lo brgyad cu gya gsum la phebs pa rab byung brgyad pa'i sa sbrul (1449)lor zhi bar gshegs so/_}
rong tha blo bzang chos 'byor lhun grub|{rje 'di smad mdo khams kyi char gtogs pa'i 'bri zla zal mo sgam rgyal bzang gi 'brog sder yab bkra shis dpal ldan dang yum sman lha tshe ring gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me sbrul (1857)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo drug la phebs skabs rje blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan gyi yang srid du ngos 'dzin gyis gdan sa rong tha rwa nyag theg chen gling du gdan drangs te khri la gsol/rje blo bzang 'phrin las rgyal mtshan mchog nas gtsug phud bzhes pa dang dge bsnyen du bsgrubs nas mtshan blo bzang chos 'byor lhun grub ces gsol/dgung lo bcu la yongs 'dzin dgongs rdzogs kyi ched du dbus gtsang du phebs/rgyal dbang thams cad mkhyen pa 'phrin las rgya mtsho dang paN chen thams cad mkhyen pa dang mjal/khyab bdag 'jog ri pa chen po dang ke'u tshang mchog sprul rin po che blo bzang ye shes gnyis kyi drung du gsang bde 'jigs gsum gyi dbang lung du ma gsan/dgung lo bcu gcig la phebs skabs phur bu lcog byang chub gling dben gnas su byams mgon bla ma rin po che'i drung nas dge bsnyen dang rab byung dge tshul dang bcas pa'i sdom pa bzhes/mtshan yang sngar yod kyi gong du byams pa zhes bsnan pa tsam las gzhan sor bzhag mdzad de pha yul phyogs su byon/gdung lo bcu gsum la ko rdzong gi paN+Di ta nA na'i mtshan can gyi drung nas snyan ngag sum rtags dang brad gsar rnying la sogs rig pa'i gnas la gsan sbyongs mdzad/dgung lo bcu drug pa dpal spungs dgon du phebs/dgung lo bcu dgur dbus su lha ldan smon lam chen mo'i tshogs su byon/lha rams pa'i dam bca' sogs la phebs/lo de'i zla ba gnyis par rje blo gros mtha' yas kyi drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa drug la rwa nyag dgon gyi byams khang dang pho brang zhig gso gnang/dgung lo sum cur rje bla ma dngul chu pa chen por bstod pa kun tu bzang po'i 'khor lo brtsams par mdzad/de nas dgung lo zhe lnga bar dbus gtsang du thengs 'ga' phebs rjes gtso bo sku mtshams su sgrub pa snying por mdzad/phyag rtsom (bka' drin gsum ldan rje btsun blo bzang chos 'byor lhun grub dpal bzang po'i rnam thar legs bshad gtam gyi rgya mtsho/) (dpal ldan chos kyi sgrol ma 'khor bcas dgyes bskyed bskang mdos phyogs bsgrigs/) (dam pa'i chos la bskul ba'i mchod sprin )sogs gsung mgur bslab bya'i rim pa du ma dkyus gcig tu bkod pa/ (855) ('dzam gling skyes mchog rin po che'i 'khor dang bcas pa la mchod bstod cho ga dngos grub 'dod 'jo )sogs pod 'bring gnyis tsam mdzad dgung lo zhe lnga la phebs pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags glang (1901)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim mdzad rnam zhib pa (bka' drin gsum ldan rje btsun blo bzang chos 'byor lhun grub dpal bzang po'i rnam thar legs bshad gtam gyi rgya mtsho )zhes par gzigs}
rong po skal ldan dge 'dun 'phrin las rab rgyas|{rje 'di nyid gta' gong brag dkar kyi lha zhol gtam thog 'brog tu yab bsod nams dbang phyug dang yum dpal mo skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags sprel (1740)lor sku bltams/stong skor bsod nams rgya mtsho dang khri rgyal mtshan seng ge gnyis kyis skal ldan ngag dbang 'phrin las rgya mtsho'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin mdzad/gnyan thog dge slong blo bzang shes rab kyi drung du sbyor klog dang/bkra shis 'khyil dga' dwags dbu mdzad ngag dbang rgya mtsho'i drung du chos spyod thugs 'dzin skabs shes rab che ba'i ngo mtshar ltas mang du thon/dgung grangs bdun pa la mkhan chen dge 'dun rgya mtsho las rab tu byung/dgung lo dgu pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa 'brug (1748)lor gdan sa bde chen chos 'khor gling du phebs/dgung lo bcu gsum par grwa tshang thos bsam gling du chos grwar zhugs/mkhan chen dge 'dun rgya mtsho las bde gsang 'jigs gsum/kun rig sogs kyi dbang/'jags byed rim gnyis kyi khrid dang/khri rin chen po lcang lung dge 'dun bstan 'dzin las snar thang brgya rtsa/rin 'byung/skal ldan gsung 'bum dang/de bzhin slob dpon 'jam dbyangs rin chen dang/mkhas chen 'phrin las sogs mkhas grub du ma bsten nas bka' gdams glegs bam dang/dben sa bka' 'bum/dwags po bkras rnam pa'i shri ma Na'i sgrub thabs/mi tra/rdor phreng/dril bu phyi nang/gdugs dkar lha mang/lha bcu bdun ma/mgon chen bcu gsum/rnam sras bco lnga sogs mdo sngags kyi gzhung khrid dbang lung khrid rjes gnang sogs mang du gsan/dgung lo bcu drug par tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtshos sku gong ma'i dus ltar dga' ldan a chi thu er ti ni no mon han zhes bsngags pa'i bka' tham gnang/dgung lo bcu bdun par rgyud grwa gsang chen chos khrir bzhugs/dgung lo nye shu pa sa yos (1759)lor mkhan chen dge 'dun rgya mtsho las bsnyen par rdzogs/bar byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu sbrul (1773)lor dus 'khor grwa tshang gsang sngags dar rgyas gling gsar du btsugs pa dang thog ma'i chos khrir bzhugs/dgung lo zhe bdun par rong rgan dge 'dun mkhyen rab rgyal tshab tu bskos te dbus su phebs/rgyal dbang 'jam dpal rgya mtsho dang mjal zhing tshe dbang zhus/yongs 'dzin ye shes r+Yal mtshan dang snying thang ba ngag dbang kun dga' bkra shis sogs las bka' chos ci rigs gsan/gzhung sa dga' ldan pho brang nas gnang sbyin gtos che dang/er ti ni no mon han gyi cho lo tham ga che chung/gdugs rta dar/chibs sga srab rin chen rgyan ldan/mkhan chas sogs gnang/phyir phebs nas dam chos bdud rtsir chab phab ste skal ldan rnams tshims par mdzad/snga phyir lo mo/ri rngan/ban shul/bdud shul sogs reb gong gi shul chen rnams kyi phyogs su 'phrin las spel/sku gsum thugs rten mang po gsar bzhengs dang/shar bla brang chen mo rgya bskyed mdzad/lam gtso'i 'grel pa sogs gsum rtsom 'ga' bzhugs/dgung lo nga lnga bzhes pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing stag (1794)lor gzugs sku'i bkod pa chos dbyings su thim}
rong po skal ldan rgya mtsho|{gsham du shar skal ldan rgya mtsho zhes par gzigs}
rong po skal ldan ngag dbang 'phrin las rgya mtsho|{yab rong po'i bu chos skyong gi sras su rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa rta (1678)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun pa la ba so rje drung dkon mchog nyi ma'i drung du bar tu byung/mtshan ngag dbang 'phrin las rgya mtshor gsol/rje btsun khrims bkra shis dang rje shes rab bkra shis bla mar bsten nas dbang lung khrid gsum dang rje gong ma'i snyan brgyud kyi gdams pa ma lus pa gsan/dgung lo nye shu pa me glang (1697)lor dbus su phabs te rgyal dbang drug pa tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho dang paN chen blo bzang ye shes sogs kyis mtshon mkhas grub du ma'i zhabs la gtugs/'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang gi chos grwar zhugs te gsan bsam mdzad/paN chen blo bzang ye shes las bsnyen rdzogs bzhes/dgung lo nyer gsum par kun man 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sgo mang khrir phebs pa'i drung du mdo gas kyi bka' chos mang du gsan/dgung lo nyer lnga pa chu rta (1702)lor gong sa rgyal dbang drug pa tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho mchog gis dga' ldan a chi thu en ti ni no mo han gyi cho lo dang/thag ga gru skor/gdugs rta dar/'beb lcags sogs chen por yos pa'i gzengs bstod dang/paN chen blo bzang ye shes mchog gis kyang gzengs bstod gnang/lo der gser ljongs zhing gi gnas sa bde chen chos 'khor gling du phebs/sngags 'chang 'jam dbyangs blo gros las zab chos kyi gdams ngag mang du gsan/dgung grangs sum cu par yongs 'dzin rje shes rab bkra shis kyi spyan sngar rang ba gsan skabs yongs 'dzin chen mo dkyil 'khor so so'i gtso bor dngos su gzigs nas thugs dad tshad med pa 'khrungs/dgung grangs so dgu par rgyal dbang bskal bzang rgya mtsho dpal bzang po dgung lo brgyad pa dang mjal te spyan ras gzigs kyi rjes gnang gsan/rje 'di pa'i ljags bkod ltar sbyin bdag arger gyis rong po nang bka' 'gyur gser bris ma bzhengs/dgung lo nga lnga pa chu byi (1732)lor nang so ngag dbang blo bzang dang bka' gros mdzad de sgrub sde dang dgon lag lhan gcig 'tshogs te rong po smon lam gsar du btsugs pa lo ltar rgyun 'jags song/dgung grangs nga bdun bzhes pa shing stag (1734)lor 'ja' mo'i dpon slob ngag dbang grags pa la zhu la ba legs pa rgyal mtshan gyi zhun thig las grub pa'i dpal rdo rje 'jigs byed kyi sku dang/sngar bcom ldan 'das rdo rje 'phags mos dngos su gnang ba'i rgyud kyi glegs bam dang bka' khyab bcas pa bstsal te sgrub sde so sor nas dge 'dun gsang ba 'dus pa'i lha grangs su bsdus te rong po'i grwa tshang gsum gyi ya gyal dpal ldan rgyud pa grwa tshang gsang chen chos kyi bang mdzod gsar du btsugs pa dang chos khri dang por byin gyis brlabs/rje nyid gang du phebs pa na tshul khrims kyi dri bzang khor yug du khyab/rdo yang 'dam ltar brdzis te zhabs rjes bkod pa la sogs rdzu 'phrul ci yang bstan/drung 'khod rnams kyi rtogs pa phra mo yang mkhyen/gsung rtsom la/(rje rin po che la brten pa'i bla ma'i rnal 'byor/) (mdo sngags lam gyi gnad ma lus pa nyams su len pa'i bla ma'i rnal 'byor/) (rje shes rab bkra shis pa'i rnam thar )de bzhin rtogs brjod dang/rnam thar/bslab bya/mgur ma sogs po ti gcig bzhugs/dgung grangs re gnyis la phebs pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa lug (1739)lor zhi bar gshegs}
rong po skal ldan blo bzang chos grags rgya mtsho|{mdo smad byang rgyud rwa lo thang du yab skal bzang rnam rgyal zhes bya ba'i sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing yos (857) (1795)lor bltams dgung lo bcu gnyis par chu bzang lcang skya bla brang du khri sprul blo bzang rgyal mtshan seng ge las rab tu byung nas gdan sar phebs dge bshes blo bzang bstan 'dzin dang rab 'byams pa 'jam dbyangs gnyis las bsdus grwa dang blo rtags don bdun cu phar phyin bcas sbyangs shing zur bkol phal cher thugs 'dzin mdzad dgung lo nyer gsum bzhes pa me glang (1817)lor dbus su phebs dga' ldan byang rtse grwa tshang du dge ba'i bshes gnyen blo bzang rgyal mtshan yongs 'dzin du bsten nas dbu phar gtso byas pa'i bka' pod rab 'byams la sbyangs tshogs chen du tshogs gleng mang du mdzad de mkhas pa'i grags pa rgyas paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma'i drung du bsnyen rdzogs zhus dgung lo nyer bdun par phyir phebs nas me dgra byung ba'i bka' bstan dang rje yab sras kyi gsung 'bum sogs glegs bam stong phrag 'ga' gsar bzhengs mdzad dgung lo nyer dgu par tshoms chung bkra shis sgo mang dang lho lta'i chos khang chen mo tshing wang bkra shis 'byung gnas kyis gdan 'dren dus te mchod bkur dang zhogs ka'i mang ja'i ja tshul sde pa'i spyi rdzas su lan chen brgya phul te bzang spyod chag med kyi rgyun btsugs de nas wang chen mo zhi bar gshegs pa'i dbu blar phebs spyi so'i 'du khang chen mo rten brten par bcas pa rnying rkyen che bas gsar bzhengs mdzad gso rig la mkhas pas nyam thag rnams la thugs brtse bas bskyangs dgung grangs zhe dug la phebs pa ra bang bcu bzhi pa'i chu yos (1843)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
rong po skal ldan blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{chu bzang rwa lo thang du rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i sa lug (1859)laur sku 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga pa la shar bla brang du rje gong ma blo bzang 'phrin las rgya mtsho'i chos khri la phebs/rje btsun a rol blo bzang lung rigs rgya mtsho dpal bzang po las dge bsnye gyi sdom pa bzhes te mtshan blo bzang bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan zhes gsol/nags rgya'i yongs 'dzin dar rgyas rgya mtsho las chos spyod kyi rigs dang/a rol rje 'chang las rab byung dge tshul 'jigs mdzad rgyal po'i dbang dngos sta sogs bzhes te gsang mtshan la mi bskyod rdo rje zhu/dgung lo bdun brgyad skabs 'jam dbyangs dkar po dang dbyangs can ma dkar mo gnyis la bstod pa mdzad pas snyan ngag pa rnams kyis ngo mtshar du 'dzin/rwa stod mkhan chen dang/spyi ya'i rab 'byams pa blo bzang bstan 'dzin/gtsos khri sprul blo bzang 'jam dpal bstan 'dzin seng ge sogs las bsdus grwa dang/sum rtags/dag yig sgra'i sa ris/rtsis dkar nag sogs mthar thug par sbyangs/de nas sog yul du gdan drangs te khrom chen la spyan ras gzigs kyi dbang sogs gnang/dgung nyi nyi shu par blo bzang rung rigs rgya mtsho las thugs rdzogs bzhes/dgung lo nyer bzhi par rgya nag ri bo rtse lngar gnas mjal dang/cang he dgon par 'jam dbyangs zhi khro sbrags sgrub kyi bsnyen mtshams gnang/de dag pe cin dang khrin 'du sogs la phebs nas gnas gzigs mdzad/dgung lor nyer brgya par dbus su phebs nas rgyal dbang thub bstan rgya mtsho mchog la stong 'bul dang chos 'brel zhus/gdan sa gsum la mang 'gyed btabs/gzhung sa chen mos 'ja' sa thag ga gru sgor/mkhan chas cha tshang/gdugs rta dar bcas dang bstan pa'i gsal byed er te ni ho thog thu man po zhes pa'i cho lo sngar srol ltar gnang ba spyi bor bzhes te phyir rang dgon du phebs/dgung lo so gcig par grub dbang 'jigs med (858) bsam gtan rin po che las phreng kri'i dbang sogs bka' chos mang du gsan dgung lo zhe lnga par gser khri zhabs sor bkod de lo bzhi ring bka' chos mang du gsungs nas spyi sger gyi dga' ldan brjod las 'das pa bskyangs te dgung lo zhe brgyad par khri khur bzhag tshoms chen phun tshogs 'du khang dang mi pham mdun sa gar bzhengs mdzad cing gdan sa'i gos sku chen mo bzhengs dgung grangs nga bdun bzhes par byung bco lnga pa'i shing yos (1915)lor bsam bzhin mya ngan las 'das pa'i tshul bstan}
