rol mo'i bye brag bco brgyad|{rgya gar gyi rig gzhung las bshad pa'i gna' rabs kyi rol mo'i rig rtsal gyi gras shig ste/1 gar mkhan/2 bro/3 rdza rnga/4 rnga chung/5 rnga zlum/6 rnga bo che/7 'khar rnga/8 pi waM rgyud gcig pa/9 rdza rnga kha gcig pa/10 lcags kyi sil 'khrol/12 pi waM rgyud gsum pa/13 rnga mu kun+da/14 sil snyan glu dbyangs dang bstun pa/15 pheg rdob/16 rol mo spyi'i rigs/17 pi waM/18 gling bu bcas (859) yin cing gong gsal rol mo'i rigs rnams cha tshang ba bod du yod pa ma zad gong ma 'dus pa dung chen cang te'u dril bu cha lang sogs sna tshogs yod}
