rwa sgreng sku phreng gsum pa dang bshad sgra bar ma mthun pa'i skor|{bod rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing yos (1855)lor bod zla bcug nyis pa'i tshes nyer lnga nyin tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gcig pa dgung grangs bco brgyad thog sku gshegs shing/tshes nyer drug nyin rwa sgreng sku phreng gsum pa ngag dbang ye shes tshul khrims kyis slar yang srid skyong gi thugs 'gan bzhes nas lo shas song ring srid skyong sku bcar kha shas kyis gsham 'og mi sna 'ga' zhig gi sku brgyud nyan nas srid tham bka' gtan dang lag 'khyer mang po btang bar brten bka' blon bshad sgra dbang phyug rgyal po sogs bka' blon tsho gros bsdur gyis slad nas srid skyong la tham 'dzin zhabs zhu bka' blon zhig bsko 'dzugs gnang dgos kyi snyan seng la rwa sgreng srid skyong gi sku bcar phyogs lhung can tshor rang phyogs 'then thabs ma byung rkyen khong tshos bka' blon nas srid skyong gi tham gar tshod 'dzin byas pa de don du srid skyong gi dbang cha 'phrog pa yin tshul srid skyong la phra ma zhus par rwa sgreng srid skyong nas yid chen kyis don chung zhig la khag btags te bshad sgra bka' blon las zhabs chabs gcig gnang dbyung (gong gnas phab pa ma zad/gzhung zhabs kyi gral nas phyir 'bud byas pa )thog /rang gzhis snye mo bya kor tshul mthun ngang sdod pa las gang byung 'gro bskyod mi chog pa'i bka' bcad btang/bshadap+sagar dbang phyug rgyal po snyen mor sdod skabs gor Sha rgyal khang blon chen dzang ga sba thur zhes par 'tshams 'dri'i yi ge btang bar lan 'debs kyi zin bris de lcam dang phyag mdzod kha mthun gyis bshad sgra dbang phyug rgyal pos gor Sha dang 'brel ba byed tshul sogs rwa sgreng la snyan seng zhus stabs bshad sgrar mi dga' ba'i phyogs gtogs tshos go skabs dang bstun nas rtsa med bzo ched thon pa mda' dpon la nang ma'i mgon mngags bcad dpon dmag hrag bsdus snye mor mngags gtor byas pa bshad sgra gzhis su 'byor skabs bka' zur bshad sgra bas rang nyid nas snga phyir gzhung don rim pa bsgrubs nas las tshan theg pa rim 'dzegs kyis bka' blon bar byas tshul dang/da lta ma nyes khag g.yog byung lugs sogs rgyas bshad byas rjes da cha khyed nas gsod rdung gang rung byed rkyang byed dgos zhes brjod pas thon pa mda' dpon gyi bsam par gal te ma nyes khag g.yog byung lugs sogs rgyas bshad byas rjes da cha khyed nas gsod rdung gang rung byed rkyang des zhes brjod pas thon pa dma' dpon gyi bsam pa gal te ma nyes khag g.yog byung ba yin na gsod thal byed mi rung snyam ste thon pa rang khongs rgyal byed dgon pa'i las sner rtsis sprod dam drag thog phyi gyar gnang ba dgos pa'i bkod khyab nan tan bcas rgyal byed dgon par bcug de skabs lha sar 'bras spungs dgon pa'i rgyas pa mkhas po zhig la ri grwa'i gtong sgo 'khel zhing/de lo lo nyes byung ba'i rkyen gyis gtong sgo 'char can gtong thub min la sngar lam gyi gtong sgo chag yang 'ong ba'i snyan zhur srid skyong nas bka' 'khrol gnang stabs 'bras spungs dgon gyi grwa pa khag cig srid skyong bzhugs gnas bzhi da dgon pa'i rwa sgreng bla brang du gtong sgo chag yang gnang na grwa dmangs kyi 'tsho bar gnod lugs zhu bcar la rwa sgreng bla rang gi 'khor g.yog nas grwa par nyer brdung btang nas grwa pa kha shas la rmas skyon byung ba sogs kyi 'bras spungs grwa dmangs dang/rwa sgreng bla brang bar 'khon 'gras che tsam (860) byung bka' blon bshad sgra gnas dbyung btang ba dang thon pa mda' dpon snye mor phyin rjes bshad sgra gar song med pa chags pa sogs kyi rkyen bshad sgra'i rgyab rtsar dga' ldan pa langs nas dga' ldan pa'i grwa pa gcig gis gnas skor bar brdzus nas nyams zhib byas mthar bshad sgra ba rgyal gces dpon par yod pa shes pa ma zad sna ru'i nang yi ge bcug ste gtong len byas nas 'brel ba'ang byung dga' ldan pas 'bras spungs dang rwa sgreng bla brang dang 'gal ba che ba'i gzhung zhabs khag gcig dang 'brel ba byas te dga' 'bras drung spyi (drung spyi zhes pa ni rtse drung dang shod drung spyi par zer ba yin )zhes pa'i tshogs pa btsugs thog dga' ldan pa'i grwa shar kha shas kyis snye mo rgyal byed dgon pa nas bshad sgra 'phrog ste lha sa'i nye 'dabs su 'byor skabs 'bras spungs pa'i srung dmag bcas lha sar yod pa dang thog mar bshad sgra gling gar bsdad kyang de rjes gtsug lag khang gi bla ste du spos nas bka' blon bshadap+sagar bas gtso bo byas pa'i dga' 'bras drung spyi'i tshogs pas rwa sgreng bla brang dang kha gtad cog rtsis byas kyang rwa sgreng bla brang gi mthar chu yul brus thog ser byes grwa tshang nas bskong ba'i srung bya bsdad de'i mthar dga' 'bras drung spyi'i dmag gis bskor nyin zhig pho brang po ta la'i gsham gyi shar phyogs ri 'dabs mkhar sna gdong nas dga' 'bras drung spyi'i dmag mis rwa sgreng bla brang la kha phyogs te me mda' kha shas brgyab par rwa sgreng bla brang phyogs nas me lan slog skabs bshad sgra'i phyogs nas rwa sgreng srid skyong gis pho brang po ta lar me mda' rgyag gi 'dug ces bshad nas me mda' rgyag res byas srid skyong rwa sgreng sku 'khor nyung shas bcas srid dam bsnams te nang sar bros phebs am ban dang bshad sgra 'brel 'dris che stabs bshad sgra srid skyong spyi mos byung tshul sogs gong mar snyan zhu phul bshad sgra dbang phyug rgyal pos rgan chos rab byung sgrub par brten sde srid bshad sgra zhes 'bod bshad sgras dbang cha bzung rjes srid skyong rwa sgreng gi skabs btang ba'i bka' gtan sogs yig rigs la zhib bsher yang byas dmag 'khrug de'i nang rwa sgreng bla brang gnas yul bzhi sde dgon par gtor skyon gang tsam phog skad}
rwa sgreng dgon pa|{rab byung dang po'i me bya (1057)lor jo bo rje a ti sha'i slob ma 'brom ston pa rgyal ba'i 'byung gnas kyis thog mar btab pa'i dgos pa zhig (deng sang bod rang skyong ljongs lhun grub rdzong phod mdo chus kyi khongs )dgon pa der 'brom ston pas gnas gi btsugs nas dar spel gtong ba gnang ba'i chos brgyud la bka' gdams pa zer/de sngon jo bo rje snye thang du dgongs pa mya ngan las 'da' bar slob ma rnams la zhal chems kyi tshul du bka' slob mang du gnang ba'i mjug tu 'brom ston pa la jo bo ring nyid kyi thugs dam rten thub dbang gi sku dang/gnang 'dun 'jam dpal rdo rje'i gser sku/sgrol ma gsung byon ma/spyan ras gzigs kyi bris thang/rgya dpe po ti khag /bla ma gser gling pa'i gdung khang dngul gdugs can bcas gnang nas sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa gnas pa de 'dun gyi sde la rag las pas khyed kyis rten 'di rnams bzhugs pa'i gtsug lag khang bzhengs te dge 'dun gyi sde tshugs shig zhes gsungs pa thugs su bcangs nas 'brom ston pas jo bo rje 'das pa'i phyi rol der rwa sgreng gi gnang bdag zhang 'phrang ka ber chung gis gdan drangs pa ltar gnas 'dir brtag pa mdzad de cha rkyen phun sum tshogs par gzigs shing/gnas bdag zhang 'phrang ka ber chung gi kyang dad 'bul zhus pa bcas thog mar ka ba gnyis kyi rgya khyon yod pa'i dbu rtsa ka gnyis ma bzhengs/de rjes dgon pa gong ma btab ste nub nas shar du rim bzhin jo bo rje'i dngos slob rnal 'byor pa chen po dang/dpal ldan dgon pa ba/ (861) }
rnal 'byor pa byams pa blo gros|{rnal 'byor pa shes rab rdo rje bcas kyi gzim khang rnams btab klu rgyal ne'u lang gi pho brang yin zer ba'i steng du 'brom ston pa rang nyid kyis gzim khang bzhengs de rjes rwa sgreng dgon pa btab pa'i phyi lo der khang khyung mgo can bzhengs der phyogs bzhir ka ba gnyis re ste ka ba brgyad zur bzhi la ka ba re re dbus su ka ba gnyis bcas ka ba bcu bzhi yod pa dang ka ba'i bar rnams spang theb dang shin phrag gyis bkag ste de la 'jim pa'i zhal ba byas shing steng du rgya phabs bkal ba zhig yod par grags lha khang de bzhengs grub rjes de 'bros rnams byed mkhan yong gsungs nas mtshams 'jog nang ste bar gnas mdzad de nas lo brgyad song ba'i shing 'brug (1064)lor 'brom ston pas bya 'dab kyi 'og tu mchod rten brgya rtsa brgyad dang dgon pa'i gnya' gong du mchod rten brgya rtsa brgyan dang bcas pa bzhengs te de thams cad la jo bo rje'i gdung thal las bzhengs pa'i sats+tsha re bcug yod 'brom ston pa 'das nas yun ring ma song bar dpon gyad pa dang zur kha chos grags sogs dad ldan mang po'i sbyin bdag zhus te dbu rtse ka gnyis ma'i nub ngos su ka ba bcu drug yod pa'i dkor khang sgo lho phyogs su gtad pa thog sum gnyis yod pa zhig bzhengs dbu rtse ka gnyis ma bzhengs nas lo dgu bcu go gnyis song ba rab byung gnyis pa'i sa 'brug (1148)lor zhang 'od 'jo ba rwa reng gi gdan sa phabs nas lo bcu gnyis bar bskyangs de de'i ring zhang 'brang kha ber chung gi yang tsha dpon srid bo gzhon tshul gyis sbyin bdag byas te dbu rtse ka ba nyi shu tsa bzhi yod pa bzhengs shing de rjes zang 'od 'jo ba'i slob ma yon brtson 'grub rdo rjes sbyin bdag byas te dbu rtse ka bzhi ma bzhengs de nas rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags byi (1240)lor sog po'i dmag ('di mong gol gyi rgyal po go dan gyis bod du btang ba'i dmag de min zhes tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas gsungs pas dmag 'di mong gol gyi rgyal po sum btang ba'i dmag yin min skor zhib 'jug mdzad dgos )bod du 'byor nas 'phan po rgyal lha khang sogs dgon pa mang po mer bsregs skabs rwa sgreng dgon 'dir sku gsung thugs rten mang che ba tshig nas ngo bo 'jam dpal rdo rje dang sgrol ma gsung byon bla ma gser gling pa'i gdung khang dngul gdugs can che chung rgya dpe khag thugs dam gshin rje gshed kyi sku thang bcas mer gtan nas ma tshig par lus zhes yongs su grags de rjes rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags yos (1231)lor bya btang rin chen bzang po dang 'jam dbyangs rin chen grags gnyis kyis gtsug lag khang nyams gso gsar bzhengs mdzad rang byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags stag (1650)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas mchod khang ka ba brgyad ca dang yang thog tu gser zangs gyi rgya phebs che chung gnyis grwa shag bdun cu lhag tsam bar 'phel rgyas btang zhing mchod gzhis su mi ser them dud shog kha bcu gnyis kyi bdag dbang gnang rwa sgreng dgon pa 'di nyid de sngon bod sa gnas srid gzhung btsugs pa nas gzhung skyong dgon pa'i khongs su gtogs pa las dga' ldan khri thog lnga bcu nga bzhi pa ngag dbang mchog ldan gyis yun ring bar tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin gnang ste sku ma 'das gong tsam du rwa sgreng dgon pa sger 'dzin du gsol ras zhus pa gnang don ltar rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa lug (1739)lor tA la'i blam sku phreng bdun pas rwa sgreng dgon pa de bzhin khong la sger 'dzin du 'bul ba gnang zhing khong sku gshegs rjes sprul sku khri chen bstan pa rab rgyas la ching rgyal rabs kyi gong ma ci ching khri lo nyi (862) shu pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing phag (1815)lor gong ma ca ching gis slar yang rwa sgreng dgon pa de rwa sgreng ho thog tu sku phreng rim byon la sger 'dzin gtan 'jags su gnang de nas bzung yongs 'dzin khri chen gyi sku phreng rim byon la rwa sgreng sprul sku zhes pa'i mtshan thogs pa yin dgon pa 'dir a ti sha rang nyid sku 'tsho bzhugs skabs bris gnang ba'i 'dra thang rgyab yig tu dge bshes nag tsho lo tsA bas brtsams pa'i jo bo'i rnam thar bstod pa brgyad cu pa bris pa yongs grags su 'dra thang dbu yon ma zer ba de dang jo bo rje'i thugs dam rten jo bo 'jam dpal rdo rje sogs rin thang bral ba'i gna' shul dngos rdzas mang po yod sngar rwa sgreng du grwa khang stong rten lugs ma ngo mtshan che ba lnga bcu skor dang thang ka sum ston drug brgya lhag tsam gzhung rten po ti sa ya bcu lhag tsam gdung rten bdun brgya dang bdun cu don lnga yod ces rwa sgreng gi lo rgyus las bshad}
rwa sgre thub bstan 'jam dpal ye shes bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{rwa sgreng sku phreng lnga pa 'di nyid rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu byi (1912)lor bod shar lho'i yul dwags po'i ru smad du yab phun tshogs dbang 'dus kyi sras su 'khrungs/sku 'khrungs pa'i dus su ltas bzang po sna tshogs byung bas yul mi rnams ha las shing dad pa'i klong du tshud/chung dus phyugs 'tsho bar phebs pa'i lam du chu rdo'i steng zhabs rjes dang/brag ldebs su shing phur bstir ba sogs skye bo mi nyung ba'i ngag rgyun du grags/de ltar ltas khyad par can dngabacas gzhan dang mi 'dra ba'i rtags dang mtshan gyis rwa sgreng sku phreng bzhi pa'i yang srid du ngos bzung zhing rwa sgreng dgon du zhabs sor 'khod/mtshan thub bstan ye shes ('jam dpal )bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan zhes gsol te sngar srol bzhin se ra theg chen gling byes grwa tshang du chos zhugs thog chos spyod kyi byed sgo ma lus pa thugs su chud/bka' gdams gsar ring gi chos sgo dang gzhung chen ka pod lnga la sogs par slob gnyer gyis sbyangs pa dpyis phyin par mdzad de rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pa sku mo mas rgyugs bzhes thog dge bshes lha rams pa'i mtshan gnas thob/dgung grangs nye shu tsam du rwa sgreng gdan sar bzhugs te bstan 'gro'i 'phral phugs kyi bde don slad du mdzad 'phrin spel ba'i dbu tshugs/dgung lo nyer gnyis la phebs pa rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pa chen po glo bur du zhi ba chos dbyings su gshegs pa'i phyi rol rgyal tsham gyi gser khrir 'god pa'i 'os su babs te bod shing khyi (1934)lo'i zla 1tshes 10nyin gangs ljongs skyong ba'i byed por mnga' gsol/srid skyong gi khri la bzhugs rjes dbang 'dzin gyi sgrig gzhir bsgyur bcos gang 'tsham gnang ba brgyud gong 'og nang 'khrug gi rkyen ngan las zlog par mdzad/bod spyir zhing las dang 'brog las thon skyed gong 'phel 'gro ba'i rnam pa bzang po thon/rgyal po nyid kyi dam pa'i mdzad spyod la skye 'gro mtho dman drag zhan kun gyis sgo gsum gus pas zhabs la 'dud/gdan sa chen po gsum gyis gtsos grub mtha' ris med kyi gdon sde khag bshad sgrub 'chad nyan gyi chos rgyun nyams pa sor chud dang mi nyams gong 'phel yong ba'i brtson pa rtse gcig tu mdzad pas bstan pa rgyas shing dge 'dun gyi sde 'phel bar gyur/bsam yas gtsug lag khang sogs rten dang brten pa dag kyang nyams gso sngar lhag tu brtson par mdzad/rgyal mchog bcu gsum pa'i sku gdung dngos su bzhugs pa gser stong dge legs 'dod 'jo gsar bzhengs gnang/rgyal pa sku phreng bzhi pa ngos 'dzin gdan zhus kyi bod mi mangs kyi bsam 'dun bskangs/bod rgya mi rigs mthun sgrib kyi srol lam slar gso mdzad/bod dngul bcu lor dang bcu sgor gsar 'don gnang/bod lcags 'brug (1940)lor rgyal tshab kyi thugs (863) 'gan dgongs zhus thog lcags sbrul (1941)lo'i zla dang por srid skyong gsar pa stag brag rin po cher chos srid kyi bya ba rnams rtsis 'bul gyis gdan sa rwa sgreng du phebs mi bsrun skya bo 'gas blo slob dbar dbyen sbyor dkrugs shing gis rwa stag don rkyen bslangs te skyes mchog nyid rwa sgreng dgon nas lha sar gdan drangs pa ma zad khrims mun du bcug pas snyun gyis btab ste bod me phag (1947)lo'i zla gsung par dgongs pa zhi ba chos dbyings su mnal ba'i tshul bstan ('ga' zhig gis sku bkrongs pa red kyang zer srol yod/)}
rwa sgreng pha bong thang|{lo 'khor re'i lug lo nam shar du pha bong rong thang skor zhes rwa sgreng dgon pa'i nub ngos kyi pho rong thang du skor ba rgyag srol yod/thang chen de'i steng rdo pha bong du ma yod pa'i nang nas che shos der mkha' 'gro gsang ba ye shes kyi bo brang zhes pa yin par gnas skor ba tshos de gar skor ba rgyab pa sogs byed cing/gzhan yang mkha' 'gro'i tshogs gzhong dang/bro rwa zhes pa sogs kyi pha bong yod/bod zla bdun pa'i tshes bco lnga'i nyin rwa sgreng bla brang nas mkha' 'gro'i tshogs gzhong zhes pa'i pha bong gi steng du rtsam khal lnga brgya'i tshogs bzhengs nas mang tshogs la tshogs kyi byin rlabs sprod pa dang/rwa sgreng dgon pa'i bla grwa rnams de gar phebs nas nyin gsum ring tshogs mchod sogs mdzad srol thog dge 'dun pa tshos gar 'cham rgyag pa dang/yul mi tshos bro gzhas 'khrab gtong/lha mo 'khrab pa/rta rtsal 'gran pa sogs byed cing/skabs der lha sa dang/nag chu/lho kha sogs nas mang tshogs khri stong kha shas 'dzoms pa dang/thang steng gung gyis khengs pa sogs 'du long che zhing/thang chen der skor ba rgyag skabs mi dar ma zhig gis chu tshod gnyis tsam 'gor gyi yod}
rwa chos rab|{(rwa chos rab ces pa'ang snang )'di nyid rwa lo rdo rje grags kyi dbon po yin zhing/khong gis rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta sa man+ta shrI spyan darangs te dus 'khor dang/phag mo mngon 'byung/mgon po mngon 'byung la sogs pa bsgyur}
rwa stag don rkyen gyi skor|{rab byung bcu drug pa'i me phag (1947)lo'i nang srid skyong zur pa rwa sgreng dang srid skyong las thog stag brag bar phyogs gtogs so so'i shugs rkyen gyis 'gal ba je cher song mthar de lo se ra byes grwa tshang du grwa pa khag gcig sdeb 'ur gyis mkhan po bstan dar bsad pa dang/ser byes grwa pa kha shas kyis mtshan mo zhig grong nang yong ste sa 'du tshang gi mtshang nas me mda' 'phrog pa sogs byas/zla gnyis pa'i nang rwa sgreng rgyal zur rwa sgreng dgon par bzhugs pa nas 'dzin bzung byas/rwa sgreng dza sag sogs khongs gtogs kyi mi sna rnams kyang bzung pho brang po ta la'i shar chen lcog tu do dam byas/ser byed kyis rwa sgreng rgyal zur skyob phyir 'thab 'dzings byas par bod sa gnas srid gzhung nas dmag mi 'bor chen btang ste mnan pas dmag 'thab nang grwa pa bcu tsam srog shor ba dang/dmag mi yang kha shas shi ba sogs byung/de nas nyin kha shas rjes rwa sgreng rgyal zur shar chen lcog tu sku gshegs/(srid skyong stag brag phyogs gtogs kyis bkrongs zhes zer/)}
rwa dang gle yi yul|{rwayi rus rgyud dang gle yi rus rgyud la dbang ba'i sa cha}
