la kha|{lha sa'i byang ngos su yod pa'i ri rgyud du lha sa nas 'phan por 'gro sa'i 'grul lam la kha sgo la dang/skam la/shar la/dga' la sogs la 'go kha shas yod pa nas de snga gzhung don du lam yig 'khyer nas 'gro mkhan rnams sgo la brgyud de ma gtogs 'gro srol med/sgo la'i shar ngos kyi shar la brgyab na 'phan po 'jog por slebs pa dang/sgo la'i nub ngos kyi skam la brgyab na 'phan po glang thang du slebs kyi yod/nyan bran pu'i dga' la phud/de min sgo la dang/skam la/shar la sogs kyi byang rgyud 'phan po nas lha sar yong mkhan tshang ma sgo la'i lho ngos gsham gyi gling ba rdzong du slebs kyi yod stabs kha rgyun du phu ga nas bskor na'i mda' gling bu rdzong zhes gtam dpe yod/de bzhin lha sa skyid chu'i lho ngos su yod pa'i sbrag la zhes pa de ni lha sa nas sbrag la dang/phreng 'go (sbrag dang phreng 'gog nyes dang skabs lho kha sa gnas khongs )sogs la 'gro sa'i 'grul lam yin/sngon dus la kha khag brgyud de 'gro skabs la 'gor jag rkun mang bas 'grub par 'phrog bcom byas rkyang lam grogs dang/mtshon cha med par 'gro mkhan ha cang nyung la/kha rgyun du yang la khar jag pas gang byas/chu khar mnyan pas gang byas zhes bshad srol yod pa red/dmangs gtso'i bcos sgyur rjes lha sa nas 'phan po bar gzhung lam gsar bskrun gyis rlangs 'khor shar bskyod thub stabs sgo la sogs kyi la kha brgyud 'gro mkhan yang sha lam med pa lta bur gyur}
