la dwags kyi sa'i bdag po|{'di skor (la dwags rgyal rabs )nas 'byung ba dang/bod kyi chos 'byung lo rgyus rnams nas 'byung ba go bsdur nas bris pa na/la dwags kyi rgyal po seng ge rnam rgyal ('di'i skor gsham du seng ge rnam rgyal zhes par gzigs )gyi bu che ba bde ldan rnam rgyal bu bde legs rnam rgyal la zer ba yin te/de yang sngar rgyal po glang dar ma bsad pa'i rjes su/de'i btsun mo chung ba la bu gcig skyes pa na/bcud mo che bas phrag dog byas nas sprang po'i bu gcig nyos nye mdang nga la bu 'di skyes so zhes smras nas bur bzung ba yul brtan dang btsun mo chung ba'i bu gnam lde 'od srung gnyis las (de gnyis kyi phyogs la blon 'bangs tha dad du gyes nas/'od srung gis g.yu ru bzung/yum brtan gyis dbu ru bzung nas 'khrug pa byung/de rjes bu gnyis lo nyer gsum tsam lon pa la glang nasab zung 'bangs kyi kheng log ste/deng sang gyen langs su grags pa byung zhing/de yang dang po dbas kho bzher legs stong gis gtso bo byas te khams nas ngo log /de nas dbus su dbas lo pho lo chung gis gtso bor byas te gyen log /de nas g.yo rur mchings kong mi drug gis gtso bo byas te gyen log byung ) 1 mnga' bdag 'od srung gi sras mnga' bdag dpal 'khor btsan/2 'di yi btsun mo che ba'i sras skya lde nyi ma mgon dang/chung ba'i sris khri bkra shis brtsegs pa dpal gnyis las/yab mnga' bdag dpal 'khor btsan blon po stag rtse gnyags kyis bkrongs pa'i skabs sras nyi ma mgon mnga' ris su bros/blon po snang pa tshab rin chen dang cog ro legs sgra lha legs gnyis kyi bu mo btsun mor blangs nas btsun mo cog ro bza' la bu gsum byung ste/dpal sde rig pa mgon/bkra shis lde mgon/lde gtsug mgon gsum byung/thabs mkhas kyi spyod pas mnga' ris skor gsum dbang du bsdus/sras che ba dpal lde rig pa mgon nas la dwags kyi rgyal brgyud rnams byung zhing/('bring po bkra shis lde mgon las brgyud pa byung min mi gsal )chung ba lde gtsug mgon las mnga' ris ya tshe'i rgyal brgyud rnams byung ba yin/3 nyi ma mgon gyi sras che ba dpal lde rig pa mgon ('di'i mnga' ris mang yul/'bangs gtu nag can/shar du thogs/gser kha 'gog lad kyi lde mchog dkar po/mtshams kyi rwa ba dmar po/lpam le yi mig gi pha bong la mgo bar/nub kha che'i la rtsa/lho bug pa can yan chad/byang g.yer kha gog po tshun chad la mnga' bsgyur/) (bkra shis mgo gyis gu ge pu hrengs dang bcas pa/lde gtsug mgon gyis zangs dkar sgo gsum spi ti/spi lcog bcas pa mnga' bsgyur ba yin/) (869) 4 dpal lde rig pa mgon gyi sras 'gro mgon dang chos mgon gnyis 5 'gro mgon gyi lha chen grags pa lde 6 de'i sras lha chen byang chub sems dpa' 7 de'i lta tsheg rgyal po ('di'i dus mnga' ris su dgon pa'i dang po li ki chos sde btab )de'i sras lha chen ut+pal ('di'i dus su la dwags kyi dmag 'khrid nas zhung ti'i yul blangs gzhan yang gla bo pu hrengs man chod lho phyogs bre srang gi yul chu la me 'bar tshun chad nub ra gan 'greng shing sga ta khu tshur yan chod byang phyogs ka shus (ka brus )man chad mnga' 'og tu bsdus nas lo ltar khral len/) 8 de'i sras lha chen nag lug (des stag gi lo la lpan lar mkhar brtsigs 'brug gi lo la kha la rtse brtsigs/) 9 de'i sras lha chen dge b+he'am dge ba 'bum 10 de'i sras lha chen ngo ldor 11 de'i sras bkra shis mgon 12 de'i sras lha rgyal 13 de'i sras lha chen jo dpal 14 de'i sras lha chen dngos grub 'di'i dus 'bri gung skyob pa 'jig rten mgon po dang 'brel ba byung bka' 'gyur dang dkyil 'khor bzhengs dbus gtsang gnyis su rab byung ba slob gter la 'gro ba'i srol dar/) 15 de'i sras lha chen rgyal bu rin chen 16 de'i sras lha chen shes rab ('di'i dus sa bu'i hang rtse mo zhes pa'i khar grong khyer seng ge sgang zhen pa brtsigs mang yul sa bu ljang mkhar yang zer/) 17 de'i sras lha chen khri gtsug lde 18 de'i sras lha chen grags 'bum sde dang grags pa bum gnyis (dang po'i skabs rje tsong kha pa'i slob ma lha dbang blo gros yan nas dpe thub dgon pa btab/) 19 de'i sras blo gros mchog ldan ('dis mnga' ris skor gsum phal che ba mnga' 'og tu bsdus )(1 ) de nas sras chung ba lha chen grags 'bum sde gyi sras lha chen b+ha ra dang de'i bu lha chen g+ha gan gnyis kyi phyi ma des gcen po'i bu dang srid dbang bcas phrogs pa yin (2) lha chen b+ha gan gyi sras lha chen lha dbang rnam rgyal dang bkra shis rnam gnyis gnyis las (bkra shis rnam rgyal gyis rang gi gcen po lha dbang rnam rgyal gyi mig bton nas btson la bzhag rang nyid rgyal por 'khod pu rig dang gro shod man chad mnga' 'og tu bsdus la dwags sle la mkhar rnam rgyal rtse mo dang chu 'bis grong khyer btab/) (3)bkra shis rnam rgyal gyi bu gsum ste tshe dbang rnam rgyal rnam rgyal mgon po 'jam dbyangs rnam rgyal dang gsum ('di'i dus su mnga' ris pa'i ngo log byung/) (4)'jam dbyangs rnam rgyal gyi bu seng ge rnam rgyal dang nor bu rnam rgyal gnyis las seng ge rnam rgyal 'di dmag thabs mkhas pa'i stobs kyi gu ge phyi nang rtsa grangs lor long bcas la dmag drangs te dbang 'og tu bsdus la dwags kyi rgyal po kun gyi nang nas mnga' thang dar shos shig yin dge lugs la sogs grub mtha' kun la phyogs la ris med (5) 'di'i bu bde ldan rnam rgyal in+d+ra b+ho d+hi rnam rgyal bde mchog rnam rgyal gyis sa dga' gro shod skar rdo shi gar sogs la dmag drangs te blangs (6) de nas de'i bu bde legs rnam rgyal gyis srid bzung skabs rab byung bcu gcig pa'i lcags bya (1681)lor sa gnas srid gung nas log pa dga' ldan tshe dbang btang nas dmag drangs te la dwags mnga' 'og tu bsdus mtshams 'brug pa thams cad mkhyen pa pad+ma dkar po'i sprul sku dmag gi dpang por phebs nas la dwags dang chings sgrigs byas bod nas lo ltar gzhung tshong pa nas ja khal ma nyis brgya'i 'bab gtong rgyu dang la dwags nas sa gnas srid gzhung gi bla brang phyag mdzod la gser thur zho bcu (thur zho do la to la bcu/) dri bzang sra bcu (gur kum/) hor zog bug (yug )drug bab sta 'bub gcig bcas 'bum rgyu gzhung tshong la dwags su (870) sdod ring bar phogs thon dang lam thog dos khal nyis brgya rta zhon nye lnga rta thab g.yog bcu rta 'ul bco lnga zhon pa bcu rta thab yong mi gsum der lta la rtsa kha bkal med 'brog da 'go phebs gcig bzhugs thab mdzod bcas la gur rta gal rnams rta zam thog dang rdzong skyel phar phyir gnyis lo re bzhin lo phyag gtong rgyu (lo gsar skabs tA li bla ma dang sa gnas srid gzhung la mjal phyag zhu mi zhig gtong gi yod pa de la la dwags lo phyag pa zer )byas de dang mnyam du kha jal rgyal po la dgos byed mnga' ris nas yong dgos pa rnams kha tshul rang la gtong rgyu las yul gzhan la 'tshong mi chog pa dang kha chul dang kha cha'i tshong pa rnams dpe thub brgal nas yong mi chog pa sogs byas nas chings yig bzhag chings yig ngo mo zur du yod tshod (chings yig 'di'i nang sa gnas su tshang rgyag phyogs skor ma gtogs sa mtshams kyi skor gang yang bris med/) skabs der 'brug pa sprul skus sa gnas srid gzhung la mnga' ris skor gsum gyi nang nas gcig dgos zhes zhus pa ma sprad kyang de'i tshab gzhis kha gsum 'brug pa sprul skur phrad ces gsal 'di rnams ni (la dwags rgyal rabs )nas gal che ba rnams drangs te bkod pa yin la zhib par gzigs 'dod na der gzigs par zhu}
la phyi gangs kyi ra ba|{gangs rgyal po mthong mthing ngam yongs grags su jo mo glang mar 'bod pa de yin/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gnang sngags kyi gzhung nas bshad tshul la/gangs ri 'di bzhin 'khor lo bde mchog gi yul nyi shu rtsa bzhi'i nang tshan gau dA wa ri yin zhes bshad srol yod cing/ri 'di'i phyi dbyibs gangs ri rtse lnga pa la/1 dbus su jo mo tshe ring mched lnga'i nang tshan bkra shis tshe ring ma dang/mtha' skor du rim bzhin/2 jo mo mthing gi zhal bzang ma dang/3 mi g.yo blo bzang ma/4 cod pan mgrin bzang ma/5 gtad dkar 'gro bzang ma bcas gnang yod par bshad/deng sang gangs ri rtse lnga 'di'i gsum pa la jo mo glang mar 'bod pa ni/jo mo lha lnga ma zhes 'bod pa'i bod skad kyi sgra de zur chag nas jo mo glang mar 'gyur ba min nam snyam/de min jo mo glang ma zhes 'bod pa'i rgyu mtshan gzhan ma rnyed pas dpyad par zhu zhing/gangs ri 'di nyid rgya mtsho'i ngos las mtho tsham ji tsam yod pa sogs kyi skor (krung go'i sa khams chags tshul gyi shes yon )skor las gsal}
