la mo grags rgan blo bzang bkra shis|{mdo smad bya khyung dgon gyi mkhan rabs nyer brgyad pa 'di nyid 'bal gzhung nya mtsho'i dpon rgyud du rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me phag (1647)lor 'khrungs/dpal ldan 'bras spungs dgon du chos zhugs mdzad/mkhyen rab che bas 'dzin grwa bdun re'i brtsi bzhag dus gcig la gsan/smra ba'i khyu mchog du gyur/tA la'i bla ma lnga pa chen por bsnyen rdzogs zhus/'bras spungs su lo bdun slob gter mdzad de lha rams pa'i mtshan rtags bzhes/bka' 'gyur gyi lung sogs chos rgyun mnog che ba gsan/a mdo dang wa gan no mon han gyi yongs 'dzin du gdan drangs/lcags bya (1681)lor rang yul du phyir phebs/mdo smad kyi grwa sa phal la dam bca' bzhag /dgung lo zhe brgyad thog slar yang dbus su phebs/kun mkhyen bla ma bar dbu ma chen mo'i ljags rtsom zhus/gtsang du byon nas paN chen blo bzang ye shes mjal/de nas rang yul du phebs/me glang (1697)lor khri chen sprul sku bstan pa'i nyi ma/thal shul chos skyong rgya mtsho/sha sbrang 'jam dbyangs blo gros/byang chub mi la sogs kyis gtsos gsan mkhas stong lhag la kri sbags ma'i dbang dang/rje yab sras kyi gsung 'bum lung/lam rim gyi myong khrid tshar mang po sogs ci 'dod du gnang/kun mkhyen bla ma bde chen du zhus nas chos bka' gsan bzhes mdzad pa sogs rnam thar 'gangs che/'jigs byed bskyed rim/dbu ma dang 'dul ba'i thal phreng/chos 'byung sogs gsum rtsom yang mang/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu 'brug (1712)lor bya khyung gi khrir phebs/'chad nyan 'phel rgyan gtsor 'don mdzad/tshogs mang la byang chub lam rim gyi bshad tshul bstsal ba sogs gdan sa phan tshun du 'chad nyan gyi khur skyong mur dgung lo re bdun bzhes pa ram byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu sbrul (1713)lor blo gur du zhi bar gshegs}
la mo tshangs pa'i sku rten|{stag rtse rdzong la mo byang chub lcog tu tshangs pa dung gi thor tshugs can sku phebs byed srol yod/de ni bod kyi lha khog zhugs byed pa'i nang nas grags che ba zhig dang/lo rguyas kyang cung ring ba zhig red/lha de khog zhugs thog mar ga dus byung ba'i lo rgyus nges gsal yig cha ma rnyed/la mo tshangs par tsher gseb chos skyong zhes 'khod pa dang/la mo tshangs pa lha gnas mtho ba'i gras shig yin stabs de snga'i sa gnas srid gzhung nas gal che'i srid don skor sogs la lung zhu 'bul srol yod la paN chen sku phreng rim pas kyang bstan gsol gnang gi yod 'dug /la mo tshangs pa'i sku bsten la de snga'i sa gnas srid gzhung gi tA la'i bla ma'i go gnas yod/sku bsten ni khyim rgyud kyis byed dgos pas khyim tshang la la mo gzhung kyang zhes 'bod kyang yod/dus rabs bcu bdun pa'i nang kong po zho kha bla ma sogs kyis kong dmag dbus su drangs skabs dbus phyogs nas la mo tshangs par lung zhus phul don tshangs pas kong dmag la dmu gab g.yog rgyu'i khas blangs nas kong dmag gnyid du yur ba'i shul du dbus dmag gis mtshan 'gebs brgyab ste kong dmag tshar bcad pa'i byas rjes la gzhung nas la mo tshang la gzhis chen brgyad dang/gzhis chung brgyad gnang stabs gzhis ka dang mi ser rgya che tsam yod la snyan grags kyang (872) chen po chags pa yin skad}
