lo tsA ba rin chen bzang po|{bod kyi lo rgyus thog bstan pa phyi dar gyi dus su byung ba'i gnang gas gsar ma bsgyur mkhan gyi lo tsA ba mtshan snyan grags shing tu che ba zhig yin/rab byung dang po'i gong gi lo drug cu re dgu pa la rta (958)lor stod mnga' ris kyi gu ge'i sa char 'khrungs/dgung lo chung dus nas slob sbyong la brtson 'grub che bas/mnga' ris rgyal pos khong sogs mi nyi shu rtsa bdun kha che'i yul (kasmir )du mngags pa ltar byon te/paN+Di ta mkhas pa mang po bsten nas sgra rig pa dang/tshad ma/gso ba rig pa/mdo dang/sngags sogs la sbyangs pa mthar phyin pa mdzad de bod du byon/mnga' ris gu ge'i rgyal po lha bla ma ye shes yod kyis mthun rkyen gnang ste gsang sngags kyi gzhung mang po dang/gso ba rig pa'i gzhung (sman dpyad yan lag brgyad pa )sogs la sogs pa rgya gar gyi sman gzhung mang po bsgyur/slob ma sman pa mkhas mi dgu sogs byung ste/bad kyi gso ba rig pa'i thog mar gol 'phel gsar pa zhig gi dus sa slebs/khong gis gsang sngags gsar ma dang/rgya gar gyi sman gzhung mang po rgya gar skad nas bod skad du bsgyur gnang mdzad pa de dag bod kyi mkhas pa chen po kun gyis tshad mar 'dzin pa zhig yin/dgung lo dgu bcu go brgyad pa rab byung dang po'i shing lug (1055)lor sku gshegs/lo rgyus zhib par gong gis dngos slob khri thang pa dz+nya nas mdzad pa'i (lo rin chen chen bzang po'i rnam thar )dang/las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog )shog grangs 66nas 67bar gsal}
lo ras pa dbang phyug brtson 'grus|{rje 'di nyid yab rnal 'byor dang yum me bza' skyed de nyis sras su rab byung gsum pa'i me lug (1187)lor sku bltams/dgung lo drug pa la phebs skabs yi ge 'bri klog legs par mkhyen/dgung lo bcu drug pa la chos rje gtsang pa dang mjal nas bsnyen bkur rgya cher mdzad/dgung lo bco brgyad pa la skyor mo lung dum khan po sbal ti las rab tu byung/mtshan dbang phyug brtson 'grus su gsol/rje gong ma'i spyan sngar bzhugs pa la yab kyis yum du bos nas bag ma bsu bar brtsams na zhal gyis ma bzhes par bla ma'i drung du phyir bros/'brug tu bla ma'i phyag phyir byon te bsnyen par rdzogs/mdo rtsa ba dang/brtag gnyis/mahA mA yA la sogs pa'i rgyu dang/do ha la sogs pa'i zab chos/bde mchog la sogs pa'i grub gzhung mang du gsan/de nas yab gshegs pa'i 'das chos rgya che gnang ste khyim tshang gi thams cad chos phyogs su gtong bar mdzad de bri gang gi 'dzin chags ma bzung bar 'brug tu phebs nas pha yul du mi 'gro ba/mi ri 'bab pa/tsog bu rgyun du mdzad pa/khyim pa'i them spangs/gos ras rkyang bzhes/gsung bcad/gtor ma brgya rtsa ma chag pa ste dam bca' bdun mdzad/chos rje gtsang pa'i zhal nas/khyed nas dam bca' 'di rnams yun ring srung dgos pa med de/thub pas kyang lo drug dka' ba spyad mdzad pas lo drug ring srung bas chog /de nas ci bder mdzod gsungs/lo drug song rjes rje gtsang pa dang mnyam du dbus gtsang du byon/chos zab mo mang du gsan/gdung lo nyi shu rtsa lnga la phebs skabs rje gtsang pa gshegs/de nas kha rag gi rtse mo cho mo grol sar bzhugs pas 'tsho ba ni med/steng du gangs rud chen po byung nas chu me shing yang blang du med par bzhugs (899) pa dang de bzhin jo mo gangs dang se mo do rnams su dka' ba dpag tu med spyad pas nang sems kyi nang dang phyi 'byung po'i bar chad sogs thugs dam gyi grogs su gyur nas nang ye shes kyi stobs rgyas mngon par shes pa chen po dang ldan de nas chu mig dkar mo dang shing skam dang lcags spyil dang dbu ri la sogs pa'i dgon pa phran re mdzad nas gzhan don bskyangs khyad par dbu rir lo bdun bzhugs pas chogs pa'