shing bzo|{(917) shing bzo'i lag rtsal ni bod du gna' rabs bskal pa ya thog gi dus skabs nas rim bzhin 'phel rgyas byung zhing spyi lo'i gong gi lo nyis brgya'i sngon la rgyal po gnya' khri btsan pos pho brang yum bu bla mkhar bzhengs pa dang de nas rgyal rabs dgu pa rgyal po pu de gung rgyal gyi dus su shing la bug pa phug te (gnya' shing )dang (gshol mda' )(gshol phur )bzo ba chu chen sha ling gi za pa 'dzugs pa bcas byas yod rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i dus sa gtsug lag khang bzhengs skabs ka ba bzo dbyibs mi 'dra ba dang lcam sna la seng ge'i gzugs gdung ma dang gzhu'i ldebs la ro sgrung dang dmangs khrod kyi sgrung gtam nang bshad pa'i gtam rgyud ri mo sna tshogs shing la brkos pa deng sang yang lta rgyu yod de rjes rim pa yon rgyal rabs kyi skabs bzhengs pa'i sa skya'i lha khang chen mo dang zha lu'i gser khang chen mo ming rgyal rabs skabs bzhengs pa'i rgyal (918) rtse dpal 'khor chos sde'i gtsug lag khang bcas la gzigs na mkhyen thub shing gi thog yi ge brko ba'i lag rtsal ni spyi lo'i dus rabs bco lnga pa'i 'khor ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma yung los karma pa sku phreng lnga pa de bzhin gshegs pa dang rje tsong kha par bod yig gi bka' 'gyur cha tshang 'bul rgyu bskur nas bod la shing dpar brko ba'i lag rtsal dar ba'i skor gdan bsdus tsam zhig kho bos bas pa'i (bod kyi dpar bskrun )zhes pa'i ched rtsom nang gsal po ta la'i pho brang dkar po gsar bzhengs skabs bod kyi shing bzo'i lag rtsal mkhas pa yod tshad bsdus pa'i nang shing bzo (dbu chen )gcig ste dol gnas gsar pa 'jam dbyangs dbang po dbu chung (rtse kha chos skyong sogs )mi grangs bcu gsum shang brkos dbu chen mi gnyis (rgya ri bstan 'phel sogs/) shing bkros lag rtsal ang dang gras (sa glang grong pa sogs )mi grangs dgu bcu go lnga shing bgros lag rtsal pa 'bring gras (rgya ri tsan dan sogs )mi grangs bcu shing bzo ba dkyus ma (rin spungs thang dkar tshe bdag sogs )mi grangs brgyad cu gya dgu shing bzo tsag lag byed mkhan (pa snang mgon po sogs )mi grangs bzhi bcu zhe gsum bcas yod shing bzo dbu chen