shes rab rgyal mtshan|{shar rgyal mo rung rgyal mo rngu'i chu'i 'gram du gnas pa'i yul stegs mchog ba'i gnas su yab bon rigs bzhi la mkhas pa klu rgyal dang yum rin chen sman gnyis kyi sras su rab byung drug pa'i me sprel (1356)lor sku bltams/sku na ches phro nyid nas yab kyi drung du 'bri klog dang mo rtsis gto dang smad dpyad sogs rgyu'i bon la sbyangs pa mdzad/dgung lo bcu'i thog bya g.yung drung rgyal mtshan gyi drung du dang po bsnyen gnas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/khro klong rnam gsum dang/yar me ba'i bka' rten rnam par mchod gab pa/rtsa brgyud gzhung chen sogs rgyun mkho'i sngon 'gro'i phyag len gyi gzhung rnams thugs 'dzin mdzad/bshes gnyen des rab tu byung ba'i mtshan shes rab rgyal mtshan du gsol zhing sha chang sgong btsong spangs nas bslab khrims tshul bzhin bsrungs te bon gyi chos sgo khag gsan sbyong mdzad/mi ring bar bon rigs bzhi la mkhas par yar kyang ngom pa med par bod yul kun 'grims te skabs der bon gyi skor la mkhas pa'i rtser son pa'i mkhas grub yod do cog gi zhabs la gtugs nas gsan sbyong mdzad/khyad par du mkhas grub rin chen blo gros kyi drung nas phar phyin dang/'dul ba/dbu ma gsan sbyong gis mkhas par yar te bar 'byams chen po'i mtshan rtags thob pa dang 'brel drang srong bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/slar yang bshes gnyen gang gi drung nas nang gsang gsum gyi rgyud lung du ma dang/(mtshan nyid sde lnga/) (sgra 'grel/) ('bum dang mkhas brgyad gtan la 'bebs pa'i bshad pa/) ('dul ba'i TIk+ka/) 'phrin las bco brgyad kyi bshad pa/) ('byung khungs mdo/) (mdo sde nyer gcig/) (theg pa rim pa mngon du bshad pa'i mdo/) (dbu ma rtsod bzlog/) (gtan tshigs theg pa )sogs lung rig gi rnam gzhag ji snyed gsan sbyong mthar phyin mdzad/rab byung bdun pa'i me khyi (1406)lor zhwa dkar g.yung drung bon gyi gnas sa chen po sman ri dgon phyag btab/gsum rtsom la mtshon na (mdzod kyi 'grel pa 'phrul gyi sgron me )sa bcas dang bcas pa/(byang sems gab pa'i 'grel pa gsal byade nyi ma'i dkyil 'khor )sa bcad dang bcas pa/('dul ba che chung gnyis kyi 'grel pa 'phrul gyi sgron me )sa bcad dang bcas pa/(khon sdud kyi 'grel pa )sa bcad dang bcas pa/(byang sems gab pa'i 'grel pa gsar byade nyi ma'i dkyil 'khor )sa bcad dang bcas pa/('dul ba che chung gnyis kyi 'grel pa 'phrul gyi sgron me/) (bden gnyis kyi 'grel pa/) (gsang sngags kyi spyi don/) (sman gyi chog khrid/) (phur pa'i cham yig/) (srung ma'i sngags 'dzab/) ('gu ba'i dbang khrid/) 'od gsal phyag len/) (sa lam gyi smon lam )sogs thal phreng dang/dbang khrid/bstod pa skor gyi rtsom yig shin tu mang zhing/gzhan yang bka' phan dang stabs bde'i smon tshig sogs ni brjod kyis mi lang ba yod/gsung gi bdud rtsis bskyangs pa'i slob ma bsam gyis mi khyab pa byung ba'i nang rgyal tshab rin chen rgyal mtshan dang/rgyal rigs bru sha'i gdung 'dzin kun dga' dbang ldan dang shes rab seng ge /mi nyag bsod nams rgyal mtshan sogs dang/rgyun du gam bcar gyis gsung gi bdud rtsi thob pa'i mkhas pa brgya phrag kha shas yod pa btsas mkhas btsun bzang gsum gyi mdzad pas g.yung drung bon gyi bstan pa la ston pa gnyis pa'i phyag rjes kyis legs par bskyangs te dgung lo drug cu pa rab byung bdun pa'i shing lug (1415)lor sku (926) gshegs}
