shong ston lo tsA ba rdo rje rgyal mtshan|{la stod lho'i dpyad lung shar ba'i yul tsho'i bong ra zhes par sku bltams/'khrungs 'das kyi lo tshigs zhib cha ma rnyed mod/'gro mgon chos rgyal 'phags pa rin po che dang dus mnyam pas rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags byi (1240)lo'i yas mas su 'khrugs par snang/sku gzhon nu'i dus nas rab tu byung zhing go lung ba mdo sde rgyal mtshan gyi drung du dus 'khor chags lugs dang/bde kyai phreng ba'i skor (928) gsum sogs rgyud sde'i chos mang du gsan gar thig dang rtsis la sogs pa mkhas par sbyangs brtson mdzad gza' gsal bar byed pa'i sgron me sogs rtsis kyi bstan bcos mang du phyag rtsom gnang tsa nar bla ma srag bde ba'i drung nas phar phyin dang tshad ma mngon par 'bro lugs kyi dbang rgyud bshad pa man ngag dang bcas pa legs par gsan 'gro mgon 'phags pa rin po ches shong lo'i thugs 'dus bzhin bdag rkyen gnang nas rab byung bzhi pa'i shing glang (1265)lor bal yul du lo tsA slob tu byon te paN+Di ta sa dbang bzang po'i drug nas sgra dang snyan ngag sdeb sbyor zlos gar mngon brjod sogs rig gnas chung ba lnga gtso bor byang chub pa gsan sbyong mdzad khyad par du sgra rig pa la phul du phyin sa skyar phyir phebs te thog mar dus 'khor rgyud 'grel shog 'gyur zhes yongs su grags pa mkhas pa thams cad kyis 'gyur legs pa rang du brtsi ba 'di mdzad de rjes su 'phags yul rdo rje gdan du byon nas mahA bo d+hi la mchod pa dang skor ba mdzad cing rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta lak+ShimA ka ra bod du gdan drangs nas (bla ma dam pa chos kyi rgyal po la bstod pa/) 'jig rten dbang phyug gi bstod pa brgya pa/) (rig pa 'dzin pa'i sprin gyi bzhon pa'i skyes rabs klu kun tu dga' ba'i zlos gar/) (byang chub sems dpa'i rtogs pa brjod pa dag bsam 'khri shing/) (ka lA pa'i ti la sogs pa'i mtha'i bya ba rnam par dpyad pa/) (lung ston pa tsan+d+ra pa'i mdo/) (snyan ngag gi gzhung chen me long ma/) (sdeb sbyor gyi dpe brjod ston pa/) (sdeb sbyor gyi phreng ba'i bstod pa/) (bzlog pa bsdus pa rtsa 'grel )sogs rig nags kyi gzhung lugs dang bstan bcos mang du bsgyur gnang ba ma zad mngon brjod kyi bstan bcos chen po 'chi med mdzod la 'gyur mchan yang bkod de nas sgra dang snyan ngag gi bshad rgyun sngar bas dar spel mdzad thog slob ma mkhas pa du ma gso skyong gi dbu tshugs bdag nyin chen po 'chi nyid kyi slob ma gtso bo ni gang gi dbon po shong lo tsA ba blo gros brtan pa yin cing de la slob ma gtso bo lo tsA ba mchog ldan legs pa'i blo gros byung khong gi ba ma gtso bo ni dpang lo tsA ba blo gros brtan pa ste bo kyi rtsom rig lo rguyas thog shong dpang rnam gnyis zhes nyi zla lta bur mtshan snyan yongs su grags par gyur pas mdzad rjes lhag par du che shong lo'i sku yon la 'gro mgon 'phags pas bsngags pa rgya cher mdzad pa ste dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i rgyud 'grel pa dang bcas pa rgya che la zab cing gting dpag dka' ba tshig brling zhing sdeb sbyor byings che bas chen po rnams kyis kyang nyams su len dka' bas sngon byung gi lo tsA ba dag gis kyang ma 'gyur ba dang log par bsgyur ba dang rnam grangs gzhan dang phyogs re ba dang thal bar bsgyur ba la sogs pa de dag khyed kyis legs par khong du chud cing nges te zhu chen mdzad pa'i glegs bam dang klu rnams kun tu dga' ba'i zlos gar mthong bas dge ba dang rjes su yi rang ba khyad par can skyes zhes rab tu bsngags sgra sgyu rnams kyi gtsug gi nor bur gyur 'khrungs 'das sogs zhib rnam pa ma rnyed 'di'i lo rgyus (deb ther sngon po )le tshan (tha)shog grangs 14pa mkhas grub rje'i (dus 'khor Tika chen/) ngor pa dkon mchog lhun grub kyis brtsams pa'i (chos 'byung bstan pa'i rgya mtshor 'jug pa'i gru chen )bcas su gsal}
