shod gzim chung 'gag|{de lnga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs kyi las khungs shig ste/srid skyong rim can dang/srid blon bcas pas dbang sgyur bkod gtong byed sa'i shog 'gag ces pa de yin/de yang rab byung bcu gcig pa'i chu rta (1642)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas srid dbang bzung rjes sde srid dang po bsod nams rab brtan bsko gzhag byas pa nas pho lha tha'i ji'i bu wang 'gyur med rnam rgyal bar sde srid rim pas dbang lung bkod gtong phal che ba bya yul rtse lang ra yin par 'dug kyang de skabs shod 'gag ces pa'i tha snyad dngos su ma byung zhing rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me glang (1757)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa gshegs rjes gong ma chad lung gis de mo bde legs rgya mtsho rgyal tshab tu bskos/de nasab zung shod 'gag ces par gsar du chags/de'i 'go khrid sne mgron mkhan chung gcig /shod mgon bzhi (rim pa lnga pa )gzim 'gag gnyis bcas yod/de dag gi las 'gan ni rtse 'gag gi lam ltar gcig mtshungs yin/'dir shog 'gag gi sgrig gzhi dang 'brel ba'i rgyal tshab dang/srid skyong/srid blon bcas kyi byung tshul cang zad 'god pa ra bya ba la/rgyal tshab dang srid skyong ni/tA la'i bla ma ma'i yang srid khrir 'khod tshun srid 'gan byed por srid skyong zer zhing/rgyal tshab dang srid skyong su yin rung tA la'i bla ma ltar bod yongs la chos srid kyi dbang sgyur byed/rgyal tshab srid skyong gnyis ka las 'khur byed ring srid gzhung dang 'dod pa zhig yin khul gyis byung song tshang ma srid gzhung gi rtse shog phyag mdzod nas nar gtong byade srol yang dbang cha byung rjes 'bul ba yongs rdzogs sger nas len pa dang/da dung sa khang mi gsum khyon che thugs rje che zhur 'bul dgos pas dpal 'byor shin tu rgyas pa'i bla brang che khag dang ho thog thu'i go gnas cho bo 'dzin pa'i bla chen zhe cig tu gyur pa yin}
