shri thu bo blo bzang bstan pa'i nyi ma|{rje 'di ni khu re nor yul du rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i sa sbrul (1689)lor sku 'khrungs/sku gzhon dus dbus su lha ldan du gnas skor la phebs te grwa sar bzhugs nas mdo sngags gzhung lugs yongs la gnas sbyong mdzad/bla ma ngag dbang blo bzang bkra shis drung nas dge tshul slong gi sdom pa bzhes/rje 'jam dbyangs blo gros dang/ngag dbang chos skyong sogs bla ma rnams bsten nas rig pa'i gnas kun la sbyangs pa mthar phyin mdzad de mkhas par gyur/dbang lung khrid sogs mang du gsan/de nas gong ma yu'u dzi nas rgya nag pe cing du gdan drangs te hu'u u chan dga' ldan shri ho thog thu'i mtshan snyan phul/pe cin tsan dan dgon ngo bo'i bla brang du rgyun ring bzhugs te gsum chos (brgya rtsa'i rnam bshad tshogs gnyis shing rta )zhes pa dang/('dul ba'i las chog tshig don rnam bshad/) (sgron me/) (dzam lha dkar nag ser gsum dang klu'i chu sbyin/) (sangs rgyas byang sems kyi bstod pa/) (sdom pa gsum gyi nyes ltung mi rigs kyi sgo nas ngos bzung ste bshags sdom byed tshul/) (nyin zhag (930) phrugs gcig gi thun mtshams kyi rnal 'byor/) (thugs rje chen po rgyal ba rgya mtsho'i sgrub thabs them skas )zhes pa sogs bstan bcos mang du brtsams sog yul mtsho bdun dgon du bzhugs te 'chad rtsod rtsom gsum gyi bgyi ba rgya cher spel dgung grangs brgyad cu gyi bzhi la phebs pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu 'brug (1772)lor dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs}
