gshin rje pho brgyad mo brgyad|{dam can chos rgyal gyi 'khor gshin rje pho brgyad mo brgyad las/gshin rje pho brgyad ni/1 chos rgyal nag po/2 ya ba ti dkar po/3 phya sangs ser nag /4 rmig pa dmar nag /5 ral pa tshar dgu sngo nag /6 tel pa dkar nag /7 glang mgo sngo nag /8 rig mdar dmar nag bcas dang/gshin rje mo brgyad ni/1 pho nya mo/2 mchi ba ma/3 be con ma/4 dus mtshan ma/5 dus kyi zhags pa mo/6 lu gu rgyud ma/7 'bebs ma/8 lcags kyu ma ste thams cad nag po'o/_}
gshin rje gshed|{'di sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags nas bshad pa'i 'jam dpal dbyangs khro bo'i rnam par bstan pa'i mtshan zhig ste/de la yang/dgra nag lha bcu gsum/gshed dmar lha bcu gsum/gdong drug lha bcu gsum/rwa lugs 'jigs byed lha dgu/skyo lugs 'jigs byed lha dgu/zhal lugs 'jigs byed lha zhe dgu/mal lugs 'jigs byed lha dgu sogs mi 'dra ba yod pa de dag gi sku mdog dang/phyag mtshan/bzhugs stangs sogs zhib par sa skya 'jam dbyangs brtse dbang pos phyogs bsgrigs gnang ba'i (sgrub thabs kun btus )kyi pod (nya)(ta)gnyis su gsal}
