gshin stong|{mi bsad pa byung na gshin po'i nang mi la dge rtsa dang sems gso'i ched du dngos po rgya mi chung ba sprod du 'jug pa'i khrims bcad de phan tshul dgra sha len mi chog par gtan 'bebs byas pa ste/ming gzhan bsad pa stong gi zhal lce yang zer/(tun hong nas thon pa'i bod kyi lo rgyus yig cha )deb gnyis pa'i nang btsan po'i dus rabs kyi gshin stong gi khrims yig zhib phra bod yod pa der gzigs}
