gshen yul 'ol mo lung ring|{'di bon gyi chos lugs gsar gtod mdzad pa po ston pa gshin rab kyi 'khrungs yul yin par bon gyi chos 'byung dang lo rgyus gzhan dag skor la bshad tshul mi 'dra ba sna tshogs 'dug /lo rgyus 'ga' zhig nang tA sig 'ol mo lung ring zhes pa stod mnga' ris zhang zhung gi yul de yin pa dang/bod gna' rabs kyi yi ge smra yig zer ba de sogs bod kyi thog ma'i rig gnas mang po zhig zhang zhung gi yul nas dar bar bshad/(bon gyi chos 'byung )'ga' zhig nang/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad pa'i sham b+ha la zer ba de dang tA sig 'ol mo lung ring zhes pa gnyis ming mi 'dra ba las don gcig yin pa dang/las snang dag pa rnams kyi mthong snang la dngos su mjal rgyu yod pa las/spyir btang rang ga bas mthong rgyu med pa zhig yin par bshad 'dug pa/zhang zhung dang bod kyi rig gnas bar gyi 'brel ga'i skor la gom gang mdun spos kyis zhib 'jug brtag dpyad bya rgyu gal chen po 'dug snyam}
