bshad rgyud|{rgyud la rtsa rgyud dang bshad rgyud gnyis yod pa'i nang tshan bshad rgyud ni/rtsa rgyud kyi nang rang nyid kyi dgongs pa gsal por mi mngon par sbras te gsungs pa rnams bshad rgyud kyi nang dgongs pa gsal por 'grel ba zhig yin te/dus 'khor gyi rgyud ni don gsal por ston pa nas zur du bshad rgyud med/bla med kyi rgyud yin na dus 'khor ltar bshad rung bas khyab ste/gsang ba 'dus pa'i rgyud don nA ro pa'i dbang mdor bstan gyi 'grel par dus 'khor lugs su bshad yod/bde mchog dang kyai rdor la'ang rang rang gi rgyud kyi bshad srol re dang/'grel chen dri med 'od dang/phyag rdor stod 'grel sogs sems 'grel skor gsum gyis dus 'khor ltar du bshad yod}
bshad sgrub kyi bstan pa|{lung sde snod gsum bshad pa'i bstan pa dang bslab pa gsum lta bu sgrub pa'i bstan pa yin/lung sde snod gsum la brgal brtags kyi gtan la 'bebs pa ni rtsod pa dang/de gsum gyi tshig don gzhan la 'chad pa dang/de gsum gyi dgongs 'grel gyi bstan bcos rtsom gsum ni bshad pa'i bstan pa 'dzin pa'i don dang/bslab pa gsum la nyams len gyis 'jug pa ni sgrub pa'i (932) bstan pa 'dzin pa'i don yin}
