bsher khang las khungs|{'di ni bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs kyi tshan pa zhig ste/de lnga lha sa gtsug lag khang gi phyogs bzhir zhi rgyas dbang drag bzhi'i las khungs khag bzhi yod pa'i ya gyal byang du yod pa'i drag po mtshon byed kyi las khungs de yin zhing/'di tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa'i skabs gsar du btsugs/las khungs 'di'i las byed do dam mi sna yang shod drung gnyis dang/do dam so sor sger btsugs kyi drung yig gnyis/shar rgyud khang gnyer dang gad pa bcas mi grangs bcu skor yod/las khungs 'di bzhi rtsa'i thog khrims las khungs shig yin pas khrims yig der gzhi khag bdag gnyer rtsa bzung gis rdzong gzhis khag tu mi bsad byung rigs la zhib dpyad 'char gzhi gtong ba/lha sa gtsug lag khang gi rten gsum mchod chas tshang ma'i rten deb sher khang nas 'god nyar thog lha sa'i gtsug lag khang gi jo bo dang thugs rjes gtsos pa'i lha'i dbu rgyan/snyan rgyan/thugs rgyan/gser kong/dngul kong sogs mchod chan rnams dkon gnyer dpon la rtsis sprod dang/gsar du 'bul sbyor dbu rgyan snyan rgyan sogs 'bul spam che rigs smos med thog tha na g.yu byur rdog grangs re gnyis yan rten deb du bkod te bka' shag gi dam zhu byed dgos/rgya khyab rdzong gzhis khag nas lo gsar legs 'bul zhes pa'i dngul dang/rgya khyab tu lha phebs mkhan yod tshad nas lha khral zhes pa'i dngul bcas bsdus te lo gsar tshes 2nas 3bar so sor tA la'i bla ma dang gnas chung chos skyong gi mdun du star sgrig byed pa/gnang chung chos skyongs phebs sar lta skyong srung 'doms dang/phyi la bskyod skabs spos sner 'gro rgyu bcas kyi 'gan dbang spyod pa yin/rab byung bcu drug pa'i me sprel (1956)lor bsher khang las khungs 'di gyon zhib las khungs su zla sgril btang rjes gong gsal 'gan dbang rnams gyod zhib las khungs nas spyod pa yin}
