sa skya dgon pa|{sa skya dgon pa ni bod ljongs gzhis rtse sa khul sa skya rdzong gi byang ngos dbon po ri'i 'dabs su gnas yod/bod rang byung dang po'i chu glang 1073)lor 'khon dkon mchog rgyal pos gnas der gzigs skabs dbon po ri glang chen nyal ba dang 'dra ba'i mkhal khung g.yas pa'i thad nas sa dkar zhing snum pa chu g.yas su 'bab pa sogs kyi bkra shis dge mtshan du ma ldan pa mkhyen nas sa der dgon pa btab pas dgon ming du yul de'i sa'i kha dog la gzhigs nas sa skya dgon zhes btags/sa skya dgon pa 'di lho byang khag gnyis su dbye ba las dngos pa lho ma de sa skya grum chu'i lho ngos thang gshongs su chags shing/dgon pa byang min grum chu'i byang ngos dpon po ri'i 'dabs su chags/dang thog sa skya bar bod spyi la dbang sgyur ba'i srid dbang med stabs dgon pa de gzhi rgya chung ngu zhig las med kyang 'gro mgon chos rgyal 'phags pa'i sku dus su (spyi lo 1235nas 1280)yon gong ma'i rgyab skyor 'og sa skya par bod yongs la chos srid kyi lung sgyur ba'i dbang cha thob rjes dpon chen shAkya bzang pos bod khri skor bcu gsum las la bskul nas lha khang byang ma rgya bskyed byas pa dang 'brel bod rab byung lnga pa'i sa 'brug (1268)lor sa skya lha khang lho ma ste sa skya lha khang che mo gsar bzhengs kyis phyis su rgas skrun rim pa byas nas da lta'i gzhi khyon 'di tsam du 'phel rgyas byung na'ang/lte ba'i bla brang lha khang byang ma rnams da cha shul ro tsam las lhag med/dgon pa de'i 'du khang gi rga khyon ka ba bzhi bcu tsam yod/de'i nang ming grags che ba'i rgya nag se chen ka ba dang/nag po khrag 'dzag gi ka ba/'brong pho ka ba/stag po ka ba bcas ka chen bzhi yod/'du khang gi rten gtsor gser zangs las grub pa'i dus gsum sangs rgyas dang/'jam dbyangs gar gzigs ma/sa skya paN+Di ta/chos rgyal 'phags pa sogs kyi sku brnyan du ma bzhugs shing/gzhan yang yon gyi rgyal pos bla ma 'phags par dbang yon du phul ba'i chos dung dkar po rgyang grags zhes pa dang/de bzhin chos po ti chen po lcags long ma zhes pa (934) che zhing lci ba zur bzhir lcags kyi a long bzhi btags te mi res a long re nas bzung ste btegs na theg tsam yod pa bcas bzhugs la da dung 'du kha nang bla ma 'phags pa'i sku dus su bod kyi yig mkhan mang po'i sor mo'i 'du byed las bskrun pa'i lag bris kyi gser dngul sogs las bris pa'i chos kyi po ti brtsigs nas yod pas phyi sa rdo'i rtsig pa zhig kyang nang chos kyi rtsig pa ma zhig pa'i dpe chags pa ltar gyi khyad chos ldan bar thog tu sa skya'i gdung rgyud dang dkyil 'khor mang po yod pa'i ldebs ris tshar du dngar ba sogs dang yang steng du bla ma sa chen kun dga' snying por lam 'bras bla brgyud kyis bskor ba'i sku brnyan ngo mtshar can dang rdo rje nag po gur gyi mgon po yum chen e ka dza Ti 'dod khams dbang phyug ma sogs rten byin can mang po bzhugs dgon 'dir sngar gzhi thog bla brang dang rin chen sgang bla brang lha khang bla brang dus mchod bla brang sogs bla brang khag bzhir bgos yod kyang rjes su bla brang gnyis la bsdus de bzhin lha khang yang ji snyed cig yod pa de dag gi nang du rten khyad par can du ma bzhugs yod la ga par du yon dang ming rgyal rabs dngos su bzhengs pa'i dam chos po ti bgrang las 'das pa bzhugs shing phal che ba lag bris yin da dung rin chen sna bdun las bzhengs pa'i rgya ba'i gsung rab kyang mang po yod la shing ta lo'i lo ma'i thug tu bris pa'i shin tu rtsa che ba'i rgya dpe yang yod dam chos de dag gi khrod du rgyal ba'i gsung rab tsam du ma zad gso ba rig pa dang gnam rig skar rtsis rnam thar rtogs brjod tshad ma'i gzhung bod kyi brda sprod kyi gzhung lugs la sogs pa'i dpe cha ji snyen cig bzhugs pa la dang par shing yang du ma yod gzhan yang chos rgyal 'phags pa'i sku rgyu phyag rdzas dang yon ming ching rgyal rabs so so'i dus kyi dkar yol la sogs rtsa che'i dngos rigs mang po nyar tshags byas yod dus rabs bcu gsum pa'i dus dkyil du sa skya pas bod yongs la chos srid kyi dbang bsgyur ba nas bzung bod 'di dus yun ring po'i nang zang zing yam yom du gnas pa'i bskal ngan gyi mjug 'gril te chung bde zhing 'jags pa byung bas sa skya pa'i rig gnas sgyu rtsal dar rgyas phun sum tshogs pa yong rgyur rmang bzhi 'ding thub pa byung yod phyis sa skya pa nang khul du zhi mthun ma byung bar bla brang bzhir gyes nas bstan pa je nyams su gyur sa skya'i bstan 'dzin skyes bu mang zhing de yang gsang gas kyi bstan pa 'dzin mkhan grags pa che shus su ngor rdzong gnyis te ngor chen kun dga' bzang po dang rdzong pa kun dga' rnam rgyal gnyis yin phyis gsang sngags lugs kyi bstan pa 'dzin mkhas grags pa che shas su yang rong gnyis yin zhing khong rnam gnyis kyis mdzad pa'i mdo phyogs kyi bka' bstan shin tu mang ba dang rig pa'i gnas lnga la byang chub pa bu slob yang shing tu mang sa skya pa'i srid dbang nyams nas da bar du dus yun ring po'i nang dang lhag par du rig gnas gsar brje'i dus ngan skabs rtse cha'i rig dngos de dag thor gyar du song ba ji snyed cig byung yod kyang da dung gna' bo'i dngos rigs mi nga ba zhig da lta'ang mjal rgyu yod dpal sa skya dgos 'dis mes rgyal gyi lo rgyus dang rig gnas 'phel rgyas gtong rgyu'i thad gal che'i gnas bab zung yod pas rgyal yongs kyi gtso gnad rig dngos srung skyob sde tshan gyi gras su gtogs}
sa skya bdag chen nam khri chen|{sa skya bas skyabs mgon rtse zhes 'bod srol yod cing/de ni 'khon gyi rigs las mched pa'i sa skya'i gdung rgyud gang rung zhig sa skya'i srid kyi 'gan 'khur ba mdzad pa dang/lha sde mi sde'i tshogs 'du rgyas 'dzoms kyi thog go bsdur gyis tA la'i bla (935) ma mchog la 'char phul phyag rtags gzhir bzung khri gsol mdzad srol dang dus phyis pho brang gnyis su gyes te phun tshogs pho brang dang sgrol ma pho brang gnyis khri pa res 'khor lta bur mdzad srol byung ba de yang sngar lam 'char phul phyag rtags dgongs don khri pa gsar pa lha sar khri mjal zhu bcar gyis sngar srol mdzad sgo grub nas sa skyar phebs mtshams khri phebs kyi mdzad sgor rten 'brel zhu bar sngar srol ltar sa gnas srid gzhung da bkras lhun bla brang so so'i sku tshab dpon rigs mngags gtong bcas khri phebs rten 'brel gza' rgyas gnang srol yod khri chen ni sa skya'i chos srid gnyis ka'i gtso 'dzin mtho shos yin pa ma zad mtshan gnas thob thab bod kyi ho thog thu yongs kyi ang dang po yod gshis lha sar phebs skabs kyang phebs byams li wang nang phebs srol yod pa ma zad skyid tshal klu lding du gzhung zhabs ser skya brgyad chibs zhabs su bcar dgos la tA la'i bla ma mchog gi mjal kha'i skabs bdag chen la ho thog tu gzhan dang mi 'dra ba'i bzhugs gdan gdan 'phar gyi gdan thob kyang yod sa skya'i chos phyogs kyi mdzad gtso lha chen mkhan khri zhes mkhan po dang srid kyi gtso bo'i 'gan 'khur mkhan mdzod pa 'pho len skabs gsar pa bdag khri rang nyid nas bsko gzhag gis gzing chung 'gag tu mgron brgyud kyi bka' bsgyur gnang srol phud de byings chos srid kyi las don gal che'i rigs phyag mdzod nas 'char phul la bdag khris phyag rgyas gnang rgyu bcas kyi mdzad srol mchis sa skyar rtse shod ces sgrig gzhi gnyis yod par rtse zhes pa ni bdag khri'i thad ka'i zhabs zhu ba'i sgrig gzhi zhig yin zhing de la yongs 'dzin dang rtse phyag mdzod gcig gsol gzim mchod gsum tshogs mgron gcig bla sman pa gcig 'dren dpon gcig phebs 'go gcig rtse gzim 'gag gcig ja dpon che mo gcig zhal ltir pa 'ga' shas de min drung rigs kyi khongs su ma gtogs pa'i rtse'i gad pa gcig byams btegs pa bcu drug rtse chibs dpon bar thab ces gsol thab ma chen gcig sogs yod cing gong gsal rtse'i zhabs zhu ba de dag kyang 'pho len byung skabs phyag mdzod nas 'os 'phar phul bar bdag chen gyi phyag rtags bstsal ba gzhir bzung mdzod pas shod 'gag tu mgron brgyud bka' bsgyur gyi thog nas bsko gzhag byed srol yod}
sa skya pa bsod nams rgyal mtshan|{sa skya'i khri pa bcu gsum pa 'di nyid rab byung lnga pa'i chu byi (1312)lor zha lu khang gsar du yab bdag chen bzang po dpal dang/yum ma gcig zhon nub 'bum gnyis kyi sras su sku 'khrungs/dgung lo brgyad par phebs dus nas gzhung lugs mang po gsal la rgya che ba gsung thub pas snyan grags che bar gyur/dgung lo bcu gcig par bla chen kun dga' blo gros kyi drung du dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa dang theg chen sems bskyed sogs gsan/dgung lo bcu bdun la mkhan chen bsod nams grags pa dang slob dpon dpal ldan seng ge gnyis kyi drung du bar tu byung gnas mtshan bsod nams grags pa dang slob dpon dpal ldan seng ge gnyis kyi drung du rab tu byung nas mtshan bsod nams rgyal mtshan bzang po zhes gsol/dgung lo nyi shu pa la sngar gyi mkhan slob rnams dang/grongs dan pa gnas brtan bcu bdun tsam gyi dbus su bo dong bya rgod gshong gi gtsug lag khang du gcen dang lhan du bsnyen par rdzogs/de nas bzung sha chang zhal la mi reg cing ltung ba phra mo tsam yang khyad du mi gsod/dgung lo bcu dag par dpang lo chen po las rtse sha'i tshig 'grel tshig gsal dang/don 'grel dbu ma 'jug pa rang 'grel dang bcas pa sogs mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/dgung lo nyi shu pa la bya gshongs rnying par bsnyen par rdzogs/yod gong ma thug the'i mur gyis gdan 'dren snga rjes thengs bzhi tsam zhugs kyang ma phebs/ (936) dgung grangs nyer lnga la phebs pa nas bzung bu ston rin po che dang rdor dbyings sogs mkhas grub rnams las 'phags bod kyi gzhung bka' mang du gsan dgung lo re gcig par bo dong er bskor ba'i chos 'khor dang drug cu re gnyis la bsam yas su bskor ba'i chos 'khor 'di gnyis ni sngon gyi skyes bu gang zhig gis kyang bskor ma myong ba'i chos 'khor rlabs shin tu che bar grags de nas rje tsong kha pa chen po'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags kyi zab chos mang po gsan sku tshe hril por mkhas grub mang po bsten nas 'chad rtsod rtsom gsum gyi mdzad pa rgya cher 'phel ba las tshad ma dang phar phyin dbus ma gsang sngags sogs rig gnas dang chos 'byung gi phyag dpe dang lo rgyus kyi dpe cha rgya rabs gsal ba'i me long sogs mang po brtsams bka' 'bum la yang po ti nyi shu rtsa lnga bzhugs slob ma'i mchog ni sngags kyi rgyal tshab chen po snar thar pa sher snang ba dang yar lus pa seng ge rgyal mtshan gnyis gsung ngag 'dzin pa'i thugs sras sngags 'chang gzungs pa dpal ldan tshul khrims bla chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan nya dbon kun dga' dpal lo chen byang rtse ngo nang mkhan chen byang seng lo chen skyabs mchog dpal spyan snga grags pa byang chub bcas brgyad de bzhin ba stan 'dzin gyi skyes bu chen po bzhi yongs grags kyi mkhas pa chen po bcu gcig sogs mang du byon dgung lo drug cu re bzhin bzhes pa rab byung drug pa'i shing yos (1375)lor zhi bar gshegs}
sa skya paN+Di ta|{(sa skya paN chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan )'di bod kyi lo rgyus dang mes rgyal nang khul gyi lo rgyus thog mtshan snyan grags che zhing/bod mi rigs la nyer ka che ba'i 'gag rtsa'i dus skabs su yon rgyal rabs kyi rgyal bu go dan gyi sar phebs nas nyen ka las grol bar mdzad pa po yin/(bod kyi rab byung gsum pa'i chu stag 1182nas rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags phag 1251bar )yab sa skya'i rje btsun grags pa rgyal mtshan gyi gcung po dpal chen 'od po che dang/yum ma gcig gar phu ma nyi khri lcam gnyis kyi sras che chung gnyis kyi nang nas che ba yin/dgung lo chung dus kyi mtshan la dpal ldan don grub zhi zhing/rjes su khu bo rje btsun grags pa rgyal mtshan gyi drung du dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes pa'i mtshan la kun dga' rgyal mtshan du gsol/dgung lo chung dus nas bzung tshad ma rig pa/bzo rig pa/skar rtsis/sgra rig pa/gso ba rig pa/phar phyin/dbu ma/'dul ba/mdzod sogs mdo phyogs dang/gsang sngags rgyud sde bzhi la sogs pashes pa'i rkang grangs tsam yin par lag len thog 'khyol thub pa'i mkhas par gyur/de'i snyan grags rgya gar yul kun tu khyab pa na rgya gar lho phyogs kyi mu stegs pa'i mkhas pa 'phrog byed dga' bo sogs ston pa drug bod du sangs rgyas chos lugs la tshur rgol byed du 'ong/chos rje sa skya paN+Di ta nyid kyang mang yul skyid grong gi 'phags pa wi ti bzang po'i gtsug lag khang dang 'dabs 'brel ba'i tshong 'dus su bzhugs pa'i skabs su 'byor pa rtsod gleng gi sgo nas pham par mdzad/de'i dpang rtags kho'i ral pa bregs nas bod du bsdams phebs pa sngar sa skya'i dbu rtse rnying ma'i mgon khang nang du yod par grags/dgung lo nyer gsum pa bod rab byung gsum pa'i shing byi (1204)lor/kha che paN chen shAkya shri bod du phabs pa dang mjal nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/bod kyi rab byung gsum pa'i sa bya (1189)lo nas mong gol mi rigs kyi rgyal po jing ger han gyis mong gol tsho pa khag gcig gyur byas pa'i srid dbang btsugs te der mu mthun nas e she sha'i shar phyogs dang/yo rob kyi shar rgyud cha shas dang byang rgyud cha shas bcas la dmag drangs (937) nas mnga' 'og tu bsdus mthar krung go'i rgyal nang gi man ju dang rgya nag shis zha bcas dbang 'og tu bsdus nas gcig gyur byas rjes khyim pa dang rab byung gi dbye ba med par thams cad dmag khral dang 'u lag gi khral sgrub tu bcug rab byung bzhi pa'i shing rta (1234)lor yon rgyal rabs kyi rgyal po tha'i tsung o go ta'i bu chung ba go dan gyis srid dbang bzung rjes 'di'i khri lo drug pa rab byung bzhi pa'i sa phag (1239)lor sa skya pa dang phag gru 'bri gung tshal pa stag lung bcas kyi chos lugs mi sna tshos yon rgyal rabs kyi rgyal po dang rgyal sras so sor mgo btags zhus (sa skya pa dang lha sde gzhung pa gnyis rgyal po go dan rang nyid lam go btags zhus de bzhin du 'bri gung pa dang gtsang mgur mo bas rgyas sras se chen han la mgo btags zhus tshal pas rgyal sras se chen han la mgo btags zhus phag gru g.yas bzang thang po che ba bcas kyis hu la'i hu la mgo btags zhus stag lung sa rgyal sras a ri bo ga la mgo btags zhus/) lo de'i phyi lo rgyal po go don gyis blon po dor rta nag pos gtso bor byas pa'i dpag dpung bod du btang nas mdo stod mdo smad sog chu kha rnams su yod pa'i bod mi mthong tshad gsod pa dang khang pa mer bsreg pa rgya nor 'phrog pa bcas byed bzhin du dbus gtsang du yong 'phan po rgyal gyi lha khang mer bsregs sa grwa pa rab tu byung ba lnga brgya tsam dmar gsod byas grwa sgreng dgon pa la yang gnod 'tshe chen po byas pas mtshon mgo btags ma zhus pa'i sa gnas tshang mar bsregs gsod 'phrog gsum gyi sgo nas ming med du gtong ba sogs byas dus skabs der bod sa gnas su yod pa'i chab srid stobs shugs rnams mthun sgril med pa'i kha 'thor yin stabs tshang mas gcig rjes gnyis mthun du mgo btags zhus te spyi lo 846lo nas bzung lo grangs 393ring bod sa gnas su gcig gyur med pa'i gnas tshul mjug sgril zhing bod sa gnas de yon rgyal rabs kya gong ma'i mnga' khongs su bsdus te srid 'dzin dpon rigs dang dmag khral bsdu ba'i lam lugs btsugs bod du chos lugs la mkhas pa'i bla ma gang yod zhib rtsad byas thog skabs der bod sa gnas su chos lugs mang po yon pa'i nang nas stobs che shos sa skya pa'i chos lugs yin pa dang sangs rgyas chos lugs la mkhas shing bod sa gnas su snyan grags che shos ni sa skya paN+Di ta yin pa'i gnas tshul go thob byung ba'i rkyen gyis sa paN rang nyid kyi dgung lo drug cu re gsum pa rab byung bzhi pa'i shing 'brug (1244)lor yon rgyal rabs ka rgyal po go dan gyis rdor sri mgon dang dbon jo dar ma gnyis kyi mdun hor yul du chos ston pa'i bla mar phebs dgos pa'i zhu yig (zhu yig 'di'i ngo bshus )sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )kyi shog grangs 67nas grangs gong gsal gyi mjug na gsal )dang dngul bre chen lnga gos chen gyi chos gos mu tig gi tshom bu can mu tig rdog po drug stong nyis brgya yod pa gcig gos chen kha thi yug gnyis thon thi yug gnyis gos chen sna tshogs yug nyi shu tham pa bcas bskur ba 'byor zhing yi ge'i nang don la gdan drangs pa ltar ma phebs na bod du dmag dpung gtong rgyu yin zhes gsal bar dgung lo mthong yang bod mi rigs kyi bde 'jags dang chos lugs khag gi dbe 'jags kyi ched du rang srog phangs med mdzad de hor yul du byon dgung lo drug cu re lnga bzhes pa rab byung bzhi pa'i me rta (1246)lo'i zla ba brgyad par hor rgyal po'i rgyal sa ling cu rtse (deng sang kan su'u zhing chen gyi wu we sa khul gnas yul 'gu tshang grong brdal la phebs 'byor byung zhing rgyal po ga dan hor yul du song nas (938) tshur log pa dang me lug lo'i zla ba dang po la mjal rgyal po go dan mdze nad kyis mnar ba la sman bcos mdzad pas rgyal po nad la grol te sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi grwa pa rnams chos lugs gzhan dag gi blam tsho'i grwar mgor sdod chog pa'i dmigs bsal thob thang sprad rgyal po dang blon po 'bangs mi rnams la yang go bde ba'i chos mang po gsungs nas hor gyi yul du sangs rgyas chos lugs sngar las lhag par dar spel mdzad ri bo rtse lngar yang phebs nas de na gnas pa'i sgom chen mang po la mdo sngags kyi chos 'dod pa dang mthun pa gnang bod nas bla ma dang slob ma bshes gnyen mkhas pa rnams kyis myur bar bod du phyir phebs dgos pa'i zhu ba nan can yang yang 'byor ba'i bka' lan du dbus gtsang mnga' ris dang bcas pa'i dge ba'i bshes gnyen yon mtshon rnams la springs pa zer ba'i bka' yig cog gtong ba gnang ('di'i ngo bshus cha tshang (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )kyang nang 'khod pa der ga zigs )yi ge 'di'i nang hor gyi rgyal rabs 'di dmag dpung mang zhing stobs che ba dang mgo btags mi zhu ba rnams dmag dpung btang nas mnga' 'og tu bsdus te dpon rigs kyang hor rang gi mi bsko gzhag byed kyi yod pa dang dmag drangs ma dgos par mgo btags zhus pa rnams kyi dpon rigs rang rang so so'i khongs nas bskos pa'i dbye ba yod pa dang hor rigs rang gi mi ser la khral dang 'u lag che zhing mgo btags zhus pa dang dmag btang nas mnga' 'og tu bcug pa'i sde mi ser rnams khral dang 'u lag chung ba'i khyad par yod pa rgyal pos sa gnas so sor btang ba'i gser yig pa dang mi sna rnams la sne len legs po ma byas tshe khong tshos rgyal po la thad kar skad cha shod pa'i go skabs dang bstun nas rgyal po gting nas khros dgos pa'i gtam shod par nges pas gser yig pa dang mi sna rnams la sne len legs par bya dgos rgyal po dga' ba'i dngos po gang dang gang dgos pa bcas yi ger bris pa gnang yod pa 'dis bod kyi mi dmangs rnams yon rgyal rabs kyi srid jus la yid chen chen po skye thub pa byung ba dang yon rgyal rabs kyis bod dang mes rgyal gcig gyur byed pa'i bya gzhag la rgyab skyor dang skul ma chen po thebs nas sa skya paN chen sku ma 'das bar gyi lo ngo brgyad tsam ring yon rgyal rabs kyis bod sa gnas su dmag dpung btang ma dgos pa'i bde 'jags chen po byung ba bcas sa skya paN chen ni bod sa nags dang mes rgyal gong bu gcig gyur byas pa'i bya gzhag nang byas rjes chen po bzhag pa'i bod rigs chos lugs mi sna zhig yin mthar dgung lo bdun cu pa rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags phag (1251)lor lang gru'u sprul pa'i da zhes bya bar sku 'das sa paN 'dis mdzad pa'i gsung rtsom pod gsum tsam yod cing grags che ba ni (thub pa'i dgongs pa rab tu gsal ba'i bstan bcos )la shog grangs 24dang (legs par bshad pa'i rin po che'i gter )yongs grags su (sa skya legs bshad )zer ba la shog grangs 23 (gzhung lugs legs par bshad pa zhes bya ba'i bstan bcos )la shog grangs 23 (rol mo'i bstan bcos )la shog grangs 8 (mkhas pa la 'jug pa'i sgo )zhes bya ba'i bstan bcas la shog grangs 58 (sgra la 'jug pa )zhes bya ba'i bstan bcos la shog grangs 28 (tshig gi gter )zhes bya ba'i bstan bcos la shog grangs 33 de'i 'grel pa rang nyid kyis mdzad pa la shog grangs 195 (sdom pa gsum gyi rab tu bye ba )zhes bya ba la shog grangs 49bcas 'di rnams bod kyi rig gnas dang tshad ma rig pa sangs rgyas chos lugs bcas la zhib 'jug byed mkhan tshos bltas na blo sgo 'byed pa'i legs bshad mang du yod pazhig yin 'di'i lo rgyus (939) dang rnam thar skor 'gro mgon chos rgyal 'phags pas mdzad pa'i (sa skya paN chen gyi rnam thar )dang sa skya paN chen rang nyid kyi dngos slob lho pa mkhan chen rin chen dpal gyis mdzad pa'i (sa skya paN+Di ta chen po'i rnam thar/) sa skya bdag chen a mes ngag dbang kun dga' bsod nams kyis mdzad pa'i (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )kyi shog grangs 47nas 85bar gsal}
