sa skya pa'i gdung rabs|{sa skya pa'i chos 'byung dang deb ther mang por bshad srol yod pa'i 'khon gyi gdung rgyud ji ltar byung ba'i skor zhib par bdag chen a mes ngag dbang kun dga' bsod nams kyis mdzad pa'i (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )dang/tshal pa kun dga' rdo rjes brtsams pa'i (deb ther dmar po )kho bon mchan 'grel bkod pa (mi rigs dpe skrun khang gi 1981lor par skrun byas pa )lcags dpar ma'i shog grangs 339nas 341bar gdung rgyud re'u mig bkod yod pa der gzigs}
sa skya dpon chen|{sa skya pas bod sa gnas yongs rdzogs gi srid dbang bzung skabs kyi dpon chen dpon rabs nyi shu ni/dang po shAkya bzang po/gnyis pa kun dga' bzang po/gsum pa zhang btsun/bzhi pa phyug po ban dkar ba/lnga pa byang rin/drug pa kun gzhon/bdun pa gzhon dbang/brgyad pa byang rdor/dgu pa ang len/bcu pa legs pa dpal/bcu gcig pa seng ge dpal/bcu gnyis pa 'od zer seng ge /gcu gsum pa kun rin/bcu bzhi pa don yod dpal/bco lnga pa yon btsun/bcu drug pa 'od zer seng ge /bcu bdun pa rgyal ba bzang po/bco brgyad pa dbang phyug dpal/bcu dgu pa yang rgyal ba bzang po/nyi shu pa dbang brtson bcas dpon rabs nyi shus rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags sprel (1260)lo nas rab byung drug pa'i sa glang (1340)lo'i bar lo dgu bcu tsam gyi ring bod sa gnas yongs su dbang sgyur byas mthar srid dbang phag mo grub pa ta'i su tu'i lag tu shor}
sa skya dpon chen shAkya bzang po|{sa skya paN+Di ta chen po yon rgyal rabs kyi rgyal bu go dan gyis gdan drangs te byon khar shAkya bzang po dpon chen du bskos/gong ma hu pi li se chen shan gyis zam klu gu ming dbang hu'i zhes pa'i cho lo dang tham kha sprad/sa skya paN chen go dan gyi gdan drangs lo rabs byung bzhi pa'i chu yos (1243)lor nas rab byung lnga pa'i lcags rta (1270)lo bar lo ngo nyi shu rtsa brgyad ring sa skya'i dbon chen byas/rab byung bzhi pa'i shing glang (1265)lor sa skya'i lha khang chen mo bzhengs pa'i 'go tshugs nas mjug ma sgril gong bar byung lnga pa'i lcags rta (1270)lor 'das/'di'i lo rgyus skor stag tshang pa dpal 'byor bzang pos brtsams pa'i (rgya bod yig tshang )la gzhi byas te bris}
sa skya dmar po rnam gnyis|{sa skya paN chen dang bla ma 'gro mgon 'phags pa gnyis rab byung yin pas dmar po rnam gnyis zer}
sa skya'i mnga' bdag rim byon brgyad|{'gro mgon 'phags pa (1255nas 1280) rin chen rgyal mtshan (1267nas 1275) d+harma pa la rak+Shi ta (1280)nas 1287) shar pa 'jam dbyangs rin chen rgyal mtshan (1287nas 1305) bdag nyid chen po bzang po dpal lam bzang dpal (1206nas 1214) nam mkha' legs pa 1325nas 1342) 'jam dbyangs don yod rgyal mtshan nam bla ma 'jam dbyangs don grub rgyal mtshan (1343nas 1344) bsod nams rgyal mtshan nam bla ma dam pa bsod nams (940) rgyal mtshan (1345nas 1348)}
sa skya'i bla brang go bzhir gyes pa|{sa skya'i nang sngar gdung brgyud mang du 'phel ba la brten nas bla brang bzhir logs su gyes pa ste/1 gzhi thog blang brang (deng yang 'gro mgon 'phags pa sku gshegs pa'i rjes su 'gro mgon phyag na sku dbang btsan pas khong rang gi sras d+harma pA la rak+Shi ta gdan sa rang du bzhag /slob dpon ye shes 'byung gnas zangs tsha bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyi g.yog mo'i sras par brten/ye shes 'byung gnas kyi sras bdag nyin chen po bzang po dpal ba sa skya'i gdung rgyud ngo ma min tshul gong ma hu pe li se chen han la zhus par brten/gong mas bdag chen bzang po dpal ba rgya mtsho'i mtha'i gling phran zhig tu bskrad/de'i shul du phyag na dang d+harma pA la rak+Shi ta gnyis ka sku gshegs pa'i dus su sa skya'i dpon chen rnams kyis gong mar bdag chen bzang po dpal ba sa skya'i gdan rab phebs chog pa'i zhu ba nan tan phul ba bzhin/bod du phebs nas sa skya'i gdan sa mdzad/jo mo bdun (kun dga' 'bum/yod bdag mo/nam mkha' rgyal mo/gzhon du 'bum/nyi ma rin chen/kun spang lcam mo/_/khang gsar dpon mo )yod pa'i kun dga' 'bum gyi sras ti shri kun dga' blo gros kyis gcung po rnams la bla brang bzhi so sor bgos nas gnang zhing/de yang/1 gzhi thog bla brang (bdag chen bzang po dpal ba'i jo mog sum pa nam mkha' rgyal mtsho'i sras gsum gyi 'bring ba mkhas btsun nam mkha' legs pa la bla brang gcig nang ba de nas byung ba'i gdung rgyud rnams la gzhi thog bla brang pa zer/) 2 rin chen sgang bla brang (bdag chen bzang po dpal ba'i jo mo bzhi pa gzhon du 'bum la sras gsum yod pa'i 'bring ba 'jam dbyangs don yod rgyal mtshan la gnang ba'i bla brang la zer/) 3 lha khang bla brang (bdag chen bzang po dpal ba'i jo mo gnyis pa yod bdag mor sras gsum yod pa'i 'bring ba tI shri kun dga' legs 'byung la gnang ba'i bla brang la zer/) 4 dus mchod bla brang ('jam dbyangs don yod rgyal mtshan spun mched la shel gyi tham kha dang/rin chen sgang bla brang gi dbang kun dga' legs pa ming sring gnyis la gser gyi tham ka dang dus mchod bla brang sprad pa na mi ring bar phan tshun mthon po ma byung ba'i 'go tshugs )bcas bzhi yin}
sa skya'i bla rabs 'jam dbyangs bdun brgyud|{1 'khon dkon mchog rgyal po'i ('di phan sa skya rnying ma la 'di nas gsar ma'i lugs su byas )sras sa chen kun dga' snying po (dkar po/) de'i sras kun dga' 'bar (rgya gar du sku gshegs/) 2 slob dpon bsod nams rtse mo (dkar po/) 3 rje btsun grangs pa rgyal mtshan (dkar po/) 4 dpal chen 'od po bzhi (yum lnga/) 5 'od po'i sras sa skya paN+Di ti kun dga' rgyal mtshan/6 zangs tsha bsod nams rgyal mtshan te chos rgyal sku mched gnyis/7 bsod nams rgyal mtshan gyi sras lo gros rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po zhes chos rgyal 'go mgon bla ma 'phags pa ste/de ltar sa chen gyi sras bzhi/chos rje sku mched gnyis/bla ma 'phags pa dang bdun la 'jam dbyangs bdun rgyud do/_}
