sa 'bri 'khrug pa|{sa skya bdag chen d+harma pA la ra k+Shi tas sa skya'i gdan sar phebs nas lo lnga la slebs pa rab byung lnga pa'i shing bya (1285)lor 'bring gung sgom pa kun rdor rin chen gyis stod hor gyi rgyal po hu la'i hu'i sog dmag khri dgu btsam bod du 'khrid nas sa skyar dmag drangs/de nas lo lnga song ba rab byung lnga pa'i lcags stag (1290)lor (sa skya'i 'jam dbyangs rin chen rgyal mtshan gyi khri lo bzhi pa/) sa skya'i dpon chen ang len gyis yon rgyal rabs kyi gong ma hu pi li se chen han bu the'u mur b+ho khas sde srid pa'i dmag dpung dang mnyam du gtsang dmag phon chen po dang bcas 'bri gung du dmag drangs/'bri gung mthil gyi lha khang chen mo mer bsreg btang/grwa pa dang mi skya bsdoms pa'i mi grangs chig khri lhag tsam bsad/de sngon 'bri gung 'i mchod gzhis khongs kyi mi sde sa cha mang po sa skya bas phrogs/de la bod kyi lo rgyus thog 'bri gung gling log zer zhing/de nas bzung dbus gtsang gnyis kyi bod rigs nang khul bar 'gal zla chen po chags pa'i 'go tshugs zhes bshad srol yod}
