sa gzhi pad+ma 'dab brgyad|{lha sa grong khyer chags pa'i sa dbyibs pad+ma 'dab brgyad kyi rnam par gnas pa ste/de'i rtsi tshul ni sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i mdzad pa'i (rgyal dbang sku phreng lnga pa'i gser gdung 'dzam gling rgyan gcig gi dkar chag )le'u dang po las/dga' bzhi 'phrul snang gi gtsug lag khang chen po'i steng nas phyogs mtshams kyi sa dbyibs la zhib tu brtags pa na/lus pa'i srang kha (shur kha )dang ri bo rnams bsnol ba'i mtshams dang la'i 'grul lam bcas kyi thog nas pad+ma 'dab brgyad kyi rnam pa gsal bar 'char ba ste/de yang shar phyogs stag rtse ngos kyi byang ri dang lho brag dkar gyi ri gnyis bsnol mtshams mal dro phyogs su 'gro ba'i lam chen gyi chad du zur gcig /chos lung/skam po yung/grib rnams kyi lung pa dang la bcas la zur re re/lho nub skyid smad kyi phyogs sde'u dang stong lung gi ri bsnol mtshams chu shul phyogs kyi mal chen thang du zur gcig /nub phyogs stod lung nang gi lam chen dang skyor mo lung gi rgyab ri yab ri bsnol mtshams su zur gcig /nub byang nyang bran gyi phu dang dog bde gnyis kyi lung shur dang la gnyis la zur re re bcas zur brgyad po de yin zhes gsungs}
