sa ra ha|{(slob dpon sa ra ha )slob dpon sgra gcan 'dzin yang zer/slob dpon 'di slob dpon klu sgrub kyi rtsa ba'i bla ma yin pas dus rabs dang po'i gong tsam du byung ba yin 'dra/slob dpon 'di'i 'khrungs yul ni lo rgyus 'ga' zhig na/rgya gar lho phyogs be d+har+b+ha yin zer ba dang/'ga' zhig gis rgya gar shar phyogs kyi grong khyer ra d+hi zhes bya ba yin zer/rang nyid sangs rgyas chos lugs la dad pa skyes nas nyin mo bram ze'i chos lugs dang/mtshan mo sangs rgyas chos lugs byas/skabs re chang yang 'thung bas bram ze rnams kyis chos lugs dang 'gal bar brtsis nas rgyal po la zhus pas rgyal pos gnas nas bskrad/de nas sangs rgyas chos lugs la rab tu byung nas nA len Ta dgon par byon/slob dpon sgra gcan 'dzin 'od bya ba la sog slob dpon mkhas pa mang po bsten nas thag pa che chung gi chos dang/gtso bor gsang gas kyi chos gsan/de nas gsang sngags kyi lam lab rten nas rtogs pa mthon por song ste mda' mkhan gyi bu mo phyag rgyar brten te spyod pa la gshegs/sku tshe'i smad du lho phyogs dpal gyi rir byon nas/der gsang gas kyi chos mang po gsungs nas slob dpon klu sgrub sogs slob ma 'ga' zhig byung/dgung lo ji tsam bzhugs min lo rgyus gsal ba zhig da phan ma mthong zhing/slob dpon des mdzad pa'i bstan bcos la/bod du 'gyur zhing grags che ba ni/(do ha mdzod/) (sku'i mdzod 'chi med rdo rje'i glu/) (thugs kyi mdzod skye med rdo rje'i glu/) (sku gsung thugs yid la mi byed pa'i phyag rgya chen po/) (man ngag tshigs su bcad pa bcu gnyis pa/) (rang byin gyis brlabs pa'i rim pa )bcas lo tsA ba shri bai ro tsa na dang/rma ban chos 'bar gyis bsgyur ba/bstan 'gyur sngags phyogs pod (tsi)par yod/slob dpon 'di'i lo rgyus rgyas pa jo nang tA ra nA thas brtsams pa'i (bka' babs bdun ldan gyi brgyud pa'i rnam thar rin po che'i 'byung gnas )su gsal}
