sa la legs drug|{bod kyi btsan po'i mi rabs bcu pa nas (950) bco lnga pa'i bar la zer 1 rgyal po pu te gung rgyal dang btsun mo bum thang rmang gnya' gnyis kyi bu e sho legs 2 de dang btsun mo rmu lcam bram nag gnyis kyi bu de sho legs 3 de dang btsun mo klu lcam mer mo gnyis kyi bu thi sho legs 4 de dang btsun mo gung sman gnyis kyi bu gu rub legs 5 de dang btsun mo mtsho sman 'brong ma gnyis kyi bu 'brong gzher legs 6 de dang btsun mo gnam sman bu mo gnyis kyi bu i sho legs bcas yin tun hong nas thon pa'i bod kyi lo rgyus shog dril nang rgyal po 'di rnams kyi mang dag ngo rim mi 'dra ba'i thog legs drug 'dren pa'i skabs ming bdun byung ba gang yin brtag}
