sangs rgyas kyi sku gsung thugs kyi yon tan gsum|{sku'i yon tan ni/sangs rgyas kyi mtshan dang dpe byad bzang po rnams yid la dran par byad pa dang/gsung gi yon tan ni/'jig rten khams kyi sems can gang yod kyis dus gcig ta rtsi ba mi 'dra ba kho na re re nas dris kyang sems kyi skad cig gci gal ldan pa'i shes rab kyis bzang nas gsung gcig gis dri ba thams cad kyi lan mdzad cing/de rnams kyis kyang rang rang gi skad du go bar 'gyur ba shin tu rmad du byung ba'i tshul dang/thugs kyi yon tan ni/shes bya'i ji lta ba dang ji snyed pa thams cad la lag mthil du skyu ru bar bzhag pa ltar mkhyen pa thogs pa mi mnga' bar 'jug pa mkhyen pa'i yon tan dang/sems can rnams nyon mongs kyis rang dbang med par bcings pa bzhin du/thub pa yang snying rje chen pos rang dbang med par bcings pa'i 'gro ba rnams kyip+sadug bsngal la gzigs pa na thugs rje chen po rgyun chad med par skye ba brtse ba'i yon tan rnams so/_}
sangs rgyas kyi chos ma 'dres pa sum brgya|{gzugs sku'i yon tan mtha' dbus med pa bcu nas rnam par thar pa bcu'i bar bcu tshan sum cu rtog ge 'bar bar gsung pa ltar ro/_}
sangs rgyas kyi chos gzhan dang ma 'dres pa bco brgyad|{dge slong gtum po sogs kyi gnod pa byung ba dang 'grogs pa sogs sku'i spyod pa 'khrul ba mi mnga' ba/nags stug por don med kyi sgra 'byin pa sogs gsung ca co mi mnga' ba/brjed nges kyi bya ba shor ba sogs dran pa nyams pa mi mnga' ba/stong pa nyid kyi don la thugs mnyam par ma bzhag pa mi mnga' ba/'khor 'dus gnyis la blang dor ngo bo nyid kyi grub pa'i tha dad pa nyi kyi 'du shes mi mnga' ba/gdul bya'i rgyud la 'phrin las mdzad pa dus la ma bab nas so sor ma brtags pa'i btang snyoms mi mnga' ba dang drug ste spyod ma pa ma 'dres pa drug /sems can gyi don mdzad pa'i 'dun pa nyams pa mi mnga' ba/gdul bya gang na yod pa'i gnas su gshegs pa la spro ba'i ban 'grub nyams pa mi mnga' ba/sems can 'dul ba'i thabs mi brjed pa'i dran pa nyams pa mi mnga' ba/chos thams cad kyi gnas lugs de bzhin nyid la mnyam par bzhag pa'i ting nge 'dzin la nyams pa mi mnga' ba/ji lta ji snyed kyi chos rab tu rnam par 'byed pa'i shes rab las nyams pa mi mnga' ba/sgrib pa spang pa'i rnam grol lam la nyams pa mi mnga' ba dang drug ste rtogs pa ma 'dres pa drug /spyod lam bzhi'i gdul bya 'dul ba sku'i 'phrin las rnams ye shes kya sngon du 'gro zhing ye shes kyi rjes su 'brang ba/byams pa dang snying rje sogs thugs kyi 'phrin las rnams ye shes sngon du 'gro zhing ye shes kya rjes su 'brang ba dang gsum ste 'phrin las ma 'dres pa gsum/'das pa'i dus mkhyen pa la ma chags ma thogs pa'i ye shes/ma 'ongs pa'i dus mkhyen pa la ma chags ma thogs pa'i ye shes/da lta bu mkhyen pa la ma chags ma thogs pa'i ye shes dang gsum ste ye shes ma 'dres pa gsum dang bcas te bco brgyad do/_/'di ni phar phyin las byung ba ltar yin no/_/mngon pa mdzod las gsungs pa'i sangs rgyas kyi chos ma 'dres pa bco brgyad ni/stobs bcu/mi 'jigs pa bzhi/dran (953) pa nyer bzhag gsum thugs rje chen po dang bco brgyad do/_/'di rnams zag med ye shes sde tshan nyer gcig gi khongs su gtogs so/_}
sangs rgyas kyi mnyam pa nyid gsum|{tshogs bsags par mnyam pa nyid/chos sku brnyes par mnyam pa nyid/'gro ba'i don spyod par mnyam pa nyid do/_}
sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/'gro ba'i sdug bsngal nad brgya sel byed sman gcig pu dang phan bde ma lus pa 'byung ba'i gnas gcig pu ste sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa yin zer}
sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa gnyis|{lung gi bstan pa dang/rtogs pa'i bstan pa/lung gi bstan pa ni chos bshad pa dang nyan pa/rtogs pa'i bstan pi ni rtogs pa sems brgyud la skyes pa}
sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa sde bzhi|{bon chos gnyis/sman dang gtsug lag khang gnyis te bzhi'o/_}
sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa lo lnga stong du gnas par bshad pa'i lnga brgya phrag bcu|{dgra bcom pa'i le'u/phyir mi 'ong gi le'u/rgyun zhugs kyi le'u/lhag mthong gi le'u/ting nge 'dzin gyi le'u/tshul khrims kyi le'u/mngon pa'i le'u/mdo sde'i le'u/'dul ba'i le'u/rtags tsam 'dzin pa'i le'u bcas le'u re la lnga brgya re yod do/_/(lnga brgya phrag bcu'ang zer/)}
sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa'i sde snod|{sangs rgyas chos lugs gsung rab sde snod gsum ste/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi kun spyod gtso bor ston pa 'dul ba'i sde snod/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi lta ba'i skor gtso bor ston pa mngon pa'i sde snod/sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi ting nge 'dzin sgom tshul gtso bor ston pa mdo sde'i sde snod bcas yin no/_}
sangs rgyas kyi dus chen bzhi|{cho 'phrul chen po'i dus chen/mngon par byang chub pa'i dus chen/chos kyi 'khor lo bskor ba'i dus chen/lha las babs pa'i dus chen no/_}
sangs rgyas kyi 'phrin las nyer bdun|{zhi ba'i las la 'god pa/gzhan rgyud smin byed bsdu bzhi la 'god pa/blang dor rtogs pa la 'god pa ste tshogs lam 'god pa'i 'phrin las gsum/gnas lugs kyi don rtogs pa la 'god pa/phyin drug rdzogs byed la 'god pa/gnyis don spyod pa la 'god pa/lta ba rnam dag la bkod pa ste sbor lam la 'god pa bzhi/nga nyid mngon sum du gsar du rtogs pa la 'god pa sta mthong lam la 'god pa gcig /sa gnyis pa nas lnga pa'i bar la 'god pa/sa drug pa dang 'god pa/bdun pa la 'god pa/brgyad pas bsdus pa'i spyod pa khyad par can la 'god pa/bden 'dzin mngon gyur zad pa la 'god pa/sa dgu pa la 'god pa/sa bcu thob ma thag pa la 'god pa/skye ba gcig thogs kyis bsdus pa'ip+sakaye ba phyi mar 'tshang rgya bar nges pa la 'god pa/gzhan don lhun grub la 'god pa/sangs rgyas kyi chos lhag ma rdzogs pa la 'god pa/srid pa tha mas bsdus pa'i byang chub 'dren par byad pa la 'god pa/las chad mi za ba la 'god pa/ji snyed pa rtogs pa la 'god pa/ji lta ba rtogs pa la 'god pa/phyan ci log zad pa la 'god pa/gzhi med pa la 'god pa/rnam byang rdzogs pa la 'god pa/srid gzhi mnyam nyid la 'god pa'i 'phrin las te sgom lam la 'god pa bco brgyad/mi gnas pa'i myang 'das la 'god pa ste 'bras ba la 'god pa gcig ste nyer bdun no/_}
sangs rgyas kyi mtshan bcu|{1 de bzhin gshegs pa dang/2 dgra bcom pa/3 yang dag par rdzogs pa'i sangs rgyas/4 rig pa dang zhabs su ldan pa/5 bde bar gshegs pa/6 'jig rten mkhyen pa/7 skyes bu (954) 'dul ba'i kha lo sgyur ba bla na med pa 8 lha dang mi rnams kyi ston pa 9 sangs rgyas 10 bcom ldan 'das te mtshan bcu}
sangs rgyas kyi mtshan bzang so gnyis|{de bzhin gshegs pas sngon dam bca' brtan par byas pas zhabs kyi mthil legs par mnyam par gnas pa/sbyin pa btang bas phyag zhabs kyi mthil 'khor los mtshan/gzhan khyad dum bsad pas rting ba yangs shing long bu mi mngon pa dang/sems can gzhan 'jigs pa las bskyabs pas sor mo ring ba/gzhan gyis 'khor phra mas bye bas phyag zhabs kyi sor mo rnams dra bas 'brel ba/gos sna tshogs byin pas phyag zhabs zhags pa 'jam zhing gzhon sha chags pa/bzang btung rgya chen po byin pas phyag zhabs kyi mthil bzhi dang phrag gcig gnyis dang ltag pa'i cha ste sku'i gnas bdun dag mtho ba dang/sangs rgyas kyis gsungs pa'i chos bzung bas byin pa e na ya zhes pa shab+ha 'am bse kha sgo'am sha ba'i byin pa dang 'dra bar sha rgyas shing byin gyis phra ba/gsang tshigs bsrungs shing 'khrig pa spangs pas glang po che ltar gsang ba sbubs su nub pa/dge ba rgya chen po rim gyis spyad pas ro stod 'phel ka che ba seng ge 'dra ba/dge ba yang dag par spyad pas thal gong ma khengs pa'i bar med par rgyas pa/gzhan la mi 'jigs pa byin pas dpung mgo legs par zlum pa/gzhan gyi bya ba byed pa la spro bas phyag mthil 'jam zhing zlum la mtho dma' med par mnyam pa/sems can gyi don la brtson pas ma btud par pas mor slebs pa'i phyag ring ba/dge bcu mi ngoms par spyad pas sku dri mas yongs su dag cing 'od kyi dkyil 'khor 'dom gang ba dang ldan pa/nad pa la sman sogs byin pas mgrin pa kha dog dri ma med cing dbyibs dung dang 'dra bar 'khyil ba/dang por dge ba la sbyor zhing phyis rdzogs par byas pas 'gram pa ri dwags kyi rgyal po 'dra ba/sems can la bsam pa mnyam par byas pas tshems bzhi bcu steng 'og nyis su nyi shu rer grangs mnyam zhing thags bzang la dri ma rnam par dag cing mtho dman mnyam pa nyid/sgo gsum gyis bsrungs pas mche ba rab mchog dkar ba/bden par gsungs pas ljags ring zhing mtha' med la bsam du med pa/ro bro ba mang po byin pa ljags kha shas kyi ro bro ba'i mchog dang ldan pa/'jam zhing dga' ba'i tshig smras pas rang byung gi gsung ka la ping+ga'i sgra dang tshangs pa'i dbyangs ltar snyan pa/byams pa dang ldan zhing thams cad bsrungs pas spyan bzang po ut+pal sngon po 'dra ba/bsam pa g.yo rgyu med pas rdzis ma khyu mchog 'dra bar snum zhing ma 'dzings pa/bsngag 'os la bsngags pas zhal mdzes dre ma med pa'i smin mtshams su mdzod spu dkar po nyag sum cu rtsa gnyis dang ldan pa/bla ma la gus pas gtsug tor dbur ldan pa ste lus drang por mi g.yo ba/chos 'tshol ba la las su rung bas pags pa dag cing srab la gser gyi mdog 'dra ba/'du 'dzi spangs pas ba spu phra zhing 'jam la khung bu re nas re re skyes pa/gdams ngag la mthun par 'dzin pas ba spu'i rtse mo gyen du phyogs shing g.yas su 'khyil ba/kun la brtse zhing mtshon cha spangs pas dbu skra ma med cing rin po che mthong mthing ltar sngo ba/rang gzhan thams cad ting nge 'dzin la sbyar bas n+ya gro d+ha rdzogs pa'i ljon shing gi dkyil 'khor dang 'dra bar sku che zhing gab pa/sangs rgyas kun tu bzang po dpe med pa drang srong chen po de sred med kyi bu'i stobs mnga' zhing mkhregs pa'i sku dang ldan pa ste sum cu so gnyis so/_}
sangs rgyas kyi yon tan bcu bdun|{mi mnyam pa dang mnyam pa'i phung po/ye shes stobs/mi 'jigs pa/ma 'dres pa'i chos/thugs rje chen po/ma 'dres pa'i dran pa nyer bzhag /bsrung ba med pa/yang dag par (955) rig pa mngon shes ting 'dzin rdzu 'phrul gyi rkang pa cho 'phrul mtshan dpe byad gsung dbyangs rnams so/_}
sangs rgyas kyi yon tan re bzhi|{de'i stobs bcu/mi 'jigs pa bzhi/mi 'dres pa bco brgyad/mtshan so gnyis bcas so/_}
sangs rgyas kyi lung|{spyir dam pa'i chos kyi lung ni ngo bo'i sgo nas dbye na rnam pa bcus legs par gsungs pa'i bka' dang bka'i gdongs pa 'grel ba'i bstan bcas gnyis yod pa las snga ma'i dbang du byas na rang gi bdag rkyen sangs rgyas la brten nas byung ba'i gsung rab gang zhig rnam pa bcus lags par gsungs pa'i bka'o/_/rnam pa bcu ni rnam bshad rigs par ji ltar na legs par gsungs pa yin no zhe na rnam pa bcu dag gis te 1 yang dag par blang pa nyid kyis dang 2 dbang du mdzad pa nyid kyis dang 3 'jug pa nyid kyis dang 4 rab tu bstan pa nyid kyis dang 5 rab tu dbye ba nyid kyis dang 6 rten nyid kyis dang 7 go bar mdzad pa nyid kyis dang 8 gdags pa nyid kyis dang 9 dus nyid kyis dang 10 yon tan yongs su 'dzin pa nyid kyis so/_/zhes so/_}
sangs rgyas kyi sa bzhi|{byang chub sems dpa'i sa bcu/nyan thos kyi sa brgyad/rig pa 'dzin pa'i sa bzhi ste/de yang rnam par smin pa'i sa dang/tsha la dbang ba'i sa/phyag rgya chen po'i sa dang/lhun gyis grub pa'i sa'o/_}
sangs rgyas kyi sa'i dag pa bzhi|{sku/longs spyod/gnas/mdzad pa yongs su dag pa'o/_}
sangs rgyas kyi sa'i mi mnyam pa'i phung po lnga|{1 tshul khrims kyi phung po/2 ting nge 'dzin gyi phung po/3 shes rab gyi phung po/4 rnam par grol ba'i phung po/5 ye shes kyi phung po'o/_}
sangs rgyas bskyangs|{rgya gar lho phyogs t+pam la'i yul gyi bye brag ngang pas rtse ba zhes par sku 'khrungs/bstan pa la rab tu byung ste bsnyen par rdzogs/mdo sngags kyi chos la gsan sbyangs gnang bas rang gzhan gyi grub mtha' rgya mtsho'i pha rol du son/'phags pa klu sgrub kyi zhabs la bsten cing/sgrub pa lhur mdzad pas rje btsun 'jam dpal dbyangs dngos su zhal gzigs/grub pa'i go 'phang mthon por gshegs te dbu ma rtsa ba shes rab 'grel pa bud+d+ha pA li ta mdzad nas rtsa shes la gsungs pa'i rigs pa rnams dbu ma thal 'gyur ba'i lugs su bkral/gzhan yang mdo rgyud kyi bstan bcos mang po mdzad do/_}
sangs rgyas mkha' 'gro|{'di yang sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags nas bshad pa'i sangs rgyas mkha' 'gro lha nyi shu rtsa lnga yod pa zhig ste/gtso bo yab yum/yum bzhi/lha mo bcu drug /sgo ma bzhi bcas yin cing/de dag gi sku mdog dang phyag mtshan bzhugs stabs bcas zhib par bshad pa'i yig cha da phan bdag gis ma mthong lags}
sangs rgyas 'khor ba 'jig|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/rang cag gnas pa'i 'jig rten gyi khams 'di chags pa nas med par ma gyur bar gyi bskal pa 'di la sangs rgyas stong phrag gcig dang lnga 'byung ba'i nang nas da phan byon zin pa'i sangs rgyas bzhi'i nang gi dang po yin pa dang/de'i skabs bskal pa mar 'grib kyis rdzogs ldan gyi dus dang/mi rnams kyi cha snyoms tshe tshad mi lon bzhi khri yin zhes bshad srol yod/rgyas pa gong gi 'khor ba 'jig ces par gsal}
sangs rgyas dga' ldan nas 'pho ba'i gzigs pa lnga|{yul la gzigs pa 'dzam bu gling gi dbus ser skya'i grong khyer/rigs la gzigs pa rgyal po'i rigs/rgyud la gzigs pa bum ram gyi shing pa shAkya'i gdung rgyud/yum (956) la gzigs pa sngon smon lam btab pa'i yum lha mdzes ma dus la gzigs pa snyigs ma lnga bdo yi dus so/_}
sangs rgyas dgung lo bcu gnyis pa'i sku tshad|{sngar sangs rgyas zhal bzhugs skabs sprul pa'i bzo bo mi shA karmas rin po che sna tshogs bsres pa las bzhengs pa'i sangs rgyas dgung lo bcu gnyis pa'i sku tshad can gyi 'dra sku ste/'di ni rgya gar du rgyal rabs mang po'i ring rdo rje gdan du bzhugs pa la/rgyal po d+harma pha la ('di rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi rdo ring nang 'khod pa'i rgyal po d+harma pA la dang mi 'dra )srid dbang bzung skabs rgya nag gi rgyal po spri sti ma dza ya dang phan tshun ma mthong ba'i grogs po byas te skyes bskur res byed kyi yod pa la/thengs shig rgya nag gi rgyal pos sangs rgyas kyi brnyan 'di dang/mdo sde lnga/dge slong bzhi da gcig bcas gnang rogs zhus pa ltar bskur ste/rgya gar nas rgya nag brgyud chu thog tu gdan drangs/rgya bza' wun khren kong jo rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i btsun mor gdan drangs skabs/yab rgyal po thang the'i tsung gis bu mo'i rten skal du gnang nas bod du phebs/ra mo che gtsug lag khang bzhengs pa'i nang rten gyi gtso bor bzhugs pa las/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po sku 'das rjes mang srong gi dus skabs su rgya bzang wun khren kong jo'i zhal bkod ltar gtsug lag khang du bzhugs pa'i jo bo dang phan tshun bzhugs sa brjes te deng sang lha sa 'phrul snang gtsug lag khang du nyams chag med par bzhugs yod}
sangs rgyas sgom pa|{'di nyid rus pa 'be'i nang tshan zi tsha yin zhing/yang 'be spyan ras gzigs ngad yum byi bza' rgyas chung gnyis kyi sras su rab byung gum pa'i lcags 'brug (1160)lor yul gzhung gi sne'u gdong par sku 'khrungs/byis pa'i dus nas lkog gyur mang po shes pa'i gsal snang yod pa zhig byung/dgung lo bcu bzhi la phebs skabs mkhan po sbal ti dang/dge bshes 'gar gyis slob dpon byas nas rab tu byung/mtshan rdo rje gzhon nur gsol/dgung lo bco brgyad la phebs skabs rin po che glang lung pa'i sar byon/glang lung pa lo bcu bzhi'i bar du bsten/gdams pa rnams tshang bar thob/glang lug pa gshegs rjes dad mo lha khang du zo gsod lo drug mdzad/dgung lo sum cu rtsa brgyad pa la brang ra mo cher mkhan po sbal ti dang/slob dpon myang dang/gsang ste ba dge bshes sbas kyis mdzad nasab snyen par rdzogs/bzhi bcu rtsa gnyis pa la tshogs bshad mdzad/zhe gnyis pa la gdan sar byon/glang lung pa chu glang la gshegs nas sangs rgyas sgom pas zhe gnyis pa la gdan sar byon pa'i bar der ser lo drug tsam ring gdan sa bskyangs zer te/lo bya yul ba rnams bla ma brgyud pa la ni se mi bgrang bar 'dug /sangs rgyas sgom pas gan sa yun ring bskyangs nas mthar dgung lo bdun cu pa rab byung bzhi pa'i sa glang (1229)lor sku gshegs}
sangs rgyas sgom pa seng ge skyabs|{'di nyid rab byung gsum pa'i sa mo phag (1179)lor lcags kyi skyo lung dro'i phu kha'u bya bar gsang sngags rnying ma'i slob dpon zhig gi sras su sku 'khrungs/dpal ldan go mo che las bsnyen par rdzogs/mkhan po gong ma gnyis las gdams ngag ma lus pa gsan/dgung lo drug cu re gsum bzhes pa lcags glang lor snar thar gyi gdan sa bzung/blo sbyong tshogs bshad pa zhes bya ba rmad du byung ba'i legs bdag cig kyang rtsom par mdzad/gdan sa lo bcu'i bar bskyangs/de nas mchims nam mkha' grags rang nyid kyi rgyal tshab tu bsko gzhag mdzad nas kun spang mdzad de rta shi lung zhes pa byang chub chen po'i dben gnas su phebs skabs dge 'dun pa rnams kyis skyes ma zhus pas/sa mtshams su bla ma ma Ni bskul cig gsungs pa la deng dus (957) kyang ma Ni bskul cig tu grags pa'i rdo phung zhig kyang yod blam 'dis skal ldan gyi 'dul bya bgrang las 'das pa zhig smin grol gyi lam la 'god par mdzad nas mthar dgung lo don gnyis pa rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags khyi (1250)lor sku gshegs zhing zhal chems ltar gdung rten ni brag skyibs mngon gsal che ba zhig tu byang chub chen po'i mchod rten nang du bzhugs su gsol ba'i gnas de la byang chub chen po'i dben gnas (byang chen sgar ri )zhes grags pa yin no/_/bla ma 'di'i gdung rten gcig ni chos sde'i gdung rten gyi gral bzhi pa na bzhugs so/_}
sangs rgyas 'jig rten du byon pa|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad pa'i 'byor bcu'i nang tshan zhig ste/sangs rgyas 'jig rten du byon pa'i dus su rang nyin mir skyes pa'am sangs rgyas de'i tshab gnang ba'i bla ma dge ba'i bshes gnyen dang mjal ba}
sangs rgyas stong|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/da lta'i 'jig rten 'di chags nas ma stong bar gyi bskal pa 'di la byung ba'i sangs rgyas stong phrag gcig dang lnga yod zer/sangs rgyas stong gi mtshan cha tshang (mdo sde bskal pa bzang po )yi nang gsal zhing/sangs rgyas stong po re re la rigs dang yul sogs don tsam bcu gnyis gi sgo nas gsal bshad yod pa ste/1 yul/2 rigs/3 rus/4 yab/5 yum/6 nye gnas/7 bdud/8 shes rab can gyi mchog /9 rdzu 'phrul can gyi mchog /10 dam pa'i chos gnas tshad/11 sku gdung gi gnas tshul bcas yin}
sangs rgyas bstan pa'i me ro|{sangs rgyas bstan pa slar yang me 'bar ba ltar dar rgyas yong ba'i me ro ste/bstan ba phyi dam gyi 'go thog tsam tshugs pa}
sangs rgyas thugs rje can sangs rgyas dus kyi zla 'dzin|{'di'i zla 'dzin nam gung yol ma thag pa glang gi dus snga char zla ba'i byang shar shar nye'i phyogs nas dus mes zla dkyil drug cha gcig ma gtogs sgrib pas las bsgrigs mnan grol yun chu tshod bcu gsum lhag tsam na slar nya rgyas yongs su gang ba yin no zhes gsal}
sangs rgyas pa'i tshul gsum|{gdeng gzhi ye sangs rgyas pa/sku gdung dngos sangs rgyas pa/lhag med rdzogs sangs rgyas pa'o/_}
sangs rgyas dpa' bo bdun|{sangs rgyas rab bdun zhes pa dang don gcig }
sangs rgyas dbon ston|{mtshan dngos gzhon nu 'byung gnas zer/rab byung gnyis pa'i sa rta (1138)lo nas rab byung gsum pa'i lcags rta (1210)lo'i bar dgung lo don gsum bzhugs/'khrungs yul lha sa'i shar phyogs rgya ma nas yin cing/yab yon bdag bu mo stag dang yum sha mo mdog gnyis la sras lcam srid gsum byung ba'i che ba yin/dgung lo bcu bdun la slebs skabs dge bshes 'ben thang pa dang/slob dpon lte'u sgom gnyis kyi mkhan slob mdzad de rab tu byung zhing/dgung lo bcu dgu la dge bshes nyang brang gyi drung du bsnyen rdzogs mdzad/dge bshes ba dar seng lo bco brgyad kyi bar bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang po la mkhas par sbyangs/dge bshes chen po sku gshegs pa nas bzung lo mang po'i bar mtshams bcad dang sgom sgrub gtso bor mdzad de/zhar la slob mi mang por chos 'chad spel gnang/dgung lo sum cu so gsum bzhes pa rab byung gsum pa'i chu stag (1182)lo la rgya ma rin chen sgang gi lha khang/dbu rtsa ka chen bcu gnyis/khyams chen ka ba drug cu rtsab zhi/mgon khang ka ba gnyis bcas bsgril bas ka ba dgu bcu'i rgya khyon yod pa log cigi nang du grub par bshad pa sogs zhib par sku tshe gcig gi mdzad pa'i don tshan bco brgyad du bsdus pa zhig /las chen kun dga' rgyal mtshan (958) gyis mdzad pa'i (bka' gdams chos 'byung mkhas pa'i yid 'phrog )shog grangs 135nas grangs 144bar gsal bas der gzigs}
sangs rgyas mar me mdzad|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/rang cag gnas pa'i 'jig rten khams 'di ma chags gong gi bskal pa mang po'i sngon la byon zin pa'i sangs rgyas shig yin zhes khas len}
sangs rgyas zhi ba|{slob dpon sangs rgyas ye shes kyi sku tshe'i stod kyi slob ma/bya rgyus zhib pa ma rnyed}
sangs rgyas 'od srung|{bskal pa 'di la gnyis ldan gyi dus su sangs rgyas 'od srung byon pa dang/skabs de'i mi rnams kyi cha snyoms tshe tshad mi lo nyis khri yin zhes sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la yod}
sangs rgyas yar byon shes rab bla ma|{sangs rgyas yar byon yar zhu/rje 'di ni yul ra stengs kyi gdong snar yab chen mgon rgyal dang yum lha mo dpal gyi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i chu phag (1203)lor sku bltams/sku gzhon byis pa'i dus nas dad pa dang brtson 'grub snying rje che la/dge sbyor la thugs mnyes shing/gcig pur dben par spyod pa la spro ba zhig byung/dgung lo bcu drug la phebs skabs mkhan chen ga stan bla ma dang slob dpon lha khang ltag pa las rab tu byung/mtshan shes rab bla mar gsol/'dul ba'i phran rnams kyang gsan/de nas slob dpon nags pa las gdams pa mang du gsan zhing/sa phu dpon du sgrub pa mdzad/dgung lo bcu dgu la dbus su byon nas stag lung thang du sku yal ba dang mjal te chos khrid rnams gsan/gtsang pas mkhan po dang/khu ston gyis slob dpon/gsang ba ste slob dpon don mo ri pas mdzad nas bsnyen par rdzogs/de nas lo bcu lnga bar du sgrub pa mdzad/dgung lo sum cu so bzhi la phebs pa rab byung bzhi pa'i me sprel (1236)lor stag lung gi gdan sar phebs/gser 'bum dang/dngul gyi gdung khang/mchod khang chen mo'i thig khang/dngos sku che chung sna tshogs sogs bzhengs/dgon par gsung bar rgyun 'don dang po la bzhed 'don pa'i srol mang du btsugs/dge 'dun sum stong drug brgya lhag 'dus pa rnams chos dang zang zing gis yang dag par bskyangs/bslab pa rin po che rnam pa gsum gtso bor mdzad nas dge 'dun gyi gling rnams kyang nag khrims la sogs shin tu dam par mdzad/dgung grangs bdun cu bzhes pa rab byung lnga pa'i chu sprel (1272)lor sku gshegs}
sangs rgyas rabs bdun|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la bskal pa snga ma'i skabs byon pa'i sangs rgyas rnam gzigs dang/gtsug tor can/thams cad skyob gsum dang/bskal pa 'di la byon zin pa'i sangs rgyas 'khor ba 'jig dang/gser thub/'od srung/shAkya thub pa bcas bzhi la 'das pa'i sangs rgyas rabs bdun zer srol yod}
sangs rgyas ras chen|{'gro mgon phag mo grub pa'i slob ma sangs rgyas gnyan ras}
sangs rgyas rin chen|{rje 'di ni mkhas grub chos dpal ba'i sras su rab byung drug pa'i sa yos (1339)lor sne'u mkhar du sku bltams/byis pa'i dus nas thugs rig skyen zhing blo gros dang ldan/sku na phra ba'i dus yab mes kyi chos brtag gnyis rngog lugs kyi bshad pa dang/rnying ma'i phur bu dang rta mgrin/bla ma gsang 'dus la sogs pa bka' gter gyi chos mang du gsan/de nas rtsed thang du byon te chen po chos seng ba dang slob dpon 'od zer dpal ba la phar phyin gsan zhing grwa skor yang mdzad/de nas rnam 'grel bslabs te TIka yang thugs la rdzogs par lon/lo tsA ba nam mkha' bzang po/chos rje phyogs pa/ (959) rtogs ldan sngo nyal ba ye shes rgyal mtshan slob dpon 'jam sgeg yar 'brog kha ba lung pa zhang stong bsod nams grags pa sogs mkhas grub kyi bla ma mang du bsten nas de dag las rgyud 'grel chen mo'i bshad pa dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i dbang man ngag sbyor drug bsnyen sgrub nA ro pa'i dbang mdor bstan gyi 'grel pa sogs mang du gsan zhing thugs la legs par chud kun mkhyen chen po lha sar phebs dus bsnyen par rdzogs chos phran 'ga' yang gsan de rnams las rjes phyogs las rnam rgyal ba'i lugs nyid gtso bor mdzad de rnams las rje phyogs las rnam rgyal ba'i lugs nyin gtso bor mdzad de nas sgrub pa la zhugs te yan lag drug gi rnal 'byor lhur bzhes pa'i tshe lo dgu tsam sku lus me mdag gis bsregs pa 'dra ba'i bsnyen drug po bzhes kyang thugs dam chag pa med bsnyun las grol rjes thugs dam yang shin tu 'phel bar gyur cing rgyud 'grel gyi bshad pa yang gnang rgyud du dad ldan gyi skye ser pho mo la sogs pa gdul bya mang po la yan lag drug gi khrid btab ste gzhan don dpe med du mdzad 'go lo tsA ba gzhon du dpal sogs mkhyen rgya cha ba'i mkhas grub kyi slob ma mang du byon dgung grangs brgyad cu rgya drug bar 'tsho bzhes kyang rab byung bdun pa'i shing 'brug (1424)lor dgongs pa zhi ba'i dbyangs su gshegs so/_}
sangs rgyas rin chen rgyal mtshan dpal bzang po|{rnying ma'i bla chen 'di nyid gtsang rta nag nags gsar du rab byung drug pa'i lcags stag (1350)lor sku bltams/dgung lo drug pa la rin po che shAka 'byung ba'i spyan sngar byon nas gsang ba nyang po'i rgyud la legs par gsan te thugs su chud/yab kyis cho ga 'phrin las rnams zhib par bslabs pas/dgung lo bcu bzhi bzhes pa na gzhal dbang bar ba'i slob dpon pher ba byung/de nas yab las sgyu 'phrul gyi chos skor gsan te thugs su legs par chud rjes rab byung mdzad de mtshan nyid sogs la sbyong ba'i thugs 'khrungs kyang yab kyi bka' dor ma nus par dgung lo nyi shu rtsa bzhi pa la jo mo bzhes te sras sros mang du byung/dgung lo nga drug bzhes pa na chos 'khor sgang du tshig rdzogs mdzad de sku shin tu btsun par bzhugs/rje 'di nyid sgyu 'phrul la shin tu mkhas par gyur pas dgung lo bzhi bcu skor la gsang ba snying po'i rgyud la TIka che ba gcig /lam rnam par bkod pa la yang rnam bshad chen po zhig mdzad/'phrin lan shar ba brgyad las khro bo la mngon par rtogs pa rgyas pa dang/gnas lung la yang cho ga shin tu rgyas pa zhig mdzad/'phrin las shar ba brgyad las khro bo la mngon par rtogs pa rgyas pa dang/gzhan lung la yang cho ga shin tu rgyas pa zhig mdzad/dgung lo bdun cu pa sa phag (1419)lor sgyu phul zhi khri'i dbang dang/sgyu 'phrul gyi tshe dbang/na rag dong sprugs kyi dbang/tshe bdag gi dbang/yang dag me gcig gi dbang/rta mgrin rna bo ba'i lugs kyi rjes gnang/zla rgyal ma'i lugs kyi rjes gnang sogs dang/sems sde brgya brgyad kyi rig pa'i rtsal dbang/gsang ba snying po'i rgyud 'grel ba dang bcas pa'i rnam bshad/lam rnam par bkod pa'i TIka nyid kyis mdzad pa'i thog nas rgyas par bshad pa/gzhan sgyu 'phrul gyi khog gsung gsal sgron la sogs pa'i gzhung chung bzhi bcu tsam dang/mdo dgongs pa 'dus pa dang/de'i rtsa ba'i rgyud kun 'dus dang/gnubs cu pa dang/bla ma gnyis dang/yang dag rtsa ba'i lung rnams kyang gnang/snying thig gi spros bcas la sogs pa'i dbang bzhi dang/me long rdo rjes mdzad pa'i khrid yig gi steng nas khrid/rdzogs pa chen po a ro'i man ngag kyang khrid du mdzad/gsang sngags rnying ma'i phyogs la lhag par mos pa thob/dgung lo don gnyis pa lcags glang (1421)lor dbus su phebs/chu stag (1422)lor bsam gtan gling du dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan gyis zhabs la gtugs pas/'dus pa mdo'i dbang la sogs (960) pa'i dbang mang po dang gsang rnying la sogs pa'i bshad pa dang lung mang du mdzad de shing 'brug (1224)lor gtsang du byon dgung lo gya gnyis la phebs pa rab byung bdun pa'i lcags phag (1431)lor gtsang du sku gshegs}
sangs rgyas shAkya thub pa'i bka' bsdu ba thengs gsum|{sangs rgyas 'das pa'i phyi rol/kun dga' po dgra bcom pa thob ste grong khyer rgyal po'i khab kyi deb can ma'i phug tu rgyal po ma skyes dgras sbyin bdag byas thog skabs der yod pa'i sangs rgyas kyi slob ma dgra bcom pa yod tshad bsdus nas/kun dga' bos mdo sde'i sde snod bsdus pa dang/'phags pa nye bar 'khor gyis 'dul ba'i sde sdod bsdus pa dang/nyan thos 'od srung chen pos mngon po'i sde snod bsdus pa bka' bsdu dang po/sangs rgyas 'das nas lo brgya dang bcu song ba'i rjes su yul langs pa can du gnas pa'i dge slong rnams kyis/hu lu lu yi rung ba dang/rung ba ma yin pa'i gzhi bcu zer ba'i srol gtod/yul de'i rgyal po mya ngan med kyis sbyin bdag byas te dgra bcom pa grags pa sogs bdun brgya spyan drangs nas chos min sum 'dzin par mdzad thog gso sbyong gnang nas bka' bsdu ba gnyis pa mdzad/kha che'i rgyal po niSh+ka pas srid bzung skabs su dus yun ring po'i rtsom zhi ched dza lan+d+ha ra'i dgon par dge slong dga' bcom pa thob pa dang 'bras bu thob pa yan chad lnga brgya 'dzin pa gdan drangs nas lta ba bco brgyad mthun par khas blangs nas rtsod pa zhi zhing sde snod gsum du bkod pa bka' bsdu gsum pa mdzad do/_}
