sangs rgyas lha|{bye brag tu smra ba'i slob dpon btsun pa chen po sangs rgyas lha zhes pa de yin/slob dpon 'di dang/dbyig bshes/chos skyabs bcas re rer slob ma 'bum phrag bgrangs pa yod par grags so/_/chos skyabs ni (ched du brjod pa'i tshoms )bsdu ba po/dbyig bshes kyang (bstan bcom rab tu byed pa )brtsams mkhan gyi dbyig bshes de yin/bye brag tu smra ba'i slob dpon chen po bzhi'i nang gses yin}
sad mi bdun|{chos rgyal khri srong lde btsan skabs mkhan chen b+ho d+hi sa twas bod mis rab byung gi bslab sdom srung nus mi nus tshod blta'i phyir du thams cad yod smra'i lugs bzhin thog mar rab tu byung ba mi bdun te/sba gsal snang/mchings shAkya bra b+ha/po gor bai ro tsa na/ngan lam rgyal ba mchog dbyangs/rma rin chen mchog 'khon klu'i dbang po/gtsang legs grub rnams so/_/sba ye shes dbang po rab tu byung ba'i mtshan 'khon klu'i dbang po yin par yang bshad/lo rgyus gcig la 'khon klu'i dbang po sad mi mi bdun la mi the 'dug kyang brtags pa'i chos so/_/o rgyan gling pa'i (pad+ma bka' thang )las/sad mi mi bdun ni/1 sba gsal snang/(sba ye shes dbang po'ang zer/) 2 sbas dpa' dbyangs/3 ngan lam rgyal ba mchog dbyangs/4 lha lung dpal rdor/5 rma rin chen mchog /6 la sum rgyal ba byang chub/ (961) 7 mkhas pa bai ro tsa na bdun no/_/'di la 'dren lugs gzhan yang yod de sngon gyi bka' chems rnying ma las 1 sbas rarna rak+Shi ta rin chen bsrung ba 2 dz+nyAn+t+ra rak+Shi ta ye shes dbang po bsrung ba 3 rernan+t+ra rak+Shi ta rin chen dbang po bsrung ba 4 rlangs su ga ta warba rak+Shi ta bde bar gshegs pa'i cho ga bsrung ba 5 be ro tsa na rak+Shi ta rnam par snang mdzad bsrung ba 6 'khon na gin+t+ra rak+Shi ta klu'i dbang po bsrung ba 7 tsang pa de wan+t+ra rak+Shi ta lha'i dbang po bsrung ba dang bdun no/_}
