si tu paN chen chos kyi 'byung gnas|{mtshan gzhan (962) karma si tu bstan pa'i nyin byed dam pa'i chos kyi 'byung gnas mchog na sde dge a lo'i yul gyi bye brag ding rir sgang du yab ngag dbang tshe ring dang yum phra mgu ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags 'brug (1700)lor sku 'khrungs mtshan mgon po srung du btags dgung lo gsum par si tu sku thog bzhi pa'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin mdzad karma zhwa dmar brgyad pa dkon mchog rnam rgyal gyis chos kyi 'byung gnas 'phrin sa kun khyab ye shes zhes pa'i mtshan gsol dgung lo lnga par yab kyi drung nas sbyor klog bslabs dgung lo bdun pa nas mkhan chen dpal grub gyi mdun nas skar rtsis dang sgra snyan ngag bcas gsan a lo bla ma kun mkhyen gyi mdun nas nang don rig pa gsan a lo bla ma kun mkhyen gyi mdun nas nad don rig pa gsan dgung lo bcu gsum pa chu 'brug (1712)ror dbus su phebs zhwa dmar brgyad pa dkon mchog rnam rgyal kyi mdun nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes mtshan karma pa bstan pa'i nyin byed gtsug lag chos kyi snang ba zhes gsol de nas karma pa zhwa dmar nag gnyis kyi mdun nas bka' brgyud pa'i chos skor dang tre hor rid po che'i mdun nas rnying ma'i chos skor gsan dgung lo nyer gnyis lcags glang (1721)lor slar dbus su phebs te karma pa zhwa dmar nag dang lhan du bal yul du phebs der rgya gar dang bal yul gyi paN+Di ta pra d+husna dang ba Sh+Du ba ti kA la nA ya na dza ma ya mang+ga sogs dang bgro gleng yun ring mdzad sgra dang snyan ngag mngon brjod sogs kyi dogs gnad mang po bkrol rgya gar gyi gzhung bod na med pa mang po mjal de nas bod du tshur phebs te zhwa dmar brgyad pa'i mdun du dge slong gi sdom pa mnos tA la'i blam sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i drung nas lam rim gyi khrid sogs dge lugs pa'i chos skor gsan me lug (1727)lor sde dge dpar spungs dgon thub bstan chos 'khor gling phyag btab spyir rje 'di snga rjes su bal yul du thengs gnyis dang dbus su thengs lnga gtsang du thengs gnyis phebs mdo khams shar rgyal mo tsha ba rong dang yun nan 'jam yul bcas su'ang zhabs kyis bcags rgya dkar nag dang bod kyi grub mtha' ris med kyi mkhas pa mang po slob dpon du bsten thun mong gi rig gnas kun la mkhas pa'i yang rtser son slob ma mkhas pa khams sprul bstan 'dzin chos kyi nyi ma dang ri bo che pa tshe dbang kun khyab dbon nges legs bstan 'dzin sogs byung dgung lo don lnga pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing rta (1774)lor shar rgyal mo tsha ba rong du phebs pa'i lam bar dkar mdzes su bad mkhris kyi snyun gzhi bzhes nas sku gshegs gsung chos sde dge'i bka' 'gyur dkar chag dang gtan tshigs rig pa sgra rig pa gsob rig pa skar rtsis rig pa sogs dang khyad par du bod rgyal srong btsan sgam po sogs kyi sku dus su ji bzhin ma 'gyur ba'i rgya rtsis gsar 'gyur dang 'brum bcos sogs gsar 'gyur sman gyi skor sna tshogs sgra pA Ni pa dang dbyangs can sgra mdo mngon brjod 'chi med mdzod bcas gsar du bsgyur ba'am 'gyur bcos mdzad pa sogs mdzad rjes shin tu che}
