sing+ga gling|{'di rgya gar lho phyogs rgya mtsho'i dkyil gyi gling phran sing+ga la zhes pa de min par deng sang gzhis rtse sa khul 'brong pa rdzong khongs gangs dkar ti se'i shar lho'i ngos yol mo gangs zhes pa der yang de ltar 'bod srol yod/'on kyang mi la ras pa'i rnam thar nang du bal yul gyi yol mo gangs ra zhes dang mon yul shing ri bde ba'i khar zhes gsal ba ltar na/stod mnga' ris kyi mtha' pu hrengs nas mon la 'og yul gsum gyi bar gyi spyi ming du mos zhes brjod pas chog pa ma zad/mnga' ris kyi mtha' mtshams sa khul rnams bal yul dang thag nye ba'i cha nas de ltar bshad pa yin nam snyam yang/da dung dpyad par zhu}
