sum pa|{sku zhabs h+phan wen lan {(WP:1,194)}gyis brtsams pa'i (krung go'i lo rgyus deb ther {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i nang gsal bar bsum pa yang 'jam rigs kyi tsho pa khag gcig yin la thog mar rma chu 'bab yul du gnas shing/phyis bod ljongs su gnas spos byas rjes skyid shod lha sa rgyud da ba byas te gzhis chags pa dang/sa rgya chen po bzung yod/sus rgyal rabs kyi gong ma sum wen d+his kyi khre hong khri lo drug pa spyi lo 587lo la pho nya ba mangs te skyes 'bul byas/sus rgyal rabs kyi deb ther nub phyogs kyi ljongs zhes zhes pa'i nang sum pa la rgyal mo'i khab ces bris yod pa de ni sum pa'i rgyal po bud med yin pa'i rkyen gyis yin/sum pa'i lugs la bud med rnams mchog tu 'dzin cing pho rnams dman par lta/rgyal srid rgyal mo ngad rgyal mo chung ba gnyis kyis 'dzin pa la/rgyal mo shi rjes rje rigs kyi nang nas bod med mdzangs ma gnyis 'dams te gcig gis rgyal mo dang/gcig gis rgyal mo chung ba byed/skyes pa pho rnams kyis g.yul gyi bya ba kho na las srid don la mi zhugs/rgyal mo'i khyo bo la cin cus zhes zer zhing/kho yang srid kyi bya ba la mi zhugs/'di ni ma rgyud rus rgyud kun hre'i lhag 'phro yin zhing/spyi tshogs gong du 'phel ba dang bstun nas lam lugs de yang 'thor nges red ces gsal/'od kyang sum pa'i yul 'di sa gnas gang du yod med skor la bar skabs lo rgyus smra ba'i mkhas pa tsho'i gsung tshul mi 'dra ba sna tshugs 'dug kyang/kong sprul rin po che yon tan rgya mtshos mdzad pa'i (gter ston brgya rtsa'i rnam thar )nang rmar khams kyi yul 'di yin zhes gsungs pa de (chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang du gsal ba'i rgod tshang stod smad gnyis dang/nags shog bcas deng sang gi sa ming dkar chag nang bar khams rgyud kyi sa cha'i gras su gsal por 'khod pa rnams yongs su mthun par 'dug pas mdo stod kyi sag nas rnams sum pa'i yul la ngos 'dzin byed chog pa 'dug snyam/sum pa ni rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i gong nas bod kyi mnga' 'og tu bsdus zin pa dang/srong btsan sku gzhon nu'i skabs sum pas ngo log byas pas myang mang pa rje zhang snang gis dmag drangs mi dgos par g