sum pa mkhan po ye shes dpal 'byor|{mtsho sngon rma chu'i 'gram tho li zhes pa'i sar o rod mtsho bzhi'i nang gi pA thud kyi thal ji'i rgyud pa yab rdo rje bkra shis dang/yum ju 'un ra ba bkra shis mtsho gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing sprel (1704)lor sku bltams/dgung lo gsum pa'i thog kun mkhyen bla mas sum pa bla ma'i sku skyer ngos 'dzin mdzad/thar shul chos skyong rgya mtsho slob dpon du bsten/yi ge 'bri klog legs par sbyangs/dgung lo bdun pa lcags stag (1710)lor thal shul dpon slob kyi drung du rab tu byung/mtshan blo bzang chos skyong zhes bstsal/dgung lo dgu par sprul sku ngos 'dzin gyis dgon lung chos grwar zhugs/dgung lo bcu gsum la phebs dus rnal 'byor chen po slob dpon chu bzang rin po che'i mdun nas dge tshul bsgrubs/dgung lo nyi shu pa chu yos (1723)lor dbus su grwa skor du phebs/paN chen blo bzang ye shes kyi mdun du dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan ye shes dpal 'byor zhes (966) bstsal de nas lha sar phebs te 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang du zhugs la mo ngag dbang nam mkha' dang mog kyA rab 'byams pa 'jam dbyangs rgya mtsho sogs mkhan chen mang po slob dpon du bsten rtsod pa'i khyu mchog tu grags me rta lor gling bsre dka' bcu mdzad de nas lnga phyir khri ngag dbang mchog ldan kong po bka' 'gyur ba chos rje rin chen zhwa dmar shes rab rgya mtsho sgo mang bla ma sems nyid dam pa sogs las mdo sngags kyi chos gsan bzhes rgya chen po mdzad pra ti dge bshes ngag dbang chos dpal dang de'i slob ma mdzo mo mkhar pa smon lam lhun grub las sgra rig dang sku 'bum mi thun bsod nams rgyal mtshan las sum rtags smin rams pa nyi ma rgyal mtshan las gso rig rgyud smad grags pa lhun grub las lha ris thig tshad dang yig rigs sna tshogs sog rams pa ngag dbang rgya mtsho las rtsi dkar nag sogs sbyangs brtson gnang ste thun mong gi rig gnas kun la mkhas pa'i yang rtser son sum pa paN+Di ti zhes mkhas pa'i grags pas sa steng khyab lcags phag (1731)lor rang yul mdo smad du phebs mtshan sgrogs mkhan chen dge 'dun don grub sog mkhas grub du ma las dbang lung man ngag mang du zhus me sbrul (1737)lor pe cing tu phebs te lo gsum tsam mtsho bdun dgon pa'i mkhan po mdzad sa lug (1739)lor dgon lung du phebs dgon lung ri khrod dang zhwa khog gi bde skyid sgrub sde gnyis kyi 'du khang dang dgon lung dga' ldan lha rtse bzhengs sri gnon 'bum pa chen po dang sum pa'i zin yon lha khang dmar gtsang lha khang bcas la zhig gso mdzad dgung lo zhe gsum pa me stag (1746)lor dgon lung gi khrir bzhugs snga phyir khri pa lan gsum mdzad rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags rta (1750)lor ri bo rtse lnga mjal du phebs bkra shis chos gling ser lung 'dul ba dgon dga' ldan rin chen gling pho rod pra ti dgon sogs kyi khri pa yang mdzad dgung lo re brgyad la sog yul du phebs nas lo brgyad tsam bzhugs dgung lo don dgu la phebs skabs slar yang khri par phebs nas mdo phyogs pod lnga dang rig gnas gso dpyad skar rtsis kyi sa ris 'byung rtsis sogs skor rang gis gang shes slob ma rnams la bshad khrid legs par mdzad slob ma thu'u bkwan chos kyi nyi ma sogs mkhas grub dam mang du byung brtsams chos su (rgya gar dang rgya nag sog yul bod bcas kyi lo rgyus 'khod pa'i stan pa spyi'i chos 'byung dpag bsam ljon bsam )sogs lo rgyus kyi skor dang (dge ldan rtsis gsar )zhes pa rtsis kyi skor yi ge'i bshad pa dris lan snyan ngag chab shog dang tha snyad rig gnas kyi skor de bzhin (tshad ma sde bdun gyi snying nor dang grub pa'i rnam gzhag nyung bsdus/) (gsung rab mdzod kyi sgo brgya 'byed pa'i lde mig ) (dbu ma 'jug pa'i mtha' dpyod nyung bsdus zla 'od/) (gso dpyad bdud rtsi'i chu rgyud yi cha lag las lag len nyung bsdus bdud rtsi zil dkar/) (mkhan po a ta ri ni paN+Di tar grags pa'i spyod tshul brjod pa sgra 'dzin bcud len )sogs bstan bcos drug cu re brgyad brtsams 'od pa de dag po ti brgyad du bsdus nas bzhugs dgung lo gya lnga la phebs pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa sprel (1788)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
