seng ge rnam rgyal|{stod kyi mgon gsum gyi ya rgyal rig pa mgon gyi rgyud pa/yab 'jam dbyangs rnam rgyal dang yum rgyal mo kha tun gnyis la sras gnyis byung ba'i bgres pa/'di nyid sku stobs che la sgyu rtsal gyi gnas kun la byang chub pa zhig byung bas gu ge phyi 'brog dang/gu ge bcas la snga rjes su dmag drangs nas rta nor ra lug la sogs pa mang po lon/la dwags su stag tshang ras chen pa gdan drangs nas yab dgongs rdzogs la gser zangs kyi byams pa dgung lo brgyad pa'i sku tshad la sogs pa'i rten gsum mang po gsar bzhengs dang/rgyun mchod dge slong gi sde btsugs/paN chen blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyi drung du yum gyi dgongs rdzogs la gser 'bum dang/dngul 'bum chu tshang/gzhan yang rin po che'i rigs brgya rtsa/lha sa dang/khra 'brug /bsam yas sogs gtsug lag khang dang/chos sde che chung la mchod sprin dang/bsnyen bkur rgya che ba/wam le/rgod yul/kha nag /gtsang dmar/skyu dmar nang/me ru/dar rtse sogs kyi sa khul dang/la dwags stod gsham dang/mnga' zhabs gang yod nas mchod gzhis su sa phud re re bskal pa nam gnas bar phul zhing/stag tshang ras chen la rang zhabs kyi khong nas sa phud mchod gzhis rgya chen phul ba dang/stag tsang ras chen gyis he mi byang chub bsam gling dgon dang/lce bde theg mchog dgon/lce bde theg mchog dgon/wam le bde chen dgon bcas dgon chen gsum gyis gtsos pa'i gtsug lag khang mang po bzhengs pa'i sbyin bdag gis mthil len mdzad/seng ge rnam rgyal gyis rus shod bdag mo skal bzang sgrol ma kham tu bzhes par sras bde ldan rnam rgyal dang/in+d+ra b+ho ti/bde mchog rnam rgyal rnams rim par 'khrungs shing/sras 'di dag las brgyud pa'i gdung rgyud kyis la dwags khul la dbang bsgyur gnang bar mnga' thang dar gud ci rigs byung skor sogs la dwags rgyal rabs rim byon skor gong du la dwags kyi sa'i bdag po zhes par gsal}
