seng go mi chen|{bod rgyal gnam ri srong btsan gyi blon po/'di nyid kyis dmag dpon byas te dwags po ngo log pa slar yang btsan po'i mnga' 'bangs su bkug /de'i dus (976) su mi rnams kyi kha la seng go mi chen gyis dwags yul bsen mkhar du mdung g.yug thengs gcig la 'brog dud thang gang thob ces pa'i gtam byung seng go mi chen dpal ba'i phul du gyur nas nyi ma gcig la dwags po mi brgya bsad ces grags rgyal pos mi chen gyi bya dga' gser khung re'u rgal gyi mi dang 'brog phyugs bcas gnang}
