seng chen blo bzang bstan 'dzin dpal 'byor|{rje 'di ni nyang stod 'brong rtse gser phu spel zhes par yal tshe ring rdo rje dang yum rdo rje sgrol ma gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing 'brug (1784)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo drug la phebs skabs bkra shis lhun po dgon du zhabs sor 'khod/blo bzang tshe brtan gyi drung nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan blo bzang bstan 'dzin dpal 'byor du gsol/ka kha klog sdeb dang chos spyod ljags 'dzin gyi dbu tshugs/dgung lo bdun par 'dul 'dzin chos 'phel don grub kyi drang nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes te zhung chen bka' pod lnga la gsan bsam mdzad/dgung lo bcu dgu'i thog dkar chen gyi mtshan btags bzhes/dgung lo nyer gnyis la bkras lhun sngags pa grwa tshang du zhugs/dgung lo nyer gsum me stag lor paN chen bstan 'i nyi ma'i drung nas bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa bzhes/rje 'dis yongs rdzogs 'brong rtse blo bzang tshul khrims dang/yongs 'dzin blo bzang bstan 'dzin/paN chen bstan pa'i nyi ma sogs mkhas grub du ma'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags kyi chos mtha' yas pa gsan/dgung lo sum cu la phabs pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu bya (1813)lor rgyud pa grwa tshang gi khri thog nyer gcig pa'i mtshan bzhes nas lo bcu'i ring khri skyong gnang mdzad/dgung lo zhi gcig nas nga gsum par skal ldan gyi skye bo du mar mdo sngags zab chos rgya cher bskor/(dpal rdo rje 'jigs byed la bstod pa'i tshig don rnam par bshad pa 'jam dpal zhi khro dgyes byed legs bshad gsal ba'i mchod sprin/) (zab pa dang rga che ba'i dam pa'i chos kyi dbang lung man ngag sogs kyi thob yig bdud rtsi'i chu rgyun/) (dus 'khor la brten pa'i bla ma'i rnal 'byor gyi don 'grel dngos grub 'byung gnas/) (grub chen tshem bu pa'i lugs kyi thugs rje chen po'i sgom bzlas dang 'brel tshogs mchod bya tshal dang 'pho ba'i dmigs rim )sogs mdor sngags kyi bstan bcos mang du brtsams/rta nag tu sman thang gsar bzhengs mdzad/dgon pa'i nang du tha ma kha dang/chang rang sogs bkag sdom nan po gnang/dgung lo drug cu la phebs pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i chu yos (1843)lor dgongs pa rdzogs}
