sems kyi ngo bo rtogs pa|{bka' brgyud pa rnams kyis kha dog dang dbyibs sogs gang du'ang ma grub pa'i ngo bo gsal zhing stong pa de rtogs sems kyi chos nyid dam/sems kyi ngo bo mthong ba yin zhes zer}
