sems bskyed nyer gnyis|{(mngon rtogs rgyan )las/de yang sa gser zla ba me/_/gter dang rin chen 'byung gnas mtsho/_/rdo rje ri sman bshes gnyen dang/_/yid bzhin nor bu nyi ma glu/_/rgyal po mdzod dang lam po che/_/bzhon pa bkol ma'i chu dang ni/_/sgra snyan chu bo sprin rnams kyis/_/rnam pa nyi shu rtsa gnyis so/_/zhes gsungs pa ltar byang sems tshogs lam chung ngu ba'i rgyud kyi 'dun pa dang mtshungs ldan gyi sa lta bu'i sems bskyed/byang sems tshogs lam 'bring po ba'i rgyud kyi bsam pa dang mtshungs ldan gyi gser lta bu'i sems bskyed/byang sems tshogs lam chen po ba'i rgyud kyi lhag pa'i bsam pa dang mtshungs ldan gyi zla ba tshes pa lta bu'i sems bskyed/byang sems sbyor lam pa'i rgyud kyi sbyor ba dang mtshungs ldan gyi me lta bu'i sems bskyed/('di bzhi la mos pa spyod pa'i sems bskyed zer/) sa dang po ba'i rgyud kyi sbyin pa dang mtshungs ldan gyi gter lta bu'i sems bskyed/sa gnyis pa ba'i (978) rgyud kyi tshul khrims dang mtshungs ldan gyi rin po che'i 'byung gnas lta bu'i sems bskyed sa gsum pa ba'i rgyud kyi bzo ba dang mtshungs ldan gyi rgya mtsho lta bu'i sems bskyed sa lnga pa pa'i rgyud gyi bsam gtan dang mtshungs ldan gyi ri'i rgyal po lta bu'i sems bskyed sa drug pa'i rgyud kyi shes rab dang mtshungs ldan gyi sman lta bu'i sems bskyed sa bdun pa ba'i rgyud kyi phar phyin dang mtshungs ldan gyi dge ba'i bshes gnyen lta bu'i sems bskyed ('di bdun la lhag bsam dag pa'i sems bskyed zer/) sa brgyad pa ba'i rgyud gyi smon lam gyi phar phyin dang mtshungs ldan gyi yid bzhin gyi nor bu lta bu'i sems bskyed sa dgu pa ba'i rgyud kyi stobs kyi phal phyin dang mtshungs ldan gyi nyi ma lta bu'i sems bskyed sa dgu pa ba'i rgyud kyi smon lam gyi phar phyin dang mtshungs ldan gyi yid bzhin gyi nor bu lta bu'i sems bskyed sa dgu pa ba'i rgyud kyi stobs kyi phar phyin dang mtshungs ldan gyi nyi ma lta bu'i sems bskyed sa bcu pa ba'i brgyud kyi ye shes kyi phar phyin dang mtshungs ldan gyi dri za'i glu dbyangs lta bu'i sems bskyed yang dag pa gsum la gnas pa'i sems dpa'i rgyud kyi mngon shes lnga dang mtshungs ldan gyi rgyal po lta bu'i sems bskyed yang dag pa gsum lag nas pa'i sems dpa'i rgyud kyi bsod nams dang ye shes kyi tshogs gnyis dang mtshungs ldan gyi bang mdzod lta bu'i sems bskyed yang dag pa gsum la gnas pa'i sems dpa'i rgyud kyi byang phyogs sa bdun dang mtshungs ldan gyi lam po che lta bu'i sems bskyed yang dag pa gsum lag nas pa'i sems pa'i rgyud kyi snying rje dang lhag mthong dang mtshungs ldan gyi bzhon pa lta bu'i sems bskyed yang dag pa gsum la gnas pa'i sems dpa'i rgyud kyi gzungs dang spobs pa dang mtshungs ldan gyi bkol ma'i chu lta bu'i sems bskyed byang sems sa bcu pa ba'i rgyud kyi dga' ston dang mtshungs ldan gyi sgra snyan lta bu'i sems bskyed (sa brgyad pa ba'i rgyud kyi smon lam phar phyin dang mtshungs ldan gyi yid bzhin gyi nor bu lta bu'i sems bskyed nas sgra snyan lta bu'i sems bskyed sangs rgyas kyi sa'i sbyor bas bsdus pa 'di man gyi sems bskyed dug pa ni rnam par smin pa'i sems bskyed yin no/) gtso bo longs sku'i rgyud kyi bgrod pa gcig pa'i lam dang mtshungs ldan gyi chu bo'i rgyun lta bu'i sems bskyed gtso bo sprul spru'i rgyud kyi thabs mkhas dang mtshungs ldan gyi sprin lta bu'i sems bskyed dang nyer gnyis so/_/mtha' ma gnyis ni sangs rgyas kyi sa'i sems bskyed de sgrib pa spangs pa'i sems bskyed zer}
