sems tsam pa|{nang pa'i grub mtha' smra ba bzhi'i ya gyal zhig ste/chos thams cad sems kyi bdag nyid mnyam las de las gzhan pa'i phyi don med par ston pas na sems tsam pa zhes brjod/ming gi rnam grangs la snam rig pa dang rnal 'byor spyod pa ba zhes kyang zer/brgyad stong pa las/kye rgyal ba'i sras dag /khams gsum po 'di ni sems tsam mo zhes pa'i lung la brten nas chos thams cad sems tsam rnam par rig pa tsam las gzhan pa'i phyir rol gyi don cung zad grub pa med kyang gzugs sogs sengs la snang ba ni rmi lam gyi snang ba dang/skra shad 'dzag snang/bla ba gnyis snang ltar sems snang 'ba' zhig yin pa dang/gzhan yang las kyi dbang gis chu phor gang la lta la bad rtsi/mi la chu/mi dwags la rnag khrag tsha dmyal bas khro chur mthong ba sogs rigs drug gi snang ba 'phral gyi 'khrul rgyus ma bslad pa la'ang so sor tha dad pa snang ba bzhin skyes bu gcig gis yul la dgra gnyen bar ma gsum snang ba sogs yod pa'i phyir na thams cad sems kyi snang ba tsam las shes pa las gzhan pa'i phyir rol gyi don ma grub par 'dod de/theg bsdus las/yi dwags dud 'gro mi rnams dang/_/lha rnams ji ltar rigs rigs su/_/dngos gcig yid ni tha dad pas/_/don ma grub par 'dod pa yi/_/zhes so/_/des na phyi don khas mi len zhing rnam shes bden par smra ba'i theg chen gyi grub mtha' smra ba'i gang zag de sems tsam pa'i mtshan nyid yin/de la dbye na/lung gi rjes 'brangs dang rigs pa'i rjes 'brangs kyis sems tsam pa gnyis su dbye ba dang/rnam pa'i 'dod tshul gyi sgo nas dgye na sems tsam rnam bden pa dang rnam rdzun pa gnyis su dbye ba sogs yod/lugs 'di ni (983) 'phags pa thogs med kyis 'dzam bu gling chos skal du dga' ldan yin dga' chos 'dzin nas byams chos sde lnga gdan drangs thogs med rang gis se ste lnga gsar du brtsams te sems tsam pa'i shing rta'i srol phye ba yin cing de'i rjes su 'brangs pa'i grub mtha' smra ba la sems tsam pa zhes zer ro/_}
