ser sngags mkhan zur nam mkha' bstan skyong|{rje 'di ni 'phan po thang shar ba'i rigs su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa lug (1799)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo zhe brgyad skabs gtsang dngul chur lan gnyis tsam phebs nas rtsa ba'i bla ma d+harma b+ha dra dang/khong gi dbon po dbyangs can grub pa'i rdo rje gnyis kyi zhabs su gtugs nas chos mang du gsan/se ra sngags pa grwa tshang gi mkhan po yun ring gnang/dgung lo re brgyad skabs kun rig 'don chog dang/sbyor ba'i chos drug gi 'dod sgrig gsar sgrig gnang/(kun rig gi rdul tshon dang 'brel skabs de nyin chab 'dren gyi tshe klu chog bya tshul phan bde'i mchog sbyin )zhes pa dang/(byang chub lam gyi rim pa'i sngon 'gro sbyor ba'i chos drug gi ngag 'don chu babs su bkod pa/) (dpal 'khor lo bde mchog dril bu lha lnga'i las rung gi bsnyen pa ji ltar bya tshul gyi ge gnas kyi don gsal sogs bka' rtsom pod che ba gcig tsam mdzad/sku gshegs pa'i lo dus kha gsal ma rnyed}
