so kha rong kha brgyad|{1 rgya dang bod kyi so mtshams grod kyi snyan lung rong/2 bod dang zhang zhung gi so mtshams zhang pa brgya cu rong/3 bod dang bon gyi so mas lcags gzer bcug pa/4 bod dang stag gzig gi so mtshams shab shang brgya cu rong/5 bod dang hor gyi so mtshams zangs thang sha'i gling/6 bod dang khrom gyi so mtshams rgya sha rong/7 bod dang 'jang gi so mtshams ra ga rong}
