so lnga pa'i sku tshad|{sangs rgyas chos lugs dang bod gyi lo rgyus nang bshad srol la/sngar sangs rgyas zhal bzhugs skabs sprul pa'i bzo bo mi shwa karmas bzhengs pa sangs rgyas dgung lo so lngar phebs pa'i sku tshad dang mnyam pa'i 'dra sku zhig /lo rgyus yig cha 'ga' zhig nang/sku 'di lha yul sum cu rtsa bdun du lha rnams kyi rten skal du bzhugs zhes gsal}
so chung ba|{'di nyid rab byung dang po'i chu stag (1062)lor yul ra mo bar sku 'khrungs/bu spun gnyis yod pa la phu bo gzungs chung bas so chung ba dang/nubo gzugs ring bas so ring zer/dgung lo bcu tsam la phebs skabs yul der lo nyer byung nas pha ma gnyis kyis bu spun gnyis khrid de yang stod skyer snar sprangs pas rma sgom gyis byis pa rgan pa de nga'i rjes la zhog /ngas lto dang gos ster gsungs pas bzhag ste pha ma gnyis yar lung du byon/der rma sgom gyis so la btsun pa bcos/ming yang dge 'dun 'bar du btags/rma sgom gyis so chung ba khrid de dam pa'i sar byon/dam pas so chung ba la don brgyud kyi gdams pa rdzogs par gnang/dam pa gar thegs kyi phyag phyir byas pas grub thob pho mo lnga bcu rtsab zhi'i gdams pa yang gnang/de la yi ge byed par zhus pas kyang (985) bkas gnang nas star kha rdo rje grags kyi 'bum gyi shog ras la gdams pa rnams bris de nas dam pa gar bzhud kyi phyag phyi byas kha rag mdun du slebs skabs dam pas khyod rang phyir log gsungs so chung ba phyir log nas lha sar rig pa'i tshad lta ba'i phyir dril gdang la dmigs pa gtad pas dril gdang rang khrol ba yang byung so chung bas nad pa la 'dre gang gnod pa dang nad ci yin pa thams cad gsal le mkhyen pa byung nas 'dre 'dul mang du byas yon yang che bar blangs de nas so chung bas dam pa ding ri na bzhugs thos te nad pa gsos pa'i yon gyi gser srang gsum dang rta po bzang ba zhig khyer nas ding rir byon dam pas mtha' sel lnga bcu rtsa gcig gi gdams pa gnang de nas yang phyir dbus su byon no/_/mthar so chung ba dgung lo drug cu rtsa bdun pa rab byung gnyis pa'i sa sprel (1128)lor sku gshegs}
so thar gyi mkhan slob spyi'i mtshan nyid drug|{tshul khrims dang ldan pa/'dul ba'i cho ga shes pa/da par nyang brtse zhing rang gi 'khor tshul khrims ldan pas dag pa/chos dang zang zing gis phan 'dogs pa/bslab bya rnams dus dang dus su 'doms pa'o/_}
so thar gyi sngon ldan bzhi|{bsnyen gnas/dge bsnyen/dge tshul/dge slong}
so thar gyi rigs bdun|{dge bsnyen pha ma'i sdom pa gnyis/dge tshul pha ma'i sdom pa gnyis/dge slob ma'i sdom pa/dge slong pha ma'i sdom pa gnyis te bdun no/_}
