so thar sdom pa skyed yul gsum|{mkhan po/slob dpon/dge 'dun}
so thar sdom pa gnyis|{khyim pa dang rab byung gi sdom pa dang/yang na/spong bdun spong bzhi can dang/yang na ji srid 'tsho bcangs dang nyin zhag gi mtha' can gnyis so/_}
so thar sdom pa'i rtsa ltung bzhi|{mi tshangs log g.yem mi gsod/mi chos bla ma'i rdzun/ma byin len pa}
so thar rigs brgyad|{dge slong ma gnyis gnyis kyi sdom pa/dge slong ma'i sdom pa/dge tshul pha ma gnyis kyi sdom pa/dge bsnyen pha ma gnyis kyi sdom pa/bsnyen gnas kyi sdom pa ste brgyad/de la bsnyen gnas yan lag brgyad kyang zer ro/_}
so nam gyi lhu|{kha gso ba'i las skal gyi ming }
so nam las khungs|{de snga bon sa gnas srid gzhung skabs kyi las khungs shig ste/mi so'i las khungs (mi rtsa dang so nam skor do dam byed pa'i bsdus ming )yang zer zhing/rab byung bco lnga pa'i me lug (1907)lor ching gong ma'i bka' gdams bod don zhib dpyod blon chen krang dbying thang gis srid skyong dga' ldan khri zur blo bzang rgyal mtshan dang bka' shag la go bsdus dang 'brel bod ljongs bstan srid 'phel thabs su slob gso dang/sbyong brdar/bzo tshong/'brel gtugs/lam bzo nags las/so nam/bde srung/dngul khang/ja tshwa bcas las khungs khag dgu gsar 'dzugs bya rtsis byas rung skabs der tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa mchog rgya sog yul gru chibs sgyur bskyangs pas las khungs de dag dngos su tshugs thub med kyang rjes su chu glang (1913)lor gong gsal las khungs dgu'i gras nas las khungs 'di dang/ja tshwa/dngul khang bcas gsar 'dzugs byas shing/las khungs 'dir bar skor lho'i sga ru shang nang tshugs/do dam mkhan rim las tshan ser skya bzhi dang/las byed drung yig gnyis yod/'dis rgya khyab rdzong gzhis khag tu sa stong ji yod do dam gyis gsar (986) sbol byed mir chog mchan sprad thog sa bogs bcu zur rgyas bcad bsdu len dang sger chos khongs min pa'i rmar mdzo sa (rmar khams mdzo sgang sa ngan )bcas sa khul gsum sogs nas yul 'khyar gyis sa khul khag la gtan sdod byed mi rtsa ji yod so nam las khungs kyi mi rtsar bcug ste mi bogs bsdu ba grong khyer nang khungs gsar rgyag gis khang gla bsdu ba bcas byed cing khungs gsar rgyag gi las gla bsdu bcas byed cing mi bogs kyi dngul 'bab rnams lo ltar rtse rnam gan du TaM dkar bka' 'jug rgyag pa bcas kyi 'os 'gan sgrub pa yin}
so tshis|{zhing las sam so nam}
so mtshams srung|{gzhan sde dang rang sde'i so mtshams brtan por srung ba}
