srang|{bod kyi ljid tshad rtsi ba'i tshad gzhi zhig ste nas 'bru drug la se ba gang/se ba nyi shu tham pa la zho gang/zho bcu la srang gang ste spor gang/de bzhi la nyag gang/nyag nyi shu tham pa ste srang brgyad cu tham pa la khal gcig tu rtsis/de la deng sang gi rgya grangs ltar na rgya ma bdun dang srang lnga yod/rje tsong kha pa'i rnam thar (bde legs char 'bebs )las/lha sa smon lam chen mo 'dzugs pa gnas skabs lha sa grong khyer gyi mar khal gcig la rgya nag lugs kyi khrom srang brgyad cu tham pa dang/mar nyag gang la rgya nag lugs kyi khrom srang bzhi re yod pa dang/ja lha sa'i mar zho gang la rgya nag lugs kyi khrom srang gang yin par gsungs/'di ni mar dang tsha sogs kyi ljid tshad 'degs pa'i tshad gzhi yin/gser dngul dang sman gyi srang tshad 'jal ba'i tshad gzhi ni 'di dang mi 'dra/gser dngul gyi ljid 'debs tshad gzhi ni bod sil bu'i dus skabs su gtsang gi tshong 'du mgur mo'i tshad gzhi ni/nas 'bru drug la se ba gang dang/se ba brgyad la zho gang/zho brgyad la srang gang/gser srang gang la dngul srang do/_/gser srang bzhi la dngul srang brgyad de dngul bre gang/gser srang bcu drug dang dngul sum cu so gnyis la gser bre gang yin cing/yon rgyal rabs kyis bod la dbang bsgyur byed skabs rta legs pa gcig la dngul brel gang ste dngul srang brgyad yin par (si tu byang chub rgyal mtshan gyi bka' chems )las gsal/yang bod sman gyi srang tshad rtsi stangs ni/nas 'bru drug la se ba gang/se (989) ba nyi shu tham pa la zho gang zho brgyad la srang gang srang do la phyor ba gang phyor ba do la snyim pa gang snyim pa do la bre phyed snyim pa bzhi ste srang bcu drug la bre gang du rtsi bar gna' rabs kyi sman gzhung 'ga' zhig las bshad}
