sras tha chung sur+ya|{(mi dbang rtogs brjod )du/lha bzang gi bu che ba dga' ldan bstan 'dzin dang/bu tha chung sur+ya yin par bshad kyang/brag dgon pa bstan pa rab rgyas kyi (mdo smad chos 'byung deb ther rgya mtshor )lha bzang gi bu che ba dga' ldan bstan 'dzin dang/'bring ba sur+ya/chung ba rnam rgyal tshe brtan yin par bshad pa 'di rang khungs dag pa yin te/bu che ba dga' ldan bstan 'dzin la jun gar tshe dbang rab brtan gyi bu mo mna' mar len rgyu byas pa jun gar nas mgo bskor btang ste jun gar du slebs thog bkrongs/'bring po su r+yar mtsho sngon nas mna' ma blangs zin mtshams lha sar 'ongs/lha bzang bsad pa'i rjes su lha sa nas bros pa lam bar nas jun gar gyis bzung ste jun gar du 'khrid pa chu la shor nas 'das/chung ba tshe brtan rnam rgyal la gong mas gung gi cho lo gnang yang rim por ma song bar ma har du grongs par bshad pas so/_}
