slob dpon chen po pad+ma sam b+ha ba|{slob dpon 'di ni bod la bka' drin che ba'i a tsar+ya gsum gyi nang tshan dang po yin/'di yi rnam thar dang lo g.yas thog bshad srol mi 'dra ba sna tshogs 'dug cing/gsang chen rnying ma'i chos rgyud 'dzin pa rnams kyi gsung srol 'ga' zhig ltar na/slob dpon 'dir yab yum med par pad+ma'i mtsho'i nang nas brdzus skyes su 'khrungs par gsungs shing/(rin chen gter mdzod )kyi dbur bzhugs pa jo nang tA ra na thas mdzad pa'i (slob dpon pad+ma'i rnam thar yid ches gsum ldan )gyi nang/slob dpon 'di nyid nub phyogs o rgyun gyi rgyal po'i sras su 'khrungs pa'i yab dang yum gyi mtshan yang gsal bar mdzad 'dug /gzhan yang slob dpon 'di rus tshod ji tsam la 'khrungs pa dang/dgung lo ji tsam bzhugs pa/bod du lo ji tsam bzhugs pa sogs kyi skor (pad+ma bka' thang sogs rnam thar mang por bshad srol 'dra mid sna tshogs 'dug pas/'di dag dang 'di mi dag ces kho bo lta bus kha tshon ga la gcod nus/'on kyang rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis bsam yas rtsig pa'i tshe slob dpon bod du byon zin pa ma zad/bsam yas gyi rab gnas skabs dang rgyal po khri srong lde btsan dang mu ne btsan po ma gshegs par bzhugs nas rgyal po sad na legs kyi dus su bod nas srid yul du gshegs pa 'dra ba ba zhig rnam thar gter ma 'ga' zhig nang gsal ba dang/(rba bzhed zhabs btags ma )zer ba'i nang bsam yas rab gnas kyi gong du slob dpon bod nas srid yul du byon zin pa lta bu zhig gsungs 'dug pa gang yin brtag dgos shing/gsang sngags snga 'gyur gyi lo rgyus la yang slob dpon chen po 'di rgya gar gyi nub phyogs au Di yA ni ste bod skad du o rgyan mkha' 'gro'i gling gi d+ha na ko sha zer ba'i mtsho yi nang du me tog pad+ma'i nang brdzus te 'khrungs pa dang/yab dang yum mi dgos par brdzus nas rang byung du 'khrungs pa'i sangs rgyas yin zhes gsungs/jo nang tA ra nA thas mdzad pa'i (slob dpon chen po pad+ma 'byung gnas kyi rnam thar yid ches gsum ldan )gyi nang 'di ltar gsungs te/rgya gar yul dbus ma g+ha d+har rgyal po de wa pA las rgyal (1008) sring skyong ba'i tshe (spyi lo 730nas 777