gsang sngags kyi rnying ma|{bod du sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gsang sngags thog mar dar ba ni rnying ma'i chos lugs yin/dus rabs brgyad pa'i dkyil du rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis srid dbang bzung skabs slob dpon pad+ma 'byung gnas bod du gdan drangs te/rgyal po dang/blon po/'bangs bcas nyung shas la gsang sngags kyi chos mang po gsungs pas slob ma grub thob rje 'bangs nyer lnga zer ba byung/gzhan yang rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus sngags 'chang d+harma kirti dang/paN chen bi ma la mi tra sogs rgya gar gyi paN+Di ta mang po bod du byon nas gsang gas kyi chos mang po bod skad du bsgyur/de rjes bod sil bu'i dus 'khor rab byung gi sde med par gyur kyang/gsang sngags kyi chos ni slob dpon sangs rgyas ye shes kyis lo brgya dang bcu gsum rim bzhugs nas gnang sngags dgongs 'dus kyi skor dar spel mdzad/de rjes zur chen zur chung sogs kyis gsang sngags kyi bstan pa dar rgyas su mdzad/gsang sngags rnying ma'i skor la brgyud pa mi 'dra ba'i sgo nas phye na gsum yod/ring brgyud bka' ma/nye brgyud gter ma/zab mo dag snang gi brgyud pa bcas dang/1 ring brgyud bka' ma ni/paN chen bi ma lami tra (snga ma )zhes rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyi dus su bod du byon pa des rma ri chen mchog dang/gnyags dz+nya na ku ma ra gnyis la sgyu 'phrul gsang ba snying po'i skor gsungs shing de nas brgyud pa'i slob ma mang du byung nas gtsang stod mang mgar dang/la stod lho byang/'chi bu 'bab yul gyi brgyud/spo 'bar sgang gi sa cha rnams su dar spel byung/yang slob dpon d+ha na rak+Shi tas bal po d+harma bo d+hi la rtsa rgyud dang/bshad rgyud sogs gsungs/bru sha'i yul du phro ru che btsan skyes la gsungs nas bod skad du bsgyur ba las dar spel byung/yang gtags d+ha na ku ma ras lo tsA ba bai ro tsA na g.yu sgra snying po gnyis la rdzogs pa chen po sems phyogs su grags pa zhus/de nas rim par 'phel ba la sems phyogs zer/yang lo tsA ba bai ro tsA nas dbang mi pham mgon po la dpal nam mkha' dang mnyam pa'i rgyud la sogs pa rdo rje zam pa'i man ngag gi skor gsungs shing/de las brgyud pa'i ch