gsang phu ne'u thog dgon|{(lha sa grong khyer stod stod lung bde chen rdzong khongs )rab byung dang po'i chu glang (1073)lor jo bo rje a ti sha'i dngos slob rngog lo tsA la legs pa'i shes rab kyis thog mar btab/de yang dgon pa 'debs sa'i sag nas 'di jo bo rje a ti shas lung bstan pa gnang zhing/thog mar grwa pa lnga brgya tsam 'dus pa la rngog gis 'chad nyan mdzad/phya pa chos kyi seng ges mtshan nyid gyi srol gtod nas dar rgas che ba byung/se 'bras ma chags gong dbus kyi gdan sa drug gi gras yin/dus rabs bzhi pa'i nang rje tsong kha pas de ga'i mkhan po seng ge ri bong las rnam 'grel gsan pa dang/bka' bzhi'i gral skor yang mdzad/de rjes mkhan po grags pa seng ges rje tshong kha pa'i zhabs la gtugs/khong gi bu slobs sogs nang brgyad de dge lugs dar rgyas che stabs gsang phur sa skya dang dge lugs kyi gar wa tshang bcu gcig tu gyes pa ste/1 spel ser/2 nyi ma thang/3 dwags po grwa tshang/4 rnam rgyal gser khang/5 khu spe bcas gling stod grwa tshang lnga dang/6 sgros rnying pa/7 gzhi ba/8 nyang rong/9 gnas sgo ba/10 sgros gsar ba/11 rwa ba stod smad bcas gling smad grwa tshang drug ste bcu gcig yod la phyis grwa tshang rnams grwa sa gzhan dang bsgril ba'ang/sa cha gzhan du gzhis phab stabs gsang bu dbyar chos tsam ma gtogs rgyud gtan grwa grangs sum cu skor las med/dbyar chos skabs mkhan po dang khrims gnon rnams snye thang rwa ba stod pa sogs bla khag bcu res skor gyis byed pa dang dga' ldan shar rtse mkhan pos gsang phu gling smad zhabs drung gi ming 'dzin byed srol yod/zhib par gling stod blo bzang rgya mtsho'i sprul sku nyid thang ngag dbang gzhon nu bstan pa'i nyi mas mdzad pa'i (gsang phu'i gdan rabs dang skyes chen dam pa'i rnam thar brjod pa dang pad dkar chun po )zhes pa der gzigs}
