gser khang blo bzang bstan 'dzin|{rje btsun gser khang ba yang zhu ba 'di nyid mdo smad a rig chu stang du yab no'i rigs dang/yum dza ti skyid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags byi (1780)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun pa la ka kor sprul sku'i drung nas rab byung dang dge tshul gyi bslab sdom bzhes/mtshan blo bzang bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho zhes gsol/dgung lo bcu gsum thog rwa rgya sgar gyi chos grwar zhugs nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bzhes mdzad/dgung lo nyi shu tham par shing bzang paN+Di ta blo bzang dar rgyas kyi drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs/dge ba'i bshes gnyen shing bza' rdo rje 'chang dang rwa bla dngos grub rgya mtsho sogs bsnyen nas mdo sngags kya dbang lung yongs rdzogs gsan/dgung lo nyer drug thog dbus gtsang du phebs nas rgyal dbang mchog dang mjal/phyir phebs rjes rwa rgya'i nye 'gram grod po rdzong dang/gser khang rtse'i sgrub gnas sogs khag brgyad la sku mtshams su bzhugs/lhag par du gser khang la 'dag sbyar gyis lo mtshams kha shas gnang bar gser khang bar grags/rong po dgon chen la mtshan nyid kyi bshad grwa btsugs/cong chung byang rgyud kyi dgon sde mchod rten thang dang/dgon lung/gser khog sogs su phebs te dbang lung sogs chos kyi sbyin pa rgya chen mdzad/de nas rgya nag ri bo rtse lngar gnas mjal du phebs/pe cin du tsan dan gyi jo bo mjal/spyir rje nyid kyis 'jigs byed bsnyen chen thengs 'ga' shas dang/sku phyag bum sum cu tsam gtong ba gnang/mdo smad lho byang gi bshad sgrub kyi sde mang por zhabs kyis bcags te thub bstan snying po rje bla ma'i lugs bzang bshadap+sagarub zung 'brel gyi sgo nas mdzad rjes mchog tu che/gsung rtsom lam tshon na (bde mchog lU i pa'i cho ga bsdus pa 'dra tshul nag 'gros su bkod pa dngos grub bde chan 'byung gnas/) (bde gsang 'jigs gsum gyi bsnyen chen )sogs kyi sngon 'gro'i rim pa rnams bla mchod bde stong dbyer med kyi steng nas bsags tshul nag 'gros su bkod pa mchog dman kun gyi khyer bde dngos grub kun 'byung/) (bcom ldan 'das dpal 'khor lo sdom pa'i bsnyen yig yang gsal sgron me )dang bsnyen chen gyi tho yig bde chen mchog sbyin )sogs ljags rtsom mang du bzhugs/dgung lo re dgu la phebs pa ra byung bcu pa'i sa sprel (1848)lor spang lung ri khrod (1024) du sku gshegs}
