gser gyi ri bdun|{sangs rgas chos lugs kyi gzhung (mngon pa mdzod )nas bshad tshul la/ri rgyal lhun po'i mtha' bskor du 'khor ba'i gser ri bdun yod pa ste/nang nas phyi rol du rim pa bzhin/1 ri'i rtse mo gnya' shing gi dbyings ltar yod pa'i gnya' shing 'dzin ri/2 ri'i rtse mo gshol mda'i dbyibs lta bur yod pa'i gshol mda' 'dzin ri/3 ri yi rtse mor seng ldeng gi nags tshal yod pa'i seng ldeng can/4 ri yi rtse mo blta na sdug cing mdzes par yod pa'i lta na sdug ri/5 ri yi rtse mo rta yin rnab lta bur yod 'i rta rna ri/6 ri yi rtse mo gus 'dud zhus pa ltar yod pa'i rnam 'dud ri/7 ri yi rtse mo 'khor lo'i mu khyud lta bur yod pa'i mu khyud 'dzin ri bcas bdun yod cing/gnya' shing 'dzin ri'i rtse mo ri rgyal lhun po'i phyed kar slebs pa nas ri phyi ma ma rnams kyi rtse mo nang ma nang ma'i tshad tsam du slebs pa'i mtho dman gyi bar khyad yod ces bshad srol yod}
gser chos|{mthing shog gi ngos su gser zhun gyis bris pa'i chos dpe}
gser tog blo bzang tshul khrims rgya mtsho|{rje 'di ni mdo smad tsong chu'i nye 'gram ar cha zhes par yab lta mgrin dang yum tshe mdo gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing sbrul (1845)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo gsum tsam la gser khang blo bzang bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho'i drung du dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa mnos/mtshan blo bzang rgya mtsho zhes gsol/dgung lo lnga la gser rtog dgon dga' ldan 'gro phan gling du gdan drangs/rje skal bzang rgya mtsho'i drung nas phyi mo'i yige sum cu dang nyer mkho'i klog 'don gsar bzhes mdzad/dgung lo bdun la chu bzang rin po che blo bzang thub bstan rab byung drung du dge tshul gyi sdom pa mnos nas mtshan bzang tshul khrims chos grags zhes bstsal/dgung lo brgyan thog sku 'bum byams pa gling gi rang sgar dang gdan drangs/dgung lo dgu nas nyer gnyis bar nya rgya lha rams pa ngag dbang chos grags yongs 'dzin du bsten nas sgar pa rang du 'don chos spyod dang/rgyan 'jug /bsdus gzhung/rnam 'grel sogs blo 'dzin dang/dpe khrid dang/sum rtags/snyan ngag sogs rig gnas dang bcas pa gsan bzhes mdzad/dgung lo bcu dgu'i thog dpyid chos dang po'i steng tshogs langs mdzad/de skabs rgya sog gi dus zing gi rkyen pas dbu mdzod 'dul ba sogs gsan bzhes gnang ma thub/dgung la nye shur shing bza' blo bzang bstan pa'i dbang phyug tshul khrims kyi drung du bsnyen par rdzogs/rje de dang/ (1025) grub dbang 'jigs med bsam gtan rje zhwa dmar rin po che rnams la tshos bka' rgya cher gsan dgung lo nyer gcig la sku 'bum gyi rgyud grwa mkhan po'i khrir lo gcig bzhugs dgung lo nyer bzhi la sum rtags kyi mtshan 'grel ngo mtshar 'khrul gyi lde mig brtsams gung lo nyer bdun la sku 'bum gyi khrir bzhugs dgung lo so bdun la chos rje don grub rin chen gyi gdan sa bya khyung dgon pa'i khril lab zhugs dgung lo nga drug skabs zi na dgon pa'i khri la bzhugs dgung lo nga drug sbas zi na skal dbang da rgyus rgya mtsho'i drung nas rtsis skar nag dang dka' ldan rtsis gsar sogs rtsis rig gnas bzhes mdzad dgung lo nga dgu la sku 'bum gyi gdan rabs phyag rtsom mdzad rtsom pa khyad du 'phags pas (dge ldan rtsis gzhung blang dor gsal ba'i snang ba'i mdzod mngon par drangs pa'i re'u mig mnor bsdus mgyogs 'gro bdun ldan gyi shing rta/) (bod kyi brda sprod pa sum cu pa dang rtags kyi 'jum pa'i mchan 'grel mdor bsdus te brjod pa ngo mtshar 'phrul gyi lde mig ) (sgrub thabs rin chen 'byung gnas kyi rjes gnang skabs su nyer mgo ba'i mchod gtor sogs kyi lag len zur du bkol ba kun gsal me long/) (gsang chen rdo rje theg pa'i sa dang lam gyi rnam par gzhag pa cung 'jug khang du bkrod pa'i rin chen them skas )sogs bka' rtsom pod 'bring bcu tsam mdzad dgung lo don gcig la phebs pa rab byung bcu lnga pa'i shing yos (1915)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
gser TaM las khungs|{de snga bod sa gnas srid gzhung skabs kyi las khungs shig ste/'di thog mar bod rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags sprel (1920)lor gsar du btsugs shing/las khungs tshugs yul nor stod gling khar yin/'di thog mar tshugs skabs kyi do dam mi snar tsha rong zla bzang dgra 'dul dang/rtse mgron phun rab pa/zur khang dbang chen tshe brtan bcas bskos pa dang/las bya ser skya lnga tsam yod/las khungs 'di btsugs rjes gser TaM bod srung nyi shu byas pa bar rgyag 'grems spel byas shing/da dung snam bu dang/kam pA li 'thag las dang/'tshem 'khor nang 'dren gyis 'tshem bu'i las snon/glog khang stabs bde 'dzugs skrun bcas byas rjes rin min las khungs khu bsdu byas}
gser gdung dge legs 'dod 'jo|{tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i sku gdung ril po ma nyams par bzhugs pa'i gser gdung yin/de'i mtho tshad la thog so gsum dang/mchod rten gyi rgyur gser rgya thur gyi srang chig khri lhag tsam dang phra rgyan dang bzo bkod thad gser gdung khag brgyad kyi nang nas spus tshad legs shos yin/lha khang 'di'i thog brtsegs gnyis par tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i rnam thar cha tshang ldebs bris su bkod pa btsun mo tshi shis tha'i ho gnyis dang thug phrad gnang ba'i skor bris yod/mchod rten 'di'i bum pa'i nang du tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i sku dmar gdung nyams chag med par bzhugs pa dang/gzhan yang rtse nas zhabs bar du lo rgyus khungs btsan yod pa'i nang rten mang po dang/bka' bstan 'gyur sogs gsung rab mang po yod}
gser gdung 'jam gling rgyan gcig|{tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i sku gdung ril po ma nyams pa rab zhugs pa'i gser gdung yin/gser gdung 'di'i phyi gtums gser lhad med rgya thur gyi srang chig 'bum chig khri dgu stang nyid brgya brgyad cu rgya gnyis las bzhengs pa dang/mtho tshan thog so gsum yod cing/phra rgyan la dus skabs de'i bod dngul srang brgyad khri stong med brgya dang bcu med bzhi'i rin thang ldan pa dang/'di'i bum pa'i nang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i sku dmar gdung nyams chags (1026) med par bzhugs mchod rten 'di'i nang du lo rgyus khungs btsan yod pa'i nang rten khag mang po yod gser bris kyi bka' 'gyur dang bstan 'gyur rje tsong kha pa yab sras gsum gyi gsung 'bum tA la'i blam sku phreng rim gyon gya gsung 'bum bcas gzugs bzhugs su phul yod gser gdung 'dzam gling rgyan gcig gi g.yas g.yon gnyis nas rim bzhin rgya dngul las bzhengs pa'i bde gshegs mchod rten brgyad yod g.yas dang po pad spungs mchod rten g.yas gnyis pa bkra shis sgo mang mchod rten g.yas gsum pa lha babs mchod rten g.yas bzhi pa rnam rgyal mchod rten bcas dang g.yon ngos dang po byang chub mchod rten g.yon gnyis pa cho 'phrul mchod rten g.yon gsum pa dbyin bsdums mchod rten g.yon bzhi pa myang 'das mchod rten bcas yod cing g.yas ngos kyi mthar tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gnyis pa'i gser gdung rtse sbyin 'od 'bar g.yon ngos gyi mthar tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu pa'i gser gdung khams gsum rgyan mchog bcas bzhugs yod}
gser pang mig bdun|{gser phye blugs pa'i sgrom bu mig bdun pa zhig }
gser 'phru|{pho brang dang 'du khang gi yang thog tu bslangs ba'i gser zangs las bzos pa'i mdzod ldan zer ba dang/bang rim mang po yod pa dang gsham la pad ma'i 'dab ldan gyi rnam 'bur du dod pa de rigs la gser 'phru zer ba}
gser bre|{gong du nga sde'i nang dngul bre stong zhes par gzigs}
gser zho|{gser dngul sogs ljid tshad brtag byed kyi yo byad/de sngon bod la grags che ba rtsed thang rdo zho dang tshong 'dus mgur mo'i mgur zho zer ba sogs 'ga' zhig yod/gser zho bcu la srang gang gi ljid tshad yod}
gser bzang grub pa'i dbang phyug|{thog mar rngon pa yin kyang rjes su khyim spangs nas smin grol gling du chos la zhugs pa'i mtshams pa zhig }
gser bzo|{gser bzhu btul byas te brdung ba dang/dkrol tshags rgyag pa/lugs su blugs pa sogs kyi bzo rtsal la zer/da yod kyi dpyad gzhi'i yig cha'i nang/spyi lo'i dus rabs dang po'i yas mas su rgyal po pu de gung rgyal gyis srid dbang bzung skabs shing bsregs nas sol ba bzos pa dang/de'i skabs gser dngul zangs lcags rnams bzhu btul byas pa'i lag rtsal thog mar byung bar bshad cing/rgya yig gi lo rgyus (thang deb bod kyi lo rgyus )zhes pa'i nang rgya bod 'brel ba'i skor gyi lo rgyus mang po bshad yod pa'i nang/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i bon po mgar ba stong btsan la gser srang stong tsho lnga bskur nas rgya bzang kong jo btsun mor slong bar mngags pa dang/thang tha'i dzung gis shar phyogs ka'o hi'i rgyal khab la dmag drangs nas rgyal kha thob pa'i rten 'brel du srong btsan sgam pos gser las bzos pa'i bya ngang pa'i gzugs nang du chang blugs pa zhig blon po mgar stong btsan la bskur nas bkra shis bde legs zhu bar mngags pa sogs 'khod pa dang/bod yig gi lo rgyus mang po'i nang/rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i dus dgung blon chung ba dang/nang blon 'bring ba/bka' blon che ba gsum la gser gyi byang bu chen po'i yi ge dang/nang blon chung ba dang/bka' blon 'bring ba la gser gyi byang bu chung ba'i yi ge bcas bya dga' gnang bar bshad pa bcas dus skabs de nas bzung bod kyi mis gser bzo'i lag rtsa chu tshad mtho tsham bzo thub par ra sprod byed thub/gser gdung 'dzam gling rgyan gcig bzhengs skabs bod dang bal po'i lha bzo ba mkhas pa yod tan bsdus te rang rang gi lag rtsal khyad chos 'don spel byed bcug pa ma zad/gser gdung chen (1027) mo dang rgya gar lugs kyi lha sku rnams bal po'i bzo par bzhengs su bcug pa dang bod lugs kyi lha dang bla ma'i sku 'dra rnams bod kyi lha bzo bar bzhengs su bcug pa yin te de'i rgyu mtshan ni bzo pa rnams rang rang gi lus srol gom gshis la rgyus mnga' che zhing mi rigs gzhan gyi yul srol goms gshis la cha rgyu chung ba'i rkyen gyis bzo rtsal legs po mi 'ong ba dang rang rang so so'i bzo rtsal khyad chos kyang mi 'dra ba red (gser gdung 'dzam gling rgyan gcig gi dkar chag (nang gser bzo pa bal po ji yod kyi grangs dang ming gsal yang bod rigs gser bzo ba'i ming mi gsal zhing 'on kyang gser bzo ba khag gcig la zla ba rer rtsam pa'i phogs sprod pa'i gnas tshul 'khod 'dug pa des gser bzo ba'i nang bod rigs bzo pa yod pa mthong thub 'on kyang (gser gdung dkar chag )nang bod rigs gser bzo ba mi grangs ji yod dang ming bcas mi gsal bas mkhas pa rnams kyis slar yang zhib dpyod gnang bar zhu rgyu}
gser yig pa|{rgyal pos btang ba'i bka' yig lag ser yig zer zhing/gser dang 'dra bar rin thang che zhing dkon pa yin pa'i don dang/bka' yig khyer ba'i mi de la gser yig pa zer/gser yig pa la dmigs bsal gyi dbang cha chen po yod pa dang rgyal po dang thad kar ngo phrad kyis skad cha shod pa zhig yin pas/kho la sne len skad cha gang byung shod kyi yod skabs/gser yig pa sa gnas gang du slebs kyang brtsi bkur dang/sne len phun sum tshogs pa mi byade ka med yong gi yod/spyir btang gong mas sa gnas gzhan la btang ba'i 'tshams 'dri'i yi ge 'khyer mi la gser yig pa zer ba'i srol de ni yon rgyal rabs nas 'go tshugs pa yin/skabs re rgyal po'i mdun gyi drung yig la'ang gser yig pa zhes 'bod srol yod pa skabs dang sbyar shes pa dgos so/_}
gser g.yu brtsegs pa'i yig tshang chen mo|{gser yang dang g.yu yig gis bris pa'i lo rgyus kyi yig cha ste/'di'i nang/kra'o rgyal rabs nas bzung thang ka'o tsung bar gyi lo grangs 160tsam gyi lo rgyus cha tshang yod pa'i deb ha cang mang po zhig gi ming}
gser las byas pa'i rna rgyan|{gser gyi rna long ste/bod med kyi rna rgyan lta bu}
gser shang gir ti|{(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang lha khang 'di ni rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos mal dro ka tshal gyi lha khang bzhengs pa dang chags cig de'i yan lag lta bur lha khang 'di bzhengs par gsungs pas/ka tshal dang thag nye ba'i sa gnas zhig tu yod nges kyang zhib cha'i dpyad gzhi ma mthong}
gso dpyad yan lag brgyad|{lus kyi dpyad/byis pa'i dpyad/gdon gyi dpyad/lus stod kyi dpyad/mtshon gyis phog pa rma'i dpyad/mche ba zung pa'i dpyad rgas pa'i dpyad/ro tsa'i dpyad rnams so/_}
gso ba yan lag brgyad|{lus dang byis pa mo nad gnod/mtshon dug rgas dang lo btsa' ba/_/yan lag brgyad du shes par bya/_/ces dang/nang gses dbye na/lus la bdun cu/byis pa la gsum/mo nad la gsum/dug la gsum/gdon la lnga/rma la lnga/rgas pa la gcig /ro btsa' la gnyis dang dgu bcu go gnyis so/_}
gso ba rig pa|{'di ni rgyal khag dang mi rigs kyi dbye ba med par 'gro ba mi'i rigs kyis dus yun ring por thon skyed ngal rtsol byed pa dang rang byung khangs la 'thab rtsod byed pa'i go rim nang skyes dngos dang/rtsi shing/gter kha/srog chags sogs kyi nus pa dang chos nyid shes rtogs byed pa brgyud rim bzhin cha je tshang dang/phun sum je tshogs su 'gro ba'i lag len gyi phyogs bsdoms shig (1028) yin pa dang rang rang so sor 'phel rgyas kyi lo rgyus yod pa zhig yin cing lhag par du bod kyi gso ba rig pa ni mes rgyal gyi gso rig rin po che'i gter mdzo nang 'od stong 'phro ba'i nor bu'i cha shas shig tu gyur pa dang rang nyid kyi rmang gzhi dang mi rigs kyi khyad chos ldan pa'i sman dpyad rig pa zhig yin da yod kyi dpyad gzhi'i yig cha gzhir bzung na spyi lo'i gong gi lo brgya phrag kha shas sngon nas bod kyi rgya cha'i mang tshogs kyis nad rigs la 'thab rtsod byed pa brgyud rang nyid kyi yul nang thon pa'i skyes dngos dang rtsi shing gter rdzas srog tshags sogs la bar+tshen nas nad bcos pa'i+o sa nyid ngos 'dzin thub ste de'i mjug bsdoms su dug yod na smad yod zhes pa dang dug skyang sman du bsgyur thub pa'i rdzas sbyor rig pa shes nas mar la brten nas khrag gcod pa dang chang la brten sa rma bcos pa sogs rang byung khams kyi nus pa ngos 'dzin byed pa'i tshad mtho po byung yod pa dang rgyal po gnya' khri btsan po'i skabs su byung ba'i bon gyi shes pa can bcu gnyis kyi nang nas phan shes sman dpyad zer ba de ni bon gyi chos lugs la dad pa yod pa'i sman pa mkhas can zhig yin pa bcas bod mi rigs rang nyid kyi gso rig lo rgyus 'phel rgyas gyi rmang gzhi legs po yod pa red lhag par du tun hong nas thon pa'i gna' rabs bod kyi sman gzhung mdor bsdus shig gi nang spang rgyan dang gur kum lcum rtsa sogs skye dngos rigs sman sna kha nyi shu rtsa bzhi gla rtsi dang dom mkhris sogs srog chags las byung ba'i sman sna nyi shu rtsa lnga gser g.yu sogs gter kha'i rigs nas sman bcos bya tshul 'khod yod pa ma zad sman bcos bya tshul de dag nang nas mang po zhig deng sang lag len bltar mun yin pa dang sman gzhung de'i mjug tu 'khod don dpyad gzhi 'di ni zhang zhung gi dpyad phug pa dang sbyar te bgyid pa lags so zhes gna' rabs zhang zhung gi sman bcos nas 'byung ba ltar gyi sman bcos bya tshul gsal po bshad yod de rjes bod du mi rigs gzhan dag gi gso ba rig pa'i gzhung lugs dar rgyas byung ba'i nang nas snga shos ni rgya mi rigs kyi gso ba rig pa yin cing de yang spyi lo'i dus rabs drug pa'i mjug tsham la bod kya btsan po gnam ri srong btsan gyi dus su thang rgyal rabs dang thog ma'i 'brel ba byung ste rgya mi rigs kyi skar rtsis dang gso ba rig pa bod du dar zhes bod kyi lo rgyus yig cha mang por gsal zhing 'on kyang skabs der rgya nag nas bod du dar ba'i sman gzhung de'i ming gang yin pa dang rnam grangs ji tsam yod pa'i gsal bshad 'khod pa zhig sngon chad ma mthong de rjes rgyal po srong btsan sgam po'i dus thang rgyal rabs kyi gong ma thang tha'i tsung gi tsha mo wun khren kong jo btsun mor blangs nas spyi lo (641lor bod du phabs skabs dpe deb 'bor chen zhig bsnams yod pa dang dus mtshungs rgya rigs kyi bzo pa dang lag rtsal pa sman pa bcas mang po bod du khrid cing dpe deb de tsho'i nang (sman dpyad brgya pa/) (brtag thabs brgyad pa/) (dpyad thabs lnga pa/) (sbyong thabs drug pa/) (sbyor sde bzhi pa/) (gso rig gzhung bzhi )bcas yod pa de rnams rgya'i ha shang mA ha de ba tshe dang d+ha rma ko Sha lo tsA ba thon mi sam b+ho Ta la sogs pas bod skad du bsgyur ba'i ming la (sman dpyad chen mo )zhes pa byung de ni rgya nag gi sman gzhung bod skad du bsgyur ba'i snga shos de yin de rjes slar yang srong btsan skabs rgya yi sman pa han len he dang rgya gar gyi smad pa b+ha ra d+ha dza stag gzig gi sman pa ga le nor bcas bod du gdan drangs nas khong tshos thun mong du brtsams pa'i sman gzhung zhig yod pa de la (mi 'jigs pa'i mtshon cha )zhes zer de rjes rgyal po khrid gtsug brtan gyis cin khren kong jos btsun mor blangs skabs slar yang sman gzhung sogs dpe deb mang po bskur ba dang chags cig rgya rigs kyi sman pa mkhan pa 'ga' (1029) zhig bod du btan