sar pa 'dzugs gnang thog sku tshe gcig ring sman pa mkhas pa sum brgya lhag tsam gso skyong mdzad de nas dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i mgor mnga' ris lo tsA ba rin chen bzang pos slob dpon dpa' bos mdzad pa'i (sman dpyad yan lag brgyad pa )dang de'i rang 'grel kha che zla ba la dga' bas mdzad pa'i (yan lag brgyad pa'i 'grel pa zla zer )bcas rgya gar skad nas bod skad du bsgyur zhing rgyal bal gyi sman pa mkhas pa'i lag len dang bshad pa dar spel nang gas stong lugs kyi sman pa mkhas pa mi dgu sogs byung ba nas stong lugs su grags lo tsA ba khong dang dus thog phal cher mnyam pa'i lo tsA ba chos kyi ye shes rab kyis rgya nag gi skad nas rgya gar gyi ska du bsgyur ba'i (sman dpyad so ma ra dza )'am ming gzhan (sman dpyad zla ba'i rgyal po )yang zer ba de bzhin slar yang rgya gar gyi skad nas bod skad du bsgyur bas gong gsal (sman dpyad zla ba'i rgyal po )zer ba der rgya nag gi skad nas bod skad du bsgyur ba dang rgya nag gi skad nas rgya gar gyi skad du bsgyur te rjes su rgya gar gyi skad nas bod skad du bsgyur ba yin yod pas de gnyis ka phan tshul bsdur nas lta rgyu yod dus rabs bcu gnyis pa'i nang g.yu thog gsar pa yon tan mgon pos slar yang phyi rgyal dang rang rgyal gyi smad bcos lag len dang sman gzhung mang por brtag dpyad gnang ste (rgyud bzhi'i 'grel pa )yang brtsams gnang nang rgyu bzhi'i bshad pa dang lag len gang gi dad nas sngar las lhag pa'i cha tshang ba dang phun sum tshogs su phyin yod de rjes bod lugs sman pa'i bshad rgyu dang lag len thad byang lugs dang zur (1030) lugs khag gnyis su gyes pa ni bod sman gyi 'phel rgyas gsar pa zhig red byang lugs ni byang pa bdag po rnam rgyal grags bzang (rab byung bdun pa'i shing phag 1395)lo nas rab byung brgyad pa'i shing lug 1475lo bar )gis gnam gshis grang ba'i sa khul gyi nad rigs bcos thabs gtso bor byed pa'i sman bcos nyams myong mang po phyogs bsdoms gnang ste (rtsa brgyud 'grel pa gsal byed sgron me/) (bshad rgyud 'grel pa bdud rtsi'i chu rgyun/) (phyi ma'i rgyud kyi 'grel pa dgon 'dod 'byung ba )bcas lag rtsal gyi rgyun gar pa zhig byung ba der zer zur lugs ni dwags po la thog zur mkhar ba mnyam nyin rdo rjes (rab byung bdun pa'i sa lug (1439lo nas rab byung brgyad pa'i shing lug 1475lo bar )gnam gshis dro ba'i sa khul gyi nad rigs bcos thabs gtso bor byed pa'i sman bcos nyams myong mang po phyogs bsdoms gnang ste rgyud bzhi'i 'grel pa (spos shel phra mo )zhes pa rtsom 'bri gnang zhing khong dgung lo sum cu so bdun las ma bzhugs pas sku tshe thung yang bod sman gyi bshad rgyun la lag len thom mdzad rjes chen po byung ba ma zad khong dang sku thog mnyam pa'i byang lugs kyi sman pa mkhas pa byang bdag rnam rgyal grags bzang gi dngos slob mi yi nyi ma mthong don ldan gyis kyang khong la brtsi bkur che zhing rnam gnyis phan tshun sman gyi lag len skor la dri ba dri lan mdzad pa yang yod la mi'i nyi ma mthong ba don ldan gyis kyang (rgyud bzhi'i 'grel pa )sogs sman gzhung 'ga' zhig brtsams pa gnang ba nas byung ba yin de nas bzung byang lugs dang zur lugs kyi rgyun dbus gtsang kham gsum du khyab pa byung zhing de gnyis ka'i thun mong ma yin pa'i khyad chos ni mi lus gshags bcos byas te nang khrol chags tshul gyi chos nyid gzhi 'dzin sa byas nas so so'i lugs mi 'dra ba'i sman bcos thang ga yang bris yod de rjes zur mkhar blo gros rgyal po'i slob brgyud dung gtogs pa blo gros rgyal pos (rab byung dgu pa'i sa sbrul 1509}?{)lo bzhi'i ring zur lugs kyi sman bcos bshad rgyun dang lag len phyogs bsdoms byas pa'i (rgyud bzhi'i 'grel pa mes po'i zhal lung/) (man ngag bye ba ring bsrel )ma yig bu yig bcas rtsom 'bri mdzad cing rab byung bcu pa'i chu bya (1573)lor zur mkhar mnyam nyid rdo rje'i gzigs dpe (rgyud bzhi sgo nang ma )la ma dpe byas te (gra thang rgyud bzhi )zhes pa'i shing dpar thog mar bskos par mdzad de la ma phye byas te tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i dus rtse po ta lar yod pa'i (rgyud bzhi )dpar rnying pa de thog mar dpar skrun gnang zhing de rjes rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me yos (1687)lor sde srid sangs rgas rgya mtshos gong gsal gyi smad gzhung mang po dang (gra than