bsam bzhin du mi'i srid pa bzung ba|{'di sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/sangs rgyas dang byang chub sems dpa'i gnyis gang rung sems can gyi don du mi dang dud go sogs kyi skye ba ched du gnyer nas len pa yin zhing/mi yi 'gro ba rnams 'dul ba'i don du mi yi skye ba len pa ste/dper na deng sang bla ma sprul sku lta bu de ltar yin zer/de yang rgya gar du bla ma'am grub thob sogs sangs rgyas dang dang byang chub sems dpa' lta bu'i sprul pa yin zer srol yod kyang/de'i sku skye yin zhes byis pa chung dus nas ngos 'dzin byed pa shin tu nyung ba yin/de yang bod du karma bka' brgyud pa'i rabs gnyis pa karma pak+shi/rab byung lnga pa'i chu lug (1284)lor gshegs nas lo rjes mar karma pa rang byung rdo rje 'khrungs shing/de nas lo lnga song ba rab byung lnga pa'i sa byi (1288)lor karma pak+Shi'i slob ma grub chen u rgyan pas karma pa rang byung rdo rje karma pak+shi'i yang srid du ngos 'dzin byas pa de bod du bla ma'i yang srid ngos 'dzin pa'i thog ma de yin/de rjes karma pak+shi yang karma pa dus gsum mkhyen pa'i sku 'phreng du brtsis pa las/karma pak+Shi nyid bzhugs skabs karma pa'i yang srid ngos 'dzin byed med/de bzhin du tA la'i bla ma sku phreng dang po dge 'dun grub rab byung brgyad pa'i shing rta (1474)lor sku gshegs nas lo gnyis song ba/rab byung brgyad pa'i me sprel (1476)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng gnyis pa dge 'dun rgya mtsho 'khrungs/de nas lo gsum song ba rab byung brgyad pa'i sa khyi (1478)lor rje dge 'dun grub kyi nye gnas dge slong sgrol ma dang/thos bsam gling mkhan po kun mkhyen chos 'byor dpal bzang gnyis kyis rje dge 'dun grub kyi sprul skur ngos 'dzin byas pa ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng dang po dang gnyis pa gnyis la rgyal dbang thams cad mkhyen pa zer ba las tA la'i bla ma zhes mi zer/tA la'i bla ma zhes pa ni sku phreng gsum pa bsod nams rgya mtshor sog po al than rgyal po sog mar phul ba yin/de nas bzung rgya nag dang sog yul du tA la'i bla ma zhes 'bod srol de byung/de rjes rab byung dgu pa'i shing glang ngam me stag (1566)lor gang rigs shig