 lnga pa'i chu bya 1873)lor bar lo 10ring srid bzung 6 stag brag ngag dbang gsum rab mthu stobs bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags sbrul (1941)lo nas rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags stag (1950)lo bar lo 10ring srid bzung ba bcas gong gsal bla ma drug po de'i sprul sku rnams rgyal sprul yin gnyis pa ho thog thu rgyal po'i sprul sku min kyang man ching gong ma'i srid gzhung dang tA la'i bla ma paN chen bcas gsum gang rigs nas ho thog thu'i go gnas sbyin pa'i bla ma'i sprul sku rnams la zer gsum pa tshogs chen sprul sku (ho thog thu'i 'og gi sprul sku go gnas mtho ba tshogs ched 'du khang nang khri mthon po thob pa rnams la zer/) bzhi pa khri sprul (dga' ldan khri pa'i sprul sku rnams/) lnga pa mkhan sprul (se 'bras dge gsum sogs dgon pa khag gi mkhan po'i sprul sku rnams ste grwa tshang sprul sku yang zer/)}
