al gser khang gling bcas yod gtsug lag khang 'di'i bzo skrun gyi bkod pa thun mong ma yin pa zhig yod pa ni 'og khang bod lugs dang bar khang rgya nag lugs steng khang rgya gar lugs bcas lugs gsum gyi khyad chos tshang ba byas yod 'og khang rnam dag sgo gsum du 'du khang ka ba bco brgyad kyi rgya khyon du rten gtso gu ru nga 'dra ma dang gtso bo'i g.yas g.yon du mkhan slob chos gsum dang bai ro tsa na g.yas su jo rngog 'brom gsum dang 'jam dbyangs rnam gsum sogs kyi sku brnyan bzhugs gtsang khang dbus mar rten gtso jo bo byang chub chen mo dang gtso bo'i mtha' skra du khro bo khams gsum rnam rgyal dang khro bo mi g.yo ba byang chub sems dpa' chen po bcu la sogs pa'i rten byin cing mang po bzhugs g.yas su srung ma khang de'i nang srin rgyal nam mkha' sprin gyi pags pa las bzhengs pa'i rgyal po dpal gnod sbyin bye ba 'bum g.yu yi thub pa mkhan chen b+ho d+hi sa twa yi dbu thod dung gi seng ge sogs bzhugs bar khang g.yu zhal thing rgya khyon ka ba nyi shu'i sa rten gtso mkhan slob chos gsum gyi sku brnyan bzhugs steng khang du sangs rgyas rnam par snang mdzad kun rig byang chub sems dpa' nye ba'i sras brgyad la sogs pa'i sangs rgyas byang sems kyi sku brnyan mang po bzhugs lha gang de dag gi sku ldebs su mdo da las byung ba'i rtogs brjod dang sangs rgyas byang sems yi dam chos skyong srung ma'i rgyud ris tshar du dngar ba bris yod gzhan yang gtsug lag khang 'di'i phyogs bzhir kha dog mi gcig pa'i mchod rten chen po bzhi yod pa ste byang shar mtshams su rgyu bod rdza las grub pa'i mchod rten sngon po thog brtsegs bdun tsam ldan pa zhig gnas mchod rten de ni chos kyi 'khor lo de bzhin gshegs pa'i lugs sgo bcu drug gis brgyan pa khri dpangs mtho ba mchod rten gyi bar rings gnyis pa'i phyogs bzhir lha khang gsum re dang bum pa'ip+sateng du chos 'khor bcu gsum de'i rtse mor nor bu'i tog gis mdzes par byas shing de nas phyogs bzhir lcags thag gi nub byang phyogs su gnas shing de ni de bzhin gshegs pa'i dgung gis brgyan pa rang sangs rgyas kyi lugs su bzhengs pa khro zangs kha sbub pa lta bur snang mchod rten de rtsig gdan gru bzhi'i steng pad ma 'dab brgyad kyi chos khri dang de'i steng du mchod rten gyi bum pa chos 'khor bcu gsum (1038) yang steng du nor bu'i tog bcas kyi mdzes par snang mchod rten dkar po ni gtsug lag khang gi shar lho'i mtshams su chags de'i mtha' skor du sa dkar gsol ba'i mchod rten chung ngu brgya rtsa brgyad kyis bskor ba dang dbus su mchod rten dkar po seng ge brgyad kyis brgyan de'i bang rim dang chos 'khor bcu gsum nor bu'i tog sogs kyang spyir na gong dang 'dra gtsug lag khang gi lho nub mtshams su mchod rten dmar po bzhugs de ni rgyu so phag dang rdo las grub cing dbyibs cong drol kha sbub pa ltar snang ba bcas mchod rten che po rnam bzhi'i bkod pa ngo mtshar che zhing nang du rten byin can khyad du 'phags pa du ma bzhugs yod gtsug lag khang gi gzhung sgo'i lho ngos rtsig 'gram du rdo ring zhig yod pa de ni btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi sku dus su btsugs rdo ring gi thog tu bod yig kho na las gzhan gyi rgyan ris sogs gang yang med pas dga' bo'i nyams dang ldan pa zhig yod gzhan yang 'og khang rnam dag sgo gsum gyi rgyal sgo'i thog tu ching gong mas bris pa'i ke lo ca lan {(WP:1,194)}zhes pa'i rgya yig gi sgo pan zhig bka' yod pa dang de'i mdun gyi rgyal sgo'i sbra shur nang bod yig bkod pa'i cong chen po zhig bka' yod pa (mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang cong 'di ni rgyal ba'i bstan par dad zhen che ba'i btsan po khri srong da btsan gyi btsun mo 'bro bzang byang chub sgron gyis phul bar gsungs dpal bsam yas mi 'gyur lhun gyis grub pa'i gtsug lag khang 'di mkhan slob chos gsum gyis thun mong thug phyag btab nas sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa rgya cher spel 'on kyang phyis kyi mi lo bzhi brgya lhag tsam ring gi zang zing dang bod sil bu'i dus yun cung ring ba bcas kyi rkyen pas dus rabs bco lnga nas dus rabs bcu drug pa'i mtshams su dgon pa 'di thor zhig tu song dus phyis sa chen kun dga' snying po sogs skyes chen mang pos nyams gso rim par mdzad ngag rgyun ltar nami lo sum rgya'i gong rol du bsam yas gtsug lag khang 'di'i sngar gyi khang rgyud rnams mes 'jig skad da lta'i bsam yas dgon 'di rgyal ba bskal bzang rgya mtsho'i sku thog de mo rgyal thog thog ma'i skabs nyams gso rgya cher mdzad nas bsgrubs gtsug lag khang 'di chos 'khor gsum gyi ya gyal bstan pa snga dar la dam pa'i chos dar yul rgya gar gyi lo paN du ma byon te dam pa'i chos mang po bsgyur ba'i gnas mchog gzhi rgya che la 'phang mtho ba rgyu bzang la bkod pa legs pa bcas yangs pa'i nor 'dzin khyon du snyan grags kyi ba dan lhab lhub tu g.yo ba zhig yin 'on kyang rig gnas gsar brje'i skabs gtor skyon chen po phog nas nang gi rten rnying phal che ba bzhugs med rigs gsar rjes nyams gso byas de cha sngar rgyun lta bur gyur yod}
