bse ru lta bu'i rang rgyal|{rang rgyal gyi rigs la bse ru lta bu dang/tshogs nas spyod pa zhes gnyis su dbye ba'i ya gyal zhig ste/dud 'gro bse bar rwa gcig la med pa ltar 'du 'dzi g.yeng bas 'jigs nas gcig pur gnas pas so/_/'di ni shin tu dbang po rnon po zhig ste/bskal chen brgyar tshogs bsags pa dang bslab par bya ba'i gnas lam khas par byas nas srid pa tha ma'i tshe/sangs rgyas dang nyan thos kyis stong pa'i 'jig rten du skyes nas/slob dpon dang rab byung ba/rang sangs rgyas gzhan dag sogs lami bsten zhing mi 'dre bar gcig pur gnas te rang gi byang chub mngon du byed pa zhig yin/rang rgyal tshogs spyod ni tshogs pa dang lhan cig tu sgom pa gzhir byed pas na de ltar brjod}
