bsod nams mchog grub grags bzang|{rje 'di (1043) nyid shab dge ldings kyi sa'i char khur gyi rigs su rab byung bdun pa'i sa yos (1399)lor sku 'khrungs dgung lo bcu gcig bzhes skabs mkhan chen grub pa shes rab dang slob dpon chos ldan skal ba bzang po sogs kyis spyan sngar rab tu byung mtshan bsod nams mchog grub grags bzang zhes gsol dung lo nyi shu par mkhan chen gang gi drung las bsnyen par rdzogs slob dpon grub pa shes dang chos ldan skal ba bzang po gnyis las bka' gdams kyi chos rnams gsan dkar bcu pa dar bzang dang grub chen bsod blo ba snar thang pa shes rab seng ge rje tsong kha pa chen po 'dul 'dzin grags pa rgyal mtshan mkhas grub chos rje spyan snga nyer gnyis rin po che gtsang pa blo bzang pa sogs mkhas grub kyi bla ma mang po'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo rgyud kyi rig gnas 'byams klas pa thugs su chud sa khyi (1418)lor nas chu glang (1433)lo bar snar thang gdan sa lo bcu drug bskyangs de nas dbus su byon te dpa' phag mo grub pa'i chos sgo'i go sar bzhugs chos rje don grub dpal chos rje nam mkha' blo gros dang chos rje don grub dpal chos rje lo chen chos rje 'dus pa ba chos rje dge 'phel sogs mkhas grub kyi slob ma mang du 'dus bstan bcos kyi phyag rtsom ji snyed mdzad mthar dgung lo lnga bcu nga bzhi bzhes pa ram byung brgyad pa'i chu sprel (1452)lor sku gshegs}
bsod nams dpal 'byor|{mkhas dbang bsod nams dpal 'byor mchog ni bod rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags sprel (1932)lo'i zla ba 12par lha ldan du 'khrungs shing/dgung lo brgyad tsam la lha ldan g.yu thog btsan khang sger gnyer slob grwar yi ge'i 'bri klog dang/dag yig /legs bshad/gzhung yig 'bri stangs/rtsis sogs kyi rmang gzhi'i rig gnas kyi slob gnyer mdzad/de nas lo bzhi tsam ring la gang de'i yab kyi phyag phyir 'brangs nas chab mdo dang chu shul sogs su bshes gnyen zur bsten gyis yig rtsis kyi sbyang pa ma chad par bskyangs/dgung lo bcu drug nas bzung lha ldan rang du gangs ljongs rig pa'i gnas la smra ba'i khyu mchog smin gling blo gros chos bzang dang/a lag rin po che/tsha sprul ngag dbang blo bzang/rdo rje rgyal po sogs kyi zhabs pad spyi bor bsten nas sum rtags snyan gsum dang/bod kyi gso rig /rgyal rabs chos 'byung/tshad ma rig pa/mdo phyogs gzhung lugs sogs la thos bsam rgya che mdzad nas mkhyen pa yangs par gyur/rab byung bcu drug pa'i chu sbrul (1953)lor dngos su phyag las la bzhugs nas thog mar bod dmag khul gang gi las byed slob gra'i dge rgan gnang zhing/de'i ring las zhor la rgya yig dang de bzhin rtsis rig /sa khams rig pa la sogs rig gnas gsar pa la sbyangs pa mdzad/sa phag (1959)lor pe cin krung dbyangs mi rigs slob grwa chen mor dus thung gi rgya yig zab sbyong gnang rjes lo rjes mar krung dbyangs mi dmangs kun khyab rlung phrin las khungs su phyag las la phebs nas bod yag gsar 'gyur gyi sgyur zhus kyi thugs 'gan bzhes/lcags glang (1961)lor rang yul du phebs nas snga phyir bod ljongs mi dmangs kun khyab rlung 'phrin las khungs dang/bod rang skyong ljongs rig gnas slob gso thing/bod ljongs mi dmangs dpe skrun khang bcas su yig sgyur rtsis zhus dang slob gzhi gsar rtsom/dpe skrun rtsom sgrig zhal zhor slob khrid sogs bod kyi rig gnas nyams pa sor chud dang/mi nyams gong spel/phul byung rigs gnas phan tshun spel res bcas kyi mdzad pas dus 'da' bar mdzad/lo bcu'i gong chag ring khong yang shes rig gi na mor 'khod pa'i yon tan can rnams dang 'dra bar ming 