hor khang|{hor khang ni hor jing gair gyi rgyud gsang gzhung bar tar jing gair dpon zhes pa tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i skabs lha sar 'byor te skabs de dus nas pha gzhis sbyor 'jags byung ba dang/ma gzhis gnas yul rgya ma khri khang ni sa skya'i dus bod kyi khri skor bcu gsum gyi gras yin pa ste/hor khang pa'i mi rgyud ni sog po o ros tha'i jis lha sar gzhis chags nas khang gsar rgyag thog /bod sa gnas srid gzhung gis chu shul sbud bde tshar sdong gzhis kyi bdag thob gnang zhing/o ros tha'i ji 'das rjes de'i bu mor pho lha mi dbang gi gcung po no an ho shu chi rab brtag mag par bsus pa des rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me lug (1727)lo rgyal rtser 'brug dmag dang 'thab pa'i byas rjes su dza sag dang tha'i ji rim pa dang po'i go gnas byung ba dang nag chu khul bar mtha' sger gzhung dgu'i dpon du bsko gzhag byung/de 'das rjes gcung po ser chen ha shi kha rab brtan don grub kyis go gnas mu mthud bzung/spun gsum pa tshe dbang rdo rje dang/de'i bu dbang 'dus la pho lha mi dbang dang/bod sdod am ban gyi rogs ram 'og gong ma chan lung nas go gnas dang bar mtha' sger gzhung dgu'i dmag gi dbang cha rang 'jags gnang/de'i bu bsod nams bkra shis kyis go nags mu mthun 'dzin thog rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu byi (1729)lo nas bka' blon byas kyang/gor dmag skabs g.yo thabs byas rkyen bka' blon gnas dbyung btang/slar zla ba gsum nas bka' blon rang 'jags byas/de'i bu tshe ring dbang phyug rdo rje/de'i bu don grub g.yul rgyal gyis bsher dpang dang/mnyam du chab mdor bskyed de la don yag po byung bar dza sag rim pa dang po'i go ming byung/de'i bu thogs med kyis pha'i go ming shul 'dzin byas kyang mi ring bar 'das/de'i bu dbang chen gyis dza sag byas kyang rjes su go gnas phab/de'i bu bsod nams stobs rgyal gyis bka' blon byedap+sakabs bod rang byung bco lnga pa'i chu yos (1903)lor bka' blon bshad (sgra )zhol (khang )chang (khyim )gsum dang mnyam du gnas dbyung thog nor bu gling khar bkag bskyil byed skabs gtsang chur mchongs nas 'das/de'i bu dbang chen phun tshogs la dza sag gi go gnas