hor khang bsod nams dpal 'bar|{sa lug (1919)lor rgya mar sku 'khrungs/lha sa skyid ras slob grwar bod yig slob sbyong dang mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel sogs las rig gnas la gnas sbyong gnang/rtsis khang (bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi dpon rigs skya bo gso sbyong byed sa )du rdel rtsis slob sbyong gnang ba brgyud sras rnam pa'i (rim bzhi chung ba )gras su zhabs sdod zhus rjes rtsam len pa dang/mdo smad phogs khang/sku srung ru dpon/gzhung 'bru spyi mdzod khang gi las bya/dza sag sogs kyi las gnang dang go ming bzhes/bod zhi bas bcings 'grol thob rjes chab mdo bcings 'grol u yon lhan khang gi u yon dang/rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag (1959)lo ngo log zing 'khrug langs skabs rgyal gces pa'i langs phyogs su brtan po bzung ste ljongs tshan se hre'i tshan se yon dang/ljongs srid gros kyi kru'u zhi gzhon pa/ljongs spyi tshogs tshan rig khang gi blo 'dri yul/ljongs mi dmangs 'thus tshogs rgyun ud kyi kru'u ren gzhan pa sogs kyi 'gan bzhes/khong ni bod kyi rig gnas bya gzhag la thugs nus 'don mkhan zhig yin stabs mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel dang dge bshes chos kyi grags pa sogs kyi sbyin bdag zhus te khong rnam pa'i rtsom yig dpe skrun (shing par )gyi mthun rkyen sgrub (1061) pa sogs gnang ba ma zad lhag par mkhas dbang dge 'dun chos 'phel sku 'da' khar gsung rtsom zin bris rnams hor khang bsod nams dpal 'bar la gnang ste bdag gces dgos tshul bka' mngags gnang ba ltar rab byung bcu bdun pa'i sa sbrul (1989)lo (gangs can rig mdzod )dpe deb gsum gyi thog dge da'un chos 'phel gyi gsung rtsom bkod pa'i zin bris mkho 'don dang zhus dag dpe skrun gsal bshad 'bri ba sogs gnang gzhan yang khong gis lo rgyus dang rig gnas sogs kyi rtsom yi mi rung ba 'bri ba gnang yod rab byung bcu bdun pa'i shing khyi (1994)lo dgung lo 76thog sku gshegs}
