hor rgyal bu go dan|{{(WP:1,194)}yon tha'i tsung au go ta'i bu gnyis kyi chung ba yin/me stag lo pa rang lo nye dgu'i thog rab byung bzhi pa'i shing rta (1234)lo nas lo bco brgyad ring srid dbang bzung/'dis srid dbang bzung ba'i phyi lo mdze nad kyis zin/'di'i khri lo drug pa sa phag (1239)lor/sa skya/phag gru/g.ya' bzang/thang po che bcas kyis hu la'i hu stag lung pas a ri bo ga bcas la mgo btags/de'i phyi lo rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags bya (1240)lor blon po dor rta nag pos sne khrid pa'i dmag dpung bod du btang/mdo stod/mdo smad/sog chu kha rnams su bod mi mthong tshad gsod pa dang/rgyal lha khang mes bsregs/rwa sgreng la yang gnod pa chen po byas/stag lung rmugs pas bsgribs nas ma mthong/grwa pa rab tu byung ba lnga brgya tsam bsad/'bri gung spyan snga grags pa 'byung gnas kyis rdo char phab pas 'bri gung par ma gnod/hor gyi mchod gnas la phebs dgos zhus kyang kho rang ma phebs (1063) par sa skya paN chen gdan drangs dgos zhes mngags pa bzhin rab byung bzhi pa'i shing 'brug (1244)lor sa paN dgung lo re gsum 'gro mgon 'phags pa dgung lo bcu phyag na dgung lo brgyad la slebs pa bcas khu dbon gsum ka hor yul du phebs nas phyi lo shing sbrul (1245)lor la myang ngos mkhar {(WP:1,194)}du 'byor go dan gyis thug 'phrad ma byas par sman bcos byed du bcug pas rgyal po nad las thar sa paN la gnam mchod pa'i rgan 'gro byin kyang chos ma zhus da dung tshod lta tshod bgam sna tshogs byas rab byung bzhi pa'i lcags phag (1251)lor sa paN 'das de rjes go dan gyi blon po dor b+hi tas sne khrid pa'i dmag dpon du btang nas bod du ma 'byor gong go dan kho rang 'das de'i phyi lo rab byung bzhi pa'i chu byi (1252)la go dan gyis btang ba'i hor dmag bod du 'byor te mon mkhar mgon po gdong bcom nas mi grangs med bsad rgyal tsha dang jo 'ber bkrongs ('dir 'ga' zhig gis go yug dang go dan gnyis kyis byang ngos shar ra tha la'i rgyal po ma gtogs byas med zer mkhan yang 'dug}
hor ston nam mkha' dpal ba|{rje 'di ni mal gro yul du rab byung drug pa'i chu glang (1373)lor sku bltams/'jam mgon bla ma tsong kha pa chen pos dbus mkhas grub pa'i bshes gnyen chen po mang po'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags kyi gzhung lugs mtha' yas par thos bsam dpyis phyin gnang bas mkhas pa chen por gyur/dga' ldan byang rtse grwa tshang phyag btab ste chos zur 'chad mdzad pas rje dge 'dun grub pa sogs mkhas grum nga pos chos zhus/(theg pa chen po'i blo sbyong snyan rgyud chen mo'i rnam bshad nyi ma'i 'od zer )zhes bya ba bka' rtsom mdzad/'go la gnas su yang dben btab ste dgung lo don lnga la phebs pa rab byung brgyad pa'i me yos (1447)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
