hor spyi|{rab byung bco lnga pa'i me 'brug (1916)lor hor tsho pa sum cu so dgu'i spyi khyab mkhan chung grags pa rnam rgyal dang/las bya rtse drung gnyis/sa srung brgya dpon gcig dang/lding dpon bzhi bcas gyi rtsa ba'i spyi khyab las khang de steng chen du yod pa dang/hor tsho de bzhin sngar phan tsho shog so sor lding dpon/brgya dpon/blon po/rgan po bcas so sos rang khungs su khrims 'doms byed pa las/sa gnas spyi khyab khrims 'dzin 'go 'doms dmigs bsal med stabs shog khang phan tshun nam/stod smad tshong 'grul/nang khul bcas la mi dpung dgra bsdebs kyis dgra jag rgyag res mi gsod rgyu 'phrog gi 'tshe ba rgyun mi chad pa yong gi yod stabs thog mar hor spyi grags rnam nas kyang nyes can byed gte srog thog dang/dbang po gcod breg sogs gang la de 'tshams gyi drag po'i khrims bcod dang 'brel dril bsgrags yang yang byas rkyen rim bzhin tshang ma rtsa ba'i cha nas bag yod tshul gnas su gyur te mi gsod rgyu 'phrog byed mi je nyung du song ba ma zad/rgya khyab tu ri klung skam gsar la gnas pa'i srog chags tshun la mi 'jigs srog gi skyabs sbyin ri klung rgya sdom bstsal ba ltar khyung po khul du'ang rngon rgyag byed mi je nyung du song ba bcas mdor na khral khrims 'khur shes kyi yod pa red/spyir btang srid 'dzinap+sapayi khyab yin na'ang 'dra/rdzong 'go gzhis sdod du 'dra zhig gi dus yin rung/khyung po khul der yun ring mi bsrun brlang spyod kyi mig ltos ngan 'phel dbang gis thog mar hor spyi grags rnam la skabs 'phral thag gcod byed thabs skor zhi drug thabs sgo gang mkhas kyis spyi dmangs bde 'jags kyi ched du thal lus med pa (1064) dgos rgyu'i dmigs bsal gyi bka' 'khrol yod pa red dpon khag brgya dpon rgan lding dang grub mtha' 'dra min gyi dgon sde che chung khag gi 'tsher sa lhas mal nor lug sogs sngar gyi thob thang gang yod dpon gnas so so'i go ming gdan thob dang bcas pa rang 'jags thog bar skabs g.yo khongs su sbug nyar byas pa'i nor lug rtsa yul sa ma 'brog khul du sa zhing bcas la spyi 'gre'i ga gzhung dang sa tho 'god 'go btsugs te hor spyi mkhan chung grags pa rgyal mtsho tsam gyi bar ga gzhung dang sa tho 'god rgyu mjug bsgril zin pa red tsho pa so dgu'i khongs sngar lam yul dmag chig stong skor gyi 'go 'doms dma' ru lding dpon dang bcas pa rang khungs tsho shog so so'i 'go dpon spyi mos che ba drug 'debs kyis bsko gzhag thog dmag khrims dang sgrigs srol tshang ma bod dmag spyi 'gre ltar tsa dang dmag sgar du bsgyur ba bcas red}
hor tsho pa dgu|{tsho pa sum cu so dgu'i nang steng chen dang/ser tsha/khri rdo/sbra chen/nag shod/'bri ru/ar rdza be sog rdzong (gnya' rong )sogs rdzong drug gi sa khul dang/tsho pa sum cu so dgur der snga hor tsho pa so dgu zhes 'bod/der ming rgyal rabs kyi dus mjug tu sog po g.yas ru'i phyogs kyis dbang sgyur byas/rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing sbrul (1725)lor man ching rgyal rabs kyis zi ling la don gcod am ban bsko gzhag byas pa dang khri ca ca ching hor pa tsho so dgu'i spyi khyab tu mngags gtong byas thog spyi khyab las khungs steng chan la bca' sdod kyis khul de yongs kyi mnga' 'og dkar ru dpon dang/ye tha dpon/stag phrug dpon bcas stong dpon gsum yod pa dang/stong dpon gyi 'og tu brgya dpon sogs 'go dpon bsko gzhag byas yod/man ching rgyal rabs kyi thog ma'i dus su hor tsho pa so dgu'i sa khongs de dag li h+phan yon phyi phyogs ya mon gyi thad ka'i mnga' khongs su brtsis nas do dam byed kyi yod/chu glang (1733)lor yung kreng khri lo bcu gcag par mtsho sngon phyi phyogs las sne am ban gyi bka' shog nang du/khyed tsho bod mi'i khral rigs 'khri sgrub zhu sgo'i thad yung kreng khri lo bcu gcig par gtan 'bebs byas pa ltar lo re them dud re nas dngul zho brgyad re 'jal sgrub dgos lugs tho gzhung nang gsal mgyogs myur them bsher bsdu len gyis 'di lo gus rang bod du khral bsdur yong skabs chad med sgrub sprod dgos pa las nar 'gyangs mi chog /'on kyang khral 'ded kha khyer gyis rang 'og mi ser rnams brdab gsig gtong rigs gtan nas mi chog /de las 'ga' rigs byung tshe chad pa nan po gcod rgyu yin zhes gsal/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags lug (1751)lor man ching gong mas hor tso pa so dgur bod sdod am ban gyi ya mon nas thad kar bdag gnyer bya rgyu'i bka' rgya btang ba red/man ching rgyal rabs kyi dus mjug tu kra'o 'ar h+phung sa khul de tshor slebs rjes sngar gyi dpon gnas rnams pha shul bu 'dzin byed du bcu nas sa cha de dag zi khron gyi mnga' khongs su bcug /lcags phag po'i gsar brje'i rjes su bod rab byung bcu drug pa'i shing stag (1914)lo'i zla gnyis pa'i nang zi khron mtha' srung dpon lu'u cun krung cang krang yes dkar smad g.yung drung bstan grags la sprad pa'i bka' yig nang 'khod don/snyan seng zhu don ltar hor tso pa so dgu zi khron mtha' mtshams kyi mnga' khongs su gtogs pas sngar mus bzhin sa khongs bdag skyong thog dpon 'bangs mi ser kun gyis sngar srol khral rigs rnams zha chag med par 'jal sgrub zhabs zhu lhod med thog min go rgyal khab chen po'i mi ser yag po zhig byed dgos/de las 'gal rigs byung tshe brgya dpon g.yung drung bstan grags la 'dri rtsa bya rgyu yin/rjes sor dmag dmangs yongs la nye ring med par skyong mkhas gang legs byed dgos pa las brnyas bcos btsan (1065) shes rigs byung tshe 'phral 'phral chad pa nan po gcod rgyu yin me 'brug (1916)lor bod sa gnas srid gzhung gis hor tsho pa so dgu'i sa khul la dbang sgyur byed skabs sngar gyi stong dpon rnams brgya dpon la phab pa dang brgya dpon rnams dpon rigs dkyus mar phal thog steng chen sogs sa khul la rdzong dpon btang nas srid don thag gcod byed bcug pa ma zad hor tso pa so dgu'i srid kyi dbang cha yang nag chu spyi khyab la sprad rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags stag (1950)lor chab mdo khongs gtogs steng chen dang ser tsha khri rdo sogs chab mdo sa khul bcings 'grol u yon lhan khang gi mnga' khongs su bsdus pa ma zad lcags yos (1951)lozi zla dang por chab mdor bcings 'grol u yon lhan khang gi don gcod khru'u dang po btsugs te wang shing yi'u yis kru'u ren gnang ba dang hor rgyal sras dang wang yun zhang sogs kyis kru'u ren gzhon pa gnang ba red}
