lha khang chen mo|{bod kyi lo rgyus thog snyan grags che ba'i sa skya'i lha khang chen mo ni deng sang rgyal khab kyis thad ka'i do dam srung skyob khongs kyi gna' shul gal chen gras shig yin/lha khang 'di bzhin rab byung bzhi pa'i shing glang (1265)lor 'gro mgon 'phags pa yon rgyal rabs kyi rgyal sa nas bod du thengs dang po phebs skabs bka' bkod gnang ba ltar/sa skya'i dpon chen shAkya bzang pos bod khri skor bcu gsum gyi 'u lag bsdus nas thog mar 'dzugs skrun byed 'go tshugs shing/'go thog gi thog 'bubs zin tsam gyi bal lo ngo drug tsam 'gor/de kha'i mu la dpon chen shAkya bzang po 'das nas de'i tshab tu dpon chen kun dga' bzang po bskos te/des lo ngo drug dpon chen byas pa'i ring la lha khang 'di'i steng thog khang dang/thig khang/rgya phibs bcas dang/lha khang gi khyams kyi ldebs bris bcas bzhengs/de rjes sa skya'i dpon chen mi rabs dgu pa ang len gyis lha khang chen mo'i spen bad dang rin chen rgyal mtshan gyis sa skya'i gdan sa lo ngo sum cu tsam gnang ring lha khang khag la nyams gso gnang zhing/gdan sa gnang ba'i tha ma'i lo bar byung lnga pa'i shing sbrul (1305)lo'i zla ba lnga pa nas 'go tshugs te zla ba gsum gyi ring lha khang chen mo'i yang thog gi rgya mthongs ka brgyad dang/bar khyams bcas kyi khor yug tu gsang sngags kyi rgyud sde bzhi'i rnal 'byor rgyun man chad kyi dkyil 'khor chen po brgya dang bzhi bcu zhe brgyad/rigs bsdus kyi dkyil 'khor drug brgya dang sum cu so dgu bcas khyon bsdoms dkyil 'khor bdun brgya brgyad cu gya bdun so so'i brgyud ris dang bcas pa 'bri bar mdzad pa da lta'ang nyams med du bzhugs bzhin pa 'di dang/lha khang 'di'i nang gi rten gsum rnams kyang 'gro mgon 'phags pa nas bzung sa skya'i gdung rabs dang/gdan sa pa rim byon rnams kyis bzhengs pa'i sku gsung thugs rten grangs las 'das pa bzhengs pa bcas zhib par sa skya bdag chen a mes zhabs ngag dbang kun dga' bsod nams kyis mdzad pa'i (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )du gsal bas 'dir ma bris}
lha khang bla brang|{thog mar bla brang 'di dpon chen mi rabs gnyis pa kun dga' bzang pos btab/rjes su bdag chen bzang po dpal ba sku gshegs rjes sras ti shrI kun dga' blo gros kyis bdag chen sras rgyud so sor bla brang bzhi so sor bgos nas gnang skabs/ti shrI kun dga' legs pa'i 'gyur nas sku mched la lha khang bla brang dang/gser gyi dam kha gnang/de nas lha khang bla brang gi gdung rgyud byung/lo rgyus rgyas pa bdag chen a mes zhabs kyis mdzad pa'i (sa skya'i gdung rabs rin chen bang mdzod )du gsal}
lha glang ru dkar|{lha yi glang rwa co dkar po byas pa gnam la 'phul shes pa zhig yod zer ba bon gyi lo rgyus nang bshad srol yod}
lha 'gro ba'i mgon po|{'di nyid yab jo 'bag dang yum lha 'bri sgang pa'i lcam mo lha gcig 'dzam gling gnyis kyi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i me rta (1186)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo drug la phebs skabs dkor 'dul ba 'dzin pa che po la bsnyen gnas kyi sdom pa mnos/dgung lo bcu drug la phebs skabs 'chad khar khu bo'i drung du byon nas dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa mnos/de'i mod la skyor mo lung du sbal til mkhan po dang/gro sa pa'i dge bshes gnas brtan la slob dpon zhus te rab tu byung nas mtshan byang chub 'od du gsol/phyis po tor dge bshes gnas brtan la mkhan pa dang/sbu gu do nas dge bshes rgyal tsha gdan drangs nas las kyi slob dpon/jo btsun pas gsang ste mdzad de bsnyen par rdzogs/khu bo las chos mang du gsan/khu bo gshegs rjes gdan sa mdzad/po to gnas brtan dang bka' gdams gzhung pa'i bshes gnyen rnams gros mdzad de po to da ma lag dang bcas pa phul/kong po nas rta bar/bu chu/byang lung gsum gyis thog drangs pa'i sde pa sum brgya tsam gyi gtsug lag khang gi lde mig gtad nas phul/dwags po nas bla mda' dang/kan mo na shod kyis thog drangs pa'i sde pa mi da dang bcas pa phul/mnyal nas zangs po che ba chen pos spyan drangs te sku 'bum chen mo'i bar gnas mdzad/zangs po che sde ma lag dang bcas pa phul/rong rtse dkar du gdung khang chen mo'i rab gnas la spyan drangs nas sde ma lag dang bcas pa phul/dus phyis kyang zangs po che dang bra gor na spyil bu ba'i chos brgyud 'dzin pa mang du byung/de ltar mkhas btsan mi chen mang po'i don mdzad nas mthar dgung lo don bzhi pa rab byung bzhi pa'i sa lug (1259)lor sku gshegs/gdung bzhu bas lha sku la sogs pa'i rten mang du byon pa las/spyil bu'i nang rten gser sku'i nang du spyan bzhugs/thugs 'chad kha bas gdan drangs nas ngo sgra'i gdung khang na bzhugs/ljags sbu gu dor gdan drangs nas byang chub chen po'i nang na bzhugs/dung gsal 'khyil bzhi byon pa la/gcig rug pa'i gser skur bzhugs/gcig spangs pa'i rten skal la gdung khang du bzhugs nas do sgra na yod/gcig spyil bu'i rten ltang ston pa la bzhag go}
lha cig di paMm ka ra|{'di gong du jo bo rje a ti sha zhes par gzigs}
lha gcig|{1 rgyal po'i btsun mo/2 rgyal po'i sras mo/3 rang gis dad pa byed yul gyi mi dam gtso bo bcas la go dgos}
lha gcig mtsho nang gi pad+ma|{bod yig gi lo rgyus 'ga' zhig nang rgya bza' wun khren kong jo'i mtshan la hru'i len kong jo zhes 'bod kyi yod tshul bshad pa rgya yig gi lo rgyus nang de 'dra'i bshad srol yod med ma shes/'di'i lo rgyus mdor bsdus tsam gong du sru'i gleng kong jo zhes par gzigs}
lha chen brgyad|{shar du dbang phyug chen po/lhor brgya byin/nub tu tshangs pa/byang du khyab 'jug /shar lhor 'dod pa'i dbang phyug /lho nub tu tshogs bdag glang sna/nub byang du b+h+ring+gi ri d+hi ('bring gi ri ti )byang shar gzhon nu gdong drug rnams so/_}
lha chen dngos grub|{stod kyi mgon gsum gyi ya rgyal rig pa mgon gyi rgyud pa/yab lha chen jo dpal gyi sras/rgyal po 'di'i dus su rab tu byung ba dbus gtsang du 'chad nyan la 'gro ba'i srol btsugs nas yab mes kyi gtsug lag khang rnams la zhig gso mdzad pa dang/khyad par du chos rje 'bri gung pa 'jig rten mgon po mjal (1069) bar phebs nas gser dngul la sogs pa rin po che brgya 'bul zhus pa gzhan yang bka' 'gyur tshar gnyis dang gsang sngags kyi dkyil 'khor yang mang po bzhengs so/_}
lha chen dpal 'bar|{ston pa sangs rgyas kyi sku brnyan chen po (tshal gung thang du yod pa de yin/)}
lha chen tshe dbang rnam rgyal|{stod kyi mgon gsum gyi ya gyal rig pa mgon gyi rgyud pa/yab bkra shis rgyal la sras gsum byung ba'i bgres pa/'di nyid rgyal srid la dbang bskur rjes sku na gzhon dus dmag mdzad pas byang ngam ring/glo bo dang/pu hrengs/gu ge la sogs pa mnga' 'og tu bsdus/lho phyogs 'dzum lang dang/nyung ti/nub shing dkar dang/bka' gsum ci sgrub zhu rgyu'i yig dan byas/mkhar rnams la sku tshab bzhag nas mang yul thams cad dar zhing rgyas par mdzad/gu ge nas khral dang dbyar lo ltar gser zho sum brgya/dngul/lug tsher mo brgya/chibs pa gcig /ru thog nas gser zho nyis brgya drug cu/lug tsher ma brgya/zhing dar chen dar chung rnams dang/gzhan yang khral dang dpya' la sogs pa phyogs phyogs nas 'bul mkhan mang po byung yod/khong gis da dung gtsug lag khang rgya chen po bzhengs pa sogs mes ral pa can lta bu'i phyag rjes shig 'jog par dgongs pa'i mur sku gshegs shing/de rjes rgyal phran lta bu'i mnga' ris rnams kyang phyogs phyogs su gyes so/_}
lha chen ut+pal|{stod kyi mgon gsum gyi ya gyal rig pa mgon gyi rgyud pa/yab bla chen rgyal po'i sras/rgyal po 'dis la dwags stod gsham gnyis kyi dmag drangs nas nyan nyi la brgyab pas nyung ti rgyal po pham nas gangs ti se nam bzhu dang/mtsho ma pham nam skam bar te ji srid bar rgyal por mdzo dang lcags la sogs pa'i khral dang dpya' 'bul ba'i man 'gan bzhag pa lag bstar rgyun 'khyongs byas pa dang/da dung glo bo/pu hrengs man chod/lho phyogs bre sang gi yul chu la me 'bar tshun chod/nub phyogs ra shan 'greng shing/stag kha tshun chad/byang phyogs ka brus phan chod mnga' 'og tu bsdus te lo ltar yong rgyu'i chod kha byas pa sogs rgyal po'i di'i dus su mnga' thang rgyas la dpung stobs btsan pa byung ngo/_}
lha chog lde|{('dol le yang zhu )smad kyi lde gsum gyi ya gyal/dpal lde'i rgyud pa/yab btsan lder sras gsum byung ba'i bgres pa/'di'i sku ring la mnga' thang sngar dang mi 'dra ba'i yar rgyas song zhing/gshongs dbus nub ri steng po che dar yol bres pa lta bur pho brang phyi nga khab gong du grags pa sku mkhar lcags ri 'ob dang bcas pa byas/de skabs rje btsun mi la ras pa yang grub pa brnyes te za 'og phug tu phebs pa dang dus mtshungs pas phal cher spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i mjug tsam la yin par snang ngo/_}
lha chos dga' ldan 'og min gling|{lha rtse chos sde dga' ldan 'og min gling/rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa glang (1649)lor/gtsang gi lha rtse rdzong khongs tA la'i blam snga pas gsar du btab pa'i dge lugs pa'i dgon pa zhig }
lha chos dge ba bcu|{lha chos dge ba bcu ni chos rgyal srong btsan sgam po'i sku dus su gtan 'bebs gnang ba'i khrims srol zhig ste/1 srog mi gcod pa/2 ma byin par mi len pa/3 log g.yem spong ba/4 bden par smra ba/5 phra ma mi byed pa/6 tshig 'jam por smra ba/7 ngag mi 'chal ba/8 gzhan gyi nor la chags sred mi byed pa/9 gzhan la gnod sems mi skyed pa/ (1070) 10 'jig rten pa'i yang dag pa'i lta ba ste bcu'o/_/skabs 'di'i lha ni sangs rgyas la go dgos shing sangs rgyas sogs chos lugs kyi nang don snying po bsdus na dge ba bcu la bsdus lus kyi mi dge ba gsum (srog gcod pa ma byin par len pa log par g.yem pa )ngag gi mi dge ba bzhi (brdzun phra ma tshig rtsub ngag kyal )yid kyi mi dge ba bcu spong ba la dge ba bcu zer}
lha chos bdun|{lha bzhi ni thub pa dang/spyan ras gzigs/sgrol ma/mi g.yo ba/chos gsum ni/sde snod gsum mo/_}
lha mchod bcu gnyis|{chu bzhi/nyer spyod lnga/rig ma bzhi'am/lnga'am/drug gam/brgyad dam/bcu gsum 'dod yon lnga/rgyal srid sna bdun/bkra shis rtags brgyad/bla bre/gdugs so/_}
lha rje dkon mchog skyabs|{tshal pa'i lha rje dkon mchog skyabs zhes 'bod pa de yin/gso dpyad la mkhas pa zhig yin pas rje tsong kha pas gso dpyad skor 'di las gsan}
lha rje dge ba 'bum gyi gdung rten|{lha rje dge ba 'bum ni bla ma zhang rin po che'i slob ma mkhas grub chen po zhig yin pa ma zad/gso ba rig pa'i gnas la rmad du byung ba dang/lhag par du lha sa gtsug lag khang gi dkon gnyer gyi tshab lta bu rgyud ring gnang myong bar brten gshegs khar gtsug lag khang la 'byung ba chu'i gnod pa zhi ba'i ched du kha bsnon zhal chems ltar gtsug lag khang byams pa mched bzhi'i lha khang sgrol dkar gyi sku 'dra zhig nang sku gdung hril po gzungs bzhugs su yod pa'i lo rgyus rje btsun pa kha shas dang/yang sman rtsis khang em rje bgres gras khag gcig nas gsung rgyun ltar na/lha sa'i sku 'bum thang zer ba'i brgyud kyi gtsang chu'i 'gram du kho rang gi zhal chems ji bzhin rjes 'jug tshos mchod rten chen po bzhengs yod pa de'i gzungs bzhugs su lha rje dge ba 'bum gyi sku gdung hril po yod pa'i skor bcas lo rgyus mi 'dra ba gnyis 'dug /rig gnas gsar brje'i skabs mchod rten dang gtsug lag khang gi sgrol ma ngo ma rtse med gtor bshig zin rung deng sang sgrol ma'i sku tshab 'dra zhig gsar skrun byas yod}
lha rje zla ba'i 'od zer|{'di nyid 'khon phu ba'i sras su rab byung gnyis pa'i chu yos (1123)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo gnyis la phabs skabs yum gshegs nas lha rje mas lo bcu'i bar du gsos/bcu drug la phebs skabs 'u yug gi zhang rgya ma ba/gangs pa she'u/rong zom chos kyi bzang po la sogs pa bsten nas gnas pa rgya chen mdzad/phyis yab dang a ne gnyis la dbang gdangs pa ma lus par zhus/gzhan bal por yang dza ya se na la sogs pa'i bla ma mang du bsten/yab kyi lugs bzhin du gdams ngag dbang bskur sde stong gi bshad pa gsum gyis yul dang yul rnams su gdul bya mtha' yas pa bskyangs/mkhas pa'i snyan pas stod lung rgya dmar ba la sogs pas kyang zhabs la gtugs/zang zing gi longs spyod pa mnga' brnyes pas yab dang a ne'i dgongs pa rdzogs thabs skye bo mang por sbyin gtong dang/dngul gyi gdung khang chen po gnyis bzhengs/bal yul du khyer nas khang gsar ba dza ya se na la rab gnas zhus/khong gis dbang bzhi rdzogs dang bcas pa'i rab gsal mdzad/slar bod du 'khor rnams kyis bsu ba rgya che mdzad de spyan drangs/bal yul du 'phags pa shin kun gyi gdugs lan mang du bkal/de nas gnas pa'i rnal 'byor ma grub pa'i rnal 'byor pa mang po bsdus nas tshogs kyi mod pa yang mang du mdzad pa sogs bstan pa'i bya ba rgya cher spel nas mthar dgung lo drug cu pa (1071) rab byung gsum pa'i chu stag (1182)lor sku gshegs}
lha gnyis brjes|{bod kyi lo rgyus thog bshad srol la/srong btsan sgam po sku 'das khar rgya bza' kong jos bod gyi blon 'bangs rnams la bod du mtha' dmag gi gnod pa mi 'ong ba'i ched du bal yul dang/rgya nag nas gdan drangs pa'i jo bo gnyis so so'i yul du rgyab bstan nas zhugs na phan thogs med pas ra mo che dang/gtsug lag khang gi jo bo gnyis bzhugs sa brjes dgos ra gsungs pa ltar brjes pa nas da lta'i bar de bzhin du gnas yod}
lha steng|{bar khams sa khul du yod pa'i karma pa lha steng gi dgon pa}
lha thugs rje chen po ka khyed rang lags mod|{lha thugs rje chen po dang spyan ras gzigs de ni khyed rang yin pa las gzhan dag yin}
lha tho tho ri gnyan btsan|{bod kyi btsan po'i gdung rabs nyi shu brgyad pa ste/'di'i 'khrungs lo la 'ga' zhig gis shing byi yin pa dang 'ga' zhig gis shing khyi yin pa sogs bshad tshul mi 'dra ba yod/jo nang tA ra nA thas mdzad pa'i (rgya gar chos 'byung )gi nang slob dpon dbyig gnyen gyi lo rgyus 'chad skabs bod kyi rgyal po lha tho tho ri gnyan btsan dang slob dpon 'di gnyis dus thog gcig yin par gsungs/(deb ther dkar po )las slob dpon dbyig gnyen gyi slob ma slob dpon phyogs kyi glang po dang bod kyi rgyal po srong btsan sgom po dus thog gcig yin par gsungs pa bcas brtag skabs dus thog mi mtshungs pa'i dogs gzhi chen po 'dug pas dpyad par zhu}
