lha drug|{don dam pa'i lha dang/sgra'i lha/mtshan ma'i lha/gzugs kyi lha/bsgom pa'i lha/rnam par dag pa'i lha}
lha gdong shan kha|{tshal gung thang don gcod khang khogs lha mthong shan kha ni de snga lha sa skyid chu'i lho byang bar 'grub pa skyel sgrol bya sa'i rgu kha gtso bo zhig yin cing/dbyar dus zla ba bdun ring ko ba gong ba dang/dgus dus zla ba lnga'i ring shing gru rta mgo can gtong gi yod/ko rgu'i do dam rnams sger shan kha bas byed cing/ko gru sgrol skabs gla cha che thog dus thog tu sgrol dka' bas chu khar snga po nas sgug sdod rgyun ring byed dgos stabs (chu mo lha mthong shan kha'i/gru la snga gru btang nas/_/gnas chen po ta la ru/_/nyi ma shar nas slebs byung/_/zhes dmangs gzhal bzos yod pa dang/bod rab byung bcu drug pa'i shing rta (1954)lor lha sa zam chen skrun stabs lha mthong shan kha'i gru gla ha cang 'phar stabs skyid chu'i lho byang du 'gro 'od byed mkhan la chi zing tshad med bzos shing/zam pa legs bsgrubs byung rjes ko grur ban mi dgos stabs ko gru'i bdag por bza' sgo 'gag nas kha la ku ru brgyab stabs rgyu mtshan de la brten nas lha sa skyid chu'i zab chen la ku ru zam pa zhes ming thogs}
lha 'dres brlams pa|{lha 'dre khog par zhugs pa la lha 'dres brlams pa zer}
lha ldan|{lha sa grong khyer gyi ming gi rnam grangs te go don ni lha shAkya mu ne dang thugs rje chen po rab byung lnga ldan bzhugs pa'i gnas yin pa'i don}
lha ldan 'phrul snang gi gan+d+ho la chen po'i khyams rwa|{(lha sa gtsug lag khang gi khyams ra)lha sa'i gtsug lag khang gi khyams ra chen mo 'di dang bar skor gnyis gtsug lag khang thog mar bzhengs dus med kyang/rje tsong (1072) kha pas lha ldan smon lam chen mo 'dzugs par gnang nye'i skabs sne gdong mi dbang grags pa rgyal mtshan la lha sa gtsug lag khang 'dir nyams gso legs po zhig gnang dgos pa'i zhu bskul mdzad pa ltar khong gis kyang sne'u rdzong dpon nam mkha' bzang po dang gzhis ka brag dkar ba sogs skyid shod dang 'phan po khul gyi rdzong dang gzhis stod rnams la bka' phab ste gnam yangs rdo rje'i ra ba ka ba bcug nyis thog mthun ka ba bcu khyams ka ba bcu bcas gsar btsugs dang nyang ser smad ri nas rdo phon chen drungs ta bar skong dang khyams kyi rdo bcal gsar brjes bcas bsgrubs shing de rjes tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas srid dbang bzhes rjes so gsum gyi ring gtsug lag khang gi khyams ra chen mor gzhi khyon che ba'i nyams gso dang gzhung sgo'i mdun du sgo 'phyor gsar gtod bar skor gyi chos 'phrul bco lnga'i ldebs bris dang khyams ra'i sangs rgyas stong sku'i ldebs bris bcas gsar bzhengs gnang de rjes sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho dang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa dang brgyad pa bcu gsum pa bcas kyis rim par nyams gso dang rgya bskyed gnang ba bcas zhib par 'a la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i (gsung 'bum pod (ca)pa'i nang )('phrul snang gtsug lag khang la nyams gso bgyis pa'i dkar chag )zhes par gsal}
