lha babs dus chen|{lo ltar bod zla dgu pa'i tshes nyer gnyis ni nyin dgung pa lha babs dus chen zhes sngon ston pa shAkya thub pa'i yum sgyu 'phrul ma lha yul du skye ba bzhes par chos gsungs phyir ston pa lha gnas sum cu rtsa gsum du phebs nas lha rnams la chos gsungs shing dbyar zhal bzhes kyis bzhugs par rgyal po gsal rgyal ston pa dran drag nas mo'u 'gal bu rgyud ston pa mi yul du byon par gsol ba na ston pa lha mi'i 'khor dang bcas te rdzu 'phrul gyis skas 'dzeg la brten nas 'phags yul gsal ldan du babs par mdzad pa'i dus chen yin pas bod zla dgu pa'i tshes shar nas pho brang po ta la dang gtsug lag khang che chung sogs la sku dkar sgron rjes grong khul gyi khang pa so sor yang sa dkar btang nas nag rtsi phyis pa sogs tshes nyer gcig gong tshar ba byas thog /de nyid bod mi tshos gtsug lag khang rnams su phyag mchod dang/dge 'dun la bsnyen bkur/ngan slong la sbyin gtos sogs byed kyi yod/gong gsal zla ba dang po chos 'phrul dus chen dang/bzhi pa sa ga zla ba/drug pa tshes bzhi/dgu pa lha babs dus chen bzhi bcas la ston pa'i dus chen rnam bzhi yang zer}
