lha brag kha ba blo gros ye shes|{'di nyid jo bo shAkya bkra shis dang skyo mo dar rgyan gyi sras su rab byung gsum pa'i lcags khyi (1190)lor bye chung du sku 'khrungs/lha 'gro ba'i mgon po'i zhabs la gtugs/sbas pa ston gzhon gyi yon tan bu pa gang byo'i tshul du mkhyen/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa bdun gdan sa mdzad/'gro ba'i don rgya chen po byung/dgung lo sum cu rtsa bdun gyi bar du bzhugs}
lha bris|{rang re'i bod 'dir gna' snga mo lo nyis stong lhag tsam gyi sngon nas ri mo 'bri ba'i lag rtsal dar yod pa ste/da yod kyi dpyad gzhi'i yig cha khag gzhir bzung na/spyi lo'i sngon gyi lo nyis brgya tsam gyi dus bod kyi rgyal po dang po gta' khri btsan po byung ba dang de'i pho brang yum bu lha mkhar bzhengs skabs ldebs bris su rgyal po gta' khri btsan po rang nyid mi bzhis gnya' bar khri byas te btegs nas rgyal por bskos tshul bris pa dang/rgyal po srong btsan sgam pos lha sa gtsug lag khang gsar bzhengs skabs ldebs bris su ro sgrung dang/gab tshig gi sgrung sna tshogs kyi ri mo dang/lha sa gtsug lag khang bzhengs pa'i lo rgyus dang/rgya bza' kong jo bod du phebs par rgyal blon 'bangs bcas kyis dga' bsu sne len ha cang rgyas (1074) po byas pa'i gnas tshul dang skabs de'i pho brang po ta la'i 'dra ris de rjes dus rabs brgyad pa'i dkyil du rgyal po khri srong lde btsan gyis srid dbang bzung rjes bsam yas gtsug lag khang bzhengs skabs gtsug lag khang gi 'khor sa'i mtha' bskor (bar khyams ka phibs )g.yas g.yon du bsam yas gtsug lag khang bzhengs pa'i lo rgyus dang lha khang bzhengs tshar ba'i dga' ston rten 'brel gyi zlos gar dang lus rtsal rigs mi 'dra ba sna tshogs byas pa'i gnas tshul rnams ldebs bris su bris yod pa'i nang nas khag gcig da lta'ang mthong rgyu yod de nas yon rgyal rabs kyi dus sa skya lha khang chen mo dang zha lu'i lha khang chen mo bzhengs skabs bris pa'i thang ka dang ldebs bris khag gcig dang ming rgyal rabs kyi rgyal rtse dpal 'khor chos sder bzhengs pa'i thang ka dang ldebs bris khag bcas ((bod kyi dus rabs rim pa'i mdzes rtsal ri mo phyogs bsdus )zhes pa'i brnyan dpar nang gzigs )de rjes ming rgyal rabs kyi gong ma yung los mtshur khu karma pa dang rje tsong kha par bod lugs kyi lha sku'i thags grub ma'i thang ka mang po zhig 'bul rgyu bskur ba (khag gcig bod rang skyong ljongs rig gnas do dam kha nas nyar tshags byas yod )nas bod kyi lha bris mkhas pa khag gcig gis rgya mi rigs kyi ri mo'i lag rtsal slob sbyong byed 'go tshugs shing de'i khyad chos ni gzhi rtsa'i thog mi rigs rang nyid kyi ri mo'i mdzes rtsal rgyun srol ma nyams pa gzhir bzung thog rgya bris kyi lag rtsal nang nas legs cha 'ga' zhig blangs te karma sgar bris dang gtsang bris khams bris dbus bris gsar rnying sogs lugs mi 'dra ba mang po byung tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa nas bdun pa'i bar gyi dus skabs der bod kyi ri mo'i lag rtsal yang rtser sod pa'i dus skabs yin dus skabs de'i ri mo'i mtshon byed ni pho brang dkar po dang dmar po'i tshoms chen dang gzim chung khag gi ldebs bris sku phreng bdun pas dngos su ljags bkod gnang nas bris pa'i pho brang dmar po'i blos bslangs khang gi ldebs bris bcas la gzigs tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa'i dus nas bzung bod kyi ri mo'i lag rtsal thog khag gnyis chags te khag gcig gis mi rigs rang nyid kyi khyad chos rgyun 'dzin byas pa dang khag gcig gis rang nyid kyi khyad chos la snang chung byas te tsi na'i rigs kyi ri mo'i lad zlos byas stabs lcam lags kyi 'gro stangs ma shes bu mo rang gi 'gro stangs yang shor 'dug zer ba'i gtam dpe ltar gyur yod pa ni skabs der bris pa'i ri mo khag gcig se 'bras gnyis dang nor bu gling khar yod pa rnams la gzigs na gsal po ta la'i pho brang dmar po gsar bzhengs skabs bod kyi ri mo'i lag rtsal mkhas pa yongs rdzogs bsdus pa'i nang rim pa bzhir phye 'dug rim pa dang po ni dbu chen yin zhing de'i las 'gan ni lha khang dang gzims chung khag gi ldebs bris dang lha sku'i thang ka gsung bar gser bris dang dngul bris khag gi dbu lha 'jim bzo dang 'bur sku khag gi skya ris su lag bstar byas nas bris dgos pa dang shin tshon khag gi btsabs dpar 'bri rgyu dang ri mo 'bri mkhan yongs rdzogs la zhib phra'i bkod 'doms bya rgyu bcas yin rim pa gnyis pa ni dbu chung yin cing des ldebs bris dang lha sku'i thang ka khag mang che ba rang nyid kyis lag bstar byas nas 'bri dgos pa'i thog dbu chen la rogs rab gyis las 'gan bsgrub rgyu yin rim pa gsum pa ni byings gras yin kho tshos dbu chen gyis bris pa'i skya bris dang btsabs dpar gzhir bzung nas shing tsho ri mo rnams 'bri rgyu dang tshon rtsi gtong dgos rim pa bzhi pa ni dkyus ma'i gras yin kho tshos spyir btang gi ri mo'i gras dang tshon gtong rgyu dang tshon byugs rgyu tshon (1075) 'dul rgyu tshon mdangs sna tshogs bzo rgyu tshon rtsi gtong rgyu bcas yin skabs der dbu chen mi gnyis (lho brag bstan 'dzin nor bu gsang sngags mkhar pa tshe 'phel/) dbu chung rong pa bsod nams rgyal po sogs mi lnga byings gras (rgyal rtse ba rgyal po sogs )mi grangs brgya dang drug cu re gcig dkyus ma'i gras (tshe ring dar rgyas sogs )mi grangs drug cu re gcig bcas yod}
