lha bla ma byang chub 'od|{stod kyi mgon gsum gyi rgyud pa/ha lam spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu gcig pa'i nang 'khrungs/'di nyid kyi yab 'khor re'i sras lha lde ('di nyid kyi yab srong nge yin zhes pa'ang snang )yin zhing/rab tu byung nas mtshan byang chub 'od ces gsol/byang chub 'od kyis khu bo lha blam ye shes 'od btson nas 'dod phyir dbus gtsang gi rab tu byung ba rnams la gsham thab gyi khral dang/bod khams gling dgu'i 'bangs la gser gyi khral mo che thengs gsum bsdus/phyag rdzas yod rgu gser du bsgyur nas khu bo blu bar gar log tu phebs rung/khu bos khong nyid btson nas 'don ma dgos par gser de rnams khyer de rgya gar nas jo bo rje gdan 'dren zhus te sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa dar 'phel gtong dgos pa'i bka' gnang ba bzhin byang chub 'od kyis nag lo tsA ba tshul khrims rgyal ba sogs jo bo rje gdan 'dren par mngags/jo bo rje bod du phebs skabs lha bla ma byang chub 'od kyis rta dkar mi dkar sum brgya tham pas gdugs dang rgyal mtshan ba dan la sogs pa'i mchod rdzas thogs te phebs bsur bcar/de bzhin glu gar dang bkra shis pa'i shis pa brjod pa sogs gzab cing rgyas pa'i bsu ba zhus/de'i skabs sngar med pa'i rag dung gsar du bzos te jo bo spyan 'dren pa'i phyir 'bud pa de nas bod du dung chen 'bud srol dar la dung chen de la lo paN spyan 'dren pa'i dung chen zhes grags/de skabs lha bla ma byang chub yod kyis jo bo rjer zhu rten du gser mang po phul nas thog mar gnad don gsum bka' 'dra zhus pa ste/sangs rgyas kyi bstan pa la rim gyis 'jug pa lags sam cig car du 'jug pa lags/dge slong gis rdo rje sngags kyi dngos dbang gong ma rnam gnyis blang du rung mi rung zhes zhus pa'i lan du/jo bos/rim gyis yin gsungs nas lam sgron mdzad/skyabs 'gro dang lta ba bka' btags kyi phyag rgya bzhi yod med yin/gsang ba shes rab ye shes ni tshangs par spyod pas blang bar mi bya zhes gsungs so/_/lha bla ma byang chub 'od 'di'i sku ring la lo chen rin chen bzang pos dam pa'i chos mang po bsgyur ba dang/'di nyid kyi sku tshe'i smad la pu hrengs pa zhang chung btsun gsal shes rab la bka' bsgos nas yul dbus kyi paN+Di ta shrI badzra bo d+hi dang/lo tsA ba gyi jo zla ba'i 'od zer gyis dus 'khor dang/ma rgyud 'ga' zhig kyang bsgyur yod do/_/'di'i lo rgyus zhib pa gu ge mkhan chen ngag dbang grags pas mdzad pa'i (mnga' ris chos 'byung )las gsal}
lha bla ma ye shes 'od|{'di nyid kyi yab mnga' ris gu ge'i rgyal po bkra shis mgon gyi sras che chung gnyis kyi chung ba yin/thog mar chung dus kyi mtshan la srong nge zer zhing/rjes su rgyal po byas pa'i mtshan la khri lde srong gtsug btsan zer/rje 'di nyid bod shing glang (965)lor sku 'khrungs shing/sku tshe'i stod la khab bzhes te sras nA ga rA dza dang d+he wa rA dza gnyis 'khrungs/phyis (1076) yab mes kyi yig tshang gzigs pas thugs skyo nas rab tu byung bas mtshan lha bla ma ye shes 'od ces gsol ye shes 'od kyis me sprel (996)lor mnga' ris mtho sting gser gyi lha khang bzhengs de rjes rin chen bzang po la sogs pa'i khye'u blo rno ba nyi shu rtsa gnyis rgya gar (kha che'i yul zhes pa'ang snang )du gser mang po bskur te chos slob tu btang ba'i nga nas bcu dgu rgya gar du tshad pas grongs lo chen rin chen bzang po dang lo chung legs pa'i shes rab gnyis kyis mdo sngags kyi chos mang po bslabs te bod du phebs nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang po bsgyur cing zhus nas gtan la phab lha bla mas kyang rgya gar nas paN+Di ta kha shas spyan drangs te bod du bzhugs pa'i mdo rgyud dgongs 'grel gsung rab khag la dag ther dang kha shas gsar du bsgyur bsgyur zin pa rnams dag bcos dang bcas 'chad nyan gyis gtan la dbab pa sogs rgyal bstan rin po che dar zhing rgyas phyir 'bad brtson med po mdzad khyad par du sku tshe smad la jo bo chen po bod du spyan 'dren pa'i thugs 'dun drag pos lo tsA ba rgya brtson 'grus seng ge la gser rten mang por bskul te bod phrug bcu gcig gis grogs dang bcas rgya gar nas jo bo gdan 'dren gyi zhu 'phreng gser rten dang bcas pho nya mngags jo bo chen pos zhal bzhes ma mdzad rkyen skabs der bod du spyan 'dren ma thub de'i rkyen la ban nas slar yang jo bo spyan 'dren gnyis pa bzhu rgyu'i thugs 'dun rtse gcig gi ngang der rgyal srid ni gcung por gtad zin stabs sku ngo mas gser 'tshol bar phebs skabs gar log dang 'thab pa'i dmag dpon du byon pas g.yul ngor pham ste btson khang du shor gcung pos khu bo'i sku srog blu bar phebs skabs gar log nas lus kyi ljid tsam dang mnyam pa'i gser byung na phyir gtong zer ba sogs mnar gcod la brten nas dbon sras rnams kyis gser mang du btsal bas sku lus tsam gyi gser 'byor yang dbu'i ljid tsam ma long pas 'gor yun ring stabs btson khang gi sgo 'gram du khu bo lha btsun gyi zhal mjal tsam byung dus khu bo'i bka' slob la da ni kho bo na tshod mtho ba'i khar lus kyi rtsa sgo thams cad gar log nas mer bsregs zin pas btson khang 'di nas thon kyang bstan 'gro'i don yong ba ni shin tu dka' khyed tshos gser 'tshol ba rnams cha rkyen byas te jo bo chen po nges par gdan 'dren thub pa gyis zhes gsungs te ring por ma lon par btson khang nang sengs bskyed rlabs po che'i thugs smon mtshams sbyor dang bcas dgung lo bdun cu yas mas la sku gshegs rjes su tsha ba lha btsun byang chub 'od nas sku gdung de thog mar mtho lding gser khang gi lha khang du gdan drangs nas gdung rten dang bcas te bzhugs jo bo chen po mtho lding kha lha du bzhugs skabs thugs smon mtshams sbyar dang bar gnas mang po mdzad rjes su tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa'i dus gor bod sder gzar skabs gor Shas bod la btsan 'dzul byas te dgon pa lha khang mang po gtor nas sku gdung 'di yang rdzong dga' chos sde nas gyar stabs rdo ring bstan 'dzin dpal 'byor gyis rtse pho brang du gdan drangs te tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bun pa'i gser gdung bkra shis 'od bar gyi g.yas phyogs su bzhugs sugasol sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i sku gdung der dngul gdung la gser sbyang gi sgo khyim can gsar skrun nyams gso gnang nas da ltar yang pho brang po ta lar bzhugs 'di'i lo rgyus zhib par gu ge mkhan chen ngag dbang grags pas mdzad pa'i (mnga' ris chos 'byung )las gsal}
lha blo gros 'od|{rje 'di nyid yab mnga' bdag grags rin chen dang yum lha gcig rdo rje'i sras su rab byung bzhi pa'i shing bya (1225)lor 'khrung/dgung lo (1077) gzhon nu'i dus lo tsA ba grags pa rgyal mtshan dang slob dpon kun dga' sogs las dbang gdams ngag mang du gsan de nas zur khang pa las dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa mnos mkhan po lhag ru ba dang sbas pa ston gzhon gnyis kyis mkhan slob mdzad nas rab tu byung dgung lo nyi shu pa la mkhan slob de gnyis las bsnyen par rdzogs zur khang pa las gzhung gdams ngag ma lus par gsan bye brag du blo sbyong don bdun ma sogs grags pa dang ma grags pa'i snyan brgyud dang kha che paN chen nas brgyud pa'i gdams pa zab mo rnams gsan sbas pa stong gzhon las sher phyin gyi skor dang mkhan po gzhon tshul las 'dul ba'i skor gsan dgung la nyi shu rtsa bdun la phebs pa lcags phag (1251)lor spyil bu'i gdan sar phebs phur khang pas dung rin po che dang 'phel gdung dang shA ri'i bu'i lhung bzed dang nA ro'i rus rgyan dang jo bo rje'i phyag dril dang phyag rdor dang po ta la sogs gtsug lag khang rnams kyi lde mig gnang spyir gdan sa lo bzhi bcu'i bar du bskyangs dgung lo drug cu re drug la phebs par rab byung lnga pa'i lcags stag (1290)lor sku gshegs}
