lha btsun dar rgyas no mon han|{a lag sha mkhan po sku phreng dang po 'di nyid la mtshan gzhan tho yon no mon han dang/lha btsun ngag dbang rdo rje/lha btsun lhun grub dar rgyas/lha btsun paN+Di ti sogs su 'bod/rje 'di nyid a lag sha'i shing kun ta le tsab bur o su zer ba'i yul du yab badzra the ci dang yum rnam 'joms gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing lug (1715)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo gnyis kyi steng rgyal dbang tshangs dbyangs pa mchog a lag shar byon skabs thugs brtse ba chen pos sde srid sangs rgyas kyi sku skye ngos bzung mdzad/chung dus nas rje tshangs dbyangs pa mchog gis gam bcar du 'jog gnang mdzad cing thugs kyi sras gcig tu bskyangs/rgyal ba'i drung las rab byung dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa legs par mno/mdo sngags kyi gzhung la thos bsam rgya che mdzad pas rje nyid kyi thugs sras su gyur/dgung lo nyi shu'i steng rje 'di nyid kyi bka' dgongs ltar dbus su slob gter du phebs nas pan chen blo bzang ye shes kyi drung du bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa mnos/'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang du zhugs/lo gsum nas rang yul du phyir phebs rjes rje tshangs dbyangs pa'i drung du mchod g.yog zhabs phyi sgrub cing chos bka' mnos/rje tshangs dbyangs pa sku gshegs rjes slar yang 'bras spungs dgon par phebs nas phur chog byams pa rim po che sogs mkhas pa'i dbang po mang po'i zhabs la gtugs nas mdo sngags gzhung la gsan bsam rgya cher gnang zhing lha rams grwa skor mdzad de mkhas pa'i grags pa rgyas/rgyal dbang bdun pas a ri lug san ser ti ni no mon han gyi cho lo bstsal cing/rtse rnam rgyal grwa tshang gi mkhan po mdzad/de nas bzung ste 'di pa'i 'khrungs rgyud rim byon la a lag shan mkhan po zhes kyang 'bod/thu'u bkwan rin po ches lha btsun paN+Di ta zhes bsngags brjod rgya cher mdzad/dus phyis rgyal dbang bcu gsum pas rje 'di pa'i gsung rtsom gzigs nas thugs dgyes shing paN+Di ta'i cho lo bstsal/gsum rtsom la mtshon na/rgyal ba tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho'i gsang ba'i rnam thar )dang/('khrul 'khor lcags mkhar sbyin sreg skor )sogs kyi yig cha mang du mchis/sku tshe'i mjug tu a lag sha wang dang 'gal ba byung nas btson du lhung skabs gsung rtsom mang po zhig thu'u bkwan gyis bdag skyong mdzad par grags/tshangs dbyangs pa sku gshegs khar dpa' ris yar lung dgon pa (1079) skyong ba'i 'khur gtad pas yar lung gi mkhan khrir bzhugs te chos srid gnyis tshul bzhin du bskyangs rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me byi (1756)lor rje ngag dbang lhun grub dar rgyas pas a lag shar chos rdo chen po pA ring khe dgon phan bde rgya mtsho'i gling ngam dga' ldan bstan rgyas gling btab tshangs dbyangs pa'i sprul sku btsal cing gdan sar bkod sprul sku thub bstan rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin du bzhugs bod sog gi yul du bstan srid kyi 'phrin las rgyas shing mtshan snyan che bas wang gi sku 'khor gras kyi nag phyogs pa skor cig phrag dog dang sdang sems kyis phra ma bcug pas rje nyid btson du btsun nas dgung lo re drug pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags byi (1780)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
lha btsun pa byang chub 'od|{de'i skor gong du lha bla ma byang chub 'od ces par gzigs}
lha btsun sprul sku blo bzang thub bstan dge legs rab rgyas|{lha btsun blo bzang thub bstan dge lags bar rgyas ni rab byung bco lnga pa'i chu lug (1883)lor stag rtse rdzong khungs thang dkar grong tsho'i nye 'gram du sku 'khrungs shing mgron che bstan pa dar rgyas dang sku mched yin/ser smad gzhung pa lha btsun sprul sku'i sku skyer ngos 'dzin thog chos zhugs kyis se ra tshogs chen sprul sku'i thob thang bzhes te sku yon gsan bzhes dang/mtshan rtags sogs gnang/rgyal dbang sku phreng bcu gsum pa dang/stag brag ngag dbang gsung rab sogs las gsung chos mang du gsan zhing khong rnam gnyis bla ma'i gtso bor mdzad pa dang/paN chen sku phreng dgu pa sogs bla ma mang po bsten/tA la'i blam sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i chibs zhabs su sog yul dang/rgya nag tu phebs/phyi sog gi dga' ldan theg chen gling du yun ring bzhugs nas de ga'i khri ba mdzad pa dang/bod du dbang lung gi rgyun chad nyer thug pa'i zab chos mang po'i rgyun gsan nas lha sar phyir phebs kyis chos 'khor mang po bskor/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu bzhi pa'i yongs 'dzin gling rin po ches kyang khong gi drung nas dus 'khor gyi dbang chen sogs gsan nas tA la'i bla ma dang/khri byang rin po che sogs la gnang/rab byung bcu drug pa'i me bya (1957)lor rgya tsha rdzong khongs su yod pa'i chos 'khor rgyal dgon pa nyams gso byed skabs lha klu spo chog gi cho ga dang/zhabs brtan gyi dbu bzhugs su phebs/grub mtha' ris ma phye ba'i blam du ma bstan nas chos phyogs su gsan rgya che zhing sa dge bka' rnying gang ci'i phyag len mdzad kyi yod la tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu bzhi pas kyang dgyes mnyes chen pos chos phyogs kyi bka' 'dri dang nang ma'i bka' mol lhug por gsungs/rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa phag (1959)lo'i skabs su se 'bras dge gsum gyi bla sprul yongs kyi mtshan tho dang pa yin 'dug /krung go nang bstan mthun tshogs bon yan lag tshogs pa'i las 'dzin mdzad de paN chen sku phreng bcu pas kyang gus bkur chen po gnang/rig gnas gsar brje zer ba'i nang khong la rdung rdeg phog cing rab byung bcu drug pa'i me lug (1967)lor dgung grangs brgyad cu gya lnga'i steng sku gshegs/skabs bcu gcig pa'i krung u tshang 'dzoms gros tshogs thengs gsum pa tshogs rjes mi rigs dang/chos lugs/'thab phyogs gcig gyur gyi srid ngus don 'khyor byed skabs srid gzhung nas khong la dag thel dang 'brel mya ngan gyi tshogs 'du yang 'tshogs so/_}
lha btsun blo bzang bstan 'dzin rgyal mtshan|{rab byung bcu gcig pa'i sa yos (1639)lor sog po'i dpon rigs kyi dud tshang zhig tu 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga thog nam mkha' bsod nams grags pa'i mdun dbang zhus/mtshan chos kyi rdo rje gsol/dgung lo drug par (1080) rje blo bzang yar 'phel bsten nas klog dang sbyor sdeb blo 'dzin gnang dgung lo bdun la blo bzang yar 'phel drung dge bsnyen bsgrubs mtshan blo bzang bstan 'dzin rgyal mtshan zhes gsol skabs der paN chen blo bzang chos rgyan mchog gis rje 'di nyid grub chen rje dpon legs tshogs lhun grub kyi sku skyer ngos 'dzin mdzad de nas chos rgyal 'phrin las rgya mtsho bla/ mar bu sten nas dbang lung khrid sogs gsan 'phan yul sman pa kun dga' byang chub sa nas gso rig dang skar rtsis sog yog sogs gsan bzhes gnang de rjes dbus gtsang du phebs 'bras spungs su rgyal dbang lnga pa dang mjal te 'jigs byed sogs kyi chos gsan chos lugs ris med kyi dgon sde khag la gnas mjal mdzad bkra shis lhun por paN chen thams cad mkhyen pa dang mjal bkras lhun rgyud pa grwa tshang du chos zhugs gnang nas gnang gas kyi gzhung la gsan sbyong mdzad dgung lo nyi shu par paN chen blo bzang chos rgyal gyi drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs de nas sog yul du phebs te dgon gsar bkra shis dge 'phel gling du bzhugs mkhan chen chos kyi rgyal po blo bzang bstan 'dzin rgyal mtshan gyi gzhung 'bum las gsol 'debs sogs thor bu'i skor (rdo rje 'jigs byed kyi zhi ba'i sbyin sreg ngag 'don du bya ba'i rim pa/) (gtor chen drug cu'i lag len ngag 'don gsar bar bkod pa gnam lcags spu gri/) (rjes gnang gi skor/) (rje btsun sgrol ma'i cho ga 'chi med bdud rtsi )zhes bya ba (rtsis gzhung blang dor gsal ba'i 'od zer )de'i bdag 'jug bkra shis dang bcas pa sogs bstan bcos pa 'ga' zhig ljags rtsom mdzad dgung grangs lnga bcu rtsa grangs te rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i 'go tsam du sku gshegs}
lha btsun blo bzang nor bu shes rab|{rje 'di nyid rab byung bcu gcig pa'i me sbrul (1677)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo dgu la phebs pa shing glang (1685)lor 'phags pa brtson 'grus bzang po'i drung du dge bsnyen dang rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyi shur phebs pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me byi (1696)lor ba dpon blo bzang dam pa dpal bzang po'i drung nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/dgung lo nyi shu rtsa bdun la phabs pa rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i chu lug (1703)lor ma ha tsi na'i yul grur phebs te mkhan po bka' 'gyur ba blo bzang tshul khrims kyi drung du dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes/chos rje blo bzang zhi ba bsten nas mdo sngags kyi chos mang du gsan/'chad rtsod rtsom gsum la mkhas pa'i go 'phang brnyes/phyag rtsom la mtshon na/(rdo rje sems dpa'i bsgom bzlas bya tshul/) (bcom ldan 'das rdo rje mi 'khrugs pa'i cho ga /) (dpal rdo rje rnam par 'joms pa'i cho ga /) (jo lugs sgrol dkar yid bzhin 'khor lo'i sgrub thabs/) (nA ro mkha' spyod/) (bde mchog lhan skyes/) (don zhags lha lnga ba ri lugs kyi sgrub thabs/) (yi dam rgya mtsho'i sgrub thabs rin chen 'byung gnas kyi lhan thabs gsal ba'i me long/) (zab pa dang rgya che ba'i dam pa'i chos kyi thob yig gsal sgron )zhes bya ba sogs mdo sngags kyi bka' rtsom pod bdun tsam bzhugs/mdzad rnam zhib padang 'das ma ma gsal}
lha rtse ye shes chos 'phel|{rje 'di ni lha rtse yul du yab khyim bdag phun tshogs dang yum bu khrid gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa rta (1798)lor 'khrungs/dgung lo lnga la lha chos dga' ldan gling gi chos grwar zhugs nas mkhan po ye shes chos 'phel nas skra phud bzhes/dgung lo brgyad la gong gi mkhan po'i drung nas rab byung gi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan ye shes chos 'phel du bstsal/slob dpon thogs med grags pa tshul bzhin (1081) bsten nas yi ge klog pa dang chos spyod sogs thugs 'dzin mdzad de nas 'dul mdzod dbu phar bzhi'i rtsa ba dang 'don cha sogs rgyugs phul dgung lo bcu gnyis skabs nas thun drug rnal 'byor kyi thugs brtson mdzad dgung lo bcu bzhi'i thog slob dpon blo bzang mgon po'i drung nas gzhi dus skye shi bar do gsum dang las dus sku gsum sogs kyi khrid zhus phyin chad snyoms chung sdod mkhas kyi srog 'tsho'i 'tsho bar brten nas stobs bzhi'i phyag 'bum dang sngon 'gro khrid chen bzhi lan mang gsog par mdzad dgung lo bcu bdun la lha sar phebs skabs rgyal dbang tshul khrims rgya mtsho la mjal phyag zhus jo shAkya rnam gnyis dang se 'bras sogs la gnas gzigs kyis bkras lhun brgyud ngam rim du phyir phebs nas chos sder grwa skor zin rjes rab 'byams pa'i mtshan btags bzhes dgung lo nyer dgu'i thog rje btsun bla ma blo bzang dpal ldan bstan pa'i nyi ma dpal bzang po'i sku mdun nas dge slong gi sdom pa bzhes dgung lo sum cu'i thog ngam ring dgon du tshogs yongs la gsang bde 'jigs gsum gyi dbang sogs gnang dgung lo so lnga'i thog bde chen ri khrod du phebs nas rta mgrin gyi ljags brnyed dang sngon 'gro'i khrid chen la thugs brtson drag po mdzad dgung lo re gsum la lha sa dang bsam yas mjal bar phebs skabs lha ldan du zhag shas bzhugs ring 'bras gtsang pa rdo rje 'chang gi mchog sprul dang tshe gling nyi thang sprul sku sogs la 'jigs byed kyi rjes gnang bstsal rtsom pa la mtshon na (lam rim bla ma rgyud pa'i rnam thar mdor bsdus/) (grub thob brgyad cu'i rtogs brjod bsdus don dngos grub gter mdzod/) ('khrungs rabs so bzhi'i bris thang 'bri tshul dang 'brel ba'i rnam bshad mdor bsdus/) (theg chen blo sbyong gi zin bris/) (sgrub thabs rin chen 'byung gnas kyi rjes gnang ge bca' gzhi gshoms tshul mdor bsdus/) (gsan yig rin chen gter mdzod )sogs po ti 'bring ba gcig tsam bzhugs sku tshe'i smad du bkras lhun brgyad bde chen ri khrod du phebs nas thugs dam kho nar gzhol dgung lo don gsum la phebs par byung bco lnga pa'i lcags rta (1870)lor sku gshegs}
lha tshe ring po|{sangs rgyas chos lugs kyi gzhung nas bshad pa'i mi khom pa brgyad kyi nang tshan zhig dang/gzugs khams gnas ris bcu bdun gyi nang gses bsam gtan bzhi pa'i 'bras bu chen ba'i phyogs gcig na gnas pa'i lha zhig yin cing/'dis ting nge 'dzin sgom pa'i yun gcig la bskal pa khri phrag mang po'i dus tshod yod par bshad}
lha rdzas nang mdzod nyin mo bde legs|{man ching rgyal rabs kyi gong ma yung Ting nas 'go tshugs te gsar du bzos pa'i kha btags nang mdzod zur btags kyi sne gnyis su bod yig gi tshig bcad/nyin mo bde legs mtshan bde legs/nyin mo'i gung yang bde legs shing/_/nyin mtshan rtag tu bde legs pa'i/_/dkon mchog gsum gyi bkra shis shog /ces thags ris su yod pa/ring thung mi tshad lon pa 'dom gsum gyi tsham tsam yod pa zhig ste yongs grags su nang mdzod nyin mo bde legs zer ba de yin/dper na lha rdzas srid du ring ba kha gru ma nyams pa bde legs kyi re kha can zhes pa lta bu'o/_}
lha zhing|{de snga dmangs gtso'i bcos sgyur gong grong gseb khul gyi ser srung zhabs rim gyi 'gro gron gtong byed kyis zhing zhig yin pa dang/de'ang bogs mar btang nas sa bogs bsdu len byed/ched spyod sa zhing de rigs med pa'i gzhis khag gi ser srung zhabs rim gyi 'gro gron rnams yul tsho spyi thog nas bsdu sgrub byed du 'jug pa yin}
lha zhol gyi chab sgo|{rtse po ta la'i zhol gyi gzhung sgo dang/ (1082) ltag sgo}
lha zhol gyi chab sgo shar ma|{rtse po ta la'i zhol la gzhung sgo chen po bzhi yod pa las/sgo shar ma}
lha zhol gyi bya ba'i sne mo 'dzin pa|{sngar lha sa zhol las khungs kyi gnyer pa ste/ming bsdus na/zhol gnyer zer zhing/lha sa'i gling bskor phyi'i khongs su gtogs pa'i rkun ma mi gsod sogs kyi khrims gcod byed pa po yin}
lha bzhi|{tshangs pa/khyab 'jug /dbang phyug /ne rany+dza na}
lha bzang khang|{(yongs grags su rgyal po lha bzang zer )gu shri han gyi bu che ba bstan 'dzin dwa yan la bu drug (rat+na dA le'i han/me rgan no yon/pe li blo bzang phun tshogs/dge 'dun me rgan no yon/bsod nams mgon po/bsod nams bkra shis bcas drug )gi cheb rat+na dA le'i han nam/dkon mchog dwa li'i han la bu gnyis (bstan 'dzin dbang rgyal/lha bzang klu dpal )yod pa'i chung ba lha bzang klu dpal lam yongs grags su lha bzang khang zer/'dis sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho dang mnyam sbrel gyis log nyis lhag tsam dang rang nyid rkyang pas lo bcu gnyis tsam bod sa gnas kyi srid dbang bzung zhing/sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho dang mthun sgril ma byung bar rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i shing bya (1705)lo'i smon lam chen mo'i skabs rgyal po lha bzang gi zhabs gras drung 'khor khag gcig dang da srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i zhabs gras drung 'khor khag gcig rtsod gleng byung skabs lha bzang gis g.yog pas sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i drung 'khor drag gras kha shas dmar gsod btang rkyen sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos lha bzang la srid dbang med pa bzos te 'dam gzhung du rgyang phud btang/go skabs de dang bstun nas rgyal po lha bzang gis rang gi mnga' khongs 'dam gzhung tsho khag brgyad dang/mtsho sngon nas dmag gra bsgrigs te sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshor tshur rgol gyis dgra sha len rtsis byas shing/da srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos kyang sog po jun gar rgyal po dga' ldan bstan 'dzin la gsang ba'i thog nas 'brel gtugs byas thog jun gar gyi dmag dpung mtsho sngon du drangs nas rgyal po lha bzang la tshur rgol byed pa dang bstun nas bod dbus gtsang khri skor bcu gsum gyi dmag dpung bskul te dmag dpung khag gnyis kyi bar du rgyal po lha bzang gi dmag shugs ske btsir btang nas lha bzang gi srid dbang stobs shugs bod nang mthar skrod btang rgyu'i jus gzhi bting/'on kyang skabs der jun gar gyi rgyal po dga' ldan bstan 'dzin dang/khal kha rje btsun dam pa gnyis bar dmag 'khrugs langs te jun gar gyi rgyal po dga' ldan 'dzin gyis rgyal po lha bzang la dmag 'dren rgyu'i stobs tshugs kyis ma sdang bar brten sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho'i dmag jus kyi 'char gzhir sgrub ma thub pa red/der brten gnas sa ser 'bras dge gsum gyis rgyal po lha bzang dang sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho gnyis dbar 'dum 'grig byas te sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos sde srid gdongs pa zhu rgyu dang bod sa gnas kyi srid dbang yongs rdzogs rgyal po lha bzang gi lag tu sprod rgyu byas nas gnas skabs ring 'grigs tsam byung yod/de'i rgyu mtshan ni/gdan sa ser 'bras dge gsum gyi nang grwa pa mang che bas sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshor dga' zhen byed kyi yod pa dang chos lugs kyi phyogs zhen chen po yod pa'i grwa pa khag gcig gi sde srid sangs rgya rgya mtsho ni dge lugs par dpal 'byor thog nas ha cang gis drin chen yin kyang sems kyi gting la rnying ma'i chos lugs la dad pa chen po yod mkhan zhig yin pa dang/rgyal po bzang ni dge lugs par dad pa che ba ma zad/kho rang gi rtsa ba'i bla ma yang paN chen er ti ni sku phreng lnga pa blo bzang ye shes/'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng dang po ngag dbang brtson 'grus yin par brten rgyal po (1083) lha bzang la dga' zhen che ba las sde srin sangs rgyas rgya mtshor dga' zhen byed kyi med pa der thug yod de rjes lha bzang dang sde srid gnyis bar rtsa ba'i 'gal ba thag gcod byung med stabs slar yang gong gsal lo de'i ston ka rgyal po lha bzang gis dmag dpung khag gnyis khrid de lha bzang rang gnyid kyis sde khrid pa'i dmag dpung de 'phan po brgyud nas lha sar yong zhing lha bzang gi btsun mo tshe dbang rgyal mos (yig cha gzhan nang rgyal mo tshe ring bkra shis zhes pa'ang snang )sne khrid pa'i dmag dpung khag gcig stod du phu brgyud nas lha sar yo bder sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos dbus gtsang khri skor bcu gsum gyi dmag dpung bsdus nas rgol lan slob kyang nus pa ma thon par pham nyes byung mthar lha sa gtsang po'i thog ko grub btang nas chu shul gong dkar rdzong du bros shing nyin shas song mtshams tA la'i bla ma sku phreng drug pa tshangs dbyangs rgya mtshos se 'bras dge gsum gyi mkhan po rnams la rgyal po lha bzang gi sar song nas sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshor srog skyon mi yong ba'i ngo chen bar dpang byed dgos pa'i bka' phab pa ltar se 'bras dge gsum gyi mkhan po tshos de'ip+sakor gros bsdus byed skabs bsam 'char 'dra min sna tshogs byung te yun ring 'gor zhing mthar skabs de'i 'bras spungs sgo mang mkhan po 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa sku phreng dang po ngag dbang brtson 'grus kyis gros thag bcad pa ltar ler 'bras dge gsum gyi mkhan po dang dga' ldan khri pa'i sku tshab bcas nas stong lung phur 'gro mus su sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho rang nyid chu shul gong dkar rdzong nas thon te rgyal po lha bzang gi btsun mo tshe dbang rgyal pos sne khrid pa'i dmag dpung gi gdong bsus nas mgo btags zhu bar song yang skabs der bar dpang byed mkhan ser 'bras dge gsum gyi mkhan po tshos rjes ma zin pa'i thog btsan mo tshe dbang rgyal mos sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtsho mig gis mthong ma thag dri ba dri lan tsam yang ma byas par mgul bregs nas bkrongs de rjes lha bzang gis sde srid kyi sras ngag dbang rin chen rgya nag tu phyir 'bud dang sras gzhan pa dmag zor tshe ring po ta la'i mdun thang gtsang po'i 'gram du bkrongs (sa der de'i dran gso lta bur dmag zor rdo phung zhes btsugs yod/) sde srid sangs rgyal rgya mtsho bkrongs pa'i la de nas lo bcu gnyis ring lha bzang rang nyid rkyang pas srid dbang bzung thog lha bzang nas sde srid sangs rgyas rgya mtshos ngos 'dzin zhus pa'i tA la'i bla ma sku phreng drug pa sangs rgyas mtsho ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pa'i yang srid ngo ma min pa dang yang srid ngo ma tsha ba dpa' shod nas yin pa'i sprang po zhig gi phru gu ngag dbang ye shes rgya mtsho zer ba de yin tshul sogs 'khod pa'i zhu yig gong ma khang shis la phul ba ltar gong ma khang shis nas bka' phab ste pad+ma bri cha'i chi sogs dpon rigs khag gcig lha sar yong nas rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me khyi (1706)lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng drug pa tshangs dbyangs rgya mtsho po tA la'i khri thog nas phab te nyin shas ring lha klu'i spro khang nang du do dam btson 'jug byas de skabs ser 'bras dge gsum 