lha lung dpal rdor|{(chos 'byung mkhas pa'i dga' ston )nang lha lung dpal gyi rdo rje 'brom thod gung ma cher 'khrungs zhes sogs gsal zhing/lha lung dpal gyi rdo rje ni spyi lo'i dus rabs brgyad pa yas mas su 'brom thod gung mo cher sku 'khrungs/skya ming du stag nya bzang zhes zer zhing/rgya bod kyi sa mtshams srung ba'i dmag dpon mdzad/bi ma la mi T+palas rab tu byung nas mtshan dpal gyi rdo rjer btags/slob dpon pad+ma sam b+ha nas byang sems kyi sdom pa zhus/grib gyi dkar mo rong du sgom la zhugs skabs chos gos rlung gis 'khyer ba'i rjes su stegs te brag yar par byon nas sgong zhing bzhugs pas thugs dam gyi rten shAkya thub pa sogs bzhengs/dpal gyi rdo rje'i slob ma sog po dpal gyi gzhon nu sogs mi bcu gsum grub pa thob/spyi lo'i dus rabs dgu pa'i nang btsan po glang dar mas chos snub skabs lha lung dpal rdor gyis lha sar byon nas btsan po glang dar rdo ring gi yi ge klog pa'i skabs dang bstun nas dma' phebs te btsan po bkrongs nas mdo smad (mtsho sngon )du bros te bsgom brgyab nas bzhugs/spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu bzhi nang bla chen dgongs pa rab gsal rab tu byung skabs kyang lha lung dpal rdor 'tshob zhugs yod tshul sogs chos 'byung 'ga' zhig tu gsal/gong gsal lha lung dpal rdol gyi 'khrungs yul ni deng sang brom thod shang snyan rong zhes pa'i nye 'dabs su gur pa zhes pa'i sa cha zhig yod pa de yin nam snyam}
lha lung ri khrod|{brag ri khug gi lha lung ri khrod ni de snga lha lung dpal rdor bzhugs myong ba'i brag phug cig yod sar dus rabs bcu dug pa'i dus mjug tu gnas chung sku brten shAkya yar 'phel gyis ri khrod btab ste grwa grangs 15btsugs/dgon bdag gnas chung grwa tshang yin}
lha sa|{'di la jo bo a ti sha'i rnam thar nang chos 'khor dpal gyi lha sa zhes 'khod pa ltar na jo bo rje bod du byon pa'i dus su yang lha sa zhes pa'i ming yod mus yin pa mthong thub/'on kyang btsan pa'i dus su sa ra zhes 'bod pa mang zhing lha sa gtsug lag khang bdun gyi dbon zhang rdo ring gi ngos shar ma'i mjug tu/lha sa'i shar phyogs sbra stod tshal zhes 'khod pa des rgyal po khri ral pa can gyi dus su lha sa zhes kyang 'bod srol byung 'dug pas/ming gi 'gyur ba de 'dra ga dus byung ba dang/de'i rgyu (1089) mtshan gang yin pa bcas zhib 'jug bya dgos}
lha sa mkhar brag|{(lha sa'i shar phyogs sku 'bum thang gi dkyil du yod ces mkhas pa 'ga' zhig gis gsungs )lo rgyus 'ga' zhig gi nang lha khang 'di rgyal po srong btsan sgom po'i btsun ma mi nyag bzas bzhengs pa yin zhes gsal yang lha sa mkhar brag ni rgyal po khri lde gtsug brtan gyis bzhengs pa'i lha khang lnga'i gras yin pas bshad tshul de ma dag pa zhig yin}
lha sa gnyer tshang las khungs|{de snga bod sag nas srid gzhung gi sham 'og las khungs shig ste/las khungs 'di tshugs yul shing ra'i lho rgyud nyis thog steng du yod/las khungs 'di'i do dam mi sna dang las byed rtse drug gcig dang/shod drung gnyis ('di thog mar rim pa lnga pa'i las tshan par bsko srol yang rjes su rim pa bzhi par gnang sbor byas )drung yig drung tog yod pa gcig /gnyer tshang nang zan nyi shu skor bcas yod pa de dag gis gtso bo ni gtsug lag khang steng shog bar gsum la mi rkun srung 'doms byed dgos pa dang/rgyun gzhan khyams ra dang/se ra ltag sgo sogs kyi gad khungs khag la 'go 'doms gnyer tsang nang zan re 'jog dgos pa ma zad/dgong dro rtag par mtshan mo'i chu tshod bcu pa tsam la lha gnyer ngo ma gcig dang nang zas kha shas bcas nas gtsug lag khang gi sgo ra ba dang/khang gnyer/gad pa/lha khang khag gi dgon gter bcas sa khungs so sor bsdad yod men dang me rkun gnyer la gzab grung dgos pa'i bskor g.yeng yang byed dgos pa/lho brag seng ge rdzong dang/do rdzong/lha khang gzhis/kong po jo rtse zho gsum (jo mo rdzong/rtse la rdzong/zho kha gzhis sdod )bcas nas 'bab deb nang gsal gyi spang leb spyan spang dang/dkyus spang/mal gro nga khongs nas rdza cha me tog khog ma g.yu rtsi ser po dang ljang khu che chung sna tshogs/'jag ma dang/bul tog /sug pa yan tsag tsig dgos mkho'i khral 'bab bsdu len gyis las khungs khag gi 'gro gron mkho 'don byed rgyu/lha sa'i sa bdag gnyer tshang las khungs yin gshis/grong khyer lha sa'i srang tsam khag la sa 'og btsog chu shar gtong thub pa'i chu yur nyams gso dang/gsang spyod gsar rgyag /gzhan yang sger khang rgya bskyed kyi rkyen pas khrom lam dang srang lam khag la gnod rkyen mi yong ba'i bkag 'gog tshod 'dzin byed dgos pa/lha gnyer res 'khor gyis lo ltar smon lam spyi khyab pa'i las 'gan 'khur te smon lam gyi gtor sgo'i do dam byed pa dang/gnyer tsang drung yig gis smod lam spyi khyab kyi drung yig gi las 'gan 'khur ba/gzhan yang mtshams khung dgon gyi btsun ma dang/lha sdod hu'i rigs kyi 'go 'doms byed dgos pa bcas red}
lha sa nang sgang|{'di ni me sprel (1956)lor bod rang skyong ljongs gra sgrig u yon lhan khang gi las don nad zhugs mi dza sag lha smon ye shes tshul khrims kyis gtsos pa'i zhabs 'bring ser skya lnga bcu skor lha sar rgyun bzhugs gnang dgos par brten byas bzhugs nang sgang yig tshang dang bcas pa gsar du btsugs shing/lha sa nang sgang gi gtso 'gan dza sag lha smon gyis gnang thog /gal che'i tshogs gros gnang rgyu sogs mnyam sdeb 'go khrid gras ka'i khongs su tA bla ma gcig dang/tha'i ji gcig /rim bzhi gsum/bla sprul gcig bcas yod/lha sa nang sgang gi gtso bo'i las 'gan ni/bod rang skyong ljongs gra sgrig u yon lhan khang gi las don nang zhugs (1090) mkhan bla khongs mi sna rnams la tang gi 'go khrid 'og 'gan bab las don khag legs 'grub yong ba dang rgya bod gzhung bla khams gsum dang bcas pa'i mthun sgril yag po yong ba byas te bla brang gi mtshan la shas gzhi mi 'byung ba'i bskul 'ded slob gcun bya rgyu dang bod las don u yon lhan khang la 'brel gtugs zhus te gzhis byes kyi lan don gnang tshul gang ci'i skor dgongs bskor dang re 'dun bsam 'char brje res sogs zhu rgyu bka' shag las gzhung bla'i dbar gyi gdan don gang ci'i grol mos dang mthun lam 'brel ba zhu rgyu rtse spyi 'doms las khungs la yig thog nas lan don snyan seng zhu rgyu gzhis yod nang sgang u yon lhan khang dang rgyun du gnas tshul dang bsam 'char spel res bya rgyu sogs red lha sa nang sgang yig tshang la gtso 'gan 'khur mi rim pa lnga pa'i mgron gnyer gcig dang drung yig gcig yig 'bri ba las bya zhabs rdol pa gsum gnyer pa gcig ma chen dang yig skyel sogs mi bdun bcas yod pa dang des nang sgang 'gro khrid kyi bka' bkod 'og lha sa nang sgang gi bka' yig dang 'phrin yig snyan zhu brda tho tshogs 'du'i zin tho sogs yi ge bzo 'bri'i 'gan yongs rdzogs dang gsham gyi snyan zhu len 'bul dang bka' bsgyur rgyu bcas kyi lan 'gan 'khur sgrub zhu dgos pa red}
lha sa rnam gnyis|{lha sa gtsug lag khang dang ra mo che rnam gnyis}
lha sa ba'i chas gos dang rgyan cha|{grong khul gyi skyes pa phal che skra tsang lo gcig lhas pa'i na mor si shan gyi skra gzhug dmar po rtsa ba lhas ma gcig gi sne mo ngo gnyis la tung chab tshom bu gcig dang/ngos gcig la tung chab tshom bu gnyis yod pa'i rtsa bar rgya nag lcags ri sogs kyi 'ching brgyab pa zhig btags pa'i lnga po rgyab tu glod/rna ba g.yas la g.yu chung zhig dang/rna ba g.yon par gser gyi rna long g.yu phra can zhig btags/rang 'khos la gzhigs pa'i gos chen nam/ther ma/ras/snam bu sogs kyi dor ma dang phyur pa'i sgab 'jug pus mo ma mthong tsam bar sdog ste rgyab tu rkub sul bzhi sgrig (rkub sul mang po bsdus na dkrog dkrog du brtsi )lham spu ma'i shol rtse dang/ko ba'i shol rtse/'jur rta/zos pa sogs gyon/bar lam gzhon nu phal che bas lo gsar dang dus chen ma gtags dus rgyun kong skra zhes lcang lo gnyis lhas pa'i skra gzhug si shan lhug ma dkyil du mdun pa can re sgar te lcang lo mgo bor dkris/de snga skyes pa tshos 'og 'jug dkar po kho na gyon gyi yod kyang/phyis na gzhon tsho 'og 'jug khra khra dang/sngo dkar sogs gyon/sman pa'am slob dge/mi drag khag gi phyag mdzod sogs ming grags cung yod pa'i rgan gras tshos skra lcang lo gcig kyang dang/'og 'jug dkar po'i gong ba phyur ba'i gong steng du slog /phyur par sked zur gnyis spyad pa'i ske rags dmar po kho na bcings shing/gos na 'jol 'jol byed/lham phal cher spu shol dang/zom pa gyon/rna ba g.yon par sog byil btugs kyi yod/ser srung sngags pa tsho gyon pa gyon stangs gong mtshungs la rnab gnyis kar rna long g.yu phra can chu chung re 'dogs srol yod/mgo ril yin na 'og 'jug gong ba rtse rnon can li hang dang/ser po/phyung pa'i sne yang lham sgrog ma mthong tsam sdog /zhwa mo'i tshos gzhi ser smug sogs las zhwa gos nag po dang/dkar po mi gyon/spyir na skye pa phal che bas dbyar dus phying zhwa dang dgun dus pags zhwa gyon/de yang rgan rabs tshos zhwa dpangs cung mtho ba zhwa sne mdun rgyab gnyis chung la g.yas g.yon gnyis che tsam yin pa'i zhwa sner dgun dus pags pa dang/dbyar dus gru'u tse btang ba rgya se'i sked 'ching sogs (1091) med pa'i gos chen nag po 'jam seng gi rgyab sha can byu ru chu chung mang por drug bcings bzos pa'i tog ldan zhig gyon na gzhon tshos phying pa'i pags zhwa rgya se'i sked 'ching dang gser skud kyi pan kyog yod pa'i zhwa sne che ba gcig mdun du bstan zhing zhwa sne rgyab ma nang du ltebs nas gyon rgan gzhon ji ltar yang rang la 'byor 'khos yod na mthe bong g.yon par dzul dang sa bon sogs kyi sha krad dang ser mdzub g.yon par gser gyi tshigs khebs dang mdzub dkris gyon pa sogs byed de bzhin tha mag gang sa 'then mkhan gyis dzul gyi bcud rtsi dang gang phor yang dngul byed pa dang skya ser sna thag 'then mkhan gyi sna ru dzul dang ma nu hog hrul cang sogs byed bud med tshos si shan tshos tshogs kyi skra gzhug sgar ba'i lcang log nyis rgyab tu glod 'bu ras dang ras sogs kyi smad g.yog dang gru'u tsi sogs kyi 'og 'jug dbyar kha phyu pa phu med dang dgus kha phyur pa phu yod gyon 'og 'jug gi steng pho khegs zhes rgya se'am gos chen tshon khra grub zhi zhig gi gsham char gos chen nam ras kyi 'thud can zhig brang du bcings phyu pa'i gsham cha lham mgar slebs tsam 'jol 'jol gyi rgyab tu sked zur gnyis ston pa'i sked rags bcings pa'i steng kha bcings zhes gru'u tsi'i sked rags shig leb ltebs su dkris mdun du pang gdan khra bo bcings lham zom pa gyon (skyes pa pho zom dang bud med kyis gyon pa'i mo zom la bzo lta dang phar phyir sogs kyi khyad par yod )rna bar de snga g.yu chung re 'dogs kyi yod skad kyang phyis su khra sna tshogs dang gser gyi rna rgyan 'dogs srol lo rabs sum cu pa'i 'go tsam bar bud med tshos lag pa g.yas par dung dkar (g.yas dung zer )zhig gyon srol yang phyes de mi gyon rgyun du rna rgyan dang ske phrug lag gdub sor gdub sogs gyon rgyur dga' po byed gzab mchor sprod skabs g.yu byur gyi spa phrug dang skra lan rtse gser gyi a sgor g.yu phra can ske rgyan gser gyi ga'u phra ldan la gzi byur mu tig gi bkag bcad nang 'khyig dang bcas pa brang steng g.yas su mu tig dang dzul gzi phrug sogs kyis 'phrul 'phrul lan rtse lan bu gnyis kyi sku gzhug sgyin gug grol tsam du slebs pa de'i sked pa'i mtshams su skra 'khyig ces mu tig gi chun por g.yu byur gyi brgyan pa zhig bcas btags gong gsal bud med kyi rgyan gos de ni grong mi spyir btang ba'i yin pa las mi drag tshon lcam gyi rgyan gos rgyan spros che ba rnams min mi drug tsho'i lcam gyi rgyan gos gzab gyon lta bu rags tsam brjod na rgyal se'am rgya 'dra'i phyu pa phu yod (dbyar dgung khyad med )rgya 'dra'am skyin khebs kyi steng rtsegs pang gdan 'dzar pang lham rta zom ske rgyan ga'u sogs gong mtshungs thog dzul gyi ske phreng mu tig gi yar 'then can lan rtse dang a sgor spyi mtshungs su mu tig spra phrag steng rtse g.yu thag pa zhes mu tig gi drag ba dang sked rgyab skra 'khyig la nor bu dga' 'khyil zhes gser gyi tshoms la g.yas g.yon du mu tig dra ba can mdun 'ching sdig ra klo phreng sogs rin chen sne mang gi rgyan cha 'dogs pa dang sgal rgyab tu gos gzan rin chen sna lnga zhes gos 'ja' sgrig gi gzan gyon steng rtsegs ma gyon nas spa phrug steng rtse g.yu thag pa dang skra 'khyig nor bu dga' 'khyir rgyab gzan rin chen sna lnga mdun 'ching sdig ra glo phreng lham rta zom pang gdan 'jar pang sogs mi dgos par skra 'khyig dang pang gdan khra khra lham zom pa sogs bud med skyi mtshungs gzhan yang rgyas gos de las rgyas pa yod kyang yig tshogs che bas 'dir ma bris gna' dus su skyes pa'am bud med gang yin rung lus kyi smad du gos zhes dar gos dang snam zer gang rung nag po zhig la sul mo mang po yod pa skyes pas 'dzab thung la bud med tshos 'dzab ring po zhig (1092) gyon stod du phu stod ces dar gos sam snam bu tshos tshogs sgrig pa'i stod gos phu thung che ba zhig gi nang gyon 'og 'jug gong ba dang phu thung gi sne mo tshon sna lnga ldan lham rdog gcig ma rtse snyung 'go sman mam snam bu dmar ljang gi bol can yu ring zhig gyon pa'i nywa rtsar lham sgrog khra khra sogs bcings bud med tshos pang gdan sne 'dzar can bcings thog steng rtsegs phu med gyon dga' ston dang phyir bskyod sogs kyi skabs gru'u rtse dmar po'i ske rags 'dra ba 'dzar ldan zhig rgyab tu gyon skyes pa tshos rna rgyan kong rnam pan rdo ces gser dngul rag gsum gang rung la g.yu chung du ma'i phra sbyar ba g.yas ngos leb mo sgor dbyings rtse mo gyen ltas snyan tsam zhig dang g.yon ngos ril bu rtse snyung thur ltas 'dzar lo can zhig btags mgo bos sba ril zhes ras dkar po sbom phra sba dbyug tsam sgom po phyogs bzhir ras dmar ser gyi 'ja' sgrig can gyis skra mnan sked par gri gzer mthe bong g.yon par ba sau gas kyi sha krad gyon pa sogs byed bud med tshos skra'i lan bu rgyab tu dpyang rna ba'i thad grum 'dzar zhes gser dngul rag sogs g.yu phra can zhig btag ske la ga'u dang g.yu byur spos shel sogs gyon phrug dam po'i skra gnon spa ril lag yu byur gyis brgyan pa zhig mo bor gyon pa ni phyi'i dung phrug ces pa de yin gong gsal gyi gna' bo'i chas gos gyon stangs ldebs ris rnying pa dag la gsal ba ltar yin (mi dbang rtogs brjod )nang de dus gyi chas gos skor cung zad gsal ba tsam las chas gos gyon stangs mthong ba rgyud pa las yig lam du 'khod pa ma mthong bud med kyi spa phrug de yang thog mar sgor sgor yin la lan rtse yang rwa co ltar min rjes su spa phrug dang lan rtse rim bzhin zur gsum dang rwa co lta bur gyur pa 'dra par rnying pa la bltas na shes spa phrug ces pa'i go don ni (spa )zhes skra'i don dang (phrug )ces pa skra gnon byed snam bu'i sba ril gyi don yin skad pang gdan la rnam pa gsum byed srol de la yang dbus mas khyim gyi bdag po ste khyo bo dang g.yas pas bud med rang nyid g.yon pas bu rgyud mtshon pa yin zer bu mo la bco lnga tsam du ma slebs bar skra lcang mo gcig las mi rgyag pa dang pang gdan yang bcings kyi med lo rabs sum cu pa'i rjes ma tsam bar bu ma'i lcang lo'i thog stag 'jar zhes g.yu byur spel ma zhig sgar ba de spa phrug bzo dmigs yin 'dug kyang rjes su ltag 'dzar sgar srol med spa phrug dngos su g.yog pa nas skra lan bu gnyis lhas te pang gdan bcings kyi yod}
lha sa gtsug lag khang|{gtsug lag khang 'di ni bod kyi btsan po srong btsan sgam pos bal bza' khri btsun dang/rgya bza' 'un khren kong jo khab tu bsus rjes bod kyi ngal rtsom mi dmangs kyis gtso shugs byas te spyi lo'i dus rabs bdun pa'i dus dkyil du gsar du bskrun pa nas da bar mi lo chig stong sum brgya lhag tsam gyi lo rgyus yod pa dang/de'i ring dus rabs rim can gyi nang nyams gso rkya skyed thems mang byas pa brgyud rim bzhin da yod kyi gzhi khyon 'di ltar chags pa yin/da lta gtsug lag khang lte ba thog tshad gsum dang mtshams bzhi zur lcog rnams bsnan na thog tshad bzhi yin zhing spyi'i rgya khyon spyi khre gru bzhi pa nyis khri lnga stong yas mas shig yod pa dang/phyogs bzhir gser zangs kyi rgya phibs dang/kho ra khor yug tu gser zangs kyi mda' yab zhu shu dang bcas pa gser 'od chem chem 'phro bas ku nasab rgyan cing brjid chags par gnas yod/gtsug lag khang 'dir jo khang gtso bor byas pa'i lha khang bcu phrag gnyis lhag gi nang li ma dang/gser zangs/'jim pa la sogs pa'i sku brnyan che chung sna tshogs dang/steng shod bar (1093) gsum khyams ra dang bcas pa gzhi rgya che ba'i ldebs ris rnam pa sna tshogs bcas kyis byur bur gtams lha khang 'di'i rnam mang bzo skrun gyi rig gnas dngos po'i thog nas bod kyi ngal rtsol mi dmangs ni las la brtson zhing phun sum tshogs pa'i shes rig dang ldan pa zhig yin pa gang legs mtshon pa ma zad skrun dngos 'di ni rgya bod spu zla mi rigs dbar gna' rabs nas bzung phan tshun 'gro 'ong dang mthun sgril mnyam las yun ring byas pa'i lo rgyus kyi dngos dpang zhig yin pa'ang mtshon gyi yod de yang dang po sa la gtsug la khang 'di ni gsar du bskrun pa'i skor lha sa gtsug lag khang 'di ni btsan po srong btsan sgam pos bod du sangs rgyas kyi chos lugs du spel gtong ba'i rten gzhir dmigs nas btsugs gnang ba zhig yin pa ma zad de rje btsan po mi rgyun rim can gyis chos lugs rgyun 'dzin byed pa'i gdung rgyud kyi lha khang lte ba 'ba' zhig tu brtsis pa bcas mtshon gyi 'dug spyi lo'i dus rabs brgyad pa'i nang btsan po khri srong lde btsan gyi