lor tA la'i bla ma sku phreng lnga pas skor (1098) lam nang logs kyi ldebs ris byang ngos su phal po che'i zhing khams rgya mtsho dang shar ngos su 'bum gyi gleng gzhi sogs lho ngos su cho 'phrul gyi bkod pa zhes 'dir dag gsar du 'bri 'khod byed bcug cing dus mtshungs gzhung sgo phyi nang gnyis kyi bar du 'jim brnyan rgyal chen bzhi gsar du bzhengs gtsug lag khang byang phyogs kyi rgya phibs te sngon paN chen rin po che sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos rgyan gyis nyams gso zhig gnang yod kyang gser mdog nyams pas gzhan dag dang cha mi mtshungs par brten tA la'i bla ma sku phreng ng+lapas bod lcags khyi (1670)lor rgya phibs gzhan dang gzhi mtshungs pa'i bskyar gso byed bcug pa gnang de sngon lha sa smon lam che mo 'tshugs skabs rtse rnam rgyal grwa tshang dkyil 'khor mthil du 'tshogs pa las zur du 'dug khang med stabs bod chu byi (1672)lor sde srid blo bzang mthu stobs kyis bla brang khongs su 'du khang gsar skrun byed bcug skor lam phyi phyogs kyi shar lho byang bcas pa'i khang pa tshang ma'ang tA la'i bla ma lnga pa gshegs rjes rim pas lha khang du gyur pa bcas mdor na gong gsal dus mtshams de'i nang lha sa gtsug lag khang gi rgya khyon dang rnam pa gang ci'i thad 'gyur ldog che shos byung sde gzhi rtsi'i cha nas da yod kyi bzo dbyibs 'di chags pa yin de rjes rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu bya (1753)lo la bod sa gnas kyi chos srid 'gan dbang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bdun pa bskal bzang rgya mtshor phul ba dang bka' blon mi grangs bzhi bsko gzhag byas te bod sa gnas kyi srid dbang las khungs bka' shag zer ba 'tshogs yul gtsug lag khang gi lho phyogs su rtsis khang las khungs dang nub phyogs su bla brang phyag mdzod byang phyogs su bsher khang las khungs sogs sa gnas srid gzhung gi las khungs mang po zhig rim bzhin lha khang 'di'i phyogs bzhi mtshams brgyad la btsugs yod lha khang lte ba'i skor lam gyi phyi ngos shar lho byang gsum khor yug gi ldebs bris dang gsum thog gi bar khyams ldebs bris rnams ni thog ma bod rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu yos (1783)lo la tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa 'jam dpal rgya mtsho'i skabs gsar du bkod 'dug pa rnams da lta'ang de bzhin du yod de min mi dbang pho lha ba bsod nams stobs rgyas dang tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gcig pa tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa bcas so so'i skabs sngar yod ldebs ris la tshon gsol dang nyams gso kha shas gnang ba bcas zhib phra gzhung sgo'i sgo mchor g.yas g.yon gyi dkar chag nang 'khod pa ltar lha khang gi bzo dbyings thad rtsa ba'i cha nas 'gyur ldan che rigs byung med dkyil 'khor sdings kyi sdings cha'i thog yod pa'i byams pa chos 'khor ma zhal byang gzigs 'di ni mi dbang pho lha bsod nams stobs rgyas kyis rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me 'brug (1736)lo la bzo skrun byed bcug pa dang de'i mdun ngos su yod pa'i spyan ras gzigs phyag stong spyan sngon 'di ni rdo ring no yon paN+Di ta dngos grub rab brtan gyis rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing rta (1774)lo'i nang bzhengs bcug pa de bzhin sdings cha'i gsham du yod pa'i gser zangs kyi byams pa stegs bzhugs chung ba 'di ni rdo ring bstan 'dzin dpal 'byor gyis rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing sbrul (1785)lo la bzhengs bcu 'dug de'i shar du gser zangs kyi byams pa stegs bzhugs che ba 'di ni tA la'i bla ma sku phreng brgyad pa'i skabs kyi gsol dpon dge legs g+r+ya mtshan zhes pas rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa lug (1799)lor bzhengs bcug pa yin tA la'i bla ma bzhugs yul bra brang steng khang skor lab zo bcos dang nyams sago thems kha shes byas yod cing gzhi rgya che (1099) shos ni rab byung bcu drug pa'i lcags stag (1950)lor byang ngos gyi khang skor phal cher rmang nas bshig ste bskyar bzo byed bcu pa de yin tshogs gzigs gzim chung zer ba 'di yang de dus gsar skrun byas pa yin lha sa gtsug lag khang gsar du bskrun pa nas da bar dus yun ha cang rin po song bar brten lha khang lte ba'i lho rgyud dang nub rgyud kyi rtsig par gas skyon shor yod pa ma zad shing cha 'ga' zhig kyang 'bus bzos rkyen steng shog gang sar de snga nas nyen ka mang po brgyab yod cing lob rgya phrag kha shas kyi gong rgyas