lha sras ljang tsha lha dbon|{rgyal po khri lde gtsug brtan dang btsun mo 'jang bza' khri btsun gnyis kyi sras yin/(rba bzhed )las sras 'di'i mna' mar rgya bzang cin khren kong jo blangs kyang rgyal bzang lha sa ma 'byor gong dus sras 'dis rta rgyug skabs rtas g.yugs te grongs zhes gsal/lo rgyus 'ga' zhig tu sras 'di'i mna' mar gnyags rigs kyi bu mo ma blangs pa'i zhe nad la brten nas sras 'dis rta rgyus pa'i go skabs dang bstun nas bon gyi sngags pas zer mda' 'phangs pa phog te rta 'drogs nas rta thog nas lhung ste 'das par bshad}
