lha sras gtsang ma|{rgyal po khri lde srong btsan gyi sras 'bring ba 'am rgan pa/'di nyid ni bod kyi btsan po'i gdung rabs gnang nas rab tu byung ba'i dang po yin/chos 'byung 'ga' zhig nang rgyal po khri ral pa can bkrongs rjes chos la mi dga' ba'i blon po dbas stag rna can la sogs pas ngal skul byas pa brgyud/rgyal po glang dar mas lha sras gtsang ma mon du spyugs/'di nyid lho brag khong thing gi bar du byon/der sna nam bzang/mang po rjes dug phul nas bkrongs zhes pa dang/chos 'byung la lar thog mar lho brag khol thing du byon/zhig ral thams cad gsos/gter tshan gcig sbas/de nas spa gror byon/skyer chu'i lha khang rnying pa gsos/gsar pa brtsigs/yab mes kyi bla dpe dang khrims kyi yig tshang sogs tshan che ba gcig sbas/stag tshang dang seng ge phug tu gter kha mang du sbas/spyar kar brgya rtsa brgyad sbas/gter phran mang du sbas/de nas lha srang gtsang ma la spyan 'dren mi med pas thugs mug ste bsam yas ke tshang gi bla dpe zab mo rnams spyan drangs te spyal ka'i brag la sbas/lha sras nyid der sku gshegs te spur yang bse sgrom du bcug nas brag la sbal zhes gsal na'ang/lha sras gtsang ma rang gi dbon rgyud kyis brtsams pa'i mon yul gyi lo rgyus nang/lha sras gtsang gi ma mon du spyugs pa'i skor la 'di ltar gsal ba ste/'di nyid mon spa grog nam thang sogs brgyud nas rim bzhin phebs pa'i mthar mi zi pa'i sa char 'byor/rgyal po'i btsun mo dpal gyi ngang tshul ma dang lkog tu nyal bshams so zhes rgyal po'i snyan du gsol bas/khrims la sbyor zhig ces gsungs pa na/btsun mo ngang tshul ma shin tu sdug bsngal te rang srog lcebs pa dang/blon po chen po bran ka dpal yon gyis kho rang bsad na rgyal po bkrongs kyi dogs nas byang du bros/mthar byang thang du bkum nas dmar gdung snye thang rgya grong na yod ces grags/gzhan yang lo rgyus yig tshang du blon chen po bran ka dpal yon nyes med du bsad rkyen mtha' gnod sbyin du skyes nas bod sil bu'i skabs kheng log gi ngan skul byad mkhan yin pa'i gtam rgyud kyang mi nyung ba zhig yod}
