lhag bcas kyi phrad 'jug yul brgyad|{1 tshig snga ma mtshams sbyor byed pa dang/phyi ma mtshams sbyor byar bzung nas dus snga phyir 'jug pa'i mtshams sbyor lhag bcas/2 tshig don snga phyi gnyis ka mtshams sbyor byar bzung nas dus rim gyi 'jug pa'i mtshams sbyor lhag bcas/3 tshig don snga phyir gnyis ka mtshams sbyor byar bzung nas dug gci gcar du 'jug pa'i mtshams sbyar lhag bcas/4 dbye ba 'dren pa'i dam bca' lhag bcas/5 gtan tshigs 'dren pa'i dam bca' lhag bcas/6 nges tshig 'dren pa'i dam bca' lhag bcas/7 rgyas bshad 'dren pa'i dam bca' lhag bcas dang btsams mtshams sbyor lhag bcas gsum dang dam bca' lhag bcas bzhi dang/lhag bcas bdun po'i steng du/8 tshig don snga ma las gzhan 'dren pa'i gzhan 'dren lhag bcas bsnan pas brgyad do/_}
