lhag pa'i dam tshig gsum|{de la gsum ste/rang bzhin lta ba'i dam tshig bzhi (a nu yo ga las/) spyod rgyun kyi dam tshig bzhi/gal mdo nges pa'i dam tshig bzhi'o/_/dang po rang bzhin lta ba'i dam tshig la bzhi ste/khams gsum byang bsgyur/dus gsum rtsa bsgyur/'khor ba gnas bsgyur/srid gsum yongs sgrol du lta ba'o/_/gnyis pa spyod pa rgyun gyi dam tshig bzhi ste/dgra bzhi spang ba ni/le lo'i dgra/gnyid kyi dgra/myos gyur pa'i dgra/gsang ba'i dgra spang ba'o/_/gsum pa gal mdo nges pa'i dam tshig la bcu gnyis te/dam nyams pa'i mdo bzhi/ma khrel ba'i tshul bzhi/mthar phyin pa'i rtags bzhi'o/_/dang po ni/rtsa/lag /zlas ma/zhal gyis ma nyams pa bzhi'o/_/gnyis pa ni/slob dpon/mched/lcam/yid dam rang sems kyis ma khrel bzhi'o/_/gsum pa ni/dman 'du zhing mthu rtsal che ba dang/byin rlabs che zhing rig pa chags pa dang/yid 'ong 'byung zhing 'dod pa 'grub pa dang/mang pos bkur zhing grags pa thob pa bzhi'o/_}
