lhan cig skyes ma'i mkha' 'gro|{gsang sngags kyi gzhung nas/mkha' 'gro ma la rigs gsum (zhing skyes kyi (1104) mkha' 'gro ma sngags skyes kyi mkha' 'gro ma lhan skyes kyi mkha' 'gro ma bcas )du phye ba'i nang tshan lhan skyes kyi mkha' 'gro ma ste gsang sngags kyi lam la brten nas sangs rgyas zin pa'i bud med kyi rigs la zer 'di la dogs pa gcod dgos pa'i gnad mang du yod kyang 'dir zur tsam yang 'god par ma nus so/_}
