lhung bzed|{sangs rgyas chos lugs pa'i dge slong rnams kyis bsod snyoms slong ba'i snod cig yin/de yang rgyu ni lcags dang 'jim pa gang rigs las byas pa mdog nag po/bzi dbyibs sgo nga phyed ka bcad pa lta bu la dge slong pha yi lhung bzed che tshad ni rgya gar ma g+ha d+ha yi bre gang gi tshad kyi 'bras rlangs bcos byas pa 'phel ba'i phul bcu gsum/de'i steng sngo tshod phul bzhi/stong pa phul gang bcas phul bco brgyad shong ba zhig dang/chung tshad ni 'bras bre gang btsos nas 'phel ba'i phul drug /de'i steng du sngo tshod phul do/stong pa phul gang ste phul dgu shong ba zhig yod cing/de gnyis kyi bar ni 'bring tshad yin la/dge slong pha'i lhung bzed chung tshad de dge slong ma'i lhung bzed che tshad yin pa sogs zhib par 'dul ba'i gzhung rab byung gi gzhi'i skabs su gsal}
