lhun grub mkhar shul|{de snga'i lhun grub rdzong gnas yul ri steng gi mkhar shul de rab byung bcu drug pa'i sa phan (1959)lo yan de p+sang bod sa gnas srid gzhung gi lhun grub rdzong gnas yul yin pa dang/thog brtsegs dgu ldan gyi mkhar dbus dmar po dang/mtha' skor dkar po/mthar rgyang gi lcags ri chen po zhig bcas yod pa de lo rgyus yun ring ldan la/rgyab phyogs kyi lta lam dang nye 'gram gyi chu mig ma bcos lhun gyis grub pa/phag gru'i dbang bsgyur dang/stag lung pas 'phan yul 'dzin skyong/dga' ldan pho brang gi dbang bsgyur bcas gang gi dus su yang de gar gnas gzhi byas nas 'dzugs (1106) skrun rgya bskyed dang nyams gso thengs 'ga' shas byas thog rig dngos 'bor chen yang yod 'dug dmangs gtso'i bcos bsgyur skabs lhun grub rdzong mi dmangs srid gzhung 'dzugs rgyu'i las don yang de gar byas rig gsar skabs phyi nang tshang ma gtor bar brten da lta gyang shul zhig mthong rgyu yod}
