lho pa bdag po|{hor ser chen rgyal po'i lung gis g.ya' 'o la nas/brang po yan gyi la stod lho'i yul ljongs la dbang ba'i khri dpon gyi 'ja' sa lon pa nas bzung sde tshugs shin tu che/si tu chos rin pa dang lha btsan skyabs khu dbon gyi dus su mkhan chen chos rgyal ba bla mar bsten nas shel dkar chos sde 'bul ba sogs byas/skabs shig byang pa bdag po dang ma mthun pas dmag 'khrug byas rjes pham nas rdzong gzhis mang po shor/slar yang 'thab pas sngar shor ba'i rdzong gzhis rnams tshul lon/rjes su spun mched nang khul ma mthun zhing/dpon skya stod po skor gsum yang blo ma rungs pa'i dbang gis nang 'khrug mang du byung zhing/rjes su byang pa bdag po dang gnyen 'brel byas pa nas lho byang gnyis khri skor gcig tu sbrel te stobs shugs che bar gyur}
