lho phyogs rgyal rabs bzhi|{{(WP:1,194)}1 sung {(WP:1,194)}rgyal sa ni can khang {(WP:1,194)}deng sang gi nan cin )yin/rgyal rabs 'dir gong ma mi rabs brgyad (1107) byung zhing (rus ming li'u )spyi lo 420nas 479bar lo drug cu'i ring srid dbang bzung 2 chis {(WP:1,194)}rgyal khab rgyal sa nan cin rgyal rabs 'dir gong ma mi rabs bdun byung zhing (rus ming ni sha'o )spyi lo 470nas 502b.ralo ngo nyi shu rtsa gsum bar srid dbang bzung 3 le'ang {(WP:1,194)}rgyal rabs rgyal sa nan cin yin rgyal rabs 'dir rgyal po mi rabs bzhi byung zhing (rus ming ni sha'o yin )spyi lo 503nas 556bar lo nga gsum bar srid dbang bzung 4 khren {(WP:1,194)}rgyal khab rgyal sa nan cin yin rgyal rabs 'dir rgyal po rim rabs lnga byung zhing (rus ming khren yin )spyi lo 557nas 589bar lo ngo sum cu so gsum ring srid dbang bzung}
lho phyogs nags rong na spyod pa'i 'brug rje|{(lho 'brug )deng sang 'brug pa'am ming gzhan pu tan rgyal khab tu 'bod pa de yin cing/rgyal khab der 'brug pa zhes 'bod pa'i rgyu mtshan ni/rgyal khab der 'brug pa bka' brgyud kyi chos lugs la dad pa byed mkhan mang ba'i dbang gis de ltar brjod pa yin/gnas yul ni nyi ma la ya'i ri rgyud kyi lho phyogs su yod cing skam sa'i nang khul gyi rgyab khag cig yin/nub byang dang/byang phyogs/shar phyogs bcas reng ri'i bod ljongs dang sa 'brel yin pa dang/lho nub ni 'bras ljongs dang lho phyogs ni rgya gar dang sa 'brel yin la/rgya khyon spyi le grub bzhi ma bzhi khri drug stong/mi 'bor ni/chu byi (1972)lor khri brgyad cu tsam yod pa'i nang nas brgya cha bdun cu don lnga tsam na 'brug pa'i mi rigs yin la/de 'phros ni bal po yin cing/mang tshongs mang che ba nang pa'i chos lugs la dad pa byed kyi yod pa dang/bod kyi yi ge dang 'brug pa'i skad byed spyod byed kyi yod/'brug pa ni bkas bkod brgyud 'dzin rgyal ldan rgyal khab yin pa dang/dus rabs bco brgyad pa'i dkyil du dbyin jis btsan 'dzul byas shing/bod rab byung bcu drug pa'i nang glang (1949)lor 'brug pa de rgya gar gyi khongs gtogs rgyal khab cig tu gyur/lcags phag (1961)lor mnyam 'brel rgyal tshags kyi khongs mir zhugs thub pa byung yod/'brug pa ni ri bo'i dkyil gyi rgyal chab cig yin cing/sa dbyibs ni byang rgyud mtho sar rgya mtsho'i ngos las skyi khre bzhi stong lhag tsam gyis mtho ba dang gnam gshis skam shas che ba dang/lho rgyud kyi sa babs dma' shing gnam gshis dro bas nags tshul mthug pos khyab pa dang/dkyil khul dug nam gshis dro grang snyoms pa dang chu rgyun 'bel po yod pas zhing las sa khul gtso bo'i gras yin/gter kha'i thon khungs gras/lhang tsher dkar po/cu gang/nyi ma kha chu/zangs/rdo sol bcas yod/yul mi rnams zhing 'brog gnyis ka gnyer zhing/zhing las thon dngos gras 'bras/bro/ma rmos lo tog sogs yod pa dang/'bru rigs rang mkho rang 'don byed thub kyi yod/tshong las bya yul gtso bo ni rgya gar yin cing/phyir 'tshong dngos 'og ni shing cha dang/shing thog /lag rtsal thon rtsal bcas yin/nang 'dren dngos zog gras la 'khel 'thag thon rdzas dang nyin mkho'i yo byad bcas yod/'grim 'grul stabs bde med pas phyugs zog dang rta bong bcas ni skyel 'dren yo byad gtso bo yin/gzhung lam thad rgya gar bar du 'gro thub pa'i 'khor lo'i 'gro lam yod/rgyal sa ni thim bu yin cing der mi 'bor lnga stong tsam yod pa dang/pu na kha ni rgya mtsho'i ngos las mtho tshad spyi khre chig stong sum brgya brgyad cu lhag tsam gyi dma' sar gnas pas dgus dus kyi rgyal sa yin cing/mi 'bor nyis khri drug stong tsam yod}
lho phyogs 'bri chu 'bab rgyud sa khul du snga rjes byung ba'i rgyal rabs bcu|{{(WP:1,194)}1 wu {(WP:1,194)}rgyal rabs/rgyal sa ni cang su'u zhing chen gyi (1108) dbyang kro'u de la rgyal rabs bzhi byung ba'i (rus ming ni dbyang )yin zhing spyi lo 902nas 937b.ralo ngo so lnga'i ring srid dbang bzung 2 min {(WP:1,194)}rgyal rabs rgyal sa ni h+phu ci'an zhing chen gyi h+phu kro'u de la rgyal rabs lnga byung ba'i rus ming ni wang yin zhing spyi lo 909nas 945b.ralongo so drug ring srid dbang bzung 3 wu g.yod {(WP:1,194)}rgyal rabs rgyal sa ni kre ca'ang zhing chen gyi hang kro'u de la rgyal rabs lnga byung ba'i rus ming ni chi'an yin zhing spyi lo 907nas 978bar lo ngo don gcig ring srid dbang bzung 4 khru'u {(WP:1,194)}rgyal rabs rgyal sa ni hu'u nan zhing chen gyi khrang hra de la rgyal rabs drug byung ba'i rus ming ni mA yin zhing spyi lo 907nas 951bar lo ngo zhe bzhi'i ring srid dbang bzung 5 chan hru'u {(WP:1,194)}rgyal rabs rgyal sa ni si khron zhing chen gyi khreng tu'u de la rgyal rabs gnyis byung ba'i rus ming ni wang yin zhing spyi lo 903nas 925bar lo ngo nyer gnyis ring srid dbang bzung 6 cing nan {(WP:1,194)}rgyal rabs rgyal sa ni ho pe zhing chen gyi ci'ang hran de la rgyal rabs lnga byung ba'i rus ming ni ka'o yin zhing spyi lo 917nas 971bar lo ngo lnga bcu nga bzhi'i ring srid dbang bzung 8 ho'u hru'u {(WP:1,194)}rgyal rabs rgyal sa ni si khron zhing chen gyi khreng tu'u de la rgyal rabs gnyis byung ba'i rung ming ni meng yin zhing spyi lo 933nas 965bar lo ngo sum cu so gnyis ring srid dbang bzung 9 nan thang {(WP:1,194)}rgyal rabs rgyal sa ni cang su'u zhing chen gyi nan cin de la rgyal rabs gsum byung ba'i rus ming ni li yin zhing spyi lo 937nas 975b.ralongo sum cu so brgyad ring srid dbang bzung 10 pe han {(WP:1,194)}rgyal rabs rgyal sa ni hran shis zhing chen gyi tha'i yon yin de la rgyal rabs bzhi byung ba'i rus ming ni li'u zhing zhing spyi lo 951nas 979bar lo ngo nyi shu rtsa brgyad ring srid dbang bzung}
