lho brag 'bum pa|{(bod ljongs stag rtse rdzong khongs )ra sha khug grong tsho'i nye 'dabs su lho brag 'bum pa zhes mchod rten grags can zhig yod pa de rje tsong kha pa'i blam lho brag nam mkha' rgyal mtshan gyi gdung rten yin par grags shing/mchod rten de'i chags dbyibs ni dbus su mchod rten chen po zhig gi mthar skor dum chod rten mang po yod pa der rgyun gtan phyag skor byed mkhan mang po yod pa ni de gar phyag skor byas na gza' dang/rgyal gzer/mdze la sogs nad ngan rnams las thar ba'i shod rgyun 'dug /rig gsar skabs mchod rten tshang ma gtor bshig byung yang dbus kyi mchod rten de'i gsham cha rang 'jags yod par rab byung bcu bdun pa'i lcags lug (1991)lo mchod rten nyams gso zhus pa dang/deng skabs phyag skor byed mkhan mang po yod}
