a kyA bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan|{rje 'di rab byung bco lnga pa'i lcags khyi (1910)lor sku 'khrungs/sku gzhon nus nas sku 'bum byams pa gling du chos grwar bzhugs te gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan sbyong gnang nas dka' bcu'i grwa skor mdzad/rje 'jigs med 'phrin las rgya mtsho'i drung nas chos bka' mang du gsan/paN chen thub tan chos kyi nyi ma'i drung las dus 'khor rdul mtshon dkyil 'khor tang nas dbang chen gsan/dgung lo nyer bdun lor lam rim chen mo'i bshad lung zin te/(byang chub lam rim chen mo'i bshad pa'i zin tho rags bsdus tsam bkod pa skya rengs gsar pa'i snang ba )zhes bya ba bka' rtsom mdzad/de bzhin (shing rta'i srol 'byed kyi rnam gzhag rags bsdus blo gsal mgul rgyan gsar pa )zhes pa dang/(rim lnga gsal sgron gyi bshad lung zin bris dngos grub bdud rtsi'i zegs ma/) sgrub thabs rin chen 'byung gnas kyi rjes gnang zin bris nyung bsdus/) (dpal dus kyi 'khor lo'i sgo nas rab gnas mdor bsdus bya tshul bklag pas don grub )ces pa sogs bka' rtsom dpon 'bring gnyis tsam mdzad/sku tshe'i smad kyi mdzad pa mi gsal}
a kyA yongs 'dzin blo bzang don grub bam dbyangs can dga'i ba'i blo gros|{rje 'di ni mdo smad phyag rdor thang a kyA sde zhes pa'i yul du yab lo lo dang yum 'ba' ko gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i lcags sprel (1740)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun la lha ri blo bzang 'byung gnas kyi drung du rab byung bsgrubs/mtshan blo bzang don grub tu gsol/dgung lo bco lnga la bya khyung dgos du chos zhugs mdzad de shing bza' paN+Di ta blo bzang dar rgyas rgya mtsho slob dpon du bsten sa chos bka' mang du gsan/dgung lo nyer bdun la phebs pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i me khyi (1766)lor bus su phebs nas 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang du chos zhugs mdzad/gzhung chen por slob gnyer gnang/dgung lo nyer brgyad thog paN chen dpal ldan ye shes kyi drung dub snyen rdzogs bsgrubs/dgung lo so gnyis la grwa skor mdzad/sum rtags rtsis skar nag sogs la'ang mkhas par grags pas mtshan dbyangs can dga' ba'i blo gros su gsol/'bru gcig la de bzhin gshegs pa'i sku'i skyed mched legs par dod pa bzhengs pa sogs bzo'i gnas kyang mkhas par mkhyen/kun mkhyen 'jigs med dbang po dang thu'u bkwan chos kyi nyi ma sogs kyi zhabs la gtugs nas mad sngags kyi zab chos mang du gsan/dgung lo bzhi bcu thams par mgur rnam rgyal gling gi khrir phebs/rdzong nang dgon pa dang/sman pa grwa tshang/dus 'khor grwa tshang sogs snga phyir phyag btab/dgung lo drug cu re bzhin la bya khyung dgon gyi gdan rabs zhi dgu pa'i khrir phebs/sku 'bum khri chen zhe dug pa bum pa ngag dbang chos kyi nyi ma sku 'bum gyi khrir bzhugs dus rje yab sras kyi gsum bum dpar du 'god rgyu la zhu dag legs par mdzad/sku 'bum sago rig dar rgyas gzhan phan gling gi gdan khrir phebs/a kyA zhabs drung blo bzang ngag dbang (1110) bstan 'dzin la rab tu byung dge tshul gyi sdom pa bstsal sku 'bum bla ma a kyA ye shes skal bzang mkhas grub rgya mtsho'i yongs 'dzin rgyas mdzad pas yongs grags su a kyA yongs 'dzin zhes gsol bka' rtsom la (mkhas pa blun po brtag pa'i bstan bcos dge ldan legs bshad pad ma dkar po'i chun po'i 'grel pa nyi ma'i 'od zer/) (shing rta'i srol 'byed kyi rnam gzhag skal bzang mgul rgyan/) ('dul pa'i sdom tshig gnad bsdus nor bu'i phreng ba/) (snyan ngag gi bstan bcos mu tig phreng ba/) (sdeb sbyor rin 'byung gi gnad don gsal ba'i me long ) (rtags kyi 'jug pa'i dka' gnad bdag gzhan dang bya byade las gsum gyi khyad par zhib tu phye ba nyung gsal 'phrul gyi lde mig )sogs pod 'bring gnyis lhag mdzad dgung lo brgyad cu gya brgyad la phebs par rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i me phag (1827)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
a khag ba|{gshis ngan nam rang bzhin ngan pa'i ming}
a khu shes rab rgya mtsho|{mdo smad rtse gzhung brag dmar mdo zhes pa'i yul du yab no kho dang yum tsin thar zhes pa gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu phag (1803)lor sku 'khrungs/chung dus khu bo rje sang bla ma las phral klog dang sbyor klog thugs su chud/dgung lo bcu drug par dben gnas yid dga' chos 'dzin bsam gtan 'phel rgyal gling du 'phags pa gnas brtan chen po dkon mchog dge 'dun las tshangs spyod dge bsnyen gyi sdom pa dang rab byung gi tshul khrims mnos te rgyal ba'i bstan pa rin po che'i sgor zhugs/de nas dge ba'i bshes gnyen chen po dkon mchog don yod dang mkhyen gter ngag dbang bkra shes las bsdus grwa dang tshad ma/gung thang bstan pa'i sgron me la byang chub bde lam dang/'jam dpal zhal lung gi khrid sogs chos bka' bsam gyis mi khyab pa gsan/dgung lo bcu bdun pa la sa yos (1819)lor dge tshul gyi sdom pa mnos/dgung lo nyi shu chu rta (1822)lo nas phar phyin dang dbu ma nyer drug pa/sa byi (1828)lo nas mdzod la sogs pa gzhung pod lnga la mthar phyin par sbyangs/gzhan yang gtor bzo/bca' gshoms/phyag bris sogs phul byung du gyur/bla ma'i bka' bzhin drung yig gi las 'gan bsnams/mkhas pa'i mtshan snyan thob/dgung lo nyer brgyad pa lcags stag (1830)lor skyabs mgon thams cad mkhyen pa rje btsun blo bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtshos mkhan slob sbrags ma dang/sgo me lha rams pa blo bzang chos 'dzin gyis gsang ston mdzad de rab byung dge tshul bskyar sgrub dang dge slong gi sdom pa mnos/mtshan shes rab rgya mtsho zhes gsol/spyir rje 'dis mkhas grub dam pa mang po'i zhabs la gtugs te mdo sngags kyi gzhung dang dbang khrid man ngag mtha' yas pa gsan/gsan yig las/skyabs mgon thams cad mkhyen cing gzags pa chen po rje btsun blo bzang thub bstan 'jigs med rgya mtsho dang/'jam dpal dbyangs dngos dgon mchog bstan pa'i sgron me/spyan ras gzigs dbang mkhan chen grags pa rgyal mtshan/gsang bdag grub pa'i dbang phyug na khri rin po che 'jam dbyangs thub bstan nyi ma la sogs pa'i dge ba'i bshes gnyen bcu phrag gsum du nye ba'i zhabs la gtugs te yang dag par rdzogs pa'i sangs rgyas nasab zung dam pa bar ma chad pa las brgyad pa'i dbang rjes gnang khrid man ngag mi nyung ba tsam 'bad pas mnos/bka' rtsom la mtshon na/(rje tsong kha pa chen po'i bstod pa rtsa 'grel gyi bshad tshul gyi brjes byang thor bu nor bu'i phra tshom/) (dpal gsang dbang 'dus pa 'phags lugs lha so gnyis pa'i rim pa dang po'i khrid dmigs brjed (1111) byang mi bskyod mgon po'i zhal lung/) ('jam dpal dus dgra'i dbang po ma he'i gdong can lha bcu gsum ba'i ring pa dang po'i zab khrid zin bris 'jigs mdzad rdo rje'i zhal lung/) (bstan pa'i gdan kun rdzogs pa'i gdams pa byang chub bde lam gyi zhal shes bdud rtsi'i dbyings kyi sgo 'byed/) sgra'i dka' gdan las brtsams pa'i brjed byang dbyangs can rol mtsho )sogs pod nyi shu tsam mdzad phyis su brag ri dgon dang smra lung bkra shis chos 'phel gling brag dkar byang chub gling sogs dgon sde ma por phebs te dbang lung man ngag gi bdud rtsi'i gru char tshad med phar te bstan 'gro sman pa'i bya ba rgya chen po mdzad dgung lo don gsum la phebs pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i shing phag (1875)lor dgongs pa chos dbyings su thim}
a khyung ngag dbang mkhyen rab|{rje 'di ni a khyung drung rabs pa mkhas mchog ye shes kyi sprul sku yin/sku gzhon nu'i dus su grub chen ngag dbang blo bzang bstan 'dzin dang/rnga rgod mkha' seng ge /mkhan chen drung yig blo bzang rgya mtsho sogs mkhas grub dam pa mang po slob dpon du bsten nas mdo sngags kyi gzhung chen spyi dang/khyad par du sum rtags/snyan ngag /sdeb sbyor sogs la mkhas pa'i yang rtser son/bis pa ngag dbang mi pham zla ba mchog gis rje 'di las snyan ngag sbyangs brtson mdzad/mdo smad kha gya tsho drug gi a khyung sgom grwa thar pa gling phyag btab/chos bstod dang rnam thar sogs pod gcig ljags rtsom gnang/rje ngag dbang mkhyen rab 'di nyid kyi rna thar ma 'jal bas 'khrungs lo ngad 'dus lo kha gsal ma 'khod kyang/rje gang gi slob dpon dang slob ma'i lo tshigs la bltas na rab byung bcu gsum par byung ba'i mkhas pa zhig yin}
a lce dwangs bzang|{spyi lo'i dus rabs bcu dgu pa'i dus mjug tu byung ba'i lha mo mkhas can dwangs bzang ni skyor mo lung lha mo tshogs pa gsar 'dzugs byed mkhas gras shig yin 'dug /khong gi zla bo pad+ma bstan dang mnyam du skyor ma long khul nas mi khag gcig bsdu rab kyis lha mo'i 'khrab gzhung 'gro ba bzang mo dang pad+ma 'od 'bar/gzugs kyi nyi ma sogs sbyangs te 'khrul ston byas par brten khong tshor dwangs bzang mo tshogs pa zhes ming thob/lha mo 'khrab skabs lus kyi 'khrab 'khyer dang/ngag gi rnam thar mgrin 'gugs/'khrab gzhung bar seng du bzhad gad slong ba sogs dmigs bsal gyi khyad chos du ma ldan la/lhag par 'khrul stabs 'ar+khug cha dod par brten ltad mo ba tshos dga' po byed kyi yod/dwangs bzang lha mo tshogs pa des skor bskyod 'khrab ston byas te dbyar dus su bod dbus gtsang khul dang/dgun dus lho mon 'brug 'bras sogs su 'gro gi yod/tA la'i bla ma sku phreng bcu gsum pa'i sku dus su skyor ma lung lha mo ba zho ston gzigs 'bul bar gtan 'bebs gnang sa skyor mo lung du sa zhing khral rten phral bu gnang yang khong tshos sa zhing ma blangs par skor bskyod 'khrul stong kho na byas stabs kha rgyun du/skyor mo lung pa pha gzhis 'dzin pa las/_/lu gu 'khrid de gnas bzang skor ba dga'/_/zhes shod srol byung/a lce dwangs bzang ni gzugs byad legs la skad gdangs snyan pa/gsar gtod kyi snying stobs ldan pa/skabs 'phral tshigs bcad gsar rtsom thub pa sogs yod thog /khong la bu mo g.yu lo sgrol ma zer ba zhig yod pa de yang gzugs byed legs la skad snyan pa/lha mo 'khrab 'khyer dod pa bcas skad grangs chod pa zhig byung skad}
a jan ta|{de ni rgya gar gyi gnas mchog cig ste/b+hom b+he dang mi rig pa'i sar gnas yod cing/mkhas dbang (1112) dge 'dun chos 'phel gyis de ni deng sang 'jig rten na grags 'i gnas ngo mtshar can te phyi brag ri la nang gtsug lag khang che chung sna tshogs par yod pa ldebs ris la ston pa'i rnam thar dang skyes rabs kyi ri mo ngo mtshar bas brgyan pa nang gi ka gdung la sogs pa'i lha khang de dag thams cad kyang brag ril po gcig las bzos pa sogs blo'i yul las 'das pa'i ngo mtshar can de 'dzam bu gling gi sa'i snying po lta bu yin no/_/brag phug der deng sang gling chen drug gi mi thams cad za ma chad par 'gro zhing nang thams cad du glog yang spar yong zhes gsungs so/_}
a ti yo ga'i spyi don drug|{dpe nam mkha' g.ya' dag pa la brten nas gzhi'i ye shes bshad pa/dpe khyung chen gshog rdzogs lab rten nas gnas lugs kyi lta ba bshad pa/dpe rgya mtsho 'khyil ba la brten nas mnyam gzhag gi sgom pa bshad pa/dpe seng ge'i sgra sde la brten nas rtogs dpyad zil gnon bshad pa/dpe dpag bsam ljon shing/la brten nas rdzogs pa'i 'brus bu bshad pa dang/mi btsal lhun rdzogs don dam gyi gnas lugs thog ma'i sangs rgyas kun tu bzang po chos sku'i chos sku 'khor 'das kyi spyi mes chen po'i rang bzhin ni rtogs ge'i rigs pa dang tha snyad kyi dpe dang tshig gis gtan la mi pha pas mngon sum rang gnas su ngo sprod pa'i brdas mtshon par byed pa bcas so/_}
