a mes kun dga' bsod nams grags pa rgyal mtshan|{dpal sa skya dgon gyi khri pa nyer drug pa 'di nyis rang byung dgu pa'i me bya (1537)lor yab sngags 'chang grags pa blo gros rgyal mtshan dang/yum lcang mo srang bod nams rgyal mo gnyis kyi sras su sa skya'i lha khang chen mo phun tshogs gling gi bla brang du sku bltams/gzhon nu nas dge bsnyen dang dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/de nas yongs rdzogs dge bsnyen rdo rje 'dzin pa'i brtul zhugs lag nas par mdzad/dgung grangs nyi shu rtsa bzhi bzhes pa rab byung dgu pa'i lcags sprel (1560)lor sa skya dgon gyi gdan khrir phebs/dgung grangs so gsum bzhes pa rab byung bcu pa'i sa sbrul (1569)lor ('dzam gling byang phyogs kyi thub pa'i rgyal tshab chen po dpal ldan sa skya pa'i gdung rabs rin po che ji ltar byon pa'i tshul gyi rnam par thar pa jo mtshar rin po che'i bang mdzod dgos 'don kun 'byung )zhes bya ba ljags rtsom mdzad pa sogs lugs gnyis kyi mdzad 'phrin legs par spel/'das la mi gsal}
