a wa d+hu ti'i lam|{nang pa'i sngags kyi chos lugs kyi bshad srol la/mi rnams kyi lus kyi nang du rtsa yi gtso bo gsum/'khor dang bcas na bdun khri nyin stong yod pa dang/de'i nang nas rtsa yi gtso bo gsum ni/khu khrag rlangs gsum 'babs pa'i gnas te/g.yas kyi rtsa rkyang ma nas khu ba/g.yon gyi ro ma nas khrag 'bab cing/dbus kyi rtsa dbu ma'i nang snying kha'i thad kyi rtsa mdud gsum yod pa'i nang du rnam shes dang por gang du chags pa'i nags mi shigs pa'i thig le rgya sran tsam yod pa dang/'chi ba'i dus kyang/rnam shes rags pa rnams rim gyis bsdus te/lus kyi 'byung ba rnams thim tshar ba'i rjes/rnam shes shin tu phra ba de nyid yi shigs pa'i thig le'i dkyil nas thon pa dang/lus sems kyi 'brel ba chad nas shi ba zhes zer/thig le'i nang nas rnam shes thon pa dang/de'i rtags gshin po'i sna bug nas khrag dang/gsang gnas nas khu ba 'bab pa yin tsang/da dang dus mnyam du bar do grub payin zer srol yod}
