a rig dge bshes byams pa 'od zer|{mtshan gzhan a rig dge bshes byams pa dge legs rgyal mtshan nam rgyal mtshan 'od zer yang zhu/rje 'di ni rab byung bcu gnyis pa'i me rta (1726)lor 'khrungs/sku na chung ngu'i dus nas rgya li sprul sku blo bzang bstan dar mchog gi sku gam du bcar nas yi ge 'bri klog gis mtshon chos bka' mang du gnas sbyong mdzad/dgung lo bcu bdun la phebs pa chu khyi (1742)lor dbus su phebs/ser byes su lo bcu gsum ring mdo sngags kyi gzhung chen mo la thugs gnyer mdzad/phur bu lcog tu lo drug gi ring rje ngag dbang byams pa'i drung nas phab chos gsan pa dang sgom sgrub mdzad/dgung lo zhe bzhi pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa glang (1769)lor rwa rgya dgon bkra shis kun bde gling phyag btab/ser byes ltar gyi 'chad nyan btsugs/ri bo dan tig tu mtshams khang dang jo khang sogs gsar bzhengs kyis der sgom sgrub mdzad pa dang dgon sde dar bar spel/rab byung bcu gsum pa'i chu phag (1802)lor sku gshegs}
a rol blo bzang lung rigs rgya mtsho|{rje 'di ni mdo smad reb gong gser rdzongs dben gnas seng ge rtse'i nye 'dabs lcang lung zhes par ldong gi rigs su yab chob 'bum rgyal dang yum klu mo rgyal gnyis kyi sras su rab byung bcu gsum pa'i shing glang (1805)lor sku 'khrungs/dgung lo bdun la rong sprul dge 'dun mkhyen rab dpal bzang po'i drung nas dge tshul gyi sdom pa bzhes/mtshan dge 'dun lung rigs rgya mtsho zhes gsol/dgung lo brgyad thog yi dam rdo rje 'jigs byed kyi lung gsan/dgung lo bcu gnyis la thos bsam nor bu'i gling gi chos grwar zhugs nas gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bzhes mdzad 'go tshugs/dgung lo bco lnga la rnam 'grel 'dzin grwar phebs/dgung lo nyi shu la gser khang blo bzang bstan 'dzin gyi drung du bsnyen rdzogs bsgrubs/mtshan blo bzang lung rigs rgya mtsho zhes bstsal/dgung lo nyer lnga la gzhung chen bka' pod lngar gsan bsam mthar phyin zin te shing bza' blo bzang dar rgyas dang/gser khang pa/skal ldan rgya mtsho sku phreng bzhi pa blo bzang chos grags sogs bla ma mang po bsten nas mdo gas kyi chos mang du gsan/gyang skya'i ri khrod du rgyun ring (1115) bzhugs dgung lo dgu'i thog rong por phebs nas chos skor rgya cher bskor sku tshe'i ring rab byung dang bsnyen rdzogs kyi sdom pa gnang ba'i mi grangs lnga stong tsam zin dgung lo don grub la phebs pa lcags 'brug (1880)lor sog yul du phebs nas chos 'khor rgya cher bskor bka' rtsom ('phags mchog thugs rje chen po la brten pa'i smyung bar gnas pa'i cho ga bdun rtsi'i snying po )zhes bya ba dang (smyung gnas kyi cho ga'i zur rgyan bde ba can du bgrod pa'i myur lam/) (bla mgon dbyer med phyag drug pa'i rgyas pa'i gtor sgrub kyi 'don bsgrigs/) (zab don gcod kyi gdams pa'i khrid yig man ngag bdud rtsi snying po/) (dpal rdo rje 'jigs byed dpa' bo gcig pa'i bcu chu'i sbyin sreg gi ngag 'don bklags chog tu bkod pa )sogs pod 'bring gsum lhag mdzad dgung lo gya bzhi la phebs pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa byi (1888)lor gzugs sku'i bkod pa chos dbyings su thim}
a lag sha ngag dbang bstan dar|{sog po bstan dar lha rams pa yang zhu ba 'di nyid rab byung bcu gsum pa'i sa yos (1759)lor sog yul a lag sha zhes pa'i sa'i char sku 'khrungs/sku na chung dus khyim nas khyim med par rab tu byung ste grwa btsun mdzad cing/dbus su phebs nas dpal ldan 'bras spung dgon gyi sgo mang grwa tshang du zhugs gnang/rje klong rdol bla ma ngag dbang blo bzang slob dpon du bsten nas bka' chos zab mo dang rig gnas khag la sbyangs pa rgya cher mdzad cing shes rab gyi blo gros rab tu rgyas/dgung lo su cu ga tsam la lha ldan smon lam chen mor rab 'byams pa'i grwa skor mdzad/dgung lo so gsum du bzhes pa rab byung bcu gsum pa'i lcags phag (1791)lor 'bras spungs sgo mang grwa tshang gi mkhan por phebs/dgung lo nga gnyis thog rdo rabs pa lha zhe'i drung nas snyan ng+ga sogs rig gnas khag gsan sbyong gnang/phyis su mdo smad sku 'bum byams pa gling du yun ring bzhugs/'chad rtsod rtsom pas 'gro don rgya chen por spel/phyag rtsom yang (lam gyi gtso bo rnam gsum gyi 'grel pa/) (snyan ngag gi dper brjod/) (sum rtags 'grel pa )sogs mang du mchis/rje 'di nyid kyi rnam thar la mjal bas mdzad rjes cha chung ba 'god dka' la/'das lo yang zhib cha 'god mi thub/'on kyang bstan dar lha rams pa mchog gis mdzad pa'i (rten 'brel bstod pa'i don 'grel rin chen phreng ba )zhes pa'i mjug byang du/rang lo don gsum pa rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i lcags mo yos (1831)lo'i hor zla gnyis pa'i yar ngo'i tshes gsum la sbyar zhes gsal zhing/bstan bcos 'di brtsams nas yang ring ma bzhugs par dgongs pa gzhan don du gshegs pa mkhas pa'i gsung las byung bas/phal cher de nas dus yun ring por ma thogs par sku gshegs par mngon}
a lags 'jigs med bsam gtan|{grub pa'i dbang phyug 'jigs med bsam gtan rin po che rab byung bcu bzhi pa'i shing khyi (1814)lor mdo smad reb gong stod kyi char g.yu 'brong khyung gsum gyi lha zhol lte thang du yab mgo gras mkhar byams dang yum snying mo skyid gnyis kyi sras su sku bltams/byis pa'i dus nas rdzong dgar kyi chos grwar zhugs te klog dang chos spyod mang po tshegs med par thugs su chud/rdzong chung paN+Di ta 'jigs med lung rigs rgya mtsho snga phyi'i mkhan por gsol te so thar gyi sdom pa rgyun bzhes/de nyid las mdo sngags kyi chos bka' mang du gnas cing rig gnas kyi dpe khrid kyang mod mi dma' ba zhus/rong po blo bzang chos dar las sgra snyan ngag sman rtsis sogs rig gnas dang/rab 'byams pa blo bzang nyi ma las bsdus rtags blo gsum slob sbyong rdo rus thug pa (1116) mdzad gzhan a rol rin po che bse sku phreng gsum pa phrag lung mtsho kha ba rnams las kyang snga phyir chos lung mang po mnos dgung lo nyer drug pa sa phag (1839)lor sgrub brgyud bstan pa'i dbang po rje gser khang ba blo bzang bstan 'dzin rgya mtsho mjal te srad dbon gyi snyan brgyud mtha' dag lhag chad med par thugs kyi bum bzang du bskyil de nas bzung lo ngo bcu bdun gyi ring dben pa'i gnang gang 'go la du dka' spyad sha stag gis sgrub pa nyams len mdzad gzhan yang shing bzang rin po che blo bzang dar rgyas dang grub chen skal bzang grags pa rdo rabs pa 'jigs med bzang po sogs las kyang chos bka' dang man ngag gi rigs mtha' yas pa gsan khyad par phyi ma las 'jam dbyangs bzhad pa yab sras nas brgyad pa'i man ngag rnam gsum gyi gdams pa rnams tshang bar mdos pas dus 'dir srad bon gyi gdams pa'i mdzod gcig pur gyur dgung lo zhe bzhi pa me sbrul (1857)lo nas gdan don mkha' khyab tu skyong ba'i dbu btsugs te sgo me mchod rten ske dang bis thang rdzong dkar sku 'bum rtse gzhung ka ring bcas dgon sde mang por dbang lung rjes gnang mtha' yas pa gnang khyad par du bla ma che dgu shar thams cad mkhyen pa blo bzang skal ldan bstan pa'i rgyal mtshan dang khri rgan 'jam dbyangs rgyal ba'i yongs 'dzin zhwa dmar paN+Di ta bde yangs no mon han mtshan sgrogs ho thog tu rje spyan snga dkon mchog phun tshogs sogs kyis mtshon snod ldan yi slob ma mi nyung ba man ngag rnam gsum gyi khrid brgya lhag brgal ba gnang gsung 'bum pod gnyis tsam ljags rtsom mdzad gzhan yang mgon po'i gtor chen dang lcags mkhar zur dug pa chos rgyal gtor chen lcam sring k+She Ta pa la'i gtor chen ya ma ra dza'i sgo nas drag po'i las sbyor grangs las 'das pa mdzad chu phag (1863)lor gtsang mig dmar dge bshes dang mjal chos bka' gang mang gsan rab byung bco lnga pa'i sa glang (1889)lor tshe tan dgon du phebs te chos bkang mang po gsungs de ltar bstan 'gro'i don kho na la dmigs pa'i mdzad pa blangs che zhing mtha' yas pa spel te dgung lo gya bzhi pa rab byung bco lnga pa'i me bya (1897)lo'i zla bdun pa'i tshes gcig la ka ring du sku gshegs}
